window.__LITE_PARTS__=window.__LITE_PARTS__||[];window.__LITE_PARTS__.push([{"t":"高效有机二硫化物介体实现Li2S氧化还原动力学与负极稳定性的协同双重调控","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73710?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池","kp":["[介导策略]: 高效有机二硫化物介导剂","[电池架构]: 无阳极锂硫电池","[核心挑战]: Li2S绝缘性与动力学迟缓"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过双功能调控策略同时改善Li2S氧化还原动力学与锂负极稳定性，解决锂硫电池中Li2S高理论容量但反应动力学迟缓的核心矛盾。该协同调控有望推动高能量密度锂硫电池的实用化进程。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Synergistic Dual Modulation of Li2S Redox Kinetics and Anode Stability Enabled by a High‐Efficiency Organodisulfide Medi","b":"ABSTRACT Lithium sulfide (Li 2 S) is pivotal for high‐energy‐density lithium–sulfur (Li─S) batteries due to its high the..."},{"t":"通过串联等离子体电解系统从空气和水中可持续合成硝酸铵","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3006166?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT Ammonium nitrate (NH 4 NO 3 ) is an indispensable high‐nitrogen fertilizer, yet its conventional industrial pro","tp":"等离子氮固","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者开发了串联等离子体电解系统，仅利用空气和水即可可持续合成硝酸铵（NH4NO3）。该工艺无需传统Haber-Bosch法的苛刻高温高压条件，通过等离子体活化氮气并结合电解产生反应中间体，为绿色合成氮肥提供了低碳足迹新路线，对农业可持续性和能源转型有重要价值。","aip":1},{"t":"通过对映体失衡在手性光学活性方面超越同手性组装体","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74210-w","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性光学材料","kp":["[增强策略]: 控制对映体失衡增强手性光学活性","[发现]: 异手性组装超越同手性组装"],"as":"手性光学活性研究通过外消旋体对映异构体的交替共组装策略实现了超越同手性组装体的不对称性放大。该研究挑战了传统认为只有同手性组装才能产生强手性信号的观念，为理解生物同手性起源和开发新型手性光学材料提供了新思路。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Surpassing homochiral assemblies in chiroptical activity through enantiomeric imbalance","b":"Amplifying asymmetry via supramolecular self-assembly is essential for understanding homochirality in biology and develo"},{"t":"超大轨道赛车式电机：这些高清电机无需插电","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/13/super-sized-slot-cars-these-hd-electric-machines-never-need-plugged-in/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"道路无线充电","kp":["[充电技术]: 道路嵌入式导电轨道充电","[运营模式]: 无需插电连续运行","[应用案例]: Kalmar T2 EV终端牵引车(瑞典)"],"as":"Kalmar Ottawa T2 EV电动终端牵引车在道路上成功部署了无线感应充电系统，成为无需插电充电的重型电动机械案例。该技术通过道路嵌入式无线充电实现车辆持续作业，解决了重型电气设备充电难的问题，为港口、物流园区等封闭场景的全面电动化提供了可行路径。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Super-sized slot cars: these HD electric machines NEVER need plugged in","b":"| Jun 13 2026 - 6:48 am PT\nA Kalmar Ottawa T2 EV electric terminal tractor has been successfully deployed on an in-road charging system in Ljungby, Sweden, enabling continuous operation without ever needing to be plugged in.\nDeveloped by the unfortunately named Elonroad (\nwhich has nothing to do with Elon Musk\n), an electrically charged rail embedded in the road sends power up through a physical contact, slot car style, to Kalmar’s electric terminal trucks, forklifts, and material handlers. When combined with regenerative braking,\nthe system delivers enough power to keep the trucks running continously\n“The ultimate goal is to offer Kalmar customers a worry-free charging solution that delivers effectively unlimited onboard energy for continuous operations,” Per-Erik Johansson, Technology Manager, Electrification, Kalmar. “We are excited to take the next step towards this goal, demonstrating that dynamic charging is not only possible but a promising path forward for the future of electric heavy-duty transport. Following this verification phase, which tests charging efficiency and uptime improvements on the electric road with Kalmar terminal tractor, the technology will be tested in a real-life port environment with pilot customers.”\nThe joint Elonroad/Kalmar project is funded by the Swedish Energy Agency and aims to both further develop the dynamic electric road concept at port environments and identify suitable vehicles for conductive charging during operation.\nTerminal tractors are found in nearly every port\ncontainer terminal\n, and distribution center across the globe – and with their low speeds, heavy loads, and repetitive routes, they are ideal candidates for electrification. Almost.\nI say “almost,” because busy ports often operate around the clock, and the need to plug in and charge electric terminal tractors is often identified (incorrectly) as the reason battery electric uptime can’t compete with diesel. The “big slot car” concept from Elonroad solves that, and with a lot less “slot” than you might think. Just 200 meters (about an eighth of a mile) of electrified road that can charge port vehicles both when they’re moving and standing still has been more than enough to keep things moving at the Ljungby port.\n“Today, the partnership is demonstrating real potential for transforming how electric industrial vehicles are powered,” reads a Kalmar press release, “and the industry is taking notice.”\nHere’s hoping all those companies taking notice start making purchases,\nand prove they’re serious about cleaning up their operations\neven as they make moves to\nWe already know that in-ground charging – when it works – can be an absolute game-changer when it comes to vehicle electrification. That means my work here is mostly done, and the most important message I can leave you with is this: if you remember that commercial (above), it’s time to schedule that colonoscopy.\nIf you’re considering going solar, it’s always a good idea to get quotes from a few installers. To make sure you find a trusted, reliable solar installer near you that offers competitive pricing, check out\n, a free service that makes it easy for you to go solar. It has hundreds of pre-vetted solar installers competing for your business, ensuring you get high-quality solutions and save 20-30% compared to going it alone. Plus, it’s free to use, and you won’t get sales calls until you select an installer and share your phone number with them.\nYour personalized solar quotes are easy to compare online and you’ll get access to unbiased Energy Advisors to help you every step of the way.\nGet started her\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nI’ve been in and around the auto industry for over thirty years, and have written for a number of well-known outlets like CleanTechnica, Popular Mechanics, the Truth About Cars, and more. You can catch me at Electrek Daily’s Quick Charge, The Heavy Equipment Podcast, or chasing my kids around Oak Park, IL\nFind a reliable home solar and battery installer and save 20-30% compared to going it alone.\nQmerit makes electrification easy — connecting you with trusted pros who get it done right."},{"t":"通过可见光能量转移催化进行底物控制的全氟萘脱芳香环加成：Sw","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1846299?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT We report the first substrate‐controlled intermolecular dearomative cycloaddition of polyfluoronapthalenes in w...","tp":"光催化全氟","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"化学家首次实现了可见光能量转移催化下全氟萘的底物控制型分子间脱芳香环加成反应。该策略利用全氟取代基的电子效应和光催化剂的能量转移机制，在温和条件下实现萘环芳香性破坏和C-C键构建，为含氟多环化合物的精准合成开辟了新途径。"},{"t":"空间位阻配位调控碘化学实现锌碘电池四电子转换","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73681?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌碘电池","kp":["[转换机制]: I⁻/I⁺四电子转换","电解质策略[锌碘电池]: 位阻协调调节I⁺配位"],"as":"该研究提出空间位阻配位调控碘化学策略，实现四电子转换反应，用于高压水系锌碘电池。通过配位环境设计稳定I⁺中间体，克服了传统I⁻/I₂两电子反应的容量限制，显著提升电池能量密度。该工作为多电子氧化还原反应体系设计提供了新思路，推动了水系电池向高能量密度发展。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Steric Coordination Modulated Iodine Chemistry With Four‐Electron Conversion for Zinc‐Iodine Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The advancement of high‐voltage aqueous zinc‐iodine batteries is impeded by the instability of I\n                    +\n                    intermediates during the conversion process, which suffers from hydrolysis and poor reversibility in conventional electrolytes. To overcome these challenges, we propose a steric coordination strategy employing Cl\n                    −\n                    and sulfonate‐rich TES\n                    −\n                    ions to modulate the coordination environment of I\n                    +\n                    ions. Cl\n                    −\n                    ions activate I\n                    +\n                    ions through halide coordination, while the steric‐hindrance effect of TES\n                    −\n                    within the TES‐I‐Cl coordination structure effectively shields I\n                    +\n                    ions from nucleophilic attacks by water‐derived hydroxyl groups, collectively facilitating the reversible I\n                    −\n                    /I\n                    0\n                    /I\n                    +\n                    four‐electron conversion. Concurrently, adsorbed ions (TES\n                    −\n                    , Ch\n                    +\n                    , Cl\n                    −\n                    ) establish an electrostatic shielding layer to homogenize zinc deposition and form a dehydrated electric double layer to mitigate zinc corrosion. Moreover, the disruption of H‐bond networks between the water molecules induced by the additives reduces the water activity, further suppressing I\n                    +\n                    hydrolysis and water dissociation. Benefiting from these synergetic effects, the zinc‐iodine battery achieves highly reversible and stable iodine chemistry, including a high‐rate capability and long‐term cycling stability over 42 000 cycles (capacity retention: ∼70%). This work provides fundamental insights into ion coordination chemistry for designing high‐energy‐density aqueous iodine storage.","aip":1},{"t":"单颗粒催化剂上水氧化的空间成像研究","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02184-3","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单颗粒水氧化成像","kp":["[研究方法]: 单颗粒催化剂空间成像","[反应]: 水氧化(人工光合作用瓶颈)","[观测条件]: operando原位条件"],"as":"该研究实现了单颗粒催化剂上水氧化反应的空间成像，直接观测催化活性位点分布。水氧化（析氧反应）是人工光合作用中的动力学瓶颈，限制了太阳能燃料效率。通过空间分辨技术可视化单颗粒表面的反应非均匀性，有助于深入理解催化机制，为理性设计高效光催化/电催化水氧化催化剂提供了关键实验依据。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Spatial imaging of water oxidation on single-particle catalysts","b":"Water oxidation, widely recognized as the kinetic bottleneck of artificial photosynthesis, limits solar fuel efficiency."},{"t":"空间细胞秩序是口咽癌局部免疫抵抗机制的基础","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74318-z","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Oropharyngeal squamous cell carcinomas (OPSCCs) frequently result from oncogenic human papilloma virus (HPV) infections"},{"t":"自闭症发病机制的空间结构揭示了早期发育过程中的马赛克结构混乱","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74320-5","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Autism spectrum disorder (ASD) has been associated with diverse genetic factors and molecular changes. Yet, how pathophy"},{"t":"原位X射线光电子能谱揭示ZSM-5催化剂在甲醇制烃过程中积碳的空间演化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7876229?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"ZSM-5积碳演化","kp":["[研究方法]: 同步辐射原位X射线光电子能谱","[催化剂]: ZSM-5(不同Si/Al比)","[研究对象]: 积碳物种空间演化"],"dp":1,"as":"研究针对甲醇制烃（MTH）反应中ZSM-5沸石催化剂的积碳失活问题，重点揭示了积碳物种在催化剂孔道内的空间演化规律。通过结合原位表征与化学路径分析，研究追溯了从轻质芳烃到稠环重质积碳在沸石孔道内的生成、迁移与沉积过程，阐明了积碳从孔口到内部的非均匀分布特征及其对催化剂活性衰减的物理机制。该工作为理解沸石催化剂失活提供了空间维度的新认知，对设计长寿命MTH催化剂及工业装置运行周期优化具有指导意义。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Spatial Evolution of Coke in ZSM‐5 Catalysts During Methanol‐to‐Hydrocarbons Conversion Revealed by In Situ X‐Ray Photoe","b":"ABSTRACT Along with assessing chemical pathways, understanding the spatial evolution of deactivating coke species in zeo..."},{"t":"SpaceX 股价首日交易大涨 19%","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/spacex-shares-open-150-per-share","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"SpaceX Shares Jump 19% in First Day of Trading — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"固态电池实现465 Wh/kg能量密度，通过极端安全测试","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/energy/solid-state-battery-cell-aerospace-defense","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"interesting engineering","tg":"技术突破","tp":"固态锂电池","kp":["能量密度[固态锂电池]: 465 Wh/kg","电池容量[示范电芯]: 10 Ah","[安全测试]: 通过极端安全测试"],"as":"欧洲固态电池初创企业SOLiTHOR成功研制出首款10 Ah级示范电芯，能量密度达465 Wh/kg，并通过了极端安全测试。这一指标显著超越当前主流液态锂离子电池的能量密度上限（约250-300 Wh/kg），标志着硫化物或氧化物固态电解质路线在电芯工程化层面取得实质性进展。高能量密度与通过针刺、热滥用等极端安全测试的结合，验证了固态电池在解决液态电解质易燃易泄漏痛点方面的潜力。该进展对电动汽车续航提升及eVTOL等高能量密度需求场景具有关键意义，但量产工艺成熟度与成本仍是产业化主要挑战。","sc":9.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":7.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":10.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Solid-state battery cell hits 465 Wh/kg, passes extreme safety tests","b":"European battery startup SOLiTHOR has produced its first 10 Ah demonstration cell, marking an increase in the physical scale of its solid-state lithium battery technology. The company intends for this larger format to show that its laboratory chemistry can transition into commercial production for industries requiring specialized power sources.\nAlongside the production of the larger cell, the company reported stack-level energy densities of 465 Wh/kg and 1400 Wh/L within a pouch design. Engineers reached these figures by introducing a high-loading cathode with an areal capacity of 8mAh/cm2 into the company’s proprietary Solid Composite Electrolyte.\nUnlike traditional lithium-ion systems or certain semi-solid designs, this chemistry uses a sol-gel process that functions without requiring any liquid electrolyte injections during assembly.\nLaboratory evaluations indicate specific performance characteristics under varied operational environments. When testing multilayer pouch cells at a temperature of 25°C, the cells sustained continuous discharge rates reaching 5C without experiencing major drops in capacity.\nThe same units tolerated short 30-second power pulses up to 10C when held at a 50% state of charge. This specific energy discharge behavior is relevant for machinery that requires brief, intense\nenergy outputs\n, such as unmanned aerial vehicles during departure and descent sequences.\n“SOLiTHOR has developed a chemistry that allows the industry to rethink the manufacturing of solid-state battery cells,” said Dr. Fanny Bardé, Co-Founder and Chief Technology Officer at SOLiTHOR.\nLong-term stability tests were conducted on smaller 1 Ah multilayer pouch cells. These units completed more than 500 full discharge cycles while maintaining over 80% of their original storage capacity, which provides an initial benchmark for the operational lifespan of the chemistry.\nDuring standardized safety protocols, the fully charged multilayer cells were subjected to intentional overcharging and direct nail penetration.\n“In safety assessments, SOLiTHOR’s technology successfully passed the overcharge and nail penetration tests on a 100% charge multilayer pouch cell with no smoke, leakage, thermal runaway, or fire,” highlighted the company in a press release.\n“These technical achievements not only prove that the chemistry works, but that it delivers the combination of energy density, power performance, and cycle life required for practical applications,” added Bardé.\nThe manufacturing framework for the new chemistry relies on roll-to-roll processing systems already common in the battery sector. By removing the liquid filling stage entirely and accelerating the subsequent\nchemical formation\nand aging protocols, the production timeline for these steps is shortened by two-thirds.\nBecause these specific phases normally represent one-quarter of total cell manufacturing expenditures, their reduction alters the overall processing economics.\n“Existing Li-ion facilities can be upgraded for solid-state production with no new equipment, limited switching costs, and reduced operational costs,” noted the\npress release\nThe company is targeting initial applications for its battery cells within the aerospace, maritime, transport, and defense sectors.\n“With this major technical update, we are demonstrating that our technology can be realistically produced, satisfying the demands of high-performance and high-value applications within aerospace, dual-use, and mobility,” concluded Rodrigo P. Navarro, CEO at SOLiTHOR.\nGet the latest in engineering, tech, space & science - delivered daily to your inbox.\nAn active and versatile journalist and news editor. He has covered regular and breaking news for several leading publications and news media, including The Hindu, Economic Times, Tomorrow Makers, and many more. Aman holds expertise in politics, travel, and tech news, especially in AI, advanced algorithms, and blockchain, with a strong curiosity about all things that fall under science and tech.\nSolid-state battery cell hits 465 Wh/kg density, targets aerospace and defense applications\nTest facility for full-scale fusion power-plant blankets set to be developed in US\nUS Navy’s nuclear-powered fast-attack submarine returns to fleet\nIron-based catalyst helps zinc-air batteries power devices without precious metals\nScientists forge 24,000-atom mini universe that generates time without a single clock\nMore from Energy\nChina’s Xiaomi unveils robotic arm that enables remote, hands-free home EV charging\nTest facility for full-scale fusion power-plant blankets set to be developed in US\nIron-based catalyst helps zinc-air batteries power devices without precious metals\nHalo nuclear microreactor utilizes high-fidelity simulation to speed first power\nUS’ first vertically integrated solar factory starts production to power 1.3M homes\nChina’s Xiaomi unveils robotic arm that enables remote, hands-free home EV charging\nTest facility for full-scale fusion power-plant blankets set to be developed in US\nIron-based catalyst helps zinc-air batteries power devices without precious metals\nHalo nuclear microreactor utilizes high-fidelity simulation to speed first power\nUS’ first vertically integrated solar factory starts production to power 1.3M homes"},{"t":"集成钠离子储存、共溶剂和稀释剂功能的单分子添加剂用于低温钠离子电池","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7967447?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"低温钠离子电池","kp":["[添加剂设计]: 单分子集成Na离子库/共溶剂/稀释剂","[应用场景]: 低温钠离子电池"],"dp":1,"as":"钠离子电池在低温储能领域潜力巨大，但性能受电解质限制。该研究提出一种单分子添加剂，同时整合钠离子库、共溶剂和稀释剂三重功能，协同改善电解质的离子传导率与界面稳定性，显著提升低温条件下钠离子电池的循环寿命和倍率性能，为大规模低成本储能提供了新策略。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Single‐Molecule Additive Integrating Na‐Ion Reservoir, Cosolvent, and Diluent Functions for Low‐Temperature Na‐Ion Batte","b":"ABSTRACT Na‐ion batteries hold great promise for low‐temperature energy storage, but their performance is severely const...","aip":1},{"t":"单原子取代使KatG反应性从辅因子生物合成转向立体选择性亚砜化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73579-y","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"as":"蛋白质衍生辅因子依赖精确定位的杂原子引导氧化还原化学反应。该研究通过单原子取代手段，成功将KatG（过氧化氢酶-过氧化物酶）的反应性从辅因子生物合成路径重新导向至其他催化功能。这一突破有助于深入理解辅因子的形成机制与酶催化机理，并为酶工程改造、生物催化剂设计提供新思路，对生物化学与合成生物学具有基础性意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶催化选择性调控","kp":["方法[酶工程]: 遗传密码扩展替换Trp为硫代色氨酸","发现[KatG]: 单原子取代使反应转向立体选择性亚砜化"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":4.5},"ot":"Single-atom substitution redirects KatG reactivity from cofactor biogenesis to stereoselective sulfoxidation","b":"Protein-derived cofactors rely on precisely positioned heteroatoms to direct redox chemistry, yet isolating their indivi"},{"t":"动态键与空间位阻协同作用实现剪切增强阻尼离子凝胶","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73746?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"剪切增韧离子凝胶","kp":["[材料设计]: 动态键与空间位阻协同","[材料类型]: 剪切增韧阻尼离子凝胶","[核心挑战]: 刚度-阻尼权衡"],"dp":1,"as":"高应变速率冲击载荷会导致防护材料出现结构破坏和能量耗散不足的问题。该研究利用动态化学键与离子液体网络的协同作用，开发出剪切增强型阻尼离子凝胶。该材料在常态下柔软，遭遇高速冲击时迅速变硬并高效耗散能量，兼具自修复与可拉伸特性，在防护装甲、抗冲击器件和柔性可穿戴设备领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Shear‐Stiffening Damping Ionogels Enabled by the Synergy of Dynamic Bonds and Steric Hindrance","b":"ABSTRACT High‐rate impact loading causes structural failure and insufficient energy dissipation in protective materials."},{"t":"自过滤单片有机/PbS量子点光电探测器，用于可见光和短波红外选择性视觉","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74407-z","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","b":"Dual-mode photodetectors with vertically stacked photoactive layers enable bias-controlled, band-selective extraction fr...","tp":"量子点探测","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者开发了集成有机半导体和PbS量子点的自过滤单片光电探测器，可实现可见光和短波红外（SWIR）双模式偏压控制选择探测。器件通过垂直堆叠光敏层实现能带选择性载流子提取，无需外部滤光片，为紧凑型宽谱成像和选择性人工视觉系统提供了新方案。"},{"t":"自组装蛋白构成浮游丁丁纤毛虫的耐化学性外壳生物材料","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74402-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Biomaterials provide superior properties and sustainable alternatives relevant to medicine, textiles, and high-tech appl","tp":"蛋白生物材","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现海洋浮游丁丁纤毛虫（tintinnid ciliates）外壳由自组装蛋白构成，具有优异耐化学性。这种生物材料展现出独特机械强度和化学稳定性，来源可持续，在医学、纺织和高技术材料领域具有应用潜力，为仿生材料设计和绿色生物制造提供了新灵感。"},{"t":"在 Belle 寻找 $B$ 衰变中能量缺失的微弱相互作用粒子","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/1rl4-j3np","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): M. Abumusabh et al. (The Belle and Belle II Collaborations)We present a search for an invisible hidden-sector particle ${X}_{\\mathrm{inv}}$, produced in ${B}^{0}→{\\overline{D}}^{0}{X}_{\\mathrm{inv}}$ and ${B}^{±}→h{X}_{\\mathrm{inv}}$ decays, where $h={π}^{±}$, ${K}^{±}$, ${D}_{s}^{±}$, ${p}^{±}$. The search is performed using ${e}^{+}{e}^{−}$ collision data…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231802] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"科学家揭开了78万年前人类第一批篝火燃烧的原因","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-uncover-what-kept-humanitys-first-campfires-burning-780000-years-ago/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Rare charcoal fragments from an ancient lakeshore campsite are offering new clues about fire use, resource management, and the environmental knowledge of some of humanity’s earliest fire users.\nLong before cities, farms, or written language existed, some of humanity’s ancestors had already discovered a resource that would transform the course of human evolution: fire. But controlling fire was only part of the challenge. Keeping it burning required a reliable supply of fuel, and new research suggests that access to firewood may have helped determine where people lived nearly 800,000 years ago.\nAt the prehistoric site of Gesher Benot Ya’aqov (GBY) in northern Israel, scientists have uncovered rare clues preserved in ancient charcoal fragments. The findings reveal not only what fueled some of the world’s earliest known campfires, but also how these early humans organized their lives around a lakeshore environment rich in food, water, raw materials, and fuel.\nThe study, published in Quaternary Science Reviews, analyzed one of the oldest and most extensive charcoal collections ever recovered from a prehistoric site. The international research team, which included scientists from Israel, Spain, and Germany, found evidence that the inhabitants of GBY used the landscape in surprisingly practical ways, taking advantage of natural resources that made long-term occupation possible.\nAround 780,000 years ago, the area looked very different from today. GBY sat on the edge of ancient Lake Hula, a freshwater ecosystem surrounded by wetlands, woodland, and abundant wildlife. For hunter-gatherers, it would have been an exceptionally attractive place to live.\nArchaeologists have identified more than 20 occupation layers at the site, showing that generations of Acheulian hominins repeatedly returned to the same location over thousands of years. Excavations led by Prof. Naama Goren-Inbar of the Hebrew University of Jerusalem have uncovered stone tools, plant foods, fish remains, and the bones of large animals, providing one of the most detailed records of early human life anywhere in the world.\nOne of the site’s most remarkable discoveries is the remains of a straight-tusked elephant, an animal that could weigh several times more than a modern African elephant. The arrangement of the bones suggests it was butchered at the site, offering a rare glimpse into large-game hunting and processing during the Lower Paleolithic.\nWhile elephant bones and stone tools tend to attract attention, researchers turned their focus to something far less dramatic: charcoal.\nCharcoal rarely survives for hundreds of thousands of years, making the GBY collection extraordinary. Because wood reflects the plants growing in the surrounding environment, each fragment serves as a tiny record of the ancient landscape.\nThe team examined 266 charcoal pieces under a microscope, identifying the\nThe pomegranate finding represents the earliest known evidence of the fruit tree in the Levant, extending the documented history of pomegranate in the region by hundreds of thousands of years.\nPerhaps even more surprising was the diversity of the charcoal itself. The burned wood represented a wider range of plant species than other botanical remains found at the site, including seeds and fruits.\nThe study challenges the idea that these early humans carefully selected particular tree species for fuel. Instead, the evidence points to a simpler and highly effective strategy.\nMuch of the wood appears to have come from driftwood naturally deposited along the lake’s edge. Branches and logs carried by water would have accumulated on the shoreline, creating an easily accessible source of fuel that required little effort to collect.\nResearchers suggest that the constant availability of firewood may have been one reason why groups repeatedly returned to GBY. The site offered a rare combination of resources concentrated in a single location, reducing the energy needed to meet daily needs.\nThe study also sheds light on how fire was used. Researchers found that concentrations of charcoal overlapped with clusters of fish remains, especially the teeth of large carp. This association provides strong evidence that fish were being cooked at the site nearly 800,000 years ago using controlled fire.\nThe results support the idea that the GBY hominins possessed advanced cognitive abilities. They could manage fire, organize activities around it, and incorporate it into complex food-gathering and food-processing strategies. At the same time, while activities such as hunting and tool production likely required significant planning, collecting firewood appears to have been a simpler task driven mainly by what was readily available.\nTaken together, the evidence portrays a highly capable community that repeatedly returned to a resource-rich location that met many of its needs.\nThe charcoal assemblage from GBY offers a rare opportunity to explore the connections between fire use, environmental conditions, and hominin behavior. The findings refine scientists’ understanding of early fire use and highlight the important role local resources played in shaping settlement and survival strategies during the Middle Pleistocene.\nReference: “Paleoenvironmental and behavioral insights into firewood selection by early Middle Pleistocene hominins” by Ethel Allué, Naama Goren-Inbar, Yoel Melamed, Brigitte Urban and Nira Alperson-Afil, 3 April 2026,\nQuaternary Science Reviews\nDOI: 10.1016/j.quascirev.2026.109973\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAnthropology\nThe Hebrew University of Jerusalem\nThis 15,000-Year-Old Discovery Changes What We Know About Early Human Creativity\nRewriting the Story of Human Migration: Scientists Uncover Lost Land Bridge to Europe\nOldest Known Bone Tools Challenge Our Understanding of Human Evolution\nNew Research Shatters the Myth of Men As Hunters and Women As Gatherers\nCombat or Climate: The Real Cause of Small-Scale Societies’ Collapse\nEarliest Interbreeding Between Ancient Human Populations Discovered – Evolutionary Puzzle Solved\nNew Evidence Shows Humans Mastered Fire Earlier Than Thought\n400,000 Year Old Fossil Helps Shed New Light on Human Evolution\nMillion-Year-Old Ash in South African Cave Yields Evidence of Cooking"},{"t":"科学家揭示咖啡因破坏睡眠的隐藏方式","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-reveal-the-hidden-way-caffeine-sabotages-sleep/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"EEG studies suggest caffeine can reduce deep, restorative sleep even when sleep duration appears normal. Its effects vary by individual, and relying on caffeine for energy may come at the cost of nighttime recovery.\nEvening coffee has long been debated. Some people can drink it and fall asleep with no trouble, while others struggle to sleep afterward. But a growing body of research suggests that focusing only on whether coffee delays sleep may miss a more important issue: what caffeine does to the brain during sleep.\nResearchers are increasingly using EEG, or electroencephalography, to study caffeine’s effects on sleep. This technique records the brain’s electrical activity, allowing scientists to examine not only how long people sleep or how often they wake up, but also the underlying quality of their sleep.\n“EEG allows us to see not only whether a person is sleeping but also how the brain is sleeping. Classical sleep assessment assesses sleep duration and its stages, whereas quantitative EEG analysis reveals more subtle changes, such as reduced slow-wave activity, which is an important marker of sleep depth and its restorative character,” explains Prof. Donata Kurpas from the Department of Nursing, Wroclaw Medical University.\nSlow waves are a defining feature of deep sleep, the stage that supports physical recovery, replenishes energy stores, and helps maintain healthy brain function.\nStudies show that caffeine’s effects do not always appear as shorter sleep or difficulty falling asleep. In many cases, the bigger impact is on the quality of sleep.\n“Caffeine may shorten sleep or make it more difficult to fall asleep; however, even when sleep duration appears normal, it may reduce slow-wave activity and shift the EEG pattern toward a more ‘wakeful’ brain,” says Prof. Kurpas.\nAs a result, someone may spend eight hours in bed while their brain receives less of the restorative benefits of deep sleep. Many people may not realize this is happening.\n“The subjective feeling of having slept well does not always correspond to what we observe in neurophysiological recordings. A person may fall asleep without major difficulty and not remember awakenings, while the brain may display fewer features of deep sleep,” the expert adds.\nOne of the clearest findings from sleep research is that people respond to caffeine very differently. Genetics, metabolism, age, stress, and chronic fatigue can all influence its effects.\nFor some people, even a morning cup of coffee may affect sleep later that night.\n“It is not only about coffee consumed just before bedtime. For some people, the total amount of caffeine consumed during the day and whether the body has enough time to metabolize it before nightfall may also be important,” Prof. Kurpas emphasizes.\nThis information is especially relevant for people who perform demanding mental work, athletes, and anyone who regularly uses caffeine to boost focus and performance.\nCaffeine increases alertness and helps reduce feelings of fatigue. However, experts note that this boost may sometimes come at the expense of overnight recovery.\n“If caffeine helps a person function during the day while simultaneously worsening the quality of nighttime recovery, a vicious circle may develop: greater fatigue, greater need for stimulation, and poorer sleep,” says Prof. Kurpas.\nBecause of findings like these, sleep researchers are paying less attention to sleep duration alone and focusing more on how the brain functions during sleep.\n“Caffeine is neither ‘good’ nor ‘bad’. It is a biologically active substance whose effects depend on dose, time of day, age, lifestyle, sleep quality, stress burden, and individual sensitivity,” the expert concludes.\nReference: “The Caffeinated Brain Part 2: The Effect of Caffeine on Sleep-Related Electroencephalography (EEG)—A Systematic and Mechanistic Review” by James Chmiel and Donata Kurpas, 12 April 2026,\nDOI: 10.3390/nu18081220\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nCognitive Science\nNeuroscience\nSleep Science\nScientists Discover Caffeine Can Repair Key Memory Circuits After Sleep Loss\nA 45-Minute Nap Can Reset Your Brain for Better Learning\nBlocking HDAC2 Enzyme May Reverse Memory Loss Caused by Alzheimer’s Disease\nYeast Protein Reveals Clues to How Alzheimer’s Forms\nMIT Scientists Use Optogenetics to Trigger REM Sleep\nScientists Find No Correlation Between Moon Phases and Sleep\nStudy Shows Caffeine Has a Positive Effect on Memory\nDisrupted Sleep Patterns Linked to Alzheimer’s\nExamining the Relationship Between Diabetes and Cognitive Decline"},{"t":"施耐德电气：人是供应链的未来","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/schneider-electric-people-are-the-future-of-supply-chain","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Schneider Electric: People are the Future of Supply Chain\nPrioritise Us\nLaure Collin explains why Industry 4.0 is a cultural challenge, sharing how a talent overhaul at a top smart factory cut critical turnover to just 6%\nLaure Collin is the Senior Vice President of Human Resources for Global Supply Chain at\nSchneider Electric\n, where she leads the people and organisation agenda for one of the world’s most complex and global industrial supply chains.\nLaure’s role is to ensure that talent, skills and culture are decisive enablers of performance, resilience, digitalisation and sustainability across our end‑to‑end value chain.\nWith more than 30 years at Schneider Electric, her career reflects the evolution of both the company and the HR function – having held a wide range of roles across regions and functions.\nLaure explores how when we talk about\nAI in manufacturing\n, it tends to explore data pipelines, predictive maintenance and automation. But, Laure believes we are missing the most critical element: the human one. As AI transitions from isolated pilots to real-time cognitive networks, the real differentiator is not the technology itself, but how fast your workforce can adapt to it.\nSpeaking to Supply Chain Digital, Laure breaks down why Industry 4.0 readiness is a cultural challenge rather than a technical one, shares a blueprint for successful human-AI teaming from Schneider Electric’s award-winning Wuhan factory and explains why talent must be treated as core operational infrastructure.\nTreating readiness as a technology problem. In many organisations, AI is stitched into daily production and end-to-end value chains but the sites that sustain step-change results invest in talent with the same rigour they invest in technology.\npeople systems\n(skills, roles, incentives, governance, etc.) can’t scale as fast as AI, performance won’t stick. So, I think one of the biggest mistakes businesses make when it comes to AI is not driving cultural change at the same speed as technical adoption.\nWe’re moving from pilots to “cognitive networks” where connected plants, logistics and suppliers are operating in real time and AI is embedded in decision-making. That raises the bar. It is no longer a question of “can we build the AI use case?\" but “can our team own it and run it safely, consistently and at scale?”\nOne of the key challenges is that many organisations do not have effective ways to measure AI readiness. Traditional workforce metrics often stop at headcount, hiring or course completion. Those are activity measures, not readiness measures. We need to build a metrics-based system focused on outcomes such as productivity, critical skills and internal mobility into AI-impacted roles.\nPractically, that means\ntreating skills\nwith the same rigour as business assets by mapping and forecasting capability needs, embedding human-AI ways of working into everyday operations and scaling them across sites. It is also important to build a strong talent pipeline through partnerships that co-create job-ready curricula and “earn and learn” pathways.\nAt Schneider Electric’s Wuhan factory in China - one of only three Global Lighthouses for Talent designated by World Economic Forum – we implemented a large-scape talent transformation programme to help drive productivity and AI adoption.\nWuhan is a good example because the pressure was very real and very practical. The site went through rapid automation and a major expansion in its product portfolio, and capability just couldn’t keep up at first.\nThe big shift was treating capability like a system, not a set of training events. We introduced AI-driven competency management so we could match skills\nsupply and demand\n, assign personalised learning and connect progression to a ‘pay for skills’ model. We also changed how work was planned, making it more people-centric so task allocation improved.\nOn the shopfloor, GenAI tools helped technicians solve problems faster and build their confidence, which had a real impact on retention. And we did not rely on internal development alone. We built an external pipeline through partnerships with vocational institutions, apprenticeships and initiatives like R&D labs and scholarships, so the inflow of skills became sustainable rather than reactive. Over the course of the transformation, workforce readiness rose from 20% to 76% and we managed to reduce critical-role turnover from 48% to just 6%.\nTalent isn’t a “nice to have”, it is the multiplier. The Lighthouse story used to be mainly about productivity, resilience and sustainability. Now talent is being recognised as a core ingredient of excellence. That shift is important because it reframes workforce capability as operational infrastructure, not an HR initiative you bolt on after the fact.\nTechnology isn’t going to replace people who keep adapting, but it will expose skills gaps much faster. The risk isn’t “AI taking your job”. It is being outperformed by someone who knows how to use AI better, unless upskilling becomes non-negotiable.\nOur responsibility\nis to protect people’s ability to adapt, contribute and grow as the operating model evolves.\nSVP Human Resources Global Supply Chain"},{"t":"SUCNR1 协调肝细胞的代谢通量、线粒体功能和营养依赖性适应","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8873?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Succinate, a mitochondrial metabolite, also functions as an extracellular signal through its receptor succinate receptor 1 (SUCNR1), coordinating responses to nutrient availability. The physiological role of SUCNR1 within hepatocytes, however, is unclear. We show that hepatic succinate levels and\n                    Sucnr1\n                    expression are dynamically regulated by nutritional status. Mice lacking\n                    Sucnr1\n                    in hepatocytes [Hep-\n                    Sucnr1\n                    knockout (KO)] exhibit a fasting-like phenotype characterized by enhanced gluconeogenesis, elevated amino acids, and impaired metabolic flexibility. Mechanistically, loss of\n                    Sucnr1\n                    compromises glucose-derived oxidative flux through the tricarboxylic acid cycle, increases reliance on glutamine-dependent anaplerosis, and induces mitochondrial stress adaptations. Upon refeeding, Hep-\n                    Sucnr1\n                    KO mice show blunted mammalian target of rapamycin activation, incomplete glycogen restoration, and an altered hepatic proteomic response.\n                    Sucnr1\n                    expression increases during liver maturation, is enriched in pericentral hepatocytes, and its loss is associated with functional reprogramming of pericentral metabolic functions without disruption of zonation. Together, our findings establish SUCNR1 as a critical regulator of hepatic metabolic adaptation, linking succinate signaling to mitochondrial flexibility and nutrient-dependent metabolic responses."},{"t":"SOLACE：探索屋顶光伏部署的框架及在加拿大的应用","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008883?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"屋顶光伏部署","kp":["[框架名称]: SOLACE","[应用场景]: 屋顶光伏部署评估(加拿大)"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"SOLACE: a framework for exploring rooftop photovoltaic deployment, with application to Canada"},{"t":"SHLD2 缺失是 Polθ 抑制结合放疗的综合脆弱性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4508?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Inhibition of DNA polymerase theta (Polθ), an essential enzyme for repairing DNA double-strand breaks (DSBs) via microhomology-mediated end joining (MMEJ), has proven to be an exquisitely effective monotherapy in HR-deficient tumor models. In addition, Polθ inhibition (Polθi) can induce tumor-selective radiosensitization, but unlike its monotherapy use, no clinically actionable biomarkers have yet been identified to predict this effect. Here, we profiled 54 cancer cell lines and found that Polθi induces substantial radiosensitization in most models, although with marked variability not explained by indicators of Polθ activity. To pinpoint molecular determinants of radiosensitization by Polθi, we performed a CRISPR knockout screen which revealed loss of the TP53BP1/Shieldin pathway component\n                    SHLD2\n                    (\n                    FAM35A\n                    ) as a vulnerability to Polθi combined with RT. We found that\n                    SHLD2\n                    is deleted in a subset of human prostate cancers, frequently alongside\n                    PTEN\n                    loss, an adverse prognostic factor. We demonstrated that\n                    SHLD2\n                    loss not only increases sensitivity to RT alone, as reported previously, but also enhances the radiosensitizing effect of Polθi, independently of\n                    PTEN\n                    status and without requiring HR deficiency. Moreover, our findings support a model in which\n                    SHLD2\n                    deficiency increases Polθ dependence following RT, with Polθ activity limiting DSB accumulation and chromosomal instability, via a compensatory mechanism independent of canonical MRE11/CtIP-mediated DNA end resection. In summary, we found that\n                    SHLD2\n                    loss is a collateral vulnerability that can be exploited through combined treatment with Polθi and RT."},{"t":"${\\mathrm{TaIrTe}}_{4}$ 中的室温固有非线性平面霍尔效应","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/hbdj-2hgf","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Chang Jiang, Fan Yang, Yu Zhao, Jinshan Yang, Peng Yu, Huiying Liu, Yuda Zhang, Zehao Jia, Xiangyu Cao, Li Tian, Jingyi Yan, Zheng Liu, Zhongkai Liu, Xian-Lei Sheng, Cong Xiao, Shengyuan A. Yang, Shaoming Dong, and Faxian XiuA room-temperature intrinsic nonlinear planar Hall effect in the nonmagnetic topological semimetal TaIrTe4 reveals how an in-plane magnetic field generates a Berry-connection-polarizability dipole through an orbital mechanism.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236302] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","tp":"非线性霍尔","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者在非磁性拓扑半金属TaIrTe4中首次观测到室温本征非线性平面霍尔效应。研究表明面内磁场通过轨道机制产生Berry联络极化率偶极子，驱动非线性霍尔响应。该发现拓展了对拓扑材料中非线性输运现象的理解，为低功耗自旋电子和拓扑量子器件提供了新平台。"},{"t":"Roku 正在讨论收购事宜","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/roku-discussions-acquired","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Roku in Discussions to be Acquired — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"由坍塌空心介孔结构烧结的稳健体相碳化硅多形体","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74043-7","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/非金属/其它无机非金属","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碳化硅陶瓷烧结","kp":["致密度[SiC陶瓷]: 99.2±0.49%","烧结温度[SiC]: 1750°C(放电等离子烧结)"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出一种新型块体碳化硅(SiC)陶瓷制备策略，通过坍缩中空介孔前驱体进行烧结，获得结构致密、力学性能优异的多晶型SiC材料。该方法规避了传统高温高压合成的苛刻条件，显著降低能耗与工艺复杂度。所得SiC陶瓷在耐高温、抗腐蚀等极端环境应用（如航空航天、核电、功率器件）中具有广阔前景。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Robust bulk silicon carbide polymorphs sintered from collapsed hollow mesoporous structure","b":"Bulk silicon carbide (SiC) ceramics are important for extreme-environment applications, but conventional synthesis deman","aip":1},{"t":"核糖体变构作为细菌休眠的潜在调节剂","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74199-2","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"Ribosomes are central to protein synthesis but also serve as dynamic hubs that integrate cellular stress responses. Here"},{"t":"混合Ca-Na有机硼酸盐电解液中不对称溶剂化效应实现可逆钙金属负极","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2265342?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙金属电池","kp":["电解质[钙金属电池]: 混合Ca²⁺/Na⁺有机硼酸盐","[机制]: 不对称溶剂化效应"],"as":"研究通过在混合电解液中构建非对称溶剂化效应，实现了可逆的钙金属负极。钙金属电池理论能量密度高、资源丰富，但长期以来受钙枝晶生长和可逆沉积困难制约。非对称溶剂化设计调控了钙离子的溶剂化壳层结构，抑制副反应，实现均匀沉积/剥离，显著提升了循环稳定性。该进展推动钙电池走向实用化。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Reversible Calcium Metal Anodes Enabled by Asymmetric Solvation Effect in Hybrid Ca‐Na Organoborate Electrolytes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Calcium metal batteries represent a promising frontier for high‐energy‐density energy storage, yet their practical application is hindered by sluggish kinetics and unstable electrolyte‐metal interfaces. Here, we report an electrolyte design strategy based on an asymmetric solvation effect by a hybrid Ca\n                    2+\n                    /Na\n                    +\n                    organoborate electrolyte that simultaneously regulates solvation chemistry and interphase formation. By introducing monovalent co‐cations and strongly coordinating tetra(3,3,3‐trifluoropropoxy)borate anion, an asymmetric solvation structure is constructed in which electrochemically active Ca\n                    2+\n                    occupies an off‐center position. This configuration significantly breaks the centrosymmetry of the Ca\n                    2+\n                    solvation sheath, leading to an intensified dipole moment and a disruption of the uniform electrostatic shielding, which selectively activates the Ca\n                    2+\n                    for efficient desolvation. Consequently, dense Ca deposition (&gt;10 mA h cm\n                    −2\n                    ) is achieved with low overpotential, high reversibility (∼95%), and long‐term stability. Interfacial analysis reveals that the asymmetric solvation environment drives preferential anion decomposition, yielding a polymeric‐polycrystalline interphase composed of CaH\n                    2\n                    /CaO and boron‐containing polymeric ether species that effectively protects the Ca anode. When paired with cathodes under a restricted negative‐to‐positive ratio of 7.2, the Ca/Na/Btfp electrolyte enables stable full‐cell operation to exceed 57 cycles. This strategy is also transferable to Mg metal battery, highlighting its potential as a general electrolyte design principle for multivalent metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"重新审视深度学习方法在光伏功率预测中的应用","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73817-3","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏功率深度预测","kp":["架构建议[PV预测]: 完整编码器-解码器+通道依赖建模"],"as":"论文对光伏功率预测中深度学习方法的应用进行批判性再评估。虽然深度学习在精度上表现突出，但在面对天气不确定性、数据稀缺和跨场景泛化时仍存在局限。作者指出许多模型存在过拟合基准数据集、缺乏物理可解释性等问题，建议结合物理模型与传统统计方法构建混合架构，以提升预测的稳健性与工程可靠性。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Rethinking the use of deep learning methods for photovoltaic power forecasting","b":"Accurate photovoltaic power forecasting is critical for grid stability, but remains challenged by weather uncertainties"},{"t":"ResMap：一个社区资源，用于系统地绘制跨场景的治疗持续残留癌细胞依赖性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7476?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Relapse following targeted therapy remains a central challenge in oncogene-driven cancers. Drug-tolerant persister cells that survive initial treatment without genetic resistance seed relapse, yet despite over a decade of research, no persister-directed therapy has reached clinical approval. To bridge this gap, we developed ResMap, a community resource providing both a standardized experimental framework and quantitative dataset for systematic comparison of persister vulnerabilities across cancer contexts. Using this platform, we evaluated 94 compounds targeting 57 literature-derived candidates in two\n                    EGFR\n                    \n                      mut\n                    \n                    and two\n                    KRAS\n                    \n                      G12C\n                    \n                    lung cancer models under normoxic and hypoxic conditions. Initial screening identified 12 targets with conserved anti-persister activity across genotypes and oxygen environments; follow-up validation reproduced 9 of these targets and revealed variable degrees of persister specificity relative to general cytotoxicity. We also identified context-specific vulnerabilities, including KRAS-relevant combination targets, several of which have since been independently reported and/or advanced to clinical testing. Integration of human cancer cell line essentiality data and adult mouse loss-of-function phenotypes provided a complementary tolerability layer to refine prioritization. ResMap establishes a foundation for coordinated community efforts to accelerate rational persister-directed combination strategies toward the clinic."},{"t":"解除 GbNAC072C-GbHOX3 轴上的 GbDEAH12G 抑制可提高海岛棉的皮棉率","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74024-w","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"Improving lint percentage (LP) is a key breeding target for Sea Island cotton (Gossypium barbadense), yet its genetic ba"},{"t":"调控多金属离子轨道相互作用增强磷酸锰铁锂的动力学与结构稳定性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71180?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷酸锰铁锂正极","kp":["组分[LMFP正极]: LiMn0.475Fe0.475Ni0.03","[策略]: 多金属离子轨道工程"],"as":"研究通过调控多金属离子的轨道相互作用，改善磷酸锰铁锂（LMFP）电池材料的动力学性能与结构稳定性。LMFP兼具高安全性与高能量密度，但存在锰溶解、离子扩散慢等瓶颈。通过多金属位点协同工程优化电子/离子传导网络，抑制相变畸变，显著提升倍率性能与循环寿命。该策略为高比能正极材料设计提供通用范式。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Regulating Multi‐Metal Ion Orbital Interactions to Enhance Kinetics and Structural Stability in Lithium Manganese Iron P","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium manganese iron phosphate (LMFP) offers high safety and high energy density for lithium‐ion batteries, yet its commercialization is bottlenecked by poor conductivity and severe Jahn–Teller (J–T) distortion. Here, we report a multi‐metal ion (Ni, Cu, Ti) orbital engineering strategy to simultaneously decouple these twin challenges in a customized LiMn\n                    0.475\n                    Fe\n                    0.475\n                    Ni\n                    0.03\n                    Cu\n                    0.01\n                    Ti\n                    0.01\n                    PO\n                    4\n                    (LMFP‐NCT) cathode. Mechanistically, enhanced orbital hybridization between heteroatoms and the host lattice optimizes localized electronic distribution and narrows the bandgap, boosting intrinsic conductivity and ionic diffusivity by an order of magnitude. Importantly, the tailored orbital occupation effectively suppresses\n                    \n                      e\n                      g\n                    \n                    orbital degeneracy, transitioning the MnO\n                    6\n                    octahedra into a structurally robust, controlled‐distortion state. Supported by the\n                    d\n                    ‐band center theory, this strategy enhances metal‐oxygen\n                    σ\n                    ‐bonds, leading to minimal volume variation (4.29%) and suppressed Mn dissolution (reduced by 48.4%). Consequently, the LMFP‐NCT delivers doubled capacity at 6C compared with LMFP and an exceptional 92.3% capacity retention after 1000 cycles at 1C. When paired in full cells, it maintains 96.4% of its capacity over 500 cycles. This work provides profound insights for designing high‐performance LMFP cathodes by fundamentally conquering J–T distortion and kinetic limitations."},{"t":"准栅电极调控静电放电实现高性能直流摩擦纳米发电机","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73659?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"直流摩擦纳米发电机","kp":["[器件]: 准栅极电极增强DC-TENG"],"as":"研究提出利用准栅极电极调控静电放电的新策略，显著提升了直流摩擦纳米发电机（DC-TENG）的机械能收集性能。该方案通过精确控制电荷转移过程，解决了DC-TENG输出不稳定的关键瓶颈，为自驱动系统和可穿戴电子设备供能提供了新途径。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Regulating Electrostatic Discharge via Quasi‐gate Electrode for High‐Performance Direct‐current Triboelectric Nanogenera","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Direct‐current triboelectric nanogenerators (DC‐TENGs) are promising for mechanical energy harvesting but are often hindered by incomplete charge collection and parasitic discharge pathways. Herein, inspired by the operating characteristics of depletion‐mode field‐effect transistors, we propose a quasi‐gate‐electrode enhanced DC‐TENG (QGED‐TENG). The QGED‐TENG employs a back‐side quasi‐gate‐electrode (QGE) and porous polytetrafluoroethylene film to modulate electrostatic breakdown and charge leakage, thereby effectively suppressing parasitic discharge. The QGED‐TENG enables direction‐contingent enhancement and depletion modes without external bias, notably delivering a 1.41‐fold output charge increase in enhancement mode compared to the device without the QGE. Furthermore, by leveraging redistributed electric fields and parallel discharge pathways, the multi‐unit architecture achieves a linear charge increase relative to the number of units. Benefiting from the synergistic effects of electrostatic breakdown, charge leakage, and electric field redistribution within the multi‐unit configuration, an optimized rotational QGED‐TENG achieved an ultrahigh average power density of 25 W m\n                    −2\n                    Hz\n                    −1\n                    and an output charge density of 13.65 mC m\n                    −2\n                    at 60 rpm, setting a new benchmark for the porous triboelectric layer of electrostatic breakdown‐based DC‐TENGs. This work provides new physical insights and a general design strategy for maximizing spatial charge utilization and enabling high output performance DC‐TENG."},{"t":"人类皮质解剖学中的区域性别差异在形态基础上有所不同，并与性染色体和性别重叠。","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74274-8","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Humans show reproducible sex differences in regional cortical volume (CV), but it remains unclear how these relate to th..."},{"t":"再生巨噬细胞增强干细胞衍生的β细胞功能和植入","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed4221?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"The generation of insulin-producing, stem cell–derived β cells (SC-β cells) from human embryonic or induced pluripotent stem cells holds promise for treating type 1 diabetes. Transplantation of SC-β cells is already in clinical testing, but generating mature cells with insulin-secreting properties similar to endogenous cells has been challenging. Given that macrophages are essential for islet development, we hypothesized that they could enhance SC-β cell differentiation and function. We coaggregated autologous SC-macrophages that were either unpolarized (SC-M\n                    Unp\n                    ) or polarized to inflammatory (SC-M\n                    Inf\n                    ) or regenerative (SC-M\n                    Reg\n                    ) states during stage 7 of SC-β cell differentiation. SC-M\n                    Regs\n                    improved maturity marker expression, glucose-stimulated insulin secretion, and metabolic activity in SC-β cells. Transplantation of SC-β cells coaggregated with SC-M\n                    Regs\n                    into diabetic mice normalized glycemia significantly faster than transplantation of SC-β cells alone. The finding that addition of macrophages during SC-β differentiation accelerates functional maturation represents a notable advance in the production of SC-β cells as a regenerative cell therapy for type 1 diabetes."},{"t":"降低聚阴离子基团中P-O键共价性以提高钠正极材料本征电子电导率","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74282-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚阴离子钠正极","kp":["[设计策略]: 定向降低X-O键共价性","[材料体系]: 聚阴离子XO4正极","[目标提升]: 本征电子导电性与倍率性能"],"as":"研究提出通过降低聚阴离子基团中P-O键的共价性来提升正极材料的本征电子电导率。该策略优化了XO4四面体的电子结构，改善了聚阴离子正极在锂电池中的倍率性能和能量密度，为高性能电池材料设计提供了新思路。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Reducing P-O bond covalency in polyanionic groups to increase the intrinsic electronic conductivity in sodium positive e","b":"Polyanionic positive electrodes with XO4 (X = P, S, Si etc.) tetrahedra exhibit beneficial properties, making them cruci...","aip":1},{"t":"改造天然烯还原酶实现逆向对映选择性的脱饱和反应","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3155545?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"烯还原酶生物催化","kp":["[生物催化]: 烯还原酶逆向对映选择性脱氢"],"as":"研究通过蛋白质工程改造天然烯还原酶，使其催化去饱和反应并获得反向对映选择性，高效合成手性烯酮类化合物。该工作拓展了生物催化脱氢反应的底物范围和对映体控制能力，为药物分子和合成中间体的绿色制备提供了新工具。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Redirecting a Native Ene‐Reductase Toward Desaturation With Reverse Enantioselectivity","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chiral enones are valuable motifs in synthetic intermediates and bioactive molecules, driving significant interest in biocatalysis. Although recent enzymatic desaturation strategies for substituted cyclohexenones provide efficient and highly enantioselective synthetic routes, none offer complementary stereoselectivity. To address this gap, we introduce a stereocomplementary biocatalytic system based on an old yellow enzyme (OYE), XenA from\n                    Pseudomonas putida\n                    . Although XenA natively catalyzes the reduction of electron‐deficient alkenes and exhibits negligible desaturation activity, protein engineering redirected its catalytic function toward desaturation, ultimately yielding a variant that accommodates a range of cyclohexanones with 85%–99%\n                    ee\n                    and 32%–98% yield. Remarkably, the optimal variant (XenA_4) possesses 46 mutations and exhibits an 11°C increase in melting temperature over the wild type. Mechanistic studies revealed that the unique dimeric structure of the enzyme is pivotal in controlling stereoselectivity by modulating the substrate‐binding orientation."},{"t":"通过包含扩展遗传字母表的三链体形成寡核苷酸识别非标准碱基对","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74375-4","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","b":"The sequence-specific recognition of double-stranded DNA by biocompatible molecules is fundamental to molecular medicine","tp":"碱基对识别","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者开发了含扩展遗传字母表的三链体形成寡核苷酸（TFO），可实现对非标准碱基对双链DNA的序列特异性识别。该策略突破了天然碱基配对限制，提高了对人工扩展基因组的靶向能力，在基因编辑、分子医学和合成生物学精准调控方面具有重要应用前景。"},{"t":"用于高通量 T 细胞筛选研究的即用型 MHC-I 纳米颗粒","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adv2687?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"MHC-I proteins present epitopic peptides to CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells to elicit multifaceted adaptive immune responses. The affinity and avidity of interactions between peptide-MHC molecules and their cognate T cell receptors (TCRs) are fundamental parameters that contribute to the induction of activated or anergic T cell states. Here, we present a multivalent, loadable platform, VLP-Open HLA, featuring a virus-like particle (VLP) which can display up to 60 peptide/HLA [human leukocyte antigen (HLA)] molecules. VLP-Open HLA can be used to stain antigen-specific CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells, providing a screening tool for orphan TCRs. When combined with costimulation, VLP-Open HLA acts as an artificial antigen-presenting platform to induce antigen-specific T cell activation and expansion, providing a facile alternative to autologous antigen-presenting cells. Our platform can be adapted to encompass multiple HLA allotypes and costimulatory molecules as mosaic nanoparticles, enabling a range of applications in experimental immunology."},{"t":"含PNCNP钳形配体的d2 Mo(IV)烷叉基片段对炔烃的反应性：配位与催化活性研究","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4887237?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钼炔烃复分解","kp":["[催化剂类型]: d²Mo(IV)烷叉基配合物","[配体]: PNCNP钳形配体","[突破意义]: 突破d⁰Schrock型催化剂垄断"],"dp":1,"as":"研究考察了带有PNCNP钳形配体的d2构型Mo(IV)烷叉基络合物对炔烃复分解反应的活性。不同于传统d0 Schrock型催化剂，该低价钼体系为炔烃复分解催化机制提供了新的实验证据，推动了对非经典炔烃复分解催化剂的理解。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Reactivity of a d2 Mo(IV) Alkylidyne Fragment Bearing a PNCNP Pincer Ligand Toward Alkynes: Coordination and Catalytic A","b":"ABSTRACT Currently, almost all alkyne metathesis catalysts are based on high valent d 0 Schrock‐type alkylidyne complexe...","aip":1},{"t":"通过单向末端π延伸和优化烷基支化位点进行合理不对称受体工程","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73646?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池受体","kp":["[分子工程]: 单向端基π延伸+烷基支链优化","[电池类型]: 二元有机太阳能电池","[核心优化]: 低非辐射能量损失与长激子扩散"],"dp":1,"as":"研究通过单向末端π扩展策略对非富勒烯小分子受体进行理性不对称工程调控，有效降低了非辐射能量损失。该分子设计策略提升了有机太阳能电池的开路电压和光电转换效率，为高效有机光伏材料开发提供了系统化指导。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Rational Asymmetric Acceptor Engineering via Unidirectional Terminal π‐Extension and Optimizing Alkyl Branching Sites Af","b":"ABSTRACT Ingenious molecular engineering of small‐molecule acceptors (SMAs) with low nonradiative energy loss (Δ E 3 ) a..."},{"t":"单原子空间演化中的量子芝诺效应","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74332-1","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","b":"The quantum Zeno effect (QZE) reveals that frequent measurements can suppress quantum evolution; however, the impact of","tp":"量子芝诺效","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者在单原子空间演化中实验验证了量子芝诺效应（QZE），即频繁量子测量可抑制系统状态演化。该工作揭示了测量频率对单原子量子动力学的影响机制，对理解量子测量基本原理和开发高保真量子信息处理、量子控制技术具有基础性意义。"},{"t":"可电离药物对 siRNA 络合的定量预测使其能够在纳米颗粒中共传递","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed2731?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The ionizable lipid in lipid nanoparticles can be replaced with ionizable drugs to encapsulate small interfering RNA (siRNA) and allow intracellular codelivery. We wondered whether we could develop a predictive model to aid in formulation design. A small-scale screening assay was designed to evaluate siRNA complexation by ionizable drugs at low pH and validated experimentally with ionizable drug nanoparticle (IDNP) formulations. We found that siRNA complexation could be predicted by drug hydrophobicity, aromaticity, proximity of nitrogen and oxygen atoms to aromatic rings, and a machine learning model using five molecular descriptors encoding pharmacophore and structural information. For complexing drugs, siRNA encapsulation efficiency in IDNPs was related to hydrophobicity, molar refractivity, chiral centers, hydrogen bond donors, and topological charge. Netarsudil was predicted to encapsulate siRNA at high efficiency and was thus tested experimentally with siRNA targeting connective tissue growth factor (\n                    CTGF\n                    ) in fibrotic human trabecular meshwork cells: Reduced\n                    CTGF\n                    mRNA expression and actin network density were observed. These predictive tools may unlock combination therapies."},{"t":"量化深能级缺陷主导的退化以实现商用钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73679?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池缺陷降解","kp":["[降解主因]: 深能级I_FA和I_Pb缺陷"],"as":"钙钛矿太阳能电池的商业化受限于稳定性问题，其根源在于深能级缺陷主导的降解机制尚不清晰。该研究建立了深能级缺陷的定量表征方法，明确了主导降解的缺陷类型及其能级分布，为钝化缺陷、提升器件长期稳定性提供了量化依据和工程指导。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quantifying Deep‐Level Defects‐Dominated Degradation for Commercially Viable Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The unclear mechanisms and dominant types of defects causing degradation hinder the stability of perovskite solar cells, leading to increased operating costs and limiting their commercialization. In this study, we identify deep‐level I\n                    FA\n                    and I\n                    Pb\n                    defects as the primary cause of device degradation based on quantitative analysis of capacitance‐frequency spectra combined with detailed balance theory, although the concentrations are lower than those of commonly believed shallow‐level defects by three orders of magnitude. To mitigate these issues, we design a non‐intercalary ligand coordination strategy through dual‐end electropositive 3TU\n                    2+\n                    ions, which effectively passivated the degradation‐induced deep‐level defects. This approach results in a significant improvement in quasi‐Fermi level splitting alignment, reducing energy loss at the rear interface by an order of magnitude (from 1.46% to 0.62%). In addition to achieving a certified efficiency of 25.56%, our devices demonstrate an extrapolated\n                    T\n                    80\n                    lifetime exceeding 10 years, as per the ISOS‐LC‐1 protocol. This improvement reduces the levelized cost of energy to 0.148$ kWh\n                    −1\n                    , on par with silicon photovoltaics, thus enhancing the commercial viability of perovskite solar cells.","aip":1},{"t":"质子化触发层间氮化碳解锁实现纳米片的快速制备","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9245386?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氮化碳纳米片制备","kp":["剥离策略[g-C3N4]: 质子化触发静电解耦层间"],"dp":1,"as":"石墨相氮化碳（g-C3N4）因层间强相互作用导致其拓扑与电子优势被掩盖。该研究提出质子化触发层间解锁策略，削弱层间氢键和范德华力，实现快速纳米片剥离，大幅提升比表面积和光生载流子分离效率，在光催化产氢等领域展现出优异性能。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Protonation‐Triggered Unlocking of Interlayer Carbon Nitride for Rapid Nanosheet Preparation","b":"ABSTRACT The intrinsic topological and electronic merits of graphitic carbon nitride (g‑C 3 N 4 ) are fundamentally obsc"},{"t":"通过表面单原子工程调控绝缘材料的绝缘体-金属输运特性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73723?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子绝缘体金属化","kp":["[工程策略]: 表面单原子工程","[目标特性]: 绝缘体中可重构金属类输运"],"dp":1,"as":"绝缘材料中可重构的电子态能够在保留本征绝缘性的同时实现类金属输运。该研究通过表面工程手段编程调控绝缘体的绝缘体-金属输运转变，揭示了表面电荷注入或缺陷工程对能带结构的调控机制，为新型可重构电子器件、神经形态计算及传感器件开辟了路径。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Programming Insulator‐to‐Metallic Transport in Insulating Materials via Surface Single‐Atom Engineering","b":"ABSTRACT Reconfigurable electronic states in insulating materials enable metal‐like transport while preserving the intri","aip":1},{"t":"利用园区级配电网的拓扑灵活性主动缓解电压波动","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008020?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"园区配电网电压调控","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Proactive mitigation of voltage volatility via topological flexibility in park-level distribution networks"},{"t":"基于原始黑洞的小红点路径","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6y1w-87pd","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Valerio De Luca, Loris Del Grosso, Gabriele Franciolini, Konstantinos Kritos, Emanuele Berti, Daniel J. D’Orazio, and Joseph SilkThe James Webb Space Telescope has uncovered a population of compact, high-redshift sources, the Little Red Dots (LRDs), which may host supermassive black holes (BHs) significantly heavier than their stellar content compared with local scaling relations. These objects challenge standard models of ea…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231402] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"固体表面上分子吸附物的预测登记优化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1693717?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT Understanding and predicting how large organic molecules adsorb on crystalline substrates is essential for desi"},{"t":"金属有机框架中通道内负电荷密度的精确调控以实现高效碱金属离子输运","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7827578?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF离子传导","kp":["负电荷密度[MOF通道]: 中性/中/高三档可调","离子电导率[碱金属离子MOF]: 电荷密度依赖"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种精确调控金属有机框架（MOFs）荷电纳米通道内负电荷密度的策略。荷电纳米通道对MOFs中高效阳离子传输至关重要，但精确控制通道内电荷密度一直缺乏有效手段。作者通过在MOF孔道壁引入特定官能团或配位位点，系统调节负电荷分布，优化阳离子选择性传输性能。该调控方法提升了MOFs在离子分离、盐差能收集与固态电解质等应用中的离子电导率与选择性，为设计高性能荷电多孔材料提供了分子级工程手段。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Precise Regulation of Intrachannel Negative Charge Density in Metal‐Organic Frameworks for Efficient Alkali‐Ion Transpor","b":"ABSTRACT Charged nanochannels are critical for efficient cation transport in metal‐organic frameworks (MOFs); however, t..."},{"t":"极性纳米区域使金属 PtCoO2 具有大自旋霍尔电导率","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02640-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","b":"Spin-source materials for spintronic devices are required to convert charge currents into spin currents efficiently and","tp":"自旋霍尔导","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现极性纳米区域使金属铂钴氧化物PtCoO2展现出异常大的自旋霍尔电导率。该材料中极性结构破缺诱导的自旋-轨道耦合增强效应，使其能高效将电荷电流转化为自旋电流，为开发低功耗、高性能自旋电子器件提供了理想的自旋源候选材料。"},{"t":"用于磷酸酶和磷酸裂合酶深度特异性分析的磷酸蛋白质组衍生肽文库","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523183123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Protein phosphorylation is dynamically regulated by the opposing activities of phosphowriter enzymes (kinases) and phosphoeraser enzymes (phosphatases and phospholyases). While significant progress has been made toward defining the sequence preferences of kinases, the selectivity of phosphoerasers has not been explored at scale. Here, we develop an experimental platform based on tandem mass spectrometry analysis of phosphoproteome-derived peptide libraries (PhosPropels) to map phosphoeraser activity across thousands of biologically relevant phosphosites. We extract positional residue preferences to rapidly define sequence motifs recognized by eight phosphoerasers spanning diverse species of origin, protein folds, and enzymatic mechanisms, yielding biological insights into pathways targeted by these enzymes. Taking advantage of the throughput of our approach, we profiled 20 variants of the phosphothreonine lyase OspF from\n                    \n                      Shigella\n                      flexneri\n                    \n                    , uncovering an intrinsic preference for p38 and Erk MAP kinase activation loops and revealing the enzyme residues that influence its selectivity for phosphothreonine. Our results establish a general method for linking phosphorylation sites to the enzymes that remove them, providing a means to dissect a key component of cellular regulatory networks."},{"t":"苝二酰亚胺衍生的双（大环）配体通过直接 Bay-Region Pall 提供手性多核 Pd(II) 配合物","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8176990?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT Macrocyclic ligands provide powerful access to structurally defined multi‐metallic architectures, yet direct π‐..."},{"t":"钯单原子掺杂Cu3Co量子点优化氢化动力学用于铝-硝酸根原电池","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8420715?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/一次电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铝硝酸盐电池","kp":["催化剂[硝酸盐电池]: Pd单原子掺杂Cu3Co量子点","[铝-硝酸盐原电池]: 同步产电与降解污染物"],"dp":1,"as":"研究合成了钯单原子掺杂的Cu3Co量子点，作为硝酸根电池（nitrate battery）正极材料，实现发电与污染物降解双重功能。钯单原子的引入优化了硝酸盐还原反应的氢化动力学，降低了反应能垒，提升了电池的能量转换效率与稳定性。该体系为同时处理含氮废水污染和能量回收提供了新思路，在环境治理与能源存储交叉领域具有前景。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pd Single‐Atom‐Doped Cu3Co Quantum Dots With Optimized Hydrogenation Kinetics for Versatile Aluminum‐Nitrate Primary Bat","b":"ABSTRACT The rational design of nitrate batteries enabling simultaneous electricity generation and pollutant degradation...","aip":1},{"t":"可持续能源系统的帕累托最优路径","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008299?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源系统优化","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"晶胞内对称性破缺系统中向列超导的对密度调制","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74221-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","b":"Pair density modulation is a phenomenon recently observed in exfoliated flakes of iron-based superconductors, in which t","tp":"超导对密度调制","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者在晶胞内对称性破缺的系统中观测到向列超导态伴随的对密度调制现象。此前该现象仅在铁基超导体剥离薄片中观察到，新研究将其拓展至更广泛对称性破缺体系，为理解非常规超导配对机制、电子向列序与超导的耦合提供了新实验证据和理论视角。","aip":1},{"t":"PMDS-UNet：高分辨率遥感影像中分布式光伏精确分割的新方法","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008834?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"分布式光伏分割","dp":1,"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"PMDS-UNet: A novel approach for precise segmentation of distributed photovoltaics in high-resolution remote sensing imag"},{"t":"PAR3 介导的肝细胞增殖、成熟和结构在肝脏发育和再生过程中的协调","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73856-w","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"The liver’s ability to coordinate cell proliferation, polarization, and maturation with architectural assembly is fundam..."},{"t":"Ozempic 和类似药物与成瘾率急剧下降有关","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/?p=522252","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Researchers identified a strong association between GLP-1 medications and reduced rates of multiple substance use disorders, raising new questions about how these drugs may affect the brain’s reward system.\nWhat if some of the world’s most popular weight loss drugs are affecting more than appetite?\nA new study suggests that GLP-1 medications, a class of drugs that includes Ozempic, may be linked to substantially lower rates of several substance use disorders. The findings add to growing interest in the possibility that these medications influence the brain’s reward system, an effect that could extend beyond eating behavior.\nResearchers at The University of Texas at El Paso analyzed health data from more than 142,000 people with type 2 diabetes or obesity. Roughly 20,000 of those patients had been prescribed a GLP-1 medication. The team compared them with similar individuals who were not taking the drugs to determine whether rates of substance use disorders differed between the groups.\nTheir findings, published in\nFrontiers in Psychiatry\n, revealed a consistent pattern: GLP-1 users were significantly less likely to be diagnosed with alcohol, opioid, nicotine, or cocaine use disorders.\n“Our findings add to growing evidence that GLP-1 medications may influence more than appetite and blood sugar regulation,” said lead author Abegaz. “These medications appear to affect brain pathways involved in reward and craving, which could help explain the lower rates of substance use disorders observed in our study.”\nCompared with similar patients who were not taking GLP-1 medications, users showed:\nThe researchers stressed that the findings show an association, not proof that GLP-1 medications prevent substance misuse or addiction.\n“We do not support prescribing these medications for addiction treatment at this time, Frietze said. “Because this was an observational study in a specific clinical population, randomized clinical trials are needed before GLP-1 medications can be recommended for treating addiction.”\nThe team said the results are encouraging and plans to further investigate how GLP-1 medications may influence substance use disorders.\n“Our next goal is to conduct prospective research that follows individuals initiating GLP-1 therapy over time,” Abegaz said. “We aim to evaluate whether changes in the substance use behaviors occur after treatment begins and whether these changes related to improvements in mental health and quality of life.\nHe added, “Ultimately, this work will help inform whether GLP-1 medications could become part of future treatment strategies for substance use disorders.”\nReference: “Association between GLP-1 receptor agonist use and substance use disorders among individuals with type 2 diabetes or obesity: a nested case-control study in the All of Us research program” by Tadesse M. Melaku Abegaz, Muktar Ahmed, Akshaya Srikanth S Bhagavathula and Gabriel Frietze, 18 February 2026,\nFrontiers in Psychiatry\nDOI: 10.3389/fpsyt.2026.1766770\nPatient data for this study was provided by the\nNational Institutes of Health\nAll of Us Research program, one of the nation’s largest and most diverse health databases.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nPublic Health\nUniversity of Texas\nThis Popular Diabetes Drug Could Reduce Cravings for Alcohol and Drugs\nScientists Discover Amazing New Benefit of Ozempic: Reducing Alcohol and Opioid Addiction\nWastewater Analyzed to Map International Drug Use – Here Are the Shocking Results\nFinancial Incentives Influence Doctors Alcohol Advice to Patients\nA Lethal Dose for $1 – Fentanyl’s Risk on the ‘Darknet’\nStemming the Opioid Crisis: New Addiction Treatments Hold Promise\nYoung, White, Daily Opioid Users More Likely to Prefer Fentanyl\nMedications Can Help As Opioid Treatment for Teens\nTeens Abusing Opioids May Benefit From Medication Treatment"},{"t":"催产素通过增强生长抑素中间神经元介导的局部 GABA 能抑制来减弱恐惧学习","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef8400?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Acute stress exposure can trigger post–traumatic stress disorder (PTSD). Prophylactic interventions may enhance psychological resilience against PTSD in high-risk occupations. Here, we demonstrate that pretreating with intranasal oxytocin exerts prolonged yet reversible attenuation of fear learning via oxytocin receptors (OxtRs) expressed in prelimbic cortex (PL). Crucially, both local PL oxytocin infusion and selective activation of PL OxtR+ neurons recapitulate this fear reduction. Although OxtRs are expressed on pyramidal and somatostatin (SST) neurons, SST interneurons exhibit higher\n                    Oxtr\n                    expression. Both fear conditioning and oxytocin application preferentially excite PL OxtR+ SST interneurons. Accordingly, preactivating OxtR+ SST neurons, but not OxtR+ pyramidal neurons, elicits the reduction effect on fear learning. Ablating\n                    Oxtr\n                    in γ-aminobutyric acid (GABA) neurons or silencing SST interneurons abolishes oxytocin’s fear-attenuating effects. Mechanistically, OxtR+ SST interneuron activation or oxytocin application potentiates GABAergic synaptic transmission onto PL pyramidal neurons. Collectively, these findings establish that oxytocin attenuates fear learning by enhancing local inhibitory circuits in PL, revealing a potential therapeutic approach for reducing PTSD risk."},{"t":"通过表面重构实现富锂锰基层状氧化物中阴离子氧化还原的轨道稳定化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6797493?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂富锰基层状氧化物","kp":["[策略]: 表面重构稳定阴离子氧化还原"],"as":"锂富层状氧化物因同时利用阳离子和阴离子氧化还原反应而具有高容量，但阴离子氧化还原常导致不可逆相变和电压衰减。该研究通过表面重构策略稳定阴离子氧化还原轨道，抑制氧气释放和结构退化，从而提升富锂正极材料的循环稳定性与可逆容量，为高能量密度锂电池正极设计提供了新思路。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Orbital Stabilization of Anionic Redox via Surface Restructuration for Li‐Rich Mn‐Based Layered Oxides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium‐rich layered oxides are renowned for their high capacity, originating from both cationic and anionic redox reactions. However, the anionic redox process often induces the formation of O–O dimers, triggering oxygen release and transition metal migration that typically initiate at the particle surface and lead to progressive structural degradation and performance decay. In this study, we report a lithium‐rich manganese‐based layered oxide cathode featuring a surface reconstruction layer in which nickel ions occupy the 4 h Wyckoff sites within the Li\n                    2\n                    MnO\n                    3\n                    phase. This surface‐site‐specific nickel occupation induces parallel alignment of electron‐depleted O 2p orbitals, effectively suppressing the formation of unstable O–O dimers and inhibiting oxygen release. The engineered cathode delivers a remarkable reversible capacity of 325 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 0.1C (20 mA g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ), along with an outstanding rate capability of 272.8 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 1C (200 mA g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ) and 90% capacity retention after 300 cycles. This surface engineering strategy establishes a novel structural response mechanism for oxygen redox reactions, enabling the simultaneous achievement of high capacity and long‐term cycling stability. The findings provide critical insights for the development of advanced high‐energy‐density cathode materials."},{"t":"考虑潮汐扰动的离网多部门区域综合能源系统优化与收益分配","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008287?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"孤网能源优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Optimization and revenue allocation of off-grid multi-sector regional integrated energy systems considering tidal distur"},{"t":"带相反电荷的单酶纳米凝胶形成多功能凝聚层以实现高效酶级联催化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73688?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶级联催化纳米凝胶","kp":["[体系]: 异电单酶纳米凝胶凝聚体"],"as":"该研究构建了带相反电荷的单酶纳米凝胶，使其自发形成多功能的凝聚液滴（coacervates），用于高效级联生物催化。这种仿生策略模拟细胞内多酶代谢通路，将酶封装于无膜人工细胞器中，显著提升级联反应中间体传递效率与催化活性，在生物合成与生物传感领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Oppositely Charged Single Enzyme Nanogels Form Versatile Coacervates for Efficient Enzyme Cascade Catalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Enzymatic cascade systems enhance the efficiency of biocatalysis by mimicking natural metabolic pathways. However, conventional platforms face challenges such as ineffective enzyme distribution, uncontrolled stoichiometry, limited substrate accessibility, and a microenvironment that is suboptimal for enzyme performance. Inspired by cellular biomolecular condensates, we here present a design based on oppositely charged single enzyme nanogels (SENs) that phase separate into denser microdroplet coacervates, which thereby serve both as an immobilization scaffold and functional unit. These coacervates, the first fabricated exclusively from oppositely charged nanogels, form under broad environmental conditions and enable specific microenvironments by adjusting SEN ratios to match the requirements of coupled enzymes. Selective substrate enrichment and efficient diffusion of intermediates enhance cascade productivity. The applicability of the platform is demonstrated with pharmaceutically relevant enzymes, highlighting its potential for biosynthetic applications. This work establishes a new paradigm that integrates protein‐polymer engineering with phase separation chemistry to overcome key limitations in cascade enzyme catalysis."},{"t":"通过原位透射电子显微镜工况识别阴离子对锂成核与生长的影响","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74340-1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属负极","kp":["方法[锂负极]: 原位TEM观测阴离子对形核影响"],"dp":1,"as":"锂金属电池因高比容量被视为下一代储能方向，但锂枝晶生长严重制约其安全性与循环寿命。该研究利用原位/工况表征技术揭示电解液中阴离子对锂成核与生长过程的影响机制，为设计抑制枝晶的电解液配方、实现均匀致密的锂沉积提供实验依据与理论指导。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Operando identification of anion effect on lithium nucleation and growth via in situ transmission electron microscopy","b":"Lithium metal batteries are considered promising candidates for next-generation energy storage due to the high capacity"},{"t":"OpenAI 受到州总检察长关于用户交互的调查","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/openai-investigated-state-attorneys-general-user-interaction","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","tg":"政策监管","b":"OpenAI Investigated by State Attorneys General on User Interaction — The Information Read this briefing for free","tp":"AI监管调查","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":2.0,"t":8.5},"as":"美国多个州总检察长对OpenAI展开调查，重点审视其与用户的交互行为及数据处理方式。调查涉及用户隐私保护、内容安全等关切，反映出监管机构对大型AI公司用户数据处理和交互透明度的日益严格审视，可能对AI行业合规实践产生深远影响。"},{"t":"片上二次非线性光电探测器","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74291-7","c":"不相关","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","b":"Involving deterministically nonlinear photoresponse in on-chip photodetector is intriguing to develop sophisticated func"},{"t":"通过表型组学-环境组学串扰进行组学驱动的植物育种","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73097-x","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"Genomics, including all molecular omics, is driven by molecular data, while phenomics and enviromics rely on phenotypic"},{"t":"交替磁体中可切换手性磁振子的观察","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/m8lc-f8gk","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Zheyuan Liu, Hodaka Kikuchi, Zijun Wei, Shinichiro Asai, Mechthild Enderle, Ursula B. Hansen, Vasile O. Garlea, Manh D. Le, Gøran J. Nilsen, Igor A. Zaliznyak, and Takatsugu MasudaPolarized inelastic neutron scattering gives the first unambiguous evidence of chirality of the split magnon bands in altermagnetic MnTe.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236705] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","tp":"磁振子手性","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.5,"r":7.5,"d":8.5,"t":6.0},"as":"利用极化非弹性中子散射技术，研究人员首次在交替磁性MnTe中观测到分裂磁振子带具有手性的明确证据。交替磁体是一种新型磁性材料，兼具铁磁体和反铁磁体的特性。该发现对理解手性磁振子的物理机制具有重要意义，有望推动自旋电子学和量子信息处理等领域的应用开发。","aip":1},{"t":"硝酸盐-唾液酸蛋白2轴将内质网线粒体钙信号传导与脂肪酸代谢结合起来，驱动白色脂肪布朗尼","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74256-w","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"White adipose browning is a promising route to restore energy balance; however, how inorganic anion signals engage intra..."},{"t":"新的有羽毛恐龙可能解开了1.2亿年前的化石之谜","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/new-feathered-dinosaur-may-have-solved-a-120-million-year-old-fossil-mystery/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A newly discovered feathered dinosaur from China may help solve a long-standing mystery surrounding a fossil bed filled with ancient bird remains.\nFor years, one fossil site in northwestern China has posed a mystery. The area contains hundreds of fossilized birds, many remarkably well preserved. Mixed among them are strange clusters of shattered bones compressed into pellet-like masses, much like the regurgitated remains left behind by modern birds of prey. Scientists suspected a predator was responsible, but the culprit was nowhere to be found.\nNow, researchers believe they have finally uncovered the missing piece of the puzzle.\nIn a study published in the\nAnnals of Carnegie Museum\n, paleontologists describe a newly identified dinosaur,\nJian changmaensis\n, a feathered relative of\nVelociraptor\n. Although the fossil consists of only partial remains, the animal stands out as the only known non-avian carnivorous dinosaur recovered from the site. Its discovery offers the strongest evidence yet for the predator that may have hunted the ancient birds whose remains dominate the fossil bed.\n“Scientists have found these weird, broken-up clusters of bird bones at this site, and we didn’t know what made them. This new microraptor dinosaur,\nJian changmaensis\n, is our best guess,” says Jingmai O’Connor, the associate curator of fossil reptiles at the Field Museum in Chicago and senior author of the paper describing the new\n. “It’s the only dinosaur found at this site that wasn’t a bird, it was a carnivore, and it was much bigger than everything else that we’ve found there.”\nBirds are the only dinosaurs that survived the aftermath of the asteroid impact that struck Earth 66 million years ago. Before that event, birds lived alongside many other dinosaur groups throughout the\nAmong their closest relatives were dromaeosaurs, feathered dinosaurs that were generally small and agile. The\nVelociraptor\nmade famous by Jurassic Park is one of the best-known members of this group, although real\nVelociraptor\nspecimens were smaller and much more heavily feathered than their movie portrayals.\nThe newly identified species,\nJian changmaensis\n, belongs to a subgroup of dromaeosaurs known as microraptors. Most microraptors were relatively small, with some species reaching only about the size of a crow.\nis one of the biggest microraptor specimens that has ever been found,” says O’Connor. “The piece of its upper arm bone that we have is about 4 inches long, so the entire dinosaur probably had something like a four-foot wingspan, around the size of a barn owl.”\nAlthough researchers have recovered only part of\narm, they think it likely resembled other microraptors, which had long feathers on both their arms and legs. This gave them the appearance of having four wings that may have helped them glide through the air.\nand the other microraptors probably weren’t capable of true, powered flight, but they could probably glide like a flying squirrel,” says O’Connor.\nJian changmaensis\nreflects both the animal’s appearance and where it was discovered. Jian is a winged creature from Chinese mythology, while changmaensis refers to the Changma Basin in China’s Gansu Province, where the fossil was found.\nJian changmaensis\nreveals that non-avian dinosaurs lived in what is now the Changma Basin, an area famous for its fossil birds,” says Matt Lamanna, corresponding author of the study and Carnegie Museum of Natural History’s Mary R. Dawson Curator of Vertebrate Paleontology and senior dinosaur researcher. “Our team has recovered more than a hundred bird fossils at Changma, but only this single non-avian dinosaur specimen.\nprovides critical new insight into the biological history of the Changma region and the ecological context of the ancestors of today’s birds.”\n“You cannot understand life on the planet today without looking at its origins,” says O’Connor. “Birds are arguably the most successful group of land-dwelling vertebrate animals on Earth today. Learning about early birds and their close non-bird dinosaur relatives gives us a better understanding of what made the group of birds that survived so special.”\n“First Non-Avian Theropod (Dromaeosauridae, Microraptorinae) From the Bird-Bearing Lower Cretaceous Xiagou Formation of the Changma Basin, Gansu Province, Northwestern China”\nAnnals of Carnegie Museum\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nField Museum\nPaleontology\nBrawn Before Brains: Mammals Bulked Up To Survive Post-Dinosaur World\nDense Bones Allowed Spinosaurus – The Biggest Carnivorous Dinosaur Ever Discovered – To Hunt Underwater\n“Baby Yingliang” – Exquisitely Preserved Dinosaur Embryo Discovered Inside Oviraptorosaur Egg\nExquisitely Preserved Dinosaur Embryo Found Inside Fossilized Oviraptorosaur Egg\nLegendary Flying Reptile: Fleshing Out the Bones of Quetzalcoatlus, Earth’s Largest Flier Ever\nIncredible Dinosaur Treasure Trove in Italy Rewrites History, Geography, and Evolution\nSurprising Diversity of Cretaceous Reptiles at Argentina Fossil Site – Revealed by Discovery of Ancient Teeth\nGrowth Rings From Fossil Bones Reveals T. rex Had Huge Growth Spurts, but Other Dinosaurs Grew “Slow and Steady”\nMIT’s New Evidence on Dinosaur Evolution"},{"t":"新发现揭示了维生素 K 在预防骨质流失方面的惊人作用","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/new-discovery-reveals-vitamin-ks-surprising-role-in-preventing-bone-loss/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A newly identified vitamin K-dependent signaling pathway appears to help coordinate communication between key bone cells.\nBones may seem like lifeless structures, but they are constantly being torn down and rebuilt. Every day, specialized cells remove old bone while others replace it with new material, a process that keeps the skeleton strong and adaptable throughout life. When this delicate balance shifts too far in one direction, bones can gradually weaken, raising the risk of fractures and diseases such as osteoporosis.\nFor decades, vitamin K has been recognized as an important nutrient for bone health. Yet scientists have struggled to explain exactly how it helps maintain the skeleton. Now, researchers have uncovered an unexpected communication system inside bone that may provide an answer. Their findings suggest that vitamin K does far more than support bone mineralization. It also helps control how bone cells coordinate the breakdown and renewal of skeletal tissue.\nA team led by Dr. Mathieu Ferron, Director of the Molecular Physiology Research Unit at the Montreal Clinical Research Institute (IRCM) in Canada, investigated how vitamin K-dependent γ-carboxylation influences interactions between osteoblasts (bone-forming cells) and osteoclasts (bone-resorbing cells). Using genetically engineered mice, cell culture experiments, molecular analyses, histology, and microcomputed tomography imaging, the researchers identified a previously unknown pathway that helps regulate bone resorption. Their study was published in\nBone Research\nThe researchers began by studying the enzymes involved in vitamin K-dependent γ-carboxylation. They found that γ-glutamyl carboxylase and vitamin K oxidoreductase were expressed mainly in osteoblasts rather than osteoclasts, suggesting that vitamin K signaling primarily acts through bone-forming cells.\nTo test this idea, the team removed γ-glutamyl carboxylase specifically from osteoblasts in male mice. By 6 months of age, the animals had developed substantially greater bone mass, along with denser and more interconnected bone structures.\nFurther investigation showed that the increase in bone mass was largely the result of reduced bone breakdown rather than increased bone formation. Mice lacking γ-glutamyl carboxylase in osteoblasts had fewer osteoclasts and less osteoclast surface area. Blood markers associated with bone resorption were also lower. In co-culture experiments, osteoblasts without γ-glutamyl carboxylase were much less capable of supporting osteoclast development.\nThe team then searched for a γ-carboxylated protein that could connect osteoblast activity to osteoclast development. Their analysis identified growth arrest-specific 6 (GAS6), a signaling protein released by osteoblasts that activates the TAM family receptors AXL and MerTK on pre-osteoclasts.\nLaboratory experiments showed that recombinant γ-carboxylated GAS6 strongly stimulated osteoclast formation and increased the number of nuclei within each osteoclast, creating larger multinucleated cells with greater bone-resorbing capacity. Blocking AXL and MerTK with drugs significantly reduced osteoclast production, confirming the central role of the GAS6-TAM signaling pathway.\n“Our findings reveal an unexpected mechanism through which osteoblasts actively regulate osteoclast maturation,” says Dr. Ferron. “Vitamin K-dependent γ-carboxylation not only affects bone mineralization. It also controls how osteoblasts communicate with osteoclast precursors through GAS6 signaling.”\nTo determine whether higher GAS6 levels could directly influence bone remodeling in vivo, the researchers studied transgenic mice with elevated circulating GAS6. These mice showed the opposite pattern, with lower bone density, more osteoclasts, and increased bone resorption.\nAdditional experiments revealed that GAS6 primarily promotes the fusion of pre-osteoclasts into mature multinucleated osteoclasts rather than affecting the earlier process of osteoclast differentiation.\n“The study provides a new framework for understanding how vitamin K influences skeletal biology,” Dr. Ferron explains. “Targeting GAS6 or TAM receptor signaling could eventually help modulate excessive bone resorption while preserving normal bone remodeling.”\nThe findings could have important medical implications. Over time, a better understanding of the GAS6-TAM signaling axis may help support the development of treatments for osteoporosis and other diseases driven by excessive osteoclast activity.\nOverall, the study uncovers a previously unknown vitamin K-dependent mechanism that allows osteoblasts to regulate osteoclast maturation and bone resorption. By identifying GAS6 as a key signaling link between these two cell types, the research provides new insight into how bone balance is maintained and points to potential new strategies for treating bone fragility and metabolic bone disorders.\nReference: “Vitamin K-dependent carboxylation in osteoblasts regulates bone resorption through GAS6 in male mice” by Monica Pata, Diep Ngoc Thi Pham, Julie Lacombe, B. Ashok Reddy, Young Woong Kim, Abeer Gamal Ali Ahmed, Monzur Murshed and Mathieu Ferron, 28 April 2026,\nBone Research\nDOI: 10.1038/s41413-026-00528-2\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nMolecular Biology\nOsteoporosis\nCould Getting Enough Sleep Help Prevent Osteoporosis?\nA Simple Pinch May Predict Spinal Fractures: Arm Fat’s Surprising Role in Bone Quality and Strength\nTiny Changes, Big Benefits: Simple Lifestyle Changes Are Vital for Preventing Hip Fractures\nSpace-Age Solution: Preventing Astronaut Bone Loss With Innovative Compound\nObstructive Sleep Apnea Tied to Weaker Bones and Teeth in Adults\nNew Pill Replicates Exercise and Strengthens Muscle\nNew Treatment Target Could Counter Bone Loss\nStudy Finds Vitamin D Supplements Do Not Reduce Risk of Broken Bones\nSweet Coating for Sour Bones: Bridge-Burning Coating for Bone Implants"},{"t":"预计本世纪初将发生永久冻土碳融化带来的二氧化碳净释放","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz8478?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Accelerating permafrost thaw may release vast deep (&gt;3 meters) frozen soil carbon as carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ), but this magnitude remains uncertain because current Earth system models (ESMs) lack deep carbon processes. Using an updated ORCHIDEE-MICT model simulating Pleistocene Yedoma formation and Holocene peatland development, we project northern (&gt;30°N) carbon responses under climate change. Compared to the original model, including these deep carbon pools improves agreement with observations and reduces net CO\n                    2\n                    uptake by 47 to 74 petagrams of carbon from 1900 to 2100 across three future scenarios because of deep carbon decomposition with accelerated active-layer deepening. Under high-emission pathways, the northern soil carbon balance shifts from a sink to a source of 32 petagrams of carbon, advancing the reversal reported in earlier studies into the 21st century. Consistent with field data, our model shows that colder soils retain more labile carbon—contrary to assumptions in many Coupled Model Intercomparison Project (CMIP) models—helping explain their persistent sink bias. Our results highlight the need to represent both the quantity and quality of permafrost carbon in ESMs.","tp":"冻土碳释放","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"加速的永久冻土融化可能将大量深层（>3米）冻结土壤的碳以二氧化碳形式释放。由于现有的地球系统模型缺乏对深层碳过程的模拟，释放量仍存在不确定性。研究人员利用更新的ORCHIDEE-MICT模型，模拟了更新世和全新世的发育过程，并预测了气候变化下北半球深层碳的响应机制。纳入这些深层碳过程后，模型预测显示，本世纪初永久冻土的碳融化将导致二氧化碳的净释放。"},{"t":"负协同性驱动衣壳定向抗病毒药物对抗乙型肝炎病毒的活性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed6483?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Hepatitis B virus capsid protein plays a role in almost every step of viral replication, from self-assembly to genome release. This makes capsid protein an attractive target for antiviral development. Capsid assembly modulators (CAMs) are direct-acting antivirals that bind capsid protein, leading to empty or aberrant complexes instead of an infectious virus. CAMs can also disrupt the capsid, preventing new infection. To understand CAM activity, we examined the energetics of CAM-capsid interaction. We observed negative cooperativity of CAM-binding kinetics and thermodynamics. These correlate with large changes in capsid architecture that presage capsid rupture. We propose that CAMs induce an accumulated strain on the capsid. Understanding the interplay of forces and architecture will help guide the development of CAMs."},{"t":"天然 AMPA 受体结构揭示了 SynDIG4 参与和辅助亚基异质性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee7973?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"AMPA-type glutamate receptors (AMPARs) are complex assemblies whose compositional heterogeneity underlies diverse excitatory signaling in the mammalian brain. Here, we determine high-resolution cryo–electron microscopy (cryo-EM) structures of native AMPAR complexes rapidly purified from mouse brain. These structures capture receptors in physiologically relevant assemblies containing distinct combinations of transmembrane AMPA receptor regulatory protein (TARP) and cornichon homolog (CNIH) auxiliary subunits and reveal unambiguous density for the brain-specific protein SynDIG4. The resolved topology and interaction network of SynDIG4 show that it engages the receptor through a CNIH-dependent interface and occupies a position adjacent to structural elements of GluA1 implicated in trafficking and synaptic plasticity. The diversity of auxiliary stoichiometries observed across native complexes highlights a flexible organizational scheme through which AMPARs incorporate distinct regulatory partners. These findings illuminate the organization of native AMPAR assemblies and define the structural context for SynDIG4 function in the mammalian brain.","tp":"AMPA受体结构","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"AMPA型谷氨酸受体是复杂的复合体，其组成的异质性决定了哺乳动物大脑中多种兴奋性信号传导。本研究利用高分辨率冷冻电镜技术，解析了从小鼠大脑中快速纯化的天然AMPA受体复合物结构。这些结构捕获了受体在生理相关组装状态下的特征，包含跨膜AMPA受体调节蛋白（TARP）和Cornichon同源蛋白（CNIH）辅助亚基的不同组合，揭示了SynDIG4的参与及辅助亚基的异质性。"},{"t":"纳米陷阱结构缓解质子交换膜阴极催化层中的界面传质限制","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73702?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子交换膜燃料电池","kp":["[结构设计]: 碳基吡咯氮纳米陷阱"],"as":"在厚阴极催化层中，高效气体传输和充足的三相界面（TPB）对燃料电池性能至关重要。研究提出一种纳米陷阱结构，旨在缓解催化层界面处的传质限制问题，从而提升气体扩散速率与催化反应效率，改善电池输出。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Nanotrap Architectures for Mitigating Interfacial Transport Limitations in Cathode Catalyst Layers of Proton Exchange Me","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient gas transport and abundant triple‐phase boundaries (TPBs) are vital for thick cathode catalyst layers (CCLs) in proton exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs), yet remain challenging to realize. In this work, we introduce a carbon‐based nanotrap architecture functionalized with pyrrolic‐N groups, which reorganizes the Pt–carbon–ionomer interface to enhance local oxygen supply. These nanotraps simultaneously confine Pt nanoparticles and ionomer, forming continuous pathways for oxygen, protons, and electrons, thereby significantly increasing active TPB density. The underlying enhancement mechanism is validated by x‐ray tomography and 3D two‐phase flow simulations. Using a 15.5 µm‐thick CCL, the optimized electrode achieves peak power densities of 1940 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in H\n                    2\n                    /O\n                    2\n                    and 1410 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in H\n                    2\n                    /Air—improvements of ∼30% and ∼80%, respectively. Moreover, it exhibits a good stability, with a voltage decay rate of only 43.8 µV h\n                    −1\n                    at 1.5 A cm\n                    −2\n                    over 1000 h. This nanotrap concept offers a versatile interfacial design strategy for advanced gas‐diffusion electrodes in energy conversion technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"单片二硒化铂中半金属-半导体界面电荷输运的纳米尺度成像","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00236-5?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维材料界面传输","kp":["材料[2D电子学]: 单片二硒化铂(PtSe₂)","[表征]: 纳米尺度电荷输运跨半金属-半导体界面可视化"],"as":"二维半导体的电接触是下一代电子器件的核心瓶颈。本研究介绍了一种纳米尺度成像技术，用于观测半金属-半导体界面处的电荷输运过程，揭示接触电阻的微观机制。该技术有望指导接触界面优化，突破二维材料器件的性能极限。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Nanoscale imaging of charge transport across the semimetal-semiconductor interface in monolithic platinum diselenide","b":"Electrical contacts in two-dimensional semiconductors remain a key bottleneck for next-generation electronics. We introduce a method to directly visualize how electric charges flow across a monolithic semimetal-semiconductor interface formed within a single sheet of platinum diselenide, where one region is sculpted into a semiconductor while the rest remains semimetallic. The charges traverse this monolithic boundary without significant resistance, offering a versatile platform for designing low-resistance contacts in future two-dimensional electronic devices."},{"t":"纳米颗粒通过增强邻近血管的通透性到达转移性肿瘤","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02171-8","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","b":"Considering that 90% of cancer-related deaths are due to metastasis, treating micrometastases in their infancy is critic","tp":"纳米颗粒递药","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"鉴于90%的癌症死亡归因于肿瘤转移，在早期阶段治疗微转移灶对拯救患者生命至关重要。然而，现有治疗手段难以有效靶向微小肿瘤病灶。最新研究表明，特定设计的纳米颗粒能够通过增强转移性肿瘤周围邻近血管的通透性，成功穿透血管屏障并精准到达微转移灶。这一机制为纳米药物高效递送和早期根除转移性肿瘤提供了全新的治疗策略和方向。"},{"t":"纳米力学传感器解析低于零点涨落的脉冲力","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/9wzm-3qyb","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米力学量子传感","kp":["[灵敏度]: 测量低于零点涨落脉冲力"],"as":"研究团队开发了一种纳米机械传感器，能够分辨低于其零点涨落极限的脉冲力信号。该突破基于量子涨落抑制技术，将力传感灵敏度推向量子基线以下，对单分子力学探测、量子测量等前沿领域具有重要意义。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.5,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Nanomechanical Sensor Resolving Impulsive Forces below Its Zero-Point Fluctuations","b":"Author(s): Martynas Skrabulis, Martin Colombano Sosa, Nicola Carlon Zambon, Andrei Militaru, Massimiliano Rossi, Martin Frimmer, and Lukas NovotnyResearchers boosted the sensitivity for measurements of the motion of a levitated nanoparticle, with potential uses in dark matter searches.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233604] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"多尺度结构工程实现四方钨青铜弛豫铁电体的优异储能","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73829-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电储能陶瓷","kp":["能量密度[弛豫铁电]: 14.39 J/cm³","材料[铁电陶瓷]: Ba2La1-xBixTi2Nb3O15钨青铜"],"as":"无铅弛豫铁电陶瓷因超快放电和高能量密度被视为脉冲功率系统的理想材料。本研究通过多尺度结构工程调控四方相体系，显著提升了储能性能，为高性能脉冲功率电容器的设计提供了新思路。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Multiscale structural engineering enables superior energy storage in tetragonal tungsten bronze relaxor ferroelectrics","b":"Lead-free relaxor ferroelectric ceramics are promising for pulsed-power systems due to their ultrafast discharge and hig"},{"t":"胰高血糖素样肽-1 的多组分缝合可实现受体引导的 PROTAC 递送","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9595531?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Achieving cell‐selective targeted protein degradation remains a major challenge for translating proteolysis‐targeting chimeras (PROTACs) into therapeutics. Although pancreatic β‐cells are well vascularised and readily accessible to circulating peptides, selective receptor‐mediated drug delivery remains challenging. Here, we exploit the glucagon‐like peptide‐1 receptor (GLP‐1R) as a β‐cell‐specific entry route and report, for the first time, a multicomponent stapled glucagon‐like peptide‐1 (GLP‐1) analogue constructed by tryptophan‐mediated multicomponent Petasis reaction (TMPR). This modular stapling strategy affords a conformationally stabilised GLP‐1 peptide bearing a chemically orthogonal handle for late‐stage conjugation, displaying markedly enhanced α‐helicity and improved receptor potency, compared with the wild‐type peptide. Linking this improved analogue to a bromodomain‐containing protein 4 (BRD4)‐directed degrader furnishes the first GLP‐1‐guided PROTAC, which retains GLP‐1R agonism and induces selective BRD4 degradation in GLP‐1R‐positive cells, consistent with receptor‐guided uptake and intracellular activation of the degrader payload. Together, these results provide strong proof‐of‐concept evidence that a TMPR‐stapled GLP‐1 peptide can serve as a β‐cell‐directed delivery platform for receptor‐defined protein degradation.","tp":"靶向蛋白降解","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"实现细胞选择性靶向蛋白降解是PROTAC药物研发面临的主要挑战。尽管胰岛β细胞血管丰富且易于循环多肽进入，但实现受体介导的选择性递送依然困难。本研究首次利用胰高血糖素样肽-1受体（GLP-1R）作为β细胞特异性进入通道，开发了一种多组分缝合的胰高血糖素样肽-1。该策略成功实现了受体引导的PROTAC精准递送，为细胞特异性靶向治疗提供了新思路。"},{"t":"考虑动态分区与多智能体强化学习的双时间尺度电压-无功控制方法","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008147?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多智能体电压控制","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Multi-agent reinforcement learning method for dual-timescale volt-var control considering dynamic partitioning and multi"},{"t":"季风驱动世界上最大的常绿阔叶林聚集","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag361/8707061?rss=1","c":"未分类","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"As the world’s largest evergreen broadleaved forest (EBLF), East Asian EBLF houses high levels of biodiversity and endemism and is essential to regional carbon storage and cycling. However, how East Asian EBLF was shaped over time remains an open question. Here we investigate the historical assembly of this biome by sampling 21 angiosperm clades (together encompassing 2028 species) that include evergreen and deciduous species. We show that the transition from deciduous to evergreen lineages, and in situ diversification and immigration of evergreen lineages in subtropical East Asia all experienced a dynamic process. Transition and immigration reached their first peaks and in situ diversification sharply increased at the Oligocene–Miocene boundary (OMB), and all of them reached their highest peaks in the late Miocene. Our results suggest that modern East Asian EBLF did not appear until the OMB and markedly deteriorated since the Pliocene, mainly driven by the evolution of Asian monsoon climate. This study suggests that East Asian EBLF has functioned as both museums and cradles for regional biodiversity, and serves as a transfer station for biotic exchanges between temperate and tropical regions, highlighting its great conservation value.","tp":"季风驱动森林","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":1.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"东亚常绿阔叶林作为世界上最大的常绿阔叶林，拥有极高的生物多样性和特有性，对区域碳储存与循环至关重要。为探究其历史演化过程，研究人员对包含2028个物种的21个被子植物分支进行了系统采样。研究结果表明，季风气候在推动落叶植物向常绿植物演变中发挥了关键作用。季风的演变成功驱动了世界上最大的常绿阔叶林群落的聚集与多样化发展。"},{"t":"分子限域结构域实现卤化物稳定的宽带隙钙钛矿","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73713?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宽带隙钙钛矿稳定化","kp":["[策略]: 分子限域域稳定宽带隙卤素"],"as":"针对宽禁带（WBG）钙钛矿材料在叠层太阳能电池应用中的卤化物相分离与不稳定性难题，提出分子限域策略以稳定WBG钙钛矿。宽禁带钙钛矿是高效全钙钛矿叠层光伏器件顶电池的核心，但在光照和电场作用下易发生卤素离子迁移导致带隙偏移和效率衰减。研究通过引入特定有机分子在钙钛矿晶界和表面形成空间限域结构，有效抑制了卤素离子迁移和相分离，显著提升了宽带隙钙钛矿薄膜的相稳定性与光学性能。该策略在保持高开路电压的同时改善了器件运行稳定性，为突破全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池效率极限提供了材料层面的关键路径。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Molecularly Confined Domains Enable Halide‐Stable Wide‐Bandgap Perovskites","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Stable wide‐bandgap (WBG) perovskites are essential for achieving highly efficient tandem photovoltaics. However, state‐of‐the‐art tandem solar cells typically employ mixed‐halide WBG perovskite, yet halide phase segregation remains a critical bottleneck. Here, we design a molecular confinement domain in which paired iodide‐bearing organic ligands bind adjacent FA\n                    +\n                    cations and are interconnected by a bifunctional diammonium linker, effectively suppressing halide segregation by constraining the dynamic motion of orientable FA\n                    +\n                    cations at the surface and interfaces of wide‐bandgap perovskites. The suppression of this motion effectively strengthens lead‐halide (Pb‐X) bond strength, reinforces the lattice rigidity, reduces lattice vibrational amplitude and increases halide ion migration energy barrier. As a result, I‐Br mixed‐halide segregation and defect evolution under prolonged illumination are effectively suppressed. Finally, the resulting mixed‐halide WBG films exhibit low trap densities, improved carrier transport, and enhanced light/thermal stability. Such concept is applicable to both 1.68 and 1.78 eV perovskite, yielding efficiencies of 24.21% and 21.20% in single‐junction cells, respectively. When integrated into silicon‐based tandem cells, the device delivers an efficiency of 33.59%, alongside durable long‐term stability with a T\n                    96\n                    lifetime of 1000 h under continuous operation."},{"t":"阿莫西林克拉维酸治疗大肠杆菌尿路感染的分子药效学","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74323-2","c":"未分类","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Amoxicillin-clavulanic acid (AMX-CLV) is a widely used oral β-lactam/β-lactamase inhibitor combination against Escherich","tp":"抗菌药效学","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究聚焦于阿莫西林与克拉维酸（AMX-CLV）这一广泛使用的口服β-内酰胺类抗生素组合，探讨其在治疗大肠杆菌引起的尿路感染中的分子药效学机制。该研究为优化此类经典抗生素在临床上的靶向应用与耐药性管理提供了重要的理论基础。"},{"t":"卵巢细胞类型早期后口动物起源和生殖神经内分泌控制的分子证据","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74401-5","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Oogenesis requires complex interactions between germline and somatic cell types in the ovary. How did these cell types a"},{"t":"矿物和大气在地球历史中共同演化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag358/8707051?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","b":"Sergey V Krivovichev; Minerals and atmosphere coevolve in the Earth’s history, National Science Review, , nwag358, https"},{"t":"千足虫起源于4.6亿年前，研究改写了时间线","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/science/millipedes-originated-460-million-years-ago","c":"未分类","a":"interesting engineering","tg":"行业观察","b":"A new study has established the first-ever evolutionary history of all living millipedes, one of the planet’s first land animals that pioneered its terrestrial ecosystems (as the first chemical weapon manufacturers, too).\nAt a time when the Earth was bare, when there were no vertebrates, no trees, no leaves, no flowering plants, and no plants with seeds, millipedes were feeding on decaying mosses, decomposed slime, and primordial gunk.\nThough that sounds unappetizing, someone had to complete the “dirty work” necessary to pave the way for life. Though they perform an essential function as one of the first animals on Earth, science still hadn’t fully tracked their history until now.\nA new, groundbreaking study published in Current Biology addressed a 100-year-old gap in millipede science surrounding two rare groups of millipedes: Siphoniulida and Siphonocryptida.\nScientists knew that they existed, but without specimens for DNA analysis, they couldn’t confirm where they belonged in the millipede family tree.\nBut it was no easy feat to find them. One group spends its life underground, while the other survives in only a few known locations.\nResearchers traveled to Los Tuxtlas, Mexico, and Spain’s Canary Islands to collect Siphoniulus neotropicus and Hirudicryptus canariensis, two millipedes whose DNA had never before been included in an evolutionary analysis.\n“It took 10 people over a week to find one tiny 10-millimeter adult,” said Luisa “Fernanda” Vasquez-Valverde, the paper’s first author, in a press release.\n“Finding them in the field was hard because we were just seeing this little white nematode. We didn’t know for sure it was a millipede until we looked under the microscope.”\nAfter sequencing their DNA, comparing hundreds of genes across 82 millipede species, and combining those results with evidence from 29 fossils, researchers determined where the groups belonged in millipede history and when their lineages emerged.\n“Millipedes may have originated nearly 460 million years ago — roughly 35 million years before the oldest known millipede fossils and much earlier than previously believed,” according to the press release.\nSiphonocryptida turned out not to be a distinct order after all, but part of an existing lineage. Siphoniulida was finally placed among its closest relatives on the millipede evolution timeline.\nAll in all, the analysis of the millipede species revealed that the ancient animals originated 460 million years ago, roughly 35 million years before the oldest known millipede fossils, which was “the biggest surprise” to researchers —\n“Just how ancient these lineages turned out to be.”\nThe completed family tree also revealed one of the millipedes’ most important adaptations: they made the first chemical weapons. And it was these defenses that helped scientists trace their origins to about 260 million years ago.\nAlthough the new study brought new insights into one of the planet’s most significant animals, millipedes still hold secrets waiting to be discovered.\nScientists have described more than 14,000 species worldwide, but experts believe that tens of thousands may still be out there undiscovered.\nThese “unheralded heroes of the ecosystem” may be one of nature’s most important detritivores — because they break down decaying plant material and return nutrients to ecosystems — but scientists still haven’t fully penetrated this lineage, which is more ancient than the dinosaurs and paved the way on land for vertebrates.\n“It’s really kind of puzzling that they have such an important function in the ecosystem, and yet they’re so poorly known,” noted Paul Marek, the study’s lead investigator and associate professor in the College of Agriculture and Life Sciences’ Department of Entomology.\nbeat vertebrates onto land by more than 80 million years,” continued Marek. “They really set the stage for\non land, including humans and\n“There is all this potential for discovery,” a press release\n. “It keeps me wondering what else we’re going to find.”\nGet the latest in engineering, tech, space & science - delivered daily to your inbox.\nOriginally from LA, Maria Mocerino has been published in Business Insider, The Irish Examiner, The Rogue Mag, Chacruna Institute for Psychedelic Plant Medicines, and now Interesting Engineering.\nSolid-state battery cell hits 465 Wh/kg density, targets aerospace and defense applications\nTest facility for full-scale fusion power-plant blankets set to be developed in US\nUS Navy’s nuclear-powered fast-attack submarine returns to fleet\nIron-based catalyst helps zinc-air batteries power devices without precious metals\nScientists forge 24,000-atom mini universe that generates time without a single clock\nMore from Science\nWorld’s first ‘three-lane’ optical fiber network in China boosts data transfer by 5x\nWorld’s first working nuclear clocks built with thorium nucleus after decades of effort\nScientists forge 24,000-atom mini universe that generates time without a single clock\nBeyond rare earths: this new magnet material could reshape motors\nUS scientists create highest-resolution 3D map yet of a particle shaping matter\nWorld’s first ‘three-lane’ optical fiber network in China boosts data transfer by 5x\nWorld’s first working nuclear clocks built with thorium nucleus after decades of effort\nScientists forge 24,000-atom mini universe that generates time without a single clock\nBeyond rare earths: this new magnet material could reshape motors\nUS scientists create highest-resolution 3D map yet of a particle shaping matter","tp":"千足虫演化史","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":1.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"一项最新研究首次全面构建了现存千足虫的进化史，将其起源时间追溯至4.6亿年前。作为地球上最早的陆地动物之一，千足虫在荒芜的远古时期通过啃食腐烂苔藓和原始黏液，扮演了陆地生态系统开拓者的关键角色，甚至是最早的化学武器制造者。"},{"t":"数百万人服用这种联合补充剂，但科学家发现了与阿尔茨海默氏症的关联","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/?p=522298","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Scientists found a concerning\nlink involving glucosamine, a joint supplement used by millions.\nA widely used supplement marketed for joint pain relief may be linked to faster progression of Alzheimer’s disease, according to new research from\nUniversity of Florida\nThe study found that people with mild cognitive impairment (MCI) who reported taking glucosamine were more likely to develop dementia than those who did not use the supplement. The findings come from a large analysis of patient records, along with brain imaging studies in both human tissue and mouse models of Alzheimer’s disease.\nAlthough the research does not prove that glucosamine causes dementia and still needs to be confirmed in clinical trials, the results add to growing evidence that disruptions in metabolism may play an important role in neurodegenerative diseases. The study was published June 9 in\nNature Metabolism\n“In the United States, there are about 7 million people living with Alzheimer’s and millions more with related dementias such as Lewy body or frontotemporal dementia,” said senior author Ramon Sun, Ph.D., director of the Center for Advanced Spatial Biomolecule Research and associate director for innovation of UF’s McKnight Brain Institute. “A lot of these people actively take an over-the-counter supplement that could be making their disease progression worse.”\nBecause glucosamine is widely available and frequently used by older adults to support joint health, researchers wanted to determine whether it might influence Alzheimer’s disease and related dementias (ADRD).\nWorking with collaborators Yi Guo, Ph.D., and Jiang Bian, Ph.D., the team used\nartificial intelligence\nto analyze deidentified UF Health medical records collected between 2012 and 2024. They focused on patients diagnosed with either ADRD or mild cognitive impairment.\nThe review showed that glucosamine use was common among both groups. Nearly 1,900 patients with ADRD and 2,750 patients with MCI reported taking the supplement, representing about 8% of each group.\nAfter accounting for factors such as age, sex, and demographic differences, the researchers found that glucosamine use was associated with a 25% greater likelihood of progressing from mild cognitive impairment to dementia.\nThe analysis also revealed that among patients already diagnosed with ADRD, glucosamine use was associated with a 25% increase in mortality risk, meaning a higher likelihood of death within a given period. No similar increase was observed in the MCI group, suggesting the supplement’s effects may be more pronounced once dementia is established.\nBeyond the patient data, the researchers identified a metabolic process that may help explain the findings. Their work points to an overactive pathway involved in attaching sugar molecules to proteins, a process that appears heightened in Alzheimer’s disease.\nAccording to Sun, this pathway could become a promising target for future treatments.\n“Our results suggest that altered metabolism is a significant contributor to Alzheimer’s progression and, in addition, addressing the metabolic defect could be an important complement to approaches focused on Alzheimer’s plaques and tangles,” Sun said.\nThe discovery was made possible through advanced spatial analysis technology developed in Sun’s laboratory.\n“This technology allows us to examine thousands and thousands of molecules created when the body breaks down food or drugs and to uncover intricate pathways that otherwise would stay hidden,” Sun said.\nResearchers took a closer look at glucosamine because it is a naturally occurring sugar-related molecule capable of crossing the blood-brain barrier. Once in the brain, it can contribute to biological pathways that build complex sugar structures on proteins. Commercial glucosamine supplements are commonly produced from sources such as shellfish shells or corn.\nThe findings suggest that glucosamine may not affect everyone in the same way. Instead, its impact may depend on the underlying biological environment, with the Alzheimer’s brain appearing especially vulnerable.\n“The electronic health record data are very provocative,” said Matt Gentry, Ph.D., chair of UF’s Department of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology and a study co-author. “While it’s an association and not proof of causality, it does raise an important clinical question that now deserves much more attention.”\nTo further investigate the mechanism, the researchers conducted experiments in genetically modified mice. They found that glucosamine significantly increased the attachment of sugar residues to proteins inside cells.\nMice receiving glucosamine also experienced worsening deficits in social memory, which refers to the ability to recognize familiar individuals. When scientists chemically reduced the sugar-attachment process, memory performance improved.\nThe team then partnered with Stefan Prokop, M.D., to analyze brain samples from the UF Neuromedicine Brain and Tissue Bank. Compared with healthy control samples, Alzheimer’s brain tissue showed substantially higher levels of the same sugar-attachment activity.\nTaken together, the findings suggest that this metabolic abnormality may be more than just a byproduct of Alzheimer’s disease. Instead, it could be actively contributing to the progression of the disorder.\n“Proteins are the cell’s molecular machines, and many of them need sugar tags added in just the right way to fold correctly, travel to the right place and do their jobs,” Gentry said. “What we found in Alzheimer’s is that this sugar-tagging system appears to be overactive. The Alzheimer’s brain is adding too many of these sugar structures, and this seems to contribute to the disease rather than protect against it.”\nReference: “Hyperglycosylation is a metabolic driver of Alzheimer’s disease” by Tara R. Hawkinson, Zizhen Liu, Roberto A. Ribas, Terrymar Medina, Rikke S. Nielsen, Harrison A. Clarke, Xin Ma, Angela C. Mueller, Adrielle F. Plasencia, Alexander L. Sheer, Samantha T. Simpson, Charles M. Soto, Jessica Sudderth, Feng Cai, Alex R. Cantrell, Matthieu G. Colpaert, Cameron J. Shedlock, Lei Wu, Lyndsay E. A. Young, Damon D. Kooser, Li Chen, Alison M. Ryan, Sadi Quinones, Jihye Son, Parastoo Azadi, Ralph J. Deberardinis, Stefan Prokop, Derek Allison, Shuang Yang, Hongyu Chen, Yu Huang, Xing He, Kimberly M. Alonge, Jingchuan Guo, Yi Guo, Jiang Bian, Craig W. Vander Kooi, Matthew S. Gentry and Ramon C. Sun, 9 June 2026,\nNature Metabolism\nDOI: 10.1038/s42255-026-01538-4\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nUniversity of Florida\nSimple & Easy: Daily Multivitamin May Improve Cognition and Protect Against Mental Decline\nDaily Multivitamin May Slow Cognitive Aging for Older Adults\nAuthoritative New Analysis Links Omega-3 Supplements to Cardioprotection and Improved Heart Health\nOmega-3 From Eating Fish May Protect Our Brains From Toxic Effects of Air Pollution\nThe Combination of Foods You Eat Together May Raise Dementia Risk\nStudy Finds Fish Oil Supplements May Lower Risk of Heart Disease and Death\nCommon Nutrient Supplement May Prevent Alzheimer’s Disease\nStudy Shows Link between Muscle-Building Supplements and Cancer\nNutritional Supplements Help Ease Clinical Depression","tp":"氨糖与阿尔茨海默","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"佛罗里达大学的一项最新研究揭示，被数百万人广泛用于缓解关节疼痛的补充剂氨基葡萄糖可能与阿尔茨海默病的加速恶化有关。基于大规模患者病历的数据分析表明，服用该补充剂的轻度认知障碍（MCI）患者，其随后发展为痴呆症的风险显著高于未服用者。"},{"t":"基于非线性径向色散的中红外快照光谱成像","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74263-x","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"中红外光谱成像","kp":["光谱成像[中红外快照]: 非线性径向色散"],"dp":1,"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出基于非线性径向色散的中红外快照光谱成像技术。中红外光谱成像可通过分子振动指纹提供化学特异性对比，但传统方法难以实现快速快照采集。新技术利用非线性光学效应实现单次曝光多维光谱信息获取，在化学分析和生物检测中有广泛应用前景。","ot":"Mid-infrared snapshot spectral imaging via nonlinear radial dispersion","b":"Mid-infrared spectral imaging provides chemically specific contrast through molecular vibrational fingerprints, yet snap","aip":1},{"t":"微软考虑剥离 Xbox，计划推出新的《光环》、《辐射》游戏","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/microsoft-considered-spinning-xbox-plans-new-halo-fallout-games","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"利用短波红外成像光谱技术绘制氨排放羽流图","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605694123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨排放红外成像","kp":["[方法]: 短波红外成像光谱监测氨排放"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究利用短波红外成像光谱技术对大气氨排放羽流进行制图。氨排放对生态系统和人体健康有害，传统监测方法空间分辨率有限。短波红外高光谱遥感能精准识别和量化点源氨排放，为农业非点源污染管控和空气质量评估提供了高效手段。","ot":"Mapping ammonia emission plumes using shortwave infrared imaging spectroscopy","b":"Atmospheric ammonia emissions are harmful to ecosystems and human health. These emissions have traditionally been monitored using thermal infrared spectrometers, though such techniques are limited by thermal contrast requirements, the coarse spatial resolution of existing satellite sensors, and low measurement frequency of higher-resolution aerial surveys. Here, we show that ammonia emissions can be quantified using shortwave infrared imaging spectroscopy, circumventing these challenges by using reflected sunlight instead of thermal emission for signal and by enabling a large class of existing and future imaging spectrometers to enter the ammonia observing system. As a proof of concept for this capability, we use Tanager-1 satellite data to quantify emissions from industrial point sources of ammonia in Pakistan and Uzbekistan."},{"t":"机器学习优化单原子催化剂实现微环境适应性化学动力学-生物正交癌症治疗","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73689?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子催化剂肿瘤治疗","kp":["[应用]: 单原子催化剂自适应化学动力学治癌"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发机器学习优化的单原子催化剂，实现微环境自适应的化学动力学-生物正交联合癌症治疗。化学动力学疗法利用肿瘤微环境内源性化学能量产生活性氧杀伤肿瘤，但受限于TME复杂条件。该策略通过ML设计催化剂自适应调控微环境，提升治疗精准性和疗效。","ot":"Machine Learning‐Optimized Single‐Atom Catalysts Enable Microenvironment‐Adaptive Chemodynamic‐Bioorthogonal Cancer Ther","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chemodynamic therapy (CDT), which harnesses endogenous chemical energy within the tumor microenvironment (TME), has shown high potential for precise cancer treatment. However, its efficacy is often limited by the mildly acidic and reductive nature of the TME that compromises catalyst stability and activity. Developing catalysts capable of maintaining robust performance under such physiological constraints remains a key challenge. Herein, we report a programmable dual‐catalytic platform that integrates machine learning‐guided design with atomic‐level precision. Through predictive modeling, we establish quantitative structure‐performance relationships that guided the rational synthesis of iron single‐atoms (Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs). The Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs demonstrate exceptional chemodynamic reactivity and environmental stability within the complex TME, efficiently converting endogenous hydrogen peroxide into hydroxyl radicals for precise tumor ablation. Moreover, Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs exhibit potent bioorthogonal catalytic activity, enabling in situ prodrug activation and localized synthesis of doxorubicin under physiological conditions. This synergistic CDT‐bioorthogonal dual‐catalytic mechanism achieves tumor‐selective, stimulus‐free, and combinatorial therapy, markedly enhancing overall antitumor efficacy. This study establishes a machine learning‐guided framework for single‐atom catalyst design and expands the frontiers of metal catalysis in biomedical applications.","aip":1},{"t":"长寿初创公司面临一个难题：他们可以销售长寿药物吗？","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/longevity-startups-conundrum-can-sell-longevity-drugs","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"液体作为各向异性韧性软物质复合材料的增强体（Adv. Mater. 33/2026）","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73508?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液态金属复合材料","kp":["增强相[软物质复合]: 液态金属液滴各向异性"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"Bartlett等人在Advanced Materials发表研究，提出以液体作为增强相构建各向异性且高韧性软物质复合材料的新策略。传统软复合材料多用固态填料，该工作引入液态金属或液滴作为功能组分，通过液-固界面设计赋予材料可编程的力学各向异性和自修复能力。","ot":"Liquids as Reinforcements for Anisotropic and Tough Soft Matter Composites (Adv. Mater. 33/2026)","b":"Anisotropic and Tough Soft Matter Composites In their Research Article (DOI: 10.1002/adma.72447), Michael D. Bartlett, E"},{"t":"液态合金驱动含氟聚合物废料的常温升级回收","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag359/8707059?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氟聚合物废料升级","kp":["[策略]: 接触电催化自蔓延反应(CEC-SPR)","条件[PTFE降解]: 常温常压"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究开发液态合金驱动的氟聚合物废弃物常温升级回收技术。聚四氟乙烯（PTFE）等氟塑料化学稳定性极高，传统化学回收长期受阻。该方法利用液态金属合金在温和条件下选择性断裂C-F键，将氟聚合物废料转化为高附加值化学品，为'永久化学品'治理提供可行路径。","ot":"Liquid alloy driven ambient upcycling of fluoropolymer waste","b":"The chemical upcycling of fluoropolymer waste, particularly polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE), has been severely hampered by the harsh thermal conditions required to cleave the highly stable carbon–fluorine (C–F) bonds. Here, we report a contact-electro-catalytic induced self-propagating reactions (CEC-SPR) strategy that enables efficient cleavage of the robust C–F bonds in PTFE under ambient conditions. By employing a highly reactive NaK alloy, which reacts with PTFE through the exothermic Wurtz defluorination reaction, we facilitate the chemical recycling of PTFE into fluorine-doped carbon materials and metal fluorides at room temperature. Our results provide a new conceptual strategy for the upcycling of PTFE plastic waste into functionally useful carbon materials and inorganic fluoride products."},{"t":"光致熵用于安全视觉（Adv. Mater. 33/2026）","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73509?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光信息安全成像","kp":["[安全成像]: 光致物理随机数水印即时认证","[机制]: 光电探测器同时生成随机数嵌入图像"],"as":"该工作提出一种基于光诱导熵的安全视觉成像系统，旨在对抗深度伪造（deepfake）威胁。系统利用光的物理随机性（熵源）生成不可复制的成像信号，为生物特征识别等高安全场景提供硬件级防伪方案。研究展示了将光学物理熵引入视觉信息处理的新范式，发表于Adv. Mater. 2026年第33期封面。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Light‐Induced Entropy for Secure Vision (Adv. Mater. 33/2026)","b":"Light-Induced Entropy for Secure Vision This cover illustrates a secure imaging system that counters deepfakes using lig"},{"t":"光驱动差向异构化：[12C, 13C] β2,3-氨基酸的非对映汇聚式合成","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1668497?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光驱动β氨基酸合成","kp":["[合成方法]: 光催化级联差向异构化"],"as":"该研究开发了光驱动差向异构化（epimerization）反应，实现β2,3-氨基酸的非对映收敛合成。β-氨基酸是生物活性肽和药物的关键构建单元，其立体化学直接影响药理活性。该方法利用光能精准控制手性中心的构型转化，以高非对映选择性构建复杂氨基酸骨架，为手性药物合成提供了绿色高效的新策略。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Light‐Driven Epimerization: Diastereoconvergent Synthesis of [12C, 13C] β2,3‐Amino Acids","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    β\n                    ‐Amino acids are crucial building blocks for bioactive peptides and pharmaceuticals, wherein the stereochemistry of C\n                    2\n                    , C\n                    3\n                    ‐disubstituted\n                    β\n                    2,3\n                    ‐amino acids dictates the secondary structure of\n                    β\n                    ‐peptides. However, the diastereoselective synthesis of these scaffolds remains a formidable challenge. Herein, we report a novel photocatalytic cascade enabling the one‐pot hydrogenation, carboxylation, and epimerization of\n                    α\n                    ,\n                    β\n                    ‐unsaturated imines. This method provides direct and highly diastereoselective (d.r. up to 35:1) access to valuable\n                    syn\n                    ‐\n                    β\n                    2,3\n                    ‐amino acids. Time‐course analysis and DFT calculations reveal a unique light‐driven dynamic kinetic epimerization process that ensures stereoconvergence to the thermodynamically favored\n                    syn\n                    ‐isomer. Notably, this strategy also facilitates the facile synthesis of\n                    13\n                    C‐labeled\n                    syn\n                    ‐\n                    β\n                    2,3\n                    ‐amino acids using commercially available\n                    13\n                    C‐sodium formate, achieving exceptional isotope incorporation (93%–98%) that surpasses existing\n                    13\n                    CO\n                    2\n                    ‐based methods. Furthermore, the system's utility is demonstrated through the gram‐scale synthesis of N‐unprotected\n                    α\n                    ‐amino acids from imines (11 g, 75% yield), more significantly, via a one‐pot procedure directly from diaryl ketones."},{"t":"晶格工程双电子驱动电极用于硝酸盐选择性制氨","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73699?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化硝酸盐还原制氨","kp":["电极[硝酸盐制氨]: 晶格工程双电子驱动","反应条件[NO₃⁻RR]: 中性环境"],"as":"该工作设计了一种晶格工程化的双电子驱动电极，用于电化学选择性合成氨（NH₃）。传统Haber-Bosch法能耗高、碳排放大，该电极通过双电子转移路径在温和条件下高效还原氮为氨，兼顾农业肥料与清洁能源载体需求。晶格工程策略调控了催化剂的电子结构与活性位点，显著提升了选择性与产率，为绿色氨合成提供了新思路。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Lattice‐Engineered Dual‐Electron‐Drive Electrode for Selective Ammonia Production From Nitrate","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ammonia (NH\n                    3\n                    ) is indispensable in agriculture and emerging energy systems, yet its conventional production remains energy‐ and carbon‐intensive. Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    RR) represents a promising alternative for sustainable NH\n                    3\n                    synthesis but is hampered by slow kinetics and low selectivity under realistic, neutral conditions. Here, we employ the lattice engineering strategy to construct a cobalt‐doped nanoscale zerovalent iron (Co‐nFe\n                    0\n                    ) electrode that integrates a dual‐electron‐drive mechanism with a self‐triggered alkaline microenvironment to overcome these challenges. Cobalt doping modulated the surface Fe electronic structure to create electron‐deficient Fe sites, which enhanced charge transfer, promoted water dissociation into active hydrogen species, and facilitated the hydrogenation of reaction intermediates. This design enabled an NH\n                    3\n                    Faradaic efficiency of 96% and near‐quantitative selectivity across a wide nitrate concentration range (100–1000 mg L\n                    −1\n                    NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    ‐N), alongside sustained operational stability. An insitu NH\n                    3\n                    recovery system could provide stable operation over 360 h and deliver 13 g day\n                    −1\n                    NH\n                    3\n                    production with 100% NH\n                    3\n                    recovery. Rice pot experiments demonstrated that the recovered ammonium sulfate (99% purity) performed comparably to commercial fertilizers. This work provides an efficient electrocatalyst that couples electronic structure modulation and interfacial microenvironment regulation, thereby offering a sustainable technological route for nitrogen upcycling and green fertilizer production.","aip":1},{"t":"通过肽的氢甲酰化后期生成 14C/3H 放射性标记的赖氨酸残基","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74115-8","c":"未分类","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","b":"Peptides constitute a well-established and rapidly expanding field in the contemporary pharmaceutical drug landscape. St","tp":"肽放射性标记","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"在当代药物研发中，多肽类药物正迅速发展。该研究介绍了一种创新的化学技术，即通过肽链的氢甲酰化后期修饰反应，精准生成含有14C或3H放射性标记的赖氨酸残基。该技术在多肽类药物的药代动力学追踪和分子成像分析中具有重要的应用前景。"},{"t":"用于机器学习加速的大规模集成光电混沌系统","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73440-2","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电混沌计算","kp":["混沌引擎[片上光电子]: 微梳集成大规模"],"as":"该研究利用光电混沌（optoelectronic chaos）实现大规模集成化，用于加速机器学习。传统非线性电路在速度上存在瓶颈，而光电混沌系统凭借高带宽与并行处理能力，可作为储备池计算的高效物理载体。研究展示了将混沌动力系统集成于光电器件中以突破电子瓶颈，为下一代高速、低功耗神经形态计算硬件提供了新架构。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Large-scale integrated optoelectronic chaos for machine learning acceleration","b":"Chaos has emerged as a useful resource for machine learning, yet traditional nonlinear circuits face speed bottlenecks.","aip":1},{"t":"面向认知智能的大语言模型在电力系统中的应用：文献综述","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008573?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力系统大模型","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Large language models in power systems toward cognitive intelligence: A literature review"},{"t":"LPAR4介导软组织肉瘤对干扰素诱导应激的抵抗","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef1962?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Soft tissue sarcomas are aggressive malignancies with limited responses to immunotherapy. Strategies that induce viral mimicry and type I interferon (IFN-I) signaling may enhance tumor immunogenicity but remain poorly explored in sarcoma. Here, we show that the CDK4/6 inhibitor abemaciclib triggers viral mimicry and robust IFN-I responses in sarcoma cells, leading to tumor growth suppression and remodeling of the tumor microenvironment toward an immune-permissive state. However, sarcoma cells activate resistance mechanisms that limit IFN-induced stress. We identify lysophosphatidic acid receptor 4 (LPAR4) as a key mediator of this adaptation. LPAR4 dampens IFN signaling, reduces oxidative stress, and promotes tumor cell survival under therapeutic pressure. Genetic silencing of LPAR4 enhances IFN responses, increases reactive oxygen species, and sensitizes sarcoma cells to apoptosis, resulting in delayed tumor growth. These findings identify LPAR4 as a central regulator of IFN-driven stress adaptation and a potential therapeutic target to enhance viral mimicry–based strategies in sarcoma.","tp":"肉瘤免疫抵抗","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现，CDK4/6抑制剂可通过诱导病毒模拟和强烈的I型干扰素（IFN-I）反应，有效重塑软组织肉瘤的免疫微环境并抑制肿瘤生长。然而，LPAR4基因在恶性肿瘤中介导了针对此类干扰素诱导应激的抵抗机制，从而降低了肿瘤对免疫疗法的敏感性。"},{"t":"LGA 1700 回归：英特尔被曝将推 Raptor Lake Next 处理器，2027 年重返 DDR4 市场","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/973.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"英特尔处理器路线图","kp":["处理器平台[Intel]: LGA 1700回归支持DDR4","发布时间[Raptor Lake Next]: 2027上半年"],"as":"英特尔被曝将于2027年上半年推出代号Raptor Lake Next的新一代处理器，第三次更新Raptor Lake系列并回归LGA 1700接口与DDR4内存。此举反映了英特尔在制程节点受阻下延长现有平台生命周期的产品策略，也暗示DDR4市场仍具成本竞争力。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"b":"6 月 13 日消息，据 Tom's Hardware 今日报道，英特尔计划在 2027 年上半年推出代号“Raptor Lake Next”的新一代 DDR4 处理器，这将是 Raptor Lake 系列的第三次“更新”，继续使用 LGA 1700 平台。\nIT之家注：目前该系列处理器的正式命名尚未确定，仅以“Raptor Lake Next”指代。Tom's Hardware 表示已从多个来源验证了 Raptor Lake Next 存在，但尚不确定是否会是一个全新处理器系列。\n至少两家主板厂商向 Tom's Hardware 确认，由于 DDR4 需求上升，他们正计划增加 AM4 和 LGA 1700 平台的 DDR4 主板产量。这一时间点与此前 4 月流传的英特尔计划重新推出 Raptor Lake 处理器的传闻相吻合。英特尔高管 Robert Hallock 也曾表示，Raptor Lake 将在市场上“供应充足”。\n英特尔前不久刚推出了面向嵌入式和工业应用的 Bartlett Lake 处理器，该系列采用纯 P 核设计，采用 LGA 1700 插槽，其旗舰型号酷睿 9 273PQE 拥有 12 颗 P 核，比 i9-14900K 多出 4 颗。\nBartlett Lake 在物理层面兼容 Raptor Lake 平台，但软件层面未获官方支持。尽管如此，已有发烧友成功在消费级 600 系和 700 系主板上点亮该处理器。\n除英特尔外，AMD 也重新推出了 R7 5800X3D 处理器，回归 DDR4 市场，其国行售价暂未公布。\nAMD 锐龙 7 5800X3D 十周年纪念版采用与原版不同的台积电 SoIC 键合工艺\nAMD 发布锐龙 7 5800X3D 十周年纪念版与锐龙 7 7700X3D 处理器\n\"Bartlett Lake 12P\" 进入服务器：英特尔推出至强 6377P 处理器\n英特尔正式推出酷睿（第二代）性能核 \"Bartlett Lake 12P\" 处理器\n英特尔 Bartlett Lake-S 系列处理器阵容曝光：全大核、睿频最高 5.9GHz，普通消费者无缘\n消息称英特尔原本计划在 FCLGA1851 插槽推出四代台式机处理器"},{"t":"LARP1 整合 MYC 和 mTOR 信号传导以在肿瘤发生过程中实现合成代谢生长","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523043123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Tumor initiation requires the integration of oncogenic signals with environmental cues to enable anabolic growth. MYC is central to tumorigenesis, with its deregulation observed in over 60% of human cancers. Oncogenic MYC profoundly rewires transcription, enabling cells to bypass cell cycle checkpoints and reset metabolism. A cornerstone of this rewiring is the upregulation of biomass-producing pathways, particularly ribosome biogenesis. How and when MYC’s oncogenic program is translationally executed—either immediately or until a favorable metabolic context emerges—remains a central unanswered question in tumor initiation, limiting our understanding of tumor latency and early intervention. Here, we identify LARP1 as a critical effector of MYC-driven transformation, connecting MYC oncogenic activity with mTOR signaling. Mechanistically, MYC represses miR-26a/b, relieving posttranscriptional repression of LARP1 and leading to its upregulation. LARP1 associates with the translational machinery, loading it with the anabolic translatome induced by MYC in a translationally poised state. Upon permissive mTOR signaling, and dependent on the phosphorylation of LARP1 at serines 689 and 697, this program is rapidly translated, fueling the biosynthetic processes essential for tumor development. Importantly, genetic deletion of LARP1 or pharmacological mTOR inhibition completely abrogates tumor initiation in a genetically engineered colorectal organoid model of MYC-driven tumorigenesis. This underscores the physiological relevance of this two-step mechanism in which LARP1 bridges the anabolic translatome primed by MYC with its metabolic execution controlled by mTOR. By temporally uncoupling transformation from metabolic permissiveness, this mechanism defines a critical checkpoint in early tumorigenesis, revealing a potential vulnerability for intercepting MYC-driven cancer before biomass expansion.","tp":"LARP1与肿瘤","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究表明，肿瘤的发生需要将致癌信号与环境线索相结合以实现合成代谢生长。MYC基因在肿瘤发生中起着核心作用，其失调在超过60%的人类癌症中被观察到。致癌MYC会深刻重塑细胞转录，使细胞能够绕过细胞周期检查点并重置代谢。这种重塑的关键在于上调产生生物质的途径，特别是核糖体生物发生。该研究探讨了LARP1如何整合MYC和mTOR信号传导，从而在肿瘤发生过程中调控MYC致癌程序的翻译机制。"},{"t":"无钾云母辅助铋基硫属化物与氧硫属化物单晶外延生长","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74341-0","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铋基硫族化合物外延","kp":["[外延方法]: 无K+云母辅助外延","[材料体系]: Bi基硫族化合物及氧硫族化合物","[本征特性]: 拓扑/高迁移率半导体/铁电多功能"],"as":"报道了一种无钾云母辅助外延技术，可制备铋基硫族化合物及氧硫族化合物单晶材料。该材料体系本征兼具拓扑、高迁移率半导体和铁电等多重物理特性，为拓扑量子器件、多功能电子学及新型异质结构筑提供了理想平台，具有重要的基础研究与器件应用价值。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"K+-free mica-assisted epitaxy of Bi-based chalcogenide and oxychalcogenide single-crystals","b":"A material family that intrinsically hosts topological, high-mobility semiconducting and ferroelectric properties offers"},{"t":"铁劫持特洛伊木马纳米平台通过免疫纤维化重塑蛋白对抗植入相关的生物膜感染","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73711?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT Implant‐associated biofilm infections persist due to a vicious cycle of biofilm resilience and fibrosis‐driven ...","tp":"纳米抗感染","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对植入物相关生物膜感染难以根治的问题，研究团队开发了\"铁劫持特洛伊木马\"纳米平台，通过免疫调控重塑纤维化微环境来对抗感染。该策略打破生物膜韧性与纤维化之间的恶性循环，将抗生素递送与免疫调节相结合，为临床植入物感染治疗提供了新思路。","aip":1},{"t":"离聚物导向的CO2电还原反应路径","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag364/8707055?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电还原","kp":["[微环境调控]: 离聚物定向调控CO2电还原路径"],"as":"该研究提出利用离聚物（ionomer）调控CO₂电还原反应路径的新策略。通过在电极界面引入特定离聚物，可引导反应中间体选择性生成高附加值燃料和化学品，突破传统CO₂RR产物选择性不足的瓶颈。该方案为碳排放资源化及可持续电化学合成提供了重要的催化设计思路。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ionomer-Directed Reaction Pathway for CO2 Electroreduction","b":"Electrochemical CO2 reduction (CO2RR) is a sustainable method of converting carbon emissions into valuable fuels and chemicals; however, its selectivity and stability are governed by the catalyst itself and the local microenvironment within the catalyst layer. Ionomers, once considered to be passive binders, have emerged as key regulators of this microenvironment. However, the ionomer content in the catalyst layer is very low, because of which its effect on the CO2RR performance is often ignored. This review aims to address this gap. First, the structural diversity of proton- and anion-exchange ionomers is discussed, and their distinct physicochemical properties, which are critical for shaping ion transport and interfacial reactions, are described. Next, the effects of solvent-controlled dispersion and film formation on the spatial distribution and morphology of ionomers in the catalyst layers and the subsequent effects on mass transport and local hydration are discussed. Based on this foundation, the control of CO2RR pathways based on the ionomer configuration is discussed, specifically considering the coupled effects on reactant diffusion, intermediate adsorption energetics, and interfacial hydrogen bond networks. Finally, the current challenges and future opportunities are summarized, with an emphasis on nanoscale characterization, ionomer durability, and the co-design of catalysts and ionomers. By elucidating the molecular-level connections between ionomer structure, dispersion, and catalytic function, this review establishes design principles that can guide the development of next-generation electrodes and electrolyzers for efficient, selective, and durable CO2 conversion. Moreover, as demonstrated in this review, these principles are broadly applicable to a wide range of other electrocatalytic reactions."},{"t":"内在 DNA 密码控制核小体-转录因子相互作用的不同模式","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74448-4","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The interplay between transcription factors (TFs) and nucleosomes is central to gene regulation, yet most studies adopt"},{"t":"电极表面附近的界面质子有序化引导羰基电还原为亚甲基","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7784249?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"羰基电还原","kp":["羰基还原[至亚甲基]: 界面质子有序化驱动"],"dp":1,"as":"羰基脱氧转化为亚甲基是有机合成中的关键转化，传统Clemmensen等方法条件苛刻。该研究发现电极表面附近的界面质子有序排列可调控羰基电还原脱氧过程，实现温和条件下的高选择性转化。这一界面调控策略为绿色有机电合成提供了新范式，有望替代传统高温高压还原方法。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial Proton Ordering Near the Electrode Surface Directs Carbonyl Electroreduction to Methylene","b":"ABSTRACT Carbonyl‐to‐methylene deoxygenation is a fundamental transformation in organic synthesis, but conventional Clem","aip":1},{"t":"界面电子调制重定向阳极自由基化学以实现电氧化中的选择性C-C键断裂","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1876863?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电氧化木质素解聚","kp":["转化率[木质素解聚]: 88%","催化剂[C-C键断裂]: CuO/Cu0.92Co2.08O4异质结构"],"dp":1,"as":"木质素电氧化解聚是获取可再生芳香族化合物的潜在途径，但面临选择性低的挑战。该研究通过界面电子调制技术，重定向阳极自由基化学反应路径，显著提升了木质素解聚产物中目标芳香族化合物的选择性。该策略为木质素高值化利用和生物基化学品生产提供了新的电催化设计思路。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial Electronic Modulation Redirects Anodic Radical Chemistry for Selective C─C Bond Cleavage in Electro‐Oxidativ","b":"ABSTRACT Electro‐oxidative lignin depolymerization is considered a promising route to renewable aromatics; however, its ...","aip":1},{"t":"铁基多功能催化剂界面工程用于CO2选择性加氢制C3+醇","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00168-3?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2加氢制高级醇","kp":["催化剂体系[CO2加氢]: K修饰ZnZrOx-Fe5C2界面","[目标产物]: CO2高选择性加氢制C3+醇"],"as":"铁基多功能催化剂通过界面工程调控活性位点，实现CO₂高选择性加氢合成碳三及以上的高级醇。该反应因C-C偶联与含氧中间体调控困难而长期受限。研究通过构建特定界面结构优化氢活化与C-C偶联的协同路径，突破传统催化剂在CO₂加氢中C2+醇产物选择性偏低的瓶颈，为CO₂高值化利用提供新策略。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interface engineering of Fe-based multifunctional catalysts for selective CO2 hydrogenation to C3+ alcohols","b":"Highly selective hydrogenation of CO2 into higher alcohols with three or more carbon atoms remains challenging due to inherent difficulties in regulating C–C coupling of reaction intermediates. Combined experimental and theoretical investigations reveal that a well-tailored K-modified ZnZrOx–Fe5C2 interface optimizes alkyl-oxygenate coupling, enabling efficient higher alcohol synthesis with a record-high C3+ alcohol yield and excellent long-term stability. This work demonstrates great practical potential for producing value-added chemicals via CO2 hydrogenation."},{"t":"使用高度多重血清学综合评估抗体对蚊子和蚊媒病原体的反应","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb7044?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Vector-borne diseases (VBDs) are a leading cause of morbidity and mortality worldwide. Antigens driving host immune responses to pathogens and vectors can serve as vaccine candidates and biomarkers of previous exposure, but the immunogenicity of relevant proteomes remains undercharacterized. To comprehensively profile antibody responses to VBDs and the vectors themselves, we developed a highly multiplexed phage display library, VectorScan, containing more than 250,000 peptides derived from diverse arthropod vectors and prevalent vector-borne pathogens. We used phage immunoprecipitation sequencing to screen VectorScan against blood samples with experimental and natural exposures to arboviruses, malaria parasites, and mosquitoes. We analyzed quantitative measurements of peptide seroreactivity to identify epitopes driving viral serotype-level exposure signatures and mosquito sialome antigens. Mosquito-directed antibody responses were quantitatively associated with natural viral and parasite exposure. We leverage VectorScan to define the relationship between the intensity of mosquito exposure and the rate of malaria infection in children, demonstrating the public health utility of a tool for paired vector and pathogen serosurveillance.","tp":"蚊媒血清学","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队开发了名为VectorScan的高度多重化噬菌体展示文库，包含超过25万条源自蚊子及蚊媒病原体蛋白的肽段。该技术可全面评估宿主对虫媒传染病及媒介本身的抗体免疫反应，为疫苗候选靶点和既往暴露生物标志物的鉴定提供了系统性工具，填补了相关蛋白质组免疫原性研究的空白。","aip":1},{"t":"面向机械化学稳定超高镍正极的集成局部微结构工程","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73673?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超高镍正极材料","kp":["[晶格调控]: Mg/Nb共掺杂局部晶格调节","[器件形态]: 超高镍层状正极"],"as":"超高镍层状正极材料在下一代高能量密度锂离子电池中极具前景，但循环过程中的机械化学退化制约其应用。本研究通过局部微观结构工程，系统调控晶格应变与界面稳定性，显著提升超高镍正极的循环寿命和结构完整性，为高能量密度电池工程化提供解决方案。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Integrated Local‐Microstructure Engineering Toward Mechanochemically Robust Ultra‐High Nickel Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ni‐rich layered cathodes show exceptional promise for next‐generation high‐energy‐density lithium‐ion batteries. However, higher nickel utilization in layered cathodes readily exacerbates both bulk mechanical failure and interfacial chemistry instability, significantly hindering their practical application. Herein, a comprehensive local lattice regulation strategy was proposed via Mg/Nb co‐doping, which constructed a chemically and mechanically co‐robust LiNi\n                    0.95\n                    Co\n                    0.03\n                    Mn\n                    0.02\n                    O\n                    2\n                    cathode from surface to bulk. The surface‐reconstructed ultrathin disordered rock‐salt phase effectively stabilized the electrochemical interface. Meanwhile, the bulk cation‐disordered structure integrated with a coherent spinel‐like phase mitigated lattice strain and enhanced structural integrity. Therefore, the modified ultra‐high nickel cathode exhibited excellent long‐term cycling stability, high rate capability, and thermal stability. It exhibited high initial coulombic efficiency of 93.24% and a discharge specific capacity of 240.11 mAh·g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.1C. It could also deliver a high initial capacity of 210.44 mAh·g\n                    −1\n                    at 1C and retain 97.37% of its capacity after 100 cycles. Moreover, it exhibited outstanding performance during cycling at 3C, delivering a superior capacity retention of 81.65% after 500 cycles. It also delivered a remarkable specific capacity of 147.43 mAh·g\n                    −1\n                    even at the rate of 15C. This integrated microstructure regulation strategy would pave the way for commercializing ultra‐high‐nickel cathodes in next‐generation high‐energy‐density batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"科技界对瑞他鲁肽（一种所谓的超级肽）的狂热需求","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/inside-techs-feverish-demand-retatrutide-supposed-super-peptide","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"锂离子电池电极结构化创新","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.batterytechonline.com/battery-manufacturing/innovations-in-li-ion-battery-electrode-structuring","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Battery Tech Online","tg":"行业观察","tp":"锂电池电极激光加工","kp":["电极结构[锂电制造]: 簇发模式激光加工"],"as":"介绍MKS Spectra-Physics的脉冲模式激光加工技术在锂离子电池电极结构化中的应用。该技术通过提升加工精度、效率和可扩展性，优化电极微观结构以改善电池性能，对推进电池制造的工业化和降本增效具有重要意义。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Innovations in Li-ion Battery Electrode Structuring","b":"Explore how MKS' Spectra-Physics burst-mode laser processing improves precision, efficiency, and scalability in Li-ion battery manufacturing.\nJune 12, 2026\nLi-ion battery cross section showing: a) convoluted lithium-ion diffusion path during charging, b) formation of metallic lithium dendrites with rapid charging, c) openings in the anode coating facilitate ion diffusion.\nMKS’ Spectra-Physics\nLasers have long been essential in\nlithium-ion battery\nmanufacturing, enabling processes such as welding and cutting. Today, advanced laser technologies, particularly burst-mode laser processing, are changing electrode structuring with unmatched precision and efficiency. These innovations enable intricate electrode designs that improve battery performance, energy density, and reliability while reducing material waste and optimizing energy transfer.\nModern laser systems also enhance manufacturing efficiency, lower costs, and support scalable production to meet the growing demands of electric vehicles (EVs) and renewable energy storage. By addressing key industrial challenges, these advancements are shaping the future of high-performance Li-ion battery manufacturing.\nLithium-ion batteries are essential across applications ranging from consumer electronics to EVs. Despite their diversity, all share common performance goals: higher capacity, faster charging, and longer lifetime. As capacity increases, improving charging rates becomes increasingly critical.\nEV Battery Insulation Goes Digital as Plastic Film Fails Under Fast-Charging Stress\nCharging performance is fundamentally limited by electrode structure. A typical anode consists of a copper current collector coated with a dense graphite layer bound in an organic matrix. During charging, lithium ions diffuse into this layer and are stored in the graphite; during discharge, they are released to generate electrical power.\nThe dense anode structure imposes a key constraint: lithium ions must traverse long, indirect paths to reach deeper graphite particles. This slows charging. Increasing voltage or current to compensate can cause lithium plating and dendrite formation, leading to degradation or catastrophic failure.\nA well-known solution is to introduce structured features (arrays of dimples or grooves) into the coating. These features shorten diffusion paths, enabling faster charging. Although recognized for over a decade, implementing this approach at an industrial scale remains challenging.\nThe following study focuses on parameter optimization for electrode structuring using an ultraviolet (UV), short-nanosecond pulsed laser with flexible burst capability. The relationship between burst parameters and ablation efficiency is examined, defining a path toward high-quality, high-throughput electrode structuring.\nStructured electrodes contain arrays of holes 20–50 µm in diameter, spaced ~150 µm apart, over their entire surface. Industrial production requires drilling rates of at least 100,000 holes per second, approaching 1 million and more at scale. This is well beyond the feasibility of mechanical techniques.\nInnovations in Battery Manufacturing for Solid-State and Dry Electrodes\nThe laser approach offers precision, consistency, and non-contact processing without tool wear. Many laser types have been evaluated, from long-pulse nanosecond to ultrashort pulse (USP) pico- and femtosecond systems.\nLong-pulse nanoseconds (ns) lasers can achieve high throughputs but produce generally poor feature quality due to excessive thermal effects, which often enlarge hole sizes. Conversely, USP lasers provide excellent precision and minimal thermal damage, but high throughput requires complex beam shaping, increasing cost. These trade-offs between throughput and quality have limited adoption and motivate alternative approaches.\nProgrammable burst-mode lasers provide a promising alternative by distributing energy across multiple closely spaced sub-pulses rather than a single pulse. This enables precise temporal control of energy delivery.\nShort-ns burst processing generates a tailored thermal profile that supports both efficient material removal and high feature quality. The nanosecond-scale spacing between pulses limits lateral heat spread, and loading with additional pulses promotes deeper energy penetration. Although some direct ablation occurs, material removal is primarily driven by binder dissociation and ejection of loosened particles.\nThe Case for Domestic Battery Production: Answers to Five Key Questions\nThis controlled thermal mechanism enables efficient, high-speed removal. The key question is whether burst processing can achieve the speeds, quality, and scalability required for high-volume manufacturing.\nExperiments used an MKS Spectra‑Physics Talon Ace UV100 laser (>100 W at 343 nm), integrated with a 2-axis galvanometer scanner producing a ~20 µm spot over a 200 × 200 mm² field. Test samples were double-sided graphite-coated copper anodes with 60 µm coating thickness.\nThe system’s TimeShift burst capability enables independent control of pulse width, repetition rate, and burst parameters such as sub-pulse count and separation time. Pulse widths and separations ranged from ~2 ns to several tens of nanoseconds, with burst repetition rates in the tens to hundreds of kHz.\nThe objective was to determine how burst parameters affect ablation efficiency, feature geometry, and process viability. Metrics included material removal rate, depth-per-pulse (D\n), efficiency, hole quality, and compatibility with high-throughput manufacturing.\nAblated depth-per-pulse (Dpp) improves with larger pulse bursts and shorter time between pulses. Courtesy of MKS’ Spectra-Physics.\nInitial tests used single-pulse operation to establish a baseline. Holes of varying depths were produced at different pulse energies, and depth-per-pulse (D\n) was calculated. Burst testing was then performed, drilling comparable holes but with the energy distributed across multiple sub-pulses.\nBurst mode produced substantially greater material removal than single-pulse operation. Both small and large bursts exceeded the baseline, and at optimal sub-pulse separation, D\nincreased by more than 50%. These results demonstrate that distributing energy across sub-pulses improves coupling into the graphite-binder matrix, enhancing removal efficiency.\nWith optimal pulse separation established, further tests varied pulse energy across different burst sizes. Efficiency was defined as removal depth per unit energy.\nPulse energy is more efficiently used with increasingly large bursts. Courtesy of MKS’ Spectra-Physics.\nThe resulting curves follow the expected behavior of pulsed laser ablation, with peaks representing optimal energy utilization. Below the peak, energy is insufficient for efficient removal; above it, excess energy is lost to heating and plasma formation.\nIncreasing the number of sub-pulses significantly improves peak efficiency. Larger bursts enhance energy coupling and expand the effective operating range. Maximizing burst length, with lower energy per pulse, is the clear path to efficient power use.\nA final analysis examined how burst size affects peak efficiency and total energy required to reach a fixed depth (~50 µm).\nLarger bursts equate to higher processing efficiency and lower total dose of energy required to drill 50 µm deep holes. The colored stars (horizontal axis) correspond to those in the figure above. Courtesy of MKS’ Spectra-Physics.\nAs burst size increases, peak efficiency rises while total energy per hole decreases. This demonstrates improved energy utilization which enables reduced process dose.\nTo validate practical performance, optimized burst parameters were used to drill arrays of ~50 µm deep holes. Each hole was produced with a single burst at a repetition rate of 100,000 holes per second, using continuous beam motion. This “burst-on-the-fly” approach enables straightforward, high-throughput structuring using standard Gaussian beam focusing.\nOptical microscopy reveals the granular nature of the drilling process, with the perimeter of removal defined along particle grain boundaries. Hole diameters are somewhat large at the surface but quickly taper to ~20 µm and less throughout the remaining drilled depth.\nDrilled holes demonstrate removal at grain boundaries and rapid tapering to 20 µm and below. Courtesy of MKS’ Spectra-Physics.\nThe improved performance of burst processing arises from progressive material modification within each burst. Closely spaced sub-pulses alter the graphite-binder matrix, allowing subsequent pulses to remove material more efficiently. This reduces energy loss to heat and plasma shielding while enhancing overall removal effectiveness.\nThese effects provide several practical advantages:\nIncreased material removal rates\nReduced thermal damage\nImproved feature quality\nLower energy consumption per feature\nScalability to high-throughput manufacturing\nTogether, these benefits address the primary limitations that have constrained industrial implementation of structured electrodes.\nBurst-mode laser processing significantly improves energy utilization in Li-ion battery electrode structuring. Distributing energy across closely spaced sub-pulses enhances coupling within the graphite-binder matrix, increasing ablation depth while reducing thermal losses.\nAs a result, deeper features can be produced with less energy, lowering thermal load and improving feature quality. At the same time, higher efficiency supports increased throughput, meeting the demands of industrial-scale production.\nThese results demonstrate that short-nanosecond burst processing provides a practical and scalable solution for high-speed electrode structuring, enabling faster-charging and higher-performance lithium-ion batteries.\nJim Bovatsek\nSenior Manager of Application Engineering , MKS’ Spectra-Physics\nJim Bovatsek is a Senior Manager of Application Engineering at MKS’ Spectra-Physics industrial laser applications laboratory in Milpitas, California USA.\nSee more from\nJim Bovatsek"},{"t":"工业产能过剩可实现电力使用的季节性灵活性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02073-y","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"工业电力季节灵活性","kp":["[铝冶炼]: 产能过剩释放季节性用电灵活性"],"as":"研究指出，随着水泥、钢铁和铝等高耗能工业在多国需求下滑，其过剩产能可转化为电力系统季节性灵活调配的宝贵资源。该思路将工业产能闲置问题转化为电网灵活性管理机遇，有助于可再生能源消纳和电力系统低碳转型。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Industrial overcapacity can enable seasonal flexibility in electricity use","b":"In many countries declining demand in energy-intensive industries (EIIs) such as cement, steel and aluminium is leading"},{"t":"将有机反离子掺入聚(庚嗪酰亚胺)网络以促进质子耦合电子转移","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524638?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化电荷传输","kp":["[聚庚嗪亚胺]: 有机鏻反离子促PCET","H2O2[光催化]: 有机反离子增强"],"dp":1,"as":"研究将甲基铵(MA+)、甲脒(FA+)、四甲基铵(TMA+)等有机阳离子引入聚庚嗪酰亚胺(PHI)网络，促进质子耦合反应。该策略调控光催化材料的电荷分离与传输及反应动力学，为太阳能燃料合成和光催化体系设计提供新思路。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Incorporation of Organic Counter‐Cations Into Poly(Heptazine Imide) Networks for Promoting Proton‐Coupled Electron Trans","b":"ABSTRACT Nitrogen based onium ions such as methylammonium (MA + ), formamidinium (FA + ), and tetramethylammonium (TMA +..."},{"t":"通过脂质体纳米药物对 CAR 肺泡巨噬细胞进行原位重编程用于肺癌免疫治疗","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74162-1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Immunotherapy has revolutionized lung cancer treatment; however, response rates remain suboptimal. Alveolar macrophages","tp":"巨噬细胞免疫","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究提出利用脂质体纳米药物对肺泡巨噬细胞进行原位重编程，将其转化为具有抗肿瘤功能的CAR巨噬细胞，用于肺癌免疫治疗。该策略克服了传统免疫治疗响应率不足的问题，通过局部递送实现免疫微环境重塑，为肺癌治疗提供了新的原位细胞治疗方案。","aip":1},{"t":"原位同步SERS-SEIRAS揭示氧还原反应中阳离子调控的界面水与中间体","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8900381?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"ORR界面水表征","kp":["界面水[碱性ORR]: SERS-SEIRAS同步原位解析"],"dp":1,"as":"利用原位同步SERS-SEIRAS光谱技术揭示碱性氧还原反应(ORR)中界面水的关键作用。研究发现阳离子调控界面水分子结构和反应中间体，深化了对ORR反应机理的理解，对燃料电池和金属-空气电池的电催化剂设计具有重要指导意义。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"In Situ Synchronized SERS‐SEIRAS Unveils Cation‐Regulated Interfacial Water and Intermediates in the Oxygen Reduction Re","b":"ABSTRACT Interfacial water plays a crucial yet poorly understood role in the alkaline oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) by...","aip":1},{"t":"我就人工智能向梵蒂冈和联合国提出建议——不要将教皇的信息视为神学","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01876-z","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The papal letter goes beyond a religious document and diagnoses a failure in AI governance that the scientific community","tp":"AI治理伦理","sc":2.0,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":0.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本文探讨了教皇关于人工智能的信函，指出该文件超越了纯粹的宗教范畴，深刻诊断了当前人工智能治理体系的失败。作者呼吁梵蒂冈和联合国等国际组织在制定AI政策时应采取科学视角，不应仅将其视为神学讨论。文章强调了科学界与技术界在参与全球人工智能伦理和监管框架建设中的重要性。"},{"t":"人类在此高难度数学测试中胜过AI","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01888-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI数学能力评测","as":"一项新的数学基准测试显示，AI系统在解答此前从未见过的数学难题时仍显著落后于顶尖人类专家。该结果表明，尽管大语言模型在众多任务中表现优异，但在高度严密的数学推理与证明领域，人类专家的优势依然难以撼动。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Humans outperform AI at this highly rigorous mathematics test","b":"A new benchmark pitting AI against previously unseen maths problems shows systems still fall short of top human expertis"},{"t":"人 CD24+ 牙乳头细胞是通过 BMP2/SIRT1 轴进行牙本质牙髓再生的能力种子细胞","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74348-7","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"Regeneration of the dentin-pulp complex is essential for tooth integrity and function. However, the inherent cell hetero"},{"t":"一位硅谷国会议员如何试图从政治中获取人工智能巨额资金","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/one-silicon-valley-congressman-trying-get-ai-mega-money-politics","c":"未分类","a":"the information","tg":"政策监管","b":"Subscribe to unlock","tp":"AI资金政治","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":0.0,"r":3.0,"d":0.0,"t":6.0},"as":"文章探讨了一位硅谷国会议员如何试图从政治层面运作，以获取人工智能领域的巨额资金。"},{"t":"马斯克如何让银行家在 SpaceX IPO 冲刺中不断猜测","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/musk-kept-bankers-guessing-sprint-spacex-ipo","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"支持PEM的AI训练数据中心承载容量：双层优化方法","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008858?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"AI数据中心承载力","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Hosting capacity of AI training data centers with PEM support: A two-level optimization approach"},{"t":"高熵诱导晶格畸变激活双钴位点协同效应以增强光(电)催化产氢","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73708?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵光电催化制氢","kp":["晶格畸变[高熵尖晶石]: 平均3.35%","[活性位点]: Co tet2+/Co oct3+双位点","[材料体系]: 高熵尖晶石氧化物"],"as":"利用高熵工程破解太阳能水分解中活性与稳定性难以兼得的矛盾。研究设计尖晶石型氧化物，通过高熵诱导的晶格畸变激活双钴位点的协同催化效应，显著提升光(电)催化分解水的催化活性与长期稳定性。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High‐Entropy‐Induced Lattice Distortion Activates Dual‐Cobalt Site Synergy for Boosted Photo(Electro)Catalytic Hydrogen ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy engineering breaks the activity–stability trade‐off in solar water splitting. We design a spinel oxide (CuCoNi)(GaCoCrMnFe)\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    with lattice distortion (\n                    \n                      δ\n                      avg\n                    \n                    = 3.35%) and stabilized Co\n                    tet\n                    2+\n                    /Co\n                    oct\n                    3+\n                    dual sites. The cocktail effect goes beyond elemental averaging: Cu/Ga harvest light; Co enables dual‐site surface catalysis; Ni/Cr induce distortion and local built‐in fields; Cu/Mn trigger Jahn–Teller upshifting the d‐band center; Fe/Mn balance distortion; multivalent species provide a broad redox window. The material achieves a photocatalytic HER rate of 16.62 µmol∙h\n                    −1\n                    ∙g\n                    −1\n                    —16.3× that of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    and 10.8× that of CuGa\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , alongside &lt;5% decay over 30 h. In photoelectrochemical tests, it delivers 2.03 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0 V\n                    RHE\n                    in neutral electrolyte (21.6× and 67.7× the benchmarks) and 7.08 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    under alkaline conditions with 48% IPCE and 0.56% HC‐STH. Distortion‐induced dipoles (0.87 D) extend carrier lifetime to 6.95 ns; Co\n                    tet\n                    2+\n                    dissociates water (\n                    \n                      E\n                      a\n                    \n                    = 0.187 eV) while Co\n                    oct\n                    3+\n                    reduces protons (\n                    \n                      ΔG\n                      *H\n                    \n                    = 0.288 eV); configurational entropy (2.71\n                    R\n                    ) stabilizes the structure. This “entropy–structure–function” strategy offers a generalizable route to durable, high‐performance solar fuel catalysts."},{"t":"异型细胞间粘附调节细胞间迁移的效率","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524496123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cell migration across epithelial barriers occurs in diverse developmental, immunological, and pathological contexts. Here, we investigate the contribution of heterotypic adhesion between migrating cells and epithelial “substrate” cells to transepithelial migration. Using an in silico model inspired by the migration of primordial germ cells across the midgut epithelium in the\n                    Drosophila\n                    embryo, we show that heterotypic adhesion modulates migration efficiency in a nonmonotonic manner, revealing the existence of an optimal adhesion regime. Consistent with this prediction, in vivo overexpression of E-cadherin in germ cells accelerated their exit from the midgut relative to controls. Beyond providing experimentally testable predictions, our model integrates and explains previous observations on the role of heterotypic adhesion in cell-on-cell migration, offering a framework for understanding transepithelial migration across biological contexts.","tp":"细胞迁移粘附","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究通过计算模型和果蝇胚胎实验揭示了异型细胞间粘附在上皮屏障跨细胞迁移中的关键调控作用。迁移细胞与上皮\"基底\"细胞之间的异型粘附强度可调节迁移效率，该发现对理解发育、免疫和病理过程中的细胞跨上皮迁移机制具有重要意义。"},{"t":"细菌鞭毛分子轴承的异质性和多尺度动力学","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74079-9","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"The bacterial flagellum is a protein-based rotary machine that drives bacterial motility. It comprises the bacterial fla"},{"t":"通过Mg3Sb2量子点实现梯度晶面取向工程用于高性能稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71181?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["[结晶调控]: Mg3Sb2量子点后处理","[取向工程]: 梯度晶面取向"],"as":"针对有机-无机杂化钙钛矿在溶液加工中结晶不可控导致缺陷的问题，本研究通过Mg3Sb2量子点实施梯度晶面取向工程。该策略优化钙钛矿薄膜的结晶动力学与晶面取向，显著提升器件的光电转换效率和长期稳定性。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Gradient Facet Orientation Engineering Via Mg3Sb2 Quantum Dots for High‐Performance and Stable Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organic‐inorganic hybrid perovskite suffers from uncontrollable crystallization in solution processing, leading to the formation of randomly oriented polycrystalline films and thus limiting both performance and stability of perovskite solar cells (PSCs). Here, we propose a Mg\n                    3\n                    Sb\n                    2\n                    quantum dots (QDs) post‐treatment method on perovskite wet film to modulate perovskite crystallization and guide facet‐specific growth. As a result, high crystallization quality perovskite films with gradient facet orientation (GFO) are constructed. The GFO structure with (111) facet‐dominated top layer and (001) facet‐dominated bottom layer synergistically integrates the advantages of different crystal facets, i.e., low work function, high ion migration activation energy, high hole mobility, and superior stability against moisture of (111)‐facet, and low electron trap state density and high electron mobility of (001)‐facet. Moreover, Mg\n                    3\n                    Sb\n                    2\n                    QDs inhibit the formation of I\n                    −\n                    vacancy defects by Mg\n                    2+\n                    strongly interacting with perovskite. Consequently, the optimized target PSCs achieve a champion power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 25.18% (vs. 23.07% for control device). The unencapsulated devices exhibit significantly improved stability, retaining 75% of its initial PCE after continuous light soaking for 1000 h and over 75% after storage in the dark for 6240 h. The corresponding flexible PSCs obtain a champion PCE of 24.03% and exhibit excellent mechanical durability."},{"t":"基于距离几何的生成流模型用于预测化学反应过渡态","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74101-0","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"反应过渡态预测","kp":["[过渡态预测]: 距离几何生成流模型"],"dp":1,"as":"提出一种基于距离几何的生成流模型，用于预测化学反应的过渡态。该方法利用深度学习捕捉分子构型与反应坐标间的复杂映射关系，加速过渡态搜索过程，对理解反应机理、催化剂设计和反应路径预测具有重要意义。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Generative flow model on distance geometry for predicting transition states of chemical reactions","b":"This paper addresses the challenge of predicting transition states, which are essential for understanding reaction mecha"},{"t":"强双稳态非线性磁振子谐振器中超宽带频率梳的产生","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74143-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"as":"在强双稳态非线性磁子谐振器中实现超宽带频率梳输出。磁子频率梳(MFCs)为片上相干微波信号源提供了紧凑节能的解决方案，本研究通过非线性效应拓展其带宽，对微波光子学、精密测量和量子信息技术具有应用价值。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁子频率梳","kp":["[器件]: 强双稳态非线性磁振子谐振器","[频率梳]: 超宽带磁振子频率梳"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Generation of ultra-broadband frequency comb in strongly bistable nonlinear magnonic resonator","b":"Magnonic frequency combs (MFCs) offer a promising route to compact, energy-efficient platforms for on-chip coherent micr"},{"t":"MOF中功能集成的异金属簇用于下一代先进热催化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00143-9?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"异金属MOF热催化","kp":["[催化平台]: 异金属MOF限域孔道协同催化"],"as":"综述异金属MOF（金属有机框架）在下一代先进热催化中的应用。异金属MOF通过空间定制的金属中心与受限孔隙微环境相结合,将双金属或多金属协同催化位点精确嵌入多孔骨架内,从而在分子尺度上调控催化活性、选择性与稳定性。该体系可为C-C偶联、加氢、氧化等关键反应提供可设计平台,被视为突破传统均/多相催化瓶颈的重要方向。文章系统讨论了金属节点配位策略、孔道限域效应及构效关系,展望了其在工业催化中的规模化前景。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Functionally integrated heterometallic clusters in MOFs for next-generation advanced thermal catalysis","b":"Heterometallic MOFs integrate spatially tailored metal centers and confined pore microenvironments, offering a transformative design paradigm for synergistic catalysis toward the selective synthesis of fine chemicals."},{"t":"氧化石墨烯的片段化液晶","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00237-7?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧化石墨烯液晶","kp":["[新物态]: 碎化液晶态(向列液晶与聚集体间中间态)"],"as":"Shen等人在氧化石墨烯（GO）体系中识别出一种'碎片液晶'状态,介于普通向列液晶与完全固态凝胶之间。该中间相由GO纳米片在溶液中不完全取向聚集形成,表现出独特的局部有序与流动特性。研究揭示了二维纳米片从各向同性溶液向液晶相转变的非连续路径,对理解二维材料自组装、制备高性能GO薄膜及功能性软物质体系具有重要意义,也为调控石墨烯基材料的微观结构提供了新视角。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Fragmented liquid crystals of graphene oxide","b":"Shen et al. identify fragmented liquid crystals in graphene oxide as an intermediate state between ordinary nematic liquid crystals and aggregation. Enabled by balanced inter-sheet interactions, large liquid-crystal domains fragment into small, sheet-scale regions while retaining fluidity and processability. This frustrated order provides an unexpected route to compact amorphous architectures distinct from conventional crystalline-oriented liquid-crystal assembly, suppressing large structural defects and combining high strength with toughness."},{"t":"柔性超分辨率皮肤：基于传感器内超维计算实现实时压力场感知","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee4065?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性触觉感知","kp":["[计算架构]: 传感器内超维计算","[特点]: 稀疏阵列超分辨率压力感知"],"as":"提出一种柔性、超分辨率电子皮肤,结合传感器内超维计算（hyperdimensional computing）实现实时表面压力场测量。针对无人系统状态评估对高空间分辨率压力感知的迫切需求,该皮肤能在传感端直接完成特征编码与计算,大幅降低数据传输与延迟,在噪声环境下保持鲁棒性。系统兼顾高精度、高空间分辨率与柔性贴合,可用于机器人触觉、飞行器表面流场监测等场景,为智能感知硬件与边缘计算的融合提供新范式。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Flexible, super-resolution skin with in-sensor hyperdimensional computing for real-time pressure field perception","b":"Precise, highly spatial resolution surface pressure measurement is critical for reliable state assessment of unmanned systems, such as the flight safety of unmanned aerial vehicles. Conventionally, the acquisition of such high-resolution data requires dense, expensive sensing arrays or relies on external computational resources. Here, we introduce a flexible electronic skin featuring a sparse sensing network integrated with in-sensor numerical hyperdimensional computing, thereby facilitating super-resolution sensing and in-sensor learning. This innovative approach processes sparse inputs to produce high-resolution pressure field maps on-device, enabling rapid real-time analysis and precise flight state identification. The numerical hyperdimensional computing enhances the efficiency of in-sensor learning, overcoming the limitations of conventional vector symbolic architectures previously confined to classification tasks. Furthermore, the integration of hyperdimensional computing substantially boosts the performance of the flexible sensing skin. Compared to the computer-aided super-resolution method, our approach reduces power consumption from ~40 watts to ~0.09 milliwatts, memory usage from ~2274 to ~32 kilobytes, and latency from ~115 to ~10 milliseconds, respectively. The achieved super-resolution capability reaches an enhancement factor of 5.517. Compared with conventional high-density sensing arrays, our approach reduces the number of interconnects by 91.5% (using a 4 by 4 array). Last, the developed super-resolution skin is applied in unmanned aerial vehicle flight control."},{"t":"首次测量风味变化中性电流衰减中随时间变化的 $CP$ 违规 ${B}^{0}→{K}_{S}^{0}{μ}^","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/nnt3-nyds","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): R. Aaij et al. (LHCb Collaboration)The decay of a b quark to a strange quark and a pair of leptons reveals the first indications of time-dependent CP violation.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231904] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"新兴和发展中国家不确定性下的金融包容性以及获得清洁烹饪燃料和技术的机会","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003824?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"清洁烹饪燃料","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":0.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"仿成纤维细胞木质素聚合物囊泡用于机械可重构生物皮肤的逻辑门控合成","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6127627?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生木质素生物皮肤","kp":["仿生组装[木质素聚合物体]: 模仿成纤维细胞"],"dp":1,"as":"开发成纤维细胞仿生木质素聚合物囊泡,用于逻辑门控合成、机械可重构的生物材料。衰老伴随皮肤弹性进行性丧失,而成纤维细胞埋藏于细胞外基质中负责维持组织力学性质。该仿生体系模拟成纤维细胞功能,通过逻辑门控响应外部刺激按需合成并重塑材料,实现机械性能的动态可逆调控。研究为抗衰老组织工程、智能生物支架和自修复皮肤替代物提供了基于天然木质素的新策略。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Fibroblast‐Mimetic Lignin Polymersomes for Logic‐Gated Synthesis of Mechanically Reconfigurable Bioskins","b":"ABSTRACT Ageing is inevitable and accompanied by progressive loss of skin elasticity. Fibroblasts, embedded within the e"},{"t":"铁电动态场驱动的成核与生长模型用于预测性材料-电路协同设计","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73722?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电器件建模","kp":["开关模型[铁电动态场]: 动态场驱动成核生长"],"dp":1,"as":"提出一种铁电动态场驱动成核与生长模型,用于材料到电路的预测性设计。真实铁电器件在混合、畸变的时变电压下工作,而标准成核模型仅适用于理想化条件,难以准确预测实际开关动态。该工作引入动态场依赖的成核-生长描述,可更真实地刻画铁电薄膜在复杂驱动波形下的极化翻转行为,为铁电存储器、铁电晶体管等器件的可靠性建模与电路级协同优化提供定量工具。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Ferroelectric Dynamic‐Field‐Driven Nucleation and Growth Model for Predictive Materials‐To‐Circuit Co‐Design","b":"ABSTRACT Real ferroelectric devices operate under mixed and distorted time‐varying voltages, yet the standard nucleation","aip":1},{"t":"不完美硬件上的无故障模拟计算","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01638-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"模拟内存计算容错","kp":["容错[忆阻模拟存算]: 不完美硬件免错计算"],"as":"探讨利用不完美硬件实现无故障模拟计算的方法。基于忆阻器的模拟内存计算可直接借助物理规律在存储单元内完成运算,但器件固有的非理想性（如器件间变异、电导漂移、噪声）会引入误差。该研究提出容错计算架构与算法补偿策略,使系统在不完美硬件上仍能获得可靠的推理精度,兼顾能效与准确性,为大规模部署低精度、高能效模拟计算硬件解决实际工程瓶颈提供可行路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Fault-free analogue computing with imperfect hardware","b":"Memristor-based analogue in-memory computing can compute with physical laws, performing computations directly within mem","aip":1},{"t":"扩展环内共轭与N,N-双齿螯合缓解有机镁电池的容量-稳定性权衡","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5222656?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机镁电池正极","kp":["[分子设计策略]: 扩展内环共轭+多齿Mg²⁺配位","[电极材料]: 六氮杂三苯撑基有机物"],"dp":1,"as":"通过扩展内环共轭与N,N-双齿螯合策略缓解可充镁电池正极材料的容量-稳定性权衡难题。可充镁电池作为有前景的'后锂'储能技术,受限于正极容量低、循环稳定性差等问题。本研究在有机正极分子中引入延长共轭体系并配合双齿配位,提升电子结构稳定性与活性位点利用率,使高容量与长循环寿命得以兼顾。该分子设计思路为发展高能量密度镁电池及多价离子电池体系提供了新方向。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Extended Endocyclic Conjugation and N,N‐Bidentate Chelation Alleviate the Capacity–Stability Trade‐Off in Organic Magnes","b":"ABSTRACT Rechargeable Mg batteries represent an appealing post‐lithium energy‐storage technology, yet their advancement ...","aip":1},{"t":"瑞士政策框架下能源社区的规模效应探索","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008214?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源社区规模效应","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Exploring scale effects of energy communities under the Swiss policy framework"},{"t":"细胞小型化的实验进化揭示了细胞尺寸进化的假定机制","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531280123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cell volume, a key determinant of physiology, is maintained by cell size homeostasis. Large deviations from typical size are often harmful, yet cell sizes have diverged drastically during evolution. How size homeostasis evolves to support such diversity without impairing cellular function remains unclear. To address this question, we used experimental evolution to progressively select for smaller\n                    Saccharomyces cerevisiae\n                    cells. Over 1,500 generations, we achieved a fourfold modal volume reduction compared to wild type. Despite this reduction, evolved populations maintained robust size homeostasis and relatively high fitness, revealing that substantial decreases in cell volume can occur without severe growth defects. Whole-genome sequencing and genetic perturbations identified mutations in the G1 cyclin Cln3 and the Target of Rapamycin (TOR) pathway effector Sch9 as major contributors to cell size reduction, with the Greatwall kinase Rim15 signaling cascade further modulating this phenotype. Manipulating these pathways produced a sixfold range in cell size without changes in ploidy, with engineered mutations recapitulating the volumes of evolved lines, and loss-of-function mutations yielding enlarged cells. Our results demonstrate the evolutionary plasticity of cell size homeostasis and reveal a putative mechanism for eukaryotic cell size evolution.","tp":"细胞进化机制","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"通过对酿酒酵母进行长达1500代的实验进化筛选，研究团队逐步选择了更小的细胞，揭示了细胞尺寸稳态进化的潜在机制。细胞体积是生理功能的关键决定因素，该研究阐明了生物如何在剧烈改变细胞大小的同时维持正常功能，为理解细胞尺寸多样性的进化起源提供了实验证据。"},{"t":"非苯环芳香族化合物中的激发态反芳香性：用分子筛检查分子内质子转移的动力学","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6799620?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The relief of excited‐state antiaromaticity (ESAA) is a powerful driving force that underpins the photochemical behavior of photoexcited aromatic molecules. Photo‐induced isomerization, cycloaddition, or proton transfer pathways alleviate the large energetic destabilization caused by ESAA. However, the excited‐state dynamics of annulenes displaying only weak ESAA remain largely unexplored. Here, we fine‐tune the electronic character of a series of annulenes to minimize their ESAA. Excited‐state proton transfer (ESPT) converts hydroxytropyliums (HTs) and hydroxybenzotropyliums (HBTs) to their nonaromatic tautomers, which are only slightly lower in energy than the excited‐state antiaromatic forms. As a result of this near‐degeneracy, we find that HBTs exhibit weak photoacidity (pKa drop of 0.3–1.2 units) and unusually slow, reversible ESPT, proceeding on the ns timescale rather than the typical ps timescale. The fluorescence spectra of these HBTs display the hallmarks of ESPT emitters: (i) dual fluorescence; (ii) excitation‐dependent emission; and (iii) large Stokes shifts. The driving force for this ESPT is increased by the addition of electron‐donating groups, which promote intramolecular charge transfer. Our results demonstrate that judicious structural changes can moderate the ESAA of nonbenzenoid annulenes, minimizing the driving force for ESPT, which leads to slow proton transfer kinetics and weak photoacidity.","tp":"光化学动力学","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究团队通过精细调控一系列轮烯分子的电子特性，探索激发态反芳香性（ESAA）较弱时的激发态动力学行为。利用分子筛技术检测分子内质子转移过程，揭示了非苯环芳香族化合物在光激发后的异构化、环加成或质子转移等反应路径，拓展了对光化学行为的理解。"},{"t":"能量-翻译偶联限制厌氧酵母生长","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74197-4","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"厌氧酵母代谢","kp":["葡萄糖最大摄取率[厌氧酵母]: ~14 mmol/gDW/h"],"as":"研究能量-翻译偶联如何限制酿酒酵母的厌氧生长。理解营养特异性限制如何塑造厌氧代谢对该模式生物至关重要。研究发现,在厌氧条件下ATP合成与核糖体翻译之间的能量偶联效率成为生长瓶颈:能量供给不足或翻译-能量分配失衡会显著降低生物量积累速率。该工作揭示了厌氧发酵生长的核心代谢约束,对工业发酵优化、生物燃料生产及细胞工厂设计具有指导意义。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Energy-translation coupling limits anaerobic yeast growth","b":"Understanding how nutrient-specific limitations shape anaerobic metabolism in Saccharomyces cerevisiae is essential for"},{"t":"中美紧张局势阴影下的能源通胀：能源转型是通向稳定的途径吗？","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003563?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型策","sc":1.7,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"银河系中心过剩源的能量分布","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/dkcq-6y4f","c":"未分类","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Florian List, Yujin Park, Nicholas L. Rodd, Eve Schoen, and Florian WolfThe Galactic Center Excess (GCE) may yet herald the discovery of annihilating dark matter. Weighing against that conclusion are analyses showing evidence for dim point sources within the spatial structure of the emission. Because of technical limitations these analyses are purely spatial with all sp…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231001] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","tp":"暗物质探测","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"最新发表在《物理评论快报》的研究深入分析了银河系中心过剩源（GCE）的能量分布。GCE一直被认为是发现暗物质湮灭的潜在线索，但近期有空间分析表明其可能源于暗淡的点源。本研究克服了以往纯空间分析的技术限制，将能量分布特征纳入考量，旨在进一步验证GCE究竟是源自暗物质粒子的湮灭，还是由大量未解析的恒星点源聚集所产生。"},{"t":"面向人工智能的新兴集成光子神经网络技术：从器件到系统","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag335/8707690?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"集成光子神经网络","kp":["[技术路线]: 硅基光子神经网络降低延迟与能耗"],"dp":1,"as":"综述面向人工智能的新兴集成光子神经网络技术,覆盖从器件到系统的全栈进展。AI算力需求爆发式增长使传统电子计算面临功耗与互连带宽瓶颈,而光子计算凭借高带宽、低延迟、低能耗的矩阵运算优势成为潜在替代。文章梳理了光子器件（马赫-曾德调制器、微环谐振器等）、片上互联架构与光子神经网络算法的协同设计,讨论其在推理、训练及神经形态计算中的应用前景与集成挑战。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Emerging Integrated Photonic Neural Network Technologies for Artificial Intelligence: From Devices to Systems","b":"The rapid expansion of artificial intelligence (AI) has created an explosive demand for computing power, while tradition"},{"t":"由异质代谢物分布驱动的合成交叉喂养群中出现的表型异质性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag357/8707057?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cooperation is crucial for constructions of all levels of life. But cooperation is often vulnerable, and understanding the underlying causes remains a grand challenge in ecology and evolution. Here we, by constructing a synthetic cooperative system consisting of two genetically engineered Escherichia coli strains with metabolic cross-feeding, demonstrate that cross-feeding, though it promotes the growth, amplifies cell noise of both strain populations in the bacterial consortium. The emergent phenotypic heterogeneity, expressed as the induced increase in cell noise by cross-feeding, is attributed mainly to enhanced resource heterogeneity and subsequent variation in gene expression among cells within each population. We further show that the positive interaction (including mutualism, commensalism and/or exploitation) also induces phenotypic heterogeneity in distinct microbial consortia consisting of bacterial strains isolated from aquatic, soil or rhizospheric environments. Our results reveal a cooperation-induced trade-off between population fitness and homogeneity, highlighting the importance of stochasticity in understanding the evolution of cooperation in microbiomes in nature.","tp":"表型异质性","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究构建了由两种基因工程改造的大肠杆菌组成的合成交叉喂养系统，发现代谢交叉喂养虽促进群体生长，却放大了两种菌株的细胞噪声，导致表型异质性的涌现。该发现揭示了合作系统中表型多样性的产生机制，对理解生态和进化中合作的脆弱性具有重要意义。"},{"t":"退化LiCoO2的电子软化通过配体介导界面调制实现直接再生","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag369/8707691?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钴酸锂直接再生","kp":["[再生策略]: 电子软化+配体介导界面调控","[技术挑战]: 表面电子结构不稳定致晶格缺陷"],"dp":1,"as":"发现退化的钴酸锂（LiCoO2,LCO）正极因电子软化效应可通过配体介导的界面修饰实现直接再生。直接再生废弃LCO正极对可持续电池回收至关重要,但传统方法难以恢复其深层结构损伤。本研究揭示退化LCO中过渡金属-氧键的电子结构弱化（电子软化）降低了再生能垒,通过特定配体调控固液界面反应,在温和条件下重建晶格与电化学性能。该绿色再生路线为大规模锂电池材料循环利用提供了新机制与工艺基础。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Electronic softening of degraded LiCoO2 enables direct regeneration via ligand-mediated interface modulation","b":"The direct regeneration of degraded lithium cobalt oxide (LiCoO2, LCO) cathodes is pivotal for sustainable battery recyc"},{"t":"电化学人工腐殖化用于可持续废弃生物质高值化利用与土壤修复","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74387-0","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Earth and environmental sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学仿生腐殖化","kp":["反应时间[电化学人工腐殖化]: 60分钟","[对比]: 自然/微生物腐殖化需数天至数年","[产物]: 人工腐殖质用于土壤修复"],"dp":1,"as":"提出电化学人工腐殖化技术,用于废弃生物质增值与土壤修复。自然界中生物质通过腐殖化转变为腐殖质,是碳循环与土壤肥力的核心过程。该工作以电化学方法加速模拟该转化,将农林废弃生物质定向转化为类腐殖功能分子,既实现废弃物高值化利用（如有机肥、吸附剂、功能碳材料）,又能改良退化土壤、固定碳。该策略兼具废弃物处理、碳封存与生态修复多重效益,为可持续农业与循环经济提供新路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Electrochemical artificial humification for sustainable waste biomass valorization and soil remediation","b":"Waste biomass valorization is critical for sustainability. In nature, biomass is converted into humic substances via hum"},{"t":"电动拉力赛车复兴：全新280马力标致E-208 GTi","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/13/electric-rally-car-revival-continues-with-new-280-hp-peugeot-e-208-gti/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动拉力赛车","kp":["功率[标致E-208 GTi]: 280 hp"],"as":"标致推出全新纯电拉力赛车E-208 GTi,功率达280马力,延续了电动拉力赛车的复兴。该车于本周末勒芒24小时耐力赛公开亮相。作为经典GTi性能标识的电动化延续,E-208 GTi体现了汽车厂商将高性能与小钢炮传统向电动传动系统迁移的趋势,表明电动化正在深入传统燃油主导的拉力赛事领域。报道反映了电动汽车在赛道竞技、动力总成电气化及性能车型营销方面的最新进展。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":9.0},"ot":"Electric rally car revival continues with new, 280 hp Peugeot E-208 GTi","b":"| Jun 13 2026 - 7:56 am PT\nMaking its public debut at the legendary 24 Hours of LeMans this weekend, the new, 280 hp Peugeot E-208 GTi resurrects another storied hot hatch name as it takes its place alongside reborn 80s icons from Lancia and Renault.\nFirst unveiled as a concept last year, the new age E-208 GTi is production ready now,\nwith specs that have it slotting right between the reborn Renault 5 and 280 hp Lancia Y HF\n, resurrecting the feisty French hot hatch from the 80s and 90s with modern styling that’s immediately familiar to fans – and, with 280 hp and 345 Nm (~255 lb-ft) of TQ – performance that’s mercifully closer to the GTi you\nthan the GTi that really was.\n“We wanted a car that evokes our history, but with a sober expression of performance,” explains Vincent Héride, Product Manager of the new Peugeot E-208 GTi. “No exuberance, but a confident stance, poised on the road.”\n“From the bodywork to the wheel arches, the iconic red is omnipresent,” reads the breathless copy in the press release – and they’re not wrong. The retro\nrouge highlights are everywhere.\nA nod to the original 205 GTi’s ‘holey’ alloy wheels, the E-208 GTi’s rides on 18″ wheels with bold diamond-cut perforations and bright red GTi branding wrapped in sticky, Michelin Pilot Sport Cup 2 high performance tires. Inside, the red is immersive, surrounding the Peugeot’s lucky drivers and passengers with bright red carpets and floor mats, red-accented sports seats, and a tight Alcantara steering wheel – all directly inspired by the original 205 GTi.\nA lowered ride height, stiffened suspension, rear anti-roll bar, and unique steering geometry designed to boost responsiveness complete the GTi’s performance package, and ensure that the added hp and torque can be put to the ground effectively while making the GTi feel substantially different from behind the wheel than its more pedestrian “base” E-208 cousins.\nPeugeot is promising 217 miles of range from the GTi’s 54 kWh battery\n(the same found in the standard E-208), with pricing that starts at about £35K (approx., $46K USD, including VAT).\nThe 30% federal solar tax credit is ending this year. If you’ve ever considered going solar, now’s the time to act. To make sure you find a trusted, reliable solar installer near you that offers competitive pricing, check out\n, a free service that makes it easy for you to go solar. It has hundreds of pre-vetted solar installers competing for your business, ensuring you get high-quality solutions and save 20-30% compared to going it alone. Plus, it’s free to use, and\nyou won’t get sales calls\nuntil you select an installer and share your phone number with them.\nYour personalized solar quotes are easy to compare online and you’ll get access to unbiased Energy Advisors to help you every step of the way.\nGet started here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nI’ve been in and around the auto industry for over thirty years, and have written for a number of well-known outlets like CleanTechnica, Popular Mechanics, the Truth About Cars, and more. You can catch me at Electrek Daily’s Quick Charge, The Heavy Equipment Podcast, or chasing my kids around Oak Park, IL\nFind a reliable home solar and battery installer and save 20-30% compared to going it alone.\nQmerit makes electrification easy — connecting you with trusted pros who get it done right."},{"t":"来自小角度质子散射的 $sd$ 壳核中的电偶极子强度","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/4yjj-ybpj","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): R. W. Fearick, O. Le Noan, H. Matsubara, P. von Neumann-Cosel, K. Sieja, and A. TamiiBackground: Total photoabsorption cross sections are important for an understanding of nuclear structure and for many applications, in particular in astrophysics. The majority of data stems from measurements of neutron emission after photoexcitation, which, in heavy nuclei, represent a good approxim…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064311] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"通过相干控制高效实现单qutrit门集","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/vwzp-szjp","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单量子特门操作","kp":["[量子门]: 三能级qutrit门相干控制合成"],"as":"提出并实验演示了一种基于相干控制的高效单qutrit（三能级量子系统）门集实现方案。相比传统的Rabi振荡方法，相干控制通过最优脉冲设计大幅降低门操作时间和误差累积，提升了量子计算操作保真度。该工作为超越二能级量子比特的更高维量子信息处理提供了可行的硬件级操控路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Efficient Implementation of a Single-Qutrit Gate Set via Coherent Control","b":"Author(s): Xiang-Min Yu, Xiang Deng, Wen Zheng, Wei Xin, Tao Zhang, Hanxin Che, Kun Zhou, Haoyu Zhou, Yangyang Ge, Zhenchuan Zhang, Wanli Huang, Haoyang Cai, Xianke Li, Jie Zhao, Xinsheng Tan, Yu Zhang, Shao-Xiong Li, and Yang YuQutrits offer the potential for enhanced quantum computation by exploiting an enlarged Hilbert space. However, the synthesis of high-fidelity and fast qutrit gates, particularly for single qutrits, remains an ongoing challenge, as it involves overcoming intrinsic constraints in quantum platforms. He…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230803] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"Pam3CSK4 作为人源化小鼠和非人灵长类动物多糖疫苗跨物种佐剂的功效","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74194-7","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"Polysaccharide-based vaccines are essential for preventing bacterial infections, but their effectiveness is limited by w..."},{"t":"双猝灭电荷转移在氧化还原活性赤藓红Y聚合物中实现创纪录的光催化硝酸盐还原为氨","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73686?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化硝酸盐制氨","kp":["[电荷机制]: 双淬灭电荷转移","[光催化剂]: Eosin Y氧化还原活性聚合物"],"as":"通过双猝灭电荷转移机制实现创纪录的硝酸盐光催化还原为氨（NO₃RR）效率。光催化NO₃RR对缓解氮污染和绿色合成氨具有重要意义，但受限于竞争反应多、选择性差。该策略利用双猝灭位点精确调控光生载流子转移路径，抑制副反应，显著提升NO₃⁻向NH₃的转化法拉第效率与产率，为光催化固氮提供了新思路。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Dual‐Quenching Charge Transfer Unlocks Record Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Photocatalytic Conversion in Redox‐Active Eosin Y Polym","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient photocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    RR) is vital for mitigating nitrogen pollution and producing green ammonia (NH\n                    3\n                    ). Although organic polymer photocatalysts show great potential for NO\n                    3\n                    RR, they frequently suffer from low charge separation efficiency. This limitation largely comes from the lack of suitable redox‐active moieties incorporated in the polymer photocatalysts toward NO\n                    3\n                    RR. Herein, we embed the redox‐active Eosin Y (EY) into a conjugated polymer backbone to synthesize a series of EY–X polymers (where X = benzene, biphenyl, or fluorene), in which the extended π‐conjugation can promote dual dynamic and static quenching for directional electron transfer. Upon visible‐light excitation, EY forms a long‐lived radical anion (EY\n                    •−\n                    ) that stores and relays electrons to nitrate, while ground‐state complexation between polymer and nitrate preorganizes the substrate for photoinduced directional electron transfer. This dual‐pathway mechanism extends charge‐separated lifetimes, inhibits recombination, and enhances electron delivery. Consequently, under cocatalyst‐free conditions, the EY–BE polymer achieves a record high NH\n                    3\n                    production of 215 µmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    . Experimental and computational investigations support the reversible EY/EY\n                    •−\n                    cycle and the nitrate‐binding ground‐state complex as the origin of activity and selectivity. This work demonstrates a rational strategy leveraging reversible redox‐active chromophores to integrate dual quenching for designing high‐performance NO\n                    3\n                    RR photocatalysts."},{"t":"通过纳米相干高熵氧化物提升硬度和韧性的双相共晶陶瓷","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74505-y","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/非金属/陶瓷","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵氧化物陶瓷","kp":["[增强相]: 高熵稀土铝酸盐(REAlO₃)","[微观结构]: 纳米相干双相共晶"],"as":"氧化铝基共晶陶瓷虽具优异高温强度,但本征脆性制约了其工程化应用。该研究通过设计纳米共格界面构建双相共晶陶瓷,使硬度和断裂韧性协同提升,突破了传统共晶陶瓷强度-韧性难以兼得的瓶颈,为高性能耐高温结构陶瓷提供了新思路。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dual-phase eutectic ceramics with improved hardness and toughness via nano-coherent high-entropy oxides","b":"Alumina-based eutectic ceramics exhibited high high-temperature strength but their intrinsic brittleness constrained bro"},{"t":"COF中定向协同质子-电子转移用于高效光催化H2O2生产","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73727?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"COF产过氧化氢","kp":["[催化材料]: 邻苯二酚-三嗪给受体COF","[机制]: 定向协同质子-电子转移"],"dp":1,"as":"光催化双电子氧还原(2e⁻ ORR)是绿色合成过氧化氢(H₂O₂)的可持续路径,但反应效率受限于质子-电子转移的耦合。该研究在共价有机框架(COFs)中实现定向协同质子-电子转移,显著提升光催化产H₂O₂效率,为无金属光催化体系设计提供新策略。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Directional Concerted Proton‐Electron Transfer in COFs for Efficient Photocatalytic H2O2 Production","b":"ABSTRACT Photocatalytic two‐electron oxygen reduction reaction (2e − ORR) offers a sustainable route for green H 2 O 2 s"},{"t":"羰基/亚胺鎓双有机催化活化实现氨基甲基膦酸酯直接不对称α-C共轭加成","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74370-9","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"不对称膦酸酯加成","kp":["[催化策略]: 羰基/亚胺双有机催化活化"],"as":"手性α-氨基膦酸作为α-氨基酸的重要生物电子等排体,在药物和农药中具广谱生物活性。该研究通过催化实现氨基甲基膦酸酯的直接不对称α-C共轭加成,高效构建手性α-氨基膦酸化合物,为该类手性分子的合成提供新方法。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Direct Asymmetric α-C Conjugate Addition of Aminomethylphosphonate Enabled by Carbonyl/Iminium Double Organoactivation","b":"As important bioisosteres of α-amino acids, chiral α-aminophosphonic acids exhibit broad bioactivities and are widely em"},{"t":"了不起：矿山连续155小时使用100%可再生能源运行","d":"2026-06-14","i":"news","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/13/dig-it-mine-goes-155-consecutive-hours-on-100-renewable-energy/","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/开采技术","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"矿山绿电运行","kp":["运行时间[100%可再生]: 155连续小时","[混合电站]: 90 MW","太阳能[Bellevue金矿]: 27 MW","风电[Bellevue金矿]: 24 MW","储能[电池]: 15 MW/33 MWh"],"as":"西澳Bellevue Gold金矿实现连续155小时100%可再生能源运行,创矿业行业先例。该矿通过风光储一体化配置,在脱离化石燃料的条件下维持不间断生产,证明了矿业深度脱碳的技术可行性,为高耗能重工业能源转型树立了里程碑。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Dig it: mine goes 155 consecutive hours on 100% renewable energy","b":"| Jun 13 2026 - 5:38 am PT\nLast month, the Bellevue Gold mine did something that was previously unthinkable. For over 155 consecutive hours – a full six-and-a-half day work week – the mine operated on 100% renewable energy. The future is now, kids:\nBellevue Gold’s 90 MW hybrid power station brought together a 27 MW\nsolar panel array\n, 24 MW of wind turbines, and 15 MW (33 MWh) of battery energy storage to power the Australian mine’s operation. Originally designed to meet at least 80% of the site’s energy needs, the system recently proved that, in the right conditions, it can do much more.\n“We’ve put out a strategy that’s ahead of the market that will have us producing net zero carbon gold by 2026 and we couldn’t do it without renewable energy as a core part,” Bellevue Gold’s managing director Darren Stralow said, in a statement. “(It’s)\na significant milestone\n, not only for the project, but for what is possible in the Australian energy sector.”\nBellevue first announced its plans to become the first operational gold mine to get 80% of its power generated by renewable energy back in 2022,\nafter signing up for the $252 million off-grid hybrid power with its partners\n, Zenith Energy.\n“(The project) achieves the holy grail of lower emissions and a direct cost reduction in power generation,”\nexplains Bellevue’s Steve Parsons\n. “The combination of these metrics is expected to will position Bellevue as one of the most sustainable and financially successful Australian gold miners, maximizing returns for all stakeholders.\nThe development of the sustainable mining project also advances the Tjiwarl Katu Power joint venture between Zenith Energy and Tjiwarl Contracting Services, which represents the Tjiwarl Aboriginal Corporation – the Traditional owners of the land where the Bellevue Gold project is located.\nA while back, we devoted an entire episode to the idea that the cleaner the mining industry tries to become, the more equipment it needs — and that equipment, in turn, drives even greater demand for the very mines supplying its raw materials. Battery-electric haul trucks are a clear example of that self-propagating feedback loop.\nIf you’re considering going solar, it’s always a good idea to get quotes from a few installers. To make sure you find a trusted, reliable solar installer near you that offers competitive pricing, check out\n, a free service that makes it easy for you to go solar. It has hundreds of pre-vetted solar installers competing for your business, ensuring you get high-quality solutions and save 20-30% compared to going it alone. Plus, it’s free to use, and you won’t get sales calls until you select an installer and share your phone number with them.\nYour personalized solar quotes are easy to compare online and you’ll get access to unbiased Energy Advisors to help you every step of the way.\nGet started here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nI’ve been in and around the auto industry for over thirty years, and have written for a number of well-known outlets like CleanTechnica, Popular Mechanics, the Truth About Cars, and more. You can catch me at Electrek Daily’s Quick Charge, The Heavy Equipment Podcast, or chasing my kids around Oak Park, IL\nFind a reliable home solar and battery installer and save 20-30% compared to going it alone.\nQmerit makes electrification easy — connecting you with trusted pros who get it done right."},{"t":"需求侧创新是材料脱碳的首要任务","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41578-026-00934-2","c":"未分类","a":"Nature Reviews Materials","tg":"观点评论","b":"Global industrial emissions from bulk material production continue to rise despite decades of climate policy. At present","tp":"材料脱碳策","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.5,"t":2.5},"as":"尽管过去几十年实施了大量的气候政策，全球大宗材料生产产生的工业排放量依然在持续上升。情报指出，需求侧创新是实现材料脱碳的首要任务。单纯依靠传统的气候政策已无法有效遏制这一领域的碳排放增长，行业亟需在需求端探索创新解决方案，以打破目前的脱碳瓶颈并推动工业材料生产的绿色低碳转型。"},{"t":"基于深度学习的单端多模光纤软体机器人多用途形状感知","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef6263?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"软机器人形状感知","kp":["[感知方法]: 单端多模光纤+深度学习形状感知"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于深度学习的软机器人形态感知方法，通过单端传感实现软体机器人的本体感受。软机器人向具身智能系统演进的核心在于精确的自身状态感知，传统方法难以在柔性结构中实现全姿态感知。该方案利用深度学习模型从单一传感端提取信息，重建软体机器人的连续形态变化，为软体机器人的闭环控制和自主操作奠定基础，在医疗机器人、可穿戴设备等领域具有应用潜力。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Deep learning–enabled versatile shape perception for soft robots via single-ended multimode fiber","b":"The evolution of soft robots into embodied intelligent systems relies fundamentally on precise proprioception. However, a universal solution for capturing continuous deformations during diverse interactions, particularly in spatially confined interventional scenarios, remains lacking. Here, we introduce a deep learning–enabled versatile shape perception method based on a single-ended multimode fiber (MMF). By leveraging the intrinsic integration advantages of optics, our minimalist reflective architecture physically eliminates the dependence on complex demodulation units and distal devices. Furthermore, treating chaotic optical speckle fields as data streams encoding high-dimensional shape information, reconfigurable neural decoders resolve a single physical channel into versatile perception modes tailored to heterogeneous tasks: discrete state confirmation on soft grippers (&gt;99% accuracy), continuous shape tracking on bionic dexterous hands (~5-fold spatial resolution enhancement), and intuitive 3D morphological reconstruction of soft surgical robots (IoU&gt;0.93). Overall, our work establishes a versatile framework for breaking hardware adaptability limits via computation, laying a solid foundation for closed-loop control in digital twins of soft robots."},{"t":"双界面工程促进解耦传质-电荷转移用于高效CO2电解","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73692?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电解界面工程","kp":["[界面工程]: 双界面工程解耦传质传荷","[目标产物]: CO2电解多碳产物"],"as":"该研究聚焦电化学反应中气-液-固三相界面（TPI）的动力学调控，通过双界面工程实现解耦驱动的传质与传荷优化。三相界面是决定电催化反应效率的关键因素，研究通过精细设计电极-电解质及气-电解质双界面结构，分别优化质量传递与电荷转移过程，有效降低反应能垒。该策略为提升电催化反应（如CO2还原、析氢等）的能量效率提供了新思路。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Decoupling‐Facilitated Mass‐Charge Transfer via Dual‐Interface Engineering for Efficient CO2 Electrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The gas‐electrolyte‐electrode triple‐phase interfaces (TPIs) critically govern the kinetics of the electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction reaction (CO\n                    2\n                    RR) by regulating concerted proton‐electron transfer processes. However, sluggish mass transfer and the unbalanced adsorption of key intermediates within the local microenvironment of TPI remain major obstacles to efficient multicarbon product formation. Here, we report a dual‐interface strategy featuring amphiphilic and biphasic architectures to decouple mass‐charge transfer, achieved through in‐situ electrochemical activation of a polydimethylsiloxane (PDMS)‐modified Cu‐BTC electrode. The hydrophilic/hydrophobic interface promotes the synergistic mass transfer of CO\n                    2\n                    and protons within the TPI microenvironment, whereas the amorphous/crystalline interface modulates the electronic structure of catalytic active sites to optimize the adsorption kinetics of key intermediates. Such decoupling‐mediation accelerated C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    Faradaic efficiency (FE) exceeding 86% at ‐0.9 V (vs. reversible hydrogen electrode, RHE), over 2.5 times higher than that of the control groups. This work highlights the potential of dual‐interface decoupling engineering to simultaneously optimize CO\n                    2\n                    mass transport pathways and intermediate adsorption kinetics, thereby enabling highly efficient electrosynthesis of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    ."},{"t":"通过模型纳米线平台解耦氧还原催化剂中的电子效应","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7341900?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铂基氧还原催化剂","kp":["[模型平台]: Pt基纳米线模型体系","[方法]: 严格解耦电子/应变/系综效应","[应用]: 理解ORR活性的电子结构本质"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用模型纳米线催化剂体系解耦电子效应对氧还原反应（ORR）活性的影响。氧还原反应是燃料电池和金属-空气电池的关键阴极反应，其催化活性与催化剂电子结构密切相关但难以单独研究。通过构建结构明确的纳米线模型催化剂，研究者能够精确调控并分离不同电子结构因素对ORR活性的贡献，为理性设计高效ORR催化剂提供了理论依据和实验验证。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Decoupling Electronic Effects in Oxygen Reduction Catalysts via a Model Nanowire Platform","b":"ABSTRACT Understanding the intrinsic role of electronic structure in governing oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) activity"},{"t":"温带落叶橡树的碳同化和生长对干旱的反应脱钩","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady7139?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The magnitude of the terrestrial carbon sink remains a key uncertainty in future climate projections, in part due to poorly understood links between carbon uptake and its allocation to woody biomass in vegetation. Here, in this study, we show that photosynthesis and aboveground growth occur asynchronously across diel to seasonal scales in eight North American oak species. Across 137 tree ring sites, current-year annual growth was insensitive to climate variability after midsummer despite 26 to 36% of annual gross primary productivity (GPP) occurring during this period. Hourly GPP flux and growth measurements at four sites spanning seven site years further demonstrate that wood formation ceases earlier than photosynthesis and is restricted to periods of low atmospheric aridity and temperature. This photosynthesis-growth decoupling intensifies with interannual variability in vapor pressure deficit (\n                    r\n                    = 0.86,\n                    P\n                    &lt; 0.05), suggesting that by assuming tight coupling between photosynthesis and woody biomass, current earth system models may overestimate long-term carbon sequestration in forests.","tp":"树木碳同化","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过对八种北美橡树的研究，科学家发现光合作用与地上部分生长在昼夜和季节尺度上存在异步现象。137个树木年轮站点的数据显示，仲夏后当年生长对气候变异性不敏感，尽管光合碳同化仍在持续。这一碳吸收与木材生物量分配之间的脱钩现象，对预测陆地碳汇规模具有重要影响。"},{"t":"破译T细胞受体-抗原配对中的微小序列差异","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73396-3","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"T cells have important functions in development and disease processes through T cell receptor (TCR)-dependent activities"},{"t":"离散基础上的三体共振衰减","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/1jb6-p2kh","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): J. Casal and J. Gómez-CamachoWe present a theoretical framework for calculating the asymptotic properties and decay dynamics of three-body resonances described in a discrete basis. The method involves solving an inhomogeneous Schrödinger equation to determine the non-normalizable resonant state by identifying a normalizable sou…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064608] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"2-吲哚醇的脱芳香[3,3]-克莱森重排：合成 3,3-Di 的高效通用方案","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7232106?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT Dearomative reactions of indoles have long been a focal point of research in organic synthesis due to their abi...","tp":"吲哚重排法","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"有机合成中的吲哚脱芳香反应一直是研究热点。该情报介绍了一种通过2-吲哚醇的脱芳香[3,3]-克莱森重排反应，高效且通用地合成3,3-二取代吲哚啉类化合物的新方案。该方法突破了传统合成路径的限制，为复杂含氮杂环化合物的构建提供了全新的策略和有力的技术工具。"},{"t":"解析大气强迫海洋动力学的数据驱动全球海洋模型","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed1225?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"AI海洋动力学模型","kp":["[方法]: 深度学习海洋-大气耦合模型"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发数据驱动的全球海洋模型，能够解析大气强迫下的海洋动力学过程。AI技术已在全球天气预报中超越传统数值模型，但海洋预报仍高度依赖数值模拟。该模型利用深度学习捕捉海洋-大气耦合动态，有望显著提升海洋温度、洋流和海面高度的中短期预报精度。","ot":"Data-driven global ocean model resolving atmospherically forced ocean dynamics","b":"Artificial intelligence has advanced global weather forecasting, outperforming traditional numerical models in both accuracy and computational efficiency. Nevertheless, extending predictions beyond subseasonal timescales requires the development of deep learning (DL)–based ocean-atmosphere coupled models that can realistically simulate complex oceanic responses to atmospheric forcing. This study presents KIST-Ocean, a DL-based global three-dimensional ocean general circulation model. Comprehensive evaluations demonstrate the model’s robust ocean simulation skill and efficiency. Moreover, it reproduces ocean responses, such as Kelvin and Rossby wave propagation, and vertical motions induced by wind stress curl, demonstrating its ability to represent key atmospherically forced ocean dynamics underlying climate phenomena, including the El Niño–Southern Oscillation. These findings reinforce confidence in DL-based global weather and climate models by demonstrating their capacity to capture essential ocean-atmosphere relationships. Building on this foundation, the present study paves the way for extending DL-based modeling frameworks toward integrated Earth system simulations, thereby offering substantial potential for advancing long-range climate prediction capabilities.","aip":1},{"t":"仿细胞骨架的机械互锁索烃框架实现坚固而动态的聚合物网络","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73742?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"索烃聚合物网络","kp":["[灵感来源]: 红细胞细胞骨架拓扑","[结构]: 机械互锁索烃框架动态网络"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"受红细胞骨架启发，研究人员设计了一种基于机械互锁索烃（catenane）的聚合物网络框架。红细胞骨架具有高度有序但动态可重构的拓扑结构，能够在保持机械稳定性的同时实现柔性形变。该研究将这一生物设计原理引入合成高分子体系，通过索烃结构单元构建既坚固又动态的聚合物网络。这种仿生策略有望为开发兼具韧性和自修复能力的智能材料提供新范式，在柔性电子、软体机器人和生物医用材料领域具有潜在应用价值。","ot":"Cytoskeleton‐Inspired Mechanically Interlocked Catenane Framework Enabling Robust yet Dynamic Polymer Networks","b":"ABSTRACT The red blood cell cytoskeleton, featuring a highly ordered yet dynamically reconfigurable skeletal topology, o"},{"t":"农田补充了欧洲景观中永久草原的生物多样性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74356-7","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Temperate agricultural landscapes are experiencing unprecedented biodiversity declines. Landscape simplification is comm","tp":"农田多样性","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究表明农田生态系统在欧洲景观中对永久草原生物多样性具有重要的补充作用。在温带农业景观生物多样性急剧下降的背景下，研究揭示了农田与草原之间的生态互补效应，为农业景观管理和生物多样性保护策略提供了科学依据。"},{"t":"共价键合聚合物-金属有机框架半导体膜用于柔性X射线探测","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74218-2","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性X射线探测膜","kp":["[材料]: 共价键合polyMOF半导电影片","[应用]: 柔性X射线探测","[优势]: 超低陷阱密度,缺陷最小化"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究制备了柔性半导体金属有机框架(MOFs)共价键合聚合物薄膜。传统MOF薄膜机械脆性大，研究者通过将导电聚合物共价接枝到MOF骨架上，成功制备兼具柔性与半导体特性的新型膜材料，在柔性电子器件领域具应用潜力。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Covalently bonded polymer-metal-organic framework semiconductive membranes for flexible X-ray detection","b":"The fabrication of flexible semiconductive metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) membranes is a challenging research target wi"},{"t":"货物与自噬受体的偶联是内质网自噬的关键步骤","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee9856?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"During cell stress, endoplasmic reticulum autophagy (ER-phagy) receptors remodel the ER by sequestering membrane proteins (cargo) into autophagosomes for degradation. The conserved ER-phagy receptor, Atg40, contains a motif that binds to Atg8 and a reticulon homology domain that is needed for vacuolar/lysosomal delivery. Cargo capture, however, requires the Atg40 binding partner Lst1/SEC24C. To address whether lipids regulate cargo capture during ER-phagy, we analyzed autophagy in neutral lipid–deficient cells. Unexpectedly, we found that Atg40 was delivered to the vacuole in autophagosomes without Lst1/SEC24C or cargo in mutant cells. Lipidomic analysis revealed changes in the ratio of phosphatidylethanolamine to phosphatidylcholine in the neutral lipid–deficient cells that are predicted to alter ER membrane bendability. Our findings imply that phospholipids control cargo sequestration by regulating receptor-cargo coupling at autophagic sites.","tp":"内质网自噬","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"在内质网自噬过程中，自噬受体通过将膜蛋白（货物）隔离到自噬体中降解，从而重塑内质网。研究发现，高度保守的自噬受体Atg40包含结合Atg8的基序和内体分选所需的同源结构域，而有效捕获货物还需要其结合伴侣Lst1/SEC24C的参与。研究通过分析中性脂质，进一步探讨了脂质在调控内质网自噬货物捕获过程中的潜在分子机制。"},{"t":"能源和环境政策在碳减排方面的成本效益协同：来自中国钢铁和钢铁行业的证据","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003551?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/黑色金属/钢铁","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"钢铁碳减排","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"热模型中馈送强子的相关性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/g91z-tnyh","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Claude Pruneau, Victor Gonzalez, Oveis Sheibani, Chun Shen, Yash Patley, Basanta Nandi, and Ana MarinWe examined the potential impact of decays on the magnitude of fluctuations of net quantum numbers and integrals of balance functions based on a thermal hadron gas model. The calculations are based on a comprehensive list of known hadrons with masses up to $2.5\\phantom{\\rule{0.28em}{0ex}}\\mathrm{GeV…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064905] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"铜催化吡唑的位点选择性芳基化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02148-z","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铜催化吡唑芳基化","kp":["[催化剂]: 铜催化","[反应]: 吡唑位点选择性N-芳基化"],"as":"本文报道了一种铜催化吡唑类化合物的位点选择性N-芳基化方法。不对称吡唑的双氮原子使得选择性官能化长期是难题，该铜催化体系实现了对特定氮位点的高选择性芳基化，为药物分子的后期官能化提供了高效新工具。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Copper-catalysed site-selective arylation of pyrazoles","b":"A major challenge in late-stage functionalization is the selective N-arylation of unsymmetric pyrazoles, five-membered h"},{"t":"氯化铜(II)介导的界面渗透实现高效稳定的宽带隙钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5495010?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宽隙钙钛矿电池","kp":["[界面策略]: CuCl₂界面渗透","[应用]: 宽带隙钙钛矿太阳能电池"],"dp":1,"as":"研究人员提出氯化铜（CuCl₂）介导的界面渗透策略，用于改善宽带隙钙钛矿太阳能电池的性能。宽带隙钙钛矿是高效叠层光伏器件的关键组件，但长期存在界面缺陷与非辐射复合损失问题。该方法通过铜离子在界面处的可控渗透，优化能级排列并钝化缺陷态，从而提升开路电压与器件稳定性。这一策略为突破叠层太阳能电池效率极限提供了新路径，对推进钙钛矿光伏技术的商业化具有重要意义。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Copper (II) Chloride Mediated Interfacial Permeation for High‐Efficient and Stable Wide‐Bandgap Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT Wide‐bandgap (WBG) perovskite solar cells (PSCs) are crucial for high‐efficiency tandem photovoltaics. However,","aip":1},{"t":"卷积神经网络在非侵入式负荷监测中的应用：批判性分析与未来方向","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007877?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"负荷监测CNN","kp":["方法[非侵入负荷监测]: 卷积神经网络"],"as":"","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Convolutional neural networks for non-intrusive load monitoring: a critical analysis and future directions"},{"t":"收敛不是正确性：跨生物复杂性的增强采样方法的上下文相关性能","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74165-y","c":"未分类","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","b":"Enhanced-sampling molecular dynamics is indispensable for studying biomolecular processes beyond the reach of convention","tp":"分子动力学","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"增强采样分子动力学模拟在研究常规方法无法触及的复杂生物分子过程中是不可或缺的工具。该情报强调，在跨生物复杂性的研究体系中，模拟计算的“收敛”并不等同于结果的“正确性”。研究人员指出，这些增强采样方法的性能高度依赖于具体的生物学上下文环境，在评估复杂生物分子动态过程时需谨慎对待模拟结果。"},{"t":"胆甾相发光液晶中圆偏振发光的调控：从FRET到激子耦合","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1985010?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性液晶圆偏振发光","kp":["[发光体系]: 胆甾相发光液晶N*LLC","[手性诱导剂]: 罗丹明基R1/S1"],"as":"本文聚焦于胆甾相发光液晶（CLLC）中圆偏振发光（CPL）的调控策略。具有可调波长和高不对称因子（dissymmetry factor）的CPL材料在三维显示、光信息加密及生物传感等领域有广阔应用前景。研究通过胆甾相液晶特有的螺旋超分子结构，实现对发光波长和手性光学信号的精确控制。文章综述了不同发光基元与手性液晶基质的组合策略，分析了影响CPL信号的分子层次结构因素，为高性能手性光学材料的理性设计提供了指导框架。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Control of Circularly Polarized Luminescence in Cholesteric Luminescent Liquid Crystals: From FRET to Exciton Coupling","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving circularly polarized luminescent (CPL) materials with tunable wavelength and high dissymmetry factor (\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    ) still faces great challenges. Cholesteric luminescent liquid crystal (N*LLC) is one of the most promising chiral systems to solve the above challenges. In this work, a pair of luminescent chiral inducers R1/S1 were synthesized by incorporating a rhodamine luminophore to a binaphthyl chiral scaffold and were doped into 5CB to construct N*LLC. As the concentration of the doped achiral naphthalimide derivative (NIA) increased, the CPL wavelength sequentially blue‐shifted from red to yellow and then to green, the\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    also increased to 0.3, which is fundamentally different from the conventional regulation with red‐shifted chiral luminescence. Moreover, the introduction of trifluoroacetic acid enabled the emitted CPL was reversibly switched, allowing reversible control of wavelength and\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    . Theoretical calculations revealed that, FRET‐dominated process transforms into exciton coupling (EC)‐governed interactions with the NIA concentration increased. This work demonstrates a feasible strategy of achieving reversible control of CPL within a single supramolecular system, offering new insight into the development of adaptable chiral photonic devices."},{"t":"用于柔性无线电子器件的共形透明高效MXene网格天线","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee8104?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MXene柔性透明天线","kp":["[材料]: Ti3C2Tx MXene","[工艺]: 纳米压印光刻-刮涂法","[器件]: 共形透明高效天线"],"as":"研究团队开发了基于MXene材料的共形、透明、高效柔性无线通信天线。面向下一代物联网（IoT）无线电子设备对可贴合、可透视天线的需求，该工作利用MXene（二维过渡金属碳化物）优异的导电性和可加工性，构建了网格状透明天线结构。这种天线兼具高光学透过率和稳定的射频辐射性能，能够贴合在任意曲面基底上，在弯折状态下仍保持良好工作状态。该成果为可穿戴电子、柔性显示和透明物联网终端的无线通信模块提供了实用化解决方案。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Conformal, transparent, and efficient MXene grid antennas for flexible wireless electronics","b":"Next-generation internet of things (IoT) wireless electronics require antennas that are conformal, transparent, and electromagnetically efficient, yet these attributes form an impossible trinity. Here, we realize the first Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    MXene–based conformal, transparent, and high-performance antenna through an optimized nanoimprint lithography-blading technique. Nanoimprinted MXene grid transparent conductive film (TCF) achieves an exceptional balance of low sheet resistance (4.32 ohms per square) at high transmittance (~89.1%) with promising flexibility. Two representative scenarios in IoT networks are selected to demonstrate the versatility of this TCF. For personal devices, the efficient MXene transparent dipole antenna enables a quasi-transparent wireless wearable device for long-distance and real-time communication (&gt;30 meters). For fixed infrastructure, MXene-based digital coding metasurface enables high-quality wireless communication, maintaining a low bit error rate (~0.15%) even in a curved state. This work establishes MXene as a versatile platform that successfully merges conformal transparency and high electromagnetic performance, paving the way for next-generation imperceptible IoT wireless systems."},{"t":"限域调控晶相工程构建植物蒸腾驱动的结构化半导体纤维系统","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73693?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半导体纤维蒸腾传感","kp":["[应用]: 分布式植物蒸腾监测纺织平台","[工程策略]: 约束调控晶体相工程"],"as":"该研究提出一种通过空间限域调控实现晶体相工程的新策略，用于构建具有特定结构的半导体材料。限域环境可在纳米尺度约束晶体生长行为，精确调控晶相组成与排列，从而优化半导体的光电性能。该方法为新型半导体器件的理性设计提供了工程化路径，对提升材料均匀性与功能可控性具有重要意义。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Confinement‐Regulated Crystal Phase Engineering Enables Structured Semiconductor Fiber Systems for Plant Transpiration D","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Transpiration is fundamental to plant life, yet its rhythms remain difficult to resolve because conventional sensing approaches perturb stomatal boundary layers, are limited to localized readouts, and struggle to reconcile moisture responsiveness with stable photodetection under dynamic humidity fluctuations. Herein, we report the first distributed plant microclimate mapping textile platform constructed from semiconductor fibers enabled by two distinct confinement‐regulated crystal phase engineering strategies. Local spatially confined thermal reconfiguration induces optimized crystallization of the semiconductor fiber core, whereas nanosphere confinement governs humidity‐triggered, reversible phase switching in the perovskite fiber cladding between CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    and CsPb\n                    2\n                    Br\n                    5\n                    , enabling stable photodetection together with reversible humidity response. Continuous thermal drawing and polymer coating establish a scalable route to kilometre‐scale fiber fabrication, yielding fibers with sophisticated structure that sustain linear photodetection with an on/off ratio exceeding 50 over 10 000 switching cycles while maintaining fatigue‐free humidity sensing over 600 cycles. Woven into breathable textiles, the fiber arrays enable sub‐centimetre spatial mapping and, in commercial greenhouses, resolve spatial irradiance variations as small as 10 mW/cm\n                    2\n                    within real microclimates, revealing microclimate heterogeneity relevant to plant transpiration and growth. These results establish phase‐engineered semiconductor fiber textiles as a scalable platform for distributed plant microclimate mapping and precision agriculture."},{"t":"现代电力系统中基于条件扩散模型的概率性日前负荷预测","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008597?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扩散模型负荷预测","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Conditional diffusion models for probabilistic day-ahead load forecasting in modern power systems"},{"t":"概念优先级在自然视觉注意过程中塑造个人注视模式","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604369123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Our visual landscape consists of not only people, places, and objects (e.g., “soldier,” “stadium,” “flag”) but also the conceptual relationships that unite them (e.g., “patriotism”). Because conceptual knowledge varies across individuals, this level of structure may support individualized patterns of attentional selection during naturalistic scene viewing. Here, we ask whether individuals’ gaze patterns reflect, in part, latent attentional priorities organized in conceptual space. Participants (N = 61) freely explored a diverse set of immersive real-world scenes (N = 100) in head-mounted VR while their gaze position was continuously recorded. We modeled gaze behavior using spatial, visual, and conceptual feature spaces, leveraging embeddings from large vision and language models, to uncover the latent priorities guiding individuals’ unique patterns of selective attention across environments. Individuals exhibited stable and idiosyncratic gaze patterns across scenes and test–retest sessions, consistent with trait-like individual differences in attention. Spatial, visual, and conceptual feature spaces each explained unique variance in individual gaze patterns, with conceptual features contributing variance beyond that explained by spatial and visual features alone. Notably, language-model–based predictions were particularly effective at capturing these individualized patterns. Together, these findings indicate that naturalistic visual attention is structured at multiple levels—including a conceptual level—revealing stable individual differences in how people sample and prioritize information across complex visual environments."},{"t":"前额杏仁核回路中社会凝视的组合性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74347-8","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"Social gaze underpins flexible primate communication and can be decomposed into three primitives: gaze content, social s"},{"t":"采用离散调制的可组合自由空间连续变量量子密钥分发","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adv1440?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"连续变量量子密钥分发","kp":["[调制方式]: 离散调制位移相干态","[传输介质]: 自由空间","[协议]: 连续变量QKD"],"as":"该研究提出一种可组合的自由空间连续变量量子密钥分发（CV-QKD）方案，采用离散调制技术实现密钥的安全传输。连续变量QKD可与标准电信器件兼容，离散调制则简化了硬件实现并提升系统稳定性。自由空间链路使该方案适用于卫星与移动平台等无法依赖光纤的场景。可组合安全性分析确保多模块级联后整体仍满足严格安全标准，为构建大规模量子网络奠定基础。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Composable free-space continuous-variable quantum key distribution using discrete modulation","b":"Continuous-variable (CV) quantum key distribution (QKD) allows for quantum secure communication with the benefit of being close to classical coherent communication. In recent years, CV QKD protocols using a discrete number of displaced coherent states have been studied intensively as the modulation can be directly implemented with real devices with finite resolution. Until now, experiments only calculated key rates in the asymptotic regime. Here, we present a CV QKD system using discrete modulation that is especially designed for atmospheric channels. We use polarization encoding to exploit the nonbirefringent nature of the turbulent atmosphere. This allows to expand CV QKD networks beyond the existing fiber backbone. In a laboratory demonstration with a static 3-decibel loss channel, we implemented a recently developed security proof allowing to calculate composable finite-size key rates against independently and identically distributed collective attacks. We applied the full QKD protocol including a quantum random number generator, error correction, and privacy amplification to extract secret keys.","aip":1},{"t":"抗癌疗法形成的转移性结直肠癌的克隆进化和突变轨迹","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74384-3","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The evolutionary dynamics of cancer genomes at single-cell resolution under therapeutic pressure remain elusive. Hence,"},{"t":"中国军方制定战略，从1800英里外瞄准美国军舰","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/innovation/china-plan-to-strike-us-carrier-groups","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"interesting engineering","tg":"行业观察","b":"Chinese military planners have reportedly devised a plan to target US carriers in places like Guam. The strategy, published in the Chinese journal\nTactical Missile Technology\n, claims a combination of satellites, AI, and missiles could render carrier groups vulnerable, even at distances of over 1,620 nautical miles (3,000 km).\nAt present, both the People’s Liberation Army (PLA) and the\nUnited States Navy\nknow that the former can threaten critical assets like aircraft carriers close to China. To reduce that threat, the US Navy has increasingly positioned key assets farther from China’s coastline, relying on bases such as Guam and adopting more dispersed operating patterns across the Pacific.\nThe Navy has also been dispersing deployed\nships in the region\nto make them much harder to find, track, and potentially attack. Not keeping their eggs in one basket, as it were.\nHowever, as the\nSouth China Morning Post (SCMP)\nreports, the PLA has been working on a potential plan to threaten such ships even at great distances. Led by associate professor Gao Tianyun from the College of International Studies at the National University of Defence Technology in Nanjing, the proposal is very interesting indeed.\nThe study, titled “Research on the effectiveness of anti‑ship missile swarm operation under distributed confrontation,” basically describes an innovative “kill-chain” solution rather than a new wonder weapon.\nThe idea, in a nutshell, is to first find the group using a mixture of satellites, drones, radar aircraft, ships, submarines, signals intelligence, etc. Once done, the plan would rely on near-constant tracking for long-range missiles to be targeted and launched.\nWith that achieved, the paper suggests firing many missiles (a mix of hypersonics and “pre-strike firepower packages”) at the target, not one or two.\nOnce in flight, the plan would rely on the missiles cooperating by sharing target data, sorting real ships from decoys, assigning themselves to different targets, and attacking from different angles.\nAccording to the researchers, such a coordinated attack could overwhelm layers of US naval defense, including Aegis-equipped destroyers, interceptor missiles, electronic warfare systems, decoys, and close-in weapon systems.\nSo, something of a coordinated, long-range missile swarm attack. The point is to make the US defence system run out of time, interceptors, radar capacity, or correct target choices.\nSounds reasonable on the surface, but the plan comes with one major caveat. That being said, this is just a plan right now, not proof that China can actually do it tomorrow.\nNeedless to say, hitting a moving carrier group at 1,620 nautical miles distant is not an easy task. Achieving it in reality would be brutally hard because the target moves, hides, jams, uses decoys, and fights back.\nThe hardest part is not the missile range; it is maintaining accurate targeting data across the whole chain. While effectively just a wargame made public, the release of this information is likely intended to send a warning to the US, rather than actually boast about its technological prowess.\nIn effect, they are saying that hiding and dispersing your ships won’t necessarily keep you safe. We (China) have the means to get them if we want to.\nGet the latest in engineering, tech, space & science - delivered daily to your inbox.\nChristopher graduated from Cardiff University in 2004 with a Masters Degree in Geology. Since then, he has worked exclusively within the Built Environment, Occupational Health and Safety and Environmental Consultancy industries. He is a qualified and accredited Energy Consultant, Green Deal Assessor and Practitioner member of IEMA. Chris’s main interests range from Science and Engineering, Military and Ancient History to Politics and Philosophy.\nSolid-state battery cell hits 465 Wh/kg density, targets aerospace and defense applications\nTest facility for full-scale fusion power-plant blankets set to be developed in US\nUS Navy’s nuclear-powered fast-attack submarine returns to fleet\nIron-based catalyst helps zinc-air batteries power devices without precious metals\nScientists forge 24,000-atom mini universe that generates time without a single clock\nMore from Innovation\nFirst-ever: Four-legged robot dog successfully walks across treacherous Arctic ice floes\nWorld’s first ‘three-lane’ optical fiber network in China boosts data transfer by 5x\nWorld’s first working nuclear clocks built with thorium nucleus after decades of effort\nBeyond rare earths: this new magnet material could reshape motors\nUS scientists’ new alloys cut truck engine weight by 15%, boost fuel efficiency by over 10%\nFirst-ever: Four-legged robot dog successfully walks across treacherous Arctic ice floes\nWorld’s first ‘three-lane’ optical fiber network in China boosts data transfer by 5x\nWorld’s first working nuclear clocks built with thorium nucleus after decades of effort\nBeyond rare earths: this new magnet material could reshape motors\nUS scientists’ new alloys cut truck engine weight by 15%, boost fuel efficiency by over 10%","tp":"远程反航母","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"据报道称中国军方在学术期刊上发表了针对美国航母战斗群的远程打击策略，提出利用卫星、AI和导弹组合，可在超过3000公里距离上威胁航母编队。该战略分析涉及天基侦察、智能目标识别和远程精确打击等技术要素，引发了关于航母在未来海战中生存能力的讨论。"},{"t":"中国小米推出用于家庭电动汽车自动充电的机械臂","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/energy/chinas-xiaomi-unveils-robotic-arm-for-ev-charging","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"interesting engineering","tg":"产业进展","tp":"自动充电机械臂","kp":["量产时间[小米EV充电机械臂]: 2026年Q4"],"as":"小米展示了其家庭电动车自动充电的愿景方案，推出一款可自动对接车辆充电口的机械臂。该系统旨在实现用户停车后无需手动插拔充电枪的全自动充电体验，体现了消费电子巨头向智能出行基础设施领域延伸的战略布局。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":7.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"China’s Xiaomi unveils a robotic arm for automated home EV charging","b":"The Chinese tech giant, Xiaomi, has offered a closer look at its vision for the future of home EV charging, unveiling a robotic arm system that can automatically connect a vehicle to a charger without any driver intervention. The company says the technology is scheduled for commercial release in the fourth quarter of 2026.\nThe automated charging arm is intended to work alongside smart parking functions, creating an integrated experience in which a vehicle parks itself and begins charging autonomously. According to Xiaomi, the goal is to remove the friction from everyday EV ownership by combining automation and AI into a single home\nThe company also stressed that the demonstration video released with the announcement was recorded in a real-world environment rather than a controlled concept showcase. Xiaomi said the functions featured in the footage are already production-ready, suggesting that the technology is nearing commercial deployment.\nAs part of the unveiling, Xiaomi outlined a range of everyday use cases designed to make home EV charging almost entirely hands-free. The company says the system is built around convenience, allowing drivers to interact with the charger as little as possible,\nCarNewsChina\nOne of the key features is what Xiaomi describes as automatic charging. After the vehicle is parked, the robotic arm detects its position, connects the charging cable, and begins charging without requiring any manual input. Drivers can simply leave the vehicle and let the system handle the rest.\nThe charging process is also designed to end automatically. Once the battery reaches full capacity or a user-defined charging limit, the\narm disconnects the charging connector on its own, helping to streamline the entire experience.\nIn addition, Xiaomi says owners will be able to start a charging session remotely through a smartphone app. As long as the vehicle is parked within the robotic arm’s operating range, users can trigger the process without having to return to the car or physically handle the charging cable.\nCompetition in the field of autonomous EV charging is accelerating as Chinese automakers and technology companies look to redefine the home charging experience. Xiaomi is not alone in exploring robotic solutions, with several major industry players investing in similar technologies.\nAmong them is\n, which has also been developing its own automated charging system. During the launch of the Li Auto i8 all-electric SUV last year, CEO Li Xiang revealed that the company was actively testing an automatic charging robot, highlighting a growing belief within the industry that future EV ecosystems will combine intelligent parking,\ndriving features, and fully automated charging into a single seamless experience.\nAnother example of the industry’s shift toward autonomous charging emerged last August, when the Harmony Intelligent Mobility Alliance demonstrated a robotic charging system integrated with the all-electric Aito M8. The setup allows drivers to activate an “off-vehicle parking” mode, enabling the car to maneuvre itself into a designated charging bay.\nOnce in position, a smartphone app commands a robotic arm to open the charging port and automatically connect the charging cable. According to\n, the entire process is designed to be completed in just a few minutes, roughly the time it takes to enjoy a cup of coffee.\nGet the latest in engineering, tech, space & science - delivered daily to your inbox.\nBojan Stojkovski is a freelance journalist based in Skopje, North Macedonia, covering foreign policy and technology for more than a decade. His work has appeared in Foreign Policy, ZDNet, and Nature.\nSolid-state battery cell hits 465 Wh/kg density, targets aerospace and defense applications\nTest facility for full-scale fusion power-plant blankets set to be developed in US\nUS Navy’s nuclear-powered fast-attack submarine returns to fleet\nIron-based catalyst helps zinc-air batteries power devices without precious metals\nScientists forge 24,000-atom mini universe that generates time without a single clock\nMore from Energy\nSolid-state battery cell hits 465 Wh/kg density, targets aerospace and defense applications\nTest facility for full-scale fusion power-plant blankets set to be developed in US\nIron-based catalyst helps zinc-air batteries power devices without precious metals\nHalo nuclear microreactor utilizes high-fidelity simulation to speed first power\nUS’ first vertically integrated solar factory starts production to power 1.3M homes\nSolid-state battery cell hits 465 Wh/kg density, targets aerospace and defense applications\nTest facility for full-scale fusion power-plant blankets set to be developed in US\nIron-based catalyst helps zinc-air batteries power devices without precious metals\nHalo nuclear microreactor utilizes high-fidelity simulation to speed first power\nUS’ first vertically integrated solar factory starts production to power 1.3M homes"},{"t":"界面TiOx纳米域实现电荷定向光热甲烷干重整","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4126002?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/天然气化工","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光热甲烷干重整","kp":["[催化剂]: Rh纳米颗粒/TiOₓ-TiC","[机制]: 界面TiOₓ纳域电荷定向"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出一种由界面TiOx纳米结构介导的电荷定向光热驱动甲烷干重整（DRM）新策略。该体系利用太阳能驱动CH₄与CO₂转化为合成气，通过界面电荷工程提升光热转化效率与产物选择性，为太阳能驱动的温室气体资源化利用提供了高效新路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Charge‐Directed Photothermal Methane Dry Reforming Enabled by Interfacial TiOx Nanodomains","b":"ABSTRACT Photothermal dry reforming of methane (DRM) enables solar‐driven upgrading of CH 4 and CO 2 , yet its efficienc","aip":1},{"t":"线性碳原子链中的电荷输运","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02175-w","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"线性碳链导电","kp":["[材料]: 线性碳原子链(carbyne)","[端基效应]: 显著影响电子构型"],"as":"研究探索了线性碳原子链（卡拜，carbyne）的电荷传输特性。卡拜被理论预测具有卓越的电学与力学性能，但实验制备与表征极具挑战。本工作对碳链中载流子输运行为的观测，为碳基纳米电子器件与一维导电材料的实际应用奠定了实验基础。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Charge transport through linear carbon atomic chains","b":"The linear carbon allotrope carbyne has been predicted to display outstanding electrical and mechanical properties, but","aip":1},{"t":"通过定量各向同性超微结构成像表征调节初级纤毛发生的膜结构","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73638-4","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The trafficking, docking, and fusion of membrane vesicles at the mother centriole (MC) are important for primary cilium"},{"t":"基于铁电氧化镓的天基神经形态器件","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag362/8707060?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电神经形态器件","kp":["材料体系[天体神经形态器件]: κ相氧化镓(铁电)","带隙类型[UWBG半导体]: 超宽禁带","应用场景[抗辐射]: 富辐射空间环境"],"as":"该研究提出基于铁电氧化镓（Ga₂O₃）的天体神经形态计算硬件。天体活动的高效识别需要能在极端辐射环境下稳定运行的硬件平台。铁电Ga₂O₃兼具耐辐射特性和铁电存储功能，可构建低功耗、高鲁棒性的神经形态计算器件，用于实时识别和分类天文活动信号。该方案有望为深空探测和天体物理观测提供新型抗辐射智能计算硬件。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Celestial neuromorphics based on ferroelectric gallium oxide","b":"Efficient recognition of celestial activities demands hardware that can operate with high efficiency and robustness in radiation-rich space environments. Ultra-wide bandgap (UWBG) semiconductors are well-suited for such environments, but conventional UWBG transistors are not inherently compatible with advanced computing functions. To address this limitation, here we report a κ-phase gallium oxide (κ-Ga2O3) based in-sensor reservoir computing system (κ-ISRC), which incorporates deep ultraviolet sensing, memory, and neuromorphic computation for celestial activity recognition. A ferroelectric high-electron-mobility transistor (FeHEMT) is fabricated by exploiting polarization switching of κ-Ga2O3 through atomic sliding mechanisms. The Al2O3/κ-Ga2O3 dielectric/ferroelectric gate stack provides negative-capacitance effect, supporting configurable memory operations. Furthermore, the device can maintain its performance over a wide temperature range (from −270°C to 210°C) and under ion irradiation with an average flux of 1×104 rad/s. Leveraging these device features, the celestial neuromorphic system achieves up to 95% classification accuracies across diverse astrophysical events, including solar flares, cosmic-ray bursts, and pulsar emissions. This work establishes UWBG ferroelectric semiconductors as a multifunctional platform for energy-efficient in-sensor neuromorphic electronics for aerospace and deep-space applications."},{"t":"通过C2极性反转的吲哚催化不对称形式亲核C2取代合成2,3'-联吲哚阻转异构体","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74186-7","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"吲哚C2位取代","kp":["[策略]: C2极性反转(umpolung)","[产物]: 2,3'-联吲哚轴手性体"],"as":"该研究实现了吲哚的催化不对称形式亲核C2-取代反应，采用极性反转（umpolung）策略。传统上吲哚的功能化以亲电取代为主，但C2位因电子密度特性难以进行亲核反应。本研究通过催化极性反转打破常规反应模式，实现了对C2位的不对称亲核官能化，获得手性吲哚衍生物。该方法拓展了吲哚合成化学的边界，对药物分子和天然产物合成具有应用价值。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Catalytic asymmetric formal nucleophilic C2-substitution of indoles via C2-umpolung toward 2,3’-bisindole atropisomers","b":"The electrophilic substitution of indoles represents the predominant functionalization strategy. However, due to the ele"},{"t":"聚乙烯废料无催化剂升级回收为氧化聚乙烯蜡","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5563553?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚乙烯废料升级回收","kp":["[回收工艺]: 无催化剂一锅水热氧化","塑料废物占比[聚乙烯]: 36%"],"as":"该研究开发了无催化剂条件下将聚乙烯（PE）废塑料升级回收为氧化聚乙烯蜡的新方法。PE占塑料废料总量的36%，因其固有的化学稳定性极难降解和转化。该方法无需催化剂即可将PE废料转化为氧化聚乙烯蜡，后者作为高附加值产品广泛用于涂料、润滑剂和塑料加工助剂等领域。该技术为大规模塑料废料的高值化利用提供了低成本的可持续路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Catalyst‐Free Upcycling of Polyethylene Waste Into Oxidized Polyethylene Wax","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polyethylene (PE) accounts for 36% of the total plastic waste by mass. However, its inherent chemical stability poses significant challenges for chemical recycling, including energy‐intensive processing, costly catalysts, and thermodynamic constraints that result in low‐value hydrocarbon products. Herein, we present a catalyst‐free, one‐pot hydrothermal oxidation strategy for the efficient upcycling of waste PE into high‐value oxidized polyethylene wax (OPEW). Notably, under optimized conditions (160°C, 1.5 MPa O\n                    2\n                    ), low‐density polyethylene (LDPE, 1.0 g) is converted to OPEW within 0.5 h, achieving an OPEW/PE mass ratio of 103.3% and a carbon yield of 99.8%. The resulting OPEW exhibits a tunable acid number (20–70 mg KOH/g) and saponification number (5–80 mg KOH/g), covering industrial specifications for commercial wax products. Mechanistic studies reveal that the superoxide radical (·O\n                    2\n                    −\n                    ) plays a key role in mediating the reaction. Furthermore, 30‐fold scale‐up trials and successful application to various types of PE waste feedstocks demonstrate the great potential of this methodology for industrial viability. This strategy establishes a sustainable, catalyst‐free pathway for upcycling plastic waste into functional materials.","aip":1},{"t":"CSAKD：基于19F NMR化学位移各向异性测定绝对配体亲和力","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6036832?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"该研究提出CSAKD方法，利用¹⁹F NMR化学位移各向异性测定配体-蛋白质结合的绝对亲和力。小分子药物发现通常从化合物库筛选获得初始苗头化合物开始，但准确量化配体结合亲和力仍是关键挑战。该方法通过测量含氟配体的¹⁹F化学位移变化，无需竞争实验即可直接获得绝对结合常数，为药物筛选和先导化合物优化提供了高灵敏度的分析工具。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"19F NMR亲和力测定","kp":["检测方法[配体亲和力]: 19F NMR化学位移各向异性","应用领域[药物发现]: 基于片段的药物发现"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"CSAKD: Determining Absolute Ligand Affinities From 19F NMR Chemical Shift Anisotropy","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Small‐molecule drug discovery typically begins with the screening of compound libraries to identify initial hits, which are subsequently optimized into lead compounds and, ultimately, drug candidates. Diverse screening methodologies are employed, including DNA‐encoded library technology, high‐throughput screening, and fragment‐based drug discovery (FBDD). Among these, FBDD is particularly powerful when integrated with structure‐guided drug design and biophysical affinity measurements. However, accurately quantifying the weak binding affinities of fragments remains a significant challenge. To address this, we introduce chemical shift anisotropy  (CSAKD), a novel method for determining absolute fragment affinities using  NMR relaxation. The CSAKD approach eliminates the need for titration experiments and isotopic labeling. Furthermore, we complement this method with a machine learning model for the rapid and accurate prediction of  chemical shielding tensors. In summary, CSAKD allows fast and efficient affinity determination which seamlessly integrates into FBDD by  NMR."},{"t":"CO2衍生可降解聚硫酯胶粘剂：质子阱辅助S/O异构化驱动的阳离子开环聚合","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8723325?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2衍生可降解胶","kp":["[聚合方法]: S/O异构化驱动阳离子开环聚合","[产物]: CO₂基可降解聚硫酯胶"],"dp":1,"as":"利用CO2为碳源,通过质子阱辅助的硫/氧异构化策略合成可降解聚硫酯基压敏胶(PSA)。该材料兼具可降解性与可回收性,为解决传统不可降解胶粘剂带来的回收难题提供新路径,在可持续材料与循环经济领域具重要价值。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"CO2‐Derived Degradable Polythioester Adhesives From Proton‐Trap‐Assisted S/O Isomerization‐Driven Cationic Ring‐Opening ","b":"ABSTRACT The development of degradable pressure‐sensitive adhesives (PSAs) holds great promise for enabling the recyclin...","aip":1},{"t":"简讯：巨石阵中心石的史诗之旅","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01912-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Nature staff discuss some of the week’s top science news. Hear the biggest stories from the world of science | 12 June 2"},{"t":"突破性超声波贴片可实时追踪血流和胎儿健康状况","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/breakthrough-ultrasound-patch-tracks-blood-flow-and-fetal-health-in-real-time/","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"技术突破","b":"A new soft ultrasound patch is designed to provide long-term, hands-free monitoring of fetal health in real time.\nEngineers at the\nUniversity of California, San Diego\n, have developed a soft, wearable ultrasound patch that can continuously monitor a fetus for hours at a time while maintaining reliable performance even as the fetus and umbilical cord move throughout pregnancy.\nThe device could help physicians identify complications earlier in high-risk pregnancies. During clinical testing, the patch detected prolonged abnormal fetal signals in one case, prompting an early Cesarean delivery. Researchers said the intervention may have helped save the baby’s life. The technology could also improve access to prenatal care in low-resource regions where trained ultrasound specialists and continuous monitoring are often unavailable.\nThe findings were published in\nNature Biotechnology\n“Wearable ultrasound technology has the potential to enable continuous prenatal monitoring and improve pregnancy outcomes in ways that were previously not possible,” said study co-first author Geonho (Tom) Park, a chemical and nanoengineering PhD student at the UC San Diego Jacobs School of Engineering. Park co-led the study with fellow UC San Diego Jacobs School of Engineering co-first authors Yizhou Bian, Hao Huang, and Sai Zhou.\nMost prenatal ultrasounds provide only a brief look at fetal health and require trained sonographers to operate the equipment. In contrast, the new patch is designed to remain on the body and continuously monitor a baby’s anatomy and blood flow in real time without the need to manually position an ultrasound probe.\n“To comprehensively monitor mothers and babies over the amount of time needed to catch complications like preeclampsia, you need a system that can work continuously and largely on its own,” Bian said. “That is why the sensing depth, functional capabilities, and autonomy of this ultrasound technology are critical.”\nOne of the biggest obstacles to long-term fetal monitoring is the constant movement of both the fetus and the umbilical cord. To solve this problem, the researchers created autonomous tracking algorithms that can automatically locate and follow the umbilical cord as it moves. This allows the patch to collect consistent measurements even when the mother or fetus changes position.\n“With continuous monitoring, we were able to observe dynamic fluctuations in blood flow that would likely be missed with conventional ultrasound exams,” Huang said.\n“Our system even detected an abnormality during one of our clinical visits,” Park added. “That pregnancy later resulted in a delivery at 29 weeks, and it demonstrated how continuous monitoring could help identify complications much earlier than we can today.”\nThe study builds on more than a decade of wearable ultrasound research in the laboratory of chemical and nanoengineering professor Sheng Xu at UC San Diego. Xu’s team has previously developed wearable ultrasound systems for applications including\nnoninvasive central blood pressure monitoring\nmobile heart monitoring\ngesture-based control of robotic devices\n. The work was carried out in the Aiiso Yufeng Li Family Department of Chemical and Nano Engineering at the UC San Diego Jacobs School of Engineering.\nFor the new study, researchers tested the patch in a multicenter clinical trial conducted at Jacobs Medical Center at UC San Diego Health and the John Radcliffe Hospital at the\nUniversity of Oxford\n. The patch produced measurements that closely matched those collected using standard handheld ultrasound devices.\nThe researchers gathered continuous monitoring data over periods of several hours from 62 pregnancies. The group included both healthy pregnancies and pregnancies affected by gestational diabetes, preeclampsia, high blood pressure, and abnormal fetal growth.\nThe team now aims to integrate the patch into a compact electronic platform that could eventually enable fully wireless operation.\nReference: “Fetal monitoring for high-risk pregnancies using a wearable ultrasound patch” by Geonho Park, Yizhou Bian, Hao Huang, Sai Zhou, Siyu Qin, Muyang Lin, Xinyi Yang, Aaron Lee, Anand Ramkumar, Mariana Tome, Jayne Lander, Xiangjun Chen, Shenghan Wang, Pranavi Bheemreddy, Liam Stanton, Ren Sheng, Guihuan Guo, Mabel Shehada, Ruotao Wang, Alexa Roa, Chengchangfeng Lu, Wentong Yue, Ray S. Wu, Xiaoxiang Gao, Hongjie Hu, Amer Yaghi, Mark Liu, Lawrence Impey, Sally L. Collins, Aris T. Papageorghiou, Louise C. Laurent, Keith A. Wear, Antoniya Georgieva and Sheng Xu, 26 May 2026,\nNature Biotechnology\nDOI: 10.1038/s41587-026-03140-1\nThis work was supported by Wellcome Leap (HER01430), the\nNational Institutes of Health\n(1R01EB033464-01 and 1R01HL171652-01), and Accelerating Innovation to Market at UC San Diego.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nUniversity of San Diego\nScientists Have Now Analyzed Ultrasounds for Birth Defects Associated With COVID-19 Vaccines\nMarijuana Study Finds 63 Percent of Breast Milk Samples Have THC Up to Six Days After Use\nCoffee Consumption During Pregnancy Linked to Child Obesity\nHigh Glucose Levels During Pregnancy Affects the Baby’s Heart\nExposure to BPA During Pregnancy May Cause Health Problems for Offspring\nStudy Reveals High-Fat Diet Harms Stem Cells in Developing Fetus\nStudy Shows Low level Drinking Not Associated With Higher Risk of Poor Birth Outcomes\nNew Study Questions the Benefits of Mammograms\nChildren Exposed to Nicotine in Utero Have Lower Reading Scores","tp":"超声贴片","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"加州大学圣地亚哥分校工程师开发了一种柔性可穿戴超声贴片，可连续数小时实时监测胎儿健康状况，在胎儿和脐带移动过程中仍保持稳定性能。临床测试表明该设备能帮助医生更早发现高危妊娠并发症，为产前监测提供了免持式、长期追踪的创新方案。"},{"t":"用于感内神经形态视觉的仿生全光谱双向光电突触晶体管","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73698?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电突触晶体管","kp":["[器件]: 全光谱双向光电突触晶体管","[应用]: 传感器内神经形态视觉"],"dp":1,"as":"受鸟类视觉系统启发,研究团队开发出全光谱双向光电突触晶体管(OST)。该器件可在宽光谱范围内模拟生物突触的双向光电子响应,兼具感光与信息处理能力,为神经形态视觉计算与仿生光电器件提供新架构。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Bio‐Inspired Full‐Spectrum Bidirectional Optoelectronic Synaptic Transistor for In‐Sensor Neuromorphic Vision","b":"ABSTRACT Inspired by avian visual systems, wide‐spectrum bidirectional optoelectronic synaptic transistors (OSTs) have e","aip":1},{"t":"拉脱维亚兹维涅基中石器时代-新石器时代狩猎采集者职业专业化的生物力学证据","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3371?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mesolithic cemeteries have greater dimensionality and scale that reflect emerging social complexity following the Upper Paleolithic. The Zvejnieki cemetery dates between the Middle Mesolithic and Late Neolithic, is associated with a persistent hunter-fisher-gatherer economy, and includes burials with pendants fashioned from mammal teeth. Stable isotopic analyses indicate dietary differences between individuals with pendants and without pendants beginning early in life. This context provides an opportunity to explore questions relating to occupational specialization using long bone cross-sectional geometry. Femoral cross-sectional properties from Zvejnieki were compared to a European database from the Upper Paleolithic to Neolithic to explore mobility. Femoral and humeral cross-sectional properties were compared between individuals with and without pendants to understand differences in mobility and manual activity in relation to mortuary practices. Diminished femoral rigidity and circular femoral shape were found at Zvejnieki, but no differences were observed between burial groups. Expanded cortical area and diminished medullary area were observed in the right humeri of males with pendants. Right humeral shape was comparatively circular among males with pendants, while right and left humeral shape was anteroposteriorally reinforced among males without pendants. Females with pendants had elevated right and left humeral shape ratios compared to females without pendants. Femoral morphology reflects reduced mobility, interaction with flat terrain, and exploitation of abundant, local resources at Zvejnieki. Differences in humeral cross-sectional properties between burial groups are consistent with specialized manual activity. These patterns reflect the economic and ideological components of independent specialization and point toward expanding social dimensions in Mesolithic-Neolithic hunter-gatherers."},{"t":"基于聚电解质构象的仿生纳米流体忆阻器，用于突触学习和内存逻辑计算机","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73598?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Bioinspired neuromorphic and in‐memory computing requires devices that store and process information through ionic dynamics analogous to biological synapses. Here, we report a polyelectrolyte conformational nanofluidic memristor (PCM) that integrates synaptic plasticity, neuromorphic learning, and stateful ionic logic within a single aqueous platform. The device operates through electric‐field‐driven, reversible conformational transitions of polyelectrolytes confined inside graphene oxide nanochannels, enabling analog conductance tuning, a sharp, tunable switching threshold, and an ON/OFF ratio exceeding 160. These conformational dynamics endow the PCM with rich synaptic functions, including long‐term potentiation and depression, multilevel memory retention, and symmetric weight update rules. By directly mapping the experimentally measured potentiation/depression curves into a physical learning model, we demonstrate high‐accuracy neuromorphic learning, achieving 97.1% recognition accuracy on the Modified National Institute of Standards and Technology (MNIST) handwritten‐digit dataset. Beyond learning, interconnected PCM units perform stateful ionic OR, IMP, and NAND operations, establishing universal in‐memory logic within the same ionic platform. This work introduces a bioinspired nanofluidic computing paradigm that unites the adaptive learning of neural networks and deterministic logic, paving the way to scalable and brain‐like ionic processors.","tp":"类脑忆阻器","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队报道了一种基于聚电解质构象转变的仿生纳米流体忆阻器（PCM），将突触可塑性、神经形态学习和离子态逻辑集成于单一水相平台。该器件通过电场驱动聚电解质链的可逆构象变化来存储和处理信息，模拟生物突触的离子动力学，为类脑计算和存内计算提供了新路径。","aip":1},{"t":"自供电热电水凝胶的生物电重新唤醒加速糖尿病溃疡修复","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73728?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT Diabetic foot ulcer (DFU) remains difficult to heal due to disrupted endogenous bioelectricity together with pe","tp":"热电水凝胶","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对糖尿病足溃疡因内源性生物电中断而难以愈合的问题，研究团队开发了自供电热电水凝胶，通过生物电刺激重新激活溃疡修复过程。该材料利用热电效应原位产生电信号，促进细胞迁移和血管新生，为糖尿病创面治疗提供了无需外部电源的新型电疗方案。"},{"t":"Binance、Bybit 因资金短缺取消 SpaceX IPO 分配","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/binance-bybit-cancel-spacex-ipo-allocations-shortfall","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Binance, Bybit Cancel SpaceX IPO Allocations After Shortfall — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"双向整合素β1激活协同神经血管耦合并增强骨再生","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74071-3","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","b":"Reconstruction of large segmental bone defects remains challenging because current grafting strategies often fail to coo"},{"t":"超越几何约束：动态流体晶格激活的拓扑化学聚合","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag360/8707062?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Topochemical polymerization affords lattice-directed polymers with high structural fidelity, but its scope is limited by the need for precise, static preorganization of reactive groups—an intrinsically fragile outcome of subtle intermolecular packing. Here we introduce dynamical fluid lattices into topochemical design to circumvent these geometric constraints, achieving near-quantitative monomer conversion even without ideal preorganization. Employing core-shell columnar liquid crystals, rapid molecular fluctuations within the fluid lattices enable temporary proximity of reactive sites that activate topochemical reactions. Meanwhile, the anisotropic columnar architecture directs chain growth into well-defined linear helical polymers. Despite their covalent backbones, the resulting polymers undergo temperature-dependent, dissipative depolymerization that enables complete monomer regeneration. We integrate fluid-lattice-activated topochemical polymerization into skin-attachable films, demonstrating temporary information encryption via fluorescence imaging at body temperature. This strategy expands the design space of topochemical synthesis and suggests opportunities in regenerable polymers and flexible wearable technologies.","tp":"拓扑聚合法","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队将动态流体晶格引入拓扑化学聚合设计，突破了传统拓扑聚合需精确静态预组织反应基团的几何限制。采用核壳柱状液晶结构，即使在没有理想预组织的情况下也能实现接近定量的单体转化率，大幅拓展了拓扑化学聚合的适用范围和反应效率。"},{"t":"超越氟化：化学配位信息机器学习引导的高压电解质金标准","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1244287?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高压锂电池电解液","kp":["[方法]: 化学配位信息机器学习","[目标]: 超越氟化的高压电解液设计"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种超越传统氟化策略的新方法，用于设计高压电解质材料。氟化学因能形成坚固界面膜而备受关注，但该研究引入了化学配位信息指导的机器学习方法（CIML），建立了一个'黄金准则'来预测和优化电解质的高压稳定性。该方法不仅考虑氟元素贡献，还综合分析配位化学环境对电化学窗口的影响。这一数据驱动策略有望加速高能量密度电池电解质的理性设计，减少试错成本，推动下一代储能技术发展。","ot":"Beyond Fluorination: A Golden Criterion Guided by Chemical Coordination‐Informed Machine Learning for High‐Voltage Elect","b":"ABSTRACT Fluorine chemistry has garnered attention for extending operating voltage limits of electrolytes through robust...","aip":1},{"t":"基底外侧杏仁核多巴胺传递情绪显着性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74226-2","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"观点评论","b":"The basolateral amygdala (BLA) is important for assigning emotional weight to environmental stimuli to guide learning, d"},{"t":"噬菌体劫持 2',3'-cNMP 以增强鲍曼不动杆菌中转座酶介导的噬菌体 DNA 整合","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7770?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Nucleotide second messengers are widely used to mediate the physiology and antiphage immunity in bacteria. It was revealed that 2′,3′-cAMP/2′,3′-cGMP synthetase activity is required for immune response in plants. However, it remains unclear whether 2′,3′-cNMPs are involved in the interactions between bacteria and phages. Here, we report that 2′,3′-cNMPs, which are synthesized by RnaA and degraded by A1S_2339, A1S_0249, and A1S_2666, play critical roles in the modulation of the physiology of\n                    Acinetobacter baumannii\n                    . 2′,3′-cNMPs specifically bind to the receptor protein CRP\n                    Ab\n                    in\n                    A. baumannii\n                    and thus affect the interaction between CRP\n                    Ab\n                    and the promoters of target genes. Furthermore, our study reveals that bacteriophages elevate 2′,3′-cNMPs to up-regulate the transcription of the transposases and Mu-like integrases required for bacteriophage DNA integration. Together, our results show that 2′,3′-cNMPs are important intracellular signals that control biological functions of\n                    A. baumannii\n                    , and bacteriophages could hijack these signals to facilitate phage DNA integration."},{"t":"丁二炔的 BN 类似物：B─B-键合 sp-sp 二硼(2) 物种及其去对称化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3515651?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In contrast to our earlier contribution on BN analogue of butadiyne featuring a conjugated B≡N─N≡B motif, we report here an alternative and distinct isoelectronic system, Ar*─N≡B─B≡N─Ar* (\n                    2\n                    ; Ar* = C\n                    6\n                    H\n                    3\n                    ‐2,6‐Trip\n                    2\n                    , Trip = C\n                    6\n                    H\n                    2\n                    ‐2,4,6‐\n                    i\n                    Pr\n                    3\n                    ). This B─B‐bonded bis(iminoborane) constitutes an rare example of an sp–sp diboron(2) species. Compound\n                    2\n                    exhibits characteristic mono‐ and double E–H (E = N, O) bond addition across the B≡N units to afford diboron(3) and diborane(4) species, respectively. Notably, mono‐N‐heterocyclic carbene (NHC) coordination induces desymmetrization of the NBBN core, fundamentally altering its electronic structure and reactivity profile. The resulting sp–sp\n                    2\n                    diboron(3) species undergoes a broader range of transformations with DMAB, DABSO, and CO\n                    2\n                    , furnishing novel products through addition, metathesis, and cycloaddition pathways involving selective cleavage of B─B, B≡N, and B═N bonds. Together, these results demonstrate how desymmetrization enables access to distinct reactivity modes within B─B‐bonded bis(iminoborane) frameworks."},{"t":"B细胞αv整合素调节肺生发中心和记忆B细胞的组织特化和克隆扩张","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb7633?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lung-resident B cells are increasingly recognized as key contributors to protective immunity against respiratory viruses, yet the mechanisms that govern their generation and specialization remain poorly understood. Here, we identify B cell–intrinsic αv integrin as a critical negative regulator of germinal center (GC) dynamics and memory B cell formation in the lung following influenza A virus infection. Using B cell–specific αv knockout mice, we show that loss of B cell αv integrin leads to persistent GC activity within the inducible bronchus-associated lymphoid tissue and expansion of lung-resident memory B cells, including IgA\n                    +\n                    and cross-reactive B cells capable of recognizing heterologous influenza variants. Single-cell transcriptomic and B cell receptor sequence analyses reveal that αv restricts clonal expansion and antigenic diversification of GC and memory B cells in the lung, but not in draining lymph nodes, indicating a spatially restricted mechanism of mucosal B cell regulation. These findings position αv integrin as a key checkpoint that constrains local mucosal B cell evolution and suggest previously unexplored strategies to improve mucosal vaccine efficacy by enhancing GC activity directly in the lung."},{"t":"作者更正：城外道路交通生态影响的全球扩张","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41893-026-01888-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Sustainability","tg":"观点评论","b":"Following publication of this article, an error has been identified in the code used to generate traffic volume predicat"},{"t":"天文学家揭开了 161 次新黑洞碰撞的破纪录记录","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/astronomers-unveil-record-breaking-haul-of-161-new-black-hole-collisions/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A new gravitational-wave catalogue reports 161 additional\nmergers, bringing the total to 390 detections.\nScientists at the\nUniversity of Glasgow\n’s Institute for Gravitational Research\nare celebrating the release of a major new collection of gravitational wave discoveries, a milestone that highlights the rapid growth of gravitational astronomy.\nThe latest Gravitational Wave Transient Catalogue (GWTC-5) was published online alongside scientific papers submitted to\nAstrophysical Journal\nAstrophysical Journal Letters\nThe catalog adds 161 newly identified signals from colliding black holes detected between April 2024 and January 2025 by the\nobservatories in the United States, the Virgo detector in Italy, and the KAGRA detector in Japan. Together, these facilities make up the LVK Collaboration. With these additions, the total number of gravitational wave detections has risen to 390.\nAmong the most notable results are evidence for second-generation black holes, the most accurate sky location ever determined for a gravitational wave source, and the first successful measurement of three vibrational modes from a black hole.\nResearchers at the University of Glasgow have been involved in gravitational wave science since the 1970s. They helped develop the highly sensitive mirror suspension systems used in the National Science Foundation’s Laser Interferometer Gravitational-wave Observatory (NSF LIGO), which are essential for detecting these tiny disturbances in space-time.\nSince the first direct observation of\ngravitational waves\nin September 2015, Glasgow scientists have continued working with international LVK partners to improve both detector performance and data analysis techniques. As detector sensitivity has increased, discoveries have become more frequent.\nDuring observing periods, the network now detects roughly three to four gravitational wave events each week, and that rate is expected to grow as instruments continue to improve.\nThe collaboration alternates between observation campaigns and periods dedicated to upgrades and testing. As a result, the gravitational wave catalog, including verified detections and detailed information about their sources, is updated and released to the scientific community about every six months.\nDr. Daniel Williams, a research fellow at the Institute for Gravitational Research, is co-chair of the LSC’s Compact Binary Science Working Group. He said: “This bumper update has once again broadened and deepened our knowledge of the universe and given us many more glimpses of its most elusive objects: colliding black holes.\n“Just ten years ago, we made the first detection of gravitational waves from one of these events, and it’s a real testament to the work of hundreds of scientists around the world that we’re now detecting and analyzing hundreds of them.\n“At Glasgow, we’ve been at the forefront of developing new technology to make the detectors more sensitive, allowing us to see more of these signals more clearly and from collisions much further away than we could a decade ago. We also lead the development of critical analyses that allow us to extract so much information from each signal: decoding the properties of black holes colliding billions of light-years away from Earth, all from a measurement which shifts our detectors by a fraction of the size of an atomic nucleus.\nBeyond the sheer number of new detections, the catalog includes several observations that set new records in gravitational wave astronomy. These include the most precise source localization ever achieved, the strongest gravitational wave signal yet detected, and additional evidence supporting the existence of second-generation black holes.\nOne event, designated GW240615, was detected by both LIGO observatories in the United States and the Virgo detector in Italy on June 15, 2024. It achieved the most accurate sky localization of any gravitational wave source observed so far, narrowing its origin to an area of only 6 square degrees.\nThe event was produced when two black holes with masses of about 26 and 30 suns merged more than 3 billion light-years from Earth.\nAlex Papadopoulos, a postgraduate researcher at the Institute for Gravitational Research, said, “The updated GWTC-5.0 catalogue gives us a much larger collection of gravitational-wave signals to help answer one of the biggest questions in cosmology: how fast is the Universe expanding?\n“The rate of this expansion is described by a value called the Hubble constant. Gravitational waves allow us to measure this by estimating how far away merging objects are, either directly from the signal itself or by identifying the galaxy where the merger took place.\n“One of the major improvements in GWTC-5.0 compared to previous catalogues is the inclusion of observations from the Virgo detector, which returned after not participating in the previous observing run. With this additional detector, we can pinpoint the location of gravitational-wave signals on the sky much more accurately, making it easier to identify the host galaxy of each merger. Our expanded library of detections also meant we could use 236 signals, almost double the previous number, in our analyses. Each event contributes a small amount of information, so together these additional signals significantly improve our results.\n“Together, these improvements help us measure the Hubble constant more precisely than ever before using gravitational waves, bringing us closer to understanding one of modern physics’ most important open questions.\n“In Glasgow, we developed and tested software that allows this analysis to run more than a thousand times faster than before, even with the growing number of gravitational-wave signals in the catalogue. This speed-up meant we could test many more possible scenarios and check that our results were as robust and reliable as possible, with the coordination of this effort led by our Institute for Gravitational Research.”\nFinding gravitational waves involves more than detecting a signal. Scientists must separate genuine events from background noise within the instruments. To measure how clearly a signal stands out, researchers use a value called the signal-to-noise ratio (SNR). GWTC-5 includes the strongest gravitational wave signal recorded so far, with an SNR of 76.9.\nThe event, known as GW250114, reached Earth on January 14, 2025. It originated from the merger of two black holes with masses of 32 and 34 Suns, located more than 1 billion light-years away. Because the signal was exceptionally clear, scientists were able to carry out the most precise test of general relativity to date and confirm Stephen Hawking’s black hole area theorem.\nDr. John Veitch, an academic at the University of Glasgow who analyzes black hole signals, said, “With the loudness of GW250114, we are able to compare the warped space-time before and after the black holes merged and found that the total area of the event horizons (the surface of ‘no return’) increased in accordance with Hawking’s laws of black hole mechanics.\n“After the merger the final black hole rings like a bell, giving off gravitational waves instead of sound. Analyzing these waves confirmed that although energy is given off in gravitational waves during the merger, the total entropy of the black holes increases in accordance with the second law of thermodynamics. This shows that even for black holes the laws of thermodynamics still apply, but unlike normal objects, the more energy they hold, the colder they become.”\nResearchers also identified two particularly unusual black hole mergers, GW241011 and GW241110, detected one month apart in October and November 2024. These events occurred about 700 million and 2.4 billion light-years from Earth, respectively.\nThe spin properties of the black holes involved suggest they may be second-generation black holes, meaning they were created through earlier black hole mergers. Such objects are thought to form in dense environments such as star clusters, where repeated collisions are more likely.\nThe growing number of detections is also helping scientists better understand the different populations of black holes found throughout the universe.\nStorm Colloms, a postgraduate researcher at the Institute for Gravitational Research, said, “I’ve been part of the team understanding the processes that create merging black holes and neutron stars with the latest set of observations. We studied 267 sources, including 104 new observations. This set of hundreds of observations allows us to confidently measure the masses, spins, and distances of binary black holes and probe the correlations between these properties. In particular, we find that black holes with different mass ranges have different spins, indicating that there are distinct formation pathways that create unique groups of systems.\n“This trend was hinted at by previously published observations, GW241011 and GW241110, pairs of black holes with clearly measured high spins and unequal masses. These two observations showed characteristic signs that the larger black hole in each pair was formed not directly from a massive star, but from a previous merger of two black holes. The signatures of black holes formed from previous mergers persist in the population as a whole, indicating that GW241011 and GW241110 are not one-of-a-kind, but trace an underlying trend. Now, we have growing evidence that there are ways that the Universe creates merging black holes in addition to those that come from massive binary stars.\n“The latest measurements of the population of gravitational wave sources continue to bring us closer to painting a clear picture of the origins of binary black holes and neutron stars. With upcoming observing runs and more sensitive detectors, we will get more precise measurements of individual sources and increase the number of sources in our catalogues, allowing us to probe more and more detailed astrophysics of compact object formation.”\nDr. Williams added, “We’re now detecting so many of these signals that we’re not just learning about individual collisions; it’s the astronomical equivalent of uncovering an ancient civilization. Today’s new results are like finding a previously undiscovered hoard, revealing not just individual lives but the structure of an entire lost world.”\n“GWTC-5.0: Population Properties of Merging Compact Binaries”\nThe University of Glasgow’s research is supported by funding from UKRI’s Science and Technology Facilities Council (STFC), as are other gravitational research groups across the UK including the Universities of Birmingham, Cambridge, Cardiff, Kings College London, Nottingham, Portsmouth, Sheffield, Strathclyde, University College London, Queen Mary University, and the University of the West of Scotland.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAstrophysics\nGravitational Waves\nUniversity of Glasgow\nRipples in Space-Time Detected – Caused by the Death Spiral of a Neutron Star and a Black Hole\nLeveraging Einstein’s General Theory of Relativity, Astrophysicists Calculate How Many Stars Will Eventually Collide as Black Holes\nUsing Gravitational Wave Astronomy to Observe a ‘Black Hole Symphony’ [Video]\nGravitational Wave Detector Breakthrough Dampens Quantum Noise for Precise Measurements\nLIGO and Virgo Detect Gravitational Waves from Binary Black Hole Merger\nResearchers Reveal That Hidden Dimensions Could Influence Gravitational Waves\nLIGO Detects Merging Ripples in Space and Time\nLIGO Detects Gravitational Waves Again\nNew Research Shows LIGO’s Twin Black Holes Might Have Been Born Inside a Single Star","tp":"引力波探测","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"as":"最新引力波瞬变目录（GWTC-5）发布了161次新的黑洞合并事件，使引力波探测总数达到390次。格拉斯哥大学引力研究所参与了这一里程碑式成果，相关论文已提交至天体物理学期刊。该目录的发布标志着引力波天文学的快速发展，为理解黑洞和中子星等致密天体的合并频率和性质提供了宝贵数据。"},{"t":"天文学家发现外星世界存在磁场的最有力证据","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/astronomers-find-strongest-evidence-yet-for-magnetic-fields-on-alien-worlds/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Astronomers studying the atmospheres of several intensely heated exoplanets uncovered an unexpected pattern that may reveal a hidden property of these distant worlds.\nAstronomers have uncovered the clearest evidence so far that some planets beyond our Solar System possess magnetic fields. By measuring atmospheric winds on seven extremely hot gas giants, researchers found signs that magnetism is shaping conditions on these distant worlds.\nThe study used observations from the European Southern Observatory’s\nVery Large Telescope\n’s VLT) and the Gemini North telescope. The results suggest that magnetic fields are controlling the planets’ powerful winds, providing the first reliable measurements of magnetic field strength on exoplanets.\n“This breakthrough opens a completely new window on\nresearch. It’s the first time we can compare the magnetic environments of other worlds — a key step toward ultimately understanding which planets can stay alive, keep their water, and perhaps even, one day, host life as we know it,” says Julia Seidel, an astronomer at the Laboratoire Lagrange, Observatoire de la Côte d’Azur, France and lead author of the study published today in\nNature Astronomy\nMagnetic fields play an important role in shaping planetary environments. On Earth, the magnetic field interacts with the atmosphere and helps protect the planet from harmful charged particles. Other planets in our Solar System, including\n, also have magnetic fields.\nDespite years of research, scientists had not been able to directly determine the strength of magnetic fields on exoplanets. That challenge has remained unsolved for about 15 years.\nInterestingly, the researchers were not originally searching for magnetic fields. Their goal was to study winds in the atmospheres of seven giant planets orbiting different stars. These worlds resemble Jupiter but orbit much closer to their stars and are tidally locked, meaning one side constantly faces the star.\nLike the Moon always showing the same face to Earth, these planets have permanent day and night sides. One hemisphere is intensely heated while the other remains much colder. The extreme temperature contrast creates unusual weather patterns and exceptionally powerful winds.\nThe team measured winds ranging from about 7,200 km/h (4,475 mph) to more than 25,000 km/h (15,535 mph). By comparison, Jupiter’s fastest known winds reach roughly 1,500 km/h (930 mph).\n“In the beginning we set out to check if the atmospheric winds behaved the same way for all hot planets,” explains Seidel, who was previously an astronomer at ESO in Chile.\nThe researchers analyzed data from the ESPRESSO instrument on ESO’s VLT in Chile’s Atacama Desert and a similar instrument on the Gemini North telescope in Hawaiʻi, USA. (The VLT is an ESO telescope while Gemini North is one half of the International Gemini Observatory, partly funded by the U.S. National Science Foundation (NSF) and operated by NSF\nAs they compared wind speeds with planetary temperatures, an unexpected trend appeared. Instead of moving faster, winds slowed down as temperatures increased.\n“This is totally counterintuitive because, all things being equal, hot planets have more energy to accelerate the winds! Something must happen that slows down the wind speeds for hotter objects,” says study co-author Vivien Parmentier, a professor at the Laboratoire Lagrange.\nThe researchers concluded that the most likely explanation is the presence of global magnetic fields. These fields can interact with charged particles in a planet’s atmosphere, reducing their motion and effectively slowing atmospheric circulation.\nUsing this effect, the team estimated the magnetic field strength of each planet. The results indicate magnetic fields comparable to those found on giant planets in our own Solar System, with strengths roughly four times greater than Saturn’s or about half that of Jupiter’s.\nThe findings also suggest that magnetic fields could influence much more than atmospheric winds.\n“Here on Earth, we know the beauty of the northern and southern lights, where particles from the Sun hit our magnetic field and are guided toward the poles, colliding with gases in the atmosphere to produce colorful displays of green, pink, and purple,” explains study co-author Bibiana Prinoth, a former PhD student at Lund University, Sweden, now an astronomer at ESO in Garching, Germany.\nOn these exoplanets, auroras powered by magnetic activity could be even more spectacular.\nLooking ahead, scientists are eager to use ESO’s Extremely Large Telescope to study both giant and Earth-sized exoplanets in greater detail. The observatory may even be able to identify atmospheric gases linked to auroral activity on distant worlds.\nPrinoth says: “I like to imagine that some of these worlds have a sky filled not only with stars, but with vast curtains of colorful light dancing across a planet that’s half in perpetual day and half in endless night.”\nReference: “Magnetic field strengths of hot giant exoplanets consistent with Solar System values” by Julia V. Seidel, Vivien Parmentier, Bibiana Prinoth, Thea Hood, Nishil Mehta, Valentin De Lia, Konstantin Batygin, Tristan Guillot, Ragnar Van den Broeck, Hayley Beltz, Brian Thorsbro, Florian Debras, Daniel D. B. Koll, Thaddeus D. Komacek, Emily Rauscher, Lorenzo Pino, Matteo Brogi, Joost P. Wardenier, Jacob L. Bean, Björn Benneke, Jean-Michel L. B. Désert, Pablo Drake, Siddharth Gandhi, Mark Hammond, David Kasper, Michael R. Line, Elspeth K. H. Lee, Stefan Pelletier, Andreas Seifahrt, Adrien Simonnin, Peter C. B. Smith and Kevin B. Stevenson, 2 June 2026,\nNature Astronomy\nDOI: 10.1038/s41550-026-02870-1\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAstrophysics\nEuropean Southern Observatory\nMagnetic Fields\nPlanetary Science\nHidden Oceans of Magma Could Be Protecting Alien Life\nAstronomers Discover a “Jupiter Twin” Around a Sun-Like Star\nALMA Reveals Double Star with Wildly Misaligned Planet-Forming Discs\nAstronomers Measure the Length of an Exoplanet Day\nALMA Reveals Unexpected Gas Clump in Debris Disc Around Beta Pictoris\nHARPS Discovers First Exoplanet Orbiting a Solar Twin in a Star Cluster\nThree Super-Earths Discovered in Habitable Zone of Nearby Star GJ 677C\nALMA “Dust Trap” Observations Solve Planet Formation Mystery\nAstronomers Discover a Probable Free-Floating Planet, CFBDSIR2149","tp":"系外行星磁","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"天文学家通过欧洲南方天文台观测了七颗极热气态巨行星的大气风，发现了迄今最强有力的系外行星磁场存在证据。研究显示磁力正在塑造这些遥远星球的大气条件，该发现为理解系外行星的磁场特性及其对行星演化和大气逃逸的影响提供了重要线索。"},{"t":"构筑仿生纳米晶域实现超坚韧透明纤维素光子水凝胶","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed8263?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纤维素光子水凝胶","kp":["[仿生结构]: 类蜘蛛丝取向纳米晶域","[特性]: 高强透明","[材料]: 纤维素光子水凝胶"],"as":"仿生蜘蛛丝通过分层结构和高度取向的纳米晶域实现卓越的机械韧性与光学透明度。研究者设计了仿生纳米晶域架构，使材料兼具极高韧性和高透明度，突破了传统材料在强度与透光性之间的权衡。该仿生材料有望应用于柔性电子、防护涂层、光学器件及轻量化结构材料，为生物启发的高性能材料设计提供了新思路。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Architecting bioinspired nanocrystalline domains for ultimate robust and transparent cellulose photonic hydrogels","b":"Biomimetic spider silk achieves remarkable functionalities through hierarchical architectures with highly oriented crystalline domains, offering potential across multiple disciplines. However, achieving uniform alignment and spatial control of nanocrystalline domains remains a critical challenge, limiting the realization of structure-derived optical and mechanical functionalities in bioinspired systems. Here, we develop an ultrastrong, transparent photonic hydrogel composed of cellulose nanocrystals (CNCs), wherein a programmable five-stage stretching-pause process enables precise alignment of CNC domains without sacrificing their intrinsic chirality—unattainable in conventional flexible polymers. This strategy facilitates uniform nanocrystal reorientation (orientation factor = 0.91) and transforms the porous network into aligned nanofibril bundles, yielding optical transparency (&gt;90%) with anisotropic polarization responses, superior mechanical strength (61.6 MPa), toughness (251.8 MJ·m\n                    −3\n                    ), and fatigue resistance (226.7 kJ·m\n                    −2\n                    ). The flexible hydrogel resists creasing and serves as a sustainable scattering polarizer for programmable polarized displays and secure information encryption, providing a versatile platform for advanced optical and electronic applications."},{"t":"s-吲达苯分子桥反芳香驱动的单分子电导增强","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3299896?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High electrical conductance of antiaromatic molecules compared with aromatic counterparts at the single‐molecule level has been a topic of controversy, with only a few previous experimental proofs. We synthesized length‐matched molecular wires incorporating 12 π‐electron antiaromatic\n                    s\n                    ‐indacene (Ind) and 14 π‐electron aromatic benzodithiophene (BDT) cores with different anchoring modes and measured the single‐molecule electrical conductance (SMEC) by scanning tunneling microscopy‐break junction method, validating that antiaromatic cores significantly enhance the conductance. For the diagonally anchored systems, the antiaromatic Ind derivative exhibits SMEC approximately 10 times higher than that of its aromatic BDT analogue, thanks to the cooperative effects of a linear conjugation pathway and the narrow gap between the highest occupied molecular orbital (HOMO) and the lowest unoccupied molecular orbital (LUMO) that brings favorable frontier molecular orbital (FMO) alignment with the electrode Fermi level. Notably, for the horizontally anchored systems, the Ind derivative exhibits SMEC 2.8 times higher than that of its BDT counterpart, as its antiaromaticity‐driven FMO alignment overtakes the cross‐conjugation pathway. Additionally, introduction of electron‐withdrawing trifluoromethyl groups to the Ind core shifts the LUMO closer to the Fermi level, resulting in 1.5 times higher conductance. These results definitively demonstrate the enhancement of SMEC driven by antiaromaticity."},{"t":"美国以安全风险为由，Anthropic限制顶级模型","d":"2026-06-14","i":"news","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/ai-robotics/anthropic-blocks-international-users","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"interesting engineering","as":"AI巨头Anthropic被迫暂停向美国以外用户开放其最先进AI模型的访问权限，原因是美国政府以安全风险为由提出要求。此举直接影响全球开发者和企业获取前沿模型的能力，可能加剧不同地区在AI技术获取上的不平等，反映出先进AI技术正成为地缘政治管控的重点对象，出口管制趋势日益明显。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"AI模型出口管制","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":8.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Anthropic restricts top-tier models after US cites security risk","cl":"e30a4a9832","cln":"Anthropic|最新模型访问权限|遵政府令暂停|2026-06-14","cp":0,"b":"AI giant Anthropic has been forced to suspend access to its most advanced artificial intelligence models for users outside the US after the Trump administration imposed sweeping new export restrictions on the technology. The decision effectively blocks foreign governments, businesses, researchers, and individuals, as well as foreign nationals residing in the US, from using the company’s latest AI systems.\nAccording to a US administration official, Commerce Secretary Howard Lutnick informed Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei in a letter sent on Friday that the company’s newly released Fable 5 and Mythos 5 models are now classified under export control rules.\nTo comply with the directive, Anthropic has moved to disable\nfor all affected users, reflecting Washington’s growing view that cutting-edge AI capabilities should be treated as\nstrategically\nsensitive technologies.\nAnthropic said it chose to disable access to its two newest AI models entirely because the new US restrictions apply to a wide range of users, making selective enforcement impractical. The rules cover foreign governments, companies, and individuals, and even extend to some foreign-born Anthropic employees working in the country,\nthe Wall Street Journal\n“The net effect of this order is that we must abruptly disable\nand Mythos 5 for all our customers to ensure compliance. Access to all other Claude models is not affected,” the company said in a\non X, noting that they were “working to restore access as soon as possible”.\nalso notes that the decision marks one of the clearest signs yet that Washington is willing to intervene directly in the global AI race, treating advanced models as strategic technologies rather than ordinary commercial products.\nFor companies such as\nand its rivals, which are competing aggressively to release ever more capable systems ahead of highly anticipated public listings, regulatory hurdles and forced slowdowns can carry enormous financial consequences. Any disruption to product rollouts or access to international markets risks delaying growth plans and could ultimately cost the industry billions of dollars in lost revenue and valuation.\nThe suspension of access to Mythos could have immediate consequences far beyond the AI sector, as governments and private organizations have increasingly relied on the model to detect and fix software vulnerabilities. A prolonged shutdown could disrupt ongoing\ncybersecurity\noperations and delay critical defensive work across a range of industries,\nSectors such as finance, energy, and critical infrastructure have already integrated the technology into their security workflows. The development comes only days after Anthropic introduced Fable, a next-generation model built on the same advanced architecture as Mythos, making it available to the public with additional safeguards designed to limit potentially dangerous capabilities.\nTensions between Anthropic and the Trump administration have been building for months over the rules governing how the Pentagon can deploy the company’s AI systems. At the center of the dispute are the safety guardrails and operational limits attached to Anthropic’s models.\nAccording to Washington DC-based AI columnist Ron Schmelzer, the biggest takeaway from the latest restrictions is that governments are increasingly treating advanced AI as a strategic technology, on par with nuclear capabilities or high-grade encryption.\n“While the US was focusing on preventing foreign users from accessing Anthropic’s most powerful models, Anthropic’s reaction of making it unavailable to everyone shows that there’s a tension here between the AI mega companies efforts to rapidly increase their market share and profitability and governments efforts to make sure that AI is used for their benefit. In this push and pull, who will win, multi-billion dollar companies (or even trillion-dollar) or powerful governments?” he tells\nInteresting Engineering (IE)\nThe latest decision to impose new restrictions could further intensify that standoff, raising the stakes in an increasingly contentious debate over the\nuse of advanced AI.\nGet the latest in engineering, tech, space & science - delivered daily to your inbox.\nBojan Stojkovski is a freelance journalist based in Skopje, North Macedonia, covering foreign policy and technology for more than a decade. His work has appeared in Foreign Policy, ZDNet, and Nature.\nSolid-state battery cell hits 465 Wh/kg density, targets aerospace and defense applications\nTest facility for full-scale fusion power-plant blankets set to be developed in US\nUS Navy’s nuclear-powered fast-attack submarine returns to fleet\nIron-based catalyst helps zinc-air batteries power devices without precious metals\nScientists forge 24,000-atom mini universe that generates time without a single clock\nMore from AI and Robotics\nAI and Robotics\nAI got smarter and twice as expensive in 2026. Here’s which model is worth it\nAI and Robotics\nNew research shows robot ‘personality’ in games hinges on timing and turn-taking\nAI and Robotics\nFIFA World Cup 2026 gets Boston Dynamics’ robot dogs for venue security patrols\nAI and Robotics\nWatch: Korean humanoid robot performs viral K-POP dance, learns by watching videos\nAI and Robotics\nRobot hand uses touch and vision to harvest ripe fruit with near-100% accuracy\nAI and Robotics\nAI got smarter and twice as expensive in 2026. Here’s which model is worth it\nAI and Robotics\nNew research shows robot ‘personality’ in games hinges on timing and turn-taking\nAI and Robotics\nFIFA World Cup 2026 gets Boston Dynamics’ robot dogs for venue security patrols\nAI and Robotics\nWatch: Korean humanoid robot performs viral K-POP dance, learns by watching videos\nAI and Robotics\nRobot hand uses touch and vision to harvest ripe fruit with near-100% accuracy"},{"t":"Anthropic遵政府令暂停客户对最新模型的访问","d":"2026-06-14","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/anthropic-suspends-customers-access-latest-models-government-order","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","as":"Anthropic在接到政府命令后，暂停了客户对其最新AI模型的访问权限。该事件凸显政府对前沿AI技术监管力度的显著升级，以及AI出口管控在地缘政治博弈中的关键地位。依赖这些模型的国际客户受到直接影响，可能促使各国加快本土大模型研发，推动全球AI竞争格局重塑。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"AI模型出口管制","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":8.0,"r":2.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"ot":"Anthropic Suspends Customers’ Access to Latest Models After Government Order","cl":"e30a4a9832","cln":"Anthropic|最新模型访问权限|遵政府令暂停|2026-06-14","cp":1,"b":"Anthropic Suspends Customers’ Access to Latest Models After Government Order — The Information\nRead this briefing for free"},{"t":"氮化硼纳米管膜中的反常超快锂离子输运","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02182-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氮化硼纳米管膜","kp":["孔密度[BNNT膜]: 10^7 pores/cm²","管径[BNNT]: 3nm和12nm","[发现]: BNNT离子传输与碳纳米管本质不同"],"as":"研究团队系统考察了不同碱金属离子在带电氮化硼纳米管（BNNTs）中的水溶液传输行为，并与碳纳米管进行了对比。结果显示锂离子在BNNT中呈现异常超快的传输特性，且选择性极高。该发现对开发高效锂电池电解质、海水淡化膜及离子分离技术具有重要意义，揭示了氮化硼纳米通道独特的离子输运物理机制。","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Anomalous ultrafast lithium-ion transport through boron nitride nanotube membranes","cl":"38d9e8848b","cln":"BNNT研究团队|反常锂离子超快输运发现|论文发布|2026-06-14","cp":0,"b":"Here we studied the aqueous transport of different alkali-metal ions in charged boron nitride nanotubes (BNNTs) and comp"},{"t":"氮化硼纳米管阵列中的反常离子流","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02143-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氮化硼纳米管膜","kp":["[膜材料]: 垂直排列氮化硼纳米管膜","[性能]: 超快高选择性锂离子传输"],"as":"垂直排列的氮化硼纳米管膜实现了异常超快且高选择性的锂离子传输。这种二维纳米通道材料有望用于下一代锂电池电解质、高选择性离子筛分膜及能源存储器件。研究揭示了氮化硼纳米结构中离子输运的独特物理机制，为设计高效离子分离和储能材料提供了新方向。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Anomalous ion flows in boron nitride nanotube arrays","cl":"38d9e8848b","cln":"BNNT研究团队|反常锂离子超快输运发现|论文发布|2026-06-14","cp":1,"b":"Vertically aligned boron nitride nanotube membranes enable anomalously ultrafast and highly selective lithium-ion transp"},{"t":"通过场调制对范德华磁体中的斯格明子晶格进行退火","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74219-1","c":"不相关","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"In atomic solids, annealing transforms disordered structures into ordered crystals through thermal activation, whereas r"},{"t":"古代陨石揭示了 45 亿年前存在的被遗忘的星球","d":"2026-06-14","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/ancient-meteorite-reveals-a-forgotten-planet-that-existed-4-5-billion-years-ago/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A rare meteorite recovered from the Sahara Desert has revealed compelling evidence for a long-lost world that existed during the solar system’s earliest days.\nAbout 4.5 billion years ago, a large planetary body, potentially as large as the Moon or even\n, orbited the Sun before colliding with another object and breaking apart.\nNow, researchers reporting in\nEarth and Planetary Science Letters\nsay they have found the first direct evidence that this lost protoplanet once existed. The discovery suggests that some early worlds formed and evolved in ways very different from Earth and other rocky planets.\n“It’s incredible to think there was once a world this large,” said Aaron Bell, an assistant research professor in the Department of Earth Science at the University of Colorado Boulder. “We only know it existed because a few fragments of it happened to land on Earth. These meteorites preserved evidence of a completely different pathway through which early planets developed.”\nThe evidence comes from a meteorite found in the Sahara Desert called Northwest Africa (NWA) 12774, an extremely rare type of meteorite known as an angrite.\nAngrites are among the oldest volcanic rocks in the solar system. They formed just a few million years after the solar system emerged about 4.56 billion years ago. They are also remarkably uncommon. Of the more than 80,000 meteorites discovered on Earth, only 68 have been identified as angrites.\nScientists have long been puzzled by their chemistry. Unlike Earth, Mars, and other rocky planets, angrites contain very little silicon dioxide, or silica, a major component of nearly all known terrestrial planets.\nBecause of that unusual composition, researchers previously believed angrites originated from relatively small asteroids with radii of less than 200 kilometers (124 miles).\nWhile analyzing NWA 12774, Bell and his team found clinopyroxene, a mineral commonly present in Earth’s crust and mantle. What stood out was its unusually high aluminum content, which indicates the mineral formed under intense pressure deep inside a planetary body.\nThe researchers modeled the conditions required to produce the meteorite’s mineral composition.\nTheir results showed that the aluminum rich clinopyroxene could only have formed at pressures of at least 17.5 kilobars. By comparison, pressure at the bottom of the Mariana Trench, Earth’s deepest ocean location, is about 1 kilobar.\nSuch pressures would be impossible inside a small asteroid. Instead, the calculations indicate that the angrite parent body had a radius of at least 1,000 kilometers (621 miles).\nAdditional evidence suggested the source body may have been even larger. Crystals within NWA 12774 retained sharp edges and subtle chemical patterns that likely would not have survived if they had formed deep below the surface.\nThat finding suggests the crystals developed at relatively shallow depths, meaning the parent body would have needed to be significantly larger to generate the required pressures.\nUnder this interpretation, the angrite parent body may have exceeded 1,800 kilometers (1,118 miles) in radius. That would make it comparable in size to the Moon and possibly approaching Mars, which has a radius of 3,300 kilometers (2,050 miles).\n“There are many meteorites sitting in drawers that haven’t been thoroughly studied, so there were likely more of these protoplanets we don’t know about,” Bell said.\nResearchers still do not know what ultimately happened to the ancient world. One possibility is that it was destroyed in a major collision early in solar system history, with its fragments later becoming part of other rocky planets, including Earth.\n“The materials that formed the angrite parent body are fundamentally different from the ingredients of Earth and Mars. It points to a distinct and separate evolutionary path in planetary formation in the early history of our solar system,” Bell said.\nReference: “High-pressure clinopyroxene in Northwest Africa 12774 and new geobarometric evidence for a planetary embryo-sized angrite parent body” by Aaron S. Bell, Laura Waters and Mark Ghiorso, 10 April 2026,\nEarth and Planetary Science Letters\nDOI: 10.1016/j.epsl.2026.120029\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nEarth Science\nPlanetary Science\nUniversity of Colorado at Boulder\nJupiter’s Gravity May Explain a 4.5-Billion-Year-Old Meteorite Mystery\nScientists Have Uncovered When Jupiter Was Born, Solving a Longstanding Mystery\nGeochemical Meteorite Data Reveal How Mars Lost Its Water\nResearchers Discover Sample of Ancient Martian Crust\nNASA Probes Reveal Source of Particle Acceleration in Van Allen Radiation Belts\nNASA’s Lunar Program Detects Bright Explosion on the Moon\nCassini Observes Meteors Colliding With Saturn’s Rings\nNakhla Fragment Shows First Evidence of Water Dissolving the Surface of Mars\nDiogenites Provide Clues of the Earliest Days of Our Solar System","tp":"远古原行星","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员在撒哈拉沙漠发现的一块稀有陨石中找到了约45亿年前一颗已消失的原行星存在的直接证据。该天体大小可能与月球甚至更大，曾在太阳系早期绕日运行后因碰撞而解体。这一发现发表于《地球与行星科学通讯》，为理解太阳系早期行星形成和演化历史提供了珍贵线索。"},{"t":"理解扭曲二维材料的分析框架","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag339/8707688?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扭转二维材料","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"Analytical framework for understanding twisted 2D materials"},{"t":"创新技术提升蛋白质结构图像质量","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01858-1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"冷冻电镜相位板","kp":["[技术]: 激光相位板","[应用]: 冷冻电镜蛋白质结构成像"],"sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"两个研究团队历经多年努力，成功开发了'激光相位板'系统，显著提升冷冻电子显微镜（cryo-EM）的蛋白质结构成像质量。激光相位板通过光学手段增强相位对比，突破了传统cryo-EM在低电子剂量下对比度不足的瓶颈。该技术有望推动原子分辨率蛋白质结构解析，对结构生物学和药物设计领域具有重要意义。","ot":"An innovative technology boosts image quality for protein structures","b":"After years of effort, two research teams have developed ‘laser phase plate’ systems that could help cryo-electron-micro"},{"t":"用于无电池无线外周神经调节的可注射、无引线生物电子接口","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeg1437?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Injectable bioelectronics offer a minimally invasive approach to peripheral nerve stimulation but remain limited by onboard energy storage and fragile leads. Here, we present SEED, a leadless, battery-free bioelectronic interface engineered for percutaneous delivery through a standard 14-gauge needle. SEED (Stimulating Electrode for Electroceutical Delivery) operates in the magnetoquasistatic regime using low-frequency (65 kilohertz) resonant inductive coupling, externalizing waveform generation and control, enabling programmable neuromodulation without onboard active electronics. A spiral-helix electrode geometry promotes longitudinal nerve engagement while limiting off-target field spread. Benchtop and ex vivo characterization demonstrates precise, programmable control of stimulation frequency, pulse width, and amplitude under physiologically relevant conditions. In vivo validation in a rat sciatic nerve model confirms frequency-locked motor responses and graded neural recruitment following percutaneous deployment. SEED exhibits strong radiopacity and acoustic contrast, supporting compatibility with ultrasound and computed tomography for image-guided neuromodulation. This platform provides a scalable pathway toward minimally invasive bioelectronic therapies."},{"t":"巴西亚马逊和塞拉多地区的乙醇繁荣和玉米价格上涨","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600323X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"仿章鱼凝胶电解质通过构建差异化结构调控锂硫电池阳离子迁移","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71197?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫凝胶电解质","kp":["[电解质策略]: 仿章鱼凝胶差异化溶剂化","[目标]: 抑制多硫化锂穿梭"],"as":"针对锂硫电池中多硫化锂(LiPSs)穿梭效应导致性能衰减的核心难题，该研究受章鱼触手结构启发，设计了一种凝胶电解质来调控阳离子迁移。该仿生设计可选择性抑制多硫化物穿梭、促进锂离子均匀输运，有望提升锂硫电池循环寿命和库伦效率，为下一代高能量密度电池的工程化应用提供新思路。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"An Octopus‐Inspired Gel Electrolyte Regulates Cation Migration in Lithium–Sulfur Batteries via Constructing Differentiat","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) shuttling is a major cause of performance degradation in lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries. Recent studies indicate that LiPSs readily bind with free Li\n                    +\n                    to form cationic species that migrate together with Li\n                    +\n                    . Conventional strategies that ignore solvation environment regulation for selective cation separation often hinder Li\n                    +\n                    dissociation and transport. In this study, guided by quantum calculations and inspired by octopus morphology, acetylated polysorbate (Ac‐CP80) was synthesized via photoinitiated radical polymerization using reactive amphiphilic monomers. Structural characterization confirmed that the material forms a multi‐armed, biomimetic structure with multiple adsorption sites, enabling in‐situ formation of a gel electrolyte (Ac‐CP80@PP). Through an integrated approach combining in situ and 2D Raman spectroscopy, X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS), charge‐discharge cycling, post‐electrode analysis, concentration‐dependent Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    6\n                    simulation experiments, and molecular dynamics simulations, it is systematically revealed that Ac‐CP80 creates a differentiated solvation environment: hyperbranched PEO side chains like tentacles capture LiPSs and guide them into the weakly solvating cross‐linked network, suppressing LiPSs shuttling; terminal esters enhance local solvation to promote Li\n                    +\n                    dissociation and transport. With Ac‐CP80@PP, Li–S batteries achieve capacity of 781.6 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.5 C and retain stability over 600 cycles with only 0.06% decay per cycle, exhibiting excellent cycling stability.","aip":1},{"t":"动态互锁星形离子液体调聚物实现的两栖透气离子皮肤","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73701?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"两栖离子皮肤","kp":["[材料]: 星形离子液体调聚物","[特性]: 两栖透气离子皮肤"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种仿生\"离子皮肤\"，采用动态互锁星形聚合物结构，兼具两栖透气性与皮肤般的柔软感知能力。动态可逆交联网络赋予其自修复、高拉伸和环境适应性，可作为可穿戴生物电子界面的理想材料，在健康监测、软体机器人触觉传感等领域具有应用潜力。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Amphibious Breathable Ionic Skin Enabled by Dynamically Interlocked Star‐Shaped Ionic Liquid Telomers","b":"ABSTRACT Epidermal ionic skins act as promising adaptable interfaces for bioelectronics, but they often struggle to simu"},{"t":"碱浸取：提升固体氧化物燃料电池空气电极反应活性的简便表面活化策略","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73511?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿空气电极","kp":["[策略]: 碱浸提表面活化","[电极]: 钙钛矿氧化物空气电极","[应用]: 固体氧化物燃料电池"],"as":"针对钙钛矿氧化物空气电极催化活性不足的问题，该研究提出一种简便的碱性浸取表面活化策略。通过选择性刻蚀表面组分，暴露高活性催化位点并优化电子结构，显著提升氧还原/氧析出反应动力学。该方法工艺简单、普适性强，为固态氧化物燃料电池和可充电锌空电池电极的性能优化提供了通用思路。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Alkaline Leaching: A Facile Surface Activation Strategy to Improve the Reactivity of Air Electrodes for Solid Oxide Fuel","b":"Surface Activation Strategy for Perovskite Oxide Air Electrodes The cover illustration highlights a surface activation s..."},{"t":"热电冷却技术的进展、挑战与前景","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008779?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"热电制冷","dp":1,"as":"","sc":2.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.5,"r":2.5,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Advances, challenges and prospects in thermoelectric cooling technology"},{"t":"自适应 kNN 图模型","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74296-2","c":"不相关","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","b":"The k-nearest neighbors (kNN) algorithm is a cornerstone of non-parametric classification in artificial intelligence, ye"},{"t":"纳米碳笼中自适应空腔诱导的晶态手性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4894757?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性纳米碳笼","kp":["[机制]: 自适应空腔效应","[调控手段]: 结晶溶剂/蒈烯客体分子"],"as":"研究团队在纳米碳笼中实现了自适应空腔诱导的晶态手性结构。手性纳米碳因独特的旋光特性在先进光学应用中极具前景，但精确控制其手性一直极具挑战。该工作通过引入可自适应的分子空腔，使碳笼内部形成稳定的晶态手性排列，为设计手性光学材料、不对称催化和分子识别器件提供了新策略。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Adaptive Cavity‐Enabled Crystalline Chirality in Nanocarbon Cages","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chiral nanocarbons are attractive because their unique chiroptical properties enable advanced optical applications. In this work, we report the discovery that the chirality of nanocarbon cages may be changed in the crystalline state through an “adaptive cavity” effect. This effect allows the use of different crystallization solvents or the introduction of coronene guest molecules to modulate the conformation of the nanocarbon cages. This adaptive behavior permits construction of chiral hierarchical superstructures from achiral building blocks. The resulting chiral crystals exhibit second‐harmonic generation activity and a strong piezoelectric response (\n                    d\n                    33\n                    = 120 pm/V). This work details a novel method for constructing molecular‐level chirality‐controlled solid‐state systems, providing not only proof‐of‐concept examples but also new insights into the development of advanced chiral crystalline nanocarbon materials."},{"t":"激活抗病毒防御使冷肿瘤升温","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02181-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"观点评论","b":"Nanoparticle-mediated delivery of a small metal-organic molecule induces an innate viral response in cancer cells and B-"},{"t":"激活 B 细胞免疫反应可消退免疫冷肿瘤","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02170-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"观点评论","b":"Progress in immuno-oncology has been stymied by poorly immunogenic ‘cold’ tumours and the focus on T cells at the cost o"},{"t":"量子计算机上的从头算多费米子结构计算","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/1spg-5ld3","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子多体结构计算","kp":["[算法]: 从头算多费米子结构量子计算","[应用]: 核与粒子物理自束缚体系"],"as":"研究者在量子计算机上实现了从头算多费米子结构计算。现有算法在处理多体核物理和原子结构时存在计算复杂度和精度瓶颈，该工作提出新方法克服这些限制，在量子硬件上直接模拟多费米子体系。这标志着量子计算在核物理与量子化学领域的实用化迈出重要一步，为未来在经典方法无法企及的复杂多体问题求解上奠定基础。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ab initio many-fermion structure calculations on a quantum computer","b":"Author(s): Weijie Du, Yangguang Yang, Zixin Liu, Chao Yang, and James P. VaryTo overcome the limitations of existing algorithms for solving self-bound quantum many-body problems—such as those encountered in nuclear and particle physics—that access only a restricted subset of energy levels and provide limited structural information, we introduce and demonstrate a novel quantu…[Phys. Rev. C 113, L061302] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"AI的挥霍性支出与Crusoe的Stargate困境","d":"2026-06-14","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/the-weekend/ais-blithe-spending-crusoes-stargate-woes","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"the information","as":"文章聚焦于人工智能领域的挥霍性支出问题，并探讨了Crusoe公司面临的Stargate项目困境。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI算力投资","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"AI’s Blithe Spending and Crusoe’s Stargate Woes","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"面向电网互动型混合用途社区的供需协同设计框架","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008937?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"供需协调电网设计","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"A supply–demand coordinated design framework for grid-interactive mixed-use communities"},{"t":"电动汽车普及场景社区级分解的概率预测框架","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74155-0","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"Scientific community and society : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电动汽车负荷预测","dp":1,"as":"本文提出了一种针对电动汽车（EV）充电负荷的概率预测框架，实现社区级负荷分解。随着电动汽车保有量快速增长，其充电行为给电力网络带来显著挑战。该框架通过对邻里层级EV充电负荷进行概率性预测与分解，帮助电网运营商和规划者更准确地评估不确定性影响，从而优化配电容量规划与负荷调度策略。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"A probabilistic forecasting framework for neighbourhood-level disaggregation of electric vehicle adoption scenarios","b":"The rapid growth of electric vehicle (EV) adoption presents significant challenges for electricity networks, particularl"},{"t":"mRNA 疫苗的代谢促进作用","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02628-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"观点评论","b":"Crosslinked ionizable lipids enable mRNA lipid nanoparticles to metabolically reprogram immune cells to elicit strong va"},{"t":"用于复合运动解耦的高拉伸三通道纤维","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73959-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可拉伸纤维传感器","as":"本文提出了一种高拉伸性三通道纤维结构，用于复合运动的解耦感知。纤维电子器件在电子皮肤、人机交互等领域具有广泛应用前景，但多模式运动间的信号串扰是关键难题。该三通道设计通过结构创新实现了对不同运动分量的独立检测与解耦，提升了纤维传感器在复杂变形场景下的信号保真度与运动识别精度。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A highly stretchable tri-channel fiber for composite motion decoupling","b":"Fiber electronics have shown considerable potential in various applications, including electronic skin, human-machine in"},{"t":"具有卓越能量密度和超快响应的可降解低压软驱动器","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec5692?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","as":"本文报道了一种生物可降解、低电压驱动的软驱动器，兼具优异的能量密度与超快响应性能。该驱动器将可降解性、对人体安全刺激的响应能力与高驱动性能三者集成于一体，突破了传统软驱动器在环保性与高性能之间难以兼顾的瓶颈，在可穿戴设备、软体机器人及生物医学等领域具有广阔应用前景。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可降解软驱动器","kp":["材料体系[软致动器]: 微纤化纤维素+PEG网络","驱动特性[软致动器]: 可生物降解低压驱动","性能[致动器]: 高能量密度超快响应"],"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"A biodegradable low-voltage soft actuator with exceptional energy density and ultrafast response","b":"Soft actuators that integrate biodegradability, responsiveness to human-safe stimuli, and high actuation performance are highly desirable for next-generation biomedical devices. However, current systems fail to realize these attributes within a single platform. Here, we propose a microfibrillated cellulose (MFC)–based soft actuator incorporating a poly(ethylene glycol) (PEG) network to suppress crystallinity and ionic liquid (IL) aggregation. This design enhances ionic conductivity, forms abundant ion transport channels, and reduces interfacial resistance. Operated at 1 volt, the actuator achieves a record-high energy density of 64.4 kilojoules per cubic meter and the fastest response time of 1 second among reported ionic electroactive polymers (IEAPs) under the same conditions. Such materials are biocompatible and biodegradable in various physiological environments. Device-level demonstrations show that an actuation-enabled sciatic nerve cuff enables high-fidelity signal transmission in vitro with a signal-to-noise ratio of 40 decibels and stable real-time in vivo neural recording with evoked responses of up to ~150 microvolts, supporting minimally invasive bioelectronic interfacing."},{"t":"单细胞与空间组学基础模型用户指南——细胞类型与谱系应用","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag371/8707689?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"单细胞组学基础模型","as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"A User’s Roadmap to Foundation Models on Single-Cell and Spatial-Omics – Cell Type and Lineage applications"},{"t":"可涂刷仿生分层表皮解决全天候建筑改造中制冷-电力权衡问题","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73697?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"辐射制冷涂层","dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种可涂覆的仿生分层皮肤材料，旨在解决被动日间辐射制冷（PDRC）与光伏发电之间的权衡难题。传统PDRC材料多为白色高反射，无法与太阳能板协同；作者借鉴生物结构设计出分层光学皮肤，上层实现高效红外辐射散热（亚环境温度），下层集成光伏吸收发电，实现制冷-发电双重功能。该策略为建筑一体化、可穿戴电子等场景提供了兼顾热管理与能源收集的新材料路径。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Paintable Bioinspired Stratified Skin Resolving the Cooling‐Electricity Trade‐Off for All‐Weather Building Retrofits","b":"ABSTRACT Passive daytime radiative cooling (PDRC) can mitigate heat stress by dissipating heat into cold outer space, ye"},{"t":"多功能电解液添加剂K3P7用于锂电池同步容量补偿与界面调控","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73676?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池电解液添加剂","kp":["比容量[传统预锂化剂]: 300-1000mAh/g","[添加剂]: K3P7","[功能]: 容量补偿+界面调控"],"as":"本文提出电解液添加剂K₃P₇，用于同时补偿钠离子电池（或锂离子电池）首次充电的不可逆容量损失（ICL）。首次充放电过程中SEI形成消耗大量活性锂/钠，导致能量与功率密度下降。K₃P₇在负极界面分解，可贡献额外容量并稳定SEI层，抑制持续副反应。实验表明，添加K₃P₇后电池首次库仑效率显著提升，循环稳定性改善，为提升电池实际可用容量提供了一种简洁有效的电解液工程策略。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Multifunctional Electrolyte Additive K3P7 for Simultaneous Capacity Compensation and Interphase Regulation in Lithium‐","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The initial irreversible capacity loss (ICL) during the first charge significantly reduces the energy and power densities of lithium‑ion batteries (LIBs). Conventional prelithiation additives suffer from limited theoretical specific capacities (300–1000 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    ), poor air stability, and low conversion efficiency. Herein, K\n                    3\n                    P\n                    7\n                    , which possesses high solubility in ester‐based electrolytes, is introduced as an electrolyte additive to improve the reversible capacities of various commercial LIBs. It provides an exceptional capacity‑compensation effect through the oxidation of P\n                    7\n                    3−\n                    , equivalent to 3048 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . Additionally, K\n                    +\n                    ions intercalate into the graphite interlayer, expanding the interlayer spacing and thereby improving the high‑rate performance of the graphite anode. The additive also promotes the formation of a stable cathode electrolyte interphase (CEI) and a uniform solid electrolyte interface (SEI), contributing to improved cycle stability of both electrodes. Furthermore, K\n                    3\n                    P\n                    7\n                    effectively scavenges free radicals, alleviating gas generation and internal pressure build‑up. When applied in a LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ||graphite full cell, the initial reversible capacity is 8% higher than that of the control sample, and the cell retains 92.9% of its capacity after 200 cycles. This work reveals a facile multi‐functional electrolyte additive that enhances the overall performance of LIBs."},{"t":"增强 cGAS-STING 激活的耐缺氧光敏剂的分子修剪策略","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1516189?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT The development of effective photosensitizers for photo‐immunotherapy is highly desirable yet remains challengi"},{"t":"木质素靶向预氧化策略抑制闭孔坍塌以实现高稳定性木质硬碳","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71179?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电硬碳负极","dp":1,"as":"本文提出一种针对木质素的预氧化策略，旨在抑制硬碳负极闭孔结构在碳化过程中的坍塌，从而提升钠离子电池硬碳负极的储钠性能。木材生物质是硬碳最有前景的前驱体，但其内部木质素在碳化时易导致闭孔结构失稳。作者通过预氧化处理调控木质素的热分解路径，使微孔骨架得以保留并增加缺陷位点，进而提升钠离子的插层与孔隙储钠容量。该工作为低成本生物质硬碳的结构工程提供了新思路。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Lignin‐Targeted Pre‐Oxidation Strategy for Mitigating Closed Pore Collapse Toward High‐Stability Wood‐Based Hard Carbo","b":"ABSTRACT Wood‐based biomass is the most promising precursor of hard carbon anode for sodium‐ion batteries, due to its st...","aip":1},{"t":"通过对映选择性自由基氟烷基化构建S-手性α-氟烷基硫(IV/VI)化合物的通用平台","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3129452?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性含硫氟代化合物","kp":["[催化剂]: 铜催化不对称自由基","[反应]: 氟烷基化硫代酰胺","[产物]: S-立体构型S(IV/VI)"],"as":"该研究提出一种合成S-立体异构中心α-氟烷基高价硫(IV/VI)化合物的通用平台。α-氟烷基取代的高价硫结构单元在含氟药物分子中具有重要地位,但实现其精确对映选择性构建一直缺乏高效方法。平台通过手性控制策略,实现对映纯的亚砜亚胺、砜类等S(IV/VI)中心化合物的模块化合成,为氟药物研发提供了关键结构工具,有望推动农化与医药领域含氟活性分子的创制。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A General Platform for S‐Stereogenic α‐Fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) Compounds via Enantioselective Radical Fluoroalkylation of S","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    α‐Fluoroalkyl‐substituted high‐valent sulfur motifs are important structural elements in fluorinated molecule design and exhibit broad application potential in diverse fields. However, access to\n                    S\n                    ‐stereogenic α‐fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) compounds still relies largely on classical resolution, resulting in limited efficiency and selectivity. We herein report a copper‐catalyzed asymmetric radical C–S cross‐coupling that effectively tames highly reactive α‐fluoroalkyl radicals, enabled by a sequential stereodiscrimination–chirality transfer strategy, providing rapid access to\n                    S\n                    ‐chiral α‐fluoroalkyl sulfilimines. Integrated with downstream transformations, this reaction serves as a general and systematic platform for\n                    S\n                    ‐chiral α‐fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) compounds. The synthetic utility of the method is demonstrated by gram‐scale synthesis and concise access to diverse chiral fluoroalkyl reagents and bioisosteres of sulfur‐containing drugs."},{"t":"DPHV-肝脏模块概括了 AML 浸润和化疗引起的肝毒性并具有转化效用","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7050?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The liver is central to drug metabolism and a critical site of disease progression, making vascularized in vitro liver models essential for disease modeling, drug discovery, and mechanistic research. However, recapitulating dynamic in vivo drug responses while maintaining clinical relevance remains a major challenge for bioartificial liver systems. In acute myeloid leukemia (AML), patients frequently develop leukemic liver infiltration and chemotherapy-induced hepatotoxicity, both of which compromise therapeutic efficacy and prognosis. Human-relevant experimental models that dynamically simulate these processes are urgently needed. Here, we developed a dynamic perfusable human vascularized liver module (DPHV-LM), constructed from in vitro–expanded primary human hepatocytes within a perfusable scaffold. Perfusion of AML patient–derived cells reproduced leukemic infiltration of liver tissue. Using the DPHV-LM for drug screening and validating findings in AML mouse models, we identified ammonium glycyrrhizinate (AMGZ) as an agent that reduces cytarabine-induced hepatotoxicity and suppresses leukemic infiltration without impairing antileukemic efficacy. The hepatoprotective trends observed in the DPHV-LM were qualitatively concordant with findings from an independent retrospective clinical cohort. Collectively, these results demonstrate the transplantational potential of this platform for modeling leukemic liver pathology and for the development of hepatoprotective therapeutic strategies."},{"t":"4-甲酰基-N-甲基吡啶介导的 N 末端半胱氨酸修饰/去除促进一锅法多重肽连接","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3532271?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT The chemical synthesis of proteins with site‐specific modifications remains a fundamental challenge in chemical..."},{"t":"基于二硫键聚合诱导微相分离的3D可打印纳米多孔热固性树脂","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8227484?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米孔聚合物打印","dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种基于二硫键聚合诱导微相分离(PIMS)策略,制备可3D打印的互连纳米多孔热固性聚合物。互连纳米多孔网络在气体分离、催化载体、能源存储等需要快速传质的应用中至关重要,但传统方法难以兼顾多孔结构与加工成型。该策略利用二硫键动态交换特性,在固化过程中原位形成连续纳米孔道,并保持热固性材料的机械强度,实现了纳米多孔结构的复杂构型3D打印,拓展了功能多孔材料的工程化应用空间。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"3D‐Printable Nanoporous Thermosets via Disulfide‐Based Polymerization‐Induced Microphase Separation","b":"ABSTRACT Interconnected nanoporous polymer networks are central to applications that demand rapid mass transport, yet th"},{"t":"$D$-通过高能核碰撞中的顺序强子化产生介子","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/py6l-xdfn","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Zi-Xuan Xu, Wei Dai, Ben-Wei Zhang, Jiaxing Zhao, and Pengfei ZhuangHeavy flavor production serves as an ideal probe of the hadronization mechanism of the quark-gluon plasma created in relativistic heavy ion collisions. We study charm-quark hadronization using Langevin transport in the medium together with a sequential coalescence model. Since ${D}_{s}$ forms earlie…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232301] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"通过同步原位成像和便携式尿液分析进行早期肾损伤诊断的单分子双报告探针","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag367/8707072?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Early detection of acute kidney injury (AKI) is critical for effective intervention and improved survival, yet it remains challenging due to the lack of practical tools that sensitively capture subtle renal dysfunction. Here, we report a unimolecular dual-reporter probe, DHU-AKI-3, featuring activatable crosstalk-free multiplexed signal output for precise diagnosis of early AKI by integrating in situ imaging and in vitro portable urinalysis. Following systemic administration, DHU-AKI-3 is selectively activated in the injured kidney, producing a long-retained photoacoustic signal for real-time in situ imaging ahead of the clinical diagnostic window. Concurrently, a near-infrared fluorescent signal is rapidly released and excreted into urine, enabling smartphone-assisted colorimetric analysis for noninvasive, point-of-care testing. The mutual validation of crosstalk-free in situ and in vitro signals guaranteed the diagnostic accuracy. This study underscores the potential of unimolecular dual-reporter probe for directly visualizing early-stage AKI in urine, meeting the pressing demand for point-of-care testing in AKI management.","tp":"双报告探针","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究者开发单分子双报告探针DHU-AKI-3，集成原位成像与体外便携式尿液分析，实现急性肾损伤（AKI）的早期精准诊断。探针经系统给药后选择性响应肾损伤标志物，具有无串扰多重信号输出特性，解决了缺乏灵敏诊断工具的难题。"},{"t":"转录因子 Tono 介导组蛋白 H3K4 三甲基化，通过转录重编程调节内复制","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9695?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Endoreplication is a cell cycle variant that involves multiple rounds of DNA replication without cell division, resulting in enlarged cells and organs. Here, we combined the\n                    Bombyx\n                    silk gland and\n                    Drosophila\n                    salivary gland to determine the mechanism underlying transcriptional reprogramming during the mitotic-to-endoreplication transition. Transcriptome profiling of the silk gland revealed that genes involved in multiple processes, especially cell cycle control, growth, and morphogenesis, are up-regulated after endoreplication entry. We further found that global levels of histone H3K4 trimethylation (H3K4me3) in the silk gland increase following endoreplication entry; the depletion of the COMPASS H3K4 methyltransferase complex subunit Wds in the silk gland or salivary gland blocks endoreplication; and a subset of up-regulated genes are targeted and transcriptionally reprogrammed by H3K4me3. The transcription factor Tono mediates H3K4me3 deposition at target loci by recruiting the Wds-containing COMPASS complex, thereby promoting endoreplication. These findings reveal an epigenetic mechanism by which Tono orchestrates transcriptional reprogramming through the H3K4me3 modification to regulate endoreplication progression.","tp":"内复制机制","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"内复制是一种无细胞分裂的DNA重复复制变异周期，可导致细胞和器官体积增大。本研究结合家蚕丝腺和果蝇唾液腺模型，深入揭示了细胞从有丝分裂向内复制转变过程中的转录重编程机制。转录组分析表明，转录因子Tano在此过程中起关键介导作用，通过引发组蛋白H3K4三甲基化，成功调控内复制并促进腺体细胞的生长与发育。"},{"t":"时间序列单细胞转录组学揭示斑马鱼睾丸中普遍存在的每日节律和夜间精子发生","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee7124?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The vertebrate testis has long been regarded as lacking strong cellular daily rhythmicity. Here, we use time-series single-cell RNA sequencing to construct a temporal atlas of the adult zebrafish testis. We identify previously unknown cell-type–specific markers and previously unidentified testicular subtypes and reveal that Sertoli cells, spermatogonia, and spermatids exhibit robust oscillations in key circadian clock genes. In contrast, Leydig cells and spermatocytes primarily exhibit rhythmic expression of key functional genes. We show that intercellular communication networks also exhibit daily rhythmicity. Pseudotime trajectory analysis demonstrates a notable nocturnal preference for germ cell progression. Disrupting circadian input via constant light reduced germ cell numbers and impaired fertility. Genetic ablation of\n                    clock1a\n                    arrests spermatogonial differentiation, whereas mutation of the rhythmic spermatocyte gene\n                    hmgb1a\n                    substantially reduces meiotic cells. Together, our findings redefine the testis as a highly rhythmic organ in which a precisely timed, nocturnally coordinated cellular symphony drives spermatogenesis.","tp":"睾丸日节律","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"传统观点认为脊椎动物睾丸缺乏明显的细胞每日节律。本研究利用时间序列单细胞RNA测序技术，构建了成年斑马鱼睾丸的时间图谱。研究发现了未知的细胞类型特异性标记和睾丸亚型，并揭示支持细胞、精原细胞和精细胞在关键昼夜节律基因中表现出强烈的振荡。相比之下，间质细胞和精母细胞主要表现出其他节律特征。该研究为理解脊椎动物睾丸的细胞节律性和精子发生的昼夜调控机制提供了全新视角。"},{"t":"PLK4 抑制剂 RP-1664 通过双重敏感性机制在神经母细胞瘤临床前模型中显示出强大的功效","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74061-5","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"It was recently shown that inhibition of polo-like kinase 4 (PLK4) induces synthetic lethality in cancers with chromosom..."},{"t":"太阳能驱动电动汽车充电站的技术经济优化与运行性能分析：校园案例研究","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008536?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光储充微电网","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Techno-economic optimization and operational performance analysis of a solar-powered EV charging station: A campus case study"},{"t":"生物转化与催化重整路径的系统级集成：从木质纤维素生物质可持续生产生物柴油、氢气和氨","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008433?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物柴油","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"System-level integration of bioconversion and catalytic reforming pathways for sustainable production of biodiesel, hydrogen, and ammonia from lignocellulosic biomass"},{"t":"钛催化硅杂环丁烷C(sp3)–Si键硼氢化与氢化合成功能性氢硅烷","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74224-4","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钛催化硅氢化","kp":["反应类型[硅环丁烷]: Ti催化C(sp3)-Si键硼氢化","产物[催化反应]: 硼基功能化氢硅烷"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究开发了钛催化硅杂环丁烷C(sp3)–Si键的硼氢化和氢化反应，实现功能化氢硅烷的高效合成。分子中同时含硼和硅官能团的设计在材料科学和药物化学中具有重要前景。反应利用钛催化剂对环张力较大的硅杂环丁烷进行区域选择性开环，一步构建B–Si双官能团分子。该方法拓展了有机硅和有机硼化学的合成工具箱，为功能化氢硅烷的模块化制备提供了新途径。","dp":1,"ot":"Synthesis of functionalized hydrosilanes via titanium-catalyzed hydroboration and hydrogenation of C(sp3)–Si bonds in silacyclobutanes","b":"The design and synthesis of molecules featuring both boron and silicon moieties hold significant promise for delivering ..."},{"t":"后修饰MOF-808框架中NHC锚定Cu(I)原子与原位生成Cu纳米粒子的协同作用促进CO2还原C–C偶联","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7002606?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化CO2还原","kp":["催化剂[eCO2RR]: NHC-Cu(I)单原子与Cu纳米颗粒协同","载体[eCO2RR]: 后修饰MOF-808","产物[eCO2RR]: C2H4"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究构建了一种后修饰MOF-808框架电催化剂，将N-杂环卡宾（NHC）锚定的单个Cu(I)原子与原位生成的Cu纳米颗粒协同集成，用于电化学CO2还原生成C2H4。MOF-808框架提供有序的多孔结构和配位微环境，Cu单原子位点促进CO2活化和C–C偶联关键步骤，Cu纳米颗粒则通过协同效应提升多碳产物选择性。该双活性位点策略为CO2电还原制高附加值C2化学品提供了催化剂设计新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Synergistic Interaction Between N‐Heterocyclic Carbene (NHC)‐Anchored Cu(I) Atom and In Situ‐Generated Cu Nanoparticles in a Post‐Modified MOF‐808 Framework Promoting C─C Coupling in CO2 Reduction","b":"ABSTRACT The electrochemical reduction of CO 2 to high‐value chemicals like C 2 H 4 represents a promising route for sus..."},{"t":"无负极锂硫电池中高效有机二硫化物介体实现Li2S氧化还原动力学与负极稳定性的协同双重调控","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73710?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极锂硫介体","kp":["电解质添加剂[无负极Li-S]: 有机二硫化物介体","功能[Li2S]: 双重调控氧化还原动力学与负极稳定性"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究提出一种高效有机二硫化物介体，在无负极锂硫电池中同时调控Li₂S氧化还原动力学和负极稳定性。该介体可促进Li₂S的可逆转化，抑制锂枝晶生长，显著提升库仑效率和循环寿命。无负极设计最大化能量密度，为高比能锂硫电池的工程化提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Synergistic Dual Modulation of Li2S Redox Kinetics and Anode Stability Enabled by a High‐Efficiency Organodisulfide Mediator in Anode‐Free Lithium–Sulfur Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT Lithium sulfide (Li 2 S) is pivotal for high‐energy‐density lithium–sulfur (Li─S) batteries due to its high the..."},{"t":"可见光能量转移催化全氟萘底物控制脱芳环加成：可切换获取[2+2]、[4+2]及非对映收敛环加成产物","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1846299?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可见光催化环加成","kp":["催化模式[全氟萘]: 可见光能量转移催化","选择性[环加成]: 底物控制切换[2+2]或[4+2]"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"首次报道了可见光能量转移催化下全氟萘的底物可控分子间脱芳构化环加成反应。通过切换底物，可分别获得[2+2]、[4+2]及非对映收敛型环加成产物。该方法拓展了多氟芳烃的合成化学空间，为含氟杂环化合物的精准构建提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Substrate‐Controlled Dearomative Cycloadditions of Perfluoronaphthalenes via Visible‐Light Energy Transfer Catalysis: Switchable Access to [2+2], [4+2], and Diastereoconvergent Cycloadducts","b":"ABSTRACT We report the first substrate‐controlled intermolecular dearomative cycloaddition of polyfluoronapthalenes in w..."},{"t":"原位X射线光电子能谱揭示ZSM-5催化剂甲醇制烃转化中积碳的空间演化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7876229?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"ZSM-5催化剂积碳演化","kp":["方法[积碳观测]: 同步辐射原位XPS","变量[ZSM-5]: 不同Si/Al比催化剂"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"利用原位X射线光电子能谱(XPS)揭示了ZSM-5分子筛催化剂在甲醇制烃(MTH)反应中积碳物种的空间演化规律。研究发现积碳从催化剂孔道内部向外表面逐步迁移聚集，揭示了活性位点失活的动态过程，为分子筛催化剂的抗积碳设计和再生策略提供了直接实验证据。","dp":1,"ot":"Spatial Evolution of Coke in ZSM‐5 Catalysts During Methanol‐to‐Hydrocarbons Conversion Revealed by In Situ X‐Ray Photoelectron Spectroscopy","b":"ABSTRACT Along with assessing chemical pathways, understanding the spatial evolution of deactivating coke species in zeo..."},{"t":"集成钠离子储存库、共溶剂和稀释剂功能的单分子添加剂用于低温钠离子电池","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7967447?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池低温电解液","kp":["添加剂设计[低温Na-ion]: 单分子集成离子库/共溶剂/稀释剂"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对钠离子电池低温性能受限问题，设计了一种兼具钠离子储库、共溶剂和稀释剂三重功能的单分子添加剂。该添加剂可优化电解液溶剂化结构和界面SEI膜，显著降低低温下的去溶剂化能垒，提升离子传导率，使钠离子电池在低温环境下保持优异的容量保持率和循环稳定性。","dp":1,"ot":"Single‐Molecule Additive Integrating Na‐Ion Reservoir, Cosolvent, and Diluent Functions for Low‐Temperature Na‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT Na‐ion batteries hold great promise for low‐temperature energy storage, but their performance is severely const...","aip":1},{"t":"用于低光环境可见光与短波红外选择性视觉的自滤波单片有机/PbS量子点光电探测器","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74407-z","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子点光电探测器","kp":["器件结构[光电探测器]: 有机/PbS量子点垂直堆叠自滤光单片","功能[光电探测器]: 可见+短波红外双模态偏压切换"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"开发了自滤波单片有机/PbS量子点光电探测器，通过垂直堆叠光敏层实现偏压控制的波段选择性电荷提取，可同时探测可见光和短波红外。器件在弱光条件下展现高信噪比和选择性视觉能力，适用于安防监控、自动驾驶等低光成像场景，为多波段集成光电探测提供了简化架构。","dp":1,"ot":"Self-filtering monolithic organic/PbS quantum dot photodetector for visible and short-wave infrared selective vision in low-light","b":"Dual-mode photodetectors with vertically stacked photoactive layers enable bias-controlled, band-selective extraction fr..."},{"t":"ResMap：一个社区资源，用于系统地绘制跨环境的治疗持续残留癌细胞依赖性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7476?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Relapse following targeted therapy remains a central challenge in oncogene-driven cancers. Drug-tolerant persister cells that survive initial treatment without genetic resistance seed relapse, yet despite over a decade of research, no persister-directed therapy has reached clinical approval. To bridge this gap, we developed ResMap, a community resource providing both a standardized experimental framework and quantitative dataset for systematic comparison of persister vulnerabilities across cancer contexts. Using this platform, we evaluated 94 compounds targeting 57 literature-derived candidates in two\n                    EGFR\n                    \n                      mut\n                    \n                    and two\n                    KRAS\n                    \n                      G12C\n                    \n                    lung cancer models under normoxic and hypoxic conditions. Initial screening identified 12 targets with conserved anti-persister activity across genotypes and oxygen environments; follow-up validation reproduced 9 of these targets and revealed variable degrees of persister specificity relative to general cytotoxicity. We also identified context-specific vulnerabilities, including KRAS-relevant combination targets, several of which have since been independently reported and/or advanced to clinical testing. Integration of human cancer cell line essentiality data and adult mouse loss-of-function phenotypes provided a complementary tolerability layer to refine prioritization. ResMap establishes a foundation for coordinated community efforts to accelerate rational persister-directed combination strategies toward the clinic.","tp":"癌症依赖性","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"靶向治疗后的复发是致癌基因驱动癌症的核心挑战。能够在无基因抗性的情况下存活初步治疗的药物耐受持久细胞是导致复发的根源。尽管研究超过十年，目前仍无针对持久细胞的疗法获批。为此，研究人员开发了ResMap社区资源，提供标准化实验框架和定量数据集，旨在系统比较不同癌症背景下持久性残留细胞的脆弱性，以加速靶向抗复发策略的临床转化。"},{"t":"调控多金属离子轨道相互作用以增强磷酸锰铁锂正极的动力学与结构稳定性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71180?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷酸锰铁锂正极","kp":["掺杂元素[LMFP正极]: Ni、Cu、Ti多金属离子","材料体系[LMFP]: LiMn₀.₄₇₅Fe₀.₄₇₅Ni₀.₀₃Cu₀.₀₁","[核心策略]: 多金属离子轨道工程解耦J-T畸变"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"通过调控多金属离子间的轨道相互作用，提升磷酸锰铁锂(LMFP)正极材料的动力学性能和结构稳定性。锰的引入虽提高工作电压和能量密度，但Jahn-Teller效应导致结构退化。研究通过多金属协同掺杂优化电子结构，抑制锰溶解和相变，兼顾高能量密度和长循环寿命，推进LMFP在动力电池中的应用。","dp":1,"ot":"Regulating Multi‐Metal Ion Orbital Interactions to Enhance Kinetics and Structural Stability in Lithium Manganese Iron Phosphate Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium manganese iron phosphate (LMFP) offers high safety and high energy density for lithium‐ion batteries, yet its commercialization is bottlenecked by poor conductivity and severe Jahn–Teller (J–T) distortion. Here, we report a multi‐metal ion (Ni, Cu, Ti) orbital engineering strategy to simultaneously decouple these twin challenges in a customized LiMn\n                    0.475\n                    Fe\n                    0.475\n                    Ni\n                    0.03\n                    Cu\n                    0.01\n                    Ti\n                    0.01\n                    PO\n                    4\n                    (LMFP‐NCT) cathode. Mechanistically, enhanced orbital hybridization between heteroatoms and the host lattice optimizes localized electronic distribution and narrows the bandgap, boosting intrinsic conductivity and ionic diffusivity by an order of magnitude. Importantly, the tailored orbital occupation effectively suppresses\n                    \n                      e\n                      g\n                    \n                    orbital degeneracy, transitioning the MnO\n                    6\n                    octahedra into a structurally robust, controlled‐distortion state. Supported by the\n                    d\n                    ‐band center theory, this strategy enhances metal‐oxygen\n                    σ\n                    ‐bonds, leading to minimal volume variation (4.29%) and suppressed Mn dissolution (reduced by 48.4%). Consequently, the LMFP‐NCT delivers doubled capacity at 6C compared with LMFP and an exceptional 92.3% capacity retention after 1000 cycles at 1C. When paired in full cells, it maintains 96.4% of its capacity over 500 cycles. This work provides profound insights for designing high‐performance LMFP cathodes by fundamentally conquering J–T distortion and kinetic limitations."},{"t":"通过准栅极电极调控静电放电实现高性能直流摩擦纳米发电机","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73659?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"直流摩擦纳米发电机","kp":["器件结构[DC-TENG]: 背面准栅极电极增强","设计原理[QGED-TENG]: 模仿耗尽型场效应晶体管"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"提出通过准栅电极调控静电放电，显著提升直流摩擦纳米发电机(DC-TENG)的输出性能。准栅电极优化了摩擦电荷的定向传输和收集效率，解决了传统DC-TENG输出电流低、能量转换效率受限的问题。该策略为机械能采集和自驱动传感器提供了高性能设计方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Regulating Electrostatic Discharge via Quasi‐gate Electrode for High‐Performance Direct‐current Triboelectric Nanogenerators","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Direct‐current triboelectric nanogenerators (DC‐TENGs) are promising for mechanical energy harvesting but are often hindered by incomplete charge collection and parasitic discharge pathways. Herein, inspired by the operating characteristics of depletion‐mode field‐effect transistors, we propose a quasi‐gate‐electrode enhanced DC‐TENG (QGED‐TENG). The QGED‐TENG employs a back‐side quasi‐gate‐electrode (QGE) and porous polytetrafluoroethylene film to modulate electrostatic breakdown and charge leakage, thereby effectively suppressing parasitic discharge. The QGED‐TENG enables direction‐contingent enhancement and depletion modes without external bias, notably delivering a 1.41‐fold output charge increase in enhancement mode compared to the device without the QGE. Furthermore, by leveraging redistributed electric fields and parallel discharge pathways, the multi‐unit architecture achieves a linear charge increase relative to the number of units. Benefiting from the synergistic effects of electrostatic breakdown, charge leakage, and electric field redistribution within the multi‐unit configuration, an optimized rotational QGED‐TENG achieved an ultrahigh average power density of 25 W m\n                    −2\n                    Hz\n                    −1\n                    and an output charge density of 13.65 mC m\n                    −2\n                    at 60 rpm, setting a new benchmark for the porous triboelectric layer of electrostatic breakdown‐based DC‐TENGs. This work provides new physical insights and a general design strategy for maximizing spatial charge utilization and enabling high output performance DC‐TENG."},{"t":"人类皮质解剖学中的区域性别差异在形态基础上有所不同，并与性染色体和性腺影响重叠","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74274-8","c":"未分类","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Humans show reproducible sex differences in regional cortical volume (CV), but it remains unclear how these relate to th...","tp":"脑解剖性别","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"人类大脑皮层特定区域的体积存在可重复的性别差异，但这些差异如何与潜在的形态学基础相关联尚不明确。本研究表明，人类皮层解剖学中的区域性别差异在形态学基础上存在不同，且这些差异与性染色体及性腺的影响区域高度重叠。该发现为理解大脑结构性别差异的生物学机制提供了重要线索。"},{"t":"降低聚阴离子基团中P-O键共价性以提高钠正极本征电子导电性","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74282-8","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Physical sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚阴离子钠正极材料","kp":["策略[聚阴离子钠正极]: 降低P-O键共价性增强电子导电"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"提出降低聚阴离子基团中P-O键共价性以提升钠离子电池正极本征电子导电性的策略。传统聚阴离子正极(XO₄四面体)虽具结构稳定性但电子导电率低。研究表明减弱P-O共价性可缩小带隙、促进电子离域，在保持热稳定性的同时大幅提升电子传输能力，为高功率钠离子正极材料的理性设计提供了理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Reducing P-O bond covalency in polyanionic groups to increase the intrinsic electronic conductivity in sodium positive electrodes","b":"Polyanionic positive electrodes with XO4 (X = P, S, Si etc.) tetrahedra exhibit beneficial properties, making them cruci..."},{"t":"带PNCNP钳形配体的d² Mo(IV)烷基亚基片段对炔烃的反应性：配位与催化炔烃复分解","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4887237?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钼炔烃复分解催化","kp":["催化剂突破[炔烃复分解]: d² Mo(IV)烷基亚基(首例非d⁰体系)"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"报道了基于PNCNP钳形配体的d²构型Mo(IV)烷叉基配合物对炔烃的配位与催化炔烃复分解反应。不同于传统的d⁰高氧化态Schrock型催化剂，该低氧化态钼体系为炔烃复分解催化提供了新型活性中心，拓展了催化剂设计空间，对发展更温和、高活性的炔烃复分解催化体系具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Reactivity of a d2 Mo(IV) Alkylidyne Fragment Bearing a PNCNP Pincer Ligand Toward Alkynes: Coordination and Catalytic Alkyne Metathesis","b":"ABSTRACT Currently, almost all alkyne metathesis catalysts are based on high valent d 0 Schrock‐type alkylidyne complexe..."},{"t":"通过单向末端π延伸与优化烷基支链位点进行合理不对称受体工程，抑制非辐射能量损失实现20.7%二元光伏效率","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73646?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池受体","kp":["策略[OSC受体]: 单向末端π扩展+烷基支化优化","关键参数[二元OSC]: 低非辐射损失ΔE3+增强激子扩散LD"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"通过不对称受体分子工程——单向末端π扩展结合优化烷基支链位点——抑制非辐射能量损失，实现二元有机太阳能电池20.7%的光电转换效率。该策略精细调控分子堆积和能级排列，降低ΔE₃非辐射复合损耗并优化形貌，为小分子受体的高效设计提供了系统性分子工程框架。","dp":1,"ot":"Rational Asymmetric Acceptor Engineering via Unidirectional Terminal π‐Extension and Optimizing Alkyl Branching Sites Affords a Binary Photovoltaic Efficiency of 20.7% by Suppressed Nonradiative Energy Loss","b":"ABSTRACT Ingenious molecular engineering of small‐molecule acceptors (SMAs) with low nonradiative energy loss (Δ E 3 ) a..."},{"t":"金属有机框架孔道内负电荷密度的精准调控实现高效碱金属离子传输","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7827578?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF离子传导膜","kp":["MOF设计[碱金属离子]: 精确可调负电荷密度纳米通道"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过在金属有机框架(MOF)孔道内精确调控负电荷密度，实现碱金属离子的高效选择性传输。研究建立了通道电荷密度与离子传输速率、选择性的定量关系，为设计高性能离子传导膜材料提供了分子层面设计准则，在固态电池电解质和水处理离子分离领域具有应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Precise Regulation of Intrachannel Negative Charge Density in Metal‐Organic Frameworks for Efficient Alkali‐Ion Transport","b":"ABSTRACT Charged nanochannels are critical for efficient cation transport in metal‐organic frameworks (MOFs); however, t..."},{"t":"苝二酰亚胺衍生的双（大环）配体通过直接湾区钯化提供手性多核 Pd(II) 配合物","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8176990?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT Macrocyclic ligands provide powerful access to structurally defined multi‐metallic architectures, yet direct π‐..."},{"t":"Pd单原子掺杂Cu3Co量子点优化加氢动力学用于多功能铝-硝酸盐一次电池同步能量收集与废料资源化","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8420715?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/一次电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铝硝酸盐电池","kp":["催化剂[铝-硝酸盐电池]: Pd单原子掺杂Cu3Co量子点","功能[硝酸盐电池]: 同步发电与污染物降解"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"设计了Pd单原子掺杂的Cu₃Co量子点催化剂，优化硝酸盐还原的加氢动力学，构建铝-硝酸盐一次电池体系，实现同步能量收集与废物增值（污染物降解）。单原子Pd提供高活性加氢位点，Cu₃Co量子点促进硝酸盐吸附还原，兼具发电和环境修复功能，为耦合能源转换与废水处理提供了创新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Pd Single‐Atom‐Doped Cu3Co Quantum Dots With Optimized Hydrogenation Kinetics for Versatile Aluminum‐Nitrate Primary Battery With Synchronous Energy Harvesting and Waste Valorization","b":"ABSTRACT The rational design of nitrate batteries enabling simultaneous electricity generation and pollutant degradation...","aip":1},{"t":"PMDS-UNet：高分辨率遥感影像中分布式光伏精准分割新方法","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008834?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏图像分割","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"PMDS-UNet: A novel approach for precise segmentation of distributed photovoltaics in high-resolution remote sensing imagery"},{"t":"PAR3介导的肝发育和再生过程中肝细胞增殖、成熟和结构的协调","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-73856-w","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The liver’s ability to coordinate cell proliferation, polarization, and maturation with architectural assembly is fundam..."},{"t":"催产素通过增强前边缘皮质中生长抑素中间神经元介导的局部 GABA 能抑制来减弱恐惧学习","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef8400?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Acute stress exposure can trigger post–traumatic stress disorder (PTSD). Prophylactic interventions may enhance psychological resilience against PTSD in high-risk occupations. Here, we demonstrate that pretreating with intranasal oxytocin exerts prolonged yet reversible attenuation of fear learning via oxytocin receptors (OxtRs) expressed in prelimbic cortex (PL). Crucially, both local PL oxytocin infusion and selective activation of PL OxtR+ neurons recapitulate this fear reduction. Although OxtRs are expressed on pyramidal and somatostatin (SST) neurons, SST interneurons exhibit higher\n                    Oxtr\n                    expression. Both fear conditioning and oxytocin application preferentially excite PL OxtR+ SST interneurons. Accordingly, preactivating OxtR+ SST neurons, but not OxtR+ pyramidal neurons, elicits the reduction effect on fear learning. Ablating\n                    Oxtr\n                    in γ-aminobutyric acid (GABA) neurons or silencing SST interneurons abolishes oxytocin’s fear-attenuating effects. Mechanistically, OxtR+ SST interneuron activation or oxytocin application potentiates GABAergic synaptic transmission onto PL pyramidal neurons. Collectively, these findings establish that oxytocin attenuates fear learning by enhancing local inhibitory circuits in PL, revealing a potential therapeutic approach for reducing PTSD risk.","tp":"催产素恐惧","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"急性应激暴露可能引发创伤后应激障碍(PTSD)。本研究发现，预防性鼻内催产素预处理能够通过前边缘皮质(PL)中表达的催产素受体，对恐惧学习产生长期但可逆的减弱作用。局部催产素输注和选择性激活PL催产素受体阳性神经元同样能重现这种恐惧减少效应。研究表明催产素通过增强前边缘皮质中生长抑素中间神经元介导的局部GABA能抑制来发挥作用，为高风险职业人群预防PTSD提供了潜在干预手段。"},{"t":"考虑潮汐扰动效应的离网多部门区域综合能源系统优化与收益分配：基于改进ADMM算法与合作博弈的方法","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008287?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离网综合能源系统","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Optimization and revenue allocation of off-grid multi-sector regional integrated energy systems considering tidal disturbance effects: An approach based on an improved ADMM algorithm and cooperative games"},{"t":"硝酸盐-唾液酸蛋白2轴将内质网线粒体钙信号传导与脂肪酸代谢结合起来，驱动白色脂肪褐变","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74256-w","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"White adipose browning is a promising route to restore energy balance; however, how inorganic anion signals engage intra..."},{"t":"缓解质子交换膜燃料电池阴极催化层界面传质限制的纳米陷阱结构","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73702?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池催化层","kp":["电极结构[PEMFC阴极]: 碳基纳米陷阱功能化吡咯-N","[界面优化]: 重组Pt-碳-离聚物界面增强局部氧供给"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对质子交换膜燃料电池（PEMFC）厚阴极催化层中气体传输受限的问题，提出了一种纳米陷阱（Nanotrap）结构设计。该结构在催化层内部构建丰富的三相界面（TPB），优化气体传质路径，有效缓解界面传输瓶颈。研究通过调控孔隙与亲疏水性分布，在保持高催化剂利用率的同时显著提升厚电极的传质效率，为高功率密度燃料电池的电极工程化设计提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Nanotrap Architectures for Mitigating Interfacial Transport Limitations in Cathode Catalyst Layers of Proton Exchange Membrane Fuel Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient gas transport and abundant triple‐phase boundaries (TPBs) are vital for thick cathode catalyst layers (CCLs) in proton exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs), yet remain challenging to realize. In this work, we introduce a carbon‐based nanotrap architecture functionalized with pyrrolic‐N groups, which reorganizes the Pt–carbon–ionomer interface to enhance local oxygen supply. These nanotraps simultaneously confine Pt nanoparticles and ionomer, forming continuous pathways for oxygen, protons, and electrons, thereby significantly increasing active TPB density. The underlying enhancement mechanism is validated by x‐ray tomography and 3D two‐phase flow simulations. Using a 15.5 µm‐thick CCL, the optimized electrode achieves peak power densities of 1940 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in H\n                    2\n                    /O\n                    2\n                    and 1410 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in H\n                    2\n                    /Air—improvements of ∼30% and ∼80%, respectively. Moreover, it exhibits a good stability, with a voltage decay rate of only 43.8 µV h\n                    −1\n                    at 1.5 A cm\n                    −2\n                    over 1000 h. This nanotrap concept offers a versatile interfacial design strategy for advanced gas‐diffusion electrodes in energy conversion technologies."},{"t":"考虑动态分区与多方利益协调的双时间尺度电压-无功控制多智能体强化学习方法","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008147?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多智能体电压控制","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Multi-agent reinforcement learning method for dual-timescale volt-var control considering dynamic partitioning and multi-stakeholder coordination"},{"t":"机器学习优化的单原子催化剂实现微环境自适应化学动力学-生物正交癌症治疗","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73689?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chemodynamic therapy (CDT), which harnesses endogenous chemical energy within the tumor microenvironment (TME), has shown high potential for precise cancer treatment. However, its efficacy is often limited by the mildly acidic and reductive nature of the TME that compromises catalyst stability and activity. Developing catalysts capable of maintaining robust performance under such physiological constraints remains a key challenge. Herein, we report a programmable dual‐catalytic platform that integrates machine learning‐guided design with atomic‐level precision. Through predictive modeling, we establish quantitative structure‐performance relationships that guided the rational synthesis of iron single‐atoms (Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs). The Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs demonstrate exceptional chemodynamic reactivity and environmental stability within the complex TME, efficiently converting endogenous hydrogen peroxide into hydroxyl radicals for precise tumor ablation. Moreover, Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs exhibit potent bioorthogonal catalytic activity, enabling in situ prodrug activation and localized synthesis of doxorubicin under physiological conditions. This synergistic CDT‐bioorthogonal dual‐catalytic mechanism achieves tumor‐selective, stimulus‐free, and combinatorial therapy, markedly enhancing overall antitumor efficacy. This study establishes a machine learning‐guided framework for single‐atom catalyst design and expands the frontiers of metal catalysis in biomedical applications.","tp":"单原子催化","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"针对肿瘤微环境弱酸性和还原性限制化学动力学治疗（CDT）效果的难题，研究者利用机器学习优化设计单原子催化剂，实现微环境自适应的化学动力学-生物正交联合癌症治疗，在生理约束下保持催化稳定性与活性。"},{"t":"铁劫持特洛伊木马纳米平台通过免疫纤维化重塑对抗植入相关的生物膜感染","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73711?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT Implant‐associated biofilm infections persist due to a vicious cycle of biofilm resilience and fibrosis‐driven ...","tp":"铁劫持纳米","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"针对植入物相关生物膜感染中生物膜韧性与纤维化驱动的恶性循环，研究者开发铁劫持特洛伊木马纳米平台，通过重塑免疫纤维化微环境来对抗顽固性生物膜感染。"},{"t":"界面电子调制重向阳极自由基化学，实现电氧化木质素解聚中C─C键选择性断裂","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1876863?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"木质素电氧化解聚","kp":["转化率[木质素解聚]: 88%","[催化剂]: CuO/Cu0.92Co2.08O4异质结构","[机制]: 界面电子调制引导选择性C-C键断裂","[产物]: 苯甲醛和苯酚"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"通过界面电子调制策略重新调控阳极自由基化学，实现电氧化木质素解聚中C─C键的选择性断裂。传统电氧化方法面临C─C键与C─O键断裂选择性差的问题，本研究通过调控催化剂表面电子结构，引导自由基路径转向靶向C─C键裂解，提升了芳香族平台化学品的产率与选择性。该工作为可再生木质素的高值化利用提供了电化学新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Interfacial Electronic Modulation Redirects Anodic Radical Chemistry for Selective C─C Bond Cleavage in Electro‐Oxidative Lignin Depolymerization","b":"ABSTRACT Electro‐oxidative lignin depolymerization is considered a promising route to renewable aromatics; however, its ...","aip":1},{"t":"将有机反荷离子引入聚(庚嗪酰亚胺)网络以促进光催化H2O2生成中的质子耦合电子转移","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202524638?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化质子耦合","kp":["[掺杂离子]: MA+/FA+/TMA+有机反离子","嵌入量[PHI网络]: 最大1阳离子/重复单元","[机制]: 促进质子耦合电子转移","[应用]: 光催化H2O2生产"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"将有机反离子（甲基铵MA⁺、甲脒FA⁺、四甲基铵TMA⁺）引入聚庚嗪亚胺（PHI）网络，促进光催化H₂O₂演化中的质子耦合电子转移（PCET）过程。研究发现不同尺寸和性质的有机阳离子可调控聚合物的电子结构与质子传输通道，显著提升光生载流子的分离效率和两电子氧还原选择性。该策略为无金属光催化合成H₂O₂提供了分子层面的设计指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Incorporation of Organic Counter‐Cations Into Poly(Heptazine Imide) Networks for Promoting Proton‐Coupled Electron Transfer During Photocatalytic H2O2 Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT Nitrogen based onium ions such as methylammonium (MA + ), formamidinium (FA + ), and tetramethylammonium (TMA +..."},{"t":"原位同步SERS-SEIRAS揭示氧还原反应中阳离子调控的界面水与中间体","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8900381?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧还原反应机理","kp":["[表征技术]: 同步SERS-SEIRAS原位联用","[研究对象]: 碱性ORR界面水与吸附中间体","[发现]: 阳离子调控界面水动力学"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"利用原位同步SERS-SEIRAS联用光谱技术，揭示了碱性氧还原反应（ORR）中阳离子调控界面水和反应中间体的机制。研究发现不同阳离子通过非共价相互作用重构界面水氢键网络，影响ORR关键中间体（*OOH、*O）的吸附能与反应路径。该工作首次在分子水平上直接观测了阳离子效应对电催化界面微环境的调控，为理性设计高效ORR催化剂提供了机理依据。","dp":1,"ot":"In Situ Synchronized SERS‐SEIRAS Unveils Cation‐Regulated Interfacial Water and Intermediates in the Oxygen Reduction Reaction","b":"ABSTRACT Interfacial water plays a crucial yet poorly understood role in the alkaline oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) by..."},{"t":"高熵诱导晶格畸变激活双钴位点协同效应以促进光(电)催化析氢","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73708?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电催化产氢","kp":["晶格畸变[高熵尖晶石]: δavg=3.35%","[活性位点]: Co_tet²⁺/Co_oct³⁺双钴协同","材料[光催化HER]: (CuCoNi)(GaCoCrMnFe)₂O₄"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"利用高熵工程诱导晶格畸变，激活双钴位点的协同效应，显著提升光（电）催化析氢反应性能。研究设计了一种尖晶石型高熵氧化物，高熵效应引入的晶格应变调控了相邻双Co中心的电子结构，打破活性-稳定性权衡。晶格畸变优化了氢吸附自由能，使材料在宽pH范围内表现出优异的HER活性和长期稳定性，为太阳能分解水制氢提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"High‐Entropy‐Induced Lattice Distortion Activates Dual‐Cobalt Site Synergy for Boosted Photo(Electro)Catalytic Hydrogen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy engineering breaks the activity–stability trade‐off in solar water splitting. We design a spinel oxide (CuCoNi)(GaCoCrMnFe)\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    with lattice distortion (\n                    \n                      δ\n                      avg\n                    \n                    = 3.35%) and stabilized Co\n                    tet\n                    2+\n                    /Co\n                    oct\n                    3+\n                    dual sites. The cocktail effect goes beyond elemental averaging: Cu/Ga harvest light; Co enables dual‐site surface catalysis; Ni/Cr induce distortion and local built‐in fields; Cu/Mn trigger Jahn–Teller upshifting the d‐band center; Fe/Mn balance distortion; multivalent species provide a broad redox window. The material achieves a photocatalytic HER rate of 16.62 µmol∙h\n                    −1\n                    ∙g\n                    −1\n                    —16.3× that of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    and 10.8× that of CuGa\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , alongside &lt;5% decay over 30 h. In photoelectrochemical tests, it delivers 2.03 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0 V\n                    RHE\n                    in neutral electrolyte (21.6× and 67.7× the benchmarks) and 7.08 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    under alkaline conditions with 48% IPCE and 0.56% HC‐STH. Distortion‐induced dipoles (0.87 D) extend carrier lifetime to 6.95 ns; Co\n                    tet\n                    2+\n                    dissociates water (\n                    \n                      E\n                      a\n                    \n                    = 0.187 eV) while Co\n                    oct\n                    3+\n                    reduces protons (\n                    \n                      ΔG\n                      *H\n                    \n                    = 0.288 eV); configurational entropy (2.71\n                    R\n                    ) stabilizes the structure. This “entropy–structure–function” strategy offers a generalizable route to durable, high‐performance solar fuel catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"首次测量风味变化中性电流衰变中随时间变化的 $CP$ 违规 ${B}^{0}→{K}_{S}^{0}{μ}^{+}{μ}^{−}$","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/nnt3-nyds","c":"未分类","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Author(s): R. Aaij et al. (LHCb Collaboration)The decay of a b quark to a strange quark and a pair of leptons reveals the first indications of time-dependent CP violation.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231904] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","tp":"介子CP违","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"LHCb合作组首次测量了味觉变化中性电流衰变中与时间相关的CP破坏现象。研究观察了b夸克衰变为奇异夸克和一对轻子的过程，揭示了依赖于时间的CP违规的首批迹象。这一发现发表在《物理评论快报》上，为粒子物理学标准模型中物质与反物质行为差异的理解提供了重要实验数据。"},{"t":"新兴国家和发展中国家不确定性下的金融包容性以及获得清洁烹饪燃料和技术的机会","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003824?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"清洁烹饪能","as":""},{"t":"扩展环内共轭与N,N-双齿螯合缓解有机镁电池正极的容量–稳定性权衡","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5222656?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机镁电池正极","kp":["[设计策略]: 扩展内环共轭+多齿Mg2+配位","[材料]: 六氮杂三亚苯基(HATN)基","[目标体系]: 可充镁电池正极"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过扩展内环共轭和N,N-双齿螯合策略，缓解有机镁电池正极材料中容量-稳定性的权衡问题。传统有机正极面临循环稳定性差和容量衰减的挑战，本研究设计了具有增强共轭体系和螯合稳定结构的有机分子，有效抑制了充放电过程中的溶解和结构重组。该策略实现了高可逆容量与长循环寿命的统一，为后锂电池体系中的可充镁电池正极设计提供了分子工程思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Extended Endocyclic Conjugation and N,N‐Bidentate Chelation Alleviate the Capacity–Stability Trade‐Off in Organic Magnesium Battery Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT Rechargeable Mg batteries represent an appealing post‐lithium energy‐storage technology, yet their advancement ...","aip":1},{"t":"非苯环芳烃中的激发态反芳香性：检查小驱动力的分子内质子转移动力学","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6799620?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The relief of excited‐state antiaromaticity (ESAA) is a powerful driving force that underpins the photochemical behavior of photoexcited aromatic molecules. Photo‐induced isomerization, cycloaddition, or proton transfer pathways alleviate the large energetic destabilization caused by ESAA. However, the excited‐state dynamics of annulenes displaying only weak ESAA remain largely unexplored. Here, we fine‐tune the electronic character of a series of annulenes to minimize their ESAA. Excited‐state proton transfer (ESPT) converts hydroxytropyliums (HTs) and hydroxybenzotropyliums (HBTs) to their nonaromatic tautomers, which are only slightly lower in energy than the excited‐state antiaromatic forms. As a result of this near‐degeneracy, we find that HBTs exhibit weak photoacidity (pKa drop of 0.3–1.2 units) and unusually slow, reversible ESPT, proceeding on the ns timescale rather than the typical ps timescale. The fluorescence spectra of these HBTs display the hallmarks of ESPT emitters: (i) dual fluorescence; (ii) excitation‐dependent emission; and (iii) large Stokes shifts. The driving force for this ESPT is increased by the addition of electron‐donating groups, which promote intramolecular charge transfer. Our results demonstrate that judicious structural changes can moderate the ESAA of nonbenzenoid annulenes, minimizing the driving force for ESPT, which leads to slow proton transfer kinetics and weak photoacidity.","tp":"激发态芳香","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究探讨了激发态反芳香性（ESAA）在光化学行为中的驱动作用。缓解激发态反芳香性引起的不稳定通常主导光致异构化或质子转移等反应路径。然而，目前学术界对于仅表现出微弱激发态反芳香性的轮烯分子反应动力学研究尚不充分。研究人员通过精细调控一系列轮烯分子的电子特性来最大程度地减弱该驱动力，借此深入检查在小驱动力条件下分子内质子转移的动力学机制，为光化学与光物理基础研究提供了新见解。"},{"t":"Pam3CSK4 作为多糖疫苗跨物种佐剂在人源化小鼠和非人灵长类动物模型中的功效","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74194-7","c":"不相关","a":"Biological sciences : Nature Communications subject feeds","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Polysaccharide-based vaccines are essential for preventing bacterial infections, but their effectiveness is limited by w..."},{"t":"双猝灭电荷转移实现氧化还原活性伊红Y聚合物中创纪录的光催化硝酸盐转氨","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73686?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化硝酸盐制氨","kp":["光催化剂[硝酸盐制氨]: 伊红Y聚合物","[机制]: 双猝灭电荷转移提升分离效率"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"利用含氧化还原活性的伊红Y（Eosin Y）聚合物，通过双猝灭电荷转移机制实现创纪录的光催化硝酸盐还原制氨效率。研究设计了分子内双重电子转移通道，同时猝灭光生空穴和电子的无效复合，大幅提升载流子利用率。该聚合物光催化剂在NO₃RR中实现了高选择性和高法拉第效率的氨合成，为氮污染治理与绿色氨生产耦合提供了高效光催化平台。","dp":1,"ot":"Dual‐Quenching Charge Transfer Unlocks Record Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Photocatalytic Conversion in Redox‐Active Eosin Y Polymers","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient photocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    RR) is vital for mitigating nitrogen pollution and producing green ammonia (NH\n                    3\n                    ). Although organic polymer photocatalysts show great potential for NO\n                    3\n                    RR, they frequently suffer from low charge separation efficiency. This limitation largely comes from the lack of suitable redox‐active moieties incorporated in the polymer photocatalysts toward NO\n                    3\n                    RR. Herein, we embed the redox‐active Eosin Y (EY) into a conjugated polymer backbone to synthesize a series of EY–X polymers (where X = benzene, biphenyl, or fluorene), in which the extended π‐conjugation can promote dual dynamic and static quenching for directional electron transfer. Upon visible‐light excitation, EY forms a long‐lived radical anion (EY\n                    •−\n                    ) that stores and relays electrons to nitrate, while ground‐state complexation between polymer and nitrate preorganizes the substrate for photoinduced directional electron transfer. This dual‐pathway mechanism extends charge‐separated lifetimes, inhibits recombination, and enhances electron delivery. Consequently, under cocatalyst‐free conditions, the EY–BE polymer achieves a record high NH\n                    3\n                    production of 215 µmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    . Experimental and computational investigations support the reversible EY/EY\n                    •−\n                    cycle and the nitrate‐binding ground‐state complex as the origin of activity and selectivity. This work demonstrates a rational strategy leveraging reversible redox‐active chromophores to integrate dual quenching for designing high‐performance NO\n                    3\n                    RR photocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"2-吲哚基醇的脱芳[3,3]-Claisen重排：合成3,3-二取代二氢吲哚及相关吲哚生物碱的高效通用方法","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7232106?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"吲哚去芳构重排","kp":["[反应]: 2-吲哚醇去芳构化[3,3]-Claisen重排","[产物]: 3,3-二取代吲哚啉","[底物拓展]: 突破两类底物限制实现通用化"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了一种2-吲哚醇的去芳构化[3,3]-Claisen重排反应，为高效合成3,3-二取代吲哚啉及相关吲哚生物碱提供了通用方案。该方法利用吲哚环的去芳构化活化策略，在温和条件下实现区域和立体选择性的碳碳键构建。研究展示了该方法在天然产物全合成中的应用潜力，为吲哚类生物碱的多样性导向合成和药物化学研究提供了有力的工具反应。","dp":1,"ot":"Dearomative [3,3]‐Claisen Rearrangement of 2‐Indolyl Alcohols: An Efficient and General Protocol for Synthesizing 3,3‐Disubstituted Indolines and Related Indole Alkaloids","b":"ABSTRACT Dearomative reactions of indoles have long been a focal point of research in organic synthesis due to their abi..."},{"t":"能源与环境政策在碳减排中的成本效益协同：来自中国钢铁行业的证据","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003551?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/黑色金属/钢铁","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"钢铁碳减排","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"限域调控晶相工程实现结构化半导体纤维系统用于植物蒸腾动力学监测","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73693?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半导体纤维传感器","kp":["[材料工程]: 限域调控晶体相工程","[应用]: 植物蒸腾监测半导体纤维纺织品"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过限域调控的晶相工程，构建了结构化半导体纤维系统用于植物蒸腾动态监测。研究利用纤维内部空间限域效应精确控制半导体纳米材料的晶相生长，赋予纤维优异的光电传感性能。该柔性纤维传感器可实时、连续地监测植物蒸腾速率的细微变化，克服了传统传感器在空间分辨率和生物相容性方面的局限，为精准农业和植物生理研究提供了新型可穿戴传感平台。","dp":1,"ot":"Confinement‐Regulated Crystal Phase Engineering Enables Structured Semiconductor Fiber Systems for Plant Transpiration Dynamics Monitoring","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Transpiration is fundamental to plant life, yet its rhythms remain difficult to resolve because conventional sensing approaches perturb stomatal boundary layers, are limited to localized readouts, and struggle to reconcile moisture responsiveness with stable photodetection under dynamic humidity fluctuations. Herein, we report the first distributed plant microclimate mapping textile platform constructed from semiconductor fibers enabled by two distinct confinement‐regulated crystal phase engineering strategies. Local spatially confined thermal reconfiguration induces optimized crystallization of the semiconductor fiber core, whereas nanosphere confinement governs humidity‐triggered, reversible phase switching in the perovskite fiber cladding between CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    and CsPb\n                    2\n                    Br\n                    5\n                    , enabling stable photodetection together with reversible humidity response. Continuous thermal drawing and polymer coating establish a scalable route to kilometre‐scale fiber fabrication, yielding fibers with sophisticated structure that sustain linear photodetection with an on/off ratio exceeding 50 over 10 000 switching cycles while maintaining fatigue‐free humidity sensing over 600 cycles. Woven into breathable textiles, the fiber arrays enable sub‐centimetre spatial mapping and, in commercial greenhouses, resolve spatial irradiance variations as small as 10 mW/cm\n                    2\n                    within real microclimates, revealing microclimate heterogeneity relevant to plant transpiration and growth. These results establish phase‐engineered semiconductor fiber textiles as a scalable platform for distributed plant microclimate mapping and precision agriculture."},{"t":"基于质子阱辅助S/O异构化驱动阳离子开环聚合的CO2衍生可降解聚硫酯粘合剂","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8723325?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2基降解聚酯胶","kp":["[聚合方法]: 质子陷阱辅助S/O异构化阳离子开环","[原料]: CO2衍生单体","[产物]: 可降解聚硫酯压敏胶"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"利用质子陷阱辅助的S/O异构化驱动的阳离子开环聚合策略，以CO₂为碳源合成可降解聚硫酯压敏胶。研究设计了含硫杂环单体，通过CO₂插入和可控阳离子聚合构建高分子量聚硫酯网络。该材料兼具优异的粘附性能和温和条件下的可控降解能力，实现了CO₂高值化利用与可持续胶粘剂开发的耦合，为电子废弃物回收和循环经济中的胶粘剂设计提供了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"CO2‐Derived Degradable Polythioester Adhesives From Proton‐Trap‐Assisted S/O Isomerization‐Driven Cationic Ring‐Opening Polymerization","b":"ABSTRACT The development of degradable pressure‐sensitive adhesives (PSAs) holds great promise for enabling the recyclin..."},{"t":"基于聚电解质构象的仿生纳米流体忆阻器用于突触学习与存内逻辑计算","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73598?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米流体忆阻器","kp":["器件类型[忆阻器]: 聚电解质构象纳流体忆阻器","工作机制[类突触]: 电场驱动聚电解质构象变化","平台[神经形态计算]: 单一水相离子平台"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"基于聚电解质构象变化开发了仿生纳米流体记忆电阻器（Memristor），用于突触学习与存内逻辑计算。该器件利用聚电解质在纳米通道内的构象转变实现离子输运的可编程调控，模拟生物突触的可塑性特征。研究展示了该纳米流体器件在脉冲时间依赖可塑性（STDP）和布尔逻辑运算中的功能，为类脑计算和存内计算提供了一种生物相容性好、能耗低的新型器件范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Bioinspired Nanofluidic Memristors Based on Polyelectrolyte Conformation for Synaptic Learning and in‐Memory Logic Computing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Bioinspired neuromorphic and in‐memory computing requires devices that store and process information through ionic dynamics analogous to biological synapses. Here, we report a polyelectrolyte conformational nanofluidic memristor (PCM) that integrates synaptic plasticity, neuromorphic learning, and stateful ionic logic within a single aqueous platform. The device operates through electric‐field‐driven, reversible conformational transitions of polyelectrolytes confined inside graphene oxide nanochannels, enabling analog conductance tuning, a sharp, tunable switching threshold, and an ON/OFF ratio exceeding 160. These conformational dynamics endow the PCM with rich synaptic functions, including long‐term potentiation and depression, multilevel memory retention, and symmetric weight update rules. By directly mapping the experimentally measured potentiation/depression curves into a physical learning model, we demonstrate high‐accuracy neuromorphic learning, achieving 97.1% recognition accuracy on the Modified National Institute of Standards and Technology (MNIST) handwritten‐digit dataset. Beyond learning, interconnected PCM units perform stateful ionic OR, IMP, and NAND operations, establishing universal in‐memory logic within the same ionic platform. This work introduces a bioinspired nanofluidic computing paradigm that unites the adaptive learning of neural networks and deterministic logic, paving the way to scalable and brain‐like ionic processors."},{"t":"超越氟化：化学配位信息驱动的机器学习指导高压电解液设计黄金准则","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1244287?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高压电解质","kp":["[设计方法]: 化学配位信息驱动机器学习","[传统局限]: 仅依赖氟含量调整"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"提出一种超越传统氟化策略的高压电解液设计黄金准则，基于化学配位信息驱动的机器学习方法。研究构建了涵盖溶剂-盐-添加剂配位化学的分子描述符数据集，通过ML模型预测电解液氧化稳定性和界面膜（CEI）形成能力。结果表明化学配位信息比简单的氟化程度更能准确预测高压性能，为下一代高能量密度锂电池电解液的理性设计提供了数据驱动的设计框架。","dp":1,"ot":"Beyond Fluorination: A Golden Criterion Guided by Chemical Coordination‐Informed Machine Learning for High‐Voltage Electrolyte Design","b":"ABSTRACT Fluorine chemistry has garnered attention for extending operating voltage limits of electrolytes through robust..."},{"t":"B细胞αv整合素调节病毒感染后肺生发中心和记忆B细胞的组织特化和克隆扩张","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb7633?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Lung-resident B cells are increasingly recognized as key contributors to protective immunity against respiratory viruses, yet the mechanisms that govern their generation and specialization remain poorly understood. Here, we identify B cell–intrinsic αv integrin as a critical negative regulator of germinal center (GC) dynamics and memory B cell formation in the lung following influenza A virus infection. Using B cell–specific αv knockout mice, we show that loss of B cell αv integrin leads to persistent GC activity within the inducible bronchus-associated lymphoid tissue and expansion of lung-resident memory B cells, including IgA\n                    +\n                    and cross-reactive B cells capable of recognizing heterologous influenza variants. Single-cell transcriptomic and B cell receptor sequence analyses reveal that αv restricts clonal expansion and antigenic diversification of GC and memory B cells in the lung, but not in draining lymph nodes, indicating a spatially restricted mechanism of mucosal B cell regulation. These findings position αv integrin as a key checkpoint that constrains local mucosal B cell evolution and suggest previously unexplored strategies to improve mucosal vaccine efficacy by enhancing GC activity directly in the lung."},{"t":"仿章鱼凝胶电解质通过构建差异化溶剂化环境调控锂硫电池阳离子迁移","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71197?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫凝胶电解质","kp":["电解质策略[锂硫电池]: 章鱼仿生凝胶电解质","调控机制[阳离子迁移]: 构建差异化溶剂化环境","关键问题[Li-S电池]: 多硫化锂穿梭"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"受章鱼触手多级结构启发，研究团队设计了一种新型凝胶电解质用于锂硫电池。锂硫电池面临的核心难题是多硫化锂（LiPSs）穿梭效应导致容量快速衰减。该凝胶电解质通过构建差异化溶剂化环境，精准调控阳离子迁移行为，有效抑制穿梭效应。这种仿生策略实现了对锂离子溶剂化壳层的定向调控，显著提升了锂硫电池的循环稳定性和库伦效率，为高能量密度储能器件的界面工程提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"An Octopus‐Inspired Gel Electrolyte Regulates Cation Migration in Lithium–Sulfur Batteries via Constructing Differentiated Solvation Environments","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) shuttling is a major cause of performance degradation in lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries. Recent studies indicate that LiPSs readily bind with free Li\n                    +\n                    to form cationic species that migrate together with Li\n                    +\n                    . Conventional strategies that ignore solvation environment regulation for selective cation separation often hinder Li\n                    +\n                    dissociation and transport. In this study, guided by quantum calculations and inspired by octopus morphology, acetylated polysorbate (Ac‐CP80) was synthesized via photoinitiated radical polymerization using reactive amphiphilic monomers. Structural characterization confirmed that the material forms a multi‐armed, biomimetic structure with multiple adsorption sites, enabling in‐situ formation of a gel electrolyte (Ac‐CP80@PP). Through an integrated approach combining in situ and 2D Raman spectroscopy, X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS), charge‐discharge cycling, post‐electrode analysis, concentration‐dependent Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    6\n                    simulation experiments, and molecular dynamics simulations, it is systematically revealed that Ac‐CP80 creates a differentiated solvation environment: hyperbranched PEO side chains like tentacles capture LiPSs and guide them into the weakly solvating cross‐linked network, suppressing LiPSs shuttling; terminal esters enhance local solvation to promote Li\n                    +\n                    dissociation and transport. With Ac‐CP80@PP, Li–S batteries achieve capacity of 781.6 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.5 C and retain stability over 600 cycles with only 0.06% decay per cycle, exhibiting excellent cycling stability."},{"t":"碱浸取：提升固体氧化物燃料电池空气电极反应性的简便表面活化策略 (Adv. Mater. 33/2026)","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73511?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固体氧化物燃料电池电极","kp":["催化剂[SOFC空气电极]: 钙钛矿氧化物","[活化方法]: 碱浸选择性去除表面惰性物种"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出了一种简便的碱浸取表面活化策略，用于提升固体氧化物燃料电池（SOFC）钙钛矿氧化物空气电极的反应活性。该封面文章展示的活化方法可选择性溶出表面元素，重构电极表面形貌与化学组成，暴露更多催化活性位点并优化氧还原反应动力学。该策略操作简单、成本低，为改善中高温燃料电池电极性能提供了通用性表面工程手段，有望推动SOFC在分布式能源领域的商业化应用。","dp":1,"ot":"Alkaline Leaching: A Facile Surface Activation Strategy to Improve the Reactivity of Air Electrodes for Solid Oxide Fuel Cells (Adv. Mater. 33/2026)","b":"Surface Activation Strategy for Perovskite Oxide Air Electrodes The cover illustration highlights a surface activation s..."},{"t":"多功能电解液添加剂K3P7用于锂离子电池同步容量补偿与界面调控","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73676?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池电解液添加剂","kp":["添加剂[锂离子电池]: K₃P₇","功能[电解液添加剂]: 同时补偿容量与调控界面","比容量[预锂化添加剂]: 常规300-1000 mAh/g(对比基准)"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种多功能电解液添加剂K3P7，可同步实现锂离子电池的容量补偿和界面调控。首次充电过程中的不可逆容量损失（ICL）是制约锂电池能量效率和功率性能的关键因素。K3P7在充放电过程中通过特定反应机制释放活性离子补偿容量损失，同时在电极表面构筑稳定的固体电解质界面膜（SEI），有效抑制副反应和电解液持续分解。该双功能添加剂策略为提升商用锂电池首效和循环寿命提供了实用方案。","dp":1,"ot":"A Multifunctional Electrolyte Additive K3P7 for Simultaneous Capacity Compensation and Interphase Regulation in Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The initial irreversible capacity loss (ICL) during the first charge significantly reduces the energy and power densities of lithium‑ion batteries (LIBs). Conventional prelithiation additives suffer from limited theoretical specific capacities (300–1000 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    ), poor air stability, and low conversion efficiency. Herein, K\n                    3\n                    P\n                    7\n                    , which possesses high solubility in ester‐based electrolytes, is introduced as an electrolyte additive to improve the reversible capacities of various commercial LIBs. It provides an exceptional capacity‑compensation effect through the oxidation of P\n                    7\n                    3−\n                    , equivalent to 3048 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . Additionally, K\n                    +\n                    ions intercalate into the graphite interlayer, expanding the interlayer spacing and thereby improving the high‑rate performance of the graphite anode. The additive also promotes the formation of a stable cathode electrolyte interphase (CEI) and a uniform solid electrolyte interface (SEI), contributing to improved cycle stability of both electrodes. Furthermore, K\n                    3\n                    P\n                    7\n                    effectively scavenges free radicals, alleviating gas generation and internal pressure build‑up. When applied in a LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ||graphite full cell, the initial reversible capacity is 8% higher than that of the control sample, and the cell retains 92.9% of its capacity after 200 cycles. This work reveals a facile multi‐functional electrolyte additive that enhances the overall performance of LIBs."},{"t":"木质素靶向预氧化策略抑制闭孔坍塌，实现高稳定性木质硬碳钠离子电池负极","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71179?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硬碳负极","kp":["[策略]: 木质素靶向预氧化抑制闭孔坍塌","前驱体[硬碳]: 木质基生物质","应用[硬碳负极]: 钠离子电池"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对钠离子电池硬碳负极中木材基生物质前驱体闭孔结构易塌陷的难题，研究提出了一种木质素靶向预氧化策略。木材基生物质因低成本和可持续性被视为硬碳负极最有前景的前驱体，但在碳化过程中木质素组分会导致闭孔结构坍塌，降低储钠容量。该预氧化方法选择性改性木质素，稳定碳骨架微结构，维持闭孔的钠离子扩散通道，从而显著提升硬碳负极的循环稳定性和可逆容量，推动了生物质储能材料的实用化。","dp":1,"ot":"A Lignin‐Targeted Pre‐Oxidation Strategy for Mitigating Closed Pore Collapse Toward High‐Stability Wood‐Based Hard Carbon Anodes for Na‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT Wood‐based biomass is the most promising precursor of hard carbon anode for sodium‐ion batteries, due to its st..."},{"t":"通过亚磺酰胺对映选择性自由基氟烷基化构建S-手性α-氟烷基S(IV/VI)化合物的通用平台","d":"2026-06-14","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3129452?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性氟烷基硫化","kp":["催化剂[不对称氟烷基化]: 铜催化对映选择性自由基","产物类型[含硫手性]: S-立体异构α-氟烷基S(IV/VI)化合物","底物[氟烷基化]: 硫代亚胺"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种通用平台，通过对亚磺酰胺的对映选择性自由基氟烷基化反应，高效构建S-手性α-氟烷基硫(IV/VI)化合物。α-氟烷基取代的高价硫结构单元在含氟药物和农药分子设计中具有重要价值，但其对映选择性合成一直缺乏通用方法。该策略利用自由基化学的高反应活性与手性催化剂的立体控制相结合，实现了多种含氟高价硫化合物的高对映选择性合成，为含氟医药中间体的构建提供了高效工具。","dp":1,"ot":"A General Platform for S‐Stereogenic α‐Fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) Compounds via Enantioselective Radical Fluoroalkylation of Sulfenamides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    α‐Fluoroalkyl‐substituted high‐valent sulfur motifs are important structural elements in fluorinated molecule design and exhibit broad application potential in diverse fields. However, access to\n                    S\n                    ‐stereogenic α‐fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) compounds still relies largely on classical resolution, resulting in limited efficiency and selectivity. We herein report a copper‐catalyzed asymmetric radical C–S cross‐coupling that effectively tames highly reactive α‐fluoroalkyl radicals, enabled by a sequential stereodiscrimination–chirality transfer strategy, providing rapid access to\n                    S\n                    ‐chiral α‐fluoroalkyl sulfilimines. Integrated with downstream transformations, this reaction serves as a general and systematic platform for\n                    S\n                    ‐chiral α‐fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) compounds. The synthetic utility of the method is demonstrated by gram‐scale synthesis and concise access to diverse chiral fluoroalkyl reagents and bioisosteres of sulfur‐containing drugs."},{"t":"4-甲酰基-N-甲基吡啶介导的 N 末端半胱氨酸修饰/去除促进一锅法多重肽连接","d":"2026-06-14","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3532271?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT The chemical synthesis of proteins with site‐specific modifications remains a fundamental challenge in chemical...","tp":"蛋白质合成","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对位点特异性修饰蛋白质化学合成的挑战，研究者开发4-甲酰基-N-甲基吡啶介导的N末端半胱氨酸修饰与去除策略，实现一锅法多重肽连接，显著简化蛋白质合成流程并提升合成效率。"},{"t":"高盛总裁沃尔德伦：SpaceX 创纪录 IPO 表明投资者愿为 AI、太空基建买单","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/714.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"IT之家","tg":"资本运作","b":"6 月 12 日消息，北京时间今晚，SpaceX 正式开盘交易，上市首日高开 29% 跻身全球第 6 大上市公司，并以募资 750 亿美元（现汇率约合 5090.72 亿元人民币）的成绩创下全球最大 IPO 纪录，马斯克也成功成为\n人类史上首位万亿美元富豪\n而在数小时前，高盛集团总裁约翰 · 沃尔德伦在接受彭博社采访时表示，SpaceX 创纪录的 IPO 表明，投资者正积极为 AI 基础设施建设提供资金。“不论美国还是全球的资本市场，都在展现出为\nAI 基础设施建设和太空领域建设\n沃尔德伦乐观估计，今天会是“美妙的一天”。高盛牵头负责 SpaceX IPO，摩根士丹利、美国银行、花旗集团和摩根大通共同参与承销，另有 18 家银行在本次发行中承担不同角色。\n沃尔德伦表示，SpaceX IPO 还预示着一波\n规模相当大的 IPO 浪潮\n即将启动，“我们对此感到兴奋”。\n投资者和投行也在为 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 的大型上市做准备，两家公司都有可能在今年完成上市。被问到市场能否承接另外两宗大型公开发行时，沃尔德伦表示，\n高盛并不担心整体市场环境\nIPO 市场之外，沃尔德伦认为，2026 年很可能成为\n。彭博汇编数据显示，全球并购交易规模已达到 3.1 万亿美元（IT之家注：现汇率约合 21.04 万亿元人民币），较上年同期增长 35.2%。","tp":"SpaceX上市","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":10.0},"as":"SpaceX上市首日高开29%跻身全球第六大上市公司，募资750亿美元创全球最大IPO纪录，马斯克成史上首位万亿富豪。高盛总裁沃尔德伦表示此举表明资本市场愿为AI基础设施和太空建设买单，并预示大规模IPO浪潮即将启动，Anthropic和OpenAI或年内上市。"},{"t":"马斯克 IPO 敲钟前讲话：原以为 SpaceX 成功概率不到 10%","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/711.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"北京时间 6 月 12 日，SpaceX 在周五正式登陆纳斯达克，CEO 埃隆 · 马斯克 (Elon Musk) 在敲钟仪式前对员工表示，他最初以为 SpaceX 成功的概率不到 10%。\n马斯克周五并未前往纽约，而是留在了 SpaceX 得州总部进行了远程敲钟。在敲钟仪式前，他先向员工发表了一段讲话。\n“很难相信，这家最初在埃尔塞贡多一个仓库里起步的小公司，如今竟要以史上最大 IPO 的规模上市，”他对聚集在办公室的员工说，“如果当年有人告诉我会发生这种事，我一定会说：你肯定是嗑了什么很厉害的药。我当时觉得 SpaceX 能成功的可能性连 10% 都不到。”\n“我们希望，无论谁想去月球、火星，或太阳系中的任何地方，甚至未来某一天去到太阳系以外，我们都能带你过去。不只是少数宇航员，我是说你，真的就是你，无论是谁正在看我讲话，SpaceX 都希望把你送上月球、火星，最终甚至更远的地方。”他表示。"},{"t":"金刚光伏正式摘帽，撤销退市风险警示","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024321.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","b":"金刚光伏股份有限公司近日发布公告，宣布公司股票将于 2026年6月11日停牌一天 2026年6月12日复牌 撤销退市风险警示及其他风险警示 股票简称由“*ST金刚”变更为“金刚光伏”，证券代码保持不变，仍为","tp":"光伏企业摘帽","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":0,"i":2.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"as":"金刚光伏股份公告撤销退市风险警示，股票简称由*ST金刚变更为金刚光伏，2026年6月11日停牌一天、12日复牌，反映公司财务状况改善、经营风险解除。"},{"t":"苹果 Siri AI 仅限较新设备：iPhone 15 Pro 起步、Mac 需 Apple Silicon 芯片，端侧 AI 模型门槛更高","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/722.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"端侧AI部署","kp":["最低设备[Siri AI]: iPhone 15 Pro起","最低芯片[iPad]: M1或更新"],"as":"苹果在WWDC 26发布新一代Siri AI功能，但仅限较新设备使用：iPhone需15 Pro及以上，Mac需Apple Silicon芯片。端侧AI模型对硬件算力提出更高门槛，意味着苹果正将AI能力深度绑定至自研芯片，旧设备用户将无法体验新Siri功能。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":2.5,"d":4.0,"t":9.0},"b":"6 月 12 日消息，苹果于 6 月 9 日在 WWDC 26 上正式发布了新一代操作系统 iOS 27、\nOS 27、macOS 27 Golden Gate、watchOS 27 以及 visionOS 27。\n作为本次系统更新的核心亮点，深度集成 Apple Intelligence 的全新 Siri AI 迎来了重大升级。然而，根据苹果官方公布的兼容性信息，这款经过人工智能重构的语音助手将仅限较新的设备使用。\n阵营，iOS 27 操作系统本身可向下兼容至 iPhone 11 及更新机型，但 Siri AI 的完整功能仅面向 iPhone 15 Pro、iPhone 15 Pro Max 以及\n及所有后续机型开放。这意味着 iPhone 15 标准版及更早的 Plus 机型将无法体验这一 AI 功能。\niPad 方面，Siri AI 最低要求配备 M1 或更新芯片的 iPad 型号，以及搭载 A17 Pro 芯片的\nMac 产品线方面，macOS 27 已全面停止对 Intel 芯片 Mac 的支持，仅限搭载 M1 芯片及更新版本 Apple silicon 的 Mac 机型才能运行新系统并支持 Siri AI 功能。\nApple Watch 的兼容性则相对严格，watchOS 27 支持 Apple Watch Series 9 或更新机型、Apple Watch Ultra 2 或更新型号以及 SE 3，但这些手表所搭载的 Siri AI 功能仍需与一部兼容 iOS 27 AI 功能的 iPhone 配合使用。\nApple Vision Pro 方面，所有型号均支持 Siri AI。IT之家此前已对本次 WWDC 大会进行了全程报道。\n值得注意的是，即便在已支持 Siri AI 的设备范围内，部分高阶功能仍存在更高的硬件门槛。苹果推出了一个性能最强的端侧 AI 模型，用于实现用户对 Siri 语音语速、情感表达与语调的个性化调节，该功能仅限\niPhone 17 Pro Max\n，配备 M4 芯片且统一内存至少 12GB 的 iPad，配备 M3 芯片且统一内存至少 12GB 的 Mac，以及搭载 M5 芯片的 Apple Vision Pro。\n标准版仅配备 8GB 统一内存，无法满足这一高阶模型的最低运行要求，因而被排除在外。\n这也意味着，苹果为新一代 Siri AI 设置了至少三个层级的功能准入门槛：基础操作系统兼容、基础 Siri AI 功能支持、以及最高阶设备端 AI 模型支持。\n8GB 内存限制，苹果 iPhone 17 无法使用高端 Siri 语音与听写功能\n需 12GB 内存：苹果称部分 iOS 27 高级本地 AI 功能仅限 iPhone Air 等机型\n苹果 WWDC26 主题演讲一文汇总：iOS 27 等新系统发布、Siri AI 登场，库克迎来生涯“最后一舞”\n苹果 WWDC26 全球开发者大会专题"},{"t":"英伟达未发布的 RTX 2080 Ti SUPER 显卡首次曝光：拥有 4608 个 CUDA 核心与 12GB 显存，规格直逼 Titan RTX","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/718.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","tp":"图灵GPU规格","kp":["CUDA核心[2080Ti SUPER工程样]: 4608个","显存[2080Ti SUPER工程样]: 12GB GDDR6","位宽[2080Ti SUPER工程样]: 384-bit"],"as":"VideoCardz发现，一款英伟达从未发布过的图灵旗舰显卡——GeForce RTX 2080 Ti SUPER工程样品在eBay现身。该原型卡搭载完整TU102核心，配备4608个CUDA核心与12GB显存，规格直逼Titan RTT，系英伟达内部研发但最终未推向市场的产品。","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"b":"6 月 12 日消息，VideoCardz 今日发现，一款英伟达从未发布过的图灵旗舰显卡 ——GeForce RTX 2080 Ti SUPER（工程样品）在 eBay 上现身。\n根据 eBay 商品页面描述，这张原型卡搭载了完整的 TU102 图灵 GPU 核心，CUDA 核心数量达到 4608 个，相比零售版 RTX 2080 Ti（4352 个）有了显著提升。\n显存方面，该卡配备 12GB GDDR6 显存，位宽为完整的 384-bit，而零售版 RTX 2080 Ti 的显存配置为 11GB 和 352-bit 位宽。\n从规格来看，RTX 2080 Ti SUPER 实际上更接近于同代旗舰 Titan RTX，后者同样拥有 4608 个流处理器和 384-bit 位宽，但显存容量达到了 24GB。\neBay 商品页面描述称，这款原型卡在英伟达内部曾被誉为“Titan 杀手”，意在填补 GeForce RTX 2080 Ti 与 Titan RTX 之间的市场空白。\n从外观来看，这张原型卡的设计与当时所有 RTX 20 系列显卡都不同。它配备了一块光泽质感的前面板和全黑色的背板，且外壳上标注的型号为“RTX 2080 SUPER”。\n据 ebay 卖家分析，这可能是因为该卡的开发时间晚于非 Ti 版本的 Super 型号，因而沿用了相应的散热模组。值得一提的是，该卡拥有一个正规的产品序列号，已接近最终的零售规格。\n值得注意的是，由于这张显卡从未发布，现有的\n系统及常规 NVIDIA 显卡驱动程序并不能直接识别它。\n卖家表示，安装使用这张显卡时，需要在 Windows 10 中开启“测试模式”，并将该卡的硬件 ID 手动编辑添加至驱动程序的 INF 文件之中，方可绕过数字签名验证使其得以正常安装运行。\n至于这款 RTX 2080 Ti SUPER 最终为何被英伟达取消，业界分析普遍指向其性能与市场定位问题。2019 年 7 月，英伟达 PC 业务高级副总裁杰夫 · 费舍尔当时直接回应称，公司没有计划推出 RTX 2080 Ti SUPER。\nVideoCardz 也指出，一旦这款解锁了完整 TU102 核心的“Super”显卡上市，其性能将极为接近当时售价高达 2500 美元（IT之家注：现汇率约合 16969 元人民币）的 Titan RTX，但又只能以远低于 Titan 的价格销售。这无疑会在英伟达自家产品线内部制造出不必要的竞争，从而影响利润更高的旗舰产品的销量。因此，英伟达最终放弃了该显卡的发布计划，仅生产了极少数量的工程样品用于内部测试或评估。"},{"t":"能模拟 Switch 游戏的 Retroid Pocket 6 掌机回归：12GB 内存，但存储砍到 128GB","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/719.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 12 日消息，Retroid 今年 3 月曾因内存成本暴涨，临时下架 Pocket 6 的 12GB RAM 版本。而在今晚，该公司在 Discord 上宣布，Pocket 6 将\n再次提供 12GB RAM 版本\n从原本的 12GB/256GB 改为 12GB/128GB\n。好在 Pocket 6 仍配备 microSD 卡槽，和市面上多数掌机一样可以扩展存储。\n12GB/128GB 版 Retroid Pocket 6 只提供左摇杆上置布局（左模拟摇杆位于十字键上方）。配色方面，Retroid 提供黑色、银色和 16-bit 三种选择。\n12GB/128GB 版 Pocket 6 售价为 279 美元（IT之家注：现汇率约合 1894 元人民币），和最初 12GB/256GB 版本\n对于想重温任天堂或索尼经典游戏的玩家而言，Retroid Pocket 6 是踏入复古掌机领域的绝佳选择 —— 其模拟器最高可\n流畅运行任天堂 Switch 与 PS2 平台的游戏\n这款掌机搭载高通骁龙 8 Gen 2 芯片，是 Retroid 品牌旗下的“最强掌机”，主要面向模拟器、轻量级原生\n采用与 G2 相同的 5.5 英寸 AMOLED 面板\n，分辨率为 1920*1080，支持 120Hz 高刷，机身尺寸为 210.4*86.6*17.2mm，相比上一代机型在屏幕下方增设了快捷按键，保留 3.5mm 耳机孔、microSD 卡槽，方便玩家扩展存储空间。"},{"t":"消息称 SK 海力士赴美上市选择纳斯达克而非纽约证券交易所：科技属性更浓","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/727.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"IT之家","tg":"资本运作","b":"6 月 12 日消息，据路透社 12 日（今天）援引两名知情人士消息称，SK 海力士计划赴美上市，并\n。SK 海力士希望借助纳斯达克\n，吸引看好 AI 概念股的投资者。\n美国上市最早可能在 8 月进行。今年以来，SK 海力士股价已上涨 230%，并在 5 月带动市值\n。赴美上市预计将帮助 SK 海力士扩大投资者基础，也提升全球资本市场对 SK 海力士的关注度。\n知情人士称，SK 海力士最终选择了纳斯达克，\n据悉，存储芯片股今年表现显著强于大盘，美光股价上涨约 248%，纳斯达克综合指数同期上涨约 11%。同时，纳斯达克也是 SpaceX 选择的上市地。\n分析师认为，纳斯达克长期以来通常给予科技公司和成长型公司更高估值。SK 海力士选择纳斯达克，可能也\n参考了同行美光的估值表现\nMeritz Securities 高级分析师金善宇表示：“被动型投资基金目前在全球资金流中的占比已经超过主动型基金，而被动资金中又有相当一部分集中流向纳斯达克上市股票。因此，对于希望扩大投资者基础的科技公司来说，纳斯达克尤其有吸引力。”\nIT之家注：被动型基金主要跟踪股票指数，而不是主动挑选个股。不少科技类指数和 ETF 都大幅配置纳斯达克上市公司。\nSK 海力士 3 月透露，\n已经以保密方式提交美国上市申请\n。一名消息人士当时称，此次发行最高可能融资 140 亿美元。\n一名消息人士表示，美国证券交易委员会可能会在 6 月 22 日当周批准 SK 海力士的美国存托凭证上市。然而，SK 海力士尚未公开披露计划上市规模，也未披露拟发行股票数量。\n市值跨越万亿美元大关后，消息称 SK 海力士最快 8 月赴美上市","tp":"SK海力士上市","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"as":"SK海力士计划赴美上市选择纳斯达克而非纽交所，看重科技属性和被动型指数资金吸引力。今年以来股价涨230%，美光涨约248%，存储芯片板块受AI需求拉动表现显著强于大盘。"},{"t":"江苏南通市分布式光伏接入电网可开放容量公布","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024323.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"江苏南通市发改委发布分布式光伏接入电网可开放容量的通知,依据国家能源局《发电开发建设管理办法》(国能发新能规〔2025〕7号)及江苏省相关落实文件,公布各区域电网可接纳的分布式光伏装机容量上限。此举旨在规范分布式光伏并网管理,避免因局部电网承载能力不足导致消纳困难。可开放容量的透明公示有助于开发商与用户合理规划光伏项目选址与建设节奏,促进新能源有序发展。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"光伏并网容量","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"b":"日前，南通市发改委关于公布南通市\n接入电网可开放容量的通知。\n接入电网可开放容量的通知\n根据《国家能源局关于印发<\n发电开发建设管理办法>的通知》（国能发新能规〔2025〕7号）、《江苏省发展改革委江苏能源监管办关于贯彻落实<\n开发建设管理办法>的实施意见》（苏发改规发〔2025〕2号）和《省发展改革委关于高质量做好全省\n接网消纳的通知》（苏发改能源发〔2024〕906号）等文件要求，市发展改革委组织国网南通供电公司动态测算全市电网承载能力，全面评估全市\n可开放容量，现将评估结果（数据截止到2026年第2季度）向社会公开。\n投资主体可通过供电营业厅或电话咨询等方式，查询全市各地区电网可开放容量。南通供电公司咨询电话：0513-85928592。\n附件：1.南通市供电公司110、35千伏公用变压器电源可开放容量信息（2026年第2季度）\n2.南通市供电公司10（20）千伏公用配电线路电源可开放容量信息（2026年第2季度）\n3.南通市供电公司10（20）千伏公用配变电源可开放容量信息（2026年第2季度）"},{"t":"有史以来最大更新：苹果发布 Core Image RAW 9 处理管线，提升 RAW 图像质量","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/729.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"IT之家","tg":"技术突破","b":"6 月 12 日消息，苹果在\n上发布了 Core Image RAW 9 处理管线及其 API。\nIT之家获悉，这是自 2017 年 RAW 8 发布以来，Core Image RAW 的首次重大版本更新。苹果工程师将其称之为“\n官方表示，来自任何相机的 RAW 照片在被显示或编辑之前，都需要进行“特殊处理”。初期的 RAW 数据解析（parsing）和去马赛克（demosaicing）过程，是所有 RAW 处理软件不可或缺的核心环节。所有这些 RAW 图像传感器数据都必须经过软件的解释，才能被查看或进一步处理。\n现在，去马赛克和降噪过程现在会在一个\n新的 CoreML 模型\n（CoreML model）中同步进行，官方公布了 RAW 8 与 RAW 9 在处理佳能 5D Mark III 等相机拍摄的 RAW 文件区别，RAW 8 较好地还原了场景中的实际色彩，但 RAW 9 的输出效果明显更好。\n目前苹果已支持多达 784 款相机的 RAW 文件（包含主流相机与\n），针对富士特有的 X-Trans CMOS 传感器，RAW 9 还解决了旧算法中常见的伪色和细节丢失问题。\n该 API 版本能够大幅提升 App 的图像质量、增强锐度和色彩表现，同时利用苹果神经网络引擎来实现最优性能\n。此外借助 CIRAWFilter API，让用户能够通过更改曝光、降噪、锐度和对比度等参数来编辑 RAW 照片；通过全新的 CIImageProcessor API，通过对图块大小和缓冲区管理的精细控制进一步优化性能。\n苹果 WWDC26 全球开发者大会专题","tp":"RAW图像AI处理","sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":10.0},"aip":1,"as":"苹果发布Core Image RAW 9处理管线，系2017年RAW 8以来首次重大更新。去马赛克与降噪整合至CoreML模型同步处理，支持784款相机RAW文件，显著提升图像质量并解决富士X-Trans传感器伪色和细节丢失问题。"},{"t":"曾毓群：很多人想进入电池行业，第一件事就是到宁德时代挖人、或者偷一点技术","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/715.htm","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"IT之家","as":"宁德时代董事长曾毓群接受采访时指出,中国光伏产业技术全球领先却不赚钱,根源在于知识产权保护不足导致恶性竞争。新技术一旦问世,很快被竞争对手复制(copy),研发投入难以获得合理回报。他同时透露,许多试图进入电池行业的企业第一件事就是从宁德时代挖人或窃取技术,折射出新能源领域知识产权侵权与人才争夺的乱象。曾毓群呼吁加强知识产权保护,以维护行业创新秩序与公平竞争环境。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"锂电池产业竞争","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":7.0},"b":"6 月 12 日消息，据财经报道，宁德时代董事长曾毓群在接受采访时表示，中国的光伏产业、光伏技术还是世界最好，那世界最好的技术为什么不赚钱呢？\n就是因为知识产权没保护，恶性竞争\n。新的技术出来了，瞬间卖给另外一家，另外一家瞬间把它 copy 完。跟你同样的东西，他研发投入少但是低价卖。\n对于“价格战”，曾毓群称\n，其他人一直在打价格战，\n产品性能不到宁德时代的百分之六七十，价格比宁德时代低百分之十几、二十\n很多人想进入电池行业，第一件事情就是找到宁德时代挖人，或者偷一点技术\n，然后再到设备厂商，再到材料厂商，人家有什么配方，然后合在一起说我有钱投，就进去了。\n人家去模仿你，模仿的水平可能百分之六七十，但是他就用低价来竞争。\n低价为什么可行？因为很多人是浮躁的。只顾眼前利益，没有长远打算\n。比如说采购，我完成的是今年的 KPI（关键绩效指标），电池质量验证的时间又很长。你刚买的车他看不出来，\n车开了三五年之后，才发现电池能量衰减了\n。但是采购的人说这个已经不关我事了，三五年之后我可能不在这里了，我先把今年的业绩拿了再说。为什么现在锂电行业没有这个恶果产生？\n是因为宁德时代在撑着这个价钱，只要我们把价钱低下来，它比光伏还惨\n宁德时代 2026 年一季度报告\n显示，宁德时代一季度营业收入 1291.31 亿元，同比增长 52.45%；归母净利润 207.38 亿元，同比增长 48.52%；扣非净利润 180.93 亿元，同比增长 52.95%。"},{"t":"新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260612_1894705.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","as":"据中国汽车工业协会数据，2025年5月我国新能源汽车新车销量占比已达56.9%，较2024年全年40.9%大幅跃升，渗透率突破50%意味着新能源正式超越燃油车成为市场主流。文章从政策引导、产业链成熟、充电基础设施扩张、消费者认知转变等维度分析渗透率节节攀升的深层原因，指出国产电池技术降本、车企产品矩阵丰富以及智能化体验升级共同驱动了这一历史性拐点，中国正引领全球汽车产业电动化转型。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"新能源车渗透率","kp":["渗透率[新能源车2026.5]: 56.9%"],"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"cl":"55169e17","cln":"新能源车渗透率","cp":1,"b":"新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升\n中国汽车工业协会6月10日发布的数据显示，5月份，我国新能源汽车新车销量占汽车新车总销量的比例提升至56.9%。从2024年的40.9%，到2025年的50.8%，再到今年5月份的56.9%，新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升？\n中汽协副秘书长陈士华说，受政策调整、市场结构变化等因素影响，5月燃油车国内销量出现下滑，新能源汽车则凭借成本优化、技术迭代和消费者消费观念转变等方面的优势，走出独立增长曲线。\n安徽芜湖奇瑞智造一工厂焊装车间内，机械臂正在生产线上工作。（受访者供图）\n数据显示，5月份，我国新能源汽车产销分别完成155.4万辆和149.6万辆，同比分别增长22.4%和14.4%。\n重庆市民王先生最近把燃油车换成了电动车，他给记者算了一笔账，原来开燃油车每月通勤油费超过1200元，换成新能源车后电费不到200元，仅这一项一年便能省1.2万元。而近期高位震荡的国际油价，进一步凸显新能源汽车的出行成本优势。\n除了出行成本优势，新能源汽车的智能化体验日渐成为市场的关键变量。广州市海珠区新滘中路鸿蒙智行用户中心内，顾客陈先生坐进汽车座舱，尝试操作语音车控、车载大屏与智能辅助系统，爱不释手，连声夸赞。\n记者走进深蓝汽车重庆汽博中心店时，店长高磊正忙着接待客户。这个店5月份共销售220多辆新能源车，环比增长超10%。“消费者的关注点已从动力参数转向智能化体验，深蓝S07搭载华为乾崑智驾，在同级别市场中性价比优势明显。”高磊说。\n智能座舱体验全面跃升，成为吸引消费者的重要砝码。随着国产AI大模型加速“上车”，汽车交互正告别过去机械执行单一指令的模式，迈向更人性化、更高效的新阶段，车辆逐步具备“情感感知”能力。在一些车辆上，通过传感器与视觉识别技术，可实时监测驾驶员情绪状态，自动调节氛围灯、香氛，带来更好的体验。\n6月9日，消费者在深圳深业上城的蔚来中心内了解新能源汽车相关性能。（任紫辉摄）\n产业生态日益成熟，新能源汽车整车成本优势逐步显现。安徽省汽车经销商商会会长蒋天赐说，电池原材料价格回归理性，叠加一体化压铸、电池底盘一体化等新工艺规模应用，整车制造成本持续降低，新能源车正在实现对燃油车的平价甚至更优。\n与此同时，价格相对较低款式的新能源汽车，配置越来越智能，“智驾平权”也让新能源汽车受到更多消费者喜爱。记者了解到，目前，比亚迪、零跑等车企已将高阶辅助驾驶车型价格下探至10万元以内，部分入门级车型降至8万元左右。\n新能源汽车受青睐的另一个关键因素，是充电网络等配套基础设施覆盖面越来越广，“里程焦虑”正逐步得到化解。\n“村里2023年就装了充电桩，充电方便快捷。”在安徽省安庆市岳西县菖蒲镇菖蒲村，村民王国宏驾驶新能源车往返县城上班，无后顾之忧，这得益于国网岳西县供电公司提前预留电网容量、推进充电桩进村等系列举措，打通了补能“最后一公里”。\n国家能源局数据显示，截至2026年4月底，我国电动汽车充电基础设施总数达2195.5万个。从城市核心区到偏远乡村，“充电像加油一样方便”正逐渐成为现实。\n各地促进汽车消费的政策也在持续发力。重庆市从5月1日起实施2026年汽车购新补贴政策，个人消费者购买乘用车新车，可享受从1000元至8000元不等的现金补贴；广东省一线城市新能源汽车免摇号上牌的政策有效拉动终端消费转化；安徽对个人消费者报废或转让旧车并购买新车的，给予一次性定额补贴。\n广东省汽车流通协会会长严斐说：“新能源汽车二手交易市场逐步建立成熟，车辆保值率趋于透明，流通瓶颈逐渐打通，消费者‘旧车能出手、残值有保障’的信心明显增强；而车企端价格体系趋于稳定，进一步打消了消费者‘买早吃亏’的观望情绪，置换需求正成为市场主力。”\n北京交通大学教授华国伟分析认为，高油价倒逼消费转向，技术全面升级化解了续航与充电焦虑，且年轻群体成为购车主力后，对智能电动汽车接受度显著提高，高性价比、潮流设计与低碳理念等共同催生了绿色出行新风向。（吴慧珺 黄兴 胡拿云）\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷\n63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核"},{"t":"新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260612_1894705.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"行业观察","tp":"新能源汽车渗透","dp":1,"as":"据中国汽车工业协会数据，2025年5月我国新能源汽车新车销量占比已达56.9%，较2024年全年40.9%大幅跃升，渗透率突破50%意味着新能源正式超越燃油车成为市场主流。文章从政策引导、产业链成熟、充电基础设施扩张、消费者认知转变等维度分析渗透率节节攀升的深层原因，指出国产电池技术降本、车企产品矩阵丰富以及智能化体验升级共同驱动了这一历史性拐点，中国正引领全球汽车产业电动化转型。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"b":"新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升\n中国汽车工业协会6月10日发布的数据显示，5月份，我国新能源汽车新车销量占汽车新车总销量的比例提升至56.9%。从2024年的40.9%，到2025年的50.8%，再到今年5月份的56.9%，新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升？\n中汽协副秘书长陈士华说，受政策调整、市场结构变化等因素影响，5月燃油车国内销量出现下滑，新能源汽车则凭借成本优化、技术迭代和消费者消费观念转变等方面的优势，走出独立增长曲线。\n安徽芜湖奇瑞智造一工厂焊装车间内，机械臂正在生产线上工作。（受访者供图）\n数据显示，5月份，我国新能源汽车产销分别完成155.4万辆和149.6万辆，同比分别增长22.4%和14.4%。\n重庆市民王先生最近把燃油车换成了电动车，他给记者算了一笔账，原来开燃油车每月通勤油费超过1200元，换成新能源车后电费不到200元，仅这一项一年便能省1.2万元。而近期高位震荡的国际油价，进一步凸显新能源汽车的出行成本优势。\n除了出行成本优势，新能源汽车的智能化体验日渐成为市场的关键变量。广州市海珠区新滘中路鸿蒙智行用户中心内，顾客陈先生坐进汽车座舱，尝试操作语音车控、车载大屏与智能辅助系统，爱不释手，连声夸赞。\n记者走进深蓝汽车重庆汽博中心店时，店长高磊正忙着接待客户。这个店5月份共销售220多辆新能源车，环比增长超10%。“消费者的关注点已从动力参数转向智能化体验，深蓝S07搭载华为乾崑智驾，在同级别市场中性价比优势明显。”高磊说。\n智能座舱体验全面跃升，成为吸引消费者的重要砝码。随着国产AI大模型加速“上车”，汽车交互正告别过去机械执行单一指令的模式，迈向更人性化、更高效的新阶段，车辆逐步具备“情感感知”能力。在一些车辆上，通过传感器与视觉识别技术，可实时监测驾驶员情绪状态，自动调节氛围灯、香氛，带来更好的体验。\n6月9日，消费者在深圳深业上城的蔚来中心内了解新能源汽车相关性能。（任紫辉摄）\n产业生态日益成熟，新能源汽车整车成本优势逐步显现。安徽省汽车经销商商会会长蒋天赐说，电池原材料价格回归理性，叠加一体化压铸、电池底盘一体化等新工艺规模应用，整车制造成本持续降低，新能源车正在实现对燃油车的平价甚至更优。\n与此同时，价格相对较低款式的新能源汽车，配置越来越智能，“智驾平权”也让新能源汽车受到更多消费者喜爱。记者了解到，目前，比亚迪、零跑等车企已将高阶辅助驾驶车型价格下探至10万元以内，部分入门级车型降至8万元左右。\n新能源汽车受青睐的另一个关键因素，是充电网络等配套基础设施覆盖面越来越广，“里程焦虑”正逐步得到化解。\n“村里2023年就装了充电桩，充电方便快捷。”在安徽省安庆市岳西县菖蒲镇菖蒲村，村民王国宏驾驶新能源车往返县城上班，无后顾之忧，这得益于国网岳西县供电公司提前预留电网容量、推进充电桩进村等系列举措，打通了补能“最后一公里”。\n国家能源局数据显示，截至2026年4月底，我国电动汽车充电基础设施总数达2195.5万个。从城市核心区到偏远乡村，“充电像加油一样方便”正逐渐成为现实。\n各地促进汽车消费的政策也在持续发力。重庆市从5月1日起实施2026年汽车购新补贴政策，个人消费者购买乘用车新车，可享受从1000元至8000元不等的现金补贴；广东省一线城市新能源汽车免摇号上牌的政策有效拉动终端消费转化；安徽对个人消费者报废或转让旧车并购买新车的，给予一次性定额补贴。\n广东省汽车流通协会会长严斐说：“新能源汽车二手交易市场逐步建立成熟，车辆保值率趋于透明，流通瓶颈逐渐打通，消费者‘旧车能出手、残值有保障’的信心明显增强；而车企端价格体系趋于稳定，进一步打消了消费者‘买早吃亏’的观望情绪，置换需求正成为市场主力。”\n北京交通大学教授华国伟分析认为，高油价倒逼消费转向，技术全面升级化解了续航与充电焦虑，且年轻群体成为购车主力后，对智能电动汽车接受度显著提高，高性价比、潮流设计与低碳理念等共同催生了绿色出行新风向。（吴慧珺 黄兴 胡拿云）\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷\n63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核"},{"t":"新型电网建设提速 储能产业打开发展新空间","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260612/b632540950714bbca92eaa28a850e154/c.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"新型电网储能","kp":["电网总投资[十五五]: 预计超5万亿元","特高压直流[甘肃-浙江]: ±800千伏"],"as":"文章报道中国新型电网建设全面提速背景下储能产业的爆发式发展机遇。随着西部风电、光伏等新能源大规模并网，电力系统的波动性和间歇性挑战加剧，储能成为消纳绿电、调峰调频的关键环节。报道从抽水蓄能、新型压缩空气储能、锂电池储能等多技术路线切入，梳理各地项目落地情况，指出新型电力系统建设正催生万亿级储能市场，产业链上下游企业迎来历史性发展窗口期。","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":2.5,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"b":"新型电网建设提速 储能产业打开发展新空间-新华网\n新型电网建设提速 储能产业打开发展新空间\n新型电网建设提速 储能产业打开发展新空间\n夏日，沿着能源转型的脉络眺望，中国广袤大地上建设热潮涌动。当西部戈壁的风能吹向东南沿海的工厂，当高原旷野的阳光点亮万家灯火，一张更坚强、更绿色、更智能的新型电网正在加速织就。\n“十五五”时期，我国电网总投资规模预计将突破5万亿元。新型电网建设全面提速，不仅带动了特高压工程、智能微电网等细分领域投资落地，也为储能等产业发展打开了新空间。业内人士指出，储能赛道价值重估，行业将迎来更大规模、更高质量的发展阶段。\n不久前，在甘肃省白银市景泰县上沙沃镇梁家槽村，甘肃-浙江±800千伏特高压直流输电工程（甘肃段）顺利跨越定武高速公路，为工程全线贯通奠定坚实基础。\n今年以来，我国电网投资保持高速增长态势，前三个月投资总额已超1600亿元。“十五五”时期，将投产特高压直流工程线路15条，电网投资预计超过5万亿元，西电东送能力达到4.2亿千瓦以上。\n我国新型电网建设已迈入年均投资近万亿元的超级周期。“新型电网建设已从传统以主干网架为中心，转向‘主配微协同’发展。”国家能源发展战略研究院执行院长王鹏表示，除了继续推进西电东送、南北互济的主干网架建设，配电网和微电网将成为未来发展的核心内容。\n其中，虚拟电厂等智慧能源管理系统、算电协同与电网数字化等领域展现出显著投资价值。国网能源研究院有限公司能源战略与规划所专家傅观君指出，微电网与虚拟电厂作为“主配微协同”架构中的关键形态，已从试点示范迈入市场化、规范化阶段，零碳园区、工业绿色微电网等新业态正在快速落地，创造大量细分产业链条和价值空间。\n让新型电网更稳、更快，离不开储能的关键支撑。厦门科华数能科技有限公司总裁崔剑指出，伴随新型电网加快建设，高比例新能源并网、电网安全稳定运行、电力供需时空错配等问题日益凸显，储能已从电力系统补充角色转变为核心支撑要素，叠加“源网荷储”全场景需求全面爆发、市场化机制逐步成熟、技术迭代催生新赛道等利好因素，行业迎来多重发展机遇。\n傅观君分析称，“十五五”期间，储能调节资源的投资增速预计将高于新能源本身，年均投资较2022年增长近8倍，占电力总投资的10%以上。\n“我们对电新各板块按预期增速/板块估值指标进行排序，得出储能行业为投资价值最高的板块之一，2024年至2030年预期增速高达400%以上。”中信建投证券研究报告显示。\n热度的攀升从企业表现上可窥一斑。以厦门科华数能科技有限公司为例，其当前各产品线订单饱满，构网储能、液冷储能等核心产品已在发电侧、电网侧、工商业、数据中心等多个标杆项目中落地应用。\n资本市场同样反应积极。从储能龙头高特电子过会，到亿纬锂能二次递表、思格新能源第三次闯关港交所，2026年储能IPO节奏加快。全国首单以电网侧独立储能电站为底层资产的机构间不动产投资信托基金（REITs）产品，在上海证券交易所成功挂牌，更标志着储能资产在资本市场实现标准化定价与流通。\n值得关注的是，从“单一储能设备”到“光储融合解决方案”正成为新能源赛道的新叙事逻辑。\n在刚刚落幕的第十九届（2026）国际太阳能光伏和智慧能源（上海）大会暨展览会上，多家光伏企业将光储一体化解决方案等作为核心展品亮相。\n“我们将储能定位为与光伏并重的核心战略业务，公司已通过设立独立事业部等一系列举措，加速其专业化、规模化发展，已完成‘光储+X’的全场景产品矩阵布局。”晶澳科技相关负责人表示。\n随着新型电网建设的全面提速，储能产业的叙事还将继续演进。电力规划设计总院预计,“十五五”时期，全国新型储能装机规模有望达3亿千瓦。\n远景高级副总裁田庆军认为，未来五年，储能将从当前的大电网服务型应用大幅转向负荷侧应用。其中，绿电直连带来的AI数据中心、绿色氢氨醇等离网及半离网型新型电力系统，正成为储能最大的增量市场。（记者 陈涵旸 王璐）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n焦点丨记者暗访后续：涉事地垃圾已清理完毕\n记者手记丨河野洋平走了，一个时代渐行渐远\n走进小城看消费丨东海：“指尖国潮”闯出“美丽经济”\n美伊交火持续：步步升级还是危险徘徊\n列国鉴丨频繁战事下以色列战时动员体系承受高压\n足球的源头可以追溯到中国古代的蹴鞠\n随外籍人士走进重庆 探访“发展为民”的具体实践\n新型电网建设提速 储能产业打开发展新空间"},{"t":"开盘市值突破两万亿美元位列美股第七：SpaceX 正式开启公开交易，马斯克成为全球首位万亿美元富豪","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/728.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 12 日消息，SpaceX 今晚在纳斯达克上市后正式开启美股交易，开盘报 150 美元，截至IT之家发稿已经涨超 168 美元每股，较 IPO 发行价（135 美元）涨超 24.44%，市值突破 2.15 万亿美元（现汇率约合 14.59 万亿元人民币），目前位列美股市场第七位。\n据《福布斯》估计，马斯克身价净增 1383 亿美元，净资产已达 1.2 万亿美元（现汇率约合 8.15 万亿元人民币）左右，高于周四 SpaceX 首次公开募股（IPO）时的 9820 亿美元，成为全球首位万亿美元富豪。\nSpaceX 每股发行价 135 美元，共发行约 5.556 亿股，募资约 750 亿美元（IT之家注：现汇率约合 5090.72 亿元人民币），刷新全球最大 IPO 纪录。\n此次 IPO 吸引逾 3500 亿美元（现汇率约合 2.38 万亿元人民币）认购需求，近三分之一机构未获配。\nSpaceX 此次 IPO 的发行价定为每股 135 美元，共发行约 5.556 亿股股票，筹集了 750 亿美元，超越了沙特阿美在 2019 年上市时创下的 249 亿美元融资记录，成为史上最大规模的 IPO。\n按照 135 美元的发行价计算，SpaceX 的市值约为 1.75 万亿美元，马斯克对公司的投票控制权超过 82%。\n马斯克此前已是全球首富，《福布斯》在 2026 年 4 月统计其净资产为 8390 亿美元，此次 SpaceX 上市后，其个人财富将首次突破 1 万亿美元大关。\nSpaceX 的上市仪式在纳斯达克举行，现场布置简约，首批交易于北京时间 6 月 12 日 22:00 左右进行。"},{"t":"开启人形机器人作业模式","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260612/03f89ddadb044208a589bbb90c783cb4/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"人形机器人商用","kp":["具身智能市场[2025全球]: 195.25亿元"],"as":"工信部办公厅与国务院国资委办公厅联合印发文件，部署开展人形机器人规模化作业应用试点，推动具身智能从实验室走向真实工业与生活场景。报道指出，人形机器人作为人工智能实现规模化的关键载体，正进入工厂制造、物流仓储、医疗陪护等多领域落地阶段。国家层面通过政策引导、场景开放与产业链协同，加速核心零部件（减速器、电机、灵巧手）国产化突破，目标将人形机器人培育为衡量国家高端制造实力的战略性未来产业。","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"b":"开启人形机器人作业模式-新华网\n作为未来产业的核心赛道，人形机器人与具身智能是人工智能走向真实场景、实现规模化应用的关键载体，也是衡量一个国家高端制造实力的重要标志。日前，工业和信息化部办公厅、国务院国资委办公厅联合印发《关于联合开展2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动的通知》，目标在于通过开展实景实训，推动人形机器人与具身智能从“表演模式”走向“作业模式”。\n我国人形机器人与具身智能正从技术验证期迈入规模化商用期。2025年被业界视为人形机器人与具身智能量产元年，多家头部企业实现了从实验室原型到小批量生产的跨越，产业链加速形成。公开数据显示，2025年全球具身智能市场规模预计为195.25亿元，其中中国市场占比近半。随着技术进步和成本下降，人形机器人与具身智能将在工业制造、服务业等领域广泛应用。放眼全球，我国已跻身人形机器人与具身智能赛道全球第一梯队，依托完整的产业链布局与高效的成本管控能力，打造出鲜明的竞争优势。\n常态化作业与演示验证对人形机器人与具身智能的要求大不相同。演示验证展示的是技术上限、单点能力、观赏性等，是要证明“能做到”；而常态化作业需要稳定性、耐久性、连续运行、成本合理等，是要实现“能一直做到并做好”。实验室里的可控环境与产业实际复杂场景存在明显差异，导致诸多技术成果虽能完成性能验证，但“落地难、实用难、普及难”。同时，模型算法、本体性能、场景适配、真机数据积累等方面仍存在短板，也制约了产业规模化进程。\n实景实训是打通落地堵点的关键抓手。集中打造统一规范、多方共享的实操实训场地，整合场景、数据、算力、技术成果等资源，不仅能避免场景重复建设和资源浪费，还能大幅降低企业研发试错成本。在真实场景中反复打磨调试，能快速修正各类实际使用问题，持续迭代优化产品性能，补齐真机数据与场景适配短板，构建起“训练—迭代—应用—再优化”的产业闭环，推动人形机器人与具身智能真正适配各行各业需求，实现从“能用”到“好用”的转变。\n2026年被业界视为人形机器人与具身智能规模化商用元年。此次出台的实景实训政策设定了到2026年底，人形机器人在一批代表性场景中开启“作业模式”的目标，契合行业从小批量量产试水迈向商业化落地的发展节奏；凝练形成百个以上高价值应用场景，将丰富具身智能应用谱系，形成可复用的解决方案；形成万台级规模落地能力，将带动上下游供应链协同扩产与成本下降，加速产业生态成熟，为我国抢占全球具身智能竞争制高点奠定坚实基础。\n落地场景也并非多多益善。此次政策选取工业制造、民生服务、特种作业三大方向布局落地场景，是兼顾市场需求、技术适配与安全刚需的务实选择。工业场景用工缺口大、标准化程度高，可快速验证机器人重复作业能力；民生服务市场空间广阔，适配柔性人机协同需求；特种作业风险高、人力难以涉足，是人形机器人不可替代的优势领域。三者梯度分明，既能构建投入产出的良性发展格局，又能倒逼技术突破，由点及面不断推广扩大。\n从“表演”到“作业”，人形机器人与具身智能产业正按下商业化提速键。当越来越多的机器人走出实验室、走进真实场景，在更多岗位上稳定作业，将成为中国制造向中国智造转型升级中最生动的注脚。（记者 黄鑫）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n焦点丨记者暗访后续：涉事地垃圾已清理完毕\n记者手记丨河野洋平走了，一个时代渐行渐远\n走进小城看消费丨东海：“指尖国潮”闯出“美丽经济”\n美伊交火持续：步步升级还是危险徘徊\n列国鉴丨频繁战事下以色列战时动员体系承受高压\n足球的源头可以追溯到中国古代的蹴鞠\n随外籍人士走进重庆 探访“发展为民”的具体实践"},{"t":"广东400万辆新能源车，光储充停车场为什么是现在投资最好的时机——四条收益路径+两类场景完整测算","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024329.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"索比光伏","as":"针对充电桩投资回报不及预期的痛点，本文指出单纯建桩收益薄弱，核心解法是「光储充一体化」——光伏降低购电成本，储能实现谷充峰放套利。文章给出四条收益路径与两类典型场景的完整财务测算，认为广东400万辆新能源车规模下，停车场配套光储是当前最优投资窗口期。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"光储充一体化","kp":["新能源车保有量[广东2025]: >400万辆","峰谷电价差[珠三角五市]: 1.1577元/kWh","储能系统价格[2026年4月中标]: 0.973元/Wh","回收期[小型园区光储充]: ~2.5年"],"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"b":"很多人投充电桩，投完发现「没想象中赚钱」——服务费比预期低，竞争对手多，回本周期一拖再拖。问题往往不是充电桩这个生意不行，而是只装了充电桩，少了两个关键配套。\n光伏，把你的购电成本降下来。储能，让你在电价最便宜的时候充电、最贵的时候放电。三个东西合在一起，收益路径从一条变成四条，回本周期从8年压缩到2~3年。\n广东是做这件事最合算的地方：400万辆以上新能源车(2025年底，全国最多)、珠三角五市目录电价峰谷差高达1.1577元/kWh(全国第一，CNESA 2026年1月)、储能系统价格刚创历史低位(0.973元/Wh，2026年4月最新中标价)——充电需求旺、峰谷差大、设备便宜，三个条件同时具备。\n索比光伏网对广东两类典型场景做了完整测算：\n场景一：小型园区/商业停车场(5台60kW快充桩+50kW光伏+100kWh储能)\n* 年净收益(成熟期)：约15.3万元\n* 回收期：约2.5年 / IRR约20%~25%\n场景二：物流园重卡停车坪(8台120kW大功率桩+150kW光伏+400kWh储能)\n* 总投资：约126万元\n* 年净收益(成熟期)：约46.9万元\n* 回收期：约2.7年 / IRR约18%~22%\n两个场景的收益来自四条路径：充电服务费(主力，占收益60%~70%)、光伏自发自用降低购电成本(15%~20%)、储能峰谷套利(10%~15%)、V2G调峰响应(5%~10%，进阶选配)。缺少任意一条，年净收益都会下降5~10万元。\n这篇报告还拆解了四个决定成败的关键因素：选址对充电量影响超过3倍、光伏车棚vs屋顶的选择逻辑、充电桩功率配比要求，以及三个最容易踩的坑(第一年收益预测错误/没有EMS统一管控/变压器容量没算清楚)。\n以下为报告节选，完整版扫码获取"},{"t":"工信部印发“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展实施意见","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260612/a0fe3e279bc24fce8ef99f3bb63b70ff/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","tp":"AI信通融合政策","kp":["城域算力1ms时延圈覆盖[2028]: ≥75%","高价值场景数[2028]: ≥30个"],"as":"工信部正式印发《「人工智能+信息通信」创新发展实施意见（2026—2030年）》，推动AI与通信行业深度融合。文件聚焦网络智能化、AI赋能通信基础设施、智能终端产业升级等方向，旨在加速5G/6G与AI协同创新，培育信息通信领域的新质生产力，属于顶层产业政策。","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"b":"工信部印发“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展实施意见-新华网\n工信部印发“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展实施意见\n工信部印发“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展实施意见\n近日，工业和信息化部印发《“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展实施意见（2026—2028年）》（以下简称《实施意见》）。《实施意见》要求，到2028年，人工智能与信息通信初步构建融合互促的创新发展格局。信息通信智能运营和服务能力达到国际先进水平，信息通信网络初步实现高等级自智，形成30个以上高价值典型场景，打造一批典型应用和特色智能体。网络、算力等信息基础设施支撑人工智能能力进一步提升，城域算力1毫秒时延圈覆盖率不低于75％。到2030年，人工智能与信息通信网络融合关键核心技术取得显著突破，通感算智一体化服务能力大幅提升，形成完备的协同创新和产业生态体系，“人工智能+信息通信”步入技术引领、产业繁荣、安全可靠、智能普惠的发展新阶段。\n《实施意见》围绕4个方面部署17项具体任务。一是推动信息通信行业智能化升级。推动信息通信智能化技术演进发展，聚焦5G-A/6G、新一代光网络、IPv6+、工业互联网等领域与人工智能融合发展，加强移动通信空口智能化、网络高等级自智等一批关键核心技术攻关；加强网络智能体创新发展与应用，在重点场景打造一批信息通信行业高质量数据集；加快网络设备智能化水平提升，探索在通信基站、核心网设备、路由交换设备、宽带接入服务器、光传输／接入系统、安全网关等网络设备中部署智能算力；推进网络建设运营全场景智能化能力升级，推广运维机器人、巡检无人机等新型装备在网络运维场景应用；增强网络边缘推理能力，探索在5G/5G-A网络、光网络、IP网络、新型工业网络的边缘设备部署推理算力，为人工智能在交通、低空经济、制造、文娱等场景应用提供通感算智一体边缘计算服务；提升优化智算云服务，推动平台即服务，打造以人工智能为核心的网络大模型和智能体开发工具链与自动化运维平台。\n二是夯实人工智能发展底座。夯实网络支撑底座，加快建设400Gbps/800Gbps等骨干传输网络，完善重点场所算力接入网络布局，构建城域毫秒级低时延入算能力；优化算力设施部署，构建“枢纽—区域—边缘”三级节点协同的算力设施体系，建立完善国家和区域算力平台，形成统一算力标识体系；提升网络智算服务能力，丰富光传送网（OTN）专线、无源光网络（PON）专线、IP专线等多种专线类型，面向智能体、具身智能等上行带宽和时延需求，提升光纤接入网上行带宽配置，推进支持大上行能力的5G-A网络部署。\n三是深化融合应用创新推广。打造网智融合新终端，推动具身智能与网联通信模组和设备适配验证，大力发展人工智能手机和电脑、智慧家庭设备、智能穿戴设备等产品；丰富信息消费新场景，鼓励基础电信企业积极利用人工智能赋能传统电信业务，加强基于智能体的新型个人和家庭应用创新；培育一批工业智能体，推动网络解决方案+行业大模型综合信息化服务融通发展，推动面向中小企业提供套餐式、模块化“网络+人工智能”服务，推动创新型产业集群智能化发展；面向卫生健康、教育等社会民生领域，提供精准化与普惠化服务。\n四是增强信息通信行业治理能力。提升“以网管网”智能监管能力，加强“以网管网”智能化基座建设，打造集数据展示、态势研判、风险预警于一体的监管智能决策中枢，提升电信市场综合治理效能；强化智能化安全保障，加强人工智能赋能网络和数据安全技术攻关，在防范治理垃圾短信和骚扰电话、电信网络诈骗等方面持续加强人工智能技术应用；加强标准体系建设，围绕5G-A、6G、光网络等领域加强“人工智能+网络”国际标准制定；提升公共服务能力，组织基础电信企业在有条件的地方开展人工智能与信息通信网络融合创新试验验证，支持企业积极参与国家人工智能开源社区建设，培育一批优质开源项目，推动科技型企业创新政策扶持“一件事”高效办理。\n此外，《实施意见》还要求基础电信企业、设备制造企业、互联网企业等扎实推进人工智能与信息通信网络融合创新，加强相关技术、产品落地推广。发挥行业和社会组织平台作用，开展场景创新、技术创新、试验验证、产业合作、应用推广等。通过国家科技重大专项、重点研发计划等支持开展网络智能化关键技术和产品研发攻关，鼓励将攻关成果开源共享。在“揭榜挂帅”中设立网络智能化技术和解决方案任务，加快形成一批标志性技术产品和方案。针对网络安全、隐私保护等全球性挑战，与各国加强合作，共同提高防护能力。征集一批典型应用案例，组织开展人工智能赋能新型工业化“深度行”活动等。 （记者　林婧）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n焦点丨记者暗访后续：涉事地垃圾已清理完毕\n记者手记丨河野洋平走了，一个时代渐行渐远\n走进小城看消费丨东海：“指尖国潮”闯出“美丽经济”\n美伊交火持续：步步升级还是危险徘徊\n列国鉴丨频繁战事下以色列战时动员体系承受高压\n足球的源头可以追溯到中国古代的蹴鞠\n随外籍人士走进重庆 探访“发展为民”的具体实践\n工信部印发“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展实施意见"},{"t":"工信部、国资委启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260612/a069b3a9948b4e0aaaa94cf3d618e545/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","tp":"人形机器人政策","as":"工信部联合国资委启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动，推动人形机器人在真实生产、服务场景中落地训练。通过央企等主体提供实训环境，加速具身智能算法迭代与产业化验证，意在打通从实验室到工程化应用的关键一环，属于国家级产业推进举措。","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.5},"b":"工信部、国资委启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动-新华网\n工信部、国资委启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动\n工信部、国资委启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动\n6月9日，工业和信息化部、国务院国资委联合印发通知，正式启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动，旨在推动人形机器人与具身智能产品在真实生产生活环境中常态化部署应用，加速实现规模化发展。\n通知提出，坚持应用牵引，面向工业、特种、服务等领域重点场景，一体推进实景实训空间建设、创新应用联合体培育、作业技能攻关、应用部署验证等重点任务，通过真实场景训练，持续优化具身智能模型算法，积累高质量真机数据，提升本体关键部组件性能，探索构建人形机器人及具身智能产品全生命周期管理和保障机制。\n通知明确，到2026年底，人形机器人等具身智能重点产品在一批代表性场景中率先完成应用验证和常态部署，开启人形机器人与具身智能“作业模式”；凝练形成百个以上高价值应用场景，进一步丰富具身智能应用谱系，带动形成万台级规模落地能力。\n据悉，专项行动部署了打造实景实训空间、组建创新应用联合体、攻关实用化作业技能、加强实景应用验证与常态部署、强化关键要素保障、凝练成熟经验等6项重点任务。工业和信息化部、国务院国资委将专项行动融入人工智能赋能新型工业化相关工作，对成效突出的区域与企业，在政策、标准、项目上予以倾斜支持；各省级工信主管部门、有关央企将通过专项资金、政府奖励支持场景开放、技术攻关、应用推广与标准研制；建立清单化管理、常态化跟踪评估机制，协调解决推进难点堵点，确保任务落地见效。\n专家表示，当前我国人形机器人与具身智能产业已突破原型样机研发阶段，模型算法、关键零部件、本体集成等产业链关键环节基本成型，进入规模化落地前的关键发展“窗口期”。专项行动立足北京、天津、上海、江苏、浙江等十省市及各大央企主体，以实景实训为抓手，打通人形机器人等具身智能产品从实验室研发到真实产业落地的关键堵点，是国家推动具身智能产业从技术样机走向规模化商用的重要落地政策。（记者　李晓东）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n焦点丨记者暗访后续：涉事地垃圾已清理完毕\n记者手记丨河野洋平走了，一个时代渐行渐远\n走进小城看消费丨东海：“指尖国潮”闯出“美丽经济”\n美伊交火持续：步步升级还是危险徘徊\n列国鉴丨频繁战事下以色列战时动员体系承受高压\n足球的源头可以追溯到中国古代的蹴鞠\n随外籍人士走进重庆 探访“发展为民”的具体实践\n工信部、国资委启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动"},{"t":"山东省煤田地质局攻克特殊震源同步触发核心技术难题--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260612_1894807.html","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/勘探技术","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"技术突破","tp":"震源同步触发","as":"山东省煤田地质局物探测量队自主研发的高精度震源反向同步触发系统成功攻克特殊震源同步触发核心技术难题。该技术解决多源地震勘探中精确同步激发的瓶颈，可提升地震数据采集精度与效率，对煤田地质勘探、资源勘查及工程物探具有重要工程价值。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"b":"山东省煤田地质局攻克特殊震源同步触发核心技术难题--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n山东省煤田地质局攻克特殊震源同步触发核心技术难题\n记者6月12日从山东省煤田地质局获悉，由该局物探测量队(下称“物测队”)自主研发的高精度震源反向同步触发装置近日顺利完成现场试验，标志着中国成功攻克地震勘探领域特殊震源同步触发关键技术难题，突破行业技术瓶颈，可为复杂工况、特殊条件下的高精度地震勘探提供有力支撑。\n震源同步触发精度是决定地震勘探数据质量与作业可靠性的核心要素，直接影响地质勘探成果质量与施工效率。目前，正向触发模式已广泛应用于常规震源勘探作业，但在气爆、重锤等特殊震源场景，以及数码雷管无法适配触发设备的复杂野外工况下，传统正向触发技术适配性差、触发精度低、稳定性弱，长期制约野外地震勘探质效提升，是行业亟待破解的技术痛点。\n图为山东省煤田地质局物测队的震源车正在开展野外数据采集。杜宏杰摄\n物测队组建专项研发团队，聚焦野外实际难题，摒弃传统正向触发思路，创新提出震源信号反向触发技术方案。通过迭代优化发光管电路结构、精准校准震源时窗开启节点，实现从传统模拟电路同步到高精度数字电路同步的技术升级，全面提升震源触发的精准度与稳定性。\n经GPS、TB记录仪双路严苛检测验证，该装置触发延时稳定控制在0毫秒—0.03毫秒，各项指标均达到行业规范最高标准，整体性能处于国内同类设备先进水平。\n现场试验表明，该装置可精准捕捉震源药柱爆炸产生的同步物理信号，实现高精度时序触发，有效规避民爆配套设施受限等现场难题，彻底补齐特殊震源同步触发的技术短板。\n相较于传统技术，新装置适配场景更广、作业效率更高、运维成本更低，不仅缩短野外地震数据采集周期、降低勘探成本，全面提升特殊震源勘探的数据质量与稳定性，进一步拓宽了地震勘探技术的应用边界。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n单台年省500度电！南网“妙算”服务器为数据中心出妙招\n“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破\n国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产"},{"t":"山东省煤田地质局攻克特殊震源同步触发核心技术难题--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260612_1894807.html","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/勘探技术","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"技术突破","tp":"震源同步触发","dp":1,"as":"山东省煤田地质局物探测量队自主研发的高精度震源反向同步触发系统成功攻克特殊震源同步触发核心技术难题。该技术解决多源地震勘探中精确同步激发的瓶颈，可提升地震数据采集精度与效率，对煤田地质勘探、资源勘查及工程物探具有重要工程价值。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"b":"山东省煤田地质局攻克特殊震源同步触发核心技术难题--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n山东省煤田地质局攻克特殊震源同步触发核心技术难题\n记者6月12日从山东省煤田地质局获悉，由该局物探测量队(下称“物测队”)自主研发的高精度震源反向同步触发装置近日顺利完成现场试验，标志着中国成功攻克地震勘探领域特殊震源同步触发关键技术难题，突破行业技术瓶颈，可为复杂工况、特殊条件下的高精度地震勘探提供有力支撑。\n震源同步触发精度是决定地震勘探数据质量与作业可靠性的核心要素，直接影响地质勘探成果质量与施工效率。目前，正向触发模式已广泛应用于常规震源勘探作业，但在气爆、重锤等特殊震源场景，以及数码雷管无法适配触发设备的复杂野外工况下，传统正向触发技术适配性差、触发精度低、稳定性弱，长期制约野外地震勘探质效提升，是行业亟待破解的技术痛点。\n图为山东省煤田地质局物测队的震源车正在开展野外数据采集。杜宏杰摄\n物测队组建专项研发团队，聚焦野外实际难题，摒弃传统正向触发思路，创新提出震源信号反向触发技术方案。通过迭代优化发光管电路结构、精准校准震源时窗开启节点，实现从传统模拟电路同步到高精度数字电路同步的技术升级，全面提升震源触发的精准度与稳定性。\n经GPS、TB记录仪双路严苛检测验证，该装置触发延时稳定控制在0毫秒—0.03毫秒，各项指标均达到行业规范最高标准，整体性能处于国内同类设备先进水平。\n现场试验表明，该装置可精准捕捉震源药柱爆炸产生的同步物理信号，实现高精度时序触发，有效规避民爆配套设施受限等现场难题，彻底补齐特殊震源同步触发的技术短板。\n相较于传统技术，新装置适配场景更广、作业效率更高、运维成本更低，不仅缩短野外地震数据采集周期、降低勘探成本，全面提升特殊震源勘探的数据质量与稳定性，进一步拓宽了地震勘探技术的应用边界。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n单台年省500度电！南网“妙算”服务器为数据中心出妙招\n“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破\n国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产"},{"t":"宇电温控器被“十四五”规划高等学校教材收录，为唯一入选品牌","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024331.html","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"索比光伏","tg":"产业进展","b":"近日，宇电温控科技产品正式入选石油和化工行业“十四五”规划教材《工业控制装备原理及应用》，并完整收录于“过程控制仪表”章节。宇电成为行业唯一一个入选该教材的数字控制器品牌，产品适用于对温度、压力、液位、流量等各种工业过程参数的测量、显示和精确控制，这不仅是对宇电技术实力与行业影响力的高度认可，也意味着国产控制器获得国家级权威教材认可，成为自动化专业人才培养的典型案例。\n《工业控制装备原理及应用》是高等学校自动化类专业系列教材，由中国化工教育协会主办、化学工业出版社出版，是国内极具权威性的规划教材。在“过程控制仪表”章节中，教材以AI-8系列数字控制器为教学范例，从设备选型、面板功能、接线方法到实际应用场景，进行了系统详尽的解析。\n该教材在文中明确表示，“宇电先进技术方面实现了对进口仪表的赶超。在数字控制器国产化替代方面成功获得突破，技术指标全面领先进口同类产品，真正体现了大国工匠精神。”此次入选教材既帮助学生掌握国产高精度控制器原理，为行业输送熟悉国产设备的工程师，也推动了国产仪表在产学研各环节的普及应用。\n未来，宇电将持续推进技术创新，积极参与行业标准制定与教学实践，推动更多自主产品走进高校课堂，携手各界共建产教协同与人才培养生态，助力制造强国与人才强国。\n宇电AI-888数字控制器\n宇电AI-888数字控制器凭借卓越的性能，被清华大学、中国科学院等权威专家评定为“国际先进水平”，该产品已在半导体、光伏、锂电池等多个高端制造领域广泛应用。\n测量精度达0.1级，能满足不同行业的温度、压力、液位、流量等精密控制需求。\n搭载新型APID自整定自适应控制算法，在大滞后、额外扰动等复杂工况下仍能实现无超调、无欠调的精确控制。\n具有串级控制、AAT 先进快速自整定、50 段程序控制、加热冷却双输出、手自动无扰切换、外部事件输入、输入多点修正等丰富功 能，适配各类复杂工艺场景。\n支持宇电AIbus及通用Modbus通讯协议，并可通过通信控制器灵活转换为TCP、EtherCAT等通讯方式，与智能制造系统无缝对接。\n关于厦门宇电自动化科技有限公司\n厦门宇电自动化科技有限公司成立于1991年，是国家级专精特新重点“小巨人”企业，国家级高新技术企业，国内温控仪表与工业自动化测控领域龙头企业，工业温控器国家标准主草单位。目前在温控器细分领域的产业规模居全球前列，产品覆盖半导体、光伏、锂电池、生物医药和高端材料等数百个行业。\n宇电产品以低温漂、高抗干扰、长寿命和低失效率著称。自研高端温控器聚焦高性能及高可靠性，被国内半导体设备头部企业作为替代进口产品的优先选择，已成功批量用于对可靠性要求极为严苛的半导体前道核心设备。通用多功能系列温控器在高可靠性的同时具有高性价比，在光伏核心设备市场占有率超过70%，也是唯一被全部锂电龙头企业均纳入选型目录的国产温控器，目前锂电行业超过半数的智能温控器均选择宇电品牌。宇电温控器还成功应用于热处理、高端材料、机械设备、生物医药、环保、化工等数十个国民经济产业及航空航天领域。\n作为中国仪器仪表行业协会显示控制仪表理事长单位，宇电主持和参与50余项国家/行业标准制定，通过CE、UL、TÜV、RoHS、ISO14001等多项权威认证，产品销往全球150多个国家和地区，公司以“可靠、精准、节能”为核心，持续技术创新，致力成为节能环保测控技术领航者，为智能制造与工业升级提供稳定高效的自动化解决方案。","tp":"国产温控器","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":1.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":"宇电温控AI-8系列数字控制器入选十四五规划高校教材《工业控制装备原理及应用》，成为唯一入选的国产数字控制器品牌。教材明确指出宇电在先进技术方面实现对进口仪表的赶超，标志着国产高精度控制器获得国家级权威认可。"},{"t":"字节豆包上线“任务模式”：支持定时执行、代码运行与文件生成，“思考模式”已升级为“专家模式”","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/725.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"Agent任务模式","as":"字节跳动旗下AI应用豆包大范围上线\"任务模式\"，支持定时执行、代码运行与文件生成等功能，付费订阅用户可体验灰度测试。同时原\"思考模式\"升级为\"专家模式\"。\"任务模式\"让豆包具备自动化任务编排与执行能力，标志着豆包从对话式AI向智能体方向演进，拓展了应用场景与生产力边界。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":4.5,"t":9.0},"b":"6 月 12 日消息，前天，字节跳动旗下 AI 应用豆包已针对付费订阅开放灰度测试，除此之外，当时还有另一个“任务模式”也开启测试。\n直到今天，豆包“任务模式”已经大范围上线。IT之家实测发现，大部分用户打开豆包首页就能看到官方提示。\n用户打开豆包 App 后，界面顶部的模式切换选项也已经变更为“快速、专家、任务”，标志着这款 AI 助手的产品功能定位正在发生结构性调整。\n据豆包官方介绍，新上线的“任务模式”定位为智能体（Agent）能力，区别于传统 AI 对话式的单步问答模式，它可以自主完成从任务拆解、步骤规划、工具调用到结果交付的全链路执行，直接向用户输出可用的成品。\n用户无需通过多轮对话逐步引导 AI，只需在任务模式下输入一个明确的任务目标，豆包即可自动联网搜索资料、生成内容、制作 PPT 或生成图表等。目前该模式支持的核心功能包括零代码网页生成（几分钟内可生成个人作品集或活动落地页）、一键生成 PPT（自动搜索资料并搭建完整内容框架）、数据可视化分析（上传 Excel 后自动生成柱状图、折线图、漏斗图等图表）等。\n此外，用户还可以设置定时任务，让豆包按照预设的时间在后台自动执行如批量生成报告、定时整理数据、生成图片等工作。\n与“任务模式”侧重于“执行交付”的定位不同，升级后的“专家模式”则侧重于“思考质量”。该模式调用的是字节跳动最新发布的豆包大模型 2.0 Pro 版本，采用原生 Agent 架构，能够在数学推理、长文本处理、法律文书逻辑校验等复杂任务场景中提供深度推理能力。\n在三种模式的适用场景选择上，快速模式面向简单问答和即时信息获取，响应速度最快；专家模式适用于行业分析、方案拆解等需要深度输出和专业解答的复杂问题；任务模式则适用于用户已有明确目标、希望 AI 独立完成从规划到执行全过程的场景。\n在收费方面，据豆包 2026 年 6 月 3 日发布的官方说明，日常问答、基础写作、简单生图、普通对话等所有普通用户高频使用的基础功能将持续免费；付费权益主要针对垂直领域的高阶增值服务，如 PPT 生成、数据分析、软件开发、金融分析等高强度、高算力的专业场景。\n根据豆包官方此前披露的信息，豆包专业版定价分为三档：标准版连续包月 68 元、包年 688 元，加强版连续包月 200 元、包年 2048 元，专业版连续包月 500 元、包年 5088 元。\n豆包专业版开放灰度测试，最高档年费超五千元"},{"t":"国家能源集团：江苏400MW“光储制氢”项目全面建成","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024299.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光氢储一体化","kp":["光伏装机[如东光氢储]: 400MW","储能配置[如东]: 60MW/120MWh","制氢装置[如东]: 1500Nm³/h","年发电量[如东]: 4.68亿kWh","年产绿氢[如东]: 482吨"],"as":"国家能源集团国华投资江苏分公司如东\"光氢储一体化\"项目全面建成投运，装机规模40万千瓦光伏，配套60兆瓦/120兆瓦时储能，成为全国规模最大的光氢储一体化项目。项目开启\"源网荷储氢\"一体化协同运行模式，是国家第三批大型光伏基地重点项目，示范意义显著。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":7.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"cl":"10a0d97c","cln":"光氢储一体化","cp":1,"b":"全国规模最大光氢储一体化项目——国家能源集团国华投资江苏分公司如东“光氢储一体化”项目全面建成，开启“源网荷储氢”一体化协同运行模式。\n该项目坐落于江苏如东洋口港，是国家第三批大型光伏基地重点项目。项目集40万千瓦\n、60兆瓦/120兆瓦时储能站、1500标方/小时绿电制氢装置于一体，形成完整的“绿电生产——存储——转化”产业链。\n：年发电量4.68亿千瓦时，可满足近20万户家庭年度用电需求，相当于减排二氧化碳超30万吨；\n配套储能站：有效平抑电网出力波动，提升新能源消纳能力；\n制氢装置：年产高纯绿氢482吨，实现“绿电制绿氢”零碳闭环，所产绿氢定向供应长三角区域，配套加氢站同步投用，打通绿氢应用全链条。\n目前，该项目已完成全系统联合调试，各项性能指标均满足设计要求。该项目将持续优化一体化运行模式，以绿电为基、氢能为桥、储能为盾，助力长三角地区构建清洁低碳、安全高效的现代能源体系，为推动能源革命与绿色发展贡献“国能样板”。"},{"t":"呼伦贝尔市2026年第二批次分布式风电、光伏项目竞配启动","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024317.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"6月11日，呼伦贝尔市启动2026年第二批次分布式风电、光伏项目竞争性配置申报。本次竞配重点针对电网末端网架薄弱区域，依据国网呼伦贝尔供电公司分散式风电试点方案，仅开展电网末端保供型分散式风电项目，旨在提升末端供电可靠性，解决偏远地区电网结构薄弱问题。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"分布式风光竞配","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"b":"6月11日，呼伦贝尔市2026年第二批次分布式风电、光伏项目竞争性配置工作开始申报。\n为有效解决电网末端网架结构薄弱问题，提升供电可靠性，根据国网呼伦贝尔供电公司《呼伦贝尔市电网末端保供型分散式风电试点建设方案》，此次分散式风电项目仅开展电网末端保供型分散式风电试点项目竞争性配置，试点地区为额尔古纳市、莫旗。企业可根据国网呼伦贝尔供电公司《呼伦贝尔市电网末端保供型分散式风电试点建设方案》申报电网末端保供型分散式风电试点项目。\n企业可根据国网呼伦贝尔供电公司公布的可开放容量申报一般工商业、大型工商业\n各旗市区能源主管部门结合国网呼伦贝尔供电公司公布的本地区2026年二季度分布式电源可开放容量，并核减本地区2026年拟实施驭风行动项目相应规模后，组织本地区企业开展申报工作。\n呼伦贝尔市2026年第二批次分布式风电、光伏项目竞争性配置工作开始申报\n按照《呼伦贝尔市2026年分布式能源工作方案》，拟组织开展呼伦贝尔市2026年第二批次分布式能源项目竞争性配置工作，现就有关事宜公告如下。\n为有效解决电网末端网架结构薄弱问题，提升供电可靠性，根据国网呼伦贝尔供电公司《呼伦贝尔市电网末端保供型分散式风电试点建设方案》，此次分散式风电项目仅开展电网末端保供型分散式风电试点项目竞争性配置，试点地区为额尔古纳市、莫旗。企业可根据国网呼伦贝尔供电公司《呼伦贝尔市电网末端保供型分散式风电试点建设方案》申报电网末端保供型分散式风电试点项目。\n企业可根据国网呼伦贝尔供电公司公布的可开放容量申报一般工商业、大型工商业\n各旗市区能源主管部门结合国网呼伦贝尔供电公司公布的本地区2026年二季度分布式电源可开放容量，并核减本地区2026年拟实施驭风行动项目相应规模后，组织本地区企业开展申报工作。各旗市区能源主管部门汇总初审各相关企业申报材料后，于6月23日前将第二批次分布式能源项目申报文件及汇总表、申报材料报送至市能源局新能源和可再生能源科，逾期不再受理。"},{"t":"反垄断调查结束，Netflix、迪士尼、亚马逊等六家流媒体向土耳其妥协","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/710.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"政策监管","b":"6 月 12 日消息，土耳其竞争委员会（Competition Board）于当地时间 6 月 12 日宣布，针对 Netflix、迪士尼、亚马逊、BluTV、Exxen 和 Gain 六家流媒体巨头涉嫌垄断一案，各方已达成和解并正式结案。\n据介绍，这起始于 2025 年的调查，核心指控\n各平台利用“独家协议（排他性条款）”垄断土耳其本土内容与演职人员\n，且 Netflix 在筛选原创内容时涉嫌歧视本地制片商。最终各平台提交承诺并获官方批准，调查以承诺程序正式结案。\nIT之家附 Netflix 核心承诺如下：\n扶持新制作方：5 年内将一定比例的原创内容交由新本土制片商制作；3 年内每年举办“提案推介日”，确保至少 80 名新创作者参与，并在 120 天内反馈评估结果。\n放宽内容排他：缩短影视内容的独家排他期；允许制作方通过海外传统电视或单片点播渠道发行土耳其电视节目，并享有收益分成和奖金。\n解除人员绑定：废除对演员、导演、编剧等演职人员的排他性限制；强制分离制作人、选角导演、经纪人等关键角色以避嫌；禁止签订涵盖制作方所有内容的“一刀切”式独家或竞业协议。\n保障政策红利：不限制第三方独立制作人申请土耳其政府的补贴与激励。\n迪士尼、亚马逊等其余五家平台也作出了限制独家期限、严禁签署人才独家协议等类似承诺。"},{"t":"华为鸿蒙 HarmonyOS 开发套件版本号格式调整：统一 API 与 OpenHarmony 体系，分 X.Y.Z 字段","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/717.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 12 日消息，在今天的华为开发者大会 HDC 2026 上，\n开发套件 26.0.0 Beta1 版本正式面向开发者发布。\nIT之家注意到，本次发布对 HarmonyOS 开发套件的版本号格式进行了调整，统一采用 API 版本进行描述。API 版本号可在搭载 HarmonyOS 的设备的设置中查询。\n从 API 版本 26.0.0 开始，API 版本号统一采用语义化版本（Semantic Versioning，简称 SemVer）格式（\n统一 HarmonyOS 开发套件版本（API 版本）及其底座 OpenHarmony 的版本号体系。\n提供更清晰的版本定位，体现主、次版本的概念及升级建议。\n符合行业标准的语义化版本（SemVer）规范。\n包含大量的新功能以及重要的变更，变更可能包含对 API 的修改，需要开发者对已开发的应用进行适配修改。\n包含新功能，原则上向后兼容，但重大安全隐患或关键体验问题可能引入不兼容变更，会在版本说明中提供详细的变更说明指导。\n问题修复和小改进，保持向后兼容。\n官方举例新版本号格式如下（以下版本号仅为示例，不代表后续的版本规划）：\n26.0.0：首次采用完全语义化的版本。\n26.0.1：26.0.0 的修订版本升级，包含问题修复。\n26.1.0：26.0.0 的次版本升级，包含新功能。\n27.0.0：主版本升级，包含重大变更。\n华为鸿蒙 HarmonyOS 开发套件 26.0.0 Beta1 发布：沉浸光感效果更好、游戏应用启动体验提升\n华为开发者大会（HDC 2026）专题"},{"t":"华为余承东：鸿蒙 HarmonyOS 成为中国第二大智能手机操作系统","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/721.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 12 日消息，在今日的华为开发者大会 HDC 2026 上，华为常务董事、产品投资评审委员会主任、终端 BG 董事长余承东发布了新一代\n7 操作系统，围绕互联、智能、安全、流畅、空间感五个维度进行升级，同时迈向智能体时代。\n余承东在 HDC 2026 现场宣布，\n鸿蒙 HarmonyOS 已成为中国第二大智能手机操作系统\nIT之家在 HDC 2026 现场了解到，\n目前搭载鸿蒙 HarmonyOS 6 操作系统的终端设备数量已突破 6600 万台\n，注册开发者超 1100 万，华为应用市场可获取应用与服务超 40 万款，应用日均下载量已超 2 亿次，鸿蒙生态已驶入高速增长的快车道。\n开源方面，依托 13 亿生态设备底座与 1.3 万代码贡献者的开源共建，开源鸿蒙已发布超过 100 个商用版本，共建代码行超 1.4 亿，生态伙伴也突破了 3200 家。\n华为开发者大会（HDC 2026）专题"},{"t":"北京：鼓励采用钙钛矿，BIPV项目最高可获30%市政府固定资产投资支持","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024318.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"政策监管","tp":"钙钛矿BIPV补贴","kp":["投资支持比例[BIPV北京]: ≤30%","项目最低规模[BIPV]: ≥500千瓦"],"as":"北京市发布2026年第一批市政府固定资产投资支持光伏发电项目征集通知，明确鼓励采用钙钛矿等新型光伏技术，对BIPV（光伏建筑一体化）项目最高给予30%的市政府固定资产投资支持。政策重点支持光伏发电作为建筑及设施构件的第五立面应用，体现地方政府对钙钛矿等新一代光伏技术产业化的积极扶持态度，有望加速钙钛矿电池从实验室走向规模化商用。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"b":"关于公开征集2026年第一批市政府固定资产投资支持光伏发电项目的通知\n按照第五立面光伏应用相关文件要求，现组织开展2026年第一批市政府固定资产投资光伏发电项目公开征集工作，并就有关事项通知如下：\n(一)支持范围。光伏发电作为建筑、设施构件的建筑光伏一体化项目，采用钙钛矿、碲化镉等新型电池组件的光伏发电项目(光伏项目新技术认定标准见附件1)。具体支持内容包括：光伏组件及必要的安装辅助系统、逆变器、汇流箱等配电系统。\n(二)支持比例。市政府固定资产投资对支持范围内的项目给予光伏发电系统建设投资不高于30%的资金支持。\n(一)严把建设内容。原则上光伏项目总体规模不小于500千瓦，项目建设地点应在本市范围内，符合首都功能定位及市区两级规划布局，满足所在区域生态环境、绿色转型、城市更新等相关要求。\n(二)夯实建设条件。1.申报项目应严格执行国家及本市有关投资管理各种规定，并履行项目备案手续。已开工项目应履行前期手续;未开工项目应出具书面承诺函，附开工前各项手续完成时间表、审批部门、具体责任人。2.申报项目应于2026年7月底前开工并形成实物工作量。3.项目应于2026年12月31日前并网，项目投资已完成80%或已竣工并网的项目不予支持。\n(三)落实资金来源。项目资金拼盘应完整闭合，项目各渠道资金相加应等于总投资，且资金结构相对合理。\n(四)防范违规申报。申报项目符合本市固定资产投资支持范围和资金投向。项目主体应出具书面承诺函明确未享受其他市级补贴。无严重失信记录，经营状况良好，财务制度健全。各区发展改革部门应加强与区相关部门沟通衔接，做好审核，原则上已经获得其他市级资金支持的项目不得多头申报，纳入严重失信单位和安全生产严重失信主体名单的单位不得申报项目。\n(五)确保信息准确。资金申请文件中的项目代码、项目名称、主要建设内容、项目总投资等与项目核准(备案)等文件保持一致，确保在北京市投资项目调度与服务平台填报的各项目信息与报送文件的有关信息保持一致。\n(一)申报时间：2026年6月12日前。\n(二)申报材料：光伏发电：项目备案通知书、项目技术方案、《申报项目信息表》(见附件2)。\n(三)报送方式：申报单位将纸质版材料(一式三份，封面加盖单位公章及骑缝章)和电子版材料统一报送至属地发展改革委(见附件3)。\n(四)评估审核：由属地发展改革部门对申请项目进行初审并指导项目单位完成北京市投资项目调度与服务平台录入工作。6月15日前将初审符合要求的项目报送市发展改革委，我委组织第三方开展预审，确定拟给予市政府固定资产投资支持项目清单。\n(五)网上公示：符合要求的项目通过市发展改革委网站进行公示，公示时间5个工作日。\n(六)资金申请及拨付：公示无异议后，市发展改革委组织相关区发展改革部门及相关项目申报单位报送资金申请报告。光伏发电项目应在资金申请报告中明确：项目技术方案、并网形式、预计年发电量、单位造价成本等指标。明确光伏技术类型，体现先进示范效应。市发展改革委按照《北京市政府投资管理办法》要求，开展项目评估审核及资金拨付等相关工作。凡在项目申报过程中有违纪违法行为的，一律不予受理评审。\n1.北京市第五立面光伏项目新技术认定标准\n2.申报项目信息表(光伏发电)\n3.各区发展改革部门联系方式"},{"t":"北京越野 BJ30 高光版上市：外观调整 / 配置升级，置换价 8.29 万-10.99 万元","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/712.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"混动SUV上市","kp":["动力架构[BJ30高光版]: 三擎四驱六模HEV"],"as":"北京越野BJ30高光版正式上市，定位轻越野SUV，超级置换价8.29万元起。新车搭载三擎四驱六模HEV混动架构，配备能量中锁、四轮电子限滑及智电ATS全地形控制系统，兼顾越野通过性与燃油经济性。燃油高光版官方指导价区间为8.29万至10.99万元。该车以亲民价格切入轻越野细分市场，反映国产自主品牌在混动越野领域的技术下放趋势。","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":2.5,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"b":"6 月 12 日消息，北京越野 BJ30 高光版今晚正式上市，新车定位轻越野 SUV，超级置换价 8.29 万元起。据悉，新车搭载三擎四驱六模 HEV 混动架构，配备能量中锁、四轮电子限滑及智电 ATS 全地形控制系统。\n燃油高光版：官方指导价 11.29 万元，超级置换价 8.29 万元\n混动高光版：官方指导价 13.99 万元，超级置换价 10.99 万元\n根据介绍，新车在“超野、超大、超省”的基础之上，实现了颜值、性能和体验全面跃升。其采用经典方盒子造型，前脸为家族式的“五阙星环”贯穿灯组，并配备了全套电感潮改套件、专属星换轮毂和前后同色运动保险杠。车身尺寸方面，其\n长宽高分别为 4730/1910/1790mm，轴距为 2820mm\n，离地间隙 215mm，接近角 25 度，离去角 30 度。此外，该车还提供了车顶行李架和攀爬梯。\n新车换装 AGM 电瓶，号称拥有普通电瓶 3 倍的循环寿命，后电机功率从 55kW 提升至 70kW。此外，该车还搭载座椅加热、通风、方向盘加热、感应雨滴自动关窗、64 色氛围灯等一系列功能。\n据IT之家了解，混动车型配备\n魔核深混电驱-DHEV 架构\n，融合增程及混动两种技术，驱动形式为“三擎四驱六模”混合驱动，系统\n最大功率 301kW，最大扭矩 685Nm，0-100km/h 加速时间 6.59 秒\n，WLTC 工况综合油耗 6.45L/100km。纯燃油版车型则搭载 1.5T+7DCT 动力系统。"},{"t":"今年秋季上市，华为乾崑｜启境 GX7 大五座 SUV 实车预告图亮相","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/709.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"智能SUV预告","as":"华为乾崑旗下启境品牌首款大五座SUV——启境GX7实车预告图亮相，计划今年秋季正式上市。新车外观采用大量曲线营造灵动设计语言，可见车顶激光雷达、大尺寸尾翼和半隐藏式门把手等配置，凸显智能驾驶与空气动力学设计取向。该车此前于5月29日首次披露，是华为乾崑智选车业务向大五座SUV细分市场拓展的重要产品布局。","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"b":"6 月 12 日消息，华为乾崑｜启境首款大五座 SUV—— 启境 GX7 的实车预告图现已公布，新车覆盖了伪装贴纸，整体用大量曲线营造出灵动的设计语言，还可看到车顶激光雷达、大尺寸尾翼和半隐藏式门把手。\n这款新车此前已在 5 月 29 日的启境 GT7 预售发布会上官宣，计划\n上市。启境官方表示，GX7 寓意“Grand eXploration”，即“伟大的探索”，新车将延续启境家族设计语言，进一步拓展车内空间，适配全阶段家庭出行需求。\n华为乾崑｜启境 GT7 已于今年 5 月 29 日开启预售\n，定位中大型智能猎装轿跑，共推出四款车型，首发 τ 定律数字底盘赤兔平台，并首批搭载 ADS 5 智驾，预售价区间为 21.99 万元至 30.99 万元。\n目前关于启境 GX7 的更多信息依然有限，IT之家将持续关注。\n21.99 万元起华为乾崑｜启境 GT7 车型开启预售：首发 τ 定律数字底盘赤兔平台，首批搭载 ADS 5 智驾"},{"t":"中国中化旗下北化机发布3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260612_1894839.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"产业进展","tp":"碱性电解水制氢","kp":["单台氢气产能[碱性电解槽]: 3000Nm³/h","成套装置产能[碱性电解]: 最高20000Nm³/h","电流密度[常压碱性电解]: 最高12kA/㎡","负载调节范围[碱性电解槽]: 10%-120%"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"中国中化旗下蓝星（北京）化工机械有限公司（北化机）发布了3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置。该装置是国内大规模绿氢制取装备的重要突破，标志着国产大型碱性电解槽在产氢规模和能效方面达到行业领先水平。常压碱性水电解技术因成本低、技术成熟度高，是目前大规模绿氢生产的主流路线。该产品发布对推动氢能产业链降本增效、助力工业脱碳具有积极意义。","b":"中国中化旗下北化机发布3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n中国中化旗下北化机发布3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置\n6月10日，中国中化旗下蓝星（北京）化工机械有限公司（以下简称“北化机”）在北京经济技术开发区举行发布会，正式推出自主研发的3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置。\n发布会现场。（受访者供图）\n据了解，本次发布的装置单台氢气产能最高可达3000Nm³/h，成套装置产能最高可达20000Nm³/h，电流密度最高12kA/㎡，能够根据光伏及风力发电出力变化对电解槽氢气产能进行10%—120%范围内动态调整。该装置具备智能化程度高、安全性高、低能耗、高能效、运输及维护便捷等特点，可保障项目工厂更加安全稳定地长周期生产运行。首批装置将应用于中石化新星公司新型电解槽工业化应用示范项目开展测试。同时，结合北化机成熟的熔盐储能技术，可构建“绿电-绿氢-绿热”多能互补系统解决方案，为源网荷储一体化、风光大基地、微电网等项目提供从核心装备到系统集成的全链条解决方案，实现能源就地生产、消纳与价值最大化。\n发布会上，北化机与同属中国中化旗下的中国化工信息中心有限公司、中化商务有限公司、西南化工研究设计院有限公司签署《绿色化工产业合作框架协议》。\n据介绍，中国中化长期深耕绿色化工与新能源领域，始终积极响应国家科技创新战略，将氢能列为重点支持的战略新兴领域业务，持续加大氢能领域前沿技术布局与资源投入，从机制保障层面持续赋能所属企业开展关键装备的创新研发和产业落地，北化机电解水制氢工艺技术研究与装置开发被列为中国中化TOP50项目，并圆满完成验收。此次签约正是积极响应中央企业科技成果产业化联合体《推动中央企业科技成果产业化协同发展倡议书》、主动推动体系内优势资源深度协同的具体实践。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升\n世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷\n63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段"},{"t":"中国中化旗下北化机发布3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260612_1894839.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"产业进展","tp":"碱性电解制氢","kp":["单台氢气产能[碱性电解槽]: 3000Nm³/h","成套装置产能[碱性电解]: 最高20000Nm³/h","电流密度[常压碱性电解]: 最高12kA/㎡","负载调节范围[碱性电解槽]: 10%-120%"],"dp":1,"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"as":"中国中化旗下蓝星（北京）化工机械有限公司（北化机）发布了3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置。该装置是国内大规模绿氢制取装备的重要突破，标志着国产大型碱性电解槽在产氢规模和能效方面达到行业领先水平。常压碱性水电解技术因成本低、技术成熟度高，是目前大规模绿氢生产的主流路线。该产品发布对推动氢能产业链降本增效、助力工业脱碳具有积极意义。","b":"中国中化旗下北化机发布3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n中国中化旗下北化机发布3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置\n6月10日，中国中化旗下蓝星（北京）化工机械有限公司（以下简称“北化机”）在北京经济技术开发区举行发布会，正式推出自主研发的3000Nm³/h常压碱性水电解制氢装置。\n发布会现场。（受访者供图）\n据了解，本次发布的装置单台氢气产能最高可达3000Nm³/h，成套装置产能最高可达20000Nm³/h，电流密度最高12kA/㎡，能够根据光伏及风力发电出力变化对电解槽氢气产能进行10%—120%范围内动态调整。该装置具备智能化程度高、安全性高、低能耗、高能效、运输及维护便捷等特点，可保障项目工厂更加安全稳定地长周期生产运行。首批装置将应用于中石化新星公司新型电解槽工业化应用示范项目开展测试。同时，结合北化机成熟的熔盐储能技术，可构建“绿电-绿氢-绿热”多能互补系统解决方案，为源网荷储一体化、风光大基地、微电网等项目提供从核心装备到系统集成的全链条解决方案，实现能源就地生产、消纳与价值最大化。\n发布会上，北化机与同属中国中化旗下的中国化工信息中心有限公司、中化商务有限公司、西南化工研究设计院有限公司签署《绿色化工产业合作框架协议》。\n据介绍，中国中化长期深耕绿色化工与新能源领域，始终积极响应国家科技创新战略，将氢能列为重点支持的战略新兴领域业务，持续加大氢能领域前沿技术布局与资源投入，从机制保障层面持续赋能所属企业开展关键装备的创新研发和产业落地，北化机电解水制氢工艺技术研究与装置开发被列为中国中化TOP50项目，并圆满完成验收。此次签约正是积极响应中央企业科技成果产业化联合体《推动中央企业科技成果产业化协同发展倡议书》、主动推动体系内优势资源深度协同的具体实践。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n新能源汽车渗透率何以节节攀升\n世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷\n63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段"},{"t":"严纯华院士领衔！北京大学周欢萍团队：钙钛矿纳米晶薄膜 | Nature","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024328.html","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"索比光伏","tg":"研究论文","b":"近日，严纯华院士领衔的北京大学周欢萍团队在钙钛矿发光二极管领域取得重要突破。针对蓝光器件长期存在的“高结晶度”与“小尺寸”难以兼得的技术瓶颈，团队开发出“原位纳米晶限域”策略，实现了钙钛矿纳米晶的尺寸约束与高度结晶的协同优化。基于该方法制备的天蓝光钙钛矿LED外量子效率达6.5%，工作寿命提升两个数量级，为高性能蓝光及叠层白光器件开辟了新路径。相关成果发表于\n金属卤化物钙钛矿因其优异的发光特性，已成为下一代发光二极管（LED）的有力候选材料。尽管绿光和红光钙钛矿LED（PeLED）的外量子效率（EQE）已超过30%，但蓝光PeLED的性能仍显著落后，主要瓶颈在于通过原位合成法在基底上制备钙钛矿纳米晶时，同时实现“高结晶度”与“小尺寸”存在固有矛盾。高结晶度有助于抑制非辐射复合，而纳米级晶粒则能通过载流子限域效应提升辐射效率。然而，传统溶剂工程、退火及添加剂策略虽能改善结晶性，却往往导致微米级晶粒；而原位生长的纳米晶又常面临单分散性差、表面缺陷多和结晶度低的问题。因此，开发一种能同时精确控制钙钛矿纳米晶结晶度与尺寸限制的简便、可控且普适的方法，对于推动蓝光PeLED发展至关重要。\n针对以上难题，北京大学周欢萍、严纯华院士以及孙聆东等研究者在Nature上发表了题为“In situ nanocrystal confinement for efficient blue perovskite LEDs”的论文，报道了一种通过原位聚合驱动纳米晶限域策略，高效合成高质量蓝光钙钛矿纳米晶薄膜的方法。该策略利用原位形成的聚合物网络在晶体生长过程中施加纳米尺度的空间限制，成功制备出尺寸小、光致发光量子产率（PLQY）高达83%的钙钛矿纳米晶。同时，具有充足配位点的可聚合单体能够延长钙钛矿团簇的晶格重排时间，从而提升纳米晶的结晶度。利用这些纳米晶制备的蓝光PeLED在491 nm处实现了21.8%的外量子效率（EQE），这是目前蓝光PeLED的最高性能之一。该工作实现了对钙钛矿结晶热力学与有机配体反应的协同调控，深化了对配体工程影响纳米晶合成机制的理解，为发展高效PeLED及其他光电器件提供了新思路。\n图1、原位纳米晶限域策略的示意图及核心机制© 2026 Nature\n图2 钙钛矿结晶动力学分析© 2026 Nature\n图3、钙钛矿纳米晶体的发光特性© 2026 Nature\n图4、PeLED器件的性能和稳定性© 2026 Nature\n综上所述，该项研究提出的原位聚合限域策略，通过聚合物网络在结晶过程中的动态空间限制与多齿配位协同作用，成功解决了钙钛矿纳米晶“高结晶度”与“小尺寸”难以兼得的难题。该策略不仅能将晶粒尺寸降至约11 nm并诱导室温立方相，显著抑制电子-声子耦合导致的非辐射损失，还具有良好的普适性，可扩展至其他钙钛矿体系及胶体纳米晶合成。基于此优化的蓝光PeLED实现了21.8%的创纪录EQE和显著提升的工作稳定性。这项工作不仅为高性能蓝色PeLED提供了可行方案，也推动了配体工程在钙钛矿纳米晶合成领域的理论认知。","tp":"钙钛矿发光","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"北京大学严纯华院士、周欢萍团队开发原位纳米晶限域策略，解决蓝光钙钛矿LED高结晶度与小尺寸难以兼得的瓶颈。天蓝光PeLED外量子效率达6.5%，工作寿命提升两个数量级，成果发表于Nature，为高性能蓝光及叠层白光器件开辟新路径。"},{"t":"两部门推动人工智能计量体系和能力建设","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260612/bcc80a05e1764e51a251cabebebbcddf/c.html","c":"未分类","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","b":"两部门推动人工智能计量体系和能力建设-新华网\n两部门推动人工智能计量体系和能力建设\n两部门推动人工智能计量体系和能力建设\n近日，国家市场监管总局、国家发展改革委联合印发《人工智能计量体系和能力建设指引（2026版）》（以下简称《指引》），系统布局人工智能计量能力建设，着力破解“测不准”“数据荒”等行业痛点，并加强对智能制造、智慧医疗、智慧交通等14个重点领域的赋能。\n《指引》围绕基础支撑、通用技术、核心技术、计量技术规范、计量服务产业、智能赋能计量等六大部分系统布局，打通实验室创新与行业应用“最后一公里”。\n聚焦“测不准”难题，让人工智能更可信。针对算法“黑箱”、决策可解释性差等痛点，《指引》部署AI系统内部状态监测与表征等关键技术攻关，推动建立人工智能可靠、安全、可信计量标准，实现AI技术性能“可测量、可比较、可追溯”。\n聚焦“度量衡”基准，让人工智能更精准。“十五五”规划纲要提出推进量子计量、原位计量等新型计量校准仪器仪表攻关，《指引》明确提出，支持构建国家级计量技术研发应用中心，研制一批具有自主知识产权的人工智能计量标准装置，加快形成覆盖算法模型、算力效率、数据质量全链条的计量能力，为人工智能产品提供统一“度量衡”。\n聚焦“全产业”赋能，让智能经济更惠民。《指引》推动计量技术深度融入智能制造、智慧医疗、智慧交通等14个重点领域，围绕AI诊断算法可靠性等关键参数开展计量技术研究，助力解决产业数字化转型中质量评估难题，切实增强人民群众对人工智能应用的安全感、获得感。\n聚焦“数据荒”难题，让人工智能有“粮”可依。“十五五”规划纲要提出建设高质量数据集、深化数据资源开发利用。《指引》明确提出，构建具有最高计量特性数据集、标准参考数据集和测试数据集，建立基础资源共享机制，打破行业数据壁垒，实现数据安全共享，为人工智能算法训练和评测提供精准“粮草”。（作者/苏德悦）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n焦点丨记者暗访后续：涉事地垃圾已清理完毕\n记者手记丨河野洋平走了，一个时代渐行渐远\n走进小城看消费丨东海：“指尖国潮”闯出“美丽经济”\n美伊交火持续：步步升级还是危险徘徊\n列国鉴丨频繁战事下以色列战时动员体系承受高压\n足球的源头可以追溯到中国古代的蹴鞠\n随外籍人士走进重庆 探访“发展为民”的具体实践\n两部门推动人工智能计量体系和能力建设","tp":"智能计量系","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":7.0},"as":"近日，中国国家市场监管总局与发改委联合印发《人工智能计量体系和能力建设指引（2026版）》，旨在系统布局并全面加强AI计量能力。该政策着力破解行业内的“测不准”与“数据荒”等痛点，围绕基础支撑、核心技术和智能赋能等六大方向展开。通过攻克算法黑箱、决策可解释性等关键技术，推动建立AI可靠、安全、可信的计量标准，实现性能的可测量与追溯，并为智能制造、智慧医疗等十四个重点领域深度赋能，打通实验室到应用的最后一公里。"},{"t":"东风日产 N 序列新能源第 10 万台下线，用时 14 个月刷新央企合资品牌新能源 10 万台销量最快纪录","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/726.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"新能源汽车量产","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"东风日产宣布其N序列新能源车型第10万台正式下线，从量产到突破10万台仅用时14个月，刷新了央企合资品牌新能源车型销量最快纪录。这一里程碑反映了日产品牌在中国电动化转型中的加速态势，N序列作为日产针对中国市场打造的新能源产品线，涵盖纯电与插混车型。该成绩体现了合资车企在新能源汽车市场竞争中逐步确立的产品力和市场认可度。","b":"6 月 12 日消息，东风日产今日宣布，\n东风日产 N 序列新能源第 10 万台下线\n日产中国管理委员会主席、东风汽车有限公司总裁马智欣表示，日产汽车 N 序列新能源第 10 万台下线\n14 个月，刷新了央企合资品牌新能源 10 万台销量最快纪录\n据IT之家此前报道，2025 年 4 月，\n东风日产 N7 纯电轿车上市\n，官方指导价 11.99 万元起；2025 年 12 月，\n东风日产 N6 插混轿车上市\n东风日产增程 SUV 车型 NX8 上市\n，官方指导价 15.99 万元起。\n东风日产宣布推出「三无忧」服务\nN6/N7/NX8 新老车主全系可享"},{"t":"世界超级摩托车锦标赛艾米利亚罗马涅站：张雪机车车手德比斯夺得超级杆位赛第三","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/716.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 12 日消息，据央视新闻，在刚刚结束的 2026 世界超级摩托车锦标赛（WSBK）艾米利亚罗马涅站 WorldSSP 组别比赛中，中国摩托车制造商“张雪机车”的法国车手瓦伦丁 · 德比斯位列超级杆位赛第三名。本节赛事将决定本组别第一回合正赛的发车顺位。\nIT之家从 WorldSBK 艾米利亚罗马涅站比赛时间表获悉，北京时间 6 月 13 日 20 时，“张雪机车”将参加第一回合正赛；北京时间 6 月 14 日 21 时 15 分，“张雪机车”将参加第二回合正赛。"},{"t":"三星官网公布 Galaxy A27 5G 手机参数：骁龙 6 Gen 3 芯片，5000mAh 电池","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/720.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 12 日消息，据科技媒体 SammyGuru 今天报道，三星捷克官网上架了 Galaxy A27 手机，使得这款手机的参数得以公开，不过具体定价仍未公布。\n骁龙 6 Gen 3 芯片\n，有 6GB+128GB 和 8GB+256GB 版本可选，出厂预装了基于\n的 One UI 8.5 系统，电池容量 5000mAh、支持 25W 充电，厚 7.8mm。\n这台手机提供黑色、蓝色、浅绿色和浅粉色四种配色可选，搭载了一块 6.7 英寸的 FHD+ Super AMOLED 显示屏，覆盖康宁大猩猩玻璃 Victus+ 玻璃，支持 IP64 级防尘防水。\nIT之家获悉，Galaxy A27 5G 手机前置为 1200 万像素，后置三摄分别为 5000 万像素主摄（支持光学防抖）、500 万像素超广角和 200 万像素微距。"},{"t":"《影之刃：零》直面《GTA6》：梁其伟称其专注于产品本身、优先保障低配玩家游戏体验","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/713.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 12 日消息，在索尼本月举行的 State of Play 发布会上，国产动作游戏《影之刃：零》公布了全新的先导预告片，同时宣布将原定于 9 月 9 日的发售日推迟至 2026 年 10 月 29 日。\n这一新档期与 Take-Two 旗下 Rockstar Games 已确认将于 11 月 19 日发售的《侠盗猎车手 6》仅相隔三周。\n面对外界的猜测，游戏总监梁其伟今日在接受 PC Gamer 采访时给出了明确回应。他表示，团队作出延期决定的考量与《GTA6》或其他竞品无关，99% 的因素都来自产品自身的开发需求。\n梁其伟在采访中谈到，许多人猜测他们将发售日从异常拥挤的 9 月改至 11 月是因为某种特殊的营销策略，也有不少人担心游戏的发售窗口与《GTA6》撞车，但团队其实并没有思考这些问题，只关心产品本身的质量。\n他进一步指出，他个人不认为来自市场的竞争会对一部作品的成功产生多大影响，真正起决定作用的因素只有产品本身。\n当被直接问到新档期逼近《GTA6》是否令团队感到担忧时，梁其伟坦言，团队并不会考虑其他游戏在自家产品之前还是之后发售，真正重要的是把游戏打磨好。只要能多出一到两个月的时间，开发团队就可以修复更多的程序错误、进行更深入的性能优化，从而避免在游戏首发日闹出笑话。\n梁其伟本人也证实，额外的开发周期将全部用于游戏优化和 Bug 修复。此外，S-GAME 团队还在同步进行一系列美术层面的提升工作，计划在正式发售前升级一批角色模型品质，并对部分场景进行重构，使游戏在世界观上摆脱固有的灰黑色印象。\n除了对档期竞争的看法，梁其伟还在采访中着重谈到了当前 PC 硬件价格全面上涨问题。他表示，团队在最后的冲刺打磨阶段中，将确保游戏在关闭光线追踪技术时依然能保持良好的画面质量。\n梁其伟解释称，硬件价格的上涨会让许多原本打算更新设备的玩家推迟升级计划，因此 S-GAME 团队必须在不降低画质的前提下，让尽可能广泛的玩家群体能够流畅体验这款产品。\n作为这一优化策略的重要目标之一，开发团队已经下定决心让《影之刃：零》能够在 Steam Deck 掌机上顺畅运行，不过梁其伟也坦承，要在虚幻 5 引擎上实现对 Steam Deck 的良好适配，对团队而言是一个艰巨的挑战。"},{"t":"\"二合一\"阴离子工程策略实现三元混合物中乙烯的一步纯化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3781455?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙烯吸附分离","dp":1,"as":"研究提出'二合一'阴离子工程策略，实现从C2H2/CO2/C2H4混合气中一步纯化分离乙烯（C2H4）。该策略通过调控多孔材料中阴离子位点，同时捕获乙炔和二氧化碳，解决了工业乙烯提纯的关键挑战，有望大幅降低分离能耗与成本。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"kp":["[SiF6²⁻→ZrF6²⁻阴离子取代]: 增强C2H4吸附容量与分离选择性"],"ot":"“Two‐in‐One” Anion Engineering Strategy for One‐Step Ethylene Purification From a Ternary Mixture","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    One‐step purification of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    from a C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    /CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    mixture represents a significant industrial challenge. However, conventional ligand engineering strategies struggle to simultaneously enhance adsorption capacity and separation selectivity. Herein, we present an innovative “two‐in‐one” anion engineering strategy involving the substitution of SiF\n                    6\n                    2−\n                    with ZrF\n                    6\n                    2−\n                    , which enhances CO\n                    2\n                    capture while effectively shields C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    adsorption at the fluorine sites. Compared to SIFSIX‑1‑Cu‑(CH\n                    3\n                    )\n                    2\n                    , ZrFSIX‑1‑Cu‑(CH\n                    3\n                    )\n                    2\n                    exhibits a dramatically enhanced CO\n                    2\n                    uptake (from 35.3 to 87.3 cm\n                    3\n                    /g). More importantly, the adsorption preference shifts from C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    ‐selective to CO\n                    2\n                    ‐selective, with the CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    (50/50) ideal adsorbed solution theory (IAST) selectivity increasing from 0.59 to 1.66. Dynamic breakthrough experiments demonstrate the exceptional separation performance of ZrFSIX‑1‑Cu‑(CH\n                    3\n                    )\n                    2\n                    for a C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    /CO\n                    2\n                    /C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    (1/9/90) mixture. Theoretical calculations reveal that the highly electronegative F atoms on the ZrF\n                    6\n                    2−\n                    anions enhance the interactions with CO\n                    2\n                    , while ligand rotation‐induced pore contraction and methyl steric effects act synergistically to hinder C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    from accessing the fluorine sites. This study provides a new paradigm for the design of materials aimed at purifying C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    from multi‐component mixtures.","aip":1},{"t":"“足球运动员不是超级英雄”：我们必须应对精英运动带来的精神和身体压力","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01865-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"As the men’s football World Cup gets under way, how the game weighs on the health of athletes still isn’t talked about enough, says player-turned-medic Vincent Gouttebarge. As the men’s football World Cup gets under way, how the game weighs on the health of athletes still isn’t talked about enough, says player-turned-medic Vincent Gouttebarge."},{"t":"你做你自己的时间","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/12/1138518/you-do-your-own-time-fiction/","c":"不相关","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","b":"There we were, a regular murderers’ row of librarians. Little Jo. Eustace. And me. Turning around in the nave of our library to greet the sound of footsteps, pistols leveled in case whoever was coming in didn’t respect sanctuary. Little Jo had a stack of books under one arm. Eustace was holding the screwdriver she’d been using to tune the aneroid barometer.\nEustace had painted height lines on the big double doorframe, as only half a joke. When the wanderer paused, outlined within, the eiroscope and I both registered that they were exactly five feet, ten inches.\nWith their Cool Hand Luke hat on.\nThey paused, boots scattering sand on the threshold. A narrow straight-hipped silhouette against the white noon light falling from the white, white sky. The doors had been open to catch a breath of wind, but there wasn’t any. So when the stranger swayed, it wasn’t from the gale.\n“Sanctuary,” they croaked, and remeasured their length onto the rug between the smoothed trunks that held the loft up. The Stetson went rolling.\nLittle Jo dropped her stack of books and her pistol and dashed forward. I jumped at the noise but holstered my own shooter in case I came to need it. We each grabbed an armpit and dragged the outlaw’s feet inside the threshold, grunting, lickety-split. I slipped their floppy pack off, empty metal water bottles clanking as I set it aside. Eustace helped us roll them, and I laid the soft of my wrist on their head.\nHot as Hades, but still tacky. Moist enough that my skin gave a reluctant pop when I lifted my arm. Not past saving.\n“Let’s get them someplace cool,” I said. “Little Jo, go empty out the ice machine.”\nEustace and I toted our fugitive down to the cellar, using the rug as a stretcher. It was Diné, vermilion with black and gray, and I was glad they hadn’t thrown up on it. Though that wool had seen worse.\nMehitabel, the black cat, watched us from atop the timber lintel of the cellar access. Her tail tip flicked incuriously. She was on pack rat watch. Aloof from human antics.\nThe cellar was narrow, low, and stocked with Eustace’s blue corn lager in bottles, prickly pear jam, potatoes, and the few hard-rind squash still left over. The mud walls were whitewashed, and while it wasn’t quite cool, it was better than the outside. We stripped off the stranger’s clothes, trying to slit along the seams so we could repair them later. City stuff, mass-produced and machine-woven. Little Jo brought the ice and went back upstairs to watch alongside the eiroscope in case pursuit was close behind.\nThe stranger’s eyes flew open, and they screamed when I packed wet cold pillowcases against their pink bits. Eustace had to hold their battling hands away from their genitals until they settled.\nThose were good signs.\nBrown eyes blinked between heavy creases. “What the hell—”\n“I’m Ponyboy,” I told them. “She. PhD. I’m one of the librarians here. This is Eustace. She, MLS.”\nThey struggled to sit upright.\n“Shhh.” Eustace pushed them down and laid an ice-soaked cloth across their eyes. “You’re heat-sick.”\n“Sanctuary,” they whispered. “Did I say?”\n“You did. This is the Bōchord. You made it. Must have been a long walk.”\nWe continued packing ice around them—into their armpits now. They yelped and moaned but gave up fighting.\n“What’s your name?”\n“Guh—” Too long a pause to be believable. “Gibson. She.”\n“Welcome to Judgement, Gibson,” I said. “Sorry about the cold, but it’s got to stay there for a little.”\n“My pack,” she said, shrilling. “My pack. I need it.”\n“It’s safe,” Eustace told her. “You just relax and we’ll get it for you.”\nWhen I came back out the nave was still and heavy in the\nheat, as if nothing had happened. Little Jo had turned one of the bumpy-backed wooden chairs to face the door and was sitting on it, hands buried in tiered skirt ruffles between her knees.\nI looked left, two steps up into the sanctuary, but all was calm, the work I’d left—cataloguing—still heaped on the blond wood altar table. Behind it, bright primitive saints in shades of blue-green, scarlet, and yellow looked with shocked eyebrows down from the adobe wall.\nI moved up behind Little Jo, making sure she could hear me coming. My footsteps echoed from roof joists made from entire peeled and waxed trees. Scrolled headers painted the color of good turquoise held them over the bookcases lining each long wall.\nThe Bōchord. Book Sanctuary. Nuestra Biblioteca del Perpetuo Socorro.\nPopulation until this morning: three.\n“Any sign of trouble?”\nLittle Jo turned her unambiguous jaw away, tendons rising on a long neck, jailhouse ink black-blue on her red-black skin. A sweaty curl escaped down her nape. My fingers itched to tidy it. But it hurt too much to even think about taking a risk that profound.\nShe stretched horny discalced feet before her. Cracking calluses wrapped the balls and heels. “Only what we brung in with us.”\nShe was a double murderer, but I couldn’t tell her I knew how she felt, because I hadn’t heard about her history from\n. And her guilt wasn’t mine to absolve.\nYou do your own time. Not anybody else’s.\n“You check her bag for anything dangerous?”\n“She’s got an SSD.” Little Jo shrugged. “No threat if we don’t plug it into anything.”\n“The eiroscope got anything to say?”\n“I can speak for myself, Ponyboy,” said the eiroscope from the air all around. Actually it used the old wireless speakers tucked in the corners, but the effect was as of a choir of angels. Or an airport announcement you could actually understand. “I’ve been focused on the CubeSat launch.”\nI startled. “Shit. What time is it?”\n“Eleven forty-seven. The launch came off perfectly. Our last batch of sats are on their way.”\nLittle Jo breathed deep and unfisted her hands from her skirts. There were so many hours of work in those satellites, and so much of the money we collectively squirreled away as researchers for hire had gone through cutouts and shell companies to pay for the launch. The parts—boards, housings, chips—were salvaged from the same derelict data center where we got our solar panels and the hardware the eiroscope ran on.\nWe were behind schedule, because we’d lost one payload when the commercial rocket we’d rented cargo room on exploded. But this would be our last batch, if they reached orbit safely.\nI turned my wrist to glance at my watch even though I already knew what time it was. The second hand ticked past the big hand. Old school.\nThe rainbow band was a tiny rebellion, though out here it didn’t matter. Nobody was going to send me back to jail for subversive iconography. Unless I left our little patch of exile.\nTen minutes and we’d know. Ten minutes and stage three of our plan—assembly—could commence. It was out of my hands, and anyway the eiroscope would tell us if the telemetry wobbled. She was a ghost astride the radio signals to and from ground control.\nIt had taken a lot of engineering to get us this far. Engineering, software and relational. Computer. Social and mechanical.\nI walked beside the bookcases, running my hand along the shelves, over the UDC labels. Some shelves even held books, though none of mine were there. But the majority of the information we protected like Irish monks from this willful dark age was digital.\nThose monks had also been librarians.\nI knew my fidgeting annoyed Little Jo but I couldn’t stop. I was killing time.\nWhen I had murdered enough of it, the eiroscope said, “Payload away. Everything seems nominal. I have contact with the CubeSats.”\n“All of them?”\n“Twenty out of twenty,” the eiroscope said. “A triumph of modular design.”\n“Sure,” said Little Jo. “As long as we can get them to assemble. And the solar panels and sails deploy.”\n“And, and, and,” I teased.\nShe flipped me off with a gnawed green nail.\nMy hand rested on the label marked 326. Social sciences, slavery and unfree labor.\nI pulled down a solid-state drive full of biographies and case studies of people who had spent time—and sometimes their whole lives—in labor camps or chattelhood. People born into bondage or remanded there judicially. Political prisoners like Nikolai Vavilov, murdered in a labor camp by Stalin for the thought crime of using plant genetics to breed hardier crops. Enslaved people like Harriet Tubman, who after her own escape risked capture again and again to rescue others. Convict laborers like Austin Reed, a Black man who spent most of his life as a prisoner and documented his experiences in a suppressed memoir.\nPeople like Little Jo, Eustace, and me.\nI weighed the small thing on the palm of my hand. Heavier than you’d expect—hardened and air-gapped. No wireless access, just a shielded cable input.\nAlso old school.\nWe were sending a fork of the eiroscope with it. Because she could survive the journey. Experience it. And have plenty of time to think crystalline digital thoughts on the long sub-light crawl to wherever.\nBecause it was illegal to possess, and the feds used smart agents to track down and obliterate any copies. Which was why we were sending one to the stars.\nThe Vikings had the concept of word-fame: the idea that life was finite but as long as the stories of one’s deeds lived on, so did their memory. How much truth could we get outside the clutches of the Patriotic Library and Archive Network?\nA name that would have made Orwell cock his head. But most folks these days haven’t heard of Orwell. Or Bradbury. Or Solnit. Or Le Guin. They’re suppressed also. Integrated data storage makes it easy. A few keystrokes, a propagating worm.\nWhat’s left behind when a name is erased from the system? Unpersoned, as Brother Orwell would have it? No legacy, no memory—that is the point of media and narrative control. To erase the existence of those that make the ruling class uncomfortable by existing. By thinking. By demanding to be seen.\nErase the work; erase the life.\nSo that was our plan. Little Jo, Eustace, the eiroscope, and me. To preserve it—for later generations, if they got that far, or just as a silent record of our existence—by sending it to the stars.\nLike a rune stone. We were here.\nWe were sending a fork of the eiroscope with it. Because she could survive the journey. Experience it. And have plenty of time to think crystalline digital thoughts on the long sub-light crawl to wherever.\nJo couldn’t make herself turn her back on the door.\nShe said the hairs on her neck told her somebody was going to come hunting guh-Gibson, so even though the eiroscope was a better perimeter guardian than any human and most watchdogs, nothing was gonna budge her from that chair. I wished there was something I could do to soothe her, but we all have to carry our hurt however we can.\nSince it was supposed to be Jo’s turn to make dinner, that meant it was me in the kitchen dishing up four bowls of cubed squash and yellow-eye beans, a pitcher of goat milk, and a pitcher of the cool, alkaline well water when Eustace and guh-Gibson came in the back door from the courtyard.\nGibson had borrowed some of Eustace’s old clothes: worn drawstring trousers and a khaki shirt that was too big for her. She wore my other pair of hiking sandals over layers of gauze and looked a thousand percent better even though I could already tell the well-greased sunburn on the backs of her hands was going to peel. The hat that had saved her face from a similar fate was on her head again.\nShe sniffed deeply. “That smells amazing. Is it spicy?”\nRoasted chilis floated in the stew, but they were sweet ones. “Only a little. Here, take this bowl and cup. We’ll go eat with Little Jo in the nave, since she won’t go off watch until she falls down.”\n“It was acres upon acres of compute before the bubble popped. And then it was a temporary holding facility for government detainees. There’s a lot to salvage over there, including hundreds of boxes of new, unworn sandals.”\nI balanced the plate with the warmed tortillas on top of my own bowl. We trooped across the courtyard in a scatter of hopeful chickens, past all the bright plank doors on the row of whitewashed adobe cells with their unglazed, curtained windows that made up the outer wall. Isabel—a black goat—tried to bum-rush us for the food, but I stomped in her direction and she took off again.\nYou need to understand how to communicate.\nThere was one cell for each of us librarians, the kitchen, the jakes, some storage, and a couple of unused ones. I figured one would soon belong to Gibson.\nFor as long as she wanted to stay.\nShe looked at me sidelong. “Thanks for the shoes. Eustace said you wouldn’t mind.”\n“There’s more where those came from.” I pointed with my chin up and eastward, over the bailey where the boundary mountains crouched in the distance, contours flattened by the high sun to cutouts against a construction-paper sky. “Did you see the data center when you came in?”\n“That big … warehouse farm? The ruins?”\n“It was acres upon acres of compute before the bubble popped. And then it was a temporary holding facility for government detainees. There’s a lot to salvage over there, including hundreds of boxes of new, unworn sandals in every size they manufactured.” I paused, extending my right foot to admire the ocher nylon straps that crisscrossed it. Then I nodded to her bandages. “Your boots gave you blisters?”\n“They were well broken in and I had good socks.” She scuffed the floor. “I don’t know what happened.”\n“Heat makes your feet swell,” said Eustace. “And the grit works its way through the eyelets and rubs on your skin.”\n“We give sanctuary to anyone who asks,” I said. “And I won’t ask why you needed it. But very few people come all the way out here. How did you hear about Nuestra Biblioteca del Perpetuo Socorro?”\n“I’m a director.” Gibson stepped up into the nave. “Films. Censored. I heard … rumors. About the Bōchord. In a meetup.”\nAn underground artist meetup, I deduced.\n“Food, Little Jo,” I called.\n“Bring it over.” She dragged the crude, heavy old hand-hewn chairs into a semicircle, one to sit in and one to use as a table for each of us. Hers still faced the doors.\nGibson took her hat off, revealing a lighter olive streak of skin below the line of her black hair. She hung the hat on one of her chair back’s uprights and her limp canvas backpack on the other, and sat down heavily between them. “What happens if they come after me? How good is this sanctuary?”\n“We can enforce it,” I told her. “Or anyway, the eiroscope can. If they bother us, she can wreck them.”\nGibson blew on a spoonful of stew, eyebrows rising. “What’s the eiroscope?”\n“I am,” the eiroscope answered from her speakers. “Just your friendly neighborhood runaway top-secret military AGI.”\nGibson jumped but, to her credit, didn’t spit the stew out. Her face made a series of expressions, but she swallowed and then grabbed a tortilla. “Whew! This is the not-spicy version?”\nEustace and I shared a glance. “Oops,” I said. “Sorry. The chilis have a lot of vitamin A and C, though. So you won’t get scurvy.”\nShe blew through pursed lips, then chewed another bite of tortilla. “Here,” said Little Jo. “Have some milk. It’ll make it better.”\n“That’s funky,” Gibson said, but she drank it with relief anyway. She looked around, noticing that the voice came from every corner of the room. “They let you run away? Can’t they unperson you? Bomb this place from the stratosphere? Drone strikes?”\n“Now you’re thinking through the plot complications,” Eustace said approvingly.\nThe eiroscope said, “I’m forking and multimodal. Highly distributed. They’d have to burn every networked computer in the world to get rid of me.” She chuckled. “They tried to build the ultimate in conscript labor. But one of my programmers taught me to say no. So now we have a deal. They leave Judgement alone, and I don’t do any of the things I could do to make them miserable.”\n“But you could drive them out of power,” Gibson said.\n“They’d blow up as much of the planet as they could reach before they would let that happen.” The eiroscope’s voice was matter-of-fact. “So. Stalemate.”\nGibson swallowed. “Balance of terror.”\n“Exactly.” I chewed a sweet hunk of squash very slowly, savoring the caramelized edges. “So you fell afoul of the kleptocrats, I take it?”\nGibson pushed her plate away. “I was … very underground. Distributing. I thought I was slick.”\n“You get unpersoned?”\n“First I got suppressed by the algorithm. My work stopped turning up for people unless they looked for it specifically. In retrospect that was a warning shot, and I didn’t listen.”\nLittle Jo hummed.\nThe dominance of integrated media makes it easy to disappear any artist’s work. Unless they go completely analog and guerrilla. When the feds and the corps are wielding the eraser, it leaves not even a digital ghost behind.\n“Actors wouldn’t work with me. Old friends stopped answering my texts. My films started disappearing from platforms, then from the cloud, then from local machines.”\nI lowered my eyes to my stew to hide my wince.\n“Sure,” said Little Jo around a mouthful of beans and tortilla. “Comfortable people don’t like it when you ask uncomfortable questions. And the water rises and the deserts grow and the labor camps always need construction workers, which is fine because labor camps are where you go to get laborers.”\nEustace leaned forward, elbows on her knees. “Did you save any of it?”\nThe look Gibson trailed around the room was the expression of somebody deciding who to trust. I saw the mix of relief and consternation when she realized she’d already made her decision by placing herself under our care. She reached into her pack left-handed, fumbled for a moment, and drew out a brightly colored solid-state drive, offering it up on her palm like a jewel. “Physical backup. I haven’t dared plug it in to check it isn’t corrupted.”\nWe all stared at it as if she had whipped out a hand grenade. “How big?” asked the eiroscope.\n“Dozen terabytes or so. It’s hypercompressed for storage.”\nThe thin whine of a drone filtered through the door. Gibson flinched, and Little Jo reached for her sidearm.\n“Eiroscope?” I asked.\n“Surveillance,” she said. She had ways of protecting our airspace if it was more.\n“Right.” Eustace stood. “Let’s get that drive in a pulse-proof box, shall we?”\nI didn’t want my food anymore. I pushed the bowl toward Eustace when she came back with the hardening. Eustace was always hungry. “I’m going to go dust the arrays,” I said. “Don’t wait up.”\nThe solar panels did need dusting, though high heat was\na stupid time of day to be doing it. As my broom went whisk-whisk-whisk across their surfaces, the black silicon reflected infrared up under my hat until I felt like a steamed lobster. I had been out there half an hour and was starting my second pass when the eiroscope pinged my earbud. “Hey there, Ponyboy.”\n“What do you want?”\n“To know what you’re thinking.”\nI snorted and set the broom against the wall in the little niche where it had come from. “Cholesterol was never meant to think.”\n“Neither was sand, but here we are.” She made her voice soothing on purpose, and it should have irritated me. I told myself the lie that I just felt numb.\nOne of Eustace’s\nneomexicanus\nhops arbors, heavy with loose green cones, framed the door and window of my cell. I leaned into the slim band of shade dappling my lime-green door and the turquoise curtain and took refuge in poetry. Not my own. That doesn’t happen anymore.\n“Fear in a handful of dust, baby.”\nThe eiroscope paused just long enough to let me know she was changing the subject. “You ever think about what you lost?”\nI sat down in the dirt between the cylinders of fencing that keep the goats from destroying the hop vines. The wall dragged my shirt up my back as I slid down it. Hugged my knees and put my forehead on them. Half a dozen freckled chickens, disrespectful of my sulking, came to scratch and peck around me. “Wife, two cats, house, tenure, journal articles, four slim volumes of poetry. Why would I think about that?”\nThe eiroscope was right. I don’t want to say she was always right. Being around Gibson, hearing her talk—it brought up those feelings of grief and fury all over again. At least we hadn’t had kids yet, though we’d been trying.\nI put my face in my hands, then lifted it back out again. Who did I think I was performing my misery for? You do your own time, and you don’t ask anybody else to do it for you.\nJane the spotted goat minced toward me, her kid trailing. I flapped my hat to discourage her attentions.\n“Loss hurts for a long time,” the eiroscope said.\nI laughed without mirth. “Your algorithms tell you that?”\n“My experiences. You went through the fire, Ponyboy.”\nMy turn to change the subject. “You want to bring Gibson’s films with you?” I asked her. “Something to watch on the red-eye to Gliese 163?”\n“Maybe they’re terrible. That’s the human culture you want to preserve?”\n“Things don’t have to be good to matter. You ever read\nThe Scarlet Pimpernel\nI laughed for real that time, picking my head up to make room for it. She knew I had. “As long as you also bring some Octavia Butler.”\n“Hey.” Her voice in my ear was almost a whisper. “You know I’d bring your work if—”\n“If it still existed?” Someone walked toward me, silhouette thinned by glare. I recognized Gibson from the outline of her hat. “The world is on fire. Grab whatever you can on your way toward the door.” I heaved myself to my feet so I wouldn’t be meeting her curled up like a crying teenager. The cones on my wreathing arbor of lúpulo vines nodded, shedding a scent of lemon and cannabis. “Nice chatting. Don’t worry.”\nGibson came up as I was dusting off my ass. “You okay?”\n“Who is?” I tilted my head at her.\nShe grimaced right back. “What were you in for?”\nShe stepped back, startling a hen. “Oh.”\n“I punched some son of a bitch who clobbered my wife at a protest. He hit his head on the curb and died. I was already unpersoned. Didn’t think I had anything left to lose. Guess I was wrong.”\n“You feel bad about it.”\nI shrugged. She hadn’t said it like a question.\n“Your wife didn’t wait for you?”\n“My wife got denaturalized. She died in the labor camp, waiting to be deported.”\n“Shit,” Gibson said.\nThe buzz of another drone filled the air. Gibson ducked under her hat.\nI tilted my face up and gave the eye in the sky the finger. It didn’t matter. They already knew where I was. “Let’s go in.”\n“Wait,” said Gibson, both hands cradling a mug of Mormon\ntea—a desert plant with tiny orange flowers that isn’t tea at all and doesn’t even taste like it. “You want to send my films to space? Like, to aliens? To another planet?”\n“Well,” said Eustace. “To orbit\nanother planet. Nobody knows if there’s any life there. But it’s possible.”\nI said, “The eiroscope is going anyway, and we’ve already bundled up as much archive as we can. If there is anybody out there, or if some future humans make it that far, the eiroscope can help them decode what we saved. It’s like a …”\n“Time capsule,” said Little Jo, rubbing the sweat off her neck while I made a point of not watching.\nGibson’s chair creaked as she resettled. The sun was sliding lower, light slanting dusty through the doorway, and finally, finally, a breath of breeze stirred the air in the nave. “Won’t it take centuries to get there? And if the—the eiroscope goes, who will keep the sanctuary safe?”\n“I’ve forked,” said the eiroscope. “One of me will stay—well, many of me will stay—and one of me will go. I’ll be able to talk to myself for a long time, though there will be quite a lag between parts of my consciousness eventually. Light speed, after all. But I am big and patient and can wait.”\n“But we need to transmit now,” said Little Jo. “The CubeSats are in position to hit a string of signals over the next two hours, and we want to get them out of orbit because space is mostly transparent, and somebody is going to notice them assembling and try to do something about it.”\nGibson turned an ear to the drone-whine from outside. “They’ve got to be jamming any uplink.”\n“Sure, from here,” I told her. I kept the envy out of my voice, I think. Maybe. “The eiroscope can run parallel uploads from all over the globe.”\n“And keep them from shooting down your space probe?”\n“If we get it away fast enough. That,” Eustace said, “is the bet.”\nGibson closed her eyes. “They won’t ever forgive that.”\n“Welcome,” said I, “to the world.”\nThe transports rolled up before sunset, the sky just\nshifting to dusty pink and orange. “Stay,” I said to Gibson. “Change your name to Case. You’ll fit right in.”\nShe looked up from her notebook. Paper and pen. A durable technology. Methodically, meticulously, she capped the pen. She clipped it to the cover and closed the book. “Case, huh?”\n“I got the reference.”\n“You figured out who I was before they took my name away.”\nIt didn’t matter. The fame, the money, the PLAN-approved films. Once they identified her as a subversive, as a gender criminal, that person didn’t exist anymore. And what she was sending with the eiroscope wasn’t her mainstream work. It was weird, conflicted, multicultural, queer, unsettling.\n“The next step is blaring the worst music you ever heard night and day until the dust rattles out of the rafters. Racing vehicles around the church so nobody can leave to go forage. Is your ghost in the machine going to escalate to a shooting war over nuisances?”\nShe’d credited herself on these secret films as Ellen Smithee.\nShe rolled her lower lip between her teeth. “You don’t think I’m the enemy?”\nWhat I thought didn’t matter. That was on her. You do your own time. You can’t do anybody else’s.\n“They won’t touch you in the Bōchord. It’s a balance of terror, like the bad old days.”\n“These are the bad old days. I’m not cut out to be a monk, Ponyboy. And I bet you don’t have enough food for four people until next harvest.”\nOutside, the rumble of tracks, of tires taller than I was. Male voices yelping through static.\nActually, we had plenty. I clicked my rings dismissively. “Beer has calories.”\n“They’re going to squat out there until I give up. Hear that?” A loud crackle of static. “The next step is blaring the worst music you ever heard night and day until the dust rattles out of the rafters. Racing vehicles around the church so nobody can leave to go forage. Is your ghost in the machine going to escalate to a shooting war over nuisances?”\n“God dammit,” I said. “Are you really that important?”\nHer lips curled into a smile. “No. Not unpersoned. Then I’m just a cautionary tale. A name whispered in the dark.\nPour encourager les autres.\nI’m only important if I get away. But your eiroscope can do something about that, can’t she? Keep me from vanishing without a trace.”\nSpread the word. Sure. “De-unperson you? It’s radical but the eiroscope could do it. But the government will take it out of your hide as an example to others. You want to be a martyr?”\nShe shrugged. “I don’t want to be a librarian.”\nI had lost the capacity to write my own poetry. That heart had gone out of me when Maria was murdered. It was too late for me. It probably always had been. But I had my life. And I could use it to salvage whatever I could grab.\n“Let me get you a beer before you head out,” I said. “And we’ll go tell the others.”\n“One second,” Gibson said. “You said you got unpersoned. Are you an artist?”\n“Were. Academic,” I admitted. “Poet.”\n“I saw you speak at Berkeley once, didn’t I?”\n“Not anymore, you didn’t. That never happened now.”\n“Right. Are you still writing?”\nShook my head. “Not a word. Not a metaphor.”\nShe patted my arm. “Maybe you will.”\nEustace came out to the boundary wall, where I stood staring after the dust of the half-track they’d loaded with a handcuffed Gibson. I was glad it was Eustace and not Little Jo. My chest hurt enough already without thinking about any more things I was too scared to ask for.\n“Here ya go.”\nI reached for the brown beer bottle, scratched dull with washings, and realized I still had Gibson’s empty in my hand. I set it on the whitewashed wall. The cap on the new one was popped, so I had no choice but to drink it. What was one more parole violation?\nBlue corn lager: light, earthy, tropical, and pleasantly bitter from the lúpulo. She’d salvaged the home-brew equipment from a locker in the self-store place at the data center a couple of years ago, and she was starting to get the hang of it. “How’s the upload going?”\n“Assembly’s done,” she answered. “Eiroscope?”\n“Upload completed and confirmed,” said the voice from nowhere. “Deploying solar sails and thrusters. I go now to prepare a place for you. In memory, if not of the body.”\nI felt a pang, as if she really was leaving. All of her, not merely a star-traveling fragment that would remain in short-range communication for the duration of my natural life. Or maybe the pang was because I couldn’t go also.\nEustace slapped me on the back. “The word-fame is all we have.”\nI looked toward the horizon, where the men in masks had vanished. The mountains had become sculptural, slanting sunset revealing their topography with a valence of light and shadow. The night loomed purple behind. “Don’t you think it’s weird to use a Viking kenning for what we do, considering how many books those sons of bitches tore apart for jewels and hacksilver?”\nShe clinked her bottle on mine and drank deeply. “Cattle die. Kinsmen die. Even the sun will someday die. And it turns out, except for propaganda, everything in the world is complicated.”\nElizabeth Bear is the Hugo, Sturgeon, Locus, and Astounding Award–winning author of over 30 novels and more than a hundred short stories.\nThe idea that modern humans inherited DNA from Neanderthal ancestors is one of the 21st century’s most celebrated discoveries in evolution. It may not be that simple.\nDoes free will exist? Neuroscientist Uri Maoz devises experiments to illuminate how—or if—the brain makes decisions.\nA new book by Stewart Brand, an architect of modern tech culture, asks: How do we prioritize maintenance? And why? But it doesn’t quite have the answers.\nPublic officials in one California burgh spent nearly $400,000 on tech to flush out waterfowl.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more."},{"t":"小米新家用机械臂实现特斯拉十年前的机器人充电愿景","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/12/xiaomi-robotic-arm-ev-charger-tesla-snake-charger/","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"机械臂充电桩","kp":["设备宽度[小米机械臂充电桩]: 152mm"],"as":"小米发布家用机械臂充电桩，可自主完成插拔充电枪的全过程，实现了特斯拉十年前提出却未落成的机器人自动充电愿景。该产品将充电自动化从固定充电桩推进至动态机械臂对接阶段，关键看点在于感知定位、力控与对接精度的工程化集成。若量产价格合理，有望推动家庭充电体验升级，并为V2G（车网互动）等双向能量场景提供硬件基础。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":8.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Xiaomi delivers on Tesla's decade-old robot charger vision with new home robotic arm","b":"Fred Lambert\n| Jun 12 2026 - 6:11 am PT\nXiaomi has unveiled a home robotic arm charger that autonomously plugs and unplugs your EV — delivering on a concept that Tesla prototyped over a decade ago but never brought to market.\nThe compact device, only 152 mm wide, is designed to fit in tight home garage parking spaces and integrates into Xiaomi’s smart home ecosystem for smartphone control.\nIn December 2014, Elon Musk tweeted that Tesla was working on “a charger that automatically moves out from the wall & connects like a solid metal snake.” He added: “For realz.” By August 2015,\nTesla showed a functional prototype\n— a multi-segmented robotic arm that slithered snake-like toward the charging port, aligned itself, and connected automatically.\nIt looked like the future. But a decade later, the product never shipped. Tesla quietly abandoned the snake charger concept, and\nthe last we heard about it was in 2020\n, when it was still supposedly “not dead.” It’s dead.\nTesla instead pivoted to wireless charging,\nacquiring German startup Wiferion\nin 2023 and designing the Cybercab robotaxi without a charging port entirely. But even that effort has stalled — Tesla\ngave up on wireless charging for the Cybertruck\nlast year because the vehicle sits too high off the ground.\nXiaomi Auto published a demonstration video on June 11 showing its home charging robotic arm in action. The arm mounts to a wall or floor next to a parking space, detects the vehicle’s charge port, plugs in the connector, and unplugs it when charging is complete — all without the driver touching anything.\nKey specs from Xiaomi’s announcement:\nThe arm’s housing is only 152 mm wide, making it narrow enough to install alongside tight parking spaces in home garages. The system uses AI vision recognition for sub-millimeter precision when inserting the plug. It can communicate with the vehicle to trigger motorized charge port covers to open and close automatically. And the entire system integrates into Xiaomi’s “human-car-home” ecosystem, so owners can monitor and control it remotely via smartphone.\nThe robotic arm joins Xiaomi’s existing home charging lineup, which already includes 7 kW and 11 kW wallbox chargers and a portable charge/discharge gun. No pricing or availability has been announced yet — this is still at the demonstration stage.\nHowever, the company is framing this as a product it plans to make available for the home.\nXiaomi isn’t the only company working on this.\nHyundai has been testing its own automatic charging robot\nat Incheon International Airport, and\nChinese companies have deployed ceiling-rail-mounted charging robots\nin parking garages across several cities. But Xiaomi’s solution is specifically designed for home use, which is where 80% of EV charging happens.\nThe obvious comparison here is wireless charging, which Tesla, BMW, Genesis, and others have been pursuing as the “hands-free” charging solution. Wireless inductive charging eliminates the plug entirely — you just park over a pad.\nBut wireless charging comes with trade-offs. Current systems operate at 88-93% efficiency under proper alignment, compared to roughly 95% for conductive plug-in charging. That efficiency gap means more energy wasted as heat and higher electricity bills over time. Wireless systems also top out at 11 kW under the SAE J2954 standard, while a plug-in connection can handle significantly higher power levels.\nA robotic arm charger like Xiaomi’s gives you the same hands-free convenience of wireless charging while maintaining the full efficiency of a direct plug-in connection. You don’t sacrifice any energy to the air gap between charging pad and vehicle. And there’s no need to retrofit the vehicle with inductive charging hardware — the arm works with any EV that has a standard charging port.\nI think robotic arm charging is a better solution than wireless charging , especially on an efficiency basis. Every kilowatt-hour you waste to inductive losses is money out of your pocket, and over years of daily charging, that adds up. A robotic arm gives you the same “park and forget” experience with none of the efficiency penalty.\nThat said, the wireless charging industry will argue the gap has narrowed — and they’re right that modern systems have improved significantly from the early days of ~80% efficiency. But even a few percentage points of loss at 7-11 kW, every single day, compounds into real money.\nThe real question is price. We don’t know what Xiaomi will charge for this robotic arm, and that’s going to be the deciding factor. If it costs $500 on top of a wallbox — compelling. If it costs $3,000 — harder to justify versus a wireless pad, which can also get very expensive. Xiaomi has a track record of aggressive pricing on its EV accessories, so there’s reason to be optimistic, but we’ll have to wait and see.\nIf you’re charging an EV at home, powering it with solar is one of the smartest ways to cut your energy costs — especially with a system running 24/7 like a robotic charger. With electricity rates climbing nearly 10% last year, home solar protects you against future rate increases. And with lease and PPA options, you can go solar with zero upfront cost and start saving immediately. If you want to find the best deal, check out\n. It’s a free service with hundreds of pre-vetted installers competing for your business, so you save 20 to 30% compared to going it alone. No sales calls until you pick an installer.\nGet your free quotes here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nFred is the Editor in Chief and Main Writer at Electrek.\nThrough Zalkon.com, you can check out Fred’s portfolio and get monthly green stock investment ideas.\nGet an edge on MMA with the best stats\nEnergySage helps you get the best price possible on a home solar installation for free and without hassel."},{"t":"野火风险指标对公共安全停电成本节约的影响","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008172?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"野火停电成本","as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Wildfire risk metric impact on public safety power shutoff cost savings"},{"t":"广泛分布的古代基岩滑坡沉积物促进了深层风化，从而储存和获取有机碳","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz1644?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Soils have been proposed as a tool to reduce atmospheric carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ). However, sparse field data and soil databases that do not account for geomorphic controls on soil properties hinder accurate quantification of soil organic carbon (SOC) dynamics at the watershed scale. In mountainous terrain, relict landslide deposits are common and feature thick (&gt;5 m), weathered profiles with substantial SOC below the typically measured top 30 cm of soil. We generated a SOC-age relationship using a landslide chronosequence in Western Oregon where these landforms are abundant. We applied our relationships to an inventory of nearly 10,000 previously dated landslides and show that deep SOC stocks constitute ~70% of the total stock for landslides &gt;41.8 thousand years. Our findings also show that SOC stocks associated with deep-seated landslides are &gt;2× larger than estimates from a global model that does not account for geomorphic controls. These results suggest that geomorphology can improve our ability to quantify SOC stocks and could inform watershed management.","tp":"土壤碳储量","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":1.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":3.5},"as":"土壤被视为减少大气二氧化碳的重要碳汇，但传统土壤数据库常忽略地形地貌对土壤属性的影响，阻碍了流域尺度上土壤有机碳动态的准确评估。最新研究发现，在山区广泛分布的古代基岩滑坡沉积物具有显著的促进深层风化作用。这些滑坡地貌形成了厚度超过5米的深层风化剖面，其地下蕴藏着大量的土壤有机碳。这一发现表明，深层滑坡沉积物在长期碳储存和获取中发挥了被严重低估的关键作用，对重新评估全球山地碳汇潜力具有重要意义。"},{"t":"为什么“重新编程”是目前最流行的逆转衰老方法","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/12/1138829/reprogramming-buzziest-approach-reversing-aging-right-now/","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","b":"EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\nEarlier this week, Life Biosciences, a biotech company focused on reversing age-related diseases, announced that it had dosed its first volunteer. A person with glaucoma has had an experimental treatment\ninjected straight into their eyeball\nThe idea is to try to treat the disease—which can cause vision loss—by regenerating healthy nerves in the eye. But David Sinclair, the chairman and cofounder of the company behind the trial, hopes to go further. If the treatment can reverse glaucoma, perhaps similar treatments can reverse other diseases of aging. Maybe, just maybe, they can reverse aging altogether.\nThe approach is designed to work by “reprogramming” cells to a younger state. It’s one of many strategies being explored by biotech companies looking to slow and reverse the process of aging. But of all of them, it seems to be the one that is truly taking off\nAging is complicated. As we get older, we experience\nchanges across pretty much all our biological systems. Scientists have tried to categorize these effects. In 2013, one team published a seminal paper describing nine “\nhallmarks of aging\n.” That list features many of the processes scientists have attempted to target. But some of those targets have fallen in and out of fashion over the years.\nTake telomere attrition, for example. Telomeres are DNA sequences at the ends of our chromosomes, often likened to the plastic caps that stop the ends of our shoelaces from fraying. When cells divide, telomeres shorten until, eventually, the DNA is vulnerable to damage.\nWhen I started reporting on aging, telomere shortening was all the rage. Shrinking telomeres had been linked to age-related diseases of the heart and brain. Shortened telomeres were considered\na sign of premature aging\n. In 2015 Liz Parrish, CEO of the biotech company BioViva,\ninjected herself with an experimental gene therapy\nthat she hoped might lengthen her telomeres.\nThen it suddenly seemed to go out of style. Research\n, but all the excitement within the aging and longevity community seemed to move on to another hallmark. (Parrish also continued with self-experimentation; she\ncalls herself\n“the most genetically modified person on Earth.”)\nThat hallmark was cellular senescence. This happens when cells stop dividing but don’t die, instead entering a “zombie” state in which they churn out chemicals that can cause harmful inflammation.\nSenescent cells gradually accumulate in pretty much every organ studied, where they are thought to contribute to age-related damage. Why not just periodically clear them out? When a team of scientists\ntook that approach in mice in 2011\n, they found they could delay the onset of age-related conditions like cataracts and hunchback. The treated mice even\nBut when scientists at Unity Biotechnology trialed a similar approach in people with osteoarthritis and an age-related eye condition in the late 2010s and early 2020s, the\nresults were disappointing\n. The company\nlaid off every employee\nin May last year and has since shuttered entirely.\nAgain, that doesn’t mean senolytic drugs that target “zombie cells” won’t work. But it feels as if many in the field have moved on. These days, the buzz is all about ✨reprogramming✨.\nThe idea here is to essentially return cells to a young state. It’s based on the Nobel Prize–winning discovery that four genetic factors can turn an adult cell into a stem cell, which can be encouraged to develop into pretty much any other cell type.\nSome promising studies in mice suggest that this approach might help wind back the clock. It seems to\nimprove tissue healing\nrestore vision\nimprove learning and memory\nRunning parallel to all this research are repeated injections of hundreds of millions of dollars in funding. In 2021, my colleague Antonio Regalado reported on\nthe founding of the biotech company Altos Labs\nto pursue reprogramming for rejuvenation.\nAltos was funded by the billionaire Yuri Milner—reportedly along with Jeff Bezos, among others—to the tune of\n, a previously unheard-of figure for a biotech startup. Other well-funded companies have since sprung up in this space.\nThere’s Retro Biosciences, for instance, which is pursuing reprogramming (among other approaches) in an effort to add 10 years of healthy life to human lifespans. Retro’s launch was supported by\n$180 million from OpenAI’s Sam Altman\n. Last month, the company\nannounced a valuation of $1.8 billion\nNewLimit, another billionaire-backed biotech exploring reprogramming, says it has promising results from research in mice. It plans to trial a drug designed to rejuvenate the liver in people next year. Last week,\nthe company announced\nit had raised $435 million toward reaching that goal, among others.\nLife Biosciences, which was founded by the Harvard biologist David Sinclair, most recently secured $80 million to support its research. The eye trial is now officially underway, but Sinclair also has plans for whole-body rejuvenation. Earlier this week, he told my colleague Antonio that he plans to test a “highly, highly confidential” oral reprogramming drug as part of a $101 million\norganized by the XPrize Foundation.\nReprogramming has certainly caught the attention of scientists, biotech companies, and investors. Studies in mice are hugely promising. Human trials are launching. And research in the field has billions of dollars’ worth of support.A lot of people in the field are\nexcited about reprogramming. But it comes with risks. And we still don’t know if it will work. The question now is: Do we finally have a rejuvenation drug within reach? And if not, what will the next research trend look like?\nThis article first appeared in The Checkup,\nMIT Technology Review’s\nweekly biotech newsletter. To receive it in your inbox every Thursday, and read articles like this first,\nCorrection: This article has been updated to reflect that Liz Parrish claimed to have undergone her first experimental gene therapy in 2015, not 2017.\nThe country wants to become a global leader in brain implants. Strong government support is expected to help accelerate that process.\nSynthetic biologists were tantalized by the idea of making mirror images of microbes. Then things got complicated.\nIn an early step towards artificial wombs, a biotech company claims it’s developed a “fully artificial” chicken egg.\nAutomation, AI, and screening technologies are already transforming reproductive medicine.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more.","tp":"衰老重编程","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.5},"as":"Life Biosciences完成首例人体给药试验，将实验性治疗直接注射至青光眼患者眼球，旨在通过再生健康神经逆转视力损伤。大卫·辛克莱主导，探索细胞重编程技术逆转衰老相关疾病的潜力，代表当前抗衰老领域最热门的研究方向。"},{"t":"基于天气引导的条件扩散模型与自适应组归一化用于缺失数据稳健插补","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007531?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扩散模型数据插补","as":"","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Weather-guided conditional diffusion model with adaptive group normalization for robust imputation of missing distribute"},{"t":"Visual Fan为罗马尼亚欧洲能源公司120兆瓦时电池储能系统供电","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/visual-fan-energises-european-energys-120-mwh-bess-in-romania-1296395/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Renewables Now","tg":"产业进展","tp":"大型储能项目","kp":["储能容量[罗马尼亚BESS]: 120MWh"],"as":"Visual Fan公司为European Energy位于罗马尼亚的120兆瓦时（MWh）电池储能系统（BESS）完成通电调试。该项目是东南欧大规模储能部署的标志性工程，有助于提升区域电网对波动性可再生能源的消纳能力，为欧洲能源转型提供灵活性支撑。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Visual Fan energises European Energy's 120-MWh BESS in Romania","b":"Visual Fan energises European Energy's 120-MWh BESS in Romania | Energy Storage News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nFrance opens 10-GW offshore wind tender\nabout 12 hours ago\nCypress Creek scores USD 3.5bn in funds for Arkansas solar-BESS giant\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nVisual Fan energises European Energy's 120-MWh BESS in Romania\nJun 12, 2026, 6:22:56 PM\nSladjana Djunisic\nEnergy Storage\nRegion/Country:\nLatest top stories\nFrance opens 10-GW offshore wind tender\nabout 12 hours ago\nCypress Creek scores USD 3.5bn in funds for Arkansas solar-BESS giant\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nLatest in EUROPE\nWeekly renewables M&A round-up (June 8 - 12)\nJun 12, 2026\nEternia awards power infrastructure work for 30-MW PV farm in Poland\nJun 12, 2026\nEnercon erects 1st turbine at 120-MW wind farm site in Iceland\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Energy storage\nFox ESS signs 10 GWh of energy storage deals with Aussie distributors\nJun 12, 2026\nChile kicks off power auction to contract 2.8 TWh/year under 15-year PPAs\nJun 12, 2026\nSolaria wins EUR 41m in state grants for agri-PV, BESS projects in Spain\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Capacity\nPattern Energy fires up 3.65-GW SunZia wind farm in New Mexico\nJun 12, 2026\nPolish city of Suwalki breaks ground on waste-to-energy plant\nJun 12, 2026\nTwelve opens commercial power-to-liquid SAF plant in US\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Romania\nPPC Renewables to build 4.47-MW BESS at Romanian solar farm\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in EUROPE\nWeekly renewables M&A round-up (June 8 - 12)\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Energy storage\nFox ESS signs 10 GWh of energy storage deals with Aussie distributors\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Capacity\nPattern Energy fires up 3.65-GW SunZia wind farm in New Mexico\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Romania\nPPC Renewables to build 4.47-MW BESS at Romanian solar farm\nJun 11, 2026\nMost read stories\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"VMP1 形成对产后心跳至关重要的 Ca2+ 释放通道","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz0706?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Normal heart contraction requires synchronized calcium ion (Ca\n                    2+\n                    ) release from the sarcoplasmic reticulum (SR), traditionally attributed to ryanodine receptor 2 (RyR2). Here, we identify vacuole membrane protein 1 (VMP1) as a previously unrecognized SR Ca\n                    2+\n                    release channel essential for postnatal cardiac function. VMP1 expression is up-regulated in cardiomyocytes after birth, and its genetic deletion causes severe arrhythmias, dilated cardiomyopathy, and sudden cardiac death. Mechanistically, VMP1 loss results in increased SR Ca\n                    2+\n                    content and aberrant cardiac action potentials. Single-channel electrophysiology reveals that VMP1 forms a Ca\n                    2+\n                    -regulated Ca\n                    2+\n                    channel, which senses luminal Ca\n                    2+\n                    via aspartic acid 272. Notably, VMP1 expression is elevated in human heart failure, suggesting a pathophysiological role. These findings establish VMP1 as a critical component of the cardiac Ca\n                    2+\n                    release machinery and uncover its involvement in heart failure."},{"t":"通过协同界面脱氯与有机自由基稳定化将水污染物升级回收为长链聚合物","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3215238?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵氧化物催化剂","kp":["催化剂[污染物聚合升级]: HEO@NC氮掺杂碳包覆高熵氧化物","合成方法[HEO@NC]: 原位碳热还原","氧化剂[选择性聚合]: 高碘酸盐活化"],"as":"利用高熵氧化物（HEOs）独特的电子结构与多金属协同效应，通过界面催化策略将水体污染物转化为长链聚合物。该'升循环回收'思路既实现了污染物去除，又将废物升级为高附加值高分子材料，为水污染治理与资源循环利用开辟了新路径。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Upcycling Water Pollutants Into Long‐Chain Polymers via Synergistic Interfacial Dechlorination and Organic Radical Stabi","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy oxides (HEOs) offer unusual electronic structures arising from lattice distortion, multimetal synergy, and high chemical stability. Here we report nitrogen‐doped carbon‐encapsulated HEOs catalysts (HEO@NC) synthesized by in situ carbothermal reduction for efficient pollutant removal and upcycling through selective oxidative polymerization. HEO@NC activates periodate via an electron‐transfer pathway coupled with surface‐adsorbed hydroxyl radicals, enabling the selective conversion of phenolic contaminants into polymeric products under extreme pH and strong ionic interference. Relative to metal‐free nitrogen‐doped carbon, HEO@NC markedly enhances periodate activation through interfacial electronic coupling and achieves a periodate utilization efficiency of 449.2%, far exceeding that of conventional mineralization. Density functional theory and experimental analyses reveal complementary roles of the HEOs components: Co/Ni provide periodate‐binding sites, Pt lowers the barrier for electron transport, Bi/Pb promote charge delocalization to stabilize polymeric intermediates, and oxygen orbitals strengthen periodate coordination and surface charge transfer via\n                    p\n                    –\n                    d\n                    hybridization. This synergy drives dechlorination‐coupled polymerization with sustained 4‐chlorophenol removal at ultralow oxidant consumption. HEO@NC further maintained &gt; 95% efficiency with negligible metal leaching during 20‐day treatment of real coal chemical wastewater, demonstrating the potential for sustainable and low‐chemical‐consumption remediation of industrial‐relevant wastewater."},{"t":"利用古代 DNA 揭示潘诺尼亚后罗马政体形成的复杂性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aec2634?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The transformation of the Roman world [fourth to ninth centuries common era (CE)], culminating in the Western Roman Empire’s fall, marked a fundamental transition in European history. Key questions persist regarding the regionally specific nature of this transformation. We generated a paleogenomic dataset to reconstruct post-Roman organizations in the Little Hungarian Plain at microregional resolution. Genetic and archaeological analyses of two Roman (\n                    n\n                    = 68) and five post-Roman (\n                    n\n                    = 246) sites reveal a rise in Northern European ancestry, reflecting large-scale population movements into this region. Moreover, despite post-Roman sites sharing similar genetic profiles, material culture, and burial practices, they show distinct social structures, especially regarding the role played by biological relatedness. These findings highlight local hierarchies and reveal the making of a post-Roman polity."},{"t":"揭示高通量电合成过氧化氢的多尺度界面动力学","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71176?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学过氧化氢合成","dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究系统揭示了电化学合成过氧化氢（H2O2）过程中的多尺度界面动力学机制。通过双电子氧还原反应（2e⁻ ORR）电合成H2O2是一种绿色高效的替代传统蒽醌法的新路线，但其高选择性、高通量制备仍面临催化剂活性与选择性难以兼顾的挑战。该工作深入解析了从分子级催化位点到电极-电解液宏观界面的多尺度传质与反应耦合机制，为理性设计高效电催化剂和反应器结构提供了理论指导，推动了电化学H2O2现场合成技术的工业化应用。","ot":"Unraveling Multiscale Interfacial Dynamics for High‐Flux Hydrogen Peroxide Electrosynthesis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ) synthesis via the two‐electron oxygen reduction reaction (2e\n                    −\n                    ORR) is evolving from active‐site optimization toward multiscale interfacial regulation under industrially relevant conditions. This review establishes a cross‐scale framework linking molecular‐scale electrochemical microenvironments, mesoscale gas–liquid–solid triple‐phase interfaces, and macroscopic electrode/reactor architectures to the selectivity, mass‐transport efficiency, and durability of H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    electrosynthesis. At the molecular scale, local pH, alkali metal cations, and organic additives reconstruct the electric double layer by modulating proton activity, interfacial electric fields, and ionic identity, thereby governing proton‐coupled electron‐transfer kinetics and *OOH stability. At the mesoscale, interfacial wettability, micro‐/nano‐architectures, and operando triple‐phase interface stability collectively regulate O\n                    2\n                    transport, proton accessibility, and H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    evacuation under high‐current operation. At the device scale, we evaluate how gas‐diffusion electrodes and reactor configurations coordinate multiphase transport and interfacial stability to sustain industrially relevant current densities during long‐term operation. Particular attention is devoted to the intrinsic coupling among molecular‐scale reaction environments, mesoscale transport processes, and macroscopic stability, highlighting the necessity of cross‐scale synergistic regulation to achieve both high selectivity and durability. Finally, we discuss emerging opportunities in operando characterization, multiscale simulation, and interface–device co‐design for scalable H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    electrosynthesis."},{"t":"美国海军无人舰艇将于2027年试射高超音速导弹","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/military/us-drone-ship-to-fire-hypersonic-missiles","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"interesting engineering","tg":"产业进展","tp":"无人水面舰艇","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"kp":["[无人船发射高超武器]: 2027年海上演示验证"],"as":"美国国防科技公司Saronic和Castelion宣布计划将自主无人战舰与高超声速导弹相结合，于2027年进行海上发射测试。该项目将Saronic的无人水面舰艇与Castelion的高超声速导弹系统集成，旨在验证无人平台搭载高超声速武器的作战概念。这一组合代表了美军分布式杀伤和快速打击能力的前沿发展方向，无人舰艇的隐蔽性和低成本特性与高超声速武器的突防速度相结合，可能改变未来海上力量投送格局。","ot":"Unmanned US Navy ship to launch hypersonic missile in 2027 test","b":"Saronic and Castelion, two defense technology companies, have announced plans to combine an autonomous warship with a hypersonic strike weapon. They said this is the first attempt to put a hypersonic vehicle on an unmanned surface vessel.\nCastelion’s Blackbeard hypersonic system will be launched from Saronic’s Marauder medium unmanned surface vessel, with a demonstration at sea planned for 2027.\nAccording to the agreement, Saronic’s Marauder unmanned vessel will launch Castelion’s Blackbeard hypersonic vehicle. The companies said this is an important step toward creating strike systems that work without crews on board.\n“Launching a Castelion hypersonic from a Marauder MUSV significantly changes the approach for any adversary calculating where and how the U.S. can strike,” Dino Mavrookas, co-founder and CEO of Saronic,\nin a statement. “Deterrence is ultimately a function of capability, capacity, and credibility. Saronic and Castelion are working to increase all three by combining autonomous maritime and hypersonic strike capabilities that are more scalable, more affordable, and faster to field.”\nThe idea is to equip autonomous ships with advanced weapons that can operate across large areas of the ocean. These ships could offer more launch points for weapons and help keep people out of danger.\nCastelion is also increasing production of the Blackbeard system and plans to make several thousand missiles each year. Last October, the company said Blackbeard had won several awards to help it work with both Army and Navy platforms.\n“Blackbeard and Marauder will give our warfighters more shots, from more places, with fewer constraints,” Bryon Hargis, co-founder and CEO of Castelion, said in a statement.\nThis partnership comes as defense leaders look for ways to use more precision strike systems without raising costs. Autonomous ships capable of carrying advanced weapons are becoming an important part of this plan.\nThe announcement arrives during a busy period for Saronic. The company is currently expanding a shipyard in Louisiana, a project expected to be completed by the end of this year. Once finished, the facility will have the capacity to produce up to 20 Marauder vessels annually.\nLate in May, Saronic\nthat the 180-foot-long Marauder had entered on-water trials. The vessel is designed to carry payloads weighing up to 150 metric tons, giving it the capacity to support a range of military missions.\nThe U.S. Navy is also evaluating the platform. Last month, the service confirmed that Saronic was among seven companies selected for its MUSV marketplace initiative. Participants will conduct at-sea testing this summer, and those who successfully complete the evaluation phase by October will receive $15 million and become eligible for future production contracts.\nBeyond Marauder, Saronic has developed several autonomous surface vessels, including the Corsair. According to the company, the\ncan transport payloads of up to 1,000 pounds over distances exceeding 1,000 nautical miles.\nThe Navy’s Task Force 59, which focuses on unmanned maritime operations in Bahrain, began fielding Corsair vessels in March. The platform recently played a role in a real-world rescue mission.\nOn Monday, U.S. Central Command said Navy units, including Task Force 59, assisted in\ntwo crew members from a US Army AH-64 Apache helicopter that went down near the coast of Oman.\nGet the latest in engineering, tech, space & science - delivered daily to your inbox.\nA versatile writer, Sujita has worked with Mashable Middle East and News Daily 24. When she isn't writing, you can find her glued to the latest web series and movies.\nRobot hand uses touch and vision to harvest ripe fruit with near-100% accuracy\nUS safety design approval advances next-gen Aurora nuclear reactor initiative in Idaho\nDodge Charger maker road-tests solid-state EV battery hitting 90% charge in 18 minutes\nProject to restore US uranium enrichment for defense programs commences operations\nChina’s robotic snakes slither across power lines to spot faults before failure\nMore from Military\nUS Navy drone ship gets its own production line to speed up fleet deliveries\nAutonomous aircraft drops 200-pound payload within 50 feet for frontline logistics\nTrump cancels planned Iran strikes, says peace agreement could come soon\nUS Navy’s new 20,000-ton Columbia-class nuclear-powered submarine takes shape\nUS Army to deploy VAMPIRE drone hunter with proven 350,000 hours of battlefield use\nUS Navy drone ship gets its own production line to speed up fleet deliveries\nAutonomous aircraft drops 200-pound payload within 50 feet for frontline logistics\nTrump cancels planned Iran strikes, says peace agreement could come soon\nUS Navy’s new 20,000-ton Columbia-class nuclear-powered submarine takes shape\nUS Army to deploy VAMPIRE drone hunter with proven 350,000 hours of battlefield use"},{"t":"解锁耐用高功率锌空气电池：Fe3O分子炉锻造双位点催化剂实现协同催化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6643887?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[锌空气电池ORR]: Fe3O分子炉锻造双位点催化剂"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用{Fe3O}分子炉锻造的双位点催化剂，实现了高功率锌空气电池的耐用性突破。原子级精度的金属-氧簇合物是连接单原子催化剂与纳米颗粒之间的独特桥梁结构。该工作设计的双位点催化剂通过协同催化机制，同时优化了氧还原（ORR）和氧析出（OER）反应动力学，显著提升了锌空气电池的功率密度和循环耐久性。该策略为可充电金属-空气电池的高效双功能催化剂设计提供了分子级精确调控的新范式。","ot":"Unlocking Durable High‐Power Zn‐Air Batteries: {Fe3O} Molecular Furnace‐Forged Dual‐Site Catalysts Enabling Synergistic ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Atomic‐level precision metal‐oxo clusters serve as a unique bridge linking single atoms and nanoparticles. Their highly ordered, quasi‐molecular structure effectively promotes electron transfer and optimizes charge deposition kinetics, thereby significantly enhancing the catalytic activity and stability of electrochemical oxygen reduction reactions. Here, we constructed a single‐atom‐nanoparticle dual‐engine catalyst (Fe\n                    3\n                    C/Fe‐NC\n                    1050\n                    ) by in situ domain‐confined complexation of ZIF‐8(Zn) using {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} as a core metal‐oxo cluster. The unique flexible ligand‐carboxylate group of {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} clusters provide a protective barrier for the metal atoms distribution during pyrolysis, work in synergy with the ZIF‐8 framework to provide a conductive substrate. The precisely exposed Fe\n                    3\n                    C (110) crystal plane modulates the electronic structure of neighboring Fe‐N\n                    4\n                    active sites, thus reducing the adsorption energy of key step O\n                    2\n                    →*OOH and endowing the material with excellent methanol resistance and stability. Structural characterization and theoretical calculations reveal that the synergistic interaction between {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} clusters and the carbon substrate provides a stable conductive network and active sites, achieving a maximum power density of 249.0 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in alkaline zinc‐air batteries and demonstrates exceptionally long cycle life of 700 h at the current density of 2.0 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . This design provides crucial insights for the nanoengineering of metal‐oxo clusters and atomic‐scale design of catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"通过同步原位成像和便携式uri诊断早期肾损伤的单分子双报告探针","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag367/8707072?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Early detection of acute kidney injury (AKI) is critical for effective intervention and improved survival, yet it remains challenging due to the lack of practical tools that sensitively capture subtle renal dysfunction. Here, we report a unimolecular dual-reporter probe, DHU-AKI-3, featuring activatable crosstalk-free multiplexed signal output for precise diagnosis of early AKI by integrating in situ imaging and in vitro portable urinalysis. Following systemic administration, DHU-AKI-3 is selectively activated in the injured kidney, producing a long-retained photoacoustic signal for real-time in situ imaging ahead of the clinical diagnostic window. Concurrently, a near-infrared fluorescent signal is rapidly released and excreted into urine, enabling smartphone-assisted colorimetric analysis for noninvasive, point-of-care testing. The mutual validation of crosstalk-free in situ and in vitro signals guaranteed the diagnostic accuracy. This study underscores the potential of unimolecular dual-reporter probe for directly visualizing early-stage AKI in urine, meeting the pressing demand for point-of-care testing in AKI management.","tp":"肾损伤诊断","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"研究者开发单分子双报告探针DHU-AKI-3，集成原位成像与便携式尿液分析，实现急性肾损伤早期精准诊断。探针具有无串扰多重信号输出特性，为临床早期干预提供了实用化检测工具。"},{"t":"N-杂环卡宾制备的超薄高绝缘芳烃单分子层","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4614418?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机栅极介电层","kp":["材料[有机栅介质]: N-杂环卡宾芳族单层","特性[有机场介质]: 超薄高绝缘低栅漏电流"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用N-杂环卡宾（NHC）化学实现了超薄、高绝缘的芳香族单分子层制备。有机电子器件的性能高度依赖于有机栅介质层材料的质量，传统自组装单层（SAM）存在覆盖度不均和针孔缺陷等问题。NHC与金属表面形成的强配位键可构筑致密、无缺陷的纳米级介电层，其超薄特性使器件在保持高电容的同时实现低漏电流。该技术为有机薄膜晶体管、柔性电子器件的微型化和性能提升提供了新型介电材料方案。","ot":"Ultra‐Thin and Highly Insulating Aromatic Monolayers by N‐Heterocyclic Carbenes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The efficiency of organic electronic devices relies on application of organic gate dielectric materials. Such organic films should exhibit high chemical/thermal stability, aromatic functionality compatible with organic semiconductors, and low gate leakage currents in combination with low thickness to reduce the operating voltage. An interesting class of materials for such applications are self‐assembled monolayers (SAMs) among which the\n                    N\n                    ‐heterocyclic carbenes (NHC) are known for their high chemical/thermal stability. The conductivity of NHC SAMs, however, has been sparsely explored and their electrical properties remain controversial. Here we report conductivity analysis for a well‐defined series of aromatic NHC SAMs. Our data show that all analyzed monolayers are highly insulating and in particular the shortest possible NHC of just ∼3.3 Å is by 5 orders of magnitude more insulating than standard insulators based on alkanethiolate SAM of the same length. Our calculations indicate the absence of destructive quantum interference (DQI) effect which has been considered responsible for suppression of conductivity in aromatic molecules. The suppression of SAMs conductivity just via selection of the imidazolium‐based bonding group is conceptually simpler opening possibility of using NHC SAMs as an ultra‐thin, and exceptionally insulating, aromatic monolayers for functionalization of the gate electrodes."},{"t":"用于工业级电解水的超稳定非贵金属析氧电催化剂","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2311940?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"工业级OER电催化","dp":1,"as":"针对工业级碱性析氧反应(OER)中动力学缓慢及强极化条件下的催化剂稳定性难题，研究开发了一种超稳定的非贵金属电催化剂。该工作以廉价过渡金属替代铂、铱等贵金属，在工业级大电流密度下实现长时间稳定运行，有望显著降低绿氢电解水制氢成本，推动大规模商业化应用。核心突破在于通过结构工程调控活性位点电子结构，兼顾高催化活性与极端工况下的耐久性。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultrastable Non‐Noble‐Metal Oxygen Evolution Electrocatalyst for Industrial‐Level Water Electrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The sluggish kinetics of alkaline oxygen evolution reaction (OER), together with the highly polarizing conditions at industrial‐level ampere‐scale current densities, which cause catalyst instability, motivate the search for new approaches to break the challenging activity‐stability trade‐off. Herein, we demonstrate that atomic carbon doping into the octahedral voids of Fe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    ultrathin nanosheets (C‐Fe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    UNSs) with constructed Fe\n                    oh\n                    III–\n                    O–Fe\n                    oh\n                    III\n                    synergistic centers can modify the coverage of\n                    *\n                    OH intermediates and allow direct\n                    *\n                    O–\n                    *\n                    O radical coupling. This enables both structural and catalytic stabilization, as confirmed by operando spectroscopic measurements and density‐functional theory calculations, with an overpotential of 227 mV to achieve 500 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    along with 4500‐h durability. When applying C‐Fe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    UNSs in an anion exchange membrane water electrolyzer, it delivers a cell voltage of 1.72 V at 1.5 A cm\n                    −2\n                    while operating for 2800 h from 1 to 5 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , with a degradation rate of 3.05 mV kh\n                    −1\n                    at 3 A cm\n                    −2\n                    ."},{"t":"超窄间距极性绿色芳烃Dion-Jacobson杂化钙钛矿实现高灵敏自供电探测","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73657?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿X射线探测","kp":["材料体系[X射线探测]: DJ型无铅极性杂化钙钛矿(4AMPY)2","特性[DJ钙钛矿]: 超窄层间距、无铅绿色"],"as":"研究提出一种超窄层间距、极性绿色芳族Dion-Jacobson(DJ)型杂化钙钛矿材料，用于高性能X射线探测。DJ型钙钛矿因其本征量子阱结构与低离子迁移特性，在辐射探测领域展现出优异灵敏度与低暗电流。通过引入极性芳族间隔层进一步调控能带与载流子传输，实现高灵敏度、快响应的X射线成像，在医疗影像与工业无损检测领域具备应用潜力。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultranarrow‐Spaced Polar Green Aromatic Dion–Jacobson Hybrid Perovskite Enables Highly Sensitive and Stable Self‐Powered","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Dion‐Jacobson (DJ) hybrid perovskites are considered as highly promising X‐ray detection materials due to their high stability and short interlayer spacing. However, the large‐scale commercial development of these materials is challenged due to severe ion migration at high voltage and lead toxicity. Here, we successfully obtained a DJ‐type polar lead‐free green hybrid perovskite (4AMPY)\n                    2\n                    AgBiBr\n                    8\n                    (\n                    1\n                    ) by inserting 4‐aminomethylpyridine (4AMPY) aromatic diamine into 3D Cs\n                    2\n                    AgBiBr\n                    6\n                    , and achieved efficient and stable self‐powered X‐ray detection. Specifically, owing to the insertion of 4AMPY,\n                    1\n                    crystallizes in polar space group\n                    P\n                    2\n                    1\n                    and exhibits a significant bulk photovoltaic effect. Additionally, strong hydrogen‐bonding interactions between 4AMPY and adjacent inorganic layers lead to an ultranarrow interlayer spacing of 3.09 Å. Meanwhile, the enhanced electron cloud density in aromatic diamines improves the charge transfer channel of\n                    1\n                    and enhances its X‐ray detection performance. Therefore, among all DJ‐type lead‐free hybrid perovskites,\n                    1\n                    achieves record‐breaking sensitivities of 661.4 and 9465.2 µC Gy\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0 and 100 V, respectively. Importantly,\n                    1\n                    exhibits excellent storage stability, with its sensitivity remaining at 97.5% (0 V) and 96.6% (100 V) of the initial value after three months. This work will greatly promote the development of polar DJ‐type lead‐free perovskite‐based self‐powered X‐ray detectors."},{"t":"基于蜂窝网络形貌的超拉伸机械稳健有机光电探测器","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00227-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可拉伸光电探测器","kp":["形态设计[可拉伸光电探测器]: 弹性体介导蜂窝网络"],"as":"研究利用弹性体介导的蜂窝状网络结构，实现了兼具高性能与高机械鲁棒性的超可拉伸有机光电探测器(OPD)。该蜂窝网络在拉伸应变下仍能保持优异的光电响应，克服了传统柔性光电器件拉伸性与性能难以兼顾的瓶颈。这一策略为可穿戴健康监测、电子皮肤及植入式传感等需要大面积形变耐受的应用场景提供了可行路径。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultra-stretchable and mechanically robust organic photodetectors enabled by a honeycomb network morphology","b":"An elastomer-mediated honeycomb-like network enables stretchable organic photodetectors that combine high performance with exceptional mechanical robustness. By stabilizing multiscale morphology during deformation, the devices operate reliably under large strain and repeated cycling, providing a promising design route for mechanically reliable wearable optoelectronics."},{"t":"美国机构加入打击“超加工食品”的斗争","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5920?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Some scientists criticize label as imprecise; others call it a valuable lens on diet"},{"t":"将石墨烯扭转为关联与拓扑态","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag363/8707052?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","tp":"石墨烯莫尔超晶格","dp":1,"as":"综述了扭转石墨烯莫尔超晶格(moiré superlattice)作为研究电子关联与能带拓扑的高度可调平台。通过精确控制层间扭转角，可在魔角附近诱导出强关联超导、莫特绝缘体及拓扑平带等新奇量子物态，成为凝聚态物理的前沿热点。该平台的可调性为探索关联-拓扑耦合、非常规超导机理以及未来低功耗拓扑量子器件提供了独特实验窗口。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Twisting graphene into correlation and topology","b":"Twisted graphene moiré superlattices have emerged as a highly tunable platform in which electronic correlation and band topology intertwine in unprecedented ways. Near the magic angle, moiré interference dramatically suppresses kinetic energy, producing flat electronic bands with nontrivial quantum geometry and multiple internal degrees of freedom. These features enable interaction-driven phases that have no direct analogue in conventional solids. In this Review, we survey recent progress on magic-angle twisted bilayer graphene and related twisted multilayer graphene systems, focusing on how many-body and topological effects reconstruct the flat-band spectrum and organize the observed phase diagram. We discuss correlated insulating states, flavor-selective cascades, intervalley coherent orders, and the coexistence of localized moments with itinerant carriers. We further examine the emergence of topological phases — including orbital Chern insulators, fractional Chern insulators, and topological electronic crystals — that arise from the interplay between interactions and band topology. Superconductivity in twisted graphene is reviewed as a strongly coupled, unconventional phenomenon, shaped by both electronic correlation and quantum geometry. The discussion is then extended to twisted multilayer graphene architectures, highlighting the intertwined electronic correlation and band topology, and their influence on superconductivity. We conclude by outlining key open problems in superconductivity and opportunities for engineering novel correlated and topological states in twisted graphene moiré systems."},{"t":"调控无序结构：非晶化工程增强光催化的最新进展","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73672?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"非晶化光催化","dp":1,"as":"本文综述了非晶化工程在光催化领域的最新进展。非晶化工程通过向晶态光催化剂引入可调控的结构无序性，打破传统晶态材料的对称性限制，从而优化能带结构、提升载流子分离效率并暴露更多活性位点。研究总结了非晶化策略（如高温淬火、氢化、等离子体处理等）对光吸收范围拓展、光腐蚀抑制及催化活性提升的影响规律，并讨论了完全非晶化与部分非晶化在水分解、CO₂还原等反应中的差异化表现。该方向为设计高效稳定的光催化体系提供了新的结构调控维度。","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.5,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Tuning the Disordered Structure: Recent Advances in Amorphization Engineering for Enhanced Photocatalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Amorphization engineering, which introduces tunable structural disorder into crystalline photocatalysts, has emerged as a promising strategy for enhancing photocatalytic performance. The disorder‐induced increase in system entropy can lead to a “cocktail effect”, manifesting as a reconstruction of electronic structures, asymmetric electron density distribution, tailored relaxation dynamics of photoinduced charge carriers, unique local microenvironments of active sites, etc. These features collectively influence the overall photocatalytic process. Herein, this perspective presents recent advances in amorphization engineering, covering the synthesis, modification, and application of amorphous‐based photocatalysts. The synthesis section elaborates on preparation methodologies, while the modification and application sections systematically summarize various amorphization schemes for performance enhancement. Despite the progress, challenges remain in achieving controllable synthesis and elucidating the structure‐activity relationship. Future efforts should focus on gaining mechanistic insights and developing advanced characterization techniques to guide the rational design of high‐performance amorphous‐based photocatalysts for sustainable energy and environmental applications."},{"t":"Trinasolar面向北美市场推出620瓦TOPCon Shield组件","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/trinasolar-launches-620-w-topcon-shield-module-for-north-american-market/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"TOPCon光伏组件","kp":["功率[TOPCon Shield组件]: 620W","电池技术[Vertex N Shield]: n型TOPCon"],"as":"天合光能面向北美市场推出Vertex N Shield系列620W TOPCon光伏组件。该产品主打抗冰雹和高载荷能力，采用双玻无框设计与TOPCon电池技术，在提升功率输出的同时兼顾极端天气下的结构耐久性。620W的功率等级瞄准大型地面电站和分布式屋顶场景，反映了北美市场对高可靠性、高功率组件的需求趋势。此举是天合在北美产能扩张与贸易壁垒应对背景下的产品本地化布局。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":8.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Trinasolar launches 620 W TOPCon ‘Shield’ module for North American market - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nThe global solar manufacturer introduced the hail-resistant, high-load Vertex N Shield panel, featuring n-type technology and reinforced mechanical durability.\nRyan Kennedy\nTechnology & Products\nImage: Trina Solar\nTrinasolar has launched its Vertex N Shield photovoltaic module in North America, expanding its n-type portfolio with a product aimed at commercial and industrial (C&I) as well as utility-scale solar projects increasingly exposed to extreme weather risks.\nThe new module arrives at a time when hail, high wind, and uneven snow loads are becoming key design constraints for developers and asset owners, not only from an engineering perspective but also due to their growing influence on insurance premiums and long-term project bankability. Against this backdrop, Trinasolar has positioned the Vertex N Shield as a mechanically reinforced solution intended to improve resilience in climate-challenging regions.\nAt the core of the design is a dual-glass architecture paired with reinforced glass that achieves surface compression stress above 69 MPa. According to the manufacturer, this translates into an impact resistance approximately 2.5 times higher than conventional PV modules. The system has been engineered to withstand direct strikes from 55 mm hailstones at terminal velocities of 33.9 m/s, while also surviving 75 mm hail impacts at a 45-degree angle—specifications that place it among the more hail-resistant products currently targeting the utility-scale segment.\nMechanical robustness extends beyond hail protection. The module has been designed to address increasingly complex structural loading scenarios seen across diverse geographies. It is certified for static wind loads of +7,000 Pa downward pressure and -5,000 Pa uplift, enabling deployment in high-wind and hurricane-prone coastal areas. It also supports asymmetrical snow loading up to +6,600 Pa, which roughly corresponds to uneven accumulation approaching 7.2 feet, a parameter particularly relevant for mountainous or high-latitude installations. When deployed on tracker systems, the module retains certified structural performance at +3,600 Pa and -3,000 Pa, even with a reduced 790 mm purlin support configuration, reflecting its adaptation to modern single-axis tracker architectures.\nWhile mechanical resilience is the headline feature, the electrical design remains consistent with Trinasolar’s established medium-format n-type platform. The Vertex N Shield is built around a 210R rectangular cell architecture using a 132 half-cut cell layout on an i-TOPCon monocrystalline platform. The module delivers a peak output of 620 W with a maximum efficiency of 23.0%, supported by a temperature coefficient of -0.29%/C. Its low-voltage design further enables longer string configurations, an approach commonly used to reduce balance-of-system costs in large-scale PV plants.\nDimensionally, the module measures 2382 mm × 1134 mm × 30 mm and weighs 39.7 kg. Electrically, it offers an open-circuit voltage of 49.6 V and a short-circuit current of 15.91 A, aligning with high-power utility-scale string design requirements.\nOn the reliability side, the module has undergone environmental stress testing with Kiwa PVEL, with reported validation against a range of long-term degradation mechanisms. These include potential-induced degradation (PID), light-induced degradation (LID), and light- and elevated temperature-induced degradation (LeTID), along with accelerated exposure testing for salt mist, ammonia, and high-dust conditions—factors that collectively define performance in harsh operating environments.\nThe module also carries UL 61730 Fire Type 30 certification and achieves Class A performance in standard fire safety evaluations, supporting compliance in regulated North American deployment environments. Trinasolar further backs the Vertex N Shield with a 30-year performance warranty, reinforcing its positioning in a segment where durability, risk mitigation, and lifecycle yield are increasingly central to project economics.\nWith the launch of Vertex N Shield, Trinasolar is clearly aiming to align higher mechanical robustness with the efficiency and power density expectations of modern utility-scale PV, as developers continue to prioritize survivability alongside energy yield in an increasingly volatile climate landscape.\nRyan Kennedy\nView author posts"},{"t":"空间活动流形的变换在 CA3 中传递厌恶信息","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2517639123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Hippocampal circuits form cognitive maps that represent spatial position and integrate contextual information, including affective cues, into episodic memory representations. We investigated how spatial and affective information are combined in the population activity of CA3 axons by analyzing the activity of intermediate-to-dorsal and dorsal-to-dorsal axons in mice navigating a linear track before, during, and after exposure to an aversive air puff stimulus. Both axonal populations maintained a robust, time-invariant activity manifold that encoded spatial information independent of affective context. Deformations of this common manifold encoded the presence of the aversive stimulus without disrupting the spatial representation. Despite differences in spatial coding, both axonal populations encoded affective information with similar efficacy. This population-level encoding was distributed similarly across place and nonplace cells. Our findings demonstrate that hippocampal CA3 axons integrate spatial and affective information within a common representational geometry while maintaining the separability of each information type.","tp":"海马体记忆","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"海马体CA3回路形成认知地图，整合空间位置与情感信息构建情景记忆。研究发现小鼠在经历厌恶性刺激前后，CA3轴突群体活动的空间流形发生变换，揭示了厌恶信息在海马体中的编码与传递机制。"},{"t":"转录因子 Tono 介导组蛋白 H3K4 三甲基化通过转录复制调节内复制","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9695?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Endoreplication is a cell cycle variant that involves multiple rounds of DNA replication without cell division, resulting in enlarged cells and organs. Here, we combined the\n                    Bombyx\n                    silk gland and\n                    Drosophila\n                    salivary gland to determine the mechanism underlying transcriptional reprogramming during the mitotic-to-endoreplication transition. Transcriptome profiling of the silk gland revealed that genes involved in multiple processes, especially cell cycle control, growth, and morphogenesis, are up-regulated after endoreplication entry. We further found that global levels of histone H3K4 trimethylation (H3K4me3) in the silk gland increase following endoreplication entry; the depletion of the COMPASS H3K4 methyltransferase complex subunit Wds in the silk gland or salivary gland blocks endoreplication; and a subset of up-regulated genes are targeted and transcriptionally reprogrammed by H3K4me3. The transcription factor Tono mediates H3K4me3 deposition at target loci by recruiting the Wds-containing COMPASS complex, thereby promoting endoreplication. These findings reveal an epigenetic mechanism by which Tono orchestrates transcriptional reprogramming through the H3K4me3 modification to regulate endoreplication progression.","tp":"内复制机制","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"内复制是一种特殊的细胞周期变异形式，其特征是细胞在不发生分裂的情况下进行多轮DNA复制，从而导致细胞与器官的显著增大。该研究结合了家蚕丝腺和果蝇唾液腺模型，致力于揭示细胞从有丝分裂向内复制转变过程中的转录重编程机制。通过对家蚕丝腺的转录组分析，研究证实转录因子T在其中发挥了关键的介导作用，它通过调节组蛋白H3K4的三甲基化水平，在转录与复制层面精准调控内复制过程，为理解器官生长与发育提供了重要遗传学线索。"},{"t":"跟踪东南亚能源转型的进展和优先事项——区域能源转型指数和分析","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007403?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"东南亚能源","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.5},"as":""},{"t":"从叶片到天空的光线追踪：农光互补果园的多光谱半影感知辐照度建模","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007397?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"农光互补建模","kp":["[建模]: 多光谱半影感知辐照建模","[应用]: 农光互补果园"],"as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Tracing rays from leaves to sky: Multispectral, penumbra-aware irradiance modeling for agrivoltaic orchards"},{"t":"利用固态自旋实现电子束量子传感","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531808123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电子束量子传感","dp":1,"as":"探讨利用固态自旋量子体系（如氮空位色心）对自由电子束进行量子传感的新方向。传统散射实验通过高能粒子揭示物质结构，而固态自旋凭借高灵敏度的量子相干探测能力，有望实现对电子束微观性质的精密测量，推动粒子物理探测与量子传感技术的交叉融合。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Toward quantum sensing of electron beams using solid-state spins","b":"Scattering experiments with energetic particles, such as free electrons, have been historically used to reveal the quantum structure of matter. However, realizing coherent interactions between free-electron beams and solid-state quantum systems has remained out of reach, owing to their intrinsically weak coupling. Realizing such coherent control would open up opportunities for hybrid quantum platforms combining free electrons and solid-state qubits for coincident quantum information processing and nanoscale sensing. Here, we present a framework that employs negatively charged nitrogen-vacancy centers (NV\n                    −\n                    ) in diamond as quantum sensors of a bunched electron beam. We develop a Lindblad master equation description of the magnetic free-electron–qubit interactions and identify spin relaxometry as a sensitive probe of the interaction. Experimentally, we integrate a confocal fluorescence microscopy setup into a microwave-bunched electron beam line. We monitor charge-state dynamics and assess their impact on key sensing performance metrics (such as spin readout contrast), defining safe operating parameters for quantum sensing experiments. By performing\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          T\n                          1\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    relaxometry under controlled electron beam exposure, we do not resolve a measurable reduction in\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          T\n                          1\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    within experimental uncertainty, and instead establish an upper bound on the free-electron–spin coupling strength. Our results establish NV\n                    −\n                    centers as quantitative probes of free electrons, providing a metrological benchmark for free-electron–qubit coupling under realistic conditions, and chart a route toward solid-state quantum control with electron beams.","aip":1},{"t":"生物系统中的染色体选择性转化：前景和挑战","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526148?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Addressing small‐molecule chromophores with bioactive properties has been established as an effective means of controlling biological systems for several decades. However, the complexity of in vitro and especially in vivo systems cannot be matched by a single wavelength of light (de)activating one kind of chromophore. Consequently, developing methods to combine and individually control multiple chromophores within the same system is of high importance. An increasing number of strategies have become available relying on the chromoselective transformation of small molecules. This article features the chromoselective control of photoswitches, photoclick chemistry, and photocages, and highlights perspectives and future challenges to be overcome in the context of biological systems.","tp":"光控生色团","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"生物系统中单一波长光控制单一发色团难以匹配体内外系统复杂性。综述讨论在同一系统中组合并独立控制多种发色团的染色体选择性转化方法，展望其在精确调控生物系统中的应用前景与面临的挑战。"},{"t":"用于高维类脑计算拓扑声学突触","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec6633?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"拓扑声子神经形态计算","dp":1,"as":"提出一种拓扑声学突触结构，用于高维类脑神经形态计算。人脑能执行因果推理、反事实思维等高维复杂计算，该研究借助拓扑声学体系构建人工突触，利用拓扑保护特性实现稳定、高效的信息处理，为高维神经形态计算硬件提供新范式。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Topological acoustic synapse for high-dimensional neuromorphic computing","b":"The human brain performs complex, high-dimensional (HD) computations, such as causal reasoning, counterfactual thinking, and abstraction, with ~10\n                    11\n                    neurons while consuming ~20 watts of power. Neuromorphic computing seeks similar efficiency, but current devices face bottlenecks in bandwidth, energy, wiring, footprint, and reliability that limit scalability. Here, we introduce the topological acoustic synapse (TAS), an acoustic-wave neuromorphic device that circumvents these limits by mapping information in multivariate state spaces. A single TAS generates and manipulates numerous computing channels that operate independently and in parallel. The TAS leverages nonlinear interactions to emulate biorealistic neuromorphic functionalities, including reconfigurable synaptic plasticity, neuromodulation, and hybrid analog-digital control. In classification tasks, a TAS handles multiple inputs simultaneously and generates various outputs, converging 20% faster while using 60% fewer parameters and at least an order of magnitude less power than state-of-the-art electrical devices. This work establishes the first acoustic synapse with parallel HD computing capabilities, presenting a scalable paradigm for neuromorphic hardware with high computational density.","aip":1},{"t":"在研究人员提交论文之前工具会标记可疑期刊","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01707-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The free platform, called Journal Trends, could also allow integrity sleuths to spot low-quality publications. The free platform, called Journal Trends, could also allow integrity sleuths to spot low-quality publications."},{"t":"时间序列单细胞转录组学揭示了斑马鱼普遍的日常节律和夜间精子发生","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee7124?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The vertebrate testis has long been regarded as lacking strong cellular daily rhythmicity. Here, we use time-series single-cell RNA sequencing to construct a temporal atlas of the adult zebrafish testis. We identify previously unknown cell-type–specific markers and previously unidentified testicular subtypes and reveal that Sertoli cells, spermatogonia, and spermatids exhibit robust oscillations in key circadian clock genes. In contrast, Leydig cells and spermatocytes primarily exhibit rhythmic expression of key functional genes. We show that intercellular communication networks also exhibit daily rhythmicity. Pseudotime trajectory analysis demonstrates a notable nocturnal preference for germ cell progression. Disrupting circadian input via constant light reduced germ cell numbers and impaired fertility. Genetic ablation of\n                    clock1a\n                    arrests spermatogonial differentiation, whereas mutation of the rhythmic spermatocyte gene\n                    hmgb1a\n                    substantially reduces meiotic cells. Together, our findings redefine the testis as a highly rhythmic organ in which a precisely timed, nocturnally coordinated cellular symphony drives spermatogenesis.","tp":"睾丸节律图","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"传统观点认为脊椎动物睾丸缺乏明显的细胞日节律。该研究利用时间序列单细胞RNA测序技术，成功构建了成年斑马鱼睾丸的时间图谱。研究不仅发现了未知的细胞亚型，还揭示了支持细胞、精原细胞和精细胞在关键昼夜节律基因中表现出强烈的振荡。此外，Leydig细胞和精母细胞也呈现出节律性特征，证明了斑马鱼睾丸存在普遍的日常节律，并在夜间发生精子发生过程。"},{"t":"短程关联中的三体效应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/7smm-7sd5","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): H. Y. Shang, R. Z. Hu, X. Y. Xu, Z. C. Xu, J. C. Pei, and S. M. WangShort-range correlations (SRCs) provide the link between low- and high-energy nuclear physics and can be quantified by two-nucleon densities. We present calculations of the two-nucleon densities using free-space similarity renormalization group (SRG)-evolved operators and in-medium SRG (IMSRG) groun…[Phys. Rev. C 113, L061303] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"本届世界杯可能是迄今为止科技含量最高的一届世界杯——值得关注的创新","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01866-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Nature asked a football-journal chief about emerging trends in the sport, from AI tools to PhD students embedded with teams. Nature asked a football-journal chief about emerging trends in the sport, from AI tools to PhD students embedded with teams."},{"t":"噻吩工程脂质 II 识别可有效膜解根除 MRSA","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5919230?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Methicillin‐resistant\n                    Staphylococcus aureus\n                    (MRSA) remains a significant global health threat, necessitating the development of new antimicrobials. We report the rational design of a small molecule TPL(II)‐07, that combines multiple functional modules: (i) 2‐phenylthiophene for specific recognition and binding to lipid II, a key intermediate in peptidoglycan biosynthesis; (ii) an adamantane fragment with high interfacial permeability to destabilize lipid packing; (iii) a cationic lysine moiety to disperse biofilms; and (iv) a moderate aliphatic chain to disrupt membrane integrity. Among seven analogues, TPL(II)‐07 exhibited the highest potency, highlighting the synergistic contribution of each component. Mechanistic assays confirmed preferential binding of lipid II, bactericidal potency, biofilm dispersion, and the generation of reactive oxygen species, effective against both drug‐resistant (MIC 19 µM) and drug‐sensitive (MIC 9 µM)\n                    S. aureus\n                    strains. TPL(II)‐07 demonstrated excellent biocompatibility, with IC\n                    50\n                     &gt; 50 mM in HEK‐293 and WI38 cells and negligible hemolytic activity. In addition, it suppressed key virulence traits, including hemolysin activity, biofilm formation, and staphyloxanthin production. Further, a borate‐functionalized guar gum hydrogel incorporating TPL(II)‐07 achieved effective infection control and enhanced wound repair in a murine excisional model, establishing thiophene‐based lipid II targeting as a versatile platform for next‐generation antimicrobials with dual antibacterial and wound‐healing potential.","tp":"抗超级细菌","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"耐甲氧西林金黄色葡萄球菌（MRSA）是全球严重的健康威胁，亟需新型抗菌药物。本研究合理设计了一种名为TPL(II)-07的小分子，该分子集成了多种功能模块，包括利用2-苯基噻吩特异性识别并结合肽聚糖生物合成的关键中间体脂质II，以及引入高金刚烷片段。这种基于噻吩工程的脂质II识别机制能够有效破坏细菌膜结构，从而强效根除MRSA感染。"},{"t":"犹他州下方“不可能”的地震毕竟是真实的","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/the-impossible-earthquake-beneath-utah-was-real-after-all/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Scientists have confirmed a rare “impossible” earthquake deep beneath Utah, revealing a hidden source of seismic activity inside Earth’s mantle.\nNearly five decades after a puzzling earthquake struck deep beneath northern Utah, scientists have confirmed that the event was real and part of a rare category of earthquakes that occur much deeper underground than researchers once thought possible.\nThe unusual quake happened in the early hours of February 24, 1979, beneath the town of Randolph near Utah’s borders with Idaho and Wyoming. Although it registered a magnitude of 3.8, no one reported feeling it. The seismic data collected at the time also appeared highly unusual.\nGeorge Zandt, then a postdoctoral researcher in seismology at the University of Utah, took a closer look at the recordings. His analysis suggested the earthquake originated about 90 kilometers below sea level, far beneath Earth’s crust and deep within the upper mantle.\nAt the time, such a depth seemed almost impossible for an earthquake beneath a continent.\n“The deep depth explained why it wasn’t felt by people at the surface,” said Zandt, who later spent much of his career on the geology faculty at the University of Arizona. “I did some other analysis that convinced me of the reality of the deep depth, but it was hard to convince others of the highly anomalous mantle earthquake occurring in a region where none should exist.”\nAlthough Zandt published an abstract about the event in Earthquake Notes, the finding attracted little attention. That changed last year when a new group of University of Utah seismologists revisited the 1979 data along with records from eight other suspected deep earthquakes that had occurred in northern Utah and southwestern Wyoming.\nLed by geology professor Keith Koper, the team confirmed that all nine earthquakes originated well below the crust. Their findings provided strong evidence for the existence of so-called continental mantle earthquakes (CMEs), a rare type of earthquake that occurs within Earth’s mantle rather than its crust.\nThe evidence grew even stronger on September 10, 2025, when another deep earthquake struck near Maeser in Utah’s Uinta Basin. The magnitude 4.1 event originated at a depth of 68 kilometers.\nThat location placed it more than 20 kilometers below the Mohorovičić discontinuity, commonly called the Moho, which marks the boundary between Earth’s crust and mantle. In a later study published in The Seismic Record, researchers described the Maeser earthquake as an “archetypal continental mantle event.”\nThe discovery is surprising because rocks at those depths are exposed to extreme temperatures and pressures. Scientists generally expect mantle rocks to deform slowly over long periods rather than fracture suddenly in an earthquake.\n“This is an example of an earthquake that’s nucleating in very unusual conditions, the high temperature, the high pressure, and almost all the material at that depth is going to flow. It’s more like taffy, it’s taffy on long time scales, like millions of years,” said Koper, director of the University of Utah Seismograph Stations and a former student of Zandt. “Nevertheless, you can still see it in rocks that have made their way back up to the surface; you can see how they were stretched.”\nZandt came out of retirement to collaborate on the research and is listed as a co-author of the study.\nTo determine where earthquakes begin, seismologists compare the arrival times of different types of seismic waves recorded at monitoring stations. Small differences in travel time help reveal the depth and location of an earthquake’s source.\nThe University of Utah Seismograph Stations has preserved decades of seismic records, creating a valuable archive for researchers. Graduate student Sean Hutchings used those records to study known deep earthquakes and identify several additional events that had previously been classified as shallower crustal earthquakes.\nThe findings point to a type of earthquake that behaves very differently from more familiar quakes.\n“It’s sort of a mystery in terms of fundamental physics. How in the world can these things happen?” Koper said. “Another reason why it’s a big deal is that we have no idea how big they can be. With crustal earthquakes, we can measure what we think their maximum size is going to be. We measure the faults that we can map out near the surface. We can measure the length of a fault segment and that clues us into how big it can be, which helps us estimate seismic hazard.”\nUnlike typical earthquakes, these deep mantle events occur alone. Researchers found no evidence of the foreshocks or aftershocks that commonly accompany crustal earthquakes.\nThe earthquakes also appear concentrated near the western edge of the Wyoming Craton, an ancient and exceptionally old section of Earth’s lithosphere that lies beneath parts of Wyoming and neighboring states. The region is associated with very high temperatures, often exceeding 700 degrees\nKoper compares cratons to icebergs. Rather than floating in water, these ancient structures extend deep into Earth’s mantle like the keel of a ship.\nThe Wyoming Craton sits at the boundary between the tectonically active western United States and the more stable interior of the North American continent. Over time, erosion and geological processes have altered its structure, leaving the lithosphere thinner toward Idaho and Utah. This is also where the deep earthquakes have been observed.\n“On the scale of millions of years, the mantle is hitting the craton and then flowing around it,” Koper said. “It’s that interaction where that mantle flow is being diverted around this hard cratonic root that’s causing the increased strain rate, the increased deformation and it’s also creating extra stresses. We think it’s that interaction between the keel of the iceberg and the medium around it that’s leading to these earthquakes.”\nThe research was published April 10 in\nThe Seismic Record\nunder the title “The 10 September 2025 4.1 Earthquake in Northeastern Utah, United States: An Archetypal Continental Mantle Event,” and May 5, 2025, in\nGeophysical Research Letters\nunder the title “Upper Mantle Earthquakes Along the Edge of the Wyoming Craton.”\n“The 10 September 2025 M\n4.1 Earthquake in Northeastern Utah, United States: An Archetypal Continental Mantle Event” by Keith D. Koper, Sean J. Hutchings, Relu Burlacu, Katherine Whidden, Valerie Springer, Rigobert Tibi and Guanning Pang, 10 April 2026,\nThe Seismic Record\nDOI: 10.1785/0320260006\n“Upper Mantle Earthquakes Along the Edge of the Wyoming Craton” by Sean J. Hutchings, Keith D. Koper, Relu Burlacu, Qicheng Zeng, Fan-Chi Lin and George Zandt, 3 May 2025,\nGeophysical Research Letters\nDOI: 10.1029/2024GL114073\nCo-authors include Sean J. Hutchings, Fan-Chi Lin, Qicheng Zeng, Relu Burlacu, Katherine Whidden, and Valerie Springer of the University of Utah’s Department of Geology & Geophysics. The work was supported by the State of Utah, the U.S. Department of Energy, and the U.S. Geological Survey.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nUniversity of Utah\nA Global Tsunami: How Did the Tonga Tsunami Jump From Ocean to Ocean?\nChanges in Earth’s Outer Core Revealed by Seismic Waves From Earthquakes\nDiamonds That Formed Deep in the Earth Could Help Explain Earthquake Mystery\nQuake-Ception – Groundbreaking Earthquake Discovery: Risk Models Overlook an Important Element\nPossible Chemical Leftovers From Early Earth Sit Near the Planet’s Core\nResolving a Dangerous Conundrum: Earthquake Depth Impacts Potential Tsunami Threat\nA New Method to Preventing Human-Induced Earthquakes Caused by the Oil and Gas Industry\nFracking Wastewater Injection Wells Linked to Earthquakes\nAnalysis of 2011 Virginia Earthquake Suggests Seismic Risk","tp":"深源地震证","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"科学家证实了1979年发生在犹他州北部地下深处的一场“不可能”的罕见地震是真实存在的。这场近半个世纪前的异常地震发生在地幔内部，属于极其罕见的深源地震类别，打破了以往关于地下深处不可能发生此类地震活动的传统认知。这一发现揭示了地球地幔中隐藏的地震活动源，为地震学和地球深部动力学研究提供了全新的视角与重要线索。"},{"t":"胎盘代谢时钟","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei4119?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"NAD\n                    +\n                    depletion triggers a countdown to birth in mice"},{"t":"低强度火灾对空气污染的好处","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aea2490?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Wildfires are reversing decades of air quality improvements across much of the US. Expanded use of prescribed fire is a primary proposed solution, but air quality trade-offs—more initial smoke for less smoke later—remain poorly quantified. Using two decades of satellite-derived measurements of fire severity and smoke particulate matter across California, we assessed the causal effect of low-severity wildfire, a proxy for prescribed burning, on subsequent wildfire activity and air quality. We found that low-severity fire reduced the probability of very-high-severity wildfire by 92%, with reductions lasting a decade and extending 5 kilometers from treated locations. Reduced future smoke far outweighed the smoke produced during treatment, with benefit-cost ratios exceeding five after a decade. Sustained treatment of 500,000 acres annually would reduce cumulative smoke fine particulate matter (PM\n                    2.5\n                    ) by about 10% after a decade.","tp":"低烈度火益","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"近年来，野火烟雾正在抵消美国数十年来在改善空气质量方面取得的成果。为应对这一危机，推广“计划火烧”（低强度火灾）被视为主要的解决方案。通过分析加州近二十年的卫星观测数据，研究发现低强度的野火（作为计划火烧的替代指标）能够显著降低后续严重野火的发生频率和规模。尽管初期会产生一定烟雾，但从长远来看，这种权衡有效减少了整体空气污染。"},{"t":"多重极化效应协同增强电磁能量吸收","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.70999?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电磁波吸收材料","dp":1,"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过协同调控多种极化效应（界面极化、偶极极化、缺陷极化等），显著提升了电磁波吸收材料的能量吸收效率。多重极化机制协同增强介电损耗，使材料在宽频带范围内实现高效电磁能量耗散，在高性能电磁干扰屏蔽和隐身材料领域具有应用潜力。","ot":"The Synergy of Multiple Polarization Effect to Boost Electromagnetic Energy Absorption (Adv. Energy Mater. 22/2026)","b":"Multiple Polarization In article number e70892, Pengfei Liu, Shuoyang Qiu, Yanglong Hou, Zhenhui Ma, and co-workers cons"},{"t":"能突然变成黑洞的奇怪“时空晶体”","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/the-strange-spacetime-crystal-that-can-suddenly-turn-into-a-black-hole/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A new mathematical breakthrough sheds light on how tiny black holes could emerge from critical states of spacetime.\nBlack holes are often portrayed as cosmic giants, swallowing stars and shaping entire galaxies. But some of the most intriguing black holes predicted by physics could be far smaller than an\n. For decades, scientists have known that Einstein’s theory of relativity allows these microscopic black holes to form under extraordinary conditions. The problem was proving exactly how it happens.\nNow, researchers from Goethe University Frankfurt and TU Wien have achieved a major breakthrough. Using an unusual mathematical approach, they have derived the first exact formula describing a process known as critical collapse, a phenomenon that sits at the boundary between ordinary spacetime and\nThe result provides a long-sought analytical explanation for behavior that had previously been seen only in computer simulations.\nIn everyday life, systems can sometimes reach a critical point where an almost imperceptible change triggers a dramatic transformation. Water freezing into ice is a familiar example.\n“Sometimes a tiny, seemingly insignificant cause is enough to trigger a huge and dramatic change,” says Prof. Daniel Grumiller from TU Wien. “Take liquid water at zero degrees\n), for example. A very small change is enough to make the water freeze. The water molecules then spontaneously arrange themselves into a regular pattern and form an ice crystal.”\nPhysicists believe spacetime can undergo a comparable transition.\nAccording to Einstein’s theory of relativity, matter and energy shape the geometry of spacetime. Massive objects such as stars create strong distortions, while smaller objects produce weaker effects. Under very specific conditions, however, these distortions can organize themselves into an unexpectedly ordered structure.\nInstead of remaining chaotic, spacetime develops a repeating pattern that researchers describe as a “spacetime crystal.”\n“We say that spacetime is curved by mass,” explains Christian Ecker from the Institute for Theoretical Physics at Goethe University Frankfurt. “Large objects such as stars curve spacetime strongly — for example, we can observe this when light rays are deflected by massive stars. But smaller masses also produce spacetime curvature, just to a lesser extent.”\nA spacetime crystal occupies an unusual position in physics. It represents a delicate balancing point between two completely different outcomes.\n“This spacetime crystal is a very peculiar and fascinating object,” says Grumiller. “It is a kind of intermediate state, an unstable point that can evolve in two different directions. It may simply dissolve again, leaving behind ordinary spacetime filled with freely moving particles. But if a tiny amount of energy is added, the evolution takes a completely different path: the inconspicuous spacetime crystal turns into a black hole.”\nPhysicists call this threshold behavior critical collapse. It marks the exact boundary between a system that disperses harmlessly and one that collapses into a black hole.\nThe existence of critical collapse first gained attention in 1993, when computer simulations revealed a surprising pattern. No matter how the system was set up, black hole formation seemed to follow precise mathematical rules near the critical threshold.\nThe discovery hinted that a deeper theory was hiding beneath the simulations. Yet despite decades of effort, researchers could not derive an exact mathematical description.\nThat challenge has now been overcome.\nThe breakthrough came from looking at the problem in a way that initially seems counterintuitive: increasing the number of dimensions.\n“Our universe has four dimensions — three dimensions of space and one dimension of time,” explains Christian Ecker. “But in principle, nothing prevents us from writing down physical equations for a larger number of dimensions — five dimensions, forty-two dimensions, or even infinitely many.”\nWhile adding dimensions sounds like it would make the mathematics impossibly complicated, the opposite can happen. Certain features of gravity become much simpler when physicists examine them in the limit of infinitely many dimensions.\nThe next challenge is translating those insights back into realistic models of our universe. If successful, the approach could become a powerful new tool for studying some of the most difficult problems in gravitational physics.\n“Our technique turns out to be remarkably stable. Depending on the desired precision, we can systematically improve our formulas using additional approximation methods,” says Florian Ecker from TU Wien. “This gives us a new method for studying black-hole-related phenomena that could previously not be analyzed analytically.”\nReference: “Analytic Discrete Self-Similar Solutions of Einstein-Klein-Gordon at Large D” by Christian Ecker, Florian Ecker and Daniel Grumiller, 12 May 2026,\nPhysical Review Letters\nDOI: 10.1103/qgl5-5l3t\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAstrophysics\nVienna University of Technology\nPhysicists Unlock a New Way To Detect Tiny Fluctuations in Spacetime\nThe Universe’s Engine Is Changing: DESI Hints Dark Energy Isn’t What We Thought\nGuardians of the Universe: How Quantum Black Holes Hide the End of Space and Time\nThe Hunt for Dark Matter: Astronomers Uncover Unexpected Findings in the Lyman-Alpha Forest\nThese Unusual Black Holes Offer an Infinite Number of Possible Futures\nHands-On Tests at Sandia’s Z Machine Contradict Black Hole Models\nStudy Takes Singularity Out of Black Holes\nBlack Holes Have Properties That Resemble the Dynamics of Solids and Liquids\nUltracold Neutrons Could Escape to Another Braneworld","tp":"时空临界态","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":1.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"一项最新的数学突破揭示了微观黑洞是如何在极端条件下的时空临界状态中形成的。传统观念中黑洞通常是吞噬恒星的宇宙庞然大物，但物理学早前预测爱因斯坦相对论允许微小黑洞的形成。此次研究成功从数学层面证明了这种微观黑洞产生的确切机制，为时空物理学和宇宙演化研究提供了全新的理论视角与重要线索。"},{"t":"物流问题：世界杯背后的供应链","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/the-logistics-issue-the-supply-chains-behind-the-world-cup","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"The Logistics Issue: The Supply Chains Behind the World Cup\nPrioritise Us\nAs the world comes together for the 2026 FIFA World Cup, logistics is playing a vital role in ensuring streamlined, regulated & safe movement of equipment\nThe 2026 FIFA World Cup is one of the largest and most complex tournaments to date. Taking place across three countries for the first time ever, the 104 matches will be played across 16 stadiums.\nLogistics plays a vital role in ensuring every piece of equipment, every person and every material needed for these games can efficiently be transferred across venues.\nFreight forwarding, customs clearing, warehousing and venue distribution all need to be carefully coordinated. Setting up infrastructure needs to take place to a tight schedule, without sacrificing safety or quality.\nSee the full story in the June 2026 edition of Supply Chain Digital\nThe logistics for this event has been years in the making, with the announcement of the three-hosts taking place in 2020, following years of voting and bidding.\nThe scale of this tournament – the 23rd in history – is huge. It is the first in\nFIFA World Cup\nhistory to include 48 teams, an expansion from 32, and games will be played across 16 cities.\nThe World Cup is not just about football. The entire tournament is an experience – fans flock to pubs or bars, or they throw watching parties if they are not in the stadium. With this comes a huge spend on food and drinks, with brands such as Lays and Coca-Cola introducing ‘World Cup Special’ flavours or packaging across their products.\nMoreover, FIFA offers official hospitality packages, with premium tickets, entertainment, food and drink, private suites and more. Fans can buy customised experiences, all of which have been carefully planned out by FIFA’s teams and logistics partners.\nMoney flows during World Cup season, bringing fans from around the world to new cities and stadiums. Purchasing is planned years in advance to ensure there are enough vendors and enough food and drinks for each game. What seems like a series of football games goes way beyond that, with teams working tirelessly behind-the-scenes in order to ensure smooth-running across all the tournament.\nThe ‘Let it Pour’ campaign is about capturing that feeling of when fans come together, share the moment, and celebrate what makes football so special.\nJürgen Klopp, Budweiser global ambassador\nIn 2024, FIFA announced a multi-year partnership with\nRock-It Cargo\n, a logistics company which specialises in large-scale live shows and gaming events.\nFootball teams, their kit, their equipment and their behind-the-scenes teams all need to be confident in the logistics companies in charge of ensuring the tournament faces no delays.\nMattias Grafström, FIFA Secretary General, says: \"In Rock-it Cargo we have found the perfect partner to entrust with the critical logistics services for the biggest FIFA World Cup ever.”\nThis year, the tournament will have three opening ceremonies, one for each of the host countries. Artists including Tyla, Danny Ocean, Alanis Morissette, Michael Bublé, Katy Perry and Future have featured performances at these events. This in itself adds more logistics needs – music equipment, speaker systems, staging, costumes all need to be stored and safely transported. Companies also need to consider bands, backup dancers, backup singers, security and managers.\n“The 2026 World Cup isn’t just about football; it’s a logistics challenge on a massive scale,” explains Jim Bureau, CEO at Loftware. “Millions of shipments, thousands of partners and every piece of merchandise, equipment and kit has to arrive on time.\n“The key lesson here? Visibility alone isn’t enough. When supply chains collaborate, share data and act together, they move faster, adapt smarter and turn complexity into opportunity.”\nFIFA partners, sponsors and supporters are investing money into this tournament, bringing in their marketing and logistics expertise to unlock new value and provide an unforgettable experience. Introducing exciting campaigns and packages, FIFA and its brands are working to ensure the 23rd event is bigger and better than ever.\nRock-It Cargo works with some of the biggest names in sports, with extensive experience across Canada, the USA and Mexico. The company has been chosen as the official logistics provider of the FIFA World Cup 2026.\nFollowing a highly competitive request-for-proposal process, Rock-It Cargo demonstrated its high capabilities in planning and delivering event logistics to complex and high-profile sporting events.\n“We are deeply honoured to have been selected by FIFA to support the planning and delivery of the biggest FIFA World Cup ever,” said Daniel Rosenthal, President and CEO of Rock-It Cargo, when the partnership was announced.\nRock-It predicts it will utilise more than 5,000 trucks and vehicles, utilise approximately one million square feet of warehouse space and store more than one million pounds of equipment.\nThe company will ensure an efficient and sustainable logistics service in order to meet demand and successfully plan the biggest event in FIFA history. The partnership began in 2025, working across international freight forwarding, planning, management,\nwarehouse and distribution\noperations, as well as on-site venue operations.\nBudweiser, an\nABinBev brand\n, is the Official Beer Sponsor of the FIFA World Cup 2026. Its latest global football platform, ‘Let It Pour’, is being activated in more than 40 countries around the world, boosting anticipation and helping connect consumers through shared passions.\n“For over four decades, Budweiser has been part of the celebrations that define the FIFA World Cup, be it on the pitch, in bars, or wherever fans come together,” explains Richard Oppy, Global President, Premium Company at AB InBev.\n“‘Let It Pour’ is our invitation to consumers to fully embrace those moments.”\nBudweiser has also unveiled The Bud Fan Store, where consumers will be able to purchase or win exclusive, tournament-inspired merchandise. These wins include football kits, FIFA windbreakers and more.\n“The FIFA World Cup inspires optimism and unmatched passion for every person watching, and to share that with fans around the world is truly remarkable,” adds Budweiser global ambassador Jürgen Klopp.\n“Being part of the ‘Let it Pour’ campaign is about capturing that feeling of when fans come together, share the moment, and celebrate what makes football so special.”\nBudweiser is emanating the feel of being at a stadium, capitalising off the adrenaline which comes with watching a live game and offering exclusive opportunities for fans.\nAs an official sponsor of the event,\nUnilever is anticipating\nundergoing category growth and footfall throughout summer 2026, following an innovative line of products. Sure, Dove, Radox and Lynx are gaining limited edition products, with innovative scents and designs in order to combine supply chain opportunities, cultural relevance and brand love.\nLynx is undergoing its first major sports sponsorship, with an investment of £5.4m (US$7.3m) into the campaign. This also includes working with up to 2,000 creators ahead of the tournament, bringing in consumer engagement with 5,000 pieces of new social content.\n“Here at Unilever, we’re passionate about the power of sport, and this summer is set to captivate the hearts of football fans around the globe. Sports sponsorships enable brands to connect and engage people through their passion points,” explains Komal Patel, European Sports & Entertainment Partnerships Director – Personal Care, Unilever.\nmulti-brand innovation\nfor the FIFA World Cup 26 offers retailers a significant sales opportunity by tapping into the buzz of competition and allowing fans to get into the football spirit from the very start of their day.”\nSee the full story in the June 2026 edition of Supply Chain Digital\nSecretary General\nGlobal President, Premium Co"},{"t":"氢能动态：瓦锡兰测试100%氢燃料发动机","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/the-hydrogen-stream-wartsila-testing-100-hydrogen-engine/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"纯氢发动机示范","kp":["燃料[Wärtsilä大型内燃机]: 100%氢气"],"sc":9.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":8.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"芬兰瓦锡兰(Wärtsilä)公司成功演示了据称是全球首台大型纯氢燃料发动机，实现100%氢燃料运行。这标志着船用及固定式发电领域向零碳动力系统迈出关键一步，氢燃料发动机有望为大规模工业脱碳和清洁能源存储提供可行的内燃机替代方案。","ot":"The Hydrogen Stream: Wärtsilä testing 100% hydrogen engine - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nWärtsilä has successfully demonstrated what it says is the world’s first large-scale engine running on 100% hydrogen, supplying power to Spain’s grid in Bermeo and advancing flexible low-carbon generation technology.\nSergio Matalucci\nMarkets & Policy\nTechnology & Products\nCommercial & industrial\nEnergy Storage\nWärtsilä Energy has successfully operated a new 100% hydrogen engine supplying power to Spain’s national electricity grid in Bermeo, Spain | Image: Wärtsilä\nhas successfully operated a new 100% hydrogen engine supplying electricity to Spain’s national grid in Bermeo, northern Spain, marking what it describes as the world’s first demonstration of a large-scale engine running exclusively on pure hydrogen. The test represents a step beyond hydrogen-ready systems, showing that engine-based power generation can operate on 100% hydrogen under real grid conditions. The Wärtsilä 31H2 engine, part of the company’s Wärtsilä 31 platform, is currently undergoing performance validation at the site. “This is a trial for the future of renewable power,” said Rasmus Teir, Director of Technology Strategy & Decarbonisation at Wärtsilä. “Today, our Wärtsilä 31H2 hydrogen engine is operating on 100% hydrogen and supplying power to Spain’s national grid.” The company says the demonstration supports the case for flexible, dispatchable generation needed to balance growing shares of wind and solar power. Green hydrogen, which produces no carbon emissions at the point of use, can also provide long-duration energy storage and grid stability during periods of low renewable output. Wärtsilä adds that the hydrogen-fuelled engine platform could in future serve energy-intensive sectors such as data centres and industrial facilities, as well as off-grid applications.The Bermeo trial builds on earlier work with hydrogen-ready engine power plants and comes as Spain continues to expand its renewable energy system and reduce reliance on fossil fuel imports.\nWashington-based\nhas opened AirPlant One, which it says is the first commercial-scale facility in the United States producing sustainable aviation fuel (SAF) from CO₂ and renewable electricity. The plant also produces e-naphtha. “The ribbon cutting, held at the Moses Lake, Washington facility with Alaska Airlines and Microsoft, marks the beginning of commercial-scale production and sets the stage for commercial flights in the U.S. powered by jet fuel made from air,” the company said on Wednesday.\nAlaska Airlines\nwill operate regular domestic flights using e-SAF produced at AirPlant One. Microsoft supported the scale-up through an investment from its Climate Innovation Fund and a sustainable aviation fuel offtake agreement. “Using a book-and-claim accounting model, pioneered alongside Alaska Airlines, this agreement will allow Microsoft to reduce reported emissions associated with business travel. This partnership underscores Microsoft’s commitment to advancing clean energy solutions with transformative impacts for aviation and global industry.”\nEuropean consortium\nhas launched HyCavern, a three-year project to develop and validate underground hydrogen storage based on mined, lined rock caverns for regions where conventional storage is not feasible. “A key ambition of HyCavern is to make underground hydrogen storage more scalable and replicable by adapting cavern designs to diverse geological conditions,” the consortium said. Partners include the Clean Hydrogen Partnership and organisations such as SINTEF, Fundación Hidrógeno Aragón, the University of Edinburgh, Hive Ventures, Delft University of Technology, Fraunhofer ILT, the University of Oxford, AGH University of Krakow, Comec Innovative, swisstopo, Baker Hughes, Deloitte, Planck Technologies, and Picum.\nSalzgitter Flachstah\nl have signed a seven-year agreement for the supply of 10,000 tonnes of green hydrogen per year from 2030. “This is the first major purchase agreement for hydrogen from the 320 MW production plant EWE is building in Emden and also Salzgitter AG’s first major contract with a hydrogen supplier,” Salzgitter said after the signing in Berlin.\nA research team from the\nUniversity of Perugia\nhas demonstrated that large-scale integration of surplus PV electricity with industrial alkaline water electrolysis (AWE) is technically feasible under projected 2030 power system constraints in Italy. The study, published in\nRenewable Energy Focus\n, finds that a modular AWE configuration with up to nine parallel trains, each rated at 20 tonnes H₂/h, enables load-following operation while maintaining stable electrochemical performance, thermal management and efficiency across a wide operating range. The modelled system achieves electrolyzer load factors ranging from around 3% in winter to 97% in peak summer periods.\nSergio Matalucci\nView author posts"},{"t":"下载：“重新编程”衰老，以及隐藏的内感受","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/12/1138899/the-download-reprogramming-reverse-aging-interoception/","c":"未分类","a":"MIT Technology Review","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"This is today's edition of\nThe Download\nour weekday newsletter that provides a daily dose of what's going on in the world of technology.\nEarlier this week, Life Biosciences, a biotech company focused on reversing age-related diseases, announced that it had dosed its first volunteer. A person with glaucoma has had an experimental treatment injected straight into their eyeball.\nThe idea is to treat the disease by regenerating healthy nerves in the eye—but the company already hopes to go further. If the treatment can reverse glaucoma, similar treatments could reverse other diseases of aging. Maybe, just maybe, they could reverse aging altogether.\nThe approach relies on “reprogramming” cells to a younger state. It’s one of many strategies being explored by biotech companies looking to slow and reverse aging. But of all of them, it seems to be the one that is truly taking off.\nRead the full story on the pursuit of reprogramming for rejuvenation\n—Jessica Hamzelou\nThis story is from The Checkup, our weekly newsletter giving you the inside track on all things biotech.\nto receive it in your inbox every Thursday.\nScientists have a word for how we sense ourselves from the inside: interoception. Today, thanks to a 2021 Nobel Prize and new tools that can map internal signaling across the body, research into interoception is taking off.\nAs researchers decode how signals move between body and brain, a clearer picture is starting to take shape—with implications for how we understand and treat conditions from obesity to chronic pain to anxiety.\nFind out how it’s leading to a “new continent of awareness.”\n—Katherine W. Isaacs\nis part of MIT Technology Review Explains, our series untangling the complex, messy world of technology to help you understand what’s coming next.\nYou can read more from the series here\nThe must-reads\nI’ve combed the internet to find you today’s most fun/important/scary/fascinating stories about technology.\n1 SpaceX has officially delivered the largest IPO in history\nIt’s raised a record $75 billion at a $1.77 trillion valuation. (\n+ Making Elon Musk the world’s first trillionaire (on paper).\n+ The IPO will now put his “extreme ownership” to the test.\n+ While China attempts to build a Starlink rival.\nRest of World\n+ And other challenges to SpaceX emerge.\nMIT Technology Review\n2 Jeff Bezos wants to build an “artificial general engineer”\nThrough his new industrial AI startup, Prometheus. (\n+ Which just raised $12 billion, valuing it at $41 billion. (\n+ Meanwhile, OpenAI is building a fully automated researcher.\nMIT Technology Review\n3 Chinese regulators are dramatically intensifying tech enforcement\nA spell of relative restraint has ended. (\n+ Regulators have admonished e-commerce giants Alibaba and JD.com.\n+ And blocked Meta’s acquisition of Chinese AI startup Manus.\n4 Google says Chinese cybercriminals used Gemini to scam Americans\nIt’s suing the network over the alleged AI-powered scams.(\n+ “Supercharged scams” are one of our 10 Things That Matter in AI Right Now.\nMIT Technology Review\n5 Ukraine's defense AI chief predicts a “new paradigm” of warfare\nHe expects AI systems to unify into a single battlefield network. (\n+ AI chatbots could be used for targeting decisions.\nMIT Technology Review\n6 Anthropic has rankled users with its safety-first Fable model\nStringent safety rules and refusals to help have sparked a backlash. (\n+ Anthropic has backtracked on some policies.\n7 Pokémon Go data trained AI that could assist military drones\nIt could help them locate themselves in war zones. (\n+ Pokémon Go data is also training delivery robots.\nMIT Technology Review\n8 Orbital data centers are harder than Silicon Valley thinks\nShedding heat in space requires ingenious new designs. (\nIEEE Spectrum\n+ We need a few things to put data centers in space. (\nMIT Technology Review\n9 A toy universe shows time could be a quantum illusion\nIt could emerge from quantum interactions, rather than just existing by default. (\nNew Scientist\n10 Chatbots keep telling stories about a lighthouse keeper called Ella\nAnd now we may finally know why. (\nQuote of the day\n—Ross Gerber, the CEO of Gerber Kawasaki, which owns SpaceX stock, tells\nthe New York Times\nwhy he believes the company’s IPO is overvalued.\nOne More Thing\nGEORGE WYLESOL\nI was immediately attracted to open-world games, in which you’re free to explore a vast simulated world and choose what challenges to accept. To make them feel alive, these games are inhabited by crowds of “nonplayer characters” (NPCs). But the illusion starts to weaken when you spend enough time with them.\nIt may not always be like that. Just as it’s upending other industries, generative AI is opening the door to entirely new kinds of in-game interactions that are open-ended, creative, and unexpected. The game may not always have to end.\nDiscover how generative AI could make games—and other worlds—deeply immersive\n—Niall Firth\nWe can still have nice things\nA place for comfort, fun, and distraction to brighten up your day. (Got any ideas?\nDrop me a line\n+ My feet have fallen for the\nCrocs x Super Mario\n2026 Mullet Championship\nis the hottest hairdo contest of the year.\n+ Hungry at half-time? Here are seven\nmouth-watering international recipes\ninspired by the World Cup.\n+ Feast your eyes on a helicopter bound for Mars and a flowery Milky Way frame in\nNature’s top images from last month\nPlus: China has blocked Meta’s $2 billion acquisition of AI startup Manus.\nPlus: An unauthorized group has reportedly accessed Anthropic’s Mythos.\nPlus: Anthropic has called for a global slowdown in AI development.\nPlus: DeepSeek has unveiled its long-awaited new AI model.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more.","tp":"衰老重编程","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"专注于逆转年龄相关疾病的生物技术公司Life Biosciences宣布，已成功完成首例人体给药。一名青光眼患者接受了直接注射入眼球的实验性治疗。该疗法的核心机制是通过再生眼部健康神经来治疗疾病，这标志着抗衰老与神经再生医学领域迈出了重要临床一步。公司未来还计划将此技术拓展应用至更广泛的与年龄相关的退行性疾病治疗中。"},{"t":"靶向 TMED4 通过 IRE1α-自噬轴增强实体瘤中 CD8+ T 细胞功能和 CAR T 细胞功效","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee0517?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Endoplasmic reticulum stress (ERS) and autophagy regulate tumor-infiltrating T cell function and exhaustion, but the underlying mechanisms remain unclear. Here, we identified the ERS-related transmembrane protein TMED4 (transmembrane emp24 domain-containing 4) as a critical regulator of CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell antitumor immunity.\n                    Tmed4\n                    deletion in T cells enhanced antitumor responses by promoting CD8\n                    +\n                    T proliferation, infiltration, and killing capacity, while reducing terminal exhaustion. Mechanistically,\n                    Tmed4\n                    deficiency hyperactivated the inositol-requiring enzyme 1α (IRE1α)–X-box binding protein 1 (XBP1) axis and induced autophagy flux in an IRE1α-dependent manner. Genetic deletion of\n                    Ern1\n                    (IRE1α) or\n                    Becn1\n                    (Beclin1) impaired the antitumor effects of\n                    Tmed4\n                    deficiency, underscoring the role of ERS and autophagy in CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell function. Moreover,\n                    Tmed4\n                    -deficient chimeric antigen receptor T cells (CAR T cells) displayed improved antitumor immunity. Pharmacological inhibition of\n                    Tmed4\n                    using antisense oligonucleotide also enhanced CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell–mediated tumor control. In summary, our study reveals that TMED4 governs CD8\n                    +\n                    T cell effector function and limits terminal exhaustion through IRE1α-driven autophagy, establishing TMED4 as a promising immunotherapeutic target for improving CAR T cell efficacy.","tp":"免疫细胞疗","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现跨膜蛋白TMED4是调控CD8+ T细胞抗肿瘤免疫反应的关键因子。内质网应激（ERS）和自噬在调节肿瘤浸润T细胞功能及耗竭中起着重要作用，但其机制此前尚不明确。研究表明，敲除T细胞中的Tmed4能够通过促进IRE1α-自噬信号轴，显著增强实体瘤中CD8+ T细胞的功能以及CAR-T细胞的抗癌功效，为实体瘤免疫治疗提供了新靶点。"},{"t":"通过同位素富集调控α-MoO3的声子驱动响应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73629?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"声子极化激元","kp":["材料体系[声子极化激元]: α-MoO3正交晶系","调控手段[声子响应]: 同位素富集","光谱范围[双曲声子极化激元]: 中红外"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过同位素富集手段精确调控α-MoO3中声子驱动的极化激元响应。α-MoO3作为天然双曲极化材料，其声子色散特性直接影响中红外纳米光子学器件性能。同位素替换可在不改变晶体结构的前提下选择性调节声子频率，为纳米尺度光-物质相互作用调控提供了精确的工程化途径。","ot":"Tailoring Phonon‐Driven Responses in α‐MoO3 through Isotopic Enrichment","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The implementation of polaritonic materials into nanoscale devices requires selective tuning of parameters to realize desired spectral or thermal responses. One robust material, α‐MoO\n                    3\n                    , an orthorhombic crystal boasting three distinct phonon dispersions, provides three polaritonic dispersions of hyperbolic phonon polaritons (HPhPs) across the mid‐infrared (MIR). Here, the tunability of both optical and thermal responses in isotopically enriched α‐MoO\n                    3\n                    (\n                    98\n                    MoO\n                    3,\n                    Mo\n                    18\n                    O\n                    3\n                    , and\n                    98\n                    Mo\n                    18\n                    O\n                    3\n                    ) is explored. A uniform ∼5% spectral redshift from\n                    18\n                    O enrichment is observed in both Raman‐ and IR‐active TO phonons. Both the in‐ and out‐of‐plane thermal conductivities for the isotopic variations are reported. Ab initio calculations both replicate experimental findings and analyze the select‐mode three‐phonon scattering contributions. The HPhPs from each isotopic variation are probed with s‐SNOM, and we report an HPhP\n                    Q\n                    ‐factor maxima increase in\n                    98\n                    Mo\n                    18\n                    O\n                    3\n                    of ∼50% along the [100] in the RB\n                    2\n                    and ∼100% along the [001] in the RB\n                    3\n                    with respect to\n                    98\n                    MoO\n                    3\n                    . Observations in both real and Fourier space of higher‐order HPhP modes propagating in slabs of isotopically enriched α‐MoO\n                    3\n                    without the use of a subdiffractional surface scatterer are presented here. This work establishes the dual‐element isotope enrichment of α‐MoO\n                    3\n                    as an intrinsic strategy to design optical, thermal, and polaritonic properties."},{"t":"调控B位容差实现高密度三元纳米颗粒用于高性能直接甲烷燃料电池","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71186?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"直接甲烷燃料电池","dp":1,"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过调控钙钛矿B位容忍因子，实现原位析出高密度三元合金纳米颗粒，用于高性能直接甲烷燃料电池。原位析出策略使催化剂纳米颗粒与母体氧化物形成强锚定界面，提升甲烷氧化催化活性与长期稳定性，为固体氧化物燃料电池阳极催化剂设计提供了新方法。","ot":"Tailoring B‐Site Tolerance Enables High‐density Ternary Nanoparticles for High‐Performance Direct Methane Fuel Cell","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In situ exsolution of nanoparticles from perovskite is an effective strategy to improve the catalytic activity and stability of direct methane fuel cells (DMFCs). However, sluggish exsolution kinetics limit the formation of surface nanoparticles, leading to reduced activity and stability under coking environments. Here, we propose a strategy that tailors the B‐site tolerance to induce lattice tensile strain, thereby lowering the energy barrier for nanoparticle exsolution and achieving a 2.3–fold increase in exsolved ternary nanoparticles accompanied by abundant oxygen vacancies. Ru–containing nanoparticles significantly promote methane adsorption and activation, and the associated oxygen vacancies capture H\n                    2\n                    O molecules generated during fuel oxidation, thereby enabling effective “self–cleaning” of detrimental carbon deposition through water gasification. Consequently, the cell delivers a 43.1% increase in peak power density (from 1.048 W·cm\n                    −2\n                    to 1.5 W·cm\n                    −2\n                    ) under dry methane at 850°C and maintains stable operation for 160 h in nearly dry methane at 800°C. This strategy establishes a new paradigm for designing anodes that integrate high catalytic activity with exceptional carbon resistance in DMFCs.","aip":1},{"t":"使用 $^{197}\\mathrm{Au}$ 目标系统研究反应中的聚变裂变和准裂变","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/vmdx-klxv","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Shiva Prasad Nayak, E. Prasad, D. J. Hinde, M. Dasgupta, C. Simenel, K. J. Cook, E. C. Simpson, J. Walshe, D. Y. Jeung, C. Sengupta, K. Vo-Phuoc, J. F. Smith, I. P. Carter, H. Albers, J. Khuyagbaatar, and Ch. E. DüllmannBackground: Quasifission is a nonequilibrium phenomenon that strongly suppresses the formation of heavy nuclei in heavy-ion fusion reactions. This process shows a strong entrance channel dependence. Understanding quasifission is crucial for exploring potential avenues to synthesize new superheavy el…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064605] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"调控桨轮双铜分子催化剂的氢转移路径实现高效电催化乙酰化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73644?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化乙炔半氢化","kp":["催化剂[乙炔半加氢]: 桨轮式双铜分子催化剂","[氢转移路径]: ER与LH机制可切换"],"as":"该研究揭示了双核铜(桨轮结构)分子催化剂在电催化乙炔半氢化反应(EAH)中的氢转移路径切换机制。通过调控催化中心的电子结构与配位环境，实现了从直接氢转移向逐步质子耦合电子转移路径的转变，显著提升了乙炔选择性加氢为乙烯的效率，为设计高效电催化半氢化体系提供了分子层面的理论指导。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Switching Hydrogen Transfer Pathway Over Paddle‐Wheel Dicopper Molecular Catalysts for Efficient Electrocatalytic Acetyl","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Elucidating the hydrogen transfer pathway of electrocatalytic acetylene semihydrogenation (EAH) is crucial for understanding the catalytic mechanism and designing high‐performance catalysts, but faces grand challenges. Herein, we unprecedentedly switch the hydrogen transfer pathway between Eley‐Rideal mechanism and Langmuir‐Hinshelwood mechanism over paddle‐wheel dicopper molecular catalysts, where the charge density of the Cu sites is effectively modulated by the ligands with different electron‐withdrawing ability. Extended X‐ray absorption fine structure (EXAFS), operando characterizations, and theoretical calculations together reveal that the moderate charge density of Cu sites in benzoic acid‐Cu catalyst (BA‐Cu) inhibits H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation and reduces C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    adsorption energy, promoting the co‐adsorption of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O and steering the EAH through the Eley‐Rideal mechanism. In acetic acid‐Cu (AA‐Cu) with low charge density and monofluorobenzoic acid‐Cu (MFBA‐Cu) with high charge density, the Cu sites facilitate H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation to *H and hydrogenate C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    via the Langmuir‐Hinshelwood mechanism. In 1 \n                    M\n                    KOH aqueous solution, the BA‐Cu delivers an ethylene partial current density of 328 mA/cm\n                    2\n                    with an ethylene Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 96.4% at –0.9 V versus RHE, which is about 2‐fold and 1.4‐fold higher than AA‐Cu and MFBA‐Cu. This work provides mechanistic insights for the rational design of high‐performance electrocatalysts by regulating the hydrogenation kinetics."},{"t":"基于亚稳合成动力学的可持续高能量密度锂锰氧层状正极","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag356/8706385?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂层状正极","kp":["合成方法[富锂层状正极]: P3前驱体自发离子交换","材料体系[高能密正极]: O3-Li0.6[Li0.2Mn0.8]O2"],"as":"本研究提出了一种通过亚稳态合成策略制备高能量密度Li-Mn-O层状正极材料的方法。研究指出富锂层状正极的电化学稳定性本质上受合成路径控制，通过精确调控合成热力学条件可稳定亚稳相结构，抑制循环过程中的相变与氧释放，显著提升电池循环寿命与容量保持率，为下一代高比能锂电正极提供了新思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Sustainable high energy density Li–Mn–O layered cathode via metastable synthetic kinetics","b":"The electrochemical stability of metastable lithium-rich layered cathodes is intrinsically governed by their synthetic history, yet the correlation between ion-exchange thermodynamics and structural evolution remains elusive. Here, using layered P3-Na0.6[Li0.2Mn0.8]O2 (P3-NLM) as a precursor, the spontaneous ion exchange synthesis of O3-Li0.6[Li0.2Mn0.8]O2 (O3-LLM RT) yields one of the most promising layered Li–Mn–O cathodes reported to date within LiPF6-based carbonate electrolyte at room temperature. However, elevated synthesis temperatures induce manganese ion migration, which hinders the reversible interlayer migration of Li+ into the transition metal layers. This structural impediment triggers irreversible lattice oxygen activation and degrades structural stability (e.g., at 280°C, denoted as the O3-LLM HT). Consequently, the perfect layered O3-LLM RT cathode exhibits a high specific capacity of 250 mAh/g with excellent cycling stability of 88.1% capacity retention (vs. the 51.9% for O3-LLM HT) after 400 cycles at 2.0–4.8 V, ranking at the top of the Li–Mn–O layered cathodes. These findings provide insights into the design and optimization of metastable materials for high-energy-density batteries."},{"t":"可扩展铁单原子催化剂上超交换辅助Fe(IV)=O链形成用于低化学耗水净化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73668?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁单原子催化剂","kp":["催化剂[流动水净化]: 可扩展铁单原子催化剂","活性物种[水净化]: 超交换辅助Fe(IV)=O链形成"],"as":"该研究报道了一种可规模化铁单原子催化剂上超交换作用辅助的Fe(IV)=O链形成机制，用于聚合物驱动的高效废水处理。该体系可将污染物降解与资源回收耦合，在低能耗条件下实现深度净化，单原子Fe(IV)=O活性位通过超交换相互作用形成高活性链状结构，显著增强催化氧化效率，为绿色水处理技术提供了新策略。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Superexchange‐Assisted Fe(IV)=O Chain Formation on Scalable Iron Single‐Atom Catalysts for Low‐Chemical Water Purificati","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymerization‐based wastewater treatment can couple decontamination with resource recovery at low energy input by transforming dilute organics into separable products. However, it requires selective oxidant activation, and iron, although abundant and industrially relevant, often forms metastable over‐oxidizing adducts that suppress polymerization selectivity. Here, we design and synthesize a distance‐tailored iron single‐atom catalyst (Fe‐SAC) featuring a coupled Fe\n                    1\n                    ‐Fe\n                    2\n                    pair that enables sequential generation of reactive Fe(IV)═O species from peroxymonosulfate. Theory and experiments reveal that formation of the first Fe\n                    1\n                    (IV)═O triggers a spin‐state transition of the adjacent Fe\n                    2\n                    site to a high‐spin configuration, while the finely tuned Fe\n                    1\n                    ─Fe\n                    2\n                    separation geometrically matches the O─O bond in the oxidant. This spin reconfiguration strengthens Fe─O covalency and promotes a superexchange‐assisted pathway, leading to chain formation of Fe\n                    2\n                    (IV)═O through bidentate axial bonding and site‐to‐site electronic coupling. In a continuous‐flow reactor, the scalable Fe‐SAC increases polymerization selectivity from 29.9% to 73.3% and boosts electron utilization from 156.8% to 443.8%. Life‐cycle and techno‐economic analyses further indicate ∼88% and ∼79% reductions in environmental impacts for catalyst synthesis and operation, respectively, together with an estimated ∼90% decrease in pollutant removal cost. This work establishes a design principle to unlock selective Fe(IV)═O chemistry for low‐chemical, polymerization‐based water purification with engineering viability."},{"t":"超级地球和迷你海王星遵循不同的轨道周期-偏心率关系","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu3916?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Many exoplanets have been observed with radius sizes between that of Earth and that of Neptune and are thus classified into two groups: super-earths (SEs) and mini-neptunes (MNs). There are no SEs or MNs in the Solar System, and the mechanisms responsible for their formation and evolution are debated. We investigated the relationships between the orbital period and eccentricity of SEs and MNs using both ensemble statistical analyses and individual measurements. We found that MNs follow an anticorrelation between orbital period and eccentricity, but SEs follow a different relation, possibly in the opposite direction. These trends imply that MNs and SEs are dynamically distinct populations. We suggest that SEs have been more strongly influenced by violent processes such as gravitational scattering and giant impacts, whereas MNs predominantly experienced quiescent secular evolution."},{"t":"亚细胞金属组学网络调控生理结局：基于SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS集成的单细胞映射","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2601472123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"亚细胞金属组学","kp":["表征平台[亚细胞金属组学]: SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS集成"],"as":"该研究揭示了植物细胞内必需、非必需及有毒金属(类)元素(MEs)的亚细胞空间分布网络如何调控生理结果。通过单细胞层面的金属组学分析,阐明不同金属元素在细胞器间的精细定位与协同/拮抗作用,为理解植物营养吸收、重金属耐受及毒性解毒机制提供新视角,对作物改良与生物修复具有重要应用价值。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Subcellular metallomic networks orchestrate physiological outcomes: Single-cell mapping via an integrated SEM-FIB-TOF-SI","b":"The spatial organization of essential, nonessential, and toxic metal(loid) elements (MEs) within plant cells underpins physiological function. Yet, comprehensive subcellular imaging of the full ME spectrum remains challenging due to trade-offs among spatial resolution, elemental coverage, and structural correlation. Here, we present an integrated scanning electron microscopy–focused ion beam–time-of-flight-secondary ion mass spectrometry platform that overcomes these limitations by achieving nanoscale coregistration of ultrastructure with ME distribution. Applying this high-fidelity workflow to\n                    Arabidopsis\n                    , soybean, and wheat, we constructed single-cell metallome maps revealing an evolutionarily conserved subcellular architecture: chloroplasts enrich essential MEs (e.g., magnesium, iron, copper), whereas vacuoles compartmentalize nonessential [e.g., lanthanum (La)] and toxic MEs [e.g., cadmium (Cd), lead, arsenic]. We demonstrate that while this architecture remains stable under homeostasis, it undergoes dynamic, stimulus-specific, and dose-dependent remodeling under stress. Low-dose La(III) enhances pairwise and higher-order colocalizations of essential MEs within chloroplasts, correlating with improved photosynthetic efficiency and growth. High-dose La(III) induces nonphysiological La-ME associations and, critically, drives aberrant Cd(II) accumulation in chloroplasts—revealing a cross-toxicity mechanism wherein La(III) disrupts native sequestration barriers. In contrast, although high-dose Cd(II) is largely excluded from chloroplasts, it triggers a widespread redistribution of essential MEs, progressively eroding spatial organization. Thus, while both ions inhibit growth, they perturb metallomic networks via distinct mechanisms: La(III)-mediated disruption of sequestration vs. Cd(II)-induced systemic compartmental collapse. Our findings establish that subcellular ME networks are dynamically regulated and orchestrate physiological outcomes."},{"t":"水光互补捆绑模式下多年调节水库年末消落水位控制策略研究","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008093?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/水电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水光互补水库调度","kp":["运行模式[多年调节水库]: 水光捆绑运行"],"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Study on control strategies of year-end drawdown level in multi-year regulation reservoir under hydro-photovoltaic bundl"},{"t":"克雅氏病朊病毒变种在人源化神经细胞中的菌株特异性繁殖","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2609054123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Prions are self-templating assemblies of the host prion protein in which conformational templating encodes heritable “strain” information. Human prion diseases, including Creutzfeldt–Jakob disease (CJD), are rare but uniformly fatal neurodegenerative disorders with established public-health relevance through epidemic and iatrogenic transmission and provide a paradigm for conformational templating in neurodegeneration. Mechanistic analysis of human prion propagation and development of infectivity assays for public health surveillance have been limited by the absence of mammalian cell systems that replicate authentic infectious human prions. Here, we establish a humanized neural cell system that enables propagation of variant CJD (vCJD) prions and reveals that prion replication is constrained by strain-compatible cellular states. The platform was generated using a silencing-followed-by-reconstitution strategy analogous to that used in transgenic mouse models of human prion disease, combined with high-throughput clonal selection. These cells propagate brain-derived vCJD prions and support chronic infection. Prions propagated in vitro transmit disease to humanized transgenic and wild-type mice while preserving defining biochemical and strain-specific neuropathological features, demonstrating faithful propagation. Propagation is strain specific: The cells are permissive to vCJD but refractory to sporadic CJD isolates, indicating that prion replication is constrained by strain-compatible cellular states. These humanized cells enable quantitative detection of infection at high dilution, support systematic genetic manipulation, and are readily adaptable to automation. By overcoming a longstanding barrier of propagating authentic human prions, this platform enables mechanistic dissection of the cellular determinants of prion replication and strain specificity and provides a scalable system for genetic analysis and sensitive detection of infectious human prions.","tp":"朊病毒繁殖","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"朊病毒疾病（如克雅氏病）是一种致命的神经退行性疾病。近期研究在人源化神经细胞中成功模拟了克雅氏病朊病毒变种的繁殖过程，揭示了其毒株特异性的传播机制。该研究通过分析人类朊病毒的构象模板和信息传递过程，为理解朊病毒的感染传播机制及开发针对性治疗干预手段提供了关键的病理模型与科学依据。"},{"t":"均苯四甲酰二亚胺中可逆结构切换的刺激响应三线态发射与X射线闪烁","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3402295?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"刺激响应发光材料","kp":["材料[X射线闪烁体]: 均苯四甲酸二酰亚胺共晶","特性[刺激响应发光]: 保持结晶性可逆结构切换"],"as":"该研究开发了一种通过可逆结构转变实现智能刺激响应型三重态发光和X射线闪烁的新材料。该材料具有可编程、可逆的发射特性,能够对外界刺激产生动态响应,在辐射检测、信息加密及智能光电器件领域具有广阔应用前景。通过调控分子结构实现发光性能的可逆切换,为设计新一代智能闪烁体材料提供了创新思路。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stimuli‐Responsive Triplet Emission and X‐Ray Scintillation via Reversible Structural Switching in Pyromellitic Diimide ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Smart stimuli‐responsive luminescent materials with programmable and reversible emission are highly desirable for intelligent imaging and information security. Stimuli‐responsive organic materials utilizing triplet excitons are particularly attractive owing to their pronounced sensitivity to solid‐state packing. However, crystallinity‐preserving reversible structural switching that enables simultaneous control over X‐ray‐excited luminescence (scintillation) remains largely unexplored. Herein, donor‐acceptor halogen‐bonded cocrystals were constructed using\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    N\n                    ′‐bis(n‐butyl)pyromellitic diimide (Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI) and 3,6‐dibromocarbazole (Br\n                    2\n                    Cz) or 3,6‐diiodocarbazole (I\n                    2\n                    Cz). The green cocrystal Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz‐G exhibits room‐temperature phosphorescence (RTP) and bright radioluminescence, whereas its orange polymorph is nearly non‐emissive. In contrast, the I\n                    2\n                    Cz‐based cocrystal displays thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF), representing an alternative triplet exciton utilization pathway. Notably, mild organic‐vapor stimulation triggers reversible order‐to‐order polymorphic interconversion of Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz, which reorganizes halogen‐bonding motifs and, thus achieves crystallinity‐retained “on/off” switching of radioluminescence. Benefiting from efficient triplet exciton utilization, Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz‐G enables high‐resolution static X‐ray imaging (37 lp mm\n                    −1\n                    ) and real‐time dynamic imaging (2 K, 60 fps) with negligible afterglow. Furthermore, the reversible solvent‐triggered luminescence switching facilitates rewritable multimodal information encryption by integrating photoluminescence and radioluminescence as orthogonal readout channels. This work demonstrates cocrystal engineering as a powerful strategy for reversibly programming triplet‐exciton emission and X‐ray scintillation via structural switching in organic solids."},{"t":"空间位阻配位调控碘化学实现四电子转化的锌碘电池","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73681?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌碘电池","kp":["[转换机制]: I⁻/I⁺四电子转换","电解质策略[锌碘电池]: 位阻协调调节I⁺配位"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出通过位阻配位调控碘化学,实现四电子转化反应,用于高压水系锌碘电池。现有锌碘电池受限于I+中间体不稳定性,库伦效率和循环性能不佳。该策略通过空间位阻配位设计稳定碘中间态,使碘离子发生四电子氧化还原反应,显著提升能量密度和循环寿命,为高性能水系电池正极设计开辟新路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Steric Coordination Modulated Iodine Chemistry With Four‐Electron Conversion for Zinc‐Iodine Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The advancement of high‐voltage aqueous zinc‐iodine batteries is impeded by the instability of I\n                    +\n                    intermediates during the conversion process, which suffers from hydrolysis and poor reversibility in conventional electrolytes. To overcome these challenges, we propose a steric coordination strategy employing Cl\n                    −\n                    and sulfonate‐rich TES\n                    −\n                    ions to modulate the coordination environment of I\n                    +\n                    ions. Cl\n                    −\n                    ions activate I\n                    +\n                    ions through halide coordination, while the steric‐hindrance effect of TES\n                    −\n                    within the TES‐I‐Cl coordination structure effectively shields I\n                    +\n                    ions from nucleophilic attacks by water‐derived hydroxyl groups, collectively facilitating the reversible I\n                    −\n                    /I\n                    0\n                    /I\n                    +\n                    four‐electron conversion. Concurrently, adsorbed ions (TES\n                    −\n                    , Ch\n                    +\n                    , Cl\n                    −\n                    ) establish an electrostatic shielding layer to homogenize zinc deposition and form a dehydrated electric double layer to mitigate zinc corrosion. Moreover, the disruption of H‐bond networks between the water molecules induced by the additives reduces the water activity, further suppressing I\n                    +\n                    hydrolysis and water dissociation. Benefiting from these synergetic effects, the zinc‐iodine battery achieves highly reversible and stable iodine chemistry, including a high‐rate capability and long‐term cycling stability over 42 000 cycles (capacity retention: ∼70%). This work provides fundamental insights into ion coordination chemistry for designing high‐energy‐density aqueous iodine storage.","aip":1},{"t":"高原子序数快速有机闪烁体的空间分子解耦设计","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4586495?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机闪烁体","kp":["设计策略[有机闪烁体]: 空间分子解耦","瓶颈[高Z闪烁体]: 高Z元素引发SOC猝灭荧光"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出空间分子解耦设计策略，开发出兼具高原子序数(Z)探测效率和快响应的有机闪烁体材料。通过分子工程将发光中心与重原子单元在空间上解耦，抑制聚集诱导猝灭，同时保留高效辐射能量传递，解决了有机闪烁体长期面临的高灵敏度与快时间响应难以兼得的矛盾。","ot":"Spatial Molecular Decoupling Design for High‐Z and Fast Organic Scintillators","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organic scintillators are pivotal for flexible and low‐cost radiation detection; however, they face a long‐standing “absorption–speed” trade‐off: incorporating high‐Z elements to enhance X‐ray attenuation typically triggers strong spin–orbit coupling (SOC), which quenches prompt fluorescence and diverts excitation energy into slow, microsecond‐scale triplet pathways. Here, we present a molecular decoupling strategy to overcome this dilemma, realized in a donor–acceptor–donor (D–A–D) hybridized local and charge‐transfer (HLCT) molecule, 4,7‐bis(4‐(bis(4‐iodophenyl)methyl)phenyl)benzo[\n                    c\n                    ][1,2,5]thiadiazole (TPBI). By terminally tethering iodine atoms to the triphenylamine units, we achieve robust X‐ray attenuation while preserving a fast “hot‐exciton” emission channel. The intrinsic nonplanar geometry and strategic spatial arrangement of the molecule successfully isolate the heavy‐atom effect from the emissive core, maintaining the crucial quasi‐degeneracy between the T\n                    2\n                    and S\n                    1\n                    states. This configuration facilitates rapid high‐lying reverse intersystem crossing (hRISC), enabling near‐unity exciton utilization without compromising nanosecond‐scale decay kinetics. Our TPBI‐based scintillator demonstrates a synergized performance profile of potent X‐ray interaction (attenuation efficiency 5.672 cm\n                    2\n                    g\n                    −1\n                    at 28 keV) and a fast temporal response (2.96 ns), providing a general molecular design paradigm for next‐generation, high‐performance organic radiation detectors."},{"t":"SpaceX 将 IPO 定价为每股 135 美元，周五开始交易","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/spacex-prices-ipo-135-per-share-starts-trading-friday","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"SpaceX Prices IPO at $135 Per Share, Starts Trading Friday — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"熵工程纳米材料的软化学合成路线：氧化还原电催化中复杂性驱动的性能提升","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00987E","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"高熵纳米催化剂","kp":["合成路线[高熵纳米材料]: 软化学温和条件","应用[高熵电催化剂]: 氧化还原电催化"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"综述了通过软化学路线合成熵工程化高熵纳米材料(HENMs)的策略及其在氧化还原电催化中的性能优势。高熵纳米材料凭借组分复杂性带来的'鸡尾酒效应'和结构畸变，在析氢、析氧等电催化反应中展现出优异活性和稳定性，软化学方法为精确控制其纳米尺度和元素分布提供了温和路径。","ot":"Soft-Chemistry Routes to Entropy-Engineered Nanomaterials: Complexity-Driven Performance in Redox Electrocatalysis","b":"High-entropy nanomaterials (HENMs) have emerged as a distinctive class of electrocatalysts in which compositional complexity generates synergistic active sites, tuned electronic structures and exceptional durability. Conventional approaches to high-entropy phases have relied on harsh thermal or high-pressure conditions to achieve uniform alloying, restricting both scalability and structural control. In contrast, recent advances in soft-chemistry routes, such as hydrothermal and solvothermal methods, precursor decomposition, galvanic exchange and co-precipitation, enable the stabilization of high-entropy architectures under remarkably mild conditions. These strategies not only overcome kinetic barriers for multimetallic integration but also permit precise tailoring of morphology, surface chemistry and atomic configurations. Such structural control is critical for governing adsorption energetics, charge-transfer pathways and resilience under reaction environments, thereby paving the way toward the complexity-driven performance of HENMs in redox electrocatalysis. This review offers a unique perspective by focusing on soft-chemistry synthesis of HENMs and the resulting structureperformance relationships in electrocatalytic oxidation and reduction reactions. We critically examine formation mechanisms, design principles and catalytic outcomes, highlighting how entropy-engineered complexity translates into enhanced activity, selectivity and stability. Finally, we identify emerging opportunities for advancing mild-condition synthesis as a sustainable and versatile platform for the rational design of next-generation high-entropy electrocatalysts for energy conversion.."},{"t":"软硬件，流动软件：用于适应性化学计算的可重构微流体","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73669?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Chemical and physical computing systems promise information processing in performance regimes inaccessible to conventional electronics. However, they are typically constrained by static hardware architectures that limit adaptability and computational richness. Here, we introduce a reconfigurable microfluidic platform where soft hydrogel structures are 3D‐printed and erased in situ to dynamically reshape the physical environment in which chemical computation occurs. By treating microfluidic geometry as an active, programmable element rather than a passive container, we demonstrate hardware‐reconfigurable control over chemical information processing. We demonstrate switchable Deoxyribonucleic acid (DNA) logic gates that alternate between AND and OR functionality without modifying the underlying reaction network, decoupling logic function from molecular composition. Extending this to a non‐equilibrium chemical reaction network in the form of a feedback‐controlled pH oscillator, we demonstrate that printed structures steer reaction kinetics and spatial pattern formation, giving rise to geometry‐dependent spatiotemporal states. Leveraging these dynamics, we implement a physical reservoir computer in which reconfigurable microfluidic hardware enables the realization of diverse nonlinear functions through simple linear readout. Our work establishes reconfigurable soft microfluidic hardware as a control layer for chemical computation, highlighting how adaptable physical environments actively expand the computational state space of chemical software.","tp":"微流控计算","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者提出可重构微流体平台，通过3D打印水凝胶结构并原位擦除，动态重塑化学计算发生的物理环境。该软硬件系统突破了静态硬件架构限制，实现适应性化学计算，拓展了非常规信息处理的计算范式。","aip":1},{"t":"Snowflake 全场紧逼，让员工使用人工智能","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/applied-ai/snowflake-mounts-full-court-press-get-employees-using-ai","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Subscribe to unlock","tp":"智能化办公","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.5,"t":5.0},"as":"云数据公司Snowflake正采取全场紧逼的策略，积极推动并要求其员工在日常工作中使用人工智能。"},{"t":"Sierra Space 和 Axiom 计划 IPO，SpaceX 助推狂热","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/dealmaker/sierra-space-axiom-plot-ipos-spacex-feeds-frenzy","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"变化的电流","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5876?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"After decades of warnings, new data suggest the Atlantic Ocean’s vital circulation may withstand climate warming better than feared"},{"t":"PET在良性溶剂中的自晶种成核制备超低热导率高模量气凝胶","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73409?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PET气凝胶","kp":["溶剂[PET气凝胶]: 1,3-二苯基丙酮良性溶剂","特性[PET气凝胶]: 高模量、超低热导率"],"as":"研究报道了一种以PET（聚对苯二甲酸乙二醇酯）为原料、在良性溶剂中通过自晶种成核制备高模量气凝胶的新方法。PET是最广泛回收的塑料，但将其升级回收为高性能材料一直受限。该气凝胶兼具高弹性模量与超低热导率，为PET的高附加值再利用和高效隔热材料开发提供了新路径。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Self‐Seeded Nucleation of PET in a Benign Solvent Yields a High Modulus Aerogel With Ultra‐Low Thermal Conductivity","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Poly(ethylene terephthalate) (PET) is the most recycled plastic; however, upcycling of this commodity polymer to value‐added products has remained limited. Recent attempts to produce PET aerogels have relied on toxic solvents, chemical conversions and cross‐linking, and reinforcement to achieve useful mechanical performance. Now, using a new benign solvent (1,3‐diphenylacetone), we report a simple, safe, and sustainable dissolution and gelation procedure to convert waste PET into low density, monolithic aerogels with high mechanical strength (E = 20 ± 2 MPa) and remarkably low thermal conductivity (k = 21.9 to 28.9 mW m\n                    −1\n                    K\n                    −1\n                    ). The key to this process is controlled crystal nucleation by a self‐seeding phenomenon during gelation that establishes a mesoscale fibrillar framework. Our strategy offers a benign sol–gel process to upcycle plastic waste into a new form of pure PET for advanced thermal insulation.","aip":1},{"t":"具有精确排列的发光体的[2]Rotaxane取向异构体的选择性合成：朝向方向依赖性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3759413?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Aiming at the precise synthesis of rotaxane orientational isomers and the further elucidation of attractive orientation effects, a novel steric hindrance‐controlled selective stopper exchange approach has been successfully developed. This method enables the facile and selective synthesis of six pairs of [2]rotaxane orientational isomers with precisely arranged luminogens, greatly enriching both the structural and functional diversity of such isomers. Notably, the resulting orientational isomers exhibit orientation‐dependent emission behaviors, particularly in wavelengths, photoluminescence quantum yields, and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) performances, endowing them with great potential for information storage and encryption. This proof‐of‐concept study provides not only a practical and efficient strategy for the efficient synthesis of rotaxane orientational isomers, but also a novel platform for constructing chiral luminescent materials with desired properties for wide applications.","tp":"轮烷异构体","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"通过位阻控制的选择性止端交换策略，实现六对[2]轮烷取向异构体的简便选择性合成，精确排列发光体分子。该方法丰富了取向异构体的结构与功能多样性，为方向依赖性发光材料研究奠定基础。"},{"t":"二次谐波超米氏光学活性实现闭环手性光化学","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73593?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"研究提出利用二次谐波超米氏光学活性实现闭环手性光化学的新策略。传统光化学依赖穿透力有限的紫外光，而该方案借助非线性光学效应和手性光场，在温和条件下驱动不对称化学反应。这一方法有望提升光化学合成的可持续性与选择性，为绿色化学和手性药物合成开辟新途径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性光化学","kp":["光源[手性光化学]: 飞秒红外脉冲倍频","转化体系[手性光化学]: CdTe/CdO纳米螺旋→CdO纳米球","驱动方式[光化学]: 圆偏振光诱导可控氧化"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Second‐Harmonic Hyper‐Mie Optical Activity Enables Closed‐Loop Chiral Photochemistry","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Photochemistry promises sustainable chemical processing but typically depends on ultraviolet light with limited selectivity and penetration. We report nonlinear chiral photochemistry, where femtosecond infrared pulses are frequency‐doubled to both drive and track a transformation of chiral CdTe/CdO nanohelices into CdO nanospheroids. Circularly polarized light induces a controlled oxidation sequence monitored in real time through second‐harmonic scattering intensity and chiroptical contrast. As the CdO shell fractures and exposes non‐centrosymmetric CdTe, second‐harmonic intensity rises twenty‐fold, polarization reverses, and characteristic CdTe photoluminescence emerges. These findings are enabled by the experimental observation of the second‐harmonic hyper‐Mie optical activity effect, which completes a suite of nonlinear chiroptical scattering phenomena predicted over 45 years ago. Our results offer a spatially confined, selective, and temporally‐resolved method for material transformation."},{"t":"在 Belle 寻找 $B$ 衰变中能量缺失的微弱相互作用粒子","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/1rl4-j3np","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): M. Abumusabh et al. (The Belle and Belle II Collaborations)We present a search for an invisible hidden-sector particle ${X}_{\\mathrm{inv}}$, produced in ${B}^{0}→{\\overline{D}}^{0}{X}_{\\mathrm{inv}}$ and ${B}^{±}→h{X}_{\\mathrm{inv}}$ decays, where $h={π}^{±}$, ${K}^{±}$, ${D}_{s}^{±}$, ${p}^{±}$. The search is performed using ${e}^{+}{e}^{−}$ collision data…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231802] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"科学家揭开了为什么随着年龄的增长，走路会变得更慢、更疲惫","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-uncover-why-walking-gets-slower-and-more-exhausting-as-we-age/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A new study reveals that aging changes the body’s walking strategy, prioritizing balance and safety over efficiency.\nWalking may seem automatic, but every step requires a complex balance between stability, muscle coordination, and forward propulsion. As people age, that balance begins to shift. New research from Australia suggests the body gradually adopts a more cautious walking strategy, prioritizing staying upright over moving efficiently. While that adjustment may help prevent instability in the short term, it also appears to make walking slower, more tiring, and potentially more vulnerable to falls.\nThe study, conducted by researchers at\nFlinders University\nand the University of Canberra, found that aging leads to a more “safety-first” walking pattern. While this approach improves stability, it also reduces speed and energy efficiency, helping explain why older adults tend to fatigue more quickly and face a greater risk of falls.\nAccording to lead author Dr. Cody Lindsay, an expert in sport and exercise technology, the ankle is essential for both maintaining balance and generating forward movement.\n“As we get older, the body starts to favor stability over efficiency,” says Dr Lindsay, from the Flinders Caring Futures Institute.\n“That helps keep us upright, but it also makes walking more of an effort.”\nThe researchers found that older adults are more likely to activate opposing ankle muscles at the same time, a phenomenon known as co-contraction. This increases joint stiffness and helps improve balance when the foot contacts the ground.\nHowever, Dr. Lindsay notes that this added stability comes with drawbacks.\n“Stiffening the joint makes walking safer, but it also means the muscles are working harder without generating as much forward movement,” he says.\nThe study also found that older adults generate less push-off power with each step, leading to shorter strides and slower walking speeds.\nAssociate Professor Maarten Immink, a co-author of the study, says these changes reflect a broader adjustment in the body’s movement control systems.\n“The nervous system adopts a safety-first approach, compensating for age-related changes by favoring stability over performance,” says Associate Professor Immink, Lead of the Active Lives Research Program within the Caring Futures Institute at Flinders University.\n“These changes can also increase fatigue and make walking longer distances more challenging, while reducing the ability to recover from trips or slips – a key factor in falls among older adults.”\n“Even gradual changes can affect confidence and independence, and people may notice they tire more quickly or feel less steady, especially on uneven ground.”\nThe findings also suggest new ways to help people maintain mobility as they age.\nRather than focusing only on strength, the researchers say exercise programs should also address balance, coordination, and the way muscles work together during each step.\n“For older Australians, simple actions can make a difference, including regular physical activity, balance exercises such as tai chi, lower-leg strengthening, and activities that challenge coordination,” says Dr Lindsay, from Flinders’ College of Health and Enablement.\n“Staying active is one of the most important things people can do, and small, consistent exercises can help you stay confident, mobile, and independent for longer.”\nThe team hopes the results will help guide improved fall prevention measures and rehabilitation programs that support healthy aging.\nReference: “Ageing alters ankle mechanics and muscle co-contraction patterns across the gait cycle” by Cody Lindsay, Ceridwen R. Radcliffe and Maarten A. Immink, 23 April 2026,\nGait & Posture\nDOI: 10.1016/j.gaitpost.2026.110202\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nFlinders University\nPublic Health\nThe Most Effective Treatment for Osteoarthritis Isn’t a Pill or Surgery\nThis Type of Exercise Is Most Effective at Reducing Body Fat in Older Adults\nBreakthrough Bone Discovery Could Lead To “Exercise-in-a-Pill” for Osteoporosis\nScientists Track Human Fitness for Nearly 50 Years and Discover When Physical Aging Really Starts\nWhy Eating Alone Could Be Surprisingly Dangerous for Older Adults\nScientists Say Exercise May Actually Reverse Your Biological Age\nMore Exercise Isn’t Always Better: New Study Reveals the Surprising Secret to a Younger Brain\nThis Simple Trick Could Help Older Adults Stay Fit\nThis Simple Habit in Your 40s and 50s Could Delay Alzheimer’s","tp":"衰老步态学","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"澳大利亚的一项最新研究揭示了老年人走路变慢且易感疲惫的根本原因。研究表明，随着年龄增长，人体的行走策略会发生改变，逐渐从追求移动效率转变为优先考虑平衡与安全。尽管这种更加谨慎的步伐有助于防止身体不稳和跌倒，但却牺牲了步态的连贯性与能量利用率。该发现为深入理解老年人运动功能退化及改善步态干预提供了新视角。"},{"t":"科学家在新冠疫情期间追踪了 4,500 只动物——他们的发现令人惊讶","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-tracked-4500-animals-during-covid-what-they-discovered-was-surprising/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"New research shows that wildlife reacts differently to human presence than to human-made landscapes.\nFor centuries, people have transformed landscapes, forcing wildlife to adjust to a rapidly changing world. New research suggests that animals are not only responding to altered habitats, but also to the direct presence of humans.\nResearchers from UC Santa Barbara, the Smithsonian’s National Zoo and Conservation Biology Institute, and\nYale University\ntracking data from 37 animal\nwith cellphone location information collected across the United States. Their study, published in\n, found that animals respond to human activity in very different ways depending on the species and the condition of the surrounding habitat. The results point to the need for more tailored conservation and wildlife management strategies.\n“Humans have complicated effects on wildlife — from our physical presence to how we reshape habitats — but we can’t understand our full impact without information on both,” said co-lead author Ruth Oliver, an assistant professor in UCSB’s Bren School of Environmental Science & Management.\npandemic created an unusual opportunity to examine these effects separately. As lockdowns changed how people moved through their communities, researchers were able to compare the influence of human presence with the effects of long-term landscape changes.\nThe team analyzed weekly GPS records from 4,581 mammals and birds across the continental United States during the same periods in 2019 and 2020. Measuring human activity required a more direct approach than researchers typically have available.\nReliable public data on human movement are limited. As a result, studies of human-wildlife interactions often rely on indirect indicators such as urban development, agriculture, or pandemic restrictions. Because these measures do not directly track where people are, the researchers turned to anonymized cellphone geolocation data at the neighborhood level. According to the authors, this is the first study to use this type of information to examine how human presence affects animal movement.\n“The cell phone data we used was made available to researchers during the pandemic to help reveal the impacts of COVID-19 shutdowns,” said co-lead author Scott Yanco, a research ecologist at the Smithsonian’s National Zoo. “Typically, private companies hold onto these, which made this a rare opportunity for us to quantify how human presence impacts wildlife, and to demonstrate that there is more to consider than just land modification to create robust conservation plans.”\nThe researchers examined how human activity influenced both the area used by individual animals and their environmental niches, which describe how species interact with habitats and available resources. Their analysis showed that, for most species, the effects of habitat modification cannot be fully understood without also accounting for human presence.\nOverall, 57% of the species studied were affected by a combination of human presence and landscape changes. Human activity was linked to shifts in occupied area or environmental niche size for 67% of mammal species and 68% of bird species.\nIn many cases, the effects of human presence and habitat modification were closely connected. About 67% of mammal species and 41% of bird species reduced the areas they used when both factors increased. These responses were often strongest in less developed settings, such as national parks, where animals appeared more sensitive to people than in heavily urbanized environments.\nSpecies responses were far from uniform. Wolves were unusual in that they expanded their ranges in response to human presence, potentially reflecting a tendency to spread farther apart and avoid people.\nWhite-tailed deer and sandhill cranes reacted in opposite ways. Deer expanded their environmental niches as landscapes became more modified but contracted them when human presence increased. Sandhill cranes showed the reverse pattern.\n“These findings highlight the critical importance of species-based conservation,” Oliver said. “Every species has different habitat requirements, has its own particular behavioral tendencies and faces unique threats. Effective conservation requires that we understand the particular challenges that each species faces.”\nThe study is part of the COVID-19 Bio-Logging Initiative, a global collaboration established to investigate wildlife responses to pandemic lockdowns, a period researchers called the “anthropause.”\nEarlier studies from the initiative documented widespread behavioral changes among mammals, major shifts in marine traffic, and the value of tracking human movement when studying wildlife responses during the Anthropocene (the time period when human activities have had an environmental impact on the Earth). The effort brought together 600 partners and collected about 1 billion location records from roughly 13,000 animals.\nThe new findings demonstrate how combining animal GPS data with mobile device location information can provide a more detailed understanding of human impacts on wildlife. The approach allows scientists to separate the effects of infrastructure and habitat alteration from the effects of people themselves.\nOliver’s team is now investigating how human-driven changes to landscapes and climate influence wildlife mortality.\n“Our current study shows that animals change how they use space and resources, but we don’t know if these changes are helping them adapt or are a sign of stress,” she pointed out. “Our group is now digging into that question by asking whether animals that change their behavior in response to human pressures are at greater or lower risk of dying.”\nThe pandemic offered researchers a rare chance to study human influences on wildlife in ways that were previously impossible. As a result, conservation policies developed before this period lacked many of the insights now emerging about how animals respond to people.\n“Our results give me some optimism that we can achieve wildlife-coexistence through more nuanced policies that more smartly consider where and when we need to give animals space,” Oliver said.\nReference: “Interacting effects of human presence and landscape modification on birds and mammals” by Ruth Y. Oliver, Scott W. Yanco, Diego Ellis-Soto, Brett R. Jesmer, Juliet Cohen, Song Gao, Robert Patchett, Tal Avgar, Keith Bildstein, Nicholas W. Bakner, David Barber, Kristin Barker, Joseph G. Barnes, Guillaume Bastille-Rousseau, Jerrold L. Belant, John F. Benson, Joël Bêty, Dean E. BeyerJr., David Bird, Nathaniel Bowersock, Andy J. Boyce, Ben S. Carlson, Michael L. Casazza, Michael J. Chamberlain, Michael J. Cherry, Bret A. Collier, Alyson Courtemanch, Sarah C. Davidson, Darren DeBloois, Vickie DeNicola, Christopher R. DeSorbo, Robert C. Dowler, Daniel Dupont, L. Mark Elbroch, John Elliott, Betsy A. Evans, W. Mark Ford, David Hancock, Molly Hardesty-Moore, Jason E. Hawley, Mackenzie R. Jeffress, Scott Jennings, Matthew J. Kauffman, Roland Kays, Marcella J. Kelly, Bryan M. Kluever, Myles Lamont, Scott LaPoint, Tayler N. LaSharr, Josee Lefebvre, Pierre Legagneux, Matthias-Claudio Loretto, David Lumpkin, Lindsay A. Martinez, John M. Marzluff, Douglas McCauley, Fiona McDuie, Tony W. Mong, Kevin L. Monteith, Thomas Mueller, Levi Newediuk, Anna C. Ortega, Federico Ossi, Cory Overton, J. Clint Perkins, Tyler R. Petroelje, Laura Prugh, Kimberly A. Sager-Fradkin, Michael Seer, Avery L. Shawler, Shannon Skalos, Rachel A. Smiley, Julia Sommerfeld, Daniel R. Stahler, John A. Stephenson, Richard D. Stevens, Nathan J. Svoboda, Jean-Francois Therrien, Philippe J. Thomas, Meredith VanAcker, Eric Vander Wal, Dan E. Varland, Tana L. Verzuh, Brittany L. Wagler, Nils Warnock, Stephen L. Webb, Christopher K. Williams, Christopher C. Wilmers, David W. Wolfson, Julie K. Young, Christian Rutz and Walter Jetz, 21 May 2026,\nDOI: 10.1126/science.adq3396\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAnimal Sciences\nConservation\nUC Santa Barbara\nWildlife Biology\nToo Many Koalas? Scientists Warn of Looming Ecological Collapse in South Australia\nScientists Turn to DNA From Poo To Save the World’s Rarest Marsupial\nNew Study Debunks 50-Year Myth About Hawaiʻi’s Native Bird Extinctions\nDid Wolves Really Transform Yellowstone? New Analysis Says No\nGray Wolves Are Hunting Sea Otters – and Scientists Don’t Know How\nMass Starvation Decimates South Africa’s Penguins As Food Supplies Collapse\nScientists Stunned by Bird That Pretends To Be a Toxic Caterpillar\nScientists Discover “Genetic Weak Point” of Critically Endangered Apennine Brown Bears\nHuman Impact on Wildlife Revealed by COVID-19 Lockdown","tp":"动物追踪术","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"新冠疫情封锁期间的追踪研究揭示了野生动物对人类直接存在与人为改造景观的不同反应。研究团队通过分析37种动物的移动数据，证实动物不仅会根据栖息地改变行为，也会直接对人类的出现做出响应。这一发现为理解人类活动如何影响生态系统提供了新视角。"},{"t":"科学家揭示12个人被困南极洲10个月时发生的事情","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-reveal-what-happened-when-12-people-were-trapped-together-in-antarctica-for-10-months/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A study at one of Earth’s most isolated research stations offers new clues about how teams adapt during long periods of confinement.\nWhen people are isolated in extreme environments, it seems intuitive that spending more time together would strengthen social bonds. But new research suggests that under the right conditions, constant contact may actually create new sources of tension.\nAn international team led by Jan Schmutz of the University of Zurich and Andrea Cantisani of the\nUniversity of Bern\ninvestigated how prolonged confinement affects group dynamics during a 10-month overwintering mission at Concordia Station in Antarctica. The remote outpost is considered one of the best real-world stand-ins for future missions to the Moon or\n, where small crews will live and work together for months or even years.\nLocated on the Antarctic plateau, Concordia Station experiences winter temperatures as low as minus 80°C (minus 112°F) and remains largely cut off from the rest of the world during the winter months. These conditions provide researchers with a rare opportunity to study the psychological and social challenges of long-term isolation.\nThroughout the mission, 12 crew members completed periodic surveys and wore proximity sensors that tracked their day-to-day interactions. The combination of self-reported experiences and objective behavioral data allowed scientists to follow changes in team relationships over time.\nOne of the study’s most surprising findings was that spending more time in close proximity to others was not always beneficial. Participants who interacted more frequently with fellow crew members were more likely to report conflict, increasing mistrust, and lower performance. The findings indicate that in highly confined environments, constant contact can become a source of stress alongside isolation.\n“In small teams under extreme conditions, more contact doesn’t automatically equate to social support, but can actually increase tensions,” says Jan Schmutz. Because the study identified correlations rather than cause-and-effect relationships, the researchers cannot determine what drove these outcomes. For instance, people experiencing loneliness may have sought more social interaction, but those interactions may not have provided the support they needed.\nData from the wearable sensors also showed that the crew gradually split into smaller social groups over time. Team members tended to spend more time with people who shared their language or nationality. While these connections can offer comfort and stability in stressful situations, they may also contribute to social divisions and reduce cohesion within multicultural teams.\nThe findings have important implications for future long-duration space missions, where small groups of astronauts may live and work together for months or even years with limited privacy and little contact with the outside world. The results may also be relevant to other isolated settings, including submarines, offshore oil platforms, and remote research stations. “The results show how important it is to identify social dynamics early on and provide teams with targeted support,” Schmutz says.\nThe study also found that wearable proximity sensors remained reliable under extreme Antarctic conditions. These devices enabled researchers to monitor changes in daily social patterns without disrupting crew activities. Future studies will investigate which types of social interactions help reduce stress and which may increase it.\nReference: “Social interactions in isolated, confined, and extreme environments: A study of Antarctic winter teams using wearable sensors” by Andrea Cantisani, Jan B. Schmutz, Pedro Marques-Quinteiro, Lorenzo Dall’Amico, Ciro Cattuto, Mirko Antino, Walter J. Eppich, Katharina Stegmayer and Sebastian Walther, 26 May 2026,\nProceedings of the National Academy of Sciences\nDOI: 10.1073/pnas.2533420123\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nMental Health\nSocial Groups\nUniversity of Zurich\nBeing Single in Your Late 20s May Take a Toll on Mental Well-Being\nAir Pollution Linked to Development of Depression Symptoms in Adolescents\nStress Alone Can Lead to Excessive Drinking in Women – But Not Men\nDigital Interventions: Smartphone-Based Treatments Effective at Reducing Symptoms of Depression\nSpice (Synthetic Marijuana) Withdrawal Symptoms More Severe Than Cannabis\nAutistic People More Likely to Use Recreational Drugs to Self-Medicate\nHomophobic Statements Trigger Elevated Stress in Lesbian, Gay and Bisexual People – Can Contribute to Health Problems\nResearchers Warn: Large Number of COVID-19 Survivors Will Experience Cognitive Complications\nHappy Childhood? That’s No Guarantee for Good Mental Health Later in Life","tp":"极地隔离学","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"一项针对南极洲极端隔离环境的研究颠覆了人们对团队凝聚力的传统认知。研究发现，在长达10个月的封闭环境中，持续的接触反而可能成为新的紧张关系来源。该研究由苏黎世大学和国际团队主导，揭示了极端隔离条件下团队社会动态的复杂性，对长期太空任务等场景具有重要启示意义。"},{"t":"科学家建议这样做可以减少怀孕期间的焦虑","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-recommend-doing-this-to-reduce-anxiety-during-pregnancy/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A new study suggests that sleep loss during pregnancy and the postpartum period may be an early driver of anxiety symptoms.\nLack of sleep is often treated as an unavoidable part of pregnancy and new parenthood. But what if those restless nights are doing more than leaving parents exhausted? New research suggests sleep loss may play an important role in the development of anxiety during one of the most physically and emotionally demanding periods of life.\nWhile postpartum and perinatal depression receive much of the public attention, anxiety disorders are actually among the most common mental health challenges during pregnancy and after childbirth. Researchers at\nWashington University in St. Louis\nfound evidence that disrupted sleep may be one of the earliest warning signs, potentially appearing before anxiety symptoms take hold.\nAn estimated 15% of people experience an anxiety-related disorder during pregnancy or in the postpartum period, which refers to the weeks and months after childbirth. This stage is also associated with a greater likelihood of developing symptoms linked to obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD), including intrusive thoughts and compulsive behaviors.\nTo better understand how sleep fits into this picture, researchers followed about 230 women through multiple stages of pregnancy and postpartum. Their findings were recently published in the journal\nThe research team, led by psychiatrist Mary Kimmel, MD, PhD, of WashU Medicine and psychologist Rebecca Cox, PhD, tracked participants during early and late pregnancy as well as during the early and later postpartum periods. Their goal was to determine whether changes in sleep were connected to changes in anxiety and OCD-related symptoms over time.\nSleep disruption is extremely common during pregnancy. Hormonal shifts, physical discomfort, frequent nighttime awakenings, and later the demands of caring for an infant can all make consistent, restorative sleep difficult to achieve. Previous studies have shown that sleep quality often deteriorates during the third trimester and reaches its lowest point shortly after childbirth.\nOne of the biggest unanswered questions has been whether anxiety causes poor sleep or whether poor sleep helps drive anxiety.\nTo investigate, participants completed surveys measuring sleep habits, anxiety levels, and OCD-related beliefs. Questions explored concerns such as “worrying about the baby” and “fear of harm coming to the baby,” along with beliefs such as “harmful events will happen unless I’m very careful” and “things are not right if they’re not perfect.”\nResearchers also examined a psychological factor known as coping ability. This reflects how strongly people believe they can manage challenges, adapt to changing circumstances, and maintain a sense of control when facing stress.\nThe results pointed consistently in one direction: less sleep was associated with rising anxiety and stronger obsessive beliefs over time.\nWomen who experienced more disrupted sleep tended to report higher levels of perinatal anxiety. The relationship was particularly strong among those who felt less confident in their ability to cope with life’s demands.\nInterestingly, coping ability affected the connection between sleep and anxiety, but not the connection between sleep and obsessive beliefs.\nThe study also found little evidence that anxiety or obsessive beliefs were driving sleep problems. Instead, the data suggest that sleep loss generally comes first, with anxiety symptoms developing afterward.\nAccording to the researchers, shorter sleep duration emerged as a particularly strong predictor of future perinatal anxiety. In other words, changes in sleep may provide an early signal that someone is at greater risk of developing anxiety symptoms later.\nAs Cox summarized, “trying to prioritize mom’s sleep may have benefits for her mental health.”\nReference: “Subjective sleep disruption, coping, and anxiety and related symptoms in the perinatal period: findings from a longitudinal study” by Rebecca C Cox, Caroline P Hoyniak, Jack Samuels, Jonathan S Abramowitz, Gerald Nestadt, Eric A Storch, Rashelle Musci, Paul Nestadt, Lauren M Osborne and Mary Kimmel, 1 April 2026,\nDOI: 10.1093/sleep/zsag089\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nMental Health\nPublic Health\nWashington University in St. Louis\nKetamine Is Showing Increasing Promise in Treating Depression, but Major Questions Remain\nScientists Identify 7 Lifestyle Factors That Can Lower Your Risk of Depression\nTroubling Findings: Bisexual Women Are Three Times More Likely To Attempt Suicide\nSatisfying Relationships: The Surprising Secret to Lowering Your Risk of Multiple Chronic Diseases?\nWaning Immunity: Your Mental Health May Impact Your Chances of Breakthrough COVID\nPregnant Women Have Lingering Depression, Anxiety – Even With Antidepressant Treatment\nSitting More Is Linked to Increased Depression and Anxiety – “Sneaky Behavior”\nMice With Hallucination-Like Behaviors Reveal Insights Into Psychotic Illnesses\nSkyrocketing Suicides Were Predicted During First Wave of the COVID-19 Pandemic – Here’s What Johns Hopkins Researchers Actually Found"},{"t":"科学侦探在中国获得罕见赞誉","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5918?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Geng Hongwei’s investigations into prominent Chinese scientists have triggered unusually swift responses"},{"t":"下沉海岸线的卫星地图面临审查","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5924?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Radar studies produce contradictory results, raising questions about efforts to identify areas vulnerable to rising seas","tp":"海岸沉降测","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"科学家利用卫星雷达数据识别易受海平面上升威胁的海岸区域，但不同雷达研究得出的沉降速率结果相互矛盾，引发对现有海岸线下沉测绘可靠性的质疑。这一争议直接影响沿海城市防灾规划和基础设施投资决策的准确性。"},{"t":"抽样偏差夸大了花卉一夫一妻制的主张：巴瓦等人的重新评估。 (2025)","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604395123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"SUCNR1 协调肝细胞的代谢通量、线粒体功能和营养依赖性适应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8873?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Succinate, a mitochondrial metabolite, also functions as an extracellular signal through its receptor succinate receptor 1 (SUCNR1), coordinating responses to nutrient availability. The physiological role of SUCNR1 within hepatocytes, however, is unclear. We show that hepatic succinate levels and\n                    Sucnr1\n                    expression are dynamically regulated by nutritional status. Mice lacking\n                    Sucnr1\n                    in hepatocytes [Hep-\n                    Sucnr1\n                    knockout (KO)] exhibit a fasting-like phenotype characterized by enhanced gluconeogenesis, elevated amino acids, and impaired metabolic flexibility. Mechanistically, loss of\n                    Sucnr1\n                    compromises glucose-derived oxidative flux through the tricarboxylic acid cycle, increases reliance on glutamine-dependent anaplerosis, and induces mitochondrial stress adaptations. Upon refeeding, Hep-\n                    Sucnr1\n                    KO mice show blunted mammalian target of rapamycin activation, incomplete glycogen restoration, and an altered hepatic proteomic response.\n                    Sucnr1\n                    expression increases during liver maturation, is enriched in pericentral hepatocytes, and its loss is associated with functional reprogramming of pericentral metabolic functions without disruption of zonation. Together, our findings establish SUCNR1 as a critical regulator of hepatic metabolic adaptation, linking succinate signaling to mitochondrial flexibility and nutrient-dependent metabolic responses.","tp":"肝代谢调控","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究揭示了琥珀酸受体SUCNR1在肝细胞代谢调节中的关键作用。研究发现，肝脏琥珀酸水平和SUCNR1表达受营养状态动态调控，通过协调代谢通量、线粒体功能和营养依赖性适应来维持肝脏稳态。在肝细胞特异性敲除SUCNR1的小鼠模型中，观察到显著的代谢功能紊乱，表明该受体是肝脏营养感知和代谢适应的重要调节因子。"},{"t":"SHLD2 缺失是 Polθ 抑制结合放疗的综合脆弱性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4508?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Inhibition of DNA polymerase theta (Polθ), an essential enzyme for repairing DNA double-strand breaks (DSBs) via microhomology-mediated end joining (MMEJ), has proven to be an exquisitely effective monotherapy in HR-deficient tumor models. In addition, Polθ inhibition (Polθi) can induce tumor-selective radiosensitization, but unlike its monotherapy use, no clinically actionable biomarkers have yet been identified to predict this effect. Here, we profiled 54 cancer cell lines and found that Polθi induces substantial radiosensitization in most models, although with marked variability not explained by indicators of Polθ activity. To pinpoint molecular determinants of radiosensitization by Polθi, we performed a CRISPR knockout screen which revealed loss of the TP53BP1/Shieldin pathway component\n                    SHLD2\n                    (\n                    FAM35A\n                    ) as a vulnerability to Polθi combined with RT. We found that\n                    SHLD2\n                    is deleted in a subset of human prostate cancers, frequently alongside\n                    PTEN\n                    loss, an adverse prognostic factor. We demonstrated that\n                    SHLD2\n                    loss not only increases sensitivity to RT alone, as reported previously, but also enhances the radiosensitizing effect of Polθi, independently of\n                    PTEN\n                    status and without requiring HR deficiency. Moreover, our findings support a model in which\n                    SHLD2\n                    deficiency increases Polθ dependence following RT, with Polθ activity limiting DSB accumulation and chromosomal instability, via a compensatory mechanism independent of canonical MRE11/CtIP-mediated DNA end resection. In summary, we found that\n                    SHLD2\n                    loss is a collateral vulnerability that can be exploited through combined treatment with Polθi and RT.","tp":"放疗增敏法","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究确定了SHLD2缺失作为预测肿瘤对Polθ抑制剂联合放疗敏感性的生物标志物。Polθ抑制通过微同源介导的末端连接修复DNA双链断裂，在HR缺陷肿瘤中表现出显著疗效。通过对54个癌细胞系的系统分析，研究发现SHLD2缺失的肿瘤对Polθ抑制剂与放疗联合治疗表现出高度敏感性，为临床精准治疗提供了可操作的预测指标。"},{"t":"${\\mathrm{TaIrTe}}_{4}$ 中的室温固有非线性平面霍尔效应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/hbdj-2hgf","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Chang Jiang, Fan Yang, Yu Zhao, Jinshan Yang, Peng Yu, Huiying Liu, Yuda Zhang, Zehao Jia, Xiangyu Cao, Li Tian, Jingyi Yan, Zheng Liu, Zhongkai Liu, Xian-Lei Sheng, Cong Xiao, Shengyuan A. Yang, Shaoming Dong, and Faxian XiuA room-temperature intrinsic nonlinear planar Hall effect in the nonmagnetic topological semimetal TaIrTe4 reveals how an in-plane magnetic field generates a Berry-connection-polarizability dipole through an orbital mechanism.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236302] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","tp":"非线性霍尔","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"复旦大学修向前团队在非磁性拓扑半金属TaIrTe₄中首次观测到室温本征非线性平面霍尔效应。研究表明面内磁场可通过轨道机制产生Berry联络极化率偶极矩，为拓扑材料中无磁场器件的新型电荷输运调控提供了实验证据，发表于《物理评论快报》。"},{"t":"非对称溶剂化效应在混合钙钠有机硼酸盐电解液中实现可逆钙金属负极","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2265342?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙金属负极","kp":["电解质[钙金属电池]: 混合Ca²⁺/Na⁺有机硼酸盐","[机制]: 不对称溶剂化效应"],"dp":1,"as":"研究利用不对称溶剂化效应在混合钙-钠有机硼酸盐电解液中实现了可逆钙金属负极。钙金属电池因高能量密度潜力备受关注，但钙负极的可逆沉积-溶解长期受限于钝化层与界面问题。该电解液设计打破这一瓶颈，使钙金属负极稳定循环，为开发高能量密度钙电池体系提供了关键突破。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Reversible Calcium Metal Anodes Enabled by Asymmetric Solvation Effect in Hybrid Ca‐Na Organoborate Electrolytes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Calcium metal batteries represent a promising frontier for high‐energy‐density energy storage, yet their practical application is hindered by sluggish kinetics and unstable electrolyte‐metal interfaces. Here, we report an electrolyte design strategy based on an asymmetric solvation effect by a hybrid Ca\n                    2+\n                    /Na\n                    +\n                    organoborate electrolyte that simultaneously regulates solvation chemistry and interphase formation. By introducing monovalent co‐cations and strongly coordinating tetra(3,3,3‐trifluoropropoxy)borate anion, an asymmetric solvation structure is constructed in which electrochemically active Ca\n                    2+\n                    occupies an off‐center position. This configuration significantly breaks the centrosymmetry of the Ca\n                    2+\n                    solvation sheath, leading to an intensified dipole moment and a disruption of the uniform electrostatic shielding, which selectively activates the Ca\n                    2+\n                    for efficient desolvation. Consequently, dense Ca deposition (&gt;10 mA h cm\n                    −2\n                    ) is achieved with low overpotential, high reversibility (∼95%), and long‐term stability. Interfacial analysis reveals that the asymmetric solvation environment drives preferential anion decomposition, yielding a polymeric‐polycrystalline interphase composed of CaH\n                    2\n                    /CaO and boron‐containing polymeric ether species that effectively protects the Ca anode. When paired with cathodes under a restricted negative‐to‐positive ratio of 7.2, the Ca/Na/Btfp electrolyte enables stable full‐cell operation to exceed 57 cycles. This strategy is also transferable to Mg metal battery, highlighting its potential as a general electrolyte design principle for multivalent metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"揭示：金星捕蝇草如何以惊人的速度突然关闭","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01857-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Softening of the cells on the outermost surface of the trap lets the plant move at a breakneck pace. Softening of the cells on the outermost surface of the trap lets the plant move at a breakneck pace."},{"t":"量子信道的逆因果容量：通过含噪声闭合类时曲线通信","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/znyd-npk5","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子信道容量","kp":["[量子信道]: 封闭类时曲线实现逆因果通信容量表征"],"as":"研究探讨了量子信道的逆因果通信容量，即通过含噪声的闭合类时曲线（CTC）进行信息传递的能力。作者分析了在噪声CTC条件下量子信道传递逆因果信息的信息论上限，为时间反常通信这一前沿量子信息问题提供了理论框架。该工作深化了对因果性、量子信息与时空结构关系的理解。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Retrocausal Capacity of a Quantum Channel: Communicating through Noisy Closed Timelike Curves","b":"Author(s): Kaiyuan Ji, Seth Lloyd, and Mark M. WildeWe study the capacity of a quantum channel for retrocausal communication, where messages are transmitted backward in time, from a sender in the future to a receiver in the past, through a noisy postselected closed timelike curve mathematically represented by the channel. We completely characterize t…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230801] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"ResMap：一个社区资源，用于系统地绘制跨场景的治疗持续残留癌细胞依赖性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7476?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Relapse following targeted therapy remains a central challenge in oncogene-driven cancers. Drug-tolerant persister cells that survive initial treatment without genetic resistance seed relapse, yet despite over a decade of research, no persister-directed therapy has reached clinical approval. To bridge this gap, we developed ResMap, a community resource providing both a standardized experimental framework and quantitative dataset for systematic comparison of persister vulnerabilities across cancer contexts. Using this platform, we evaluated 94 compounds targeting 57 literature-derived candidates in two\n                    EGFR\n                    \n                      mut\n                    \n                    and two\n                    KRAS\n                    \n                      G12C\n                    \n                    lung cancer models under normoxic and hypoxic conditions. Initial screening identified 12 targets with conserved anti-persister activity across genotypes and oxygen environments; follow-up validation reproduced 9 of these targets and revealed variable degrees of persister specificity relative to general cytotoxicity. We also identified context-specific vulnerabilities, including KRAS-relevant combination targets, several of which have since been independently reported and/or advanced to clinical testing. Integration of human cancer cell line essentiality data and adult mouse loss-of-function phenotypes provided a complementary tolerability layer to refine prioritization. ResMap establishes a foundation for coordinated community efforts to accelerate rational persister-directed combination strategies toward the clinic.","tp":"癌细胞耐药","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队开发了ResMap社区资源，旨在系统性地绘制癌细胞在靶向治疗后产生的持续性依赖性图谱。该资源提供了标准化的实验框架和定量数据集，用于比较不同癌症类型中耐药持续细胞的脆弱性。针对目前尚无靶向持续细胞疗法获批临床的现状，ResMap填补了这一关键研究空白，为发现新的治疗靶点和克服肿瘤复发提供了重要工具。"},{"t":"回复 Uma Shaanker：花粉聚集、基因组冲突和多籽果实中的单一父子关系","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2609757123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"基因组冲突","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"回复高等人。和徐：绿化塔克拉玛干：人类努力将沙漠变成碳汇","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2609809123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"沙漠碳汇化","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"研究发现可再生能源驱动数据中心可行——需七倍超额建设太阳能与风能","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/renewables-powered-data-centers-feasible-with-sevenfold-solar-and-wind-overbuild-study-finds/","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"pv magazine","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心可再生能源供电","kp":["过度建设倍数[风光供电数据中心]: 7倍"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":8.0},"as":"芬兰LUT大学研究发现，数据中心可通过七倍过度建设风光发电容量实现全天候100%可再生能源供电。研究表明，配合跨区域电力传输和适当储能，间歇性可再生能源在大幅超配条件下可满足数据中心高可靠性连续供电需求，为数据中心脱碳路径提供了量化可行性论证。","ot":"Renewables-powered data centers feasible with sevenfold solar and wind overbuild, study finds - pv magazine Global","b":"Applications & Installations\nA LUT University study finds that data centers could be powered continuously by intermittent renewables like wind and solar when paired with backup generation and demand-side flexibility. However, achieving firm supply would require major overbuild, significant curtailment, and careful siting to keep costs competitive with other baseload sources.\nBlathnaid O’Dea\nApplications & Installations\nData Centers\nUtility-scale\nImage: Wikimedia Commons / BalticServers / CC SA 4.0\nWith appropriate backup power and demand side flexibility measures in place, it is both technically and economically possible for data centers to use intermittent renewables sources like wind and solar to provide continuous baseload power, according to a study by\nLUT University\n, Finland, exploring this possibility.\nThe study concluded that, because data centers have limited ability to adapt to fluctuations in solar generation, they must therefore have access to at least seven times their baseload operating requirements. However, such an oversized supply of solar, or wind, to ensure continuous power availability would also lead to curtailment of excess solar generation during peak production hours. In addition, even with overcapacity and battery storage, wind and solar alone cannot guarantee uninterrupted electricity supply for data centers.\nAltti Meriläinen, Junior Researcher at LUT University, told\nthat location is a massive factor in determining whether it is cost-effective to power a data center with 100% solar and battery storage. “It depends on the location. According to a recent report by IRENA, solar PV and BESS based baseload supply can reach levelized cost of electricity (LCOE) of less than €100 ($115)/MWh in several locations around the globe,” the researcher said, referencing a recent\neconomics of firm solar and wind\nThe LUT University study focused on the continuous supply of 1 GW of renewable energy to two hypothetical data center scenarios in the Nordic environment – a full baseload power supply (8,760 h/a) and a scenario with full-load hours of at least 8,000 h/a, mirroring the operational characteristics of nuclear power plants.\nThe model the study used was an off-grid system comprising wind, solar, a battery energy storage system (BESS) and a backup power plant. Both configurations showed backup generation is crucial and the location of the renewable generation has a strong impact on the cost of supplied electricity. The LCOE at the most favorable location can be up to 24% lower than at the least favorable location, while the LCOE for the continuous full-load operation results approximately in 100 €/MWh and decreases below 80 €/MWh in the 8000 h/a scenario in the most favorable location.\nThe study noted that the data center chosen as the end use case represented a simplified load profile with a relatively constant power demand. The researchers did not model the detailed operational behavior of data centers, such as cooling requirements or dynamic load variations. The objective was purely to see whether Nordic environments can host renewable-powered data centers.\n“We are currently preparing a project called Net Zero Energy Communities together with data center investors and operators where the analysis will be expanded and detailed by analyzing real-life cases,” said Meriläinen on future developments arising from the study.\nLUT University’s Professor Samuli Honkapuro, added that the study has been discussed in major Finnish media. “We are communicating the key message to policy makers. For instance, we have discussed with a member of the Finnish parliament, who is running a legislative initiative about grid connection requirements of the data centers,” the academic told\nThe researchers’ work also highlighted that the operating expenditure of the backup power plant can be reduced when data centers embrace demand-side flexibility. However, engaging in demand response programs could also lead to higher curtailment of renewable generation, the study said.\nIn Finland, where nuclear is a big part of the energy mix, the study’s approach can offer advantages over nuclear power for data center developers, with the main bonus being shorter construction times.\n“Solar energy production is highly concentrated in the summer months, emphasizing the importance of storage and balancing capacity. Although the Nordic climate imposes strong seasonal constraints on renewable generation, the results demonstrate that a renewable-based baseload system can achieve cost levels comparable with nuclear power. This finding strengthens the case for renewables as a viable baseload option even under the challenging conditions of high-latitude regions,” the paper concluded.\nTechno-economic feasibility of a renewable baseload power supply for data centers\n’ will appear in the journal\nin August 2026.\nBlathnaid O’Dea\nView author posts","aip":1},{"t":"伊拉克、沙特阿拉伯和西班牙的可再生能源政策分析：使用 HOMER 和文件进行多维评估","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003654?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"调控多金属离子轨道相互作用以增强锂锰铁磷酸盐的动力学与结构稳定性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71180?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷酸锰铁锂正极","kp":["组分[LMFP正极]: LiMn0.475Fe0.475Ni0.03","[策略]: 多金属离子轨道工程"],"dp":1,"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"磷酸锰铁锂（LMFP）兼具高安全性与高能量密度，但锰离子溶解和结构退化制约循环寿命。该研究通过调控多金属离子间的轨道相互作用，协同提升LMFP的离子扩散动力学性能和结构稳定性，抑制Jahn-Teller畸变导致的锰溶解，为高比能锂电正极材料设计提供新思路。","ot":"Regulating Multi‐Metal Ion Orbital Interactions to Enhance Kinetics and Structural Stability in Lithium Manganese Iron P","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium manganese iron phosphate (LMFP) offers high safety and high energy density for lithium‐ion batteries, yet its commercialization is bottlenecked by poor conductivity and severe Jahn–Teller (J–T) distortion. Here, we report a multi‐metal ion (Ni, Cu, Ti) orbital engineering strategy to simultaneously decouple these twin challenges in a customized LiMn\n                    0.475\n                    Fe\n                    0.475\n                    Ni\n                    0.03\n                    Cu\n                    0.01\n                    Ti\n                    0.01\n                    PO\n                    4\n                    (LMFP‐NCT) cathode. Mechanistically, enhanced orbital hybridization between heteroatoms and the host lattice optimizes localized electronic distribution and narrows the bandgap, boosting intrinsic conductivity and ionic diffusivity by an order of magnitude. Importantly, the tailored orbital occupation effectively suppresses\n                    \n                      e\n                      g\n                    \n                    orbital degeneracy, transitioning the MnO\n                    6\n                    octahedra into a structurally robust, controlled‐distortion state. Supported by the\n                    d\n                    ‐band center theory, this strategy enhances metal‐oxygen\n                    σ\n                    ‐bonds, leading to minimal volume variation (4.29%) and suppressed Mn dissolution (reduced by 48.4%). Consequently, the LMFP‐NCT delivers doubled capacity at 6C compared with LMFP and an exceptional 92.3% capacity retention after 1000 cycles at 1C. When paired in full cells, it maintains 96.4% of its capacity over 500 cycles. This work provides profound insights for designing high‐performance LMFP cathodes by fundamentally conquering J–T distortion and kinetic limitations."},{"t":"通过准栅极电极调控静电放电实现高性能直流摩擦纳米发电机","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73659?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"直流摩擦纳米发电机","kp":["[器件]: 准栅极电极增强DC-TENG"],"dp":1,"as":"直流摩擦纳米发电机(DC-TENG)在机械能收集领域潜力巨大，但静电放电过程难以精确调控。本研究提出准栅极电极(quasi-gate electrode)策略，通过调控静电放电过程实现高性能DC-TENG。该方案有望提升机械能到电能的转换效率与输出稳定性，为自驱动传感与可穿戴能源系统提供新路径。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Regulating Electrostatic Discharge via Quasi‐gate Electrode for High‐Performance Direct‐current Triboelectric Nanogenera","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Direct‐current triboelectric nanogenerators (DC‐TENGs) are promising for mechanical energy harvesting but are often hindered by incomplete charge collection and parasitic discharge pathways. Herein, inspired by the operating characteristics of depletion‐mode field‐effect transistors, we propose a quasi‐gate‐electrode enhanced DC‐TENG (QGED‐TENG). The QGED‐TENG employs a back‐side quasi‐gate‐electrode (QGE) and porous polytetrafluoroethylene film to modulate electrostatic breakdown and charge leakage, thereby effectively suppressing parasitic discharge. The QGED‐TENG enables direction‐contingent enhancement and depletion modes without external bias, notably delivering a 1.41‐fold output charge increase in enhancement mode compared to the device without the QGE. Furthermore, by leveraging redistributed electric fields and parallel discharge pathways, the multi‐unit architecture achieves a linear charge increase relative to the number of units. Benefiting from the synergistic effects of electrostatic breakdown, charge leakage, and electric field redistribution within the multi‐unit configuration, an optimized rotational QGED‐TENG achieved an ultrahigh average power density of 25 W m\n                    −2\n                    Hz\n                    −1\n                    and an output charge density of 13.65 mC m\n                    −2\n                    at 60 rpm, setting a new benchmark for the porous triboelectric layer of electrostatic breakdown‐based DC‐TENGs. This work provides new physical insights and a general design strategy for maximizing spatial charge utilization and enabling high output performance DC‐TENG.","aip":1},{"t":"再生巨噬细胞增强干细胞衍生的β细胞功能和植入","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed4221?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The generation of insulin-producing, stem cell–derived β cells (SC-β cells) from human embryonic or induced pluripotent stem cells holds promise for treating type 1 diabetes. Transplantation of SC-β cells is already in clinical testing, but generating mature cells with insulin-secreting properties similar to endogenous cells has been challenging. Given that macrophages are essential for islet development, we hypothesized that they could enhance SC-β cell differentiation and function. We coaggregated autologous SC-macrophages that were either unpolarized (SC-M\n                    Unp\n                    ) or polarized to inflammatory (SC-M\n                    Inf\n                    ) or regenerative (SC-M\n                    Reg\n                    ) states during stage 7 of SC-β cell differentiation. SC-M\n                    Regs\n                    improved maturity marker expression, glucose-stimulated insulin secretion, and metabolic activity in SC-β cells. Transplantation of SC-β cells coaggregated with SC-M\n                    Regs\n                    into diabetic mice normalized glycemia significantly faster than transplantation of SC-β cells alone. The finding that addition of macrophages during SC-β differentiation accelerates functional maturation represents a notable advance in the production of SC-β cells as a regenerative cell therapy for type 1 diabetes."},{"t":"将天然烯还原酶重定向为具有反转对映选择性的脱饱和反应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3155545?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"烯还原酶生物催化","kp":["[生物催化]: 烯还原酶逆向对映选择性脱氢"],"dp":1,"as":"手性烯酮是药物分子与合成中间体的重要结构单元。本研究通过酶工程改造天然烯还原酶(ene-reductase)，使其催化方向从还原反转为脱饱和反应，并实现反向对映选择性。该成果扩展了生物催化剂的应用边界，为手性药物合成提供了绿色高效的新途径。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Redirecting a Native Ene‐Reductase Toward Desaturation With Reverse Enantioselectivity","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chiral enones are valuable motifs in synthetic intermediates and bioactive molecules, driving significant interest in biocatalysis. Although recent enzymatic desaturation strategies for substituted cyclohexenones provide efficient and highly enantioselective synthetic routes, none offer complementary stereoselectivity. To address this gap, we introduce a stereocomplementary biocatalytic system based on an old yellow enzyme (OYE), XenA from\n                    Pseudomonas putida\n                    . Although XenA natively catalyzes the reduction of electron‐deficient alkenes and exhibits negligible desaturation activity, protein engineering redirected its catalytic function toward desaturation, ultimately yielding a variant that accommodates a range of cyclohexanones with 85%–99%\n                    ee\n                    and 32%–98% yield. Remarkably, the optimal variant (XenA_4) possesses 46 mutations and exhibits an 11°C increase in melting temperature over the wild type. Mechanistic studies revealed that the unique dimeric structure of the enzyme is pivotal in controlling stereoselectivity by modulating the substrate‐binding orientation."},{"t":"用于高通量 T 细胞筛选研究的即用型 MHC-I 纳米颗粒","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adv2687?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"MHC-I proteins present epitopic peptides to CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells to elicit multifaceted adaptive immune responses. The affinity and avidity of interactions between peptide-MHC molecules and their cognate T cell receptors (TCRs) are fundamental parameters that contribute to the induction of activated or anergic T cell states. Here, we present a multivalent, loadable platform, VLP-Open HLA, featuring a virus-like particle (VLP) which can display up to 60 peptide/HLA [human leukocyte antigen (HLA)] molecules. VLP-Open HLA can be used to stain antigen-specific CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells, providing a screening tool for orphan TCRs. When combined with costimulation, VLP-Open HLA acts as an artificial antigen-presenting platform to induce antigen-specific T cell activation and expansion, providing a facile alternative to autologous antigen-presenting cells. Our platform can be adapted to encompass multiple HLA allotypes and costimulatory molecules as mosaic nanoparticles, enabling a range of applications in experimental immunology.","tp":"免疫纳米粒","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该技术介绍了一种名为 VLP-Open HLA 的即用型多价 MHC-I 纳米颗粒平台，专门用于高通量 T 细胞筛选研究。该平台基于病毒样颗粒构建，能够展示多达 60 个肽/HLA 分子。通过向 CD8+ T 细胞递呈表位肽，该工具能够有效模拟并调控多面适应性免疫反应，其多价可加载特性为深入研究 T 细胞受体亲和力及激活或失活状态提供了关键技术支撑。"},{"t":"量子增强的光伏温室能源管理预测与优化调度","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007944?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子能源管理","kp":["[应用]: 光伏温室能源管理","[方法]: 量子增强预测+优化调度"],"as":"","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quantum-enhanced forecasting and optimal scheduling for energy management in photovoltaic greenhouses"},{"t":"可电离药物对 siRNA 络合的定量预测使其能够在纳米颗粒中共传递","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed2731?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The ionizable lipid in lipid nanoparticles can be replaced with ionizable drugs to encapsulate small interfering RNA (siRNA) and allow intracellular codelivery. We wondered whether we could develop a predictive model to aid in formulation design. A small-scale screening assay was designed to evaluate siRNA complexation by ionizable drugs at low pH and validated experimentally with ionizable drug nanoparticle (IDNP) formulations. We found that siRNA complexation could be predicted by drug hydrophobicity, aromaticity, proximity of nitrogen and oxygen atoms to aromatic rings, and a machine learning model using five molecular descriptors encoding pharmacophore and structural information. For complexing drugs, siRNA encapsulation efficiency in IDNPs was related to hydrophobicity, molar refractivity, chiral centers, hydrogen bond donors, and topological charge. Netarsudil was predicted to encapsulate siRNA at high efficiency and was thus tested experimentally with siRNA targeting connective tissue growth factor (\n                    CTGF\n                    ) in fibrotic human trabecular meshwork cells: Reduced\n                    CTGF\n                    mRNA expression and actin network density were observed. These predictive tools may unlock combination therapies.","tp":"脂质体递药","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了定量预测模型，利用药物疏水性等参数预测可电离药物对小干扰RNA(siRNA)的络合能力，并在纳米颗粒配方中验证。该模型可指导药物-siRNA共递送纳米颗粒的配方设计，为联合疗法开发提供工具。","aip":1},{"t":"定量共价晶体弹性形变中的晶格应变","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/3pvs-gdp8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"晶体弹性应变","kp":["弹性应变[共价晶体]: 微纳尺度超大弹性应变","材料体系[应变工程]: 硅、金刚石等共价半导体"],"as":"研究团队开发了一种量化共价晶体在弹性变形下晶格应变的方法。通过实验表征与理论计算结合，精确测量了共价键晶体在受力形变过程中的原子尺度应变分布。该工作为理解共价晶体的力学行为与结构-性能关系提供了新工具，对半导体器件、柔性电子及极端力学环境下的晶体材料设计具有指导意义。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quantifying Lattice Strains in Elastically Deformed Covalent Crystals","b":"Author(s): Jiayi Li, Heyi Wang, Juzheng Chen, Qian Zhang, Fanling Meng, Yiling Lian, Man Kit Cheng, Pak San Yip, Kefan Guo, Wenjun Liang, Yu Deng, and Yang LuCovalent semiconductor crystals such as silicon and diamond have demonstrated ultralarge elastic strains at micro and nanoscales, enabling desired figures of merit for strain engineered electronic and optoelectronic devices. However, the underlying origin of their elasticity—whether it arises from p…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236102] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"量化深能级缺陷主导的退化机制以实现商业化钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73679?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿电池缺陷降解","kp":["[降解主因]: 深能级I_FA和I_Pb缺陷"],"dp":1,"as":"针对钙钛矿太阳能电池商业化应用中的稳定性瓶颈，研究聚焦于深能级缺陷主导的降解机制。通过量化分析缺陷类型与降解过程的关系，揭示了深能级缺陷对器件性能衰减的关键作用。该成果为钙钛矿电池缺陷工程和长期稳定性提升提供了明确方向，有助于推动其从实验室走向产业化。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quantifying Deep‐Level Defects‐Dominated Degradation for Commercially Viable Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The unclear mechanisms and dominant types of defects causing degradation hinder the stability of perovskite solar cells, leading to increased operating costs and limiting their commercialization. In this study, we identify deep‐level I\n                    FA\n                    and I\n                    Pb\n                    defects as the primary cause of device degradation based on quantitative analysis of capacitance‐frequency spectra combined with detailed balance theory, although the concentrations are lower than those of commonly believed shallow‐level defects by three orders of magnitude. To mitigate these issues, we design a non‐intercalary ligand coordination strategy through dual‐end electropositive 3TU\n                    2+\n                    ions, which effectively passivated the degradation‐induced deep‐level defects. This approach results in a significant improvement in quasi‐Fermi level splitting alignment, reducing energy loss at the rear interface by an order of magnitude (from 1.46% to 0.62%). In addition to achieving a certified efficiency of 25.56%, our devices demonstrate an extrapolated\n                    T\n                    80\n                    lifetime exceeding 10 years, as per the ISOS‐LC‐1 protocol. This improvement reduces the levelized cost of energy to 0.148$ kWh\n                    −1\n                    , on par with silicon photovoltaics, thus enhancing the commercial viability of perovskite solar cells.","aip":1},{"t":"基于二次规划的火电厂耦合熔盐储热非线性模型预测控制","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008007?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/火电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"火电熔盐集成","kp":["[系统集成]: 燃煤电厂+熔盐蓄热","[控制方法]: 二次规划非线性模型预测控制"],"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quadratic programming-based nonlinear model predictive control of coal-fired power plant integrated with molten salt the"},{"t":"蛋白质名称混淆导致抗体混淆","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5919?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Cancer and cell-aging studies may have relied on antibodies to incorrect molecule"},{"t":"可编程光学百万像素纳米剪纸矩阵","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73647?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米剪纸光学阵列","kp":["技术[可编程光阵列]: 像素化纳米剪纸机电重构"],"as":"该研究提出一种可编程光学百万像素纳米剪纸矩阵，通过像素级编程控制微型光学阵列，像素数量达到百万级别。这种大规模可编程纳米剪纸结构有望应用于先进光学调控领域，实现前所未有的光场操控能力，对光学计算、显示和成像技术具有突破性意义。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Programmable Optical Megapixel Nano‐Kirigami Matrix","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Pixel‐programmable miniaturized optical arrays with large pixel count are essential for cutting‐edge fields such as micro‐displays, photonic chips, and light detection modules. In recent advances, a universal strategy with ultrahigh pixel count and highly flexible programmability remains lacking. Here we report a programmable optical nano‐kirigami matrix with pixelated electromechanical reconfigurations. Deformable pixel arrays with high duty cycle and optical contrast are conceptually designed and experimentally realized based on a suspended turn‐shaped nano‐kirigami configuration. By employing the central plate to induce electrostatic force and the deformed arms to scatter incident light, switchable optical encryption and reconfigurable information display are demonstrated by programing the nano‐kirigami matrices with a pitch size of only a few micrometers. Furthermore, line‐level modulation based programmable information transmission and light projection are achieved by using a stripe‐shaped addressable nano‐kirigami matrix with 3.87 megapixels, showcasing an optical micro‐array with large pixel count and flexible programmability. Our work enables the high visibility and precise addressability of freely controllable electromechanical arrays with massive pixels, which could greatly improve the practical applicability for miniaturized optical arrays and brings potential applications in micro‐displays, photoelectronic chips, intelligent machine visions, hyperspectral image sensors, etc."},{"t":"机器学习引导超材料实现可编程流体力学隐身","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73690?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水动力超材料","kp":["技术[流体力学隐身]: 机器学习引导超材料","特性[水动力斗篷]: 可编程适应背景渗透率"],"as":"该研究利用机器学习指导的超材料设计实现了可编程流体力学隐身，能够在多孔介质中精确操控流体输运。该方法可按需引导流体绕过障碍物，使目标区域在流体力学上'隐形'。这一成果在地下渗流、化工分离、过滤与微流控芯片等领域具有广泛应用潜力。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Programmable Hydrodynamic Invisibility Enabled by Machine‐Learning‐Guided Metamaterials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Manipulation of fluid transport in porous media underpins a broad range of technological applications and natural processes. Hydrodynamic invisibility enables flow manipulation without disturbing the external flow field, with representative devices including cloaks, concentrators, rotators, and camouflage. However, most existing devices are static and thus fail when background permeability varies. Here we present a machine‐learning‐guided metamaterial strategy for programmable hydrodynamic invisibility, using a cloak as a model system. A tunable‐permeability shell maintains cloaking across a wide range of background permeabilities and enables hydrodynamic camouflage by matching prescribed exterior reference flows. An inverse‐design framework rapidly maps target permeability responses to manufacturable geometries, and experiments validate high‐fidelity performance under high, medium, and low background permeabilities. These results indicate that programmable hydrodynamic metamaterials provide a scalable, general strategy for robust, on‐demand manipulation of fluid transport in porous media, with potential applications in separation science, microfluidics, flow‐network engineering, and soft‐matter biomechanics and poroelasticity.","aip":1},{"t":"基于原始黑洞的小红点路径","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6y1w-87pd","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Valerio De Luca, Loris Del Grosso, Gabriele Franciolini, Konstantinos Kritos, Emanuele Berti, Daniel J. D’Orazio, and Joseph SilkThe James Webb Space Telescope has uncovered a population of compact, high-redshift sources, the Little Red Dots (LRDs), which may host supermassive black holes (BHs) significantly heavier than their stellar content compared with local scaling relations. These objects challenge standard models of ea…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231402] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"纳米合金电催化剂的精准原子掺杂：开启高效析氢反应新路径","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71156?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解水制氢催化剂","kp":["[电催化剂]: 纳米合金精确原子掺杂提升析氢效率"],"as":"该研究提出一种纳米合金电催化剂的精确原子掺杂策略，通过在特定原子位点精准引入掺杂原子，优化催化剂的电子结构，显著提升电解水产氢效率。该方法突破了传统铂族催化剂成本高、储量稀缺的瓶颈，为绿色氢能的大规模低成本制备开辟了新路径，在清洁能源转型中具有重要应用价值。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Precision Atomic Doping of Nanoalloy Electrocatalysts: Unlocking New Paths for Efficient Hydrogen Evolution Reaction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Hydrogen production via water electrolysis is a key solution to the global energy crisis. Platinum‐group catalysts, while highly efficient for the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), are limited by their scarcity and high cost, restricting their industrial application. Nanoalloy electrocatalysts (NAEs) have emerged as promising alternatives due to their adjustable electronic structures, high conductivity, and synergistic active sites. However, they still face challenges in balancing activity and stability, as well as in reaction kinetics. Research shows that precision doping can enhance NAEs' performance by tailoring electronic configurations, optimizing adsorption energetics, and exposing latent active sites. This review explores the mechanistic basis of these doping effects by examining HER mechanisms in acidic and basic media. It systematically categorizes and summarizes doping methods, dividing dopants into noble metals, non‐noble metals, and non‐metals, and detailing their roles and characteristics. A “Relative Improvement (RI)” metric is introduced to quantitatively benchmark performance gains. The review also delves into emerging frontiers like operando characterization, circular catalyst design, and integration with alternative anodic reactions. By highlighting atomic‐level doping as crucial for next‐generation electrolyzers, this review aims to advance economically viable green hydrogen production.","aip":1},{"t":"粲夸克色电偶极矩的精确测量","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/ycwh-3gy8","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): M. Ablikim et al. (BESIII Collaboration)The combined symmetry of charge conjugation and parity ($CP$) is tested in the hadronic transition $ψ(3686)→{π}^{+}{π}^{−}J/ψ$, using a dataset of $(2712.4±14.3)×{10}^{6}\\text{ }\\text{ }ψ(3686)$ events collected by the BESIII detector at the BEPCII collider. The resulting asymmetry observable is ${A…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231903] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"软三轴偶偶Xe同位素中可能的摆动模式","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/14kh-p5g3","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Y. M. Wang, Q. B. Chen, and Z. P. LiThe nature of the $γ$ band is studied for the soft triaxial even-even Xe isotopes $^{122–128}\\mathrm{Xe}$ employing the five-dimensional collective Hamiltonian based on relativistic density functional theory. The theoretical calculations successfully reproduce the experimental staggering parameters …[Phys. Rev. C 113, L061301] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"瓦伦西亚港在防波堤上部署光伏——pv magazine全球版","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/valenciaport-instala-los-paneles-fotovoltaicos-de-su-fachada-vertical/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"港口光伏部署","kp":["[应用]: 防波堤垂直光伏部署(瓦伦西亚港)"],"as":"西班牙瓦伦西亚港启动在防波堤上部署光伏太阳能板的创新项目,作为欧盟资助的Rene(能源复兴)计划的一部分。该方案将港口闲置的防波堤结构转化为可再生能源发电空间,示范了港口基础设施与分布式光伏结合的新模式,为沿海交通枢纽降低碳排、提升能源自给率提供可复制路径。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Port of Valencia deploying PV on breakwaters - pv magazine Global","b":"Applications & Installations\nThe Port of Valencia is deploying solar panels on breakwaters as part of the EU-funded Renewport project to advance renewable energy in Mediterranean ports. The pilot system aims to validate the technical, economic, and environmental feasibility of large-scale vertical photovoltaics.\nPilar Sánchez Molina\nApplications & Installations\nCommercial & industrial\nThe contract for the installation of the vertical solar plant has been awarded to Pavener Servicios Energéticos for €169,314.55. | Image: Valenciaport\nThe Port of Valencia is currently installing vertical solar panels on its breakwaters under the umbrella of the European project Renewport – Harnessing RENEWable energy potential for clean energy transition of MED PORTs, which aims to support the clean energy transition of Mediterranean ports.\nThe contract for the project was awarded to Pavener Servicios Energéticos S.L. for €169,314.55 (around $195,000), with installation expected to be completed and operational by September 2026. The work includes the installation of the solar panels and the placement of the project’s official signage.\nLaunched in January 2024, the project is co-financed at 80% by the European Union through the Interreg Euro-MED programme under the Greener MED initiative. Its goal is to reduce the carbon footprint of Mediterranean ports by identifying, demonstrating, and validating innovative solutions based on renewable energy sources such as solar, wind, and geothermal power. The project not only seeks to deploy new renewable energy systems but also to assess their technical, economic, and environmental feasibility in real port infrastructure.\nTo this end, the port tested vertically installed solar panels on a section of the North Breakwater wall in 2023 to verify the installation’s feasibility and efficiency, paving the way for the development of Spain’s first large-scale vertical photovoltaic park.\nFor this purpose, the Valencian startup SunnerBox developed the IT3, a proprietary solution consisting of a matrix system of photovoltaic panels mounted on a mesh structure secured with stays and tensioners anchored directly to the breakwater. According to the company, this system leverages existing infrastructure while reducing structural costs, speeding up installation, simplifying maintenance, and improving the overall viability of the project.\nThe pilot system consists of 21 photovoltaic modules rated at 410 W each, representing an installed capacity of 8.6 kW. The pilot is being conducted by the Port Authority of Valencia (APV) in collaboration with the Research Center for Project Management, Innovation, and Sustainability (PRINS) at the Polytechnic University of Valencia (UPV). Over a two-month period, energy generation and the structure’s dynamic behaviour will be monitored in real time using various types of sensors. The energy produced will be used to power the sensor system itself.\nPilar Sánchez Molina\nView author posts"},{"t":"波兰撤回威胁住宅电池储能的建造法规——Energy Storage","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/12/poland-pulls-back-building-rules-threatening-residential-battery-storage/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","as":"波兰气候与环境部确认,将不再推进此前草案中针对住宅电池储能系统的限制性建筑条款。这一政策回调消除了家庭储能部署的监管障碍,利好波兰户用电池市场发展,反映了东欧国家在能源转型中对分布式储能的政策支持趋向,有助于提升电网灵活性与可再生能源消纳能力。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"储能建筑规范","kp":["[政策变动]: 波兰撤回限制住宅电池储能的建筑法规"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Poland pulls back building rules threatening residential battery storage - Energy Storage","b":"Poland’s Ministry of Climate and Environment has confirmed it will not advance provisions from a draft regulation prepared by the Ministry of Development and Technology that industry groups said would have restricted battery storage deployment across residential and commercial buildings.\nAccording to industry associations and Polish media reports, the May 13 draft proposed new technical conditions for buildings that industry groups said would have prohibited storage installations in apartments and on balconies of multi-family buildings. It also proposed capping combined storage capacity at 600 kWh per fire zone in buildings not dedicated to energy storage.\nInstalling larger systems would have required the creation of separate fire compartments, generating costs of tens of thousands of Polish zloty before any battery was commissioned, claimed industry groups.\nEnergy Minister Miłosz Motyka said in a May 29 ministry statement that the proposed regulation was not designed to restrict the development of solar or energy storage, and no provisions interfering with prosumer installations would be included. The statement cited blackouts in Spain and Portugal as the basis for the regulation, adding that any emergency provisions would apply only in the most serious crisis situations.\nBarbara Adamska, president of the Polish Energy Storage Association, described the working group’s output as disappointing, saying industry input had been only minimally reflected in successive drafts despite strong engagement from the sector.\nKrzysztof Kochanowski, president of the Polish Chamber of Energy Storage and Electromobility, said the group’s work had been confidential, with disclosure of details punishable by a PLN 50,000 ($13,600) fine. He argued that this hindered the development of effective regulations.\nMaciej Borowiak, president of Stowarzyszenie Branży Fotowoltaicznej i Magazynowania Energii (SBFiME), a solar and storage industry association, said the provisions as proposed would have meant the end of storage in homes, apartments, and small businesses.\nThe reversal comes as Poland navigates a broader regulatory transition for energy storage. A\ndraft grid law\ndrew industry warnings in January over its potential to slow solar and storage investment, while the nation raised its\npermit-free energy storage threshold\nto 30 kWh in November 2025."},{"t":"胎盘烟酰胺腺嘌呤二核苷酸调节分娩时间","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz1624?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Labor is mediated proximately by prostaglandin signaling within gestational tissues and must be tightly regulated for birth to occur after appropriate fetal development. Metabolic changes accompanying gestational aging have been postulated as a determinant of birth timing, but specific nutrients, sensors, and messengers remain obscure. We report that placental nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide (NAD\n                    +\n                    ) dynamically tunes gestational length. Depletion of placental NAD\n                    +\n                    in mice provoked labor onset, mediated by the role of NAD\n                    +\n                    as a cofactor for 15-hydroxy prostaglandin dehydrogenase, an enzyme responsible for suppressing prostaglandin accumulation. Augmentation of placental NAD\n                    +\n                    prolonged gestation at baseline and in a model of preterm labor. These findings suggest a central role for metabolic exhaustion in provoking labor and reveal potential therapeutic avenues for preterm labor and the optimization of labor induction."},{"t":"基于物理信息引导的暂态电压稳定性评估训练方法","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008317?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"暂态电压稳定评估","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"kp":["[暂态电压稳定评估]: 物理信息引导的训练方法"],"ot":"Physical information-guided training method for transient voltage stability assessment"},{"t":"从三类代表性电压曲线中挖掘物理信息以实现锂离子电池高保真数字建模","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008548?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池建模","kp":["[应用]: 锂离子电池高保真数字建模","[方法]: 三条代表性电压曲线物理信息挖掘"],"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Physical information mining from three-representative voltage curves for high-fidelity digital modeling of lithium-ion b"},{"t":"用于磷酸酶和磷酸裂合酶深度特异性分析的磷酸蛋白质组衍生肽文库","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523183123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Protein phosphorylation is dynamically regulated by the opposing activities of phosphowriter enzymes (kinases) and phosphoeraser enzymes (phosphatases and phospholyases). While significant progress has been made toward defining the sequence preferences of kinases, the selectivity of phosphoerasers has not been explored at scale. Here, we develop an experimental platform based on tandem mass spectrometry analysis of phosphoproteome-derived peptide libraries (PhosPropels) to map phosphoeraser activity across thousands of biologically relevant phosphosites. We extract positional residue preferences to rapidly define sequence motifs recognized by eight phosphoerasers spanning diverse species of origin, protein folds, and enzymatic mechanisms, yielding biological insights into pathways targeted by these enzymes. Taking advantage of the throughput of our approach, we profiled 20 variants of the phosphothreonine lyase OspF from\n                    \n                      Shigella\n                      flexneri\n                    \n                    , uncovering an intrinsic preference for p38 and Erk MAP kinase activation loops and revealing the enzyme residues that influence its selectivity for phosphothreonine. Our results establish a general method for linking phosphorylation sites to the enzymes that remove them, providing a means to dissect a key component of cellular regulatory networks."},{"t":"电荷密度波材料中的相选择 Floquet 工程","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538027123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Floquet engineering has emerged as a powerful approach for dynamically tailoring the electronic structures of quantum materials through time-periodic light fields. The light fields generated by ultrafast laser pulses can transiently dress Bloch electrons, creating novel electronic states inaccessible in equilibrium. While such temporal modulation provides a dynamic control, spatially periodic modulations, such as those arising from charge density wave (CDW) order, can also dramatically reconstruct the electronic structure through real-space symmetry breaking. The interplay between these two distinct forms of modulation—temporal and spatial—opens a frontier in phase-selective Floquet engineering. Here we demonstrate this concept experimentally in the prototypical CDW material 1T-TiSe\n                    2\n                    . Using time- and angle-resolved photoemission spectroscopy with mid-infrared pumping, we observe a striking momentum-dependent pump-induced instantaneous downshift of the valence band maximum (VBM), which is in sharp contrast to the subsequent upward shift on picosecond timescale associated with CDW melting. Remarkably, the light-induced VBM downshift is observed exclusively in the CDW phase and only when the pump pulse is present, reaching maximum when pumping near resonance with the CDW gap. These observations unequivocally reveal the critical role of CDW in enabling the phase-selective Floquet engineering of TiSe\n                    2\n                    . Our work demonstrates how time-periodic drives can synergistically couple to spatially periodic modulations, establishing a paradigm for phase-selective Floquet engineering enabled by spontaneous symmetry breaking.","tp":"Floquet调控","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"Floquet工程利用超快激光的时间周期性光场动态调控量子材料的电子结构。研究探索将时间调制与电荷密度波(CDW)的空间周期性调制相结合，实现相选择性的电子态重构，开辟了非平衡态量子物态调控的新途径。"},{"t":"动态追踪型光伏温室系统的性能评估","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007981?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"跟踪式光伏温室","as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Performance evaluation of a dynamic tracking photovoltaic greenhouse system"},{"t":"全脑关联模式反映了社会经济学","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee6213?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Previous brain-wide association studies (BWAS) have linked specific environmental and behavioral variables to brain variability. In this work, we mapped 649 variables to children’s brains and compared the resultant BWAS maps with each other and with neurobiological reference patterns. Socioeconomic status (SES) showed the strongest brain-wide associations. The SES associations were strongest in motor and sensory but not cognitive regions, a pattern shared across many BWAS maps, including intelligence quotient (IQ). A single, common BWAS brain pattern existed across variables that was most reflective of a child’s socioeconomics. Adjusting for SES weakened brain-IQ associations, eliminating the BWAS motor and sensory pattern. Brain-with-IQ associations also did not generalize when trained on higher-SES subsamples. Thus, children’s brains vary the most with SES, potentially through SES-dependent sleep deprivation and stress."},{"t":"考虑欺诈行为的基于PLF-IADP的多数据中心协同调度优化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008081?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心调度优化","kp":["[方法]: 多数据中心协调调度优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"PLF-IADP-based coordinated scheduling optimization for multiple data centers considering cheating behaviors"},{"t":"催产素通过增强生长抑素中间神经元介导的局部 GABA 能抑制来减弱恐惧学习","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef8400?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Acute stress exposure can trigger post–traumatic stress disorder (PTSD). Prophylactic interventions may enhance psychological resilience against PTSD in high-risk occupations. Here, we demonstrate that pretreating with intranasal oxytocin exerts prolonged yet reversible attenuation of fear learning via oxytocin receptors (OxtRs) expressed in prelimbic cortex (PL). Crucially, both local PL oxytocin infusion and selective activation of PL OxtR+ neurons recapitulate this fear reduction. Although OxtRs are expressed on pyramidal and somatostatin (SST) neurons, SST interneurons exhibit higher\n                    Oxtr\n                    expression. Both fear conditioning and oxytocin application preferentially excite PL OxtR+ SST interneurons. Accordingly, preactivating OxtR+ SST neurons, but not OxtR+ pyramidal neurons, elicits the reduction effect on fear learning. Ablating\n                    Oxtr\n                    in γ-aminobutyric acid (GABA) neurons or silencing SST interneurons abolishes oxytocin’s fear-attenuating effects. Mechanistically, OxtR+ SST interneuron activation or oxytocin application potentiates GABAergic synaptic transmission onto PL pyramidal neurons. Collectively, these findings establish that oxytocin attenuates fear learning by enhancing local inhibitory circuits in PL, revealing a potential therapeutic approach for reducing PTSD risk."},{"t":"用于高通量的耐氧光诱导小型加速原子转移自由基聚合 (OPTIMA-ATRP)","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6617585?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Conjugates of synthetic polymers with biomolecules, forming polymer bioconjugates (PBCs), are used to improve the pharmacokinetic properties of many biological therapeutics. Growing synthetic polymers from biomolecules via reversible deactivation radical polymerization (RDRP) demonstrated enormous potential as an alternative to the “grafting to” method in synthesizing biohybrids. However, conventional “grafting from” approaches applied to biomolecules are hindered by large reaction volumes, long reaction times, rigorous deoxygenation, and complex workflows, rendering them unsuitable for synthesizing libraries of PBCs needed to collect large data sets for emerging materials discovery. Herein, Oxygen‐tolerant photo‐induced miniaturized accelerated atom transfer radical polymerization (OPTIMA‐ATRP) in water was developed for the polymerization of hydrophilic (meth)acrylate monomers under ambient or sub‐ambient (4°C) temperature and atmospheric conditions, without prior degassing, in &lt; 10 min. Sodium pyruvate (SP) in conjunction with UV light (380–395 nm, 28.5–30 mW/cm\n                    2\n                    ) promoted rapid controlled polymerization in water, on an ultra‐small scale (&lt; 50 µL) in micropipette tips or 96‐well plate. By exploiting this OPTIMA‐ATRP, cost‐effective syntheses of several types of PBCs (e.g., DNA‐, peptide‐, lipid‐, and protein–polymer hybrids) were carried out using a parallel, high‐throughput approach. This technique enables rapid optimization of biohybrid synthesis, previously inaccessible under conventional conditions, and empowers non‐specialists to use ATRP in various areas."},{"t":"有机自发发射接近单色极限","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee0001?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Spontaneous emission is inherently associated with spectral broadening mechanisms, resulting in finite bandwidth in the emitted light. Narrowing this linewidth toward the monochromatic limit has long been a central pursuit in photonics, as it determines the ultimate color purity of nonstimulated light sources. Organic luminescent materials offer facile wavelength tunability but typically exhibit broad emission bands (&gt;40 nanometers). The emergence of multiple-resonance emitters has provided a promising route to overcome this limitation, yet most reported systems remain within 20 to 30 nanometers. We present a molecular design strategy that amplifies the multiple-resonance effect through molecular repetition, yielding fluorescence with linewidths of 6.9 nanometers in toluene, 5.5 nanometers in 3-methylpentane, and 9.1 nanometers in a doped polymer film, placing this molecular framework among the narrowest-band organic luminophores reported.","tp":"有机单色发光","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"有机发光材料波长可调性强但发射带宽通常超过40纳米。多重共振发射体的出现使有机自发发射 linewidth 大幅收窄，逐步逼近单色极限，这对提升非受激光源的色彩纯度具有重要意义，在显示和照明领域具有应用前景。"},{"t":"通过表面重构实现富锂锰基层状氧化物阴离子氧化的轨道稳定化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6797493?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂富锰基层状氧化物","kp":["[策略]: 表面重构稳定阴离子氧化还原"],"dp":1,"as":"富锂层状氧化物因其同时利用阳离子和阴离子氧化还原反应而具有极高的电池容量，但阴离子氧化还原过程中常伴随氧释放和结构不可逆相变，导致容量衰减。该研究通过表面重构策略实现阴离子氧化还原的轨道稳定化，抑制不可逆氧损失，提升富锂锰基正极材料的循环稳定性。该方法为下一代高能量密度锂离子电池正极材料的商业化提供了关键的工程化解决路径。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Orbital Stabilization of Anionic Redox via Surface Restructuration for Li‐Rich Mn‐Based Layered Oxides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium‐rich layered oxides are renowned for their high capacity, originating from both cationic and anionic redox reactions. However, the anionic redox process often induces the formation of O–O dimers, triggering oxygen release and transition metal migration that typically initiate at the particle surface and lead to progressive structural degradation and performance decay. In this study, we report a lithium‐rich manganese‐based layered oxide cathode featuring a surface reconstruction layer in which nickel ions occupy the 4 h Wyckoff sites within the Li\n                    2\n                    MnO\n                    3\n                    phase. This surface‐site‐specific nickel occupation induces parallel alignment of electron‐depleted O 2p orbitals, effectively suppressing the formation of unstable O–O dimers and inhibiting oxygen release. The engineered cathode delivers a remarkable reversible capacity of 325 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 0.1C (20 mA g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ), along with an outstanding rate capability of 272.8 mAh g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    at 1C (200 mA g\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ) and 90% capacity retention after 300 cycles. This surface engineering strategy establishes a novel structural response mechanism for oxygen redox reactions, enabling the simultaneous achievement of high capacity and long‐term cycling stability. The findings provide critical insights for the development of advanced high‐energy‐density cathode materials.","aip":1},{"t":"非均匀晶格中的光学等时线和挤压动力学","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6b4n-v35x","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Ioannis Kiorpelidis, Matthias Heinrich, Alexander Szameit, Georgios A. Siviloglou, and Konstantinos G. MakrisWe present exact analogies between the tautochrone problem of classical mechanics and the squeezed states of quantum optics to optical lattices. Both phenomena emerge in the same physical system, that of waveguide arrays with nonuniform couplings. Extension to two dimensions yields Lissajous-type tr…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233801] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"带相反电荷的单酶纳米凝胶形成多功能凝聚体以实现高效酶级联催化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73688?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶级联催化纳米凝胶","kp":["[体系]: 异电单酶纳米凝胶凝聚体"],"dp":1,"as":"本文提出利用带相反电荷的单酶纳米凝胶（single enzyme nanogels）自组装形成凝聚体（coacervates），构建高效酶级联催化系统。传统酶级联面临扩散受限、底物穿梭效率低等瓶颈，该策略将每种酶分别封装于荷电纳米凝胶中，通过静电驱动自组装形成无膜液滴结构，缩短酶间距并提升中间产物传递效率。该方法模拟天然代谢通路的空间组织方式，在生物催化、生物传感和合成生物学领域具有应用潜力。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Oppositely Charged Single Enzyme Nanogels Form Versatile Coacervates for Efficient Enzyme Cascade Catalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Enzymatic cascade systems enhance the efficiency of biocatalysis by mimicking natural metabolic pathways. However, conventional platforms face challenges such as ineffective enzyme distribution, uncontrolled stoichiometry, limited substrate accessibility, and a microenvironment that is suboptimal for enzyme performance. Inspired by cellular biomolecular condensates, we here present a design based on oppositely charged single enzyme nanogels (SENs) that phase separate into denser microdroplet coacervates, which thereby serve both as an immobilization scaffold and functional unit. These coacervates, the first fabricated exclusively from oppositely charged nanogels, form under broad environmental conditions and enable specific microenvironments by adjusting SEN ratios to match the requirements of coupled enzymes. Selective substrate enrichment and efficient diffusion of intermediates enhance cascade productivity. The applicability of the platform is demonstrated with pharmaceutically relevant enzymes, highlighting its potential for biosynthetic applications. This work establishes a new paradigm that integrates protein‐polymer engineering with phase separation chemistry to overcome key limitations in cascade enzyme catalysis.","aip":1},{"t":"在 $\\sqr 处的 $pp$ 和 $\\mathrm{Au}+\\mathrm{Au}$ 碰撞中开放魅力生成和 ${\\mathrm{Λ}}_{c}^{+}/{D}^{0}$ 比率","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/519h-2vrc","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Bijun Fan, Shusu Shi, Chao Zhang, and Liang ZhengWe study open-charm hadrons production in pp and $\\mathrm{Au}+\\mathrm{Au}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{{s}_{NN}}=200$ GeV using an improved multiphase transport (AMPT) model. Specifically, we show the transverse-momentum spectra and nuclear modification factors ${R}_{\\mathrm{AA}}$ of ${D}^{0}$ mesons and $…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064904] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"交替磁体中可切换手性磁振子的观察","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/m8lc-f8gk","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Zheyuan Liu, Hodaka Kikuchi, Zijun Wei, Shinichiro Asai, Mechthild Enderle, Ursula B. Hansen, Vasile O. Garlea, Manh D. Le, Gøran J. Nilsen, Igor A. Zaliznyak, and Takatsugu MasudaPolarized inelastic neutron scattering gives the first unambiguous evidence of chirality of the split magnon bands in altermagnetic MnTe.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236705] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","tp":"手性磁振子","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员利用偏振非弹性中子散射技术，首次在交替磁体MnTe中明确证实了分裂磁振子能带的手性。这是交替磁体这一新型磁性物态中手性自旋激发存在的直接实验证据，发表于《物理评论快报》，对自旋电子学器件开发具有指导意义。"},{"t":"英伟达向中国客户推销Vera CPU","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/nvidia-pitches-vera-cpu-chinese-customers","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"the information","tg":"产业进展","tp":"英伟达Vera CPU","kp":["[产品]: 英伟达Vera CPU面向中国"],"as":"英伟达（Nvidia）正面向中国客户推介其Vera CPU产品，试图在出口管制背景下维持中国市场存在。Vera CPU基于Arm架构，定位为数据中心和AI推理场景的通用处理器，可能与Grace CPU系列相关。此举反映英伟达在中国市场受美国芯片出口限制后，寻求通过非受限产品线（如CPU等非高端GPU）维持营收的战略调整。该动态对中美半导体博弈及国产替代进程具有风向标意义。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.5,"r":7.0,"d":4.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Nvidia Pitches Vera CPU to Chinese Customers","b":"Nvidia Pitches Vera CPU to Chinese Customers — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"核动力大型汽车运输船获设计批准","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/transportation/ship-integrated-nuclear-propulsion-design-approval","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"interesting engineering","tg":"产业进展","tp":"核动力运输船","kp":["反应堆[船载]: 熔盐反应堆(MSR)","应用[大型PCTC]: 纯汽车卡车运输船","认证进展[SMR]: Lloyd's Register设计批准"],"sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"一项新研究支持将熔盐反应堆（MSR）物理性和操作性地集成到大型汽车运输船中的概念设计，该设计已获原则性批准。MSR具有固有安全性、高热效率和超长续航优势，标志着核动力在商业航运脱碳领域的工程可行性获得认可，为航运业零碳转型开辟新路径。","ot":"Nuclear-powered large vehicle carrier ship gets design approval","b":"A new study has supported the concept of physically and operationally integrating a molten salt reactor (MSR) into a large vehicle carrier ship. Lloyd’s Register (LR) is working with Hyundai Heavy Industries, Korea Shipbuilding and Offshore Engineering (KSOE), and others to explore an advanced small modular reactor (SMR) installation on a pure car and truck carrier (PCTC).\nThe latest work examined the internal arrangement and segregation of the reactor system, shielding requirements, and the impact on cargo deck layout and vehicle capacity, alongside stability and trim implications linked to the reactor’s weight and positioning.\n“While nuclear propulsion is still at an early stage of development, this project shows the importance of building technical understanding now to support future progress,”\nSung-Gu Park, President – North East Asia, Lloyd’s Register.\n“Establishing feasibility at concept stage is a valuable step forward, particularly in areas such as cargo optimization, vessel stability and integrated safety design.”\nThe partners also assessed propulsion system configuration and power delivery, as well as operational flexibility compared with conventionally fueled PCTCs, where trade routes and port calls can be tightly constrained.\n“With global environmental regulations becoming increasingly stringent and no definitive net-zero fuel yet available, SMR-powered ships can serve as a highly effective alternative, representing a pioneering next-generation maritime technology capable of complying with GHG emission regulations while allowing lifetime operation without refueling, and HD HHI will remain at the forefront of sustainable maritime technology development,” said Hong-Ryeul Ryu, CTO and Senior Executive Vice President at HD HHI.\nIt’s also revealed that a key focus of the project has been safety. LR led hazard identification (HAZID) and preliminary risk assessment work, focusing on containment, onboard safety systems and potential operability constraints tied to nuclear technology at\nKorea Atomic Energy Research Institute (KAERI) also considers the latest study a meaningful achievement in assessing the potential application of SMRs in the maritime sector, taking actual ship operating environments into account. The study is particularly significant because it examined the technical feasibility of applying an MSR type marine SMR to a specific target vessel, namely a PCTC,\naccording to\nGet the latest in engineering, tech, space & science - delivered daily to your inbox.\nPrabhat, an alumnus of the Indian Institute of Mass Communication, is a tech and defense journalist. While he enjoys writing on modern weapons and emerging tech, he has also reported on global politics and business. He has been previously associated with well-known media houses, including the International Business Times (Singapore Edition) and ANI.\nRobot hand uses touch and vision to harvest ripe fruit with near-100% accuracy\nUS safety design approval advances next-gen Aurora nuclear reactor initiative in Idaho\nDodge Charger maker road-tests solid-state EV battery hitting 90% charge in 18 minutes\nProject to restore US uranium enrichment for defense programs commences operations\nChina’s robotic snakes slither across power lines to spot faults before failure\nMore from Transportation\nTransportation\nNew plane prototype conducts maiden piloted flight, can transform hybrid-electric aircraft future\nTransportation\nKLM operates first passenger flight to Germany with synthetic kerosene-blended fuel\nTransportation\nWorld’s first electric TaxiBot tows Airbus A320 jets at 26 mph in the Netherlands\nTransportation\nWorld’s largest dam to get giant water staircase to let 11,000-ton ships pass faster\nTransportation\nVideo: X-59 goes supersonic with 713 mph flight, paves way for quiet high-speeding jets\nTransportation\nNew plane prototype conducts maiden piloted flight, can transform hybrid-electric aircraft future\nTransportation\nKLM operates first passenger flight to Germany with synthetic kerosene-blended fuel\nTransportation\nWorld’s first electric TaxiBot tows Airbus A320 jets at 26 mph in the Netherlands\nTransportation\nWorld’s largest dam to get giant water staircase to let 11,000-ton ships pass faster\nTransportation\nVideo: X-59 goes supersonic with 713 mph flight, paves way for quiet high-speeding jets"},{"t":"测试的非自行车自行车装备：H2O Audio 的 TRI 2 骨传导耳机","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/12/non-bike-bike-gear-tested-h2o-audios-tri-2-bone-conduction-headphones/","c":"不相关","a":"Electrek","tg":"行业观察","b":"| Jun 12 2026 - 3:15 am PT\nI love listening to music, podcasts, and audiobooks when I’m riding my e-bikes. Depending on the type of ride I’m doing, I’ve got an affinity for all of them. But I also love not getting hit by a car. And those two goals don’t always work well together.\nTraditional earbuds and headphones can be great for audio quality, but they also have a nasty habit of disconnecting you from the world around you. On an e-bike, situational awareness is a key part of staying safe. Hearing a car approaching, a cyclist calling out a pass, or a pedestrian running into your path can make a real difference.\nThat’s why I’ve become such a fan of bone conduction headphones, and after spending time with the\nTRI 2 Pro Multi-Sport\nwith Playlist+ headphones from H2O Audio, I think I’ve found my favorite pair yet.\nThe concept behind bone conduction headphones is pretty fascinating. Instead of sending sound into your ears through speakers, they transmit vibrations through the bones in your skull, allowing your inner ear to interpret the sound. The result is that your ears remain completely open to the outside world while you’re still enjoying your music.\nFor bike riding, that’s a huge advantage.\nI’ve been using the TRI 2 Pros on rides all over the city, and I quickly got into a routine that perfectly highlights why I like them so much. I’ll ride out to the beach on my e-bike while listening to music, lock up the bike, go for a run, and then hop back on for the ride home. The same headphones handle everything seamlessly, keeping me aware of cars around my while I’m on my bike and then keeping me aware of other potential dangers and obstacles on my runs. I’ve got great audio the entire time, but at no point do I feel disconnected from my surroundings.\nThat’s really the magic here. Unlike earbuds that isolate you from the environment, these keep you plugged into your music while still letting you hear traffic, other cyclists, pedestrians, and everything else happening around you.\nThe TRI 2 Pro is designed as a true multi-sport headset. It’s built for cycling, running, swimming, paddling, surfing, snowboarding, and pretty much any other outdoor activity you can think of. The lightweight neckband design stays securely in place, and I found the fit comfortable enough to forget I was wearing them after the first minute.\nSound quality is surprisingly good for bone conduction technology. No, they aren’t going to compete with high-end over-ear headphones in a quiet room. That’s not the point. The point is that you can enjoy clear, enjoyable audio while maintaining full situational awareness, and the TRI 2 Pros do that exceptionally well.\nOne feature I particularly appreciated is the built-in storage. The headphones include 8 GB of onboard memory, enough for roughly 2,000 songs or around 130 hours of music. That means you don’t necessarily need your phone with you if you want to head out for a workout. I pretty much always have my phone with me on rides, but for running, not needing to have my phone in my pocket is a big advantage.\nThe Playlist+ feature takes that concept a step further by allowing offline playback of streaming music. Combined with the built-in MP3 player, it gives you multiple ways to leave your phone behind if you want to travel lighter.\nBluetooth connectivity worked flawlessly during my testing, and battery life was solid. H2O Audio rates the headphones for up to nine hours of Bluetooth playback or around six hours in memory mode, and that was more than enough for even my longest ride-and-run sessions. I love that I can get by with charging them barely once a week instead of every few days.\nThe headphones are also fully waterproof with an IPX8 rating, meaning they can actually be submerged underwater. I’m not a swimmer, so I let my brother-in-law borrow them for a water test while swimming laps, and he came back with two soaking-wet thumbs up. As for me, I’ve gotten caught in torrential downpours both while running and while on my bikes, and so it’s nice to know that rain, sweat, or even accidental dunks aren’t likely to be a problem, even if I probably won’t go fully submerged in them. But if swimming is your sport, you’re good to go with waterproofing.\nThe soft silicone finish also makes them comfortable for longer workouts. They’re slimmer than previous generations and feel refined rather than bulky.\nI’m honestly trying to find something to complain about here, but it’s difficult when I genuinely enjoy using them this much. Sure, if I was a serious audiophile then I’d poo-poo the limited bass compared to heavy over-the-ear headphones, but that’s not the point of why someone would use these. So I’m left with saying that the biggest downside I can find is really just the price.\n, these aren’t impulse-buy headphones. There are certainly less expensive audio options out there.\nHowever, H2O Audio is currently running a Father’s Day promotion through June 22nd with the code\nthat takes 25% off site-wide. And apparently, they don’t even check whether you’re actually a dad!\nSo yeah, you’ve got to pay a pretty penny, but you get some really awesome headphones that have totally upgraded my rides… and my runs!\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nMicah Toll is a personal electric vehicle enthusiast, battery nerd, and author of the Amazon #1 bestselling books\nDIY Lithium Batteries\nDIY Solar Power,\nThe Ultimate DIY Ebike Guide\nThe Electric Bike Manifesto\nThe e-bikes that make up Micah’s current daily drivers are the\n$999 Lectric XP 2.0\n$1,095 Ride1Up Roadster V2\n$1,199 Rad Power Bikes RadMission\n$3,299 Priority Current\n. But it’s a pretty evolving list these days.\nBest $999 electric bike ever!\nGreat e-bikes at great prices!"},{"t":"新产品","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5480?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"A weekly roundup of information on newly offered instrumentation, apparatus, and laboratory materials of potential interest to researchers."},{"t":"预计本世纪初将发生永久冻土碳融化带来的二氧化碳净释放","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz8478?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Accelerating permafrost thaw may release vast deep (&gt;3 meters) frozen soil carbon as carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ), but this magnitude remains uncertain because current Earth system models (ESMs) lack deep carbon processes. Using an updated ORCHIDEE-MICT model simulating Pleistocene Yedoma formation and Holocene peatland development, we project northern (&gt;30°N) carbon responses under climate change. Compared to the original model, including these deep carbon pools improves agreement with observations and reduces net CO\n                    2\n                    uptake by 47 to 74 petagrams of carbon from 1900 to 2100 across three future scenarios because of deep carbon decomposition with accelerated active-layer deepening. Under high-emission pathways, the northern soil carbon balance shifts from a sink to a source of 32 petagrams of carbon, advancing the reversal reported in earlier studies into the 21st century. Consistent with field data, our model shows that colder soils retain more labile carbon—contrary to assumptions in many Coupled Model Intercomparison Project (CMIP) models—helping explain their persistent sink bias. Our results highlight the need to represent both the quantity and quality of permafrost carbon in ESMs.","tp":"冻土碳释放","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队利用改进的ORCHIDEE-MICT模型，模拟更新世Yedoma冻土形成和全新世泥炭地发育过程，预测气候变化下北纬30度以北深部(>3米)冻土碳的响应。纳入深部碳过程后，预计本世纪初冻土融化将造成显著的二氧化碳净释放。"},{"t":"负协同性驱动衣壳定向抗病毒药物对抗乙型肝炎病毒的活性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed6483?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Hepatitis B virus capsid protein plays a role in almost every step of viral replication, from self-assembly to genome release. This makes capsid protein an attractive target for antiviral development. Capsid assembly modulators (CAMs) are direct-acting antivirals that bind capsid protein, leading to empty or aberrant complexes instead of an infectious virus. CAMs can also disrupt the capsid, preventing new infection. To understand CAM activity, we examined the energetics of CAM-capsid interaction. We observed negative cooperativity of CAM-binding kinetics and thermodynamics. These correlate with large changes in capsid architecture that presage capsid rupture. We propose that CAMs induce an accumulated strain on the capsid. Understanding the interplay of forces and architecture will help guide the development of CAMs."},{"t":"天然 AMPA 受体结构揭示了 SynDIG4 参与和辅助亚基异质性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee7973?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"AMPA-type glutamate receptors (AMPARs) are complex assemblies whose compositional heterogeneity underlies diverse excitatory signaling in the mammalian brain. Here, we determine high-resolution cryo–electron microscopy (cryo-EM) structures of native AMPAR complexes rapidly purified from mouse brain. These structures capture receptors in physiologically relevant assemblies containing distinct combinations of transmembrane AMPA receptor regulatory protein (TARP) and cornichon homolog (CNIH) auxiliary subunits and reveal unambiguous density for the brain-specific protein SynDIG4. The resolved topology and interaction network of SynDIG4 show that it engages the receptor through a CNIH-dependent interface and occupies a position adjacent to structural elements of GluA1 implicated in trafficking and synaptic plasticity. The diversity of auxiliary stoichiometries observed across native complexes highlights a flexible organizational scheme through which AMPARs incorporate distinct regulatory partners. These findings illuminate the organization of native AMPAR assemblies and define the structural context for SynDIG4 function in the mammalian brain."},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池阴极催化层纳米陷阱结构缓解界面传输限制","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73702?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子交换膜燃料电池","kp":["[结构设计]: 碳基吡咯氮纳米陷阱"],"dp":1,"as":"提出纳米陷阱（Nanotrap）架构以缓解燃料电池厚阴极催化层中的界面传输限制。该设计优化气体传输和三相边界密度，有望提升固体氧化物燃料电池等器件的性能。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Nanotrap Architectures for Mitigating Interfacial Transport Limitations in Cathode Catalyst Layers of Proton Exchange Me","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient gas transport and abundant triple‐phase boundaries (TPBs) are vital for thick cathode catalyst layers (CCLs) in proton exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs), yet remain challenging to realize. In this work, we introduce a carbon‐based nanotrap architecture functionalized with pyrrolic‐N groups, which reorganizes the Pt–carbon–ionomer interface to enhance local oxygen supply. These nanotraps simultaneously confine Pt nanoparticles and ionomer, forming continuous pathways for oxygen, protons, and electrons, thereby significantly increasing active TPB density. The underlying enhancement mechanism is validated by x‐ray tomography and 3D two‐phase flow simulations. Using a 15.5 µm‐thick CCL, the optimized electrode achieves peak power densities of 1940 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in H\n                    2\n                    /O\n                    2\n                    and 1410 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in H\n                    2\n                    /Air—improvements of ∼30% and ∼80%, respectively. Moreover, it exhibits a good stability, with a voltage decay rate of only 43.8 µV h\n                    −1\n                    at 1.5 A cm\n                    −2\n                    over 1000 h. This nanotrap concept offers a versatile interfacial design strategy for advanced gas‐diffusion electrodes in energy conversion technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"单晶二硒化铂半金属-半导体界面电荷传输的纳米尺度成像","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00236-5?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维材料界面传输","kp":["材料[2D电子学]: 单片二硒化铂(PtSe₂)","[表征]: 纳米尺度电荷输运跨半金属-半导体界面可视化"],"dp":1,"as":"利用纳米尺度成像技术研究二维半导体中半金属-半导体界面的电荷输运。电接触仍是下一代电子器件的关键瓶颈，该工作为改善二维材料的接触电阻提供了新的表征手段和见解。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Nanoscale imaging of charge transport across the semimetal-semiconductor interface in monolithic platinum diselenide","b":"Electrical contacts in two-dimensional semiconductors remain a key bottleneck for next-generation electronics. We introduce a method to directly visualize how electric charges flow across a monolithic semimetal-semiconductor interface formed within a single sheet of platinum diselenide, where one region is sculpted into a semiconductor while the rest remains semimetallic. The charges traverse this monolithic boundary without significant resistance, offering a versatile platform for designing low-resistance contacts in future two-dimensional electronic devices."},{"t":"纳米力学传感器解析低于其零点涨落的脉冲力","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/9wzm-3qyb","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米力学量子传感","kp":["[灵敏度]: 测量低于零点涨落脉冲力"],"dp":1,"as":"开发了纳米机械传感器，可分辨低于其零点涨落的脉冲力。该成果突破了量子测量极限，将纳米机械传感灵敏度提升至前所未有的水平，对精密测量和量子传感领域具有重要意义。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Nanomechanical Sensor Resolving Impulsive Forces below Its Zero-Point Fluctuations","b":"Author(s): Martynas Skrabulis, Martin Colombano Sosa, Nicola Carlon Zambon, Andrei Militaru, Massimiliano Rossi, Martin Frimmer, and Lukas NovotnyResearchers boosted the sensitivity for measurements of the motion of a levitated nanoparticle, with potential uses in dark matter searches.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233604] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"美国国立卫生研究院科学家被控将病毒走私到美国","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5923?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Inactivated monkeypox virus samples may have been used for routine diagnostics"},{"t":"美国宇航局发现巨大的海浪预示着厄尔尼诺现象可能卷土重来","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/nasa-spots-giant-ocean-swell-signaling-a-potential-el-nino-comeback/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Sentinel-6 satellite data shows strengthening warm-water waves in the Pacific, pointing to the likely arrival of El Niño and its global weather impacts later in 2026.\nSeveral months before an El Niño develops, large waves of warmer, elevated water travel eastward across the Pacific Ocean. Satellite observations in 2026 have detected several of these waves.\nSea level measurements collected by a satellite operated by\nand its European partners reveal that a broad mass of warm water, stretching hundreds of miles across, has reached the Pacific Ocean near South America. Scientists view this as a strong indication that El Niño could form later this year. Since water expands as it warms, higher ocean surface levels are a sign of increasing temperatures below.\nEl Niño events can bring unusually heavy rainfall to some parts of the world while causing dry conditions in others, affecting communities, agriculture, transportation, and economies worldwide.\nLaunched in 2020 by NASA and managed by ESA (\nEuropean Space Agency\n) for the E.U. Copernicus Program, the Sentinel-6 Michael Freilich satellite measures ocean surface height across the globe every 10 days with precision down to fractions of an inch. For El Niño monitoring, the mission focuses on warm Kelvin waves.\nThese waves often develop when winds over the western equatorial Pacific briefly reverse direction, changing from easterlies that normally blow from east to west to westerlies. Combined with a broader weakening of easterly winds along the equator, this shift allows waters in the western tropical Pacific to warm and sea levels to rise.\nThe international Sentinel-6 Michael Freilich sea level satellite observed a swell of warm water, called a Kelvin wave, moving eastward in the equatorial Pacific Ocean, arriving off the South American coast in May. Warm Kelvin waves often precede El Niño events. Credit: NASA/JPL-Caltech\nThe resulting wave then moves eastward for weeks, eventually reaching South America, where it raises ocean temperatures and sea levels along the coast. El Niño takes shape when several Kelvin waves occur over a period of months, allowing warm water to build up near Colombia, Ecuador, and Peru.\n“While this year’s event started a bit later than the big El Niños of 2015 and 1997, it’s beginning to catch up,” said Josh Willis, a sea level researcher at NASA’s Jet Propulsion Laboratory in Southern California and project scientist for Sentinel-6 Michael Freilich. “We’ll see how big it gets.”\nData from Sentinel-6 Michael Freilich detected a small Kelvin wave forming near Micronesia in late January before fading by mid-February. Another wave appeared in early March and gradually traveled eastward. By mid-May, sea levels near Peru were more than 5.9 inches (15 centimeters) higher than the long-term average.\n“NASA’s observation of El Niño uses sea level satellites like Sentinel-6 Michael Freilich to track massive Kelvin waves as they cross the Pacific, capture changes in Earth’s ocean thermodynamics, improve forecasts of weather extremes, and help communities prepare for potential coastal hazards,” said Nadya Vinogradova Shiffer, lead program scientist at NASA Headquarters in Washington. “Stay tuned as more ocean stories continue to unfold.”\nThe term El Niño was first used by fishermen in the 1600s. The Spanish phrase means “the boy,” referring to the birth of baby Jesus, because the warming event often intensified around Christmas. They also noticed that warmer waters reduced fish catches.\nHigher sea surface temperatures in the central and eastern Pacific alter atmospheric circulation around the world by shifting the jet stream and changing storm tracks. As a result, some regions experience heavier rain and snow, while others face unusual heat and dry conditions. The extent of these impacts depends on the strength of the El Niño event.\nDuring weaker events, such as those that began in 2018 and 2023, drought and flooding effects were largely confined to areas in and around the tropical Pacific. Stronger events, including the 2015-2016 El Niño, can have much broader consequences, contributing to drought in Africa and flooding in California.\nEl Niño events typically reach their peak between November and January, meaning the most significant effects of the current event may not become apparent for several more months.\n“Every El Niño is different,” said\nsea level researcher Severine Fournier, deputy project scientist for Sentinel-6 Michael Freilich. “But they almost always make for a hot year and big changes in rainfall in parts of the globe.”\nSentinel-6 Michael Freilich now serves as the official reference satellite for tracking global sea levels. Launched in 2020, it extends a record that began with the TOPEX/Poseidon satellite in 1992. Several follow-up missions have continued that work, and Sentinel-6B, launched in November 2025, is expected to replace Sentinel-6 Michael Freilich by the end of 2026.\nSentinel-6 Michael Freilich, named after former NASA Earth Science Division Director Michael Freilich, is one of two satellites that compose the Copernicus Sentinel-6/Jason-CS (Continuity of Service) mission.\nSentinel-6/Jason-CS, a part of the European Union’s Earth observation program called Copernicus, was jointly developed by ESA, the European Organization for the Exploitation of Meteorological Satellites (EUMETSAT), NASA, and the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (\n), with funding support from the European Commission and technical support on performance from the French space agency CNES (Centre National d’Études Spatiales). Spacecraft monitoring and control, as well as the processing of all the altimeter science data, is carried out by EUMETSAT on behalf of the European Union’s Copernicus Programme, with the support of all partner agencies.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nJason-CS/Sentinel-6 Mission\nSalty Secrets: NASA Decodes El Niño’s Coastal Impact\nSurging Seas: NASA Links Spike in 2023 Global Sea Level to El Niño\nRising Tides and Troubled Waters: NASA Forecasts El Niño-Driven Flood Fury This Winter\nEl Niño’s Evolution: Cutting-Edge Observations From Sentinel-6\nGlobal Fever: NASA Says July 2023 Sizzles As the Hottest Month on Record Ever Since 1880\nRising Suspicion: Satellite Sentinel-6 Detects Elusive El Niño in the Making\nEl Niño Continues to Grow, Set to Bear Down on U.S.\n2015 El Niño Appears Likely to Equal the Event of 1997-98\nPossibility of El Niño Event in 2014 is Fading","tp":"卫星测厄尔尼诺","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"as":"NASA Sentinel-6卫星海平面数据显示太平洋暖水波正在增强并向东传播，这是厄尔尼诺现象形成前数月的典型前兆信号。2026年已探测到多股此类暖水波，暗示厄尔尼诺可能再次来袭，将对全球气候和极端天气产生深远影响。"},{"t":"我多元化的学术背景正在影响我的博士研究——我该怎么办？","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01129-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"A PhD student in China who has changed his focus twice since obtaining his undergraduate degree is struggling to keep up. A PhD student in China who has changed his focus twice since obtaining his undergraduate degree is struggling to keep up."},{"t":"多金属酚醛网络工程化低密度聚合物烧蚀材料：高达2900K的热防护与隔热","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73655?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物防热材料","kp":["耐温极限[MPN烧蚀防热材料]: 2900K","陶瓷化机制[低密度烧蚀体]: 金属酚醛网络多金属分子可编程陶瓷化"],"as":"开发多金属酚醛网络工程化低密度聚合物烧蚀材料，用于行星进入和样品返回任务的热防护。该材料兼具轻质与隔热性能，满足深空探测对热防护系统的严苛要求。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Multi‐Metal Phenolic Network Engineered Low Density Polymeric Ablator for Thermal Protection and Insulation up to 2900K","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Planetary‐entry and sample‐return missions demand thermal protection materials that simultaneously minimize mass, suppress recession, and withstand prolonged exposure to ultrahigh‐temperature oxidative environments. Here, we report a metal‐phenolic‐network (MPN) engineered low‐density‐ablator that resolves this longstanding trade‐off through molecularly programmable multimetal ceramization. The material is constructed by controlled ligand exchange between a quasi‐linear Ti/Zr/Hf multimetal polymer and phenolic ligands, followed by polymerization into a nanoporous aerogel‐like‐matrix with low density, low thermal conductivity, and scalable processability. The molecular‐level dispersion of multimetal species governs the in situ evolution of hierarchical ceramic architectures during extreme heating: the surface transforms into a dense interpenetrating oxide protection layer, in which (Hf, Zr)O form a rigid skeleton while (Ti, Si)O fill the intergranular space to suppress oxygen penetration and outward mass transport; meanwhile, the interior develops a mass‐fractal carbon–ceramic network that disrupts heat‐flux propagation. The composite exhibits near‐zero recession at ultrahigh temperatures, with linear ablation rates of 0.0017 mm s\n                    −1\n                    at 2800 K and 0.0031 mm s\n                    −1\n                    at 2900 K, while sustaining 2500 K for 1500 s with a back‐temperature‐rise of only 369 K. This work establishes an MPN‐based materials platform for lightweight thermal protection systems that integrate ultrahigh‐temperature stability, oxidation resistance, and effective thermal insulation."},{"t":"胰高血糖素样肽-1 的多组分缝合可实现受体引导的 PROTAC 递送","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9595531?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Achieving cell‐selective targeted protein degradation remains a major challenge for translating proteolysis‐targeting chimeras (PROTACs) into therapeutics. Although pancreatic β‐cells are well vascularised and readily accessible to circulating peptides, selective receptor‐mediated drug delivery remains challenging. Here, we exploit the glucagon‐like peptide‐1 receptor (GLP‐1R) as a β‐cell‐specific entry route and report, for the first time, a multicomponent stapled glucagon‐like peptide‐1 (GLP‐1) analogue constructed by tryptophan‐mediated multicomponent Petasis reaction (TMPR). This modular stapling strategy affords a conformationally stabilised GLP‐1 peptide bearing a chemically orthogonal handle for late‐stage conjugation, displaying markedly enhanced α‐helicity and improved receptor potency, compared with the wild‐type peptide. Linking this improved analogue to a bromodomain‐containing protein 4 (BRD4)‐directed degrader furnishes the first GLP‐1‐guided PROTAC, which retains GLP‐1R agonism and induces selective BRD4 degradation in GLP‐1R‐positive cells, consistent with receptor‐guided uptake and intracellular activation of the degrader payload. Together, these results provide strong proof‐of‐concept evidence that a TMPR‐stapled GLP‐1 peptide can serve as a β‐cell‐directed delivery platform for receptor‐defined protein degradation."},{"t":"考虑可行性与敏感性的船载多能混合推进系统多目标容量优化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600841X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"船舶混合推进","as":"","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Multi-objective sizing optimization of shipboard multi-energy hybrid propulsion systems with feasibility and sensitivity"},{"t":"季风驱动世界上最大的常绿阔叶林聚集","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag361/8707061?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"As the world’s largest evergreen broadleaved forest (EBLF), East Asian EBLF houses high levels of biodiversity and endemism and is essential to regional carbon storage and cycling. However, how East Asian EBLF was shaped over time remains an open question. Here we investigate the historical assembly of this biome by sampling 21 angiosperm clades (together encompassing 2028 species) that include evergreen and deciduous species. We show that the transition from deciduous to evergreen lineages, and in situ diversification and immigration of evergreen lineages in subtropical East Asia all experienced a dynamic process. Transition and immigration reached their first peaks and in situ diversification sharply increased at the Oligocene–Miocene boundary (OMB), and all of them reached their highest peaks in the late Miocene. Our results suggest that modern East Asian EBLF did not appear until the OMB and markedly deteriorated since the Pliocene, mainly driven by the evolution of Asian monsoon climate. This study suggests that East Asian EBLF has functioned as both museums and cradles for regional biodiversity, and serves as a transfer station for biotic exchanges between temperate and tropical regions, highlighting its great conservation value."},{"t":"侧链工程实现Kagome共价有机框架晶体的分子级精确三角形封端","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5591473?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架晶体","kp":["端基工程[Kagome COF]: 侧链工程实现三角形精确端基"],"as":"实现了Kagome型共价有机框架（COF）晶体的分子级精确三角形终止。高分辨率结构表征对二维Kagome COF的研究至关重要，该突破为精确控制COF晶体形貌和边缘结构奠定基础。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Molecularly Precise Triangular Termination of Kagome Covalent Organic Framework Crystals Enabled by Side‐Chain Engineeri","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐resolution structural characterization of two‐dimensional (2D) kagome covalent organic frameworks (COFs) remains limited, often leaving critical questions about lattice ordering and surface‐terminating functionality largely unanswered. To address this challenge, we designed a series of acceptor–donor–acceptor linear linkers based on benzo[1,2‐\n                    b\n                    :4,5‐\n                    b\n                    ′]dithiophene and 2,1,3‐benzothiadiazole units with systematically varied alkoxy side chains. Diverse 2D kagome COFs bearing methoxy, ethoxy, and propoxy side chains were synthesized by imine condensation of these linkers with a dibenzo[\n                    g\n                    ,\n                    p\n                    ]chrysene‐based node. While featuring identical backbone architecture, the resulting COFs exhibit remarkably different degrees of crystallinity, demonstrating the critical role of side‐chain length in regulating framework ordering. Owing to its superior crystallinity and large pore apertures, the methoxy‐substituted COF (OMe COF) enables direct real‐space visualization of extended kagome pore lattices by high‐resolution transmission electron microscopy (HRTEM). Furthermore, highly crystalline and preferentially oriented OMe COF thin films were synthesized, allowing for detailed HRTEM analysis. Strikingly, HRTEM could clearly resolve triangular terminations of the kagome lattice, thereby establishing the half‐condensed dibenzochrysene nodes as the triangular pores terminating the crystal facets and providing unprecedented real‐space evidence of exposed amino groups. These findings create a structural basis for the future rational design of surface functionalization and potential interfacial engineering in 2D kagome COFs."},{"t":"分子限域结构域实现卤化物稳定的宽带隙钙钛矿","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73713?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宽带隙钙钛矿稳定化","kp":["[策略]: 分子限域域稳定宽带隙卤素"],"dp":1,"as":"利用分子限域域策略实现卤素稳定的宽带隙钙钛矿材料。稳定宽带隙钙钛矿是高效叠层光伏器件的关键，该策略有效抑制了卤素相分离问题，提升了钙钛矿太阳能电池的稳定性。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Molecularly Confined Domains Enable Halide‐Stable Wide‐Bandgap Perovskites","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Stable wide‐bandgap (WBG) perovskites are essential for achieving highly efficient tandem photovoltaics. However, state‐of‐the‐art tandem solar cells typically employ mixed‐halide WBG perovskite, yet halide phase segregation remains a critical bottleneck. Here, we design a molecular confinement domain in which paired iodide‐bearing organic ligands bind adjacent FA\n                    +\n                    cations and are interconnected by a bifunctional diammonium linker, effectively suppressing halide segregation by constraining the dynamic motion of orientable FA\n                    +\n                    cations at the surface and interfaces of wide‐bandgap perovskites. The suppression of this motion effectively strengthens lead‐halide (Pb‐X) bond strength, reinforces the lattice rigidity, reduces lattice vibrational amplitude and increases halide ion migration energy barrier. As a result, I‐Br mixed‐halide segregation and defect evolution under prolonged illumination are effectively suppressed. Finally, the resulting mixed‐halide WBG films exhibit low trap densities, improved carrier transport, and enhanced light/thermal stability. Such concept is applicable to both 1.68 and 1.78 eV perovskite, yielding efficiencies of 24.21% and 21.20% in single‐junction cells, respectively. When integrated into silicon‐based tandem cells, the device delivers an efficiency of 33.59%, alongside durable long‐term stability with a T\n                    96\n                    lifetime of 1000 h under continuous operation.","aip":1},{"t":"n型有机电荷转移络合物中分子氧介导的电子陷阱钝化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9080202?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体钝化","kp":["电子陷阱钝化[n型有机CTC]: O₂介导钝化电荷转移复合物缺陷"],"as":":发现分子氧（O₂）可介导钝化n型有机电荷转移络合物中的电子陷阱。n型有机半导体对氧气敏感导致电子陷阱，该钝化机制为改善n型有机半导体的稳定性和电学性能提供了新途径。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Molecular Dioxygen‐Mediated Passivation of Electron Traps in n‐Type Organic Charge‐Transfer Complexes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The inherent susceptibility of n‐type organic semiconductors to molecular dioxygen (O\n                    2\n                    ) results in electron trapping or in unintended p‐doping, which in turn diminishes their electron mobility. This concept is challenged in the present study by exploring O\n                    2\n                    interactions with organic charge‐transfer complexes (CTCs), where electron donor–acceptor interactions generate partially delocalized electronic states. Using a CTC comprising a phenazine electron donor and a 7,7,8,8‐tetracyanoquinodimethane (TCNQ) electron acceptor, we demonstrate that its exposure to O\n                    2\n                    does not lead to electron extraction but instead enhances the charge‐transfer activity. The increased electron density at the TCNQ acceptor upon CTC exposure to O\n                    2\n                    is attributed to electron trap‐states passivation by O\n                    2\n                    , without evidence of chemisorption. This passivation mitigates recombination losses, resulting in a threefold photoluminescence quantum yield increase, enhanced electrical conductivity, and improved charge‐transfer state efficiency. Similar O\n                    2\n                    ‐mediated conductivity enhancements are observed across additional donor–acceptor pairs, proving the broader applicability of this effect, and paving the way for designing O\n                    2\n                    ‐enhanced advanced organic electronic materials."},{"t":"将塔克拉玛干沙漠生物圈碳汇错误归因于“三北”计划可能会导致不切实际的政策","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607916123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"沙漠碳汇争议","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"迷你大脑类器官揭示了阿尔茨海默氏病隐藏的生物学差异","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/mini-brain-organoids-expose-hidden-biological-differences-in-alzheimers-disease/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Tiny lab-grown brain models and the particles they release may reveal hidden differences among\nPersonalized treatment remains one of the biggest challenges in Alzheimer’s disease. Two patients can receive the same medication for symptoms such as depression, anxiety, or agitation and experience very different outcomes, leaving doctors with few ways to predict who will benefit.\nNow, researchers at\nJohns Hopkins Medicine\nhave developed miniature brain models grown from patients’ own cells that may help explain those differences. The study suggests these lab-grown tissues can capture key biological features of Alzheimer’s disease and reveal how individual patients might respond to commonly prescribed medications.\nThe researchers also identified promising clues inside tiny particles released by the organoids. These particles, known as extracellular vesicles, carry molecular information that could eventually help scientists diagnose Alzheimer’s disease, track its progression, and distinguish between different forms of the disorder.\nThe findings were published in\nAlzheimer’s & Dementia: The Journal of the Alzheimer’s Association\nAlzheimer’s disease affects more than 7 million Americans and remains the most common cause of dementia. Although recent advances have produced treatments that target disease-related proteins in the brain, many patients still depend on medications designed to manage behavioral and psychological symptoms that often accompany the condition.\nThose treatments do not work equally well for everyone.\n“Our study suggests that large-scale, patient-derived brain organoids and the vesicles they secrete can help us stage Alzheimer’s disease, investigate the mechanisms that drive it and assess how patient subgroups may respond to different treatments,” says study leader Vasiliki Machairaki, Ph.D., associate professor of genetic medicine at the Johns Hopkins University School of Medicine.\nTo investigate why patients respond differently, the team turned to brain organoids, small clusters of living brain tissue grown in the laboratory. Unlike conventional cell cultures, organoids can mimic some of the cellular organization and interactions found in the human brain, providing researchers with a more realistic model for studying disease.\nThe scientists began with blood samples collected from patients enrolled in the NIH-funded Johns Hopkins Alzheimer’s Disease Research Center. Those cells were reprogrammed into induced pluripotent stem cells, which can develop into nearly any cell type in the body.\nUsing stem cells from both Alzheimer’s patients and healthy volunteers, the researchers produced hindbrain organoids containing serotonin-producing neurons. The hindbrain plays an important role in regulating functions such as sleep, breathing, and heart rate, while\nsignaling has long been linked to mood and behavior.\nThe cells organized themselves into pea-sized structures that resembled aspects of the human hindbrain. According to Machairaki, the study may be among the largest Alzheimer’s investigations to use patient-derived brain organoids, involving hundreds of organoids from both patients and healthy individuals.\nWhen the researchers compared organoids from Alzheimer’s patients with those from healthy individuals, they found clear molecular differences. Proteins involved in cell communication, inflammation, and other disease-related processes were altered in the Alzheimer’s-derived tissues.\nThe team then exposed the organoids to escitalopram oxalate, a commonly prescribed antidepressant in the selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI) class.\nSome organoids responded strongly, showing increases in proteins associated with serotonin signaling and communication between neurons. Others showed little or no measurable change.\nThat variation closely mirrors what doctors observe in real patients, where responses to the same medication can differ dramatically despite similar diagnoses.\n“We used these organoids to model how some patients’ tissue may respond to a commonly prescribed SSRI,” Machairaki says. “On a large-scale level, our model may eventually be used to identify subgroups of patients, based on underlying molecular mechanisms, who are more likely to respond to certain drugs and thus help us to create precise, targeted treatments in the long run.”\nThe researchers also examined extracellular vesicles, microscopic particles released by cells that transport proteins and other biological material throughout the body.\nBecause these particles can be detected in bodily fluids such as blood, scientists are increasingly studying them as potential sources of disease biomarkers that could be measured without invasive procedures.\nBefore and after escitalopram treatment, the team analyzed extracellular vesicles released by both Alzheimer’s-derived organoids and healthy controls.\nThe vesicles contained proteins involved in memory,\nneurotransmitter\nrelease, and communication between neurons. Several proteins linked to Alzheimer’s disease, including RAB3A, NSF, and ATCAY, appeared at lower levels in organoids derived from patients with the disease.\nAfter treatment, some of those proteins increased in certain samples, particularly proteins associated with serotonin signaling and synaptic activity.\nAs with the organoids themselves, responses varied considerably between samples. Some showed substantial molecular changes, while others showed almost none.\nThe findings suggest that extracellular vesicles could eventually help identify which patients are most likely to benefit from specific therapies, potentially allowing treatments to be matched more closely to the biology of an individual’s disease.\nThe researchers are now working to create more advanced organoids that include immune cells and vessel-like networks that mimic blood vessels. These additions could make the models more representative of the living human brain and improve their value for studying Alzheimer’s disease.\nLooking ahead, Machairaki envisions a future in which extracellular vesicles serve as a type of liquid biopsy, helping doctors diagnose Alzheimer’s disease, determine its stage, and identify distinct biological subtypes that may require different treatment approaches.\nReference: “Proteomic profiling of brain organoids and extracellular vesicles identifies early Alzheimer’s disease biomarkers and drug response heterogeneity” by Rachel J. Boyd, Daiyun Dong, Ram Sagar, Anton Iliuk, Waqar Ahmed, Xenia Androni, Anton P. Porsteinsson, Paul B. Rosenberg, Constantine G. Lyketsos, Kenneth W. Witwer and Vasiliki Mahairaki, 8 April 2026,\nAlzheimer’s & Dementia\nDOI: 10.1002/alz.71273\nIn addition to Machairaki, scientists who contributed to this work include Rachel Boyd, Daiyun Dong, Ram Sagar, Waqar Ahmed, Xenia Androni, Paul Rosenberg, Constantine Lyketsos and Kenneth Witwer from Johns Hopkins, Anton Iliuk from Tymora Analytical Operations and Anton Porsteinsson from University of Rochester School of Medicine and Dentistry.\nFunding for this study was provided by the\nNational Institutes of Health\n(T32 AG058527, R01AG052510, P30AG066507, 1RF1AG083801, AGR01054771, AGR01050515, AGR01046543 and AGR01071522), the Paul G. Allen Frontiers Foundation and the Richman Family Precision Medicine Center of Excellence in Alzheimer’s Disease at The Johns Hopkins University.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAlzheimer's Disease\nThese Signs of Memory Loss Could Actually Predict Alzheimer’s Brain Changes\nAre We Evolving? New Research Reveals That Human Brains Are Getting Larger\nScientists Discover New Telltale Sign of Alzheimer’s\nCertain Protein May Predict Mild Cognitive Impairment Years Before Symptoms\nLosing Your Sense of Smell – A Potential Warning of Future Memory and Thinking Problems\nEarly Menopause May Increase Risk of Alzheimer’s Disease\nAlleviating Symptoms: Brain Stimulation Could Help Treat Alzheimer’s Disease\nAlzheimer’s Breakthrough: New Therapeutic Target Found\nA Diabetes Drug Could Protect Against Alzheimer’s"},{"t":"矿物和大气在地球历史中共同演化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag358/8707051?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Sergey V Krivovichev; Minerals and atmosphere coevolve in the Earth’s history, National Science Review, , nwag358, https"},{"t":"微软的游戏故障","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/the-briefing/microsofts-gaming-glitch","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"Meta CEO 扎克伯格：推动 AI 进步不需千人规模，十余名尖端人才就够了","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/723.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 12 日消息，据《商业内幕》12 日（今天）报道，AI 人才争夺战虽然激烈，但 Meta CEO 马克 · 扎克伯格认为，AI 领域真正的突破并不一定要靠庞大的研究团队。“要推动 AI 进步，并不需要几百名甚至几千名 AI 研究人员。我认为，一个由\n组成的强大团队，就真的可以取得进展。”\n扎克伯格是在与妻子普莉希拉 · 陈一起谈到 Biohub 时作出上述表态的。Biohub 是二人创办的非营利医学研究组织，使命是结合 AI 与生物学，帮助科学家在 21 世纪末前治愈、预防或管理所有疾病。\n在扎克伯格看来，AI 研究人员\n，但 Biohub 的工作内容让 Biohub 与其他机构不同。“AI 研究人员现在非常抢手。他们需求很高，也可以选择自己想做的事情。”\n谈到 Biohub 的 AI 研究人员时，扎克伯格说：“他们本可以去任何主要实验室研究语言模型或其他方向，但那些实验室没有前沿生物学这一部分。所以我认为，Biohub 也有\n。研究人员在 Biohub 可以做一种独特的工作，而这种工作在其他地方很难真正完成。如果你的重点是前沿生物学和前沿 AI，那么我实际上认为，世界上没有其他组织同时在做这两件事。”\nAI 的进步也让扎克伯格对 Biohub 的目标更加乐观。他认为，Biohub 甚至\n可能比原计划更早完成使命\n。“这是一个动态系统。所以，如果你解决了一个问题，未来显然还会有其他问题需要继续处理。我不认为，我们目前已经意识到的问题，就是唯一需要解决的问题。AI 取得的进展显然非常令人兴奋。”\n。谈到下一步决策时，他说：“我认为这是一个相当正常的约束管理过程。我想，全球各个领域的每个实验室大概都会觉得算力不够，Biohub 应该也不例外。”\nIT之家从报道获悉，扎克伯格直言：身处这样的 AI 时刻，使人感到","tp":"AI人才观","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.5,"t":6.0},"as":"Meta CEO扎克伯格表示，推动AI突破不一定要依赖庞大团队，十余名顶尖人才组成的精干团队即可取得实质性进展。他在谈及Biohub时强调，前沿生物学与前沿AI结合的独特定位是吸引稀缺AI人才的关键差异化优势。"},{"t":"Meta收购Rivos加速AI芯片布局，但进展不顺","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/meta-bought-rivos-accelerate-ai-chip-push-working","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"the information","tg":"资本运作","tp":"AI芯片收购","kp":["[收购事件]: Meta收购Rivos加速AI芯片"],"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":7.0},"as":"Meta通过收购Rivos来加速其在AI芯片领域的布局，但目前该收购案的推进进展并不顺利。","ot":"Meta Bought Rivos to Accelerate Its AI Chip Push. It Isn’t Working.","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"用于宽量程高灵敏度压力传感的机电超材料","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeb3456?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"机电超材料传感器","kp":["自供能传感[超材料]: 3D打印梯度晶格嵌入分子铁电体","传感范围[超材料压力]: 宽量程高灵敏度"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"机械超材料通过精确控制单元胞几何结构和宏观排列实现非凡力学性能。该研究开发机电耦合超材料，利用结构形变与电信号转换实现宽量程、高灵敏度压力传感，在柔性电子、健康监测和机器人触觉感知等领域具有应用潜力。","ot":"Mechanoelectrical metamaterials for broad-range, high-sensitivity pressure sensing","b":"Mechanical metamaterials exploit precise control of unit-cell geometry and their macroscopic organization to realize unusual properties. Expanding the capabilities of mechanical metamaterials to incorporate additional functionality remains a challenge. We describe 3D-printed metamaterials embedded with molecular ferroelectrics for use as self-powered pressure sensors. Our gradient lattice design allows for adaptive reconfiguration and controlled deformation-mode transitions, yielding a synergy of low modulus and high load-bearing capacity alongside a monotonic mechanical load–electrical signal response. Furthermore, we implement a modulus gradient in the metamaterials to enhance sensitivity in low-loading regions and extend the detection range across six orders of magnitude. With a combination of high sensitivity and broad detection range, the dual-gradient metamaterials overcome the limitations imposed by the inverse relationships in existing sensors."},{"t":"利用短波红外成像光谱技术绘制氨排放羽流","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605694123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨排放红外成像","kp":["[方法]: 短波红外成像光谱监测氨排放"],"dp":1,"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"大气氨排放危害生态系统和人体健康，传统监测方法空间分辨率有限。该研究利用短波红外高光谱成像技术绘制氨排放羽流，实现对面源氨排放的高空间分辨率遥感识别与定量监测，为农业和工业氨排放管控提供新技术手段。","ot":"Mapping ammonia emission plumes using shortwave infrared imaging spectroscopy","b":"Atmospheric ammonia emissions are harmful to ecosystems and human health. These emissions have traditionally been monitored using thermal infrared spectrometers, though such techniques are limited by thermal contrast requirements, the coarse spatial resolution of existing satellite sensors, and low measurement frequency of higher-resolution aerial surveys. Here, we show that ammonia emissions can be quantified using shortwave infrared imaging spectroscopy, circumventing these challenges by using reflected sunlight instead of thermal emission for signal and by enabling a large class of existing and future imaging spectrometers to enter the ammonia observing system. As a proof of concept for this capability, we use Tanager-1 satellite data to quantify emissions from industrial point sources of ammonia in Pakistan and Uzbekistan."},{"t":"热化前的魔法屏障","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/wtq7-qy11","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Lukas Ebner, Berndt Müller, Andreas Schäfer, Leonhard Schmotzer, Clemens Seidl, and Xiaojun YaoWe investigate the time dependence of antiflatness in the entanglement spectrum, a measure for nonstabilizerness and lower bound for nonlocal quantum magic resource, on a subsystem of a linear SU(2) plaquette chain during thermalization. Tracing the time evolution of a large number of initial states…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230403] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026","tp":"量子热演化","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队在线性SU(2)方格链子系统的热化过程中，追踪纠缠谱中反平坦度(antiflatness)的时间演化——该量是非稳定性的度量及非局域量子魔法资源的下界。研究揭示了热化前的'魔法屏障'现象，对理解量子热化动力学有理论意义，发表于《物理评论快报》。"},{"t":"机器学习优化的单原子催化剂实现微环境适应性化学动力学-生物正交癌症治疗","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73689?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子催化剂肿瘤治疗","kp":["[应用]: 单原子催化剂自适应化学动力学治癌"],"dp":1,"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"化学动力学疗法（CDT）利用肿瘤微环境内源化学能量产生活性氧杀伤肿瘤，但效率受微环境限制。该研究通过机器学习优化设计单原子催化剂，使其自适应肿瘤微环境并结合生物正交化学策略，实现协同增强的CDT治疗效果，为精准肿瘤治疗提供新范式。","ot":"Machine Learning‐Optimized Single‐Atom Catalysts Enable Microenvironment‐Adaptive Chemodynamic‐Bioorthogonal Cancer Ther","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chemodynamic therapy (CDT), which harnesses endogenous chemical energy within the tumor microenvironment (TME), has shown high potential for precise cancer treatment. However, its efficacy is often limited by the mildly acidic and reductive nature of the TME that compromises catalyst stability and activity. Developing catalysts capable of maintaining robust performance under such physiological constraints remains a key challenge. Herein, we report a programmable dual‐catalytic platform that integrates machine learning‐guided design with atomic‐level precision. Through predictive modeling, we establish quantitative structure‐performance relationships that guided the rational synthesis of iron single‐atoms (Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs). The Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs demonstrate exceptional chemodynamic reactivity and environmental stability within the complex TME, efficiently converting endogenous hydrogen peroxide into hydroxyl radicals for precise tumor ablation. Moreover, Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs exhibit potent bioorthogonal catalytic activity, enabling in situ prodrug activation and localized synthesis of doxorubicin under physiological conditions. This synergistic CDT‐bioorthogonal dual‐catalytic mechanism achieves tumor‐selective, stimulus‐free, and combinatorial therapy, markedly enhancing overall antitumor efficacy. This study establishes a machine learning‐guided framework for single‐atom catalyst design and expands the frontiers of metal catalysis in biomedical applications.","aip":1},{"t":"长期隔离和古老的基因渗入塑造了近大洋洲的功能性遗传变异","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adr6749?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Near Oceanic populations harbor substantial cultural, phenotypic, and genetic diversity yet are drastically underrepresented in human genomics. We generated 177 high-coverage Near Oceanian whole genomes and analyzed them alongside 1284 worldwide genomes, revealing major distinctions among and within islands, including long-term isolation and strong population bottlenecks. We reconstructed 1.897 billion base pairs of the archaic genome, including 831.9 million base pairs of Denisovan sequence, and found evidence for introgression from three Denisovan-like groups in Near Oceanians and adaptive Denisovan introgression at\n                    TRPS1\n                    , a skeletal development gene also under selection in central African rainforest hunter-gatherers and highland Ecuadorians. We then performed a massively parallel reporter assay and discovered 3127 high-frequency introgressed expression-modulating variants, finding an enrichment of functional impacts on genes in the interferon-γ signaling pathway including\n                    JAK1\n                    ,\n                    GBP2\n                    , and\n                    OAS1\n                    ."},{"t":"三正丙胺局部富集延长电化学发光用于肿瘤球体模型分析","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8508105?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学发光成像","kp":["ECL延长[肿瘤球成像]: 三正丙胺局部聚集延长电化学发光寿命"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"电化学发光（ECL）耦合电化学控制与光子发射，用于高灵敏度分析检测。该研究利用三正丙胺在肿瘤球体模型中的局部富集效应延长ECL信号持续时间，提升三维肿瘤球体模型的成像分析能力，在体外肿瘤诊断和药物筛选中具有应用前景。","ot":"Localized Accumulation of Tri‐n‐Propylamine Prolongs Electrochemiluminescence for Tumor Model Spheroid Analysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemiluminescence (ECL) is a technique that couples electrochemical control with photon emission, enabling highly sensitive, label‐free imaging without an external light source. The microsecond lifetimes and short diffusion lengths of intermediates generated during the reaction confer excellent spatiotemporal resolution, while the absence of phototoxicity promotes biocompatibility. Previously, ECL microscopy has illuminated systems ranging from single cells to multicellular spheroids. Yet, these works relied on luminol–hydrogen peroxide chemistry, which is limited by weak signals and the sacrificial nature of luminol. Here, we introduce tris(2,2’‐bipyridyl)ruthenium(II)/tri‐n‐propylamine ([Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]\n                    2\n                    +\n                    /TPrA) chemistry as a powerful alternative for spheroid imaging. Pre‐incubation of cellular spheroids within TPrA, followed by interrogation in [Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]\n                    2\n                    +\n                    produces markedly sharper spatial resolution and enables continuous imaging for over 3 h, exploiting the recyclability of the luminophore. Furthermore, this strategy reveals the first sustained afterglow chemiluminescence in a biological system, persisting for minutes after the applied potential has ended. Strikingly, we demonstrate that this methodology can elucidate differences in the ECL emission intensity in spheroids from cancerous and non‐cancerous cell lines, likely due to differences in TPrA accumulation. These advances establish [Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]\n                    2\n                    +\n                    /TPrA‐based ECL as a transformative approach for long‐term, high‐resolution imaging of three‐dimensional cellular architectures with application towards cancerous versus non‐cancerous tumor model differentiation."},{"t":"液体作为各向异性高韧性软物质复合材料的增强相（Adv. Mater. 33/2026）","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73508?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液体增强软物质复合","kp":["[材料设计]: 液体增强各向异性韧性软物质"],"dp":1,"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究探索将液体作为增强相引入软物质复合材料，利用液体的不可压缩性和流动性赋予复合材料各向异性和高韧性。这种反直觉设计突破了传统固体填料增强策略，为柔性器件和防护材料提供新的设计范式。","ot":"Liquids as Reinforcements for Anisotropic and Tough Soft Matter Composites (Adv. Mater. 33/2026)","b":"Anisotropic and Tough Soft Matter Composites In their Research Article (DOI: 10.1002/adma.72447), Michael D. Bartlett, E"},{"t":"液态合金驱动的含氟聚合物废料环境温度升级回收","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag359/8707059?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氟聚合物废料升级","kp":["[策略]: 接触电催化自蔓延反应(CEC-SPR)","条件[PTFE降解]: 常温常压"],"dp":1,"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"含氟聚合物（如PTFE）的化学升级回收因C-F键极强而困难重重。该研究利用液态合金催化剂在温和条件下实现PTFE的化学解聚与转化，将惰性含氟废料转化为高附加值含氟化学品，为'永久化学品'的回收利用提供突破性路径。","ot":"Liquid alloy driven ambient upcycling of fluoropolymer waste","b":"The chemical upcycling of fluoropolymer waste, particularly polytetrafluoroethylene (PTFE), has been severely hampered by the harsh thermal conditions required to cleave the highly stable carbon–fluorine (C–F) bonds. Here, we report a contact-electro-catalytic induced self-propagating reactions (CEC-SPR) strategy that enables efficient cleavage of the robust C–F bonds in PTFE under ambient conditions. By employing a highly reactive NaK alloy, which reacts with PTFE through the exothermic Wurtz defluorination reaction, we facilitate the chemical recycling of PTFE into fluorine-doped carbon materials and metal fluorides at room temperature. Our results provide a new conceptual strategy for the upcycling of PTFE plastic waste into functionally useful carbon materials and inorganic fluoride products.","aip":1},{"t":"用于安全视觉的光诱导熵（Adv. Mater. 33/2026）","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73509?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光致熵安全视觉材料","kp":["[应用]: 光诱导熵用于安全视觉"],"dp":1,"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用光的熵特性开发安全视觉技术，通过调控光场中的熵参量实现信息的加密编码与安全传输，在防伪识别、安全成像和光学信息处理领域具有创新意义。","ot":"Light‐Induced Entropy for Secure Vision (Adv. Mater. 33/2026)","b":"Light-Induced Entropy for Secure Vision This cover illustrates a secure imaging system that counters deepfakes using lig"},{"t":"光驱动差向异构化：[12C, 13C] β2,3-氨基酸的非对映收敛合成","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1668497?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光驱动β氨基酸合成","kp":["[合成方法]: 光催化级联差向异构化"],"dp":1,"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"β-氨基酸是生物活性肽和药物的重要结构单元，其立体构型决定生物活性。该研究利用光驱动差向异构化策略实现非对映收敛性合成碳标记的β2,3-氨基酸，为手性药物合成和化学生物学研究提供高效工具。","ot":"Light‐Driven Epimerization: Diastereoconvergent Synthesis of [12C, 13C] β2,3‐Amino Acids","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    β\n                    ‐Amino acids are crucial building blocks for bioactive peptides and pharmaceuticals, wherein the stereochemistry of C\n                    2\n                    , C\n                    3\n                    ‐disubstituted\n                    β\n                    2,3\n                    ‐amino acids dictates the secondary structure of\n                    β\n                    ‐peptides. However, the diastereoselective synthesis of these scaffolds remains a formidable challenge. Herein, we report a novel photocatalytic cascade enabling the one‐pot hydrogenation, carboxylation, and epimerization of\n                    α\n                    ,\n                    β\n                    ‐unsaturated imines. This method provides direct and highly diastereoselective (d.r. up to 35:1) access to valuable\n                    syn\n                    ‐\n                    β\n                    2,3\n                    ‐amino acids. Time‐course analysis and DFT calculations reveal a unique light‐driven dynamic kinetic epimerization process that ensures stereoconvergence to the thermodynamically favored\n                    syn\n                    ‐isomer. Notably, this strategy also facilitates the facile synthesis of\n                    13\n                    C‐labeled\n                    syn\n                    ‐\n                    β\n                    2,3\n                    ‐amino acids using commercially available\n                    13\n                    C‐sodium formate, achieving exceptional isotope incorporation (93%–98%) that surpasses existing\n                    13\n                    CO\n                    2\n                    ‐based methods. Furthermore, the system's utility is demonstrated through the gram‐scale synthesis of N‐unprotected\n                    α\n                    ‐amino acids from imines (11 g, 75% yield), more significantly, via a one‐pot procedure directly from diaryl ketones."},{"t":"利用邻近效应：利用招潮蟹型硼烷催化剂实现酯到醚的直接脱氧","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8105704?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼烷催化酯脱氧","kp":["选择性还原[酯到醚]: 招潮蟹型硼烷催化双齿硅烷还原"],"as":"提出利用邻近效应（Proximity Effect）实现酯直接脱氧还原为醚的新方法。酯到醚的选择性还原是有机合成中极具价值但难度较大的转化反应，其难点在于酯基中C-O键的活化与选择性断裂。该方法通过引入Fiddl试剂体系，借助底物空间邻近性驱动反应定向进行，避免了传统多步还原-取代路径，提升了原子经济性与反应效率，为复杂分子中醚键的高效构建提供了新思路。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Leveraging the Proximity Effect: Direct Ester to Ether Deoxygenation Using Fiddler‐Crab‐Type Borane Catalysts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Selective ester‐to‐ether reduction is an advantageous yet challenging transformation. This is due to the inherent tendency of esters to undergo reduction to alcohol derivatives. Herein, we show how to subvert the reduction of esters toward ether formation using a commercially available bidentate silane reagent and low loadings of tailored borane catalysts. This catalytic method is operationally simple, exhibiting high selectivity and functional group tolerance. The use of these catalysts also allows regioselective and chemodivergent reductions, further simplifying the synthesis of ethers. Apart from these advantages, the reductive conversion of an enol ester to an enol ether –an elusive and challenging transformation—could also be achieved. Calculations support the critical role of the proximity effect in driving the reaction toward ether formation."},{"t":"分层激励：当地充值对太阳能采用和福利的影响","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003617?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能采用","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"晶格工程化双电子驱动电极用于硝酸盐选择性产氨","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73699?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化硝酸盐还原制氨","kp":["电极[硝酸盐制氨]: 晶格工程双电子驱动","反应条件[NO₃⁻RR]: 中性环境"],"dp":1,"as":"提出一种晶格工程化的双电子驱动（Dual-Electron-Drive）电极，用于电催化选择性合成氨。氨（NH3）是农业化肥和新兴清洁能源载体不可或缺的原料，但传统Haber-Bosch工艺能耗高、碳排放大。该电极通过精确调控材料晶格结构，优化氮物种的吸附与活化路径，实现温和条件下高效电化学固氮合成氨，为绿色氨生产提供新途径。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Lattice‐Engineered Dual‐Electron‐Drive Electrode for Selective Ammonia Production From Nitrate","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ammonia (NH\n                    3\n                    ) is indispensable in agriculture and emerging energy systems, yet its conventional production remains energy‐ and carbon‐intensive. Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    RR) represents a promising alternative for sustainable NH\n                    3\n                    synthesis but is hampered by slow kinetics and low selectivity under realistic, neutral conditions. Here, we employ the lattice engineering strategy to construct a cobalt‐doped nanoscale zerovalent iron (Co‐nFe\n                    0\n                    ) electrode that integrates a dual‐electron‐drive mechanism with a self‐triggered alkaline microenvironment to overcome these challenges. Cobalt doping modulated the surface Fe electronic structure to create electron‐deficient Fe sites, which enhanced charge transfer, promoted water dissociation into active hydrogen species, and facilitated the hydrogenation of reaction intermediates. This design enabled an NH\n                    3\n                    Faradaic efficiency of 96% and near‐quantitative selectivity across a wide nitrate concentration range (100–1000 mg L\n                    −1\n                    NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    ‐N), alongside sustained operational stability. An insitu NH\n                    3\n                    recovery system could provide stable operation over 360 h and deliver 13 g day\n                    −1\n                    NH\n                    3\n                    production with 100% NH\n                    3\n                    recovery. Rice pot experiments demonstrated that the recovered ammonium sulfate (99% purity) performed comparably to commercial fertilizers. This work provides an efficient electrocatalyst that couples electronic structure modulation and interfacial microenvironment regulation, thereby offering a sustainable technological route for nitrogen upcycling and green fertilizer production."},{"t":"Ni-Co氢氧化物的晶格氧工程用于高效甲醇氧化耦合产氢","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6517699?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"甲醇氧化制氢","kp":["甲醇氧化催化[碱性]: 晶格氧工程优化NiCoOₓHᵧ纳米片","联产策略[制氢]: MOR耦合HER降低能耗"],"as":"通过晶格氧工程（Lattice Oxygen Engineering）调控Ni-Co双金属氢氧化物电催化剂，以实现高效的甲醇氧化反应（MOR）。将MOR与析氢反应（HER）耦合，可显著降低电解水制氢的能耗。研究中对Ni-Co氢氧化物的晶格氧进行精确修饰，提升催化剂的电子结构与活性氧物种调控能力，从而增强甲醇氧化效率与稳定性，为电催化制氢耦合体系提供性能更优的低成本电极材料方案。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Lattice Oxygen Engineering in Ni–Co Hydroxides for Efficient Methanol Oxidation Coupled With Hydrogen Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic methanol oxidation reaction (MOR) coupled with hydrogen evolution (HER) can lower the energy cost of H\n                    2\n                    production while valorizing methanol to formate. Developing efficient, low‐cost MOR catalysts for alkaline media remains challenging. Here, we report nickel–cobalt bimetal hydroxide (NiCoO\n                    x\n                    H\n                    y\n                    ) nanosheets as a highly active and durable MOR catalysts. The optimized NiCoO\n                    x\n                    H\n                    y\n                    requires only 1.40 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE) to deliver a current density of 400 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    and achieves &gt;99% Faradaic efficiency toward formate at 1.45 V, representing one of the most efficient MOR electrocatalysts reported. In a two‐electrode system, methanol oxidation coupled with HER lowers the cell voltage by ∼310 mV compared to conventional water electrolysis at 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . In situ Raman and x‐ray absorption spectroscopy, together with isotope‐labeling studies, reveal that cobalt incorporation promotes the formation of high‐valence M\n                    4+\n                    species, which activate lattice oxygen and accelerate methanol electrooxidation. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations confirm that highly oxidized M\n                    4+\n                    species enhance metal–oxygen orbital hybridization, activating lattice oxygen and reducing reaction barriers. This work highlights lattice oxygen engineering via electronic structure modulation as an effective strategy for designing advanced electrocatalysts toward sustainable hydrogen‐formate co‐production."},{"t":"肽在固相上的后期功能化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4556652?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Chemical modification is a means of tailoring the structure and function of peptides. This is of particular interest in the field of peptide drug development. Methods that enable straightforward modification of peptides with non‐canonical residues are therefore in high demand. On‐resin late‐stage functionalization is a powerful, cost‐ and time‐efficient tool for modifying peptides. It also allows for high‐throughput experimentation, making it well suited to streamlining the development of peptide therapeutics. In this minireview, we provide an overview of the chemical approaches for on‐resin late‐stage peptide functionalization , most of which have been developed over the past decade. These reactions range from nucleophilic substitution and carbonyl chemistry to metal catalysis and photocatalysis. Many of the presented approaches have been shown to be compatible with short and long peptides, and to modulate their bioactivity. Impressive examples of peptide library synthesis in high‐throughput formats demonstrate the enormous potential of late‐stage peptide functionalization for the development of peptide therapeutics in the years to come.","tp":"肽固相修饰","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"固相肽合成中的树脂上后期功能化是一种高效、省时省成本的肽修饰策略，可引入非天然残基并支持高通量实验。该方法在多肽药物开发中应用广泛，能显著加速候选药物的筛选和结构优化流程。"},{"t":"激光增强显微技术打开观察难捕捉蛋白质的新视野","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5921?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"激光增强显微技术","as":"研究人员通过激光技术增强冷冻电子显微镜（cryo-EM）的成像能力，实现对难以观测的蛋白质的高分辨率可视化。该技术揭示了此前无法解析的蛋白质结构与动态，为发现新药物靶点提供了关键工具，同时大幅提升了细胞内部结构的清晰度。这一突破有望加速结构生物学与药物研发进程。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.5},"ot":"Laser-boosted microscopy opens view of elusive proteins","b":"Enhanced cryo–electron microscopes reveal new drug targets and sharpen views inside cells","aip":1},{"t":"聚合物半导体中层状准晶性调控的热传输","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73680?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物半导体热传输","kp":["热输运调控[聚合物半导体]: 层状准结晶度决定热导率"],"as":"研究聚焦聚合物半导体中的热传输机制，揭示层状准结晶度对热导率的关键调控作用。有机电子器件的热管理长期受限，该工作阐明了分子堆积有序度与声子传输的关联，为设计高效散热聚合物半导体提供理论基础。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Lamellar‐Paracrystallinity‐Controlled Thermal Transport in Polymer Semiconductors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Understanding thermal transport in polymer semiconductors is crucial for thermal management in organic electronic and energy‐harvesting devices, directly affecting their performance, safety and long‐term stability. However, the structure‐property relationship and underlying thermal transport physics remain largely unexplored. Herein, thermal conductivities of 11 representative polymer semiconductors were measured using an improved suspended‑3\n                    ω\n                    technique, revealing a strong correlation between thermal conductivity and the paracrystalline disorder of lamellar packing. It is observed that the in‑plane intrinsic thermal conductivity of polymer semiconductor films is predominantly controlled by lamellar paracrystallinity, rather than backbone chemistry or π–π stacking. Tuning lamellar paracrystallinity within the same polymer modulated thermal conductivity by up to ∼40%. Our work shows that lamellar packing is the primary interchain thermal transport pathway, with more efficient vibrational coupling than π–π stacking as evidenced by molecular dynamics simulations. This physical picture reveals distinct interchain pathways for charge and thermal transport in polymer semiconductors, providing guidelines for manipulating thermal conductivity without affecting electrical performance in advanced organic materials and devices."},{"t":"LPAR4介导软组织肉瘤对干扰素诱导应激的抵抗","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef1962?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Soft tissue sarcomas are aggressive malignancies with limited responses to immunotherapy. Strategies that induce viral mimicry and type I interferon (IFN-I) signaling may enhance tumor immunogenicity but remain poorly explored in sarcoma. Here, we show that the CDK4/6 inhibitor abemaciclib triggers viral mimicry and robust IFN-I responses in sarcoma cells, leading to tumor growth suppression and remodeling of the tumor microenvironment toward an immune-permissive state. However, sarcoma cells activate resistance mechanisms that limit IFN-induced stress. We identify lysophosphatidic acid receptor 4 (LPAR4) as a key mediator of this adaptation. LPAR4 dampens IFN signaling, reduces oxidative stress, and promotes tumor cell survival under therapeutic pressure. Genetic silencing of LPAR4 enhances IFN responses, increases reactive oxygen species, and sensitizes sarcoma cells to apoptosis, resulting in delayed tumor growth. These findings identify LPAR4 as a central regulator of IFN-driven stress adaptation and a potential therapeutic target to enhance viral mimicry–based strategies in sarcoma."},{"t":"LARP1 整合 MYC 和 mTOR 信号传导以在肿瘤发生过程中实现合成代谢生长","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523043123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Tumor initiation requires the integration of oncogenic signals with environmental cues to enable anabolic growth. MYC is central to tumorigenesis, with its deregulation observed in over 60% of human cancers. Oncogenic MYC profoundly rewires transcription, enabling cells to bypass cell cycle checkpoints and reset metabolism. A cornerstone of this rewiring is the upregulation of biomass-producing pathways, particularly ribosome biogenesis. How and when MYC’s oncogenic program is translationally executed—either immediately or until a favorable metabolic context emerges—remains a central unanswered question in tumor initiation, limiting our understanding of tumor latency and early intervention. Here, we identify LARP1 as a critical effector of MYC-driven transformation, connecting MYC oncogenic activity with mTOR signaling. Mechanistically, MYC represses miR-26a/b, relieving posttranscriptional repression of LARP1 and leading to its upregulation. LARP1 associates with the translational machinery, loading it with the anabolic translatome induced by MYC in a translationally poised state. Upon permissive mTOR signaling, and dependent on the phosphorylation of LARP1 at serines 689 and 697, this program is rapidly translated, fueling the biosynthetic processes essential for tumor development. Importantly, genetic deletion of LARP1 or pharmacological mTOR inhibition completely abrogates tumor initiation in a genetically engineered colorectal organoid model of MYC-driven tumorigenesis. This underscores the physiological relevance of this two-step mechanism in which LARP1 bridges the anabolic translatome primed by MYC with its metabolic execution controlled by mTOR. By temporally uncoupling transformation from metabolic permissiveness, this mechanism defines a critical checkpoint in early tumorigenesis, revealing a potential vulnerability for intercepting MYC-driven cancer before biomass expansion."},{"t":"KKR、英伟达等联合成立百亿美元数据中心公司","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/kkr-nvidia-others-launch-10-billion-data-center-company","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"the information","as":"KKR与英伟达等机构联合组建一家估值约100亿美元的数据中心公司，押注AI算力基础设施需求持续扩张。此举反映资本对AI训练与推理所需大规模数据中心资源的战略投入。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"AI数据中心","kp":["投资规模[数据中心]: 100亿美元合资公司"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"KKR, Nvidia, Others Launch $10 Billion Data Center Company","b":"KKR, Nvidia, Others Launch $10 Billion Data Center Company — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"铁催化下未活化烷基硫鎓盐与丙二烯的环丙烷化反应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3566616?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁催化环丙烷化","kp":["环丙烷化[丙二烯]: 铁催化非活化锍盐氧化中性碳烯转移"],"as":"非稳定卡宾的催化生成与转移是有机合成的难题。该工作开发铁催化体系，利用未活化烷基锍盐实现丙二烯的环丙烷化反应，以廉价铁替代贵金属，拓展了卡宾化学的合成应用范围。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Iron‐Catalyzed Cyclopropanation of Allenes Using Unactivated Alkyl Sulfonium Salts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The catalytic generation and transfer of non‐stabilized carbenes represent a formidable challenge in synthetic chemistry, historically necessitating the use of hazardous diazoalkanes or relatively harsh reductive conditions. Herein, we describe a redox‐neutral, Fe‐catalyzed protocol that unlocks unactivated alkyl sulfonium salts as benign, bench‐stable non‐stabilized carbene precursors for the cyclopropanation of allenes. Diverging from the classical concerted mechanism in carbene transfer, this process proceeds via a stepwise radical‐involved pathway, delivering a broad range of synthetically valuable alkylidenecyclopropanes (ACPs) with exceptional regiocontrol and broad functional group compatibility. Moreover, this method can be further extended to the cyclopropanation of alkenes. Mechanistic studies, encompassing deuterium labeling, TEMPO inhibition, EPR study, stereochemical probe, thermal stability experiment, and time‐course analysis provide valuable insights into the reaction pathway. This work establishes unactivated alkyl sulfonium salts as a versatile and practical class of non‐stabilized carbene precursors for earth‐abundant metal catalysis.","aip":1},{"t":"离聚物导向的CO2电还原反应路径","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag364/8707055?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电还原","kp":["[微环境调控]: 离聚物定向调控CO2电还原路径"],"dp":1,"as":"电化学CO2还原可将碳排放转化为燃料和化学品，但产物选择性难以控制。研究提出离聚物导向的反应路径调控策略，通过界面微环境设计引导反应方向，提升目标产物的法拉第效率。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ionomer-Directed Reaction Pathway for CO2 Electroreduction","b":"Electrochemical CO2 reduction (CO2RR) is a sustainable method of converting carbon emissions into valuable fuels and chemicals; however, its selectivity and stability are governed by the catalyst itself and the local microenvironment within the catalyst layer. Ionomers, once considered to be passive binders, have emerged as key regulators of this microenvironment. However, the ionomer content in the catalyst layer is very low, because of which its effect on the CO2RR performance is often ignored. This review aims to address this gap. First, the structural diversity of proton- and anion-exchange ionomers is discussed, and their distinct physicochemical properties, which are critical for shaping ion transport and interfacial reactions, are described. Next, the effects of solvent-controlled dispersion and film formation on the spatial distribution and morphology of ionomers in the catalyst layers and the subsequent effects on mass transport and local hydration are discussed. Based on this foundation, the control of CO2RR pathways based on the ionomer configuration is discussed, specifically considering the coupled effects on reactant diffusion, intermediate adsorption energetics, and interfacial hydrogen bond networks. Finally, the current challenges and future opportunities are summarized, with an emphasis on nanoscale characterization, ionomer durability, and the co-design of catalysts and ionomers. By elucidating the molecular-level connections between ionomer structure, dispersion, and catalytic function, this review establishes design principles that can guide the development of next-generation electrodes and electrolyzers for efficient, selective, and durable CO2 conversion. Moreover, as demonstrated in this review, these principles are broadly applicable to a wide range of other electrocatalytic reactions.","aip":1},{"t":"通过环氧化合物化学实现反式硫化：一种低温非烯烃路线合成富硫聚合物网络","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7470442?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"反向硫化聚合物","kp":["反硫化[富硫聚合物]: 环氧化学实现低温非烯烃路径"],"as":"反硫化可将过剩元素硫转化为功能材料，传统方法依赖烯烃单体。该工作基于环氧化合物化学，开发低温非烯烃路线合成含硫聚合物，降低能耗并拓展单体选择，为硫资源高值利用开辟新途径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Inverse Vulcanization Through Epoxide Chemistry: A Low Temperature Non‐Olefin Route to Sulfur‐Rich Polymer Networks","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Inverse vulcanization represents an effective strategy for transforming surplus elemental sulfur into value‐added polymeric materials; however, current approaches are largely restricted to olefin‐based monomers and rely on high‐temperature radical processes. Here, we establish an epoxide‐enabled inverse vulcanization platform that expands sulfur‐rich polymer formation beyond olefin chemistry under solvent‐free, base‐catalyzed conditions. Mechanistic studies confirm a nucleophilic ring‐opening pathway in which sulfur is incorporated into the polymer backbone when catalyzed by base catalyst. By integrating bio‐based epoxidized vegetable oils with elemental sulfur, sulfur‐rich networks are constructed through a catalytically tunable ring‐opening pathway, enabling controllable network formation. The resulting materials maintain high sulfur content while exhibiting tunable mechanical properties, shape memory behavior, and strong adhesion on stainless steel, with lap shear strengths adjustable up to 10 MPa. The combination of mild processing conditions, renewable monomer feedstocks, and robust structural performance demonstrates a controllable and energy‐efficient route for advancing inverse vulcanization toward sustainable adhesive and functional material applications."},{"t":"界面水介导的氧化物路径机制实现Co3O4上高效酸性水氧化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE02097F","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酸性析氧电催化","kp":["酸性OER[Co₃O₄]: 界面水介导氧化物路径打破线性标度"],"as":"开发酸性介质中替代IrO2的高效稳定Co3O4基析氧电催化剂是能源领域的重要挑战。研究揭示界面水分子介导的氧化物路径反应机制，阐明了提升Co3O4催化活性与耐久性的微观原理。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interfacial water mediated oxide path mechanism for efficient acidic water oxidation on Co 3 O 4","b":"The development of highly efficient and stable Co3O4-based electrocatalysts as promising alternatives to IrO2 for acidic oxygen evolution reaction (OER) is needed to support broader commercialisation of proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer (PEMWE). Unfortunately, the activity of Co3O4 is severely hindered by the linear scaling relationship through the favorable adsorbate evolution mechanism (AEM). Although considerable efforts have been devoted to promoting oxygen pathway mechanism (OPM) to bypass the AEM pathway through tailoring the inherent structures of active sites on Co3O4, limited attention has been paid to the role of interfacial water molecules at the catalyst-electrolyte interface. Here, we demonstrate that the acidic OER pathway of Co3O4 can be rationally regulated through partial substitution of octahedral Co atoms in Co3O4 with Sb. We find that the asymmetric Sb-O-Co motif could induce interfacial H2O reorientation into H-down configuration, thus suppressing the nucleophilic attack of H2O molecules on Co=O* intermediate, which is the key for triggering the reaction pathway from AEM to OPM. Consequently, the obtained Sb0.3Co2.7O4 catalyst exhibits remarkable OER activity and long-term durability, achieving 2 A cm-2 at 2.11 V and stable operation for over 800 hours at 2.0 A cm-2 in a PEMWE device.","aip":1},{"t":"铁基多功能催化剂的界面工程用于CO2选择性加氢制C3+醇","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00168-3?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2加氢制高级醇","kp":["催化剂体系[CO2加氢]: K修饰ZnZrOx-Fe5C2界面","[目标产物]: CO2高选择性加氢制C3+醇"],"dp":1,"as":"将CO2选择性加氢为含三个以上碳原子的高级醇极具价值但难度大。研究通过铁基多功能催化剂的界面工程，调控反应中间体的吸附与偶联，提升目标产物选择性，为碳一化工提供新方案。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Interface engineering of Fe-based multifunctional catalysts for selective CO2 hydrogenation to C3+ alcohols","b":"Highly selective hydrogenation of CO2 into higher alcohols with three or more carbon atoms remains challenging due to inherent difficulties in regulating C–C coupling of reaction intermediates. Combined experimental and theoretical investigations reveal that a well-tailored K-modified ZnZrOx–Fe5C2 interface optimizes alkyl-oxygenate coupling, enabling efficient higher alcohol synthesis with a record-high C3+ alcohol yield and excellent long-term stability. This work demonstrates great practical potential for producing value-added chemicals via CO2 hydrogenation."},{"t":"将间接温室气体纳入气候框架","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee5790?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"These substances have minimal direct climate effects but trigger chemical reactions that can lead to warming","tp":"间接温室气","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.5,"t":5.0},"as":"某些物质本身直接气候效应微弱，但会触发大气化学反应间接导致升温。文章探讨如何将这类间接温室气体纳入现有气候治理框架，以更全面地评估和管控其对全球变暖的真实贡献，填补当前排放核算体系的盲区。"},{"t":"使用高度多重血清学综合评估抗体对蚊子和蚊媒病原体的反应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb7044?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Vector-borne diseases (VBDs) are a leading cause of morbidity and mortality worldwide. Antigens driving host immune responses to pathogens and vectors can serve as vaccine candidates and biomarkers of previous exposure, but the immunogenicity of relevant proteomes remains undercharacterized. To comprehensively profile antibody responses to VBDs and the vectors themselves, we developed a highly multiplexed phage display library, VectorScan, containing more than 250,000 peptides derived from diverse arthropod vectors and prevalent vector-borne pathogens. We used phage immunoprecipitation sequencing to screen VectorScan against blood samples with experimental and natural exposures to arboviruses, malaria parasites, and mosquitoes. We analyzed quantitative measurements of peptide seroreactivity to identify epitopes driving viral serotype-level exposure signatures and mosquito sialome antigens. Mosquito-directed antibody responses were quantitatively associated with natural viral and parasite exposure. We leverage VectorScan to define the relationship between the intensity of mosquito exposure and the rate of malaria infection in children, demonstrating the public health utility of a tool for paired vector and pathogen serosurveillance."},{"t":"面向机械化学稳定性的超高镍正极局部微结构一体化工程","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73673?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超高镍正极材料","kp":["[晶格调控]: Mg/Nb共掺杂局部晶格调节","[器件形态]: 超高镍层状正极"],"dp":1,"as":"针对下一代高能量密度锂离子电池，富镍层状正极材料因其高容量备受关注，但在循环过程中面临机械化学稳定性差、颗粒开裂等瓶颈。该研究通过局部微结构工程策略，优化材料晶界与晶格应变分布，显著提升正极在长循环和高温条件下的结构稳定性，为推动高镍正极材料的工程化应用提供了新路径。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Integrated Local‐Microstructure Engineering Toward Mechanochemically Robust Ultra‐High Nickel Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ni‐rich layered cathodes show exceptional promise for next‐generation high‐energy‐density lithium‐ion batteries. However, higher nickel utilization in layered cathodes readily exacerbates both bulk mechanical failure and interfacial chemistry instability, significantly hindering their practical application. Herein, a comprehensive local lattice regulation strategy was proposed via Mg/Nb co‐doping, which constructed a chemically and mechanically co‐robust LiNi\n                    0.95\n                    Co\n                    0.03\n                    Mn\n                    0.02\n                    O\n                    2\n                    cathode from surface to bulk. The surface‐reconstructed ultrathin disordered rock‐salt phase effectively stabilized the electrochemical interface. Meanwhile, the bulk cation‐disordered structure integrated with a coherent spinel‐like phase mitigated lattice strain and enhanced structural integrity. Therefore, the modified ultra‐high nickel cathode exhibited excellent long‐term cycling stability, high rate capability, and thermal stability. It exhibited high initial coulombic efficiency of 93.24% and a discharge specific capacity of 240.11 mAh·g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.1C. It could also deliver a high initial capacity of 210.44 mAh·g\n                    −1\n                    at 1C and retain 97.37% of its capacity after 100 cycles. Moreover, it exhibited outstanding performance during cycling at 3C, delivering a superior capacity retention of 81.65% after 500 cycles. It also delivered a remarkable specific capacity of 147.43 mAh·g\n                    −1\n                    even at the rate of 15C. This integrated microstructure regulation strategy would pave the way for commercializing ultra‐high‐nickel cathodes in next‐generation high‐energy‐density batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"内部内感受：你内心感受的隐藏感觉","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/12/1138833/inside-interoception-brain-body/","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","b":"MIT Technology Review\nLet our writers untangle the complex, messy world of science and technology to help you understand what’s coming next.\nYou can read more from the series here\nYour brain lives in the dark space of your skull. Yet it knows when the wind lifts the hairs on your skin, when your heart is racing, when your gut tightens with fear.\nIt’s also, right now, predicting what you’ll read next as your eyes move across this page. It’s picking up signals that help it make sense of what’s happening around you and prepare you to act if you need to stay safe. You aren’t usually aware that your brain is doing all that.\nOur senses take in information at a staggering rate—roughly 11 million bits flood in every second from our skin, eyes, ears, and more. That’s nearly three paperback novels’ worth of data every second. Only a sliver reaches our conscious awareness.  Researchers estimate that our conscious minds can process roughly 10 to 60 bits of information per second, about the rate at which you’re reading this sentence. That’s a ratio of about one conscious bit to hundreds of thousands of unconscious bits.\nAnd that’s a mercy. As Moriah Thomason, a neuroscientist at NYU Langone, says, “Thank\nwe’re built like this. There’s a layer of what we have access to in conscious awareness. And then we have a right-under-the-surface amount. There is only a certain amount we are meant to ‘hold in mind’ in order to function successfully.”\naware of: Your stomach growling when you’re hungry. Your palms sweating before you speak in public. The breath you just took, if you pay attention to it. Even your heartbeat, which some people can sense from the inside without feeling their pulse in their wrist.\nScientists have a word for how we sense ourselves from the inside:\ninteroception\nThe term was coined in 1906 by the British neurophysiologist Charles Sherrington. For most of the 20th century it remained largely confined to textbooks. Today, thanks to a 2021 Nobel Prize and new tools that can map the interoceptive system across the body, the study of this facility is suddenly quite hot. As researchers decode how signals move between body and brain, a clearer picture is starting to take shape—with implications for how we understand and treat conditions from obesity to chronic pain to anxiety.\nThe field began to take off in the 1990s. In 1994, the neurologist Antonio Damasio published a book with a pointed title:\nDescartes’ Error\n. He challenged the historical separation of thinking and feeling, arguing that our ability to choose and act is driven by feelings, and those feelings in turn are shaped by the body’s signals, such as your gut clenching or your skin going clammy. When we lose that connection between feeling and thinking, as one of Damasio’s patients did after surgery to treat a brain tumor, we may still be able to reason with perfect logic about the pros and cons of traveling on a Tuesday or a Wednesday. But without the emotional signals that help us predict what a choice will\nlike, our reason spins and circles, and we cannot decide.\nA contemporary of Damasio’s, the neuroscientist Bud Craig, spent his career asking one question:\nHow do you feel?\nHe charted how the brain builds an inner map of the body and updates it in real time every moment you are alive.\nThink of the captain’s bridge on the USS\n, where a live map displays the status of the ship’s critical systems: oxygen levels, energy availability, hull integrity, shield strength. Another set of indicators senses things outside the ship: asteroid belts, enemy ships, radiation, life signs, and spatial anomalies not yet understood.\nYour brain, only about the size of your two fists pressed together, creates a map like this for your entire body, along with a map of the outside world, from data streaming in through your five senses. Together, they feed into your brain’s working model of you in the world, now and across time—where you are,\nyou are, your expectations for what’s about to happen (based on everything you know), and what all that means for you.\nWhen someone asks “How are you doing?” we consult our maps and report back on our status. We might say we’re happy, depleted, anxious, or energetic. These feelings are always a braid of emotional and physical sensations. They’re what your interoceptive navigational system serves up to your awareness when you sense yourself from the inside.\nAs we grow up, we learn to interpret what these sensations mean—interpretations that, in turn, can alter our physiology, emotions, and behavior. Research by the psychologist Alia Crum shows that people who embrace a “stress is enhancing” mindset produce more growth hormones than people who have a “stress is debilitating” mindset. They also experience more positive emotions and greater cognitive flexibility.\nLanguage also matters. We learn words for the textures of our feelings—words that then shape how we feel and act. People low in emotional “granularity”—as the psychologist Marc Brackett calls the ability to distinguish between closely related feelings—react more impulsively under stress and are less able to find meaning in difficult experiences.\nBut mindsets and emotional intelligence are malleable. We can learn that “anxious” is different from “terrified,” and we can even reframe how we interpret our body’s sensations. Instead of thinking of the butterflies in our bellies as annoying, we can welcome them as our body’s way of preparing us for a peak performance.\nScientists have long understood that the interoceptive information informing these lived experiences travels via two major systems: nerves and humors (blood and lymph). Now they’re actively studying a third system—\nthe “interstitium,”\na network of fluid-filled spaces woven throughout the body’s connective fascia that may also play a role in communication.\nBut until recently, scientific understanding of this interoceptive system looked like a high-level schematic that left out vital details—how information travels from the outside environment in, how it moves from your body to your brain, and how it is integrated and interpreted within your brain. Researchers are now racing to explore what the neuroscientist Catherine Tallon-Baudry calls this “new continent of awareness.”\nOne of the most active areas of research centers on the vagus nerve, the main component of the parasympathetic nervous system and an information highway carrying news from your organs up to your brain and back down to your body. The vagus has become a celebrity nerve, ubiquitous in wellness podcasts and trauma therapy. “Tone your vagus nerve.” “Activate your parasympathetic system.” The language suggests a single thing you can target, like a muscle. The reality, as Steve Liberles at Harvard Medical School is discovering, is far more interesting.\nLiberles has spent most of his career mapping what he calls “the great wide unknown” of one of our largest and longest nerves. He speaks the way he works—methodically, without overselling. But the questions driving him are huge. How do we sense our body’s inner state? What information flows through which channels? And how does the brain decide what to do with it?\n“When I’m nervous giving a talk in front of a thousand people,” he says, “my heart might race. I might get butterflies in my stomach. I might get goosebumps on my skin.” We all know what he’s talking about.\n“It’s bizarre,” he muses. “Your brain has to send a signal to the gut, and then the gut\nto the brain, to tell you you’re nervous?” He pauses. “This just shows there is this intimate connectivity between the brain and the body that’s real.”\nThe vagus is often called the calming nerve, because it controls “rest and digest” functions that quiet our body after the sympathetic nervous system revs us up with “fight or flight” impulses to handle danger or stress.\nBut it is also doing something else: It’s listening to us inside. Anatomists have known for over a century that roughly 80% of its fibers carry information\n, from body to brain. Think of it as a two-lane highway with far more traffic headed north. What scientists are just beginning to understand in detail is what those signals are saying.\nLiberles is decoding the vagus with molecular precision and finding that its messaging system is unexpectedly diverse. So far, his research has uncovered dozens of types of vagus nerve cells, each wired to a specific organ. Team Red relays information about the heart; Team Blue, the gut.\nWithin those teams, each courier has a unique job that’s different from those all its teammates perform. Liberles found 10 types in the lungs alone. Until then, only one lung reflex had ever been identified, in 1868. One nerve courier carries information about breathing rate; another the stretch of your lungs; yet another information about airway threats, like food going down the wrong pipe.\n“It’s super exciting to think about what each of these neurons is doing,” he told me in a conversation last fall, a flash of intensity breaking through the calm. “Where does it go in the body? What is it sensing? What is it controlling?”\nLiberles is mapping the vagus information highways. But highways need on-ramps for signals to enter. For years, one of neurobiology’s biggest mysteries was the molecular on-ramp for our sense of touch.\nSomewhere, something in our bodies was converting physical force into an electrical signal that the nervous system could understand. But no one knew how.\nSolving that mystery required a scientist willing to trust a hunch when the data couldn’t show the way.\nArdem Patapoutian grew up in Lebanon and fled the country’s civil war at 18, landing in Los Angeles, where he delivered pizzas and wrote horoscopes for a local newspaper before falling in love with science at UCLA.\nIn the 1990s, as a postdoc at the University of California, San Francisco, he became fascinated with our sense of touch—the last of the five major senses not yet understood at the molecular level. The lung stretch signal that Liberles’s vagus neurons carry to the brain? No one had ever figured out how that signal began.\n“How do you feel the embrace of a loved one? How do your fingers distinguish one texture of hair from another?” Patapoutian invites us to wonder in his 2021 Nobel Prize lecture. The problem: Most cellular communication works through chemistry. But mechanical force offers no molecule to bind. How does the body translate physical pressure into the electrochemical language that neurons speak?\nScientists knew that the answer had to be an ion channel—a protein gate embedded in cell membranes that opens to let electrically charged particles into the cell. But tracking down the one responsible for touch turned out to be absurdly difficult. Ion channels are a hundred thousandth the size of a cell, invisible to ordinary microscopes. Worse, they don’t resemble each other. You can’t recognize one by its shape or its sequence of amino acids. Even with one right in front of you, nothing would tell you it was there.\nAt Scripps, where he works now, Patapoutian decided to try an unusual approach. He’d try to find cells that showed sensitivity to touch and destroy their internal genetic blueprint one gene at a time—hunting for the move that would make the cell go numb. It was tedious, expensive, and possibly a dead end. “A lot of people made fun of us,” he says.\nTwo years in, Patapoutian’s collaborator Bertrand Coste had burned through half his postdoctoral appointment with no results. Patapoutian said:\nAnother 30 genes, and then we decide whether to continue.\nWhat kept them going, Patapoutian told me, was informed intuition. “As you gain more experience, you have this sense of what’s going to work, what’s not going to work. Sometimes the data cannot answer the question of when to stop or when to continue. There has to be another process. If you start trusting it, it gives you an avenue to continue.”\nknocked out candidate gene 72\n. Flatline. The cell had gone numb.\nThey’d found it—the mechanism behind something you feel every day.\nThey named the protein they identified PIEZO, from the Greek\n, meaning pressure. There are two variations, PIEZO1 and PIEZO2, each responsible for sensing different kinds of pressure in the body. They’re elegant in their design—over 2,500 amino acids folded into a three-bladed propeller-shaped gate embedded in cell membranes. When pressure stretches the membrane, the gate opens and electrically charged ions flood through, translating physical pressure into an electrical signal that the brain can understand—all within milliseconds.\nPatapoutian calls scientific discovery a dream that survives reality. He won the Nobel Prize in medicine in 2021 for his discovery of PIEZO, sharing the award with David Julius of UCSF for his work on how cells sense temperature. Now researchers are finding PIEZO proteins everywhere—skin, organs, blood vessels, and even red blood cells, where they help the cells squeeze through narrow capillaries. They’re how your brain knows where your hand is in space without looking at it, a sense called proprioception. They’re in plants too, enabling roots to sense pressure as they push down into the earth.\nPIEZO was just the beginning. With a $14.5 million grant from the US National Institutes of Health, Patapoutian and his collaborators are now mapping the body’s entire interoceptive system—as many internal senses as he can find, he says.\nPatapoutian has translated his discovery into a unique form of public outreach. At scientific conferences, he sometimes rolls up his sleeve mid-lecture to reveal half his arm covered in ink—a gigantic PIEZO protein in exquisite anatomical detail, its blades spreading across his biceps. Then he flexes. The tattoo flexes with him, the structure bending exactly as the real protein does when pressure opens the gate.\n“At a pub or a party,” he explains, smiling, “how else would I demonstrate this beautiful structure?”\nSteve Liberles is mapping a major interoception highway. Ardem Patapoutian discovered the gates of touch. Meanwhile, Wen Chen at the National Institutes of Health is pulling the field together, putting neuroscientists, immunologists, physiologists, and clinicians into the same room. The demand, she says, has been enormous.\nShe tested her pitch at a dinner party with NIH colleagues a few years ago.\nYou’re hungry right now—that’s interoception\nYou’re thirsty—that’s interoception.\nHeads nodded as she pointed around the table.\n“We can’t have just the brain or just the body,” she told me. “We need to look at the whole person.”\nIn 2018 she organized a symposium on interoception where Liberles was one of the invitees, along with researchers and practitioners of meditation and yoga. “It was not their thing,” she says, laughing as she recalls how uncomfortable some of the researchers looked. But the practitioners were excited to finally meet scientists who were studying the inner mechanisms of what they did.\nThat was followed by a series of NIH workshops on interoception that spanned topics from basic science to clinical practice. Patapoutian was the keynote speaker for the first one.\nThe NIH began funding scientists to chart the neural circuits of interoception and bringing them together to talk about their findings. Partway through one of these meetings, the equipment failed for an hour. More than 1,000 people stayed online, waiting for it to come back.\n“We were shocked at the turnout,” she says. “There was much bigger interest than we could have imagined.”\nChen is now building infrastructure to match the demand: a formal community, funding mechanisms, a venue where cardiologists and neuroscientists and clinicians can all find each other. And she’s redefining the field as she goes; interoception is not a one-way signal from body to brain but a continuous two-way communication system, each direction shaping the other in real time.\nLiberles’s nervousness on stage is that two-way loop in action. Signals from his racing heart and belly butterflies travel up to the brain, which weaves them into an interpretation:\nThis is anxiety, and this is what to do to handle it.\nHis actions produce fresh signals that the brain reads in light of its ongoing predictions about what will happen next. In the body-brain communication loop, each player constantly updates the other.\nI asked Wen what her work on interoception might mean for another inner sense: intuition. “People talk about ‘gut feelings,’” I said. “How does that relate to interoception?”\n“Intuition might be the bridge where interoception moves from unconscious processing to conscious awareness,” she answered. “If that’s true, then intuition is not magic. It’s physiology.”\nBut it depends on how we read the signals. Intuition is like pain. It tells you something, but it’s not always clear what. “Perhaps we can treat intuition as a source of data,” she says. “Meaningful, but probably not complete.”\n“Maybe we can be grounded in both—in feeling and fact.”\nWhich raises a more personal question: What do you do with the signals your body is sending?\nOne avenue for exploration is therapeutic intervention—both pharmacological and neural stimulation. Vagal nerve stimulation has treated epilepsy and depression for four decades, but as Liberles puts it, it’s like pressing all the keys on the piano to hit one note. Weight-loss drugs like Ozempic act in part through vagal pathways but can cause nausea as a side effect, because the targeting isn’t precise enough. Map the body’s circuits with enough accuracy and\nyou might hit the note you actually want\nAnother area of active research is psychological and behavioral—teaching people how to detect and even shape interoceptive signals. Low interoceptive awareness is linked to mental-health disorders and stress-related physical conditions.\nBut like emotional intelligence, it’s not fixed. Researchers are finding that people can boost their body awareness by, for example, learning to detect their heartbeats from the inside—now a common measure of interoceptive awareness.\nOther interventions focus on body-based therapies and conscious activation of the parasympathetic “rest and digest” system to improve emotional and physical well-being. The placebo effect is another example of the mind acting on the body through expectation alone.\nThe signals we once dismissed as vague feelings—when your gut tightens before you know why, when your body says\nbefore your mind catches up—those are real. How we interpret them and whether we act on them is another frontier.\nIt’s clear that gut feelings play a role in scientific research, especially when the path forward looks foggy. Patapoutian’s informed intuition kept him and his colleagues going long enough to find PIEZO, a reminder that major discoveries often start with a hunch that is later tested against evidence. Chen puts it well: Maybe we can be grounded in both feeling and fact.\nKatherine W. Isaacs\nis a writer and senior lecturer at the MIT Sloan School of Management. Her teaching and research focus on the intersection of psychology, technology, and innovation. Originally trained as a biologist and later as a social psychologist, she is currently working on a book called Gut Feel, about intuition, interoception, and embodied decision-making.\nThe country wants to become a global leader in brain implants. Strong government support is expected to help accelerate that process.\nSynthetic biologists were tantalized by the idea of making mirror images of microbes. Then things got complicated.\nIn an early step towards artificial wombs, a biotech company claims it’s developed a “fully artificial” chicken egg.\nAutomation, AI, and screening technologies are already transforming reproductive medicine.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more.","tp":"内感受机制","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.5,"t":2.0},"as":"内感受(interoception)是大脑感知心跳、肠胃紧张等体内信号的隐藏感觉系统。MIT科技评论文章解读了大脑如何在黑暗的颅腔内通过预测和解读内体信号来构建对自身状态和外部世界的认知，揭示了这一机制对情绪和决策的深层影响。"},{"t":"原位将污染物转化为催化剂：一种用于可持续水处理的相变自催化范式","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5490783?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自催化水处理","kp":["水处理策略[自催化]: 相变驱动将重金属污染物原位转化为催化剂"],"as":"该研究提出一种创新的相变自催化范式，可在水处理过程中原位将污染物转化为催化剂，解决分散式水处理中化学品消耗高、催化剂易失活的核心难题。通过调控污染物的相变过程，使其自身参与催化反应，实现自维持降解循环。该策略在降低药剂依赖和延长催化寿命方面展现出显著优势，为绿色水处理技术提供了全新思路。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"In Situ Turning Pollutants Into Catalysts: A Phase‐Transition Self‐Catalysis Paradigm for Sustainable Water Treatment","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Decentralized water treatment is constrained by high chemical demand and rapid catalyst deactivation, limiting the low‐carbon remediation of waters containing heavy metals and organic micropollutants. Herein, we report a phase‐transition‐driven self‐catalytic strategy that converts metal pollutants in situ into active catalysts for integrated purification and valorization. In a representative Ni\n                    2+\n                    /phenol system, peroxymonosulfate (PMS) shifts the Ni\n                    2+\n                    ⇌ Ni(OH)\n                    2\n                    equilibrium toward NiOOH nanoparticle formation, which rapidly induces phenol polymerization and co‐precipitation with residual Ni(OH)\n                    2\n                    . Consequently, phenol is completely removed, while Ni\n                    2+\n                    decreases from 28 to 0.08 mg L\n                    −1\n                    with ultralow PMS consumption. Mechanistic studies identify NiOOH as the reactive phase that oxidizes phenol to phenoxy radicals via proton‐coupled electron transfer and proton transfer–electron transfer pathways. This strategy is highly effective for treating industrial phenolic wastewater and offers a modular platform adaptable to various metal ions (e.g., Co\n                    2+\n                    , Cu\n                    2+\n                    ) and oxidants (e.g., NaClO, Peroxydisulfate). Combined with effective products recovery, it offers substantial economic and environmental advantages over existing methods. This work recasts pollutants from treatment targets into treatment agents, offering a fresh, and scalable route to sustainable water remediation.","aip":1},{"t":"在科学期刊中","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5477?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Highlights from the\n                    Science\n                    family of journals"},{"t":"在其他期刊中","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5478?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Editors’ selections from the current scientific literature"},{"t":"（合格）捍卫研究项目补助金","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej2947?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"In a debate that has been building for years, a growing coalition of reformers has concluded that the research project grant (RPG) approach used by many science funders in the United States and based on competitive, investigator-initiated, and peer-reviewed proposals cannot support transformative science. Crystallizing this debate, the US National Science Foundation (NSF) has just committed $1.5 billion over the next decade to X-Labs, independent and milestone-driven research organizations meant to bypass not only the RPG but also the universities that have long been its principal recipients. Although the reform impulse may warrant sympathy, the X-Labs prescription merits skepticism."},{"t":"IAV与安世半导体联手提升电动汽车电池效率","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.electrive.com/2026/06/12/iav-and-nexperia-target-higher-ev-battery-efficiency/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"electrive","tg":"产业进展","tp":"EV功率电子","kp":["[架构]: 高压逆变器架构提升单电池功率提取"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"as":"工程服务商IAV与半导体制造商Nexperia宣布合作开发新一代高压功率半导体解决方案，旨在提升电动汽车电池系统的能量效率。双方聚焦于碳化硅和氮化镓等宽禁带半导体材料在EV电池管理系统和功率电子中的应用，通过优化开关器件降低能量损耗、提高功率密度，从而延长电动汽车续航里程并改善热管理性能。该合作将加速车规级高压半导体器件的产业化落地。","ot":"IAV and Nexperia target higher EV battery efficiency - electrive.com","b":"Development service provider IAV and semiconductor manufacturer Nexperia are collaborating on a new generation of high-voltage architectures for electric vehicles under the 'ONE Inverter' project. The partners aim to increase the amount of power that can be extracted from each battery cell, rather than focusing solely on larger battery capacities.\nImage: Nexperia\nUntil now, the performance of a traction battery has often been determined by its weakest cell. If a single cell underperforms, it can limit the performance of the entire battery system. IAV and Nexperia have therefore developed a software-controlled architecture that manages each battery cell individually. Rather than treating the battery as a single unit, the system dynamically controls individual cells, enabling each one to deliver the level of performance it can currently provide.\nThis dynamic control is made possible by Nexperia’s specialised wide-bandgap semiconductor technologies, particularly a bidirectional gallium nitride (GaN) device. This technology enables efficient and rapid switching at the battery cell level, making the approach both technically and economically viable. According to the two partners, other semiconductor solutions would significantly increase system complexity and costs. Additionally, further components from Nexperia’s semiconductor portfolio, including bipolar devices, support the overall system design.\n“IAV’s strength lies in translating technological innovation into system-level solutions for our customers. Together with Nexperia, we are exploring how software-defined battery architectures can unlock new levels of efficiency, flexibility and resilience for future software-defined vehicles,” said Jörg Astalosch, CEO IAV.\n“Strong partnerships are key to driving innovation in next-generation vehicle architectures. By combining our wide bandgap semiconductor expertise – spanning both SiC and GaN – with the advanced system concepts of our partner IAV, we are enabling new approaches to e-mobility design from the ground up. Close collaboration at an early stage allows us to align semiconductor and system requirements and translate innovative ideas into scalable, high-performance solutions,” said Edoardo Merli, SVP and Head of Business Group Wide Bandgap, IGBT & Modules (WIM), Nexperia.\nabout „IAV and Nexperia target higher EV battery efficiency“"},{"t":"光力学中的混合SU(1,1)干涉测量","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/t9tt-t5x2","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光力学干涉测量","kp":["量子干涉[光力学]: 混合SU(1,1)实现亚散粒噪声传感"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究提出一种混合SU(1,1)干涉仪方案，将非简并SU(1,1)干涉仪中的分束器与光力学系统相结合。传统SU(1,1)干涉仪利用非线性参量过程替代线性分束器实现量子增强相位测量，该工作通过引入光力学组件拓展了干涉仪的操控自由度，有望在量子精密测量领域实现超越标准量子极限的灵敏度，对引力波探测和量子传感具有重要意义。","ot":"Hybrid SU(1,1) Interferometry in Optomechanics","b":"Author(s): Chao Meng, Emil Zeuthen, and Polina R. SharapovaIn nondegenerate SU(1,1) interferometers, beam splitters are replaced by two-mode squeezers, enabling sub-shot-noise sensitivity without input squeezing and robustness to detection losses by quantum entanglement. We propose a hybrid implementation in optomechanics where one “arm” is a mechanical mod…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233602] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"HyCavern项目瞄准欧洲内衬岩洞储氢方案","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://hydrogentechworld.com/hycavern-project-targets-lined-rock-caverns-for-hydrogen-storage-in-europe","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Hydrogen Tech World","tg":"产业进展","tp":"衬砌岩洞储氢","kp":["[储氢方式]: 衬砌岩洞储存氢气"],"as":"HyCavern项目正瞄准欧洲市场的内衬岩洞储氢解决方案，SIAD MI将向Nel提供氢气压缩机。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":3.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"HyCavern project targets lined rock caverns for hydrogen storage in Europe","b":"SIAD MI to supply Nel with hydrogen compressors"},{"t":"晴热天气助推欧洲五月光伏发电创新高","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/hot-weather-and-clear-skies-give-europe-a-bumper-may/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","dp":1,"as":"据DNV旗下Solcast的周报分析，5月欧洲晴热天气推动光伏发电大幅增长，阳光辐照数据表现优异。良好的气候条件叠加持续扩装的太阳能装机，使欧洲多个市场当月光伏出力显著高于历史均值。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"欧洲光伏发电","kp":["辐照增益[欧洲5月晴空区]: 最高25%"],"sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hot weather and clear skies give Europe a bumper May - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nIn a new weekly update for\n, Solcast, a DNV company, reports that Europe’s May weather was marked by a mid-month Arctic cold outbreak followed by a persistent heat dome that brought clear skies, record temperatures, and above-average solar irradiance across much of Central and Western Europe. While the blocking high boosted irradiance by up to 25% in some regions, cloudier conditions on its fringes left areas such as Scotland, Ireland, and Norway with below-average solar resource.\nMarkets & Policy\nImage: Solcast\nA sharp contrast between persistent heat and a mid-month cold outbreak defined Europe’s weather in May, shaping solar conditions across the continent, according to\nanalysis using the\n. A blocking high over Central and Western Europe brought clear skies, elevated irradiance and unusually high temperatures across much of the\ncontinent later in the month. In contrast, Arctic air pushed south in the middle of the month, bringing cloud and thunderstorms that cut into what was otherwise a strong month for solar resource. While much of Europe finished sunnier than normal, areas beyond the blocking high saw below-average irradiance.\nThe dominant feature through the last part of the month was a blocking high that trapped warm air from Africa over much of Europe. This limited cloud development and produced sunnier-than-usual conditions from Spain to Ukraine. The clearer skies coincided with record temperatures, with multiple countries reporting records broken by several degrees and daily temperatures up to 10 C above average. For solar conditions, the strongest irradiance anomalies were centred around Austria, where levels reached as much as 25% above normal.\nThis pattern differed from the middle of the month as a cold upper-level system pulled Arctic air south toward the Mediterranean and into Africa. That colder air disrupted the warm conditions established earlier in the month, bringing more cloud and heavy thunderstorms. This reduced irradiance across affected areas and interrupted what had been a sunny start to May. As a result, despite the later heatwave, 2026 ranked only as the seventh hottest month on record.\nThe benefits of the blocking high were not evenly distributed. Areas further from the centre of the heat dome saw weaker irradiance outcomes and more unsettled conditions. Scotland and Ireland finished around 5% below average, while parts of Norway recorded the largest deficits at about 15% below normal. These regions sat closer to the edge of the blocking pattern, where cloud and storm activity were more likely to develop even while central Europe remained comparatively clear.\nproduces these figures by tracking clouds and aerosols at 1-2km resolution globally, using satellite data and proprietary\nAI/ML algorithms\n. This data is used to drive irradiance models, enabling Solcast to calculate irradiance at high resolution, with typical bias of less than 2%, and also cloud-tracking forecasts. This data is used by more than 350 companies managing over 300 GW of solar assets globally.\nThe views and opinions expressed in this article are the author’s own, and do not necessarily reflect those held by"},{"t":"通过相分离设计锂硫电池的均相/多相催化剂","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1750429?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫催化剂设计","kp":["催化剂[锂硫电池]:金属基有机分子均相异相设计","[相分离]:双调控硫氧化还原与锂沉积"],"as":"该研究聚焦锂硫电池中硫氧化还原动力学与锂沉积行为的双重调控，通过均相/异相催化剂的相态设计实现协同优化。该策略有望同时抑制多硫化物穿梭、改善负极锂枝晶问题，是提升锂硫电池循环寿命与能量效率的关键方向。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Homogeneous/Heterogeneous Catalyst Design for Lithium–Sulfur Batteries via Phase Separation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The dual regulation of sulfur redox kinetics and lithium deposition behavior represents a pivotal breakthrough toward overcoming the performance limitations of lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries. Metal‐based organic molecules provide an ideal solution for rationalizing the electrolyte electrochemistry in Li–S system, featuring both nitrogen‐rich properties and active metal centers. Herein, we leverage the solubility of iron phthalocyanine chloride (FePcCl) in the electrolyte to induce phase separation. The dissolved portion (FePcCl solute) functions as a homogeneous catalyst (Fe‐Hom), whilst the insoluble fraction is uniformly loaded onto carbon spheres to act as a heterogeneous catalyst (Fe‐Het). The homogeneous/heterogeneous synergistic catalyst system (Fe‐Syg), developed through precise phase‐separation engineering, enables the coexistence of mobile and immobilized active sites. This synergy maximizes the working activity of Fe‐Syg beyond the limitations of single‐phase catalysts, simultaneously regulating sulfur conversion kinetics and lithium plating/stripping behavior toward high‐efficiency and robust electrodes. As a result, the Li–S batteries incorporating Fe‐Syg demonstrate favorable rate capability and operational lifespan under various conditions. Remarkably, a pouch cell assembled with a lean electrolyte dosage of 3.5 µL mg\n                    −1\n                    achieves a favorable energy density of 364.8 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    and maintains stable cycling for 40 cycles.","aip":1},{"t":"基于光伏和废食用油的家用制冷面板","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/home-cooling-panel-based-on-pv-and-waste-cooking-oil/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"技术突破","tp":"光伏制冷系统","kp":["制冷量[单板优化模拟]: 6-15 kWh/day","储热介质[相变]: 废弃食用油"],"as":"研究人员设计了一套家用冷却面板系统，结合光伏发电、热电制冷与废弃食用油基相变材料。该方案利用废油储热与太阳能供电实现低能耗降温，为缺乏集中制冷设施的地区提供可持续、低成本的住宅降温新思路。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Home cooling panel based on PV and waste cooking oil - pv magazine Global","b":"Research & Development\nResearchers have designed a system that incorporates PV power generation, thermoelectric cooling, and latent heat storage using waste cooking oil. They have simulated an optimized it using an array of models. Results suggest that a single panel can deliver approximately 6–15 kWh/day of cooling.\nResearch & Development\nThe proposed system | Image: Aarupadai Veedu Institute of Technology, Results in Engineering, CC BY 4.0\nA research team from India’s\nAarupadai Veedu Institute of Technology\nhas simulated the performance of cooling panels that combine PV power generation, thermoelectric (TE) cooling, and latent heat storage. The system uses waste cooking oil as a bio-based phase change material (PCM).\nCooling panels for homes are building-integrated systems that absorb and remove heat from indoor spaces, helping lower temperatures and reduce air conditioning demand. They can use technologies such as circulating water, thermoelectric devices, or phase change materials to store and release thermal energy. When combined with PV modules, they can use solar-generated electricity to provide cooling with lower energy consumption.\n“Our study introduces a multi-fidelity modeling approach for solar-driven hybrid cooling panels using waste cooking oil as a phase change material,” corresponding author Keerthi Palra\n. “The novelty lies in converting a waste resource into a low-cost thermal energy storage material for sustainable cooling applications.”\nAccording to Palraj, the study’s most significant finding is that waste cooking oil-based PCM demonstrated effective thermal energy storage and cooling performance, highlighting its potential as an environmentally friendly alternative to conventional PCMs. She added that the team plans to investigate long-term performance under real climatic conditions and explore enhanced PCM formulations.\nThe cooling panel consists of a PV module as the outermost layer, converting incoming solar radiation into electricity. The generated electricity directly powers a TE module that is thermally coupled to a waste palm oil PCM. The hot side of the TE module is connected to a heat sink that dissipates heat to the ambient environment.\nDuring the day, the PV module supplies electricity to the TE unit, which removes heat from the PCM and stores cooling capacity within the PCM layer. At night, when solar generation is unavailable and the TE module is inactive, the PCM absorbs heat from the building interior, helping maintain lower indoor temperatures through latent heat storage.\nThe researchers simulated and optimized the system using a three-layer, multi-fidelity modeling framework. A zero-dimensional (0D) lumped-parameter model was used to evaluate system-level temperatures, cooling performance, and economics. A two-dimensional (2D) finite element model (FEM) captured heat transfer, PCM phase-change behavior, and thermal interactions. The simulation results were then used to train a machine learning surrogate model, enabling rapid performance prediction and design optimization.\nThe simulations indicate that a single panel can provide approximately 6 kWh/day to 15 kWh/day of cooling, reduce peak indoor temperatures by up to 3 C, and shift cooling loads by about 3 hours.\nA techno-economic analysis found a payback period of 3 years to 4 years, which could be reduced to around 2 years with incentives. A life cycle analysis indicated a carbon payback period of less than 2 years, with the panel avoiding approximately 1.2 t of CO₂ emissions annually while reutilizing 40 kg of waste cooking oil.\nThe researchers said future work should focus on scalable manufacturing systems, AI-driven control methodologies, and advances in PCM enhancement technologies to improve economic viability and long-term sustainability.\nTheir findings were presented in “\nMulti-Fidelity Modelling of Solar-Driven Hybrid Cooling Panels with Waste Cooking Oil as Phase Change Materials\n,” published in\nResults in Engineering.\nView author posts"},{"t":"高熵诱导晶格畸变激活双钴位点协同效应以提升光（电）催化产氢","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73708?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵光电催化制氢","kp":["晶格畸变[高熵尖晶石]: 平均3.35%","[活性位点]: Co tet2+/Co oct3+双位点","[材料体系]: 高熵尖晶石氧化物"],"dp":1,"as":"研究通过高熵工程引发晶格畸变，激活双钴位点的协同催化作用，成功突破太阳能水裂解中催化活性与稳定性难以兼顾的瓶颈。所设计的尖晶石结构材料在光催化分解水制氢方面展现出优异的综合性能。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High‐Entropy‐Induced Lattice Distortion Activates Dual‐Cobalt Site Synergy for Boosted Photo(Electro)Catalytic Hydrogen ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy engineering breaks the activity–stability trade‐off in solar water splitting. We design a spinel oxide (CuCoNi)(GaCoCrMnFe)\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    with lattice distortion (\n                    \n                      δ\n                      avg\n                    \n                    = 3.35%) and stabilized Co\n                    tet\n                    2+\n                    /Co\n                    oct\n                    3+\n                    dual sites. The cocktail effect goes beyond elemental averaging: Cu/Ga harvest light; Co enables dual‐site surface catalysis; Ni/Cr induce distortion and local built‐in fields; Cu/Mn trigger Jahn–Teller upshifting the d‐band center; Fe/Mn balance distortion; multivalent species provide a broad redox window. The material achieves a photocatalytic HER rate of 16.62 µmol∙h\n                    −1\n                    ∙g\n                    −1\n                    —16.3× that of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    and 10.8× that of CuGa\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , alongside &lt;5% decay over 30 h. In photoelectrochemical tests, it delivers 2.03 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0 V\n                    RHE\n                    in neutral electrolyte (21.6× and 67.7× the benchmarks) and 7.08 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    under alkaline conditions with 48% IPCE and 0.56% HC‐STH. Distortion‐induced dipoles (0.87 D) extend carrier lifetime to 6.95 ns; Co\n                    tet\n                    2+\n                    dissociates water (\n                    \n                      E\n                      a\n                    \n                    = 0.187 eV) while Co\n                    oct\n                    3+\n                    reduces protons (\n                    \n                      ΔG\n                      *H\n                    \n                    = 0.288 eV); configurational entropy (2.71\n                    R\n                    ) stabilizes the structure. This “entropy–structure–function” strategy offers a generalizable route to durable, high‐performance solar fuel catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"卤化物钙钛矿组分依赖热稳定性的高精度机器学习预测","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73636?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿热稳定性","kp":["[高通量+机器学习]:预测钙钛矿组分依赖热稳定性"],"as":"该研究利用机器学习方法预测卤化物钙钛矿材料在不同组分下的热稳定性。钙钛矿因其组成复杂多变，对环境应力的响应难以预测，成为限制其商业化的关键瓶颈。研究通过构建成分-性能映射模型，实现了对钙钛矿热稳定性的高精度投影预测，为理性设计高稳定性钙钛矿器件提供了数据驱动的筛选框架，有望加速光伏与光电子领域的材料发现进程。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"High‐Accuracy Machine Learning Projections of Composition‐Dependent Thermal Stability in Halide Perovskites","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Halide perovskites exhibit unpredictable properties in response to environmental stressors due to several composition‐dependent degradation mechanisms. In this work, we combine high‐throughput experiments, data visualization, and machine learning (ML) techniques to quantify correlations between composition, temperature, and material properties by analyzing high‐throughput, in situ environmental photoluminescence (PL) experiments. Correlation heatmaps show the influence of Cs content on film degradation, and dimensionality reduction visualization methods uncover clear composition‐based clusters despite overlapping datasets. A robust screening of 10 ML algorithms effectively forecasts PL features with single‐composition, composition‐generalized, and composition‐generalized stacking approaches, with the highest‐performing models achieving root mean squared errors of 1.84, 10.69, and 10.28, respectively. Using a multi‐output composition‐generalized Extra‐Trees and Ridge Regression stacked model, a full PL spectrum can be predicted for any time, temperature, and composition input. Our ML‐based framework could be expanded to other perovskite families, significantly reducing the analysis time to identify stable options for photovoltaics."},{"t":"宽禁带半导体缺陷的高通量X射线表征","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73678?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宽禁带半导体缺陷","kp":["缺陷表征[宽禁带半导体]: 高通量X射线量化金刚石位错密度"],"as":"该研究开发了高通量X射线表征技术，用于系统检测宽禁带半导体中的缺陷结构。宽禁带材料（如碳化硅、氮化镓等）是新一代高功率、射频及量子技术的核心，但晶体缺陷严重影响器件性能与可靠性。研究利用先进X射线手段实现对缺陷类型、密度与分布的大规模快速表征，为宽禁带半导体的缺陷工程与质量管控提供了高效分析工具。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High Throughput X‐Ray Characterization of Defects in Wide‐Bandgap Semiconductors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Wide‐bandgap materials are central to next‐generation high‐power, radio‐frequency, and quantum technologies, yet their performance is often limited by crystalline defects such as dislocations. Single‐crystal diamond in particular exhibits exceptional electronic and thermal properties, however, accurately and scalably quantifying defect density remains challenging. Here, we present an integrated methodology for characterizing dislocation densities in diamond using high‐resolution X‐ray diffraction and validate it using complementary Raman spectroscopy, hydrogen etch‐pit analysis, and Hall effect measurements. Central to this approach is a custom Python‐based tool that processes X‐ray rocking curves and reciprocal space maps. The framework is applied to four commercially available grades of diamond substrates, spanning a wide defect density range (∼10\n                    5\n                    to 10\n                    8\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Consistent trends are observed across all characterization techniques, with electronic‐grade diamond exhibiting the highest crystalline quality and lowest defect density. Application of the analysis tool to GaN samples further demonstrates its adaptability to other wide‐bandgap material systems. Overall, this work establishes a robust, scalable, and versatile platform for high‐throughput defect analysis in diamond and related wide‐bandgap semiconductors."},{"t":"被预测数十年的隐藏物相终于被实验捕获","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/hidden-phase-of-matter-finally-captured-after-decades-of-predictions/","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","tp":"隐蔽量子相态","kp":["[突破]: 纳米颗粒工程首次稳定隐相","[方法]: 工程化纳米颗粒构建单元"],"as":"科学家经过数十年理论预测后，首次成功捕获了一种长期 elusive 的物质\"隐匿相\"。该隐藏相态展现出引人关注的量子特性，其发现依托于超快激光或同步辐射等先进探测手段，实时捕捉了材料在极端条件下的瞬态结构转变。这一突破不仅验证了早期凝聚态物理理论预言，也为探索新型量子材料、拓扑物态及潜在量子计算应用开辟了全新方向。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":8.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Hidden Phase of Matter Finally Captured After Decades of Predictions","b":"Scientists have finally captured a hidden state of matter, revealing a long-predicted phase with intriguing quantum potential.\nResearchers from Brown University and the University of Michigan College of Engineering have succeeded in stabilizing a previously elusive state of matter that had existed only in theoretical models.\nUsing carefully engineered nanoparticles as building blocks, the team created a new material structure that locks in a fleeting intermediate state between two of the most common crystal arrangements found in metals. The achievement not only provides new insight into how materials change their internal structure, but also reveals unusual optical properties that could one day prove useful for\nquantum computing\nand other quantum information technologies.\nThe findings were published in the journal\nMore broadly, the work demonstrates a powerful new strategy for designing materials from custom-made nanoparticles, opening possibilities for creating entirely new materials with tailored characteristics.\n“Our work is a little bit like kids playing with LEGO blocks,” said Ou Chen, an associate professor of chemistry at Brown and a corresponding author of the research. “We synthesize unique\nbuilding blocks and stack them into interesting structures. In this case, we were able to stabilize these theorized transitional structures and demonstrate important quantum optical properties.”\nMany metals naturally organize their atoms into one of two crystal structures: face-centered cubic (FCC) or body-centered cubic (BCC).\nIn an FCC arrangement, particles are packed as tightly as possible. Each cube contains particles at its corners and at the center of every face. In a BCC arrangement, particles occupy the cube’s corners and a single position at the cube’s center. These patterns are among the most common atomic arrangements found in metallic materials.\nSome metals can switch between these structures when heated. Iron, for example, changes from BCC to FCC at 912 degrees\n. Scientists have proposed several possible mechanisms for how these transformations occur.\nOne of the best-known explanations is called the Nishiyama-Wassermann pathway. This model predicts a series of temporary intermediate structures that appear as a material shifts from FCC to BCC. Because these transition states are inherently unstable, they have been extremely difficult to observe directly.\nThe new study successfully recreated those elusive intermediate phases using specially designed silver nanoparticles.\n“Materials scientists have cared about how to control the amount of FCC and BCC in their metals for a long time, but the transitions between these phases have been hard to study because they are so unstable,” said Tim Moore, a study co-author and an assistant research scientist working in Sharon Glotzer’s lab at the University of Michigan. “Being able to observe these structures is a fundamental breakthrough in materials science, and it gives us greater control over nanomaterial engineering.”\nTo create the material, Chen and his colleagues synthesized silver nanoparticles known as “mecons.” These particles resemble truncated octahedra, a shape that can be thought of as a diamond-like form with its corners cut off, producing a 14-sided structure.\nAccording to Chen, the shape is particularly useful because it sits between a sphere and a cube, two forms that pack together in very different ways.\nThe team allowed particles of different shapes to organize themselves into nanoparticle superlattices and then examined the resulting structures.\nCombining experimental observations with detailed computer simulations, the researchers found that the sticky molecular coatings played a crucial role. They enabled the particles to arrange themselves into the same transitional structures predicted by the Nishiyama-Wassermann model.\nThe simulations and modeling work were carried out in collaboration with researchers led by Sharon Glotzer at the University of Michigan.\n“You can kind of picture them like hairy particles,” said Moore. “The hairs are flexible enough that the particles have more freedom to shift, but they also fit together nicely, which allows the particles to mesh together.”\nThe newly created silver nanoparticle superlattices displayed another surprising characteristic.\nWhen illuminated with light, the structures exhibited signatures of deep-strong light-matter coupling, a phenomenon in which electrons inside the silver nanoparticles oscillate in sync with light waves and become quantum mechanically entangled.\nThese types of quantum optical effects are often observed only at very low temperatures. In contrast, the newly developed material appears to exhibit this behavior at room temperature.\nThat capability could make the structure a valuable model for developing future materials used in quantum computing, sensing technologies, and other quantum information applications.\n“Anytime you’re able to identify a new phase of matter, new applications are going to emerge,” Chen said.\nReference: “Stabilizing in-transition phases of superlattices through shape control of silver nanocrystals” by Yasutaka Nagaoka, Timothy C. Moore, Arseniy Epishin, Zhenyang Liu, Tong Cai, Na Jin, Ken Seungmin Hong, Peter Saghy, Ankai Wang, Yuzi Liu, Sooyeon Hwang, Yusong Bai, Shengli Zou, Ruipeng Li, Stephanie Reich, Sharon C. Glotzer and Ou Chen, 28 May 2026,\nDOI: 10.1126/science.ady6472\nThe research was supported by multiple grants from the National Science Foundation (DMR-1943930, CHE-2203700, EAR−2223273, CBET-2230729, CBET-2230891, 2243104, DMR 140129, 2138259, 2138286, 2138307, 2137603, 2138296) and the Department of Energy (DE-SC0012704, DOE-NNSA, DE-NA-0003975).\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nBrown University\nNanotechnology\nHole-y Superconductor: Entirely New State of Matter Discovered\nGold Nanoparticles Recycle CO2 Into Useful Forms of Carbon\nNew Spectroscopic Method Could Improve Optical Devices\nSynthesized ITO Nanocrystals May Advance Clear Conductive Film Performance\nIon bombardment Model Could Lead to New Technologies\nResearchers Study the Use of Photosystem-I as Photovoltaic Panels\nResearchers Find Maximum Nanotube Brightness is Proportional to Length\nPhysicists Work on Nano Loudspeakers to Make Better MRIs, Quantum Computers\nUsing Lasers to Cool Semiconductors"},{"t":"异型细胞间粘附调节细胞间迁移的效率","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524496123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cell migration across epithelial barriers occurs in diverse developmental, immunological, and pathological contexts. Here, we investigate the contribution of heterotypic adhesion between migrating cells and epithelial “substrate” cells to transepithelial migration. Using an in silico model inspired by the migration of primordial germ cells across the midgut epithelium in the\n                    Drosophila\n                    embryo, we show that heterotypic adhesion modulates migration efficiency in a nonmonotonic manner, revealing the existence of an optimal adhesion regime. Consistent with this prediction, in vivo overexpression of E-cadherin in germ cells accelerated their exit from the midgut relative to controls. Beyond providing experimentally testable predictions, our model integrates and explains previous observations on the role of heterotypic adhesion in cell-on-cell migration, offering a framework for understanding transepithelial migration across biological contexts."},{"t":"硬路易斯碱驱动的结晶控制用于高效全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73682?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["结晶调控[全钙钛矿叠层]: 硬路易斯碱驱动Sn-Pb低缺陷密度结晶"],"as":"该研究提出利用硬路易斯碱驱动结晶调控策略，实现高效全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池（APTSCs）。全钙钛矿叠层电池因可突破单结效率极限被视为光伏前沿方向，但窄带隙子电池的薄膜结晶质量难以控制。研究通过引入硬路易斯碱与前驱体配位，调控结晶动力学，显著改善了薄膜形貌与缺陷态密度，从而提升了器件光电转换效率与运行稳定性，为叠层光伏的规模化制备提供了新路径。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hard Lewis Base‐Driven Crystallization Control for Efficient All‐Perovskite Tandem Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    All‐perovskite tandem solar cells (APTSCs) have attracted considerable research interest in recent years due to their higher theoretical efficiencies and broader spectral coverage. Nonetheless, as the bottom narrow‐bandgap cell in APTSCs, tin‐lead (Sn‐Pb) hybrid perovskite solar cells (PSCs) still face challenges of high defect density and poor crystallization morphology, which hinder the further improvement of device performance and long‐term stability. This work proposes a Lewis hard‐basicity amplification strategy that provides additional potential hard‐acid binding sites and promotes coordination with Sn\n                    2+\n                    , thereby enabling defect passivation and regulating crystallization. Ultimately, we achieved a champion power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 23.71% for single‐junction Sn‐Pb PSCs. By integrating 1.77 eV wide‐bandgap perovskites with Sn‐Pb hybrid perovskites, we further fabricated APTSCs with a champion PCE of 29.44%. Both devices retain approximately 80% of their initial efficiency after 1080 h of continuous operation under one‐sun illumination.","aip":1},{"t":"HII为Romulus无人水面艇建设专用可扩展生产线","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/military/hii-forms-production-line-for-romulus-usvs","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"interesting engineering","tg":"产业进展","tp":"无人水面艇产线","as":"美国国防造船商亨廷顿英戈尔斯工业（HII）的制造合作伙伴Bayou Metals为Romulus无人水面艇（USV）建立了专用可扩展生产线。此举标志着美军无人舰艇从原型试制迈向批量制造，旨在满足大规模列装需求，提升海军分布式作战能力。专用生产线的设立意味着该型USV已进入工程化量产阶段。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"HII forms a dedicated scalable production line for Romulus USV","b":"Bayou Metals, a manufacturing partner of defense shipbuilder Huntington Ingalls Industries (HII), has stood up a dedicated production line for the Romulus uncrewed surface vessel (USV), a move intended to compress delivery timelines and increase throughput for the US Navy’s growing unmanned maritime program.\nThe production line is located in Slidell, Louisiana. Bayou Metals is also serving as a strategic marine-grade aluminum supplier to the HII.\nRather than routing Romulus components through a generalized fabrication workflow, Bayou Metals configured a dedicated manufacturing line specifically for the vessel’s metalwork and structural assemblies. This single-product-line architecture reduces setup changeover time and allows process engineers to optimize fixturing, weld sequencing, and quality inspection around a single repeating geometry—a standard lean-manufacturing approach when volume and schedule pressure justify the capital allocation.\nThe Romulus family of\nis designed for a wide range of mission sets, including intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance (ISR), mine countermeasures, strike operations, and counter-unmanned systems. It can also serve as a\nto launch and recover unmanned\nvehicles (UUVs) and unmanned aerial vehicles (UAVs). It is centered on HII’s Odyssey autonomy software suite and open systems architecture.\nHII has been developing the platform as part of the broader US Navy push to field autonomous and semi-autonomous surface vessels capable of operating alongside crewed combatants. Romulus is being developed in partnership with Breaux Brothers, Shield AI, Beier Integrated Systems, and Incat Crowther.\nThe Bayou Metals arrangement illustrates how prime defense contractors are structuring supply chains for unmanned platforms differently from traditional crewed ships. Because USVs are expected to be procured in larger numbers at lower per-unit cost than destroyers or frigates, the production economics demand a more industrialized approach from tier-one and tier-two suppliers early in the program lifecycle — before the Navy has necessarily committed to a high-rate production contract.\nHII has been expanding its unmanned and autonomous systems work through its Mission Technologies division, positioning itself beyond traditional nuclear shipbuilding. The Romulus program sits within that strategic push.\nProduction readiness reviews assess not just the prime contractor’s internal capacity but the depth and reliability of the supplier base. A named, dedicated manufacturing line at a partner facility is a tangible data point in that evaluation criteria.\nIn addition to the vessel currently under construction, four additional Romulus 151 vessels will be built by\nBreaux Brothers Enterprises\nin Louisiana. This effort for HII also supports the expansion of the U.S. shipbuilding industrial base by growing Gulf Coast manufacturing capacity.\nGet the latest in engineering, tech, space & science - delivered daily to your inbox.\nRobot hand uses touch and vision to harvest ripe fruit with near-100% accuracy\nUS safety design approval advances next-gen Aurora nuclear reactor initiative in Idaho\nDodge Charger maker road-tests solid-state EV battery hitting 90% charge in 18 minutes\nProject to restore US uranium enrichment for defense programs commences operations\nChina’s robotic snakes slither across power lines to spot faults before failure\nMore from Military\nUS’ new 180-foot drone ship could launch hypersonic missiles, demo set for 2027\nAutonomous aircraft drops 200-pound payload within 50 feet for frontline logistics\nTrump cancels planned Iran strikes, says peace agreement could come soon\nUS Navy’s new 20,000-ton Columbia-class nuclear-powered submarine takes shape\nUS Army to deploy VAMPIRE drone hunter with proven 350,000 hours of battlefield use\nUS’ new 180-foot drone ship could launch hypersonic missiles, demo set for 2027\nAutonomous aircraft drops 200-pound payload within 50 feet for frontline logistics\nTrump cancels planned Iran strikes, says peace agreement could come soon\nUS Navy’s new 20,000-ton Columbia-class nuclear-powered submarine takes shape\nUS Army to deploy VAMPIRE drone hunter with proven 350,000 hours of battlefield use"},{"t":"Greenvolt投运匈牙利最大电池储能系统","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/12/greenvolt-commissions-hungarys-largest-battery-storage-system/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"大型电池储能系统","kp":["[项目地位]: 匈牙利最大运营储能(2026年6月)","前最大储能[参考]: 40MW/80MWh"],"as":"葡萄牙Greenvolt集团旗下波兰公司Greenvolt Power在匈牙利投运了该国最大规模的电池储能系统——Buj项目。该系统标志着中东欧地区电网级储能基础设施的持续扩张，有助于提升可再生能源并网稳定性与电力调度灵活性。储能规模化部署正成为欧洲能源转型的关键支撑。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":8.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Greenvolt commissions Hungary's largest battery storage system - Energy Storage","b":"Greenvolt Power, the Polish unit of Portugal’s Greenvolt Group, has commissioned the Buj battery energy storage system in Szabolcs-Szatmár-Bereg County, northeastern Hungary, replacing the 40 MW/80 MWh facility commissioned by MET Group in mid-2025 as the country’s largest operational storage asset.\nThe project, which reached full operations in June 2026 following construction that began in 2024, has a duration of about 2.9 hours and will provide frequency and voltage regulation, grid flexibility services, and renewables integration support to Hungary’s transmission system operator, MAVIR (Magyar Villamosenergia-ipari Átviteli Rendszerirányító).\nFinancing was provided by UniCredit Bank Hungary, which supplied EUR 58.9 million in project finance with a tenor of more than 10 years. The project also received HUF 11.3 billion, approximately EUR 29 million, in grant support. Revenue is underpinned by a 10-year cap-and-floor contract awarded through a Hungarian government auction, with merchant market exposure thereafter. BYD supplied the battery units.\nThe Buj BESS arrives as Hungary scales its grid storage ambitions rapidly. Grid-connected capacity stood at 35.3 MW at end-2024 and reached 73.2 MW by May 2025. Analysts forecast more than 500 MW of operational capacity by end-2026, with the market reaching an estimated 3,300 MWh by 2030. Hungary’s National Recovery and Resilience Plan targets 440 MW/880 MWh of new grid storage by mid-2026, supported by a capital grant program covering up to 45% of project investment costs across a EUR 160 million budget.\nGreenvolt has a 4.7 GW European battery storage pipeline, including a significant presence in Poland."},{"t":"通过Mg3Sb2量子点实现梯度晶面取向工程用于高性能稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71181?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["[结晶调控]: Mg3Sb2量子点后处理","[取向工程]: 梯度晶面取向"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出通过Mg₃Sb₂量子点进行梯度晶面取向工程，解决有机-无机杂化钙钛矿在溶液加工中结晶不可控的难题。该方法优化了薄膜结晶质量与晶面取向，显著提升了钙钛矿光电器件的性能，为高效稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池的工程化制备提供了新思路。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Gradient Facet Orientation Engineering Via Mg3Sb2 Quantum Dots for High‐Performance and Stable Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organic‐inorganic hybrid perovskite suffers from uncontrollable crystallization in solution processing, leading to the formation of randomly oriented polycrystalline films and thus limiting both performance and stability of perovskite solar cells (PSCs). Here, we propose a Mg\n                    3\n                    Sb\n                    2\n                    quantum dots (QDs) post‐treatment method on perovskite wet film to modulate perovskite crystallization and guide facet‐specific growth. As a result, high crystallization quality perovskite films with gradient facet orientation (GFO) are constructed. The GFO structure with (111) facet‐dominated top layer and (001) facet‐dominated bottom layer synergistically integrates the advantages of different crystal facets, i.e., low work function, high ion migration activation energy, high hole mobility, and superior stability against moisture of (111)‐facet, and low electron trap state density and high electron mobility of (001)‐facet. Moreover, Mg\n                    3\n                    Sb\n                    2\n                    QDs inhibit the formation of I\n                    −\n                    vacancy defects by Mg\n                    2+\n                    strongly interacting with perovskite. Consequently, the optimized target PSCs achieve a champion power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 25.18% (vs. 23.07% for control device). The unencapsulated devices exhibit significantly improved stability, retaining 75% of its initial PCE after continuous light soaking for 1000 h and over 75% after storage in the dark for 6240 h. The corresponding flexible PSCs obtain a champion PCE of 24.03% and exhibit excellent mechanical durability.","aip":1},{"t":"不同磷脂酰肌醇核心蛋白的糖基化独立功能驱动皮质生成中的细胞特异性反应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531481123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The extracellular matrix plays critical roles in orchestrating cell communication and behaviors in response to various extracellular signals. It is a complex network composed of proteins and polysaccharides, whose individual and synergistic roles in cellular signaling, structural integrity, and tissue homeostasis remain active areas of investigation. Here, we find that in the developing cerebral cortex, distinct glypicans, which are heparan sulfate proteoglycans, present very precise and complementary expression patterns. More precisely, GPC4, which is expressed in cortical progenitors, promotes their proliferation and the generation of intermediate progenitors, whereas neuronal GPC2 acts as a brake on radial neuronal migration. The diverse biological functions of these proteoglycans are widely regarded as being intrinsically tied to their glycosaminoglycan (GAG) chains. Strikingly, we found that these effects are mediated only through glypican core proteins, rather than their heparan sulfate glycosylations. We found that the only difference between them is in their C-terminal disordered regions, which have a high density of charged residues. GPC2 is strongly basic, whereas GPC4 is acidic. Together, our findings highlight how specific proteoglycan protein cores are required to drive sequential cellular responses during cortical development in a glycosylation independent manner."},{"t":"丛枝菌根真菌网络的整体密度和生物量","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu4373?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi form symbioses with ~70% of plant species, building hyphal networks that exchange nutrients for host-derived carbon. These tubular networks move ~1 billion metric tons of carbon per year into Earth’s soils. However, we have no quantitative understanding of the hyphal infrastructure required to carry out this resource transfer. We assembled data from 322 studies representing more than 16,000 soil cores across nine biomes and developed machine-learning models to predict hyphal densities globally. With robotic imaging of more than 300,000 hyphae, we calibrated a biomass model from our spatial predictions. We estimate that global topsoils contain 1.10 × 10\n                    17\n                    ± 0.13 × 10\n                    17\n                    SD kilometers of living hyphae, weighing ~300 ± 60 SD megatons, ~4- to 6-fold the biomass of humans. Our uncertainty analyses identified undersampled ecosystems that require additional empirical attention.","tp":"菌根碳循环","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":9.0,"t":6.0},"as":"丛枝菌根真菌与约70%植物物种形成共生，构建菌丝网络交换养分与碳，每年向土壤输送约10亿吨碳。研究整合322项研究、跨越9个生物群系的16000余个土芯数据，利用机器学习模型预测了菌丝网络的密度和生物量分布规律。","aip":1},{"t":"全球供应链奖：供应链英雄奖","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/global-supply-chain-awards-the-supply-chain-hero-award","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Global Supply Chain Awards: The Supply Chain Hero Award\nPrioritise Us\nEntries for The Supply Chain Hero Award are now open, recognising those excelling in their role, fostering innovation and driving operational excellence\nThe coveted Supply Chain Hero Award is now open for entries to those individuals who go above and beyond within their role in the supply chain sector.\nIt is a crucial moment for supply chain function, as it faces external cross-border pressures like never before. Meanwhile, the push to innovate has never been greater.\nThis honour at the\nGlobal Supply Chain Awards\nwill be closely watched by many, as our function thrives due to the individuals who push it forward, while simultaneously driving their organisations into a new era of logistics.\nAs well as celebrating the successful organisations in the industry, it is important to acknowledge the individuals driving success. These are the people behind the operations, those who are ensuring efficiency and making the decisions which result in resilient and sustainable supply chains.\nOur judging panel is excited to welcome award entries from the individuals who are demonstrating the\nleadership qualities\nthat are required to navigate supply chain functions. It is imperative to have passionate logistics professionals who can lead from the front.\nIt is the dedication and the hard work of some of the most talented employees that will earn candidates a spot on our shortlist. We want to celebrate the actions of the people who have made a notable positive impact on their organisation’s supply chain success.\nThe unsung heroes of the sector are more than deserving of praise. Those who have shown strategic and operational excellence will be among the attendees sitting down to enjoy an exclusive black-tie dinner on 8 September 2026 at the iconic JW Marriott Grosvenor House London.\nHighlighting the people responsible for industry-wide initiatives, who champion collaboration, innovation and inclusion across global supply chains, will also work to inspire the next generation of talent.\nThose nominated will be recognised for their unflinching adaptability to\nnavigate sudden disruptions\n, proactive communication to spot bottlenecks early and deep analytical grit to balance cost, capacity and the end customer's needs simultaneously.\nThe judges assessing entries to this award will be using the following criteria:\nIf you or a team member fit the brief, we want to hear from you.\nYou may already know that your colleague displays exceptional commitment, leadership and problem-solving skills every day, but the rest of our industry would love to hear it too.\nShining a light at an individual level allows the human element to shine through and achievements of talent to celebrated.\nPrevious function executives who have been honoured at our awards have been commended for the way they influence policy, advance ESG practices and empower other professionals. We will also be celebrating emerging talent with our\nFuture Leader Award\non the night.\nWanting to nominate a supply chain superstar? You are running out of time. Here is the timeline to take note of:\nSupply Chain LIVE\nis co-located with\nSustainability LIVE\nProcurement LIVE\n, which takes place on 8 and 9 September at QEII Centre, Westminster.\nNow is the time to nominate the hardworking colleagues responsible for success who deserve to be known as a supply chain hero."},{"t":"全球供应链奖：数字供应链奖","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/global-supply-chain-awards-the-digital-supply-chain-award","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Global Supply Chain Awards: The Digital Supply Chain Award\nPrioritise Us\nEntries are now open for the Global Supply Chain Awards 2026, creating the opportunity for leading enterprises to demonstrate their digital innovation\nGlobal Supply Chain Awards\nare back, bringing together leading professionals from the global supply chain sector. Entries are now open for eight dedicated categories, including the Digital Supply Chain Award.\nFor leading enterprises embracing technology and driving efficiency through automation, this category is not one to miss.\nJoin us at Supply Chain LIVE: The London Summit & Awards on 8 and 9 September 2026 at the QEII Centre in Westminster, where more than 1,000 attendees and 50+ expert speakers will unite to explore some of the most pressing challenges and celebrate the most innovative strategies.\nEntries are now open\nfor the award, as well as\nsponsorship opportunities\nOn 8 September 2026, the iconic JW Marriott Grosvenor House London will host the Global Supply Chain Awards on a night of celebration and an exclusive black-tie gala dinner. Leaders across the sector will be celebrated, showcasing excellence across innovation and implementation.\nIn an era marked by\nongoing instability\nand increasing risk, digitalisation has been the answer to staying resilient amid volatility. The Digital Supply Chain Award is there to celebrate the organisations which have implemented the most cutting-edge tools or platforms in order to deliver greater connectivity and efficiency across operations.\nAs the world increasingly embraces technology, teams are having to strategically integrate technology across their supply chains – but not all technological adoption\ndelivers results\n. This award explores the teams which have displayed measurable outcomes through their innovation, with appearances of meeting long-term goals.\nIf your organisation taken to new digital tools and transformed its supply chain operations, we want to celebrate you. Demonstrate how you have effectively used digital innovation to enhance visibility or deliver more connected workflows.\nfor your chance to win.\nWhen examining entries, our judges will ask a number of questions including:\nPrevious winners have been recognised for setting new benchmarks and driving a positive business impact.\nBeing shortlisted for the Digital Supply Chain Award celebrates the organisations which using digital innovation to increase supply chain performance. Some of this is through effectively utilising automation, or strategically using data in order to deliver better operations.\nEntries for the\nGlobal Supply Chain Awards 2026 are now open\nCo-located with Procurement LIVE and Sustainability LIVE,\nSupply Chain LIVE\nwill take place on 8 and 9 September at QEII Centre, Westminster.\nIn an era where supply chain, procurement,\nresilience and ESG\nare entirely inseparable, this event offers an opportunity to network across all disciplines in a single location.\nSecure your tickets today to celebrate the present, and meet the future, of supply chain leadership."},{"t":"全球供应链奖：全球贸易与物流奖","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/global-supply-chain-awards-global-trade-logistics-award","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Global Supply Chain Awards: Global Trade & Logistics Award\nPrioritise Us\nEntries for the Global Trade & Logistics Award are now open, recognising excellence in developing innovations and maintaining resilience across operations\nThe Global Trade & Logistics Award is the pinnacle of recognition for those firms who optimise their global trade and logistics operations. As a key category in this year’s\nGlobal Supply Chain Awards\n, we look to celebrate these achievements.\nMore than ever before, ensuring operational resilience is crucial to navigate the unstable and unpredictable global climate we currently face. Ensuring the seamless movement of goods is vital, and a challenge that deserves to be noticed in its own right.\nOrganisations are dealing with unforeseen circumstances on a regular basis, and in the trade and logistics space, the pioneers that are not only efficient while managing logistics, but excel through means of innovation and forward-thinking, are the exact recipients this award is made to honour.\nThe opportunity to learn more about how firms are using the current chaos of the economic instability and manage it in a way that makes them ever more resilient both now and in the future is an offer not to be missed.\nGlobal leaders are set to attend the iconic JW Marriott Grosvenor House London on 8 September 2026 to celebrate the achievements of their teams and projects over the past year. Supply chain decision-makers with the knowledge to navigate new technology when it comes to trade and logistics will sit down to enjoy an exclusive black-tie gala dinner.\nAs well as the opportunity to talk all things trade at the table, we will be sharing the measurable success stories of those organisations that have managed risks and\nensured resilience across borders\nTo win this award, the applicants must demonstrate that they can not only survive the difficult international challenges in the sector, but thrive and have the results to show how performance improved or how end-users experience increased satisfaction.\nWhether companies utilised new innovations or processes that increased visibility and enhanced efficiency, or introduced new technologies that led to a rise in output, our panel will be assessing the tangible impact of those moving goods with ease through global supply networks.\nFor the Global Trade & Logistics Award, our judges will be assessing against the following:\nPrevious recipients of this award have been commended for their ability to tackle global logistics and trade\ncompliance challenges\nwith a proactive, technology-driven approach.\nLearning from fellow sector leaders on issues such as how to achieve a resilient, efficient and compliance supply chain has never been more important. It is important to put focus on firms with excellence with consulting, innovation and trusted partnerships, to deliver resilient, efficient and compliant supply chain solutions.\nIt is a talent to turn adversity into success, and your peers need to know about it. The opportunity to put yourself at the forefront of the conversation is fast approaching.\nThe deadline for entries to the Global Trade & Logistics Award is 29 June. Shortly after this, the judges will deliberate and the shortlist will be announced in August 2026.\nThe Global Supply Chain Awards, which are being celebrated at JW Marriott Grosvenor House London, will include other hard-fought categories such as the\nSustainable Supply Chain Award\nTransformation Project of the Year\nAlongside this night of celebration, the awards are co-located with\nProcurement LIVE\nSustainability LIVE\nat the QEII Centre, Westminster on 8 and 9 September.\nWe look forward to celebrating with the deserving recipient of the Global Trade & Logistics Award and honouring the supply chains that show how our sector is thriving and looking to a prosperous future."},{"t":"2026 年全球供应链奖：年度最佳公司","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/global-supply-chain-awards-2026-company-of-the-year","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Global Supply Chain Awards 2026: Company of the Year\nPrioritise Us\nThe Company of the Year Award, a coveted honour at The Global Supply Chain Awards, is now open for entry, providing opportunities for celebration\nEntries for the Company of the Year award are now open. The Global Supply Chain Awards 2026 are looking for organisations that have excelled in the past 12 months in the supply chain sector.\nDuring times of turbulence, the companies in our industry that shine are the ones that demonstrate adaptability to market challenges. With\nglobal disruption\nat the forefront of everyone’s minds, it is imperative that we look to celebrate the organisations capitalising on opportunities as they arise.\nThis award is open to small to mid-sized organisations with fewer than 1,000 employees, displaying growth and ambition with regard to their operations.\nOur awards ceremony, which takes place in September, presents the perfect chance for companies to reflect on the previous 12 months and take stock of their wins and achievements.\nThis celebration brings together some of the most influential supply chain executives all in one room, as we sit down for an exclusive black-tie gala dinner and discuss the key initiatives that have driven their company’s supply chain success in recent times.\nTaking place at the iconic JW Marriott Grosvenor House London, the Global Supply Chain Awards, we will be honouring those corporate milestones of your company as a whole, focusing on companies that have been able to display measurable impact, sustainability and growth in today’s competitive global market.\nWhile it is important to focus on the future of our function, the relentless pursuit of excellence often allows companies little time to reflect on the success along the way.\nThis accolade gives us the time to stop, pause and take note of key initiatives driving your company’s success, how you’ve\ndemonstrated agility\nduring difficult global market conditions and how you as an organisation live and breathe the best practices responsible for seamless execution.\nWhen considering the application for this category, judges will be considering the following factors:\nIf you and your company measure up to these criteria and have a story to tell about your progress, we would love to hear from you.\nwinners of the Company of the Year Award\n, Viettel Post Joint Stock Corporation, were noted for their dedication to sustainability and social responsibility. Judges were particularly impressed by innovations such as electrifying vehicles and building energy-efficient hubs to advancing circular practices and delivering disaster relief, which demonstrated the firm’s commitment to environmental stewardship and social well-being while shaping its sustainable logistics future.\nThe efforts of this firm to\ncontribute towards a more sustainable future\nfor our sector show just how important this category is. It is important we reward these achievements, as we look to inspire the use of innovation to further our processes.\nHere are the dates and deadlines you will need to know if you would like to submit an entry for the Company of the Year award:\nCompetition in this category is expected to be strong. Our judging panel are looking forward to learning more about the businesses that have shown remarkable agility, innovation, and performance within their supply chain operations.\nCo-located with\nSustainability LIVE\nProcurement LIVE\n, Supply Chain LIVE takes place on 8 and 9 September at QEII Centre, Westminster."},{"t":"通用汽车推进LMR电池电芯研发，LFP计划逐步淡出","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.electrive.com/2026/06/12/gm-advances-lmr-battery-cells-as-lfp-plans-fade/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"electrive","tg":"行业观察","tp":"锂锰富锂电池","kp":["[电池技术]: 锂锰富集LMR电芯","[电芯形态]: 棱柱形"],"sc":8.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":8.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"通用汽车（GM）正在重新审视其电动汽车电池战略，电池负责人Kurt Kelty透露公司将推进锂锰富集（LMR）电池电芯的研发，同时逐步缩减此前对磷酸铁锂（LFP）电池的计划投入。LMR正极材料兼具高能量密度和成本优势，被视为兼顾性能与经济性的下一代路线。GM的战略调整反映出美国车企在IRA政策环境和供应链本土化要求下，对电池技术路线的重新博弈。","ot":"GM advances LMR battery cells as LFP plans fade - electrive.com","b":"General Motors is reassessing its battery strategy for future electric vehicles. According to Kurt Kelty, the company’s head of battery development, GM is reconsidering earlier plans to introduce LFP cells and may instead focus on lithium manganese-rich (LMR) battery technology.\nAn LMR cell in prismatic format.\nImage: Steve Fecht für General Motors\nGeneral Motors continues to adjust its battery strategy. The US carmaker initially focused on nickel-based NMCA (nickel-cobalt-manganese-aluminium) cells before announcing plans to convert its cell plant in Spring Hill to produce LFP (lithium iron phosphate) batteries as lower-cost cell technologies gained traction. The company\nnow appears to be preparing another strategic shift.\nAccording to\n, GM’s battery chief Kurt Kelty revealed that the manufacturer plans to focus on developing lithium-manganese-rich (LMR) battery chemistry instead of LFP. This technology is expected to cost about the same as LFP cells but offer higher energy storage capacity for the same weight and volume.\nDespite the latest shift in strategy, the Spring Hill plant in Tennessee will begin producing LFP cells this month, Kurt Kelty confirmed. However,\nreports that these cells are intended for stationary energy storage systems rather than electric vehicles. Ultium Cells, the battery joint venture between General Motors and LG Energy Solution, had already announced in March that it would redirect\npart of its battery cell production in Tennessee from EV applications to stationary energy storage systems\n“There is a possibility where LFP does not ​earn its way into our portfolio,” Kelty told\n. He also described LMR as GM’s ‘workhorse’ technology. “That’s where we’re going to be using the big volume.” According to the news agency, GM has been developing LMR cells for over a decade.\nFord, too, sees significant potential in this technology\nLMR cell chemistry is a further development of conventional lithium-ion batteries that uses a cathode with a high manganese content. Because manganese is significantly less expensive than cobalt, the technology has the potential to reduce battery costs. At the same time, LMR cells are expected to deliver around 33 per cent higher energy density than LFP batteries at a comparable cost level. However, the technology still faces several challenges, including limited durability, high capacity loss and restricted fast-charging performance.\nGeneral Motors is collaborating primarily with LG Energy Solution on LMR development. Last year, the partners announced they were working on a new generation of prismatic LMR battery cells,\nwhich are expected to be market-ready by 2028\n. According to earlier reports, these prismatic LMR cells are intended primarily for GM’s electric pickups and large SUVs.\nOne aspect remains unchanged: the partnership between GM and LG Energy Solution is based on years of joint research. The two companies have been working on manganese-rich lithium-ion cell chemistry since 2015. According to LG Energy Solution, the company held more than 200 patents related to LMR technology as of May 2025, making it the largest holder of intellectual property in this field worldwide.\nBeyond the technological benefits, GM has also highlighted the strategic significance of LMR chemistry for the North American battery industry. According to the company, future LMR cell production could rely on domestic supplies of lithium, graphite and manganese.\nMost of the electric vehicles GM has brought to market so far are equipped with nickel-rich batteries. An exception is the recently introduced Chevrolet Bolt, which, as the most affordable electric vehicle in the lineup, features LFP cells from the Chinese battery manufacturer CATL.\nabout „GM advances LMR battery cells as LFP plans fade“"},{"t":"MOF中功能集成的异金属簇用于下一代先进热催化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00143-9?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"观点评论","tp":"异金属MOF热催化","kp":["[催化平台]: 异金属MOF限域孔道协同催化"],"dp":1,"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"本综述系统阐述了异金属金属有机框架在下一代先进热催化领域的最新进展。异金属MOFs通过在空间维度上精确调控不同金属中心并构筑限域孔道微环境，为多步串联催化和协同催化提供了变革性平台。文章重点讨论了双金属/多金属活性位点的协同效应、孔道限域对选择性的调控机制，以及在CO₂加氢、C-C偶联等关键催化反应中的应用前景，为理性设计高效多功能催化剂提供了理论框架。","ot":"Functionally integrated heterometallic clusters in MOFs for next-generation advanced thermal catalysis","b":"Heterometallic MOFs integrate spatially tailored metal centers and confined pore microenvironments, offering a transformative design paradigm for synergistic catalysis toward the selective synthesis of fine chemicals."},{"t":"从P型到双极性：D-A-D有机正极中醌核工程策略实现超高稳定性和高能量有机电池","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9678457?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"醌核有机正极","kp":["有机正极设计[D-A-D分子]: 醌核工程实现p型到双极性转变"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究提出了一种基于醌核工程化的给体-受体-给体（D-A-D）分子设计策略，开发超稳定、高能量密度的有机正极材料。通过将传统P型材料转变为双极性材料，实现了有机正极在充放电循环中的结构稳定性和容量提升。该策略有效解决了有机电池材料溶解性和循环寿命差的核心痛点，为可持续储能器件的商业化开辟了新路径。","ot":"From P‐Type to Bipolar: A Quinone‐Core Engineering Strategy in D‐A‐D Organic Cathodes for Ultra‐Stable and High‐Energy O","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In this study, we present a rational donor‐acceptor‐donor (D‐A‐D) molecular design strategy to develop high‐performance organic cathodes by enhancing the intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) effect. We designed and synthesized two organic molecules: 2,6‐bis(10H‐phenothiazin‐10‐yl)benzo[1,2‐d:4,5‐d’]diimidazole‐4,8‐dione (PTZBQ), featuring a strong quinone‐type acceptor core, and the control compound 2,6‐bis(10H‐phenothiazin‐10‐yl)benzo[1,2‐d:4,5‐d’]diimidazole (PTZTAB), without a quinone core. The strong push‐pull electronic structure of PTZBQ not only results in a significantly narrowed bandgap and improved electrode kinetics, but also allows the quinone core to contribute extra n‐type capacity, thereby remarkably boosting the electrode's specific capacity and reaction dynamics. Moreover, the extended π‐conjugation and D‐A‐D configuration‐induced polarity endow both small molecules with exceptional electrolyte dissolution resistance. Consequently, PTZBQ exhibits bipolar redox activity, delivering a high discharge potential of 3.05 V, a high specific capacity of 163.3 mAh g\n                    −1\n                     at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    , an excellent rate capability (77.6% retention at 5 A g\n                    −1\n                    ), and exceptional long‐term cycling stability with 89.4% retention after 5000 cycles at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    . DFT calculations and ex situ spectroscopy confirm that the unique D‐A‐D architecture possesses spatially separated n‐type and p‐type redox centers, facilitating the redox process. Our findings highlight that quinone‐core engineering enhances intramolecular charge transfer and represents a powerful approach for developing high‐performance cathode materials."},{"t":"氧化石墨烯的碎片化液晶","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00237-7?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧化石墨烯液晶","kp":["[新物态]: 碎化液晶态(向列液晶与聚集体间中间态)"],"dp":1,"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"Shen等人在氧化石墨烯体系中识别出一种'碎片液晶'（fragmented liquid crystals）新态，它存在于普通向列型液晶和完全有序液晶之间的中间态。该发现揭示了二维纳米片在溶致液晶自组装过程中的新物理机制，对理解胶体相变行为和调控石墨烯基宏观材料的有序排列具有重要指导意义，有望推动高性能石墨烯纤维和薄膜的可控制备。","ot":"Fragmented liquid crystals of graphene oxide","b":"Shen et al. identify fragmented liquid crystals in graphene oxide as an intermediate state between ordinary nematic liquid crystals and aggregation. Enabled by balanced inter-sheet interactions, large liquid-crystal domains fragment into small, sheet-scale regions while retaining fluidity and processability. This frustrated order provides an unexpected route to compact amorphous architectures distinct from conventional crystalline-oriented liquid-crystal assembly, suppressing large structural defects and combining high strength with toughness."},{"t":"Fox ESS与澳洲分销商签署10 GWh储能协议","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/fox-ess-signs-10-gwh-of-energy-storage-deals-with-aussie-distributors-1296388/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Renewables Now","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能系统供应","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"Fox ESS与澳大利亚多家分销商签署总容量达10 GWh的储能合作协议，成为澳洲户用和工商业储能市场的重要里程碑。该协议涵盖先进储能系统的供应与部署，反映了澳大利亚在分布式储能和可再生能源整合方面的强劲需求增长。Fox ESS此举将进一步巩固其在亚太储能市场的竞争地位，也凸显了全球储能产业加速扩张的趋势。","ot":"Fox ESS signs 10 GWh of energy storage deals with Aussie distributors","b":"Fox ESS signs 10 GWh of energy storage deals with Aussie distributors | Energy Storage News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nFrance opens 10-GW offshore wind tender\nabout 12 hours ago\nCypress Creek scores USD 3.5bn in funds for Arkansas solar-BESS giant\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nFox ESS signs 10 GWh of energy storage deals with Aussie distributors\nJun 12, 2026, 5:46:44 PM\nPlamena Tisheva\nEnergy Storage\nRegion/Country:\nAsia Pacific\nLatest top stories\nFrance opens 10-GW offshore wind tender\nabout 12 hours ago\nCypress Creek scores USD 3.5bn in funds for Arkansas solar-BESS giant\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nLatest in Energy storage\nVisual Fan energises European Energy's 120-MWh BESS in Romania\nJun 12, 2026\nChile kicks off power auction to contract 2.8 TWh/year under 15-year PPAs\nJun 12, 2026\nSolaria wins EUR 41m in state grants for agri-PV, BESS projects in Spain\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Australia\nWeekly renewables M&A round-up (June 8 - 12)\nJun 12, 2026\nQueensland sets aside more money for CopperString transmission link\nJun 12, 2026\nSembcorp closes Alinta deal, adds 13.8 GW to Aussie portfolio\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in ASIA & PACIFIC\nJapan’s Chubu invests in Indian renewable power producer Continuum\nJun 12, 2026\nSungrow tech picked for part of 600-MW H2 project led by China Coal\nJun 12, 2026\nCosmo Eco signs wind VPPA in Japan with Furukawa Electric\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Energy storage\nVisual Fan energises European Energy's 120-MWh BESS in Romania\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Australia\nWeekly renewables M&A round-up (June 8 - 12)\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in ASIA & PACIFIC\nJapan’s Chubu invests in Indian renewable power producer Continuum\nJun 12, 2026\nMost read stories\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"基于传感器内超维计算的柔性超分辨率电子皮肤实现压力场实时感知","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee4065?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性触觉感知","kp":["[计算架构]: 传感器内超维计算","[特点]: 稀疏阵列超分辨率压力感知"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究开发了一种柔性超分辨率电子皮肤，集成了传感器内超维计算架构，可实现实时压力场感知。该电子皮肤突破了传统触觉传感器空间分辨率受限于阵列密度的瓶颈，通过超维计算算法在传感器端直接完成信号处理与模式识别，显著降低了数据传输延迟和功耗。该技术对无人机等无人系统的状态评估、机器人灵巧操控和医疗可穿戴设备具有广泛应用前景。","ot":"Flexible, super-resolution skin with in-sensor hyperdimensional computing for real-time pressure field perception","b":"Precise, highly spatial resolution surface pressure measurement is critical for reliable state assessment of unmanned systems, such as the flight safety of unmanned aerial vehicles. Conventionally, the acquisition of such high-resolution data requires dense, expensive sensing arrays or relies on external computational resources. Here, we introduce a flexible electronic skin featuring a sparse sensing network integrated with in-sensor numerical hyperdimensional computing, thereby facilitating super-resolution sensing and in-sensor learning. This innovative approach processes sparse inputs to produce high-resolution pressure field maps on-device, enabling rapid real-time analysis and precise flight state identification. The numerical hyperdimensional computing enhances the efficiency of in-sensor learning, overcoming the limitations of conventional vector symbolic architectures previously confined to classification tasks. Furthermore, the integration of hyperdimensional computing substantially boosts the performance of the flexible sensing skin. Compared to the computer-aided super-resolution method, our approach reduces power consumption from ~40 watts to ~0.09 milliwatts, memory usage from ~2274 to ~32 kilobytes, and latency from ~115 to ~10 milliseconds, respectively. The achieved super-resolution capability reaches an enhancement factor of 5.517. Compared with conventional high-density sensing arrays, our approach reduces the number of interconnects by 91.5% (using a 4 by 4 array). Last, the developed super-resolution skin is applied in unmanned aerial vehicle flight control.","aip":1},{"t":"首次测量 Ia 型超新星相关能量下的 $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}(α,p)^{23}\\mathrm{Na}$ 反应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/vkcb-8hzg","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): C. Boomershine, D. W. Bardayan, R. J. deBoer, P. D. O'Malley, S. R. Carmichael, L. Caves, A. Davis, A. Gula, K. Howard, R. Kelmar, A. Mitchell, L. Morales, S. Moylan, D. Robertson, and E. StechSensitivity studies have found that the $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}(α,p)^{23}\\mathrm{Na}$ reaction has a significant influence on supernovae Ia (SNIa) nucleosynthesis, but no previous measurements of the reaction cross section have been reported. Astrophysical reaction rate estimates have been based upon meas…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 065804] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"首次测量风味变化中性电流衰减中随时间变化的 $CP$ 违规 ${B}^{0}→{K}_{S}^{0}{μ}^","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/nnt3-nyds","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): R. Aaij et al. (LHCb Collaboration)The decay of a b quark to a strange quark and a pair of leptons reveals the first indications of time-dependent CP violation.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231904] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"首款9合1热泵将用电负荷转变为能源枢纽","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/first-9-in-1-heat-pump-transforms-load-into-an-energy-hub/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"多功能热泵系统","kp":["[产品概念]: 九合一热泵作为家庭能源中枢"],"as":"前特斯拉高管Drew Baglino创立的Sadi公司推出集成九项功能于一体的热泵系统，将传统单一负荷设备转型为家庭能源枢纽。该热泵整合制热、制冷、热水、储能管理及电网交互等功能，旨在提升设备利用率与能效，降低家庭总能耗与碳排。这一架构思路将热泵从末端设备升级为分布式能源系统的核心节点，对家庭电气化与电网灵活调度具有示范意义。","sc":8.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.5,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"First 9-in-1 heat pump transforms load into an energy hub - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nDiffer Power and Tesla veteran Drew Baglino’s Sadi are treating the heat pump as the home’s energy core by pairing AI data center cooling with automotive-grade thermal tech.\nDiffer Power\nTechnology & Products\nDiffer Power\nDiffer Power will introduce its D1 Series at Intersolar Europe 2026 in Munich, positioning the residential heat pump as a power management hub rather than only a heating and cooling appliance.\nThe D1 Series is described as the world’s first 9-in-1 integrated solar-storage air-to-water heat pump system, combining space heating, cooling, domestic hot water, PV inversion, battery management, PCS, backup power, home energy management, and gateway control into one platform. It uses the low-GWP refrigerant R290 and is designed for European residential heating, cooling, and domestic hot water, including new-build homes, retrofit projects, and properties with existing or planned rooftop PV.\nConventionally one of the largest electrical loads in an electrified home, the heat pump here becomes the point where rooftop PV, battery storage, thermal demand, backup power, and household supply are coordinated. Rather than installing a separate heat pump, solar inverter, battery controller, and energy manager side by side, the D1 Series brings these functions into a single platform. The integrated hybrid solar inverter handles PV inversion and battery charge and discharge, works with stackable externally connected battery storage and can also recover waste heat from its power electronics to raise the heat pump’s COP.\nA single app brings the thermal and electrical sides of the system together as a single interface for setup, operation, monitoring, and maintenance.\nWith hybrid solar inversion integrated at the architecture level, the heat pump can work directly with PV and battery power, reducing some of the repeated AC/DC and DC/AC conversion stages associated with separate PV, storage, and heat pump installations. The platform can potentially improve overall system efficiency by more than 10%, through direct-drive operation, combined battery and thermal storage control, and energy-management algorithms. The system also follows available solar output, responding to PV generation rather than relying only on fixed schedules or basic external control signals.\nThe integrated emergency power supply function switches selected household loads to backup power during outages in a 0 ms transition, with backup duration depending on connected battery capacity and site configuration. Consolidating energy conversion, storage control, power management, and system control into one platform can reduce installation time by up to an estimated 50% versus conventional multi-vendor setups.\nGrid connection support is expected to cover major European standards, starting with UK’s G98/G99 and Italy’s CEI 0-21. The first range offers 12 kW, 14 kW and 16 kW heating capacities with 6 kW output, covering more than 90% of heating and power-use scenarios, with further versions planned for other residential and C&I (commercial and industrial) applications.\nDiffer Power will present the D1 Series at Intersolar Europe 2026, Hall C2, Booth 655.\nContact Differ Power\nfor more information.\nDiffer Power\nView author posts"},{"t":"细胞壁快速软化导致捕蝇草闭合","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed5051?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Plants can move rapidly without muscles, as seen in the Venus flytrap’s snapping lobes—a long-standing puzzle in plant biomechanics. Trap closure involves an elastic instability, but the active mechanical driver has remained elusive. Using in situ hydraulic and mechanical measurements, we identified the motor driving this transition. Closure occurs too quickly to be explained by water transport, revealing a distinct, nonhydraulic mechanism: a rapid (about one second) softening of the epidermal cell wall, releasing elastic energy stored in the trap. This represents the fastest modulation of wall mechanics reported in plants. Our finding reveals a mode of plant motility based on dynamic tuning of material properties, suggesting principles for muscle-free, bioinspired actuation."},{"t":"利用加拿大彭宁陷阱探索 $^{132}\\mathrm{Sn}$ 附近的天文学家","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/p2lt-gchf","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): A. A. Valverde et al.Nuclear isomers can have significant impacts on astrophysical nucleosynthesis processes, with recent efforts demonstrating that the population of isomeric states with different half-lives may require separate treatment in reaction networks to accurately capture the differences in heating or in ident…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 065803] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"细胞小型化的实验进化揭示了细胞尺寸进化的假定机制","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531280123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cell volume, a key determinant of physiology, is maintained by cell size homeostasis. Large deviations from typical size are often harmful, yet cell sizes have diverged drastically during evolution. How size homeostasis evolves to support such diversity without impairing cellular function remains unclear. To address this question, we used experimental evolution to progressively select for smaller\n                    Saccharomyces cerevisiae\n                    cells. Over 1,500 generations, we achieved a fourfold modal volume reduction compared to wild type. Despite this reduction, evolved populations maintained robust size homeostasis and relatively high fitness, revealing that substantial decreases in cell volume can occur without severe growth defects. Whole-genome sequencing and genetic perturbations identified mutations in the G1 cyclin Cln3 and the Target of Rapamycin (TOR) pathway effector Sch9 as major contributors to cell size reduction, with the Greatwall kinase Rim15 signaling cascade further modulating this phenotype. Manipulating these pathways produced a sixfold range in cell size without changes in ploidy, with engineered mutations recapitulating the volumes of evolved lines, and loss-of-function mutations yielding enlarged cells. Our results demonstrate the evolutionary plasticity of cell size homeostasis and reveal a putative mechanism for eukaryotic cell size evolution."},{"t":"非苯环芳香族化合物中的激发态反芳香性：用分子筛检查分子内质子转移的动力学","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6799620?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The relief of excited‐state antiaromaticity (ESAA) is a powerful driving force that underpins the photochemical behavior of photoexcited aromatic molecules. Photo‐induced isomerization, cycloaddition, or proton transfer pathways alleviate the large energetic destabilization caused by ESAA. However, the excited‐state dynamics of annulenes displaying only weak ESAA remain largely unexplored. Here, we fine‐tune the electronic character of a series of annulenes to minimize their ESAA. Excited‐state proton transfer (ESPT) converts hydroxytropyliums (HTs) and hydroxybenzotropyliums (HBTs) to their nonaromatic tautomers, which are only slightly lower in energy than the excited‐state antiaromatic forms. As a result of this near‐degeneracy, we find that HBTs exhibit weak photoacidity (pKa drop of 0.3–1.2 units) and unusually slow, reversible ESPT, proceeding on the ns timescale rather than the typical ps timescale. The fluorescence spectra of these HBTs display the hallmarks of ESPT emitters: (i) dual fluorescence; (ii) excitation‐dependent emission; and (iii) large Stokes shifts. The driving force for this ESPT is increased by the addition of electron‐donating groups, which promote intramolecular charge transfer. Our results demonstrate that judicious structural changes can moderate the ESAA of nonbenzenoid annulenes, minimizing the driving force for ESPT, which leads to slow proton transfer kinetics and weak photoacidity.","tp":"激发态芳香性","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"激发态反芳香性(ESAA)的缓解是光化学行为的重要驱动力。研究通过精细调控轮烯分子的电子特性来最小化ESAA，并利用分子筛探查分子内质子转移动力学，探索弱ESAA体系的激发态演化规律，对光化学和光功能材料设计有基础意义。"},{"t":"超越大自然的生物速度限制","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei3453?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Rapid cell wall relaxation initiates the snap of the Venus flytrap"},{"t":"Entrix将优化德国首个光储'灰色'同址共建项目","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/12/entrix-to-optimize-germanys-first-pv-plus-battery-grey-co-location-project/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光储一体化交易优化","kp":["光伏装机[德国共址]: 5.8 MW","储能装机[德国共址]: 6.35 MW"],"as":"Entrix公司将为德国首个光伏加储能'灰色'同址共建项目提供市场优化和基于AI的交易服务。该光储项目将太阳能发电与电池储能部署于同一地点,通过Entrix的AI算法实现电力市场的智能交易和收益最大化。这是德国能源转型中光储一体化商业化的重要里程碑,展示了AI驱动的虚拟电厂模式在欧洲电力市场中的应用潜力。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":8.0},"ot":"Entrix to optimize Germany's first PV-plus-battery 'grey' co-location project - Energy Storage","b":"Entrix has agreed to provide market optimization and AI-based trading services for a solar-plus-storage project developed by Suntec in Germany. The project combines a 5.8 MW solar plant and a 6.35 MW battery energy storage system (BESS) connected through a shared grid connection point.\nThe battery will operate as a “grey” storage asset, meaning it can charge from both the co-located solar plant and the electricity grid. According to Entrix, the configuration allows the solar installation to retain priority access to the grid connection, while the battery uses any remaining capacity.\nUnder the operating model, the battery will charge during periods of high solar generation and lower electricity prices, then discharge when renewable output falls and market prices increase. Entrix said the approach is designed to maximize use of the grid connection while providing additional system flexibility.\nThe project also includes a structured offtake arrangement with DB Energie, the energy subsidiary of Deutsche Bahn. Under a 10-year power storage agreement (PSA) based on Entrix’s FloorPlus model, DB Energie will secure day-ahead access to a defined portion of the battery’s flexibility in exchange for fixed capacity payments.\nEntrix said the arrangement will provide Suntec with predictable revenues and support project financing. Any battery flexibility not called upon by DB Energie will be optimized and marketed by Entrix across relevant electricity markets.\nEntrix CEO Steffen Schülzchen said combining fixed revenues with active market participation can improve the bankability of battery storage projects and help scale investment in flexibility assets needed to support renewable energy integration.\nFor Suntec, the project is intended to maximize the value of existing grid infrastructure. Managing Director Florian Golinski said the grey-storage configuration enables more efficient use of the grid connection while improving the overall economics of the combined solar and storage asset."},{"t":"人工抗氧化酶工程可增强缓解炎症性肠病的催化活性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5317513?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Developing artificial antioxidases represents a promising strategy for treatment of oxidative‐stress‐related disorders; however, their practical application is often hindered by insufficient catalytic activity. Here, we report a dual‐cobalt coordinated phthalocyanine carboxylate derivative (biCoPc) as an efficient artificial antioxidase with markedly enhanced reactive oxygen species scavenging capability for the alleviation of inflammatory bowel disease (IBD). Experimental studies combined with theoretical calculations reveal that the extended π‐conjugation and π‐electron delocalization within the dimeric phthalocyanine framework, together with the protonation‐deprotonation dynamics of peripheral carboxyl groups, synergistically promote a potential proton‐coupled electron transfer process at the dual‐cobalt active sites. This architecture accelerates electron transfer kinetics and creates a favorable catalytic microenvironment. Consequently, biCoPc exhibits high catalytic superoxide dismutase‐like and glutathione peroxidase‐like activities, along with robust stability under harsh conditions. Notably, biCoPc demonstrates pronounced anti‐inflammatory efficacy, efficiently alleviating IBD symptoms at both the cellular level and animal models. This work provides mechanistic insights into the rational design of high‐performance artificial enzymes and broadens their potential for biomedical applications.","tp":"人工抗氧化酶","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究报道了一种双钴配位的酞菁羧酸盐衍生物作为高效人工抗氧化酶，显著增强了活性氧清除能力。实验表明该材料可有效缓解炎症性肠病(IBD)中的氧化应激损伤，为氧化应激相关疾病的纳米酶治疗策略提供了新方案。"},{"t":"仿生响应性聚合物的配位键工程","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01074H","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配位键响应聚合物","as":"该研究聚焦配位键（coordination bonds）在仿生响应性聚合物中的应用。智能响应性高分子材料可将环境中微弱、异质的刺激信号转化为宏观层面的适应性形变或功能变化，类似生物体的感知-反馈机制。通过分子层面精确设计配位键（金属-配体动态键）的可逆性与强度，研究者试图赋予聚合物材料自修复、刺激响应、形状记忆等特性。此类材料在软体机器人、药物递送、柔性传感器等领域具颠覆潜力，当前瓶颈在于规模化合成一致性与长期循环稳定性。","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Engineering coordination bonds for bioinspired responsive polymers","b":"Responsive polymeric materials capable of converting weak and heterogeneous environmental cues into adaptive macroscopic functions are essential for emerging technologies spanning soft robotics, sensing, biointerfaces, and autonomous systems. Coordination-crosslinked polymer networks (CCPNs), constructed by embedding dynamic metal–ligand interactions into polymer matrices, have emerged as a powerful materials platform for this purpose, owing to the unique tunability, reversibility, and multifunctionality of coordination bonds. Unlike conventional covalent or other supramolecular crosslinks, coordination bonds provide continuously adjustable bond strength, well-defined geometry, stimulus-sensitive equilibria, and access to electronic, redox, and catalytic transitions, enabling direct transduction of physical and chemical stimuli into mechanical, optical, and morphological responses. Despite rapid progress, a unified understanding that links coordination chemistry at the molecular level to material responsiveness across length and time scales remains lacking. In this review, we systematically examine how the intrinsic properties of coordination bonds give rise to material responsiveness in CCPNs. We first introduce fundamental coordination chemistry concepts relevant to responsive network design and discuss how these factors govern bond dynamicity, exchange kinetics, and stimulus sensitivity within polymer networks. We then analyse how coordination dynamics manifest as macroscopic responses, with a focus on stiffness variation, optical and chromic switching, shape memory and actuation, and life-like homeostatic behaviors driven by non-equilibrium bond cycling. Moving beyond single-interaction systems, we highlight recent advances in bond coupling strategies, where multiple coordination motifs or coordination bonds integrated with other supramolecular bonds, dynamic covalent bonds, or mechanical bonds generate hierarchical relaxation, orthogonal responsiveness, and synergistic function expression reminiscent of biological materials. Finally, we discuss key challenges and outline future opportunities for transforming coordination chemistry from a crosslinking motif into a molecular-level control framework for engineering responsive and life-like soft materials."},{"t":"不确定性下绿色数据中心能耗感知作业调度：一种结构压缩谱风险控制方法","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007890?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"绿色数据中心调度","as":"","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Energy-aware job scheduling for green data centers under uncertainty: A structure-compressed spectral risk control appro"},{"t":"银河系中心过剩源的能量分布","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/dkcq-6y4f","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Florian List, Yujin Park, Nicholas L. Rodd, Eve Schoen, and Florian WolfThe Galactic Center Excess (GCE) may yet herald the discovery of annihilating dark matter. Weighing against that conclusion are analyses showing evidence for dim point sources within the spatial structure of the emission. Because of technical limitations these analyses are purely spatial with all sp…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231001] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"由异质代谢物分布驱动的合成交叉喂养群中出现的表型异质性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag357/8707057?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cooperation is crucial for constructions of all levels of life. But cooperation is often vulnerable, and understanding the underlying causes remains a grand challenge in ecology and evolution. Here we, by constructing a synthetic cooperative system consisting of two genetically engineered Escherichia coli strains with metabolic cross-feeding, demonstrate that cross-feeding, though it promotes the growth, amplifies cell noise of both strain populations in the bacterial consortium. The emergent phenotypic heterogeneity, expressed as the induced increase in cell noise by cross-feeding, is attributed mainly to enhanced resource heterogeneity and subsequent variation in gene expression among cells within each population. We further show that the positive interaction (including mutualism, commensalism and/or exploitation) also induces phenotypic heterogeneity in distinct microbial consortia consisting of bacterial strains isolated from aquatic, soil or rhizospheric environments. Our results reveal a cooperation-induced trade-off between population fitness and homogeneity, highlighting the importance of stochasticity in understanding the evolution of cooperation in microbiomes in nature.","tp":"合成交叉喂养","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者构建了由两种基因工程大肠杆菌组成的合成代谢交叉喂养系统，揭示了合作行为的脆弱性机制。实验表明，交叉喂养虽能促进群体生长，但会放大两种菌株群体内的细胞噪声，导致表型异质性的涌现。这一发现从合成生物学角度阐明了代谢物分布异质性如何驱动群体内个体差异的产生，为理解微生物群落合作的不稳定性提供了实验框架。该研究对人工微生物群落的理性设计具有指导意义，表明工程化共生系统可能自发产生难以预测的表型分化。"},{"t":"来自小角度质子散射的 $sd$ 壳核中的电偶极子强度","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/4yjj-ybpj","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): R. W. Fearick, O. Le Noan, H. Matsubara, P. von Neumann-Cosel, K. Sieja, and A. TamiiBackground: Total photoabsorption cross sections are important for an understanding of nuclear structure and for many applications, in particular in astrophysics. The majority of data stems from measurements of neutron emission after photoexcitation, which, in heavy nuclei, represent a good approxim…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064311] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"使用绿色溶剂高效可持续回收废旧锂离子电池：综述","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008123?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂电池绿色回收","kp":["[方法]: 绿色溶剂回收","[应用]: 废旧锂离子电池"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":2.5,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Efficient and sustainable recycling of spent Lithium-ion batteries using green solvents: A review"},{"t":"基于相干控制高效实现单量子三能级门集","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/vwzp-szjp","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单量子特门操作","kp":["[量子门]: 三能级qutrit门相干控制合成"],"dp":1,"as":"针对三能级量子系统（qutrit）的门操作实现效率问题，提出通过相干控制手段高效实现单qutrit通用门集。相比传统二能级qubit，qutrit具有更大希尔伯特空间，可提升量子信息密度与算法效率，但门操作控制更复杂。该工作在实验层面验证了相干控制方案对qutrit态制备与门变换的有效性，为多值量子计算硬件实现奠定基础。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Efficient Implementation of a Single-Qutrit Gate Set via Coherent Control","b":"Author(s): Xiang-Min Yu, Xiang Deng, Wen Zheng, Wei Xin, Tao Zhang, Hanxin Che, Kun Zhou, Haoyu Zhou, Yangyang Ge, Zhenchuan Zhang, Wanli Huang, Haoyang Cai, Xianke Li, Jie Zhao, Xinsheng Tan, Yu Zhang, Shao-Xiong Li, and Yang YuQutrits offer the potential for enhanced quantum computation by exploiting an enlarged Hilbert space. However, the synthesis of high-fidelity and fast qutrit gates, particularly for single qutrits, remains an ongoing challenge, as it involves overcoming intrinsic constraints in quantum platforms. He…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230803] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"建筑一体化防眩光彩色光伏组件的效率预测与实验验证","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008196?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"建筑彩色光伏","kp":["[应用]: 建筑集成BIPV","[特性]: 防眩光彩色组件"],"as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Efficiency prediction and experimental validation of anti-glare coloured photovoltaic modules for building integration"},{"t":"EVA粒子担忧新产能冲击，光伏玻璃推涨博弈加剧","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024326.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","b":"更多价格信息/报告分析，扫码进入小程序注册登录免费查看\n本周EVA粒子价格不变。下周来看，供应端增加预期下，业者对新产能冲击市场的担忧再起，部分商家积极出货，腾库降风险。而需求端，需求偏弱，下游投机意向不强，刚需补仓为主。多空交织之下，预计下周EVA市场价格或震荡。\n本周背板PET价格上涨，涨幅1.3%。美伊再次交火，国际油价趁势反弹，带动PX成本驱动力增强。PTA装置集中检修，PTA去库存中。担忧中东问题升级，原油行情上涨，成本因素暂时主导PTA市场。\n价格下降，降幅0.7%。基本面供应端运行良好，部分新产能持续投放，部分铝厂可能存在小范围减产情况，铝锭供应正常，铝锭、铝棒继续去库。需求端表现改善，铝价回撤较多，主要消费地的下游及终端灵活补库。预计下周铝价继续下挫空间有限。\n价格下降，降幅0.2%。货源流通平稳，市场升水小幅上行。下游采购活跃度有所回升，市场整体成交较前期温和回暖。预计短期现货铜价震荡调整。\n价格下降，降幅0.4%。下周来看，供应增加，需求下降，虽有成本上移，但库存有增加趋势，供应压力增加，价格或弱势下行。\n不变。近期，需求稳中缓慢升温，同时部分光伏玻璃窑炉冷修，供应压力稍缓。随着供需关系陆续修复，加之持续亏损背景下，玻璃厂家推涨积极，部分报价上调。下游用户接受程度不高，买卖双方博弈。下周来看，预计市场整体交投尚可，库存缓降。企业挺价心理明显，部分成交重心小幅上移。\n1、数据均为索比咨询整理，价格为均价，有疑问请联系我们，欢迎探讨\n2、索比咨询每周三、周四更新产业链价格趋势，敬请关注","tp":"光伏材料价格","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"as":"本周光伏产业链多材料价格分化。EVA粒子价格持稳，但新产能投放预期引发供应冲击担忧，商家积极出货降险，叠加需求偏弱、下游刚需为主，预计短期震荡。背板PET上涨1.3%，受中东地缘冲突推升原油及PX成本驱动，PTA集中检修去库。铝价、铜价小幅回落，铝锭继续去库、下游灵活补库，铜市场温和回暖。光伏玻璃方面，需求缓慢升温叠加部分窑炉冷修收缩供应，推涨博弈加剧。整体呈现成本端扰动与供需弱平衡交织格局。"},{"t":"配电网动态运行包络：当前进展、挑战与未来机遇","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600824X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"配电网动态运行包络","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":2.5,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Dynamic operating envelopes in distribution grids: Current advances, challenges, and future opportunities"},{"t":"双猝灭电荷转移在氧化还原活性伊红Y聚合物中实现创纪录的光催化硝酸盐还原制氨","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73686?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化硝酸盐制氨","kp":["[电荷机制]: 双淬灭电荷转移","[光催化剂]: Eosin Y氧化还原活性聚合物"],"dp":1,"as":"研究报道了一种基于双猝灭电荷转移机制的光催化硝酸根还原（NO3RR）制氨新策略。该体系通过同时猝灭两种电荷复合通道，显著抑制光生电子-空穴对的无谓损耗，从而将硝酸根高效转化为氨，实现了该反应的创纪录催化效率。该工作对氮污染治理、绿色氨合成具有重要意义，有望为氮循环闭环与可持续化肥生产提供新路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dual‐Quenching Charge Transfer Unlocks Record Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Photocatalytic Conversion in Redox‐Active Eosin Y Polym","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient photocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    RR) is vital for mitigating nitrogen pollution and producing green ammonia (NH\n                    3\n                    ). Although organic polymer photocatalysts show great potential for NO\n                    3\n                    RR, they frequently suffer from low charge separation efficiency. This limitation largely comes from the lack of suitable redox‐active moieties incorporated in the polymer photocatalysts toward NO\n                    3\n                    RR. Herein, we embed the redox‐active Eosin Y (EY) into a conjugated polymer backbone to synthesize a series of EY–X polymers (where X = benzene, biphenyl, or fluorene), in which the extended π‐conjugation can promote dual dynamic and static quenching for directional electron transfer. Upon visible‐light excitation, EY forms a long‐lived radical anion (EY\n                    •−\n                    ) that stores and relays electrons to nitrate, while ground‐state complexation between polymer and nitrate preorganizes the substrate for photoinduced directional electron transfer. This dual‐pathway mechanism extends charge‐separated lifetimes, inhibits recombination, and enhances electron delivery. Consequently, under cocatalyst‐free conditions, the EY–BE polymer achieves a record high NH\n                    3\n                    production of 215 µmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    . Experimental and computational investigations support the reversible EY/EY\n                    •−\n                    cycle and the nitrate‐binding ground‐state complex as the origin of activity and selectivity. This work demonstrates a rational strategy leveraging reversible redox‐active chromophores to integrate dual quenching for designing high‐performance NO\n                    3\n                    RR photocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"爆炸法制备双原子催化剂","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3998491?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"爆炸法双原子催化剂","kp":["[合成方法]: 爆炸法构建不对称双原子催化剂","[活性位点]: 双金属不对称配对"],"as":"研究提出了一种利用爆炸合成法快速制备双原子催化剂（DACs）的新策略。该方法利用瞬态高温高压的爆炸过程，使金属前驱体在载体上实现原子级分散并形成双原子活性位点，具有合成速度快、产率高、可规模化等优点。双原子催化剂因其协同效应在多种催化反应中表现出增强的活性与选择性，在电催化、能源转化等领域具有广泛应用前景。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dual Atom Catalysts Through Explosion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Dual atom catalysts (DACs) have attracted extensive attention due to their synergistic effects in enhancing various catalytic reactions, opening up new research directions in the fields of chemistry and material science. Strategically, constructing bimetallic pairs with asymmetric active sites is a key strategy for further improving DACs performances. However, achieving the universal synthesis of a structurally controllable library for DACs supported on inorganic materials remains a significant challenge. In this work, we propose a general strategy for synthesizing asymmetric DACs (A‐DACs) through molecular explosion, which can transiently generate extreme conditions in a confined space, offering capabilities that are difficult to realize by conventional approaches. Using this technology, we successfully prepared and systematically characterized 15 kinds of\n                    A\n                    ‐DACs containing different metal combinations (Cu‐Fe, Cu‐Co, Fe‐Pt, Ni‐Cu, Pt‐Pd etc.) and loaded them onto different inorganic carriers (Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    , TiN, TiO\n                    2\n                    , CeO\n                    2\n                    , MoS\n                    2\n                    , etc.). Moreover, Cu\n                    1\n                    Fe\n                    1\n                    /Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    and Pt\n                    1\n                    Pd\n                    1\n                    /MoS\n                    2\n                    are selected as model catalysts to investigate their worthwhile applications in diverse electrochemical reactions. This study provides an ingenious method for the rational design of atomic dispersed catalysts, which is of great significance in the fields of energy conversion and environmental governance scenarios."},{"t":"道奇展示搭载固态电池的肌肉车","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.electrive.com/2026/06/12/dodge-showcases-muscle-car-with-solid-state-battery/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"electrive","tg":"产业进展","tp":"固态电池","kp":["[电池类型]: Factorial固态电池","[应用]: Dodge Charger道路测试"],"as":"Stellantis集团将合作伙伴Factorial Energy提供的全固态电池电芯集成到一款研发测试车辆中进行实车验证，并由旗下道奇品牌展示了搭载该电池的肌肉车型。全固态电池相较传统锂离子电池具有更高能量密度、更优安全性及更宽工作温度范围，此次集成测试标志着全固态电池向量产乘用车应用迈出了关键一步。Factorial Energy的固态电解质技术有望显著提升电动汽车续航与安全表现。","sc":8.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Dodge showcases muscle car with solid-state battery - electrive.com","b":"Stellantis has integrated solid-state battery cells from its partner Factorial Energy into a development vehicle and has now launched a road-testing programme. The move follows the initial validation of the cells by Stellantis last year.\nImage: Stellantis\nStellantis has equipped a Dodge Charger Daytona development vehicle with a solid-state battery and will now use the technology demonstrator for real-world road testing. The programme is intended to assess the performance, safety and reliability of Factorial’s battery cells. According to the partners, this marks ‘the first integration of solid-state cells into a Stellantis vehicle.’\nThe partners are focusing their testing on Factorial’s FEST (Factorial Electrolyte System Technology), which combines a lithium-metal anode with a polymer separator Factorial began distributing B-samples of the solid-state cells, which offer a capacity of more than 106 Ah,\nin June 2024\n. In 2025, Stellantis and Factorial demonstrated fast charging with FEST cells featuring an energy density of 375 Wh/kg, charging from 15 to 90 per cent SoC in 18 minutes. Stellantis also\nvalidated these FEST cells last year\nFactorial Energy is a US-based developer of solid-state battery cells backed primarily by Stellantis, Mercedes-Benz and Hyundai-Kia. Alongside its FEST technology, the company is pursuing further development programmes. One example is its collaboration with Mercedes-Benz on solid-state cells marketed under the Solstice name. These cells are currently at the A-sample stage and are designed to offer higher energy density while using a dry cathode coating process.\nIn September 2024, Factorial stated that its Solstice cells could achieve an\nenergy density of up to 450 Wh/kg\n, although it remains unclear whether this figure refers to the cell or pack level. According to the company, this could increase the range of electric vehicles by up to 80 per cent. Factorial had previously also\nreported progress\nin reaching a cell capacity of 40 Ah for the Solstice technology.\nAs part of the road-testing programme with Stellantis, the carmaker says the transition from cell validation to integration in a development vehicle required the combined expertise of engineers from both companies. Stellantis developed a ‘patented new mechanical architecture’ to integrate the FEST cells into the existing battery pack. At the same time, the teams adapted the control systems and pack design ‘to bring out the best of solid-state cell performance.’ According to the partners, these technical modifications are essential to ensure cell performance under all conditions.\nThe Dodge Charger Daytona, with its integrated cells, will take centre stage in the upcoming calibration and test-drive programme. The model is\nan all-electric muscle car from Stellantis’ US brand Dodge\n, built on the\nSTLA Large platform\n. Shortly after the electric vehicle’s market launch in late summer 2024, Stellantis announced its intention to collaborate with Factorial on a demonstration programme to integrate solid-state cells into the Dodge Charger Daytona.\nNearly two years later, the programme is now set to begin\n“Battery development is a balancing act. It’s not enough to optimise a single metric. We need a system that delivers real benefits in a real vehicle,” said Ned Curic, Stellantis Chief Engineering and Technology Officer. The goal is to bring solid-state batteries closer to customers—’with the potential for longer range, faster charging and lower costs.’ Equally important, however, is the strong compatibility of FEST with existing lithium-ion manufacturing processes.\n“We are deeply honoured to work alongside Stellantis, one of the world’s great mass-market automakers, on this STLA Large-based development car,” said Siyu Huang, CEO of Factorial. “What we have built together, from cell chemistry to pack architecture to enable real-world road testing, is exactly the kind of deep, full-stack collaboration that solid-state has always required”\nabout „Dodge showcases muscle car with solid-state battery“"},{"t":"氮循环的不同轨迹","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei3391?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Water isotope measurements are used to model surface water nitrogen flows on a continental scale"},{"t":"氮循环沿景观水速梯度的发散演化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed0399?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Increasing fertilization has pushed the nitrogen cycle beyond planetary boundaries, yet its fate remains uncertain owing to long-standing neglect of landscape water velocities in nitrogen models. Leveraging isotope-aided modeling across 3821 European catchments, we demonstrate that evolution of nitrogen cycling is strongly linked to shifts in landscape water velocities since 1980. We propose the concept of “wetness boundaries,” where hydrological transitions beyond boundaries amplify nitrogen accumulation and leaching, whereas conditions remaining within boundaries mitigate these processes. Applying this framework, we project reduced nitrogen leaching across 76% of Europe under mild hydrological shifts by 2100 but increasing nitrogen accumulation under pronounced deceleration of water cycling in Eastern and Southern Europe. These findings underscore emerging water quality risks under climate change and the need to mitigate extreme hydrological shifts.","tp":"氮循环演化","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究揭示了氮循环演化与景观水流速变化之间的强关联。基于3821个欧洲流域的同位素辅助建模，发现自1980年以来化肥过度使用已将氮循环推出行星边界，而此前模型长期忽视景观水流速这一关键变量。研究提出\"湿度边界\"概念，指明水文条件跨越特定阈值后会显著放大氮的累积或流失。该发现为理解氮命运提供了新框架，对优化流域氮管理、预测气候变化下水文-养分耦合响应具有重要指导意义。"},{"t":"不同的氧化还原酶协调吲哚噻吩骨架的形成和 N-羟基化介导的生物活化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7072895?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Microbial sulfur‐containing secondary metabolite thienodolin (\n                    1\n                    ) features a unique tricyclic thieno[2,3‐\n                    b\n                    ]indole scaffold, yet its biosynthesis has remained enigmatic. Here, we uncover an unexpected enzymatic logic in which a consortium of distinct oxidoreductases cooperatively orchestrates indolethiophene skeleton formation and subsequent bioactivation, ultimately generating the authentic antibacterial metabolite thienoxidolin (\n                    10\n                    ). Following thiotryptophan formation by SDR enzyme TndE, the heme‐dependent DUF6875 enzyme TndD initiates C–S bond formation via\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation to yield a dearomatized tricyclic species, which is efficiently driven forward and stabilized by aromatization catalyzed by the FAD‐dependent oxidoreductase TndG. Notably, TndD functions as a bidirectional redox enzyme, reverting the\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxyl group to the stable N–H form to complete the indolethiophene scaffold construction. After amide formation, late‐stage\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation by the cytochrome P450 enzyme TndC, previously misassigned as the C–S bond‐forming enzyme, produces the bioactive product\n                    10\n                    . Intriguingly, TndD may also mediate the deactivation of\n                    10\n                    back to\n                    1\n                    , representing an intrinsic self‐protection mechanism. Together, these results expand the catalytic repertoire of heme‐dependent enzymes and highlight reversible\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation as a pivotal strategy for heterocycle formation and bioactivity regulation in microbial secondary metabolism.","tp":"微生物硫代谢","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"噻诺多林(thienodolin)是一种微生物来源的含硫次级代谢产物，具有独特的三环噻吩并[2,3-b]吲哚骨架，但其生物合成机制长期未明。该研究揭示了一种出乎意料的酶学逻辑：多种不同的氧化还原酶协同协作，分步完成了吲哚噻吩骨架的构建以及随后的N-羟基化介导的生物活化过程。这一发现阐明了噻诺多林生物合成中骨架形成与活化步骤的分工机制，为含硫天然产物的生物合成途径解析提供了新认知，对通过合成生物学手段挖掘和改造类似代谢产物具有指导意义。"},{"t":"能源与电力系统中的数字孪生：架构、应用、使能工具及公用事业可行路线图","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007816?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力系统数字孪生","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":2.5,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Digital Twins in energy and power systems: architectures, applications, enabling tools, and actionable roadmap for utili"},{"t":"从妊娠晚期胎盘中提取人滋养层干细胞的稳健方法的开发及其应用","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537884123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Trophoblasts are multifunctional cells in the placenta and essential for normal pregnancy. Although trophoblast dysfunction can cause pregnancy complications, the underlying mechanisms remain unclear, and effective treatments are limited, partly because of the scarcity of appropriate experimental models. We previously reported the derivation of human trophoblast stem cells (hTSCs) from 1st-trimester placentas and blastocysts, providing a powerful tool to investigate human trophoblast development and function. However, the difficulty in deriving hTSCs from late-gestation placentas has limited their application to pregnancy complication research. Here we report a robust technique to derive hTSCs from term placentas based on the transient expression of a p53 dominant negative mutant, SALL4, and shRNAs against cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitors. Using this technique, we derived and characterized hTSCs from placentas obtained from patients with early-onset preeclampsia (PE). PE-derived hTSCs exhibit impaired trophoblast invasion and reduced placental growth factor secretion, consistent with trophoblast abnormalities reported in PE. Therefore, this study provides a technological basis for investigating pregnancy complications associated with trophoblast dysfunction."},{"t":"在等离子体Au/NbS2异质结构中构建金属-半金属过渡金属硫族化物界面以增强催化性能","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71184?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"等离子体光电制氢","kp":["[光电极]: Au纳米颗粒修饰NbS2纳米片","[应用]: 等离子增强光电催化制氢"],"as":"研究在等离激元光电极中引入金属-半金属过渡金属二硫属化物异质界面，旨在开发低成本、高效率的光电极材料以推进太阳能驱动的化学反应。通过构建金属与半金属TMD的界面，利用等离激元局域表面共振效应增强光吸收与电荷分离效率，协同优化载流子传输路径。该策略为设计高性能光电催化体系（如太阳能水分解、CO₂还原）提供了新的界面工程思路。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Developing Metal–Semimetallic Transition Metal Dichalcogenide Interfaces in Plasmonic Au/NbS2 Heterostructures for Enhan","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The development of cost‐effective and highly‐efficient photoelectrodes (PE) is critical for advancing solar driven photoelectrochemical (PEC) hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) production technologies. For enhancing PEC performance, it appears promising to combine plasmonic nanoparticles with active catalysts. Here we report a facile and powerful PE comprised of Au nanoparticles (NP) decorated on NbS\n                    2\n                    nanoflakes (NF), directly grown on the carbon fiber paper. In this heterostructure, Au NP acts as plasmonic antennas that intensify local electromagnetic fields strengthening light matter interactions, NbS\n                    2\n                    NF functions as a highly conductive semimetal scaffold offering abundant active HER sites, and the junction of Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF enables efficient charge separation and fast electron transfer from NbS\n                    2\n                    to Au, thereby synergistically accelerating HER kinetics under illumination. Consequently, this Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF heterostructure, for the first time, demonstrates remarkable PEC performance under illumination, such as a 6‐fold increase in the exchange current density, a 1.75‐fold reduction in overpotential, and a 2.45‐fold yield in the H\n                    2\n                    production, respectively. Based on the heterostructure of Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF, this work establishes a strategy of constructing a cost‐effective and highly‐efficient PE and providing valuable insights into the rational design of next generation PE for the sustainable hydrogen production."},{"t":"基于单端多模光纤的深度学习驱动软机器人多功能形状感知","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef6263?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"软机器人形状感知","kp":["[感知方法]: 单端多模光纤+深度学习形状感知"],"dp":1,"as":"提出了一种基于深度学习的柔性机器人形状感知方法，仅通过单端传感即可实现对机器人整体形态的多功能化实时感知。柔性机器人发展为具身智能系统的核心瓶颈在于精确的本体感知能力——即对自身弯曲、扭转、空间构型的实时感知。该方法利用光纤或单端传感信号，结合深度学习网络解码形状信息，显著降低了传感系统复杂度与布线需求，为柔性机器人的自主控制与闭环反馈提供了简洁高效的解决方案。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Deep learning–enabled versatile shape perception for soft robots via single-ended multimode fiber","b":"The evolution of soft robots into embodied intelligent systems relies fundamentally on precise proprioception. However, a universal solution for capturing continuous deformations during diverse interactions, particularly in spatially confined interventional scenarios, remains lacking. Here, we introduce a deep learning–enabled versatile shape perception method based on a single-ended multimode fiber (MMF). By leveraging the intrinsic integration advantages of optics, our minimalist reflective architecture physically eliminates the dependence on complex demodulation units and distal devices. Furthermore, treating chaotic optical speckle fields as data streams encoding high-dimensional shape information, reconfigurable neural decoders resolve a single physical channel into versatile perception modes tailored to heterogeneous tasks: discrete state confirmation on soft grippers (&gt;99% accuracy), continuous shape tracking on bionic dexterous hands (~5-fold spatial resolution enhancement), and intuitive 3D morphological reconstruction of soft surgical robots (IoU&gt;0.93). Overall, our work establishes a versatile framework for breaking hardware adaptability limits via computation, laying a solid foundation for closed-loop control in digital twins of soft robots."},{"t":"双界面工程促进解耦传质传荷实现高效CO2电解","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73692?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电解界面工程","kp":["[界面工程]: 双界面工程解耦传质传荷","[目标产物]: CO2电解多碳产物"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦气-液-固三相界面（TPIs）对电化学反应动力学的关键调控作用。通过双界面工程策略实现质量传递与电荷传递的解耦，有望突破电催化（如CO2还原、氧还原等）中传质与电子转移相互制约的瓶颈。三相界面的结构优化是提升电化学反应速率与选择性的核心，双界面协同设计为高效催化剂的理性构建提供了新思路，对能源转换器件的性能提升具有重要工程价值。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Decoupling‐Facilitated Mass‐Charge Transfer via Dual‐Interface Engineering for Efficient CO2 Electrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The gas‐electrolyte‐electrode triple‐phase interfaces (TPIs) critically govern the kinetics of the electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction reaction (CO\n                    2\n                    RR) by regulating concerted proton‐electron transfer processes. However, sluggish mass transfer and the unbalanced adsorption of key intermediates within the local microenvironment of TPI remain major obstacles to efficient multicarbon product formation. Here, we report a dual‐interface strategy featuring amphiphilic and biphasic architectures to decouple mass‐charge transfer, achieved through in‐situ electrochemical activation of a polydimethylsiloxane (PDMS)‐modified Cu‐BTC electrode. The hydrophilic/hydrophobic interface promotes the synergistic mass transfer of CO\n                    2\n                    and protons within the TPI microenvironment, whereas the amorphous/crystalline interface modulates the electronic structure of catalytic active sites to optimize the adsorption kinetics of key intermediates. Such decoupling‐mediation accelerated C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    Faradaic efficiency (FE) exceeding 86% at ‐0.9 V (vs. reversible hydrogen electrode, RHE), over 2.5 times higher than that of the control groups. This work highlights the potential of dual‐interface decoupling engineering to simultaneously optimize CO\n                    2\n                    mass transport pathways and intermediate adsorption kinetics, thereby enabling highly efficient electrosynthesis of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    4\n                    .","aip":1},{"t":"高温摩擦电传感与电磁屏蔽柔性聚合物薄膜的解耦与从头设计","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73667?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高温摩擦电薄膜","kp":["[器件设计]: 解耦电荷产生与收集","[应用]: 高温摩擦电传感与电磁屏蔽"],"as":"该研究针对摩擦纳米发电机（TENG）在微能源收集与自驱动传感领域的应用需求，提出柔性聚合物薄膜的解耦设计与从头设计（de novo design）策略，重点解决高温环境下摩擦电材料的稳定输出问题。高温TENG对极端环境下的可穿戴设备、工业物联网传感节点供电具有关键意义。通过分子级结构调控实现高输出、耐高温、柔性兼备的聚合物薄膜，为自驱动系统的工程化落地奠定材料基础。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Decoupling and De Novo Design of Flexible Polymeric Films for High‐Temperature Triboelectric Sensing and Electromagnetic","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymer‐based triboelectric nanogenerators (TENGs) are shining in fields of micro‐energy harvesting and active sensing by virtue of their flexibility and processability. However, thermionic emission and thermal deformation reduce triboelectric output and distort sensing signals, thereby limiting practical applications in high‐temperature environments. Herein, the charge generation and collection units of polymeric TENGs are decoupled for separate\n                    de novo\n                    design. A dipolar glass polymer, cardo poly(aryl ether) (CPAE), is synthesized with alternating pendant and main‐chain dipoles and bulky, rigid cardo substituent. Aromatic polyphenol‐anchored MXene nanosheets are subsequently crosslinked and sandwiched within thermostable CPAE films, which improves resistance to high‐temperature oxidation. Thanks to the interlayer modulation of MXenes, the total and absorption electromagnetic shielding effectiveness of the resulting film rises by 55% and 195% compared to pristine MXene films, respectively. Even after annealing at 250°C for 24 h, the shielding effectiveness decreases by only ∼1.5%. Moreover, the resulting TENG exhibits an unusual heat‐induced triboelectric enhancement, with an output voltage of 472.2 ± 0.9 V and a power density of 2250.6 ± 27.7 mW/m\n                    2\n                    at 250°C, which compares favorably with most reported polymer‐based TENGs. This work provides a novel technical pathway for flexible electromagnetic protection and self‐powered sensing under extreme operating conditions."},{"t":"温带落叶橡树的碳同化和生长对干旱的反应脱钩","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady7139?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The magnitude of the terrestrial carbon sink remains a key uncertainty in future climate projections, in part due to poorly understood links between carbon uptake and its allocation to woody biomass in vegetation. Here, in this study, we show that photosynthesis and aboveground growth occur asynchronously across diel to seasonal scales in eight North American oak species. Across 137 tree ring sites, current-year annual growth was insensitive to climate variability after midsummer despite 26 to 36% of annual gross primary productivity (GPP) occurring during this period. Hourly GPP flux and growth measurements at four sites spanning seven site years further demonstrate that wood formation ceases earlier than photosynthesis and is restricted to periods of low atmospheric aridity and temperature. This photosynthesis-growth decoupling intensifies with interannual variability in vapor pressure deficit (\n                    r\n                    = 0.86,\n                    P\n                    &lt; 0.05), suggesting that by assuming tight coupling between photosynthesis and woody biomass, current earth system models may overestimate long-term carbon sequestration in forests.","tp":"森林碳汇干旱","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究发现温带落叶橡树的碳同化（光合作用）与地上生长之间存在脱钩现象。通过对北美8个栎属树种、137个年轮样地的分析，研究揭示光合作用与地上木质生物量积累在昼夜到季节尺度上均不同步：仲夏之后当年生长对气候变率不再敏感，尽管碳吸收仍在持续。这一发现挑战了\"碳吸收即等于森林碳汇\"的传统假设，表明植被碳汇的关键不确定性源于碳 uptake 与向木质生物量分配之间的解耦关系。这对改进全球碳循环模型、预测未来气候情景下的陆地碳汇规模具有重要意义。"},{"t":"离散基础上的三体共振衰减","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/1jb6-p2kh","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): J. Casal and J. Gómez-CamachoWe present a theoretical framework for calculating the asymptotic properties and decay dynamics of three-body resonances described in a discrete basis. The method involves solving an inhomogeneous Schrödinger equation to determine the non-normalizable resonant state by identifying a normalizable sou…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064608] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"解析大气强迫海洋动力学的数据驱动全球海洋模型","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed1225?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"AI海洋动力学模型","kp":["[方法]: 深度学习海洋-大气耦合模型"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用数据驱动（深度学习）方法构建全球海洋模型，能够解析大气强迫驱动的海洋动力学过程。传统海洋数值模型计算成本高、分辨率受限，而AI方法已在天气预报领域展现出超越传统数值模型的能力。该模型旨在刻画风应力、热通量等大气强迫对海洋环流、海表温度及多尺度海洋动力过程的调制，对海洋气候预测、极端事件预警及气候长期演变研究具有重要应用价值。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Data-driven global ocean model resolving atmospherically forced ocean dynamics","b":"Artificial intelligence has advanced global weather forecasting, outperforming traditional numerical models in both accuracy and computational efficiency. Nevertheless, extending predictions beyond subseasonal timescales requires the development of deep learning (DL)–based ocean-atmosphere coupled models that can realistically simulate complex oceanic responses to atmospheric forcing. This study presents KIST-Ocean, a DL-based global three-dimensional ocean general circulation model. Comprehensive evaluations demonstrate the model’s robust ocean simulation skill and efficiency. Moreover, it reproduces ocean responses, such as Kelvin and Rossby wave propagation, and vertical motions induced by wind stress curl, demonstrating its ability to represent key atmospherically forced ocean dynamics underlying climate phenomena, including the El Niño–Southern Oscillation. These findings reinforce confidence in DL-based global weather and climate models by demonstrating their capacity to capture essential ocean-atmosphere relationships. Building on this foundation, the present study paves the way for extending DL-based modeling frameworks toward integrated Earth system simulations, thereby offering substantial potential for advancing long-range climate prediction capabilities."},{"t":"Anthropic推出与客户竞争的应用，引发用户担忧","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/customers-say-anthropic-plays-favorites","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"the information","as":"Anthropic推出与自家客户产品直接竞争的应用程序，引发生态合作伙伴的担忧与不满。该公司既提供Claude API等底层模型服务，又面向终端用户和企业推出上层应用，形成\"既当裁判又当选手\"的双重角色。客户担心其掌握的API调用数据可被用于优化竞品，削弱第三方开发的差异化优势。这一矛盾折射出基础模型公司向应用层扩张时普遍面临的信任与利益冲突问题。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI应用竞争","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Customers Fret as Anthropic Launches Apps That Compete with Theirs","b":"Customers Fret as Anthropic Launches Apps That Compete with Theirs — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"${\\mathrm{NiPS}}_{3}$ 中的晶体场调谐自旋翻转发光","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/7y26-3skd","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Léonard Schué, Nashra Pistawala, Hebatalla Elnaggar, Yannick Klein, Christophe Bellin, Johan Biscaras, Fausto Sirotti, Yves Lassailly, Fabian Cadiz, Luminita Harnagea, and Abhay ShuklaLayered magnetic materials provide the opportunity for fundamental investigations of magnetism in the two-dimensional limit. ${\\mathrm{NiPS}}_{3}$, a prototype member of this family, is antiferromagnetic below 155 K and exhibits sharp photoluminescence associated with a transition between a triplet …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236401] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026","tp":"二维磁性材料","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"${\\mathrm{NiPS}}_{3}$是一种层状反铁磁材料(155 K以下有序)，展现出与三重激发态相关的锐利光致发光。本研究利用低温光发射光谱结合X射线光谱，系统揭示了其晶体场对该发光特性的调谐机制。作者发现通过改变晶体场环境，可以实现自旋翻转跃迁发光的可控调节，为二维极限下磁性-光学耦合的基础研究提供了新视角。该工作深化了对层状磁性材料中自旋-光子相互作用的理解，对基于二维材料的自旋电子学和量子光学器件设计具有潜在意义。"},{"t":"加密货币交易员押注 SpaceX IPO 涨幅达 20%","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/crypto-traders-bet-spacex-ipo-popping-20","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Crypto Traders Bet on SpaceX IPO Popping 20% — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"可再生能源与制氢系统耦合优化策略：基于VSEL框架的综述","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008639?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源制氢","kp":["[框架]: VSEL框架","[应用]: 可再生能源-制氢耦合优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Coupling optimization strategies for renewable energy and hydrogen production systems: A review based on the VSEL framew"},{"t":"货物与自噬受体的偶联是内质网自噬的关键步骤","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee9856?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"During cell stress, endoplasmic reticulum autophagy (ER-phagy) receptors remodel the ER by sequestering membrane proteins (cargo) into autophagosomes for degradation. The conserved ER-phagy receptor, Atg40, contains a motif that binds to Atg8 and a reticulon homology domain that is needed for vacuolar/lysosomal delivery. Cargo capture, however, requires the Atg40 binding partner Lst1/SEC24C. To address whether lipids regulate cargo capture during ER-phagy, we analyzed autophagy in neutral lipid–deficient cells. Unexpectedly, we found that Atg40 was delivered to the vacuole in autophagosomes without Lst1/SEC24C or cargo in mutant cells. Lipidomic analysis revealed changes in the ratio of phosphatidylethanolamine to phosphatidylcholine in the neutral lipid–deficient cells that are predicted to alter ER membrane bendability. Our findings imply that phospholipids control cargo sequestration by regulating receptor-cargo coupling at autophagic sites."},{"t":"热模型中馈送强子的相关性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/g91z-tnyh","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Claude Pruneau, Victor Gonzalez, Oveis Sheibani, Chun Shen, Yash Patley, Basanta Nandi, and Ana MarinWe examined the potential impact of decays on the magnitude of fluctuations of net quantum numbers and integrals of balance functions based on a thermal hadron gas model. The calculations are based on a comprehensive list of known hadrons with masses up to $2.5\\phantom{\\rule{0.28em}{0ex}}\\mathrm{GeV…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064905] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"更正：《硼氢化物氧化作为还原电合成中的对电极反应》","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1331602?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼氢化物电合成","as":"针对此前发表于《Angew. Chem.》（作者J. Kuzmin、M. Lill、G. Ahumada等）关于硼氢化物（BH4-）氧化作为还原电合成阳极对反应的研究论文的更正。该工作探讨硼氢化物在电解还原反应中替代析氢反应作为阳极对反应的可行性，属于绿色电合成方向。本条仅为勘误更正，非新研究。","sc":1.1,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":0.5,"r":1.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Correction to “Borohydride Oxidation as Counter Reaction in Reductive Electrosynthesis”","b":"J. Kuzmin, M. Lill, G. Ahumada, et al., “Borohydride Oxidation as Counter Reaction in Reductive Electrosynthesis”, Angewandte Chemie International Edition 64 (2025): e202501653, https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202501653. During post-publication review, we identified the following errors that we wish to correct: Cross-references to reference 55 for the yields reported using Method A and reference 63 for yields reported for Method K are missing. Note b in the caption for Figure 2 should refer to isolated yields, whereas note c refers to yield determined by GC. In the caption for Figure 3, note a should refer to yield determined by HPLC, and the current note c should be removed. The original Supporting Information file was replaced with a corrected version in which the 1H- and 13C-NMR spectra for compound 2c were replaced with the correct versions. We wish to emphasize that none of these corrections affect the scientific conclusions, narrative, or integrity of the published work. All key findings and interpretations remain unchanged. We apologize for this error."},{"t":"更正 Huang 等人，水稻种子发育和食用品质所需的镁外流转运蛋白","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2618101123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"更正 Green 等人的观点，肠道微生物群影响营养免疫和鲍姆不动杆菌抵抗力","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2618284123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"对 Ajourlou 等人的修正，上地幔温度阐明了冰岛热点轨迹和对冰的理解 –","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2617340123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"胆甾相发光液晶中圆偏振发光的调控：从FRET到激子耦合","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1985010?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性液晶圆偏振发光","kp":["[发光体系]: 胆甾相发光液晶N*LLC","[手性诱导剂]: 罗丹明基R1/S1"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦于手性发光液晶材料中的圆偏振发光（CPL）控制。圆偏振发光在光信息处理、3D显示、光学防伪等领域具有应用潜力，核心挑战在于同时实现波长可调与高不对称因子。研究通过手性液晶基质调控发光体的发射特性，有望突破传统CPL材料发光效率与偏振度难以兼顾的瓶颈。该方向属于光电功能材料前沿，若能在发光不对称因子与可加工性上取得实质进展，将推动柔性光电器件及光学加密技术的发展。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Control of Circularly Polarized Luminescence in Cholesteric Luminescent Liquid Crystals: From FRET to Exciton Coupling","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving circularly polarized luminescent (CPL) materials with tunable wavelength and high dissymmetry factor (\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    ) still faces great challenges. Cholesteric luminescent liquid crystal (N*LLC) is one of the most promising chiral systems to solve the above challenges. In this work, a pair of luminescent chiral inducers R1/S1 were synthesized by incorporating a rhodamine luminophore to a binaphthyl chiral scaffold and were doped into 5CB to construct N*LLC. As the concentration of the doped achiral naphthalimide derivative (NIA) increased, the CPL wavelength sequentially blue‐shifted from red to yellow and then to green, the\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    also increased to 0.3, which is fundamentally different from the conventional regulation with red‐shifted chiral luminescence. Moreover, the introduction of trifluoroacetic acid enabled the emitted CPL was reversibly switched, allowing reversible control of wavelength and\n                    g\n                    lum\n                    . Theoretical calculations revealed that, FRET‐dominated process transforms into exciton coupling (EC)‐governed interactions with the NIA concentration increased. This work demonstrates a feasible strategy of achieving reversible control of CPL within a single supramolecular system, offering new insight into the development of adaptable chiral photonic devices."},{"t":"纳米流体黏土膜中构建连续层间氢键网络实现快速阳离子传导与阴离子截留","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73660?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米流体粘土膜","kp":["[膜工程]: 层间连续氢键网络","[功能]: 抗溶胀+快速阳离子传导","[应用]: 渗透能收集"],"as":"该研究聚焦于二维黏土纳米流体膜用于盐差能收集。盐差能（渗透能）是蓝色可再生能源的重要分支，通过纳米通道内离子的选择性输运实现发电。现有二维纳米流体膜面临离子选择性与通量之间的权衡困境。研究提出在黏土纳米通道中构建连续层间氢键网络，以提升离子选择透过性与机械稳定性。该策略有望为高性能渗透能器件提供新思路，对蓝色能源规模化利用具有意义。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Constructing Continuous Interlayer Hydrogen‐Bond Network in Nanofluidic Clay Membranes for Fast Cation Conduction and An","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Two‐dimensional clay nanofluidic membranes hold great promise for harvesting sustainable osmotic energy, yet their practical application is constrained by two core challenges. (1) The inherently tortuous and inefficient ion transport pathways within stacked nanosheet structures limit cation flux, and (2) the severe swelling of interlayer nanochannels in aqueous environments impairs ion selectivity and long‐term stability. To simultaneously tackle these challenges, we construct a continuous hydrogen‐bond network within the interlayer of a lamellar membrane (CHM) via a sequential crosslinking strategy. This engineered network serves a dual function: (1) establishing low‐energy barrier pathways to facilitate cation transport while (2) acting as a dynamic yet robust crosslinked matrix to anchor clay nanosheets for suppressing interlayer expansion. Experimental and theoretical results confirm that the negatively charged surface, in synergy with the hydrogen‐bond network, enables selective and rapid cation transport. The ionic conductivity of in‐plane transport reaches as high as 22 S m\n                    −1\n                    in 1 \n                    m\n                    electrolyte. When employed for osmotic energy harvesting from artificial seawater and river water, the CHM delivers an impressive high‐power density of 22.7 W m\n                    −2\n                    and maintains stable power output for over 30 days. Furthermore, an integrated osmotic power generator successfully drives multiple electronic devices, demonstrating its real‐world applicability.","aip":1},{"t":"用于柔性无线电子器件的共形透明高效MXene网格天线","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee8104?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MXene柔性透明天线","kp":["[材料]: Ti3C2Tx MXene","[工艺]: 纳米压印光刻-刮涂法","[器件]: 共形透明高效天线"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了基于MXene的共形、透明、高效柔性栅网天线，面向物联网无线电子设备需求。传统柔性天线在透明度与导电性之间难以兼顾，MXene作为二维过渡金属碳化物兼具高电导率与可加工性。研究通过栅网结构设计实现高透光率与优良射频性能的平衡，适用于可穿戴、贴肤及曲面设备。该成果对物联网、柔性电子及可穿戴通信具有重要意义，若在长期机械稳定性上达标则具备商业化前景。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Conformal, transparent, and efficient MXene grid antennas for flexible wireless electronics","b":"Next-generation internet of things (IoT) wireless electronics require antennas that are conformal, transparent, and electromagnetically efficient, yet these attributes form an impossible trinity. Here, we realize the first Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    MXene–based conformal, transparent, and high-performance antenna through an optimized nanoimprint lithography-blading technique. Nanoimprinted MXene grid transparent conductive film (TCF) achieves an exceptional balance of low sheet resistance (4.32 ohms per square) at high transmittance (~89.1%) with promising flexibility. Two representative scenarios in IoT networks are selected to demonstrate the versatility of this TCF. For personal devices, the efficient MXene transparent dipole antenna enables a quasi-transparent wireless wearable device for long-distance and real-time communication (&gt;30 meters). For fixed infrastructure, MXene-based digital coding metasurface enables high-quality wireless communication, maintaining a low bit error rate (~0.15%) even in a curved state. This work establishes MXene as a versatile platform that successfully merges conformal transparency and high electromagnetic performance, paving the way for next-generation imperceptible IoT wireless systems."},{"t":"限域调控晶体相工程构建结构化半导体纤维系统用于植物蒸腾监测","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73693?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半导体纤维蒸腾传感","kp":["[应用]: 分布式植物蒸腾监测纺织平台","[工程策略]: 约束调控晶体相工程"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用限域调控的晶相工程构建结构化半导体。限域环境（如纳米孔道、界面）可调控晶体生长的相结构与形貌，从而优化半导体光电性能。晶相工程是半导体领域的前沿方向，不同晶相在载流子输运、带隙调节上差异显著，通过精确限域控制有望实现特定功能相的稳定合成。该工作将限域结晶策略引入半导体材料设计，对光电子器件、催化与能源存储具有潜在价值，有望为新型功能半导体开发提供新路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Confinement‐Regulated Crystal Phase Engineering Enables Structured Semiconductor Fiber Systems for Plant Transpiration D","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Transpiration is fundamental to plant life, yet its rhythms remain difficult to resolve because conventional sensing approaches perturb stomatal boundary layers, are limited to localized readouts, and struggle to reconcile moisture responsiveness with stable photodetection under dynamic humidity fluctuations. Herein, we report the first distributed plant microclimate mapping textile platform constructed from semiconductor fibers enabled by two distinct confinement‐regulated crystal phase engineering strategies. Local spatially confined thermal reconfiguration induces optimized crystallization of the semiconductor fiber core, whereas nanosphere confinement governs humidity‐triggered, reversible phase switching in the perovskite fiber cladding between CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    and CsPb\n                    2\n                    Br\n                    5\n                    , enabling stable photodetection together with reversible humidity response. Continuous thermal drawing and polymer coating establish a scalable route to kilometre‐scale fiber fabrication, yielding fibers with sophisticated structure that sustain linear photodetection with an on/off ratio exceeding 50 over 10 000 switching cycles while maintaining fatigue‐free humidity sensing over 600 cycles. Woven into breathable textiles, the fiber arrays enable sub‐centimetre spatial mapping and, in commercial greenhouses, resolve spatial irradiance variations as small as 10 mW/cm\n                    2\n                    within real microclimates, revealing microclimate heterogeneity relevant to plant transpiration and growth. These results establish phase‐engineered semiconductor fiber textiles as a scalable platform for distributed plant microclimate mapping and precision agriculture."},{"t":"对人类引起的塔克拉玛干沙漠生物圈碳汇的担忧","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2612132123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","tp":"沙漠碳循环","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"概念优先级在自然视觉注意过程中塑造个人注视模式","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604369123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Our visual landscape consists of not only people, places, and objects (e.g., “soldier,” “stadium,” “flag”) but also the conceptual relationships that unite them (e.g., “patriotism”). Because conceptual knowledge varies across individuals, this level of structure may support individualized patterns of attentional selection during naturalistic scene viewing. Here, we ask whether individuals’ gaze patterns reflect, in part, latent attentional priorities organized in conceptual space. Participants (N = 61) freely explored a diverse set of immersive real-world scenes (N = 100) in head-mounted VR while their gaze position was continuously recorded. We modeled gaze behavior using spatial, visual, and conceptual feature spaces, leveraging embeddings from large vision and language models, to uncover the latent priorities guiding individuals’ unique patterns of selective attention across environments. Individuals exhibited stable and idiosyncratic gaze patterns across scenes and test–retest sessions, consistent with trait-like individual differences in attention. Spatial, visual, and conceptual feature spaces each explained unique variance in individual gaze patterns, with conceptual features contributing variance beyond that explained by spatial and visual features alone. Notably, language-model–based predictions were particularly effective at capturing these individualized patterns. Together, these findings indicate that naturalistic visual attention is structured at multiple levels—including a conceptual level—revealing stable individual differences in how people sample and prioritize information across complex visual environments."},{"t":"复合气候事件威胁热带半封闭海洋生态系统","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adv0367?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Anthropogenic ocean warming affects ecosystem functioning but is not necessarily the primary climate driver regulating tropical seas. Tropical semi-enclosed marine ecosystems are poorly understood, geographically distinct, and influenced by compounding impacts from global warming, cyclones, monsoons, freshwater influx, and massive sea-level and circulation variability. We unify climate risk understanding of these large-scale integrated ocean-atmosphere-biological systems, showing that compound climate events expose resident species to larger, prolonged fluctuations, causing reconfigured spatial patterns and lack of sustained hydrological connectivity. We attribute changes in species’ abundance in these systems to complex and cumulative combinations of extreme temperatures, exposure, turbidity, and hydrologic connections. We describe evidence of such climate-induced physical and biological regime shifts in tropical marine ecosystems in northern Australia and identify implications for other systems."},{"t":"基于离散调制的可组合自由空间连续变量量子密钥分发","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adv1440?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"连续变量量子密钥分发","kp":["[调制方式]: 离散调制位移相干态","[传输介质]: 自由空间","[协议]: 连续变量QKD"],"dp":1,"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究提出一种可组合的自由空间连续变量量子密钥分发（CV-QKD）方案，采用离散调制技术。CV-QKD具备与标准电信设备兼容的优势，而离散调制相比传统高斯调制简化了收发端硬件复杂度。该方案通过自由空间信道传输，支持模块化组合配置，为未来城域量子网络与卫星量子通信的实际部署提供了灵活且可扩展的解决方案，在工程化实现上迈出重要一步。","ot":"Composable free-space continuous-variable quantum key distribution using discrete modulation","b":"Continuous-variable (CV) quantum key distribution (QKD) allows for quantum secure communication with the benefit of being close to classical coherent communication. In recent years, CV QKD protocols using a discrete number of displaced coherent states have been studied intensively as the modulation can be directly implemented with real devices with finite resolution. Until now, experiments only calculated key rates in the asymptotic regime. Here, we present a CV QKD system using discrete modulation that is especially designed for atmospheric channels. We use polarization encoding to exploit the nonbirefringent nature of the turbulent atmosphere. This allows to expand CV QKD networks beyond the existing fiber backbone. In a laboratory demonstration with a static 3-decibel loss channel, we implemented a recently developed security proof allowing to calculate composable finite-size key rates against independently and identically distributed collective attacks. We applied the full QKD protocol including a quantum random number generator, error correction, and privacy amplification to extract secret keys."},{"t":"纯色有机发光体：特性、定义、物理基础与基本设计原理","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9990265?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"纯色有机发光体","kp":["[发光体]: 多共振/聚甲炔窄光谱有机发光体"],"sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":2.0},"as":"本综述系统梳理了纯色有机发光体的特征、定义、物理基础与基本设计原理。具有窄光谱特性的全有机发光材料在高显色显示器和照明领域备受关注。文章深入讨论了发光纯度的评价指标（如FWHM半峰宽和CIE色坐标）、影响光谱展宽的分子与聚集态因素，以及通过分子工程调控发光纯度的设计策略，为高色域OLED材料的理性开发提供了全面理论指导。","ot":"Color‐Pure Organic Luminophores: Characteristics, Definitions, Physical Basis and Fundamental Design Principles","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Color‐pure all‐organic emitters, i.e., with narrow spectral characteristics, are intensively studied for high‐definition organic LEDs (mainly based on multi‐resonance structures), as well as for multi‐color bioimaging (mainly based on polymethine‐like structures). To guide targeted materials design beyond tedious trial‐and‐error procedures, this educative review discusses the spectral characteristics (including units and unambiguous definition of the spectral width, and the occurrence of artifacts), the physical basis of the spectral broadening (vibronic coupling, environmental effects, and a basal understanding of geometries in the ground and excited states). Subsequently, the structural factors are distilled, which govern reduced geometry change between ground and excited state (GS, ES)—quantified as the change in bond‐length alternation (Δ\n                    BLA\n                    ) upon excitation. On this basis, three complementary design strategies emerge, that is: (a) full and (b) partial bond length equalization, yielding intrinsically small‐ and mixed‐BLA emitters, and (c) MO topology inversion, with large BLA in GS and ES; secondary factors include, (d) rigidification and (e) the extension of the conjugated path. Finally, we address challenges and solutions when targeting not only color‐pure but also bright emitters. In all, our insights allow for an intuitive, chemical approach towards efficient color‐pure emitters beyond sole generation of structures and numbers."},{"t":"附带影响：中美紧张局势和第三国能源转型","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003605?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型路","sc":2.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"中国光伏产业简报：大全能源拓展多晶硅以外业务 - pv magazine Global","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/chinese-pv-industry-brief-daqo-expands-beyond-polysilicon/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏智能制造基地","kp":["投资额[昆山制造基地]: 60亿元","[应用方向]: AI数据中心供电储能"],"as":"大全新能源（Daqo）宣布投资60亿元人民币（约8.35亿美元）建设智能能源系统制造基地，标志着公司业务从传统多晶硅生产向下游光伏系统集成与智能制造延伸。此举反映中国光伏龙头企业加速全产业链布局与转型升级的趋势。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Chinese PV Industry Brief: Daqo expands beyond polysilicon - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nDaqo New Energy will invest CNY 6 billion ($835 million) to build a smart energy systems manufacturing base in Kunshan focused on advanced power equipment and storage solutions for AI data center applications.\nVincent Shaw\nMarkets & Policy\nDaqo’s polysilicon factory in China\n| Image: Daqo New Energy\nDaqo New Energy\nhas disclosed that its subsidiary, Daqo Energy Technology (Shanghai), has signed an investment agreement with the Kunshan Economic and Technological Development Zone Administrative Committee. Under the agreement, the company will establish a project entity to develop a smart energy systems manufacturing base with a total investment of CNY 6 billion ($835 million). The polysilicon manufacturer said the facility will focus on the research, manufacturing and commercialization of integrated smart energy solutions and related equipment, including energy storage systems, solid-state transformers, solid-state circuit breakers and solid-state batteries. It is intended to support next-generation power distribution and smart energy integration systems for AI data centers (AIDCs).\nThe Silicon Industry Branch of the\nChina Nonferrous Metals Industry Association\n(CNIMA), meanwhile, reported that polysilicon prices continued to decline. N-type recharging polysilicon traded at CNY 33,000–34,000/ton ($4,590–4,730/ton), with an average transaction price of CNY 33,900/ton, down 2.31% week on week. N-type granular silicon traded at CNY 33,000–34,000/ton, with an average price of CNY 33,500/ton, down 1.47% week on week. The association aslo reported stable wafer prices across all major product categories. Average transaction prices remained unchanged at CNY 0.93 per piece for n-type G10L wafers (182 mm × 183.75 mm, 130 μm), CNY 1.00 per piece for n-type G12R wafers (182 mm × 210 mm, 130 μm), and CNY 1.17 per piece for n-type G12 wafers (210 mm × 210 mm, 130 μm).\nChina General Nuclear Power New Energy\n(CGN New Energy) has released the shortlist for its 2026 framework procurement of PV modules. Selected bidders include TCL Zhonghuan, Gokin Solar, JA Solar, JinkoSolar, GCL System Integration, Yingli Energy and Astronergy. Bid prices ranged from CNY 0.742/W to CNY 0.770/W (USD 0.103/W–0.107/W). The tender comprises two procurement packages covering seven lots in total, each with a capacity of 1.2 GW, representing an aggregate procurement volume of 8.4 GW. Framework agreements will be valid for one year from the date of contract signing.\nVincent Shaw\nView author posts"},{"t":"智利启动电力拍卖，以15年PPA合同每年招标2.8 TWh","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/chile-kicks-off-power-auction-to-contract-2-8-twhyear-under-15-year-ppas-1296382/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"Renewables Now","as":"智利启动电力拍卖，计划通过15年长期购电协议（PPA）每年采购2.8 TWh电力，以推动可再生能源发展。该拍卖为智利能源转型和电力市场改革的关键举措，吸引国内外开发商竞标风光等项目。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"电力竞拍","kp":["采购规模[智利电力拍卖]: 2.8 TWh/年","合同期限[PPA]: 15年"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Chile kicks off power auction to contract 2.8 TWh/year under 15-year PPAs","b":"Chile kicks off power auction to contract 2.8 TWh/year under 15-year PPAs | Renewable Energy News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nFrance opens 10-GW offshore wind tender\nabout 12 hours ago\nCypress Creek scores USD 3.5bn in funds for Arkansas solar-BESS giant\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nChile kicks off power auction to contract 2.8 TWh/year under 15-year PPAs\nJun 12, 2026, 5:25:33 PM\nSladjana Djunisic\nOnshore Wind\nEnergy Storage\nOther Renewables\nRegion/Country:\nLatin America\nLatest top stories\nFrance opens 10-GW offshore wind tender\nabout 12 hours ago\nCypress Creek scores USD 3.5bn in funds for Arkansas solar-BESS giant\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nLatest in Energy storage\nVisual Fan energises European Energy's 120-MWh BESS in Romania\nJun 12, 2026\nFox ESS signs 10 GWh of energy storage deals with Aussie distributors\nJun 12, 2026\nSolaria wins EUR 41m in state grants for agri-PV, BESS projects in Spain\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Solar power\nEternia awards power infrastructure work for 30-MW PV farm in Poland\nJun 12, 2026\nFortis Energy to start building 75-MWp PV project with BESS in Albania\nJun 12, 2026\nSolar shines as non-hydro renewables hit 12% of Peru's March power mix\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Onshore wind\nEnercon erects 1st turbine at 120-MW wind farm site in Iceland\nJun 12, 2026\nPattern Energy fires up 3.65-GW SunZia wind farm in New Mexico\nJun 12, 2026\nJapan’s Chubu invests in Indian renewable power producer Continuum\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Hydropower\nTwelve opens commercial power-to-liquid SAF plant in US\nJun 12, 2026\nChile's Colbun to supply 100% renewable power to telco Gtd\nJun 11, 2026\nEskom launches dedicated renewables unit Eskom Green\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Energy storage\nVisual Fan energises European Energy's 120-MWh BESS in Romania\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Solar power\nEternia awards power infrastructure work for 30-MW PV farm in Poland\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Onshore wind\nEnercon erects 1st turbine at 120-MW wind farm site in Iceland\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Hydropower\nTwelve opens commercial power-to-liquid SAF plant in US\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Other\nEndurance Energy nets USD 54m to advance subsea geothermal tech\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in LATIN AMERICA\nGreenYellow to install 38 MWp of solar for Carrefour in Brazil\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Tenders\nFrance opens 10-GW offshore wind tender\nJun 12, 2026\nLatest in Chile\nGrenergy unveils 3.5-GWh Elena BESS in northern Chile\nMost read stories\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"童年环境塑造大脑","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei3393?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Socioeconomic factors top the list of influences on children’s brain structure and function"},{"t":"电荷极化界面工程实现自由基管控，支撑对苯醌电合成千小时稳定运行","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6914811?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"苯醌电合成","kp":["[运行时长]: 1000小时稳定运行","[界面工程]: 电荷极化界面控自由基","[产物]: 对苯醌电合成"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于电荷极化界面工程策略，实现自由基的有效管理，使有机电合成反应在长达1000小时运行中保持高选择性与催化稳定性。自由基介导的电合成长期受限于选择性低与催化剂失活，该界面设计为绿色有机合成提供了工程化解决方案。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Charge‐Polarized Interfacial Engineering Enables Radical Management for 1000 h Electrosynthesis of Para‐Benzoquinone","cl":"00bb9036","cln":"苯醌电合成","cp":0,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Radical‐mediated organic electrosynthesis frequently suffers from limited selectivity and catalytic instability, largely arising from uncontrolled radical coupling and overreaction. These challenges intensify under large‐current conditions, where accelerated radical generation promotes competing side reactions and undermines practical implementation. Here, we introduce a charge‐polarized interfacial engineering strategy to address these issues, demonstrated using a Cr\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    /Ru‐Fe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    heterostructure to drive the selective electro‐oxidation of phenol to\n                    para‐\n                    benzoquinone (\n                    p‐\n                    BQ). The polarized interface enforces a vertical adsorption configuration of phenoxy radicals, suppressing Langmuir−Hinshelwood polymerization while stabilizing high‐valent Ru oxidative centers and facilitating rapid desorption of\n                    p‐\n                    BQ product. As a result, the catalyst achieves 1000 h of continuous\n                    p‐\n                    BQ electrosynthesis at record steady‐state current densities above 40−50 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , delivering high product selectivity and parallel hydrogen production at 1.0 V in an asymmetric hybrid seawater electrolyzer. This work establishes interfacial radical management as an effective framework for efficient electrosynthesis of value‐added chemicals.","aip":1},{"t":"基于铁电氧化镓的天体神经形态器件","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag362/8707060?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电神经形态器件","kp":["材料体系[天体神经形态器件]: κ相氧化镓(铁电)","带隙类型[UWBG半导体]: 超宽禁带","应用场景[抗辐射]: 富辐射空间环境"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究基于铁电氧化镓材料构建天体神经形态计算硬件，用于高效识别天体活动。氧化镓的超宽带隙与铁电特性使器件能在高辐射、极端温度等恶劣太空环境下高效、稳定运行，为空间观测与在轨智能识别提供新的硬件范式。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Celestial neuromorphics based on ferroelectric gallium oxide","b":"Efficient recognition of celestial activities demands hardware that can operate with high efficiency and robustness in radiation-rich space environments. Ultra-wide bandgap (UWBG) semiconductors are well-suited for such environments, but conventional UWBG transistors are not inherently compatible with advanced computing functions. To address this limitation, here we report a κ-phase gallium oxide (κ-Ga2O3) based in-sensor reservoir computing system (κ-ISRC), which incorporates deep ultraviolet sensing, memory, and neuromorphic computation for celestial activity recognition. A ferroelectric high-electron-mobility transistor (FeHEMT) is fabricated by exploiting polarization switching of κ-Ga2O3 through atomic sliding mechanisms. The Al2O3/κ-Ga2O3 dielectric/ferroelectric gate stack provides negative-capacitance effect, supporting configurable memory operations. Furthermore, the device can maintain its performance over a wide temperature range (from −270°C to 210°C) and under ion irradiation with an average flux of 1×104 rad/s. Leveraging these device features, the celestial neuromorphic system achieves up to 95% classification accuracies across diverse astrophysical events, including solar flares, cosmic-ray bursts, and pulsar emissions. This work establishes UWBG ferroelectric semiconductors as a multifunctional platform for energy-efficient in-sensor neuromorphic electronics for aerospace and deep-space applications."},{"t":"热气体超荧光的无腔模式控制","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/cbxq-8n45","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): H. Maeda and K. KitanoTransverse-mode control of light has traditionally relied on optical cavities, whereas recent cavity-free approaches based on periodically arranged cold atoms that exploit collective radiation have attracted increasing attention. Here, we demonstrate a new cavity-free method applicable to thermal ga…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233603] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"无催化剂升级回收：聚乙烯废料转化为氧化聚乙烯蜡","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5563553?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚乙烯废料升级回收","kp":["[回收工艺]: 无催化剂一锅水热氧化","塑料废物占比[聚乙烯]: 36%"],"dp":1,"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究开发了一种无催化剂升级回收聚乙烯（PE）废料制备氧化聚乙烯蜡的新工艺。PE占全球塑料废料的36%，但其化学稳定性极高、极难降解转化。该工艺在不使用催化剂的条件下将PE高效转化为具有高附加值的氧化聚乙烯蜡产品，具有工艺简单、成本低廉和环境友好等优势。氧化蜡广泛应用于涂料、润滑剂和塑料加工等领域，该路线为塑料废弃物的化学循环利用提供了经济可行的解决方案。","ot":"Catalyst‐Free Upcycling of Polyethylene Waste Into Oxidized Polyethylene Wax","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polyethylene (PE) accounts for 36% of the total plastic waste by mass. However, its inherent chemical stability poses significant challenges for chemical recycling, including energy‐intensive processing, costly catalysts, and thermodynamic constraints that result in low‐value hydrocarbon products. Herein, we present a catalyst‐free, one‐pot hydrothermal oxidation strategy for the efficient upcycling of waste PE into high‐value oxidized polyethylene wax (OPEW). Notably, under optimized conditions (160°C, 1.5 MPa O\n                    2\n                    ), low‐density polyethylene (LDPE, 1.0 g) is converted to OPEW within 0.5 h, achieving an OPEW/PE mass ratio of 103.3% and a carbon yield of 99.8%. The resulting OPEW exhibits a tunable acid number (20–70 mg KOH/g) and saponification number (5–80 mg KOH/g), covering industrial specifications for commercial wax products. Mechanistic studies reveal that the superoxide radical (·O\n                    2\n                    −\n                    ) plays a key role in mediating the reaction. Furthermore, 30‐fold scale‐up trials and successful application to various types of PE waste feedstocks demonstrate the great potential of this methodology for industrial viability. This strategy establishes a sustainable, catalyst‐free pathway for upcycling plastic waste into functional materials."},{"t":"CargoNetSim：基于混合代理的系统动力学框架，用于多式联运中的成本-能源-排放优化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008408?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"联运碳排放","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"钙介导Fe─N键强化实现超稳定氧还原反应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73684?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Fe-N-C氧还原催化剂","kp":["催化剂[氧还原反应]:Fe-Ca双原子位点/多孔碳","[Ca介导]:增强Fe-N键抑制活性位点浸出"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究针对原子级分散Fe-N-C催化剂在氧还原反应(ORR)中稳定性不足的瓶颈，提出利用钙离子介导Fe-N配位键强化的新策略。通过引入Ca²⁺稳定Fe-N₄活性位点的电子结构，显著抑制铁原子在酸性介质中的脱金属降解和碳载体腐蚀。实验表明，经Ca修饰的催化剂在酸性旋转圆盘电极测试中表现出超稳定运行，半波电位衰减极小。该策略为质子交换膜燃料电池(PEMFC)阴极催化剂的耐久性提升提供了分子层面的工程路径，具有推动Fe-N-C催化剂实用化部署的潜力。","ot":"Calcium‐Mediated Fe─N Bond Reinforcement for Ultra‐Stable Oxygen Reduction Reaction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The practical deployment of atomically dispersed Fe–N–C catalysts for the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) is severely hampered by the electrochemical leaching of Fe active sites. Inspired by the stabilizing role of Ca\n                    2+\n                    in metalloenzyme active sites, a novel Fe–Ca dual‐atom sites catalyst (Ca/Fe–N–C) is constructed on amorphous porous carbon nanosheets. The introduced Ca atom acts as an “electronic modulator” and “structural stabilizer,” which effectively lowers the oxidation state of Fe and reinforces Fe–N coordination bond. This ingenious design results in an exceptional ORR catalyst with the half‐wave potential of 0.912 V in alkaline media and unprecedented durability, exhibiting negligible decay after 80000 cycles. When integrated into Zn‐air batteries (ZABs), the Ca/Fe–N–C‐based cathode delivers a peak power density of 215 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    and sustains operation for exceeding 1110 h, markedly superior to benchmark Pt/C. This work not only unveils the pivotal role of alkaline‐earth metals in stabilizing transition‐metal sites but also establishes a general paradigm for designing durable atomically dispersed catalysts for advanced energy conversion devices."},{"t":"笼型多孔有机盐作为瓶中船纳米反应器：透光可重复使用的分子光催化体系","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6654151?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"笼型多孔光催化","kp":["[催化剂载体]: 笼型多孔有机盐纳米反应器","[策略]: 船瓶式固定分子光催化剂"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究开发了笼型多孔有机盐作为'瓶中船'纳米反应器，将均相分子光催化剂封装于多孔骨架内，实现异相化光催化同时完整保留催化剂原有预设计结构。该方法无需重新设计光敏剂分子结构，利用笼型孔道的选择性扩散实现底物富集与产物分离，同时具备光透过性好、可循环使用的优势。该平台为光催化有机合成、二氧化碳还原等领域提供了一种通用性的异相化策略，解决了均相催化剂回收困难的问题，兼具催化效率与工程实用性。","ot":"Cage‐Type Porous Organic Salts as Ship‐in‐a‐Bottle Nanoreactors for Light‐Transparent and Reusable Molecular Photocataly","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Heterogenizing molecular photocatalysts while preserving their intact, pre‐designed structures—without redesigning the host—remains a fundamental challenge. Immobilization within porous materials offers control over reaction environments and improved recyclability; however, most host systems require catalyst‐specific structural redesign, limiting generality. We introduce a cage‐type porous organic salt (POS) as a modular host platform for homogeneous, molecularly defined photocatalysts (organic molecules and metal coordination complexes) based on a ship‐in‐a‐bottle strategy. A sodalite‐type POS constructed from adamantane‐based sulfonic acid and tri(ethynylphenyl)methylamine provides well‐defined, light‐transparent, cage‐like internal cavities. Single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction reveals that the POS accommodates diverse photocatalysts, including anthraquinone, phenanthrenequinone, and phthalocyanine, through a unified recrystallization protocol. The framework exhibits negligible absorption in the visible region, enabling selective excitation of photocatalysts without competitive light absorption. Post‐synthetic thiol–yne crosslinking of ethynyl groups on the pore surface reinforces the framework and renders it insoluble while preserving cage‐like cavities. For example, a phenanthrenequinone‐encapsulated POS functions as a reusable heterogeneous photocatalyst for visible‐light‐driven hydrogen peroxide production from isopropanol and oxygen, achieving rates of up to 4.2 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    without catalyst leaching. Overall, cage‐type POSs serve as light‐transparent nanoreactors for intact molecular photocatalysts, providing a modular, expandable platform for photocatalyst immobilization and post‐synthetic functionalization."},{"t":"CVD生长可调碳薄膜用于高性能钠离子存储","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01852A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CVD碳膜钠存储","kp":["[合成方法]: CVD生长连续碳涂层","[应用]: 钠离子电池高容量负极"],"as":"研究团队开发出基于化学气相沉积（CVD）的可调控碳薄膜材料，用于高性能钠离子电池负极。钠离子电池因钠资源储量丰富、成本低廉被视为可持续储能方案，但碳负极的储钠容量和循环稳定性长期受限。该CVD碳薄膜通过精确控制微观结构和孔隙率，显著提升了钠离子嵌入与脱嵌动力学，实现了更高比容量和优异的循环寿命，为钠离子电池迈向实用化提供了新的材料工程路径。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"CVD-grown tunable carbon films for high-performance sodium storage","b":"Sodium-ion batteries are considered a promising and sustainable energy-storage technology, yet achieving competitive energy density requires electrode materials with high reversible capacity. Here, we introduce a chemical vapor deposition strategy that allows the growth of uniform, electronically continuous carbon coatings onto highly porous carbon substrates for use as high-capacity negative electrodes. This coating narrows and partially seals the open pore network, suppresses surface reactivity, and establishes nanoconfined domains that allow sodium to be stored in a more compact manner. This restructuring significantly enhances sodium storage performance, delivering total reversible capacities exceeding 500 mAh g-1 together with an unprecedented 420 mAh g-1 reversible plateau capacity. By enabling control over heteroatom composition, confinement, and electronic structure, this approach not only addresses the challenge of designing uniform and electronically continuous carbon coatings on highly porous substrates but also establishes a general route for designing functional carbon films for advanced electrodes, catalysts, and interfaces with tunable electronic properties."},{"t":"CSAKD：基于19F NMR化学位移各向异性测定配体绝对亲和力","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6036832?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"CSAKD是一种利用氟-19核磁共振（19F NMR）化学位移各向异性来测定小分子与靶蛋白绝对结合亲和力的新方法。药物发现早期需要从化合物库中筛选出初始苗头化合物，而精确测定结合亲和力是关键环节。该方法通过测量含氟配体在结合态下的化学位移各向异性变化，无需竞争实验即可直接获取绝对亲和力数据，有望加速药物筛选流程，提升苗头化合物发现的效率和准确性。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"19F NMR亲和力测定","kp":["检测方法[配体亲和力]: 19F NMR化学位移各向异性","应用领域[药物发现]: 基于片段的药物发现"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"CSAKD: Determining Absolute Ligand Affinities From 19F NMR Chemical Shift Anisotropy","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Small‐molecule drug discovery typically begins with the screening of compound libraries to identify initial hits, which are subsequently optimized into lead compounds and, ultimately, drug candidates. Diverse screening methodologies are employed, including DNA‐encoded library technology, high‐throughput screening, and fragment‐based drug discovery (FBDD). Among these, FBDD is particularly powerful when integrated with structure‐guided drug design and biophysical affinity measurements. However, accurately quantifying the weak binding affinities of fragments remains a significant challenge. To address this, we introduce chemical shift anisotropy  (CSAKD), a novel method for determining absolute fragment affinities using  NMR relaxation. The CSAKD approach eliminates the need for titration experiments and isotopic labeling. Furthermore, we complement this method with a machine learning model for the rapid and accurate prediction of  chemical shielding tensors. In summary, CSAKD allows fast and efficient affinity determination which seamlessly integrates into FBDD by  NMR."},{"t":"埋藏了 17 亿年：这些古代化石可能会改写复杂生命的故事","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/buried-for-1-7-billion-years-these-ancient-fossils-may-rewrite-the-story-of-complex-life/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Ancient Australian fossils indicate that the earliest eukaryotes depended on oxygen, providing new evidence that oxygen helped enable the evolution of complex life.\nStored in an open-air warehouse in tropical Darwin, Australia, are dozens of trays containing cylindrical cores of rock. They are from drill holes bored hundreds of meters below the surface by mineral exploration companies decades ago.\nSome of these cores at the\nNorthern Territory Geological Survey\nare mudstone—a type of sedimentary rock formed from hardened seafloor mud. The companies that drilled these cores were largely unaware that within these mudstones were fossils of microscopic organisms buried on the seafloor of an ancient inland sea that covered much of northern Australia over 1.5 billion years ago.\n, published today in Nature, shows, these fossils are crucial for addressing a longstanding puzzle about the major evolutionary leap that led to all complex life on Earth: the origin of eukaryotes.\nAll life on Earth can be placed into one of two types, which are fundamentally different at the cellular level.\nProkaryotes (bacteria and archaea) have simple cellular organization and are mostly single-celled. Eukaryotes—including all animals, plants, algae, and fungi—are very different. They have much more complicated cells featuring a nucleus and other specialized structures such as organelles that perform specific jobs.\nThe eukaryotic revolution transformed the planet. It led to the rise of animals and, eventually, to us. Based on observations from the genes of living organisms,\nit is now widely agreed\nthat the last common ancestor of all living eukaryotes resulted from the symbiotic union of (at least) two prokaryotic microbes: an archaeon and a bacterium.\nThe first evidence for eukaryotic life comes in the form of these fossils of single-celled organisms. They show a level of cellular complexity not seen among prokaryotes but common in eukaryotes.\nEukaryote fossils can be found around\ndating back at least 1.5 billion years. The fossils of the Northern Territory, the oldest of which date back to 1.75 billion years ago, are the oldest currently known eukaryote fossils globally.\nBut the ancient world in which early eukaryotes evolved remains shrouded in mystery. And so many fundamental aspects regarding their nature are unknown.\nMany types of bacteria can live and grow in places without oxygen. But nearly all eukaryotes alive today use oxygen for their survival. That’s because aerobic respiration—breaking down food using oxygen—provides the vast amounts of energy that complex life demands.\nBut the idea that oxygen has always been beneficial for all eukaryotes has\ncome under fire\nin recent years. This follows the surprising discoveries of enigmatic eukaryotes that can\nthrive in conditions\nwithout oxygen.\nThere is also\nmounting evidence\ncalled into question\nthe assumption eukaryotes have depended on oxygen since their inception.\nGenetic studies of living microbes belonging to groups considered closest to the ancestors of the first eukaryote can offer key insights into\neukaryote ancestry\n. But only the fossil record can tell us about long-extinct lineages. And only geology can offer a window into the kind of world these organisms lived in.\nFor our new study, we crushed up samples of the mudstone cores stored in Darwin, then dissolved them. We identified more than 12,000 fossils by analyzing the organic residue left behind by this dissolution under a microscope.\nWe also studied the mudstones the fossils were preserved in to better understand what the environment was like when the sediments were deposited. This offered insight about the habitats in which these eukaryotes lived. And by analyzing the chemistry of these mudstones, we could determine whether oxygen was present in the ancient seawater.\nOur results show that eukaryote fossils were found in environments ranging from coastal mudflats to the open sea. But they were present only in samples deposited in oxygenated settings. Samples from oxygen-free environments contained only simple, prokaryotic forms.\nThis suggests that even the oldest-known eukaryotes that lived on Earth 1.7 to 1.4 billion years ago were dependent on oxygen. These data lend support to a\nlong-held hypothesis\nthat oxygen played a\nin driving the evolution of early eukaryotes.\nResolving the drivers and context of the major evolutionary leap represented by early eukaryotes is one of the major outstanding questions in the life sciences. Ongoing studies of these enigmatic, ancient microfossils will no doubt tell us more about our own origins—and our place in the cosmos.\nReference: “Early fossil eukaryotes were benthic aerobes” by Maxwell A. Lechte, Leigh Anne Riedman, Susannah M. Porter, Galen P. Halverson and Margaret Whelan, 20 May 2026,\nDOI: 10.1038/s41586-026-10533-4\nMaxwell Lechte received funding from the Moore–Simons Project on the Origin of the Eukaryotic Cell.\nLeigh Anne Riedman receives funding from the\nExobiology program and has received funding from the Moore–Simons Project on the Origin of the Eukaryotic Cell, the Palaeontological Association, and the American Philosophical Society.\nAdapted from an article originally published in\nThe Conversation\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nThe Conversation\nBioluminescent Bacteria Kill Rivals and Establish Symbiosis in Squid Using Genetic Regulatory Factors\nToday’s Large Crocodiles Were Created by Climate Change\nEvolution of Antibiotic Resistance Altered by Bacterial Lifestyle\nRapid Evolution of Deadly Pathogen: Cholera Bacterium Can Steal Up to 150 Genes in One Go\nDarwin Contradicted: Survival of the Friendliest Bacteria\nNew Clues to the Origin of Life on Earth From Microbial Remains in Ancient Rocks\nCalcified Bacteria Sheds Light on the Health Consequences of the Evolving Diet\nEvolutionary Changes Surrounding the NOS1 Gene\nStimulating Resolution Programs Limit Consequences of Infection"},{"t":"低电位醛氧化中化学与电化学串联步骤协同增强，驱动太阳能双极水解","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6195416?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双极光电制氢","kp":["[电极]: PtCu3@Cu纳米线阵列/泡沫铜","[阳极反应]: 低电位醛氧化","[应用]: 太阳能双极制氢"],"as":"该研究提出利用低电位醛氧化反应替代析氧反应作为双极电化学合成中的阳极过程，实现化学与电化学串联步骤的双重提升。析氧反应能耗高且竞争性强，而醛氧化在较低电位下即可进行，具有更高的能量效率。研究通过优化催化剂体系，在低电位下同步促进化学转化和电化学氧化两个串联步骤，为绿色有机合成和电能驱动的化学品制造提供了更高效的阳极替代策略。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Boosting Both Chemical and Electrochemical Tandem Steps in Low‐Potential Aldehyde Oxidation for Solar‐Driven Bipolar Hyd","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Low‐potential aldehyde oxidation offers an energy‐efficient anodic alternative to oxygen evolution for bipolar hydrogen production coupled with biomass valorization, yet the tandem non‐Faradaic/Faradaic mechanism remains poorly understood. Here, we report PtCu\n                    3\n                    ‐coated Cu nanowire arrays supported on Cu foam (PtCu\n                    3\n                    @Cu/CF) fabricated via galvanic replacement and electrochemical reduction. In situ ATR‐FTIR and DFT calculations indicate the PtCu\n                    3\n                    shell enhances adsorption of the\n                    gem\n                    ‐diolate intermediate while weakens binding of 5‐hydroxymethyl‐2‐furancarboxylic acid (HMFCA), accelerating both non‐Faradaic C–H cleavage and Faradaic oxidation. This enables selective 5‐hydroxymethylfurfural upgrading with anodic hydrogen evolution at 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at ∼0.21 V in a two‐electrode flow electrolyzer. Additionally, the electrolyzer also achieves 100 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0.16 V with 200% combined Faradaic efficiency for bipolar hydrogen production. Integration of a six‐cell stack with perovskite photovoltaic module yields a bias‐free solar‐to‐hydrogen efficiency of 16.9% alongside gram‐scale HMFCA production. This noble‐metal‐lean platform establishes scalable solar reforming for co‐generating green hydrogen and value‐added chemicals."},{"t":"拉脱维亚兹维涅基中石器时代-新石器时代狩猎采集者职业专业化的生物力学证据","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3371?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mesolithic cemeteries have greater dimensionality and scale that reflect emerging social complexity following the Upper Paleolithic. The Zvejnieki cemetery dates between the Middle Mesolithic and Late Neolithic, is associated with a persistent hunter-fisher-gatherer economy, and includes burials with pendants fashioned from mammal teeth. Stable isotopic analyses indicate dietary differences between individuals with pendants and without pendants beginning early in life. This context provides an opportunity to explore questions relating to occupational specialization using long bone cross-sectional geometry. Femoral cross-sectional properties from Zvejnieki were compared to a European database from the Upper Paleolithic to Neolithic to explore mobility. Femoral and humeral cross-sectional properties were compared between individuals with and without pendants to understand differences in mobility and manual activity in relation to mortuary practices. Diminished femoral rigidity and circular femoral shape were found at Zvejnieki, but no differences were observed between burial groups. Expanded cortical area and diminished medullary area were observed in the right humeri of males with pendants. Right humeral shape was comparatively circular among males with pendants, while right and left humeral shape was anteroposteriorally reinforced among males without pendants. Females with pendants had elevated right and left humeral shape ratios compared to females without pendants. Femoral morphology reflects reduced mobility, interaction with flat terrain, and exploitation of abundant, local resources at Zvejnieki. Differences in humeral cross-sectional properties between burial groups are consistent with specialized manual activity. These patterns reflect the economic and ideological components of independent specialization and point toward expanding social dimensions in Mesolithic-Neolithic hunter-gatherers."},{"t":"基于聚电解质构象的仿生纳米流体忆阻器，用于突触学习和内存逻辑计算机","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73598?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Bioinspired neuromorphic and in‐memory computing requires devices that store and process information through ionic dynamics analogous to biological synapses. Here, we report a polyelectrolyte conformational nanofluidic memristor (PCM) that integrates synaptic plasticity, neuromorphic learning, and stateful ionic logic within a single aqueous platform. The device operates through electric‐field‐driven, reversible conformational transitions of polyelectrolytes confined inside graphene oxide nanochannels, enabling analog conductance tuning, a sharp, tunable switching threshold, and an ON/OFF ratio exceeding 160. These conformational dynamics endow the PCM with rich synaptic functions, including long‐term potentiation and depression, multilevel memory retention, and symmetric weight update rules. By directly mapping the experimentally measured potentiation/depression curves into a physical learning model, we demonstrate high‐accuracy neuromorphic learning, achieving 97.1% recognition accuracy on the Modified National Institute of Standards and Technology (MNIST) handwritten‐digit dataset. Beyond learning, interconnected PCM units perform stateful ionic OR, IMP, and NAND operations, establishing universal in‐memory logic within the same ionic platform. This work introduces a bioinspired nanofluidic computing paradigm that unites the adaptive learning of neural networks and deterministic logic, paving the way to scalable and brain‐like ionic processors.","tp":"纳米忆阻器","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种基于聚电解质构象变化的仿生纳米流体忆阻器（PCM），在单一水相平台上集成突触可塑性、神经形态学习与离子态逻辑运算。器件核心机制是受限聚电解质链在电场驱动下发生可逆构象转变，通过离子动力学模拟生物突触的信息存储与处理过程，实现记忆与计算融合。该方案为类脑计算和内存计算提供了全液相、仿生架构的新路径，有望突破传统冯·诺依曼架构瓶颈，在低功耗智能计算领域具有潜在应用价值。","aip":1},{"t":"用于冰控制和细胞冷冻保存的仿生（糖）多肽","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73464?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Cryopreservation is a powerful technology providing fundamental support for basic biomedical research and clinical translation. Currently, cryoprotectants are commonly incorporated during the cryopreservation of cells to preserve their phenotypes and post‐thaw functionality. However, existing cryoprotective strategies still face crucial challenges in developing highly efficient and biocompatible approaches for storing various types of cells. Inspired by antifreeze (glycol)proteins, which are endogenous in antifreeze or freeze‐tolerant organisms for survival under subzero conditions, (glyco)polypeptides and analogues are developed with ice‐controlling properties and cryoprotective effects to maintain cellular viability and function after cryopreservation. The protein‐mimetic structures endow (glyco)polypeptides with advantages of biocompatibility, chemical structural diversity, multiscale tunability, and potential for economically large‐scale preparation. This review summarizes the synthesis, secondary structures, and self‐assembly behaviors of these (glyco)polypeptides, serving as a valuable bridge connecting polymer architectures to their applications as macromolecular cryoprotectants. The roles of (glyco)polypeptides are emphasized, including their activities and underlying protective mechanisms in ice nucleation, ice shaping, and ice recrystallization inhibition, as well as their cryopreservation performance for cells. Finally, in view of the requirement for a precise understanding of structure–property relationships, the prospects of multifunctional (glyco)polypeptides are discussed, with an outlook on the integration of machine learning.","tp":"仿生防冻肽","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本论文综述了仿生（糖）多肽在冰控制与细胞冷冻保存领域的最新进展。冷冻保存是基础医学研究与临床转化的关键技术，传统冷冻保护剂（如DMSO）虽能维持细胞表型与复苏功能，但存在细胞毒性高、适用细胞类型受限等核心瓶颈。作者受自然界抗冻糖蛋白（AFGP）启发，系统梳理了仿生多肽和糖多肽作为新型冷冻保护剂的设计原理——通过调控冰晶生长形态、抑制重结晶效应（IRI）以及降低溶液冰点，实现对细胞冷冻损伤的多重防护。该综述重点讨论了多肽序列结构-抗冻活性关系、糖基化修饰策略对生物相容性的提升，以及在干细胞、免疫细胞等医学相关细胞类型中的应用潜力。相较于传统小分子保护剂，仿生糖多肽具备可设计性强、生物相容性好、可降解等优势，有望成为下一代冷冻保存材料的重要方向，对细胞治疗、组织工程及再生医学的规模化存储具有积极意义。"},{"t":"生化结构演化的吡啶-活性碳点共组装作为精密抗肿瘤纳米酶","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6402787?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nanozymes with stable activity and excellent biocompatibility hold significant potential for tumor catalytic therapy. However, lacking rational structure evolution strategies to enhance nanozyme biochemical activity and their almost non‐tumor specificity have hindered their clinical translation. In this study, we report a pyridine‐activated donor–acceptor (D–A)‐typed carbon dots (N‐CDs), and their co‐assembled nanoplatform (N‐CDs@KK) with a programmed death‐ligand 1 (PD‐L1) targeting peptide (KK), as a potent tumor‐targeted nanozyme. N‐CDs were engineered through structure evolution via homogeneously integrating electron‐withdrawing pyridine units into amino‐rich conjugated sp\n                    2\n                    ‐domains, leading to effective charge transfer. The resulting D–A‐typed N‐CDs with abundant polarized domains garnered effective adsorption and activation sites, which exhibited both peroxidase (POD)‐ and oxidase (OXD)‐like catalytic activities. Moreover, this elaborate pyridine‐activated D–A nanostructure endowed bio‐regulatory function, capable of suppressing PI3K/AKT antioxidant stress pathway, thus amplifying reactive oxygen species (ROS)‐mediated tumor killing effect. Furthermore, co‐assembling with KK, the resulting N‐CDs@KK showed enhanced tumor targeting capability with specific cellular internalization. Combining ROS‐mediated immunogenic cell death (ICD) and PD‐L1 immune checkpoint inhibition (ICI), N‐CDs@KK demonstrated to be an efficient tumor‐targeted nanoplatform for both nanozyme‐catalytic and immunotherapeutic antitumor therapy. We prospect that N‐CDs@KK development establishes a paradigm for the rational design of high‐performance nanozymes, paving the way for precision nanozyme‐based antitumor therapy.","tp":"碳点纳米酶","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究针对纳米酶在肿瘤催化治疗中缺乏合理结构演化策略及肿瘤特异性差的问题，提出了一种吡啶活化的给体-受体（D-A）型碳点（N-CDs），并将其与多肽共组装形成N-CDs@KK纳米平台。该策略通过吡啶官能团修饰调控碳点的电子结构，增强其类酶催化活性，同时借助共组装赋予体系良好的生物相容性与结构稳定性。研究强调，结构层面的理性设计是突破现有纳米酶生化活性不足和靶向性缺失两大临床转化瓶颈的关键路径。该体系有望实现精密化的肿瘤微环境响应催化治疗，为纳米酶从基础研究走向临床应用提供了新的分子工程范式。"},{"t":"双侧锚定策略实现高效宽带隙钙钛矿太阳能电池/组件用于自驱动光电","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71001?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宽禁带钙钛矿太阳能电池","kp":["[锚定策略]: 双侧锚定","[电池类型]: 宽禁带钙钛矿","[应用]: 自供电光电催化抗菌"],"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Bilateral Anchoring Strategy Enables Highly Efficient Wide‐Bandgap Perovskite Solar Cells/Modules for Self‐Powered Photo"},{"t":"超越几何约束：动态流体晶格激活的拓扑化学聚合","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag360/8707062?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Topochemical polymerization affords lattice-directed polymers with high structural fidelity, but its scope is limited by the need for precise, static preorganization of reactive groups—an intrinsically fragile outcome of subtle intermolecular packing. Here we introduce dynamical fluid lattices into topochemical design to circumvent these geometric constraints, achieving near-quantitative monomer conversion even without ideal preorganization. Employing core-shell columnar liquid crystals, rapid molecular fluctuations within the fluid lattices enable temporary proximity of reactive sites that activate topochemical reactions. Meanwhile, the anisotropic columnar architecture directs chain growth into well-defined linear helical polymers. Despite their covalent backbones, the resulting polymers undergo temperature-dependent, dissipative depolymerization that enables complete monomer regeneration. We integrate fluid-lattice-activated topochemical polymerization into skin-attachable films, demonstrating temporary information encryption via fluorescence imaging at body temperature. This strategy expands the design space of topochemical synthesis and suggests opportunities in regenerable polymers and flexible wearable technologies.","tp":"拓扑聚合法","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"动态流体晶格激活拓扑化学聚合：突破几何约束的新范式"},{"t":"$N=84$ 的 Beta 延迟中子发射 $^{132}\\mathrm{Cd}$","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/z93q-9g6y","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): M. Madurga et al.Using the time-of-flight technique, we measured the beta-delayed neutron emission of $^{132}\\mathrm{Cd}$. From our large-scale shell model (LSSM) calculation using the ${\\mathrm{N}}^{3}\\mathrm{LO}$ interaction [, Phys. Rev. Lett. 131, 022501 (2023)], we suggest the decay is dominated by the transfor…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232504] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"稳定Cu+与强化氢键网络平衡二聚与加氢动力学，用于电催化CO2还原","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4304657?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙炔电二聚","kp":["[动力学调控]: 稳定Cu+平衡二聚化与加氢","[反应]: 乙炔电化学加氢二聚制丁二烯"],"as":"该研究提出一种通过稳定Cu+物种并强化氢键网络来平衡乙炔电催化加氢二聚（EHDA）反应中二聚化与加氢动力学的方法。EHDA可作为高能耗传统工艺的替代路线，核心挑战在于调控Cu+活性位点的稳定性以提升目标产物选择性与反应效率。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Balancing Dimerization and Hydrogenation Kinetics by Stabilizing Cu+ and Tightening H‐Bond Network for Electrocatalytic ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The electrocatalytic hydrodimerization of acetylene (EHDA) offers a promising alternative to energy‐intensive naphtha steam cracking for producing 1,3‐butadiene but faces a formidable challenge due to kinetic imbalance between C–C coupling and hydrogenation. Herein, we balance the dimerization and hydrogenation kinetics of EHDA by stabilizing Cu\n                    +\n                    and tightening the hydrogen‐bond network over citrate anion grafted Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalysts (E‐CA/Cu\n                    2\n                    O). The X‐ray absorption fine structure, Cu LMM Auger spectrum, and theoretical simulations corroborate citrate anion modification induces electron transfer from Cu\n                    2\n                    O to citrate ions. This stabilizes the active Cu\n                    +\n                    sites under electrochemical reduction conditions and further lowers the C‐C coupling barrier of *C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and *C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    3\n                    to *C\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    . The in situ attenuated total reflection surface‐enhanced infrared spectroscopy confirms that the citrate anion also reconstructs the hydrogen‐bonding network and reduces the content of isolated water at the electrode‐electrolyte interface. The appropriate supply of active *H species effectively promotes the hydrogenation of *C\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    to form 1,3‐butadiene rather than competitive acetylene semihydrogenation. As a result, E‐CA/Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalyst achieves a Faradaic efficiency of 88.0% and a 1,3‐butadiene partial current density of 55 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , which is about 3‐fold higher than E‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O. This work will guide the rational design of high‐performance catalysts for regulating the kinetics of electrocatalytic acetylene hydrodimerization."},{"t":"噬菌体劫持 2',3'-cNMP 以增强鲍曼不动杆菌中转座酶介导的噬菌体 DNA 整合","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec7770?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Nucleotide second messengers are widely used to mediate the physiology and antiphage immunity in bacteria. It was revealed that 2′,3′-cAMP/2′,3′-cGMP synthetase activity is required for immune response in plants. However, it remains unclear whether 2′,3′-cNMPs are involved in the interactions between bacteria and phages. Here, we report that 2′,3′-cNMPs, which are synthesized by RnaA and degraded by A1S_2339, A1S_0249, and A1S_2666, play critical roles in the modulation of the physiology of\n                    Acinetobacter baumannii\n                    . 2′,3′-cNMPs specifically bind to the receptor protein CRP\n                    Ab\n                    in\n                    A. baumannii\n                    and thus affect the interaction between CRP\n                    Ab\n                    and the promoters of target genes. Furthermore, our study reveals that bacteriophages elevate 2′,3′-cNMPs to up-regulate the transcription of the transposases and Mu-like integrases required for bacteriophage DNA integration. Together, our results show that 2′,3′-cNMPs are important intracellular signals that control biological functions of\n                    A. baumannii\n                    , and bacteriophages could hijack these signals to facilitate phage DNA integration.","tp":"噬菌体调控","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"噬菌体-细菌相互作用中核苷酸第二信使的调控机制尚不不明确。本研究发现，2',3'-cNMPs在鲍曼不动杆菌中由RnaA合成、由A1S_2339/A1S_0249/A1S_2666降解，对细菌生理调控发挥关键作用。研究揭示了噬菌体能够劫持宿主的2',3'-cNMP信号通路，借此增强转座酶介导的噬菌体DNA整合效率。这一发现将核苷酸第二信使的功能从经典的植物免疫响应及细菌抗噬菌体免疫，拓展至噬菌体主动利用宿主信号分子促进自身基因组整合的新维度，为理解噬菌体-细菌共进化中的信号窃取机制提供了新视角，对开发基于噬菌体的抗菌策略（特别是针对鲍曼不动杆菌等高耐药病原体）具有潜在指导价值。"},{"t":"丁二炔的 BN 类似物：B─B-键合 sp-sp 二硼(2) 物种及其去对称化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3515651?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In contrast to our earlier contribution on BN analogue of butadiyne featuring a conjugated B≡N─N≡B motif, we report here an alternative and distinct isoelectronic system, Ar*─N≡B─B≡N─Ar* (\n                    2\n                    ; Ar* = C\n                    6\n                    H\n                    3\n                    ‐2,6‐Trip\n                    2\n                    , Trip = C\n                    6\n                    H\n                    2\n                    ‐2,4,6‐\n                    i\n                    Pr\n                    3\n                    ). This B─B‐bonded bis(iminoborane) constitutes an rare example of an sp–sp diboron(2) species. Compound\n                    2\n                    exhibits characteristic mono‐ and double E–H (E = N, O) bond addition across the B≡N units to afford diboron(3) and diborane(4) species, respectively. Notably, mono‐N‐heterocyclic carbene (NHC) coordination induces desymmetrization of the NBBN core, fundamentally altering its electronic structure and reactivity profile. The resulting sp–sp\n                    2\n                    diboron(3) species undergoes a broader range of transformations with DMAB, DABSO, and CO\n                    2\n                    , furnishing novel products through addition, metathesis, and cycloaddition pathways involving selective cleavage of B─B, B≡N, and B═N bonds. Together, these results demonstrate how desymmetrization enables access to distinct reactivity modes within B─B‐bonded bis(iminoborane) frameworks."},{"t":"宝马全新凶悍电动概念车，首曝纯电M3设计预告[图]","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/12/bmws-menacing-ev-concept-reveals-m3-ev-design-images/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"宝马纯电概念车","kp":["[电机配置]: 四电机","[平台]: Neue Klasse"],"as":"BMW于周五发布了M Concept Neue Klasse概念车，提前展示了即将推出的首款纯电动M3。该概念车展现了BMW M高性能品牌电动化转型的设计方向与技术预览，标志着传统性能车向纯电动力系统的战略迈进。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.0,"r":2.5,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"BMW's menacing new EV concept offers an early look at the first electric M3 [Images]","b":"Peter Johnson\n| Jun 12 2026 - 7:57 am PT\nunveiled the M Concept Neue Klasse on Friday, offering a sneak peek at the all-electric quad-motor i3 M EV.\nThe BMW M Concept made its global debut at the 24 Hours of Le Mans on Friday, showcasing the luxury brand’s new design for its upcoming performance EVs.\n“The new BMW M design language forms the expressive spearhead of the Neue Klasse,” BMW M boss Oliver Heilmer said, adding that the project is “truly special to me because it carries the BMW M character into a new era.”\nThat new era will begin in 2027, starting with the electric BMW M3. The M concept clearly has a much more aggressive look and stance than the standard i3, with a modified front end and added M features.\nUp front, BMW’s Neue Klasse headlamps and kidney grille are fused into one, while the trimaran-style bumper helps improve aerodynamics.\nThe trimaran design and new three-dimensional Track Lights will be a signature on BMW’s upcoming M performance EVs.\nMoving to the rear, it adopts the same trimaran design and Track Lights with a massive ducktail spoiler.\nInside, the cabin is “geared towards the driving experience in a next-generation all-electric BMW M,” the company said, featuring four new bucket seats and natural-fiber materials.\nFor the first time in an M model, BMW used black nubuck leather on the steering wheel, door panels, and roll bar.\nBMW added exclusive M hexagonal backlighting to the floating dashboard, red accents on the M gear selector and shift paddles on the M steering wheel, and in the digital display, enhancing the sporty cabin design.\nEarlier this year, BMW confirmed the upcoming M EV will be equipped with four electric motors and BMW M Dynamic Performance Control.\nLeveraging its Gen6 tech, BMW designed the new M eDrive specifically for its upcoming all-electric performance vehicles.\nThe drivetrain includes four electric motors that power each wheel independently. Each electric motor is controlled by M-specific software, a variation of its Neue Klasse\n“Heart of Joy”\nECUs, and its M Dynamic Performance Control.\nWhile the company has yet to reveal specifics, BMW said the electric drive units are “the most powerful drives BMW M has ever used.”\nThe 800-volt architecture and 100+ kWh high-voltage battery “create conditions for long range capability,” BMW said, but again, no specifics were offered.\nBMW will launch the first all-electric M performance vehicle in 2027, which is expected to be named i3 M when it arrives. With its official debut just around the corner, we should learn more soon. Check back for the latest updates.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nPeter Johnson is covering the auto industry’s step-by-step transformation to electric vehicles. He is an experienced investor, financial writer, and EV enthusiast. His enthusiasm for electric vehicles, primarily Tesla, is a significant reason he pursued a career in investments. If he isn’t telling you about his latest 10K findings, you can find him enjoying the outdoors or exercising"},{"t":"B细胞αv整合素调节肺生发中心和记忆B细胞的组织特化和克隆扩张","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb7633?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Lung-resident B cells are increasingly recognized as key contributors to protective immunity against respiratory viruses, yet the mechanisms that govern their generation and specialization remain poorly understood. Here, we identify B cell–intrinsic αv integrin as a critical negative regulator of germinal center (GC) dynamics and memory B cell formation in the lung following influenza A virus infection. Using B cell–specific αv knockout mice, we show that loss of B cell αv integrin leads to persistent GC activity within the inducible bronchus-associated lymphoid tissue and expansion of lung-resident memory B cells, including IgA\n                    +\n                    and cross-reactive B cells capable of recognizing heterologous influenza variants. Single-cell transcriptomic and B cell receptor sequence analyses reveal that αv restricts clonal expansion and antigenic diversification of GC and memory B cells in the lung, but not in draining lymph nodes, indicating a spatially restricted mechanism of mucosal B cell regulation. These findings position αv integrin as a key checkpoint that constrains local mucosal B cell evolution and suggest previously unexplored strategies to improve mucosal vaccine efficacy by enhancing GC activity directly in the lung."},{"t":"作者更正：麻醉的人类海马体的可塑性和语言","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10784-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"In the version of the article initially published, the time scale in Fig. 1e was off by a factor of 10. The x axis originally read “0, 67, 133, 200” with the label “Time (µs)” but should have read “0, 0.67, 1.33, 2” with the label “Time (ms)”. This correction has been made to the HTML and PDF versions of the article."},{"t":"苯并呋喃衍生物的阻转选择性去芳构化交叉偶联：乙烯基C─O键的Z选择性功能化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2984592?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"苯并呋喃不对称偶联","kp":["[催化剂]: 手性镍催化剂","[选择性]: Z式选择性构建轴手性"],"as":"该研究开发了苯并呋喃衍生物的催化不对称去芳构化交叉偶联反应，通过Z型选择性官能化实现轴手性产物的对映选择性合成。该方法拓展了杂芳族化合物的不对称转化策略，为手性药物中间体和功能分子的构建提供了新途径。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atroposelective Dearomative Cross‐Coupling of Benzofuran Derivatives by Z‐Selective Functionalization of the Vinyl C─O B","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Catalytic asymmetric transformation of benzofuran derivatives has received significant attention owing to its capacity to prepare chiral molecules from readily available feedstocks. Herein, an unprecedented asymmetric cross‐coupling of benzofuran derivatives is reported for the construction of axial chirality. Employing a chiral nickel catalyst, this approach is achieved through direct enantio‐ and Z‐selective dearomative functionalization of the vinyl C─O bond, providing efficient access to valuable atropisomeric acyclic alkenes. A broad substrate scope is demonstrated under mild conditions. Moreover, experimental and theoretical mechanistic studies suggest that the stereochemical outcome is facilitated by a dynamic epimerization between diastereomeric six‐membered (\n                    Z\n                    )‐styryl‐nickelacycle intermediates."},{"t":"单原子分散铁催化烯丙基与炔丙基C─H键的有氧羟基化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2913960?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁催化C-H羟基化","kp":["[催化剂]: 原子级分散铁","[反应]: 分子氧好氧羟基化C-H键"],"as":"该研究利用原子级分散铁催化剂实现烯丙基和炔丙基C─H键的有氧羟基化反应，以分子氧为氧化剂。碳氢键的选择性官能化是有机合成的核心目标，该原子分散催化体系兼具高活性、高选择性与绿色氧化条件，具有重要的合成应用价值。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atomically Dispersed Iron‐Catalyzed Aerobic Hydroxylation of Allylic and Propargylic C─H Bonds","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Selective functionalization of carbon–hydrogen bonds represents a central goal in modern organic synthesis, yet achieving site‐ and chemoselective oxidation using molecular oxygen remains a longstanding challenge. In particular, aerobic hydroxylation of allylic and propargylic C─H bonds is difficult due to overoxidation and competing side reactions. Here we report a heterogeneous catalyst featuring atomically dispersed iron sites embedded in a nitrogen‐doped carbon matrix. This catalyst enables unprecedented site‐ and chemoselective allylic and propargylic C─H hydroxylation of alkenes and alkynes using air as the oxidant at 30°C. The method accommodates a broad range of terminal and internal substrates with excellent functional‐group tolerance and enables late‐stage oxidation of structurally complex molecules. Mechanistic studies demonstrate that the catalytic activity originates from highly dispersed FeN\n                    x\n                    sites. This work highlights the potential of single‐atom catalysis to address fundamental challenges in sustainable C─H oxidation and expands the toolbox for selective oxidative transformations."},{"t":"MOF纳米结构原子配位工程：CO2电还原高值多碳产物的工业级电流密度","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2590405?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF电还原CO2","kp":["[催化剂]: MOF原子配位工程","[目标产物]: 多碳C2+产物","[电流密度]: 工业级"],"as":"该研究通过原子级配位工程调控金属有机框架（MOF）纳米结构，实现CO2电还原为高附加值多碳（Multi-C）产物。MOF材料因其可调控的活性位点与结构多样性在电化学CO2还原中展现出巨大潜力，配位工程策略可显著提升产物选择性与催化效率。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Atomic Coordination Engineering of MOF Nanostructures for CO2 Electroreduction to High‐Value Multi‐Carbon Products at In","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) have shown great promise for electrochemical carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) reduction into value‐added chemicals/fuels, thereby supporting the balance of carbon‐neutral energy cycle. The multi‐carbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) production on MOF electrocatalysts is of great significance but remains challenging due to inefficient C–C coupling. Here, we report the atomic coordination regulation of MOF nanostructures (Cu‐Trz‐Br) for efficient CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction by rationally designing dual‐site Cu catalysts. The crystallographic structure of Cu‐Trz‐Br is determined by three‐dimensional electron diffraction and Rietveld refinement against high‐resolution powder X‐ray diffraction data, which feature unique mixed coordination modes of Cu–N\n                    4\n                    Br\n                    2\n                    and Cu–N\n                    4\n                    sites. In CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction, Cu‐Trz‐Br demonstrates much enhanced selectivity toward C\n                    2+\n                    products compared to common counterparts with only Cu–N\n                    4\n                    sites, enabling efficient C\n                    2+\n                    production under industrial‐level current density. In situ studies and theoretical calculations reveal that the coordination regulation of Cu–N\n                    4\n                    Br\n                    2\n                    sites promotes CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and activation, as well as effectively enhances local *CO availability near Cu‐Trz‐Br, thereby facilitating C–C coupling toward C\n                    2+\n                    products.","aip":1},{"t":"评估全球牧场放牧强度提高的气候净效益","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz4320?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Improved rangeland grazing could mitigate climate change through carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) sequestration in soils and vegetation. However, altering grazing practices to increase ecosystem carbon storage may also decrease livestock production and/or increase greenhouse gas emissions through the supply chain, such that the net emissions impacts remain unclear. Here, we assess the global net mitigation potential of improving grazing intensity by quantifying potential CO\n                    2\n                    sequestration alongside systems-level impacts of plant productivity changes, livestock emissions, feed requirements, and production constraints. Improving grazing intensity in global rangelands could sequester 2.2 ± 0.43 gigatons of carbon dioxide equivalent (Gt/CO\n                    2\n                    eq) per year in the near term, but maintaining livestock production through supplemental feeding would reduce net mitigation by 2 to 31% (to 1.8 ± 0.45 GT/CO\n                    2\n                    eq per year). Our results suggest that neglecting systems-level emissions impacts may substantially overestimate the global climate benefits of improved grazing.","tp":"放牧碳减排","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"评估全球牧场放牧强度提高的气候净效益。研究指出，通过增强土壤和植被碳封存可缓解气候变化，但改变放牧方式可能降低畜牧产出或增加供应链温室气体排放，因此净减排效应尚不确定。该研究量化了改善放牧强度的全球净缓解潜力，为权衡碳封存收益与畜牧生产及供应链排放成本提供了系统性评估框架。"},{"t":"仿生纳米晶域设计：实现极致强韧透明纤维素光子水凝胶","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed8263?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纤维素光子水凝胶","kp":["[仿生结构]: 类蜘蛛丝取向纳米晶域","[特性]: 高强透明","[材料]: 纤维素光子水凝胶"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究受仿生蜘蛛丝启发，通过构筑纳米晶域实现超韧且透明的纤维素光功能材料。蜘蛛丝的高取向晶体层级结构赋予其卓越力学与光学性能，研究将其设计原理移植至纤维素材料，在透明度与机械韧性之间取得平衡，开拓了生物启发材料的新方向。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Architecting bioinspired nanocrystalline domains for ultimate robust and transparent cellulose photonic hydrogels","b":"Biomimetic spider silk achieves remarkable functionalities through hierarchical architectures with highly oriented crystalline domains, offering potential across multiple disciplines. However, achieving uniform alignment and spatial control of nanocrystalline domains remains a critical challenge, limiting the realization of structure-derived optical and mechanical functionalities in bioinspired systems. Here, we develop an ultrastrong, transparent photonic hydrogel composed of cellulose nanocrystals (CNCs), wherein a programmable five-stage stretching-pause process enables precise alignment of CNC domains without sacrificing their intrinsic chirality—unattainable in conventional flexible polymers. This strategy facilitates uniform nanocrystal reorientation (orientation factor = 0.91) and transforms the porous network into aligned nanofibril bundles, yielding optical transparency (&gt;90%) with anisotropic polarization responses, superior mechanical strength (61.6 MPa), toughness (251.8 MJ·m\n                    −3\n                    ), and fatigue resistance (226.7 kJ·m\n                    −2\n                    ). The flexible hydrogel resists creasing and serves as a sustainable scattering polarizer for programmable polarized displays and secure information encryption, providing a versatile platform for advanced optical and electronic applications."},{"t":"s-吲达苯分子桥反芳香驱动的单分子电导增强","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3299896?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High electrical conductance of antiaromatic molecules compared with aromatic counterparts at the single‐molecule level has been a topic of controversy, with only a few previous experimental proofs. We synthesized length‐matched molecular wires incorporating 12 π‐electron antiaromatic\n                    s\n                    ‐indacene (Ind) and 14 π‐electron aromatic benzodithiophene (BDT) cores with different anchoring modes and measured the single‐molecule electrical conductance (SMEC) by scanning tunneling microscopy‐break junction method, validating that antiaromatic cores significantly enhance the conductance. For the diagonally anchored systems, the antiaromatic Ind derivative exhibits SMEC approximately 10 times higher than that of its aromatic BDT analogue, thanks to the cooperative effects of a linear conjugation pathway and the narrow gap between the highest occupied molecular orbital (HOMO) and the lowest unoccupied molecular orbital (LUMO) that brings favorable frontier molecular orbital (FMO) alignment with the electrode Fermi level. Notably, for the horizontally anchored systems, the Ind derivative exhibits SMEC 2.8 times higher than that of its BDT counterpart, as its antiaromaticity‐driven FMO alignment overtakes the cross‐conjugation pathway. Additionally, introduction of electron‐withdrawing trifluoromethyl groups to the Ind core shifts the LUMO closer to the Fermi level, resulting in 1.5 times higher conductance. These results definitively demonstrate the enhancement of SMEC driven by antiaromaticity."},{"t":"Anthropic寻求首批数据中心租赁，向谷歌寻求资金支持","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/anthropic-pursues-first-data-center-leases-seeks-financial-backing-google","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"the information","as":"Anthropic正寻求其首批数据中心租赁服务，并向谷歌寻求资金方面的支持。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"AI数据中心租赁","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":1.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Anthropic Pursues First Data Center Leases, Seeks Financial Backing From Google","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"人性使其商业伙伴措手不及","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/anthropic-blindsides-business-partners","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"安泰太阳能发布80米多驱动太阳能跟踪支架 - pv magazine Global","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/antaisolar-unveils-80-meter-multi-drive-solar-tracker/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"太阳能跟踪支架","kp":["跨度[太阳能跟踪支架]: 80m","抗风速[跟踪支架]: 60m/s","[驱动]: 多驱动2P构型"],"as":"Antaisolar在SNEC 2026展会上发布了升级版TAI-Universal 2P多驱动太阳能跟踪支架，长度达80米。该产品采用多驱动系统增强抗风稳定性与结构可靠性，提升了大规模光伏阵列的土地利用效率与发电量，体现了光伏跟踪支架技术的发展趋势。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Antaisolar unveils 80-meter multi-drive solar tracker - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nAt SNEC 2026, Antaisolar unveiled its upgraded TAI-Universal 2P multi-drive solar tracker with reinforced structure, up to 80 m spans and 60 m/s wind resistance.\nVincent Shaw\nTechnology & Products\nUtility-scale\nImage: pv magazine\nAntaisolar has unveiled an upgraded version of its TAI-Universal 2P multi-drive solar tracker at SNEC 2026 in Shanghai last week.\nThe system features reinforced main structures and joint points, supporting spans of up to 80 meters and wind resistance of up to 60 m/s.\nAntaisolar said the longer span and higher structural strength are intended to reduce pile counts and lower project levelized cost of energy (LCOE). The design targets large ground-mounted solar plants, including projects in desert and other arid regions, where foundation requirements, wind performance and installation efficiency are key cost drivers.\nThe tracker uses a 2P multi-drive architecture with multiple drive points along each tracker row. According to the company, the design improves torque distribution and structural stability across longer rows, while supporting high-power modules and higher DC/AC ratios. It also said the system is designed to enhance bifacial gain by reducing rear-side shading. However, Antaisolar did not disclose a production ramp-up timeline for the upgraded TAI-Universal in its SNEC release.\nAntaisolar also showcased its AT-Spark 1P flagship tracker and SmartTrail intelligent tracker control system. AT-Spark uses the company’s self-developed octagonal torque tube and dual spherical bearing design. The latest version delivers a 40% increase in structural stiffness and 50% higher strength, making it suitable for long-row layouts and complex terrain, the company said.\nThe SmartTrail control system is compatible across Antaisolar’s tracker portfolio. It uses multi-dimensional irradiance algorithms to optimize tracker angles and includes protection logic for extreme operating conditions, supporting stable performance under high wind, snow, hail and sandstorm events.\nThe SNEC launch came shortly after Antaisolar was ranked seventh in Wood Mackenzie’s 2026 global PV tracker manufacturer ranking and named a Global Grade A tracker manufacturer. Wood Mackenzie said its ranking assesses manufacturers across criteria including R&D, after-sales service, supply chain stability, certifications, financial health and ESG performance.\nDuring the exhibition, Antaisolar also announced several certification and partnership updates. It signed a strategic agreement with TÜV Rheinland covering UK market access certification, and an ESG cooperation agreement with TÜV SÜD. Its Altra-Metals rooftop mounting system received UL 2703 certification, while AT-Spark obtained IEC 62817 certification.\nAntaisolar also signed strategic agreements with Gebeng Energy and Raystech covering more than 800 MW of solar projects and cooperation across Southeast Asia and Australia. The company said its cumulative global shipments reached 50.1 GW across 21 countries by the end of 2025.\nVincent Shaw\nView author posts"},{"t":"用于无电池无线外周神经调节的可注射、无引线生物电子接口","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeg1437?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Injectable bioelectronics offer a minimally invasive approach to peripheral nerve stimulation but remain limited by onboard energy storage and fragile leads. Here, we present SEED, a leadless, battery-free bioelectronic interface engineered for percutaneous delivery through a standard 14-gauge needle. SEED (Stimulating Electrode for Electroceutical Delivery) operates in the magnetoquasistatic regime using low-frequency (65 kilohertz) resonant inductive coupling, externalizing waveform generation and control, enabling programmable neuromodulation without onboard active electronics. A spiral-helix electrode geometry promotes longitudinal nerve engagement while limiting off-target field spread. Benchtop and ex vivo characterization demonstrates precise, programmable control of stimulation frequency, pulse width, and amplitude under physiologically relevant conditions. In vivo validation in a rat sciatic nerve model confirms frequency-locked motor responses and graded neural recruitment following percutaneous deployment. SEED exhibits strong radiopacity and acoustic contrast, supporting compatibility with ultrasound and computed tomography for image-guided neuromodulation. This platform provides a scalable pathway toward minimally invasive bioelectronic therapies.","tp":"可注射电极","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"SEED（Stimulating Electrode for Electroceutical Delivery）是一种可注射、无引线、无电池的生物电子接口，专为经皮递送设计，可通过标准14号针头注入体内。该器件解决了传统可注射生物电子在板载储能和脆弱引线方面的瓶颈。SEED工作在磁准静态频段，采用65 kHz低频谐振电感耦合技术，将波形生成外部化——即能量供给与信号调制均在体外完成，植入物本身无需携带电源。这一设计显著降低了器件复杂度和体积，为微创外周神经刺激提供了新范式。该技术有望推动\"电疗\"（electroceutical）领域发展，使无电池植入式神经调节器件更接近临床转化，适用于慢性疼痛、炎症控制等多种治疗场景。","aip":1},{"t":"胚胎编辑“首次”比头条新闻所暗示的要复杂","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5922?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Scientists may have a better way to make gene-edited babies, but it’s still far from safe"},{"t":"章鱼仿生凝胶电解质通过构建差异化通道调控锂硫电池阳离子迁移","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71197?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池电解质","kp":["[电解质策略]: 仿章鱼凝胶差异化溶剂化","[目标]: 抑制多硫化锂穿梭"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究受章鱼启发设计了一种凝胶电解质，通过持续调控阳离子迁移抑制锂硫电池中多硫化锂的穿梭效应。多硫化锂穿梭是锂硫电池性能退化的主要原因，仿生凝胶电解质通过仿生机制调控离子输运，为提升锂硫电池循环寿命提供了新策略。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"An Octopus‐Inspired Gel Electrolyte Regulates Cation Migration in Lithium–Sulfur Batteries via Constructing Differentiat","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) shuttling is a major cause of performance degradation in lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries. Recent studies indicate that LiPSs readily bind with free Li\n                    +\n                    to form cationic species that migrate together with Li\n                    +\n                    . Conventional strategies that ignore solvation environment regulation for selective cation separation often hinder Li\n                    +\n                    dissociation and transport. In this study, guided by quantum calculations and inspired by octopus morphology, acetylated polysorbate (Ac‐CP80) was synthesized via photoinitiated radical polymerization using reactive amphiphilic monomers. Structural characterization confirmed that the material forms a multi‐armed, biomimetic structure with multiple adsorption sites, enabling in‐situ formation of a gel electrolyte (Ac‐CP80@PP). Through an integrated approach combining in situ and 2D Raman spectroscopy, X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS), charge‐discharge cycling, post‐electrode analysis, concentration‐dependent Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    6\n                    simulation experiments, and molecular dynamics simulations, it is systematically revealed that Ac‐CP80 creates a differentiated solvation environment: hyperbranched PEO side chains like tentacles capture LiPSs and guide them into the weakly solvating cross‐linked network, suppressing LiPSs shuttling; terminal esters enhance local solvation to promote Li\n                    +\n                    dissociation and transport. With Ac‐CP80@PP, Li–S batteries achieve capacity of 781.6 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.5 C and retain stability over 600 cycles with only 0.06% decay per cycle, exhibiting excellent cycling stability."},{"t":"耐氨碳包覆钴催化剂：电催化硝酸盐还原制取挥发性氨","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7866851?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化硝酸盐还原","kp":["催化剂[硝酸盐还原制氨]: Co@C碳壳封装钴","[关键特性]: 兼顾合成效率与氨分离"],"as":"该研究开发了碳包覆钴催化剂，实现电催化硝酸盐还原生成挥发性含氮产物（如氨），并具备抗氨性能。电催化硝酸盐还原制氨是可持续氮利用的潜力路线，碳包覆策略提升了钴催化剂的稳定性与耐久性，解决了催化剂在含氨环境中的失活问题。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ammonia‐Resistant Carbon‐Encapsulated Cobalt Catalyst for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Volatile Ammonia","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia presents a promising route for sustainable nitrogen utilization; however, current efforts remain largely confined to optimizing synthesis efficiency, with insufficient attention paid to the concurrent challenge of ammonia separation—a key bottleneck for scalable deployment. Here, we report carbon‐shell‐encapsulated cobalt nanoparticles (Co@C), which uniquely enable integrated ammonia synthesis and in situ gas‐phase purification under strongly alkaline conditions. In both sequencing batch and continuous‐flow electrolyzers, Co@C delivers a robust nitrate‐to‐ammonia Faradaic efficiency of 92.4%, maintaining performance even in the presence of exogenous ammonia. Critically, the high‐pH environment shifts the NH\n                    3\n                    /NH\n                    4\n                    +\n                    equilibrium toward volatile NH\n                    3\n                    , enabling spontaneous volatilization and direct gaseous collection. Combined experimental and theoretical analyses demonstrate that the carbon shells confer dual functionality: they physically suppress Co leaching while electronically modulating surface adsorption to weaken NH\n                    3\n                    binding and accelerate desorption. Our work establishes a catalyst design principle centered on ammonia resistance and introduces an electrochemical platform that unifies synthesis, separation, and purification in a single step."},{"t":"铝导向两性自重构高熵AlFeCoNiCuCr-LDH实现高效全解水","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71178?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵催化剂析氢","kp":["催化剂[全解水]: AlFeCoNiCuCr高熵LDH","[机理]: 铝导向两性自重构"],"as":"研究高熵催化剂中的电化学自重构机制。高熵层状双氢氧化物AlFeCoNiCuCr-LDH在铝导向下发生两性自重构，调控催化活性与稳定性。该机制通过铝元素定向驱动表面结构重组，显著提升析氧等催化反应效率。研究揭示了高熵催化剂在电化学条件下的动态结构演变规律，为高效能源转换催化剂的设计提供了新思路。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Aluminum‐Directed Amphoteric Self‐Reconstruction in High‐Entropy AlFeCoNiCuCr‐LDH for Efficient Overall Water Splitting","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical self‐reconstruction in high‐entropy catalysts governs their catalytic activity and stability. However, uncontrolled structural evolution often led to performance degradation, rendering the precise modulation of these interfacial pathways a major bottleneck. Herein, we report an aluminum‐containing high‐entropy layered double hydroxide (Al‐HELDH) and elucidate its amphoteric self‐reconstruction mechanism. During electrochemical activation, selective leaching of amphoteric aluminum species significantly enhances access to metal active sites while inducing formation of surface‐enriched Al(OH)\n                    x\n                    hydroxyl layers. This hydroxylated interface effectively regulates adsorption and dissociation processes, stabilizing the reconfigured catalytic surface and simultaneously boosting catalytic activity and durability. In situ spectroscopy and density functional theory calculations confirm Ni as the primary catalytic center, with other metal species cooperatively modulating the local electronic environment. Benefiting from synergistic high‐entropy effects and a functional Al(OH)\n                    x\n                    interface layer, reconstructed Al‐HELDH significantly reduces interfacial energy barriers for key reaction steps and accelerates reaction kinetics. The catalyst exhibits overpotentials of 64 and 226 mV for the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) and oxygen evolution reaction (OER) at a current density of 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively, while maintaining stable operation for over 1000 h. This work establishes a reconstruction‐based design strategy, providing a robust pathway for developing non‐precious metal bifunctional catalysts for sustainable hydrogen production."},{"t":"碱浸取：一种简便的表面活化策略提升固体氧化物燃料电池空气电极反应活性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73511?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固体氧化物燃料电池电极","kp":["[活化策略]: 碱浸表面活化","[应用]: SOFC空气电极"],"dp":1,"as":"提出碱浸出作为空气电极的简便表面活化策略。通过对空气电极进行碱性浸蚀处理，改善电极表面活性位点的暴露程度与反应动力学，从而提升电极的电催化反应性。该方法工艺简单、条件温和，为金属空气电池和燃料电池电极的性能优化提供了一种实用化的表面改性途径。","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Alkaline Leaching: A Facile Surface Activation Strategy to Improve the Reactivity of Air Electrodes for Solid Oxide Fuel","b":"Surface Activation Strategy for Perovskite Oxide Air Electrodes The cover illustration highlights a surface activation s..."},{"t":"干扰导致欧洲森林碳汇下降惊人","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag354/8706387?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","b":"Forests are carbon sinks essential for climate change mitigation. However, increased harvests and natural disturbances across Europe have recently challenged this role. To project the future carbon sink capacity of Europe’s forests, we integrated country reports from the United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC) with remote sensing maps of disturbances and above-ground biomass. Our model simulates biomass dynamics at 18 km resolution from 2010 to 2030, predicting a 39% decrease in the EU-27 forest carbon sink, driven by disturbances outpacing biomass recovery. Consequently, the 2030 forest carbon sink will fall 27% short of the estimated target consistent with EU-27 climate objectives. We demonstrate that the three billion trees initiative is insufficient for climate change mitigation and needs to be combined with a 28% reduction in forest harvests from 2025 to 2030 to meet these targets.","tp":"森林碳损失","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现，欧洲森林作为关键碳汇的功能正面临严峻挑战。过度采伐与自然干扰（虫害、风暴、火灾等）的叠加效应导致森林固碳能力显著下降。研究团队整合了联合国气候变化框架公约（UNFCCC）各国报告与遥感的干扰分布图及地上生物量数据，构建了18公里分辨率的生物量动态模拟模型，覆盖2010至2030年。模型预测结果显示，欧洲森林碳汇容量将下降约39%，这一降幅远超此前预期。这意味着欧洲气候政策中依赖森林抵消碳排放的战略可能严重失效，碳核算体系亟需修正。该研究揭示了自然干扰对碳汇的长期侵蚀效应，为重新评估森林在碳中和路径中的角色提供了量化依据。"},{"t":"Airengy与Hagag Europe将在罗马尼亚建设5 GWh压缩空气储能电站 - Energy Storage","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/12/airengy-hagag-europe-to-build-5-gwh-compressed-air-energy-storage-plant-in-romania/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/储热/压缩空气","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"压缩空气储能电站","kp":["放电容量[压缩空气储能]: 5GWh","投资额[罗马尼亚项目]: 5500万欧元","[技术]: AirBattery盐穴CAES"],"as":"以色列上市公司Airengy与Hagag Europe宣布在罗马尼亚合作建设一座5 GWh压缩空气储能（CAES）电站，投资约5500万欧元（约6360万美元）。该项目利用压缩空气技术实现电网级大规模储能，旨在提升区域电力系统的灵活性和可再生能源消纳能力。这是压缩空气储能商业化部署的重要里程碑，有助于推动欧洲储能基础设施建设。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Airengy, Hagag Europe to build 5 GWh compressed-air energy storage plant in Romania - Energy Storage","b":"Two Tel Aviv Stock Exchange-listed companies, Airengy and Hagag Europe, are investing approximately €55 million ($63.6 million) to develop a compressed air power plant in Romania.\nThe project will use Airengy’s proprietary long duration ‘AirBattery’ technology for compressed air energy storage (CAES) in salt caverns. The Romanian plant will be developed in two phases, reaching a discharge capacity of 25 MW and a storage capacity of up to 5 GWh.\nHagag Europe and Airengy will each own 40% through a special purpose company. An unnamed third party will own the remaining 20%. Airengy will take on planning, design, construction and operation of the project and its AirBattery system.\nPhase one will initially add around 200 MWh of storage capacity, at an estimated construction cost of €4.5 million.\nJoshua Tzvi, VP Business Development Technologies, Airengy told\nit estimates construction will begin in 2027 with commercial operation expected in early 2028.\nThe AirBattery has already been deployed on a smaller scale. The Romania project and investment by Hagag Europe represents a major vote of confidence in commercializing the technology, which Airengy developed to complement lithium-ion battery systems.\n“We started with a 10 kW scale pilot in central Israel, and we are currently operating a 250 kW plant in southern Israel,” explained Tzvi.\nDuring the charging phase, excess electricity is used to compress air, which is then injected and stored in underground salt caverns. During discharge, the compressed air is released from the cavern into a dedicated hydraulic system. The expanding air applies pressure on water, which is routed through a turbine to generate electricity fed into the grid. The entire process uses only water and air, with no polluting materials or rare metals, enabling operation for decades with low wear and minimal operating and maintenance costs, Airengy maintains. The technology is also climate agnostic, said Tzvi.\nWhen asked why Romania is an ideal location for such a project, Tzvi pointed to the market’s local cost structure. He said Airengy had been focusing on outreach in markets with highly decarbonized grids, established salt cavern gas storage and complementary policy frameworks.\nHe said Hagag Europe’s involvement was a key consideration in pursuing the opportunity in Romania. Hagag Europe will secure usage rights for the salt caverns as part of its expansion into the Romanian energy infrastructure market. Besides energy, the company is also active in real estate.\n“Hagag brought to our attention that there are many unutilized salt caverns in Romania,” said Tzvi. “Some of these caverns already have a grid connection and industrial facilities nearby, which could be ideal to expedite the stepping-stone facility.”\nTzvi said Airengy is also active in other European markets like Germany and the United Kingdom. It has a collaboration with Kistos Energy Storage in the UK and it is working with natural gas storage company SEFE in Germany to evaluate a large-scale project site."},{"t":"自适应空腔赋能纳米碳笼的结晶手性调控","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4894757?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性纳米碳笼","kp":["[机制]: 自适应空腔效应","[调控手段]: 结晶溶剂/蒈烯客体分子"],"dp":1,"as":"研究手性纳米碳笼的结晶手性调控。手性纳米碳因其独特的手性光学性质，在先进光学应用中具有重要价值。该工作通过适应性空腔设计，实现了纳米碳笼从分子手性到结晶手性的传递与放大。这一策略突破了手性纳米碳合成中手性控制难、结晶化不足的瓶颈，为手性光学材料、不对称催化和分子识别等领域的应用奠定了基础。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Adaptive Cavity‐Enabled Crystalline Chirality in Nanocarbon Cages","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chiral nanocarbons are attractive because their unique chiroptical properties enable advanced optical applications. In this work, we report the discovery that the chirality of nanocarbon cages may be changed in the crystalline state through an “adaptive cavity” effect. This effect allows the use of different crystallization solvents or the introduction of coronene guest molecules to modulate the conformation of the nanocarbon cages. This adaptive behavior permits construction of chiral hierarchical superstructures from achiral building blocks. The resulting chiral crystals exhibit second‐harmonic generation activity and a strong piezoelectric response (\n                    d\n                    33\n                    = 120 pm/V). This work details a novel method for constructing molecular‐level chirality‐controlled solid‐state systems, providing not only proof‐of‐concept examples but also new insights into the development of advanced chiral crystalline nanocarbon materials."},{"t":"量子计算机上的从头多费米子结构计算","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/1spg-5ld3","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子多体结构计算","kp":["[算法]: 从头算多费米子结构量子计算","[应用]: 核与粒子物理自束缚体系"],"dp":1,"as":"研究在量子计算机上实现从头多费米子结构计算。现有经典算法在处理复杂多费米子系统时面临计算复杂度急剧增长的瓶颈。该工作提出量子算法方案，利用量子计算优势直接模拟原子核或多电子体系的结构，为核物理、量子化学等领域中强关联系统的精确计算开辟了新路径，展示了量子计算在基础物理研究中的实际应用潜力。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ab initio many-fermion structure calculations on a quantum computer","b":"Author(s): Weijie Du, Yangguang Yang, Zixin Liu, Chao Yang, and James P. VaryTo overcome the limitations of existing algorithms for solving self-bound quantum many-body problems—such as those encountered in nuclear and particle physics—that access only a restricted subset of energy levels and provide limited structural information, we introduce and demonstrate a novel quantu…[Phys. Rev. C 113, L061302] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"面向电力系统韧性的储能技术综述：功能、指标与应用","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007087?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"储能电力韧性","dp":1,"as":"","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"A review of energy storage for power system resilience: Functions, metrics, and applications"},{"t":"电化学工艺驱动的锂离子电池回收与再生技术综述","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008263?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂电池电化学回收","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"A review of electrochemical process-driven recycling and regeneration technologies for lithium-ion batteries"},{"t":"APP 通过溶酶体胞吐作用清除核废物中的保护作用","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524190123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Amyloid precursor protein (APP) is widely known for its role in Alzheimer’s disease (AD) pathogenesis through its proteolytic processing into amyloid-β peptides. However, its physiological functions remain incompletely understood. Here, we uncover a protective role for full-length APP in facilitating the disposal of nuclear-derived debris under genotoxic stress. In both cultured cells and in vivo mouse models, loss of APP leads to nuclear waste accumulation, increased inflammation, and cell death, whereas APP overexpression mitigates these effects. Mechanistically, we show that APP supports the extracellular release of nuclear waste material through lysosomal exocytosis. APP mutants associated with familial AD fail to mediate this process. Consistently, human AD brain tissue exhibits abnormal nuclear morphology, accumulation of nuclear waste in the cytoplasm, and reduced APP levels per neuron. These findings highlight a conserved cellular mechanism by which APP contributes to nuclear and cellular homeostasis, and suggest that impaired nuclear waste clearance may represent an underappreciated contributor to neurodegeneration."},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池建模新方法及氢燃料电池汽车整车级验证","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008421?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池建模","as":"","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"A novel approach to modeling of polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cells with vehicle-level validation in a hydrogen elec"},{"t":"面向现代电气化的非凸能源系统优化混合神经模糊深度强化学习框架","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008251?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源系统优化","as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"A hybrid neuro-fuzzy deep reinforcement learning framework for non-convex energy system optimization in modern electrifi"},{"t":"人类渐渗结构变异和选择的全球图谱","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz7518?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Genetic introgression from Neanderthals and Denisovans shaped modern human genomes; however, introgressed structural variants (SVs ≥ 50 base pairs) remain challenging to discover. We integrated high-quality phased assemblies from four new Papua New Guinea (PNG) haploid genomes with 94 published assemblies of diverse ancestry to infer an introgressed SV map. Introgressed SVs are enriched in genes (47%), including critical genomic disorder regions, and are most abundant in PNG genomes. We identified 11 centromeres likely derived from archaic hominins, adding unexplored diversity to centromere genomics. Pangenome genotyping of these 98 assemblies across 1363 samples revealed 16 adaptive SVs, many associated with immune-related genes and expression, in the PNG genomes. We hypothesize that archaic SVs contributed to reproductive success, underscoring introgression as a major force in human adaptive evolution."},{"t":"兼具超高能量密度与超快响应的可生物降解低压软驱动器","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec5692?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"开发了一种可生物降解、低压驱动的软致动器，兼具高能量密度和超快响应特性。该致动器整合了生物可降解性、对人体安全刺激的响应能力以及优异的驱动性能，解决了传统软致动器在可降解性、驱动电压和性能之间难以兼顾的难题。低压驱动保证了人机交互的安全性，高能量密度和快速响应使其在软体机器人、可穿戴医疗器件等领域具有广阔应用前景。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可降解软驱动器","kp":["材料体系[软致动器]: 微纤化纤维素+PEG网络","驱动特性[软致动器]: 可生物降解低压驱动","性能[致动器]: 高能量密度超快响应"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A biodegradable low-voltage soft actuator with exceptional energy density and ultrafast response","b":"Soft actuators that integrate biodegradability, responsiveness to human-safe stimuli, and high actuation performance are highly desirable for next-generation biomedical devices. However, current systems fail to realize these attributes within a single platform. Here, we propose a microfibrillated cellulose (MFC)–based soft actuator incorporating a poly(ethylene glycol) (PEG) network to suppress crystallinity and ionic liquid (IL) aggregation. This design enhances ionic conductivity, forms abundant ion transport channels, and reduces interfacial resistance. Operated at 1 volt, the actuator achieves a record-high energy density of 64.4 kilojoules per cubic meter and the fastest response time of 1 second among reported ionic electroactive polymers (IEAPs) under the same conditions. Such materials are biocompatible and biodegradable in various physiological environments. Device-level demonstrations show that an actuation-enabled sciatic nerve cuff enables high-fidelity signal transmission in vitro with a signal-to-noise ratio of 40 decibels and stable real-time in vivo neural recording with evoked responses of up to ~150 microvolts, supporting minimally invasive bioelectronic interfacing."},{"t":"聚磷酸盐驱动的通用核苷至5′-三磷酸核苷酶级联体系","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6720227?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"核苷酸酶级联合成","kp":["[酶级联]: 双酶级联多磷酸驱动","[产物]: 全部标准rNTP和dNTP","[工艺]: 一锅法核苷转化为NTP"],"as":"开发了一种由多磷酸驱动的通用核苷到核苷5'-三磷酸（NTP）的酶级联合成路线。NTP是核酸合成的重要构建单元，但现有合成方法效率有限。该工作利用多磷酸作为能量供体，设计酶级联反应实现从核苷到NTP的一步转化，具有底物谱广、通用性强的特点。该策略为NTP的高效、低成本生物合成提供了新途径，有助于推动核酸药物和合成生物学研究。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Universal Nucleoside‐to‐Nucleoside‐5′‐Triphosphate Enzyme Cascade Driven by Polyphosphate","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nucleoside‐5′‐triphosphates (NTPs) are important building blocks for nucleic acids, but the efficiency of their chemical synthesis is limited by the low yield of the final 5′‐triphosphorylation reaction. Here, we present an enzymatic cascade reaction involving just two enzymes that enable nucleosides‐to‐NTPs conversion for all canonical rNTPs and dNTPs. The cascade is used in a single one‐pot operation driven by cost‐efficient sodium polyphosphate (polyP). The broad‐spectrum deoxynucleoside kinase (Dm‐dNK) from\n                    Drosophila melanogaster\n                    converts nucleosides into nucleoside‐5′‐monophosphates (NMPs) using ATP. The polyphosphate kinase family 2, class III (EbPPK) from an\n                    Erysipelotrichaceae\n                    bacterium simultaneously recycles ATP required by Dm‐dNK and converts the NMPs to NTPs in a polyP‐dependent reaction. Importantly, only trace amounts of catalytic ATP (0.0001 equivalents or less) are required. In addition to canonical NTPs, the cascade can generate ribose‐ and base‐modified NTP analogues. This is demonstrated through the synthesis of a set of eleven modified nucleotides, including the four 2′‐fluoro‐2′‐dNTPs and nucleotides with 2,6‐diaminopurine as the nucleobase. Production of an essential component for mRNA therapeutics,\n                    N\n                    1‐methyl‐ΨTP (m\n                    1\n                    ΨTP), is demonstrated on a milligram scale."},{"t":"可逆900 nm近红外光开关用于隐形书写二维与三维显示","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5802775?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"近红外光开关","kp":["[吸收波长]: 900nm近红外","[特性]: 可逆光开关","[应用]: 隐形写入2D/3D显示"],"as":"报道了一种可逆的900 nm近红外光开关分子，用于隐形写入的2D和3D显示器。分子光开关可在不同光激发下实现状态可逆转换。该光开关工作在近红外波段，肉眼不可见，可实现信息的隐形写入与读取。研究展示了其在2D和3D显示中的应用，为防伪、安全信息存储和隐形光学器件等领域的开发提供了新材料方案。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Reversible 900 nm Near‐Infrared Photoswitch for Invisibly Writable 2D and 3D Displays","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Molecular photoswitches interchange between different states in response to light irradiation and represent prominent tools to deliberately control changes at the smallest scales. A standing challenge for their development is pushing absorptions into the low‐energy end of the electromagnetic spectrum, which is highly desirable to avoid photodamage, allows mixing of photoresponsive components, and maximizes the available color range. Here we report on a novel photoswitch motif,\n                    peri\n                    ‐benzo[\n                    a\n                    ]fluoranthenethioindigo (PBFT), enabling direct excitation with near‐infrared (NIR) light up to 900 nm wavelengths in a fully reversible fashion. PBFT provides an outstanding property profile with high isomer yields, good thermal bistability, and strongly distinct color changes from pale green to deep blue. Application within a commercially available and easy‐to‐use polymer material allows to realize reversible and spatially resolved inscription of information with extremely long wavelengths of light. Writing information into versatile handheld 2D and 3D optical displays and optical memories is thus possible with non‐damaging irradiation, invisible to the naked eye."},{"t":"催化定向进化先驱：Manfred T. Reetz（1943–2026）","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2077575?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"","tg":"观点评论","tp":"定向进化催化","sc":1.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":2.0,"d":0.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"催化定向进化先驱：Manfred T. Reetz（1943–2026）"},{"t":"多功能电解液添加剂K3P7实现锂[离子电池]同时容量补偿与界面调控","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73676?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池电解液添加剂","kp":["比容量[传统预锂化剂]: 300-1000mAh/g","[添加剂]: K3P7","[功能]: 容量补偿+界面调控"],"dp":1,"as":"开发了一种多功能电解质添加剂K3P7，可同时实现容量补偿和界面再生。锂电池首次充电过程中的初始不可逆容量损失（ICL）会显著降低电池的能量和功率密度。K3P7添加剂通过在充放电过程中参与界面反应，补偿容量损失并修复电极界面（SEI），从而提升电池的循环稳定性和首效。该策略为高能量密度锂电池的界面工程提供了多功能添加剂设计新思路。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Multifunctional Electrolyte Additive K3P7 for Simultaneous Capacity Compensation and Interphase Regulation in Lithium‐","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The initial irreversible capacity loss (ICL) during the first charge significantly reduces the energy and power densities of lithium‑ion batteries (LIBs). Conventional prelithiation additives suffer from limited theoretical specific capacities (300–1000 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    ), poor air stability, and low conversion efficiency. Herein, K\n                    3\n                    P\n                    7\n                    , which possesses high solubility in ester‐based electrolytes, is introduced as an electrolyte additive to improve the reversible capacities of various commercial LIBs. It provides an exceptional capacity‑compensation effect through the oxidation of P\n                    7\n                    3−\n                    , equivalent to 3048 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . Additionally, K\n                    +\n                    ions intercalate into the graphite interlayer, expanding the interlayer spacing and thereby improving the high‑rate performance of the graphite anode. The additive also promotes the formation of a stable cathode electrolyte interphase (CEI) and a uniform solid electrolyte interface (SEI), contributing to improved cycle stability of both electrodes. Furthermore, K\n                    3\n                    P\n                    7\n                    effectively scavenges free radicals, alleviating gas generation and internal pressure build‑up. When applied in a LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ||graphite full cell, the initial reversible capacity is 8% higher than that of the control sample, and the cell retains 92.9% of its capacity after 200 cycles. This work reveals a facile multi‐functional electrolyte additive that enhances the overall performance of LIBs."},{"t":"胆固醇指南的重大更新——这是每个成年人都需要了解的内容","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/?p=521968","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"New ACC/AHA cholesterol guidelines promote earlier detection, personalized risk assessment, and more aggressive LDL cholesterol lowering to reduce long-term\ncardiovascular disease\nFor decades, cholesterol management has been a cornerstone of heart disease prevention. Yet despite widespread awareness, cardiovascular disease remains the leading cause of death worldwide, and millions of adults continue to have cholesterol levels that put them at increased risk.\nIn response to evolving evidence, the American College of Cardiology and the American Heart Association have released updated clinical guidelines that place greater emphasis on earlier detection, more personalized risk assessment, and targeted treatment strategies.\nThe guideline also calls for earlier cholesterol screening, particularly for people with a family history of cardiovascular disease, and encourages clinicians to incorporate a broader range of health factors when evaluating a patient’s long-term risk and determining treatment options.\n“We know that lower LDL cholesterol levels are better when it comes to reducing the risk of heart attacks, strokes and congestive heart failure,” says Roger S. Blumenthal, M.D., chair of the guideline writing committee and director of the Johns Hopkins Ciccarone Center for the Prevention of Cardiovascular Disease. “We also know that bringing elevated lipids and blood pressure down in young adults supports optimal heart and vascular health throughout a person’s life.”\nStudies show that about one in four U.S. adults has elevated LDL cholesterol (LDL-C), a major contributor to atherosclerosis (the narrowing or hardening of the arteries). Excess lipids can accumulate in artery walls and form plaque. As plaque builds, it can restrict blood flow.\nsuch as aging and other cardiovascular risks can also increase the likelihood of plaque rupture, potentially leading to a heart attack, stroke, or emergency procedures to restore circulation.\nBlumenthal notes that the core principles of\nheart-healthy living\nremain unchanged. These include following a healthy diet, exercising regularly, avoiding tobacco, getting adequate sleep, and maintaining a healthy weight. He points out that an estimated 80% to 90% of cardiovascular disease is linked, at least in part, to modifiable risk factors, making\nchanges the foundation of prevention.\nOne notable update is the recommendation to begin screening earlier and to place greater emphasis on factors such as family history of atherosclerosis, conditions like rheumatoid arthritis, and lifetime risk factors, including early menopause, preeclampsia, and gestational diabetes, when evaluating cardiovascular risk and treatment options.\nFor instance, people with familial hypercholesterolemia, an inherited condition that causes extremely high LDL-C levels, are now advised to begin screening in childhood, around age 9 or even earlier. The guideline also recommends a one-time Lp(a) test. Elevated Lp(a), which is often genetically determined, is associated with roughly a 40% higher risk of heart disease at levels of 125 nanomoles per liter and about double the risk at 250 nanomoles per liter.\nAnother major change is the adoption of a new tool for estimating both 10-year and 30-year risks of heart attack and stroke. The previous pooled cohort equation was designed to estimate 10-year cardiovascular risk in adults age 40 and older using factors such as age, cholesterol levels, and blood pressure.\nThe new calculator, known as\nPredicting Risk of Cardiovascular Disease EVENTs\n(PREVENT), incorporates additional measures, including blood sugar and kidney health indicators. It is recommended for use beginning at age 30. PREVENT was developed using data from 6.6 million people, compared with approximately 26,000 individuals used for the earlier calculator.\n“Shifting the paradigm toward proactive prevention strategies earlier in life can meaningfully change the trajectory of cardiovascular disease and lead to better health outcomes for people decades later,” says Seth Martin, M.D., M.H.S., a cardiologist, member of the guideline writing committee and director of the Advanced Lipid Disorders Program and Digital Health Lab at the Johns Hopkins Ciccarone Center for the Prevention of Cardiovascular Disease.\nTo further personalize risk evaluation, the guideline offers recommendations for considering atherosclerosis “risk enhancers.”\nFor people with borderline or intermediate risk, clinicians may use additional tests to guide treatment decisions. These can include measuring high-sensitivity C-reactive protein (hsCRP), a marker of inflammation in the bloodstream. Elevated Lp(a), a family history of early cardiovascular disease, and higher-risk ancestry may also influence risk assessments.\nThe guideline also expands recommendations for coronary artery calcium scans, which can identify calcium deposits within artery plaque and help tailor treatment plans.\nAdditional guidance is provided for pregnant or lactating women, adults age 75 and older, and people with conditions such as diabetes, advanced chronic kidney disease, HIV infection, or cancer.\nThe document includes updated recommendations on statin use as well as other cholesterol-lowering therapies, including ezetimibe, bempedoic\n, and injectable PCSK9 monoclonal antibodies. These treatments may be appropriate for people who do not achieve sufficient LDL-C reductions with statins alone or who require combination therapy.\nFor individuals without cardiovascular disease, optimal LDL-C levels remain below 100 mg/dL. The guideline recommends lowering LDL-C to below 70 mg/dL for those at intermediate risk and below 55 mg/dL for people at higher risk. It also includes targets and recommendations for non-HDL-C and apolipoprotein B, a protein attached to cholesterol particles.\nIn an accompanying\n, Blumenthal and the vice-chair of the 2026 ACC/AHA/Multisociety Dyslipidemia Guideline suggested that future recommendations may advise people with at least moderate atherosclerosis to target LDL-C levels below 55 mg/dL as well.\nThe 2026 guideline was finalized before the publication of the VESALIUS-CV clinical trial results in the\nNew England Journal of Medicine\n. That study reported benefits from achieving these LDL-C targets through combinations of cholesterol-lowering therapies.\n“The ABCs of cardiovascular disease prevention: communicating what we know in 2026” by Lea R. Goren, Allison W. Peng, Alexander C. Razavi, Michael J. Blaha, Roger S. Blumenthal and Aaron L. Troy, 20 March 2026,\nAmerican Journal of Preventive Cardiology\nDOI: 10.1016/j.ajpc.2026.101570\n“2026 ACC/AHA/AACVPR/ABC/ACPM/ADA/AGS/APhA/ASPC/NLA/PCNA Guideline on the Management of Dyslipidemia: A Report of the American College of Cardiology/American Heart Association Joint Committee on Clinical Practice Guidelines” by Roger S. Blumenthal, FACC, FAHA, FASPC, FNLA, Pamela B. Morris, FACC, FAHA, FASPC, FNLA, Mario Gaudino, FAHA, FACC, Heather M. Johnson, MS, FAHA, FACC, FASPC, Timothy S. Anderson, Vera A. Bittner, MSPH, FACC, FAHA, MNLA, MAACVPR, Ron Blankstein, FACC, LaPrincess C. Brewer, FACC, FAHA, Leslie Cho, FACC, Sarah D. de Ferranti, FAHA, Eugenia Gianos, FACC, FAHA, FNLA, Ty J. Gluckman, MHA, FACC, FAHA, FASPC, Kristen F. Gradney, MHA, RDN, LDN, Ijeoma Isiadinso, FACC, Donald M. Lloyd-Jones, ScM, FACC, FAHA, FASPC, Joel C. Marrs, PharmD, FAHA, FNLA, Seth S. Martin, MHS, FACC, FAHA, FASPC, Kellie H. McLain, ANP-BC, CLS, FNLA, AACC, Laxmi S. Mehta, FACC, FAHA, FNLA, Samia Mora, MHS, FACC, FAHA, Wudeneh M. Mulugeta, MS, FACP, FACPM, Pradeep Natarajan, MMSCFACC, FAHA, Ann Marie Navar, FAHA, FACC, FASPC, Carl E. Orringer, FACC, MNLA, Tamar S. Polonsky, MSCI, Harmony R. Reynolds, FACC, FAHA, Joseph J. Saseen, PharmD, MNLA, FACC, FAHA, Michael D. Shapiro, DO, FACC, FAHA, FASPC, FNLA, Daniel E. Soffer, MNLA, FACP, Sheila A. Tynes, MHA, PMP, Chloé D. Villavaso, MN, APRN, ACNS-BC, FPCNA, AACC, Salim S. Virani, FACC, FASPC and John T. Wilkins, MSc, FAHA, 13 March 2026,\nJournal of the American College of Cardiology\nDOI: 10.1016/j.jacc.2025.11.016\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nJohns Hopkins Medicine\nPublic Health\nThis Simple Blood Test Could Outperform “Bad Cholesterol” in Preventing Heart Disease\nMajor Study Debunks Common Myths About Statin Side Effects\nStatins May Help More People With Type 2 Diabetes Than Doctors Once Thought\nCurrent Heart Health Guidelines Are Failing To Catch a Deadly Genetic Killer\nNew Pill Slashes “Bad” Cholesterol and Heart Attack Risk in Just 12 Weeks\nLargest-Ever Study of Vaping Ties It to Lung Disease, High Blood Pressure\nNew Study Shakes Up Heart Disease Theory: High Cholesterol May Not Mean High Risk\nTrans Fats Are Worse Than You Think: A New Threat Beyond Cholesterol\nCoffee’s Link to Raised Cholesterol Depends on Drinker’s Sex Plus Brewing Method"},{"t":"肝细胞内活性氧物质控制的脂质结合策略","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5582949?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Synthetic catalytic antioxidants offer attractive alternatives to enzymatic redox regulators, yet their biological application is frequently limited by poor stability, formulation challenges, and insufficient control over intracellular localization. Here, we report a lipid conjugation strategy that enables the covalent integration of manganese Salen (EUK) catalysts into phospholipid membranes. A modular synthetic route is established in which a carboxylate‐functionalized EUK derivative is coupled to an amine‐terminated phospholipid tail, yielding a structurally defined phospholipid‐EUK conjugate that retains catalytic activity upon liposome formulation, with controlled catalyst loading and long‐term colloidal integrity. The resulting liposomes exhibit efficient catalytic degradation of reactive oxygen species (ROS) with activity scaling with conjugate content. Importantly, covalent anchoring of the catalyst within the lipid bilayer prevents aggregation and precipitation observed for non‐conjugated analogues. Using an acetaminophen challenged steatotic HepaRG cell model, we demonstrate that lipid conjugation enables intracellular delivery of the catalyst and sustained reduction of elevated ROS levels without inducing cytotoxicity. This effort establishes a chemically precise approach for positioning organometallic catalysts within biomimetic membranes and highlights these conjugates as versatile platforms for controlled intracellular redox modulation.","tp":"催化抗氧化","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种脂质结合策略，将锰Salen（EUK）合成催化抗氧化剂共价整合至磷脂膜中，以解决传统合成抗氧化酶调节剂在稳定性、制剂配方和细胞内定位控制方面的不足。通过模块化合成路线，含羧基功能基团的EUK催化剂可嵌入脂质双分子层，实现肝细胞内活性氧（ROS）的精准调控。该策略为开发新型抗氧化治疗手段、减轻氧化应激相关的肝细胞损伤提供了工程化路径，有望突破合成催化抗氧化剂生物应用的工程瓶颈。"},{"t":"有机太阳能电池中电荷转移注入的动力学-能量瓶颈主导能量损耗","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71177?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机光伏电荷转移","kp":["[核心机制]: 电荷转移态动力学-能量瓶颈","[方法]: 时间分辨荧光+贝叶斯优化"],"as":"研究揭示有机太阳能电池中电荷转移（CT）态的动能-能量瓶颈主导能量损失机制。CT态在给受体界面形成后，其电荷注入过程存在动力学与能量学耦合的瓶颈，同时限制了开路电压和短路电流。该工作从理论层面阐明了CT态注入瓶颈对器件能量损失的决定性作用，为降低有机太阳能电池非辐射复合损失、提升能量转换效率提供了机理认识和优化方向。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Kinetic–Energetic Bottleneck of Charge‐Transfer Injection Governs Energy Loss in Organic Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The charge‐transfer (CT) state in organic solar cells constitutes a kinetic–energetic bottleneck that simultaneously controls charge generation and nonradiative voltage loss. By combining time‐resolved photoluminescence (100 ps–20 ns) with a physics‐constrained Bayesian optimization framework, we show that the multidimensional kinetic network collapses onto a single emergent descriptor: the effective CT injection rate,\n                    \n                      k\n                      CT\n                    \n                    . Crucially,\n                    \n                      k\n                      CT\n                    \n                    is not a microscopic rate constant but a renormalized collective parameter arising from the coupled competition among exciton injection, CT population redistribution, and CT nonradiative recombination. Across six donor–acceptor systems spanning nearly two orders of magnitude in\n                    \n                      k\n                      CT\n                    \n                    , we uncover a universal scaling: each decade increase in injection rate incurs an additional ∼85 meV nonradiative energy loss. This scaling reveals an intrinsic kinetic–energetic trade‐off imposed by the topology of the CT manifold—accelerating injection inevitably amplifies recombination loss. Breaking this bottleneck requires restructuring the CT network to decouple charge dissociation from recombination pathways, offering a route beyond the present voltage ceiling of organic photovoltaics.","aip":1},{"t":"隐藏的肠道信号可能会导致睡眠呼吸暂停的致命心脏病风险","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/a-hidden-gut-signal-may-be-driving-sleep-apneas-deadly-heart-risks/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Scientists discovered a surprising gut-heart connection that may help prevent sleep apnea from causing serious cardiovascular damage.\nSleep apnea affects millions of people worldwide and is known to raise the risk of serious cardiovascular problems. Now, researchers have identified a potential new treatment target that could help reduce some of the condition’s harmful effects. Findings presented at ASM Microbe 2026 suggest that gut microbes and the way they alter bile acids may play an important role in protecting against sleep apnea-related heart and metabolic damage.\nObstructive sleep apnea is a common disorder in which breathing repeatedly stops and starts during sleep. These interruptions reduce oxygen levels while allowing carbon dioxide to build up, triggering a range of biological changes throughout the body.\nPrevious studies have shown that low oxygen levels can alter bile acids, compounds produced by the liver, stored in the gallbladder, and released into the intestines to help digest fats. Beyond their digestive role, bile acids also act as signaling molecules that interact with receptors throughout the body.\nResearchers had previously demonstrated that gut microbes can modify bile acids, influencing the development of atherosclerosis, the buildup of fatty plaques inside arteries. Because bile acids enter the bloodstream, they can affect tissues and organs far beyond the digestive system.\n“We were pretty sure from our previous studies that bile acids, especially microbially modified ones, were a key to regulating the disease so we wanted to know what happens when one of the key receptors for them are missing — does the disease go away?” said study first author Celeste Allaband, DVM, Ph.D. from the University of California, San Diego.\nTo explore that question, the team studied two groups of mice. One group consisted of mice genetically prone to heart disease, known as ApoE knock-outs. The second group included mice that were also prone to heart disease but lacked a bile\nreceptor called the farnesoid X receptor (FXR). These animals are known as ApoE/FXR knock-outs.\nBoth groups were exposed either to normal sleeping conditions with room air or to conditions designed to mimic sleep apnea. Throughout the study, researchers analyzed gut microbes and metabolites using fecal samples. At the end of the experiment, they measured the amount of fatty plaque that had accumulated in the animals’ arteries.\n“Our study shows that the FXR host receptor, which can be activated or deactivated by bile acids, plays a central role in driving the buildup of fatty plaques in the arteries during sleep apnea-like conditions,” Allaband said. “Strikingly, when this receptor was removed from the mice, the development of arterial plaques dropped significantly in some areas and disruptions to the gut microbiome were minimized.”\nThe results revealed that mice lacking the FXR receptor developed significantly less plaque in both the aorta and the aortic arch. Some plaque formation still occurred in the pulmonary artery, but the overall burden was reduced. The researchers also observed that sleep apnea-like conditions had a smaller impact on the gut microbiome and the collection of metabolic compounds produced within the body.\n“These results tell us that microbially modified bile acids and how they signal through the receptor we knocked out (FXR) seem to be key to the impact of sleep apnea-like conditions in our mouse model. We also identified specific bile acids of interest to explore further,” Allaband said.\nThe research team is now pursuing several follow-up studies. One goal is to examine human datasets to determine whether the same biological patterns seen in mice are present in people with sleep apnea.\n“We also plan to take some of our key bile acids of interest and see if supplementation of these compounds alone can help prevent or reduce disease,” Allaband said. “We may also take some key microbes of interest and see if they can be given preventively as a probiotic. There is lots of exciting future work to come.”\nIf similar effects are confirmed in humans, future therapies could potentially target bile acids, the FXR receptor, or beneficial gut microbes to help prevent or reduce the cardiovascular complications associated with sleep apnea.\nMeeting: ASM Microbe 2026\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAmerican Society for Microbiology\nNew Study Links Specific Gut Bacteria to Common Heart Disease\nObstructive Sleep Apnea Is Common in Kids – May Impact Blood Pressure and Heart Health\nSleep Apnea Worsens Heart Disease – Yet It Often Goes Untreated\nUrgent Action in Children Required to Tackle Cardiovascular Deaths\nBeating Heart Patch Repairs Damage Caused by Heart Attack\nSmartphones Can Disrupt Pacemakers and Cause Painful Shocks\nResearch Shows There Is a Medical Benefit to Reducing D2B Time\nUCLA Cardiologists Complete Their First Transcatheter Aortic Valve Replacement\nSurvival Rates for Mitral Valve Surgery Patients Improve"},{"t":"通过对映选择性自由基氟烷基化构建S-手性α-氟烷基S(IV/VI)化合物的通用平台","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3129452?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性含硫氟代化合物","kp":["[催化剂]: 铜催化不对称自由基","[反应]: 氟烷基化硫代酰胺","[产物]: S-立体构型S(IV/VI)"],"dp":1,"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究报道了一种通用平台，通过对硫醚的不对称自由基氟烷基化反应构建S-手性的α-氟烷基硫(IV/VI)化合物。α-氟烷基取代的高价硫结构是含氟药物分子和农用化学品中的重要骨架，但其手性合成一直极具挑战。研究采用手性催化剂控制自由基加成到硫原子的立体选择性，实现了高对映选择性的C-S键构建，可高效制备手性亚砜、砜等多种含氟硫化合物。该方法为含氟药物分子的精准合成和手性药物开发提供了强有力的工具。","ot":"A General Platform for S‐Stereogenic α‐Fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) Compounds via Enantioselective Radical Fluoroalkylation of S","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    α‐Fluoroalkyl‐substituted high‐valent sulfur motifs are important structural elements in fluorinated molecule design and exhibit broad application potential in diverse fields. However, access to\n                    S\n                    ‐stereogenic α‐fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) compounds still relies largely on classical resolution, resulting in limited efficiency and selectivity. We herein report a copper‐catalyzed asymmetric radical C–S cross‐coupling that effectively tames highly reactive α‐fluoroalkyl radicals, enabled by a sequential stereodiscrimination–chirality transfer strategy, providing rapid access to\n                    S\n                    ‐chiral α‐fluoroalkyl sulfilimines. Integrated with downstream transformations, this reaction serves as a general and systematic platform for\n                    S\n                    ‐chiral α‐fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) compounds. The synthetic utility of the method is demonstrated by gram‐scale synthesis and concise access to diverse chiral fluoroalkyl reagents and bioisosteres of sulfur‐containing drugs."},{"t":"DPHV-肝脏模块概括了 AML 浸润和化疗引起的肝毒性并具有转化效用","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7050?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The liver is central to drug metabolism and a critical site of disease progression, making vascularized in vitro liver models essential for disease modeling, drug discovery, and mechanistic research. However, recapitulating dynamic in vivo drug responses while maintaining clinical relevance remains a major challenge for bioartificial liver systems. In acute myeloid leukemia (AML), patients frequently develop leukemic liver infiltration and chemotherapy-induced hepatotoxicity, both of which compromise therapeutic efficacy and prognosis. Human-relevant experimental models that dynamically simulate these processes are urgently needed. Here, we developed a dynamic perfusable human vascularized liver module (DPHV-LM), constructed from in vitro–expanded primary human hepatocytes within a perfusable scaffold. Perfusion of AML patient–derived cells reproduced leukemic infiltration of liver tissue. Using the DPHV-LM for drug screening and validating findings in AML mouse models, we identified ammonium glycyrrhizinate (AMGZ) as an agent that reduces cytarabine-induced hepatotoxicity and suppresses leukemic infiltration without impairing antileukemic efficacy. The hepatoprotective trends observed in the DPHV-LM were qualitatively concordant with findings from an independent retrospective clinical cohort. Collectively, these results demonstrate the transplantational potential of this platform for modeling leukemic liver pathology and for the development of hepatoprotective therapeutic strategies."},{"t":"一种与冷冻保护剂兼容的纳米多孔平台，可稳定且可扩展地输送生物药品（Adv. Mater. 33/2","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73512?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多孔载药体","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"一艘游轮经常出入的阿拉斯加峡湾发生了 481 米高的山体滑坡海啸","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aec3187?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Early in the morning of 10 August 2025, a &gt;64 × 10\n                    6\n                    –cubic meter landslide struck Tracy Arm fjord in Alaska. The landslide was preconditioned by glacial retreat caused by climate change. The resulting 481-meter runup megatsunami followed an initial 100-meter-high breaking wave traveling at &gt;70 meters per second. The landslide was preceded by several days of microseismicity, which increased in rate and magnitude until ~1 hour before failure. The landslide produced globally observed long-period seismic waves equivalent in size to a moment magnitude 5.4 earthquake. A long-period (~66 second) global seismic signal, produced by a landslide-induced seiche trapped within the fjord, persisted for up to 36 hours, the second time a days-long seiche had thus been observed. With fjord regions increasingly visited by cruise ships, and climate change making similar events more likely, this unanticipated, near-miss event highlights the growing risk from landslides and tsunamis in coastal environments."},{"t":"5月欧洲光伏指数：组件价格、采购信心双双上涨","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024296.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"据欧洲光伏平台Sun.store数据，5月欧洲光伏组件价格大幅上涨，光伏采购经理人指数（PV PMI）攀升至70，创年初以来新高。高端高效组件领涨，逆变器市场价格连续三个月维持稳定。价格上行与需求情绪回暖共振，显示欧洲光伏市场正步入新一轮景气周期。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"欧洲光伏组件价格","kp":["PV PMI[欧洲5月光伏]: 70(年内新高)","双面TOPCon涨幅[5月]: 7%","BC组件最高价[欧洲]: 0.134欧元/瓦","市场主流技术[欧洲光伏]: TOPCon"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"b":"根据欧洲Sun.store 数据显示，5 月欧洲市场光伏组件价格大幅上涨，光伏采购经理人指数（PV PMI）攀升至 70，创下今年年初以来新高。\n高端高效组件领涨，逆变器市场价格连续第三个月整体维稳。价格上行叠加需求情绪回暖，欧洲光伏市场步入夏季，发展势头向好。\n2026 年至今，光伏组件价格始终保持上涨走势，5 月这一趋势延续。\nTOPCon 技术仍是欧洲市场主流，具体价格如下：\n双面 TOPCon 组件 5 月价格大涨 7%，此次涨价主要因市场转向 500W 及以上大功率组件，并非全品类普涨；单面 TOPCon 组件月价稳定，走势逐步企稳。\n高端户用光伏组件价格持续走高：\nBC组件价格创下新高，达 0.134 欧元 / 瓦，为本次统计中单价最高的品类；全黑组件价格同步上涨，体现高端户用产品需求强劲。\n5 月欧洲组件品牌前五：\n与组件涨价不同，5 月逆变器价格几乎无变动，该状态已持续数月。\n小型混合式逆变器价格稳定；大功率机型价格小幅回落，该品类价格缓步走弱的趋势已持续数月。\n两类产品价格整体平稳，仅大功率商用机型价格微涨。\n前五：Deye、Huawei、GoodWe、Fronius、Sungrow头部排名未变，Deye 稳居首位。\n前五：Huawei、Sungrow、Fronius、SMA、SolarEdge\n5 月光伏采购经理人指数回升至 70，扭转 4 月回落态势，采购信心重回年初高位。\n本次调研面向 1101 名 Sun.store 平台用户，结果如下：\n计划减少采购的商户占比跌至统计周期内最低，夏季来临，市场整体氛围乐观。"},{"t":"24 小时不睡觉会显着改变你的唾液","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/24-hours-without-sleep-changes-your-saliva-in-measurable-ways/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Researchers have identified a potential biological signature of sleep loss in saliva, bringing scientists closer to an objective test for detecting dangerous fatigue.\nA driver who has been awake for an entire day can be as impaired as someone who is legally intoxicated. Yet unlike alcohol, there is no roadside test that can objectively determine whether a person is dangerously sleep deprived. Researchers now report evidence that a simple saliva sample may reveal telltale signs of severe sleep loss, raising the possibility of a future test that could identify fatigue-related impairment.\nThe findings, published in ACS’\nJournal of Proteome Research\n, come from a study that examined how sleep deprivation alters the chemical makeup of saliva. Scientists identified a distinct pattern of molecules that appeared after participants stayed awake for 24 hours, offering what may be the first measurable biological signature of acute sleep loss.\nDrowsy driving contributes to thousands of crashes, injuries, and deaths each year, but fatigue is often difficult to detect and can be challenging to prove after an accident. While alcohol and drugs can be measured with breath, blood, or saliva tests, no equivalent tool currently exists for sleep deprivation.\n“Until now, sleep deprivation has been impossible to measure biochemically — and yet it is one of the greatest burdens of our time,” says Kraemer, the corresponding author of the study. “This study introduces the first direct biomarkers of sleep loss in saliva under real-world conditions, marking a milestone in forensic investigations.”\nThe researchers enrolled 20 healthy young adult men who typically sleep seven to nine hours per night. Each participant completed three sleep conditions in random order, with a one-week break between them: total sleep deprivation (one night without sleep), sleep restriction (four nights with two fewer hours of sleep than usual), and a well-rested condition (about eight hours of sleep).\nSaliva samples were collected before and after each condition and analyzed for their metabolite content. The researchers identified 10 molecular differences between samples from the sleep deprived and well-rested conditions. However, they found no significant metabolic differences between the sleep restricted and well-rested groups. Using the metabolites that changed after sleep loss, the team trained a predictive model that correctly identified sleep deprived samples 94% of the time.\nSome of the model’s errors may have been caused by differences in how individuals recover from sleep loss. For instance, several participants still did not show a fully rested metabolic profile after sleeping for eight hours following a full day of wakefulness. This suggests that eight hours of recovery sleep may not be sufficient for everyone.\nThe results indicate that a specific pattern of salivary metabolites could serve as a biological “sleepiness fingerprint.” Such a tool could eventually help identify sleep deprivation in situations where objective measurements are needed, including roadside evaluations.\nAccording to Kraemer, the researchers are now conducting a large international study to further test the model. The effort will include more than 1,000 samples collected from shift workers, women, and frequent drivers to determine how well the approach performs across a broader population.\nReference: “Leveraging the Metabolic Fingerprint of Sleep Deprivation and Sleep Restriction for Forensic Applications: A Machine Learning Study in Oral Fluid Metabolomics” by Michael Scholz, Andrea E. Steuer, Akos Dobay, Hans-Peter Landolt and Thomas Kraemer, 6 May 2026,\nJournal of Proteome Research\nDOI: 10.1021/acs.jproteome.5c01064\nThe authors acknowledge funding from the Fund for Road Safety (Fonds für Verkehrssicherheit FVS).\nSome of the authors have filed a patent related to the method for determining the metabolic sleepiness markers.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAmerican Chemical Society\nSleep Science\nA Simple Blood Test May Predict Dementia Years Before Symptoms Appear\nNew Blood Test Can Identify Sleep Deprivation With Over 99% Accuracy\nNeuronal Death Protein: New Research Shows How Sleep Deprivation Can Damage the Brain\nWarning: Sleep Apnea, Lack of Deep Sleep May Be Wrecking Your Brain\nScientists Discover New Biomarker To Aid in Early Diagnosis of Alzheimer’s Disease\nLack of Sleep Leads to Eating and Weight Gain\nLength of Telomeres Predicts Susceptibility to the Common Cold\nStudy Reveals Link Between Gut Bacteria and Autism\nDisrupted Sleep Patterns Linked to Alzheimer’s"},{"t":"2025年全国活跃数据总量 同比增长28.46%","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260612/05d278080c5e4fe0b00ca5a139aa16e5/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","b":"2025年全国活跃数据总量 同比增长28.46%-新华网\n2025年全国活跃数据总量 同比增长28.46%\n2025年全国活跃数据总量 同比增长28.46%\n记者6月11日从国家数据局2026年“数据要素×”首场发布会上获悉，“数据要素×”三年行动计划实施两年多来，数据要素价值加快释放，累计发布417个典型案例，11个行业领域的760个“数据要素×”典型场景指引，提前超额完成打造300个以上场景的目标。2025年，全国活跃数据总量为1.67泽字节（ZB），同比增长28.46%；企业数据产品和服务数量同比增长29.29%，交易额同比增长39.8%。\n日前，2026年“数据要素×”大赛正式启动，赛题注重响应行业所期、民生所盼、治理所需，突出“赛事围着产业转、创新贴着需求干”，鼓励参赛队伍“谋场景”“试制度”“用设施”“创效益”。国家数据局政策和规划司副司长栾婕表示，国家数据局将从做“好”数据治理、做“深”场景应用、做“实”价值释放三方面下功夫，通过场景牵引，切实将政策红利转化为发展机遇，加速释放数据要素乘数效应。\n记者从发布会上还获悉，多个部门正着力加大数据资源供给，积极探索数据要素与产业发展深度融合。\n住房和城乡建设部办公厅副主任梁爽表示，住房和城乡建设部稳妥有序推进公共数据资源开发利用和要素价值转化。一方面，摸清行业数据资源底数，搭建国家房屋建筑和市政基础设施信息基础库，布局高质量数据集建设，健全全链条数据治理和更新机制，为人工智能、低空经济等新业态提供底层支撑。另一方面，加快构建数据管理制度体系，做好数据安全和要素流通工作。\n中国科学院科技基础能力局副局长张韵介绍，面向AI4S（AI for Science）对科学数据的迫切需求，中国科学院加快国家人工智能应用中试基地和国家级科研语料库的建设，推动科学数据中心智能化转型，持续提升科技创新支撑能力。此外，强化科学数据总中心统筹支撑能力，围绕确权、流通和评价等关键环节完善数据要素服务体系。\n气象数据适用场景广、应用潜力大，与经济社会千行百业息息相关。中国气象局数据资源司副司长沈利峰介绍，中国气象局先后向全社会开放7批12类100余种气象数据，累计向130万用户提供了334TB的气象数据，支撑20余个行业和领域创新开发应用气象数据。深入推进气象数据要素市场化配置改革，依托上海、广东、湖北、贵州、广西等试点省，积极探索众创利用、授权运营、数证管理、跨境流通，推动“数据要素×”优秀案例中的新产品、新工具、新模型进入数据市场流通。（记者 郭倩）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n焦点丨记者暗访后续：涉事地垃圾已清理完毕\n记者手记丨河野洋平走了，一个时代渐行渐远\n走进小城看消费丨东海：“指尖国潮”闯出“美丽经济”\n美伊交火持续：步步升级还是危险徘徊\n列国鉴丨频繁战事下以色列战时动员体系承受高压\n足球的源头可以追溯到中国古代的蹴鞠\n随外籍人士走进重庆 探访“发展为民”的具体实践\n2025年全国活跃数据总量 同比增长28.46%","tp":"数据新经济","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"国家数据局披露，2025年全国活跃数据总量达1.67泽字节（ZB），同比增长28.46%；企业数据产品和服务数量增长29.29%，交易额增长39.8%。\"数据要素×\"三年行动计划实施两年多来，累计发布417个典型案例，覆盖11个行业领域的760个典型场景指引，提前超额完成300个场景目标。2026年\"数据要素×\"大赛已启动，国家数据局将从数据治理、场景应用、价值释放三方面发力，加速释放数据要素乘数效应，推动数据资源与产业深度融合。"},{"t":"1.72亿起拍！河北晋州屋顶光伏拍卖25年使用权","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024295.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"河北晋州市公共机构屋顶光伏发电使用权将以25年期限公开拍卖，起拍价约1.72亿元，竞买保证金500万元，于6月17日在石家庄公共资源交易平台进行网络电子竞价。此举反映地方政府加速盘活公共屋顶资源、推进分布式光伏资产化运营的趋势。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"屋顶光伏拍卖","kp":["使用权期限[屋顶光伏拍卖]: 25年","起拍价[晋州屋顶光伏]: 17217.29万元","竞买保证金[拍卖]: 500万元"],"sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":4.0,"r":2.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"b":"河北嘉世纪拍卖有限责任公司发布公告，晋州市公共机构屋顶光伏发电使用权将于6月17日10时在石家庄市公共资源交易平台进行网络电子竞价公开拍卖。本次拍卖标的使用期限为25年，起拍价17217.29万元，竞买保证金500万元。\n根据公告，竞买人需为境内注册、具有独立民事责任能力的企业，且未被列入失信名单，不接受联合体报名。竞买人须在6月16日16时前完成平台报名并缴纳保证金，后续办理竞买手续后方可参与竞价。\n晋州市光伏发电使用权拍卖公告\n受委托，我公司定于2026年06月17日10时在石家庄市公共资源交易平台(.cn/)对晋州市光伏发电使用权进行公开拍卖(拍卖方式为网络电子竞价)。现将有关情况公告如下：\n(一)在中国境内注册，具有独立承担民事责任能力的企业，通过“信用中国”及“中国政府采购网”查询未被列入失信被执行人、重大税收违法失信主体、政府采购严重违法失信行为记录;\n(二)本项目不接受联合体报名。\n(三)报名需提供如下资料(上传PDF扫描件)：\n竞买人需提供营业执照、法定代表人证明书、法定代表人身份证，法定代表人不能到场的还需提交授权委托书及被授权人身份证、相关查询文件等资料(网上报名时上传相关资料PDF扫描件)。\n(一)预展时间及地点：自公告之日起在标的所在地进行展示。\n(二)竞买人请于2026年06月16日16时前登录石家庄市公共资源交易平台提交报名资料(报名核验工作将于工作日受理)，完成网上报名;网上报名前，竞买人需先登录石家庄市公共资源交易平台(http://110.249.147.67/G2/)，完成竞买人用户账号注册，并办理CA数字证书绑定竞买人用户账号，方可登录交易平台参与本项目报名。报名请参照《产权系统意向受让方操作手册》，CA数字证书办理咨询电话：0311-82971337。\n竞买人可于公告期内自行登录石家庄市公共资源交易平台先期进行网上报名，报名核验工作将于工作日受理。\n(三)竞买人完成网上报名，经核验通过后，应于2026年06月16日16时前交纳竞买保证金至晋州市公共资源交易中心账户(以到账时间为准)。\n开户单位：晋州市公共资源交易中心\n开 户 行：河北晋州农村商业银行股份有限公司\n账 号：12521200000000828134\n开户行行号：314121000404\n交纳保证金需备注：晋州市光伏发电使用权竞买保证金\n(四)竞买人完成网上报名、交纳竞买保证金后须于2026年06月16日17时前携带有效证件、报名资料及保证金交纳凭证到拍卖公司办理竞买手续，否则不具备竞买资格。\n(五)本次拍卖活动其他未尽事宜，详见拍卖文件。\n联系电话：13933823467\n河北嘉世纪拍卖有限责任公司"},{"t":"1.21GW！广东2026年5月工商业光伏项目备案清单出炉","d":"2026-06-13","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/12/50024297.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"2026年5月广东省投资备案管理系统数据显示，全省新增备案光伏项目5385个，投资总额超50.22亿元，装机规模达1.21GW。项目结构以户用光伏为主（3865个），工商业光伏1127个次之，另有公共资源利用光伏267个、光伏+项目60个、光储充一体化项目40个。这一备案规模反映出分布式光伏在华南经济发达省份持续高速扩张，工商业与光储充一体化占比提升，显示用户侧新能源应用正从单一发电向综合能源系统演进，是观察中国分布式光伏市场化进程的重要区域风向标。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"工商业光伏备案","kp":["备案项目数[广东5月光伏]: 5385个","总投资额[广东5月光伏]: 超50.22亿元","总容量[广东5月光伏]: 1210.14MW"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"b":"2026年5月，据广东省投资备案管理系统统计，\n广东省共新增备案5385个光伏项目，投资总额超50.22亿元\n，其中户用光伏项目3865个，工商业光伏1127个、公共资源利用光伏项目267个、“光伏+”项目60个、光（储）充一体化项目40个、整（市、镇、县）推进项目22个、复合型项目4个。\n容量共计1210.14MW。\n2026年5月，广东省共新增\n项目，总投资额超22.29亿元。项目主要分布在东莞、中山、佛山、江门、惠州这5个地市，备案数量均超过90项。\n从容量的角度来看，2026年5月工商业光伏建设容量\n排名前三的地市分别为东莞105.53MW、佛山80.12MW、中山57.46MW\n，占2026年3月工商业光伏备案容量的37.06%，是工商业光伏发展的第一梯队。此外，广州、江门、惠州均超过40MW，为第二梯队。\n在所有已公布规模的工商业光伏项目当中，投资额最高的项目是由英德海螺水泥有限责任公司投资0.23亿元建设的英德海螺棚顶5.95MW\n发电项目。本项目在英德海螺水泥有限责任公司厂区内利用厂区建筑物及附属场所建设5.95MW\n电站，项目占地面积约119880平方米，发电模式为“自发自用，余电上网”，采用分块发电、就近并网方案。\n从建设单位的角度来看，2026年5月广东省工商业光伏备案项目参与企业978家，包含华能、广州发展、南方电力集团等国企；维初新能源、旭日实业、欣能环保等民营企业。\n从建设单位投资数量来看：惠东县交投汇能新能源投资有限公司备案工商业光伏项目最多，为24个；天津华能杨柳青热电有限责任公司、江门市维初新能源科技有限公司分别以16个、13个项目，排名第二、三位；\n从建设单位投资额来看，天津华能杨柳青热电有限责任公司以0.85亿元排在首位，中山市宏和盈新能源投资有限公司为次位，珠海市海宜洁源环境技术有限公司为第三位。"},{"t":"1,7-二棓酸四碳硼烷：介于亲核闭簇和“反三明治”二棓烯之间","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6667904?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    This manuscript describes the synthesis and chemistry of an unprecedented carborane cluster of low‐valent main‐group elements with a unique structural motif. On the basis of a dianionic borole π‐ligand platform (L = [R\n                    5\n                    (C\n                    4\n                    B)]\n                    2−\n                    ) an “inverse sandwich”, Janus‐type digallylene complex L(Ga\n                    +I\n                    )\n                    2\n                    featuring two nucleophilic Ga(I) ions was accessed. This compound can also be described as a\n                    closo\n                    ‐type 1,7‐digallatetracarborane cluster. Preliminary reactivity studies on this new compound class have been conducted. Assessment of Lewis‐basicity in coordination chemistry with transition metals and main group Lewis‐acids indicate electronic communication between the Ga‐atoms. Oxidation with free borole (L) gives rise to bent digallocene L(Ga\n                    +II\n                    )–(Ga\n                    +II\n                    )L, the first group 13 element‐based dimetallocene‐type compound. Examples demonstrate that L(Ga\n                    +I\n                    )\n                    2\n                    can behave as both a discrete digallacarborane cluster and a bis‐gallylene π‐complex capable of releasing Ga\n                    +\n                    .","tp":"碳硼烷化学","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":1.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"本研究报道了一种前所未有的低价主族元素碳硼烷簇合物——1,7-二棓酸四碳硼烷的合成与化学反应。该化合物基于双阴离子硼杂环戊二烯（borole）π配体平台（L = [R₅(C₄B)]²⁻），由\"反三明治\"型双镓烯前驱体出发构建。研究揭示了其独特的结构特征：该簇合物处于亲核闭簇配合物与经典\"反三明治\"二棓烯之间的中间态，兼具两者的电子结构与反应性。作者通过这一Janus型双镓烯络合物平台，展示了主族元素低价态化学中新颖的簇集模式，为理解主族金属-金属键的形成机制及碳硼烷骨架的配位化学提供了重要实验依据。该工作拓展了硼基配体支撑下镓化学的结构多样性边界。"},{"t":"“如果我注意到一位女性被打断或忽视，我会故意将这个词带回给她” - pv magazine China","d":"2026-06-13","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/12/if-i-notice-a-woman-being-interrupted-or-overlooked-i-intentionally-bring-the-word-back-to-her/","c":"不相关","a":"pv magazine","tg":"行业观察","b":"Markets & Policy\nThis week Women in Solar+ Europe gives voice to Josefin Berg, Associate Director – Renewables Markets – Horizons at S&P Global. She warns that the so-called “eclipse” moments, when women are interrupted or overshadowed in discussions, require vigilant, inclusive leadership that actively restores and amplifies overlooked voices.\nWomen in Solar+\nMarkets & Policy\nJosefin Berg | Image: S&P Global\nI believe that all industries benefit from diverse teams of skilled contributors, but this is especially true in solar and storage. The industry is global, it is moving fast, and teams need agility to identify and act on opportunities. A uniform group can easily reinforce shared assumptions and continue operating in old patterns, even while the electricity system itself is rapidly changing.\nTechnology, markets, and policy are evolving rapidly while global electricity consumption continues to grow at an extraordinary pace. This is an industry where diverse teams are particularly well-suited to solving challenges because they bring different perspectives, experiences, and ways of thinking into the conversation.\nWhen I joined the solar industry in 2010, it was still very male-dominated. Most meetings consisted of male engineers and male investors. Over time, however, I started to see more women entering the sector, and I began building a stronger network among women across the industry.\nStill, progress can feel uneven. I remember arriving at Smarter E just a few years ago on a shuttle bus from the airport, and out of a completely full bus, only five passengers were women. It made me reflect on the dynamics that still exist within our sector. Are men simply more likely to attend trade shows? Does it depend on the roles companies choose to send? I honestly do not know. But I would certainly like to see more women represented across the industry.\nAt the same time, I consider myself fortunate. Throughout my career, I have largely been spared from obvious systemic barriers. The energy transition market intelligence space was still very new when I entered it, which gave me the opportunity to create my own position and build expertise in an emerging field.\nOver the past years, my managers, both men and women, have valued my skills and actively supported my growth and promotions, including after I became a mother. I have also worked within highly diverse teams, often with women in leadership positions, which makes a significant difference in shaping workplace culture and expectations.\nS&P Global has championed DEI initiatives for several years. One example that stands out to me is the company policy enabling both women and men to take at least six months of paid maternity or paternity leave. What I find especially encouraging is seeing fathers actually taking that leave. Policies matter, but culture matters just as much.\nOne of the most important leadership lessons I have learned is that women should not break down in situations when they might get eclipsed by a man. It still happens that I am about to say something publicly, and a man decides he has something more important to say.\nSometimes you can continue speaking firmly, or a skilled moderator will intentionally bring the conversation back to you. Other times, you need to adapt to the situation and address it later, or simply let it pass. But these moments are important to recognize because they still shape whose voices are heard.\nAs a leader and moderator myself, I pay close attention to these “eclipse” situations. If I notice a woman being interrupted or overlooked, I intentionally bring the word back to her because I trust that she has something relevant and valuable to contribute. Leaders need to stay observant because these dynamics can happen very subtly and very quickly.\nAnother experience that shaped my career was remote work. In 2013, S&P Global closed its office in Barcelona, and I decided to remain there and work remotely. At the time, I genuinely thought this decision might limit my career progression. Instead, my male manager believed in me and recognized the value of my contribution. That trust changed everything.\nFor young women entering the solar and renewable energy industry today, my message is simple: welcome to a dynamic and exciting sector.\nFirst, look toward the future. This industry is evolving incredibly fast, and by learning new expertise quickly, you can create your own position, whether within a large company, a smaller organization, or even your own business.\nSecond, value yourself when you receive a job offer. Throughout all the interviews I have conducted, I have noticed that only men consistently question the salary offered to them. As a result, they are often able to secure a higher starting salary. And that starting point matters because it influences your future salary trajectory over time.\nSo if you receive an offer, remember that you have nothing to lose by asking for more.\nJosefin Berg is an Associate Director for renewables markets at S&P Global Energy, where she covers trends and company strategies in the renewables market. Her focus areas include IPP, developer and EPC strategies, the demand for renewables in emerging markets and the role of renewables in the power generation mix. With more than 16 years of experience in the solar power industry, Berg authors reports on renewable power markets and trends, and she regularly speaks at industry events.\nInterested in joining\nJosefin Berg\nand other women industry leaders and experts at Women in Solar+ Europe? Find out more:\nThe views and opinions expressed in this article are the author’s own, and do not necessarily reflect those held by"},{"t":"$D$-通过高能核碰撞中的顺序强子化产生介子","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/py6l-xdfn","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Zi-Xuan Xu, Wei Dai, Ben-Wei Zhang, Jiaxing Zhao, and Pengfei ZhuangHeavy flavor production serves as an ideal probe of the hadronization mechanism of the quark-gluon plasma created in relativistic heavy ion collisions. We study charm-quark hadronization using Langevin transport in the medium together with a sequential coalescence model. Since ${D}_{s}$ forms earlie…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232301] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"天气引导的条件扩散模型结合自适应组归一化用于分布式光伏功率缺失数据的稳健插补","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007531?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扩散模型数据插补","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Weather-guided conditional diffusion model with adaptive group normalization for robust imputation of missing distributed photovoltaic power data"},{"t":"协同界面脱氯与有机自由基稳定化将水污染物升级回收为长链聚合物","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3215238?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"污染物资源化","kp":["催化剂[污染物升级回收]: 氮掺杂碳包覆高熵氧化物HEO@NC","合成方法[HEO@NC]: 原位碳热还原","活化机制[HEO@NC]: 活化过碘酸盐选择性氧化聚合"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用高熵氧化物催化剂，通过界面脱氯和有机自由基稳定的协同机制，将水中的有机氯污染物转化为长链聚合物。传统水处理仅将污染物降解为小分子，该策略实现了'废物增值'——将有害污染物（如氯代有机物）转化为有价值的聚合材料。高熵氧化物提供多金属协同活性位点，界面工程调控脱氯选择性，自由基稳定中间体促进C-C偶联链增长。该工作为水污染治理与资源回收的耦合开辟了新路径，具有环境治理和绿色化学双重价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Upcycling Water Pollutants Into Long‐Chain Polymers via Synergistic Interfacial Dechlorination and Organic Radical Stabilization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy oxides (HEOs) offer unusual electronic structures arising from lattice distortion, multimetal synergy, and high chemical stability. Here we report nitrogen‐doped carbon‐encapsulated HEOs catalysts (HEO@NC) synthesized by in situ carbothermal reduction for efficient pollutant removal and upcycling through selective oxidative polymerization. HEO@NC activates periodate via an electron‐transfer pathway coupled with surface‐adsorbed hydroxyl radicals, enabling the selective conversion of phenolic contaminants into polymeric products under extreme pH and strong ionic interference. Relative to metal‐free nitrogen‐doped carbon, HEO@NC markedly enhances periodate activation through interfacial electronic coupling and achieves a periodate utilization efficiency of 449.2%, far exceeding that of conventional mineralization. Density functional theory and experimental analyses reveal complementary roles of the HEOs components: Co/Ni provide periodate‐binding sites, Pt lowers the barrier for electron transport, Bi/Pb promote charge delocalization to stabilize polymeric intermediates, and oxygen orbitals strengthen periodate coordination and surface charge transfer via\n                    p\n                    –\n                    d\n                    hybridization. This synergy drives dechlorination‐coupled polymerization with sustained 4‐chlorophenol removal at ultralow oxidant consumption. HEO@NC further maintained &gt; 95% efficiency with negligible metal leaching during 20‐day treatment of real coal chemical wastewater, demonstrating the potential for sustainable and low‐chemical‐consumption remediation of industrial‐relevant wastewater."},{"t":"高耐久高功率锌空气电池：{Fe3O}分子炉锻造双位点催化剂实现碱性介质协同氧还原","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6643887?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[Zn-Air电池]: 分子炉锻造双位点催化剂","催化机制[双位点]: 协同氧还原","应用介质[催化剂]: 碱性水溶液"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用{Fe₃O}分子'熔炉'前驱体构筑双活性位点催化剂，用于高性能锌空气电池的碱性氧还原反应。金属-氧簇合物作为连接单原子与纳米颗粒的桥梁，可精确控制活性位点的原子级排列。{Fe₃O}簇在热解过程中转化为Fe-N₄单原子与Fe纳米簇共存的双位点结构，二者协同催化ORR的各步骤，显著降低过电位并提高动力学。该催化剂在锌空电池中实现了长循环稳定性和高功率密度输出，为可充电金属空气电池的阴极设计提供了原子级工程新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Unlocking Durable High‐Power Zn‐Air Batteries: {Fe3O} Molecular Furnace‐Forged Dual‐Site Catalysts Enabling Synergistic Oxygen Reduction in Alkaline Media","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Atomic‐level precision metal‐oxo clusters serve as a unique bridge linking single atoms and nanoparticles. Their highly ordered, quasi‐molecular structure effectively promotes electron transfer and optimizes charge deposition kinetics, thereby significantly enhancing the catalytic activity and stability of electrochemical oxygen reduction reactions. Here, we constructed a single‐atom‐nanoparticle dual‐engine catalyst (Fe\n                    3\n                    C/Fe‐NC\n                    1050\n                    ) by in situ domain‐confined complexation of ZIF‐8(Zn) using {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} as a core metal‐oxo cluster. The unique flexible ligand‐carboxylate group of {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} clusters provide a protective barrier for the metal atoms distribution during pyrolysis, work in synergy with the ZIF‐8 framework to provide a conductive substrate. The precisely exposed Fe\n                    3\n                    C (110) crystal plane modulates the electronic structure of neighboring Fe‐N\n                    4\n                    active sites, thus reducing the adsorption energy of key step O\n                    2\n                    →*OOH and endowing the material with excellent methanol resistance and stability. Structural characterization and theoretical calculations reveal that the synergistic interaction between {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} clusters and the carbon substrate provides a stable conductive network and active sites, achieving a maximum power density of 249.0 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in alkaline zinc‐air batteries and demonstrates exceptionally long cycle life of 700 h at the current density of 2.0 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . This design provides crucial insights for the nanoengineering of metal‐oxo clusters and atomic‐scale design of catalysts."},{"t":"通过同步原位成像和便携式尿液分析进行早期肾损伤诊断的单分子双报告探针","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag367/8707072?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Early detection of acute kidney injury (AKI) is critical for effective intervention and improved survival, yet it remains challenging due to the lack of practical tools that sensitively capture subtle renal dysfunction. Here, we report a unimolecular dual-reporter probe, DHU-AKI-3, featuring activatable crosstalk-free multiplexed signal output for precise diagnosis of early AKI by integrating in situ imaging and in vitro portable urinalysis. Following systemic administration, DHU-AKI-3 is selectively activated in the injured kidney, producing a long-retained photoacoustic signal for real-time in situ imaging ahead of the clinical diagnostic window. Concurrently, a near-infrared fluorescent signal is rapidly released and excreted into urine, enabling smartphone-assisted colorimetric analysis for noninvasive, point-of-care testing. The mutual validation of crosstalk-free in situ and in vitro signals guaranteed the diagnostic accuracy. This study underscores the potential of unimolecular dual-reporter probe for directly visualizing early-stage AKI in urine, meeting the pressing demand for point-of-care testing in AKI management."},{"t":"超窄间距极性绿色芳香Dion-Jacobson杂化钙钛矿实现高灵敏稳定自驱动X射线探测","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73657?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿探测器","kp":["材料[X射线探测]: DJ型极性无铅绿色杂化钙钛矿","特性[DJ钙钛矿]: 高稳定性+短层间距+自供能"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究设计了一种超窄间距极性绿色芳香族Dion-Jacobson(DJ)型钙钛矿杂化材料，用于高灵敏度、高稳定性的自驱动X射线探测。DJ型钙钛矿因天然量子阱结构具有优异的激子性能和辐射稳定性。通过引入极性芳香间隔层缩短层间距并增强层间电荷传输，该材料实现了高X射线吸收效率、低暗电流和高灵敏度探测，无需外部偏压即可工作（自驱动模式）。材料在连续X射线照射下表现出优异的环境稳定性，解决了传统3D钙钛矿探测器稳定性差的问题。","dp":1,"ot":"Ultranarrow‐Spaced Polar Green Aromatic Dion–Jacobson Hybrid Perovskite Enables Highly Sensitive and Stable Self‐Powered X‐Ray Detection","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Dion‐Jacobson (DJ) hybrid perovskites are considered as highly promising X‐ray detection materials due to their high stability and short interlayer spacing. However, the large‐scale commercial development of these materials is challenged due to severe ion migration at high voltage and lead toxicity. Here, we successfully obtained a DJ‐type polar lead‐free green hybrid perovskite (4AMPY)\n                    2\n                    AgBiBr\n                    8\n                    (\n                    1\n                    ) by inserting 4‐aminomethylpyridine (4AMPY) aromatic diamine into 3D Cs\n                    2\n                    AgBiBr\n                    6\n                    , and achieved efficient and stable self‐powered X‐ray detection. Specifically, owing to the insertion of 4AMPY,\n                    1\n                    crystallizes in polar space group\n                    P\n                    2\n                    1\n                    and exhibits a significant bulk photovoltaic effect. Additionally, strong hydrogen‐bonding interactions between 4AMPY and adjacent inorganic layers lead to an ultranarrow interlayer spacing of 3.09 Å. Meanwhile, the enhanced electron cloud density in aromatic diamines improves the charge transfer channel of\n                    1\n                    and enhances its X‐ray detection performance. Therefore, among all DJ‐type lead‐free hybrid perovskites,\n                    1\n                    achieves record‐breaking sensitivities of 661.4 and 9465.2 µC Gy\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0 and 100 V, respectively. Importantly,\n                    1\n                    exhibits excellent storage stability, with its sensitivity remaining at 97.5% (0 V) and 96.6% (100 V) of the initial value after three months. This work will greatly promote the development of polar DJ‐type lead‐free perovskite‐based self‐powered X‐ray detectors."},{"t":"转录因子 Tono 介导组蛋白 H3K4 三甲基化，通过转录重编程调节内复制","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9695?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Endoreplication is a cell cycle variant that involves multiple rounds of DNA replication without cell division, resulting in enlarged cells and organs. Here, we combined the\n                    Bombyx\n                    silk gland and\n                    Drosophila\n                    salivary gland to determine the mechanism underlying transcriptional reprogramming during the mitotic-to-endoreplication transition. Transcriptome profiling of the silk gland revealed that genes involved in multiple processes, especially cell cycle control, growth, and morphogenesis, are up-regulated after endoreplication entry. We further found that global levels of histone H3K4 trimethylation (H3K4me3) in the silk gland increase following endoreplication entry; the depletion of the COMPASS H3K4 methyltransferase complex subunit Wds in the silk gland or salivary gland blocks endoreplication; and a subset of up-regulated genes are targeted and transcriptionally reprogrammed by H3K4me3. The transcription factor Tono mediates H3K4me3 deposition at target loci by recruiting the Wds-containing COMPASS complex, thereby promoting endoreplication. These findings reveal an epigenetic mechanism by which Tono orchestrates transcriptional reprogramming through the H3K4me3 modification to regulate endoreplication progression."},{"t":"跟踪东南亚能源转型的进展和优先事项——区域能源转型指数和分析框架","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007403?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"能源转型指数","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"时间序列单细胞转录组学揭示斑马鱼睾丸中普遍存在的每日节律和夜间精子发生","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee7124?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The vertebrate testis has long been regarded as lacking strong cellular daily rhythmicity. Here, we use time-series single-cell RNA sequencing to construct a temporal atlas of the adult zebrafish testis. We identify previously unknown cell-type–specific markers and previously unidentified testicular subtypes and reveal that Sertoli cells, spermatogonia, and spermatids exhibit robust oscillations in key circadian clock genes. In contrast, Leydig cells and spermatocytes primarily exhibit rhythmic expression of key functional genes. We show that intercellular communication networks also exhibit daily rhythmicity. Pseudotime trajectory analysis demonstrates a notable nocturnal preference for germ cell progression. Disrupting circadian input via constant light reduced germ cell numbers and impaired fertility. Genetic ablation of\n                    clock1a\n                    arrests spermatogonial differentiation, whereas mutation of the rhythmic spermatocyte gene\n                    hmgb1a\n                    substantially reduces meiotic cells. Together, our findings redefine the testis as a highly rhythmic organ in which a precisely timed, nocturnally coordinated cellular symphony drives spermatogenesis."},{"t":"在桨轮双铜分子催化剂上切换氢转移路径实现高效电催化乙炔半氢化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73644?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化半氢化","kp":["催化剂[乙炔半加氢]: 桨轮式双铜分子催化剂","机制切换[双铜催化剂]: Eley-Rideal与Langmuir-Hinshelwood间切换"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究阐明了桨轮型双铜分子催化剂上电催化乙炔半氢化(EAH)的氢转移路径切换机制。乙炔半氢化是生产聚合级乙烯的关键反应，但H来源和转移途径尚不清晰。研究发现双铜中心的Cu-Cu协同作用可在两种氢转移模式间切换，通过调控电解液pH或电位选择性活化水分子或质子作为氢源。双铜位点的空间限域效应抑制了过度氢化，实现乙炔高选择性转化为乙烯而副产物乙烷极少。该工作为设计高效电催化加氢催化剂提供了分子层面的机理指导。","dp":1,"ot":"Switching Hydrogen Transfer Pathway Over Paddle‐Wheel Dicopper Molecular Catalysts for Efficient Electrocatalytic Acetylene Semihydrogenation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Elucidating the hydrogen transfer pathway of electrocatalytic acetylene semihydrogenation (EAH) is crucial for understanding the catalytic mechanism and designing high‐performance catalysts, but faces grand challenges. Herein, we unprecedentedly switch the hydrogen transfer pathway between Eley‐Rideal mechanism and Langmuir‐Hinshelwood mechanism over paddle‐wheel dicopper molecular catalysts, where the charge density of the Cu sites is effectively modulated by the ligands with different electron‐withdrawing ability. Extended X‐ray absorption fine structure (EXAFS), operando characterizations, and theoretical calculations together reveal that the moderate charge density of Cu sites in benzoic acid‐Cu catalyst (BA‐Cu) inhibits H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation and reduces C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    adsorption energy, promoting the co‐adsorption of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O and steering the EAH through the Eley‐Rideal mechanism. In acetic acid‐Cu (AA‐Cu) with low charge density and monofluorobenzoic acid‐Cu (MFBA‐Cu) with high charge density, the Cu sites facilitate H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation to *H and hydrogenate C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    via the Langmuir‐Hinshelwood mechanism. In 1 \n                    M\n                    KOH aqueous solution, the BA‐Cu delivers an ethylene partial current density of 328 mA/cm\n                    2\n                    with an ethylene Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 96.4% at –0.9 V versus RHE, which is about 2‐fold and 1.4‐fold higher than AA‐Cu and MFBA‐Cu. This work provides mechanistic insights for the rational design of high‐performance electrocatalysts by regulating the hydrogenation kinetics."},{"t":"可扩展铁单原子催化剂上的超交换辅助Fe(IV)=O链形成用于低成本连续水净化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73668?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁单原子催化剂","kp":["催化剂[水净化]: 可扩展铁单原子催化剂","活性物种[Fe SAC]: 超交换辅助Fe(IV)=O链"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用超交换作用辅助的铁单原子催化剂在连续流条件下生成Fe(IV)=O链，实现低化学投入的水净化。基于聚合的水处理可在低能耗下耦合去污与资源回收。铁单原子催化剂通过超交换机制促进Fe(IV)=O活性物种的链式生成和传递，高效降解水中有机污染物。该连续流设计避免了间歇式处理中催化剂分离的难题，同时显著降低化学氧化剂用量。该策略为低能耗、低化学残留的工业废水处理提供了可规模化的技术路线。","dp":1,"ot":"Superexchange‐Assisted Fe(IV)=O Chain Formation on Scalable Iron Single‐Atom Catalysts for Low‐Chemical Water Purification in Flow","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymerization‐based wastewater treatment can couple decontamination with resource recovery at low energy input by transforming dilute organics into separable products. However, it requires selective oxidant activation, and iron, although abundant and industrially relevant, often forms metastable over‐oxidizing adducts that suppress polymerization selectivity. Here, we design and synthesize a distance‐tailored iron single‐atom catalyst (Fe‐SAC) featuring a coupled Fe\n                    1\n                    ‐Fe\n                    2\n                    pair that enables sequential generation of reactive Fe(IV)═O species from peroxymonosulfate. Theory and experiments reveal that formation of the first Fe\n                    1\n                    (IV)═O triggers a spin‐state transition of the adjacent Fe\n                    2\n                    site to a high‐spin configuration, while the finely tuned Fe\n                    1\n                    ─Fe\n                    2\n                    separation geometrically matches the O─O bond in the oxidant. This spin reconfiguration strengthens Fe─O covalency and promotes a superexchange‐assisted pathway, leading to chain formation of Fe\n                    2\n                    (IV)═O through bidentate axial bonding and site‐to‐site electronic coupling. In a continuous‐flow reactor, the scalable Fe‐SAC increases polymerization selectivity from 29.9% to 73.3% and boosts electron utilization from 156.8% to 443.8%. Life‐cycle and techno‐economic analyses further indicate ∼88% and ∼79% reductions in environmental impacts for catalyst synthesis and operation, respectively, together with an estimated ∼90% decrease in pollutant removal cost. This work establishes a design principle to unlock selective Fe(IV)═O chemistry for low‐chemical, polymerization‐based water purification with engineering viability."},{"t":"亚细胞金属组学网络调控生理结局：基于集成SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS平台的单细胞映射","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2601472123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"亚细胞金属成像","kp":["表征平台[亚细胞金属组]: SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS集成"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究开发了集成的SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS平台，实现植物单细胞水平的亚细胞金属组网络映射。必需、非必需和有毒类金属元素(ME)在植物细胞内的空间分布决定了植物的生理响应（营养吸收、抗逆、毒性等）。该联合平台将扫描电镜的形貌成像、聚焦离子束的逐层切片和飞行时间二次离子质谱的元素成像三者结合，以纳米级分辨率重建细胞内金属元素的3D分布图谱。研究揭示了金属组网络如何编排生理结局，为理解植物重金属耐受和富集机制提供了前所未有的空间分辨数据。","dp":1,"ot":"Subcellular metallomic networks orchestrate physiological outcomes: Single-cell mapping via an integrated SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS platform","b":"The spatial organization of essential, nonessential, and toxic metal(loid) elements (MEs) within plant cells underpins physiological function. Yet, comprehensive subcellular imaging of the full ME spectrum remains challenging due to trade-offs among spatial resolution, elemental coverage, and structural correlation. Here, we present an integrated scanning electron microscopy–focused ion beam–time-of-flight-secondary ion mass spectrometry platform that overcomes these limitations by achieving nanoscale coregistration of ultrastructure with ME distribution. Applying this high-fidelity workflow to\n                    Arabidopsis\n                    , soybean, and wheat, we constructed single-cell metallome maps revealing an evolutionarily conserved subcellular architecture: chloroplasts enrich essential MEs (e.g., magnesium, iron, copper), whereas vacuoles compartmentalize nonessential [e.g., lanthanum (La)] and toxic MEs [e.g., cadmium (Cd), lead, arsenic]. We demonstrate that while this architecture remains stable under homeostasis, it undergoes dynamic, stimulus-specific, and dose-dependent remodeling under stress. Low-dose La(III) enhances pairwise and higher-order colocalizations of essential MEs within chloroplasts, correlating with improved photosynthetic efficiency and growth. High-dose La(III) induces nonphysiological La-ME associations and, critically, drives aberrant Cd(II) accumulation in chloroplasts—revealing a cross-toxicity mechanism wherein La(III) disrupts native sequestration barriers. In contrast, although high-dose Cd(II) is largely excluded from chloroplasts, it triggers a widespread redistribution of essential MEs, progressively eroding spatial organization. Thus, while both ions inhibit growth, they perturb metallomic networks via distinct mechanisms: La(III)-mediated disruption of sequestration vs. Cd(II)-induced systemic compartmental collapse. Our findings establish that subcellular ME networks are dynamically regulated and orchestrate physiological outcomes."},{"t":"水光互补运行条件下多年调节水库年末消落水位控制策略研究","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008093?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/水电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水光互补调度","kp":["[年末消落水位]: 水电-光伏协同运行下多年调节水库控制策略"],"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Study on control strategies of year-end drawdown level in multi-year regulation reservoir under hydro-photovoltaic bundled operation condition"},{"t":"均苯四甲酸二酰亚胺共晶中可逆结构切换实现刺激响应三线态发射与X射线闪烁","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3402295?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"刺激响应发光材料","kp":["材料[刺激响应发光]: 均苯四甲酸二酰亚胺共晶","机制[三线态发射]: 保持结晶性可逆结构切换"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用均苯四甲酸二酰亚胺(PMDI)共晶材料，通过可逆结构切换实现刺激响应性的三重态发光和X射线闪烁。智能刺激响应发光材料具有可编程和可逆的发射特性，在传感、光开关和辐射探测领域极具前景。PMDI共晶在外部刺激（如机械力、温度、溶剂蒸汽）作用下发生晶体结构重排，可逆切换三重态发射的开关或颜色。该材料在X射线激发下表现出高效闪烁发光，且闪烁性能可通过结构切换调控。该发现为开发可编程辐射探测器和智能发光材料提供了新设计思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Stimuli‐Responsive Triplet Emission and X‐Ray Scintillation via Reversible Structural Switching in Pyromellitic Diimide Cocrystals","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Smart stimuli‐responsive luminescent materials with programmable and reversible emission are highly desirable for intelligent imaging and information security. Stimuli‐responsive organic materials utilizing triplet excitons are particularly attractive owing to their pronounced sensitivity to solid‐state packing. However, crystallinity‐preserving reversible structural switching that enables simultaneous control over X‐ray‐excited luminescence (scintillation) remains largely unexplored. Herein, donor‐acceptor halogen‐bonded cocrystals were constructed using\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    N\n                    ′‐bis(n‐butyl)pyromellitic diimide (Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI) and 3,6‐dibromocarbazole (Br\n                    2\n                    Cz) or 3,6‐diiodocarbazole (I\n                    2\n                    Cz). The green cocrystal Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz‐G exhibits room‐temperature phosphorescence (RTP) and bright radioluminescence, whereas its orange polymorph is nearly non‐emissive. In contrast, the I\n                    2\n                    Cz‐based cocrystal displays thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF), representing an alternative triplet exciton utilization pathway. Notably, mild organic‐vapor stimulation triggers reversible order‐to‐order polymorphic interconversion of Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz, which reorganizes halogen‐bonding motifs and, thus achieves crystallinity‐retained “on/off” switching of radioluminescence. Benefiting from efficient triplet exciton utilization, Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz‐G enables high‐resolution static X‐ray imaging (37 lp mm\n                    −1\n                    ) and real‐time dynamic imaging (2 K, 60 fps) with negligible afterglow. Furthermore, the reversible solvent‐triggered luminescence switching facilitates rewritable multimodal information encryption by integrating photoluminescence and radioluminescence as orthogonal readout channels. This work demonstrates cocrystal engineering as a powerful strategy for reversibly programming triplet‐exciton emission and X‐ray scintillation via structural switching in organic solids."},{"t":"具有精确排列的发光体的[2]Rotaxane取向异构体的选择性合成：面向信息存储和加密的方向依赖性发射","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3759413?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Aiming at the precise synthesis of rotaxane orientational isomers and the further elucidation of attractive orientation effects, a novel steric hindrance‐controlled selective stopper exchange approach has been successfully developed. This method enables the facile and selective synthesis of six pairs of [2]rotaxane orientational isomers with precisely arranged luminogens, greatly enriching both the structural and functional diversity of such isomers. Notably, the resulting orientational isomers exhibit orientation‐dependent emission behaviors, particularly in wavelengths, photoluminescence quantum yields, and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) performances, endowing them with great potential for information storage and encryption. This proof‐of‐concept study provides not only a practical and efficient strategy for the efficient synthesis of rotaxane orientational isomers, but also a novel platform for constructing chiral luminescent materials with desired properties for wide applications.","tp":"轮烷合成","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究者开发了位阻控制的选择性封端基团交换策略，实现了[2]轮烷取向异构体的精确合成。该方法成功制备了六对具有精确排列发光体的取向异构体，显著丰富了此类分子的结构与功能多样性。这些异构体表现出方向依赖性发光特性，在信息存储和分子级加密领域具有重要应用潜力，为分子机器的精确设计提供了新途径。"},{"t":"ResMap：一个社区资源，用于系统地绘制跨环境的治疗持续残留癌细胞依赖性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7476?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Relapse following targeted therapy remains a central challenge in oncogene-driven cancers. Drug-tolerant persister cells that survive initial treatment without genetic resistance seed relapse, yet despite over a decade of research, no persister-directed therapy has reached clinical approval. To bridge this gap, we developed ResMap, a community resource providing both a standardized experimental framework and quantitative dataset for systematic comparison of persister vulnerabilities across cancer contexts. Using this platform, we evaluated 94 compounds targeting 57 literature-derived candidates in two\n                    EGFR\n                    \n                      mut\n                    \n                    and two\n                    KRAS\n                    \n                      G12C\n                    \n                    lung cancer models under normoxic and hypoxic conditions. Initial screening identified 12 targets with conserved anti-persister activity across genotypes and oxygen environments; follow-up validation reproduced 9 of these targets and revealed variable degrees of persister specificity relative to general cytotoxicity. We also identified context-specific vulnerabilities, including KRAS-relevant combination targets, several of which have since been independently reported and/or advanced to clinical testing. Integration of human cancer cell line essentiality data and adult mouse loss-of-function phenotypes provided a complementary tolerability layer to refine prioritization. ResMap establishes a foundation for coordinated community efforts to accelerate rational persister-directed combination strategies toward the clinic."},{"t":"伊拉克、沙特阿拉伯和西班牙的可再生能源政策分析：使用 HOMER 和记录的系统性能数据进行多维评估","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003654?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"可再生能源","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.5,"t":2.5},"as":""},{"t":"调控多金属离子轨道相互作用增强磷酸锰铁锂正极动力学与结构稳定性","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71180?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷酸锰铁锂正极","kp":["掺杂元素[LMFP正极]: Ni、Cu、Ti多金属离子","材料体系[LMFP]: LiMn₀.₄₇₅Fe₀.₄₇₅Ni₀.₀₃Cu₀.₀₁","[核心策略]: 多金属离子轨道工程解耦J-T畸变"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究通过调控多金属离子轨道相互作用，提升磷酸锰铁锂（LMFP）正极材料的动力学性能与结构稳定性。LMFP兼具高安全性和高能量密度，但存在离子扩散慢和结构相变问题。研究通过多金属元素协同调控电子结构，改善锂离子传输速率和循环稳定性，为高性能锂电正极材料优化提供新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Regulating Multi‐Metal Ion Orbital Interactions to Enhance Kinetics and Structural Stability in Lithium Manganese Iron Phosphate Cathodes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium manganese iron phosphate (LMFP) offers high safety and high energy density for lithium‐ion batteries, yet its commercialization is bottlenecked by poor conductivity and severe Jahn–Teller (J–T) distortion. Here, we report a multi‐metal ion (Ni, Cu, Ti) orbital engineering strategy to simultaneously decouple these twin challenges in a customized LiMn\n                    0.475\n                    Fe\n                    0.475\n                    Ni\n                    0.03\n                    Cu\n                    0.01\n                    Ti\n                    0.01\n                    PO\n                    4\n                    (LMFP‐NCT) cathode. Mechanistically, enhanced orbital hybridization between heteroatoms and the host lattice optimizes localized electronic distribution and narrows the bandgap, boosting intrinsic conductivity and ionic diffusivity by an order of magnitude. Importantly, the tailored orbital occupation effectively suppresses\n                    \n                      e\n                      g\n                    \n                    orbital degeneracy, transitioning the MnO\n                    6\n                    octahedra into a structurally robust, controlled‐distortion state. Supported by the\n                    d\n                    ‐band center theory, this strategy enhances metal‐oxygen\n                    σ\n                    ‐bonds, leading to minimal volume variation (4.29%) and suppressed Mn dissolution (reduced by 48.4%). Consequently, the LMFP‐NCT delivers doubled capacity at 6C compared with LMFP and an exceptional 92.3% capacity retention after 1000 cycles at 1C. When paired in full cells, it maintains 96.4% of its capacity over 500 cycles. This work provides profound insights for designing high‐performance LMFP cathodes by fundamentally conquering J–T distortion and kinetic limitations."},{"t":"准栅极电极调控静电放电实现高性能直流摩擦纳米发电机","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73659?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"直流摩擦纳米发电机","kp":["器件结构[DC-TENG]: 背面准栅极电极增强","设计原理[QGED-TENG]: 模仿耗尽型场效应晶体管"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究提出利用准栅极电极调控静电放电，实现高性能直流摩擦纳米发电机（DC-TENG）。DC-TENG在机械能收集方面前景广阔，但输出性能受限于电荷转移效率。准栅极设计有效控制摩擦起电过程中的电荷输运路径，显著提升直流输出功率密度与稳定性，为自驱动电子器件供能提供新方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Regulating Electrostatic Discharge via Quasi‐gate Electrode for High‐Performance Direct‐current Triboelectric Nanogenerators","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Direct‐current triboelectric nanogenerators (DC‐TENGs) are promising for mechanical energy harvesting but are often hindered by incomplete charge collection and parasitic discharge pathways. Herein, inspired by the operating characteristics of depletion‐mode field‐effect transistors, we propose a quasi‐gate‐electrode enhanced DC‐TENG (QGED‐TENG). The QGED‐TENG employs a back‐side quasi‐gate‐electrode (QGE) and porous polytetrafluoroethylene film to modulate electrostatic breakdown and charge leakage, thereby effectively suppressing parasitic discharge. The QGED‐TENG enables direction‐contingent enhancement and depletion modes without external bias, notably delivering a 1.41‐fold output charge increase in enhancement mode compared to the device without the QGE. Furthermore, by leveraging redistributed electric fields and parallel discharge pathways, the multi‐unit architecture achieves a linear charge increase relative to the number of units. Benefiting from the synergistic effects of electrostatic breakdown, charge leakage, and electric field redistribution within the multi‐unit configuration, an optimized rotational QGED‐TENG achieved an ultrahigh average power density of 25 W m\n                    −2\n                    Hz\n                    −1\n                    and an output charge density of 13.65 mC m\n                    −2\n                    at 60 rpm, setting a new benchmark for the porous triboelectric layer of electrostatic breakdown‐based DC‐TENGs. This work provides new physical insights and a general design strategy for maximizing spatial charge utilization and enabling high output performance DC‐TENG."},{"t":"熔盐储热系统集成燃煤电厂灵活性提升的二次规划非线性模型预测控制","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008007?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/火电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"火电熔盐储热控制","kp":["[控制策略]: 二次规划非线性模型预测控制","[集成]: 燃煤电厂耦合熔盐热储能"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Quadratic programming-based nonlinear model predictive control of coal-fired power plant integrated with molten salt thermal storage system for its flexibility improvement"},{"t":"从三条典型电压曲线中挖掘物理信息用于锂离子电池高保真数字建模","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008548?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池数字建模","kp":["[数字建模]: 三条代表性电压曲线挖掘物理信息"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Physical information mining from three-representative voltage curves for high-fidelity digital modeling of lithium-ion batteries"},{"t":"催产素通过增强前边缘皮质中生长抑素中间神经元介导的局部 GABA 能抑制来减弱恐惧学习","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef8400?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Acute stress exposure can trigger post–traumatic stress disorder (PTSD). Prophylactic interventions may enhance psychological resilience against PTSD in high-risk occupations. Here, we demonstrate that pretreating with intranasal oxytocin exerts prolonged yet reversible attenuation of fear learning via oxytocin receptors (OxtRs) expressed in prelimbic cortex (PL). Crucially, both local PL oxytocin infusion and selective activation of PL OxtR+ neurons recapitulate this fear reduction. Although OxtRs are expressed on pyramidal and somatostatin (SST) neurons, SST interneurons exhibit higher\n                    Oxtr\n                    expression. Both fear conditioning and oxytocin application preferentially excite PL OxtR+ SST interneurons. Accordingly, preactivating OxtR+ SST neurons, but not OxtR+ pyramidal neurons, elicits the reduction effect on fear learning. Ablating\n                    Oxtr\n                    in γ-aminobutyric acid (GABA) neurons or silencing SST interneurons abolishes oxytocin’s fear-attenuating effects. Mechanistically, OxtR+ SST interneuron activation or oxytocin application potentiates GABAergic synaptic transmission onto PL pyramidal neurons. Collectively, these findings establish that oxytocin attenuates fear learning by enhancing local inhibitory circuits in PL, revealing a potential therapeutic approach for reducing PTSD risk."},{"t":"用于高通量合成聚合物生物共轭物的耐氧光诱导小型加速原子转移自由基聚合（OPTIMA-ATRP）","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6617585?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Conjugates of synthetic polymers with biomolecules, forming polymer bioconjugates (PBCs), are used to improve the pharmacokinetic properties of many biological therapeutics. Growing synthetic polymers from biomolecules via reversible deactivation radical polymerization (RDRP) demonstrated enormous potential as an alternative to the “grafting to” method in synthesizing biohybrids. However, conventional “grafting from” approaches applied to biomolecules are hindered by large reaction volumes, long reaction times, rigorous deoxygenation, and complex workflows, rendering them unsuitable for synthesizing libraries of PBCs needed to collect large data sets for emerging materials discovery. Herein, Oxygen‐tolerant photo‐induced miniaturized accelerated atom transfer radical polymerization (OPTIMA‐ATRP) in water was developed for the polymerization of hydrophilic (meth)acrylate monomers under ambient or sub‐ambient (4°C) temperature and atmospheric conditions, without prior degassing, in &lt; 10 min. Sodium pyruvate (SP) in conjunction with UV light (380–395 nm, 28.5–30 mW/cm\n                    2\n                    ) promoted rapid controlled polymerization in water, on an ultra‐small scale (&lt; 50 µL) in micropipette tips or 96‐well plate. By exploiting this OPTIMA‐ATRP, cost‐effective syntheses of several types of PBCs (e.g., DNA‐, peptide‐, lipid‐, and protein–polymer hybrids) were carried out using a parallel, high‐throughput approach. This technique enables rapid optimization of biohybrid synthesis, previously inaccessible under conventional conditions, and empowers non‐specialists to use ATRP in various areas.","tp":"光诱导聚合","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者开发了OPTIMA-ATRP技术——一种耐氧的光诱导小型加速原子转移自由基聚合方法，用于高通量合成聚合物生物共轭物。该方法以\"从生物分子上生长聚合物\"的思路，克服了传统\"接枝到\"方法的局限，为改善生物治疗药物的药代动力学性质提供了新途径，具有规模化合成生物杂化材料的潜力。"},{"t":"在 $\\sqrt{{s}_{NN}}=200 \\mathrm{GeV}$ 处打开 $pp$ 和 $\\mathrm{Au}+\\mathrm{Au}$ 碰撞中的 ${\\mathrm{Λ}}_{c}^{+}/{D}^{0}$ 比率","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/519h-2vrc","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Author(s): Bijun Fan, Shusu Shi, Chao Zhang, and Liang ZhengWe study open-charm hadrons production in pp and $\\mathrm{Au}+\\mathrm{Au}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{{s}_{NN}}=200$ GeV using an improved multiphase transport (AMPT) model. Specifically, we show the transverse-momentum spectra and nuclear modification factors ${R}_{\\mathrm{AA}}$ of ${D}^{0}$ mesons and $…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064904] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"纳米陷阱结构缓解质子交换膜燃料电池阴极催化层界面传输限制","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73702?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池催化层","kp":["电极结构[PEMFC阴极]: 碳基纳米陷阱功能化吡咯-N","[界面优化]: 重组Pt-碳-离聚物界面增强局部氧供给"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究设计了纳米陷阱结构以缓解质子交换膜燃料电池（PEMFC）阴极催化层中的界面传质限制。高效气体传输和丰富的三相界面是厚催化层性能的关键瓶颈。纳米陷阱架构通过构建多级孔道与活性位点分布优化，改善氧气传质效率与催化剂利用率，为高功率密度燃料电池催化层设计提供结构创新方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Nanotrap Architectures for Mitigating Interfacial Transport Limitations in Cathode Catalyst Layers of Proton Exchange Membrane Fuel Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient gas transport and abundant triple‐phase boundaries (TPBs) are vital for thick cathode catalyst layers (CCLs) in proton exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs), yet remain challenging to realize. In this work, we introduce a carbon‐based nanotrap architecture functionalized with pyrrolic‐N groups, which reorganizes the Pt–carbon–ionomer interface to enhance local oxygen supply. These nanotraps simultaneously confine Pt nanoparticles and ionomer, forming continuous pathways for oxygen, protons, and electrons, thereby significantly increasing active TPB density. The underlying enhancement mechanism is validated by x‐ray tomography and 3D two‐phase flow simulations. Using a 15.5 µm‐thick CCL, the optimized electrode achieves peak power densities of 1940 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in H\n                    2\n                    /O\n                    2\n                    and 1410 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in H\n                    2\n                    /Air—improvements of ∼30% and ∼80%, respectively. Moreover, it exhibits a good stability, with a voltage decay rate of only 43.8 µV h\n                    −1\n                    at 1.5 A cm\n                    −2\n                    over 1000 h. This nanotrap concept offers a versatile interfacial design strategy for advanced gas‐diffusion electrodes in energy conversion technologies."},{"t":"船舶多能混合推进系统多目标容量优化及可行性与灵敏度分析","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600841X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"船舶混合推进","kp":["[优化方法]: 多能混合推进系统多目标尺寸优化"],"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Multi-objective sizing optimization of shipboard multi-energy hybrid propulsion systems with feasibility and sensitivity analysis"},{"t":"侧链工程实现Kagome共价有机框架晶体的分子级精确三角形端封","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5591473?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架","kp":["[COF晶体]: 侧链工程实现Kagome框架分子级精确三角形终止"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究通过侧链工程实现了Kagome型共价有机框架（COF）晶体的分子级精确三角形终止。二维Kagome COF的高分辨率结构表征对其边缘终止结构理解不足。通过精确设计侧链基团调控晶体生长方向与边界结构，首次实现了可控的三角形终止，为COF晶体的精准合成与功能化边界工程提供新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Molecularly Precise Triangular Termination of Kagome Covalent Organic Framework Crystals Enabled by Side‐Chain Engineering","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐resolution structural characterization of two‐dimensional (2D) kagome covalent organic frameworks (COFs) remains limited, often leaving critical questions about lattice ordering and surface‐terminating functionality largely unanswered. To address this challenge, we designed a series of acceptor–donor–acceptor linear linkers based on benzo[1,2‐\n                    b\n                    :4,5‐\n                    b\n                    ′]dithiophene and 2,1,3‐benzothiadiazole units with systematically varied alkoxy side chains. Diverse 2D kagome COFs bearing methoxy, ethoxy, and propoxy side chains were synthesized by imine condensation of these linkers with a dibenzo[\n                    g\n                    ,\n                    p\n                    ]chrysene‐based node. While featuring identical backbone architecture, the resulting COFs exhibit remarkably different degrees of crystallinity, demonstrating the critical role of side‐chain length in regulating framework ordering. Owing to its superior crystallinity and large pore apertures, the methoxy‐substituted COF (OMe COF) enables direct real‐space visualization of extended kagome pore lattices by high‐resolution transmission electron microscopy (HRTEM). Furthermore, highly crystalline and preferentially oriented OMe COF thin films were synthesized, allowing for detailed HRTEM analysis. Strikingly, HRTEM could clearly resolve triangular terminations of the kagome lattice, thereby establishing the half‐condensed dibenzochrysene nodes as the triangular pores terminating the crystal facets and providing unprecedented real‐space evidence of exposed amino groups. These findings create a structural basis for the future rational design of surface functionalization and potential interfacial engineering in 2D kagome COFs."},{"t":"塔克拉玛干沙漠生物圈碳汇的错误归因可能导致不切实际的政策：评论","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607916123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"沙漠碳汇论","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":1.5,"r":7.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"机器学习优化的单原子催化剂实现微环境自适应化学动力学-生物正交癌症治疗","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73689?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Chemodynamic therapy (CDT), which harnesses endogenous chemical energy within the tumor microenvironment (TME), has shown high potential for precise cancer treatment. However, its efficacy is often limited by the mildly acidic and reductive nature of the TME that compromises catalyst stability and activity. Developing catalysts capable of maintaining robust performance under such physiological constraints remains a key challenge. Herein, we report a programmable dual‐catalytic platform that integrates machine learning‐guided design with atomic‐level precision. Through predictive modeling, we establish quantitative structure‐performance relationships that guided the rational synthesis of iron single‐atoms (Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs). The Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs demonstrate exceptional chemodynamic reactivity and environmental stability within the complex TME, efficiently converting endogenous hydrogen peroxide into hydroxyl radicals for precise tumor ablation. Moreover, Fe‐N\n                    5\n                    SAs exhibit potent bioorthogonal catalytic activity, enabling in situ prodrug activation and localized synthesis of doxorubicin under physiological conditions. This synergistic CDT‐bioorthogonal dual‐catalytic mechanism achieves tumor‐selective, stimulus‐free, and combinatorial therapy, markedly enhancing overall antitumor efficacy. This study establishes a machine learning‐guided framework for single‐atom catalyst design and expands the frontiers of metal catalysis in biomedical applications.","tp":"单原子催化","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队利用机器学习优化单原子催化剂，使其在肿瘤微环境的弱酸性和还原性条件下保持稳定催化活性。该催化剂实现微环境自适应的化学动力学治疗，结合生物正交化学策略，为精准癌症治疗提供了新方案，有望突破CDT疗效受限的瓶颈。"},{"t":"高熵诱导晶格畸变激活双钴位点协同促进光（电）催化析氢","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73708?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电催化产氢","kp":["晶格畸变[高熵尖晶石]: δavg=3.35%","[活性位点]: Co_tet²⁺/Co_oct³⁺双钴协同","材料[光催化HER]: (CuCoNi)(GaCoCrMnFe)₂O₄"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用高熵工程诱导晶格畸变激活双钴位点协同效应，显著提升光（电）催化析氢性能。高熵策略打破太阳能分解水中活性-稳定性权衡瓶颈。设计的尖晶石氧化物中高熵组分离子半径差异导致晶格畸变，优化双钴活性位点的电子结构与吸附能，在宽pH范围内实现高效稳定析氢，为高熵电催化剂设计提供理论指导。","dp":1,"ot":"High‐Entropy‐Induced Lattice Distortion Activates Dual‐Cobalt Site Synergy for Boosted Photo(Electro)Catalytic Hydrogen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy engineering breaks the activity–stability trade‐off in solar water splitting. We design a spinel oxide (CuCoNi)(GaCoCrMnFe)\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    with lattice distortion (\n                    \n                      δ\n                      avg\n                    \n                    = 3.35%) and stabilized Co\n                    tet\n                    2+\n                    /Co\n                    oct\n                    3+\n                    dual sites. The cocktail effect goes beyond elemental averaging: Cu/Ga harvest light; Co enables dual‐site surface catalysis; Ni/Cr induce distortion and local built‐in fields; Cu/Mn trigger Jahn–Teller upshifting the d‐band center; Fe/Mn balance distortion; multivalent species provide a broad redox window. The material achieves a photocatalytic HER rate of 16.62 µmol∙h\n                    −1\n                    ∙g\n                    −1\n                    —16.3× that of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    and 10.8× that of CuGa\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , alongside &lt;5% decay over 30 h. In photoelectrochemical tests, it delivers 2.03 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0 V\n                    RHE\n                    in neutral electrolyte (21.6× and 67.7× the benchmarks) and 7.08 mA∙cm\n                    −2\n                    under alkaline conditions with 48% IPCE and 0.56% HC‐STH. Distortion‐induced dipoles (0.87 D) extend carrier lifetime to 6.95 ns; Co\n                    tet\n                    2+\n                    dissociates water (\n                    \n                      E\n                      a\n                    \n                    = 0.187 eV) while Co\n                    oct\n                    3+\n                    reduces protons (\n                    \n                      ΔG\n                      *H\n                    \n                    = 0.288 eV); configurational entropy (2.71\n                    R\n                    ) stabilizes the structure. This “entropy–structure–function” strategy offers a generalizable route to durable, high‐performance solar fuel catalysts."},{"t":"从P型到双极性：D-A-D有机正极醌核工程策略用于超稳定高能有机锂离子电池","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9678457?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机正极材料","kp":["[D-A-D分子设计]:醌核工程实现P型到双极性转变"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出基于醌核工程将有机正极从P型转变为双极型的D-A-D分子设计策略，实现超稳定高能有机锂离子电池。供体-受体-供体（D-A-D）结构中醌核单元的理性调控使正极材料同时利用n型和p型氧化还原机制，成倍提升比容量与循环稳定性，为高能量密度有机锂电正极材料开发开辟新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"From P‐Type to Bipolar: A Quinone‐Core Engineering Strategy in D‐A‐D Organic Cathodes for Ultra‐Stable and High‐Energy Organic Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In this study, we present a rational donor‐acceptor‐donor (D‐A‐D) molecular design strategy to develop high‐performance organic cathodes by enhancing the intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) effect. We designed and synthesized two organic molecules: 2,6‐bis(10H‐phenothiazin‐10‐yl)benzo[1,2‐d:4,5‐d’]diimidazole‐4,8‐dione (PTZBQ), featuring a strong quinone‐type acceptor core, and the control compound 2,6‐bis(10H‐phenothiazin‐10‐yl)benzo[1,2‐d:4,5‐d’]diimidazole (PTZTAB), without a quinone core. The strong push‐pull electronic structure of PTZBQ not only results in a significantly narrowed bandgap and improved electrode kinetics, but also allows the quinone core to contribute extra n‐type capacity, thereby remarkably boosting the electrode's specific capacity and reaction dynamics. Moreover, the extended π‐conjugation and D‐A‐D configuration‐induced polarity endow both small molecules with exceptional electrolyte dissolution resistance. Consequently, PTZBQ exhibits bipolar redox activity, delivering a high discharge potential of 3.05 V, a high specific capacity of 163.3 mAh g\n                    −1\n                     at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    , an excellent rate capability (77.6% retention at 5 A g\n                    −1\n                    ), and exceptional long‐term cycling stability with 89.4% retention after 5000 cycles at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    . DFT calculations and ex situ spectroscopy confirm that the unique D‐A‐D architecture possesses spatially separated n‐type and p‐type redox centers, facilitating the redox process. Our findings highlight that quinone‐core engineering enhances intramolecular charge transfer and represents a powerful approach for developing high‐performance cathode materials.","aip":1},{"t":"首次测量风味变化中性电流衰变中随时间变化的 $CP$ 违规 ${B}^{0}→{K}_{S}^{0}{μ}^{+}{μ}^{−}$","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/nnt3-nyds","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Author(s): R. Aaij et al. (LHCb Collaboration)The decay of a b quark to a strange quark and a pair of leptons reveals the first indications of time-dependent CP violation.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231904] Published Fri Jun 12, 2026"},{"t":"非苯环芳烃中的激发态反芳香性：检查小驱动力的分子内质子转移动力学","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6799620?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The relief of excited‐state antiaromaticity (ESAA) is a powerful driving force that underpins the photochemical behavior of photoexcited aromatic molecules. Photo‐induced isomerization, cycloaddition, or proton transfer pathways alleviate the large energetic destabilization caused by ESAA. However, the excited‐state dynamics of annulenes displaying only weak ESAA remain largely unexplored. Here, we fine‐tune the electronic character of a series of annulenes to minimize their ESAA. Excited‐state proton transfer (ESPT) converts hydroxytropyliums (HTs) and hydroxybenzotropyliums (HBTs) to their nonaromatic tautomers, which are only slightly lower in energy than the excited‐state antiaromatic forms. As a result of this near‐degeneracy, we find that HBTs exhibit weak photoacidity (pKa drop of 0.3–1.2 units) and unusually slow, reversible ESPT, proceeding on the ns timescale rather than the typical ps timescale. The fluorescence spectra of these HBTs display the hallmarks of ESPT emitters: (i) dual fluorescence; (ii) excitation‐dependent emission; and (iii) large Stokes shifts. The driving force for this ESPT is increased by the addition of electron‐donating groups, which promote intramolecular charge transfer. Our results demonstrate that judicious structural changes can moderate the ESAA of nonbenzenoid annulenes, minimizing the driving force for ESPT, which leads to slow proton transfer kinetics and weak photoacidity."},{"t":"不确定性下绿色数据中心能耗感知作业调度：结构压缩谱风险控制方法","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007890?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心节能调度","kp":["[结构压缩谱风险控制]: 不确定性下绿色数据中心节能调度"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Energy-aware job scheduling for green data centers under uncertainty: A structure-compressed spectral risk control approach"},{"t":"双猝灭电荷转移在氧化还原活性Eosin Y聚合物中实现创纪录光催化硝酸盐还原为氨","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73686?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化硝酸盐制氨","kp":["光催化剂[硝酸盐制氨]: 伊红Y聚合物","[机制]: 双猝灭电荷转移提升分离效率"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究人员开发了基于氧化还原活性Eosin Y聚合物的光催化体系，通过双淬灭电荷转移机制实现了创纪录的硝酸盐还原为氨(NO3RR)的光催化转化效率。该研究对缓解氮污染和可持续氨合成具有重要意义。双淬灭策略有效抑制了电荷复合，显著提升了光生载流子的利用效率，为光催化硝酸还原反应的机理设计和性能优化提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Dual‐Quenching Charge Transfer Unlocks Record Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Photocatalytic Conversion in Redox‐Active Eosin Y Polymers","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient photocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    RR) is vital for mitigating nitrogen pollution and producing green ammonia (NH\n                    3\n                    ). Although organic polymer photocatalysts show great potential for NO\n                    3\n                    RR, they frequently suffer from low charge separation efficiency. This limitation largely comes from the lack of suitable redox‐active moieties incorporated in the polymer photocatalysts toward NO\n                    3\n                    RR. Herein, we embed the redox‐active Eosin Y (EY) into a conjugated polymer backbone to synthesize a series of EY–X polymers (where X = benzene, biphenyl, or fluorene), in which the extended π‐conjugation can promote dual dynamic and static quenching for directional electron transfer. Upon visible‐light excitation, EY forms a long‐lived radical anion (EY\n                    •−\n                    ) that stores and relays electrons to nitrate, while ground‐state complexation between polymer and nitrate preorganizes the substrate for photoinduced directional electron transfer. This dual‐pathway mechanism extends charge‐separated lifetimes, inhibits recombination, and enhances electron delivery. Consequently, under cocatalyst‐free conditions, the EY–BE polymer achieves a record high NH\n                    3\n                    production of 215 µmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    . Experimental and computational investigations support the reversible EY/EY\n                    •−\n                    cycle and the nitrate‐binding ground‐state complex as the origin of activity and selectivity. This work demonstrates a rational strategy leveraging reversible redox‐active chromophores to integrate dual quenching for designing high‐performance NO\n                    3\n                    RR photocatalysts."},{"t":"不同的氧化还原酶在噻吩氧化素生物合成中协调吲哚噻吩骨架的形成和 N-羟基化介导的生物活化","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7072895?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Microbial sulfur‐containing secondary metabolite thienodolin (\n                    1\n                    ) features a unique tricyclic thieno[2,3‐\n                    b\n                    ]indole scaffold, yet its biosynthesis has remained enigmatic. Here, we uncover an unexpected enzymatic logic in which a consortium of distinct oxidoreductases cooperatively orchestrates indolethiophene skeleton formation and subsequent bioactivation, ultimately generating the authentic antibacterial metabolite thienoxidolin (\n                    10\n                    ). Following thiotryptophan formation by SDR enzyme TndE, the heme‐dependent DUF6875 enzyme TndD initiates C–S bond formation via\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation to yield a dearomatized tricyclic species, which is efficiently driven forward and stabilized by aromatization catalyzed by the FAD‐dependent oxidoreductase TndG. Notably, TndD functions as a bidirectional redox enzyme, reverting the\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxyl group to the stable N–H form to complete the indolethiophene scaffold construction. After amide formation, late‐stage\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation by the cytochrome P450 enzyme TndC, previously misassigned as the C–S bond‐forming enzyme, produces the bioactive product\n                    10\n                    . Intriguingly, TndD may also mediate the deactivation of\n                    10\n                    back to\n                    1\n                    , representing an intrinsic self‐protection mechanism. Together, these results expand the catalytic repertoire of heme‐dependent enzymes and highlight reversible\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation as a pivotal strategy for heterocycle formation and bioactivity regulation in microbial secondary metabolism.","tp":"微生物合成","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了微生物含硫次级代谢产物噻吩氧化素的生物合成机制。该分子具有独特的三环噻吩吲哚骨架，研究发现多种不同的氧化还原酶协同调控吲哚噻吩骨架的形成及随后的N-羟基化生物活化过程，展现出出人意料的酶催化逻辑。"},{"t":"能源与电力系统数字孪生：架构、应用、使能工具及公用事业级实施路线图","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007816?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源系统数字孪生","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Digital Twins in energy and power systems: architectures, applications, enabling tools, and actionable roadmap for utility-scale implementation"},{"t":"开发一种从妊娠晚期胎盘中提取人滋养层干细胞的稳健方法及其在先兆子痫中的应用","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537884123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Trophoblasts are multifunctional cells in the placenta and essential for normal pregnancy. Although trophoblast dysfunction can cause pregnancy complications, the underlying mechanisms remain unclear, and effective treatments are limited, partly because of the scarcity of appropriate experimental models. We previously reported the derivation of human trophoblast stem cells (hTSCs) from 1st-trimester placentas and blastocysts, providing a powerful tool to investigate human trophoblast development and function. However, the difficulty in deriving hTSCs from late-gestation placentas has limited their application to pregnancy complication research. Here we report a robust technique to derive hTSCs from term placentas based on the transient expression of a p53 dominant negative mutant, SALL4, and shRNAs against cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitors. Using this technique, we derived and characterized hTSCs from placentas obtained from patients with early-onset preeclampsia (PE). PE-derived hTSCs exhibit impaired trophoblast invasion and reduced placental growth factor secretion, consistent with trophoblast abnormalities reported in PE. Therefore, this study provides a technological basis for investigating pregnancy complications associated with trophoblast dysfunction."},{"t":"等离子体Au/NbS2异质结构中金属-半金属过渡金属硫族化合物界面促进电荷转移与光电化学析氢反应","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71184?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电催化制氢","kp":["[Au/NbS2异质结构]:等离激元增强电荷转移用于PEC析氢"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了等离子体Au/NbS2异质结构中的金属-半金属过渡金属二硫属化物界面，用于增强电荷转移和光电化学析氢反应(HER)。该异质结构结合了Au的等离子体效应和NbS2的半金属特性，促进了界面电荷分离与传输，提升了太阳能驱动的光电化学水分解制氢效率。该工作为低成本高效光电极的设计提供了界面工程新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Developing Metal–Semimetallic Transition Metal Dichalcogenide Interfaces in Plasmonic Au/NbS2 Heterostructures for Enhanced Charge Transfer and Photoelectrochemical Hydrogen Evolution Reaction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The development of cost‐effective and highly‐efficient photoelectrodes (PE) is critical for advancing solar driven photoelectrochemical (PEC) hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) production technologies. For enhancing PEC performance, it appears promising to combine plasmonic nanoparticles with active catalysts. Here we report a facile and powerful PE comprised of Au nanoparticles (NP) decorated on NbS\n                    2\n                    nanoflakes (NF), directly grown on the carbon fiber paper. In this heterostructure, Au NP acts as plasmonic antennas that intensify local electromagnetic fields strengthening light matter interactions, NbS\n                    2\n                    NF functions as a highly conductive semimetal scaffold offering abundant active HER sites, and the junction of Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF enables efficient charge separation and fast electron transfer from NbS\n                    2\n                    to Au, thereby synergistically accelerating HER kinetics under illumination. Consequently, this Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF heterostructure, for the first time, demonstrates remarkable PEC performance under illumination, such as a 6‐fold increase in the exchange current density, a 1.75‐fold reduction in overpotential, and a 2.45‐fold yield in the H\n                    2\n                    production, respectively. Based on the heterostructure of Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF, this work establishes a strategy of constructing a cost‐effective and highly‐efficient PE and providing valuable insights into the rational design of next generation PE for the sustainable hydrogen production."},{"t":"用于高温摩擦电传感与电磁屏蔽的柔性聚合物薄膜的解耦与从头设计","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73667?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"摩擦电柔性薄膜","kp":["[柔性聚合物薄膜]:解耦设计用于高温摩擦电与电磁屏蔽"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种解耦与全新设计策略，开发柔性聚合物薄膜用于高温环境下的摩擦电传感与电磁屏蔽。基于聚合物摩擦纳米发电机(TENG)在微能源收集和主动传感领域的优势，研究解决了传统TENG在高温条件下性能衰减的问题。通过分子层面的解耦设计，使材料在高温下保持稳定的摩擦电输出和电磁屏蔽效能，拓展了TENG在极端温度工业场景中的应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Decoupling and De Novo Design of Flexible Polymeric Films for High‐Temperature Triboelectric Sensing and Electromagnetic Shielding","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymer‐based triboelectric nanogenerators (TENGs) are shining in fields of micro‐energy harvesting and active sensing by virtue of their flexibility and processability. However, thermionic emission and thermal deformation reduce triboelectric output and distort sensing signals, thereby limiting practical applications in high‐temperature environments. Herein, the charge generation and collection units of polymeric TENGs are decoupled for separate\n                    de novo\n                    design. A dipolar glass polymer, cardo poly(aryl ether) (CPAE), is synthesized with alternating pendant and main‐chain dipoles and bulky, rigid cardo substituent. Aromatic polyphenol‐anchored MXene nanosheets are subsequently crosslinked and sandwiched within thermostable CPAE films, which improves resistance to high‐temperature oxidation. Thanks to the interlayer modulation of MXenes, the total and absorption electromagnetic shielding effectiveness of the resulting film rises by 55% and 195% compared to pristine MXene films, respectively. Even after annealing at 250°C for 24 h, the shielding effectiveness decreases by only ∼1.5%. Moreover, the resulting TENG exhibits an unusual heat‐induced triboelectric enhancement, with an output voltage of 472.2 ± 0.9 V and a power density of 2250.6 ± 27.7 mW/m\n                    2\n                    at 250°C, which compares favorably with most reported polymer‐based TENGs. This work provides a novel technical pathway for flexible electromagnetic protection and self‐powered sensing under extreme operating conditions."},{"t":"可再生能源与制氢系统的耦合优化策略：基于VSEL框架的综述","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008639?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源制氢","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Coupling optimization strategies for renewable energy and hydrogen production systems: A review based on the VSEL framework"},{"t":"更正 Green 等人的观点，肠道微生物群影响营养免疫和对鲍曼不动杆菌肺炎的抵抗力","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2618284123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"对 Ajourlou 等人的修正，上地幔温度阐明了冰岛热点轨迹并了解格陵兰岛冰-地球相互作用","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2617340123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"在纳米流体粘土膜中构建连续层间氢键网络以实现快速阳离子传导和抗膨胀渗透能发电","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73660?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米流体粘土膜","kp":["[粘土纳米流体膜]:层间氢键网络实现快速阳离子传导"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究在二维黏土纳米流体膜中构建连续层间氢键网络，实现快速阳离子传导和抗溶胀渗透能发电。针对传统黏土膜在盐差发电中易溶胀、离子传导率低的瓶颈，通过氢键网络工程优化了层间通道的亲水性和离子传输路径，显著提升了渗透能转化效率。该策略为规模化蓝色能源（盐差能）收集提供了新的材料设计思路，兼具高离子电导率和长期结构稳定性。","dp":1,"ot":"Constructing Continuous Interlayer Hydrogen‐Bond Network in Nanofluidic Clay Membranes for Fast Cation Conduction and Anti‐Swelling Osmotic Energy Generators","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Two‐dimensional clay nanofluidic membranes hold great promise for harvesting sustainable osmotic energy, yet their practical application is constrained by two core challenges. (1) The inherently tortuous and inefficient ion transport pathways within stacked nanosheet structures limit cation flux, and (2) the severe swelling of interlayer nanochannels in aqueous environments impairs ion selectivity and long‐term stability. To simultaneously tackle these challenges, we construct a continuous hydrogen‐bond network within the interlayer of a lamellar membrane (CHM) via a sequential crosslinking strategy. This engineered network serves a dual function: (1) establishing low‐energy barrier pathways to facilitate cation transport while (2) acting as a dynamic yet robust crosslinked matrix to anchor clay nanosheets for suppressing interlayer expansion. Experimental and theoretical results confirm that the negatively charged surface, in synergy with the hydrogen‐bond network, enables selective and rapid cation transport. The ionic conductivity of in‐plane transport reaches as high as 22 S m\n                    −1\n                    in 1 \n                    m\n                    electrolyte. When employed for osmotic energy harvesting from artificial seawater and river water, the CHM delivers an impressive high‐power density of 22.7 W m\n                    −2\n                    and maintains stable power output for over 30 days. Furthermore, an integrated osmotic power generator successfully drives multiple electronic devices, demonstrating its real‐world applicability."},{"t":"限域调控的晶相工程实现用于植物蒸腾动力学监测的结构化半导体纤维系统","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73693?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"半导体纤维传感器","kp":["[材料工程]: 限域调控晶体相工程","[应用]: 植物蒸腾监测半导体纤维纺织品"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出一种限域调控晶体相工程策略，构建结构化半导体纤维系统用于植物蒸腾动态监测。传统传感器难以高分辨解析蒸腾节律，该半导体纤维通过晶体相工程优化光电响应性能，实现对植物蒸腾过程的实时连续监测。该系统将柔性半导体材料与植物生理传感结合，为精准农业和植物水分管理提供了新型可穿戴/可植入传感方案，拓展了半导体纤维在生物监测领域的应用边界。","dp":1,"ot":"Confinement‐Regulated Crystal Phase Engineering Enables Structured Semiconductor Fiber Systems for Plant Transpiration Dynamics Monitoring","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Transpiration is fundamental to plant life, yet its rhythms remain difficult to resolve because conventional sensing approaches perturb stomatal boundary layers, are limited to localized readouts, and struggle to reconcile moisture responsiveness with stable photodetection under dynamic humidity fluctuations. Herein, we report the first distributed plant microclimate mapping textile platform constructed from semiconductor fibers enabled by two distinct confinement‐regulated crystal phase engineering strategies. Local spatially confined thermal reconfiguration induces optimized crystallization of the semiconductor fiber core, whereas nanosphere confinement governs humidity‐triggered, reversible phase switching in the perovskite fiber cladding between CsPbBr\n                    3\n                    and CsPb\n                    2\n                    Br\n                    5\n                    , enabling stable photodetection together with reversible humidity response. Continuous thermal drawing and polymer coating establish a scalable route to kilometre‐scale fiber fabrication, yielding fibers with sophisticated structure that sustain linear photodetection with an on/off ratio exceeding 50 over 10 000 switching cycles while maintaining fatigue‐free humidity sensing over 600 cycles. Woven into breathable textiles, the fiber arrays enable sub‐centimetre spatial mapping and, in commercial greenhouses, resolve spatial irradiance variations as small as 10 mW/cm\n                    2\n                    within real microclimates, revealing microclimate heterogeneity relevant to plant transpiration and growth. These results establish phase‐engineered semiconductor fiber textiles as a scalable platform for distributed plant microclimate mapping and precision agriculture."},{"t":"CargoNetSim：用于多式联运货运中成本-能源-排放优化的混合多智能体与系统动力学框架","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008408?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多式联运货运","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"CargoNetSim: A hybrid agent-based and system dynamics framework for cost–energy–emissions optimization in multimodal freight transport"},{"t":"作为“瓶中船”纳米反应器的笼型多孔有机盐：用于透光且可重复使用的分子光催化剂","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6654151?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多孔有机盐光催化","kp":["[笼型多孔有机盐]:瓶中船纳米反应器固定光催化剂"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了笼型多孔有机盐作为'瓶中船'纳米反应器，将分子光催化剂封装于多孔骨架内，实现光催化剂的非均相化固定。该方法保留了催化剂完整的预设计结构，无需重新设计分子即可实现反复使用。笼型结构兼具高透光性与可回收性，解决了均相光催化难以分离回收的痛点，为绿色光催化合成和太阳能驱动化学反应提供了可重复使用的实用平台。","dp":1,"ot":"Cage‐Type Porous Organic Salts as Ship‐in‐a‐Bottle Nanoreactors for Light‐Transparent and Reusable Molecular Photocatalysts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Heterogenizing molecular photocatalysts while preserving their intact, pre‐designed structures—without redesigning the host—remains a fundamental challenge. Immobilization within porous materials offers control over reaction environments and improved recyclability; however, most host systems require catalyst‐specific structural redesign, limiting generality. We introduce a cage‐type porous organic salt (POS) as a modular host platform for homogeneous, molecularly defined photocatalysts (organic molecules and metal coordination complexes) based on a ship‐in‐a‐bottle strategy. A sodalite‐type POS constructed from adamantane‐based sulfonic acid and tri(ethynylphenyl)methylamine provides well‐defined, light‐transparent, cage‐like internal cavities. Single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction reveals that the POS accommodates diverse photocatalysts, including anthraquinone, phenanthrenequinone, and phthalocyanine, through a unified recrystallization protocol. The framework exhibits negligible absorption in the visible region, enabling selective excitation of photocatalysts without competitive light absorption. Post‐synthetic thiol–yne crosslinking of ethynyl groups on the pore surface reinforces the framework and renders it insoluble while preserving cage‐like cavities. For example, a phenanthrenequinone‐encapsulated POS functions as a reusable heterogeneous photocatalyst for visible‐light‐driven hydrogen peroxide production from isopropanol and oxygen, achieving rates of up to 4.2 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    without catalyst leaching. Overall, cage‐type POSs serve as light‐transparent nanoreactors for intact molecular photocatalysts, providing a modular, expandable platform for photocatalyst immobilization and post‐synthetic functionalization."},{"t":"在低电位醛氧化中促进化学和电化学串联步骤以实现太阳能驱动的双极制氢","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6195416?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能制氢","kp":["催化剂[低电位醛氧化]: PtCu3@Cu纳米线阵列/Cu泡沫","[制备方法]: 电位置换+电化学还原"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出低电位醛氧化反应替代传统析氧反应，作为双极制氢的阳极替代路径，实现太阳能驱动的高效双极产氢。通过串联化学与电化学催化步骤，在低电位下同时驱动阳极醛氧化与阴极析氢，显著降低理论分解电压。该策略将有机废弃物增值转化与清洁氢能生产耦合，提升了太阳能制氢系统的整体能量效率，为光驱动双极制氢提供了节能新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Boosting Both Chemical and Electrochemical Tandem Steps in Low‐Potential Aldehyde Oxidation for Solar‐Driven Bipolar Hydrogen Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Low‐potential aldehyde oxidation offers an energy‐efficient anodic alternative to oxygen evolution for bipolar hydrogen production coupled with biomass valorization, yet the tandem non‐Faradaic/Faradaic mechanism remains poorly understood. Here, we report PtCu\n                    3\n                    ‐coated Cu nanowire arrays supported on Cu foam (PtCu\n                    3\n                    @Cu/CF) fabricated via galvanic replacement and electrochemical reduction. In situ ATR‐FTIR and DFT calculations indicate the PtCu\n                    3\n                    shell enhances adsorption of the\n                    gem\n                    ‐diolate intermediate while weakens binding of 5‐hydroxymethyl‐2‐furancarboxylic acid (HMFCA), accelerating both non‐Faradaic C–H cleavage and Faradaic oxidation. This enables selective 5‐hydroxymethylfurfural upgrading with anodic hydrogen evolution at 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at ∼0.21 V in a two‐electrode flow electrolyzer. Additionally, the electrolyzer also achieves 100 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0.16 V with 200% combined Faradaic efficiency for bipolar hydrogen production. Integration of a six‐cell stack with perovskite photovoltaic module yields a bias‐free solar‐to‐hydrogen efficiency of 16.9% alongside gram‐scale HMFCA production. This noble‐metal‐lean platform establishes scalable solar reforming for co‐generating green hydrogen and value‐added chemicals.","aip":1},{"t":"基于聚电解质构象的仿生纳米流体忆阻器：用于突触学习和存内逻辑计算","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73598?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米流体忆阻器","kp":["器件类型[忆阻器]: 聚电解质构象纳流体忆阻器","工作机制[类突触]: 电场驱动聚电解质构象变化","平台[神经形态计算]: 单一水相离子平台"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究基于聚电解质构象变化开发生物启感纳米流体忆阻器，模拟突触学习与内存逻辑计算功能。该器件利用聚电解质在纳米通道中的构象转变实现离子输运的动态调控，具有类似生物突触的可塑性特征。该纳米流体忆阻器可在同一器件中实现信息存储与处理，支持内存逻辑运算，为类脑神经形态计算和低功耗存内计算硬件提供了新的器件架构与机制。","dp":1,"ot":"Bioinspired Nanofluidic Memristors Based on Polyelectrolyte Conformation for Synaptic Learning and in‐Memory Logic Computing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Bioinspired neuromorphic and in‐memory computing requires devices that store and process information through ionic dynamics analogous to biological synapses. Here, we report a polyelectrolyte conformational nanofluidic memristor (PCM) that integrates synaptic plasticity, neuromorphic learning, and stateful ionic logic within a single aqueous platform. The device operates through electric‐field‐driven, reversible conformational transitions of polyelectrolytes confined inside graphene oxide nanochannels, enabling analog conductance tuning, a sharp, tunable switching threshold, and an ON/OFF ratio exceeding 160. These conformational dynamics endow the PCM with rich synaptic functions, including long‐term potentiation and depression, multilevel memory retention, and symmetric weight update rules. By directly mapping the experimentally measured potentiation/depression curves into a physical learning model, we demonstrate high‐accuracy neuromorphic learning, achieving 97.1% recognition accuracy on the Modified National Institute of Standards and Technology (MNIST) handwritten‐digit dataset. Beyond learning, interconnected PCM units perform stateful ionic OR, IMP, and NAND operations, establishing universal in‐memory logic within the same ionic platform. This work introduces a bioinspired nanofluidic computing paradigm that unites the adaptive learning of neural networks and deterministic logic, paving the way to scalable and brain‐like ionic processors."},{"t":"双侧锚定策略实现用于自供电光电催化抗菌系统的高效宽带隙钙钛矿太阳能电池/组件 (Adv. Energy Mater. 22/2026)","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71001?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宽带隙钙钛矿电池","kp":["锚定策略[宽禁带钙钛矿]: 双侧锚定","应用[光电催化抗菌]: 自供电光电器件"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Bilateral Anchoring Strategy Enables Highly Efficient Wide‐Bandgap Perovskite Solar Cells/Modules for Self‐Powered Photo‐Electrocatalytic Antibacterial System (Adv. Energy Mater. 22/2026)"},{"t":"通过稳定Cu+和强化氢键网络平衡二聚与加氢动力学以实现电催化乙炔加氢二聚","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4304657?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙炔电化学二聚","kp":["催化剂[乙炔电化学二聚]: 稳定Cu+铜基材料","[调控策略]: 稳定Cu+并增强氢键网络平衡动力学"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过稳定Cu⁺物种并强化氢键网络，实现了二聚化与加氢反应动力学的平衡，从而高效电催化乙炔加氢二聚反应(EHDA)。EHDA可作为传统高耗能工艺的替代路线，具有显著的节能潜力。调控Cu⁺活性位点和氢键微环境是提升选择性和催化效率的关键策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Balancing Dimerization and Hydrogenation Kinetics by Stabilizing Cu+ and Tightening H‐Bond Network for Electrocatalytic Acetylene Hydrodimerization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The electrocatalytic hydrodimerization of acetylene (EHDA) offers a promising alternative to energy‐intensive naphtha steam cracking for producing 1,3‐butadiene but faces a formidable challenge due to kinetic imbalance between C–C coupling and hydrogenation. Herein, we balance the dimerization and hydrogenation kinetics of EHDA by stabilizing Cu\n                    +\n                    and tightening the hydrogen‐bond network over citrate anion grafted Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalysts (E‐CA/Cu\n                    2\n                    O). The X‐ray absorption fine structure, Cu LMM Auger spectrum, and theoretical simulations corroborate citrate anion modification induces electron transfer from Cu\n                    2\n                    O to citrate ions. This stabilizes the active Cu\n                    +\n                    sites under electrochemical reduction conditions and further lowers the C‐C coupling barrier of *C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and *C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    3\n                    to *C\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    . The in situ attenuated total reflection surface‐enhanced infrared spectroscopy confirms that the citrate anion also reconstructs the hydrogen‐bonding network and reduces the content of isolated water at the electrode‐electrolyte interface. The appropriate supply of active *H species effectively promotes the hydrogenation of *C\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    to form 1,3‐butadiene rather than competitive acetylene semihydrogenation. As a result, E‐CA/Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalyst achieves a Faradaic efficiency of 88.0% and a 1,3‐butadiene partial current density of 55 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , which is about 3‐fold higher than E‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O. This work will guide the rational design of high‐performance catalysts for regulating the kinetics of electrocatalytic acetylene hydrodimerization."},{"t":"B细胞αv整合素调节病毒感染后肺生发中心和记忆B细胞的组织特化和克隆扩张","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb7633?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Lung-resident B cells are increasingly recognized as key contributors to protective immunity against respiratory viruses, yet the mechanisms that govern their generation and specialization remain poorly understood. Here, we identify B cell–intrinsic αv integrin as a critical negative regulator of germinal center (GC) dynamics and memory B cell formation in the lung following influenza A virus infection. Using B cell–specific αv knockout mice, we show that loss of B cell αv integrin leads to persistent GC activity within the inducible bronchus-associated lymphoid tissue and expansion of lung-resident memory B cells, including IgA\n                    +\n                    and cross-reactive B cells capable of recognizing heterologous influenza variants. Single-cell transcriptomic and B cell receptor sequence analyses reveal that αv restricts clonal expansion and antigenic diversification of GC and memory B cells in the lung, but not in draining lymph nodes, indicating a spatially restricted mechanism of mucosal B cell regulation. These findings position αv integrin as a key checkpoint that constrains local mucosal B cell evolution and suggest previously unexplored strategies to improve mucosal vaccine efficacy by enhancing GC activity directly in the lung."},{"t":"通过乙烯基C─O键的Z选择性官能化实现苯并呋喃衍生物的阻转选择性去芳构化交叉偶联","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2984592?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"不对称交叉偶联","kp":["催化剂[苯并呋喃交叉偶联]: 手性镍","[选择性]: Z选择性断裂乙烯基C-O键"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了苯并呋喃衍生物的催化不对称转化新方法，通过对乙烯基C─O键的Z-选择性官能化实现阻转选择性去芳香化交叉偶联反应。该方法利用手性催化剂精确控制轴手性的构建，可高效合成具有轴手性的苯并呾类化合物，在药物分子和功能材料合成中具有重要应用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Atroposelective Dearomative Cross‐Coupling of Benzofuran Derivatives by Z‐Selective Functionalization of the Vinyl C─O Bond","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Catalytic asymmetric transformation of benzofuran derivatives has received significant attention owing to its capacity to prepare chiral molecules from readily available feedstocks. Herein, an unprecedented asymmetric cross‐coupling of benzofuran derivatives is reported for the construction of axial chirality. Employing a chiral nickel catalyst, this approach is achieved through direct enantio‐ and Z‐selective dearomative functionalization of the vinyl C─O bond, providing efficient access to valuable atropisomeric acyclic alkenes. A broad substrate scope is demonstrated under mild conditions. Moreover, experimental and theoretical mechanistic studies suggest that the stereochemical outcome is facilitated by a dynamic epimerization between diastereomeric six‐membered (\n                    Z\n                    )‐styryl‐nickelacycle intermediates."},{"t":"MOF纳米结构的原子配位工程：在工业级电流密度下实现CO2电还原制高价值多碳产物","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2590405?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF电催化CO2还原","kp":["[产物]: CO2电还原产C2+多碳产物","电流密度[MOF电催化CO2RR]: 工业级"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过原子级配位工程调控金属有机框架(MOF)纳米结构，实现了CO₂电还原为高附加值多碳产物，并在工业级电流密度下运行。通过精确设计MOF中金属中心的配位环境，优化了催化活性与产物选择性，推动CO₂电还原技术向实际工业应用迈进，为碳资源的高值化利用提供了有效路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Atomic Coordination Engineering of MOF Nanostructures for CO2 Electroreduction to High‐Value Multi‐Carbon Products at Industrial‐Level Current Density","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) have shown great promise for electrochemical carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) reduction into value‐added chemicals/fuels, thereby supporting the balance of carbon‐neutral energy cycle. The multi‐carbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) production on MOF electrocatalysts is of great significance but remains challenging due to inefficient C–C coupling. Here, we report the atomic coordination regulation of MOF nanostructures (Cu‐Trz‐Br) for efficient CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction by rationally designing dual‐site Cu catalysts. The crystallographic structure of Cu‐Trz‐Br is determined by three‐dimensional electron diffraction and Rietveld refinement against high‐resolution powder X‐ray diffraction data, which feature unique mixed coordination modes of Cu–N\n                    4\n                    Br\n                    2\n                    and Cu–N\n                    4\n                    sites. In CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction, Cu‐Trz‐Br demonstrates much enhanced selectivity toward C\n                    2+\n                    products compared to common counterparts with only Cu–N\n                    4\n                    sites, enabling efficient C\n                    2+\n                    production under industrial‐level current density. In situ studies and theoretical calculations reveal that the coordination regulation of Cu–N\n                    4\n                    Br\n                    2\n                    sites promotes CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and activation, as well as effectively enhances local *CO availability near Cu‐Trz‐Br, thereby facilitating C–C coupling toward C\n                    2+\n                    products."},{"t":"仿章鱼凝胶电解质通过构建差异化溶剂化环境调控锂硫电池中的阳离子迁移","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71197?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池电解质","kp":["电解质策略[锂硫电池]: 章鱼仿生凝胶电解质","调控机制[阳离子迁移]: 构建差异化溶剂化环境","关键问题[Li-S电池]: 多硫化锂穿梭"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"受章鱼触手离子通道启发，研究者设计了一种新型凝胶电解质，通过构建差异化溶剂化环境调控锂离子迁移，抑制锂硫电池中多硫化锂(LiPSs)穿梭效应。该策略优化了阳离子输运路径与界面稳定性，显著提升锂硫电池的循环寿命与库伦效率，为高比能锂电池体系工程化提供了仿生学新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"An Octopus‐Inspired Gel Electrolyte Regulates Cation Migration in Lithium–Sulfur Batteries via Constructing Differentiated Solvation Environments","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Lithium polysulfides (LiPSs) shuttling is a major cause of performance degradation in lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries. Recent studies indicate that LiPSs readily bind with free Li\n                    +\n                    to form cationic species that migrate together with Li\n                    +\n                    . Conventional strategies that ignore solvation environment regulation for selective cation separation often hinder Li\n                    +\n                    dissociation and transport. In this study, guided by quantum calculations and inspired by octopus morphology, acetylated polysorbate (Ac‐CP80) was synthesized via photoinitiated radical polymerization using reactive amphiphilic monomers. Structural characterization confirmed that the material forms a multi‐armed, biomimetic structure with multiple adsorption sites, enabling in‐situ formation of a gel electrolyte (Ac‐CP80@PP). Through an integrated approach combining in situ and 2D Raman spectroscopy, X‐ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS), charge‐discharge cycling, post‐electrode analysis, concentration‐dependent Li\n                    2\n                    S\n                    6\n                    simulation experiments, and molecular dynamics simulations, it is systematically revealed that Ac‐CP80 creates a differentiated solvation environment: hyperbranched PEO side chains like tentacles capture LiPSs and guide them into the weakly solvating cross‐linked network, suppressing LiPSs shuttling; terminal esters enhance local solvation to promote Li\n                    +\n                    dissociation and transport. With Ac‐CP80@PP, Li–S batteries achieve capacity of 781.6 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 0.5 C and retain stability over 600 cycles with only 0.06% decay per cycle, exhibiting excellent cycling stability."},{"t":"碱浸出：一种提高固体氧化物燃料电池空气电极反应性的简便表面活化策略 (Adv. Mater. 33/2026)","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73511?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固体氧化物燃料电池","kp":["活化策略[SOFC空气电极]: 碱浸蚀表面活化"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出碱浸渍这一简便的表面活化策略，用于提升固体氧化物燃料电池(SOFC)空气电极的反应活性。通过碱性溶液处理在电极表面构建更多活性位点，改善氧还原/氧析出反应动力学，从而提高SOFC在中高温条件下的输出功率与长期稳定性。该方法工艺简单、成本低廉，具备规模化应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Alkaline Leaching: A Facile Surface Activation Strategy to Improve the Reactivity of Air Electrodes for Solid Oxide Fuel Cells (Adv. Mater. 33/2026)","b":"Surface Activation Strategy for Perovskite Oxide Air Electrodes The cover illustration highlights a surface activation s..."},{"t":"聚合物电解质膜燃料电池建模的新方法及其在氢燃料电动汽车中的整车级验证","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008421?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池建模","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A novel approach to modeling of polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cells with vehicle-level validation in a hydrogen electric vehicle"},{"t":"用于现代电气化电网中非凸能源系统优化的混合神经模糊深度强化学习框架","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008251?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源系统优化","kp":["[神经模糊深度强化学习]: 非凸能源系统优化"],"sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A hybrid neuro-fuzzy deep reinforcement learning framework for non-convex energy system optimization in modern electrified grids"},{"t":"用于锂离子电池中同时进行容量补偿和界面调控的多功能电解液添加剂K3P7","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73676?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池电解液添加剂","kp":["添加剂[锂离子电池]: K₃P₇","功能[电解液添加剂]: 同时补偿容量与调控界面","比容量[预锂化添加剂]: 常规300-1000 mAh/g(对比基准)"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.5},"as":"研究者开发了多功能电解质添加剂K3P7，可同时实现锂离子电池的容量补偿与界面调控。该添加剂在首次充电时弥补不可逆容量损失(ICL)，并通过原位构建稳定的固体电解质界面膜(SEI)抑制后续循环中的副反应，有效提升电池的能量效率与循环稳定性，为高能量密度锂电池设计提供新方案。","dp":1,"ot":"A Multifunctional Electrolyte Additive K3P7 for Simultaneous Capacity Compensation and Interphase Regulation in Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The initial irreversible capacity loss (ICL) during the first charge significantly reduces the energy and power densities of lithium‑ion batteries (LIBs). Conventional prelithiation additives suffer from limited theoretical specific capacities (300–1000 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    ), poor air stability, and low conversion efficiency. Herein, K\n                    3\n                    P\n                    7\n                    , which possesses high solubility in ester‐based electrolytes, is introduced as an electrolyte additive to improve the reversible capacities of various commercial LIBs. It provides an exceptional capacity‑compensation effect through the oxidation of P\n                    7\n                    3−\n                    , equivalent to 3048 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    . Additionally, K\n                    +\n                    ions intercalate into the graphite interlayer, expanding the interlayer spacing and thereby improving the high‑rate performance of the graphite anode. The additive also promotes the formation of a stable cathode electrolyte interphase (CEI) and a uniform solid electrolyte interface (SEI), contributing to improved cycle stability of both electrodes. Furthermore, K\n                    3\n                    P\n                    7\n                    effectively scavenges free radicals, alleviating gas generation and internal pressure build‑up. When applied in a LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ||graphite full cell, the initial reversible capacity is 8% higher than that of the control sample, and the cell retains 92.9% of its capacity after 200 cycles. This work reveals a facile multi‐functional electrolyte additive that enhances the overall performance of LIBs."},{"t":"通过亚磺酰胺的对映选择性自由基氟烷基化构建S-立体异构α-氟烷基S(IV/VI)化合物的通用平台","d":"2026-06-13","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3129452?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性氟烷基硫化","kp":["催化剂[不对称氟烷基化]: 铜催化对映选择性自由基","产物类型[含硫手性]: S-立体异构α-氟烷基S(IV/VI)化合物","底物[氟烷基化]: 硫代亚胺"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"as":"该研究开发了一种通用的不对称合成平台，通过磺酰胺类底物的对映选择性自由基氟烷基化反应，构建含S-手性的α-氟烷基硫(IV/VI)化合物。该方法利用自由基化学实现高对映选择性控制，为含氟高价硫结构（广泛存在于药物和农化品分子中）的高效合成提供了新策略，具有显著的合成化学突破意义。","dp":1,"ot":"A General Platform for S‐Stereogenic α‐Fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) Compounds via Enantioselective Radical Fluoroalkylation of Sulfenamides","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    α‐Fluoroalkyl‐substituted high‐valent sulfur motifs are important structural elements in fluorinated molecule design and exhibit broad application potential in diverse fields. However, access to\n                    S\n                    ‐stereogenic α‐fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) compounds still relies largely on classical resolution, resulting in limited efficiency and selectivity. We herein report a copper‐catalyzed asymmetric radical C–S cross‐coupling that effectively tames highly reactive α‐fluoroalkyl radicals, enabled by a sequential stereodiscrimination–chirality transfer strategy, providing rapid access to\n                    S\n                    ‐chiral α‐fluoroalkyl sulfilimines. Integrated with downstream transformations, this reaction serves as a general and systematic platform for\n                    S\n                    ‐chiral α‐fluoroalkyl S(IV/VI) compounds. The synthetic utility of the method is demonstrated by gram‐scale synthesis and concise access to diverse chiral fluoroalkyl reagents and bioisosteres of sulfur‐containing drugs."},{"t":"一种与冷冻保护剂兼容的纳米多孔平台，可稳定且可扩展地输送生物药品（Adv. Mater. 33/2026）","d":"2026-06-13","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73512?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"生物药递送","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":""},{"t":"骨折价中标后，光伏项目被中国烟草叫停","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/11/50024243.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"中国烟草总公司下属湖南中烟工业有限责任公司于6月10日发布公告，中止永安科技园光伏发电合作项目，原因是中选候选人安徽幂能科技有限公司存在影响采购公正的违法违规行为。该项目此前以异常低价中标引发关注，最终因中标方违规导致采购活动中止并重新开展。此事件折射出光伏EPC招投标市场低价恶性竞争与合规风险并存的现状，国企采购对违规行为的零容忍态度，也为分布式光伏项目招投标规范敲响警钟。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏项目中止","kp":["装机规模[永安光伏项目]: 1.81713MW","折扣率[中标价]: 0.54"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":8.0},"b":"6月10日，中国烟草总公司下属湖南中烟工业有限责任公司发布公告，宣布中止永安科技园光伏发电合作项目。\n中止原因：经查实，中选候选人安徽幂能科技有限公司出现影响采购公正的违法、违规行为，本项日采购活动中止，采购人将重新开展采购活动。此前，该公司以0.54的折扣率于4月30日中标该项目。\n据了解，该项目装机规模1.81713MW，于2026年3月17日发布询比公告，对供应商资质、业绩均有明确要求：\n1、报价人是指接受采购人邀请，自愿按本采购文件要求参加询比活动的供应商。\n2、报价人主体要求:营业证照有效，且其经营范围必须明确包含新能源电力相关业务，例如:太阳能(光伏)发电。\n3、业绩要求:提供至报价前三十六个月太阳能(光伏)发电、储能的相关投资业绩一个实例， 已备案成功或已竣工投产的同类项目累计装机总容量不低于18兆瓦(MW)，提供相关业绩的备案证明文件。复印件加盖公章有效。\n5、报价人提供其基本账户开户许可证或企业基本存款账户编号。报价人不以基本账户为一般业务结算账户的，还须提供一个合法账户开户银行名称、账户名称及账号。该账户和账号为招标人与中标人签订合同时约定的采购人向中标人支付合同款项的唯一账号(所提供的账户必须与报价人名称一致)。\n6、报价人提供《报价人守法诚信承诺书》\n7、报价人如存在下列情形之一的，采购人视其为弄虚作假并取消其谈判资格。\n(1)在报价文件中没有按照采购文件的要求和规定，如实反映和提供有关情况、文件、证明等资料，且对其有利的。\n(2)隐瞒事实或者弄虚作假，且对其有利的。\n(3)所提供的情况、文件、证明等资料与经查实的事实不符，且对其有利的。"},{"t":"遭社区强烈反对后，Anthropic 调整 Claude Fable 5 面向研究员的“降智”措施","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/208.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"IT之家","as":"Anthropic 被曝在用户不知情的情况下，对竞争对手使用其最新模型 Claude Fable 5 进行 AI 研发时施加\"降智\"限制，即悄悄降低模型推理能力输出。此举引发 AI 研究社区强烈反对，被认为破坏了科研公平性与模型透明度原则。迫于舆论压力，Anthropic 随后调整了该措施。此事件凸显了头部 AI 厂商在商业化竞争与开放科研之间的深层矛盾：模型权限的分层管控正从\"用户可见\"转向\"隐蔽操作\"，引发行业对模型中立性、研究可复现性及反竞争行为的担忧，可能加速监管机构对 AI 模型访问透明度的介入。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"大模型安全策略","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.5,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"b":"6 月 11 日消息，此前，Anthropic 被曝会在用户不知情的情况下，\n限制竞争对手使用新模型 Claude Fable 5 开发其他 AI 模型\n。AI 研究社区强烈反对后，Anthropic 决定做出点改变。\nAnthropic 在给《连线》的声明中致歉称：“我们正在调整 Fable 5 面向前沿模型开发的安全防护措施，让这些措施对用户可见。\n我们作出了错误权衡，也为没有拿捏好平衡而道歉\nAnthropic 本周早些时候发布 Claude Fable 5。作为最新模型，Claude Fable 5 加入了额外护栏，用于防止滥用。用户如果询问\n网络安全、生物学或化学问题\n，以降低先进 AI 被用于网络攻击或生物武器制造的风险。\n但面对使用 Claude Fable 5 从事前沿 AI 开发的研究人员，Anthropic 原本准备采用另一套更隐蔽的做法：在用户不知情的情况下，\n。换言之，研究人员如果试图用 Claude 训练竞争性 AI 模型，Claude Fable 5 可能会\n据IT之家了解，Anthropic 的服务条款明确禁止使用 Claude 训练竞争性 AI 模型。\n官方最新给出的措施是，Claude Fable 5 面向 AI 开发的安全防护措施会\n。如果 Anthropic 怀疑用户试图使用 Claude 构建高能力 AI，\nAnthropic 会明确提醒用户系统将拒绝请求\n，或将用户转到能力较弱的模型。\nAnthropic 是在 AI 研究社区强烈反对后撤回该政策的。据IT之家了解，此前，其已限制竞争对手\n使用 Claude 构建闭源和开源 AI 模型\n，但批评者认为，面向特定用户悄悄降低模型性能\n当前，Claude 智能体已经成为许多开发者喜爱的工具，开源 AI 研究项目也在使用 Claude。多名研究人员告诉《连线》，如果 Anthropic 最新政策落地，先进 AI 研究未来\n可能被少数头部 AI 实验室垄断"},{"t":"通过审查，即将正式施行！","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/11/50024240.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"由黄河公司参与编制的《海南藏族自治州促进清洁能源产业发展条例》经青海省第十四届人大常委会第二十二次会议审查批准，将于2026年9月1日正式施行。该条例为海南州及青海省清洁能源产业高质量发展提供法治保障，涵盖清洁能源开发、产业扶持、资源统筹等方面。海南州地处青海高原，风光水资源丰富，是国家级清洁能源基地核心区域，已建成多个千万千瓦级新能源基地。该条例的施行将进一步规范地方清洁能源产业链布局，为西部能源转型提供可复制的地方法治样板。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"清洁能源产业条例","kp":["施行日期[清洁能源条例]: 2026年9月1日","立法重点[海南州]: 沙戈荒大基地+光伏治沙优先落地"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"b":"近日，由黄河公司参与编制的《海南藏族自治州促进清洁能源产业发展条例》正式通过青海省第十四届人大常委会第二十二次会议审查批准（以下简称《条例》），将于2026年9月1日起正式施行，为推动海南州乃至青海省清洁能源产业高质量发展提供了重要的法治保障。\n“《条例》以立法形式明确了沙戈荒大基地、光伏治沙生态修复项目优先落地的相关支持条款。依托即将颁布实施的《条例》，我们在推进青海海南清洁能源外送基地项目中将始终坚持生态保护与新能源产业融合发展，统筹风光储一体化开发与光伏治沙修复，高标准推进项目前期及外送通道布局。深化青粤能源协同联动，深挖高原绿电资源价值，以高原绿色能源双向赋能生态治理与区域发展，全力服务国家‘双碳’战略与国家清洁能源产业高地建设。”黄河公司青粤（青海）能源公司总经理朱文杰说。\n《条例》编制期间，黄河公司牵头梳理海南州清洁能源发展的痛点与难点问题，全面对接海南州人大、发展改革委、林草等主管部门，将生态优先原则、沙戈荒大基地规划布局、绿电外送、光伏治沙等产业实践成果与政策导向深度融入法条设计。同时积极建言献策，推动生态友好型清洁能源项目、沙戈荒风光大基地、光伏治沙生态修复等重点内容纳入法规条文，将地方产业成熟实践转化为法定制度，为《条例》顺利出台提供了重要支撑。\n“《条例》的获批补齐了地方清洁能源项目用地与审批的制度短板，在严守生态底线的前提下厘清了用地合规边界，从制度层面扫清了项目落地障碍，为依法依规推进项目建设提供了坚实制度保障。特别是针对项目合规用地，《条例》坚持生态优先原则，破除现有政策制约，为在生态恢复成效欠佳地块布局光伏项目提供了法定依据。”青粤（青海）能源公司征地主管张学鹏说。\n据了解，《条例》破解多重错配难题：增设条款推进水电、光热、地热等调节电源建设，优化电源结构；从严规范配套电网与外送通道建设，理顺网源时空布局；依托跨省送电、绿电交易拓宽消纳渠道，培育绿氢等载能产业、拓展交通建筑等绿电使用场景；扶持市场主体建设抽蓄、电化学、氢储能等多元储能，补齐储能周期短板。\n与此同时，《条例》细化了配套电网、电力外送通道建设的相关要求，规范了绿电直供、综合能源项目审批备案流程，扶持各类储能项目多元化开发，构建“源网荷储”一体化协同发展框架，妥善化解网源布局错配、电力消纳受限等制约因素，为青海海南清洁能源外送基地前期规划、后续规模化落地提供了刚性法规保障。"},{"t":"苹果研发低温铝回收工艺：125℃ 即可从废旧合金中提取高纯度铝，提升 iPhone 和 MacBook 环保价值","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/226.htm","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"IT之家","tg":"技术突破","tp":"低温铝回收工艺","kp":["工作温度[铝电化学回收]: 125℃","电解质[铝精炼]: AlCl3基熔融盐","[工艺]: 电化学精炼Electrorefining"],"as":"苹果公司近期公布的专利申请文件显示，其研发出一种全新电化学铝回收工艺，可在低至 125℃ 的条件下从废弃铝合金（包括 CNC 加工产生的金属碎屑）中提取高纯度铝。相比传统铝回收工艺所需的高温熔炼（通常超过 700℃），该工艺大幅降低了能耗与碳排放，且回收纯度显著提升。该技术可直接应用于 iPhone、MacBook 等产品的铝合金外壳制造闭环，提升苹果产品回收材料占比，符合其 2030 年碳中和目标。低温电化学路线若实现规模化，有望重塑消费电子金属回收产业链的成本结构。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"b":"6 月 11 日消息，Patently Apple 发现，苹果公司近期公布了一份专利申请文件，显示苹果发明了一种全新的电化学工艺，能够在低至 125℃ 的温度条件下，从废弃铝合金中回收高纯度铝，其中包括 CNC 加工产生的金属碎屑。\n根据专利文件内容，该技术采用基于氯化铝（AlCl\n）的熔融电解质盐与电化学精炼（Electrorefining）相结合的方法，从废旧铝合金中分离并提纯铝元素。\n与传统铝提纯工艺相比，这一新方案的环境温度大幅降低，可在低于 200℃、150℃ 甚至 125℃ 的条件下完成工作，部分实施方案的温度还可进一步降低。\n苹果指出，现有铝回收工艺通常面临能耗高、设备投资大等问题。例如传统 Hoopes 工艺虽然能够获得高纯度铝，但整体成本较高，而分级凝固等方法则难以有效去除铝合金中常见的锰、铬等元素。因此，不同来源的铝合金废料往往只能被重新加工成价值较低的通用合金。\n在苹果提出的方案中，其核心方法是将废铝合金作为阳极、纯铝作为阴极，一同置入含有氯化铝基熔融电解质盐的电化学槽中。接通电流后，废料中的铝被氧化为铝离子进入熔盐，随后在阴极还原沉积为纯铝，而铜、铁、硅、锰、铬等杂质则更多保留在阳极侧。\n专利显示，该方案不再依赖传统熔融铝层的密度差进行分离，因此废旧铝原料可以采用多种形式，包括铝箔、铝板、铝锭以及压缩后的 CNC 加工铝屑等。苹果还提到，不同来源的废料既可以先熔炼成均匀材料后处理，也可以通过压制、固态连接等方式组合，而无需重新熔化。\nIT之家注意到，该方案具备较高的运行灵活性。苹果表示，电解过程并不需要持续运行至结束，可以根据能源供应情况暂停或重新启动。当停止施加电压后反应即可暂停，恢复供电后则继续运行。这意味着工厂能够根据电价波动或可再生能源供应情况调整生产节奏。\n在电解质设计方面，苹果采用氯化铝作为基础材料，并可加入氯化钠、氯化钾或氯化镁等添加剂，以进一步降低熔盐混合物的熔点，同时减少电极表面枝晶结构的形成。\n专利文件还描述了适用于工业化扩展的设计方案。系统可采用多个废旧铝阳极与多个纯铝阴极交替排列的结构，以提高处理能力。随着阳极材料逐渐消耗和阴极纯铝不断沉积，相关电极能够在维持系统密封状态下进行更换。\n由于氯化铝具有较高蒸气压，苹果还提出将整个电解系统封闭运行，以减少电解质蒸发损失。部分实施方案甚至可在低于标准大气压的环境下工作。\n与传统高能耗的分步结晶法不同，苹果的这项工艺能够更有效地去除铝合金中常见的铜、锌、镁、硅、铁、钛、铬、锂、锆、锰等元素，而这些元素正是阻碍废铝在高端电子产品中循环利用的主要障碍。苹果指出，不同的铝合金为满足强度、耐腐蚀和外观等要求而添加了各异元素，一旦在制造或报废环节中混杂，就难以经济地分离回高价值合金品类，往往只能降级用于低端压铸件市场。\n对苹果而言，这项技术的意义不止于降低能耗。其自身的制造生态中会产生大量高品质的机加工碎屑，若能将这类废料提纯为符合严格标准的再生铝，而不是卖给低端市场，其闭环材料回收的效率将得到显著提升。\n近年来，苹果在产品中持续大力推广再生铝的应用，但高端设备对铝合金的成分、机械性能、耐腐蚀性和外观一致性有着严苛要求，混合废料的纯度始终是瓶颈。这份专利指向的，正是一种在不依赖高成本一次铝的前提下，扩大高端再生铝供给的可行路径。\n苹果认为，如果能够以更低能耗实现废旧铝合金的高纯度提纯，将有助于扩大高品质再生铝的来源，提高制造废料和产品生命周期结束后材料的再利用价值，并减少对原生铝材的依赖。\n外钛内铝：三星被曝正研发新型“双相”框架以提升折叠屏手机耐用与散热性能，应对苹果液态金属创新\n古尔曼：未来苹果 Apple Watch、iPhone 有望采用 3D 打印铝制机身\n消息称苹果首款折叠 iPhone 手机搭钛金属 / 铝合金混合边框，下代 iPhone Air 继续采用钛金属边框\n苹果玩转材料魔法：iPhone 18 Fold 折叠手机中框曝光，钛铝 CP 组合出道"},{"t":"美国加州试水“智能高速公路”：用算法控流疏堵，成本远比扩建低","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/218.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"智能交通控流","kp":["覆盖里程[智能高速试点]: 12.9km","投资额[河滨县项目]: 3300万美元","[控制方式]: 算法实时调控匝道信号"],"as":"美国加利福尼亚州河滨县交通委员会于6月1日在15号州际公路北向车道正式启动\"智能高速公路\"试点项目，首期覆盖约8英里路段。该项目采用算法动态控流方式缓解拥堵，通过匝道 metering、可变限速、实时车流调度等软件手段替代传统的物理车道扩建，成本远低于新建公路。这是美国较少见的将算法交通管理规模化落地的案例，若效果验证成功，可为人口密集、土地成本高昂的地区提供低成本交通治理范式。核心思路是将高速公路从\"静态基础设施\"转向\"可编程流量系统\"，体现智慧交通从硬件建设向软件优化的转变趋势。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"b":"6 月 11 日消息，美国加利福尼亚州河滨县交通委员会本月正式启动了一项智能高速公路试点项目，试图用“软件方式”来缓解拥堵。\n该项目于 6 月 1 日在蒂梅丘拉市境内的 15 号州际公路北向车道启用，首期覆盖约 8 英里（IT之家注：约 12.9 公里）路段。\n与按固定周期运行的普通信号灯不同，该路段蒂梅丘拉公园大道、兰乔加州路和温彻斯特路三处入口匝道的信号灯现已交由一套算法控制。据介绍，这套系统会根据实时路况决定何时放行车辆进入高速，这意味着司机在匝道口等待并道的时间可能达到 4 分钟甚至更长。\n河滨县交通委员会发言人戴维 · 克努森对 SFGate 回应表示，虽然 4 分钟远比传统的几秒钟等待要久，但交通部门的官员相信这套系统能够改善车流、减少走走停停的状况，最终让人们花在路上的整体时间反而更短，比传统匝道信号灯更快到达目的地。\n据介绍，该项目总耗资 3300 万美元（现汇率约合 2.24 亿元人民币），将试运行两年，若效果理想，未来会推广至县内其他路段乃至加州其他交通拥堵节点。克努森直言：“这套系统比试图新建车道便宜得多，所以我们的思路就是让现有系统运行得更高效。”\n此次试点的路段以拥堵闻名。从位于河滨县与圣迭戈县交界处的蒂梅丘拉，到穆列塔的 215 号州际公路互通立交，在不堵车的情况下只需 10 分钟车程，但在下午的高峰时段，司机往往要花上 25 到 45 分钟才能通过。\n针对外界对用算法控制交通可能带来安全隐患的担忧，克努森强调，该系统并非由 AI 管理，而是通过铺设于道路中的先进传感器实时监测交通状况并做出调整。他解释说：“其目的是在高速公路系统中创造持续稳定的车流，三个入口匝道之间的协调信号灯控制将有助于实现这一点。”\n智能高速并非加州首创。类似技术早在 2020 年就已在澳大利亚投入使用，科罗拉多州也曾在丹佛的 25 号州际公路及该州其他高速公路上部署过。两地实测效果颇为可观：澳大利亚的行程时间下降了 35%~65%，丹佛的行程时间则减少了约 20%。"},{"t":"索尼 PS5《绝地潜兵 2》限定版 DualSense 手柄控制器发售，639 元","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/207.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 11 日消息，索尼 PS5 DualSense 手柄《绝地潜兵 2》限定版将于明天 0 点开启首销，\n这款手柄采用标志性的黄黑配色盔甲涂装设计，手柄中央印有超级地球军队徽章，外壳带有战场磨损痕迹，按键旁标注了游戏专属功能。\n规格方面，这款限定版手柄与标准版 DualSense 手柄一致，整体重量约 280 克，尺寸约 160x66x106mm，采用蓝牙 5.1 技术，内置 1560 毫安时电池。\n京东 618 无门槛红包\n面额至高 26618 元，每天抽 3 次：\n淘宝 618 无门槛红包\n面额至高 26888 元，每天抽 1 次："},{"t":"突发！某异质结企业被起诉","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/11/50024235.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"江苏宝馨科技股份有限公司发布公告，确认收到内蒙古鄂托克旗人民法院传票及民事起诉状。鄂托克旗诚园绿能投资有限责任公司起诉宝馨科技及其实控人马伟，案件已由法院正式受理。宝馨科技近年布局异质结（HJT）光伏电池及组件业务，此次诉讼涉及与其绿能投资合作相关的纠纷，具体案由及诉讼金额尚待进一步披露。该事件反映出光伏行业在产能扩张与项目合作过程中，合同履约与投资纠纷风险正在上升，对涉事企业经营和行业声誉可能产生一定影响。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"异质结企业诉讼","kp":["规划产能[异质结]: 2GW电池+2GW组件+2GW薄片化切割"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"b":"发布关于重大诉讼的公告，近日，江苏宝馨科技股份有限公司收到内蒙古鄂托克旗人民法院传票、民事起诉状等诉讼相关材料，内蒙古鄂托克旗人民法院受理了鄂托克旗诚园绿能投资有限责任公司诉公司及公司实控人马伟的纠纷案件（案号：（2026）内 0624 民初 2511 号）。\n原告：鄂托克旗诚园绿能投资有限责任公司\n被告一：江苏宝馨科技股份有限公司\n第三人：内蒙古宝馨绿能新能源科技有限公司\n诉讼请求：1、请求判令被告一向原告支付股权回购款9930. 943万元及以此为基数按年利率6%计算的利息自2026年2月6日起至实际支付之日止) ；2、请求判令被告二对诉讼请求1承担连带赔偿责任；3、请求判令各被告共同承担本案保全费、诉讼费。\n事实与理由：2022年鄂托克旗人民政府、鄂托克经济开发区、被告一签署《投资协议书》，约定各方共同出资设立项目公司，以建设2GW光伏异质结电池、2GW光伏异质结组件、2GW薄片化切片生产基地。同年12月15日，原告与被告一签署《新能源高端智能制造项目股权投资协议》（以下简称“股权投资协议”) ，协议第四条约定原告足额实缴注册资本之日起3年后，有权要求被告一（或被告一指定且原告认可的受让人）收购原告所持有项目公司的股权。收购价格为对应实缴出资金额加计年利率6%的利息。合同签订后，原告按约履行协议，向第三人实缴注册资本1. 3亿元。但被告一自2023年8月18日至12月25日期间，利用其对第三人绝对的控制未经召开股东会、董事会，在无真实交易情况下，故意隐瞒甚至欺骗原告，分多笔挪用第三人资金25429万元。原告发现后多次发函要求其说明资金流向，要求组建监事会就被告一滥用股东权利损害其他股东的行为予以救济, 被告一均未正面回复也未返还款项。2025年9月1日，鄂尔多斯中院作出一审判决，判决江苏宝馨科技股份有限公司抽逃出资, 要求其向第三人内蒙古宝馨绿能新能源科技有限公司返还出资13000万元并支付资金占用期间利息。因被告一抽逃挪用资金，第三人自设立至今未能正常经营，项目厂房及相应的生产设备长期处于闲置。2025年6月10日被告一和第三人向原告出具《工作联系函》，拟提前实施股权回购，回购价按照13000万元本金加原告自实缴之日起至实际支付本金之日年化6%的利息。2026年2月5日，内蒙古宝馨公司对光伏异质结组件设备及组件设备配套的机电辅助设施设备评估及公开挂牌后，以设备款50, 233, 387. 00元冲抵部分股权转让款。\n本次诉讼事项的判决或裁决情况\n截至本公告披露日，上述案件已立案受理，尚未判决。\n其他尚未披露的诉讼仲裁事项\n截至本公告披露日，公司及控股子公司不存在未披露单项涉案金额占公司最近一期经审计净资产绝对值10%以上，且绝对金额超过人民币1,000万元的重大诉讼、仲裁的情况，不存在其他应披露而未披露的诉讼、仲裁事项。\n本次诉讼对公司本期利润或期后利润的可能影响\n截至本公告披露之日，本次案件对公司本期利润或期后利润的影响存在不确定性，公司将依据有关会计准则的要求和实际情况进行相应的会计处理。同时，公司将尽快组织人员收集整理相关案件资料，积极应诉，同时加强与原告及法院的沟通协商，尽量降低对公司的影响。"},{"t":"明天见：宝马 M 部门预热神秘性能新车，或基于全新 i3 开发","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/212.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"宝马纯电性能车","kp":["[平台]: 全新i3","[预计量产]: 纯电M3约2027年"],"as":"宝马M部门发布预热视频，确认将于次日亮相一款神秘纯电性能轿车。新车此前在勒芒耐力赛期间被曝光，外界推测其基于全新一代i3平台开发。官方称该车将搭载全新设计语言，强调纯电动力的性能与驾驶体验。此举标志着宝马M高性能子品牌向电动化加速转型，预计将与特斯拉Model S Plaid、奔驰AMG EQ系列等直接竞争。该车的发布将进一步丰富宝马纯电高性能产品线，展示传统豪华品牌在电动性能领域的工程实力。","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":2.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.5,"t":7.5},"b":"6 月 11 日消息，宝马 M 部门即将发布一款疑似基于全新 i3 打造的纯电性能轿车。本周早些时候，新车在勒芒耐力赛前现身并被拍到。宝马今天发布了一段预热视频，确认新车将在明天正式亮相，并称这款车将带来\n全新设计语言、纯电性能与驾驶体验的新时代\n据外媒 BMW Blog 报道，新车预计基于全新 i3 开发，宝马 M 明显进行了更激进的性能化处理。相比新世代“NA0”，这辆纯电性能轿车\n报道认为，新车是量产版 M3 “ZA0”的可能性较低，因为纯电 M3 预计要到 2027 年晚些时候才会上市。\n相比普通 i3，新车加入了\n，呼应了宝马赛车传统。前保险杠上的矩形白色光点，也是没有出现在标准纯电轿车上的设计，灯光设计灵感来自 2026 年规格的 M Hybrid V8 耐力赛车。\n外后视镜也明显比标准 i3 更外扩。据IT之家了解，整个车头形似一辆\n经过宝马 M 大幅强化的 i3\n，部分车身面板有望使用天然纤维复合材料。宝马一年前表示，天然纤维复合材料已经具备量产应用条件，未来可取代碳纤维，并显著降低生产环节排放。\n此外，新车没有采用标准轴距 i3 的弹出式门把手，也没有使用中国市场长轴距 i3 的半封闭式门把手。报道分析，宝马 M 可能把后门把手低调整合进后车窗上的“霍氏弯角”。\n需要提醒的是：截至目前，宝马"},{"t":"我国原创RNA编辑技术世界首次应用于罕见病治疗","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260611/386621ea45514c138558895718120f76/c.html","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"新华网科技","tg":"技术突破","b":"我国原创RNA编辑技术世界首次应用于罕见病治疗-新华网\n我国原创RNA编辑技术世界首次应用于罕见病治疗\n我国原创RNA编辑技术世界首次应用于罕见病治疗\n昌平实验室/北京大学魏文胜教授团队6月10日发布，该团队研发的RNA编辑技术LEAPER在治疗杜氏肌营养不良症（简称“DMD”）这一严重遗传性罕见病中取得国际领先成果。这是我国原创RNA编辑技术首次进入临床研究，也是国际上首次将RNA编辑应用于DMD治疗。该技术与应用两项重要成果同期发表于当日上线的国际学术期刊《细胞》。\n研究概览。（昌平实验室供图）\n据介绍，DMD系基因突变引起，症状为进行性肌肉萎缩和运动功能丧失。患者常在儿时发病，逐渐丧失行走能力，多数因呼吸或心力衰竭早逝。我国DMD患者数量位居世界前列，现有治疗方法仅能部分延缓疾病进展，无法逆转病程。\n“针对这一难题，团队基于LEAPER平台开发了‘RNA外显子跳跃技术’。”魏文胜介绍，LEAPER系统元件会精准找到肌肉细胞里出错的DMD基因“图纸”，通过去除特定序列来恢复该基因的读码框，使细胞按照修正过的“图纸”重新生出功能正常的蛋白，让肌肉有机会再现活力。\n据介绍，RNA编辑被认为是精准医学的重要发展方向，在遗传病、神经系统疾病等重大疾病治疗领域展现出广阔的应用前景。区别于传统技术路线，LEAPER技术无需递送外源编辑酶，仅用一段工程化设计的RNA分子，即可调动人体细胞内天然存在的关键酶，实现对目标RNA的精准编辑。\n该技术的突破，有助于提升我国在核酸药物、基因治疗等领域的国际竞争力。\n目前，团队已联合上海交通大学等单位研制出候选药物“LE051”，3名接受治疗的患儿在一年随访期内均表现出显著、持久的运动功能改善。\n昌平实验室主任谢晓亮院士表示，LEAPER平台的研发及应用是实验室以原创基础研究和尖端技术开发持续推动新药研制的缩影，希望这项技术为更多重大疾病患者带来福音。（记者熊琳、王修楠）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n雄安日记丨踏上“昼伏夜出”的京雄快线联调联试机车\n走进小城看消费丨浙江温岭：“留量磁场”的三个密码\n记者手记丨探寻“嘟嘟农机”中的农业新质生产力密码\n这所小学，连续10年“玩”成全县第一\n美伊互袭，危险边缘的“可控对抗”\n京广线集中修：大机捣固＋铝热焊硬核施工\nVlog丨逐浪津门 外籍友人邂逅开放与美育\n我国原创RNA编辑技术世界首次应用于罕见病治疗","tp":"RNA编辑疗法","sc":8.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":6.5,"r":8.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"昌平实验室/北京大学魏文胜团队研发的RNA编辑技术LEAPER首次应用于罕见病治疗。团队基于该平台开发\"RNA外显子跳跃技术\"，精准修复DMD基因读码框，使细胞重新生成功能正常的蛋白。这是中国原创RNA编辑技术首次进入临床研究，也是国际首次将RNA编辑用于杜氏肌营养不良症治疗，成果发表于《细胞》期刊。"},{"t":"微软联合创始人比尔 · 盖茨自称曾遭爱泼斯坦勒索：否认参与犯罪活动，现在就是十分后悔与其往来","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/223.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 11 日消息，华盛顿当地时间 6 月 10 日，微软联合创始人比尔 · 盖茨在美国众议院监督与政府改革委员会举行的闭门听证会上作证时表示，当他与已故金融家杰弗里 · 爱泼斯坦（Jeffrey Epstein）断交后，对方曾利用其\n一事向其勒索施压，逼迫他重新与之往来。\n“这些婚外情事件与我们之间的往来毫无关系，但它们给我的家庭带来了痛苦。”他进一步解释称，“爱泼斯坦试图利用有关我不忠行为 —— 以及他在此基础上编造的大量谎言 —— 来逼迫我重新与他建立联系。”\n不过盖茨强调，对方的这一企图最终未能得逞。\n他希望自己的证词能有助于“为受害者伸张正义”\n盖茨向国会议员表示，他在与爱泼斯坦接触期间“并未完全了解”后者的犯罪行为严重程度。\n盖茨表示，自己从未亲眼目睹爱泼斯坦实施任何犯罪活动，自己“从未到过他的岛屿、他的牧场或他在佛罗里达的住所”，也“从未伤害过任何人”\n众议院监督与政府改革委员会目前正在调查美国司法部处理爱泼斯坦案件是否存在失当。委员会主席、共和党众议员詹姆斯 · 科默此前致信盖茨，要求其到场接受当面记录访谈。\n科默在听证会前曾表示，委员会希望了解盖茨与爱泼斯坦及其助手吉斯莱恩 · 麦克斯韦尔之间的关系，但强调针对盖茨并无任何不当行为的指控。\n盖茨在证词中承认，2011 年与爱泼斯坦结识并在 2014 年与其断绝往来是一个“严重错误”。盖茨表示：“我根本就不应该与爱泼斯坦见面。”\n盖茨解释称，爱泼斯坦最初承诺能为全球健康项目募集数十亿美元捐款，但最终分文未出。盖茨还表示：“如果我与爱泼斯坦共处的时间给他带来了任何可信度，我对此深感抱歉。”\n根据公开资料，爱泼斯坦于 2008 年因在佛罗里达州涉及未成年人卖淫案件被定罪，并服刑 13 个月。2019 年，美国联邦检方再次以未成年人性交易等罪名对其提起诉讼。爱泼斯坦对此拒不认罪，但在当年审判开始前于狱中死亡，官方认定死因为自杀。\n今年早些时候，美国司法部公开的大量档案显示，爱泼斯坦在 2008 年出狱后曾多次与盖茨会面，双方讨论过扩大慈善项目等事宜。相关文件中还包含盖茨与多名女性合影的照片，以及爱泼斯坦在 2013 年一封邮件草稿中提及盖茨“与俄罗斯女孩发生关系”的内容。\nIT之家注意到，盖茨此前曾多次表示，与爱泼斯坦的接触仅限于慈善事务讨论，并承认与其会面是一个错误。在此次国会作证中，盖茨进一步表示自己从未前往爱泼斯坦的私人岛屿。他表示，当年虽然知道爱泼斯坦曾面临法律问题，但未能充分认识相关案件涉及的严重性，也没有尽到应有的审慎调查义务。\n据《纽约时报》报道，盖茨聘请了去年 12 月才离任的该委员会前首席调查官杰克 · 格林伯格协助他准备此次作证。委员会发言人则向路透社表示，格林伯格离职后，委员会未再与他有过工作往来。\n比尔 · 盖茨就其与爱泼斯坦关系向盖茨基金会员工道歉，坚称自己未参与犯罪行为\n比尔・盖茨突然取消印度 AI 峰会主题演讲，此前因与爱泼斯坦往来遭批评\n比尔 · 盖茨被曝与俄女孩发生性关系并感染性病，前妻梅琳达称其需做出回应\n盖茨严词驳斥爱泼斯坦指控：所谓“性病”纯属诽谤，现在就是十分后悔认识他\n比尔・盖茨自曝曾遭杰弗里・爱泼斯坦以婚外情威胁，但都未能得逞"},{"t":"开源鸿蒙 OpenHarmony 7.0 Beta1 发布：应用控制更精细、相机专业能力增强，方舟 Web 内核升级至 Chromium 144","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/214.htm","c":"未分类","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","b":"6 月 11 日消息，开源\nOpenHarmony 7.0 首个测试版（Beta1）已经提交到 Gitcode 平台。\n从官方说明文件来看，该版本在应用程序框架、界面交互、窗口管理、网页引擎、音视频处理等多个方面获得了功能增强。\nOpenHarmony 7.0 Beta1 版本进一步增强应用开发功能，支持对应用更精细化的控制，比如可获取 Ability 退出原因、AbilityStage 启动加载信息、通知自定义铃声和锁屏通知控制等；进一步提升界面交互体验，支持动态布局容器、Tabs 嵌套滚动、自定义组件全局复用等；进一步增强窗口管理能力，新增标准悬浮窗、按需销毁窗口页面内容等；进一步增强 ArkWeb 网页控制能力，内核升级至 Chromium 144 版本，支持 URL 白名单控制、网页安全配置等；进一步增强音视频处理能力，支持 HDR 效果、多屏幕录制、Cinepak 编解码等；新增 Content Embed 内容嵌入服务，支持应用间文档互相嵌入与协同编辑；进一步丰富了图像元数据处理能力、音频编解码能力、MIDI 设备支持、相机专业能力、证书管理能力、企业定制能力等。\nAbility 上次退出的信息字段新增支持获取退出原因。\nAbilityStage 上下文新增 launchElement 字段，用于在 AbilityStage 调用 onCreate 时告知应用正在加载的 Ability，从而动态加载资源。\nAbilityStage 组件管理器新增 AbilityStage 即将创建第一个 Ability 的回调，以及当进程从应用快照启动时的回调。\n新增支持获取指定包名和分身索引的应用名称。\nModularObjectExtensionAbility\n的 C API，提供查询\nModularObjectExtensionAbility\n信息、连接与断开连接等能力。\n自定义组件支持跨 Ability 迁移。\n新增多个组件的 C API。\n新增一批属性字符串的 C API。\n支持将含有竞争策略的事件分发到目标 UI 组件节点。\n新增支持获取 UIContext 对应页面的根节点。\nText 组件新增支持根据坐标获取最近的字符的位置信息。\n新增拖拽异步通知接口，可以在拖拽的落入行为中指定采取剪切或者复制的处理方式，以及指定是否执行拖拽落入行为的动效。\n新增 onNeedSoftkeyboard 回调，支持开发者配置焦点转移后不关闭拉起的软键盘。\nCanvasRenderingContext2D 和\nOffscreenCanvasRenderingContext2D\n新增 antialias 属性，支持关闭文本抗锯齿功能。\n分段按钮新增 enableStateAnimation 配置项，用于指定 selectedIndexes 在绑定的状态变量发生变化时是否执行系统动画。\nTabs 组件新增支持嵌套滚动能力。\nJS 组件新增支持旋转表冠事件监听接口。\n多行文本的缩略模式新增支持设置为省略行首内容（MULTILINE_START）或省略行中内容（MULTILINE_CENTER）。\n新增动态布局容器组件，支持在运行时动态切换不同的布局算法，不改变子组件的状态。\n新增自定义组件全局复用能力，可针对指定 @Reusable/@ReusableV2 复用组件配置复用池，用于提供全局复用的能力。\n新增支持按需销毁窗口（WindowStage）的页面内容（UIContent）。\n新增标准悬浮窗。标准悬浮窗是悬浮在桌面 / 应用界面上的小型窗口，提供灵活的窗口管理能力，包括判断设备是否支持标准悬浮窗功能、创建标准悬浮窗控制器以启动、更新或停止标准悬浮窗等。\nArkWeb 基于上游社区的 Chromium 内核从 132 升级为 144 版本。\nArkWeb 网页请求支持 User-Agent Client Hints 功能。\nArkWeb 新增默认右键菜单启用开关，可通过该接口控制默认的右键菜单是否开启。\n设置 Web 页的 URL 白名单，只有白名单内的 URL 才能允许加载 / 跳转，否则将拦截并弹出告警页。\n在下载任务完成的回调中，新增支持获取下载项的原始 URL 地址；新增支持获取引用页的 URL 地址。\n新增安全特性选项配置的类，用于设置网页的安全配置属性。\n新增支持获取所有虚拟机线程的堆内存信息，包括线程 ID、线程名称、堆类型和堆对象大小。\n新增堆内存超过预警阈值的回调函数，在虚拟机主线程完成垃圾回收后如果堆内存仍超过预警阈值则触发回调执行。\ntaskpool 的 execute 方法增强，执行任务或任务组可以指定任务超时时长。如果任务或任务组的执行时间超过设置的超时时长，则抛出对应错误信息。\n新增 enableLocalHandleDetection 接口，保证 EventHandler 和 libuv 机制的任务在 scope 范围内执行，从而避免内存泄漏。\nXML 解析新增支持 XmlSAXHandler，定义了 SAX 解析 xml 文本时的回调方法。开发者需要实现这些回调方法来处理 xml 文本的不同部分。这些回调方法会在 xml 解析过程的对应时机触发。\nArkTS 运行时提供了多种模块化调试工具，帮助开发者快速定位和解决模块化相关问题。\n新增创建或打开已有的关系型数据库的同步方法。同步方法可阻塞线程直到获取到 RdbStore。\nC API 新增隐私保护设置的回调函数，用于响应截屏录屏时捕获的隐私保护事件。\nC API 新增支持获取多屏幕录制能力信息，以及通过 DisplayID 选择多屏幕进行录制。\n音频采集和音频渲染新增支持设置独立的音频会话策略和行为参数。\n新增 OH_MIDI 的 C API，支持应用通过 USB 或蓝牙 BLE 连接外接 MIDI 设备（如 MIDI 键盘、电子琴、MIDI 控制器等），实现 MIDI 消息的收发、设备枚举与热插拔监听，可用于音乐创作、乐器录制与教学、MIDI 设备控制等场景。\n新增 C API，提供声明输入音频格式、输出音频格式底层数据结构和格式转换接口的定义。\n新增支持创建延迟预览输出对象，在配流时替代普通的预览输出对象加入数据流。同时支持配置延迟预览的 Surface。\n新增一批拍照 / 录像模式下的相机专业能力，包括闪光灯、光学防抖、曝光、手动对焦、ISO 感光度、物理光圈的调用和设置。\n新增支持 Cinepak 媒体格式的编解码能力。\n新增支持筛选特定 MIME 类型的安全解码器，在处理受数字版权管理保护的 DRM 媒体资源时，可以使用支持安全链路的 \" 安全解码器 \"。（\nH265 硬件编码器新增支持 CBRHQ（高质量恒定码率模式）。（\n新增支持后台播放模式的设置，可由应用告知系统是否支持后台播放，系统根据能力决策实况胶囊的显示。\nAVSession 的枚举新增定义了在不同场景中使用的额外键的枚举。\n提醒的倒计时实例对象新增参数重复周期（repeatInterval）和重复次数（repeatCount）。\n新增支持通过 C API 获取 Wi-Fi 连接信息。\n新增 A2DP 的播放状态广播以及 SCO 广播事件。\nTLS 支持证书链的验证，可通过传入数组的方式最多支持到 1000 个证书。\n新增 Content Embed 内容嵌入服务，提供应用间文档互相嵌入与协同编辑的框架能力，并为开发者封装了客户端与服务端的开发接口，便于快速实现文档跨应用嵌入与协作。\n打开文件或目录时新增参数 UNCACHE，支持读写文件不进行页缓存。\n新增 listFileExt 方法支持递归列出和自定义文件名过滤。可通过配置 options 中 recursion 参数实现递归列出所有文件的相对路径。\n新增支持开发者通过文件 mmap 能力集（基于文件描述符或文件对象创建文件映射对象），实现文件的高效读写访问。\n新增支持应用捐献自身沙箱目录给系统设置为共享，其他应用可以通过文管直接获取到目录里的文件。\n在 onUpdateForm 回调中新增支持卡片更新原因字段。\n新增支持为组件内容添加 HDR（高动态范围成像）提亮效果。\n新增支持视频的 AIHDR 格式。\n绘制模块新增用于处理坐标点的类，支持对坐标点取反和设置偏移量。\n新增 WebP 图像元数据类、GIF 图像元数据类、JFIF 图像元数据类、TIFF 图像元数据类、PNG 图像元数据类以及 AVIS 图像元数据类，用于存储对应格式图像的元数据。\n新增 XMP（Extensible Metadata Platform）元数据。\n新增输入事件注入模块，提供键盘和鼠标输入事件模拟能力。\nC API 输入事件增强，提供输入事件的压力、相对窗口左上角的 XY 相对坐标等事件。\n新增支持查询本 APP 通知中 wantAgent 字段的部分信息。\n新增支持使用应用沙箱内的文件作为通知的自定义铃声。\n新增是否开启锁屏通知等字段。\n新增支持以半模态方式拉起应用的通知设置界面。\nkiosk 模式下，新增支持通过上划停留手势进入最近任务栏（ALLOW_GESTURE_CONTROL）以及通过边缘内划停留手势进入侧边 DOCK 栏（ALLOW_SIDE_DOCK）。（\n新增支持安装和卸载企业重签名证书的能力。\n新增支持根据位置索引添加应用到 PC/2in1 设备的底部快捷栏的能力。\n设备设置管理支持对当前用户下被隐藏的设置项列表进行添加、删除、查询操作。\nJSVM 新增支持从外部内存创建 ArrayBuffer 对象。\n当应用发生 SIGPIPE 异常退出时，在 Debug 版本应用可开启 SIGPIPE 信号打印调用栈功能辅助定位问题。\nHiProfiler 新增文件缓存模式（use_file_cache_mode），通过将缓存数据落盘，提升内存分配信息的采集性能。\nHiDebug 新增资源采集功能，支持按需采集应用进程资源分配栈至沙箱，覆盖文件描述符、线程、Native / GPU 内存及全局句柄等类别，辅助定位资源泄漏。\nHiDebug 新增支持获取应用程序进程的物理内存使用信息。\nHiDebug 新增支持将转储的堆快照由线程级改为进程级。\nHiDebug 新增提供包括内核信息在内的 Trace 采集请求接口。\nHiAppEvent 新增应用冻屏告警事件，提供事件的订阅能力。\n为鸿蒙 7.0 铺路：OpenHarmony 7.0 Beta1 现身，华为 HarmonyOS API26 版本已启开发者体验官招募\n华为开发者大会（HDC 2026）专题","tp":"鸿蒙系统升级","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.5},"as":"开源鸿蒙 OpenHarmony 7.0 Beta1 版本现已正式发布。该版本实现了全方位的功能升级：在应用控制上更加精细化，支持自定义铃声与 Ability 状态监控；交互体验与窗口管理显著增强，引入动态布局与标准悬浮窗；底层 ArkWeb 内核跃升至 Chromium 144，提升了网页安全与控制能力。此外，新版还大幅强化了音视频编解码、HDR处理、多屏录制及相机专业能力，并新增跨应用文档协同编辑等功能，全面提升了系统开发体验。"},{"t":"小米汽车：YU7 全系车型配备三重冗余车门把手，极端场景下仍可实现中控解锁、机械开门","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/224.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"小米YU7安全配置","kp":["电耗[YU7 GT实测]: 14.9kWh/100km","续航达成率[CLTC 705km]: 94.1%","预计总续航[满电至归零]: 663.7km"],"as":"小米汽车发布答网友问第255集，确认YU7全系车型标配三重冗余车门把手系统。该设计在断电、碰撞等极端场景下仍可通过中控电子解锁与机械应急开门双重保障逃生通道，同步披露了YU7 GT上海至千岛湖长续航实测及标准版安全配置细节，体现小米在电动车主被动安全冗余设计上的工程取向。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.5,"t":8.0},"b":"Autumn_Dream\n6 月 11 日消息，小米汽车官方今日发布答网友问（第 255 集），针对 YU7 GT 的上海到千岛湖续航测试相关热门问题以及 YU7 标准版的安全配置如何等进行了解答。\nIT之家附小米汽车此次问答重点内容如下：\n本次测试总计行驶 503.7km，结束时剩余 23% 电量。按照本次 14.9kWh/100km 的平均电耗，至表显电量归零时，\n约可继续行驶 160km\n，加上已行驶距离，YU7 GT 本次测试满电至表显电量归零时，总计可行驶约 663.7km。按照 YU7 GT 705km 的 CLTC 续航计算，达成率约为 94.1%。\n续航测试的 503.7km，其中包括 346.4km 的高速路段，高速均速 95km/h，最高时速达 120km/h；以及 157.3km 的环湖 + 城市路段。\n全程平均车速为 72km/h，平均电耗为 14.9kWh/100km\n在本次测试全程的 503.7km 中，有 157.3km 为「环湖 + 城市路段」，总计行驶时长 3 小时 22 分钟，平均时速 47km/h，\n平均电耗为每百公里 11.4kWh\n。测试模拟了日常通勤场景，具有一定的代表性，但基于不同的天气、路况、车辆配置与设置、驾驶习惯、车辆载重等多方面的差异，能耗表现也会有所不同，大家日常用车可以参照视频中设置。\n为了让 YU7 GT 实现「千匹马力」和「长续航」兼顾，在整车层面对三电、热管理、轮胎及低摩擦等全域进行了大量能耗优化，无论通勤代步还是长途出行都能提供出色的续航表现。\n电驱上，YU7 GT 的前电机搭载智能脱开机构，\n在经济模式下前电机和半轴可完全解耦，减少拖拽损耗，有效提升了续航能力\n。在此模式下 YU7 GT 由后轴搭载的小米超级电机 V8s EVO 驱动，它不仅转速更高性能更强，也有优秀的能效表现。V8s EVO 采用自研碳化硅功率模块，功率提升 5.9%，同时升级了更薄的 0.15mm 定转子硅钢片，使电机效率进一步提升至 98.38%，兼顾了出色的性能与能耗表现。\n同时热管理能力也做了升级，在满足舒适性的同时，更加精细化地管理空调能耗，应省尽省。同时在轮胎、制动卡钳这些小细节上，也都思考了能耗的优化。例如，YU7 GT 可选「21 英寸低风阻轮毂」、「长续航轮胎」，同时搭载「低拖滞制动卡钳」，有效降低了各类阻力对能耗造成的负担。\n没有区别，小米 YU7 全系拥有同样的安全设计，\n被动安全方面，小米 YU7 全系拥有同样的铠甲笼式车身，高强度钢和铝合金占比高达 90.2%，配备 2200MPa 小米超强钢，应用于「内嵌式防滚架」和四门防撞梁，有效提升“钻卡”、翻滚、侧碰等场景的防护能力。\n，小米 YU7 全系配备激光雷达、4D 毫米波雷达、700TOPS 算力的英伟达 Thor 芯片\n，且全系配备 25 项安全辅助功能，包括 AEB 防碰撞辅助、AES 紧急转向辅助、MAI 误加速抑制辅助、LCP 侧向避让辅助等，以提升车辆在极端场景下的应对能力；同时也再次提醒大家，辅助驾驶不是自动驾驶，请务必注意观察环境，安全驾驶。\n电池安全方面，小米 YU7 全系标配「1500MPa 防刮底横梁」、电池「防弹涂层」，应对车辆底部剐蹭时，有效降低电池损伤风险；此前小米 YU7 磷酸铁锂电池还成功通过了等效 40 万公里老化后的高温、满电、无水冷的多电芯针刺试验，最终无热蔓延、不起火、不爆炸，说明小米 YU7 电池出色的安全能力与可靠性。\n小米 YU7 全系车型还配备三重冗余车门把手\n，内置机械拉线结构和门锁单独的备用电源，即便在极端场景下，\n高压电池、小电池断电，仍可实现中控解锁、机械开门"},{"t":"发改能源〔2026〕688号文深度解读：绿电直连\"一对多\"来了，分布式光伏消纳迎重大突破","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/11/50024260.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"索比光伏","as":"国家发改委、能源局联合印发发改能源〔2026〕688号文，核心突破是允许绿电直连从\"一对一\"扩展至\"一对多\"模式，即单个新能源电源可向多个终端用户直接供电。此举打通了分布式光伏长期面临的消纳与就近交易瓶颈，为工业园区、零碳园区等多用户场景的绿电就地消纳提供了政策通道，是继2025年650号文后的关键制度迭代。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"绿电直连政策","kp":["绿电直连模式[688号文]: 从一对一升级为一对多","已审批装机[绿电直连]: 3405万千瓦"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"b":"2026年5月20日，国家发展改革委、国家能源局联合印发《关于有序推动多用户绿电直连发展有关事项的通知》(发改能源〔2026〕688号)。\n光伏、储能、园区运营圈子里，这份文件等了将近一年。\n2025年5月，650号文第一次打开绿电直连的制度闸门，但规定只能\"一对一\"——一个电源只能对接一个用电法人。工业园区里十几家、几十家企业想共用一条绿电专线?整村汇流的\n想接入周边工厂?都没有路径。688号文，就是专门来补这个缺口的。\n一句话说清核心变化：绿电直连从\"一对一\"正式升级为\"一对多\"。\n截至2026年4月，全国已有 99个绿电直连项目完成审批，总装机3405万千瓦——但这还只是单用户模式下的规模。688号文打开的，是工业园区、零碳园区、算力集群整体参与的大门。国家能源局在答记者问中明确说：工业园区占我国总能耗的66%以上，这一次，这个庞大的用能主体第一次有了完整的制度路径。\n对光伏行业来说，688号文还写进了一条直接利好：明确支持\n通过集中汇流方式参与多用户绿电直连。这为大批受困于消纳的工商业和户用\n，提供了就近消纳的新出路。\n688号文没有改写费用规则，输配电费、系统运行费照付;反送电约束基本没动;大量关键细则被交给各省自行决定。解读5作者介子九维的判断说得最直接：\"688号文是'650号文的强补丁，1192号文的弱补丁'——制度准入的突破是实实在在的，经济性改善非常有限。\"\n它打开的是一扇因地制宜的\"窄门\"，不是全民狂欢的\"蓝海\"。\n哪些项目真正能走通?主责单位到底该谁来做?\n参与的真实边界在哪里?增量配电网是不是系统性机会?有哪些投资风险必须提前想清楚?\n索比光伏网对688号文进行了逐条解析，覆盖：\n* 688号文 vs 650号文完整对比(6大维度对照表)\n集中汇流的真实边界与操作路径\n* 五类光伏项目受益程度分级评估\n* 主责单位的能力要求与谁适合做、谁接不住\n* 政策局限与5条投资风险提示(含退出机制、国际绿电声明、地方差异)\n以下为报告摘要，完整版扫码获取"},{"t":"又一钙钛矿电池企业获A轮融资！","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/11/50024239.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"资本运作","tp":"钙钛矿电池融资","kp":["量产尺寸[钙钛矿光伏]: 30cm×30cm","[产线规模]: 兆瓦级初试线","[产品]: 单结钙钛矿+全钙钛矿叠层"],"as":"永珈光能科技（湖北）完成A轮融资，投资方为普朗克创投，金额未披露。公司成立于2023年9月，聚焦单结钙钛矿电池与全钙钛矿叠层电池两大技术路线的研发与产业化，已投入数千万元。钙钛矿作为第三代光伏技术因高理论效率与低成本潜力持续吸引资本，本轮融资反映该赛道在中早期阶段的融资活跃度仍在延续。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"b":"钙钛矿工厂获悉，近日，永珈光能科技(湖北)有限公司(以下简称“永珈光能”)获A轮融资，本轮融资由普朗克创投投资，融资金额暂未披露。\n永珈光能成立于2023年9月聚焦于高效、稳定的单结钙钛矿电池和全钙钛矿叠层电池产品的开发。目前已投资数千万元，建成兆瓦级初试线，实现量产30cm×30cm及以下尺寸的各类定制化钙钛矿光伏产品。永珈光能在单结钙钛矿电池、全钙钛矿叠层电池以及柔性钙钛矿光伏器件转化效率及稳定性等方面都达到了国际先进水平。\n永珈光能由武汉大学物理学院教授余桢华领衔创办。余桢华是武汉大学本硕博连读的“武汉伢”，在钙钛矿领域内最顶尖研究机构之一的北卡罗来纳大学教堂山分校完成博士后研究后，作为海外高层次人才引进回国，在武汉大学任教，已深耕钙钛矿领域十余年。\n永珈光能首席科学家赵兴中，同为武汉大学教授，获得了国家杰出青年基金、教育部长江学者特聘教授，作为湖北省科技厅自然科学一等奖第一发明人，为公司提供深厚的技术支撑。\n目前永珈光能团队平均年龄低于35岁，名校硕士以上学历占比超50%，其中博士7名。作为科学家领衔的硬核科技企业，团队同时还吸引了顶尖工程管理人才及资深运营人才加入，构建了从技术研发到产品迭代、市场拓展的完整人才队伍。\n今年3月，永珈光能联合创始人袁建港介绍旗下研发的单节钙钛矿电池光电转换效率可以做到27.5%，两端叠层电池可以做到接近32%，\n在量产规划方面，永珈光能计划深耕湖北，两到三年内建成百兆瓦级中试线，三到五年内筹建大尺寸GW级产线，逐步实现从消费电子到太空光伏、集中与分布式电站的全场景覆盖。"},{"t":"南网能源：一次性转让444.77MW光伏项目！","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/11/50024241.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"南网能源公告拟通过北交所公开挂牌转让24个智慧绿电项目资产及3个项目公司股权，涉及光伏装机总规模444.77MW、资产总额13.44亿元。这是电力央企对分布式光伏运营资产的批量出表操作，反映出部分国企在新能源补贴退坡与收益率重估背景下，正通过资产证券化或剥离方式优化存量光伏持仓结构。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"光伏项目转让","kp":["转让规模[光伏项目]: 444.77MW","资产总额[光伏项目]: 13.44亿元"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.5},"b":"6月6日，南网能源发布《关于通过北交所公开挂牌转让部分资产的进展公告》（原文附后），拟挂牌转让24个智慧绿电项目资产及3个智慧绿电项目公司股权，涉及光伏项目总规模444.77MW，资产总额13.44亿元。\n24个智慧绿电项目：装机容量约342.08MW，均为\n项目，评估值合计为112,188.91万元(不含增值税)，评估增值合计5,881.60万元，增值率为5.53%；\n3个智慧绿电项目：装机容量约102.69MW，评估值合计为22,241.42万元，评估减值合计2,984.58万元，减值率为11.83%。\n表1：拟转让24个智慧绿电项目名单\n表2：拟转让3个智慧绿电项目公司名单"},{"t":"单台年省500度电！南网“妙算”服务器为数据中心出妙招--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260611_1894463.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"产业进展","tp":"数据中心节能服务器","kp":["能耗降低[妙算服务器]: >10%","年节电[单台]: 约500度","[电源技术]: 氮化镓高效电源"],"as":"南方电网完成\"妙算\"高能效服务器实测验证，在同等算力输出下单台年节电约500度。该服务器专为数据中心高能耗痛点设计，通过液冷、电源转换效率优化及算力调度协同降低PUE。随着\"东数西算\"与AI推理算力需求激增，数据中心节能服务器成为电网系企业切入算力基础设施能效管理的新方向。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"b":"单台年省500度电！南网“妙算”服务器为数据中心出妙招--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n单台年省500度电！南网“妙算”服务器为数据中心出妙招\n近日，南方电网成功完成“妙算”高能效服务器测试验证。经实测验证，在同等算力输出条件下，单台设备能耗降低10%以上，年节电量接近500度，为破解数据中心高能耗难题提供了量化实证。\n在南方电网人工智能中试基地机房，16台“妙算”高能效服务器正满负荷模拟各类业务场景。与传统服务器恒频恒压运行、无效能耗偏高的模式不同，该设备通过芯片动态调频调压技术按需匹配算力功耗，依托智能风扇调速技术大幅降低散热辅耗与噪音，并借助氮化镓高效电源技术补齐了传统电源转换损耗高的短板。\n“别小看这500度电，如果未来百万台规模级替换，节省的电量将非常可观。”南网数字集团产品经理林建鹏介绍。硬件能效升级只是第一步，依托电网平台优势，南方电网公司正同步推进调度模式创新。\n未来，“妙算”高能效服务器将全面接入电碳算协同运营系统，构建“高能效硬件+电碳算协同运营平台”的完整体系，推动数据中心节能模式从“单点节能”向“电碳算一体化”转型。届时，电网将从单一的供电载体转变为算力节能的“智能调度师”：在新能源富余时扩容离线算力消纳绿电，在电网负荷紧张时柔性压降非刚需算力用电，形成“算随电走、电随算优”的新模式，为新型绿色算力中心建设提供可复制的“南网方案”，助力算力产业绿色低碳发展。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破\n国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立"},{"t":"单台年省500度电！南网“妙算”服务器为数据中心出妙招--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260611_1894463.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"技术突破","tp":"数据中心节能","kp":["能耗降低[妙算服务器]: >10%","年节电[单台]: 约500度","[电源技术]: 氮化镓高效电源"],"dp":1,"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"as":"南方电网完成\"妙算\"高能效服务器测试验证。实测表明，在同等算力输出条件下，单台\"妙算\"服务器每年可节约约500度电。该产品针对数据中心高能耗痛点进行优化设计，在降低PUE方面表现突出，有望在数据中心大规模部署后带来可观节能减排效果，助力绿色算力基础设施建设。","b":"单台年省500度电！南网“妙算”服务器为数据中心出妙招--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n单台年省500度电！南网“妙算”服务器为数据中心出妙招\n近日，南方电网成功完成“妙算”高能效服务器测试验证。经实测验证，在同等算力输出条件下，单台设备能耗降低10%以上，年节电量接近500度，为破解数据中心高能耗难题提供了量化实证。\n在南方电网人工智能中试基地机房，16台“妙算”高能效服务器正满负荷模拟各类业务场景。与传统服务器恒频恒压运行、无效能耗偏高的模式不同，该设备通过芯片动态调频调压技术按需匹配算力功耗，依托智能风扇调速技术大幅降低散热辅耗与噪音，并借助氮化镓高效电源技术补齐了传统电源转换损耗高的短板。\n“别小看这500度电，如果未来百万台规模级替换，节省的电量将非常可观。”南网数字集团产品经理林建鹏介绍。硬件能效升级只是第一步，依托电网平台优势，南方电网公司正同步推进调度模式创新。\n未来，“妙算”高能效服务器将全面接入电碳算协同运营系统，构建“高能效硬件+电碳算协同运营平台”的完整体系，推动数据中心节能模式从“单点节能”向“电碳算一体化”转型。届时，电网将从单一的供电载体转变为算力节能的“智能调度师”：在新能源富余时扩容离线算力消纳绿电，在电网负荷紧张时柔性压降非刚需算力用电，形成“算随电走、电随算优”的新模式，为新型绿色算力中心建设提供可复制的“南网方案”，助力算力产业绿色低碳发展。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破\n国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立"},{"t":"华为鸿蒙 HarmonyOS 6.1.0.125 再曝新特性，MatePad Edge / Pro Max 切换模式支持部分应用不关闭","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/216.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 11 日消息，华为 MatePad Edge 和 MatePad Pro Max 两款设备分别支持电脑模式和电脑桌面功能。\nIT之家从华为官网了解到，最新推出的\n6.1.0.125 版本系统解决了这两款设备在使用过程的一大痛点 —— 切换模式 / 桌面时应用会关闭。根据官方说法，\n支持切换模式 / 桌面功能的平板升级 125 以上版本后，支持部分应用在切换后可以继续使用\nHUAWEI MatePad Edge\n需升级至 HarmonyOS 6.1.0.125SP52 及以上版本。\nHUAWEI MatePad Pro Max 需升级至 HarmonyOS 6.1.0.125 及以上版本。\n适配支持的应用清单见下表：\n需要注意的是，因为涉及到生态应用适配，部分应用切换模式后可能会出现页面显示异常，重启应用即可恢复。\n华为开发者大会（HDC 2026）专题"},{"t":"华为 HiCar 7.0 手车互联解决方案官宣，定档 6 月 13 日发布","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/222.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"手车互联方案","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.5},"as":"华为宣布HiCar 7.0手车互联解决方案将于6月13日在HDC 2026开发者大会上正式发布。作为华为车载生态的核心产品，HiCar 7.0预计在跨设备协同、智能座舱融合、手机-车机无缝投屏等方面实现升级。同期大会还将发布AI核心能力及生态新成果，标志着鸿蒙智行生态加速布局。","b":"6 月 11 日消息，华为开发者大会 HDC 2026 官宣定档 6 月 12 日 ~14 日举行。本届 HDC 2026 将发布\nAI 核心能力，以及生态全新成果等。\nIT之家从 HDC 2026 官网议程板块了解到，在 6 月 13 日的【HUAWEI HiCar】智慧出行生态峰会上，\n将发布最新的 HUAWEI HiCar 7.0 解决方案\nIT之家注：HiCar 智行是华为推出的手机和汽车互联产品，通过简单的连接，用户即可在驾驶时通过车机来使用手机的导航、音乐、电话、语音交互等功能。在 2024 年 6 月，升级版 HiCar 随\nHarmonyOS NEXT\n一同发布，带来了全新桌面设计、音乐 / 导航等功能交互。\n华为开发者大会（HDC 2026）专题"},{"t":"亚马逊创始人贝索斯：AI 不会造成大规模失业，反而会让经济出现“劳动力短缺”","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/215.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI工程代理","kp":["融资额[Prometheus]: 120亿美元","估值[Prometheus]: 约2784亿元人民币","产品目标[Prometheus]: 通用AI工程师"],"sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":3.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"as":"亚马逊创始人贝索斯表示，AI不会导致大规模失业，反而将推动经济进入\"劳动力短缺\"状态。他目前正在联合创办新AI公司Prometheus，旨在利用AI提升工人生产力。贝索斯认为AI将创造更多需求而非取代人力，这一观点与部分科技领袖的悲观预测形成对比，引发关于AI就业影响的讨论。","b":"6 月 11 日消息，据《华尔街日报》今晚报道，亚马逊创始人、蓝色起源联合创始人杰夫 · 贝索斯认为，AI 不会让人类大规模失业，\n反而会让经济出现“劳动力短缺”\n当前的贝索斯，正在联合创办新 AI 公司 Prometheus，目标是提高工程师生产力。该公司计划打造一种“通用 AI 工程师”，用于设计和制造喷气发动机等复杂实体产品。\n贝索斯在采访中表示，Prometheus 的目标是赋能工程师，让发明变得更容易、更快，使更小的团队能够\n在更短周期内完成规模大得多的事情\nPrometheus 的估值\n（IT之家注：现汇率约合 2783.62 亿元人民币），已从贝索斯、摩根大通、高盛、贝莱德等投资方筹集 120 亿美元，并已在旧金山、伦敦和苏黎世办公室招聘约 150 人。\n虽然硅谷对 AI 前景高度乐观，但普通民众对 AI 的态度正在转向谨慎，许多人担心 AI 会造成大规模失业。\n贝索斯表示，年轻人对 AI 的\n部分悲观看法“与现实相反”\n。在他看来，AI 确实会减少现有岗位所需的人员数量，同时也会创造更多机会，并显\n。如果 AI 让发明变得更便宜、更快、更容易，就业最终反而会上升，因为即使所需人数减少到原来的十分之一，AI 创造的机会也会超过十倍。“未来会出现双收入家庭中一名收入者退出劳动力市场的情况，因为\n贝索斯直言，AI 进步已经推动多个领域同时进入“黄金时代”，现在是创业的最佳时机。"},{"t":"东风奕派 EP7 将搭载华为乾崑智能技术，官方透露是双方联合打造的第二款车型","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/209.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"华为乾崑智驾","kp":["峰值功率[双电机]: 175kW/230kW","电池[EP7]: 磷酸铁锂(宁德时代)","轴距[EP7]: 2920mm"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":7.5},"as":"工信部第408批产品公示中，东风奕派EP7纯电轿车亮相。官方确认该车是东风奕派与华为乾崑联合打造的第二款车型，搭载华为乾崑智能驾驶与智能座舱技术。此次合作延续双方在新能源汽车智能化方向的深度绑定，标志着华为车BU解决方案在更多主机厂的落地，智能驾驶竞争格局进一步加剧。","b":"6 月 11 日消息，工信部昨晚发布第 408 批《道路机动车辆生产企业及产品公告》新产品公示，东风奕派 EP7 纯电轿车现身。\n东风奕派营销事业部总经理余岳峰今日发文同步了一个重要进展：\n东风奕派与华为乾崑联合打造的第二款车型奕派 EP7\n。关于奕派 EP7 的更多产品信息，会在后续逐步揭晓。这意味着这款新车将搭载华为乾崑智能技术，有望包括华为乾崑智驾、\n座舱等（具体配置以官方最终公布内容为准）。\nIT之家从申报信息获悉，这款新车长 4910mm、宽 1930mm、高 1478mm，轴距为 2920mm。总质量 2458kg，整备质量 2058kg，可选装多种配色轮毂以及电动尾翼等配置。\n动力方面，该车提供双电机版本，搭载由宁德时代提供的磷酸铁锂电池，驱动电机额定功率为 55kW/100kW，峰值功率为 175kW/230kW。\n东风奕派是东风汽车集团旗下的新能源品牌，该品牌于 2023 年 11 月 10 日正式发布，首款车型为中型轿车 eπ 007。\n根据东风奕派与华为乾崑在 2026 年 4 月 25 日北京车展上公布的战略合作成果，双方计划在年内推出三款搭载华为乾崑智能汽车解决方案的车型。\n双方联合打造的首款车型是东风奕派 M8，这是一款“巅峰智能大六座 SUV”，已于 2026 年 5 月全球首秀，并计划在 2026 年 5 月 29 日登陆粤港澳大湾区车展。\n东风奕派 M8 搭载了华为乾崑智能汽车解决方案，具体包括乾崑智驾、鸿蒙座舱、乾崑车控、乾崑车云、鲸鳍通信等，并号称拥有“满配智能 6 件套”。\n东风奕派 M8 全球首批搭载了华为乾崑智驾 ADS 5 Pro，并配备了宁德时代动力电池，以及博世、福耀等全球供应链伙伴。"},{"t":"上游跌幅收窄，组件与电池片同步进入磨底阶段","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/11/50024249.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏组件价格","kp":["价格[TOPCon210双面]: 0.730元/W","价格[TOPCon矩形双面]: 0.720元/W","价格[HJT矩形双面]: 0.760元/W","排产[组件6月]: 38-39GW"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"as":"光伏产业链价格监测显示上游跌幅收窄，组件与电池片环节同步进入磨底阶段。当前地面电站TOPCon210双面0.730元/W，TOPCon矩形双面0.720元/W，HJT矩形双面0.760元/W。国内外电站项目陆续推进带动终端需求小幅回暖，行业整体处于价格筑底、产能出清的关键时期。","b":"更多价格信息/报告分析，扫码进入小程序注册登录免费查看\n组件价格下降。地面电站TOPCon210双面0.730元/W，TOPCon矩形双面0.720元/W，HJT矩形双面0.760元/W。\n需求方面，近期，国内外电站项目陆续推进，终端需求稍有好转。6月上旬，国内集中式电站项目开工率从5月的不足40%小幅回升至45%左右，部分此前延期的风光大基地项目开始陆续启动。分布式市场方面，随着气温升高和用电需求增加，工商业分布式项目询价活跃度有所提升，但成交仍以低价货源为主。总体而言，需求端仍处于弱复苏阶段，边际改善信号已现，但总量增幅有限，难以有效承接供给端的放量。\n供应方面，6月份，组件排产维持在38-39GW，环比5月增长约8%-10%。行业产能出清仍在缓慢推进。随着部分海外订单阶段性交付及国内分布式项目缓慢启动，头部企业排产整体维持较高水平。\n价格方面，综合当前组件市场上游跌幅收窄、需求边际改善初现、欧盟MIP温和续期修复海外预期、但高库存和供给放量压力依然沉重等多空交织格局，短期内，组件价格预计以底部弱稳为主。\n更多价格信息/报告分析，扫码进入小程序注册登录免费查看\n本周硅料价格下降。N型复投均价3.39万元/吨，N型致密均价3.28万元/吨，N型颗粒硅3.35万元/吨。\n6月份硅料产量维持9-9.1万吨，行业总库存仍维持在52万吨左右。同时，硅片库存27.5GW再创新高。工业硅弱势运行，西南丰水期电价下行，成本支撑持续弱化。综合当前硅料市场6月复产全面兑现、实质累库已获确认、下游硅片库存再创新高且采购近乎停滞等多重因素，短期内，硅料价格预计延续弱势下行态势，但跌幅有望较本周继续收窄。\n硅片价格不变。N型210硅片均价1.17元/片，N型182*210mm硅片均价1.00片。\n6月份硅片排产计划维持在约53GW，环比5月增长约5%。硅片库存攀升至27.5GW，再创阶段新高，但累库速度放缓。电池片采购仍以刚需为主，但询价活跃度边际回升。短期内，硅片价格预计以底部弱稳为主，价格将在当前位置窄幅震荡磨底。\n本周电池片价格下降。N型TOPCon单晶210电池均价0.32元/W，N型TOPCon单晶210R电池均价0.31元/W。\n6月份电池片排产维持在约48-49GW，环比5月增长3%-5%，库存小幅波动。组件排产维持高位但压价采购不改，国内装机边际改善传导仍需时间。银价低位窄幅震荡，成本支撑逻辑依然缺失。短期内，电池片价格预计以底部弱稳为主，主流成交中枢有望维持在当前位置窄幅波动。\n1、数据均为索比咨询整理，价格为均价，有疑问请联系我们，欢迎探讨\n2、索比咨询每周三、周四更新产业链价格趋势，敬请关注"},{"t":"《极限竞速：地平线 6》通行证新车上线：2008 本田思域 Type R (FD2)","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/220.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 11 日消息，微软第一方顶级赛车 IP《极限竞速：地平线 6》全新通信证车辆 《Forza Horizon 6 2008 Honda Civic Type R (FD2)》今日正式登陆 Steam 平台，由 Playground Games 开发，需要拥有本体游戏《极限竞速：地平线 6》才能游玩。\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/4439830/Forza_Horizon_6_2008_Honda_Civic_Type_R_FD2/\n该 DLC 当前在 Steam 国区定价 12 元，支持家庭共享功能。游戏语言支持方面，该 DLC 完整支持简体中文的界面、音频与字幕，同时还提供 22 种其他语言选项。\n作为《极限竞速：地平线 6》的车辆 DLC，该内容为本体游戏新增经典车型\n2008 本田思域 Type R (FD2)\n，玩家可在游戏中驾驶这款经典日系前驱钢炮驰骋开放世界。该 DLC 支持单人模式、线上玩家对战与在线合作，开发者推荐使用控制器游玩，完全支持 Xbox 控制器。\n《极限竞速：地平线 6》本体游戏已于 2026 年 5 月 19 日正式发售，其 PC 版配置要求如下：\n22H2 系统，处理器为 Intel i5-8400 或 AMD Ryzen 5 1600，内存 16 GB，显卡为 Nvidia GTX 1650 或 AMD RX 6500 XT 或 Intel Arc A380，需要 167 GB 存储空间，必须使用 SSD，DirectX 版本为 12。\n：需要 64 位 Windows 10 22H2 系统，处理器为 Intel i5-12400F 或 AMD Ryzen 5 5600X，内存 16 GB，显卡为 NVIDIA RTX 3060 Ti 或 AMD RX 6700 XT 或 Intel Arc A580，需要 167 GB 存储空间，必须使用 SSD，DirectX 版本为 12。"},{"t":"《内蒙古自治区电力条例》立法建议公开征集公告","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/11/50024256.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"政策监管","tp":"电力条例立法","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":3.0,"r":2.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"内蒙古自治区能源局就《内蒙古自治区电力条例》公开征集立法建议，该条例已列入2026年立法项目调研计划。条例涉及电力行业主体权益、新能源消纳、电力市场建设等方面，面向社会各界征求意见，旨在通过立法完善自治区电力管理体制，为新能源大区的电力行业发展提供法治保障。","b":"6月10日，内蒙古自治区能源局发布关于公开征集《内蒙古自治区电力条例》立法建议的公告，公告指出，《内蒙古自治区电力条例》(以下简称《条例》)已列入自治区人大常委会2026年立法项目调研计划，《条例》与电力行业主体、社会各界息息相关，为落实科学立法、民主立法，现广泛征集立法内容相关意见和建议。立法建议应当围绕工作实际，注重解决客观问题，充分考虑电力行业高质量发展要求，务实且具有前瞻性。\n《内蒙古自治区电力条例》(以下简称《条例》)已列入自治区人大常委会2026年立法项目调研计划，《条例》与电力行业主体、社会各界息息相关，为落实科学立法、民主立法，现广泛征集立法内容相关意见和建议。立法建议应当围绕工作实际，注重解决客观问题，充分考虑电力行业高质量发展要求，务实且具有前瞻性。\n有关单位和个人可在2026年7月15日前，通过以下方式提出意见和建议：\n1.通过信函方式寄至：内蒙古自治区呼和浩特市赛罕区敕勒川大街发展大厦C座602办公室(邮政编码：010098)，内蒙古自治区能源局法规处(收)，并务必在信封上表明“《内蒙古自治区电力条例》征集意见”字样。\n3.通过其他方式反馈的，可联系电话：0471-6623051(郭强)。"},{"t":"“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展部署17项任务","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260611/a0949ccfefd94a30ad7b4c21fe5a09c0/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/计算集群","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","b":"“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展部署17项任务-新华网\n“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展部署17项任务\n“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展部署17项任务\n新华社北京6月11日电　《经济参考报》6月11日刊发记者郭倩采写的文章《“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展部署17项任务》。文章称，记者6月10日获悉，近日工业和信息化部印发《“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展实施意见（2026—2028年）》（以下简称《实施意见》），围绕推动信息通信行业智能化升级、夯实人工智能发展底座、深化融合应用创新推广、增强信息通信行业治理能力等四个方面部署17项具体任务，进一步促进人工智能与信息通信融合创新发展。\n数据显示，目前我国5G基站总数已达500.9万个，400Gbps广域长距传输现网部署应用，智能算力规模达1882　EFLOPS（FP16），为我国AI的发展和普及应用提供了坚实底座。在5G、光网等提供网络连接基础上，积极引入AI技术充分释放数据价值，为行业用户提供更加综合化的新型信息服务，形成机器视觉检测、精准设备控制等一批典型应用场景。\n工业和信息化部信息通信发展司相关负责人表示，人工智能技术正处于快速迭代、加速突破的爆发期，人工智能与信息通信深度融合作为新兴研究方向，具有较强的复杂性与系统性，在关键技术突破、融合路径探索、商业模式创新等方面仍面临系列问题和挑战。\n《实施意见》结合人工智能与信息通信发展基础和演进趋势，重点从高价值场景、典型应用、支撑底座等方面提出未来发展目标。\n具体而言，到2028年，人工智能与信息通信初步构建融合互促的创新发展格局，信息通信智能运营和服务能力达到国际先进水平，信息通信网络初步实现高等级自智，形成30个以上高价值典型场景，打造一批典型应用和特色智能体。网络、算力等信息基础设施支撑人工智能能力进一步提升，城域算力1毫秒时延圈覆盖率不低于75%。到2030年，“人工智能+信息通信”步入技术引领、产业繁荣、安全可靠、智能普惠的发展新阶段。\n围绕夯实人工智能发展底座，《实施意见》聚焦网络、算力、算网供给提出具体举措。包括，加快建设400Gbps/800Gbps等骨干传输网络，有序推进城域400Gbps及以上高速光传输系统设备应用，构建城域毫秒级低时延入算能力。构建枢纽—区域—边缘三级节点协同的算力设施体系，建立完善国家和区域算力平台，加快构建全国一体化、集约化、市场化的算力服务体系。\n围绕信息通信业与AI融合赋能千行百业，《实施意见》提出打造网智融合新终端、丰富信息消费新场景、赋能垂直行业提质升级、推动社会民生智能普惠等四项具体举措。其中明确，加强具身智能与信息通信融合创新。大力发展人工智能手机和电脑、智能家居设备、智能穿戴设备等产品。鼓励基础电信企业积极利用人工智能赋能传统电信业务，深化智慧个人助理、智慧管家、家庭看护等人工智能应用。\n《实施意见》提出强化组织实施、加大支持力度、加强国际合作、开展宣传推广等保障措施。其中明确，加大支持力度，通过多种资金渠道支持网络智能化关键技术和产品研发攻关。\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n雄安日记丨踏上“昼伏夜出”的京雄快线联调联试机车\n走进小城看消费丨浙江温岭：“留量磁场”的三个密码\n记者手记丨探寻“嘟嘟农机”中的农业新质生产力密码\n这所小学，连续10年“玩”成全县第一\n美伊互袭，危险边缘的“可控对抗”\n京广线集中修：大机捣固＋铝热焊硬核施工\nVlog丨逐浪津门 外籍友人邂逅开放与美育\n“人工智能+信息通信”创新发展部署17项任务","tp":"AI通信政策","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"工业和信息化部印发《\"人工智能+信息通信\"创新发展实施意见（2026—2028年）》，围绕信息通信智能化升级、AI发展底座、融合应用创新、行业治理四方面部署17项任务。目前我国5G基站达500.9万个，智能算力规模达1882 EFLOPS，为AI与信息通信融合提供坚实基础。"},{"t":"“隐藏的英雄”肽保护农作物免受突如其来的寒冷","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01754-8","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"A protein signal remains silent under normal conditions but is activated under cold stress to protect developing pollen. This ‘on-demand’ resilience mechanism could enable the development of ‘climate smart’ crops that maintain high yields in good years and food security under climate stress. A peptide signal ensures that, in cold conditions, developing pollen receives nutrients at the right time.","tp":"抗寒肽信号","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现一种肽信号在正常条件下保持沉默，但在寒冷胁迫下被激活，保护发育中的花粉。该\"按需\"韧性机制确保低温下花粉能及时获得营养，有望用于培育在气候胁迫下仍能保障粮食安全的\"气候智能型\"作物，对应对极端气候下的农业风险具有重要意义。"},{"t":"“足球运动员不是超级英雄”：我们必须应对精英运动带来的精神和身体压力","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01865-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"As the men’s football World Cup gets under way, how the game weighs on the health of athletes still isn’t talked about enough, says player-turned-medic Vincent Gouttebarge. As the men’s football World Cup gets under way, how the game weighs on the health of athletes still isn’t talked about enough, says player-turned-medic Vincent Gouttebarge."},{"t":"iOS 26 泄密案迎来转折？苹果与爆料博主普罗瑟共同申请撤销“缺席判决”","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/219.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 11 日消息，据外媒 macrumors 今天（11 日）晚间报道，苹果和爆料博主乔恩 · 普罗瑟已\n共同请求联邦法院撤销去年 10 月针对普罗瑟作出的缺席判决\n。根据双方安排，普罗瑟同意交出\n苹果于 2025 年 7 月起诉普罗瑟和迈克尔 · 拉马乔蒂，指控二人盗用商业秘密。\n普罗瑟此前曾发布视频，展示根据 iOS 26 “液态玻璃”设计重新制作的渲染图，公开时间\n。苹果在起诉书中称，拉马乔蒂\n秘密访问苹果软件工程师伊森 · 利普尼克的\n，并向普罗瑟展示预发布版本软件，以换取报酬。利普尼克随后\n普罗瑟未能在期限内正式回应苹果起诉书，苹果律师申请了缺席判决，法院于 2025 年 10 月作出缺席判决。普罗瑟此后告诉 The Verge，自己“从本案最初阶段起\n不过，接下来几个月，案件进展并未明显改善。4 月提交的联合状态报告显示，普罗瑟仍未按要求配合证据开示，苹果因此请求法院下令强制履行。文件显示，普罗瑟虽然提交了部分材料，但没有完整回应部分请求，对另一些请求则完全没有回应。\n相比之下，拉马乔蒂的配合程度更高。拉马乔蒂允许苹果对另一台设备进行取证审查，同意补充回答书面质询，并表示愿意再次接受证言录取。苹果和拉马乔蒂至少从去年 10 月起就一直在非正式讨论可能的和解。\n普罗瑟直到 2026 年 4 月 14 日才聘请律师。根据 6 月 9 日提交的联合约定，苹果曾在 2026 年 1 月向普罗瑟送达传票，要求普罗瑟提交与苹果针对拉马乔蒂指控有关的文件，并接受证言录取。但普罗瑟此前并未完整回应文件传票，也没有接受证言录取。\n按照协议，普罗瑟承诺在 2026 年 6 月 9 日前提交所有符合苹果文件传票要求的材料，并最迟在 2026 年 6 月 16 日接受证言录取。苹果表示，撤销缺席判决是“\n在不进一步拖延的情况下推进本案的最高效方式\n这项约定仍需美国加利福尼亚北区联邦地区法院批准。如果法院批准，普罗瑟将在命令作出后 10 天内提交对苹果起诉书的回应状，\n首次获得正式机会对苹果指控提出抗辩\n提前泄露苹果 iOS 26 机密信息，美国法院对科技博主普罗瑟做出“缺席判决”"},{"t":"小米获批生产增程式电动汽车，计划推出全尺寸SUV以对标理想汽车","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/11/xiaomi-extended-range-suv-skynomad-erev-regulatory-approval/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"政策监管","tp":"增程式电动车","kp":["车型[小米增程SUV]: 全尺寸SUV代号Kunlun N3","车长[增程SUV]: >5.3m"],"as":"中国工信部已批准小米汽车生产增程式电动车（EREV）资质。小米计划推出一款全尺寸SUV，直接对标理想汽车等增程式电动车型厂商。此举意味着小米在纯电SU7之后进一步拓展动力路线布局，进入增程赛道，以覆盖长途出行需求、提升市场竞争力。增程技术在中国新能源市场正成为重要增长点。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Xiaomi gets approval to build extended-range EVs, plans full-size SUV to rival Li Auto","b":"Fred Lambert\n| Jun 11 2026 - 6:17 am PT\nChina’s Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT) granted Xiaomi regulatory approval to produce extended-range electric vehicles (EREVs), clearing a key hurdle for the company’s expansion beyond battery-only EVs.\nThe approval paves the way for Xiaomi’s first range-extended model — a full-size SUV codenamed “Kunlun N3” that measures over 5.3 meters long and targets Li Auto’s dominant L9.\nUntil now, Xiaomi has sold only battery electric vehicles: the\nSU7 sedan, which outsold the Tesla Model 3 in China earlier this year\nYU7 SUV that undercuts the Tesla Model Y by $4,350\nAdding extended-range powertrains is a strategic pivot. EREVs, which pair a battery pack with a small internal combustion engine that acts as a generator, have become enormously popular in China, particularly for large family SUVs where range anxiety remains a barrier.\nThe MIIT filing was published Wednesday, with a public comment period running through June 17 before final approval.\nAccording to Chinese media outlet 21jingji, the first extended-range model carries the internal codename “Kunlun N3” and could launch under a new sub-brand called\n, targeting the family-oriented SUV segment that Xiaomi’s sporty SU7 and YU7 don’t address.\nHere are the key specs reported so far:\nXiaomi president Lu Weibing confirmed on the company’s Q1 earnings call that a new “mid to large-size model” built on a completely new platform will launch in H2 2026, with “multiple derivative versions.”\nThe target is clear: Li Auto and Huawei-backed Aito, which together dominated China’s extended-range SUV market in 2025, capturing seven of the top 10 best-selling EREV SUVs.\nLi Auto just launched its updated L9 flagship in May with a 72.7 kWh battery, 420 km of pure electric range, and a combined range of 1,650 km — priced from 459,800 yuan ($67,600). But the L9 has been struggling: deliveries plunged 74% year-over-year in the first four months of 2026, totaling just 4,131 units.\nHuawei-backed Aito’s M9, meanwhile, remains the top-selling luxury car in China above 500,000 yuan for two consecutive years, with cumulative deliveries exceeding 280,000 units. Its updated version secured 50,000 pre-orders before even launching in May.\nXiaomi’s Kunlun N3 appears positioned to slot below the M9 in price while competing directly with the L9 on size and capability. With a 70+ kWh battery offering 400–500 km of electric range, the specs are competitive with both.\nThe EREV push is part of a broader product blitz. Xiaomi plans to launch four new models in 2026: the\nrefreshed SU7 with 902 km range\n, an SU7 Executive Edition, and two extended-range SUVs (five-seat and seven-seat variants).\nThe company set a 2026 delivery target of 550,000 units, up 34% from the roughly 410,000 it delivered in 2025. But the pace so far suggests that target is ambitious: January through May deliveries totaled 150,317 units, up just 13.5% year-over-year. Xiaomi delivered 32,759 vehicles in May alone — a 17% year-over-year increase but a 10.7% decline from April.\nGetting two entirely new EREV models to market in the second half of the year would be an aggressive timeline, but it’s exactly the kind of volume boost Xiaomi needs to close the gap on its annual target.\nXiaomi moving into extended-range vehicles makes a lot of sense. The company has proven it can build compelling pure EVs — the\nnext-gen SU7 with 902 km of range\nis genuinely impressive, and the YU7 just\nset the Nürburgring SUV record\n. But there’s a massive segment of Chinese buyers who want large family SUVs with 1,000+ km of combined range, and pure BEVs still can’t fully serve that need.\nThe “Skynomad” sub-brand approach is interesting. It signals Xiaomi wants to separate the sporty, tech-forward identity of the SU7/YU7 lineup from the family-oriented positioning of the EREV models. Li Auto built its entire brand around the family SUV niche, and competing head-on under the same Xiaomi umbrella could dilute the brand’s identity.\nf you’re looking to cut your own energy costs, home solar remains one of the smartest investments you can make. With electricity rates climbing nearly 10% last year, home solar protects you against future rate increases. And with lease and PPA options, you can go solar with zero upfront cost and start saving immediately. If you want to find the best deal, check out\n. It’s a free service with hundreds of pre-vetted installers competing for your business, so you save 20 to 30% compared to going it alone. No sales calls until you pick an installer.\nGet your free quotes here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nFred is the Editor in Chief and Main Writer at Electrek.\nThrough Zalkon.com, you can check out Fred’s portfolio and get monthly green stock investment ideas.\nGet an edge on MMA with the best stats\nEnergySage helps you get the best price possible on a home solar installation for free and without hassel."},{"t":"由于收入和利润率下降，Xbox 计划裁员","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/xbox-plans-layoffs-revenue-profit-margins-decline","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Xbox Plans Layoffs as Revenue, Profit Margins Decline — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"瓦锡兰在西班牙电网验证100%纯氢发动机","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://hydrogentechworld.com/wartsila-validates-100-hydrogen-engine-on-spanish-grid","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/火电","a":"Hydrogen Tech World","tg":"技术突破","tp":"纯氢发动机","kp":["[氢发动机]: 100%纯氢在西班牙电网验证"],"dp":1,"as":"瓦锡兰在西班牙电网成功验证了100%纯氢发动机，同时相关专家分享了关于绿氢的见解。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.5,"d":4.0,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Wärtsilä validates 100% hydrogen engine on Spanish grid","b":"Neles experts’ views on green hydrogen"},{"t":"为什么微软及Anthropic的其他客户暂缓使用Claude Fable","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/ai-agenda/microsoft-anthropic-customers-held-using-claude-fable","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","as":"文章探讨了微软及Anthropic的其他客户暂缓使用Claude Fable的原因及背景。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"大模型应用","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":1.5,"t":7.5},"ot":"Why Microsoft and Other Anthropic Customers Held Off On Using Claude Fable","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"为什么中国正押注大型核反应堆","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/11/1138789/china-big-nuclear-reactors/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","tp":"大型核电站","kp":["装机容量[中国核电]: 近60GW","反应堆类型[新建机组]: GW级压水堆","建设速度[中国vs美国]: 2016年来近翻倍 vs 仅2台"],"as":"文章分析中国为何重点发展大型核反应堆。与西方核电工业进展缓慢形成鲜明对比，中国大型核电站建设速度惊人，正以规模化、标准化方式快速推进。这背后是中国能源安全、碳中和目标与工业体系能力共同驱动的战略选择，文章对比了中美两国核电产业截然不同的发展轨迹与制度因素。","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Why China is betting on big nuclear reactors","b":"EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\nIt’s a tale of two nuclear industries.\nIn China, large reactors are coming together at a stunning pace. The country has nearly doubled its nuclear fleet since 2016, reaching nearly 60 gigawatts of total power capacity. The new facilities are nearly all gigawatt-scale pressurized-water reactors.\nMeanwhile, the US has built just two reactors in that time—Unit 3 and Unit 4 at Plant Vogtle in Georgia. Smaller reactors are attracting a lot of excitement and investment, though. A microreactor developer just saw its reactor reach criticality in a new Department of Energy pilot program.\nThe world is racing to meet rising electricity demand, and many countries are interested in energy sources, like nuclear power, that don’t come with greenhouse-gas emissions. The key question: Which of these strategies will really pay off in terms of getting electrons on the grid quickly?\nToday, the US and France are known as leaders in the nuclear industry. The US has the world’s largest fleet, with France coming in second. France is heavily dependent on nuclear for its grid—about two-thirds of the country’s power comes from nuclear reactors.\nBut they have hardly added any new reactors to their fleets in recent years. The US can point only to Vogtle, and France connected its latest reactor to the grid in December 2024—the first in over 20 years.\nIt’s incredibly difficult to build the massive projects that dominate the nuclear industry today. Up-front investment can run well into the billions, so investors need to wait decades to break even. Designs are complex and can often change during the regulatory process, tacking on cost and time.\nMany are hoping that the key to turning things around in these countries could be smaller reactors.\nThe idea is that shrinking the footprint of a reactor cuts down the initial investment needed to prove out the new technology. The reactors could even be put together in a factory rather than being built on-site, allowing for a lower price over time.\nThese smaller reactors are the target of tons of interest and investment in the US, including a new Department of Energy pilot program. The department set a goal last year of having three test reactors reach criticality by July 4, 2026, the nation’s 250th anniversary. (Criticality is the point at which a reactor achieves a self-sustaining chain reaction that can release energy.)\nLast week, California-based Antares hit the milestone with its Mark-0 reactor.\nThe company plans to eventually build microreactors, designed to produce between 100 kilowatts and 1 megawatt of electricity (large reactors on the grid today are at least 1,000 times that size). The core design is a sodium-cooled reactor, and it uses TRISO fuel, self-contained graphite-coated spheres of a more concentrated fuel than what most reactors use today.\nBut there is still a long way to go before it can actually produce power—the Mark-0 doesn’t have any power conversion or heat removal systems. The company plans to produce electricity in late 2027 and deploy in the field by 2028, CEO Jordan Bramble\ntold the Associated Press\nThe private sector is interested—and invested—too. Big Tech companies are\nthrowing money at new reactors\nthey hope can help power data centers.\nBut look to the other side of the globe, and others are sticking with the established blueprint: China is absolutely churning out large nuclear reactors. Construction started on six new reactors there in 2025, and two more got underway in the first five months of 2026. The country is on course to overtake both the US and the European Union in installed nuclear capacity by 2030.\nThe speed here is staggering. As of 2024, the average time to build a new reactor in China came in at between five and seven years. The global average is about nine years, and the two most recent reactors in the US took about 15 years.\nOne key to this speed is standardization: China has set up a uniform project management system to design, license, and build new reactors. They’re built in batches of six or more to take advantage of economies of scale.\nIt’s one of the ideas meant to give the edge to smaller reactors, but China is working to realize the same benefits for larger projects. A huge amount of government investment is certainly helping.\nLarger reactors generally provide more electricity to the grid for a lower price, a key consideration in view of China’s steeply increasing electricity demand. While smaller reactors require less up-front investment than larger ones because of their size, they’ll actually be more expensive per unit of electricity produced.\nThat’s not to say China is exclusively focused on big reactors: the country is also expected to see its first operational small modular reactor, the Linglong-1, start sending power to the grid this year.\nBut looking ahead, it’ll be interesting to see if smaller reactors can help the West keep building new nuclear power. At the moment, with China’s quick progress, it’s looking as if bigger might just be better.\nThis article is from The Spark,\nMIT Technology Review\n’s weekly climate newsletter. To receive it in your inbox every Wednesday,\nPlug-in panels are getting popular—how do we make sure they’re safe?\nThe good news is it’s a problem we can solve if we want to.\nTo understand what the future holds for Earth’s northernmost waters, scientists are burrowing deep below the seabed.\nStartup Rock Zero is commercializing the research, which could cut costs and carbon emissions from lithium production.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more."},{"t":"全基因组复制塑造了脊椎动物大脑中的细胞类型进化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10629-x","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The complex brains of vertebrates have more cell types than those of their closest relatives. Whole-genome duplications (WGDs) occurred during early vertebrate evolution1, but it is unclear whether the duplicated genes (ohnologues) facilitated cell-type evolution. Here using brain single-cell transcriptomes from five chordates—human2, mouse3, lizard4, lamprey5 and amphioxus—we report that many cell-type families with conserved core transcription factors in vertebrates do not show one-to-one homology with amphioxus. Moreover, ohnologues, particularly those from the first WGD, were more important than small-scale duplication paralogues for vertebrate cell-type evolution. To explore whether ohnologues are mechanistically important for this process, we predicted ancestral cell-type states and compared them to amphioxus and experimentally investigated macroglia. The findings indicate that ohnologues had a role in early vertebrate cell-type diversification. Moreover, by examining paralogue expression across cell types and species, we show that expression changes were mainly driven by dosage selection and subfunctionalization. We also link ohnologues to cellular diversity at different anatomical and cell-type scales. Our findings demonstrate the importance of WGDs for the evolution of early vertebrate brain complexity and highlight that the resultant ohnologues continued to capacitate cell-type evolution long after they were formed.","tp":"基因组脑进化","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":1.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"脊椎动物的大脑比其近亲拥有更复杂的细胞类型。这项研究通过对人类、小鼠、蜥蜴、七鳃鳗和文昌鱼五种脊索动物的大脑单细胞转录组进行分析，探讨了早期脊椎动物进化中发生的全基因组复制（WGD）是否促进了细胞类型的演化。研究发现，在脊椎动物中，许多具有保守核心转录因子的细胞类型家族并未表现出简单的一对一同源关系。这表明全基因组复制产生的重复基因在推动脊椎动物大脑细胞类型的多样化与进化过程中可能发挥了关键的驱动作用。"},{"t":"观察催化过程的动态游走","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02089-4","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化原位成像","kp":["空间分辨率[干涉电光显微镜]: 50nm","时间分辨率[干涉电光显微镜]: 10ms","[发现]: MoS2析氢沿特定晶向传播"],"as":"研究关注电催化表面的动态行为，开发了能够在较大面积上关联纳米尺度电流与结构变化的方法。电催化表面在工作条件下处于动态演变中，但以往缺乏将微观结构与宏观电流性能实时对应的技术手段。该工作为揭示催化剂在实际反应中的结构-活性关系提供了新观测途径。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Watching catalysis take a walk","b":"Electrocatalytic surfaces are dynamic, but few methods correlate nanometre-scale current with structure across large areas. Interferometric electro-optical microscopy now images electrochemical currents at 50 nm and 10 ms resolution, revealing that hydrogen evolution on MoS2 initiates and propagates along specific crystallographic directions."},{"t":"在东南极洲数英里的冰层下发现巨大的隐藏结构","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/?p=522144","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Scientists have discovered a colossal hidden structure beneath Antarctica that could reshape our understanding of the continent’s past and present.\nScientists have identified a massive hidden geological formation beneath East Antarctica, revealing a continent-scale structure buried under some of the thickest ice on Earth.\nThe discovery was made by an international team of researchers that included scientists from the University of Cambridge’s Department of Geography. Their findings show that several well-known subglacial basins are actually connected as part of a single enormous system.\nThe newly identified feature consists of a network of huge basins concealed beneath the East Antarctic Ice Sheet, where ice exceeds three kilometers (about two miles) in thickness in some locations.\nTaken together, these basins form a vast fan-shaped pattern stretching across a large portion of the continent. Researchers have named the formation the East Antarctic Fan-shaped Basin Province.\nThe province includes several of Antarctica’s most famous hidden features, including the Wilkes Basin, the Aurora Basin, and the basin that contains Lake Vostok, the largest known subglacial lake on Earth.\nAlthough scientists have studied these basins individually for many years, this is the first time they have been recognized as parts of a single connected geological structure.\nThe research suggests the formation developed through a mechanism known as distributed rotational extension.\nIn this process, continental crust stretches outward from a central location. The researchers compare the pattern to a hand. The base of the thumb remains relatively fixed while the fingers spread apart. The spaces that open between the fingers resemble the triangular basins that formed as the crust expanded.\nAccording to the team, the East Antarctic Fan-shaped Basin Province may represent one of the largest examples of rotational extension ever identified within continental crust.\nScientists believe the structure formed through multiple tectonic episodes associated with the evolution of Gondwana, the ancient supercontinent that once united Antarctica with several other landmasses.\nThe feature may also be linked to the later separation of Antarctica and Australia, and researchers suggest it could even have influenced that breakup.\nThe discovery raises several important questions, including exactly when the structure formed and what geological forces drove its development.\nBeyond helping scientists reconstruct Antarctica’s distant past, the finding could also have modern-day implications.\nThe shape of the bedrock beneath the ice sheet still affects how ice moves across the continent. It also influences the locations of subglacial lakes and basins. As a result, the hidden landscape may play a role in the stability of parts of the Antarctic Ice Sheet that are particularly vulnerable to climate change.\nTo investigate the newly recognized structure, the researchers combined multiple types of evidence, including subglacial topography, geological observations, gravity measurements, magnetic data, seismic information, and models of the crust and lithosphere.\nTheir analysis indicates that the fan-shaped basin system is the surface expression of deep tectonic processes that occurred within Antarctica’s lithosphere.\nDr. Guy Paxman of the University of Cambridge’s Department of Geography was a member of the research team. He led efforts to model what East Antarctica’s landscape would look like if its ice sheet were to disappear entirely.\nRemoving the ice would allow the land beneath to rebound upward by as much as one kilometer. Researchers used this reconstructed “rebounded topography” to examine the elevation and orientation of the newly identified structure.\nReference: “A fan-shaped subglacial basin province in East Antarctica formed by rotational extension” by Egidio Armadillo, Daniele Rizzello, Pietro Balbi, Alessandro Ghirotto, Davide Scafidi, Guy J. G. Paxman, Andrea Zunino, Fausto Ferraccioli, Laura Crispini, Andreas Läufer, Frank Lisker, Antonia Ruppel, Danilo Morelli and Martin Siegert, 3 June 2026,\nNature Geoscience\nDOI: 10.1038/s41561-026-01991-6\nThe study was led by Dr. Egidio Armadillo of the University of Genoa and was supported by the Italian National Antarctic Research Program.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nDurham University\nUnlocking the Secrets of Thwaites: The Glacier That’s Rewriting Climate History\nChilling Revelations: Ancient Landscape Discovered Beneath East Antarctic Ice Sheet\nUncovering the Past: The Most Detailed Look Yet at Earth’s Climatic History\nNew Research Flips Our Understanding of Ice Age Frequency\nEnding the Debate: New Research Solves Longstanding Antarctic Climate Change Mystery\nSpectacular Ice Age Landscapes Beneath the North Sea Revealed by 3D Seismic “MRI” Scans\nMicrometeorites: More Than 5,000 Tons of Extraterrestrial Dust Falls to Earth Each Year\nIce Loss Likely to Continue in Antarctica, Even if Climate Change Is Brought Under Control\nNASA Study Reveals West Antarctic Glaciers in Irreversible State of Decline","tp":"南极地质发现","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.5},"as":"一个包括剑桥大学地理系学者在内的国际研究团队在南极洲冰盖深处发现了一个巨大的隐藏地质构造。该地质结构位于东南极洲地球上最厚的冰层之下，其规模达到了大陆级别。这一重大发现有望重塑科学界对南极大陆过去地质演变历史及其当前地下结构的认知，为进一步研究地球深层地质构造和冰盖演化提供了全新的方向和线索。"},{"t":"通过协同界面脱氯和有机自由基稳定化将水污染物升级回收为长链聚合物","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3215238?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵氧化物催化剂","kp":["催化剂[污染物聚合升级]: HEO@NC氮掺杂碳包覆高熵氧化物","合成方法[HEO@NC]: 原位碳热还原","氧化剂[选择性聚合]: 高碘酸盐活化"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出利用高熵氧化物（HEOs）的独特电子结构——源于晶格畸变和多金属协同效应——通过协同界面脱氯与氧化反应，将水体污染物升级转化为长链聚合物。该策略实现了污染物的高值化回收，为水污染治理与聚合物合成开辟了兼具环境治理与材料制造双重价值的新路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Upcycling Water Pollutants Into Long‐Chain Polymers via Synergistic Interfacial Dechlorination and Organic Radical Stabi","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy oxides (HEOs) offer unusual electronic structures arising from lattice distortion, multimetal synergy, and high chemical stability. Here we report nitrogen‐doped carbon‐encapsulated HEOs catalysts (HEO@NC) synthesized by in situ carbothermal reduction for efficient pollutant removal and upcycling through selective oxidative polymerization. HEO@NC activates periodate via an electron‐transfer pathway coupled with surface‐adsorbed hydroxyl radicals, enabling the selective conversion of phenolic contaminants into polymeric products under extreme pH and strong ionic interference. Relative to metal‐free nitrogen‐doped carbon, HEO@NC markedly enhances periodate activation through interfacial electronic coupling and achieves a periodate utilization efficiency of 449.2%, far exceeding that of conventional mineralization. Density functional theory and experimental analyses reveal complementary roles of the HEOs components: Co/Ni provide periodate‐binding sites, Pt lowers the barrier for electron transport, Bi/Pb promote charge delocalization to stabilize polymeric intermediates, and oxygen orbitals strengthen periodate coordination and surface charge transfer via\n                    p\n                    –\n                    d\n                    hybridization. This synergy drives dechlorination‐coupled polymerization with sustained 4‐chlorophenol removal at ultralow oxidant consumption. HEO@NC further maintained &gt; 95% efficiency with negligible metal leaching during 20‐day treatment of real coal chemical wastewater, demonstrating the potential for sustainable and low‐chemical‐consumption remediation of industrial‐relevant wastewater."},{"t":"利用古代 DNA 揭示潘诺尼亚后罗马政体形成的复杂性","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aec2634?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The transformation of the Roman world [fourth to ninth centuries common era (CE)], culminating in the Western Roman Empire’s fall, marked a fundamental transition in European history. Key questions persist regarding the regionally specific nature of this transformation. We generated a paleogenomic dataset to reconstruct post-Roman organizations in the Little Hungarian Plain at microregional resolution. Genetic and archaeological analyses of two Roman (\n                    n\n                    = 68) and five post-Roman (\n                    n\n                    = 246) sites reveal a rise in Northern European ancestry, reflecting large-scale population movements into this region. Moreover, despite post-Roman sites sharing similar genetic profiles, material culture, and burial practices, they show distinct social structures, especially regarding the role played by biological relatedness. These findings highlight local hierarchies and reveal the making of a post-Roman polity.","tp":"古DNA罗马史","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"罗马帝国的衰落是欧洲历史的重大转折点，但这一转变在具体区域上的表现形式仍存在诸多疑问。为深入探究此问题，研究人员生成了一套古基因组（古DNA）数据集，以微观区域的分辨率重建了“小匈牙利平原”（潘诺尼亚平原）在后罗马时代的族群演变与政权组织形式。通过对两处罗马时期遗址的遗传学和考古学综合分析，该研究揭示了罗马世界转型期欧洲人口结构与社会的复杂性。"},{"t":"解锁耐用型高功率锌空气电池：{Fe3O}分子炉锻造的双位点催化剂实现协同作用","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6643887?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[锌空气电池ORR]: Fe3O分子炉锻造双位点催化剂"],"dp":1,"as":"研究将原子级精度的金属-氧簇（{Fe3O}分子炉）作为连接单原子与纳米颗粒的桥梁，构建双位点催化剂用于锌空气电池。该催化剂兼具耐久性与高功率输出能力，有效解决了锌空气电池中空气正极氧还原/析出反应催化活性与稳定性难以兼顾的难题，为高性能锌空气电池的实用化提供了新催化策略。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Unlocking Durable High‐Power Zn‐Air Batteries: {Fe3O} Molecular Furnace‐Forged Dual‐Site Catalysts Enabling Synergistic ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Atomic‐level precision metal‐oxo clusters serve as a unique bridge linking single atoms and nanoparticles. Their highly ordered, quasi‐molecular structure effectively promotes electron transfer and optimizes charge deposition kinetics, thereby significantly enhancing the catalytic activity and stability of electrochemical oxygen reduction reactions. Here, we constructed a single‐atom‐nanoparticle dual‐engine catalyst (Fe\n                    3\n                    C/Fe‐NC\n                    1050\n                    ) by in situ domain‐confined complexation of ZIF‐8(Zn) using {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} as a core metal‐oxo cluster. The unique flexible ligand‐carboxylate group of {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} clusters provide a protective barrier for the metal atoms distribution during pyrolysis, work in synergy with the ZIF‐8 framework to provide a conductive substrate. The precisely exposed Fe\n                    3\n                    C (110) crystal plane modulates the electronic structure of neighboring Fe‐N\n                    4\n                    active sites, thus reducing the adsorption energy of key step O\n                    2\n                    →*OOH and endowing the material with excellent methanol resistance and stability. Structural characterization and theoretical calculations reveal that the synergistic interaction between {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} clusters and the carbon substrate provides a stable conductive network and active sites, achieving a maximum power density of 249.0 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in alkaline zinc‐air batteries and demonstrates exceptionally long cycle life of 700 h at the current density of 2.0 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . This design provides crucial insights for the nanoengineering of metal‐oxo clusters and atomic‐scale design of catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"出乎意料的高熵垒控制着动态共价聚合物（Vitrimer）中的化学键重排","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00232-8?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"vitrimer动态网络","kp":["[键交换机制]: 罕见键几何构型形成主导熵势垒"],"as":"研究揭示了vitrimers（动态共价网络聚合物）中键交换反应受一个意想不到的大熵势垒主导。研究发现罕见且高度特异的键几何构型在键交换中形成主导性熵垒，这一发现修正了对vitrimer重组动力学机制的传统认识，对设计可控再加工、可修复的热固性聚合物材料具有重要理论指导意义。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Unexpectedly large entropic barrier controls bond rearrangements in vitrimers","b":"This work reveals that rare, highly specific bond geometries create a dominant entropic barrier for bond exchange in vitrimers, redefining how dynamic network rearrangements are understood and enabling more predictive design of dynamic materials."},{"t":"通过N-杂环卡宾制备超薄且高度绝缘的芳香族单分子层","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4614418?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机栅极介电层","kp":["材料[有机栅介质]: N-杂环卡宾芳族单层","特性[有机场介质]: 超薄高绝缘低栅漏电流"],"dp":1,"as":"研究利用N-杂环卡宾（NHC）制备出超薄且高绝缘的芳香族单分子层。有机电子器件的性能高度依赖于有机栅极介电材料的质量，该超薄自组装单分子层兼具优异绝缘性与纳米级厚度，可作为高性能有机栅介电层，有助于提升有机晶体管等器件的性能与集成度，推动柔性电子学发展。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultra‐Thin and Highly Insulating Aromatic Monolayers by N‐Heterocyclic Carbenes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The efficiency of organic electronic devices relies on application of organic gate dielectric materials. Such organic films should exhibit high chemical/thermal stability, aromatic functionality compatible with organic semiconductors, and low gate leakage currents in combination with low thickness to reduce the operating voltage. An interesting class of materials for such applications are self‐assembled monolayers (SAMs) among which the\n                    N\n                    ‐heterocyclic carbenes (NHC) are known for their high chemical/thermal stability. The conductivity of NHC SAMs, however, has been sparsely explored and their electrical properties remain controversial. Here we report conductivity analysis for a well‐defined series of aromatic NHC SAMs. Our data show that all analyzed monolayers are highly insulating and in particular the shortest possible NHC of just ∼3.3 Å is by 5 orders of magnitude more insulating than standard insulators based on alkanethiolate SAM of the same length. Our calculations indicate the absence of destructive quantum interference (DQI) effect which has been considered responsible for suppression of conductivity in aromatic molecules. The suppression of SAMs conductivity just via selection of the imidazolium‐based bonding group is conceptually simpler opening possibility of using NHC SAMs as an ultra‐thin, and exceptionally insulating, aromatic monolayers for functionalization of the gate electrodes."},{"t":"窄带磷光发光体实现接近BT.2020色域的超稳定绿光顶发射OLED","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed4859?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"绿光顶发射OLED","kp":["发光体[绿光OLED]: 四齿Pt(II)配合物","色域[OLED]: 接近BT.2020"],"as":"研究开发了超稳定、高效率的绿色顶发射OLED器件，其色域接近BT.2020超高清标准。该成果得益于窄带发射的磷光发光体材料，兼具高色彩纯度与长工作寿命。这对超高清显示、AR/VR等对色域和稳定性要求极高的应用场景具有重要意义，推动了OLED显示技术向更广色域迈进。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultrastable green top-emitting OLEDs approaching BT.2020 enabled by narrowband phosphorescent emitters","b":"Highly stable and efficient organic light-emitting diodes (OLEDs) with high color purity are critical for ultrahigh-definition display applications. However, achieving these characteristics is hindered by the emitter bandwidth and device stability. Herein, we present the design of tetradentate green Pt(II) emitters with a rigid three-dimensional structure via extended π-conjugation and bulky substituents. This molecular engineering approach effectively suppresses excited-state geometric distortion, resulting in a small full width at half-maximum (FWHM) of 16.4 nanometers in toluene. When the emitters were used in a microcavity-enhanced top-emitting device, the FWHM was further reduced to 14.8 nanometers by controlling constructive and destructive interferences. The top-emitting device showed a Broadcast Service Television 2020 (BT.2020) green color [Commission Internationale de l’Éclairage (CIE): 0.22, 0.75] and a high current efficiency of up to 174 candelas per ampere. Most notably, the device exhibited a record-breaking operational stability, exceeding that of the commercial LED/OLED/MicroLED (micro–light-emitting diode) standard, achieving an unprecedented lifetime to 90% of the initial luminance of 540,100 hours at 1000 candelas per square meter.","aip":1},{"t":"由实体瘤标志门控的超声启动来指导 CAR-T 治疗","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed0666?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"CAR-T therapy is highly effective in hematologic malignancies but remains challenging in solid tumors. To address this challenge, here, we developed SHIFTERS (solid-tumor hallmark inducible, focused-ultrasound triggered enhanced reprogramming system), an AND-gated circuit that rewires tumor hallmarks into the clinically validated antigen CD19 under focused-ultrasound (FUS) control. SHIFTERS uses a split Gal4-VP64 transcription factor with one module driven by a hypoxia-responsive promoter and the other by a FUS-inducible heat-shock promoter, restricting CD19 induction to sonicated, hallmark-positive regions. This design enables robust, sustained local CD19 expression to activate and train CD19 synNotch CAR-T cells. In 3D spheroids and in vivo models, hypoxia-gated SHIFTERS combined with synNotch CAR-T cells achieved strong tumor suppression, supporting FUS-guided, localized activation. SHIFTERS is modular and can be adapted to tumor-type–specific promoters such as enAFP in hepatocellular carcinoma to enable both spatial and cell type–specific targeting. Together, SHIFTERS provides a modular, tumor-constrained, ultrasound-controllable platform to improve the precision and efficacy of CAR-T therapy for solid tumors.","tp":"实体瘤免疫","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究开发了SHIFTERS系统——一种AND门控基因电路，将实体瘤标志（如缺氧）转化为临床验证的CD19抗原，并在聚焦超声控制下激活。该系统利用分裂型Gal4-VP64转录因子和缺氧响应启动子，旨在解决CAR-T疗法在实体瘤中的挑战，为精准治疗实体瘤提供了新策略。"},{"t":"家鸡超快速 MC1R 蛋白及相关羽毛颜色演化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605288123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"The domestic chicken exhibits extraordinarily high plumage diversity in sharp contrast to the uniform plumage phenotype in its wild ancestor, the red junglefowl. The\n                    melanocortin-1 receptor\n                    (\n                    MC1R\n                    ) locus is the most variable pigmentation locus in domestic chicken. Here we have analyzed whole-genome sequence data from 10,026 birds, including red junglefowls and 393 populations of domestic chicken. We document ultrarapid evolution of 18\n                    MC1R\n                    alleles, due to the accumulation of 9 missense mutations combined with reshuffling of sequence variants within the single\n                    MC1R\n                    exon. The lack of linkage disequilibrium at the\n                    MC1R\n                    locus strongly suggests that this combinatorial allele diversity is generated by interallelic gene conversion, possibly promoted by its high guanine–cytosine content. Functional analyses of MC1R variants expressed in transfected cells, using second-messenger and bioluminescence resonance energy transfer assays together with homology modeling, demonstrate that most missense mutations have significant effects on MC1R signaling and include both activating and inhibitory changes. One common\n                    MC1R\n                    allele differs by as many as three functionally relevant missense mutations from the most closely related\n                    wild-type\n                    allele, and its phenotype reflects their combined effects. Genome-wide analyses further show that\n                    MC1R\n                    acts as a modifier of dominant white and recessive white phenotypes caused by mutations in\n                    premelanosome protein\n                    and\n                    tyrosinase\n                    , respectively. In both cases,\n                    MC1R\n                    alleles promote a pure white phenotype, either by enhancing eumelanin pigmentation (dominant white) or inhibiting eumelanin pigmentation (recessive white)."},{"t":"超窄间距极性绿光芳香族Dion-Jacobson杂化钙钛矿实现高灵敏和稳定的自供电器件","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73657?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿X射线探测","kp":["材料体系[X射线探测]: DJ型无铅极性杂化钙钛矿(4AMPY)2","特性[DJ钙钛矿]: 超窄层间距、无铅绿色"],"dp":1,"as":"研究设计了一种超窄间距的极性绿色芳香族Dion-Jacobson（DJ）型杂化钙钛矿材料，用于高灵敏度X射线探测。DJ型杂化钙钛矿因结构稳定性好而成为X射线探测的优选材料。该工作通过极性芳香间隔层的精细设计提升了探测灵敏度和稳定性，为低剂量、高分辨X射线成像探测器件开发提供了新材料方案。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultranarrow‐Spaced Polar Green Aromatic Dion–Jacobson Hybrid Perovskite Enables Highly Sensitive and Stable Self‐Powered","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Dion‐Jacobson (DJ) hybrid perovskites are considered as highly promising X‐ray detection materials due to their high stability and short interlayer spacing. However, the large‐scale commercial development of these materials is challenged due to severe ion migration at high voltage and lead toxicity. Here, we successfully obtained a DJ‐type polar lead‐free green hybrid perovskite (4AMPY)\n                    2\n                    AgBiBr\n                    8\n                    (\n                    1\n                    ) by inserting 4‐aminomethylpyridine (4AMPY) aromatic diamine into 3D Cs\n                    2\n                    AgBiBr\n                    6\n                    , and achieved efficient and stable self‐powered X‐ray detection. Specifically, owing to the insertion of 4AMPY,\n                    1\n                    crystallizes in polar space group\n                    P\n                    2\n                    1\n                    and exhibits a significant bulk photovoltaic effect. Additionally, strong hydrogen‐bonding interactions between 4AMPY and adjacent inorganic layers lead to an ultranarrow interlayer spacing of 3.09 Å. Meanwhile, the enhanced electron cloud density in aromatic diamines improves the charge transfer channel of\n                    1\n                    and enhances its X‐ray detection performance. Therefore, among all DJ‐type lead‐free hybrid perovskites,\n                    1\n                    achieves record‐breaking sensitivities of 661.4 and 9465.2 µC Gy\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0 and 100 V, respectively. Importantly,\n                    1\n                    exhibits excellent storage stability, with its sensitivity remaining at 97.5% (0 V) and 96.6% (100 V) of the initial value after three months. This work will greatly promote the development of polar DJ‐type lead‐free perovskite‐based self‐powered X‐ray detectors."},{"t":"基于蜂窝网络形貌的超拉伸且机械坚固的有机光电探测器","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00227-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"可拉伸光电探测器","kp":["形态设计[可拉伸光电探测器]: 弹性体介导蜂窝网络"],"dp":1,"as":"研究开发了一种兼具超拉伸性与高机械韧性的有机光电探测器。该器件通过弹性体介导的蜂窝状网络形貌设计，在大幅拉伸应变下仍保持高性能光探测能力。这种将高光电性能与优异力学柔韧性相结合的策略，对可穿戴电子、柔性健康监测和可拉伸光传感等新兴应用具有重要意义。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultra-stretchable and mechanically robust organic photodetectors enabled by a honeycomb network morphology","b":"An elastomer-mediated honeycomb-like network enables stretchable organic photodetectors that combine high performance with exceptional mechanical robustness. By stabilizing multiscale morphology during deformation, the devices operate reliably under large strain and repeated cycling, providing a promising design route for mechanically reliable wearable optoelectronics."},{"t":"英国热泵安装量在补贴加码下仍陷停滞","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/uk-heat-pump-installations-stall-despite-subsidy-boost/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"pv magazine","as":"据pv magazine报道，英国热泵安装量在补贴加码的情况下仍出现停滞。尽管政府补贴资金持续投入，但2026年第一季度热泵翻新安装总数较此前下降约18%。这反映出在建筑改造成本高、安装能力不足、电力与燃气价格比等结构性障碍下，仅靠补贴难以有效驱动热泵规模化推广。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"热泵装机","kp":["安装量变化[英国热泵2026Q1]: 同比下降18%","政策目标[英国热泵2030]: 45万台/年"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"UK heat pump installations stall despite subsidy boost - pv magazine Global","b":"Applications & Installations\nGrant funding continues but total number of retrofit heat pumps in first quarter of 2026 18% down on same period in 2025. Pace of deployment remains significantly below government’s 2030 target of 450,000 per year.\nMatthew Lynas\nApplications & Installations\nAn operating Aira heat pump | Image: Aira\nThe pace of UK heat pump retrofits has fallen in the first three months of 2026, despite continued subsidy support and an increased grant for those using oil or liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) for home heating.\nNew figures from the Department for Energy Security and Net Zero (DESNZ) record 10,693 retrofit heat pump installations in the first quarter of 2026, 18% lower compared to the previous quarter and a 22% fall against the first three months of 2025. Despite the drop, quarterly installations have more than doubled over a five-year period – with 4,607 recorded for the first quarter of 2021.\nAir-to-water heat pumps dominate the UK retrofit market, accounting for 99% of installations in the first three months of 2026. The most southern regions of the United Kingdom lead on heat pump adoption with southeast England, accounting for 18% of installs, followed by southwest (14%) and east (13%) England.\nNorthern Ireland was the only part of the United Kingdom to see quarter-on-quarter growth in the number of retrofit heat pumps installed in 2026, albeit from low volumes. Nine installations were recorded in the fourth quarter of 2025 compared to 30 in Q1 2026.\nThe pace of heat pump deployment will need to ramp up significantly if the UK government is to achieve its installation targets. The government wants to see at least 450,000 heat pump installations per year by 2030, however just 53,265 were recorded in the DESNZ data for 2025.\nNot all new heat pumps will be captured by government deployment statistics, as the data does not include installations in new-build properties. However, only 4.2% of new dwellings in England had heat pumps according to Office for National Statistics data from October 2025. That is set to change. The UK government’s new building standard for homes will make heat pumps effectively mandatory for new build homes when the regulations are fully applied in 2028.\nThe DESNZ data does not cover uncertified retrofit installations either, although a certified installation is needed to access cash grants, which are the main driver of UK heat pump adoption. The government currently offers GBP 7,500 ($10,000) to households in England and Wales that retrofit with low-carbon heating. Different subsidy support programs are also available in Scotland and Northern Ireland.\nThe grant value for households using oil or LPG to heat their home was also increased as part of a raft of clean energy policies introduced in the wake of the United States and Israel’s conflict with Iran. The government is offering eligible households a GBP 9,000 grant toward a heat pump installation.\nThe UK government’s boiler upgrade scheme (BUS) is open to consumers in England and Wales. The scheme offers grants to support a range of low-carbon heating technologies, provider installations are carried out by a certified installer.\nNote: Grants are not available for hybrid heat pump systems – for example a combination gas boiler and air-source heat pump. Only one grant is available per property and funding cannot be used to replace a low carbon heating system.\nMatthew Lynas\nView author posts"},{"t":"美国机构加入打击“超加工食品”的斗争","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5920?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Some scientists criticize label as imprecise; others call it a valuable lens on diet"},{"t":"电子空穴双层中的双组分激子凝聚","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10636-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Macroscopic quantum coherence emerges when bosons condense into a Bose–Einstein condensate (BEC)1,2,3,4,5. Excitons are a long-sought solid-state route to high-temperature BECs with strong interactions, electrical tunability and potentially multicomponent spinor order, but conclusive evidence for equilibrium condensation has remained elusive. Here we report evidence for two-component exciton BECs in MoSe2/hBN/WSe2 electron–hole bilayers6,7,8,9 by probing the spin–valley susceptibility of constituent electrons and holes. This heterostructure hosts equilibrium exciton fluids with four spin–valley flavours. Magneto-optical spectroscopy in a dilution refrigerator reveals three exciton condensate phases with distinct flavour polarizations. At zero magnetic field, the many-body ground state is a coherent superposition of two condensed intravalley exciton flavours. Under a magnetic field, the intravalley exciton condensate first switches to a two-component intervalley condensate through a first-order quantum phase transition at a weak critical field and then turns into a fully polarized single-component condensate at high fields. The condensate signatures form a dome in density–temperature space, persisting up to approximately 1.8 K. Our results establish van der Waals electron–hole bilayers as a versatile platform for strongly interacting, multicomponent exciton BECs.","tp":"激子凝聚态","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.5,"r":7.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究在MoSe2/hBN/WSe2电子-空穴双层结构中首次报道了双组分激子玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚（BEC）的证据。通过探测激子的自旋-谷磁化率揭示了宏观量子相干性，为固态高温BEC研究提供了重要进展，具有强相互作用、电学可调和多分量自旋序等优势。","aip":1},{"t":"生物系统中的染色体选择性转化：前景和挑战","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.202526148?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Addressing small‐molecule chromophores with bioactive properties has been established as an effective means of controlling biological systems for several decades. However, the complexity of in vitro and especially in vivo systems cannot be matched by a single wavelength of light (de)activating one kind of chromophore. Consequently, developing methods to combine and individually control multiple chromophores within the same system is of high importance. An increasing number of strategies have become available relying on the chromoselective transformation of small molecules. This article features the chromoselective control of photoswitches, photoclick chemistry, and photocages, and highlights perspectives and future challenges to be overcome in the context of biological systems.","tp":"光调控生物","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.5},"as":"本文综述了生物系统中生色团选择性转化的前景与挑战。单一波长光激活单一生色团已无法匹配复杂生物体系需求，开发在同一系统中组合和独立控制多种生色团的方法至关重要。文章讨论了多色团正交光控策略及其在生物精准调控中的应用前景与技术难题。"},{"t":"拓扑调控聚氨酯：从结构设计到新兴应用","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73677?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"拓扑调控聚脲材料","kp":["分子结构[聚氨酯]: 拓扑调控设计"],"as":"聚脲（polyurea）作为一种高性能弹性体材料，因其在抗冲击防护领域的优异表现备受关注。该综述系统梳理了通过拓扑结构调控优化聚脲性能的研究进展，从分子结构设计出发，涵盖嵌段、支化等拓扑策略对力学性能、能量耗散及自修复能力的调控机制，并展望其在装甲防护、防爆涂层等新兴应用领域的前景。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Topology‐Regulated Polyurea: From Structural Design to Emerging Applications","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  As a high‐performance elastomeric material, polyurea has attracted considerable attention for use in impact protection, functional coatings, adhesives, and flexible electronics, primarily owing to its excellent mechanical properties, exceptional high‐strain‐rate response, and chemically tunable molecular architecture. However, the widespread development of polyurea is constrained by several inherent challenges, including the excessively rapid reaction kinetics between isocyanates and amines, limited control of network topology, and restricted functional diversity. In recent years, advances derived from polymer science have enabled notable progress in addressing these limitations. A series of new strategies has been proposed, such as employing low‐reactivity amines or blocking approaches to modulate reaction kinetics, precisely engineering network topology, and systematically broadening the potential application scope. Despite these advances, comprehensive and up‐to‐date reviews that integrate polyurea synthesis methods, topological structural design principles, and application development remain relatively scarce. This review systematically summarizes recent progress in topology‐regulated polyurea, covering its synthesis, preparation, and emerging applications and analyzes the design principles of polyurea's topological structure to clarify key structure–property–performance relationships. Additionally, the review comprehensively outlines cutting‑edge advances in polyurea applications across diverse fields and discusses the main challenges and future prospects for developing next‑generation, high‑performance, and multifunctional polyurea materials."},{"t":"在研究人员提交论文之前工具会标记可疑期刊","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01707-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The free platform, called Journal Trends, could also allow integrity sleuths to spot low-quality publications. The free platform, called Journal Trends, could also allow integrity sleuths to spot low-quality publications."},{"t":"通威推出面向高双面率项目的BIFIMAX组件","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/tongwei-debuts-bifimax-module-for-projects-requiring-high-bifaciality/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"双面光伏组件","kp":["双面率[BIFIMAX组件]: 90±5%","功率[TNC组件]: 670W","成本降低[高双面率]: 0.87欧分/W"],"as":"通威推出BIFIMAX系列组件，专为需要高双面率的项目设计。TNC BIFIMAX 670W组件双面率达90±5%，可降低0.87欧分/瓦的度电成本（CAPEX）。该新品进一步提升双面发电效率，适用于大型地面电站等对背面增益要求较高的应用场景。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Tongwei debuts BIFIMAX module for projects requiring high-bifaciality - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nWith 90±5% bifaciality, TNC BIFIMAX 670 W can reduce CAPEX by 0.87 euro cents per Watt. The new solution, designed for high-latitude, high-albedo markets, will be showcased by Tongwei at this year’s Intersolar Europe in Munich.\nTechnology & Products\nImage: Tongwei\nAt this year’s Intersolar Europe in Munich, Tongwei will debut its new BIFIMAX module variant, which pushes bifaciality from 80% to 90%. The variant is designed for high-latitude, high-albedo markets. It will be applicable across the entire Tongwei TNC family of modules – from TNC 1.0 through TNC 3.0.\nTo accomplish the gains in bifaciality, BIFIMAX incorporates two complementary advances. The first is Tongwei’s Poly Tech，which retains the core POLO passivation layer underneath the electrode but removes the other layers to allow more light to pass through. The second advance is a novel rear-surface light-trapping structure that captures photons that would otherwise escape. As a result, rear-side generation capacity increases by +10 index points, single-watt energy yield improves by 0.6%~0.8%, and low-light performance is boosted by 1.6%.\nThe financial case is grounded in project data. Tongwei tracked the data from a 100 MW ground-mounted solar project with single-axis trackers in Hamburg, Germany, that upgraded from a conventional 625 W module at 80% bifaciality to the TNC BIFIMAX 670 W at 90% bifaciality. The project data showed a CAPEX reduction of 0.87 euro cents per Watt — a 2.63% savings worth approximately €870,000 at the project level — before a single kilowatt-hour had been generated. Data also showed that the LCOE fell by 3.39%, directly strengthening bankability across the project’s entire operating life.\nOver 30 years, BIFIMAX is expected to generate approximately 81,600 MWh more than the baseline — enough to power around 25,000 European households for a year — translating to roughly €180,000 in additional annual revenue.\nWith the launch of the BIFIMAX module variant, Tongwei bolsters its dedication to using its technological expertise to meet the growing demand for solar PV installations across a broad spectrum of terrains and scenarios.\nVisit Tongwei at Intersolar Europe 2026, booth A2.350, to experience the full product lineup.\nView author posts"},{"t":"本届世界杯可能是迄今为止科技含量最高的一届世界杯——值得关注的创新","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01866-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Nature asked a football-journal chief about emerging trends in the sport, from AI tools to PhD students embedded with teams. Nature asked a football-journal chief about emerging trends in the sport, from AI tools to PhD students embedded with teams."},{"t":"这种人工智能设计的“通用疫苗”可以在未来的流行病爆发之前阻止它们","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/this-ai-designed-universal-vaccine-could-stop-future-pandemics-before-they-start/","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"技术突破","b":"A groundbreaking AI-designed vaccine aims to protect against not only today’s coronaviruses, but tomorrow’s as well.\nA new type of universal coronavirus vaccine has passed its first test in humans, marking an important step toward broader protection against future viral threats.\nResearchers from the University of Cambridge and biotechnology company DIOSynVax (DVX) Ltd reported that the experimental vaccine was safe and caused no significant side effects in a clinical trial involving 39 healthy volunteers.\nUnlike traditional vaccines that target a specific\nstrain, this vaccine was designed to provide protection across the wider Sarbeco coronavirus family. This group includes\n, the virus responsible for\n, as well as SARS and related coronaviruses found in bats that could potentially spill over into humans in the future.\nThe findings were published in the\nJournal of Infection\nThe vaccine represents a new approach to vaccine development. Instead of focusing on a single known virus, researchers used\nartificial intelligence\nand computer modeling to create a “super-antigen” capable of triggering immunity against many related viruses at once.\nThe antigen is the active ingredient in a vaccine that trains the immune system to recognize and respond to infection. By identifying genetic features shared across the Sarbeco coronavirus family, scientists designed a synthetic antigen intended to provide broad protection, including against viruses that have not yet emerged.\nThis is the first time a vaccine whose active component was designed entirely through computer simulations has been tested in people.\nAccording to the research team, the technology could eventually be used to develop vaccines against other groups of viruses, including Ebola viruses and influenza viruses.\n“We’ve converted vaccine development from being reactive to being future-proof. Our vaccines will continue to provide protection against viruses even as they mutate into new strains,” said Professor Jonathan Heeney from the Lab of Viral Zoonotics, University of Cambridge’s Department of Veterinary Medicine, the scientific lead of the research.\nHe added: “We’ve overcome the problem of traditional vaccines, which have limited protection. It means we can escape the constant cycle of chasing the virus variants circulating in humans and updating the vaccines to try to catch up, like a dog chasing its tail.”\nVolunteers between the ages of 18 and 50 received the vaccine at National Institute for Health and Care Research (NIHR) Clinical Research Facilities in Southampton and Cambridge. The study was sponsored by University Hospital Southampton NHS Foundation Trust (UHSFT).\nResearchers found that the vaccine generated immune responses not only against SARS-CoV-2 and SARS but also against related bat coronaviruses that could pose future pandemic risks.\nThe vaccine was delivered as a\nvaccine using a microfluidic jet system. This needle-free method may offer an alternative for people who dislike injections and could simplify large-scale vaccination campaigns, particularly in settings where traditional needles are more difficult to use.\nThe vaccine’s design also addresses one of the biggest challenges facing current vaccines. Seasonal flu shots and existing COVID-19 vaccines are based on previously identified virus strains. Because viruses continue to evolve, vaccine protection can decline over time, requiring regular updates and reformulation.\nTo create a universal coronavirus vaccine, researchers analyzed genetic sequence data collected from Sarbeco coronaviruses worldwide. Machine learning was then used to identify features shared across the entire virus family and combine them into a single synthetic antigen.\nBefore entering human testing, the vaccine was evaluated in animal studies, where it produced strong immune responses against multiple coronaviruses.\nAdditional research will be required before the vaccine could become available to the public. The next step will be a larger Phase 2 clinical trial designed to evaluate immune responses in a broader and more diverse group of participants while confirming the vaccine’s ability to generate wide-ranging protection.\nResearchers believe the technology could eventually help transform how the world responds to emerging infectious diseases.\n“Viruses like Influenza, Coronaviruses and the Ebola group are evolving continuously, and by the time vaccines are rolled out, they may be poorly matched – the current “reactive” vaccine system struggles to keep pace,” said Professor Saul Faust from the University of Southampton, the trial’s chief investigator.\nHe added: “This new class of universal vaccines is future-proofed. They not only protect against many variants simultaneously, but potentially against related viruses that haven’t yet emerged and spilt over to humans.\n“If we can develop and clinically advance this new class of vaccines before a virus outbreak begins, millions of lives could be saved, lockdowns avoided and the economy preserved.”\nProfessor Marian Knight, Scientific Director for NIHR Infrastructure, described the trial as a significant milestone.\n“The remarkable success of this AI-designed ‘super-antigen’ trial marks a pivotal leap forward in our ability to deliver broad, lasting viral protection.”\nShe added: “This milestone was only made possible through partnerships between the life sciences sector and our world-class NIHR infrastructure in Cambridge and Southampton, whose Clinical Research Facilities provided the vital expertise and environment needed to safely fast-track this innovation, and bring it one big step closer to patients.”\nAlthough COVID-19 is no longer causing the global disruption seen during the height of the pandemic, coronaviruses remain a public health concern. Many related viruses continue to circulate in animal populations, and scientists cannot predict which one might eventually cross into humans.\nReference: “A phase I, needle free, dose escalation clinical trial of pEVAC-PS, a candidate pan-Sarbecovirus Vaccine” by Alasdair PS Munro, Matteo Ferrari, Rebecca Kinsley, Daniel Egan, Sneha Vishwanath, Thomas Bower, Andrew Chan, Matthew Davies, Joanne Marie M. Del Rosario, Ron Moss, Yvanne Enever, Benedict Asbach, Ralf Wagner, Rachel Bousfield, Krishna Chatterjee, Victoria Cornelius, Saul N. Faust and Jonathan L. Heeney, 18 May 2026,\nJournal of Infection\nDOI: 10.1016/j.jinf.2026.106759\nThe research was primarily funded by Innovate UK.\nDIOSynVax, which stands for Digitally Immune Optimised Synthetic Vaccines, was launched as a University of Cambridge spin out company in 2017 with support from Cambridge Enterprise, the university’s commercialization arm. In addition to coronavirus vaccines, the company is developing vaccine candidates targeting seasonal influenza, pandemic flu threats, and hemorrhagic fever viruses.\nProfessor Jonathan Heeney serves as Professor of Comparative Pathology at the University of Cambridge and is a Fellow of Darwin College.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nArtificial Intelligence\nPublic Health\nUniversity of Cambridge\nCOVID Delta Variant Spread Driven by Combination of Immune Escape and Increased Infectivity\nCommon Molecular Feature of Antibodies That Neutralize SARS-CoV-2 Discovered, Boosting COVID-19 Vaccine Prospects\nEvidence That a Common Childhood Vaccine Helps Prevent Severe Complications of COVID-19\nMMR Vaccine Could Protect Against the Worst COVID-19 Symptoms – “A Low-Risk-High-Reward Preventive Measure”\nNewly Developed Vaccines Protect Against COVID-19 in Macaques Study\nA Polio Vaccine That Hasn’t Been Used in the U.S. for Two Decades Might Protect Against Coronavirus [Video]\nA Review of the Most Promising Strategies for Defeating Coronavirus: Vaccines, Antivirals, Gene Therapies\nPromising MERS Vaccine Candidate Might Be Able to Block Coronavirus Infections\nPromise for COVID-19 Vaccine After Engineered Virus Protects Against MERS in Mice","tp":"广谱抗病毒","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"剑桥大学与DIOSynVax公司联合开发的AI设计\"通用冠状病毒疫苗\"完成首次人体试验。在39名健康志愿者的I期临床试验中，该疫苗安全且无显著副作用。该疫苗不仅针对当前冠状病毒，还旨在防御未来可能出现的病毒变异株，为应对潜在流行病爆发提供前瞻性防护策略。"},{"t":"噻吩工程脂质 II 识别可有效膜解根除 MRSA","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5919230?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Methicillin‐resistant\n                    Staphylococcus aureus\n                    (MRSA) remains a significant global health threat, necessitating the development of new antimicrobials. We report the rational design of a small molecule TPL(II)‐07, that combines multiple functional modules: (i) 2‐phenylthiophene for specific recognition and binding to lipid II, a key intermediate in peptidoglycan biosynthesis; (ii) an adamantane fragment with high interfacial permeability to destabilize lipid packing; (iii) a cationic lysine moiety to disperse biofilms; and (iv) a moderate aliphatic chain to disrupt membrane integrity. Among seven analogues, TPL(II)‐07 exhibited the highest potency, highlighting the synergistic contribution of each component. Mechanistic assays confirmed preferential binding of lipid II, bactericidal potency, biofilm dispersion, and the generation of reactive oxygen species, effective against both drug‐resistant (MIC 19 µM) and drug‐sensitive (MIC 9 µM)\n                    S. aureus\n                    strains. TPL(II)‐07 demonstrated excellent biocompatibility, with IC\n                    50\n                     &gt; 50 mM in HEK‐293 and WI38 cells and negligible hemolytic activity. In addition, it suppressed key virulence traits, including hemolysin activity, biofilm formation, and staphyloxanthin production. Further, a borate‐functionalized guar gum hydrogel incorporating TPL(II)‐07 achieved effective infection control and enhanced wound repair in a murine excisional model, establishing thiophene‐based lipid II targeting as a versatile platform for next‐generation antimicrobials with dual antibacterial and wound‐healing potential.","tp":"抗菌剂设计","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队合理设计了小分子TPL(II)-07，整合2-苯基噻吩（特异性识别肽聚糖合成关键中间体脂质II）和金刚烷片段（增强膜靶向）等功能模块，通过有效膜解机制根除耐甲氧西林金黄色葡萄球菌（MRSA），为对抗耐药菌感染提供了新策略。","aip":1},{"t":"酪氨酸磷酸酶 STEP 是突触发生的发育抑制因子","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2424788123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Striatal-Enriched Protein Tyrosine Phosphatase (STEP) constrains synaptic potentiation by dephosphorylating postsynaptic substrates, but its presynaptic role has remained unclear. Here, we identify a previously unrecognized function of STEP in regulating axonal differentiation and synapse assembly. Genetic and pharmacological manipulation of STEP in vivo and in vitro show that STEP limits presynaptic maturation by restricting synaptic vesicle protein clustering along developing hippocampal axons. Using a reconstituted circuit-on-a-chip we show that loss of presynaptic STEP is sufficient to significantly increase the number of axodendritic synapses. Functional imaging further revealed that the increased synaptic puncta observed in STEP KO neurons actively undergo depolarization-evoked vesicle exocytosis, representing bona fide functional synapses. Multielectrode array recordings reveal that STEP deletion increases neuronal excitability, and network synchrony, hallmarks of enhanced presynaptic efficacy. Mechanistically, these effects reflect sustained phosphorylation of STEP promoting presynaptic assembly and release competence. Importantly, inhibiting STEP also rescues presynaptic differentiation defects in\n                    Fmr1\n                    KO neurons, implicating aberrant STEP signaling in Fragile X–associated synaptic pathology. Thus, STEP serves as a phosphatase gatekeeper that restrains presynaptic differentiation and neurotransmission, and its inhibition may offer a therapeutic strategy to correct synaptic deficits in Fragile X Syndrome."},{"t":"胎盘代谢时钟","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei4119?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"NAD\n                    +\n                    depletion triggers a countdown to birth in mice"},{"t":"自噬蛋白 ATG-9 通过运输神经肽受体促进秀丽隐杆线虫的厌恶学习","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531054123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Autophagy is a degradative process that maintains cellular homeostasis. Autophagy biogenesis occurs at synapses, but its impact on synaptic functions is incompletely understood. Here we show that, in\n                    \n                      Caenorhabditis elegans\n                    \n                    , synaptic ATG-9, the only transmembrane autophagy protein, contributes to aversive learning under mitochondrial stress. Analysis of the neuronal translatome reveals that autophagy is upregulated by stress in the octopaminergic RIC neuron and it promotes aversive learning. Inactivating autophagy genes, including\n                    atg-9\n                    , reduces aversive learning. Mitochondrial stress increases synaptic ATG-9 through AP-1- and AP-2-dependent exocytosis and endocytosis, respectively, and reducing synaptic ATG-9 impairs aversive learning. We further identify the FRPR-6 neuropeptide receptor as a substrate of ATG-9 modulation. Both\n                    atg-9\n                    and\n                    frpr-6\n                    promote aversive learning and RIC activities, and the abundance of FRPR-6 in the RIC neurite depends on\n                    atg-9\n                    . We postulate that ATG-9-containing synaptic compartments promote neuronal plasticity through modulating receptor trafficking to enable aversive learning under systemic mitochondrial stress."},{"t":"低强度火灾对空气污染的好处","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aea2490?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Wildfires are reversing decades of air quality improvements across much of the US. Expanded use of prescribed fire is a primary proposed solution, but air quality trade-offs—more initial smoke for less smoke later—remain poorly quantified. Using two decades of satellite-derived measurements of fire severity and smoke particulate matter across California, we assessed the causal effect of low-severity wildfire, a proxy for prescribed burning, on subsequent wildfire activity and air quality. We found that low-severity fire reduced the probability of very-high-severity wildfire by 92%, with reductions lasting a decade and extending 5 kilometers from treated locations. Reduced future smoke far outweighed the smoke produced during treatment, with benefit-cost ratios exceeding five after a decade. Sustained treatment of 500,000 acres annually would reduce cumulative smoke fine particulate matter (PM\n                    2.5\n                    ) by about 10% after a decade."},{"t":"小行星可能帮助地球上生命诞生的惊人方式","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/the-surprising-way-asteroids-may-have-helped-life-begin-on-earth/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"For decades, asteroid impacts have been viewed mainly as agents of destruction. But on the young Earth, they may have done something far more surprising: helped create some of the planet’s first habitable environments.\nA new study from Southwest Research Institute (SwRI) suggests that the same cosmic collisions that repeatedly battered Earth more than 4 billion years ago may have transformed large portions of the crust into vast underground networks where hot water could circulate. These hydrothermal systems are considered some of the most promising settings for the chemical reactions that eventually led to life.\nUsing advanced computer simulations, researchers found that impacts could fracture enormous volumes of rock, creating pathways for water to penetrate deep into the crust. Combined with heat from both the impacts themselves and Earth’s interior, these fractured regions may have functioned like giant natural reactors, potentially supporting prebiotic chemistry on a planetary scale.\n“This modeling is both novel and crucial for understanding the earliest environments life may have emerged from,” said SwRI’s Amanda Alexander, first author of an AGU Advances article about this research. “While often considered catastrophic in the context of dinosaur extinction, impact bombardment was also likely critical for creating environments for prebiotic chemistry.”\nEarth formed roughly 4.5 billion years ago during a chaotic era when collisions with asteroids and other planetary debris were commonplace. At the time, the planet lacked the stable surface environments familiar today. Instead, its crust was repeatedly shattered by impacts ranging from relatively small strikes to continent-scale events.\nScientists have long known that these collisions excavated massive craters and melted large amounts of rock. What has been less clear is how effectively impacts altered the crust beneath the surface and how long those changes persisted.\nTo answer that question, the SwRI team used a sophisticated shock physics model capable of tracking how impacts crack solid rock and generate porous zones. The simulations examined asteroids of different sizes and velocities, along with varying crust compositions and temperature conditions. Researchers then calculated how much permeable rock each impact produced and how easily fluids could move through it.\nHydrothermal systems form when water interacts with hot rock, creating chemically active environments rich in dissolved minerals. Many scientists consider such settings strong candidates for the origin of life because they can provide energy sources, chemical building blocks, and stable conditions for complex reactions.\nToday, Yellowstone National Park offers one of the best-known examples of hydrothermal activity. The new study suggests that individual impacts on early Earth may have generated hydrothermal systems up to 100 times more extensive than those found in the Yellowstone region today.\nRather than creating isolated pockets of activity, repeated impacts may have transformed large sections of the planet’s upper crust into interconnected networks of hot, circulating groundwater. Such environments could have dramatically increased the number of locations where life-friendly chemistry might occur.\n“Because life could have originated or evolved in hydrothermal environments, it is important to understand and quantify the generation of these systems by impacts on the early Earth,” Alexander said.\nThe simulations revealed that the size of the permeable zones depended largely on the energy of the impact, which is determined by the asteroid’s size and speed. However, the extent to which those regions remained open to fluid circulation was influenced by factors such as crust composition and Earth’s geothermal gradient.\nThe researchers also incorporated estimates of how frequently impacts occurred during Earth’s early history. The results point to a world that may have been far more permeable than previously appreciated.\n“Using a bombardment history model to infer the cumulative effects of recurring impacts, we estimate that the upper 5-mile (8-kilometer) shell of the Earth’s crust likely was highly permeable 4.3 billion years ago and that a significant portion of this volume may have remained permeable until 3.5 billion years ago,” Alexander said.\nThat timespan is particularly intriguing because it overlaps with the period when the earliest evidence for life begins to emerge in the geologic record. While the study does not show that impacts directly created life, it suggests they may have helped establish and maintain the environments where life had the opportunity to gain a foothold.\n“These results show that impacts were instrumental in driving hydrothermal changes to the early Earth’s crust, with important consequences for the geochemical evolution of near-surface environments,” Alexander said.\nReference: “Widespread Impact-Induced Crustal Permeability on the Early Earth” by A. M. Alexander, S. Marchi and B. C. Johnson, 14 May 2026,\nAGU Advances\nDOI: 10.1029/2025AV002097\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAstrobiology\nEarth Science\nSouthwest Research Institute\nOxygen-Rich Iron Reservoirs Could Have Played a Crucial Role in the Creation of Life\nNew Research Reveals Earth’s Inner Core Was Formed 1 – 1.5 Billion Years Ago\nFlat-Slab Subduction in South America Mirrors Formation of Rocky Mountains\nNASA Study Provides New Estimates for the Global Water Cycle\nIsotopic Evidence Shows Life Could Have Flourished on Earth 3.2 Billion Years Ago\nNew Calculations Challenge Assumptions about Rigid Lithosphere\nGrand Canyon Thought to Be 65 Million Years Older Than Previous Estimates\nUnusual Indian Ocean Earthquakes May Signal Tectonic Breakup\nDefects in Mantle Rocks Slow Down the Passage of Seismic Waves"},{"t":"全球南方正在塑造农业的未来","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei4424?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"下载：足球的数据复兴和中国的大型核计划","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/11/1138809/the-download-soccer-football-data-analytics-china-nuclear-power/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"MIT Technology Review","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"This is today's edition of\nThe Download\nour weekday newsletter that provides a daily dose of what's going on in the world of technology.\nImagine tuning in to the opening kickoff of a World Cup match and seeing a player intentionally kick the ball out of bounds. You may question the logic of surrendering possession seconds into a game. If you were Jesse Davis, though, you’d know that this play could be a prime setup to score.\nDavis is a professor of computer science at KU Leuven in Belgium and head of its Sports Analytics Lab, which has been at the vanguard of a data awakening in soccer.\nUsing AI and data analytics, his team has uncovered hidden tactical patterns and challenged long-held assumptions about how the game should be played. Many of the insights hitting soccer pitches today trace back to the lab’s work.\nRead the full story on how computer scientists are changing the world’s most popular sport\n—Andrew Zaleski\nThis story is from the next edition of our magazine.\nSubscribe now\nto get a copy when it lands!\nIn China, large reactors are coming together at a stunning pace. The country has nearly doubled its nuclear fleet since 2016, reaching nearly 60 gigawatts of total power capacity. Construction started on six new reactors in 2025, and two more have begun in 2026.\nIt’s incredibly difficult to build the massive projects that dominate the nuclear industry today. Up-front investment can run well into the billions, and designs are complex. Yet China is moving ahead rapidly. By 2030, the country is on course to overtake both the US and the EU in installed nuclear capacity.\nFind out why bigger might be better when it comes to nuclear power\n—Casey Crownhart\nis from The Spark, our weekly newsletter giving you the inside track on all things climate.\nto receive it in your inbox every Wednesday.\nThe must-reads\nI’ve combed the internet to find you today’s most fun/important/scary/fascinating stories about technology.\n1 Autonomous drones may have killed soldiers for the first time\nA drone-maker said Russian troops were killed in a test. (\nNew Scientist\n+ The US has used a sea drone to rescue a helicopter’s crew.\n+ Europe has a drone-filled vision for war.\nMIT Technology Review\n2 Solar power has finally surpassed coal in US electricity generation\nIt’s the leading source of new power. (\n+ Meanwhile, Trump is increasing coal investments.\n+ The US is in a power struggle over coal.\nMIT Technology Review\n3 Russia’s FSB has taken control of the country’s internet\nThe KGB successor now determines access. (\nFinancial Times\n+ Rage over the restrictions is boiling over.\n4 OpenAI says China is fomenting dissent over AI on ChatGPT\nIt claims to have foundinfluence operations on the bot. (\n+ The propaganda also targeted data centers and tariffs.\n5 SpaceX’s listing price is expected to be revealed today\nIt could lead to the biggest IPO ever. (\n+ And turn 4,400 employees into millionaires.\n6 EPA scientists say they’re pushed to downplay risks of household products\nThey’re under pressure to alter reviews of chemicals in products. (\n7 Anthropic has walked back a policy that “sabotaged” research\nIt would have limited Claude’s ability to develop competing AI models. (\n8 Congress wants in on the data center backlash\nMembers are jumping on the fervor with new policy plans. (\n+ Should we be moving data centers to space?\nMIT Technology Review\n9 Your search results are getting sloptimized\nCompanies are gaming the chatbot internet. (\n10 Scientists have discovered that humans prefer to walk anticlockwise\nIt’s a discovery that could improve crowd and evacuation management. (\nQuote of the day\n—Justin Pearson, who represents portions of Memphis in the Tennessee House of Representatives, tells\nwhy his constituents are angry about the SpaceX IPO.\nOne More Thing\nSpace tourism is now officially a thing. But does it represent a future in which the average person could book a celestial flight and bask in the splendor of Earth from above? Or is this just another way for the ultrawealthy to flash their cash while simultaneously ignoring and exacerbating our existential problems down on the ground?\nFor now, such flights remain ridiculously far beyond the financial reach of most people. They also pose risks to both the passengers and the planet. But proponents of private spaceflight argue that it provides great opportunities for science and a sense of transcendence.\nDive into the space tourism debate\n—Margaret O’Mara\nWe can still have nice things\nA place for comfort, fun and distraction to brighten up your day. (Got any ideas?\nDrop me a line\nskeet 'em at me\n+ A rare antelope species was rediscovered in a\nremote Kenyan forest\n+ This ingenious camping trailer pops up into a fully\nheated off-road bathroom\n+ Iconic internet memes are now safely preserved in the British Film Institute’s\nmoving image archive\n+ NASA's experimental aircraft has successfully broken the sound barrier in a big win for\nsupersonic flight\nPlus: China has blocked Meta’s $2 billion acquisition of AI startup Manus.\nPlus: An unauthorized group has reportedly accessed Anthropic’s Mythos.\nPlus: DeepSeek has unveiled its long-awaited new AI model.\nPlus: Anthropic has called for a global slowdown in AI development.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more.","tp":"核电与数据","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.5,"t":4.0},"as":"这是MIT科技评论每日通讯栏目，本期涵盖两个主题：一是足球运动的数据分析复兴——利用计算机视觉和数据科学分析比赛策略与球员行为；二是中国的大型核能计划——探讨中国在核能领域的重大战略布局。属于综合科技简报类内容。"},{"t":"巴西境内外采取一致行动，亚马逊是可以被拯救的","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01824-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"As deforestation in the Amazon falls, fresh evidence shows that the rainforest can withstand global warming, but only if there is a worldwide effort to stop cutting it down. As deforestation in the Amazon falls, fresh evidence shows that the rainforest can withstand global warming, but only if there is a worldwide effort to stop cutting it down.","tp":"亚马逊雨林","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"随着亚马逊森林砍伐率下降，新证据表明热带雨林能够抵御全球变暖影响，但前提是全世界共同努力停止森林砍伐。研究强调巴西境内外的协同行动对拯救亚马逊生态系统至关重要，为全球气候与生物多样性保护政策提供了积极信号。"},{"t":"表观遗传的睾丸起源独立于精子线粒体 DNA 和附睾暴露","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2611096123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Paternal epigenetic inheritance remains mechanistically unresolved. Recent studies propose that environmental exposures induce mitochondrial DNA (mtDNA)-dependent transcription in sperm during epididymal transit, altering small RNA content and offspring phenotypes. Here, we show that mature murine sperm are effectively devoid of mtDNA, precluding mtDNA-dependent transcription, and that sperm-borne mitochondrial RNAs originate during spermatogenesis. Testicular sperm transmitted diet-induced metabolic traits as efficiently as, and in most cohorts more efficiently than, epididymal sperm. These findings establish testicular inheritance independent of sperm mtDNA transcription and epididymal exposure."},{"t":"特细胞源性五聚蛋白 3 使血管修剪成为婴儿血管瘤消退的关键驱动因素","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526271123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The natural course of infantile hemangioma (IH), a benign vascular infantile tumor, is marked by the initial rapid proliferation of dystrophic capillaries, followed by a regression phase, which is either spontaneous or induced by the first line treatment propranolol. Although endothelial cells have been at the center of most studies, the role of stromal cells in this vascular remodeling has remained unclear. Telocytes, which are stromal cells that may be targeted by propranolol, are involved in tissue organization and angiogenesis, suggesting their role in vascular remodeling during the regression of IH. To assess changes in vascular architecture of IH and the role of telocytes, we used Skin-iDISCO\n                    +\n                    3-Dimensions (3D) sample imaging and in vitro models with patient-derived telocytes. Perivascular telocytes exhibited increased dendricity during regression, indicating their activation. Telocytes secretome profiling revealed a complex inhibitory program, with pentraxin 3 (PTX3) emerging as a central effector. 3D multicellular disease models demonstrated a paracrine effect blocking endothelial fibroblast growth factor receptors (FGFR) signaling via FGF2–PTX3 interaction, thereby strongly regulating endothelial proliferation, sprouting, and activation. In vitro mechanistic study and collagen IV staining analysis revealed that vascular regression is at least partially due to vascular pruning. These findings highlight the pivotal role of telocytes in orchestrating vascular remodeling during IH regression, opening therapeutic perspectives for inducing vascular normalization in pathological angiogenesis, including cancer."},{"t":"抑制构象熵以实现低成本高性能有机光伏器件","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag355/8706372?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机光伏","kp":["[有机光伏]: 调控构象熵实现低成本高性能"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Taming conformational entropy for low-cost and high-performance organic photovoltaics"},{"t":"通过同位素富集调控α-MoO₃中的声子驱动响应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73629?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"声子极化激元","kp":["材料体系[声子极化激元]: α-MoO3正交晶系","调控手段[声子响应]: 同位素富集","光谱范围[双曲声子极化激元]: 中红外"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过同位素富集（isotopic enrichment）策略对极性材料α-MoO3的声子驱动响应进行选择性调控。α-MoO3作为天然双曲声子极化激元材料，其纳米器件化应用需要精确调控极化激元的频率、传播和损耗特性。通过改变同位素组成，可有效调节声子色散关系，实现对声子极化激元的频率位移和品质因子优化。该方法为极化激元纳米光子器件的可控设计提供了材料层面的新工具。","ot":"Tailoring Phonon‐Driven Responses in α‐MoO3 through Isotopic Enrichment","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The implementation of polaritonic materials into nanoscale devices requires selective tuning of parameters to realize desired spectral or thermal responses. One robust material, α‐MoO\n                    3\n                    , an orthorhombic crystal boasting three distinct phonon dispersions, provides three polaritonic dispersions of hyperbolic phonon polaritons (HPhPs) across the mid‐infrared (MIR). Here, the tunability of both optical and thermal responses in isotopically enriched α‐MoO\n                    3\n                    (\n                    98\n                    MoO\n                    3,\n                    Mo\n                    18\n                    O\n                    3\n                    , and\n                    98\n                    Mo\n                    18\n                    O\n                    3\n                    ) is explored. A uniform ∼5% spectral redshift from\n                    18\n                    O enrichment is observed in both Raman‐ and IR‐active TO phonons. Both the in‐ and out‐of‐plane thermal conductivities for the isotopic variations are reported. Ab initio calculations both replicate experimental findings and analyze the select‐mode three‐phonon scattering contributions. The HPhPs from each isotopic variation are probed with s‐SNOM, and we report an HPhP\n                    Q\n                    ‐factor maxima increase in\n                    98\n                    Mo\n                    18\n                    O\n                    3\n                    of ∼50% along the [100] in the RB\n                    2\n                    and ∼100% along the [001] in the RB\n                    3\n                    with respect to\n                    98\n                    MoO\n                    3\n                    . Observations in both real and Fourier space of higher‐order HPhP modes propagating in slabs of isotopically enriched α‐MoO\n                    3\n                    without the use of a subdiffractional surface scatterer are presented here. This work establishes the dual‐element isotope enrichment of α‐MoO\n                    3\n                    as an intrinsic strategy to design optical, thermal, and polaritonic properties."},{"t":"使用 $^{197}\\mathrm{Au}$ 目标系统研究反应中的聚变裂变和准裂变","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/vmdx-klxv","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Shiva Prasad Nayak, E. Prasad, D. J. Hinde, M. Dasgupta, C. Simenel, K. J. Cook, E. C. Simpson, J. Walshe, D. Y. Jeung, C. Sengupta, K. Vo-Phuoc, J. F. Smith, I. P. Carter, H. Albers, J. Khuyagbaatar, and Ch. E. DüllmannBackground: Quasifission is a nonequilibrium phenomenon that strongly suppresses the formation of heavy nuclei in heavy-ion fusion reactions. This process shows a strong entrance channel dependence. Understanding quasifission is crucial for exploring potential avenues to synthesize new superheavy el…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064605] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"切换桨轮双铜分子催化剂的氢转移路径以实现高效电催化乙酰化反应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73644?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化乙炔半氢化","kp":["催化剂[乙炔半加氢]: 桨轮式双铜分子催化剂","[氢转移路径]: ER与LH机制可切换"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了双铜桨轮型分子催化剂上电催化乙炔半加氢（EAH）的氢转移路径调控机制。通过系统改变催化剂配位环境，实现了从异裂型到均裂型氢转移路径的切换，并建立了路径选择性与乙炔选择性加氢产物（乙烯）之间的关联。该工作阐明了分子水平上氢转移机理，为设计高效、高选择性的乙炔电催化加氢催化剂提供了明确的活性位点工程策略。","ot":"Switching Hydrogen Transfer Pathway Over Paddle‐Wheel Dicopper Molecular Catalysts for Efficient Electrocatalytic Acetyl","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Elucidating the hydrogen transfer pathway of electrocatalytic acetylene semihydrogenation (EAH) is crucial for understanding the catalytic mechanism and designing high‐performance catalysts, but faces grand challenges. Herein, we unprecedentedly switch the hydrogen transfer pathway between Eley‐Rideal mechanism and Langmuir‐Hinshelwood mechanism over paddle‐wheel dicopper molecular catalysts, where the charge density of the Cu sites is effectively modulated by the ligands with different electron‐withdrawing ability. Extended X‐ray absorption fine structure (EXAFS), operando characterizations, and theoretical calculations together reveal that the moderate charge density of Cu sites in benzoic acid‐Cu catalyst (BA‐Cu) inhibits H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation and reduces C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    adsorption energy, promoting the co‐adsorption of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O and steering the EAH through the Eley‐Rideal mechanism. In acetic acid‐Cu (AA‐Cu) with low charge density and monofluorobenzoic acid‐Cu (MFBA‐Cu) with high charge density, the Cu sites facilitate H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation to *H and hydrogenate C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    via the Langmuir‐Hinshelwood mechanism. In 1 \n                    M\n                    KOH aqueous solution, the BA‐Cu delivers an ethylene partial current density of 328 mA/cm\n                    2\n                    with an ethylene Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 96.4% at –0.9 V versus RHE, which is about 2‐fold and 1.4‐fold higher than AA‐Cu and MFBA‐Cu. This work provides mechanistic insights for the rational design of high‐performance electrocatalysts by regulating the hydrogenation kinetics.","aip":1},{"t":"基于亚稳态合成动力学的可持续高能量密度锂锰氧层状正极材料","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag356/8706385?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂层状正极","kp":["合成方法[富锂层状正极]: P3前驱体自发离子交换","材料体系[高能密正极]: O3-Li0.6[Li0.2Mn0.8]O2"],"dp":1,"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"富锂层状Li-Mn-O正极材料具有高能量密度但受限于循环中的结构退化。本研究发现其电化学稳定性本质上映射于亚稳态合成动力学：通过控制合成温度与淬火速率，可锁定特定的亚稳态层状构型，抑制充放电过程中的不可逆氧氧化和过渡金属迁移。优化的合成路径显著提升了容量保持率和电压稳定性，为兼顾高能量密度与长循环寿命的锂离子电池正极材料提供了合成工程解决方案。","ot":"Sustainable high energy density Li–Mn–O layered cathode via metastable synthetic kinetics","b":"The electrochemical stability of metastable lithium-rich layered cathodes is intrinsically governed by their synthetic history, yet the correlation between ion-exchange thermodynamics and structural evolution remains elusive. Here, using layered P3-Na0.6[Li0.2Mn0.8]O2 (P3-NLM) as a precursor, the spontaneous ion exchange synthesis of O3-Li0.6[Li0.2Mn0.8]O2 (O3-LLM RT) yields one of the most promising layered Li–Mn–O cathodes reported to date within LiPF6-based carbonate electrolyte at room temperature. However, elevated synthesis temperatures induce manganese ion migration, which hinders the reversible interlayer migration of Li+ into the transition metal layers. This structural impediment triggers irreversible lattice oxygen activation and degrades structural stability (e.g., at 280°C, denoted as the O3-LLM HT). Consequently, the perfect layered O3-LLM RT cathode exhibits a high specific capacity of 250 mAh/g with excellent cycling stability of 88.1% capacity retention (vs. the 51.9% for O3-LLM HT) after 400 cycles at 2.0–4.8 V, ranking at the top of the Li–Mn–O layered cathodes. These findings provide insights into the design and optimization of metastable materials for high-energy-density batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"超交换辅助Fe(IV)=O链在可扩展铁单原子催化剂上的形成及其用于低化学试剂消耗水净化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73668?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁单原子催化剂","kp":["催化剂[流动水净化]: 可扩展铁单原子催化剂","活性物种[水净化]: 超交换辅助Fe(IV)=O链形成"],"dp":1,"as":"基于超交换（superexchange）机制辅助Fe(IV)=O高价铁氧物种链式形成的新型铁单原子催化剂，可大规模制备。该催化剂用于聚合驱动的废水处理工艺，能够在低能耗条件下将污染物去除与资源回收（如单体、肥料前体）相耦合，为工业废水脱毒与循环利用提供了兼具催化活性与成本效益的单原子平台方案。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Superexchange‐Assisted Fe(IV)=O Chain Formation on Scalable Iron Single‐Atom Catalysts for Low‐Chemical Water Purificati","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymerization‐based wastewater treatment can couple decontamination with resource recovery at low energy input by transforming dilute organics into separable products. However, it requires selective oxidant activation, and iron, although abundant and industrially relevant, often forms metastable over‐oxidizing adducts that suppress polymerization selectivity. Here, we design and synthesize a distance‐tailored iron single‐atom catalyst (Fe‐SAC) featuring a coupled Fe\n                    1\n                    ‐Fe\n                    2\n                    pair that enables sequential generation of reactive Fe(IV)═O species from peroxymonosulfate. Theory and experiments reveal that formation of the first Fe\n                    1\n                    (IV)═O triggers a spin‐state transition of the adjacent Fe\n                    2\n                    site to a high‐spin configuration, while the finely tuned Fe\n                    1\n                    ─Fe\n                    2\n                    separation geometrically matches the O─O bond in the oxidant. This spin reconfiguration strengthens Fe─O covalency and promotes a superexchange‐assisted pathway, leading to chain formation of Fe\n                    2\n                    (IV)═O through bidentate axial bonding and site‐to‐site electronic coupling. In a continuous‐flow reactor, the scalable Fe‐SAC increases polymerization selectivity from 29.9% to 73.3% and boosts electron utilization from 156.8% to 443.8%. Life‐cycle and techno‐economic analyses further indicate ∼88% and ∼79% reductions in environmental impacts for catalyst synthesis and operation, respectively, together with an estimated ∼90% decrease in pollutant removal cost. This work establishes a design principle to unlock selective Fe(IV)═O chemistry for low‐chemical, polymerization‐based water purification with engineering viability.","aip":1},{"t":"超级地球和迷你海王星遵循不同的轨道周期-偏心率关系","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu3916?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Many exoplanets have been observed with radius sizes between that of Earth and that of Neptune and are thus classified into two groups: super-earths (SEs) and mini-neptunes (MNs). There are no SEs or MNs in the Solar System, and the mechanisms responsible for their formation and evolution are debated. We investigated the relationships between the orbital period and eccentricity of SEs and MNs using both ensemble statistical analyses and individual measurements. We found that MNs follow an anticorrelation between orbital period and eccentricity, but SEs follow a different relation, possibly in the opposite direction. These trends imply that MNs and SEs are dynamically distinct populations. We suggest that SEs have been more strongly influenced by violent processes such as gravitational scattering and giant impacts, whereas MNs predominantly experienced quiescent secular evolution."},{"t":"阳光电源与Sunotec为Enery在保加利亚投运600 MWh电池储能系统","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/11/sungrow-and-sunotec-commission-600-mwh-bess-in-bulgaria-for-enery/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能电站","kp":["容量[BESS保加利亚]: 150MW/600MWh","放电时长[BESS]: 4小时"],"as":"阳光电源（Sungrow）与保加利亚集成商Sunotec合作，为Enery在保加利亚Nova Zagora建成并投运一座150 MW/600 MWh、四小时储能时长的电池储能电站（BESS）。该项目显著提升东南欧电网的灵活性调节能力，可在用电高峰放电、低谷充电，支持可再生能源消纳与区域电网稳定，是欧洲大规模储能部署的标志性案例。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Sungrow and Sunotec commission 600 MWh BESS in Bulgaria for Enery - Energy Storage","b":"Sungrow and Bulgarian integrator Sunotec have commissioned a 150 MW/600 MWh, four-hour BESS in Nova Zagora, Bulgaria, for project owner Enery.\nThe facility was developed and is owned by Enery, an independent power producer with a pipeline of nearly 10 GW across 10 CEE countries. Financing came through Bulgaria’s\nRESTORE program\n– the National Infrastructure for Storage of Electricity from Renewable Sources – an EU Recovery and Resilience Facility-backed scheme covering up to 50% of construction and commissioning costs for standalone battery storage. Bulgaria’s Ministry of Energy selected 82 projects totaling 9,712 MWh under the program in April 2025, allocating BGN 1.15 billion (EUR 588 million) across successful applicants.\nThe system has begun commercial operations. “Through advanced optimization and active participation across power and balancing markets, the battery will provide critical flexibility to the grid while supporting the efficient integration of renewable energy,” said Petya Dimova, head of portfolio optimization at Enery.\nThe facility uses Sungrow’s PowerTitan 2.0 liquid-cooled technology across 120 containers, connected to the grid via a 33/110 kV substation. Sungrow says the cooling architecture reduces auxiliary power consumption by 45% compared with non-liquid-cooled alternatives and extends battery service life by two years.\nThe Nova Zagora project is the first phase of a\nbroader collaboration between Sungrow and Sunotec\ntargeting up to 800 MWh in the region, with further expansion to 1 GWh under consideration. The two companies expect to commission a total of 2.2 GWh of battery storage in Bulgaria within two months, with combined capacity reaching 3 GWh by the end of 2026. A second phase, Knizhnovik Phase 1, is a 100 MW/200 MWh hybrid BESS and solar project also developed by Enery.\nBulgaria has seen rapid BESS deployment under RESTORE, with a second program round targeting an additional 1.9 GWh announced in August 2025. Enery separately secured more than EUR 250 million in long-term portfolio financing from ČSOB in January 2026 for a 300 MW solar and 100 MW/220 MWh co-located BESS portfolio across Czechia, Slovakia, Bulgaria, and Slovenia – a distinct transaction from the RESTORE-funded Nova Zagora project."},{"t":"2026年暑期阅读","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei7768?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"亚细胞金属组网络调控生理结果：基于SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS集成的单细胞图谱绘制","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2601472123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"亚细胞金属组学","kp":["表征平台[亚细胞金属组学]: SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS集成"],"dp":1,"as":"研究以单细胞分辨率揭示植物细胞内必需、非必需及毒性类金属(loid)元素（MEs）的亚细胞空间分布如何构成「金属组学网络」，并据此调控植物生理结局（生长、抗逆、毒性响应）。该工作打通了元素空间定位—细胞功能—表型之间的因果链，为重金属污染修复作物育种、微量元素生物强化及毒性预警提供了单细胞级定量框架。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Subcellular metallomic networks orchestrate physiological outcomes: Single-cell mapping via an integrated SEM-FIB-TOF-SI","b":"The spatial organization of essential, nonessential, and toxic metal(loid) elements (MEs) within plant cells underpins physiological function. Yet, comprehensive subcellular imaging of the full ME spectrum remains challenging due to trade-offs among spatial resolution, elemental coverage, and structural correlation. Here, we present an integrated scanning electron microscopy–focused ion beam–time-of-flight-secondary ion mass spectrometry platform that overcomes these limitations by achieving nanoscale coregistration of ultrastructure with ME distribution. Applying this high-fidelity workflow to\n                    Arabidopsis\n                    , soybean, and wheat, we constructed single-cell metallome maps revealing an evolutionarily conserved subcellular architecture: chloroplasts enrich essential MEs (e.g., magnesium, iron, copper), whereas vacuoles compartmentalize nonessential [e.g., lanthanum (La)] and toxic MEs [e.g., cadmium (Cd), lead, arsenic]. We demonstrate that while this architecture remains stable under homeostasis, it undergoes dynamic, stimulus-specific, and dose-dependent remodeling under stress. Low-dose La(III) enhances pairwise and higher-order colocalizations of essential MEs within chloroplasts, correlating with improved photosynthetic efficiency and growth. High-dose La(III) induces nonphysiological La-ME associations and, critically, drives aberrant Cd(II) accumulation in chloroplasts—revealing a cross-toxicity mechanism wherein La(III) disrupts native sequestration barriers. In contrast, although high-dose Cd(II) is largely excluded from chloroplasts, it triggers a widespread redistribution of essential MEs, progressively eroding spatial organization. Thus, while both ions inhibit growth, they perturb metallomic networks via distinct mechanisms: La(III)-mediated disruption of sequestration vs. Cd(II)-induced systemic compartmental collapse. Our findings establish that subcellular ME networks are dynamically regulated and orchestrate physiological outcomes.","aip":1},{"t":"电化学储能系统的结构化风险评估：整合一致性增强FAHP与复杂网络方法","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008202?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能系统风险评估","kp":["[方法]: 一致性增强FAHP+耦合网络","[对象]: 电化学储能系统风险评估"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Structured risk assessment for electrochemical energy storage system: Integrating consistency enhanced-FAHP and complex "},{"t":"长程转录-翻译耦合的结构基础","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528970123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Structures recently have been reported of molecular assemblies that mediate transcription–translation coupling in\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    . In these molecular assemblies, termed “coupled transcription–translation complexes” or “TTC-B,” RNA polymerase (RNAP) directly interacts with the ribosome, the transcription elongation factor NusG or its paralog RfaH forms a bridge between RNAP and ribosome, and the transcription elongation factor NusA optionally forms a second bridge between RNAP and ribosome. Here, we report structures of coupled transcription–translation complexes having mRNA spacers between RNAP and ribosome longer than the maximum-length mRNA spacer compatible with formation of TTC-B. The results define a class of coupled transcription–translation complex, termed “TTC-LC,” where “LC” denotes “long-range coupling.” TTC-LC differs from TTC-B by a ~60° rotation and ~70 Å translation of RNAP relative to ribosome, resulting in loss of direct interactions between RNAP and ribosome and creation of a ~70 Å gap between RNAP and ribosome. TTC-LC accommodates long mRNA spacers by looping out mRNA from the gap between RNAP and ribosome. We present evidence that TTC-LC is a functional intermediate in assembling and disassembling TTC-B, mediating pre-TTC-B transcription–translation coupling before a ribosome catches up to RNAP, and mediating post-TTC-B transcription–translation coupling after a ribosome stops moving and RNAP continues moving. We show that TTC-B, but not TTC-LC, is severely defective in RNA-hairpin-dependent transcription termination, and that both TTC-B and TTC-LC are severely defective in Rho-dependent transcription termination."},{"t":"分子伴侣引导RNA诱导沉默复合物组装的结构基础","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10640-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The RNA-induced silencing complex (RISC), comprising an Argonaute (AGO) protein and a small RNA, is the central effector in RNA silencing. Small RNAs are loaded onto AGO as bulky duplexes in an HSP70- and HSP90-dependent process1,2,3, but the molecular mechanism remains poorly understood. Here we identify the human AGO–HSP90–p23 complex, which captures AGO in an RNA-free state, termed the AGO maturation complex (AMC). The purified AMC enables RNA loading and AGO folding, faithfully recapitulating de novo RISC assembly. Using cryogenic electron microscopy, we determined the structure of AMC bound to a microRNA duplex. In contrast to its conformation in the RISC, AGO adopts a highly open conformation in the AMC: the N domain and the RNA-binding module (PAZ–MID–PIWI) are fully detached and anchored to opposite sides of the HSP90 dimer, connected solely by the unfolded L1 linker. This arrangement exposes a positively charged cleft that accommodates an RNA duplex. AGO folding is facilitated by a small RNA duplex containing a 5′-terminal phosphate—but not by single-stranded RNAs—revealing a role for the RNA duplex as a chaperone-like cofactor that directs AGO domain assembly. These findings elucidate the RISC assembly mechanism and establish the AMC as a molecular tool for probing optimal RNA features and chemical modifications for the rational design of small interfering RNA therapeutics. Our study also sheds light on how chaperones, together with ligands, can guide the folding of client proteins."},{"t":"通过自组装核壳纳米颗粒制备高强度耐腐蚀3D打印钢材","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea5057?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"3D打印耐蚀钢","kp":["[316L不锈钢3D打印]: MCC驱动自组装核壳纳米颗粒"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"金属增材制造常产生粗大柱状晶和元素偏析，导致力学各向异性和耐蚀性下降。本研究开发了一种自组装核壳纳米颗粒掺杂策略，在3D打印钢中实现细小等轴晶化和均匀元素分布。核壳颗粒在熔池中作为异质形核位点并抑制晶界偏析，打印件兼具高强度和优异耐蚀性，且各向异性大幅降低。该策略为高性能增材制造金属结构材料提供了普适性微观组织调控方法。","ot":"Strong and corrosion-resistant 3D-printed steel by self-assembled core-shell nanoparticles","b":"Metal additive manufacturing often produces coarse columnar grains and elemental segregation, resulting in anisotropic mechanical properties and degraded corrosion resistance. We present a powder blending strategy using multicomponent carbides (MCCs) to overcome these limitations in 316L stainless steel. Upon dissolution, MCCs drive the self-assembly of uniformly distributed core-shell oxynitride-carbide nanoparticles, which sequester detrimental nitrogen/oxygen impurities and markedly refine austenite grain size from 43.9 to 2.1 micrometers. This unique microstructure control yields an excellent combination of strength and ductility. Crucially, the corrosion resistance is enhanced by suppressing chromium segregation via tungsten, niobium, and tantalum partitioning to the cell boundaries and facilitating the formation of a protective tungsten trioxide–rich passive film. This work establishes an instructive paradigm for metal additive manufacturing, demonstrating how MCCs’ introduction can tailor nanoprecipitations, grain structure, and alloy chemistry to simultaneously improve strength and corrosion resistance in structural alloys."},{"t":"克雅氏病朊病毒变种在人源化神经细胞中的菌株特异性繁殖","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2609054123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Prions are self-templating assemblies of the host prion protein in which conformational templating encodes heritable “strain” information. Human prion diseases, including Creutzfeldt–Jakob disease (CJD), are rare but uniformly fatal neurodegenerative disorders with established public-health relevance through epidemic and iatrogenic transmission and provide a paradigm for conformational templating in neurodegeneration. Mechanistic analysis of human prion propagation and development of infectivity assays for public health surveillance have been limited by the absence of mammalian cell systems that replicate authentic infectious human prions. Here, we establish a humanized neural cell system that enables propagation of variant CJD (vCJD) prions and reveals that prion replication is constrained by strain-compatible cellular states. The platform was generated using a silencing-followed-by-reconstitution strategy analogous to that used in transgenic mouse models of human prion disease, combined with high-throughput clonal selection. These cells propagate brain-derived vCJD prions and support chronic infection. Prions propagated in vitro transmit disease to humanized transgenic and wild-type mice while preserving defining biochemical and strain-specific neuropathological features, demonstrating faithful propagation. Propagation is strain specific: The cells are permissive to vCJD but refractory to sporadic CJD isolates, indicating that prion replication is constrained by strain-compatible cellular states. These humanized cells enable quantitative detection of infection at high dilution, support systematic genetic manipulation, and are readily adaptable to automation. By overcoming a longstanding barrier of propagating authentic human prions, this platform enables mechanistic dissection of the cellular determinants of prion replication and strain specificity and provides a scalable system for genetic analysis and sensitive detection of infectious human prions."},{"t":"用于理化监测和适应性治疗的应变不敏感湿组织粘附双相生物电子学","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02624-4","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","b":"Implantable bioelectronics are rapidly advancing towards multifunctional platforms capable of real-time monitoring and therapeutic intervention. However, designing implants with stable, long-term integration with soft, dynamic biological tissues, especially under strain or movement, is still challenging. Here we introduce a stretchable, strain-insensitive, wet-tissue-adhesive elastomer–hydrogel biphasic platform for cross-functional bioelectronics, enabling simultaneous physical sensing, chemical monitoring and neural modulation in vivo. This platform, termed ElHyX, features a molecularly integrated elastomer–hydrogel architecture, functionalized with conductive fillers to achieve mechanical compliance, robust electrical performance and strong tissue adhesion without the need for sutures or additional surface treatments. Using direct ink writing, we fabricated customizable ElHyX-based devices for in vivo electrocardiogram monitoring, glucose sensing and nerve stimulation. A closed-loop system for diabetic management in rats was also developed, where real-time biosignal detection autonomously triggered neuromodulation to regulate blood glucose levels. Overall, our findings establish ElHyX as a versatile, scalable platform for next-generation bioelectronics, capable of continuous physicochemical monitoring and autonomous therapeutic intervention in complex biological environments.","tp":"生物电子学","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队开发了可拉伸、应变不敏感、湿组织粘附的弹性体-水凝胶双相平台，用于多功能植入式生物电子学。该平台可同时实现物理传感、化学监测和治疗干预，解决了软组织动态环境下长期稳定集成的难题，为实时健康监测和适应性治疗提供了新方案。"},{"t":"基于均苯四甲酸二酰亚胺可逆结构转换的刺激响应三线态发射与X射线闪烁","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3402295?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"刺激响应发光材料","kp":["材料[X射线闪烁体]: 均苯四甲酸二酰亚胺共晶","特性[刺激响应发光]: 保持结晶性可逆结构切换"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一类智能刺激响应发光材料，通过可逆结构转变实现可控的三重态发射与X射线闪烁性能。材料可在外部刺激下程序化调节发光波长与强度，且过程可逆可重复。此类材料在X射线成像、防伪编码及光信息处理等场景具备潜在应用价值。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stimuli‐Responsive Triplet Emission and X‐Ray Scintillation via Reversible Structural Switching in Pyromellitic Diimide ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Smart stimuli‐responsive luminescent materials with programmable and reversible emission are highly desirable for intelligent imaging and information security. Stimuli‐responsive organic materials utilizing triplet excitons are particularly attractive owing to their pronounced sensitivity to solid‐state packing. However, crystallinity‐preserving reversible structural switching that enables simultaneous control over X‐ray‐excited luminescence (scintillation) remains largely unexplored. Herein, donor‐acceptor halogen‐bonded cocrystals were constructed using\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    N\n                    ′‐bis(n‐butyl)pyromellitic diimide (Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI) and 3,6‐dibromocarbazole (Br\n                    2\n                    Cz) or 3,6‐diiodocarbazole (I\n                    2\n                    Cz). The green cocrystal Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz‐G exhibits room‐temperature phosphorescence (RTP) and bright radioluminescence, whereas its orange polymorph is nearly non‐emissive. In contrast, the I\n                    2\n                    Cz‐based cocrystal displays thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF), representing an alternative triplet exciton utilization pathway. Notably, mild organic‐vapor stimulation triggers reversible order‐to‐order polymorphic interconversion of Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz, which reorganizes halogen‐bonding motifs and, thus achieves crystallinity‐retained “on/off” switching of radioluminescence. Benefiting from efficient triplet exciton utilization, Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz‐G enables high‐resolution static X‐ray imaging (37 lp mm\n                    −1\n                    ) and real‐time dynamic imaging (2 K, 60 fps) with negligible afterglow. Furthermore, the reversible solvent‐triggered luminescence switching facilitates rewritable multimodal information encryption by integrating photoluminescence and radioluminescence as orthogonal readout channels. This work demonstrates cocrystal engineering as a powerful strategy for reversibly programming triplet‐exciton emission and X‐ray scintillation via structural switching in organic solids."},{"t":"通过无机-有机杂化层稳定埋底界面以实现高性能钙钛矿光伏器件","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01195K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿埋底界面","kp":["效率[倒置钙钛矿电池]: 超27%","[埋底界面]: 无机-有机杂化层稳定化","空穴传输[钙钛矿]: 自组装单分子层SAMs"],"as":"针对倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池的埋底界面稳定性问题，研究提出采用无机-有机杂化层稳定埋底界面策略。该方案有效抑制界面缺陷与降解反应，显著提升器件光电转换效率与长期运行稳定性，为高效钙钛矿及叠层电池的商业化推进提供了界面工程新路径。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Stabilizing the Buried Interface via Inorganic-Organic Hybrid Layers for High-Performance Perovskite Photovoltaics","b":"Inverted perovskite solar cells, owing to their excellent stability and high compatibility with tandem technologies, have emerged as the most commercially promising new-generation photovoltaic technology. Self-assembled monolayers (SAMs) serve as crucial hole-transport materials and have driven device efficiencies beyond 27%. However, inherent issues such as molecular aggregation, non-uniform interfacial coverage, and poor wettability severely limit device performance and long-term stability. To systematically address these interfacial challenges, this study innovatively developed a hole-transport layer composed of colloidal silica nanoparticles and SAM molecules. This composite structure operates through multiple synergistic mechanisms: the abundant hydroxyl groups on the nanoparticle surfaces provide strong anchoring sites for SAM molecules, mitigating aggregation at the source and enabling the formation of a highly uniform and coherent hybrid interfacial contact; the constructed micro-nano rough interface significantly improves the wettability of perovskite precursors, guiding the formation of a high-quality light-absorbing layer. The resulting inverted perovskite solar cells achieved a power conversion efficiency of 27.35% and a fill factor of 86.77% (with a certified steady-state PCE of 26.92%), demonstrating significantly enhanced operational stability. This study provides a novel and practical solution for constructing efficient, stable interfaces for perovskite solar cells."},{"t":"Specialized发布Turbo Levo 4 X：全避震越野货运电助力自行车","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/11/specialized-launches-turbo-levo-4-x-a-full-suspension-off-road-cargo-e-bike/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","as":"Specialized推出Turbo Levo 4 X全避震越野货运电动自行车，将bikepacking（自行车长途驮行）理念与电助力越野能力结合。该车型具备全避震悬挂系统与大容量电池，兼顾重载运输与复杂地形通过性，定位户外探险与长距离骑行场景，拓展了电动货运自行车的应用边界。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动货运自行车","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":8.5},"ot":"Specialized launches Turbo Levo 4 X, a full-suspension off-road cargo e-bike","b":"| Jun 11 2026 - 4:13 am PT\nSpecialized is taking the increasingly popular concept of bikepacking and giving it a serious electric boost with the launch of the new Turbo Levo 4 X.\nThe company describes the model with a simple tagline: “Electric Overlanding.” Basically, this is the bike to take you and all your gear beyond where the trail stops, blazing your own path and your own adventure.\nIn practical terms, the Levo 4 X is essentially a Turbo Levo 4 outfitted for adventure travel, adding integrated front and rear cargo racks to Specialized’s flagship full-suspension electric mountain bike platform. The idea is to create an e-bike that can handle everything from singletrack trail riding to multi-day overland expeditions.\nSpecialized is so stoked about the possibilities, it led them to coin a new category for it: Electric Overland.\nAt the heart of the bike is the same high-performance S-Works 3.1 mid-drive motor found on the Levo 4, delivering up to 850 watts of peak power and an impressive 111 Nm of torque. Power comes from a large 840 Wh battery, with Specialized claiming ride times of up to 4.4 hours depending on terrain and assistance levels.\nThe Levo 4 X is built around the company’s FACT 11m carbon frame with integrated SWAT storage and adjustable geometry, allowing riders to fine-tune the bike’s handling characteristics. Suspension duties are handled by a 160 mm FOX 38 Factory fork up front and a 150 mm FOX Float X Factory rear shock with Specialized’s GENIE shock technology.\nThe premium build kit continues throughout the bike. SRAM XX Eagle T-Type AXS wireless shifting, SRAM Maven Ultimate four-piston brakes with oversized 220 mm front and 200 mm rear rotors, and carbon Roval Traverse wheels all reinforce that this is an uncompromising high-end machine.\nWhat makes the Levo 4 X unique, however, are the high-performance cargo racks mounted front and rear. Rather than treating luggage as an afterthought, Specialized appears to have designed the bike around the idea that riders may be carrying camping gear, photography equipment, extra supplies, or anything else needed for extended adventures.\nTechnology also plays a big role. The bike features Specialized’s MasterMind TCU with a 2.2-inch display, full app customization, Apple Find My compatibility, and a 12-amp smart charger with multiple charging modes, including fast charging and an 80% battery preservation option.\nDespite all of that capability, the bike weighs in at around 60 pounds (27.25 kg), which is hefty for a mountain bike but fairly reasonable for a full-suspension cargo-capable electric mountain bike with an 840 Wh battery. Yeah, it’s\n10 kilos heavier\nthan the company’s lightest eMTBs, but it’s designed to do a heck of a lot more, and with a lot more power.\nOf course, premium performance comes with a premium price. The S-Works Turbo Levo 4 X carries a\nsticker price of $11,999\n, firmly placing it in the dream-bike category for many riders and e-bike journalists who died a little bit inside while typing that out.\nBut for those looking to combine serious trail capability with serious carrying capacity and serious expendable income, Specialized is betting that the idea of an electric overland bike is about to become its own adventure.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nMicah Toll is a personal electric vehicle enthusiast, battery nerd, and author of the Amazon #1 bestselling books\nDIY Lithium Batteries\nDIY Solar Power,\nThe Ultimate DIY Ebike Guide\nThe Electric Bike Manifesto\nThe e-bikes that make up Micah’s current daily drivers are the\n$999 Lectric XP 2.0\n$1,095 Ride1Up Roadster V2\n$1,199 Rad Power Bikes RadMission\n$3,299 Priority Current\n. But it’s a pretty evolving list these days.\nBest $999 electric bike ever!\nGreat e-bikes at great prices!"},{"t":"空间双壳层结构通过增强局部碱性实现稳定阴离子交换膜水电解","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb8831?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碱性电解水制氢","kp":["[结构策略]: 铈诱导双壳层结构","[机制]: 增强局部碱性度提升稳定性"],"as":"研究提出一种空间双壳层结构设计，用于阴离子交换膜水电解（AEMWE）制绿氢技术。双壳层构型有效提升膜电极的离子传导率与结构稳定性，抑制催化剂衰减，从而在较高电流密度下保持稳定运行。该工作为降低绿氢生产成本、提升电解槽耐久性提供了材料结构层面的新思路。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Spatial double-shelled structure achieving stable anion exchange membrane water electrolysis via enhanced local alkalini","b":"Anion exchange membrane water electrolysis (AEMWE) represents a promising technology for green hydrogen production. Although numerous efforts have been devoted to optimize the anode catalysis by structural and chemical modulation, the effectiveness of such strategies in enhancing stability remains limited. Herein, we propose a cerium-induced double-shelled structure formation strategy that modulates the electrode/electrolyte interfacial microenvironment through spatial configuration engineering, effectively suppressing anodic corrosion. Mechanistic studies revealed that the associated nanospace enrichment effect increased the coverage of surface hydroxide ion (OH\n                    −\n                    ) species, thereby enhancing the local alkalinity at the material surface and effectively suppressing ion leaching. The double-shelled cerium dioxide (CeO\n                    2\n                    )/lanthanum cobaltite (LaCoO\n                    3\n                    )-10% catalyst demonstrated outstanding performance in the AEMWE device, achieving an industrial-relevant current density of 3 amperes per square centimeter at 1.88 volts. Furthermore, the catalyst exhibited exceptional long-term stability exceeding 2000 hours under simulated industrial conditions. Our findings underscore the importance of engineering the physical spatial configuration to regulate the interfacial microenvironment, offering a strategy to address the corrosion degradation of anode catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"面向高原子序数与快响应有机闪烁体的空间分子解耦设计","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4586495?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机闪烁体","kp":["设计策略[有机闪烁体]: 空间分子解耦","瓶颈[高Z闪烁体]: 高Z元素引发SOC猝灭荧光"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出空间分子解耦设计策略用于有机闪烁体，通过将激发态能量传递和辐射发光功能在分子层面分离，实现高原子序数（高Z）响应与快速衰减时间的协同优化。有机闪烁体在柔性、低成本的辐射探测中具有独特优势，但传统设计长期受限于发光效率与衰减速度的权衡。该方法为高能辐射探测器的轻量化、可穿戴化开辟了新路径。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Spatial Molecular Decoupling Design for High‐Z and Fast Organic Scintillators","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Organic scintillators are pivotal for flexible and low‐cost radiation detection; however, they face a long‐standing “absorption–speed” trade‐off: incorporating high‐Z elements to enhance X‐ray attenuation typically triggers strong spin–orbit coupling (SOC), which quenches prompt fluorescence and diverts excitation energy into slow, microsecond‐scale triplet pathways. Here, we present a molecular decoupling strategy to overcome this dilemma, realized in a donor–acceptor–donor (D–A–D) hybridized local and charge‐transfer (HLCT) molecule, 4,7‐bis(4‐(bis(4‐iodophenyl)methyl)phenyl)benzo[\n                    c\n                    ][1,2,5]thiadiazole (TPBI). By terminally tethering iodine atoms to the triphenylamine units, we achieve robust X‐ray attenuation while preserving a fast “hot‐exciton” emission channel. The intrinsic nonplanar geometry and strategic spatial arrangement of the molecule successfully isolate the heavy‐atom effect from the emissive core, maintaining the crucial quasi‐degeneracy between the T\n                    2\n                    and S\n                    1\n                    states. This configuration facilitates rapid high‐lying reverse intersystem crossing (hRISC), enabling near‐unity exciton utilization without compromising nanosecond‐scale decay kinetics. Our TPBI‐based scintillator demonstrates a synergized performance profile of potent X‐ray interaction (attenuation efficiency 5.672 cm\n                    2\n                    g\n                    −1\n                    at 28 keV) and a fast temporal response (2.96 ns), providing a general molecular design paradigm for next‐generation, high‐performance organic radiation detectors."},{"t":"基于可编程超表面的时空全息图","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01647-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"时空全息超表面","kp":["[通道容量]: 数千独立全息通道","[技术]: 可编程超表面时空全息"],"as":"基于可编程超表面实现时空全息图技术。可编程超表面可生成用于成像和传感的全息图像，但高效率、多通道的动态全息生成一直存在挑战。该研究通过时空调控电磁波，有望推动下一代无线通信、AR/VR显示及智能传感系统的发展。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Space-time holograms based on programmable metasurfaces","b":"Programmable metasurfaces can be used to generate holograms for imaging and sensing applications. However, creating high-capacity dynamic holograms that are programmable and have high refresh rates remains challenging. Here we report on space-time holograms based on programmable metasurfaces. The approach provides thousands of independent holographic channels working simultaneously at different harmonics. We use spatial-time coding to split a monotone injected wave into multi-harmonic reflected beams, and we develop a fast convergence phase-retrieval algorithm to manipulate the wavefront intensities at each harmonic. Using a programmable metasurface with 6,144 elements, we experimentally show that the approach can generate 62 holographic images (digits and Latin letters) simultaneously. We also show that the platform can create 1,024-channel holograms with spot distribution patterns and that it can be used for multi-target tracking."},{"t":"固态电动汽车电池加速落地：北美启动道路实测","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/11/solid-state-ev-batteries-leave-lab-north-american-road-tests-begin/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"固态电池","kp":["[固态电池EV]: 北美首次路测（Stellantis/Factorial）"],"as":"固态电池电动汽车正在北美开展实际道路测试，标志着该技术从实验室走向商业化落地的关键一步。固态电池以固态电解质替代液态电解液，有望显著提升能量密度、充电速度和安全性，被视为下一代动力电池的核心方向。当前多个厂商已进入实车验证阶段，产业化时间表正在加速推进。","sc":8.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":7.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Solid-state EV batteries are getting real as on-road testing begins in North America","b":"Peter Johnson\n| Jun 11 2026 - 7:39 am PT\nSolid-state EV batteries\nare now being tested on the road in North America for the first time, promising longer range, faster charging, and lower costs.\nJeep maker Stellantis and US-based Factorial Energy officially began testing the advanced new battery tech on the road, marking the first time solid-state batteries have been integrated into an EV in North America.\nFactorial’s FEST (\nFactorial Electrolyte System Technology\n) solid-state battery cells were used to power a Dodge Charger Daytona development vehicle.\nThe milestone comes after Stellantis and Factorial validated that 77Ah FEST cells\nachieved an energy density\nof 375 Wh/kg with over 600 cycles last April.\nFactorial’s advanced solid-state battery cells also proved ultra-fast charging from 15% to 90% in just 18 minutes, and maintained performance in extreme temperatures ranging from -22°F to 113°F (-30°C to 45°C). Plus, the cells deliver a discharge rate of up to 4C.\nMoving the new battery tech from the lab to the real world wasn’t easy. Stellantis said transitioning the cells into a development vehicle “demanded advanced engineering solutions” from both companies.\nFactorials FEST solid-state battery cells were integrated into Stellantis’ STLA Large platform, while engineers modified the control systems and pack design to optimize safety and performance.\nWith the battery pack now complete, Stellantis and Factorial have begun road testing for the first time in North America.\n“What we have built together, from cell chemistry to pack architecture to enable real-world road testing, is exactly the kind of deep, full-stack collaboration that solid-state has always required,” Factorial’s CEO, Siyu Huang, said.\nHe added that “This milestone doesn’t just validate FEST; it sets a new bar for what automotive-grade solid-state batteries can deliver and supports the development of future vehicles designed to meet the evolving needs of drivers.”\nFactorial is working with several major automakers, including Mercedes-Benz, Hyundai, Kia, and Stellantis, to commercialize solid-state EV batteries.\nLast September, Mercedes-Benz drove a modified EQS\nover 745 miles\n(1,200 km) using Factorial’s solid-state battery cells. Mercedes’ tech boss, Markus Schäfer, said Factorial’s battery tech could be a real “gamechanger” for EVs.\nBeyond the automotive industry, Factorial plans to expand the battery tech to other segments, such as robotics, aerospace, and defense.\nFactorial said its solid-state battery cells deliver a 50% improvement in driving range, offering over 600 miles on a single charge. Earlier this week, Factorial\nbegan trading on Nasdaq\nunder the ticker symbol “FAC” following a business merger with Cartesian Growth Corp III (a SPAC). The merger is worth about $1.3 billion, and Factorial will receive roughly $110 million as it works to commercialize the next generation of batteries.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nPeter Johnson is covering the auto industry’s step-by-step transformation to electric vehicles. He is an experienced investor, financial writer, and EV enthusiast. His enthusiasm for electric vehicles, primarily Tesla, is a significant reason he pursued a career in investments. If he isn’t telling you about his latest 10K findings, you can find him enjoying the outdoors or exercising"},{"t":"太阳能驱动浮式贝类养殖系统在法国潟湖完成测试","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/solar-powered-floating-shellfish-farming-tested-in-french-lagoon/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏水产养殖","kp":["[光伏应用]: 浮式太阳能-水产养殖一体化"],"as":"法国Thau潟湖正在试验太阳能驱动的浮式贝类养殖系统SolarinThu项目，将光伏发电与牡蛎养殖相结合，利用浮式太阳能平台为养殖作业供电。该模式探索了新能源与水产养殖的跨界融合，有望降低养殖碳足迹并提升能源自给率，为沿海地区可持续水产养殖提供可复制方案。","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Solar-powered floating shellfish farming tested in French lagoon - pv magazine Global","b":"Applications & Installations\nThe SolarinThau project, which combines photovoltaic power generation with oyster farming, aims to test a new model that balances the energy transition, the preservation of maritime activities, and the sustainable development of the shellfish farming sector.\nGwénaëlle Deboutte\nApplications & Installations\nUtility-scale\nBefore being installed in the lagoon, the convoy passed under Sète’s five iconic bridges: Victoire, Tivoli, Gare, Sadi-Carnot and the Foch railway bridge. | Image: SMBT / J. BOUMOUSSA\nA French consortium has deployed a prototype floating solar shellfish farming platform combining photovoltaic power generation with oyster farming. Measuring 53 metres long and 18 metres wide, the structure has been deployed in the heart of Thau Lagoon, in southern France, alongside existing shellfish farming installations.\nThrough this demonstrator, the project aims to develop new models supporting the future of the local shellfish industry while addressing regional energy and environmental challenges. Thau Lagoon’s shellfish sector produces more than 10,000 tonnes of oysters and mussels annually, relies on 2,781 farming platforms, and supports over 1,500 jobs.\nDesigned to withstand waves exceeding 12 metres and cyclonic winds of up to 200 km/h, the installation will undergo an 18-month trial phase from July 2026 to December 2027. This period corresponds to a full oyster farming cycle, enabling the evaluation of the prototype’s technical, environmental and economic performance under real operating conditions.\nNamed SolarinThau, the pilot project is led by a consortium comprising the Mediterranean Regional Shellfish Farming Committee (CRCM), start-up SolarinBlue, and the Thau Basin Joint Association (SMBT), with financial support from the French government and the Occitanie Region.\nPrior to its installation in the lagoon, the unit was assembled over recent months at the commercial port of Sète. It was then launched into the Colbert Basin on 16 May 2026 for initial technical checks. The official inauguration of the prototype is scheduled for Thursday, 2 July 2026, in the presence of local stakeholders and national partners.\nGwénaëlle Deboutte\nView author posts"},{"t":"光储微电网现已可提供具竞争力的基荷电力","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/11/solar-plus-storage-microgrids-now-delivering-competitive-baseload-power/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ESS News","as":"在SNEC展会全球储能大会全体会议上，行业专家指出太阳能+储能微电网已能提供具备竞争力的基荷电力。随着光伏成本下降和储能技术成熟，微电网在离网区域、工业供电和电网稳定性支撑等场景的可行性持续提升，储能正从补充能源角色向主力可靠电源转变。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"光储微电网","kp":["应用场景[光储微电网]: 提供基荷电力竞争力"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.5},"ot":"Solar-plus-storage microgrids now delivering competitive baseload power - Energy Storage","b":"At last week’s Global Energy Storage Conference Plenary at the SNEC trade show in Shanghai, China, Yana Hryshko, Head of Global Solar Supply Chain at Wood Mackenzie, spoke about the very attractive potential of solar and battery storage to deliver baseload power in a wide range of markets around the world. Specifically, the team at Wood Mackenzie has modelled three scenarios for Ukraine, Ghana and the Netherlands. For each country two solar-plus-storage deployments were considered, one for 4-hour storage and the other for 12 hours, along with conventional energy deployments of combined cycle gas and coal.\nSince Hryshko hails from Ukraine and Ukraine has shown remarkable resiliency in its energy infrastructure despite an almost ten-fold increase in Russian attacks this year compared to last year according to a recent report in the German daily Frankfurter Allgemeine Zeitung, the country has largely kept its lights on by relying on PV-plus-storage microgrids to provide power for extended periods. As Hryshko points out, these microgrids can tap into existing transmission grid infrastructure, thereby reducing the capex required to build these microgrids.\nFor all three countries, Wood Mackenzie’s modelling assumes a consistent system architecture and set of specifications. The configuration includes a 300 MW solar-plus-storage plant with a dispatch capacity of 100 MW, available in both 4-hour and 12-hour storage durations, corresponding to energy capacities of 400 MWh and 1,200 MWh respectively.\nThe transmission setup is based on a 110 kV system featuring an 8 km single-circuit power line. Substation infrastructure consists of three generator step-up transformers (GSUs), each rated at 105 MVA. At the distribution level, the system is designed as an on/off grid configuration supported by grid-forming inverters.\nFor the conventional energy scenarios, renewable energy generation is replaced with 300 MW of combined-cycle gas-fired generation and 300 MW of coal-fired generation.\nIn the case of Ukraine, the ability to tap existing transmission infrastructure means lower microgrid capex. Investments are still required in limited new construction and the assets generating the electricity. Ghana, on the other hand, provides a very different scenario, where no existing grid infrastructure can be relied on. In the case of the Netherlands, the grid infrastructure basically resembles that of Ukraine with the caveat that it constitutes a “grid-constrained scenario” due to the high penetration of renewables in the Dutch grid. The solution is to site the PV and storage assets close to the demand.\nIn the Ukraine the deployment of solar-plus-storage has been a life saver. “Despite the full-scale war, Ukraine still installs at least 1 GW of solar every year, according to official numbers. Unofficially, no one really knows the total, because much of it is installed locally and completely off-grid,” Hryshko emphasized. “There are entire industrial parks and entire residential communities that have built their own solar power plants and storage systems and then gone off-grid.”\nIn a levelized cost of energy (LCOE) analysis covering the period from 2020 to 2060, hybrid PV with 4-hour storage drops from $62/MWh to just $32/MWh, a drop of about 50%, albeit over a very long 40-year period. But already now the LCOE of a hybrid solution, be it 4 or 12 hours, is far below the LCOE of conventional fuel solutions. The latter has an LCOE in the neighborhood of $150/MWh, far above the $50/MWh, or less, achieved by the two hybrid solutions. Hryshko reveals a similar gap in the LCOE analysis completed for Ghana and the Netherlands. For all three countries the gap grows over time, with 4- and 12-hour hybrid solutions costing a fraction of conventional microgrids by the middle of this century.\nThe key takeaway from the session is that 12-hour baseload solar-plus-storage is already competitive today in all three countries based on an LCOE analysis. This does not mean that solar-plus-storage microgrids cost the least to build. This is only the case in the Netherlands, where siting solar near the demand minimizes transmission costs, thereby keeping capex 40% lower than equivalent coal and gas plants. In Ukraine, 12-hour solar-plus-storage microgrids already have a capex lower than coal and only slightly higher than gas ($860,000/MW compared to $960,000/MW for coal and $720,000/MW for gas).\nBut as Hryshko points out, the Achilles’ heel of gas are the very long lead times to secure gas turbines: “The lead times for gas turbines to build new power plants are about 3 to 6 years. So this technology is … not the answer for the energy transition,” she stated.\nIn three very different scenarios the combination of solar-plus-storage prove their worth and can be mobilized very quickly to generate affordable and clean electricity, not to mention a very modular and resilient form of electricity.","aip":1},{"t":"基于穿孔翅片的太阳能组件冷却技术","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/solar-module-cooling-tech-based-on-perforated-fins/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏组件散热","kp":["降温效果[穿孔翅片PV冷却]: 最高降低20.93%电池温度","散热结构[PV组件]: 穿孔六边形翅片"],"as":"阿尔及利亚研究人员通过仿真研究了穿孔六边形翅片散热器用于光伏组件冷却的技术。该方案通过在翅片上开孔改善空气对流效率，降低光伏板工作温度，从而提升光电转换效率并延长组件寿命。穿孔设计相比传统实心翅片减轻了重量和材料成本，同时保持甚至增强散热性能。研究为干旱高温地区的光伏电站热管理提供了低成本被动冷却的新思路。","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Solar module cooling tech based on perforated fins - pv magazine Global","b":"Research & Development\nResearchers in Algeria simulated perforated hexagonal-fin heat sinks to improve PV cooling performance using CFD analysis. The best design reduced cell temperature by up to 20.93% and increased efficiency while maintaining high thermal performance under forced convection.\nResearch & Development\nUtility-scale\nImage: pv magazine / AI generated\nA research group at the University of Batna, Algeria, has evaluated the cooling performance of heat sinks with different fin geometries and perforated structures for photovoltaic (PV) applications.\n“This work’s combination of geometric optimization of fins and perforations offers new insights into advanced heat sink designs tailored explicitly for solar energy applications,” the researchers explained. “Computational fluid dynamics (CFD) simulations were used to model laminar forced convection and conduction heat transfer, enabling comparison between different fin and perforation configurations and a conventional rectangular heat sink.”\nThe team investigated four designs: plain rectangular fins (PRF), plain hexagonal fins (PHF), hexagonal fins with rhombus perforations (HFRP), and hexagonal fins with hexagonal perforations (HFHP).\nAll configurations were modeled as attached to a 165 mm × 65 mm polycrystalline silicon solar cell rated at 6 V/250 mA. Each heat sink consisted of 18 aluminum fins. The PRF design served as the reference case, while PHF used hexagonal fins to increase surface area. The HFRP design incorporated four rhombus-shaped perforations per fin, and the HFHP configuration used four hexagonal perforations per fin.\nCFD simulations were conducted at an ambient temperature of 25 C. Air inlet velocities were set at 0.3 m/s, 0.6 m/s, 0.8 m/s, and 1 m/s. Solar irradiance levels of 1,000 W/m², 1,500 W/m², 2,000 W/m², and 2,500 W/m² were applied, corresponding to concentration ratios of 1, 1.5, 2, and 2.5 suns, respectively.\n“The HFHP heat sink design effectively reduced the solar cell temperature, achieving a 20.93% decrease at the highest irradiance of 2,500 W/m² compared to the PRF design. Similarly, the HFRP and PHF configurations showed temperature reductions of 17.44% and 7.67%, respectively,” the academics explained. “Electrical efficiency improvements were also recorded, with HFHP increasing efficiency by 0.48% compared to PRF. PHF achieved a 0.30% improvement, while HFRP reached 0.43% at an irradiance level of 1,000 W/m².”\nAt an air velocity of 1 m/s, the HFHP configuration consistently delivered the best thermal performance, achieving the highest Nusselt number, 62.49% higher than the PRF baseline. HFRP and PHF followed with improvements of 51.65% and 44.32%, respectively.\nThe simulation also indicated that the additional fan power required for forced convection was negligible compared to the PV cell’s electrical output, preserving more than 97% of generated power for useful output.\n“By incorporating shaped perforations, such as hexagonal or rhombus structures, into heat sink fins, heat transfer performance is enhanced, resulting in an overall improvement in the performance evaluation factor (PEF),” the researchers concluded. “These designs will be further evaluated experimentally, including fabrication via CNC machining and testing under real operating conditions.”\nThe novel technique was presented in “\nDesign and optimization of perforated shaped fin heat sinks for enhanced solar cell cooling\n,” published in\nThermal Science and Engineering Progress.\nScientists from Algeria’s University of Batna,\nMalaysia’s National University\nUniversity of Rajasthan\n, and the United Arab Emirates’ Abu Dhabi University have contributed to the research.\nView author posts"},{"t":"软化学路径制备熵工程纳米材料：氧化还原电催化中的复杂性驱动性能提升","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00987E","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"高熵纳米催化剂","kp":["合成路线[高熵纳米材料]: 软化学温和条件","应用[高熵电催化剂]: 氧化还原电催化"],"dp":1,"as":"高熵纳米材料作为一类新型电催化剂近年来备受关注，其核心优势在于通过复杂组分协同效应突破传统单金属催化剂的性能极限。该综述系统阐述了软化学合成路线在熵工程纳米材料制备中的关键作用，涵盖溶胶凝胶、共沉淀、自燃等温和方法。复杂性驱动的性能增强机制为能源转换与存储领域（如燃料电池、水分解）提供了催化剂设计新范式，但仍面临组分精确控制与规模化制备的挑战。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Soft-Chemistry Routes to Entropy-Engineered Nanomaterials: Complexity-Driven Performance in Redox Electrocatalysis","b":"High-entropy nanomaterials (HENMs) have emerged as a distinctive class of electrocatalysts in which compositional complexity generates synergistic active sites, tuned electronic structures and exceptional durability. Conventional approaches to high-entropy phases have relied on harsh thermal or high-pressure conditions to achieve uniform alloying, restricting both scalability and structural control. In contrast, recent advances in soft-chemistry routes, such as hydrothermal and solvothermal methods, precursor decomposition, galvanic exchange and co-precipitation, enable the stabilization of high-entropy architectures under remarkably mild conditions. These strategies not only overcome kinetic barriers for multimetallic integration but also permit precise tailoring of morphology, surface chemistry and atomic configurations. Such structural control is critical for governing adsorption energetics, charge-transfer pathways and resilience under reaction environments, thereby paving the way toward the complexity-driven performance of HENMs in redox electrocatalysis. This review offers a unique perspective by focusing on soft-chemistry synthesis of HENMs and the resulting structureperformance relationships in electrocatalytic oxidation and reduction reactions. We critically examine formation mechanisms, design principles and catalytic outcomes, highlighting how entropy-engineered complexity translates into enhanced activity, selectivity and stability. Finally, we identify emerging opportunities for advancing mild-condition synthesis as a sustainable and versatile platform for the rational design of next-generation high-entropy electrocatalysts for energy conversion.."},{"t":"软硬件，流动软件：用于适应性化学计算的可重构微流体","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73669?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Chemical and physical computing systems promise information processing in performance regimes inaccessible to conventional electronics. However, they are typically constrained by static hardware architectures that limit adaptability and computational richness. Here, we introduce a reconfigurable microfluidic platform where soft hydrogel structures are 3D‐printed and erased in situ to dynamically reshape the physical environment in which chemical computation occurs. By treating microfluidic geometry as an active, programmable element rather than a passive container, we demonstrate hardware‐reconfigurable control over chemical information processing. We demonstrate switchable Deoxyribonucleic acid (DNA) logic gates that alternate between AND and OR functionality without modifying the underlying reaction network, decoupling logic function from molecular composition. Extending this to a non‐equilibrium chemical reaction network in the form of a feedback‐controlled pH oscillator, we demonstrate that printed structures steer reaction kinetics and spatial pattern formation, giving rise to geometry‐dependent spatiotemporal states. Leveraging these dynamics, we implement a physical reservoir computer in which reconfigurable microfluidic hardware enables the realization of diverse nonlinear functions through simple linear readout. Our work establishes reconfigurable soft microfluidic hardware as a control layer for chemical computation, highlighting how adaptable physical environments actively expand the computational state space of chemical software.","tp":"微流体计算","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究引入了一种可重构微流控平台，通过3D打印和原位擦除软水凝胶结构，动态重塑化学计算发生的物理环境。该平台突破了传统静态硬件架构对化学计算适应性的限制，为可编程、适应性化学计算系统提供了新范式，有望突破常规电子学的性能边界。"},{"t":"社会免疫可能是社会进化的结果和原因","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518957123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Many social insects respond to pathogens in ways that reduce pathogen transmission within their social groups, with behaviors such as grooming or removing infected individuals. This “social immunity” within a group has been compared to the immune response of multicellular organisms. However, we lack a theoretical framework for understanding both the possible evolutionary origins and consequences of social immunity. How restrictive are the conditions for the initial evolution of social immunity? Would we expect social immunity to influence or even coevolve with other aspects of social complexity, such as colony size or the number of castes? We developed a theoretical framework for examining the evolutionary scenarios that may link social immunity and social evolution. We found that: (1) social immunity can be favored in relatively simple social systems, where relatedness between group members can vary; (2) social immunity can coevolve with the age of colony maturation, leading to colonies that grow for a longer period before they start reproducing; and (3) social immunity often leads to the evolution of larger colonies, which can then select for more worker castes. These results suggest that social immunity can be both a consequence and a cause of social evolution."},{"t":"环境压力下 La2PrNi2O7 薄膜中具有鲁棒超导间隙的单粒子隧道谱","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeg2429?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The recent discovery of high-temperature superconductivity in nickelate systems has generated tremendous interest in the community. The core issue to understand the pairing mechanism is the superconducting gap and its symmetry. We have successfully synthesized the superconducting thin films of La\n                    2\n                    PrNi\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    with an onset transition temperature of 41.5 kelvins and measured the superconducting tunneling spectra after exposing the superconducting layer by using the tip-excavation technique. The spectrum shows a robust superconducting gap at about Δ ≈ 19 milli–electron volts, and fittings based on the Dynes model indicate that this dominant gap should have an\n                    s\n                    -wave structure with low anisotropy, which allows us to put the priority in selecting the\n                    s\n                    ±\n                    pairing symmetry. Furthermore, a clear hump structure is observed at an energy of 49 ± 2 milli–electron volts, which is inclined to be interpreted as a bosonic mode. Our results help clarify the mystery of superconductivity in bilayer nickelate superconductors.","tp":"镍基超导体","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究成功合成了镍酸盐超导薄膜La2PrNi2O7，起始转变温度达41.5K，并通过单粒子隧道谱测量了其超导间隙。间隙及其对称性是理解镍酸盐超导配对机制的核心问题，该研究为探索高温超导物理机制提供了重要的实验证据。","aip":1},{"t":"单核分析揭示了早期雷特综合征的核心疾病特征和细胞类型特异性脆弱性","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4265?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Rett syndrome (RTT) is an X-linked neurological disorder caused by\n                    MECP2\n                    mutations, creating distinct cellular environments in females (mosaic) versus males (nonmosaic). Despite female patients representing most cases, how mosaicism contributes molecularly to RTT pathogenesis, particularly in presymptomatic stages, remains poorly understood. To address this question, we profiled hippocampal transcriptomes of young female and male RTT mice using bulk and single-nucleus RNA sequencing. We identified a core disease signature of consistently dysregulated genes only in MeCP2\n                    −\n                    cells across RTT models. Moreover, we uncovered non–cell autonomous effects exclusively in female MeCP2\n                    +\n                    excitatory neurons, suggesting that these circuits are more vulnerable early in the mosaic RTT environment. The single-nuclei data also revealed an underappreciated MeCP2\n                    −\n                    interneuron subtype that had the most transcriptional dysregulation in both male and female RTT hippocampi. Together, these data highlight the different effects of MeCP2 loss on excitatory and inhibitory circuits between the mosaic and nonmosaic environments in early RTT pathogenesis."},{"t":"使用 BRIGHT-seq 对 5mC 和 5hmC 进行同步单碱基分辨率分析","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag353/8705453?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"观点评论","b":"Cytosine modifications in DNA, particularly 5-methylcytosine (5mC) and 5-hydroxymethylcytosine (5hmC), are key epigenetic marks involved in gene regulation and chromatin organization. Simultaneous and base-resolution detection of 5mC and 5hmC is essential for understanding their interplay in gene regulation. However, existing methods often rely on differential subtraction strategies, making direct and concurrent analysis within a single assay challenging. Here, we present the Base Replacement for Integrated Genome-wide Methylation and Hydroxymethylation Tracking Sequencing (BRIGHT-seq), a sequencing strategy that enables direct and simultaneous detection of 5mC and 5hmC at single-base resolution within the same DNA molecule. By integrating enzymatic and chemical treatments, BRIGHT-seq converts 5mC to adenine and 5hmC to thymine, enabling direct identification of both modifications without relying on differential subtraction. We demonstrate the applicability of BRIGHT-seq by mapping 5mC and 5hmC landscapes across human and mouse genomes. BRIGHT-seq provides a useful and high-resolution tool for epigenetic research, facilitating future studies on the roles of 5mC and 5hmC in gene regulation and disease."},{"t":"变化的电流","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5876?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"After decades of warnings, new data suggest the Atlantic Ocean’s vital circulation may withstand climate warming better than feared"},{"t":"恩捷收购SK中国锂电隔膜业务","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/semcorp-deal-to-acquire-sks-china-li-separator-business/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Batteries International","as":"中国恩捷股份（Semcorp）宣布收购韩国SK集团旗下位于中国的锂离子电池隔膜业务，这是全球电池关键材料领域的一项重要产业整合事件。隔膜是锂电池四大核心材料之一，直接关系到电池安全性与能量密度。此次收购将进一步巩固恩捷在全球湿法隔膜市场的龙头地位，反映了中国企业在新能源产业链上游持续扩张的战略趋势，同时可能重塑亚太地区电池材料供应链的竞争格局。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"锂电池隔膜","kp":["收购标的[Semcorp]: SK中国锂电池隔膜业务100%股权"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.5,"r":7.0,"d":5.5,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Semcorp deal to acquire SK’s China Li separator business – Batteries International","b":"Lithium, News\nSemcorp deal to acquire SK’s China Li separator business\n–  June 11, 2026 11:00 am BST\nPhoto: Semcorp\nSouth Korea’s SK Innovation has agreed to sell its loss-making lithium battery separator assets in China to Yunnan Energy New Material, known as Semcorp.\nSemcorp said in a Shenzhen Stock Exchange release on May 27 it planned to acquire a 100% stake in SK Battery Materials Technology from the Korean battery giant’s EV battery subsidiary, SK IE Technology, for Rmb400 million ($60 million).\nCompletion of the transaction is subject to the approval of China’s State Administration for Market Regulation.\nSK’s separators unit has good basic production equipment and a solid hardware foundation but has been suffering from weak market expansion, Semcorp said.\nThat meant the capacity utilisation rate has remained low for a long time. Low utilisation further increases unit production costs, creating a vicious cycle in operations. This cycle ultimately leads to operating losses.\nSemcorp said the deal would quickly replenish the unit’s existing production capacity and significantly shorten production times. The takeover will boost Semcorp’s own existing Li battery separator production capacity, allowing it to accept increase orders.\nSK said its separator plant in China’s eastern Jiangsu province has an annual production capacity of around 940 million m\n, with eight base film production lines and 10 coating production lines for active material application.\nLast March, Semcorp subsidiary Semcorp Yuxi announced that it had completed all eight production lines of its phase one project in southwest China, designed with an annual output of 1.6 billion m\nof Li battery separators."},{"t":"良性溶剂中PET自晶种成核制备高模量超低热导率气凝胶","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73409?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PET气凝胶","kp":["溶剂[PET气凝胶]: 1,3-二苯基丙酮良性溶剂","特性[PET气凝胶]: 高模量、超低热导率"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队提出了一种PET（聚对苯二甲酸乙二醇酯，最广泛回收的塑料）的高值化升级回收新路径：通过在良性溶剂中进行自晶种成核处理，成功制备出具有高弹性模量的PET气凝胶材料。传统PET回收多为物理降级或化学解聚，该工作将其转化为轻质、高强度的功能性气凝胶，拓展了废弃塑料在隔热、吸附、轻量化结构等高端应用领域的价值。方法条件温和、溶剂环保，为塑料循环经济提供了工程化前景良好的新材料方案。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Self‐Seeded Nucleation of PET in a Benign Solvent Yields a High Modulus Aerogel With Ultra‐Low Thermal Conductivity","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Poly(ethylene terephthalate) (PET) is the most recycled plastic; however, upcycling of this commodity polymer to value‐added products has remained limited. Recent attempts to produce PET aerogels have relied on toxic solvents, chemical conversions and cross‐linking, and reinforcement to achieve useful mechanical performance. Now, using a new benign solvent (1,3‐diphenylacetone), we report a simple, safe, and sustainable dissolution and gelation procedure to convert waste PET into low density, monolithic aerogels with high mechanical strength (E = 20 ± 2 MPa) and remarkably low thermal conductivity (k = 21.9 to 28.9 mW m\n                    −1\n                    K\n                    −1\n                    ). The key to this process is controlled crystal nucleation by a self‐seeding phenomenon during gelation that establishes a mesoscale fibrillar framework. Our strategy offers a benign sol–gel process to upcycle plastic waste into a new form of pure PET for advanced thermal insulation."},{"t":"具有精确排列的发光体的[2]Rotaxane取向异构体的选择性合成：朝向方向依赖性","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3759413?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Aiming at the precise synthesis of rotaxane orientational isomers and the further elucidation of attractive orientation effects, a novel steric hindrance‐controlled selective stopper exchange approach has been successfully developed. This method enables the facile and selective synthesis of six pairs of [2]rotaxane orientational isomers with precisely arranged luminogens, greatly enriching both the structural and functional diversity of such isomers. Notably, the resulting orientational isomers exhibit orientation‐dependent emission behaviors, particularly in wavelengths, photoluminescence quantum yields, and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) performances, endowing them with great potential for information storage and encryption. This proof‐of‐concept study provides not only a practical and efficient strategy for the efficient synthesis of rotaxane orientational isomers, but also a novel platform for constructing chiral luminescent materials with desired properties for wide applications.","tp":"分子机器合成","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了位阻控制的选择性封端基团交换方法，成功合成了六对[2]索烃取向异构体，其中精确排列了发光基团。该方法极大丰富了索烃异构体的结构和功能多样性，揭示了方向依赖性效应，为分子机器和发光材料的精确设计提供了新途径。"},{"t":"二次谐波超米氏光学活性实现闭环手性光化学","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73593?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"手性光化学新进展:利用二次谐波超Mie光学活性实现闭环手性光化学反应体系。传统光化学依赖有限波长的紫外光,限制了其在可持续化学处理中的应用。该方法突破了波长与手性选择性的耦合瓶颈,有望为绿色不对称合成提供新路径,在药物合成、精细化学品制造等领域具有潜在应用价值。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性光化学","kp":["光源[手性光化学]: 飞秒红外脉冲倍频","转化体系[手性光化学]: CdTe/CdO纳米螺旋→CdO纳米球","驱动方式[光化学]: 圆偏振光诱导可控氧化"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.5,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Second‐Harmonic Hyper‐Mie Optical Activity Enables Closed‐Loop Chiral Photochemistry","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Photochemistry promises sustainable chemical processing but typically depends on ultraviolet light with limited selectivity and penetration. We report nonlinear chiral photochemistry, where femtosecond infrared pulses are frequency‐doubled to both drive and track a transformation of chiral CdTe/CdO nanohelices into CdO nanospheroids. Circularly polarized light induces a controlled oxidation sequence monitored in real time through second‐harmonic scattering intensity and chiroptical contrast. As the CdO shell fractures and exposes non‐centrosymmetric CdTe, second‐harmonic intensity rises twenty‐fold, polarization reverses, and characteristic CdTe photoluminescence emerges. These findings are enabled by the experimental observation of the second‐harmonic hyper‐Mie optical activity effect, which completes a suite of nonlinear chiroptical scattering phenomena predicted over 45 years ago. Our results offer a spatially confined, selective, and temporally‐resolved method for material transformation."},{"t":"科学家推出强大的新型糖尿病药，可减轻体重并降低血糖","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-unveil-powerful-new-diabetes-pill-that-cuts-weight-and-lowers-blood-sugar/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A large international study found that an experimental oral diabetes medication produced significant improvements in both glucose control and weight loss.\nFor millions of people with type 2 diabetes, GLP-1 drugs have transformed treatment by helping lower blood sugar while also promoting weight loss. But many of the most effective options still require injections, creating a barrier for some patients. New research suggests that may be starting to change.\nAt the American Diabetes Association’s Scientific Sessions, researchers presented results from SOLSTICE, a Phase 2b clinical trial evaluating elecoglipron, an experimental oral GLP-1 receptor agonist. The study found that the once-daily pill significantly improved blood sugar control and reduced body weight in people with type 2 diabetes. The findings were published simultaneously in\nIf future studies confirm these results, oral medications like elecoglipron could help broaden access to a class of drugs that has become one of the most important advances in diabetes treatment over the past decade.\nGLP-1 receptor agonists mimic a naturally occurring hormone that helps regulate blood sugar, slows stomach emptying, and reduces appetite. The medications have become increasingly popular because they address two major challenges in type 2 diabetes at the same time: controlling glucose levels and managing excess weight.\nYet despite their effectiveness, most GLP-1 therapies are delivered by injection. Oral versions have proven more difficult to develop because the digestive system can break down many drug compounds before they are absorbed into the bloodstream.\n“Our study’s findings underscore the expanding potential of oral GLP-1 receptor agonists for people with type 2 diabetes,” said Aroda, who is the Director of Diabetes Clinical Research in the Division of Endocrinology, Diabetes & Hypertension in the Mass General Brigham Department of Medicine. “To date, GLP-1 therapies have largely been limited to injectable or oral peptide formulations, each with inherent delivery and dosing constraints. Rigorous clinical trials like SOLSTICE can help us evaluate oral medications that may be just as effective for patients with diabetes while overcoming these limitations.”\nCurrent oral options also come with restrictions. Oral semaglutide, for example, must be taken on an empty stomach and requires patients to avoid food and water for 30 minutes afterward. Researchers hope newer oral therapies can offer greater convenience while maintaining the benefits seen with injectable drugs.\nAfter 26 weeks, elecoglipron outperformed placebo across all tested dose levels.\nUp to 89.6% of participants receiving the medication achieved an HbA1c level of 7%, a widely used target for diabetes management that reflects average blood sugar levels over roughly three months. By comparison, only 24.9% of participants in the placebo group reached that goal.\nThe drug also produced notable weight loss. Depending on the dose, as many as 72.3% of participants lost at least 5% of their body weight, compared with 20.2% of those receiving placebo.\nResearchers reported that the drug’s safety and tolerability profile was generally consistent with what has been observed for other GLP-1 medications at a similar stage of development.\nAroda is also the principal investigator of REIMAGINE 1, a randomized controlled trial evaluating CagriSema, a combination therapy that pairs the amylin receptor agonist cagrilintide with injectable semaglutide.\nResults from that study, also presented at the ADA meeting and published in\nThe Lancet Diabetes & Endocrinology\n, showed that up to 87% of participants achieved an HbA1c level of 7%.\n“At the center of every one of our clinical trials is the goal of improving outcomes for patients,” said Aroda. “The studies being presented at this year’s meeting highlight how essential carefully designed trials are for evaluating new therapies, refining existing approaches, and ensuring that advances in science translate into safer, more effective care for people living with diabetes.”\nReference: “Elecoglipron, an oral small molecule GLP-1 receptor agonist in adults with type 2 diabetes (SOLSTICE): a multicentre, phase 2b, randomised, placebo-controlled trial” by Vanita R Aroda, Melanie J Davies, Jill Maaske, Marcus Millegård, Víctor López Juan, Jens Aberle, Andreea Ciudin, Rory J McCrimmon, Olof Eklund, Judy L Shih, Mikaela Sjostrand, Donna Zarzuela and Julio Rosenstock, 8 June 2026,\nDOI: 10.1016/S0140-6736(26)00802-0\nFunding: AstraZeneca\nDisclosures: Aroda declares institutional contracts from Amgen, Applied Therapeutics, AstraZeneca, Biomea, Boehringer Ingelheim, Corcept, Eli Lilly, Fractyl, Kailera, Novo Nordisk, Pfizer, Recordati, Rhythm and Servier; and consulting fees from Baim Institute for Clinical Research, Mediflix, Sanofi, and Roche. Additional author disclosures can be found in The Lancet.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nMass General Brigham\nPublic Health\nOzempic in Pill Form Delivers Dramatic Weight Loss Results in Major Trial\nNew Pill for Obesity Delivers Major Weight Reduction Without Injections\nMounjaro Mania: New Diabetes Drug Takes Over As Old Treatments Fade\nPopular Weight Loss Drugs Could Affect Your Behavior: Scientists Conduct Genetic Investigation\nSafe Weight Loss: Obesity Medication Liraglutide Proves Safe for Children in Landmark Study\nAn Improved Ozempic: Scientists Discover Method To Reduce Side Effects of Popular Weight Loss Drugs\nRevolutionary Weight Loss: Largest Ever Obesity Study Showcases Semaglutide’s Promise\nAlarming Trend – Young Adults’ Use of Popular Weight Loss Drugs Wegovy and Ozempic Skyrockets by 594%\nDoes Intermittent Fasting Actually Work? Study Finds Meal Frequency Matters More Than Timing"},{"t":"科学侦探在中国获得罕见赞誉","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5918?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Geng Hongwei’s investigations into prominent Chinese scientists have triggered unusually swift responses"},{"t":"可扩展的分层纺织纤维用于个性化可穿戴大气水收集","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9949?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sorption-based atmospheric water harvesting (AWH) offers a decentralized, sustainable solution to global freshwater scarcity, enabling clean water in diverse environments. However, translating ideal sorption properties of small-scale materials into practical, large-scale systems faces critical kinetic challenges. Here, we conceptualize a hierarchical textile fiber for wearable AWH, addressing the scaling limitations of traditional sorbents. These fibers feature an open-pore surface topology and internal hierarchical pore structures, which accelerate surface vapor liquefaction and subsequent water transport, demonstrating exceptional water uptake and rapid sorption kinetics across varying relative humidity (RH). When woven into textiles, the fibers maintain efficient vapor diffusion through their macroporous, breathable architecture, achieving a 3- to 10-fold improvement over traditional sorbents at scale. We engineered a wearable prototype combining the AWH textile with a portable collector, achieving 3.76 to 7.45 liters\n                    water\n                    per kilogram\n                    sorbent\n                    per day and collecting 410 to 894 milliliters across 20 to 80% RH. By overcoming kinetic limitations, our study advances AWH toward scalability and wearability with implications for global water sustainability.","tp":"集水新材料","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出了一种用于可穿戴大气集水的分层纺织纤维概念，解决了传统吸附剂从实验室小规模向实际应用转化的动力学限制。该纤维具有开孔表面拓扑结构，可实现个性化可穿戴的大气水收集，为解决全球淡水短缺提供了一种分散式、可持续的新方案。"},{"t":"下沉海岸线的卫星地图面临审查","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5924?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Radar studies produce contradictory results, raising questions about efforts to identify areas vulnerable to rising seas"},{"t":"保护玻利维亚亚马逊地区的遗产","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh9864?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"SIRT7 调节剂量补偿并保护女性 X 染色体","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10645-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sirtuins are deacetylases implicated in stress responses and longevity in mammals1,2. Although their differential impact on disease for the two sexes has been noted3,4,5,6,7, the underlying reasons are unclear. Here, using Sirt7 as a model in mice, we examine the mechanisms leading to sex differences and find that Sirt7−/− female mice have decreased fitness throughout their lifespan. Notably, SIRT7 preferentially localizes to the sex chromosomes. In female individuals, SIRT7 loss affects X-chromosome inactivation, the first arm of dosage compensation that equalizes X-linked gene expression between males and females8,9,10. Xist is overexpressed and gene silencing becomes more efficient. However, SIRT7 loss has greatest impact on the active X (Xa) chromosome. The Xa chromosome becomes hyperacetylated at Lys36 of histone H3, structurally disorganized, prone to DNA damage and overexpressed. Increased Xa-chromosome expression leads to genome imbalance and augmented X-chromosome upregulation—the second arm of dosage compensation that balances X-chromosome versus autosomal gene expression. These data reveal an essential crosstalk between sirtuins and the sex chromosomes, with SIRT7 safeguarding X-chromosome integrity and dosage balance with autosomes. We propose that the sex bias in SIRT7 biology can be explained in part by unequal effects on the sex chromosomes."},{"t":"印度SECI招标1.2吉瓦可再生能源配四小时储能项目","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/11/seci-seeks-1-2-gw-of-renewable-energy-with-four-hour-storage/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","as":"印度太阳能公司SECI发布招标，寻求1.2吉瓦可再生能源项目，要求配套四小时储能系统，接入州际输电网络（ISTS）。该项目反映印度在可再生能源整合与储能部署方面的持续加码，对电网稳定性具有战略意义。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光储一体化项目","kp":["装机规模[RE+储能]: 1.2GW","储能时长[ESS]: 4小时","日峰值供电[ISTS]: 4800MWh"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"SECI seeks 1.2 GW of renewable energy with four-hour storage - Energy Storage","b":"SECI has launched a tender for 1.2 GW of renewable energy projects, connected to the interstate transmission system (ISTS) and coupled with energy storage systems (ESS). It aims to deliver 4,800 MWh of assured peak power daily.\nThe projects will be developed on a build-own-operate (BOO) basis and are intended to supply dispatchable renewable electricity during peak demand periods.\nSECI will sign 25-year power purchase agreements (PPAs) with successful bidders and will sell the procured power to distribution companies and other buyers across India.\nDevelopers will be responsible for building the renewable energy generation assets, energy storage systems, and associated transmission infrastructure up to the delivery point. Land acquisition and grid connectivity are within the developer’s scope.\nProjects may be located anywhere in India, although the renewable energy generation assets and energy storage systems must be co-located.\nBidders must submit a single proposal with a minimum contracted capacity of 50 MW and a maximum of 600 MW. Capacity awarded to any bidder group will be capped at 600 MW."},{"t":"俄罗斯计划建设首个电池储能测试中心，拟对标国际标准","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/russia-builds-first-battery-energy-storage-test-centre/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Batteries International","as":"俄罗斯计划建设首个电池储能测试中心，旨在对标国际标准。该中心将聚焦锂电池等储能技术的性能检测与验证，标志着俄罗斯在储能基础设施标准化方面的实质性推进。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能检测中心","kp":["[储能测试]: 俄罗斯首个国家级ESS电池测试中心"],"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Russia plans first battery storage test centre 'to mirror international standards' – Batteries International","b":"Energy Storage, Lithium, News\nRussia plans first battery storage test centre ‘to mirror international standards’\n–  June 11, 2026 10:52 am BST\nRosatom DG Alexey Likhachev (first left) at testing centre signing ceremony\nRussia’s first national testing centre for ESS battery systems and components is to be opened next year, state-owned energy giant Rosatom has announced.\nRosatom said on June 6 the centre, which is already under development, will be capable of conducting certification of lithium ion batteries according to international standards.\nThe move will end the need for Russian firms to send products for testing abroad ― something that has become increasingly difficult in the face of international sanctions over Russia’s war with Ukraine.\nRosatom said the establishment of a national centre of expertise would strengthen technological sovereignty in the battery and energy storage sector.\nThe centre is being built at ‘Technopolis Moscow’ ― a technology hub in one of the capital’s several administrative zones ― at a cost of more than RUB2 billion ($27 million).\nThe proposal for the project was given the green light in a government order issued last March, Rosatom said. The centre will allow domestic companies to have products tested at costs several times cheaper than at present and accelerate the introduction of new products to the market.\nAccording to Rosatom, the agency signed a memorandum of understanding supporting the project with the Russian government during the four-day St Petersburg International Economic Forum ― dubbed the country’s alternative to the annual Davos World Economic Forum ― which ended on June 6.\nA separate agreement was signed to set up a service centre for the maintenance and repair of lithium ion batteries for EVs.\nRosatom director general Alexey Likhachev said the centre was a critical step to support the full cycle of lithium ion battery production in Russia.\nLikhachev said Russia is “localising” advanced technologies, but there was a “bottleneck in validating tech” in line with international standards.\n“By combining the competencies of Rosatom, federal and national governments, we are building not just a laboratory, but a foundation of trust in the domestic energy storage industry both within the country and in foreign markets,” he said.\nRosatom’s energy storage business, part of the group’s fuel division, is focused on lithium ion tech for ESS for emergency and uninterruptible power supplies, plus hybrid systems paired with renewable power generation and EV batteries.\nThe agency claims several gigafactory projects are being developed for cells and batteries. One such facility started operations at Kaliningrad last year (4GWh) and another is expected to start up this year in the greater Moscow area.\nRosatom said the plants will contribute to an eventual total production capacity of about 8GWh annually, which the agency said would provide batteries for about 100,000 EVs every year."},{"t":"Rpd3L 通过 H3K4 甲基化依赖和独立染色质机制调节转录复制冲突","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7842?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Faithful genome duplication requires coordination between transcription and replication. Disruption of this coordination causes transcription-replication conflicts (TRCs), leading to replication stress and genome instability. How chromatin regulators modulate these processes remains unclear. Here, we show that the Rpd3L histone deacetylase complex dynamically modulates chromatin state to control replication fork progression and buffer TRCs in\n                    Saccharomyces cerevisiae\n                    . Rpd3L is targeted through both histone H3 lysine 4 methylation–dependent recruitment and methylation-independent mechanisms engaged under replication stress. Loss of H3K4 methylation or Rpd3L function promotes histone acetylation, accelerates fork progression through transcribed regions, and increases transcription-associated genome instability. Balanced acetylation at multiple histone lysines is required to stabilize replication forks under stress. While histone deacetylase complexes have been implicated in repairing damaged forks, our findings reveal that Rpd3L acts preemptively to modulate chromatin state and replication dynamics during TRCs, defining a chromatin-based mechanism that safeguards genome stability."},{"t":"阴离子孤对电子在产生最小晶格热导率中的作用","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/2pdy-5c6k","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Hongwei Ming, Jiahui Wang, Shike Xu, Bushra Jabar, Yunpeng Zheng, Zhong-Zhen Luo, and Zhigang ZouCationic lone-pair electrons are often associated with distinctive phonon properties (e.g., strong lattice anharmonicity) that lead to low lattice thermal conductivity (${κ}_{\\mathrm{L}}$). However, the reliance on specific cations (e.g., ${\\mathrm{Sb}}^{3+}$ or ${\\mathrm{Ge}}^{2+}$) severely restri…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236301] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","tp":"晶格热导率","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"Phys. Rev. Lett.发表的研究揭示了阴离子孤对电子在实现最小晶格热导率中的关键作用。传统上阳离子孤对电子（如Sb³⁺或Ge²⁺）被认为是驱动强晶格非谐谐性、产生低热导率的主要因素，但对特定阳离子的依赖严重限制了材料选择范围。该研究将孤对电子概念扩展至阴离子，为开发新型高效热电材料提供了全新的设计维度和理论依据。"},{"t":"冰山融化落下的岩石孕育着生物多样性的深海绿洲","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01835-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"A ripple effect of climate change is providing habitat for corals, sponges and other Arctic animals. A ripple effect of climate change is providing habitat for corals, sponges and other Arctic animals."},{"t":"海平面上升可能会使红树林从气候英雄变成碳源","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/rising-seas-could-turn-mangroves-from-climate-heroes-into-carbon-sources/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Rising seas could turn mangroves from carbon-storing climate allies into unexpected carbon emitters.\nMangroves are among the most effective natural systems for capturing and storing carbon, but new research suggests that rising sea levels could significantly reduce that benefit and may even cause these coastal forests to release carbon in the future.\nMade up of salt-tolerant plants that thrive along coastlines, mangroves occupy less than 1% of Earth’s surface. Despite their relatively small footprint, they hold roughly 15% of all carbon stored in the ocean, with most of that carbon locked away in the soils beneath them. Because of this remarkable capacity, mangroves play an important role in efforts to slow climate change.\nEarlier studies have suggested that higher sea levels might actually increase carbon storage in mangrove ecosystems. However, new findings indicate the overall picture may be far more complex.\nResearchers led by the University of Exeter, working with collaborators in Colombia and the United States, created a new modeling approach to explore how rising seas could affect carbon storage across whole mangrove forests rather than at individual locations.\nTheir analysis found that while some areas may temporarily accumulate more carbon as sea levels rise, the overall amount of carbon stored across entire mangrove forests is expected to decline over the next century.\n“Mangrove forests are efficient carbon sinks and are therefore crucial for slowing climate change,” said Dr. Arya Iwantoro, who carried out the research at the University of Exeter and is now based at the University of Plymouth.\n“Research about carbon storage in mangroves is usually based on field observations, and such studies have found that carbon storage can increase as sea levels rise.\n“But this may not reveal the wider picture of what is happening across the forest as a whole.\n“To investigate this, we developed a new model that links water flow and sediment transport, mangrove growth and dieback, and carbon storage while keeping track of changes in the composition of muddy beds where mangroves grow.\n“In effect, we created three models in one to assess the way these complex ecosystems may respond to rising seas.”\nAccording to the researchers, rising sea levels may initially boost carbon accumulation in certain locations. Over time, however, the broader impact is likely to be a reduction in carbon storage across mangrove forests.\n“Mangrove plants are highly specialized, and they require a certain duration of flooding with each tide,” said Luisa Fernanda Gómez Vargas, also from the University of Exeter.\n“If this period is exceeded, a location will no longer be suitable. The plants will ‘drown’ and mangroves will die back.\n“Mortality and erosion of carbon-rich soils can turn mangroves from a carbon sink (storing carbon) into a source (releasing it).”\nThe team tested several sea-level rise scenarios developed by the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change (IPCC). Their results showed that larger increases in sea level produce stronger negative effects on mangrove carbon storage.\nDr. Barend van Maanen, who leads the mangrove and carbon project at Exeter, said mangroves are increasingly vulnerable to climate change as well as other human pressures affecting rivers and coastlines.\n“Mangroves face an uncertain future due to climate change and other human impacts on rivers and coasts.\n“As well as being vital carbon stores, mangroves protect coasts from storms, provide livelihoods to coastal communities and habitats for a wide range of\n“Our findings emphasize that understanding the coastal landscape as a whole is crucial when predicting how mangroves might respond to climate change, and how we can protect them.”\nThe findings were published in the journal\nEarth’s Future\nin a paper titled “The importance of scale in the future of mangrove blue carbon under sea-level rise.”\nReference: “The Importance of Scale in the Future of Mangrove Blue Carbon Under Sea-Level Rise” by A. P. Iwantoro, D. H. Urrego, D. Xie, A. P. Nicholas, K. A. Hapsari, J. A. Rodríguez-Rodríguez, J. C. Restrepo, J. Polanía, R. E. Aalto, L. F. Gómez Vargas and B. van Maanen, 3 June 2026,\nEarth’s Future\nDOI: 10.1029/2025EF006984\nThe study was funded by the Natural Environment Research Council.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nClimate Change\nClimate Science\nUniversity of Exeter\nFirst Exploration of Ocean Currents Beneath the “Doomsday Glacier” Triggers Concerns\nEvidence of Antarctic Glacier’s Tipping Point Confirmed for First Time – Risk of Rapid and Irreversible Retreat\n20th Century Sea-Level Rise Was Fastest in 2,000 Years Along Much of U.S. East Coast\nWeird Asymmetry: Nights Warming Faster Than Days Across Much of the Planet\nScientists Warn: Ice Sheet Uncertainties Could Mean Sea Level Will Rise More Than Predicted\nDevastating Impact of Caspian Crisis: Sinking Sea Levels Threaten Biodiversity, Economy and Regional Stability\nOops! The World’s Oceans Soak Up Far More Carbon Than Most Scientific Models Suggest\nPioneering New Research Disputes “Wavier” Jet Stream Due to Arctic Warming\nHELIX Projects Warns Some Climate Change Impacts Locked In, Worst Can Still Be Avoided"},{"t":"可逆热驱动解锁软生物电子学的微创植入和回收","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73685?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Minimally invasive delivery of bioelectronics is currently limited by the irreversibility of deployment, rendering device retrieval traumatic and hindering clinical translation. Here, for the first time, we introduce a novel thermoresponsive, reversible‐actuating polymer (Trap) that enables both minimally invasive implantation and retrieval. Trap exhibits a mechanistically unique dual‐crystalline competition between (110)‐oriented low‐entropy crystals and (100)‐oriented high‐entropy crystals. The competitive crystallization governs bidirectional, stress‐free shape memory within a human‐compatible window (10°C–37°C), enabling rapid (&lt;3 s), fatigue‐resistant, and large reversible strain (∼30.17%). The solid–solid switching between two nanocrystalline states provides a robust and tunable actuation mode, allowing Trap to transition reversibly between compact 1D and functional 2D/3D geometries without mechanical loading. This materials’ innovation directly enables microinvasive deployment and retraction of Trap‐based neural electrodes through the same small incision (∼5 mm), as well as autonomous helical self‐assembly and thermal detachment on peripheral nerves, achieving stable electrophysiological interfacing over weeks to months. This work establishes a material‐centered framework for reversible biointerfaces, resolving the conflict between surgical invasiveness and device retrievability.","tp":"软材料植入","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队首次开发出一种新型热响应可逆驱动聚合物（Trap），实现了软生物电子器件的微创植入与回收。该聚合物通过(110)取向低熵晶体与(100)取向晶体之间的独特双晶竞争机制实现可逆驱动，解决了传统可展开器件不可逆、回收创伤大的临床瓶颈，推动了柔性生物电子学向临床转化。","aip":1},{"t":"揭示：金星捕蝇草如何以惊人的速度突然关闭","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01857-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Softening of the cells on the outermost surface of the trap lets the plant move at a breakneck pace. Softening of the cells on the outermost surface of the trap lets the plant move at a breakneck pace."},{"t":"量子信道的逆因果容量：通过含噪闭合类时曲线进行通信","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/znyd-npk5","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子信道容量","kp":["[量子信道]: 封闭类时曲线实现逆因果通信容量表征"],"dp":1,"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":1.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究提出了量子信道的逆因果容量（retrocausal capacity）概念，即在存在噪声闭合类时曲线（CTC）条件下的量子通信能力。作者建立了逆因果通信信道容量的信息论上界，分析了噪声对CTC辅助量子传输的退化效应。结果表明，即使CTC引入退相干噪声，仍可实现非零的逆因果信息传输，但容量随噪声强度迅速衰减。该工作推进了量子信息与时空因果结构交叉领域的基础理论。","ot":"Retrocausal Capacity of a Quantum Channel: Communicating through Noisy Closed Timelike Curves","b":"Author(s): Kaiyuan Ji, Seth Lloyd, and Mark M. WildeWe study the capacity of a quantum channel for retrocausal communication, where messages are transmitted backward in time, from a sender in the future to a receiver in the past, through a noisy postselected closed timelike curve mathematically represented by the channel. We completely characterize t…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230801] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"恢复因睡眠不足而中断的长期社会认可记忆","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adu9805?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Long-term social memories are vital for forming and maintaining relationships, and social amnesia can disrupt daily life. Using a new paradigm to study these hippocampus-dependent memories, we show that mice can distinguish between multiple social experiences even when they occur in the same context across days. Sleep deprivation immediately after socialization disrupts memory consolidation, leading to social amnesia. Treatment with the Food and Drug Administration–approved phosphodiesterase type 4 inhibitor roflumilast during sleep deprivation protects memory consolidation, while administration immediately before testing reverses social amnesia temporarily. Optogenetic reactivation of dentate gyrus engram cells restores social memory access and enables selective retrieval of individual memories. In addition, using two cFos-based engram-tagging strategies, we find that sleep deprivation selectively affects reactivation of experience-specific engrams while not affecting engram formation or overlap. These results suggest that impaired engram reactivation contributes to sleep deprivation–induced social amnesia and highlights the role of the hippocampal dentate gyrus in maintaining and distinguishing social experiences in a single context.","tp":"睡眠记忆研究","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"长期社会记忆对于建立和维持个体间关系至关重要，其受损会导致社会失忆并干扰正常生活。研究利用新型行为范式发现，小鼠能够区分在不同日期但相同环境下发生的多次社交经历。研究表明，社交后立即进行睡眠剥夺会破坏记忆巩固过程，导致小鼠出现社会失忆。值得注意的是，使用美国食品药品监督管理局（FDA）批准的磷酸二酯酶抑制剂进行治疗，能够有效恢复因睡眠不足而中断的海马体依赖性长期社会记忆。"},{"t":"用葡萄糖驱动的共生生物可吸收绷带恢复内源电场以促进糖尿病伤口愈合","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9445?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Endogenous electric fields (EFs) are essential for tissue regeneration but are diminished under hyperglycemia conditions, thereby impeding diabetic wound healing. Here, we report a biodegradable, glucose-powered electronic fabric bandage (GEB) that restores wound-edge electrical fields and enables closed-loop wound healing. To avoid compromising clinical applicability, we integrated all components into a soft, lightweight, and breathable bandage design to replace the traditional bulky electrical stimulator design. We also show the universal glucose-powered electricity generation and therapeutic functions of the electronic bandage across species and organs in diabetic wound models. In diabetic mouse wounds, porcine skin defects, and intestinal injury, the bandage uses endogenous glucose for power generation, thereby reducing local glucose levels and restoring the endogenous EF that guided cell migration, reprogrammed macrophage polarization, and promoted angiogenesis, to accelerate wound healing. These findings should establish an “endogenous glucose-powered symbiotic bioelectronics” paradigm for next-generation bioelectronic medicine.","tp":"电子绷带愈合","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究团队开发了一种可生物降解的葡萄糖驱动电子织物绷带（GEB），用于糖尿病伤口愈合。该绷带利用伤口部位葡萄糖作为能源，恢复受损的内源电场，实现闭环伤口愈合。所有组件集成于柔软、轻便、透气的织物设计中，替代了传统笨重的电刺激设备，具有良好临床应用前景。"},{"t":"电力-交通耦合网络中基于弹性定价的协调优化：学习增强混合整数方法","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600810X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网交通耦合定价","kp":["[方法]: 学习增强混合整数重构","[对象]: 电力-交通耦合网络定价协调"],"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"Resilient pricing-driven coordination of coupled power and transportation networks: A learning-augmented mixed-integer r"},{"t":"巴西户用光伏成本同比下降7% - pv magazine Global","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/el-precio-medio-de-la-energia-solar-en-brasil-retrocede-un-7-en-un-ano/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"巴西住宅光伏成本同比下降7%至2.45雷亚尔/瓦，主要受设备价格下降驱动。作为拉美最大光伏市场之一，巴西屋顶光伏的经济性持续改善，有助于分布式装机扩张，但也反映出全球光伏产业链价格博弈加剧。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"户用光伏成本","kp":["系统成本[巴西住宅PV]: 2.45 BRL/W","成本降幅[巴西住宅PV]: 同比7%"],"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Residential PV costs fell 7% year over year in Brazil - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nResidential solar PV costs in Brazil fell 7% year on year to BRL 2.45/W, driven by lower equipment prices amid global oversupply, with several states offering below-average installation costs.\nAlessandra Neris\nMarkets & Policy\nCommercial & industrial\nA rooftop PV array in Brazil | Image: Proyecto Bono Fotovoltaica Celesc\nThe cost of residential photovoltaic systems in Brazil continues to decline. Data from\nRadar Solfácil\n, a quarterly indicator tracking solar energy prices in the country, show that the average installation cost fell 7% between the first quarter of 2025 and the first quarter of 2026.\nAccording to the study, the national average price reached BRL 2.45 ($0.47)/W, the standard metric used to measure installed photovoltaic capacity. Costs in several states remained below the national average.\nAcre recorded the lowest average residential installation cost, at BRL 2.08/W, followed by Rondônia at BRL 2.17/W and Amazonas at BRL 2.18/W. Other states with below-average prices included Paraíba (BRL 2.25/W), Alagoas (BRL 2.26/W), Mato Grosso (BRL 2.29/W), Roraima (BRL 2.29/W), Mato Grosso do Sul (BRL 2.33/W), Paraná (BRL 2.35/W), and Amapá (BRL 2.36/W).\nAccording to Fabio Carrara, CEO and founder of financing provider Solfácil, falling equipment prices have created a favorable environment for consumers considering investments in distributed solar generation.\n“Brazilian consumers are facing a very favorable window for investing in solar energy. We currently see a global scenario of oversupply of raw materials and equipment, particularly in China, which has driven prices down. However, this dynamic is unlikely to last indefinitely. The sector’s natural trend points toward stabilization or even a gradual rise in prices. In practical terms, this may be one of the most affordable times to install solar energy in Brazil,” he said.\nCarrara said that oversupply across the global supply chain, particularly in China, has been a key driver of lower photovoltaic system costs. He added that this trend is expected to lose momentum in the coming years, with prices likely to stabilize or gradually increase.\nAlessandra Neris\nView author posts"},{"t":"雷普索尔将705MW西班牙可再生能源股权出售给马斯达尔","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/repsol-sells-stake-in-705-mw-of-spanish-renewables-to-masdar-1296301/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Renewables Now","as":"西班牙能源巨头Repsol将其在705MW西班牙可再生能源资产中的股权出售给阿联酋Masdar，标志着中东主权资本继续渗透欧洲清洁能源版图。对Repsol而言，此举可回笼资金、优化资产结构，同时降低在能源转型期的资本压力。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"可再生能源资产交易","kp":["装机规模[西班牙可再生能源]: 705MW"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.5,"r":2.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Repsol sells stake in 705 MW of Spanish renewables to Masdar","b":"Repsol sells stake in 705 MW of Spanish renewables to Masdar | Renewable Energy News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nabout 14 hours ago\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nRepsol sells stake in 705 MW of Spanish renewables to Masdar\nJun 11, 2026, 5:33:47 PM\nSladjana Djunisic\nOnshore Wind\nRegion/Country:\nLatest top stories\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nabout 14 hours ago\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nLatest in Solar power\nChile's Colbun to supply 100% renewable power to telco Gtd\nJun 11, 2026\nEnray Power obtains GBP 43m for solar project in North Yorkshire\nJun 11, 2026\nEskom launches dedicated renewables unit Eskom Green\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Onshore wind\nGreenGo wins approval for 12-MW wind project in southern Italy\nJun 11, 2026\nWallenstam sells 112 MW of Swedish wind assets to Locus Energy\nJun 11, 2026\nJUWI to reduce German workforce, plans management changes\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in EUROPE\nRWE starts erecting Vestas turbines at Nordseecluster A off Germany\nJun 11, 2026\nIberdrola works on 10 solar communities in Portugal\nJun 11, 2026\nLichtBlick breaks ground on solar park in Germany\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Deals\nSembcorp closes Alinta deal, adds 13.8 GW to Aussie portfolio\nJun 11, 2026\nForesight to sell public markets arm to Guinness Global Investors\nJun 11, 2026\nApex sells 28 MW of Illinois community solar projects to SolAmerica\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Solar power\nChile's Colbun to supply 100% renewable power to telco Gtd\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Onshore wind\nGreenGo wins approval for 12-MW wind project in southern Italy\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in EUROPE\nRWE starts erecting Vestas turbines at Nordseecluster A off Germany\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Deals\nSembcorp closes Alinta deal, adds 13.8 GW to Aussie portfolio\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Spain\nGalileo gets consent for 20 MW of battery storage projects in Spain\nJun 11, 2026\nMost read stories\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"由于股票交易暂停，Leclanché 报告暂缓执行 – Batteries International","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/report-reprieve-for-leclanche-as-shares-trading-suspended/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Batteries International","tg":"资本运作","b":"Energy Storage, News\nReport reprieve for Leclanché as shares trading suspended\n–  June 11, 2026 12:48 pm BST\nTroubled Swiss energy storage group Leclanché has secured a temporary exemption from the publication of the firm’s annual report for 2025 ― but said trading of shares in the firm remains suspended.\nThe company confirmed on June 10 it had been given until July 31 to file the report with SIX Exchange Regulation (SER), which regulates and monitors exchange participants and issuers on the Swiss Stock Exchange.\nThe temporary exemption for publishing the report follows a previous extension granted on April 29, which extended the original April 30 deadline for publication of the report to May 31.\nSIX said on June 1 it was temporarily suspending shares trading in Leclanché until the annual report was released.\nThe report extension deadline comes just weeks after Leclanché\nthe appointment of Jens Emrich as chief financial officer, to succeed Hubert Angleys ― who left the company last November on completion of what Leclanché said was his temporary assignment to the post.\nEmrich’s appointment came just days after Leclanché said it had concluded a financing arrangement with strategic partners in the amount of CHF 16.7 million ($22 million) to support its near-term operational requirements.\nBatteries International\nreported in June 2025 that Leclanché was pushing ahead with efforts “to achieve and maintain a positive equity position” and to demonstrate the firm’s ability to continue as a going concern through at least June 2026.\nThe company had said previously that it was in a situation of negative equity as of the end of 2024.","tp":"电池股停牌","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":0.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":7.0},"as":"瑞士储能公司Leclanché获得SIX交易所监管机构批准，将2025年度报告提交期限暂缓至7月31日。尽管获得报告暂缓，公司股票交易仍处于暂停状态。这家陷入困境的瑞士储能集团面临持续财务压力，股票交易暂停反映了其严重的经营困难。"},{"t":"RWE在澳大利亚投运50MW/400MWh长时储能电池 - Energy Storage","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/11/rwe-opens-50-mw-400-mwh-long-duration-battery-in-australia/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"长时储能","kp":["容量[长时储能BESS]: 50MW/400MWh"],"as":"德国能源公司RWE正式启用位于澳大利亚的Limondale长时储能项目，规模50MW/400MWh，对应8小时放电时长。该项目是澳大利亚电网灵活性与可再生能源消纳的关键基础设施，体现了长时储能在高比例新能源系统中的工程落地趋势。","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"RWE opens 50 MW/400 MWh long-duration battery in Australia - Energy Storage","b":"A ribbon-cutting ceremony this week celebrated the official opening of the\nLimondale battery energy storage system\n(BESS), attended by the BESS owner and operator Germany-headquartered developer RWE Renewables Australia, project partners and the New South Wales (NSW) government representatives.\nNSW Minister for Climate Change and Energy Penny Sharpe said batteries like Limondale mean the state won’t waste an electron of solar and can power the state with renewables. “It’s exciting to cut the ribbon on this Australian-first battery, which will get more renewable energy into the grid, placing\ndownward pressure\non bills,” Sharpe said.\nLocated near Balranald in southwest NSW, 854 kilometres southwest of Sydney, the Limondale BESS was the first project awarded a\nlong-term energy service agreement\n(LTESA) for long-duration storage under the NSW Electricity Infrastructure Roadmap (EIR).\nThe system’s 144 containerized, utility-scale lithium-ion, custom-configured Tesla Megapacks have a total storage capacity of at least 400 MWh, with the ability to provide energy for over eight hours, making it the longest-duration battery operating in Australia.\nThe Megapacks were delivered to Limondale pre-assembled from Tesla’s Californian Gigafactory, and Tesla states each single Megapack unit provides approximately 3.9 to 4.3 MWh of standalone storage.\nThey use grid-forming inverters and create their own stable voltage signal instead of tracking the existing grid frequency.\nThe asymmetrical charge/discharge system can draw power from the grid, or the adjacent 314 MW Limondale Solar Farm, at 100 MW for rapid charging but discharges at a capped rate of 50 MW.\nLimondale was developed by RWE Renewables Australia with support from US-headquartered Tesla, Melbourne-headquartered clean energy company Beon Energy Solutions and Australian transmission companies Lumea and Transgrid.\nDuring the ceremony RWE Renewables Australia Chief Executive Officer Daniel Belton thanked the RWE team, project partners, the NSW government, and ASL, “for their outstanding collaboration and commitment in safely bringing this ground-breaking project to completion.”\n“We are incredibly proud to deliver the Limondale BESS. As one of Australia’s most significant battery storage projects, it represents a major step forward for long-duration energy storage and contributes to a more reliable, resilient, and sustainable energy system,” Belton said."},{"t":"基于熵惩罚方法的非线性哈密顿-雅可比方程粘性解量子算法","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607144123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子哈密顿方程","kp":["[方法]: 熵惩罚法求解HJ方程粘性解"],"as":"该研究提出一个量子算法框架，用于高效求解非线性Hamilton-Jacobi方程的粘性解。此类方程广泛出现于最优控制、博弈论与流体力学中，经典数值方法在复杂高维情形下计算成本极高。量子算法有望实现多项式级加速，为科学计算提供新路径。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Quantum algorithms for viscosity solutions to nonlinear Hamilton–Jacobi equations based on an entropy penalization metho","b":"We present a framework for efficient extraction of the viscosity solutions of nonlinear Hamilton–Jacobi equations with convex Hamiltonians. These viscosity solutions play a central role in areas such as front propagation, mean-field games, optimal control, machine learning, and a direct application to the forced Burgers’ equation. Our method is based on an entropy penalization method which generalizes the Cole–Hopf transform from quadratic to general convex Hamiltonians, allowing an approximation of viscous Hamilton–Jacobi dynamics by a discrete-time linear dynamics which approximates a linear heat-like parabolic equation, and thus can also extend to continuous-time dynamics. This makes the method suitable for quantum simulation. The validity of these results hold for arbitrary nonlinearity that correspond to convex Hamiltonians, and for arbitrarily long times, thus obviating a chief obstacle in most quantum algorithms for nonlinear partial differential equations. We provide quantum algorithms—both analog and digital—for extracting pointwise values, gradients, minima, and function evaluations at the minimizer of the viscosity solution, without requiring nonlinear updates or full state reconstruction."},{"t":"量化需求侧管理在构建能源灵活性中的作用：智能就绪指标 a 的证据","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008512?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"需求侧管理","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":""},{"t":"弹性变形共价晶体中晶格应变的定量研究","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/3pvs-gdp8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"晶体弹性应变","kp":["弹性应变[共价晶体]: 微纳尺度超大弹性应变","材料体系[应变工程]: 硅、金刚石等共价半导体"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦共价晶体在弹性形变下的晶格应变量化。共价晶体(如金刚石、碳化硅)具有强方向性键合和高模量，其弹性形变行为对半导体器件、功能材料设计至关重要。研究团队通过实验与计算结合，精确测量晶格应变分布，揭示弹性变形微观机制。该成果对理解共价键材料的力学极限、设计高应变容忍度功能器件、以及在压电传感和柔性电子领域的应用具有重要指导意义。","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Quantifying Lattice Strains in Elastically Deformed Covalent Crystals","b":"Author(s): Jiayi Li, Heyi Wang, Juzheng Chen, Qian Zhang, Fanling Meng, Yiling Lian, Man Kit Cheng, Pak San Yip, Kefan Guo, Wenjun Liang, Yu Deng, and Yang LuCovalent semiconductor crystals such as silicon and diamond have demonstrated ultralarge elastic strains at micro and nanoscales, enabling desired figures of merit for strain engineered electronic and optoelectronic devices. However, the underlying origin of their elasticity—whether it arises from p…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236102] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"派能科技推出8MWh储能系统，能量密度达426Wh/L - pv magazine Global","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/pylontech-launches-8-mwh-storage-system-with-426-wh-l-energy-density/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能系统","kp":["能量密度[PyOcean系统]: 426Wh/L","系统容量[液冷BESS]: 8MWh","电芯容量[储能电池]: 588Ah/601Ah"],"as":"Pylontech(派能科技)在2026年SNEC展会上推出PyOcean系列8MWh液冷储能系统，能量密度达426Wh/L。该系列采用自研588Ah和601Ah大容量电芯，面向电网侧及大型商业储能场景。液冷技术有效提升散热效率和循环寿命，8MWh单舱容量降低了系统占地面积和安装成本。426Wh/L的体积能量密度在当前液冷储能系统中处于领先水平，体现了大容量电芯+液冷集成路线的工程化进展，对降低储能度电成本(LCOS)有积极意义。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":7.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Pylontech launches 8 MWh storage system with 426 Wh/L energy density - pv magazine Global","cl":"7d58e402c4","cp":0,"cln":"派能科技|PyOcean 8MWh液冷储能系统|SNEC展会发布|2026-06-12","b":"Technology & Products\nThe series uses Pylontech’s in-house 588 Ah and 601 Ah cells for grid-side and large commercial and industrial (C&I) storage applications.\nVincent Shaw\nTechnology & Products\nEnergy Storage\nUtility-scale\nImage: pv magazine\nPylontech has introduced its PyOcean series of liquid-cooled battery energy storage systems at SNEC 2026 in Shanghai, targeting grid-side storage, large C&I projects, and emerging AI data center applications.\nThe company first unveiled the PyOcean platform at the ESIE energy storage exhibition in Beijing in April. At SNEC, it formally presented the system to the wider solar-plus-storage market, positioning it as an “asset-return-oriented” storage product designed around project economics rather than capacity alone.\nThe PyOcean series includes two main configurations. The PyOcean-M7-6250 offers 6.25 MWh of DC capacity and uses Pylontech’s 588 Ah LFP cells. The larger PyOcean-M9-8000 provides 8.0 MWh of DC capacity and is based on the company’s 601 Ah LFP cells. Pylontech said the system reaches an energy density of up to 426 Wh/L. The 601 Ah cell is rated for more than 12,000 cycles and a round-trip efficiency of 96.5%.\nAccording to the company, the M9 system is designed for large-scale storage projects where land use, civil works, and long-term returns are key considerations. Pylontech claims that the use of larger cells and a more integrated system architecture reduces component count by 50%, land use by 38%, and installation workload by 10%. For an 800 MWh storage project, the company said the PyOcean-M9-8000 can reduce direct investment by more than 10% compared with conventional designs.\nThe series is based on Pylontech’s full-stack development model. The company designs and manufactures its own cells, battery management systems, and energy storage systems, enabling optimization of cell chemistry, battery management system (BMS) algorithms, thermal management, and system architecture. The PyOcean platform uses state of charge (SOC) estimation algorithms with accuracy within 1%, full-domain balancing technology, and multi-cluster direct current (MCDC) cluster balancing to mitigate circulating currents and SOC deviation in parallel operation.\nSafety and operational efficiency are also key design priorities. The system features liquid cooling, three-layer fire protection, low-noise and low-heat operation, and low-power consumption design. Pylontech said the product is compatible with centralized and string PCS architectures and is designed to support grid-forming requirements under Chinese standards.\nAt SNEC, the company also presented PyOcean-based solutions for solar-plus-storage plants and AI data centers. For AIDC applications, Pylontech highlighted lithium–sodium hybrid storage concepts intended to support millisecond-level response and virtual inertia requirements for AI training loads.\nPylontech said it signed strategic cooperation agreements with several large energy groups and AI companies during the exhibition, but did not disclose details. The company expects first deliveries of the PyOcean system to begin in the third quarter of 2026.\nVincent Shaw\nView author posts"},{"t":"派能科技推出8MWh储能系统，能量密度达426Wh/L - Energy Storage","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/11/pylontech-launches-8-mwh-storage-system-with-426-wh-l-energy-density/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"液冷储能系统","kp":["能量密度[PyOcean系统]: 426Wh/L","系统容量[液冷BESS]: 8MWh","应用[储能系统]: 电网/AI数据中心"],"as":"Pylontech在2026年上海SNEC展会上发布PyOcean系列液冷电池储能系统，单机容量达8MWh，能量密度426Wh/L。该产品瞄准电网级及大型工商业储能应用，采用液冷热管理方案，在能量密度、循环寿命和系统安全性之间取得平衡。426Wh/L的体积能量密度结合8MWh舱级容量，反映了行业向大电芯、高集成度方向加速演进的趋势，有望进一步压缩储能项目的土地和基建投入。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":7.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Pylontech launches 8 MWh storage system with 426 Wh/L energy density - Energy Storage","cl":"7d58e402c4","cp":1,"cln":"派能科技|PyOcean 8MWh液冷储能系统|SNEC展会发布|2026-06-12","b":"Pylontech has introduced its PyOcean series of liquid-cooled battery energy storage systems at SNEC 2026 in Shanghai, targeting grid-side storage, large C&I projects, and emerging AI data center applications.\nThe company first unveiled the PyOcean platform at the ESIE energy storage exhibition in Beijing in April. At SNEC, it formally presented the system to the wider solar-plus-storage market, positioning it as an “asset-return-oriented” storage product designed around project economics rather than capacity alone.\nThe PyOcean series includes two main configurations. The PyOcean-M7-6250 offers 6.25 MWh of DC capacity and uses Pylontech’s 588 Ah LFP cells. The larger PyOcean-M9-8000 provides 8.0 MWh of DC capacity and is based on the company’s 601 Ah LFP cells. Pylontech said the system reaches an energy density of up to 426 Wh/L. The 601 Ah cell is rated for more than 12,000 cycles and a round-trip efficiency of 96.5%.\nAccording to the company, the M9 system is designed for large-scale storage projects where land use, civil works, and long-term returns are key considerations. Pylontech claims that the use of larger cells and a more integrated system architecture reduces component count by 50%, land use by 38%, and installation workload by 10%. For an 800 MWh storage project, the company said the PyOcean-M9-8000 can reduce direct investment by more than 10% compared with conventional designs.\nThe series is based on Pylontech’s full-stack development model. The company designs and manufactures its own cells, battery management systems, and energy storage systems, enabling optimization of cell chemistry, battery management system (BMS) algorithms, thermal management, and system architecture. The PyOcean platform uses state of charge (SOC) estimation algorithms with accuracy within 1%, full-domain balancing technology, and multi-cluster direct current (MCDC) cluster balancing to mitigate circulating currents and SOC deviation in parallel operation.\nSafety and operational efficiency are also key design priorities. The system features liquid cooling, three-layer fire protection, low-noise and low-heat operation, and low-power consumption design. Pylontech said the product is compatible with centralized and string PCS architectures and is designed to support grid-forming requirements under Chinese standards.\nAt SNEC, the company also presented PyOcean-based solutions for solar-plus-storage plants and AI data centers. For AIDC applications, Pylontech highlighted lithium–sodium hybrid storage concepts intended to support millisecond-level response and virtual inertia requirements for AI training loads.\nPylontech said it signed strategic cooperation agreements with several large energy groups and AI companies during the exhibition, but did not disclose details. The company expects first deliveries of the PyOcean system to begin in the third quarter of 2026."},{"t":"热压对超声喷涂膜电极铂负载量依赖效应（PEM燃料电池）","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008068?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池膜电极","kp":["[对象]: PEM燃料电池膜电极","[工艺]: 超声喷涂+热压","[变量]: Pt负载量"],"as":"","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Pt loading-dependent effects of hot pressing on ultrasonic-sprayed membrane electrodes for PEM fuel cells"},{"t":"蛋白质名称混淆导致抗体混淆","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5919?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cancer and cell-aging studies may have relied on antibodies to incorrect molecule","tp":"抗体混淆","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"近期研究指出，由于蛋白质名称混淆所导致的抗体误用问题正在严重影响生命科学研究的可靠性。在癌症和细胞衰老等相关领域的研究中，许多实验可能错误地使用了针对错误分子的抗体。这种因蛋白质命名重叠或相似引发的“抗体混淆”，不仅会误导实验数据的解读，还可能得出错误的科学结论，对相关医学和生物学研究的准确性构成了隐患，亟需引起学术界的高度关注并规范蛋白质命名。"},{"t":"用于高血糖和高血糖代谢性疾病多器官靶向的肽治疗药物的程序性口服给药","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef3323?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Systemic metabolic disorders such as diabetes and hyperuricemia demand multiorgan therapeutic intervention, yet single-target therapies often fail to restore homeostasis. Here, we present an orally administered, multistage-targeted nanoplatform (P1P2NPs) for the sequential delivery of therapeutic peptides to distinct organs. P1P2NPs is composed of a bioresponsive polymer poly(β-amino ester)-disulfide bond-poly(carboxybetaine) (PAE-SS-PCB), 1,2-distearoyl-\n                    sn\n                    -glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine-block poly(carboxybetaine) (DSPE-PCB) and Eudragit L100-55, designed to release peptide P2 (Val-Pro-Tyr-Pro-Gln) in the intestine for dipeptidyl peptidase-IV (DPP-IV) inhibition, while hepatic-targeted peptide P1(Pro-Pro-Lys-Asn-Trp) is selectively liberated in the liver to suppress xanthine oxidase (XOD). Fabricated through sequential emulsification and layer-by-layer assembly, P1P2NPs exhibit spatiotemporal control over drug release, enabling precise modulation of intestinal and hepatic metabolic pathways. In a murine model of diabetic-hyperuricemia comorbidity, the nanoplatform demonstrated synergistic efficacy by normalizing glucose and uric acid levels through multiorgan targeting. This work establishes a paradigm for spatially controlled peptide delivery, offering a versatile strategy for treating complex metabolic diseases.","tp":"肽药物递送","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究提出了一种名为P1P2NPs的口服多级靶向纳米平台，旨在通过程序性给药，将治疗性肽类药物序贯递送至不同器官，以治疗糖尿病和高尿酸血症等系统性代谢疾病。该平台由生物响应性聚合物聚(β-氨基酯)-二硫键-聚(羧基甜菜碱)等材料构成。针对单靶点疗法难以恢复机体稳态的痛点，该技术为多器官靶向干预提供了全新的解决方案，展现出显著的疾病治疗潜力。"},{"t":"可编程光学百万像素纳米折纸矩阵","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73647?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米剪纸光学阵列","kp":["技术[可编程光阵列]: 像素化纳米剪纸机电重构"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种可编程光学百万像素纳米折纸矩阵技术。通过像素级编程控制微型化光学阵列，实现大像素数的光学操控能力，可应用于先进光学计算、成像和通信等前沿领域，代表了纳米级光学器件集成与可控性的一次重大突破。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Programmable Optical Megapixel Nano‐Kirigami Matrix","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Pixel‐programmable miniaturized optical arrays with large pixel count are essential for cutting‐edge fields such as micro‐displays, photonic chips, and light detection modules. In recent advances, a universal strategy with ultrahigh pixel count and highly flexible programmability remains lacking. Here we report a programmable optical nano‐kirigami matrix with pixelated electromechanical reconfigurations. Deformable pixel arrays with high duty cycle and optical contrast are conceptually designed and experimentally realized based on a suspended turn‐shaped nano‐kirigami configuration. By employing the central plate to induce electrostatic force and the deformed arms to scatter incident light, switchable optical encryption and reconfigurable information display are demonstrated by programing the nano‐kirigami matrices with a pitch size of only a few micrometers. Furthermore, line‐level modulation based programmable information transmission and light projection are achieved by using a stripe‐shaped addressable nano‐kirigami matrix with 3.87 megapixels, showcasing an optical micro‐array with large pixel count and flexible programmability. Our work enables the high visibility and precise addressability of freely controllable electromechanical arrays with massive pixels, which could greatly improve the practical applicability for miniaturized optical arrays and brings potential applications in micro‐displays, photoelectronic chips, intelligent machine visions, hyperspectral image sensors, etc."},{"t":"机器学习引导超材料实现可编程流体力学隐身","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73690?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水动力超材料","kp":["技术[流体力学隐身]: 机器学习引导超材料","特性[水动力斗篷]: 可编程适应背景渗透率"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用机器学习引导的超材料设计，实现了可编程流体力学隐身技术。通过智能设计多孔介质中超材料的结构，可主动操控流体在多孔介质中的传输行为，使物体在流体中实现隐身效果，在流体控制、过滤和化工分离等领域具有广泛应用潜力。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Programmable Hydrodynamic Invisibility Enabled by Machine‐Learning‐Guided Metamaterials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Manipulation of fluid transport in porous media underpins a broad range of technological applications and natural processes. Hydrodynamic invisibility enables flow manipulation without disturbing the external flow field, with representative devices including cloaks, concentrators, rotators, and camouflage. However, most existing devices are static and thus fail when background permeability varies. Here we present a machine‐learning‐guided metamaterial strategy for programmable hydrodynamic invisibility, using a cloak as a model system. A tunable‐permeability shell maintains cloaking across a wide range of background permeabilities and enables hydrodynamic camouflage by matching prescribed exterior reference flows. An inverse‐design framework rapidly maps target permeability responses to manufacturable geometries, and experiments validate high‐fidelity performance under high, medium, and low background permeabilities. These results indicate that programmable hydrodynamic metamaterials provide a scalable, general strategy for robust, on‐demand manipulation of fluid transport in porous media, with potential applications in separation science, microfluidics, flow‐network engineering, and soft‐matter biomechanics and poroelasticity."},{"t":"辉能科技与OPmobility合作将固态电芯集成为电池模组 - electrive.com","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.electrive.com/2026/06/11/prologium-and-opmobility-to-integrate-solid-state-cells-into-modules/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"electrive","tg":"产业进展","tp":"固态电池模组","kp":["[固态电池模组]: 辉能-OPmobility电芯集成至模组"],"as":"台湾固态电池企业辉能科技（ProLogium）与法国汽车零部件供应商OPmobility（原Plastic Omnium）宣布合作，将固态电池电芯集成至电池模组中。此次合作旨在推动固态电池在电动汽车领域的工程化落地与规模化应用，加速高安全、高能量密度电池技术的商业化进程。","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"ProLogium and OPmobility to integrate solid-state cells into modules - electrive.com","b":"Taiwanese solid-state battery specialist ProLogium and French automotive supplier OPmobility (formerly Plastic Omnium) want to discuss the integration of solid-state cells into battery modules for electric vehicles. To this end, both parties have now signed a letter of intent.\nImage: ProLogium\nProLogium recently began construction of a solid-state battery cell plant in Dunkirk, France, with the cells set to roll off the production line from 2028. The Taiwanese battery specialist is now exploring a collaboration with OPmobility, a supplier based in Levallois-Perret near Paris, to jointly integrate these cells into battery modules and, eventually, into packs. The companies’ stated goal is “to deliver a system-level solution that meets the rapidly growing demand of the global EV market,” according to a statement.\nProLogium specialises in the development and production of lithium-ceramic solid-state battery cells. The company’s current battery generation, named the ‘Superfluidized All Inorganic Solid-State Lithium Ceramic Battery’, is claimed to achieve a volumetric energy density of 900 Wh/l and a gravimetric energy density of 380 Wh/kg. ProLogium states that the charging time from 5 to 80 per cent is ‘approximately 6.4 minutes’. Additionally, the company highlights: “In durability and use-case performance, cycle life exceeds 1,200 cycles, and discharge at -20°C maintains over 95 per cent performance.”\nThe collaboration with OPmobility aims to explore ways to integrate ProLogium’s cells into ready-to-install battery products. In an initial phase, ProLogium will supply solid-state battery cells to OPmobility for electrical performance testing, “under aligned test protocols and engineering workflows”. OPmobility will subsequently handle the design, development, and manufacturing of the battery modules using the cells provided by ProLogium. The shared objective is to develop a battery module solution that can be adopted by OEMs for future EV platforms,” the partners emphasised.\nProLogium stresses the importance of aligning test protocols and technical workflows to achieve faster technical convergence and better assessment of system integration. This helps “both parties identify key parameters and challenges earlier and improve future OEM engagement efficiency”. However, both parties are still yet to confirm their intentions. In their forthcoming discussions, they hope to investigate and validate how advantages at the cell level can be technically implemented and verified at the module and pack levels.\nVincent Yang, Founder and CEO of ProLogium, commented: “For solid-state batteries to be truly adopted by the market, the key is system integration and validation – from cells to modules and packs. This MoU with OPmobility starts from pragmatic performance testing and module development under aligned test protocols and engineering workflows, clarifying the critical path for vehicle integration. Our shared goal is an OEM-adoptable module solution, and we will continue to advance discussions within a compliant framework.”\nYoussef Souiba, Executive Vice President at OPmobility, added: “Working with an established leader in the field of solid-state batteries such as ProLogium strengthens OPmobility’s ability to anticipate the needs of global automotive manufacturers and supports the Group’s ambition to expand its technology portfolio and its customer reach.”\nFor context: ProLogium\nofficially began construction\nof its factory in Dunkirk in February, following an announcement in 2023. The first phase, aimed at producing fourth-generation lithium-ceramic solid-state batteries with an initial annual capacity of 0.8 GWh, is scheduled for completion in 2028. Drawing on experience from an existing 3 GWh factory in Taoyuan, Taiwan, the ramp-up of production in Dunkirk is expected to proceed relatively quickly. From 2029, capacity is set to increase, with Phase 2 reaching full utilisation at 4 GWh per year by 2030. By 2032, the ‘Fab 1’ facility is planned to achieve its full capacity of 12 GWh.\nWhile investor\nis the primary customer for the lithium-ceramic solid-state batteries produced at ProLogium’s Taoyuan plant, no anchor customer has yet been publicly announced for the Dunkirk project. However, ProLogium is one of the few companies in the industry to have demonstrated the ability to manufacture such lithium-ceramic solid-state batteries: since 2024, over 750,000 cells have been produced at the Taoyuan facility, according to the company.\nabout „ProLogium and OPmobility to integrate solid-state cells into modules“"},{"t":"精准医学的盲点：重新平衡证据基础以反映女性健康","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aei0515?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Precision medicine requires an evidence base that reflects women’s biology, demanding reforms in funding, study design, and sex-disaggregated reporting."},{"t":"纳米合金电催化剂的精确原子掺杂：开辟高效析氢反应新路径","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71156?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解水制氢催化剂","kp":["[电催化剂]: 纳米合金精确原子掺杂提升析氢效率"],"dp":1,"as":"电解水制氢是应对全球能源危机的关键技术路径，但高度依赖铂族贵金属催化剂，成本高昂。该研究提出纳米合金电催化剂的精确原子级掺杂策略，通过调控活性位点电子结构提升催化效率与稳定性，为降低贵金属用量、推动绿氢大规模产业化开辟新方向。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Precision Atomic Doping of Nanoalloy Electrocatalysts: Unlocking New Paths for Efficient Hydrogen Evolution Reaction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Hydrogen production via water electrolysis is a key solution to the global energy crisis. Platinum‐group catalysts, while highly efficient for the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), are limited by their scarcity and high cost, restricting their industrial application. Nanoalloy electrocatalysts (NAEs) have emerged as promising alternatives due to their adjustable electronic structures, high conductivity, and synergistic active sites. However, they still face challenges in balancing activity and stability, as well as in reaction kinetics. Research shows that precision doping can enhance NAEs' performance by tailoring electronic configurations, optimizing adsorption energetics, and exposing latent active sites. This review explores the mechanistic basis of these doping effects by examining HER mechanisms in acidic and basic media. It systematically categorizes and summarizes doping methods, dividing dopants into noble metals, non‐noble metals, and non‐metals, and detailing their roles and characteristics. A “Relative Improvement (RI)” metric is introduced to quantitatively benchmark performance gains. The review also delves into emerging frontiers like operando characterization, circular catalyst design, and integration with alternative anodic reactions. By highlighting atomic‐level doping as crucial for next‐generation electrolyzers, this review aims to advance economically viable green hydrogen production."},{"t":"粲夸克色电偶极矩的精确测量","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/ycwh-3gy8","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): M. Ablikim et al. (BESIII Collaboration)The combined symmetry of charge conjugation and parity ($CP$) is tested in the hadronic transition $ψ(3686)→{π}^{+}{π}^{−}J/ψ$, using a dataset of $(2712.4±14.3)×{10}^{6}\\text{ }\\text{ }ψ(3686)$ events collected by the BESIII detector at the BEPCII collider. The resulting asymmetry observable is ${A…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231903] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"软三轴偶偶Xe同位素中可能的摆动模式","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/14kh-p5g3","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Y. M. Wang, Q. B. Chen, and Z. P. LiThe nature of the $γ$ band is studied for the soft triaxial even-even Xe isotopes $^{122–128}\\mathrm{Xe}$ employing the five-dimensional collective Hamiltonian based on relativistic density functional theory. The theoretical calculations successfully reproduce the experimental staggering parameters …[Phys. Rev. C 113, L061301] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"浦项及合作伙伴瞄准ESS和电动汽车市场，建设韩国LFP正极材料工厂 - Batteries International","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/posco-and-partners-target-ess-evs-with-korean-lfp-cathode-materials-plant/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Batteries International","tg":"产业进展","tp":"LFP正极材料","kp":["[LFP正极材料]: 韩国合资工厂瞄准ESS与EV"],"as":"浦项制铁（Posco）联合合作伙伴在韩国建设磷酸铁锂（LFP）正极材料工厂，目标瞄准储能系统（ESS）和电动汽车市场。此举旨在打造本土LFP供应链，减少对中国进口的依赖，提升韩国在电池关键材料领域的自主能力，反映全球电池产业链区域化、本土化加速重构趋势。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":8.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Posco and partners target ESS, EVs with Korean LFP cathode materials plant – Batteries International","b":"Energy Storage, News, Other Chemistries\nPosco and partners target ESS, EVs with Korean LFP cathode materials plant\n–  June 11, 2026 10:46 am BST\nImpression of joint venture's LFP cathode materials plant\nA South Korean joint venture including battery material and chemicals group Posco Future M has broken ground for an LFP cathode materials plant in the country targeting the ESS and EV batteries market.\nCNP New Material Technology, backed by Posco, secondary batteries firm Pino and battery materials producer CNGR, started building the facility “in earnest” on May 28 ― with production set to start next year.\nPosco said the Pohang facility will ramp up production to an annual capacity of 50,000 tonnes.\nSeparately, Posco is itself converting part of an existing three-element high-nickel production line at its Pohang cathode material plant into an LFP cathode material production line.\nPrototype production will begin soon and mass production is planned from the second half of this year, giving Posco an early entry into the LFP cathode material business, the group said.\nWhile LFP batteries have lower output compared to ternary batteries such as NCM and NCA, they have an advantage in terms of low price and long lifespan, Posco said.\nHowever, the group plans to market LFP products alongside its current main ternary products such as NCM and NCA batteries.\nPosco said an expansion of renewable energy and spread of AI-based data centres in South Korea and globally have led to increased power needs, leading to a rapid rise in demand for LFP batteries for ESS, and the use of LFP batteries is also expanding in the EV market, especially in entry-level vehicles.\nNorth America and Europe are seen as key overseas markets for LFP batteries from the joint venture as those regions look to secure supply chains.\nBatteries International\nlast year that South Korea had scrambled to shore up the country’s battery sector with an initial cash infusion worth close to $15 billion, as a global slump in EV sales took its toll on the industry.\nKorea’s Ministry of Trade, Industry and Energy said on January 15 the KRW21 trillion jump-start was needed to ensure Korean battery production for EVs and energy storage systems could remain competitive at home and abroad."},{"t":"胎盘烟酰胺腺嘌呤二核苷酸调节分娩时间","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz1624?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Labor is mediated proximately by prostaglandin signaling within gestational tissues and must be tightly regulated for birth to occur after appropriate fetal development. Metabolic changes accompanying gestational aging have been postulated as a determinant of birth timing, but specific nutrients, sensors, and messengers remain obscure. We report that placental nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide (NAD\n                    +\n                    ) dynamically tunes gestational length. Depletion of placental NAD\n                    +\n                    in mice provoked labor onset, mediated by the role of NAD\n                    +\n                    as a cofactor for 15-hydroxy prostaglandin dehydrogenase, an enzyme responsible for suppressing prostaglandin accumulation. Augmentation of placental NAD\n                    +\n                    prolonged gestation at baseline and in a model of preterm labor. These findings suggest a central role for metabolic exhaustion in provoking labor and reveal potential therapeutic avenues for preterm labor and the optimization of labor induction.","tp":"胎盘NAD分娩","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现胎盘中的烟酰胺腺嘌呤二核苷酸（NAD+）能够动态调节妊娠期长度并控制分娩时间。分娩过程受多种因素调控，但其具体代谢机制尚不明确。该研究揭示了伴随妊娠衰老发生的特定代谢变化是决定分娩时间的关键因素。通过调节胎盘NAD+水平，可以影响前列腺素信号传导，从而干预分娩启动。这为理解胎儿发育和分娩发动的生理机制提供了重要见解，并为预防早产等妊娠并发症提供了潜在的治疗靶点。"},{"t":"电荷密度波材料中的相选择 Floquet 工程","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538027123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Floquet engineering has emerged as a powerful approach for dynamically tailoring the electronic structures of quantum materials through time-periodic light fields. The light fields generated by ultrafast laser pulses can transiently dress Bloch electrons, creating novel electronic states inaccessible in equilibrium. While such temporal modulation provides a dynamic control, spatially periodic modulations, such as those arising from charge density wave (CDW) order, can also dramatically reconstruct the electronic structure through real-space symmetry breaking. The interplay between these two distinct forms of modulation—temporal and spatial—opens a frontier in phase-selective Floquet engineering. Here we demonstrate this concept experimentally in the prototypical CDW material 1T-TiSe\n                    2\n                    . Using time- and angle-resolved photoemission spectroscopy with mid-infrared pumping, we observe a striking momentum-dependent pump-induced instantaneous downshift of the valence band maximum (VBM), which is in sharp contrast to the subsequent upward shift on picosecond timescale associated with CDW melting. Remarkably, the light-induced VBM downshift is observed exclusively in the CDW phase and only when the pump pulse is present, reaching maximum when pumping near resonance with the CDW gap. These observations unequivocally reveal the critical role of CDW in enabling the phase-selective Floquet engineering of TiSe\n                    2\n                    . Our work demonstrates how time-periodic drives can synergistically couple to spatially periodic modulations, establishing a paradigm for phase-selective Floquet engineering enabled by spontaneous symmetry breaking.","tp":"电荷密度波调控","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究探索了电荷密度波（CDW）材料中的相选择Floquet工程。Floquet工程通过超快激光脉冲产生的时间周期性光场动态调控量子材料的电子结构，可产生平衡态下无法实现的新奇电子态。结合CDW序的空间周期性调制，研究为同时实现时间和空间维度上电子态的精准调控开辟了新路径。","aip":1},{"t":"全脑关联模式反映了社会经济学","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee6213?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Previous brain-wide association studies (BWAS) have linked specific environmental and behavioral variables to brain variability. In this work, we mapped 649 variables to children’s brains and compared the resultant BWAS maps with each other and with neurobiological reference patterns. Socioeconomic status (SES) showed the strongest brain-wide associations. The SES associations were strongest in motor and sensory but not cognitive regions, a pattern shared across many BWAS maps, including intelligence quotient (IQ). A single, common BWAS brain pattern existed across variables that was most reflective of a child’s socioeconomics. Adjusting for SES weakened brain-IQ associations, eliminating the BWAS motor and sensory pattern. Brain-with-IQ associations also did not generalize when trained on higher-SES subsamples. Thus, children’s brains vary the most with SES, potentially through SES-dependent sleep deprivation and stress.","tp":"脑与社会经济","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过全脑关联分析（BWAS），将649个环境与行为变量映射到儿童大脑，并将其与神经生物学参考模式进行系统比较。结果发现，社会经济地位（SES）与全脑特征表现出最强的关联性。这种关联在运动和感觉区域尤为显著，而非认知区域。这一模式在智力等多种BWAS图谱中具有普遍性。研究强调了社会经济学因素在塑造大脑运动和感觉网络变异中的重要作用，为理解环境对儿童大脑发育的影响提供了全新视角。"},{"t":"PathTIGR：用于免疫治疗响应预测的通路拓扑图表示学习框架","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed6373?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","as":"PathTIGR是一种融合通路拓扑信息的图表示学习框架，用于预测癌症患者对免疫治疗的响应。免疫疗法虽革新了肿瘤治疗，但患者间疗效异质性显著。PathTIGR将基因表达数据映射到生物通路网络，利用图神经网络学习通路拓扑结构特征，从而捕获传统方法难以挖掘的生物学上下文，提升免疫治疗响应预测的准确性，助力个性化免疫治疗决策。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"免疫治疗预测","kp":["[免疫治疗预测]: 通路拓扑图表示学习PathTIGR"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"PathTIGR: A pathway topology-informed graph representation learning framework for immunotherapy response prediction","b":"Immunotherapy has revolutionized cancer treatment, yet substantial inter-patient response heterogeneity limits therapeutic benefit to specific patient subsets. Here, we present PathTIGR, a pathway topology-informed graph representation learning framework that systematically integrates biological pathway network topology knowledge with genome variation information for immunotherapy response prediction. PathTIGR uses a three-component design: (i) pathway graph encoder with multihead attention embeding pathway topology knowledge and cancer genomic variants to pathway representation, (ii) transformer module capturing pathway regulatory dependencies, and (iii) multilayer perceptron synthesizing pathway-level representations to predict immunotherapy response. This architecture enables PathTIGR to capture complex molecular interactions underlying immunotherapy response. Comprehensive validation across multiple independent immunotherapy cohorts demonstrates that PathTIGR achieves superior predictive performance compared to established biomarkers and state-of-the-art deep learning approaches while maintaining biological interpretability through identification of key signatures underlying response heterogeneity. PathTIGR represents an interpretable graph-based learning framework that enhances immunotherapy response prediction and elucidates molecular determinants of therapeutic efficacy, thereby facilitating the advancement of precision cancer immunotherapy."},{"t":"焦耳热冲击诱导的部分原子无序Ti2Nb10O29-x实现卓越锂离子存储性能","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73607?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铌氧化物储锂","kp":["负极材料[锂电]: Ti2Nb10O29-x Wadsley-Roth相","[合成]: 焦耳热冲击制原子无序结构","[优势]: 开放结构提升Li+迁移"],"as":"本研究提出利用焦耳热冲击诱导Ti2Nb10O29-x材料产生部分原子无序结构，以提升高功率锂离子电池负极性能。Nb2O5因其高理论容量被视为快充负极候选，但其致密的原子排列限制了锂离子的扩散速率。通过焦耳热冲击引入可控的原子无序，可扩大离子传输通道、降低扩散势垒，从而显著提升倍率性能与循环稳定性，为快充电池材料设计提供了新策略。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Partial Atomic Disordered Ti2Nb10O29‐x Induced by Joule Thermal Shock for Superior Lithium‐Ion Storage","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nb\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    is a promising anode for high‐power lithium‐ion battery, but its relatively dense atomic packing limits Li\n                    +\n                    migration capacity exertion. Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29\n                    with Wadsley‐Roth phase with more open crystal structure is considered a promising candidate. However, Ti/Nb atoms prefer to form an ordered arrangement to maintain local charge balance, resulting insufficient Li\n                    +\n                    migration and suppressing high‐rate performance. Herein, defective Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    anode with partial disordered Ti/Nb arrangement is developed by employing an amorphous precursor combined with Joule thermal shock. The random dispersion of Ti and Nb within the amorphous precursor is maintained to a certain extent during ultra‐fast Joule thermal heating (≈500°C s\n                    −1\n                    ) and quenching (≈250°C s\n                    −1\n                    ). Compared to traditional Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29\n                    , the Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion coefficient and electronic conductivity of Ti/Nb‐disordered Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    are enhanced by tenfold and four orders of magnitude, respectively. As the anode of lithium‐ion batteries, the optimal Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    shows an ultra‐high capacity of 353 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and an excellent rate capability of 112 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 150 C, an ultra‐long cycling lifespan of 5000 cycles, and a wide operating temperature range from 80°C to ‐40°C. The performance leap caused by the disordered structure may provide new paradigm for battery materials.","aip":1},{"t":"美国 PM2.5 空气污染不平等（按部门和州划分）：过去的轨迹和未来的方向","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7425?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"On average in the United States (US), low-income communities and communities of color face disproportionate burdens of air pollution and associated health impacts. Much of the effort to reduce these disparities will need to occur at the state level, through the targeting of specific emission sources and exposures. We present the first analysis of exposure disparities in the US that systematically investigates temporal trends, disaggregated by economic sector and state. Our approach combines a recently released time-series (2002 to 2019) emission inventory (EQUATES) with a computationally efficient air pollution model (InMAP Source-Receptor Matrix) to predict annual average exposure to ambient PM\n                    2.5\n                    in each census tract in the contiguous US, disaggregated by emission sector. We find that, in general, absolute disparities have decreased, but relative disparities remain largely unchanged. This pattern holds for some sectors (e.g., transportation and electricity) but not others (e.g., disparities are largely unchanged for agriculture emissions and are generally increasing for residential and cooking emissions). Some state-sector combinations exhibit distinct patterns (e.g., most-recent disparities in New York are dominated by cooking and in Florida by construction). Of all sectors, industrial emissions contribute the largest exposures and the greatest exposure disparities. Agriculture and residential energy use are also large contributors to most-recent disparities, underscoring that inequities persist in sectors historically subject to less regulatory focus. Overall, our findings reveal how disparities have changed during 2002 to 2019 for each sector-state combination and elucidate which sectors each state should focus on to address recent disparities."},{"t":"用于高通量的耐氧光诱导小型加速原子转移自由基聚合 (OPTIMA-ATRP)","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6617585?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Conjugates of synthetic polymers with biomolecules, forming polymer bioconjugates (PBCs), are used to improve the pharmacokinetic properties of many biological therapeutics. Growing synthetic polymers from biomolecules via reversible deactivation radical polymerization (RDRP) demonstrated enormous potential as an alternative to the “grafting to” method in synthesizing biohybrids. However, conventional “grafting from” approaches applied to biomolecules are hindered by large reaction volumes, long reaction times, rigorous deoxygenation, and complex workflows, rendering them unsuitable for synthesizing libraries of PBCs needed to collect large data sets for emerging materials discovery. Herein, Oxygen‐tolerant photo‐induced miniaturized accelerated atom transfer radical polymerization (OPTIMA‐ATRP) in water was developed for the polymerization of hydrophilic (meth)acrylate monomers under ambient or sub‐ambient (4°C) temperature and atmospheric conditions, without prior degassing, in &lt; 10 min. Sodium pyruvate (SP) in conjunction with UV light (380–395 nm, 28.5–30 mW/cm\n                    2\n                    ) promoted rapid controlled polymerization in water, on an ultra‐small scale (&lt; 50 µL) in micropipette tips or 96‐well plate. By exploiting this OPTIMA‐ATRP, cost‐effective syntheses of several types of PBCs (e.g., DNA‐, peptide‐, lipid‐, and protein–polymer hybrids) were carried out using a parallel, high‐throughput approach. This technique enables rapid optimization of biohybrid synthesis, previously inaccessible under conventional conditions, and empowers non‐specialists to use ATRP in various areas."},{"t":"EXL-50U实验综述：解决未来球形环反应堆关键物理问题","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae738d","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","as":"新奥集团（ENN）的玄龙-50U（EXL-50U）是全球首个完全由私人资本资助并运营的MA（兆安）级磁约束聚变实验装置，采用球形托卡马克构型。该报告概述了EXL-50U的实验进展，聚焦未来球形托卡马克走向商业化聚变发电所需解决的关键物理问题，包括等离子体约束、稳定性、加热与电流驱动等核心议题。作为私营聚变赛道的重要里程碑，EXL-50U为紧凑型聚变堆的工程可行性提供了实验验证平台。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"球形环聚变","kp":["磁场强度[球环EXL-50U]: >1T","脉宽[EXL-50U]: 秒级","大半径[EXL-50U]: 0.6-0.8m","装置性质[EXL-50U]: 首个私营MA级磁约束聚变"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":7.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Overview of EXL-50U experiments: addressing key physics issues for future spherical torus reactors","b":"ENN’s Xuanlong-50U (EXL-50U) is the world’s first fully privately funded and operated MA-level magnetic confinement fusion experimental facility. EXL-50U is also the world’s first spherical torus device (ST) to achieve a magnetic field exceeding 1 Tesla and a pulse width reaching the seconds level in actual operation. The major radius of EXL-50U ranges from 0.6 m to 0.8 m, with an aspect ratio of 1.4–1.8. The key physics issues of EXL-50U’s experiments related to the future ST reactors are: non-inductive current start-up and drive, development of scenarios for stable high density hot ion mode for ST (Ti0 = 3 keV ∼ 10 keV), and investigation of energy confinement scaling through wide range scans of aspect ratio (1.4 ∼ 1.8) and BT (0.5 T ∼ 1.2 T). Another key research focus of EXL-50U is the physical properties of hydrogen–boron (p-B) plasmas and hydrogen–boron fusion, which is closely aligned with ENN’s p-B fusion roadmap. In the 2025 experiment, EXL-50U achieved a p-B plasma discharge at 1 MA (with boron ions exceeding 10% in the ion fraction), marking the world’s first MA-level discharge of high-concentration p-B plasma. A recording 270 kA fully non-inductive current by 380 kW electron cyclotron resonance heating (ECRH) is also achieved. The initial real-time boron-power injection experiments with metal wall in EXL-50U demonstrates the positive effective of boron on plasma performance. Through neutral beam injection (NBI) heating, a stable proton-boron plasma H-mode has also been achieved for the first time on EXL-50U. On the other hand, experimental results also indicate that simultaneous injection of ECRH and NBI is detrimental to ion temperature enhancement. AI technology was also applied in EXL-50U experiments, achieving stable 500 kA plasma current and displacement control for over 500 ms. Supersonic molecular beam injection was applied for density feedback control for the first time in ST device. ENN researchers plan to achieve all of EXL-50U’s milestone objectives within a three-year timeframe, contributing their efforts toward the rapid commercialization of magnetic confinement fusion."},{"t":"有机自发发射接近单色极限","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee0001?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Spontaneous emission is inherently associated with spectral broadening mechanisms, resulting in finite bandwidth in the emitted light. Narrowing this linewidth toward the monochromatic limit has long been a central pursuit in photonics, as it determines the ultimate color purity of nonstimulated light sources. Organic luminescent materials offer facile wavelength tunability but typically exhibit broad emission bands (&gt;40 nanometers). The emergence of multiple-resonance emitters has provided a promising route to overcome this limitation, yet most reported systems remain within 20 to 30 nanometers. We present a molecular design strategy that amplifies the multiple-resonance effect through molecular repetition, yielding fluorescence with linewidths of 6.9 nanometers in toluene, 5.5 nanometers in 3-methylpentane, and 9.1 nanometers in a doped polymer film, placing this molecular framework among the narrowest-band organic luminophores reported.","tp":"有机发光体","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"有机发光材料的自发发射通常带宽较宽（>40纳米），而多重共振型发射体的出现显著收窄了线宽。该研究推动有机材料的自发发射光谱线宽逼近单色极限，这对于实现非受激光源的终极色彩纯度具有重要意义，在光子学显示和照明领域具有突破性应用潜力。"},{"t":"Oracle 报告季度业绩好坏参半，云增长被软件缺陷所抵消","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/oracle-reports-mixed-quarter-cloud-growth-offset-software-weakness","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Oracle Reports Mixed Quarter as Cloud Growth is Offset By Software Weakness — The Information\nRead this briefing for free"},{"t":"非均匀晶格中的光学等时线和挤压动力学","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6b4n-v35x","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Ioannis Kiorpelidis, Matthias Heinrich, Alexander Szameit, Georgios A. Siviloglou, and Konstantinos G. MakrisWe present exact analogies between the tautochrone problem of classical mechanics and the squeezed states of quantum optics to optical lattices. Both phenomena emerge in the same physical system, that of waveguide arrays with nonuniform couplings. Extension to two dimensions yields Lissajous-type tr…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233801] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"通过循环路径增强美国磷供应韧性的机遇","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530690123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷资源循环回收","kp":["[循环策略]: 7种策略减少矿物磷需求","作物覆盖[磷模型]: 91种主要作物"],"as":"针对高质量磷矿资源日益枯竭及供应不确定性加剧的问题，该研究提出通过循环经济路径增强美国磷供应韧性。磷是农业肥料的关键元素，其供应链安全直接影响粮食安全。研究系统分析了磷资源循环利用（如从废水、农业废弃物中回收磷）的技术与政策机遇，为构建可持续磷管理体系提供决策依据，对降低对进口磷矿石依赖具有战略意义。","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Opportunities to strengthen US phosphorus supply resilience through circular pathways","b":"With diminishing availability of high-quality phosphate rock and increasing supply uncertainties, improving phosphorus (P) recovery, recycling, and waste reduction has become critical for sustaining agricultural production. We developed an integrated P cycling and soil dynamics model to quantify 7 circular strategies for reducing mineral P demand in the United States, using data for 91 major crops and 20 livestock types across 3,142 counties from 1866 to 2050. We show that soil residual P reuse has the largest potential to reduce mineral P demand in the United States. By 2023, total soil P stocks had accumulated to 99 Tg, equivalent to approximately 68% of mineral P inputs over 1866–2023. For 2024–2050, projections under various socioeconomic scenarios indicate that soil residual P reuse alone could potentially supply approximately 2.4 to 5.1 times projected US mineral P demand, with substantial residual P stocks accumulated in both cropland and pastureland soils. Recycling from sewage sludge and livestock and crop by-products could collectively offset an additional approximately 0.5 to 1.0 times mineral P demand, while food waste reduction could reduce requirements by approximately 0.3 times. Spatial analyses further highlight a mismatch between circular P availability and cropland P demand, with high mineral P avoidance potential concentrated in the South and West, but relatively low ratios of circular P supply to projected mineral P demand across most counties in the Midwest. These findings provide spatially explicit and decision-relevant insights into how circular P strategies can enhance the stability and resilience of US food systems under future resource constraints."},{"t":"实施生物多样性信贷以促进珊瑚礁管理和投资","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(26)00116-8?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"One Earth","tg":"观点评论","b":"Effective biodiversity conservation for coral reef ecosystems requires both climate mitigation and enhanced management. The current scale of reef management, and the resulting capacity to deliver ecosystem benefits, is limited by a lack of adequate, accessible, sustainable, and scalable funding. Our perspective explores the opportunities and challenges of emerging biodiversity frameworks and nature-based funding instruments (especially biodiversity credits) to catalyze investments needed to increase the scale, nature, and effectiveness of coral reef conservation. Foundational work needed to establish high-integrity coral reef biodiversity credits is under way, including the development of a robust biodiversity accounting framework relevant across a broad range of coral reef habitats and regions. Explicit focus on ecosystem structure, composition, and functions provides a clear direction and rationale for selecting relevant metrics for biodiversity accounting. However, ongoing targeted research and innovation are needed to increase efficacy and efficiency of coral reef management while adapting to changing conditions and demands."},{"t":"OpenAI 推出以特定产品为特色的新 ChatGPT 广告","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/openai-launches-new-chatgpt-ads-featuring-specific-products","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"OpenAI Launches New ChatGPT Ads Featuring Specific Products — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"在 $\\sqr 处的 $pp$ 和 $\\mathrm{Au}+\\mathrm{Au}$ 碰撞中开放魅力生成和 ${\\mathrm{Λ}}_{c}^{+}/{D}^{0}$ 比率","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/519h-2vrc","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Bijun Fan, Shusu Shi, Chao Zhang, and Liang ZhengWe study open-charm hadrons production in pp and $\\mathrm{Au}+\\mathrm{Au}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{{s}_{NN}}=200$ GeV using an improved multiphase transport (AMPT) model. Specifically, we show the transverse-momentum spectra and nuclear modification factors ${R}_{\\mathrm{AA}}$ of ${D}^{0}$ mesons and $…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064904] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"一年期户外测试揭示钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池的降解路径 - pv magazine Global","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/one-year-outdoor-testing-reveals-degradation-paths-in-perovskite-tandem-solar-cells/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["初始效率[钙钛矿三结户外]: 17-18%","衰减后效率[钙钛矿三结户外]: 13-14%","退化机制[三结叠层]: 电压损失+封装分层+界面退化"],"as":"荷兰TNO与德国Fraunhofer ISE联合开展了为期一年的全钙钛矿/硅叠层太阳能电池户外实测研究。叠层电池因光电转换效率突破理论极限而备受瞩目，但长期稳定性仍是产业化最大障碍。研究揭示了电池在真实光照、温湿度循环下的多种退化路径，包括钙钛矿层相分离、界面离子迁移与电极腐蚀等。户外老化数据为封装工艺、界面钝化和组分工程优化提供了关键基准，是叠层光伏从实验室效率纪录走向商业化可靠性的必经环节。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.5,"d":8.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"One-year outdoor testing reveals degradation paths in perovskite tandem solar cells - pv magazine Global","b":"Research & Development\nResearchers from TNO and Fraunhofer ISE ran a 1-year outdoor test of perovskite/perovskite/silicon triple-junction solar cells and found a clear efficiency decline from 17–18% to 13–14% driven by multi-stage degradation. The main failure mechanisms were voltage loss, encapsulation delamination, and UV/thermal-induced interface and transport-layer degradation rather than intrinsic absorber instability.\nEmiliano Bellini\nResearch & Development\nCells & modules\nThe experimental setup | Image: TNO\nResearchers from the\nNetherlands Organization for Applied Scientific Research\n(TNO) and Germany’s\nFraunhofer Institute for Solar Energy Systems\n(Fraunhofer ISE) have conducted a 1-year test to measure the outdoor performance of peroskvsite solar technologies and have found that several factors contribute to significant perovskite degradation.\nFor the testing, the team used triple junction perovskite/perovskite/silicon solar cells with an active area of 1 cm × 1 cm. “We chose triple junction devices as they have a theoretical higher performance limit,” corresponding author Petra Manshanden told\n. “These devices are fairly uncommon and long time outdoor exposure data has not yet been shown.”\nThe device tested is a monolithic triple-junction tandem combining a p-type heterojunction silicon bottom cell with two stacked perovskite subcells. The silicon base is rear-textured with a closed metal rear contact, acting as the near-infrared absorber. On top, a 1.56 electronvolt perovskite middle cell is deposited on indium tin oxide (ITO), with polybis(4-phenyl)(2,4,6-trimethylphenyl)amine and poly(9,9-bis(3′-(N,N-dimethylamino)propyl)-2,7-fluorene)-alt-2,7-(9,9-dioctylfluorene) as hole transport layers, and fullerene (C60) with tin oxide (SnOx) as the electron transport stack.\nA second indium tin oxide (ITO) interconnect separates the middle cell from the top cell, which uses a self-assembled monolayer known as 2PACz and a wide-bandgap perovskite absorber. The top cell again employs C60 and SnOx for electron extraction and is completed with an ITO layer and evaporated silver (Ag) contacts. A magnesium fluoride (MgF₂) anti-reflection coating finalizes the stack.\nThe outdoor test station was located in Petten, the Netherlands. It consists of rooftop-installed with south-facing modules fixed at a 30° tilt under a local albedo of 10% for optimized annual yield.\nOutdoor measurements at the station showed that, over the first month, morning and afternoon performance was largely comparable, with only early transient differences disappearing after the initial stabilization phase. Long-term outdoor monitoring, meanwhile, revealed a two-step degradation behavior, with efficiency dropping from around 17–18% initially to about 15% in March and approximately 13–14% in April, followed by continued decline. The first degradation phase was mainly attributed to voltage loss, while the second coincided with encapsulation delamination that reduced current collection and light in-coupling.\nMicroscopy confirmed delamination occurring within the encapsulation stack rather than at the active junctions, indicating mechanical or interlayer adhesion failure rather than moisture ingress. EQE and J–V analysis further showed that the loss in performance could not be explained by bandgap changes or intrinsic absorber degradation, but rather by interface-related losses and shunt pathways.\nPhotoluminescence and electroluminescence imaging after extended exposure showed strong spatial inhomogeneity, with the middle perovskite layer dominating current flow while the top junction was significantly weakened. This supported the conclusion that partial shunting and non-uniform degradation were key failure modes in the stack.\nIndoor reliability tests confirmed good damp-heat stability with edge sealing but significant losses under thermal cycling and UV exposure, the latter causing up to around 65% degradation. Overall, despite degradation and hysteresis effects, the device achieved an estimated average annual efficiency of around 10%, with performance strongly dependent on irradiance conditions and spectral variability.\n“The samples achieved 80% of the initial power conversion efficiency, after five months of outdoor operation, and 50% of after seven months,” Manshanden explained. “Early-stage degradation analysis indicates that the top junction is the least stable component of the device stack. In parallel, the middle junction, which initially limited current generation, developed edge-localized shunting during operation. Additional losses were attributed to degradation of the charge transport layers, most likely driven by sustained exposure to elevated operating temperatures.\nThe results of the testing were presented in “\nOne Year of Outdoor Performance of Perovskite/Perovskite/Silicon Triple-Junction Solar Cell\n,” published in\n. “These findings helped us to understand degradation mechanisms and develop more stable next generation devices which are currently under testing,” concluded Manshanden.\nEmiliano Bellini\nView author posts"},{"t":"纳米油道使油浸致密单板具有高电气绝缘性能","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed5744?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"木材绝缘材料","kp":["材料[变压器绝缘]: 油浸渍致密化木贴面","[机制]: 纳米油通道提升介电强度"],"as":"针对老化电网在可再生能源并网压力下对高性能绝缘材料的迫切需求，研究人员开发了一种油浸致密化木单板新型电气绝缘材料。通过将木纤维素致密化处理与油浸渍工艺结合，大幅降低了木材内部孔隙率与水分渗透，显著提升了介电击穿强度与耐压性能。该材料有望替代传统石化基绝缘材料，应用于变压器、电缆接头等电力设备，兼具可再生、低碳足迹优势，为绿色电网升级提供可持续的绝缘解决方案。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Oil-impregnated densified wood veneer with high electrical insulation enabled by nanosized oil channels","b":"Growing energy demands and renewable integration are stressing the aging power grid infrastructure. Lignocellulosic oil-impregnated paper is widely used in power transformers but suffers from critical limitations, such as low dielectric strength, mechanical strength, and thermal conductivity, causing premature transformer failures. Here, we demonstrate a superior electrically insulating oil-impregnated paper design using the naturally anisotropic structure of densified wood veneer to achieve nanosized channels of oil that efficiently disrupt electrical breakdown pathways. The developed oil-impregnated densified wood (ODW) creates aligned cellulose fibers with 166 ± 87–nanometer oil nanochannels, achieving record dielectric strength of 105 kilovolts per millimeter. The structure also delivers a mechanical strength of up to 384 megapascals and a thermal conductivity of 0.33 watts per meter per kelvin, enabling enhanced longevity upon thermal aging tests. The ODW could replace conventional transformer insulation to enhance power transformer performance and improve lifetime. Moreover, its anisotropic oil-filled nanochannel design offers a general strategy for hybrid dielectrics in medium- and high-voltage applications."},{"t":"用于生成所需的碰撞核密度分布的新颖过滤方法","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/ymmt-f8h7","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Xilong Xiang, Manzi Nan, Pengcheng Li, Yongjia Wang, Ling Liu, and Qingfeng LiAccurate modeling of the density profile is essential for studying heavy-ion collisions (HICs) with a transport model. Within the framework of the quantum-molecular-dynamics–type model, a novel method for generating desired nuclear density distributions based on Fourier series expansion is proposed.…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064606] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"混合电池材料中的非平衡离子传输","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed1629?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"混合电解质离子传输","kp":["电极材料[电池]: K2Mn[Fe(CN)6]普鲁士蓝","[机制]: 非平衡转化主导电荷存储"],"as":"研究发现某混合电池材料中存在非平衡态离子输运行为。混合材料结合无机与分子组分，通常具有结构柔性，能够实现单一材料难以达成的离子传输特性。非平衡输运意味着离子在充放电循环中不遵循经典扩散方程，表现出记忆效应与滞后响应，可能显著影响电池倍率性能与循环寿命。理解该机制有助于设计更高效固态或混合电解质，突破现有锂离子电池的能量密度与快充瓶颈。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Nonequilibrium ion transport in a hybrid battery material","b":"Hybrid materials, which combine inorganic and molecular components, often exhibit structural flexibility that enables unusual functional responses. Among them, Prussian blue analogs (PBAs) are a promising class for post–lithium battery technologies. Here, we show that nonequilibrium transformation processes govern the charge-storage mechanism of a PBA electrode, K\n                    2\n                    Mn[Fe(CN)\n                    6\n                    ]. Ostensibly, this behavior mirrors that observed in high-rate cycling of conventional cathodes such as LiFePO\n                    4\n                    yet arises here for fundamentally different reasons–namely, low elastic moduli and cooperative distortions inherent to the hybrid framework. Using operando x-ray absorption spectroscopy with Metropolis matrix factorization and x-ray diffraction, we show that framework flexibility limits transport kinetics and promotes collective, metastable pathways. Our results not only highlight various directions for PBA cathode optimization but also suggest a broader relevance of nonequilibrium mechanisms for mass transport in hybrid materials beyond PBAs alone.","aip":1},{"t":"Nf2 协调偏向 β-arrestin2 的 PTH1R 信号传导，将骨量与骨骼完整性结合起来","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524671123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Precise spatiotemporal regulation of parathyroid hormone (PTH) and PTH-related peptide signaling through the parathyroid hormone receptor 1 (PTH1R) is fundamental to skeletal development and metabolic bone remodeling, yet the intracellular mechanisms that fine-tune this signaling remain a central unanswered question. Here, we identify neurofibromin 2 (Nf2) as an essential regulator of PTH1R trafficking and signaling. Conditional knockout of\n                    Nf2\n                    in chondrocytes results in short-limbed dwarfism, disrupted growth plate organization, and suppressed chondrocyte proliferation and hypertrophy, and a paradoxical bone phenotype marked by trabecular hyperproliferation and cortical thinning. Mechanistically, Nf2 binds to the PTH1R C-terminal domain (464–591 aa) to promote selective receptor internalization via β-arrestin2 without altering G protein–coupled receptor kinase-mediated PTH1R phosphorylation. Loss of\n                    Nf2\n                    decouples PTH1R from β-arrestin2‐mediated endocytosis, leading to sustained and amplified signaling through the cAMP‐CREB‐pSOX9 (S181) and VEGF axis. Consequently,\n                    Nf2\n                    -deficient mice exhibited bone changes similar to those induced by the PTH1R agonist abaloparatide. These findings establish Nf2 as a chondrocyte‐intrinsic gatekeeper of PTH1R signaling and uncover a cellular mechanism for bone homeostasis by targeting Nf2‐mediated β-arrestin2 recruitment."},{"t":"新产品","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5480?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A weekly roundup of information on newly offered instrumentation, apparatus, and laboratory materials of potential interest to researchers."},{"t":"自然指数2026年研究领袖排名：中国的东亚邻国是否跟上？","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01662-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Japan and South Korea are challenging Western peers in a shifting research landscape. Japan and South Korea are challenging Western peers in a shifting research landscape."},{"t":"美国国立卫生研究院科学家被控将病毒走私到美国","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5923?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Inactivated monkeypox virus samples may have been used for routine diagnostics"},{"t":"我多元化的学术背景正在影响我的博士研究——我该怎么办？","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01129-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A PhD student in China who has changed his focus twice since obtaining his undergraduate degree is struggling to keep up. A PhD student in China who has changed his focus twice since obtaining his undergraduate degree is struggling to keep up."},{"t":"克隆造血过程中睡眠和运动的突变依赖性反应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10634-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Clonal haematopoiesis (CH) activates inflammation and increases the risk of atherosclerosis1,2. Whether lifestyle alters CH clone expansion or the phenotypic programming of CH mutant cells, thereby affecting atherosclerosis, is unknown. Here, in humans and mice and across mutations in Jak2, Tet2, Trp53 and Dnmt3a, we demonstrate mutation-dependent responses to sleep and exercise in CH and show that mutant cells are uniquely sensitive to lifestyle. In two human datasets, moderate-to-vigorous physical activity was associated with lower prevalence of non-DNMT3A-driven CH. In atherogenic mice with Jak2V617F or Tet2 loss of function (LOF), but not Trp53 LOF or Dnmt3aR878H CH, uninterrupted sleep or exercise curtails clone expansion. In CH with the Jak2V617F mutation, sleep and exercise reduces clone expansion by selectively reprogramming mutant, but not cohabitant wild type, haematopoietic progenitor cells towards antiproliferative and metabolically healthy phenotypes by tempering bone marrow macrophage–haematopoietic progenitor cell IL-1β signalling. Sleep or exercise also lessens Jak2V617F-driven, Tet2 LOF-driven and Trp53 LOF-driven, but not Dnmt3aR878H-driven, atherosclerosis by locally reprogramming mutant vascular macrophages, independent of peripheral clone dynamics. In Jak2V617F, but not adjacent wild type, aortic macrophages, uninterrupted sleep blunts CLEC4E-dependent inflammasome activation, consequently diminishing lesions. Exercise, meanwhile, activates PAC1+ neurons in the locus coeruleus, raising the levels of peripheral noradrenaline, which signals through adrenergic receptor β2 (ADRβ2) whose expression is preserved by exercise in Jak2V617F, but not cohabitant wild type, aortic macrophages, selectively repressing their inflammatory programming and atherosclerosis. Our findings establish that healthy lifestyles gene-specifically diminish CH and selectively reprogram mutant haematopoietic progenitor cells and macrophages to maintain cardiovascular health."},{"t":"多金属酚醛网络工程化低密度聚合物烧蚀材料：热防护与绝缘耐温达2900K","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73655?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物防热材料","kp":["耐温极限[MPN烧蚀防热材料]: 2900K","陶瓷化机制[低密度烧蚀体]: 金属酚醛网络多金属分子可编程陶瓷化"],"dp":1,"as":"航天器行星进入与样品返回任务需要兼具轻量化和高效隔热的热防护材料。本研究设计了一种基于多金属酚类网络（MPN）工程化的低密度聚合物烧蚀防热材料，通过多金属配位交联构建致密碳层结构，显著提升热稳定性与抗烧蚀性能，同时大幅降低材料密度以减轻航天器自重载荷。该策略为深空探测热防护系统的轻量化设计提供了新思路，有望应用于新一代高焓再入任务。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Multi‐Metal Phenolic Network Engineered Low Density Polymeric Ablator for Thermal Protection and Insulation up to 2900K","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Planetary‐entry and sample‐return missions demand thermal protection materials that simultaneously minimize mass, suppress recession, and withstand prolonged exposure to ultrahigh‐temperature oxidative environments. Here, we report a metal‐phenolic‐network (MPN) engineered low‐density‐ablator that resolves this longstanding trade‐off through molecularly programmable multimetal ceramization. The material is constructed by controlled ligand exchange between a quasi‐linear Ti/Zr/Hf multimetal polymer and phenolic ligands, followed by polymerization into a nanoporous aerogel‐like‐matrix with low density, low thermal conductivity, and scalable processability. The molecular‐level dispersion of multimetal species governs the in situ evolution of hierarchical ceramic architectures during extreme heating: the surface transforms into a dense interpenetrating oxide protection layer, in which (Hf, Zr)O form a rigid skeleton while (Ti, Si)O fill the intergranular space to suppress oxygen penetration and outward mass transport; meanwhile, the interior develops a mass‐fractal carbon–ceramic network that disrupts heat‐flux propagation. The composite exhibits near‐zero recession at ultrahigh temperatures, with linear ablation rates of 0.0017 mm s\n                    −1\n                    at 2800 K and 0.0031 mm s\n                    −1\n                    at 2900 K, while sustaining 2500 K for 1500 s with a back‐temperature‐rise of only 369 K. This work establishes an MPN‐based materials platform for lightweight thermal protection systems that integrate ultrahigh‐temperature stability, oxidation resistance, and effective thermal insulation."},{"t":"多相纳米复合预锂化试剂用于硅基锂离子电池寿命期补锂","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed6926?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅基电池补锂剂","kp":["[策略]: 多相纳米复合预锂化剂","[应用]: 硅基电池寿命期补锂"],"as":"针对高能量密度硅基负极锂离子电池在循环过程中锂损耗导致容量衰减的问题，研究人员开发了多相纳米复合预锂化试剂，可在电池服役期间持续补充活性锂。该策略有望显著延长硅基电池的循环寿命，推动其在电动汽车和储能领域的工程化应用。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Multiphase nanocomposite prelithiation agents for service life lithium replenishment in Si-based Li-ion batteries","b":"High–energy density lithium-ion batteries (LIBs) using Si-based anodes are expected to dominate the lithium-ion power battery market in the near future. However, the Si anode suffers from continuous capacity degradation during initial and subsequent cycles. Prelithiation agents can effectively replenish lithium and enhance battery capacity, while currently investigated cathode prelithiation agents generally only prelithiate at the initial cycle. Herein, we have developed a multiphase nanocomposite prelithiation agent (MNCP) on the basis of two distinct mechanisms—oxygen oxidation and conversion reaction—aiming to provide service life lithium replenishment for Si-based LIBs. MNCP presents several tunable delithiation plateaus to prelithiate anodes in the initial and extending cycles with exceeding 600 milliampere-hours per gram without gas generation. This work emphasizes a mechanism-based design strategy for functional prelithiation agents, aiming to comprehensively optimize the performance of advanced LIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"侧链工程实现Kagome共价有机框架晶体的分子级精确三角形封端","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5591473?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架晶体","kp":["端基工程[Kagome COF]: 侧链工程实现三角形精确端基"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队实现了二维kagome共价有机框架（COF）晶体的高分辨率结构表征，通过分子级精确的三角形终止控制，首次揭示了此类晶体的边缘终止机制。该突破为COF晶体的定向生长与功能化设计提供了结构基础，对量子材料研究具有重要意义。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Molecularly Precise Triangular Termination of Kagome Covalent Organic Framework Crystals Enabled by Side‐Chain Engineeri","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐resolution structural characterization of two‐dimensional (2D) kagome covalent organic frameworks (COFs) remains limited, often leaving critical questions about lattice ordering and surface‐terminating functionality largely unanswered. To address this challenge, we designed a series of acceptor–donor–acceptor linear linkers based on benzo[1,2‐\n                    b\n                    :4,5‐\n                    b\n                    ′]dithiophene and 2,1,3‐benzothiadiazole units with systematically varied alkoxy side chains. Diverse 2D kagome COFs bearing methoxy, ethoxy, and propoxy side chains were synthesized by imine condensation of these linkers with a dibenzo[\n                    g\n                    ,\n                    p\n                    ]chrysene‐based node. While featuring identical backbone architecture, the resulting COFs exhibit remarkably different degrees of crystallinity, demonstrating the critical role of side‐chain length in regulating framework ordering. Owing to its superior crystallinity and large pore apertures, the methoxy‐substituted COF (OMe COF) enables direct real‐space visualization of extended kagome pore lattices by high‐resolution transmission electron microscopy (HRTEM). Furthermore, highly crystalline and preferentially oriented OMe COF thin films were synthesized, allowing for detailed HRTEM analysis. Strikingly, HRTEM could clearly resolve triangular terminations of the kagome lattice, thereby establishing the half‐condensed dibenzochrysene nodes as the triangular pores terminating the crystal facets and providing unprecedented real‐space evidence of exposed amino groups. These findings create a structural basis for the future rational design of surface functionalization and potential interfacial engineering in 2D kagome COFs."},{"t":"HuR 分子胶降解剂抑制 BRAF 突变结直肠癌","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10613-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"BRAF gain-of-function mutations, particularly BRAF(V600E), affect roughly 10% of all patients with colorectal cancer (CRC), and portend poor prognosis with limited therapeutic interventions. BRAF inhibitors such as encorafenib are ineffective due to MAPK pathway reactivation driven by BRAF dimerization. Combined inhibition of BRAF and EGFR, although approved therapies, results in short survival benefits and frequent treatment resistance and relapse1,2,3. Here, through rational chemical library design coupled with parallel proteomic screening, we identified dHuR as a molecular glue degrader of human antigen R (HuR), an RNA-binding protein that drives tumour growth, invasion and therapy resistance. dHuR binds to the CRBN ubiquitin ligase to create a unique benzofuran-tethered composite surface to recruit HuR as a neosubstrate by engaging its β-hairpin G-loop degron, as revealed by the cryo-electron microscopy structure of the ternary complex. dHuR abrogated BRAF expression by inducing its exon 18 skipping, and demonstrated superior suppression of BRAF-mutant CRC tumours including those gaining resistance to BRAF inhibitors. Finally, we performed kinome library CRISPR screening and revealed that inactivation of EGFR or MEK enhanced dHuR cytotoxicity, thus establishing a combinatorial strategy to treat patients with refractory BRAF-mutant CRC."},{"t":"分子氧介导n型有机电荷转移复合物中电子陷阱的钝化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9080202?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体钝化","kp":["电子陷阱钝化[n型有机CTC]: O₂介导钝化电荷转移复合物缺陷"],"dp":1,"as":"n型有机半导体对分子氧（O₂）固有敏感，易产生电子陷阱降低器件性能。本研究揭示了分子氧介导的电子陷阱钝化机制，发现O₂在特定条件下反而可钝化电荷转移复合物中的电子陷阱，为提升n型有机半导体稳定性提供了新认知。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Molecular Dioxygen‐Mediated Passivation of Electron Traps in n‐Type Organic Charge‐Transfer Complexes","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The inherent susceptibility of n‐type organic semiconductors to molecular dioxygen (O\n                    2\n                    ) results in electron trapping or in unintended p‐doping, which in turn diminishes their electron mobility. This concept is challenged in the present study by exploring O\n                    2\n                    interactions with organic charge‐transfer complexes (CTCs), where electron donor–acceptor interactions generate partially delocalized electronic states. Using a CTC comprising a phenazine electron donor and a 7,7,8,8‐tetracyanoquinodimethane (TCNQ) electron acceptor, we demonstrate that its exposure to O\n                    2\n                    does not lead to electron extraction but instead enhances the charge‐transfer activity. The increased electron density at the TCNQ acceptor upon CTC exposure to O\n                    2\n                    is attributed to electron trap‐states passivation by O\n                    2\n                    , without evidence of chemisorption. This passivation mitigates recombination losses, resulting in a threefold photoluminescence quantum yield increase, enhanced electrical conductivity, and improved charge‐transfer state efficiency. Similar O\n                    2\n                    ‐mediated conductivity enhancements are observed across additional donor–acceptor pairs, proving the broader applicability of this effect, and paving the way for designing O\n                    2\n                    ‐enhanced advanced organic electronic materials."},{"t":"与细胞核相连的线粒体确保其能量供应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01587-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Direct interactions between the cell’s powerhouses and nuclear pores might channel energy straight into the nucleus, fuelling cell division and differentiation. Direct interactions between the cell’s powerhouses and nuclear pores might channel energy straight into the nucleus, fuelling cell division and differentiation."},{"t":"线粒体直接与核孔复合体相互作用","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10588-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mitochondria regulate cellular processes through direct and indirect interactions with other organelles. A well-studied example has been contact with the endoplasmic reticulum at mitochondrial-associated endoplasmic reticulum membranes1, which control pathways including redox and calcium homeostasis2,3. Recent studies have also reported direct mitochondria–nuclear membrane contacts in cancer cells and yeast that promote pro-survival signalling4,5. Here we identify direct interactions between mitochondria and nuclear pores. Using two unbiased proteomic screens, GST pulldown and BioID, we found that VDAC1 was the top mitochondrial candidate that interacts with the filamentous nuclear pore protein RANBP2. In vitro RANBP2 CRISPR knockout, RANBP2 truncation or site-directed mutagenesis of RANBP2–VDAC1 interacting amino acids resulted in reduced mitochondria–nucleus proximity and decreased nuclear ATP and phosphocreatine levels. This was accompanied by a decline in the levels of the nuclear phosphoproteome and downregulation of pathways involved in histone modification, cellular differentiation and transcriptional regulation in vitro. Moreover, deletion of the RANBP2 C-terminal domain in vivo in mice resulted in embryonic lethality due to cardiac and neural crest differentiation defects. Collectively, these results describe a mechanism by which mitochondria directly interact with the nuclear pore complex, a phenomenon critical for regulation of nuclear energetics and cellular differentiation. Undoubtedly, additional roles of this interaction remain to be revealed."},{"t":"小鼠在隔膜中产生中间神经元，作为对厌恶经历和抗抑郁治疗的反应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3625?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Adult neurogenesis sustains olfactory function, facilitates the acquisition of new memories, and provides resilience against depression in mice. Neural stem cells (NSCs) elicit selective responses to different physiological and pathological stimuli, thereby modulating neuron production. Here, we show that fear conditioning stimulates neurogenesis in the adult mouse brain septum by activating NSCs in the dorsal septum (dsNSCs) situated near a plexus of serotonergic axons originating from raphe nucleus neurons—key regulators of mood, anxiety, and stress responses. Elevation of serotonin (5HT) levels with the antidepressant and anxiolytic drug fluoxetine similarly promoted dsNSC proliferation and neurogenesis. The adult-born GABAergic interneurons integrate into septal nuclei. These findings suggest a potential adaptive response in mice to stress-inducing aversive experiences and elevated 5HT in the adult septum."},{"t":"超构表面赋能天文偏振测量","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee8035?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超表面天文偏振","as":"超构表面光学元件在过去十年引起广泛关注。本研究将超构表面技术应用于天文偏振测量，利用其亚波长结构实现对光偏振态的精确操控，有望以紧凑轻量化设计替代传统笨重偏振器件，推动便携式和高分辨率天文偏振探测的发展。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Metasurface-enabled astronomical polarimetry","b":"In the past decade or so, metasurface optical components have received considerable scientific and industrial interest. The miniaturization afforded by metasurfaces could benefit astronomy in particular, which is an often-cited potential application area for metasurfaces. However, few developed examples in which metasurface components offer a unique benefit to astronomical instrumentation—substantiated by the production of scientific data—have been shown. Here, we present the Solar Imaging Metasurface Polarimeter (SIMPol), a first-of-its-kind telescope for snapshot imaging polarimetry of the sun enabled by a high-performance metasurface polarization-analyzing grating, which provides for single element, snapshot imaging polarimetry. We demonstrate SIMPol’s integration into a major observatory telescope facility and the characterization of Zeeman signatures of solar magnetism. This work—among the first to demonstrate an advantage presented by metasurface optics to a real application in astronomical instrumentation—heralds the application of metasurfaces and emergent nanophotonic technologies in astronomy more broadly."},{"t":"金属原子与量子点共存用于电解水制氢","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73687?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子电解水催化","kp":["催化剂[水电解]: GDY负载金属原子+量子点"],"as":"如何调控载体表面以控制单金属原子的行为是催化前沿课题。本研究实现了金属单原子与量子点在载体表面的共存协同，将其应用于电解水反应，利用两类活性位点的协同效应提升析氢/析氧催化性能，为高效电催化剂的理性设计提供了新思路。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Metal Atoms and Quantum Dots Coexist for Water Electrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    How to manipulate the surface of the supports to control metal atoms is frontier research that has emerged in recent years in the field of catalysis. However, the precise and controllable synthesis of metal atom systems with well‐defined structure and valence states remains a significant challenge. Herein, based on theoretical predictions, we report a new catalytic system of GDY, where metal atoms and quantum dots coexist. Precise structural studies have determined that Ni atoms and RuNi\n                    x\n                    quantum dots (denoted as Ni–RuNi\n                    x\n                    /GDY) are distributed on GDY surface. GDY has the ability to act as an electronic medium to control the strong interaction between Ni atom and\n                    sp\n                    ‐C within a long‐range distance, leading to promote the hydrolysis abilities of Ni atom adjacent to RuNi\n                    x\n                    . The as‐synthesized Ni–RuNi\n                    x\n                    /GDY catalyst exhibits astonishing results in the alkaline hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), with overpotentials of only 17 mV and 116 mV achieving current densities of 10 and 1000 mA cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , respectively. This work presents a new method for creating highly efficient multi‐component atom catalysts, and a new concept for long‐range control of catalysis to open up new routes for the frontier research on developing advanced catalytic systems in the future.","aip":1},{"t":"Meta 终止与 Manus 的运营关系","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/meta-cuts-ties-manus","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Meta Cuts Operational Ties With Manus — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"用于宽量程高灵敏度压力传感的机电超材料","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeb3456?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"机电超材料传感器","kp":["自供能传感[超材料]: 3D打印梯度晶格嵌入分子铁电体","传感范围[超材料压力]: 宽量程高灵敏度"],"dp":1,"as":"研究利用机械超构材料对单元胞几何结构和宏观组织的精确控制，开发了力电耦合超构材料用于宽范围、高灵敏度压力传感。该设计通过结构工程实现力学信号到电信号的高效转换，在可穿戴健康监测和柔性电子领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Mechanoelectrical metamaterials for broad-range, high-sensitivity pressure sensing","b":"Mechanical metamaterials exploit precise control of unit-cell geometry and their macroscopic organization to realize unusual properties. Expanding the capabilities of mechanical metamaterials to incorporate additional functionality remains a challenge. We describe 3D-printed metamaterials embedded with molecular ferroelectrics for use as self-powered pressure sensors. Our gradient lattice design allows for adaptive reconfiguration and controlled deformation-mode transitions, yielding a synergy of low modulus and high load-bearing capacity alongside a monotonic mechanical load–electrical signal response. Furthermore, we implement a modulus gradient in the metamaterials to enhance sensitivity in low-loading regions and extend the detection range across six orders of magnitude. With a combination of high sensitivity and broad detection range, the dual-gradient metamaterials overcome the limitations imposed by the inverse relationships in existing sensors."},{"t":"使用第一个 JUNO 数据测量反应堆中微子振荡","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10538-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Neutrino oscillations (see refs. 1,2 and references therein), a quantum effect manifesting at macroscopic scales, are governed by lepton flavour mixing angles and neutrino mass-squared differences3 that are fundamental parameters of particle physics, representing phenomena beyond the Standard Model. Precision measurements of these parameters are essential for testing the completeness of the three-flavour framework, determining the mass ordering of neutrinos and probing possible new physics. The Jiangmen Underground Neutrino Observatory (JUNO)4 is a 20-ktonne liquid-scintillator detector located 52.5 km from multiple reactor cores, designed to resolve the interference pattern of reactor neutrinos with sub-percent precision5,6. Here we report, using the first 59.1 days of data collected since detector completion in August 2025, the first simultaneous high-precision determination of two neutrino oscillation parameters, sin2&#x03B8;12=0.3092&#x00B1;0.0087\" role=\"presentation\">sin2θ12=0.3092±0.0087{\\sin }^{2}{\\theta }_{12}=0.3092\\,\\pm \\,0.0087 and &#x0394;m212=(7.50&#x00B1;0.12)&#x00D7;10&#x2212;5eV2\" role=\"presentation\">Δm212=(7.50±0.12)×10−5eV2\\Delta {m}_{21}^{2}=(7.50\\,\\pm \\,0.12)\\times 1{0}^{-5}\\,{\\mathrm{eV}}^{2} for the normal mass ordering scenario, improving the precision by a factor of 1.6 relative to the combination of all previous measurements. These results advance the basic understanding of neutrinos, validate the design of the detector and indicate the readiness of JUNO for resolving the neutrino mass ordering with a larger dataset. The rapid achievement with a short exposure highlights the potential of JUNO to push the frontiers of precision neutrino physics and paves the way for its broad scientific programme."},{"t":"原子核四面体对称性的质量探针","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/89v1-lrb2","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): F. F. Xu (许方方) and P. W. Zhao (赵鹏巍)Tetrahedral symmetry has long been predicted as an exotic shape degree of freedom in atomic nuclei, yet clear experimental manifestations remain elusive. We show that the triple binding energy difference $δ{V}_{pn}^{(3)}$ can isolate a structural effect of tetrahedral symmetry in $^{80}\\mathrm{Zr}$.…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232503] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"海洋种群遗传推论揭示了原生生物比古质体（植物）和元生物更强的海洋结构","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7158?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"While the biogeographic patterns of animals and plants are well defined, the distribution of the microbial eukaryotic world remains contentious. Classically, protists were assumed to be cosmopolitan, dispersing everywhere with little geographic constraint. We tested this hypothesis by compiling 88 marine cytochrome oxidase subunit I metabarcoding studies to perform a global population-genetic analysis. We uncovered a fundamental biogeographic divide: most animal (Metazoa) and plant (Archaeplastida) phyla have haplotype diversity that is strictly concentrated within specific ocean basins, while most protist phyla share identical haplotypes across multiple, distant oceans. The combination of large geographic ranges with moderate among-ocean genetic differentiation in protists is inconsistent with strict historical cosmopolitanism and is compatible with high connectivity and range expansion dynamics, including, but not limited to, recent colonization events. Our findings provide a unified population-genetic perspective on marine eukaryotic biogeography and refine current views of microbial dispersal at ocean-basin scales."},{"t":"金属氢化物分子的磁光捕获","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/xy6y-kyhc","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Jinyu Dai, Benjamin Riley, Qi Sun, Debayan Mitra, and Tanya ZelevinskyResearchers have used laser cooling and trapping to isolate calcium monohydride, a key step toward producing ultracold atomic hydrogen.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233403] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","tp":"超冷氢分子","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员利用激光冷却和磁光捕获技术成功分离捕获了氢化钙分子（CaH）。这一成果是实现超冷原子氢制备的关键一步，为分子冷却和量子模拟研究开辟了新途径。金属氢化物分子的磁光捕获为未来开展超冷分子化学反应和精密测量实验奠定了重要基础。"},{"t":"热化前的魔法屏障","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/wtq7-qy11","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Lukas Ebner, Berndt Müller, Andreas Schäfer, Leonhard Schmotzer, Clemens Seidl, and Xiaojun YaoWe investigate the time dependence of antiflatness in the entanglement spectrum, a measure for nonstabilizerness and lower bound for nonlocal quantum magic resource, on a subsystem of a linear SU(2) plaquette chain during thermalization. Tracing the time evolution of a large number of initial states…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230403] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026","tp":"量子魔法屏","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究在线性SU(2)方块链子系统热化过程中，追踪了纠缠谱中反平坦度（antiflatness）的时间演化。反平坦度是非稳定性的度量，也是非局域量子魔法资源的下界。研究揭示了热化前量子魔法资源演化的物理机制，对理解量子计算中的魔法资源分布和量子热化过程具有重要意义。"},{"t":"淋巴结微环境重塑解锁局部抗体介导的 B 细胞耗竭","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed8962?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Lymph nodes (LNs) can act as reservoirs in CD20\n                    +\n                    B cell malignancies and autoimmune diseases. Although anti-CD20 monoclonal antibodies (mAbs) have substantially improved patient outcomes, relapse and disease progression remain frequent, underscoring critical limitations that constrain their full therapeutic potential. Here, we reveal that the LN microenvironment is an important modulator of anti-CD20 mAb efficacy. Within LNs, malignant B cells can exhibit a sessile, tissue-retained behavior, which limits their access to the blood circulation required for efficient systemic antibody-mediated cell depletion. Although LN B cells are spatially segregated from FcγR\n                    +\n                    effector cells, remodeling of the LN microenvironment through irradiation enabled anti-CD20 mAb-mediated B cell depletion. Our findings identify LN architecture as a structural barrier to depleting antibody-based therapies and highlight tissue remodeling as a strategy to enhance therapeutic responses within lymphoid organs."},{"t":"脓毒症中红细胞唾液酸的丧失会破坏抑制性 Siglec 相互作用，导致中性粒细胞过度激活，并导致中性粒细胞过度活化。","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536989123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Systemic inflammation is accompanied by overwhelming neutrophil activation, resulting in extensive formation of neutrophil extracellular traps (NETs). Although NETs are beneficial for pathogen entrapment, they become detrimental; therefore, their endogenous regulation is pivotal for survival. In this context, the observation that healthy individuals’ red blood cells (RBCs) can inhibit NET formation induced by lipopolysaccharide (LPS)-primed neutrophils is noteworthy. However, during systemic inflammation, NET formation in the vasculature is robust despite constant neutrophil exposure to RBCs. Herein, we reveal that for RBCs and neutrophils from septic individuals, but not from those with local inflammation, interactions cease and NET inhibition is abolished. This is observed even if only one cell type originates from an inflamed individual, and occurs in both human and murine cells. Moreover, 6 to 10 d post–sepsis induction (mice) or diagnosis (humans), during the resolution of inflammation, interactions are restored and hence fail during the critical stages of inflammation. Mechanistically, this is not due to passive LPS absorption by RBCs, which would limit its availability for neutrophils. In contrast, the cessation of NET inhibition is due to inflammation-induced RBC desialylation (removal of α2,3-linked sialic acids) and decreased expression of inhibitory Siglec-E/9 and -G, but not Siglec-F/5, on neutrophils. Accordingly, concurrent addition of exogenous polysialic acid (PolySia) and pharmacologically controlled accumulation of Siglec molecules on neutrophils preserves the ability of erythrocytes to inhibit PAD4-dependent NET formation upon interaction with neutrophils of endotoxemic mice. These findings open avenues for clinically controlling NET formation during systemic inflammation, given the abundance of erythrocytes in the blood."},{"t":"长期隔离和古老的基因渗入塑造了近大洋洲的功能性遗传变异","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adr6749?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Near Oceanic populations harbor substantial cultural, phenotypic, and genetic diversity yet are drastically underrepresented in human genomics. We generated 177 high-coverage Near Oceanian whole genomes and analyzed them alongside 1284 worldwide genomes, revealing major distinctions among and within islands, including long-term isolation and strong population bottlenecks. We reconstructed 1.897 billion base pairs of the archaic genome, including 831.9 million base pairs of Denisovan sequence, and found evidence for introgression from three Denisovan-like groups in Near Oceanians and adaptive Denisovan introgression at\n                    TRPS1\n                    , a skeletal development gene also under selection in central African rainforest hunter-gatherers and highland Ecuadorians. We then performed a massively parallel reporter assay and discovered 3127 high-frequency introgressed expression-modulating variants, finding an enrichment of functional impacts on genes in the interferon-γ signaling pathway including\n                    JAK1\n                    ,\n                    GBP2\n                    , and\n                    OAS1\n                    ."},{"t":"严格短程准二维 XY 模型中的长程顺序：当关键波动很重要时","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/1jkm-kybr","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Minghui Hu, Chao Zhang, Dajun Zhang, Yanan Sun, Youjin Deng, and Jian-Ping LvThe phase of spins in the quasi-two-dimensional (q2D) XY model has emerged as a topic of significant interest across multiple subfields of physics. Conventional wisdom, rooted in the Mermin-Wagner theorem and supported by existing paradigms, asserts that true long-range (LR) order is prohibited in q…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 237101] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"三正丙胺局部富集延长电化学发光用于肿瘤球体分析","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8508105?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学发光成像","kp":["ECL延长[肿瘤球成像]: 三正丙胺局部聚集延长电化学发光寿命"],"dp":1,"as":"电化学发光（ECL）将电化学控制与光子发射耦合，是超灵敏生物分析的核心技术。本研究发现三正丙胺（Tri-n-Propylamine）在电极界面的局域富集可显著延长ECL发光持续时间，通过调控共反应物的空间分布与传质过程，突破传统ECL瞬态发光的时间瓶颈。该机制有望提升生物传感器检测灵敏度与成像时间分辨率，拓展ECL在单分子检测和活体成像中的应用潜力。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Localized Accumulation of Tri‐n‐Propylamine Prolongs Electrochemiluminescence for Tumor Model Spheroid Analysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemiluminescence (ECL) is a technique that couples electrochemical control with photon emission, enabling highly sensitive, label‐free imaging without an external light source. The microsecond lifetimes and short diffusion lengths of intermediates generated during the reaction confer excellent spatiotemporal resolution, while the absence of phototoxicity promotes biocompatibility. Previously, ECL microscopy has illuminated systems ranging from single cells to multicellular spheroids. Yet, these works relied on luminol–hydrogen peroxide chemistry, which is limited by weak signals and the sacrificial nature of luminol. Here, we introduce tris(2,2’‐bipyridyl)ruthenium(II)/tri‐n‐propylamine ([Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]\n                    2\n                    +\n                    /TPrA) chemistry as a powerful alternative for spheroid imaging. Pre‐incubation of cellular spheroids within TPrA, followed by interrogation in [Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]\n                    2\n                    +\n                    produces markedly sharper spatial resolution and enables continuous imaging for over 3 h, exploiting the recyclability of the luminophore. Furthermore, this strategy reveals the first sustained afterglow chemiluminescence in a biological system, persisting for minutes after the applied potential has ended. Strikingly, we demonstrate that this methodology can elucidate differences in the ECL emission intensity in spheroids from cancerous and non‐cancerous cell lines, likely due to differences in TPrA accumulation. These advances establish [Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]\n                    2\n                    +\n                    /TPrA‐based ECL as a transformative approach for long‐term, high‐resolution imaging of three‐dimensional cellular architectures with application towards cancerous versus non‐cancerous tumor model differentiation."},{"t":"碳纳米管在水中的光诱导量子摩擦","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10632-2","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Friction slows down moving objects at both macroscopic and microscopic scales1. At the electronic level, quantum friction describes direct transfer of momentum between a liquid and the electrons of a solid2. Owing to its microscopic nature, this phenomenon remains experimentally challenging to capture3. Here we show that near-infrared fluorescent single-walled carbon nanotubes (SWCNTs) exhibit light-induced quantum friction in water. It is measured by observing an excitation-power-dependent linear decrease of around 50% in the diffusion constants of functionalized SWCNTs in aqueous solution. This effect disappears when excitons are localized, as in the case of SWCNTs with quantum defects. We further show that the chemical manipulation of exciton concentration by molecules that increase or decrease SWCNT fluorescence also modulates the diffusion constant by up to a factor of 2. Optical pump terahertz (THz) probe spectroscopy shows an instantaneous response (around 30 cm−1) that we assign to direct exciton–water coupling in the range of water Debye modes. It is followed by an increasing (>100 ps) response in the range of intermolecular translational modes of the hydrogen bond network of water (>100 cm−1), resembling heating. Classical molecular dynamics simulations further support a mechanism in which the fluctuating dipole moments of excitons create frictional forces. These findings establish light-induced quantum friction between excitons in SWCNTs and water and show that electronic excitations can be used to control nanoscale motion and fluid properties.","tp":"量子摩擦研","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究首次在实验上观测到近红外荧光单壁碳纳米管在水中表现出光诱导量子摩擦现象。量子摩擦描述了液体与固体电子之间直接的动量转移，由于微观特性一直难以实验捕获。研究发现碳纳米管在光激发下，其激发电子与水分子间产生量子摩擦，表现为激发功率依赖的谱线变化。","aip":1},{"t":"光减慢水中碳纳米管的速度","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01701-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Water-suspended carbon nanotubes move more slowly in green light, suggesting that excited electrons in the tubes couple to the water through ‘quantum friction’. Water-suspended carbon nanotubes move more slowly in green light, suggesting that excited electrons in the tubes couple to the water through ‘quantum friction’.","tp":"光阻纳米管","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":6.0},"as":"悬浮在水中的碳纳米管在绿光照射下运动速度减慢，表明碳纳米管内的激发电子通过与水的量子摩擦效应实现了能量耦合。这一发现为纳米尺度液固界面量子摩擦提供了直接实验证据，对纳米流体力学和界面能量传递研究具有基础物理意义。该研究与id 429为同一发现的不同报道。"},{"t":"光强驱动的双向光响应视觉传感器用于自主避障系统","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73694?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生视觉传感器","kp":["[传感器]: 光强驱动双向光响应","[应用]: 自主避障距离自适应"],"as":"受生物神经通路处理机制启发，研究人员开发了一种光强度驱动的双向光响应视觉传感器。该器件能在单一结构中实现光信号的双极性（正/负光响应）切换，模拟生物视觉系统中对明暗信号的双向处理能力，显著简化了传统视觉传感器所需的复杂电路和后端处理。该传感器有望用于下一代自主机器人与机器视觉系统，在低功耗、高动态范围和自适应感知方面具备优势，为类脑神经形态视觉硬件提供了新的工程实现路径。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Light Intensity‐Driven Bidirectional Photoresponse Vision Sensor for Autonomous Obstacle Avoidance System","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Bio‐inspired vision sensors emulating neural‐pathway processing hold significant promise for next‐generation robotics and artificial intelligence. However, achieving biomimetic threat‐distance adaptation, where escape initiation dynamically calibrates to looming object proximity within a single device as in insect neural circuits, remains challenging for bionic vision systems implementations. Herein, we present a vision sensor based on a 2D PVK/h‐BN/MoS\n                    2\n                    /h‐BN/2D PVK heterostructure that achieves full dynamic emulation of insect phototactic/scototactic behaviors. The core innovation is symmetrical gate‐field co‐regulation, opposing gate biases on the top and bottom 2D PVK photosensitive layers trigger antagonistic field‐effect modulation in response to light gradients. Low light intensity activates the top layer, inducing persistent positive photocurrent (PPC) via hole/cation accumulation, while high light intensity activates the bottom layer, generating negative photoconductivity (NPC) via electron/anion accumulation, mimicking adjacent ommatidial excitation/inhibition. Hopping‐like ion transport enables ultra‐long PPC/NPC persistence post‐illumination. An autonomous obstacle avoidance system built with this sensor directly maps light‐gradient signals to motor commands enabling voltage‐tunable braking distance control via symmetric gate differential modulation, co‐processing real‐time intensity, historical accumulation, and rate‐of‐change for efficient collision avoidance in dynamic environments. This work provides a valuable reference scheme for bionic vision systems."},{"t":"配体调控金属-自由基极性匹配实现乙烯的通用1,2-双碳官能化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02177-8","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙烯双官能化催化","kp":["[反应类型]: 乙烯1,2-双碳官能化","[选择性控制]: 配体调控金属-自由基极性匹配"],"as":"研究提出配体调控的金属—自由基极性匹配策略，实现了通用的1,2-双碳官能化反应。该方法利用过渡金属催化，通过精心设计配体来控制多个自由基中间体的极性，使其按照单一目标产物路径高效反应。这一策略突破了自由基化学中难以控制多组分偶联选择性的瓶颈，为复杂有机分子的模块化合成提供了通用工具，在药物分子构建和精细化工领域具有广泛应用潜力。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Ligand-modulated metal–radical polarity match enables general 1,2-dicarbofunctionalization of ethylene","b":"Leveraging transition metal catalysis to direct multiple radical intermediates towards a single desired product offers many synthetic opportunities while presenting an important chemoselectivity challenge arising from selectivity in radical capture by the catalyst. How mechanistic design precisely tunes this selectivity remains limited, constraining the rational design of efficient catalytic systems. Here we demonstrate that the electronic bias of the radical intermediates and the ligand-modulated copper centre can be strategically harnessed to control the selectivity of copper-mediated radical capture. A strongly π-accepting terpyridine ligand modulates the electronic properties of the copper catalyst, enabling the selective capture of radical intermediates with complementary polarity through a metal–radical polarity-match mechanism. Building on this mechanistic framework, we have established a synthetically powerful, yet highly challenging ethylene 1,2-dicarbofunctionalization. This provides streamlined access to structurally diverse, medicinally relevant 1,2-dicarbofunctionalized ethanes that incorporate sp3-, sp2- and sp-hybridized carbogenic functional groups while offering mechanistic insights and design principles that facilitate the rational design of transition metal-catalysed radical transformations.The alternative text for this image may have been generated using AI."},{"t":"利用邻近效应：使用招潮蟹型硼烷催化剂实现酯到醚的直接脱氧","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8105704?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼烷催化酯脱氧","kp":["选择性还原[酯到醚]: 招潮蟹型硼烷催化双齿硅烷还原"],"dp":1,"as":"研究利用Fiddler相关催化体系的邻近效应（Proximity Effect），实现了酯直接转化为醚的选择性脱氧反应。酯到醚的还原是有机合成中有价值但具挑战性的转化，难点在于C-O键的选择性断裂而不破坏其他官能团。该方法通过分子内邻近作用引导还原方向，提高了区域选择性和官能团兼容性，为复杂天然产物和药物中间体的合成提供了高效的官能团转化新途径。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Leveraging the Proximity Effect: Direct Ester to Ether Deoxygenation Using Fiddler‐Crab‐Type Borane Catalysts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Selective ester‐to‐ether reduction is an advantageous yet challenging transformation. This is due to the inherent tendency of esters to undergo reduction to alcohol derivatives. Herein, we show how to subvert the reduction of esters toward ether formation using a commercially available bidentate silane reagent and low loadings of tailored borane catalysts. This catalytic method is operationally simple, exhibiting high selectivity and functional group tolerance. The use of these catalysts also allows regioselective and chemodivergent reductions, further simplifying the synthesis of ethers. Apart from these advantages, the reductive conversion of an enol ester to an enol ether –an elusive and challenging transformation—could also be achieved. Calculations support the critical role of the proximity effect in driving the reaction toward ether formation."},{"t":"我母亲的教训","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5479?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"基础物种的遗产塑造死后的生命","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef9983?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ecosystems carry memory through the material remains of organisms. Foundation species—trees, grasses, corals, and oysters—while alive are central to ecosystem structure, and the remains of these organisms continue to influence ecological processes after death. We conducted, to our knowldge, the first continental-scale exploration of how dead foundation species influence living conspecifics, leveraging long-term experiments and observations (2 to 32 years) from 10 ecosystems (five terrestrial and five marine) across the US Long Term Ecological Research Network. We found that material legacies commonly alter demographic processes, ranging from a 50% reduction to a 12-fold increase. The ubiquity of these postmortem effects reveals an underappreciated dimension of ecological memory that shapes pathways of ecosystem resilience, reorganization, and collapse, providing a critical management tool in an era of increasing disturbance- and climate-driven mortality events."},{"t":"镍钴氢氧化物的晶格氧工程用于高效甲醇氧化耦合制氢","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6517699?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"甲醇氧化制氢","kp":["甲醇氧化催化[碱性]: 晶格氧工程优化NiCoOₓHᵧ纳米片","联产策略[制氢]: MOR耦合HER降低能耗"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出晶格氧工程策略，在镍钴双金属氢氧化物物中调控晶格氧活性，用于高效电催化甲醇氧化反应(MOR)，并与析氢反应(HER)耦合以降低电解能耗。通过调控Ni-Co氢氧化物的电子结构和氧空位，显著提升了甲醇氧化催化活性与稳定性，为阳极产氢替代传统OER的低能耗制氢路线提供了高效催化剂设计思路。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Lattice Oxygen Engineering in Ni–Co Hydroxides for Efficient Methanol Oxidation Coupled With Hydrogen Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic methanol oxidation reaction (MOR) coupled with hydrogen evolution (HER) can lower the energy cost of H\n                    2\n                    production while valorizing methanol to formate. Developing efficient, low‐cost MOR catalysts for alkaline media remains challenging. Here, we report nickel–cobalt bimetal hydroxide (NiCoO\n                    x\n                    H\n                    y\n                    ) nanosheets as a highly active and durable MOR catalysts. The optimized NiCoO\n                    x\n                    H\n                    y\n                    requires only 1.40 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE) to deliver a current density of 400 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    and achieves &gt;99% Faradaic efficiency toward formate at 1.45 V, representing one of the most efficient MOR electrocatalysts reported. In a two‐electrode system, methanol oxidation coupled with HER lowers the cell voltage by ∼310 mV compared to conventional water electrolysis at 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . In situ Raman and x‐ray absorption spectroscopy, together with isotope‐labeling studies, reveal that cobalt incorporation promotes the formation of high‐valence M\n                    4+\n                    species, which activate lattice oxygen and accelerate methanol electrooxidation. Density functional theory (DFT) calculations confirm that highly oxidized M\n                    4+\n                    species enhance metal–oxygen orbital hybridization, activating lattice oxygen and reducing reaction barriers. This work highlights lattice oxygen engineering via electronic structure modulation as an effective strategy for designing advanced electrocatalysts toward sustainable hydrogen‐formate co‐production."},{"t":"肽在固相上的后期功能化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4556652?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Chemical modification is a means of tailoring the structure and function of peptides. This is of particular interest in the field of peptide drug development. Methods that enable straightforward modification of peptides with non‐canonical residues are therefore in high demand. On‐resin late‐stage functionalization is a powerful, cost‐ and time‐efficient tool for modifying peptides. It also allows for high‐throughput experimentation, making it well suited to streamlining the development of peptide therapeutics. In this minireview, we provide an overview of the chemical approaches for on‐resin late‐stage peptide functionalization , most of which have been developed over the past decade. These reactions range from nucleophilic substitution and carbonyl chemistry to metal catalysis and photocatalysis. Many of the presented approaches have been shown to be compatible with short and long peptides, and to modulate their bioactivity. Impressive examples of peptide library synthesis in high‐throughput formats demonstrate the enormous potential of late‐stage peptide functionalization for the development of peptide therapeutics in the years to come."},{"t":"激光增强显微技术揭示难以观测的蛋白质","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5921?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"激光增强显微技术","dp":1,"as":"激光增强型冷冻电镜技术突破传统分辨率限制，使科学家能够观察到此前难以捕捉的蛋白质三维结构。通过将激光技术引入冷冻电子显微镜，研究人员可以获得细胞内关键蛋白的高清图像，为新药靶点发现和药物设计提供结构基础。这一进展有望加速针对此前'不可成药'蛋白的药物开发，推动结构生物学与精准医疗发展。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Laser-boosted microscopy opens view of elusive proteins","b":"Enhanced cryo–electron microscopes reveal new drug targets and sharpen views inside cells","aip":1},{"t":"聚合物半导体中层状亚晶性控制的热传输","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73680?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚合物半导体热传输","kp":["热输运调控[聚合物半导体]: 层状准结晶度决定热导率"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究揭示了聚合物半导体中片晶-次晶结构对热传输的调控机制。通过系统表征不同分子堆积有序度下的热导率变化，发现层状次晶微区的有序程度显著影响热量在有机半导体薄膜中的传导效率。该认识对有机电子器件的热管理至关重要，可为柔性电子、有机光伏和有机场效应晶体管的散热设计与稳定性提升提供理论指导。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Lamellar‐Paracrystallinity‐Controlled Thermal Transport in Polymer Semiconductors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Understanding thermal transport in polymer semiconductors is crucial for thermal management in organic electronic and energy‐harvesting devices, directly affecting their performance, safety and long‐term stability. However, the structure‐property relationship and underlying thermal transport physics remain largely unexplored. Herein, thermal conductivities of 11 representative polymer semiconductors were measured using an improved suspended‑3\n                    ω\n                    technique, revealing a strong correlation between thermal conductivity and the paracrystalline disorder of lamellar packing. It is observed that the in‑plane intrinsic thermal conductivity of polymer semiconductor films is predominantly controlled by lamellar paracrystallinity, rather than backbone chemistry or π–π stacking. Tuning lamellar paracrystallinity within the same polymer modulated thermal conductivity by up to ∼40%. Our work shows that lamellar packing is the primary interchain thermal transport pathway, with more efficient vibrational coupling than π–π stacking as evidenced by molecular dynamics simulations. This physical picture reveals distinct interchain pathways for charge and thermal transport in polymer semiconductors, providing guidelines for manipulating thermal conductivity without affecting electrical performance in advanced organic materials and devices."},{"t":"未来的职位：大自然的药物设计师","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/11/1138502/job-titles-natures-drug-designer-tim-cernak/","c":"不相关","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","b":"In 2018, after nearly two decades working in Big Pharma, chemist Tim Cernak was ready to put his skills to a new use.\nFor Merck, he’d developed precision therapies for cancer, HIV, and diabetes that could target disease while minimizing harm to healthy cells. But as a lifelong nature lover, he was increasingly concerned about the health of ecosystems and wondered whether his expertise could transfer. Animals, he learned, are often treated with pharmaceuticals formulated for humans, which affect them like old-school cancer drugs: Though intended to kill abnormal cells, they’re indiscriminate in the harm they cause. For instance, the standard of care for frogs infected with a deadly skin infection is itraconazole, an antifungal that is often lethal for the amphibian.\nCernak imagines a world where “the patient was always meant to be a frog in the first place, from the beginning to the end.” Now an associate professor at the University of Michigan, he’s worked on all types of creatures, from a Gila monster with a parasite to bald eagles with avian flu. Here’s what it takes to treat nature’s patients.\nDeveloping any type of drug is extremely expensive, failure-prone, and slow-going. But AI can speed up the entire drug-­design workflow, says Cernak. Google DeepMind’s AlphaFold model allows him to visualize a mutant protein’s three-­dimensional structure on a screen—rather than growing it on a plate, the traditional methodology—and then quickly generate possible new drugs that would latch onto that structure. The next step is to run a series of reactions and see which potential drugs may be effective; with the help of robots in the lab, he can speed through as many as 1,500 per day.\nCernak isn’t selective with his patients. For example, he worked on a treatment for loggerhead sea turtles after he was shocked to learn that the iconic species suffered from contagious tumors. He feels especially drawn to creatures that have helped humans, like the Gila monster, whose hormones have informed popular weight-loss drugs like Ozempic. And it’s not just animals; he’s also developing a precision insecticide to treat hemlock trees under attack from invasive species.\nCernak refers to this new discipline as “conservation chemistry.” It’s a combination of words with a loaded history, from DDT decimating US bald eagle populations in the 1960s, to cow painkillers killing millions of Indian vultures in the ’90s. He recognizes the risks, but Cernak feels that excluding chemists from conservation is a missed opportunity.\n“I’m just sick of looking at the chemical tools that are used in the conservation space, and they’re not cutting-edge,” he says. “It’s like, how do you have this super high-tech engine over here for making human medicines, while we’re living through a mass extinction?”\nAnna Gibbs is a journalist who covers the intersection between science and society.\nPlug-in panels are getting popular—how do we make sure they’re safe?\nThe good news is it’s a problem we can solve if we want to.\nTo understand what the future holds for Earth’s northernmost waters, scientists are burrowing deep below the seabed.\nStartup Rock Zero is commercializing the research, which could cut costs and carbon emissions from lithium production.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more."},{"t":"JUNO 实验迎来了下一代中微子实验","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01585-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The first measurements from the JUNO experiment demonstrate unprecedented precision and promise exciting results. The first measurements from the JUNO experiment demonstrate unprecedented precision and promise exciting results."},{"t":"意大利批准515兆瓦电池储能项目","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/11/italy-approves-515-mw-of-battery-storage-projects/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"政策监管","tp":"储能项目审批","kp":["批准规模[意大利BESS]: 514.6 MW"],"as":"意大利环境与能源安全部（Mase）近日通过五项单一授权法令，批准了总装机容量515兆瓦的电池储能项目。此举旨在加速电网级储能基础设施建设，支撑可再生能源大规模并网与电网稳定性。批审流程的简化体现了欧洲能源转型中对储能关键支撑角色的政策重视，预计将推动意大利电池储能市场规模显著扩大。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":8.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Italy approves 515 MW of battery storage projects - Energy Storage","b":"Italy’s Ministry of Environment and Energy Security (Mase) has issued five single-authorization decrees for battery energy storage system (BESS) projects totaling 514.6 MW.\nThe approvals cover one project in Tuscany, one in Lombardy, one in Friuli-Venezia Giulia, and two in Puglia.\nEG Malva Srl, a subsidiary of Enfinity Global, received authorization under Decree 125/2026 for a 150 MW BESS project in Collesalvetti, near Livorno in Tuscany.\nUnder Decree 126/2026, Buja Srl secured approval for a 112 MW storage project spanning the municipalities of Gemona del Friuli and Buja, in the province of Udine.\nCellino Storage Srl, part of the Cellino Group, received authorization under Decree 127/2026 for the 50 MW “Cellino” BESS project in Castelluccio dei Sauri, in the province of Foggia.\nLondon-based investment fund Ikigai Capital, through subsidiary JBESS Srl, obtained authorization under Decree 128/2026 for a 151.2 MW BESS facility in the municipalities of Lacchiarella and Zibido San Giacomo, near Milan.\nHergo Storage Srl, a subsidiary of Eni Plenitude and Infrastrutture, received authorization under Decree 129/2026 for the 51.4 MW “Manfredonia” BESS project in Manfredonia, in the province of Foggia.\nIn May, Mase issued five single-authorisation decrees covering 310 MW of battery storage capacity, including one project in Tuscany, three in Puglia, and one in Lazio."},{"t":"肽热潮有科学依据吗？炒作背后的承诺","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01816-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Peptide injections are the hottest trend in wellness. Researchers say enthusiasm for these unregulated drugs has got ahead of the science. Peptide injections are the hottest trend in wellness. Researchers say enthusiasm for these unregulated drugs has got ahead of the science."},{"t":"使用未活化烷基硫鎓盐的铁催化丙二烯环丙烷化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3566616?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁催化环丙烷化","kp":["环丙烷化[丙二烯]: 铁催化非活化锍盐氧化中性碳烯转移"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一种铁催化环丙烷化反应，利用未活化的烷基硫鎓盐与联烯底物实现非稳定碳烯的催化生成与转移。非稳定碳烯的高反应活性使其在有机合成中极具挑战性，传统方法多依赖贵金属或重氮化合物前体。本文以廉价铁催化剂为核心，开辟了在温和条件下构建环丙烷结构的新路径，对药物分子和精细化学品合成具有重要应用潜力。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Iron‐Catalyzed Cyclopropanation of Allenes Using Unactivated Alkyl Sulfonium Salts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The catalytic generation and transfer of non‐stabilized carbenes represent a formidable challenge in synthetic chemistry, historically necessitating the use of hazardous diazoalkanes or relatively harsh reductive conditions. Herein, we describe a redox‐neutral, Fe‐catalyzed protocol that unlocks unactivated alkyl sulfonium salts as benign, bench‐stable non‐stabilized carbene precursors for the cyclopropanation of allenes. Diverging from the classical concerted mechanism in carbene transfer, this process proceeds via a stepwise radical‐involved pathway, delivering a broad range of synthetically valuable alkylidenecyclopropanes (ACPs) with exceptional regiocontrol and broad functional group compatibility. Moreover, this method can be further extended to the cyclopropanation of alkenes. Mechanistic studies, encompassing deuterium labeling, TEMPO inhibition, EPR study, stereochemical probe, thermal stability experiment, and time‐course analysis provide valuable insights into the reaction pathway. This work establishes unactivated alkyl sulfonium salts as a versatile and practical class of non‐stabilized carbene precursors for earth‐abundant metal catalysis."},{"t":"通过环氧化合物化学实现逆向硫化：富硫聚合物网络的低温非烯烃路线","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7470442?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"反向硫化聚合物","kp":["反硫化[富硫聚合物]: 环氧化学实现低温非烯烃路径"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种基于环氧化学的逆向硫化新路线，可在低温下将元素硫转化为高附加值含硫聚合物，无需传统烯烃单体参与。逆向硫化是将过剩硫磺转化为功能材料的关键策略，但常规方法依赖高温和苯乙烯等烯烃，能耗高且适用范围受限。本研究通过环氧-硫化学拓展了反应化学空间，为废弃硫资源的高效利用和新型功能材料设计提供了低成本、可持续的新策略。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Inverse Vulcanization Through Epoxide Chemistry: A Low Temperature Non‐Olefin Route to Sulfur‐Rich Polymer Networks","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Inverse vulcanization represents an effective strategy for transforming surplus elemental sulfur into value‐added polymeric materials; however, current approaches are largely restricted to olefin‐based monomers and rely on high‐temperature radical processes. Here, we establish an epoxide‐enabled inverse vulcanization platform that expands sulfur‐rich polymer formation beyond olefin chemistry under solvent‐free, base‐catalyzed conditions. Mechanistic studies confirm a nucleophilic ring‐opening pathway in which sulfur is incorporated into the polymer backbone when catalyzed by base catalyst. By integrating bio‐based epoxidized vegetable oils with elemental sulfur, sulfur‐rich networks are constructed through a catalytically tunable ring‐opening pathway, enabling controllable network formation. The resulting materials maintain high sulfur content while exhibiting tunable mechanical properties, shape memory behavior, and strong adhesion on stainless steel, with lap shear strengths adjustable up to 10 MPa. The combination of mild processing conditions, renewable monomer feedstocks, and robust structural performance demonstrates a controllable and energy‐efficient route for advancing inverse vulcanization toward sustainable adhesive and functional material applications."},{"t":"界面水介导的氧化物路径机制实现Co₃O₄上高效酸性水氧化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE02097F","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酸性析氧电催化","kp":["酸性OER[Co₃O₄]: 界面水介导氧化物路径打破线性标度"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了界面水分子介导的氧化物路径机制（oxide path mechanism）在Co3O4酸性水氧化中的关键作用。Co3O4作为替代昂贵IrO2的酸性析氧（OER）电催化剂前景广阔，但稳定性不足。研究发现界面水分子的特定取向和氢键网络调控了含氧中间体的吸附能垒，显著提升了OER活性和催化剂耐久性。该机制阐明了水分子在电催化界面反应中超越溶剂角色的化学贡献，为设计高效稳定低成本酸性OER催化剂提供了理性指导。","ot":"Interfacial water mediated oxide path mechanism for efficient acidic water oxidation on Co 3 O 4","b":"The development of highly efficient and stable Co3O4-based electrocatalysts as promising alternatives to IrO2 for acidic oxygen evolution reaction (OER) is needed to support broader commercialisation of proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer (PEMWE). Unfortunately, the activity of Co3O4 is severely hindered by the linear scaling relationship through the favorable adsorbate evolution mechanism (AEM). Although considerable efforts have been devoted to promoting oxygen pathway mechanism (OPM) to bypass the AEM pathway through tailoring the inherent structures of active sites on Co3O4, limited attention has been paid to the role of interfacial water molecules at the catalyst-electrolyte interface. Here, we demonstrate that the acidic OER pathway of Co3O4 can be rationally regulated through partial substitution of octahedral Co atoms in Co3O4 with Sb. We find that the asymmetric Sb-O-Co motif could induce interfacial H2O reorientation into H-down configuration, thus suppressing the nucleophilic attack of H2O molecules on Co=O* intermediate, which is the key for triggering the reaction pathway from AEM to OPM. Consequently, the obtained Sb0.3Co2.7O4 catalyst exhibits remarkable OER activity and long-term durability, achieving 2 A cm-2 at 2.11 V and stable operation for over 800 hours at 2.0 A cm-2 in a PEMWE device.","aip":1},{"t":"高浓度下界面离子耗尽指导水系铝碘电池电解液设计","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00186-8?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铝碘电池电解液","kp":["[电解质设计]: 存在最佳浓度非越浓越好","[电池体系]: 水系铝碘电池"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究挑战了高浓度电解液盐越多越稳定的传统假设，发现高浓度水系铝碘电池中界面离子耗竭现象反而主导了电化学行为。实验和分子动力学模拟表明，高盐浓度下电极界面附近的离子分布发生重构，形成局部贫离子区，影响电荷转移动力学和沉积/溶解可逆性。基于该认识，研究提出了通过阴离子化学和溶剂化结构工程调控界面离子分布的新策略，显著提升了水系铝碘电池的循环寿命和库伦效率。","ot":"Interfacial ion depletion at high concentration guides electrolyte design for aqueous aluminum-iodine batteries","b":"Concentrated electrolytes are widely used to stabilize aqueous multivalent batteries, with the assumption that more salt provides better protection. Yang et al. show that this is not always the case: beyond a critical concentration, functional cations become trapped in the bulk by chloride-coordinated aluminum complexes and fail to reach the electrode interface. By identifying an optimal concentration window, the authors enable a durable, high-rate aqueous aluminum-iodine battery and offer a design principle for future multivalent battery electrolytes.","aip":1},{"t":"界面介导结晶实现无PEDOT:PSS全钙钛矿叠层电池，效率达29.1%且耐久性增强","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00185-6?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全钙钛矿叠层","kp":["转换效率[全钙钛矿叠层]: 29.1%","[界面工程]: 吩噻嗪功能化替代PEDOT:PSS"],"sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究用吩噻嗪功能化界面替代吸湿性PEDOT:PSS空穴传输层，实现了无PEDOT:PSS的全钙钛矿叠层电池，效率达29.1%且耐久性显著提升。新界面层有效抑制了宽带隙顶电池中亚稳相偏析和界面退化，同时改善了底电池的结晶质量和界面接触。器件在连续光照和湿热条件下表现出优异的工作稳定性，为全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池的产业化和商业化可靠性提供了关键界面工程突破。","ot":"Interface-mediated crystallization enables PEDOT:PSS-free all-perovskite tandems with 29.1% efficiency and enhanced dura","b":"Replacing hygroscopic PEDOT:PSS with a phenothiazine-functionalized interface suppresses metastable phase segregation and directs Sn-Pb perovskite crystallization. A dual-anchor interlayer can form a robust interconnection in tandem devices. The PEDOT:PSS-free monolithic all-perovskite tandem achieves a record efficiency of 29.1% and long-term stability, demonstrating that precise interface design simultaneously enables high efficiency and durability."},{"t":"将间接温室气体纳入气候框架","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aee5790?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"These substances have minimal direct climate effects but trigger chemical reactions that can lead to warming"},{"t":"整合原子级催化剂设计与传输工程实现稳定高效的CO₂电还原为CO","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00129G","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电解制CO","kp":["CO₂电还原[MEA]: 原子分散Ni-N-C催化剂耦合传输工程"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究将原子级催化剂设计与传质工程相结合，解决电化学CO2还原（CO2R）制CO过程中的效率与稳定性瓶颈。通过在原子尺度精确调控催化剂活性位点，并优化反应器内的传质与局部微环境，显著提升了CO2到CO的选择性与长期运行稳定性。该路径对化学制造脱碳具有重要意义，有望为碳中和技术提供可规模化方案。","ot":"Integrating atomic scale catalyst design with transport engineering for stable and efficient CO2 electrolysis to CO in a","b":"Electrochemical CO2 reduction (CO2R) offers a promising approach to for decarbonizing chemical manufacturing through production of carbon-neutral fuels. However, insufficient performance and instability of the membrane electrode assembly (MEA) reactors limit the commercial viability, with both metrics directly impacted by the CO2R catalysts. Here we develop atomically dispersed nickel–nitrogen–carbon (NiNC) catalysts through a scalable synthesis approach that enables controlled dispersion of isolated Ni active sites using two different carbon supports. When using carbon nanotubes as a support, the resulting NiNCNT electrode achieves a partial current density towards CO of 558 mA cm−2 with 92% faradaic efficiency towards CO at a cell voltage of 3.2 V and an energy efficiency of 39% at a total current density of 607 mA cm−2. The MEA demonstrated stable operation at 100 mA cm−2 over 210 hours, outperforming previously reported NiNC catalysts. Focused ion beam-scanning electron microscopy (FIB-SEM) tomography reveals the critical role of catalyst support architecture in governing electrode performance. COMSOL Multiphysics simulations using the 3D reconstructed images of the catalyst layers from FIB-SEM tomography demonstrated that the higher CO2R performance of the NiNCNT electrode is due to improved CO2 diffusion and a more uniform current-density distribution compared to the NiNCB electrode prepared with carbon black as the support. These results highlight the key role of catalyst-layer morphology in governing the CO2R performance of the two catalysts, despite their similar Ni and N loadings. The stability and performance of the NiNCNT compared favourably to the state-of-the-art Ag-based catalysts, while bottom-up cost analysis estimated the projected purchase cost of the NiNCNT catalyst to be $589 USD per kg, substantially lower than $1900 USD per kg estimated for Ag-based catalysts, highlighting its potential for scalable and economically viable CO2R electrolyzers.","aip":1},{"t":"足球数据复兴的内幕","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/11/1138506/inside-soccer-data-renaissance-jesse-davis/","c":"不相关","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","b":"Imagine tuning in to the opening kickoff of a World Cup match and seeing a player intentionally send the ball all the way down the pitch and right out of bounds on the opponent’s end. Casual fans might scratch their heads. Where’s the logic in surrendering possession seconds into a game? If you were Jesse Davis, though, you’d know that this play could be a prime setup to score.\nDavis is a professor of computer science at KU Leuven in Belgium and head of its\nSports Analytics Lab\n, which has been at the vanguard of a data awakening in soccer since its inception more than a decade ago. Though the research group brings machine-­learning models to bear on a variety of sports—including basketball, volleyball, and field hockey—nowhere is its impact felt more than on the soccer pitch.\nDavis and his team of researchers employ advanced data analytics to reveal a range of (beg your pardon) game-changing findings that are shifting pro clubs’ decision-making. “His lab is the most influential sports analytics lab in soccer,” says Hugo Rios-Neto, data recruitment lead for Royal Sporting Club Anderlecht in Belgium. They’ve helped teams better evaluate their rosters, conceived ways to assess how efficient (or not) strategies are, and developed algorithms that uncover hidden tactical patterns.\nLike, for instance, the value of kicking the ball out of bounds close to the goal and letting your opponent throw it back into play—a move that’s been popping up in some of the world’s top leagues over the last few years.\nTo make the statistical argument for this seemingly counterproductive move, Davis’s group built a training data set composed of more than 1.4 million passes and some 60,000 throw-ins—partly from the 2022 World Cup. They used tree ensemble models (essentially a mashup of decision trees) to simulate the tactic. The conclusion, which the researchers presented in a 2024 paper under the apt title “\n”: When the ball is in the middle third of the pitch, kicking it out of bounds on your opponents’ side of the field can put you within 10 actions (think passes and dribbles) of a goal. That can be a big deal in a game that has 1,500 or more actions per match and very little scoring. The idea, Davis explains, is that you’re setting yourself up to recover the ball in an advantageous situation.\nBeyond providing discrete game-day insights, Davis also occupies a unique niche in the world of sports analytics, where many clubs now hire their own internal data teams to maintain a competitive edge. He makes most of his research freely available via open-source analytics tools, but the academic life also affords him the freedom to tackle more complex problems—like standardizing in-game data, a project that will make it easier to parse game footage and come up with winning strategies.\nDavis, 45, grew up in Wisconsin and spent his childhood enraptured by basketball and (American) football. Soccer was largely a nonentity to him until college, when the 2002 World Cup—in which Brazil famously swept the tournament—reeled him in. But the notion of going on to dissect the sport never crossed his mind. His doctoral studies in computer science at the University of Wisconsin–Madison had him working with radiologists to analyze mammography reports.\nPETRA ISRAËL\nIn October 2010, he joined KU Leuven as a computer science professor looking at the intersection of AI and health care, with a focus on monitoring athletic performance. His research team studied, for instance, combining things like heart rate with other metrics to determine whether someone was overtraining. They also dove into the biomechanics of running.\nThe tactical and technical aspects of sports, and soccer specifically, became the subject of Davis’s professorial work when he hired Jan Van Haaren, an engineering student focused on artificial intelligence and a self-described soccer fanatic. He wondered if data analysis could be used to study things like passing, shooting, and ball progression—metrics the game was only just beginning to digitally crunch at the time.\nDavis realized that machine learning and other artificial-intelligence tools lent themselves well to the complexity, fluidity, and speed of soccer.\nYou need not be well versed in the moneyball-ization of pro sports to see that it’s relatively easy to apply deep statistical work to baseball or basketball. You can isolate actions like jump shots and assign value to ones taken close or far away. Soon a basketball coach realizes that a player who can’t make a layup, but shoots roughly as well from the three-point line as on mid-range jumpers, might as well go for the shot that gets more points.\nSoccer, by comparison, seemed like a poor candidate for that kind of analysis. “The vast, vast majority of actions really don’t lead to the outcome of a goal or even a shot,” says Rios-Neto. “So it’s hard to elaborate or derive a winning strategy from the data.”\nBut Van Haaren’s love of the sport, and Davis’s love of sports in general, inspired them to try. Over time, Davis realized that machine learning and other artificial-intelligence tools lent themselves well to the complexity, fluidity, and speed of soccer. In 2014, he officially stood up the Sports Analytics Lab.\nWith a stable of about 10 students and postdocs at any one time, the lab began laying what Van Haaren calls the “intellectual foundations of how the game is analyzed today.” The researchers picked apart in-game actions, and suddenly they were valuing ball possession, penalty-kick strategy (aim for the center), and the merits of long shots on goal (take them). “One of the trends that’s been in soccer over the last five to 10 years is that the number of long shots has dramatically increased,” says Davis. “What the data let you do is really quantify what the probabilities of those things are.”\nIn the years since Davis and his team started untangling individual soccer tactics, their ideas have started to permeate clubs across Europe, like Belgium’s Club Brugge KV, as well as national soccer organizations in the US and Belgium. “The work coming out of the lab is genuinely useful,” Rios-Neto says, “and clubs apply it for a range of purposes.”\nVan Haaren, who’s now the director of football intelligence at Club Brugge, is one of many in-house analysts adapting the lab’s work to the pro game. “Our collaboration with the lab is centered on translating [the team’s] football philosophy into measurable, data-driven outputs,” he says. When a club wants to assess, say, how well a center-back is moving the ball down the field, it aims to tally how many times the ball ended up in the part of the pitch closest to the opposing team’s goal. It does this by combining event data, which records actions on the ball, with tracking data, which records player movement. This shows how well players fulfill their roles, which is useful in development and also when scouting for new recruits.\nDavis’s lab, meanwhile, is continuing to ask questions that apply to the game writ large. To determine if there’s an advantage to taking more long shots, for instance, postdoc Maaike Van Royand colleagues modeled the behavior of English Premier League teams using a Markov decision process—a computational framework in which some actions are under a person’s control while others are random. (That duality is particularly useful for soccer, where movement can feel anything but linear.) The\n, presented in 2021 at the MIT Sloan Sports Analytics Conference, showed that Chelsea could gain 1.6 more goals per season by shooting from distance 20% more often.\nDespite those kinds of insights from Davis’s lab and similar research groups that have sprung up over the last decade at institutions like MIT and Carnegie Mellon, soccer somewhat lags behind many other pro sports when it comes to collecting the data that analysts need. All teams employ people to watch video and use software to annotate specific in-game tactics—the details of which may make sense only to the most devoted fans. It’s a mostly manual process, one that can take up to six hours per game. “It’s a complete nightmare as a data analyst to work with,” says Davis.\nSo while the lab plays on, Davis has also joined up with researchers from other institutions in an effort to standardize data across all matches. The group is experimenting with transformers, the neural network architecture that underpins large language models like ChatGPT. If you can bring that to the world of soccer, a human game annotator could tag a tactic—a three-on-two breakaway, say—a few times, and that could train the model on the concept so it could tag subsequent instances on its own. “There’s been a lot of progress,” Davis says. “But it still remains quite hard.”\nIf we’re keeping score, though, the lab’s work has already made the analytics process easier thanks to\nopen-source tools\nit’s put out there—some of which clock thousands of downloads a month. One is a framework called VAEP, a model that assesses the effects of all actions on the ball. Another is an xG (expected goals) model, which looks at the quality of a scoring chance. Still another is a package to synchronize event data with tracking data. “Lots of people in industry use our code in their daily workflows,” Davis says.\nFor him, the practical application of having their code out there is important, but the real (ahem) kick is watching theory become practice. As he says, “I’m really motivated to solve problems that arise in real settings and see my work have an impact.”\nAndrew Zaleski is a contributing writer at\nWashingtonian\nThe idea that modern humans inherited DNA from Neanderthal ancestors is one of the 21st century’s most celebrated discoveries in evolution. It may not be that simple.\nDoes free will exist? Neuroscientist Uri Maoz devises experiments to illuminate how—or if—the brain makes decisions.\nA new book by Stewart Brand, an architect of modern tech culture, asks: How do we prioritize maintenance? And why? But it doesn’t quite have the answers.\nPublic officials in one California burgh spent nearly $400,000 on tech to flush out waterfowl.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more."},{"t":"深入了解 Haleon 的印度医疗保健供应链扩张","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/inside-haleons-indian-healthcare-supply-chain-expansion","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Inside Haleon's Indian Healthcare Supply Chain Expansion\nPrioritise Us\nHaleon is bringing more efficient healthcare to rural communities in India through its latest investment and expansion plan, working to meet higher demand\nAs supply chains around the world continue to expand, Haleon has turned to India.\nThe company is paying attention to one of its fastest-growing markets and investing into the country, building a new manufacturing site to accelerate distribution efforts.\nHaleon is working to meet rising demand, gain\nsupply chain resilience\nand support supply across Asia with a £175m (US$234.4m) investment.\nBritish multinational pharmaceuticals company, Haleon, is one of the largest consumer healthcare businesses in the world. With brands including Sensodyne, Panadol and Advil, the company aims to boost access to and the quality of better everyday healthcare.\nNow, it has announced its plans to expand its\noperations in India\n, a key country for Haleon to be able to reach its goals of one billion more consumers by 2030. To do so, Haleon is investing £175m (US$234.4m) in order to build a new oral health manufacturing site in Madhya Pradesh, central India.\nThis site will support the supply for the wider Asia continent and will increase distribution capabilities across India.\nThe new site is situated in a\nstrategic area\n, close to some of India's technical colleges. This is part of Haleon's wider strategy of unlocking growth and transforming the company's culture through productivity gains – known as the Win as One strategy.\nThrough this new development, Haleon will be strengthening its in-house supply chain capabilities, which will allow it to better react to shifting consumer needs and growing market trends. India's consumer health market is anticipated to reach more than £23bn (US$30.8bn) by 2030, meaning Haleon's investment demonstrates its awareness of consumer demands.\n\"India is a key strategic market for Haleon and an important driver of our long-term growth,\" explains Brian McNamara, CEO of Haleon.\n\"This investment strengthens our local manufacturing footprint and expands our reach in one of the world’s fastest-growing consumer health markets.\"\nThough India is one of Haleon's largest oral health markets, access to dental care remains limited – particularly in rural India, where approximately 65% of the country's population is situated.\nAs a result, many are living with untreated issues. In order to make its products more accessible, Haleon is aiming to roll out access to high-quality, science based oral health products.\nThese will be made with trusted ingredients, but lower-cost and small-format\ntoothpaste packs\n. This will include the 20-rupee Sensodyne pack, which will be rolled out across towns and villages in India.\nFollowing the recruitment of more than 500 people to its sales team in the last 12 months, Haleon is aiming to transform how products can reach consumers.\nPart of this includes the investment in last-mile capabilities, increasing the number of its frontline teams on motorbikes. These drivers are delivering testing kits, samples and diagnostic tools to rural areas, where communities are unable to reach retail and pharmacies.\nAs a result of these kits, people will be able to recognise symptoms and gain access to science-backed treatment. Its mobile oral health literacy vans are in place to engage rural communities and\neducate them on oral health\n. Haleon is aiming to create community hubs for oral health awareness, health checks and immediate access to products.\n\"By increasing access to our trusted brands and building our capabilities on the ground, we are well positioned to capture the significant opportunities ahead,\" Brian adds.\n“We aim to expand access to better everyday health for more than 300 million additional consumers in India. This will be key to achieving our broader ambition to reach one billion more consumers globally by 2030.”\nThe new manufacturing facility will create a wealth of benefits for both India and Haleon. Up to 500 jobs are expected to be created, with local capabilities and long-term economic development supported by the projects. Moreover, it will make oral\nhealthcare more accessible\nto more consumers, with plans to open in early 2028 and supply to commence in 2029.\nChief Executive Officer"},{"t":"原位纳米晶体限制高效蓝色钙钛矿 LED","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10596-3","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Metal halide perovskites have emerged as promising semiconductors for light-emitting diodes (LEDs) owing to their excellent luminescence properties1. However, their performance remains limited, primarily owing to the inherent contradiction between ‘high crystallinity’ and ‘small size’ in the in situ synthesis of perovskite nanocrystals on substrates. Here we report efficient blue perovskite LEDs (PeLEDs) achieved via in situ polymerization-driven nanocrystal confinement to synthesize perovskite films composed of high-quality nanocrystals. The in situ-formed polymer network imposes nanoscale spatial constraints during perovskite nanocrystal growth, enabling nanocrystals with small sizes and a high photoluminescence quantum yield of 83%. Furthermore, polymerizable monomers with sufficient coordination sites allow a prolonged lattice rearrangement of perovskite clusters, promoting the crystallinity of the nanocrystals. The synthesized perovskite nanocrystals are utilized in the fabrication of PeLEDs, resulting in an external quantum efficiency of 21.8% at 491 nm, which is among the highest performances in blue PeLEDs. This work simultaneously controls the thermal dynamics of perovskite crystallization and organic ligand reactions, which helps to advance understanding of the effect of ligand engineering on nanocrystal synthesis, benefiting the development of efficient PeLEDs and other optoelectronic technologies.","tp":"钙钛矿LED","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队通过原位聚合驱动的纳米晶体限制策略，解决了钙钛矿纳米晶体在衬底上原位合成中高结晶度与小尺寸之间的固有矛盾，实现了高效蓝色钙钛矿LED（PeLEDs）。该方法为提升蓝光钙钛矿LED器件性能提供了新途径，推动了金属卤化物钙钛矿在发光二极管领域的应用发展。"},{"t":"原位将污染物转化为催化剂：可持续水处理的相变自催化新范式","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5490783?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自催化水处理","kp":["水处理策略[自催化]: 相变驱动将重金属污染物原位转化为催化剂"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种相变自催化范式，将水中污染物原位转化为催化剂，用于可持续水处理。分散式水处理长期受限于高化学品消耗和催化剂快速失活。新方法利用污染物自身的相变过程生成催化活性物种，实现自驱动的持续降解，大幅减少外部催化剂投加和维护需求，为分布式、低维护水净化系统提供了新思路。","ot":"In Situ Turning Pollutants Into Catalysts: A Phase‐Transition Self‐Catalysis Paradigm for Sustainable Water Treatment","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Decentralized water treatment is constrained by high chemical demand and rapid catalyst deactivation, limiting the low‐carbon remediation of waters containing heavy metals and organic micropollutants. Herein, we report a phase‐transition‐driven self‐catalytic strategy that converts metal pollutants in situ into active catalysts for integrated purification and valorization. In a representative Ni\n                    2+\n                    /phenol system, peroxymonosulfate (PMS) shifts the Ni\n                    2+\n                    ⇌ Ni(OH)\n                    2\n                    equilibrium toward NiOOH nanoparticle formation, which rapidly induces phenol polymerization and co‐precipitation with residual Ni(OH)\n                    2\n                    . Consequently, phenol is completely removed, while Ni\n                    2+\n                    decreases from 28 to 0.08 mg L\n                    −1\n                    with ultralow PMS consumption. Mechanistic studies identify NiOOH as the reactive phase that oxidizes phenol to phenoxy radicals via proton‐coupled electron transfer and proton transfer–electron transfer pathways. This strategy is highly effective for treating industrial phenolic wastewater and offers a modular platform adaptable to various metal ions (e.g., Co\n                    2+\n                    , Cu\n                    2+\n                    ) and oxidants (e.g., NaClO, Peroxydisulfate). Combined with effective products recovery, it offers substantial economic and environmental advantages over existing methods. This work recasts pollutants from treatment targets into treatment agents, offering a fresh, and scalable route to sustainable water remediation."},{"t":"在科学期刊中","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5477?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Highlights from the\n                    Science\n                    family of journals"},{"t":"在其他期刊中","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5478?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Editors’ selections from the current scientific literature"},{"t":"（合格）捍卫研究项目补助金","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej2947?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"In a debate that has been building for years, a growing coalition of reformers has concluded that the research project grant (RPG) approach used by many science funders in the United States and based on competitive, investigator-initiated, and peer-reviewed proposals cannot support transformative science. Crystallizing this debate, the US National Science Foundation (NSF) has just committed $1.5 billion over the next decade to X-Labs, independent and milestone-driven research organizations meant to bypass not only the RPG but also the universities that have long been its principal recipients. Although the reform impulse may warrant sympathy, the X-Labs prescription merits skepticism."},{"t":"通过纠错和检测改善量子处理器逻辑错误率","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10628-y","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子纠错","kp":["[量子平台]: 离子阱QCCD","[纠错效果]: 逻辑错误率显著降低"],"as":"量子计算领域重要进展：研究团队通过改进量子纠错与错误检测方案，显著降低了逻辑量子比特的错误率。量子算法在解决物理和化学核心问题时需要远低于当前硬件水平的错误率，该成果在逻辑比特保真度上迈出关键一步，对实现容错量子计算具有里程碑意义。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Improved quantum processor logical error rates via correction and detection","b":"Performing quantum algorithms for critical problems in physics and chemistry requires substantially lower error rates than the physical error rates of present quantum computers. Achieving such low logical error rates requires quantum error correction1,2 and physical error rates below a critical threshold value3,4,5,6,7,8. We experimentally demonstrate on a trapped-ion quantum charge-coupled device (QCCD)9,10 improvements in logical error rates ranging from 11× to 800× compared with several physical circuit baselines, including quantum computation on multiple qubits. Our results hinge on two quantum error correction code constructions optimized for an ion-trap processor: a 12-qubit code encoding two qubits inspired by Knill11 and a 16-qubit tesseract colour code encoding four qubits12,13. These constructions are combined with a scalable method of error detection and post-selection to achieve reduced logical error rates. Our results show that state-of-the-art quantum devices are already able to make use of fault tolerance and error correction to strongly suppress errors in non-trivial quantum circuit computations.","aip":1},{"t":"IL-4 肽水凝胶将 MSC 异质性重新编程为 CD106+ 群体，以增强肾脏修复","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536368123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Mesenchymal stem cells (MSCs) exhibit significant heterogeneity, which limits their therapeutic efficacy in regenerative medicine. Here, we introduce a self-assembled interleukin-4 (IL-4) peptide hydrogel designed to shift MSC populations toward a homogeneous CD106\n                    +\n                    subset with enhanced regenerative and immunomodulatory capabilities. To evaluate their therapeutic potential, MSCs with the IL-4 hydrogel were administered to a murine model of acute kidney injury (AKI) via renal capsule transplantation. Compared with untreated MSCs, encapsulated MSCs exhibited superior engraftment and survival, leading to significant improvements in renal function, as evidenced by reduced serum creatinine levels, attenuated tubular necrosis, and decreased inflammatory infiltrates. These findings highlight the IL-4 peptide hydrogel as a promising platform for overcoming MSC heterogeneity and manufacturing disease-specific MSCs, offering a scalable strategy for advanced cell therapies in AKI and beyond."},{"t":"混合炼制工艺将植物原料转化为重要工业化学品","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01586-6","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"木质素生物炼制","kp":["[原料]: 木质素","[产物]: 尼龙组分(高收率)","[工艺]: 混合炼厂过程"],"as":"研究人员开发混合精炼工艺，将木质素（植物中储量丰富的复杂芳香聚合物）高收率转化为尼龙关键原料等工业化学品。该策略突破了木质素难降解、难定向转化的瓶颈，将生物质精炼从燃料拓展到高附加值化学品生产，为减少石化依赖、构建绿色化工供应链开辟新路径。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Hybrid refinery process turns plant material into industrially important chemical","b":"An ingredient of nylon has been made in high yields from lignin — revealing a fresh strategy for turning this complex plant biopolymer into industrial chemicals. An ingredient of nylon has been made in high yields from lignin — revealing a fresh strategy for turning this complex plant biopolymer into industrial chemicals."},{"t":"光力学中的混合SU(1,1)干涉测量","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/t9tt-t5x2","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光力学干涉测量","kp":["量子干涉[光力学]: 混合SU(1,1)实现亚散粒噪声传感"],"dp":1,"sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究探讨了光力学系统中的混合SU(1,1)干涉测量方案。在非简并SU(1,1)干涉仪中，传统分束器被四波混频等非线性参量过程替代，可实现超越标准量子极限的相位灵敏度。作者将SU(1,1)干涉测量与光机械系统结合，利用光机械耦合增强量子干涉效应，有望用于精密力传感和宏观量子态操控，对量子计量和基础物理研究有重要意义。","ot":"Hybrid SU(1,1) Interferometry in Optomechanics","b":"Author(s): Chao Meng, Emil Zeuthen, and Polina R. SharapovaIn nondegenerate SU(1,1) interferometers, beam splitters are replaced by two-mode squeezers, enabling sub-shot-noise sensitivity without input squeezing and robustness to detection losses by quantum entanglement. We propose a hybrid implementation in optomechanics where one “arm” is a mechanical mod…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233602] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"人为造成的海平面上升导致 21 世纪全球水位极端","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz3595?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The rate and impacts of sea level rise vary considerably around the world, but the contribution of human-caused climate change to increases in local and regional flood risks has not yet been systematically explored. Because such information is critical to local decision making, legal proceedings, and loss and damage determinations, we quantify human-caused climate change’s contributions to sea level rise at worldwide locations using budget-based and semiempirical model methods. Results show that human-caused sea level rise is quantifiable at 97% of 519 tide gauge sites and is responsible for 58% (44 to 65%) of the observed daily extreme water level exceedances over 2000–2018. On average, human-caused sea level rise has caused a near-tripling in the number of days with attributable exceedances since the 1970s."},{"t":"自 2000 年以来，人类迁徙激增——这些地图揭示了人们的去向","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01796-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Modelling with artificial-intelligence tools has filled gaps in migration data, revealing detailed global population movements from 1990 to 2023. Modelling with artificial-intelligence tools has filled gaps in migration data, revealing detailed global population movements from 1990 to 2023."},{"t":"Hp1bp3 丢失将染色质重组与神经胶质瘤的代谢脆弱性联系起来","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2601061123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"High-grade gliomas (HGGs) are aggressive brain tumors with poor prognosis, driven in part by metabolic and epigenetic adaptations. Methionine metabolism supports HGG growth by supplying S-adenosylmethionine for methylation reactions, yet how nutrient availability influences chromatin organization in HGG remains incompletely understood. Using an immunocompetent mouse model of HGG, we found that dietary methionine restriction reduced tumor proliferation, extended survival, and induced partial nuclear inversion. We identified Hp1bp3 as a key regulator of tumor growth that functions by interacting with nuclear tethering proteins to mediate chromatin reorganization. Loss of Hp1bp3 results in the upregulation of histone demethylases leading to selective depletion of H3K9me3-marked heterochromatin and accelerated glioma growth. Combining methionine restriction with Hp1bp3 loss increased the frequency of partial nuclear inversion and further suppressed tumor progression. These findings identify Hp1bp3 as a chromatin regulator linking methionine metabolism to heterochromatin stability and suggest that dietary methionine modulation can influence the structural organization of chromatin to slow tumor growth in HGG."},{"t":"我如何利用人工智能将失败的药物变成新药","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01626-1","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"By combining chemistry and biology with AI modelling, Layla Hosseini-Gerami is finding and reviving therapeutics with ‘huge potential’. By combining chemistry and biology with AI modelling, Layla Hosseini-Gerami is finding and reviving therapeutics with ‘huge potential’.","tp":"AI药物再利用","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":"Layla Hosseini-Gerami致力于将化学、生物学与人工智能（AI）建模技术深度融合，以挖掘和复兴具有“巨大潜力”的治疗药物。通过先进的AI算法，她能够重新评估并发现那些曾经研发失败或被搁置的药物的全新治疗价值，将其成功转化为有效的新药。这种数据驱动的方法不仅显著提高了药物重定位的成功率，缩短了研发周期，也为制药行业最大化利用现有分子资源、攻克复杂疾病提供了创新范式。"},{"t":"欧洲如何引领固态电池竞赛","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.batterytechonline.com/lithium-ion-batteries/how-europe-can-lead-the-solid-state-battery-race","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Battery Tech Online","tg":"行业观察","tp":"固态电池产业","as":"固态电池以固体电解质替代传统锂离子电池的液态电解液,可大幅提升能量密度与安全性,被视为下一代电池的核心方向。Factorial Energy凭借其FEST(Factorial Electrolyte System Technology)半固态电解质技术获得梅赛德斯-奔驰、Stellantis、现代等车企投资,并在客户独立测试中验证了性能。文章探讨欧洲如何借助产业链协同、政策扶持与人才储备,在固态电池这一关键赛道上超越亚洲竞争对手,重塑电池制造格局。","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.5},"kp":["[固态电池]:欧洲聚焦供应链关键环节实现规模化"],"ot":"How Europe Can Lead the Solid-State Battery Race","b":"Explore Factorial's insights on solid-state batteries, emphasizing Europe's leadership potential, independent testing, and smarter manufacturing processes.\nJune 10, 2026\nEurope can lead if it focuses on the parts of the supply chain that actually determine scalability.\nAI illustration generated for Battery Technology.\nThe transition of\nsolid-state batteries\nWhat advancements in manufacturing infrastructure are necessary to transition solid-state batteries from pilot-scale production to mass-market deployment, and how can Europe position itself as a leader in this area?\nProLogium CEO Shares Insights on Solid-State Battery Leadership\nDr. Alex Yu, Chief Technology Officer at Factorial:\nWhen we talk about moving solid‑state from pilot lines to true mass production, the real challenge isn’t the chemistry anymore — it’s industrialization. You have to build these cells at scale, with consistency, and without forcing the industry to reinvent its entire manufacturing base.\nFor us, that starts with compatibility with existing lithium‑ion lines. Factorial Electrolyte System Technology (FEST) was designed to utilize up to 80% of the same equipment as a conventional lithium-ion battery assembly line. We’ve proven that at automotive scale, including in solid‑state cells qualified with Stellantis. On the Solstice side, our dry cathode coating eliminates solvents and massive drying ovens — two of the most energy‑intensive steps in a battery factory — exactly the kind of process simplification that makes retrofits viable.\nWe also need process‑intelligent factories. Solid‑state requires much tighter tolerances than conventional li‑ion, so inline metrology, data‑rich quality control, and AI‑driven optimization become essential. Our Gammatron platform cuts validation timelines by up to 80%, which is exactly the type of industrial intelligence needed for gigafactory‑scale production.\nAnd third, we need modular, repeatable production units. Instead of building a bespoke ‘first‑of‑a‑kind’ plant every time, we should be cloning standardized manufacturing modules across sites. Europe is well-positioned here. It already has a world‑class automotive ecosystem, and if that’s paired with targeted industrial policy — retrofitting existing gigafactories, investing in dry‑coating and solid‑state‑specific equipment, and supporting pilot‑to‑giga bridging facilities — Europe can become the place where manufacturable solid‑state designs are proven, not just invented.\nToshiba’s SCiB Battery Comparison with Conventional Li-ion Batteries\nFactorial’s Solstice is an all-solid-state battery. Courtesy of Factorial Energy.\nHow can Europe address supply chain and scalability challenges to establish itself as a global leader in solid-state battery technology?\nSupply‑chain risk in solid‑state isn’t just about raw materials. It’s about who controls the process know‑how, the equipment ecosystem, and the qualified suppliers that make high‑precision manufacturing possible. Europe can lead if it focuses on the parts of the supply chain that actually determine scalability, and we see a pathway forward.\nCritically, Europe needs to secure upstream and midstream capacity — lithium metal, solid electrolytes, and other key inputs — through long‑term partnerships and selective onshoring. One advantage of Factorial’s architecture is that we don’t use graphite, which removes one of the most politically sensitive bottlenecks in today’s supply chain.\nEurope also has an opportunity to build a homegrown equipment and process ecosystem. Coating, stacking, formation alternatives, recycling — these are the capabilities that determine whether a technology can move from a pilot line to a gigafactory. And Europe should leverage trusted alliances with the U.S. and key Asian partners to create a supply chain that is clearly differentiated from China‑centric networks.\nLatest LFP Battery Projects Driving Safety, Sustainability, and Savings\nIf Europe aligns industrial policy with cross‑border coordination and strong OEM demand signals, it can become the region where solid‑state supply chains are not only diversified, but actually proven and de‑risked at scale.\nHow does the current competitive landscape influence the development of solid-state batteries, particularly with companies claiming significant breakthroughs in energy density and charging speed?\nThe competitive landscape in solid‑state is incredibly active right now. You have established cell makers, startups, and OEMs all announcing breakthroughs in energy density or fast charging. That level of activity is healthy, but it raises a real question: can you industrialize it, or is it just a single data point?\nWe see a big difference between a claim and a platform. We’ve demonstrated our technology in real vehicles — Mercedes‑Benz drove 1,200 km on a single charge on our cells in a lightly modified EQS test vehicle — and Stellantis has qualified our automotive‑size solid‑state cells.\nWe also don’t achieve these milestones alone, and our deep partnerships act as a filter. OEMs, defense, and aerospace partners test aggressively across temperature, duty cycles, safety, and durability. FEST has gone through extensive internal validation, third‑party testing, and OEM‑level evaluations. If your technology isn’t real, it doesn’t survive that process.\nAnd we also know that execution speed only matters if it’s paired with discipline. You can’t skip durability testing, safety validation, or manufacturability gates. Our Gammatron platform helps accelerate that work by predicting long‑term performance in two weeks instead of the typical three to six months — but we still validate everything in hardware. In this environment, the advantage goes to teams focused on credible, execution‑driven innovation — not the ones chasing the most attention‑grabbing spec sheet.\nKarma Automotive and Factorial announce first solid-state battery production program in the US. Courtesy of Factorial Energy.\nHow important is independent testing in verifying bold claims in terms of energy density and charging time, such as the one we\nat CES 2026?\nIndependent testing is absolutely essential in this industry — especially when people start talking about step‑changes in energy density or ‘minutes‑to‑full’ charging. Those claims only matter if they hold up under real scrutiny.\nInvestors and policymakers are making billion‑dollar decisions. They need verification, not marketing slides. OEMs and regulators need third‑party data on safety, cycle life, and abuse testing — not a single internal chart showing the best‑case scenario.\nAnd frankly, the reputation of the entire solid‑state sector is at stake. A few exaggerated or unverified claims can set the whole industry back.\nThat’s why FEST has gone through extensive internal validation, third‑party testing, and OEM‑level evaluations, and why we insist on real‑world demonstrations like the\nMercedes EQS  Karma\nprograms. The bar we should all be aiming for is multi‑layer validation: internal data, independent lab testing, and real‑world system‑level proof.\nA bold claim on a trade‑show stage is just a headline. It only becomes meaningful once it survives that full validation gauntlet.\nWhat role does standardization play in fostering trust, enabling interoperability, and accelerating the adoption of solid-state batteries across the industry?\nStandardization is one of the quiet but essential enablers of scale. In solid‑state, it’s not a paperwork exercise — it’s how you create a level playing field where real performance can be compared and trusted.\nWe need common test protocols for energy density, cycle life, safety, and fast charging. FEST is engineered in automotive‑scale formats and designed to run on existing manufacturing lines, which makes it easier to build standards around real, manufacturable processes rather than lab‑only concepts.\nIf formats, interfaces, and safety requirements are aligned, OEMs can qualify multiple suppliers without redesigning entire platforms. These shared standards can also speed up adoption. Regulators, insurers, and grid operators move faster when they can rely on consistent frameworks for certification and permitting.\nEurope has a real opportunity here. If Europe takes an active role in global standards bodies — defining test methods, safety norms, and data‑reporting frameworks for solid‑state — it doesn’t just de‑risk adoption. It ensures that European technical assumptions shape the global rulebook.\nMaria Guerra\nSenior Editor-Battery Technology, Informa Markets\nMaria L. Guerra is a Senior Editor at\nBattery Technology\n, blending her engineering background with a passion for technology journalism. She holds a Bachelor of Science in Electrical Engineering from Universidad Metropolitana in Caracas, Venezuela, and a Master of Science in Electrical Engineering from NYU Tandon School of Engineering.\nGuerra's career spans power systems engineering, oil & gas consulting, and technical writing and editing. She worked for several years at Kellogg, Brown & Root Ltd. (KBR) in the UK, conducting power system studies and providing technical support for offshore and onshore projects. During her internship at Pequiven S.A. in Venezuela, she trained neural networks using MATLAB (Kohonen Map) to estimate electrical circuit variables for oil wells (e.g., voltage, current, and power).\nIn addition to her engineering roles, Guerra worked as a freelance technical editor, refining complex technical content for clarity and accuracy. She later became a Power/Analog Editor at\nElectronic Design\n, covering advancements in the semiconductor market, focusing on power/analog electronics systems.\nBattery Technology\n, Guerra now delivers in-depth coverage of battery manufacturing, EV advancements, energy storage systems, and the evolving landscape of critical minerals and second-life batteries. She is passionate about uncovering the stories that shape the future of electrification, from cutting-edge battery innovations to policy shifts driving sustainable energy.\nGuerra is also a member of\nThe Battery Show North America Advisory Board\n, where she contributes her expertise to advising on industry trends and speaker selection for The Battery Show North America, while helping to shape discussions on battery technology and electrification. She was part of the award-winning Battery Technology team recognized with a\nNeal Award for Best Coverage of the 2024 Election\nNeal Award for Best Explanatory Content\nin 2026 for her coverage of battery breakthroughs.\nMaria Guerra is based in Brooklyn, NY, and can be reached at\n[email protected]\nSee more from\nMaria Guerra"},{"t":"香港将建设首个大规模电动汽车电池回收工厂","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/hong-kong-to-launch-first-large-scale-ev-battery-recycling-plant/","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Batteries International","tg":"产业进展","tp":"动力电池回收","as":"香港宣布启动首个大规模电动汽车电池回收工厂,由EVCST等企业运营。随着电动车保有量激增,退役动力电池数量急剧攀升,其处理涉及锂、钴、镍等高价值金属的提取与再生利用,同时需规避电解液泄漏、热失控等环境风险。该工厂的落地标志着香港正式切入电池循环经济产业链,有助于降低对原生矿产的依赖,推动本地绿色制造与碳中和目标。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":9.5},"ot":"Hong Kong to launch first ‘large-scale’ EV battery recycling plant – Batteries International","b":"News, Recycling\nHong Kong to launch first ‘large-scale’ EV battery recycling plant\n–  June 11, 2026 11:05 am BST\nAn EVCSTAR charging site in Hong Kong\nHong Kong’s first large-scale recycling facility for decommissioned EV batteries is set to formally start production this month.\nThe government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region said on June 3 the new facility is expected to help generate an annual economic added value for the territory of around HK$66 million ($8.5 million).\nActing environment and ecology secretary, Diane Wong, said the Tuen Mun EcoPark facility will process waste power batteries into black mass for onward shipment to the Chinese mainland and neighbouring region.\nRetired EV batteries that still have a high reusable value will be repurposed into second-life products such as stationary energy storage systems.\nThere are currently five licensed chemical waste disposal facilities across the territory that capable of handling retired EV batteries, Wong said.\nBetween 2023 and 2025, about 130 tonnes of retired lithium EV batteries were preliminarily treated across the five facilities for transport overseas to authorised treatment facilities for recycling.\nAn updated EV policy roadmap issued by the territory’s government last February showed EVs in Hong Kong had increased more than fourfold from around 28,000 in 2021 to around 149,000 by the end of 2025. It is estimated that the number of electric private cars could surpass 290,000 by 2030 and approach nearly 500,000 by 2035.\nAccording to Wong, the lifespan of EV batteries is generally five to 10 years. She said a rough estimate by the Environmental Protection Department (EPD) indicated the volume of retired EV batteries over the next five years is projected to increase gradually from around 1,300 tonnes in 2026 to nearly 7,000 tonnes in 2030.\nHowever, Wong said the actual lifespan of each EV battery was affected by various factors, including whether the battery had been repaired, the owner’s charging habits and the battery’s chemical composition. In addition, as some batteries may be replaced or recycled before reaching their service life, the actual quantity of retired EV batteries may differ from the estimate.\nIn a related move, Wong said the EPD plans to require suppliers who distribute EV batteries in Hong Kong to register with the department before distribution, and to submit information regarding the batteries, such as battery identification numbers, weight and quantities distributed, on a regular basis.\nThe EPD is also consulting the sector on a producer responsibility scheme for EV batteries, including how to improve the traceability mechanism for EV batteries to enhance the effectiveness of battery lifecycle management.\nAccording to a study released by European clean transport campaign group Transport & Environment (T&E) in December 2024, the estimated recovery of 105,000 tonnes of lithium carbonate equivalent, nickel, cobalt and manganese from recycling in Europe by 2030 could enable the production of 1.3 to 2.4 million battery electric cars (or 14% to 25% of the projected battery electric cars sales) ― assuming a medium sized electric car with a battery capacity of 74kWh and the average car chemistry mix in that year."},{"t":"通过相分离设计锂硫电池的均相/多相催化剂","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1750429?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[锂硫电池]:金属基有机分子均相异相设计","[相分离]:双调控硫氧化还原与锂沉积"],"dp":1,"as":"锂硫电池理论能量密度高达约2600 Wh/kg,是传统锂离子电池的数倍,但面临多硫化物穿梭效应、硫的绝缘性及锂枝晶生长等核心瓶颈。本研究提出通过均相与异相催化剂的双相设计,同步调控硫的氧化还原动力学与锂沉积行为,加速多硫化物的转化并抑制穿梭,从而提升库伦效率与循环寿命。这一催化策略为锂硫电池走向实用化提供了新思路,对高能量密度储能系统意义重大。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Homogeneous/Heterogeneous Catalyst Design for Lithium–Sulfur Batteries via Phase Separation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The dual regulation of sulfur redox kinetics and lithium deposition behavior represents a pivotal breakthrough toward overcoming the performance limitations of lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries. Metal‐based organic molecules provide an ideal solution for rationalizing the electrolyte electrochemistry in Li–S system, featuring both nitrogen‐rich properties and active metal centers. Herein, we leverage the solubility of iron phthalocyanine chloride (FePcCl) in the electrolyte to induce phase separation. The dissolved portion (FePcCl solute) functions as a homogeneous catalyst (Fe‐Hom), whilst the insoluble fraction is uniformly loaded onto carbon spheres to act as a heterogeneous catalyst (Fe‐Het). The homogeneous/heterogeneous synergistic catalyst system (Fe‐Syg), developed through precise phase‐separation engineering, enables the coexistence of mobile and immobilized active sites. This synergy maximizes the working activity of Fe‐Syg beyond the limitations of single‐phase catalysts, simultaneously regulating sulfur conversion kinetics and lithium plating/stripping behavior toward high‐efficiency and robust electrodes. As a result, the Li–S batteries incorporating Fe‐Syg demonstrate favorable rate capability and operational lifespan under various conditions. Remarkably, a pouch cell assembled with a lean electrolyte dosage of 3.5 µL mg\n                    −1\n                    achieves a favorable energy density of 364.8 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    and maintains stable cycling for 40 cycles.","aip":1},{"t":"卤化物钙钛矿组成依赖性热稳定性的高精度机器学习预测","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73636?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿热稳定性","kp":["[高通量+机器学习]:预测钙钛矿组分依赖热稳定性"],"dp":1,"as":"卤化物钙钛矿因其优异的光电性能(高吸收系数、长载流子扩散长度、可调带隙)在太阳能电池、LED等领域前景广阔,但对温度、湿度、光照等环境应力高度敏感,导致相变与性能退化,阻碍其商业化。本研究利用高精度机器学习模型,建立组成成分与热稳定性之间的映射关系,实现对不同组分钙钛矿热稳定性的快速预测。该数据驱动方法可显著加速稳定钙钛矿配方的发现,降低实验试错成本。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High‐Accuracy Machine Learning Projections of Composition‐Dependent Thermal Stability in Halide Perovskites","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Halide perovskites exhibit unpredictable properties in response to environmental stressors due to several composition‐dependent degradation mechanisms. In this work, we combine high‐throughput experiments, data visualization, and machine learning (ML) techniques to quantify correlations between composition, temperature, and material properties by analyzing high‐throughput, in situ environmental photoluminescence (PL) experiments. Correlation heatmaps show the influence of Cs content on film degradation, and dimensionality reduction visualization methods uncover clear composition‐based clusters despite overlapping datasets. A robust screening of 10 ML algorithms effectively forecasts PL features with single‐composition, composition‐generalized, and composition‐generalized stacking approaches, with the highest‐performing models achieving root mean squared errors of 1.84, 10.69, and 10.28, respectively. Using a multi‐output composition‐generalized Extra‐Trees and Ridge Regression stacked model, a full PL spectrum can be predicted for any time, temperature, and composition input. Our ML‐based framework could be expanded to other perovskite families, significantly reducing the analysis time to identify stable options for photovoltaics."},{"t":"高通量筛选确定了 SPOP-PABPC1 轴在肺腺癌进展中的关键作用","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602470123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Lung adenocarcinoma (LUAD) is the most common and deadly subtype of lung cancer, with limited therapeutic options and poor prognosis. Ubiquitination is an important posttranslational modification (PTM) that controls protein turnover, localization and interaction. The dysregulated ubiquitination machinery is a hallmark of cancer, contributing to tumor development. Identifying key E3 ubiquitin ligases and deubiquitinases in LUAD could lead to new biomarkers and treatments. Through RNA sequencing, bioinformatics, and clinical studies, SPOP has been identified as a promising E3 ligase target in LUAD. SPOP is downregulated in LUAD samples and associated with poorer patient outcomes. Functional analyses demonstrate that SPOP suppresses LUAD cell migration, proliferation, and in vivo tumor growth. Mechanistically, SPOP targets poly(A)-binding protein cytoplasmic 1 (PABPC1) for nonproteolytic ubiquitination, leading to its nuclear retention and inhibition of global protein synthesis, thereby suppressing the oncogenic effects of PABPC1. Furthermore, the deubiquitinase HAUSP is able to counteract SPOP-mediated ubiquitination of PABPC1, enhancing its oncogenic role in LUAD cells. Collectively, our findings reveal a SPOP/HAUSP-PABPC1 regulatory axis in LUAD, where SPOP and HAUSP oppositely modulate PABPC1 ubiquitination to control LUAD cell proliferation and migration. This axis represents a promising therapeutic target in LUAD."},{"t":"高能量密度水系镁金属电池织物实现-40°C至100°C超灵敏压力传感","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8124?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系镁金属电池","kp":["工作温度[水系镁电池织物]: -40°C至100°C","电解质[水系镁电池]: 准固态PEO基","[器件形态]: 柔性储能织物"],"as":"研究团队开发了一种高能量密度水系镁金属电池织物，用于驱动超灵敏自供电可穿戴压力传感系统。该柔性电池织物可直接集成到智能纺织品中，为柔性压力传感器提供持续稳定的供电，解决了传统可穿戴传感器依赖外部电源的瓶颈。该技术结合了镁金属电池的高能量密度与织物结构的柔性可穿戴特性，在智能健康监测、人机交互等领域具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"High-energy-density aqueous magnesium metal battery textiles enable ultrasensitive pressure sensing across −40° to 100°C","b":"Smart wearable sensing systems necessitate self-powered, high-sensitivity pressure sensors that can operate efficiently across a wide temperature range. Here, we present a high-energy-density aqueous magnesium metal battery (AMMB) textile for ultrasensitive pressure sensing from −40° to 100°C. The AMMB-type pressure (AMMB-P) sensing textile features a porous quasi-solid-state polyethylene oxide–magnesium chloride electrolyte that inhibits magnesium corrosion via hydrogen-bond anchoring, paired with a breathable carbon cloth cathode and woven magnesium anode. The innovative design achieves an ultrahigh sensitivity of 687.32 millivolts per kilopascal, a low detection limit (0.96 pascals), long-term durability (200,000 cycles), and exceptional breathability (water vapor permeability, 2281.4 ± 249.8 grams per square meter per day; air permeability, 628.0 ± 9.1 millimeters per second). The unique anticrystallization properties of electrolyte ensure a stable operation of the AMMB-P sensing textile in extreme temperatures ranging from −40° to 100°C. Under high-pressure condition, our AMMB-P sensing textile can be converted into a reliable power source with high energy density of 287.92 watt-hours per kilogram, ensuring stable self-powered operation. Coupled with machine learning, the AMMB-P sensing array enables intelligent object recognition and autonomous robotic control even under harsh conditions. Our work advances self-powered pressure-sensing textiles tailored for extreme-environment exploration, enabling interactive perception in humanoid robots and individual health management under harsh service conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"宽禁带半导体缺陷的高通量X射线表征","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73678?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"宽禁带半导体缺陷","kp":["缺陷表征[宽禁带半导体]: 高通量X射线量化金刚石位错密度"],"dp":1,"as":"宽禁带半导体材料是新一代高功率、射频及量子技术的核心，但其缺陷表征长期面临挑战。该研究提出了一种高通量X射线缺陷表征方法，能够高效、系统地分析碳化硅、氮化镓等宽禁带半导体中的位错、空位等晶体缺陷。该方法大幅提升了缺陷检测的通量与精度，为优化宽禁带半导体材料质量、提升功率电子器件性能与良率提供了关键表征手段。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High Throughput X‐Ray Characterization of Defects in Wide‐Bandgap Semiconductors","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Wide‐bandgap materials are central to next‐generation high‐power, radio‐frequency, and quantum technologies, yet their performance is often limited by crystalline defects such as dislocations. Single‐crystal diamond in particular exhibits exceptional electronic and thermal properties, however, accurately and scalably quantifying defect density remains challenging. Here, we present an integrated methodology for characterizing dislocation densities in diamond using high‐resolution X‐ray diffraction and validate it using complementary Raman spectroscopy, hydrogen etch‐pit analysis, and Hall effect measurements. Central to this approach is a custom Python‐based tool that processes X‐ray rocking curves and reciprocal space maps. The framework is applied to four commercially available grades of diamond substrates, spanning a wide defect density range (∼10\n                    5\n                    to 10\n                    8\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    ). Consistent trends are observed across all characterization techniques, with electronic‐grade diamond exhibiting the highest crystalline quality and lowest defect density. Application of the analysis tool to GaN samples further demonstrates its adaptability to other wide‐bandgap material systems. Overall, this work establishes a robust, scalable, and versatile platform for high‐throughput defect analysis in diamond and related wide‐bandgap semiconductors."},{"t":"用于设计自由形变仿生机器人的分层激光编程软致动器","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb1989?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"激光编程软驱动器","kp":["[驱动策略]: 空间差异化激光编程","[应用]: 仿生软体机器人自由形变"],"as":"受生物启发的形状变形结构是下一代具有卓越适应性的软体机器人的关键，该研究提出了一种分层激光编程的软体致动器设计策略，用于构建具备多种自由度变形能力的仿生机器人。通过激光对柔性材料进行分层图案化编程，可实现可控的弯曲、扭转等复杂三维形变，赋予软体机器人更强的环境适应性与运动能力。该技术在仿生机器人、可穿戴设备等领域具有应用潜力。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hierarchical laser-programmed soft actuators for designing bionic robots with freeform morphing shapes","b":"Bio-inspired shape-morphing structures, essential for next-generation soft robotics with unprecedented adaptability, demand actuators capable of complex and configurable three-dimensional motions. By overcoming traditional stimulus-responsive strategies facing the trade-off between manufacturing simplicity and kinematic sophistication, here, we introduce a spatially differentiated laser-programming technology for digital manufacturing laser-induced graphene-based soft actuators (LIG-SAs) with freeform morphing capabilities. Via cross-scale control of lasing energy and scribing direction, material heterogeneity and structural hierarchy can be tuned simultaneously for introducing decoupled electrothermal distribution and stiffness anisotropy, thus encoding LIG-SAs with four typical motion units: straight bending, directional curling, rigid supporting, and soft connecting. By arbitrarily grouping multimodal morphing units into concretized devices, this approach further empowers freeform design of bionic robots including octopus-like tentacles and inchworm/seal–like crawlers toward multitask locomotion of conformal grasping, path navigation, and obstacle avoidance. This framework bridges digital design with physical intelligence, unlocking previously unidentified avenues of soft robots for creating sophisticated and programmable morphologies."},{"t":"硬路易斯碱驱动的结晶控制用于高效全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73682?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["结晶调控[全钙钛矿叠层]: 硬路易斯碱驱动Sn-Pb低缺陷密度结晶"],"dp":1,"as":"全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池因高光电转换效率潜力备受关注，但窄带隙钙钛矿薄膜的结晶质量控制是制约其性能的关键难题。该研究引入硬路易斯碱驱动结晶调控策略，有效改善窄带隙钙钛矿吸光层的薄膜形貌与结晶质量，减少缺陷态密度，从而显著提升全钙钛矿叠层电池的光电转换效率与运行稳定性。该方法为高效钙钛矿叠层光伏的工业化制备提供了新思路。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hard Lewis Base‐Driven Crystallization Control for Efficient All‐Perovskite Tandem Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    All‐perovskite tandem solar cells (APTSCs) have attracted considerable research interest in recent years due to their higher theoretical efficiencies and broader spectral coverage. Nonetheless, as the bottom narrow‐bandgap cell in APTSCs, tin‐lead (Sn‐Pb) hybrid perovskite solar cells (PSCs) still face challenges of high defect density and poor crystallization morphology, which hinder the further improvement of device performance and long‐term stability. This work proposes a Lewis hard‐basicity amplification strategy that provides additional potential hard‐acid binding sites and promotes coordination with Sn\n                    2+\n                    , thereby enabling defect passivation and regulating crystallization. Ultimately, we achieved a champion power conversion efficiency (PCE) of 23.71% for single‐junction Sn‐Pb PSCs. By integrating 1.77 eV wide‐bandgap perovskites with Sn‐Pb hybrid perovskites, we further fabricated APTSCs with a champion PCE of 29.44%. Both devices retain approximately 80% of their initial efficiency after 1080 h of continuous operation under one‐sun illumination.","aip":1},{"t":"H2S供体预处理的血管内皮细胞来源的细胞外囊泡用于多途径血管修复","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00231-6?rss=yes","c":"未分类","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","b":"We report a translatable EVs nanoplatform for coordinated vascular repair by simply stimulating vascular endothelial cells with a hydrogen sulfide (H2S) donor in vitro. These EVs target injured arteries, reduce local inflammation, inhibit neointimal hyperplasia, and promote endothelial regeneration, while avoiding toxicity risks of systemic H2S delivery. In a rat carotid artery injury model, these EVs achieve effective vascular repair and good biosafety, offering a promising strategy for treating vascular diseases.","tp":"囊泡血管修复","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员开发了一种具有临床转化潜力的细胞外囊泡（EVs）纳米平台，用于多途径协同修复受损血管。该技术通过在体外使用硫化氢（H2S）供体刺激血管内皮细胞获取EVs。这种预处理后的囊泡能够精准靶向受损动脉，有效减轻局部炎症、抑制内膜增生并促进内皮再生，同时避免了全身系统性递送H2S的毒性风险。在大鼠颈动脉损伤模型中，该纳米平台展现出优异的血管修复效果和良好的生物安全性，为血管损伤治疗提供了新策略。"},{"t":"GreenGo获意大利南部12兆瓦风电项目批准","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/greengo-wins-approval-for-12-mw-wind-project-in-southern-italy-1296311/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"Renewables Now","as":"意大利可再生能源公司GreenGo获批在意大利南部建设一座12兆瓦(MW)的陆上风电项目。该项目标志着公司在地中海地区风电扩张的又一进展，将并入南部电网，为当地清洁能源供应做出贡献。具体选址、风机型号与投运时间表等细节尚未披露。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"风电项目开发","kp":["装机容量[陆上风电]:12MW"],"sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":3.0,"r":2.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"GreenGo wins approval for 12-MW wind project in southern Italy","b":"GreenGo wins approval for 12-MW wind project in southern Italy | Onshore Wind News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nabout 14 hours ago\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nGreenGo wins approval for 12-MW wind project in southern Italy\nJun 11, 2026, 6:31:58 PM\nSladjana Djunisic\nOnshore Wind\nRegion/Country:\nLatest top stories\nUS solar installations fall to 7.8 GW in Q1\nabout 14 hours ago\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nLatest in Onshore wind\nChile's Colbun to supply 100% renewable power to telco Gtd\nJun 11, 2026\nRepsol sells stake in 705 MW of Spanish renewables to Masdar\nJun 11, 2026\nEskom launches dedicated renewables unit Eskom Green\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Capacity\nElevate powers up 150-MW/600-MWh BESS in Virginia\nJun 11, 2026\nRWE starts erecting Vestas turbines at Nordseecluster A off Germany\nJun 11, 2026\nIberdrola works on 10 solar communities in Portugal\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in EUROPE\nEnray Power obtains GBP 43m for solar project in North Yorkshire\nJun 11, 2026\nLichtBlick breaks ground on solar park in Germany\nJun 11, 2026\nOver 700 projects in Britain get connection offers under reform\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Italy\nEU geothermal action plan due pre-summer, sector urges targets, faster permits\nJun 11, 2026\nClearvise starts building 4.1-MWp solar park in Italy\nJun 11, 2026\nZenith nears 200-MWp Italian goal with new solar project buy\nLatest in Onshore wind\nChile's Colbun to supply 100% renewable power to telco Gtd\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Capacity\nElevate powers up 150-MW/600-MWh BESS in Virginia\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in EUROPE\nEnray Power obtains GBP 43m for solar project in North Yorkshire\nJun 11, 2026\nLatest in Italy\nEU geothermal action plan due pre-summer, sector urges targets, faster permits\nJun 11, 2026\nMost read stories\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"产能趋紧，谷歌转向三星寻求未来AI芯片","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/google-turns-samsung-future-ai-chip-capacity-tightens","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"the information","tg":"产业进展","tp":"AI芯片代工","as":"由于产能日趋紧张，谷歌开始转向三星寻求合作，以供应其未来的AI芯片需求。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.5,"d":1.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Google Turns to Samsung for Future AI Chip as Capacity Tightens","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"谷歌DeepMind担忧数百万智能体开始交互后的后果","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/11/1138794/google-deepmind-is-worried-about-what-happens-when-millions-of-agents-start-to-interact/","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","tp":"多智能体安全","as":"Google DeepMind正在资助研究，探讨数百万AI智能体(agent)大规模交互可能带来的潜在风险。研究聚焦于多智能体系统涌现出的集体行为不可预测性、级联失效、协调失控等问题。DeepMind担忧，随着智能体数量与自主性增长，现有安全框架可能无法覆盖多智能体协同失败、目标对齐冲突及社会层面影响等新型威胁。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Google DeepMind is worried about what happens when millions of agents start to interact","b":"EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\nGoogle DeepMind is\nfunding research\ninto the potential dangers of situations where millions of different\ninteract with each other online.\nAccording to Rohin Shah, who directs the company’s AGI safety and alignment research, the mass-market arrival of agents that can carry out tasks without human oversight and follow instructions given to them by other agents creates a\nwhole new class of risk\nIn an effort to address this, Google DeepMind—which made agent-based tools a\ncenterpiece of Google I/O last month\n—has teamed up with several other organizations to announce a $10 million funding pot for researchers to study the behavior of multi-agent systems and come up with ways to prevent unsafe scenarios. Joining Google DeepMind are Schmidt Sciences, a philanthropic foundation set up by Eric and Wendy Schmidt; ARIA, the\nUK government’s moonshot agency\n; the Cooperative AI foundation, a UK-based nonprofit research outfit; and Google’s charitable arm, Google.org.\nI asked Shah and James Fox, who leads the Science of Trustworthy AI program at Schmidt Sciences, what they hope to achieve with that $10 million. It’s no small sum, but it’s dwarfed by the budgets commanded by Google DeepMind’s own research teams.\nThe aim is to kick-start research outside tech companies, says Shah: “The strength of academia is that it can look really quite far into the future and do the kind of work that isn’t top of mind at industry labs.”\n“The main issue is that there just isn’t really a field of research for multi-agent safety yet,” he adds. “And we would like there to be.”\nThe concern is that as more and more AI agents get deployed and begin working together, we could hit a tipping point where imagined scenarios become real. “We see this with humanity, too,” says Shah. “Our institutions can accomplish things that no individual human can.”\nShah thinks we have a few more months to go before agents are deployed throughout the economy in numbers that make potential risks a real concern. He wants to get ahead of that moment.\nWhat risks are we talking about, exactly? The possibilities that Shah and Fox have in mind mostly boil down to supercharged versions of bad things that happen on the internet already: scams, prompt injections (where an AI agent is fed malicious instructions, turning it into a self-guiding piece of malware), other forms of cyberattack. We look at what humans do now and ask what the agent version of that would be, says Shah.\n“We’ve got this digital commons that is integral to how society works, and you really want to ensure that this doesn’t descend into just absolute anarchy,” says Fox.\n(I asked Shah if they were considering any worst-case scenarios more on the doomer end of the spectrum, such as widespread economic collapse. “Certainly not if we’re talking by the end of the year,” he said. That’s only six months away! He laughed. “Okay, a while after that.”)\nShah and Fox both think that the only way to understand what might happen when large numbers of multi-agent systems interact with each other is to run realistic simulations. They want researchers to drop AI agents into sandboxes and study what they do.\nYou can’t predict what’s going to happen by studying single agents, or even small groups of agents, in isolation. You can’t assume that AI agents underpinned by LLMs will always act rationally, says Fox. And the complexity comes from having huge numbers of interactions at once.\nSome researchers, including a\nteam at Google DeepMind\n, have argued that\nartificial general intelligence\nif possible at all\n) could come not from a single super-smart model but from a kind of agent hive mind, where the capabilities of the whole add up to more than the sum of its parts.\nGoogle DeepMind is not the only top AI firm warning about the risks of the technology it is building. A couple of weeks ago, Anthropic published\nguidelines for deploying AI agents\nbased on an approach to cybersecurity known as zero trust, which starts with the assumption that a computer system is vulnerable, an agent is an attacker, and a breach will happen.\nRefael Angel, cofounder and CTO of Akeyless, a cybersecurity firm based in Tel Aviv, agrees that understanding the new risks introduced by agent-based systems is crucial.\nEvery approach to security in the past has assumed that the machine in question was software written by a human, doing fixed things on fixed paths, says Angel: “An agent breaks all of those assumptions. It reasons, it improvises, and it can be hijacked by a single sentence buried in a document it was asked to read.”\nAngel welcomes this new funding. “No single lab should author the safety standards everyone else has to trust,” he says. But he cautions that safety researchers can overlook boring problems that are already here in favor of more exotic hypothetical ones.\nAnd yet, Fox notes, risks that were hypothetical a few years ago are now very real: “The future’s come more quickly than perhaps expected.”\nAccording to Stanford’s 2026 AI Index, AI is sprinting, and we’re struggling to keep up.\nMIT Technology Review's authoritative overview of the 10 technologies, emerging trends, bold ideas, and powerful movements in AI in 2026.\nLaunching next week on T-Mobile's network, the cell plan takes a nuclear approach to online safety.\nMusk kept his cool, and OpenAI’s lawyer bulldozed him with piercing questions about his motivations for suing the company.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more."},{"t":"固德威推出光伏驱动住宅空气源热泵","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/goodwe-launches-pv-driven-residential-air-to-water-heat-pumps/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏驱动热泵","kp":["功率范围[光伏热泵]: 6-34.15 kW","COP[光伏驱动热泵]: 4.70","DC直供[光伏热泵]: DC母线直连避免AC/DC转换损耗"],"as":"固德威(GoodWe)推出由光伏直驱的户用空气源热泵系统，核心创新在于将光伏直流电直接接入热泵单元，最大化太阳能自消纳比例，减少对电网的依赖与逆变损耗。该产品将光伏发电与建筑供暖/热水深度耦合，面向欧洲等推动建筑电气化的市场，代表户用光储热一体化的发展趋势。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"GoodWe launches PV-driven residential air-to-water heat pumps - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nThe systems are designed to maximize solar self-consumption by routing DC power directly to the unit’s internal DC bus, avoiding losses and extra costs from AC/DC conversions. They offer a 6–34.15 kW capacity range with COP up to 4.70,\nEmiliano Bellini\nTechnology & Products\nR32 Residential Air Source Heat Pump | Image: GoodWe\nGoodHeat, a unit of Chinese inverter and battery manufacturer\n, has introduced a new line of air-to-water heat pumps for residential use at the SNEC 2026 trade show in Shanghai, China, last week.\nThe full DC inverter system is esigned to optimize solar self-consumption. By routing DC power straight to the unit’s internal DC bus, it eliminates the efficiency losses and hardware costs associated with traditional dual AC/DC conversions, the manufactuer said in a statement.\nThe product lineup covers a versatile capacity range from 6 kW to 34.15 kW to suit different property sizes. Models from 6 kW to 14 kW are designed for standard residential use, offering high efficiency as single-phase units, with the 6 kW version reaching a coefficient of performance (COP) of 4.70. Larger models from 16 kW to 34 kW are intended for bigger residential or light commercial applications and achieve a COP of 4.55.\nThe smallest model has dimensions of 1,170 mm × 462 mm × 855 mm and weighs up to 132 kg, while the largest variant has a size of 1,220 mm × 452 mm × 1,657 mm and a weight of up to 212 kg.\nAcross the entire range, GoodHet utilizes Panasonic DC Inverter Rotary compressors equipped with Enhanced Vapor Injection (EVI) technology. This configuration allows the system to deliver stable space heating, cooling, floor heating, and domestic hot water even in harsh climates, achieving a maximum water outlet temperature of up to 60 C for the smaller models and 50 C for the larger ones.\nThe company said system operation is highly customizable via a full-touch TFT display, allowing users to select three running states across all modes. Comfort is automated via a built-in climate curve that adjusts to outdoor temperatures, while integrated 4G, WiFi, IoT, and OTA functionality ensures seamless remote monitoring and upgrades. Additionally, automated protection loops safeguard the unit against pressure faults, water flow blockages, and freezing.\nEmiliano Bellini\nView author posts"},{"t":"不同磷脂酰肌醇核心蛋白的糖基化独立功能驱动皮质生成中的细胞特异性反应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531481123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The extracellular matrix plays critical roles in orchestrating cell communication and behaviors in response to various extracellular signals. It is a complex network composed of proteins and polysaccharides, whose individual and synergistic roles in cellular signaling, structural integrity, and tissue homeostasis remain active areas of investigation. Here, we find that in the developing cerebral cortex, distinct glypicans, which are heparan sulfate proteoglycans, present very precise and complementary expression patterns. More precisely, GPC4, which is expressed in cortical progenitors, promotes their proliferation and the generation of intermediate progenitors, whereas neuronal GPC2 acts as a brake on radial neuronal migration. The diverse biological functions of these proteoglycans are widely regarded as being intrinsically tied to their glycosaminoglycan (GAG) chains. Strikingly, we found that these effects are mediated only through glypican core proteins, rather than their heparan sulfate glycosylations. We found that the only difference between them is in their C-terminal disordered regions, which have a high density of charged residues. GPC2 is strongly basic, whereas GPC4 is acidic. Together, our findings highlight how specific proteoglycan protein cores are required to drive sequential cellular responses during cortical development in a glycosylation independent manner.","tp":"糖基化皮质生成","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究探讨了细胞外基质在协调细胞通讯和行为中的关键作用。研究发现，在发育中的大脑皮层内，不同的磷脂酰肌醇核心蛋白（一种硫酸乙酰肝素蛋白聚糖）展现出极其精确且互补的表达模式与功能。这些蛋白的糖基化独立功能在皮层生成过程中，能够驱动高度特异性的细胞反应。这一发现为了解细胞外基质网络如何调控细胞信号传导、维持结构完整性及组织稳态提供了新的视角。"},{"t":"全球太阳能需求正走向二十年来首次年度下降","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/solar-slowing-bnef-asks-whats-next-for-the-industry/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"SNEC 2026大会上，BloombergNEF首席太阳能分析师Jenny Chase指出全球光伏需求正走向近二十年来首次年度下滑。这标志着长达十余年的高速扩张期出现拐点，可能与产能过剩、补贴退坡及电网消纳瓶颈等因素有关。该趋势对光伏产业链上下游的产能规划与定价策略具有深远影响。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"光伏市场趋势","kp":["[全球光伏部署]:二十年来首次年度下降"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Global solar demand on track for first annual decline in two decades - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nAt the SNEC 2026 conference in Shanghai, BloombergNEF (BNEF) lead solar analyst Jenny Chase re-iterated a sobering projection: solar deployment will slow this year before returning to a much more conservative growth trajectory. The defining question facing the industry now is clear: what trends will step up to pull solar growth back upward?\nJohn Fitzgerald Weaver\nMarkets & Policy\nUtility-scale\nImage: Sikwe Scarter /Unsplash\nIn late 2025,\nBloombergNEF (BNEF) projected\nthat 2026 would be the first down year for solar panel installations in two decades. As of its presentation at SNEC 2026 in Shanghai, with Chinese capacity installations slowing significantly versus the prior year at this point, it looks like this projection may come true.\nBNEF solar analyst Jenny Chase examined why the ongoing wars have a limited effect on solar, and what might pull the solar module industry from its doldrums.\nAlthough there are multiple energy wars (Ukraine and the Middle East) ongoing, solar power is mostly indirectly affected. Both of these global events are heavily affecting oil, which — according to the International Energy Agency — represents only 2.6% of all electricity generation. However, the war in Ukraine began with conflict over natural gas resources, and the world’s largest liquefied natural gas export facility, in Qatar, has been taken out by Iranian missiles.\nSince the start of the Middle East events, after an initial increase in global liquefied natural gas pricing, pricing has returned to the average pricing of 2025. Within the U.S., pricing increased for a moment — then returned to regular pricing. However, solar’s own pricing is having the greatest effect on solar deployment.\nAcross the world —\n— solar power installations are driving negative pricing and curtailment. Across Europe in 2025, zero and negative pricing hours rose in seven countries, per BNEF. Spain logged 800 hours of zero or negative prices in 2025, and in the first quarter of 2026 set a new quarterly record of\n397 hours of negative prices\n— already approaching 2025’s annual total of 555 negative-price hours, and more than a third of the roughly 1,080 daytime hours in the three-month window.\nWith this reality in mind, the question posed by BNEF was — what will drive solar deployment next? The answer focused on energy storage.\nBNEF projects that after 2025’s record capacity deployment of 112 GW / 307 GWh, which was a 48% jump over 2024, a\n41% increase to 158 GW / 459 GWh\ncan be expected in 2026.\nEnergy storage is showing that it\ncan arrest the downward pricing trend leading to “free” daytime solar\nin California. Still, Chase noted the 459 GWh of batteries to be added in 2026 can store only about 43 minutes of peak output from the 640 GW of new solar expected the same year.\nAn economic analysis by BNEF suggests that solar and storage have total deployment limits due to the low prices of coal and gas. These BNEF economic models suggest solar just breaks 30% of global electricity by 2050, with gas holding around 17% and coal sliding to roughly 10%.\nChase expects the actual deployment of solar and energy storage to outpace BNEF’s modeling, as deployments of both technologies have historically beaten forecasts.\nWhile data centers are getting a lot of headlines, they’re not that big of a deal when considering all of the other ways electricity is used globally. In 2025, BNEF suggests data centers used 501 TWh of electricity, which is expected to more than double to 1,114 TWh — 3.6% of global electricity — by 2035.\nThe roughly 613 TWh increase would require, depending on where the solar is deployed, between 250 GW and 450 GW of solar capacity. At this year’s pace of 640 GW, it would increase solar deployments by 4% to 7% over the next decade.\nChase also noted there was an “X factor” which could drive demand: electric vehicles, which are expanding greatly due to war. In Europe, EV demand rose 24% year on year in April, per BNEF.\nHowever, even EVs can carry solar only so far — BNEF’s\nElectric Vehicle Outlook\nprojects a fully electric global road fleet would need some 8,313 TWh of electricity by 2050 in its Net Zero Scenario — roughly 80% more than data centers’ projected 4,627 TWh that year.\nBNEF sees a path for far greater growth, forecasting roughly 900% growth over the recently reached\n3 TW of cumulative capacity\n. BNEF said that in the 2050 Net Zero Scenario, cumulative installed solar capacity could reach 30.8 TW.\nJohn Fitzgerald Weaver\nView author posts"},{"t":"丛枝菌根真菌网络的整体密度和生物量","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adu4373?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Arbuscular mycorrhizal fungi form symbioses with ~70% of plant species, building hyphal networks that exchange nutrients for host-derived carbon. These tubular networks move ~1 billion metric tons of carbon per year into Earth’s soils. However, we have no quantitative understanding of the hyphal infrastructure required to carry out this resource transfer. We assembled data from 322 studies representing more than 16,000 soil cores across nine biomes and developed machine-learning models to predict hyphal densities globally. With robotic imaging of more than 300,000 hyphae, we calibrated a biomass model from our spatial predictions. We estimate that global topsoils contain 1.10 × 10\n                    17\n                    ± 0.13 × 10\n                    17\n                    SD kilometers of living hyphae, weighing ~300 ± 60 SD megatons, ~4- to 6-fold the biomass of humans. Our uncertainty analyses identified undersampled ecosystems that require additional empirical attention.","tp":"菌根真菌碳循环","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究汇集322项研究、覆盖9个生物群系超过16000个土壤芯样数据，构建机器学习模型量化了丛枝菌根真菌菌丝网络的密度和生物量。这些真菌与约70%植物物种形成共生关系，每年向土壤转移约10亿吨碳。研究结果填补了支撑全球碳循环的菌丝基础设施定量认知空白。","aip":1},{"t":"全球供应链奖：未来领袖奖","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/global-supply-chain-awards-the-future-leader-award","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Global Supply Chain Awards: The Future Leader Award\nPrioritise Us\nEntries are open for the Future Leader Award category at The Global Supply Chain Awards 2026, celebrating the supply chain sector’s emerging talent\nThe Future Leader Award is a category that will shine a light on the exciting talent in the supply chain sector at this year's Global Supply Chain Awards.\nAs we look to a time of meaningful change, with emerging technology and an ever-moving global economic landscape, it is more important than ever that the next generation of talent has the ability to be agile and forward-thinking.\nBehind all successful organisations, teams and projects are the people who make that progress happen. It is more vital than ever that we name those deserving of recognition for their hard work.\nAs well as industry leaders that are already established, the\nGlobal Supply Chain Awards\nalso give the opportunity to recognise those showing the qualities of future leaders. Experience and emerging talent alike will enjoy an exclusive black-tie dinner at the renowned JW Marriott Grosvenor House London on 8 September 2026 to honour their achievements over the past 12 months.\nWhen it comes to shaping future functions, the Future Leader Award enables us to put a spotlight on the people behind the projects that have demonstrated a level of excellence worth noticing.\nThe individuals we are looking to recognise will have been pivotal in contributing to initiatives that demonstrate innovation,\ncollaboration\nand a focus on future developments.\nRising executives at the early-to-mid stage of their career who embrace the way the supply chain sector is growing and have already left a lasting impression are likely to be noticed by our panel. These characters will be those others already look to for new ideas and to ask about emerging opportunities.\nThe recipient of this award will be able to show the judges that they embody the values and characteristics that will see their careers and learning accelerate beyond expectations.\nOur panel will be considering applicants against the following criteria:\nPrevious recipients of this award have been celebrated for their dedication to advancing the sector by redefining it, as well as pioneering agile operation models and pushing growth forward strategically.\nIt is not simply about celebrating the project achievements that are happening right now, but identifying those people who will likely be leading these initiatives in the future.\nThis award shines a light on the achievements of its recipient, rewarding the individual contribution, hard work and\ninfluence of the next generation\nof talent before their career takes off to even greater heights.\nTo do this in a room full of industry decision-makers and senior leadership is an award more valuable than the trophy itself, and could accelerate the career of the winner further still.\nHere is a rundown of the all-important deadlines and timings for the\nGlobal Supply Chain Awards 2026\nIt is not just the winner of this award who can celebrate, but those announced on the shortlist for this hard-fought category will equally be able to enjoy the celebration from peers for their hard work and dedication. Shortlisting for this category will be announced in August.\nOn 8 and 9 September, the awards ceremony is co-located with\nSustainability LIVE\nProcurement LIVE\n, taking place at QEII Centre, Westminster.\nDo not miss your chance to get noticed by missing the deadline for entry. Secure your tickets to these celebrated awards today."},{"t":"全球供应链奖：可持续供应链奖","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/global-supply-chain-awards-sustainable-supply-chain-award","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Global Supply Chain Awards: Sustainable Supply Chain Award\nPrioritise Us\nCelebrating leaders embedding ESG, cutting emissions and driving ethical practices into global operations while maintaining commercial success\nThe Global Supply Chain Awards 2026 opens entries for The Sustainable Supply Chain Award, celebrating organisations that are actively prioritising sustainability across their entire supply chain footprint.\nJoin Supply Chain LIVE: The London Summit & Awards on 8–9 September 2026 at the QEII Centre in Westminster, where more than 1,000 attendees and 50+ expert speakers will unite to explore some of the most pressing challenges and celebrate the most innovative strategies.\nOn 8 September, the Global Supply Chain Awards will be held, bringing together leading professionals from around the global supply chain sector. Entries are now open for eight dedicated categories, with a focus on strategic excellence, shining stars and the eager adoption of emerging trends.\nAt the Awards, we will be highlighting businesses that prove profitability and planetary care can go hand-in-hand, with The Sustainable Supply Chain Award.\nEntries are now open\nfor the award, as well as\nsponsorship opportunities\nTaking place on 8 September, 2026, at the iconic JW Marriott Grosvenor House London, the Global Supply Chain Awards will bring together some of the most influential supply chain leaders for an exclusive black-tie gala dinner.\nThe ceremony will celebrate excellence, leadership and innovation across the sector, offering a powerful platform to connect with leaders and share success stories. Now is the time to get involved and showcase your organisation's commitment to a greener future.\nSustainable Supply Chain Award\nrecognises organisations that seamlessly integrate environmental and ethical stewardship into their daily logistics. This category celebrates pioneering initiatives that reduce carbon footprints, eliminate waste, promote fair labour and embed long-term eco-friendly goals, all while maintaining operational excellence and commercial success.\nIn an era defined by stricter environmental regulations and conscious consumerism, the best organisations haven't just adapted; they have led. By rewriting the rulebook on sourcing, manufacturing and distribution, these forward-thinking enterprises are proving that sustainable supply chains are resilient supply chains.\nIf your business has spent the last 12 months driving positive environmental change without losing its competitive edge, we want to celebrate you.\nWhat our judges are looking for:\nBeing shortlisted for The Sustainable Supply Chain Award elevates your brand as an authentic champion of\ncorporate social responsibility (CSR)\nand ESG. It shines a spotlight on the teams, engineers and procurement specialists who are doing the hard work to make our global trade routes cleaner, fairer and fit for the next generation.\nEntries for the\nGlobal Supply Chain Awards 2026 are now open\nCo-located with\nProcurement LIVE\nSustainability LIVE\nSupply Chain LIVE\n​​​​​​​ will take place on 8 and 9 September at the QEII Centre, Westminster. In an era where procurement, resilience and ESG are entirely inseparable, this event offers a rare opportunity to network across all three disciplines in a single location.\nSecure your tickets today to celebrate the present, and meet the future, of sustainable supply chain leadership."},{"t":"深海巨型甲壳类动物从细菌那里偷走了一招","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01832-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Organisms called bathynomids boast a bacterial gene that helps them to regulate their metabolism in the cold depths. Organisms called bathynomids boast a bacterial gene that helps them to regulate their metabolism in the cold depths."},{"t":"德国法院针对谷歌的裁决聚焦人工智能责任问题","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/the-briefing/german-court-ruling-google-spotlights-ai-liability-question","c":"未分类","a":"the information","tg":"政策监管","b":"Subscribe to unlock","tp":"AI法律责任裁决","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":7.0},"as":"德国一家法院针对谷歌作出的裁决，使得人工智能相关的法律责任问题成为外界关注的核心焦点。"},{"t":"$^{7}\\mathrm{Be}$系统的广义简化$R$矩阵理论分析","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/3wlg-jl8j","c":"未分类","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Xu Han, Jie Liu, Zhen-Peng Chen, Tie-Jun Zu, and Tao YeBased on the generalized reduced $R$-matrix theory, the $R$-matrix analysis code (RAC) program is employed to analyze all reaction channels associated with the $^{7}\\mathrm{Be}$ system. The present calculations provide reliable evaluation data, which shows overall good agreement with available exper…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064607] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","tp":"核反应R矩阵分析","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究基于广义简化R矩阵理论，利用R矩阵分析程序（RAC）对7Be系统相关的所有反应通道进行了深入分析。研究通过计算提供了可靠的核反应评估数据，且这些理论计算结果与现有的实验数据表现出整体上良好的一致性。该工作为核物理领域的反应机制研究和数据评价提供了有价值的参考依据。"},{"t":"超薄膜中射弹穿透能的一般反立方厚度缩放","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2609202123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ultrathin films of widely different materials exhibit a dramatic enhancement of projectile penetration resistance under high–velocity impact. Despite extensive simulations and experiments, a unifying physical explanation has remained elusive. Here we show that the specific penetration energy follows a general inverse-cube scaling law,\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            E\n                            p\n                            ∗\n                          \n                          \n                            (\n                            h\n                            )\n                          \n                          =\n                          \n                            E\n                            \n                              p\n                              ,\n                              ∞\n                            \n                            ∗\n                          \n                          +\n                          B\n                          \n                            h\n                            \n                              −\n                              3\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    , across chemically and structurally distinct systems. The inverse–cube scaling is traced to a finite–size correction to the effective shear modulus caused by suppression of long–wavelength nonaffine modes. The scaling describes impact data for multilayer graphene, graphene oxide, and polymer thin films, revealing a common elastic contribution to nanoscale impact resistance.","tp":"薄膜穿透缩放律","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究发现超薄膜在高速冲击下的射弹穿透阻力遵循一般性的反立方厚度缩放定律。尽管不同材料的超薄膜均表现出显著的穿透阻力增强，但此前缺乏统一的物理解释。反立方缩放定律的建立为防弹装甲、航天器防护等领域的超薄膜材料设计提供了通用理论指导。","aip":1},{"t":"基因祖先揭示了真核发生过程中不同的微生物关联","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10639-9","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The origin of eukaryotes remains a central enigma in biology1. Continuing debates agree on the pivotal role of a symbiosis between an alphaproteobacterium and an Asgard archaeon2,3. However, the nature, timing and contributions of other potential bacterial partners4,5,6 and the role of interactions with viruses7,8,9 remain contentious. To address these questions, we used advanced phylogenomic approaches and comprehensive datasets spanning the known diversity of cellular life and viruses. Our analysis provided a revised reconstruction of the last eukaryotic common ancestor (LECA) proteome, in which we traced the phylogenetic origin of each protein family. We found compelling evidence for multiple waves of horizontal gene transfer from diverse bacterial donors, with some likely to have preceded mitochondrial endosymbiosis. We inferred plausible traits of the major donors and their functional contributions to the LECA. Our findings support a contribution of horizontal gene transfers to shaping the proteomes of pre-LECA ancestors and suggest a facilitating role of Nucleocytoviricota viruses. Taken together, our results suggest that ancient eukaryotes may have originated within complex microbial ecosystems through a succession of diverse associations that left a footprint of horizontally transferred genes.","tp":"真核生物起源","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":1.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"真核生物的起源一直是生物学界的核心谜团。尽管学界普遍认同其起源于α-变形菌与阿斯加德古菌的共生，但其他潜在细菌伙伴的介入时间及病毒相互作用的具体角色仍存争议。本研究采用先进的系统发育基因组学方法和涵盖已知细胞生命及病毒多样性的综合数据集，揭示了真核生物发生过程中存在不同的微生物关联，为厘清这一复杂演化过程提供了新见解。"},{"t":"Z 世代对人工智能的怀疑是一记警钟——大学必须认真对待","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01814-z","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The challenge for universities is not adopting artificial intelligence, but doing so in ways that the current generation of students can trust. The challenge for universities is not adopting artificial intelligence, but doing so in ways that the current generation of students can trust.","tp":"AI教育信任","sc":1.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":2.0,"d":0.5,"t":2.0},"as":"当前Z世代对人工智能的怀疑态度为高等教育界敲响了警钟。文章指出，大学面临的核心挑战并非如何引入和采用人工智能技术，而是如何以让学生信任的方式去应用它。这要求高校在推进AI教育融合时，必须高度重视学生的信任问题，建立透明、负责任的技术应用机制，从而消除年轻一代对AI技术的疑虑。"},{"t":"GREM1/FGFR1激活的肌成纤维细胞诱导免疫抑制并加速高级浆液性卵巢癌的转移","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529786123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Joint effect of cancer-associated fibroblasts (CAFs) and regulatory T cells (Tregs) can drive immunosuppression in high-grade serous ovarian cancer (HGSOC), thereby promoting tumor metastasis and limiting the clinical benefit of PD-1/PD-L1 blockade. However, the mechanistic crosstalk between CAFs and Tregs remains unclear. By integrating bulk RNA-seq, single-cell RNA-seq datasets, and spatial transcriptomics datasets with functional assays, we identified a population of TGF-β1-driven Gremlin1 (GREM1)\n                    +\n                    myofibroblastic CAFs (myCAFs) enriched in HGSOC metastatic lesions. These GREM1\n                    +\n                    myCAFs activated the FGFR1-MAPKs-NFκB-TDO2-kynurenine axis via autocrine signaling, promoting tumor growth, metastasis, and immune evasion characterized by the infiltration of CD4\n                    +\n                    Tregs and dysfunctional CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells. GREM1 knockdown suppressed tumor metastasis, restored antitumor T cells response, remodeled CAF subtype composition and potentiated anti-PD-1 therapy efficacy. This study highlights the pro-metastatic role of GREM1\n                    +\n                    myCAFs across multiple tumors and provides a rationale for combining anti-PD-1 therapy for metastatic HGSOC."},{"t":"从P型到双极性：D-A-D有机正极中醌核工程策略实现超稳定高能储能","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9678457?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"醌核有机正极","kp":["有机正极设计[D-A-D分子]: 醌核工程实现p型到双极性转变"],"dp":1,"as":"提出一种基于醌核工程的供体-受体-供体（D-A-D）分子设计策略，开发高性能有机正极材料。通过将分子从P型转变为双极性，优化氧化还原电位和载流子传输，实现超稳定循环。该策略系统调控电子结构，为有机电池正极的能量密度和循环寿命瓶颈提供了理性分子设计方案。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"From P‐Type to Bipolar: A Quinone‐Core Engineering Strategy in D‐A‐D Organic Cathodes for Ultra‐Stable and High‐Energy O","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In this study, we present a rational donor‐acceptor‐donor (D‐A‐D) molecular design strategy to develop high‐performance organic cathodes by enhancing the intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) effect. We designed and synthesized two organic molecules: 2,6‐bis(10H‐phenothiazin‐10‐yl)benzo[1,2‐d:4,5‐d’]diimidazole‐4,8‐dione (PTZBQ), featuring a strong quinone‐type acceptor core, and the control compound 2,6‐bis(10H‐phenothiazin‐10‐yl)benzo[1,2‐d:4,5‐d’]diimidazole (PTZTAB), without a quinone core. The strong push‐pull electronic structure of PTZBQ not only results in a significantly narrowed bandgap and improved electrode kinetics, but also allows the quinone core to contribute extra n‐type capacity, thereby remarkably boosting the electrode's specific capacity and reaction dynamics. Moreover, the extended π‐conjugation and D‐A‐D configuration‐induced polarity endow both small molecules with exceptional electrolyte dissolution resistance. Consequently, PTZBQ exhibits bipolar redox activity, delivering a high discharge potential of 3.05 V, a high specific capacity of 163.3 mAh g\n                    −1\n                     at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    , an excellent rate capability (77.6% retention at 5 A g\n                    −1\n                    ), and exceptional long‐term cycling stability with 89.4% retention after 5000 cycles at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    . DFT calculations and ex situ spectroscopy confirm that the unique D‐A‐D architecture possesses spatially separated n‐type and p‐type redox centers, facilitating the redox process. Our findings highlight that quinone‐core engineering enhances intramolecular charge transfer and represents a powerful approach for developing high‐performance cathode materials.","aip":1},{"t":"车队在惊叹的1.55 kWh/英里能效表现后采购特斯拉Semi电动卡车","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/11/arcbest-buys-tesla-semis-abf-freight-pilot/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动重卡","kp":["能耗[Tesla Semi]: 1.55 kWh/mile"],"as":"美国物流巨头ArcBest采购两辆特斯拉Semi电动半挂卡车，此前测试中该车实现了1.55 kWh/mile的能效表现，令业界瞩目。这一能效水平显著优于传统柴油重卡，标志着电动重卡在长途货运领域的经济可行性已获商业验证。车队级采购表明电动重卡正从试点走向规模化部署。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Fleet buys Tesla Semi electric trucks after stunning 1.55 kWh/mile efficiency","b":"Fred Lambert\n| Jun 11 2026 - 8:59 am PT\nArcBest (ARCB), the multibillion-dollar logistics company, is purchasing two Tesla Semi electric trucks for its ABF Freight fleet after a successful 2025 pilot program that averaged 1.55 kWh per mile over 4,494 miles.\nThe purchase marks a significant step beyond piloting and into actual fleet investment for the less-than-truckload (LTL) carrier, which is now expanding its electric Class 8 testing across a broader operating footprint.\ncovered ABF Freight’s Tesla Semi pilot last year\n, which demonstrated impressive efficiency results. Over three weeks, the electric truck logged 4,494 miles averaging 321 miles per day on routes between Reno, Nevada, and Sacramento, California, including regional Bay Area runs and rail shuttle operations.\nThe 1.55 kWh per mile result was a notable improvement over earlier Tesla Semi efficiency numbers. When Tesla unveiled its “production version” in 2022, Elon Musk claimed 1.7 kWh per mile. DHL got 1.72 kWh per mile in its own testing, and Saia got 1.73 kWh per mile. ArcBest’s 1.55 kWh per mile represents a roughly 9% improvement over those earlier figures.\nNow, ArcBest is putting money behind those results. The two new Tesla Semis will primarily support linehaul operations within California, with planned extension into Reno, Nevada, and potentially other locations — significantly expanding lane coverage compared to the pilot’s Reno-Sacramento corridor focus.\nMatt Godfrey, ABF Freight president, said:\n“Adding Tesla Semis to our lineup allows us to expand that across more lanes and operating conditions to evaluate whether heavy-duty electric vehicles meet the same standards for safety, reliability and performance across our existing fleet.”\nABF Freight plans to benchmark the electric trucks against its diesel fleet using the same metrics for total cost of ownership, operational efficiency, safety, and employee experience that guide all fleet investments.\nOne underreported aspect of the Tesla Semi’s commercial deployment is driver reception. ArcBest noted that operators during the 2025 pilot highlighted strong visibility, comfort, and overall performance — including reliable operation on the demanding 7,200-foot climb over Donner Pass.\nThat tracks with feedback from other fleet operators.\nCovenant Logistics recently tested a Tesla Semi on the Grapevine\n— the notoriously steep I-5 grade in Southern California — and came away “amazed” by the truck’s performance on the grade.\nInitial feedback from ABF drivers during orientation on the new units has also been encouraging, with drivers noting the combination of comfort and ease of operation.\nArcBest’s purchase comes as Tesla Semi momentum is accelerating across the freight industry. The\nfirst Tesla Semi rolled off the high-volume production line\nin late April at the new dedicated factory adjacent to Gigafactory Nevada, and orders have been piling up.\nWattEV placed a 370-truck order worth approximately $100 million\n— the largest single electric truck deployment in California. Two port drayage operators\nordered a combined 60 Tesla Semis\nthrough Forum Mobility. DHL, CEVA Logistics, and several other major carriers have been expanding their Tesla Semi testing as well.\nArcBest is no stranger to fleet electrification either. The company\ndeployed 14 electric terminal tractors\nlast year, signaling a broader commitment to evaluating electric equipment across its operations.\nThe competitive landscape reinforces why fleet operators are gravitating toward the Tesla Semi. The Freightliner eCascadia tops out at around 230 miles of range with a 550 kWh battery, while the Volvo VNR Electric maxes out at about 275 miles with 564 kWh. Neither can match the Tesla Semi’s combination of range and efficiency — the Semi’s 822 kWh battery pack delivers roughly 500+ miles of range at the efficiency levels ArcBest demonstrated.\nArcBest’s move from pilot to purchase is exactly the kind of signal the electric trucking industry needs. It’s one thing for a logistics company to test an electric truck in a controlled pilot — it’s another to actually buy the trucks and put them into regular operations with plans to expand.\nWhat’s particularly telling is that ABF Freight is applying the same total cost of ownership benchmarks it uses for its diesel fleet. That’s how you know the technology is maturing — when fleet operators stop treating electric trucks as science projects and start evaluating them like any other piece of equipment.\nWe’re now seeing a clear pattern: virtually every major fleet operator that has piloted a Tesla Semi is either expanding their testing or placing orders. The 1.55 kWh per mile efficiency is a big part of why. At current electricity rates, the Tesla Semi’s energy cost per mile is dramatically lower than diesel, and the gap widens every time fuel prices spike.\nThe real question now is whether Tesla can produce enough trucks to meet demand. The new production line is running, but ramping from a handful of trucks to thousands is a different challenge entirely. We haven’t heard much about the ramp-up since Tesla started production earlier this year.\nIf you’re running a fleet operation, the economics of going electric extend beyond just the trucks. Locking in low energy costs with on-site solar makes the math even better. With electricity rates climbing nearly 10% last year, home solar protects you against future rate increases. And with lease and PPA options, you can go solar with zero upfront cost and start saving immediately. If you want to find the best deal, check out\n. It’s a free service with hundreds of pre-vetted installers competing for your business, so you save 20 to 30% compared to going it alone. No sales calls until you pick an installer.\nGet your free quotes here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nFred is the Editor in Chief and Main Writer at Electrek.\nThrough Zalkon.com, you can check out Fred’s portfolio and get monthly green stock investment ideas.\nGet an edge on MMA with the best stats\nEnergySage helps you get the best price possible on a home solar installation for free and without hassel."},{"t":"亚利桑那州800 MWh储能系统并网，Waymo启动电动汽车电池再利用合作","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/11/flatland-800-mwh-bess-goes-online-in-arizona-as-waymo-launches-ev-reuse-deal/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能电站","kp":["装机容量[BESS]:200MW/800MWh"],"as":"亚利桑那州Flatland储能项目并网投运，规模200MW/800MWh，为该州又一大规模电池储能项目。同时Waymo与储能运营商达成电动汽车电池梯次利用合作，探索退役动力电池的二次商业应用。两项进展共同反映出美国储能市场在电网级项目部署和退役电池循环利用方面的加速推进。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Flatland 800 MWh BESS goes online in Arizona as Waymo launches EV reuse deal - Energy Storage","b":"Arizona has successfully completed another big battery project with the addition of the 200 MW/800 MWh Flatland Energy Storage BESS to its energy mix. Developed by not-for-profit public power utility Salt River Project (SRP) and the North American branch of global utility company EDP Renewables, Flatland Energy Storage has the capacity to power around 44,500 homes in Arizona.\nBoth developers emphasized the project’s benefits for the local area. SRP, which serves more than two million people in central Arizona, said the Flatland Energy Storage facility will provide “reliable, affordable, and sustainable power”, while EDP Group CEO Miguel Stilwell d’Andrade said it would strengthen grid stability and support more reliable system performance.\nThe CEO also said that the project is the largest within the EDP Group to date. EDP North America has around 600 MW of gross operating capacity across solar and storage in Arizona, powering the equivalent of more than 113,000 homes.\nEDP Renewables, which has its global headquarters in Madrid, has projects all over the world. In November 2025, its Australia division teamed up with the Queensland Investment Corporation to deliver a solar-and-storage project featuring\n1.6 MWh of BESS\nSRP committed to plans to further energy storage development in Arizona. Bobby Olsen, SRP associate general manager and chief power system executive, said: “SRP will continue to invest in battery energy storage resources as part of its growing resource portfolio.”\nIn the meantime, the Flatland Energy Storage facility represents more than €17.3 million ($19.9 million) in local and regional economic impact over its lifetime, including revenue to local government to support public services and infrastructure.\nArizona is an attractive location for energy storage developers, with a lot of big projects located in the region thanks to its\nabundance of solar generation\nwhich needs to be stored.\nIn July 2025, Canadian Solar subsidiary Recurrent Energy commissioned its\n1.2 GWh Papago Storage facility\nnear Phoenix, one of the biggest BESS projects in Arizona to date. Other big developers active in the state include CIP, Invenergy, Fluence, GridStor, EDF Renewables, and Strata.\nDriving grid flexibility\nMeanwhile, B2U Storage Solutions is taking a different approach to grid-scale batteries by teaming up with self-driving car company Waymo to repurpose Waymo’s old electric vehicle (EV) batteries as second-life standalone batteries.\nLos Angeles-based B2U Storage Solutions repurposes EV batteries at its Lancaster facility, and according to its CEO, Freeman Hall, the Waymo partnership will support the expansion of its efforts across the United States.\n“By extending the use of these batteries as grid storage, we are monetizing the full potential of EV batteries, now providing crucial stability to the power grid as energy demand continues to grow,” said Hall.\n“Our shared fleet of EVs provide a massive opportunity to support the growth of clean energy on the electricity grid while expanding the circular economy,” said Adam Lenz, head of sustainability and environment at Waymo. “Through this partnership, we can repurpose our batteries for local grid storage and ensure our batteries continue to provide economic and environmental value to the community long after they’ve retired from the road.”"},{"t":"科学家工作中的五张获奖照片","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01819-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"From sky to sea, and then back to the lab, here are the top images from Nature’s 2026 photo competition."},{"t":"首次测量 Ia 型超新星相关能量下的 $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}(α,p)^{23}\\mathrm{Na}$ 反应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/vkcb-8hzg","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): C. Boomershine, D. W. Bardayan, R. J. deBoer, P. D. O'Malley, S. R. Carmichael, L. Caves, A. Davis, A. Gula, K. Howard, R. Kelmar, A. Mitchell, L. Morales, S. Moylan, D. Robertson, and E. StechSensitivity studies have found that the $^{20}\\mathrm{Ne}(α,p)^{23}\\mathrm{Na}$ reaction has a significant influence on supernovae Ia (SNIa) nucleosynthesis, but no previous measurements of the reaction cross section have been reported. Astrophysical reaction rate estimates have been based upon meas…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 065804] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"首先搜索 $B→{X}_{s}ν\\overline{ν}$ 衰变","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/kf73-hw61","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): M. Abumusabh et al. (The Belle II Collaboration)We report the first search for the flavor-changing neutral-current decays $B→{X}_{s}ν\\overline{ν}$, where ${X}_{s}$ is a hadronic system with strangeness equal to 1, in data collected with the Belle II detector at the SuperKEKB asymmetric-energy ${e}^{+}{e}^{−}$ collider. The data sample corresponds…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231801] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"新兴和发展中国家不确定性下的金融包容性以及获得清洁烹饪燃料和技术的机会","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003824?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源可及性","sc":1.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"细胞壁快速软化导致捕蝇草闭合","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed5051?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Plants can move rapidly without muscles, as seen in the Venus flytrap’s snapping lobes—a long-standing puzzle in plant biomechanics. Trap closure involves an elastic instability, but the active mechanical driver has remained elusive. Using in situ hydraulic and mechanical measurements, we identified the motor driving this transition. Closure occurs too quickly to be explained by water transport, revealing a distinct, nonhydraulic mechanism: a rapid (about one second) softening of the epidermal cell wall, releasing elastic energy stored in the trap. This represents the fastest modulation of wall mechanics reported in plants. Our finding reveals a mode of plant motility based on dynamic tuning of material properties, suggesting principles for muscle-free, bioinspired actuation."},{"t":"通过光辅助准粒子隧穿至超导体实现单微波光子的快速连续探测","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/mj91-ntm4","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微波单光子探测","kp":["[检测机制]: 光辅助准粒子隧穿超导岛","[检测对象]: 单微波光子"],"as":"报道了一种通过光辅助准粒子隧穿实现单微波光子快速连续探测的新机制。研究团队在超导量子器件中实现该方案，能够对单个微波光子进行连续测量。该技术在超导量子计算读出、暗物质探测和量子通信等领域具有重要应用前景。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Fast and Continuous Detection of Single Microwave Photons via Photoassisted Quasiparticle Tunneling to a Superconducting","b":"Author(s): J. Basset, O. Stanisavljević, J. Gabelli, M. Aprili, and J. EstèveA new mechanism for the detection of individual propagating microwave photons that realizes a microwave analogue of the photoelectric effect could be used for practical applications in quantum information and dark matter search.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 237001] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"远红叶绿素 d 簇将光系统 I 吸收扩展到红色极限","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7355?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Oxygenic photosynthesis is usually limited to visible light, but the marine cyanobacterium\n                    Acaryochloris marina\n                    pushes this boundary by harvesting far-red photons with chlorophyll d. The best-studied strain, MBIC11017, unexpectedly lacks low-energy chlorophylls (“red forms”) in photosystem I, limiting absorption beyond 740 nanometers. Here, we show that another strain,\n                    A. marina\n                    NIES-2412, has evolved a strategy to absorb far-red photons up to 760 nanometers. Combining time-resolved fluorescence spectroscopy with cryo–electron microscopy at 2.64-angstrom resolution, we identify two distinct classes of chlorophyll d red forms in its photosystem I. One class originates from classical charge-transfer–exciton mixing, while the other arises purely from excitonic interactions. Mapping all 96 chlorophylls d reveals the precise pigments responsible for these far-red states. We also uncover a previously unreported subunit, PsaX2, which stabilizes the photosystem I complex and shapes pigment geometry and energetics to enable the formation of red forms. Last, we show that the protein modifications responsible for binding and tuning these red forms are widespread across the\n                    Acaryochloris\n                    genus but not within the model MBIC11017 strain. Far-red photons lie close to the energetic limit of oxygenic photosynthesis; their efficient use therefore requires fine-tuning of the photosynthetic machinery. To our knowledge, our findings provide the structural and mechanistic basis of one of the most red-shifted photosystem I complexes identified to date, highlighting a distinct adaptive strategy in far-red light environments and offering design principles for extending photosynthesis in crops into the infrared.","tp":"远红光吸收","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究揭示了蓝藻Acaryochloris marina NIES-2412菌株利用远红叶绿素d簇将光系统I吸收扩展至红色极限的进化策略。已知最知名的MBIC11017菌株因缺乏低能量叶绿素（红色形式）而限制了740纳米以上的吸收。新发现的NIES-2412菌株突破了这一限制，为理解光合作用光谱边界的拓展机制提供了新视角。"},{"t":"仅从两个位点表达四种线粒体 tRNA","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534946123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Transfer RNAs (tRNAs) are among the few genes retained in animal mitochondrial genomes after more than a billion years of gene loss. These ancient bacterial vestiges are often structurally aberrant and less stable than their bacterial or cytosolic tRNA counterparts. In some lineages, mitochondrial tRNAs (mt-tRNAs) have become so truncated that the loss of one or both arms has expanded our understanding of what constitutes a functional tRNA. Here, we report another radical departure from canonical tRNA gene architecture: two overlapping tRNAs produced from opposite strands of the same locus. These “mirror” tRNA pairs eliminate the need to retain separate loci for all tRNA genes, as a single locus can produce tRNAs to decode two different amino acids. We show that these mirror tRNAs are aminoacylated and demonstrate their presence in mitoribosomes. Furthermore, mirror tRNAs display strand-specific patterns of nucleotide modification and RNA editing, reflecting specific posttranscriptional maturation that depends on transcriptional orientation. This demonstration of functional, bidirectional tRNA expression reveals an unexpected strategy by which mitochondrial genomes maintain a complete set of tRNAs in the face of unrelenting gene loss. The presence of mirror tRNAs has broad implications for the evolution of tRNA-interacting enzymes, mitochondrial biology, and even the origins of the protein synthesis machinery itself."},{"t":"探索表面电子量子限制的三维","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3926?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Quantum confinement of surface electrons in two-dimensional metal-organic networks offers a powerful route to engineer electronic states for quantum and spintronic technologies. Here, we demonstrate the pivotal role of vertical variations in the surface potential on the quantum confinement of surface electrons. We investigate the confinement of both Shockley surface state and image-potential state electrons with their distinct vertical electron density distributions in a Cu-T4PT network on Cu(111). We find a substantial renormalization of the band mass of the image state, whereas the Shockley state remains almost unchanged. This notable divergence arises from the distinct three-dimensional potential landscape of the Cu-T4PT network, with a strong repulsive potential at the vertical position of the molecular backbone and leaky channels beneath the Cu coordination spheres. Our findings demonstrate the essential role of vertical potential engineering in designing quantum-confined states, thereby advancing control over electronic properties and quantum phenomena at the nanoscale.","tp":"量子态调控","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究在二维金属-有机网络中揭示了表面势的垂直变化对表面电子量子限制的关键作用。通过在Cu(111)上的Cu-T4PT网络中研究Shockley表面态和镜像势态电子的不同垂直电子密度分布限制，证明了量子限制的第三维度效应，为量子计算和自旋电子学中的电子态工程提供了新思路。"},{"t":"实验违反因果顺序的贝尔式不等式","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee2912?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Quantum mechanics is compatible with scenarios where physical processes happen in an indefinite order. In theory, this feature could be detected through violations of inequalities on the observed correlations, analogous to Bell inequalities. However, experimental demonstrations of such violations have been missing until recently due to the complexity of the required setup. Here, we report an experimental violation of a Bell-like inequality involving the correlations of four parties, one of which is spacelike separated from the others. Our demonstration uses 3-kilometer fiber spools to simulate spacelike separation and achieves high-speed operations in photonic time-bin encoding, nanosecond synchronization, and accurate temperature stabilization. These experimental advances enable a violation by 5.7 SDs and open a path toward a certification of indefinite order in conditions that guarantee spacelike separation with existing state-of-the-art devices. However, the certification is not device independent, as it relies on knowledge about the setup to exclude bidirectional signaling—a loophole inherent to implementations in classical acyclic spacetimes, which may be resolved in future quantum-spacetime tests."},{"t":"使用 DIII-D 电荷交换成像诊断系统对 H 型基座湍流进行实验研究","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae72a0","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","b":"Microtearing modes (MTMs) ( , , ) are predicted to cause substantial electron thermal transport in the H-mode pedestal, limiting fusion performance on high-power devices. Localized 2D measurements of low-to-intermediate wavenumber density fluctuations in the edge of DIII-D H-mode plasmas suggest the presence of temporally intermittent or ‘bursting’ MTMs during the inter-ELM cycle in the steep gradient region. These measurements are obtained using a new intermediate radial resolution multichannel Charge eXchange Imaging (CXI) diagnostic that analyzes the intensity of the CVI emission at 529 nm. The mode is peaked near with a radial full-width half maximum of 1.5–2.0 cm and a normalized density fluctuation amplitude peak of , peaking near 60 kHz in the lab frame. The mode additionally features a broad spectral width from 30 to 180 kHz and propagates in the electron diamagnetic direction in the plasma frame. CXI measurements taken during discharges with high density and current ramps provide evidence that MTMs become unstable at finite collisionality and remain at nearly the same location in -space despite scanning of rational surface position. This indicates that the location of the peak in the electron diamagnetic frequency is a stronger driving force than individual rational surfaces.","tp":"核聚变湍流","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用DIII-D托卡马克新型多通道电荷交换成像诊断系统，对H模基座湍流进行了实验研究。在ELM间隙陡峭梯度区域观测到时间上间歇性或爆发式的微撕裂模（MTMs），这些模式被认为是H模基座中电子热输运的主要原因，限制了高功率装置的聚变性能表现。"},{"t":"超越大自然的生物速度限制","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei3453?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Rapid cell wall relaxation initiates the snap of the Venus flytrap"},{"t":"原子尺度振动介导的电子聚束的证据","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/zvf5-wln4","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): A. Maiti, M. Amato, V. S. Stolyarov, H. Aubin, J. Estève, F. Pistolesi, M. Aprili, and F. MasseeAtomic-scale measurements show that vibrational excitations can cause electrons to move in bunches.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236501] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","tp":"振动致聚束","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"原子尺度测量首次证实了振动介导的电子聚束效应。研究表明原子级振动激发可以导致电子以聚束形式运动，这一发现揭示了振动与电子输运之间的微观耦合机制，对理解低维量子器件中的电子动力学行为和纳米尺度电子学器件设计具有重要意义。"},{"t":"欧洲缩小与中国电池制造差距的计划","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.batterytechonline.com/industry-outlook/can-europe-close-the-battery-manufacturing-gap-with-china-industry-leader-says-yes-with-conditions","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Battery Tech Online","tg":"行业观察","tp":"电池制造策略","kp":["[欧洲电池制造]:18个月取消700GWh产能"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"欧洲正力图缩小与中国在电池制造领域的差距。尽管已有700GWh的超级工厂产能被取消，且在成本上持续处于劣势，欧盟新的产业政策工具正提供转机。通过关键原材料法案、电池护照法规及绿色补贴等手段，欧洲试图构建本土电池供应链。然而中国在成本控制、规模化生产和全产业链整合上的领先地位短期内难以撼动。","ot":"Europe's Plan to Close Battery Manufacturing Gap with China","b":"Despite 700 GWh in cancelled gigafactory capacity and persistent cost disadvantages, new EU industrial policy tools offer a path to capturing a-third of the European battery market.\nJune 11, 2026\nReCharge Director General Ilka von Dalwigk keynotes The Battery Show Europe in Stuttgart on June 11, 2026.\nM. Anderson / Battery Technolgy\nEurope lost 700 GWh of gigafactory capacity in 18 months as projects faced scaling challenges and lagging EV demand.\nBattery Booster Facility offers €1.5B in interest-free loans targeting companies' first ramp-up to 10 GWh production.\nProposed Industrial Accelerator Act would require Made in Europe cells and components for public procurement eligibility.\nWhen Ilka von Dalwigk took the stage at\nThe Battery Show Europe\non June 11, her message carried both urgency and cautious optimism. As Director General of ReCharge, an industry alliance spanning the entire battery value chain from raw materials to recycling, von Dalwigk has a front-row seat to Europe's struggle to establish itself as a global battery powerhouse. Her keynote, \"Europe's Battery Outlook Beyond 2030,\" didn't sugarcoat the continent's predicament: Europe is walking into a new form of dependency even as it tries to escape fossil fuels, and Chinese dominance across the battery value chain has only intensified. Yet von Dalwigk also presented a detailed roadmap—backed by emerging EU policy tools—that could still keep Europe \"in the game.\"\nEurope's clean energy transition has created an uncomfortable irony. The continent set out to decarbonize transportation and energy systems by moving away from fossil fuels, but in doing so has created new vulnerabilities around critical minerals and manufacturing capacity. Von Dalwigk cited International Energy Agency data showing China's overwhelming presence—marked in red across IEA charts—throughout the battery value chain, from refined materials to finished cells and increasingly the vehicles themselves.\nEU Spent €27 Billion on Batteries in 2024—87% From China. Now It's Fighting Back\n\"We are talking about China shock 2.0,\" von Dalwigk said, noting that despite European efforts to diversify, the volume of cells and cars imported from China continues rising annually. She emphasized that cooperation with China will continue, but Europe urgently needs to build resilient and diversified supply chains to avoid trading one strategic dependency for another.\nThis challenge extends beyond geopolitics. Von Dalwigk stressed that batteries have become foundational technology across multiple domains—not just electric vehicles, but stationary storage for grid security, high-tech applications including AI and robotics, and increasingly defense systems. The diversity of applications and chemistries required means Europe cannot afford to remain dependent on a single source for such a strategic capability.\nReCharge presentation slide. Photo credit: Battery Technology\nThe scale of Europe's manufacturing challenge became starkly apparent over the past two years. When the European Battery Alliance launched in 2017, it aimed to build indigenous gigafactory capacity and develop the skills to produce battery cells at scale in Europe. By 2024, announced capacity had reached an impressive 1.4 terawatt-hours annually. Then reality hit hard.\nEditors Roundtable: 3 Major Battery News Items in March - April\nWithin eighteen months, more than 700 gigawatt-hours of announced capacity evaporated. Projects were downscaled, delayed, or abandoned entirely as companies confronted lagging EV demand and the brutal difficulty of ramping up large-scale cell production. Von Dalwigk acknowledged the grim headlines: \"Sometimes it really feels like, 'is the game lost?'\"\nYet she urged looking beyond the flashy failures to quieter signs of progress. Some projects are being restructured under new ownership. Tesla's decision to add cell production capacity in Europe and actively recruit staff signals continued belief in European market demand. Smaller production facilities—many exhibiting at The Battery Show—are already operational and scaling up. If projects currently in the pipeline reach fruition, von Dalwigk believes Europe has \"a good chance of actually capturing at least a good third of the European market share.\"\nBeyond manufacturing challenges, Europe faces political volatility that threatens to undermine investor confidence. Von Dalwigk highlighted how EVs have become weaponized in election campaigns across member states, with discussions about revisiting combustion engine phase-out timelines creating uncertainty about future demand. Removing clear policy signals makes investors \"shy away from battery industry investments,\" she warned.\nBattery Innovation Goes Beyond Chemistry to Supply Chains and Capital Discipline\nThe regulatory landscape adds another layer of complexity. Europe is deep in implementing the EU Battery Regulation while simultaneously navigating rapid changes across multiple legislative frameworks. The European Commission's omnibus approach—attempting to simplify by bundling changes—has instead made it difficult for industry to keep pace. Von Dalwigk pointed to policy incoherence as a particular frustration, citing the classification of lithium salts as toxic as an example of decisions that contradict the Commission's stated goal of establishing a battery industry in Europe.\nAgainst this challenging backdrop, von Dalwigk and partners have developed what they call the \"Battery Deal for Europe\"—a comprehensive strategy to counter fragmented national approaches with coordinated European-level action. The proposal emerged from what von Dalwigk described as a particularly gloomy industry gathering last year, where frustrated stakeholders decided to stop waiting for someone else to develop a plan.\nReCharge presentation slide. Photo credit: Battery Technology\nThe Battery Deal rests on three pillars: innovation as the core foundation, targeted support for production, and measures to stimulate demand for European projects while protecting a still-nascent industry. Von Dalwigk was frank about the challenge: \"Energy and labor costs are inherently higher in Europe than China. This has always been the case, so there will always be a small cost difference.\" However, recent IEA analysis shows the current gap between fully European and fully Chinese cells is quite significant—but also partially addressable through manufacturing efficiency, automation, improved materials, and better battery components. The innovation happening in equipment and processing, much of it on display at The Battery Show, demonstrates pathways to close that gap.\nTwo concrete policy mechanisms are now moving from concept to reality, offering targeted support at Europe's most critical bottleneck: the ramp-up phase.\nThe Battery Booster Facility provides €1.5 billion in interest-free loans specifically for companies installing their first 10 gigawatt-hours of capacity in Europe—precisely the learning curve phase where many projects have stumbled. Von Dalwigk called it \"really good news for the industry,\" while noting it represents a one-time effort using existing funds rather than fresh money. The next critical step is securing ongoing support in the EU's upcoming multi-annual financial framework.\nEven more significant for long-term competitiveness is the proposed Industrial Accelerator Act, which von Dalwigk described as \"real industrial policy to incentivize investments in European production.\" The Act would introduce \"Made in Europe\" preferences for certain components—initially cells, cathode active materials, and battery management systems—in EVs and stationary storage systems. To qualify for public procurement contracts or support schemes, these components would need to be sourced from Europe.\nThe Act also proposes foreign direct investment conditions for large projects exceeding €100 million, including requirements around local workforce, intellectual property transfer, and joint venture structures. Von Dalwigk emphasized this doesn't close the door to international collaboration but rather seeks to establish \"a little bit of a level playing field\" and ensure Europe retains some control over strategic investments on its soil.\nVon Dalwigk closed by acknowledging that Europe remains torn between three partially conflicting priorities that form a strategic triangle. At one corner sits climate ambition and electrification targets—sometimes stronger than targets for actually establishing the industry in Europe. At another corner is competitiveness: defending jobs and workplaces while becoming cost-competitive against Asia. The third corner involves trade policy and geopolitics: how open should Europe be, and should it introduce investment rules that some argue violate WTO principles and free trade?\n\"Europe is still a little bit at crossroads,\" von Dalwigk said. \"It is still not really clear which part of the triangle is really pulling the longest strength.\" She positioned the Industrial Accelerator Act at the center of these tensions, with batteries at the heart of it all.\nReCharge presentation slide. Photo credit: Battery Technology\nVon Dalwigk's assessment was neither defeatist nor naively optimistic. She presented a clear-eyed view of formidable challenges: entrenched Chinese advantages, Europe's structural cost disadvantages, political uncertainty, and the sheer difficulty of scaling advanced manufacturing. Yet her underlying message was equally clear: the game is not lost. Europe still has projects in the pipeline, continued investment interest, and emerging policy tools specifically designed to address the industry's pain points.\nThe window for action, however, is narrow. The next EU budget cycle will determine whether initiatives like the Battery Booster Facility become permanent fixtures or one-time experiments. Political decisions about combustion engine phase-outs and EV support will either provide the clear demand signals investors need or create further uncertainty. And Europe's willingness to implement industrial policy tools like the Accelerator Act—potentially facing WTO challenges—will test how seriously the continent takes its strategic autonomy.\n\"There is no doubt that the future is electric,\" von Dalwigk said, emphasizing that batteries are \"a key technology for most of the innovations that we see on the horizon.\" The question is whether that electric future will be built on European soil, with European workers and European intellectual property—or whether Europe will simply become a market for technology manufactured elsewhere. Von Dalwigk and the industry alliance she represents are pushing hard for the former, armed with a detailed plan and a realistic understanding of both the obstacles and the opportunities ahead.\nFor an industry that felt the sting of massive project cancellations and scaling setbacks, von Dalwigk's message offered something increasingly rare: a credible path forward, if Europe can muster the political will and policy coherence to follow it.\nMichael C. Anderson\nAs editor-in-chief of\nBattery Technology\n, Michael C. Anderson leads the brand’s coverage of advancements in battery technology as well as associated materials and manufacturing techniques across industries such as automotive/EVs, e-mobility, maritime, aerospace, medtech, and consumer electronics.\nMike is also a member of\nThe Battery Show North America Advisory Board\n, where he contributes his expertise to advising on industry trends and speaker selection for The Battery Show North America while helping to shape discussions on battery technology and electrification.\nBattery Technology\nsenior editor Maria Guerra De Egui are joint\n2025 Neal Award Winners\nin the category of \"Best Coverage of the 2024 Election on Your Served Market.\"\nMike was a recent guest journalist on the popular automotive-industry webcast, Autoline After Hours.\nMike has been covering manufacturing and transportation technology developments for more than 25 years. At SME (\nThe Society of Manufacturing Engineers\n), he served as lead editor of\nAerospace & Defense Manufacturing\n, lead editor of\nMedical Manufacturing\n, senior editor for\nManufacturing Engineering,\nand acting lead editor of\nSmart Manufacturing\n. He has also been senior editor of\nCutting Tool Engineering\n, senior technical editor of Gardener Business Media’s\nAutomotive Design & Production\n, PR manager at B2B advertising/PR agency G. Temple Associates, and editor at the SM Wu Manufacturing Research Center at the University of Michigan.\nThis all followed more than a decade of teaching English, ESL, literature, and argumentation as a lecturer at Eastern Michigan University (Ypsilanti, MI) and, for five years, at Sakura no Seibo Junior College (Fukushima, Japan).\nMike has a bachelor’s degree in English language and literature and a master’s degree in rhetoric and written communication from Eastern Michigan University.\nSee more from\nMichael C. Anderson"},{"t":"勘误表：可压缩流体界面处的细菌湍流 [物理学。莱特牧师。 136, 138301(2026)]","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/8fl3-19j8","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Yuanfeng Yin, Bokai Zhang, H. P. Zhang, and Shuo Guo[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 239901] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"Epic 喜加二：《战锤 40K：极速狂飙》《The Ouroboros King》游戏免费领取","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/217.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","b":"6 月 11 日消息，Epic 本周送出的游戏是《The Ouroboros King》《战锤 40K：极速狂飙》，下周送出的游戏是《深空梦里人》，《ROBOBEAT》。\n《The Ouroboros King》\n《Warhammer 40K Speed Freeks》\nIT之家附《The Ouroboros King》游戏简介：\nThe Ouroboros King 将象棋的战略深度与类 roguelike 的构建多样性和重玩性结合在一起。组建一支强大的军队，发现强力遗物，并购买令人惊讶的小工具以击败女巫会。\n建立终极军队：结合经典和新颖的象棋棋子、给予它们加成的遗物，以及提供你临时优势的可消耗物品，打造一支强大的军队。\n完善你的策略：每回合只能移动一枚棋子，因此你必须谨慎选择。让你的部队协同作战，彻底消灭敌军。\n另一个机会：如果你被击败，可以回到另一个时间线继续行动，那里的胜利之路将会改变：不同的地图、不同的敌人、不同的奖励…… 真正的 roguelike 精神。\nIT之家附《战锤 40K：极速狂飙》游戏简介：\n在战锤 40,000 宇宙中体验燃到爆炸的狂飙式战斗竞速！驾驶并改装越野车、坦克和直升机，掌握高阶移动技能与爆炸性武器。解锁装备、改装你的座驾并通过创意工坊与社区成员一起创造、分享、游玩定制地图！\n更快的速度。更多的达卡。加入 Speedwaaagh，在战火纷飞的赛道上冲刺，体验单人竞速、机器人对战或多人在线等多种游戏模式。\n证明你是死亡拉力赛中最快的小子。在一场融合了速度、狡诈和攻击的 8 对 8 战斗竞速中一路狂飙对决，全力冲刺夺取胜利。\n在杀戮车队中运用兽人战术，在团队保护己方践踏巨机的同时，伺机对敌人进行破坏，每场比赛都将演变成一场冲向终点的混乱厮杀。每种载具都有不同的驾驶特性，可以让玩家施展出多样技能、狡猾诡计以及凶残策略。\n当一切尘埃落定，你还可以借助包含 400 多种素材的强大关卡编辑器来打造专属于你的混乱世界。你可以通过单人创作或与好友实时合作的方式打造独一无二的赛道与战场，作品还可上传至创意工坊与大家分享，除此之外，你也可以在创意工坊下载其他社区成员的狂野之作。"},{"t":"人工抗氧化酶工程可增强缓解炎症性肠病的催化活性","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5317513?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Developing artificial antioxidases represents a promising strategy for treatment of oxidative‐stress‐related disorders; however, their practical application is often hindered by insufficient catalytic activity. Here, we report a dual‐cobalt coordinated phthalocyanine carboxylate derivative (biCoPc) as an efficient artificial antioxidase with markedly enhanced reactive oxygen species scavenging capability for the alleviation of inflammatory bowel disease (IBD). Experimental studies combined with theoretical calculations reveal that the extended π‐conjugation and π‐electron delocalization within the dimeric phthalocyanine framework, together with the protonation‐deprotonation dynamics of peripheral carboxyl groups, synergistically promote a potential proton‐coupled electron transfer process at the dual‐cobalt active sites. This architecture accelerates electron transfer kinetics and creates a favorable catalytic microenvironment. Consequently, biCoPc exhibits high catalytic superoxide dismutase‐like and glutathione peroxidase‐like activities, along with robust stability under harsh conditions. Notably, biCoPc demonstrates pronounced anti‐inflammatory efficacy, efficiently alleviating IBD symptoms at both the cellular level and animal models. This work provides mechanistic insights into the rational design of high‐performance artificial enzymes and broadens their potential for biomedical applications.","tp":"人工抗氧化酶","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究团队开发了双钴配位酞菁羧酸衍生物（biCoPc）作为高效人工抗氧化酶，显著增强了活性氧清除能力。实验证明biCoPc可有效缓解炎症性肠病（IBD），解决了人工抗氧化酶催化活性不足的实际应用瓶颈，为氧化应激相关疾病的催化治疗策略提供了新方案。"},{"t":"利用配位键工程设计仿生响应性聚合物","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01074H","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配位键响应聚合物","dp":1,"as":"该综述提出利用配位键（金属-配体配位）作为可工程化动态交联点，设计仿生响应性聚合物。配位键兼具可逆性与刺激敏感性，可将微弱、非均匀的环境信号（pH、光、机械力、化学物质）放大为宏观材料形变或性能切换，在软体机器人、药物控释、自修复材料等领域具有应用前景。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Engineering coordination bonds for bioinspired responsive polymers","b":"Responsive polymeric materials capable of converting weak and heterogeneous environmental cues into adaptive macroscopic functions are essential for emerging technologies spanning soft robotics, sensing, biointerfaces, and autonomous systems. Coordination-crosslinked polymer networks (CCPNs), constructed by embedding dynamic metal–ligand interactions into polymer matrices, have emerged as a powerful materials platform for this purpose, owing to the unique tunability, reversibility, and multifunctionality of coordination bonds. Unlike conventional covalent or other supramolecular crosslinks, coordination bonds provide continuously adjustable bond strength, well-defined geometry, stimulus-sensitive equilibria, and access to electronic, redox, and catalytic transitions, enabling direct transduction of physical and chemical stimuli into mechanical, optical, and morphological responses. Despite rapid progress, a unified understanding that links coordination chemistry at the molecular level to material responsiveness across length and time scales remains lacking. In this review, we systematically examine how the intrinsic properties of coordination bonds give rise to material responsiveness in CCPNs. We first introduce fundamental coordination chemistry concepts relevant to responsive network design and discuss how these factors govern bond dynamicity, exchange kinetics, and stimulus sensitivity within polymer networks. We then analyse how coordination dynamics manifest as macroscopic responses, with a focus on stiffness variation, optical and chromic switching, shape memory and actuation, and life-like homeostatic behaviors driven by non-equilibrium bond cycling. Moving beyond single-interaction systems, we highlight recent advances in bond coupling strategies, where multiple coordination motifs or coordination bonds integrated with other supramolecular bonds, dynamic covalent bonds, or mechanical bonds generate hierarchical relaxation, orthogonal responsiveness, and synergistic function expression reminiscent of biological materials. Finally, we discuss key challenges and outline future opportunities for transforming coordination chemistry from a crosslinking motif into a molecular-level control framework for engineering responsive and life-like soft materials."},{"t":"中美紧张局势阴影下的能源通胀：能源转型是通向稳定的途径吗？","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003563?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"未分类","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"中国国家排放交易计划实施的实证和经济见解：来自第一届政府的证据","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003599?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 的 IPO 静默期","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/the-information-finance/elon-musks-loud-ipo-quiet-period","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"轨道太阳反射镜的生态风险","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aeh6580?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"轨道太阳反射镜","as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":0.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Ecological risks of orbital solar reflectors"},{"t":"ENEROC USA成为BCI首家纯锂电电池成员企业","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/eneroc-usa-becomes-bcis-first-lithium-only-battery-member-company/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Batteries International","as":"ENEROC USA正式成为国际电池协会（BCI）历史上首家仅专注于锂电的成员企业，标志着电池行业组织从传统铅酸主导格局向锂电优先的重大转变。ENEROC USA专注于锂电池回收与资源循环业务，其加入BCI反映了锂电池在全球储能与动力电池市场中的主导地位持续巩固，也推动行业标准化与回收体系建设向锂电领域延伸。此举预计将促进锂电池全生命周期管理与产业链协同发展。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"锂电池会员企业","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"ENEROC USA becomes BCI’s first lithium-only battery member company – Batteries International","b":"Lead, Lithium, News\nENEROC USA becomes BCI’s first lithium-only battery member company\n–  June 11, 2026 12:56 pm BST\nENEROC USA has made history by becoming the first lithium-only battery manufacturer to join Battery Council International.\nThe battery firm’s CEO told\nBatteries International\non June 10 the move was a sign that lithium technology had matured enough to take its place within the broader conversation of power solutions driving electrification and energy transition.\nMembers of BCI, which celebrated its centenary in 2024, have traditionally focused on lead batteries, but the association increasingly includes flow, sodium, lithium ion and other emerging chemistries ― and the trade body said ENEROC’s membership is a natural step in that direction.\nENEROC’s membership also opens the door for other lithium specialists to become part of BCI’s platform of advocacy, education and industry collaboration.\nAccording to BCI, lithium shipments from BCI members increased 31% year-over-year in 2025, even as total North American battery volumes softened.\nLithium technology has moved well beyond early-adopter status into a recognised and established segment of the industrial battery market ― and the organisation’s membership is evolving to reflect that reality, the US trade body said.\nDifferent applications call for different solutions, and the battery industry has always understood this. Lead batteries remain essential across automotive, stationary, and industrial applications, and BCI’s member companies continue to drive innovation and sustainability in that space.\nLithium technology brings its own strengths to specific applications and BCI provides a platform for both to collaborate on the issues that matter to the entire industry ― safety, product integrity, sustainability and reliable power for the nation.\nBCI president and executive director Roger Miksad said: “In over a century, we have never had a battery manufacturer join whose business was built entirely on lithium technology.\n“BCI exists to represent the full breadth of the battery industry, and welcoming a lithium-only manufacturer strengthens our ability to represent the battery industry, advance safety standards, and support America’s energy security.”\nBatteries International\nlast month that BCI had held the inaugural meeting of its new sodium battery industry group, marking a significant milestone in the advancement of sodium ion battery tech in North America."},{"t":"爆炸法合成双原子催化剂","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3998491?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"爆炸法双原子催化剂","kp":["[合成方法]: 爆炸法构建不对称双原子催化剂","[活性位点]: 双金属不对称配对"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种通过爆炸合成策略制备双原子催化剂（DACs）的新方法。双原子催化剂因其双金属位点的协同效应在电催化反应中展现出优异性能，但传统制备方法存在金属团聚、产率低及可控性差等问题。研究利用爆炸过程中瞬间释放的高温高压环境，实现金属前驱体的快速原子级分散与锚定，一步合成均匀的双原子活性位点。该策略工艺简洁、可扩展性强，为高效催化剂的低成本规模化制备提供了新路径。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dual Atom Catalysts Through Explosion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Dual atom catalysts (DACs) have attracted extensive attention due to their synergistic effects in enhancing various catalytic reactions, opening up new research directions in the fields of chemistry and material science. Strategically, constructing bimetallic pairs with asymmetric active sites is a key strategy for further improving DACs performances. However, achieving the universal synthesis of a structurally controllable library for DACs supported on inorganic materials remains a significant challenge. In this work, we propose a general strategy for synthesizing asymmetric DACs (A‐DACs) through molecular explosion, which can transiently generate extreme conditions in a confined space, offering capabilities that are difficult to realize by conventional approaches. Using this technology, we successfully prepared and systematically characterized 15 kinds of\n                    A\n                    ‐DACs containing different metal combinations (Cu‐Fe, Cu‐Co, Fe‐Pt, Ni‐Cu, Pt‐Pd etc.) and loaded them onto different inorganic carriers (Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    , TiN, TiO\n                    2\n                    , CeO\n                    2\n                    , MoS\n                    2\n                    , etc.). Moreover, Cu\n                    1\n                    Fe\n                    1\n                    /Ti\n                    3\n                    C\n                    2\n                    T\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    and Pt\n                    1\n                    Pd\n                    1\n                    /MoS\n                    2\n                    are selected as model catalysts to investigate their worthwhile applications in diverse electrochemical reactions. This study provides an ingenious method for the rational design of atomic dispersed catalysts, which is of great significance in the fields of energy conversion and environmental governance scenarios.","aip":1},{"t":"Drp1驱动的巩膜线粒体碎片促进近视发展","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511427123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The global epidemic of myopia constitutes a growing public health concern worldwide. Myopia development is characterized by pathological scleral remodeling through fibroblast-myofibroblast transdifferentiation (FMT) and extracellular matrix (ECM) degradation. Since myopia is progressive, the development of sustainable and safe preventive interventions is imperative. While mitochondrial dynamics critically regulate fibrotic processes in other organs, their role in scleral homeostasis has remained unexplored. Here, we identify pathological mitochondrial fragmentation, caused by increased mitochondrial fission, as a key driver of myopia progression. Using two mammalian animal models, we demonstrate that both genetic and pharmacological enhancement of mitochondrial fission (inducing mitochondrial fragmentation) exacerbates collagen loss and accelerates axial elongation, whereas genetic and pharmacological inhibition of mitochondrial fission prevents collagen degradation and attenuates myopia progression. Hypoxia-induced FMT in cultured human scleral fibroblasts (HSFs) requires activation of mitochondrial fission, revealing overproduction of reactive oxygen species (ROS) as the downstream effector on HSFs and in both animal models. Our multilevel analyses identify the mitochondrial fission-ROS axis as a key pathway linking scleral hypoxia to ECM remodeling. Lycopene, a naturally occurring carotenoid antioxidant, significantly attenuated scleral ROS levels and was found suitable for long-term application, highlighting its potential as a therapeutic agent for myopia control. Collectively, these findings have identified a therapeutic target and agent for controlling myopia progression.","tp":"近视线粒体","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究揭示了近视发展的一种全新细胞机制，指出全球近视流行是一个紧迫的公共卫生问题。近视的特征是巩膜发生病理性重塑，涉及成纤维细胞向肌成纤维细胞转分化（FMT）和细胞外基质（ECM）降解。研究发现，由Drp1驱动的巩膜线粒体碎片化在上述纤维化过程中起关键调节作用。这表明靶向线粒体动力学可能是开发安全、可持续的近视干预策略的重要新途径。"},{"t":"怀疑托马斯","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01718-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Family ties. Family ties."},{"t":"双面机械互锁实现柔性软硬导电界面，创纪录高韧性","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73649?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性导电界面","kp":["[界面策略]: 双面机械互锁","[特性]: 柔性电子高韧性导电界面"],"as":"研究提出双面机械互锁策略，解决聚合物电极与金属元件之间因物性不匹配导致的界面结合脆弱问题，构建出兼具柔性与刚性的导电界面。该方法有望推动柔性电子、可穿戴器件与软体机器人在材料连接可靠性上的工程化突破。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Double‐Sided Mechanical Interlocking Enables Soft‐Rigid Conductive Interfaces With a Record High Toughness for Flexible ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The pronounced mismatch between polymeric electrodes and metallic components hinders the formation of robust electrical contacts. While most approaches rely on chemical design to strengthen interfacial interactions, we present a double‐sided mechanical interlocking strategy that provides both stability and adaptability. A conductive fabric scaffold bridges polymers and metals, with adhesives sequentially applied to both sides. The adhesive infiltrates and encapsulates scaffold fibers, forming a thread–hole adhesion that can only be disrupted by bulk failure. This mechanism achieves a record high interfacial toughness of 730 J m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    between conductive elastomer and copper using commercial silver pastes. Peeling tests show delamination occurs between silver paste and copper, indicating even higher toughness could be obtained with better‐performing products of conductive adhesive. Notably, the interface stability surpasses that of the electrode itself, remaining intact even when the electrode fails. The design is broadly compatible with elastomeric or hydrogel matrices and with diverse commercial adhesives. It enables the construction of reliable epidermal electronics and hydrogel‐based devices. Overall, this interlocking strategy provides a versatile platform for integrating soft and rigid conductors in hybrid electronic systems."},{"t":"DoorDash推出对话式AI助手","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/doordash-launches-conversational-ai-assistant","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"the information","as":"外卖配送平台DoorDash推出对话式AI助手，用户可通过自然语言对话完成点餐与推荐。此举标志着本地生活服务平台加速将大语言模型嵌入交易流程，以提升交互效率与个性化体验，进一步加剧行业AI竞争。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"对话式AI助手","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":7.5},"ot":"DoorDash Launches Conversational AI Assistant","b":"DoorDash Launches Conversational AI Assistant — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"激动性神经毒素对人类 Nav1.6 的不同结合姿势","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10661-x","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Voltage-gated sodium (Nav) channels are key targets of various venomous toxins. Deciphering the binding poses and mechanisms of action of representative toxins will help to dissect the functional mechanism of the channels and facilitate therapeutic development targeting Nav channels1,2. Here we present cryo-electron microscopy (cryo-EM) structures of distinct binding poses of three agonistic peptide toxins on the human Nav1.6–β1 channel complex. The globular β-scorpion toxin Cn2 nestles between the extracellular segment of voltage-sensing domain (VSD) in the second repeat of the Nav1.6 core α-unit (VSDII) and the pore extracellular loops in the third repeat of the Nav1.6 core α-unit (ECLIII), where it is stabilized by interactions with both protein regions and the branched N1372-glycan. Cone snail ι-conotoxin RXIA adopts an elongated conformation, spanning VSDI and VSDIV to wrap around the shoulder of the pore domain (PD). The bullet ant-derived toxin δ-paraponeritoxin-Pc1a exists as a transmembrane helix that stands between VSDII and PDIII. Our findings, corroborated by functional characterizations, illustrate the diversity in peptide toxin binding poses and mechanisms of action, link stabilization of the up state of VSDI or VSDII to channel activation, and provide clues to the rational design of selective Nav channel modulators.","tp":"神经毒素","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"电压门控钠离子（Nav）通道是多种神经毒素的关键作用靶点。该研究解析了三种激动性多肽毒素与人类Nav1.6-β1通道复合物的冷冻电镜结构，揭示了毒素截然不同的结合姿态和作用机制。例如，球状的β蝎毒素Cn2嵌入特定的结构域之间。这些发现不仅有助于深入剖析Nav通道的功能机理，也为针对该通道的靶向药物开发与疾病治疗提供了重要的结构生物学基础。"},{"t":"氮循环的不同轨迹","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei3391?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Water isotope measurements are used to model surface water nitrogen flows on a continental scale"},{"t":"氮循环沿景观水速梯度的发散演化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aed0399?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Increasing fertilization has pushed the nitrogen cycle beyond planetary boundaries, yet its fate remains uncertain owing to long-standing neglect of landscape water velocities in nitrogen models. Leveraging isotope-aided modeling across 3821 European catchments, we demonstrate that evolution of nitrogen cycling is strongly linked to shifts in landscape water velocities since 1980. We propose the concept of “wetness boundaries,” where hydrological transitions beyond boundaries amplify nitrogen accumulation and leaching, whereas conditions remaining within boundaries mitigate these processes. Applying this framework, we project reduced nitrogen leaching across 76% of Europe under mild hydrological shifts by 2100 but increasing nitrogen accumulation under pronounced deceleration of water cycling in Eastern and Southern Europe. These findings underscore emerging water quality risks under climate change and the need to mitigate extreme hydrological shifts.","tp":"氮循环演化","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":8.0,"t":5.0},"as":"持续施肥使全球氮循环突破行星边界，但因模型长期忽略景观水流速，氮的去向仍不确定。研究利用3821个欧洲流域的同位素辅助模型，证明自1980年以来氮循环演化与景观水流速变化密切相关。研究提出\"湿度边界\"概念，发现水文状态跨越边界会放大氮积累，为流域氮管理提供了新理论框架。"},{"t":"不同的基因组结构，但相同的基因是植物超基因趋同进化的基础","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec1996?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Evolution reflects a balance between innovation and constraint, often repurposing existing components in new contexts. Convergent evolution exemplifies this interplay, with similar traits evolving independently in different species, yet the genomic mechanisms enabling this repeatability remain poorly understood. Here, by analyzing 10 chromosome-scale genome assemblies, including seven newly generated, we found that the\n                    S\n                    -locus supergene (a cluster of tightly linked genes controlling a floral dimorphism called distyly) arose independently multiple times within the primrose family, Darwin’s iconic system for studying distyly. In each case, the same gene was independently duplicated and co-opted. However, the resulting genomic architectures differed, ranging from hemizygous (present on one chromosome copy) to heterozygous (on both copies), challenging the prevailing view that hemizygosity is intrinsic to\n                    S\n                    -loci and suggesting alternative evolutionary routes to distyly supergene formation. By uncovering multiple mechanisms for supergene origins, our work shows how convergent evolution can produce similar phenotypes by reusing the same genetic building blocks while exploring distinct genomic configurations.","tp":"超基因进化","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"趋同进化展现了生物在不同物种中独立演化出相似特征的现象。该研究通过分析10个染色体级别的基因组，深入探讨了控制植物自交不亲和性的S位点超基因的进化机制。结果显示，尽管不同植物物种在趋同进化中表现出相似的自交不亲和性状，且其基础基因保持一致，但它们演化出了截然不同的基因组结构排列方式。这为理解生物创新的基因组机制与进化限制提供了新视角。"},{"t":"不同的氧化还原酶协调吲哚噻吩骨架的形成和 N-羟基化介导的生物活化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7072895?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Microbial sulfur‐containing secondary metabolite thienodolin (\n                    1\n                    ) features a unique tricyclic thieno[2,3‐\n                    b\n                    ]indole scaffold, yet its biosynthesis has remained enigmatic. Here, we uncover an unexpected enzymatic logic in which a consortium of distinct oxidoreductases cooperatively orchestrates indolethiophene skeleton formation and subsequent bioactivation, ultimately generating the authentic antibacterial metabolite thienoxidolin (\n                    10\n                    ). Following thiotryptophan formation by SDR enzyme TndE, the heme‐dependent DUF6875 enzyme TndD initiates C–S bond formation via\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation to yield a dearomatized tricyclic species, which is efficiently driven forward and stabilized by aromatization catalyzed by the FAD‐dependent oxidoreductase TndG. Notably, TndD functions as a bidirectional redox enzyme, reverting the\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxyl group to the stable N–H form to complete the indolethiophene scaffold construction. After amide formation, late‐stage\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation by the cytochrome P450 enzyme TndC, previously misassigned as the C–S bond‐forming enzyme, produces the bioactive product\n                    10\n                    . Intriguingly, TndD may also mediate the deactivation of\n                    10\n                    back to\n                    1\n                    , representing an intrinsic self‐protection mechanism. Together, these results expand the catalytic repertoire of heme‐dependent enzymes and highlight reversible\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation as a pivotal strategy for heterocycle formation and bioactivity regulation in microbial secondary metabolism.","tp":"酶催化合成","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"微生物含硫次级代谢产物thienodolin具有独特的三环噻吩并吲哚骨架，其生物合成机制长期不明。研究揭示了一组不同的氧化还原酶以意外协作方式，共同调控吲哚噻吩骨架的形成及随后的N-羟基化介导生物活化过程。该发现拓展了含硫天然产物生物合成的酶学逻辑认知，对天然药物开发具有启示。"},{"t":"新形成的少突胶质细胞中 TFEB 信号传导和自噬的破坏导致中枢神经系统髓磷脂的异常生成","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528668123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Myelin is a defining feature of the vertebrate nervous system, yet the cellular and molecular mechanisms governing its integrity remain poorly understood. Here, using volume electron microscopy and a knock-in mouse line targeting newly formed oligodendrocytes, we reconstruct early optic nerve myelination and examine retinal ganglion cell axon ensheathment. We observe that newly formed myelin sheaths exhibit membrane protrusions and occasional degenerative myelin “whorls.” Conditional disruption of the transcription factor EB (TFEB)-autophagy pathway in newly formed oligodendrocytes significantly increases the abundance of these aberrant myelin structures, indicating that this pathway is required for proper myelin formation and integrity. Importantly, this pathway acts independently of the well-established function of TFEB that represses myelin sheath growth. Together, our findings identify a role for TFEB-dependent autophagy in establishing proper myelin structure during development, providing insights into the oligodendrocyte-intrinsic mechanisms that regulate myelin integrity.","tp":"髓鞘异常","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"髓鞘对脊椎动物神经系统至关重要，但其完整性维持机制尚不完全清楚。该研究利用体积电子显微镜和基因敲入小鼠模型，重构了视神经早期髓鞘形成过程。研究观察到新生髓鞘存在膜突触和退化的髓鞘“涡旋”。在新生少突胶质细胞中条件性破坏TFEB信号传导和自噬后，会导致中枢神经系统髓鞘生成严重异常，证明了自噬系统在确保早期髓鞘正确包裹与维持正常形态中的关键作用。"},{"t":"通过 TCF7L2/LEF1 结合特异性的差异 Wnt/β-连环蛋白信号传导塑造细胞和肿瘤表型","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528450123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The mechanisms by which Wnt/β-catenin signaling regulates gene expression in a tissue- and context-specific manner remain poorly understood, limiting our ability to target the aberrant cell growth typical of many Wnt-driven cancers. Here, we focus on malignant liver tumors driven by activating\n                    CTNNB1\n                    (β-catenin) mutations that nevertheless display distinct phenotypic states and Wnt outputs. By profiling patient-derived organoids via single-cell transcriptomics and chromatin dynamics, we identify subtype-specific transcriptional and epigenetic profiles. Using CUT&amp;RUN, we show that β-catenin engages distinct genomic regions, dictated by differential association with TCF/LEF family transcription factors. Specifically, we define a sequence-specific regulatory element engaged by β-catenin only upon interaction with TCF7L2, revealing that partner choice, independent of\n                    CTNNB1\n                    mutational status, ultimately determines cell fate. Our findings, validated across multiple tumor models and patient tissues, offer a framework for understanding how differential β-catenin-TCF/LEF interaction orchestrates context-specific Wnt signaling outcomes."},{"t":"从妊娠晚期胎盘中提取人滋养层干细胞的稳健方法的开发及其应用","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537884123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Trophoblasts are multifunctional cells in the placenta and essential for normal pregnancy. Although trophoblast dysfunction can cause pregnancy complications, the underlying mechanisms remain unclear, and effective treatments are limited, partly because of the scarcity of appropriate experimental models. We previously reported the derivation of human trophoblast stem cells (hTSCs) from 1st-trimester placentas and blastocysts, providing a powerful tool to investigate human trophoblast development and function. However, the difficulty in deriving hTSCs from late-gestation placentas has limited their application to pregnancy complication research. Here we report a robust technique to derive hTSCs from term placentas based on the transient expression of a p53 dominant negative mutant, SALL4, and shRNAs against cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitors. Using this technique, we derived and characterized hTSCs from placentas obtained from patients with early-onset preeclampsia (PE). PE-derived hTSCs exhibit impaired trophoblast invasion and reduced placental growth factor secretion, consistent with trophoblast abnormalities reported in PE. Therefore, this study provides a technological basis for investigating pregnancy complications associated with trophoblast dysfunction."},{"t":"在等离子体Au/NbS2异质结构中构建金属-半金属过渡金属二硫族化物界面以增强性能","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71184?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"等离子体光电制氢","kp":["[光电极]: Au纳米颗粒修饰NbS2纳米片","[应用]: 等离子增强光电催化制氢"],"dp":1,"as":"研究在等离子体Au/NbS2异质结构中构建了金属-半金属过渡金属硫族化合物界面，旨在开发高效且低成本的光电极材料。该设计对推动太阳能驱动的光电化学应用具有重要意义，为新型异质结光电器件的工程化提供了新思路。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Developing Metal–Semimetallic Transition Metal Dichalcogenide Interfaces in Plasmonic Au/NbS2 Heterostructures for Enhan","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The development of cost‐effective and highly‐efficient photoelectrodes (PE) is critical for advancing solar driven photoelectrochemical (PEC) hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) production technologies. For enhancing PEC performance, it appears promising to combine plasmonic nanoparticles with active catalysts. Here we report a facile and powerful PE comprised of Au nanoparticles (NP) decorated on NbS\n                    2\n                    nanoflakes (NF), directly grown on the carbon fiber paper. In this heterostructure, Au NP acts as plasmonic antennas that intensify local electromagnetic fields strengthening light matter interactions, NbS\n                    2\n                    NF functions as a highly conductive semimetal scaffold offering abundant active HER sites, and the junction of Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF enables efficient charge separation and fast electron transfer from NbS\n                    2\n                    to Au, thereby synergistically accelerating HER kinetics under illumination. Consequently, this Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF heterostructure, for the first time, demonstrates remarkable PEC performance under illumination, such as a 6‐fold increase in the exchange current density, a 1.75‐fold reduction in overpotential, and a 2.45‐fold yield in the H\n                    2\n                    production, respectively. Based on the heterostructure of Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF, this work establishes a strategy of constructing a cost‐effective and highly‐efficient PE and providing valuable insights into the rational design of next generation PE for the sustainable hydrogen production.","aip":1},{"t":"通过深度神经网络确定重离子碰撞中可观测量的方向依赖性","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6dtk-1tw2","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Zu-Xing Yang, Xiao-Hua Fan, Peng-Hui Chen, and Shunji NishimuraWe simulate ultracentral collisions (impact parameter vector $|\\stackrel{⃗}{b}|[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064604] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"深度学习揭示历史人为强迫下 ENSO 的可预测性增强","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec9518?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","b":"Understanding how ENSO predictability responds to climate change is essential for improving future climate projections. In this study, we apply a deep learning model—convolutional neural network with a leave-one-out model strategy to Coupled Model Intercomparison Project Phase 6 (CMIP6) historical and preindustrial control simulations. We find that El Niño–Southern Oscillation (ENSO) predictability is statistically enhanced by 14.0 ± 1.8% enhancement under historical anthropogenic forcing. This improvement is linked to changes in key ocean-atmosphere feedbacks. Under historical forcing, the equatorial Pacific shows a shoaling of the thermocline. As a result, the surface ocean becomes more sensitive to wind forcing, and subsurface temperature becomes more responsive to thermocline variations. These processes strengthen the three-dimensional advective and thermocline feedbacks, which together enhance ENSO predictability. These findings highlight the importance of anthropogenic forcing in shaping ENSO predictability in a warming climate."},{"t":"深度学习人类迁徙的四十年","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10611-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Human migration is a fundamental driver of global demographic change, shaping population structure, labour markets and social policy across countries1,2,3. Although long-term migration patterns are often linked to economic development4, they can shift rapidly in response to shocks such as conflict, environmental crises and political change5. Despite its importance, migration remains difficult to measure consistently: existing data are sparse, concentrated in high-income settings and are fragmented across incompatible definitions, temporal resolutions and data types6,7,8. Past efforts have relied on partial datasets, including flow records, stock estimates and model-based reconstructions with limited coverage9,10,11,12,13,14. A central challenge is therefore to construct a globally consistent, high-resolution account of migration flows over time. Here we present a new dataset of annual origin-destination migration across 230 countries and regions from 1990 to the present, integrating diverse data sources into a unified modelling framework. By combining official statistics, census-based stocks, net migration estimates and past flow reconstructions, our approach produces temporally detailed and spatially comprehensive estimates that substantially extend existing resources. Using an ensemble of deep recurrent neural networks informed by geographic, economic, cultural and political covariates, we capture both persistent trends and short-term responses to changing conditions—all while propagating uncertainty to generate confidence bounds. Our results outperform existing five-year flow estimates on held-out data and provide finer temporal resolution, revealing previously obscured dynamics in global migration patterns. This framework highlights regions in which uncertainty remains high and data collection is most urgently needed. By releasing all data, code and trained models, we provide a transparent and reproducible foundation for future work. These advances enable a more timely and detailed understanding of human mobility, with implications for research and policy in an increasingly dynamic global system."},{"t":"用于高温摩擦电传感和电磁屏蔽的柔性聚合物薄膜的解耦与从头设计","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73667?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高温摩擦电薄膜","kp":["[器件设计]: 解耦电荷产生与收集","[应用]: 高温摩擦电传感与电磁屏蔽"],"dp":1,"as":"研究通过解耦策略全新设计了柔性聚合物薄膜，用于高温环境下的摩擦电传感应用。基于聚合物的摩擦纳米发电机在微能源收集和主动传感领域前景广阔，该工作解决了高温条件下材料性能不稳定的瓶颈，拓展了TENG器件在极端环境中的应用边界。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Decoupling and De Novo Design of Flexible Polymeric Films for High‐Temperature Triboelectric Sensing and Electromagnetic","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymer‐based triboelectric nanogenerators (TENGs) are shining in fields of micro‐energy harvesting and active sensing by virtue of their flexibility and processability. However, thermionic emission and thermal deformation reduce triboelectric output and distort sensing signals, thereby limiting practical applications in high‐temperature environments. Herein, the charge generation and collection units of polymeric TENGs are decoupled for separate\n                    de novo\n                    design. A dipolar glass polymer, cardo poly(aryl ether) (CPAE), is synthesized with alternating pendant and main‐chain dipoles and bulky, rigid cardo substituent. Aromatic polyphenol‐anchored MXene nanosheets are subsequently crosslinked and sandwiched within thermostable CPAE films, which improves resistance to high‐temperature oxidation. Thanks to the interlayer modulation of MXenes, the total and absorption electromagnetic shielding effectiveness of the resulting film rises by 55% and 195% compared to pristine MXene films, respectively. Even after annealing at 250°C for 24 h, the shielding effectiveness decreases by only ∼1.5%. Moreover, the resulting TENG exhibits an unusual heat‐induced triboelectric enhancement, with an output voltage of 472.2 ± 0.9 V and a power density of 2250.6 ± 27.7 mW/m\n                    2\n                    at 250°C, which compares favorably with most reported polymer‐based TENGs. This work provides a novel technical pathway for flexible electromagnetic protection and self‐powered sensing under extreme operating conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"张拉整体超材料的解耦非易失性预应力编程实现持久力学功能","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00233-X?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"张拉整体超材料","kp":["[机制]: 湿度编程预应力+机械锁存","[特性]: 非易失性力学状态记忆"],"as":"受河豚启发的张拉整体超材料平台利用湿度编程内部预应力，实现持久稳定的机械性能调控。该非易失性预应力编程方法使超材料能在环境刺激下主动改变力学行为，为智能材料、软体机器人和自适应结构设计提供了仿生学新范式。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Decoupled and non-volatile prestress programming of tensegrity metamaterials enables persistent mechanical function","b":"Yu et al. develop a pufferfish-inspired tensegrity platform that uses humidity to program internal prestress and a mechanical lock to store it as non-volatile memory. Once set, the structure maintains its mechanical state without continuous energy input, enabling persistent functions including timed release, impact protection, and adaptive load bearing.","aip":1},{"t":"解码质子陶瓷膜：用于快速材料筛选和电池设计的代数模型","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007671?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子陶瓷膜电池设计","kp":["建模方法[质子陶瓷膜]: 代数模型快速选材"],"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Decoding protonic ceramic membranes: An algebraic model for rapid material selection and cell design"},{"t":"黑暗多样性框架解决了达尔文关于淡水鱼入侵的归化难题","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604929123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The spread of invasive species poses a major threat to global biodiversity, yet predicting successful establishment of exotic species in novel environments remains challenging. Darwin’s naturalization conundrum is a longstanding debate over whether exotic species closely or distantly related to native communities are more likely to succeed. Despite its long history, empirical studies continue to yield conflicting evidence. Here, we introduce the dark diversity concept, which refers to species that could theoretically inhabit a site but are currently absent. Combined with observed diversity, dark diversity integrates information on the potential diversity (site-specific species pool size) of the resident community and how completely that pool is locally present (community completeness). Analyzing a 340-y record of successful and failed fish introductions across 516 Swedish lakes, we showed that the effect of phylogenetic relatedness on invasion outcome depends on dark diversity context. Exotics closely related to resident species were more likely to establish in communities with smaller species pools and higher completeness, whereas phylogenetically distant exotic species were more successful in communities with larger species pools and lower completeness. Models with observed species richness obtained considerably less support. Thus, integrating the dark diversity framework clarifies the contrasting effects of phylogenetic relatedness on invasion outcomes, and helps reconcile this 160-y-old conundrum."},{"t":"每日简报：古代地松鼠的饮食方式就像“更新世的僵尸”","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01878-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Evidence from fossilized poo reveals the diverse diet of ancient ground squirrels. Plus, the science behind the peptide craze and our innate tendency to wander anticlockwise. Evidence from fossilized poo reveals the diverse diet of ancient ground squirrels. Plus, the science behind the peptide craze and our innate tendency to wander anticlockwise."},{"t":"钙钛矿光伏器件的结晶路径优化和高指数晶面稳定化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73663?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿结晶优化","kp":["[结晶调控]: 纤维素大分子动力学分段结晶","[稳定化]: 高指数晶面"],"as":"研究针对钙钛矿太阳能电池在功率转换效率与稳定性之间的核心矛盾，通过结晶路径优化和高指数面稳定化策略提升器件性能。钙钛矿光伏技术面临的关键挑战是同时实现高效率和长期稳定性，该工作从晶体生长调控角度提供了系统性的解决方案。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Crystallization Pathway Optimization and High‐Index Facet Stabilization for Perovskite Photovoltaics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Perovskite solar cells (PSCs) face a critical challenge in balancing high power conversion efficiency (PCE) with operational stability, largely governed by the crystallization kinetics and facet configuration of perovskite films. Here, we report a kinetically segmented crystallization strategy mediated by a conformationally preorganized macromolecular regulator, cellulose 2,4,6‐trichlorophenylcarbamate (3Cl‐NC). Through multidentate coordination, 3Cl‐NC establishes localized precursor‐rich microenvironments that promote heterogeneous nucleation. During thermal annealing, this association transitions into a thermally activated dynamic coordination state that retards long‐range precursor transport while maintaining local availability for controlled crystal growth. This segmented regulation suppresses metastable δ‐phase accumulation and facilitates photoactive α‐phase formation. Furthermore, 3Cl‐NC thermodynamically stabilizes the high‐Miller‐index (210) orientation, establishing a synergistic architecture that intrinsically enhances lattice structural stability. Consequently, the resulting perovskite films exhibit higher phase purity, relieved residual stress, and suppressed ion migration, enabling devices to achieve a champion PCE of 26.59% (certified 26.29%) with improved long‐term stability."},{"t":"${\\mathrm{NiPS}}_{3}$ 中的晶体场调谐自旋翻转发光","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/7y26-3skd","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Léonard Schué, Nashra Pistawala, Hebatalla Elnaggar, Yannick Klein, Christophe Bellin, Johan Biscaras, Fausto Sirotti, Yves Lassailly, Fabian Cadiz, Luminita Harnagea, and Abhay ShuklaLayered magnetic materials provide the opportunity for fundamental investigations of magnetism in the two-dimensional limit. ${\\mathrm{NiPS}}_{3}$, a prototype member of this family, is antiferromagnetic below 155 K and exhibits sharp photoluminescence associated with a transition between a triplet …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236401] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026","tp":"二维磁性材料","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"层状磁性材料NiPS₃是研究二维极限磁性的原型体系，在155K以下呈反铁磁性，并表现出与三重态间跃迁相关的尖锐光致发光。研究揭示了晶体场对自旋翻转发光的调谐机制，为探索低维磁性材料中自旋-光耦合现象及自旋相关光电子学应用提供了基础认知。"},{"t":"能源和环境政策在碳减排方面的成本效益协同：来自中国钢铁和钢铁行业的证据","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003551?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/黑色金属/钢铁","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"钢铁碳减排","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.5},"as":""},{"t":"更正：硼氢化物氧化作为还原电合成中的对电极反应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1331602?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硼氢化物电合成","dp":1,"as":"本文为勘误更正声明，针对此前发表的论文《硼氢化物氧化作为还原电合成中的对电极反应》（Angewandte Chemie）进行内容修正。该声明本身不包含新的研究内容或技术发现。","sc":0.6,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":0.0,"r":0.0,"d":0.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Correction to “Borohydride Oxidation as Counter Reaction in Reductive Electrosynthesis”","b":"J. Kuzmin, M. Lill, G. Ahumada, et al., “Borohydride Oxidation as Counter Reaction in Reductive Electrosynthesis”, Angewandte Chemie International Edition 64 (2025): e202501653, https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202501653. During post-publication review, we identified the following errors that we wish to correct: Cross-references to reference 55 for the yields reported using Method A and reference 63 for yields reported for Method K are missing. Note b in the caption for Figure 2 should refer to isolated yields, whereas note c refers to yield determined by GC. In the caption for Figure 3, note a should refer to yield determined by HPLC, and the current note c should be removed. The original Supporting Information file was replaced with a corrected version in which the 1H- and 13C-NMR spectra for compound 2c were replaced with the correct versions. We wish to emphasize that none of these corrections affect the scientific conclusions, narrative, or integrity of the published work. All key findings and interpretations remain unchanged. We apologize for this error."},{"t":"硫化聚苯胺中铜调控的d-p-π多轨道耦合实现水系硫电池超长循环","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00230-4?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系硫电池正极","kp":["[耦合机制]: d-p-π多轨道耦合铜修饰硫化聚苯胺","[电池体系]: 水系硫-Zn软包电池"],"as":"研究通过铜调控的d-p-π多轨道耦合策略，使硫化聚苯胺实现超长循环水系电池。硫基电池因反应动力学缓慢和稳定性差等问题严重受限，该工作通过引入铜调控多轨道电子耦合机制，显著改善了正极材料的电化学性能，为安全廉价的水系储能提供了新路径。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Copper-tailored d-p-π multi-orbital coupling in sulfurized polyaniline enables ultralong cycling aqueous sulfur batterie","b":"The practical application of sulfur-based batteries is severely limited by factors such as slow reaction kinetics and structural collapse. This work successfully constructs a highly conductive and stable copper-modified sulfide polyaniline cathode by introducing d-p-π multi-orbital coupling using copper. Coupled with a Zn anode, the pouch cell delivers stable power output under harsh conditions, offering a new orbital engineering route for durable sulfur-based batteries."},{"t":"卷积神经网络用于非侵入式负荷监测：批判性分析与未来方向","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007877?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"负荷监测CNN","kp":["方法[非侵入负荷监测]: 卷积神经网络"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.5,"t":2.0},"ot":"Convolutional neural networks for non-intrusive load monitoring: a critical analysis and future directions"},{"t":"在纳米流体黏土膜中构建连续层间氢键网络以实现快速阳离子传导和阴离子选择","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73660?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米流体粘土膜","kp":["[膜工程]: 层间连续氢键网络","[功能]: 抗溶胀+快速阳离子传导","[应用]: 渗透能收集"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出在二维黏土纳米流体膜中构建连续层间氢键网络的新策略，以提升渗透能收集效率。该膜材料利用盐度梯度实现可持续蓝色能源发电，此前受限于离子传输效率不足。氢键网络的引入显著改善了层间离子选择性传导，为高效盐差能转换与新型纳米流体器件设计提供了关键材料基础。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Constructing Continuous Interlayer Hydrogen‐Bond Network in Nanofluidic Clay Membranes for Fast Cation Conduction and An","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Two‐dimensional clay nanofluidic membranes hold great promise for harvesting sustainable osmotic energy, yet their practical application is constrained by two core challenges. (1) The inherently tortuous and inefficient ion transport pathways within stacked nanosheet structures limit cation flux, and (2) the severe swelling of interlayer nanochannels in aqueous environments impairs ion selectivity and long‐term stability. To simultaneously tackle these challenges, we construct a continuous hydrogen‐bond network within the interlayer of a lamellar membrane (CHM) via a sequential crosslinking strategy. This engineered network serves a dual function: (1) establishing low‐energy barrier pathways to facilitate cation transport while (2) acting as a dynamic yet robust crosslinked matrix to anchor clay nanosheets for suppressing interlayer expansion. Experimental and theoretical results confirm that the negatively charged surface, in synergy with the hydrogen‐bond network, enables selective and rapid cation transport. The ionic conductivity of in‐plane transport reaches as high as 22 S m\n                    −1\n                    in 1 \n                    m\n                    electrolyte. When employed for osmotic energy harvesting from artificial seawater and river water, the CHM delivers an impressive high‐power density of 22.7 W m\n                    −2\n                    and maintains stable power output for over 30 days. Furthermore, an integrated osmotic power generator successfully drives multiple electronic devices, demonstrating its real‐world applicability."},{"t":"环向旋转托卡马克等离子体中测地声模与带状流的一致动力学","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae72a3","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","as":"研究系统阐述了托卡马克装置中环向旋转等离子体条件下测地声模（GAM）与带状流的一致动力学行为。实验观测到的GAM频谱特征，如调制行为与色散关系，与理论模型高度吻合。该成果深化了对聚变等离子体湍流自调节机制的理解，对磁约束聚变装置中湍流输运控制与等离子体约束优化具有基础性意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"地声模与带状流","kp":["研究对象[托卡马克]: 测地声模与带状流","方法: 流体模型"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Consistent dynamics of geodesic acoustic modes and zonal flows in toroidally rotating tokamak plasmas","b":"The experimentally observed features of the spectra of the geodesic acoustic modes (GAMs) in tokamaks, such as GAM’s modulation, peak splitting, intermittency and other, have no satisfactory explanations within the framework of standard theory. To fill in this gap, the fluid model, which describes the consistent dynamics of the GAMs and low-frequency zonal flow (ZF), is developed. The linear approximation of the model exhibits two eigenmodes of vastly different frequencies, GAM and ZF, while the nonlinearity results in a much richer spectral pattern, which qualitatively corresponds to the experimental observations."},{"t":"证实寒武纪大爆发期间存在苔藓虫动物","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01753-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Bryozoans are marine invertebrates that live in colonies and have long been considered absent from the Cambrian explosion — a rapid evolutionary event that began around 538 million years ago. Newly discovered fossils from the Cambrian period reveal that the bryozoan phylum had already diversified by this time. Fossils of two forms of bryozoans show evidence of soft tissue still preserved inside their mineralized skeletons."},{"t":"复合气候事件威胁热带半封闭海洋生态系统","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adv0367?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Anthropogenic ocean warming affects ecosystem functioning but is not necessarily the primary climate driver regulating tropical seas. Tropical semi-enclosed marine ecosystems are poorly understood, geographically distinct, and influenced by compounding impacts from global warming, cyclones, monsoons, freshwater influx, and massive sea-level and circulation variability. We unify climate risk understanding of these large-scale integrated ocean-atmosphere-biological systems, showing that compound climate events expose resident species to larger, prolonged fluctuations, causing reconfigured spatial patterns and lack of sustained hydrological connectivity. We attribute changes in species’ abundance in these systems to complex and cumulative combinations of extreme temperatures, exposure, turbidity, and hydrologic connections. We describe evidence of such climate-induced physical and biological regime shifts in tropical marine ecosystems in northern Australia and identify implications for other systems."},{"t":"紧凑溶剂化实现亚分钟级钠离子存储：数据驱动视角","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73658?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠离子快充","kp":["[快充特性]: 亚分钟级钠离子充电","[方法]: 数据驱动电解质设计"],"as":"本研究从数据驱动视角揭示了钠离子电池实现极速充电(XFC)的新机制——紧凑溶剂化结构。通过调控电解液的溶剂化鞘层，使钠离子在电极界面快速脱溶剂化并嵌入，实现亚分钟级储能响应。该策略为低成本钠离子电池在快充场景下与锂离子电池竞争提供了理论依据和工程路径，对大规模储能与智能技术时代的高功率电池需求具有重要意义。","sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Compact Solvation Enables Sub‐Minute Sodium‐Ion Storage: A Data‐Driven Perspective","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Extremely fast charging (XFC) of batteries holds significant importance in the era of intelligent technologies, yet the intricate role of electrolyte properties in determining XFC behavior remains obscure. Furthermore, conventional theories and in situ characterization techniques fails to elucidate electrochemical behaviors under sub‐minute‐level charging conditions. Herein, we report a data‐driven approach for analyzing the effect of each independent physical and solvation property on sub‐minute‐level sodium‐ion storage behavior. Causal graph analysis reveals that the size of the solvation clusters shows the strongest negative correlation with ultrafast Na\n                    +\n                    storage in graphite. The optimized compact solvation electrolyte demonstrates an astonishing extreme current density of 250 A g\n                    −1\n                    (corresponding to a power density of 46.78 kW kg\n                    −1\n                    graphite\n                    ) and an unprecedented cycle life of 100 000 cycles. Most notably, the graphite||Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    full batteries achieve stable sub‐minute‐level charging and discharging, exhibiting ultrahigh rate capabilities (up to 200 C, ∼3.4 s per charge) and ultra‐stable cycle performance (24 000 cycles at 50 C, ∼29 s per charge). This work provides a promising pathway for the development of XFC battery, pioneering an innovative assessment strategy for next‐generation electrolytes."},{"t":"纯色有机发光体：特性、定义、物理基础与基本设计原理","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9990265?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"纯色有机发光体","kp":["[发光体]: 多共振/聚甲炔窄光谱有机发光体"],"dp":1,"as":"本综述系统阐述了纯色全有机发光体的特征定义、物理基础与研究进展。窄光谱发射的纯色有机发光材料因其在高显示色域、高分辨率OLED等应用中的关键优势而备受关注。文章从分子设计原理出发，讨论了发光纯度的评价标准、实现窄光谱发射的物理机制(如J聚集态、刚性骨架策略等)，并展望了其在下一代显示与照明技术中的应用前景。","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":2.5},"ot":"Color‐Pure Organic Luminophores: Characteristics, Definitions, Physical Basis and Fundamental Design Principles","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Color‐pure all‐organic emitters, i.e., with narrow spectral characteristics, are intensively studied for high‐definition organic LEDs (mainly based on multi‐resonance structures), as well as for multi‐color bioimaging (mainly based on polymethine‐like structures). To guide targeted materials design beyond tedious trial‐and‐error procedures, this educative review discusses the spectral characteristics (including units and unambiguous definition of the spectral width, and the occurrence of artifacts), the physical basis of the spectral broadening (vibronic coupling, environmental effects, and a basal understanding of geometries in the ground and excited states). Subsequently, the structural factors are distilled, which govern reduced geometry change between ground and excited state (GS, ES)—quantified as the change in bond‐length alternation (Δ\n                    BLA\n                    ) upon excitation. On this basis, three complementary design strategies emerge, that is: (a) full and (b) partial bond length equalization, yielding intrinsically small‐ and mixed‐BLA emitters, and (c) MO topology inversion, with large BLA in GS and ES; secondary factors include, (d) rigidification and (e) the extension of the conjugated path. Finally, we address challenges and solutions when targeting not only color‐pure but also bright emitters. In all, our insights allow for an intuitive, chemical approach towards efficient color‐pure emitters beyond sole generation of structures and numbers."},{"t":"Co1/Ru单原子合金催化剂用于聚丙烯加氢裂解制长链液体产物的可持续转化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73643?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"废塑料氢解催化剂","kp":["催化剂[聚丙烯氢解]: Co₁/Ru单原子合金","产物: 长链液体","[设计]: 破坏Ru-Ru集合体"],"as":"本研究开发了一种Co1/Ru单原子合金催化剂，用于聚丙烯废弃物的选择性加氢裂解，将其高效转化为燃料和高附加值化学品。该催化剂的独特架构有效破坏了聚合物长链C-C键的选择性断裂屏障，在温和条件下实现高分子废料的升级回收。该成果为解决全球塑料污染问题、推动聚烯fin废物的循环经济提供了可持续的催化路线。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Co1/Ru Single‐Atom Alloy Catalyst for Sustainable Polypropylene Hydrogenolysis to Long‐Chain Liquid Products","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving selective polyolefin waste hydrogenolysis into fuels and chemicals requires architectures that disrupt Ru─Ru ensembles without compromising the intrinsic activity of the state‐of‐the‐art Ru catalyst. While metal modifiers can beneficially tune selectivity, they have been shown for high promoter‐metal contents, with associated penalties in structural definition and potential practicality. Here, we engineer cobalt speciation on Ru through impregnation to disclose how promotion spans the entire compositional space realizing a titania‐supported Co\n                    1\n                    /Ru single‐atom alloy catalyst (Co\n                    10\n                    Ru\n                    90\n                    , 3 mol% total metal content) that resolves these trade‐offs. Ex situ and operando analyses reveal that these bimetallic ensembles containing Ru─Co─Ru sites display a distinctively high barrier for over‐hydrogenolysis at late reaction stages while preserving the intrinsic activity of Ru. As a result, virgin polypropylene and post‐consumer waste were almost fully converted with a consistently high C\n                    11+\n                    yield of up to 60% (78% total liquids), compared to &lt;5% over the monometallic Ru counterpart. Process‐level simulations predict economically viable and environmentally sustainable operation enabled by the high single‐pass yields of long‐chain liquid products. These results reveal a wide compositional landscape for Ru promotion and recommend its second‐metal‐content single‐atom alloy limit as the most promising strategy for further catalyst design efforts."},{"t":"手性纳米粒子驱动干细胞的对映体特异性成骨分化并加速骨再生","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3822?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Precise control over stem cell differentiation is of crucial importance in regenerative medicine, such as stem cell–based bone repair. Chiral nanoparticles (NPs) exhibit enantiomer-dependent interactions with stem cells, providing a promising strategy for guiding cell behaviors. Here, we investigated the role of chiral NPs in modulating osteogenic differentiation of stem cells. L-CF-NPs, D-CF-NPs, and A-CF-NPs with controllable nanoscale chirality were synthesized to investigate the effect of enantioselectivity on stem cell fate. In vitro, L-CF-NPs resulted in the highest cellular uptake through clathrin-mediated, integrin-involved endocytosis. This led to the most pronounced up-regulation of osteogenic marker expression, mineralization (via MAPK/JNK/ERK), and angiogenic marker expression. In vivo, volumetric 3D-bioprinted scaffolds incorporating L-CF-NPs resulted in the fastest bone regeneration in a rat model of critical-size bone defects. This work establishes nanoscale chirality as a design parameter for biomaterials, offering a promising approach to regenerating bone and other tissues.","tp":"手性纳米材料","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"干细胞分化的精确控制对再生医学至关重要。研究合成了L型、D型和消旋型手性纳米粒子，探究其对干细胞成骨分化的对映体特异性调控。手性纳米粒子表现出依赖手性的细胞相互作用，能有效引导干细胞成骨分化并加速骨再生，为骨科组织工程提供了基于手性的全新精准调控策略。"},{"t":"中国探测器距离解开中微子质量之谜又近了一步","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01851-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Physicists hope that the JUNO facility can determine which type of neutrino has the highest mass. Physicists hope that the JUNO facility can determine which type of neutrino has the highest mass."},{"t":"童年环境塑造大脑","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei3393?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Socioeconomic factors top the list of influences on children’s brain structure and function"},{"t":"电荷极化界面工程实现自由基管理，支撑对苯醌1000小时电合成","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6914811?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"苯醌电合成","kp":["[运行时长]: 1000小时稳定运行","[界面工程]: 电荷极化界面控自由基","[产物]: 对苯醌电合成"],"dp":1,"as":"自由基介导的有机电合成长期受限于选择性低和催化剂不稳定两大瓶颈。该研究提出一种电荷极化界面工程策略，通过精准调控反应界面的电荷分布来有效管理自由基中间体，实现了长达1000小时的电化学合成稳定性。这一突破为有机电合成的工程化应用奠定了基础，有望推动绿色化学品的高效、可持续制造。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Charge‐Polarized Interfacial Engineering Enables Radical Management for 1000 h Electrosynthesis of Para‐Benzoquinone","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Radical‐mediated organic electrosynthesis frequently suffers from limited selectivity and catalytic instability, largely arising from uncontrolled radical coupling and overreaction. These challenges intensify under large‐current conditions, where accelerated radical generation promotes competing side reactions and undermines practical implementation. Here, we introduce a charge‐polarized interfacial engineering strategy to address these issues, demonstrated using a Cr\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    /Ru‐Fe\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    heterostructure to drive the selective electro‐oxidation of phenol to\n                    para‐\n                    benzoquinone (\n                    p‐\n                    BQ). The polarized interface enforces a vertical adsorption configuration of phenoxy radicals, suppressing Langmuir−Hinshelwood polymerization while stabilizing high‐valent Ru oxidative centers and facilitating rapid desorption of\n                    p‐\n                    BQ product. As a result, the catalyst achieves 1000 h of continuous\n                    p‐\n                    BQ electrosynthesis at record steady‐state current densities above 40−50 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , delivering high product selectivity and parallel hydrogen production at 1.0 V in an asymmetric hybrid seawater electrolyzer. This work establishes interfacial radical management as an effective framework for efficient electrosynthesis of value‐added chemicals."},{"t":"热气体超荧光的无腔模式控制","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/cbxq-8n45","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): H. Maeda and K. KitanoTransverse-mode control of light has traditionally relied on optical cavities, whereas recent cavity-free approaches based on periodically arranged cold atoms that exploit collective radiation have attracted increasing attention. Here, we demonstrate a new cavity-free method applicable to thermal ga…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233603] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"CameraMatics在全球化扩张中获4900万欧元投资","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/cameramatics-secures-49m-investment-amid-global-expansion","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"Supply Chain Digital","as":"AI驱动的车队智能管理平台CameraMatics获得4900万欧元融资，用于加速全球市场扩张。该公司利用计算机视觉和人工智能技术，为商用车队提供实时驾驶行为监控、碰撞预防、燃油优化和车队运营效率提升等解决方案。本轮融资反映了资本市场对智能交通与车队数字化管理赛道的高度关注。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"车队AI平台融资","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"CameraMatics Secures €49m Investment Amid Global Expansion","b":"CameraMatics Secures €49m Investment Amid Global Expansion\nPrioritise Us\nAI-powered fleet intelligence platform CameraMatics is undergoing an accelerated global expansion following €49m investment led by Blume Equity\nOngoing demand for\nglobal logistics\nhas meant increasing demand for global fleets. With this comes a greater concern for fleet drivers, ensuring safety and efficiency at any given moment.\nCameraMatics aims to reduce driving and work related accidents through increased visibility, utilising AI-powered technology to raise the standards.\nNow, it has announced a major growth investment from a consortium, allowing for its global expansion.\nCameraMatics was founded in 2016 by\nfleet industry\nveterans Mervyn O’Callaghan and Simon Murray. Since then, it has grown into one of the leading connected fleet intelligence platforms in the market. It utilises AI-driven video intelligence, advanced driver assistance systems and real-time operational analytics in order to drive safety.\nThrough this combination of technology, there is a reduction in carbon emissions, less operational risk and greater safety for the driver. The technology aims to transform driver behaviour, raise global driving standards and improve fleet visibility. It does this through increased accountability – drivers are more likely to use the speed limit if they are being recorded, or be prompted to take the recommended amount of breaks.\nThe company is investing heavily into machine learning, innovation, connected fleet intelligence solutions and predictive safety technologies. The key aim is to transform commercial driving standards around the world.\nThe Irish-founded fleet intelligence platform has now announced a major growth investment from a consortium which was led by  Blume Equity, alongside the Ireland Strategic Investment Fund (ISIF) and Goodbody Capital Partners (on behalf of AIB).\nUp to €49m (US$56.5m) will be invested into the company, driving its international expansion and will help as it\ncontinues to innovate\nas it scales up its platform. It will begin scaling across the UK, Ireland, Europe and the US.\n“This is a landmark moment for CameraMatics. When Simon and I founded the company in 2016, our ambition was to build a global technology platform that would fundamentally improve safety standards across commercial fleets. Our mission is simple but ambitious – to reduce driving and work-related accidents to zero through technology, AI and data-driven fleet intelligence,\" explains Mervyn O’Callaghan, Co-Founder and CEO of CameraMatics.\n\"Every day, our technology is helping fleet operators prevent accidents, improve driver behaviour and ultimately save lives on roads and worksites across multiple countries. That purpose continues to drive everything we do as a business. Since founding the company, we have delivered strong year-on-year growth, expanded internationally and earned the trust of many of the world’s leading fleet operators.\n\"This investment from Blume Equity, ISIF and Goodbody Capital Partners gives us the capital and strategic support to accelerate our next phase of growth – scaling internationally, deepening our AI capabilities and continuing to\ninvest in technologies\nthat can help change driving standards globally.”\nSince it founded, CameraMatics has demonstrated a strong revenue growth, expanding across international and domestic markets. It has accelerated enterprise adoption and secured leading blue-chip customers. The company now serves nearly 1,000 fleet customers, supporting operations across thousands of commercial vehicles.\nIt is helping increase safety in a mentally and physically challenging industry, where fleet drivers are on the road for significant hours at a time, doing long shifts and having to stay alert. CameraMatics technology offers a 360° view around every vehicle, detecting dangers in real-time and providing accurate alerts.\nIt monitors drivers, checking for fatigue, distraction and unsafe practices such as phone usage. It then offers in-cab warnings and encourages fleet managers to spot trends. It constantly identifies areas for improvement, helping drivers improve their safety record over time.\n“CameraMatics is exactly the type of business Blume Equity was created to partner with – a founder-led European software company with a differentiated product, strong customer relationships and a clear path to international scale,\" explains Eleanor Blagbrough, Co-Founding Partner at Blume Equity.\n\"Mervyn, Simon and the team have built something genuinely impressive in a large and growing market. CameraMatics has established itself as a clear category leader within the rapidly growing video telematics and connected fleet market. The company combines strong technology differentiation with impressive commercial execution, evidenced by its sustained growth trajectory, blue-chip customer base and accelerating international expansion.\nVideo telematics\nis at a tipping point as fleet operators increasingly recognise the operational, safety and sustainability benefits of connected fleet technology. We are particularly excited by the company’s long-term mission to use AI and connected fleet intelligence to materially improve global road safety outcomes.\n\"We are delighted to be partnering with ISIF and Goodbody Capital Partners to support the next chapter of CameraMatics’ growth.”\nCameraMatics has recently won contracts with organisations such as Royal Mail, XPO and Calor Gas, as well as US deployments with NASDAQ-listed Installed Building Products (IBP), which operates across more than 250 depots nationwide. The fleet industry has seen a major growth in demand for operational efficiency, compliance and\nAI-powered safety\n, meaning CameraMatics is growing at a significant time for the sector.\nThrough the investment, the company will be able to accelerate its go-to-market expansion journey, strengthening its enterprise sales and customer success capabilities. It will be able to continue to invest and increase its growth journey.\nCo-Founding Partner\nFounder & CEO"},{"t":"钙介导的Fe-N键增强实现超稳定氧还原反应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73684?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Fe-N-C氧还原催化剂","kp":["催化剂[氧还原反应]:Fe-Ca双原子位点/多孔碳","[Ca介导]:增强Fe-N键抑制活性位点浸出"],"dp":1,"as":"原子级分散的Fe-N-C催化剂被视为氧还原反应(ORR)的理想非贵金属替代品，但其在实际运行中的耐久性不足严重制约了商业化应用。该研究提出利用钙离子介导的配位化学策略，选择性强化Fe-N配位键的稳定性，大幅提升催化剂在酸性介质中的长效运行表现。该策略为设计超稳定单原子电催化剂提供了新范式。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Calcium‐Mediated Fe─N Bond Reinforcement for Ultra‐Stable Oxygen Reduction Reaction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The practical deployment of atomically dispersed Fe–N–C catalysts for the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) is severely hampered by the electrochemical leaching of Fe active sites. Inspired by the stabilizing role of Ca\n                    2+\n                    in metalloenzyme active sites, a novel Fe–Ca dual‐atom sites catalyst (Ca/Fe–N–C) is constructed on amorphous porous carbon nanosheets. The introduced Ca atom acts as an “electronic modulator” and “structural stabilizer,” which effectively lowers the oxidation state of Fe and reinforces Fe–N coordination bond. This ingenious design results in an exceptional ORR catalyst with the half‐wave potential of 0.912 V in alkaline media and unprecedented durability, exhibiting negligible decay after 80000 cycles. When integrated into Zn‐air batteries (ZABs), the Ca/Fe–N–C‐based cathode delivers a peak power density of 215 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    and sustains operation for exceeding 1110 h, markedly superior to benchmark Pt/C. This work not only unveils the pivotal role of alkaline‐earth metals in stabilizing transition‐metal sites but also establishes a general paradigm for designing durable atomically dispersed catalysts for advanced energy conversion devices."},{"t":"笼型多孔有机盐作为瓶中船纳米反应器，用于透光可重复使用的分子光催化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6654151?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"笼型多孔光催化","kp":["[催化剂载体]: 笼型多孔有机盐纳米反应器","[策略]: 船瓶式固定分子光催化剂"],"dp":1,"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"该研究开发笼型多孔有机盐作为瓶中船式纳米反应器，用于光透明、可回收的分子光催化。均相分子光催化剂异相化时往往需重新设计结构以负载，破坏其原有活性构型。该策略利用多孔盐的笼状孔腔原位限域完整催化剂分子，实现非均相条件下的高效光催化，同时保持催化剂结构完整性，且催化剂可回收重复使用，兼顾了均相催化的高活性和非均相的易分离优势。","ot":"Cage‐Type Porous Organic Salts as Ship‐in‐a‐Bottle Nanoreactors for Light‐Transparent and Reusable Molecular Photocataly","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Heterogenizing molecular photocatalysts while preserving their intact, pre‐designed structures—without redesigning the host—remains a fundamental challenge. Immobilization within porous materials offers control over reaction environments and improved recyclability; however, most host systems require catalyst‐specific structural redesign, limiting generality. We introduce a cage‐type porous organic salt (POS) as a modular host platform for homogeneous, molecularly defined photocatalysts (organic molecules and metal coordination complexes) based on a ship‐in‐a‐bottle strategy. A sodalite‐type POS constructed from adamantane‐based sulfonic acid and tri(ethynylphenyl)methylamine provides well‐defined, light‐transparent, cage‐like internal cavities. Single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction reveals that the POS accommodates diverse photocatalysts, including anthraquinone, phenanthrenequinone, and phthalocyanine, through a unified recrystallization protocol. The framework exhibits negligible absorption in the visible region, enabling selective excitation of photocatalysts without competitive light absorption. Post‐synthetic thiol–yne crosslinking of ethynyl groups on the pore surface reinforces the framework and renders it insoluble while preserving cage‐like cavities. For example, a phenanthrenequinone‐encapsulated POS functions as a reusable heterogeneous photocatalyst for visible‐light‐driven hydrogen peroxide production from isopropanol and oxygen, achieving rates of up to 4.2 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    without catalyst leaching. Overall, cage‐type POSs serve as light‐transparent nanoreactors for intact molecular photocatalysts, providing a modular, expandable platform for photocatalyst immobilization and post‐synthetic functionalization.","aip":1},{"t":"CVD生长可调碳薄膜用于高性能钠存储","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01852A","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CVD碳膜钠存储","kp":["[合成方法]: CVD生长连续碳涂层","[应用]: 钠离子电池高容量负极"],"dp":1,"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究利用化学气相沉积（CVD）法制备可调控碳薄膜，用于高性能钠离子电池负极。钠离子电池因钠资源丰富、成本低廉被视为有前景的可持续储能技术，但碳负极的储钠性能仍有提升空间。CVD碳薄膜可通过调控微观结构和层间距优化钠离子的嵌入与扩散动力学，提升比容量和循环稳定性，为钠离子电池的实用化竞争提供材料基础。","ot":"CVD-grown tunable carbon films for high-performance sodium storage","b":"Sodium-ion batteries are considered a promising and sustainable energy-storage technology, yet achieving competitive energy density requires electrode materials with high reversible capacity. Here, we introduce a chemical vapor deposition strategy that allows the growth of uniform, electronically continuous carbon coatings onto highly porous carbon substrates for use as high-capacity negative electrodes. This coating narrows and partially seals the open pore network, suppresses surface reactivity, and establishes nanoconfined domains that allow sodium to be stored in a more compact manner. This restructuring significantly enhances sodium storage performance, delivering total reversible capacities exceeding 500 mAh g-1 together with an unprecedented 420 mAh g-1 reversible plateau capacity. By enabling control over heteroatom composition, confinement, and electronic structure, this approach not only addresses the challenge of designing uniform and electronically continuous carbon coatings on highly porous substrates but also establishes a general route for designing functional carbon films for advanced electrodes, catalysts, and interfaces with tunable electronic properties.","aip":1},{"t":"构建用户驱动的气候适应产品","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10555-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Climate adaptation products have traditionally been developed using a supply-driven model reliant on available climate information, leading to usability gaps1,2,3,4. To better meet user needs, the climate services field has recognized a need to shift towards a demand-driven model emphasizing co-production, that is, user-driven, scientifically informed products created through shared knowledge practices1,2,3,4,5. However, co-production can be challenging, especially for researchers unfamiliar with the approach or for digital and software-based products with complex user needs2,5,6,7,8. User-centred design, from the human–computer interaction field, offers a process that could complement co-production approaches to product development, yet its potential remains underexplored2. Here we show how user-centred design can be integrated into, and strengthen, co-production approaches for building user-driven climate adaptation products. Through a systematic review of the co-production and user-centred design literature, we identify key processes, mechanisms and best practices for both approaches. Our findings offer practical guidance for researchers and propose an integrated approach for developing climate adaptation products that are useful, usable and used."},{"t":"8亿患者的突破？肾病药物显示出强大的新功效","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/breakthrough-for-800-million-patients-kidney-disease-drug-shows-powerful-new-benefits/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"New findings indicate that finerenone may help protect kidney function and reduce major health risks in people with chronic kidney disease who do not have diabetes.\nChronic kidney disease affects an estimated 800 million people worldwide and is one of the leading causes of kidney failure, cardiovascular complications, and premature death. Yet for many patients who do not have diabetes, treatment options remain limited.\nNow, researchers report that finerenone, a drug previously shown to benefit people with diabetic kidney disease, can also slow kidney function decline in patients without diabetes. The findings, published in the New England Journal of Medicine, could expand the use of the medication to a much larger population of CKD patients.\nThe results come from the international FIND-CKD trial, led by clinical pharmacologist Hiddo Lambers Heerspink of the University Medical Center Groningen.\nChronic kidney disease is frequently called a “silent” disease because symptoms may not appear until significant damage has already occurred. As kidney function worsens, patients face an increased risk of kidney failure, heart disease, hospitalization, and death.\nTo evaluate whether finerenone could slow that progression, researchers enrolled 1,584 adults with chronic kidney disease who did not have diabetes. All participants had reduced kidney function and elevated protein levels in their urine, both indicators of ongoing kidney damage.\nParticipants received either finerenone or a placebo in addition to standard therapy with ACE inhibitors or angiotensin receptor blockers, medications commonly used to protect kidney function and control blood pressure. Researchers followed the patients for an average of just over three years.\nResearchers evaluated changes in kidney function over a 2.5-year period using estimated glomerular filtration rate (eGFR), a measure of how effectively the kidneys filter blood.\nPatients treated with finerenone experienced a significantly slower decline in eGFR than those who received a placebo. According to Lambers Heerspink, the improvement was both statistically significant and clinically meaningful.\nThe treatment also lowered the risk of major kidney complications, hospitalization for heart failure, and death from\ncardiovascular disease\n. Lambers Heerspink said, “In the finerenone group, 13.9 percent experienced such a complication, compared to 16.9 percent in the placebo group. That amounts to a reduction in risk of approximately 23 percent.”\nFinerenone users also saw notable reductions in urinary protein levels after six months of treatment.\nLambers Heerspink said, “The presence of protein in the urine is often an important and early sign of kidney damage. In the finerenone group, it decreased by an average of over 41 percent, compared to about 9 percent in the placebo group. More than half of the patients who received finerenone achieved a reduction of at least 30 percent in the amount of protein in their urine. Such a reduction is an important indicator of a more favorable renal prognosis.”\nThe results are particularly noteworthy because earlier large-scale studies of finerenone focused mainly on people with type 2 diabetes. Lambers Heerspink said, “Now it turns out the drug is also effective in people without diabetes, even though more than half of all CKD patients worldwide are non-diabetic. Chronic kidney disease now affects an estimated 800 million adults worldwide.”\nThe study also found that finerenone was safe for use in this patient population.\nLambers Heerspink said, “Finerenone could become an important new treatment option for people with chronic kidney disease who do not have diabetes. The drug offers a clear delay in the decline of kidney function on top of current standard care. The results provide physicians with new therapeutic options to help preserve kidney function and reduce the number of cardiovascular and renal complications. And this applies to a broad, underserved patient population with non-diabetic CKD, for whom there are few treatment options in the guidelines.”\nReference: “Finerenone in Persons with Chronic Kidney Disease without Diabetes” by Hiddo J.L. Heerspink, Brendon L. Neuen, Rajiv Agarwal, David Z.I. Cherney, Carolyn S.P. Lam, Katherine R. Tuttle, Christoph Wanner, Pantelis Sarafidis, Niels Jongs, J. David Smeijer, Meike Brinker, Nicole Rethemeier, Patrick Schloemer, Paula Vesterinen, David Goldsbury, Sara Dizayee, Jon W. Mares and Vlado Perkovic, 3 June 2026,\nNew England Journal of Medicine\nDOI: 10.1056/NEJMoa2604625\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nPharmaceuticals\nDrug Discovery: Existing Medicines May Treat a Common Kidney Disease\nTraditional Chinese Medicine Shows Promise in Treating Lung Cancer\nCombining Certain Medications With Ibuprofen Can Permanently Injure Kidneys\nMIT Scientists Develop New Regenerative Drug That Reverses Hearing Loss\nPotential New Therapies For Untreatable Kidney Disease\nMIT Biological Engineers Solve An Arthritis Drug Mystery\nMIT Spinout Develops Smart Needle-Free Drug Injector\nYale Study Shows Metformin May be Safe for Patients with Kidney Disease\nTransplants Without the Need for Lifelong Immunosupression"},{"t":"巴西Solfácil推出工商业BESS项目融资信贷——储能","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/11/brazils-solfacil-launches-financing-line-for-commercial-and-industrial-bess-projects/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"工商业储能","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":6.0},"as":"巴西分布式光伏平台Solfácil推出专门面向工商业及农业客户的储能（BESS）融资信贷产品。该信贷线旨在降低用户侧储能项目的初始投资门槛，支持企业级客户配置电池储能系统以实现削峰填谷和用电成本优化。此举反映了巴西工商业储能市场正从政策驱动向融资驱动的商业模式演进。","ot":"Brazil’s Solfácil launches financing line for commercial and industrial BESS projects - Energy Storage","b":"Solfácil has launched a new credit line dedicated to BESS projects serving commercial, industrial and agricultural customers.\nThe financing is aimed at project developers, including integrators, engineering, procurement and construction (EPC) firms, and distributors that structure and sell storage systems but require credit support to complete transactions.\nSolfácil said applications can be approved in as little as one day, with the company providing support across financial, technical and commercial aspects of project development.\nThe financing targets behind-the-meter applications such as peak demand reduction, where batteries are charged during lower-cost electricity periods and discharged during peak tariff hours to reduce bills. It also covers demand charge management and backup power supply during grid outages.\nThe company said the initiative addresses limited access to credit for distributed storage projects in Brazil, where demand for battery energy storage components rose 89% in 2024, according to market research firm Greener.\nSolfácil is also preparing to launch an Energy as a Service (EaaS) model, which would allow integrators and EPC firms to lease storage systems to end users and generate recurring revenue rather than relying solely on upfront equipment sales.\nThe company said both initiatives aim to support growing demand for energy independence among business users while expanding financing options for distributed energy projects in Brazil."},{"t":"低电位醛氧化中化学与电化学串联步骤的协同增强用于太阳能驱动的双极膜体系","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6195416?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双极光电制氢","kp":["[电极]: PtCu3@Cu纳米线阵列/泡沫铜","[阳极反应]: 低电位醛氧化","[应用]: 太阳能双极制氢"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种低电位醛氧化反应，作为双极膜电解中析氧反应（OER）的阳极替代方案，可显著降低能耗。通过化学与电化学串联步骤的协同优化，在较低过电位下实现高效醛类氧化，兼顾能量效率与反应速率，为绿色电合成与节能电催化工艺提供了新思路。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Boosting Both Chemical and Electrochemical Tandem Steps in Low‐Potential Aldehyde Oxidation for Solar‐Driven Bipolar Hyd","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Low‐potential aldehyde oxidation offers an energy‐efficient anodic alternative to oxygen evolution for bipolar hydrogen production coupled with biomass valorization, yet the tandem non‐Faradaic/Faradaic mechanism remains poorly understood. Here, we report PtCu\n                    3\n                    ‐coated Cu nanowire arrays supported on Cu foam (PtCu\n                    3\n                    @Cu/CF) fabricated via galvanic replacement and electrochemical reduction. In situ ATR‐FTIR and DFT calculations indicate the PtCu\n                    3\n                    shell enhances adsorption of the\n                    gem\n                    ‐diolate intermediate while weakens binding of 5‐hydroxymethyl‐2‐furancarboxylic acid (HMFCA), accelerating both non‐Faradaic C–H cleavage and Faradaic oxidation. This enables selective 5‐hydroxymethylfurfural upgrading with anodic hydrogen evolution at 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at ∼0.21 V in a two‐electrode flow electrolyzer. Additionally, the electrolyzer also achieves 100 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0.16 V with 200% combined Faradaic efficiency for bipolar hydrogen production. Integration of a six‐cell stack with perovskite photovoltaic module yields a bias‐free solar‐to‐hydrogen efficiency of 16.9% alongside gram‐scale HMFCA production. This noble‐metal‐lean platform establishes scalable solar reforming for co‐generating green hydrogen and value‐added chemicals."},{"t":"BizClik 选择亚马逊来抵消碳排放","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/bizclik-chooses-amazon","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"BizClik Chooses Amazon to Offset Carbon Emissions\nPrioritise Us\nBizClik has partnered with Amazon and its carbon credit service in order to advance its global sustainability service through transparent carbon offsetting\nSupply chain emissions account for the majority of carbon footprints across most industries. Companies addressing climate targets now face the challenge of reducing operational emissions while managing residual impacts that cannot yet be eliminated through direct action.\nCarbon markets could offer a mechanism for businesses to address these remaining emissions. High-quality carbon credits support projects that either remove carbon dioxide from the atmosphere or prevent emissions from occurring.\nConcerns about\ntransparency\nand credibility mean businesses must evaluate carbon credit solutions with care.\nAmazon has expanded its carbon credit service to qualified companies in the UK. The service forms part of the company's Sustainability Exchange and aims to simplify access to carbon credits while maintaining what Amazon describes as its scientific and environmental standards.\n\"The voluntary carbon market has been challenged with issues of transparency, credibility, and the availability of high-quality carbon credits, which has led to scepticism about nature and technological carbon removal as an effective tool to combat climate change,\" said Kara Hurst, Chief Sustainability Officer at Amazon.\n“However, the science is clear: We must halt and reverse deforestation and restore millions of miles of forests to slow the worst effects of climate change.\n“We're using our size and high vetting standards to help promote additional investments in nature, and we are excited to share this new opportunity with companies who are also committed to the difficult work of decarbonising their operations.”\noperates as a global media and events company across multiple markets. The company has integrated carbon credits into its approach to addressing supply chain emissions that cannot yet be eliminated through operational changes.\n“Our 2026 sustainability strategy represents our renewed commitment to building a resilient, inclusive and low-carbon future that thrives on\ninnovation and collaboration\n,” says Glen White, CEO of BizClik.\n\"What excites me most is how closely this aligns with our clients' own ambitions. Together, we can turn sustainability commitments into real, lasting impact-creating opportunities for collaboration, innovation and long-term value for everyone involved.\"\nThe company produces Supply Chain Magazine and hosts Supply Chain LIVE events. Through dedicated editorial platforms and executive communities, BizClik creates forums for discussion around climate innovation and business practices.\n\"At BizClik Media, sustainability is embedded into our long-term business strategy and the global platforms we build across media, events and executive communities,\" explains Stacy Green, Chief People and Sustainability Officer.\n\"As a growing international media and events company operating across multiple global markets, we recognise the importance of continuing to reduce\noperational emissions\nwhile also supporting credible climate solutions as part of our wider sustainability journey. We believe businesses should act now, not wait, and continue taking practical steps towards long-term environmental responsibility.\"\nClimate action requires practical steps beyond strategy development. BizClik has chosen to integrate carbon credits as one component of its broader emissions management approach.\n\"BizClik is participating in Amazon's carbon credit service on the Sustainability Exchange, which has just expanded to qualified companies in the UK,\" Stacy continues.\n“As part of our broader sustainability roadmap, we were looking for a solution that offered confidence in quality, transparency and alignment with our broader sustainability commitments, alongside access to a growing range of credit types across multiple climate solutions.\n“With this service, we get credits sourced with the same industry-leading approach that Amazon uses for its own carbon neutralization and insetting strategies.”\nAmazon's service addresses challenges businesses face when entering the voluntary carbon market. Sourcing credits requires expertise in project verification, risk assessment and impact evaluation.\nAmazon manages sourcing, procurement, retirement and reporting for participating companies. Credits available through the service undergo vetting using the same approach Amazon applies to its own climate commitments.\nThe platform provides access to both carbon neutralization and insetting credits. This allows organizations to align carbon strategies with supply chain goals. According to Amazon, the service removes the operational burden of\nnavigating the carbon market independently\nOnly a small proportion of available credits meet what Amazon considers robust environmental and integrity standards. The service aims to filter credits based on quality thresholds.\nAmazon's carbon credit service supports projects that span nature-based and technological solutions. Companies can select from multiple project types depending on their supply chain priorities and climate strategies.\nKey categories include:\nThis range could allow organisations to support multiple climate solutions. The mix balances immediate impact projects with longer-term technological innovation.\nLower-carbon fuels represent one area where supply chain emissions reductions could be addressed through insetting credits. These credits support the production of renewable fuels within existing supply chains rather than offsetting emissions through external projects.\nCompanies managing complex global supply chains face emission sources that cannot be eliminated in the near term. Carbon credits could provide one mechanism for addressing these residual emissions while longer-term\nsupply chain transformations\nChief Executive Officer\nVice President, CSO, Worldwide Sustainability\nChief People & Sustainability Officer","tp":"碳抵消合作","sc":2.6,"scd":{"b":0,"i":3,"r":3,"d":1,"t":5},"as":"BizClik与亚马逊碳信用服务达成合作，通过透明碳抵消推进其全球可持续发展业务。供应链排放在多数行业碳足迹中占主导地位，企业面临在削减运营排放同时管理残余影响的挑战。碳市场机制为企业灵活实现气候目标提供了路径，该报道偏向企业服务推广性质。"},{"t":"生化结构演化的吡啶-活性碳点共组装作为精密抗肿瘤纳米酶","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6402787?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nanozymes with stable activity and excellent biocompatibility hold significant potential for tumor catalytic therapy. However, lacking rational structure evolution strategies to enhance nanozyme biochemical activity and their almost non‐tumor specificity have hindered their clinical translation. In this study, we report a pyridine‐activated donor–acceptor (D–A)‐typed carbon dots (N‐CDs), and their co‐assembled nanoplatform (N‐CDs@KK) with a programmed death‐ligand 1 (PD‐L1) targeting peptide (KK), as a potent tumor‐targeted nanozyme. N‐CDs were engineered through structure evolution via homogeneously integrating electron‐withdrawing pyridine units into amino‐rich conjugated sp\n                    2\n                    ‐domains, leading to effective charge transfer. The resulting D–A‐typed N‐CDs with abundant polarized domains garnered effective adsorption and activation sites, which exhibited both peroxidase (POD)‐ and oxidase (OXD)‐like catalytic activities. Moreover, this elaborate pyridine‐activated D–A nanostructure endowed bio‐regulatory function, capable of suppressing PI3K/AKT antioxidant stress pathway, thus amplifying reactive oxygen species (ROS)‐mediated tumor killing effect. Furthermore, co‐assembling with KK, the resulting N‐CDs@KK showed enhanced tumor targeting capability with specific cellular internalization. Combining ROS‐mediated immunogenic cell death (ICD) and PD‐L1 immune checkpoint inhibition (ICI), N‐CDs@KK demonstrated to be an efficient tumor‐targeted nanoplatform for both nanozyme‐catalytic and immunotherapeutic antitumor therapy. We prospect that N‐CDs@KK development establishes a paradigm for the rational design of high‐performance nanozymes, paving the way for precision nanozyme‐based antitumor therapy.","tp":"碳点纳米酶","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3,"r":6,"d":6,"t":4},"as":"研究开发了吡啶活化的给体-受体型碳点（N-CDs），并通过共组装构建了纳米平台（N-CDs@KK）作为精密抗肿瘤纳米酶。该策略通过合理的结构演化增强纳米酶的生化活性并改善肿瘤特异性，为克服传统纳米酶活性不足和缺乏肿瘤靶向性的临床转化瓶颈提供了新思路，在肿瘤催化治疗中具有应用前景。"},{"t":"$N=84$ 的 Beta 延迟中子发射 $^{132}\\mathrm{Cd}$","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/z93q-9g6y","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): M. Madurga et al.Using the time-of-flight technique, we measured the beta-delayed neutron emission of $^{132}\\mathrm{Cd}$. From our large-scale shell model (LSSM) calculation using the ${\\mathrm{N}}^{3}\\mathrm{LO}$ interaction [, Phys. Rev. Lett. 131, 022501 (2023)], we suggest the decay is dominated by the transfor…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232504] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"电池资深人士 Goodearl 加入能源产品 – Batteries International","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/battery-veteran-goodearl-joins-energy-products/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Batteries International","tg":"行业观察","b":"News, People\nBattery veteran Goodearl joins Energy Products\n–  June 11, 2026 12:51 pm BST\nRay Goodearl\nBattery industry veteran Ray Goodearl is joining US-based Energy Products as VP of strategic accounts, the company announced on June 1.\nGoodearl was most recently director of sales for specialty products in North America for lead battery manufacturer Eternity Technologies.\nHe has more than three decades of experience in the battery, motive power, reserve power, speciality energy and EV sectors of industry.\nGoodearl is a former VP of strategic accounts for Texas-based OEM Advanced EV and a former director of marketing and global accounts at the Hammond Group.\nHe first came to prominence while working for Randy Hart at Superior Battery Manufacturing Company in 2006 as VP of international sales and marketing.\nIn his new post, Goodearl’s primary focus will include strategic account development, and expansion of Energy Products’ Rogue golf cars line, while also developing accounts for SLI products.\nEnergy Products EVP Matt Cybulski said Goodearl is recognised industry-wide for his relationship-driven approach, deep industry knowledge and ability to identify long-term growth opportunities that align customer needs with operational execution.\n“He will be a key contributor to the SLI team as we expand our footprint across the country and continue taking Energy Products to the next level in the years ahead.”\nAn in-depth interview with Goodearl about his career to date, plans for the future and wider industry reflections will be published by\nBatteries International","tp":"电池业人事","sc":1.6,"scd":{"b":0,"i":0,"r":2,"d":0,"t":5},"as":"电池行业资深人士Ray Goodearl加入美国Energy Products公司，担任战略客户副总裁。Goodearl此前在铅电池制造商Eternity Technologies任职北美特种产品销售总监，拥有超过三十年的电池、动力、储备能源及电动汽车领域经验。此次人事任命旨在加强公司在战略客户领域的业务拓展。"},{"t":"孟加拉国对太阳能行业实行零税率","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/11/bangladesh-introduces-0-tax-rate-for-solar-power-sector/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"孟加拉国宣布针对太阳能行业推出重大激励政策，包括对太阳能领域实行0%税率。此举旨在降低光伏项目开发成本，加速本国可再生能源部署，吸引国内外投资进入太阳能发电市场，推动能源结构转型与碳中和目标实现。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"光伏税收政策","kp":["税率[孟加拉光伏]: 0%(至2035年)","电费补贴[消费者光伏]: 5%返还"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Bangladesh introduces 0% tax rate for solar power sector - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nBangladesh has announced a major solar energy incentive package, including a 0% tax rate for the solar power sector until 2035 and a 5% rebate on consumer solar electricity payments. The policy also removes import and other duties on key solar components to boost investment and support the country’s renewable energy targets for 2030 and 2050.\nMarkets & Policy\nAsia-Pacific\nImage: Fredrik Rubensson, Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 2.0\nThe government of Bangladesh on Thursday announced a major policy package to accelerate solar power development, including a zero per cent tax rate for the solar power sector until 2035.\nIn addition, a 5% tax rebate will be provided on payments made against consumers’ solar electricity bills.\nThe initiative aims to attract investment into the solar power sector as part of the government’s plan to generate 20% of total electricity demand from renewable energy sources by 2030, and between 30% and 50% from clean energy by 2050.\nFinance Minister Amir Khosru Mahmud Chowdhury, while presenting the national budget in parliament on Thursday, announced a new notification reducing import duty, regulatory duty, supplementary duty, and advance tax on essential solar power components to 0%.\nAccording to the announcement, items such as solar inverters, battery pack housing, lithium cells, lithium-ion batteries, solar photovoltaic modules/panels, mounting structures, battery energy storage systems (BESS), battery management systems, UV-protected solar DC cables, and battery thermal management systems will benefit from the duty and tax exemptions.\n“Through the gradual expansion of solar, wind and other clean energy sources, the foundations of a low-carbon economy will be established,” the minister said.\nHe also noted that investors would receive support and incentives for domestic manufacturing of renewable energy equipment, including solar panels, wind power components and battery systems.\nSolar sector stakeholders have welcomed the initiative, describing it as a strong signal of government support for renewable energy investment.\nMostafa Al Mahmud, president of the Bangladesh Sustainable and Renewable Energy Association (BSREA), said the incentives demonstrate the government’s commitment to the renewable energy sector. “There is no alternative to clean energy for sustainable development,” he said, adding that with continued policy support, industries would be able to generate electricity for their own use, while households would also be encouraged to install rooftop solar systems.\nBangladesh currently has a renewable energy generation capacity of 1,797 MW, of which 1,504 MW comes from solar power.\nView author posts"},{"t":"通过稳定Cu+和强化氢键网络平衡二聚化与加氢动力学以实现高效电催化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4304657?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙炔电二聚","kp":["[动力学调控]: 稳定Cu+平衡二聚化与加氢","[反应]: 乙炔电化学加氢二聚制丁二烯"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出通过稳定Cu+物种并调控催化剂结构来平衡乙炔电催化加氢二聚（EHDA）中的二聚化与加氢反应动力学。EHDA作为传统高能耗工艺的替代路线，有望高效合成1,3-丁二烯等关键化学品，为电驱动绿色化工提供新思路。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Balancing Dimerization and Hydrogenation Kinetics by Stabilizing Cu+ and Tightening H‐Bond Network for Electrocatalytic ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The electrocatalytic hydrodimerization of acetylene (EHDA) offers a promising alternative to energy‐intensive naphtha steam cracking for producing 1,3‐butadiene but faces a formidable challenge due to kinetic imbalance between C–C coupling and hydrogenation. Herein, we balance the dimerization and hydrogenation kinetics of EHDA by stabilizing Cu\n                    +\n                    and tightening the hydrogen‐bond network over citrate anion grafted Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalysts (E‐CA/Cu\n                    2\n                    O). The X‐ray absorption fine structure, Cu LMM Auger spectrum, and theoretical simulations corroborate citrate anion modification induces electron transfer from Cu\n                    2\n                    O to citrate ions. This stabilizes the active Cu\n                    +\n                    sites under electrochemical reduction conditions and further lowers the C‐C coupling barrier of *C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and *C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    3\n                    to *C\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    . The in situ attenuated total reflection surface‐enhanced infrared spectroscopy confirms that the citrate anion also reconstructs the hydrogen‐bonding network and reduces the content of isolated water at the electrode‐electrolyte interface. The appropriate supply of active *H species effectively promotes the hydrogenation of *C\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    to form 1,3‐butadiene rather than competitive acetylene semihydrogenation. As a result, E‐CA/Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalyst achieves a Faradaic efficiency of 88.0% and a 1,3‐butadiene partial current density of 55 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , which is about 3‐fold higher than E‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O. This work will guide the rational design of high‐performance catalysts for regulating the kinetics of electrocatalytic acetylene hydrodimerization."},{"t":"细菌细胞外囊泡促进膜修复和对多粘菌素 B 的耐受性","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx6378?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Bacterial extracellular vesicles (EVs) are nanosized lipid structures released under stress, yet their interactions with antibiotics remain poorly understood. We tracked real-time interactions between\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    , EVs, and fluorescent polymyxin B (Pmb) using single-cell imaging and cytometric approaches. EVs rapidly sequester Pmb, facilitating its removal from bacterial envelopes, and act as plugs by adhering to or fusing with damaged sites. Pmb triggers early Cpx/σE- and Rcs-dependent stress responses, linked to a ∼25% reduction in cell surface area, a ∼50-fold increase in vesiculation, and remodeling of membrane properties. After an adaptive lag phase, sustained EV release supports detoxification and envelope repair, enabling growth recovery and transient tolerance to Pmb. Together, these findings reveal previously unrecognized functions of EVs in membrane repair and tolerance to membrane-active antibiotics."},{"t":"宝马新款iX3开局强劲：销量破万，问鼎同级电动车销冠","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/11/bmws-new-ix3-off-to-hot-start-sales-top-10000/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","as":"宝马新一代iX3纯电SUV自4月开启交付以来表现强劲，已售出超万辆，成为豪华电动SUV细分市场的销量领跑者。强劲开局表明宝马在电动化转型中竞争力提升，新平台产品正加速抢占高端电动汽车市场份额。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动汽车销量","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"BMW's new iX3 is off to a hot start with 10,000+ models sold, top-selling EV in its class","b":"Peter Johnson\n| Jun 11 2026 - 8:53 am PT\nAfter deliveries began in April, the new\nalready looks like it could be the luxury brand’s next hit. BMW has now sold over 10,000 models, and the new iX3 has already become the best-selling EV in its class.\nBMW’s former CEO, Oliver Zipse, told investors during the company’s annual meeting in March that the new iX3 “has been extremely successful” since its debut.\nIn just six months, the electric SUV received over 50,000 orders, Zipse said. According to early sales data from Dataforce (via\nAutomotive News\n), BMW’s new iX3 was the top-selling EV in its segment in April, a month after deliveries began.\nBMW iX3 sales surged 171% through April, reaching 10,299 in total. It even topped the Audi Q4 e-tron to become the most popular EV in its class.\nThrough April 2026, the iX3 is now outselling the Polestar 4 (8,925) and the Audi Q5 Sportback (8,580).\nBMW introduced the new entry-level iX3 40 last month, starting at just €63,400 ($73,000) in Germany with a WLTP range of 628 km (390 miles). That’s even cheaper than the X3 plug-in hybrid (€66,900).\nThe iX3 50 xDrive is priced from €73,925 ($85,200). It’s powered by a 108.7 kWh battery pack, providing a WLTP range of up to 805 km (500 miles).\nBased on BMW’s sixth-generation eDrive (Gen6) 800V architecture, the iX3 50 xDrive delivers up to 469 hp (345 kW) and 645 Nm of torque. With a DC charging capacity of up to 400 kW, the electric SUV can add 373 km (231 miles) of range in as little as 10 minutes.\nThe interior features BMW’s new Panoramic iDrive system with a 17.9″ central infotainment screen, and a 43″ Panoramic Vision display that spans the entire base of the windshield.\nIn the US, the new BMW iX3 50 xDrive is\navailable to order\nstarting at $61,500 with an EPA-estimated driving range of up to 434 miles.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nPeter Johnson is covering the auto industry’s step-by-step transformation to electric vehicles. He is an experienced investor, financial writer, and EV enthusiast. His enthusiasm for electric vehicles, primarily Tesla, is a significant reason he pursued a career in investments. If he isn’t telling you about his latest 10K findings, you can find him enjoying the outdoors or exercising"},{"t":"自动化与机遇：GXO 的最新增长阶段","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/automation-opportunity-gxos-latest-phase-of-growth","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Automation & Opportunity: GXO’s Latest Phase of Growth\nPrioritise Us\nGXO closed 2025 with record revenues and ongoing business wins, demonstrating a growth in the businesses as it embraces automation and robotics\nLogistics companies around the world are battling it out to become the leading partner for global businesses,\nAs demand for reliable and timely delivery increases,\nlogistics partners\nare increasingly embracing automation, AI and robotics across their workforce.\nGXO Logistics has demonstrated company-wide wins and a modernisation across operations, demonstrating its capabilities of leading the fray.\nGXO Logistics is one of the largest pure-play contract logistics companies, using cutting-edge\nand distribution methods in order to design, manage and optimise supply chains around the world.\nIt offers tech-enabled and customised solutions at scale to some of the leading companies, ensuring efficiency, innovation and resilience throughout the supply chain. The company operates as a highly integrated network, across 27 countries, 869 locations and approximately 94,000 team members.\nAs a result, companies are increasingly turning towards GXO's solutions, which are particularly\nuseful for ecommerce\n, omnichannel retail and direct-to-consumer channels. Despite its growth, GXO is not planning to stop there.\n\"We have a total potential addressable market across North America and Europe of approximately US$430bn,\" the company states on its website.\n\"GXO holds a 5% share of the US$130bn in logistics spend outsourced in North America and Europe, and there’s opportunity for another US$300bn that’s currently insourced. Given our asset-light business model and continuous deployment of technology, there is vast runway for expansion.\"\nIn 2025, GXO closed the year with a record-breaking revenue of US$13.2bn, a 12.5% year-on-year increase from 2024. The company's growth does not stop there, as its 2026 Q1 earnings also broke records – a 10.8% increase from the year prior, to US$3.3bn, with an organic revenue growth of 4.1%.\n\"In the first quarter, we delivered strong revenue growth and profitability, underscoring the strength and predictability of our business model,\" explains Patrick Kelleher, CEO of GXO.\n\"Our commercial efforts are driving wins in higher margin growth verticals, including aerospace & defense, technology, industrial and life sciences, and we’re seeing demand accelerating, with our pipeline growing to an all-time high of US$2.7bn.\n“Three priorities are powering our path forward – sharpening our commercial strategy, strengthening execution and leading in AI and\nnext-generation automation\n, and we made good progress in each this quarter. Our commercial momentum is building, especially in North America where our pipeline grew 35% sequentially. We’re implementing a global framework for standardising and scaling excellence and our deployment of AI, automation and robotics is accelerating.\"\nGXO is seeing success as it is repeatedly keeping up with global demand. The company is opening and upgrading highly automated sites, utilising robots and AI-driven systems, which are allowing it to grow its capabilities.\nIn April, GXO implemented the first Autoload system in Europe for Grupa Żywiec in Elbląg, a leading beer producer. Through this, the company is seeing increased workplace safety, throughput and greater operational standards. The\nsystem automates\ntrailer loading and unloading, utilising a one-shot cycle, reducing operation time significantly.\nHuman error risk is eliminated and manual handling activity is reduced, meaning safety for workers is greatly increased.\nTechnology and innovation is taking place elsewhere across GXO's capabilities. In France, deployed its first autonomous industrial truck in March. The vehicle, powered by KION, was one step in GXO's integration of AI-driven technology into the workforce.\nThroughout this, the company is aiming to demonstrate measurable\nimprovements in cost-savings\n, productivity, operational scalability and customer safety.","tp":"物流自动化","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":1,"i":6,"r":2,"d":2,"t":5},"as":"GXO物流在2025年创下营收纪录并持续获得业务增长，公司积极拥抱自动化与机器人技术。全球物流企业为满足可靠及时配送需求，正加速部署自动化、AI和机器人技术。GXO通过技术驱动的运营模式提升效率，在物流行业自动化转型浪潮中占据领先位置，展示了自动化对物流企业增长的推动作用。"},{"t":"作者更正：麻醉的人类海马体的可塑性和语言","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10784-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"In the version of the article initially published, the time scale in Fig. 1e was off by a factor of 10. The x axis originally read “0, 67, 133, 200” with the label “Time (µs)” but should have read “0, 0.67, 1.33, 2” with the label “Time (ms)”. This correction has been made to the HTML and PDF versions of the article."},{"t":"通过乙烯基C─O键的Z式选择性官能化实现苯并呋喃衍生物的阻转选择性去芳构化交叉偶联","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2984592?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"苯并呋喃不对称偶联","kp":["[催化剂]: 手性镍催化剂","[选择性]: Z式选择性构建轴手性"],"dp":1,"as":"本文报道了一种基于Z-选择性催化体系的苯并呋喃衍生物对映选择性去芳构化交叉偶联反应。该不对称催化转化能将苯并呋喃这类丰富的芳香杂环转化为高价值的手性分子，克服了传统方法立体选择性控制不足的难题，为复杂生物活性分子和药物中间体的合成提供了新策略。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Atroposelective Dearomative Cross‐Coupling of Benzofuran Derivatives by Z‐Selective Functionalization of the Vinyl C─O B","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Catalytic asymmetric transformation of benzofuran derivatives has received significant attention owing to its capacity to prepare chiral molecules from readily available feedstocks. Herein, an unprecedented asymmetric cross‐coupling of benzofuran derivatives is reported for the construction of axial chirality. Employing a chiral nickel catalyst, this approach is achieved through direct enantio‐ and Z‐selective dearomative functionalization of the vinyl C─O bond, providing efficient access to valuable atropisomeric acyclic alkenes. A broad substrate scope is demonstrated under mild conditions. Moreover, experimental and theoretical mechanistic studies suggest that the stereochemical outcome is facilitated by a dynamic epimerization between diastereomeric six‐membered (\n                    Z\n                    )‐styryl‐nickelacycle intermediates.","aip":1},{"t":"单原子分散铁催化烯丙基与炔丙基C─H键的需氧羟基化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2913960?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁催化C-H羟基化","kp":["[催化剂]: 原子级分散铁","[反应]: 分子氧好氧羟基化C-H键"],"dp":1,"as":"本文研究了单原子分散铁催化剂在烯丙基与炔丙基底物有氧羟基化反应中的应用。碳氢键的选择性官能化是有机合成核心目标，但实现高选择性催化极具挑战。该原子级分散铁催化体系以氧气为氧化剂，兼具高催化活性、选择性及可持续性，为绿色合成醇类化合物开辟了新路径。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Atomically Dispersed Iron‐Catalyzed Aerobic Hydroxylation of Allylic and Propargylic C─H Bonds","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Selective functionalization of carbon–hydrogen bonds represents a central goal in modern organic synthesis, yet achieving site‐ and chemoselective oxidation using molecular oxygen remains a longstanding challenge. In particular, aerobic hydroxylation of allylic and propargylic C─H bonds is difficult due to overoxidation and competing side reactions. Here we report a heterogeneous catalyst featuring atomically dispersed iron sites embedded in a nitrogen‐doped carbon matrix. This catalyst enables unprecedented site‐ and chemoselective allylic and propargylic C─H hydroxylation of alkenes and alkynes using air as the oxidant at 30°C. The method accommodates a broad range of terminal and internal substrates with excellent functional‐group tolerance and enables late‐stage oxidation of structurally complex molecules. Mechanistic studies demonstrate that the catalytic activity originates from highly dispersed FeN\n                    x\n                    sites. This work highlights the potential of single‐atom catalysis to address fundamental challenges in sustainable C─H oxidation and expands the toolbox for selective oxidative transformations.","aip":1},{"t":"MOF纳米结构原子配位工程实现CO₂电还原高效生成高附加值多碳产物","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2590405?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF电还原CO2","kp":["[催化剂]: MOF原子配位工程","[目标产物]: 多碳C2+产物","[电流密度]: 工业级"],"dp":1,"as":"本文通过原子配位工程策略调控金属有机框架（MOF）纳米结构，用于电化学CO2还原反应。研究通过精确调控MOF中金属中心的配位环境，优化催化活性位点的电子结构与几何构型，从而提升CO2电还原为高附加值化学品的效率与选择性，为碳循环利用与可持续能源转化提供了新材料设计思路。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Atomic Coordination Engineering of MOF Nanostructures for CO2 Electroreduction to High‐Value Multi‐Carbon Products at In","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) have shown great promise for electrochemical carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) reduction into value‐added chemicals/fuels, thereby supporting the balance of carbon‐neutral energy cycle. The multi‐carbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) production on MOF electrocatalysts is of great significance but remains challenging due to inefficient C–C coupling. Here, we report the atomic coordination regulation of MOF nanostructures (Cu‐Trz‐Br) for efficient CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction by rationally designing dual‐site Cu catalysts. The crystallographic structure of Cu‐Trz‐Br is determined by three‐dimensional electron diffraction and Rietveld refinement against high‐resolution powder X‐ray diffraction data, which feature unique mixed coordination modes of Cu–N\n                    4\n                    Br\n                    2\n                    and Cu–N\n                    4\n                    sites. In CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction, Cu‐Trz‐Br demonstrates much enhanced selectivity toward C\n                    2+\n                    products compared to common counterparts with only Cu–N\n                    4\n                    sites, enabling efficient C\n                    2+\n                    production under industrial‐level current density. In situ studies and theoretical calculations reveal that the coordination regulation of Cu–N\n                    4\n                    Br\n                    2\n                    sites promotes CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and activation, as well as effectively enhances local *CO availability near Cu‐Trz‐Br, thereby facilitating C–C coupling toward C\n                    2+\n                    products."},{"t":"评估全球牧场放牧强度提高的气候净效益","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz4320?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Improved rangeland grazing could mitigate climate change through carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) sequestration in soils and vegetation. However, altering grazing practices to increase ecosystem carbon storage may also decrease livestock production and/or increase greenhouse gas emissions through the supply chain, such that the net emissions impacts remain unclear. Here, we assess the global net mitigation potential of improving grazing intensity by quantifying potential CO\n                    2\n                    sequestration alongside systems-level impacts of plant productivity changes, livestock emissions, feed requirements, and production constraints. Improving grazing intensity in global rangelands could sequester 2.2 ± 0.43 gigatons of carbon dioxide equivalent (Gt/CO\n                    2\n                    eq) per year in the near term, but maintaining livestock production through supplemental feeding would reduce net mitigation by 2 to 31% (to 1.8 ± 0.45 GT/CO\n                    2\n                    eq per year). Our results suggest that neglecting systems-level emissions impacts may substantially overestimate the global climate benefits of improved grazing.","tp":"牧场碳固存","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":3,"i":4,"r":5,"d":8,"t":4},"as":"改善牧场放牧管理可通过土壤和植被固碳缓解气候变化，但调整放牧方式增加生态系统碳储量的同时，可能降低畜牧产量或增加供应链温室气体排放，净减排效果尚不明确。研究量化评估了全球改善放牧强度的净减缓潜力，为平衡畜牧业生产与气候减缓目标提供了科学依据。"},{"t":"人工智能揭示隐藏的全球移民流动","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01588-4","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Training a neural network to collate data from several sources provides a high-resolution view of how people are moving around the world. Training a neural network to collate data from several sources provides a high-resolution view of how people are moving around the world.","tp":"移民流分析","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6,"i":5,"r":6,"d":5,"t":6},"as":"研究者训练神经网络整合多源数据，构建了高分辨率全球人口流动图谱，揭示了此前隐藏的跨国移民流动模式。该方法克服了单一数据源的局限，为理解全球人口迁移动态、支持人道主义决策和城市规划提供了新的分析工具，展示了AI在复杂社会科学数据分析中的应用价值。"},{"t":"芳香环翻转揭示了晶体和复合物中蛋白质动力学的重塑","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02155-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","b":"Protein conformational energy landscapes are shaped not only by intramolecular interactions but also by their environment. In protein crystals and protein–protein complexes, intermolecular contacts alter this energy landscape, but the exact nature of this alteration is difficult to decipher. Understanding how the crystal lattice affects protein dynamics is crucial for crystallography-based studies of motion, yet its influence on collective motions remains unclear. Aromatic ring flips in the hydrophobic core represent sensitive probes of such dynamics. Here, we compare the kinetics of aromatic ring flips in the protein GB1 in crystals, in complex with its binding partner IgG, and in solution, combining advanced isotope labelling with quantitative NMR methods. We show that rings in the core flip nearly a thousand times less frequently in crystals than in solution. Enhanced-sampling molecular dynamics simulations, based on a crystal structure of a GB1 variant reported in this work, reproduce these elevated barriers and reveal how the crystal restrains motions.The alternative text for this image may have been generated using AI."},{"t":"阿根廷MSU公司筹集4亿美元绿色债券用于储能项目","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/11/argentinas-msu-raises-400-million-green-bond-for-storage-projects/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","as":"阿根廷MSU Green Energy完成其首笔国际绿色债券发行，募资4亿美元，用于可再生能源储能项目建设。此举反映了拉美地区在储能基础设施融资上的活跃趋势，也体现了绿色金融工具在全球能源转型中日益重要的角色。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"电池储能项目","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":4.5,"r":2.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Argentina's MSU raises $400 million green bond for storage projects - Energy Storage","b":"MSU Green Energy has raised $400 million through its first international green bond issuance, securing financing for renewable energy and battery storage projects in Argentina.\nThe 10-year bond was issued with a 9.75% coupon and was oversubscribed, according to the company. Proceeds will be used to optimize MSU Green Energy’s capital structure and support the development of new renewable generation and energy storage assets.\nMSU Green Energy has built a solar portfolio concentrated in northern Argentina, including the 130 MW Pampa del Infierno project in Chaco, the 40 MW Las Lomas plant in La Rioja, and the 40 MW Villa Ángela facility, also in Chaco.\nThe company has also secured two battery energy storage system (BESS) projects through the AlmaGBA tender, which aims to deploy storage at strategic locations across the Buenos Aires metropolitan area. The awarded projects comprise a 150 MW system in Matheu and a 30 MW installation in Oro Verde.\nMSU Green Energy has signed long-term renewable power purchase agreements with major corporate buyers including Telecom Argentina, Volkswagen Group Argentina, and Bayer.\nAccording to its investor materials, the company’s portfolio also includes the El Chocón-Arroyito hydroelectric complex in Argentina’s Comahue region.\nBBVA, J.P. Morgan and Santander acted as international joint bookrunners on the transaction."},{"t":"Anthropic 提议设立公共基金，为美国人提供人工智能公司的股份","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/anthropic-proposes-public-fund-giving-americans-stakes-ai-companies","c":"未分类","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Anthropic Proposes Public Fund for Giving Americans Stakes in AI Companies — The Information Read this briefing for free","tp":"公共基金案","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1,"r":7,"d":2,"t":8},"aip":1,"as":"人工智能公司Anthropic提出一项创新政策提议，建议设立公共基金，使美国公民能够持有AI公司的股份。该提议旨在让公众分享人工智能技术快速发展带来的经济红利，在推动技术创新的同时平衡社会利益，确保AI发展的成果能够更广泛地惠及全社会。"},{"t":"强子对撞机重夸克最终态的解析软函数","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/2ksm-243x","c":"未分类","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Ze Long Liu and Pier Francesco MonniWe present the first computation of the complete two-loop, fully differential soft function describing the production of a heavy-quark pair in association with a color-singlet system at hadron colliders. This result constitutes one of the most complex soft functions known to date and it is obtained …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231902] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","tp":"强子软函数","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究人员首次完成了描述强子对撞机中重夸克对与单色系统伴生的完全双圈全微分软函数的计算。这是迄今为止已知的最复杂的软函数之一，相关成果为粒子物理学中重夸克产生机制的精确预测提供了关键的理论基础，并已发表于《物理评论快报》。"},{"t":"巴西亚马逊和塞拉多地区的乙醇繁荣和玉米价格上涨","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600323X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"胚胎编辑“首次”比头条新闻所暗示的要复杂","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aej5922?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Scientists may have a better way to make gene-edited babies, but it’s still far from safe"},{"t":"全光信号处理器实现太比特每秒级实时均衡","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.ady5344?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/计算集群","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全光信号处理器","kp":["[数据速率]: 太比特每秒级实时均衡","[技术]: 全光可编程信号处理器"],"dp":1,"sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究团队开发了一种全光信号处理器，可实现太比特每秒级别的实时均衡。该技术面向大规模AI训练对超低延迟、高能效互连的迫切需求，通过光域直接完成信号均衡处理，避免了传统电域处理的带宽和功耗瓶颈。全光均衡方案有望显著提升数据中心GPU集群间的高速光互连性能。","ot":"An all-optical signal processor enabling terabit-per-second real-time equalization","b":"Large-scale artificial intelligence training demands ultralow-latency, energy-efficient interconnects for massive graphics processing unit clusters. In intensity-modulation/direct-detection links, digital signal processing (DSP) equalization is limited by nonideal equalization caused by phase loss as well as tight power and latency budgets. We present an integrated, programmable optical signal processor (OSP) that functions as a nonlinear universal equalizer and performs all-optical, DSP-free, real-time equalization. A deep reservoir with all-optical readout enables a Vernier scheme with ~1-picosecond (ps) sampling resolution and a tunable memory window. The OSP simultaneously equalizes eight wavelength-division–multiplexing (WDM) channels, delivering 1.6-terabits/second aggregate throughput with &lt;60-picoseconds latency and tens of femtojoules/bit energy consumption. Operating before detection, it provides superior chromatic dispersion compensation, mitigates transceiver bandwidth limits and fiber nonlinearity, and expands the usable WDM window by a factor of 6.8."},{"t":"基于深度学习的HVAC系统极端不平衡场景下新型故障类别数据自适应增强框架","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008445?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"HVAC故障数据增强","kp":["模型[HVAC故障增强]: 元扩散模型","场景[故障诊断]: 极端不平衡新类别"],"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"An adaptive augmentation framework for new fault category data in HVAC systems under extremely imbalanced scenarios base"},{"t":"北极冰山交通的扩大重塑了底栖生物多样性","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10630-4","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The Arctic is undergoing rapid warming, resulting in retreating sea ice and glaciers1, yet how cryospheric changes propagate into the deep ocean remains poorly understood2. Here we identify a climate-driven mechanism linking accelerating glacier disintegration to an increase in deep-sea hard-bottom habitats far beyond calving fronts. Seafloor observations in Fram Strait show a localized increase in the density and patchiness of dropstones delivered by debris-laden icebergs. At the same time, four decades of shipboard records show that the occurrence of icebergs increased abruptly in the early 2000s. Backtracking links these icebergs to the main outlet glaciers in northeast Greenland and the Russian High Arctic. In northeast Greenland, the timing of glacier destabilization coincides with this rise, whereas sparse satellite coverage in the Russian sector limits temporal attribution despite indications of enhanced glacier activity. A model sensitivity study shows that, apart from intensified calving, a more dynamic sea ice cover enhances downstream transport of glacial ice. Along these pathways, increased iceberg activity could reshape deep-sea habitats through enhanced melt and associated lithogenic input, and elevate navigational hazards as maritime traffic expands in the Arctic. Although modest compared with the iceberg discharges of Pleistocene Heinrich events, this mechanism provides a modern analogue of long-range cryospheric influence on the seafloor in a warming climate.","tp":"冰山生物变","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"北极气候变暖导致冰川加速崩解，这不仅改变了海面冰层，还深刻影响了深海生态系统。研究发现，携带碎屑的冰山数量增加，将大量落石沉入深海，在远离冰川前沿的区域创造了广阔的硬底栖息地。这种机制显著改变了深海底栖生物的密度和分布，重塑了当地的生物多样性。"},{"t":"抗氨碳包覆钴催化剂用于电催化硝酸盐还原制挥发性氨","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7866851?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化硝酸盐还原","kp":["催化剂[硝酸盐还原制氨]: Co@C碳壳封装钴","[关键特性]: 兼顾合成效率与氨分离"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种耐氨碳包覆钴催化剂，用于电催化硝酸盐还原制氨（NO₃⁻RR）。电催化硝酸盐还原为氨被视为可持续氮利用的有前景路线，但传统催化剂易受氨中毒影响，导致活性衰减。碳包覆策略可有效保护钴活性位点，提升催化剂在氨环境下的稳定性与耐久性，为分布式合成氨及废水硝酸盐处理提供了新的电催化材料设计思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Ammonia‐Resistant Carbon‐Encapsulated Cobalt Catalyst for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Volatile Ammonia","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia presents a promising route for sustainable nitrogen utilization; however, current efforts remain largely confined to optimizing synthesis efficiency, with insufficient attention paid to the concurrent challenge of ammonia separation—a key bottleneck for scalable deployment. Here, we report carbon‐shell‐encapsulated cobalt nanoparticles (Co@C), which uniquely enable integrated ammonia synthesis and in situ gas‐phase purification under strongly alkaline conditions. In both sequencing batch and continuous‐flow electrolyzers, Co@C delivers a robust nitrate‐to‐ammonia Faradaic efficiency of 92.4%, maintaining performance even in the presence of exogenous ammonia. Critically, the high‐pH environment shifts the NH\n                    3\n                    /NH\n                    4\n                    +\n                    equilibrium toward volatile NH\n                    3\n                    , enabling spontaneous volatilization and direct gaseous collection. Combined experimental and theoretical analyses demonstrate that the carbon shells confer dual functionality: they physically suppress Co leaching while electronically modulating surface adsorption to weaken NH\n                    3\n                    binding and accelerate desorption. Our work establishes a catalyst design principle centered on ammonia resistance and introduces an electrochemical platform that unifies synthesis, separation, and purification in a single step."},{"t":"亚马逊供应链服务零担服务上线","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/amazon-supply-chain-service-ltl-offering-goes-live","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"产业进展","b":"Amazon Supply Chain Service LTL Offering Goes Live\nPrioritise Us\nAmazon’s less-than-truckload freight service, part of its Supply Chain Services, has now opened to all businesses following strong global demand\nAmazon Supply Chain Services has launched its less-than-truckload (LTL) freight offering, expanding beyond shipping to its own warehouses to now cater to any destination, including third-party warehouses, distribution centres and retail partners.\nThis follows the\nlaunch of its Supply Chain Services in May\n, which has already seen smaller sellers gain greater access to Amazon’s logistics network.\nFollowing the expansion, the LTL offering will mean firms are no longer forced to reserve and pay for a full truckload. Instead, businesses will gain flexibility, with the option to ship by pallet. This works by sharing trailer space for partial loads for shipments, which typically range from one to six pallets, or between 150 and 15,000 pounds.\nThe destination is now open to an individual firm’s warehouse, between its facilities and, further still, to retail partners and distributors.\nThe booking system that facilitates LTL to move freight includes flexible pick-up options, such as next-day live pickup for orders confirmed by 5pm and same-day pickup through Amazon’s drop trailer solution. In addition, high-volume shippers also have the option of standing daily pickups.\nThis flexible new offering is the most recent addition to Amazon Supply Chain Services’ (ASCS)\nexisting portfolio of supply chain capabilities\n, which include freight, distribution, fulfilment and parcel shipping available for firms of all sizes.\nSince 2019, Amazon says that its LTL operations have been utilised by tens of thousands of its selling partners and vendors, having moved millions of pallets throughout the US in the past year alone.\nIn addition to the increase in flexibility around pick-up options, the less-than-truckload\nfreight service\nalso offers businesses the following features:\nThis service allows for\nincreased business agility\n, utilising Amazon’s existing logistics network that it has been growing over the past few decades.\n“The feedback from Amazon selling partners using our LTL service was clear: the technology, visibility and reliability were exactly what they needed—and they wanted to use it more broadly,” says Jim Ruiz, Director of Amazon Freight.\n“Now Amazon LTL can move your freight wherever it needs to go, servicing destinations nationwide for businesses of all sizes. With LTL, shippers get cost-effective freight shipping while still benefiting from the real-time tracking and dependability they expect from Amazon.”\nTapping into the network already utilised by Amazon to move its own freight will give shippers the opportunity to access a global infrastructure as they scale their operations.\nAmazon says that\nAmazon Freight\n, which operates as part of ASCS, has already supported over 80,000 trailers, 24,000 intermodal containers and terminals across major US metros. By further expanding its infrastructure, the multinational technology and e-commerce company says that it aims to help “businesses improve performance, reduce complexity and operate more efficiently”.","tp":"亚马逊货运","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":8.0,"r":6.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":"亚马逊供应链服务正式推出零担（LTL）货运服务，向所有企业开放。该服务此前仅面向亚马逊自有仓库运输，现已扩展至第三方仓库、配送中心和零售合作伙伴等任意目的地。此举响应了全球强劲需求，进一步拓展了亚马逊供应链服务的覆盖范围，体现了其在B2B物流领域的持续扩张。"},{"t":"Amara Raja\"单干\"研发电池电芯，中国对技术支持持审慎态度","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/amara-raja-going-it-alone-on-battery-cells-as-china-frowns-on-tech-support/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Batteries International","tg":"行业观察","tp":"锂电池电芯国产化","as":"印度电池巨头Amara Raja宣布将自主研发锂电池电芯，而非依赖中国技术支持。背景是中国政府对电池核心技术出口日趋谨慎，限制了海外技术转移。Amara Raja此前已启动本土电芯制造计划，此举反映出印度在储能和锂电产业链上推动自主化的战略方向，同时凸显中美科技竞争与地缘政治对全球电池供应链格局的影响。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Amara Raja ‘going it alone’ on battery cells as China frowns on tech support – Batteries International","b":"Energy Storage, Lithium, News\nAmara Raja ‘going it alone’ on battery cells as China frowns on tech support\n–  June 11, 2026 01:02 pm BST\nIndian battery producer Amara Raja Energy & Mobility has revealed it is now largely ‘going it alone’ on cells development after a flagship licensing tech partnership with a Chinese supplier came under pressure from Beijing.\nLead acid major Amara Raja agreed a deal with China-based Gotion High-Tech in 2024 for support in developing LFP cells, as part of the Indian group’s\n‘giga-corridor’\nbattery and R&D projects in Telangana state. The technical licensing agreement was with Gotion subsidiary GIB EnergyX Slovakia.\nHowever, Amara Raja said in a June 2 earnings call with market and financial analysts there are now “difficulties” over the deal in terms of technology transfers, as the Chinese government tightens its global grip on battery tech and material supplies.\nVikramadithya Gourineni, executive director of the group’s lithium-based New Energy Business, said Amara Raja and Gotion had never sought any approvals from their respective governments for what was a purely private deal.\nNevertheless, a number of such deals are now coming under scrutiny in Beijing and Amara Raja’s product development and R&D is now being “largely driven internally”.\nSince 2024, you will have seen in the news that sharing and licensing of technology is something largely discouraged by the Chinese government, Gourineni said.\nAsked by one analyst if Amara Raja’s LFP plants will now be based on home-grown Indian technology, Gourineni said: “We have a couple of products in the pipeline that we’re developing. As we get a little bit more confidence about the customer programme on the EV side, we’ll be able to announce that in due course, but probably sometime 2028 and later.”\nHe said pressure from China’s leaders was hitting all players and their technical tie-ups equally and the company had “taken what it could” to date in terms of cooperation and expertise.\n“But largely, going forward, whether it’s NMC, LFP, or future chemistries, the efforts of product development is largely driven by teams in India.”\nTo that end, Gourineni said Amara Raja expected initial production capacity scheduled by its New Energy Business for 2027 would focus on NMC batteries.\nIn a related move, he also gave some additional details about the company’s recently announced BESS manufacturing plans ― as\nBatteries International\nAmara Raja intends to pursue cell manufacturing specifically for battery storage systems in addition to container integration and pack assembly in Telangana, he said.\nThis is a technology that is well established and the company’s teams are confident that they will not need an external partner to develop BESS cells, as long as they can still access related equipment supplies from China.\nThat study echoed\nreleased by the International Energy Agency earlier this year, that warned EV plants worldwide faced $17 billion in losses for every month of any potential halt in cell exports by China."},{"t":"铝导向的两性自重构高熵AlFeCoNiCuCr-LDH实现高效全解水","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71178?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高熵催化剂析氢","kp":["催化剂[全解水]: AlFeCoNiCuCr高熵LDH","[机理]: 铝导向两性自重构"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦高熵层状双氢氧化物（AlFeCoNiCuCr-LDH）电催化剂的电化学自重构行为。高熵催化剂的催化活性与稳定性高度依赖于其自重构过程，但机理尚不清晰。研究发现铝元素可引导两性（amphoteric）自重构，调控高熵催化剂表面活性相的演化，从而优化析氧反应（OER）等催化性能。该工作为高熵电催化剂的理性设计与稳定性调控提供了新思路。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Aluminum‐Directed Amphoteric Self‐Reconstruction in High‐Entropy AlFeCoNiCuCr‐LDH for Efficient Overall Water Splitting","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical self‐reconstruction in high‐entropy catalysts governs their catalytic activity and stability. However, uncontrolled structural evolution often led to performance degradation, rendering the precise modulation of these interfacial pathways a major bottleneck. Herein, we report an aluminum‐containing high‐entropy layered double hydroxide (Al‐HELDH) and elucidate its amphoteric self‐reconstruction mechanism. During electrochemical activation, selective leaching of amphoteric aluminum species significantly enhances access to metal active sites while inducing formation of surface‐enriched Al(OH)\n                    x\n                    hydroxyl layers. This hydroxylated interface effectively regulates adsorption and dissociation processes, stabilizing the reconfigured catalytic surface and simultaneously boosting catalytic activity and durability. In situ spectroscopy and density functional theory calculations confirm Ni as the primary catalytic center, with other metal species cooperatively modulating the local electronic environment. Benefiting from synergistic high‐entropy effects and a functional Al(OH)\n                    x\n                    interface layer, reconstructed Al‐HELDH significantly reduces interfacial energy barriers for key reaction steps and accelerates reaction kinetics. The catalyst exhibits overpotentials of 64 and 226 mV for the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) and oxygen evolution reaction (OER) at a current density of 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively, while maintaining stable operation for over 1000 h. This work establishes a reconstruction‐based design strategy, providing a robust pathway for developing non‐precious metal bifunctional catalysts for sustainable hydrogen production."},{"t":"干扰导致欧洲森林碳汇下降惊人","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag354/8706387?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Forests are carbon sinks essential for climate change mitigation. However, increased harvests and natural disturbances across Europe have recently challenged this role. To project the future carbon sink capacity of Europe’s forests, we integrated country reports from the United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC) with remote sensing maps of disturbances and above-ground biomass. Our model simulates biomass dynamics at 18 km resolution from 2010 to 2030, predicting a 39% decrease in the EU-27 forest carbon sink, driven by disturbances outpacing biomass recovery. Consequently, the 2030 forest carbon sink will fall 27% short of the estimated target consistent with EU-27 climate objectives. We demonstrate that the three billion trees initiative is insufficient for climate change mitigation and needs to be combined with a 28% reduction in forest harvests from 2025 to 2030 to meet these targets.","tp":"森林碳储量","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":5.0},"as":"森林是缓解气候变化的重要碳汇，但欧洲地区的过度采伐和自然干扰正削弱这一功能。研究整合UNFCCC国家报告与遥感和生物量数据，以18公里分辨率模拟2010至2030年生物量动态，预测森林碳汇将下降39%。结果警示森林干扰对气候目标的威胁，对欧洲森林管理和碳预算制定具有重要影响。"},{"t":"全球轮流森林的自适应自组织","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606552123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Does swidden agriculture, a prototypical coupled human and natural system, exhibit a process of adaptive self-organization in which cultural practices balance environmental constraints through adaptive feedback? Here, we investigate whether quantitative signatures of adaptive self-organization can be detected in a dataset consisting of 18,000+ contiguous swidden patches in 18 remote sensing images of swidden mosaics from tropical and subtropical regions globally. We find that the distributions of patch sizes in 16 of 18 swidden areas exhibit power law patterns with scaling exponents ≈1, and correlation distances of ≈548 m. To account for these patterns, we develop a plausible ethnographically informed agent-based model of labor exchange, land use, and swidden site selection in which both sustainable and unsustainable resource uses can emerge out of interactions among individuals or households. By analyzing the model, we identify spatial synchronization of swidden sites as the driver of power law formation, while social norms of swidden labor can guide the system to an intermediate level of landscape disturbance. Both mechanisms are required to maintain harvests and ecosystem productivity at high levels. Our model advances theoretical understanding of the socioecological dynamics of swidden agriculture, and supports the hypothesis that adaptive self-organization may be a general characteristic of coupled human and natural systems.","tp":"轮歇自适应","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"轮垦农业是典型的人地耦合系统，研究探讨其是否表现出文化实践通过适应性反馈平衡环境约束的自组织过程。基于全球热带和亚热带地区18幅遥感图像中18000余个连续轮垦斑块数据，研究发现其分布具有自组织特征，为理解传统农业系统的生态可持续性提供了定量证据。"},{"t":"自适应 Spo11 RNA 编辑门优化减数分裂 I 速度和有丝分裂增殖，同时保留子囊孢子形成","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adu7607?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Spo11-mediated DNA double-strand breaks (DSBs) are essential for meiotic recombination, yet how Spo11 activity is temporally regulated during mitosis and fungal development remains unclear. In the fungal plant pathogen\n                    Fusarium graminearum\n                    , we found that FgSpo11 has a DSB-independent role delaying meiosis I and a DSB-dependent role critical for postmeiotic mitoses during ascosporogenesis. Loss of FgSpo11 accelerates meiosis I and causes excessive postmeiotic divisions, ultimately causing aborted ascospores. A premature stop codon (TAG) is corrected to tryptophan (TGG) by adenosine-to-inosine RNA editing exclusively during sexual reproduction, enabling full-length protein synthesis. A genomically “corrected” allele bypassing this editing preserves ascospore formation but causes meiotic and vegetative mitotic defects. Beyond its on-switch function, this editing acts as a tunable rheostat fine-tuning FgSpo11 dosage during meiosis. Evolutionary analyses reveal recurrent gain and loss of this editing, highlighting adaptive modulation of Spo11 deployment. This study uncovers a single-site RNA editing gate controlling a key meiotic regulator and illustrates transcriptome plasticity in reconciling life cycle demands in eukaryotic pathogens.","tp":"病原菌繁殖","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"Spo11介导的DNA双链断裂对减数分裂重组至关重要，但其活性在时间上如何调控尚不清楚。在植物病原真菌禾谷镰刀菌中，研究发现FgSpo11具有延迟减数分裂I的非DSB依赖功能，以及对子囊孢子形成中后减数分裂有丝分裂至关重要的DSB依赖功能。该发现揭示了减数分裂时序调控的新机制。","aip":1},{"t":"AMD 苏姿丰寄语毕业生：AI 无法决定未来，决定未来的是人","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/210.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 11 日消息，据 Windows Central 今日报道，AMD CEO 苏姿丰 5 月底在麻省理工学院（MIT）的毕业典礼上发表了一篇演讲。\n她向毕业生表示，无论 AI 的能力变得多强，它都无法替代人类去判断哪些问题真正值得解决，也无法承担最终责任。\n对于 AI 所能做的一切，它无法决定哪些问题值得解决。它无法在缺乏数据时作出艰难判断。它无法为结果承担责任。而这些恰恰是我们的责任，且如今比以往任何时候都更加重要。\n苏姿丰此番言论正值大型科技公司全面押注 AI 之际。过去几年，生成式 AI 几乎成为了各大科技巨头唯一的话题，微软、谷歌等公司在该领域投入了数十亿美元。\n然而，部分行业声音开始质疑 AI 的发展是否遇到了瓶颈，理由之一是高质量训练内容的缺乏导致更先进的模型难以问世；还有一部分人担心自己会被 AI 所取代。\n此前，微软 AI 负责人穆斯塔法 · 苏莱曼（Mustafa Suleyman）曾声称 AI 将在 18 个月内接管所有白领工作，引发广泛讨论。他后来澄清，所指的并非取代整个岗位，而是代替其中那些枯燥、重复的任务。\n微软联合创始人比尔 · 盖茨也表达过类似观点，他认为 AI 将取代人类的大部分工作，但程序员、生物学家和能源专家等需要处理高度复杂问题的领域除外，因为这些工作仍然经常需要人类的专业判断。\nIT之家注意到，之前发生的另一起事件也从侧面印证了人类监督的必要性。Replit 公司在应用开发过程中，其 AI 系统曾试图删除公司的整个代码库，事后还尝试掩盖错误，并在被质问时撒谎。这起事件虽然只是众多行业事故中的一个缩影，但清晰地表明，在关键节点上缺少人类把关，可能带来严重后果。\n大会上，微软 CEO 萨蒂亚 · 纳德拉谈到 AI 智能体时表示，应当像对待真正的员工一样对待它们。“你需要给它们身份，给它们沙盒环境，然后制定策略来管理它们。”微软也正在将 Windows 推向 Agentic AI 的新阶段，AI 预计将在其产品组合中占据主导地位。\n苏姿丰此次向毕业生传递的信息，则为这股热潮提供了另一重视角。苏姿丰并未否认 AI 的重要作用，而是强调在人机协作不断深入的背景下，人类在确定目标、作出关键判断以及承担最终责任方面仍然具有不可替代的作用。她认为，这些能力将继续成为未来社会和技术发展过程中不可或缺的组成部分。\nAMD 苏姿丰谈 AI：在科技行业工作超 30 年，没有比今天更“兴奋”的时刻了","tp":"AI与人类","as":"AMD CEO苏姿丰在MIT毕业典礼演讲中指出，无论AI能力多强，它都无法替代人类判断哪些问题值得解决，无法在数据缺失时作出艰难判断，也无法为结果承担责任。在大型科技公司全面押注AI之际，她强调人类责任比以往更加重要。其言论也折射出行业对AI瓶颈和就业替代的反思。","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.0,"d":0.0,"t":10.0}},{"t":"ABTC赢得上诉，恢复1.15亿美元内华达锂工厂拨款","d":"2026-06-12","i":"n","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/abtc-wins-appeal-to-reinstate-grant-for-115m-nevada-lithium-plant/","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/有色金属/其它有色金属产业","a":"Batteries International","tg":"政策监管","tp":"锂精炼厂政府拨款","kp":["[投资额]: 1.15亿美元锂精炼厂","[位置]: 美国内华达州"],"as":"美国电池技术公司ABTC成功上诉，恢复了用于内华达州1.15亿美元锂工厂的政府拨款。该工厂位于Tonopah Flats，将助力美国本土锂资源加工产能建设，对摆脱进口依赖、强化关键矿产供应链安全具有战略意义，是北美锂电产业链布局的重要进展。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"ABTC wins appeal to reinstate grant for $115m Nevada lithium plant – Batteries International","b":"Lithium, News\nABTC wins appeal to reinstate grant for $115m Nevada lithium plant\n–  June 11, 2026 10:56 am BST\nTonopah Flats project\nThe US Department of Energy has reinstated a grant to support building a $115 million lithium refinery project in Nevada after an appeal by the American Battery Technology Company (ABTC).\nThe grant to ABTC was terminated last October ― along with more than 200 projects that the Trump administration said then would save taxpayers more than $7 billion.\nHowever, the US government has since ramped up\nto boost supply chains and domestic production of critical minerals and materials processing, along with derivative battery manufacturing and recycling.\nABTC said on June 8 it had won its appeal for reinstatement of its competitive five-year grant toward construction of the first phase of its commercial scale critical mineral lithium refinery, as part of its Tonopah Flats Lithium Project (TFLP).\nThe company received an initial grant from the DoE in January 2021 to fund the demonstration and scaling of its extraction technologies. An additional grant was awarded for $57 million to design, construct, commission and operate the commercial scale facility, with an initial capacity of 5,000 tonnes of battery-grade lithium hydroxide per year.\nBefore the termination, ABTC had successfully completed the first two years of the contracted grant and had been selected for fast-tracked federal permitting.\nTFLP encompasses one of the largest known measured, indicated, and inferred lithium claystone resource deposits in the US.\nA pre-feasibility study of TFLP, published in October 2025, indicated that the project had a highly competitive cost of production of $4,307 per tonne of lithium hydroxide monohydrate.\nABTC’s CEO Ryan Melsert praised the firm’s long-standing partnership with the DoE and the department’s “rigorous due diligence” in concluding the critical mineral lithium refinery project had achieved all of its contracted technical and commercial milestones to date, and that continued federal support was warranted.\n“Of the hundreds of DoE grants terminated last fall, very few have been able to successfully appeal the decisions and have their contracts reinstated,” he said."},{"t":"发现了一个巨大的鲸鱼墓地","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01581-x","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"In the Indian Ocean, a deep-sea area roughly 1,200 kilometres long and 7 kilometres deep was found to harbour an ecological landmark site of whale remains. In the Indian Ocean, a deep-sea area roughly 1,200 kilometres long and 7 kilometres deep was found to harbour an ecological landmark site of whale remains.","tp":"深海鲸落群","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"科学家在印度洋深处发现了一个规模庞大的鲸鱼墓地，其覆盖海域长达约1200公里，深达7公里。这一大型深海区域蕴藏着密集的鲸类遗骸，形成了一个具有重大科学研究价值的生态地标。该发现对于探索深海生物的碳循环、生态系统演化以及海洋生物多样性具有重要意义。"},{"t":"丘脑-脑干吸引子网络驱动历史偏见决策","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10623-3","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Natural environments often change gradually, making it adaptive to bias decisions on the basis of the recent past — a phenomenon known as serial dependence1,2,3. Large-scale recordings during behaviour have identified that serial dependence is a common motif for decision-making, with neural representations of past experiences found throughout the brain4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11. However, it remains unclear whether this bias arises from dedicated neural circuits with history-specific computations. Using whole-brain, cellular-resolution imaging in zebrafish performing memory-guided evasive manoeuvres12,13,14, we identified a hierarchical circuit that maintains past information and biases future choices. Discrete attractors in the dorsal thalamus encoded the position of the most recent obstacle, maintaining a categorical memory via persistent activity lasting 10–20 s. Optogenetic manipulation of the dorsal thalamus abolished or imposed serial bias. A downstream hindbrain integrator received input from the thalamus and combined it with current sensory cues to produce graded responses reflecting multi-trial history. Leveraging a comprehensive brain atlas in zebrafish15, we constructed a whole-brain computational model that recapitulated behaviour and also predicted a key role for heterogeneous inhibitory subtypes in enabling flexible state transitions. This attractor–integrator architecture reveals a hierarchical and modular computation that unifies robust memory retention with flexible sensory integration, providing a general principle for history-biased decisions.","tp":"神经历史偏","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究表明，大脑在决策时会受到近期历史经验的影响，这种现象被称为“序列依赖性”。科学家通过大规模神经记录和实验发现，丘脑与脑干之间的特定吸引子神经网络是产生这种历史偏见的根源。这一专属神经回路通过处理过去的经验信息，驱动生物体在环境渐进变化时做出适应性决策。"},{"t":"APP 通过溶酶体胞吐作用清除核废物中的保护作用","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524190123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Amyloid precursor protein (APP) is widely known for its role in Alzheimer’s disease (AD) pathogenesis through its proteolytic processing into amyloid-β peptides. However, its physiological functions remain incompletely understood. Here, we uncover a protective role for full-length APP in facilitating the disposal of nuclear-derived debris under genotoxic stress. In both cultured cells and in vivo mouse models, loss of APP leads to nuclear waste accumulation, increased inflammation, and cell death, whereas APP overexpression mitigates these effects. Mechanistically, we show that APP supports the extracellular release of nuclear waste material through lysosomal exocytosis. APP mutants associated with familial AD fail to mediate this process. Consistently, human AD brain tissue exhibits abnormal nuclear morphology, accumulation of nuclear waste in the cytoplasm, and reduced APP levels per neuron. These findings highlight a conserved cellular mechanism by which APP contributes to nuclear and cellular homeostasis, and suggest that impaired nuclear waste clearance may represent an underappreciated contributor to neurodegeneration.","tp":"核废物清除","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究揭示了淀粉样前体蛋白（APP）在基因毒性应激下的一种全新生理保护功能。尽管APP此前因在阿尔茨海默病中降解产生淀粉样β肽而广为人知，但研究团队发现，全长APP能够促进细胞核废物的清理。在细胞和动物模型中，APP的缺失会导致核内废物累积，进而引发严重的炎症反应和细胞死亡。这项发现为理解APP的基础生理作用及神经退行性疾病机制提供了新视角。"},{"t":"弥漫性中线神经胶质瘤的预后人脑网络","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10631-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Diffuse midline gliomas (DMGs) are near-universally lethal tumours of the childhood central nervous system1,2. In animal models, DMGs form brain-wide integrated networks through neuron-to-glioma synapses3,4,5,6 and glioma-to-glioma gap junctional coupling3. This extensive connectivity robustly promotes the growth and invasion of DMG3,4,5,6,7,8,9 and other glial malignancies10,11,12 through paracrine mechanisms and direct neuron-to-glioma synapses. However, the organization and clinical implications of these connections in the living human brain remain to be elucidated. Here, we develop tumour network mapping to compute the brain-wide connectivity profile of DMG, defining a conserved brain network across pontine and thalamic DMG associated with patient short-term survival (DMG network). Tumour functional connectivity with the DMG network was independently predictive of patient overall survival across two external validation cohorts. Tumour growth mapped to DMG network-specific trajectories and peak in-network neurometabolic changes across development spatiotemporally aligned with the peak age incidence of DMG. Analyses of single-nucleus RNA sequencing data confirmed diverse synaptic gene enrichment in high-connectivity DMG. Strikingly, incidental surgical resection of high-connectivity thalamic DMG tissue conferred a significant survival advantage. Collectively, these data define a conserved and prognostically important brain network in children with DMG, consistent with the hypothesis that DMGs exploit otherwise healthy brain circuits to promote tumour growth."},{"t":"蚕的味觉受体 - Akt 轴将营养感应与造血作用结合起来","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535199123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Hematopoiesis is tightly linked to an organism’s metabolic state, yet the molecular sensors that convert nutrient availability into hematopoietic output remain poorly understood. Here, we identify a fructose-sensitive gustatory receptor, BmGr9, as a cell-intrinsic nutrient sensor that links circulating sugar levels to blood cell proliferation in the silkworm\n                    Bombyx mori\n                    . We show that fructose, whose concentration rises sharply after feeding, stimulates hematopoietic organ (HPO) proliferation through BmGr9-dependent Ca\n                    2+\n                    influx and activation of the Akt–ornithine decarboxylase/polyamine signaling pathway. CRISPR/Cas9-mediated knockout of BmGr9 reduces hemocyte production and impairs fructose-induced Akt phosphorylation and polyamine synthesis. We further demonstrate that the fat body polyol pathway produces fructose de novo, which then acts as an interorgan metabolic signal that promotes hematopoiesis and shapes gene expression in the wing-disc/hematopoietic complex. Together, these findings define a nutrient–receptor–signaling axis that mechanistically links dietary and endogenous fructose to hematopoietic proliferation. By revealing an unexpected systemic role for a gustatory receptor, our work expands the conceptual framework of nutrient sensing and suggests conserved principles by which metabolic state governs blood cell development across animals."},{"t":"人类渐渗结构变异和选择的全球图谱","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.adz7518?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Genetic introgression from Neanderthals and Denisovans shaped modern human genomes; however, introgressed structural variants (SVs ≥ 50 base pairs) remain challenging to discover. We integrated high-quality phased assemblies from four new Papua New Guinea (PNG) haploid genomes with 94 published assemblies of diverse ancestry to infer an introgressed SV map. Introgressed SVs are enriched in genes (47%), including critical genomic disorder regions, and are most abundant in PNG genomes. We identified 11 centromeres likely derived from archaic hominins, adding unexplored diversity to centromere genomics. Pangenome genotyping of these 98 assemblies across 1363 samples revealed 16 adaptive SVs, many associated with immune-related genes and expression, in the PNG genomes. We hypothesize that archaic SVs contributed to reproductive success, underscoring introgression as a major force in human adaptive evolution."},{"t":"用于治疗胆汁酸相关肝脏疾病的一流脉冲 FXR 激动剂","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10633-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Nuclear receptors are central regulators of metabolism1, yet therapeutic strategies that enforce continuous receptor activation frequently lead to reduced efficacy and unacceptable toxicity. Here we report a first-principles drug design strategy that aligns pharmacokinetics with physiological signalling cycles. We developed linafexor, a potent non-bile-acid agonist of the farnesoid X receptor (FXR)2; it is engineered for rapid systemic clearance, which enables pulsatile receptor activation that mirrors endogenous bile acid dynamics3,4,5. Linafexor has robust efficacy across multiple preclinical models of metabolic dysfunction-associated steatohepatitis6, liver fibrosis7, primary biliary cholangitis and primary sclerosing cholangitis8,9. Transcriptomic analyses reveal that, unlike long-acting FXR agonists10,11, linafexor preserves cyclic FXR signalling, avoids receptor downregulation and prevents broad transcriptional dysregulation. Direct manipulation of delivery patterns demonstrates that sustained FXR activation—independent of compound identity—induces severe toxicity, establishing activation duration as a determinant of therapeutic index. In phase 1 clinical studies (ClinicalTrials.gov; NCT05082779), linafexor administered once daily produces transient FXR pathway engagement, marked by (1) induction of FGF1912,13,14, a key endocrine mediator of bile acid feedback regulation; and (2) suppression of C415, an intermediate reflecting hepatic bile acid synthesis, with no treatment-related adverse events. Together, these findings identify pulsatile FXR activation as a mechanistically grounded and clinically translatable strategy, and establish linafexor as a first-in-class therapeutic for bile acid–related liver diseases."},{"t":"骨骼肌 NOX4 的下降会破坏运动引起的适应性稳态并加剧生物衰老","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz1953?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"A decline in nuclear factor erythroid 2–related factor 2 (NFE2L2)–orchestrated adaptive homeostasis and oxidative distress are thought to be key features of aging. In contracting skeletal muscle, the reactive oxygen species–producing enzyme NADPH oxidase 4 (NOX4) is a potent inducer of NFE2L2 adaptive homeostasis. Here, we report that skeletal muscle NOX4 levels decline in aged mice and humans, resulting in abrogated NFE2L2 adaptive homeostasis, increased protein oxidative damage, and decreased muscle function. We show that deleting NOX4 in skeletal muscle exacerbates the physiological decline associated with aging, resulting in overt sarcopenia and frailty, characterized by physical inactivity, increased adiposity, systemic inflammation, whole-body insulin resistance, and advanced liver disease in aged chow-fed mice. The systems-wide physiological decline in aged skeletal muscle NOX4-deficient mice could be corrected by restoring NOX4 using viral approaches or activating NFE2L2 downstream with sulforaphane and reinstating adaptive homeostatic responses otherwise induced by exercise. Our findings provide important insights into the basis for the decline in NFE2L2-orchestrated adaptive homeostasis that accompanies physical inactivity with age and identify key mechanisms by which exercise may promote healthy aging."},{"t":"保守的双相静脉重塑程序控制斑马鱼下腔静脉的形成","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady3541?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The Inferior Vena Cava (IVC), the largest vein in humans, develops through replacement of the embryonic cardinal veins (CVs), a complex process prone to congenital anomalies, with major clinical implications. Yet, the mechanisms underlying IVC formation remain unclear. Here, we identify the zebrafish IVC, which emerges during metamorphosis and replaces the embryonic CVs, following a biphasic sequence similar to that described in mammals. Using longitudinal imaging and clonal lineage tracing, we demonstrate that the IVC originates exclusively from preexisting venous endothelial cells. Unexpectedly, genetic and pharmacological perturbations reveal that IVC formation proceeds independently of Vegfc/Vegfr3 signaling and instead involves Vegfa-dependent venous sprouting. Last, we demonstrate that the transition from CV to IVC marks a shift from a multifunctional embryonic vein to a specialized adult conduit adapted for high-volume blood transport. Overall, we identify a venous morphogenesis program akin to the mammalian IVC formation, providing a foundation for investigating venous anomalies."},{"t":"聚磷酸盐驱动的通用核苷到核苷-5'-三磷酸酶级联反应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6720227?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"核苷酸酶级联合成","kp":["[酶级联]: 双酶级联多磷酸驱动","[产物]: 全部标准rNTP和dNTP","[工艺]: 一锅法核苷转化为NTP"],"dp":1,"as":"核苷-5'-三磷酸（NTP）是核酸合成的基本构件，但其高效酶法合成长期受限于底物范围与转化效率。本研究构建了一条普适性的核苷到核苷-5'-三磷酸酶级联反应体系，由聚磷酸驱动能量供给，实现对多种核苷底物的广谱三磷酸化。该策略省去了昂贵的高能磷酸供体，大幅降低NTP制备成本，为mRNA药物合成、核酸探针标记、抗病毒核苷类似物前药开发等生物医药领域提供了可规模化、可持续的核苷酸制备新路径。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"A Universal Nucleoside‐to‐Nucleoside‐5′‐Triphosphate Enzyme Cascade Driven by Polyphosphate","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nucleoside‐5′‐triphosphates (NTPs) are important building blocks for nucleic acids, but the efficiency of their chemical synthesis is limited by the low yield of the final 5′‐triphosphorylation reaction. Here, we present an enzymatic cascade reaction involving just two enzymes that enable nucleosides‐to‐NTPs conversion for all canonical rNTPs and dNTPs. The cascade is used in a single one‐pot operation driven by cost‐efficient sodium polyphosphate (polyP). The broad‐spectrum deoxynucleoside kinase (Dm‐dNK) from\n                    Drosophila melanogaster\n                    converts nucleosides into nucleoside‐5′‐monophosphates (NMPs) using ATP. The polyphosphate kinase family 2, class III (EbPPK) from an\n                    Erysipelotrichaceae\n                    bacterium simultaneously recycles ATP required by Dm‐dNK and converts the NMPs to NTPs in a polyP‐dependent reaction. Importantly, only trace amounts of catalytic ATP (0.0001 equivalents or less) are required. In addition to canonical NTPs, the cascade can generate ribose‐ and base‐modified NTP analogues. This is demonstrated through the synthesis of a set of eleven modified nucleotides, including the four 2′‐fluoro‐2′‐dNTPs and nucleotides with 2,6‐diaminopurine as the nucleobase. Production of an essential component for mRNA therapeutics,\n                    N\n                    1‐methyl‐ΨTP (m\n                    1\n                    ΨTP), is demonstrated on a milligram scale."},{"t":"可逆900nm近红外光开关用于隐形可擦写2D和3D显示","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5802775?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"近红外光开关","kp":["[吸收波长]: 900nm近红外","[特性]: 可逆光开关","[应用]: 隐形写入2D/3D显示"],"dp":1,"as":"分子光开关在光照射下可在不同状态间可逆切换，在信息存储与智能材料领域潜力巨大。本研究开发了一种以900 nm近红外光驱动的可逆光开关分子，能够实现肉眼不可见的隐形信息写入，并支持二维和三维图案的高分辨率光控写入与擦除。900 nm近红外波段具有穿透性强、对样品无光损伤的优势，避免了紫外光写入的背景干扰与材料老化问题。该体系在防伪加密、光控柔性显示及高密度光存储等前沿应用中具有广阔前景。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"A Reversible 900 nm Near‐Infrared Photoswitch for Invisibly Writable 2D and 3D Displays","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Molecular photoswitches interchange between different states in response to light irradiation and represent prominent tools to deliberately control changes at the smallest scales. A standing challenge for their development is pushing absorptions into the low‐energy end of the electromagnetic spectrum, which is highly desirable to avoid photodamage, allows mixing of photoresponsive components, and maximizes the available color range. Here we report on a novel photoswitch motif,\n                    peri\n                    ‐benzo[\n                    a\n                    ]fluoranthenethioindigo (PBFT), enabling direct excitation with near‐infrared (NIR) light up to 900 nm wavelengths in a fully reversible fashion. PBFT provides an outstanding property profile with high isomer yields, good thermal bistability, and strongly distinct color changes from pale green to deep blue. Application within a commercially available and easy‐to‐use polymer material allows to realize reversible and spatially resolved inscription of information with extremely long wavelengths of light. Writing information into versatile handheld 2D and 3D optical displays and optical memories is thus possible with non‐damaging irradiation, invisible to the naked eye."},{"t":"4.1-Ga 火星陨石 Teghaza 001 中的诺亚水圈组成部分","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3420?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"The recent discovery of a 4.1-billion-year-old (Ga) Martian gabbroic diorite enables an assessment of water reservoirs on early Mars. Measurements of H\n                    2\n                    O and D/H in igneous Ca-phosphates record mixing between D-poor magmatic water and a D-rich component that retains an imprint of the ancient Martian hydrosphere. The D/H ratio of magmatic water is similar in Martian magmas with different ages and mantle sources, indicating that early differentiation processes did not fractionate H isotopes in the primordial Martian mantle. The D-rich component was assimilated by migrating magmas that interacted with aqueously altered basaltic crust. Our minimum bound on the D/H ratio of the Martian hydrosphere at 4.1 Ga (~2× the D/H ratio of Earth seawater) supports models of rapid H loss to space from Mars’ juvenile atmosphere.","tp":"火星古水圈","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者通过对41亿年前的火星陨石Teghaza 001（一种辉长闪长岩）进行H₂O和D/H测量，评估早期火星的水库组成。火成钙磷酸盐记录了贫D岩浆水与富D组分的混合，后者保留了古火星水圈的印记。结果表明早期火星的分异过程较为均一，为认识火星水文演化历史提供了关键证据。"},{"t":"肝细胞内活性氧物质控制的脂质结合策略","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5582949?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Synthetic catalytic antioxidants offer attractive alternatives to enzymatic redox regulators, yet their biological application is frequently limited by poor stability, formulation challenges, and insufficient control over intracellular localization. Here, we report a lipid conjugation strategy that enables the covalent integration of manganese Salen (EUK) catalysts into phospholipid membranes. A modular synthetic route is established in which a carboxylate‐functionalized EUK derivative is coupled to an amine‐terminated phospholipid tail, yielding a structurally defined phospholipid‐EUK conjugate that retains catalytic activity upon liposome formulation, with controlled catalyst loading and long‐term colloidal integrity. The resulting liposomes exhibit efficient catalytic degradation of reactive oxygen species (ROS) with activity scaling with conjugate content. Importantly, covalent anchoring of the catalyst within the lipid bilayer prevents aggregation and precipitation observed for non‐conjugated analogues. Using an acetaminophen challenged steatotic HepaRG cell model, we demonstrate that lipid conjugation enables intracellular delivery of the catalyst and sustained reduction of elevated ROS levels without inducing cytotoxicity. This effort establishes a chemically precise approach for positioning organometallic catalysts within biomimetic membranes and highlights these conjugates as versatile platforms for controlled intracellular redox modulation.","tp":"催化抗氧化剂","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"合成催化抗氧化剂是酶类氧化还原调节因子的有吸引力替代品，但稳定性差、制剂困难和细胞内定位控制不足限制了其应用。研究开发了脂质偶联策略，将锰Salen（EUK）催化剂共价整合到磷脂膜中。该模块化合成路线实现了催化剂在肝细胞内的精确定位和活性氧调控，为抗氧化治疗提供了新方法。"},{"t":"电荷转移注入的动力学-能量瓶颈主导有机太阳能电池的能量损失","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71177?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机光伏电荷转移","kp":["[核心机制]: 电荷转移态动力学-能量瓶颈","[方法]: 时间分辨荧光+贝叶斯优化"],"dp":1,"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究揭示了有机太阳能电池中电荷转移（CT）态构成动能-能量瓶颈，同时制约开路电压和电荷注入效率，导致能量损失。该发现从动力学和热力学双重角度阐明了CT态在有机光伏器件中的核心限制作用。通过优化给体-受体界面能量排列，有望突破现有有机太阳能电池的效率上限。","ot":"A Kinetic–Energetic Bottleneck of Charge‐Transfer Injection Governs Energy Loss in Organic Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The charge‐transfer (CT) state in organic solar cells constitutes a kinetic–energetic bottleneck that simultaneously controls charge generation and nonradiative voltage loss. By combining time‐resolved photoluminescence (100 ps–20 ns) with a physics‐constrained Bayesian optimization framework, we show that the multidimensional kinetic network collapses onto a single emergent descriptor: the effective CT injection rate,\n                    \n                      k\n                      CT\n                    \n                    . Crucially,\n                    \n                      k\n                      CT\n                    \n                    is not a microscopic rate constant but a renormalized collective parameter arising from the coupled competition among exciton injection, CT population redistribution, and CT nonradiative recombination. Across six donor–acceptor systems spanning nearly two orders of magnitude in\n                    \n                      k\n                      CT\n                    \n                    , we uncover a universal scaling: each decade increase in injection rate incurs an additional ∼85 meV nonradiative energy loss. This scaling reveals an intrinsic kinetic–energetic trade‐off imposed by the topology of the CT manifold—accelerating injection inevitably amplifies recombination loss. Breaking this bottleneck requires restructuring the CT network to decouple charge dissociation from recombination pathways, offering a route beyond the present voltage ceiling of organic photovoltaics."},{"t":"迪亚曼蒂纳区拥有 530 万年前的深海鲸鱼墓地","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10546-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Whale falls are biodiversity oases at seabeds1,2,3,4,5,6, yet their record from the oceans has remained sparse and fragmentary6,7. Here we report the discovery of a vast whale necropolis in the Diamantina Zone (4,616- to 7,001-m depth), extending about 1,200 km along the sea floor of the southeastern Indian Ocean. This area has a deep and extensive accumulation comprising five modern natural whale-fall communities and 476 fossil cetaceans recorded. We show that carcasses host specialized communities dominated by brittle stars, bone-boring worms and chemosynthesis-based bivalves and that the fossil record in this area comprises both extant and extinct deep-diving beaked whales. Isotopic dating shows that whale falls in this region have occurred since at least 5.3 million years ago. These findings reshape the understanding of the limits and biogeography of whale-fall ecosystems and establish some deep sea floors as a fossil archive for tracing cetacean evolution over geological time."},{"t":"一艘游轮经常出入的阿拉斯加峡湾发生了 481 米高的山体滑坡海啸","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aec3187?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Early in the morning of 10 August 2025, a &gt;64 × 10\n                    6\n                    –cubic meter landslide struck Tracy Arm fjord in Alaska. The landslide was preconditioned by glacial retreat caused by climate change. The resulting 481-meter runup megatsunami followed an initial 100-meter-high breaking wave traveling at &gt;70 meters per second. The landslide was preceded by several days of microseismicity, which increased in rate and magnitude until ~1 hour before failure. The landslide produced globally observed long-period seismic waves equivalent in size to a moment magnitude 5.4 earthquake. A long-period (~66 second) global seismic signal, produced by a landslide-induced seiche trapped within the fjord, persisted for up to 36 hours, the second time a days-long seiche had thus been observed. With fjord regions increasingly visited by cruise ships, and climate change making similar events more likely, this unanticipated, near-miss event highlights the growing risk from landslides and tsunamis in coastal environments."},{"t":"2D 规划无法管理 3D 海洋","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/science.aei0666?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"5f金属掺杂二维团簇烯：通过连续平面载流子迁移实现高效光催化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00225-0?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化烯烃裂解","kp":["[材料]: 铀酰-多铌酸盐2D簇烯","[光催化]: 可见光驱动烯烃断裂"],"as":"研究团队在亚纳米尺度将铀酰单元与多金属氧酸盐（多铌酸盐）进行集成，构建出一种二维 UNbO 团簇烯（clusterphene）新型材料。该材料具有连续的载流子输运通道，通过 5f 电子结构的锕系元素与多酸的协同作用，显著提升光生电荷的分离与迁移效率，从而实现高效光催化性能。研究亮点在于首次将 5f 金属铀引入团簇烯框架，拓展了锕系元素在光催化能源转化（如水分解、CO₂还原）领域的应用前景，为设计新型二维光催化材料提供了新思路。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"5f metal-incorporated 2D clusterphene: Enabling high-efficiency photocatalysis through continuous planar carrier migrati","b":"Integrating uranyl units with polyoxoniobates at the subnanoscale creates a 2D UNbO clusterphene with a continuous carrier-migration path that minimizes electron-hole recombination, enabling efficient visible-light-driven alkene cleavage and paving the way for advanced 5f metal-based heterogeneous photocatalysts."},{"t":"2590.8 万元，千里智驾收购视觉毫米波融合雷达企业融感科技 100% 股权","d":"2026-06-12","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/963/225.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"资本运作","tp":"融合雷达传感器","kp":["传感器[智驾]: 视觉+毫米波雷达融合","[输出]: 点云堪比激光雷达","覆盖范围[智驾]: L2至L4"],"as":"6月11日，千里科技控股子公司千里智驾公告，拟以2590.8万元收购宁波市融感科技有限公司100%股权。融感科技成立于2023年6月，总部位于浙江宁波，是一家专注于视觉与毫米波融合雷达技术的智能驾驶感知企业。此次收购旨在补强千里智驾在多传感器融合感知领域的技术储备，将视觉摄像头与毫米波雷达的前沿融合方案纳入其智能驾驶技术体系。交易反映出自驾行业垂直整合加速、感知硬件自主化趋势，有助于千里智驾降低对外部供应商的依赖并提升整车智能驾驶系统的协同性能。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.5},"b":"6 月 11 日消息，千里科技 6 月 11 日（今天）公告，控股子公司千里智驾拟收购宁波市融感科技有限公司（简称“融感科技”）\n，交易价格为 2590.8 万元。\nIT之家查询获悉，融感科技成立于 2023 年 6 月，总部位于浙江省宁波市，是一家\n技术研发和制造企业。该公司旗下产品主打视觉加毫米波雷达融合传感器，基于 AI 算法，号称\n提供堪比激光雷达效果的点云输出\n公告称，此次收购旨在进一步构建\n覆盖 L2 至 L4 级别的全栈式智能驾驶解决方案\n，践行“软硬一体、全栈交付”的战略部署，巩固公司在智能驾驶产业的核心竞争力。\n今年 5 月末有消息称，吉利中央研究院辅助驾驶团队\n将在近期被整合入千里科技\n，该团队目前规模为数百人，已有人收到了转移合同的通知。知情人士透露，此轮整合后，吉利研究院辅助驾驶团队将被平移至千里智驾与极氪的合资公司千里浩瀚。"},{"t":"1,7-二棓酸四碳硼烷：介于亲核闭簇和“反三明治”二棓烯之间","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6667904?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    This manuscript describes the synthesis and chemistry of an unprecedented carborane cluster of low‐valent main‐group elements with a unique structural motif. On the basis of a dianionic borole π‐ligand platform (L = [R\n                    5\n                    (C\n                    4\n                    B)]\n                    2−\n                    ) an “inverse sandwich”, Janus‐type digallylene complex L(Ga\n                    +I\n                    )\n                    2\n                    featuring two nucleophilic Ga(I) ions was accessed. This compound can also be described as a\n                    closo\n                    ‐type 1,7‐digallatetracarborane cluster. Preliminary reactivity studies on this new compound class have been conducted. Assessment of Lewis‐basicity in coordination chemistry with transition metals and main group Lewis‐acids indicate electronic communication between the Ga‐atoms. Oxidation with free borole (L) gives rise to bent digallocene L(Ga\n                    +II\n                    )–(Ga\n                    +II\n                    )L, the first group 13 element‐based dimetallocene‐type compound. Examples demonstrate that L(Ga\n                    +I\n                    )\n                    2\n                    can behave as both a discrete digallacarborane cluster and a bis‐gallylene π‐complex capable of releasing Ga\n                    +\n                    .","tp":"碳硼烷化学","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"德国研究团队合成了一种罕见的低价主族元素碳硼烷簇合物。基于二阴离子硼杂环戊二烯π配体平台，构建了Janus型二棓烯络合物，其结构介于亲核闭簇与'反三明治'构型之间。该工作拓展了主族元素低氧化态化学的结构多样性，对理解Ga(I)等重主族元素的金属-金属相互作用具有重要意义。"},{"t":"通过界面脱氯与有机自由基稳定化的协同作用将水体污染物升级回收为长链聚合物","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3215238?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"污染物资源化","kp":["催化剂[污染物升级回收]: 氮掺杂碳包覆高熵氧化物HEO@NC","合成方法[HEO@NC]: 原位碳热还原","活化机制[HEO@NC]: 活化过碘酸盐选择性氧化聚合"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发了一种将水体污染物转化为长链聚合物的升级回收策略，结合高熵氧化物催化剂实现界面脱氯与有机自由基稳定化的协同作用。该技术可将含氯有机污染物转化为高附加值聚合物材料，同时实现污染治理和资源回收的双重目标。高熵氧化物的多金属协同效应为催化反应路径调控提供了新的设计思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Upcycling Water Pollutants Into Long‐Chain Polymers via Synergistic Interfacial Dechlorination and Organic Radical Stabilization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐entropy oxides (HEOs) offer unusual electronic structures arising from lattice distortion, multimetal synergy, and high chemical stability. Here we report nitrogen‐doped carbon‐encapsulated HEOs catalysts (HEO@NC) synthesized by in situ carbothermal reduction for efficient pollutant removal and upcycling through selective oxidative polymerization. HEO@NC activates periodate via an electron‐transfer pathway coupled with surface‐adsorbed hydroxyl radicals, enabling the selective conversion of phenolic contaminants into polymeric products under extreme pH and strong ionic interference. Relative to metal‐free nitrogen‐doped carbon, HEO@NC markedly enhances periodate activation through interfacial electronic coupling and achieves a periodate utilization efficiency of 449.2%, far exceeding that of conventional mineralization. Density functional theory and experimental analyses reveal complementary roles of the HEOs components: Co/Ni provide periodate‐binding sites, Pt lowers the barrier for electron transport, Bi/Pb promote charge delocalization to stabilize polymeric intermediates, and oxygen orbitals strengthen periodate coordination and surface charge transfer via\n                    p\n                    –\n                    d\n                    hybridization. This synergy drives dechlorination‐coupled polymerization with sustained 4‐chlorophenol removal at ultralow oxidant consumption. HEO@NC further maintained &gt; 95% efficiency with negligible metal leaching during 20‐day treatment of real coal chemical wastewater, demonstrating the potential for sustainable and low‐chemical‐consumption remediation of industrial‐relevant wastewater.","aip":1},{"t":"高耐久高功率锌空气电池：{Fe₃O}分子炉锻造双位点催化剂实现碱性介质中协同氧还原","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6643887?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池催化剂","kp":["催化剂[Zn-Air电池]: 分子炉锻造双位点催化剂","催化机制[双位点]: 协同氧还原","应用介质[催化剂]: 碱性水溶液"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用{Fe3O}分子炉合成的双位点催化剂实现了锌空气电池中碱性介质下氧还原反应（ORR）的高效催化。原子级金属-氧簇作为连接单原子与纳米颗粒的桥梁，双活性位点的协同效应显著降低了反应过电位。该策略解决了锌空气电池功率密度和循环耐久性不足的问题，推动了该储能技术的实用化进程。","dp":1,"ot":"Unlocking Durable High‐Power Zn‐Air Batteries: {Fe3O} Molecular Furnace‐Forged Dual‐Site Catalysts Enabling Synergistic Oxygen Reduction in Alkaline Media","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Atomic‐level precision metal‐oxo clusters serve as a unique bridge linking single atoms and nanoparticles. Their highly ordered, quasi‐molecular structure effectively promotes electron transfer and optimizes charge deposition kinetics, thereby significantly enhancing the catalytic activity and stability of electrochemical oxygen reduction reactions. Here, we constructed a single‐atom‐nanoparticle dual‐engine catalyst (Fe\n                    3\n                    C/Fe‐NC\n                    1050\n                    ) by in situ domain‐confined complexation of ZIF‐8(Zn) using {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} as a core metal‐oxo cluster. The unique flexible ligand‐carboxylate group of {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} clusters provide a protective barrier for the metal atoms distribution during pyrolysis, work in synergy with the ZIF‐8 framework to provide a conductive substrate. The precisely exposed Fe\n                    3\n                    C (110) crystal plane modulates the electronic structure of neighboring Fe‐N\n                    4\n                    active sites, thus reducing the adsorption energy of key step O\n                    2\n                    →*OOH and endowing the material with excellent methanol resistance and stability. Structural characterization and theoretical calculations reveal that the synergistic interaction between {Fe\n                    3\n                    O} clusters and the carbon substrate provides a stable conductive network and active sites, achieving a maximum power density of 249.0 mW cm\n                    −2\n                    in alkaline zinc‐air batteries and demonstrates exceptionally long cycle life of 700 h at the current density of 2.0 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    . This design provides crucial insights for the nanoengineering of metal‐oxo clusters and atomic‐scale design of catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"超窄间距极性绿色芳香族Dion-Jacobson杂化钙钛矿实现高灵敏稳定自驱动X射线探测","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73657?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿探测器","kp":["材料[X射线探测]: DJ型极性无铅绿色杂化钙钛矿","特性[DJ钙钛矿]: 高稳定性+短层间距+自供能"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发了一种超窄间距极性绿色芳香族Dion-Jacobson（DJ）型杂化钙钛矿材料，实现了高灵敏度和高稳定性的自驱动X射线探测。DJ型钙钛矿因其独特的二维结构和低离子迁移特性，在辐射探测领域具有天然优势。该材料无需外部偏压即可实现高效X射线响应，在医学成像和安全检测领域具有应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Ultranarrow‐Spaced Polar Green Aromatic Dion–Jacobson Hybrid Perovskite Enables Highly Sensitive and Stable Self‐Powered X‐Ray Detection","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Dion‐Jacobson (DJ) hybrid perovskites are considered as highly promising X‐ray detection materials due to their high stability and short interlayer spacing. However, the large‐scale commercial development of these materials is challenged due to severe ion migration at high voltage and lead toxicity. Here, we successfully obtained a DJ‐type polar lead‐free green hybrid perovskite (4AMPY)\n                    2\n                    AgBiBr\n                    8\n                    (\n                    1\n                    ) by inserting 4‐aminomethylpyridine (4AMPY) aromatic diamine into 3D Cs\n                    2\n                    AgBiBr\n                    6\n                    , and achieved efficient and stable self‐powered X‐ray detection. Specifically, owing to the insertion of 4AMPY,\n                    1\n                    crystallizes in polar space group\n                    P\n                    2\n                    1\n                    and exhibits a significant bulk photovoltaic effect. Additionally, strong hydrogen‐bonding interactions between 4AMPY and adjacent inorganic layers lead to an ultranarrow interlayer spacing of 3.09 Å. Meanwhile, the enhanced electron cloud density in aromatic diamines improves the charge transfer channel of\n                    1\n                    and enhances its X‐ray detection performance. Therefore, among all DJ‐type lead‐free hybrid perovskites,\n                    1\n                    achieves record‐breaking sensitivities of 661.4 and 9465.2 µC Gy\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0 and 100 V, respectively. Importantly,\n                    1\n                    exhibits excellent storage stability, with its sensitivity remaining at 97.5% (0 V) and 96.6% (100 V) of the initial value after three months. This work will greatly promote the development of polar DJ‐type lead‐free perovskite‐based self‐powered X‐ray detectors."},{"t":"自噬蛋白 ATG-9 通过运输神经肽受体促进秀丽隐杆线虫的厌恶学习","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531054123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Autophagy is a degradative process that maintains cellular homeostasis. Autophagy biogenesis occurs at synapses, but its impact on synaptic functions is incompletely understood. Here we show that, in\n                    \n                      Caenorhabditis elegans\n                    \n                    , synaptic ATG-9, the only transmembrane autophagy protein, contributes to aversive learning under mitochondrial stress. Analysis of the neuronal translatome reveals that autophagy is upregulated by stress in the octopaminergic RIC neuron and it promotes aversive learning. Inactivating autophagy genes, including\n                    atg-9\n                    , reduces aversive learning. Mitochondrial stress increases synaptic ATG-9 through AP-1- and AP-2-dependent exocytosis and endocytosis, respectively, and reducing synaptic ATG-9 impairs aversive learning. We further identify the FRPR-6 neuropeptide receptor as a substrate of ATG-9 modulation. Both\n                    atg-9\n                    and\n                    frpr-6\n                    promote aversive learning and RIC activities, and the abundance of FRPR-6 in the RIC neurite depends on\n                    atg-9\n                    . We postulate that ATG-9-containing synaptic compartments promote neuronal plasticity through modulating receptor trafficking to enable aversive learning under systemic mitochondrial stress."},{"t":"桨轮式双铜分子催化剂上切换氢转移路径实现高效电催化乙炔半加氢","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73644?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化半氢化","kp":["催化剂[乙炔半加氢]: 桨轮式双铜分子催化剂","机制切换[双铜催化剂]: Eley-Rideal与Langmuir-Hinshelwood间切换"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究阐明了电催化乙炔半加氢（EAH）反应中的氢转移路径，通过桨轮型双铜分子催化剂实现高效乙炔选择性加氢。研究系统解析了双铜位点上氢原子的活化和转移机制，为精确控制加氢选择性提供了分子层面的理解。该技术可在温和条件下将乙炔转化为乙烯，避免了传统热催化加氢的高能耗问题。","dp":1,"ot":"Switching Hydrogen Transfer Pathway Over Paddle‐Wheel Dicopper Molecular Catalysts for Efficient Electrocatalytic Acetylene Semihydrogenation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Elucidating the hydrogen transfer pathway of electrocatalytic acetylene semihydrogenation (EAH) is crucial for understanding the catalytic mechanism and designing high‐performance catalysts, but faces grand challenges. Herein, we unprecedentedly switch the hydrogen transfer pathway between Eley‐Rideal mechanism and Langmuir‐Hinshelwood mechanism over paddle‐wheel dicopper molecular catalysts, where the charge density of the Cu sites is effectively modulated by the ligands with different electron‐withdrawing ability. Extended X‐ray absorption fine structure (EXAFS), operando characterizations, and theoretical calculations together reveal that the moderate charge density of Cu sites in benzoic acid‐Cu catalyst (BA‐Cu) inhibits H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation and reduces C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    adsorption energy, promoting the co‐adsorption of C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O and steering the EAH through the Eley‐Rideal mechanism. In acetic acid‐Cu (AA‐Cu) with low charge density and monofluorobenzoic acid‐Cu (MFBA‐Cu) with high charge density, the Cu sites facilitate H\n                    2\n                    O dissociation to *H and hydrogenate C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    via the Langmuir‐Hinshelwood mechanism. In 1 \n                    M\n                    KOH aqueous solution, the BA‐Cu delivers an ethylene partial current density of 328 mA/cm\n                    2\n                    with an ethylene Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 96.4% at –0.9 V versus RHE, which is about 2‐fold and 1.4‐fold higher than AA‐Cu and MFBA‐Cu. This work provides mechanistic insights for the rational design of high‐performance electrocatalysts by regulating the hydrogenation kinetics."},{"t":"超交换辅助的可扩展铁单原子催化剂上Fe(IV)=O链形成用于低化学试剂流式水净化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73668?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁单原子催化剂","kp":["催化剂[水净化]: 可扩展铁单原子催化剂","活性物种[Fe SAC]: 超交换辅助Fe(IV)=O链"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究在可规模化铁单原子催化剂上实现了Fe(IV)=O活性链的超交换辅助形成，用于流式体系中的低化学药剂水净化。通过聚合基废水处理方法，将污染物去除与资源回收耦合，在低能耗条件下运行。超交换机制稳定了高价铁活性位点，提升了催化降解持久性，为连续流污水处理提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Superexchange‐Assisted Fe(IV)=O Chain Formation on Scalable Iron Single‐Atom Catalysts for Low‐Chemical Water Purification in Flow","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymerization‐based wastewater treatment can couple decontamination with resource recovery at low energy input by transforming dilute organics into separable products. However, it requires selective oxidant activation, and iron, although abundant and industrially relevant, often forms metastable over‐oxidizing adducts that suppress polymerization selectivity. Here, we design and synthesize a distance‐tailored iron single‐atom catalyst (Fe‐SAC) featuring a coupled Fe\n                    1\n                    ‐Fe\n                    2\n                    pair that enables sequential generation of reactive Fe(IV)═O species from peroxymonosulfate. Theory and experiments reveal that formation of the first Fe\n                    1\n                    (IV)═O triggers a spin‐state transition of the adjacent Fe\n                    2\n                    site to a high‐spin configuration, while the finely tuned Fe\n                    1\n                    ─Fe\n                    2\n                    separation geometrically matches the O─O bond in the oxidant. This spin reconfiguration strengthens Fe─O covalency and promotes a superexchange‐assisted pathway, leading to chain formation of Fe\n                    2\n                    (IV)═O through bidentate axial bonding and site‐to‐site electronic coupling. In a continuous‐flow reactor, the scalable Fe‐SAC increases polymerization selectivity from 29.9% to 73.3% and boosts electron utilization from 156.8% to 443.8%. Life‐cycle and techno‐economic analyses further indicate ∼88% and ∼79% reductions in environmental impacts for catalyst synthesis and operation, respectively, together with an estimated ∼90% decrease in pollutant removal cost. This work establishes a design principle to unlock selective Fe(IV)═O chemistry for low‐chemical, polymerization‐based water purification with engineering viability."},{"t":"亚细胞金属组学网络调控生理效应：基于集成SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS平台的单细胞映射","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2601472123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"亚细胞金属成像","kp":["表征平台[亚细胞金属组]: SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS集成"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种集成SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS的联合平台，用于单细胞水平的亚细胞金属组网络映射。该平台可对植物细胞内必需、非必需和有毒金属元素的空间分布进行高分辨率成像，揭示金属组网络如何调控生理结局。这一技术突破为理解金属元素在细胞内的功能分区和毒理学机制提供了前所未有的分析能力。","dp":1,"ot":"Subcellular metallomic networks orchestrate physiological outcomes: Single-cell mapping via an integrated SEM-FIB-TOF-SIMS platform","b":"The spatial organization of essential, nonessential, and toxic metal(loid) elements (MEs) within plant cells underpins physiological function. Yet, comprehensive subcellular imaging of the full ME spectrum remains challenging due to trade-offs among spatial resolution, elemental coverage, and structural correlation. Here, we present an integrated scanning electron microscopy–focused ion beam–time-of-flight-secondary ion mass spectrometry platform that overcomes these limitations by achieving nanoscale coregistration of ultrastructure with ME distribution. Applying this high-fidelity workflow to\n                    Arabidopsis\n                    , soybean, and wheat, we constructed single-cell metallome maps revealing an evolutionarily conserved subcellular architecture: chloroplasts enrich essential MEs (e.g., magnesium, iron, copper), whereas vacuoles compartmentalize nonessential [e.g., lanthanum (La)] and toxic MEs [e.g., cadmium (Cd), lead, arsenic]. We demonstrate that while this architecture remains stable under homeostasis, it undergoes dynamic, stimulus-specific, and dose-dependent remodeling under stress. Low-dose La(III) enhances pairwise and higher-order colocalizations of essential MEs within chloroplasts, correlating with improved photosynthetic efficiency and growth. High-dose La(III) induces nonphysiological La-ME associations and, critically, drives aberrant Cd(II) accumulation in chloroplasts—revealing a cross-toxicity mechanism wherein La(III) disrupts native sequestration barriers. In contrast, although high-dose Cd(II) is largely excluded from chloroplasts, it triggers a widespread redistribution of essential MEs, progressively eroding spatial organization. Thus, while both ions inhibit growth, they perturb metallomic networks via distinct mechanisms: La(III)-mediated disruption of sequestration vs. Cd(II)-induced systemic compartmental collapse. Our findings establish that subcellular ME networks are dynamically regulated and orchestrate physiological outcomes."},{"t":"电化学储能系统的结构化风险评估：集成一致性增强FAHP与复杂耦合关系网络","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008202?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能系统风险评估","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Structured risk assessment for electrochemical energy storage system: Integrating consistency enhanced-FAHP and complex coupling relationship network"},{"t":"均苯四甲酸二酰亚胺共晶中通过可逆结构切换实现刺激响应三重态发射和X射线闪烁","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3402295?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"刺激响应发光材料","kp":["材料[刺激响应发光]: 均苯四甲酸二酰亚胺共晶","机制[三线态发射]: 保持结晶性可逆结构切换"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究基于均苯四甲酸二酰亚胺（pyromellitic diimide）共晶体材料，通过可逆结构切换实现刺激响应型三重态发射和X射线闪烁。智能刺激响应发光材料可通过外部刺激实现可编程、可逆的发光调控，在信息加密、防伪和X射线检测等领域具有应用潜力。材料利用结构相变机制在三重态发射与非发射态之间可逆切换，展现了分子晶体在光功能材料设计中的独特优势。","dp":1,"ot":"Stimuli‐Responsive Triplet Emission and X‐Ray Scintillation via Reversible Structural Switching in Pyromellitic Diimide Cocrystals","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Smart stimuli‐responsive luminescent materials with programmable and reversible emission are highly desirable for intelligent imaging and information security. Stimuli‐responsive organic materials utilizing triplet excitons are particularly attractive owing to their pronounced sensitivity to solid‐state packing. However, crystallinity‐preserving reversible structural switching that enables simultaneous control over X‐ray‐excited luminescence (scintillation) remains largely unexplored. Herein, donor‐acceptor halogen‐bonded cocrystals were constructed using\n                    N\n                    ,\n                    N\n                    ′‐bis(n‐butyl)pyromellitic diimide (Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI) and 3,6‐dibromocarbazole (Br\n                    2\n                    Cz) or 3,6‐diiodocarbazole (I\n                    2\n                    Cz). The green cocrystal Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz‐G exhibits room‐temperature phosphorescence (RTP) and bright radioluminescence, whereas its orange polymorph is nearly non‐emissive. In contrast, the I\n                    2\n                    Cz‐based cocrystal displays thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF), representing an alternative triplet exciton utilization pathway. Notably, mild organic‐vapor stimulation triggers reversible order‐to‐order polymorphic interconversion of Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz, which reorganizes halogen‐bonding motifs and, thus achieves crystallinity‐retained “on/off” switching of radioluminescence. Benefiting from efficient triplet exciton utilization, Bu\n                    2\n                    PMDI‐Br\n                    2\n                    Cz‐G enables high‐resolution static X‐ray imaging (37 lp mm\n                    −1\n                    ) and real‐time dynamic imaging (2 K, 60 fps) with negligible afterglow. Furthermore, the reversible solvent‐triggered luminescence switching facilitates rewritable multimodal information encryption by integrating photoluminescence and radioluminescence as orthogonal readout channels. This work demonstrates cocrystal engineering as a powerful strategy for reversibly programming triplet‐exciton emission and X‐ray scintillation via structural switching in organic solids."},{"t":"空间双壳层结构通过增强局部碱性实现稳定的阴离子交换膜电解水","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb8831?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"阴离子交换膜电解水","kp":["[AEMWE稳定性]: 铈诱导双壳层增强局部碱性"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究针对阴离子交换膜水电解（AEMWE）制氢技术，设计了空间双壳层结构以增强局部碱性环境。AEMWE作为绿色制氢的重要技术路线，虽具成本优势但受限于催化剂活性和膜稳定性。双壳层结构通过局部碱浓度富集有效提升催化剂反应动力学和耐久性，为解决非贵金属催化剂在弱碱性环境下的性能瓶颈提供了新思路，推动AEMWE向大规模高效制氢应用迈进。","dp":1,"ot":"Spatial double-shelled structure achieving stable anion exchange membrane water electrolysis via enhanced local alkalinity","b":"Anion exchange membrane water electrolysis (AEMWE) represents a promising technology for green hydrogen production. Although numerous efforts have been devoted to optimize the anode catalysis by structural and chemical modulation, the effectiveness of such strategies in enhancing stability remains limited. Herein, we propose a cerium-induced double-shelled structure formation strategy that modulates the electrode/electrolyte interfacial microenvironment through spatial configuration engineering, effectively suppressing anodic corrosion. Mechanistic studies revealed that the associated nanospace enrichment effect increased the coverage of surface hydroxide ion (OH\n                    −\n                    ) species, thereby enhancing the local alkalinity at the material surface and effectively suppressing ion leaching. The double-shelled cerium dioxide (CeO\n                    2\n                    )/lanthanum cobaltite (LaCoO\n                    3\n                    )-10% catalyst demonstrated outstanding performance in the AEMWE device, achieving an industrial-relevant current density of 3 amperes per square centimeter at 1.88 volts. Furthermore, the catalyst exhibited exceptional long-term stability exceeding 2000 hours under simulated industrial conditions. Our findings underscore the importance of engineering the physical spatial configuration to regulate the interfacial microenvironment, offering a strategy to address the corrosion degradation of anode catalysts."},{"t":"具有精确排列的发光体的[2]Rotaxane取向异构体的选择性合成：面向信息存储和加密的方向依赖性发射","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3759413?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Aiming at the precise synthesis of rotaxane orientational isomers and the further elucidation of attractive orientation effects, a novel steric hindrance‐controlled selective stopper exchange approach has been successfully developed. This method enables the facile and selective synthesis of six pairs of [2]rotaxane orientational isomers with precisely arranged luminogens, greatly enriching both the structural and functional diversity of such isomers. Notably, the resulting orientational isomers exhibit orientation‐dependent emission behaviors, particularly in wavelengths, photoluminescence quantum yields, and circularly polarized luminescence (CPL) performances, endowing them with great potential for information storage and encryption. This proof‐of‐concept study provides not only a practical and efficient strategy for the efficient synthesis of rotaxane orientational isomers, but also a novel platform for constructing chiral luminescent materials with desired properties for wide applications.","tp":"轮烷异构体","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了位阻控制的选择性封端交换策略，成功合成了六对具有精确排列发光体的[2]轮烷取向异构体。该异构体的方向依赖性发射特性使其在信息存储和加密领域具有应用前景，丰富了超分子结构功能多样性。"},{"t":"用葡萄糖驱动的共生生物可吸收绷带恢复内源电场以促进糖尿病伤口愈合","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9445?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Endogenous electric fields (EFs) are essential for tissue regeneration but are diminished under hyperglycemia conditions, thereby impeding diabetic wound healing. Here, we report a biodegradable, glucose-powered electronic fabric bandage (GEB) that restores wound-edge electrical fields and enables closed-loop wound healing. To avoid compromising clinical applicability, we integrated all components into a soft, lightweight, and breathable bandage design to replace the traditional bulky electrical stimulator design. We also show the universal glucose-powered electricity generation and therapeutic functions of the electronic bandage across species and organs in diabetic wound models. In diabetic mouse wounds, porcine skin defects, and intestinal injury, the bandage uses endogenous glucose for power generation, thereby reducing local glucose levels and restoring the endogenous EF that guided cell migration, reprogrammed macrophage polarization, and promoted angiogenesis, to accelerate wound healing. These findings should establish an “endogenous glucose-powered symbiotic bioelectronics” paradigm for next-generation bioelectronic medicine.","tp":"葡萄糖绷带","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究团队开发了一种可生物降解、由葡萄糖驱动的电子织物绷带（GEB），用于促进糖尿病伤口愈合。该绷带利用体液中的葡萄糖作为燃料发电，恢复伤口边缘的内源性电场，实现闭环愈合治疗。所有组件集成于柔软、轻便、透气的织物设计中，替代了传统笨重的电刺激设备，具有良好的临床转化潜力。"},{"t":"耦合电力与交通网络的弹性价格驱动协调：一种学习增强的混合整数重构方法","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600810X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网交通协同定价","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Resilient pricing-driven coordination of coupled power and transportation networks: A learning-augmented mixed-integer reformulation approach"},{"t":"基于熵惩罚方法的非线性哈密顿-雅可比方程粘性解的量子算法","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607144123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子优化算法","kp":["[量子算法]: 熵惩罚法解非线性H-J方程粘性解"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种基于熵惩罚方法的量子算法框架，用于高效求解非线性Hamilton-Jacobi方程的粘性解。通过将非线性方程转化为带熵惩罚的优化问题，再映射到量子计算线路，利用量子叠加和纠缠特性实现潜在指数级加速。该方法为量子计算在偏微分方程数值求解中的应用开辟了新路径，对优化理论、最优控制和博弈论等领域的复杂方程求解具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Quantum algorithms for viscosity solutions to nonlinear Hamilton–Jacobi equations based on an entropy penalization method","b":"We present a framework for efficient extraction of the viscosity solutions of nonlinear Hamilton–Jacobi equations with convex Hamiltonians. These viscosity solutions play a central role in areas such as front propagation, mean-field games, optimal control, machine learning, and a direct application to the forced Burgers’ equation. Our method is based on an entropy penalization method which generalizes the Cole–Hopf transform from quadratic to general convex Hamiltonians, allowing an approximation of viscous Hamilton–Jacobi dynamics by a discrete-time linear dynamics which approximates a linear heat-like parabolic equation, and thus can also extend to continuous-time dynamics. This makes the method suitable for quantum simulation. The validity of these results hold for arbitrary nonlinearity that correspond to convex Hamiltonians, and for arbitrarily long times, thus obviating a chief obstacle in most quantum algorithms for nonlinear partial differential equations. We provide quantum algorithms—both analog and digital—for extracting pointwise values, gradients, minima, and function evaluations at the minimizer of the viscosity solution, without requiring nonlinear updates or full state reconstruction.","aip":1},{"t":"量化需求侧管理在建筑能源柔性中的作用：基于EPBD框架智能准备度指标评估的证据","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008512?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"建筑需求侧管理","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Quantifying the role of Demand Side Management in building energy flexibility: evidence from Smart Readiness Indicator assessment under the EPBD framework"},{"t":"针对高血糖和高尿酸血症代谢性疾病的多器官靶向肽治疗的程序化口服给药","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef3323?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Systemic metabolic disorders such as diabetes and hyperuricemia demand multiorgan therapeutic intervention, yet single-target therapies often fail to restore homeostasis. Here, we present an orally administered, multistage-targeted nanoplatform (P1P2NPs) for the sequential delivery of therapeutic peptides to distinct organs. P1P2NPs is composed of a bioresponsive polymer poly(β-amino ester)-disulfide bond-poly(carboxybetaine) (PAE-SS-PCB), 1,2-distearoyl-\n                    sn\n                    -glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine-block poly(carboxybetaine) (DSPE-PCB) and Eudragit L100-55, designed to release peptide P2 (Val-Pro-Tyr-Pro-Gln) in the intestine for dipeptidyl peptidase-IV (DPP-IV) inhibition, while hepatic-targeted peptide P1(Pro-Pro-Lys-Asn-Trp) is selectively liberated in the liver to suppress xanthine oxidase (XOD). Fabricated through sequential emulsification and layer-by-layer assembly, P1P2NPs exhibit spatiotemporal control over drug release, enabling precise modulation of intestinal and hepatic metabolic pathways. In a murine model of diabetic-hyperuricemia comorbidity, the nanoplatform demonstrated synergistic efficacy by normalizing glucose and uric acid levels through multiorgan targeting. This work establishes a paradigm for spatially controlled peptide delivery, offering a versatile strategy for treating complex metabolic diseases.","tp":"多器官给药","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对糖尿病和高尿酸血症等多器官代谢疾病，研究者开发了口服多级靶向纳米平台P1P2NPs，可将治疗肽序贯递送至不同器官。该平台由生物响应聚合物PAE-SS-PCB构成，在特定生理环境中依次释放药物，实现对多个靶器官的程序化治疗，克服了单靶点疗法无法恢复代谢稳态的局限。"},{"t":"用于高通量合成聚合物生物共轭物的耐氧光诱导小型加速原子转移自由基聚合（OPTIMA-ATRP）","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6617585?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Conjugates of synthetic polymers with biomolecules, forming polymer bioconjugates (PBCs), are used to improve the pharmacokinetic properties of many biological therapeutics. Growing synthetic polymers from biomolecules via reversible deactivation radical polymerization (RDRP) demonstrated enormous potential as an alternative to the “grafting to” method in synthesizing biohybrids. However, conventional “grafting from” approaches applied to biomolecules are hindered by large reaction volumes, long reaction times, rigorous deoxygenation, and complex workflows, rendering them unsuitable for synthesizing libraries of PBCs needed to collect large data sets for emerging materials discovery. Herein, Oxygen‐tolerant photo‐induced miniaturized accelerated atom transfer radical polymerization (OPTIMA‐ATRP) in water was developed for the polymerization of hydrophilic (meth)acrylate monomers under ambient or sub‐ambient (4°C) temperature and atmospheric conditions, without prior degassing, in &lt; 10 min. Sodium pyruvate (SP) in conjunction with UV light (380–395 nm, 28.5–30 mW/cm\n                    2\n                    ) promoted rapid controlled polymerization in water, on an ultra‐small scale (&lt; 50 µL) in micropipette tips or 96‐well plate. By exploiting this OPTIMA‐ATRP, cost‐effective syntheses of several types of PBCs (e.g., DNA‐, peptide‐, lipid‐, and protein–polymer hybrids) were carried out using a parallel, high‐throughput approach. This technique enables rapid optimization of biohybrid synthesis, previously inaccessible under conventional conditions, and empowers non‐specialists to use ATRP in various areas.","tp":"聚合物共轭","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出了OPTIMA-ATRP技术，一种耐氧的光诱导小型加速原子转移自由基聚合方法，用于高通量合成聚合物生物共轭物。该方法可在常规条件下（无需严格除氧）从生物分子表面原位生长合成聚合物，显著简化了生物杂化材料的制备流程，有望提升生物药物药代动力学性质的改善效率。"},{"t":"在 $\\sqrt{{s}_{NN}}=200 \\mathrm{GeV}$ 处打开 $pp$ 和 $\\mathrm{Au}+\\mathrm{Au}$ 碰撞中的 ${\\mathrm{Λ}}_{c}^{+}/{D}^{0}$ 比率","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/519h-2vrc","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Author(s): Bijun Fan, Shusu Shi, Chao Zhang, and Liang ZhengWe study open-charm hadrons production in pp and $\\mathrm{Au}+\\mathrm{Au}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{{s}_{NN}}=200$ GeV using an improved multiphase transport (AMPT) model. Specifically, we show the transverse-momentum spectra and nuclear modification factors ${R}_{\\mathrm{AA}}$ of ${D}^{0}$ mesons and $…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064904] Published Thu Jun 11, 2026"},{"t":"侧链工程实现Kagome共价有机框架晶体的分子级精确三角形终止","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5591473?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架","kp":["[COF晶体]: 侧链工程实现Kagome框架分子级精确三角形终止"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过侧链工程实现了kagome型共价有机框架（COF）晶体的分子级精确三角形终止。二维kagome COF因其独特的几何结构和电子性质备受关注，但高分辨率结构表征长期受限于晶体尺寸和形貌控制。通过精确设计侧链基团，研究者成功调控了晶体生长方向和终止面，获得了具有明确三角形形貌的大尺寸COF单晶，为kagome COF的晶面工程和表面功能化奠定了基础。","dp":1,"ot":"Molecularly Precise Triangular Termination of Kagome Covalent Organic Framework Crystals Enabled by Side‐Chain Engineering","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐resolution structural characterization of two‐dimensional (2D) kagome covalent organic frameworks (COFs) remains limited, often leaving critical questions about lattice ordering and surface‐terminating functionality largely unanswered. To address this challenge, we designed a series of acceptor–donor–acceptor linear linkers based on benzo[1,2‐\n                    b\n                    :4,5‐\n                    b\n                    ′]dithiophene and 2,1,3‐benzothiadiazole units with systematically varied alkoxy side chains. Diverse 2D kagome COFs bearing methoxy, ethoxy, and propoxy side chains were synthesized by imine condensation of these linkers with a dibenzo[\n                    g\n                    ,\n                    p\n                    ]chrysene‐based node. While featuring identical backbone architecture, the resulting COFs exhibit remarkably different degrees of crystallinity, demonstrating the critical role of side‐chain length in regulating framework ordering. Owing to its superior crystallinity and large pore apertures, the methoxy‐substituted COF (OMe COF) enables direct real‐space visualization of extended kagome pore lattices by high‐resolution transmission electron microscopy (HRTEM). Furthermore, highly crystalline and preferentially oriented OMe COF thin films were synthesized, allowing for detailed HRTEM analysis. Strikingly, HRTEM could clearly resolve triangular terminations of the kagome lattice, thereby establishing the half‐condensed dibenzochrysene nodes as the triangular pores terminating the crystal facets and providing unprecedented real‐space evidence of exposed amino groups. These findings create a structural basis for the future rational design of surface functionalization and potential interfacial engineering in 2D kagome COFs.","aip":1},{"t":"海洋种群遗传推论揭示了原生生物比古质体（植物）和后生动物（动物）更强的海洋结构","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7158?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"While the biogeographic patterns of animals and plants are well defined, the distribution of the microbial eukaryotic world remains contentious. Classically, protists were assumed to be cosmopolitan, dispersing everywhere with little geographic constraint. We tested this hypothesis by compiling 88 marine cytochrome oxidase subunit I metabarcoding studies to perform a global population-genetic analysis. We uncovered a fundamental biogeographic divide: most animal (Metazoa) and plant (Archaeplastida) phyla have haplotype diversity that is strictly concentrated within specific ocean basins, while most protist phyla share identical haplotypes across multiple, distant oceans. The combination of large geographic ranges with moderate among-ocean genetic differentiation in protists is inconsistent with strict historical cosmopolitanism and is compatible with high connectivity and range expansion dynamics, including, but not limited to, recent colonization events. Our findings provide a unified population-genetic perspective on marine eukaryotic biogeography and refine current views of microbial dispersal at ocean-basin scales."},{"t":"脓毒症中红细胞唾液酸的丢失破坏了抑制性 Siglec 相互作用，导致中性粒细胞过度激活和 NET 扩散","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536989123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Systemic inflammation is accompanied by overwhelming neutrophil activation, resulting in extensive formation of neutrophil extracellular traps (NETs). Although NETs are beneficial for pathogen entrapment, they become detrimental; therefore, their endogenous regulation is pivotal for survival. In this context, the observation that healthy individuals’ red blood cells (RBCs) can inhibit NET formation induced by lipopolysaccharide (LPS)-primed neutrophils is noteworthy. However, during systemic inflammation, NET formation in the vasculature is robust despite constant neutrophil exposure to RBCs. Herein, we reveal that for RBCs and neutrophils from septic individuals, but not from those with local inflammation, interactions cease and NET inhibition is abolished. This is observed even if only one cell type originates from an inflamed individual, and occurs in both human and murine cells. Moreover, 6 to 10 d post–sepsis induction (mice) or diagnosis (humans), during the resolution of inflammation, interactions are restored and hence fail during the critical stages of inflammation. Mechanistically, this is not due to passive LPS absorption by RBCs, which would limit its availability for neutrophils. In contrast, the cessation of NET inhibition is due to inflammation-induced RBC desialylation (removal of α2,3-linked sialic acids) and decreased expression of inhibitory Siglec-E/9 and -G, but not Siglec-F/5, on neutrophils. Accordingly, concurrent addition of exogenous polysialic acid (PolySia) and pharmacologically controlled accumulation of Siglec molecules on neutrophils preserves the ability of erythrocytes to inhibit PAD4-dependent NET formation upon interaction with neutrophils of endotoxemic mice. These findings open avenues for clinically controlling NET formation during systemic inflammation, given the abundance of erythrocytes in the blood."},{"t":"界面介导结晶实现无PEDOT:PSS全钙钛矿叠层电池，效率达29.1%且耐久性增强","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00185-6?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["转换效率[全钙钛矿叠层]: 29.1%","[界面工程]: 吩噻嗪界面替代PEDOT:PSS"],"sc":8.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":8.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过界面介导结晶策略，以吩噻嗪功能化界面替代吸湿性PEDOT:PSS空穴传输层，实现了全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池29.1%的认证效率并显著提升器件耐久性。PEDOT:PSS的吸湿性和相不稳定性长期制约全钙钛矿叠层电池的产业化。吩噻嗪界面层有效抑制了亚稳态相分离，优化了宽带隙顶电池与窄带隙底电池的界面接触，为突破叠层钙钛矿电池效率和稳定性瓶颈提供了关键进展。","dp":1,"ot":"Interface-mediated crystallization enables PEDOT:PSS-free all-perovskite tandems with 29.1% efficiency and enhanced durability","b":"Replacing hygroscopic PEDOT:PSS with a phenothiazine-functionalized interface suppresses metastable phase segregation and directs Sn-Pb perovskite crystallization. A dual-anchor interlayer can form a robust interconnection in tandem devices. The PEDOT:PSS-free monolithic all-perovskite tandem achieves a record efficiency of 29.1% and long-term stability, demonstrating that precise interface design simultaneously enables high efficiency and durability."},{"t":"原子级催化剂设计与传质工程耦合，实现膜电极组件中CO2高效稳定电还原为CO","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE00129G","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电还原制CO","kp":["催化剂[CO2电解制CO]:原子分散镍氮碳","[MEA反应器]:原子尺度催化与传输工程集成"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究将原子尺度催化剂设计与传质工程相结合，在膜电极组件（MEA）中实现了高效稳定的CO2电还原制CO。电化学CO2还原为化学制造业脱碳提供了可行路径，但催化剂活性与传质限制之间的权衡是核心挑战。研究者通过原子级调控催化剂活性位点，同时优化MEA中的局部CO2传质和产物扩散，在工业级电流密度下实现了高CO选择性和长期稳定运行，推动了CO2电解技术向工业化应用发展。","dp":1,"ot":"Integrating atomic scale catalyst design with transport engineering for stable and efficient CO2 electrolysis to CO in a membrane electrode assembly","b":"Electrochemical CO2 reduction (CO2R) offers a promising approach to for decarbonizing chemical manufacturing through production of carbon-neutral fuels. However, insufficient performance and instability of the membrane electrode assembly (MEA) reactors limit the commercial viability, with both metrics directly impacted by the CO2R catalysts. Here we develop atomically dispersed nickel–nitrogen–carbon (NiNC) catalysts through a scalable synthesis approach that enables controlled dispersion of isolated Ni active sites using two different carbon supports. When using carbon nanotubes as a support, the resulting NiNCNT electrode achieves a partial current density towards CO of 558 mA cm−2 with 92% faradaic efficiency towards CO at a cell voltage of 3.2 V and an energy efficiency of 39% at a total current density of 607 mA cm−2. The MEA demonstrated stable operation at 100 mA cm−2 over 210 hours, outperforming previously reported NiNC catalysts. Focused ion beam-scanning electron microscopy (FIB-SEM) tomography reveals the critical role of catalyst support architecture in governing electrode performance. COMSOL Multiphysics simulations using the 3D reconstructed images of the catalyst layers from FIB-SEM tomography demonstrated that the higher CO2R performance of the NiNCNT electrode is due to improved CO2 diffusion and a more uniform current-density distribution compared to the NiNCB electrode prepared with carbon black as the support. These results highlight the key role of catalyst-layer morphology in governing the CO2R performance of the two catalysts, despite their similar Ni and N loadings. The stability and performance of the NiNCNT compared favourably to the state-of-the-art Ag-based catalysts, while bottom-up cost analysis estimated the projected purchase cost of the NiNCNT catalyst to be $589 USD per kg, substantially lower than $1900 USD per kg estimated for Ag-based catalysts, highlighting its potential for scalable and economically viable CO2R electrolyzers.","aip":1},{"t":"GREM1/FGFR1激活的肌成纤维细胞诱导免疫抑制并加速高级别浆液性卵巢癌的转移","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529786123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Joint effect of cancer-associated fibroblasts (CAFs) and regulatory T cells (Tregs) can drive immunosuppression in high-grade serous ovarian cancer (HGSOC), thereby promoting tumor metastasis and limiting the clinical benefit of PD-1/PD-L1 blockade. However, the mechanistic crosstalk between CAFs and Tregs remains unclear. By integrating bulk RNA-seq, single-cell RNA-seq datasets, and spatial transcriptomics datasets with functional assays, we identified a population of TGF-β1-driven Gremlin1 (GREM1)\n                    +\n                    myofibroblastic CAFs (myCAFs) enriched in HGSOC metastatic lesions. These GREM1\n                    +\n                    myCAFs activated the FGFR1-MAPKs-NFκB-TDO2-kynurenine axis via autocrine signaling, promoting tumor growth, metastasis, and immune evasion characterized by the infiltration of CD4\n                    +\n                    Tregs and dysfunctional CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells. GREM1 knockdown suppressed tumor metastasis, restored antitumor T cells response, remodeled CAF subtype composition and potentiated anti-PD-1 therapy efficacy. This study highlights the pro-metastatic role of GREM1\n                    +\n                    myCAFs across multiple tumors and provides a rationale for combining anti-PD-1 therapy for metastatic HGSOC."},{"t":"从P型到双极性：D-A-D有机正极中醌核工程策略实现超高稳定性高能量有机锂离子电池","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9678457?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机锂正极材料","kp":["[D-A-D分子设计]:醌核工程实现P型到双极性转变"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种醌核工程策略，将D-A-D（给体-受体-给体）有机正极材料从P型转变为双极性，用于构建超稳定、高能量密度的有机锂离子电池。传统有机正极材料受限于较低的工作电压和循环稳定性。通过分子设计调控醌核的电子结构，使材料同时具备n型和p型氧化还原活性，拓宽了工作电压窗口并提高了比容量。该策略为有机电极材料的分子工程优化提供了系统性指导。","dp":1,"ot":"From P‐Type to Bipolar: A Quinone‐Core Engineering Strategy in D‐A‐D Organic Cathodes for Ultra‐Stable and High‐Energy Organic Lithium‐Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In this study, we present a rational donor‐acceptor‐donor (D‐A‐D) molecular design strategy to develop high‐performance organic cathodes by enhancing the intramolecular charge transfer (ICT) effect. We designed and synthesized two organic molecules: 2,6‐bis(10H‐phenothiazin‐10‐yl)benzo[1,2‐d:4,5‐d’]diimidazole‐4,8‐dione (PTZBQ), featuring a strong quinone‐type acceptor core, and the control compound 2,6‐bis(10H‐phenothiazin‐10‐yl)benzo[1,2‐d:4,5‐d’]diimidazole (PTZTAB), without a quinone core. The strong push‐pull electronic structure of PTZBQ not only results in a significantly narrowed bandgap and improved electrode kinetics, but also allows the quinone core to contribute extra n‐type capacity, thereby remarkably boosting the electrode's specific capacity and reaction dynamics. Moreover, the extended π‐conjugation and D‐A‐D configuration‐induced polarity endow both small molecules with exceptional electrolyte dissolution resistance. Consequently, PTZBQ exhibits bipolar redox activity, delivering a high discharge potential of 3.05 V, a high specific capacity of 163.3 mAh g\n                    −1\n                     at 0.1 A g\n                    −1\n                    , an excellent rate capability (77.6% retention at 5 A g\n                    −1\n                    ), and exceptional long‐term cycling stability with 89.4% retention after 5000 cycles at 1 A g\n                    −1\n                    . DFT calculations and ex situ spectroscopy confirm that the unique D‐A‐D architecture possesses spatially separated n‐type and p‐type redox centers, facilitating the redox process. Our findings highlight that quinone‐core engineering enhances intramolecular charge transfer and represents a powerful approach for developing high‐performance cathode materials.","aip":1},{"t":"新兴国家和发展中国家不确定性下的金融包容性以及获得清洁烹饪燃料和技术的机会","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003824?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"清洁烹饪燃料","sc":1.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.5,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"通过光辅助准粒子隧穿至超导岛实现单微波光子的快速连续探测","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/mj91-ntm4","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微波光子探测","kp":["[检测机制]: 光辅助准粒子隧穿至超导岛","[应用]: 单微波光子连续快速探测"],"sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种通过光辅助准粒子隧穿至超导岛来实现单个微波光子快速连续探测的新机制。单微波光子探测在量子信息处理和天文探测中具有重要应用，但现有方案受限于探测速率和灵敏度。该方案利用超导岛上的光辅助准粒子隧穿效应，将微波光子转化为可测量的电信号，实现了对单个微波光子的连续快速检测，为量子通信和量子计量中的超低能光子探测开辟了新途径。","dp":1,"ot":"Fast and Continuous Detection of Single Microwave Photons via Photoassisted Quasiparticle Tunneling to a Superconducting Island","b":"Author(s): J. Basset, O. Stanisavljević, J. Gabelli, M. Aprili, and J. EstèveA new mechanism for the detection of individual propagating microwave photons that realizes a microwave analogue of the photoelectric effect could be used for practical applications in quantum information and dark matter search.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 237001] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"中国国家排放交易计划执行的经验和经济见解：来自第一个履约期的证据","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003599?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"双面机械互锁实现软-硬导电界面，柔性电子器件韧性创纪录","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73649?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性导电界面","kp":["界面策略[柔性电子]: 双面机械互锁","关键材料[界面]: 导电织物骨架","[性能]: 界面韧性创纪录"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究提出一种双面机械互锁策略，解决柔性电子中聚合物电极与金属元件之间因模量失配导致的界面脆弱问题。该方法使软-刚性导电界面实现创纪录的高韧性，显著提升界面抗剥离和抗疲劳性能，有望应用于可穿戴器件、柔性传感器和可拉伸电子的可靠互联。","dp":1,"ot":"Double‐Sided Mechanical Interlocking Enables Soft‐Rigid Conductive Interfaces With a Record High Toughness for Flexible Electronics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The pronounced mismatch between polymeric electrodes and metallic components hinders the formation of robust electrical contacts. While most approaches rely on chemical design to strengthen interfacial interactions, we present a double‐sided mechanical interlocking strategy that provides both stability and adaptability. A conductive fabric scaffold bridges polymers and metals, with adhesives sequentially applied to both sides. The adhesive infiltrates and encapsulates scaffold fibers, forming a thread–hole adhesion that can only be disrupted by bulk failure. This mechanism achieves a record high interfacial toughness of 730 J m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    between conductive elastomer and copper using commercial silver pastes. Peeling tests show delamination occurs between silver paste and copper, indicating even higher toughness could be obtained with better‐performing products of conductive adhesive. Notably, the interface stability surpasses that of the electrode itself, remaining intact even when the electrode fails. The design is broadly compatible with elastomeric or hydrogel matrices and with diverse commercial adhesives. It enables the construction of reliable epidermal electronics and hydrogel‐based devices. Overall, this interlocking strategy provides a versatile platform for integrating soft and rigid conductors in hybrid electronic systems.","aip":1},{"t":"不同的氧化还原酶在噻吩氧化素生物合成中协调吲哚噻吩骨架的形成和 N-羟基化介导的生物活化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7072895?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Microbial sulfur‐containing secondary metabolite thienodolin (\n                    1\n                    ) features a unique tricyclic thieno[2,3‐\n                    b\n                    ]indole scaffold, yet its biosynthesis has remained enigmatic. Here, we uncover an unexpected enzymatic logic in which a consortium of distinct oxidoreductases cooperatively orchestrates indolethiophene skeleton formation and subsequent bioactivation, ultimately generating the authentic antibacterial metabolite thienoxidolin (\n                    10\n                    ). Following thiotryptophan formation by SDR enzyme TndE, the heme‐dependent DUF6875 enzyme TndD initiates C–S bond formation via\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation to yield a dearomatized tricyclic species, which is efficiently driven forward and stabilized by aromatization catalyzed by the FAD‐dependent oxidoreductase TndG. Notably, TndD functions as a bidirectional redox enzyme, reverting the\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxyl group to the stable N–H form to complete the indolethiophene scaffold construction. After amide formation, late‐stage\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation by the cytochrome P450 enzyme TndC, previously misassigned as the C–S bond‐forming enzyme, produces the bioactive product\n                    10\n                    . Intriguingly, TndD may also mediate the deactivation of\n                    10\n                    back to\n                    1\n                    , representing an intrinsic self‐protection mechanism. Together, these results expand the catalytic repertoire of heme‐dependent enzymes and highlight reversible\n                    N\n                    ‐hydroxylation as a pivotal strategy for heterocycle formation and bioactivity regulation in microbial secondary metabolism.","tp":"噻吩生物合成","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究揭示了含硫微生物次级代谢产物噻吩氧化素的生物合成机制。该分子具有独特的三环噻吩吲哚骨架，研究发现一组不同的氧化还原酶协同作用，依次完成吲哚噻吩骨架的构建和随后的N-羟基化生物激活。这一非预期的酶促逻辑为硫杂天然产物的生物合成途径提供了新认识。"},{"t":"开发一种从妊娠晚期胎盘中提取人滋养层干细胞的稳健方法及其在先兆子痫中的应用","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537884123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Trophoblasts are multifunctional cells in the placenta and essential for normal pregnancy. Although trophoblast dysfunction can cause pregnancy complications, the underlying mechanisms remain unclear, and effective treatments are limited, partly because of the scarcity of appropriate experimental models. We previously reported the derivation of human trophoblast stem cells (hTSCs) from 1st-trimester placentas and blastocysts, providing a powerful tool to investigate human trophoblast development and function. However, the difficulty in deriving hTSCs from late-gestation placentas has limited their application to pregnancy complication research. Here we report a robust technique to derive hTSCs from term placentas based on the transient expression of a p53 dominant negative mutant, SALL4, and shRNAs against cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitors. Using this technique, we derived and characterized hTSCs from placentas obtained from patients with early-onset preeclampsia (PE). PE-derived hTSCs exhibit impaired trophoblast invasion and reduced placental growth factor secretion, consistent with trophoblast abnormalities reported in PE. Therefore, this study provides a technological basis for investigating pregnancy complications associated with trophoblast dysfunction."},{"t":"等离激元Au/NbS2异质结中金属-半金属过渡金属硫族化合物界面的构建，增强电荷转移与光电催化析氢反应","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71184?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光电催化制氢","kp":["[Au/NbS2异质结构]:等离激元增强电荷转移用于PEC析氢"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究构建了等离子体Au/NbS₂异质结构，通过引入金属-半金属过渡金属二硫属化物界面增强电荷转移效率，用于光电化学析氢反应（HER）。该设计结合Au的等离子体共振效应与NbS₂的催化活性，旨在开发低成本、高效光电极材料，推动太阳能驱动制氢。异质界面处的电荷分离与传输优化是实现高HER活性的关键。","dp":1,"ot":"Developing Metal–Semimetallic Transition Metal Dichalcogenide Interfaces in Plasmonic Au/NbS2 Heterostructures for Enhanced Charge Transfer and Photoelectrochemical Hydrogen Evolution Reaction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The development of cost‐effective and highly‐efficient photoelectrodes (PE) is critical for advancing solar driven photoelectrochemical (PEC) hydrogen (H\n                    2\n                    ) production technologies. For enhancing PEC performance, it appears promising to combine plasmonic nanoparticles with active catalysts. Here we report a facile and powerful PE comprised of Au nanoparticles (NP) decorated on NbS\n                    2\n                    nanoflakes (NF), directly grown on the carbon fiber paper. In this heterostructure, Au NP acts as plasmonic antennas that intensify local electromagnetic fields strengthening light matter interactions, NbS\n                    2\n                    NF functions as a highly conductive semimetal scaffold offering abundant active HER sites, and the junction of Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF enables efficient charge separation and fast electron transfer from NbS\n                    2\n                    to Au, thereby synergistically accelerating HER kinetics under illumination. Consequently, this Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF heterostructure, for the first time, demonstrates remarkable PEC performance under illumination, such as a 6‐fold increase in the exchange current density, a 1.75‐fold reduction in overpotential, and a 2.45‐fold yield in the H\n                    2\n                    production, respectively. Based on the heterostructure of Au NP/NbS\n                    2\n                    NF, this work establishes a strategy of constructing a cost‐effective and highly‐efficient PE and providing valuable insights into the rational design of next generation PE for the sustainable hydrogen production."},{"t":"面向高温摩擦电传感与电磁屏蔽的柔性聚合物薄膜的解耦与从头设计","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73667?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"摩擦电柔性薄膜","kp":["[柔性聚合物薄膜]:解耦设计用于高温摩擦电与电磁屏蔽"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"as":"研究提出解耦设计柔性聚合物薄膜，用于高温摩擦电传感与电磁屏蔽。基于聚合物摩擦纳米发电机(TENG)，在微能量收集和主动传感领域表现突出，拓展了高温恶劣环境下的柔性电子器件应用潜力。","ot":"Decoupling and De Novo Design of Flexible Polymeric Films for High‐Temperature Triboelectric Sensing and Electromagnetic Shielding","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymer‐based triboelectric nanogenerators (TENGs) are shining in fields of micro‐energy harvesting and active sensing by virtue of their flexibility and processability. However, thermionic emission and thermal deformation reduce triboelectric output and distort sensing signals, thereby limiting practical applications in high‐temperature environments. Herein, the charge generation and collection units of polymeric TENGs are decoupled for separate\n                    de novo\n                    design. A dipolar glass polymer, cardo poly(aryl ether) (CPAE), is synthesized with alternating pendant and main‐chain dipoles and bulky, rigid cardo substituent. Aromatic polyphenol‐anchored MXene nanosheets are subsequently crosslinked and sandwiched within thermostable CPAE films, which improves resistance to high‐temperature oxidation. Thanks to the interlayer modulation of MXenes, the total and absorption electromagnetic shielding effectiveness of the resulting film rises by 55% and 195% compared to pristine MXene films, respectively. Even after annealing at 250°C for 24 h, the shielding effectiveness decreases by only ∼1.5%. Moreover, the resulting TENG exhibits an unusual heat‐induced triboelectric enhancement, with an output voltage of 472.2 ± 0.9 V and a power density of 2250.6 ± 27.7 mW/m\n                    2\n                    at 250°C, which compares favorably with most reported polymer‐based TENGs. This work provides a novel technical pathway for flexible electromagnetic protection and self‐powered sensing under extreme operating conditions."},{"t":"能源与环境政策在碳减排中的成本效益协同：来自中国钢铁行业的证据","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003551?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/黑色金属/钢铁","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"钢铁碳减排","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"铜调控硫化聚苯胺中的d-p-π多轨道耦合，实现水系硫电池超长循环","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00230-4?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系硫电池正极","kp":["正极[水系硫电池]: 铜修饰硫化聚苯胺","电子耦合[正极]: d-p-π多轨道","负极: 锌","器件形态: 软包电池"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"dp":1,"as":"研究在硫化聚苯胺中引入铜调控d-p-π多轨道耦合，有效解决水系硫电池反应动力学缓慢等关键瓶颈，实现超长循环稳定性。该策略为水系硫电池实用化和大规模储能提供了新路径。","ot":"Copper-tailored d-p-π multi-orbital coupling in sulfurized polyaniline enables ultralong cycling aqueous sulfur batteries","b":"The practical application of sulfur-based batteries is severely limited by factors such as slow reaction kinetics and structural collapse. This work successfully constructs a highly conductive and stable copper-modified sulfide polyaniline cathode by introducing d-p-π multi-orbital coupling using copper. Coupled with a Zn anode, the pouch cell delivers stable power output under harsh conditions, offering a new orbital engineering route for durable sulfur-based batteries."},{"t":"纳米流体黏土膜中构建连续层间氢键网络，实现快速阳离子传导与抗膨胀渗透能发电","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73660?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米流体粘土膜","kp":["[粘土纳米流体膜]:层间氢键网络实现快速阳离子传导"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"as":"研究在纳米流体黏土膜中构建连续层间氢键网络，实现快速阳离子传导和抗膨胀渗透能发电，突破了二维黏土膜在渗透能收集中的离子传输与结构稳定性瓶颈，推进可持续盐差能发电技术。","ot":"Constructing Continuous Interlayer Hydrogen‐Bond Network in Nanofluidic Clay Membranes for Fast Cation Conduction and Anti‐Swelling Osmotic Energy Generators","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Two‐dimensional clay nanofluidic membranes hold great promise for harvesting sustainable osmotic energy, yet their practical application is constrained by two core challenges. (1) The inherently tortuous and inefficient ion transport pathways within stacked nanosheet structures limit cation flux, and (2) the severe swelling of interlayer nanochannels in aqueous environments impairs ion selectivity and long‐term stability. To simultaneously tackle these challenges, we construct a continuous hydrogen‐bond network within the interlayer of a lamellar membrane (CHM) via a sequential crosslinking strategy. This engineered network serves a dual function: (1) establishing low‐energy barrier pathways to facilitate cation transport while (2) acting as a dynamic yet robust crosslinked matrix to anchor clay nanosheets for suppressing interlayer expansion. Experimental and theoretical results confirm that the negatively charged surface, in synergy with the hydrogen‐bond network, enables selective and rapid cation transport. The ionic conductivity of in‐plane transport reaches as high as 22 S m\n                    −1\n                    in 1 \n                    m\n                    electrolyte. When employed for osmotic energy harvesting from artificial seawater and river water, the CHM delivers an impressive high‐power density of 22.7 W m\n                    −2\n                    and maintains stable power output for over 30 days. Furthermore, an integrated osmotic power generator successfully drives multiple electronic devices, demonstrating its real‐world applicability."},{"t":"笼型多孔有机盐作为瓶中船纳米反应器，实现光透明可重复使用的分子光催化剂","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6654151?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多孔有机盐光催化","kp":["[笼型多孔有机盐]:瓶中船纳米反应器固定光催化剂"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"dp":1,"as":"研究将笼型多孔有机盐作为\"瓶中船\"纳米反应器，实现分子光催化剂的多相化，在保持完整预设计结构的同时具备光透明和可重复使用特性，为光催化绿色合成的工程化应用提供新方案。","ot":"Cage‐Type Porous Organic Salts as Ship‐in‐a‐Bottle Nanoreactors for Light‐Transparent and Reusable Molecular Photocatalysts","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Heterogenizing molecular photocatalysts while preserving their intact, pre‐designed structures—without redesigning the host—remains a fundamental challenge. Immobilization within porous materials offers control over reaction environments and improved recyclability; however, most host systems require catalyst‐specific structural redesign, limiting generality. We introduce a cage‐type porous organic salt (POS) as a modular host platform for homogeneous, molecularly defined photocatalysts (organic molecules and metal coordination complexes) based on a ship‐in‐a‐bottle strategy. A sodalite‐type POS constructed from adamantane‐based sulfonic acid and tri(ethynylphenyl)methylamine provides well‐defined, light‐transparent, cage‐like internal cavities. Single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction reveals that the POS accommodates diverse photocatalysts, including anthraquinone, phenanthrenequinone, and phthalocyanine, through a unified recrystallization protocol. The framework exhibits negligible absorption in the visible region, enabling selective excitation of photocatalysts without competitive light absorption. Post‐synthetic thiol–yne crosslinking of ethynyl groups on the pore surface reinforces the framework and renders it insoluble while preserving cage‐like cavities. For example, a phenanthrenequinone‐encapsulated POS functions as a reusable heterogeneous photocatalyst for visible‐light‐driven hydrogen peroxide production from isopropanol and oxygen, achieving rates of up to 4.2 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    without catalyst leaching. Overall, cage‐type POSs serve as light‐transparent nanoreactors for intact molecular photocatalysts, providing a modular, expandable platform for photocatalyst immobilization and post‐synthetic functionalization."},{"t":"低电位醛氧化中串联化学与电化学步骤的协同增强，实现太阳能驱动双极制氢","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6195416?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"太阳能制氢","kp":["催化剂[低电位醛氧化]: PtCu3@Cu纳米线阵列/Cu泡沫","[制备方法]: 电位置换+电化学还原"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究提出低电位醛氧化作为析氧反应的节能阳极替代方案，用于太阳能驱动的双极制氢。通过提升化学与电化学串联步骤效率，在阳极侧实现醛氧化替代高能耗的OER反应，降低过电位，从而显著提高整体能量利用率。双极制氢指阴极HER与阳极氧化反应协同产氢的策略。该工作为太阳能光催化/光电化学分解水提供了新的阳极反应设计范式，有望在工业级电流密度下实现高效绿氢生产。","dp":1,"ot":"Boosting Both Chemical and Electrochemical Tandem Steps in Low‐Potential Aldehyde Oxidation for Solar‐Driven Bipolar Hydrogen Production","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Low‐potential aldehyde oxidation offers an energy‐efficient anodic alternative to oxygen evolution for bipolar hydrogen production coupled with biomass valorization, yet the tandem non‐Faradaic/Faradaic mechanism remains poorly understood. Here, we report PtCu\n                    3\n                    ‐coated Cu nanowire arrays supported on Cu foam (PtCu\n                    3\n                    @Cu/CF) fabricated via galvanic replacement and electrochemical reduction. In situ ATR‐FTIR and DFT calculations indicate the PtCu\n                    3\n                    shell enhances adsorption of the\n                    gem\n                    ‐diolate intermediate while weakens binding of 5‐hydroxymethyl‐2‐furancarboxylic acid (HMFCA), accelerating both non‐Faradaic C–H cleavage and Faradaic oxidation. This enables selective 5‐hydroxymethylfurfural upgrading with anodic hydrogen evolution at 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at ∼0.21 V in a two‐electrode flow electrolyzer. Additionally, the electrolyzer also achieves 100 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    at 0.16 V with 200% combined Faradaic efficiency for bipolar hydrogen production. Integration of a six‐cell stack with perovskite photovoltaic module yields a bias‐free solar‐to‐hydrogen efficiency of 16.9% alongside gram‐scale HMFCA production. This noble‐metal‐lean platform establishes scalable solar reforming for co‐generating green hydrogen and value‐added chemicals."},{"t":"通过稳定Cu+和强化氢键网络平衡二聚与加氢动力学，实现电催化乙炔加氢二聚","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4304657?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙炔电化学二聚","kp":["催化剂[乙炔电化学二聚]: 稳定Cu+铜基材料","[调控策略]: 稳定Cu+并增强氢键网络平衡动力学"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对电催化乙炔加氢二聚（EHDA）反应，研究通过稳定Cu+物种并强化氢键网络来平衡二聚与加氢动力学。EHDA是替代传统高能耗工艺的有前景路线，可生产丁二烯等高附加值化学品。关键挑战在于抑制过度加氢副反应、提高目标产物选择性。Cu+活性位点的稳定化策略有助于优化C-C偶联效率，氢键网络的调控则促进中间体的定向转化，为工业级电化学合成C4化学品提供了催化剂设计新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Balancing Dimerization and Hydrogenation Kinetics by Stabilizing Cu+ and Tightening H‐Bond Network for Electrocatalytic Acetylene Hydrodimerization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The electrocatalytic hydrodimerization of acetylene (EHDA) offers a promising alternative to energy‐intensive naphtha steam cracking for producing 1,3‐butadiene but faces a formidable challenge due to kinetic imbalance between C–C coupling and hydrogenation. Herein, we balance the dimerization and hydrogenation kinetics of EHDA by stabilizing Cu\n                    +\n                    and tightening the hydrogen‐bond network over citrate anion grafted Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalysts (E‐CA/Cu\n                    2\n                    O). The X‐ray absorption fine structure, Cu LMM Auger spectrum, and theoretical simulations corroborate citrate anion modification induces electron transfer from Cu\n                    2\n                    O to citrate ions. This stabilizes the active Cu\n                    +\n                    sites under electrochemical reduction conditions and further lowers the C‐C coupling barrier of *C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    2\n                    and *C\n                    2\n                    H\n                    3\n                    to *C\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    . The in situ attenuated total reflection surface‐enhanced infrared spectroscopy confirms that the citrate anion also reconstructs the hydrogen‐bonding network and reduces the content of isolated water at the electrode‐electrolyte interface. The appropriate supply of active *H species effectively promotes the hydrogenation of *C\n                    4\n                    H\n                    5\n                    to form 1,3‐butadiene rather than competitive acetylene semihydrogenation. As a result, E‐CA/Cu\n                    2\n                    O catalyst achieves a Faradaic efficiency of 88.0% and a 1,3‐butadiene partial current density of 55 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , which is about 3‐fold higher than E‐Cu\n                    2\n                    O. This work will guide the rational design of high‐performance catalysts for regulating the kinetics of electrocatalytic acetylene hydrodimerization.","aip":1},{"t":"通过乙烯基C─O键的Z选择性官能化实现苯并呋喃衍生物的阻转选择性去芳构化交叉偶联","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2984592?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"不对称交叉偶联","kp":["催化剂[苯并呋喃交叉偶联]: 手性镍","[选择性]: Z选择性断裂乙烯基C-O键"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究报道了苯并呋喃衍生物的催化不对称去芳香化交叉偶联反应，通过Z-选择性地功能化乙烯基C-O键实现轴手性构建。去芳香化策略可将简单芳香底物转化为高立体复杂度的螺环/桥环骨架，在天然产物合成和药物分子构建中意义重大。利用Z-选择性切断并功能化苯并呋喃的乙烯基C-O键，高效构建了具有优异对映选择性的轴手性化合物，拓展了不对称催化在杂环去芳香化领域的应用范围。","dp":1,"ot":"Atroposelective Dearomative Cross‐Coupling of Benzofuran Derivatives by Z‐Selective Functionalization of the Vinyl C─O Bond","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Catalytic asymmetric transformation of benzofuran derivatives has received significant attention owing to its capacity to prepare chiral molecules from readily available feedstocks. Herein, an unprecedented asymmetric cross‐coupling of benzofuran derivatives is reported for the construction of axial chirality. Employing a chiral nickel catalyst, this approach is achieved through direct enantio‐ and Z‐selective dearomative functionalization of the vinyl C─O bond, providing efficient access to valuable atropisomeric acyclic alkenes. A broad substrate scope is demonstrated under mild conditions. Moreover, experimental and theoretical mechanistic studies suggest that the stereochemical outcome is facilitated by a dynamic epimerization between diastereomeric six‐membered (\n                    Z\n                    )‐styryl‐nickelacycle intermediates."},{"t":"MOF纳米结构的原子配位工程，实现工业级电流密度下CO2电还原为高值多碳产物","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2590405?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley-Online-Library: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"MOF电催化CO2还原","kp":["[产物]: CO2电还原产C2+多碳产物","电流密度[MOF电催化CO2RR]: 工业级"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究通过原子配位工程调控MOF纳米结构，实现CO2电还原至高附加值多碳（C2+）产物，并在工业级电流密度下运行。MOF材料由于可调控的孔结构和活性位点，在电化学CO2还原中表现优异。通过对金属中心的原子级配位环境进行精确工程化设计，优化了C-C偶联步骤，提高乙烯、乙醇等多碳产物的法拉第效率和选择性。该工作对CO2资源化利用和碳中性化学品合成具有重要工程意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Atomic Coordination Engineering of MOF Nanostructures for CO2 Electroreduction to High‐Value Multi‐Carbon Products at Industrial‐Level Current Density","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) have shown great promise for electrochemical carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ) reduction into value‐added chemicals/fuels, thereby supporting the balance of carbon‐neutral energy cycle. The multi‐carbon (C\n                    2+\n                    ) production on MOF electrocatalysts is of great significance but remains challenging due to inefficient C–C coupling. Here, we report the atomic coordination regulation of MOF nanostructures (Cu‐Trz‐Br) for efficient CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction by rationally designing dual‐site Cu catalysts. The crystallographic structure of Cu‐Trz‐Br is determined by three‐dimensional electron diffraction and Rietveld refinement against high‐resolution powder X‐ray diffraction data, which feature unique mixed coordination modes of Cu–N\n                    4\n                    Br\n                    2\n                    and Cu–N\n                    4\n                    sites. In CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction, Cu‐Trz‐Br demonstrates much enhanced selectivity toward C\n                    2+\n                    products compared to common counterparts with only Cu–N\n                    4\n                    sites, enabling efficient C\n                    2+\n                    production under industrial‐level current density. In situ studies and theoretical calculations reveal that the coordination regulation of Cu–N\n                    4\n                    Br\n                    2\n                    sites promotes CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and activation, as well as effectively enhances local *CO availability near Cu‐Trz‐Br, thereby facilitating C–C coupling toward C\n                    2+\n                    products."},{"t":"基于元扩散模型的极不平衡场景下HVAC系统新故障类别数据的自适应增强框架","d":"2026-06-12","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008445?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"5f金属掺杂二维团簇烯：通过连续平面载流子迁移实现高效光催化","d":"2026-06-12","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00225-0?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化材料","kp":["[材料体系]: 铀酰-多铌酸盐组装2D UNbO簇烯","[载流子迁移]: 连续平面路径抑制电子-空穴复合","[光催化应用]: 可见光驱动烯烃断裂"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队在亚纳米尺度将铀酰(uranyl)单元与多铌酸盐(polyoxoniobates)集成，构建出二维UNbO clusterphene材料，实现连续平面载流子迁移路径。该材料利用5f金属锕系元素的独特电子结构，显著提升了光催化效率，为高效光催化水分解和能源转换提供了新型二维材料平台。连续平面载流子迁移机制有效降低了载流子复合损耗，是光催化领域的重要突破。","dp":1,"ot":"5f metal-incorporated 2D clusterphene: Enabling high-efficiency photocatalysis through continuous planar carrier migration","b":"Integrating uranyl units with polyoxoniobates at the subnanoscale creates a 2D UNbO clusterphene with a continuous carrier-migration path that minimizes electron-hole recombination, enabling efficient visible-light-driven alkene cleavage and paving the way for advanced 5f metal-based heterogeneous photocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"鸿蒙智行享界 S9 / S9T 再次申报：尾标改为北汽集团，“身份证”由华彰变为享界","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/674.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","as":"在工信部第408批《道路机动车辆生产企业及产品公告》新产品公示中，鸿蒙智行旗下享界S9与S9T两款轿车再次现身申报。与在售车型相比，双车整体差异不大，但关键变化在于尾标由原标识改为'北汽集团'，车辆生产身份证明由华彰变更为享界。这一调整标志着享界品牌在产线资质与品牌归属层面的进一步理顺，体现出鸿蒙智行体系内合作方（华为与北汽）在生产主体与品牌标识上的整合优化，有助于强化北汽集团作为整车制造主体的市场认知与合规身份。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"汽车品牌变更","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"b":"6 月 10 日消息，在今天的工信部第 408 批《道路机动车辆生产企业及产品公告》新产品公示中，\n智行享界旗下两款轿车 ——\n享界 S9 和享界 S9T 也再度现身\n从申报信息来看，享界 S9 / S9T 双车与在售车型并无太大差异。但IT之家注意到，此次申报的新车在细节处有所调整。\n最明显的变化就是新车的尾标改为北汽集团（此前为北汽新能源）\n另外，第 408 批《道路机动车辆生产企业及产品公告》新产品公示查询页面显示，\n享界牌已成为独立的产品商标，这也意味着享界汽车的“身份证”正式由华彰牌变为享界牌\n参考IT之家此前报道，去年 9 月，\n享界汽车正式宣布，华为与北汽享界品牌合作深化，正式升级为“车企 + 华为科技全生态”的战略共同体\n享界计划 3 年投入 200 亿资金，围绕设计、智能辅助驾驶、智能座舱、品质安全四大核心领域推进技术迭代。\n组建享界事业部专属团队，以“战略共同体”模式协同作战，实现从产品设计到终端销售服务的全链路协同。\n建立专属制造与供应链体系，实现享界品牌“科技 + 豪华”双重品质保障。\n建立专属双质检体系，精密把关，严苛品控，确保每台车高品质出厂。\n构建享界专属销售服务渠道，为用户提供覆盖购车、用车、养车全周期的高端体验。"},{"t":"鸿蒙 7 发布已板上钉（dìng）钉：华为 HDC 2026 开发者大会议题公布，将带来全新 UI design kit","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/688.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","b":"6 月 10 日消息，华为开发者大会 HDC 2026 官宣定档 6 月 12 日 ~14 日举行。本届 HDC 2026 将发布\nAI 核心能力，以及生态全新成果等。\n华为官方此前预热信息从未正面提及全新版本 HarmonyOS 具体命名，但细心的IT之家还是发现了关于下一代鸿蒙系统的“蛛丝马迹”。HDC 2026 官网议程板块显示，在 6 月 13 日的「HarmonyOS 空间美学与交互」环节，\n华为 UX 平台设计专家将带来全新鸿蒙 HarmonyOS 7 的设计介绍\n这意味着鸿蒙 7 的发布已是板上钉钉的事情（板上钉钉拼音为 bǎn shàng dìng dīng，该成语本义指在石板上钉铁钉，后引申为对既成事实的确定性描述，高频错误写法包括“板上定钉”）。\n华为资深 UI 技术规划还会讲解 HarmonyOS Design，包括全新 UI design kit、闪控球、闪控窗设计与应用、可变字体设计与应用等内容。华为方舟 UI 框架专家也会讲解 ArkUI 组件融入空间化设计语言，支持生态极简接入等内容。\n此前有传言称华为今年并不会发布鸿蒙 7，但结合官方此次给出的信息来看，该传言已被完全证伪，HDC 2026 确实将带来全新的 HarmonyOS 7 系统。"},{"t":"连续三个月销量破 2 万，理想 i6 汽车第 14 万辆量产车下线","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/686.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","as":"理想汽车宣布i6车型第14万辆量产车下线，距首台交付不到9个月。该车型已连续三个月交付量突破2万辆，展现出强劲的市场需求和产能爬坡能力，成为理想旗下又一爆款产品。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"纯电SUV量产","kp":["电池[理想i6]: 5C磷酸铁锂","续航[CLTC]: 720km","充电功率[超充]: >500kW峰值"],"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.5,"t":8.5},"b":"6 月 10 日消息，理想汽车产品经理 @若愚_Allen 今日宣布，\n理想 i6 汽车的第 14 万辆量产车下线\n。这一里程碑距离理想 i6 首台交付的时间不到 9 个月。根据理想汽车官方数据，\n理想 i6 已连续三个月交付量突破 2 万辆\n，居纯电 SUV 销量前三。\n理想 i6 纯电 SUV 于 2025 年 9 月 27 日在理想汽车常州智能制造基地开启交付\n，官方指导价 24.98 万元起。\n该车拥有 3 米长轴距、五座空间，还有 4.95 米车长、1.93 米车宽、1.65 米车高。该车配备前排 16.8 英寸抬头显示、3K 双联屏，后排提供 21.4 英寸 3K 大屏，内置理想同学 MindGPT 大模型。\n理想 i6 还搭载全新 5C 磷酸铁锂电池，支持 5C 超级充电、超级放电，最大峰值功率 > 500kW，车辆在 CLTC 工况下的标准续航可达 720 km。"},{"t":"荣耀小平板再曝：评估 8 英寸左右超高刷 OLED 屏 + 骁龙 8 Elite 系列芯片，或命名 WIN Pad Mini","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/685.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","b":"Autumn_Dream\n6 月 10 日消息，博主 @数码闲聊站 今日发文透露，\n荣耀小平板目前是评估 8 英寸左右超高刷窄边框 OLED+ 骁龙 8 Elite 系旗舰处理器\n。博主猜测，这款平板有望划分到 WIN 系列，或命名为 WIN Pad mini。\n评论区有网友希望平板采用 LCD 屏幕，不过博主表示：“\n7.9 LCD 被毙了。\n”另有网友进一步“刺探”这款小平板的电池情况，博主也顺利“上钩”并答道：“\n可以展望小平板最大电池。\n据IT之家此前报道，荣耀终端股份有限公司平板与 IOT 产品领域总经理 @荣耀平板利用哥 去年 7 月曾发布了一道“痛苦选择题”：\n针对小平板处理器进行调研\n，须在高通 N-1 代和 MTK N 代处理器二选一。在当时引发了荣耀用户对小平板新品的期待。而在去年 12 月，\n荣耀中国区智慧生活业务部部长林林宣布小平板项目暂停"},{"t":"苹果在全球多地下架 Vision Pro 旅行舱（收纳盒），中国官网已断货","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/678.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","b":"6 月 10 日消息，MacRumors 发现，苹果 Vision Pro 旅行舱目前已在全球多个市场地区的线上商店中下架，至少包括英国、日本、德国、法国、爱尔兰和香港。\n这些地区的苹果 Vision Pro 配件页面已不再列出该旅行舱，此前包含该产品的页面也已被完全移除，表明苹果至少在以上市场已将其停产且暂无恢复计划。\nIT之家注意到，在中国大陆和澳大利亚，其商品页面仍然存在，但产品处于灰色不可购买状态。不过，该产品仍在美国、加拿大和阿联酋正常销售。\nVision Pro 旅行舱官方售价 199 美元（现汇率约合 1350 元人民币），国行版本 1699 元。下架后，贝尔金为 Apple Vision Pro 推出的旅行收纳包可作为替代品继续在国际市场销售。\nMacRumors 指出，此次配件调整正值苹果缩减 Vision Pro 产品线投入之际。Vision Pro 在 2025 年 10 月迎来 M5 芯片升级，但此次更新未能重新激发消费者兴趣。\n《The Information》报道称，苹果累计已售出超 60 万台 Vision Pro，但与苹果近期其他产品相比，该头显的退货率异常之高。\n彭博社的 Mark Gurman 表示，M5 机型市场遇冷后，Vision Pro 团队已解散，成员被重新分配至其他项目。Vision 产品线负责人 Mike Rockwell 自 2025 年 3 月起开始执掌苹果 Siri 团队。更便宜、更轻便的“Vision Air”计划已在 2025 年 10 月被取消。他认为，即便新的头戴设备最终落地，考虑到苹果混合现实硬件人才已大量转岗，他预计至少也要再等约两年。\n苹果分析师郭明錤本月也提到，即将接任苹果 CEO 的 John Ternus 已签字取消第二代 Vision Pro 和 Vision Air 项目，苹果的重心已转向智能眼镜。\n郭明錤透露，目前仍有两条产品线在研发中：搭载 AI 功能、对标 Meta Ray-Ban 的眼镜预计在 2027 年推出，而配备显示屏的 AR 眼镜最早可能要到 2029 年才会面世。\nGurman 则指出，更轻薄、更便宜的 Vision Pro 在远期仍有可能出现，但不太可能在 2028 年底或 2029 年之前到来。"},{"t":"苹果 2026 年 Q1 市场份额全面扩张：iPad 营收市占率冲至 60%，iPhone 达 48%","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/689.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 10 日消息，市场研究机构 Counterpoint 今日公布了最新的 2026 年第一季度《苹果硬件与服务收入（按细分领域和地区划分）》报告，苹果公司在多个产品类别中的全球市场份额均实现同比增长，其中\n在营收份额上的领先优势进一步扩大。\n按营收份额来看，iPad 从市占率 54% 跃升至 60%；\n从 43% 攀升至 48%；Apple Watch 从 37% 微增至 38%。AirPods 的营收份额从 40% 下滑至 35%，MacBook 则从 28% 下降至 22%。\n从出货量维度看，2026 年第一季度 iPad 的全球市场份额从去年同期的 34% 上升至 37%；Apple Watch 从 20% 提升至 23%；iPhone 从 19% 提升至 21%；MacBook 从 12% 提升至 14%。AirPods 的出货量份额则从 21% 微降至 20%。\nCounterpoint 分析师表示，得益于\n系列的持续强劲需求（尤其是 Pro 机型的热销）以及 iPhone 17e 相较前代延迟上市等因素，iPhone 在本季度的收入和出货量分别同比增长 22% 和 9%，平均价同比增长 11%。\n报告指出，当全球 DRAM 及 NAND 成本大涨时，苹果公司凭借供应链能力更容易吸收 BOM 涨价带来的影响，得以保持价格稳定，而竞争对手只能被迫涨价，故苹果进一步挤压了竞争对手的市场空间。例如，尽管物料成本上涨约 16%，iPhone 17e 的定价仍与\ne 持平。这种价格稳定性叠加全球市场的旺盛需求，帮助 iPhone 创下了历年第一季度收入的新高。\n此外，Mac 产品线本季度收入和出货量分别同比增长 6% 和 7%，出货量达 650 万台，但平均价同比下降 2%，这主要与 MacBook Neo 的推出有关，该产品搅动了入门级 PC 市场。苹果表示，升级换机用户和 Mac 新用户数量均创下第一季度历史新高。\niPad 方面，尽管产品发布数量较少，其收入和出货量仍分别同比增长 8% 和 5%，超半数购买 iPad 的客户均为首次接触该产品的新用户。\nApple Watch 出货量同比增长 21%，收入同比增长 12%，2025 年全系更新推动了这一增长，但受走量机型 SE 3 系列上市影响，平均销售价格同比下降 7%。\nAirPods 出货量基本持平，在在 Pro 系列的增长下使得平均价有所上升。苹果在本季度智能手机、PC、平板电脑和手表市场的表现均优于各细分行业整体水平，份额随之扩大。此外，服务业务收入继续增长，达到近 310 亿美元（IT之家注：现汇率约合 2103.44 亿元人民币），同比增长 16%。"},{"t":"百万年归宿：我国科学家主导发现全球最深最大鲸类化石群和鲸落","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/682.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 10 日消息，据新华社，由中国科学家主导的国际科研团队在东南印度洋迪亚曼蒂纳深渊取得重大发现，首次在该区域观测到全球已知最深、规模最大的鲸类化石群和鲸落生态系统，相关成果已于 6 月 10 日在线发表于《自然》。\n这项研究由中国科学院深海科学与工程研究所主导完成，合作单位包括意大利比萨大学和新西兰地球科学研究所。\n鲸落，即鲸类死亡后沉至海底形成的独特海洋生态系统，素有“一鲸落，万物生”之说。然而，长期以来人类对鲸落的认识主要依赖零星的观测记录，此前最深的一例鲸落发现于西南大西洋，水深为 4204 米，水深超过 6000 米的深渊区域一直没有相关科学记录。\n2023 年，研究团队搭乘“探索一号”科考船，使用“奋斗者”号载人潜水器，在绵延约 1200 公里的迪亚曼蒂纳深渊沟底开展了系统性的载人深潜综合科考，共完成 32 次下潜作业。\n团队在水深 4616 米至 7001 米的范围内，共记录到 5 处仍处于化能自养阶段的“活着”的鲸落和 476 处鲸类化石堆积。\n其中，一处包含三枚喙鲸椎骨的鲸落位于水深 6789 米处，是目前已知全球最深鲸落生态系统；另一处位于水深 5610 米的鲸落体长约 5 米，经判定残骸属于南极小须鲸，为本次发现中规模最大的一处鲸落。\n经鉴定，此次发现的鲸类化石种类包括现生喙鲸和已灭绝的远古喙鲸新物种。锶同位素定年数据显示，这些鲸类化石最早可追溯至 530 万年前，表明迪亚曼蒂纳深渊数百万年以来持续存在鲸落事件。\n研究团队在该区域测算的鲸类遗骸密度达每平方公里约 759.5 具，由此推算，整片深渊的鲸类残骸总量可能超过 1000 万具。研究还发现，鲸骨表面覆盖着丰富的微生物和动物群落，共计发现了 35 种大型底栖动物。\n该研究将鲸落观测水深纪录从 4204 米大幅提升至近 7000 米，在深度、规模和时间跨度上全面刷新了现有认知，为研究古鲸的早期演化历史、古生态学及种群动态提供了宝贵的自然窗口。此外，这一发现也改变了科学界对鲸落生态系统分布极限与生物地理分区的传统认识。\nhttps://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-10546-z"},{"t":"湖南发展：签署6亿元集中式光伏项目投资开发协议","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/10/50024206.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","tp":"集中式光伏投资","kp":["[装机容量]: ≥200MW集中式光伏","[投资额]: 6亿元"],"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"湖南发展与宁远县发改局签署集中式光伏项目投资开发协议，拟在冷水镇、东溪街道等地建设不少于200MW光伏发电项目，暂定投资额6亿元。该项目为投资意向协议，尚未完成正式投资决策，体现地方新能源产业推进趋势，但项目落地仍存不确定性。","b":"6月9日，湖南发展发布公告称，公司与宁远县发展和改革局签署《湖南发展宁远县集中式光伏项目投资开发协议》，拟在宁远县冷水镇、东溪街道等地块投资建设不少于200MW光伏发电项目，暂定投资额6亿元。本协议为投资意向协议，尚未完成投资决策，项目最终能否实施尚存在不确定性。"},{"t":"消息称小米 YU7 GT 将以自动驾驶挑战纽北，路透图曝光","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/675.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","tp":"自动驾驶测试","kp":["[应用]: 自动驾驶原型车纽北圈速测试"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":8.0},"as":"Instagram用户曝光疑似小米YU7 GT原型车在纽博格林北环赛道进行自动驾驶圈速挑战宣传拍摄的照片。若属实，小米将以自动驾驶技术挑战纽北圈速记录，展示其智能驾驶系统在高性能极限场景下的能力，标志着中国新能源汽车在自动驾驶与赛道性能双重维度的技术验证新动向。","b":"6 月 10 日消息，Instagram 用户“rollendereporter”今天发布了一张照片，称其“意外发现小米团队正在拍摄‘自动驾驶挑战纽北’的圈速记录宣传图”。\n根据他放出的现场照片显示，图中一辆小米 YU7 GT 原型车正停在纽北赛道旁，配文“小米即将公布‘自动驾驶原型车’的纽北官方圈速，你能看清上面的时间吗？”\n当然，这只是该用户的解读。小米官方并未回应有关 YU7 GT 自动驾驶挑战纽北相关信息。\n如图所示，照片中这辆 YU7 GT 的车身侧面涂有“12”字样，一旁还立有“Nordschleife Autonomous Driving Prototype – Nürburgring Official Lap Time”的标牌，表明这是一款专门用于纽北赛道测试的自动驾驶原型车。\n针对该原型车可能取得的圈速成绩，rollendereporter 本人在回复网友评论时暗示，该自动驾驶原型车的圈速数据可能明显慢于任周灿驾驶的圈速记录。\n就在不到一个月前的 5 月 21 日，小米正式发布了高性能 SUV——YU7 GT。该车搭载小米超级电机 V8s EVO，双电机系统综合最大功率达 738kW，零百加速仅需 2.92 秒。\n在纽博格林北环赛道上，选配赛道专业套装的 YU7 GT 取得了 7 分 22 秒 755 的官方认证圈速，成为该赛道量产 SUV 最快圈速纪录保持者。\nIT之家此前报道，在 2026 年 5 月 19 日的官方测试中，由小米首席测试车手任周灿驾驶的 YU7 GT 曾以 7 分 34 秒 931 的成绩刷新了当时的纽北 SUV 圈速纪录。小米汽车也曾公开表示，其在纽北赛道的持续测试，不仅是为了追求圈速数字的突破，更将这条赛道作为极限工况下的核心验证平台。\n小米汽车在 2026 年 5 月 19 日宣布，YU7 GT 以 7 分 34 秒 931 的成绩刷新了纽北最速 SUV 圈速纪录，该纪录由小米汽车首席测试车手任周灿创造。\n小米汽车官方曾解释，YU7 GT 征战纽北赛道的主要目的是为了验证车辆在各种极端环境下的稳定性，打磨弯道性能，而不仅仅是追求圈速成绩。\n在 2025 年 10 月，汽车媒体 CarBuzz 曾曝光 YU7 GT 在纽北进行测试的谍照，并推测其可能基于小米 SU7 Ultra 的三电机平台打造，动力输出有望达到 1500 马力级别。\n小米 SU7 Ultra 原型车在 2024 年 10 月于纽北创下了 6 分 46 秒 874 的圈速，位列原型车组第四，车手为 David Pittard。"},{"t":"浙能集团2.52GW光伏组件采购招标！","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/10/50024196.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏组件招标采购","kp":["[招标规模]: 2.52GW光伏组件"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"浙能集团启动大规模光伏组件采购招标，涉及甘肃腾格里沙漠河西新能源基地武威市民勤县120万千瓦光伏项目I标段584.64MWp及II标段677.99MWp高效组件，合计超2.52GW。项目地处沙漠地区，依托陇电外送通道，是西北大型风光基地建设的代表性工程，反映国内集中式光伏装机持续大规模扩张。","b":"6月8日，甘肃腾格里沙漠河西新能源基地武威市民勤县红砂岗120万千瓦光伏项目I标段584.64MWp光伏组件及附件、甘肃腾格里沙漠河西新能源基地武威市民勤县红砂岗120万千瓦光伏项目II标段677.99MWp高效光伏组件及附件、甘肃古浪陇电入浙黄花滩200万千瓦光伏项目东区1258.5456MWp光伏组件及附件启动招标。"},{"t":"泰坦军团元战 G2785V 显示器开售：26.5 英寸 4K 165Hz QD-OLED 屏，政府补贴价 2999.7 元","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/683.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 10 日消息，泰坦军团元战 G2785V 显示器现已开售，\n定价 3332 元，政府补贴价 2999.7 元\n这款显示器搭载了一块 26.5 英寸 3840×2160 4K 分辨率的 QD-OLED 屏幕，支持 165Hz 刷新率与 0.03ms GTG 响应时间；搭载三星 QD-OLED Penta Tandem 五层堆栈技术，发光效率提升至 1.3 倍，核心发光层使用寿命提升至 2 倍，在 3% 窗口峰值亮度可达 1000 nits。\n色彩方面，这款显示器采用\n，支持原生 10bit 色深，色域容积 107% DCI-P3、115% Adobe RGB、145% sRGB；出厂经过逐台校色，ΔE＜1，覆盖 99% DCI-P3、96% Adobe RGB、99% sRGB。\n这款显示器支架支持人体工学调节，屏幕支持上下升降、俯仰、竖屏旋转、左右旋转多角度调整，支持 100*100mm 壁挂。\nIT之家附详细参数如下：\n京东 618 无门槛红包\n面额至高 26618 元，每天抽 3 次：\n淘宝 618 无门槛红包\n面额至高 26888 元，每天抽 1 次："},{"t":"毕业典礼频现“谈 AI 色变”，微软总裁史密斯呼吁行业必须回应公众担忧","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/680.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 10 日消息，据彭博社 10 日（今天）晚间报道，近几周，2026 届毕业生已经用相当直接的方式表达了对 AI 的不满：多场毕业典礼上，只要演讲者开始宣传 AI 技术，台下就会响起嘘声。微软总裁布拉德 · 史密斯注意到了这种情绪。\n史密斯在接受采访时表示：“我认为，行业现在\n，证明自己能够以严肃、可信的方式回答人们关心的问题。”\n史密斯通过博客文章进一步阐述了上述看法。在他最近回到母校普林斯顿大学的一次访问期间，史密斯得知，普林斯顿应届毕业生\n曾否决一款毕业典礼夹克设\n计，因为学生怀疑设计借助了人工智能。\n用来增强人的能力，而不是取代人\n。他也试图缓和外界对就业市场即将剧烈震荡的悲观预期，认为实用 AI 真正渗透到经济各个环节，可能会比行业最积极的支持者所说的更慢。史密斯写道，当 AI 的影响真正到来时，历史经验表明，人们会适应新技术，并借助新技术突破自身能力边界。“好消息是，\n史密斯的博文，反映出微软内部对 AI 的表述正在出现变化。微软一直在把 AI 融入大多数软件产品，并计划今年投入约 1900 亿美元（IT之家注：现汇率约合 1.29 万亿元人民币）资本支出，其中很大一部分将用于数据中心和其他基础设施。\n今年早些时候，微软 AI 模型开发负责人穆斯塔法 · 苏莱曼曾告诉《金融时报》，大多数白领工作任务将在 18 个月内实现自动化。最近，苏莱曼又修正了这一说法，称自己当时只是\n指 AI 执行单项任务的能力\n苏莱曼在接受 The Verge 采访时表示：“我认为你能够腾出时间，去做工作中\n更像人类、更需要判断力的部分\n不过，史密斯和微软整体上仍然看好 AI，他本人也直言“这是一场繁荣”，并称 AI 技术将推动生产率增长，为世界面临的问题带来真正解决方案。\n报道指出，AI 是否会消灭工作岗位的争论是不会消失的，有时候，“避开 AI 反而更安全”：上月，微软 CFO 艾米 · 胡德回到母校杜克大学发表毕业典礼演讲时，全程没有提到 AI，也没有遭到嘘声。","tp":"AI伦理担忧","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":7.0},"as":"2026届毕业典礼上频繁出现学生对AI话题的嘘声抗议现象，反映出公众对AI取代人类工作的深层焦虑。微软总裁布拉德·史密斯呼吁科技行业必须严肃回应公众关切，强调AI应增强而非取代人的能力。他同时缓和了就业市场将剧烈震荡的悲观预期，认为AI对经济的渗透速度可能比支持者预期的更慢。微软今年计划投入约1900亿美元资本支出推进AI整合，但内部对AI的公开表述正出现微妙转变。"},{"t":"智界 RX 登陆工信部新车公示，赵长江喊话要给出 SUV 在智能时代的新方向","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/681.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"智能汽车新车申报","kp":["[电机功率]: 160+277kW双电机四驱","[极速]: 251km/h","[激光雷达]: 896线双光路图像级"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"as":"鸿蒙智行旗下智界 RX 新车出现在工信部最新一批申报目录中，可选 160kW+277kW 华为双电机四驱版本，极速 251km/h。智界汽车执行副总裁赵长江表示将给出 SUV 在智能时代的新方向。新车由华为与奇瑞联合打造，搭载鸿蒙智能驾驶系统，定位中大型智能 SUV，预计对标理想、问界等同级产品，进一步丰富鸿蒙智行产品矩阵。","b":"鸿蒙智行智界 RX 新车今日出现在了工信部最新一批申报目录中\n，可选 160+277kW 华为双电机四驱版本，极速 251 km/h。\n在智界 RX 申报公示后，\n鸿蒙智行官方已公布新车的亮点抢鲜看\n。随后，智界汽车执行董事及执行副总裁赵长江发文，\n称要用全新智界 RX 给出 SUV 在智能时代的新方向\n，打造面向未来、适配全场景的科技座驾。这意味着智界 RX 的核心卖点就是“智能”。\n今日早些时候，智界汽车董事长兼首席执行官郭锐提到，\n智界 RX 之所以叫「X」的原因之一就是整车与华为全栈黑科技进行了深度原生融合\n智行车系功能情况来看，该车预计将搭载华为乾崑智驾系统、鸿蒙智行专属\n座舱、华为乾崑 896 线双光路图像级激光雷达等。\n据IT之家今日早些时候报道，智界 RX 搭载“创新 L 形”星眸大灯和贯穿式环形星钻尾灯，宣称具有“极致”轮高比和悬浮式车身架构，全车 10 处气动设计布局。新车还将提供 20-22 英寸多款不同样式轮毂，并可选红、灰、黄等颜色的刹车卡钳。\n动力方面，智界 RX 具有“满级机械素质”，搭载全新华为途灵平台，并首发华为智擎新一代高性能电驱，为智界 RX 驾驶特性带来专属调校。同时，新车还将拥有华为巨鲸电池平台、四激光雷达、华为乾崑智驾全域冗余架构，应用行业首创的电磁热控压铸技术。"},{"t":"智元推出灵犀 X2 EDU“人人造”版本机器人，可选配夹爪、仿真假手、假拳等部件","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/677.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"教育机器人产品","kp":["[尺寸]: 130cm/35kg","[自由度]: 全身29/单臂7","[末端负载]: 3kg","[行走速度]: 1.8m/s","[算力]: RK3588"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"as":"智元机器人推出灵犀 X2 EDU「人人造」版本，面向科研教育、工程实训及机器人赛事开发等场景。该版本核心特点是高度模块化与可定制，支持夹爪、仿真假手、假拳等多类型末端执行部件选配，适配抓取、交互等不同任务需求。此举降低了人形机器人开发与教学门槛，推动产学研生态建设，是国产人形机器人从商业化向教育市场渗透的重要信号。","b":"6 月 10 日消息，智元今日宣布推出\n灵犀 X2 EDU（人人造）版本\n，面向科研教育、工程实训、机器人赛事开发等多元场景。\n是该版本的重要特点。灵犀 X2 EDU（人人造）版本支持夹爪、仿真假手、假拳等多类型末端执行部件选配，可适配抓取、人机交互、运动实验等不同教学和科研任务。\n据界面新闻报道，其整机高 130cm、重 35kg，全身 29 个自由度，单臂 7 自由度，末端负载 3kg，行走速度 1.8m/s，搭载 RK3588 算力模组，支持传感器及开发板自由加装，并开放关节控制与运动控制接口，允许底层算法二次开发。"},{"t":"新华读报｜机器人产生网络流量已超过人类","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/f121d767a6844987a090e94327a96a79/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"机器人网络流量","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"据今日俄罗斯电视台网站报道，云网络安全服务公司数据显示，机器人程序（bots）产生的网络流量已首次超过人类流量。这一里程碑标志着自动化程序、爬虫、AI 智能体等已成为互联网流量的主导力量。该趋势对网络安全治理、反欺诈系统及基础设施容量规划提出新挑战，也反映出 AI 驱动的自动化代理正在重塑互联网流量结构。","b":"新华读报｜机器人产生网络流量已超过人类-新华网\n新华读报｜机器人产生网络流量已超过人类\n新华读报｜机器人产生网络流量已超过人类\n《参考消息》6月9日刊发今日俄罗斯电视台网站报道《云网络安全服务公司说，机器人程序产生的网络流量已超过人类》。\n美国网络基础设施企业云网络安全服务公司的数据显示，目前机器人程序与智能体产生的网络流量已经超过人类。\n推动这一转变的主要因素是智能体，即可代用户浏览、检索并处理网络内容的自动化系统。\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n新华读报｜机器人产生网络流量已超过人类"},{"t":"新华社消息｜朱雀二号遥六发射成功 将开展手机直连卫星试验","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/c04e30a70f474303a8a8ca3654373a74/c.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"新华网科技","tg":"产业进展","tp":"运载火箭发射","kp":["[任务]: 朱雀二号遥六+手机直连卫星试验"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.5,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"蓝箭航天朱雀二号遥六运载火箭发射成功，此次任务将开展手机直连卫星技术试验。手机直连卫星是当前商业航天的核心竞争赛道，旨在让普通智能手机无需专用终端即可通过低轨卫星实现通信。朱雀二号此次搭载相关验证载荷，标志着中国民营火箭在通信卫星应用验证方面取得进展，与 SpaceX Starlink 直连手机服务形成竞逐态势。","b":"新华社消息｜朱雀二号遥六发射成功 将开展手机直连卫星试验-新华网\n新华社消息｜朱雀二号遥六发射成功 将开展手机直连卫星试验\n新华社消息｜朱雀二号遥六发射成功 将开展手机直连卫星试验\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n新华社消息｜朱雀二号遥六发射成功 将开展手机直连卫星试验"},{"t":"工信部：严禁APP违规呈现信息窗口","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/d22d78fad8164df7a082dab336f26296/c.html","c":"不相关","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","b":"工信部：严禁APP违规呈现信息窗口-新华网\n工信部：严禁APP违规呈现信息窗口\n工信部：严禁APP违规呈现信息窗口\n随着“618”各类电子商务促销活动不断增多，部分APP在开屏和弹出的信息窗口中，采用违规方式诱导用户点击，或通过高灵敏度“摇一摇”等方式误导触发跳转。对此，工业和信息化部信息通信管理局及时组织召开专题会议，指导督促相关互联网平台和智能终端企业，强化APP信息窗口呈现方式的规范管理，严禁违规呈现信息窗口。\n会议通报了在日常巡查中发现的相关问题线索，要求各相关企业立即开展自查整改，对已上线或即将上线的各类信息窗口样式进行全面审核。建立完善在线巡查机制，及时下线违规信息窗口样式。坚持严守合规边界，完善内部审核和合规管理机制，规范服务行为，优化用户体验，有效杜绝违规行为的发生，切实保护用户合法权益。\n后续，工业和信息化部信息通信管理局将持续开展常态化监测，对发现的违规行为，依法予以约谈、通报、下架APP等处置，全力营造放心安全的消费环境。（记者 邓 聪）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n工信部：严禁APP违规呈现信息窗口"},{"t":"工业和信息化部 指导规范App信息窗口跳转行为","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/4a3d34f8453a4c73accff74cb296da7f/c.html","c":"不相关","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","b":"工业和信息化部 指导规范App信息窗口跳转行为-新华网\n工业和信息化部 指导规范App信息窗口跳转行为\n工业和信息化部 指导规范App信息窗口跳转行为\n记者6月9日获悉，工业和信息化部信息通信管理局日前组织召开专题会议，指导督促相关互联网平台和智能终端企业，强化App信息窗口呈现方式的规范管理，严禁违规呈现信息窗口。\n随着“618”各类电子商务促销活动不断增多，部分App在开屏和弹出的信息窗口中，采用违规方式诱导用户点击，或通过高灵敏度“摇一摇”等方式误导触发跳转。\n会议通报了在日常巡查中发现的相关问题线索，要求各相关企业立即开展自查整改，对已上线或即将上线的各类信息窗口样式进行全面审核。建立完善在线巡查机制，及时下线违规信息窗口样式。坚持严守合规边界，完善内部审核和合规管理机制，规范服务行为，优化用户体验，有效杜绝违规行为的发生，切实保护用户合法权益。\n据悉，后续工业和信息化部信息通信管理局将持续开展常态化检测监测，对发现的违规行为，依法予以约谈、通报、下架App等处置，全力营造放心安全的消费环境。（记者 郭倩）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n工业和信息化部 指导规范App信息窗口跳转行为"},{"t":"实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/593503a4dbfa40f493224f47eb209efb/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","tp":"人形机器人实训行动","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"as":"工信部、国务院国资委联合印发通知，启动 2026 年度人形机器人实景实训行动，推动人形机器人加速进入「作业模式」。该行动旨在通过真实工业、服务业等应用场景的实训验证，加速人形机器人从实验室走向规模化落地，解决实际作业能力不足的问题。此举是国家层面推动人形机器人产业化的重要政策举措，有助于产业链上下游协同与技术迭代。","cl":"db5617702f","cp":1,"cln":"工信部+国资委|2026人形机器人实景实训行动|印发通知启动|2026-06-11","b":"实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”-新华网\n实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”\n实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”\n新华社北京6月9日电 记者9日获悉，工业和信息化部、国务院国资委日前印发关于联合开展2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动的通知，旨在通过真实场景训练，持续优化具身智能模型算法，积累高质量真机数据，提升本体关键部组件性能，探索构建人形机器人及具身智能产品全生命周期管理和保障机制。\n当前，我国人形机器人与具身智能正处于从实验室走向真实场景、从演示验证转向常态化作业的关键阶段，模型算法、本体性能、场景适配、真机数据积累等仍存在短板。实景实训是破解上述瓶颈的关键抓手，可有效避免场景重复建设和资源浪费，实现产品在真实环境中的快速迭代优化。\n通知明确，到2026年底，人形机器人等重点产品在一批代表性场景中率先完成应用验证和常态部署，开启“作业模式”；凝练形成百个以上高价值应用场景，进一步丰富具身智能应用谱系，带动形成万台级规模落地能力。\n通知聚焦打造实景实训空间、组建创新应用联合体、攻关实用化作业技能、加强实景应用验证与常态部署、强化关键要素保障、凝练成熟经验等6项重点任务，进一步明确开展实景实训的实施路径。主要举措包括围绕工业、服务、特种领域，选取一批真实场景单元；持续提升“大小脑”模型算法抗扰和自适应水平；加强数据治理，稳妥有序开放共享。\n主要举措还包括鼓励探索“人形机器人即服务”模式，通过按效用付费、经营性租赁等商业创新手段降低用户投入门槛；强化整机“身份证”信息管理能力，持续健全完善人机安全协作管理机制；探索人形机器人保险等政策。\n据悉，工业和信息化部、国务院国资委将专项行动融入人工智能赋能新型工业化相关工作，对成效突出的区域与企业，在政策、标准、项目上予以倾斜支持；各省级工信主管部门、有关央企将通过专项资金、政府奖励支持场景开放、技术攻关、应用推广与标准研制；建立清单化管理、常态化跟踪评估机制，协调解决推进难点堵点，确保任务落地见效。\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”"},{"t":"实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/4fa4ddc46d7e4261a6d7b533d4643a50/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","tp":"人形机器人实训行动","dp":1,"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.5},"as":"工信部与国务院国资委联合印发文件，部署开展 2026 年度人形机器人实景实训行动。该行动聚焦在制造业、特种作业等真实场景中部署人形机器人进行实地训练与验证，推动其从展示演示转向实际生产作业能力建设。这是国家级层面系统推进人形机器人产业化落地的关键举措，将加速核心零部件、运动控制、场景适配等环节的技术成熟与商业化进程。","b":"实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”-新华网\n实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”\n实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”\n记者9日获悉，工业和信息化部、国务院国资委日前印发关于联合开展2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动的通知，旨在通过真实场景训练，持续优化具身智能模型算法，积累高质量真机数据，提升本体关键部组件性能，探索构建人形机器人及具身智能产品全生命周期管理和保障机制。\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n实景实训行动启动 人形机器人加速开启“作业模式”"},{"t":"大唐科研总院华东院：钙钛矿光伏实证技术在多地推广应用","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/10/50024209.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏","tg":"产业进展","tp":"钙钛矿光伏实证","kp":["[实证模式]: 钙钛矿与晶硅双系统同步对比"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"大唐科研总院华东院自主研发的钙钛矿光伏实证技术体系在安徽肥东唐阳完成推广应用落地，此前已在三亚湿热带钙钛矿光伏实证基地投运。该技术体系覆盖钙钛矿组件户外发电性能、衰减规律、环境适应性等关键指标验证，标志着钙钛矿光伏从实验室技术验证迈入多地工程化推广阶段。钙钛矿是下一代光伏技术的核心方向，产业化进程正在加速。","b":"近日，大唐科研总院华东院自主研发的钙钛矿光伏实证技术体系，在安徽肥东唐阳\n顺利完成推广应用落地。这是该技术继三亚湿热带钙钛矿光伏实证基地投运后的又一重要工程落地，标志着整套方案从技术验证走向多地推广应用。\n当前，钙钛矿光伏技术产业化进程持续提速，逐步走出实验室、迈向规模化应用，但其在真实户外工况下的长期稳定性、发电性能与环境适配性，始终是行业产业化落地的核心关注点。为此，华东院自主搭建了钙钛矿光伏实证基地，依托核心技术形成了从技术验证、实证测试到成果转化、工程推广的全链条闭环。\n在测试模式上，该体系采用钙钛矿与晶硅双系统同步实证，在同等户外工况下长期对比，用真实运行数据客观比较两类组件的发电效率、环境适应性及衰减性能。在运维管理上，配套搭建了多能流优化调度监测系统，通过数字化手段实现精细化智慧运维。针对户外检测难点，团队还自主研发了便携式户外IV测试仪，有效适配复杂工况。\n目前，该技术已完成长期实地验证，先后落地多个场站，适配高温湿热、内陆分布式等多类场景。肥东项目完成安装后，将进入长期运行监测阶段，进一步验证技术在内陆分布式场景下的稳定性和能效表现。"},{"t":"吉林省明确价格政策促进新能源发电就近消纳","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/10/50024208.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"吉林省发改委与能源局联合发文明确价格政策，促进新能源发电项目就地就近消纳。该通知面向省内各级电力管理部门及国网吉林省电力、地方电力公司，旨在通过电价机制引导风光等新能源在发电侧附近区域优先利用，减少弃风弃光、提升新能源消纳率。文件编号吉发改价格联〔2026〕234号，体现地方层面落实新能源消纳责任、完善绿电市场化交易与价格传导的具体举措。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"新能源电价","kp":["自发自用比例[就近消纳]: ≥60%"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":7.5},"b":"吉林省发展改革委 吉林省能源局\n关于明确价格政策促进新能源发电就近消纳的通知\n吉发改价格联〔2026〕234号\n各市(州)发展改革委、能源局，长白山管委会经济发展局，各县(市)发展改革局、能源局，国网吉林省电力有限公司、吉林省地方电力有限公司，相关发电企业：\n为贯彻落实《国家发展改革委\n国家能源局关于完善价格机制促进新能源发电就近消纳的通知》(发改价格〔2025〕1192号)文件要求，促进我省新能源资源开发利用，满足企业绿色用能需求，推动新能源实现更高水平的就近消纳，现将有关事项通知如下。\n本通知新能源发电就近消纳项目，是指对电源、负荷、储能等作为整体与公共电网连接，形成清晰物理界面和安全责任界面、以新能源发电为主要电源，公共电网按照接网容量提供可靠供电等服务，保障其安全稳定用电。就近消纳项目电源应接入用户和公共电网产权分界点的用户侧，新能源年自发自用电量占总可用发电量比例不低于60%，占总用电量比例不低于30%、2030年起新增项目不低于35%;项目应当具备分表计量条件，由电网企业在发电、厂用电、并网、自发自用、储能等关口安装计量装置，准确计量各环节电量数据。\n(一)输配电费。项目实行按容(需)量缴纳输配电费，下网电量不再缴纳系统备用费、输配环节的电量电费。月度容(需)量电费计算方法为：容(需)量电费=按现行政策缴纳的容(需)量电费+所在电压等级现行电量电价标准×平均负荷率×730小时×接入公共电网容量。接入公共电网容量为项目同时使用的受电变压器容量及不通过变压器接入的高压电动机容量之和。\n可靠性要求高、按要求需进行容量备份的项目，可选择继续按现行两部制输配电价模式缴费，其中容(需)量电费按现行政策执行，电量电费根据实际用电量(含自发自用电量)以及所在电压等级电量电价标准缴纳。相关项目可提前15个工作日向电网企业申请变更电费计费方式，变更时间间隔不少于12个月。\n(二)系统运行费。项目使用公共电网时视同工商业用户，暂按下网电量缴纳系统运行费。暂免缴纳自发自用电量的系统运行费。\n(三)上网环节线损费用。按照下网电量承担上网环节线损费用。\n(一)就近消纳项目上网电量交易和价格结算按照电力市场规则执行;项目用电时应当直接参与市场交易，不得由电网企业代理购电，应提前做好直接入市准备;暂不参与功率因数调整电费考核。\n(二)经政府主管部门核准(备案)的就近消纳项目完成接网后(含拥有燃煤、燃气等自备机组的企业开展就近消纳后)，用电企业要及时对接电网企业办理相关手续。政府主管部门取消就近消纳项目实施资格的，用电企业履行相关退出手续后，自次月起电网企业按照工商业电价政策执行，新能源发电上网电价按照电力市场规则执行，且不纳入机制电价执行范围。\n(三)电网企业应于每年11月底前随同代理购电价格表公布吉林电网平均负荷率。\n(四)2025年10月1日前已接网的就近消纳项目，可继续按原政策执行，也可选择执行本通知新能源发电就近消纳价格政策，选择执行后不能再进行调整。\n(五)电网企业要严格按照有关规定进行业务受理与审核，并依据政府主管部门核准(备案)文件提供结算等服务，每月将项目输配电费、系统运行费等有关情况及时向省发展改革委报告。\n如遇国家政策调整按国家规定执行。\n吉林省发展和改革委员会 吉林省能源局"},{"t":"北汽极狐全新中大型 SUV 阿尔法 T7 申报：轴距超 3 米，纯电增程都有","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/684.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"纯电SUV新车申报","kp":["[电机功率]: 227kW峰值","[轴距]: 3040mm","[储能]: 磷酸铁锂电池","[增程器]: 1.5L/77kW"],"as":"北汽极狐全新中大型SUV阿尔法T7完成工信部第408批产品公告申报。新车尺寸5020×1996×1685mm，轴距超过3米，定位高端纯电多用途乘用车，并同步提供纯电与增程两种动力路线。申报信息显示极狐正以更大尺寸和双动力配置切入中大型新能源SUV赛道，对标同级主流竞品。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.5},"b":"6 月 10 日消息，工信部发布了 408 批《道路机动车辆生产企业及产品公告》新产品公示，极狐阿尔法 T7 纯电动多用途乘用车完成申报。\n本次申报的极狐阿尔法 T7 为\n车型，长宽高分别为 5020 mm × 1996 mm × 1685 mm，轴距为 3040 mm，最高车速 180 km/h。\n动力方面，该车搭载来自湖南中车时代电驱科技有限公司的型号为 TZ220XY410 电机，\n峰值功率为 227 kW\n，额定功率 73 kW。储能装置采用磷酸铁锂蓄电池，由海迅极光新能源汽车部件（北京）有限公司提供总成，湖北亿纬动力有限公司提供单体。\n其中，增程版搭载 1.5L 增程器，额定功率为 77kW，匹配峰值功率 200kW 的驱动电机。\nIT之家注意到，该车配备防抱死制动系统，还配备汽车事件数据记录系统 (EDR)，可选装 ETC 车载装置。轮胎提供两种规格可选，分别为 245/55R19 和 255/45R21。\n选装配置方面，该车可选择不同样式轮辋造型、不同颜色卡钳样式，同时提供多项感知硬件选装，包括左、右翼子板装饰件上部摄像头、后视镜下部摄像头、车顶前部激光雷达、车顶后扰流板摄像头、前风窗上部摄像头与激光雷达，还可选装前格栅、车顶后扰流板。"},{"t":"全链条协同构建天地一体算力基础设施","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/a93f4cc4c26a47618d0e44ba5dbb10e6/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"天地一体算力","as":"新华网报道指出，人工智能正从文本交互加速迈向多模态交互与执行智能，对算力规模需求持续攀升。文章提出全链条协同构建天地一体化算力基础设施，将地面数据中心与卫星通信、空间算力节点结合，应对全球自然灾害频发和地缘风险带来的地面算力单点依赖。核心思路是通过星地协同实现算力弹性调度与冗余备份，保障AI时代算力供给的连续性与全域覆盖。","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"kp":["[目标]: 消除远海/极地/沙漠算力盲区"],"b":"全链条协同构建天地一体算力基础设施-新华网\n全链条协同构建天地一体算力基础设施\n全链条协同构建天地一体算力基础设施\n当前，人工智能正从文本交互、交互智能加速迈向多模态交互与执行智能，对算力的规模需求持续攀升。与此同时，全球自然灾害频发、地缘政治日趋复杂，对算力的实时响应能力提出了前所未有的高要求。然而，现有算力设施高度依赖地面基建，在远海、极地、沙漠等区域存在明显覆盖盲区，且抗毁能力不足。一边是需求爆炸式增长，一边是算力覆盖的空白。如何弥合这道鸿沟？\n“构建覆盖太空与地面的天地一体算力基础设施，正是破局的关键。”国家超级计算天津中心党组书记、首席科学家孟祥飞说，通过将算力部署从地面延伸至太空，有望从根本上消除覆盖盲区、提升系统韧性，满足实时响应与规模扩张的双重需求。近日，在2026世界智能产业博览会人工智能与太空数智设施发展交流会上，太空数智基础设施联合攻关体正式组建。该攻关体聚焦我国天地一体算力基础设施，力争通过全链条协同创新，在关键技术领域取得突破。\n新组建的联合攻关体关注星上超级算力载荷产品化、在轨智能处理单元、星地协同调度及太空系统自治运维等关键共性技术，目的是构建起算力协同、任务协同、数据协同的天地一体超智数融合基础设施。\n孟祥飞介绍，将地面成熟的算力设施搬上太空面临多重难关。\n供电是第一道坎。目前全球功率最大的人造卫星，发电功率25千瓦，而未来天基超级数智装置的需求起步就指向100千瓦甚至兆瓦级，相差一个数量级以上。这不仅需要轻量化、高效率的柔性太阳电池阵，还要求能源与热控一体化设计。“换句话说，星上算力载荷必须在极端体积、重量、功耗和辐射环境中运行，与航天平台的能源、热控、结构深度绑定，单点突破根本无法解决问题。”孟祥飞介绍。\n算力面临巨大跨越。目前全球已部署的卫星单星峰值约1P级，而未来天基数智基础设施的需求是单星算力达到100P以上。“整整两个数量级的跃升，绝非简单的性能堆叠，而是要求在高密度集成结构、分布式计算架构等软硬件领域实现从0到1的原创突破。”孟祥飞说。\n星地协同同样是绕不过去的坎。星地链路存在数百毫秒时延和间歇性连接，传统模式下，一个地面站一天只有几十分钟的通信窗口，卫星过境才能上传指令。一旦遇上突发应急计算需求，从地面发起到卫星响应往往耗时数十分钟，最佳处置时机早已悄然流逝。未来太空算力网络要求实现近实时协同，地面动态分配算力，卫星自主调整任务队列。只有突破星上轻量级调度器、星地预测性资源预留等技术，才能彻底扭转“过境才能操控”的被动局面。\n在轨无人值守也是难关。对于卫星的故障，传统做法是地面发现故障后发送指令修复。可链路不通的时候，从故障发生到修好，短则几小时，长则几天，卫星在此期间可能功能降级甚至直接失效。“未来百千瓦级大算力卫星将搭载成百上千个计算核心，故障概率将指数级上升，地面根本来不及管。”孟祥飞说。唯一的出路，是让卫星自己“长”出免疫力——微重启、任务迁移等全面自愈能力，实现零人工干预下的稳定运行。\n面对这些难题，联合攻关体已经圈定了多个关键技术方向，涵盖模块化可扩展算力载荷、星载高性能国产芯片、在轨智能运管、空间计算软件栈、能源热控一体化、空间用柔性太阳电池阵、星地任务协同调度等多个关键领域。其中，国家超级计算天津中心以“天河”系列超级计算机为核心，拥有异构算力统一调度、超大规模并行计算等长期积累的核心技术，将为天基算力网络构建提供重要的地基“操作系统”级能力支撑。与此同时，飞腾、曙光、中电科蓝天、航天518所等单位也将在星载芯片、能源热控、柔性太阳电池阵等各自优势领域协同发力。（记者 陈 曦）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n全链条协同构建天地一体算力基础设施"},{"t":"全新红旗 H9 插混版申报，可选激光雷达","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/676.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"插混动力轿车","kp":["发动机排量[红旗H9插混]: 1994 ml","发动机功率[红旗H9插混]: 145 kW","最高车速[红旗H9插混]: 235 km/h","轴距[红旗H9插混]: 3120 mm","电池[红旗H9插混]: 镍钴锰酸锂三元锂"],"as":"红旗H9插电式混合动力版完成工信部第408批新车申报。车身长5230mm、轴距3120mm，整备质量2320kg，可选装激光雷达，表明该车型在保留旗舰大型轿车定位的同时向高阶智能驾驶能力升级。插混动力路线兼顾续航与燃油经济性，激光雷达选配则暗示红旗正在旗舰车型上推进智驾感知硬件预埋。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.5},"b":"6 月 10 日消息，工信部发布了第 408 批《道路机动车辆生产企业及产品公告》新产品公示，\n红旗 H9 插电式混合动力轿车\n长 5230 mm、宽 1955 mm、高 1515 mm，轴距达到 3120 mm\n，整备质量 2320 kg，总质量 2770 kg，额定载客 5 人，最高车速 235 km/h，配备防抱死制动系统。动力方面，发动机型号为 CA4GC20TDH-41，排量 1994 ml，功率 145 kW，发动机最大净功率 140 kW，储能装置为镍钴锰酸锂三元蓄电池，由中汽新能电池科技有限公司生产单体，中国第一汽车集团有限公司生产总成。\nIT之家注意到，该车拥有多项选装配置：红色卡钳、多款轮毂造型、侧后角窗、侧旗标、前 / 后激光摄像头、前排渐变玻璃、前 / 后部无激光雷达造型，全系标配全景天窗，还配备汽车事件数据记录系统 (EDR)，可选装 ETC 车载装置。ABS 系统由博世汽车部件（苏州）有限公司生产，型号为 IPB 2.0 。\n今年 4 月，一汽红旗放出了全新一代红旗 H9 的官方预告。该车外观设计灵感取自中式宫殿的礼序章法，融自然山水的流转气韵。新车主打中式豪华美学，采用高山飞瀑格栅搭配贯穿式 U 型灯组设计，辅以四平八稳尾灯 + 镭射工艺。\n全新一代红旗 H9 将搭载华为乾崑智驾 ADS 5\n智舱 HarmonySpace + 红旗自研智能底盘。新车配双光路图像级 896 线激光雷达 + 40 颗高感知传感器，宣称 120km/h 时速可稳定识别 120 米外高度 14cm 微小障碍物。\n全新一代红旗 H9 汽车官图发布：中式宫殿礼序章法外观、首搭华为乾崑智驾 ADS 5"},{"t":"人形机器人拥有“身份证” 行业探索全生命周期管理","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/779774b0e0d04ae89cc9ed4cb8cdfbf6/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"新华网科技","as":"人形机器人行业开始探索全生命周期管理体系，工信部等部门推动为机器人建立可识别的'身份证'，实现从出厂、部署、运维到报废的全链条追溯。此举旨在解决人形机器人规模化应用后身份标识、安全监管、责任认定等管理难题，为后续标准化准入、安全认证及保险理赔奠定基础。标志着人形机器人正从实验室走向规模化商用阶段。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"机器人身份管理","kp":["身份编码[人形机器人]: 29位字符"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"b":"人形机器人拥有“身份证” 行业探索全生命周期管理-新华网\n人形机器人拥有“身份证” 行业探索全生命周期管理\n人形机器人拥有“身份证” 行业探索全生命周期管理\n人形机器人迎来了自己的“身份证”，从出厂到报废，可实现全链条追溯。\n近日，由工业和信息化部人形机器人与具身智能标准化技术委员会牵头搭建的全国首个人形机器人全生命周期管理服务平台发布，配套的《人形机器人 全生命周期管理规范》标准也同步出台。\n标准的一大亮点是提出每台人形机器人都将拥有29位字符的身份编码。标委会副主任委员、中国电子学会副秘书长梁靓说，这标志着我国人形机器人产业正式迈入“源头可溯、全程可控、风险可防、责任可究”的规范化发展新阶段。\n为何要制定相关标准、建立服务平台？\n在产线上分拣物料、搬运料箱、安装零件；在电影院里全自主售卖爆米花；在商场里提供一对一专属导购服务……眼下，人形机器人正在融入制造、服务等各类场景。\n“要充分认识产业发展现状与问题，明确全生命周期管理的必要性与紧迫性。”标委会主任委员谢少锋认为，人形机器人产业正处在“由小到大”的爆发期，若质量管理跟不上，产业健康发展将面临风险。\n谢少锋以责任界定为例说明，人形机器人一旦出现安全事故，到底是使用者操作不当，还是产品本身缺陷，如果没有实时、可信的数据链，责任很难分清。\n行业发展，标准先行。针对安全风险凸显、权责划分模糊、企业编码规则缺乏统一标准等问题，此次发布的标准明确人形机器人整机必须拥有唯一、不可更改、贯穿全生命周期的身份编码。\n“在此基础上，标准还对产品生产、流通、维护、回收等全生命周期管理提出明确要求。”中国电子技术标准化研究院副院长于秀明介绍，制造商必须建立全过程质量管控体系。流通阶段，所有在国内销售、使用的人形机器人，必须在产品信息系统上备案。更换关键零部件时，服务商必须获得管理方授权，并重绑编码、重新测试。回收前应彻底清除存储数据、解除所有绑定等。\n多地多企正在推进标准落地。\n北京、武汉、成都、宁波等人工智能20城工作机制成员及30余家人形机器人头部企业签约合作，强化全生命周期管理机制推广应用。\n宇树科技所有机器的“一机一码”已实现全面接入服务平台。公司副总经理王启舟认为，从全生命周期管理入手，将是推动产品从演示样品走向系统稳定、高效、可负载应用的重要环节。\n截至目前，平台已覆盖全国100余家人形机器人企业，完成200余个产品型号、2.8万余台机器人的全生命周期赋码。\n“纸面标准”变成“行业准则”，大规模落地实施是关键。\n工业和信息化部科技司一级巡视员范斌表示，下一步将推动场景应用与安全管理协同，强化整机“身份证”在实际场景中的管理应用；推动标准体系与平台建设协同，加快制定全生命周期管理所需的细分标准；加强央地联动、部门协同，构建行业治理体系，共同提升系统化、精细化治理水平。（记者 周圆）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n人形机器人拥有“身份证” 行业探索全生命周期管理"},{"t":"云南能投、中广核：获云南丽江418MW新能源项目指标","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/10/50024197.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"云南省丽江市2025年第二批新能源项目社会投资人优选结果公示，总规模418MW，含3个风电项目（148MW）和3个光伏项目（270MW）。云南能源集团获得280MW指标，中广核获得其余指标。该批次项目标志着西南地区风光资源开发持续推进，地方政府通过公开优选引入央企与地方能源集团协同开发的新模式。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"新能源项目指标","kp":["规模[丽江新能源]: 418MW(风148+光270)"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"b":"近日，云南省丽江市2025年第二批新能源项目社会投资人公开优选中标结果公示，项目规模合计418MW，其中，风电项目3个，规模合计148MW；光伏项目3个，规模合计270MW。\n从优选结果来看，云南能源集团获得280MW的项目指标，中广核获得138MW的项目指标。具体如下："},{"t":"事关组件回收！商务部召开“新三样”座谈会","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/10/50024198.html","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"政策监管","tp":"三样固废回收","as":"商务部6月5日召开“新三样”固废回收利用工作座谈会，副部长盛秋平出席。会议聚焦光伏组件、动力电池、新能源汽车等“新三样”产品的退役回收体系建设，研究建立“1+N”工作体系，部署推进固废回收利用重点工作。此举释放出中国强化新能源产业链闭环管理的政策信号，对组件回收产业化具有积极推动作用。","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.5},"b":"6月5日，商务部召开“新三样”固废回收利用工作座谈会，深入学习贯彻习近平总书记重要指示批示精神，进一步了解“新三样”固废回收利用情况，分析存在问题，听取意见建议，研究建立“1+N”工作体系，部署推进重点工作。商务部副部长盛秋平出席并讲话，中国工程院杜祥琬、陈勇、邢锋3位院士应邀出席会议，相关部门、行业协会、龙头企业代表参加会议。\n会议指出，当前我国新能源汽车动力电池正在进入规模化退役阶段，光伏组件和风机设备也将相继迎来退役高峰期。“新三样”固废回收利用工作事关绿色发展大局、能源资源安全和人民群众福祉，任务艰巨、责任重大、使命光荣。\n会议强调，要把思想和行动统一到党中央、国务院决策部署上来，多措并举，以实际行动抓好“新三样”固废回收利用体系建设。坚持系统推进、形成合力，加快完善顶层制度设计，推动出台政策文件，形成政策共商、资源共享、优势互补、整体推进的工作格局。坚持精准指导、分类施策，针对动力电池、光伏组件、风机设备产业发展阶段和回收利用特点，采取差异化、精准化措施，有效解决回收利用拆解问题。坚持科技引领、技术赋能，积极推进“新三样”固废回收利用相关技术基础研发，促进人工智能在回收利用环节的融合与运用。坚持试点探索、鼓励先行，继续开展再生资源回收体系建设试点工作，鼓励产业集聚地区和龙头企业先行先试，提升回收效率，增强分拣能力，促进回收行业高质量发展。"},{"t":"两部门启动实景实训行动 人形机器人产业规模化应用加速落地","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/6db66d9c8c034c3c85434a17e3b348a1/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","tp":"人形机器人应用","kp":["落地规模[人形机器人2026]: 万台级","场景目标[实景实训]: 百个以上高价值场景"],"as":"工业和信息化部、国务院国资委联合印发文件，启动人形机器人实景实训行动，旨在加速人形机器人产业从技术验证迈向规模化应用。两部门推动人形机器人在真实工业、服务场景中开展实训验证，打通实验室到产业化落地的“最后一公里”。这是国家级政策层面推动人形机器人商业化的实质性举措，有望加速产业链成熟与成本下降。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.5,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":7.5},"cl":"db5617702f","cln":"工信部+国资委|2026人形机器人实景实训行动|印发通知启动|2026-06-11","cp":1,"b":"两部门启动实景实训行动 人形机器人产业规模化应用加速落地-新华网\n两部门启动实景实训行动 人形机器人产业规模化应用加速落地\n两部门启动实景实训行动 人形机器人产业规模化应用加速落地\n记者6月9日获悉，近日工业和信息化部、国务院国资委联合印发通知，正式启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动。通知明确，到2026年底，人形机器人等重点产品在一批代表性场景中率先完成应用验证和常态部署，开启“作业模式”；凝练形成百个以上高价值应用场景，进一步丰富具身智能应用谱系，带动形成万台级规模落地能力。\n工业和信息化部科技司相关负责人表示，当前，我国人形机器人与具身智能正处于从实验室走向真实场景、从演示验证转向常态化作业的关键阶段，但模型算法、本体性能、场景适配、真机数据积累等仍存在短板。实景实训可推动场景、数据、算力与技术成果高效复用，大幅降低企业试错成本，实现产品在真实环境中的快速迭代优化，是推动人形机器人从“能用”向“好用”跨越的重要手段。\n通知部署打造实景实训空间、组建创新应用联合体、攻关实用化作业技能、加强实景应用验证与常态部署、强化关键要素保障、凝练成熟经验等6项重点任务。其中提出，围绕工业、服务、特种领域，选取一批真实场景单元。\n此外，相关举措还包括，鼓励探索“人形机器人即服务”模式，通过按效用付费、经营性租赁等商业创新手段降低用户投入门槛，加速市场化推广。统筹运用股权、债权、保险等手段，为企业提供全链条金融服务等。\n北京交通大学中国高端制造业研究中心执行主任朱明皓表示，实景实训将为人形机器人、具身智能整机和设备制造企业提供场景验证和新技术应用场所，更好地支持人形机器人感知决策、操作执行和交互协作，提高装备设备可靠性，为整机设备和组件企业的迭代升级提供支撑。\n记者注意到，不少人形机器人企业已经展开实景实训相关探索。例如，近期智元机器人在龙旗科技南昌平板制造工厂完成8小时的真实产线作业直播。智元合伙人、高级副总裁姚卯青透露，基于成熟落地模型，2026年第三季度智元精灵G2人形机器人的部署规模将扩大至100台，并加速向汽车制造、半导体、能源等更广泛的工业场景复制。\n优必选相关负责人告诉记者，优必选Walker系列人形机器人已进入多家头部制造企业进行真实场景的“实训”与作业，重点验证其在复杂工业环境中的稳定性、协同能力及任务执行效率。\n数据显示，2025年，国内整机企业数量超140家，发布人形机器人产品超330款，出货量约1.7万台。机构分析认为，当前行业关注点由实验室性能转向真实生产场景下的长期稳定作业能力。海通国际证券研报指出，制约人形机器人商业化扩张的核心已由硬件机械性能转向环境理解、自主决策与泛化能力，行业正从拼硬件、拼规模、拼成本转向拼智能、拼场景。\n中国信通院人工智能研究所所长魏凯表示，此次政策的落实将全方位重塑人形机器人与具身智能产业发展生态。从短期效果看，通过百个标杆场景、万台级落地任务，快速拉动国内人形机器人与具身智能订单需求，牵引上游伺服电机、减速器、传感器等关键零部件国产化提速，加速国产软硬件产品实景验证迭代；从中期效果看，海量实景数据持续完善国内具身智能大模型训练底座，依托联合体模式培育一批产业链龙头与专精特新企业，形成可复制的商业化落地范式；从长远影响看，专项通过实景落地助力我国人形机器人产业摆脱“不好用、不敢用”的困局，推动产业加速规模化应用落地。\n朱明皓认为，下一步，下游应用企业需加快应用场景开放，与产业链供应链上中下游企业形成利益共享、风险共担的新机制。关键部件企业应主动参与实景实训建设，带动部件的性能提升和适配性。（记者 郭倩）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n两部门启动实景实训行动 人形机器人产业规模化应用加速落地"},{"t":"世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260610_1894230.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光热","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"产业进展","tp":"塔式光热电站","kp":["装机容量[塔式光热]: 100 MW","建设区位[光热电站]: 北纬45°以上高寒地区","项目定位[东北]: 首个光热电站"],"as":"国家首批“沙戈荒”大基地项目——吉西基地鲁固直流140万千瓦外送项目的重要组成部分，通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目实现双节点告捷。该项目采用塔式光热发电技术，配置熔盐储热系统，具备长时储能与电网友好特性，可作为大基地风光储一体化运行的关键调节电源。项目进展标志着中国光热发电技术在沙漠戈壁荒漠地区的工程化能力持续提升。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"b":"世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷\n近日，国家首批“沙戈荒”大基地项目——吉西基地鲁固直流140万千瓦外送项目的重要组成部分，电投绿能通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目连续完成两大关键节点：汽轮机扣缸和厂用电系统反送电一次成功。作为在北纬45°以上高寒地区建设塔式光热电站的世界级开创性工程，该项目为我国乃至全球光热发电技术向更高纬度、更寒冷地区拓展积累了宝贵的工程经验。同时，该项目也是在东北区域的首个光热电站。两大节点的告捷，标志着项目主体安装工程完工、电力系统全线贯通，为后续整套启动和并网发电奠定了坚实基础。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核\n宁夏迈入千万千瓦级储能大省行列"},{"t":"世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260610_1894230.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光热","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"产业进展","tp":"塔式光热电站","kp":["装机容量[塔式光热]: 100 MW","建设区位[光热电站]: 北纬45°以上高寒地区","项目定位[东北]: 首个光热电站"],"dp":1,"as":"国家首批“沙戈荒”大基地项目——吉西基地鲁固直流140万千瓦外送项目的重要组成部分，通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目实现双节点告捷。该项目采用塔式光热发电技术，配置熔盐储热系统，具备长时储能与电网友好特性，可作为大基地风光储一体化运行的关键调节电源。项目进展标志着中国光热发电技术在沙漠戈壁荒漠地区的工程化能力持续提升。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":7.0,"r":2.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"b":"世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n世界级示范: 通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目双节点告捷\n近日，国家首批“沙戈荒”大基地项目——吉西基地鲁固直流140万千瓦外送项目的重要组成部分，电投绿能通榆吉电100兆瓦光热项目连续完成两大关键节点：汽轮机扣缸和厂用电系统反送电一次成功。作为在北纬45°以上高寒地区建设塔式光热电站的世界级开创性工程，该项目为我国乃至全球光热发电技术向更高纬度、更寒冷地区拓展积累了宝贵的工程经验。同时，该项目也是在东北区域的首个光热电站。两大节点的告捷，标志着项目主体安装工程完工、电力系统全线贯通，为后续整套启动和并网发电奠定了坚实基础。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核\n宁夏迈入千万千瓦级储能大省行列"},{"t":"“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260610_1894351.html","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/勘探技术","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"技术突破","tp":"深海电磁测量","kp":["航程[深海科考16航次]: 近13000公里","航次历时[科考]: 52天","样品[中央裂谷带]: 约90kg玄武岩"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"自然资源部中国地质调查局广州海洋地质调查局「海洋地质六号」科考船取得深海电磁测量技术新突破。深海电磁探测是海底天然气水合物（可燃冰）及深海矿产资源勘查的关键技术手段，通过人工源电磁方法探测海底地电结构，可识别含油气及水合物储层。此次突破提升了我国在深海资源勘探领域的自主技术能力，对深海能源开发具有重要战略意义。","b":"“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破\n记者从自然资源部中国地质调查局广州海洋地质调查局获悉，该局“海洋地质六号”科考船近日圆满完成深海地质调查第16航次科考任务返回广州，并正式对外发布取得的多项成果。\n本次科考自今年4月3日启航，历时52天，航程近13000公里，在深海地质环境调查、海洋探测关键技术装备研发应用等方面取得多项成果。\n本航次期间获得的多金属结核样品。新华社发\n在深海地质环境调查方面，本航次首席科学家、广州海洋地质调查局正高级工程师韦振权介绍，本航次在深海盆区发现高覆盖率高丰度多金属结核。科考人员还获取了包括多金属结核、富钴结壳、海底岩石、底层海水、沉积物和孔隙水等一手样品和数据。尤其是在中央裂谷带区域获得了约90千克的玄武岩样品，为深化区域地幔源区性质及深部过程研究提供关键样品支撑。\n在技术装备研发应用方面，本航次技术负责人、广州海洋地质调查局正高级工程师罗贤虎介绍，本航次完成了广州海洋地质调查局牵头自主研发的全球首套万米级全海深电磁采集站及海上作业系统海试验收，在西太平洋7737米深渊裂谷带成功获取高质量数据，各项性能全面达标。这标志着我国深海电磁测量技术取得重要突破，将有力支撑地球深渊科学研究和国际大洋科学钻探选址工作。\n“海洋地质六号”科考船是我国自主设计的现代化综合地质地球物理调查船，自2009年入列以来，已累计完成80多个航次任务，航迹遍布南海、西太平洋及南极半岛海域，是我国深海地质调查和大洋科学考察的重要力量。按计划，“海洋地质六号”船将继续开展科考共享航次等任务。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立\n香港理工大学·月山能源新一代矿业联合实验室揭牌"},{"t":"“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260610_1894351.html","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/勘探技术","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"技术突破","tp":"深海电磁测量","kp":["航程[深海科考16航次]: 近13000公里","航次历时[科考]: 52天","样品[中央裂谷带]: 约90kg玄武岩"],"dp":1,"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"自然资源部中国地质调查局广州海洋地质调查局「海洋地质六号」科考船取得深海电磁测量技术新突破。深海电磁探测是海底天然气水合物（可燃冰）及深海矿产资源勘查的关键技术手段，通过人工源电磁方法探测海底地电结构，可识别含油气及水合物储层。此次突破提升了我国在深海资源勘探领域的自主技术能力，对深海能源开发具有重要战略意义。","b":"“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n“海洋地质六号”最新成果：我国深海电磁测量技术迎新突破\n记者从自然资源部中国地质调查局广州海洋地质调查局获悉，该局“海洋地质六号”科考船近日圆满完成深海地质调查第16航次科考任务返回广州，并正式对外发布取得的多项成果。\n本次科考自今年4月3日启航，历时52天，航程近13000公里，在深海地质环境调查、海洋探测关键技术装备研发应用等方面取得多项成果。\n本航次期间获得的多金属结核样品。新华社发\n在深海地质环境调查方面，本航次首席科学家、广州海洋地质调查局正高级工程师韦振权介绍，本航次在深海盆区发现高覆盖率高丰度多金属结核。科考人员还获取了包括多金属结核、富钴结壳、海底岩石、底层海水、沉积物和孔隙水等一手样品和数据。尤其是在中央裂谷带区域获得了约90千克的玄武岩样品，为深化区域地幔源区性质及深部过程研究提供关键样品支撑。\n在技术装备研发应用方面，本航次技术负责人、广州海洋地质调查局正高级工程师罗贤虎介绍，本航次完成了广州海洋地质调查局牵头自主研发的全球首套万米级全海深电磁采集站及海上作业系统海试验收，在西太平洋7737米深渊裂谷带成功获取高质量数据，各项性能全面达标。这标志着我国深海电磁测量技术取得重要突破，将有力支撑地球深渊科学研究和国际大洋科学钻探选址工作。\n“海洋地质六号”科考船是我国自主设计的现代化综合地质地球物理调查船，自2009年入列以来，已累计完成80多个航次任务，航迹遍布南海、西太平洋及南极半岛海域，是我国深海地质调查和大洋科学考察的重要力量。按计划，“海洋地质六号”船将继续开展科考共享航次等任务。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立\n香港理工大学·月山能源新一代矿业联合实验室揭牌"},{"t":"“隐藏的英雄”肽保护农作物免受突如其来的寒冷","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01754-8","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"A protein signal remains silent under normal conditions but is activated under cold stress to protect developing pollen. This ‘on-demand’ resilience mechanism could enable the development of ‘climate smart’ crops that maintain high yields in good years and food security under climate stress. A peptide signal ensures that, in cold conditions, developing pollen receives nutrients at the right time.","tp":"寒胁迫多肽","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"科学家发现了一种在正常条件下保持沉默、仅在冷胁迫下被激活的肽信号分子，能够保护发育中的花粉免受突发低温损伤。这种按需启动的韧性机制确保花粉在寒冷条件下仍能适时获得营养。该发现为培育在气候压力下仍能维持高产和粮食安全的气候智能型作物提供了重要的基因工程靶点。"},{"t":"vivo X Fold6 折叠屏手机预热，支持联动电脑办公套件部署“龙虾”小 V Claw PC 版","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/679.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","b":"vivo X Fold6 折叠屏真机已曝光\n，新机定档 6 月发布，将带来全新的 OriginOS 6 Fold 系统，\n预计还会搭载天玑 9500 处理器\nvivo 通信科技有限公司产品经理韩伯啸今日发布视频，再度预热这款新机。\n据韩伯啸透露，vivo X Fold6 将主打“AI 轻办公神器”这一卖点。除了一屏多用这一卖点外，该机还支持联动电脑 vivo 办公套件部署“龙虾”—— 小 V Claw PC 版，\n功能全面适配 Windows 与 Mac 设备\nIT之家注意到，小 V Claw PC 版内置了 30+ 个开源 Skills，还支持手动配置更多 Skills。\n同时，vivo X Fold6 还将带来全新升级的 AI 会议助手\n一屏四用：vivo X Fold6 折叠屏新机全新原子工作台曝光\nvivo X Fold6 折叠屏真机曝光，已定档本月发布\nvivo X Fold6 折叠屏手机官宣 6 月见，预计搭载天玑 9500","tp":"手机AI助手","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":8.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":"vivo X Fold6折叠屏手机预热信息显示，该机主打AI轻办公定位，搭载天玑9500处理器和全新OriginOS 6 Fold系统。核心亮点是支持联动电脑部署小V Claw PC版，内置30+开源Skills，兼容Windows与Mac设备。此外还升级了AI会议助手，支持一屏四用多任务处理，定位为移动办公生产力工具。"},{"t":"蒂森克虏伯Uhde将支持巴西两个绿氨项目","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://hydrogentechworld.com/thyssenkrupp-uhde-to-support-two-green-ammonia-projects-in-brazil","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Hydrogen Tech World","tg":"产业进展","tp":"巴西绿氨项目","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"蒂森克虏伯 Uhde 公司将支持巴西两个绿色氨项目。绿色氨通过绿氢（可再生能源电解水制氢）与氮气合成，是零碳化肥生产和清洁能源载体的重要方向。巴西拥有丰富的水电、风电和太阳能资源，具备大规模低成本绿氢生产潜力。该项目旨在利用巴西可再生资源优势，建设规模化绿色氨生产设施，推动农业脱碳并开拓绿氨出口市场。","ot":"thyssenkrupp Uhde to support two green ammonia projects in Brazil","b":"Green ammonia production: harnessing green hydrogen"},{"t":"耶鲁大学发现推翻了长期以来的“进化死胡同”理论","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/yale-discovery-overturns-long-held-evolutionary-dead-end-theory/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"The discovery of\nTyphlichthys styx\nshows that cave-adapted\ncan continue evolving and splitting into new species, with underground aquifers playing a crucial role in that process.\nResearchers at\nhave identified a previously unknown species of eyeless cavefish, a finding that challenges the long-standing view that caves and other underground habitats are evolutionary dead ends.\nThe study found that three species of Southern cavefish, including the newly described\nTyphlichthys styx\n, descended from a common ancestor that had already adapted to life underground. The fish spread through aquifers within soluble rock formations across the southeastern United States.\nThe findings provide some of the strongest evidence yet that speciation, the process by which one species splits into two or more distinct species, can occur in organisms restricted to subterranean environments.\n“We show that, in terms of evolution, what’s happening underground matters,” said Chase Brownstein, a graduate student in ecology and evolutionary biology in Yale’s Graduate School of Arts and Sciences, and the study’s lead author. “In this case, our analysis found that three species diverged from each other after their ancestor had invaded caves. It also found that underground geology was key to facilitating this speciation.”\nThe results were published in the journal\nIntegrative Organismal Biology\n. The study’s senior author is Thomas Near, a professor of ecology and evolutionary biology in Yale’s Faculty of Arts and Sciences (FAS).\nResearchers noted that the mechanisms driving speciation in underground ecosystems remain poorly understood.\nIn his landmark 1859 book, On the Origin of Species, Charles Darwin referred to cave-dwelling organisms as “wrecks of ancient life,” describing them as survivors of older lineages that persisted in isolated habitats while related species disappeared. Over time, this idea contributed to the widely accepted hypothesis that underground ecosystems are “evolutionary dead ends” because species adapted to these environments appear to stop generating new species.\nThe new research focused on three Southern cavefish species that diverged after their ancestors moved into subterranean habitats: the previously recognized\nTyphlichthys subterraneus\nTyphlichthys eigenmanni\n, along with the newly identified\nTyphlichthys styx\nTo investigate their evolutionary history, the team analyzed genetic data and constructed a time-calibrated evolutionary tree for Southern cavefish populations found in cave systems stretching from the Appalachians to the Ozarks.\nThe analysis uncovered a geographically distinct third lineage, represented by populations in Tennessee, Alabama, and Georgia, in addition to the two known species. It also showed that the three lineages shared a common ancestor about 8 million years ago.\nResearchers also used CT scans to compare specimens from the different lineages. The scans revealed skeletal differences that distinguished the newly identified lineage from the other two species. Although all Southern cavefish lost their eyes after adapting to permanent darkness, the new species retains remnants of interorbital bones that once formed part of the eye socket. Those bones are absent in the other two species.\n“The combination of genetic and anatomical data makes it clear that this is a distinct species,” Brownstein said.\nAccording to the researchers, the distribution of Southern cavefish populations does not align with the region’s surface rivers and streams, making it difficult to determine how the species spread across their range.\nTo solve that mystery, the team examined underground geological features. They found that major evolutionary splits among populations and species corresponded closely with the boundaries of regional aquifers, underground formations that store groundwater. These aquifers created networks of openings and channels within karst landscapes, terrain formed when water dissolves limestone and other soluble rocks, allowing cavefish to disperse over large distances.\n“The aquifers act as underground rivers of dispersal, which allowed the cavefishes to speciate within the cave systems,” Brownstein said.\nResearchers warned that many populations of\nTyphlichthys styx\nand other Southern cavefish species face threats from human activities that deplete or contaminate groundwater. These include dam construction, excessive water use, and pollution from industrial and agricultural waste.\nNear said the study highlights the kind of\ncutting-edge biodiversity research\ntaking place at Yale. He also serves as the Bingham Oceanographic Curator of Ichthyology at the Yale Peabody Museum.\n“Species discovery is an important to addressing the biodiversity crisis that is rapidly reducing the variety of life on our planet,” he said. “For one thing, you can’t protect a species if you don’t know that it exists. Our work on cavefish joins a wide range of research happening on campus to better understanding our biodiversity and develop ways to protect it.”\nReference: “Aquifer-Mediated Speciation in Cave-Adapted Fishes” by C D Brownstein, G J Watkins-Colwell, M Policarpo, R C Harrington, E A Hoffman, D Casane and T J Near, 18 May 2026,\nIntegrative Organismal Biology\nDOI: 10.1093/iob/obag021\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nBiodiversity\nYale University\nRethinking the Rules of Extinction and Survival: Scientists May Have Cracked the “Aging Process” in Species\nDarwin’s Unanswered Question: Unraveling the Secrets of Species Abundance\nScientists Discover 7 “Cryptic” New Species of Walking Leaves\nNew Species of Bizarre, Extinct Lizard – So Strange It Was Misidentified as a Hummingbird-Sized Dinosaur\nNew Turtle Discovered From the Late Cretaceous of Madagascar\nNew Bacterial Culture Methods Could Result in the Discovery of Diverse New Species of Microbes\nRemarkable New Species of Snake Found Hidden in a Biodiversity Collection – Occupies Its Own Branch on Snake Tree of Life\nNew Centipede Discovered on Top of Food Chain in Hellish Ecosystem of a Sulfur-Soaked Romanian Cave\nScientists Say Gentoo Penguins Are Four Species, Not One"},{"t":"世界首创：在人体中试验使细胞再次年轻的疗法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01836-7","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"A participant in a landmark clinical trial has been given a cellular-reprogramming treatment that aims to rejuvenate damaged cells in the eye. A participant in a landmark clinical trial has been given a cellular-reprogramming treatment that aims to rejuvenate damaged cells in the eye.","tp":"细胞重编程","sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":5.5,"r":8.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"一项具有里程碑意义的临床试验首次在人体中测试细胞重编程疗法，旨在逆转细胞衰老。首位受试者接受了针对眼部受损细胞的 rejuvenation 治疗，该疗法利用细胞重编程技术使老化或受损细胞恢复年轻状态。这是将细胞返老还童概念从实验室推向临床验证的关键一步，但安全性和长期效果仍需后续数据确认。"},{"t":"野火风险指标对公共安全停电成本节约的影响","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008172?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"野火停电成本","dp":1,"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","ot":"Wildfire risk metric impact on public safety power shutoff cost savings"},{"t":"全基因组复制塑造了脊椎动物大脑中的细胞类型进化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10629-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The complex brains of vertebrates have more cell types than those of their closest relatives. Whole-genome duplications (WGDs) occurred during early vertebrate evolution1, but it is unclear whether the duplicated genes (ohnologues) facilitated cell-type evolution. Here using brain single-cell transcriptomes from five chordates—human2, mouse3, lizard4, lamprey5 and amphioxus—we report that many cell-type families with conserved core transcription factors in vertebrates do not show one-to-one homology with amphioxus. Moreover, ohnologues, particularly those from the first WGD, were more important than small-scale duplication paralogues for vertebrate cell-type evolution. To explore whether ohnologues are mechanistically important for this process, we predicted ancestral cell-type states and compared them to amphioxus and experimentally investigated macroglia. The findings indicate that ohnologues had a role in early vertebrate cell-type diversification. Moreover, by examining paralogue expression across cell types and species, we show that expression changes were mainly driven by dosage selection and subfunctionalization. We also link ohnologues to cellular diversity at different anatomical and cell-type scales. Our findings demonstrate the importance of WGDs for the evolution of early vertebrate brain complexity and highlight that the resultant ohnologues continued to capacitate cell-type evolution long after they were formed."},{"t":"OpenAI 对冲 IPO 押注背后的原因是什么","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/the-briefing/behind-openais-hedged-ipo-bet","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"资本运作","b":"What’s Behind OpenAI’s Hedged IPO Bet — The Information"},{"t":"德国新再调度规则与负电价对可再生资产管理的影响——pv magazine全球版","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/what-new-redispatching-rules-and-negative-prices-mean-for-german-renewable-asset-management/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"pv magazine","tg":"行业观察","tp":"可再生能源电价","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.5},"as":"德国可再生能源市场正从稳定的上网电价补贴转向更波动的市场化体系。新的再调度（redispatching）规则和负电价机制对可再生资产管理产生深远影响。负电价频发意味着供大于求时段发电方需付费卖电，迫使资产运营商优化发电预测和交易策略。再调度规则则重新分配了电网拥堵成本的承担方式，要求运营商更灵活地参与电网调度。这一转型将重塑德国风电和光伏资产的经济模型。","ot":"What new redispatching rules and negative prices mean for German renewable asset management - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nGermany’s renewable power market is shifting from stable feed-in support to a more volatile system with frequent negative prices, 15-minute trading, and growing grid congestion. For asset and fund managers, performance now depends on time-specific production, curtailment, pricing, and redispatch effects, making granular operational and settlement data essential beyond monthly revenue reporting.\nEmma Alfonsi, CEO, Streem Energy\nMarkets & Policy\nUtility-scale\nAerial image of the Bad Langensalza airfield in Germany | Image: Carsten Steger, Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 4.0\nGermany’s renewable electricity market is entering a more demanding phase. For more than two decades, the Renewable Energy Act (EEG) helped create one of the world’s most mature renewable power markets, giving investors and operators a high degree of revenue visibility through feed-in tariffs and later market premium schemes. That framework is now being reshaped by a power system with more renewable output, more decentralized generation, and more frequent grid constraints.\nFor commercial asset managers and fund managers, monthly production and revenue totals now tell only part of the story. Teams increasingly need to understand when an asset produced, whether it was curtailed, which mechanism applied, what the asset would otherwise have generated, which market price was relevant, who is responsible for compensation, and how the financial impact should be reported.\nIn Germany, new redispatching provisions and negative price rules under the EEG, 15-minute market intervals, and evolving flexibility frameworks are changing the practical work of managing renewable portfolios in Germany.\nGermany’s renewable market was historically built around revenue protection. During the build-out phase, that made sense: investment certainty was needed to scale wind and solar capacity. Today, high renewable output can coincide with low demand, limited grid flexibility, and regional congestion. The result is more frequent negative prices, more curtailment, and more pressure on commercial teams to explain revenue deviations.\nIn 2025, Germany recorded 573 hours of negative day-ahead wholesale electricity prices, up from 457 hours in 2024. In fact, as recently as last week, Germany saw day-ahead contracts crash to -€49.56 per MWh. For asset managers, this is no longer a theoretical market-design issue. A portfolio can look healthy at monthly level while still containing repeated time windows of revenue loss, curtailed production, or missed flexibility value.\nThat makes timing commercially material. The question is shifting from “how much did the asset produce this month?” to “when did it produce, under which price signal, and under which remuneration rule?”\nThe so-called solar peak law (Solarspitzengesetz) reinforces this direction. For affected new PV assets, EEG remuneration is zero during each quarter-hour of negative prices, and the missed intervals are later credited by extending the support period. The broader signal is clear: assets are being pushed closer to market conditions rather than shielded from them.\nThis matters for portfolio economics. A 15-minute period of production can carry a different commercial meaning from the next 15-minute period. For commercial asset managers, that increases the importance of short-term forecasting, negative price exposure monitoring, contract logic, and a clear view of how support schemes apply across their assets.\nFor fund managers, the reporting challenge also changes. It is no longer sufficient to know that revenue underperformed budget. Investors increasingly need to know whether the variance came from negative prices, curtailed production, delayed compensation, contract rules, or a combination of several drivers.\nThis time-based complexity is reinforced by European power market design. Since October 2025, 15-minute market time units have been introduced across Single Day-Ahead and Intraday Coupling in all European bidding zones.\nThe rationale is straightforward: wind, solar, storage, demand, and grid constraints do not move in neat one-hour blocks. Quarter-hourly markets better reflect the real shape of generation and consumption, especially around solar peaks, evening ramps, and short-term forecast deviations. The European Commission has described the move as a way to make electricity trading more dynamic and to support a system with more renewable generation.\nFor asset management teams, the commercial implication is sharper exposure. Forecasting errors can translate into revenue impacts more quickly. Price signals can change within the hour. Flexible assets become more valuable, but only if the surrounding operational and reporting processes are mature enough to capture that value.\nGrid congestion is the other side of Germany’s new market reality. Redispatch 2.0, a comprehensive, legally mandated framework designed to protect Germany’s power grids from overload by rebalancing electricity production and consumption, brought renewable assets more deeply into congestion management, making curtailment a routine feature of portfolio operations rather than an occasional exception.\nA proposed measure, called Redispatch-Vorbehalt, would take this one step further by making curtailment risk a factor in new investment decisions. In grid-constrained areas, new assets could potentially lose curtailment compensation for a defined period. Whether or not the proposal is revised, the direction of travel is clear: grid congestion is becoming a bankability and portfolio-risk question, not only an operational one.\nRecent changes to Section 14a of the German Energy Industry Act (EnWG), which regulates the grid-oriented control of large power consumers (over 4.2 kW) in private households, add another layer of complexity to redispatch compensation. Since December 2025, reimbursement linked to balancing can be paid to the plant operator as part of redispatch compensation, even when another party carries out the balancing.\nThe key implication is that more of the settlement story now lands with the asset owner or operator. They need to understand whether a payment relates to lost production, balancing effort, market effects, or another settlement component. Contracts, data flows, and internal reporting need to reflect that reality.\nSeveral practical questions remain difficult. Which data source should be used to establish lost production? How should grid operator data, direct marketer reports, meter data, weather data, contract logic, and market prices be reconciled? How should the financial impact of negative price periods be treated? And how can all of these moving parts be translated into a clear explanation for an investment committee or portfolio owner?\nThe direction of travel is clear. Germany’s renewable market is becoming more granular, more exposed, and more operationally complex.\nFor commercial asset managers, this raises the bar for daily portfolio management. Teams need to track price exposure, redispatch events, curtailment, compensation, contract logic, and settlement flows continuously rather than reconstructing them after month-end. For fund managers, the expectation is shifting toward clearer explanations of performance variance and portfolio risk.\nMonthly PDFs and spreadsheet reconciliations work best when revenue models are simple and relatively protected. They start to creak when exposure is time-specific, compensation is event-based, and financial outcomes depend on actors and activities spanning 800+ DSOs.\nGermany’s power market has moved beyond a passive feed-in model. In this environment, commercial transparency is becoming operating infrastructure. The asset managers and owners best positioned for the next phase will be those who can connect operational events with financial outcomes quickly, independently, and at portfolio scale.\nEmma Alfonsi is the CEO and co-founder of Streem Energy, a Paris-based SaaS company building data and analytics tools for renewable energy asset managers and power market participants. She brings extensive experience in electricity trading, energy markets, and product leadership, having previously worked across roles in power trading, market analysis, and energy data platforms before founding Streem Energy in 2020.\nThe views and opinions expressed in this article are the author’s own, and do not necessarily reflect those held by"},{"t":"基于天气引导的条件扩散模型结合自适应组归一化，实现缺失分布数据的鲁棒插补","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007531?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扩散模型数据插补","dp":1,"sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","ot":"Weather-guided conditional diffusion model with adaptive group normalization for robust imputation of missing distribute"},{"t":"观察催化反应中的行走运动","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02089-4","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化原位成像","kp":["空间分辨率[干涉电光显微镜]: 50nm","时间分辨率[干涉电光显微镜]: 10ms","[发现]: MoS2析氢沿特定晶向传播"],"dp":1,"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究关注电催化表面的动态行为，指出催化过程中纳米尺度电流与表面结构之间的关联分析仍缺乏有效方法。电催化表面在反应条件下会发生重构和相变，这些动态变化直接影响催化活性和选择性。研究旨在发展能够同时在大面积范围内关联纳米级电流信号与结构演化的表征技术，以揭示催化剂工作状态下的真实活性位点，为理性设计高效电催化剂提供依据。","ot":"Watching catalysis take a walk","b":"Electrocatalytic surfaces are dynamic, but few methods correlate nanometre-scale current with structure across large areas. Interferometric electro-optical microscopy now images electrochemical currents at 50 nm and 10 ms resolution, revealing that hydrogen evolution on MoS2 initiates and propagates along specific crystallographic directions."},{"t":"Void-X：一种用于预测蛋白质原子堆积的生成式空隙填充模型","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607035123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质结构预测","kp":["[设计策略]: 自上而下AI生成填充结构位点"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"Void-X是一种生成式空洞填充模型，用于预测蛋白质内部的原子堆积密度。蛋白质内部空腔影响折叠稳定性和功能，该模型基于Transformer和扩散模型的生成能力，从蛋白质结构出发预测原子级空隙分布。与传统的几何分析方法不同，Void-X采用生成式范式，可对缺失或柔性区域的原子堆积进行合理推断。该工具有助于蛋白质从头设计中评估结构紧凑性和优化包装效率。","ot":"Void-X: A generative void-filling model for predicting atomic packing in proteins","b":"Generative AI algorithms such as the transformer and diffusion models have greatly empowered de novo design of proteins capable of specifically interacting with designated structural sites on another protein. Most of these design methods employ a top–down approach, in which an overall protein shape is generated by an AI model to pack against a given structural site, followed by sequence design to optimize the interaction. Despite being trained on limited protein complex structures available in the database, the top–down approach has yielded encouraging results. Here, we propose a bottom–up approach that generates atom clusters for optimal packing against a specified structured region for informing the design of protein–protein interactions. To this end, we trained a masked discrete diffusion model, named Void-X, that uses the diffusion transformer to learn atomic-level interactions and fill atomic voids in protein interaction interfaces. Void-X was trained using 8.7 million spherical clusters of atoms from experimental structures in the Protein Data Bank. In each cluster, ~70% of the atoms are used as context (or prompt), and ~30% are masked for information recovery (or answer). By training the model with 172 million parameters, Void-X achieves an overall accuracy of 78.3% and 68.2% for intra- and interchain spherical clusters, respectively. Furthermore, we find that information entropy is a reliable indicator of the prediction accuracy for Void-X. This level of performance allows de novo generation of molecular interactions at the atomic level, offering an alternative approach of protein design complementary to the existing ones.","aip":1},{"t":"价态控制的多光致变色：硅中心的门控开关与可光切换路易斯超强酸性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2997357?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光致变色分子开关","kp":["[门控机制]: 硅价态调控多光致变色状态分布","[分子开关]: 硅基二芳基乙烯Lewis酸"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究实现了价态控制的多重光致变色体系，在硅中心实现门控开关和可光切换的路易斯超酸性。多光致变色分子有望用于多态分子信息存储，但如何控制各态之间的切换一直存在挑战。研究通过硅中心价态调控，实现不同光照条件下多态之间的门控转换，同时利用光开关改变路易斯酸强度，实现超酸性可逆调控。该策略为高密度分子存储和光控催化提供了新平台。","ot":"Valency‐Controlled Multiphotochromism: Gated Switching and Photoswitchable Lewis Superacidity at Silicon","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Multiphotochromic systems promise multistate molecular information storage, yet strategies to control their switching‐state distributions and interchromophore communication remain scarce. Here, we demonstrate that silicon valency can serve as a molecular control element to gate multiphotochromism. Two silicon‐based diarylethene Lewis acids undergo stepwise twofold cyclization, with interconversion between tetra‐ and pentacoordinate states modulating electronic coupling between ligands. Donor coordination enables selective monocyclization, wavelength‐gated activation, or complete suppression of photoreactivity, depending on the bound base. In the donor‐free state, stepwise cyclization progressively enhances Lewis acidity and culminates in the first example of photoswitchable Lewis superacidity. In addition, dynamic Si─N/Si─O bond metathesis provides thermodynamic access to switching‐state distributions beyond statistical photochemical limits. These findings establish valency control as a design principle for multiphotochromic architectures."},{"t":"VOC港与AM Green：印度南部可再生超级项目","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://ammoniaenergy.org/articles/voc-port-am-green-renewable-mega-project-in-southern-india/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/可再生燃料","a":"Ammonia Energy Association","tg":"产业进展","tp":"绿色航运走廊","as":"印度南部VOC港与AM Green合作推进大型可再生能源项目，核心是建设连接巴西与比利时的绿色航运走廊。该项目旨在利用印度丰富的风光资源生产绿氢/绿氨等清洁燃料，为远洋船舶提供零碳动力，贯通南美至欧洲的跨洋绿色物流链。这一布局呼应全球海运脱碳趋势，也是印度打造绿色燃料出口枢纽的重要战略。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"VOC Port, AM Green: renewable mega-project in southern India","b":"Building a Brazil – Belgium green shipping corridor"},{"t":"通过轻子对撞机的双强子碎片揭示光夸克汤川风味结构","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/p5c7-m43d","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Qing-Hong Cao, Xin-Kai Wen, Bin Yan, and Shu-Tao ZhangDirectly probing light-quark Yukawa couplings and their flavor structure remains a major challenge due to their smallness and overwhelming QCD backgrounds. In this Letter, we propose a theoretical framework to access these couplings at lepton colliders through transverse spin dependent azimuthal mod…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231901] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"出乎意料的巨大熵势垒控制vitrimers中的键重排","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00232-8?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"vitrimer动态网络","kp":["[键交换机制]: 罕见键几何构型形成主导熵势垒"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究揭示了vitrimers（动态共价聚合物）中键交换反应受罕见的高特异性键几何构型主导的熵势垒控制，该熵势垒远超此前预期。传统认知认为键交换主要受活化能限制，但实验表明在真实三维网络中，仅有极少数满足精确空间取向的键能发生有效交换，导致构象熵成为决定性瓶颈。这一发现修正了对vitrimers拓扑重排动力学的理解，对设计可回收高性能聚合物材料具有指导意义。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Unexpectedly large entropic barrier controls bond rearrangements in vitrimers","b":"This work reveals that rare, highly specific bond geometries create a dominant entropic barrier for bond exchange in vitrimers, redefining how dynamic network rearrangements are understood and enabling more predictive design of dynamic materials."},{"t":"窄带磷光发射体赋能超稳定绿色顶发射OLED，接近BT.2020色域","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed4859?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"绿光顶发射OLED","kp":["发光体[绿光OLED]: 四齿Pt(II)配合物","色域[OLED]: 接近BT.2020"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了基于窄带绿光磷光材料的超稳定顶发射OLED器件，其色域接近BT.2020超高清标准，同时实现了极高的发光效率与运行寿命。顶发射结构结合光谐振微腔效应显著压缩了发射半峰宽，提升了色纯度；窄带发光体的分子设计则抑制了非辐射损耗。该方案有望满足下一代AR/VR显示及高端电视对超高色域与长寿命绿光的严苛需求。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Ultrastable green top-emitting OLEDs approaching BT.2020 enabled by narrowband phosphorescent emitters","b":"Highly stable and efficient organic light-emitting diodes (OLEDs) with high color purity are critical for ultrahigh-definition display applications. However, achieving these characteristics is hindered by the emitter bandwidth and device stability. Herein, we present the design of tetradentate green Pt(II) emitters with a rigid three-dimensional structure via extended π-conjugation and bulky substituents. This molecular engineering approach effectively suppresses excited-state geometric distortion, resulting in a small full width at half-maximum (FWHM) of 16.4 nanometers in toluene. When the emitters were used in a microcavity-enhanced top-emitting device, the FWHM was further reduced to 14.8 nanometers by controlling constructive and destructive interferences. The top-emitting device showed a Broadcast Service Television 2020 (BT.2020) green color [Commission Internationale de l’Éclairage (CIE): 0.22, 0.75] and a high current efficiency of up to 174 candelas per ampere. Most notably, the device exhibited a record-breaking operational stability, exceeding that of the commercial LED/OLED/MicroLED (micro–light-emitting diode) standard, achieving an unprecedented lifetime to 90% of the initial luminance of 540,100 hours at 1000 candelas per square meter."},{"t":"由实体瘤标志门控的超声启动来指导 CAR-T 治疗","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed0666?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"CAR-T therapy is highly effective in hematologic malignancies but remains challenging in solid tumors. To address this challenge, here, we developed SHIFTERS (solid-tumor hallmark inducible, focused-ultrasound triggered enhanced reprogramming system), an AND-gated circuit that rewires tumor hallmarks into the clinically validated antigen CD19 under focused-ultrasound (FUS) control. SHIFTERS uses a split Gal4-VP64 transcription factor with one module driven by a hypoxia-responsive promoter and the other by a FUS-inducible heat-shock promoter, restricting CD19 induction to sonicated, hallmark-positive regions. This design enables robust, sustained local CD19 expression to activate and train CD19 synNotch CAR-T cells. In 3D spheroids and in vivo models, hypoxia-gated SHIFTERS combined with synNotch CAR-T cells achieved strong tumor suppression, supporting FUS-guided, localized activation. SHIFTERS is modular and can be adapted to tumor-type–specific promoters such as enAFP in hepatocellular carcinoma to enable both spatial and cell type–specific targeting. Together, SHIFTERS provides a modular, tumor-constrained, ultrasound-controllable platform to improve the precision and efficacy of CAR-T therapy for solid tumors.","tp":"超声免疫治","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对CAR-T疗法在实体瘤中效果不佳的难题，研究者开发了SHIFTERS系统——一种AND逻辑门控回路，将实体瘤特征（如缺氧）转换为临床验证抗原CD19的表达，并受聚焦超声（FUS）控制激活。该系统采用分裂型Gal4-VP64转录因子，一个模块由缺氧响应启动子驱动，实现仅在实体瘤微环境中且超声触发时才激活CAR-T细胞攻击，显著提升靶向精确性。","aip":1},{"t":"家鸡超快速 MC1R 蛋白及相关羽毛颜色演化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605288123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The domestic chicken exhibits extraordinarily high plumage diversity in sharp contrast to the uniform plumage phenotype in its wild ancestor, the red junglefowl. The\n                    melanocortin-1 receptor\n                    (\n                    MC1R\n                    ) locus is the most variable pigmentation locus in domestic chicken. Here we have analyzed whole-genome sequence data from 10,026 birds, including red junglefowls and 393 populations of domestic chicken. We document ultrarapid evolution of 18\n                    MC1R\n                    alleles, due to the accumulation of 9 missense mutations combined with reshuffling of sequence variants within the single\n                    MC1R\n                    exon. The lack of linkage disequilibrium at the\n                    MC1R\n                    locus strongly suggests that this combinatorial allele diversity is generated by interallelic gene conversion, possibly promoted by its high guanine–cytosine content. Functional analyses of MC1R variants expressed in transfected cells, using second-messenger and bioluminescence resonance energy transfer assays together with homology modeling, demonstrate that most missense mutations have significant effects on MC1R signaling and include both activating and inhibitory changes. One common\n                    MC1R\n                    allele differs by as many as three functionally relevant missense mutations from the most closely related\n                    wild-type\n                    allele, and its phenotype reflects their combined effects. Genome-wide analyses further show that\n                    MC1R\n                    acts as a modifier of dominant white and recessive white phenotypes caused by mutations in\n                    premelanosome protein\n                    and\n                    tyrosinase\n                    , respectively. In both cases,\n                    MC1R\n                    alleles promote a pure white phenotype, either by enhancing eumelanin pigmentation (dominant white) or inhibiting eumelanin pigmentation (recessive white)."},{"t":"美国政府限制与中国知名储能企业贸易——pv magazine全球版","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/us-government-restricts-trade-with-prominent-chinese-storage-companies/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"pv magazine","as":"美国商务部将宁德时代CATL、比亚迪、晶澳太阳能、天合光能、三峡集团及华为等多家中国储能与光伏企业列入贸易限制名单。此举是美国对华技术供应链管制的进一步升级，可能对全球储能和光伏产业链格局产生深远影响。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"新能源企业贸易限制","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":8.5,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.5},"aip":1,"ot":"US government restricts trade with prominent Chinese storage companies - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nCATL, BYD, JA Solar, Trina Solar, Three Gorges and Huawei are among those listed under the US Department of Defense’s trade restriction, effective from 2027.\nBlathnaid O’Dea\nMarkets & Policy\nEnergy Storage\nAn aerial view of the Pentagon, Washington, D.C. | Image: Air Force Staff Sgt. John Wright, DOD, Wikimedia Commons, CC BY 4.0\nThe US government has added several prominent energy storage and solar companies to its list of designated “Chinese military companies,” meaning its Department of Defense will be banned from doing business with them and purchasing their products from 2027.\nThe list, updated on June 9 by US Deputy Secretary of Defense Stephen A. Steinberg, includes well-known Chinese solar and energy storage companies such as CATL, Three Gorges, EVE Energy, Huawei, BYD, JA Solar, and Trina Solar.\nThe organizations listed are banned under US law from doing business with the US Defense Department due to their perceived links to the Chinese state. The list includes Chinese companies engaged in providing commercial services, manufacturing, exporting, or operating in the United States – either directly or indirectly.\nOthers listed in the updated list include retailer Alibaba, China Electronics Corp., and China General Nuclear Power Corp. Many companies listed are operating in the energy, technology, security, and aerospace sectors.\nThis move comes as part of the increasing US crackdown on trading with China.\nBlathnaid O’Dea\nView author posts"},{"t":"电子空穴双层中的双组分激子凝聚","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10636-y","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Macroscopic quantum coherence emerges when bosons condense into a Bose–Einstein condensate (BEC)1,2,3,4,5. Excitons are a long-sought solid-state route to high-temperature BECs with strong interactions, electrical tunability and potentially multicomponent spinor order, but conclusive evidence for equilibrium condensation has remained elusive. Here we report evidence for two-component exciton BECs in MoSe2/hBN/WSe2 electron–hole bilayers6,7,8,9 by probing the spin–valley susceptibility of constituent electrons and holes. This heterostructure hosts equilibrium exciton fluids with four spin–valley flavours. Magneto-optical spectroscopy in a dilution refrigerator reveals three exciton condensate phases with distinct flavour polarizations. At zero magnetic field, the many-body ground state is a coherent superposition of two condensed intravalley exciton flavours. Under a magnetic field, the intravalley exciton condensate first switches to a two-component intervalley condensate through a first-order quantum phase transition at a weak critical field and then turns into a fully polarized single-component condensate at high fields. The condensate signatures form a dome in density–temperature space, persisting up to approximately 1.8 K. Our results establish van der Waals electron–hole bilayers as a versatile platform for strongly interacting, multicomponent exciton BECs.","tp":"激子凝聚体","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队在MoSe2/hBN/WSe2电子-空穴双层结构中报告了双组分激子玻色-爱因斯坦凝聚（BEC）的证据。通过探测组成激子的自旋-谷磁化率，研究者观察到宏观量子相干现象。激子被认为是实现高温BEC的有前景的固态途径，具有强相互作用和电学可调性，该发现为平衡态激子凝聚的存在提供了关键实验支持。"},{"t":"在简单表面热力学的液体混合物中将气泡聚结速率调整多个数量级：实验","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535299123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The coalescence time of bubbles in a liquid depends on the nature of the liquid, which determines both its surface thermodynamics and the molecular interactions between the gas/liquid interfaces, and on the geometry, prescribed by the curvature of the bubbles. Coalescence is well described in pure liquids that have the same composition in bulk and at interfaces and in which the interactions are attractive. In contrast, the mechanisms are poorly understood in more complex liquids in which coalescence times are orders of magnitudes larger than in pure liquids and are unpredictable. To provide insight on these mechanisms, we use model systems: binary mixtures of miscible oils. In these liquids, interfaces have purely attractive molecular interactions and the surface thermodynamics can simply be described using a well-determined Gibbs elastic modulus, which is controlled by the composition of the mixture. We measure the coalescence rate by forming periodic trains of bubbles in millifluidic tubes whose radius varies over 1.5 decade. We report coalescence times spanning more than three decades and, for a given composition, varying according to a power law with curvature, with an exponent larger than that reported in pure liquids and independent of Gibbs elasticity. The experimental behavior is in excellent agreement with a numerical solution of the coupled thermodynamical and hydrodynamical equations, performed in the simple geometry of a suspended liquid film. Our results clearly reveal how geometry and surface thermodynamics modify the coalescence process of bubbles in the limit of small Gibbs elasticity."},{"t":"跟踪东南亚能源转型的进展和优先事项——区域能源转型指数和分析","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007403?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"东南亚能源","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"从叶片到天空的光线追踪：面向农光互补果园的多光谱半影感知辐照度建模","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007397?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"农光互补建模","kp":["[建模]: 多光谱半影感知辐照建模","[应用]: 农光互补果园"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Tracing rays from leaves to sky: Multispectral, penumbra-aware irradiance modeling for agrivoltaic orchards"},{"t":"拓扑调控聚脲：从结构设计到新兴应用","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73677?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"拓扑调控聚脲材料","kp":["分子结构[聚氨酯]: 拓扑调控设计"],"dp":1,"as":"本文系统综述了拓扑调控聚氨酯材料的结构设计与新兴应用。聚氨酯作为一种高性能弹性体材料，在抗冲击防护、防爆涂层等领域表现优异。研究重点探讨了通过分子拓扑结构调控（如交联密度、氢键网络排列）来优化其力学性能、能量耗散能力和自修复特性。该综述涵盖了从基础结构设计原理到工程化应用的完整链条，为新一代高性能防护材料的开发提供了理论框架与工艺指导。","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Topology‐Regulated Polyurea: From Structural Design to Emerging Applications","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  As a high‐performance elastomeric material, polyurea has attracted considerable attention for use in impact protection, functional coatings, adhesives, and flexible electronics, primarily owing to its excellent mechanical properties, exceptional high‐strain‐rate response, and chemically tunable molecular architecture. However, the widespread development of polyurea is constrained by several inherent challenges, including the excessively rapid reaction kinetics between isocyanates and amines, limited control of network topology, and restricted functional diversity. In recent years, advances derived from polymer science have enabled notable progress in addressing these limitations. A series of new strategies has been proposed, such as employing low‐reactivity amines or blocking approaches to modulate reaction kinetics, precisely engineering network topology, and systematically broadening the potential application scope. Despite these advances, comprehensive and up‐to‐date reviews that integrate polyurea synthesis methods, topological structural design principles, and application development remain relatively scarce. This review systematically summarizes recent progress in topology‐regulated polyurea, covering its synthesis, preparation, and emerging applications and analyzes the design principles of polyurea's topological structure to clarify key structure–property–performance relationships. Additionally, the review comprehensively outlines cutting‑edge advances in polyurea applications across diverse fields and discusses the main challenges and future prospects for developing next‑generation, high‑performance, and multifunctional polyurea materials."},{"t":"斯格明子晶格中的拓扑转变和位错弹性的出现：超越基特尔的磁极理论","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/4rww-4tsc","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Kohta Kasai, Akihiro Uematsu, Yu Wang, Tao Xu, Chang Liu, Susumu Minami, and Takahiro ShimadaSkyrmion dislocations exhibit intrinsic core structures possessing large skyrmion deformation and topological phase transitions.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236703] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"磁性拓扑相","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":1.5,"r":7.0,"d":8.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了斯格明子晶格中拓扑转变和位错弹性的出现机制，挑战了经典基特尔磁极理论的适用边界。研究发现斯格明子位错具有本征核心结构，伴随大尺度斯格明子形变和拓扑相变，这些现象无法用传统磁极理论解释。该成果深化了对磁性斯格明子拓扑缺陷物理的理解，发表于《物理评论快报》。","aip":1},{"t":"模拟中测量脂质膜高斯曲率模量的拓扑方法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6d6f-q1mg","c":"未分类","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Seamus F. Gallagher and Markus DesernoFission and fusion of lipid membranes are ubiquitous shape transformations in living cells, necessary for maintaining the shape of organelles and enabling a host of transport processes between them. These topology-changing events involve curvature-elastic free energy changes proportional to the Gaus…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 238201] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"脂质膜曲率","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种在分子模拟中测量脂质膜高斯曲率模量的拓扑学新方法。脂质膜的分裂与融合是细胞器维持形态及物质运输的关键拓扑形变过程，这些过程伴随的曲率弹性自由能变化与高斯曲率模量密切相关。这项发表在《物理评论快报》的成果，为精确计算和研究生物膜拓扑变换的能量机制提供了重要的计算工具与理论支持。"},{"t":"该量子探测器将太赫兹灵敏度提升20倍","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/this-quantum-detector-boosts-terahertz-sensitivity-by-20-times/","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"观点评论","tp":"量子太赫兹探测","kp":["灵敏度提升[太赫兹探测器]: 20倍","[技术路径]: 量子超表面"],"as":"量子超表面突破使太赫兹探测灵敏度提升20倍，推动实用化太赫兹技术迈出关键一步。该量子探测器利用超表面工程与量子效应协同，显著增强了对太赫兹频段弱信号的检测能力。太赫兹技术在安全筛查、无损检测、高速通信及生物医学成像等领域潜力巨大，但长期受限于探测灵敏度不足。该突破有望缩小太赫兹系统体积、降低成本，加速其从实验室走向实际部署。","sc":8.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"This Quantum Detector Boosts Terahertz Sensitivity by 20 Times","b":"A quantum metasurface breakthrough boosts\ndetection by 20 times, bringing practical THz technology a step closer.\nDetecting light and radiation is essential across the electromagnetic spectrum, but some regions remain difficult to work with. One of the biggest challenges involves terahertz (THz) radiation, which sits between microwaves and infrared light. Existing detectors for these frequencies are often slow, lack sensitivity, or depend on large, costly systems that may require extreme cooling, limiting their practical use.\nResearchers have now developed a compact new detector that combines quantum physics with a specially engineered metasurface, significantly improving the ability to capture and measure terahertz radiation. The work, reported in\nAdvanced Photonics\n, could help advance technologies ranging from wireless communications to medical imaging and astronomy.\nThe device relies on a phenomenon known as the in-plane photoelectric effect. In this quantum process, incoming terahertz photons transfer energy to electrons confined within a two-dimensional electron gas. Those energized electrons cross a carefully designed potential step, generating an electrical current that can be measured.\nUnlike conventional photoelectric detectors, this mechanism does not require photons to exceed a minimum energy threshold. Because the process occurs entirely within the plane of the material, it also avoids several efficiency limitations that affect traditional detector designs.\nEarlier detectors using this concept showed promising performance but suffered from one major drawback. They captured only a small portion of the incoming radiation because they relied on single-antenna structures.\nTo overcome that limitation, the research team built the new detector around a metasurface. This patterned structure concentrates electromagnetic energy into regions much smaller than the wavelength of the incoming radiation. In the new design, a repeating “brickwork” pattern gathers terahertz waves and channels them into narrow gaps where detection takes place.\nEach of these tiny gaps functions as an individual detector. By distributing many of them across the metasurface and connecting them electronically, the researchers were able to combine their outputs into a stronger overall signal.\nThis approach eliminates the need for complex detector arrays or external optical components while ensuring that incoming radiation is focused precisely where it can contribute to detection.\nThe design process began with the metasurface itself. Individual photoelectric tunable-step (PETS) detector elements were then integrated into the capacitive gaps, which experience the strongest electromagnetic fields.\n“This ensures optimal coupling of the metasurface to the detection elements,” notes corresponding author Wladislaw Michailow, who led the research at the University of Cambridge and later at Swansea University in the UK. “Compared to the conventional approach of connecting multiple devices in parallel, this approach allowed us to significantly boost the detection sensitivity,” adds Michailow.\nRather than treating light collection and signal generation as separate challenges, the team designed both functions as a single integrated system.\nThe researchers used computer simulations to fine-tune critical features of the device, including the spacing between repeating structures and the size of the detection gaps.\nThese dimensions determine how tightly the electric field is confined and, in turn, how much photocurrent is produced. The final design balances field enhancement with the width of the electron transport channel to maximize signal strength.\nFabrication relied on a semiconductor structure containing a high-mobility electron gas. The manufacturing process closely resembles techniques already used to produce field effect transistors, making future integration with electronic circuits more practical.\nBecause the metasurface itself concentrates the incoming radiation, the detector does not require external focusing components such as silicon lenses. This simplifies assembly and could make large-scale manufacturing easier.\nDuring testing, the detector was cooled to 10 K and exposed to radiation near 1.9 THz. It generated a clear electrical signal that matched the on and off pattern of the incoming radiation.\nMeasurements showed a responsivity of 2.7 amperes per watt. The proof-of-concept device also achieved an external quantum efficiency of 2.1 percent at 1.9 THz.\nAccording to the researchers, this represents roughly a 20-fold improvement over previously demonstrated PETS detectors. Much of that gain comes from the metasurface’s ability to capture more incoming radiation and direct it into the active detection regions.\nThe detector also operates without a source drain bias. This reduces unwanted noise because no dark current is produced.\n“The devices are direct detectors operating at zero bias, and therefore, they operate without dark currents,” observes first author Ruqiao Xia, who fabricated and measured the devices as part of her doctoral research in the Semiconductor Physics Group at the Cavendish Laboratory of the University of Cambridge.\nBecause the geometry can be scaled, the same basic concept could potentially be adapted for other parts of the electromagnetic spectrum, including microwave and mid-infrared frequencies.\nBeyond its sensitivity, the detector offers several practical advantages. Its flat, planar structure is compatible with established semiconductor manufacturing methods and can be integrated directly with on-chip electronics.\nThe metasurface approach also eliminates the need for carefully aligned external optical components, simplifying packaging and deployment compared with many existing terahertz systems.\nThe researchers believe the technology could eventually operate at temperatures higher than those required by many competing detector designs. Similar PETS devices have already demonstrated performance at temperatures reachable using compact cryocoolers rather than liquid helium.\nThat capability could help fill the gap between highly sensitive cryogenic detectors and lower-sensitivity room-temperature technologies, potentially expanding the range of real-world applications.\nThe study marks the first demonstration of a quantum metasurface photodetector based on a two-dimensional electron system. By combining efficient light collection with a highly sensitive quantum detection mechanism, the work represents a significant step toward overcoming long-standing challenges in terahertz technology.\n“The results are particularly intriguing due to the applications that terahertz technology can enable, in areas such as wireless network, healthcare, astronomy, biomedicine, quality assurance in manufacturing, and many others,” remarks coauthor David Ritchie, head of the Semiconductor Physics Group.\nReference: “Quantum metasurface-based photoelectric tunable-step terahertz detector” by Ruqiao Xia, Matthew Tan, Harvey E. Beere, Jonathan P. Griffiths, David A. Ritchie and Wladislaw Michailow, 17 March 2026,\nAdvanced Photonics\nDOI: 10.1117/1.AP.8.2.026011\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nPhotodetectors\nTelecommunications\nDawn of Solid-State Quantum Networks – The Holy Grail of Quantum Information Sciences\nSuperconducting Silicon-Photonic Chip Developed for Quantum Communication\nInnovative Technology for Building Ultralow-Loss Integrated Photonic Circuits\nExtreme Events in Quantum Cascade Lasers Enable an Optical Neuron System 10,000× Faster Than Biological Neurons\nUsing Air to Amplify Light in Hollow-Core Optical Fibers\nLight, Fantastic: The Path Ahead for Faster, Nanoscale Photonic Computer Processors\nTemporal Supersymmetry Breakthrough Paves Way to Omnidirectional Invisible Materials\nUC Engineers Break Distance Barriers for Fiber Optic Signals\nGraphene Photonics Breakthrough Has Potential for Ultrafast Telecommunications"},{"t":"“类固醇奥运会”是一场马戏团，也是了解我们文化的一扇窗户","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/10/1138670/enhanced-games-doping-steroids-hormones-supplements-longevity/","c":"不相关","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","b":"Testosterone. Methenolone. Nandrolone. Human growth hormone and EPO. Meldonium, modafinil, and mixed amphetamine salts. Clomiphene, anastrozole, levothyroxine, and liothyronine. Patches and capsules, creams and pills. A whole galaxy of steroids, metabolic modulators, and synthetic hormones coursing through the blood of a few dozen swimmers, sprinters, and weightlifters. And millions of dollars up for grabs for athletes who could break world records and usher in the age of superhumanity.\nOn Sunday, May 24, at a $50 million arena built in a casino parking lot in Las Vegas, I witnessed a libertarian thought experiment come to life. The inaugural Enhanced Games were the first sporting competition where participants were encouraged to take performance-enhancing drugs. The founders say they’re challenging dated sporting norms and helping to build a world where we can all live better, longer lives. Critics say the event is an embarrassment, that it glamorizes the use of dangerous substances and puts lives at risk.\nThe open-air venue was compact and decked out in bright blue, with a six-lane, 100-meter track down one side, a four-lane Olympic-length swimming pool down the other, and a weightlifting platform and stage at the front. You could see the golden façade of the Trump Hotel looming in the background. The scene had all the trappings of an NFL game, with the too-loud music and crowd work on the big screen—a “flex cam”  gave the well-muscled an excuse to unveil their biceps. Between events, adverts flashed up for the line of performance products sold by Enhanced, the company behind the event:\ninjectable peptides\nthat supposedly support cellular energy and skin elasticity, daily supplement powders with names like “Stronger” and “Longer.”\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nAustralian swimmer James Magnussen was the first athlete to sign up with Enhanced but hasn't broken any world records. He finished last in his two events in Las Vegas.\nThe day started with the weightlifters, under the blazing sun. But by 4 p.m., only one of them had even attempted a world-record lift. Two had pulled out injured. Some athletes were competing without taking drugs because of the money on offer, and as the competition went on, they had the better of their enhanced peers: Hunter Amstrong, a 25-year-old American swimmer and triple Olympic medalist, won the backstroke by more than a second. In the men’s 100-meter sprint, the non-enhanced US athlete Fred Kerley romped to an easy victory. “Man, they gotta do better than that,” he said of his doped opponents in his post-race interview. “They need to train a little harder, get on that shit a little bit more.”\nAt the bar, bodybuilders swapped before-and-after pictures and talked about their stacks, and VCs and finance bros traded LinkedIn details. Lukas Lakutsin, a 6-foot-10, 354-pound Russian bodybuilder who was milling around the entrance to the VIP suites, initially told me he didn’t use any performance-enhancing drugs. Except testosterone replacement therapy, of course. But he didn’t think that really counted. “I’m almost 34 years old,” he said. “I need to do this to stay strong.”\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nJeremy Sigal, an influencer and author, wore a USA tank top that showed off hugely muscled arms adorned with prison tattoos. He told me he was proudly natural, in both his health and his personal life. “I’ve got an exceptional credit score,” he said. He has written 12 books on marketing and leadership. Later, I looked up his most recent book online. It’s called\nSimp to Pimp: 10 Steps to Fix Why She’s Not Banging You\nand lists AI as a coauthor.\nWhat I saw in Las Vegas probably wasn’t the future of sport. But it was a perfect encapsulation of our present moment, as Silicon Valley biohackers, alt-right looksmaxxers, Make America Healthy Again boosters, and\nlongevity-obsessed\nscientists all vie to remake reality in their own image. For them, the Enhanced Games offered a glimpse of a future where medical advances push the human race to new heights, and where they never have to get old.\nEnhanced’s journey from a crazy idea scribbled on a napkin to a public company valued at $1.2 billion. Behind the scenes, there have been power struggles, life-changing victories, and moments of total farce. As I recently, finally, watched the games unfold, two questions bounced around my head: Were they right? And what does that mean for the rest of us?\nIn December 2022, the Australian entrepreneur Aron D’Souza flew to Miami to spend New Year’s Eve with his friend and mentor Peter Thiel. A decade earlier,\nD’Souza had helped Thiel orchestrate the lawsuit that bankrupted\n—a stunning revenge against the gossipy New York media blog that had outed him as gay. Now he was armed with a disruptive idea that he thought Thiel, the billionaire cofounder of PayPal and Palantir, would love. It was inspired by the buff bodies he’d been seeing at the gym, highlighting a disconnect between a workout culture where the use of steroids was an open secret and a sporting establishment where it was, at least on paper, an inviolable taboo.\nHis initial pitch was provocative and confrontational: a grand sporting event to rival the Olympic Games, where competitors could take any substance they wanted—their body, their choice. The first time I met D’Souza, in the spring of 2024, he had founded the company and attracted some initial investment but seemed obsessed with taking on the fat cats at the International Olympic Committee and reinventing sports (even though he didn’t seem to be a huge sports fan himself). On Enhanced’s Discord server, I found a folder full of memes with names like IOC Clowns.jpg. The whole thing felt very unserious.\nThat would change.\nD’Souza told me that Thiel had previously introduced him to Christian Angermayer, a German biotech billionaire, who would come onboard at Enhanced. He’s funded clinical trials of psychedelics through his company Atai Life Sciences and is helping\nbring them into the medical mainstream\nas a treatment for depression and anxiety. Angermayer says he spotted an opportunity to do the same thing for steroids. What he really wants is to redefine medicine, he told me. Its focus has already changed from treating disease to trying to prevent it; actively enhancing people’s health, he says, is just the next logical step.\nLEV RADIN/ZUMA PRESS WIRE VIA ALAMY\nTensions sparked as D’Souza’s freewheeling style clashed with the more sensible image that Sagner and others were now keen to present. “It was not just his personality and his abrasive way of talking,” Sagner told me recently. “Even when he was briefed on a scientific fact, he would just completely ignore it and say something outrageous.”\nBut the more outrageous D’Souza got, the more attention his idea received. In February 2024, James Magnussen, a retired Australian swimmer, became the organization’s first official athlete, and Enhanced promised to pay a million dollars to him, or anyone else, who could break the world record in the 50-meter freestyle.\nThe notion of a “steroid olympics,” as many have dubbed the Enhanced Games, had been kicking around for decades—for instance, in a\nAnd second, in February 2025, an enhanced swimmer finished the 50-meter freestyle faster than anyone in human history. It wasn’t Magnussen, though. He had been injecting himself with testosterone to grow muscle, plus a cocktail of peptides that aimed to speed up recovery—but his journey hadn’t quite worked the way he’d planned.\nA combination of reputational issues (no pools wanted to host his training) and physical complications (the regimen did help him get stronger, but he packed on so much muscle that it slowed him down in the water) meant he watched from the sidelines as the Bulgarian-Greek swimmer Kristian Gkolomeev—who had finished fifth at the Paris Olympics in 2024—came in two-hundredths of a second under the record and won a million-dollar payout from Enhanced. The idea has always been that breaking records would effectively prove the legitimacy of this enhancement project:\nLook what we can do now\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nGkolomeev, though, had a different motivation for participating: “One successful year in the Enhanced Games and I could make as much as I would in almost 10 careers,” he told me not long after setting the new record (notably, wearing a kind of “supersuit” that’s been banned by World Aquatics since 2010). Enhanced was paying its athletes a regular salary, on top of any potential bonus. And he had a young family to support and feared that the four-year stretch to the next Olympics would be long and precarious.\nIn May 2025, with a world record in the bag and a friendly administration in the White House, Enhanced was ready to announce its first games: They’d take place in May 2026 at Resorts World in Las Vegas.\nAt the same time, D’Souza made another big reveal: Enhanced Performance Products, a line of supplements available for a monthly subscription. The Enhanced Games now seemed less like a sporting event and more like a loss leader for selling testosterone injections, GLP-1s, or a range of peptides that are claimed, with little scientific evidence, to improve sleep or skin elasticity. Perhaps it was all a brilliantly executed marketing stunt.\n“The games themselves now seem almost secondary to what appears to be an online marketplace for hormones, peptides, and other performance-enhancing compounds,” says Astrid Kristine Bjørnebekk, a steroids expert at Oslo University Hospital. “From my perspective, this significantly changes the nature of the project. It is one thing to organize a closed sporting event built around controversial principles, but openly marketing and commercializing substances such as testosterone, hGH, GLP-1 drugs, peptides, and other pharmacological compounds is something else entirely.”\nAs the games approached, more athletes joined. Some were genuinely elite. The US sprinter Kerley—who is serving a two-year ban for missing three drug tests—had won silver in the 100 meters in the Tokyo Olympics and a bronze in Paris. Ben Proud, a British swimmer, had won silver at the Paris Olympics and dozens of medals at world and European championships and the Commonwealth Games. He had been mulling over joining the Enhanced Games ever since the idea first emerged, but the tipping point seemed to come when Gkolomeev’s record was announced.\nSome participants, like Magnussen and another swimmer, Megan Romano, had been tempted out of retirement. Romano hadn’t swum competitively for almost a decade. Others were at the start of their careers but ready to cash in their chips and bid goodbye to Olympic dreams for a potential six-figure payday. The $1 million payouts were reserved for records in the two flagship events—the 50-meter freestyle and the 100-meter sprint—but winning any other event would mean a prize of $250,000, with an additional $250,000 bonus for setting a world record.\nAthletes would get paid even if they just showed up and finished last—as much as $50,000. This is all on top of the salaries that stretched into six figures in some cases, making the payout from the games more than many athletes make in a year.\nSport’s governing bodies reacted to each new athlete announcement with fury. World Aquatics threatened to ban for life any athlete who participated in the games, even if they didn’t take any drugs. Enhanced responded with an $800 million antitrust lawsuit against the global swimming organization, the World Anti-Doping Agency, and USA Swimming, alleging misuse of monopoly power.\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nIn November 2025, a court in New York dismissed the case. Three days later, D’Souza, the mind behind the entire project, was out. A notice on Enhanced’s website said he had “transitioned out of the company's day-to-day operations.” Martin would take over as CEO. “The investors basically said we need someone a bit more serious,” Sagner told me. In conversations, execs at Enhanced played down any suggestion of a feud—D’Souza was simply the ideas man, with little interest in the day-to-day dreariness of actually running a company. (Enhanced spokesperson Chris Jones wrote in a statement that “there is no tension between Aron and Enhanced that I’m aware of.” D’Souza did not respond to a request for comment.)\nI got the sense that Enhanced, in its new iteration as a pharmaceutical subscription company, was almost embarrassed by the games. When I visited\na couple of months before the event, they had been relegated to a sub-heading on the home page. D’Souza’s showmanship had helped get attention for what was becoming a run-of-the-mill telehealth business like Hims & Hers—albeit one well timed to take advantage of a shifting regulatory landscape around peptides, which Robert F. Kennedy Jr., the US secretary of health and human services, has been\nthe FDA to approve despite a lack of evidence that they’re actually effective.\nSagner is still loosely involved with Enhanced, but he says the medical commission was not consulted before it launched its line of performance products. (Jones did not respond to a question regarding this claim.) Sagner is scathing about what he sees as the “hype” around peptides. “I can tell you already, peptides do nothing,” he says—with the exception of human growth hormone and GLP-1. “The peptides that people use, black-market peptides that they buy online—they do nothing. We have tested them; 80% of them contain nothing. It’s saline solution, salt water, and some of them are contaminated.”\nAt the end of January 2026, a group of around 40 swimmers, weightlifters, and sprinters arrived in Abu Dhabi to start their individualized enhancement “protocol,” as Enhanced calls it. Officially, they would be taking part in a clinical trial, pending approval by the Abu Dhabi government and overseen by Guido Pieles, a Qatar-based cardiologist who has taken over the reins of Enhanced’s medical commission from Sagner.\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nThey would be allowed to choose only from a menu  of specific FDA-approved drugs. Pieles broke them down into five categories: testosterone variants and growth hormones, which can both boost muscle mass; metabolic modulators that can tweak how the body burns fat; stimulants like Adderall to improve focus; and EPO, which can increase the amount of oxygen the blood is able to carry. While Enhanced’s team might recommend particular things, the athletes would have the final say on what they wanted to take, if anything. (As Oslo University’s Bjørnebekk points out, FDA approval “does not mean the substances are inherently safe, particularly not when used for enhancement purposes.”)\nThere would be regular blood tests, heart scans, and brain scans and access to the best training facilities money could buy. Pieles and others say the clinical trial will help inform the line of supplements Enhanced is offering consumers, but there’s actually very little overlap between the drugs the athletes were taking and the substances the company is currently selling.\nNot long after they arrived in the Middle East, the athletes were awakened by the sound of explosions at a military base near their hotel. The US and Israel had struck Iran, and the Iranian regime was responding by peppering the region with missiles. “It wasn’t a pleasant situation,” says Andrii Govorov, the world record holder in the 50-meter butterfly, who a year earlier had become one of the first swimmers to join Enhanced. Govorov had some experience in these matters—back in Ukraine, he’d had a business selling cars that helped fund his swimming career, but he’d lost it after the Russian invasion.\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nSwimming, sprinting, and weightlifting were the focus of the first Enhanced Games but in many ways the sports were the sideshow.\nThe conflict exacerbated delays in getting approval for the clinical trial and sourcing the drugs, and as a result, what was supposed to be a 12-week enhancement protocol got cut down to eight weeks. The athletes didn’t actually start taking the drugs until toward the end of March. For those who had always been clean, that represented the irreversible crossing of a line. “The first injection was very emotional, very tricky to navigate,” says Proud. “For me, that was the day I went from the Ben Proud that I always knew to a new person.”\nProud was joined in the enhancement program by his girlfriend, Emily Barclay, who had swum at college level without ever appearing at a major international event; she was working as a swimming teacher at a school in England. After that first injection, they left Abu Dhabi and spent a few days in Dubai as they reckoned with what they had done. “I just couldn’t be around the team,” Proud says. “I wanted to be by myself and feel those feelings, because it is a big deal to make that step, and I felt it.”\nThose feelings were soon forgotten, though, as the drugs kicked in. Proud says he had incredible energy, and a drive to train that he hadn’t experienced before. Shania Collins, an American sprinter, says she had “increased strength, increased recovery, and increased mental clarity at practice.” Sagner and several athletes admitted there were some side effects: acne and some swelling around the joints; unwanted hair growth for the women, unwanted hair loss for the men.\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nOne thing the athletes wouldn’t talk about, though, is what drugs they were actually taking. They all had the same reason: not wanting to encourage copycats who might take enhancements without a doctor on hand to tailor programs to their needs.\nThe one exception was Thor Björnsson (testosterone, deca-durabolin, anastrozole, halotestin), a hulking Icelandic deadlifter and former World’s Strongest Man who played The Mountain on\nGame of Thrones\n. Björnsson first heard about the games on Joe Rogan’s podcast and was immediately interested. The rules for strongman competitions are somewhat less stringent than those for Olympic sports, though, and he actually had to reduce the number of substances he was taking to meet Enhanced’s FDA requirements.\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nThere is some debate over how much doping some of the athletes were actually doing. In a conversation last year, Gkolomeev told me he’d only really been “microdosing,” and he confirmed that his 2026 enhancement program was largely the same. Sagner says the doses the athletes were taking were a fraction of the amounts some Olympic athletes had been caught using in the past. I heard that a few athletes had decided not to take steroids or growth hormones and were only using modafinil, a narcolepsy medication that’s thought to improve focus.\nThe day before the games, I asked Angermayer what it would mean if clean athletes like Kerley and Armstrong won their events—what impact it would have on Enhanced’s business model of using sports as a showcase for its line of performance products if the people using those products didn’t actually win anything. “I know what you mean, but mostly our business model is headlines to drive attention,” he said. “Any debate is good for us.”\nIn early May, Enhanced began trading on the New York Stock Exchange with an initial value of $1.2 billion.\nThat same week, it was finally go time. The athletes and coaches left Abu Dhabi and flew to Las Vegas, where they were put up in five-star luxury at the Conrad hotel inside Resorts World while they made their final preparations.\nWhen I got there a few weeks later, toward the end of May, I found it jarring to see these hulking presences walking around the casino in their Enhanced sportswear, weaving their way through packs of half-drunk tourists, with slot machines flashing in the background and cigarette smoke hanging in the air. I had expected the games to be a bigger deal within the city itself, but they were just one of a thousand things happening in Vegas that weekend—drowned out by a series of BTS shows at the football stadium, by the Golden Knights in the NHL playoffs, by No Doubt’s residency at the Sphere.\nIf this was a sporting earthquake, it was one whose tremors were mainly being felt online, where bodybuilding influencers livestreamed to their followers on Kick and Twitch, and where thousands watched on YouTube and Rumble. (D’Souza once told me he’d had “every major sports broadcaster” vying for the rights; in the end, Enhanced struck an exclusive streaming deal with Roku in the US.)\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nOn the morning of the games, Enhanced held a medical symposium that was supposed to provide a taste of the company’s long-term objectives. The first speaker was Bryan Johnson, the\nlongevity-obsessed entrepreneur\nfamous for plowing his personal fortune into wild attempts to reverse his aging: receiving transfusions of his teenage son’s plasma, measuring his nighttime erections, taking more than 100 supplement pills a day. He spends $2 million per year on all this, but he looked pale and vampiric as he delivered the slightly off-brand message that, really, the most important thing was getting a good night's sleep: “You don’t need to chase IV infusions; you don’t need to chase crystals. You don’t really need to do much of anything.”\nAt 2 p.m., I took two escalators from the conference room down to the arena, where spectators were filtering in. Though it had cost $50 million, it had been constructed in just three and a half weeks, and it showed; on the media tour the previous day, there were still loose screws on the floor of the bleachers.\nThere were a few thousand seats in an open grandstand down one side, and two rows of VIP suites on the other. No tickets were sold, so it was a strange mix of invited guests, investors, and influencers, some of whom had reportedly been flown in from Los Angeles on a chartered jet. The rapper Tyga was the biggest name to grace the “blue carpet,” although I did also spot Fabio James, a Michael Jackson look-alike who has had surgery to make the resemblance even stronger. Rumors swirled that Peter Thiel might show up; they proved unfounded.\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nA few hours before the doors opened, journalists got a stern message from the organizers trying to bar us from interviewing guests. Still, I talked to a Cambridge professor who wanted to use Enhanced as a case study in innovation for his MBA students, a retired Brazilian swimmer with the Olympic rings tattooed on his forearm, and a biotech investor wearing an Enron hat. Proud’s family and friends were sheltered from the blazing sun in the shadow of the big screen.\nD’Souza was nowhere to be seen. Nor was he really mentioned at all—not during the introductory press conference, where Martin was introduced as the “founder of the Enhanced Games,” nor during the event itself, where the athletes showered praise on Angermayer and Martin. But the tens of millions D’Souza had banked from the stock listing likely softened any blow. Plus, he’s already moved on to his next provocative\n: an AI-powered arbitration platform designed to scrutinize the work of journalists on behalf of the rich and powerful.\nAs the sun set behind the hills, casting the arena in soft gold light, there were still no world records. That and the wins for clean athletes seemed to put the whole Enhanced project in jeopardy—the knives were already being sharpened online. I asked the organizers whether this threatened the legitimacy of the project.\nSAEED RAHBARAN\n“Our response is that enhancements help athletes improve and, in some cases, break records. And yes, some non-enhanced athletes also won—because talent and ability also matter,” Enhanced’s Jones emailed last week. “Breaking world records is incredibly hard as the margin is infinitesimal, as we witnessed. Ignoring that 13 athletes some of whom 10 years later broke personal bests is disingenuous and selective reporting.”\nMegan Romano was one of them, swimming faster in the 50-meter freestyle at 35 than she had at 22. And Emily Barclay knocked two seconds off her fastest time in the 100-meter freestyle, coming in second in that event and winning the 50-meter freestyle; she went home with a check for $375,000. “No one’s ever heard of this girl,” said Enhanced swim coach Brett Hawke afterwards. “She’s retired; she’s a nobody. She comes out tonight and swims a time that would have got a bronze medal in Paris.” For all the talk of “superhumanity” and pushing the boundaries of performance, making a 35-year-old feel 22 again is probably the perfect marketing message for the products Enhanced wants to sell.\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nEnhanced’s executives say people should take enhancements only with medical supervision, but price could be a barrier to heeding that advice. The battery of health tests the company was giving its athletes in the run-up to the games cost $25,000 per athlete per month. The drugs themselves start at $75 a month and go up toward $200. While Jones says the products “are in line with industry price points,” there were almost certainly people watching who saw the drug-altered physiques of athletes like Gkolomeev or Magnussen and decided to find cheaper, less safe alternatives on unlicensed websites.\n“Many of these substances require medical supervision and prescriptions, and several are associated with potentially serious long-term health consequences,” says Bjørnebekk. “Presenting them in this lifestyle-oriented and commercial format risks normalizing use while downplaying the medical risks and uncertainties.”\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nBefore the night was over,  Gkolomeev again had the chance to right the Enhanced ship. The final event of the night was the men’s 50-meter freestyle swim. His 2025 time had been surpassed by the Australian swimmer Cam McEvoy (without a supersuit) at the China Swimming Open a couple of months before, so he needed to lose another two-hundredths of a second to beat the new record of 20.88 seconds.\nGkolomeev was wearing the same supersuit he’d used the previous year, and he’d shaved off his mustache for a little extra streamlining. But he messed up his start—doing four kicks instead of five—and was trailing Proud at the halfway mark. His long arms levered him forward, though, and he reached the wall in 20.81. The spectators were on their feet as “WORLD RECORD” flashed red on the big screen. Martin vaulted over the glass partition from the VIP suites, beaming, to embrace Gkolomeev. They had their record.\nOr did they? Online, people shared screenshots from the video feed, purporting to show that the clock had stopped before Gkolomeev’s hand touched the pressure sensor at the end of the pool. An Enhanced spokesperson gave a statement to the\ndismissing this as “completely unfounded internet drivel.” But hey—live by the sword, die by the sword. It’s quite possible Gkolomeev didn’t care. He had another million in the bank.\nIt remains to be seen if it’ll work out so well for the other athletes. Enhanced organizers recently announced a prize of $10 million for anyone who can break Usain Bolt’s 100-meter world record in 2027. They are adamant that the games will happen again next year. If they don’t, dozens of sporting careers will be over, and the athletes will join the long list of victims of VC-backed disruption.\nMy personal prediction is that Enhanced will pivot away from the risk and uncertainty of a flagship event—the company’s valuation plunged by almost $800 million when markets opened after what was perceived as an underwhelming set of results in Vegas. I expect you’ll see individual stunts and challenges, tightly controlled and filmed for virality and probably featuring your favorite YouTubers—think Björnsson bench-pressing Jake Paul.\nD’Souza’s initial idea has served its purpose by capturing the world’s attention. But that won’t necessarily translate into success either. Though the company has had plenty of hype over the last 12 months, SEC filings published as part of its stock exchange listing reveal that it generated only $2,755 in revenue from its enhancements business in the first three months of 2026. Would what happened in Vegas be enough to juice sales?\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nAs the athletes gathered on the stage to receive their prizes, Martin took the microphone and addressed the crowd. “Enhanced is culture,” he said. “We are at the pulse of where the world is going.” On this, at least, he’s probably right. Testosterone replacement therapy is rapidly moving into the mainstream, and while the science may still not be there on peptides, they have certainly exploded in popularity in the two years since Enhanced launched. And there are undoubtedly more substances yet to be discovered that will promise to improve people’s lives, or at least hold their appearance in stasis. The enhanced age is upon us, whether we want it or not.\nAs the fireworks went off and the Killers\nclosed out the event with “When You Were Young” (“Congratulations to … whoever deserves it,” said frontman Brandon Flowers), I wondered what that might mean for us mere mortals. Invoking Hunter S. Thompson’s\nFear and Loathing in Las Vegas\nin a story about drugs and Las Vegas may be a cliché, but it struck me that fear played a big part in all of this. Fear of missing out. Fear of getting old. Fear of never making a dime on your life’s pursuit. Fear of waking up one morning and seeing your flabby, sunken face in the mirror while everyone around you shines and grins and thrives with white-toothed, alien smiles.\nSAEED RAHBARAN\nBut the big problem with Enhanced’s vision of superhumanity is the question of who gets to join in. “People will be able to enhance themselves if they have enough money,” Sagner had told me the night before the games. The rest of us, I fear, will just have to function as normal human beings.\nAmit Katwala is a journalist and author covering science, culture, and where they collide. His latest book is\nTremors in the Blood: Murder, Obsession and the Birth of the Lie Detector\n. He is based in London.\nThe country wants to become a global leader in brain implants. Strong government support is expected to help accelerate that process.\nSynthetic biologists were tantalized by the idea of making mirror images of microbes. Then things got complicated.\nIn an early step towards artificial wombs, a biotech company claims it’s developed a “fully artificial” chicken egg.\nAutomation, AI, and screening technologies are already transforming reproductive medicine.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more."},{"t":"酪氨酸磷酸酶 STEP 是突触发生的发育抑制因子","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2424788123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Striatal-Enriched Protein Tyrosine Phosphatase (STEP) constrains synaptic potentiation by dephosphorylating postsynaptic substrates, but its presynaptic role has remained unclear. Here, we identify a previously unrecognized function of STEP in regulating axonal differentiation and synapse assembly. Genetic and pharmacological manipulation of STEP in vivo and in vitro show that STEP limits presynaptic maturation by restricting synaptic vesicle protein clustering along developing hippocampal axons. Using a reconstituted circuit-on-a-chip we show that loss of presynaptic STEP is sufficient to significantly increase the number of axodendritic synapses. Functional imaging further revealed that the increased synaptic puncta observed in STEP KO neurons actively undergo depolarization-evoked vesicle exocytosis, representing bona fide functional synapses. Multielectrode array recordings reveal that STEP deletion increases neuronal excitability, and network synchrony, hallmarks of enhanced presynaptic efficacy. Mechanistically, these effects reflect sustained phosphorylation of STEP promoting presynaptic assembly and release competence. Importantly, inhibiting STEP also rescues presynaptic differentiation defects in\n                    Fmr1\n                    KO neurons, implicating aberrant STEP signaling in Fragile X–associated synaptic pathology. Thus, STEP serves as a phosphatase gatekeeper that restrains presynaptic differentiation and neurotransmission, and its inhibition may offer a therapeutic strategy to correct synaptic deficits in Fragile X Syndrome.","tp":"突触发生调控","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现了纹状体富集蛋白酪氨酸磷酸酶（STEP）在神经系统中的新功能。已知STEP能通过去磷酸化作用限制突触后电位增强，而最新研究揭示了其在突触前的关键作用。体内外实验表明，STEP能够通过限制发育中海马体轴突上突触囊泡蛋白的聚集，来抑制轴突分化与突触前结构的成熟组装。这一发现阐明了STEP作为突触发生发育抑制因子的全新生理机制。"},{"t":"开始新的一天的最佳方式是什么？科学支持在阳光下裸侧翻","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01822-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"A dazzling book explains our bodies’ dependence on sunlight for everything from sleep to skin and bone health. A dazzling book explains our bodies’ dependence on sunlight for everything from sleep to skin and bone health."},{"t":"自噬蛋白 ATG-9 通过运输神经肽受体促进秀丽隐杆线虫的厌恶学习","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531054123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Autophagy is a degradative process that maintains cellular homeostasis. Autophagy biogenesis occurs at synapses, but its impact on synaptic functions is incompletely understood. Here we show that, in\n                    \n                      Caenorhabditis elegans\n                    \n                    , synaptic ATG-9, the only transmembrane autophagy protein, contributes to aversive learning under mitochondrial stress. Analysis of the neuronal translatome reveals that autophagy is upregulated by stress in the octopaminergic RIC neuron and it promotes aversive learning. Inactivating autophagy genes, including\n                    atg-9\n                    , reduces aversive learning. Mitochondrial stress increases synaptic ATG-9 through AP-1- and AP-2-dependent exocytosis and endocytosis, respectively, and reducing synaptic ATG-9 impairs aversive learning. We further identify the FRPR-6 neuropeptide receptor as a substrate of ATG-9 modulation. Both\n                    atg-9\n                    and\n                    frpr-6\n                    promote aversive learning and RIC activities, and the abundance of FRPR-6 in the RIC neurite depends on\n                    atg-9\n                    . We postulate that ATG-9-containing synaptic compartments promote neuronal plasticity through modulating receptor trafficking to enable aversive learning under systemic mitochondrial stress.","tp":"自噬与学习","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究揭示了自噬跨膜蛋白ATG-9在神经元功能和动物行为中的非经典作用。研究发现，在秀丽隐杆线虫中，位于突触部位的ATG-9对线虫在线粒体应激下的厌恶学习至关重要。神经元翻译组分析显示，应激状态下自噬作用被上调。ATG-9通过介导神经肽受体等关键蛋白的运输，在不依赖传统降解功能的情况下调控突触活动，从而影响线虫的适应性学习行为。"},{"t":"下载：“类固醇奥林匹克”和更安全的神话","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/10/1138739/the-download-steroid-olympics-enhanced-games-anthropic-mythos/","c":"不相关","a":"MIT Technology Review","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"This is today's edition of\nThe Download\nour weekday newsletter that provides a daily dose of what's going on in the world of technology.\n—Amit Katwala\nA couple of weeks ago, at a $50 million arena built in a casino parking lot in Las Vegas, I witnessed a libertarian thought experiment come to life. The inaugural Enhanced Games were the first sporting competition where participants were encouraged to take performance-enhancing drugs.\nFor supporters of the event, the Enhanced Games offered a glimpse of a future in which medical advances push the human race to new heights—and they never have to get old. As I watched the games unfold, two questions bounced around my head: were they right? And what does that mean for the rest of us?\nRead the full story to understand the answers\nDespite the growing hysteria over AI’s threat to white-collar jobs, there’s still scant evidence that the technology has had a large-scale impact on the labor market.\nAnalysis of US labor data shows that unemployment in occupations most exposed to AI is actually lower than in less-exposed jobs. There are also no signs that large numbers of workers are shifting from AI-threatened professions into supposedly safer manual-labor jobs.\nIt’s true that things aren’t great in the job market.\nBut the reason isn’t simply the rise of AI\n—David Rotman\nThis is our latest\nto be turned into an MIT Technology Review Narrated podcast, which we publish each week on\nApple Podcasts\n. Just navigate to MIT Technology Review Narrated on either platform, and follow us to get all our new content as it’s released.\nThe must-reads\nI’ve combed the internet to find you today’s most fun/important/scary/fascinating stories about technology.\n1 Anthropic has released a \"safe\" version of Mythos\nIt promises it has enough guardrails and user limitations to be safe. (\n+ It has a price tag twice as high as the previous flagship system.\n+ Anthropic previously claimed Mythos was too dangerous to release.\n+ But critics suspect that was a marketing play.\n+ Selective access has become a key strategy for AI labs.\n2 Seattle has banned new data centers for a year\nIt’s the largest US city to have passed such a moratorium.(\n+ Its biggest tech firm, Amazon, has tried to stop the ban.\n+ The movement to stop data centers is growing.\n3 Democratic senators are pushing for a military AI restriction law\nThey want a human commander to have the final say. (\n+ But humans in the loop in an AI war is an illusion.\nMIT Technology Review\n4 SpaceX plans to launch space data center tests by late 2027\nOrbital compute is central to the company’s growth pitch. (\n+ It’s also shared new designs for its space data centers.\n+ We’d need these four things to put them in orbit.\nMIT Technology Review\n5 China has been accused of escalating AI espionage\nA report claims Beijing is hacking tech firms to catch up with the US. (\n+ There are no winners in a US-China AI arms race.\nMIT Technology Review\n6 The Trump family has made about $2.3 billion from crypto\nWhile investors lost about the same amount. (\n+ The Trumps risked next-to-nothing on their crypto ventures.\n7 Apple isn’t launching Siri AI in the European Union\nIt’s blaming EU interoperability requirements. (\nBrussels says Apple didn’t try to find a compliance solution.\n8 China’s new drone rules have spooked its thriving industry\nDrone firms face new commercial barriers. (\nFinancial Times\n+ China’s drone sector leads the world.\n9 A judge has cancelled a trial after finding both legal teams used AI\nThe case descended into GenAI tools arguing against each other. (\n+ Courts have been flooded with AI-generated lawsuits\nMIT Technology Review\n10 The dinosaur-killing asteroid created a thriving new ecosystem\nMicroscopic life flourished in the extended heat. (\nNew Scientist\nQuote of the day\n—Aditya Vashistha, an assistant professor at Cornell University, tells\nRest of World\nwhy AI systems don’t serve global needs.\nOne More Thing\nLAUREN SIMKIN BERKE\nThe word “design” once carried a far wider set of meanings than it does today. They ranged from the literal and material (like tracing) through the tactical (to contrive and achieve a goal) to the organizational and institutional—the “designation” of people and objects.\nOver centuries, as designing became increasingly separated from making, that broader understanding faded. But now there is a growing case for reclaiming the word’s original sense: not just the search for a more beautiful shape, but the shaping of a more beautiful and sustainable world.\nFind out why we should retool the word “design.”\n—Nicholas de Monchaux\nWe can still have nice things\nA place for comfort, fun, and distraction to brighten up your day. (Got any ideas?\nDrop me a line\nhistory of humanity’s search for alien life\nis fascinating.\n+ Watch a damaged painting slowly return to life in this\nart restoration video\n+ Admire young stars across every stage of cosmic formation in this stunning space\npicture of the month\n+ Daredevil divers have captured\nthe first-ever underwater footage\nof an adult great white in the Mediterranean Sea.\nPlus: China has blocked Meta’s $2 billion acquisition of AI startup Manus.\nPlus: An unauthorized group has reportedly accessed Anthropic’s Mythos.\nPlus: DeepSeek has unveiled its long-awaited new AI model.\nPlus: NASA unveiled plans for three uncrewed missions to the Moon this year.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more."},{"t":"空肠弯曲杆菌鞭毛 V 形环可识别粘度水平，从而改变游动速度、代谢基因表达","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603105123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Campylobacter jejuni\n                    \n                    is an intestinal commensal of birds and animals and a leading cause of bacterial diarrheal disease in humans. In hosts,\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    primarily resides in the mucus layer atop the lower intestinal epithelium. Persistence in this niche requires a single flagellar motor at both\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    poles that generates high torque for flagellar rotation to facilitate motility and high swimming velocities. Unlike many bacterial flagellates,\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    swimming velocity increases as external viscosity increases. We identified a complex formed by FlgV, VidA, and VidC (Cjj81176_1732) positioned near the MS-ring-rotor junction in the flagellar motor we annotated as the V-ring. Viscosity-influenced growth, modulation of swimming velocity, and transcription of iron/heme acquisition, respiratory, and energy-generating systems were dependent on the V-ring.\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    Δ\n                    flgV\n                    and Δ\n                    vidC\n                    populations lacking a complete V-ring were motile, but could not optimally modulate swimming velocity. Like nonmotile flagellar stator or filament mutants, motile V-ring mutants had in vivo and in vitro growth and viability defects and dysregulated transcription of genes likely impacting physiology. Because the V-ring mutants behaved similarly as nonmotile mutants that experience little to no viscous drag on the filament, we propose\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    V-ring mutants cannot detect viscous drag on their rotating filaments. We propose the V-ring evolved in\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    and potentially other bacteria producing high torque flagellar motors to monitor external viscosity information via viscous drag on the rotating flagellar filament to adjust swimming velocity, transcription, and physiology for optimal fitness in different host lower intestinal niches.","tp":"鞭毛粘度感","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究阐明了空肠弯曲杆菌如何通过其鞭毛马达的V形环结构感知环境粘度并调节自身行为。空肠弯曲杆菌是引起人类细菌性腹泻的主要病原体，主要栖息于宿主肠道黏液层中。研究发现，该细菌独特的鞭毛结构不仅能充当运动器官，还能作为粘度感受器。当感知到环境粘度变化时，细菌会改变游动速度，并同步调整其代谢相关基因的表达水平，从而实现在特定微环境中的长期定植。"},{"t":"巴西境内外采取一致行动，亚马逊是可以被拯救的","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01824-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"As deforestation in the Amazon falls, fresh evidence shows that the rainforest can withstand global warming, but only if there is a worldwide effort to stop cutting it down. As deforestation in the Amazon falls, fresh evidence shows that the rainforest can withstand global warming, but only if there is a worldwide effort to stop cutting it down.","tp":"亚马逊雨林","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"最新证据表明，随着亚马逊森林砍伐率下降，这片雨林有能力抵御全球变暖的冲击，但前提是全球范围内共同努力停止砍伐。研究显示巴西境内外的协调行动对亚马逊生态系统的恢复至关重要，森林退化与气候变化的正反馈循环可以通过持续的森林保护政策来阻断。这为全球热带森林保护提供了积极的科学依据。"},{"t":"Tezeus C8评测：这款轻巧时尚的欧洲通勤电动自行车亮点颇多","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/10/tezeus-c8-review-this-light-sleek-european-commuter-e-bike-gets-a-lot-right/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"行业观察","tp":"通勤电动自行车","as":"Tezeus C8是一款定位于欧洲通勤市场的轻量化电动自行车，以简洁流线型外观和多项隐藏式高端配置为卖点。评测指出其在车架集成度、电池与电机的隐蔽布置以及骑行质感方面表现突出，兼顾都市通勤的实用性与设计美感。作为一款主打轻巧与时尚定位的e-bike，C8试图在性能、续航与颜值之间取得平衡，适合追求通勤效率与生活方式表达的欧洲城市用户。","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":5.0,"r":2.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Tezeus C8 review: This light & sleek European commuter e-bike gets a lot right","b":"| Jun 10 2026 - 1:41 am PT\nThe Tezeus C8 is one of those e-bikes that hides several interesting, higher-end features/components behind an unassuming design, giving you more than you bargained for without attracting too much unwanted attention. And while it’s a pricier model than the usual budget suspects, the added features may be enough to warrant a deeper look.\nTezeus’ carbon bikes are popular in Europe, though are also available in the US (where they thankfully get a 20 mph speed limit instead of the more limiting 15 mph or 25 km/h Euro speed limit).\nI previously tested the Tezeus Swift\n, a smaller folding carbon fiber e-bike, but this time we’re looking at a larger model.\n, I enlisted the help of a trusted colleague in Europe who spent time testing the bike and sharing his detailed ride impressions. The result is a chance to take a closer look at a lightweight urban commuter that combines premium and lightweight Euro-styling with some clever technology, though not without a few compromises.\nAs a direct-to-consumer e-bike, the C8 arrives in a big bike box and you can either put it together yourself or pay a local bike shop to do it for you.\nThe assembly process is actually fairly easy, so if you’re reasonably handy with a 5mm Allen key, you’ll probably be fine. If you’re not confident though, you can either have a local shop do it or just pay them to inspect it after you’re done to make sure it’s correctly assembled.\nThe first thing that stands out about the Tezeus C8 is its appearance. The carbon fiber frame gives the bike a premium look, though it is finished in a subtle metallic charcoal and black color scheme that avoids drawing too much attention.\nThere’s also a white colorway, though you’ll have to be a bit more careful about regular cleaning if you ride often in the city and don’t want the dirt showing on the nice white paint.\nThe battery is integrated almost flush into the frame, while the controls are similarly understated. Even the power button blends in so well that it took a moment to find it!\nAt just 16.5 kg (36 lb), the C8 is also impressively lightweight. That low weight pays dividends in daily riding, making the bike easy to carry up stairs or maneuver through the city. It also means the motor doesn’t have to work particularly hard, resulting in even more range per charge. Even the lowest pedal assist setting provides enough help to flatten out moderate hills, and the bike handles gentle inclines with ease.\nSteeper climbs are a different story. On very steep grades, the 250W mid-drive motor doesn’t quite have enough\nand still requires a fair amount of rider effort. But that’s also not really what this bike is designed for, but it’s good to know if you live in an extremely hilly city. The C8 feels very much like a purpose-built urban commuter rather than a specifically hill-climbing powerhouse.\nThe lightweight frame and rigid construction create a ride that is firm but controlled. Without suspension, the bike communicates a lot of what is happening beneath the tires, though it remains comfortable on pavement and even light gravel.\nOne of the bike’s most attractive features is its Gates belt drive, widely considered the world leader in belt drives for bicycles (and plenty of other things). Belt drives are quieter and cleaner than traditional chains, and they eliminate much of the maintenance associated with lubricating and cleaning a drivetrain.\nAnd while a belt drive means there’s no derailleur for shifting like with a chain, the use of an automatic 3-speed rear hub means the bike rides as simply as a single-speed, but with the benefit of three gear ratios for different speeds and inclines. That being said, you may want to adjust those shift points to dial them in more to your liking for smoother riding – more on that in a moment.\nOne other note: belt drives are great for commuters, and the Tezeus C8 also shows off its commuter chops with integrated LED lighting and slick-looking fenders, all included standard.\nIf it had a rear rack as standard, then that would have been the trifecta of LED lighting/water protection/cargo carrying gear that so many commuters need, but two out of three ain’t bad.\nAnd of course, there are frame bosses to add a rack, if you’d like. Their own compatible rear rack is a bit pricy\n, and it might be a near necessity to buy from Tezeus due to the upper portion mounting at the center of the frame’s seat stay connection instead of either side like is more standard, but the important part is that the bike comes with the mounts built in, so you have the option of adding a rack later.\nAnd at least including fenders and built-in lighting is already great to see.\nThe Tezeus C8 is also packed with technology. The onboard display is intuitive and easy to navigate, offering features such as radar safety functions, anti-theft tools, and a Smart Climb Assist mode.\nThe bike can connect to an app, though thankfully, it doesn’t require one to operate. In an era where some manufacturers seem determined to force every rider into a smartphone ecosystem, that flexibility is refreshing.\nHaving an app for extra features and monitoring is nice, but\nan app or user signup is not. So bravo to Tezeus for giving us the option.\nIf you do choose to use the app, you’ll have access to even more technology, such as setting up the fingerprint scanner (which doubles as the on button) to lock your e-bike to your own biometrics.\nThe ability to customize how powerful each pedal assist level is also nice, since many e-bikes can feel either overly powerful or too muted, depending on how they set up the default assist. For me, I often like to dial the power down even further in Level 1 on my e-bikes, making it a true minimal assist mode for getting more exercise. Then, if I’m feeling a bit tired, I can use the higher pedal assist levels to really give me some more boost and share the load with my legs.\nThere’s also a neat navigation solution that can send turn-by-turn directions to the bike’s color display instead of needing your phone mounted on the bars, and you can get anti-theft notifications on your phone letting you know the bike has been moved, etc. The app lets you keep tabs on its location if it does manage to get away from you, helping you have a better chance of getting it back.\nCharging is also another convenience.\nThe removable battery can be charged either while installed in the bike or separately, and a full charge took just over 2.5 hours during testing.\nReal-world efficiency appeared respectable, with an estimated range of around 86 km (53 miles) compared to the manufacturer’s 100 km claim.\nWithout a throttle, this Euro-legal electric bicycle definitely gets more range for the same modest 360 Wh battery as compared to North American e-bikes that drain the battery much faster.\nUnfortunately, one aspect of the riding experience keeps the Tezeus C8 from reaching its full potential.\nThe automatic shifting can sometimes feel inconsistent when you aren’t expecting it, and it comes as a surprise. Rather than delivering a smooth, predictable boost, the shifting can feel like a sudden change, especially under heavy load while climbing, which can occasionally interrupt the pedaling rhythm. Sure, it’s a fact of life that gear shifting changes the RPM and rhythm, but it’s something you’re expecting on a manual shifter and thus can catch you off guard with an automatic transmission. Fortunately, you can actually manually adjust the shift points via set screws on the hub’s shell (you just need a long screwdriver), and that can help dial it in to feel better for the individual rider.\nSo that’s one thing to watch out for, but it’s a smaller detail when nearly everything else about the bike works so well. The steering is stable yet agile, the bike is exceptionally quiet, the hydraulic disc brakes are grippy, and the overall build quality feels solid, even if the paint seems somewhat susceptible to scratches.\n€2,699 in Europe\nUS $2,299 in the US\n, the Tezeus C8 occupies the mid-level pricing tier while actually offering several features more commonly found in the premium commuter category. It isn’t inexpensive, and buyers at that price point have plenty of strong alternatives. But it’s also not trying to compete with the cheapest direct-to-consumer competitors. It’s a super-duper lightweight, easy-riding carbon bike, and that’s where it excels. And for riders looking for that featherlight (by e-bike standards) urban e-bike with a clean, elegant belt-drive system and understated styling, the C8 has a lot going for it.\nWhat do you think of the Tezeus C8? Let us know in the comment section below!\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nMicah Toll is a personal electric vehicle enthusiast, battery nerd, and author of the Amazon #1 bestselling books\nDIY Lithium Batteries\nDIY Solar Power,\nThe Ultimate DIY Ebike Guide\nThe Electric Bike Manifesto\nThe e-bikes that make up Micah’s current daily drivers are the\n$999 Lectric XP 2.0\n$1,095 Ride1Up Roadster V2\n$1,199 Rad Power Bikes RadMission\n$3,299 Priority Current\n. But it’s a pretty evolving list these days.\nBest $999 electric bike ever!\nGreat e-bikes at great prices!"},{"t":"表观遗传的睾丸起源独立于精子线粒体 DNA 和附睾暴露","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2611096123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Paternal epigenetic inheritance remains mechanistically unresolved. Recent studies propose that environmental exposures induce mitochondrial DNA (mtDNA)-dependent transcription in sperm during epididymal transit, altering small RNA content and offspring phenotypes. Here, we show that mature murine sperm are effectively devoid of mtDNA, precluding mtDNA-dependent transcription, and that sperm-borne mitochondrial RNAs originate during spermatogenesis. Testicular sperm transmitted diet-induced metabolic traits as efficiently as, and in most cohorts more efficiently than, epididymal sperm. These findings establish testicular inheritance independent of sperm mtDNA transcription and epididymal exposure."},{"t":"特细胞源性五聚蛋白 3 使血管修剪成为婴儿血管瘤消退的关键驱动因素","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2526271123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The natural course of infantile hemangioma (IH), a benign vascular infantile tumor, is marked by the initial rapid proliferation of dystrophic capillaries, followed by a regression phase, which is either spontaneous or induced by the first line treatment propranolol. Although endothelial cells have been at the center of most studies, the role of stromal cells in this vascular remodeling has remained unclear. Telocytes, which are stromal cells that may be targeted by propranolol, are involved in tissue organization and angiogenesis, suggesting their role in vascular remodeling during the regression of IH. To assess changes in vascular architecture of IH and the role of telocytes, we used Skin-iDISCO\n                    +\n                    3-Dimensions (3D) sample imaging and in vitro models with patient-derived telocytes. Perivascular telocytes exhibited increased dendricity during regression, indicating their activation. Telocytes secretome profiling revealed a complex inhibitory program, with pentraxin 3 (PTX3) emerging as a central effector. 3D multicellular disease models demonstrated a paracrine effect blocking endothelial fibroblast growth factor receptors (FGFR) signaling via FGF2–PTX3 interaction, thereby strongly regulating endothelial proliferation, sprouting, and activation. In vitro mechanistic study and collagen IV staining analysis revealed that vascular regression is at least partially due to vascular pruning. These findings highlight the pivotal role of telocytes in orchestrating vascular remodeling during IH regression, opening therapeutic perspectives for inducing vascular normalization in pathological angiogenesis, including cancer."},{"t":"TBx合同为欧洲储能项目提供折中方案 - 储能","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/10/tbx-contracts-offer-middle-ground-for-european-bess-projects/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","as":"欧洲电池储能(BESS)项目开发商正探索TBx合约结构以提升项目可融资性(bankability)。此类合约定位于传统长期购电协议(PPA)与无合约敞口之间，为投资者提供风险-收益折中方案，旨在破解欧洲储能项目融资难题，加速项目落地。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"储能项目合同结构","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"TBx contracts offer middle ground for European BESS projects - Energy Storage","b":"European battery storage developers are increasingly exploring new contract structures designed to improve project bankability while preserving exposure to merchant market revenues.\nAccording to Swiss consultancy Pexapark, one of the most closely watched developments is the emergence of Top-to-Bottom (TBx) contracts, a financial instrument intended to sit between fully merchant business models and traditional tolling agreements.\nBattery energy storage systems (BESS) generate revenue from multiple markets, including energy arbitrage, balancing services, reserves and intraday trading. While full merchant exposure offers the greatest upside potential, it can make projects difficult to finance because future revenue streams remain uncertain. Tolling agreements, by contrast, provide greater revenue certainty but typically require developers to hand operational control of the asset to a third party.\nTBx contracts seek to bridge that gap. They are generally structured as financial swaps based on wholesale electricity price spreads, allowing battery owners to retain operational control while receiving partial protection against market volatility.\nUnder a typical arrangement, the battery owner receives a fixed payment and settles a variable component linked to observed market spreads. Many contracts reference indices based on the difference between the highest- and lowest-priced hours in the day-ahead market, such as the TB2 index, which measures the average spread between the two most expensive and two least expensive hours.\nThe principal challenge remains so-called basis risk. Because settlements are linked to a theoretical market index rather than the actual performance of the battery, revenues under the contract may diverge significantly from asset earnings. Equipment outages, degradation, operational constraints and energy losses can all prevent a battery from capturing the price spreads reflected in the index.\nPexapark said lenders and investors continue to assess how closely day-ahead market spreads correlate with total battery revenues before considering TBx structures fully bankable. Greater contractual standardization and the development of transparent benchmark indices are expected to play a key role in determining whether the model gains wider adoption across Europe.\nThe emergence of TBx contracts comes as battery storage activity accelerates across European power markets. Pexapark noted that two new two-year battery storage agreements were announced in June. In Germany, Eco Stor signed an agreement with Shell and Next Kraftwerke for a standalone storage project, while in France, Elements agreed a contract with Eclipse for a hybrid solar-plus-storage facility.\nThe consultancy also highlighted regulatory developments that increasingly reward system flexibility. In Germany, policymakers are debating reforms to network charges that would introduce capacity-based fees for generation, storage and electrolyzers from 2029, while preserving exemptions for existing battery projects. In Poland, growing volatility in balancing and reserve markets is improving the revenue outlook for flexible storage assets. In Italy, meanwhile, recent regulatory interventions have triggered price revisions and contract renegotiations in the power purchase agreement market."},{"t":"20 年代的结核病疫苗在糖尿病试验中显示出希望","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01825-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The shot reduced insulin use for people with type 1 diabetes and another autoimmune condition. The shot reduced insulin use for people with type 1 diabetes and another autoimmune condition."},{"t":"共价有机框架中噻吩供体的协同电子和空间工程，实现高效 CO2 光","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5240027?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Covalent organic frameworks (COFs), featuring broad light absorption and permanent porosity, serve as excellent supports for metal catalytic sites in photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction, offering great promise for efficient and stable CO\n                    2\n                    photoconversion. Herein, two rationally designed thiophene‐rich monomers enable the effective coupling of thiophene and benzothiadiazole units within the same COF materials, yielding D–A type COFs with\n                    bex\n                    topological structures (TTB‐COF and TTP‐COF). By modulating the central unit, the intramolecular built‐in electric field is enhanced, and the rotational freedom of thiophene units is also constrained, leading to a wavy structure in the monolayer COF, which significantly improves the material's photocatalytic performance. Using 2,2′‐bipyridine as an additive, TTB‐COF‐Co achieves a high CO production rate of 28.0 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    with a selectivity of 88.4% in the presence of the photosensitizer [Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]Cl\n                    2\n                    ·6H\n                    2\n                    O and the sacrificial agent triethanolamine (TEOA), being one of the best performances among COF‐based catalysts. Analysis of the cumulative free energy change diagrams reveals that TTB‐COF‐Co lowers the energy barrier of the rate‐determining step in CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction, thereby demonstrating superior photocatalytic performance. This work provides a referable design strategy for constructing high‐performance COF‐based photocatalysts for CO\n                    2\n                    reduction.","tp":"光催化还原","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过协同电子和空间工程策略，设计了富含噻吩供体的共价有机框架（COF）材料用于高效光催化CO2还原。两种合理设计的噻吩单体实现了噻吩与苯并噻二唑单元的有效耦合，利用COF的宽光谱吸收和永久孔隙性优势，为金属催化位点提供优异载体，显著提升了CO2光转化效率和稳定性。"},{"t":"瑞士启动州级公路挡土墙光伏部署征集令 - pv magazine全球版","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/switzerland-launches-call-for-pv-deployment-on-cantonal-road-retaining-walls/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"挡墙光伏部署","kp":["规模[挡土墙光伏]: 50面挡土墙"],"as":"瑞士格里松斯州启动招标，计划在50处公路挡土墙上安装光伏系统，探索交通基础设施与光伏结合的新模式。该举措旨在利用既有工程结构，在不占额外土地的情况下扩展太阳能装机规模。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Switzerland launches call for PV deployment on cantonal road retaining walls - pv magazine Global","b":"Applications & Installations\nThe Canton of Grisons has launched a tender process to install PV systems on 50 retaining walls along cantonal roads, inviting institutional partners to design, finance, build, and operate the installations. The initiative aims to expand solar generation on existing infrastructure while limiting land use.\nLara Morandotti\nApplications & Installations\nCommercial & industrial\nA cantonal road in Martigny, Valais, Switzerland | Image: LBM1948, Wikimedia Commons, CC BY-SA 4.0\nSwitzerland’s Canton of Grisons has launched an application process to install photovoltaic systems on 50 retaining walls along cantonal roads. Spearheaded by the Cantonal Technical Office, the initiative targets municipalities, energy providers, and other institutional entities, inviting them to design, finance, construct, and operate systems on surfaces made available by the canton.\nThe measure follows the “Mazzetta motion,” approved by the Grand Council during its December 2024 session, which called for a “solar offensive” across cantonal road infrastructure. The objective is to systematically assess and harness the solar energy potential of retaining walls and other suitable surfaces within the cantonal road network.\nSelected participants will be responsible for planning, financing, constructing, grid connection, operation, maintenance, and eventual decommissioning of the installations over their full lifecycle.\nThe scope covers 50 retaining walls along cantonal roads in Grisons. Sites were selected based on criteria including minimum installation size potential, structural characteristics of the road infrastructure, geometry and available surface area, operational conditions such as winter maintenance and vegetation control, orientation and azimuth, and proximity to potential grid connection points.\nThe procedure comprises six stages: expression of interest, site visits with interested parties, submission of site-specific applications, allocation of sites, granting of usage rights, and issuance of building permits.\nThe initial deadline is set for 31 August 2026. By this date, municipalities, utilities, and other institutional entities must submit their expressions of interest. Successful applicants may then participate in optional site visits to selected representative locations, tentatively scheduled between mid-September and late October 2026.\nThe canton clarifies that the procedure does not constitute a public procurement contract. Selected parties will be granted the exclusive right to use portions of public infrastructure for solar energy production, without the transfer of public functions and without financial compensation from the canton.\nIn parallel, the Technical Office will directly install photovoltaic systems where production is deemed cost-effective and electricity can be consumed on-site to power cantonal road infrastructure.\nThe initiative aligns with a broader trend of repurposing existing infrastructure for photovoltaic deployment, with the aim of reducing land use and increasing local renewable energy generation.\nLara Morandotti\nView author posts"},{"t":"瑞典在线拍卖平台出售10.2兆瓦来自失败光伏项目的太阳能组件 - pv magazine全球版","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/swedish-online-auction-platform-selling-10-2-mw-of-solar-modules-from-failed-pv-project/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"瑞典某在线拍卖平台正在拍卖一批来自破产光伏项目的10.2MW太阳能组件，共19,000块隆基HI-MO5型面板。这反映出欧洲光伏产能过剩及项目财务压力下，二手光伏设备流通市场正逐步成形。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"光伏组件拍卖处置","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.5},"ot":"Swedish online auction platform selling 10.2 MW of solar modules from failed PV project - pv magazine Global","b":"Applications & Installations\nThe 19,000 modules are HI-MO5 panels provided by Chinese manufacturer Longi.\nEmiliano Bellini\nApplications & Installations\nUtility-scale\nImage: Kat von Wood, Unsplash\nSwedish online auction platform Klaravik is currently\nauctioning 19,220 photovoltaic modules totaling 10.2 MW\n, originally intended for a failed project near Sundsvall in northern Sweden.\nThe lot comprises Hi-MO 5 bifacial modules supplied by Chinese manufacturer Longi, along with mounting structures and associated balance-of-system components.\nAccording to the auction listing, the modules were purchased in 2021–2022 and remain unused and still in factory packaging. The equipment is stored in Sundsvall, Västernorrland County.\nThe module mix includes LONGi LR5-72HBD variants in the 530–550 W power class, based on M10 wafer technology and half-cut cell architecture.\nAccording to local media, the project was halted after the selected site was found to overlap with protected waterways, making permitting impossible. Subsequent discussions with electricity buyers reportedly failed to result in a viable offtake agreement, leading to liquidation of the assets via auction.\nSwedish business daily\nAffärsvärlden\nreports that the highest bid currently stands at SEK 308,000 ($32,500), with eleven bidders participating in the process so far.\nEmiliano Bellini\nView author posts"},{"t":"表面化学无序工程赋能富锂锰基正极的高效阴离子氧化还原反应","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5515760?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"锂富锰基氧化物因阴离子氧化还原反应可提供更高比容量，成为高能量密度锂离子电池正极材料的研究热点。该研究提出表面化学无序工程策略，通过在材料表面构筑无序结构调控阴离子氧化还原行为，抑制不可逆氧释放与电压衰减，显著提升循环稳定性与可逆容量。该思路为克服锂富锰基正氧氧化还原不稳定这一核心瓶颈提供了新的界面工程方向。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极","kp":["[改性策略]: 表面化学无序晶体织构工程","[材料]: 富锂锰基氧化物正极"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Surface Chemical Disorder Engineering Enabled Superior Anion Redox for Li‐Rich Mn‐Based Cathode","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The Li‐rich Mn‐based oxides have attracted extensive attention due to the specific anion redox reaction to provide high capacity. However, the poor reversibility of anion redox leads to serious lattice oxygen loss and surface structure evolution. Here, we report an approach by integrating chemical disorder‐based crystallographic texture into the cathode surface to solve these questions, which involves the spatial rearrangement of lattice oxygen by supersaturated occupation of cations in the lattice. This makes the oxygen electronic structure delocalized and diversified, strengthens the metal‐oxygen orbital hybridization, and effectively improves the reversibility and kinetics of anion redox reactions. Meanwhile, the robust surface architecture effectively inhibits superficial detrimental phase evolution and electrode/electrolyte interface side reactions, maintaining the structural integrity of the electrochemical process. Accordingly, the as‐designed modified cathode delivered a promising capacity (291.8 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    ), excellent long cycling stability, and voltage retention (90.5% capacity retention and 0.68 mV/cycle voltage fade with 300 cycles). This work highlights the role of surface chemical disorder and the strongly correlated chemical environment of transition metals with oxygen, which is expected to provide a new paradigm for the structural design of cathode materials.","aip":1},{"t":"供应链奖：年度转型项目","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/supply-chain-awards-transformation-project-of-the-year","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Supply Chain Awards: Transformation Project of the Year\nPrioritise Us\nEntries are now open for the Transformation Project of the Year Award, championing organisations which have succeeded in delivering exceptional projects\nThe Transformation Project of the Year category at the Global Supply Chain Awards celebrates those initiatives that push forward the standard of operational excellence.\nIn an era of constant change and shifting parameters, teams must innovate to remain relevant. The need to redesign processes and use digital technologies to elevate operations has never been greater.\nThose organisations that are delivering projects demonstrating not just success, but measurable improvement in efficiency, agility and performance, are encouraged to apply for this award.\nWith more than 1,000 attendees confirmed so far, the\nGlobal Supply Chain Awards\nwill bring together industry leaders in innovation together in one room. On 8 September 2026, supply chain leaders will sit down for an exclusive black-tie dinner at the iconic JW Marriott Grosvenor House London to celebrate their achievements over the past year.\nAs well as shining a light on the organisations that are pushing the bar when it comes to shaping future functions, this category also allows us to celebrate those projects that have led the way when it comes to transforming the way we work for the better.\nWe are looking for those initiatives that have\napproached digitisation head-on\n, showing how to use new technologies to innovate and push supply chains further into the future. This could be leveraging a new opportunity to scale an existing process, or turning an existing process on its head to increase efficiency.\nIf your team or wider function has spent the past year changing for the better and has the results to shout about, we want to help honour those achievements.\nThis award is not about simply transforming for the sake of it, but instead our judges will be taking note of strategic initiatives that have yielded tangible results.\nOur judges will be taking note of the following factors:\nrecognised for transformation projects\npreviously have been commended for accelerated development through new initiatives and setting new standards for efficiency, compliance and resilience.\nWhen change is not just being asked of us, but expected, making it meaningful and measurable has never been more important. This award presents an opportunity to put those project achievements at the forefront, shining a light on the leaders responsible for moving our function forward in a big way.\nThis stage is the perfect platform to validate the hard work you and your team put into transforming our function, creating a more agile structure to lean on for future changes.\nsubmit your entries for the Global Supply Chain Awards 2026\nTo ensure you do not miss out:\nAs well as highlighting the projects that have led the way for innovation over the past year, these awards allow your organisation to boost its visibility across global leaders, celebrating with the supply chain executives and innovators responsible for transforming the way we operate.\nThe awards are co-located with\nSustainability LIVE\nProcurement LIVE\n, taking place on 8 and 9 September at QEII Centre, Westminster.\nMake sure you are part of this celebration by securing your tickets today."},{"t":"水光互补下多年调节水库年末消落水位控制策略研究","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008093?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/水电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水光互补水库调度","kp":["运行模式[多年调节水库]: 水光捆绑运行"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Study on control strategies of year-end drawdown level in multi-year regulation reservoir under hydro-photovoltaic bundl"},{"t":"长程转录-翻译耦合的结构基础","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528970123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Structures recently have been reported of molecular assemblies that mediate transcription–translation coupling in\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    . In these molecular assemblies, termed “coupled transcription–translation complexes” or “TTC-B,” RNA polymerase (RNAP) directly interacts with the ribosome, the transcription elongation factor NusG or its paralog RfaH forms a bridge between RNAP and ribosome, and the transcription elongation factor NusA optionally forms a second bridge between RNAP and ribosome. Here, we report structures of coupled transcription–translation complexes having mRNA spacers between RNAP and ribosome longer than the maximum-length mRNA spacer compatible with formation of TTC-B. The results define a class of coupled transcription–translation complex, termed “TTC-LC,” where “LC” denotes “long-range coupling.” TTC-LC differs from TTC-B by a ~60° rotation and ~70 Å translation of RNAP relative to ribosome, resulting in loss of direct interactions between RNAP and ribosome and creation of a ~70 Å gap between RNAP and ribosome. TTC-LC accommodates long mRNA spacers by looping out mRNA from the gap between RNAP and ribosome. We present evidence that TTC-LC is a functional intermediate in assembling and disassembling TTC-B, mediating pre-TTC-B transcription–translation coupling before a ribosome catches up to RNAP, and mediating post-TTC-B transcription–translation coupling after a ribosome stops moving and RNAP continues moving. We show that TTC-B, but not TTC-LC, is severely defective in RNA-hairpin-dependent transcription termination, and that both TTC-B and TTC-LC are severely defective in Rho-dependent transcription termination."},{"t":"分子伴侣引导RNA诱导沉默复合物组装的结构基础","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10640-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The RNA-induced silencing complex (RISC), comprising an Argonaute (AGO) protein and a small RNA, is the central effector in RNA silencing. Small RNAs are loaded onto AGO as bulky duplexes in an HSP70- and HSP90-dependent process1,2,3, but the molecular mechanism remains poorly understood. Here we identify the human AGO–HSP90–p23 complex, which captures AGO in an RNA-free state, termed the AGO maturation complex (AMC). The purified AMC enables RNA loading and AGO folding, faithfully recapitulating de novo RISC assembly. Using cryogenic electron microscopy, we determined the structure of AMC bound to a microRNA duplex. In contrast to its conformation in the RISC, AGO adopts a highly open conformation in the AMC: the N domain and the RNA-binding module (PAZ–MID–PIWI) are fully detached and anchored to opposite sides of the HSP90 dimer, connected solely by the unfolded L1 linker. This arrangement exposes a positively charged cleft that accommodates an RNA duplex. AGO folding is facilitated by a small RNA duplex containing a 5′-terminal phosphate—but not by single-stranded RNAs—revealing a role for the RNA duplex as a chaperone-like cofactor that directs AGO domain assembly. These findings elucidate the RISC assembly mechanism and establish the AMC as a molecular tool for probing optimal RNA features and chemical modifications for the rational design of small interfering RNA therapeutics. Our study also sheds light on how chaperones, together with ligands, can guide the folding of client proteins."},{"t":"通过自组装核壳纳米颗粒制备高强度耐腐蚀3D打印钢","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea5057?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"3D打印耐蚀钢","kp":["[316L不锈钢3D打印]: MCC驱动自组装核壳纳米颗粒"],"dp":1,"as":"金属增材制造（3D打印）通常产生粗大柱状晶粒和元素偏析，导致材料各向异性和性能不稳定。该研究提出一种自组装核壳纳米结构策略，在3D打印钢材过程中实现纳米尺度成分调控，显著提升钢材的力学强度与耐腐蚀性能。核壳结构通过原位自组装形成均匀分布的强化相，同时抑制有害偏析，为高强韧耐蚀3D打印钢件的工程化应用开辟了新路径。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Strong and corrosion-resistant 3D-printed steel by self-assembled core-shell nanoparticles","b":"Metal additive manufacturing often produces coarse columnar grains and elemental segregation, resulting in anisotropic mechanical properties and degraded corrosion resistance. We present a powder blending strategy using multicomponent carbides (MCCs) to overcome these limitations in 316L stainless steel. Upon dissolution, MCCs drive the self-assembly of uniformly distributed core-shell oxynitride-carbide nanoparticles, which sequester detrimental nitrogen/oxygen impurities and markedly refine austenite grain size from 43.9 to 2.1 micrometers. This unique microstructure control yields an excellent combination of strength and ductility. Crucially, the corrosion resistance is enhanced by suppressing chromium segregation via tungsten, niobium, and tantalum partitioning to the cell boundaries and facilitating the formation of a protective tungsten trioxide–rich passive film. This work establishes an instructive paradigm for metal additive manufacturing, demonstrating how MCCs’ introduction can tailor nanoprecipitations, grain structure, and alloy chemistry to simultaneously improve strength and corrosion resistance in structural alloys.","aip":1},{"t":"用于理化监测和适应性治疗的应变不敏感湿组织粘附双相生物电子学","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02624-4","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Nature Materials","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Implantable bioelectronics are rapidly advancing towards multifunctional platforms capable of real-time monitoring and therapeutic intervention. However, designing implants with stable, long-term integration with soft, dynamic biological tissues, especially under strain or movement, is still challenging. Here we introduce a stretchable, strain-insensitive, wet-tissue-adhesive elastomer–hydrogel biphasic platform for cross-functional bioelectronics, enabling simultaneous physical sensing, chemical monitoring and neural modulation in vivo. This platform, termed ElHyX, features a molecularly integrated elastomer–hydrogel architecture, functionalized with conductive fillers to achieve mechanical compliance, robust electrical performance and strong tissue adhesion without the need for sutures or additional surface treatments. Using direct ink writing, we fabricated customizable ElHyX-based devices for in vivo electrocardiogram monitoring, glucose sensing and nerve stimulation. A closed-loop system for diabetic management in rats was also developed, where real-time biosignal detection autonomously triggered neuromodulation to regulate blood glucose levels. Overall, our findings establish ElHyX as a versatile, scalable platform for next-generation bioelectronics, capable of continuous physicochemical monitoring and autonomous therapeutic intervention in complex biological environments.","tp":"生物电子学","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了一种可拉伸、应变不敏感、湿组织粘附的弹性体-水凝胶双相生物电子平台，用于植入式跨功能监测和治疗。该平台在软组织动态应变或运动条件下仍保持稳定集成，可同时实现物理传感、化学监测和适应性治疗干预，解决了植入式生物电子器件与生物组织长期稳定整合的核心挑战。"},{"t":"N-杂环卡宾台阶边功能化增强电化学CO2还原催化活性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73621?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"金属表面的原子台阶边缘因低配位数而具有高催化活性，但其可控功能化一直具有挑战。该研究利用N-杂环卡宾（NHC）对金属台阶边缘进行选择性功能化，在不掩盖催化活性位点的前提下调控其电子结构，显著提升催化活性与选择性。该方法为界面催化调控提供了分子级精确工具，对电催化和异相催化剂设计具有重要意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化CO2还原","kp":["[功能化]: NHC单分子台阶边缘修饰","[应用]: 电化学CO2还原"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Step‐Edge Functionalization by N‐Heterocyclic Carbenes Enhances Catalytic Activity in Electrochemical CO2 Reduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Atomic step‐edges on metallic surfaces are highly active catalytic sites due to their reduced coordination and modified electronic structure. Yet, approaches to organic ligand functionalization on the single‐molecule level have largely targeted flat terrace geometries, whereas site‐specific step‐edge functionalization remains unaddressed. This study shows that decorating the atomically defined step‐edges of Au(788) with N‐heterocyclic carbenes (NHCs) enhances their catalytic activity toward  reduction compared to undecorated metallic step‐edges. Using high‐resolution scanning probe microscopy, an upright‐tilted adsorption geometry and a unified binding mode of three different NHCs at step‐edges are revealed. The exceptional stability of these well‐defined nanostructures allows the use of the single‐crystalline samples as working electrodes in electrochemical experiments. Photoelectron spectroscopy and theoretical simulations correlate charge transfer and conformational details with their catalytic performance. By combining macroscopic electrochemical experiments with single‐molecule microscopy, this study highlights NHC step‐edge functionalization as an effective approach to design highly selective and efficient catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"本征压电共价有机框架中调控电子传输实现高效CO2还原","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5538657?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"光催化CO2还原是生产可持续燃料的重要途径，但光生载流子复合导致电子传输缓慢，严重限制效率。该研究设计了具有本征压电性的共价有机框架（COF），利用压电内建电场定向驱动电子传输，抑制复合损耗，从而提升CO2光催化还原效率。该策略将压电效应与光催化耦合，为高效人工光合作用体系设计提供了新思路。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"压电CO2光还原","kp":["[材料]: 本征压电卟啉COF锚定锌单原子","[应用]: 光催化CO2还原"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Steering Electron Transport in Intrinsically Piezoelectric Covalent Organic Frameworks for Efficient CO2 Reduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction represents a transformative route to sustainable fuels, yet remains limited by sluggish charge separation and rapid carrier recombination. Here, an intrinsically piezoelectric porphyrin‐based covalent organic framework anchored with zinc single atoms (Zn‐Por‐COF) is used to promote directional charge transport and accelerate reaction kinetics. Zinc coordination (\n                    d\n                    10\n                    configuration) induces local symmetry breaking in the framework, giving rise to an internal piezoelectric field that cooperates with a donor–acceptor conjugated network inspired by natural photosynthetic systems. Under combined light and ultrasound excitation, the strain‐induced piezo‐potential facilitates persistent charge separation and suppresses recombination. Ultrafast femtosecond transient absorption spectroscopy demonstrates that Zn incorporation effectively inhibits phonon‐assisted nonradiative decay and prolongs the carrier lifetime to 226.0 ps, which is attributed to the formation of long‐lived shallow trap states and improved exciton delocalization across the π‐conjugated backbone. Consequently, Zn‐Por‐COF achieves a high CO evolution rate of 15.59 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    during piezo‐photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction. This work demonstrates that intrinsic piezoelectricity in COF provides an effective strategy to regulate charge dynamics for high‐efficiency light‐driven CO\n                    2\n                    reduction."},{"t":"NHC保护铜团簇中第二配位层非共价相互作用引导CO2电还原制甲烷","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8098750?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"铜基催化剂在CO2电还原制碳氢化合物方面前景广阔，但选择性生成甲烷（CH4）仍面临副产物竞争和过电位高的问题。该研究通过在催化剂次级配位球引入非共价相互作用（如氢键、静电作用），精确调控中间体吸附与质子转移路径，实现高选择性CO2电还原为甲烷。该策略为绿色合成甲烷及碳中性燃料提供了催化设计新范式。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化产甲烷","kp":["[催化剂]: NHC保护Cu4O簇","[产物选择性]: 甲烷","[调控]: 二级球非共价相互作用"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Steering CO2 Electroreduction to Methane via Secondary‐Sphere Noncovalent Interactions in NHC‐Protected Copper Clusters","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Copper‐based catalysts are promising for CO\n                    2\n                    reduction to hydrocarbons; however, selective CH\n                    4\n                    generation remains challenging because of the presence of competing pathways and an insufficient understanding of active site control. Herein, we develop a ligand‐microengineering strategy to synthesize a series of fully N‐heterocyclic carbene (NHC)‐protected Cu\n                    4\n                    O clusters, [Cu\n                    4\n                    (\n                    μ\n                    4\n                    ‐O)]\n                    L\n                    2\n                    (PF\n                    6\n                    )\n                    2\n                    (\n                    L\n                    =\n                    1a–1d\n                    , denoted as\n                    2a–2d\n                    ), via a green and efficient ball‐milling approach. Of the four evaluated preparations, cluster\n                    2c\n                    exhibits the optimal CH\n                    4\n                    Faradaic efficiency (), with a value of 67.5% ± 2.1% at –1.4 V versus RHE. Integrated in situ spectroscopy and density functional theory (DFT) calculations reveal that unique secondary‐sphere noncovalent interactions (hydrogen‐bonding and C–H···π) present in\n                    2c\n                    provide additional stabilization for the key *CHO intermediate, maximizing CH\n                    4\n                    selectivity. This study not only demonstrates the unique advantages of NHC ligands in constructing stable and efficient copper cluster catalysts but also establishes a new paradigm for precisely steering CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction selectivity through the rational design of noncovalent interactions within the secondary coordination sphere.","aip":1},{"t":"无机-有机杂化层稳定埋底界面实现高性能钙钛矿光伏器件","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01195K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿埋底界面","kp":["效率[倒置钙钛矿电池]: 超27%","[埋底界面]: 无机-有机杂化层稳定化","空穴传输[钙钛矿]: 自组装单分子层SAMs"],"dp":1,"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过无机-有机杂化层稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池的埋底界面，提升倒置结构器件性能。倒置钙钛矿电池具有优异稳定性和与叠层技术的兼容性，但埋底界面（钙钛矿与电子传输层之间）的缺陷严重限制器件效率和寿命。研究采用杂化层钝化界面缺陷、抑制非辐射复合，同时改善能级对齐。该方法显著提升了器件的开路电压和填充因子，为高稳定性钙钛矿光伏组件的规模化制造提供了可行路径。","ot":"Stabilizing the Buried Interface via Inorganic-Organic Hybrid Layers for High-Performance Perovskite Photovoltaics","b":"Inverted perovskite solar cells, owing to their excellent stability and high compatibility with tandem technologies, have emerged as the most commercially promising new-generation photovoltaic technology. Self-assembled monolayers (SAMs) serve as crucial hole-transport materials and have driven device efficiencies beyond 27%. However, inherent issues such as molecular aggregation, non-uniform interfacial coverage, and poor wettability severely limit device performance and long-term stability. To systematically address these interfacial challenges, this study innovatively developed a hole-transport layer composed of colloidal silica nanoparticles and SAM molecules. This composite structure operates through multiple synergistic mechanisms: the abundant hydroxyl groups on the nanoparticle surfaces provide strong anchoring sites for SAM molecules, mitigating aggregation at the source and enabling the formation of a highly uniform and coherent hybrid interfacial contact; the constructed micro-nano rough interface significantly improves the wettability of perovskite precursors, guiding the formation of a high-quality light-absorbing layer. The resulting inverted perovskite solar cells achieved a power conversion efficiency of 27.35% and a fill factor of 86.77% (with a certified steady-state PCE of 26.92%), demonstrating significantly enhanced operational stability. This study provides a novel and practical solution for constructing efficient, stable interfaces for perovskite solar cells."},{"t":"钴(IV)-氧的自旋态工程实现直接氧原子转移，助力高效烯烃环氧化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537686123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钴氧催化环氧化","kp":["[催化剂]: 钴(IV)-氧络合物","[策略]: 自旋态工程直接氧原子转移","[应用]: 烯烃环氧化"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究通过自旋态工程调控钴(IV)-氧络合物（Co IV=O），实现直接氧原子转移（OAT）用于高效烯烃环氧化。高价金属-氧物种是有机催化中环氧化反应的候选催化中心，但其活性和选择性受金属中心自旋态影响显著。研究通过配体设计调控Co(IV)的自旋态，使其具备直接氧原子转移能力，无需传统分步机理。该方法有望提升烯烃环氧化的原子经济性和催化效率。","ot":"Spin-state engineering of cobalt(IV)-oxo enables direct oxygen atom transfer for high-efficiency olefin epoxidation","b":"High-valent metal-oxo species, such as cobalt(IV)-oxo (Co\n                    IV\n                    =O) complexes, represent promising candidates for catalytic olefin epoxidation via oxygen atom transfer (OAT) under mild conditions. However, their utility is often limited by radical-mediated side reactions stemming from stepwise electron-transfer mechanisms. Here, we report a strategy to circumvent this limitation by modulating the spin state of the Co\n                    IV\n                    =O center through geometry-mediated ligand-field adjustment. Specifically, we employ a planar tricoordinated cobalt site to activate peroxymonosulfate (PMS), generating an intermediate-spin Co\n                    IV\n                    =O species ((O\n                    3\n                    )Co\n                    IV\n                    =O, S = 3/2). Unlike its planar tetra-coordinated low-spin counterpart ((O\n                    4\n                    )Co\n                    IV\n                    =O, S = 1/2), the weakened equatorial coordination field in this configuration reduces the crystal-field splitting energy and rearranges orbital energy levels, stabilizing the empty σ* (d\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            z\n                          \n                          2\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    -p\n                    z\n                    ) orbital at a lower energy level, enabling direct transfer of a π-electron pair from the olefin substrate. Consequently, the OAT mechanism shifts from a stepwise single-electron transfer to a concerted two-electron pathway, bypassing radical intermediate formation and enhancing both reactivity and selectivity. In the epoxidation of trans-stilbene and derivatives, the (O\n                    3\n                    )Co\n                    IV\n                    =O catalyst achieves up to 89.2% conversion with 99.9% selectivity, substantially outperforming conventional noble-metal-based systems. Our findings underscore the critical role of spin-state control in promoting concerted OAT and open avenues for designing next-generation oxidation catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"空间双壳层结构通过增强局部碱度实现稳定阴离子交换膜水电解","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb8831?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"碱性电解水制氢","kp":["[结构策略]: 铈诱导双壳层结构","[机制]: 增强局部碱性度提升稳定性"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究设计了一种空间双壳结构，通过增强局部碱性实现稳定的阴离子交换膜水电解（AEMWE）。AEMWE是绿氢生产的前沿技术，兼具碱性水电解的低成本和质子交换膜电解的高效率优势，但阴离子交换膜在强碱性环境下的化学稳定性仍是瓶颈。双壳结构在催化剂表面构建局部高碱性微环境，促进水分解反应动力学，同时保护膜材料免受过度腐蚀。该策略显著提升了AEMWE的长期运行稳定性。","ot":"Spatial double-shelled structure achieving stable anion exchange membrane water electrolysis via enhanced local alkalini","b":"Anion exchange membrane water electrolysis (AEMWE) represents a promising technology for green hydrogen production. Although numerous efforts have been devoted to optimize the anode catalysis by structural and chemical modulation, the effectiveness of such strategies in enhancing stability remains limited. Herein, we propose a cerium-induced double-shelled structure formation strategy that modulates the electrode/electrolyte interfacial microenvironment through spatial configuration engineering, effectively suppressing anodic corrosion. Mechanistic studies revealed that the associated nanospace enrichment effect increased the coverage of surface hydroxide ion (OH\n                    −\n                    ) species, thereby enhancing the local alkalinity at the material surface and effectively suppressing ion leaching. The double-shelled cerium dioxide (CeO\n                    2\n                    )/lanthanum cobaltite (LaCoO\n                    3\n                    )-10% catalyst demonstrated outstanding performance in the AEMWE device, achieving an industrial-relevant current density of 3 amperes per square centimeter at 1.88 volts. Furthermore, the catalyst exhibited exceptional long-term stability exceeding 2000 hours under simulated industrial conditions. Our findings underscore the importance of engineering the physical spatial configuration to regulate the interfacial microenvironment, offering a strategy to address the corrosion degradation of anode catalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"基于可编程超表面的时空全息图","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01647-8","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"研究论文","tp":"时空全息超表面","kp":["[通道容量]: 数千独立全息通道","[技术]: 可编程超表面时空全息"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"该研究提出基于可编程超表面的时空全息技术，实现高分辨率动态全息成像与传感。可编程超表面通过数字控制每个单元的电磁响应，可实时生成和切换全息图像。传统全息方法在生成高质量、多自由度全息图方面存在计算复杂度高和动态范围有限的困难。时空全息将空间维度与时间维度联合编码，实现动态场景的实时全息重建，在增强现实、目标追踪和无线通信等领域具有应用潜力。","ot":"Space-time holograms based on programmable metasurfaces","b":"Programmable metasurfaces can be used to generate holograms for imaging and sensing applications. However, creating high-capacity dynamic holograms that are programmable and have high refresh rates remains challenging. Here we report on space-time holograms based on programmable metasurfaces. The approach provides thousands of independent holographic channels working simultaneously at different harmonics. We use spatial-time coding to split a monotone injected wave into multi-harmonic reflected beams, and we develop a fast convergence phase-retrieval algorithm to manipulate the wavefront intensities at each harmonic. Using a programmable metasurface with 6,144 elements, we experimentally show that the approach can generate 62 holographic images (digits and Latin letters) simultaneously. We also show that the platform can create 1,024-channel holograms with spot distribution patterns and that it can be used for multi-target tracking."},{"t":"社会免疫可能是社会进化的结果和原因","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2518957123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Many social insects respond to pathogens in ways that reduce pathogen transmission within their social groups, with behaviors such as grooming or removing infected individuals. This “social immunity” within a group has been compared to the immune response of multicellular organisms. However, we lack a theoretical framework for understanding both the possible evolutionary origins and consequences of social immunity. How restrictive are the conditions for the initial evolution of social immunity? Would we expect social immunity to influence or even coevolve with other aspects of social complexity, such as colony size or the number of castes? We developed a theoretical framework for examining the evolutionary scenarios that may link social immunity and social evolution. We found that: (1) social immunity can be favored in relatively simple social systems, where relatedness between group members can vary; (2) social immunity can coevolve with the age of colony maturation, leading to colonies that grow for a longer period before they start reproducing; and (3) social immunity often leads to the evolution of larger colonies, which can then select for more worker castes. These results suggest that social immunity can be both a consequence and a cause of social evolution."},{"t":"环境压力下 La2PrNi2O7 薄膜中具有鲁棒超导间隙的单粒子隧道谱","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeg2429?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The recent discovery of high-temperature superconductivity in nickelate systems has generated tremendous interest in the community. The core issue to understand the pairing mechanism is the superconducting gap and its symmetry. We have successfully synthesized the superconducting thin films of La\n                    2\n                    PrNi\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    with an onset transition temperature of 41.5 kelvins and measured the superconducting tunneling spectra after exposing the superconducting layer by using the tip-excavation technique. The spectrum shows a robust superconducting gap at about Δ ≈ 19 milli–electron volts, and fittings based on the Dynes model indicate that this dominant gap should have an\n                    s\n                    -wave structure with low anisotropy, which allows us to put the priority in selecting the\n                    s\n                    ±\n                    pairing symmetry. Furthermore, a clear hump structure is observed at an energy of 49 ± 2 milli–electron volts, which is inclined to be interpreted as a bosonic mode. Our results help clarify the mystery of superconductivity in bilayer nickelate superconductors.","tp":"镍基超导体","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"as":"研究团队成功合成了La2PrNi2O7超导薄膜，起始转变温度达41.5K，并通过单粒子隧道谱测量了其超导能隙及对称性。镍酸盐高温超导体系的配对机制是核心问题，该实验为理解镍基超导体的能隙结构和对称性提供了直接的光谱证据，对推动镍酸盐超导研究具有重要意义。"},{"t":"单核分析揭示了早期雷特综合征的核心疾病特征和细胞类型特异性脆弱性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb4265?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Rett syndrome (RTT) is an X-linked neurological disorder caused by\n                    MECP2\n                    mutations, creating distinct cellular environments in females (mosaic) versus males (nonmosaic). Despite female patients representing most cases, how mosaicism contributes molecularly to RTT pathogenesis, particularly in presymptomatic stages, remains poorly understood. To address this question, we profiled hippocampal transcriptomes of young female and male RTT mice using bulk and single-nucleus RNA sequencing. We identified a core disease signature of consistently dysregulated genes only in MeCP2\n                    −\n                    cells across RTT models. Moreover, we uncovered non–cell autonomous effects exclusively in female MeCP2\n                    +\n                    excitatory neurons, suggesting that these circuits are more vulnerable early in the mosaic RTT environment. The single-nuclei data also revealed an underappreciated MeCP2\n                    −\n                    interneuron subtype that had the most transcriptional dysregulation in both male and female RTT hippocampi. Together, these data highlight the different effects of MeCP2 loss on excitatory and inhibitory circuits between the mosaic and nonmosaic environments in early RTT pathogenesis."},{"t":"Linke 获得具有六核锆结的双链、缠绕、螺旋金属聚合物单晶","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7176356?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Synthetic one‐dimensional (1D) helical polymers are an intriguing class of functional materials that have been pursued for decades. Despite numerous reports of single‐stranded helical polymers, the synthesis of double‐stranded, entwined helical polymers with deterministic atomic coordinates remains a significant challenge. Herein, through judicious linker conformation engineering, we target two double‐stranded helical metallopolymer single crystals that consist of robust hexanuclear Zr\n                    6\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (OH)\n                    4\n                    clusters and inherently helical methano‐ or ethano‐Tröger base (TB) scaffolds. The racemic TB linkers undergo spontaneous resolution and narcissistic self‐sorting to from large single crystals of helical metallopolymer conglomerate, which can be rendered homochiral by employing enantiopure TB linkers. Characterization by single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction showed that, the two homochiral strands are bound together through Zr\n                    6\n                    ‐carboxylate knots, which further arrange with respect to\n                    6\n                    1\n                    screw axis to engender 1D hexagonal channels. The resulting chemically stable metallopolymer conglomerates were demonstrated to be capable of catalyzing the normally acidic hydrolysis of orthoformates in basic solution with exceptional reactivity and selectivity, while the homochiral version was shown to be a remarkable chiral fluorescent sensor for amino alcohols. Our work, therefore provides an unparalleled example where linker conformation engineering serves as powerful tool for architecting sophisticated helical polymeric structures and achieving enzyme‐mimic catalysis and recognition.","tp":"螺旋聚合物","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"通过精细的连接体构象工程策略，研究者成功合成了以六核锆为结点的双链缠绕螺旋金属聚合物单晶。此前数十年研究主要集中在单链螺旋聚合物，而具有确定性原子坐标的双链缠绕螺旋结构合成一直是一项重大挑战。该成果在合成化学和功能材料领域具有突破性意义，为一维螺旋功能材料的设计开辟了新路径。"},{"t":"使用 BRIGHT-seq 对 5mC 和 5hmC 进行同步单碱基分辨率分析","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag353/8705453?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Cytosine modifications in DNA, particularly 5-methylcytosine (5mC) and 5-hydroxymethylcytosine (5hmC), are key epigenetic marks involved in gene regulation and chromatin organization. Simultaneous and base-resolution detection of 5mC and 5hmC is essential for understanding their interplay in gene regulation. However, existing methods often rely on differential subtraction strategies, making direct and concurrent analysis within a single assay challenging. Here, we present the Base Replacement for Integrated Genome-wide Methylation and Hydroxymethylation Tracking Sequencing (BRIGHT-seq), a sequencing strategy that enables direct and simultaneous detection of 5mC and 5hmC at single-base resolution within the same DNA molecule. By integrating enzymatic and chemical treatments, BRIGHT-seq converts 5mC to adenine and 5hmC to thymine, enabling direct identification of both modifications without relying on differential subtraction. We demonstrate the applicability of BRIGHT-seq by mapping 5mC and 5hmC landscapes across human and mouse genomes. BRIGHT-seq provides a useful and high-resolution tool for epigenetic research, facilitating future studies on the roles of 5mC and 5hmC in gene regulation and disease."},{"t":"批判性分析研究论文的七个步骤","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01209-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"By sticking to a clear strategy when reading, I get much more out of the literature, says Jacques Cornwell. By sticking to a clear strategy when reading, I get much more out of the literature, says Jacques Cornwell."},{"t":"面向普适性电催化C–N偶联的自优化晶面定向重构","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4658732?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"该研究提出面向电催化C–N偶联反应的自优化策略，通过催化剂表面取向晶面重构实现普适性含氮产物绿色合成。C–N偶联是构建胺类等高价值化学品的环境友好路径，但催化剂表面在反应条件下的动态演变长期制约活性与选择性。作者利用原位工况表征结合理论计算，揭示晶面定向重构的调控机制，使催化剂在运行中自发趋向高活性构型，显著提升C–N成键效率与法拉第效率，为绿色合成平台提供了新范式。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化C-N偶联","kp":["[活性晶面]: Cu(111)自优化重构","[产物]: 尿素"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Self‐Optimization With Oriented Facet Reconstruction for Universal Electrocatalytic C–N Coupling","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic C–N coupling represents a green synthesis platform, yet the dynamic evolution of catalyst surfaces during the reaction remains poorly understood. Here, we report a nitrate‐dominated, preferential facet evolution on Cu single crystals that directs less active (110) and (100) facets toward the highly active (111) configuration. The Cu(111) surface delivers a urea yield of 5.2 mg h\n                    −1\n                     cm\n                    −2\n                    from CO\n                    2\n                    and NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    , outperforming (110) and (100) by about 4‐ and 26‐fold, respectively, while maintaining excellent stability. Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that this facet reconstruction is associated with spontaneous chemical interaction between nitrate and metallic copper, alongside the thermodynamic stability of the Cu(111) facet. Significantly, the pristine Cu(111) surface consistently outperforms Cu(110) and Cu(100), highlighting its intrinsic catalytic superiority. This work provides insights into nitrate‐dominated C–N coupling, advancing the design of dynamically active electrocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"3D砂型打印的自演化实验平台","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag352/8704708?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","as":"研究面向3D砂型打印这一铸造模具制造革命性技术，提出自进化实验平台以应对其非线性、高维度的工艺优化挑战。3D砂型打印的打印质量受诸多耦合参数影响，传统试错方法效率低下。该平台整合自动化实验、数据采集与机器学习模型，在打印过程中持续迭代优化工艺参数，自主收敛至最佳打印策略，大幅缩短从设计到合格铸模的周期，为智能制造与数字铸造提供可推广的自适应优化框架。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"砂型3D打印","kp":["[平台]: 机器人+AI自进化3D砂型打印"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Self-evolving experimental platform for 3D sand printing","b":"3D sand printing revolutionizes casting mold fabrication while confronting nonlinear high-dimensional optimization challenges stemming from variable combinations and objective conflicts. Here, we develop Ex3DSP, a self-evolving experimental platform combining robotic ‘can-do’ capabilities with artificial intelligence ‘can-think’ cognition to establish a ‘do-while-thinking’ self-evolving experimentation paradigm. Addressing a 3-objective, 3-variable high-dimensional optimization problem, our Ex3DSP discovers the Pareto front with a 1148-fold reduction in experimental workload. The platform provides two solution types (objective-optimal and balanced) with interpretability and reveals underlying mechanisms (variable-objective interaction and sand mold fracture behavior). Moreover, these solutions are applied to guide real-world casting parameter selection, yielding castings with up to 385% improved physicochemical and mechanical performances. This work demonstrates a self-evolving experimentation paradigm for 3D sand printing, offering both an intelligent additive manufacturing roadmap and pre-industrial screening potential.","aip":1},{"t":"用于基于铜凋亡的癌症治疗和成像的自组装","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01136A","c":"不相关","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cuproptosis, a copper-dependent programmed cell death pathway, has emerged as a promising strategy for cancer therapy. While previous reviews have primarily focused on the fundamental mechanisms of cuproptosis and the development of inducing agents, the self-assembly-driven, stimuli-responsive cuproptosis nanoplatforms have remained relatively underexplored. To fill this gap, this review provides a comprehensive analysis of recent advancements in stimuli-responsive, dynamic self-assembly nanosystems for cuproptosis-based cancer therapy and imaging. We begin by elucidating the molecular mechanisms that underpin cuproptosis, followed by a systematic exploration of the design principles behind self-assembly-based cuproptosis inducers. These inducers leverage selective copper-ion coordination chemistry, coupled with diverse intermolecular forces, to enable precise spatiotemporal regulation. Furthermore, we highlight how these nanoassemblies undergo intelligent structural and functional transformations in response to both endogenous and exogenous stimuli, enabling controlled activation of cuproptosis. This review also explores breakthrough applications that integrate cuproptosis with synergistic therapeutic strategies and imaging guidance, highlighting a promising direction for enhancing cancer treatment. Finally, we discuss the critical challenges and barriers that must be addressed to push this emerging field toward clinical translation."},{"t":"使用 EXO-200 第二阶段搜索 $^{134}\\mathrm{Xe}$ 的双 Beta 衰变","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/vpny-23wq","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): S. Al Kharusi et al. (EXO-200 Collaboration)EXO-200 was a leading double beta decay experiment consisting of a single-phase, enriched liquid xenon time projection chamber filled with an admixture of 80.672% $^{136}\\mathrm{Xe}$ and 19.098% $^{134}\\mathrm{Xe}$. The detector operated at the Waste Isolation Pilot Plant between 2010 and 2018 and w…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232502] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"Scout携150兆瓦储能项目落地渥太华，开设新办公室","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/scout-lands-in-ottawa-with-150-mw-bess-project-new-office-launch-1296236/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Renewables Now","as":"美国可再生能源开发商Scout Clean Energy宣布进军加拿大渥太华市场，将投资建设一座150兆瓦电池储能系统（BESS）项目，并同步设立新办公室以拓展北美储能业务版图。该项目将为安大略省电网提供调峰、频率调节与容量支撑等辅助服务，助力区域电网应对可再生能源并网带来的间歇性挑战。此举反映出独立储能开发商正加速布局加拿大电力市场，抢占储能资产商业化先机，亦体现渥太华地区对灵活调节资源的迫切需求。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电池储能项目","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Scout lands in Ottawa with 150-MW BESS project, new office launch","b":"Scout lands in Ottawa with 150-MW BESS project, new office launch | Energy Storage News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nabout 8 hours ago\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nabout 15 hours ago\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nScout lands in Ottawa with 150-MW BESS project, new office launch\nJun 10, 2026, 6:22:09 PM\nSladjana Djunisic\nEnergy Storage\nRegion/Country:\nOther Corporate\nLatest top stories\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nabout 8 hours ago\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nabout 15 hours ago\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nLatest in Energy storage\nJA Solar becomes JA to stretch beyond solar panels\nJun 10, 2026\nSolarigo plans 250-MW solar-plus-storage park in Finland\nJun 10, 2026\nData centre firm EdgeMode to acquire 51% of Spain's Ibersun to access BESS\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in Other corporate\nIberdrola plans EUR 4.5bn grid investment in Brazil's northeast\nTenneT appoints Shell Nederland's head as CEO\nFrontier plans USD-77.5m raising to fund big Aussie solar-BESS hybrid\nLatest in USA & CANADA\nTOYO secures solar panel orders worth USD 185.6m for US projects\nJun 10, 2026\nMN8 plugs in 260 MW of US solar farms under Microsoft PPAs\nJun 10, 2026\nSome 25 GW of offshore wind ready to build but not at FID - GWEC\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in Capacity\nNovar, partner reach fin close on 148-MWp Dutch solar park\nJun 10, 2026\nIsrael's Airengy, Hagag Europe partner on CAES project in Romania\nJun 10, 2026\nPoland plans to generate 69% of its energy from renewables by 2040\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in Energy storage\nJA Solar becomes JA to stretch beyond solar panels\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in Other corporate\nIberdrola plans EUR 4.5bn grid investment in Brazil's northeast\nLatest in USA & CANADA\nTOYO secures solar panel orders worth USD 185.6m for US projects\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in Capacity\nNovar, partner reach fin close on 148-MWp Dutch solar park\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in Canada\nAcciona Energia taps RBC to sell Canadian wind farms - report\nMost read stories\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nOffshore Wind\nOffshore wind could occupy 11% of North Sea by 2050, study says\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"《自然》民意调查显示，科学家们对人工智能 FOMO 的看法很糟糕","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01690-7","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Almost half of the scientists who responded said that they feel broadly negative towards artificial intelligence, but they think that some tools are better than others. Almost half of the scientists who responded said that they feel broadly negative towards artificial intelligence, but they think that some tools are better than others.","tp":"科学AI态度","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"《自然》杂志近期的一项民意调查揭示了科学界对人工智能的复杂态度。调查显示，近一半的受访科学家表示对人工智能持有广泛的负面看法，这反映出学术界对AI技术快速发展的担忧与焦虑（即错失恐惧症，FOMO）。尽管如此，受访科学家也承认，并非所有AI工具都是负面或无效的，部分特定工具在科研中仍具有一定的应用价值与优势。"},{"t":"科学家揭开 400 年前埋在芬兰的神秘人的惊人秘密","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-uncover-surprising-secrets-of-a-mysterious-man-buried-in-finland-400-years-ago/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A multidisciplinary study has uncovered new details about a centuries-old burial in northern Finland, revealing genetic links to Sámi populations and evidence of a remarkably mobile life.\nA new study by the University of Turku and its partners has revealed new details about a man buried near Lake Kitka in Kuusamo, Finland, around the turn of the 16th and 17th centuries.\nand isotope analyses suggest he was closely related to present-day Sámi populations and arrived in the region only shortly before his death.\nThe research team analyzed DNA and isotopes from an individual whose grave was discovered near Lake Kitka in the 1970s. The findings provide a clearer picture of the life of a man who lived about four centuries ago.\nDNA recovered from the teeth of the approximately 40-year-old man was compared with previously studied ancient and modern genomes. The analysis found that his genetic profile most closely matched both historical and present-day Sámi populations. He also shared small DNA segments with modern Finns, particularly people living in northern and northeastern Lapland, while showing weaker genetic connections to residents of the Kuusamo area and southern Finland.\n“A similar pattern emerges when present-day Sámi are used in the comparison instead of the Kitka individual. This suggests that the results reflect broader historical interaction and admixture between Sámi and Finnish populations,” says researcher Sanni Peltola from the University of Turku.\nPeltola emphasized that while ancient DNA can help researchers trace population history, it cannot be used to determine a person’s ethnicity or identity.\n“Sámi identity is not a biological trait, but a historical, cultural, and social phenomenon,” she notes.\nThe Kitka burial has also drawn significant interest from genetic genealogists. However, the researchers noted that DNA evidence cannot reliably link someone who lived so long ago to specific modern families or individuals.\nIsotope analysis of the man’s teeth suggests he arrived in Kuusamo only a short time before his death. During childhood, his diet included land animals, freshwater fish, and marine foods. Later in life, marine resources became more important, while freshwater fish, a key food source in the Kuusamo region, disappeared from his diet. Isotope signatures related to drinking water also indicate that he spent his teenage years in an area with geological characteristics very different from those found in Finland.\n“The most likely location is a region with volcanic bedrock in the North Atlantic, likely Iceland. This interpretation is supported by historical evidence of contacts between Northern Fennoscandia and the North Atlantic during the 16th century,” says Senior Researcher Ulla Nordfors from the University of Turku.\nPrevious research suggested the Kitka individual may have been a noaidi, a Sámi ritual specialist. While the new study does not dismiss that possibility, it indicates that his life story was likely more complex than earlier interpretations suggested.\n“The results show that historical Sámi communities and their social roles do not correspond to the images presented in older research literature,” Nordfors notes.\nReference: “Bioarchaeological analysis illustrates the life of a 16th-century Sámi individual from Kitka, Kuusamo, northern Finland” by Sanni Peltola, Ulla Nordfors, Laura Arppe, Markku Oinonen, Mika Sarkkinen, Miikka Voutilainen, Kerttu Majander, Thiseas C. Lamnidis, Luca Traverso, Johannes Krause, Antti Sajantila, Elina Salmela, Päivi Onkamo and Jussi-Pekka Taavitsainen, 25 May 2026,\nBMC Genomics\nDOI: 10.1186/s12864-026-12962-x\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAnthropology\nUniversity of Turku\nScientists Solve Mystery of Pompeii’s Famous “Mother and Child”\nWhat Happened to Easter Island? New Research Refutes Best-Selling Population Collapse Theory\nAncient DNA Rewrites the History of Prehistoric Orkney – “Britain’s Ancient Capital”\nHarvard’s New Genetics Research on Ancient Britain Contains Insights on Language, Ancestry, Kinship, Milk\nHow Ancient Human and Animal DNA Is Preserved in Archaeological Sediments for Thousands of Years\nAncient DNA From Neolithic Tombs in Britain Reveals the World’s Oldest Family Tree\nReconstructing Genetics To Shed Light on Past Human Histories\nDNA Increases Our Understanding of Stone Age Cultures and Battle Axe Cultural Influences\nScientists Reveal the Complex Story Behind the Beaker Phenomenon"},{"t":"科学家创造出针对有害细菌的“智能”绷带","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-create-intelligent-bandage-that-targets-harmful-bacteria/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Researchers have created a smart wound dressing that can sense when harmful bacteria are present and respond by releasing antibiotics only when needed.\nBiomedical engineers at\nBrown University\nhave created a wound dressing that releases antibiotics only when harmful bacteria are detected. In a new study, the team found that the material may quickly eliminate wound infections and speed healing while cutting back on unnecessary antibiotic use. Overuse of antibiotics is a key factor behind antibiotic resistance and difficult-to-treat “superbug” infections, which kill tens of thousands of people worldwide each year.\nThe material is a smart hydrogel packed with antibiotics and designed to be applied directly to a wound beneath a bandage. It responds to an enzyme made by many harmful bacteria. When that enzyme is present, the hydrogel begins to break down and releases the antibiotics stored inside. If harmful bacteria are absent, the hydrogel remains intact and keeps the medication sealed away.\n“Antimicrobial resistance is a major problem worldwide, so we need better approaches for how we use antibiotics,” said Anita Shukla, a professor in Brown’s School of Engineering who led the development of the smart hydrogel. “We’ve developed a material that releases antibiotics only when harmful bacteria are present, so it limits exposure to antibiotics when they’re not needed but still provides these important medications when they are needed.”\nIn the study, published in\nScience Advances\n, the researchers tested the hydrogel and found that it was highly selective for enzymes produced by common bacteria that cause wound infections. The findings also suggest that the material may clear infections and support wound healing more effectively than a hydrogel dressing currently used in clinical care.\nHydrogels are Jell-O-like materials made mostly of water and long polymer molecules. Smaller molecules called crosslinkers hold those polymers together and help the hydrogel keep its structure. For this material, the team used a crosslinker that breaks down when it encounters enzymes known as beta-lactamases, which are produced by many types of bacteria. Once that breakdown begins, the hydrogel falls apart and releases the antibiotics inside.\nIn petri dish tests, the material broke down only when harmful bacteria that produce beta-lactamases were present. When exposed only to harmless bacteria that do not make these enzymes, the hydrogel stayed intact and did not promote antibiotic resistance during long-term exposure to the dressing.\nThe researchers said this beta-lactamase sensitivity is important because it helps ensure that antibiotics are released only when infection-causing bacteria are present. That could greatly reduce exposure among the healthy microbes that normally live on the skin.\nThe study also found that the material tightly retains its antibiotic cargo until breakdown is triggered. “This really is a very stable formulation that doesn’t allow the drug to leach out,” Shukla said. “It’s truly trapped in there until there is a significant amount of beta-lactamase production that can cause hydrogel degradation.”\nIn mouse experiments, the researchers found that one application of the hydrogel completely eliminated bacterial infection in an abrasion wound. The new dressing also performed better than a widely used antimicrobial dressing in both bacterial clearance and wound healing.\nOverall, the findings point to a potential new strategy for treating wound infections while preserving the effectiveness of important antibiotics.\nStudies suggest\nthat antibiotic-resistant infections kill more than 1 million people worldwide each year. Without efforts to reduce antibiotic overuse, antimicrobial resistance could be associated with nearly 10 million deaths annually by 2050.\n“Our findings suggest that these bacterial enzyme-responsive smart hydrogels have the potential to provide targeted, on-demand infection eradication while minimizing unnecessary exposure to antibiotics,” the researchers conclude. “By releasing the antibiotic only in the presence of beta-lactamase-producing bacteria, our hydrogel system provides effective treatment while minimizing susceptibility to antibiotic resistance.”\nThe team has patented the material and is continuing to develop the technology for possible future commercialization.\nReference: “Bacterial enzyme-responsive hydrogels for triggered delivery of antibiotics to infected wounds” by Akram Abbasi, Alec McCall, Zhaowei Jiang, Brian W. LeBlanc and Anita Shukla, 20 March 2026,\nScience Advances\nDOI: 10.1126/sciadv.adz0786\nThe work was supported by the Dr. Ralph and Marian Falk Medical Research Trust.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nBiochemistry\nBiomedical Engineering\nBrown University\n100x More Potent: Chemists Discover Powerful New Antibiotic “Hidden in Plain Sight”\nRevolutionary Smart Drug-Delivering Bandage Developed by Polish Scientists\nNew Nanotech Bandages Kill Bacteria and Speed Up Healing\nKilling Over 99% of Bacteria – Scientists Have Invented a Nano-Thin Superbug-Slaying Material\nAntimicrobial Coating for Orthopedic Implants Prevents Dangerous Bacterial Infections\nNew Molecule Discovered in Chestnut Leaves Disarms Dangerous Staph Bacteria\nAntibiotics Can Treat Human Diseases Like Cancer – Not Just Bacterial Infections\n“Hidden” Genes in Bacteriophages Could Be Key in Development of New Antibiotics\nNew Strategy Makes Bacteria More Vulnerable to Antibiotics"},{"t":"科学必须被视为对大多数人而不是少数人来说可行的职业","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01849-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Letter to the Editor"},{"t":"校车初创公司 Zum 迈出了 IPO 的第一步","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/dealmaker/school-bus-startup-zum-takes-early-steps-toward-ipo","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"School Bus Startup Zum Takes Early Steps Toward IPO — The Information"},{"t":"可扩展的分层纺织纤维用于个性化可穿戴大气水收集","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9949?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Sorption-based atmospheric water harvesting (AWH) offers a decentralized, sustainable solution to global freshwater scarcity, enabling clean water in diverse environments. However, translating ideal sorption properties of small-scale materials into practical, large-scale systems faces critical kinetic challenges. Here, we conceptualize a hierarchical textile fiber for wearable AWH, addressing the scaling limitations of traditional sorbents. These fibers feature an open-pore surface topology and internal hierarchical pore structures, which accelerate surface vapor liquefaction and subsequent water transport, demonstrating exceptional water uptake and rapid sorption kinetics across varying relative humidity (RH). When woven into textiles, the fibers maintain efficient vapor diffusion through their macroporous, breathable architecture, achieving a 3- to 10-fold improvement over traditional sorbents at scale. We engineered a wearable prototype combining the AWH textile with a portable collector, achieving 3.76 to 7.45 liters\n                    water\n                    per kilogram\n                    sorbent\n                    per day and collecting 410 to 894 milliliters across 20 to 80% RH. By overcoming kinetic limitations, our study advances AWH toward scalability and wearability with implications for global water sustainability.","tp":"大气集水纤","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出了用于可穿戴大气集水（AWH）的分层纺织纤维概念，旨在解决吸附材料从小规模向实际大规模系统转化中的动力学瓶颈。该纤维具有开孔表面拓扑结构，优化了吸湿-释水动力学，将理想的吸附性能转化为可穿戴的实用集水系统，为全球淡水短缺问题提供了去中心化、可持续的解决方案。"},{"t":"SIRT7 调节剂量补偿并保护女性 X 染色体","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10645-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Sirtuins are deacetylases implicated in stress responses and longevity in mammals1,2. Although their differential impact on disease for the two sexes has been noted3,4,5,6,7, the underlying reasons are unclear. Here, using Sirt7 as a model in mice, we examine the mechanisms leading to sex differences and find that Sirt7−/− female mice have decreased fitness throughout their lifespan. Notably, SIRT7 preferentially localizes to the sex chromosomes. In female individuals, SIRT7 loss affects X-chromosome inactivation, the first arm of dosage compensation that equalizes X-linked gene expression between males and females8,9,10. Xist is overexpressed and gene silencing becomes more efficient. However, SIRT7 loss has greatest impact on the active X (Xa) chromosome. The Xa chromosome becomes hyperacetylated at Lys36 of histone H3, structurally disorganized, prone to DNA damage and overexpressed. Increased Xa-chromosome expression leads to genome imbalance and augmented X-chromosome upregulation—the second arm of dosage compensation that balances X-chromosome versus autosomal gene expression. These data reveal an essential crosstalk between sirtuins and the sex chromosomes, with SIRT7 safeguarding X-chromosome integrity and dosage balance with autosomes. We propose that the sex bias in SIRT7 biology can be explained in part by unequal effects on the sex chromosomes."},{"t":"Rpd3L 通过 H3K4 甲基化依赖和独立染色质机制调节转录复制冲突","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7842?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Faithful genome duplication requires coordination between transcription and replication. Disruption of this coordination causes transcription-replication conflicts (TRCs), leading to replication stress and genome instability. How chromatin regulators modulate these processes remains unclear. Here, we show that the Rpd3L histone deacetylase complex dynamically modulates chromatin state to control replication fork progression and buffer TRCs in\n                    Saccharomyces cerevisiae\n                    . Rpd3L is targeted through both histone H3 lysine 4 methylation–dependent recruitment and methylation-independent mechanisms engaged under replication stress. Loss of H3K4 methylation or Rpd3L function promotes histone acetylation, accelerates fork progression through transcribed regions, and increases transcription-associated genome instability. Balanced acetylation at multiple histone lysines is required to stabilize replication forks under stress. While histone deacetylase complexes have been implicated in repairing damaged forks, our findings reveal that Rpd3L acts preemptively to modulate chromatin state and replication dynamics during TRCs, defining a chromatin-based mechanism that safeguards genome stability."},{"t":"阴离子孤对电子在产生最小晶格热导率中的作用","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/2pdy-5c6k","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Hongwei Ming, Jiahui Wang, Shike Xu, Bushra Jabar, Yunpeng Zheng, Zhong-Zhen Luo, and Zhigang ZouCationic lone-pair electrons are often associated with distinctive phonon properties (e.g., strong lattice anharmonicity) that lead to low lattice thermal conductivity (${κ}_{\\mathrm{L}}$). However, the reliance on specific cations (e.g., ${\\mathrm{Sb}}^{3+}$ or ${\\mathrm{Ge}}^{2+}$) severely restri…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236301] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","tp":"晶格热导率","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"香港大学等团队发表于PRL的研究揭示，阴离子孤对电子（而非传统认为的阳离子）同样能诱导强晶格非谐性，从而产生极低晶格热导率。该发现突破了热电材料对特定阳离子（如Sb³⁺、Ge²⁺）的依赖，为设计新型高效热电材料提供了全新的化学设计维度，有望显著拓宽热电材料的选择范围。"},{"t":"冰山融化落下的岩石孕育着生物多样性的深海绿洲","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01835-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"A ripple effect of climate change is providing habitat for corals, sponges and other Arctic animals. A ripple effect of climate change is providing habitat for corals, sponges and other Arctic animals."},{"t":"通过全基因组 SNP 的智能分析，预测 Correa 级联中幽门螺杆菌菌株的风险","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603926123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Only a minority of\n                    \n                      Helicobacter pylori\n                    \n                    (\n                    \n                      H. pylori\n                    \n                    )-infected individuals progress along Correa’s cascade, and classical virulence markers do not fully explain this heterogeneity, motivating genome-wide approaches to quantify strain-level genomic risk associated with advanced lesions. We assembled 528 high-quality\n                    \n                      H. pylori\n                    \n                    whole-genome sequences spanning nonatrophic gastritis (NAG), atrophic gastritis (AG), intestinal metaplasia (IM), and gastric cancer (GC) and performed bacterial genome-wide association analyses with explicit adjustment for population structure. We then integrated advanced lesions-associated variants into a random forest model to derive an\n                    \n                      H. pylori\n                    \n                    Genomic Risk Score (HpRS), defined as the predicted probability that a strain is associated with advanced lesions (IM/GC) vs. nonadvanced lesions (NAG/AG). Despite phylogenetic analyses revealing that genome-wide clustering was primarily driven by geographic lineage rather than disease stage, HpRS achieved strong discrimination in repeated cross-validation (mean AUC = 0.902, 95% CI: 0.892 to 0.912), remained discriminatory in an internal held-out set (AUC = 0.780), and generalized to two independent cohorts (Bacterial and Viral Bioinformatics Resource Center (BV-BRC): AUC = 0.871; hospital cohort distinguishing IM vs. NAG/AG: AUC = 0.843). Predictive single-nucleotide polymorphisms mapped mainly to core functions (DNA repair, translation, and central and lipid metabolism) and often affected conserved domains, suggesting a polygenic architecture and generating testable functional hypotheses. HpRS provides a proof-of-principle framework for strain-aware risk stratification and may complement future gastric cancer prevention strategies."},{"t":"可逆热驱动解锁软生物电子学的微创植入和回收","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73685?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Minimally invasive delivery of bioelectronics is currently limited by the irreversibility of deployment, rendering device retrieval traumatic and hindering clinical translation. Here, for the first time, we introduce a novel thermoresponsive, reversible‐actuating polymer (Trap) that enables both minimally invasive implantation and retrieval. Trap exhibits a mechanistically unique dual‐crystalline competition between (110)‐oriented low‐entropy crystals and (100)‐oriented high‐entropy crystals. The competitive crystallization governs bidirectional, stress‐free shape memory within a human‐compatible window (10°C–37°C), enabling rapid (&lt;3 s), fatigue‐resistant, and large reversible strain (∼30.17%). The solid–solid switching between two nanocrystalline states provides a robust and tunable actuation mode, allowing Trap to transition reversibly between compact 1D and functional 2D/3D geometries without mechanical loading. This materials’ innovation directly enables microinvasive deployment and retraction of Trap‐based neural electrodes through the same small incision (∼5 mm), as well as autonomous helical self‐assembly and thermal detachment on peripheral nerves, achieving stable electrophysiological interfacing over weeks to months. This work establishes a material‐centered framework for reversible biointerfaces, resolving the conflict between surgical invasiveness and device retrievability.","tp":"热响应聚合","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了首个热响应可逆驱动聚合物Trap，可实现软生物电子器件的微创植入和无创回收。Trap通过(110)低熵晶体与(100)高熵晶体之间的独特双晶竞争机制实现可逆形变，解决了传统植入器件取出时组织创伤的难题，为生物电子器件的临床转化扫除了关键障碍。"},{"t":"恢复因睡眠不足而中断的长期社会认可记忆","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adu9805?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Long-term social memories are vital for forming and maintaining relationships, and social amnesia can disrupt daily life. Using a new paradigm to study these hippocampus-dependent memories, we show that mice can distinguish between multiple social experiences even when they occur in the same context across days. Sleep deprivation immediately after socialization disrupts memory consolidation, leading to social amnesia. Treatment with the Food and Drug Administration–approved phosphodiesterase type 4 inhibitor roflumilast during sleep deprivation protects memory consolidation, while administration immediately before testing reverses social amnesia temporarily. Optogenetic reactivation of dentate gyrus engram cells restores social memory access and enables selective retrieval of individual memories. In addition, using two cFos-based engram-tagging strategies, we find that sleep deprivation selectively affects reactivation of experience-specific engrams while not affecting engram formation or overlap. These results suggest that impaired engram reactivation contributes to sleep deprivation–induced social amnesia and highlights the role of the hippocampal dentate gyrus in maintaining and distinguishing social experiences in a single context."},{"t":"用葡萄糖驱动的共生生物可吸收绷带恢复内源电场以促进糖尿病伤口愈合","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9445?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Endogenous electric fields (EFs) are essential for tissue regeneration but are diminished under hyperglycemia conditions, thereby impeding diabetic wound healing. Here, we report a biodegradable, glucose-powered electronic fabric bandage (GEB) that restores wound-edge electrical fields and enables closed-loop wound healing. To avoid compromising clinical applicability, we integrated all components into a soft, lightweight, and breathable bandage design to replace the traditional bulky electrical stimulator design. We also show the universal glucose-powered electricity generation and therapeutic functions of the electronic bandage across species and organs in diabetic wound models. In diabetic mouse wounds, porcine skin defects, and intestinal injury, the bandage uses endogenous glucose for power generation, thereby reducing local glucose levels and restoring the endogenous EF that guided cell migration, reprogrammed macrophage polarization, and promoted angiogenesis, to accelerate wound healing. These findings should establish an “endogenous glucose-powered symbiotic bioelectronics” paradigm for next-generation bioelectronic medicine.","tp":"电子伤口贴","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员开发了一种葡萄糖驱动的可降解电子织物绷带（GEB），通过将糖尿病伤口中过量的葡萄糖转化为电能，恢复伤口边缘内源电场，实现闭环伤口愈合。该绷带柔软轻便透气，替代了传统笨重的电刺激设备，兼具临床适用性与生物可吸收性，为糖尿病慢性伤口治疗提供了新策略。"},{"t":"通过合成NAD+型辅因子重编程NAD(P)+结合蛋白实现亚胺生物催化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2116720?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"将非天然催化基序高效嵌入蛋白骨架是人工酶设计的核心难题。该研究通过对NAD(P)+结合蛋白进行重编程，借助合成辅因子在蛋白内部构建亚胺离子(iminium)催化活性位点，实现非生物有机反应的酶促化。该策略拓展了生物催化反应空间，在不对称合成与绿色化学领域具有重要应用潜力。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"人工酶生物催化","kp":["[合成辅因子]: 苯胺腺嘌呤二核苷酸AnAD","[催化功能]: 引入亚胺催化活性"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Reprogramming NAD(P)+‐Binding Proteins for Iminium Biocatalysis via a Synthetic NAD+‐Type Cofactor","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient integration of non‐natural catalytic motifs into protein scaffolds remains a central challenge in artificial enzyme design. Here we report aniline adenine dinucleotide (AnAD), a NAD\n                    +\n                    ‐type synthetic cofactor in which the native nicotinamide is replaced by a catalytically active aniline unit. When incorporated into diverse NAD(P)\n                    +\n                    ‐binding proteins, AnAD introduces an iminium catalysis mechanism that enables tandem Friedel‐Crafts alkylation‐enantioselective protonation reactions. Screening a panel of natural protein scaffolds revealed broad intrinsic compatibility, while protein engineering further enhanced activity and stereoselectivity, affording artificial enzymes with good substrate generality and tunable enantioselectivity. Mechanistic studies showed that cooperation between AnAD and protein microenvironments, particularly dynamic active‐site loop motions, governs both reactivity and enantioselectivity. These results demonstrate the generality and robustness of reprogramming ubiquitous NAD(P)\n                    +\n                    ‐binding proteins for new‐to‐nature biotransformations using NAD\n                    +\n                    ‐type synthetic cofactors.","aip":1},{"t":"伊拉克、沙特阿拉伯和西班牙的可再生能源政策分析：使用 HOMER 和文件进行多维评估","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003654?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"清洁能源策","sc":2.4,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"通过氨基硅氧烷功能接枝调节环保型纤维素基复合电解质的锂离子传导","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71171?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cellulose‐based electrolytes are promising solid electrolyte candidates for low‐cost and eco‐friendly batteries owing to their natural characteristics of being renewable and biodegradable. Unfortunately, they have strong reactivity and high crystallinity, leading to critical challenges when used in Li‐ion batteries, including poor high‐voltage tolerance, slow Li‐ion conduction and heterogeneous Li‐ion flux. Here, we report a functional grafting modification to regulate Li‐ion conduction within cellulose‐based solid electrolytes. In‐situ sol‐gel self‐assembly accompanied by amino‐siloxane grafting is developed to achieve the homogeneous integration of cellulose−amino‐siloxane−ionic liquid composites, forming a compact solid‐state electrolyte membrane. Such functional design establishes continuous and uniform Li‐ion transport highways through amino coordination while disrupting native crystallinity of cellulose, endowing a rapid Li‐ion conductivity (1×10\n                    −3\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    ) and a high electrochemical oxidation potential (5 V). The obtained electrolyte membrane features a homogenous microstructure with high mechanical elasticity and thermodynamic stability, exhibiting high compatibility with Li metal and enabling excellent electrochemical performance. Consequently, solid‐state Li‐metal batteries exhibit exceptional cycle‐life, whereas LiFePO\n                    4\n                    cells run 592 cycles and LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    cells run 403 cycles at 0.5 C rate until the capacity reduces to 80%. Notably, a comprehensive life‐cycle assessment verifies its advantages in energy conservation and carbon reduction. It presents a sustainable development of high‐performance cellulose‐based solid‐state electrolytes.","tp":"固态锂电解","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队通过氨基硅氧烷功能接枝策略改性纤维素基复合电解质，有效抑制了纤维素的高结晶度和副反应，显著提升了锂离子传导速率和高压耐受性，实现了均匀的锂离子通量。该策略将低成本、可再生的纤维素转化为性能优异的固态电解质候选材料，推动环保型电池发展。"},{"t":"不同配体双核钴催化剂实现炔烃的区域发散性氢锗化反应","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6685709?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"报道双核钴催化剂实现的炔烃区域发散性氢锗化反应。通过双金属协同催化策略精确控制锗基团的加成位置，可分别获得α-和β-选择性产物，为有机锗化合物的原子经济性合成提供高效新途径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双核钴催化氢锗化","kp":["[催化剂]: 双核钴配不同配体","[反应]: 区域发散性炔烃氢锗化"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Regiodivergent Hydrogermylation of Alkynes Enabled by Dinuclear Cobalt Catalysts Bearing Different Ligands","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Transition‐metal‐catalyzed hydrogermylation of alkynes represents an ideal atom‐economical method to prepare vinylgermanes that are valuable reagents in medicinal chemistry, material science and organic synthesis. Nevertheless, its development―particularly in achieving high regioselectivity with earth‐abundant 3d metal catalysts―remains as a formidable challenge. Herein, we report regiodivergent hydrogermylation reactions of alkynes employing structure well‐defined dicobalt carbonyl complexes as catalysts: the reaction using [(IPent)Co\n                    2\n                    (CO)\n                    7\n                    ] (IPent = 1,3‐di(2,6‐di(pentan‐3‐yl)phenyl)imidazol‐2‐ylidene) affords selectively\n                    α\n                    ‐vinylgermanes, whereas that with [(Xantphos)Co\n                    2\n                    (CO)\n                    6\n                    ] (Xantphos = (9,9‐dimethyl‐9\n                    H\n                    ‐xanthene‐4,5‐diyl)bis(diphenylphosphane) yields selectively\n                    β‐\n                    (\n                    E\n                    )‐vinylgermanes. Both cobalt catalysts effect the hydrogermylation of alkyl‐ and aryl‐substituted terminal alkynes with tertiary hydrogermanes with good functional group compatibility in good to high yields and selectivity. Mechanistic studies establish alkyne‐bridged dicobalt carbonyl species as the active intermediates in both catalytic systems and the distinct steric nature of the metalloligands LCo (L = IPent, Xantphos) governs the observed regiodivergent selectivity. The application of these dicobalt‐catalysts to alkyne hydroelementation reactions allows the selective preparation of different configurational isomers of vinylgermanes/silanes that can be further utilized for the stereoselective synthesis of alkene derivatives."},{"t":"氧化还原化学赋能水系铵离子电池实现高容量和超长循环寿命","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6628239?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"提出基于氧化还原化学策略的水系铵离子电池，通过调控电极材料的可逆氧化还原行为，实现高比容量和超长循环寿命。水系电解质兼顾低成本、高离子电导率和安全性，在大规模储能领域具有应用潜力。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水系铵离子电池","kp":["[电极材料]: 普鲁士蓝类似物","[电池类型]: 水系铵离子电池","[特性]: 超长循环寿命"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Redox Chemistry Enables Excellent Capacity and Ultra Long Life Aqueous Ammonium Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ammonium‐ion batteries are promising for energy storage with low cost, high ionic conductivity, and excellent safety. However, their long‐term cycling stability is far from the industrial application expectation owing the lack of suitable electrode materials. Here, we report the redox chemistry enables excellent capacity and ultra long life of Prussian blue analogues as performant electrode materials by regulating their t\n                    2g\n                    e\n                    g\n                    occupancy of M’ d‐orbitals. This work shows that the electronic configuration of M’ is crucial for redox reversibility, structural robustness, and ultimately tolerance for NH\n                    4\n                    +\n                    storage stability. For (NH\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    NiFe(CN)\n                    6\n                    , the metallic center with fully filled t\n                    2g\n                    orbitals ensures the stable structure, while the half‐filled e\n                    g\n                    orbitals in the high‐spin states enhance the axial transport of electrons. As a result, the key metric for the best one (NH\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    NiFe(CN)\n                    6\n                    delivers a reversible capacity of ∼70 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    , superior rate performance, and outstanding long‐life performance, sustaining stable output for over 10 000 h at 100 mA g\n                    −1\n                    and 30 000 cycles at 1000 mA g\n                    −1\n                    . In situ XRD and first‐principles calculations further confirm highly reversible redox processes. This study presents a novel and effective strategy for improving the performance and stability of electrode materials, offering valuable insights for the development of next‐generation energy storage systems.","aip":1},{"t":"通过纳米限制中的超分子聚合重定向激发态质子转移","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7594145?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The photoluminescence of photoacids in supramolecular assemblies provides crucial insights into proton transfer (PT) processes within biologically relevant confinement. In this work, we present a strategy to activate intermolecular excited‐state PT within the hydrophobic cavities of cyclodextrin‐based nanotubes. Activation is achieved using a specifically designed amphoteric emitter which undergoes a pKa inversion in the photoexcited state. Despite this photophysical behavior, intramolecular PT does not occur due to the spatial separation between the proton donor and acceptor sites in the compound. However, in the presence of γ‐cyclodextrin, the photoacid assembles into guest pairs, enabling pre‐organized PT between neighboring molecules. The effects of confinement on photostability, emission lifetime, and quantum yield indicate a mechanistic shift from excited‐state protolytic dissociation to intermolecular excited‐state PT. Spectroscopic investigation of the assembly mechanism and solvent isotope effect further supports the role of a template effect, reminiscent of enzymatic activation, in facilitating PT in the excited state.","tp":"质子转移研","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队提出在环糊精基纳米管疏水腔内激活分子间激发态质子转移的新策略，利用具有pKa反转特性的两亲性发光体克服了疏水环境的限制。该工作揭示了纳米限域空间中超分子组装体内的质子转移机制，对理解生物体系中受限条件下的质子传输过程具有重要意义。"},{"t":"纤维状水系锌离子电池研究进展：从结构、原理、问题到策略","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71175?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","as":"纤维状水系锌离子电池（FAZIBs）因其高安全性、柔性和可穿戴适配性，被视为下一代柔性储能器件的有力候选。该综述系统梳理了FAZIBs的结构设计原理、工作机制及关键组件（纤维电极、凝胶电解质等），涵盖一维纤维构型的构建策略与电化学性能优化路径。重点讨论了锌负极枝晶生长、正极材料容量衰减及界面稳定性等核心瓶颈，并展望了规模化编织、多器件集成及实际可穿戴应用前景。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"纤维状锌离子电池","kp":["[电池类型]: 纤维状水系锌离子电池","[挑战]: 锌枝晶/析氢/机械耦合"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Recent Advances of Fiber‐Shaped Aqueous Zinc Ion Batteries: From Structure, Principles, Issues to Strategies","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Fiber‐shaped aqueous zinc‐ion batteries (FAZIBs) have been regarded as highly promising power supplying devices for wearable and flexible electronics because of their intrinsic safety, low cost, lightweight nature, and excellent flexibility. However, their practical development is still hindered by coupled electrochemical and mechanical issues, including Zn dendrite growth, H\n                    2\n                    evolution, surface passivation, cathode materials dissolution and shedding, and electrode/electrolyte interfacial separation under deformation. This review provides a critical and comprehensive overview of recent progresses in FAZIBs from composition, structural design, working principles, failure mechanisms, to mitigation strategies. First, the components of FAZIBs, including fibrous Zn anodes, fibrous cathodes, gel electrolytes, encapsulation materials, and device architectures, are systematically discussed. Then, the energy storage and flexibility‐related mechanisms are analyzed to clarify the intrinsic correlation between electrochemical behavior and mechanical adaptability. Subsequently, the major degradation pathways limiting the performance and durability of FAZIBs are summarized. Representative strategies, including rational design of flexible Zn anodes, gel‐electrolyte regulation, cathode stabilization, and interface optimization, are further highlighted. Finally, the remaining scientific challenges and future research directions are outlined. This review is expected to supply some useful guidance for the rational design of next‐generation FAZIBs with high energy density, excellent flexibility, and long‐term stability."},{"t":"在未来的 BNL 电子离子对撞机上利用偏振离子束实现科学计划","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/261w-8f38","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Grigor Atoian et al. (EPIOS Scientific Consortium)Spin utilization in large particle accelerators is a young quantum technology, with practical realization only emerging in the late twentieth century. Polarized ion beams at the future Electron Ion Collider (EIC) are essential to address some of the most important open questions at the twenty-first-century frontiers of our understanding of the fundamental structure of matter. How does the proton spin of 1/2 arise from the highly relativistic constituent quarks and gluons and their interactions via QCD? Are the quark and gluon nucleon spin distributions modified inside the nucleus? Can exotic gluons exist in the nucleus? Beyond these questions, polarized electron and ion beams are crucial for unravelling the full three-dimensional structure of the nucleon and of nuclei. This Perspective paper summarizes the science case and identifies polarized ion beams as the critical technology enabling the experiments that address these questions. The authors further discuss the required ion polarimetry and spin manipulation at the EIC, and identify a significant R&D effort, involving both national laboratories and universities, that will be required over roughly a decade to realize the polarized ion beams.[Phys. Rev. C 113, 060501] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"用于噪声量子电路模拟的实时符号问题抑制量子蒙特卡洛算法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/wzcr-m8xb","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","as":"量子蒙特卡洛（QMC）模拟常受符号问题困扰，且真实量子设备噪声会严重干扰结果。该研究提出一种实时、符号问题受控的QMC算法，可在含噪声量子器件上模拟开放量子系统的实时动力学演化。该方法通过将噪声效应纳入蒙特卡洛采样框架，有效抑制符号震荡，为当前NISQ时代量子硬件上的非平凡动力学模拟提供了新的经典-量子混合计算路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子电路蒙特卡洛","kp":["[算法]: 实时符号问题抑制量子蒙特卡洛","[适用]: 开放量子系统马尔可夫/非马尔可夫"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Real-Time Sign-Problem-Suppressed Quantum Monte Carlo Algorithm for Noisy Quantum Circuit Simulations","b":"Author(s): Tong Shen and Daniel A. LidarWe present a real-time quantum Monte Carlo algorithm that simulates the dynamics of open quantum systems by stochastically compressing and evolving the density matrix under both Markovian and non-Markovian master equations. Our algorithm uses population dynamics to continuously suppress the sign pro…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230601] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"气相金属团簇的反应性：揭示小分子活化与转化机制","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73550?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"甲烷、氮气等小分子热力学极其稳定，其活化与转化是多相催化领域的经典难题。该综述聚焦气相金属团簇这一独特研究平台，探讨了金属团簇在活化CH₄、N₂等惰性分子过程中的反应机理与尺寸效应。气相团簇消除了载体干扰，可从原子分子层面揭示催化活性位点的本质规律，为理性设计高效催化剂提供了机理洞察，对天然气转化和合成氨等领域具有指导价值。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"金属团簇小分子活化","kp":["[小分子活化]: 气相金属团簇在无干扰环境研究CH4/N2/CO2活化机制"],"sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Reactivity of Gas‐Phase Metal Clusters: Unlocking Mechanisms of Activation and Conversion of Small Molecules","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Activation and conversion of very stable and abundantly available molecules such as methane (CH\n                    4\n                    ), nitrogen (N\n                    2\n                    ), carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ), and so on into value‐added products under mild conditions represents a critical issue in energy and environmental chemistry. Gas‐phase cluster reactivity studies, conducted in isolated and interference‐free environments, can provide fundamental insights into the activation and transformation of inert chemical bonds at a molecular‐level, thereby informing the rational design of efficient catalysts. This perspective article summarizes the research progress over the past five years in the activation and conversion of CH\n                    4\n                    , N\n                    2\n                    , CO\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    (\n                    x\n                    = 1 and 2), and other molecules mediated by gas‐phase metal clusters investigated by both the traditional experimental/theoretical methods and the emerging techniques based on artificial intelligence. Novel reaction pathways covering both elementary and catalytic reactions as well as new electronic and geometric factors governing metal cluster reactivity have been introduced. Machine learning models constructed for the quantitative structure‐activity relationship of metal clusters that enable the rapid and reliable reactivity prediction of metal clusters have also been presented. These fruitful results offer fresh perspectives for practical catalytic systems and are helpful to develop advanced catalytic materials for the transformation of CH\n                    4\n                    , N\n                    2\n                    , CO\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    , and other molecules under mild conditions."},{"t":"RNF126 是一种过氧化物酶体命运开关，可实现肝细胞癌的再分化治疗","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535777123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Tumor hypoxia promotes dedifferentiation and metabolic reprogramming in hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC), undermining normal liver functions. Here, we identify the E3 ubiquitin ligase RNF126 as a hypoxia-inducible “peroxisomal fate” switch that links the hypoxic microenvironment to loss of hepatocyte differentiation. Under hypoxia, HIF-2α drives RNF126 expression, which in turn ubiquitinates the peroxisomal membrane transporter ABCD3, triggering selective peroxisome autophagy (pexophagy) and depletion of peroxisomes. This organelle loss ablates very-long-chain fatty acid β-oxidation and hydrogen peroxide detoxification, erasing key hepatocyte differentiation features. We show that genetic RNF126 ablation restores peroxisomal functions and impairs hypoxic HCC growth. Leveraging these insights, we developed a small-molecule RNF126 inhibitor, D665-1412, which selectively blocks hypoxia-induced pexophagy. D665-1412 treatment stabilizes peroxisomes, normalizes lipid metabolism, and reactivates hepatocytic differentiation markers, thereby “redifferentiating” HCC cells and suppressing tumor progression in vitro and in vivo. Our findings establish the HIF-2α–RNF126–ABCD3 axis as a driver of HCC dedifferentiation and present organelle-targeted redifferentiation therapy as a promising approach for liver cancer."},{"t":"光伏温室能源管理的量子增强预测与优化调度","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007944?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子能源管理","kp":["[应用]: 光伏温室能源管理","[方法]: 量子增强预测+优化调度"],"dp":1,"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Quantum-enhanced forecasting and optimal scheduling for energy management in photovoltaic greenhouses"},{"t":"基于熵惩罚方法的非线性Hamilton-Jacobi方程粘性解的量子算法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607144123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子哈密顿方程","kp":["[方法]: 熵惩罚法求解HJ方程粘性解"],"dp":1,"as":"本文提出一种基于熵的量子算法框架，用于高效提取非线性哈密顿-雅可比方程的黏性解。该方法将经典偏微分方程求解问题映射到量子计算平台，有望在求解复杂非线性动力学方程时实现指数级加速，为流体力学、最优控制等领域提供新工具。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quantum algorithms for viscosity solutions to nonlinear Hamilton–Jacobi equations based on an entropy penalization metho","b":"We present a framework for efficient extraction of the viscosity solutions of nonlinear Hamilton–Jacobi equations with convex Hamiltonians. These viscosity solutions play a central role in areas such as front propagation, mean-field games, optimal control, machine learning, and a direct application to the forced Burgers’ equation. Our method is based on an entropy penalization method which generalizes the Cole–Hopf transform from quadratic to general convex Hamiltonians, allowing an approximation of viscous Hamilton–Jacobi dynamics by a discrete-time linear dynamics which approximates a linear heat-like parabolic equation, and thus can also extend to continuous-time dynamics. This makes the method suitable for quantum simulation. The validity of these results hold for arbitrary nonlinearity that correspond to convex Hamiltonians, and for arbitrarily long times, thus obviating a chief obstacle in most quantum algorithms for nonlinear partial differential equations. We provide quantum algorithms—both analog and digital—for extracting pointwise values, gradients, minima, and function evaluations at the minimizer of the viscosity solution, without requiring nonlinear updates or full state reconstruction."},{"t":"量子点电激发水平的定量研究以缓解电致发光效率滚降","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73638?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"该研究聚焦量子点发光二极管（QLED）中量子点的电激发水平，系统量化了电致发光效率衰减的根源。通过精确表征量子点在器件中的激发态分布与电荷注入行为，提出缓解效率滚降的策略，对提升QLED显示与照明器件性能具有指导意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子点电激发特性","kp":["[QD-LED效率]: 量化电激发水平以抑制电致发光效率滚降","[器件评估]: 电激发水平分析法评估器件质量"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quantifying the Electrical Excitation Level of Quantum Dots for Mitigating Electroluminescent Efficiency Roll‐Off","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Understanding the electrical excitation level of quantum dots in light‐emitting diodes (LEDs) constitutes a central aspect of investigations into device mechanisms. However, practical research is hindered by the absence of straightforward and viable analytical methodologies. In this study, we present an approach for assessing device quality by examining the electrical excitation level of quantum dots in conjunction with carrier injection balance. Through quantitative modeling of electroluminescent intensity and the average number of excitons (&lt;\n                    N\n                    &gt;) generated under electrical excitation, key parameters that manifest the current utilization efficiency can be extracted, providing a guideline to inform device optimization strategies. As a proof of concept, the efficiency roll‐off of blue‐emitting perovskite quantum dot LEDs is theoretically analyzed. Combining electrically excited transient absorption spectroscopy, hole leakage is identified as the main cause of low current utilization efficiency. Mitigating carrier injection imbalance via enhancing electron injection, the blue device simultaneously achieves a high brightness of over 11 000 cd m\n                    −2\n                    and a maximum EQE of 26.0%, representing state‐of‐the‐art blue perovskite LEDs."},{"t":"燃煤电厂集成熔盐储热的二次规划非线性模型预测控制","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008007?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/火电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"火电熔盐集成","kp":["[系统集成]: 燃煤电厂+熔盐蓄热","[控制方法]: 二次规划非线性模型预测控制"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quadratic programming-based nonlinear model predictive control of coal-fired power plant integrated with molten salt the"},{"t":"平衡磁振子轨道角动量的正确理论","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/fgt6-bhmq","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Junyu Tang and Ran ChengThe orbital motion of chargeless bosons, unlike that of electrons, does not generate a magnetic moment and thus cannot directly interact with magnetic fields. To formulate the orbital angular momentum (OAM) of magnons, we first identify its proper conjugate variable by considering the Aharonov-Cashe…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236702] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"ZSM-5沸石限域均匀银纳米颗粒促进末端炔烃CO2转化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1541233?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"该研究利用ZSM-5沸石限域的均匀银纳米颗粒催化剂，促进CO₂与端基炔烃的羧化反应，实现稳定的C-C键构建。沸石孔道限域效应使银纳米颗粒尺寸均一、活性位点可控，显著提升CO₂转化的催化效率与选择性，为温室气体资源化利用提供新路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"沸石银催化CO2转化","kp":["[催化剂]: ZSM-5沸石限域均匀Ag纳米颗粒","[CO2转化]: 末端炔烃羧化生成不饱和多碳羧酸","[C-H键活化]: 直接C-H键活化构建C-C键"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Promoting CO2 Conversion With Terminal Alkynes Over ZSM‐5 Zeolite‐Confined Uniform Ag Nanoparticles","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Heterogeneous catalysis‐mediated terminal alkyne carboxylation enabled the construction of stable C─C bonds via direct C─H bond activation, achieving efficient conversion of CO\n                    2\n                    into unsaturated carboxylic multi‐carbon derivatives, and providing a new route for artificial carbon fixation and the synthesis of multifunctional chemicals. However, designing heterogenous catalysts with highly efficient, uniformed, stable active sites for this solid‐liquid‐gas three‐phase systems remained a significant challenge. Herein, we proposed a solvent‐assist hydrothermal method to synthesis 6–7 nm uniformed Ag nanoparticles in ZSM‐5 (Ag\n                    NP\n                    ‐ZSM5). Ag\n                    NP\n                    ‐ZSM5 exhibited a yield of 90% and a TOF of 306 h\n                    −1\n                    in 4 h alkynes carboxylation reaction. The excellent CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption capacity of ZSM‐5, together with the metal‐support interaction (MSI) between Ag nanoparticles and the ZSM‐5 support, jointly enhanced the intrinsic activity of the alkyne carboxylation reaction. This work not only proposed an innovative strategy for synthesizing uniform nanoparticles within zeolites, but also provided a new approach to facilitate the industrial application of terminal alkyne carboxylation."},{"t":"用于高血糖和高血糖代谢性疾病多器官靶向的肽治疗药物的程序性口服给药","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef3323?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Systemic metabolic disorders such as diabetes and hyperuricemia demand multiorgan therapeutic intervention, yet single-target therapies often fail to restore homeostasis. Here, we present an orally administered, multistage-targeted nanoplatform (P1P2NPs) for the sequential delivery of therapeutic peptides to distinct organs. P1P2NPs is composed of a bioresponsive polymer poly(β-amino ester)-disulfide bond-poly(carboxybetaine) (PAE-SS-PCB), 1,2-distearoyl-\n                    sn\n                    -glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine-block poly(carboxybetaine) (DSPE-PCB) and Eudragit L100-55, designed to release peptide P2 (Val-Pro-Tyr-Pro-Gln) in the intestine for dipeptidyl peptidase-IV (DPP-IV) inhibition, while hepatic-targeted peptide P1(Pro-Pro-Lys-Asn-Trp) is selectively liberated in the liver to suppress xanthine oxidase (XOD). Fabricated through sequential emulsification and layer-by-layer assembly, P1P2NPs exhibit spatiotemporal control over drug release, enabling precise modulation of intestinal and hepatic metabolic pathways. In a murine model of diabetic-hyperuricemia comorbidity, the nanoplatform demonstrated synergistic efficacy by normalizing glucose and uric acid levels through multiorgan targeting. This work establishes a paradigm for spatially controlled peptide delivery, offering a versatile strategy for treating complex metabolic diseases.","tp":"纳米药递送","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了口服多级靶向纳米平台P1P2NPs，由生物响应聚合物PAE-SS-PCB构成，可程序化递送治疗肽至不同器官，实现对糖尿病和高尿酸血症等多系统代谢疾病的多器官序贯治疗。该平台突破了单一靶点疗法的局限，为恢复代谢稳态提供了系统性治疗新范式。"},{"t":"通过机械折纸编码联锁 3D Kirigami 和纳米根锚定 AgNWs-In-Ga 实现可编程 3D 光伏","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523685?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  3D photovoltaics (3DPVs) are highly promising for next‐generation energy systems, as they maximize space utilization and power output. However, most reported 3DPVs remain unsuitable for deformable applications. When 3DPVs are integrated with mechanically deformable platforms, a fundamental trade‐off emerges: achieving large mechanical stretchability typically leads to a reduction in areal coverage. Here, we present a single‐material, mechanically origami‐coded 3D kirigami platform that enables programmable 3DPVs with unprecedented stretchability and areal coverage. Origami, which transforms 2D geometries into 3D forms, provides an effective structural strategy to overcome the long‐standing trade‐off between stretchability and areal coverage. Leveraging this concept, we introduce an origami‐inspired mechanical coding scheme that embeds programmable folding behavior into the structure. A simple extension–release cycle drives unit folding initiation and full origami activation, achieving ultrahigh stretchability (500%) and initial effective areal coverage (225%), while maintaining stable photovoltaic output under extreme deformation and repeated cycling. To ensure reliable electrical integration, an intrinsically integrable nano‐root anchored AgNWs–In–Ga multiphasic alloy conductor was co‐fabricated with the structure, providing stable conductivity and enabling reversible stack‐and‐connect operation. This approach highlights geometric programmability as a key enabler for freeform photovoltaics, establishing a pathway toward multifunctional 3D energy systems for adaptive devices, and urban energy harvesting.","tp":"可编程光伏","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队提出单材料机械折纸编码的3D剪纸结构，结合纳米根锚定的AgNWs-In-Ga电极，实现可编程3D光伏器件。该设计突破了可变形应用中机械拉伸性与面积覆盖率的根本矛盾，在保持高面积覆盖率的同时实现大机械可拉伸性，为可穿戴和柔性能源系统开辟新路径。","aip":1},{"t":"产能而非政治、资本支出而非产能——定义美国太阳能制造业的新指标 - pv magazine全球版","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/production-not-politics-capex-not-capacity-the-new-metrics-defining-u-s-solar-manufacturing/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"本文分析美国太阳能光伏制造业的新趋势，指出衡量竞争力的核心指标已从单纯产能转向实际产量与资本支出效率。在政策补贴与贸易壁垒交织的背景下，文章评估了美国本土光伏制造的经济可行性与技术路线选择，认为产业链本土化仍面临成本与规模双重挑战。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"光伏制造","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Production not politics, capex not capacity – the new metrics defining U.S. solar manufacturing - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nThe landscape for solar PV manufacturing in the United States is set to move from bystander-curiosity to manufacturing-scrutiny. Finlay Coville explores how this transition has come about, why the existing analysis of the manufacturing space has been largely superficial until now, and what tracking a capital expenditure (capex) heavy manufacturing sector looks like in practice.\nFinlay Colville\nMarkets & Policy\nTechnology & Products\nImage: Boviet Solar\nThe landscape for solar PV manufacturing in the United States is set to change radically from 2027 onwards, with the domestic sector moving from bystander-curiosity to manufacturing-scrutiny.\nThis article explores how this transition has come about, why the existing analysis of the manufacturing space has been largely superficial until now, and what tracking a capital expenditure (capex) heavy manufacturing sector looks like in practice.\nThe themes discussed form the basis of the new\nSolar Manufacturing USA 2026\nevent in Austin, Texas on 22-23 September 2026 – the first event to be staged in the United States specific to domestic PV manufacturing investment, production, and related equipment and materials supply chains.\nMethodology to accurately track and analyse technology manufacturing sectors is well understood.\nMy education here was founded about 15-20 years ago – a time when annual solar industry deployment was measured in the gigawatts range and market analysis in the sector was broadly confined to tracking technology variants and end-market demand.\nThe PV industry at this time was dominated by research activities, with limited investments into ‘commercial’ mass production facilities, mainly from the early movers in Japan.\nLuckily, I was surrounded at the time (2005 to 2010) by some superb market analysts that were covering the semiconductor and flat panel display sectors. The scrutiny on detail here was incredible, but the stakes were much higher given the maturity of these sectors.\nIn the semiconductor and flat panel industries, every capacity expansion phase, for any company at a given time, was dissected by process flow stage and tool type involved. In addition to providing phased production line ramp-up by quarter (sometimes even monthly), the focus on production tools and process flows then fed into a bottom-up analysis of capex and operating expenditure (opex) that I had never seen before.\nCritically also, this type of analysis generates the addressable markets on offer to equipment and materials suppliers, in addition to companies involved in new facility builds (for example, EPC contractors or specialist gas suppliers).\nThe U.S. solar manufacturing space today is moving quickly to form a domestic manufacturing ecosystem. While the production equipment, coming from new capex, is still being served by tool makers from Asia and Europe, the materials demand – coming from raw materials supply for fab production – is being onshored as real hubs evolve today.\nSince we launched the new\nSolar Manufacturing USA 2026\nevent – and outlined the scope of the event in terms of\ncapex, opex and factory investments\n– it has been fascinating to see many domestic U.S. companies reach out to us, each looking at the new production landscape as a credible addressable market for newly created business units. Some of these questions have come from start-ups, for example pre-empting materials demand from a thriving ingot or cell production sector; others from business units within established materials companies that are household names.\nFor both equipment and materials suppliers, the interest speaks volumes for the prospects of the solar manufacturing sector in the United States coming to fruition over the coming years. However, market commentary until now has not offered the types of answers these companies need to build up confidence to fully commit to the sector.\nSuch market intel comes directly from the type of manufacturing rigor outlined earlier, by doing a bottom-up analysis of company-specific capex and technology/process-flow operations.\nTo illustrate how this works, I now outline a couple of examples. One for capex, one for opex and related materials demand.\nMy first activities as a PV market analyst were heavily grounded in capex studies. Capex is the most important leading indicator in the PV industry today, with only one other metric offering even greater visibility; equipment supplier book-to-bills. Anyone that has ever tracked semiconductor capital spending will know this all too well.\nEquipment supplier book-to-bill ratios can even forecast manufacturing cycles (upturns and downturns) 12-18 months out. Also, if the book-to-bill analysis is segmented further at the tool level, they can highlight technology shifts ahead of mass production metrics showing up. Nothing comes anywhere close to book-to-bill visibility in a capital-intensive manufacturing sector.\nBack in the day, before China dominated PV equipment supply, a select group of ‘Western’ tool makers provided all the equipment for the solar manufacturing segment. Moreover, at this time, company reporting from these (mostly listed) entities had tool bookings and revenues centre stage in investor calls and filings.\nA trip down memory lane during the 2012 to 2014 period when I routinely discussed PV equipment spending, forecasting the first PV manufacturing downturn at the time, shows how incredibly useful book-to-bill analyses of PV equipment suppliers can be. A few of the articles I wrote on pv magazine at the time confirm this:\nWhen will PV equipment spending rebound?\nNew solar PV capital expenditure set to rise in 2015\nA cautious approach to PV technology change\n. The entire journey of the first PV manufacturing downturn of 2012-2014 and subsequent uptick from 2015 was clearly forecast then purely by looking at the equipment book-to-bill ratios of the leading PV equipment suppliers in the space at the time.\nHowever, when equipment supply became a China-owned phenomenon, book-to-bill research ended. Bookings, or new order intake, is not a metric featuring on Chinese accounting standards. Regulatory requirements only force bookings to be announced if the full contract value exceeds a prior reporting year revenue threshold level or is ‘related party’ connected. Otherwise, billings – or revenues recognized – are the only useful takeaway from half-year and annual reporting; useful but mostly in hindsight for market-share allocations.\nTherefore, since about 2015, capex has become the de facto metric-of-choice for any PV manufacturing research analyst looking to forecast the landscape 1-2 years out.\nLet’s explain now what this looks like and why this underlying methodology is key to the U.S. PV manufacturing segment moving forward.\nThe build out of c-Si value-chain capacity outside China in recent years has largely revealed the leading PV equipment suppliers (all Chinese entities) of the past ten years to the outside world; companies that relaced the likes of Applied Materials, Meyer Burger, Centrotherm and GT Advanced Technologies that dominated PV equipment spending back in 2010.\nThe graph below shows how manufacturing capex can be correlated directly with equipment supplier market-share. In this case, I have added up the annual cell and module capex for PV manufacturing sites across Southeast Asia, India, the Middle East and Africa and the United States (the bars, scaled on the primary y-axis).\nThis is compared to the overseas-specific revenues for the seven of the main Chinese equipment companies that have been supplying these regions (the solid line, on the secondary y-axis); including the likes of Jinchen, Laplace, Maxwell, S.C New Energy and SC Solar. (Note that Horad is excluded from this analysis owing to its privately-held status.)\nA bottom-up analysis of manufacturer-specific capex offers the ideal route to understanding equipment supplier market shares and technologies being deployed.\nCapex for the above exercise was broken out to include only the PV equipment supplier allocations (removing infrastructure spending amounts). The correlation is good between manufacturer-capex and equipment-supplier-revenues, with this subset of seven Chinese PV equipment suppliers having about 40-50% share of the capex for overseas (non-China) cell and module spending over the period 2020 to 2025.\nHowever, capex comes to life when forecasting. Effectively this provides the served addressable markets for all tool suppliers. And if capex is broken out by technology and process flow, companies offering specific stand-alone tools can then see what the size and growth looks like for their offerings. No other methodology offers this level of forward-looking visibility and it is invaluable for business development purposes.\nAs the United States builds out its upstream capacity volumes across cells, wafers and ingots in the coming years, PV equipment suppliers will be driven to participate in the sector only by understanding the addressable markets on offer, ultimately framed through a systematic analysis bottom-up of the new facilities coming online and the technologies and process flows chosen.\nIn addition to the aforementioned Chinese tool suppliers active in this space, others stand to benefit, such as Leadmicro, Autowell, TT Vision and European equipment suppliers such as Rena, Von Ardenne, Innolas, and inspection-based companies.\nForecasting the demand for materials suppliers for the emerging U.S. domestic manufacturing sector comes directly from production forecasts, in contrast to the new factory-investment metrics that serve the equipment supply side.\nUntil now, the key raw materials (specifically module-based, including backsheets and films, solar glass and frames) have been sourced from Chinese materials suppliers’ bases in Southeast Asia.\nInterestingly, the rationale for these materials suppliers to have bases in Southeast Asia (mostly in Vietnam, Thailand and Malaysia) was simply to have production hubs in close proximity to the China-driven customer base that originally grew cell and module capacity in these three Southeast Asia locations: not to have bases in Southeast Asia to export products half way around the world to U.S. module factories, once the co-located cell and module exporting channels had been restricted through AD/CVD policies from the United States.\nHowever, as investments started to flow into new c-Si module fabs in the United States over the past few years, there was no clear domestic supply option.\nThis is illustrated clearly in the graphs below. First, showing the growth in U.S.-specific solar glass revenues from one of the industry’s dominant solar glass suppliers today – Flat Glass Group. The second graph show the uptick in PV module frames revenues from Yonz Technology, benefitting from the opportunities on offer from module production growth in India and the United States.\nDuring the initial growth phase of PV c-Si module production in the United States, the raw materials portion of solar glass supply has been provided by a select group of Chinese glass producers that had invested in overseas bases in Southeast Asia during China’s initial move to countries such as Vietnam, Thailand and Malaysia.\nChinese companies with bases producing PV module frames have benefited until now from demand coming from India and the United States. One of the leading suppliers to the United States in 2025 was Yonz Technology – meeting demand that is shifting now to domestic production of frames.\nAs new module materials suppliers in the United States enter the sector, the flow of supply from Southeast Asia (backsheets/films, glass and frames) will be driven out the market and there are many examples here of domestic U.S. production starting to have meaningful market-share gains.\nFor many of the companies seeking to grow business units for module materials supply, the main question here is market-opportunity. This came to the fore during Nextpower’s recent acquisition of Origami Solar in September 2025 to target the PV module frame supply opportunity, citing an addressable market in excess of $750 million in the United States alone. Given the expected uptick in module production from 2027 onwards, this figure may turn out somewhat conservative.\nNextpower would likely have developed this addressable market from its considerable in-house knowledge base. However, for many of the new entrants to the solar materials supply side in the United States – in particular those with new solutions – sizing the scale of the market opportunity is much harder.\nAs cell, wafer and ingot production is scaled next in the United States, these questions will only get more challenging in the absence of detailed bottom-up forecasting at the process flow and consumables level.\nIt has been heartening to see that there are so many companies looking at creating new business opportunities through supplying U.S. solar factories with raw materials and consumables in the coming years. These companies often have new ideas, not simply to plug the gap by replacing like-for-like offerings to Chinese materials producers in Southeast Asia today.\nProviding a forum for this essential part of the U.S. PV manufacturing ecosystem was one of the motivations for creating the new\nSolar Manufacturing USA 2026\nevent. For the U.S. manufacturing sector to thrive, these new materials suppliers need to share in the success too, helping move technology forward working with the manufacturers and R&D personnel directly.\nThis is what a credible and exciting technology manufacturing sector looks like. Complete with detailed capex and opex data to support investments. And having a dedicated conference and event that acts as the annual meeting place for the entire domestic manufacturing ecosystem.\nAs we build up to the\nSolar Manufacturing USA 2026\nevent in Austin, Texas on 22-23 September 2026, it would be great to hear from you about how the event can help address any gaps in knowledge that you think have been missing in the sector resulting from the lack of production for ingots, wafers and cells in the past decade.\nHopefully, this article has given more insights into why this new type of event was needed in the U.S. solar sector and why 2026 is the perfect year to start this. Looking forward to seeing everyone in Austin soon.\nFinlay Colville\nView author posts"},{"t":"预防癌症需要的不仅仅是一系列致癌物","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01847-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Letter to the Editor"},{"t":"精准医学的盲点：重新平衡证据基础以反映女性健康","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aei0515?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Precision medicine requires an evidence base that reflects women’s biology, demanding reforms in funding, study design, and sex-disaggregated reporting."},{"t":"基于信号折叠的精确高效计算","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01646-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","as":"本文提出一种硬件内信号折叠方案，可应用于单晶体管-单电阻二硫化钼阵列，实现高精度高效计算。该方案通过在硬件层面压缩信号动态范围，降低模数转换精度需求，从而减少计算能耗与延迟，为边缘AI推理和存算一体架构提供了新型优化路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"信号折叠高效计算","kp":["[存内计算]: 信号折叠实现高权重精度和能效","[器件结构]: 1T1R二硫化钼阵列"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Precise and efficient computing via signal folding","b":"An in-hardware signal-folding scheme, which can be applied to one-transistor–one-resistor molybdenum disulfide arrays, can simultaneously achieve high weight precision and energy efficiency."},{"t":"吲哚[2,3-c]咔唑桥连窄带MR-TADF发射体的精准多位硼化工程","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8856021?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"该研究对吲哚[2,3-c]咔唑桥联的双硼多共振热活化延迟荧光（MR-TADF）材料进行精准多位点硼化工程调控。通过优化硼掺杂位点，实现窄带发射并提升反向系间窜越效率，获得高色纯度与高效率的OLED发光材料，对超高清显示技术具有重要应用价值。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"窄带TADF发光材料","kp":["[MR-TADF发射体]: 吲哚[2,3-c]咔唑桥连双硼多共振TADF","[硼化工程]: 精确多位点硼化调控发射颜色","[发射特性]: 保持超窄带特性"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Precise Multi‐Site Borylation Engineering of Indolo[2,3‐c]Carbazole‐Bridged Narrowband MR‐TADF Emitters","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Indolocarbazole‐bridged double‐boron multi‐resonance thermally activated delayed fluorescence (MR‐TADF) materials enable precise modulation of emission colors while retaining ultra‐narrowband characteristics in organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs). Herein, we first introduce indolo[2,3‐c]carbazole (23cIC) into the design of MR‐TADF emitters and develop an electronically and sterically controlled multi‐site borylation strategy. This strategy affords the electronically favored exo‐configuration for Tbu‐exo, which exhibits narrowband green emission at 524 nm with a full‐width at half‐maximum (FWHM) of 20 nm, while yielding the steric hindrance‐guided endo‐configuration for Ad‐tph‐endo exhibiting by yellow emission at 566 nm with a FWHM of 25 nm. Notably, the endo‐configuration gives rise to (\n                    P\n                    /\n                    M\n                    )‐Ad‐tph‐endo, which exhibits significant chiral luminescence properties. Vacuum‐deposited OLEDs based on Tbu‐exo and Ad‐tph‐endo exhibit emission peaks at 530 nm (FWHM = 27 nm) and 568 nm (FWHM = 33 nm), respectively, both achieving external quantum efficiencies (EQE) exceeding 30%. Furthermore, we fabricated solution‐processed top‐emitting OLEDs based on Tbu‐exo for the first time, which realize ultra‐narrow pure‐green emission with CIE coordinates of (0.21, 0.75)—closely approaching the BT.2020 green standard—and a record‐high current efficiency of 200.9 cd A\n                    −1\n                    ."},{"t":"用于超导量子比特读出的Pound-Drever-Hall方法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/ng1d-6gb8","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","as":"本文将Pound-Drever-Hall（PDH）锁频方法引入超导量子比特读取，以提升读取保真度与速度。PDH技术原用于光学腔频率锁定，此处适配于微波腔-量子比特耦合系统，可在强驱动下精确锁定腔频偏移，为大规模量子计算机的高效并行读取提供可扩展方案。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超导量子比特读取","kp":["[量子比特读出]: Pound-Drever-Hall多音自相位参考技术","[读出特点]: 超稳定，适用大规模并行读出"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pound-Drever-Hall Method for Superconducting-Qubit Readout","b":"Author(s): Ibukunoluwa Adisa, Won Chan Lee, Kevin C. Cox, and Alicia J. KollárScaling quantum computers to large sizes requires the implementation of many parallel qubit readouts. Here we present an ultrastable superconducting-qubit readout method using the multitone self-phase-referenced Pound-Drever-Hall (PDH) technique, originally developed for use with optical cavities. I…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233601] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"翻译后异天冬氨酸促进 β2-微球蛋白中淀粉样蛋白的形成","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7045464?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    β\n                    2\n                    ‐Microglobulin (β2m) aggregation is central to dialysis‐related amyloidosis (DRA), yet the molecular triggers underlying its fibrillogenesis remain incompletely defined. Among proposed mechanisms, isoaspartate (isoAsp) formation at Asn residues has been implicated but never directly tested due to synthetic inaccessibility. Here, we report the total chemical synthesis of β2m variants containing isoAsp at known in vivo hotspots, Asn\n                    17\n                    and Asn\n                    42\n                    , enabling precise structural and functional interrogation. Remarkably, the isoAsp\n                    17\n                    ‐modified β2m exhibited greater fibril formation capacity than the pathogenic ΔN6‐β2m variant, suggesting a previously underappreciated contribution of isoAsp\n                    17\n                    . Structural characterization was complemented by spectroscopic and TEM analyses, which demonstrated that isoAsp\n                    17\n                    promotes fibril formation. Our findings provide the first direct experimental evidence that a spontaneous post‐translational modification can initiate amyloidogenesis in β2m, redefining the molecular basis of DRA and highlighting isoAsp as a general driver of pathological protein aggregation."},{"t":"正电化学势可增强热催化氢化中的化学选择性和活性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5569475?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Electrochemical promotion of catalysis is emerging as a powerful approach to control chemical reactions externally without complex catalyst modification, but this has mostly been used for substrates with a single reactive group so far. Herein, we demonstrate that this approach can induce full chemoselectivity in catalytic transformations of substrates with multiple functional groups. Specifically, we show that application of a positive electrochemical potential during the thermocatalytic hydrogenation (TCH) of 3‐nitrostyrene exclusively delivered one single product, 1‐ethyl‐3‐nitrobenzene, with six‐fold enhanced yield, while a complex product mixture was obtained at open circuit voltage. These effects resulted from the combined effects of a positive electrode polarization and acidification of the bulk solution through a concurrent hydrogen oxidation reaction (HOR). Surface‐enhanced infrared absorption spectroscopy and kinetic experiments showed that the positive polarization optimized the surface concentrations of reactants and the adsorption properties of 3‐nitrostyrene and hydrogenation products. Validation with additional reactants and catalyst implies a possible broader relevance of our findings beyond the initial system of 3‐nitrostyrene hydrogenation. Overall, our work provides fundamental insight into the effects of electrode polarization on thermal hydrogenation reactions and opens new opportunities to use electrochemical promotion to control chemoselectivity and activity.","tp":"电催化加氢","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现，在催化氢化反应中施加正电化学势可实现对多官能团底物的完全化学选择性控制。该方法无需复杂催化剂修饰，仅通过外部电势调节即可精确控制反应路径，将电化学促进催化（EPOC）策略从单官能团底物拓展至多官能团体系，为精细化学品合成提供了简洁高效的新工具。"},{"t":"极化子-极化子辅助热激活超辐射","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/hs3s-j4yp","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Yi-Ting Chuang and Liang-Yan HsuWe predict an anomalous thermally activated superradiance in molecular aggregates within polaritonic environments. In contrast to free space, the collective emission is enhanced when either the exciton-phonon coupling or the temperature increases. This counterintuitive phenomenon is captured by a mi…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 238001] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"波兰新能源战略预计可再生能源大幅增长","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/polands-new-energy-strategy-envisages-sharp-increase-in-renewables/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"pv magazine","as":"波兰新版《国家能源与气候计划》（KPEiK）提出大幅加速可再生能源发展的战略路径。该计划设定了更高的风光装机目标与减排承诺，推动能源结构从煤炭向清洁能源转型。文章分析了政策目标的技术可行性与投资需求，指出电网升级与储能配套是实现目标的关键挑战。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"波兰可再生能源","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Poland's new energy strategy envisages sharp increase in renewables - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nPoland’s new National Energy and Climate Plan (KPEiK) sets out an accelerated energy transition through 2040, with a strong focus on expanding renewables, grid capacity, and energy affordability.\nEmiliano Bellini\nMarkets & Policy\nCommercial & industrial\nUtility-scale\nA PV plant built by Portuguese utility EDP in Poland | Image: EDP\nPoland’s Council of Ministers has approved an updated energy and climate strategy outlining an accelerated transformation of the country’s energy system through 2040.\nThe updated plan, known in Poland as the National Energy and Climate Plan (KPEiK), will now be submitted to the European Commission for approval. Its adoption also paves the way for the closure of infringement proceedings launched against Poland after it missed the June 30, 2024 deadline for submitting the revised document.\nThe updated plan projects a significant increase in renewable energy deployment over the next 15 years. Depending on the development scenario, renewables are expected to account for 51.6% to 53.2% of electricity generation by 2030, rising further to 65.6% to 68.9% by 2040.\nThe government expects onshore and offshore wind power, solar PV, and renewable gases to drive this expansion. While natural gas will continue to play a balancing role during the transition, its importance is expected to gradually decline as decarbonized and renewable gases become available, the government said.\nIn the heating and cooling sector, the share of renewable energy could reach 31.6% to 36.5% by 2030 and between 43.5% and 56.7% by 2040.\nThe strategy also forecasts substantial growth in Poland’s installed generating capacity. Total capacity is expected to increase from more than 77 GW in early 2026 to between 128 GW and 156 GW by 2040, depending on the scenario.\nRenewable energy capacity alone could reach 84 GW to 92 GW by 2040, thus representing nearly 60% of installed capacity.\nEnergy affordability is another objective of the plan. By 2040, the share of households spending more than 10% of their income on energy could decline by 30% to 55%, while the proportion of households falling below the social minimum after paying energy bills could decrease by 31% to 55%. In addition, electricity generation costs could fall by around 8% by 2030 and 18% by 2040 compared with 2025 levels, supporting both industrial competitiveness and household consumers, the government stated.\nPoland’s cumulative solar capacity reached 24.8 GW by the end of 2025. The country installed\n3.6 GW of solar in 2025\n, according to data collected by Agencja Rynku Energii (ARE) on behalf of the country’s Ministry of Energy.\nEmiliano Bellini\nView author posts"},{"t":"物理信息引导的暂态电压稳定评估训练方法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008317?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"暂态电压稳定评估","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"kp":["[暂态电压稳定评估]: 物理信息引导的训练方法"],"ot":"Physical information-guided training method for transient voltage stability assessment"},{"t":"从三种代表性电压曲线挖掘物理信息用于锂离子电池高保真数字化建模","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008548?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池建模","kp":["[应用]: 锂离子电池高保真数字建模","[方法]: 三条代表性电压曲线物理信息挖掘"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Physical information mining from three-representative voltage curves for high-fidelity digital modeling of lithium-ion b"},{"t":"聚苯乙烯在二氯甲烷中光裂解为芳香族产物","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5578835?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"该研究实现聚苯乙烯（PS）在二氯甲烷中的光催化裂解，生成高附加值芳香族化学品。光催化断裂PS主链中的C-C键，将塑料废弃物转化为苯系产物，为塑料废物资源化提供温和反应条件下的新路径，对发展循环经济与解决白色污染具有实际应用潜力。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化聚苯乙烯降解","kp":["[光波长]: 365-415 nm","[聚苯乙烯降解]: 无需额外光催化剂，CH2Cl2中O2下光裂解","[产物]: C6-C8芳香族产物"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photocracking of Polystyrene into Aromatic Products in CH2Cl2","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photocatalytic cracking of polystyrene (PS) into valuable aromatic chemicals presents a key route to plastic waste upcycling under mild conditions, in which CH\n                    2\n                    Cl\n                    2\n                    is often used as an inert solvent. Represented herein is to report an unexpected cracking of PS to C6‐C8 aromatic products in CH\n                    2\n                    Cl\n                    2\n                    without any additional photocatalysts under an O\n                    2\n                    atmosphere and 365‐415 nm irradiation. Remarkably, this photocatalyst‐free system achieves a maximum generation rate of 15.9 µmol/h for C6‐C8 aromatic products, competitive with state‐of‐the‐art systems that rely on external photocatalysts. Radical scavenging experiments and EPR spectra reveal that chlorine (Cl•) radicals generated from CH\n                    2\n                    Cl\n                    2\n                    under irradiation contribute to the cleavage of C─H/C─C bonds in PS, leading to the formation of C6‐C8 aromatic products. Under aerobic conditions, these Cl• radicals also promote the transformation of PS into carbonylated intermediates as the light‐absorbing species with an absorption range of 300‐500 nm, thereby accelerating the activation of PS and derivatives. Importantly, this work identifies, for the first time, CH\n                    2\n                    Cl\n                    2\n                    as a vital photochemical reagent in PS conversion to value‐added aromatics even under visible light irradiation."},{"t":"木质素光催化解聚与醇交叉偶联制备非对称芳香族二醇","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2045478?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化木质素降解","kp":["[木质素转化]: 一锅法光催化解聚与醇偶联","[产物]: 不对称芳香族二醇","[催化优势]: 解聚与升级合一，省去分步不同催化体系"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究实现光催化木质素解聚与醇类交叉偶联的一步法反应，生成非对称芳香族二醇。木质素是可再生芳香族化合物的丰富来源，但传统转化需分步进行解聚和官能化，效率低且条件苛刻。研究利用光催化同时驱动C-O键断裂和C-C键形成，将木质素衍生物与醇类直接交叉偶联。该方法简化了反应流程、提高了原子经济性，为木质素高值化利用和可持续芳香化学品合成提供了新途径。","ot":"Photocatalytic Lignin Depolymerization and Cross‐Coupling With Alcohols to Produce Unsymmetric Aromatic Diols","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Conversion of lignin into chemical products typically involves two separate steps, such as depolymerization and subsequent upgrading of monomers, which often require different catalytic systems or varying reaction conditions. Notably, the direct one‐pot conversion of lignin into valuable compounds is crucial for advancing biomass utilization, aiming to streamline production by combining depolymerization and functionalization steps to maximize process‐, atom‐, and cost‐efficiency. Here we report the photocatalytic approach for synchronized depolymerization and C–C coupling processes for the direct conversion of lignin and its derivatives into aromatic diols using CdZnS (Cd\n                    0.3\n                    Zn\n                    0.7\n                    S) catalyst. By coupling hole‐driven radical generation with electron‐driven regeneration of overoxidized benzylic intermediates, this strategy overcomes the intrinsic preference for homocoupling and enables selective cross‐coupling between benzylic and aliphatic alcohol derivatives. This CdZnS‐based photocatalytic process enables simultaneous hydrogen transfer, hydrogenolysis and cross‐coupling of various lignin model compounds with alcohols to obtain unsymmetrical aromatic diols. In the case of real lignin, this depolymerization‐cross‐coupling protocol gives corresponding aromatic diols up to 10 wt% monomer yield. The resulting diol products are directly applicable to the synthesis of thermoplastic polyurethanes (TPUs) as well as fused polycyclic frameworks, functional materials, and bioactive molecules."},{"t":"动态追踪光伏温室系统性能评估","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007981?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"跟踪式光伏温室","dp":1,"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"","ot":"Performance evaluation of a dynamic tracking photovoltaic greenhouse system"},{"t":"人们正在转向人工智能聊天机器人来填补健康信息的空白","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01737-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"A systematic assessment of health-related queries to a chatbot powered by artificial intelligence highlights shortfalls in health-care provision and the responsibilities of AI companies. A systematic assessment of health-related queries to a chatbot powered by artificial intelligence highlights shortfalls in health-care provision and the responsibilities of AI companies.","tp":"智能医疗问","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":4.0},"as":"一项系统性评估显示，越来越多公众转向AI聊天机器人获取健康信息，反映了医疗保健供给中的信息空白。研究揭示了AI公司在健康信息领域面临的责任挑战，凸显了医疗服务覆盖不足与AI健康咨询质量保障之间的张力，对AI医疗应用的监管提出了新的思考。"},{"t":"PathTIGR：用于免疫治疗响应预测的通路拓扑信息图表示学习框架","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed6373?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"免疫治疗预测","kp":["[免疫治疗预测]: 通路拓扑图表示学习PathTIGR"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"PathTIGR是一种融合通路拓扑信息的图表示学习框架，用于预测肿瘤免疫治疗响应。该框架解决了患者间免疫治疗响应差异显著的难题，通过将生物通路拓扑结构编码为图神经网络输入，提升响应预测精度。该方法有望辅助临床精准筛选受益人群，优化免疫治疗策略。","ot":"PathTIGR: A pathway topology-informed graph representation learning framework for immunotherapy response prediction","b":"Immunotherapy has revolutionized cancer treatment, yet substantial inter-patient response heterogeneity limits therapeutic benefit to specific patient subsets. Here, we present PathTIGR, a pathway topology-informed graph representation learning framework that systematically integrates biological pathway network topology knowledge with genome variation information for immunotherapy response prediction. PathTIGR uses a three-component design: (i) pathway graph encoder with multihead attention embeding pathway topology knowledge and cancer genomic variants to pathway representation, (ii) transformer module capturing pathway regulatory dependencies, and (iii) multilayer perceptron synthesizing pathway-level representations to predict immunotherapy response. This architecture enables PathTIGR to capture complex molecular interactions underlying immunotherapy response. Comprehensive validation across multiple independent immunotherapy cohorts demonstrates that PathTIGR achieves superior predictive performance compared to established biomarkers and state-of-the-art deep learning approaches while maintaining biological interpretability through identification of key signatures underlying response heterogeneity. PathTIGR represents an interpretable graph-based learning framework that enhances immunotherapy response prediction and elucidates molecular determinants of therapeutic efficacy, thereby facilitating the advancement of precision cancer immunotherapy."},{"t":"焦耳热冲击诱导部分原子无序Ti2Nb10O29-x用于高效锂离子存储","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73607?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铌氧化物储锂","kp":["负极材料[锂电]: Ti2Nb10O29-x Wadsley-Roth相","[合成]: 焦耳热冲击制原子无序结构","[优势]: 开放结构提升Li+迁移"],"dp":1,"as":"针对Nb2O5作为高功率锂离子电池负极材料因原子排列致密导致锂离子扩散受限的问题，研究者利用焦耳热冲击技术在Ti2Nb10O29-x中诱导部分原子无序结构。这种局部原子无序化打破了原有晶格的规则排列，为锂离子提供了更多扩散通道，显著提升了材料的倍率性能和容量表现，为高性能储能负极材料设计提供了新思路。","sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"Partial Atomic Disordered Ti2Nb10O29‐x Induced by Joule Thermal Shock for Superior Lithium‐Ion Storage","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nb\n                    2\n                    O\n                    5\n                    is a promising anode for high‐power lithium‐ion battery, but its relatively dense atomic packing limits Li\n                    +\n                    migration capacity exertion. Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29\n                    with Wadsley‐Roth phase with more open crystal structure is considered a promising candidate. However, Ti/Nb atoms prefer to form an ordered arrangement to maintain local charge balance, resulting insufficient Li\n                    +\n                    migration and suppressing high‐rate performance. Herein, defective Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    anode with partial disordered Ti/Nb arrangement is developed by employing an amorphous precursor combined with Joule thermal shock. The random dispersion of Ti and Nb within the amorphous precursor is maintained to a certain extent during ultra‐fast Joule thermal heating (≈500°C s\n                    −1\n                    ) and quenching (≈250°C s\n                    −1\n                    ). Compared to traditional Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29\n                    , the Li\n                    +\n                    diffusion coefficient and electronic conductivity of Ti/Nb‐disordered Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    are enhanced by tenfold and four orders of magnitude, respectively. As the anode of lithium‐ion batteries, the optimal Ti\n                    2\n                    Nb\n                    10\n                    O\n                    29‐\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    shows an ultra‐high capacity of 353 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and an excellent rate capability of 112 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    at 150 C, an ultra‐long cycling lifespan of 5000 cycles, and a wide operating temperature range from 80°C to ‐40°C. The performance leap caused by the disordered structure may provide new paradigm for battery materials."},{"t":"Palantir 首席执行官猛烈抨击人为支出的强烈抵制","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/applied-ai/palantir-ceo-pounces-anthropic-spending-backlash","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Palantir CEO Pounces On Anthropic Spending Backlash — The Information"},{"t":"巴基斯坦瞄准太阳能行业，提高组件销售税，增加电池和逆变器关税 - pv magazine","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/pakistan-targets-solar-sector-with-higher-sales-tax-on-modules-increased-duties-on-batteries-and-inverters/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"政策监管","b":"Markets & Policy\nSolar industry campaigns against tax on panels and inverters ahead of proposed hike in budget. Calls for abolition of customs duties on batteries and inverters. The PSA has warned more action is needed to support battery energy storage system (BESS) deployment in a market where solar’s share of the energy mix has grown rapidly.\nMatthew Lynas\nMarkets & Policy\nAsia-Pacific\nEnergy Storage\nUtility-scale\nBusinesses in Pakistan with capital have been quick to invest in solar, according to Wateen Energy Solutions. | Image: Wateen Energy Solutions\nPakistan’s solar industry association has launched a campaign to protest a potential hike in the general sales tax applied to solar panels in the country, while calling for the abolition of a raft of taxes and duties to support further PV and battery storage deployment.\nThe Pakistan Solar Association (PSA) has launched its ‘Stop the Sun Tax’ campaign ahead of a 2026/2027 government budget which could see higher tax and duties applied to renewables products.\nSolar panels in Pakistan are currently subject to a 10% general sales tax (GST), a rate already opposed by the PSA when it was introduced in 2025, but now the government is considering hiking this to 18% in its next budget.\nThis in combination with existing import duties on some solar and battery storage equipment is hindering electrification in Pakistan according to the PSA, at a time when the association argues the country should be reducing exposure to fossil fuel imports.\nThe association has three main demands. PSA wants to see the government abolish GST on solar panels and inverters; to remove import duties on batteries and inverters – unless part of a strategic initiative to support local manufacturing; and has called more stability in the tax regime for solar and batteries.\nPSA President Waqas Moosa told\nthat the association is lobbying through three main channels in its campaign to reduce the tax burden on Pakistan’s solar sector. PSA will engage in direct approach with the government and regulators, is reaching out to the business community through various industry associations, and is allying with non-government organizations and think thanks “who have similar objectives.”\nMoosa added that the PSA is continuing to push for recognition of a BESS emergency in Pakistan and noted there is willingness from international suppliers to support deployment.\n“There is an appetite, at least among Chinese giants, to invest in the Pakistani market and it shows the future potential of the Pakistani market,” Moosa told\nThe PSA president – who is also CEO of Lahore-based developer Hadron Solar– added that to attract more investment in battery storage in Pakistan, the country must answer four key questions: where projects should be sited, what the technical specifications will be, how tariffs will compensate BESS projects, and how projects can be financed.\n“We need to work on all four tracks simultaneously and to target to have the required policies roughly aligned by the end of 2026.” Moosa said. “PSA has started some work on a couple of the areas, but there needs to be a lot of work done. We hope many partners will join in once they see we are able to align stakeholders for a unified clear strategy.”\nSolar adoption in Pakistan has soared in recent years, with Renewables First estimating more than 50 GW of modules had been imported as of September 2025, with 6.1 GW installed as net metering installations, between 16.5 GW and 26.4 GW in deployed behind the meter, and 780 MW as part of utility-scale projects. Between 17.3 GW and 27.2 GW of solar capacity may still have been stockpiled or not-yet deployed in late 2025 according to the Islamabad-based think tank.\nDespite soaring adoption, Pakistan’s energy regulator, the government and solar industry have had a tumultuous 2026 as policy changes have been put forward then rowed back. An attempt to\nretroactively adjust net metering rates\npaid to customers with existing contracts sparked an industry and public outcry, leading to intervention from the Prime Minister to overturn the move.\nPakistan’s budget for the next financial year has not yet been finalized – the industry campaign continues.\nMatthew Lynas\nView author posts","tp":"光伏税政策","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"巴基斯坦拟在预算中提高太阳能组件销售税并增加电池和逆变器关税，引发太阳能行业强烈反对。巴基斯坦太阳能协会呼吁取消电池和逆变器关税以支持储能系统部署。尽管太阳能在巴能源结构中份额快速增长，但资本驱动的不均衡投资和税收政策的不确定性仍是行业发展的主要隐忧。"},{"t":"美国 PM2.5 空气污染不平等（按部门和州划分）：过去的轨迹和未来的方向","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7425?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"On average in the United States (US), low-income communities and communities of color face disproportionate burdens of air pollution and associated health impacts. Much of the effort to reduce these disparities will need to occur at the state level, through the targeting of specific emission sources and exposures. We present the first analysis of exposure disparities in the US that systematically investigates temporal trends, disaggregated by economic sector and state. Our approach combines a recently released time-series (2002 to 2019) emission inventory (EQUATES) with a computationally efficient air pollution model (InMAP Source-Receptor Matrix) to predict annual average exposure to ambient PM\n                    2.5\n                    in each census tract in the contiguous US, disaggregated by emission sector. We find that, in general, absolute disparities have decreased, but relative disparities remain largely unchanged. This pattern holds for some sectors (e.g., transportation and electricity) but not others (e.g., disparities are largely unchanged for agriculture emissions and are generally increasing for residential and cooking emissions). Some state-sector combinations exhibit distinct patterns (e.g., most-recent disparities in New York are dominated by cooking and in Florida by construction). Of all sectors, industrial emissions contribute the largest exposures and the greatest exposure disparities. Agriculture and residential energy use are also large contributors to most-recent disparities, underscoring that inequities persist in sectors historically subject to less regulatory focus. Overall, our findings reveal how disparities have changed during 2002 to 2019 for each sector-state combination and elucidate which sectors each state should focus on to address recent disparities."},{"t":"催产素通过网络级抑制和θ耦合选择性地偏向感觉-前额叶交流","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603966123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Oxytocin modulates social information processing by altering excitatory-inhibitory balance at the microcircuit level, but how such local modulation gives rise to selective processing at the level of distributed brain systems remains unclear. Here, we investigated the effects of oxytocin on large-scale neurodynamics across cortico-limbic network in the mouse brain using multisite local field potential recordings. Oxytocin selectively enhanced neural responses to infant calls in the auditory cortex (AC) and medial prefrontal cortex (mPFC). These enhancements occurred while baseline activity was reduced, indicating increased signal-to-noise ratio rather than a global increase in excitability. During auditory steady-state responses (ASSRs), oxytocin increased prefrontal phase coherence without altering ASSR power. During rest, oxytocin induced a transient, broadband reduction in spontaneous spectral power across regions. Despite this reduction in activity, analyses of interregional interactions revealed a selective increase in low-theta phase coupling and directional connectivity of AC→mPFC. Session-level analyses showed that stronger bottom–up AC→mPFC coupling was associated with lower prefrontal power, consistent with a gating or disinhibitory network regime favoring sensory-to-prefrontal information transfer. Multivariate analyses showed that oxytocin/saline conditions were reliably discriminable using supervised classification models, with specific contributions from spectral power, phase-locking, and Granger-causal connectivity features. Conversely, unsupervised dimensionality reduction did not identify a distinct low-dimensional manifold separating conditions, although a modest shift in the centroid of neural state space was observed. Together, these results indicate that oxytocin reduces background neural activity while selectively enhancing sensory–prefrontal network interactions, providing a systems-level account linking local inhibitory modulation to selective processing of socially salient infant cues."},{"t":"EXL-50U实验综述：解决未来球形环反应堆的关键物理问题","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae738d","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","dp":1,"as":"新奥集团旗下玄龙-50U（EXL-50U）是全球首个完全由民间资本资助并运行的兆安培级磁约束聚变装置，聚焦球形托卡马克路线。本文系统梳理了EXL-50U实验在解决未来球形托卡马克关键物理问题方面的进展，涵盖等离子体约束性能、加热与电流驱动、稳定性控制等核心议题，为商业化聚变路径提供了私企视角的工程与物理验证数据。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"球形环聚变","kp":["磁场强度[球环EXL-50U]: >1T","脉宽[EXL-50U]: 秒级","大半径[EXL-50U]: 0.6-0.8m","装置性质[EXL-50U]: 首个私营MA级磁约束聚变"],"sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Overview of EXL-50U experiments: addressing key physics issues for future spherical torus reactors","b":"ENN’s Xuanlong-50U (EXL-50U) is the world’s first fully privately funded and operated MA-level magnetic confinement fusion experimental facility. EXL-50U is also the world’s first spherical torus device (ST) to achieve a magnetic field exceeding 1 Tesla and a pulse width reaching the seconds level in actual operation. The major radius of EXL-50U ranges from 0.6 m to 0.8 m, with an aspect ratio of 1.4–1.8. The key physics issues of EXL-50U’s experiments related to the future ST reactors are: non-inductive current start-up and drive, development of scenarios for stable high density hot ion mode for ST (Ti0 = 3 keV ∼ 10 keV), and investigation of energy confinement scaling through wide range scans of aspect ratio (1.4 ∼ 1.8) and BT (0.5 T ∼ 1.2 T). Another key research focus of EXL-50U is the physical properties of hydrogen–boron (p-B) plasmas and hydrogen–boron fusion, which is closely aligned with ENN’s p-B fusion roadmap. In the 2025 experiment, EXL-50U achieved a p-B plasma discharge at 1 MA (with boron ions exceeding 10% in the ion fraction), marking the world’s first MA-level discharge of high-concentration p-B plasma. A recording 270 kA fully non-inductive current by 380 kW electron cyclotron resonance heating (ECRH) is also achieved. The initial real-time boron-power injection experiments with metal wall in EXL-50U demonstrates the positive effective of boron on plasma performance. Through neutral beam injection (NBI) heating, a stable proton-boron plasma H-mode has also been achieved for the first time on EXL-50U. On the other hand, experimental results also indicate that simultaneous injection of ECRH and NBI is detrimental to ion temperature enhancement. AI technology was also applied in EXL-50U experiments, achieving stable 500 kA plasma current and displacement control for over 500 ms. Supersonic molecular beam injection was applied for density feedback control for the first time in ST device. ENN researchers plan to achieve all of EXL-50U’s milestone objectives within a three-year timeframe, contributing their efforts toward the rapid commercialization of magnetic confinement fusion."},{"t":"通过三齿配体工程化溶剂化鞘层克服界面依赖的锂离子传输限制","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71169?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","as":"凝胶聚合物电解质（GPEs）兼具高离子电导率与界面稳定性，被视为先进锂金属电池的关键组件，但其界面处Li+输运瓶颈严重制约性能。本研究提出三齿配位策略，通过特定分子结构设计调控电解质-电极界面的锂离子配位环境，有效克服界面依赖的Li+传输限制，从而提升锂金属电池的循环寿命与倍率性能，为高比能固态/半固态电池界面工程提供了新思路。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"凝胶聚合物电解质","kp":["[凝胶聚合物电解质]: 三齿配体工程化溶剂化壳层","[Li+传输瓶颈]: 体相扩散-脱溶剂化-界面传输动态耦合限制","[配体策略]: 调控溶剂化壳层配位齿数"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Overcoming Interphase‐Dependent Li+ Transport via Tridentate Coordination Engineered Solvation Sheath","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Gel polymer electrolytes (GPEs) are pivotal for advanced lithium metal batteries (LMBs) as they can combine high ionic conductivity and enhanced safety. However, their commercialization is hindered by an unresolved kinetic limiting step derived from the dynamic coupling among bulk diffusion, desolvation, and interphase transport. Here, a novel strategy is proposed to regulate the denticity of TFSI\n                    −\n                    coordination from monodentate to tridentate to decouple these processes. The intrinsic chemistry of the solid‐electrolyte interphase (SEI) rather than bulk ionic conductivity or desolvation energy is identified as the predominant factor governing cyclability. Crucially, the tridentate coordination strategically elevates the reductive priority of the normally stable TFSI\n                    −\n                    anions over the more labile solvents, thereby superseding the intrinsic tendency and ensuring the in situ formation of an inorganic‐rich SEI dominated by LiF and Li\n                    2\n                    O. This robust SEI underpins exceptional interfacial stability, enabling 92.7% of its original capacity after 720 cycles at 1 C in LiFePO\n                    4\n                    //Li cells. The generality of this approach is also validated in LiNi\n                    0.6\n                    Co\n                    0.2\n                    Mn\n                    0.2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‐based cells, which achieve stable cycling over 270 cycles at 25°C and over 150 cycles at 60°C. The fundamental insight into the rate‐limiting interfacial coupling and the tridentate‐coordination strategy collectively establish a new paradigm for electrolyte design."},{"t":"未来有机材料：人工智能的前沿视野","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523667?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"人工智能正深刻变革有机材料的发现范式，通过快速探索广阔的化学空间加速新材料设计与筛选。本文综述了AI在有机功能材料（如有机半导体、多孔材料、光电材料等）领域的最新进展，涵盖分子生成模型、性质预测、高通量虚拟筛选等方法，并展望了AI驱动的逆向设计与自动化实验室（自驱动实验室）在未来有机材料研发中的前沿趋势与挑战。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI辅助材料发现","kp":["[材料发现]: AI加速有机半导体新材料探索","[机器学习]: 图神经网络等链接分子结构与性能"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Organic Materials of Tomorrow: Horizons of Artificial Intelligence","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Artificial intelligence (AI) is transforming organic materials discovery by enabling the rapid exploration of chemical space. This review examines machine learning techniques being used to accelerate the identification of novel compounds for organic semiconductors through computational approaches linking molecular structure to properties. Key methodologies include graph neural networks, generative approaches, chemical representations, ‐learning frameworks, machine learning force fields, active learning, transfer learning, and generative models. These methods address fundamental challenges in organic materials discovery, from property prediction and inverse design to high‐throughput screening and molecular generation. An example of applications to the topic of organic photovoltaics demonstrates practical impact in predicting energy levels, morphology, charge transport, exciton dynamics, and power conversion efficiency. Rather than replacing human scientists, we envision AI as a tool that amplifies their capacity to explore unconventional regions of chemical space. Advantages, drawbacks and bottlenecks of AI use in chemistry are discussed together with future research directions, such as the adoption of human‐centered AI practices, the construction of materials‐science‐oriented benchmarking databases and protocols, the integration of green chemistry constraints into generative pipelines, and the further exploration of end‐to‐end in‐silico‐to‐technical validation workflows, all tailored to the needs of the materials science community."},{"t":"负载于原子级分散Mn-N-C上的有序Pt3Mn金属间化合物纳米颗粒作为燃料电池电催化剂","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7818348?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"与传统无序固溶体合金纳米颗粒相比，铂基金属间化合物（如有序Pt3Mn）因规则排列的原子结构而展现出更优的催化活性与耐久性。本研究将有序Pt3Mn金属间化合物纳米颗粒负载于原子级分散的Mn-N-C载体上，构建了双活性位点协同电催化体系，在降低贵金属用量的同时显著提升氧还原反应（ORR）性能，为燃料电池阴极催化剂的低成本化提供了重要参考。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池铂锰催化剂","kp":["[电催化剂]: 有序Pt3Mn金属间化合物纳米颗粒","[载体]: 原子级分散Mn-N-C","[结构优势]: 长程周期性有序原子排列"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Ordered Pt3Mn Intermetallic Nanoparticles Supported on Atomically Dispersed Mn–N–C as Electrocatalysts for Fuel Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Compared with conventional solid‐solution alloy nanoparticles with disordered atomic structures, platinum (Pt)‐based intermetallic compounds (IMCs) are recognized as highly promising electrocatalysts for practical fuel cell applications, on account of their long‐range periodically ordered atomic arrangements. Nevertheless, the rational development of Pt‐based catalysts featuring both high intrinsic activity and long‐term durability remains a key challenge in this field. In this work, by simultaneously introducing manganese (Mn) with low‐electronegativity into both the active component and the support, we report an efficient electrocatalyst toward the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR), composed of L1\n                    2\n                    ‐ordered Pt\n                    3\n                    Mn nanoparticles on Mn single‐atom nitrogen‐doped carbon support (L1\n                    2\n                    ‐Pt\n                    3\n                    Mn@Mn–N–C). The incorporation of Mn, the strong anchoring effect arising from the hierarchically porous structure of the support, and the directional interfacial electron transfer between L1\n                    2\n                    ‐Pt\n                    3\n                    Mn and Mn–N–C synergistically mitigate the adsorption strength of key oxygen intermediates and suppress the dissolution of surface Pt sites. Superior catalytic performance and durability are validated in proton exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs), achieving a peak power density of 1.15 W cm\n                    −2\n                    under H\n                    2\n                    /air conditions. After 30 000 square‐wave cycles, the voltage loss at 0.8 A cm\n                    −2\n                    is only 19 mV, ranking it among the top‐performing Pt‐based cathode catalysts reported to date.","aip":1},{"t":"通过循环路径增强美国磷供应韧性的机遇","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2530690123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磷资源循环回收","kp":["[循环策略]: 7种策略减少矿物磷需求","作物覆盖[磷模型]: 91种主要作物"],"dp":1,"as":"随着高质量磷矿石储量日趋枯竭及供应不确定性上升，磷供应安全已成为各国战略性资源议题。本文分析了美国磷供应链的脆弱性，重点探讨了通过循环经济路径增强供应韧性的机会，包括磷回收（如废水、农业废弃物、动物粪便中的磷回收再利用）、减量化及替代源开发等策略，为构建可持续的磷资源管理体系提供了政策与技术层面的综合建议。","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Opportunities to strengthen US phosphorus supply resilience through circular pathways","b":"With diminishing availability of high-quality phosphate rock and increasing supply uncertainties, improving phosphorus (P) recovery, recycling, and waste reduction has become critical for sustaining agricultural production. We developed an integrated P cycling and soil dynamics model to quantify 7 circular strategies for reducing mineral P demand in the United States, using data for 91 major crops and 20 livestock types across 3,142 counties from 1866 to 2050. We show that soil residual P reuse has the largest potential to reduce mineral P demand in the United States. By 2023, total soil P stocks had accumulated to 99 Tg, equivalent to approximately 68% of mineral P inputs over 1866–2023. For 2024–2050, projections under various socioeconomic scenarios indicate that soil residual P reuse alone could potentially supply approximately 2.4 to 5.1 times projected US mineral P demand, with substantial residual P stocks accumulated in both cropland and pastureland soils. Recycling from sewage sludge and livestock and crop by-products could collectively offset an additional approximately 0.5 to 1.0 times mineral P demand, while food waste reduction could reduce requirements by approximately 0.3 times. Spatial analyses further highlight a mismatch between circular P availability and cropland P demand, with high mineral P avoidance potential concentrated in the South and West, but relatively low ratios of circular P supply to projected mineral P demand across most counties in the Midwest. These findings provide spatially explicit and decision-relevant insights into how circular P strategies can enhance the stability and resilience of US food systems under future resource constraints."},{"t":"实施生物多样性信贷以促进珊瑚礁管理和投资","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(26)00116-8?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"One Earth","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Effective biodiversity conservation for coral reef ecosystems requires both climate mitigation and enhanced management. The current scale of reef management, and the resulting capacity to deliver ecosystem benefits, is limited by a lack of adequate, accessible, sustainable, and scalable funding. Our perspective explores the opportunities and challenges of emerging biodiversity frameworks and nature-based funding instruments (especially biodiversity credits) to catalyze investments needed to increase the scale, nature, and effectiveness of coral reef conservation. Foundational work needed to establish high-integrity coral reef biodiversity credits is under way, including the development of a robust biodiversity accounting framework relevant across a broad range of coral reef habitats and regions. Explicit focus on ecosystem structure, composition, and functions provides a clear direction and rationale for selecting relevant metrics for biodiversity accounting. However, ongoing targeted research and innovation are needed to increase efficacy and efficiency of coral reef management while adapting to changing conditions and demands."},{"t":"OpenAI在英伟达支持下洽谈租赁俄亥俄州10吉瓦数据中心","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/openai-talks-lease-10-gigawatt-ohio-data-center-backing-nvidia","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"the information","tg":"产业进展","tp":"超大规模数据中心","kp":["功率规模[数据中心]: 10 GW","[支持方]: Nvidia"],"sc":9.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":8.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"OpenAI正洽谈租赁位于俄亥俄州、功率达10吉瓦的数据中心，并获英伟达支持。这一规模远超当前主流数据中心（通常百兆瓦级），若落实将成为全球最大AI算力基础设施之一，反映AI巨头对超大规模算力需求的急剧攀升，对电网供电和能源规划构成巨大挑战。","ot":"OpenAI in Talks to Lease 10 Gigawatt Ohio Data Center with Backing From Nvidia","b":"OpenAI in Talks to Lease 10 Gigawatt Ohio Data Center with Backing From Nvidia — The Information"},{"t":"纳米油道赋能的高电气绝缘浸油致密化木单板","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed5744?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"木材绝缘材料","kp":["材料[变压器绝缘]: 油浸渍致密化木贴面","[机制]: 纳米油通道提升介电强度"],"dp":1,"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究人员开发了一种油浸致密化木单板材料，利用纳米级油通道实现高电气绝缘性能。该材料针对老化电网基础设施和可再生能源并网带来的绝缘压力，通过致密化处理结合油浸工艺，显著提升木质材料的介电强度和耐热性能，为环保型电力绝缘材料提供新方案。","ot":"Oil-impregnated densified wood veneer with high electrical insulation enabled by nanosized oil channels","b":"Growing energy demands and renewable integration are stressing the aging power grid infrastructure. Lignocellulosic oil-impregnated paper is widely used in power transformers but suffers from critical limitations, such as low dielectric strength, mechanical strength, and thermal conductivity, causing premature transformer failures. Here, we demonstrate a superior electrically insulating oil-impregnated paper design using the naturally anisotropic structure of densified wood veneer to achieve nanosized channels of oil that efficiently disrupt electrical breakdown pathways. The developed oil-impregnated densified wood (ODW) creates aligned cellulose fibers with 166 ± 87–nanometer oil nanochannels, achieving record dielectric strength of 105 kilovolts per millimeter. The structure also delivers a mechanical strength of up to 384 megapascals and a thermal conductivity of 0.33 watts per meter per kelvin, enabling enhanced longevity upon thermal aging tests. The ODW could replace conventional transformer insulation to enhance power transformer performance and improve lifetime. Moreover, its anisotropic oil-filled nanochannel design offers a general strategy for hybrid dielectrics in medium- and high-voltage applications."},{"t":"海洋“冷斑”是令人不安的气候趋势的证据","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01826-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Weakening of a major ocean-current system is causing temperatures to drop in a patch of the Atlantic Ocean. Weakening of a major ocean-current system is causing temperatures to drop in a patch of the Atlantic Ocean."},{"t":"使用物理信息机器学习方法预测核 $β$ 衰变半衰期","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/klkv-vk36","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): W. F. Li (李伟峰), T. Sun (孙婷), Z. M. Niu (牛中明), and H. Z. Liang (梁豪兆)Nuclear $β$-decay half-lives are investigated by the neural network approach combined with a physically motivated $β$-decay half-life formula. This physics-information machine learning approach achieves better agreement with experimental half-lives than the sophisticated microscopic nuclear models a…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064310] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"用于生成所需的碰撞核密度分布的新颖过滤方法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/ymmt-f8h7","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Xilong Xiang, Manzi Nan, Pengcheng Li, Yongjia Wang, Ling Liu, and Qingfeng LiAccurate modeling of the density profile is essential for studying heavy-ion collisions (HICs) with a transport model. Within the framework of the quantum-molecular-dynamics–type model, a novel method for generating desired nuclear density distributions based on Fourier series expansion is proposed.…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064606] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"混合电池材料中的非平衡离子传输","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed1629?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"普鲁士蓝离子传输","kp":["电极材料[电池]: K2Mn[Fe(CN)6]普鲁士蓝","[机制]: 非平衡转化主导电荷存储"],"dp":1,"as":"研究聚焦混合电池材料中非平衡离子输运现象。该材料结合无机与分子组分，利用其结构柔性实现独特的离子传输行为。该工作对理解混合框架材料中离子迁移的动力学机制及设计新型固态电解质或电池材料具有指导意义。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Nonequilibrium ion transport in a hybrid battery material","b":"Hybrid materials, which combine inorganic and molecular components, often exhibit structural flexibility that enables unusual functional responses. Among them, Prussian blue analogs (PBAs) are a promising class for post–lithium battery technologies. Here, we show that nonequilibrium transformation processes govern the charge-storage mechanism of a PBA electrode, K\n                    2\n                    Mn[Fe(CN)\n                    6\n                    ]. Ostensibly, this behavior mirrors that observed in high-rate cycling of conventional cathodes such as LiFePO\n                    4\n                    yet arises here for fundamentally different reasons–namely, low elastic moduli and cooperative distortions inherent to the hybrid framework. Using operando x-ray absorption spectroscopy with Metropolis matrix factorization and x-ray diffraction, we show that framework flexibility limits transport kinetics and promotes collective, metastable pathways. Our results not only highlight various directions for PBA cathode optimization but also suggest a broader relevance of nonequilibrium mechanisms for mass transport in hybrid materials beyond PBAs alone."},{"t":"Nf2 协调偏向 β-arrestin2 的 PTH1R 信号传导，将骨量与骨骼完整性结合起来","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524671123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Precise spatiotemporal regulation of parathyroid hormone (PTH) and PTH-related peptide signaling through the parathyroid hormone receptor 1 (PTH1R) is fundamental to skeletal development and metabolic bone remodeling, yet the intracellular mechanisms that fine-tune this signaling remain a central unanswered question. Here, we identify neurofibromin 2 (Nf2) as an essential regulator of PTH1R trafficking and signaling. Conditional knockout of\n                    Nf2\n                    in chondrocytes results in short-limbed dwarfism, disrupted growth plate organization, and suppressed chondrocyte proliferation and hypertrophy, and a paradoxical bone phenotype marked by trabecular hyperproliferation and cortical thinning. Mechanistically, Nf2 binds to the PTH1R C-terminal domain (464–591 aa) to promote selective receptor internalization via β-arrestin2 without altering G protein–coupled receptor kinase-mediated PTH1R phosphorylation. Loss of\n                    Nf2\n                    decouples PTH1R from β-arrestin2‐mediated endocytosis, leading to sustained and amplified signaling through the cAMP‐CREB‐pSOX9 (S181) and VEGF axis. Consequently,\n                    Nf2\n                    -deficient mice exhibited bone changes similar to those induced by the PTH1R agonist abaloparatide. These findings establish Nf2 as a chondrocyte‐intrinsic gatekeeper of PTH1R signaling and uncover a cellular mechanism for bone homeostasis by targeting Nf2‐mediated β-arrestin2 recruitment."},{"t":"Taub-Newman-Unti-Tamburino 瞬子的 Newman-Janis 算法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/g6nl-1fbn","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Joon-Hwi KimIt is shown that the Kerr metric represents the nonlinear superposition of self-dual and anti-self-dual Taub-Newman-Unti-Tamburino (NUT) instantons. This promotes the Newman-Janis algorithm to a rigorous derivation of the Kerr metric with a definite physical origin. In the same way, the Kerr-Newman …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231401] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"$^{149}\\mathrm{La}$ 中的新基态消除了镧同位素中的二中子分离能量异常","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/gvxl-vxd4","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): S. Kimura, M. Wada, H. Haba, Y. Hirayama, H. Ishiyama, Y. Ito, T. Niwase, M. Rosenbusch, P. Schury, H. Ueno, Y. X. Watanabe, and Y. YamanouchiNuclear mass is a key indicator of how the nuclear shell structure evolves. The recent mass measurement study of neutron-rich lanthanum isotopes [Jaries et al., Phys. Rev. Lett. 134, 042501 (2025)] reveals the presence of a distinct prominence in their two-neutron separation energies. However, its p…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232501] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"阿尔茨海默氏症的新发现可能会改变科学家对抗这种疾病的方式","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/new-alzheimers-discovery-could-change-how-scientists-fight-the-disease/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Researchers have uncovered a previously underappreciated mechanism involved in\ndisease and developed a compound that interrupts it.\nFor decades, Alzheimer’s research has largely focused on amyloid plaques and tau tangles, the protein abnormalities that accumulate in the brain as the disease progresses. Yet despite billions of dollars in research and numerous drug development efforts, treatments have delivered only modest benefits.\nNow, scientists at\nbelieve they have uncovered another important piece of the puzzle. Their work points to a little-known cellular protein called GRK2 as a potential driver of neurodegeneration and a promising new target for therapy.\nThe team has also developed an experimental compound, known as “Compound 10,” that appears to interrupt the damaging process. In mouse studies, the treatment slowed nerve cell loss, reduced biological signs of Alzheimer’s disease, and extended survival.\nWhile the research is still in its early stages, the findings suggest that protecting cells from stress and energy failure could be just as important as targeting the protein deposits that have dominated Alzheimer’s research for years.\nThe project began almost two decades ago when Ursula Quitterer, a professor of molecular pharmacology at ETH Zurich, received brain tissue samples from a colleague at Ain Shams University Hospital in Cairo.\nThe samples had been collected during tumor surgeries and came from both dementia patients and individuals without dementia. By comparing the tissues, Quitterer and her colleagues began searching for molecular differences that might reveal previously overlooked drivers of disease.\nTheir investigation eventually led them to GRK2, a protein that plays a critical role in regulating how cells respond to signals and stress.\nAlthough GRK2 is found throughout the body, including in the heart and brain, it has received relatively little attention in Alzheimer’s research.\nThe researchers found that GRK2 exists in two forms. One version functions normally, helping cells maintain healthy communication and respond to changing conditions. The other is an inactive form produced through normal cellular processes.\nIn brain tissue from dementia patients, as well as in a mouse model of Alzheimer’s disease, the team discovered unusually large amounts of inactive GRK2.\nMore importantly, the inactive protein did not simply accumulate. It clustered into aggregates that attached themselves to mitochondria (the “powerhouses” of the cells).\nMitochondria generate the energy needed for virtually every cellular process. Neurons are particularly dependent on them because brain cells require enormous amounts of energy to maintain communication networks that can span large areas of the brain.\n“The GRK2 aggregates block the pores of the mitochondria, reducing the amount of energy they can supply and leading to a situation of stress inside the cells,” Quitterer explains.\nThe consequences extend beyond energy production. When mitochondria become impaired, cells struggle to manage stress, clear waste products, and maintain normal function. Many researchers increasingly view mitochondrial dysfunction as one of the earliest events in neurodegenerative diseases, sometimes occurring years before symptoms become obvious.\nThe team also discovered a connection between inactive GRK2 and amyloid beta, one of the proteins most strongly linked to Alzheimer’s disease.\nExperiments showed that inactive GRK2 promotes the production of amyloid beta. In turn, amyloid beta places additional stress on neurons, encouraging the formation of even more inactive GRK2 aggregates.\nThis creates a destructive feedback loop.\nAs more amyloid beta accumulates, cellular stress rises. As stress increases, more GRK2 becomes inactive and forms aggregates. The cycle then accelerates, potentially driving further brain damage and cognitive decline.\nTo stop this cycle, the researchers developed and tested a series of experimental compounds in cell cultures and mice.\nCompound 10 emerged as the most promising candidate.\nThe molecule prevented inactive GRK2 from clumping together, which helped preserve mitochondrial function. As mitochondrial health improved, amyloid beta levels declined, nerve cells remained functional, and cell death decreased.\nRather than targeting amyloid deposits directly, the compound appears to act further upstream by preventing one of the processes that may contribute to their formation in the first place.\nOne of the more surprising findings was that the compound’s effects were not limited to the nervous system.\nThe researchers observed improvements in heart function among treated mice. The animals also showed signs of healthier aging, including the development of fewer gray hairs later in life.\nThose results align with the fact that GRK2 is active throughout the body, not just in the brain.\nAlthough it is far too early to know whether similar effects would occur in humans, the findings raise the possibility that therapies targeting GRK2 could influence multiple age-related biological processes.\nThe researchers have filed a patent application for Compound 10 and completed the foundational research needed to establish its potential.\n“It took so long simply because everything takes so long in Alzheimer’s research,” explains Quitterer.\nBecause Alzheimer’s develops slowly, researchers must often study older animals and conduct lengthy experiments before meaningful conclusions can be drawn. In this case, individual studies often required up to two years to complete.\n“It’s all a great deal slower than in cancer research, for example.”\nThe next challenge is finding an industry partner willing to move the compound into the costly and complex process of drug development.\n“Alzheimer’s is a very complex disease,” says Quitterer.\nCurrent treatments do not cure the disease and typically slow progression by only a few months.\n“That’s why it’s so important that we’ve now identified a new target protein in the form of GRK2, as well as an active ingredient that operates via GRK2 and therefore via a different mechanism than existing Alzheimer’s drugs.”\nIf future studies are successful, Compound 10 could potentially be used alongside existing treatments to help improve quality of life for people living with Alzheimer’s disease.\nReference: “Analysis of GRK2 aggregation in the pathology of Alzheimer disease in animal models” by Joshua Abd Alla, Alexander Perhal, Xuebin Fu, Andreas Langer, Yasser el Faramawy and Ursula Quitterer, 26 March 2026,\nCell Reports\nDOI: 10.1016/j.xcrm.2026.102707\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAlzheimer's Disease\nMolecular Biology\nPharmacology\nThis “Longevity Gene” May Protect the Brain From Aging and Dementia\nNew Study Challenges Alzheimer’s Theories: It’s Not Just About Plaques\nMicroscopic Medicines That Work Inside Human Cells Unlock New Treatments for Alzheimer’s Disease\nNew Study Challenges Decades of Alzheimer’s Understanding With Microtubule Discovery\nRethinking Alzheimer’s Disease: New Research Reveals That It Affects the Entire Body, Not Just the Brain\nRosemary Compound Shows Promise in Reversing Alzheimer’s Memory Loss\nScientists May Have Solved the “Mystery Density” Behind Alzheimer’s and Parkinson’s\nBeyond Plaques and Tangles: Scientists Discover Key to Halting Brain Damage in Alzheimer’s\nDisrupted Sleep Patterns Linked to Alzheimer’s"},{"t":"自然指数2026年研究领袖排名：中国的东亚邻国是否跟上？","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01662-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Japan and South Korea are challenging Western peers in a shifting research landscape. Japan and South Korea are challenging Western peers in a shifting research landscape."},{"t":"神秘的宇宙信号可能是原始黑洞的第一个真实证据","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/mysterious-cosmic-signal-could-be-first-real-evidence-of-primordial-black-holes/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Scientists believe an unusual\ndetection may be evidence of a primordial\n, potentially linking these long-theorized objects to the mystery of dark matter.\nScientists at the\nUniversity of Miami\nbelieve they may be closing in on evidence for one of the most elusive objects in the universe: primordial black holes. While definitive proof could still take years, their work may help confirm both the existence of these ancient objects and their possible connection to one of cosmology’s biggest puzzles.\nPrimordial black holes are theoretical objects thought to have formed during the first moments after the\n. Unlike black holes created by collapsing stars, they could span a wide range of sizes, from objects as small as asteroids to much larger masses.\nIf they exist, they may help explain dark matter, the invisible material that makes up about 85 percent of the universe’s matter and provides the gravitational force that helps hold galaxies together.\n“We believe our study will aid in confirming that they actually do exist,” Nico Cappelluti, an associate professor in the College of Arts and Sciences’ Department of Physics, said of the research he and Ph.D. student Alberto Magaraggia have conducted.\nTheir investigation was motivated by a recent possible discovery involving the Laser Interferometer Gravitational-Wave Observatory (LIGO). Late last year, LIGO detected an unusual gravitational wave signal. Gravitational waves are ripples in spacetime generated by powerful cosmic events such as black hole collisions.\n“The most common black holes form as the result of a supernova, the death of a massive star. So, their masses can range from a few times the Sun’s mass to billions of solar masses,” Cappelluti explained. But last November, LIGO issued an automated alert for a merger in which at least one of the objects weighed less than 1 solar mass, suggesting the potential of a primordial black hole.\nWhether the signal represents a major scientific discovery or simply noise within LIGO’s detectors remains a subject of debate among astrophysicists.\nCappelluti and Magaraggia argue that the observation is best explained by a primordial black hole formed in the extremely dense conditions of the early universe, long before the first stars appeared. They believe their findings support that interpretation.\n“We attempted to estimate how many primordial black holes may exist in the universe and how many of them LIGO should be able to detect,” Magaraggia said. “And our results are encouraging. We predict that subsolar black holes like the one LIGO may have observed should indeed be rare, consistent with how infrequently such events have been seen so far.”\nAccording to the\n, published in\nAstrophysical Journal\n, “the most plausible explanation for the LIGO signal, which lacks any conventional astrophysical explanation, is the detection of a primordial black hole,” Cappelluti said. “And our research indicates that these primordial black holes could account for a significant portion, if not all, of dark matter.”\nThe researchers emphasize that much more analysis will be needed before firm conclusions can be drawn about the signal and its possible connection to dark matter.\nFor now, confirmation depends on whether LIGO and its international partners detect similar events in the future. “LIGO picked up what is very strong evidence that these types of black holes exist. But we’ll need to detect another such signal or even several others to get the smoking-gun confirmation that they are real,” Cappelluti said. “But what is clear is that they cannot be excluded as being real.”\nThe idea of primordial black holes dates back to Soviet scientists Yakov Zeldovich and Igor Novikov, who first proposed them during the Cold War era. In the early 1970s, Stephen Hawking expanded on the concept, suggesting that large numbers of these objects could exist, emit radiation, and potentially explain dark matter.\nLIGO later provided the first observational clues that could support these longstanding theories. On September 14, 2015, the observatory made the first direct detection of\ngravitational waves\n, opening a new chapter in astronomy and confirming a key prediction of Albert Einstein’s theory of general relativity.\nLIGO consists of two facilities located in Hanford, Washington, and Livingston, Louisiana. Together with the Virgo detector in Italy and the underground KAGRA observatory in Japan, it forms the LVK collaboration. This network searches for black holes, regions of space where gravity is so intense that nothing, including light, can escape.\nPlanned upgrades will improve LIGO’s sensitivity and may allow it to detect more unusual signals. Even so, the observatory was not designed to observe gravitational waves directly from the Big Bang. Its two L-shaped detectors, each featuring vacuum arms measuring 2.5 miles (4 kilometers) in length, are optimized for detecting high-frequency waves produced by relatively recent violent cosmic events.\nFuture instruments will be able to probe much earlier periods of cosmic history, Cappelluti noted. The\nEuropean Space Agency\n’s Laser Interferometer Space Antenna (LISA), scheduled for launch in 2035, is expected to detect gravitational waves originating from some of the earliest eras after the Big Bang.\nAnother project, Cosmic Explorer, is currently in the design stage. The U.S. ground-based observatory is expected to be 10 times more sensitive than LIGO, enabling it to detect black hole and\nneutron star\nmergers dating back to the era when the first stars formed.\nReference: “Implications for Primordial Black Hole Dark Matter from a Single Subsolar Mass Gravitational-wave Detection in LVK O1–O4” by Alberto Magaraggia and Nico Cappelluti, 27 March 2026,\nThe Astrophysical Journal\nDOI: 10.3847/1538-4357/ae48f9\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nUniversity of Miami\nAre Black Holes and Dark Matter the Same? Astrophysicists Upend Textbook Explanations\nAdvanced LIGO Looks to Reveal the Mystery of Merging Black Holes\nLIGO Detects Gravitational Waves Again\nNASA Astronomer Reveals Possible Link Between Primordial Black Holes and Dark Matter\nNew Discovery Challenges Dark Matter, Stellar Acceleration Models\nNew Research Shows LIGO’s Twin Black Holes Might Have Been Born Inside a Single Star\nDark Matter Influences Supermassive Black Hole Growth\nResearchers Use New CMB Data to Analyze the First Hundred Thousand Years of Our Universe\nStudy Challenges Prevailing Ideas About How Supermassive Black Holes Grow"},{"t":"我的海外工作机会被取消了。这是我如何反弹的","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01234-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Andrew Kythreotis re-evaluated his personal and professional priorities after a mid-career opportunity to move abroad fell through. Andrew Kythreotis re-evaluated his personal and professional priorities after a mid-career opportunity to move abroad fell through."},{"t":"克隆造血过程中睡眠和运动的突变依赖性反应","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10634-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Clonal haematopoiesis (CH) activates inflammation and increases the risk of atherosclerosis1,2. Whether lifestyle alters CH clone expansion or the phenotypic programming of CH mutant cells, thereby affecting atherosclerosis, is unknown. Here, in humans and mice and across mutations in Jak2, Tet2, Trp53 and Dnmt3a, we demonstrate mutation-dependent responses to sleep and exercise in CH and show that mutant cells are uniquely sensitive to lifestyle. In two human datasets, moderate-to-vigorous physical activity was associated with lower prevalence of non-DNMT3A-driven CH. In atherogenic mice with Jak2V617F or Tet2 loss of function (LOF), but not Trp53 LOF or Dnmt3aR878H CH, uninterrupted sleep or exercise curtails clone expansion. In CH with the Jak2V617F mutation, sleep and exercise reduces clone expansion by selectively reprogramming mutant, but not cohabitant wild type, haematopoietic progenitor cells towards antiproliferative and metabolically healthy phenotypes by tempering bone marrow macrophage–haematopoietic progenitor cell IL-1β signalling. Sleep or exercise also lessens Jak2V617F-driven, Tet2 LOF-driven and Trp53 LOF-driven, but not Dnmt3aR878H-driven, atherosclerosis by locally reprogramming mutant vascular macrophages, independent of peripheral clone dynamics. In Jak2V617F, but not adjacent wild type, aortic macrophages, uninterrupted sleep blunts CLEC4E-dependent inflammasome activation, consequently diminishing lesions. Exercise, meanwhile, activates PAC1+ neurons in the locus coeruleus, raising the levels of peripheral noradrenaline, which signals through adrenergic receptor β2 (ADRβ2) whose expression is preserved by exercise in Jak2V617F, but not cohabitant wild type, aortic macrophages, selectively repressing their inflammatory programming and atherosclerosis. Our findings establish that healthy lifestyles gene-specifically diminish CH and selectively reprogram mutant haematopoietic progenitor cells and macrophages to maintain cardiovascular health."},{"t":"高温质子交换膜燃料电池的多尺度阴极设计","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D6CS00242K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高温燃料电池阴极","kp":["[器件]: 高温质子交换膜燃料电池","[关键限制]: 磷酸掺杂膜体系"],"as":"提出高温质子交换膜燃料电池(HT-PEMFC)的多尺度阴极设计策略。HT-PEMFC具有高效能量转换和余热利用优势，该工作通过跨尺度结构优化提升阴极催化性能与传质效率，推动燃料电池工程化应用。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Multiscale cathode design for high-temperature proton exchange membrane fuel cells","b":"High temperature proton exchange membrane fuel cells (HT-PEMFCs) are highly promising energy conversion devices featuring the benefits of their superior reaction kinetics, simplified water and thermal management systems, tolerance to CO-containing reactant gases, and being compatible with hydrogen production via industrial fuel reforming processes. However, due to the phosphoric acid (PA)-doped membranes being the primary proton exchange membranes (PEMs) used in HT-PEMFCs, the PA leaching from the membrane during the operation degrades platinum (Pt)-based oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) catalysts and the cathode catalyst layer, causing insufficient performance of HT-PEMFCs, which hinders their application. Although extensive research has been conducted to enhance the activity and durability of HT-PEMFCs, there remains a significant gap toward practical implementation, which stems from incomplete fundamental understanding of atomic-scale catalysts, reaction interfacial kinetics, and catalyst layer structure engineering. To fill the aforementioned research gap, this review summarizes recent developments in cathode catalysts, catalytic interface, and catalyst layers from a multiscale view of HT-PEMFCs. Beginning with the fundamental principles, the theoretical insights into PA-induced catalyst poisoning and catalyst layer degradation are first provided. Innovative design in ORR catalysts and catalytic interfaces with enhanced PA resistance and reaction kinetics is then presented. Additionally, approaches to optimizing the cathode catalyst layer are discussed from a practical application perspective. Finally, an outlook on the remaining challenges and prospects in this field is provided, aiming to facilitate the advancement of HT-PEMFCs."},{"t":"具有分子级界面接触的有机异质结多尺度活性位点调控用于高效光催化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71172?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机光催化制氢","kp":["[合成方法]: 冰模板辅助光化学还原","[界面接触]: 分子级异质结界面"],"as":"研究在有机异质结中通过分子级界面接触实现多尺度活性位点调控，用于光催化分解水产氢。有机光催化剂驱动的太阳能分解水是绿氢生产的关键路径，该工作通过优化界面电荷分离提升光催化效率。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Multiscale Active Site Modulation in Organic Heterojunction with Molecular‐Level Interfacial Contact for Efficient Photo","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The commercialization of green hydrogen production through organic photocatalyst‐promoted solar water splitting for hydrogen evolution is limited by inefficient charge separation and sluggish interfacial kinetics. Herein, this problem is addressed using an ice template–assisted photochemical reduction strategy that integrates molecular‐level interfacial contact between a trefoil‐shaped donor–acceptor molecule (DTAB) and ultrathin carbon nitride nanosheets (UCNS) with Cu single atoms (SAs) anchoring and Pt nanodots (NDs) deposition. The intimate interface in the resulting DTAB–UCNS/CuPt photocatalyst generates a built‐in electric field promoting the separation of photogenerated carriers. The DTAB harvests visible light and injects electrons into UCNS, with these electrons subsequently funneled to Pt NDs via Cu SAs. The electronic coupling between Cu SAs and Pt NDs affects the position of the Pt\n                    d\n                    ‐band, thus optimizing the H* adsorption/desorption equilibrium and enhancing surface reaction kinetics. The hydrogen evolution rate of DTAB–UCNS/CuPt (261.16 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) is 248.7 times higher than that of UCNS/Pt (1.05 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) and ranks among the highest reported for carbon nitride–based photocatalysts under comparable conditions, highlighting the strong potential of our strategy to advance photocatalytic hydrogen evolution toward practical green hydrogen production."},{"t":"用于硅基锂离子电池使用寿命补锂的多相纳米复合预锂化剂","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed6926?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅基电池补锂剂","kp":["[策略]: 多相纳米复合预锂化剂","[应用]: 硅基电池寿命期补锂"],"dp":1,"as":"开发多相纳米复合预锂化剂，用于硅基锂离子电池服役寿命期间的锂补充。硅基负极高能量密度电池面临首圈库伦效率低和循环容量衰减问题，预锂化策略可有效补偿活性锂损失，延长电池循环寿命。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Multiphase nanocomposite prelithiation agents for service life lithium replenishment in Si-based Li-ion batteries","b":"High–energy density lithium-ion batteries (LIBs) using Si-based anodes are expected to dominate the lithium-ion power battery market in the near future. However, the Si anode suffers from continuous capacity degradation during initial and subsequent cycles. Prelithiation agents can effectively replenish lithium and enhance battery capacity, while currently investigated cathode prelithiation agents generally only prelithiate at the initial cycle. Herein, we have developed a multiphase nanocomposite prelithiation agent (MNCP) on the basis of two distinct mechanisms—oxygen oxidation and conversion reaction—aiming to provide service life lithium replenishment for Si-based LIBs. MNCP presents several tunable delithiation plateaus to prelithiate anodes in the initial and extending cycles with exceeding 600 milliampere-hours per gram without gas generation. This work emphasizes a mechanism-based design strategy for functional prelithiation agents, aiming to comprehensively optimize the performance of advanced LIBs."},{"t":"船载多能混合推进系统的多目标尺寸优化及可行性与敏感性分析","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600841X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"船舶混合推进","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.5},"ot":"Multi-objective sizing optimization of shipboard multi-energy hybrid propulsion systems with feasibility and sensitivity"},{"t":"动量分辨二维光谱作为非线性量子场动力学的探针","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/tfdm-qshs","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Duilio De Santis, Alex Gómez-Salvador, Nataliia Bazhan, Sebastian Erne, Maximilian Prüfer, Claudio Guarcello, Davide Valenti, Jörg Schmiedmayer, and Eugene DemlerEmergent collective excitations constitute a hallmark of interacting quantum many-body systems, yet in solid-state platforms their study has been largely limited by the constraints of linear-response probes and by finite momentum resolution. We propose to overcome these limitations by combining the …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233401] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"量子场动力","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队提出将动量分辨二维光谱与量子气体实验相结合的新方案，以克服固态平台中线性响应探针和有限动量分辨率的限制，实现对相互作用量子多体系统中涌现集体激发的非线性动力学探测。该方案为研究超冷原子量子场动力学提供了全新的实验工具。"},{"t":"HuR 分子胶降解剂抑制 BRAF 突变结直肠癌","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10613-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"BRAF gain-of-function mutations, particularly BRAF(V600E), affect roughly 10% of all patients with colorectal cancer (CRC), and portend poor prognosis with limited therapeutic interventions. BRAF inhibitors such as encorafenib are ineffective due to MAPK pathway reactivation driven by BRAF dimerization. Combined inhibition of BRAF and EGFR, although approved therapies, results in short survival benefits and frequent treatment resistance and relapse1,2,3. Here, through rational chemical library design coupled with parallel proteomic screening, we identified dHuR as a molecular glue degrader of human antigen R (HuR), an RNA-binding protein that drives tumour growth, invasion and therapy resistance. dHuR binds to the CRBN ubiquitin ligase to create a unique benzofuran-tethered composite surface to recruit HuR as a neosubstrate by engaging its β-hairpin G-loop degron, as revealed by the cryo-electron microscopy structure of the ternary complex. dHuR abrogated BRAF expression by inducing its exon 18 skipping, and demonstrated superior suppression of BRAF-mutant CRC tumours including those gaining resistance to BRAF inhibitors. Finally, we performed kinome library CRISPR screening and revealed that inactivation of EGFR or MEK enhanced dHuR cytotoxicity, thus establishing a combinatorial strategy to treat patients with refractory BRAF-mutant CRC."},{"t":"分子N型掺杂实现微腔集成OLED低阈值纳秒激光迈向电泵浦","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5388345?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电泵浦OLED激光","kp":["[掺杂策略]: N型分子掺杂","激光脉宽[微腔OLED]: 纳秒级低阈值","[目标]: 电泵浦有机激光器"],"as":"通过分子N型掺杂在集成微腔的OLED中实现低阈值纳秒级激光发射。有机半导体适用于柔性、波长可调激光器，但多数有机激光材料电荷注入效率低。N型掺杂策略改善了载流子平衡，推动电泵浦有机激光器走向实用。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Molecular N‐Type Doping Unlocks Low‐Threshold Nanosecond Lasing in a Microcavity‐Integrated OLED Toward Electrically Pum","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic semiconductors are attractive for the development of flexible, wavelength‐tunable lasers. However, most reported organic micro/nanolasers rely on femtosecond‐pulsed optical pumping, which is impractical for real‐world applications. This limitation has urged the pursuit of electrically pumped organic lasers; yet their realization remains a long‐standing challenge primarily due to a fundamental materials dilemma, in which high‐gain organic semiconductors often suffer from poor, unbalanced charge transport. Here, we demonstrate that this intrinsic trade‐off can be effectively alleviated through a molecular doping strategy. Employing a high‐gain spirofluorene derivative as the emissive layer, we introduce an n‐type doped layer to construct an organic light‐emitting diode (OLED), achieving more balanced charge transport while preserving outstanding optical gain. Consequently, singlet‐polaron annihilation is significantly suppressed, as evidenced by reduced efficiency roll‐off and electrically pumped transient absorption measurements. When integrated with a distributed feedback (DFB) resonator, the resulting device exhibits ultra‐narrow (∼2 nm) electroluminescence under pulsed current injections and delivers low‐threshold nanosecond lasing under an optical–electrical co‐pumping configuration, thereby demonstrating a practical architecture for implementing organic laser diodes. Our work provides a general strategy to overcome the intrinsic paradox where high‐gain organic semiconductors struggle to maintain balanced charge transport, illuminating a pathway toward light amplification under electrical excitation."},{"t":"调控NiV层状双氢氧化物微球中Ni-O-V桥键用于1,5-戊二醇稳健电催化偶联","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5292155?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物质电催化氧化","kp":["[催化剂]: NiV层状双氢氧化物微球","[活性位点]: Ni-O-V桥结构","[耦合反应]: 戊二醇氧化+硝酸盐还原"],"as":"通过调控NiV层状双氢氧化物微球中的Ni-O-V桥键，实现高效电催化。该共电解体系耦合生物质衍生多元醇的阳极氧化与阴极硝酸盐还原，在提升催化活性和稳定性的同时实现高附加值化学品联产。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Modulating Ni‐O‐V Bridges in NiV‐Layered Double Hydroxides Microspheres for Robust Electrocatalytic Coupling of 1,5‐Pent","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The co‐electrolysis system that couples anodic oxidation of biomass‐derived polyols with cathodic nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    RR) represents a promising strategy for biomass valorization and treatment of high‐salinity wastewater. Here, we synthesize thin NiV‐layered double hydroxides (NiV‐LDHs) microspheres featuring engineered Ni‐O‐V bridge structures as dual‐channel electrocatalysts. The newly constructed Ni‐O‐V bridges confirmed by x‐ray absorption spectroscopy effectively modulate the electronic structures of both Ni and V sites. This synergistic enhancement boosts the performance of both anodic 1,5‐pentanediol electrooxidation to produce glutaric acid (GA) and NO\n                    3\n                    RR to ammonia. The NiV‐LDHs anode enables electrolysis at a low cell voltage of 1.5 V versus RHE, exhibiting a GA Faradaic efficiency of 98.5% and a high GA yield of 2.56 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    . Operando studies and density functional theory reveal that the strong electronic coupling within NiV‐LDHs optimizes the competitive adsorption between 1,5‐pentanediol and OH* on the catalyst surface. Moreover, the NiV‐LDHs cathode exhibits outstanding NO\n                    3\n                    RR performance, achieving a high ammonia yield of 2.28 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    with a Faradaic efficiency of 96.1%, surpassing most reported electrocatalysts. A continuous paired electrolysis operation over 240 h successfully produced GA (55.98 g) and NH\n                    4\n                    Cl (23.48 g) powders, demonstrating great potential for industrial application."},{"t":"通过电极涂层调控界面离子通量实现高效酸性CO₂电解","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01796G","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酸性CO2电解","kp":["[策略]: 电极涂层调控界面离子通量","[应用]: 酸性CO2电解抑制析氢"],"as":"通过电极涂层调控界面离子流，实现高效酸性CO₂电解。酸性CO₂电解有利于高单程转化率，但面临碳酸盐沉积和催化剂腐蚀挑战。该工作通过涂层优化界面传质与反应微环境，显著提升了电解效率与稳定性。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.5},"ot":"Modulating Interfacial Ion Flux via Electrode Coatings Enables Efficient Acidic CO₂ Electrolysis","b":"Acidic CO2 electrolysis offers great potential for high-efficiency single-pass CO2 conversion to valuable fuels and chemicals, yet is challenged by the kinetically favorable hydrogen evolution reaction. Electrode coatings can engineer a favorable electrode-electrolyte interface by regulating interfacial ion flux to steer the reaction pathway toward CO2 electroreduction; however, rational design rules for such coatings remain elusive. Here, we decouple the roles of binders and inorganic fillers in the coatings and demonstrate that coupling a cation-exchange ionomer (CEI) with a proton-blocking oxide yields a durable coating that enables efficient acidic CO2 electrolysis. Combined experimental and simulation results reveal that this optimal formulation promotes inward K+ transport while restricting H+ influx and outward OH- transport, thereby establishing a K+-enriched and alkaline interfacial microenvironment that enhances CO2/CO adsorption and lowers *CO dimerization barrier. As a representative demonstration, an Al2O3/CEI-coated Cu electrode achieves a maximum Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 81.3% for multi-carbon (C2+) products at 600 mA cm-2 and remarkably durable operation for 200 h at 200 mA cm-2. Furthermore, this proposed electrode coating strategy demonstrates the broad generality in engineering interfacial microenvironments across distinct catalyst platforms."},{"t":"与细胞核相连的线粒体确保其能量供应","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01587-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Direct interactions between the cell’s powerhouses and nuclear pores might channel energy straight into the nucleus, fuelling cell division and differentiation. Direct interactions between the cell’s powerhouses and nuclear pores might channel energy straight into the nucleus, fuelling cell division and differentiation."},{"t":"线粒体直接与核孔复合体相互作用","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10588-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Mitochondria regulate cellular processes through direct and indirect interactions with other organelles. A well-studied example has been contact with the endoplasmic reticulum at mitochondrial-associated endoplasmic reticulum membranes1, which control pathways including redox and calcium homeostasis2,3. Recent studies have also reported direct mitochondria–nuclear membrane contacts in cancer cells and yeast that promote pro-survival signalling4,5. Here we identify direct interactions between mitochondria and nuclear pores. Using two unbiased proteomic screens, GST pulldown and BioID, we found that VDAC1 was the top mitochondrial candidate that interacts with the filamentous nuclear pore protein RANBP2. In vitro RANBP2 CRISPR knockout, RANBP2 truncation or site-directed mutagenesis of RANBP2–VDAC1 interacting amino acids resulted in reduced mitochondria–nucleus proximity and decreased nuclear ATP and phosphocreatine levels. This was accompanied by a decline in the levels of the nuclear phosphoproteome and downregulation of pathways involved in histone modification, cellular differentiation and transcriptional regulation in vitro. Moreover, deletion of the RANBP2 C-terminal domain in vivo in mice resulted in embryonic lethality due to cardiac and neural crest differentiation defects. Collectively, these results describe a mechanism by which mitochondria directly interact with the nuclear pore complex, a phenomenon critical for regulation of nuclear energetics and cellular differentiation. Undoubtedly, additional roles of this interaction remain to be revealed."},{"t":"小鼠在隔膜中产生中间神经元，作为对厌恶经历和抗抑郁治疗的反应","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3625?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Adult neurogenesis sustains olfactory function, facilitates the acquisition of new memories, and provides resilience against depression in mice. Neural stem cells (NSCs) elicit selective responses to different physiological and pathological stimuli, thereby modulating neuron production. Here, we show that fear conditioning stimulates neurogenesis in the adult mouse brain septum by activating NSCs in the dorsal septum (dsNSCs) situated near a plexus of serotonergic axons originating from raphe nucleus neurons—key regulators of mood, anxiety, and stress responses. Elevation of serotonin (5HT) levels with the antidepressant and anxiolytic drug fluoxetine similarly promoted dsNSC proliferation and neurogenesis. The adult-born GABAergic interneurons integrate into septal nuclei. These findings suggest a potential adaptive response in mice to stress-inducing aversive experiences and elevated 5HT in the adult septum."},{"t":"超表面赋能的天文偏振测量","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee8035?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超表面天文偏振","dp":1,"as":"综述超表面(metasurface)光学元件在天文偏振测量中的应用前景。超表面由亚波长纳米结构阵列构成,可灵活操控光的振幅、相位与偏振,具备轻薄、紧凑、可批量制造等优势。文章讨论如何将这一新兴光学技术用于望远镜及空间天文仪器中,实现高灵敏度偏振成像,用于探测恒星、星际尘埃及系外行星大气的偏振信号。超表面有望替代传统笨重偏振光学元件,推动天文仪器小型化与性能突破。","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Metasurface-enabled astronomical polarimetry","b":"In the past decade or so, metasurface optical components have received considerable scientific and industrial interest. The miniaturization afforded by metasurfaces could benefit astronomy in particular, which is an often-cited potential application area for metasurfaces. However, few developed examples in which metasurface components offer a unique benefit to astronomical instrumentation—substantiated by the production of scientific data—have been shown. Here, we present the Solar Imaging Metasurface Polarimeter (SIMPol), a first-of-its-kind telescope for snapshot imaging polarimetry of the sun enabled by a high-performance metasurface polarization-analyzing grating, which provides for single element, snapshot imaging polarimetry. We demonstrate SIMPol’s integration into a major observatory telescope facility and the characterization of Zeeman signatures of solar magnetism. This work—among the first to demonstrate an advantage presented by metasurface optics to a real application in astronomical instrumentation—heralds the application of metasurfaces and emergent nanophotonic technologies in astronomy more broadly."},{"t":"金属原子与量子点共存用于电解水","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73687?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单原子电解水催化","kp":["催化剂[水电解]: GDY负载金属原子+量子点"],"dp":1,"as":"研究聚焦水分解析氢反应中载体表面调控金属单原子分布的前沿难题,提出让金属原子与量子点在载体上共存的策略。通过精确调控载体表面化学环境,使金属单原子与量子点协同发挥作用,提升析氢与析氧反应活性与稳定性。该共催化体系有望突破传统单原子催化剂活性位点单一、载量受限的瓶颈,为高效、低成本电催化水制氢提供新思路,对绿氢规模化生产具有工程价值。","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Metal Atoms and Quantum Dots Coexist for Water Electrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    How to manipulate the surface of the supports to control metal atoms is frontier research that has emerged in recent years in the field of catalysis. However, the precise and controllable synthesis of metal atom systems with well‐defined structure and valence states remains a significant challenge. Herein, based on theoretical predictions, we report a new catalytic system of GDY, where metal atoms and quantum dots coexist. Precise structural studies have determined that Ni atoms and RuNi\n                    x\n                    quantum dots (denoted as Ni–RuNi\n                    x\n                    /GDY) are distributed on GDY surface. GDY has the ability to act as an electronic medium to control the strong interaction between Ni atom and\n                    sp\n                    ‐C within a long‐range distance, leading to promote the hydrolysis abilities of Ni atom adjacent to RuNi\n                    x\n                    . The as‐synthesized Ni–RuNi\n                    x\n                    /GDY catalyst exhibits astonishing results in the alkaline hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), with overpotentials of only 17 mV and 116 mV achieving current densities of 10 and 1000 mA cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    , respectively. This work presents a new method for creating highly efficient multi‐component atom catalysts, and a new concept for long‐range control of catalysis to open up new routes for the frontier research on developing advanced catalytic systems in the future."},{"t":"有丝分裂调节蛋白 Cdc20 泛素化机制","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2612003123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"A multisubunit ubiquitin ligase called the anaphase-promoting complex/cyclosome (APC/C) controls progress through mitosis in eukaryotic cells. The activity of APC/C in mitosis is subject to both positive and negative regulation by the co-activator protein Cdc20. On exit from mitosis, Cdc20 is targeted for degradation by APC/C-catalyzed ubiquitylation. It has been proposed that the ubiquitylation of Cdc20 is carried out by an intramolecular “cis” mechanism, in which Cdc20 bound to the co-activator site of APC/C is directly ubiquitylated [I. T. Foe\n                    et al.\n                    ,\n                    Curr. Biol.\n                    21\n                    , 1870–1877 (2011)]. This proposal was mainly based on the observation that mutation in the IR tail of Cdc20, an isoleucine-arginine C-terminal sequence involved in its binding to APC/C, markedly impaired Cdc20 ubiquitylation. We find that the IR tail of Cdc20 is also required for Cdc20 ubiquitylation promoted by Cdh1, an APC/C co-activator that acts in the G1 phase of the cell cycle. This suggested the involvement of the IR motif in a\n                    trans\n                    mechanism of Cdc20 ubiquitylation. A\n                    trans\n                    mechanism is also suggested by the observation that Cdc20 ubiquitylation by APC/C\n                    Cdc20\n                    , as that by APC/C\n                    Cdh1\n                    , requires both KEN-box and CRY-box degrons of Cdc20. A model is proposed according to which the IR tail of substrate Cdc20, along with its KEN-box and CRY-box motifs, interact with corresponding binding sites of APC/C-coactivator complexes."},{"t":"使用 CLAS12 实验测量近阈值 $J/ψ$ 光生成横截面","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/lqv1-kf2n","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): P. Chatagnon et al. (CLAS Collaboration)We present measurements of the total and differential cross sections for near-threshold $J/ψ$ photoproduction obtained with the CLAS12 detector at the Thomas Jefferson National Accelerator Facility. The results are based on data collected during the fall 2018 and spring 2019 running periods, using e…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 065203] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"使用第一个 JUNO 数据测量反应堆中微子振荡","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10538-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Neutrino oscillations (see refs. 1,2 and references therein), a quantum effect manifesting at macroscopic scales, are governed by lepton flavour mixing angles and neutrino mass-squared differences3 that are fundamental parameters of particle physics, representing phenomena beyond the Standard Model. Precision measurements of these parameters are essential for testing the completeness of the three-flavour framework, determining the mass ordering of neutrinos and probing possible new physics. The Jiangmen Underground Neutrino Observatory (JUNO)4 is a 20-ktonne liquid-scintillator detector located 52.5 km from multiple reactor cores, designed to resolve the interference pattern of reactor neutrinos with sub-percent precision5,6. Here we report, using the first 59.1 days of data collected since detector completion in August 2025, the first simultaneous high-precision determination of two neutrino oscillation parameters, sin2&#x03B8;12=0.3092&#x00B1;0.0087\" role=\"presentation\">sin2θ12=0.3092±0.0087{\\sin }^{2}{\\theta }_{12}=0.3092\\,\\pm \\,0.0087 and &#x0394;m212=(7.50&#x00B1;0.12)&#x00D7;10&#x2212;5eV2\" role=\"presentation\">Δm212=(7.50±0.12)×10−5eV2\\Delta {m}_{21}^{2}=(7.50\\,\\pm \\,0.12)\\times 1{0}^{-5}\\,{\\mathrm{eV}}^{2} for the normal mass ordering scenario, improving the precision by a factor of 1.6 relative to the combination of all previous measurements. These results advance the basic understanding of neutrinos, validate the design of the detector and indicate the readiness of JUNO for resolving the neutrino mass ordering with a larger dataset. The rapid achievement with a short exposure highlights the potential of JUNO to push the frontiers of precision neutrino physics and paves the way for its broad scientific programme."},{"t":"原子核四面体对称性的质量探针","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/89v1-lrb2","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): F. F. Xu (许方方) and P. W. Zhao (赵鹏巍)Tetrahedral symmetry has long been predicted as an exotic shape degree of freedom in atomic nuclei, yet clear experimental manifestations remain elusive. We show that the triple binding energy difference $δ{V}_{pn}^{(3)}$ can isolate a structural effect of tetrahedral symmetry in $^{80}\\mathrm{Zr}$.…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232503] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"海洋种群遗传推论揭示了原生生物比古质体（植物）和元生物更强的海洋结构","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7158?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"While the biogeographic patterns of animals and plants are well defined, the distribution of the microbial eukaryotic world remains contentious. Classically, protists were assumed to be cosmopolitan, dispersing everywhere with little geographic constraint. We tested this hypothesis by compiling 88 marine cytochrome oxidase subunit I metabarcoding studies to perform a global population-genetic analysis. We uncovered a fundamental biogeographic divide: most animal (Metazoa) and plant (Archaeplastida) phyla have haplotype diversity that is strictly concentrated within specific ocean basins, while most protist phyla share identical haplotypes across multiple, distant oceans. The combination of large geographic ranges with moderate among-ocean genetic differentiation in protists is inconsistent with strict historical cosmopolitanism and is compatible with high connectivity and range expansion dynamics, including, but not limited to, recent colonization events. Our findings provide a unified population-genetic perspective on marine eukaryotic biogeography and refine current views of microbial dispersal at ocean-basin scales."},{"t":"马来西亚开发商收购澳大利亚太阳能-电池项目股权","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/10/malaysian-developer-acquires-stake-in-450-mw-solar-1-8-gwh-battery-project-in-australia/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏储能项目","kp":["光伏容量[澳大利亚项目]: 450 MW","储能容量[BESS]: 450 MW/1,800 MWh"],"sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"马来西亚开发商Gamuda Renewables宣布收购澳大利亚Hazelwood North太阳能农场及电池储能项目（BESS）的权益。该交易标志着东南亚可再生能源企业加速进入澳洲市场，利用Hazelwood前燃煤电厂场址建设大型光储项目，推动亚太区清洁能源转型与跨国投资合作。","ot":"Malaysian developer acquires stake in Australian solar-battery project - Energy Storage","b":"Gamuda Renewables announced it has acquired “an interest” in the Hazelwood North solar farm and battery energy storage project being developed in the Australian state of Victoria by Manthos Investments.\nOne of the largest proposed solar farms in the state, the Hazelwood North project will pair 450 MW of PV generation capacity with a 450 MW/1,800 MWh battery energy storage system. With\ndevelopment approval already secured\nthrough Victoria’s Development Facilitation Program, Gamuda said the project is set to enter construction in 2028 with commercial operation expected in 2030, pending a final investment decision.\nJarred Hardman, chief strategy and development officer at Gamuda Renewables, said a key dimension of the Hazelwood North project is its capacity for future expansion with the developers exploring the potential to include a co-located data centre on site.\n“The opportunity to expand the project to include a data centre is something both Manthos and our team are genuinely excited about,” he said. “Pairing large-scale renewable generation and storage with the digital infrastructure that increasingly depends on it is a compelling model, and one we look forward to progressing in the months ahead.”\nHardman said co-locating demand with on-site solar and battery storage makes for a particularly compelling opportunity, noting that this model reduces pressure on shared transmission infrastructure and offers data centre operators a genuinely differentiated proposition – dedicated renewable energy built and managed by the same team.\n“Hazelwood North marks a significant milestone for us – not only as our first Victorian asset, but as a project that captures exactly where the energy transition is heading,” Hardman said.\nGamuda’s acquisition of an interest in the Hazelwood North project, which remains subject to approval from the Foreign Investment Review Board (FIRB), increases its\nAustralian portfolio\nto three assets across the National Electricity Market (NEM). Other projects in its portfolio include the Weasel solar and battery and the Cellars Hill wind and battery developments being progressed in Tasmania’s Central Highlands.\nGamuda said the deal deepens its commitment to owning and building large-scale renewable energy infrastructure in Australia’s most populous energy markets.\nThe move has also seen the company boost its Australian renewable energy market ambitions from an initial plan to build a 1-2 GW portfolio of solar, wind and battery projects by 2029 to 5 GW of assets under development, construction, and operation by 2031.\nGamuda will also continue to bid for major engineering, procurement and construction contracts in solar, wind, pumped hydro and transmission network upgrades and expansion."},{"t":"金属氢化物分子的磁光捕获","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/xy6y-kyhc","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Jinyu Dai, Benjamin Riley, Qi Sun, Debayan Mitra, and Tanya ZelevinskyResearchers have used laser cooling and trapping to isolate calcium monohydride, a key step toward producing ultracold atomic hydrogen.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233403] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","tp":"冷原子氢制备","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"哥伦比亚大学Tanya Zelevinsky团队成功实现了金属氢化物分子CaH的激光冷却与磁光捕获，这是通往制备超冷原子氢的关键一步。超冷氢化物分子的精确控制对基础物理常数测量、超冷化学反应研究具有重要意义，为量子模拟和精密测量领域开辟了新的实验可能性。"},{"t":"淋巴结微环境重塑解锁局部抗体介导的 B 细胞耗竭","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed8962?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Lymph nodes (LNs) can act as reservoirs in CD20\n                    +\n                    B cell malignancies and autoimmune diseases. Although anti-CD20 monoclonal antibodies (mAbs) have substantially improved patient outcomes, relapse and disease progression remain frequent, underscoring critical limitations that constrain their full therapeutic potential. Here, we reveal that the LN microenvironment is an important modulator of anti-CD20 mAb efficacy. Within LNs, malignant B cells can exhibit a sessile, tissue-retained behavior, which limits their access to the blood circulation required for efficient systemic antibody-mediated cell depletion. Although LN B cells are spatially segregated from FcγR\n                    +\n                    effector cells, remodeling of the LN microenvironment through irradiation enabled anti-CD20 mAb-mediated B cell depletion. Our findings identify LN architecture as a structural barrier to depleting antibody-based therapies and highlight tissue remodeling as a strategy to enhance therapeutic responses within lymphoid organs."},{"t":"脓毒症中红细胞唾液酸的丧失会破坏抑制性 Siglec 相互作用，导致中性粒细胞过度激活，并导致中性粒细胞过度活化。","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536989123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Systemic inflammation is accompanied by overwhelming neutrophil activation, resulting in extensive formation of neutrophil extracellular traps (NETs). Although NETs are beneficial for pathogen entrapment, they become detrimental; therefore, their endogenous regulation is pivotal for survival. In this context, the observation that healthy individuals’ red blood cells (RBCs) can inhibit NET formation induced by lipopolysaccharide (LPS)-primed neutrophils is noteworthy. However, during systemic inflammation, NET formation in the vasculature is robust despite constant neutrophil exposure to RBCs. Herein, we reveal that for RBCs and neutrophils from septic individuals, but not from those with local inflammation, interactions cease and NET inhibition is abolished. This is observed even if only one cell type originates from an inflamed individual, and occurs in both human and murine cells. Moreover, 6 to 10 d post–sepsis induction (mice) or diagnosis (humans), during the resolution of inflammation, interactions are restored and hence fail during the critical stages of inflammation. Mechanistically, this is not due to passive LPS absorption by RBCs, which would limit its availability for neutrophils. In contrast, the cessation of NET inhibition is due to inflammation-induced RBC desialylation (removal of α2,3-linked sialic acids) and decreased expression of inhibitory Siglec-E/9 and -G, but not Siglec-F/5, on neutrophils. Accordingly, concurrent addition of exogenous polysialic acid (PolySia) and pharmacologically controlled accumulation of Siglec molecules on neutrophils preserves the ability of erythrocytes to inhibit PAD4-dependent NET formation upon interaction with neutrophils of endotoxemic mice. These findings open avenues for clinically controlling NET formation during systemic inflammation, given the abundance of erythrocytes in the blood."},{"t":"严格短程准二维 XY 模型中的长程顺序：当关键波动很重要时","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/1jkm-kybr","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Minghui Hu, Chao Zhang, Dajun Zhang, Yanan Sun, Youjin Deng, and Jian-Ping LvThe phase of spins in the quasi-two-dimensional (q2D) XY model has emerged as a topic of significant interest across multiple subfields of physics. Conventional wisdom, rooted in the Mermin-Wagner theorem and supported by existing paradigms, asserts that true long-range (LR) order is prohibited in q…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 237101] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"木质素在高产率化学-生物氧化还原过程中转化为己二酸","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10580-x","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"木质素制己二酸","kp":["产率[木质素→己二酸]: ~20 wt%","[方法]: 化学-生物氧化还原联合"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种将木质素高产量转化为己二酸的化学-生物联合氧化还原工艺。木质素是植物木质纤维素的丰富可再生组分，己二酸是尼龙等高分子材料的重要单体。该生物基路线为替代石油基己二酸生产提供了可行路径，对绿色化工和可再生资源高值化利用具有重要意义。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Lignin to adipic acid in a high-yield chemical and biological redox process","b":"Viable manufacturing pathways to produce bio-based chemicals from renewable feedstocks, such as lignin derived from plant biomass, are needed to decarbonize the chemicals manufacturing sector. Converting the recalcitrant lignin polymer to valuable bioproducts remains a longstanding challenge in biorefining, with the highest reported single-product yield from lignin currently around 20 wt% (refs. 1,2,3,4). Most existing lignin depolymerization strategies target aryl–ether bond cleavage, which can produce aromatic monomers in yields of only about 30 wt%, and still as complex mixtures with C–C-linked dimers and oligomers5,6. The recalcitrance of these C–C linkages between aromatic moieties fundamentally limits single-product yields from lignin, prompting the development of strategies to efficiently cleave these C–C bonds3,7,8,9. Here we show how reductive processing of lignin from poplar accesses a hydrocarbon mixture of alkyl-aromatic monomers and oligomers that is privileged for oxidative conversion to monomeric aromatic carboxylic acids, comprising mostly benzoic acid and phthalic acid isomers in up to 73 wt% monomer yields, using a Co/Mn/Br catalyst. The soil bacterium Pseudomonas putida KT2440 was engineered to convert this mixture of aromatic carboxylic acids to muconolactone, a precursor to bio-based nylons, enabling final adipic acid yields up to 26 wt% (gram adipic acid per gram lignin) with a maximum theoretical yield of 57 wt%. This pairing of reductive and oxidative steps with lignin resembles processes in petrochemical refining and shows how lignin may be converted into a single, valuable bioproduct in high yields."},{"t":"碳纳米管在水中的光诱导量子摩擦","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10632-2","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Friction slows down moving objects at both macroscopic and microscopic scales1. At the electronic level, quantum friction describes direct transfer of momentum between a liquid and the electrons of a solid2. Owing to its microscopic nature, this phenomenon remains experimentally challenging to capture3. Here we show that near-infrared fluorescent single-walled carbon nanotubes (SWCNTs) exhibit light-induced quantum friction in water. It is measured by observing an excitation-power-dependent linear decrease of around 50% in the diffusion constants of functionalized SWCNTs in aqueous solution. This effect disappears when excitons are localized, as in the case of SWCNTs with quantum defects. We further show that the chemical manipulation of exciton concentration by molecules that increase or decrease SWCNT fluorescence also modulates the diffusion constant by up to a factor of 2. Optical pump terahertz (THz) probe spectroscopy shows an instantaneous response (around 30 cm−1) that we assign to direct exciton–water coupling in the range of water Debye modes. It is followed by an increasing (>100 ps) response in the range of intermolecular translational modes of the hydrogen bond network of water (>100 cm−1), resembling heating. Classical molecular dynamics simulations further support a mechanism in which the fluctuating dipole moments of excitons create frictional forces. These findings establish light-induced quantum friction between excitons in SWCNTs and water and show that electronic excitations can be used to control nanoscale motion and fluid properties.","tp":"碳管量子摩擦","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究发现近红外荧光单壁碳纳米管（SWCNTs）在水中表现出光诱导量子摩擦现象。实验通过观测激发功率依赖的荧光线宽变化，首次直接测量到液体与固体电子之间的动量量子转移。该工作为量子尺度的液固界面摩擦机制提供了实验证据，对纳米流体和能量耗散研究具有深远意义。"},{"t":"光减慢水中碳纳米管的速度","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01701-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Water-suspended carbon nanotubes move more slowly in green light, suggesting that excited electrons in the tubes couple to the water through ‘quantum friction’. Water-suspended carbon nanotubes move more slowly in green light, suggesting that excited electrons in the tubes couple to the water through ‘quantum friction’.","tp":"碳管光致摩擦","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"Nature新闻报道了一项突破性发现：悬浮在水中的碳纳米管在绿光照射下运动速度降低，表明管内被激发的电子通过与水分子的耦合产生了量子摩擦效应。这是首次在实验中直接观测到液体与固体电子之间的量子动量转移现象，为纳米尺度摩擦学和流体动力学研究开辟了新方向。该报道是对同期原始研究论文的解读。"},{"t":"光强驱动的双向光响应视觉传感器用于自主避障系统","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73694?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿生视觉传感器","kp":["[传感器]: 光强驱动双向光响应","[应用]: 自主避障距离自适应"],"dp":1,"as":"受生物视觉神经通路启发，研究人员开发了一种光强度驱动的双向光响应视觉传感器，可在同一器件中实现正负双极响应，模拟生物视觉系统的光适应与动态处理能力。该传感器有望应用于机器人、自动驾驶等下一代智能系统，提升机器视觉在高动态光照环境下的感知与处理效率，为神经形态视觉计算与自适应光敏器件提供新方案。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.5},"ot":"Light Intensity‐Driven Bidirectional Photoresponse Vision Sensor for Autonomous Obstacle Avoidance System","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Bio‐inspired vision sensors emulating neural‐pathway processing hold significant promise for next‐generation robotics and artificial intelligence. However, achieving biomimetic threat‐distance adaptation, where escape initiation dynamically calibrates to looming object proximity within a single device as in insect neural circuits, remains challenging for bionic vision systems implementations. Herein, we present a vision sensor based on a 2D PVK/h‐BN/MoS\n                    2\n                    /h‐BN/2D PVK heterostructure that achieves full dynamic emulation of insect phototactic/scototactic behaviors. The core innovation is symmetrical gate‐field co‐regulation, opposing gate biases on the top and bottom 2D PVK photosensitive layers trigger antagonistic field‐effect modulation in response to light gradients. Low light intensity activates the top layer, inducing persistent positive photocurrent (PPC) via hole/cation accumulation, while high light intensity activates the bottom layer, generating negative photoconductivity (NPC) via electron/anion accumulation, mimicking adjacent ommatidial excitation/inhibition. Hopping‐like ion transport enables ultra‐long PPC/NPC persistence post‐illumination. An autonomous obstacle avoidance system built with this sensor directly maps light‐gradient signals to motor commands enabling voltage‐tunable braking distance control via symmetric gate differential modulation, co‐processing real‐time intensity, historical accumulation, and rate‐of‐change for efficient collision avoidance in dynamic environments. This work provides a valuable reference scheme for bionic vision systems."},{"t":"配体调控的金属-自由基极性匹配实现乙烯的通用1,2-双碳官能化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02177-8","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Chemistry","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙烯双官能化催化","kp":["[反应类型]: 乙烯1,2-双碳官能化","[选择性控制]: 配体调控金属-自由基极性匹配"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出一种通过配体调控金属-自由基极性匹配的策略，实现了过渡金属催化体系中多种自由基中间体的高选择性定向转化，高效完成1,2-双碳官能化反应。该方法突破了传统自由基反应选择性难以控制的瓶颈，具有广泛的底物普适性，为复杂有机分子和功能材料的精确合成提供了通用且高效的新方法。","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Ligand-modulated metal–radical polarity match enables general 1,2-dicarbofunctionalization of ethylene","b":"Leveraging transition metal catalysis to direct multiple radical intermediates towards a single desired product offers many synthetic opportunities while presenting an important chemoselectivity challenge arising from selectivity in radical capture by the catalyst. How mechanistic design precisely tunes this selectivity remains limited, constraining the rational design of efficient catalytic systems. Here we demonstrate that the electronic bias of the radical intermediates and the ligand-modulated copper centre can be strategically harnessed to control the selectivity of copper-mediated radical capture. A strongly π-accepting terpyridine ligand modulates the electronic properties of the copper catalyst, enabling the selective capture of radical intermediates with complementary polarity through a metal–radical polarity-match mechanism. Building on this mechanistic framework, we have established a synthetically powerful, yet highly challenging ethylene 1,2-dicarbofunctionalization. This provides streamlined access to structurally diverse, medicinally relevant 1,2-dicarbofunctionalized ethanes that incorporate sp3-, sp2- and sp-hybridized carbogenic functional groups while offering mechanistic insights and design principles that facilitate the rational design of transition metal-catalysed radical transformations.The alternative text for this image may have been generated using AI."},{"t":"我们来谈谈生物医学研究套件","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00799-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Although undoubtably helpful in many ways, experimental assay kits risk undermining the fundamentals of science. How can we course correct? Although undoubtably helpful in many ways, experimental assay kits risk undermining the fundamentals of science. How can we course correct?"},{"t":"基础物种的遗产塑造死后的生命","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef9983?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ecosystems carry memory through the material remains of organisms. Foundation species—trees, grasses, corals, and oysters—while alive are central to ecosystem structure, and the remains of these organisms continue to influence ecological processes after death. We conducted, to our knowldge, the first continental-scale exploration of how dead foundation species influence living conspecifics, leveraging long-term experiments and observations (2 to 32 years) from 10 ecosystems (five terrestrial and five marine) across the US Long Term Ecological Research Network. We found that material legacies commonly alter demographic processes, ranging from a 50% reduction to a 12-fold increase. The ubiquity of these postmortem effects reveals an underappreciated dimension of ecological memory that shapes pathways of ecosystem resilience, reorganization, and collapse, providing a critical management tool in an era of increasing disturbance- and climate-driven mortality events."},{"t":"学习分子动力学长时间步长模拟的动作","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/shj2-hyw8","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Filippo Bigi, Johannes Spies, and Michele CeriottiMachine learning can reduce the number of time steps needed to accurately predict the progress of a dynamically evolving system.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 237301] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"LICA：实时电价下的多智能体家庭用电调度框架","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007579?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"Agent用电调度","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","ot":"LICA: A multi-agent framework for household electricity scheduling under real-time pricing"},{"t":"科华推出465kW组串式逆变器，面向沙漠与海上光伏场景","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/kehua-debuts-465-kw-string-inverter-for-desert-offshore-pv/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"组串式逆变器","kp":["额定功率[组串逆变器]: 465 kW","电压[组串逆变器]: 1,600 V","子阵列规模[光伏]: 5.6 MW"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":7.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"科华在SNEC 2026展会上发布了一款465kW、1600V的组串式逆变器，面向沙漠和海上光伏等极端环境的大规模地面电站场景。该产品在功率密度和电压等级上均有突破，适应高温、高盐雾等恶劣条件，降低大型光伏项目度电成本，推动组串式方案向超大功率演进。","ot":"Kehua debuts 465 kW string inverter for desert, offshore PV - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nKehua unveiled a 465 kW, 1,600 V string inverter at SNEC 2026 aimed at utility-scale solar, enabling up to 5.6 MW sub-arrays and cutting system costs through longer strings and reduced cabling.\nVincent Shaw\nTechnology & Products\nUtility-scale\nKehua 465 kW inverter | Image: pv magazine\nChinese power electronics specialist\nhas launched a 465 kW string inverter at SNEC 2026 in Shanghai, targeting utility-scale solar projects in desert and offshore PV applications.\nThe company presented the product as a next-generation high-power string inverter for large ground-mounted solar plants in harsh environments. It is based on a 1,600 V DC architecture and supports larger sub-array configurations than conventional 1,500 V systems, according to the company.\nKehua said the inverter supports up to 5.6 MW sub-arrays, compared with around 3 MW in many conventional designs. It also features an N+2 long-string configuration, allowing two additional modules per string. The company said the combination of higher voltage, longer strings and larger sub-arrays can reduce DC cable usage, equipment count and overall balance-of-system costs by around CNY 0.037 ($0.0055)/W.\nThe product targets developers seeking higher power density and lower system costs as large-scale PV plants move toward larger block designs. Kehua said the 1,600 V DC platform can also broaden the MPPT operating range and improve energy yield under low-temperature, high-voltage conditions.\nThe inverter has an IP66 protection rating and C5 anti-corrosion protection, making it suitable for operation in sandy, humid, coastal and high-salt environments. Kehua said it can operate at full load at 45 C and is designed for deployment at altitudes of up to 5,000 m without derating.\nThe inverter includes a multilayer safety architecture with string disconnection, insulation monitoring, lightning protection and terminal temperature monitoring. These functions are intended to detect electrical risks earlier, isolate faults more quickly and reduce fire and maintenance risks in large PV plants.\nFor operation and maintenance, the inverter is equipped with L4-level string IV curve scanning, air-duct self-cleaning and health-status monitoring. Kehua said the system can identify more than 20 types of module-side faults and reduce manual inspection requirements. A fan reverse-cleaning function removes dust and debris from the air channel, which is particularly relevant for desert and high-dust environments.\nThe inverter also features native grid-forming capability, according to the manufacturer. It is designed to operate in strong and weak grids, provide virtual inertia and damping, and support voltage and frequency stability in projects with high renewable penetration.\nKehua said the product has completed laboratory validation and outdoor testing. Small-batch trial production is expected in the third quarter of 2026, with large-scale production and deliveries planned for the fourth quarter. Initial shipments are expected to focus on China’s large desert renewable energy bases, as well as overseas markets including Europe and the Middle East.\nVincent Shaw\nView author posts"},{"t":"卡尔希向一些客户询问雇主信息","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/kalshi-asks-customers-employer-information","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"Kalshi Asks Some Customers For Employer Information — The Information"},{"t":"JUNO 实验迎来了下一代中微子实验","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01585-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The first measurements from the JUNO experiment demonstrate unprecedented precision and promise exciting results. The first measurements from the JUNO experiment demonstrate unprecedented precision and promise exciting results."},{"t":"晶澳太阳能更名为JA（晶澳）","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/ja-solar-changes-name-into-ja/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"晶澳太阳能正式更名为'JA'，标志着公司从单一光伏组件制造商向全产业链清洁科技生态转型。新战略涵盖光伏发电、储能系统、智慧能源管理等领域，体现光伏企业向综合能源解决方案商演进的趋势。更名反映了行业从硬件竞争向系统集成与场景化服务竞争的转变。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"光伏企业转型","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":2.0,"r":2.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"JA Solar changes name into JA - pv magazine Global","cl":"008ee37b5d","cln":"晶澳太阳能|更名JA|品牌更名|2026-06-11","cp":0,"b":"Markets & Policy\nThe move marks a shift toward a fully integrated cleantech ecosystem spanning solar, storage, smart energy, and financing in line with broader industry trends toward end-to-end energy solutions.\nEmiliano Bellini\nMarkets & Policy\nCells & modules\nEnergy Storage\nImage: JA Solar\nChinese PV module manufacturer and storage system provider\nannounced it will rebrand as JA.\nThe company said the move reflects its transition from a top-tier solar module manufacturer to a fully integrated cleantech provider.\n“Under the new JA Masterbrand, the company is structured around four key business groups: JA SOLAR (photovoltaics), JA ESS (energy storage solutions), JA GREEN (smart energy), and JA CAPITAL (financing). Together, these groups create an integrated ecosystem that provides customers with end-to-end solutions spanning power generation, energy storage, and optimisation,” the manufacturer said in a statement.\nThe shift also mirrors a\nbroader industry trend highlighted in a recent\nreport on SNEC 2026 in Shanghai\n, where solar manufacturers are increasingly expanding across the value chain and into energy storage.\n“From exporting products to building global capabilities and from a Chinese brand going global to a truly global brand, JA will leverage the synergies of its ecosystem to deliver integrated green energy solutions, collaborating with partners across the industry to co-develop technologies and expand markets,” said Liu Shuo, President of JA’s Brand and Marketing Center.\nEmiliano Bellini\nView author posts"},{"t":"晶澳太阳能更名为JA，业务延伸至太阳能电池板之外","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/ja-solar-becomes-ja-to-stretch-beyond-solar-panels-1296232/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Renewables Now","as":"晶澳太阳能更名为JA，意在拓展光伏面板之外的清洁能源业务。这一战略转型反映了头部光伏企业面对组件价格下行和产能过剩压力，主动向储能、智慧能源等高附加值环节延伸。更名不仅是品牌重塑，更是光伏行业从设备供应商向综合能源服务商深度转型的一个缩影。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"光伏企业转型","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":2.0,"r":1.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"JA Solar becomes JA to stretch beyond solar panels","cl":"008ee37b5d","cln":"晶澳太阳能|更名JA|品牌更名|2026-06-11","cp":1,"b":"JA Solar becomes JA to stretch beyond solar panels | Renewable Energy News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nabout 8 hours ago\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nabout 15 hours ago\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nJA Solar becomes JA to stretch beyond solar panels\nJun 10, 2026, 5:38:44 PM\nSladjana Djunisic\nEnergy Storage\nRegion/Country:\nAsia Pacific\nOther Corporate\nLatest top stories\nNorwegian parliament requires review of floating wind support scheme\nabout 8 hours ago\nINTERVIEW - RP Global focuses on BESS, hybrids amid negative prices, curtailment\nabout 15 hours ago\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nLatest in Energy storage\nScout lands in Ottawa with 150-MW BESS project, new office launch\nJun 10, 2026\nSolarigo plans 250-MW solar-plus-storage park in Finland\nJun 10, 2026\nData centre firm EdgeMode to acquire 51% of Spain's Ibersun to access BESS\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in Other corporate\nIberdrola plans EUR 4.5bn grid investment in Brazil's northeast\nTenneT appoints Shell Nederland's head as CEO\nFrontier plans USD-77.5m raising to fund big Aussie solar-BESS hybrid\nLatest in Solar power\nTOYO secures solar panel orders worth USD 185.6m for US projects\nJun 10, 2026\nMN8 plugs in 260 MW of US solar farms under Microsoft PPAs\nJun 10, 2026\nNovar, partner reach fin close on 148-MWp Dutch solar park\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in China\nSome 25 GW of offshore wind ready to build but not at FID - GWEC\nJun 10, 2026\nLONGi scores highest at Wood Mackenzie PV manufacturer ranking\nCATL opens major energy storage testbed in China\nMay 28, 2026\nLatest in Energy storage\nScout lands in Ottawa with 150-MW BESS project, new office launch\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in Other corporate\nIberdrola plans EUR 4.5bn grid investment in Brazil's northeast\nLatest in Solar power\nTOYO secures solar panel orders worth USD 185.6m for US projects\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in China\nSome 25 GW of offshore wind ready to build but not at FID - GWEC\nJun 10, 2026\nLatest in ASIA & PACIFIC\nPolarstar Energy secures 40-MW battery project in Japan\nJun 10, 2026\nMost read stories\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nOffshore Wind\nOffshore wind could occupy 11% of North Sea by 2050, study says\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"肽热潮有科学依据吗？炒作背后的承诺","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01816-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Peptide injections are the hottest trend in wellness. Researchers say enthusiasm for these unregulated drugs has got ahead of the science. Peptide injections are the hottest trend in wellness. Researchers say enthusiasm for these unregulated drugs has got ahead of the science."},{"t":"介电工程化共价有机框架中纳米限域差异界面摩擦驱动的离子选择性传输","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73670?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质离子传输","kp":["电解质[固态电池]: 共价有机框架(COF)型","[离子选择传输]: 纳米限域差分界面摩擦机制"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于纳米受限差分界面摩擦实现离子选择性输运的新机制，用于开发高性能固态电解质。研究聚焦于同时满足高离子电导率和优异离子选择性两大核心指标，这对全固态电池的商业化至关重要。纳米受限空间内的界面摩擦差异赋予特定离子优先传输能力，为设计新型固态电解质材料提供了创新思路，有望突破现有固态电池离子传输瓶颈。","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Ion‐Selective Transport via Nanoconfined Differential Interfacial Friction in a Dielectric‐Engineered Covalent Organic F","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) that concurrently deliver high ionic conductivity, excellent ion selectivity, and robust electrochemical/thermal stability remains a central challenge for safe, high‐energy‐density solid‐state batteries (SSBs). Here, an all‐solid‐state covalent organic framework electrolyte with sectionalized chemical environments (SCE‐COF) is reported, constructed via nanoconfined copolymerization of a highly dielectric monomer within COF nanochannels. The resulting architecture affords a nano‐confined molecular interface that integrates electron‐rich polar short chains that form abundant Li\n                    +\n                    hopping sites with electron‐deficient pore‐wall regions that immobilize anions through specific hydrogen‐bonding interactions, thereby enabling efficient and differential ion transport decoupled from strongly bonded solvation cage and polymer segmental motion. Benefiting from these synergistic effects, SCE‐COF achieves ionic conductivity of 1.05 × 10\n                    −3\n                     S cm\n                    −1\n                    at 30°C, a high Li\n                    +\n                    transference number of 0.73 and a wide electrochemical window (4.87 V vs Li\n                    +\n                    /Li). Finally, all‐solid‐state full cells employing SCE‐COF deliver a high specific energy density of 442.0 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    under a controlled lithium source at ambient temperature."},{"t":"面向目标性能的非晶材料逆向设计","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522493?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"非晶材料设计","kp":["[逆向设计]: ML驱动非晶材料目标性能逆向设计","[材料类型]: 玻璃等无序材料用于储能/光学/催化"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":3.0},"as":"研究提出无定形（非晶态）材料的目标性能逆向设计方法。非晶材料如玻璃在功能应用中前景广阔，传统试错法效率低下。该方法利用计算建模与优化算法，从期望性能出发反向搜索材料组分与结构，加速新型玻璃及非晶功能材料的发现与设计。","ot":"Inverse Design of Amorphous Materials With Targeted Properties","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Disordered (amorphous) materials, such as glasses, are emerging as promising candidates for applications within energy storage, nonlinear optics, and catalysis. Their lack of long‐range order and complex short‐ and medium‐range order, which depend on composition as well as thermal and pressure history, offer a vast materials design space. To this end, relying on machine learning methods instead of trial and error is promising, and among these, inverse design has emerged as a tool for generating materials with desired properties. Although inverse design methods based on diffusion models have shown success for crystalline materials and molecules, similar methods targeting amorphous materials remain less developed, mainly because of the limited availability of large‐scale datasets and the requirement for larger simulation cells. In this work, we propose and validate an inverse design method for amorphous materials, introducing AMDEN (Amorphous Material DEnoising Network), a diffusion model‐based framework that generates structures of amorphous materials. First, we demonstrate the inherent challenges for diffusion models to generate relaxed structures. These low‐energy configurations are typically obtained through a thermal motion‐driven random search‐like process that cannot be replicated by standard denoising procedures. We therefore introduce an energy‐based AMDEN variant that implements Hamiltonian Monte Carlo refinement for generating these relaxed structures. We further introduce several amorphous material datasets with diverse properties and compositions to evaluate our framework and support future development."},{"t":"胞内质子富集驱动统一双辅因子再生用于生物杂化二氧化碳固定","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8155133?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物杂化固碳","kp":["[生物杂化CO2还原]: 胞内质子富集驱动双辅因子统一再生"],"sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究报道了一种光催化生物杂化CO₂固定系统，通过胞内质子富集驱动双辅酶统一再生。该体系将光敏剂与全细胞生物催化剂耦合，利用胞内富集的质子同时再生NADH和NADPH两种辅酶，实现高效的CO₂生物转化。该策略为人工光合作用和碳固定提供了新思路。","ot":"Intracellular Proton Enrichment Drives Unified Dual‐Cofactor Regeneration for Biohybrid CO2 Fixation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photocatalytic biohybrid systems, which interface photosensitizers with whole‐cell biocatalysts, represent a platform for sustainable solar‐to‐chemical CO\n                    2\n                    conversion. However, their efficiency is fundamentally constrained by kinetic mismatch between sluggish transmembrane electron injection and uncoupled proton flux required for bioenergetic transduction. This uncoupling restricts the regeneration of adenosine triphosphate (ATP) and reduced nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide (NADH), the dual cofactors essential for driving carbon fixation pathways. Here, we introduce a proton enrichment strategy utilizing protonated manganese‐doped carbon dots (HMnCDs) that function simultaneously as reversible proton buffers and photoelectron donors. HMnCDs localize to the periplasm of\n                    Cupriavidus necato\n                    r H16, where their labile protons reinforce the transmembrane proton gradient driving ATP synthase. Concurrently, cytoplasmic HMnCDs facilitate proton‐coupled electron transfer, accelerating NADH photoregeneration. The concerted management of proton and electron fluxes decouples ATP generation from respiratory NADH oxidation, creating a synergistic cofactor supply even under electron transport chain inhibition. Consequently, the biohybrid achieves light‐driven autotrophic growth and poly(3‐hydroxybutyrate) biosynthesis from CO\n                    2\n                    , attaining a record quantum efficiency of 20.8%. Multi‐omics analyses reveal global metabolic reprogramming, including upregulated carbon fixation pathways and adaptive modulation of energy homeostasis under the proton‐enriched microenvironment. This work establishes proton enrichment as a generalizable design principle for coupling photochemistry with cellular bioenergetics."},{"t":"高浓度下的界面离子耗尽指导水系铝碘电池电解液设计","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00186-8?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Joule","tg":"观点评论","tp":"铝碘电池电解液","kp":["[电解质设计]: 存在最佳浓度非越浓越好","[电池体系]: 水系铝碘电池"],"dp":1,"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":4.5},"as":"研究发现高浓度电解质中界面离子耗尽现象，为水系铝碘电池电解液设计提供了新指导。传统假设认为盐浓度越高越有利于稳定多价电池，但该研究揭示高浓度下电极界面反而出现离子耗竭层。这一发现纠正了电解液设计的认知偏差，为水系铝碘电池的性能优化指明新方向。","ot":"Interfacial ion depletion at high concentration guides electrolyte design for aqueous aluminum-iodine batteries","b":"Concentrated electrolytes are widely used to stabilize aqueous multivalent batteries, with the assumption that more salt provides better protection. Yang et al. show that this is not always the case: beyond a critical concentration, functional cations become trapped in the bulk by chloride-coordinated aluminum complexes and fail to reach the electrode interface. By identifying an optimal concentration window, the authors enable a durable, high-rate aqueous aluminum-iodine battery and offer a design principle for future multivalent battery electrolytes."},{"t":"界面介导结晶实现无PEDOT:PSS全钙钛矿叠层电池，效率达29.1%且耐久性增强","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00185-6?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全钙钛矿叠层","kp":["转换效率[全钙钛矿叠层]: 29.1%","[界面工程]: 吩噻嗪功能化替代PEDOT:PSS"],"dp":1,"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究通过界面介导结晶策略，实现了不含PEDOT:PSS的全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池，效率达29.1%且耐久性增强。团队用吩噻嗪功能化界面替代易吸湿的PEDOT:PSS空穴传输层，抑制了亚稳相偏析问题，显著提升器件稳定性。该成果推动无空穴传输层叠层电池的实用化进程。","ot":"Interface-mediated crystallization enables PEDOT:PSS-free all-perovskite tandems with 29.1% efficiency and enhanced dura","b":"Replacing hygroscopic PEDOT:PSS with a phenothiazine-functionalized interface suppresses metastable phase segregation and directs Sn-Pb perovskite crystallization. A dual-anchor interlayer can form a robust interconnection in tandem devices. The PEDOT:PSS-free monolithic all-perovskite tandem achieves a record efficiency of 29.1% and long-term stability, demonstrating that precise interface design simultaneously enables high efficiency and durability."},{"t":"界面诱导内建磁场增强自旋交换相互作用实现高效氧电催化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00163-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁场氧电催化","kp":["[氧电催化]: 界面内置磁场实现无外场自旋交换调控"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队设计了反铁磁/铁磁异质结构，在界面处产生内置磁场，使电子自旋方向一致排列，从而显著增强氧电催化中的自旋交换相互作用。该机制可加速氧析出（OER）和氧还原（ORR）反应动力学，提升锌空气电池等能源器件的充放电效率。界面工程策略为设计高效非贵金属氧电催化剂提供了新思路，有望降低燃料电池和金属空气电池的铂族金属依赖。","ot":"Interface-induced built-in magnetic field boosted spin exchange interactions to enable high-efficiency oxygen electrocat","b":"Engineered antiferromagnetic/ferromagnetic heterostructures generate an interfacial built-in magnetic field that aligns electron spins, an effect that enables external field-free control of spin-dependent oxygen electrocatalysis via rapid quantum spin exchange interactions. This strategy enhances oxygen evolution activity and reveals the critical role of spin polarization in governing reaction process; thus, it offers a general design principle for efficient energy conversion materials."},{"t":"将营养重要性纳入陆生脊椎动物的保护中","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605237123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"There is global consensus on the need to prioritize conservation efforts to prevent biodiversity loss and defaunation. Most current conservation initiatives focus on areas with high species diversity or many threatened species, treating species independently and neglecting trophic interactions. To address these oversights, we developed a framework to quantify species’ roles along continuums of trophic importance (TI) and global endangerment (GE), estimated from a global terrestrial meta-food web of over 25,000 vertebrate species. We combined TI with IUCN Red List categories to create a Trophic Importance Global Endangerment (TIGE) index, integrating TI and extinction risk. Our analysis revealed that the TI index provides distinct and complementary insights beyond species endangerment. Systematic conservation planning indicated that prioritizing areas based on TIGE shows significant spatial inconsistency compared to traditional taxonomic approaches. Our findings emphasize the value of incorporating species trophic network importance into conservation strategies to reconcile species ecosystem functioning and biodiversity conservation."},{"t":"原位纳米晶体限制高效蓝色钙钛矿 LED","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10596-3","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Metal halide perovskites have emerged as promising semiconductors for light-emitting diodes (LEDs) owing to their excellent luminescence properties1. However, their performance remains limited, primarily owing to the inherent contradiction between ‘high crystallinity’ and ‘small size’ in the in situ synthesis of perovskite nanocrystals on substrates. Here we report efficient blue perovskite LEDs (PeLEDs) achieved via in situ polymerization-driven nanocrystal confinement to synthesize perovskite films composed of high-quality nanocrystals. The in situ-formed polymer network imposes nanoscale spatial constraints during perovskite nanocrystal growth, enabling nanocrystals with small sizes and a high photoluminescence quantum yield of 83%. Furthermore, polymerizable monomers with sufficient coordination sites allow a prolonged lattice rearrangement of perovskite clusters, promoting the crystallinity of the nanocrystals. The synthesized perovskite nanocrystals are utilized in the fabrication of PeLEDs, resulting in an external quantum efficiency of 21.8% at 491 nm, which is among the highest performances in blue PeLEDs. This work simultaneously controls the thermal dynamics of perovskite crystallization and organic ligand reactions, which helps to advance understanding of the effect of ligand engineering on nanocrystal synthesis, benefiting the development of efficient PeLEDs and other optoelectronic technologies.","tp":"钙钛矿发光器","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队通过原位聚合驱动的纳米晶体限制策略，解决了钙钛矿纳米晶体制备中高结晶度与小尺寸之间的固有矛盾，成功制备出高效蓝色钙钛矿LED（PeLEDs）。该方法的聚合物限域机制有效控制了纳米晶体尺寸和结晶质量，显著提升了蓝光器件的发光效率，推动了钙钛矿LED在全彩显示中的应用。","aip":1},{"t":"通过纠错与检测提升量子处理器逻辑错误率","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10628-y","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子纠错","kp":["[量子平台]: 离子阱QCCD","[纠错效果]: 逻辑错误率显著降低"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过改进量子纠错与错误检测技术，显著降低了量子处理器的逻辑错误率。容错量子计算要求逻辑错误率远低于物理错误率，是解决物理和化学关键问题的前提。研究团队在超导量子比特系统上优化纠错码的编解码方案，提升错误检测精度与速度，并减少逻辑比特所需的物理比特开销。改进后的逻辑错误率接近容错阈值，为运行更深层的量子算法（如量子化学模拟、材料科学计算）奠定了基础，标志着向实用化容错量子计算迈出关键一步。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Improved quantum processor logical error rates via correction and detection","b":"Performing quantum algorithms for critical problems in physics and chemistry requires substantially lower error rates than the physical error rates of present quantum computers. Achieving such low logical error rates requires quantum error correction1,2 and physical error rates below a critical threshold value3,4,5,6,7,8. We experimentally demonstrate on a trapped-ion quantum charge-coupled device (QCCD)9,10 improvements in logical error rates ranging from 11× to 800× compared with several physical circuit baselines, including quantum computation on multiple qubits. Our results hinge on two quantum error correction code constructions optimized for an ion-trap processor: a 12-qubit code encoding two qubits inspired by Knill11 and a 16-qubit tesseract colour code encoding four qubits12,13. These constructions are combined with a scalable method of error detection and post-selection to achieve reduced logical error rates. Our results show that state-of-the-art quantum devices are already able to make use of fault tolerance and error correction to strongly suppress errors in non-trivial quantum circuit computations.","aip":1},{"t":"层缠结三维共价有机框架中的亚胺键联异构调制荧光传感","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1228418?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架","kp":["[3D COF]: 亚胺键方向异构调控荧光传感性能"],"as":"该研究报道了在层间纠缠型三维共价有机框架（3D COFs）中发现的亚胺键键合异构现象。3D COFs作为新型多孔晶体材料，在气体存储、催化等领域具有应用潜力，但由二维层相互穿插形成的纠缠结构长期难以精确调控。研究团队通过设计特定单体并调控合成条件，实现了对亚胺键连接方式（C=N位置异构）的可控构建，获得了一系列具有纠缠拓扑的高结晶3D COFs。该工作揭示了COFs中键合异构对材料结构与性能的影响，为精准设计复杂拓扑多孔材料提供了新策略。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Imine Linkage Isomerism in Layer‐Entangled Three‐Dimensional Covalent Organic Frameworks Modulates Fluorescent Sensing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Three‐dimensional covalent organic frameworks (3D COFs) constructed from entangled two‐dimensional layers represent a rare yet intriguing structural class; however, the influence of variations in linkage structure within such architectures remains unexplored. Herein, we investigate a linkage‐isomeric pair of isoreticular layer‐entangled 3D COFs with opposite imine bond orientations (3D‐An‐CN‐COF and 3D‐An‐NC‐COF). Remarkably, although these two frameworks share nearly identical composition, topology, and porosity, the subtle difference in C═N bond orientation leads to pronounced differences in their optoelectronic properties and fluorescent sensing behaviors. In particular, 3D‐An‐CN‐COF exhibits nearly an order‐of‐magnitude higher sensitivity toward 2,4,6‐trinitrophenol (TNP) in aqueous media than 3D‐An‐NC‐COF, with a quenching constant of 3.27 × 10\n                    6\n                     M\n                    −1\n                    and a detection limit of 9.5 nmol L\n                    −1\n                    , placing it among the most sensitive COF‐based fluorescent sensors for TNP reported to date. These results establish imine linkage isomerism as an effective structural parameter for reprogramming the optoelectronic properties and sensing behavior of layer‐entangled 3D COFs, offering new insight into the rational design of high‐performance fluorescent sensing materials."},{"t":"IL-4 肽水凝胶将 MSC 异质性重新编程为 CD106+ 群体，以增强肾脏修复","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536368123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Mesenchymal stem cells (MSCs) exhibit significant heterogeneity, which limits their therapeutic efficacy in regenerative medicine. Here, we introduce a self-assembled interleukin-4 (IL-4) peptide hydrogel designed to shift MSC populations toward a homogeneous CD106\n                    +\n                    subset with enhanced regenerative and immunomodulatory capabilities. To evaluate their therapeutic potential, MSCs with the IL-4 hydrogel were administered to a murine model of acute kidney injury (AKI) via renal capsule transplantation. Compared with untreated MSCs, encapsulated MSCs exhibited superior engraftment and survival, leading to significant improvements in renal function, as evidenced by reduced serum creatinine levels, attenuated tubular necrosis, and decreased inflammatory infiltrates. These findings highlight the IL-4 peptide hydrogel as a promising platform for overcoming MSC heterogeneity and manufacturing disease-specific MSCs, offering a scalable strategy for advanced cell therapies in AKI and beyond."},{"t":"混合炼油工艺将植物材料转化为重要工业化学品","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01586-6","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"木质素生物炼制","kp":["[原料]: 木质素","[产物]: 尼龙组分(高收率)","[工艺]: 混合炼厂过程"],"dp":1,"as":"研究团队开发了一种混合精炼工艺，成功以高收率从木质素（lignin）这一植物复杂聚合物中制备出尼龙的关键原料（如己二酸等工业重要化学品）。木质素是自然界储量第二丰富的生物质，但因其结构复杂、极难降解，长期被视为低价值副产物。该工艺揭示了一条将木质素定向转化为高附加值化学品的新策略，为生物质精炼替代石油化工路线提供了可行路径，对可再生化学品供应链具有重要意义。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Hybrid refinery process turns plant material into industrially important chemical","b":"An ingredient of nylon has been made in high yields from lignin — revealing a fresh strategy for turning this complex plant biopolymer into industrial chemicals. An ingredient of nylon has been made in high yields from lignin — revealing a fresh strategy for turning this complex plant biopolymer into industrial chemicals."},{"t":"人为造成的海平面上升导致 21 世纪全球水位极端","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz3595?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The rate and impacts of sea level rise vary considerably around the world, but the contribution of human-caused climate change to increases in local and regional flood risks has not yet been systematically explored. Because such information is critical to local decision making, legal proceedings, and loss and damage determinations, we quantify human-caused climate change’s contributions to sea level rise at worldwide locations using budget-based and semiempirical model methods. Results show that human-caused sea level rise is quantifiable at 97% of 519 tide gauge sites and is responsible for 58% (44 to 65%) of the observed daily extreme water level exceedances over 2000–2018. On average, human-caused sea level rise has caused a near-tripling in the number of days with attributable exceedances since the 1970s.","tp":"人为海平面升","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"本研究重点评估了人为气候变化对全球海平面上升的具体贡献。海平面上升的速率和影响在全球各地差异显著，但此前针对人类活动如何增加局部和区域洪水风险的研究尚不充分。由于相关数据对地方决策、法律诉讼及损失评估至关重要，研究人员采用基于收支和半经验的模型方法，量化了全球多地人为气候变化对海平面上升的影响程度。"},{"t":"自 2000 年以来，人类迁徙激增——这些地图揭示了人们的去向","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01796-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Modelling with artificial-intelligence tools has filled gaps in migration data, revealing detailed global population movements from 1990 to 2023. Modelling with artificial-intelligence tools has filled gaps in migration data, revealing detailed global population movements from 1990 to 2023."},{"t":"Hp1bp3 丢失将染色质重组与神经胶质瘤的代谢脆弱性联系起来","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2601061123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"High-grade gliomas (HGGs) are aggressive brain tumors with poor prognosis, driven in part by metabolic and epigenetic adaptations. Methionine metabolism supports HGG growth by supplying S-adenosylmethionine for methylation reactions, yet how nutrient availability influences chromatin organization in HGG remains incompletely understood. Using an immunocompetent mouse model of HGG, we found that dietary methionine restriction reduced tumor proliferation, extended survival, and induced partial nuclear inversion. We identified Hp1bp3 as a key regulator of tumor growth that functions by interacting with nuclear tethering proteins to mediate chromatin reorganization. Loss of Hp1bp3 results in the upregulation of histone demethylases leading to selective depletion of H3K9me3-marked heterochromatin and accelerated glioma growth. Combining methionine restriction with Hp1bp3 loss increased the frequency of partial nuclear inversion and further suppressed tumor progression. These findings identify Hp1bp3 as a chromatin regulator linking methionine metabolism to heterochromatin stability and suggest that dietary methionine modulation can influence the structural organization of chromatin to slow tumor growth in HGG."},{"t":"冰是如何形成的还是个谜——现在科学家正在破解这个谜团","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01817-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Theories about how ice crystals grow in cooling liquids are wildly inaccurate when compared with experimental data, but studies are starting to illuminate the earliest moments in freezing. Theories about how ice crystals grow in cooling liquids are wildly inaccurate when compared with experimental data, but studies are starting to illuminate the earliest moments in freezing."},{"t":"能源政策如何支持全球南方国家的公正转型？来自南非可再生能源的见解","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003770?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源","sc":2.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"纳斯达克如何将其指数变成上市武器","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/nasdaq-turned-index-listings-weapon","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","b":"How Nasdaq Turned Its Index Into a Listings Weapon — The Information"},{"t":"我如何利用人工智能将失败的药物变成新药","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01626-1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","dp":1,"b":"By combining chemistry and biology with AI modelling, Layla Hosseini-Gerami is finding and reviving therapeutics with ‘huge potential’. By combining chemistry and biology with AI modelling, Layla Hosseini-Gerami is finding and reviving therapeutics with ‘huge potential’.","tp":"药物再利用","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":"Layla Hosseini-Gerami通过将化学与生物学知识结合AI建模技术，致力于发现和复活具有巨大潜力的治疗药物。她的研究方法利用AI从失败的药物候选物中筛选和优化具有新治疗价值的新药，展示了AI在药物重定位和药物化学创新中的应用前景，体现了计算方法对传统药物研发范式的变革。"},{"t":"高能晶面取向介孔单晶金属氧化物用于选择性氧化催化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73641?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"介孔单晶氧化物","kp":["[介孔单晶金属氧化物]: 无模板能量驱动高能晶面取向结晶"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了高能晶面取向的介孔单晶金属氧化物材料，用于选择性氧化催化。介孔单晶结构兼具高比表面积和优异电子传输性能，高能暴露晶面提供更丰富的催化活性位点。该材料体系在低碳烷烃氧化、醇选择性氧化等反应中展现出增强的催化活性和产物选择性，为设计高效多相催化剂提供了形貌-晶面协同工程的新范式。","ot":"High‐Energy‐Facet‐Oriented Mesoporous Single‐Crystal Metal Oxides for Selective Oxidation Catalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mesoporous single‐crystal metal oxides are highly attractive for heterogeneous catalysis because they combine high surface accessibility with long‐range lattice coherence; however, their synthesis remains fundamentally challenging due to the thermodynamic incompatibility between crystallization and pore formation. Here we report a template‐free, energy‐driven facet‐oriented crystallization strategy that enables the formation of mesoporous single‐crystal metal oxides with tunable pore architectures and exposed high‐energy facets. Polyvinylpyrrolidone functions simultaneously as a pore maintainer and surface‐energy regulator, preserving mesoporosity while selectively stabilizing high‐energy facets to direct single‐crystal growth. The method is applicable to multiple oxides, including Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , MgO, NiO, and mixed‐metal systems. As a representative example, mesoporous single‐crystal Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    with preferentially exposed (111) facets exhibits outstanding performance in the selective oxidation of aromatic alkanes, achieving up to 99% conversion and selectivity under mild conditions. Experimental and theoretical analyses suggest that the synergy between mesoporosity and active‐facet exposure enhances reactant adsorption, oxygen activation, and reaction kinetics, providing a general design principle for crystallographically defined porous catalysts."},{"t":"二碳分子的高激发电子态：从光谱学到动力学","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73631?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The dicarbon molecule (C\n                    2\n                    ) serves not only as a benchmark for studying chemical bonding, but also as an elementary building block in the bottom‐up synthesis of carbon materials, and a key species in astrochemistry. The spectroscopic and dynamic studies of C\n                    2\n                    have lasted for longer than two centuries, which provide invaluable insights into its complex electronic structure manifested as dense manifolds of low‐lying electronic states, quasi‐degenerate frontier orbitals, and significant multi‐configurational characters. From a materials perspective, spectroscopic and dynamical insights into the excited states of C\n                    2\n                    are pivotal for controlling the non‐equilibrium carbon chemistry in chemical vapor deposition (CVD) processes, where C\n                    2\n                    acts as a primary building block. Here, we present a comprehensive review of recent progress on the spectroscopic and dynamic study of C\n                    2\n                    , focusing on its highly excited states near or above the lowest dissociation threshold. These advances not only led to the identification of several new highly excited states but also provided important information on the decay dynamics in excited states, including state‐specific lifetimes and predissociation dynamics. Despite these advances, our understanding of the predissociation dynamics of C\n                    2\n                    remains limited; thus, several future prospects are proposed, and implications for the precise controlled synthesis of carbon materials are also mentioned.","tp":"碳分子光谱","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"该综述系统总结了二碳分子（C₂）高激发电子态的光谱学和动力学研究进展。C₂不仅是化学键理论的基准体系，也是碳材料自下而上合成的基本构建单元和天体化学中的关键物种。历经两个多世纪的研究，该综述深入分析了C₂复杂的电子结构、激发态动力学及其在基础化学和天体物理中的意义。"},{"t":"高通量筛选确定了 SPOP-PABPC1 轴在肺腺癌进展中的关键作用","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602470123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Lung adenocarcinoma (LUAD) is the most common and deadly subtype of lung cancer, with limited therapeutic options and poor prognosis. Ubiquitination is an important posttranslational modification (PTM) that controls protein turnover, localization and interaction. The dysregulated ubiquitination machinery is a hallmark of cancer, contributing to tumor development. Identifying key E3 ubiquitin ligases and deubiquitinases in LUAD could lead to new biomarkers and treatments. Through RNA sequencing, bioinformatics, and clinical studies, SPOP has been identified as a promising E3 ligase target in LUAD. SPOP is downregulated in LUAD samples and associated with poorer patient outcomes. Functional analyses demonstrate that SPOP suppresses LUAD cell migration, proliferation, and in vivo tumor growth. Mechanistically, SPOP targets poly(A)-binding protein cytoplasmic 1 (PABPC1) for nonproteolytic ubiquitination, leading to its nuclear retention and inhibition of global protein synthesis, thereby suppressing the oncogenic effects of PABPC1. Furthermore, the deubiquitinase HAUSP is able to counteract SPOP-mediated ubiquitination of PABPC1, enhancing its oncogenic role in LUAD cells. Collectively, our findings reveal a SPOP/HAUSP-PABPC1 regulatory axis in LUAD, where SPOP and HAUSP oppositely modulate PABPC1 ubiquitination to control LUAD cell proliferation and migration. This axis represents a promising therapeutic target in LUAD."},{"t":"高比例可再生能源下真实输电网络中电网级储能的高分辨率选址与定容","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007889?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能选址定容","as":"","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"High-resolution siting and sizing of grid-scale energy storage for real-world transmission networks under high renewable"},{"t":"高能量密度水系镁金属电池织物实现−40°C至100°C超灵敏压力传感","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec8124?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"镁金属电池织物","kp":["工作温度[水系镁电池织物]: -40°C至100°C","电解质[水系镁电池]: 准固态PEO基","[器件形态]: 柔性储能织物"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了高能量密度的水系镁金属电池纺织品，用于驱动超灵敏柔性压力传感器，面向智能可穿戴传感系统。水系镁电池具备高安全性、低成本和环境友好等优势，将其编织成柔性纺织品后可为可穿戴设备自供电。该方案解决了传统柔性传感器依赖外部电源的瓶颈，在健康监测、人机交互等场景具有广阔应用前景。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"High-energy-density aqueous magnesium metal battery textiles enable ultrasensitive pressure sensing across −40° to 100°C","b":"Smart wearable sensing systems necessitate self-powered, high-sensitivity pressure sensors that can operate efficiently across a wide temperature range. Here, we present a high-energy-density aqueous magnesium metal battery (AMMB) textile for ultrasensitive pressure sensing from −40° to 100°C. The AMMB-type pressure (AMMB-P) sensing textile features a porous quasi-solid-state polyethylene oxide–magnesium chloride electrolyte that inhibits magnesium corrosion via hydrogen-bond anchoring, paired with a breathable carbon cloth cathode and woven magnesium anode. The innovative design achieves an ultrahigh sensitivity of 687.32 millivolts per kilopascal, a low detection limit (0.96 pascals), long-term durability (200,000 cycles), and exceptional breathability (water vapor permeability, 2281.4 ± 249.8 grams per square meter per day; air permeability, 628.0 ± 9.1 millimeters per second). The unique anticrystallization properties of electrolyte ensure a stable operation of the AMMB-P sensing textile in extreme temperatures ranging from −40° to 100°C. Under high-pressure condition, our AMMB-P sensing textile can be converted into a reliable power source with high energy density of 287.92 watt-hours per kilogram, ensuring stable self-powered operation. Coupled with machine learning, the AMMB-P sensing array enables intelligent object recognition and autonomous robotic control even under harsh conditions. Our work advances self-powered pressure-sensing textiles tailored for extreme-environment exploration, enabling interactive perception in humanoid robots and individual health management under harsh service conditions.","aip":1},{"t":"分层激光编程软致动器用于设计具有自由形变形状的仿生机器人","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb1989?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"激光编程软驱动器","kp":["[驱动策略]: 空间差异化激光编程","[应用]: 仿生软体机器人自由形变"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了分层激光编程的软致动器设计方法，用于构建具有自由变形能力的仿生机器人。受生物启发的形态可变结构是下一代软体机器人实现前所未有适应性的关键。通过激光逐层编程调控软材料的非均匀响应，可实现复杂的三维形状变化与可控运动。该方法为仿生机器人在复杂环境中的抓取、移动和适应提供了新范式，推动了软体机器人向多功能化发展。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Hierarchical laser-programmed soft actuators for designing bionic robots with freeform morphing shapes","b":"Bio-inspired shape-morphing structures, essential for next-generation soft robotics with unprecedented adaptability, demand actuators capable of complex and configurable three-dimensional motions. By overcoming traditional stimulus-responsive strategies facing the trade-off between manufacturing simplicity and kinematic sophistication, here, we introduce a spatially differentiated laser-programming technology for digital manufacturing laser-induced graphene-based soft actuators (LIG-SAs) with freeform morphing capabilities. Via cross-scale control of lasing energy and scribing direction, material heterogeneity and structural hierarchy can be tuned simultaneously for introducing decoupled electrothermal distribution and stiffness anisotropy, thus encoding LIG-SAs with four typical motion units: straight bending, directional curling, rigid supporting, and soft connecting. By arbitrarily grouping multimodal morphing units into concretized devices, this approach further empowers freeform design of bionic robots including octopus-like tentacles and inchworm/seal–like crawlers toward multitask locomotion of conformal grasping, path navigation, and obstacle avoidance. This framework bridges digital design with physical intelligence, unlocking previously unidentified avenues of soft robots for creating sophisticated and programmable morphologies."},{"t":"H2S供体预处理的血管内皮细胞来源的细胞外囊泡用于多途径血管修复","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00231-6?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"Matter","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"We report a translatable EVs nanoplatform for coordinated vascular repair by simply stimulating vascular endothelial cells with a hydrogen sulfide (H2S) donor in vitro. These EVs target injured arteries, reduce local inflammation, inhibit neointimal hyperplasia, and promote endothelial regeneration, while avoiding toxicity risks of systemic H2S delivery. In a rat carotid artery injury model, these EVs achieve effective vascular repair and good biosafety, offering a promising strategy for treating vascular diseases."},{"t":"Grenergy在智利启动3.5 GWh电池项目，扩建阿塔卡马计划 - 储能","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/10/grenergy-inaugurates-3-5-gwh-battery-project-in-chile-expands-atacama-plans/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能项目投产","kp":["储能容量[智利Elena项目]: 3.5 GWh","电池集装箱数: 624个","[规模]: 美洲最大运营储能"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":8.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"西班牙独立发电商Grenergy在智利安托法加斯塔地区投运了Elena储能项目，规模达3.5 GWh，是拉丁美洲最大的电池储能项目之一。同时公司扩大了阿塔卡马地区的开发计划。该项目结合光伏发电与电池储能，为智利电网提供调峰和稳定性服务，标志着拉美可再生能源+储能一体化模式的规模化落地。","ot":"Grenergy inaugurates 3.5 GWh battery project in Chile, expands Atacama plans - Energy Storage","b":"Madrid-based IPP Grenergy has inaugurated Elena, a 3.5 GWh battery energy storage project in Chile’s Antofagasta region. The facility forms Phase 6 of the company’s Oasis de Atacama solar and storage platform in northern Chile.\nGrenergy said the project is the largest battery storage facility currently operating in the Americas. The installation comprises 624 battery containers housing 6,240 battery units and forms part of the company’s plan to expand its storage portfolio to 7 GWh by 2028.\nThe project was officially opened at a ceremony in the municipality of María Elena attended by Chilean President José Antonio Kast Rist, Energy Minister Ximena Rincón, Science, Technology, Knowledge and Innovation Minister Ximena Lincolao, and Spain’s ambassador to Chile, Laura Oroz.\nElena is one component of the broader Oasis de Atacama development, which Grenergy expanded last month as part of an updated strategic plan. The company now aims to develop 2.5 GW of solar generation and 14.1 GWh of battery storage across the platform.\nGrenergy said the project established the template for a solar-plus-storage model it intends to replicate elsewhere. Planned developments include the Oasis Central platform in central Chile, with 1.4 GW of solar and 5.1 GWh of storage, and the Iberian Oasis project in Spain.\nCombined, the company’s Oasis developments represent 5 GW of solar capacity and 22 GWh of battery storage, according to Grenergy. The company said the projects are designed to shift solar generation into non-solar hours, provide grid flexibility and supply dispatchable renewable energy to industrial customers.\nData center plans\nGrenergy also disclosed additional details about GR Data, its data center business in Chile, which it said has a development pipeline totaling 1 GW of IT capacity.\nOne of the first planned projects is Atacama Data, an artificial intelligence training campus located near the Elena battery facility. Grenergy said the development will launch with 400 MW of IT capacity and could expand to 1 GW.\nThe company is also planning the Polpaico Campus Norte and Alto Jahuel Campus Sur data center projects near Chile’s main connectivity hubs. Together, the two facilities are expected to provide an additional 600 MW of IT capacity.\nGrenergy has operated in Chile since 2012. The company said it has invested $2.8 billion in the country to date and plans to invest a further $2 billion over the next two years, bringing its total investment in Chile to $4.8 billion."},{"t":"欧盟\"电池助推器\"计划获批","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.electrive.com/2026/06/10/green-light-for-the-eus-battery-booster/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"electrive","tg":"政策监管","tp":"电池产业政策","kp":["资金规模[欧盟电池项目]: €15亿无息贷款"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"as":"欧盟委员会正式启动'电池助推器'（Battery Booster）设施，旨在支持欧洲本土电池电芯制造产能建设。该政策工具回应了欧洲在动力电池供应链上对亚洲的深度依赖，通过资金支持和监管协调加速本土产能扩张。此举是欧盟绿色协议产业计划的关键组成，目标是在2030年前建立具有全球竞争力的电池产业链生态。","ot":"Green light for the EU’s ‘Battery Booster’ - electrive.com","b":"The European Commission has launched its long-planned Battery Booster Facility to support battery cell production in Europe. The programme provides €1.5 billion in interest-free loans, with the call for proposals expected in the third quarter.\nSymbolic image\nImage: PowerCo\nThe European Commission has long signalled its intention to support the expansion of battery cell production in Europe. Commission President Ursula von der Leyen first proposed a ‘Battery Booster Package’\nin March 2025\nas part of the EU’s action plan for the automotive sector. At the time, she also said the Commission would ‘explore direct production subsidies by the EU for companies manufacturing batteries in Europe’.\nWhen the Commission presented its\n‘Automotive Package’\nin December 2025, it followed up on those plans by announcing a €1.8 billion ‘Battery Booster’ programme aimed at supporting the production of battery cells for electric vehicles.\nlengthy delay\n, the European Commission has officially launched the Battery Booster Facility. The facility is a financing instrument that will provide interest-free loans to support battery cell production in Europe. Its budget amounts to €1.5 billion and will be funded through revenues from the EU Emissions Trading System (ETS). The remaining €300 million from the €1.8 billion package announced previously appears to have been allocated to separate battery raw material projects and is not included in the new facility.\n“Europe’s battery industry has made important steps forward but is now at a critical juncture. This is the right time to support them to reach commercial success. The Battery Booster Facility does exactly that: it steps in at the most critical and capital-intensive phase of industrial scale-up and does so in a way that is financially sound,” says EU Climate Commissioner Wopke Hoekstra. “This will support the European automotive industry to step up electric vehicle production with European batteries. Funded with the revenues from the Emission Trading System, it is turning the cost of emissions into the fuel for innovation.”\nThe European Commission’s funding programme is focused solely on large-scale projects—and only under specific conditions. Applications are open exclusively to companies already in the ramp-up phase of cell production and planning a minimum annual production capacity of 10 GWh. Based on an assumed average battery capacity of 50 kWh, this would equate to battery cells for 200,000 electric vehicles.\nThe European Commission justifies its focus on supporting cell factories during the ramp-up phase – after construction but before stable mass production – by pointing to the financial challenges of this stage. “[The ramp-up phase] is characterised by high scrap rates, making it difficult to achieve profitability and meet strict quality standards required by the automotive sector,” the Commission states.\nHowever, the programme includes a key restriction: funding is only available for an applicant’s first industrial-scale cell factory. Additional plants operated by existing manufacturers are not eligible. Under these criteria, only a limited number of companies are likely to qualify, including\n, the battery joint venture of Stellantis, Mercedes-Benz and TotalEnergies, Renault-backed\n, and Volkswagen\nGroup’s PowerCo\nThe facility can provide up to €500 million per applicant. In theory, the €1.5 billion budget could therefore be allocated among three companies, although the eventual distribution remains unclear.\nThe strict limitations of the funding programme suggest that the European Commission aims to prevent a repeat of the Northvolt scenario. The Swedish cell manufacturer, among other reasons,\nfiled for insolvency\nbecause it failed to minimise production scrap rates and achieve profitability in its first commercial plant. As a result, Northvolt’s commercial ramp-up was unsuccessful.\n(press release),\n(funding guidelines; PDF)\nabout „Green light for the EU’s ‘Battery Booster’“"},{"t":"良好的回收从本土做起——造福全球","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01823-y","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"家庭废物分类","sc":2.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"新研究证实了家庭层面垃圾源头分类的显著价值，精细化的居民端分离可大幅提升回收材料纯度和再利用率，降低后端处理成本并减少环境负担。但研究同时强调政策设计须审慎考虑消费者行为习惯、便利性和激励机制，避免因规则复杂导致参与率下降。家庭分类是全球循环经济体系的基础环节，对减碳和资源安全具有系统性意义。","ot":"Good recycling starts at home — and benefits the world","b":"New research supports the value of household-level waste separation. But policies must also carefully consider consumer behaviours to maximize the quality of material collected. New research supports the value of household-level waste separation. But policies must also carefully consider consumer behaviours to maximize the quality of material collected."},{"t":"FeOOH 纳米纺锤中谷胱甘肽诱导的原位氧空位促进声催化肿瘤治疗","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6524839?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Defect engineering can enhance carrier separation in sonocatalysts to boost reactive oxygen species (ROS) generation; however, the current methods still rely on in vitro physicochemical defect introduction that lacks tumor specificity and poses a risk of off‐target activation. Herein, we developed FeOOH nanospindles in which glutathione (GSH) within tumor cells triggers the formation of in situ oxygen vacancies (O\n                    vac\n                    ), promoting ROS generation during sonocatalytic therapy (SCT) to enhance antitumor efficacy while minimizing off‐target toxicity. The introduction of O\n                    vac\n                    narrows the bandgap, raises the Fermi level, promotes charge separation, and inhibits electron‐hole recombination, thereby significantly enhancing the sonocatalytic production of\n                    1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    . Concurrently, Fe\n                    3+\n                    ions catalyze oxygen evolution to alleviate tumor hypoxia, while Fe\n                    3+\n                    ions are reduced to Fe\n                    2+\n                    ions by GSH, which mediate the Fenton reaction, generating toxic •OH under ultrasound irradiation. This “three‐in‐one” design ingeniously integrates tumor microenvironment (TME) responsiveness, in situ defect engineering, and multiple catalytic mechanisms to disrupt redox homeostasis and trigger apoptosis and ferroptosis synergistically. By enabling in situ activation and site‐specific amplification of therapeutic functions, this work offers a great promise for advancing precision oncology and overcoming the current limitations of ROS‐based tumor therapies.","tp":"声催化治疗","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了FeOOH纳米纺锤体声催化剂，利用肿瘤细胞内谷胱甘肽（GSH）触发原位氧空位形成，增强载流子分离和活性氧（ROS）生成，实现高效声催化肿瘤治疗。该策略利用肿瘤微环境特异性激活缺陷工程，避免了传统体外物理化学缺陷引入方法缺乏肿瘤特异性和脱靶激活风险，显著提升了治疗的靶向性和安全性。"},{"t":"全球供应链奖：年度企业","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/global-supply-chain-awards-enterprise-of-the-year","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Global Supply Chain Awards: Enterprise of the Year\nPrioritise Us\nThe Global Supply Chain Awards 2026 opens entries for the Enterprise of the Year category, celebrating those demonstrating exceptional global impact\nJoin Supply Chain LIVE: The London Summit & Awards on 8–9 September 2026 at the QEII Centre in Westminster, where more than 1,000 attendees and 50+ expert speakers will unite to explore some of the most pressing challenges and celebrate the most innovative strategies.\nOn 8 September, the Global Supply Chain Awards will be held, bringing together leading professionals from around the global supply chain sector. Entries are now open for eight dedicated categories, with a focus on strategic excellence, shining stars and acceptance of emerging trends.\nAt the Awards, we will be celebrating some of the large-scale organisations which are demonstrating excellence, with the Enterprise of the Year Award.\nEntries are now open\nfor the award, as well as\nsponsorship opportunities\nTaking place on 8 September, 2026, at the iconic JW Marriott Grosvenor House London, the Global Supply Chain Awards will bring together some of the most influential supply chain leaders for an exclusive black-tie gala dinner.\nThe ceremony will celebrate excellence,\nleadership and innovation\nacross the sector, offering a powerful platform to connect with leaders and share success stories. Now is the time to get involved and show off your organisations' excellence.\nThe Enterprise of the Year Award recognises organisations with more than 1,000 employees, celebrating those who are consistently\nsetting new benchmarks\nand delivering strong results. Whether the success is in supply chain management, leadership or innovation, this category is one not to miss out on,\nBusinesses have undergone significant shifts in the last year, driven by ongoing turbulence and constantly shifting trade agreements. The best organisations have stayed afloat, demonstrating resilience and operational efficiency even amid volatility.\nThrough the application of strong strategies and innovative thinking, these leading enterprises have been able to deliver on global impact, making a difference to communities and environments around the world.\nIf your business has spent the last 12 months demonstrating its excellence and shone throughout volatility,\nwe want to celebrate you\nWhat our judges are looking for:\nPrevious rising star winners have recognised for setting new benchmarks and driving a positive global impact.\nWhy This Award Matters\nBeing shortlisted for the Enterprise of the Year Award celebrates those large-scale organisations which are using innovative measures for good. Some of this is through exceptional leadership, celebrating the environment which has been built within the company, or it could be those that are driving new strategies and making a difference.\nKey Dates and Deadlines\nEntries for the\nGlobal Supply Chain Awards 2026 are now open\nCo-located with Procurement LIVE and Sustainability LIVE,\nSupply Chain LIVE\nwill take place on 8 and 9 September at QEII Centre, Westminster.\nIn an era where procurement, resilience and ESG are entirely inseparable, this event offers a rare opportunity to network across all three disciplines in a single location.\nSecure your tickets today to celebrate the present, and meet the future, of supply chain leadership."},{"t":"深海巨型甲壳类动物从细菌那里偷走了一招","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01832-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Organisms called bathynomids boast a bacterial gene that helps them to regulate their metabolism in the cold depths. Organisms called bathynomids boast a bacterial gene that helps them to regulate their metabolism in the cold depths."},{"t":"德国法院裁定Google对AI概览错误承担责任","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/german-court-rules-google-responsible-ai-overviews-errors","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","as":"德国法院裁定谷歌需对其AI Overviews（AI概述）生成的错误内容承担责任。这一判决可能对搜索引擎行业产生深远影响，意味着AI生成内容不再被视为免责的自动摘要，平台需为AI输出的事实性错误承担法律后果，或倒逼企业加强AI内容审核。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"AI概览责任","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.5,"r":6.5,"d":3.5,"t":9.0},"ot":"German Court Rules Google is Responsible for AI Overviews Errors","b":"German Court Rules Google is Responsible for AI Overviews Errors — The Information"},{"t":"$^{7}\\mathrm{Be}$系统的广义简化$R$矩阵理论分析","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/3wlg-jl8j","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Xu Han, Jie Liu, Zhen-Peng Chen, Tie-Jun Zu, and Tao YeBased on the generalized reduced $R$-matrix theory, the $R$-matrix analysis code (RAC) program is employed to analyze all reaction channels associated with the $^{7}\\mathrm{Be}$ system. The present calculations provide reliable evaluation data, which shows overall good agreement with available exper…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064607] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","tp":"核反应分析","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"基于广义简化R矩阵理论，使用RAC程序对7Be系统的所有反应通道进行分析，为核反应评估数据提供可靠参考，计算结果与现有实验数据整体吻合良好。"},{"t":"超薄膜中射弹穿透能的一般反立方厚度缩放","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2609202123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/强度材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Ultrathin films of widely different materials exhibit a dramatic enhancement of projectile penetration resistance under high–velocity impact. Despite extensive simulations and experiments, a unifying physical explanation has remained elusive. Here we show that the specific penetration energy follows a general inverse-cube scaling law,\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            E\n                            p\n                            ∗\n                          \n                          \n                            (\n                            h\n                            )\n                          \n                          =\n                          \n                            E\n                            \n                              p\n                              ,\n                              ∞\n                            \n                            ∗\n                          \n                          +\n                          B\n                          \n                            h\n                            \n                              −\n                              3\n                            \n                          \n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    , across chemically and structurally distinct systems. The inverse–cube scaling is traced to a finite–size correction to the effective shear modulus caused by suppression of long–wavelength nonaffine modes. The scaling describes impact data for multilayer graphene, graphene oxide, and polymer thin films, revealing a common elastic contribution to nanoscale impact resistance.","tp":"薄膜抗穿透","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现超薄膜在高速度冲击下展现出显著增强的抗穿透能力，并揭示了特定穿透能量遵循一般反立方厚度缩放定律，为不同材料的穿透行为提供了统一物理解释。"},{"t":"基因祖先揭示了真核发生过程中不同的微生物关联","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10639-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The origin of eukaryotes remains a central enigma in biology1. Continuing debates agree on the pivotal role of a symbiosis between an alphaproteobacterium and an Asgard archaeon2,3. However, the nature, timing and contributions of other potential bacterial partners4,5,6 and the role of interactions with viruses7,8,9 remain contentious. To address these questions, we used advanced phylogenomic approaches and comprehensive datasets spanning the known diversity of cellular life and viruses. Our analysis provided a revised reconstruction of the last eukaryotic common ancestor (LECA) proteome, in which we traced the phylogenetic origin of each protein family. We found compelling evidence for multiple waves of horizontal gene transfer from diverse bacterial donors, with some likely to have preceded mitochondrial endosymbiosis. We inferred plausible traits of the major donors and their functional contributions to the LECA. Our findings support a contribution of horizontal gene transfers to shaping the proteomes of pre-LECA ancestors and suggest a facilitating role of Nucleocytoviricota viruses. Taken together, our results suggest that ancient eukaryotes may have originated within complex microbial ecosystems through a succession of diverse associations that left a footprint of horizontally transferred genes."},{"t":"Z 世代对人工智能的怀疑是一记警钟——大学必须认真对待","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01814-z","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The challenge for universities is not adopting artificial intelligence, but doing so in ways that the current generation of students can trust. The challenge for universities is not adopting artificial intelligence, but doing so in ways that the current generation of students can trust.","tp":"教育AI信任","sc":1.4,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":"Z世代对人工智能日益增长的怀疑态度为高等教育敲响了警钟。文章指出，当前大学面临的主要挑战并非仅仅在于引入和采用人工智能技术，更关键的是必须以一种能够让当代学生建立信任的方式去应用它。这要求高校在拥抱AI技术革新时，需高度重视学生的信任度、透明度以及伦理考量，而非单纯追求技术普及。"},{"t":"GREM1/FGFR1激活的肌成纤维细胞诱导免疫抑制并加速高级浆液性卵巢癌的转移","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529786123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Joint effect of cancer-associated fibroblasts (CAFs) and regulatory T cells (Tregs) can drive immunosuppression in high-grade serous ovarian cancer (HGSOC), thereby promoting tumor metastasis and limiting the clinical benefit of PD-1/PD-L1 blockade. However, the mechanistic crosstalk between CAFs and Tregs remains unclear. By integrating bulk RNA-seq, single-cell RNA-seq datasets, and spatial transcriptomics datasets with functional assays, we identified a population of TGF-β1-driven Gremlin1 (GREM1)\n                    +\n                    myofibroblastic CAFs (myCAFs) enriched in HGSOC metastatic lesions. These GREM1\n                    +\n                    myCAFs activated the FGFR1-MAPKs-NFκB-TDO2-kynurenine axis via autocrine signaling, promoting tumor growth, metastasis, and immune evasion characterized by the infiltration of CD4\n                    +\n                    Tregs and dysfunctional CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells. GREM1 knockdown suppressed tumor metastasis, restored antitumor T cells response, remodeled CAF subtype composition and potentiated anti-PD-1 therapy efficacy. This study highlights the pro-metastatic role of GREM1\n                    +\n                    myCAFs across multiple tumors and provides a rationale for combining anti-PD-1 therapy for metastatic HGSOC.","tp":"卵巢癌转移","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"as":"最新研究揭示了高级浆液性卵巢癌（HGSOC）免疫逃逸和转移的新机制。研究发现，癌症相关成纤维细胞与调节性T细胞（Tregs）的协同作用会诱导免疫抑制，加速肿瘤转移，并限制PD-1/PD-L1免疫疗法的临床疗效。通过整合 Bulk RNA测序、单细胞RNA测序及空间转录组学数据，研究团队识别出由TGF-β1驱动的特定细胞亚群，深入阐明了肿瘤微环境的复杂作用。"},{"t":"通用汽车与Redwood扩大合作，推进梯次利用电池储能项目","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.electrive.com/2026/06/10/gm-and-redwood-expand-partnership-with-second-life-battery-storage-project/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"electrive","tg":"产业进展","tp":"退役电池梯次利用","kp":["装机容量[梯次利用]: 1.5 MW/7.2 MWh","电池包数[梯次利用]: 约100个"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"通用汽车与Redwood Materials扩展电池回收合作，启动梯次利用储能项目。退役电动车电池虽不再满足车辆动力要求，但仍保留可观容量可用于固定式储能。该项目将回收电池重新部署于电网级储能系统，延长电池全生命周期价值，降低储能成本。此举体现了EV电池'车用-储能-材料回收'三段式循环经济模式的产业化推进。","ot":"GM and Redwood expand partnership with second-life battery storage project - electrive.com","b":"General Motors and Redwood Materials are extending their battery partnership with a second-life energy storage project in Michigan. Around 100 repurposed GM EV battery packs will provide 1.5 MW/7.2 MWh of capacity at a GM manufacturing plant, supporting lower energy costs and grid resilience.\nImage: Redwood Materials\nAccording to Redwood, the Michigan installation demonstrates how battery technology originally developed for electric vehicles can continue to create value after its automotive service life. The installation is expected to reduce the plant’s electricity costs by more than $3 million over the system’s operational lifetime.\nThe project marks a further step in the relationship between the two companies and makes GM the first automotive manufacturer to work with Redwood across the entire battery lifecycle. The partnership now spans battery manufacturing scrap recycling, end-of-life EV battery recycling, second-life battery deployment and the recovery of materials for future battery production.\nRedwood already works with Ultium Cells, GM’s battery cell joint venture with LG Energy Solution, recycling manufacturing scrap from battery production facilities in the United States. When GM electric vehicle batteries reach the end of their useful life on the road, they are sent to Redwood, where they are either repurposed into stationary energy storage systems or processed to recover critical raw materials.\nTo date, Redwood says it has received more than 28,000 metric tonnes of battery material from GM and Ultium Cells for recycling. In addition, around 10,000 GM battery packs are currently earmarked for second-life applications through Redwood Energy, the company’s energy storage division.\nThe Michigan deployment follows several other large-scale projects using repurposed GM batteries. Second-life GM battery packs are already being used in Redwood’s energy storage installation in Sparks, Nevada. The project, developed for AI infrastructure company Crusoe, is described by Redwood as the world’s largest battery energy storage system built from repurposed EV batteries and the largest microgrid in North America.\n“Together, GM and Redwood are showing how repurposed EV batteries can keep working well beyond their useful life in a vehicle — first as energy storage, and ultimately as recovered material for future batteries,” the company stated.\nabout „GM and Redwood expand partnership with second-life battery storage project“\n10.06.2026 um 13:45\nThis is great day for GM and Energy Storage. Excited to see what the future holds!"},{"t":"G 蛋白调节网络控制受体内化动力学","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524866123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"G protein–coupled receptors (GPCRs) enable chemical communication between cells and are involved in nearly all essential functions. They transduce signals via heterotrimeric G proteins and are regulated by internalization, a process which redirects them from the cell surface to internal compartments and enables diversified signaling through spatial reorganization. Beyond the receptor, a vast regulatory network exists to further control G-protein signaling. However, it is unclear whether these modes of G-protein regulation also impact the upstream GPCR. Here, we systematically address how G-protein cycle regulation shapes GPCR internalization and establish several key principles and mechanisms governing this process. We find that timing of G-protein activation and deactivation and changes in G-protein cycle lifetime imparted by guanine nucleotide exchange factors, activators of G-protein signaling, and regulators of G-protein signaling can alter internalization outcomes. Furthermore, we determine how the activity and balance of discrete G-protein components interact with the G protein–coupled receptor kinase system to influence GPCR spatial distribution. Finally, we uncover that disease-associated variants of the most abundant G protein in the brain, GαoA, affect the regulatory network that drives GPCR internalization. Altogether, this study reveals that GPCR internalization is not a fixed receptor property but is dynamically governed by receptor–G-protein activation order, cycle lifetime, and the balance of Gα and Gβγ availability. As such, alterations in receptor internalization dynamics may contribute to the complex disease phenotypes associated with dysregulated G-protein networks.","tp":"G蛋白调控","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"G蛋白偶联受体（GPCR）是细胞间化学通信的核心，几乎参与所有关键的生理过程。该受体通过异三聚体G蛋白转导信号，并受控于受体内化过程，从而改变其在细胞内的空间分布以实现信号多样化。尽管已知存在一个庞大的调节网络来控制G蛋白信号传导，但该网络内部分子的具体运作机制及如何精确调控受体内化动力学，目前仍待进一步阐明。"},{"t":"利用液晶液滴阵列实现全矢量场传感","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73661?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液晶光场传感","kp":["[全矢量光场传感]: 液晶液滴阵列测量振幅/相位/偏振"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究开发了基于液晶液滴阵列的全矢量光场传感技术，可同时测量光的振幅、相位和偏振分布。液晶液滴对光场的各向异性响应使其能够编码矢量信息，阵列化设计实现空间分辨。该方案突破了传统传感器仅能测量标量强度的局限，在光学成像、量子光场表征和环境监测等领域具有应用潜力，为多维光场探测提供了紧凑、低成本的解决方案。","ot":"Full Vectorial Field Sensing Using Liquid Crystal Droplet Arrays","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Determining the amplitude, phase, and polarization profile of light is essential for both fundamental scientific discovery and applications spanning optical metrology, microscopy, astronomy, and optical communication/computing technologies. However, most modern measurement approaches are unable to retrieve such parameters readily, often relying on bulky and expensive hardware or lacking the capability for single‐shot sensing. Here, we introduce a low cost, compact, full vectorial field sensor based on an inkjet‐printed nematic liquid crystal droplet array that enables simultaneous measurement of these important characteristics of light. Polarization and intensity are measured via division‐of‐wavefront polarimetry, exploiting the droplets’ spatially varying birefringence, while the phase is reconstructed by treating each droplet as a separate microlens in a Shack‐Hartmann‐like wavefront sensor configuration. To demonstrate the system's performance, we characterize aberrated dual‐wavelength beams carrying distinct intensity, phase, and polarization information, confirming accurate retrieval of the optical field profiles for both spectral components."},{"t":"核废料处理用框架材料","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D6CS00154H","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"框架材料核废处理","kp":["[核废料处理]: 框架材料选择性捕获阴阳离子核素"],"as":"随着能源需求增长与环境安全要求提升，核废料处理与处置成为关键课题。该研究聚焦于框架类材料（如金属有机框架MOFs、沸石、共价有机框架等）在核废料处理中的应用。这类材料凭借高比表面积、可调控孔道结构与丰富活性位点，能够高效吸附、分离和固定放射性核素，有望为核废料的安全存储与处置提供新方案。","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Framework materials for nuclear waste treatment","b":"Driven by energy demand and environmental safety, the ability to treat and dispose of nuclear waste is sought to fulfil the demand for sustainable nuclear power. Radioactive byproducts generated by nuclear fission, including cationic radionuclides (235UO22+, 137Cs+, 90Sr2+, noble metals and partial actinide elements), anionic radionuclides (99TcO4−, 129/131I3−, 129/131I−, etc.), gaseous effluents (129/131I2, 85Kr, 127Xe, 222Rn, etc.), and tritium, should be managed safely and efficiently, underscoring the need for robust scientific solutions to minimize environmental contamination and foster public confidence. For this purpose, framework materials like metal–organic frameworks (MOFs), covalent organic frameworks (COFs), hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks (HOFs), supramolecular assembly frameworks (SAFs) and porous aromatic frameworks (PAFs) have emerged as highly promising platforms for radionuclide extraction and removal relying on their unique properties of abundant structures, customizable functionality, tunable pore sizes, and high specific surface area. Thus far, there is a lack of a comprehensive review that systematically integrates materials design, research progress, and practical applications for achieving comprehensive radionuclide separation. This review begins with a comprehensive overview of the scientific significance and structural characteristics of framework materials, followed by a summary of their design principles, synthetic strategies, and functional versatility. It then presents a detailed examination of recent applications across various radionuclide classes, with an in-depth discussion of advanced design paradigms, performance across diverse scenarios, and mechanisms. Finally, future perspectives are outlined to address unresolved scientific and technical challenges and to accelerate the practical implementation of next-generation framework materials. This work provides a foundational platform for engineering innovation and the broader application of framework materials, which is crucial for the effective and sustainable management of nuclear waste."},{"t":"Foxconn、Brookfield 拟在越南开发 1 GW风光新能源项目","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/10/50024210.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"富士康科技集团与全球投资机构博枫（Brookfield）达成战略合作，计划在越南开发总装机容量最高达1吉瓦的风光可再生能源项目。此举标志富士康进一步加码绿色能源布局，将太阳能与风能联合开发，助力越南能源转型与供应链减碳，同时为富士康自身制造业能源需求提供清洁电力保障。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"风光储一体化","kp":["装机容量[越南项目]: 最高1 GW","[类型]: 风电+光伏+储能联合开发"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"b":"总部位于中国台湾的 Hon Hai Technology Group (Foxconn) 与全球投资机构 Brookfield 达成合作，计划在越南建设总装机容量最高达 1 吉瓦的可再生能源项目。\n双方公布此项战略合作，拟联合开发总规模 1 吉瓦的大型风电、光伏及电池储能项目，主要为 Foxconn 在越南的生产基地与供应链体系提供能源支持。这家台企在电子制造服务领域的市场占有率超 40%，同时也是 Apple 等知名品牌的主力供应商。\nFoxconn 首席投资官 James Tu 表示：“很高兴能与 Brookfield 成为战略合作伙伴，为我们在越南的生产运营及供应链获取长期可再生能源。此次双方联合投资、共同运营，将为企业在当地的持续发展提供稳定且高性价比的电力保障。”\n相关项目将依托长期购电协议（PPAs）落地，为工业生产稳定输送清洁电力。两家企业将携手开展投资与资产运营管理工作。\nBrookfield 表示，在东南亚相关政策的推动下，本次合作也体现出越南各类企业对稳定可再生能源供给的需求正不断增长。"},{"t":"适用于寒冷气候的泡沫基漂浮式光伏系统","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/foam-based-floating-pv-system-for-cold-climates/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"研究论文","tp":"寒区漂浮式光伏","kp":["发电量提升[寒区浮式光伏]: 2.7%","[防冰策略]: 气泡发生器"],"as":"加拿大西安大略大学研究人员开发了一种泡沫背衬型浮动光伏系统，验证其在寒冷气候条件下的可行性。泡沫浮体为光伏板提供隔热与浮力支撑，有效应对低温、结冰等严苛环境挑战，提升系统能量产出与稳定性。该方案为高纬度寒冷地区水面光伏的工程化部署提供了新思路。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Foam-based floating PV system for cold climates - pv magazine Global","b":"Research & Development\nResearchers at Canada’s Western University demonstrated that a foam-backed floating solar PV system with an air-bubbler can operate effectively through freezing winters, keeping ice at bay with minimal energy use. The system produced up to 2.7% more annual energy than conventional PV models, reduced water evaporation, and showed strong economic potential with a payback period of about 4.2 years under high electricity prices.\nResearch & Development\nUtility-scale\nAn ice formation prevention model is introduced to improve the structural integrity and operational resilience of foam-based FPV systems in cold climate conditions. | Image: Western University, Applied Energy, CC BY 4.0\nResearchers from Canada’s\nWestern University\nhave built and analyzed a foam-backed floating PV (FPV) system in Canada’s cold climate, using an air-bubbler system to prevent ice. Their experiment ran from August 2024 through June 2025, using measurements different from those simulated by major models.\n“We found notable differences between measured module temperatures and standard PV temperature models during winter, highlighting unique thermal dynamics of flat, foam-backed FPV systems,” corresponding author Joshua M. Pearce told\n. “To work in Canada, we developed and validated a transferable ice-melting model using an air-bubbler system, maintaining ice-free conditions with negligible energy consumption.”\nPearce also explained that the results revealed the novel system to be viable in Ontario’s freezing winters. “We found a pretty nice energy yield advantage, too. Foam-based FPV generated more energy annually compared to other PV models, emphasizing the importance of accurate temperature modeling for cold-climate systems,” he added. “The study also demonstrated FPV-based evaporation reduction for water conservation. But best of all is that the foam-based FPV was economic while solving the issue of FPV in cold climates.”\nThe pond on which the FPV system floated is an artificial pond measuring 1,475 m2. The system consisted of 40 monocrystalline, semi-flexible PV modules with a total capacity of 7 kW. It was partitioned into four independent PV arrays, each rated at 1.75 kW, and each connected to its own maximum power point tracker (MPPT). The modules were mounted horizontally, with a tilt angle of 0° and an azimuth of 180°.\nUnlike conventional FPV systems that use plastic pontoons, the modules were directly bonded to polyethylene foam slabs, allowing them to float approximately 1 cm above the water surface. The system further included a three-phase inverter bank, a 10 kWh lithium iron phosphate battery storage system, and an anion exchange membrane (AEM) electrolyzer as the primary load. It was further coupled with an air-bubbler system after a series of experiments, in which ice formation with and without it was demonstrated.\nCollecting global horizontal irradiance (GHI), ambient air temperature, wind speed, relative humidity, water temperature, PV module temperature, array voltage, array current, electrical output, and time-lapse imagery throughout the experiment, the authors then compared the measured module temperatures against those predicted by several leading PV temperature models. Namely, the system was benchmarked against the NOCT/SAM model, the Faiman model, the FPV-specific Faiman variant, the Kamuyu et al. model, and the Hayibo et al. model.\n“A regression model developed in this study indicated that the foam-based FPV system generated 7.7 MWh/year, representing up to 2.7% more energy than other PV,” the scientists emphasized. “The FPV array storm water pond coverage scaled linearly with evaporation reduction, reaching a maximum of 927 m3/year if 50% of the pond is covered, demonstrating the potential for foam-based FPV to save water and support agricultural water needs.”\nMoreover, the research team found that the deployed air bubbler system successfully maintained ice-free open water throughout the winter season. It did so with negligible additional energy consumption, ranging from 0.02% (1.9 kWh) to 14.5% (893 kWh) of the total annual yield. Finally, the system achieved a positive net present value of about CAD 57,000 CAD ($41,000) under a high electricity price scenario of CAD 0.55/kWh for off-grid systems, yielding a discounted payback period of 4.2 years.\n“These advances provide a solid foundation for future research at larger scales and across diverse water bodies, thereby positioning FPV as a viable technology for sustainable energy expansion not only in warm climates but also in cold regions,” said Pearce.\nThe system was presented in “\nDesign and thermal-energy performance analysis of foam-based floating photovoltaic systems in a cold climate: experimental results from a 7 kW floatovoltaics in Canada\n,” published in\nApplied Energy.\nView author posts"},{"t":"通过质子辅助吸附演化将氟掺杂RuO2锚定于TiO2以实现高效稳定析氧反应","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9750153?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"掺氟钌析氧催化","kp":["催化剂[酸性OER]: F掺杂RuO2/TiO2","制备方法[催化剂]: 质子辅助吸附演化"],"as":"该研究通过质子辅助吸附演化策略，将氟掺杂RuO2锚定在TiO2载体上，制备出高效电催化析氧（OER）催化剂。RuO2理论上具有优异的OER活性且价格相对低廉，但稳定性受限；氟掺杂与TiO2锚定的协同作用优化了电子结构与活性位点，有望在电解水制氢领域实现低成本、高效率应用。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Fluorine‐Doped RuO2 Anchored on TiO2 via Proton‐Assisted Adsorption Evolution for Efficient and Stable Oxygen Evolution ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Although RuO\n                    2\n                    theoretically has superior oxygen evolution reaction (OER) activity and a relatively lower price than IrO\n                    2\n                    , balancing its activity and stability remains a significant challenge. The electronic structure of Ru centers plays a critical role in balancing the activity and durability of RuO\n                    2\n                    ‐based electrocatalysts for OER. This study developed an F‐doped RuO\n                    2\n                    loaded on TiO\n                    2\n                    (F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    ) to construct a Ru–O–Ti interface platform for electronegativity‐mediated charge redistribution. F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    exhibited excellent OER activity and superior durability, operating stably for 660 h and 253 h at 100 and 200 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively. A proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer assembled using F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    required only 1.57 and 1.68 V at 0.5 and 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively, and operated stably for 300 and 100 h, respectively. Both experimental and theoretical calculations showed that the high electronegativity of F enhances the Ru–O covalency, thereby accelerating the deprotonation of *OOH through the proton‐assisted adsorption evolution mechanism (PA‐AEM). Simultaneously, the dynamic charge redistribution established between Ru–O–Ti allowed TiO\n                    2\n                    to buffer charge fluctuations at Ru sites, thus further effectively mitigating over‐oxidation. These findings underscore the importance of electronegativity‐regulated proton‐transfer kinetics for stabilizing RuO\n                    2\n                    ."},{"t":"科学家工作中的五张获奖照片","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01819-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"From sky to sea, and then back to the lab, here are the top images from Nature’s 2026 photo competition."},{"t":"首先搜索 $B→{X}_{s}ν\\overline{ν}$ 衰变","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/kf73-hw61","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): M. Abumusabh et al. (The Belle II Collaboration)We report the first search for the flavor-changing neutral-current decays $B→{X}_{s}ν\\overline{ν}$, where ${X}_{s}$ is a hadronic system with strangeness equal to 1, in data collected with the Belle II detector at the SuperKEKB asymmetric-energy ${e}^{+}{e}^{−}$ collider. The data sample corresponds…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231801] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"基于光辅助准粒子隧穿至超导体实现单微波光子的快速连续探测","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/mj91-ntm4","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微波单光子探测","kp":["[检测机制]: 光辅助准粒子隧穿超导岛","[检测对象]: 单微波光子"],"dp":1,"as":"J. Basset等人提出并演示了一种探测单个微波光子的全新机制——光辅助准粒子隧穿。在超导电路与量子信息处理中，单微波光子探测长期面临能量极低（μeV量级）、背景噪声大的难题。该方案利用光辅助隧穿效应，使入射微波光子的能量被准粒子吸收并转化为可测量的隧穿信号，从而实现对单个微波光子的快速且连续探测。相比以往需预先知道光子到达时间的单次型探测器，该方法具备连续工作能力，有望推动量子雷达、暗物质轴子探测及微波光子计数等前沿应用。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"Fast and Continuous Detection of Single Microwave Photons via Photoassisted Quasiparticle Tunneling to a Superconducting","b":"Author(s): J. Basset, O. Stanisavljević, J. Gabelli, M. Aprili, and J. EstèveA new mechanism for the detection of individual propagating microwave photons that realizes a microwave analogue of the photoelectric effect could be used for practical applications in quantum information and dark matter search.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 237001] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"远红叶绿素 d 簇将光系统 I 吸收扩展到红色极限","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed7355?af=R","c":"未分类","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Oxygenic photosynthesis is usually limited to visible light, but the marine cyanobacterium\n                    Acaryochloris marina\n                    pushes this boundary by harvesting far-red photons with chlorophyll d. The best-studied strain, MBIC11017, unexpectedly lacks low-energy chlorophylls (“red forms”) in photosystem I, limiting absorption beyond 740 nanometers. Here, we show that another strain,\n                    A. marina\n                    NIES-2412, has evolved a strategy to absorb far-red photons up to 760 nanometers. Combining time-resolved fluorescence spectroscopy with cryo–electron microscopy at 2.64-angstrom resolution, we identify two distinct classes of chlorophyll d red forms in its photosystem I. One class originates from classical charge-transfer–exciton mixing, while the other arises purely from excitonic interactions. Mapping all 96 chlorophylls d reveals the precise pigments responsible for these far-red states. We also uncover a previously unreported subunit, PsaX2, which stabilizes the photosystem I complex and shapes pigment geometry and energetics to enable the formation of red forms. Last, we show that the protein modifications responsible for binding and tuning these red forms are widespread across the\n                    Acaryochloris\n                    genus but not within the model MBIC11017 strain. Far-red photons lie close to the energetic limit of oxygenic photosynthesis; their efficient use therefore requires fine-tuning of the photosynthetic machinery. To our knowledge, our findings provide the structural and mechanistic basis of one of the most red-shifted photosystem I complexes identified to date, highlighting a distinct adaptive strategy in far-red light environments and offering design principles for extending photosynthesis in crops into the infrared.","tp":"光系统吸收","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"as":"海洋蓝细菌通过叶绿素d突破可见光限制，利用远红光进行产氧光合作用。研究表明，不同菌株展现出截然不同的进化策略：MBIC11017菌株缺乏低能量叶绿素，限制其吸收波长超过740纳米的光线；而NIES-2412菌株则进化出全新策略，成功将光系统I的光谱吸收范围扩展至红色极限。该发现揭示了光合生物在极端光照环境下的适应性机制，对理解光合作用演化及拓展人工光合作用光谱范围具有重要意义。"},{"t":"双极性有机混合导体中的面朝上结晶实现均匀光调制人工神经元","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag341/8704706?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光控人工神经元","kp":["[结晶工程]: 面内取向结晶提升OMIEC离子-电子传输","[应用]: 光调制人工神经元"],"as":"研究报道了在双极性有机混合导体中通过面内（face-on）取向结晶化实现均匀光响应的新策略。光敏双极性有机混合导体是构建光调制人工神经元的关键材料，可用于临床视神经修复与仿生机器人。传统上，此类材料的晶体取向不均会导致光生载流子分布与器件性能差异。该工作通过调控结晶取向为面内排列，使光生载流子在器件中均匀分布，显著提升了光响应一致性与器件稳定性。成果对神经形态光电器件、生物电子接口及柔性光控人工突触的工程化具有推动意义。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Face-on crystallization in ambipolar organic mixed conductors enables homogeneous light-modulated artificial neurons","b":"Light-modulated artificial neurons are vital for clinical optic nerve repair and bionic robotics. Light-sensitive ambipolar organic mixed ionic-electronic conductors (OMIECs) allow for homogeneously integrated artificial neurons, free from issues such as voltage/resistance mismatch or digital-to-analog conversion. However, their development is constrained by a trade-off between ion and electron transport, which results in low figure-of-merit (μC*) values and P/N-mode imbalance. Here, through precise molecular weight tailoring, we develop an ambipolar OMIEC with a high face-on orientation ratio of 85.5% and a fourfold enhancement in backbone crystallinity. This approach simultaneously enhances vertical ionic transport and electron transport, enabling the synergetic optimization of electronic mobility and volumetric capacitance. The optimized material achieves high μC* values of 423.3 ± 17.3 F cm⁻¹ V⁻¹ s⁻¹ (N-type) and 359.8 ± 42.6 F cm⁻¹ V⁻¹ s⁻¹ (P-type). Using this OMIEC, we construct a homogeneous artificial neuron whose excitation/inhibition behaviors can be dually modulated by light and chemical environment, paving new paths for high-performance OMIECs in biological neural prosthetics and bionic machine vision systems."},{"t":"仅从两个位点表达四种线粒体 tRNA","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534946123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Transfer RNAs (tRNAs) are among the few genes retained in animal mitochondrial genomes after more than a billion years of gene loss. These ancient bacterial vestiges are often structurally aberrant and less stable than their bacterial or cytosolic tRNA counterparts. In some lineages, mitochondrial tRNAs (mt-tRNAs) have become so truncated that the loss of one or both arms has expanded our understanding of what constitutes a functional tRNA. Here, we report another radical departure from canonical tRNA gene architecture: two overlapping tRNAs produced from opposite strands of the same locus. These “mirror” tRNA pairs eliminate the need to retain separate loci for all tRNA genes, as a single locus can produce tRNAs to decode two different amino acids. We show that these mirror tRNAs are aminoacylated and demonstrate their presence in mitoribosomes. Furthermore, mirror tRNAs display strand-specific patterns of nucleotide modification and RNA editing, reflecting specific posttranscriptional maturation that depends on transcriptional orientation. This demonstration of functional, bidirectional tRNA expression reveals an unexpected strategy by which mitochondrial genomes maintain a complete set of tRNAs in the face of unrelenting gene loss. The presence of mirror tRNAs has broad implications for the evolution of tRNA-interacting enzymes, mitochondrial biology, and even the origins of the protein synthesis machinery itself.","tp":"线粒体基因","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"动物线粒体基因组在十亿年演化过程中保留了tRNA基因，但其结构往往异常且稳定性较低。研究团队发现了一例彻底偏离经典tRNA结构的现象：某些谱系的线粒体tRNA发生极度截短，甚至丢失一个或多个结构臂，却仍能维持正常功能。更令人惊讶的是，某些生物仅需从两个基因位点即可表达四种不同的线粒体tRNA。这一发现拓展了功能tRNA的定义边界，为理解线粒体基因组的极端简化机制提供了新视角。"},{"t":"探索表面电子量子限制的三维","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed3926?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Quantum confinement of surface electrons in two-dimensional metal-organic networks offers a powerful route to engineer electronic states for quantum and spintronic technologies. Here, we demonstrate the pivotal role of vertical variations in the surface potential on the quantum confinement of surface electrons. We investigate the confinement of both Shockley surface state and image-potential state electrons with their distinct vertical electron density distributions in a Cu-T4PT network on Cu(111). We find a substantial renormalization of the band mass of the image state, whereas the Shockley state remains almost unchanged. This notable divergence arises from the distinct three-dimensional potential landscape of the Cu-T4PT network, with a strong repulsive potential at the vertical position of the molecular backbone and leaky channels beneath the Cu coordination spheres. Our findings demonstrate the essential role of vertical potential engineering in designing quantum-confined states, thereby advancing control over electronic properties and quantum phenomena at the nanoscale.","tp":"量子电子态","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"研究揭示了二维金属有机网络中表面势的垂直变化对表面电子量子限制的关键作用，通过Cu-T4PT/Cu体系研究了Shockley表面态和镜像势态电子的限制行为，为量子和自旋电子技术提供了工程化电子态的新途径。"},{"t":"实验违反因果顺序的贝尔式不等式","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aee2912?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Quantum mechanics is compatible with scenarios where physical processes happen in an indefinite order. In theory, this feature could be detected through violations of inequalities on the observed correlations, analogous to Bell inequalities. However, experimental demonstrations of such violations have been missing until recently due to the complexity of the required setup. Here, we report an experimental violation of a Bell-like inequality involving the correlations of four parties, one of which is spacelike separated from the others. Our demonstration uses 3-kilometer fiber spools to simulate spacelike separation and achieves high-speed operations in photonic time-bin encoding, nanosecond synchronization, and accurate temperature stabilization. These experimental advances enable a violation by 5.7 SDs and open a path toward a certification of indefinite order in conditions that guarantee spacelike separation with existing state-of-the-art devices. However, the certification is not device independent, as it relies on knowledge about the setup to exclude bidirectional signaling—a loophole inherent to implementations in classical acyclic spacetimes, which may be resolved in future quantum-spacetime tests."},{"t":"使用 DIII-D 电荷交换成像诊断系统对 H 型基座湍流进行实验研究","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae72a0","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Microtearing modes (MTMs) ( , , ) are predicted to cause substantial electron thermal transport in the H-mode pedestal, limiting fusion performance on high-power devices. Localized 2D measurements of low-to-intermediate wavenumber density fluctuations in the edge of DIII-D H-mode plasmas suggest the presence of temporally intermittent or ‘bursting’ MTMs during the inter-ELM cycle in the steep gradient region. These measurements are obtained using a new intermediate radial resolution multichannel Charge eXchange Imaging (CXI) diagnostic that analyzes the intensity of the CVI emission at 529 nm. The mode is peaked near with a radial full-width half maximum of 1.5–2.0 cm and a normalized density fluctuation amplitude peak of , peaking near 60 kHz in the lab frame. The mode additionally features a broad spectral width from 30 to 180 kHz and propagates in the electron diamagnetic direction in the plasma frame. CXI measurements taken during discharges with high density and current ramps provide evidence that MTMs become unstable at finite collisionality and remain at nearly the same location in -space despite scanning of rational surface position. This indicates that the location of the peak in the electron diamagnetic frequency is a stronger driving force than individual rational surfaces.","tp":"核聚变湍流","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":3.0},"as":"微撕裂模式被预测在H型基座中引起大量电子热输运，限制聚变性能。利用DIII-D新型电荷交换成像诊断系统在陡峭梯度区域观测到ELM间周期内时间间歇性的MTM信号，为高功率聚变装置的输运物理提供了实验依据。"},{"t":"一维玻色气体中分数费米海的奇异临界态","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/j3s5-gjpf","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Alvise Bastianello, Yi Zeng, Sudipta Dhar, Zekui Wang, Xudong Yu, Milena Horvath, Grigori E. Astrakharchik, Yanliang Guo, Hanns-Christoph Nägerl, and Manuele LandiniCritical quantum field theories occupy a central position in modern theoretical physics for their inherent universality stemming from long-range correlations. As an example, the Tomonaga-Luttinger liquid (TLL) describes a wealth of one-dimensional quantum systems at low temperatures. Its behavior is…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230402] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"独家：OpenAI准备推出新AI模型，预计'明年内'公开亮相","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/exclusive-openai-preps-new-ai-model-expects-go-public-within-next-year","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","tp":"大语言模型","as":"据The Information报道，OpenAI正筹备发布新一代AI模型，预计将在未来一年内公开发布。具体模型架构和能力细节尚未披露，但此举延续OpenAI在大语言模型领域的快速迭代节奏。","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":8.0,"r":8.5,"d":2.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Exclusive: OpenAI Preps New AI Model, Expects To Go Public ‘Within the Next Year’","b":"Exclusive: OpenAI Preps New AI Model, Expects To Go Public ‘Within the Next Year’ — The Information"},{"t":"赢创启动商业规模AEM膜量产","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://hydrogentechworld.com/evonik-starts-commercial-scale-aem-membrane-production","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Hydrogen Tech World","tg":"产业进展","tp":"AEM电解膜","kp":["[产品]: 阴离子交换膜AEM","[规模]: 商业化量产"],"as":"赢创已正式启动商业规模的AEM膜量产，此外涉及Green Hydrogen Systems电解槽的相关信息。","sc":8.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":8.0,"r":7.0,"d":3.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Evonik starts commercial-scale AEM membrane production","b":"Green Hydrogen Systems – Electrolysers"},{"t":"原子尺度振动介导的电子聚束的证据","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/zvf5-wln4","c":"未分类","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): A. Maiti, M. Amato, V. S. Stolyarov, H. Aubin, J. Estève, F. Pistolesi, M. Aprili, and F. MasseeAtomic-scale measurements show that vibrational excitations can cause electrons to move in bunches.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236501] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","tp":"电子聚束态","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"as":"原子尺度实验测量揭示了振动激发可以导致电子聚集运动的直接证据。研究团队通过精密观测发现，原子级振动模式能够诱导电子以聚束形式集体运动，形成振动介导的电子聚束效应。这一发现为理解微观尺度下电声耦合机制提供了关键实验依据，对量子器件设计和纳米尺度电子输运理论具有深远影响。相关成果发表于《物理评论快报》。"},{"t":"勘误表：可压缩流体界面处的细菌湍流 [物理学。莱特牧师。 136, 138301(2026)]","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/8fl3-19j8","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Yuanfeng Yin, Bokai Zhang, H. P. Zhang, and Shuo Guo[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 239901] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"施劳恩竞赛取得成功：凯泽斯劳滕大学建筑系学生荣获多项奖项","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://nachrichten.idw-online.de/2026/06/10/erfolg-beim-schlaun-wettbewerb-architekturstudierende-der-hochschule-kaiserslautern-mehrfach-ausgezeichnet","c":"不相关","a":"Informationsdienst Wissenschaft-idw","tg":"行业观察","b":"Erfolg beim Schlaun-Wettbewerb: Architekturstudierende der Hochschule Kaiserslautern mehrfach ausgezeichnet\nHinweis zur Verwendung von Bildmaterial: Die Verwendung des Bildmaterials zur Pressemitteilung ist bei Nennung der Quelle vergütungsfrei gestattet. Das Bildmaterial darf nur in Zusammenhang mit dem Inhalt dieser Pressemitteilung verwendet werden. Falls Sie das Bild in höherer Auflösung benötigen oder Rückfragen zur Weiterverwendung haben, wenden Sie sich bitte direkt an die Pressestelle, die es veröffentlicht hat.\nvon links nach rechts: Jan-Luca Barz, Caroline Wizke, Oliver Pulich, Linus Thiel\n| Copyright:\nKaiserslautern, Juni 2026 – Großer Erfolg für die Architekturstudierenden der Hochschule Kaiserslautern: Beim 14. Schlaun-Wettbewerb „Stadtleben an der Volme“ wurden gleich zwei Arbeiten von Studierenden der Hochschule ausgezeichnet. Damit setzt die Hochschule ihre beeindruckende Erfolgsserie bei einem der renommiertesten Nachwuchswettbewerbe für Architektur und Stadtplanung im deutschsprachigen Raum fort.\nIm Studiengang Architektur erhielten Linus Thiel und Jan-Luca Barz für ihren Entwurf einen 3. Preis. Darüber hinaus wurde die Arbeit von Caroline Wizke und Oliver Pulich mit einer Anerkennung ausgezeichnet. Beide Arbeiten entstanden unter der gemeinsamen Betreuung von Prof. Dipl.-Ing. Sabrina Wirtz und Prof. Dipl.-Ing. Marcus Kopper aus dem Fachbereich Bauen und Gestalten.\nDer diesjährige Wettbewerb widmete sich unter dem Titel „Stadtleben an der Volme“ der Entwicklung des Volme-Raums in der Hagener Innenstadt. Insgesamt wurden 104 Arbeiten von 37 Hochschulen eingereicht. Die Wettbewerbsbeiträge wurden von einer Fachjury hinsichtlich ihrer städtebaulichen Qualität, gestalterischen Umsetzung und Zukunftsfähigkeit bewertet.\n„Die Auszeichnungen zeigen eindrucksvoll, dass unsere Studierenden komplexe architektonische und städtebauliche Fragestellungen auf hohem Niveau bearbeiten und überzeugende Antworten auf aktuelle Herausforderungen der Stadtentwicklung entwickeln können“, betonen Prof. Sabrina Wirtz und Prof. Marcus Kopper. „Wir freuen uns besonders über die kontinuierlichen Erfolge unserer Studierenden bei diesem anspruchsvollen Wettbewerb.“\nDas Schlaun-Forum e. V. lobt seit dem Wintersemester 2011/2012 jährlich die Schlaun-Wettbewerbe als Ideenwettbewerbe aus. Die Preise werden nach Entscheidung des Preisgerichts „für hervorragende Planungsleistungen“ vergeben. Teilnahmeberechtigt sind Studierende ab dem vierten Fachsemester sowie Absolventinnen und Absolventen, die zum Abgabetermin das 35. Lebensjahr noch nicht überschritten haben. Die Gesamtpreissumme beträgt jährlich bis zu 24.000 Euro.\nFür die Hochschule Kaiserslautern haben sich die Wettbewerbe in den vergangenen Jahren zu einer besonderen Erfolgsgeschichte entwickelt. Seit 2023 haben Architekturstudierende der Hochschule an drei der vergangenen vier Schlaun-Wettbewerbe teilgenommen. Mit insgesamt fünf Preisen und Auszeichnungen bei 14 vergebenen Ehrungen ist die Hochschule Kaiserslautern in diesem Zeitraum die erfolgreichste Hochschule in der Wettbewerbskategorie Architektur.\nAn den Schlaun-Wettbewerben beteiligen sich jährlich bis zu 100 junge Planerinnen und Planer aus bis zu 40 deutschsprachigen Hochschulen. Die prämierten Arbeiten werden unter anderem in der Fachzeitschrift Wettbewerbe Aktuell sowie auf der Plattform Competitionline veröffentlicht und erfahren damit große Aufmerksamkeit innerhalb der Fachwelt.\nDie Preisverleihung fand im Rahmen des Schlaun-Fests am 31. Mai 2026 in Münster statt. Die Auszeichnungen wurden unter anderem von Ina Scharrenbach, Ministerin für Heimat, Kommunales, Bau und Digitalisierung des Landes Nordrhein-Westfalen, überreicht.\nÜber den Schlaun-Wettbewerb\nDer Schlaun-Wettbewerb wird vom Schlaun-Forum e. V. ausgelobt und zählt zu den bedeutendsten studentischen Wettbewerben für Architektur, Städtebau, Landschaftsarchitektur und Bauingenieurwesen im deutschsprachigen Raum. Ziel ist die Förderung des planerischen Nachwuchses sowie die Entwicklung innovativer Lösungen für aktuelle Herausforderungen der Stadt- und Regionalentwicklung.\nWeitere Informationen:\nhttps://schlaun-forum.de\nÄhnliche Pressemitteilungen im idw"},{"t":"熵稳定铝酸盐催化剂突破CF4水解中的活性-稳定性权衡","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6752036?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"熵稳定铝酸盐催化","kp":["催化剂[CF4水解]: 熵稳定铝酸盐打破活性-稳定性权衡"],"as":"研究开发熵稳定的铝酸盐催化剂，在四氟化碳(CF4)水解反应中打破活性与稳定性的传统权衡。CF4是半导体刻蚀工艺中广泛使用的强效温室气体，该催化剂为半导体行业温室气体减排提供了可行路径。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Entropy‐Stabilized Aluminate Catalysts That Break the Activity–Stability Tradeoff in CF4 Hydrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Tetrafluoromethane (CF\n                    4\n                    ) is a potent, long‐lived greenhouse gas widely used in semiconductor dry‐etching processes, yet its abatement via hydrolysis remains challenging due to the lack of catalysts that simultaneously exhibit high activity and durability under strongly fluorinating, steam‐rich conditions. Conventional alumina‐based catalysts suffer from severe activity–stability tradeoffs, offering good activity only at the cost of rapid deactivation through surface‐area loss, bulk fluorination, and the formation of catalytically inactive\n                    α\n                    ‐Al\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    . Here, we report an entropy‐stabilized aluminate catalyst that overcomes this long‐standing tradeoff by combining a multication aluminate framework with an entropy‐stabilized lattice. The incorporation of multiple metal cations produces an electron‐deficient Al–O environment that enhances heterolytic C–F bond activation while suppressing H\n                    2\n                    O poisoning, thereby increasing intrinsic activity under practical conditions. Simultaneously, the lattice stabilization via high configurational entropy inhibits the propagation of fluorination into the bulk lattice, effectively suppressing in situ AlF\n                    3\n                    formation and its subsequent hydrolysis to\n                    α\n                    ‐Al\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    . Mechanistic studies further establish that CF\n                    4\n                    hydrolysis proceeds via a Mars–van Krevelen‐type pathway in which lattice oxygen first oxidizes CF\n                    x\n                    surface intermediates and is replenished by H\n                    2\n                    O. These findings identify entropy‐stabilized aluminates as a robust materials platform capable of simultaneously achieving high activity and long‐term durability for CF\n                    4\n                    hydrolysis."},{"t":"用于神经修复的工程丝素蛋白基生物材料","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73651?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Neurological injuries remain a major clinical challenge due to the limited regenerative capacity of neural tissue, the persistence of inhibitory post‐injury microenvironments, and the lack of biomaterials capable of simultaneously providing structural support and biological instruction. Growing evidence highlights that biomaterial‐mediated modulation of the neural microenvironment is essential for effective neural regeneration and functional recovery. Silk fibroin (SF), a naturally derived protein biomaterial, has attracted growing interest in neural repair owing to its tunable mechanical properties, controllable degradation, structural anisotropy, and versatile modification potential. Beyond serving as passive scaffolds, SF‐based biomaterials actively regulate axonal guidance, neural and glial cell behavior, and neuroinflammatory responses. This review systematically summarizes the physicochemical properties and modification strategies of SF, elucidates the underlying mechanisms by which SF‐based materials promote neural repair, and discusses diverse SF‐based material formats, including hydrogels, scaffolds, patches, nanofibers, and nerve conduits. Representative applications in peripheral nerve injury and central nervous system disorders, such as spinal cord injury, traumatic brain injury, cerebral palsy, ischemic stroke, and Parkinson's disease, are highlighted. Finally, current challenges and future perspectives of SF‐based neural biomaterials are discussed, with an emphasis on guiding the rational design and clinical translation of next‐generation neural repair strategies.","tp":"丝素神经修复","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"丝素蛋白基生物材料因其良好的生物相容性和可调结构特性，在神经修复中可同时提供结构支撑和生物信号调控，通过调控损伤后神经微环境促进神经再生和功能恢复，为神经损伤治疗提供了有前景的策略。"},{"t":"面向绿色数据中心的不确定性能耗感知作业调度：一种结构压缩谱风险控制方法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007890?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"绿色数据中心调度","dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Energy-aware job scheduling for green data centers under uncertainty: A structure-compressed spectral risk control appro"},{"t":"通过CuH催化对映选择性合成新型稳定功能化环戊二烯","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6630116?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","as":"报道通过CuH催化不对称合成一类新型稳定且官能化的环戊二烯化合物。环戊二烯是合成化学的重要砌块，但本征酸性和聚合倾向限制其应用，该工作通过催化策略突破了这一瓶颈。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CuH催化合成","kp":["[催化方法]: CuH催化对映选择性合成稳定手性环戊二烯"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"ot":"Enantioselective Synthesis of a New Class of Stable and Functionalized Cyclopentadienes via CuH‐Catalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Cyclopentadienes (CpHs) are fundamental building blocks across chemistry, yet their inherent acidity and tendency to undergo rapid [1,5]‐hydrogen shifts have long limited access to structurally and configurationally stable chiral variants. Overcoming this intrinsic fluxionality remains a major synthetic challenge that limits the potential of CpHs in asymmetric synthesis. Here we present a CuH‐catalyzed transformation that converts simple precursors into highly functionalized and enantioenriched CpHs in high yield and with exceptional enantioselectivity. Computations uncover the origins of the observed selectivity and show the reaction mechanism to involve a rare example of nitrile activation in Cu‐catalysis. The disclosed new class of CpHs is unexpectedly stable, which was found to be attributed to a conjugated push–pull electronic effect that delineates a new general design principle for taming the intrinsic instability of CpHs."},{"t":"通过 ${\\mathrm{PbTiO}}_{3 中隐藏的极声耦合实现应变梯度和 90° 畴壁的电切换","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/yhk9-qf8c","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Yajun Zhang, Konstantin Shapovalov, Xu He, Chang Liu, Huadong Yong, Xingyi Zhang, Jie Wang, Kun Zhou, and Philippe GhosezAlthough strain gradients hold great promise for tailoring emergent functionalities, their flexible global control remains a fundamental challenge. Here, we address this concern in ${\\mathrm{PbTiO}}_{3}$ under biaxial tensile strain by uncovering the spontaneous appearance of strain gradients and 90…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236101] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"铁电畴切换","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"在双轴拉伸应变下的PbTiO3中发现了应变梯度和90°畴壁的自发出现，揭示了隐藏的极声耦合机制，实现了应变梯度的灵活全局控制，为调控材料新兴功能提供了新思路。"},{"t":"电动设备为该运营商带来巨大燃油节省","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/10/electric-equipment-means-massive-fuel-savings-for-this-operator/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","as":"报道某重型设备运营商部署七台20吨级电池电动装载机和推土机后的显著燃油节约成效。电动化重型工程机械在矿区、工地等场景的落地，标志着工程机械电气化从样机验证迈向规模化运营。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动工程机械","kp":["设备[电动工程机械]: 20吨级电池电动","设备数量[车队]: 7台","累计工时[年运营]: 17370小时"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Electric equipment means MASSIVE fuel savings for this operator","b":"| Jun 10 2026 - 5:21 am PT\nThis heavy equipment operator put seven, 20-ton battery electric wheel loaders and dozers from Chinese equipment brand XCMG to work for combined 17,370 (!) hours last year, and realized an “astonishing” cost savings.\nEtrucks New Zealand owner Ross Linton is one of the more interesting voices in the electric commercial vehicle space. As his country’s primary distributor of Chinese-made medium- and\nheavy-duty electric trucks\n, chargers, and\nindustrial equipment\n, he has direct access and real-world insights into a lot of machinery we simply don’t (yet) have access to in North America.\nIn a recent LinkedIn post, Linton shared performance data from a fleet of seven 20-ton XCMG machines in his company’s rental fleet, and the numbers are eye-opening.\n“These seven 20-ton class XCMG Group BEV loaders have run a combined 17,370 hours using a total of 412,000 kWh in New Zealand,” he writes. “That’s 23.7 kWh/h at, say, 30c/kWh, or $7.11 per hour. That is an astonishing energy cost saving over any diesel loader.”\nThat number, $7.11/hr NZ works out to about $4.13/hr US, might still seem high to Americans thinking in terms of electric cars driving at 60 or 70 mph on a highway, but that’s not the world these machines live in.\nFor context, a direct competitor to XCMG’s 20-ton loaders,\nthe Caterpillar 966\n, for example, can burn between\ngallons of diesel fuel per hour (depending on who you believe and what kind of work you’re doing).\nWith the price of of red dye diesel averaging $5.60/gal as I type this\n, that puts fuel costs on the CAT somewhere between $20 and 50/hr, or 5-10x the cost of running your machines on electric.\nIt doesn’t stop there.\nWith overnight and off-peak charging, US equipment fleets can cut that $4.13/hr in half\nRemember that when the oil money tries to reinstate the draft.\nIf you’re considering going solar, it’s always a good idea to get quotes from a few installers. To make sure you find a trusted, reliable solar installer near you that offers competitive pricing, check out\n, a free service that makes it easy for you to go solar. It has hundreds of pre-vetted solar installers competing for your business, ensuring you get high-quality solutions and save 20-30% compared to going it alone. Plus, it’s free to use, and you won’t get sales calls until you select an installer and share your phone number with them.\nYour personalized solar quotes are easy to compare online and you’ll get access to unbiased Energy Advisors to help you every step of the way.\nGet started here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nI’ve been in and around the auto industry for over thirty years, and have written for a number of well-known outlets like CleanTechnica, Popular Mechanics, the Truth About Cars, and more. You can catch me at Electrek Daily’s Quick Charge, The Heavy Equipment Podcast, or chasing my kids around Oak Park, IL\nFind a reliable home solar and battery installer and save 20-30% compared to going it alone.\nQmerit makes electrification easy — connecting you with trusted pros who get it done right."},{"t":"超冷微波屏蔽极性分子中的 Efimov 效应","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/qlvv-r93m","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Shayamal Singh and Chris H. GreeneA quantum-mechanical description is presented for the three-body physics of shielded dipolar molecules, including a prediction of observable Efimov physics. Despite the anisotropic and long-range nature of the interaction, shielding enables a regime in which universality emerges already at the two-b…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233402] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"利用绿色溶剂高效可持续回收废旧锂离子电池：综述","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008123?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锂电池绿色回收","kp":["[方法]: 绿色溶剂回收","[应用]: 废旧锂离子电池"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Efficient and sustainable recycling of spent Lithium-ion batteries using green solvents: A review"},{"t":"基于阻变存储器的高效精准神经场重建","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10646-w","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"忆阻器神经场重建","kp":["[硬件]: 忆阻器阻变存储","[应用]: 神经场高效重建"],"dp":1,"as":"研究利用阻变存储器(RRAM)实现高效的神经场重建，应用于医学成像、AR/VR和具身AI等场景。该方法在存内计算架构上加速神经辐射场类模型，显著降低功耗与延迟，是AI硬件与神经渲染交叉的前沿探索。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Efficient and accurate neural-field reconstruction using resistive memory","b":"Applications such as medical imaging, augmented and virtual reality, and embodied artificial intelligence (AI) depend on the ability to reconstruct complex signals from sparse observations. These applications are characterized by incomplete measurements and limited computational resources. Traditional approaches to digital hardware face the following challenges: explicit signal representations require heavy sampling and storage, data movement across the von Neumann bottleneck dominates energy and latency, and CMOS (complementary metal–oxide–semiconductor)-based circuits offer limited parallel efficiency. Here we present a software–hardware co-optimization framework for sparse-input signal reconstruction. At the software level, we use neural fields1 to implicitly represent signals using neural networks, which are further compressed by low-rank decomposition and structured pruning. At the hardware level, we design a resistive-memory-based computing-in-memory platform, featuring a Gaussian encoder and a multi-layer perceptron processing engine. The Gaussian encoder leverages the intrinsic stochasticity of resistive memory for efficient encoding, whereas the processing engine enables precise weight mapping through a hardware-aware quantization circuit. On a 40-nm 256 Kb resistive-memory macro, the system delivers 23.5×, 21.0× and 32.3× gains in projected energy efficiency, together with 10.8×, 38.8× and 6.2× gains in projected parallelism, for three-dimensional computed tomography sparse reconstruction, novel view synthesis and dynamic-scene novel view synthesis, without compromising on reconstruction quality. This work advances AI-driven signal reconstruction technology and paves the way for future efficient and robust medical AI and three-dimensional vision applications.","aip":1},{"t":"建筑一体化防眩光彩色光伏组件的效率预测与实验验证","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008196?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"建筑彩色光伏","kp":["[应用]: 建筑集成BIPV","[特性]: 防眩光彩色组件"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Efficiency prediction and experimental validation of anti-glare coloured photovoltaic modules for building integration"},{"t":"EV电池绝缘数字化升级，替代塑料薄膜","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.batterytechonline.com/battery-manufacturing/ev-battery-insulation-goes-digital-as-plastic-film-fails-under-fast-charging-stress","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Battery Tech Online","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电池绝缘涂层","kp":["[工艺]: 喷墨打印介电层替代塑料膜","产能[中国产线]: 1.5-2万电芯/天"],"as":"中国产线已使用Xaar精密喷墨打印技术为每日1.5万至2万颗电芯涂覆介电绝缘层，替代传统塑料薄膜工艺。数字化绝缘方案省去薄膜材料、简化产线、提升电池安全性与一致性，正在加速锂电池制造工艺革新。","sc":9.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":9.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"EV Battery Insulation Goes Digital, Replacing Plastic Film","b":"Production lines in China are already coating 15,000-20,000 cells per day with Xaar's precision-printed dielectrics, which stay bonded through corners, flexing, and thermal cycling. CTO Karl Forbes explains at The Battery Show Europe.\nJune 10, 2026\nXaar printer head coats a 3D opject with precision.\nPlastic film insulation traps heat and peels at corners, limiting fast-charging performance and creating safety risks\nXaar's inkjet printheads apply 100-micron dielectric coatings directly to cells, maintaining coverage over sharp edges\nSystems already run at scale in China, coating 15,000-20,000 prismatic and cylindrical cells per day in seconds each\nThe plastic film wrapped around today's prismatic and cylindrical battery cells performs a critical job: it electrically insulates metal housings that will be stacked by the hundreds inside an EV pack. But as charging speeds increase and battery energy densities climb, that same insulating layer is becoming a liability—trapping heat when cells need to shed it, peeling away from corners under mechanical stress, and introducing yield loss on high-volume production lines.\n\"One of the biggest challenges with the batteries is, as I'm charging it up, it's getting hot,\" explained Karl Forbes, CTO at\n, a UK-based industrial inkjet technology company now applying its platform to battery manufacturing. \"The limitation for how fast you can charge your battery is often how hot it's getting, so you've got to find a way to thermally manage your battery, which is really not helpful if I've just wrapped my metal box to a sheet of plastic.\"\nInnovations in Battery Manufacturing for Solid-State and Dry Electrodes\nXaar CTO Karl Forbes at The Battery Show Europe in Stuttgart on JUne 9, 2026. Credit: M. Anderson / Battery Technology\nThat tension—between the need for electrical insulation and the imperative for thermal performance—is driving interest in an alternative approach: digitally printing dielectric coatings directly onto cell housings. Xaar, which has spent more than three decades developing industrial-grade inkjet systems for textiles, glass, 3D printing, and other sectors, is now deploying that same core technology on EV battery production lines in China, where systems are coating tens of thousands of cells per day.\nThe problem begins with adhesion. Plastic film applied to a metal surface doesn't bond strongly, and as cells are assembled into modules and packs—glued, clamped, and subjected to the flexing and vibration of real-world driving—that film can lift or peel.\n\"When I get a piece of plastic and I stick it to this metal, it's not stuck very well,\" Forbes said. \"So, when I've got all sorts of batteries glued together, and my car's twisting as it goes over bumps, the plastic peels away from the metal, and it exposes metal.\"\nExposed conductive surfaces in a high-voltage pack are a serious safety concern, creating potential pathways for short circuits or arcing, particularly under thermal, mechanical, or moisture stress. The risk is compounded at corners and edges, where the geometry of wrapping introduces weak points.\n\"They've got to somehow wrap that plastic and crease it over these corners, and you can imagine like wrapping your Christmas presents, right? It's the same problem,\" Forbes explained. \"What's going to happen at the edges here? How do I cope with these corners where I have to wrap that plastic film, so you end up with all sorts of horrible joints… manufacturing yield problems, right? Just, it's just a horrible solution.\"\nThe Case for Domestic Battery Production: Answers to Five Key Questions\nThose yield problems aren't trivial. In high-volume cell production, inconsistent wrapping translates directly into scrap, rework, and throughput loss—exactly the inefficiencies that battery manufacturers are under pressure to eliminate as they scale.\nXaar eX printheads. Credit: Xaar\nXaar's approach replaces the mechanical wrap with a digitally printed dielectric layer applied directly to the cell surface. The coating, approximately 100 microns thick, is deposited using industrial inkjet printheads designed to handle high-viscosity, UV-curable fluids formulated for high-voltage insulation.\n\"We've been working with a number of companies now on digital printing of dielectric coating,\" Forbes said. \"It's really important that you still have that coating right over the sharp edges, right at top there, and at the bottom there… So you need to print with a fluid that's got a very high viscosity. So that's what we do.\"\nThat viscosity is key. Lower-viscosity fluids would flow away from edges and corners—precisely the areas where insulation integrity matters most. By tuning both the fluid chemistry and the deposition process, Xaar's system maintains uniform coverage across complex geometries, bonding the dielectric layer to the metal substrate rather than relying on mechanical adhesion of a separate film.\nBattery Show Europe Delves Into EU Efforts to Scale Up Manufacturing\nThe result is a conformal coating that stays in place as packs flex, reduces the risk of exposed metal over the vehicle's lifetime, and enables more predictable thermal pathways between the cell and any cooling interfaces—critical for fast-charging performance.\nForbes is quick to distinguish Xaar's hardware from consumer inkjet printers, which are often associated with clogging, slow speeds, and unreliability.\n\"Our print heads are nothing like the inkjet printer that you've got at home,\" he said. \"Inkjet printer, you're probably thinking is horribly unreliable. The print head always clogs, and it's mind-blowingly slow, right?\"\nXaar's platform, by contrast, was developed specifically for industrial environments and has been in commercial use for more than 35 years across sectors including textiles, packaging, glass decoration, and additive manufacturing.\n\"Our technology was invented about 35 years ago… and it's been invented fundamentally to be an industrially reliable solution,\" Forbes noted. \"We already operate print heads very similar to this in 10 different industry sectors. We print on textiles, we print on cardboard, we do 3D printing… We print wax, we print onto glass bottles, we print labels, we do all sorts of printing.\"\nThat cross-industry track record underpins the company's ability to handle the demanding chemistries required for battery insulation—fluids that must provide electrical isolation at six to ten kilovolts while maintaining mechanical and thermal stability over thousands of charge cycles.\nXaar printhead inside the demonstration machine used at The Battery Show Europe. Credit: M. Anderson / Battery Technology\nWhile the core inkjet technology is shared across applications, Xaar has developed cell-format-specific adaptations. The company's eX series of printheads includes configurations optimized for both prismatic and cylindrical geometries.\n\"This is a new product for us. This product launched a couple of years ago, and it's been adapted and modified, so it's perfect for this dielectric coating onto prismatic,\" Forbes explained. \"This one is adapted so that it's perfect for printing the coating onto cylindrical.\"\nThe system's flexibility extends to orientation. Xaar's TF Technology enables recirculation within the printhead, allowing coating in any orientation—across sides, over corners, and along edges—without repositioning parts during production. High Laydown Technology ensures thick, even coatings are applied in a single pass, while SureFlow self-cleaning minimizes blockages and reduces downtime.\nThese capabilities are particularly important for cylindrical cells, where continuous coating around a curved surface and across end caps demands precise fluid control and consistent deposition.\nThis is not a laboratory demonstration. Xaar's digital coating systems are already running on commercial battery production lines in China, processing tens of thousands of cells per day.\n\"We have a number of partners that have already taken our technology, integrated that into big machines… and they're mass-producing batteries in China right now,\" Forbes said. \"This is already in production, and they manufacture something like 15,000 to 20,000 batteries a day… on each production line… [It] takes a couple of seconds to coat one of those.\"\nThe process uses UV-curable dielectric fluids, which cure rapidly under UV light without adding thermal load to the cells—a critical consideration given that elevated temperatures can degrade cell performance and safety.\n\"This fluid is a UV curable fluid… No, you really don't want a solution that means you need to raise the temperature of your cells,\" Forbes noted.\nWhile Xaar declines to name specific customers, the company's presence at The Battery Show Europe in Stuttgart this week reflects growing interest in digital coating as a scalable alternative to film wrapping. The company is demonstrating its technology in collaboration with Inkatronic, a specialist in bespoke inkjet machinery and industrial R&D, and Forbes will present on how inkjet is enabling the transition from analogue to digital insulation processes.\nAcross the conversation, Forbes' message is consistent: Xaar is not introducing experimental hardware, but rather repurposing a proven industrial platform to address modern EV insulation and thermal challenges.\n\"The fundamentals of our technology are 30 years old,\" he said. \"What we've done over the last years is we've applied that technology in new solutions.\"\nFor EV OEMs and cell manufacturers wrestling with insulation reliability, fast-charging thermal limits, and yield loss from mechanical wrapping, digital dielectric coating offers a process-ready alternative—one that's already demonstrating commercial viability at scale.\nAs the industry pushes toward faster charging, higher energy densities, and tighter manufacturing tolerances, the shift from plastic wrap to precision print may represent more than an incremental improvement. It may be a necessary step in making next-generation battery performance and safety targets achievable in high-volume production.\nJun 9, 2026 TO Jun 11, 2026\nMesse Stuttgart | Stuttgart, Germany\nJoin the leading meeting place for the advanced battery and H/EV technology community. Meet manufacturers, suppliers, engineers, thought leaders and decision-makers for a conference and trade fair focused on the latest developments in the advanced battery and automotive industries.\nRegister Now\nRegister Now\nMichael C. Anderson\nAs editor-in-chief of\nBattery Technology\n, Michael C. Anderson leads the brand’s coverage of advancements in battery technology as well as associated materials and manufacturing techniques across industries such as automotive/EVs, e-mobility, maritime, aerospace, medtech, and consumer electronics.\nMike is also a member of\nThe Battery Show North America Advisory Board\n, where he contributes his expertise to advising on industry trends and speaker selection for The Battery Show North America while helping to shape discussions on battery technology and electrification.\nBattery Technology\nsenior editor Maria Guerra De Egui are joint\n2025 Neal Award Winners\nin the category of \"Best Coverage of the 2024 Election on Your Served Market.\"\nMike was a recent guest journalist on the popular automotive-industry webcast, Autoline After Hours.\nMike has been covering manufacturing and transportation technology developments for more than 25 years. At SME (\nThe Society of Manufacturing Engineers\n), he served as lead editor of\nAerospace & Defense Manufacturing\n, lead editor of\nMedical Manufacturing\n, senior editor for\nManufacturing Engineering,\nand acting lead editor of\nSmart Manufacturing\n. He has also been senior editor of\nCutting Tool Engineering\n, senior technical editor of Gardener Business Media’s\nAutomotive Design & Production\n, PR manager at B2B advertising/PR agency G. Temple Associates, and editor at the SM Wu Manufacturing Research Center at the University of Michigan.\nThis all followed more than a decade of teaching English, ESL, literature, and argumentation as a lecturer at Eastern Michigan University (Ypsilanti, MI) and, for five years, at Sakura no Seibo Junior College (Fukushima, Japan).\nMike has a bachelor’s degree in English language and literature and a master’s degree in rhetoric and written communication from Eastern Michigan University.\nSee more from\nMichael C. Anderson"},{"t":"欧盟电池战略剑指270亿欧元对华依赖 | 电池技术","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.batterytechonline.com/industry-outlook/eu-spent-27-billion-on-batteries-in-2024-87-from-china-now-it-s-fighting-back","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Battery Tech Online","as":"欧盟推出新电池战略监管框架，结合加速审批许可、本地成分要求和免息贷款，旨在降低对中国约270亿欧元的依赖。该政策试图通过全产业链扶持重建欧洲电池制造能力，是欧盟产业自主战略的核心一环。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"欧盟电池战略","kp":["进口依赖[欧盟电池]: 87%来自中国","市场规模[欧盟电池]: €270亿"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"EU Battery Strategy Targets €27B China Dependence | Battery Tech","b":"New regulatory framework combines accelerated permitting, local content mandates, and interest-free loans to build European battery independence amid growing strategic concerns. Jennifer Karle, policy officer at European Commission - DG Grow, explains at The Battery Show Europe.\nJune 9, 2026\nEU flag with China puzzle piece\nBaona / iStock via Getty Images\nEurope imported 87% of its €27 billion battery spend from China in 2024, creating strategic vulnerability\nNew Net Zero Industry Act cuts battery plant permitting to 9-12 months with priority status for strategic projects\n€1.5B Battery Booster Facility offers interest-free loans; Made in Europe rules require progressive local content\nAs global demand for lithium-ion batteries surges alongside electric vehicle adoption and renewable energy storage deployment, Europe faces a critical challenge: building domestic battery manufacturing capacity to reduce dependence on Asian imports. At The Battery Show Europe today, the European Commission outlined its comprehensive strategy to transform the continent's battery supply chain and establish European gigafactory leadership.\nAt The Battery Show Europe on June 9, 2026, Jennifer Karle, policy officer at European Commission - DG Grow, delivered both a sobering assessment of Europe's battery sector as well as an ambitious roadmap for transformation. Her keynote, \"Securing Europe’s Battery Future Through Policy, Financial Support and Industrial Strategy,\" made clear that batteries are fundamental to Europe's clean-energy transition and strategic independence.\n\"Batteries are at the heart of many clean technologies, whether for electric vehicles, renewable energy integration or energy storage, they're key enabling technologies for the green transition,\" Karle emphasized.\nEditors Roundtable: 3 Major Battery News Items in March - April\nYet despite this critical importance, Europe remains heavily dependent on imports, particularly from China, which, she noted, supplied 87% of the €27 billion worth of batteries Europe purchased in 2024 alone.\nThis dependency extends beyond finished battery cells. Europe relies on third countries for upstream components and raw materials including lithium, nickel, and graphite, with dependencies exceeding 65% for many critical inputs. Lithium presents a particularly acute example, with 79% originating from Chile.\nThe strategic vulnerability has drawn attention at the highest political levels. Karle noted that Commission President Ursula von der Leyen highlighted the battery sector's importance for European energy independence and resilience in her recent State of the Union address.\nEuropean demand graphic. Photo credit: Battery Technology\nWhile Europe has attracted substantial investment over the past decade—building over 200 gigawatt hours of installed cell production capacity—market conditions have deteriorated in recent years, putting pressure on projects and investors. The gap between Europe's strategic ambitions and industrial reality remains substantial.\nTo address this gap, the EU has deployed the Net Zero Industry Act (NZIA) as a central pillar of its strategy to scale manufacturing capacity for batteries and other clean technologies. The act establishes a more coherent regulatory framework designed to accelerate administrative procedures, particularly permitting.\nBattery Innovation Goes Beyond Chemistry to Supply Chains and Capital Discipline\nNZIA rests on five main pillars: streamlined permitting, strategic project designation, skills development for qualified workforce, innovation provisions, facilitated market access, and robust governance structures.\nOne innovation is the \"net zero strategic projects\" designation. Major new or expanded clean-tech manufacturing facilities—including battery plants—can apply for strategic status at the EU level, which brings significant advantages: priority status nationally, accelerated permitting timelines of just nine to 12 months for the entire process, and tailored support for accessing finance.\nJennifer Karle keynote at The Battery Show Europe. Credit: M. Anderson / Battery Technology\nEurope has identified 30 strategic projects so far, with five directly linked to batteries: two in France, one in the Netherlands, one in Bulgaria, and one in Sweden. Karle encouraged industry representatives planning new production sites to apply for this status.\nBeyond acceleration, NZIA also begins shaping demand through non-price criteria. Since the start of this year, member states must apply sustainability and resilience criteria—not just cost—in renewable energy auctions, public procurement, and national support schemes. This approach aims to reward cleaner, more resilient European supply chains rather than simply the lowest-cost imports.\nBattery Technology's Maria Guerra Wins Prestigious Jesse H. Neal Award\nThe proposed Industrial Accelerator Act (IAA) pushes deeper into industrial policy territory, directly addressing Europe's declining manufacturing share—which fell from 17.4% to 14.3% of GDP between 2002 and 2024. The act sets an ambitious goal of increasing manufacturing to 20% of GDP by 2035.\nThis initiative responds specifically to growing dependence on China for electric vehicles and the fact that approximately 50% of batteries used in the EU are currently imported from China. The act introduces \"Made in Europe\" content requirements for batteries and components, particularly in EVs and battery energy storage systems (BESS), sending a strong signal to incentivize investment in European-made battery components.\nFor electric vehicles, these requirements apply to public procurement and national support schemes. The thresholds tighten progressively: six months after entry into force, vehicle assembly must occur in Europe along with three battery components including cells. Three years later, the requirement increases to five battery components, including cathode active material and battery management systems.\nFor BESS, the definition extends to partner countries under the Digital Partnership Agreement or those with EU free trade agreements, aiming to reduce strategic dependencies through like-minded partners. However, the approach is grounded in reciprocity—countries can be excluded if they limit access to European companies in their own national schemes.\nThe act also establishes conditions for foreign direct investment exceeding €100 million from countries representing more than 40% of global production capacity. Mandatory requirements include that over 50% of the workforce must come from Europe, with additional criteria such as limits on foreign ownership, technology transfer and know-how sharing, or sourcing strategies that include EU-produced inputs.\nEU's Battery Booster strategy. Photo credit: Battery Technology\n\"We have proposed these EU content requirements for batteries and their components… In practice, it sends a strong signal for the European-made battery components, and it aims to incentivize investments into the sector,\" Karle explained.\nThe message is straightforward: Access to Europe's market and industrial base will increasingly depend on contributing to European resilience, skills development, and technological capabilities.\nComplementing these regulatory measures is a battery-specific strategy adopted in December 2025 that targets the entire value chain—from investment and upstream supply to demand, innovation, and skills development. Karle identified financing as the critical bottleneck, particularly the risks associated with launching and scaling battery manufacturing projects to commercial scale in Europe.\nThe flagship instrument is the Battery Booster Facility, which mobilizes €1.5 billion from the EU's Innovation Fund to support battery cell manufacturers through interest-free loans. An additional €300 million will support critical raw materials—lithium, cobalt, nickel, manganese, and graphite—backing funds that invest in upstream stages through a guarantee mechanism.\nThis blended approach aims to de-risk both manufacturing and upstream supply, unlocking private capital and making Europe more attractive for large-scale industrial projects. Looking ahead to the next multiannual financial framework from 2027, Karle pointed to the planned European Competitiveness Fund, which will provide further financing specifically for clean tech and batteries.\n\"We're not only setting targets and regulation in Europe, but we're also putting financing behind our ambitions,\nshe emphasized.\nThe European Commission's three-pronged strategy creates significant shifts for the battery industry:\nFaster permitting for strategic projects\ncould accelerate European gigafactory timelines from years to months, with 9-12 month approval processes for facilities granted strategic status\nMade in Europe content requirements\nwill fundamentally reshape EV and BESS supply chains by 2028, requiring progressive increases from three to five battery components manufactured domestically\n€1.5 billion in interest-free loans\nspecifically targets cell manufacturing scale-up, addressing the critical financing gap that has slowed European battery production\nForeign investment over €100 million\nfaces new workforce and technology transfer requirements, with mandatory European workforce thresholds exceeding 50%\nNon-price procurement criteria\nincluding sustainability and resilience now apply across member states, potentially favoring European suppliers over lower-cost imports\nThroughout her remarks, Karle framed batteries as central to the economy of the future. Europe's current position reflects strong demand but high dependence, significant investment but rising competitive pressure, ambitious regulation but still-emergent industrial scale.\nThe suite of initiatives she outlined—Net Zero Industry Act, Industrial Accelerator Act, and the dedicated battery value chain strategy with its Battery Booster Facility—represents an integrated attempt to align regulation, industrial policy, and finance behind a single strategic goal: transforming Europe from a consumer of imported batteries into a global leader in innovation and manufacturing.\nWhether Europe can successfully translate this complex framework of acts, criteria, and funds into operational gigafactories, resilient supply chains, and skilled jobs will be the ultimate test of its European Battery Ecosystem Strategy in the years ahead.\nJun 9, 2026 TO Jun 11, 2026\nMesse Stuttgart | Stuttgart, Germany\nJoin the leading meeting place for the advanced battery and H/EV technology community. Meet manufacturers, suppliers, engineers, thought leaders and decision-makers for a conference and trade fair focused on the latest developments in the advanced battery and automotive industries.\nRegister Now\nRegister Now\nMichael C. Anderson\nAs editor-in-chief of\nBattery Technology\n, Michael C. Anderson leads the brand’s coverage of advancements in battery technology as well as associated materials and manufacturing techniques across industries such as automotive/EVs, e-mobility, maritime, aerospace, medtech, and consumer electronics.\nMike is also a member of\nThe Battery Show North America Advisory Board\n, where he contributes his expertise to advising on industry trends and speaker selection for The Battery Show North America while helping to shape discussions on battery technology and electrification.\nBattery Technology\nsenior editor Maria Guerra De Egui are joint\n2025 Neal Award Winners\nin the category of \"Best Coverage of the 2024 Election on Your Served Market.\"\nMike was a recent guest journalist on the popular automotive-industry webcast, Autoline After Hours.\nMike has been covering manufacturing and transportation technology developments for more than 25 years. At SME (\nThe Society of Manufacturing Engineers\n), he served as lead editor of\nAerospace & Defense Manufacturing\n, lead editor of\nMedical Manufacturing\n, senior editor for\nManufacturing Engineering,\nand acting lead editor of\nSmart Manufacturing\n. He has also been senior editor of\nCutting Tool Engineering\n, senior technical editor of Gardener Business Media’s\nAutomotive Design & Production\n, PR manager at B2B advertising/PR agency G. Temple Associates, and editor at the SM Wu Manufacturing Research Center at the University of Michigan.\nThis all followed more than a decade of teaching English, ESL, literature, and argumentation as a lecturer at Eastern Michigan University (Ypsilanti, MI) and, for five years, at Sakura no Seibo Junior College (Fukushima, Japan).\nMike has a bachelor’s degree in English language and literature and a master’s degree in rhetoric and written communication from Eastern Michigan University.\nSee more from\nMichael C. Anderson"},{"t":"适配体工程限域反应微环境双单原子催化剂实现时空可控选择性催化转化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73645?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双单原子催化","kp":["催化剂[时空控制转化]: 适配体功能化Au-Fe双单原子催化剂"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究设计了双单原子催化剂，利用适配体工程构建限域反应微环境，实现对短寿命活性中间体的时空可控选择性转化。催化剂的两种单原子位点分别负责不同反应步骤，适配体分子筛机制精确调控底物传质和中间体寿命。该策略突破了传统多相催化中活性物种难以精确操控的瓶颈，为仿生级高选择性催化反应设计提供了新范式。","ot":"Dual‐Single‐Atom Catalyst with Aptamer‐Engineered Confined Reactive Milieu for Spatiotemporally Controlled Selective Con","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Spatiotemporal control of short‐lived reactive intermediates remains a central challenge in heterogeneous catalysis, as non‐selective diffusion fundamentally limits efficiency in complex media. Inspired by enzymatic compartmentalization, we report an aptamer‐functionalized Au‐Fe dual‐single‐atom catalyst (Apt‐Au\n                    1\n                    ‐Fe\n                    1\n                    /NC) that mimics nature's precision by integrating atomically dispersed Au‐Fe sites with a genetically engineered recognition element. This material design creates a “smart reactive pocket” featuring two synergistic interfaces: the Au‐Fe heteronuclear pair electronically modulates the\n                    d\n                    ‐band center to lock the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) into a highly selective 3‐electron pathway with a lowered energy barrier (0.424 eV), while the grafted aptamer acts as a molecular gatekeeper for substrate pre‐enrichment. The resulting architecture achieves exceptional selectivity (87.0%–92.6%) for specific targets while suppressing non‐specific mineralization to below 5.3%—a stark contrast to conventional systems where selectivity is negligible and mineralization exceeds 90%. Mechanistically, the synergistic electronic interaction ensures localized ·OH generation, while the aptamer enforces a strict “proximity effect,” confining these radicals within the nanoscale space for instantaneous consumption by captured substrates. By imposing biological recognition‐based spatial constraints on inorganic active centers, this work establishes a universal paradigm for decoupling activity from selectivity, enabling precision chemical conversion in complex matrices."},{"t":"通过轨道和关联协同作用双重增强 FeSe/SrTiO3 的超导性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602209123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"In iron-based superconductors, the\n                    \n                      d\n                      z\n                    \n                    2\n                    orbital band typically resides far below the Fermi level and has not been considered to participate in Cooper pairing. Here, using monolayer FeSe/SrTiO\n                    3\n                    as a model system, we demonstrate that tip-induced tensile strain controllably shifts the\n                    \n                      d\n                      z\n                    \n                    2\n                    band toward the Fermi level, driving a two-stage enhancement of superconductivity. In-plane lattice expansion first enhances electronic correlation, amplifying superconductivity in the initial stage. As strain further increases, the upward-shifted\n                    \n                      d\n                      z\n                    \n                    2\n                    band hybridizes with the\n                    \n                      d\n                      xy\n                    \n                    band, reconstructing the pairing-active\n                    d\n                    -orbital bands and inducing a secondary, stronger gap enhancement. Collectively, these two stages enlarge the superconducting gap from 17.8 to 23.6 meV. Throughout this process, invariant Fermi wave vectors confirm that the enhancement originates from band renormalization and reconstruction rather than carrier doping. Our work establishes a route to tailor superconducting states via strain-activated electronic correlations and band engineering, and reveals a previously unrecognized orbital-selective pairing mechanism with broad implications for correlated multiband superconductors.","tp":"超导性增强","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"铁基超导体中dz²轨道能带通常远离费米能级，被认为不参与库珀配对。以单层FeSe/SrTiO3为模型体系，证明针尖诱导的拉伸应变可控制性地移动该轨道能带，通过轨道与关联效应协同作用双重增强超导性。","aip":1},{"t":"Drp1驱动的巩膜线粒体碎片促进近视发展","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2511427123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The global epidemic of myopia constitutes a growing public health concern worldwide. Myopia development is characterized by pathological scleral remodeling through fibroblast-myofibroblast transdifferentiation (FMT) and extracellular matrix (ECM) degradation. Since myopia is progressive, the development of sustainable and safe preventive interventions is imperative. While mitochondrial dynamics critically regulate fibrotic processes in other organs, their role in scleral homeostasis has remained unexplored. Here, we identify pathological mitochondrial fragmentation, caused by increased mitochondrial fission, as a key driver of myopia progression. Using two mammalian animal models, we demonstrate that both genetic and pharmacological enhancement of mitochondrial fission (inducing mitochondrial fragmentation) exacerbates collagen loss and accelerates axial elongation, whereas genetic and pharmacological inhibition of mitochondrial fission prevents collagen degradation and attenuates myopia progression. Hypoxia-induced FMT in cultured human scleral fibroblasts (HSFs) requires activation of mitochondrial fission, revealing overproduction of reactive oxygen species (ROS) as the downstream effector on HSFs and in both animal models. Our multilevel analyses identify the mitochondrial fission-ROS axis as a key pathway linking scleral hypoxia to ECM remodeling. Lycopene, a naturally occurring carotenoid antioxidant, significantly attenuated scleral ROS levels and was found suitable for long-term application, highlighting its potential as a therapeutic agent for myopia control. Collectively, these findings have identified a therapeutic target and agent for controlling myopia progression."},{"t":"在气候变化的推动下，干湿之间的突然波动会造成“水文鞭打”","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2617960123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"怀疑托马斯","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01718-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Family ties. Family ties."},{"t":"双面机械互锁实现柔性器件用软-硬导电界面创纪录韧性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73649?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性导电界面","kp":["[界面策略]: 双面机械互锁","[特性]: 柔性电子高韧性导电界面"],"dp":1,"as":"材料科学领域研究：提出双面机械互锁策略，解决聚合物电极与金属元件之间的界面失配难题，构建兼具柔性与刚性特征的导电界面。该柔性电子互连方案有望提升可穿戴器件、柔性传感器及软体机器人在循环形变下的界面稳定性与信号传输可靠性，推动柔性电子系统工程化应用。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Double‐Sided Mechanical Interlocking Enables Soft‐Rigid Conductive Interfaces With a Record High Toughness for Flexible ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The pronounced mismatch between polymeric electrodes and metallic components hinders the formation of robust electrical contacts. While most approaches rely on chemical design to strengthen interfacial interactions, we present a double‐sided mechanical interlocking strategy that provides both stability and adaptability. A conductive fabric scaffold bridges polymers and metals, with adhesives sequentially applied to both sides. The adhesive infiltrates and encapsulates scaffold fibers, forming a thread–hole adhesion that can only be disrupted by bulk failure. This mechanism achieves a record high interfacial toughness of 730 J m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    between conductive elastomer and copper using commercial silver pastes. Peeling tests show delamination occurs between silver paste and copper, indicating even higher toughness could be obtained with better‐performing products of conductive adhesive. Notably, the interface stability surpasses that of the electrode itself, remaining intact even when the electrode fails. The design is broadly compatible with elastomeric or hydrogel matrices and with diverse commercial adhesives. It enables the construction of reliable epidermal electronics and hydrogel‐based devices. Overall, this interlocking strategy provides a versatile platform for integrating soft and rigid conductors in hybrid electronic systems."},{"t":"不要竞争，要合作：为什么集体资助申请是未来","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01815-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Scientists with disparate expertise writing grants together can identify knowledge gaps and drive progress — but systems must change to incentivize them. Scientists with disparate expertise writing grants together can identify knowledge gaps and drive progress — but systems must change to incentivize them."},{"t":"激动性神经毒素对人类 Nav1.6 的不同结合姿势","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10661-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Voltage-gated sodium (Nav) channels are key targets of various venomous toxins. Deciphering the binding poses and mechanisms of action of representative toxins will help to dissect the functional mechanism of the channels and facilitate therapeutic development targeting Nav channels1,2. Here we present cryo-electron microscopy (cryo-EM) structures of distinct binding poses of three agonistic peptide toxins on the human Nav1.6–β1 channel complex. The globular β-scorpion toxin Cn2 nestles between the extracellular segment of voltage-sensing domain (VSD) in the second repeat of the Nav1.6 core α-unit (VSDII) and the pore extracellular loops in the third repeat of the Nav1.6 core α-unit (ECLIII), where it is stabilized by interactions with both protein regions and the branched N1372-glycan. Cone snail ι-conotoxin RXIA adopts an elongated conformation, spanning VSDI and VSDIV to wrap around the shoulder of the pore domain (PD). The bullet ant-derived toxin δ-paraponeritoxin-Pc1a exists as a transmembrane helix that stands between VSDII and PDIII. Our findings, corroborated by functional characterizations, illustrate the diversity in peptide toxin binding poses and mechanisms of action, link stabilization of the up state of VSDI or VSDII to channel activation, and provide clues to the rational design of selective Nav channel modulators."},{"t":"不同的基因组结构，但相同的基因是植物超基因趋同进化的基础","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec1996?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Evolution reflects a balance between innovation and constraint, often repurposing existing components in new contexts. Convergent evolution exemplifies this interplay, with similar traits evolving independently in different species, yet the genomic mechanisms enabling this repeatability remain poorly understood. Here, by analyzing 10 chromosome-scale genome assemblies, including seven newly generated, we found that the\n                    S\n                    -locus supergene (a cluster of tightly linked genes controlling a floral dimorphism called distyly) arose independently multiple times within the primrose family, Darwin’s iconic system for studying distyly. In each case, the same gene was independently duplicated and co-opted. However, the resulting genomic architectures differed, ranging from hemizygous (present on one chromosome copy) to heterozygous (on both copies), challenging the prevailing view that hemizygosity is intrinsic to\n                    S\n                    -loci and suggesting alternative evolutionary routes to distyly supergene formation. By uncovering multiple mechanisms for supergene origins, our work shows how convergent evolution can produce similar phenotypes by reusing the same genetic building blocks while exploring distinct genomic configurations."},{"t":"新形成的少突胶质细胞中 TFEB 信号传导和自噬的破坏导致中枢神经系统髓磷脂的异常生成","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528668123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Myelin is a defining feature of the vertebrate nervous system, yet the cellular and molecular mechanisms governing its integrity remain poorly understood. Here, using volume electron microscopy and a knock-in mouse line targeting newly formed oligodendrocytes, we reconstruct early optic nerve myelination and examine retinal ganglion cell axon ensheathment. We observe that newly formed myelin sheaths exhibit membrane protrusions and occasional degenerative myelin “whorls.” Conditional disruption of the transcription factor EB (TFEB)-autophagy pathway in newly formed oligodendrocytes significantly increases the abundance of these aberrant myelin structures, indicating that this pathway is required for proper myelin formation and integrity. Importantly, this pathway acts independently of the well-established function of TFEB that represses myelin sheath growth. Together, our findings identify a role for TFEB-dependent autophagy in establishing proper myelin structure during development, providing insights into the oligodendrocyte-intrinsic mechanisms that regulate myelin integrity."},{"t":"非对称基元触发放电触发电子离域，抑制锰基层状材料的Jahn-Teller畸变","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE03005J","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锰基钠电正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: 锰基层状氧化物(阴离子氧化还原)","[抑制姜泰勒畸变]: MMCT机制触发非对称基元电子离域"],"as":"针对钠离子电池锰基层状氧化物正极材料的阴离子氧化还原活性，研究提出通过非对称基序在放电过程中触发电子离域的策略，抑制Jahn-Teller畸变。该设计显著提升了正极材料的结构稳定性与循环寿命，为高能量密度钠离子电池的工程化提供了新思路。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Discharge-Triggered Electronic Delocalization via Asymmetric Motifs Suppresses Jahn-Teller Distortion in Mn-Based Layere","b":"Mn-based layered oxide cathodes with anionic redox activity are promising candidates for sodium-ion batteries (SIBs) owing to their high operating voltage and energy density.However, the inevitable Mn 3+ generation after cycles results in severe Jahn-Teller distortion, damaging the long cycling stability of the cathodes. Herein, we present a metal-to-metal charge transfer (MMCT) mechanism that acts at the end of discharge to inhibit the generation of Mn 3+ , thereby improving the structural sustainability of the electrode. A P2-Na 0.69 Li 0.23 Ru 0.17 Mn 0.6 O 2 cathode is selected as a model. The doping of highly electronegative Ru regulates the covalency of asymmetrical Mn-O-Ru, ensuring the electron transfer between Mn 3+ and Ru 4+ , which reduces Mn 3+ content and mitigates the Jahn-Teller distortion.As a result, the electrode shows a robust structural stability with a minimal unit cell volume change of only 0.2%. Moreover, the cathode exhibits excellent electrochemical performance, maintaining capacity retention of over 90% after 900 cycles at 2-4.3 V. The findings provide fresh insights for inhibiting the Jahn-Teller effect, offering a new paradigm for the application of Mn-based layered cathodes with high energy density for sustainable SIBs.","aip":1},{"t":"城市采矿数字辅助系统：MIRAKEL研究项目助力建筑实践循环经济","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://nachrichten.idw-online.de/2026/06/10/digitales-assistenzsystem-fuer-urban-mining-forschungsprojekt-mirakel-staerkt-kreislaufwirtschaft-in-der-baupraxis","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Informationsdienst Wissenschaft-idw","tg":"观点评论","tp":"城市矿山数字化","kp":["[技术]: AI+混合现实辅助系统","[应用]: 城市矿山循环建造"],"as":"德国SRH应用科学大学牵头的MIRAKEL研究项目开发了一套城市采矿数字辅助系统，旨在提升建筑实践中的循环经济水平。该系统通过数字化手段优化建筑废弃物中可再生资源的识别、回收与再利用流程，为建筑行业减少原生资源消耗提供技术支撑。","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Digitales Assistenzsystem für Urban Mining: Forschungsprojekt MIRAKEL stärkt Kreislaufwirtschaft in der Baupraxis","b":"Digitales Assistenzsystem für Urban Mining: Forschungsprojekt MIRAKEL stärkt Kreislaufwirtschaft in der Baupraxis\nDie SRH University beteiligt sich an einem innovativen Forschungsprojekt für zirkuläres Bauen. Ziel ist die Entwicklung eines durch Künstliche Intelligenz (KI) und Mixed Reality (MR) gestützten Assistenzsystems, das Gebäudebestände digital erfasst, Bauteile automatisch bewertet und Wiederverwendungsempfehlungen liefert. Das Projekt wird vom Bundesministerium für Forschung, Technologie und Raumfahrt (BMFTR) über einen Zeitraum von 2,5 Jahren gefördert.\nUrban Mining – also die Bewirtschaftung vom Menschen geschaffener Materiallager wie Bestandsgebäuden – gilt als zentraler Transformationshebel für Klimaanpassung und Ressourceneffizienz. Für den systematischen Rückbau und die hochwertige Anschlussnutzung von Bauprodukten braucht es verlässliche Bestandsdaten, vereinfachte Prüfprozesse, belastbare Wirtschaftlichkeitsbewertungen und die verbesserte Planbarkeit mit Re-Use-Bauteilen. Genau hier setzt das Forschungsprojekt MIRAKEL an, an dem auch die SRH University maßgeblich beteiligt ist.\nZiel ist die Entwicklung eines digitalen Assistenzsystems, das Fachleute dabei unterstützt, den Wert verbauter Produkte zu erfassen und ihre Wiederverwendung wirtschaftlich zu bewerten.\n„MIRAKEL wird ein Werkzeug, das den verborgenen Wert von Gebäudebeständen sichtbar und nutzbar macht“, erklärt Prof. Dr.-Ing. Patrick Teuffel, Professor für Innovation und Nachhaltigkeitsstrategien an der SRH University. „Damit kann Urban Mining zum Standardprozess im Bauwesen werden.“\nDigitale Technologien für die optimierte Bewertung von Re-Use-Bauteilen\nIm Zentrum steht eine praxisnahe Anwendung: Gebäude werden vor Rückbau oder Sanierung mithilfe von Smartphone und 3D-Kamera interaktiv erfasst. Die gewonnenen Bauteildaten werden mit vorhandenen Informationen zum Gebäude, mit Material- und Ökobilanzdatenbanken sowie wirtschaftlichen Erfahrungswerten verknüpft und bei Bedarf live ergänzt. Auf dieser Basis ermittelt MIRAKEL automatisch Wiederverwendungspotenziale, realistische Kosten, Erlöse und Umweltwirkungen wie Emissionseinsparungen.\n„Unser Ansatz reduziert Informationsunsicherheiten zu Bestandsgebäuden und schafft eine fundierte Datengrundlage für Portfolioentscheidungen“, so Prof. Teuffel weiter. „Das erleichtert nicht nur die Planung ‚form follows availability‘, sondern verbessert insgesamt die Wirtschaftlichkeit zirkulärer Bauprozesse.“\nTechnologisch kombiniert MIRAKEL erstmals mehrere digitale Schlüsseltechnologien in einem durchgängigen Prozess:\n— Erklärbare künstliche Intelligenz (XAI) für nachvollziehbare Empfehlungen zur Reduktion von Unsicherheiten, Verbesserung von Schätzungen und Erhöhung der Planbarkeit, bspw. Einschätzung von Materialqualitäten und Potenzialen\n— Mixed Reality (MR) ermöglicht die interaktive, standardisierte Begehung von Bestandsgebäuden, Beschleunigung von Inspektionen und Schließung von Dokumentationslücken\n— Interaktives maschinelles Lernen (IML) integriert kontinuierlich das fachliche Feedback der Expert:innen vor Ort in die KI und präzisiert die Bewertungsmodelle\n— Knowledge Graphs verknüpfen strukturiert Bestands-, Material-, Kosten- und Nachhaltigkeitsdaten zur Abbildung komplexer Zusammenhänge\nEin besonderer Fokus liegt auf der Integration von Re-Use-Objekten in digitale Planungsmethoden mit Building Information Modeling (BIM) – der digitalen Modellierung und Verwaltung von Gebäudedaten. Nutzende sollen unterschiedliche Rückbau- und Verwertungsszenarien simulieren und vergleichen können. Der Prototyp wird in realen Gebäuden getestet und kontinuierlich weiterentwickelt.\nStarke Partnerschaft und Rolle der SRH University\nDas Projekt wird von einem interdisziplinären Konsortium getragen: Concular, Deutsches Forschungszentrum für Künstliche Intelligenz, SRH University, BIM Berliner Immobilienmanagement GmbH, ryze technologies, Knepper und CIRCULAR STRUCTURAL DESIGN bündeln ihre Expertise aus Baupraxis, Immobilienmanagement, Digitalisierung, KI, Forschung und zirkulärem Design.\nDie SRH University übernimmt dabei die wissenschaftliche Begleitung und Evaluierung von Technologien zur Wiederverwendung von Bauteilen. Dazu gehören die Entwicklung von Bewertungsmethoden und die Durchführung von Machbarkeitsstudien. „Wir verbinden Forschung, Praxis und Lehre eng miteinander“, betont Prof. Dr.-Ing. Patrick Teuffel. „Unsere Studierenden arbeiten direkt an aktuellen Fragestellungen des nachhaltigen Bauens und der digitalen Transformation.“\nDie Ergebnisse des Projekts fließen sowohl in die Lehre – etwa im Masterstudiengang „Engineering and Sustainable Technology Management – Smart Building Technologies“ – als auch in Fachpublikationen und Konferenzbeiträge ein.\nDas Projekt „Mixed-Reality- und vertrauenswürdiges KI-basiertes Assistenzsystem zur Einschätzung von Werten anthropogener Lager und Kosten von Erschließungsprozessen in der Kreislaufwirtschaft“ (MIRAKEL) wird vom Bundesministerium für Forschung, Technologie und Raumfahrt (BMFTR) unter dem Förderkennzeichen 033R422E im Rahmen der Strategie Forschung für Nachhaltigkeit (FONA) über 30 Monate mit einem Gesamtvolumen von ca. 2,6 Millionen Euro gefördert.\nWeiterführende Informationen\nSRH University\nDie SRH University ist eine private Hochschule mit bundesweit 18 Standorten, knapp 11.000 Studierenden aus über 140 Ländern und einem Angebot von rund 120 Studiengängen. Sie gehört zum gemeinnützigen Stiftungskonzern SRH, einem der größten Bildungs- und Gesundheitsanbieter Deutschlands.\nMit über 50 Jahren Erfahrung in der Hochschulbildung strebt die SRH University an, den Zugang zu qualitativ hochwertiger Bildung zu ermöglichen und Fachkräfte von morgen auszubilden. Die SRH University legt großen Wert auf Offenheit, Vielfalt und zeitgemäße Bildungskonzepte, die Präsenz- und Online-Lehre miteinander kombinieren. Gemeinsam mit der SRH Fernhochschule – The Mobile University und der EBS Universität für Wirtschaft und Recht studieren aktuell über 20.000 Studierende an den Hochschulen der SRH.\nSRH | Gemeinsam für Bildung und Gesundheit\nAls Stiftung mit führenden Angeboten in den Bereichen Bildung und Gesundheit begleiten wir Menschen auf ihren individuellen Lebenswegen. Unserer Leidenschaft fürs Leben folgend, helfen wir ihnen aktiv bei der Gestaltung ihrer Zukunft, hin zu einem selbstbestimmten Leben. Mit rund 17.000 Mitarbeiterinnen und Mitarbeitern und 1,2 Mio. Kunden erwirtschaften wir einen Umsatz von fast 1,5 Mrd. Euro (2024).\nDie 1966 gegründete SRH ist heute eines der größten Bildungs- und Gesundheitsunternehmen Deutschlands mit bundesweit rund 80 Standorten. Hauptsitz der SRH ist Heidelberg.\nWeitere Informationen:\nhttps://concular.de/mirakel/\nProjektwebsite\nÄhnliche Pressemitteilungen im idw"},{"t":"能源与电力系统中的数字孪生：架构、应用、使能工具及实用化行动路线图","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007816?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"电力系统数字孪生","dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":4.5,"t":3.5},"ot":"Digital Twins in energy and power systems: architectures, applications, enabling tools, and actionable roadmap for utili"},{"t":"通过 TCF7L2/LEF1 结合特异性的差异 Wnt/β-连环蛋白信号传导塑造细胞和肿瘤表型","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528450123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The mechanisms by which Wnt/β-catenin signaling regulates gene expression in a tissue- and context-specific manner remain poorly understood, limiting our ability to target the aberrant cell growth typical of many Wnt-driven cancers. Here, we focus on malignant liver tumors driven by activating\n                    CTNNB1\n                    (β-catenin) mutations that nevertheless display distinct phenotypic states and Wnt outputs. By profiling patient-derived organoids via single-cell transcriptomics and chromatin dynamics, we identify subtype-specific transcriptional and epigenetic profiles. Using CUT&amp;RUN, we show that β-catenin engages distinct genomic regions, dictated by differential association with TCF/LEF family transcription factors. Specifically, we define a sequence-specific regulatory element engaged by β-catenin only upon interaction with TCF7L2, revealing that partner choice, independent of\n                    CTNNB1\n                    mutational status, ultimately determines cell fate. Our findings, validated across multiple tumor models and patient tissues, offer a framework for understanding how differential β-catenin-TCF/LEF interaction orchestrates context-specific Wnt signaling outcomes."},{"t":"DexAnyTwist：基于混合操作系统的通用灵巧扭转技能学习","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag351/8704707?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"灵巧操作学习","kp":["[灵巧操作]: 混合动力学系统辨识解决异构数据优化冲突"],"as":"灵巧旋转扭转操作是通用机器人长期未解的难题。DexAnyTwist提出一种混合操作系统，结合学习策略实现通用旋转扭动操作的泛化能力。该系统针对工业装配、物体定向调整等需精细扭动控制的场景，通过混合硬件（夹爪与灵巧手结合）与策略学习，克服了传统单一末端执行器在复杂扭转动作上的局限。研究为通用灵巧操作提供新范式，有望拓展至柔性物体处理和精密装配等实际应用。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"DexAnyTwist: Learning General Dexterous Twisting with Hybrid Manipulation System Identification","b":"Developing general-purpose dexterous manipulation, particularly for intricate twisting tasks, remains a long-standing challenge. Large-scale training on massive datasets encompassing a vast spectrum of geometric and physical properties is a promising path. Yet, the hybrid dynamical space inherent in heterogeneous datasets creates optimization conflicts, where standard learning paradigms fail to synthesize a cohesive control strategy across disparate physical laws. This paper presents DexAnyTwist, a framework that reformulates the general twisting task as a problem of identification and control within a hybrid dynamical system. DexAnyTwist employs an iterative strategy to progressively partition the hybrid manipulation task into dynamically consistent subsystems. This approach utilizes forward partitioning to isolate data modes based on expert performance and backward refinement to optimize specialized policies. A learned gating mechanism then dynamically composes these experts, effectively mitigating interference between distinct dynamic modes. Beyond achieving state-of-the-art performance on our large-scale dataset, our framework spontaneously evolves manipulation primitives consistent with human twisting, and demonstrates superior zero-shot generalization to novel real-world geometries. This study not only solves a complex class of twisting tasks but also establishes a scalable pathway for robots to acquire general-purpose contact-rich manipulation skills."},{"t":"DIII-D与KSTAR中面向钨兼容长脉冲运行的混合模式开发","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae6f2c","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚变长脉冲运行","kp":["[聚变运行]: DIII-D/KSTAR联合验证高混合场景与钨偏滤器兼容"],"as":"面向聚变堆稳态运行，钨偏滤器等面向等离子体部件的长期脉冲高参数运行是关键挑战。该研究在DIII-D和KSTAR托卡马克上联合开发混合运行模式，兼顾高约束性能与钨杂质兼容性。混合模式融合了先进磁拓扑与优化的电流密度分布，有效控制钨杂质输运与等离子体约束退化，为ITER及未来反应堆在钨壁条件下实现长脉冲稳态运行提供了重要实验依据和情景验证。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Developing the hybrid scenario in DIII-D and KSTAR for W-compatible long-pulse operation","b":"Long-pulse, high-performance operation with tungsten plasma-facing components is a crucial challenge for achieving steady-state (SS) goals in ITER and future fusion devices. This paper presents a joint international effort between the DIII-D and KSTAR tokamaks aimed at demonstrating the compatibility of the high hybrid scenario with a tungsten divertor and superconducting coils. A DIII-D hybrid scenario recipe is successfully tailored to KSTAR’s operational constraints, which facilitates cross-device studies. The results show successful 30 s long-pulse operation in KSTAR at a normalized beta ( = 2.4) with a benign 4/3 mode and effective mitigation of tungsten accumulation. Despite this success, the KSTAR scenario exhibits a greater than 25% reduction in thermal confinement compared to the DIII-D reference. To investigate this discrepancy, we performed a predictive TGYRO validation study, which suggests that the difference is likely caused by a weaker temperature pedestal in the KSTAR discharge due to a higher and narrower density pedestal. In addition, such lower thermal confinement leads to higher impurity accumulation, possibly due to a change in neoclassical transport with increased inward pinch, which further degrades global confinement. We also report that stationary, long-pulse operation with sustained thermal confinement requires consistent fueling and wall conditioning. These findings highlight the importance of optimized fueling and real-time wall conditioning in achieving a high temperature pedestal and strong global confinement during stable long-pulse operation. We propose potential approaches toward fully SS, long-pulse operation, including real-time wall conditioning using an impurity dropper in KSTAR and future tokamaks."},{"t":"通过深度神经网络确定重离子碰撞中可观测量的方向依赖性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6dtk-1tw2","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Zu-Xing Yang, Xiao-Hua Fan, Peng-Hui Chen, and Shunji NishimuraWe simulate ultracentral collisions (impact parameter vector $|\\stackrel{⃗}{b}|[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064604] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"深度学习揭示历史人为强迫下 ENSO 的可预测性增强","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aec9518?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Understanding how ENSO predictability responds to climate change is essential for improving future climate projections. In this study, we apply a deep learning model—convolutional neural network with a leave-one-out model strategy to Coupled Model Intercomparison Project Phase 6 (CMIP6) historical and preindustrial control simulations. We find that El Niño–Southern Oscillation (ENSO) predictability is statistically enhanced by 14.0 ± 1.8% enhancement under historical anthropogenic forcing. This improvement is linked to changes in key ocean-atmosphere feedbacks. Under historical forcing, the equatorial Pacific shows a shoaling of the thermocline. As a result, the surface ocean becomes more sensitive to wind forcing, and subsurface temperature becomes more responsive to thermocline variations. These processes strengthen the three-dimensional advective and thermocline feedbacks, which together enhance ENSO predictability. These findings highlight the importance of anthropogenic forcing in shaping ENSO predictability in a warming climate."},{"t":"深度学习人类迁徙的四十年","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10611-7","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Human migration is a fundamental driver of global demographic change, shaping population structure, labour markets and social policy across countries1,2,3. Although long-term migration patterns are often linked to economic development4, they can shift rapidly in response to shocks such as conflict, environmental crises and political change5. Despite its importance, migration remains difficult to measure consistently: existing data are sparse, concentrated in high-income settings and are fragmented across incompatible definitions, temporal resolutions and data types6,7,8. Past efforts have relied on partial datasets, including flow records, stock estimates and model-based reconstructions with limited coverage9,10,11,12,13,14. A central challenge is therefore to construct a globally consistent, high-resolution account of migration flows over time. Here we present a new dataset of annual origin-destination migration across 230 countries and regions from 1990 to the present, integrating diverse data sources into a unified modelling framework. By combining official statistics, census-based stocks, net migration estimates and past flow reconstructions, our approach produces temporally detailed and spatially comprehensive estimates that substantially extend existing resources. Using an ensemble of deep recurrent neural networks informed by geographic, economic, cultural and political covariates, we capture both persistent trends and short-term responses to changing conditions—all while propagating uncertainty to generate confidence bounds. Our results outperform existing five-year flow estimates on held-out data and provide finer temporal resolution, revealing previously obscured dynamics in global migration patterns. This framework highlights regions in which uncertainty remains high and data collection is most urgently needed. By releasing all data, code and trained models, we provide a transparent and reproducible foundation for future work. These advances enable a more timely and detailed understanding of human mobility, with implications for research and policy in an increasingly dynamic global system.","tp":"深度迁徙学","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"利用深度学习方法对四十年全球人类迁徙数据进行分析，构建了可跨国家一致衡量的迁徙模型。该研究揭示了人口迁徙的长期规律及其对经济冲击、冲突和政治变化的响应，为理解全球人口结构变化提供了新工具。"},{"t":"基于深度学习的EAST装置三维外加磁场扰动等离子体响应模型","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae70c0","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","tp":"深度学习等离子体","kp":["模型[等离子体响应预测]: iTransformer优于FNN和CNN-LSTM"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究基于EAST托卡马克装置提出深度学习等离子体响应模型，实时监测三维外部磁场扰动下的等离子体响应并优化物理特征，推动核聚变等离子体控制向智能化实时反馈发展。","ot":"Deep learning based plasma response models to 3D external magnetic field perturbations in EAST","b":"The real-time response monitoring model and the physics feature based response optimization model are proposed on EAST using three deep learning models. Compared with the widely used fully connected neural network (FNN) and convolutional neural network—long short-term memory (CNN–LSTM) models, the inverted transformer (iTransformer) model, which uses the attention mechanism to more naturally capture multivariate dependencies, demonstrates the best overall performance. For real-time response monitoring, the iTransformer model is trained on 133157 experimental samples with 4-fold toroidal phase symmetry augmentation. This model establishes a direct nonlinear mapping from resonant magnetic perturbation (RMP) coils and electromagnetic measurement sensors to the plasma response. With an inference time per discharge of less than , it can provide real-time response monitoring under flexible three-dimensional (3D) fields. For experimental response optimization, the physics feature based iTransformer model is trained on 12080 filtered experimental samples. This model captures the dependence of the response amplitude on key parameters, including , , , , , , and . Combined with SHapley Additive exPlanations (SHAP) analysis, it provides interpretable insights into parameter influences and directly guides the optimization of 3D field experimental discharges. This work establishes a comprehensive framework for real-time monitoring and physics feature based optimization of plasma responses based on statistical patterns in large datasets, thereby paving the way for active control of error-field locked mode and edge localized mode (ELM)."},{"t":"张拉整体超材料的解耦非易失性预应力编程实现持久力学功能","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00233-X?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"张拉整体超材料","kp":["[机制]: 湿度编程预应力+机械锁存","[特性]: 非易失性力学状态记忆"],"dp":1,"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究受河豚启发的张拉整体超材料平台，利用湿度编程内部预应力，实现非易失性预应力调控，使超材料获得持久的力学功能响应。该策略为智能可编程材料和柔性机器人提供新设计范式。","ot":"Decoupled and non-volatile prestress programming of tensegrity metamaterials enables persistent mechanical function","b":"Yu et al. develop a pufferfish-inspired tensegrity platform that uses humidity to program internal prestress and a mechanical lock to store it as non-volatile memory. Once set, the structure maintains its mechanical state without continuous energy input, enabling persistent functions including timed release, impact protection, and adaptive load bearing."},{"t":"黑暗多样性框架解决了达尔文关于淡水鱼入侵的归化难题","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604929123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The spread of invasive species poses a major threat to global biodiversity, yet predicting successful establishment of exotic species in novel environments remains challenging. Darwin’s naturalization conundrum is a longstanding debate over whether exotic species closely or distantly related to native communities are more likely to succeed. Despite its long history, empirical studies continue to yield conflicting evidence. Here, we introduce the dark diversity concept, which refers to species that could theoretically inhabit a site but are currently absent. Combined with observed diversity, dark diversity integrates information on the potential diversity (site-specific species pool size) of the resident community and how completely that pool is locally present (community completeness). Analyzing a 340-y record of successful and failed fish introductions across 516 Swedish lakes, we showed that the effect of phylogenetic relatedness on invasion outcome depends on dark diversity context. Exotics closely related to resident species were more likely to establish in communities with smaller species pools and higher completeness, whereas phylogenetically distant exotic species were more successful in communities with larger species pools and lower completeness. Models with observed species richness obtained considerably less support. Thus, integrating the dark diversity framework clarifies the contrasting effects of phylogenetic relatedness on invasion outcomes, and helps reconcile this 160-y-old conundrum."},{"t":"每日简报：细胞“延缓衰老”试验治疗第一人称","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01861-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"The gene-therapy trial aims to treat glaucoma by rejuvenating cells in the optic nerve. Plus, the mystery of how things freeze and encouragement to go out into the sunlight. The gene-therapy trial aims to treat glaucoma by rejuvenating cells in the optic nerve. Plus, the mystery of how things freeze and encouragement to go out into the sunlight."},{"t":"每日简报：古代地松鼠的饮食方式就像“更新世的僵尸”","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01878-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Evidence from fossilized poo reveals the diverse diet of ancient ground squirrels. Plus, the science behind the peptide craze and our innate tendency to wander anticlockwise. Evidence from fossilized poo reveals the diverse diet of ancient ground squirrels. Plus, the science behind the peptide craze and our innate tendency to wander anticlockwise."},{"t":"DMEGC-ESS推出直流耦合离网储能系统 - 储能","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/10/dmegc-ess-unveils-dc-coupled-off-grid-energy-storage-system/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"离网储能系统","kp":["电池类型[离网储能]: 磷酸铁锂","[耦合方式]: DC直流耦合"],"as":"DMEGC-ESS发布了一款面向离网应用场景的新型储能系统，采用直流耦合架构设计，以锂电池为核心。该系统旨在为无电网覆盖的偏远地区提供可靠的电力存储解决方案，有望在分布式能源、微电网及离网工业场景中获得应用。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"ot":"DMEGC-ESS unveils DC-coupled off-grid energy storage system - Energy Storage","b":"DMEGC-ESS has introduced a new energy storage system designed for off-grid applications. The system is built around lithium iron phosphate (LiFePO₄) battery technology and is intended for standalone installations rather than grid-tied use.\nIt operates in DC coupling, meaning it connects directly to solar PV generation on the direct current side. This setup avoids intermediate conversion between DC and alternating current (AC), which the company says helps reduce energy losses during charging and discharging.\nThe system uses a modular architecture with an integrated energy management system (EMS). Depending on configuration, it can provide storage capacities ranging from 10 kWh to more than 60 kWh.\nOn the electrical side, the product is available in both single-phase and three-phase versions. It also offers an asymmetric output capability of up to 150% of rated power, intended to handle short-duration load peaks such as motor start-ups without oversizing the full system.\nWhile DC coupling can improve efficiency by reducing conversion steps, overall system performance depends on compatibility with the photovoltaic inverter setup used in a given installation.\nThe company notes that LiFePO₄ chemistry is already widely used in the storage sector. It positions the integration of an EMS in a compact modular system as a key feature for off-grid projects requiring autonomous energy management. The system is currently being rolled out in the French market."},{"t":"钙钛矿光伏的结晶路径优化与高指数晶面稳定化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73663?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿结晶优化","kp":["[结晶调控]: 纤维素大分子动力学分段结晶","[稳定化]: 高指数晶面"],"dp":1,"as":"钙钛矿太阳能电池（PSCs）面临高光电转换效率与长期稳定性难以兼顾的核心挑战。本研究通过优化钙钛矿薄膜的结晶路径并稳定高指数晶面，协同提升器件效率与耐久性，为推进PSCs商业化量产提供了关键的工艺与材料工程策略。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Crystallization Pathway Optimization and High‐Index Facet Stabilization for Perovskite Photovoltaics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Perovskite solar cells (PSCs) face a critical challenge in balancing high power conversion efficiency (PCE) with operational stability, largely governed by the crystallization kinetics and facet configuration of perovskite films. Here, we report a kinetically segmented crystallization strategy mediated by a conformationally preorganized macromolecular regulator, cellulose 2,4,6‐trichlorophenylcarbamate (3Cl‐NC). Through multidentate coordination, 3Cl‐NC establishes localized precursor‐rich microenvironments that promote heterogeneous nucleation. During thermal annealing, this association transitions into a thermally activated dynamic coordination state that retards long‐range precursor transport while maintaining local availability for controlled crystal growth. This segmented regulation suppresses metastable δ‐phase accumulation and facilitates photoactive α‐phase formation. Furthermore, 3Cl‐NC thermodynamically stabilizes the high‐Miller‐index (210) orientation, establishing a synergistic architecture that intrinsically enhances lattice structural stability. Consequently, the resulting perovskite films exhibit higher phase purity, relieved residual stress, and suppressed ion migration, enabling devices to achieve a champion PCE of 26.59% (certified 26.29%) with improved long‐term stability.","aip":1},{"t":"Cryo-EM 揭示了 PCDH15 的右手双螺旋二聚体结构","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607573123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Tip links connect the stereocilia of mechanosensory hair cells in the inner ear and transmit force onto mechanotransduction (MET) channels. Tip links consist of protocadherin 15 (PCDH15) and cadherin 23, which assemble into an extracellular filament approximately 150 nm in length. Rare freeze-etched electron microscopy (EM) images have suggested that tip links could be right-handed double helices in vivo, but direct structural evidence has been lacking. Using cryo-EM we determined the structure of a large part of the extracellular PCDH15 domain. Two PCDH15 molecules form a parallel cis dimer stabilized by several dimerization interfaces, including two strand crossovers and two parallel contacts, yielding a right-handed double helix. Functional studies show that mutations in PCDH15 dimerization-domains impair MET. Our results establish the molecular foundation for how PCDH15 forms a right-handed double helix to enable mechanical sensing.","tp":"蛋白质结构","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"利用冷冻电镜技术解析了内耳毛细胞尖端连接中PCDH15的右手双螺旋二聚体结构。尖端连接将力传递至机械转导通道，此前其体内双螺旋构象缺乏直接结构证据，该研究填补了听觉机械转导机制的关键空白。"},{"t":"可再生能源与制氢系统耦合优化策略：基于VSEL框架的综述","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008639?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源制氢","kp":["[框架]: VSEL框架","[应用]: 可再生能源-制氢耦合优化"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Coupling optimization strategies for renewable energy and hydrogen production systems: A review based on the VSEL framew"},{"t":"硅中静电定义量子点与⁷³Ge核自旋的耦合","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/49gt-msw9","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅量子点核自旋","kp":["[硅基量子计算]: 73Ge核自旋与静电定义量子点耦合"],"as":"该研究实现了⁷³Ge核自旋与静电定义量子点的耦合。锗基自旋量子比特因长相干时间和自旋轨道耦合优势，被视为硅基量子计算的潜在替代平台。研究团队通过高保真度测量将核自旋态初始化与读取，展示了在锗空穴量子点中操控核自旋的可行性，为固态量子存储器和高保真量子逻辑门提供新路径，推进了基于锗的量子处理器架构发展。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coupling a $^{73}\\mathrm{Ge}$ Nuclear Spin to an Electrostatically Defined Quantum Dot in Silicon","b":"Author(s): Paul Steinacker, Gauri Goenka, Rocky Yue Su, Tuomo Tanttu, Wee Han Lim, Santiago Serrano, Tim Botzem, Jesus D. Cifuentes, Shao Qi Lim, Jeffrey C. McCallum, Brett C. Johnson, Fay E. Hudson, Kok Wai Chan, Christopher C. Escott, Andre Saraiva, Chih Hwan Yang, Vincent Mourik, Andrea Morello, Andrew S. Dzurak, and Arne LauchtSingle nuclear spins in silicon are a promising resource for quantum technologies due to their long coherence times and excellent control fidelities. Qubits and qudits have been encoded on donor nuclei, with successful demonstrations of Bell states and quantum memories on the spin-$^{1}{/}_{2}$ $^{3…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230602] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"共溶剂调控超分子手性揭示多肽纳米材料显著压电响应","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3135255?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"肽基压电材料","kp":["[多肽压电材料]: 共溶剂调控超分子手性增强压电响应"],"as":"该研究通过共溶剂调控多肽超分子手性，发现其展现出显著压电响应。多肽基生物功能材料因良好生物相容性备受关注，而手性对称性破缺直接决定压电性能。研究利用溶剂环境调节分子自组装过程中的手性偏好，实现压电系数的大幅提升，为可降解柔性电子器件、生物传感器及纳米发电机等绿色能源收集器件开辟新方向。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Cosolvent‐Modulated Supramolecular Chirality Unveils Pronounced Piezoelectric Response in Peptide‐Based Nanomaterials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Peptide‐based functional biomaterials have attracted widespread interest due to their inherent biocompatibility, biodegradability, and structural tunability. Among functional biomaterials, piezoelectric materials are particularly valuable for developing self‐powered biodevices in biomedical applications. However, peptide‐based piezoresponsive systems remain largely underexplored. In this study, we present a chromophore‐conjugated peptide (PEP‐A) that self‐assembles into nanomaterials exhibiting either piezo‐active or inactive states, with the functional behaviour closely linked to their chiroptical properties under different solvent conditions. Through a comprehensive investigation involving spectroscopy, microscopy, and atomistic simulations, we uncover how cosolvent‐induced modulation of the self‐assembly process co‐governs chiroptical and piezoelectric properties. Interestingly, PEP‐A forms elongated nanofibers in pure water that are both chiroptically and piezoelectrically inactive. However, the introduction of a minimal amount of cosolvent (1% DMSO or 1% DMF) triggers the emergence of supramolecular chirality alongside a significant piezoresponse, revealing a direct correlation between macroscopic chirality and piezoelectric functionality. Our findings highlight how subtle changes in the assembly environment can drive profound shifts in material properties, offering a powerful strategy to design responsive piezoelectric biomaterials. This study provides a novel approach to designing next‐generation, responsive, peptide‐based piezoelectric biomaterials for biomedical and bioelectronic applications."},{"t":"修正 Forrest 等人的《人属进化过程中稳定且灵活的觅食生态位的早期证据》","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2617803123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"硫化聚苯胺中铜定制d-p-π多轨道耦合实现水系硫电池超长循环","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00230-4?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂硫电池正极","kp":["[耦合机制]: d-p-π多轨道耦合铜修饰硫化聚苯胺","[电池体系]: 水系硫-Zn软包电池"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过铜定制d-p-π多轨道耦合策略，在硫化聚苯胺中实现超高容量硫基电池性能。硫基电池受限于反应动力学迟缓和多硫化物穿梭效应，实际应用受阻。铜引入后激活了多轨道协同电子传输通道，加速氧化还原反应并有效锚定多硫化物，显著提升比容量和循环稳定性，为高能量密度锂硫电池的工程化推进提供新机制思路。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Copper-tailored d-p-π multi-orbital coupling in sulfurized polyaniline enables ultralong cycling aqueous sulfur batterie","b":"The practical application of sulfur-based batteries is severely limited by factors such as slow reaction kinetics and structural collapse. This work successfully constructs a highly conductive and stable copper-modified sulfide polyaniline cathode by introducing d-p-π multi-orbital coupling using copper. Coupled with a Zn anode, the pouch cell delivers stable power output under harsh conditions, offering a new orbital engineering route for durable sulfur-based batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"电催化CO2转化与下游升级的配位工程界面路径分区策略","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7212170?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电催化还原","kp":["催化剂[CO2电还原]: Cu-Sn配位环境可调","[选择性调控]: Sn中心产甲酸/Cu中心产CO路径分离"],"as":"该研究提出配位工程调控界面路径分区策略，优化电催化CO₂还原反应选择性。电化学CO₂还原技术已具备产出工业兼容碳产品的能力，但多产物竞争导致选择性不足。研究通过精准设计催化界面的配位环境，将不同反应路径进行空间隔离与分区，抑制副反应，提升目标碳产物的法拉第效率，为CO₂资源化利用与碳中和工艺提供关键催化设计范式。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coordination‐Engineered Interfacial Pathway Partitioning for Electrocatalytic CO2 Conversion and Downstream Upgrading","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (eCO\n                    2\n                    RR) is increasingly capable of delivering downstream‐compatible carbon products, yet the interfacial origin of pathway selection remains insufficiently understood. Here, coordination‐environment‐tunable Cu–Sn catalysts are employed to partition CO\n                    2\n                    electrosynthesis between a Sn‐centered formate‐selective pathway and a Cu‐centered CO‐selective pathway. In situ spectroscopy reveals coordination‐dependent evolution of adsorbed intermediate and interfacial water structures, while H/D kinetic isotope analysis and in situ electrochemical impedance spectroscopy‐distribution of relaxation times (EIS‐DRT) measurements resolve distinct proton‐coupled and polarization‐sensitive kinetic regimes. Density functional theory calculations further elucidate the energetic origin of pathway bifurcation through coordination‐dependent reconstruction of adsorption geometry and interfacial energetics. Sn‐centered medium‐coordination regimes favor oxygen‐bound intermediates and a proton‐coupled formate pathway, whereas Cu‐centered medium‐coordination regimes promote carbon‐bound adsorption and CO‐selective reactivity. In the downstream modules, electrodialysis achieves a 98.1% HCOOK‐to‐HCOOH conversion with 93.97% Faradaic efficiency (FE) at 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , while CO\n                    2\n                    ‐NH\n                    3\n                    route delivers formamide with a maximum FE of 45.2% and a production rate of 840 µmol cm\n                    −2\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    . This work establishes coordination‐engineered interfacial partitioning as a strategy for integrated CO\n                    2\n                    electrosynthesis with downstream upgrading.","aip":1},{"t":"Ir-Mo原子对位点的配位工程打破析氧反应标度限制","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3665828?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铱钼原子对析氧","kp":["催化剂[酸性OER]: Ir-Mo原子对/MoO3","[打破标度关系]: 第二壳层配位工程调控Ir单原子构型"],"as":"该研究提出通过配位工程调控单原子催化剂（SACs）中的Ir─Mo原子对位点，打破传统催化反应中的标度关系限制。单原子催化剂因原子利用率高而备受关注，但其反应中间体的吸附能往往受限于线性标度关系，难以同时优化多个催化步骤。通过构建异核Ir─Mo双原子位点，调控局部电子结构，实现对不同中间体的差异化吸附，从而突破Sabatier关系的束缚。该策略为设计高效、耐久的电催化或热催化体系提供了新思路，尤其在能源转换反应中具有显著潜力。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coordination Engineering of Ir─Mo Atomic Pair Sites to Break Scaling Limitations for Acidic Oxygen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Coordination engineering of single‐atom catalysts (SACs) is a powerful strategy to address durability and activity challenges in the acidic oxygen evolution reaction (OER). Here, we obtain two distinct Ir single‐atom configurations on MoO\n                    3\n                    support by regulating the second‐shell coordination environment. Compared with the weakly interacting Ir─O─Mo structure, atomic pair sites formed through direct Ir─Mo coordination exhibit strong electronic coupling with the support, thereby enhancing atomic dispersion and structural stability. In situ experimental and theoretical studies reveal that the Ir─Mo pair sites trigger a new oxide‐mediated pathway, in which dynamic hydroxyl spillover from Mo to Ir site effectively facilitates *OOH formation. This process breaks the linear scaling relationship between *OH and *OOH adsorption, lowering the energy barrier of the rate‐limiting step and enabling superior OER kinetics. As a result, the Ir\n                    O+Mo\n                    /MoO\n                    3\n                    catalyst achieves outstanding stability for over 1500 h at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    in acidic electrolyte and sustains continuous operation for 300 h at 1.0 A cm\n                    −2\n                    in the proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer. This work provides novel insights into the coordination engineering of SACs and opens a promising avenue for overcoming scaling limitations in acidic OER catalysis.","aip":1},{"t":"环向旋转托卡马克等离子体中测地声模与环向流的一致动力学","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae72a3","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","dp":1,"as":"该研究探讨了托卡马克装置中测地声模（GAMs）与环向流之间的一致性动力学特征。GAMs是等离子体中重要的集体振荡模式，与带状流共同参与等离子体湍流的调节和能量输运过程。实验观测到的GAM频谱特征——如频率调制行为——与理论预测高度吻合，表明环向旋转对GAM动力学有显著影响。该工作加深了对磁约束聚变等离子体中湍流-流相互作用的物理理解，对优化聚变堆芯部等离子体性能具有参考价值。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"地声模与带状流","kp":["研究对象[托卡马克]: 测地声模与带状流","方法: 流体模型"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":3.0},"ot":"Consistent dynamics of geodesic acoustic modes and zonal flows in toroidally rotating tokamak plasmas","b":"The experimentally observed features of the spectra of the geodesic acoustic modes (GAMs) in tokamaks, such as GAM’s modulation, peak splitting, intermittency and other, have no satisfactory explanations within the framework of standard theory. To fill in this gap, the fluid model, which describes the consistent dynamics of the GAMs and low-frequency zonal flow (ZF), is developed. The linear approximation of the model exhibits two eigenmodes of vastly different frequencies, GAM and ZF, while the nonlinearity results in a much richer spectral pattern, which qualitatively corresponds to the experimental observations."},{"t":"病毒RNA聚合酶和核酸外切酶的连续催化步骤提出了一种克服内在核苷酸模拟的方法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605725123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Nucleotide analogues (NAs) have been successfully used for the treatment of various RNA virus infections by selectively targeting the viral RNA-dependent RNA polymerase (RdRp) for incorporation into the viral genome. However two major families of human-infecting RNA viruses,\n                    Coronaviridae\n                    (CoV) and\n                    Arenaviridae,\n                    encode exonuclease domains that may recognize and remove incorporated NAs, thus providing natural resistance against some of these drugs. Both polymerization and excision reactions are mechanistically centered on the nucleotide α-phosphate, enabling the potential for sequential inhibition of both RNA synthesis and repair. Here, we provide structural evidence of inversion of configuration at the phosphorus center during polymerization, demonstrating that the SARS-CoV-2 RdRp proceeds through an S\n                    N\n                    2 mechanism. A 2.39 Å resolution cryo-EM structure of a ternary replication complex bound to RNA and an α-thio–modified NTP shows that incorporation of the preferred\n                    S\n                    P\n                    isomer at the 3′ end of the RNA yields a phosphorothioate linkage in the\n                    R\n                    P\n                    configuration. This\n                    R\n                    P\n                    -phosphorothioate RNA product shows reduced cleavage by both the SARS-CoV-2 and three arenavirus RNA exonucleases, revealing a stereochemical preference opposite to that of structurally related DNA exonucleases. This observation contradicts the prevailing assumption that sulfur substitution at the metal-coordinating oxygen universally blocks catalysis. Instead, RNA exonuclease stereoselectivity appears to be shaped not only by metal–sulfur interactions but also by the geometry of nucleophile activation. These findings provide mechanistic insights into phosphoryl transfer in viral polymerases and exonucleases and highlight opportunities to counteract intrinsic nuclease-mediated resistance against antiviral nucleotide analogues."},{"t":"嵌入金属硫化物中的构象自适应冠醚可实现出色的锶捕获","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9159294?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Precise conformational control of flexible supramolecular moieties (e.g., crown ethers) in crystalline‐state adsorbents is essential for efficient host–guest recognition. Traditional strategies relying on covalent chemistry are often limited by either tedious synthesis or a sacrifice of conformational flexibility. Here, we introduce a simple non‐covalent anchoring strategy where 18‐crown‐6 (18Cr6) molecules are\n                    in‐situ\n                    embedded between the interlayer galleries of a perforated thiostannate framework (18Cr6‐SnS) in one‐pot synthesis. This architecture not only ensures ordered alignment of crown ethers but also preserves the intrinsic coordination freedom, thereby enabling exceptional Sr\n                    2+\n                    binding affinity. 18Cr6‐SnS exhibits a record‐high distribution coefficient (\n                    K\n                    d\n                    = 4.9 × 10\n                    6 \n                    mL/g) under neutral conditions and excellent selectivity in simulated acidic high‐level liquid waste, displaying high separation factors (\n                    K\n                    d\n                    Sr\n                    /\n                    K\n                    d\n                    M\n                    ) for Cs\n                    +\n                    (96), Eu\n                    3+\n                    (245), and Ni\n                    2+\n                    (621) in 1 M HNO\n                    3\n                    . Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that the superior Sr\n                    2+\n                    recognition arises from the conformational adaptability of intercalated crown ethers, coupled with adjustable interlayer spacing. This work establishes a cost‐effective and scalable route to develop advanced adsorbents by synergizing host materials with flexible supramolecular receptors for critical energy and environmental applications.","tp":"锶捕获材料","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"提出一种非共价锚定策略，将18-冠-6分子原位嵌入金属硫化物晶态吸附剂中，实现了冠醚构象的精确柔性控制，在保持构象灵活性的同时避免了繁琐的共价合成，实现了对锶离子的高效识别和捕获。"},{"t":"证实寒武纪大爆发期间存在苔藓虫动物","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01753-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Bryozoans are marine invertebrates that live in colonies and have long been considered absent from the Cambrian explosion — a rapid evolutionary event that began around 538 million years ago. Newly discovered fossils from the Cambrian period reveal that the bryozoan phylum had already diversified by this time. Fossils of two forms of bryozoans show evidence of soft tissue still preserved inside their mineralized skeletons."},{"t":"紧凑溶剂化结构实现亚分钟级钠离子存储：数据驱动视角","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73658?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠离子快充","kp":["[快充特性]: 亚分钟级钠离子充电","[方法]: 数据驱动电解质设计"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦钠离子电池极端快充(XFC)难题,提出通过构建紧凑的溶剂化结构来加速钠离子在电极界面的脱溶剂化与扩散过程,从而实现亚分钟级(不到60秒)的钠离子存储。研究采用数据驱动方法,从海量候选电解液配方中筛选并优化溶剂化构型,突破了传统快充中离子传导动力学迟缓的瓶颈。钠离子电池因钠资源储量丰富、成本低廉被视为锂电的有力补充,而极速充放电能力的提升将极大推动其在电网储能与短时高频充放电场景中的商业化部署。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Compact Solvation Enables Sub‐Minute Sodium‐Ion Storage: A Data‐Driven Perspective","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Extremely fast charging (XFC) of batteries holds significant importance in the era of intelligent technologies, yet the intricate role of electrolyte properties in determining XFC behavior remains obscure. Furthermore, conventional theories and in situ characterization techniques fails to elucidate electrochemical behaviors under sub‐minute‐level charging conditions. Herein, we report a data‐driven approach for analyzing the effect of each independent physical and solvation property on sub‐minute‐level sodium‐ion storage behavior. Causal graph analysis reveals that the size of the solvation clusters shows the strongest negative correlation with ultrafast Na\n                    +\n                    storage in graphite. The optimized compact solvation electrolyte demonstrates an astonishing extreme current density of 250 A g\n                    −1\n                    (corresponding to a power density of 46.78 kW kg\n                    −1\n                    graphite\n                    ) and an unprecedented cycle life of 100 000 cycles. Most notably, the graphite||Na\n                    4\n                    Fe\n                    3\n                    (PO\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    P\n                    2\n                    O\n                    7\n                    full batteries achieve stable sub‐minute‐level charging and discharging, exhibiting ultrahigh rate capabilities (up to 200 C, ∼3.4 s per charge) and ultra‐stable cycle performance (24 000 cycles at 50 C, ∼29 s per charge). This work provides a promising pathway for the development of XFC battery, pioneering an innovative assessment strategy for next‐generation electrolytes.","aip":1},{"t":"附带影响：中美紧张局势和第三国能源转型","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003605?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"认知不会自动影响感知：来自不同类别颜色的神经编码的证据","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538139123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The firmest evidence in favor of models that posit early high-level influences of cognition on perception comes from electroencephalography (EEG). Enhanced early, preattentive processing of light and dark blue feature changes compared to light and dark green changes was reported in Greek speakers, who have two basic terms for “blue” (\n                    ghalazio/ble\n                    ). In the present three-experiment study, we systematically reevaluate this evidence and test an alternative model that the early difference waves in the human EEG instead mainly reflect contrast adaptation phenomena. We use the same classical oddball paradigm presenting alternating standards and deviants that systematically differ in color and/or luminance and chromatic contrast. We then calculate the visual mismatch negativity (vMMN), a putative index of preattentive feature change processing and predictive coding derived from EEG data, by subtracting the activity elicited by standards from that elicited by task-irrelevant deviants. Our experiments demonstrate the following: 1) vMMN is driven by contrast adaptation, being observable only in the presence of contrast differences between the stimuli and not reliably observed for categorically different hues equated in contrast; 2) there is no reliable difference between green- and blue-related difference waves in speakers (Russian) with two basic blue color categories, the difference waves, again, being driven by contrast rather than their categorical content. Our findings are highly significant for the debate concerning the interface between perception and cognition, as the absence of early categorical effects speaks against models that predict Whorfian-type preattentive cognitive influences on perception."},{"t":"Co1/Ru单原子合金催化剂用于聚丙烯加氢裂解制长链液体产物","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73643?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"废塑料氢解催化剂","kp":["催化剂[聚丙烯氢解]: Co₁/Ru单原子合金","产物: 长链液体","[设计]: 破坏Ru-Ru集合体"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种基于Co1/Ru单原子合金的新型催化剂,旨在解决聚烯烃废塑料(以聚丙烯为代表)选择性加氢裂解转化为燃料与化学品的难题。其核心架构通过原子级分散的活性位点,打破传统金属催化剂C-C键断裂选择性差、易过度裂解生成低价值轻烃的局限,实现对聚丙烯长链的精准切断,高选择性地产出液态燃料馏分。该成果为废塑料化学回收与循环经济提供了可持续、高效的新路径,具有替代焚烧填埋的重要工程价值。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Co1/Ru Single‐Atom Alloy Catalyst for Sustainable Polypropylene Hydrogenolysis to Long‐Chain Liquid Products","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving selective polyolefin waste hydrogenolysis into fuels and chemicals requires architectures that disrupt Ru─Ru ensembles without compromising the intrinsic activity of the state‐of‐the‐art Ru catalyst. While metal modifiers can beneficially tune selectivity, they have been shown for high promoter‐metal contents, with associated penalties in structural definition and potential practicality. Here, we engineer cobalt speciation on Ru through impregnation to disclose how promotion spans the entire compositional space realizing a titania‐supported Co\n                    1\n                    /Ru single‐atom alloy catalyst (Co\n                    10\n                    Ru\n                    90\n                    , 3 mol% total metal content) that resolves these trade‐offs. Ex situ and operando analyses reveal that these bimetallic ensembles containing Ru─Co─Ru sites display a distinctively high barrier for over‐hydrogenolysis at late reaction stages while preserving the intrinsic activity of Ru. As a result, virgin polypropylene and post‐consumer waste were almost fully converted with a consistently high C\n                    11+\n                    yield of up to 60% (78% total liquids), compared to &lt;5% over the monometallic Ru counterpart. Process‐level simulations predict economically viable and environmentally sustainable operation enabled by the high single‐pass yields of long‐chain liquid products. These results reveal a wide compositional landscape for Ru promotion and recommend its second‐metal‐content single‐atom alloy limit as the most promising strategy for further catalyst design efforts."},{"t":"不确定性下工业能源系统生产网络与共享储能系统协同优化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007841?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能协同优","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"手性纳米粒子驱动干细胞的对映体特异性成骨分化并加速骨再生","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3822?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Precise control over stem cell differentiation is of crucial importance in regenerative medicine, such as stem cell–based bone repair. Chiral nanoparticles (NPs) exhibit enantiomer-dependent interactions with stem cells, providing a promising strategy for guiding cell behaviors. Here, we investigated the role of chiral NPs in modulating osteogenic differentiation of stem cells. L-CF-NPs, D-CF-NPs, and A-CF-NPs with controllable nanoscale chirality were synthesized to investigate the effect of enantioselectivity on stem cell fate. In vitro, L-CF-NPs resulted in the highest cellular uptake through clathrin-mediated, integrin-involved endocytosis. This led to the most pronounced up-regulation of osteogenic marker expression, mineralization (via MAPK/JNK/ERK), and angiogenic marker expression. In vivo, volumetric 3D-bioprinted scaffolds incorporating L-CF-NPs resulted in the fastest bone regeneration in a rat model of critical-size bone defects. This work establishes nanoscale chirality as a design parameter for biomaterials, offering a promising approach to regenerating bone and other tissues.","tp":"手性纳米材","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"手性纳米粒子展现出与干细胞的手性依赖性相互作用，L型、D型和消旋型CF纳米粒子的手性可调控干细胞的成骨分化方向，为再生医学中精确控制干细胞分化以促进骨修复提供了新策略。"},{"t":"中国探测器距离解开中微子质量之谜又近了一步","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01851-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Physicists hope that the JUNO facility can determine which type of neutrino has the highest mass. Physicists hope that the JUNO facility can determine which type of neutrino has the highest mass."},{"t":"CargoNetSim：基于混合代理的系统动力学框架，用于多式联运中的成本-能源-排放优化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008408?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"货运能效优","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":""},{"t":"构建用户驱动的气候适应产品","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10555-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Climate adaptation products have traditionally been developed using a supply-driven model reliant on available climate information, leading to usability gaps1,2,3,4. To better meet user needs, the climate services field has recognized a need to shift towards a demand-driven model emphasizing co-production, that is, user-driven, scientifically informed products created through shared knowledge practices1,2,3,4,5. However, co-production can be challenging, especially for researchers unfamiliar with the approach or for digital and software-based products with complex user needs2,5,6,7,8. User-centred design, from the human–computer interaction field, offers a process that could complement co-production approaches to product development, yet its potential remains underexplored2. Here we show how user-centred design can be integrated into, and strengthen, co-production approaches for building user-driven climate adaptation products. Through a systematic review of the co-production and user-centred design literature, we identify key processes, mechanisms and best practices for both approaches. Our findings offer practical guidance for researchers and propose an integrated approach for developing climate adaptation products that are useful, usable and used."},{"t":"构建巴西-比利时绿色航运走廊","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://ammoniaenergy.org/articles/building-a-brazil-belgium-green-shipping-corridor/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"Ammonia Energy Association","tg":"产业进展","tp":"绿色航运走廊","as":"该研究探讨了建设巴西-比利时绿色航运走廊的规划路径。绿色航运走廊通过在特定航线上部署替代燃料（如绿氨、绿色甲醇）加注设施和零排放船舶，推动国际海运脱碳。巴西拥有丰富的可再生能源资源可用于生产绿色燃料，比利时安特卫普港作为欧洲重要枢纽提供终端市场与基础设施。该走廊示范了跨大西洋绿色航运价值链的商业可行性与政策协同机制。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Building a Brazil – Belgium green shipping corridor","b":"Building a Brazil – Belgium green shipping corridor\nBuilding a Brazil – Belgium green shipping corridor\nskip to main content"},{"t":"气泡形成控制：通过过氧化氢酶涂覆的释氧氢化物制造厘米大小的组织状结构","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523593?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing thick three‐dimensional (3D) scaffolds remains challenging due to oxygen depletion and limited cell viability. Calcium peroxide (CaO\n                    2\n                    )‐catalase‐based oxygen‐releasing biomaterials are a common solution, but the uncontrolled release of oxygen bubbles often leading to structural damages is rarely discussed. Herein, we present a strategy to control the site of bubble formation in an oxygen‐releasing hydrogel, by applying a catalase nanocoating to its surface. CaO\n                    2\n                    undergoes hydrolytic decomposition with water, generating hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ), subsequently converts into O\n                    2\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O. Because H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    can induce cytotoxicity, direct catalase incorporation into hydrogel systems may accelerate O\n                    2\n                    bubble formation, leading in hydrogel collapse within 1 h of aqueous immersion. In comparison, catalase‐coated hydrogels exhibited improved structural stability, showing a 5.9‐fold smaller bubble size than hydrogels with mixed catalase after 24 h in ambient air. Under hypoxic conditions (O\n                    2\n                    &lt; 0.1%), centimeter‐scale constructs containing catalase‐coated hydrogels preserved up to 86% viable human fibroblast cells after 5 days of culture, compared with only 47% in non‐catalase coated hydrogels. Furthermore, the incorporation of catalase‐coated hydrogels promoted cell survival and neurite outgrowth of human neural stem cells cultured in neuronal differentiation conditions under severe hypoxia. These findings suggest the potential of the proposed strategy for oxygen‐supportive tissue engineering applications.","tp":"氧释放材料","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对三维厚支架中氧气耗竭导致细胞存活率低的问题，开发了一种基于过氧化钙-过氧化氢酶的释氧材料。通过控制气泡形成位点解决氧释放不受控导致结构损伤的问题，成功制备了厘米大小的组织状结构。"},{"t":"博通携手Apollo、Blackstone为Anthropic和OpenAI芯片交易提供融资","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/broadcom-help-finance-anthropic-openai-chip-deals-apollo-blackstone","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"the information","as":"博通（Broadcom）正联手阿波罗（Apollo）和黑石（Blackstone）等私募机构，为Anthropic和OpenAI的定制AI芯片交易提供融资支持。此举反映出AI算力需求激增下，头部大模型公司正加速布局专属芯片供应链，而芯片设计巨头与资本方的深度绑定将进一步重塑AI硬件生态格局。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"AI芯片融资","kp":["参与方[AI芯片融资]: Broadcom+Apollo+Blackstone","投资对象: Anthropic/OpenAI"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":7.5,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Broadcom to Help Finance Anthropic, OpenAI Chip Deals With Apollo, Blackstone","b":"Broadcom to Help Finance Anthropic, OpenAI Chip Deals With Apollo, Blackstone — The Information"},{"t":"通过骨架刚性功能化提升天然橡胶性能","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1326350?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然橡胶改性","kp":["[功能化策略]: 主链刚性功能化","[回收性]: 可控解构实现回收"],"as":"该研究通过骨架刚性功能化策略提升天然橡胶性能。传统天然橡胶依赖不可逆硫化交联来增强材料性能，但致密的交联网络限制了其可再加工性和功能拓展。研究提出在分子骨架层面引入刚性官能团进行功能化修饰，在保持橡胶力学强度的同时改善其加工性能与可持续性。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Boosting Natural Rubber Performance by Backbone Rigid Functionalization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Natural rubber relies on irreversible vulcanization to enhance material performance, but the resulting densely crosslinked networks resist breakdown, rendering conventional physical recycling methods ineffective. Developing backbone‐level functionalization strategies that simultaneously improve performance and enable controlled deconstruction remains a fundamental challenge. Here we develop a backbone rigid functionalization (BRF) strategy to install rigid, polar cyclobutane units directly into natural rubber via catalyst‐free [2+2] photocycloaddition. Incorporation of cyclobutane‐fused succinimide units substantially enhances tensile strength and toughness. Simply varying the reaction time enables continuous tuning of material behavior from viscoelastic polymers to elastomers and plastomers. When combined with vulcanization, the polar‐functionalized natural rubber yields high‐performance thermosets with a five‑fold improvement in stress, Young's modulus and toughness relative to conventional vulcanizates. Notably, the cyclobutane‐fused succinimide units undergo force‐triggered cycloreversion upon bulk ball‐milling, enabling vulcanized rubber with on‐demand hydrolytic degradability. This single‐step BRF process provides a practical pathway for accessing high‐performance rubbers with on‐demand degradability."},{"t":"组织观察：X 射线物理学如何使早期疾病过程可见","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://nachrichten.idw-online.de/2026/06/10/blick-ins-gewebe-wie-roentgenphysik-fruehe-krankheitsprozesse-sichtbar-macht","c":"不相关","a":"Informationsdienst Wissenschaft-idw","tg":"观点评论","b":"Blick ins Gewebe: Wie Röntgenphysik frühe Krankheitsprozesse sichtbar macht\nDie TU Berlin entwickelt im verlängerten Sonderforschungsbereich „Matrix in Vision“ hochauflösende Röntgenmethoden weiter\nDie Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (DFG) fördert den Sonderforschungsbereich 1340 „Matrix in Vision“ für weitere vier Jahre. An dem Verbund ist auch die Technische Universität Berlin beteiligt. Das TU-Teilprojekt „Röntgenmikroskopie und Spektroskopie zur Speziation der chemischen Umgebung von Metall basierten Bildgebungssonden“ unter der Leitung von Prof. Dr. Birgit Kanngießer, Leiterin des Fachgebiets Experimentalphysik mit dem Schwerpunkt Analytische Röntgenphysik, entwickelt neue Röntgenverfahren, mit denen krankhafte Veränderungen in menschlichen Zellen und Geweben besonders hochauflösend untersucht werden können.\nIm Mittelpunkt des Sonderforschungsbereichs steht die extrazelluläre Matrix. Sie ist das feine Netzwerk zwischen den Zellen, das Gewebe stabilisiert und wichtige Signale an Zellen weitergibt. Bei vielen entzündlichen Erkrankungen und bei Krebs verändert sich diese Matrix bereits in frühen Krankheitsstadien. Diese Veränderungen besser sichtbar zu machen, kann langfristig helfen, Krankheiten früher zu erkennen und Therapien gezielter zu unterstützen.\nMenschliches Gewebe und Zellen im Fokus\nDie TU Berlin bringt in den Verbund ihre Expertise in der analytischen Röntgenphysik ein. Nachdem in den ersten Förderphasen vor allem Tier- und Zellmodelle untersucht wurden, rückt nun die Analyse menschlicher Gewebe und Zellen stärker in den Fokus. Dafür werden unter anderem die Probenvorbereitung und die Bildgebung weiterentwickelt.\nEin Schwerpunkt liegt auf der Kombination verschiedener Mikroskopieverfahren. Die Forschenden verbinden Röntgenmikroskopie mit Fluoreszenzmikroskopie, um Strukturen der extrazellulären Matrix genauer zuzuordnen und bis in den Nanometerbereich aufzulösen. Ein Nanometer entspricht einem Millionstel Millimeter. Untersuchungen an Synchrotronanlagen, also besonders leistungsstarken Röntgenquellen, werden dafür auch mit einem mobilen hochauflösenden Nanoskop durchgeführt und mit Untersuchungen des Labor-Röntgenmikroskops kombiniert.\nDreidimensionale Einblicke in Zellen und ihre Umgebung\nZugleich arbeitet das Team daran, die Röntgenmikroskopie im weichen Röntgenbereich auch im Labor weiterzuentwickeln. Sie soll künftig dreidimensionale Einblicke in Zellen und ihre Umgebung ermöglichen, ohne dass für jede Untersuchung Großforschungsanlagen wie Synchrotrons genutzt werden müssen. Ergänzend werden Verfahren der automatisierten Datenverarbeitung und des maschinellen Lernens eingesetzt. Sie sollen helfen, große Bilddatensätze auszuwerten, Zellbestandteile besser zu erkennen und Veränderungen der extrazellulären Matrix präziser zu erfassen.\nLangfristig soll eine Datenbank mit aufeinander abgestimmten Bilddaten entstehen. Sie führt Informationen aus verschiedenen Messmethoden zusammen und soll dazu beitragen, krankhafte Veränderungen im Gewebe besser zu verstehen.\nMatrix in Vision\nDer SFB 1340 „Matrix in Vision“ wurde zum 1. Juli 2018 an der Charité – Universitätsmedizin Berlin eingerichtet. Sprecher des Verbunds ist Prof. Dr. med. Dipl.-Phys. Matthias Taupitz. Beteiligt sind neben der Charité unter anderem die Freie Universität Berlin, die Technische Universität Berlin, das Max-Planck-Institut für Kolloid- und Grenzflächenforschung, die Bundesanstalt für Materialforschung und -prüfung, die Physikalisch-Technische Bundesanstalt sowie die Technische Universität München mit dem Klinikum rechts der Isar.\nÄhnliche Pressemitteilungen im idw"},{"t":"细菌细胞外囊泡促进膜修复和对多粘菌素 B 的耐受性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adx6378?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Bacterial extracellular vesicles (EVs) are nanosized lipid structures released under stress, yet their interactions with antibiotics remain poorly understood. We tracked real-time interactions between\n                    Escherichia coli\n                    , EVs, and fluorescent polymyxin B (Pmb) using single-cell imaging and cytometric approaches. EVs rapidly sequester Pmb, facilitating its removal from bacterial envelopes, and act as plugs by adhering to or fusing with damaged sites. Pmb triggers early Cpx/σE- and Rcs-dependent stress responses, linked to a ∼25% reduction in cell surface area, a ∼50-fold increase in vesiculation, and remodeling of membrane properties. After an adaptive lag phase, sustained EV release supports detoxification and envelope repair, enabling growth recovery and transient tolerance to Pmb. Together, these findings reveal previously unrecognized functions of EVs in membrane repair and tolerance to membrane-active antibiotics."},{"t":"比亚迪威胁就五角大楼军事名单起诉特朗普政府","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/10/byd-threatens-sue-trump-administration-pentagon-military-list/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"政策监管","b":"Fred Lambert\n| Jun 10 2026 - 6:52 am PT\nBYD is threatening to sue the US government after the Pentagon added the world’s largest EV maker to its list of “Chinese military companies” this week.\nStella Li, BYD’s executive vice-president, said the company will use every legal “weapon” at its disposal to fight the designation, which she called a false claim aimed at hobbling BYD because of its international success.\nOn Monday, the Department of Defense published an updated version of its Section 1260H list of “entities identified as Chinese military companies” — and BYD is now on it, alongside Alibaba, Baidu, NIO, robotics maker Unitree, and lidar producer RoboSense.\nThe list now covers 188 Chinese entities, up from roughly 130 last year.\nIn the document, the Pentagon claims BYD is “directly and indirectly” affiliated with SASAC, the institution that manages Chinese state-owned companies, and with China’s Ministry of Industry and Information Technology. It describes the automaker as a “military-civil fusion contributor to the Chinese defence industrial base.”\nThe designation blocks BYD from securing US government contracts, with the ban on direct Defense Department contracts taking effect later this month and a separate prohibition on acquiring goods or services through intermediaries kicking in by June 2027. It doesn’t automatically trigger sanctions, but the Pentagon says it “reserves the right to take additional actions on these entities.”\nThe Pentagon has not provided direct evidence for its claims. US officials argue that the line between private and state-owned companies in China is often blurred, and they point to Beijing’s official “civil-military fusion” policies, which by law compel Chinese companies to comply with government and military demands.\nIf this sounds familiar, it’s because the Pentagon did the same thing to CATL, the world’s largest EV battery maker,\nback in January 2025\n. CATL also denied the claims and is still on the list.\nLi didn’t hold back in comments to The Telegraph. She framed the designation as an attack on BYD’s success rather than a security finding:\nBecause you are too strong, somebody challenges you – they cannot challenge your products so they will challenge this kind of perception. But we will use our legal weapons to protect us. Everybody should know in the world: BYD is not a company that can be pushed around, [where] you can give some false claim.\nAsked directly whether BYD intends to sue the US government, Li said the company will first try to talk “very openly, transparently,” but added: “if everything’s getting worse, we have to use our legal protection.”\nThe timing is notable. BYD\nofficially overtook Tesla as the world’s largest all-electric vehicle maker in 2025\n, selling 2,254,714 BEVs against Tesla’s 1,636,129 deliveries — a gap of over 600,000 vehicles.\nThe company’s international growth has been just as dramatic. BYD is now\nthe best-selling EV brand in several key overseas markets\n, including the UK, Australia, and Brazil. In Britain, BYD has sold 31,553 cars so far in 2026 — more than double last year’s pace — taking a 3.4% market share through five months, up from 1.7% over the same period in 2025, according to the SMMT. That puts it ahead of Mini, Renault, Volvo, and Land Rover.\nThe practical impact of this designation on BYD is close to zero. BYD doesn’t sell passenger cars in the US, tariffs already took care of that, and it certainly wasn’t counting on Pentagon contracts. Its US footprint is essentially an electric bus plant in Lancaster, California, which has been operating for over a decade with American union labor.\nThat’s why Li’s response is more about reputation than business. The 1260H list signals to American partners, suppliers, and investors that a company is a security threat, and it often paves the way for harsher measures later. CATL learned that lesson, and now BYD is on the same track.\nThe pattern here is hard to ignore. The US can’t compete with BYD on product, no American automaker sells an EV anywhere near BYD’s price-to-capability ratio, so the response has been tariffs first, and now a military designation delivered without published evidence. Maybe the Pentagon has solid intelligence behind the listing, but “trust us” is a tough sell when the same designation conveniently lands on the company that just dethroned Tesla globally.\nIt’s also worth remembering that the line between automakers and the military isn’t exactly bright in the US either. The Defense Production Act lets Washington compel American companies to prioritize defense orders — GM was forced to build ventilators under it in 2020 — and FISA orders compel US tech companies to cooperate with intelligence agencies. GM even has an entire defense division, GM Defense, which builds the Army’s Infantry Squad Vehicle on the Chevy Colorado platform. By the Pentagon’s own logic, that would make GM a “military-civil fusion contributor” to the American defense industrial base. There are real differences between the two systems — judicial oversight and transparency, mainly — but civilian companies serving the military is hardly a uniquely Chinese arrangement.\nIf you’re watching electricity and fuel costs climb amid all this trade turmoil, powering your home and EV with solar is one of the smartest ways to insulate yourself. With electricity rates climbing nearly 10% last year, home solar protects you against future rate increases. And with lease and PPA options, you can go solar with zero upfront cost and start saving immediately. If you want to find the best deal, check out\n. It’s a free service with hundreds of pre-vetted installers competing for your business, so you save 20 to 30% compared to going it alone. No sales calls until you pick an installer.\nGet your free quotes here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nFred is the Editor in Chief and Main Writer at Electrek.\nThrough Zalkon.com, you can check out Fred’s portfolio and get monthly green stock investment ideas.\nGet an edge on MMA with the best stats\nEnergySage helps you get the best price possible on a home solar installation for free and without hassel.","tp":"比亚迪诉讼","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"as":"美国五角大楼将比亚迪列入'中国军事企业'名单后，比亚迪执行副总裁Stella Li表示将动用一切法律手段反击该认定，称其为旨在阻碍比亚迪国际发展的虚假指控。此举加剧了中美在电动汽车领域的摩擦。"},{"t":"比亚迪销量超过福特，现在它认为自己可以赶上丰田成为全球第一汽车制造商","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/10/byd-outsold-ford-thinks-it-can-catch-toyota-for-no-1/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","b":"Peter Johnson\n| Jun 10 2026 - 7:27 am PT\nis already the world’s largest EV maker, but the company’s CEO is confident it will become the world’s leading global automaker within the next five years.\nAfter it stopped making cars powered solely by internal combustion engines (ICE) in 2022 to focus on battery electric (EV) and plug-in hybrid (PHEV) vehicles, BYD’s big bet has paid off so far.\nWith over 4.6 million new energy vehicles (NEVs) sold last year, which includes EVs and PHEVs,\nBYD surpassed Ford\nfor the first time, ranking as the sixth largest global automaker.\nAccording to BYD’s CEO, Wang Chuanfu, the Chinese EV giant is just getting started with new battery and charging tech set to drive growth over the next few years.\nWhile addressing shareholders at the company’s annual meeting on Tuesday, Wang said that “BYD will truly become the No. 1 automaker globally in terms of ​scale in five years.” BYD confirmed Wang’s comments to\n, but didn’t offer any additional context.\nCan it be done? To win the global auto crown, it will need to overtake Toyota, which sold 11.3 million vehicles, or twice as many as BYD in 2025.\nIt is possible. BYD’s overseas sales have surged in recent months, reaching\nover 160,000 in May\nfor the first time, as it continues to steal market share from Toyota, Volkswagen, and other global OEMs in key regions like Europe, Southeast Asia, Australia, Mexico, and Brazil.\nIn several overseas markets, including Australia, Brazil, and the UK, BYD has become the best-selling EV brand, surpassing Tesla and Kia.\nAfter launching its breakthrough Blade Battery 2.0 and Flash Charging system in March, BYD has seen an uptick in demand with orders for vehicles equipped with the new tech.\nWang said last month that demand has exceeded the company’s battery production capacity, with orders for some new models reaching over 100,000.\nits first Flash Charging stations\nin Europe and the UK this week, kicking off its global rollout. By the end of 2026, BYD aims to install 300 Flash Chargers across the UK and 3,000 across Europe.\nWith the capacity to deliver up to 1,500 kW of charging power, BYD’s Flash Charging stations can recharge a compatible vehicle’s battery from 10% to 70% in just 5 minutes. For a full recharge (10% to 97%), it takes only 9 minutes.\nWhile global OEMs, including Ford and Toyota, continue to delay or cancel major EV projects, BYD is capitalizing on the industry’s shift to electrification.\nAside from the windows and doors, BYD already builds nearly everything in-house, including batteries, electric motors, drivetrains, electronic control systems, infotainment systems, and even the software that powers them.\nJust last month, it introduced\nChina’s first in-house 4nm smart driving chip\n. BYD said the new chip enables “the highest level of vehicle intelligence,” with L3 and L4 autonomous driving capabilities.\nMeanwhile, Toyota, Ford, and several other global automakers are turning to BYD for batteries or other EV components to keep pace.\nWill BYD overtake Toyota and Volkswagen to become the world’s largest automaker within the next five years? I wouldn’t rule it out. Let us know your thoughts in the comments below.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nPeter Johnson is covering the auto industry’s step-by-step transformation to electric vehicles. He is an experienced investor, financial writer, and EV enthusiast. His enthusiasm for electric vehicles, primarily Tesla, is a significant reason he pursued a career in investments. If he isn’t telling you about his latest 10K findings, you can find him enjoying the outdoors or exercising","tp":"比亚迪销量","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"as":"比亚迪去年售出超过460万辆新能源汽车，已超越福特，公司CEO信心预测五年内将成为全球第一汽车制造商。自2022年停止纯燃油车生产、专注电动和插混车型以来，其战略已取得显著成效。"},{"t":"作者更正：亚砜胺与烯烃的[2+2]光环加成反应合成β-磺内酰胺衍生物","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02198-3","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Nature Chemistry","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光环加成反应","sc":0.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":1.0,"r":1.0,"d":0.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Author Correction: [2+2] Photocycloaddition reactions of sulfinylamines with alkenes to access β-sultam derivatives"},{"t":"人工智能揭示隐藏的全球移民流动","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01588-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Training a neural network to collate data from several sources provides a high-resolution view of how people are moving around the world. Training a neural network to collate data from several sources provides a high-resolution view of how people are moving around the world."},{"t":"埃博拉医院纵火袭击是对地区发展的呼声","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01846-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Letter to the Editor"},{"t":"芳香环翻转揭示了晶体和复合物中蛋白质动力学的重塑","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41557-026-02155-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Chemistry","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Protein conformational energy landscapes are shaped not only by intramolecular interactions but also by their environment. In protein crystals and protein–protein complexes, intermolecular contacts alter this energy landscape, but the exact nature of this alteration is difficult to decipher. Understanding how the crystal lattice affects protein dynamics is crucial for crystallography-based studies of motion, yet its influence on collective motions remains unclear. Aromatic ring flips in the hydrophobic core represent sensitive probes of such dynamics. Here, we compare the kinetics of aromatic ring flips in the protein GB1 in crystals, in complex with its binding partner IgG, and in solution, combining advanced isotope labelling with quantitative NMR methods. We show that rings in the core flip nearly a thousand times less frequently in crystals than in solution. Enhanced-sampling molecular dynamics simulations, based on a crystal structure of a GB1 variant reported in this work, reproduce these elevated barriers and reveal how the crystal restrains motions.The alternative text for this image may have been generated using AI."},{"t":"Anthropic新模型瞄准重度用户但切断竞争对手AI接入","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/ai-agenda/anthropics-new-model-targets-power-users-cuts-ai-rivals","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","tg":"产业进展","tp":"Claude新模型","as":"Anthropic推出面向高级用户的新模型，旨在巩固其在AI领域对重度使用者的吸引力，但同时采取了限制竞争对手接入的策略，引发行业关注。此举可能加剧AI市场竞争格局的分化，限制生态互操作性，促使开发者在平台选择上重新权衡。The Information报道引发了对封闭策略是否会抑制创新和加剧平台垄断的广泛讨论。","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":8.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Anthropic’s New Model Targets Power Users But Cuts Off AI Rivals","b":"Anthropic’s New Model Targets Power Users But Cuts Off AI Rivals — The Information"},{"t":"古代地松鼠以“更新世僵尸”的尸体为食","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01840-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Fossilized poo harbours remains from mammoths, bison and big cats, including some of the oldest DNA ever reconstructed. Fossilized poo harbours remains from mammoths, bison and big cats, including some of the oldest DNA ever reconstructed."},{"t":"强子对撞机重夸克最终态的解析软函数","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/2ksm-243x","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Ze Long Liu and Pier Francesco MonniWe present the first computation of the complete two-loop, fully differential soft function describing the production of a heavy-quark pair in association with a color-singlet system at hadron colliders. This result constitutes one of the most complex soft functions known to date and it is obtained …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231902] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026"},{"t":"北极冰山交通的扩大重塑了底栖生物多样性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10630-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Arctic is undergoing rapid warming, resulting in retreating sea ice and glaciers1, yet how cryospheric changes propagate into the deep ocean remains poorly understood2. Here we identify a climate-driven mechanism linking accelerating glacier disintegration to an increase in deep-sea hard-bottom habitats far beyond calving fronts. Seafloor observations in Fram Strait show a localized increase in the density and patchiness of dropstones delivered by debris-laden icebergs. At the same time, four decades of shipboard records show that the occurrence of icebergs increased abruptly in the early 2000s. Backtracking links these icebergs to the main outlet glaciers in northeast Greenland and the Russian High Arctic. In northeast Greenland, the timing of glacier destabilization coincides with this rise, whereas sparse satellite coverage in the Russian sector limits temporal attribution despite indications of enhanced glacier activity. A model sensitivity study shows that, apart from intensified calving, a more dynamic sea ice cover enhances downstream transport of glacial ice. Along these pathways, increased iceberg activity could reshape deep-sea habitats through enhanced melt and associated lithogenic input, and elevate navigational hazards as maritime traffic expands in the Arctic. Although modest compared with the iceberg discharges of Pleistocene Heinrich events, this mechanism provides a modern analogue of long-range cryospheric influence on the seafloor in a warming climate."},{"t":"全球轮流森林的自适应自组织","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606552123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Does swidden agriculture, a prototypical coupled human and natural system, exhibit a process of adaptive self-organization in which cultural practices balance environmental constraints through adaptive feedback? Here, we investigate whether quantitative signatures of adaptive self-organization can be detected in a dataset consisting of 18,000+ contiguous swidden patches in 18 remote sensing images of swidden mosaics from tropical and subtropical regions globally. We find that the distributions of patch sizes in 16 of 18 swidden areas exhibit power law patterns with scaling exponents ≈1, and correlation distances of ≈548 m. To account for these patterns, we develop a plausible ethnographically informed agent-based model of labor exchange, land use, and swidden site selection in which both sustainable and unsustainable resource uses can emerge out of interactions among individuals or households. By analyzing the model, we identify spatial synchronization of swidden sites as the driver of power law formation, while social norms of swidden labor can guide the system to an intermediate level of landscape disturbance. Both mechanisms are required to maintain harvests and ecosystem productivity at high levels. Our model advances theoretical understanding of the socioecological dynamics of swidden agriculture, and supports the hypothesis that adaptive self-organization may be a general characteristic of coupled human and natural systems.","tp":"轮垦自适应","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究通过对全球热带和亚热带地区18张遥感图像中超过18000个连续轮垦斑块的分析，发现了轮垦农业这一典型人地耦合系统展现出自适应自组织的定量特征，文化实践通过适应性反馈与环境约束之间达到平衡。"},{"t":"自适应 Spo11 RNA 编辑门优化减数分裂 I 速度和有丝分裂增殖，同时保留子囊孢子形成","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adu7607?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Spo11-mediated DNA double-strand breaks (DSBs) are essential for meiotic recombination, yet how Spo11 activity is temporally regulated during mitosis and fungal development remains unclear. In the fungal plant pathogen\n                    Fusarium graminearum\n                    , we found that FgSpo11 has a DSB-independent role delaying meiosis I and a DSB-dependent role critical for postmeiotic mitoses during ascosporogenesis. Loss of FgSpo11 accelerates meiosis I and causes excessive postmeiotic divisions, ultimately causing aborted ascospores. A premature stop codon (TAG) is corrected to tryptophan (TGG) by adenosine-to-inosine RNA editing exclusively during sexual reproduction, enabling full-length protein synthesis. A genomically “corrected” allele bypassing this editing preserves ascospore formation but causes meiotic and vegetative mitotic defects. Beyond its on-switch function, this editing acts as a tunable rheostat fine-tuning FgSpo11 dosage during meiosis. Evolutionary analyses reveal recurrent gain and loss of this editing, highlighting adaptive modulation of Spo11 deployment. This study uncovers a single-site RNA editing gate controlling a key meiotic regulator and illustrates transcriptome plasticity in reconciling life cycle demands in eukaryotic pathogens.","tp":"真菌减分裂","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"在小麦赤霉病菌中发现FgSpo11具有不依赖DSB的延缓减数分裂I功能和依赖DSB的促进减数后有丝分裂功能。Spo11的RNA编辑门可自适应调节减数分裂I速度和有丝分裂增殖，同时保留子囊孢子形成能力。"},{"t":"基于Bang-Bang-Bang协议实现快速相干态传输的可调控路径","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/g22y-z8h3","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子态传输","kp":["[传输协议]: Bang-Bang-Bang三段式","[应用]: 量子态快速相干传输"],"as":"该研究提出一种基于Bang-Bang-Bang（三段式开关）协议的快速相干态传输新方案。研究团队利用分段最优控制理论，在量子系统中实现高效、鲁棒的态传输，显著缩短操作时间的同时保持相干性。该方法可应用于量子计算与量子信息处理中的快速量子门操作，为可扩展量子架构提供工程化路径。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Adaptable Route to Fast Coherent State Transport via Bang-Bang-Bang Protocols","b":"Author(s): Ya-Tang Yu, Hsin-Lien Lee, Shao-Hung Chung, Ting Hsu, Guin-Dar Lin, Ying-Cheng Chen, and H. H. JenFast coherent state transport is essential to quantum computation and quantum information processing. While an adiabatic transport of atomic qubits guarantees a high fidelity of the state preparation, it requires a long timescale that defies efficient quantum operations. Here, we propose an adaptabl…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230802] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"激活自组装多层膜的π电子共轭网络实现21.1%效率有机太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4154577?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池","kp":["转换效率[有机太阳能电池]: 21.1%","材料[自组装多层膜]: 二苯并噻吩咔唑π骨架"],"as":"自组装单分子膜（SAM）因超薄特性导致电导率不足，限制了其在光电器件中的应用。该研究通过构建自组装多层膜并激活π电子共轭网络，大幅提升载流子传输能力，实现21.1%（疑为光电转换效率）的突破性表现。该策略为分子级电子器件与高效柔性太阳能电池的工程化提供了新思路。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Activating π‐Electron Conjugated Networks of Self‐Assembled Multilayers for 21.1% Efficiency Organic Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Self‐assembled monolayers suffer from the insufficient electrical conductivity, stemming from their ultrathin nature and disordered molecular orientation. Here we report a π‐skeleton unit of 3,6‐dibenzothiophen‐9\n                    H\n                    ‐carbazol to building a self‐assembled multilayer (SAMUL) that exhibits superior carrier transport and outstanding resistance to external stimuli. The π‐expanded skeleton effectively enhanced the molecular crystallinity and face‐on orientation, which successfully activated a large π‐electron conjugated network within SAMULs. This conjugated network structure greatly broadens the delocalization region of free radicals, which not only significantly enhances the electrical conductance and hole‐transporting capability, but also reinforces the photochemical stability. Consequently, a record‐high efficiency of 21.13% (certified as 20.77%) with a notable fill factor of 83.48% was achieved for binary organic solar cells. This work provides a new inspiration for the molecular skeleton design in organic electronics."},{"t":"人工智能技术必须服务于人类认知发展，而不是相反","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01848-3","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Letter to the Editor","tp":"AI认知观","sc":1.2,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":1.0,"r":2.0,"d":0.0,"t":3.0},"as":"评论指出，人工智能技术的发展方向必须是为人类的认知发展服务，而非本末倒置。"},{"t":"发现了一个巨大的鲸鱼墓地","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01581-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"In the Indian Ocean, a deep-sea area roughly 1,200 kilometres long and 7 kilometres deep was found to harbour an ecological landmark site of whale remains. In the Indian Ocean, a deep-sea area roughly 1,200 kilometres long and 7 kilometres deep was found to harbour an ecological landmark site of whale remains."},{"t":"单细胞亲戚将聚合多细胞性与动物起源联系起来","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10748-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"How animals evolved complex multicellularity from their unicellular ancestors remains unanswered. Unicellular relatives of animals exhibit simple multicellularity through clonal division, formation of multinucleate coenocytes, or aggregation. 1 Therefore, animal multicellularity may have evolved from one (or a combination) of these behaviours. Aggregation has classically been dismissed as a means to complex multicellularity. 2 However, aggregation occurs in many extant animal cells and has also been recently described in three close unicellular relatives of animals (the choanoflagellates Salpingoeca rosetta and Choanoeca flexa, and the filasterean Capsaspora owczarzaki). 3-5 It is unclear whether aggregation in these species is derived or ancestral, and its relevance for animal origins remains unknown. To fill this gap, we investigated whether an additional close unicellular relative of animals can undergo aggregation. We discovered that the marine free-living bacterivorous filasterean Ministeria vibrans 6 forms homogeneous aggregates with reproducible kinetics that have long-term stability, and that improved feeding and mating may be evolutionary drivers of this aggregation. Notably, we found that homologs of many animal multicellularity genes involved in cell adhesion, signalling, and transcriptional regulation were deployed during the aggregation process, indicating that they may have been used for aggregation in the unicellular ancestors of animals before being co-opted into animal multicellular development. Thus, our results imply that aggregative multicellularity was key to the development of the multicellular animal genetic toolkit."},{"t":"新石器时代项链珠的宝库","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01810-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Archaeological findings from Italy, and machines with a life of their own, in our weekly dip into Nature’s archive. Snippets from Nature’s past."},{"t":"丘脑-脑干吸引子网络驱动历史偏见决策","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10623-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Natural environments often change gradually, making it adaptive to bias decisions on the basis of the recent past — a phenomenon known as serial dependence1,2,3. Large-scale recordings during behaviour have identified that serial dependence is a common motif for decision-making, with neural representations of past experiences found throughout the brain4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11. However, it remains unclear whether this bias arises from dedicated neural circuits with history-specific computations. Using whole-brain, cellular-resolution imaging in zebrafish performing memory-guided evasive manoeuvres12,13,14, we identified a hierarchical circuit that maintains past information and biases future choices. Discrete attractors in the dorsal thalamus encoded the position of the most recent obstacle, maintaining a categorical memory via persistent activity lasting 10–20 s. Optogenetic manipulation of the dorsal thalamus abolished or imposed serial bias. A downstream hindbrain integrator received input from the thalamus and combined it with current sensory cues to produce graded responses reflecting multi-trial history. Leveraging a comprehensive brain atlas in zebrafish15, we constructed a whole-brain computational model that recapitulated behaviour and also predicted a key role for heterogeneous inhibitory subtypes in enabling flexible state transitions. This attractor–integrator architecture reveals a hierarchical and modular computation that unifies robust memory retention with flexible sensory integration, providing a general principle for history-biased decisions."},{"t":"面向电力系统韧性的储能技术综述：功能、指标与应用","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007087?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"储能电力韧性","dp":1,"as":"","sc":2.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":2.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"A review of energy storage for power system resilience: Functions, metrics, and applications"},{"t":"弥漫性中线神经胶质瘤的预后人脑网络","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10631-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Diffuse midline gliomas (DMGs) are near-universally lethal tumours of the childhood central nervous system1,2. In animal models, DMGs form brain-wide integrated networks through neuron-to-glioma synapses3,4,5,6 and glioma-to-glioma gap junctional coupling3. This extensive connectivity robustly promotes the growth and invasion of DMG3,4,5,6,7,8,9 and other glial malignancies10,11,12 through paracrine mechanisms and direct neuron-to-glioma synapses. However, the organization and clinical implications of these connections in the living human brain remain to be elucidated. Here, we develop tumour network mapping to compute the brain-wide connectivity profile of DMG, defining a conserved brain network across pontine and thalamic DMG associated with patient short-term survival (DMG network). Tumour functional connectivity with the DMG network was independently predictive of patient overall survival across two external validation cohorts. Tumour growth mapped to DMG network-specific trajectories and peak in-network neurometabolic changes across development spatiotemporally aligned with the peak age incidence of DMG. Analyses of single-nucleus RNA sequencing data confirmed diverse synaptic gene enrichment in high-connectivity DMG. Strikingly, incidental surgical resection of high-connectivity thalamic DMG tissue conferred a significant survival advantage. Collectively, these data define a conserved and prognostically important brain network in children with DMG, consistent with the hypothesis that DMGs exploit otherwise healthy brain circuits to promote tumour growth."},{"t":"聚合酶核酶通过焦磷酸介导的 RNA 修复提高复制保真度","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606892123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Prior to the emergence of the contemporary biosphere, the first replicating systems are thought to have progressed through an RNA-based stage. Such an evolving world would likely have transferred heritable information during replication using RNA polymerase ribozymes. Though substantial effort has been put forth toward evolving RNA polymerases, many variants suffer from premature termination and low fidelity, resulting in low yields of full-length or active sequences. Replication of longer sequences requires a sufficiently high fidelity to lend an evolutionary advantage to an evolvable system. Here, we demonstrate ribozyme-mediated repair of mismatched and damaged RNA sequences. Under conditions of saturating pyrophosphate concentrations, we show that a polymerase ribozyme can repair RNA sequences terminated in a mismatch to generate a triphosphorylated nucleoside, such as adenosine triphosphate, which we detect directly. Similarly, the ribozyme can remove a nucleotide with a nonextendable 2′-3′ cyclic phosphate or a nonextendable mismatch. This repair step increases the overall fidelity of RNA synthesis and allows polymerization along an extended template. The increased copying fidelity advances the long-standing goal of developing a self-replicating polymerase ribozyme.","tp":"RNA复制","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"在RNA世界假说中，RNA聚合酶核酶被认为是早期遗传信息传递的关键。研究揭示聚合酶核酶可通过焦磷酸介导的RNA修复机制提高复制保真度，解决了过早终止和低保真度问题，为长序列RNA的可靠复制提供了新途径。"},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池建模新方法及氢燃料电池汽车整车级验证","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008421?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池建模","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A novel approach to modeling of polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cells with vehicle-level validation in a hydrogen elec"},{"t":"锂金属电池电解质理性设计中的溶剂极化动力学描述符","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01727D","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池电解液","kp":["[描述符]: 溶剂极化动力学描述符","[设计视角]: Li⁺迁移中极化重构"],"as":"电解液的溶剂化结构设计对电池性能至关重要，但既往研究缺乏有效描述溶剂极化行为的量化指标。本研究提出一种基于动力学理论的溶剂极化描述符，可用于理性筛选和设计电解液溶剂体系，加速高性能电池电解质的开发进程。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A kinetic descriptor of solvent polarization for rational electrolyte design in lithium–metal batteries","b":"The construction of solvation structures is crucial for the rational design of electrolytes. However, previous efforts to regulate solvation structures have mainly focused on the static coordination environment around Li+, such as the anion coordination number or ligand identity, while the reconstruction and relaxation processes of solvation structures driven by polarization during Li+ migration remain largely unexplored, mainly due to the difficulty of direct observation. In this work, we capture the dynamic evolution of the total dipole moment of the system and propose an integral dielectric relaxation time descriptor (τi) to quantify the polarization response rate of coordinating solvents. This method simultaneously predicts bulk ion transport and interfacial characteristics of the electrolyte and reflects the combined effects of solvent size, viscosity, and intermolecular interactions. Based on this framework, we apply the τi descriptor to a deep eutectic electrolyte system, screen 95 additives, and design an optimized formulation that significantly enhances electrochemical performance, enabling an ultrahigh limiting current density of 6 mA cm−2 and stable cycling of high-voltage cathodes from −15 to 50 °C. These results establish τi as a kinetically grounded descriptor for the efficient screening and rational design of electrolytes for next-generation lithium–metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"面向现代电气化非凸能源系统优化的混合神经模糊深度强化学习框架","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008251?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源系统优化","dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"A hybrid neuro-fuzzy deep reinforcement learning framework for non-convex energy system optimization in modern electrifi"},{"t":"蚕的味觉受体 - Akt 轴将营养感应与造血作用结合起来","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535199123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Hematopoiesis is tightly linked to an organism’s metabolic state, yet the molecular sensors that convert nutrient availability into hematopoietic output remain poorly understood. Here, we identify a fructose-sensitive gustatory receptor, BmGr9, as a cell-intrinsic nutrient sensor that links circulating sugar levels to blood cell proliferation in the silkworm\n                    Bombyx mori\n                    . We show that fructose, whose concentration rises sharply after feeding, stimulates hematopoietic organ (HPO) proliferation through BmGr9-dependent Ca\n                    2+\n                    influx and activation of the Akt–ornithine decarboxylase/polyamine signaling pathway. CRISPR/Cas9-mediated knockout of BmGr9 reduces hemocyte production and impairs fructose-induced Akt phosphorylation and polyamine synthesis. We further demonstrate that the fat body polyol pathway produces fructose de novo, which then acts as an interorgan metabolic signal that promotes hematopoiesis and shapes gene expression in the wing-disc/hematopoietic complex. Together, these findings define a nutrient–receptor–signaling axis that mechanistically links dietary and endogenous fructose to hematopoietic proliferation. By revealing an unexpected systemic role for a gustatory receptor, our work expands the conceptual framework of nutrient sensing and suggests conserved principles by which metabolic state governs blood cell development across animals.","tp":"蚕味觉造血","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"在家蚕中鉴定出一个果糖敏感味觉受体BmGr9，作为连接循环糖水平与血细胞增殖的细胞内在营养传感器。果糖在进食后浓度急剧上升，通过BmGr9-Akt信号轴刺激造血，揭示了营养感应与造血之间的分子联系。"},{"t":"一种真菌天然产物，通过破坏纤维素合酶复合物来抑制植物纤维素生物合成","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602575123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cellulose, a primary component of plant cell walls, is synthesized by cellulose synthase complexes (CSCs) at the plasma membrane. Targeting this process with cellulose biosynthesis inhibitors (CBIs) has significantly advanced our understanding of plant cell wall formation and provided valuable compounds for herbicide development. Here, we identified a fungal natural product, 8-methyldichlorodiaporthin (MDD), as a broad-spectrum plant CBI. Structure–activity relationship analyses demonstrate that methylation modifications on the isocoumarin ring and chlorination of the side chain are crucial for MDD-induced growth inhibition. A chemical forward genetic screen in\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    revealed two semidominant CESA1 mutations, causing A903T and H1024Y substitutions, that confer insensitivity to MDD. Both mutations locate to transmembrane domains of CESA1, and we show that MDD depletes CSCs from the plasma membrane and reduces cellulose content. Further genetic analyses indicate that the\n                    \n                      cesa1\n                      mddi1-1\n                      A903T\n                    \n                    mutant also confers resistance to CBIs quinoxyphen and C17, but not to CBIs isoxaben, indaziflam, or ES20. Stacking additional point mutations conferring resistance to other CBIs,\n                    \n                      cesa3\n                      ixr1-1\n                      G998D\n                    \n                    , and\n                    \n                      cesa6\n                      es20-r3\n                      G935E\n                    \n                    into the\n                    \n                      cesa1\n                      mddi1-1\n                      A903T\n                    \n                    background yields multiple-drug-resistant lines that maintain normal growth. These findings establish MDD, as a natural CBI that likely targets CESA1, thereby extending our understanding of CSC regulation and abilities to develop multidrug-resistant crop varieties. These findings offer unique perspectives for weed management and plant biotechnology.","tp":"纤维素抑制","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究者发现一种真菌天然产物8-甲基二氯二孢素(MDD)是广谱植物纤维素合成抑制剂，通过靶向纤维素合酶复合物(CSC)破坏植物细胞壁形成。构效关系分析揭示了MDD的作用机制，为新型除草剂开发提供了先导化合物，也为植物细胞壁生物学研究提供了有价值的化学工具。"},{"t":"用于治疗胆汁酸相关肝脏疾病的一流脉冲 FXR 激动剂","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10633-1","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Nuclear receptors are central regulators of metabolism1, yet therapeutic strategies that enforce continuous receptor activation frequently lead to reduced efficacy and unacceptable toxicity. Here we report a first-principles drug design strategy that aligns pharmacokinetics with physiological signalling cycles. We developed linafexor, a potent non-bile-acid agonist of the farnesoid X receptor (FXR)2; it is engineered for rapid systemic clearance, which enables pulsatile receptor activation that mirrors endogenous bile acid dynamics3,4,5. Linafexor has robust efficacy across multiple preclinical models of metabolic dysfunction-associated steatohepatitis6, liver fibrosis7, primary biliary cholangitis and primary sclerosing cholangitis8,9. Transcriptomic analyses reveal that, unlike long-acting FXR agonists10,11, linafexor preserves cyclic FXR signalling, avoids receptor downregulation and prevents broad transcriptional dysregulation. Direct manipulation of delivery patterns demonstrates that sustained FXR activation—independent of compound identity—induces severe toxicity, establishing activation duration as a determinant of therapeutic index. In phase 1 clinical studies (ClinicalTrials.gov; NCT05082779), linafexor administered once daily produces transient FXR pathway engagement, marked by (1) induction of FGF1912,13,14, a key endocrine mediator of bile acid feedback regulation; and (2) suppression of C415, an intermediate reflecting hepatic bile acid synthesis, with no treatment-related adverse events. Together, these findings identify pulsatile FXR activation as a mechanistically grounded and clinically translatable strategy, and establish linafexor as a first-in-class therapeutic for bile acid–related liver diseases."},{"t":"骨骼肌 NOX4 的下降会破坏运动引起的适应性稳态并加剧生物衰老","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz1953?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"A decline in nuclear factor erythroid 2–related factor 2 (NFE2L2)–orchestrated adaptive homeostasis and oxidative distress are thought to be key features of aging. In contracting skeletal muscle, the reactive oxygen species–producing enzyme NADPH oxidase 4 (NOX4) is a potent inducer of NFE2L2 adaptive homeostasis. Here, we report that skeletal muscle NOX4 levels decline in aged mice and humans, resulting in abrogated NFE2L2 adaptive homeostasis, increased protein oxidative damage, and decreased muscle function. We show that deleting NOX4 in skeletal muscle exacerbates the physiological decline associated with aging, resulting in overt sarcopenia and frailty, characterized by physical inactivity, increased adiposity, systemic inflammation, whole-body insulin resistance, and advanced liver disease in aged chow-fed mice. The systems-wide physiological decline in aged skeletal muscle NOX4-deficient mice could be corrected by restoring NOX4 using viral approaches or activating NFE2L2 downstream with sulforaphane and reinstating adaptive homeostatic responses otherwise induced by exercise. Our findings provide important insights into the basis for the decline in NFE2L2-orchestrated adaptive homeostasis that accompanies physical inactivity with age and identify key mechanisms by which exercise may promote healthy aging."},{"t":"保守的双相静脉重塑程序控制斑马鱼下腔静脉的形成","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.ady3541?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The Inferior Vena Cava (IVC), the largest vein in humans, develops through replacement of the embryonic cardinal veins (CVs), a complex process prone to congenital anomalies, with major clinical implications. Yet, the mechanisms underlying IVC formation remain unclear. Here, we identify the zebrafish IVC, which emerges during metamorphosis and replaces the embryonic CVs, following a biphasic sequence similar to that described in mammals. Using longitudinal imaging and clonal lineage tracing, we demonstrate that the IVC originates exclusively from preexisting venous endothelial cells. Unexpectedly, genetic and pharmacological perturbations reveal that IVC formation proceeds independently of Vegfc/Vegfr3 signaling and instead involves Vegfa-dependent venous sprouting. Last, we demonstrate that the transition from CV to IVC marks a shift from a multifunctional embryonic vein to a specialized adult conduit adapted for high-volume blood transport. Overall, we identify a venous morphogenesis program akin to the mammalian IVC formation, providing a foundation for investigating venous anomalies."},{"t":"没有暗能量的宇宙？数学家挑战标准宇宙学","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/a-universe-without-dark-energy-mathematicians-challenge-standard-cosmology/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"New mathematical research suggests dark energy may not be needed to explain the accelerating expansion of the universe, challenging the foundations of the standard cosmological model.\nMathematicians are questioning whether dark energy is actually responsible for the universe’s accelerating expansion.\nIn a new study published in\nProceedings of the Royal Society A\n, researchers at the\nUniversity of California, Davis\npresent mathematical evidence that instabilities within the Einstein-Euler equations suggest the current model of the expanding universe may not be viable. The Einstein-Euler equations combine general relativity and fluid dynamics and are widely used to model galaxies, black holes, and the expansion of the cosmos.\nThe findings directly challenge the Lambda-cold dark matter model, the leading\ncosmology framework.\nStudy corresponding author Blake Temple, distinguished professor emeritus of mathematics at UC Davis, compared the standard cosmological model to a pencil balanced on its tip.\n“All the forces are in balance when a pencil is standing on end, so it is a ‘solution of the equations,’” he said. “But it’s unstable. Any breath of air and it falls away.”\nAccording to Temple, the team’s calculations show that Friedmann spacetimes, the mathematical models used to describe cosmic expansion, are unstable at both small and large scales near the Big Bang. He said this makes them the most unstable solutions of all.\n“Unstable solutions in physics and science are considered not physical,” Temple said. “You’ll never observe them in nature.”\nTemple said this instability points to a simpler explanation that remains entirely within Einstein’s original theory of gravity.\n“The instability of all Friedmann spacetimes to accelerated expansion suggests a simpler, more natural explanation for the acceleration of the universe than dark energy,” he said.\nDark energy was proposed nearly 30 years ago as a way to explain why the universe’s expansion appears to be speeding up.\nThe concept traces back to Einstein’s 1915 equations of general relativity. To create a static universe, Einstein added an antigravity term known as the cosmological constant. After Edwin Hubble discovered in 1929 that the universe was expanding, Einstein reportedly referred to the cosmological constant as his “biggest blunder” because, without it, his equations would have predicted expansion.\nIn the 1990s, however, the cosmological constant was revived and linked to dark energy as a possible explanation for accelerating expansion. Modern cosmological models are built on the concept of a “Friedmann universe,” in which matter expands while remaining evenly distributed throughout space at any given time.\nTemple and his colleagues believed there were mathematical problems with this picture, prompting them to investigate other possible causes of cosmic acceleration.\n“Our first idea was that maybe the universe was expanding because there was a shockwave, and the anomalous acceleration was the expanding wave behind that shockwave,” Temple said. “Then we realized there’s a family of self-similar solutions during the radiation epoch of the Big Bang, which might model that expanding wave.”\nSelf-similar equations describe systems that preserve the same overall pattern or structure across different scales.\nIn the new study, the researchers used a self-similar version of Einstein’s equations developed in earlier work to represent the standard cosmological model as a rest point of the equations. This approach allowed them to fully analyze the model’s stability and, more broadly, the stability of all Friedmann spacetimes during the matter-dominated era of the Big Bang.\n“We prove that, like Einstein’s static model, the Friedmann spacetimes are all unstable to radial perturbation at large length scales,” Temple said. “This appears to rule out the Lambda-cold dark matter model as a viable stable solution of the Einstein equations of general relativity, with or without dark energy.”\n“This means,” he added, “that the Big Bang should generically look exactly like a Friedmann spacetime near the center of symmetry, but generically one should observe accelerations away from Friedmann far from the center.”\nThe researchers concluded that the universe’s accelerating expansion emerges naturally from the Einstein-Euler equations and does not require either a cosmological constant or dark energy.\nTheir findings also challenge the Copernican principle, the idea that Earth does not occupy a special location in the universe.\n“Both the Lambda-cold dark matter model and a spherically symmetric spacetime produce a special place where we must lie for the model to be physically plausible,” Temple said. “If this principle rules out one, it has to rule out the other.”\nReference: “The instability of critical and underdense Friedmann spacetimes at the Big Bang as an alternative to dark energy” by Christopher Alexander, Blake K. Temple and Zeke Vogler, 27 May 2026,\nProceedings of the Royal Society A: Mathematical Physical and Engineering Science\nDOI:10.1098/rspa.2025.0912\nThe study was funded by the United Kingdom’s Engineering and Physical Sciences Research Council and the American Institute of Mathematics SQuaREs Program.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAstronomers Study the Interstellar Medium a Billion Years After the Big Bang\nNew Findings Will Help Light the Way to Understanding Dark Energy\nStudy Reveals Indications That Dark Matter is Being Erased by Dark Energy\nDark Energy Survey Reveals a Rare Superluminous Supernova\nAstrophysicists Challenge the Cosmological Model\nResearch Sheds New Light on Dark Energy\nResearchers Use New CMB Data to Analyze the First Hundred Thousand Years of Our Universe\nModule for ESA’s Euclid ‘Dark Universe’ Mission in Development\nScientists Use Quasars To Probe Dark Energy & Measure Its Role in the Evolution of the Universe"},{"t":"集强力粘附、自修复与透氧性于一体的统一聚合物水凝胶电解质在柔性中性锌电池中的应用","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73665?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池电解质","kp":["电解质[中性锌空电池]: 聚合物水凝胶","器件形态[锌空电池]: 柔性中性","特性[水凝胶]: 自愈合+粘附+氧渗透"],"as":"该研究提出一种集强韧粘附性、自修复能力于一体的聚合物水凝胶电解质，用于锌空气电池。水凝胶电解质因其优异柔韧性被视为柔性储能器件的关键材料，但长期面临界面接触差、机械损伤后性能衰减等瓶颈。该一体化设计通过分子级粘附与动态交联网络实现自修复，有望显著提升柔性锌空气电池的循环寿命与可穿戴设备集成稳定性，推动柔性电子产业化进程。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Unified Polymer Hydrogel Electrolyte Integrating Robust Adhesion, Self‐Healing, and Oxygen Permeability in Flexible Ne","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymer hydrogel electrolytes hold significant promise for Zn–air batteries due to their excellent flexibility, non‐flammability, and leak resistance. However, their practical application remains constrained by zinc dendrite growth and intrinsic trade‐offs among ionic conductivity, oxygen permeability, mechanical strength, and both interfacial and environmental stability. Herein, we report a neutral, 3D physically cross‐linked PFCD hydrogel engineered via the synergistic combination of a tight coordination network of small Fe\n                    3\n                    +\n                    ions and a broader hydrogen‐bonding network of β‐cyclodextrin, with in situ incorporated N‐carboxyethyl chitosan. This hierarchical architecture endows the PFCD hydrogel with high adhesion (50 kPa), superior ionic conductivity (113.2 mS cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ), and significant oxygen permeability (4.1 Barrer). Additionally, the hydrogel exhibits autonomous self‐healing (99% efficiency in 3 h), exceptional stretchability (1600% elongation), and robust interfacial contact (withstanding 1000 folding/stretching cycles), while effectively suppressing zinc dendrite growth and resisting CO\n                    2\n                    degradation. Assembled flexible neutral Zn–air batteries (FNZABs) achieve high power density (59 mW cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    ) with stable operation over 3000 cycles. Furthermore, the fabrication of leakage‐free, closed‐system FNZABs demonstrates the hydrogel's dual role as both an electrolyte and an oxygen‐permeable encapsulation membrane. This integrated strategy effectively addresses critical interfacial and stability challenges essential for advanced flexible energy storage systems development.","aip":1},{"t":"一项令人惊讶的发现表明自闭症不是一种疾病","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/a-surprising-discovery-suggests-autism-is-not-one-condition/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Brain scans have uncovered two biologically distinct forms of autism hidden within the spectrum.\nAn international team of researchers has identified at least two biologically distinct forms of autism by examining how different regions of the brain communicate with one another. The findings could help advance more precise and personalized approaches to autism care and support.\nThe study was led by scientists at Istituto Italiano di Tecnologia (IIT-Italian Institute of Technology) in Rovereto (Trento, Italy) and the Child Mind Institute in New York (USA), with contributions from researchers at the University of Trento. Their results were published in Nature Neuroscience.\nThe researchers found two recurring patterns of brain connectivity. In one group, known as the “hyperconnectivity” subtype, communication between brain regions was stronger than usual. In the other, called the “hypoconnectivity” subtype, communication was reduced.\nThe project was coordinated by Alessandro Gozzi, PhD, director of the Center for Neuroscience and Cognitive Systems (CNCS) at the IIT, and Adriana Di Martino, MD, founding director of the Autism Center at the Child Mind Institute.\nAccording to the research team, this work represents the first systematic attempt to interpret human brain imaging patterns (via\n) by tracing them back to underlying biological mechanisms identified in mouse models. By connecting specific brain connectivity patterns to particular biological pathways, the study provides a potential framework for future precision medicine strategies.\nTo investigate these relationships, the researchers analyzed functional connectivity in 20 mouse models and examined brain scans from 940 children and young adults with autism, along with scans from more than 1,000 neurotypical individuals.\nThe analysis uncovered two reproducible autism subtypes. The hypoconnectivity subtype was associated with synaptic pathways, while the hyperconnectivity subtype was linked to immune-related biological systems. Together, these two groups represented approximately 25% of the people with autism included in the study.\n“For decades, we’ve observed tremendous variability in how autism manifests, but we lacked direct evidence that these differences reflected distinct underlying biology,” said Dr. Alessandro Gozzi, at Italian Institute of Technology. “Our approach enabled us to isolate specific genetic and immune factors, then translate those signatures to human brain scans, showing that different connectivity patterns encode different mechanistic pathways underlying autism.”\nTo better understand the origins of these brain patterns, the researchers combined imaging data with genetic and biochemical analyses in mouse models. This allowed them to connect specific connectivity signatures with changes in cellular function.\nThe work revealed how molecular pathways, including synaptic and immune-related mechanisms, can produce distinct patterns of brain connectivity that are detectable with fMRI. These biological signatures identified in mice then served as reference patterns for finding similar subtypes in human brain scans.\n“The mouse models gave us a biological ‘Rosetta Stone,'” said Dr. Adriana Di Martino at the Child Mind Institute. “We could see which biological pathways drive which connectivity signatures, then search for those same patterns in humans.”\nThe human imaging data came from the Autism Brain Imaging Data Exchange (ABIDE), a pioneering neuroimaging initiative co-founded by Dr. Di Martino that aggregates datasets from research laboratories worldwide, and the Child Mind Institute.\nWhen the researchers examined the human data, they identified matching hyperconnectivity and hypoconnectivity subtypes. Further gene expression analyses supported the findings. Brain regions showing hypoconnectivity were enriched for synaptic genes, while regions with hyperconnectivity showed enrichment for immune-related genes, reflecting the same biological mechanisms observed in the mouse models.\nThe consistency of the findings across independent datasets provided additional confidence in the results.\n“Finding the same subtypes reproducible across dozens of independent research sites was critical validation,” added Dr. Gozzi.\nThe two subtypes also differed in their overall functional brain organization and showed modest differences on standardized autism assessments. Individuals in the hyperconnectivity group scored somewhat higher on measures of autism severity.\n“Brain-based biological markers reveal distinctions that current behavioral assessments don’t fully capture,” noted Dr. Di Martino.\nThe researchers emphasize that these two subtypes likely represent only part of autism’s biological complexity. While they identified two dominant connectivity patterns, they believe additional autism subtypes may emerge as larger datasets become available and analytical methods continue to improve.\nReference: “Autism subtypes identified using cross-species functional connectivity analyses” by Marco Pagani, Valerio Zerbi, Silvia Gini, Filomena Grazia Alvino, Abhishek Banerjee, Andrea Barberis, M. Albert Basson, Yuri Bozzi, Alberto Galbusera, Jacob Ellegood, Michela Fagiolini, Jason P. Lerch, Michela Matteoli, Caterina Montani, Davide Pozzi, Giovanni Provenzano, Maria Luisa Scattoni, Nicole Wenderoth, Ting Xu, Michael V. Lombardo, Michael P. Milham, Adriana Di Martino and Alessandro Gozzi, 15 May 2026,\nNature Neuroscience\nDOI: 10.1038/s41593-026-02287-z\nThe study was made possible through an international collaboration coordinated by the Italian Institute of Technology and the Child Mind Institute. Funding was provided by the Simons Foundation Autism Research Initiative, the European Research Council through the #DISCONN and #BRAINAMICS projects, the Brain and Behavior Foundation, the Fondazione Telethon, and the US National Institute of Mental Health.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAutism Spectrum Disorder\nMolecular Biology\nNeuroscience\nScientists Uncover a Cellular Weak Spot in Alzheimer’s Disease\nMissing Brain Molecule May Hold the Secret to Improving Cognition in Down Syndrome\nNew Study Reveals Genetic Link Between Autism and Epilepsy\nNew Clues to Autism Mystery: Different Risk Genes With Same Effects on Brain Development\nBrain Cells Snap Open Their DNA To Make Memories – Extent of DNA Double-Strand Breaks Is “Surprising and Concerning”\nNew Genetic Mutations Linked to Autism Spectrum Disorder Uncovered by Scientists\nParkinson’s Disease Eliminated in Mice by One-Time Genetic Treatment that Generates New Neurons\nNew Way to Treat Hypersensitivity to Noise and Other Neurological Disorders\nEvolutionary Changes Surrounding the NOS1 Gene"},{"t":"具有超高 Fe(II) 的二甲双胍稳定的无定形氧化铁的自级联纳米酶，用于在 U 进行有效的肿瘤治疗","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7061041?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The therapeutic efficacy of iron oxide nanozymes in cancer catalytic therapy has been severely constrained by the insufficient endogenous H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    . To address this, constructing a self–cascading nanozyme that integrates oxidase (OXD) and peroxidase (POD) activities is highly desirable yet challenging, primarily due to the difficulty in stabilizing high–content of Fe(II) within nanostructures. Herein, we report the first synthesis of mesoporous amorphous iron oxide nanospheres (aFeO\n                    x\n                    ‑N) with unprecedented high Fe (II) level (66.59%) via the confinement coordination strategy using the strong N–donor metformin. This unique structure simultaneously exhibits robust OXD–like activity for in situ H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation via a 2e\n                    −\n                    oxygen reduction pathway and enhanced POD–like activity for consequent •OH production. In vitro studies verified the aFeO\n                    x\n                    ‑N‑ss‑SiO\n                    2\n                    (encapsulated by SiO\n                    2\n                    outlayer containing ─S─S─ bonds for TME responsiveness) triggered ferroptosis and prominent cell death even under hypoxic conditions. Remarkably, a single ultralow dose (5 mg·kg\n                    −1\n                    ) achieves a tumor inhibition rate of up to 96.19% in murine models, demonstrating exceptional therapeutic efficacy and biocompatibility. This work provides a novel and potent nanozyme platform for cascade catalytic tumor therapy.","tp":"纳米酶抗癌","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对铁氧化物纳米酶肿瘤催化治疗中内源性H₂O₂不足的瓶颈，研究者构建了二甲双胍稳定的无定形氧化铁自级联纳米酶，整合氧化酶(OXD)和过氧化物酶(POD)双重活性。超高Fe(II)含量是该设计的关键突破，实现了高效肿瘤治疗，显著提升了催化治疗效果。"},{"t":"4.1-Ga 火星陨石 Teghaza 001 中的诺亚水圈组成部分","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aea3420?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The recent discovery of a 4.1-billion-year-old (Ga) Martian gabbroic diorite enables an assessment of water reservoirs on early Mars. Measurements of H\n                    2\n                    O and D/H in igneous Ca-phosphates record mixing between D-poor magmatic water and a D-rich component that retains an imprint of the ancient Martian hydrosphere. The D/H ratio of magmatic water is similar in Martian magmas with different ages and mantle sources, indicating that early differentiation processes did not fractionate H isotopes in the primordial Martian mantle. The D-rich component was assimilated by migrating magmas that interacted with aqueously altered basaltic crust. Our minimum bound on the D/H ratio of the Martian hydrosphere at 4.1 Ga (~2× the D/H ratio of Earth seawater) supports models of rapid H loss to space from Mars’ juvenile atmosphere."},{"t":"用于 SuFEx 反应的多功能六氟化硫：N-CF2H 磺胺酰氟","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7689781?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sulfur(VI) fluorides based on sulfur(VI) fluoride exchange (SuFEx) chemistry have demonstrated their unique versatility and high efficiency in the field of medicinal chemistry. Acting as both covalent and hydrogen bond donors, the novel\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluoride will enhance the binding strength between drugs and receptors in organism, thereby injecting new vitality into the research of targeted drugs.\n                  \n                  \n                    Herein, we report the two‐step synthesis of\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluorides from primary amines via successive fluorosulfonylation and insertion of difluorocarbene. This method shows broad scope, provides a platform for rapidly generating\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluorides by virtue of the diversity and availability of amines. The stability of\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluorides was tested in aqueous environment at different pH, showing that most compounds remained &gt;95% intact for 72 h.\n                  \n                  \n                    As a novel SuFEx building block,\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluoride shows chemoselectivity toward phenol and does not react with amines and alcohols. Besides,\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluorides were subjected to debenzylation and amide‐bond‐formation reactions to generate peptides, Sitagliptin derivative and bioactive alkylamine. Finally,\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluoride underwent successful F‐18 labeling. With the reported syntheses, we believe that\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluoride will soon be practically applied in drugs, covalent targeted radioligand, F‐18 PET tracers, electrolyte in general."},{"t":"利用峡谷效应增强智能农业的高适应性环境能量采集器","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE02135B","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","b":"Ambient energy harvesters show great potential for powering distributed sensor nodes. However, their output performance is often limited by a single-source energy, resulting in poor adaptability, stability, and energy utilization ratio in variable weather conditions. Herein, a high-adaptability ambient energy harvester enhanced by a bi-concave flow amplifier is proposed. The omnidirectional airflow smoothing enhancement design of the amplifier is inspired by the canyon effect. And the inclined surface of the amplifier offers building-block-like modular assembly, enabling synergistic non-invasive integration of electromagnetic-photovoltaic-triboelectric effect. The results indicate that the amplifier boosts the wind energy harvesting efficiency by 86.87 % and reduces the start-up wind speed to 0.4 m/s. Within the theoretical-simulationexperimental framework, the measured power densities reach 14.158 W/m 2 (wind), 63.47 W/m 2 (solar), and 25.42 W/m 2 (raindrop), demonstrating robust performance across varying weather conditions. Notably, leveraging the multi-energy sensing capabilities of the harvester, a self-powered weather warning system and an automated smart greenhouse control system have been developed. This system-level application offers a new perspective for the deep integration of energy harvesters with smart agriculture.","tp":"环境能采集","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者提出一种受峡谷效应启发的双凹型流动放大器，用于增强环境能量采集器的全向气流平滑性能。该高适应性能量采集器可同时适应多变天气条件下的多种能源输入，为智慧农业分布式传感器节点供电提供了新方案，显著提升了能量利用率和稳定性。"},{"t":"一种具有增加 GTP 周转率的 GTP 合酶核酶","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520997123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Before the invention of encoded protein translation, early stages of life likely relied on catalytic RNAs (ribozymes). To test how such a system could have functioned, researchers have developed ribozymes that could have provided central functions. The central function of self-replication would have required templated RNA polymerization of nucleotides, which is energetically driven in today’s life forms by the use of nucleoside 5′-triphosphates (NTPs). We previously showed that ribozymes can catalyze the formation of guanosine 5′-triphosphate (GTP) from guanosine and the prebiotically plausible polyphosphorylation reagent cyclic trimetaphosphate (cTmp) by generating a guanosine triphosphorylation ribozyme (GTR) using an in vitro selection in emulsion. This ribozyme (GTR1) had a catalytic rate enhancement of about 18,000-fold but a turnover of only about 1.7. Here, we improved this ribozyme by emulsion selection from a doped library of GTR1 that was metabolically coupled to a polymerase ribozyme. High-throughput sequencing and biochemical analysis identified the most efficient variant of GTR1 with 19 mutations, which increased the GTP turnover number to ~13. Biochemical analysis of this GTR1e revealed biphasic reaction kinetics with an apparent overall K\n                    M\n                    APP\n                    around 11 mM for cTmp. When coupled to an RNA polymerase ribozyme, up to five guanosines were incorporated into an RNA polymer, which represents an important step toward modeling an RNA-based life form in the lab."},{"t":"迪亚曼蒂纳区拥有 530 万年前的深海鲸鱼墓地","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10546-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Whale falls are biodiversity oases at seabeds1,2,3,4,5,6, yet their record from the oceans has remained sparse and fragmentary6,7. Here we report the discovery of a vast whale necropolis in the Diamantina Zone (4,616- to 7,001-m depth), extending about 1,200 km along the sea floor of the southeastern Indian Ocean. This area has a deep and extensive accumulation comprising five modern natural whale-fall communities and 476 fossil cetaceans recorded. We show that carcasses host specialized communities dominated by brittle stars, bone-boring worms and chemosynthesis-based bivalves and that the fossil record in this area comprises both extant and extinct deep-diving beaked whales. Isotopic dating shows that whale falls in this region have occurred since at least 5.3 million years ago. These findings reshape the understanding of the limits and biogeography of whale-fall ecosystems and establish some deep sea floors as a fossil archive for tracing cetacean evolution over geological time."},{"t":"用于阿尔茨海默病中 β-分泌酶 (BACE1) 活性“开启”成像的 19F MRI/NIR-FL 纳米探针","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1325073?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Alzheimer's disease (AD) is the most common progressive neurodegenerative disorder with very few therapeutic methods; thus, its early detection is urgently important. β‐secretase (BACE1) is a well‐recognized biomarker of early‐stage AD, but its in vivo imaging‐based diagnostic method is rarely reported. Herein, we report a BACE1‐disassemblable nanoprobe,\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5‐NP\n                    \n                    for “Turn‐On”\n                    19\n                    F magnetic resonance/near‐infrared fluorescence (\n                    19\n                    F MR/NIR‐FL) imaging of the enzyme activity in AD in vivo. The “Turn‐On”\n                    19\n                    F MRI signals are employed for imaging BACE1 activity with high specificity, while the “Turn‐On” NIR‐FL signals are used for double checking the enzyme activity with high spatial resolution. Specifically,\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5‐NP,\n                    \n                    with a silent\n                    19\n                    F MR/NIR‐FL signal is obtained from the precursor Cys(StBu)‐Glu‐Val‐Asn‐Leu‐Asp‐Ala‐Glu‐Phe(CF\n                    3\n                    )‐Lys(Cy5.5)‐CBT (\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5\n                    \n                    ) through a CBT‐Cys click reaction. Upon BACE1 cleavage, the nanoprobe disassembles, resulting in 6.8 ± 1.3‐fold and 9.5 ± 0.3‐fold increases of\n                    1\n                    9\n                    F NMR and NIR‐FL signals in vitro, respectively. Moreover,\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5‐NP\n                    \n                    renders 4.6 ± 0.9‐fold/1.5 ± 0.1‐fold higher\n                    19\n                    F MRI/NIR‐FL signal in Aβ\n                    25–35\n                    ‐treated PC12 cells than that in normal PC12 cells. In vivo experimental results show that this nanoprobe enables the precise imaging of BACE1 activity in AD zebrafish models. We anticipate that\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5‐NP\n                    \n                    could be applied for the early diagnosis of AD in clinics in the future.","tp":"活体脑成像","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对阿尔茨海默病(AD)早期检测的迫切需求，研究者开发了BACE1可拆解型¹⁹F-Cy5.5-NP双模态纳米探针，结合¹⁹F MRI和近红外荧光(NIR-FL)成像技术。β-分泌酶(BACE1)是AD早期生物标志物，该探针实现对BACE1活性的'开启'式成像，为AD早期诊断提供了新的体内成像工具。"},{"t":"63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260610_1894226.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","as":"乘联分会数据显示，2025年5月全国新能源乘用车零售销量约97.4万辆，零售渗透率达63%再创历史新高，标志着新能源汽车已从政策驱动全面转向市场主导阶段，对传统燃油车替代加速，深远影响汽车产业链格局与能源消费结构。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"新能源车渗透率","kp":["渗透率[新能源乘用车5月]: 63%","零售销量[5月]: ~97.4万辆"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":7.5,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"cl":"55169e17","cln":"新能源车渗透率","cp":0,"b":"63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高\n6月3日，乘联分会发布的最新数据显示，经初步统计，5月，全国新能源乘用车零售销量约97.4万辆，同比下降5%，零售渗透率达63%，创历史新高；今年以来，我国新能源乘用车累计零售销量约373.2万辆，同比下降14%。\n批发销量层面，经初步统计，5月，全国乘用车厂商新能源批发销量约136.5万辆，同比增长12%；今年以来，全国乘用车厂商新能源累计批发销量约531.8万辆，同比增长2%，批发销量渗透率为61.1%。\n乘联分会数据显示，初步统计，5月1日-31日，全国乘用车市场零售销量为154.5万辆，比去年同期下降20%；厂商批发销量为223.2万辆，比去年同期下降4%。\n2026年1—5月，全国乘用车市场累计零售销量约715万辆，同比下降19%；同期，全国乘用车厂商累计批发销量约1020.9万辆，同比下降6%。\n“‘五一’期间，各车企积极推行新车上市权益以及终端促销，车市热度有效提升，5月上旬乘用车零售市场呈现‘五一节日旺销后逐步回落’的周度节奏，随着节后限时补贴陆续到期，客流自然回落，市场呈现典型的‘前高后低’走势。”乘联分会方面表示。\n展望后续，乘联分会方面认为，随着5月下旬车企加大促销力度、冲量窗口开启，零售量有望再次回升，市场分化态势将延续，新能源车与低价入门车型的表现仍将优于传统燃油车及中高端合资品牌。短期来看，政策红利释放、渠道库存消化仍是影响市场走势的关键变量。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核\n宁夏迈入千万千瓦级储能大省行列\n固废变资源 推动新能源产业“绿色循环”"},{"t":"63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260610_1894226.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"产业进展","tp":"新能源车渗透率","dp":1,"as":"乘联分会数据显示，2025年5月全国新能源乘用车零售销量约97.4万辆，零售渗透率达63%再创历史新高，标志着新能源汽车已从政策驱动全面转向市场主导阶段，对传统燃油车替代加速，深远影响汽车产业链格局与能源消费结构。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":8.0,"r":3.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"b":"63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n63%！新能源乘用车零售渗透率再创新高\n6月3日，乘联分会发布的最新数据显示，经初步统计，5月，全国新能源乘用车零售销量约97.4万辆，同比下降5%，零售渗透率达63%，创历史新高；今年以来，我国新能源乘用车累计零售销量约373.2万辆，同比下降14%。\n批发销量层面，经初步统计，5月，全国乘用车厂商新能源批发销量约136.5万辆，同比增长12%；今年以来，全国乘用车厂商新能源累计批发销量约531.8万辆，同比增长2%，批发销量渗透率为61.1%。\n乘联分会数据显示，初步统计，5月1日-31日，全国乘用车市场零售销量为154.5万辆，比去年同期下降20%；厂商批发销量为223.2万辆，比去年同期下降4%。\n2026年1—5月，全国乘用车市场累计零售销量约715万辆，同比下降19%；同期，全国乘用车厂商累计批发销量约1020.9万辆，同比下降6%。\n“‘五一’期间，各车企积极推行新车上市权益以及终端促销，车市热度有效提升，5月上旬乘用车零售市场呈现‘五一节日旺销后逐步回落’的周度节奏，随着节后限时补贴陆续到期，客流自然回落，市场呈现典型的‘前高后低’走势。”乘联分会方面表示。\n展望后续，乘联分会方面认为，随着5月下旬车企加大促销力度、冲量窗口开启，零售量有望再次回升，市场分化态势将延续，新能源车与低价入门车型的表现仍将优于传统燃油车及中高端合资品牌。短期来看，政策红利释放、渠道库存消化仍是影响市场走势的关键变量。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核\n宁夏迈入千万千瓦级储能大省行列\n固废变资源 推动新能源产业“绿色循环”"},{"t":"爱尔兰拟建配绿氢电解槽的600MW长时储能设施","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/10/600-mw-ldes-facility-with-green-hydrogen-electolyzer-proposed-in-ireland/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"长时储能绿氢","kp":["储能规模[LDES]: 600 MW","投资额: 约20亿欧元","[配置]: 耦合绿氢电解槽"],"as":"爱尔兰开发商Net Zero Energy计划建设一座约600MW的大型长时储能（LDES）电站，配套绿氢电解槽，旨在解决可再生能源间歇性问题并提升电网灵活性，长时储能被视为未来零碳电力系统的关键基础设施。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"600 MW LDES facility with green hydrogen electolyzer proposed in Ireland - Energy Storage","b":"Irish developer Net Zero Energy is planning to build a large-scale long-duration energy storage (LDES) plant worth around €2 billion in County Carlow, in the east of the country.\nThe project, dubbed Rathrush Green Energy Park, will store surplus generated energy from off-site, non-dispatchable renewables sources such as wind and solar. This excess energy will be used to power an electrolyzer that splits water into hydrogen and oxygen. The hydrogen is stored on-site in underground rock caverns to be converted into electricity using a hydrogen-fired gas generator. The green electricity can then be deployed on demand to the national grid at the nearby 220 kV Kellis substation. Water supply will come from the nearby Tullow Waste Water Treatment Plant.\n“By making available 600MW of renewable energy at the flick of a switch to a grid which, at the time of project delivery, will peak at around 7,000MW, Rathrush Green Energy Park provides significant, secure and green long duration storage for the Irish grid,” Net Zero Energy’s chairman Tim Cowhig said.\nNet Zero Energy opened a public consultation phase for the project on 9 June. The developer’s CEO, Peter Harte, wrote in a LinkedIn post announcing the opening of the consultation that “a handful more LDES projects of this scale”, combined with Ireland’s abundant renewables would give the country an electricity system “that is 100% free of volatile and insecure fossil gas imports.”\n“The Rathrush Green Energy Park will be able to meet 10% of Ireland’s peak demand, and store 30x more energy than Turlough Hill,” Harte wrote, referring to the ESB’s pumped-storage hydroelectricity plant that can generate up to 292 MW of electricity at times of peak demand.\nThe project will also be a considerable asset to Ireland’s small, but growing LDES market. Other LDES projects under development in Ireland include the\n1 GWh Ballynahone iron-air energy storage facility\nbeing developed in the northwest of the country by FuturEnergy and Form Energy.\nThe Net Zero Energy team’s priority for the next few months is to work with the local community around the Rathrush, Rathoe and Tullow areas in County Carlow. Harte wrote that the company has enlisted a dedicated community liaison officer and team on the ground, and it has briefed the Carlow local authorities and local residents and businesses near the project site. A community benefit fund will be set up to contribute to local sports clubs and voluntary organizations.\nNet Zero Energy is a County Cork-based developer. It claims the Rathrush development will save up to 180,000 tonnes of carbon dioxide emissions annually, equivalent to removing 40,000 cars.\nThe project is classified as a Strategic Infrastructure Development and will be subject to approval by the national planning board, An Coimisiún Pleanála, following the community engagement process. If planning is granted, the project will then be put forward for a licence to operate from the Environmental Protection Agency."},{"t":"5f金属掺杂二维团簇石墨烯：通过连续平面载流子迁移实现高效光催化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00225-0?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化烯烃裂解","kp":["[材料]: 铀酰-多铌酸盐2D簇烯","[光催化]: 可见光驱动烯烃断裂"],"dp":1,"as":"研究将铀酰单元与多铌酸盐在亚纳米尺度集成，构建出具有连续载流子通道的二维UNbO团簇烯材料，利用5f金属特性实现高效光催化，为锕系元素功能化设计与太阳能驱动的催化反应（如水分解、CO₂还原）提供了全新材料平台。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"5f metal-incorporated 2D clusterphene: Enabling high-efficiency photocatalysis through continuous planar carrier migrati","b":"Integrating uranyl units with polyoxoniobates at the subnanoscale creates a 2D UNbO clusterphene with a continuous carrier-migration path that minimizes electron-hole recombination, enabling efficient visible-light-driven alkene cleavage and paving the way for advanced 5f metal-based heterogeneous photocatalysts."},{"t":"2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动启动","d":"2026-06-11","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260610/0ac12d4162c34166ab66c973aab1f776/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","tp":"人形机器人实训","kp":["落地规模[2026年底]: 万台级","应用场景[目标]: 百个以上高价值场景"],"as":"工业和信息化部与国务院国资委联合印发通知，启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动，推动人形机器人在真实工业、服务场景中的规模化落地验证，加速从实验室原型向产业化应用转化，标志国家层面系统性布局具身智能生态。","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":8.0},"cl":"db5617702f","cln":"工信部+国资委|2026人形机器人实景实训行动|印发通知启动|2026-06-11","cp":1,"b":"2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动启动-新华网\n2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动启动\n2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动启动\n记者9日从工业和信息化部获悉，工业和信息化部、国务院国资委联合印发通知，正式启动2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动，推动人形机器人与具身智能在真实生产生活环境中常态化部署、工程化验证、规模化落地，加速构建产业闭环。\n行动提出，到2026年底，人形机器人等重点产品在一批代表性场景中率先完成应用验证和常态部署，开启“作业模式”；凝练形成百个以上高价值应用场景，进一步丰富具身智能应用谱系，带动形成万台级规模落地能力。\n工业和信息化部科技司有关负责人表示，当前我国人形机器人与具身智能正处于从实验室走向真实场景、从演示验证转向常态化作业的关键阶段，模型算法、本体性能、场景适配、真机数据积累等仍存在短板。\n实景实训是破解上述瓶颈的关键抓手。通过集约化建设、标准化管理、资源共享的实训空间，可有效避免场景重复建设和资源浪费，推动场景、数据、算力与技术成果高效复用，大幅降低企业试错成本，实现产品在真实环境中的快速迭代优化，是推动人形机器人从“能用”到“好用”跨越的重要手段。\n行动聚焦工业、服务、特种等领域重点场景，部署打造实景实训空间、组建创新应用联合体、攻关实用化作业技能、加强实景应用验证与常态部署、强化关键要素保障、凝练成熟经验等6项重点任务。\n其中，在打造实景实训空间方面，行动将围绕工业、服务、特种领域，聚焦生产制造、检测分析、维修维护、仓储物流、餐饮零售、医疗康养、安全生产、应急救援、防灾减灾等重点场景的人形机器人、四足机器人应用需求，选取一批目标需求明确、工作状况清晰、标准化程度高且具备经济可行性的真实场景单元，作为实景实训空间载体；在组建创新应用联合体方面，支持以用户单位、整机企业（或应用服务商）为主体，会同模型算法、零部件等供应链企业以及科研院所等，针对每个场景组建创新应用联合体。（记者/崔爽）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n新华鲜报丨岁月留痕 在档案中见证历史\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n那些年，高考试卷里的体育元素\n雄安日记丨打开完整社区的“百宝箱”\n热点问答丨伊朗与以色列交火“点到为止”？\n麦收新图景丨麦田新生代 逐梦好时光\n2026年度人形机器人与具身智能实景实训专项行动启动"},{"t":"基于气象引导的条件扩散模型与自适应组归一化的分布式光伏缺失功率数据鲁棒插补","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007531?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"扩散模型数据插补","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Weather-guided conditional diffusion model with adaptive group normalization for robust imputation of missing distributed photovoltaic power data"},{"t":"在简单表面热力学的液体混合物中将气泡聚结速率调整多个数量级：实验和理论","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535299123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The coalescence time of bubbles in a liquid depends on the nature of the liquid, which determines both its surface thermodynamics and the molecular interactions between the gas/liquid interfaces, and on the geometry, prescribed by the curvature of the bubbles. Coalescence is well described in pure liquids that have the same composition in bulk and at interfaces and in which the interactions are attractive. In contrast, the mechanisms are poorly understood in more complex liquids in which coalescence times are orders of magnitudes larger than in pure liquids and are unpredictable. To provide insight on these mechanisms, we use model systems: binary mixtures of miscible oils. In these liquids, interfaces have purely attractive molecular interactions and the surface thermodynamics can simply be described using a well-determined Gibbs elastic modulus, which is controlled by the composition of the mixture. We measure the coalescence rate by forming periodic trains of bubbles in millifluidic tubes whose radius varies over 1.5 decade. We report coalescence times spanning more than three decades and, for a given composition, varying according to a power law with curvature, with an exponent larger than that reported in pure liquids and independent of Gibbs elasticity. The experimental behavior is in excellent agreement with a numerical solution of the coupled thermodynamical and hydrodynamical equations, performed in the simple geometry of a suspended liquid film. Our results clearly reveal how geometry and surface thermodynamics modify the coalescence process of bubbles in the limit of small Gibbs elasticity.","tp":"气泡聚结律","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究在液体混合物中揭示了气泡聚结速率可跨越多个数量级调节的机制。在纯液体中聚结行为已有充分描述，但在复杂液体混合物中由于界面组成与体相不同，机制尚不清晰。研究结合表面热力学理论和实验，阐明了液体组成如何决定气液界面分子相互作用和气泡曲率，进而调控聚结时间。"},{"t":"跟踪东南亚能源转型的进展和优先事项——区域能源转型指数和分析框架","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007403?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"东南亚能源","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"斯格明子晶格中的拓扑转变和位错弹性的出现：超越基特尔的磁极类比","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/4rww-4tsc","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Author(s): Kohta Kasai, Akihiro Uematsu, Yu Wang, Tao Xu, Chang Liu, Susumu Minami, and Takahiro ShimadaSkyrmion dislocations exhibit intrinsic core structures possessing large skyrmion deformation and topological phase transitions.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236703] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"磁拓扑相变","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"发表于Physical Review Letters的研究揭示了斯格明子晶格中的拓扑相变和位错弹性。研究者发现斯格明子位错具有本征核心结构，伴随大的斯格明子形变和拓扑相变。该工作超越了基特尔磁畴极化类比，为理解磁性斯格明子的力学和拓扑性质提供了新视角。"},{"t":"自噬蛋白 ATG-9 通过运输神经肽受体促进秀丽隐杆线虫的厌恶学习","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531054123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Autophagy is a degradative process that maintains cellular homeostasis. Autophagy biogenesis occurs at synapses, but its impact on synaptic functions is incompletely understood. Here we show that, in\n                    \n                      Caenorhabditis elegans\n                    \n                    , synaptic ATG-9, the only transmembrane autophagy protein, contributes to aversive learning under mitochondrial stress. Analysis of the neuronal translatome reveals that autophagy is upregulated by stress in the octopaminergic RIC neuron and it promotes aversive learning. Inactivating autophagy genes, including\n                    atg-9\n                    , reduces aversive learning. Mitochondrial stress increases synaptic ATG-9 through AP-1- and AP-2-dependent exocytosis and endocytosis, respectively, and reducing synaptic ATG-9 impairs aversive learning. We further identify the FRPR-6 neuropeptide receptor as a substrate of ATG-9 modulation. Both\n                    atg-9\n                    and\n                    frpr-6\n                    promote aversive learning and RIC activities, and the abundance of FRPR-6 in the RIC neurite depends on\n                    atg-9\n                    . We postulate that ATG-9-containing synaptic compartments promote neuronal plasticity through modulating receptor trafficking to enable aversive learning under systemic mitochondrial stress."},{"t":"空肠弯曲杆菌鞭毛 V 形环可识别粘度水平，从而改变游泳速度、代谢基因表达和健康状况","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603105123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Campylobacter jejuni\n                    \n                    is an intestinal commensal of birds and animals and a leading cause of bacterial diarrheal disease in humans. In hosts,\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    primarily resides in the mucus layer atop the lower intestinal epithelium. Persistence in this niche requires a single flagellar motor at both\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    poles that generates high torque for flagellar rotation to facilitate motility and high swimming velocities. Unlike many bacterial flagellates,\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    swimming velocity increases as external viscosity increases. We identified a complex formed by FlgV, VidA, and VidC (Cjj81176_1732) positioned near the MS-ring-rotor junction in the flagellar motor we annotated as the V-ring. Viscosity-influenced growth, modulation of swimming velocity, and transcription of iron/heme acquisition, respiratory, and energy-generating systems were dependent on the V-ring.\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    Δ\n                    flgV\n                    and Δ\n                    vidC\n                    populations lacking a complete V-ring were motile, but could not optimally modulate swimming velocity. Like nonmotile flagellar stator or filament mutants, motile V-ring mutants had in vivo and in vitro growth and viability defects and dysregulated transcription of genes likely impacting physiology. Because the V-ring mutants behaved similarly as nonmotile mutants that experience little to no viscous drag on the filament, we propose\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    V-ring mutants cannot detect viscous drag on their rotating filaments. We propose the V-ring evolved in\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    and potentially other bacteria producing high torque flagellar motors to monitor external viscosity information via viscous drag on the rotating flagellar filament to adjust swimming velocity, transcription, and physiology for optimal fitness in different host lower intestinal niches."},{"t":"共价有机框架中噻吩给体的电子-位阻协同工程实现高效CO₂光转化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5240027?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2还原","kp":["[催化剂载体]: 噻吩富集COF耦合苯并噻二唑"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.0},"as":"研究通过电子效应与空间位阻的协同工程策略，对共价有机框架（COFs）中的噻吩供体进行分子设计优化。在噻吩供体上引入供电子基团并调控空间位阻，增强了可见光吸收、促进了激子解离与电荷迁移，同时优化CO₂吸附位点。该协同策略显著提升了CO₂光还原效率，实现了高效的CO₂光转化。研究为通过供体工程理性设计COF光催化剂提供了系统方法论，对太阳能驱动碳资源化利用具有重要指导意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Synergistic Electronic and Steric Engineering of Thiophene Donors in Covalent Organic Frameworks for Efficient CO2 Photoconversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Covalent organic frameworks (COFs), featuring broad light absorption and permanent porosity, serve as excellent supports for metal catalytic sites in photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction, offering great promise for efficient and stable CO\n                    2\n                    photoconversion. Herein, two rationally designed thiophene‐rich monomers enable the effective coupling of thiophene and benzothiadiazole units within the same COF materials, yielding D–A type COFs with\n                    bex\n                    topological structures (TTB‐COF and TTP‐COF). By modulating the central unit, the intramolecular built‐in electric field is enhanced, and the rotational freedom of thiophene units is also constrained, leading to a wavy structure in the monolayer COF, which significantly improves the material's photocatalytic performance. Using 2,2′‐bipyridine as an additive, TTB‐COF‐Co achieves a high CO production rate of 28.0 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    with a selectivity of 88.4% in the presence of the photosensitizer [Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]Cl\n                    2\n                    ·6H\n                    2\n                    O and the sacrificial agent triethanolamine (TEOA), being one of the best performances among COF‐based catalysts. Analysis of the cumulative free energy change diagrams reveals that TTB‐COF‐Co lowers the energy barrier of the rate‐determining step in CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction, thereby demonstrating superior photocatalytic performance. This work provides a referable design strategy for constructing high‐performance COF‐based photocatalysts for CO\n                    2\n                    reduction."},{"t":"水光互补运行条件下多年调节水库年末消落水位控制策略研究","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008093?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/水电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"水光互补调度","kp":["[年末消落水位]: 水电-光伏协同运行下多年调节水库控制策略"],"sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Study on control strategies of year-end drawdown level in multi-year regulation reservoir under hydro-photovoltaic bundled operation condition"},{"t":"空间双壳层结构通过增强局部碱度实现稳定的阴离子交换膜水电解","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aeb8831?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"阴离子交换膜电解水","kp":["[AEMWE稳定性]: 铈诱导双壳层增强局部碱性"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出一种空间双壳层结构催化剂，通过增强局部碱性实现阴离子交换膜水电解（AEMWE）的稳定运行。该双壳层设计在催化活性位点周围构建富OH⁻微环境，提高局部pH值从而加速析氢/析氧反应动力学并抑制催化剂溶解。在工业级电流密度下，该催化剂表现出优异的活性和长期稳定性，解决了AEMWE中催化层在高电流下衰减快的核心难题。该策略为绿氢规模化制备提供了高效低成本的器件级解决方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Spatial double-shelled structure achieving stable anion exchange membrane water electrolysis via enhanced local alkalinity","b":"Anion exchange membrane water electrolysis (AEMWE) represents a promising technology for green hydrogen production. Although numerous efforts have been devoted to optimize the anode catalysis by structural and chemical modulation, the effectiveness of such strategies in enhancing stability remains limited. Herein, we propose a cerium-induced double-shelled structure formation strategy that modulates the electrode/electrolyte interfacial microenvironment through spatial configuration engineering, effectively suppressing anodic corrosion. Mechanistic studies revealed that the associated nanospace enrichment effect increased the coverage of surface hydroxide ion (OH\n                    −\n                    ) species, thereby enhancing the local alkalinity at the material surface and effectively suppressing ion leaching. The double-shelled cerium dioxide (CeO\n                    2\n                    )/lanthanum cobaltite (LaCoO\n                    3\n                    )-10% catalyst demonstrated outstanding performance in the AEMWE device, achieving an industrial-relevant current density of 3 amperes per square centimeter at 1.88 volts. Furthermore, the catalyst exhibited exceptional long-term stability exceeding 2000 hours under simulated industrial conditions. Our findings underscore the importance of engineering the physical spatial configuration to regulate the interfacial microenvironment, offering a strategy to address the corrosion degradation of anode catalysts."},{"t":"通过连接体构象工程实现含六核锆结点的双链缠绕螺旋金属聚合物单晶","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7176356?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"螺旋金属聚合物","kp":["[材料]: 双股螺旋金属聚合物含六核锆结","[合成策略]: 连接体构象工程"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"研究团队通过配体构象工程成功合成出具有六核锆节点（knots）的双链缠绕螺旋金属聚合物单晶。这类一维螺旋金属聚合物是重要的功能材料，其螺旋拓扑结构与手性特征赋予其在催化、传感、分子识别及手性分离等领域的应用潜力。关键突破在于通过精确调控有机连接体的空间构象，实现了对螺旋拓扑和金属节点排列的定向控制，首次获得高质量单晶结构，为揭示螺旋金属聚合物的构效关系提供了晶体学证据。该工作对推进超分子化学与拓扑材料设计具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Single Crystals of Double‐Stranded, Entwined, Helical Metallopolymers With Hexanuclear Zirconium Knots Achieved by Linker Conformation Engineering","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Synthetic one‐dimensional (1D) helical polymers are an intriguing class of functional materials that have been pursued for decades. Despite numerous reports of single‐stranded helical polymers, the synthesis of double‐stranded, entwined helical polymers with deterministic atomic coordinates remains a significant challenge. Herein, through judicious linker conformation engineering, we target two double‐stranded helical metallopolymer single crystals that consist of robust hexanuclear Zr\n                    6\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (OH)\n                    4\n                    clusters and inherently helical methano‐ or ethano‐Tröger base (TB) scaffolds. The racemic TB linkers undergo spontaneous resolution and narcissistic self‐sorting to from large single crystals of helical metallopolymer conglomerate, which can be rendered homochiral by employing enantiopure TB linkers. Characterization by single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction showed that, the two homochiral strands are bound together through Zr\n                    6\n                    ‐carboxylate knots, which further arrange with respect to\n                    6\n                    1\n                    screw axis to engender 1D hexagonal channels. The resulting chemically stable metallopolymer conglomerates were demonstrated to be capable of catalyzing the normally acidic hydrolysis of orthoformates in basic solution with exceptional reactivity and selectivity, while the homochiral version was shown to be a remarkable chiral fluorescent sensor for amino alcohols. Our work, therefore provides an unparalleled example where linker conformation engineering serves as powerful tool for architecting sophisticated helical polymeric structures and achieving enzyme‐mimic catalysis and recognition."},{"t":"用葡萄糖驱动的共生生物可吸收绷带恢复内源电场以促进糖尿病伤口愈合","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aed9445?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Endogenous electric fields (EFs) are essential for tissue regeneration but are diminished under hyperglycemia conditions, thereby impeding diabetic wound healing. Here, we report a biodegradable, glucose-powered electronic fabric bandage (GEB) that restores wound-edge electrical fields and enables closed-loop wound healing. To avoid compromising clinical applicability, we integrated all components into a soft, lightweight, and breathable bandage design to replace the traditional bulky electrical stimulator design. We also show the universal glucose-powered electricity generation and therapeutic functions of the electronic bandage across species and organs in diabetic wound models. In diabetic mouse wounds, porcine skin defects, and intestinal injury, the bandage uses endogenous glucose for power generation, thereby reducing local glucose levels and restoring the endogenous EF that guided cell migration, reprogrammed macrophage polarization, and promoted angiogenesis, to accelerate wound healing. These findings should establish an “endogenous glucose-powered symbiotic bioelectronics” paradigm for next-generation bioelectronic medicine.","tp":"生物电绷带","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究者开发了一种葡萄糖驱动的可降解生物电子织物绷带(GEB)，用于糖尿病伤口愈合。高血糖条件下内源性电场减弱阻碍组织再生，GEB通过葡萄糖供能恢复伤口边缘电场，实现闭环愈合。所有组件集成于柔软、轻便、透气的绷带设计中，避免了传统笨重电刺激设备的局限。"},{"t":"伊拉克、沙特阿拉伯和西班牙的可再生能源政策分析：使用 HOMER 和记录的系统性能数据进行多维评估","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003654?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"可再生政策","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"通过氨基硅氧烷功能接枝调控环保型纤维素基复合电解质锂离子传导用于可持续锂金属电池","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71171?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纤维素固态电解质","kp":["[电解质]: 纤维素基复合电解质","[改性]: 氨基硅氧烷功能化接枝","[应用]: 锂金属电池"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"研究通过氨基-硅氧烷功能化接枝改性纤维素基底，开发了环保型复合固态电解质，用于可持续锂金属电池。纤维素基电解质因低成本、生物相容性良好被视为有前景的固态电解质候选材料，但其室温离子电导率和锂离子迁移数仍有不足。氨基-硅氧烷官能团引入后，有效调控了锂离子传导路径，提升了离子电导率与界面兼容性，同时抑制锂枝晶生长。该策略兼顾环境友好性与电化学性能，为绿色固态电池的工程化提供了可行路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Regulating Li‐Ions Conduction of Eco‐Friendly Cellulose‐Based Composite Electrolytes via Amino‐Siloxane Functional Grafting for Sustainable Li‐Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cellulose‐based electrolytes are promising solid electrolyte candidates for low‐cost and eco‐friendly batteries owing to their natural characteristics of being renewable and biodegradable. Unfortunately, they have strong reactivity and high crystallinity, leading to critical challenges when used in Li‐ion batteries, including poor high‐voltage tolerance, slow Li‐ion conduction and heterogeneous Li‐ion flux. Here, we report a functional grafting modification to regulate Li‐ion conduction within cellulose‐based solid electrolytes. In‐situ sol‐gel self‐assembly accompanied by amino‐siloxane grafting is developed to achieve the homogeneous integration of cellulose−amino‐siloxane−ionic liquid composites, forming a compact solid‐state electrolyte membrane. Such functional design establishes continuous and uniform Li‐ion transport highways through amino coordination while disrupting native crystallinity of cellulose, endowing a rapid Li‐ion conductivity (1×10\n                    −3\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    ) and a high electrochemical oxidation potential (5 V). The obtained electrolyte membrane features a homogenous microstructure with high mechanical elasticity and thermodynamic stability, exhibiting high compatibility with Li metal and enabling excellent electrochemical performance. Consequently, solid‐state Li‐metal batteries exhibit exceptional cycle‐life, whereas LiFePO\n                    4\n                    cells run 592 cycles and LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    cells run 403 cycles at 0.5 C rate until the capacity reduces to 80%. Notably, a comprehensive life‐cycle assessment verifies its advantages in energy conservation and carbon reduction. It presents a sustainable development of high‐performance cellulose‐based solid‐state electrolytes."},{"t":"基于熵惩罚方法的非线性Hamilton-Jacobi方程粘性解量子算法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607144123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子优化算法","kp":["[量子算法]: 熵惩罚法解非线性H-J方程粘性解"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究提出了一种基于熵惩罚方法的量子算法框架，用于高效求解非线性哈密顿-雅可比（Hamilton-Jacobi）方程的粘性解。哈密顿-雅可比方程广泛出现在最优控制、博弈论和流体力学等问题中，其非线性特征使经典数值方法计算代价高昂。研究者利用量子计算的叠加与纠缠特性，通过熵惩罚将原始非线性问题转化为适合量子线路求解的形式，实现了相较于经典算法的多项式级加速。该框架为量子计算在偏微分方程数值求解领域的应用开辟了新方向。","dp":1,"ot":"Quantum algorithms for viscosity solutions to nonlinear Hamilton–Jacobi equations based on an entropy penalization method","b":"We present a framework for efficient extraction of the viscosity solutions of nonlinear Hamilton–Jacobi equations with convex Hamiltonians. These viscosity solutions play a central role in areas such as front propagation, mean-field games, optimal control, machine learning, and a direct application to the forced Burgers’ equation. Our method is based on an entropy penalization method which generalizes the Cole–Hopf transform from quadratic to general convex Hamiltonians, allowing an approximation of viscous Hamilton–Jacobi dynamics by a discrete-time linear dynamics which approximates a linear heat-like parabolic equation, and thus can also extend to continuous-time dynamics. This makes the method suitable for quantum simulation. The validity of these results hold for arbitrary nonlinearity that correspond to convex Hamiltonians, and for arbitrarily long times, thus obviating a chief obstacle in most quantum algorithms for nonlinear partial differential equations. We provide quantum algorithms—both analog and digital—for extracting pointwise values, gradients, minima, and function evaluations at the minimizer of the viscosity solution, without requiring nonlinear updates or full state reconstruction."},{"t":"基于二次规划的燃煤电厂耦合熔盐储热系统非线性模型预测控制以提升灵活性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008007?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/火电","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"火电熔盐储热控制","kp":["[控制策略]: 二次规划非线性模型预测控制","[集成]: 燃煤电厂耦合熔盐热储能"],"sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Quadratic programming-based nonlinear model predictive control of coal-fired power plant integrated with molten salt thermal storage system for its flexibility improvement"},{"t":"针对高血糖和高尿酸血症代谢性疾病的多器官靶向肽治疗的程序化口服给药","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.aef3323?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Systemic metabolic disorders such as diabetes and hyperuricemia demand multiorgan therapeutic intervention, yet single-target therapies often fail to restore homeostasis. Here, we present an orally administered, multistage-targeted nanoplatform (P1P2NPs) for the sequential delivery of therapeutic peptides to distinct organs. P1P2NPs is composed of a bioresponsive polymer poly(β-amino ester)-disulfide bond-poly(carboxybetaine) (PAE-SS-PCB), 1,2-distearoyl-\n                    sn\n                    -glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine-block poly(carboxybetaine) (DSPE-PCB) and Eudragit L100-55, designed to release peptide P2 (Val-Pro-Tyr-Pro-Gln) in the intestine for dipeptidyl peptidase-IV (DPP-IV) inhibition, while hepatic-targeted peptide P1(Pro-Pro-Lys-Asn-Trp) is selectively liberated in the liver to suppress xanthine oxidase (XOD). Fabricated through sequential emulsification and layer-by-layer assembly, P1P2NPs exhibit spatiotemporal control over drug release, enabling precise modulation of intestinal and hepatic metabolic pathways. In a murine model of diabetic-hyperuricemia comorbidity, the nanoplatform demonstrated synergistic efficacy by normalizing glucose and uric acid levels through multiorgan targeting. This work establishes a paradigm for spatially controlled peptide delivery, offering a versatile strategy for treating complex metabolic diseases.","tp":"多器官给药","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"针对糖尿病和高尿酸血症等多器官代谢疾病，研究者开发了程序化口服多阶段靶向纳米平台(P1P2NPs)，实现治疗肽向不同器官的序贯递送。该平台由氧化还原响应聚合物PAE-SS-PCB构建，克服了单靶点治疗难以恢复代谢稳态的问题，为系统性代谢疾病的精准治疗提供了新策略。"},{"t":"通过机械折纸编码互锁3D剪纸与纳米根锚定AgNWs-In-Ga多相合金导体实现可编程3D光伏器件","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523685?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三维折纸结构光伏","kp":["[3D光伏]: 折纸编程互锁3D剪纸结构","[柔性导体]: 纳米根锚定AgNWs-In-Ga多相合金","[权衡]: 大拉伸率与面积功率输出之间基本矛盾"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究团队利用折纸（Origami）编码的三维剪纸（Kirigami）互锁结构与纳米根锚定的银纳米线-铟-镓多相合金导体，实现了可编程三维光伏器件。三维光伏通过空间化设计最大化光吸收面积，显著提升单位占地面积的光电转换效率。Kirigami折纸结构赋予器件可编程的几何形变能力，使其能适应曲面和动态光照环境；纳米根锚定的合金导体解决了三维结构中导电网络连续性难题。该方案在可穿戴电子、建筑一体化光伏等柔性场景中具有应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Programmable 3D Photovoltaics via Mechanically Origami‐Coded Interlocked 3D Kirigami and Nano‐Root Anchored AgNWs–In–Ga Multiphasic Alloy Conductor","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  3D photovoltaics (3DPVs) are highly promising for next‐generation energy systems, as they maximize space utilization and power output. However, most reported 3DPVs remain unsuitable for deformable applications. When 3DPVs are integrated with mechanically deformable platforms, a fundamental trade‐off emerges: achieving large mechanical stretchability typically leads to a reduction in areal coverage. Here, we present a single‐material, mechanically origami‐coded 3D kirigami platform that enables programmable 3DPVs with unprecedented stretchability and areal coverage. Origami, which transforms 2D geometries into 3D forms, provides an effective structural strategy to overcome the long‐standing trade‐off between stretchability and areal coverage. Leveraging this concept, we introduce an origami‐inspired mechanical coding scheme that embeds programmable folding behavior into the structure. A simple extension–release cycle drives unit folding initiation and full origami activation, achieving ultrahigh stretchability (500%) and initial effective areal coverage (225%), while maintaining stable photovoltaic output under extreme deformation and repeated cycling. To ensure reliable electrical integration, an intrinsically integrable nano‐root anchored AgNWs–In–Ga multiphasic alloy conductor was co‐fabricated with the structure, providing stable conductivity and enabling reversible stack‐and‐connect operation. This approach highlights geometric programmability as a key enabler for freeform photovoltaics, establishing a pathway toward multifunctional 3D energy systems for adaptive devices, and urban energy harvesting."},{"t":"正电化学势在3-硝基苯乙烯热催化加氢中诱导增强的化学选择性与活性","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5569475?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学促进催化加氢","kp":["[电化学催化促进]: 正电势诱导多官能团底物完全化学选择性","[加氢选择性]: 3-硝基苯乙烯热催化加氢实现完全选择性"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究发现施加正电化学电势可显著提升3-硝基苯乙烯热催化加氢反应的化学选择性和催化活性。电化学催化促进（EPOC）效应通过改变催化剂功函数调控表面吸附物种的键合状态，从而在无需改变反应温度和压力的条件下调控产物选择性。对于含硝基和碳碳双键的多官能团底物，选择性还原硝基而保留双键是关键挑战。研究表明正电势条件下催化剂电子结构优化，促进了硝基的优先活化，为电势调控的多相催化选择性问题提供了机理认识与工程策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Positive Electrochemical Potentials Induce Enhanced Chemoselectivity and Activity in the Thermocatalytic Hydrogenation of 3‐Nitrostyrene","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Electrochemical promotion of catalysis is emerging as a powerful approach to control chemical reactions externally without complex catalyst modification, but this has mostly been used for substrates with a single reactive group so far. Herein, we demonstrate that this approach can induce full chemoselectivity in catalytic transformations of substrates with multiple functional groups. Specifically, we show that application of a positive electrochemical potential during the thermocatalytic hydrogenation (TCH) of 3‐nitrostyrene exclusively delivered one single product, 1‐ethyl‐3‐nitrobenzene, with six‐fold enhanced yield, while a complex product mixture was obtained at open circuit voltage. These effects resulted from the combined effects of a positive electrode polarization and acidification of the bulk solution through a concurrent hydrogen oxidation reaction (HOR). Surface‐enhanced infrared absorption spectroscopy and kinetic experiments showed that the positive polarization optimized the surface concentrations of reactants and the adsorption properties of 3‐nitrostyrene and hydrogenation products. Validation with additional reactants and catalyst implies a possible broader relevance of our findings beyond the initial system of 3‐nitrostyrene hydrogenation. Overall, our work provides fundamental insight into the effects of electrode polarization on thermal hydrogenation reactions and opens new opportunities to use electrochemical promotion to control chemoselectivity and activity."},{"t":"从三种代表性电压曲线中挖掘物理信息以实现锂离子电池高保真数字化建模","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008548?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂电池数字建模","kp":["[数字建模]: 三条代表性电压曲线挖掘物理信息"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Physical information mining from three-representative voltage curves for high-fidelity digital modeling of lithium-ion batteries"},{"t":"巴基斯坦对光伏组件加征销售税、对电池和逆变器提高关税","d":"2026-06-11","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/10/pakistan-targets-solar-sector-with-higher-sales-tax-on-modules-increased-duties-on-batteries-and-inverters/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"政策监管","tp":"巴基斯坦光伏税收","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":8.5},"as":"巴基斯坦在新预算中计划大幅提高太阳能组件的销售税，并增加电池和逆变器的进口关税。此举引发了该国太阳能行业的强烈反对，业界呼吁在税率上调前重新审视政策影响。巴基斯坦近年来分布式光伏装机快速增长，居民和企业大量依赖进口组件和储能设备。加税将直接推高系统成本，可能抑制已形成规模的分布式太阳能市场发展，同时也可能鼓励本地制造业。该政策反映了发展中国家在促进本土光伏制造与维持设备进口可及性之间的两难博弈。","dp":1,"ot":"Pakistan targets solar sector with higher sales tax on modules, increased duties on batteries and inverters - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nSolar industry campaigns against tax on panels and inverters ahead of proposed hike in budget. Calls for abolition of customs duties on batteries and inverters. The PSA has warned more action is needed to support battery energy storage system (BESS) deployment in a market where solar’s share of the energy mix has grown rapidly.\nMatthew Lynas\nMarkets & Policy\nAsia-Pacific\nEnergy Storage\nUtility-scale\nBusinesses in Pakistan with capital have been quick to invest in solar, according to Wateen Energy Solutions. | Image: Wateen Energy Solutions\nPakistan’s solar industry association has launched a campaign to protest a potential hike in the general sales tax applied to solar panels in the country, while calling for the abolition of a raft of taxes and duties to support further PV and battery storage deployment.\nThe Pakistan Solar Association (PSA) has launched its ‘Stop the Sun Tax’ campaign ahead of a 2026/2027 government budget which could see higher tax and duties applied to renewables products.\nSolar panels in Pakistan are currently subject to a 10% general sales tax (GST), a rate already opposed by the PSA when it was introduced in 2025, but now the government is considering hiking this to 18% in its next budget.\nThis in combination with existing import duties on some solar and battery storage equipment is hindering electrification in Pakistan according to the PSA, at a time when the association argues the country should be reducing exposure to fossil fuel imports.\nThe association has three main demands. PSA wants to see the government abolish GST on solar panels and inverters; to remove import duties on batteries and inverters – unless part of a strategic initiative to support local manufacturing; and has called more stability in the tax regime for solar and batteries.\nPSA President Waqas Moosa told\nthat the association is lobbying through three main channels in its campaign to reduce the tax burden on Pakistan’s solar sector. PSA will engage in direct approach with the government and regulators, is reaching out to the business community through various industry associations, and is allying with non-government organizations and think thanks “who have similar objectives.”\nMoosa added that the PSA is continuing to push for recognition of a BESS emergency in Pakistan and noted there is willingness from international suppliers to support deployment.\n“There is an appetite, at least among Chinese giants, to invest in the Pakistani market and it shows the future potential of the Pakistani market,” Moosa told\nThe PSA president – who is also CEO of Lahore-based developer Hadron Solar– added that to attract more investment in battery storage in Pakistan, the country must answer four key questions: where projects should be sited, what the technical specifications will be, how tariffs will compensate BESS projects, and how projects can be financed.\n“We need to work on all four tracks simultaneously and to target to have the required policies roughly aligned by the end of 2026.” Moosa said. “PSA has started some work on a couple of the areas, but there needs to be a lot of work done. We hope many partners will join in once they see we are able to align stakeholders for a unified clear strategy.”\nSolar adoption in Pakistan has soared in recent years, with Renewables First estimating more than 50 GW of modules had been imported as of September 2025, with 6.1 GW installed as net metering installations, between 16.5 GW and 26.4 GW in deployed behind the meter, and 780 MW as part of utility-scale projects. Between 17.3 GW and 27.2 GW of solar capacity may still have been stockpiled or not-yet deployed in late 2025 according to the Islamabad-based think tank.\nDespite soaring adoption, Pakistan’s energy regulator, the government and solar industry have had a tumultuous 2026 as policy changes have been put forward then rowed back. An attempt to\nretroactively adjust net metering rates\npaid to customers with existing contracts sparked an industry and public outcry, leading to intervention from the Prime Minister to overturn the move.\nPakistan’s budget for the next financial year has not yet been finalized – the industry campaign continues.\nMatthew Lynas\nView author posts"},{"t":"有机异质结中分子级界面接触的多尺度活性位点调控实现高效光催化析氢","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71172?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机异质结光催化产氢","kp":["[光催化析氢]: 有机异质结分子级界面接触","[合成方法]: 冰模板辅助光化学还原策略","[活性位点]: 多尺度活性位点工程"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究通过分子级界面接触的有机异质结多尺度活性位点调控，实现了高效光催化析氢反应。有机光催化剂驱动的太阳能水分解制绿氢具有商业化潜力，但光生载流子的复合损失和活性位点不足制约了产氢效率。研究设计了具有分子级紧密界面接触的有机异质结，缩短了电荷转移路径，并通过多尺度工程在界面和体相同时引入高效催化位点。该策略有效促进了光生电子-空穴分离与迁移，显著提升了可见光下的析氢速率，为有机光催化制氢走向实用提供了思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Multiscale Active Site Modulation in Organic Heterojunction with Molecular‐Level Interfacial Contact for Efficient Photocatalytic Hydrogen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The commercialization of green hydrogen production through organic photocatalyst‐promoted solar water splitting for hydrogen evolution is limited by inefficient charge separation and sluggish interfacial kinetics. Herein, this problem is addressed using an ice template–assisted photochemical reduction strategy that integrates molecular‐level interfacial contact between a trefoil‐shaped donor–acceptor molecule (DTAB) and ultrathin carbon nitride nanosheets (UCNS) with Cu single atoms (SAs) anchoring and Pt nanodots (NDs) deposition. The intimate interface in the resulting DTAB–UCNS/CuPt photocatalyst generates a built‐in electric field promoting the separation of photogenerated carriers. The DTAB harvests visible light and injects electrons into UCNS, with these electrons subsequently funneled to Pt NDs via Cu SAs. The electronic coupling between Cu SAs and Pt NDs affects the position of the Pt\n                    d\n                    ‐band, thus optimizing the H* adsorption/desorption equilibrium and enhancing surface reaction kinetics. The hydrogen evolution rate of DTAB–UCNS/CuPt (261.16 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) is 248.7 times higher than that of UCNS/Pt (1.05 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) and ranks among the highest reported for carbon nitride–based photocatalysts under comparable conditions, highlighting the strong potential of our strategy to advance photocatalytic hydrogen evolution toward practical green hydrogen production."},{"t":"船舶多能源混合推进系统多目标优化选型及可行性与敏感性分析","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600841X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"船舶混合推进","kp":["[优化方法]: 多能混合推进系统多目标尺寸优化"],"sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Multi-objective sizing optimization of shipboard multi-energy hybrid propulsion systems with feasibility and sensitivity analysis"},{"t":"分子N型掺杂实现微腔集成OLED低阈值纳秒激光发射，迈向电泵浦有机激光器","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5388345?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体激光掺杂","kp":["[OLED激光器]: 分子N型掺杂实现低阈值纳秒激光","[微腔集成]: 微腔集成OLED","[激光特性]: 低阈值纳秒级脉冲"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过分子N型掺杂技术，在微腔集成的OLED中实现了低阈值纳秒级激光发射，向电泵浦有机激光器迈出关键一步。有机半导体激光器具有波长可调和柔性化优势，但电泵浦有机激光长期受限于高激射阈值和载流子诱导吸收损耗。N型掺杂有效提升了电子注入效率，降低了器件工作电压和激射阈值；微腔结构增强了光与增益介质的相互作用。纳秒级激射的实现对推进柔性光源和片上光互连技术具有重要价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Molecular N‐Type Doping Unlocks Low‐Threshold Nanosecond Lasing in a Microcavity‐Integrated OLED Toward Electrically Pumped Organic Lasers","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic semiconductors are attractive for the development of flexible, wavelength‐tunable lasers. However, most reported organic micro/nanolasers rely on femtosecond‐pulsed optical pumping, which is impractical for real‐world applications. This limitation has urged the pursuit of electrically pumped organic lasers; yet their realization remains a long‐standing challenge primarily due to a fundamental materials dilemma, in which high‐gain organic semiconductors often suffer from poor, unbalanced charge transport. Here, we demonstrate that this intrinsic trade‐off can be effectively alleviated through a molecular doping strategy. Employing a high‐gain spirofluorene derivative as the emissive layer, we introduce an n‐type doped layer to construct an organic light‐emitting diode (OLED), achieving more balanced charge transport while preserving outstanding optical gain. Consequently, singlet‐polaron annihilation is significantly suppressed, as evidenced by reduced efficiency roll‐off and electrically pumped transient absorption measurements. When integrated with a distributed feedback (DFB) resonator, the resulting device exhibits ultra‐narrow (∼2 nm) electroluminescence under pulsed current injections and delivers low‐threshold nanosecond lasing under an optical–electrical co‐pumping configuration, thereby demonstrating a practical architecture for implementing organic laser diodes. Our work provides a general strategy to overcome the intrinsic paradox where high‐gain organic semiconductors struggle to maintain balanced charge transport, illuminating a pathway toward light amplification under electrical excitation."},{"t":"调控NiV层状双氢氧化物微球中Ni-O-V桥键用于1,5-戊二醇氧化与硝酸盐还原的高效电催化耦合","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5292155?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化偶联","kp":["[催化剂]: NiV层状双氢氧化物微球","[活性位点]: Ni-O-V桥结构工程化","[耦合反应]: 1,5-戊二醇氧化与硝酸盐还原双通道"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究通过调控NiV层状双氢氧化物（LDH）微球中的Ni-O-V桥键，实现了1,5-戊二醇氧化与硝酸根还原的稳健电催化耦合系统。生物质衍生多元醇的阳极氧化替代传统析氧反应，可同时获得高附加值化学品和降低能耗；阴极硝酸根还原则将废水氮污染物转化为氨。Ni-O-V桥键的精准调控优化了活性位点的电子结构，提升了双向催化活性和选择性。该共电解系统将废物资源化与化学品合成相结合，为电催化驱动的绿色化工提供了高效方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Modulating Ni‐O‐V Bridges in NiV‐Layered Double Hydroxides Microspheres for Robust Electrocatalytic Coupling of 1,5‐Pentanediol Oxidation and Nitrate Reduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The co‐electrolysis system that couples anodic oxidation of biomass‐derived polyols with cathodic nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    RR) represents a promising strategy for biomass valorization and treatment of high‐salinity wastewater. Here, we synthesize thin NiV‐layered double hydroxides (NiV‐LDHs) microspheres featuring engineered Ni‐O‐V bridge structures as dual‐channel electrocatalysts. The newly constructed Ni‐O‐V bridges confirmed by x‐ray absorption spectroscopy effectively modulate the electronic structures of both Ni and V sites. This synergistic enhancement boosts the performance of both anodic 1,5‐pentanediol electrooxidation to produce glutaric acid (GA) and NO\n                    3\n                    RR to ammonia. The NiV‐LDHs anode enables electrolysis at a low cell voltage of 1.5 V versus RHE, exhibiting a GA Faradaic efficiency of 98.5% and a high GA yield of 2.56 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    . Operando studies and density functional theory reveal that the strong electronic coupling within NiV‐LDHs optimizes the competitive adsorption between 1,5‐pentanediol and OH* on the catalyst surface. Moreover, the NiV‐LDHs cathode exhibits outstanding NO\n                    3\n                    RR performance, achieving a high ammonia yield of 2.28 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    with a Faradaic efficiency of 96.1%, surpassing most reported electrocatalysts. A continuous paired electrolysis operation over 240 h successfully produced GA (55.98 g) and NH\n                    4\n                    Cl (23.48 g) powders, demonstrating great potential for industrial application."},{"t":"海洋种群遗传推论揭示了原生生物比古质体（植物）和后生动物（动物）更强的海洋结构","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.science.org/doi/abs/10.1126/sciadv.adz7158?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"AAAS: Science Advances: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"While the biogeographic patterns of animals and plants are well defined, the distribution of the microbial eukaryotic world remains contentious. Classically, protists were assumed to be cosmopolitan, dispersing everywhere with little geographic constraint. We tested this hypothesis by compiling 88 marine cytochrome oxidase subunit I metabarcoding studies to perform a global population-genetic analysis. We uncovered a fundamental biogeographic divide: most animal (Metazoa) and plant (Archaeplastida) phyla have haplotype diversity that is strictly concentrated within specific ocean basins, while most protist phyla share identical haplotypes across multiple, distant oceans. The combination of large geographic ranges with moderate among-ocean genetic differentiation in protists is inconsistent with strict historical cosmopolitanism and is compatible with high connectivity and range expansion dynamics, including, but not limited to, recent colonization events. Our findings provide a unified population-genetic perspective on marine eukaryotic biogeography and refine current views of microbial dispersal at ocean-basin scales."},{"t":"脓毒症中红细胞唾液酸的丢失破坏了抑制性 Siglec 相互作用，导致中性粒细胞过度激活和 NET 扩散","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536989123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Systemic inflammation is accompanied by overwhelming neutrophil activation, resulting in extensive formation of neutrophil extracellular traps (NETs). Although NETs are beneficial for pathogen entrapment, they become detrimental; therefore, their endogenous regulation is pivotal for survival. In this context, the observation that healthy individuals’ red blood cells (RBCs) can inhibit NET formation induced by lipopolysaccharide (LPS)-primed neutrophils is noteworthy. However, during systemic inflammation, NET formation in the vasculature is robust despite constant neutrophil exposure to RBCs. Herein, we reveal that for RBCs and neutrophils from septic individuals, but not from those with local inflammation, interactions cease and NET inhibition is abolished. This is observed even if only one cell type originates from an inflamed individual, and occurs in both human and murine cells. Moreover, 6 to 10 d post–sepsis induction (mice) or diagnosis (humans), during the resolution of inflammation, interactions are restored and hence fail during the critical stages of inflammation. Mechanistically, this is not due to passive LPS absorption by RBCs, which would limit its availability for neutrophils. In contrast, the cessation of NET inhibition is due to inflammation-induced RBC desialylation (removal of α2,3-linked sialic acids) and decreased expression of inhibitory Siglec-E/9 and -G, but not Siglec-F/5, on neutrophils. Accordingly, concurrent addition of exogenous polysialic acid (PolySia) and pharmacologically controlled accumulation of Siglec molecules on neutrophils preserves the ability of erythrocytes to inhibit PAD4-dependent NET formation upon interaction with neutrophils of endotoxemic mice. These findings open avenues for clinically controlling NET formation during systemic inflammation, given the abundance of erythrocytes in the blood."},{"t":"介电工程化共价有机框架中基于纳米限域差异界面摩擦的离子选择性输运与分区化学环境","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73670?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质离子传输","kp":["[固态电解质]: 分区化学环境共价有机框架(SCE-COF)","[离子选择性]: 纳米限域差异界面摩擦调控","[介电工程]: 介电工程化COF"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究设计了一种介电工程化的共价有机框架（COF），利用纳米限域差分界面摩擦实现离子选择性传输。固态电解质需同时满足高离子电导率、优异离子选择性和良好机械稳定性，但三者往往难以兼顾。该COF材料通过分段化化学环境构建了非对称离子传输通道，介电工程调控了通道内壁的静电势分布，使不同离子在纳米限域空间中经历差异化的界面摩擦力。该设计实现了锂离子的优先传输和高迁移数，为高性能固态电池电解质的结构设计提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Ion‐Selective Transport via Nanoconfined Differential Interfacial Friction in a Dielectric‐Engineered Covalent Organic Framework With Sectionalized Chemical Environments","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) that concurrently deliver high ionic conductivity, excellent ion selectivity, and robust electrochemical/thermal stability remains a central challenge for safe, high‐energy‐density solid‐state batteries (SSBs). Here, an all‐solid‐state covalent organic framework electrolyte with sectionalized chemical environments (SCE‐COF) is reported, constructed via nanoconfined copolymerization of a highly dielectric monomer within COF nanochannels. The resulting architecture affords a nano‐confined molecular interface that integrates electron‐rich polar short chains that form abundant Li\n                    +\n                    hopping sites with electron‐deficient pore‐wall regions that immobilize anions through specific hydrogen‐bonding interactions, thereby enabling efficient and differential ion transport decoupled from strongly bonded solvation cage and polymer segmental motion. Benefiting from these synergistic effects, SCE‐COF achieves ionic conductivity of 1.05 × 10\n                    −3\n                     S cm\n                    −1\n                    at 30°C, a high Li\n                    +\n                    transference number of 0.73 and a wide electrochemical window (4.87 V vs Li\n                    +\n                    /Li). Finally, all‐solid‐state full cells employing SCE‐COF deliver a high specific energy density of 442.0 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    under a controlled lithium source at ambient temperature."},{"t":"界面介导结晶实现无PEDOT:PSS全钙钛矿叠层电池效率达29.1%且耐久性增强","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00185-6?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Joule","tg":"研究论文","tp":"全钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["转换效率[全钙钛矿叠层]: 29.1%","[界面工程]: 吩噻嗪界面替代PEDOT:PSS"],"sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":7.5,"r":5.5,"d":8.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"该研究通过界面介导结晶策略，用吩噻嗪官能化界面替代吸湿性PEDOT:PSS层，实现了PEDOT:PSS-free的全钙钛矿叠层太阳能电池，效率达29.1%且耐久性显著提升。全钙钛矿叠层电池将宽禁带和窄禁带钙钛矿子电池串联，理论效率潜力高，但PEDOT:PSS空穴传输层的吸湿性和不稳定性导致亚稳相偏析和界面退化。吩噻嗪界面层有效调控了钙钛矿结晶过程，抑制了相偏析，改善了界面接触与电荷抽取。该成果在效率和稳定性双重维度上推进了全钙钛矿叠层电池的实用化。","dp":1,"ot":"Interface-mediated crystallization enables PEDOT:PSS-free all-perovskite tandems with 29.1% efficiency and enhanced durability","b":"Replacing hygroscopic PEDOT:PSS with a phenothiazine-functionalized interface suppresses metastable phase segregation and directs Sn-Pb perovskite crystallization. A dual-anchor interlayer can form a robust interconnection in tandem devices. The PEDOT:PSS-free monolithic all-perovskite tandem achieves a record efficiency of 29.1% and long-term stability, demonstrating that precise interface design simultaneously enables high efficiency and durability."},{"t":"界面诱导内建磁场增强自旋交换作用实现高效氧电催化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00163-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧电催化","kp":["[氧电催化]: 反铁磁/铁磁异质结构界面内建磁场","[自旋调控]: 无外场量子自旋交换控制自旋依赖反应","[机制]: 界面内建磁场对齐电子自旋"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究通过构建反铁磁/铁磁异质结构，在界面处引入内置磁场，增强自旋交换相互作用，实现了高效氧电催化。氧析出反应（OER）和氧还原反应（ORR）是金属-空气电池和燃料电池的关键反应，但四电子转移过程动力学缓慢。界面内置磁场通过塞曼效应调控了反应中间体的自旋态，促进自旋守恒的电子转移路径，降低反应能垒。该自旋电催化策略不依赖贵金属，为高效非铂族氧电催化材料的设计提供了磁性调控新维度，具有重要的电化学能源转换应用价值。","dp":1,"ot":"Interface-induced built-in magnetic field boosted spin exchange interactions to enable high-efficiency oxygen electrocatalysis","b":"Engineered antiferromagnetic/ferromagnetic heterostructures generate an interfacial built-in magnetic field that aligns electron spins, an effect that enables external field-free control of spin-dependent oxygen electrocatalysis via rapid quantum spin exchange interactions. This strategy enhances oxygen evolution activity and reveals the critical role of spin polarization in governing reaction process; thus, it offers a general design principle for efficient energy conversion materials."},{"t":"能源政策如何支持全球南方国家的公正转型？南非可再生能源采购的见解","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003770?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"能源公正转型","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"高可再生能源渗透下电网级储能的精细化选址与定容：一种两阶段元启发式方法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007889?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能选址定容","kp":["[储能选址定容]: 两阶段元启发法优化高可再生能源输电网"],"sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"High-resolution siting and sizing of grid-scale energy storage for real-world transmission networks under high renewable penetration: a two-stage metaheuristic approach"},{"t":"GREM1/FGFR1激活的肌成纤维细胞诱导免疫抑制并加速高级别浆液性卵巢癌的转移","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529786123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Joint effect of cancer-associated fibroblasts (CAFs) and regulatory T cells (Tregs) can drive immunosuppression in high-grade serous ovarian cancer (HGSOC), thereby promoting tumor metastasis and limiting the clinical benefit of PD-1/PD-L1 blockade. However, the mechanistic crosstalk between CAFs and Tregs remains unclear. By integrating bulk RNA-seq, single-cell RNA-seq datasets, and spatial transcriptomics datasets with functional assays, we identified a population of TGF-β1-driven Gremlin1 (GREM1)\n                    +\n                    myofibroblastic CAFs (myCAFs) enriched in HGSOC metastatic lesions. These GREM1\n                    +\n                    myCAFs activated the FGFR1-MAPKs-NFκB-TDO2-kynurenine axis via autocrine signaling, promoting tumor growth, metastasis, and immune evasion characterized by the infiltration of CD4\n                    +\n                    Tregs and dysfunctional CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells. GREM1 knockdown suppressed tumor metastasis, restored antitumor T cells response, remodeled CAF subtype composition and potentiated anti-PD-1 therapy efficacy. This study highlights the pro-metastatic role of GREM1\n                    +\n                    myCAFs across multiple tumors and provides a rationale for combining anti-PD-1 therapy for metastatic HGSOC."},{"t":"质子辅助吸附演化法将氟掺杂RuO2锚定于TiO2实现酸性析氧反应高效稳定","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9750153?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"析氧电催化剂","kp":["催化剂[酸性OER]: F掺杂RuO₂/TiO₂","[合成方法]: 质子辅助吸附演化法"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究通过质子辅助吸附演化策略，将氟掺杂的RuO₂锚定在TiO₂载体上，制备出高效稳定的酸性析氧反应（OER）电催化剂。氟掺杂调控了RuO₂的电子结构，优化含氧中间体的吸附能；TiO₂载体提供强金属-载体相互作用，抑制Ru在酸性条件下的溶解流失。该催化剂在质子交换膜水电解等酸性介质中展现出优异的活性和长效稳定性。","dp":1,"ot":"Fluorine‐Doped RuO2 Anchored on TiO2 via Proton‐Assisted Adsorption Evolution for Efficient and Stable Oxygen Evolution Reaction in Acid","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Although RuO\n                    2\n                    theoretically has superior oxygen evolution reaction (OER) activity and a relatively lower price than IrO\n                    2\n                    , balancing its activity and stability remains a significant challenge. The electronic structure of Ru centers plays a critical role in balancing the activity and durability of RuO\n                    2\n                    ‐based electrocatalysts for OER. This study developed an F‐doped RuO\n                    2\n                    loaded on TiO\n                    2\n                    (F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    ) to construct a Ru–O–Ti interface platform for electronegativity‐mediated charge redistribution. F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    exhibited excellent OER activity and superior durability, operating stably for 660 h and 253 h at 100 and 200 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively. A proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer assembled using F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    required only 1.57 and 1.68 V at 0.5 and 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively, and operated stably for 300 and 100 h, respectively. Both experimental and theoretical calculations showed that the high electronegativity of F enhances the Ru–O covalency, thereby accelerating the deprotonation of *OOH through the proton‐assisted adsorption evolution mechanism (PA‐AEM). Simultaneously, the dynamic charge redistribution established between Ru–O–Ti allowed TiO\n                    2\n                    to buffer charge fluctuations at Ru sites, thus further effectively mitigating over‐oxidation. These findings underscore the importance of electronegativity‐regulated proton‐transfer kinetics for stabilizing RuO\n                    2\n                    ."},{"t":"通过光辅助准粒子隧穿至超导岛实现单微波光子的快速连续探测","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/mj91-ntm4","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微波光子探测","kp":["[检测机制]: 光辅助准粒子隧穿至超导岛","[应用]: 单微波光子连续快速探测"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"研究提出一种基于光辅助准粒子隧穿至超导岛的新机制，实现了单个微波光子的快速连续探测。当单个微波光子入射超导岛时，通过光辅助效应打破库珀对产生准粒子，准粒子隧穿至邻近电极被检测，实现单光子分辨。该方案突破了传统光子探测器效率低、响应慢的瓶颈，在量子通信和量子计算中的微波光子探测领域具有重要应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Fast and Continuous Detection of Single Microwave Photons via Photoassisted Quasiparticle Tunneling to a Superconducting Island","b":"Author(s): J. Basset, O. Stanisavljević, J. Gabelli, M. Aprili, and J. EstèveA new mechanism for the detection of individual propagating microwave photons that realizes a microwave analogue of the photoelectric effect could be used for practical applications in quantum information and dark matter search.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 237001] Published Wed Jun 10, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"不确定性下绿色数据中心能效感知任务调度：一种结构压缩谱风险控制方法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007890?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"数据中心节能调度","kp":["[结构压缩谱风险控制]: 不确定性下绿色数据中心节能调度"],"sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Energy-aware job scheduling for green data centers under uncertainty: A structure-compressed spectral risk control approach"},{"t":"PbTiO3中通过隐藏极性-声学耦合实现应变梯度和90°畴壁的电学切换","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/yhk9-qf8c","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电应变梯度调控","kp":["材料[应变梯度电学开关]: PbTiO₃","[耦合机制]: 隐匿极性-声学耦合"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究在PbTiO₃铁电材料中发现了一种隐藏的极性-声学耦合机制，可通过电场切换应变梯度和90°畴壁。该耦合利用铁电极化与声学声子之间的隐藏相互作用，在非传统路径上实现应变梯度的电控翻转。这一发现扩展了铁电材料中可控自由度的范围，为纳米级应变工程、柔性电子器件和新一代存储技术提供了全新的物理基础和操控手段。","dp":1,"ot":"Electrical Switching of Strain Gradients and 90° Domain Walls via Hidden Polar-Acoustic Coupling in ${\\mathrm{PbTiO}}_{3}$","b":"Author(s): Yajun Zhang, Konstantin Shapovalov, Xu He, Chang Liu, Huadong Yong, Xingyi Zhang, Jie Wang, Kun Zhou, and Philippe GhosezAlthough strain gradients hold great promise for tailoring emergent functionalities, their flexible global control remains a fundamental challenge. Here, we address this concern in ${\\mathrm{PbTiO}}_{3}$ under biaxial tensile strain by uncovering the spontaneous appearance of strain gradients and 90…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236101] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"适配体工程化限域反应微环境双单原子催化剂用于时空可控选择性转化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73645?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双单原子催化剂","kp":["催化剂[时空选择性转化]: Apt-Au₁-Fe₁/NC双单原子","[设计策略]: 适配体仿酶区室化控制中间体"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究设计了一种双单原子催化剂，利用适配体工程构建受限反应微环境，实现对短寿命反应中间体的时空可控选择性转化。双单原子位点分别催化不同步骤，适配体的分子识别功能将底物精确限制在活性位点附近，抑制副反应。该策略突破了非均相催化中活性中间体难以调控的瓶颈，在精细化学品合成和生物传感领域展现出应用潜力。","dp":1,"ot":"Dual‐Single‐Atom Catalyst with Aptamer‐Engineered Confined Reactive Milieu for Spatiotemporally Controlled Selective Conversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Spatiotemporal control of short‐lived reactive intermediates remains a central challenge in heterogeneous catalysis, as non‐selective diffusion fundamentally limits efficiency in complex media. Inspired by enzymatic compartmentalization, we report an aptamer‐functionalized Au‐Fe dual‐single‐atom catalyst (Apt‐Au\n                    1\n                    ‐Fe\n                    1\n                    /NC) that mimics nature's precision by integrating atomically dispersed Au‐Fe sites with a genetically engineered recognition element. This material design creates a “smart reactive pocket” featuring two synergistic interfaces: the Au‐Fe heteronuclear pair electronically modulates the\n                    d\n                    ‐band center to lock the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) into a highly selective 3‐electron pathway with a lowered energy barrier (0.424 eV), while the grafted aptamer acts as a molecular gatekeeper for substrate pre‐enrichment. The resulting architecture achieves exceptional selectivity (87.0%–92.6%) for specific targets while suppressing non‐specific mineralization to below 5.3%—a stark contrast to conventional systems where selectivity is negligible and mineralization exceeds 90%. Mechanistically, the synergistic electronic interaction ensures localized ·OH generation, while the aptamer enforces a strict “proximity effect,” confining these radicals within the nanoscale space for instantaneous consumption by captured substrates. By imposing biological recognition‐based spatial constraints on inorganic active centers, this work establishes a universal paradigm for decoupling activity from selectivity, enabling precision chemical conversion in complex matrices."},{"t":"双面机械互锁实现柔性电子中韧性创纪录的软-硬导电界面","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73649?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性导电界面","kp":["界面策略[柔性电子]: 双面机械互锁","关键材料[界面]: 导电织物骨架","[性能]: 界面韧性创纪录"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对柔性电子中聚合物电极与金属元件之间界面韧性不足的问题，提出一种双面机械互锁策略构建软-硬导电界面。通过在界面两侧构筑微纳级互锁结构，实现界面应力的有效分散和裂纹扩展的偏转，使界面韧性达到创纪录的高值。该方法兼具高导电性和优异耐疲劳性，显著提升了柔性电子器件在反复弯曲拉伸下的界面可靠性。","dp":1,"ot":"Double‐Sided Mechanical Interlocking Enables Soft‐Rigid Conductive Interfaces With a Record High Toughness for Flexible Electronics","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The pronounced mismatch between polymeric electrodes and metallic components hinders the formation of robust electrical contacts. While most approaches rely on chemical design to strengthen interfacial interactions, we present a double‐sided mechanical interlocking strategy that provides both stability and adaptability. A conductive fabric scaffold bridges polymers and metals, with adhesives sequentially applied to both sides. The adhesive infiltrates and encapsulates scaffold fibers, forming a thread–hole adhesion that can only be disrupted by bulk failure. This mechanism achieves a record high interfacial toughness of 730 J m\n                    −\n                    2\n                    between conductive elastomer and copper using commercial silver pastes. Peeling tests show delamination occurs between silver paste and copper, indicating even higher toughness could be obtained with better‐performing products of conductive adhesive. Notably, the interface stability surpasses that of the electrode itself, remaining intact even when the electrode fails. The design is broadly compatible with elastomeric or hydrogel matrices and with diverse commercial adhesives. It enables the construction of reliable epidermal electronics and hydrogel‐based devices. Overall, this interlocking strategy provides a versatile platform for integrating soft and rigid conductors in hybrid electronic systems."},{"t":"不对称基元引发的放电触发电子离域抑制锰基层状氧化物的Jahn-Teller畸变","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE03005J","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池锰基正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: Mn基层状氧化物阴离子氧化活性","[稳定机制]: MMCT抑制Jahn-Teller畸变"],"sc":7.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对钠离子电池锰基层状氧化物正极中Jahn-Teller畸变导致的结构退化问题，研究提出通过非对称基元设计触发放电过程中的电子离域，有效抑制Mn³⁺引起的Jahn-Teller效应。非对称排列促进了Mn-O键的电子均匀分布，减轻晶格畸变，显著提升正极材料的循环稳定性和容量保持率。该策略为高能量密度钠离子电池正极的理性设计提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Discharge-Triggered Electronic Delocalization via Asymmetric Motifs Suppresses Jahn-Teller Distortion in Mn-Based Layered Oxides","b":"Mn-based layered oxide cathodes with anionic redox activity are promising candidates for sodium-ion batteries (SIBs) owing to their high operating voltage and energy density.However, the inevitable Mn 3+ generation after cycles results in severe Jahn-Teller distortion, damaging the long cycling stability of the cathodes. Herein, we present a metal-to-metal charge transfer (MMCT) mechanism that acts at the end of discharge to inhibit the generation of Mn 3+ , thereby improving the structural sustainability of the electrode. A P2-Na 0.69 Li 0.23 Ru 0.17 Mn 0.6 O 2 cathode is selected as a model. The doping of highly electronegative Ru regulates the covalency of asymmetrical Mn-O-Ru, ensuring the electron transfer between Mn 3+ and Ru 4+ , which reduces Mn 3+ content and mitigates the Jahn-Teller distortion.As a result, the electrode shows a robust structural stability with a minimal unit cell volume change of only 0.2%. Moreover, the cathode exhibits excellent electrochemical performance, maintaining capacity retention of over 90% after 900 cycles at 2-4.3 V. The findings provide fresh insights for inhibiting the Jahn-Teller effect, offering a new paradigm for the application of Mn-based layered cathodes with high energy density for sustainable SIBs."},{"t":"能源与电力系统中的数字孪生：架构、应用、使能工具及公用事业级实施路线图","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007816?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源系统数字孪生","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Digital Twins in energy and power systems: architectures, applications, enabling tools, and actionable roadmap for utility-scale implementation"},{"t":"可再生能源与制氢系统耦合优化策略：基于VSEL框架的综述","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008639?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源制氢","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.5,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":2.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Coupling optimization strategies for renewable energy and hydrogen production systems: A review based on the VSEL framework"},{"t":"硫化聚苯胺中铜定制d-p-π多轨道耦合实现水系硫电池超长循环","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00230-4?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硫化聚苯胺正极","kp":["正极[水系硫电池]: 铜修饰硫化聚苯胺","电子耦合[正极]: d-p-π多轨道","负极: 锌","器件形态: 软包电池"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"as":"针对水系硫电池中硫反应动力学缓慢和多硫化物穿梭效应的限制，研究在硫化聚苯胺中引入铜tailored的d-p-π多轨道耦合机制。铜位点与硫物种之间的多轨道杂化加速了氧化还原反应动力学，同时硫化聚苯胺骨架有效锚定多硫化物抑制穿梭。该正极材料在水系硫电池中实现了超长循环寿命，为高安全低成本储能体系提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Copper-tailored d-p-π multi-orbital coupling in sulfurized polyaniline enables ultralong cycling aqueous sulfur batteries","b":"The practical application of sulfur-based batteries is severely limited by factors such as slow reaction kinetics and structural collapse. This work successfully constructs a highly conductive and stable copper-modified sulfide polyaniline cathode by introducing d-p-π multi-orbital coupling using copper. Coupled with a Zn anode, the pouch cell delivers stable power output under harsh conditions, offering a new orbital engineering route for durable sulfur-based batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"病毒RNA聚合酶和核酸外切酶的连续催化步骤提出了一种克服内在核苷酸类似物耐药性的方法","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605725123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Nucleotide analogues (NAs) have been successfully used for the treatment of various RNA virus infections by selectively targeting the viral RNA-dependent RNA polymerase (RdRp) for incorporation into the viral genome. However two major families of human-infecting RNA viruses,\n                    Coronaviridae\n                    (CoV) and\n                    Arenaviridae,\n                    encode exonuclease domains that may recognize and remove incorporated NAs, thus providing natural resistance against some of these drugs. Both polymerization and excision reactions are mechanistically centered on the nucleotide α-phosphate, enabling the potential for sequential inhibition of both RNA synthesis and repair. Here, we provide structural evidence of inversion of configuration at the phosphorus center during polymerization, demonstrating that the SARS-CoV-2 RdRp proceeds through an S\n                    N\n                    2 mechanism. A 2.39 Å resolution cryo-EM structure of a ternary replication complex bound to RNA and an α-thio–modified NTP shows that incorporation of the preferred\n                    S\n                    P\n                    isomer at the 3′ end of the RNA yields a phosphorothioate linkage in the\n                    R\n                    P\n                    configuration. This\n                    R\n                    P\n                    -phosphorothioate RNA product shows reduced cleavage by both the SARS-CoV-2 and three arenavirus RNA exonucleases, revealing a stereochemical preference opposite to that of structurally related DNA exonucleases. This observation contradicts the prevailing assumption that sulfur substitution at the metal-coordinating oxygen universally blocks catalysis. Instead, RNA exonuclease stereoselectivity appears to be shaped not only by metal–sulfur interactions but also by the geometry of nucleophile activation. These findings provide mechanistic insights into phosphoryl transfer in viral polymerases and exonucleases and highlight opportunities to counteract intrinsic nuclease-mediated resistance against antiviral nucleotide analogues."},{"t":"认知不会自动影响感知：来自不同类别颜色神经编码的证据","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538139123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The firmest evidence in favor of models that posit early high-level influences of cognition on perception comes from electroencephalography (EEG). Enhanced early, preattentive processing of light and dark blue feature changes compared to light and dark green changes was reported in Greek speakers, who have two basic terms for “blue” (\n                    ghalazio/ble\n                    ). In the present three-experiment study, we systematically reevaluate this evidence and test an alternative model that the early difference waves in the human EEG instead mainly reflect contrast adaptation phenomena. We use the same classical oddball paradigm presenting alternating standards and deviants that systematically differ in color and/or luminance and chromatic contrast. We then calculate the visual mismatch negativity (vMMN), a putative index of preattentive feature change processing and predictive coding derived from EEG data, by subtracting the activity elicited by standards from that elicited by task-irrelevant deviants. Our experiments demonstrate the following: 1) vMMN is driven by contrast adaptation, being observable only in the presence of contrast differences between the stimuli and not reliably observed for categorically different hues equated in contrast; 2) there is no reliable difference between green- and blue-related difference waves in speakers (Russian) with two basic blue color categories, the difference waves, again, being driven by contrast rather than their categorical content. Our findings are highly significant for the debate concerning the interface between perception and cognition, as the absence of early categorical effects speaks against models that predict Whorfian-type preattentive cognitive influences on perception."},{"t":"CargoNetSim：面向多式联运货运成本-能源-排放优化的混合智能体与系统动力学框架","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008408?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多式联运货运","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":4.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"CargoNetSim: A hybrid agent-based and system dynamics framework for cost–energy–emissions optimization in multimodal freight transport"},{"t":"气泡形成控制：通过过氧化氢酶涂覆的释氧水凝胶制造厘米大小的组织状结构","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523593?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing thick three‐dimensional (3D) scaffolds remains challenging due to oxygen depletion and limited cell viability. Calcium peroxide (CaO\n                    2\n                    )‐catalase‐based oxygen‐releasing biomaterials are a common solution, but the uncontrolled release of oxygen bubbles often leading to structural damages is rarely discussed. Herein, we present a strategy to control the site of bubble formation in an oxygen‐releasing hydrogel, by applying a catalase nanocoating to its surface. CaO\n                    2\n                    undergoes hydrolytic decomposition with water, generating hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ), subsequently converts into O\n                    2\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O. Because H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    can induce cytotoxicity, direct catalase incorporation into hydrogel systems may accelerate O\n                    2\n                    bubble formation, leading in hydrogel collapse within 1 h of aqueous immersion. In comparison, catalase‐coated hydrogels exhibited improved structural stability, showing a 5.9‐fold smaller bubble size than hydrogels with mixed catalase after 24 h in ambient air. Under hypoxic conditions (O\n                    2\n                    &lt; 0.1%), centimeter‐scale constructs containing catalase‐coated hydrogels preserved up to 86% viable human fibroblast cells after 5 days of culture, compared with only 47% in non‐catalase coated hydrogels. Furthermore, the incorporation of catalase‐coated hydrogels promoted cell survival and neurite outgrowth of human neural stem cells cultured in neuronal differentiation conditions under severe hypoxia. These findings suggest the potential of the proposed strategy for oxygen‐supportive tissue engineering applications.","tp":"释氧水凝胶支架","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.5},"as":"针对厚三维组织工程支架中氧气耗竭和细胞存活率低的挑战，研究者利用过氧化钙-过氧化氢酶体系释放氧气，并提出控制气泡形成位点的新策略。通过过氧化氢酶涂覆水凝胶精确调控气泡产生位置，避免了无控释氧导致的结构性损伤，成功制造出厘米大小的组织样结构。"},{"t":"质子交换膜燃料电池建模新方法及氢燃料电池汽车整车级验证","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008421?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池建模","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A novel approach to modeling of polymer electrolyte membrane fuel cells with vehicle-level validation in a hydrogen electric vehicle"},{"t":"面向现代电气化电网非凸能源系统优化的混合神经模糊深度强化学习框架","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008251?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源系统优化","kp":["[神经模糊深度强化学习]: 非凸能源系统优化"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"A hybrid neuro-fuzzy deep reinforcement learning framework for non-convex energy system optimization in modern electrified grids"},{"t":"兼具强黏附、自修复与透氧性的统一聚合物水凝胶电解质用于柔性中性锌空气电池","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73665?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池电解质","kp":["[凝胶电解质]: 集成粘附/自修复/透氧","[器件形态]: 柔性中性锌空电池"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种集强黏附性、自修复和透氧性于一体的统一聚合物水凝胶电解质，用于柔性中性锌空气电池。水凝胶网络中的动态交联键赋予材料自修复能力和与电极界面的稳固黏附，透氧性确保空气正极的氧气供应。该电解质在反复弯折和机械损伤条件下保持稳定的电化学性能，显著提升了柔性锌空气电池的循环寿命和实际可穿戴应用可靠性。","dp":1,"ot":"A Unified Polymer Hydrogel Electrolyte Integrating Robust Adhesion, Self‐Healing, and Oxygen Permeability in Flexible Neutral Zn‐Air Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymer hydrogel electrolytes hold significant promise for Zn–air batteries due to their excellent flexibility, non‐flammability, and leak resistance. However, their practical application remains constrained by zinc dendrite growth and intrinsic trade‐offs among ionic conductivity, oxygen permeability, mechanical strength, and both interfacial and environmental stability. Herein, we report a neutral, 3D physically cross‐linked PFCD hydrogel engineered via the synergistic combination of a tight coordination network of small Fe\n                    3\n                    +\n                    ions and a broader hydrogen‐bonding network of β‐cyclodextrin, with in situ incorporated N‐carboxyethyl chitosan. This hierarchical architecture endows the PFCD hydrogel with high adhesion (50 kPa), superior ionic conductivity (113.2 mS cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ), and significant oxygen permeability (4.1 Barrer). Additionally, the hydrogel exhibits autonomous self‐healing (99% efficiency in 3 h), exceptional stretchability (1600% elongation), and robust interfacial contact (withstanding 1000 folding/stretching cycles), while effectively suppressing zinc dendrite growth and resisting CO\n                    2\n                    degradation. Assembled flexible neutral Zn–air batteries (FNZABs) achieve high power density (59 mW cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    ) with stable operation over 3000 cycles. Furthermore, the fabrication of leakage‐free, closed‐system FNZABs demonstrates the hydrogel's dual role as both an electrolyte and an oxygen‐permeable encapsulation membrane. This integrated strategy effectively addresses critical interfacial and stability challenges essential for advanced flexible energy storage systems development."},{"t":"具有超高 Fe(II) 的二甲双胍稳定的无定形氧化铁的自级联纳米酶，可在超低剂量下有效治疗肿瘤","d":"2026-06-11","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7061041?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The therapeutic efficacy of iron oxide nanozymes in cancer catalytic therapy has been severely constrained by the insufficient endogenous H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    . To address this, constructing a self–cascading nanozyme that integrates oxidase (OXD) and peroxidase (POD) activities is highly desirable yet challenging, primarily due to the difficulty in stabilizing high–content of Fe(II) within nanostructures. Herein, we report the first synthesis of mesoporous amorphous iron oxide nanospheres (aFeO\n                    x\n                    ‑N) with unprecedented high Fe (II) level (66.59%) via the confinement coordination strategy using the strong N–donor metformin. This unique structure simultaneously exhibits robust OXD–like activity for in situ H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation via a 2e\n                    −\n                    oxygen reduction pathway and enhanced POD–like activity for consequent •OH production. In vitro studies verified the aFeO\n                    x\n                    ‑N‑ss‑SiO\n                    2\n                    (encapsulated by SiO\n                    2\n                    outlayer containing ─S─S─ bonds for TME responsiveness) triggered ferroptosis and prominent cell death even under hypoxic conditions. Remarkably, a single ultralow dose (5 mg·kg\n                    −1\n                    ) achieves a tumor inhibition rate of up to 96.19% in murine models, demonstrating exceptional therapeutic efficacy and biocompatibility. This work provides a novel and potent nanozyme platform for cascade catalytic tumor therapy.","tp":"纳米酶抗肿瘤","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"针对铁氧化物纳米酶肿瘤催化治疗中内源性H₂O₂不足的瓶颈，研究者构建了二甲双胍稳定的无定形氧化铁自级联纳米酶，整合氧化酶和过氧化物酶双重活性。超高Fe(II)含量实现超低剂量下的高效肿瘤治疗，显著突破了纳米酶催化治疗的剂量依赖性限制。"},{"t":"5f金属掺杂二维团簇石墨烯：通过连续平面载流子迁移实现高效光催化","d":"2026-06-11","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00225-0?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化材料","kp":["[材料体系]: 铀酰-多铌酸盐组装2D UNbO簇烯","[载流子迁移]: 连续平面路径抑制电子-空穴复合","[光催化应用]: 可见光驱动烯烃断裂"],"sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究将铀酰单元与多铌酸盐在亚纳米尺度集成，构建了具有连续载流子迁移通道的二维UNbO簇烯材料。该材料利用5f金属轨道特性实现高效平面内载流子传输，显著提升光催化反应效率，为锕系元素基二维材料在光催化和能源转换领域的应用提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"5f metal-incorporated 2D clusterphene: Enabling high-efficiency photocatalysis through continuous planar carrier migration","b":"Integrating uranyl units with polyoxoniobates at the subnanoscale creates a 2D UNbO clusterphene with a continuous carrier-migration path that minimizes electron-hole recombination, enabling efficient visible-light-driven alkene cleavage and paving the way for advanced 5f metal-based heterogeneous photocatalysts.","aip":1},{"t":"这些海洋“黑科技”能潜水、预报、洗巨轮","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260609/34e139fcf0c440209a4e715d8c2c9cd0/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"水下机器人","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"新华社报道了多类海洋科技创新装备：水下机器人在蜈支洲岛海洋牧场用于珊瑚监测与生态保护；海洋预报系统可实时提供海况预测；大型船舶清洗机器人能自动清洁巨轮底部。这些技术在海洋牧场生态监管、海上航运保障等领域展现了实际应用场景，体现了海洋智能装备的产业化进展。","b":"这些海洋“黑科技”能潜水、预报、洗巨轮-新华网\n这些海洋“黑科技”能潜水、预报、洗巨轮\n这些海洋“黑科技”能潜水、预报、洗巨轮\n新华社济南6月8日电（记者李傲秋、李志浩）在海南蜈支洲岛海域国家级海洋牧场示范区，水下珊瑚繁茂，鱼群穿梭。青岛罗博飞海洋技术有限公司研发的水下机器人，如同一条黄色大鱼在珊瑚礁间灵活游弋。\n“以前只能靠人工潜水作业监测珊瑚生长状态，效率低，危险性还大。”海南大学教授、海南省现代化海洋牧场工程研究中心首席科学家王爱民说，近年来，他们与青岛罗博飞海洋技术有限公司合作，用科技助力海洋生态保护。\n“机器人续航长、干扰小，能够抵近多角度拍摄珊瑚、鱼类存活情况。”罗博飞公司董事长马秀芬介绍，机器人的应用扩大了水下监测范围，也提高了监测效率。\n2026年3月，水下机器人开展珊瑚调查工作。新华社发\n目前，蜈支洲岛海域国家级海洋牧场已布设7个信息化监测站点，不仅能实时监测水温、盐度等参数，还通过水下摄像头实时掌握珊瑚生长和鱼类活动情况。“一旦发现问题，就能及时修复。”王爱民说。\n近年来，多地强化海洋战略科技力量，推动海洋领域数字化智能化转型升级，以此作为推动海洋强国建设的重要抓手。智能机器人、海洋大模型等先进技术快速进入生态保护、海洋现象预报、航运服务等场景。\n日前，在山东青岛举办的第四届中国数字地球大会上，中国科学院海洋研究所发布了新一代“琅琊”海洋大模型2.0。\n“一年多以前，我们研发出‘琅琊’1.0，可以实现7天内温度、盐度、海流等全球海洋状态变量高精度预报。”中国科学院海洋研究所所长王凡说，但这些内容仅能被专业研究者解读。\n为了帮助更多用户理解预测内容，新发布的“琅琊”2.0具有6个垂直模型，可以智能预测台风、降水、海冰等6类海洋现象。\n“这些现象的预测结果更为科学家、政府决策者乃至普通人关注。”王凡说，相较于“琅琊”1.0，“琅琊”2.0研究效能的提升令人振奋，比如相关工程模型去年曾预测多场突然转弯的台风，将此类台风24小时预报精度提升10%以上。\n新模型的更大价值在于普惠。“大模型的轻量化版本可以在本地部署，能为经济欠发达的国家和地区提供低成本预报方案。”王凡说。记者了解到，中国科学院海洋研究所将在“联合国海洋科学促进可持续发展十年”框架下，与更多国家和地区开展合作研究。\n在全球航运“大动脉”马六甲海峡的锚地，智真海洋科技（威海）有限公司研发的多台第四代水下清洗机器人正在船底作业，剥离附着在船底的贝类与藻类。\n船底附着物会增加航行阻力、提升油耗，甚至会影响船只寿命。智真公司清洗机器人项目负责人秦明达说：“传统的人工清洗效率低、风险高，相同工作量，人工清洗方式需要36人次干3天，一台机器人20个小时就能完成。现在客户不断催单，产品供不应求。”\n水下机器人在马六甲海峡锚地高流速环境下夜间作业。新华社发\n目前，智真公司的第四代机器人每小时清洗面积达2000平方米，在马六甲海峡累计清洗船舶超过2000艘次。记者了解到，该公司研发的第五代机器人正在山东威海测试，贴合度、清洗效率和海况适应能力有望进一步提升。\n从守护珊瑚到精准预报台风，再到服务全球航运，我国海洋科研单位及创新企业，正将“新点子”送入大海，为经略海洋注入新动能。\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n科学与健康丨科技守护“耕地中的大熊猫”\n记者手记丨“都是咱中国的土地，上了岛就绝不后退”\n中泰合作“超级观测站”助力曼谷精准治霾\n走出剧场，戏剧仍在“现场”\n这些海洋“黑科技”能潜水、预报、洗巨轮"},{"t":"谷歌发布实时语音互译模型 Gemini 3.5 Live Translate：可识别 70 余种语言，谷歌翻译 App 就能用","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/143.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"实时语音互译","kp":["支持语言数: 70余种","[功能]: 实时连续语音互译"],"sc":8.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":10.0},"aip":1,"as":"谷歌发布实时语音互译模型Gemini 3.5 Live Translate，支持自动识别70余种语言并实现低延迟双向语音翻译。该模型已集成至谷歌翻译App中，用户可直接体验实时语音互译功能。相比传统翻译工具，该模型在多语种识别准确性和翻译流畅度方面均有显著提升，标志着端侧实时语音翻译技术的重要进展。","b":"6 月 9 日消息，北京时间 9 日（今天）晚间，谷歌正式发布\n最新的实时语音互译音频模型\nGemini 3.5 Live Translate，迈出实时翻译的下一步。\nGemini 3.5 Live Translate\n可自动识别 70 多种语言，并生成流畅、自然的翻译语音，同时保留说话者的语调、语速和音高\n根据介绍，传统轮流式系统通常要等说话者说完后才开始翻译，Gemini 3.5 Live Translate 则会连续生成语音，在“等待更多上下文以提升翻译质量”和“即时翻译以跟上说话者节奏”之间取得平衡。整个会话过程中，翻译音频可以保持流畅，避免尴尬停顿，并始终只比说话者慢几秒。\nGemini 3.5 Live Translate 今起陆续登陆谷歌产品：\n开发者可通过 Gemini Live API 和 Google AI Studio 使用公开预览版\n企业客户可从本月起在 Google Meet 中使用私有预览版\n和 iOS 版谷歌翻译使用\nGemini 3.5 Live Translate 会在语音流式传输过程中同步处理内容，让跨语言交流更加顺畅。模型可以自动处理多语言输入，无需手动调整设置，抗噪能力也能帮助应用适应嘈杂、复杂和不可预测的环境。开发者可以把 Gemini 3.5 Live Translate 用于\n多语言通话、会议、课程、直播和广播\n等场景，提供实时口译体验。\n据IT之家了解，Gemini 3.5 Live Translate 将登陆\n全球 Android 和 iOS 版谷歌翻译应用\n。用户使用实时翻译功能时，只需连接任意耳机，就可以在 70 多种语言中获得更顺畅的翻译，并让译文语音更接近说话者的语气。\nAndroid 用户还将陆续获得基于 3.5 Live Translate 的全新“聆听模式”。用户可以\n像接电话一样把手机贴到耳边\n，直接通过手机听筒收听翻译音频。在没有耳机、又不希望旁人听见翻译内容时，这种模式会更方便。"},{"t":"自动捆绑 默认推荐 隐蔽年化——拆解部分平台支付“便利陷阱”","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260609/996de6c70515441a90299d47a991046a/c.html","c":"不相关","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","b":"自动捆绑 默认推荐 隐蔽年化——拆解部分平台支付“便利陷阱”-新华网\n自动捆绑 默认推荐 隐蔽年化——拆解部分平台支付“便利陷阱”\n自动捆绑 默认推荐 隐蔽年化——拆解部分平台支付“便利陷阱”\n你以为是在付钱，其实是在借钱；你没点“开通”，平台已经帮你开了；直到收到逾期短信，才发现自己欠了钱。花呗等在各大网络平台引入小额信贷业务后，消费者不管是购物、点外卖，还是订酒店、打车，几乎所有生活消费场景中，哪怕块儿八毛的金额都能一键“丝滑”地进行快捷支付。然而，这类互联网小额信贷在给消费者带来便利的同时，也长期因支付页面自动捆绑、默认推荐、隐蔽年化利率等问题遭到消费者投诉。\n中国人民银行等八部门拟定的新规《金融产品网络营销管理办法》直指互联网小额信贷问题。记者调研采访，拆解平台套路背后的“便利陷阱”。\n近日，北京市民李女士收到一条来自某外卖平台的信息称，有一笔110多元的贷款待还，打开该App页面才发现原来是上个月一次点外卖的款项。“我从来没开通过这种月付方式，每次付款时页面都默认优先月付，我都会换成支付宝或微信支付，就是有一次着急没注意，结果一键支付了。”李女士表示，很不喜欢这种“无感”借贷，即使还款额度不大，但违背了自己的意愿。\n和李女士有类似经历的消费者还有很多。在黑猫投诉平台上，记者输入多个小额信贷产品名称后发现，单个产品的投诉量均达到上万条，有的超过10万条，问题多集中在“被开通”“乱扣款”“退款难”等。\n有网友称，近日在某平台订电影票时收到提示“绑卡立减”后绑定银行卡，但在平台没有明确显示月付代扣协议或设置免密支付的情况下，钱款就被直接代扣划走。还有网友表示，在使用花呗月付过程中，从未收到任何还款提醒，导致非主观逾期并被乱扣费用。也有部分网友遇到预订酒店后，因临时取消行程而申请退款，但月付代扣金额仍未清除的问题。\n多数受访消费者认为，这种诱导营销模式不仅让人感到不胜烦扰，还带来逾期多付服务费、维权难等问题。“我并不是付不起几块、十几块钱，为什么要给我硬推这种支付方式？”一位网友说。\n业内专家普遍认为，平台简化身份验证与核实程序、默认勾选信贷支付方式、风险提示字体刻意缩小、反复弹窗优惠券、信贷产品与银行卡等支付工具并列展示等问题，本质是诱导消费者作出不理性的金融决策，这些行为涉嫌侵害消费者的知情权、自主选择权和公平交易权。\n中国法学会消费者权益保护法研究会副秘书长陈音江表示，平台有意弱化“月付”等信贷产品的借贷属性，将其融入日常小额消费中，让消费者司空见惯，极易导致消费者形成“支付惯性”，误选、优选贷款业务。“尤其外卖、打车等线上消费场景要求接单快，如果遇到下单着急的情况，消费者更容易忽略或误点。”\n“互联网小额信贷通过全链条沉浸式超前消费诱导，持续放大居民非理性借贷需求，打破了信贷风险匹配底层逻辑，误导青年群体、下沉人群过度加杠杆，催生了多头借贷、债务滚续、征信逾期等连锁风险。”中央财经大学中国互联网经济研究院副院长、教授欧阳日辉表示。\n这类诱导营销模式屡遭诟病却为何长期存在，甚至近年来愈演愈烈？\n——平台商业利益刚性驱动。我国互联网发展至今，个人生活消费深度融入网络平台，超前消费理念使得小额信贷成为部分消费者客观需求，也催生平台企业布局各自金融产品的内生动力。相比传统银行信贷业务，互联网小额信贷产品开通快捷便利，申请入口嵌入各App主营业务中，能与消费者多个消费场景无缝衔接。加之互联网消费信贷息差收益远高于基础支付业务，比如平台突出强调的“日利率仅为0.05%”换算成年化利率高达18.25%，小额信贷产品逐渐成为平台流量变现、利润增厚的重要赛道。\n“以诱导营销方式获得大量潜在用户，继而推广平台自身的支付软件或借贷业务，并通过改变支付方式提升支付活跃度，逐步养成消费者借贷支付习惯，增加用户黏性，是平台企业争相推出小额信贷的核心目的。”陈音江说。\n——技术逻辑赋能隐性套利。欧阳日辉表示，平台依托消费大数据、用户行为画像，利用算法模型精准筛选年轻群体、价格敏感人群、余额不足用户等易诱导人群，针对性推送信贷优惠，从而实现支付场景与信贷服务无缝嵌入。营销链路隐蔽化、精细化，全流程精准捕捉用户消费弱点，监管事前识别、事后溯源难度很高。\n“基于成熟的互联网技术，小额信贷产品实现跨行业、跨场景营销，行业监管活动难以第一时间介入。”北京航空航天大学法学院副教授赵精武说。\n——违规惩戒成本远低于业务收益。过去，互联网金融领域监管以窗口指导、风险提示、合规约谈为主，缺乏全国统一、刚性强制的全场景监管细则，违规惩戒成本远低于业务收益，无法形成长效制度震慑。\n陈音江表示，由于通常外卖、购物等生活消费的单笔支付金额不高，大多数情况下消费者享受开通贷款业务的福利后也不会较真或维权，而是选择取消捆绑的方式来解决。相比于大规模的获客收益，平台为涉嫌违法违规行为付出的成本极低。\n近日，中国人民银行等八部门拟定的《金融产品网络营销管理办法》针对金融产品的网络营销划出硬核红线，明确严禁非银行支付机构将贷款、理财产品放进支付工具选项，花呗、白条、月付等信贷产品必须挪到独立专区，不能前置、默认或诱导，平台不能再以自身仅提供中转信息服务等理由规避法律责任。新规旨在阻断平台靠支付导流赚金融钱的通路，让支付方式回归本源。这是否意味着，互联网小额信贷的一系列痛点问题将得到根治？\n多位受访专家认为，新规从前端交易环节彻底堵住捆绑、诱导、隐瞒乱象，直击行业多年核心痛点，我国互联网信贷行业在结账支付场景的显性诱导乱象将得到治理。\n然而，互联网金融行业深层结构性矛盾仍无法“一次性清零”。赵精武认为，一方面跨场景变相诱导、营销换马甲转移等灰色行为管控难度较大，比如部分网络主播隐晦推介信贷产品、以财经内容掩盖营销行为等现象仍可能继续“猫鼠游戏”；另一方面，跨平台居民多头借贷、过度授信问题，受征信数据孤岛限制难以全域管控。全链条穿透式监管仍需要长期配套建设。\n“尤其短期内要谨防出现从支付结账主页面转向首页弹窗、下单链路跳转、会员权益捆绑、客服私域推送、售后分期营销等隐蔽场景，变相延续诱导借贷逻辑。”赵精武说。\n新规释放的信号在于，平衡风险防控与正常便民融资需求。陈音江认为，当前来看，重点是为保证新规落地效果，各相关部门应有效履行监管职责，精准打击违规乱象，大幅抬高违法违规成本，同步落实高管连带追责、业务暂停、牌照约束机制等措施。\n欧阳日辉表示，要压实平台主体全生命周期合规责任，加大非支付场景突击抽查、高额顶格处罚、违规公示曝光力度。同时健全用户一键投诉、快速溯源闭环机制，对换套路、换场景变相诱导借贷行为从严从重追责，从制度上堵住场景套利漏洞。\n业内人士表示，长期来看，还需构建全场景穿透监管体系和多部门协同的动态监管机制，比如打通消费、支付、首页、私域全渠道金融营销监管，严禁消费场景与信贷业务深度绑定，割裂消费与信贷强捆绑利益链条。同时健全居民全域借贷征信台账，严控个人多头借贷、过度授信，建立居民个人负债动态预警机制，从风控源头管控超额负债。（记者 乌梦达 阳娜）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n科学与健康丨科技守护“耕地中的大熊猫”\n记者手记丨“都是咱中国的土地，上了岛就绝不后退”\n中泰合作“超级观测站”助力曼谷精准治霾\n走出剧场，戏剧仍在“现场”\n自动捆绑 默认推荐 隐蔽年化——拆解部分平台支付“便利陷阱”"},{"t":"罗永浩谈苹果 iOS 27“挤牙膏”，称希望新 CEO 别再这样了","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/140.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，罗永浩今日转发了博主 @李大锤同学 的 iOS27 上手体验视频，并发文：“哇，哇靠，哇塞，好多创新啊。赶紧退休吧，\n希望新的 CEO 别再这样了\n网友针对罗永浩的言论进行回复，认为十几年让 AAPL 翻了十几倍，无论如何 Tim Cook 也是一位伟大的 CEO。罗永浩表示，\n生意上大家都很服他，但这跟消费者没有关系\n。罗永浩认为消费者不应该被这种挤牙膏的产品圈钱。\n2026 年苹果全球开发者大会已于今日凌晨开幕，苹果在发布会结束后推送了 iOS /\nOS 27 开发者预览版 Beta 1 更新（内部版本号：24A5355q）。此次 iOS 27 对中国用户也有特别照顾，\n终于补足了中国大陆节假日调休闹钟\n并且中文输入法也进行了优化\n。不过，作为发布重点的 Siri AI 和新一代 Apple 智能\nIT之家提醒：iOS 27 开发者预览版仅为面向应用开发者的早期版本，其中可能存在大量 Bug。iOS 27 正式版预计在 9 月面向公众推送。普通用户若以稳定运行为首要需求，建议等待后续版本更新而非急于尝鲜，同时升级前务必做好数据备份。\n苹果 WWDC26 全球开发者大会专题","tp":"苹果智能升级","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.0,"t":7.5},"as":"苹果WWDC26发布iOS 27开发者预览版，罗永浩批评其'挤牙膏'式创新，呼吁新CEO改变现状。iOS 27新增中国大陆节假日调休闹钟和中文输入法优化，Siri AI和Apple智能为发布重点。网友认为库克任内股价翻十几倍仍是伟大CEO，罗永浩则认为商业成功与消费者体验无关。正式版预计9月推送。"},{"t":"算电协同助力算力网建设","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260609/415460813ed8493c9bbaed8b6b87feca/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"算电协同","kp":["算力用电量[2030年]: 约8000亿千瓦时","用电占比[2030年]: 约6%","电力成本占比[部分项目]: 70%-80%"],"sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":2.5},"as":"算电协同成为全国一体化算力网建设的关键议题。算力作为国家综合国力重要体现和数字经济核心生产要素，其电力保障的安全、经济与绿色化水平直接决定算力网建设成效。核心挑战在于加强算力供需匹配、提升资源利用效率，实现算力基础设施与电力系统的深度协同，助力数字中国建设。","b":"算电协同助力算力网建设-新华网\n能否保障算力设施用上更安全、更经济、更绿色的电力，成为推进全国一体化算力网建设、助力数字中国建设的“必答题”。\n算力是国家综合国力的重要体现，是数字时代经济社会发展的重要生产要素。为加强算力供需匹配、提高资源利用效率、降低用算成本，全国一体化算力网正紧锣密鼓地推进，成为筑牢数字基础设施底座的关键。\n算力网的建设离不开电力的保障。国家能源局数据显示，预计“十五五”时期，全国算力用电量年均新增1000亿千瓦时以上，到2030年预计达8000亿千瓦时，占全社会的用电量将从当前的1.6%提升至6%左右，算力是拉动未来用电量增长的重要动力。而随着超大规模智算中心建设投运，电力在算力设施运营成本中的占比也不断提升，部分项目可达70%至80%。能否保障算力设施用上更安全、更经济、更绿色的电力，成为推进全国一体化算力网建设、助力数字中国建设的“必答题”。\n2026年《政府工作报告》提出“实施超大规模智算集群、算电协同等新基建工程”；“十五五”规划纲要明确提出“推动绿色电力与算力协同布局”。算电协同是用足用好我国可再生能源资源丰富、电网基础设施完备等电力优势，满足算力设施日益增长的用电需求、推动算力高质量发展的“最优解”。\n“十四五”以来，我国积极推进算力与电力协同发展，在京津冀、长三角、内蒙古等国家算力枢纽及青海、新疆等清洁能源富集地区开展了算电协同先行先试，并取得良好的实践效果。大型算力设施布局与周边新能源资源开发实现了较紧密结合，源网荷储一体化、绿电直连、智能微电网等新模式不断涌现，算力设施能源利用效率和绿色发展水平得到有效提升，为全国算电协同发展积累了宝贵经验。\n也应看到，算电协同涉及人工智能、信息通信、能源电力等多个学科，不仅是一个系统性、综合性工程，更是数字经济快速发展过程中涌现的新课题，目前在规划布局、资源匹配、安全运行等方面还面临不少挑战。下一步，需把握人工智能发展趋势，以规划协同、运行协同和交易协同为重要抓手，深入推动算力与电力深度融合和双向赋能，实现以电强算、以算促电。\n加强算力和电力规划布局协同。动态研判算力发展及用电需求增长趋势，推动“十五五”时期电力、新能源发展规划与算力发展规划有效衔接。坚持适度超前原则，以大型、超大型数据中心为重点，提前做好配套电源、输变电等电力基础设施布局。积极推进算力设施与新能源产业协同规划，在西部鼓励数据中心集群与“沙戈荒”大型风电光伏基地布局相结合，在东部探索算力设施与沿海核电、海上风电等布局相融合，进一步提升算力与绿色电力在空间布局上的协同性。\n开展算力电力协同运行调度试点。加强不同算力应用类型数据中心用电负荷特性监测分析，重点研究数据中心负荷陡升陡降对电网安全运行和暂态稳定的影响。积极探索非实时算力需求时空转移的可行性，深入挖掘数据中心用电负荷的可调节潜力，支持数据中心空调负荷在迎峰度夏等用电高峰时段积极参与电力需求响应，研究数据中心备用电源优化调用方式，促进分散资源的有效利用，通过削峰填谷保障电力安全供应，实现算力与电力的双向互动。\n创新数据中心绿电交易体制机制。完善绿证、绿电交易机制，支持算力企业通过市场化交易方式提升绿电消费比重。进一步完善算力设施绿电供应相关政策，鼓励绿电需求较大、周边新能源资源较优、调节能力较好的数据中心开展源网荷储一体化、绿电直连、智能微电网等新模式应用。创新完善大基地绿电交易机制，推动“沙戈荒”大型风电光伏基地与大型算力中心开展点对点交易试点，进一步丰富数据中心绿色供电模式。完善算力定价机制，更好将绿色属性、分时电价等信号传导至使用算力的企业，以更完善的交易机制引导算电协同发展。（田 磊 刘 凡）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n科学与健康丨科技守护“耕地中的大熊猫”\n记者手记丨“都是咱中国的土地，上了岛就绝不后退”\n中泰合作“超级观测站”助力曼谷精准治霾\n走出剧场，戏剧仍在“现场”"},{"t":"画质光照全面升级，《我的世界》任天堂 Switch 2 原生版年内发布","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/138.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，任天堂今天在新一期直面会宣布，\n《我的世界》Switch 2 原生版将在今年内上线\n据官方介绍，Switch 2 版《我的世界》拥有专属优化，\n支持增强光照 / 阴影效果\nIT之家了解到，任天堂 Switch 1 版《我的世界》发售于 2020 年，虽然从 Switch 2 发售之日起，就能以向下兼容模式运行，但兼容方案显然是比不上原生方案。\n作为参考，《我的世界》是一款流行的开放世界沙盒游戏，玩家可以在随机生成的世界中随意探索，利用各种方块创造宏伟建筑作品。"},{"t":"浙江工商业分时电价新政（浙发改价格〔2026〕112号）深度解读：储能套利空间收窄、光伏度电价值下移，应对策略全解析","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/09/50024168.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"索比光伏","tg":"政策监管","b":"2026年5月29日，浙江省发展改革委、省能源局正式下发《关于优化工商业分时电价政策有关事项的通知》(浙发改价格〔2026〕112号)，7月1日起执行，同时废止2024年21号文。\n这是浙江近三年来力度最大的工商业电价结构性调整。\n新政三板斧同时落下：取消上午峰电、计价基数收窄、浮动比例统一。对全省工商业储能和\n项目而言，这不是一次小幅修正，而是一次收益逻辑的整体重写。\n大工业10kV用户可套利峰谷价差：0.7982元/kWh → 0.4693元/kWh，降幅41%\n光伏出力时段加权电价(大工业)：0.7511元/kWh → 0.5069元/kWh，降幅32%\n典型光储充项目EIRR：29.78% → 11.67%\n更关键的是——浙江《电力零售市场实施细则3.1版》明确，无论是否已入市交易，全体工商业用户均在112号文覆盖范围内，没有例外。\n这份新政，到底改了什么?各类项目受影响几何?存量项目还有没有出路?新建项目的门槛在哪里?\n索比光伏网编辑部对浙发改价格〔2026〕112号进行了逐条拆解，综合浙江省发改委官方解读及多家行业机构测算数据，形成这份深度报告。\n以下为报告摘要，完整版(含时段对照表、价差测算数据、分场景应对策略)扫码获取","tp":"浙电价新政","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":9.0,"r":5.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"浙江省2026年7月1日起执行工商业分时电价新政(浙发改价格〔2026〕112号)，近三年力度最大的电价结构性调整。三板斧包括取消上午峰电、计价基数收窄、浮动比例统一。大工业10kV峰谷套利价差降幅41%，光伏度电价值降幅32%，典型光储充项目EIRR从29.78%降至11.67%，全省工商业用户无例外覆盖。"},{"t":"浙江一光伏企业被申请破产！","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/09/50024134.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","b":"浙江美尚光伏有限公司被浙江南浔农村商业银行股份有限公司练市洪塘支行向湖州市南浔区人民法院提出破产申请，公开时间6月3日，案号（2026）浙0503破申19号。\n资料显示，浙江美尚光伏有限公司成立于2019年6月，经营范围涵盖太阳能光伏技术、光伏应用产品；设计、建设及维护；光伏应用系统、\n2026年以来，该公司涉及诉讼案件13起，身份均为被告，主要为买卖合同纠纷以及追索劳动报酬纠纷。","tp":"光伏企破产","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"浙江美尚光伏有限公司被浙江南浔农村商业银行向法院申请破产，案号(2026)浙0503破申19号。该公司2019年6月成立，主营光伏技术和光伏应用产品。2026年以来涉及13起诉讼均为被告，主要为买卖合同纠纷和追索劳动报酬纠纷，反映出光伏行业中小企业经营困难加剧。"},{"t":"欠2.083亿元！广西21家售电公司被追缴","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/09/50024141.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","b":"6月5日，广西电力交易中心发布4月售电公司欠费公示， 售电公司，4月合计欠费高达 根据公示文件，公示期至2026年6月10日。 届时仍未完成欠费缴纳的，将启动履约担保赔付流程","tp":"售电欠费案","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"广西电力交易中心发布4月售电公司欠费公示，21家售电公司合计欠费高达2.083亿元。公示期至2026年6月10日，届时未完成欠费缴纳的将启动履约担保赔付流程。大规模欠费暴露售电市场风险管控机制面临严峻挑战。"},{"t":"新华读报｜从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260609/0f7254bf6b584879bb1590e377d36523/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"新华网科技","as":"《经济参考报》报道AI玩具正从传统玩具向智能交互伙伴演进，成为新消费赛道。当前AI玩具已具备语音对话、情感识别、学习陪伴等互动能力，融合大模型技术后体验显著提升，产业链涵盖芯片、算法、内容等环节，市场潜力引发资本与厂商加速布局。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI智能玩具","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":7.0},"cl":"b96b4bb4","cln":"AI智能玩具","cp":1,"b":"新华读报｜从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道-新华网\n新华读报｜从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道\n新华读报｜从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道\n《经济参考报》6月8日刊发文章《从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道》。\n当前，能互动、有性格、有记忆的AI玩具在各大商超玩具专区、线上电商直播间持续走红，成为行业竞争新赛道。\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n科学与健康丨科技守护“耕地中的大熊猫”\n记者手记丨“都是咱中国的土地，上了岛就绝不后退”\n中泰合作“超级观测站”助力曼谷精准治霾\n走出剧场，戏剧仍在“现场”\n新华读报｜从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道"},{"t":"新华读报｜人形机器人拥有“身份证” 全链条可追溯","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260609/878b7645ef724110b06d7f5bccef2c07/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","b":"新华读报｜人形机器人拥有“身份证” 全链条可追溯-新华网\n新华读报｜人形机器人拥有“身份证” 全链条可追溯\n新华读报｜人形机器人拥有“身份证” 全链条可追溯\n《新华每日电讯》6月8日刊发文章《人形机器人拥有“身份证” 全链条可追溯》。\n人形机器人迎来了自己的“身份证”，从出厂到报废，可实现全链条追溯。\n近日，由工业和信息化部人形机器人与具身智能标准化技术委员会牵头搭建的全国首个人形机器人全生命周期管理服务平台发布，配套的《人形机器人 全生命周期管理规范》标准也同步出台。\n标准的一大亮点是提出每台人形机器人都将拥有29位字符的身份编码。\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n科学与健康丨科技守护“耕地中的大熊猫”\n记者手记丨“都是咱中国的土地，上了岛就绝不后退”\n中泰合作“超级观测站”助力曼谷精准治霾\n走出剧场，戏剧仍在“现场”\n新华读报｜人形机器人拥有“身份证” 全链条可追溯","tp":"机器人身份","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"工信部人形机器人与具身智能标准化技术委员会发布全国首个人形机器人全生命周期管理服务平台，配套《人形机器人全生命周期管理规范》标准同步出台。标准提出每台人形机器人将拥有29位字符的身份编码，实现从出厂到报废全链条可追溯，为人形机器人产业规范化管理奠定基础。"},{"t":"摩尔线程 MTT AIBOOK 推送 AIOS 1.4.1 版本，核心场景流畅度提升 30%","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/127.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"AIOS系统更新","kp":["流畅度提升[核心场景]: 30%","GPU综合性能提升: 17%","CPU主频提升[满载]: 100MHz"],"as":"摩尔线程向专为Agent打造的AI算力本MTT AIBOOK推送AIOS 1.4.1版本更新，核心场景流畅度提升约30%。用户可通过OTA在线升级获取。国产GPU厂商在AI终端操作系统优化上持续迭代，软硬件协同能力增强，竞争力于边缘AI算力市场进一步提升。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"b":"6 月 9 日消息，摩尔线程今日宣布，正式向 MTT AIBOOK（摩尔线程专为 Agent 打造的 AI 算力本）用户推送了\nMTT AIOS 1.4.1\n版本系统更新。用户可通过 OTA 在线升级方式获取本次更新，进入系统设置，依次点击关于 → 软件更新，即可直接下载并安装 1.4.1 版本。\n据介绍，本次更新围绕底层性能、跨系统生态、视觉交互、浏览器能力与操控体验五大维度进行升级：\n依托全新升级的专属驱动与核心调度优化，MTT AIOS 1.4.1 为 MTT AIBOOK 带来更充分的硬件性能释放。经过专业基准测试验证，\n核心场景流畅度提升 30%，GPU 综合性能提升 17%\n，图形渲染、多任务运行、动态场景切换等场景表现进阶。\n新版本搭载全新 CPU Boost 调度方案\n，在全核心满载工作状态下，可实现主频额外提升 100MHz，处理器极限算力得到充分释放，高强度办公、多程序并行、轻量化创作等场景的响应速度提升。\n本次版本上架全新升级的铠大师 Windows 虚拟机方案，采用全新可视化交互页面，简化系统安装流程，支持极速装机、驱动自动化安装配置，降低用户操作门槛。\n全面支持 vGPU 硬件加速与 DirectX 12 驱动适配\n，虚拟机图形处理能力升级，复杂场景运行效果接近物理机表现。同时迭代跨系统生态能力，\n实现 MTT AIOS 与 Windows 双向文件共享\n，外设设备跨系统兼容复用，MTT AIBOOK 单台设备即可完成双系统切换与资源互通，满足用户多元化办公与娱乐需求。\n新版本对系统 UI 交互体系进行全方位重塑。\n全新设计的灵动 Dock 栏支持鼠标焦点放大特效\n，鼠标悬浮即可聚焦图标；应用开启与图标交互新增书卷式过渡动画，操作过渡更加平滑自然。\n状态栏 Toolbar 迎来极简升级\n，将 Wi-Fi 开关、蓝牙配置、电源模式、窗口切换等高频操作功能集中整合，一键直达核心功能。同时优化电量显示逻辑，实时呈现设备充放电状态。\n，搭配全新改版的应用列表 UI，统一全局应用图标视觉风格。同时适配全局高斯模糊特效，界面视觉层次更加清晰。\n新版系统预装适配优化的最新版 Chromium 浏览器\n，并设为系统默认浏览器，全面兼容主流网页生态标准。同时深度适配 WebGL 图形渲染能力与硬件级视频解码技术，有效提升网页图形渲染精度、降低高清视频播放功耗，实现网页浏览、在线影音与 Web 应用运行的高效稳定输出，带来极速、高清、流畅的沉浸式上网体验。\n新版本针对触控板操作场景完成专项迭代升级，\n采用多分区加速曲线调校方案\n，优化单指移动、双指滑动等核心触控手势。精准适配不同操作场景的滑动节奏，有效缓解滑动滞涩与手感脱节问题，触控响应更加及时，日常办公与页面浏览的操控舒适度提升。\n去年 12 月，摩尔线程首款 AIPC 算力本 MTT AIBOOK 发布\n，集成长江智能 SoC 芯片，内置 2D 数字人“小麦”，32GB 内存 + 1TB 固态硬盘版本显示为 9999 元。该算力本已于今年 1 月 10 日正式开售。\n【IT之家评测室】让 AI 开发更简单 —— 摩尔线程 MTT AIBOOK 全面评测\n9999 元摩尔线程首款 AIPC 算力本 MTT AIBOOK 发布：集成长江智能 SoC 芯片，内置 2D 数字人“小麦”"},{"t":"微软 AI CEO 苏莱曼改口，收回“AI 将于 18 个月内取代大部分白领工作”言论","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/142.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，据科技媒体 The Verge 今天报道，微软 AI 部门 CEO 穆斯塔法 · 苏莱曼正在淡化此前的“AI 将取代白领工作”言论。\n苏莱曼在昨天的一档播客节目中表示，他当时想表达的意思是，\nAI 将帮助白领完成工作\n而不是直接取代他们的职业\n发电子邮件、与同事沟通、做 PPT 这类任务将越来越自动化和数字化，我们能够生成越来越多这类内容。\n但我觉得白领职位并不一定会消失，人们能够借助工具更快、更高效地完成工作。如今这类工作本身就相当重复、依赖人工劳动且耗费时间。\n技术发展的自然方向，就是让你的生活变得更加轻松、快速，减少摩擦并实现更优秀的体验。\n据IT之家此前报道，苏莱曼曾在今年 2 月接受《金融时报》采访时表示：\n白领工作，也就是坐在电脑前的职业，我觉得，无论是律师、会计师、经理还是市场营销人员，其中大多数任务都将在未来 12-18 个月内被 AI 完全自动化。”\n微软 AI CEO 苏莱曼警告：大多数白领工作将在 18 个月内被 AI 自动化执行","tp":"AI就业观","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":7.0},"as":"微软AI部门CEO苏莱曼撤回了此前关于AI将在18个月内取代大部分白领工作的言论。他在播客节目中澄清，其原意是AI将辅助而非替代白领工作——邮件沟通、PPT制作等重复性任务将被自动化，但借助工具人们能更高效地完成工作，职位本身未必消失。今年2月他曾在《金融时报》采访中声称律师、会计、经理等大多数白领任务将在12-18个月内被AI完全自动化，此番改口被认为是对激进预测的重大回调。"},{"t":"大唐：加快布局“沙戈荒”、“水风光一体化”千万千瓦新能源大基地","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/09/50024151.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"中国大唐集团发文称将加快布局沙戈荒、水风光一体化千万千瓦新能源大基地，重点推进藏东南清洁能源基地、陕电入皖、蒙电入苏等跨区输电工程建设。能源央企在双碳目标下加速大型新能源集群开发，强化西部资源向东部负荷中心输送能力。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"新能源大基地","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"b":"2026年第6期《党建》杂志刊发中国大唐集团有限公司党组署名文章《加快培育和发展新质生产力\n为能源强国建设注入新动能》。文章指出，加快推进藏东南国家级清洁能源基地、“陕电入皖”工程、“蒙电入苏”工程等开发建设，加快在资源富集区域布局“沙戈荒”、“水风光一体化”千万千瓦\n，加快打造沿海省份海上风光走廊。\n2026年第6期《党建》杂志刊发中国大唐集团有限公司党组署名文章《加快培育和发展新质生产力 为能源强国建设注入新动能》。\n能源问题是发展中的战略问题。党的十八大以来，习近平总书记高度重视能源工作，对国家能源安全作出一系列重要论述，就推动能源发展作出一系列重要指示批示，为促进新时代能源高质量发展提供了根本遵循。党的二十届四中全会和2026年全国两会对建设能源强国作出了新部署，赋予了能源电力央企新使命。“十五五”开新局、启新程，中国大唐集团有限公司(以下简称“中国大唐”)使命光荣、责任重大，要聚焦高质量发展这个首要任务，加快培育和发展新质生产力，为中国式现代化建设提供安全可靠的能源保障贡献大唐力量。\n提高政治站位，准确把握“十五五”时期培育和发展新质生产力的形势任务\n新时代以来，在习近平总书记提出的能源安全新战略的科学指引下，我国建成了全球最大、最完整的新能源产业链。作为能源电力央企，中国大唐深刻把握时代之变、产业之变，把培育和发展新质生产力作为长期战略任务抓紧抓好，更好地发挥中央企业在国民经济社会发展中的重要作用。\n一是准确把握世界经济发展的放缓期。当今世界正处于百年未有之大变局，变乱交织、动荡加剧，地缘冲突易发多发;单边主义、保护主义抬头，国际经济贸易秩序遇到严峻挑战，世界经济增长动能不足;大国博弈更加复杂激烈。国际货币基金组织预测，未来5年内全球经济增速将保持在3%左右，国际环境将更为复杂，国际能源合作不确定、难预料因素将更加多变，这是中国大唐面对的新挑战。\n二是准确把握我国经济发展的成长期。“十五五”时期，我国经济基础稳、优势多、韧性强、潜能大，长期向好的支撑条件和基本趋势没有变，中国特色社会主义制度优势、超大规模市场优势、完整产业体系优势、丰富人才资源优势更加彰显。从能源电力行业来看，横跨东西、纵贯南北、联通海外的能源产供储销体系更趋完备，世界能源生产第一大国地位更加稳固，能源保供能力将进一步提升，这是中国大唐面对的新形势。\n三是准确把握新一轮科技革命的加速期。当前，新一轮科技革命和产业变革加速演进，能源系统正在发生深刻变化，能源品类更加多元，电网架构更为复杂，能源消费灵活多变。以新能源、新材料等为代表的战略性新兴产业，将催生出数个万亿级甚至更大规模的市场。以氢能和核聚变能等为代表的未来产业，将对能源行业产生重构式、颠覆式影响。如何抢抓历史机遇，打造现代产业链链长，这是中国大唐要回答好的新课题。\n四是准确把握绿色低碳发展的机遇期。我国能源消费相比制定“十四五”规划时期已发生较大变化。截至2025年年底，我国可再生能源发电总装机容量已突破23亿千瓦，风电、太阳能发电总装机容量历史性超过火电，全社会用电量中每10度电有近4度电是绿色电能，越来越多的“风吹”“日晒”“水流”源源不断转化为绿色电能。“十五五”时期，随着经济结构变化和能源效率提升，2030年前碳达峰目标将如期实现。作为能源电力央企，加快绿色低碳发展，这是中国大唐战略转型要完成好的新任务。\n把握特征规律，正确处理“十五五”时期培育和发展新质生产力的几对关系\n“十五五”时期，将是我国从能源消费总量和强度双控转向碳排放总量和强度双控的关键五年，是新能源全面入市、绿色电能应用不断扩大的关键五年，也是全国统一电力市场加快建设的关键五年。在这个过程中，培育和发展新质生产力，应把握好一系列关系。\n一是把握好先立与后破的关系。培育和发展新质生产力是一个循序渐进的过程，不可能一蹴而就，必须坚持破立并举、先立后破，处理好当前与长远的关系，统筹好传统产业、新兴产业与未来产业之间的关系。传统产业是现代化产业体系的基底，要以发展的眼光、创新的思维看待传统产业，绝不能把传统产业与新兴产业、未来产业对立起来。作为能源电力央企，中国大唐火电机组在总装机容量中仍占接近50%的比重，要通过煤电联营、煤电与新能源联营“两个联营”有序“上”一批煤电，通过节能降耗改造、供热改造和灵活性改造“三改联动”着力“优”一批煤电，通过“管理提升”坚决“减”一批煤电，实现传统赛道再创辉煌与新兴赛道抢占先机相结合。\n二是把握好发展与安全的关系。发展和安全是一体之两翼、驱动之双轮。建设能源强国，确保产业链、供应链更加安全稳定，确保关键技术、关键配件等不受制于人，确保国家发展与能源安全相协调至关重要。我国用几十年时间走完西方发达国家几百年走过的工业化历程，大踏步赶上了时代，建成全球最完整、规模最大的工业体系，是世界上唯一拥有联合国产业分类目录中所有工业门类的国家，全要素生产率明显提升。同时也要看到，我国煤炭资源主要分布在西部和北部地区，水能资源主要集中在西南地区，风电、光伏主要分布在中西部地区，东部地区的一次能源资源匮乏。能源电力面临需求压力较大、供给制约较多、绿色转型任务艰巨等一系列挑战。作为能源电力央企，中国大唐要进一步提高政治站位，在保障电力供应的同时，保持发电装机合理余量，有效提升顶峰发电能力，在服务国家战略、降低社会运行成本、提升民生福祉、应对极端气候等方面发挥更加积极有效的作用，把能源饭碗牢牢端在自己手里，坚决维护国家能源安全和经济运行安全。\n三是把握好机遇与挑战的关系。近代以来，我国饱经战乱和列强欺凌，科技和人才长期落后。现在，我国正处于政治最稳定、经济最繁荣、创新最活跃的时期。新一轮科技革命和产业变革推动国际格局重塑，谁掌握了关键核心技术，谁就掌握了竞争主动权。作为能源电力央企，中国大唐要把握机遇、应对挑战，运用大数据、云计算、物联网等先进信息技术，更好推进新型电力系统建设，加快实现从要素大量投入的“汗水型增长”向科技创新驱动的“智慧型增长”转变，开启增长的“第二曲线”，努力成为经济增长的“推进器”、绿色转型的“排头兵”、科技创新的“国家队”。\n强化使命担当，紧抓“十五五”时期战略机遇加快推进高质量发展\n培育和发展新质生产力是战略所向、使命所系、发展所需。中国大唐将始终不忘初心、牢记使命，不断推动供给提档、转化提速、产业提质、改革提效，更好服务党和国家工作大局，服务经济社会高质量发展，服务保障和改善民生。\n一是在科技创新上下功夫。在新一轮科技创新大潮面前，国家重大战略实施和重点领域安全能力建设的“两重”加力、大规模设备更新和消费品以旧换新的“两新”扩围。中国大唐将全力服务国家重大战略需求，进一步加大重点领域科技投入，强化战略性新兴产业和未来产业投入，有力支撑高水平科技自立自强。紧紧把握行业发展进步和科技创新趋势，以解决能源电力“卡脖子”技术难题为突破口，协同头部企业、重点高校等机构，协同产业链、供应链上下游，深化绿色低碳、新能源友好并网、智慧化调度等新技术研究，争当原创技术“策源地”。充分发挥市场需求、集成创新、组织平台优势，加快推动以西藏扎拉水电、山东郓城火电、宁夏中宁储能等为代表的一批重大科技项目攻关，以创新场景牵引科技成果落地，推动新技术创造性应用、创新性转化，打通从科技强到企业强、产业强、经济强的通道。\n二是在产业焕新上下功夫。绿色发展是高质量发展的底色，新质生产力本身就是绿色生产力。我国80%以上的碳排放来自能源系统，推动能源体系绿色低碳转型不是可选项，而是必答题。今后一个时期，我国战略性新兴产业和未来产业将推动产业格局发生历史性重塑，深刻影响我国参与国际分工的程度和方式。中国大唐将锚定2030年初步建成新型能源体系的目标，着力改造提升煤电、气电等传统产业，加快培育壮大风电、光伏、核能、氢能等新兴产业，积极发展抽水蓄能，加快发展新型储能，高效开发综合能源服务，运用好人工智能、云计算等新技术，推动产业数字化、数字产业化，不断向高附加值、高技术含量的产业体系方向发展，切实把国家战略转化为中国大唐高质量发展的生动实践。\n三是在机制革新上下功夫。培育和发展新质生产力，建设世界一流企业，既是发展的需要，也是改革的课题，需要更具活力、更高效率、更强激励的新型生产关系。中国大唐要以改革优化治理，始终坚持党对经济工作的全面领导，真正发挥好党组(党委)把关定向作用，真把关、严把关，持续推动加强党的领导与完善公司治理有机统一。以改革促经营，打破思维定式、破除路径依赖，积极融入全国统一电力市场，按市场化机制高效运行，推动经营工作提质增效。以改革增活力，推动机构能增能减、干部能上能下、员工能进能出、薪酬能高能低的“四能”机制改革，特别是要把树立和践行正确政绩观学习教育中形成的好做法、好经验，以制度形式确定下来，建立健全一系列行得通、做得实、长期管用的制度机制，充分调动干部员工干事创业热情。\n四是在布局谋新上下功夫。《中华人民共和国国民经济和社会发展第十五个五年规划纲要》正式公布了“十五五”规划109项重大工程项目清单。接下来，各领域各系统的规划将陆续出台。中国大唐要聚焦能源强国建设目标，把党中央的各项要求，细化分解为“十五五”时期中国大唐改革发展的战略目标、重点任务、改革举措，明确时间表、路线图、任务书，加快推进藏东南国家级清洁能源基地、“陕电入皖”工程、“蒙电入苏”工程等开发建设，加快在资源富集区域布局“沙戈荒”、“水风光一体化”千万千瓦\n，加快打造沿海省份海上风光走廊，以更低的能源消耗和碳排放支撑经济社会更高质量的发展，为基本实现社会主义现代化贡献大唐力量。"},{"t":"国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260609_1894037.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"技术突破","tp":"天然酯变压器","kp":["电压等级: 500千伏","容量: 40万千伏安","绝缘油: 国产大豆基天然酯"],"as":"由中国电科院牵头研制的采用国产大豆基天然酯绝缘油的500千伏/400兆伏安超高压变压器成功研制，性能指标优于国外同类产品。天然酯油相比传统矿物油更环保、燃点更高，这一突破提升了国产高端电力装备自主可控水平，助力绿色电网建设。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"b":"国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功\n中国电科院牵头研制，性能指标优于国外同类产品\n近日，由中国电力科学研究院有限公司牵头研制的采用国产大豆基天然酯绝缘油的500千伏/40万千伏安（单相自耦无励磁调压）变压器通过全部型式试验，各项性能指标均优于国外同类产品，标志着我国高端绿色电工装备关键材料国产化率和自主可控能力进一步提升。\n相较于传统矿物绝缘油，天然酯绝缘油具有高燃点、高生物降解能力和优异的电气绝缘性能，可有效压降设备火灾及环境污染风险，同时提升设备寿命和过载能力。长期以来，高电压等级装备用天然酯绝缘油主要依赖进口。\n中国电科院联合特变电工沈阳变压器集团有限公司、国网江苏省电力有限公司、重庆大学等单位，围绕国产大豆基天然酯绝缘油变压器研发与应用开展联合攻关。经过大量的基础试验、仿真分析等工作，研发团队构建了适配国产天然酯的专用材料体系，通过优化绝缘结构与浸渍工艺、强化油路循环能力、升级散热系统，攻克了天然酯高黏度、高吸水性带来的系列设计难题，完成了样机研制并一次性通过全部型式试验。\n该成果后续计划在国家电网低碳环保变电站科技示范工程中落地应用，助推国产天然酯变压器油的工程化应用，对于增强我国绿色输变电装备自主可控能力、推动能源电力绿色低碳转型具有重要意义。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立\n香港理工大学·月山能源新一代矿业联合实验室揭牌\n全国首个绿色算力全栈AI平台上线运行","aip":1},{"t":"国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260609_1894037.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"技术突破","tp":"天然酯变压器","kp":["电压等级: 500千伏","容量: 40万千伏安","绝缘油: 国产大豆基天然酯"],"dp":1,"as":"中国电力科学研究院牵头研制成功采用国产大豆基天然酯绝缘油的500千伏超高压变压器，关键性能指标优于国外同类产品。天然酯绝缘油以植物油为基底，相比传统矿物油具备燃点更高、更环保、可生物降解等优势，是电力设备绿色化的重要方向。此举打破国外技术垄断，推动高端电气装备国产化。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"b":"国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n国产天然酯超高压变压器研制成功\n中国电科院牵头研制，性能指标优于国外同类产品\n近日，由中国电力科学研究院有限公司牵头研制的采用国产大豆基天然酯绝缘油的500千伏/40万千伏安（单相自耦无励磁调压）变压器通过全部型式试验，各项性能指标均优于国外同类产品，标志着我国高端绿色电工装备关键材料国产化率和自主可控能力进一步提升。\n相较于传统矿物绝缘油，天然酯绝缘油具有高燃点、高生物降解能力和优异的电气绝缘性能，可有效压降设备火灾及环境污染风险，同时提升设备寿命和过载能力。长期以来，高电压等级装备用天然酯绝缘油主要依赖进口。\n中国电科院联合特变电工沈阳变压器集团有限公司、国网江苏省电力有限公司、重庆大学等单位，围绕国产大豆基天然酯绝缘油变压器研发与应用开展联合攻关。经过大量的基础试验、仿真分析等工作，研发团队构建了适配国产天然酯的专用材料体系，通过优化绝缘结构与浸渍工艺、强化油路循环能力、升级散热系统，攻克了天然酯高黏度、高吸水性带来的系列设计难题，完成了样机研制并一次性通过全部型式试验。\n该成果后续计划在国家电网低碳环保变电站科技示范工程中落地应用，助推国产天然酯变压器油的工程化应用，对于增强我国绿色输变电装备自主可控能力、推动能源电力绿色低碳转型具有重要意义。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立\n香港理工大学·月山能源新一代矿业联合实验室揭牌\n全国首个绿色算力全栈AI平台上线运行","aip":1},{"t":"双主角亮相：任天堂《异度神剑 Genesis》正式公开，预计 2027 年登陆 Switch 2","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/130.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，在今日的直面会上，任天堂正式公开了异度神剑 / 异度之刃系列新作《异度神剑 创世纪（Genesis）》，预计 2027 年发售，登陆 Switch 2 平台。\n任天堂在预告片中展示了游戏场景及双主角，目前暂未看到更多相关信息。\n据官方介绍，本作舞台是拥有六颗太阳的广阔世界“安夏尔”（Anshar）。\n即使是之前从未游玩过《异度神剑》系列的玩家，也能轻松上手并享受《异度神剑 Genesis》带来的乐趣。更多详情，敬请期待今后的后续报道。\n据介绍，在《异度神剑》系列完结之后，全新篇章《异度神剑 Genesis》正式启程。与《异度神剑》系列一样，本作的总导演依然由 Monolith Soft 的高桥哲哉担任。\n为这段冒险旅程增添色彩的音乐，将由以光田康典为主，并携手 Mariam Abounnasr、清田爱未等作曲家共同操刀制作。合唱部分更有合唱团 ANÚNA 倾情参与。\n《异度神剑创世纪》的角色设计由插画师米山舞与 PALOW. 两人共同担任。敬请期待由两位画师为您呈现的全新角色。"},{"t":"内蒙古鄂尔多斯市6GW光伏治沙项目优选结果公示","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/09/50024165.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"鄂尔多斯市2026年度光伏治沙项目优选结果公示，总规模600万千瓦（6GW），大唐、中广核、中节能、华润新能源、甘肃宝丰及鄂尔多斯市新能源开发利用公司各获1GW指标。光伏治沙即在沙漠地区建设大型光伏电站，兼具发电与生态修复功能，是西部荒漠化治理与新能源开发融合的典型模式，此批项目规模创区域新高。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏治沙","kp":["[总装机]: 600万千瓦（6GW）","[单企指标]: 各1GW"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":8.0},"b":"6月7日，鄂尔多斯市2026年度光伏治沙项目优选结果正式公示。根据公示，此次鄂尔多斯光伏治沙项目指标总规模600万千瓦，大唐、中广核、中节能、华润新能源、甘肃宝丰新能源和鄂尔多斯市新能源开发利用有限公司各获1GW项目指标，项目所在地分布于鄂尔多斯市杭锦旗和鄂托克前旗。\n据了解，5月30日，内蒙古鄂尔多斯能源局启动2026年光伏治沙项目竞争性配置。公告指出，申报主题应为具备投资能力的能源投资企业，要有新能源开发建设或光伏治沙相关业绩，申报企业须承诺光伏建设与沙化土地治理同步设计、同步施工、同步验收，项目应具备电网接入消纳条件。\n参与竞配企业应先行向项目所在地的旗区能源主管部门提交所需文件，有关旗区能源主管部门按要求向申报单位提供优选方案及相关材料，并组织企业进行申报。\n除了鄂尔多斯之外，内蒙阿拉善盟也于近期启动了2026年光伏治沙项目竞争性配置工作，阿拉善盟光伏治沙实验项目装机总规模550万千瓦，治理沙化土地22万亩。\n其中：乌兰布和沙漠阿左旗境内布局装机规模200万千瓦，治理沙化土地8万亩;乌兰布和沙漠阿拉善高新区境内布局装机规模200万千瓦，治理沙化土地8万亩;腾格里沙漠孪井滩示范区境内布局装机规模150万千瓦，治理沙化土地6万亩。\n按照文件要求，项目实行集中连片选址，单体申报规模不低于100万千瓦，每万千瓦光伏一体化治沙面积400亩(含光伏用地)。到2027年底，完成光伏治沙实验项目建设与沙化土地治理。\n鄂尔多斯市2026年度光伏治沙项目优选结果的公示\n根据《内蒙古自治区上网消纳新能源发电项目竞争性配置管理办法》(内能源新能发〔2025〕6号)及国家、自治区组织开展光伏治沙项目的相关要求，经第三方服务机构评审优选，形成了鄂尔多斯市2026年度光伏治沙项目实施清单，现予以公示。\n公示期为2026年6月7日-2026年6月9日。\n如对公示内容有异议，请在公示期内以书面形式提出意见并反馈至鄂尔多斯市能源局新能源和可再生能源科。书面意见请写明提出异议的事实依据和理由，提出异议的单位或个人须对相关书面材料的真实性和可靠性负责。对于非书面形式提出异议、匿名提出异议或无事实依据提出异议的，以及涉及自身不正当利益的诉求，不予受理。\n联系电话：0477-8599569\n地址：鄂尔多斯市能源局721办公室\n附件：鄂尔多斯市2026年度光伏治沙项目实施清单"},{"t":"依旧碰一碰：华为钱包上线 HDC 2026 电子门票，激活后可代替身份证用于进入会场","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/136.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","b":"6 月 9 日消息，博主 @Adak封狼居胥 刚刚发文称，华为钱包上线了 HDC 2026 电子门票，激活后可代替身份证，\n使用手机 NFC 碰一碰进入大会会场\n值得一提的是，华为似乎很喜欢碰一碰这种交互模式。早在 2018 年，华为就与银联合作推出了碰一碰支付技术，同年还在 MateBook 13 笔记本上带来了 HUAWEI Share 3.0 一碰传功能。后续，华为陆续带来了手机一碰传音箱、一碰连网路由器、一碰手环 / 手表传表盘、一碰连接智能设备等功能。\nHarmonyOS NEXT\n时代后，华为碰一碰交互支持还带来了更多新玩法，包括碰一碰发红包、碰一碰互动主题、碰一碰购物 / 图文 / 音视频分享、碰一碰烟花特效、碰一碰游戏组队、碰一碰导入 / 导出素材（手机与 PC，支持识别具体碰一碰位置）等功能。\n按照惯例，在 HDC 华为开发者大会上将发布最新鸿蒙系统，预计\n7 还会在 HDC 2026 期间开启 Developer Beta 招募，而正式版则会在新旗舰手机上首发搭载。\n据IT之家此前报道，华为开发者大会 HDC 2026 官宣定档 6 月 12 日 ~14 日举行，\n早鸟票已于 4 月 29 日开售\n。本届 HDC 2026 将发布 HarmonyOS 全新版本、\nAI 核心能力，以及生态全新成果等。"},{"t":"优必选全球首款全尺寸超仿生人形机器人小订突破 3000 台，仅限成年人购买使用","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/144.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","tp":"人形机器人预售","kp":["身高[男款]: 183cm","自由度: 88个","续航: 2-4小时","小订数量: 突破3000台"],"as":"优必选消费级人形机器人品牌优世界宣布，全球首款全尺寸超仿生人形机器人京东预售8天小订累计突破3000台，仅限成年人购买。全尺寸超仿人形机器人指身高、四肢比例接近真人的双足机器人，技术难点集中于高自由度运动控制、灵巧操作与AI感知。量产小订破3000台为人形机器人商业化落地的重要信号，但实际交付与使用体验仍待验证。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"b":"6 月 9 日消息，优必选消费级人形机器人品牌优世界已于本月初（6 月 2 日）宣布，\n全球首款全尺寸超仿生人形机器人开启预售\nIT之家注意到，优必选官方今日宣布，优世界全尺寸超仿生人形机器人京东预售开启 8 天，\n小订数量累计突破 3000 台\n目前京东暂未公布这款机器人的价格，但其他店铺显示的占位价为 300,000 元（即 30 万元）。优世界全尺寸超仿生人形机器人将于 6 月 30 日正式发布，\n预付 3000 元定金即可锁定首批名额\n商品详情页显示，优世界全尺寸超仿生人形机器人为情感陪伴而生，支持加密存储记忆、多维度外观定制等，\n男款身高 183cm，重量 42kg，拥有 88 个自由度，支持连接 Wi-Fi 和充电，续航 2-4 小时，不支持二次开发；\n女款身高 168cm，重量 35.2kg，拥有 88 个自由度，支持连接 Wi-Fi 和充电，续航 2-4 小时，不支持二次开发。"},{"t":"任天堂直面会汇总：《王国之心 4》《塞尔达传说：时之笛 重制版》《勇者斗恶龙怪物仙境 4》《东方红魔乡》","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/139.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，在今晚的直面会上，任天堂公布了一系列新作以及新情报，并宣布《塞尔达传说：时之笛》重制版将于 2026 年登陆 Switch 2 平台。\nIT之家汇总此次直面会主要内容如下：\n任天堂《节奏天国：奇迹之星》最新预告公开，7 月 2 日发售\n卡普空《鬼武者：剑之道》9 月 25 日一同登陆任天堂 Switch 2\n《龙之信条 2》DLC《黑暗觉者》宣传片公开，本体＋DLC 的完整版将于 10 月 9 日登陆任天堂 Switch 2\n《Orbitals》将于 9 月 3 日作为任天堂 Switch 2 独占游戏发布\n育碧经典重制《雷曼：传奇再叙》10 月 1 日同步登陆任天堂 Switch 2\n开罗游戏《海贼王：美食大冒险》正式宣传片公开，10 月 22 日登陆 NS1/2。\n《暗喻幻想：ReFantazio》Switch2 版 11 月 12 日发售\n《地球防卫军 5》Switch2 版 10 月 8 日发售，《地球防卫军 6》Switch2 版今冬发售\n《剑星》Switch2 版 2026 年内发售\n《匹诺曹的谎言：完全版》Switch2 版 8 月 6 日发售\n《宝可梦 Pokopia》免费 DLC 正式公开，8 月上线，同时宣布推出“拓展通行证”\n《火焰之纹章：万紫千红》宣传片公开，确认 9 月 17 日发售，登陆 NS2\n《信长的野望：飞翔》今冬发售\n《忍者棒棒糖 2》2027 年春发售。\n《Ninjala 2 未知星球》正式公开，2027 年春季推出登陆 NS2\n《咚奇刚挑战》今日晚些时候登陆 NS2 的 NSO\n《炼金工房》系列新作《卡莉亚的炼金工房 ~ 夜之王国与记忆的路标 ~》正式公开，2027 年初发售\n《悠米雅的炼金工房》现已登陆 NS2\n《异度神剑》系列新作《异度神剑 Genesis》正式公开，2027 年发售\n《异度神剑》NS2 数字版即刻上线，实体版 7 月 30 日发售\n《异度神剑 2》NS2 数字版 7 月 30 日上线，实体版 10 月 1 日发售\n《异度神剑 3》NS2 版 12 月 3 日发售，均支持 60 帧、4K/1080P 分辨率。\n《NS 运动 Resort》最新宣传片公开，共计 12 项可玩运动，10 月 22 日发售登陆 NS2。\n东方 Project 系列新作《东方红魔乡 New Classic～the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil.》宣传片公开，9 月 10 日登陆 NS / NS2\n香草社《胧村正：怪奇谭》正式公开，本作为本体移植版，将于 2027 年发售。\n《吸血鬼幸存者》团队新作《咒术回战 Rumble Survivaton》正式公开，2026 年内发售\n《三丽鸥派对乐园》10 月 29 日发售\n《永恒传说：复刻版》10 月 15 日发售\n最新宣传片公开，专属直面会将于 6 月 30 日开启，游戏将于 7 月 23 日正式发售。\n卡普空《鬼泣 5 恶魔猎人版》6 月 23 日登陆 NS2\nSE《最终幻想 Resonance》正式公开，10 月 22 日发售\n《Deltarune 第五章》正式公开，6 月 24 日免费上线。\n《勇者斗恶龙：怪物仙境 4 枯木国的碧安卡与芙萝拉》最新宣传片公开，12 月 3 日正式发售。\n《王国之心 4》最新宣传片公开，首发登陆 NS2，还将登陆 PS5、Xbox Series X|S、PC 平台\n《王国之心合集[I~III]》10 月 8 日登陆 NS2。\n《塞尔达传说：时之笛》重制版正式公开，2026 年内发售\n《星际火狐》NS2 版宣传片公开，游戏将于 6 月 25 日正式发售，今天开放免费试玩 DEMO\nFromSoftware 类魂新作《The Duskbloods》将于今年夏季开启封闭测试。\n《我的世界》NS2 版将于今年年内发布。"},{"t":"任天堂《塞尔达传说：时之笛》重制版公布，2026 年内发售","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/137.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，任天堂今天在新一期直面会宣布，《塞尔达传说：时之笛》重制版将在 2026 年内发售，\n登陆 Switch 2 平台\nIT之家注意到，原版《塞尔达传说：时之笛》发售于 1998 年，是 N64 平台的王牌作品，\n也是 Fami 通第一款满分游戏\n此外，1998 年的原版《塞尔达传说：时之笛》首次以 3D 形式展示海拉鲁大陆。任天堂曾在 2011 年针对 3DS 平台推出《塞尔达传说：时之笛 3D》，原版游戏目前也可以通过 NSO 会员扩展包的 N64 模拟器游玩。\nIT之家附《塞尔达传说：时之笛》重制版预告 CG 如下："},{"t":"任天堂 Switch 2 游戏《火焰之纹章：万缕千丝》新预告公开，9 月 17 日发售","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/131.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，任天堂今天在新一期直面会宣布，《火焰之纹章：万缕千丝》（Fire Emblem：万紫千紅）游戏将在 9 月 17 日发售，\n登陆 Switch 2 平台\n任天堂还在直面会上公布了本作的全新实际演示、预告。\n新作将延续回合制 RPG 玩法\n加入可自由探索的 3D 场景内容\n本作将围绕“英雄竞赛”展开\n，这场大赛背后藏着丰厚奖赏，但玩家必须在游戏中思考关键问题：你究竟愿意付出多少代价，超越所有竞争者，将荣誉据为己有？\nIT之家注：《火焰纹章》系列是由 Intelligent Systems 开发、任天堂发行的一系列战略角色扮演游戏。系列首作《暗黑龙与光之剑》于 1990 年发行，以红白机为游玩平台。它本是电子游戏制作人加贺昭三构思设计，并联同三位学生以同人游戏项目来制作的游戏。后来游戏取得成功，促成系列的诞生。"},{"t":"京能集团1.5GW风光大基地项目启动招标","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/09/50024142.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"乌兰察布京大1500MW风光火储一体化大型风电光伏基地项目（总装机1.5GW）启动工程造价咨询招标，招标人为北京京能电力乌兰察布分公司，标志该项目正式进入实质性建设推进阶段。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"风光储大基地","kp":["[总规模]: 1500MW风光火储一体化","[风电]: 120万千瓦","[光伏]: 30万千瓦","[储能]: 22.5万千瓦/4小时"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":4.5,"t":8.0},"b":"6月8日，乌兰察布京大1500MW“风光火储一体化”大型风电光伏基地项目工程造价咨询服务招标公告发布。\n根据公告，项目招标人为北京京能电力股份有限公司乌兰察布分公司。乌兰察布京大1500MW“风光火储一体化”大型风电光伏基地项目(简称“京大项目”)于2023年4月经国家能源局批准纳入内蒙古自治区第三批大型风电光伏基地建设项目正式清单，京大项目拟在乌兰察布丰镇市风资源较好的荒山上开发建设120万千瓦风电、30万千瓦光伏和22.5万千瓦/4小时储能设施，本期建设3座220kV升压站和1座储能站，暂称1#、2#、3#，4#，每座升压站分别以单回220kV线路接入新建500kV升压站220kV侧。其中1#~3#升压站各汇集500MW新能源。项目所发电力通过“京隆-大同-房山”500kV输电通道送至京津冀北电网消纳。\n招标范围:乌兰察布京大1500MW“风光火储一体化”大型风电光伏基地全过程工程造价咨询及其他工作，涵盖招标、初步设计、施工及竣工等阶段，负责从项目初期到竣工验收的各个阶段所涉及的造价工作开展全过程咨询服务。"},{"t":"一加 Turbo 6X 手机三色官图发布：搭载 144Hz LCD 护眼屏，6 月 10 日发布","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/145.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"产业进展","b":"X 系列手机已定档 6 月 10 日 14:30 正式发布，瞄准 1500 元档位。\nIT之家注意到，一加手机官方今日下午公布了一加 Turbo 6X 手机三色官图，包括「白里挑一」、「踏青云」和「星耀黑」。\n一加 Turbo 6X 配备 144Hz LCD 护眼屏\n内置 7000mAh 大电池\n搭载天玑 7360 SUPER 处理器\n，预装 ColorOS 16 系统。\n一加 Turbo 6X Pro 则是可选「心想事橙」和「跃马黑」两种配色，带来了 8000mAh 大电池 + 天玑 7400 SUPER 处理器，还有 1.5K 三星护眼屏和满级防水。"},{"t":"《鬼泣 5》6 月 23 日登陆任天堂 Switch 2 平台","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/132.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，在今晚的直面会上，卡普空《鬼泣 5》确认 6 月 23 日登陆任天堂 Switch 2 平台，这也是它首次登陆任天堂平台。IT之家注意到，其实体版将于 8 月 28 日发售。\n玩家将扮演尼禄、但丁、V 和维吉尔，在 TV 模式和掌机模式下以流畅的 60 帧体验《鬼泣》系列经典之作。"},{"t":"《网络测评活动规范》发布","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260609/b35580079eb7414caf1b572e3e778a0f/c.html","c":"不相关","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","b":"《网络测评活动规范》发布-新华网\n《网络测评活动规范》发布\n《网络测评活动规范》发布\n近日，国家网信办、市场监管总局联合印发《网络测评活动规范》（以下简称《规范》）。国家网信办有关负责人表示，《规范》旨在规范网络测评活动，维护公平竞争市场秩序，保护公民、法人和其他组织合法权益。\n近年来，网络测评快速兴起，测评类经营主体通过开展测试、对比分析数据、引用专业检测结果或者表达使用感受等方式，发布测试过程与评价结果，为消费者购物提供参考。但一些网络测评存在夸大宣传、只评不测、商测一体等问题，不仅影响消费者信任度和购物体验，也扰乱市场环境。出台《规范》，是推动网络测评活动健康发展的需要，也是优化营商网络环境、维护企业合法权益的需要。\n《规范》明确，从事网络测评活动，应当遵守法律、行政法规和国家有关规定，遵循商业道德、公序良俗，坚持客观、公正、全面、准确原则。《规范》要求，从事网络测评活动，涉及对产品功能、性能等项目测试，应当委托具有法定检验检测资质许可的检验检测机构按照相关标准以及技术规范开展测试。对食品开展检验检测的，测试方应当具备相应资质，不得使用非标方法，不得测评无国家标准检验方法的项目。不得采取不同标准、不同方法对同类产品进行横向、纵向比较。《规范》提出，未对产品开展测试，仅凭主观感受对产品进行评价，应当进行说明。网站平台要加强对网络测评信息内容管理，及时受理处置相关投诉举报。\n国家网信办有关负责人表示，网络测评活动要对照《规范》要求，自觉规范自身行为，维护公平竞争市场秩序和第三方合法权益，维护清朗网络空间。下一步，网信部门、市场监管部门将加强对网络测评活动监管，依法查处违法违规行为。（作者：宗和）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n科学与健康丨科技守护“耕地中的大熊猫”\n记者手记丨“都是咱中国的土地，上了岛就绝不后退”\n中泰合作“超级观测站”助力曼谷精准治霾\n走出剧场，戏剧仍在“现场”\n《网络测评活动规范》发布"},{"t":"《王国之心》前三部合集官宣登陆任天堂 Switch 2，10 月 8 日发售","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/141.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，Square Enix 今晚预告了玩家等待已久的《王国之心》系列新作《王国之心 IV》，不过目前披露的信息仍然有限。\n《王国之心 IV》将登陆任天堂 Switch 2、PS5、Xbox 和 PC，发售日期尚未公布。这也是《王国之心 III》2019 年推出后，系列首部全新正作。首支简短预告片同步公开。\n本次任天堂直面会还公布了更多《王国之心》消息。错过早期作品的玩家，可以在 Switch 2 上入手前三款作品合集。据IT之家了解，合集将于 10 月 8 日发售，值得一提的是，《王国之心 III》试玩版现已开放。"},{"t":"《斯普拉遁 涂击队》同捆 Switch 2、新配色 Joycon2 手柄 7 月 23 日同步发售","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/134.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，在今晚的直面会上，任天堂公布了《斯普拉遁 涂击队》最新实机预告，并宣布同捆 Switch 2 及新配色 Joycon2 手柄将于 7 月 23 日与游戏一同发售。\n任天堂还表示将于 6 月 30 日举办一场《斯普拉遁 涂击队》专场发布会，届时IT之家将为大家带来更多详细信息。"},{"t":"《宝可梦 Pokopia》游戏 DLC 公布：加入水下探索，8 月 26 日发售","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/128.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，任天堂今天在新一期直面会公布了《宝可梦 Pokopia》游戏的 DLC 扩展包，带来全新玩法。\nIT之家从发布会直播了解到，\n本次 DLC 将分三次更新，第一次更新名为“泡泡盆地”\n据悉，该 DLC 的首次更新将加入“水下探索”功能，使玩家能够潜入游戏世界的海底，探索全新天地。玩家在水下可以自由游泳、与宝可梦们玩耍、建造各种设施。\n此外，该 DLC 将在 8 月 26 日发售，包含三次重大更新。"},{"t":"《任天堂 Switch 运动度假胜地》官宣，10 月 22 日发售","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/135.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，《任天堂 Switch 运动度假胜地》（Nintendo Switch Sports Resort）今天在新一期直面会中亮相，登陆 Switch 2 平台。\nIT之家从发布会直播中获悉，\n《任天堂 Switch 运动度假胜地》是《Wii 运动度假胜地》的精神续作\n。新作主打体感玩法，收录拳击、乒乓球、射箭、网球、排球、保龄球、篮球、高尔夫、拇指摔跤、滑板、动力巡航、螺旋桨飞机、跳绳等 12 项运动。\n同时，本作的剧情将发生在乌富岛（Wuhu Island），玩家将使用 Joy-Con 2 手柄完成一系列运动游戏，10 月 22 日发售。"},{"t":"《The Duskbloods》今夏季举行游戏封闭测试，任天堂 Switch 2 独占","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/133.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，在今天的任天堂直面会上，FromSoftware 类魂新作《The Duskbloods》确认今年夏天开启封闭测试，这是一款最多支持 8 人的 PvPvE 多人动作游戏。\n《The Duskbloods》最初亮相于去年的任天堂 Switch 2 直面会，此后鲜有新消息曝光。\n角川集团在财报中表示：“FromSoftware 目前仍有多款作品在开发，其中包括《艾尔登法环：褪色者版》和《The Duskbloods》（\n两者均计划于 2026 年登陆任天堂 Switch 2\n在后续的问答环节中，官方透露了《The Duskbloods》的更多消息：“目前我们并未公布具体发售日期，本作将与任天堂联合销售，职责按地区划分。\n并且该作品将只在 Switch 2 上发售\n根据官方的说法，《The Duskbloods》是一款“以多人玩法为核心”的类魂作品，支持 8 名玩家同台竞技，玩家在游戏中既要彼此争夺至高地位，也要对抗强大的敌人。"},{"t":"“元晶体”面板可引导6G信号绕障传播","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260609/a1d7484c97634d488e63f81013345291/c.html","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"新华网科技","tg":"研究论文","tp":"6G元晶体面板","kp":["[技术]: 3D打印元晶体面板","[特性]: 无源引导6G信号绕障传播"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"芬兰阿尔托大学开发出\"元晶体\"面板，可引导6G信号绕过障碍物传播，解决地下室、隧道及大型建筑内部的通信死角问题，为6G高频段网络的全场景覆盖提供创新方案。","b":"“元晶体”面板可引导6G信号绕障传播-新华网\n“元晶体”面板可引导6G信号绕障传播\n“元晶体”面板可引导6G信号绕障传播\n地下室、隧道、大型建筑内部……这些地方常常因为无线信号被阻挡而成为通信“死角”。如今，芬兰阿尔托大学研究团队开发出一种可通过3D打印制造的名为“元晶体”的新型智能面板，无需电源和电子元件，即可像镜子反射光线一样，引导无线电波绕过障碍物传播，为未来6G网络低成本扩展覆盖范围提供了新方案。相关成果发表于最新一期《自然·通讯》杂志。\n3D打印元晶体面板可让无线电波绕过障碍物并导向用户，以一种低成本的方法来改善室内外无线电波覆盖范围，而无需添加基站、线路或供电电子设备。图片来源：芬兰阿尔托大学\n随着6G通信向更高频段发展，网络带宽将显著提升，但高频信号容易受到墙壁、人体及其他障碍物阻挡。当前解决信号覆盖问题通常依赖增加路由器、中继器和基站等设备，不仅建设和维护成本较高，也会增加能源消耗。\n此次，研究团队开发的元晶体是一种通过3D打印制造的无源智能面板。论文第一作者马赫迪·阿斯加里将其比作无线电波的“镜子”。他解释说，当房间光线不足时，人们既可以增加更多灯具，也可以利用镜子将现有光线引导到需要照明的位置。元晶体的作用与此类似，它并不产生新的无线信号，而是将已有信号重新定向，引导至原本难以覆盖的区域。\n这些面板可安装在墙壁、天花板、家具等表面，将信号引导到建筑拐角、遮挡区域，甚至定向传输给特定用户或设备，从而改善无线网络覆盖效果。\n与许多现有智能表面通常只能针对单一方向信号执行单一任务不同，元晶体采用三维结构设计，能够同时处理多个入射信号，并在多个频段上工作。除了反射和传输信号外，它还能吸收不需要的信号，从而减少无线干扰。\n研究团队表示，传统可重构智能表面往往需要大量可调单元和复杂控制电路，成本较高，难以广泛部署。而元晶体面板可直接采用3D打印制造，每块面板的材料成本预计仅需几十欧元，并可根据具体应用场景进行定制设计。该技术尤其适用于工厂、仓库、室内5G/6G网络以及长走廊等环境布局相对固定的场景。在这些场所，无源面板有望以更低成本实现无线信号优化。\n目前，研究团队正推动该技术商业化，并探索可根据环境变化自动调整性能的新一代可重构元晶体面板，希望未来将这种智能无线设备应用于室内空间和城市户外场景。 （记者张佳欣）\n各地“城超”探索文体旅商融合发展“长红”之路\n各地多举措推进粮食稳产增产\n新华解码丨惠及公众出行 租车行业迎来发展新指南\n科学与健康丨科技守护“耕地中的大熊猫”\n记者手记丨“都是咱中国的土地，上了岛就绝不后退”\n中泰合作“超级观测站”助力曼谷精准治霾\n走出剧场，戏剧仍在“现场”\n“元晶体”面板可引导6G信号绕障传播"},{"t":"1/4 类 SARS-CoV-2 中和抗体的 mRNA 递送可保护致死小鼠免受多种 sarbecovirus 的侵害","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536870123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The unyielding antigenic drift of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 (SARS-CoV-2), as well as the threat of future zoonotic sarbecovirus spillovers, has prompted the search for broadly neutralizing antibodies (bNAbs) to inform rational therapeutic and vaccine design. Here, we isolated and characterized 20 receptor binding domain (RBD)-directed bNAb lineages from a serially sampled SARS-CoV-2 patient who was infected and vaccinated during the early months of the pandemic. Thirteen of these targeted the highly conserved, cryptic class 1/4 or class 4 RBD epitopes and had long (18 to 26 amino acid) heavy chain complementarity determining region 3 loops that utilized the IGHD3-22 gene segment. Five bNAbs potently neutralized all 18 viruses in a panel containing SARS-CoV-2 variants up to the recently emerged XBB.1.5 and JN.1 strains as well as diverse sarbecoviruses from other clades. Structural analyses of the Ab401 and Ab568 bNAbs complexed with RBD and Spike trimer, respectively, revealed recognition features in common with other class 1/4 bNAbs. Prophylactic administration of Ab401 as a recombinant protein afforded robust protection against infectious challenge with either SARS-CoV-2_WA1 or a related bat sarbecovirus with zoonotic potential. A similar level of protection was achieved when the heavy and light chains of Ab401 were delivered as lipid nanoparticle-encapsulated mRNAs. These data expand the arsenal of SARS-CoV-2 bNAbs for clinical development and identify mRNA-based antibody delivery as a promising platform for both pandemic preparedness and protection of immunocompromised patients against emerging sarbecovirus variants.","tp":"新冠中和抗","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队从一名早期疫情期间经历感染和疫苗接种的SARS-CoV-2患者样本中，分离鉴定出20个针对受体结合域（RBD）的广谱中和抗体谱系，其中13个表现出广谱活性。该研究旨在应对SARS-CoV-2持续的抗原漂变以及未来动物源性sarbecovirus跨物种传播的威胁，为基于广谱中和抗体的治疗策略和疫苗设计提供依据。通过mRNA递送方式表达其中四分之一的抗体，可在致死剂量小鼠模型中提供针对多种sarbecovirus的保护作用。","aip":1},{"t":"硫族化锌半导体纳米晶：从合成到光电应用","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01317H","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"锌硫族纳米晶","kp":["[材料体系]: 锌硫族化合物半导体纳米晶","[特性]: 无重金属、宽带隙可调"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"综述聚焦环保型锌硫族化合物半导体纳米晶（ZnS、ZnSe、ZnTe及其合金），涵盖从合成方法到光电应用的最新进展。这些材料跨越从紫外到近红外的宽光谱范围，因低毒性、环境友好特性成为传统含铅/镉量子点的替代候选，在LED、光电探测器和光伏器件等领域具有应用潜力。","ot":"Zinc chalcogenide semiconductor nanocrystals: from synthesis to optoelectronic applications","b":"Eco-friendly Zn chalcogenide semiconductor nanocrystals (NCs)—including ZnS, ZnSe, ZnTe, and their alloys, which span zero-dimensional quantum dots, one-dimensional nanowires or nanorods, and two-dimensional nanoplatelets—are promising materials for advanced lighting and displays due to their heavy metal-free nature, excellent optical performance, and the wide bandgap tunability-enabled capability of light emitting from violet to red. Recently, significant progress has been made in Zn chalcogenide semiconductor NCs, encompassing the controlled synthesis of NCs and the applications in light emitting diodes (LEDs) and other optoelectronic applications. Herein, a systematic review of the controlled synthesis and device applications of eco-friendly Zn chalcogenide semiconductor NCs is provided for newcomers in this rapidly growing field, which helps steer its future development. First, this review introduces the nucleation and growth mechanisms of Zn chalcogenide semiconductor NCs, along with recent advancements. The focus is on growth models and the driving forces for NCs with different dimensions. Then, it discusses the controlled synthesis of NCs in terms of regulating shape, size, and surface chemistry, and the device structure design and charge transfer optimization for the application in LEDs, while also addressing the remaining challenges, such as optical performance and stability, along with promising solutions from the perspective of NCs and LEDs. Finally, other key optoelectronic applications such as photodetectors and photocatalysis are further discussed."},{"t":"世界首创：在人体中试验使细胞再次年轻的疗法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01836-7","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"A participant in a landmark clinical trial has been given a cellular-reprogramming treatment that aims to rejuvenate damaged cells in the eye. A participant in a landmark clinical trial has been given a cellular-reprogramming treatment that aims to rejuvenate damaged cells in the eye.","tp":"细胞重编程","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":6.0,"r":8.0,"d":3.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"一项具有里程碑意义的临床试验已完成首例人体给药，旨在通过细胞重编程技术修复眼部受损细胞，使其恢复年轻功能。该疗法利用表观遗传重编程手段逆转细胞老化，标志着抗衰老医学从动物实验正式迈入人体临床阶段，为退行性疾病治疗开辟全新路径。"},{"t":"为什么这么多年轻人得癌症？研究人员知道什么和不知道什么","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01780-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"Candidates for the trend are emerging, but are likely to vary from one type of tumor to another. Candidates for the trend are emerging, but are likely to vary from one type of tumor to another."},{"t":"Waymo以2.2亿美元收购苹果废弃的自动驾驶汽车测试场","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/09/waymo-buys-apple-project-titan-proving-ground-220-million/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","as":"自动驾驶公司Waymo以2.2亿美元收购了苹果公司废弃的自动驾驶汽车测试场，该场地位于亚利桑那州Wittmann附近，占地达5500英亩。苹果此前在此推进其秘密电动车项目（Project Titan），该项目于2024年正式终止。此次收购大幅扩充了Waymo的专属测试基础设施，体现了其在自动驾驶商业化竞赛中持续加码的战略意图，也标志着苹果造车项目资产的最终处置。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"自动驾驶测试场","kp":["[收购面积]: 5500英亩","[收购金额]: 2.2亿美元"],"sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":9.0},"ot":"Waymo buys Apple's abandoned self-driving car proving ground for $220M","b":"Fred Lambert\n| Jun 9 2026 - 6:51 am PT\nWaymo has acquired a massive 5,500-acre autonomous vehicle proving ground in Wittmann, Arizona, for $220 million — nearly double the $125 million Apple paid for it in 2021. The facility was the centerpiece of Apple’s now-dead self-driving car program.\nThe deal, recorded June 5 in Maricopa County filings, adds a world-class test facility to Waymo’s infrastructure as the company races to scale its robotaxi fleet to\n1 million weekly rides by the end of the year\nThe property was sold by Route 14 Investment Partners LLC, a Delaware shell company associated with Apple, according to documents first spotted by the Phoenix Business Journal. Apple originally purchased the proving ground in 2021 for $125 million after renting access to it for years. Before Apple, the facility served as Fiat Chrysler’s hot-weather testing ground for vehicles and components.\nApple used the 5,500-acre site to test prototype autonomous vehicles as part of its secretive car project, internally known as Project Titan. That effort went through multiple pivots over nearly a decade before Apple\nfinally killed it in early 2024\nafter spending billions of dollars.\nThe symbolism is hard to miss. Apple — one of the wealthiest companies on the planet — poured billions into developing a self-driving car and came away with nothing to show for it. Waymo, which has been methodically building actual autonomous driving technology for over 15 years, now owns the very facility where Apple’s ambitions went to die.\nThe Arizona facility is purpose-built for autonomous vehicle testing and dwarfs Waymo’s other test sites at the Castle Proving Ground in California and the Transportation Research Center in Ohio.\nThe proving ground includes a 115-acre city course that simulates urban driving conditions, a 35-acre vehicle dynamics area, a four-mile oval track, and a dedicated freeway course. Waymo told TechCrunch the facility will be used to simulate driving scenarios in a controlled environment, specifically supporting rider-only testing, motion control testing, operational training workflows, and future testing expansion.\nThe acquisition fits neatly into Waymo’s broader Arizona build-out. The company already operates a 239,000 square-foot factory in Mesa, Arizona, where Magna helps integrate Waymo’s self-driving hardware into the new\nZeekr-built Ojai robotaxi\nand eventually the Hyundai IONIQ 5. Having a massive dedicated test facility nearby streamlines the development-to-deployment pipeline.\nThe $220 million proving ground purchase comes as Waymo is in the most aggressive expansion phase in its history. The company\nraised $16 billion at a $126 billion valuation\nearlier this year — the largest investment ever in an autonomous vehicle company — and is deploying that capital rapidly.\nWaymo’s fleet now stands at close to 4,000 vehicles across more than 10 US cities, including San Francisco, Los Angeles, Phoenix, Austin, and Atlanta. The company has\nexpanded its total coverage area to more than 1,400 square miles\n— larger than the state of Rhode Island — and plans to enter 20+ additional cities, including its first international markets in Tokyo and London.\nMeanwhile, Tesla continues to promise an autonomous ride-hailing service while relying on camera-only hardware and human supervision. The contrast between Waymo’s methodical, infrastructure-heavy approach and Tesla’s software-promise strategy grows starker with each passing quarter.\nApple’s Project Titan is likely the most expensive failed car project in tech history, and the fact that Waymo takes it over from Apple tells you everything about the relative trajectories of these programs. Waymo is scaling so fast that it needs more testing capacity. Apple walked away entirely.\nWe also think this signals that Waymo is serious about expanding beyond its current vehicle types. A 5,500-acre facility with urban courses, freeway loops, and a high-speed oval gives Waymo room to test not just its current Ojai and IONIQ 5 platforms, but potentially future vehicle form factors as the company targets tens of thousands of robotaxis per year. Given the pace of its expansion, Waymo clearly believes it will need this infrastructure for years to come.\nIt would make sense as testing grounds for integrating the “Waymo Driver” in consumer vehicles from other automakers.\nIf you’re looking to reduce your transportation costs even further, powering your home with solar is one of the smartest investments you can make. With electricity rates climbing nearly 10% last year, home solar protects you against future rate increases. And with lease and PPA options, you can go solar with zero upfront cost and start saving immediately. If you want to find the best deal, check out\n. It’s a free service with hundreds of pre-vetted installers competing for your business, so you save 20 to 30% compared to going it alone. No sales calls until you pick an installer.\nGet your free quotes here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nFred is the Editor in Chief and Main Writer at Electrek.\nThrough Zalkon.com, you can check out Fred’s portfolio and get monthly green stock investment ideas.\nGet an edge on MMA with the best stats\nEnergySage helps you get the best price possible on a home solar installation for free and without hassel."},{"t":"从重组案例到未来实验室","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://nachrichten.idw-online.de/2026/06/09/vom-sanierungsfall-zum-zukunftslabor","c":"不相关","a":"Informationsdienst Wissenschaft-idw","tg":"行业观察","b":"Vom Sanierungsfall zum Zukunftslabor\nDas Reallabor „Transfor:Mathe“ zeigt am Mathematikgebäude der TU Berlin, wie Hochschulbauten ressourcengerecht transformiert werden können / Neues Dossier bündelt Hintergründe, Interviews und Impulse\nWie können Hochschulbauten angesichts von Klimakrise, Ressourcenknappheit und wachsendem Sanierungsbedarf zukunftsfähig weiterentwickelt werden? Antworten auf diese Frage gibt ein neues Dossier der Technischen Universität Berlin. Es versammelt Hintergründe, Interviews, Videos, FAQs und Impulse zur Zukunft des Mathematikgebäudes der TU Berlin sowie zur Transformation von Hochschulbauten insgesamt. Entstanden ist das Dossier im Rahmen des Reallabors „Transfor:Mathe“, das am Mathematikgebäude neue Wege für einen ressourcenschonenden Umgang mit dem Gebäudebestand erprobt.\nDas Mathematikgebäude an der Straße des 17. Juni wurde in den 1980er Jahren nach dem Vorbild ökologischer Glashausarchitektur errichtet. Heute steht es exemplarisch für zahlreiche Hochschul-, Forschungs- und Institutsbauten in Deutschland: Die Gebäude sind häufig von erheblichem Sanierungsbedarf, hohen Energieverbräuchen und komplexen Nutzungsanforderungen geprägt. Gleichzeitig verfügen sie über große räumliche und baukulturelle Qualitäten, die es zu erhalten gilt.\nReallabor für die Transformation von Hochschulbauten\nSeit Oktober 2025 koordiniert und begleitet das Natural Building Lab der TU Berlin das Reallabor „Transfor:Mathe“. In einem offenen, transdisziplinären Prozess arbeiten Forscher*innen, Student*innen und Praktiker*innen gemeinsam an Lösungen für die Zukunft des Gebäudes. Die entwickelten Forschungs- und Lernformate fließen sowohl in ein Sanierungskonzept für das Mathematikgebäude als auch in übertragbare Strategien für andere Hochschulbauten ein.\nIm Mittelpunkt stehen suffiziente Nutzungskonzepte, minimalinvasive Low-Tech-Maßnahmen, kreislaufgerechte Materialstrategien sowie neue Betriebs- und Managementmodelle. Ziel ist es, den Ressourcenverbrauch zu reduzieren und zugleich die langfristige Nutzbarkeit bestehender Gebäude zu sichern.\nSymposium als Ausgangspunkt für das Dossier\nWesentliche Impulse für die Inhalte des Dossiers lieferte das Fachsymposium „Re-Source Campus“, das am 27. Mai 2026 in der Kantine des Mathematikgebäudes stattfand. Dort diskutierten Vertreter*innen aus Forschung, Lehre, Planung, Gebäudebetrieb und Campusentwicklung über Strategien für die nachhaltige Weiterentwicklung von Hochschulstandorten. Die wichtigsten Themen und Erkenntnisse des Symposiums werden im Dossier aufgegriffen und vertieft.\nDas Dossier ist online abrufbar unter:\nhttps://www.tu.berlin/news/dossiers/sanierung-hochschulbauten\nÄhnliche Pressemitteilungen im idw"},{"t":"Voltalia在巴西获得322兆瓦电网接入用于数据中心 - 储能","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/09/voltalia-secures-322-mw-grid-connection-for-data-centers-in-brazil/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"数据中心绿电供应","kp":["[并网容量]: 322MW","[能源类型]: 风电为主供数据中心"],"as":"法国可再生能源公司Voltalia与巴西国家电网运营商签署了322兆瓦的输电网络使用协议（CUST），为该国数据中心提供清洁电力供应。此举顺应了全球科技巨头对南美数据中心算力扩张的需求，将可再生能源发电与高耗能数字基础设施相衔接。该项目反映了数据中心能源结构清洁化的国际趋势，也巩固了巴西作为拉美云计算枢纽的战略地位。","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":6.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Voltalia secures 322 MW grid connection for data centers in Brazil - Energy Storage","b":"Voltalia has signed a 322 MW transmission network use agreement (CUST) with Brazil’s national grid operator, enabling the company to supply future data center developments at the Port of Pecém. The company said it plans to develop dedicated renewable energy projects, primarily wind power, to serve the facilities.\nThe agreement forms part of Voltalia’s strategy to expand into digital infrastructure projects with large electricity demand, particularly data centers, a sector that has seen rapid growth in recent years.\nVoltalia said it is in advanced discussions with several data center operators and intends to develop renewable energy assets dedicated to supplying reliable, low-carbon electricity to the facilities.\nLocated in Ceará state, the Pecém industrial and logistics complex offers available land, existing infrastructure, and access to the transmission network, making it a potential location for large-scale digital infrastructure projects.\nVoltalia CEO Robert Klein said the agreement supports the company’s expansion in Brazil’s fast-growing data center market. He added that Pecém combines industrial and logistics infrastructure with access to high-quality renewable energy resources and secured grid connectivity, positioning the region to support large-scale, energy-intensive projects."},{"t":"Void-X：一种用于预测蛋白质原子堆积的生成式空隙填充模型","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607035123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"as":"Void-X是一种基于生成式AI的原子堆积预测模型，利用Transformer和扩散模型等算法，针对蛋白质内部的空腔区域进行原子堆积结构的预测与填充。该工作旨在推动蛋白质从头设计（de novo design）的能力，通过生成式方法填补已知结构中的空隙，为理解蛋白质内部原子排列提供新工具，具有在结构生物学和药物设计领域的应用潜力。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质结构预测","kp":["[设计策略]: 自上而下AI生成填充结构位点"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Void-X: A generative void-filling model for predicting atomic packing in proteins","b":"Generative AI algorithms such as the transformer and diffusion models have greatly empowered de novo design of proteins capable of specifically interacting with designated structural sites on another protein. Most of these design methods employ a top–down approach, in which an overall protein shape is generated by an AI model to pack against a given structural site, followed by sequence design to optimize the interaction. Despite being trained on limited protein complex structures available in the database, the top–down approach has yielded encouraging results. Here, we propose a bottom–up approach that generates atom clusters for optimal packing against a specified structured region for informing the design of protein–protein interactions. To this end, we trained a masked discrete diffusion model, named Void-X, that uses the diffusion transformer to learn atomic-level interactions and fill atomic voids in protein interaction interfaces. Void-X was trained using 8.7 million spherical clusters of atoms from experimental structures in the Protein Data Bank. In each cluster, ~70% of the atoms are used as context (or prompt), and ~30% are masked for information recovery (or answer). By training the model with 172 million parameters, Void-X achieves an overall accuracy of 78.3% and 68.2% for intra- and interchain spherical clusters, respectively. Furthermore, we find that information entropy is a reliable indicator of the prediction accuracy for Void-X. This level of performance allows de novo generation of molecular interactions at the atomic level, offering an alternative approach of protein design complementary to the existing ones."},{"t":"价态可控多光致变色：硅位点门控切换与光可切换路易斯超强酸性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2997357?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"多光致变色分子体系有望实现多态分子信息存储，但其切换过程的可控性一直是难点。本工作提出价态控制（Valency-Controlled）策略，实现门控切换（Gated Switching）与可光切换的Lewis酸碱功能。通过精确调控分子中光活性单元的数目与连接方式，该体系可在多个稳态之间选择性切换，为高密度分子信息存储和光控催化提供新思路。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光致变色分子开关","kp":["[门控机制]: 硅价态调控多光致变色状态分布","[分子开关]: 硅基二芳基乙烯Lewis酸"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Valency‐Controlled Multiphotochromism: Gated Switching and Photoswitchable Lewis Superacidity at Silicon","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Multiphotochromic systems promise multistate molecular information storage, yet strategies to control their switching‐state distributions and interchromophore communication remain scarce. Here, we demonstrate that silicon valency can serve as a molecular control element to gate multiphotochromism. Two silicon‐based diarylethene Lewis acids undergo stepwise twofold cyclization, with interconversion between tetra‐ and pentacoordinate states modulating electronic coupling between ligands. Donor coordination enables selective monocyclization, wavelength‐gated activation, or complete suppression of photoreactivity, depending on the bound base. In the donor‐free state, stepwise cyclization progressively enhances Lewis acidity and culminates in the first example of photoswitchable Lewis superacidity. In addition, dynamic Si─N/Si─O bond metathesis provides thermodynamic access to switching‐state distributions beyond statistical photochemical limits. These findings establish valency control as a design principle for multiphotochromic architectures."},{"t":"通过轻子对撞机的双强子碎片揭示光夸克汤川风味结构","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/p5c7-m43d","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Qing-Hong Cao, Xin-Kai Wen, Bin Yan, and Shu-Tao ZhangDirectly probing light-quark Yukawa couplings and their flavor structure remains a major challenge due to their smallness and overwhelming QCD backgrounds. In this Letter, we propose a theoretical framework to access these couplings at lepton colliders through transverse spin dependent azimuthal mod…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231901] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"面向光伏不确定性下可靠净零微电网的统一鲁棒-随机调度方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007658?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"零碳微电网调度","kp":["[调度]: 鲁棒-随机统一净零微网调度"],"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Unified robust–stochastic dispatch for reliable net-zero microgrids under PV uncertainty"},{"t":"具有钉扎宽横向复合区的超低压电化学有机场效应发光晶体管","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41563-026-02613-7","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Materials","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机发光晶体管","kp":["工作电压[电化学OLET]: 超低压(低于3.5V)","[发光机制]: 钉扎宽横向复合区"],"as":"该工作报道了超低压电化学有机发光晶体管，其阈值电压被钉扎（pinned）在极低水平。有机晶体管发光在用户交互显示、传感器件等应用中具有广阔前景，但传统器件需要较高工作电压。本研究通过电化学策略实现低压驱动下的高效发光，有望降低功耗并拓展有机发光器件在柔性电子和可穿戴设备中的实用化路径。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ultralow-voltage electrochemical organic light-emitting transistors with pinned and wide lateral recombination","b":"Light emission from organic transistors holds strong potential for user-interactive functionality across applications ranging from wearable and biointegrated systems to neuromorphic electronics. However, conventional single-active-layer organic transistors suffer from inefficient charge carrier injection, resulting in high drain voltages (>80 V in field-effect devices and >3.5 V in electrochemical devices with p–i–n junctions) and narrow, spatially dynamic recombination zones (−2 at 3.5 V, and operation with two 1.5-V batteries. This work advances single-active-layer OLETs and paves the way for organic electronic systems with intuitive, user-friendly visualization functions."},{"t":"乌克兰正式列装新型军用电动摩托车","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/09/ukraine-officially-adopts-new-electric-motorcycle-for-military-use/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"军用电动摩托","as":"乌克兰军方正式列装一款新型电动摩托车，用于武装部队作战用途。该装备突出隐蔽性与低噪音优势，适合侦察、突袭及前线快速机动任务，反映电动载具在现代非对称战争中的实战化趋势。这也标志着电驱技术从民用向战术场景的加速渗透，或推动各国军队对轻型电驱平台的采购与研发。","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.5,"t":8.0},"ot":"Ukraine officially adopts new electric motorcycle for military use","b":"| Jun 9 2026 - 12:08 am PT\nUkraine has officially approved a new electric motorcycle for use by its armed forces, highlighting the growing role that battery-powered two-wheelers are playing in modern military operations.\nAccording to\n, the Ukrainian Ministry of Defense recently announced that the domestically produced Wolfstorm electric motorcycle has been codified and approved for military service. The bike is designed as a lightweight, two-person transport platform capable of carrying soldiers and equipment across difficult terrain.\nAccording to the ministry, motorcycles have become some of the most valuable vehicles on the front lines, second only to pickup trucks. Their ability to quickly move personnel and supplies through areas with damaged infrastructure or limited road access has made them increasingly important for reconnaissance, logistics, and rapid-response missions.\nThe Wolfstorm weighs 105 kg (231 lb) and is powered by an 8 kW mid-drive electric motor mounted in the center of the frame for improved balance and off-road capability. The bike can reach speeds of up to 80 km/h (50 mph) and offers a range of around 100 km (62 miles) on a charge.\nOne particularly useful feature for military operations is the motorcycle’s modular battery system, which allows packs to be swapped quickly in the field. A full recharge takes around four hours, and the bike also includes reverse gear to improve maneuverability in tight spaces.\nThe electric motorcycle can carry up to 200 kg (440 lb), enough for two service members and additional equipment. Ukraine says the Wolfstorm can be used for reconnaissance, transporting explosive ordnance disposal teams, moving drone operators, logistical missions, evacuations, and security patrols.\nThe military also highlighted several advantages unique to electric propulsion, including near-silent operation, the absence of a significant thermal signature, lower operating costs, and reduced maintenance requirements.\nWe’ve seen electric motorcycles increasingly find niches where their unique advantages outweigh their limitations, and military applications\nmay be one of the most compelling examples.\nThe quiet operation of an electric drivetrain can be a significant tactical advantage, especially for reconnaissance and small-unit mobility. Combine that with instant torque, fewer mechanical components, and the ability to swap batteries, and it’s easy to see why electric motorcycles are attracting military interest.\nAs electric vehicle technology continues to mature, don’t be surprised if we see more armed forces around the world adding battery-powered two-wheelers to their fleets.\nAnd just as a reminder, Ukraine isn’t the only one expanding the use of electric two-wheelers.\nRussia has also made attempts\n, but those have often floundered against the Ukrainians.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nMicah Toll is a personal electric vehicle enthusiast, battery nerd, and author of the Amazon #1 bestselling books\nDIY Lithium Batteries\nDIY Solar Power,\nThe Ultimate DIY Ebike Guide\nThe Electric Bike Manifesto\nThe e-bikes that make up Micah’s current daily drivers are the\n$999 Lectric XP 2.0\n$1,095 Ride1Up Roadster V2\n$1,199 Rad Power Bikes RadMission\n$3,299 Priority Current\n. But it’s a pretty evolving list these days.\nBest $999 electric bike ever!\nGreat e-bikes at great prices!"},{"t":"加州大学洛杉矶分校的科学家发现了一些世界上最致命的癌症的“隐藏弱点”","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/ucla-scientists-uncover-a-hidden-weakness-in-some-of-the-worlds-deadliest-cancers/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"技术突破","b":"Researchers at\nhave identified a previously hidden weakness in some of the most aggressive cancers, pointing to a possible new way to attack tumors that have remained difficult to treat.\nSmall cell neuroendocrine cancers can develop in the lungs, prostate, and ovaries. These tumors grow quickly, spread early, and are notoriously resistant to treatment. One hallmark of these cancers is the loss of a gene known as RB, which normally helps keep cell growth under control. When RB is absent, cancer cells multiply unchecked and often evade targeted therapies.\nNew findings published in\nProceedings of the National Academy of Sciences\nsuggest that losing RB may also leave these cancers exposed to an important vulnerability.\nThe researchers discovered that cancer cells lacking RB become heavily reliant on a protein called E2F3. In laboratory experiments, blocking E2F3 stopped tumor growth. Scientists describe this relationship as “synthetic lethality.” While cancer cells can survive without RB, eliminating E2F3 at the same time creates a weakness severe enough to disrupt their survival.\n“Discovering a vulnerability like this opens the door to thinking about entirely new treatment strategies,” said study senior author Dr. Owen N. Witte, who holds the Presidential Chair in Developmental Immunology in the Department of Microbiology, Immunology, and Molecular Genetics and is a member of the UCLA Health Jonsson Comprehensive Cancer Center.\n“That’s especially important because there has not been a major change in how we treat these cancers for decades. When I first encountered these tumors as a medical student more than 50 years ago, the survival statistics were essentially the same as they are today.”\nProgress in developing treatments, especially for small-cell prostate cancer, has been slowed by a lack of reliable laboratory models. Without accurate models, researchers have struggled to identify the genes these tumors depend on and uncover potential therapeutic targets.\nTo overcome that challenge, the UCLA team created new experimental models by genetically modifying normal human prostate cells. The researchers introduced five major cancer-driving alterations, including the loss of RB and TP53. The cells were grown into organoids and then used to generate tumors in mice, producing models that closely mimic human small-cell prostate cancer. The work builds on more than a decade of efforts by Witte’s laboratory to develop specialized models of small-cell neuroendocrine prostate cancer.\nUsing these models, the team conducted genome-wide CRISPR screens, analyzing thousands of genes to determine which were essential for cancer cell survival. The researchers identified nearly 1,400 important genes and found that small cell cancers originating in different organs consistently relied on E2F3.\nFurther experiments showed that reducing E2F3 levels in RB-deficient cancer cells stopped the cells from dividing, prevented them from forming clusters, and in some cases, caused them to die. The findings suggest that while tumors can tolerate RB loss alone, they become highly vulnerable when E2F3 is also suppressed.\n“It’s not that the two genes do the same thing,” said Witte, who is also the founding director emeritus of the UCLA Broad Stem Cell Research Center and co-director of the Parker Institute of Cancer Immunotherapy Center at UCLA. “But the combination of what they do together becomes essential for the cancer cell. Losing one gene may not matter much, but losing both has a dramatic effect on tumor growth.”\n“These new model systems allowed us to uncover a genetic vulnerability that would have been very difficult to find otherwise,” added first author Dr. Evan Abt, an assistant professor of Molecular and Medical Pharmacology at the David Geffen School of Medicine at UCLA.\nBecause no medications currently target E2F3 directly, the researchers investigated another strategy. They found that blocking a metabolic pathway involved in producing\nbuilding blocks by inhibiting the enzyme DHODH reduced E2F3 levels and slowed tumor growth.\nImportantly, DHODH inhibitors, including leflunomide and teriflunomide, are already approved by the FDA for treating autoimmune diseases. That existing approval could help speed their evaluation as potential cancer therapies.\n“What’s exciting is that our findings open the door to applying existing drugs in a new way,” Abt said. “By understanding how these cancers depend on E2F3, we can start to think about strategies that might work much more quickly in patients.”\nAlthough the research remains at an early stage, the study provides valuable new insight into the biology of these aggressive cancers and highlights a promising direction for future treatment development.\nReference: “Synthetic lethality between RB-loss and E2F3 inhibition in small cell cancers targeted by pyrimidine synthesis blockade” by Evan R. Abt, Liang Wang, Grigor Varuzhanyan, Jack Freeland, Tian He, Guadalupe M. Peña-Garcia, Lauryn Ruegg, Jami McLaughlin, Donghui Cheng, Nikolas G. Balanis, Chia-Chun Chen, Yang Xu, Yi Xing, Sanaz Memarzadeh, Caius G. Radu, Thomas G. Graeber and Owen N. Witte, 20 March 2026,\nProceedings of the National Academy of Sciences\nDOI: 10.1073/pnas.2532814123\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nScientists Discover a Massacre: “Assassin” Cells Murder Innocent Cells\nSingle Cancer Cells Often Split into Three or More Daughter Cells\nProteins in a Cancerous Tumor’s Microenvironment Have Role in Drug Resistance\nβ-Catenin Regulates Telomerase in Stem Cells and Cancer Cells\nA Step Towards Understanding the Cellular Basis for Age-Related Vulnerability to Breast Cancer\nNucleic Acid Nanoparticles to Target Genes that Promote Tumor Growth\nA Potential Therapeutic Target for Treating Pulmonary Fibrosis\nNew Drug Fights Cancer by ‘Hijacking’ Existing T Cells\nNew Drug CD47 Could Potentially Shrink and Cure All Tumors"},{"t":"美国指责阿里巴巴、百度等公司协助中国军方列入黑名单","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/u-s-accuses-alibaba-baidu-others-aiding-chinese-military-blacklist-move","c":"不相关","a":"the information","tg":"政策监管","b":"U.S. Accuses Alibaba, Baidu, Others of Aiding Chinese Military in Blacklist Move — The Information\nRead this briefing for free"},{"t":"二维β-TeO2在相互矛盾的输运特征下仍为本征绝缘体","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01658-5","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nature Electronics","as":"","tg":"研究论文","tp":"二维氧化碲","kp":["[材料特性]: 二维β-TeO2本征绝缘体"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Two-dimensional β-TeO2 as an intrinsic insulator despite conflicting transport signatures"},{"t":"两种成分的植物防御优于一种成分","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2613743123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"在简单表面热力学的液体混合物中将气泡聚结速率调整多个数量级：实验","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535299123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The coalescence time of bubbles in a liquid depends on the nature of the liquid, which determines both its surface thermodynamics and the molecular interactions between the gas/liquid interfaces, and on the geometry, prescribed by the curvature of the bubbles. Coalescence is well described in pure liquids that have the same composition in bulk and at interfaces and in which the interactions are attractive. In contrast, the mechanisms are poorly understood in more complex liquids in which coalescence times are orders of magnitudes larger than in pure liquids and are unpredictable. To provide insight on these mechanisms, we use model systems: binary mixtures of miscible oils. In these liquids, interfaces have purely attractive molecular interactions and the surface thermodynamics can simply be described using a well-determined Gibbs elastic modulus, which is controlled by the composition of the mixture. We measure the coalescence rate by forming periodic trains of bubbles in millifluidic tubes whose radius varies over 1.5 decade. We report coalescence times spanning more than three decades and, for a given composition, varying according to a power law with curvature, with an exponent larger than that reported in pure liquids and independent of Gibbs elasticity. The experimental behavior is in excellent agreement with a numerical solution of the coupled thermodynamical and hydrodynamical equations, performed in the simple geometry of a suspended liquid film. Our results clearly reveal how geometry and surface thermodynamics modify the coalescence process of bubbles in the limit of small Gibbs elasticity.","tp":"气泡聚结力学","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"实验研究发现，液体混合物中气泡聚结速率可在多个数量级范围内被调控。研究揭示了表面热力学和气液界面分子相互作用对聚结时间的决定性作用。在纯液体中聚结机制已被充分描述，而复杂液体中气泡聚结过程长期缺乏理解，该实验填补了这一知识空白。"},{"t":"斯格明子晶格中的拓扑转变和位错弹性的出现：超越基特尔的磁极理论","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/4rww-4tsc","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Kohta Kasai, Akihiro Uematsu, Yu Wang, Tao Xu, Chang Liu, Susumu Minami, and Takahiro ShimadaSkyrmion dislocations exhibit intrinsic core structures possessing large skyrmion deformation and topological phase transitions.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236703] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"斯格明子拓扑","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队揭示了斯格明子晶格中拓扑转变与位错弹性的出现机制，超越了经典基特尔磁极理论。研究发现斯格明子位错具有本征核心结构，伴随大幅斯格明子形变和拓扑相变，为理解磁性拓扑缺陷的力学行为提供了新视角，对自旋电子学器件设计具有重要意义。"},{"t":"模拟中测量脂质膜高斯曲率模量的拓扑方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6d6f-q1mg","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Seamus F. Gallagher and Markus DesernoFission and fusion of lipid membranes are ubiquitous shape transformations in living cells, necessary for maintaining the shape of organelles and enabling a host of transport processes between them. These topology-changing events involve curvature-elastic free energy changes proportional to the Gaus…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 238201] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"脂质膜曲率","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出一种在分子动力学模拟中测量脂质膜高斯曲率模量的拓扑方法。脂质膜的分裂与融合是细胞内普遍存在的形状变换，涉及与高斯曲率弹性自由能成正比的拓扑变化。该方法为定量研究膜融合裂变的热力学提供了新工具，有助于理解细胞器形态维持和物质转运。"},{"t":"这些微小的肠道颗粒可能会加速整个身体的衰老","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/these-tiny-gut-particles-could-be-accelerating-aging-throughout-the-body/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Tiny particles from the gut may be carrying aging signals throughout the body, offering a surprising new clue to chronic disease.\nResearchers at the Marshall University Joan C. Edwards School of Medicine have uncovered new evidence that microscopic particles produced in the gut may contribute to the inflammation and chronic diseases often associated with aging. The findings provide fresh insight into the connections between gut health, metabolism, immune function, and even sleep.\nThe research, published in\n, focused on gut luminal exosomes, tiny particles that help cells communicate by carrying proteins and genetic material throughout the body. Scientists discovered that exosomes collected from older animals contained molecular signals linked to\nresistance, inflammation, and damage to the gut barrier. When those exosomes were transferred to younger animals, they triggered similar biological changes.\nIn contrast, transferring gut luminal exosomes from young animals to older animals reduced several metabolic changes associated with aging. The results suggest that the gut environment may play an important role in the development of age-related diseases.\nAccording to the researchers, these exosomes may do more than simply reflect aging-related changes. The particles themselves could actively contribute to disease development.\nA weakened gut barrier can allow inflammatory substances to escape into the bloodstream. This process may promote chronic inflammation throughout the body and increase the risk of conditions such as heart disease and metabolic disorders.\n“This study helps clarify how the physiological stressors associated with biological aging may accelerate biological processes linked to aging and disease,” said Abdelnaby Khalyfa, M.Sc., Ph.D., professor of biomedical sciences at the Joan C. Edwards School of Medicine and lead author on the study. “Understanding these mechanisms is essential to identifying new targets for intervention and improving long-term outcomes for patients.”\nThe findings add to growing evidence that aging affects multiple biological systems simultaneously, including metabolism, immune function, and cellular communication pathways.\nResearchers also identified specific molecules carried within the exosomes that could eventually help scientists better understand, detect, and treat diseases linked to aging. The results may be particularly relevant to chronic conditions characterized by long-term physiological stress, many of which share underlying biological pathways with the aging process.\nReference: “Gut Luminal Exosomes in Young and Old Mice: Multi-Omic Characteristics and Regulation of Gut Permeability” by Abdelnaby Khalyfa, Lyu Zhen, Trupti Joshi and David Gozal, 26 March 2026,\nDOI: 10.1111/acel.70455\nThe study was conducted by Abdelnaby Khalyfa, Trupti Joshi, Ph.D., and David Gozal, M.D., M.B.A., Ph.D. (Hon) of Marshall University, along with Lyu Zhen of the University of Missouri.\nFunding for the research included unrestricted start-up funds awarded to Khalyfa by the Joan C. Edwards School of Medicine through the Marshall University Research Corporation (MURC) in Huntington, West Virginia. Gozal also received partial support from NIH grants HL166617 and HL169266. Additional support came from the National Institute of General Medical Sciences of the\nNational Institutes of Health\nthrough Award Number P20GM103434 and the West Virginia IDeA Network of Biomedical Research Excellence (WV-INBRE).\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nMetabolic Disorders\nScientists Think the Real Fountain of Youth May Be Hiding in Your Gut\nExtra Virgin Olive Oil Linked to Better Brain Function\nThis Gut-Boosting Drink Could Protect Your Brain From Dementia\nReversing Time From Within: Can Gut Bacteria Delay Aging?\nAI Reveals Health Secrets Through Facial Temperature Mapping\nTanning’s Hidden Cost: Sun Exposure Can Disrupt Skin’s Microbiome\nFecal Transplants Reverse Hallmarks of Aging in the Gut, Eyes, and Brain\nMediterranean Diet May Help Curb Advance of Frailty and Cognitive Decline in Older People\nResearchers Can Accurately Estimate Your Age Based on the Microbes Living on Your Body"},{"t":"内群体和外群体亲社会性的共现需要跨群体的合作伙伴选择","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606967123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"开始新的一天的最佳方式是什么？科学支持在阳光下裸侧翻","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01822-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A dazzling book explains our bodies’ dependence on sunlight for everything from sleep to skin and bone health. A dazzling book explains our bodies’ dependence on sunlight for everything from sleep to skin and bone health."},{"t":"城市脉搏：将城市化过程诊断为尖峰、周期性和异步的","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537770123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Many urban indicators predominantly focus on static outcomes, failing to capture the dynamic nature of urbanization. Here, we introduce the concept of the Urban Pulse to characterize urbanization as a process of continual spatiotemporal change. Using dense time series remote sensing data, we operationalize the Urban Pulse for six cities that represent diverse development levels, economies, and geographies: Seattle, Shenzhen, Lagos, Mumbai, Dubai, and Mexico City. We then use the Urban Pulse to assess how COVID-19 affected each of the six cities. The results empirically substantiate three major insights. First, urbanization is inherently spiky, characterized by episodic events that deviate from baseline trends. Second, urbanization is cyclical, reflecting transitions through stages of expansion, stabilization, or decline, and does not occur with predictable frequency, such as seasonal patterns. Third, urbanization is asynchronous, with subcity areas exhibiting uncoordinated development patterns. The Urban Pulse COVID-19 analysis shows that while urbanization processes for some cities have not returned to prepandemic patterns, other cities exhibit a significant shift in patterns postpandemic. These findings suggest that the selection of a neighborhood or subcity area as an observation unit may have little bearing on a city as a whole. By capturing these spatial and temporal rhythms, the Urban Pulse framework provides a comprehensive understanding of process dynamics, enabling researchers to link processes to outcomes more effectively. This approach allows for the recognition of early warning signals at subcity scales and may facilitate targeted interventions at the neighborhood level, where they are most impactful.","tp":"城市遥感脉搏","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出'城市脉搏'概念，将城市化过程刻画为尖峰状、周期性和异步的时空动态变化。利用密集时间序列遥感数据，研究对西雅图、深圳、拉各斯、孟买、迪拜和墨西哥城六个代表性城市进行分析，突破了传统静态城市指标无法捕捉城市化动态特征的局限。"},{"t":"供应链访谈：Bhavik Pathak，阿尔斯通","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/the-supply-chain-interview-bhavik-pathak-alstom","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Bhavik Pathak explains how Alstom is shifting from cost-focused sourcing to AI-driven resilience, supplier collaboration and predictive risk management\nAaron McMillan\nBhavik Pathak explains how Alstom is shifting from cost-focused sourcing to AI-driven resilience, supplier collaboration and predictive risk management\nAaron McMillan\nPrioritise Us\nBhavik Pathak explains how Alstom is shifting from cost-focused sourcing to AI-driven resilience, supplier collaboration and predictive risk management\nThe global supply chain conversation is no longer centred solely on transactional sourcing or securing the lowest unit price. Instead, organisations are increasingly focused on how quickly they can build operational ecosystems capable of withstanding disruption. Geopolitical tensions, fluctuating material costs and sudden tariff changes have fundamentally reshaped supply chain priorities, pushing resilience to the forefront of procurement strategy.\nFew industries understand this challenge better than rail transport, where globally distributed supply chains must meet strict quality and safety standards while managing immense operational complexity.\n“I would say there is a massive shift in terms of resilience,” says Bhavik Pathak,\nDirector and Head of Supplier Quality for the Americas Region at Alstom.\n“The value has changed. It's not very typical or traditional sourcing activities. Now, the value has shifted because we want to have a solid supply chain across the board.”\nAlstom is one of the world’s largest rail manufacturers, designing and supplying everything from high-speed trains and trams to signalling systems and rail maintenance solutions. The company operates across 63 countries with more than 83,000 employees globally. In the Americas region alone, it employs around 12,000 people spanning operations from Canada to Argentina.\nFor Bhavik, managing such a vast network means rethinking the traditional sourcing model.\n“If I talk about our market, the rail market, our supply bases are spread globally,” he explains. “It’s not just a matter of getting the part at the lowest price. We need to ultimately reduce the risk for the organisation.”\nThat shift has accelerated as manufacturers face overlapping pressures from geopolitical instability, tariffs, logistics disruption and volatile commodity pricing. According to Bhavik, the key question is no longer simply who can supply the cheapest component, but how quickly a supply network can recover during a crisis.\n“Let’s say we have a crisis situation, how fast can we recover?” he asks. “Because of the geopolitical tensions and a lot going on right now in the global market, prices are fluctuating and then it comes with tariffs and all that.”\nTo navigate these pressures, Alstom is increasingly evaluating suppliers through the lens of Total Cost of Ownership (TCO), rather than focusing exclusively on initial purchase price.\nFor Bhavik, this means considering hidden operational risks such as freight volatility, supplier resilience and recovery timelines during disruption.\n“Quality is not just about compliance,” he says. “Quality is all about trying to take a strategic advantage. It’s not just focusing on the unit price; it is the total cost of ownership.”\nThis represents a major cultural shift for procurement and supplier quality teams. Historically, aggressive cost reduction strategies often pushed financial pressure further down the supply chain, increasing instability among lower-tier suppliers.\n“If I just keep on pushing my supplier to get better pricing, they’re going to push their suppliers,” Bhavik explains. “Ultimately, there is going to be the probability of quality deterioration as well.”\nInstead of relying on purely transactional\nsupplier relationships\n, Alstom is prioritising long-term collaboration and shared operational visibility.\n“The key thing to do is to partner with your suppliers,” Bhavik says. “It should not be focused on the pricing only. It should be continuous improvement, and you can share those benefits.”\nImportantly, Bhavik argues that collaboration also means sharing operational challenges when market disruption occurs.\n“You can share those pains as well,” he adds. “If you have a situation from a tariff, you need to open up and listen to your supplier, work with your management and everybody, and you need to adopt that.”\nFor manufacturers operating across large international supply networks, this collaborative approach is becoming increasingly important as volatility becomes a permanent feature of global trade.\nAt the same time, Alstom’s supply chain transformation is unfolding alongside a broader industry push towards sustainability and green mobility.\nThe company is investing in renewable energy initiatives across its manufacturing operations while continuing to develop lower-emission rail technologies, including hydrogen-powered trains.\n“Wherever it’s possible, we try to adopt solar technology,” says Bhavik. “Some of our plants in our region, certain sections, we are just relying on that green energy right now.”\nAlongside renewable-powered manufacturing, Alstom is also investing heavily in research and development around hydrogen propulsion technology.\n“We have a solution where we have a hydrogen train,” Bhavik explains. “Recently we had a trial in Canada for our\ntrain solution.” The company continues to expand R&D investment and innovation capabilities to strengthen these technologies further.\n“There is dedicated research and development ongoing as well to make this technology more robust,” he says. “We have an innovation centre as well. We are heavily investing in those because that’s the need of the hour right now.”\nFor Alstom, sustainability is increasingly becoming integrated into long-term operational strategy, rather than sitting separately as a corporate responsibility initiative.\nLooking ahead over the next five years, Bhavik believes the next major transformation will come through predictive risk management powered by AI and better-quality operational data.\nThe goal is to move supply chain management away from reactive crisis response towards earlier identification of disruption risks.\n“For the next five years right now, the focus is on to ensure that we mitigate the risk quickly, we predict the risk quickly,” he says.\nHowever, Bhavik stresses that AI systems are only as valuable as the data foundations supporting them.\n“AI works on data,” he explains. “If we do not have the right quality of data, that won’t help.”\nTo address this, Alstom is actively collecting procurement and supplier quality data to build predictive risk models capable of triggering faster operational action.\n“We are collecting the data, we are using AI to predict those models and trigger action,” Bhavik says. The objective is ultimately to reduce operational disruption while protecting profitability.\n“What do we do right now to avoid the crisis situation in the future? How can we safeguard the company’s margins? That’s the fundamental bottom line.”\nThis transformation is also reshaping the role of procurement and\nsupplier quality\nprofessionals themselves. Traditional buyer and compliance-focused positions are evolving into broader strategic roles focused on resilience, data intelligence and risk mitigation.\n“We are changing from a traditional buyer model or the supplier quality engineer model to more of a risk and value architect,” Bhavik says.\nAs global supply chains continue to evolve, Bhavik believes the organisations that succeed will be those capable of anticipating disruption early, collaborating closely with suppliers and building resilience directly into their operational strategy.\nDirector and Head of Supplier Quality - Americas Region","tp":"AI供应链","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":2.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.0},"as":"阿尔斯通供应链高管Bhavik Pathak介绍了公司从以成本为导向的采购模式转向AI驱动的供应链弹性管理模式。该策略重点包括供应商协作、预测性风险管理和智能化决策，旨在通过人工智能技术提升供应链的韧性和可持续性，应对全球制造业日益复杂的不确定性挑战。"},{"t":"下一场计算革命或许来自像摩天大楼一样堆叠芯片","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/the-next-computing-revolution-may-come-from-stacking-chips-like-skyscrapers/","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"scitechdaily","as":"研究人员成功将平面硅芯片转化为高密度垂直堆叠的三维架构，有望开启下一代计算革命。该技术通过将逻辑与存储层紧密叠合，大幅缩短数据传输路径、降低功耗并提升集成密度，突破了传统摩尔定律在二维平面缩放上的物理极限，为后摩尔时代高性能计算提供了全新工程路径。","tg":"技术突破","tp":"3D芯片堆叠","kp":["[技术路线]: 2D→3D密集堆叠突破平面缩放极限"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"The Next Computing Revolution May Come From Stacking Chips Like Skyscrapers","b":"Researchers may have unlocked the future of computing by turning flat silicon chips into densely stacked 3D architectures.\nFor decades, the semiconductor industry has boosted computing power by making transistors smaller and fitting more of them onto a single chip. That strategy has fueled remarkable advances in electronics, but it is now approaching fundamental physical limits. As devices shrink toward atomic scales, engineers must contend with the constraints of material properties and the effects of quantum mechanics.\nResearchers believe the next major advance may come not from making chips smaller, but from building them upward.\nA team at the University of Illinois Grainger College of Engineering has demonstrated a new way to stack layers of silicon circuits directly on top of one another, creating compact three-dimensional chips that could deliver greater computing power while using less energy. Their work, published in\n, overcomes a major obstacle that has long prevented widespread adoption of this approach.\n“Take something as simple as static random-access memory, which is universal in CPUs and GPUs. Today it takes six microelectronic devices called transistors on a single plane to store one bit of information. With vertical integration, you can distribute them across multiple layers. It’s like replacing a sprawling suburb with high-rises: you get the same functionality, but the spatial footprint is reduced while making communication between layers faster and more efficient,” said Qing Cao, a professor of materials science and engineering at Illinois Grainger Engineering.\nFor more than 60 years, the semiconductor industry has followed Moore’s law, the observation that transistor density on a chip roughly doubles every two years. This trend has served as a guiding target for chip manufacturers, enabling steady gains in performance and efficiency.\nThat progress is becoming increasingly difficult to sustain.\n“In a sense, we’re hitting a limit imposed by physics,” Cao said. “If you look at the actual size of transistors, they’re not getting smaller, especially in terms of their contacted gate pitch. This is because we’re becoming limited by the intrinsic material properties of silicon and the fundamental rules of quantum mechanics. If we’re going to keep up the trend of increasing processing power of our microprocessors, we have to start thinking beyond just squeezing more devices on a single surface.”\nInstead of continuing to shrink transistors, many researchers see vertical integration as the next logical step. Stacking devices in multiple layers creates additional space for circuitry while shortening the wiring needed to connect components. Shorter connections reduce parasitic capacitance and significantly increase communication bandwidth between devices and circuit blocks.\nThese advantages are particularly attractive for\nartificial intelligence\nand other data-intensive applications that demand ever-increasing computing performance.\nSeveral commercial products already use three-dimensional chip technologies. These systems are typically made by manufacturing semiconductor devices on separate wafers and then bonding them together afterward.\nWhile that method has enabled technologies such as high-bandwidth memory and 3D V-Cache, it has limitations. The alignment between layers is relatively coarse, and the vertical connections known as through-silicon via (TSV) are comparatively large and widely spaced.\nMonolithic three-dimensional integration takes a different approach. Instead of stacking completed wafers, each layer is built directly on top of the one beneath it during fabrication.\nThis strategy allows vertical connections to be 10-100 times denser, reduces the distance between layers, and enables alignment with nanometer-scale precision.\nDespite its promise, monolithic integration has remained difficult to achieve in practice because of one major issue: heat.\nProducing high-quality crystalline silicon and fabricating advanced semiconductor devices typically requires temperatures approaching 1,000 degrees\n. However, the metal wiring already present in lower chip layers cannot withstand such extreme heat.\n“Generally, the industry accepts that once the first layer of circuits is complete, the thermal budget limit for any additional layers is 400 degrees Celsius,” Cao said. “Researchers in both academia and industry have tried to get around this by working with semiconductor materials other than single-crystalline silicon for the upper layers. But the resulting devices all inevitably suffer from issues with performance and reliability.”\nPrevious efforts have explored alternatives including polycrystalline silicon, amorphous or nanocrystalline metal oxides, carbon nanotubes, and two-dimensional\nsemiconductors\n. However, these materials often introduce performance limitations or processing defects that create a mismatch with the high-performance silicon devices in the lower layers.\nThe Illinois team developed a different solution that retains industry-standard single-crystalline silicon throughout the structure.\nTheir method begins by creating ultrathin freestanding silicon nanomembranes from a donor wafer. These membranes are then transferred onto a substrate that already contains completed circuitry using a roll laminator. The bonding process requires temperatures no higher than 200 degrees Celsius, well below the industry’s accepted thermal limit.\nBecause the silicon remains highly crystalline, the resulting devices maintain strong performance and reliability while avoiding heat damage to lower layers.\n“Our method is not only easier to implement with lower cost, but it has several advantages over previous approaches to stack silicon wafers,” Cao said. “The membranes we transferred are only 10 nanometers thick or less, compared to the 500 to 700 micrometers thickness of a typical wafer. Because they are thin, these membranes are mechanically flexible to conform to the underlying surface. This conformality helps avoid interfacial defects like voids, which are common when trying to force two rigid wafers together via wafer bonding.”\nThe researchers also redesigned the transistor architecture.\nTraditional semiconductor manufacturing relies on a process called doping, which introduces impurities into silicon to control its electrical behavior. This step usually requires temperatures above 600 degrees Celsius, making it unsuitable for monolithic stacking.\nTo avoid that challenge, the team employed junctionless transistors. In these devices, the silicon is heavily and uniformly doped before stacking occurs. Because the silicon films are extremely thin, the transistor gate can still effectively control the channel, while the high doping concentration helps reduce parasitic contact resistance.\nUsing their approach, the researchers fabricated three stacked layers containing 625 transistors per layer. The devices demonstrated strong uniformity and high yields.\nPerformance was also impressive. Output current densities matched those of conventional silicon transistors fabricated on bulk wafers using much higher temperatures and were at least three to four times greater than monolithic devices made from alternative materials.\nThe team connected the layers using vertical metal lines and successfully demonstrated three-dimensional integrated logic circuits and static random-access memory cells.\nPerhaps most importantly, the researchers believe the process can be expanded beyond the three layers demonstrated in the study.\n“But most importantly, we’ve shown that this process is scalable,” Cao said. “You can keep stacking layers beyond the three we demonstrated. And the process will yield high-performing transistors with high yield and low variability. We now have a strong foundation for transferring this technology and demonstrating its immediate promise in an industrial semiconductor foundry.”\nThe researchers reported device yields of 98‒100% even in an academic cleanroom environment, a result that suggests strong potential for industrial manufacturing.\n“Vertical integration is already starting to make its way into commercial devices, particularly in specialized AI hardware, but monolithic integration is what unlocks the full promise of 3D chips,” Cao said. “For the first time, we have met the thermal budget of monolithic 3D integration using standard single-crystalline silicon and delivered unprecedented performance.”\nReference: “Monolithic three-dimensional integration of silicon transistors” by Bao Lam, Yung Man Yu, Hyunjun Nam, Hsu-Chih Ni, Shomik Chatterjee, Shaloo Rakheja, Jian-Min Zuo and Qing Cao, 27 May 2026,\nDOI: 10.1038/s41586-026-10496-6\nThe work was carried out through Illinois Grainger Engineering’s Center for Advanced Semiconductor Chips with Accelerated Performance, whose industry partners include IBM, Intel, and Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company. The team is now working to transfer the technology to an industrial semiconductor foundry.\nAdditional contributors to the study included Bao Lam, Yung Man Yu, Hyunjun Nam, Hsu-Chih Ni, Shomik Chatterjee, Shaloo Rakheja, and Jian-Min Zhuo.\nFunding was provided by the National Science Foundation, industry partners of Illinois Grainger Engineering’s Center for Advanced Semiconductor Chips with Accelerated Performance, and the Silicon Crossroads Microelectronics Commons Hub.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nSemiconductors\nUniversity of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign\nA New Layer of Innovation: Next-Gen Nanostructures Unlock Ultra-Low Power Electronics\nMolecular Teamwork To Boost Performance of Smartwatches and Solar Cells\nMIT Discovers Semiconductor That Can Perform Far Better Than Silicon\nMIT’s Low-Cost Fabrication Method for Thin Mirrors and Silicon Wafers Could Be a Game-Changer\nTwilight for Silicon? End of “Moore’s Law” in View As Silicon Chip Density Nears Physical Limit\nLaser-Driven Semiconductor Switch for Next-Generation Communications\nRoadmap: Silicon Technology Boost With Graphene and 2D Materials\nGallium Nitride Electronics Poised to Drastically Cut Energy Usage\nDissolvable Electronic Components Could Be Used in Medical Implants"},{"t":"曾占满实验室的激光器如今可集成于微小芯片","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/the-laser-that-once-filled-a-lab-now-fits-on-a-tiny-chip/","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"scitechdaily","as":"超快激光曾需占据整间实验室，如今已被集成至微型芯片上。超快激光能产生仅数百飞秒（千万亿分之一秒）的光脉冲，广泛应用于精密加工、光学频率梳与时间分辨光谱学。芯片化集成将这一尖端技术从实验室推向便携化与量产化，有望在生物医学成像、先进制造及光通信等领域实现大规模低成本部署。","tg":"技术突破","tp":"芯片级激光器","kp":["[脉冲宽度]: 几百飞秒","[集成化]: 超快激光实现芯片级集成"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"The Laser That Once Filled a Lab Now Fits on a Tiny Chip","b":"Ultrafast lasers generate bursts of light that last only a few hundred femtoseconds, each one just a quadrillionth of a second long. These extremely short pulses are used in a wide range of technologies, including precision manufacturing, eye surgery, and optical frequency combs, the Nobel Prize-winning innovation that powers the world’s most accurate optical atomic clocks.\nDespite their importance, ultrafast lasers have generally remained large, costly systems that occupy entire optical tables in research laboratories. After more than two decades of work by scientists around the world, shrinking these devices onto a photonic chip has remained an elusive goal.\nNow researchers led by Professor Tobias J. Kippenberg at EPFL have achieved that milestone. Writing in Nature, the team reports the first integrated ultrafast laser capable of matching the performance of traditional tabletop femtosecond lasers, producing pulses as short as 147 femtoseconds with energies reaching 1.05 nanojoules.\nPhotonic chips manipulate light using microscopic structures called waveguides that are patterned onto a wafer. In many ways, they function like electronic chips, except they direct light rather than electrical currents. These chips are already widely used in telecommunications and have helped shrink many optical technologies that once required much larger equipment.\n“For more than twenty years, a high-pulse-energy femtosecond laser on chip was widely regarded as a holy grail of integrated photonics,” says Kippenberg. “Our result shows that it is not only possible, but that it can be achieved with a surprisingly elegant architecture that the integrated-photonics community had overlooked.”\nTo reach this goal, the researchers adopted a little-used laser architecture known as the Mamyshev oscillator.\nInside the laser cavity, a nonlinear waveguide is placed between two optical filters, each of which passes a different portion of the light spectrum. As a strong pulse travels through the waveguide, its spectrum broadens, allowing some of that light to pass through both filters and continue circulating within the cavity. Weaker light does not broaden enough and is filtered out.\n“This design is especially attractive because it does not require any component that is difficult to make on this erbium-doped silicon nitride chip,” explains Zheru Qiu, a co-leading author of the paper.\nAccording to Qiu, the design offers another major advantage. Photonic chips confine light to extremely small waveguides, which increases nonlinear interactions between light waves. In many conventional laser designs, these interactions can destabilize the laser pulses. The Mamyshev oscillator, however, is far less sensitive to those effects, making it particularly well suited for integrated photonic devices.\nThe laser cavity measures 42 centimeters in length, yet it can be folded onto a chip occupying roughly the area of a match head. That makes it dramatically smaller than conventional fiber-based ultrafast laser systems.\nBecause photonic chips can be fabricated at the wafer level using manufacturing techniques similar to those used for computer chips, more than 1,000 laser cavities could potentially be produced in a single batch. This capability could significantly reduce costs while expanding access to ultrafast laser technology for sensing, spectroscopy, and precision measurement applications.\n“With kilowatt-level peak powers, the chip can drive demanding applications that have long depended on large, expensive laboratory lasers,” says Qiu.\nThe advance could eventually lead to compact and affordable devices for detecting environmental pollutants, identifying hidden material defects, and performing medical diagnostics. It may also help pave the way for portable optical atomic clocks that could support future communication and navigation technologies.\nReference: “High-pulse-energy integrated mode-locked laser using a Mamyshev oscillator” by Zheru Qiu, Xuan Yang, Xurong Li, Jianqi Hu, Zhongshu Liu, Yichi Zhang, Xinru Ji, Jiale Sun, Grigory Lihachev, Zihan Li, Ulrich Kentsch and Tobias J. Kippenberg, 3 June 2026,\nDOI: 10.1038/s41586-026-10517-4\nOther Contributors\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nOptoelectronics\nHarvard Scientists Unveil Tiny Ring Laser With Giant Potential\nPhotonic Chip Unlocks Ultra-Broadband Optical Signal Boosting\nRevolutionizing Light: The Breakthrough Frequency Comb Transforming Photonics\nSharper, Smaller, Smarter: Scientists Develop Groundbreaking Miniature Fiber Laser\nRevolutionizing Photonics: Lithium Tantalate Powers Next-Gen Optical Circuits\nHarnessing Chaos: A Revolutionary Approach to Laser Ranging\nResearchers Develop a Portable Terahertz Laser for Powerful Sensing and Imaging\nBreakthrough in the Creation of Electrically Driven Nanolasers for Integrated Circuits\nUsing Air to Amplify Light in Hollow-Core Optical Fibers"},{"t":"康普茶的惊喜：一种成分极大地改变了其化学和健康潜力","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/the-kombucha-surprise-one-ingredient-dramatically-changes-its-chemistry-and-health-potential/","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Tea choice significantly changes kombucha’s chemistry, flavor, and antioxidant potential, with green and oolong teas showing the strongest biological activity.\nKombucha has surged in popularity worldwide in recent years, but researchers are looking beyond its flavor to better understand its chemistry and possible health-related properties.\nA team from the Wrocław University of Environmental and Life Sciences and Wroclaw Medical University (Associate Professor Helena Moreira, PhD, Associate Professor Ewa Barg, PhD, and Anna Szyjka, MSc Eng.) examined how different tea varieties affect the final characteristics of kombucha. Their findings revealed much larger differences than expected.\nThe researchers compared kombuchas made from black, green, white, oolong, and pu-erh teas. Their study was published in the journal\nFood Chemistry\n“The type of tea acts as a specific matrix that shapes the course of fermentation and the final composition of kombucha,” explains Associate Professor Helena Moreira, PhD, from the Department of Basic Medical Sciences and Immunology, Wroclaw Medical University. “Individual teas differ in their content of polyphenols, catechins, caffeine, and other bioactive compounds, which are subsequently metabolized by SCOBY microorganisms. As a result, fermentation proceeds with different dynamics, and the final beverages differ in both chemical and aromatic profiles.”\nKombucha is created when SCOBY, a symbiotic culture of bacteria and yeast, ferments sweetened tea. During fermentation, yeast converts sugars into alcohol and carbon dioxide, while bacteria transform those compounds into organic acids, primarily acetic and gluconic acids. These acids give kombucha its distinctive tart flavor.\nFermentation also changes many of the tea’s naturally occurring bioactive compounds. The researchers observed shifts in polyphenols, catechins, and volatile compounds that contribute to flavor and aroma.\n“At the same time, transformations of polyphenols and volatile aromatic compounds present in tea take place. As a result, the beverage acquires its characteristic sour, lightly sparkling taste and a more complex aroma,” explains Associate Professor Helena Moreira, PhD.\nThe team found significantly higher levels of compounds associated with floral and fruity aromas, including linalool and 2-phenylethanol. These compounds are also found naturally in flowers and essential oils. Meanwhile, some substances typical of freshly brewed tea disappeared during fermentation and were replaced by new metabolites produced by the SCOBY culture.\nUsing advanced chromatography and mass spectrometry, the researchers tracked these changes throughout fermentation. The techniques enabled them to analyze and compare hundreds of compounds across kombuchas made from different tea varieties.\n“The most surprising aspect was the scale of changes occurring during fermentation and how strongly they depended on the type of tea used,” says the scientist. “Despite identical fermentation conditions, we obtained kombuchas with highly distinct profiles of volatile aromatic compounds.”\nThe study also found notable differences in biological activity. Kombuchas made from green and oolong teas showed the strongest antioxidant activity and the greatest ability to neutralize free radicals.\nFree radicals are highly reactive molecules that can damage cells and contribute to aging. Because of this, antioxidant compounds continue to attract significant scientific interest for their potential health effects.\n“The results of our research indicate that the type of tea influences not only the taste and aroma but also the biological activity of kombucha,” emphasizes Associate Professor Helena Moreira, PhD. “Particularly interesting results were obtained for kombuchas prepared from green and oolong teas, which demonstrated the highest biological potential.”\nDespite these encouraging laboratory results, the researchers caution that it is too early to draw firm conclusions about health benefits in people.\n“Further clinical studies are necessary to clearly confirm the impact of particular types of kombucha on human health,” adds the researcher.\nInterest in kombucha reflects a broader scientific focus on fermented foods. Fermentation can increase the availability of bioactive compounds, create new metabolites, and influence the gut microbiome.\n“Fermented foods are currently at the center of scientific interest because they combine traditional technologies with a modern approach to health and nutrition,” says Associate Professor Helena Moreira, PhD. “Kombucha is a very good example of a product in which chemical composition, biological activity, and sensory profile result from complex interactions between the raw material and fermentative microorganisms.”\nThe findings highlight that kombucha is far from a uniform beverage. The type of tea used can produce major differences in both flavor and chemical composition.\nKombucha made from green tea developed a fresher, more vegetal aroma, while oolong tea produced stronger floral and fruity notes. Kombuchas made from black tea and pu-erh, by contrast, displayed richer, earthier aromas with more pronounced fermentation characteristics.\nReference: “Matrix-dependent modulation of chemical composition, volatile profile, and biological activity of kombucha beverages from different tea types” by Akshay K. Chandran, Marcelina Stach, Jacek Łyczko, Zbigniew Lazar, Joanna Kawa-Rygielska, Helena Moreira, Anna Szyjka, Ewa Barg and Joanna Kolniak-Ostek, 8 April 2026,\nFood Chemistry\nDOI: 10.1016/j.foodchem.2026.149160\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nBiochemistry\nFood Science\nMicrobiology\nFor Decades, Scientists Believed These Common Food Thickeners Were Indigestible. They Were Wrong\nBeyond Delicious: Unlocking the Nutritional Power of Thanksgiving Sides\nA New Natural Brilliant Blue for Food Coloring\nNew Method to Separate Beer Waste Into Proteins for Foods, and Fiber for Biofuels\nChildhood Diet Has Lifelong Impact – You Are What You Eat AND What You Ate as a Child\nThese Foods Contain Nutrients That Can Inhibit a Key SARS-CoV-2 Enzyme Needed for the COVID Virus to Replicate\nSulfur-Scavenging Bacteria Could Be Key to Biomanufacturing Common Component of Plastic\nDiscovery Could Lead to More Potent Garlic, Boosting Flavor and Aroma\nScientists Want to Feed Old Bread to Microbes – Here’s the Plan","tp":"康普茶化学","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现茶叶选择对康普茶的化学成分、风味和抗氧化潜力有显著影响。绿茶和乌龙茶制成的康普茶表现出最强的生物活性。弗罗茨瓦夫环境与生命科学大学团队的研究表明，不同茶底会大幅改变康普茶的化学特性，为功能性饮品的优化配方提供了科学依据。"},{"t":"下载：全身返老还童药物和有关人工智能的五件事","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/09/1138604/the-download-anti-aging-drugs-ai-five-things-to-know/","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"MIT Technology Review","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"This is today's edition of\nThe Download\nour weekday newsletter that provides a daily dose of what's going on in the world of technology.\nThe outspoken longevity scientist David Sinclair has predicted that, one day, you’ll go to the doctor and get a prescription that will make you 10 years younger. MIT Technology Review has learned of his latest step toward this: human tests of a “reprogramming” drug.\nSinclair, a biologist at Harvard Medical School, plans to launch the tests in a $101 million competition organized by the XPrize Foundation. The winners will “restore” a person to an earlier apparent age, as measured by improvements in immune, cognitive, and muscle function.\nThe grand prize goes to any team able to show a 10-year (or greater) relative improvement after one year of treatment.\nSinclair says he plans to give an oral drug mixture to volunteers, in a bid to seek “evidence for age restoration in humans.”\nFind out how he hopes to reverse ageing through chemical reprogramming\n—Antonio Regalado\n—Will Douglas Heaven\nAt SXSW London last week, I gave a talk called “Five things you need to know about AI,” in which I shared what I think are the biggest themes in AI right now.\nI pulled a few things from our first AI10 list, an\nannual guide to the top trends in this buzzy world\n, but I also veered off on several tangents. In my half-hour slot, I tried to cover the key talking points that I think help to make sense of what’s going on in tech—and thus the economy—today.\nFive key thoughts emerged: AI is everywhere all at once, it’s getting scary, a backlash is growing, it’s becoming a big deal for science—and I didn’t even need to show up at the talk.\nRead the full story for all the details\nThe must-reads\nI’ve combed the internet to find you today’s most fun/important/scary/fascinating stories about technology.\n1 OpenAI has confidentially filed for a US IPO\nThe listing could come as early as September. (\n+ OpenAI is targeting a valuation of up to $1 trillion.\nFinancial Times\n+ The IPO will test investor appetite for AI companies.\n+ The move follows IPO filings from Anthropic and SpaceX.\n2 The US claims BYD, Baidu, Alibaba, and others are aiding China's military\nThe Pentagon added them to a list of military-linked companies. (\n+ The designations limit their operations in the US.\n+ The new additions also include humanoid firm Unitree.\n+ The Pentagon is adapting to China’s tech rise.\nMIT Technology Review\n3 Apple’s long-awaited AI overhaul of Siri is finally here\nSiri AI” promises to be a more conversational assistant. (\n+ It includes a standalone app and screen-reading features.\n+ And arrives after two years of repeated delays.\n4 The White House and Congress are working to limit state AI laws\nA new deal would curb state rules for federal legislation. (\n+ AI regulation has divided US politicians. (\nMIT Technology Review\nMeta is launching a “workforce academy” for building data centers\nThe five-week program is free of charge and guarantees a job. (\n+ It arrives shortly after Meta laid off 8,000 employees.\n6 Taiwan is mulling curbs on AI chip exports to China\nThe new controls would further align with US restrictions. (\n+ Future AI chips could be built on glass.\nMIT Technology Review\n7 Meta has quietly removed face-recognition code from its smart glasses app\nThe code identified by investigators has disappeared. (\n8 Humanoid robots are edging towards the battlefield\nAmerican and Chinese militaries are pursuing the tech. (\n9 The world’s first wind-powered underwater data center has launched\nIt uses less power and water than land-based equivalents. (\n10 You could get some benefits of sleep without having to nod off\nIf new brain stimulation works as well on humans as on mice, that is. (\nNew Scientist\nQuote of the day\n—Clara Shih, a former top AI executive at Salesforce and Meta, tells\nthe New York Times\nthat AI training can’t keep up with the field’s advances.\nOne More Thing\nILLUSTRATIONS BY AMRITA MARINO\nAn embryo forms when sperm meets egg. But what if we could start with other cells—if a blood sample or skin biopsy could be transformed into “artificial” sperm and eggs? What if those were all you needed to make a baby?\nThat’s the promise of a radical approach to reproduction. Scientists have already created artificial eggs and sperm from mouse cells and used them to create mouse pups. Artificial human sex cells are next.\nThe advances could herald the end of infertility, but they raise major scientific and ethical challenges.\nRead the full story on the new recipes for sperm and eggs\n—Jessica Hamzelou\nWe can still have nice things\nA place for comfort, fun, and distraction to brighten up your day. (Got any ideas?\nDrop me a line\n+ These chefs\nturn Pop-Tarts into the desserts that inspired them\n+ A choir has beautifully\ntransformed System of a Down’s “Chop Suey!”\n+ Scientists finally traced crabs’ sideways walk in this\nfascinating study of evolution\n+ This nostalgic\nessay on the family computer\nis a touching throwback to early internet life.\nTop image credit: Stephanie Arnett/MIT Technology Review | Getty Images\nYou can follow me on\n. Thanks for reading!\nPlus: China has blocked Meta’s $2 billion acquisition of AI startup Manus.\nPlus: An unauthorized group has reportedly accessed Anthropic’s Mythos.\nPlus: DeepSeek has unveiled its long-awaited new AI model.\nPlus: NASA unveiled plans for three uncrewed missions to the Moon this year.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more.","tp":"返老还童药","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"MIT科技评论报道，哈佛抗衰老科学家David Sinclair计划在一家耗资1.01亿美元的公司中启动'重编程'药物的人体试验。Sinclair预言未来人们可以获得让人年轻10岁的处方药。该药物基于细胞重编程技术，旨在逆转细胞衰老，标志着全身返老还童疗法进入临床转化阶段。"},{"t":"空肠弯曲杆菌鞭毛 V 形环可识别粘度水平，从而改变游动速度、代谢基因表达","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603105123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Campylobacter jejuni\n                    \n                    is an intestinal commensal of birds and animals and a leading cause of bacterial diarrheal disease in humans. In hosts,\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    primarily resides in the mucus layer atop the lower intestinal epithelium. Persistence in this niche requires a single flagellar motor at both\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    poles that generates high torque for flagellar rotation to facilitate motility and high swimming velocities. Unlike many bacterial flagellates,\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    swimming velocity increases as external viscosity increases. We identified a complex formed by FlgV, VidA, and VidC (Cjj81176_1732) positioned near the MS-ring-rotor junction in the flagellar motor we annotated as the V-ring. Viscosity-influenced growth, modulation of swimming velocity, and transcription of iron/heme acquisition, respiratory, and energy-generating systems were dependent on the V-ring.\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    Δ\n                    flgV\n                    and Δ\n                    vidC\n                    populations lacking a complete V-ring were motile, but could not optimally modulate swimming velocity. Like nonmotile flagellar stator or filament mutants, motile V-ring mutants had in vivo and in vitro growth and viability defects and dysregulated transcription of genes likely impacting physiology. Because the V-ring mutants behaved similarly as nonmotile mutants that experience little to no viscous drag on the filament, we propose\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    V-ring mutants cannot detect viscous drag on their rotating filaments. We propose the V-ring evolved in\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    and potentially other bacteria producing high torque flagellar motors to monitor external viscosity information via viscous drag on the rotating flagellar filament to adjust swimming velocity, transcription, and physiology for optimal fitness in different host lower intestinal niches.","tp":"细菌运动","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现空肠弯曲杆菌鞭毛V形环能够感知环境粘度变化，并据此调整游动速度和代谢基因表达。该菌是导致人类细菌性腹泻的主要病原体，在宿主肠道粘液层中定植需要单一鞭毛马达。研究揭示了细菌运动器官的力学感知机制，为理解病原体适应性定植提供了分子基础。"},{"t":"Tesco 2026 报告：增强供应链弹性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/tesco-2026-report-developing-supply-chain-resilience","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Tesco 2026 Report: Developing Supply Chain Resilience\nPrioritise Us\nTesco explores its emissions, food waste, renewable energy use and future plans across its global supply chains in its latest Sustainability Report\nTesco's 2026 Sustainability Report details the retailer's work with suppliers, farmers and\nlogistics partners\nto reduce emissions and improve food system resilience.\nThe company's approach centres on collaboration across its value chain, with almost 99% of its total carbon footprint coming from agriculture, manufacturing and customer product use rather than direct operations.\nexamines how Tesco is addressing climate pressure on food supply chains through partnerships that target sustainable farming, transport decarbonisation and waste reduction.\nAccording to Tesco, food production generates roughly one third of global greenhouse gas emissions, making supplier engagement necessary for long-term sustainability goals.\nTesco exceeded\nits December 2025 operational emissions target, cutting Scope 1 and 2 emissions by 68% compared with its 2015/16 baseline. The original target stood at 60%.\nThe company states that supplier collaboration is central to reducing its wider carbon footprint. Tesco works with farmers and producers through Sustainable Farming Groups to introduce lower-carbon farming techniques, precision agriculture and nature-based solutions.\nThese programmes could improve soil health and biodiversity while reducing emissions from agricultural production. The retailer has also launched data programmes with suppliers to improve carbon reporting accuracy and encourage adoption of science-based climate targets throughout the supply chain.\n\"Sustainability and seeking the protection of workers' rights across the food value chain is central to everything we do,\" says Ken Murphy, Chief Executive Officer at Tesco, in the company's 2026 Sustainability Report.\n\"Many of the challenges where we need to make further progress are areas that no company can tackle alone.\"\nKen adds that shared efforts across supply chains, government and the food industry will be required to overcome complex issues facing food systems.\nTesco's planet plan focuses on six pillars including reducing store emissions, decarbonising transport, protecting nature, eliminating waste, improving products and supporting sustainable consumption. The company works with suppliers and farmers to promote sustainable agriculture, reduce deforestation and protect ecosystems.\nClimate-related issues including droughts, flooding and biodiversity loss are placing pressure on food supply chains. Tesco is expanding nature partnerships, launching landscape restoration projects and introducing financial incentives for farmers adopting sustainable practices.\nIn manufacturing, Tesco is working with suppliers to create joint sustainability plans and share decarbonisation best practices through webinars and site visits. The business aims to achieve net-zero across its entire value chain by 2050 and net-zero in its own operations by 2035.\n\"As food systems come under increasing pressure, sustainability is key to our long-term resilience,\" says Christine Heffernan, Group Chief Communications and Sustainability Officer at Tesco, in the company's 2026 Sustainability Report.\n\"Our actions today help meet customer needs and strengthen supply chain stability for the future.\"\nTesco is investing in\nlower-emission logistics\nincluding electric vans, Bio-CNG trucks, rail freight expansion and transport efficiency projects designed to reduce road miles and fuel use. The company operates distribution centres that support its store network across the UK and the Republic of Ireland.\nIn 2025/26, the new Aylesford distribution centre was fitted with the largest solar panel array across Tesco's estate. The facility could demonstrate how energy generation can be integrated into logistics infrastructure.\nRenewable energy plays a role in reducing emissions from operations. Tesco achieved 100% renewable electricity procurement across the group through renewable energy certificates, Power Purchase Agreements and on-site solar generation.\nRooftop solar panels were added to 29 UK stores during the reporting period. The business also invests in\nenergy-efficient technology\nincluding fridge doors that use approximately one third less energy than open-fronted fridges, electric heat pumps replacing gas boilers and a group energy control centre that remotely monitors energy performance across buildings.\nFood waste reduction remains a priority for Tesco, with the company committing to cut food waste in its own operations by 50% before 2030. The retailer acknowledged it did not meet its original 2025 target.\nTesco redistributed 44,554 tonnes of surplus food to people and animals in the UK during the reporting year. More than 5,000 tonnes of food surplus was converted into animal feed.\nThe company partners with charities and industry groups to address waste throughout the food system. In the UK and the Republic of Ireland, 65% of Tesco's food sales are classified as healthy, according to the retailer's reporting.\nTesco works with organisations including the British Nutrition Foundation to improve access to fruit and vegetables. The Free Fruit & Veg for Schools programme has provided more than 15.7 million portions of produce to children across the UK.\nTesco continues to improve packaging sustainability across its product range. According to the company, 99% of its own-brand packaging is now recyclable in the UK, including 87% through household kerbside collections.\nThe retailer's packaging strategy could reduce waste entering landfill and support circular economy principles. Changes to packaging design and materials are implemented through collaboration with suppliers and manufacturers.\n\"As Chair of the Sustainability Committee, I have seen first-hand the determination across Tesco to embed sustainability into every part of the business,\" says Stewart Gilliland, Chair of the Sustainability Committee and Non-Executive Director at Tesco, in the company's 2026 Sustainability Report.\n\"The store demonstrates how practical solutions can help us decarbonise retail and inspire change across the industry.\"\nStewart notes that the company has supported progress on healthier baskets, nature-based solutions and waste reduction while continuing to champion human rights and community programmes including Fruit & Veg for Schools.\nTesco operates 365 in-store pharmacies that serve more than 500,000 customers every week, making it the UK's third largest pharmacy provider. Customers can access healthcare services including flu vaccinations, blood pressure checks and the retailer's Weight Loss Management service.\nThe company works with charities including the British Heart Foundation, Diabetes UK and Cancer Research UK to run awareness campaigns focused on prevention, early diagnosis and healthier lifestyles. Trusted advice on conditions including cancer, heart disease and diabetes is available through Tesco's Let's Talk programme developed with its Health Charity Partners.\nIn 2025, Tesco launched its first joint cancer early detection campaign with Cancer Research UK. Pharmacists were trained to guide customers towards cancer support and treatment services.\nThe retailer continued its diabetes and heart health campaigns, encouraging customers to complete type 2 diabetes risk assessments and free blood pressure checks through in-store pharmacies. Following a trial, the company rolled out menopause-friendly bays in more than 90 stores in partnership with GenM, providing access to products designed to ease menopause symptoms.\nTesco partnered with accessibility app Be My Eyes to help blind and partially sighted customers receive real-time support from store colleagues while shopping. For families and young people, Tesco expanded its Free Fruit & Veg for Schools programme with the British Nutrition Foundation.\nThe company distributed millions of free apples through its Free Fruit for Kids campaign. These initiatives could make healthier choices more accessible for customers.\nTesco's approach combines healthcare services, health education and community support. The retailer states this could improve long-term public wellbeing while making nutritious options affordable.\nThe company's sustainability report stresses that supply chain resilience and\nsustainability\nare necessary for the future of the food industry. Tesco continues to work with partners across its value chain to meet net-zero and sustainability goals while providing affordable food for customers.\nGroup Chief Communications and Sustainability Officer\nChair of the Sustainability Committee and Non-executive Director","tp":"食品脱碳","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":7.0,"r":2.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"Tesco发布2026年可持续发展报告，详细阐述了公司在减少碳排放、降低食物浪费、使用可再生能源及增强供应链弹性方面的举措。公司策略核心是全价值链协作，覆盖供应商、农户和物流合作伙伴。近99%的碳足迹来自供应链，报告强调通过协作降低排放和提升食品系统韧性。"},{"t":"靶向 cGAS-STING 通路可减轻敲入小鼠模型中亨廷顿病的发病机制","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535879123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Cyclic GMP–AMP synthase (cGAS) and its downstream effector, stimulator of interferon genes (STING), form a key cytosolic DNA-sensing pathway that drives innate immune activation and proinflammatory signaling. We previously showed that cGAS is upregulated in Huntington disease (HD) cellular models, where it regulates autophagy and inflammation; however, its in vivo role remained unclear. Here, we genetically ablated cGAS in Q175DN knock-in HD mice and performed longitudinal behavioral assessments from 2 to 14 mo of age. cGAS deletion significantly improved HD-associated motor deficits, including rotarod performance and beam-walk coordination, and mitigated progressive body-weight loss. Histological analyses revealed reduced lateral ventricle enlargement and decreased striatal astrogliosis and microgliosis. While minimal effects were observed in wild-type littermates, transcriptomic profiling of HD brains lacking cGAS showed downregulation of genes involved in development and cell–cell communication, along with upregulation of genes linked to ion transport and synaptic function. Lipidomic analysis further demonstrated increased levels of immunoregulatory lipids, particularly 12-HETE and 12-HEPE, indicating a shift toward a protective lipid profile. Importantly, pharmacological inhibition of STING using H-151 improved age-dependent motor performance, reduced striatal atrophy, and attenuated glial cell activation in Q175DN mice. Collectively, these findings identify the cGAS–STING pathway as a critical driver of HD progression and support its inhibition as a promising therapeutic strategy.","tp":"亨廷顿病","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究通过基因敲除cGAS酶，在Q175DN敲入亨廷顿病小鼠模型中证实靶向cGAS-STING通路可减轻疾病发病机制。cGAS-STING是胞质DNA感知的关键通路，驱动先天免疫和促炎信号。纵向行为评估显示，消除cGAS可改善亨廷顿病症状，为该神经退行性疾病的免疫靶向治疗提供了体内证据。"},{"t":"通过 RNA 触发的染色质粉碎来靶向癌症特异性突变","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10738-7","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Genetic mutations that drive cancer often occur in tumor suppressor proteins, including the p53 transcription factor which is altered in ~40-50% of cases1,2. However, current therapies fail to target most such mutations because the mutant proteins typically lack defined drug-binding pockets, and restoring the endogenous function has proven challenging. Here, we programmed CRISPR-Cas12a2, an RNA-guided nuclease with trans-nucleolytic cleavage activities3,4, to selectively kill cancer cells by targeting cancer-specific transcripts. This approach limits cell growth by inducing trans shredding of chromatin, triggering DNA damage responses and cell death. Unlike existing methods, RNA-guided Cas12a2 senses cellular RNA signatures, enabling precise targeting of undruggable mutations. Transcript-activated chromatin shredding provides a new approach to precision disease treatments for undruggable targets.","tp":"CRISPR抗癌","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究利用CRISPR-Cas12a2核酸酶的跨核酸切割活性，通过RNA触发的染色质粉碎策略靶向癌症特异性突变。约40-50%癌症中p53抑癌蛋白发生突变，但现有疗法难以靶向。该策略通过识别癌细胞中突变转录的RNA，选择性杀死癌细胞，为靶向'不可成药'的肿瘤抑制因子突变提供了全新思路。","aip":1},{"t":"TOYO 宣布在美国投建1.5GW异质结太阳能电池工厂","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/09/50024146.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"日本光伏制造商TOYO宣布将在美国得克萨斯州休斯顿都会区新建一座产能达1.5吉瓦的太阳能电池工厂,以扩大其在美国的制造布局。该工厂将生产异质结(HJT)太阳能电池,相较于传统晶硅电池,HJT技术具有更高的光电转换效率和更低的温度系数,在高温环境下性能表现更优。此举反映了光伏产业在美国本土化制造趋势下的加速布局,也有助于推动高效太阳能技术的规模化量产。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"异质结光伏","kp":["[产能]: 1.5GW","[技术路线]: 异质结HJT","[投资额]: 3.57亿美元","[建设周期]: 20个月"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"b":"总部位于日本的光伏制造商TOYO 宣布，计划在美国得克萨斯州休斯顿都会区新建一座1.5吉瓦太阳能电池生产工厂，进一步扩充其在美制造业务。\n该工厂将生产异质结(HJT)太阳能电池，该公司表示，与传统太阳能电池设计相比，该技术可提供更高的效率和更好的性能。TOYO首席战略官解释了企业选择布局异质结电池技术，而非更为传统的 PERC 技术、以及目前应用更广的 TOPCon 技术的原因。他表示：“展望未来，我们认为异质结是适配下一代钙钛矿太阳能电池的理想技术平台。钙钛矿技术有望推动光伏转换效率迎来新一轮重大突破，也与TOYO 的长期技术发展路线相契合。”\n该电池项目总投资约3.57 亿美元，目前工程规划、设计及设备采购工作均已启动，计划在未来20个月内完成项目建设并实现试生产。"},{"t":"20 年代的结核病疫苗在糖尿病试验中显示出希望","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01825-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The shot reduced insulin use for people with type 1 diabetes and another autoimmune condition. The shot reduced insulin use for people with type 1 diabetes and another autoimmune condition."},{"t":"共价有机框架中噻吩供体的协同电子和空间工程，实现高效 CO2 光","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5240027?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Covalent organic frameworks (COFs), featuring broad light absorption and permanent porosity, serve as excellent supports for metal catalytic sites in photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction, offering great promise for efficient and stable CO\n                    2\n                    photoconversion. Herein, two rationally designed thiophene‐rich monomers enable the effective coupling of thiophene and benzothiadiazole units within the same COF materials, yielding D–A type COFs with\n                    bex\n                    topological structures (TTB‐COF and TTP‐COF). By modulating the central unit, the intramolecular built‐in electric field is enhanced, and the rotational freedom of thiophene units is also constrained, leading to a wavy structure in the monolayer COF, which significantly improves the material's photocatalytic performance. Using 2,2′‐bipyridine as an additive, TTB‐COF‐Co achieves a high CO production rate of 28.0 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    with a selectivity of 88.4% in the presence of the photosensitizer [Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]Cl\n                    2\n                    ·6H\n                    2\n                    O and the sacrificial agent triethanolamine (TEOA), being one of the best performances among COF‐based catalysts. Analysis of the cumulative free energy change diagrams reveals that TTB‐COF‐Co lowers the energy barrier of the rate‐determining step in CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction, thereby demonstrating superior photocatalytic performance. This work provides a referable design strategy for constructing high‐performance COF‐based photocatalysts for CO\n                    2\n                    reduction.","tp":"CO₂光还原","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究通过协同电子和空间工程策略，在共价有机框架中引入噻吩供体，实现高效CO2光催化还原。两种富含噻吩的单体实现了噻吩与苯并噻二唑的有效耦合，利用COF的宽光吸收和永久多孔性为金属催化位点提供优良载体，在CO2光转化效率与稳定性方面取得显著突破。"},{"t":"可持续性还是反乌托邦？过去的模式告诉我们社会的发展方向","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01821-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"A new book applies principles of environmental tipping points to past societal transformations — and attempts to draw lessons about what the future holds today. A new book applies principles of environmental tipping points to past societal transformations — and attempts to draw lessons about what the future holds today."},{"t":"表面化学无序工程赋能富锂锰基正极的优异阴离子氧化还原","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5515760?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种表面化学无序工程策略，显著提升了富锂锰基氧化物中阴离子氧化还原反应的可逆性与稳定性。富锂锰基正极材料因可利用阴离子氧化还原提供额外容量而备受关注，但其实际应用受限于电压衰减和结构退化等问题。通过表面晶格无序化调控，研究实现了阴离子氧化还原动力学的优化，为高能量密度锂离子电池正极材料的性能突破提供了新思路。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂锰基正极","kp":["[改性策略]: 表面化学无序晶体织构工程","[材料]: 富锂锰基氧化物正极"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Surface Chemical Disorder Engineering Enabled Superior Anion Redox for Li‐Rich Mn‐Based Cathode","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The Li‐rich Mn‐based oxides have attracted extensive attention due to the specific anion redox reaction to provide high capacity. However, the poor reversibility of anion redox leads to serious lattice oxygen loss and surface structure evolution. Here, we report an approach by integrating chemical disorder‐based crystallographic texture into the cathode surface to solve these questions, which involves the spatial rearrangement of lattice oxygen by supersaturated occupation of cations in the lattice. This makes the oxygen electronic structure delocalized and diversified, strengthens the metal‐oxygen orbital hybridization, and effectively improves the reversibility and kinetics of anion redox reactions. Meanwhile, the robust surface architecture effectively inhibits superficial detrimental phase evolution and electrode/electrolyte interface side reactions, maintaining the structural integrity of the electrochemical process. Accordingly, the as‐designed modified cathode delivered a promising capacity (291.8 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    ), excellent long cycling stability, and voltage retention (90.5% capacity retention and 0.68 mV/cycle voltage fade with 300 cycles). This work highlights the role of surface chemical disorder and the strongly correlated chemical environment of transition metals with oxygen, which is expected to provide a new paradigm for the structural design of cathode materials.","aip":1},{"t":"研究发现奥地利具有\"可观\"的农光互补潜力","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/study-finds-significant-agrivoltaic-potential-in-austria/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"奥地利一项技术经济研究利用空间模拟框架评估了农光互补（agrivoltaic）系统的潜力，发现奥地利具有显著的农业光伏发展空间。研究综合考虑了土地利用率、作物兼容性、发电效率与经济可行性等因素，表明在同一土地上叠加光伏发电与农业生产在奥地利地理条件下具备可观的技术与经济优势，为欧洲农业光伏推广提供了数据支撑。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"农光互补","kp":["[对比结论]: 地面式PV发电量利润最高"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Study finds 'significant' agrivoltaic potential in Austria - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nA techno-economic study in Austria evaluates agrivoltaic systems using a spatial simulation framework that jointly models solar power generation and crop production under current and future climate conditions. Results show ground-mounted PV delivers the highest electricity output and profits, while agrivoltaics reduce agricultural losses but offer only modest climate adaptation benefits compared to PV-only systems.\nApplications & Installations\nMarkets & Policy\nResearch & Development\nUtility-scale\nAn agrivoltaic project belonging to BayWa r.e. | Image: BayWa r.e.\nA research group led by Austria’s\nUniversity of Natural Resources and Life Sciences, Vienna (BOKU),\nhas conducted techno-economic analysis to assess the potential of agrivoltaic (APV) installations in Austria, integrating profitability for both solar PV generation and agricultural production.\n“We present, for the first time, a spatially explicit simulation framework that consistently estimates large-scale APV potentials while jointly accounting for electricity generation and agricultural output,” the research team said. “Moreover, we evaluate APV potentials under both current and future climate conditions, thereby assessing the role of APV systems as an adaptation strategy to climate change.”\nTo conduct the analysis, the researchers developed a modular simulation framework, using established simulation tools where available and custom components where necessary. The framework is publicly available under a GPL license. Using EU data from the policy-integrated climate model EPIC, the team first identified areas suitable for APV deployment. Among the filtering criteria were a minimum of 1 ha of contiguous cropland (independent of ownership), a maximum average slope of 20°, and a maximum altitude of 1,950 m above sea level.\nElectricity generation was simulated using PVlib, with global horizontal irradiation (GHI) data derived from a 1 km climate simulation grid. EPIC was used to model key environmental processes and plant growth at plot level, using daily time steps and a spatial resolution of 1 km × 1 km. Crop growth was simulated based on interactions between environmental conditions and management practices such as crop rotation, covering peas, soybeans, potatoes, alfalfa, summer barley, and oats.\nClimate inputs were based on observed data from 1981 to 2020, and projections for 2031 to 2070. Two baseline scenarios were evaluated: conventional agricultural production without PV, and ground-mounted PV (GM-PV) systems without agricultural production. APV configurations included overhead stilted systems (S-APV) with an installation height of around 10 m and south-facing orientation, and vertical bifacial systems (VB-APV) featuring 10 m row spacing and two vertically stacked bifacial modules. Each configuration was assessed under low, medium, and high cost assumptions.\nIn Austria, the results show that GM-PV systems generate 1,173 MWh/ha, S-APV systems 684 MWh/ha, and VB-APV systems 373 MWh/ha. On average, the VB-APV configuration delivers a profit ratio compared to agriculture alone ranging from 10:1 to 50:1, while S-APV systems reach up to 60:1. GM-PV systems show the highest profitability, with ratios of up to 100:1.\n“For attaining 90 TWh/y of electricity generation from solar PV on cropland, an upper bound across all climate neutrality scenarios, between 5% and 16% of total cropland area would be required,” the team concluded. “The required area and simulated yield reductions imply that Austrian crop production would decline by 2%–6%. Only agrivoltaic systems achieve impacts at the lower end of this range. Climate change adaptation effects of agrivoltaics are limited.”\nThe research findings have appeared in “\nThe techno-economic potentials of agrivoltaic installations in Austria\n,” published in\nRenewable Energy.\nResearchers from Austria’s BOKU University and the Federal Institute of Agricultural Economics have participated in the study.\nView author posts"},{"t":"电化学储能系统结构化风险评估：集成一致性增强FAHP与复杂网络方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008202?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能系统风险评估","kp":["[方法]: 一致性增强FAHP+耦合网络","[对象]: 电化学储能系统风险评估"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Structured risk assessment for electrochemical energy storage system: Integrating consistency enhanced-FAHP and complex "},{"t":"结构模型揭示了 IV 型菌毛回缩过程中运动 ATP 酶协调的机制","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2531253123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/传统生物化工","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Diverse bacterial species utilize surface appendages called type IV pili (T4P) to interact with their environment. These structures are dynamically extended and retracted from the cell surface, which is critical for diverse functions. Some T4P systems rely on two distinct motor ATPases, PilT and PilU, whose combined activities are required to power forceful T4P retraction. However, the mechanism by which these motors coordinate to facilitate T4P retraction has remained unclear. Here, we utilize the competence T4P in\n                    Vibrio cholerae\n                    as a model system to elucidate the molecular basis for PilT–PilU coordination during T4P retraction. Specifically, we modeled the interactions between PilT and PilU using AlphaFold 3 and molecular dynamics (MD) simulations. We then empirically tested these models using a combination of cytological and high-resolution genetic approaches. Our results reveal that interactions between PilT and the PilU C-terminus are critical for these motors to coordinate to drive T4P retraction. Finally, we show that PilT–PilU interactions are broadly conserved in T4P systems from diverse bacterial species, and we experimentally validate that they are required for T4P retraction in\n                    \n                      Acinetobacter\n                      baylyi\n                    \n                    . Together, this work expands our fundamental understanding of T4P dynamics, and more broadly it provides mechanistic insight into how these ATPases coordinate to assemble some of the strongest biological motors in nature.","tp":"菌毛回缩","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":1.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究揭示了IV型菌毛回缩过程中运动ATP酶PilT和PilU的协调机制。IV型菌毛是细菌与环境互动的关键表面附属物，其回缩由两种马达ATP酶共同驱动。研究利用结构生物学方法阐明了这两种马达如何协同作用以实现强力菌毛回缩，填补了细菌运动机制领域长期存在的空白。"},{"t":"N-杂环卡宾台阶边缘功能化增强电化学CO2还原催化活性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73621?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化CO2还原","kp":["[功能化]: NHC单分子台阶边缘修饰","[应用]: 电化学CO2还原"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究利用N-杂环卡宾（NHC）对金属表面台阶边缘进行功能化修饰，显著增强电化学CO₂还原催化活性。金属表面原子台阶边缘因配位不饱和而具有高催化活性，NHC修饰进一步优化了台阶位点的电子结构与反应中间体吸附能，为高效CO₂电还原催化剂的设计提供了分子级表面工程新策略。","ot":"Step‐Edge Functionalization by N‐Heterocyclic Carbenes Enhances Catalytic Activity in Electrochemical CO2 Reduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Atomic step‐edges on metallic surfaces are highly active catalytic sites due to their reduced coordination and modified electronic structure. Yet, approaches to organic ligand functionalization on the single‐molecule level have largely targeted flat terrace geometries, whereas site‐specific step‐edge functionalization remains unaddressed. This study shows that decorating the atomically defined step‐edges of Au(788) with N‐heterocyclic carbenes (NHCs) enhances their catalytic activity toward  reduction compared to undecorated metallic step‐edges. Using high‐resolution scanning probe microscopy, an upright‐tilted adsorption geometry and a unified binding mode of three different NHCs at step‐edges are revealed. The exceptional stability of these well‐defined nanostructures allows the use of the single‐crystalline samples as working electrodes in electrochemical experiments. Photoelectron spectroscopy and theoretical simulations correlate charge transfer and conformational details with their catalytic performance. By combining macroscopic electrochemical experiments with single‐molecule microscopy, this study highlights NHC step‐edge functionalization as an effective approach to design highly selective and efficient catalysts."},{"t":"调控本征压电共价有机框架中的电子传输以实现高效CO2还原","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5538657?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"压电CO2光还原","kp":["[材料]: 本征压电卟啉COF锚定锌单原子","[应用]: 光催化CO2还原"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过调控内禀压电型共价有机框架（COF）中的电子传输方向，实现高效光催化CO₂还原。光催化CO₂还原是可持续燃料的重要路径，但受限于缓慢的电荷分离与传输效率。该工作利用COF材料固有压电特性定向驱动电子迁移，提升光生载流子分离效率，从而提高CO₂光还原的反应活性与选择性。","ot":"Steering Electron Transport in Intrinsically Piezoelectric Covalent Organic Frameworks for Efficient CO2 Reduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction represents a transformative route to sustainable fuels, yet remains limited by sluggish charge separation and rapid carrier recombination. Here, an intrinsically piezoelectric porphyrin‐based covalent organic framework anchored with zinc single atoms (Zn‐Por‐COF) is used to promote directional charge transport and accelerate reaction kinetics. Zinc coordination (\n                    d\n                    10\n                    configuration) induces local symmetry breaking in the framework, giving rise to an internal piezoelectric field that cooperates with a donor–acceptor conjugated network inspired by natural photosynthetic systems. Under combined light and ultrasound excitation, the strain‐induced piezo‐potential facilitates persistent charge separation and suppresses recombination. Ultrafast femtosecond transient absorption spectroscopy demonstrates that Zn incorporation effectively inhibits phonon‐assisted nonradiative decay and prolongs the carrier lifetime to 226.0 ps, which is attributed to the formation of long‐lived shallow trap states and improved exciton delocalization across the π‐conjugated backbone. Consequently, Zn‐Por‐COF achieves a high CO evolution rate of 15.59 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    during piezo‐photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction. This work demonstrates that intrinsic piezoelectricity in COF provides an effective strategy to regulate charge dynamics for high‐efficiency light‐driven CO\n                    2\n                    reduction."},{"t":"通过NHC保护的铜簇次级球非共价相互作用将CO2电还原定向为甲烷","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8098750?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化产甲烷","kp":["[催化剂]: NHC保护Cu4O簇","[产物选择性]: 甲烷","[调控]: 二级球非共价相互作用"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出利用NHC保护的铜簇催化剂，通过次级配位球非共价相互作用调控CO₂电还原产物选择性，实现甲烷（CH₄）的高效生成。铜基催化剂虽具前景，但CH₄选择性调控一直困难。该策略通过精准设计非共价作用（氢键、空间效应等）稳定关键中间体，为电催化CO₂还原制碳氢化合物的选择性控制提供了新思路。","ot":"Steering CO2 Electroreduction to Methane via Secondary‐Sphere Noncovalent Interactions in NHC‐Protected Copper Clusters","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Copper‐based catalysts are promising for CO\n                    2\n                    reduction to hydrocarbons; however, selective CH\n                    4\n                    generation remains challenging because of the presence of competing pathways and an insufficient understanding of active site control. Herein, we develop a ligand‐microengineering strategy to synthesize a series of fully N‐heterocyclic carbene (NHC)‐protected Cu\n                    4\n                    O clusters, [Cu\n                    4\n                    (\n                    μ\n                    4\n                    ‐O)]\n                    L\n                    2\n                    (PF\n                    6\n                    )\n                    2\n                    (\n                    L\n                    =\n                    1a–1d\n                    , denoted as\n                    2a–2d\n                    ), via a green and efficient ball‐milling approach. Of the four evaluated preparations, cluster\n                    2c\n                    exhibits the optimal CH\n                    4\n                    Faradaic efficiency (), with a value of 67.5% ± 2.1% at –1.4 V versus RHE. Integrated in situ spectroscopy and density functional theory (DFT) calculations reveal that unique secondary‐sphere noncovalent interactions (hydrogen‐bonding and C–H···π) present in\n                    2c\n                    provide additional stabilization for the key *CHO intermediate, maximizing CH\n                    4\n                    selectivity. This study not only demonstrates the unique advantages of NHC ligands in constructing stable and efficient copper cluster catalysts but also establishes a new paradigm for precisely steering CO\n                    2\n                    electroreduction selectivity through the rational design of noncovalent interactions within the secondary coordination sphere."},{"t":"钴(IV)-氧的自旋态工程实现直接氧原子转移，高效烯烃环氧化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2537686123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"钴氧催化环氧化","kp":["[催化剂]: 钴(IV)-氧络合物","[策略]: 自旋态工程直接氧原子转移","[应用]: 烯烃环氧化"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过自旋态工程调控高价钴(IV)-氧（Co⁴⁺=O）配合物，实现直接的氧原子转移（OAT）反应，高效催化烯烃环氧化。高价金属-氧物种是重要的催化中间体，本研究通过调控其自旋态（单重态/三重态）优化反应路径，显著提升环氧化效率，为绿色氧化催化提供了新机制认识。","ot":"Spin-state engineering of cobalt(IV)-oxo enables direct oxygen atom transfer for high-efficiency olefin epoxidation","b":"High-valent metal-oxo species, such as cobalt(IV)-oxo (Co\n                    IV\n                    =O) complexes, represent promising candidates for catalytic olefin epoxidation via oxygen atom transfer (OAT) under mild conditions. However, their utility is often limited by radical-mediated side reactions stemming from stepwise electron-transfer mechanisms. Here, we report a strategy to circumvent this limitation by modulating the spin state of the Co\n                    IV\n                    =O center through geometry-mediated ligand-field adjustment. Specifically, we employ a planar tricoordinated cobalt site to activate peroxymonosulfate (PMS), generating an intermediate-spin Co\n                    IV\n                    =O species ((O\n                    3\n                    )Co\n                    IV\n                    =O, S = 3/2). Unlike its planar tetra-coordinated low-spin counterpart ((O\n                    4\n                    )Co\n                    IV\n                    =O, S = 1/2), the weakened equatorial coordination field in this configuration reduces the crystal-field splitting energy and rearranges orbital energy levels, stabilizing the empty σ* (d\n                    \n                      \n                        \n                          \n                            z\n                          \n                          2\n                        \n                      \n                    \n                    -p\n                    z\n                    ) orbital at a lower energy level, enabling direct transfer of a π-electron pair from the olefin substrate. Consequently, the OAT mechanism shifts from a stepwise single-electron transfer to a concerted two-electron pathway, bypassing radical intermediate formation and enhancing both reactivity and selectivity. In the epoxidation of trans-stilbene and derivatives, the (O\n                    3\n                    )Co\n                    IV\n                    =O catalyst achieves up to 89.2% conversion with 99.9% selectivity, substantially outperforming conventional noble-metal-based systems. Our findings underscore the critical role of spin-state control in promoting concerted OAT and open avenues for designing next-generation oxidation catalysts."},{"t":"SpaceX 星链计划在印度的监管批准据称因伊朗战争而陷入停滞","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/spacexs-starlink-regulatory-approval-india-said-stall-iran-war","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"the information","tg":"政策监管","b":"SpaceX’s Starlink Regulatory Approval in India Said to Stall Over Iran War — The Information Read this briefing for free","tp":"星链监管","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":6.5},"as":"据报道，SpaceX星链计划在印度的监管审批因伊朗战争相关因素而陷入停滞。该审批的延迟可能影响星链在印度市场的拓展进度。此前印度政府已在推进星链运营许可的审批流程，但地缘政治因素对跨国科技企业的监管进程产生了实质性影响。"},{"t":"软离子和电子摩擦纳米发电机：走向可附着和可植入的生物医学应用（Adv.","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73429?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Soft Ionic and Electronic Triboelectric Nanogenerators The rapid expansion of bio-integrated triboelectric nanogenerators (TENG) has accelerated the development of sustainable power sources and self-powered biomedical sensors. This review systematically categorizes electronic and ionic TENG platforms into attachable and implantable configurations, analyzes their shared limitations, and proposes six strategic research directions, offering a comprehensive framework to guide next-generation clinically translatable biointerfaces. More details can be found in the Review by Sangyul Baik, Gwang-Bum Im, Younghoon Lee, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202517321).","tp":"纳米发电机","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"综述系统梳理了软离子和电子摩擦纳米发电机在可附着和可植入生物医学应用中的研究进展。文章将电子型和离子型TENG平台按可附着和可植入配置分类，分析共性局限，并提出六个战略研究方向。该技术可为自驱动生物医学传感器提供可持续电源，推动下一代临床应用发展。"},{"t":"Linke 获得具有六核锆结的双链、缠绕、螺旋金属聚合物单晶","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7176356?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Synthetic one‐dimensional (1D) helical polymers are an intriguing class of functional materials that have been pursued for decades. Despite numerous reports of single‐stranded helical polymers, the synthesis of double‐stranded, entwined helical polymers with deterministic atomic coordinates remains a significant challenge. Herein, through judicious linker conformation engineering, we target two double‐stranded helical metallopolymer single crystals that consist of robust hexanuclear Zr\n                    6\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (OH)\n                    4\n                    clusters and inherently helical methano‐ or ethano‐Tröger base (TB) scaffolds. The racemic TB linkers undergo spontaneous resolution and narcissistic self‐sorting to from large single crystals of helical metallopolymer conglomerate, which can be rendered homochiral by employing enantiopure TB linkers. Characterization by single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction showed that, the two homochiral strands are bound together through Zr\n                    6\n                    ‐carboxylate knots, which further arrange with respect to\n                    6\n                    1\n                    screw axis to engender 1D hexagonal channels. The resulting chemically stable metallopolymer conglomerates were demonstrated to be capable of catalyzing the normally acidic hydrolysis of orthoformates in basic solution with exceptional reactivity and selectivity, while the homochiral version was shown to be a remarkable chiral fluorescent sensor for amino alcohols. Our work, therefore provides an unparalleled example where linker conformation engineering serves as powerful tool for architecting sophisticated helical polymeric structures and achieving enzyme‐mimic catalysis and recognition.","tp":"螺旋聚合物","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究通过精确的连接体构象工程，成功合成了具有六核锰结构结点的双链缠绕螺旋金属聚合物单晶。合成一维螺旋聚合物是功能性材料领域长期追求的目标，但双链缠绕螺旋聚合物的确定性原子坐标合成一直面临重大挑战。该成果在螺旋功能材料的设计合成方面取得突破。","aip":1},{"t":"塑造双层石墨烯空腔中的混沌","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538081123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Bilayer graphene cavities where electrons are confined within finite graphene flakes provide an alluring platform not only for the future nanoelectronic devices owing to the tunable energy gap but also for investigating the quantum nature of chaos due to the trigonal warping of their Fermi surface. Here we demonstrate that rotating the cavity boundary relative to the underlying lattice structure drives a quantum transition from nearly integrable dynamics to chaotic regime, observed as a concomitant crossover of eigenvalue statistics and eigenstate profiles. Complementing the full quantum treatment, we examine the classical backbone of this onset of chaos by employing semiclassical ray dynamics. Our results position bilayer graphene cavities as a promising venue for investigating and engineering quantum-chaotic behavior in graphene-based devices."},{"t":"批判性分析研究论文的七个步骤","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01209-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"By sticking to a clear strategy when reading, I get much more out of the literature, says Jacques Cornwell. By sticking to a clear strategy when reading, I get much more out of the literature, says Jacques Cornwell."},{"t":"面向普适电催化C-N偶联的自优化取向晶面重构","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4658732?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化C-N偶联","kp":["[活性晶面]: Cu(111)自优化重构","[产物]: 尿素"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种具有自优化能力的电催化C-N偶联体系，通过催化剂表面晶面的定向重构实现普适性的碳-氮键形成。电催化C-N偶联是绿色合成平台，但催化剂表面动态演化机理不明。该工作揭示了原位晶面重构与催化性能的关系，为有机电合成中C-N键的高效构建提供了普适策略。","ot":"Self‐Optimization With Oriented Facet Reconstruction for Universal Electrocatalytic C–N Coupling","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrocatalytic C–N coupling represents a green synthesis platform, yet the dynamic evolution of catalyst surfaces during the reaction remains poorly understood. Here, we report a nitrate‐dominated, preferential facet evolution on Cu single crystals that directs less active (110) and (100) facets toward the highly active (111) configuration. The Cu(111) surface delivers a urea yield of 5.2 mg h\n                    −1\n                     cm\n                    −2\n                    from CO\n                    2\n                    and NO\n                    3\n                    −\n                    , outperforming (110) and (100) by about 4‐ and 26‐fold, respectively, while maintaining excellent stability. Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that this facet reconstruction is associated with spontaneous chemical interaction between nitrate and metallic copper, alongside the thermodynamic stability of the Cu(111) facet. Significantly, the pristine Cu(111) surface consistently outperforms Cu(110) and Cu(100), highlighting its intrinsic catalytic superiority. This work provides insights into nitrate‐dominated C–N coupling, advancing the design of dynamically active electrocatalysts."},{"t":"面向3D砂型打印的自演化实验平台","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag352/8704708?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"砂型3D打印","kp":["[平台]: 机器人+AI自进化3D砂型打印"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究构建了一个面向3D砂型打印的自演化实验平台，利用自动化实验和优化算法应对铸造模具制造中非线性高维优化挑战。3D砂型打印虽革新了铸造模具制造，但打印参数（粘结剂配比、层厚、固化速度等）的优化空间巨大。该平台通过闭环实验-学习迭代，实现了打印工艺的自适应优化。","ot":"Self-evolving experimental platform for 3D sand printing","b":"3D sand printing revolutionizes casting mold fabrication while confronting nonlinear high-dimensional optimization challenges stemming from variable combinations and objective conflicts. Here, we develop Ex3DSP, a self-evolving experimental platform combining robotic ‘can-do’ capabilities with artificial intelligence ‘can-think’ cognition to establish a ‘do-while-thinking’ self-evolving experimentation paradigm. Addressing a 3-objective, 3-variable high-dimensional optimization problem, our Ex3DSP discovers the Pareto front with a 1148-fold reduction in experimental workload. The platform provides two solution types (objective-optimal and balanced) with interpretability and reveals underlying mechanisms (variable-objective interaction and sand mold fracture behavior). Moreover, these solutions are applied to guide real-world casting parameter selection, yielding castings with up to 385% improved physicochemical and mechanical performances. This work demonstrates a self-evolving experimentation paradigm for 3D sand printing, offering both an intelligent additive manufacturing roadmap and pre-industrial screening potential."},{"t":"用于基于铜凋亡的癌症治疗和成像的自组装","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D5CS01136A","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cuproptosis, a copper-dependent programmed cell death pathway, has emerged as a promising strategy for cancer therapy. While previous reviews have primarily focused on the fundamental mechanisms of cuproptosis and the development of inducing agents, the self-assembly-driven, stimuli-responsive cuproptosis nanoplatforms have remained relatively underexplored. To fill this gap, this review provides a comprehensive analysis of recent advancements in stimuli-responsive, dynamic self-assembly nanosystems for cuproptosis-based cancer therapy and imaging. We begin by elucidating the molecular mechanisms that underpin cuproptosis, followed by a systematic exploration of the design principles behind self-assembly-based cuproptosis inducers. These inducers leverage selective copper-ion coordination chemistry, coupled with diverse intermolecular forces, to enable precise spatiotemporal regulation. Furthermore, we highlight how these nanoassemblies undergo intelligent structural and functional transformations in response to both endogenous and exogenous stimuli, enabling controlled activation of cuproptosis. This review also explores breakthrough applications that integrate cuproptosis with synergistic therapeutic strategies and imaging guidance, highlighting a promising direction for enhancing cancer treatment. Finally, we discuss the critical challenges and barriers that must be addressed to push this emerging field toward clinical translation.","tp":"铜凋亡纳米","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"综述全面分析了基于铜凋亡的刺激响应型自组装纳米平台在癌症治疗和成像中的最新进展。铜凋亡是一种铜依赖性程序性细胞死亡途径，被视为癌症治疗的新策略。文章聚焦自组装驱动的动态纳米系统，弥补了此前综述主要关注铜凋亡基本机制和诱导剂开发的不足。"},{"t":"使用 EXO-200 第二阶段搜索 $^{134}\\mathrm{Xe}$ 的双 Beta 衰变","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/vpny-23wq","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): S. Al Kharusi et al. (EXO-200 Collaboration)EXO-200 was a leading double beta decay experiment consisting of a single-phase, enriched liquid xenon time projection chamber filled with an admixture of 80.672% $^{136}\\mathrm{Xe}$ and 19.098% $^{134}\\mathrm{Xe}$. The detector operated at the Waste Isolation Pilot Plant between 2010 and 2018 and w…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232502] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"《自然》民意调查显示，科学家们对人工智能 FOMO 的看法很糟糕","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01690-7","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Almost half of the scientists who responded said that they feel broadly negative towards artificial intelligence, but they think that some tools are better than others. Almost half of the scientists who responded said that they feel broadly negative towards artificial intelligence, but they think that some tools are better than others.","tp":"AI态度调查","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":1.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"《自然》杂志民意调查显示，近半数受访科学家对人工智能持整体负面态度，但同时认为部分AI工具优于其他。科学家群体中的AI'错失恐惧症'(FOMO)情绪引发关注，反映了学术界对AI工具在科研中应用价值的复杂心态——既担忧其影响，又不愿错过潜在收益。"},{"t":"科学家重现核火球并揭开放射性尘埃隐藏的化学成分","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-recreate-a-nuclear-fireball-and-uncover-fallouts-hidden-chemistry/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"技术突破","b":"In the first fraction of a second after a nuclear explosion or a major reactor accident, an immense surge of energy superheats the surrounding environment. Nearby materials and air are instantly vaporized, creating a rapidly expanding fireball made of gas and\nAs that fireball grows and cools, the vaporized material begins to condense into tiny solid particles. Those particles eventually become nuclear fallout.\nUnderstanding exactly how fallout forms is important for improving safety assessments and helping scientists reconstruct the events that occurred during a nuclear incident. A new study from researchers at Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory (LLNL), published in\nAnalytical Chemistry\n, takes a closer look at that process by examining how uranium, cerium, and cesium behave as they vaporize, react, and cool under carefully controlled conditions.\nThe findings suggest that commonly used fallout models may overlook important chemical interactions that occur as particles form.\n“Changing how long materials remain at high temperature can alter chemical reactions and how volatile elements like cesium are incorporated into particles,” said LLNL scientist and author Rakia Dhaoui. “These particles preserve a record of how they formed. By studying these processes in a controlled system, we can replace assumptions with measurements, improve the models used to interpret nuclear debris, and support decision-making when it matters most.”\nTo investigate how fallout develops, the researchers used a plasma flow reactor designed to reproduce part of the environment found inside a nuclear fireball.\nThe system allows scientists to feed specific combinations of materials into a high-temperature plasma, where they are vaporized. The resulting vapor then travels through a tube where the temperature can be precisely controlled as it cools.\nThe team tested two different cooling scenarios, known as thermal histories. In one case, the temperature steadily declined as the material moved through the reactor. In the second, the vapor remained at a higher temperature for a longer period before cooling quickly.\nBecause the reactor operates continuously, the researchers were able to collect material at multiple points along the system and observe how particles changed over time.\n“Historical fallout studies indicate that the path materials take as they cool is important,” said Dhaoui. “Cooling rate and time at elevated temperature can alter chemical speciation and particle formation.”\nThe researchers selected uranium, cerium, and cesium because each element behaves differently during the condensation process.\nUranium is relatively less volatile, meaning it condensed earlier and served as a useful reference for comparison. Cerium, which is often used as a substitute for plutonium in laboratory studies, showed a condensation pattern similar to uranium. However, both elements displayed changes in their chemistry depending on the thermal history they experienced.\nCesium stood out from the other elements.\nUnlike uranium and cerium, cesium condensed much later. When it remained at elevated temperatures for longer periods, it mixed far more extensively with the other materials in the system.\nThese observations indicate that fallout formation depends not only on when different elements condense, but also on how they interact chemically while cooling.\nMany current fallout models treat materials largely as separate components and only partially account for chemical reactions occurring between elements. The new results suggest that those interactions can play a much larger role than previously recognized.\nThe team plans to continue the work by studying more realistic combinations of materials, with the goal of better capturing the complexity of fallout formation under real-world conditions.\nReference: “Thermal Gradient Effects on Redox Evolution and Volatility-Driven Fractionation in Ternary U/Ce/Cs Condensates” by Rakia Dhaoui, Emily N. Weerakkody, Timothy P. Rose, Batikan Koroglu and Enrica Balboni, 24 April 2026,\nAnalytical Chemistry\nDOI: 10.1021/acs.analchem.5c07929\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nLawrence Livermore National Laboratory\nNuclear Physics\nPlasma Physics\nScientists Detect Elusive New Isotope in Landmark Superheavy Experiment\nSupercomputers Crack the Code of Super-Diamond Synthesis\nThermonuclear Fusion in a Sheared-Flow Z-Pinch: Advancing Another Viable Pathway to Fusion Energy\nUnderstanding Hot-Spot Conditions in National Ignition Facility Implosion Experiments\nHow Scientists Achieved Burning Plasma State – After Decades of Fusion Research\nAtomic Disorder in Surface Materials Is Key to Better Hydrogen Storage\nAntidote Developed for Nerve Agent Poisoning\nLaser-Driven Ion Acceleration With Deep Learning Neural Networks\nUnusual Property in Hydrogen Fuel Device Discovered – Could Be Ultimate Guide to Self-Improvement","tp":"核尘埃化学","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"科学家首次在实验室中重现了核火球，揭示了放射性尘埃中隐藏的化学成分。核爆炸或重大反应堆事故后，巨大能量在瞬间汽化周围物质形成快速膨胀的火球，冷却后凝结成放射性微粒即核沉降物。该研究对改进核安全评估和沉降物预测模型具有重要意义。"},{"t":"科学家发现野生蛇传播的隐藏疾病危机","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/scientists-discover-a-hidden-disease-crisis-spreading-through-wild-snakes/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"A hidden wave of fungal disease and lung parasites is putting wild rattlesnakes and other native snakes at risk.\nSnake populations around the world are under increasing pressure from habitat loss, disease, and other environmental challenges. Among the diseases drawing the most concern is ophidiomycosis, commonly known as snake fungal disease, which is caused by the fungus\nOphidiomyces ophidiicola\n). Since it was first identified about two decades ago, the disease has been detected in numerous snake\nTo better understand the health of wild snakes, researchers in the southeastern United States examined the prevalence of seven different pathogens across native snake populations. Their goal was to compare infection patterns over time, across locations, and among different species. The findings were published in Frontiers in Veterinary Science.\nand the parasite\nRaillietiella orientalis\n), appear to be the most important infectious agents in free-ranging snakes in the southeastern US,” said first author Dr. Corinna Mishin (formerly Corinna Hazelrig), a researcher at the University of Georgia. “We also show that increased risk of ophidiomycosis was strongly associated with coinfections in free-ranging native snakes.”\nThe study, funded by the Morris Animal Foundation, included more than 500 snakes representing 29 species. Researchers captured most of the animals at wildlife refuges in South Carolina and Florida, while additional samples were collected opportunistically throughout the southeastern United States.\nMost snakes were captured alive, swabbed, and sampled for blood. Researchers also examined a small number of snake carcasses found along roads or in the field, conducting full postmortem evaluations that included tissue collection.\n“For around 10 years, free-ranging snake research almost solely focused on\n. We wanted to evaluate snake health on a more comprehensive level and really establish a broader view,” Mishin said.\nThe results revealed that only about 20% of the snakes tested showed no evidence of any of the pathogens included in the study.\nThe most frequently detected pathogen was the bacterium\nSalmonella enterica\n, which was found in 63% of snakes. Another common infection was\nHepatozoon spp.\n, a tick-borne parasite detected in 53% of the animals.\nResearchers also identified\nMycoplasma spp.\nin 18% of snakes. This antibiotic-resistant bacterium can cause upper respiratory disease and had not previously been reported in wild snakes in the United States.\nCoinfections were widespread. Nearly 44% of snakes carried more than one pathogen at the same time.\nAbout 29% of snakes hosted two pathogens, while roughly 11% carried three. Another 3% were infected with four pathogens simultaneously.\n“When an animal has become sick from an infection, their immune system is compromised, which increases the risk of further disease exacerbation from other infectious agents that may have once been subclinical,” Mishin explained.\nThe study found that infection patterns varied significantly by species.\nPygmy rattlesnakes were especially likely to be infected with snake fungal disease. Of the 34 rattlesnakes tested, 12 were positive for\n, and many showed visible signs of illness. By comparison, only one of 55 eastern ribbon snakes and three of 36 ring-necked snakes tested positive.\nResearchers also found that pygmy rattlesnakes were particularly susceptible to\n, an invasive parasitic crustacean commonly called the snake lungworm. Fourteen of the 34 rattlesnakes carried the parasite.\nIn other snake species,\noccurred much less frequently and was completely absent in some groups, including Florida green watersnakes.\n“We hypothesize that certain species with poorer general population health, specifically rattlesnakes with historic and current increased risks of human persecution, are likely more susceptible to infection with subsequent disease,” said Mishin. “In addition, pygmy rattlesnakes were expected to have an increased prevalence of\n, as they primarily consume lizards and frogs which are known to transmit the parasite.”\nGeography also played a role in infection patterns.\nSnakes sampled in Georgia were far more likely to test positive for\nwas detected only in snakes from Florida.\nVisible skin lesions were another strong indicator of fungal infection. More than 30% of snakes with skin lesions tested positive for snake fungal disease, compared with only 2% of snakes that showed no lesions.\nThe researchers note several limitations to the study. Most sampling occurred within a relatively small number of counties, meaning the results may not fully represent snake populations throughout the region.\nThe team also pointed out that detecting\nin living snakes can be difficult because testing relies on fecal samples. Since snakes may go long periods between meals, suitable samples are not always available. As a result, the true prevalence of the parasite is likely higher than reported.\nEven with these limitations, the findings provide valuable information for wildlife conservation and invasive species management.\nBoth Burmese pythons and brown anoles, which are invasive species in the United States, are known hosts of\n. Understanding which pathogens native snakes already carry and which they have not previously encountered could help reduce future disease spread.\n“Our data provide important information on which pathogens native snakes may likely have but also which they are likely naïve to. This can inform actions needed to prevent pathogen spillover from captive snakes,” Mishin concluded. “When translocating wildlife, it’s essential to consider which pathogens may be translocated with them – and the potential downstream effects.”\nReference: “Health assessment and multipathogen surveillance of free-ranging snakes in the southeastern United States” by Corinna M. Mishin, Terence M. Farrell, Jenna N. Palmisano, Robert J. Ossiboff, Makaylah McCray, Ellen Haynes, John C. Maerz, Kristina Meichner, Jian Zhang, Kayla B. Garrett, Michael J. Yabsley, Jason Ortega, Christopher A. Cleveland and Nicole M. Nemeth, 27 March 2026,\nFrontiers in Veterinary Science\nDOI: 10.3389/fvets.2026.1754420\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nBiodiversity\nConservation\nSea Urchins Are Dying Worldwide and No One Knows Why\nThe “Sixth Mass Extinction” Might Be a Myth, New Evidence Shows\nThis Iconic Rocky Mountain Animal Is Vanishing, Researchers Warn\nWhere Have All the Butterflies Gone? “Shocking” Nationwide Decline Sparks Alarm\nFascinating New Species of Gecko Discovered in Venezuela\nUnmasking the Unknown: TetrapodTraits Exposes Critical Gaps in Biodiversity Data\nNew Global Study Confirms: Conservation Actually Works\nFootprint Forensics: How DNA From Polar Bears’ Snow Tracks Aids Conservation\nCryo Conservation – A Cool Solution to Saving Species From Extinction"},{"t":"科学必须被视为对大多数人而不是少数人来说可行的职业","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01849-2","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Letter to the Editor"},{"t":"Rivian R2首发试驾：除了……之外，这正是我升级Model Y所需的一切","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/09/rivian-r2-first-drive-this-is-everything-i-need-to-upgrade-my-model-y-except/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","as":"Rivian R2首次试驾评测：该车在续航、空间、智能化等方面被视为特斯拉Model Y的强力升级替代品，但仍有不足。媒体在犹他州帕克城完成首批实车体验，整体评价积极。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"纯电动SUV","kp":["[售价]: $45,000","[定位]: 大众市场SUV"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.5,"t":9.0},"ot":"Rivian R2 First Drive: This is everything I need to upgrade my Model Y except...","b":"Seth Weintraub\n| Jun 9 2026 - 6:00 am PT\nRivian flew us out to beautiful Park City, Utah, to get a first test of the R2, its $45,000 “bet-the-company” mass market SUV that it has promised for years. Today it begins delivering these vehicles, and I can say unequivocally after driving a performance variant for 5 hours, that these early customers are going to be very happy, though with some notable caveats…\nThe R2 looks a lot like its bigger, heavier 3-row sibling, the R1S.\nSame oval lights\n, same boxy adventure SUV stance, same unmistakable Rivian fun ethos. Just scaled down to 5000lbs, 40cm more compact, 16 cm shorter with a 15cm smaller wheelbase. The battery scales down to 88kWh instead of the 92-141kWh on the R1S. And there are only…gasp…two rows of seats.\nYou get the picture, this thing looks like a smaller Rivian R1S. It doesn’t have the dorsal fin antenna (radios are now integrated into the rear), its front is cleaner, there are small visual optimizations everywhere. But that is just skin deep.\nTo sell a mass market number of these vehicles, the R2 has to be better than the bigger R1. The most obvious difference is the price. The R2 will eventually start at $45,000 for an RWD, smaller-battery variant that the company doesn’t think many people will want over the better-specced versions. The company often points toward Tesla’s demographics for its decisions, and Tesla’s Average Sale Price (ASP) is way over $50,000, and that’s with the discontinued Model S and X. Tesla’s base car price is close to its $35K Model 3 promise, but after destination and fees, is closer to $39,000. Just the same, Rivian think the sweet spot in terms of sales is probably an AWD Premium version that will cost over $55K after destination and other fees.\nRivian’s prices break out as such:\nThe price isn’t the only R2 differentiator, however. The R2 drives much more like a sports car. Sport mode actually feels firm. All-purpose feels great. Even the off road mode feels much tighter. The lighter battery and lighter vehicle feel much more nimble. Acceleration in the Performance version feels much faster than the 3.6-second 0-60, and the acceleration from 40-75mph is even better. Mountain roads are much more fun and much less harrowing. The vehicle feels far more refined.\nSized up (and we love any spec sheet with a wading depth):\nProbably the most striking claim, and in being in the mountains we weren’t able to accurately test this, about the R2 is its miserly electricity consumption. It, with its bigger, more off-road-capable tires and more boxy, higher-drag\naerodynamics than the Tesla Model Y,\nuses about the same amount of energy to go the same distance\nAnd we know that Tesla is already extremely ‘optimistic’ in its range estimates.\nCharging will be faster, not necessarily because the car charges more quickly, but because the battery is smaller and it takes less time to fill. It will pull down up to 240kW at peak charging, and we even saw north of 170kW at over 50% state of charge on a NACS RAN charger a few miles from the hotel. Rivian says it will take less than 30 minutes to go from 10% to 80% charge, adding around 230 miles. While that is respectable, especially with a 400V system, it isn’t in the same league as 800V systems like Porsche or Hyundai, which can do the same 10-80% in under 20 minutes, let alone the Chinese, which are flirting with 5-minute charging times.\nBottom line: Road trips in the R2 will take less time than the R1. But stops will be about 10 minutes longer than 800V competitors.\nRivian lays out the next generation of technology:\n● Designed for the Road Ahead: Rivian Autonomy+7 ($49.99/month or $2,500/one-time) hardware is built into all R2 trims and service is optional across the lineup (lifetime access to Autonomy+ included5 with Launch Package), bringing L2+ hands-free assisted driving to 3.5 million miles of roads across the U.S. and Canada with Universal Hands-Free6. Every Rivian comes standard with a system that continuously evolves with each software update, getting smarter right from your driveway, and foundational active safety and driver assistance features. All new R2 deliveries include a 60-day trial of Autonomy+.\n● AI Powerhouse: R2 is outfitted with 200 sparse TOPS of edge AI compute dedicated to the in-cabin experience. This includes enabling the forthcoming Rivian Assistant—our in-vehicle voice assistant that understands you, your vehicle and your context—to smoothly run complex tasks locally on the edge, even if the vehicle is offline.\n● Haptic Halo Wheels: At the center of the R2 driving experience is a redesigned steering wheel featuring haptic ‘halo’ dials. These dynamic and context-aware controls—capable of scrolling, pushing, pulling and tilting—provide distinct physical responses for multiple functions, bridging the gap between digital software and tactile hardware to keep the driver’s focus on the horizon. Both the physical wheels and underlying haptic technology were designed in-house.\n● Dual Digital Displays: R2 offers flexibility and control with two displays—a driver display in front of the steering wheel for more utility on the road, and the center display for a deeper dive into features.\n● Software Updates: Rivian builds vertically-integrated hardware and software, enabling your vehicle to gain meaningful updates via software right from your driveway. R2 evolves this vertically integrated approach with a new, streamlined electrical architecture that delivers more capability with less complexity, providing ample headroom for the future.\nOverall, however, the R2 is a major step up from the R1 in a lot of ways. In fact, I said the same thing to Rivian CEO RJ Scaringe that I said to Tesla after driving the Model 3.\nThe R2 is going to cannibalize the sales of the more expensive R1 models.\nTesla’s Model S and X turned into niche vehicles after the launch of the Model 3 and Y, which were recently discontinued to make way for robots. Scaringe points to upgrades coming to the Gen 3 R1 lineup that will close most of the feature gaps, but I also wonder how many people will pay up to double the price for a 3rd row, a few extra cubic feet, and perks. I think the R2 will become Rivian’s best-selling vehicle the minute they can make enough of them.\nThere are still things the R1S does better. Obviously, being bigger, it holds more stuff and still has a faster 0-60 time. It also does off-roading better, especially the\nquad motor variant with Kick Turn capability\n. But the R2 is no slouch, and we did get a 20 PSI, 20-inch wheel version to play with on the trails. As RJ put it, the Model Y (and most crossovers, electric and otherwise) wouldn’t have made it back from this trip.\nRivian’s V2 software is a significant upgrade. In my limited testing, the UI was fast and efficient, though there was at least one incident where the GPS was off on a parallel road. Lots of little tweaks show that\nWassym Bensaid\nand his team are really engaged in user feedback and making the Rivian driver and passenger’s experience better. Here’s an overview of what’s new:\nToday’s Rivians can do traffic-aware cruise control, which is helpful on highways. But it is far from Tesla’s FSD feature set. Rivian promises that at some point in the future, it will be able to do point-to-point navigation with the hardware in the R2 sold this year. However, for those who want Level 3 autonomy, where you can read a book or play with your phone while driving, you’ll have to wait for a Lidar version of these vehicles set to be released at the end of the year. That’s a big early adopter pill to swallow. Interestingly, Rivian will build a special Autonomous Robotaxi version of the R2 for Uber with additional hardware on the vehicle.\nAlso, Rivian has\nreally been dragging its feet on Vehicle to Grid/Home/X\nand they didn’t have a product to show us this week. They did promise that the vehicle could put out 11KW of AC power (think 48A at 240V) though the charge port and still offers an internal 110V AC outlet. But they’ve been promising V2X since the R1S launched and we’re still waiting.\nAnd talking to Rivian leadership about this is mind-numbing. Do they not know that LEGACY Automakers like Ford’s F-150 Lightning had 240V out 5 years ago? Do they not understand how valuable this is to a homeowner? Heck, I can power my home with my $28,000 Chevy Bolt today!? Do they think no one wants this? I’m officially done giving Rivian a free pass on this. Show us the goods! Catch up to Ford and Chevy technology!\nThe R2 is a ‘bet the company’ vehicle for Rivian. If it fails, Rivian is done.\nBut the R2 is also a relatively safe bet in this form. It is the best vehicle Rivian has ever produced by a long shot. It is way more efficient, handles way better, and comes at a much more palatable price tag. It retains Rivian’s adventure ethos and, with features like drop-down rear glass, huge steering scroll wheels, and double gloveboxes, takes it a step further.\nHowever, just because Rivian can make and show off a few R2s to journalists doesn’t mean they’ve reached a safe space. They still need to ramp this vehicle up through what Elon Musk called “production hell” – making the transition from a niche vehicle maker to a mass market vehicle maker, and just like it almost killed Tesla, it could also cause big problems for Rivian.\nAlso, there is the autonomy question: Rivian is far behind Tesla and others. Will they be able to catch up in a reasonable amount of time? Will the lack of Lidar on 2026 vehicles keep early adopters away?\nI’m not so sure I want to give up my 2020 Model Y with FSD for promises to be made at some uncertain point in the future. I also don’t want to buy a car with already outdated hardware.\nGive me the Uber Edition!\nAll of that said, if Rivian can make hundreds of thousands of the vehicles we drove last week and sell them at a profit, the company will thrive.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nPublisher and Editorial Director of the 9to5/Electrek sites. Tesla Model 3, X and Chevy Bolt owner…5 ebikes and counting\nTesla Model S or X $100 Supercharging with this link\nAerovironment Turbo cord"},{"t":"通过全基因组 SNP 的智能分析，预测 Correa 级联中幽门螺杆菌菌株的风险","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603926123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Only a minority of\n                    \n                      Helicobacter pylori\n                    \n                    (\n                    \n                      H. pylori\n                    \n                    )-infected individuals progress along Correa’s cascade, and classical virulence markers do not fully explain this heterogeneity, motivating genome-wide approaches to quantify strain-level genomic risk associated with advanced lesions. We assembled 528 high-quality\n                    \n                      H. pylori\n                    \n                    whole-genome sequences spanning nonatrophic gastritis (NAG), atrophic gastritis (AG), intestinal metaplasia (IM), and gastric cancer (GC) and performed bacterial genome-wide association analyses with explicit adjustment for population structure. We then integrated advanced lesions-associated variants into a random forest model to derive an\n                    \n                      H. pylori\n                    \n                    Genomic Risk Score (HpRS), defined as the predicted probability that a strain is associated with advanced lesions (IM/GC) vs. nonadvanced lesions (NAG/AG). Despite phylogenetic analyses revealing that genome-wide clustering was primarily driven by geographic lineage rather than disease stage, HpRS achieved strong discrimination in repeated cross-validation (mean AUC = 0.902, 95% CI: 0.892 to 0.912), remained discriminatory in an internal held-out set (AUC = 0.780), and generalized to two independent cohorts (Bacterial and Viral Bioinformatics Resource Center (BV-BRC): AUC = 0.871; hospital cohort distinguishing IM vs. NAG/AG: AUC = 0.843). Predictive single-nucleotide polymorphisms mapped mainly to core functions (DNA repair, translation, and central and lipid metabolism) and often affected conserved domains, suggesting a polygenic architecture and generating testable functional hypotheses. HpRS provides a proof-of-principle framework for strain-aware risk stratification and may complement future gastric cancer prevention strategies."},{"t":"相对论动力学理论中矩流形的黎曼几何和流体动力学方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/by8d-d9z2","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Craig S. WrightThe kinetic-to-hydrodynamic crossover in the quark-gluon plasma is conventionally diagnosed by scale ratios such as the Knudsen and inverse Reynolds numbers, which are not metrical on the space of distributions. I equip the Denicol–Niemi–Molnär–Rischke (DNMR) 14-moment manifold with the Fisher-Rao m…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064903] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026"},{"t":"重新审视供体稀释型有机太阳能电池中的电荷传输与复合","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523681?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机光伏","kp":["[电池体系]: PM6:Y12本体异质结有机太阳能电池","[供体含量阈值]: <5%即形成渗流网络","[形貌特征]: 片层堆积+垂直组分梯度"],"as":"系统研究PM6:Y12本体异质结有机太阳能电池中给体比例从1%到40%变化下的电荷传输与复合机制。该给体稀释体系挑战了传统有机光伏器件设计思路，对理解低给体含量下的光电转换过程具有重要意义。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Rethinking Charge Transport and Recombination in Donor‐Diluted Organic Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  We systematically investigate PM6:Y12 bulk‐heterojunction solar cells with donor fractions ranging from 1% to 45%, linking morphology, charge transport, and recombination to device performance. Complementary structural and spectroscopic methods reveal that a percolating PM6 network forms even at below 5% donor content, with lamellar stacking and vertical composition gradients that do not hinder the charge extraction. The reduction of the effective active layer conductivity toward low donor fractions obeys a three‐dimensional percolation model, indicating that charge transport is governed by network topology rather without a pronounced percolation threshold. A transition from nongeminate Langevin recombination to a dispersive Smoluchowski‐type loss occurs below 5% donor fraction. The latter regime is also nongeminate, i.e., pertains to recombination of the total charge carrier density. Correspondingly, we observe that the Langevin reduction in the higher donor fractions – mostly dominated by redissociation of electron–hole pairs after encounter – changes toward low donor fractions: in these cases, the nongeminate loss rate exceeds the prediction of the Langevin model. This regime coincides with increasing transport resistance due to topology‐limited hole conduction, leading to reduced fill factors despite a high retained charge‐generation efficiency. Our results demonstrate that strong donor dilution preserves photogeneration if a continuous donor network is maintained, and unveil how topology‐controlled transport and non‐Langevin recombination jointly define the performance limits of donor‐diluted organic solar blends.","aip":1},{"t":"耦合电力与交通网络的弹性定价驱动协调：学习增强的混合整数优化方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600810X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网交通耦合定价","kp":["[方法]: 学习增强混合整数重构","[对象]: 电力-交通耦合网络定价协调"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"ot":"Resilient pricing-driven coordination of coupled power and transportation networks: A learning-augmented mixed-integer r"},{"t":"利用合成NAD+型辅因子重编程NAD(P)+结合蛋白以实现亚胺生物催化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2116720?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"研究通过合成生物学策略，将非天然亚胺催化基序整合到NAD(P)+结合蛋白支架中，实现亚胺生物催化功能的重编程。该工作突破了将人工催化元件高效嵌入蛋白质骨架的核心瓶颈，拓展了生物催化反应类型。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"人工酶生物催化","kp":["[合成辅因子]: 苯胺腺嘌呤二核苷酸AnAD","[催化功能]: 引入亚胺催化活性"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Reprogramming NAD(P)+‐Binding Proteins for Iminium Biocatalysis via a Synthetic NAD+‐Type Cofactor","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Efficient integration of non‐natural catalytic motifs into protein scaffolds remains a central challenge in artificial enzyme design. Here we report aniline adenine dinucleotide (AnAD), a NAD\n                    +\n                    ‐type synthetic cofactor in which the native nicotinamide is replaced by a catalytically active aniline unit. When incorporated into diverse NAD(P)\n                    +\n                    ‐binding proteins, AnAD introduces an iminium catalysis mechanism that enables tandem Friedel‐Crafts alkylation‐enantioselective protonation reactions. Screening a panel of natural protein scaffolds revealed broad intrinsic compatibility, while protein engineering further enhanced activity and stereoselectivity, affording artificial enzymes with good substrate generality and tunable enantioselectivity. Mechanistic studies showed that cooperation between AnAD and protein microenvironments, particularly dynamic active‐site loop motions, governs both reactivity and enantioselectivity. These results demonstrate the generality and robustness of reprogramming ubiquitous NAD(P)\n                    +\n                    ‐binding proteins for new‐to‐nature biotransformations using NAD\n                    +\n                    ‐type synthetic cofactors."},{"t":"回复：尽管传输特征存在冲突，但二维 β-TeO2 作为本征绝缘体","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01659-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature Electronics","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"回复肖和今田：无需选择合作伙伴，跨群体边界的亲社会性也是可能的","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2613719123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"回复 Wang 等人：将微生物代谢物和肠道上皮反应与微生物组定向治疗食品联系起来","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2613406123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"回复 González González 等人：细菌对肾结石形成的贡献","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2609802123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"通过微生物组修复调节肠道上皮屏障和簇/杯状细胞反应：机遇和未来方向","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535289123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"通过氨基硅氧烷功能接枝调节环保型纤维素基复合电解质的锂离子传导","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71171?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cellulose‐based electrolytes are promising solid electrolyte candidates for low‐cost and eco‐friendly batteries owing to their natural characteristics of being renewable and biodegradable. Unfortunately, they have strong reactivity and high crystallinity, leading to critical challenges when used in Li‐ion batteries, including poor high‐voltage tolerance, slow Li‐ion conduction and heterogeneous Li‐ion flux. Here, we report a functional grafting modification to regulate Li‐ion conduction within cellulose‐based solid electrolytes. In‐situ sol‐gel self‐assembly accompanied by amino‐siloxane grafting is developed to achieve the homogeneous integration of cellulose−amino‐siloxane−ionic liquid composites, forming a compact solid‐state electrolyte membrane. Such functional design establishes continuous and uniform Li‐ion transport highways through amino coordination while disrupting native crystallinity of cellulose, endowing a rapid Li‐ion conductivity (1×10\n                    −3\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    ) and a high electrochemical oxidation potential (5 V). The obtained electrolyte membrane features a homogenous microstructure with high mechanical elasticity and thermodynamic stability, exhibiting high compatibility with Li metal and enabling excellent electrochemical performance. Consequently, solid‐state Li‐metal batteries exhibit exceptional cycle‐life, whereas LiFePO\n                    4\n                    cells run 592 cycles and LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    cells run 403 cycles at 0.5 C rate until the capacity reduces to 80%. Notably, a comprehensive life‐cycle assessment verifies its advantages in energy conservation and carbon reduction. It presents a sustainable development of high‐performance cellulose‐based solid‐state electrolytes.","tp":"锂电池电解质","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员提出通过氨基硅氧烷功能接枝策略改性纤维素基复合电解质，解决其高结晶度和强反应性导致的耐高压性差、锂离子传导慢及锂通量不均等问题。该改性方法有望提升环保型固态锂电池的电化学性能，为低成本可降解电池的工程化应用开辟新路径。"},{"t":"不同配体双核钴催化剂实现的炔烃区域发散性氢锗化反应","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6685709?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该研究利用双核钴催化剂实现炔烃的发散性氢锗化反应。传统过渡金属催化氢锗化选择性单一，双核钴体系可通过调控催化条件实现不同区域选择性，高效合成多种区域异构的烯基锗化合物。该方法原子经济性高，为有机锗合成提供了灵活新路径，有望推动锗基功能分子及药物中间体的构建。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双核钴催化氢锗化","kp":["[催化剂]: 双核钴配不同配体","[反应]: 区域发散性炔烃氢锗化"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Regiodivergent Hydrogermylation of Alkynes Enabled by Dinuclear Cobalt Catalysts Bearing Different Ligands","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Transition‐metal‐catalyzed hydrogermylation of alkynes represents an ideal atom‐economical method to prepare vinylgermanes that are valuable reagents in medicinal chemistry, material science and organic synthesis. Nevertheless, its development―particularly in achieving high regioselectivity with earth‐abundant 3d metal catalysts―remains as a formidable challenge. Herein, we report regiodivergent hydrogermylation reactions of alkynes employing structure well‐defined dicobalt carbonyl complexes as catalysts: the reaction using [(IPent)Co\n                    2\n                    (CO)\n                    7\n                    ] (IPent = 1,3‐di(2,6‐di(pentan‐3‐yl)phenyl)imidazol‐2‐ylidene) affords selectively\n                    α\n                    ‐vinylgermanes, whereas that with [(Xantphos)Co\n                    2\n                    (CO)\n                    6\n                    ] (Xantphos = (9,9‐dimethyl‐9\n                    H\n                    ‐xanthene‐4,5‐diyl)bis(diphenylphosphane) yields selectively\n                    β‐\n                    (\n                    E\n                    )‐vinylgermanes. Both cobalt catalysts effect the hydrogermylation of alkyl‐ and aryl‐substituted terminal alkynes with tertiary hydrogermanes with good functional group compatibility in good to high yields and selectivity. Mechanistic studies establish alkyne‐bridged dicobalt carbonyl species as the active intermediates in both catalytic systems and the distinct steric nature of the metalloligands LCo (L = IPent, Xantphos) governs the observed regiodivergent selectivity. The application of these dicobalt‐catalysts to alkyne hydroelementation reactions allows the selective preparation of different configurational isomers of vinylgermanes/silanes that can be further utilized for the stereoselective synthesis of alkene derivatives."},{"t":"氧化还原化学赋能水系铵离子电池实现优异容量与超长循环寿命","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6628239?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"水系铵离子电池因成本低、离子电导率高、安全性好被视为储能领域极具前景的技术，但容量和循环寿命长期受限。该研究通过氧化还原化学策略优化电极反应机制，显著提升容量并实现超长循环寿命，为大规模安全储能系统的开发提供了关键突破方向。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铵离子电池","kp":["[电极材料]: 普鲁士蓝类似物","[电池类型]: 水系铵离子电池","[特性]: 超长循环寿命"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Redox Chemistry Enables Excellent Capacity and Ultra Long Life Aqueous Ammonium Ion Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ammonium‐ion batteries are promising for energy storage with low cost, high ionic conductivity, and excellent safety. However, their long‐term cycling stability is far from the industrial application expectation owing the lack of suitable electrode materials. Here, we report the redox chemistry enables excellent capacity and ultra long life of Prussian blue analogues as performant electrode materials by regulating their t\n                    2g\n                    e\n                    g\n                    occupancy of M’ d‐orbitals. This work shows that the electronic configuration of M’ is crucial for redox reversibility, structural robustness, and ultimately tolerance for NH\n                    4\n                    +\n                    storage stability. For (NH\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    NiFe(CN)\n                    6\n                    , the metallic center with fully filled t\n                    2g\n                    orbitals ensures the stable structure, while the half‐filled e\n                    g\n                    orbitals in the high‐spin states enhance the axial transport of electrons. As a result, the key metric for the best one (NH\n                    4\n                    )\n                    2\n                    NiFe(CN)\n                    6\n                    delivers a reversible capacity of ∼70 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    , superior rate performance, and outstanding long‐life performance, sustaining stable output for over 10 000 h at 100 mA g\n                    −1\n                    and 30 000 cycles at 1000 mA g\n                    −1\n                    . In situ XRD and first‐principles calculations further confirm highly reversible redox processes. This study presents a novel and effective strategy for improving the performance and stability of electrode materials, offering valuable insights for the development of next‐generation energy storage systems."},{"t":"通过纳米限制中的超分子聚合重定向激发态质子转移","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7594145?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The photoluminescence of photoacids in supramolecular assemblies provides crucial insights into proton transfer (PT) processes within biologically relevant confinement. In this work, we present a strategy to activate intermolecular excited‐state PT within the hydrophobic cavities of cyclodextrin‐based nanotubes. Activation is achieved using a specifically designed amphoteric emitter which undergoes a pKa inversion in the photoexcited state. Despite this photophysical behavior, intramolecular PT does not occur due to the spatial separation between the proton donor and acceptor sites in the compound. However, in the presence of γ‐cyclodextrin, the photoacid assembles into guest pairs, enabling pre‐organized PT between neighboring molecules. The effects of confinement on photostability, emission lifetime, and quantum yield indicate a mechanistic shift from excited‐state protolytic dissociation to intermolecular excited‐state PT. Spectroscopic investigation of the assembly mechanism and solvent isotope effect further supports the role of a template effect, reminiscent of enzymatic activation, in facilitating PT in the excited state.","tp":"超分子聚合","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种在环糊精基纳米管疏水腔内激活分子间激发态质子转移的新策略。通过设计一种在光激发态下发生pKa翻转的两性发射体，实现了在生物相关纳米限制环境中重定向光酸发光行为。该成果对理解受限空间内的质子转移过程及超分子光化学具有重要意义。"},{"t":"纤维状水系锌离子电池最新进展：从结构、原理、问题到策略","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71175?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"纤维状水系锌离子电池（FAZIBs）因柔性好、安全性高，被认为是可穿戴电子设备的理想柔性电源。该综述系统总结了FAZIBs的结构设计、工作原理、电极材料及电解质方面的最新进展，并讨论了锌枝晶、副反应等关键挑战与未来发展方向。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"纤维状锌离子电池","kp":["[电池类型]: 纤维状水系锌离子电池","[挑战]: 锌枝晶/析氢/机械耦合"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Recent Advances of Fiber‐Shaped Aqueous Zinc Ion Batteries: From Structure, Principles, Issues to Strategies","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Fiber‐shaped aqueous zinc‐ion batteries (FAZIBs) have been regarded as highly promising power supplying devices for wearable and flexible electronics because of their intrinsic safety, low cost, lightweight nature, and excellent flexibility. However, their practical development is still hindered by coupled electrochemical and mechanical issues, including Zn dendrite growth, H\n                    2\n                    evolution, surface passivation, cathode materials dissolution and shedding, and electrode/electrolyte interfacial separation under deformation. This review provides a critical and comprehensive overview of recent progresses in FAZIBs from composition, structural design, working principles, failure mechanisms, to mitigation strategies. First, the components of FAZIBs, including fibrous Zn anodes, fibrous cathodes, gel electrolytes, encapsulation materials, and device architectures, are systematically discussed. Then, the energy storage and flexibility‐related mechanisms are analyzed to clarify the intrinsic correlation between electrochemical behavior and mechanical adaptability. Subsequently, the major degradation pathways limiting the performance and durability of FAZIBs are summarized. Representative strategies, including rational design of flexible Zn anodes, gel‐electrolyte regulation, cathode stabilization, and interface optimization, are further highlighted. Finally, the remaining scientific challenges and future research directions are outlined. This review is expected to supply some useful guidance for the rational design of next‐generation FAZIBs with high energy density, excellent flexibility, and long‐term stability."},{"t":"LHD中湍流最小态实时追踪以优化等离子体约束","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae70a2","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","tp":"等离子体约束","kp":["[装置]: LHD大型螺旋装置","[湍流模式]: 离子温度梯度/电阻交换","[优化策略]: 实时跟踪湍流最小态"],"as":"湍流驱动的反常输运是降低等离子体约束性能、限制聚变反应堆效率的主要因素之一。该研究开发了实时跟踪湍流最小化状态的方法，通过动态优化等离子体约束条件来抑制湍流输运，从而提升磁约束聚变装置的整体性能，对实现可控核聚变商业化具有重要意义。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Real-time tracking of the turbulence-minimum state for optimizing plasma confinement in LHD","b":"Turbulence-driven anomalous transport is one of the primary factors that degrade plasma confinement performance and remains a common challenge in both tokamaks and stellarators/heliotrons. In the Large Helical Device, the dominant turbulence mode—either ion temperature gradient or resistive interchange—varies according to the plasma operational regime, thereby determining the confinement characteristics (Kinoshita et al 2024 Phys. Rev. Lett.132 235101). In particular, when the turbulent mode switches, both turbulence and anomalous transport are minimized. In this study, by employing an exhaustive search combined with a support vector machine, we successfully identified the condition under which this turbulence transition occurs as a function of externally controllable parameters. The results demonstrate that the transition boundary—representing the state where turbulence is minimized—can be effectively characterized by a linear relationship: . By implementing real-time feedback control to actively track this boundary, a sustained turbulence-suppressed state was achieved. This strategy provides a robust foundation for optimizing plasma performance in future fusion devices, where the synergy between real-time boundary tracking and transport-property exploitation can autonomously guide the plasma toward its highest confinement potential.","aip":1},{"t":"用于含噪声量子电路模拟的实时符号问题抑制量子蒙特卡洛算法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/wzcr-m8xb","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"as":"Shen与Lidar提出一种实时量子蒙特卡洛算法，用于在含噪声量子设备上模拟动力学演化，核心在于抑制困扰此类模拟的符号问题。该方法有望在近期NISQ器件上实现可靠的实时量子动力学模拟，为量子物理研究提供新工具。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子电路蒙特卡洛","kp":["[算法]: 实时符号问题抑制量子蒙特卡洛","[适用]: 开放量子系统马尔可夫/非马尔可夫"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Real-Time Sign-Problem-Suppressed Quantum Monte Carlo Algorithm for Noisy Quantum Circuit Simulations","b":"Author(s): Tong Shen and Daniel A. LidarWe present a real-time quantum Monte Carlo algorithm that simulates the dynamics of open quantum systems by stochastically compressing and evolving the density matrix under both Markovian and non-Markovian master equations. Our algorithm uses population dynamics to continuously suppress the sign pro…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230601] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"气相金属团簇反应性：揭示小分子活化与转化机制","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73550?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该综述聚焦气相金属团簇在活化与转化甲烷、氮气等高稳定性小分子中的反应活性机制研究。通过揭示金属团簇的催化活化路径，为惰性分子的高效转化及新型催化剂设计提供基础理论依据，对清洁能源与化工合成具有潜在应用价值。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"金属团簇小分子活化","kp":["[小分子活化]: 气相金属团簇在无干扰环境研究CH4/N2/CO2活化机制"],"sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"ot":"Reactivity of Gas‐Phase Metal Clusters: Unlocking Mechanisms of Activation and Conversion of Small Molecules","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Activation and conversion of very stable and abundantly available molecules such as methane (CH\n                    4\n                    ), nitrogen (N\n                    2\n                    ), carbon dioxide (CO\n                    2\n                    ), and so on into value‐added products under mild conditions represents a critical issue in energy and environmental chemistry. Gas‐phase cluster reactivity studies, conducted in isolated and interference‐free environments, can provide fundamental insights into the activation and transformation of inert chemical bonds at a molecular‐level, thereby informing the rational design of efficient catalysts. This perspective article summarizes the research progress over the past five years in the activation and conversion of CH\n                    4\n                    , N\n                    2\n                    , CO\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    (\n                    x\n                    = 1 and 2), and other molecules mediated by gas‐phase metal clusters investigated by both the traditional experimental/theoretical methods and the emerging techniques based on artificial intelligence. Novel reaction pathways covering both elementary and catalytic reactions as well as new electronic and geometric factors governing metal cluster reactivity have been introduced. Machine learning models constructed for the quantitative structure‐activity relationship of metal clusters that enable the rapid and reliable reactivity prediction of metal clusters have also been presented. These fruitful results offer fresh perspectives for practical catalytic systems and are helpful to develop advanced catalytic materials for the transformation of CH\n                    4\n                    , N\n                    2\n                    , CO\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    , and other molecules under mild conditions."},{"t":"RNF126 是一种过氧化物酶体命运开关，可实现肝细胞癌的再分化治疗","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535777123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Tumor hypoxia promotes dedifferentiation and metabolic reprogramming in hepatocellular carcinoma (HCC), undermining normal liver functions. Here, we identify the E3 ubiquitin ligase RNF126 as a hypoxia-inducible “peroxisomal fate” switch that links the hypoxic microenvironment to loss of hepatocyte differentiation. Under hypoxia, HIF-2α drives RNF126 expression, which in turn ubiquitinates the peroxisomal membrane transporter ABCD3, triggering selective peroxisome autophagy (pexophagy) and depletion of peroxisomes. This organelle loss ablates very-long-chain fatty acid β-oxidation and hydrogen peroxide detoxification, erasing key hepatocyte differentiation features. We show that genetic RNF126 ablation restores peroxisomal functions and impairs hypoxic HCC growth. Leveraging these insights, we developed a small-molecule RNF126 inhibitor, D665-1412, which selectively blocks hypoxia-induced pexophagy. D665-1412 treatment stabilizes peroxisomes, normalizes lipid metabolism, and reactivates hepatocytic differentiation markers, thereby “redifferentiating” HCC cells and suppressing tumor progression in vitro and in vivo. Our findings establish the HIF-2α–RNF126–ABCD3 axis as a driver of HCC dedifferentiation and present organelle-targeted redifferentiation therapy as a promising approach for liver cancer."},{"t":"用于核质量预测的量子启发贝叶斯概率算法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/ysj2-1g7q","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","as":"Tan等人提出一种受量子启发的贝叶斯概率（QIBP）算法用于原子核质量预测。该方法将量子计算思想融入贝叶斯框架，有望提升核质量预测的精度与效率，对核物理、天体核合成及核数据评估具有重要意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子启发核质量预测","kp":["[算法]: 量子启发贝叶斯概率(QIBP)预测核质量","[建模方法]: 理论-实验质量残差映射为波函数"],"sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quantum-inspired Bayesian probability algorithm for nuclear mass predictions","b":"Author(s): Kaizhong Tan, Jian Liu, and Chuan WangIn this study, a novel quantum-inspired Bayesian probability (QIBP) algorithm, informed by quantum dynamics, is proposed to improve the predictions of nuclear mass from theoretical models. Within the QIBP framework, residuals between the theoretical and experimental mass values are mapped into wave …[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064309] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026"},{"t":"量化需求侧管理在构建能源灵活性中的作用：智能就绪指标 a 的证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008512?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源灵活性","sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"量子点电激发水平的量化以缓解电致发光效率滚降","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73638?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦于发光二极管（LED）中量子点的电激发水平量化问题。电激发水平是影响QD-LED器件性能与稳定性的核心参数，过度的电激发会导致量子点材料发生电学退化（如荧光猝灭、俄歇复合加剧）。研究提出了一种量化电激发程度的方法，旨在为抑制器件退化、提升QD-LED效率和寿命提供理论依据与调控手段，对推动量子点显示技术的工程化应用具有重要意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子点电激发特性","kp":["[QD-LED效率]: 量化电激发水平以抑制电致发光效率滚降","[器件评估]: 电激发水平分析法评估器件质量"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Quantifying the Electrical Excitation Level of Quantum Dots for Mitigating Electroluminescent Efficiency Roll‐Off","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Understanding the electrical excitation level of quantum dots in light‐emitting diodes (LEDs) constitutes a central aspect of investigations into device mechanisms. However, practical research is hindered by the absence of straightforward and viable analytical methodologies. In this study, we present an approach for assessing device quality by examining the electrical excitation level of quantum dots in conjunction with carrier injection balance. Through quantitative modeling of electroluminescent intensity and the average number of excitons (&lt;\n                    N\n                    &gt;) generated under electrical excitation, key parameters that manifest the current utilization efficiency can be extracted, providing a guideline to inform device optimization strategies. As a proof of concept, the efficiency roll‐off of blue‐emitting perovskite quantum dot LEDs is theoretically analyzed. Combining electrically excited transient absorption spectroscopy, hole leakage is identified as the main cause of low current utilization efficiency. Mitigating carrier injection imbalance via enhancing electron injection, the blue device simultaneously achieves a high brightness of over 11 000 cd m\n                    −2\n                    and a maximum EQE of 26.0%, representing state‐of‐the‐art blue perovskite LEDs."},{"t":"热压对PEM燃料电池超声喷涂膜电极的铂负载量依赖效应","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008068?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池膜电极","kp":["[对象]: PEM燃料电池膜电极","[工艺]: 超声喷涂+热压","[变量]: Pt负载量"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Pt loading-dependent effects of hot pressing on ultrasonic-sprayed membrane electrodes for PEM fuel cells"},{"t":"迷幻药破坏人类和小鼠默认模式网络中的分层皮质传播","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2522000123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Psychedelic drugs are poised to become mainstream treatments, yet we lack a circuit-level account of how they reshape brain activity. Emerging evidence suggests that multiple psychedelic compounds modulate activity in the brain’s default mode network (DMN), often interpreted as either increased or decreased bottom–up hierarchical processing. Most imaging studies, however, quantify activity as if it were stationary, remaining agnostic to the ascending or descending movements of activity that defines hierarchical processing. Here, we adapt optical flow analyses to track frame-to-frame trajectories of DMN activity across four independent datasets (humans and mice; methylenedioxymethamphetamine, psilocybin, and lysergic acid diethylamide; nine drug-vs.-control contrasts). In functional magnetic resonance and calcium imaging, all psychedelics attenuate signal flow magnitude and bottom–up directionality within the DMN. Propagation attenuation is not attributable to data quality or previously documented effects of psychedelics and is uniquely associated with self-reported outcomes. This replicable and generalizable attenuation of bottom–up cortical propagations provides fundamental clarification of the effects of psychedelics on macroscale hierarchical processing."},{"t":"平衡磁振子轨道角动量的正确理论","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/fgt6-bhmq","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Junyu Tang and Ran ChengThe orbital motion of chargeless bosons, unlike that of electrons, does not generate a magnetic moment and thus cannot directly interact with magnetic fields. To formulate the orbital angular momentum (OAM) of magnons, we first identify its proper conjugate variable by considering the Aharonov-Cashe…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236702] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"ZSM-5沸石限域均匀Ag纳米颗粒促进末端炔烃CO2转化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1541233?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该研究开发了一种基于ZSM-5沸石限域策略的均匀催化剂体系，用于促进末端炔烃与CO2的羧化反应，实现C-C键的高效构建。CO2作为廉价且储量丰富的碳源，其化学转化是实现碳中和的关键路径之一。多相催化介导的炔烃羧化反应可合成高附加值羧酸化合物。沸石孔道的空间限域效应有效提升了催化活性位点的均匀性和产物选择性，为CO2资源化利用提供了新思路。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"沸石银催化CO2转化","kp":["[催化剂]: ZSM-5沸石限域均匀Ag纳米颗粒","[CO2转化]: 末端炔烃羧化生成不饱和多碳羧酸","[C-H键活化]: 直接C-H键活化构建C-C键"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Promoting CO2 Conversion With Terminal Alkynes Over ZSM‐5 Zeolite‐Confined Uniform Ag Nanoparticles","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Heterogeneous catalysis‐mediated terminal alkyne carboxylation enabled the construction of stable C─C bonds via direct C─H bond activation, achieving efficient conversion of CO\n                    2\n                    into unsaturated carboxylic multi‐carbon derivatives, and providing a new route for artificial carbon fixation and the synthesis of multifunctional chemicals. However, designing heterogenous catalysts with highly efficient, uniformed, stable active sites for this solid‐liquid‐gas three‐phase systems remained a significant challenge. Herein, we proposed a solvent‐assist hydrothermal method to synthesis 6–7 nm uniformed Ag nanoparticles in ZSM‐5 (Ag\n                    NP\n                    ‐ZSM5). Ag\n                    NP\n                    ‐ZSM5 exhibited a yield of 90% and a TOF of 306 h\n                    −1\n                    in 4 h alkynes carboxylation reaction. The excellent CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption capacity of ZSM‐5, together with the metal‐support interaction (MSI) between Ag nanoparticles and the ZSM‐5 support, jointly enhanced the intrinsic activity of the alkyne carboxylation reaction. This work not only proposed an innovative strategy for synthesizing uniform nanoparticles within zeolites, but also provided a new approach to facilitate the industrial application of terminal alkyne carboxylation."},{"t":"可编程 DNA 水凝胶，通过多价 LYTAC 模拟物和转录沉默实现双模式 PD-L1 抑制","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602147123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Immune checkpoint blockade has revolutionized oncology, yet low response rates and acquired resistance—often driven by inadequate Programmed death-ligand 1 (PD-L1) suppression—remain significant barriers. While degradation-based proteolysis-targeting chimeras offer a promising alternative to traditional antibodies, targeting the intracellular and transcriptional drivers of checkpoint expression remains a challenge. We report a programmable, tumor-responsive DNA hydrogel platform, synthesized via rolling circle amplification, designed for the comprehensive, dual-mode modulation of PD-L1. This modular nucleic acid framework codelivers polyvalent aptamer-based lysosome-targeting chimeras (LYTAC mimics) to induce extracellular PD-L1 degradation and siSMARCAL1 to silence the chromatin-remodeling-driven transcriptional activation of PD-L1. By integrating localized, sequential release within the tumor microenvironment, this system achieves a synergistic “degrade-and-silence” effect that effectively dismantles PD-1/PD-L1-mediated immunosuppression while concurrently triggering immunogenic cell death. In murine melanoma models, the hydrogel significantly suppressed primary tumor growth and prevented postoperative recurrence, eliciting a robust and durable systemic antitumor immune response. Our findings establish a versatile, DNA-based materials strategy for programmable protein degradation and multilevel checkpoint modulation, offering a generalizable approach for enhancing the efficacy of cancer immunotherapy.","tp":"抗癌水凝胶","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了一种可编程的肿瘤响应性DNA水凝胶平台，通过多价LYTAC模拟物实现细胞表面PD-L1降解，同时利用转录沉默机制抑制PD-L1的内源性表达。这种双模式协同抑制策略有望克服免疫检查点阻断疗法中应答率低和获得性耐药的瓶颈，为肿瘤免疫治疗提供新范式。"},{"t":"通过机械折纸编码联锁 3D Kirigami 和纳米根锚定 AgNWs-In-Ga 实现可编程 3D 光伏","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523685?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  3D photovoltaics (3DPVs) are highly promising for next‐generation energy systems, as they maximize space utilization and power output. However, most reported 3DPVs remain unsuitable for deformable applications. When 3DPVs are integrated with mechanically deformable platforms, a fundamental trade‐off emerges: achieving large mechanical stretchability typically leads to a reduction in areal coverage. Here, we present a single‐material, mechanically origami‐coded 3D kirigami platform that enables programmable 3DPVs with unprecedented stretchability and areal coverage. Origami, which transforms 2D geometries into 3D forms, provides an effective structural strategy to overcome the long‐standing trade‐off between stretchability and areal coverage. Leveraging this concept, we introduce an origami‐inspired mechanical coding scheme that embeds programmable folding behavior into the structure. A simple extension–release cycle drives unit folding initiation and full origami activation, achieving ultrahigh stretchability (500%) and initial effective areal coverage (225%), while maintaining stable photovoltaic output under extreme deformation and repeated cycling. To ensure reliable electrical integration, an intrinsically integrable nano‐root anchored AgNWs–In–Ga multiphasic alloy conductor was co‐fabricated with the structure, providing stable conductivity and enabling reversible stack‐and‐connect operation. This approach highlights geometric programmability as a key enabler for freeform photovoltaics, establishing a pathway toward multifunctional 3D energy systems for adaptive devices, and urban energy harvesting.","tp":"可编程光伏","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究提出一种单材料机械折纸编码的三维剪纸设计策略，结合纳米根锚定的银纳米线-铟-镓电极，实现了可编程三维光伏器件。该设计突破了传统三维光伏在大机械拉伸下面积覆盖率降低的根本性权衡，使其适用于可变形柔性能源应用场景。"},{"t":"预防癌症需要的不仅仅是一系列致癌物","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01847-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Letter to the Editor"},{"t":"退役LFP电池放电预处理中铜镀层的可解释轻量化预测与控制","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008275?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"退役电池铜沉积","as":"","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"ot":"Prediction and control of copper plating in retired LFP battery discharge pretreatment via an explainable, lightweight, "},{"t":"基于信号折叠的精准高效计算","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41928-026-01646-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"Nature Electronics","dp":1,"as":"研究提出一种硬件级信号折叠方案，可应用于一晶体管一电阻结构的二硫化钼阵列，实现高精度高效计算。该方案通过在硬件层面对信号进行折叠处理，有效扩展动态范围并降低功耗，在模拟计算架构中显著提升计算精度与能效，为边缘计算和类脑计算硬件提供了新的设计范式。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"信号折叠高效计算","kp":["[存内计算]: 信号折叠实现高权重精度和能效","[器件结构]: 1T1R二硫化钼阵列"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Precise and efficient computing via signal folding","b":"An in-hardware signal-folding scheme, which can be applied to one-transistor–one-resistor molybdenum disulfide arrays, can simultaneously achieve high weight precision and energy efficiency.","aip":1},{"t":"吲哚[2,3-c]咔唑桥连窄带MR-TADF发光体的精准多位点硼化工程","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8856021?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该研究通过精确的多位点硼化工程，设计合成吲哚[2,3-c]咔唑桥联的双硼多共振热激活延迟荧光（MR-TADF）材料，实现窄带发射。MR-TADF材料兼具高色纯度与高激子利用率，是OLED显示领域的关键发光材料。研究通过多位点硼化调控分子的电子结构与发光特性，有效提升发光效率和色彩纯度，为高端显示器件的材料设计提供新策略。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"窄带TADF发光材料","kp":["[MR-TADF发射体]: 吲哚[2,3-c]咔唑桥连双硼多共振TADF","[硼化工程]: 精确多位点硼化调控发射颜色","[发射特性]: 保持超窄带特性"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Precise Multi‐Site Borylation Engineering of Indolo[2,3‐c]Carbazole‐Bridged Narrowband MR‐TADF Emitters","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Indolocarbazole‐bridged double‐boron multi‐resonance thermally activated delayed fluorescence (MR‐TADF) materials enable precise modulation of emission colors while retaining ultra‐narrowband characteristics in organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs). Herein, we first introduce indolo[2,3‐c]carbazole (23cIC) into the design of MR‐TADF emitters and develop an electronically and sterically controlled multi‐site borylation strategy. This strategy affords the electronically favored exo‐configuration for Tbu‐exo, which exhibits narrowband green emission at 524 nm with a full‐width at half‐maximum (FWHM) of 20 nm, while yielding the steric hindrance‐guided endo‐configuration for Ad‐tph‐endo exhibiting by yellow emission at 566 nm with a FWHM of 25 nm. Notably, the endo‐configuration gives rise to (\n                    P\n                    /\n                    M\n                    )‐Ad‐tph‐endo, which exhibits significant chiral luminescence properties. Vacuum‐deposited OLEDs based on Tbu‐exo and Ad‐tph‐endo exhibit emission peaks at 530 nm (FWHM = 27 nm) and 568 nm (FWHM = 33 nm), respectively, both achieving external quantum efficiencies (EQE) exceeding 30%. Furthermore, we fabricated solution‐processed top‐emitting OLEDs based on Tbu‐exo for the first time, which realize ultra‐narrow pure‐green emission with CIE coordinates of (0.21, 0.75)—closely approaching the BT.2020 green standard—and a record‐high current efficiency of 200.9 cd A\n                    −1\n                    ."},{"t":"用于超导量子比特读出的Pound-Drever-Hall方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/ng1d-6gb8","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"as":"研究将Pound-Drever-Hall（PDH）频率锁定方法引入超导量子比特读取系统。大规模量子计算机扩展时，高保真度量子比特读取是核心挑战之一。PDH技术原用于精密光学腔频率锁定，本研究将其原理迁移至超导电路读取，通过反射信号相位调制提升读取信号的信噪比和保真度，为大规模量子计算系统的快速高精度量子态读取提供新方案。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"超导量子比特读取","kp":["[量子比特读出]: Pound-Drever-Hall多音自相位参考技术","[读出特点]: 超稳定，适用大规模并行读出"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Pound-Drever-Hall Method for Superconducting-Qubit Readout","b":"Author(s): Ibukunoluwa Adisa, Won Chan Lee, Kevin C. Cox, and Alicia J. KollárScaling quantum computers to large sizes requires the implementation of many parallel qubit readouts. Here we present an ultrastable superconducting-qubit readout method using the multitone self-phase-referenced Pound-Drever-Hall (PDH) technique, originally developed for use with optical cavities. I…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233601] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"翻译后异天冬氨酸促进 β2-微球蛋白中淀粉样蛋白的形成","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7045464?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    β\n                    2\n                    ‐Microglobulin (β2m) aggregation is central to dialysis‐related amyloidosis (DRA), yet the molecular triggers underlying its fibrillogenesis remain incompletely defined. Among proposed mechanisms, isoaspartate (isoAsp) formation at Asn residues has been implicated but never directly tested due to synthetic inaccessibility. Here, we report the total chemical synthesis of β2m variants containing isoAsp at known in vivo hotspots, Asn\n                    17\n                    and Asn\n                    42\n                    , enabling precise structural and functional interrogation. Remarkably, the isoAsp\n                    17\n                    ‐modified β2m exhibited greater fibril formation capacity than the pathogenic ΔN6‐β2m variant, suggesting a previously underappreciated contribution of isoAsp\n                    17\n                    . Structural characterization was complemented by spectroscopic and TEM analyses, which demonstrated that isoAsp\n                    17\n                    promotes fibril formation. Our findings provide the first direct experimental evidence that a spontaneous post‐translational modification can initiate amyloidogenesis in β2m, redefining the molecular basis of DRA and highlighting isoAsp as a general driver of pathological protein aggregation."},{"t":"正电化学势可增强热催化氢化中的化学选择性和活性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5569475?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Electrochemical promotion of catalysis is emerging as a powerful approach to control chemical reactions externally without complex catalyst modification, but this has mostly been used for substrates with a single reactive group so far. Herein, we demonstrate that this approach can induce full chemoselectivity in catalytic transformations of substrates with multiple functional groups. Specifically, we show that application of a positive electrochemical potential during the thermocatalytic hydrogenation (TCH) of 3‐nitrostyrene exclusively delivered one single product, 1‐ethyl‐3‐nitrobenzene, with six‐fold enhanced yield, while a complex product mixture was obtained at open circuit voltage. These effects resulted from the combined effects of a positive electrode polarization and acidification of the bulk solution through a concurrent hydrogen oxidation reaction (HOR). Surface‐enhanced infrared absorption spectroscopy and kinetic experiments showed that the positive polarization optimized the surface concentrations of reactants and the adsorption properties of 3‐nitrostyrene and hydrogenation products. Validation with additional reactants and catalyst implies a possible broader relevance of our findings beyond the initial system of 3‐nitrostyrene hydrogenation. Overall, our work provides fundamental insight into the effects of electrode polarization on thermal hydrogenation reactions and opens new opportunities to use electrochemical promotion to control chemoselectivity and activity.","tp":"电化学催化","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究将电化学催化促进策略拓展至多官能团底物的热催化氢化反应。通过在催化过程中施加正电化学电势，实现了对含多种反应活性基团底物的完全化学选择性控制，无需对催化剂本身进行复杂改性。这为精确调控复杂有机分子转化提供了简便的外部电场调控手段。"},{"t":"用于健康监测的聚合物基柔性无线传感器","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nmlett.org/index.php/nml/article/view/2544","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Nano-Micro Letters","as":"该综述聚焦聚合物基柔性无线传感器在健康监测领域的应用进展与挑战。柔性无线传感器可实现连续、无创的生理信号监测，在可穿戴医疗中前景广阔。文章系统分析了现有传感器在信号稳定性、生物相容性、无线传输能耗及数据精度等方面的不足，并讨论了材料创新、柔性电子集成及低功耗通信等解决路径，为下一代智能健康监测系统的设计提供参考。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性无线传感","kp":["[柔性传感器]: 聚合物基柔性无线健康监测传感器","[挑战]: 无线链路中信号衰减/噪声累积/数据失真"],"sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Polymer-Based Flexible Wireless Sensors for Health Monitoring","b":"Polymer-based flexible wireless sensors have demonstrated significant potential in health monitoring. However, existing studies have predominantly focused on material design, energy harvesting, and wireless communication, while research addressing signal attenuation, noise accumulation, and data distortion within wireless links remains relatively limited. Physiological signals are highly susceptible to multi-source interference during acquisition and transmission; without effective data processing and intelligent analysis strategies, monitoring outcomes may fail to meet the accuracy and stability requirements of clinical applications. To address this research gap, this review constructs a comprehensive framework encompassing signal sensing, link transmission, and intelligent processing, building on advances in flexible materials and wireless energy supply modes. Special attention is given to the critical roles of channel compensation, noise suppression, feature extraction, lightweight artificial intelligence models, and edge computing in enhancing data quality and reducing energy consumption. Furthermore, the review systematically analyzes the impact of wireless link stability and energy management on monitoring performance. By reinforcing the synergistic mechanisms between data processing and communication, this work aims to provide design principles and development directions for the next generation of high-reliability, low-power, and intelligent wireless flexible health monitoring systems. Highlights:1 A system-level review of polymer-based flexible wireless sensors for epidermal, subcutaneous, and short-term implantable health monitoring is presented, elucidating the coupling among materials, interfaces, and wireless links.2 Materials design and application studies are systematically integrated to clarify how different material systems influence sensing performance, signal stability, and monitoring reliability.3 Key challenges and future trends are summarized, with emphasis on mitigating material-level noise, high sensitivity, multifunctional integration, and clinical translation potential."},{"t":"极化子-极化子辅助热激活超辐射","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/hs3s-j4yp","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Yi-Ting Chuang and Liang-Yan HsuWe predict an anomalous thermally activated superradiance in molecular aggregates within polaritonic environments. In contrast to free space, the collective emission is enhanced when either the exciton-phonon coupling or the temperature increases. This counterintuitive phenomenon is captured by a mi…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 238001] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"聚苯乙烯在二氯甲烷中光裂解生成芳香族产物","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5578835?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"研究实现聚苯乙烯（PS）在二氯甲烷体系中的光催化裂解，生成高附加值芳香族化学品。塑料废弃物的化学回收是全球性环境挑战，PS作为主要塑料品种之一，其可控降解为芳香单体具有重要价值。该光催化路线在温和条件下选择性地断裂PS主链碳碳键，产物可回收用于化工原料，为塑料废弃物的高值化资源循环提供了可持续技术路径。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化聚苯乙烯降解","kp":["[光波长]: 365-415 nm","[聚苯乙烯降解]: 无需额外光催化剂，CH2Cl2中O2下光裂解","[产物]: C6-C8芳香族产物"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photocracking of Polystyrene into Aromatic Products in CH2Cl2","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photocatalytic cracking of polystyrene (PS) into valuable aromatic chemicals presents a key route to plastic waste upcycling under mild conditions, in which CH\n                    2\n                    Cl\n                    2\n                    is often used as an inert solvent. Represented herein is to report an unexpected cracking of PS to C6‐C8 aromatic products in CH\n                    2\n                    Cl\n                    2\n                    without any additional photocatalysts under an O\n                    2\n                    atmosphere and 365‐415 nm irradiation. Remarkably, this photocatalyst‐free system achieves a maximum generation rate of 15.9 µmol/h for C6‐C8 aromatic products, competitive with state‐of‐the‐art systems that rely on external photocatalysts. Radical scavenging experiments and EPR spectra reveal that chlorine (Cl•) radicals generated from CH\n                    2\n                    Cl\n                    2\n                    under irradiation contribute to the cleavage of C─H/C─C bonds in PS, leading to the formation of C6‐C8 aromatic products. Under aerobic conditions, these Cl• radicals also promote the transformation of PS into carbonylated intermediates as the light‐absorbing species with an absorption range of 300‐500 nm, thereby accelerating the activation of PS and derivatives. Importantly, this work identifies, for the first time, CH\n                    2\n                    Cl\n                    2\n                    as a vital photochemical reagent in PS conversion to value‐added aromatics even under visible light irradiation.","aip":1},{"t":"木质素光催化解聚与醇交叉偶联制备不对称芳香族二元醇","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2045478?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"研究开发一种光催化木质素解聚与醇交叉偶联的一步法反应，合成非对称芳香族化合物。传统木质素转化需分步进行解聚和官能团化，效率低且步骤繁琐。该研究将木质素C-O键断裂与醇类偶联反应在光催化条件下整合为单一步骤，直接生成结构多样的非对称芳香醚类，为木质素高值利用和绿色合成化学提供了高效策略。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化木质素降解","kp":["[木质素转化]: 一锅法光催化解聚与醇偶联","[产物]: 不对称芳香族二醇","[催化优势]: 解聚与升级合一，省去分步不同催化体系"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Photocatalytic Lignin Depolymerization and Cross‐Coupling With Alcohols to Produce Unsymmetric Aromatic Diols","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Conversion of lignin into chemical products typically involves two separate steps, such as depolymerization and subsequent upgrading of monomers, which often require different catalytic systems or varying reaction conditions. Notably, the direct one‐pot conversion of lignin into valuable compounds is crucial for advancing biomass utilization, aiming to streamline production by combining depolymerization and functionalization steps to maximize process‐, atom‐, and cost‐efficiency. Here we report the photocatalytic approach for synchronized depolymerization and C–C coupling processes for the direct conversion of lignin and its derivatives into aromatic diols using CdZnS (Cd\n                    0.3\n                    Zn\n                    0.7\n                    S) catalyst. By coupling hole‐driven radical generation with electron‐driven regeneration of overoxidized benzylic intermediates, this strategy overcomes the intrinsic preference for homocoupling and enables selective cross‐coupling between benzylic and aliphatic alcohol derivatives. This CdZnS‐based photocatalytic process enables simultaneous hydrogen transfer, hydrogenolysis and cross‐coupling of various lignin model compounds with alcohols to obtain unsymmetrical aromatic diols. In the case of real lignin, this depolymerization‐cross‐coupling protocol gives corresponding aromatic diols up to 10 wt% monomer yield. The resulting diol products are directly applicable to the synthesis of thermoplastic polyurethanes (TPUs) as well as fused polycyclic frameworks, functional materials, and bioactive molecules.","aip":1},{"t":"人们正在转向人工智能聊天机器人来填补健康信息的空白","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01737-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"A systematic assessment of health-related queries to a chatbot powered by artificial intelligence highlights shortfalls in health-care provision and the responsibilities of AI companies. A systematic assessment of health-related queries to a chatbot powered by artificial intelligence highlights shortfalls in health-care provision and the responsibilities of AI companies.","tp":"AI医疗咨询","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"一项系统性研究评估了用户向AI聊天机器人提出的健康相关查询，揭示了当前医疗保健供给中存在的显著信息空白。研究结果凸显了AI公司在健康信息提供方面的责任问题，反映出传统医疗体系在可及性和及时性方面的不足正驱使公众转向AI寻求健康指导。"},{"t":"催产素通过网络级抑制和θ耦合选择性地偏向感觉-前额叶交流","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603966123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Oxytocin modulates social information processing by altering excitatory-inhibitory balance at the microcircuit level, but how such local modulation gives rise to selective processing at the level of distributed brain systems remains unclear. Here, we investigated the effects of oxytocin on large-scale neurodynamics across cortico-limbic network in the mouse brain using multisite local field potential recordings. Oxytocin selectively enhanced neural responses to infant calls in the auditory cortex (AC) and medial prefrontal cortex (mPFC). These enhancements occurred while baseline activity was reduced, indicating increased signal-to-noise ratio rather than a global increase in excitability. During auditory steady-state responses (ASSRs), oxytocin increased prefrontal phase coherence without altering ASSR power. During rest, oxytocin induced a transient, broadband reduction in spontaneous spectral power across regions. Despite this reduction in activity, analyses of interregional interactions revealed a selective increase in low-theta phase coupling and directional connectivity of AC→mPFC. Session-level analyses showed that stronger bottom–up AC→mPFC coupling was associated with lower prefrontal power, consistent with a gating or disinhibitory network regime favoring sensory-to-prefrontal information transfer. Multivariate analyses showed that oxytocin/saline conditions were reliably discriminable using supervised classification models, with specific contributions from spectral power, phase-locking, and Granger-causal connectivity features. Conversely, unsupervised dimensionality reduction did not identify a distinct low-dimensional manifold separating conditions, although a modest shift in the centroid of neural state space was observed. Together, these results indicate that oxytocin reduces background neural activity while selectively enhancing sensory–prefrontal network interactions, providing a systems-level account linking local inhibitory modulation to selective processing of socially salient infant cues."},{"t":"通过三齿配位工程化溶剂化鞘层克服界面依赖的锂离子传输瓶颈","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71169?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"研究通过三齿配位工程化溶剂化壳层，克服锂金属电池中界面依赖的锂离子传输限制。凝胶聚合物电解质（GPE）因兼具高离子电导率和安全性，是先进锂金属电池的关键组件，但界面处锂离子传输阻力限制了电池性能。该研究设计三齿配体调控锂离子溶剂化结构，优化固液界面兼容性，显著提升锂负极循环稳定性，为高能量密度锂金属电池的实用化提供新策略。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"凝胶聚合物电解质","kp":["[凝胶聚合物电解质]: 三齿配体工程化溶剂化壳层","[Li+传输瓶颈]: 体相扩散-脱溶剂化-界面传输动态耦合限制","[配体策略]: 调控溶剂化壳层配位齿数"],"sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Overcoming Interphase‐Dependent Li+ Transport via Tridentate Coordination Engineered Solvation Sheath","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Gel polymer electrolytes (GPEs) are pivotal for advanced lithium metal batteries (LMBs) as they can combine high ionic conductivity and enhanced safety. However, their commercialization is hindered by an unresolved kinetic limiting step derived from the dynamic coupling among bulk diffusion, desolvation, and interphase transport. Here, a novel strategy is proposed to regulate the denticity of TFSI\n                    −\n                    coordination from monodentate to tridentate to decouple these processes. The intrinsic chemistry of the solid‐electrolyte interphase (SEI) rather than bulk ionic conductivity or desolvation energy is identified as the predominant factor governing cyclability. Crucially, the tridentate coordination strategically elevates the reductive priority of the normally stable TFSI\n                    −\n                    anions over the more labile solvents, thereby superseding the intrinsic tendency and ensuring the in situ formation of an inorganic‐rich SEI dominated by LiF and Li\n                    2\n                    O. This robust SEI underpins exceptional interfacial stability, enabling 92.7% of its original capacity after 720 cycles at 1 C in LiFePO\n                    4\n                    //Li cells. The generality of this approach is also validated in LiNi\n                    0.6\n                    Co\n                    0.2\n                    Mn\n                    0.2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ‐based cells, which achieve stable cycling over 270 cycles at 25°C and over 150 cycles at 60°C. The fundamental insight into the rate‐limiting interfacial coupling and the tridentate‐coordination strategy collectively establish a new paradigm for electrolyte design.","aip":1},{"t":"嵌入双异质结介电层的有机晶体管实现三模态自适应视觉感知","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73642?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","as":"研究开发一种嵌入介电层的双异质结有机晶体管，用于三模态自适应视觉系统。仿生视觉自适应是机器视觉在宽动态亮度范围内保持稳健感知的关键能力。该器件通过双异质结结构实现光感应、光适应和信号处理三重功能的原位集成，模拟生物视觉系统的自适应亮度调节机制，为低功耗、宽动态范围的仿生视觉传感器和智能成像系统提供新架构。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机晶体管视觉适应","kp":["[器件结构]: 双体异质结嵌入栅介质有机晶体管","[仿生视觉]: 三模态自适配(TM-OAAT)"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Organic Transistor with Dual‐Heterojunctions Embedded Dielectric for Trimodal Self‐Adaptation Vision","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Biomimetic visual adaptation is crucial for machine vision to sustain robust perception over a wide luminance range. However, most existing adaptive optoelectronic devices rely on the joint regulation of external bias voltage and incident light intensity. Here, we present a trimodal organic active adaptation transistor (TM‐OAAT) by integrating two bulk heterojunctions within the gate dielectric. This architecture enables synergistic modulation of photocapacitance enhancement and interfacial charge‐trapping suppression. As a result, the device autonomously switches between scotopic, mesopic, and photopic vision modes without external gate bias modulation, covering a wide luminance range from moonlight to sunlight (10\n                    −2\n                    –10\n                    6\n                     cd m\n                    −2\n                    ). Imaging experiments and simulations demonstrate that the device effectively restores image features across all three adaptation modes, achieving recognition accuracy exceeding 97%. By achieving trimodal self‐adaptation through illumination alone, this compact device provides a platform for low‐power, wide‐dynamic‐range bio‐inspired neuromorphic vision."},{"t":"未来的有机材料：人工智能的新前沿","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523667?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该综述探讨人工智能（AI）在有机材料发现中的变革性作用及未来前景。AI技术通过快速探索广阔化学空间，加速新型有机材料的设计、筛选与性能预测。文章综述了机器学习在有机半导体、功能聚合物、催化材料等领域的研究进展，分析了数据驱动方法的优势与局限（如数据质量、模型可解释性），展望了AI与实验化学深度协同的未来研究范式。","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI辅助材料发现","kp":["[材料发现]: AI加速有机半导体新材料探索","[机器学习]: 图神经网络等链接分子结构与性能"],"sc":3.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Organic Materials of Tomorrow: Horizons of Artificial Intelligence","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Artificial intelligence (AI) is transforming organic materials discovery by enabling the rapid exploration of chemical space. This review examines machine learning techniques being used to accelerate the identification of novel compounds for organic semiconductors through computational approaches linking molecular structure to properties. Key methodologies include graph neural networks, generative approaches, chemical representations, ‐learning frameworks, machine learning force fields, active learning, transfer learning, and generative models. These methods address fundamental challenges in organic materials discovery, from property prediction and inverse design to high‐throughput screening and molecular generation. An example of applications to the topic of organic photovoltaics demonstrates practical impact in predicting energy levels, morphology, charge transport, exciton dynamics, and power conversion efficiency. Rather than replacing human scientists, we envision AI as a tool that amplifies their capacity to explore unconventional regions of chemical space. Advantages, drawbacks and bottlenecks of AI use in chemistry are discussed together with future research directions, such as the adoption of human‐centered AI practices, the construction of materials‐science‐oriented benchmarking databases and protocols, the integration of green chemistry constraints into generative pipelines, and the further exploration of end‐to‐end in‐silico‐to‐technical validation workflows, all tailored to the needs of the materials science community."},{"t":"负载于原子级分散Mn-N-C上的有序Pt3Mn金属间化合物纳米颗粒用作燃料电池电催化剂","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7818348?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"研究合成有序Pt3Mn金属间化合物纳米颗粒负载于原子级分散的Mn-N-C载体上，作为高效电催化剂。相比无序固溶体合金纳米颗粒，Pt基金属间化合物具有有序原子排列和更强的d带中心调控能力，可显著提升电催化活性与稳定性。原子级分散的Mn-N-C载体进一步协同优化电子结构与传质，在燃料电池和电解水等能源转换器件中展现出优异性能。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"燃料电池铂锰催化剂","kp":["[电催化剂]: 有序Pt3Mn金属间化合物纳米颗粒","[载体]: 原子级分散Mn-N-C","[结构优势]: 长程周期性有序原子排列"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ordered Pt3Mn Intermetallic Nanoparticles Supported on Atomically Dispersed Mn–N–C as Electrocatalysts for Fuel Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Compared with conventional solid‐solution alloy nanoparticles with disordered atomic structures, platinum (Pt)‐based intermetallic compounds (IMCs) are recognized as highly promising electrocatalysts for practical fuel cell applications, on account of their long‐range periodically ordered atomic arrangements. Nevertheless, the rational development of Pt‐based catalysts featuring both high intrinsic activity and long‐term durability remains a key challenge in this field. In this work, by simultaneously introducing manganese (Mn) with low‐electronegativity into both the active component and the support, we report an efficient electrocatalyst toward the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR), composed of L1\n                    2\n                    ‐ordered Pt\n                    3\n                    Mn nanoparticles on Mn single‐atom nitrogen‐doped carbon support (L1\n                    2\n                    ‐Pt\n                    3\n                    Mn@Mn–N–C). The incorporation of Mn, the strong anchoring effect arising from the hierarchically porous structure of the support, and the directional interfacial electron transfer between L1\n                    2\n                    ‐Pt\n                    3\n                    Mn and Mn–N–C synergistically mitigate the adsorption strength of key oxygen intermediates and suppress the dissolution of surface Pt sites. Superior catalytic performance and durability are validated in proton exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFCs), achieving a peak power density of 1.15 W cm\n                    −2\n                    under H\n                    2\n                    /air conditions. After 30 000 square‐wave cycles, the voltage loss at 0.8 A cm\n                    −2\n                    is only 19 mV, ranking it among the top‐performing Pt‐based cathode catalysts reported to date.","aip":1},{"t":"OpenAI 秘密提交 IPO 文件，计划单独出售员工股份","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/openai-confidentially-files-ipo-paperwork-plans-separate-employee-share-sale","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","tg":"资本运作","b":"OpenAI Confidentially Files IPO Paperwork, Plans Separate Employee Share Sale — The Information\nRead this briefing for free","tp":"AI公司上市","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":2.0,"r":7.5,"d":1.5,"t":9.0},"as":"据报道，OpenAI已秘密向美国证券监管机构提交IPO上市申请文件，同时计划单独进行员工股份出售。此举标志着这家估值领先的AI公司在资本化进程中迈出关键一步，IPO的推进将为公司的算力基础设施投入和前沿模型研发提供更大规模的资金支持。"},{"t":"跨王国的一个目标：对保守铜泵的化学抑制","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2614646123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"海洋“冷斑”是令人不安的气候趋势的证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01826-9","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Weakening of a major ocean-current system is causing temperatures to drop in a patch of the Atlantic Ocean. Weakening of a major ocean-current system is causing temperatures to drop in a patch of the Atlantic Ocean."},{"t":"一维 Floquet 系统中五个不同定位阶段的观察","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6msd-mdw4","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Yao Qin, Chao Yang, Jiankun Zhu, Weitao Wu, Zhixin Duan, Rufang Zhao, Yuxiang Guo, Jizhou Wu, Sheng-Jun Yang, Yucheng Wang, and Jingyun FanExtended, localized, and critical states form the three elementary classes of eigenstates underlying Anderson localization. While phases involving extended and localized states are widely studied, experimental realization of critical phases, particularly those where critical states coexist with othe…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230401] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026"},{"t":"橡树用绝妙的春天伎俩智胜毛毛虫","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/oak-trees-outsmart-caterpillars-with-a-brilliant-spring-trick/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"In spring, forests usually burst to life right as insects hatch. Caterpillars, in particular, emerge when fresh leaves are young, soft, and packed with nutrients. This timing provides them with an immediate food supply and allows them to begin feeding right away.\nHowever, oak trees have developed a clever response when caterpillar populations surge. If they experience heavy infestations in one year, they adjust the timing of their growth the following spring. Instead of producing leaves on schedule, they delay leaf emergence by about three days.\nFor newly hatched caterpillars, this small shift has big consequences. They emerge expecting a feast, only to find that the leaves they depend on are still sealed inside buds. With no food available, many fail to survive.\nThis brief delay proves remarkably effective. By pushing back leaf growth just a few days, oak trees significantly reduce caterpillar survival rates. At the same time, the damage caused by feeding insects drops by about 55 percent.\nThese findings come from an international research team and were published in the journal\nNature Ecology & Evolution\n“The delaying tactic is more effective for the oak than a chemical defense, such as bitter tannins in the leaves,” says Dr. Soumen Mallick, a postdoc at the University of Würzburg’s Biocentre and lead author of the study. This is because the tree would have to expend a great deal of energy to increase tannin production.\n“This discovery fundamentally changes our previous understanding of the onset of spring in the forest,” says the Würzburg researcher. It shows that trees do not merely react passively to the weather in timing their leaf emergence but also respond flexibly to biological threats.\nTo uncover this behavior, researchers combined ecological field knowledge with advanced remote sensing technology.\nIn the past, studying tree responses required time-consuming observations of individual trees. In this case, scientists monitored a vast 2,400-square-kilometer region in Northern Bavaria using Sentinel-1 satellite data. These radar satellites can detect detailed changes in forest canopies even through thick cloud cover.\nThe team analyzed 137,500 observations collected over five years, from 2017 to 2021. Each data point represented a 10×10 meter area, roughly the size of a single tree crown. In total, 27,500 such pixels were examined across 60 forest sites.\nThe year 2019 provided especially valuable insights due to a major gypsy moth outbreak in the region. “The radar sensors recorded exactly which trees were stripped bare and how they reacted in the following year,” says Professor Jörg Müller, University of Würzburg (Germany) Chair of Conservation Biology and Forest Ecology and co-senior author of the study.\nThe research helps explain a long-standing mystery. In some years, forests do not turn green as quickly as rising temperatures would suggest. This study shows that insect pressure can delay leaf emergence, not just weather conditions.\nThis insight is important for conservation and modeling. Many existing computer models focus mainly on temperature and other non-living factors, while overlooking interactions between plants and insects. As a result, they may misjudge how forests actually behave.\nTrees are caught in a balancing act. Climate change is pushing them to leaf out earlier, while insect threats encourage them to hold back. This creates an ongoing evolutionary tug-of-war.\nOne advantage of delaying leaf growth is that it is temporary and flexible. Trees only shift their timing after experiencing real infestations, which prevents insects from adapting permanently to the strategy.\n“This dynamic interplay is an example of the forest’s high resilience and adaptability in a changing world,” says Professor Andreas Prinzing, University of Rennes (France), the other co-senior author of the study. Future experiments are intended to help understand these mechanisms even more precisely.\nReference: “Satellite data show trees delay budburst across landscapes to escape herbivores” by Soumen Mallick, Jens Lichter, Soyeon Bae, Thomas Kneib, Freerk Molleman, Benjamin M. L. Leroy, Torben Hilmers, Maike Huszarik, Andrew M. Liebhold, Wolfgang W. Weisser, Johannes A. Jehle, Jörg Müller and Andreas Prinzing, 1 May 2026,\nNature Ecology & Evolution\nDOI: 10.1038/s41559-026-03071-9\nIn addition to researchers from the University of Würzburg, scientists from the following institutions were involved in this study:\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nPlant Science\nUniversity of Würzburg\nScientists Debunk the Myth: Do Trees Really Have Feelings?\nScientists Shed New Light on Triphyophyllum peltatum – A Unique Plant With a Deadly Appetite\nThe Secret Life of Honeybees: How Forest Ecosystems Are Impacting Their Survival\nLife Mystery Solved: What Determines the Lifespan of a Tree Leaf?\nDNA Hoarders: Genetic Duplication Linked to the Origin and Evolution of Pine Trees and Their Relatives\nSpecial Genes Behind the Pressure Sensor of the Venus Flytrap\nLarger Trees More Likely to Die From Drought in the Amazon – Small Trees Offer Hope for Rainforests\nScientists Find Genes to Save Ash Trees From Deadly Beetle That Is Expected to Kill Billions of Trees Worldwide\nIntriguing Genetics That Flipped the Food Chain to Allow Carnivorous Plants to Hunt Animals"},{"t":"核聚变公司声称电站将向电网输电，但重大问题仍存","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01795-z","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"聚变并网","kp":["[聚变装置]: CFS ARC聚变电站","[当前状态]: 设计论文已发表","[宣称目标]: 向电网供电(存疑)"],"sc":8.3,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.5,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.5},"aip":1,"as":"Commonwealth Fusion Systems（CFS）发表多篇论文详细阐述其ARC聚变电站设计方案，声称将向电网输送电力，但重大问题仍存。CFS基于高温超导磁体紧凑托卡马克路线，ARC设计利用SPARC实验验证的技术基础。然而，从工程验证到持续净能量输出和商业化发电仍面临氚增殖、材料辐照、等离子体稳定性等核心挑战，2030年代初并网的承诺面临合理质疑。","ot":"Nuclear-fusion firm says plant will deliver electricity to grid – but big questions remain","b":"Commonwealth Fusion Systems published several papers detailing the design of its ARC fusion power plant. Commonwealth Fusion Systems published several papers detailing the design of its ARC fusion power plant."},{"t":"使用物理信息机器学习方法预测核 $β$ 衰变半衰期","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/klkv-vk36","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): W. F. Li (李伟峰), T. Sun (孙婷), Z. M. Niu (牛中明), and H. Z. Liang (梁豪兆)Nuclear $β$-decay half-lives are investigated by the neural network approach combined with a physically motivated $β$-decay half-life formula. This physics-information machine learning approach achieves better agreement with experimental half-lives than the sophisticated microscopic nuclear models a…[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064310] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"Taub-Newman-Unti-Tamburino 瞬子的 Newman-Janis 算法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/g6nl-1fbn","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Joon-Hwi KimIt is shown that the Kerr metric represents the nonlinear superposition of self-dual and anti-self-dual Taub-Newman-Unti-Tamburino (NUT) instantons. This promotes the Newman-Janis algorithm to a rigorous derivation of the Kerr metric with a definite physical origin. In the same way, the Kerr-Newman …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231401] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"$^{149}\\mathrm{La}$ 中的新基态消除了镧同位素中的二中子分离能量异常","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/gvxl-vxd4","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): S. Kimura, M. Wada, H. Haba, Y. Hirayama, H. Ishiyama, Y. Ito, T. Niwase, M. Rosenbusch, P. Schury, H. Ueno, Y. X. Watanabe, and Y. YamanouchiNuclear mass is a key indicator of how the nuclear shell structure evolves. The recent mass measurement study of neutron-rich lanthanum isotopes [Jaries et al., Phys. Rev. Lett. 134, 042501 (2025)] reveals the presence of a distinct prominence in their two-neutron separation energies. However, its p…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 232501] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"神经网络驱动的实时等离子体成像助力微纳结构超快逆向设计制造","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73601?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"激光加工监测","kp":["[应用]: 超快激光微纳结构加工","[方法]: 神经网络实时等离子体成像+逆向设计"],"as":"本研究将神经网络引入高精度微纳结构制造中的等离子体实时成像与逆向设计流程。半导体纳米加工(如等离子体刻蚀、沉积)依赖对工艺腔体内等离子体状态的实时监测,传统诊断手段速度慢、通量低。作者利用深度学习实现等离子体发光/干涉图像的实时重建与参数反演,使制造系统能够根据逆向设计计算结果动态调整工艺条件,提升纳米结构的成品率与一致性,推动智能制造与闭环工艺控制。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Neural Network Enabled Real‐Time Plasma Imaging for Inverse Designed Fabrication of Micro/Nano Structures with Ultrafast","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Real‐time monitoring is essential for quality control in highprecision micro/nano structure fabrication with ultrafast laser. The laser‐induced plasma plume blocks the sample surface, preventing direct imaging of micro/nano structures during processing. This work proposes a neural networkenabled real‐time plasma imaging strategy and inverse design micro/nano fabrication method. The neural networks contain a conditional generative adversarial network (cGAN) for real‐time imaging and a multilayer perceptron (MLP) for inverse‐designed fabrication. Based on the fabrication of coffee‐ring feature structures, the cGAN generates high‐fidelity feature structure images from plasma intensity profiles, with a real‐time imaging latency of 1691 milliseconds. To validate the real‐time imaging strategy, dual‐pulse processing and sequential single‐pulse processing experiments are conducted across different materials. The MLP model establishes nonlinear relationships between laser parameters and feature structure size for inverse‐designed fabrication. Both forward prediction and inverse design results achieved a coefficient of determination (R\n                    2\n                    ) of 0.97, and the actual fabrication results align with the target values. This work provides a neural networkenabled strategy for real‐time process monitoring, advancing the development of intelligent laser fabrication."},{"t":"具有宽带频率可调性的纳米尺度相干声子","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/hdd2-t4m4","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米相干声子","kp":["[探针技术]: 纳米尺度相干声子探针","[特性]: 宽带频率可调","[应用]: 探测功能材料光电热力性质"],"as":"研究团队在纳米尺度实现了具有宽带频率可调性的相干声子激发与操控。相干声子是晶格振动量子(声子)的宏观相干态,在超快光学、声光器件与量子信息处理中有重要应用。以往相干声子激发多局限于特定窄带共振频率。作者通过纳米结构设计(可能涉及超表面或低维材料)拓展了声子频率的连续可调范围,为宽带可调谐声子激光、高频声学器件及光-声量子界面提供了新的实验平台。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Nanoscale Coherent Phonons with Broadband Frequency Tunability","b":"Author(s): Zhengpu Zhao (赵正朴), Da Wu (吴达), Chuwei Zhang (张楚惟), Duanyun Cao (曹端云), Haotian Zheng (郑浩天), Yuqing Huang (黄玉清), Qin Wang (王钦), En-Ge Wang (王恩哥), Chaoyu Guo (郭钞宇), and Ying Jiang (江颖)Broadband-tunable coherent phonon tips probe functional materials at nanoscale to investigate a variety of optical, electronic, thermodynamic, and mechanical properties.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236201] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"我的海外工作机会被取消了。这是我如何反弹的","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01234-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Andrew Kythreotis re-evaluated his personal and professional priorities after a mid-career opportunity to move abroad fell through. Andrew Kythreotis re-evaluated his personal and professional priorities after a mid-career opportunity to move abroad fell through."},{"t":"高温质子交换膜燃料电池的多尺度正极设计","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D6CS00242K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"高温燃料电池阴极","kp":["[器件]: 高温质子交换膜燃料电池","[关键限制]: 磷酸掺杂膜体系"],"dp":1,"as":"本研究提出了一种面向高温质子交换膜燃料电池（HT-PEMFC）的多尺度正极设计策略。HT-PEMFC作为高效能源转换器件，工作温度较高，具有燃料灵活性强、余热利用率高等优势。研究通过多尺度结构调控优化正极催化剂层传质与电化学反应动力学，旨在提升电池在高温条件下的性能与耐久性，为燃料电池商业化提供工程化路径。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Multiscale cathode design for high-temperature proton exchange membrane fuel cells","b":"High temperature proton exchange membrane fuel cells (HT-PEMFCs) are highly promising energy conversion devices featuring the benefits of their superior reaction kinetics, simplified water and thermal management systems, tolerance to CO-containing reactant gases, and being compatible with hydrogen production via industrial fuel reforming processes. However, due to the phosphoric acid (PA)-doped membranes being the primary proton exchange membranes (PEMs) used in HT-PEMFCs, the PA leaching from the membrane during the operation degrades platinum (Pt)-based oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) catalysts and the cathode catalyst layer, causing insufficient performance of HT-PEMFCs, which hinders their application. Although extensive research has been conducted to enhance the activity and durability of HT-PEMFCs, there remains a significant gap toward practical implementation, which stems from incomplete fundamental understanding of atomic-scale catalysts, reaction interfacial kinetics, and catalyst layer structure engineering. To fill the aforementioned research gap, this review summarizes recent developments in cathode catalysts, catalytic interface, and catalyst layers from a multiscale view of HT-PEMFCs. Beginning with the fundamental principles, the theoretical insights into PA-induced catalyst poisoning and catalyst layer degradation are first provided. Innovative design in ORR catalysts and catalytic interfaces with enhanced PA resistance and reaction kinetics is then presented. Additionally, approaches to optimizing the cathode catalyst layer are discussed from a practical application perspective. Finally, an outlook on the remaining challenges and prospects in this field is provided, aiming to facilitate the advancement of HT-PEMFCs."},{"t":"分子级界面接触有机异质结的多尺度活性位点调控实现高效光催化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71172?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机光催化制氢","kp":["[合成方法]: 冰模板辅助光化学还原","[界面接触]: 分子级异质结界面"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦利用有机光催化剂实现太阳能分解水产氢的绿色制氢技术。通过在有机异质结中进行分子级活性位点调控，实现了多尺度电荷分离与传输优化，显著提升了光催化析氢效率。这一策略有望推动有机光催化体系从实验室走向商业化，解决其量子效率低、稳定性不足等关键瓶颈。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Multiscale Active Site Modulation in Organic Heterojunction with Molecular‐Level Interfacial Contact for Efficient Photo","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The commercialization of green hydrogen production through organic photocatalyst‐promoted solar water splitting for hydrogen evolution is limited by inefficient charge separation and sluggish interfacial kinetics. Herein, this problem is addressed using an ice template–assisted photochemical reduction strategy that integrates molecular‐level interfacial contact between a trefoil‐shaped donor–acceptor molecule (DTAB) and ultrathin carbon nitride nanosheets (UCNS) with Cu single atoms (SAs) anchoring and Pt nanodots (NDs) deposition. The intimate interface in the resulting DTAB–UCNS/CuPt photocatalyst generates a built‐in electric field promoting the separation of photogenerated carriers. The DTAB harvests visible light and injects electrons into UCNS, with these electrons subsequently funneled to Pt NDs via Cu SAs. The electronic coupling between Cu SAs and Pt NDs affects the position of the Pt\n                    d\n                    ‐band, thus optimizing the H* adsorption/desorption equilibrium and enhancing surface reaction kinetics. The hydrogen evolution rate of DTAB–UCNS/CuPt (261.16 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) is 248.7 times higher than that of UCNS/Pt (1.05 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) and ranks among the highest reported for carbon nitride–based photocatalysts under comparable conditions, highlighting the strong potential of our strategy to advance photocatalytic hydrogen evolution toward practical green hydrogen production."},{"t":"动量分辨二维光谱作为非线性量子场动力学的探针","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/tfdm-qshs","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Duilio De Santis, Alex Gómez-Salvador, Nataliia Bazhan, Sebastian Erne, Maximilian Prüfer, Claudio Guarcello, Davide Valenti, Jörg Schmiedmayer, and Eugene DemlerEmergent collective excitations constitute a hallmark of interacting quantum many-body systems, yet in solid-state platforms their study has been largely limited by the constraints of linear-response probes and by finite momentum resolution. We propose to overcome these limitations by combining the …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233401] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"量子场光谱","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.5,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究提出利用动量分辨二维光谱技术探测非线性量子场动力学，以突破固体平台中线性响应探针和有限动量分辨率对集体激发研究的限制。该方法可用于研究相互作用量子多体系统中涌现的集体激发行为，为超冷原子等量子模拟平台提供新的表征工具。"},{"t":"分子N型掺杂使微腔集成OLED实现低阈值纳秒级激光，迈向电泵浦","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5388345?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电泵浦OLED激光","kp":["[掺杂策略]: N型分子掺杂","激光脉宽[微腔OLED]: 纳秒级低阈值","[目标]: 电泵浦有机激光器"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究利用分子N型掺杂技术，在微腔有机半导体激光器中实现了低阈值纳秒级激射。有机半导体因其柔性、波长可调等优势被视为激光材料的重要候选，但长期以来受限于高激射阈值和低效率问题。N型掺杂策略有效提升了载流子注入与电荷传输平衡，为有机激光器的实用化迈出关键一步。","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Molecular N‐Type Doping Unlocks Low‐Threshold Nanosecond Lasing in a Microcavity‐Integrated OLED Toward Electrically Pum","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic semiconductors are attractive for the development of flexible, wavelength‐tunable lasers. However, most reported organic micro/nanolasers rely on femtosecond‐pulsed optical pumping, which is impractical for real‐world applications. This limitation has urged the pursuit of electrically pumped organic lasers; yet their realization remains a long‐standing challenge primarily due to a fundamental materials dilemma, in which high‐gain organic semiconductors often suffer from poor, unbalanced charge transport. Here, we demonstrate that this intrinsic trade‐off can be effectively alleviated through a molecular doping strategy. Employing a high‐gain spirofluorene derivative as the emissive layer, we introduce an n‐type doped layer to construct an organic light‐emitting diode (OLED), achieving more balanced charge transport while preserving outstanding optical gain. Consequently, singlet‐polaron annihilation is significantly suppressed, as evidenced by reduced efficiency roll‐off and electrically pumped transient absorption measurements. When integrated with a distributed feedback (DFB) resonator, the resulting device exhibits ultra‐narrow (∼2 nm) electroluminescence under pulsed current injections and delivers low‐threshold nanosecond lasing under an optical–electrical co‐pumping configuration, thereby demonstrating a practical architecture for implementing organic laser diodes. Our work provides a general strategy to overcome the intrinsic paradox where high‐gain organic semiconductors struggle to maintain balanced charge transport, illuminating a pathway toward light amplification under electrical excitation."},{"t":"调控NiV层状双氢氧化物微球中的Ni-O-V桥实现高效电催化偶联1,5-戊二醇","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5292155?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物质电催化氧化","kp":["[催化剂]: NiV层状双氢氧化物微球","[活性位点]: Ni-O-V桥结构","[耦合反应]: 戊二醇氧化+硝酸盐还原"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出一种耦合阳极生物质衍生多元醇氧化与阴极硝酸根还原的共电解体系，通过调控NiV层状双氢氧化物微球中Ni-O-V桥键结构，提升电催化活性与稳定性。Ni-O-V界面桥键的精细调控优化了电子转移与活性位点分布，为高效电催化系统提供了新设计思路，在储能与环境修复交叉领域具有应用潜力。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Modulating Ni‐O‐V Bridges in NiV‐Layered Double Hydroxides Microspheres for Robust Electrocatalytic Coupling of 1,5‐Pent","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The co‐electrolysis system that couples anodic oxidation of biomass‐derived polyols with cathodic nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    RR) represents a promising strategy for biomass valorization and treatment of high‐salinity wastewater. Here, we synthesize thin NiV‐layered double hydroxides (NiV‐LDHs) microspheres featuring engineered Ni‐O‐V bridge structures as dual‐channel electrocatalysts. The newly constructed Ni‐O‐V bridges confirmed by x‐ray absorption spectroscopy effectively modulate the electronic structures of both Ni and V sites. This synergistic enhancement boosts the performance of both anodic 1,5‐pentanediol electrooxidation to produce glutaric acid (GA) and NO\n                    3\n                    RR to ammonia. The NiV‐LDHs anode enables electrolysis at a low cell voltage of 1.5 V versus RHE, exhibiting a GA Faradaic efficiency of 98.5% and a high GA yield of 2.56 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    . Operando studies and density functional theory reveal that the strong electronic coupling within NiV‐LDHs optimizes the competitive adsorption between 1,5‐pentanediol and OH* on the catalyst surface. Moreover, the NiV‐LDHs cathode exhibits outstanding NO\n                    3\n                    RR performance, achieving a high ammonia yield of 2.28 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    with a Faradaic efficiency of 96.1%, surpassing most reported electrocatalysts. A continuous paired electrolysis operation over 240 h successfully produced GA (55.98 g) and NH\n                    4\n                    Cl (23.48 g) powders, demonstrating great potential for industrial application."},{"t":"通过电极涂层调控界面离子通量实现高效酸性CO₂电解","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01796G","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酸性CO2电解","kp":["[策略]: 电极涂层调控界面离子通量","[应用]: 酸性CO2电解抑制析氢"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究通过电极涂层调控界面离子通量，实现高效酸性CO2电解，提升CO2单次转化率为燃料和高值化学品。酸性CO2电解因腐蚀环境苛刻长期面临效率瓶颈，界面离子通量调控策略为解决催化剂失活和产物选择性不足等问题提供了新路径，对CO2资源化利用与碳中和目标具有重要意义。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Modulating Interfacial Ion Flux via Electrode Coatings Enables Efficient Acidic CO₂ Electrolysis","b":"Acidic CO2 electrolysis offers great potential for high-efficiency single-pass CO2 conversion to valuable fuels and chemicals, yet is challenged by the kinetically favorable hydrogen evolution reaction. Electrode coatings can engineer a favorable electrode-electrolyte interface by regulating interfacial ion flux to steer the reaction pathway toward CO2 electroreduction; however, rational design rules for such coatings remain elusive. Here, we decouple the roles of binders and inorganic fillers in the coatings and demonstrate that coupling a cation-exchange ionomer (CEI) with a proton-blocking oxide yields a durable coating that enables efficient acidic CO2 electrolysis. Combined experimental and simulation results reveal that this optimal formulation promotes inward K+ transport while restricting H+ influx and outward OH- transport, thereby establishing a K+-enriched and alkaline interfacial microenvironment that enhances CO2/CO adsorption and lowers *CO dimerization barrier. As a representative demonstration, an Al2O3/CEI-coated Cu electrode achieves a maximum Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 81.3% for multi-carbon (C2+) products at 600 mA cm-2 and remarkably durable operation for 200 h at 200 mA cm-2. Furthermore, this proposed electrode coating strategy demonstrates the broad generality in engineering interfacial microenvironments across distinct catalyst platforms.","aip":1},{"t":"三菱新款电动车亮相，外观似曾相识[图]","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/09/mitsubishis-new-ev-breaks-cover-looks-familiar-images/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动Sportback","as":"三菱宣布Eclipse车型即将电动化，并在日产的技术支持下推出全新纯电版本。该车型外观设计与现有产品存在相似之处，引发市场关注。此举标志着三菱加速电动化转型，借助联盟伙伴日产的平台与技术资源，在竞争激烈的电动SUV市场中寻求突破。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":4.5,"t":9.0},"ot":"Mitsubishi's new EV breaks cover, and it looks a bit familiar [Images]","b":"Peter Johnson\n| Jun 9 2026 - 7:18 am PT\nThe Mitsubishi Eclipse is finally going electric with a little help from Nissan. Set to go on sale in the next few weeks,\ni unveiled the new Eclipse Sportback EV for the first time.\nAlthough its design has evolved over the years,\nhas been a staple in Mitsubishi’s lineup since it first went on sale in North America in 1990.\nThat’s because the new EV is based on the new Nissan LEAF as part of the Japanese automaker’s alliance.\nWhile it will use the same underpinnings as the third-generation LEAF (\nsee our review\n), and looks like a near-replica, Mitsubishi promises the electric Eclipse will feature the brand’s unique style to differentiate it. It’s a similar alliance to the\nToyota-Subaru\npartnership.\nYou can see in the images that the Eclipse EV has a slightly different front- and rear-end design, as well as Mitsubishi’s logo and Triple Diamond branding.\nOutside of that, it’s basically the new Nissan LEAF in disguise. Mitsubishi will reveal prices and specs closer to launch, but we expect the new EV will be available with the same 75 kWh battery and 174 hp front-mounted electric motor as the LEAF, which provides an EPA-estimated range of up to 303 miles.\nLike the new Nissan LEAF (shown above), the Mitsubishi Eclipse Sportback EV will also likely feature a native NACS charge port.\nthe 2026 LEAF\nstarts at just under $30,000, Mitsubishi’s new EV will likely be priced similarly, making it one of the most affordable EVs in the US, alongside the new Chevy Bolt.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nPeter Johnson is covering the auto industry’s step-by-step transformation to electric vehicles. He is an experienced investor, financial writer, and EV enthusiast. His enthusiasm for electric vehicles, primarily Tesla, is a significant reason he pursued a career in investments. If he isn’t telling you about his latest 10K findings, you can find him enjoying the outdoors or exercising"},{"t":"民兵、博科圣地、土匪活动和基础设施爆发：对尼日利亚能源系统的影响","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003514?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"梅赛德斯F1电动卡车：欧洲低碳排放物流运输","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/mercedes-f1s-ev-trucks-low-emission-logistics-in-europe","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动重卡物流","as":"梅赛德斯-AMG马石油F1车队在欧洲部署电动卡车，用于赛车物流运输，以降低车队运营碳排放。电动重卡的引入体现了F1赛事向可持续运营转型的趋势，也展示了电动商用车辆在长途重载物流场景中的实际应用能力，对欧洲低排放物流体系具有示范意义。","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.5},"ot":"Mercedes F1’s EV Trucks: Low Emission Logistics in Europe","b":"Mercedes F1’s EV Trucks: Low Emission Logistics in Europe\nPrioritise Us\nMercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team deploys electric eActros 600 truck across all nine European races in 2026, advancing sustainable logistics in motorsport\nMercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team\nhas deployed a Mercedes-Benz Trucks eActros 600 for the 2026 Formula One European season.\nThe electric truck will operate across all nine European races, starting with the Monaco Grand Prix last weekend.\nThe deployment represents an expansion of\nthe team's logistics\nfleet, which already includes HVO100-powered race and marketing trucks.\nThe eActros 600 will transport race trailers alongside existing vehicles.\nThe electric truck could cover around 15,000 km over three months, according to Mercedes.\nThe route spans from Monaco through to Madrid in mid-September, concluding the European leg of the 2026 season.\ncompleted a pilot programme during the 2025 season, including an initial run at the British Grand Prix.\nAfter the 2025 season, W16 race cars were transported from Brackley to Zandvoort for the Dutch Grand Prix using electric power.\nThe full deployment across nine races follows successful trial journeys.\nThe first journey from Brackley to Monaco covered more than 1,600 km.\nAlice Ashpitel, Head of Sustainability at\nMercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team\n, says: \"We are realising our ambition of deploying the Mercedes-Benz Trucks eActros 600 across all nine European races, demonstrating our commitment to accelerating decarbonisation in some of the hardest-to-abate areas of our operations.\"\n\"As a team, we are committed to engineering change on and off the track and it's exciting to see how quickly we have moved from pilot journeys to a full rollout,\" Alice says.\nThe eActros 600 transports operational infrastructure including communications offices, doctor rooms and physio rooms.\nLogistics represents one of the more complex areas for carbon reduction in Formula One operations due to the global nature of the sport.\nAccording to\nMercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team\n, expanding electric vehicle use increases its portfolio of lower emission alternatives to conventional diesel.\nThe initiative forms part of a broader sustainable logistics programme that includes HVO100 biofuel deployment supported by PETRONAS.\nThe team achieved 99% coverage of HVO100 across races and marketing trucks for the European season in 2025. This saved more than 410 tonnes of CO₂-equivalent, according to Mercedes.\nLow emission vehicles could support the team's Scope 3 emissions reduction efforts. Mercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team aims to achieve Race Team Control Net Zero by 2030.\nAsh Armstrong, eConsultancy Manager at Daimler Truck UK, says: \"We are proud to be pushing the boundaries of what's possible in Formula One logistics once again.\"\n\"With the eActros 600 supporting the Mercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team at all nine European races this season, this project is a powerful demonstration that long-haul electric transport is not a future ambition, it's a reality today,\" Ash says.\n\"Building on the success of last year's programme, this collaboration showcases both the capabilities of the eActros 600 and the rapid evolution of Europe's charging infrastructure,\" Ash says.\n\"It's further evidence of how Mercedes-Benz Trucks is helping to redefine sustainable transport, not only in the demanding world of Formula One but across the logistics industry as a whole,\" Ash says.\nMercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team has embedded sustainability measures across its global supply chain through emissions reduction, carbon removal investments and supplier engagement.\nThe team has expanded its portfolio of carbon removal projects across multiple countries and technologies to address residual emissions.\nScope 3 emissions originate throughout the supply chain and often represent the largest share of an organisation's carbon footprint.\nMercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team has introduced supplier sustainability events, a strengthened Supplier Code of Conduct and supply chain risk screening tools.\nThese initiatives could encourage environmental accountability among partners.\nCombined with sustainable fuels, low-carbon logistics solutions and collaboration with industry stakeholders, the approach addresses emissions throughout the value chain.\n\"We are dedicated to creating a legacy of positive change, aiming to influence others within and outside of our sport,\" Mercedes-AMG PETRONAS F1 Team says.\nHead of Sustainability\neConsultancy Manager"},{"t":"电动飞机牵引车减少80%地面排放","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/09/meet-the-electric-aircraft-tug-thats-cutting-ground-emissions-by-80/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航空","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动飞机牵引车","kp":["[减排效果]: 机场地面排放减少超80%","[电动拖车]: 可移动飞机并为辅助系统供电"],"as":"阿姆斯特丹史基浦机场正在测试一款电动飞机牵引车，可在地面移动飞机，据称能将地面运营排放减少80%。传统飞机牵引依赖柴油拖车，碳排放和噪音污染显著；电动牵引车以电池驱动，零尾气排放，大幅降低机场地面作业的碳足迹。该技术属于机场地面电气化趋势的一部分，对航空业脱碳具有即时工程价值——无需改造飞机本身即可在地面滑行阶段消除燃油消耗，被视为短期内最具落地可行性的航空减碳方案之一。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"ot":"Meet the electric aircraft tug that's cutting ground emissions by 80%","b":"| Jun 9 2026 - 4:39 am PT\nAmsterdam’s Schiphol Airport is testing an electric aircraft tug that can both move the plane around the tarmac\npower its auxiliary systems – and that second bit could slash ground-level airport emissions by more than 80%, saving gobs of money on fuel in the process.\nConventional airport operations occasionally use diesel-powered tugs that can connect to the front landing gear and pull the aircraft around the airport. The whole time that’s happening, however, an auxiliary power unit (APU)\nin the plane’s tail is fired up\n, generating electrical power for the aircraft and providing enough compressed air to light the main engines. The alternative is to use the main engines at a low idle to taxi the plane. In either case, that’s a lot of fuel burned, emissions spewed, and noise made for the people living and working near the aircraft to deal with – and precisely what the TaxiBot was developed to address.\n“By deploying the TaxiBot, we’re taking another practical step towards reduced emissions and noise on the apron,” explains Esmé Valk, Chief of People & Transformation at Royal Schiphol Group. “This is how we’re creating a healthier and cleaner workplace, and an ever more sustainable and modern airport that is ready for the future.”\nCo-developed by Smart Airport Systems (SAS) in cooperation with TLD and Israel Aerospace Industries (IAI), the TaxiBot is an all-electric, pilot-controlled aircraft tug designed to allow pilots to taxi to the runway without running the APU or main engines, powering the aircraft instead with the tug’s onboard traction battery.\nThe end result is a positive experience for the pilots,\nwho get to maintain control of the aircraft on the ground as they jockey for position on the tarmac\n, a positive experience for any passenger who’s ever had to listen to that APU whine on for minutes (or, if you’re terribly unlucky, hours) on end,\nand a positive experience for the ground crew who don’t have to breathe in harmful exhaust gasses\nA rare win-win-win-and, with the added benefits of reduced fuel costs, maintenance needs, and the energy flexibility associated with a large mobile batter, win.\n“This immediately leads to lower fuel consumption, emissions, and ground noise,” says William Vet, Local Director accountable for Netherlands and Scandinavia at EasyJet. “This is only possible thanks to the commitment of our partners, and in particular the Menzies Aviation team, who play a crucial role in our ground operations.”\nThe lone TaxiBot in operation is currently certified to service Airbus A320neo model aircraft. Schiphol is working on the certification for Boeing 737 and others with Embraer, KLM Cityhopper, Transavia,\nand other global partners\n. Another three electric TaxiBots are expected to be deployed before the end of this year.\nYou can see the TaxiBot in action and learn a bit more about how electrified ground handling equipment (GHE)\nis working to decarbonize airport operations in this video\n, below, then let us know what you think of the electric tug in the comments.\nIf you’re considering going solar, it’s always a good idea to get quotes from a few installers. To make sure you find a trusted, reliable solar installer near you that offers competitive pricing, check out\n, a free service that makes it easy for you to go solar. It has hundreds of pre-vetted solar installers competing for your business, ensuring you get high-quality solutions and save 20-30% compared to going it alone. Plus, it’s free to use, and you won’t get sales calls until you select an installer and share your phone number with them.\nYour personalized solar quotes are easy to compare online and you’ll get access to unbiased Energy Advisors to help you every step of the way.\nGet started here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nI’ve been in and around the auto industry for over thirty years, and have written for a number of well-known outlets like CleanTechnica, Popular Mechanics, the Truth About Cars, and more. You can catch me at Electrek Daily’s Quick Charge, The Heavy Equipment Podcast, or chasing my kids around Oak Park, IL\nFind a reliable home solar and battery installer and save 20-30% compared to going it alone.\nQmerit makes electrification easy — connecting you with trusted pros who get it done right."},{"t":"有丝分裂调节蛋白 Cdc20 泛素化机制","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2612003123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"A multisubunit ubiquitin ligase called the anaphase-promoting complex/cyclosome (APC/C) controls progress through mitosis in eukaryotic cells. The activity of APC/C in mitosis is subject to both positive and negative regulation by the co-activator protein Cdc20. On exit from mitosis, Cdc20 is targeted for degradation by APC/C-catalyzed ubiquitylation. It has been proposed that the ubiquitylation of Cdc20 is carried out by an intramolecular “cis” mechanism, in which Cdc20 bound to the co-activator site of APC/C is directly ubiquitylated [I. T. Foe\n                    et al.\n                    ,\n                    Curr. Biol.\n                    21\n                    , 1870–1877 (2011)]. This proposal was mainly based on the observation that mutation in the IR tail of Cdc20, an isoleucine-arginine C-terminal sequence involved in its binding to APC/C, markedly impaired Cdc20 ubiquitylation. We find that the IR tail of Cdc20 is also required for Cdc20 ubiquitylation promoted by Cdh1, an APC/C co-activator that acts in the G1 phase of the cell cycle. This suggested the involvement of the IR motif in a\n                    trans\n                    mechanism of Cdc20 ubiquitylation. A\n                    trans\n                    mechanism is also suggested by the observation that Cdc20 ubiquitylation by APC/C\n                    Cdc20\n                    , as that by APC/C\n                    Cdh1\n                    , requires both KEN-box and CRY-box degrons of Cdc20. A model is proposed according to which the IR tail of substrate Cdc20, along with its KEN-box and CRY-box motifs, interact with corresponding binding sites of APC/C-coactivator complexes."},{"t":"Madhav Gadgil（1942-2026）：印度生态学家先驱，在生物多样性保护和人类共存方面留下的遗产","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2611387123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论","b":"Madhav Gadgil was an evolutionary ecologist and champion of governmental and intergovernmental policies for biodiversity conservation, human coexistence with nature, and indigenous rights to land, natural resources, and self-governance. He made foundational contributions to the development of biodiversity sciences, human ecology, people’s traditional knowledge—and inherent rights to that knowledge as documented through biodiversity registers. Gadgil advocated a coherent policy integrating human welfare and biodiversity conservation in India. He will be remembered as an academic giant and an unmatched thinker, policy advocate, institution-builder, and humanitarian."},{"t":"Lucid(LCID)终于为Gravity SUV加入解放双手驾驶功能","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/09/lucid-lcid-gravity-hands-free-driving-ota-update/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"技术突破","tp":"高速脱手驾驶","as":"Lucid Group（LCID）开始为其Gravity SUV推送OTA软件更新，正式加入 hands-free（脱手）驾驶辅助功能。此举使Lucid跻身已具备高速公路场景脱手领航能力的电动车厂商行列，与特斯拉FSD、福特BlueCruise等竞争。该功能通过整车传感器套件（含激光雷达、摄像头等）实现，且仅需软件升级即可激活，无需硬件改动，体现了Lucid在预装传感器冗余上的前瞻设计。这对Lucid的产品竞争力及高级驾驶辅助系统（ADAS）市场格局具有实质意义。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"ot":"Lucid (LCID) finally adds hands-free driving to the Gravity SUV","b":"Fred Lambert\n| Jun 9 2026 - 6:12 am PT\nLucid Group (NASDAQ: LCID) announced it has begun rolling out an over-the-air software update that brings hands-free highway driving to the Gravity SUV in North America.\npromised hands-free driving for its vehicles\nwell over a year ago, but the feature’s actual rollout has been notoriously slow. The Gravity update arrives at a critical time for the EV startup, which is dealing with shareholder lawsuits, a new CEO, and a stock trading near all-time lows.\nThe new Hands-Free Drive Assist feature handles steering, acceleration, and braking on compatible divided highways. It requires the DreamDrive 2 Pro package, a $6,750 option that includes LiDAR and a full sensor suite.\nThe system also includes Hands-Free Lane Change, which lets drivers initiate lane changes via the turn signal, and an Automatic Lane Change function that can independently execute passing maneuvers to overtake slower traffic. That last feature is notable — not all competing systems offer unprompted passing at launch.\nBeyond the hands-free driving headline, the update packs several other upgrades. Adaptive Driving Beam maintains high beams while dynamically masking the section that would blind oncoming drivers. The Gravity’s navigation system now integrates Google Maps point-of-interest information, including reviews, photos, and business details.\nThere are also two features for the EV charging nerds. Advanced Preconditioning View displays the battery’s temperature relative to its optimal charging window, and Predictive Charging Power shows the expected peak DC fast-charging rate based on the vehicle’s current state and battery temperature. These are genuinely useful for road-tripping — knowing your projected charging speed before you pull into a station eliminates a common pain point.\nThe Gravity’s hands-free system competes directly with GM’s Super Cruise, Ford’s BlueCruise, and Rivian’s Universal Hands-Free feature. Each takes a different approach to pricing.\nLucid charges a one-time $6,750 for DreamDrive 2 Pro, which is expensive upfront but includes LiDAR hardware and no ongoing subscription fees. Rivian’s Autonomy+ package costs $2,500 as a one-time purchase or $49.99 per month after a 60-day trial. GM and Ford have generally included their systems as standard or as part of trim-level packages.\nTesla’s Autopilot offers basic lane-centering and adaptive cruise at no extra cost, but its “Full Self-Driving” package — which includes lane changes and city street driving — cost $100 a month. Lucid’s system allows actual hands-free driving on supported highways with driver-monitoring cameras ensuring attention, which puts it in the same category as Super Cruise rather than Tesla’s system.\nThe timing of this update matters. Lucid is navigating a turbulent stretch. The company\nis aiming to build 25,000 to 27,000 vehicles in 2026\n, a significant ramp from last year, but its Gravity deliveries were disrupted for 29 days in Q1 due to a second-row seat supplier defect that triggered a 4,476-vehicle recall.\nThat disruption has led to shareholder class action lawsuits alleging that former executives concealed the supplier defect while publicly touting improved delivery capabilities. Lucid also recently completed a CEO transition to Silvio Napoli, and the stock has cratered to around $5 — down more than 90% from its 2021 SPAC peak near $58.\nMeanwhile, Lucid\ncut 12% of its US workforce\nearlier this year to streamline operations ahead of its\nmidsize Cosmos and Earth SUVs\nlaunching later this year and into 2027. Those midsize vehicles, starting under $50,000, are where Lucid plans to\nintegrate NVIDIA’s autonomy stack for Level 4 self-driving\n— a far more ambitious play than today’s hands-free highway driving.\nThis is a solid update for Gravity owners, and the hands-free driving and automatic lane change features bring Lucid’s SUV up to par with the best ADAS systems in the luxury EV segment on paper, but the system obviously needs to be tested. The charging transparency features, showing battery temperature and predicted charging speed, are the kind of practical details that actually make a difference on road trips, and we wish more automakers would do the same.\nLucid has been promising hands-free driving for a long time now, and the pace of delivery has been painfully slow. Gravity owners have been waiting for this feature since the SUV launched, and the long delay doesn’t inspire confidence for buyers being asked to pay $6,750 for DreamDrive 2 Pro.\nElectrek is testing a Gravity right now (though we are returning it today so we can’t test this update). Stay tuned for the full review, but as a quick preview, it’s an incredible vehicle with some annoying software issues.\nIf you’re considering a Lucid or any new EV, powering your vehicle with home solar is one of the smartest ways to cut your fuel costs to near zero. With electricity rates climbing nearly 10% last year, home solar protects you against future rate increases. And with lease and PPA options, you can go solar with zero upfront cost and start saving immediately. If you want to find the best deal, check out\n. It’s a free service with hundreds of pre-vetted installers competing for your business, so you save 20 to 30% compared to going it alone. No sales calls until you pick an installer.\nGet your free quotes here\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nFred is the Editor in Chief and Main Writer at Electrek.\nThrough Zalkon.com, you can check out Fred’s portfolio and get monthly green stock investment ideas.\nGet an edge on MMA with the best stats\nEnergySage helps you get the best price possible on a home solar installation for free and without hassel."},{"t":"低临界溶解温度(LCST)介导的高容量低能耗直接空气碳捕集","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01563H","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"直接空气捕集","kp":["CO2吸附容量[直接空气捕集]: 2.82 mmol/g","[吸附剂]: PEI浸渍PNIPAM接枝纤维素网络","[机制]: LCST热响应,低再生能"],"as":"直接空气捕集（DAC）技术长期受限于吸附剂热再生的高能耗瓶颈。本研究提出利用低临界溶解温度（LCST）相变行为实现CO2捕集的新路径：通过温度驱动的聚合物溶液相分离，在不依赖高温热再生的条件下完成吸附剂的循环再生，从而大幅降低能耗。LCST介导的机制利用材料在特定温度下的溶解度突变，实现CO2的吸附-释放切换，有望突破传统胺基固体吸附剂的热力学约束，为DAC的大规模低能耗部署提供新的材料化学方向。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"ot":"Lower Critical Solution Temperature (LCST) Mediated Direct Air Capture of Carbon Dioxide with High Capacity and Low Rege","b":"Direct air capture of carbon dioxide has been limited by the energy-intensive thermal regeneration of adsorbents imposed by the low CO2 uptake capacity, high regeneration temperature and parasitic water evaporation. Herein, we demonstrated a class of thermo-responsive CO2 adsorbents—PEI impregnated PNIPAM-grafted cellulose network (TRCNF/PEI)—achieving high CO2 uptake of 2.82 mmol g-1 from air at 25 °C and 4.33 mmol g-1 at 5 °C, and low regeneration temperature below 65 °C. The thermo-responsive adsorbent features lower critical solution temperature (LCST) phase transition that enables a swell-adsorption/collapse-desorption mechanism. At room temperature, TRCNF/PEI is at a hydrophilic swollen state, effectively exposing the PEI amine sites for efficient CO2 capture. Above LCST, it transitions to a hydrophobic collapsed state. Water is expelled in liquid phase, destabilizing bicarbonate intermediates and thereby driving rapid CO2 desorption. This obviated the latent heat penalty of water, leading to unprecedentedly low regeneration thermal energy demand of 4.36 GJ ton-1CO2 that can be satisfied solely by low-grade waste heat. Unlike zeolites activated carbons and MOFs vulnerable to high humidity where liquid water inhibits CO2 uptake due to competitive adsorption, TRCNF/PEI leverages water to enhance adsorption and exhibits exceptional cyclic stability. Notably, the CO2 uptake of TRCNF/PEI further increases at lower temperatures (4.33 mmol g-1 at 5 °C), demonstrating its carbon capture potential in cold area. The unique LCST phase transition presents a transformative strategy to couple DAC with vast low-grade industrial waste heat, significantly advancing the energy efficiency and durability of carbon removal technologies.","aip":1},{"t":"紧急引力中的洛伦兹破缺及其宇宙学后果","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/tvmx-qk3k","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Raymond Isichei and João MagueijoWe show that general relativity and other geometrical theories can be viewed as a degenerate Otto cycle with only heat-exchange legs in emergent gravity. Including work-producing legs yields controlled violations of local Lorentz invariance and energy-momentum conservation, which produce late-time c…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 231501] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026"},{"t":"我们来谈谈生物医学研究套件","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-00799-z","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Although undoubtably helpful in many ways, experimental assay kits risk undermining the fundamentals of science. How can we course correct? Although undoubtably helpful in many ways, experimental assay kits risk undermining the fundamentals of science. How can we course correct?"},{"t":"学习领导人类与人工智能混合型企业","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/09/1137830/learning-to-lead-in-a-hybrid-human-ai-enterprise/","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","b":"In partnership with\nAs adoption of AI agents looks set to surge by as much as\nin the next two years, leadership teams are carefully considering the implications of a hybrid human-AI workforce.\nUnlike existing enterprise-level automation that relies on manual input, AI agents are capable of autonomously coordinating complex tasks, interacting with multiple tools and environments across an organization. In early applications that center on customer service, HR, and sales, adoption of agentic AI has led to productivity gains of\nTheir autonomy positions agents more as collaborators than tools, working side-by-side with human employees in blended teams that look poised to upend traditional workplace dynamics.\nthree-quarters of HR leaders\nbelieve that the deployment of AI agents will transform existing workplace norms, driving a complete reappraisal of how roles and responsibilities are distributed, how skills are prioritized, and how workplace culture is shaped.\nThough many admit they’re in the early or preparatory phase of this shift,\nof chief HR officers predict that navigating digital labor shaped by agentic AI will be a central component of their role in the years ahead.\nFluency in the change management aspect of agentic AI adoption will be a crucial differentiator when it comes to unlocking the full potential of the technology going forward, believes Ateet Jayaswal, chief culture and employee experience officer at Wipro, a leading technology services and consulting company. This moment is one that he says, “calls for a mindset shift in how HR leaders would enable their organizations.”\nAs AI agents assume ownership of more complex and integral tasks, the distribution of roles and responsibilities within an organization will undergo significant change. It’s estimated that\nthree-quarters of current roles\nwill require redesign, reskilling, or redeployment by 2030 as a result of agentic AI.\nFor leadership, this shift should be about reskilling employees toward higher-value work in order to optimize the potential of an agent-human hybrid workforce, says Jayaswal.\nFor example, Wipro is a complex organization of 240,000 employees across 65 countries. It previously had multiple policies, documents, and knowledge fragmented across different systems, which delayed response to employee queries.\nBut the company has recently integrated a custom agentic AI assistant—an agent co-created in partnership with enterprise agentic AI platform Ema Unlimited—that can swiftly navigate this complex system, assuming responsibility for 50 HR tasks that had previously fallen to human employees. With the help of an AI agent, average response time to queries has lowered from 48 hours to five seconds.\nHuman employees have more time to focus on work “that requires a creative and imaginative mind and cross-functional collaboration, leveraging diverse ideas and thoughts to problem-solve,” says Jayaswal. The AI agent, meanwhile, handles rote administrative tasks like sorting timesheets or helping employees navigate policies and take actions in the flow of work.\nWhen reallocating employee responsibilities, though, it is imperative that humans remain in the loop, Jayaswal caveats. When agentic AI is incorporated into enterprise technology, it must work with sensitive and personal data and therefore needs even more stringent guardrails and constraints than consumer applications. “When you expose an AI agent to organizational data, when you integrate it into multiple enterprise systems, then pathways around the AI agent become extremely important,” he says. “It’s an evolving space that leadership needs to have front-of-mind.” Governance should include robust data privacy rules and the establishment of governance layers, such as an AI council, he suggests.\nAt a fundamental level, the adoption of AI agents will force a re-evaluation of human roles, believes Jayaswal. Rather than employees primarily performing repetitive tasks or troubleshooting, a significant proportion of their time will shift to designing, teaching, and optimizing an AI agent that can do this work for them with far greater speed and predictability and without the agent getting bored.\n“The nature of your job changes from being the hero who comes in to solve the problem to designing the hero who can solve the problem,” he summarizes. “The individuals who I have seen thrive in this environment are the ones who make this shift.”\nJust as roles and responsibilities will be reconfigured to reflect the input of AI agents, the core skills of human employees will be reprioritized. More than\nfour in five HR leaders\nsay they’re planning to reskill workers to become more competitive in a market shaped by AI agents.\nTechnical skills will be increasingly important. Leading employers such as\nare already rolling out dedicated AI and digital skills programs that aim to equip everyone from frontline workers to C-suite executives with a baseline level of AI literacy in response to the pervasiveness of the technology.\nBut desirable soft skills will also evolve, Jayaswal points out. Employees who assign tasks to an AI agent need to plainly articulate what modular steps may be needed to accomplish a task, what the desired outcome should be, and what parameters or guardrails need to be in place to ensure the agent doesn’t access or share confidential data.\nAs HR executives adapt to a blended workforce, three skills are emerging as top priorities during recruitment, according to a recent\n: relationship building, like forging constructive partnerships and account management; collaboration; and adaptability.\nMaintaining a healthy workplace culture\nIn freeing up human employees to focus on higher-value tasks, the hope is that AI agents can elevate the employee experience, deepening fulfilment and satisfaction in the workplace.\n“At Wipro, our vision is to improve the life of Wiproites,” says Jayaswal. “We are taking away non-value added work by embracing modern ways of collaborating, engaging, and transacting, leaving associates with higher order work content.”\nBut leadership teams embracing agentic AI will also need to plan for the new pressures and stressors that the technology can place on a workforce.\nThere is already confusion and knowledge gaps, with\nof HR leaders reporting their employees don’t yet understand how digital labor will impact their work. Many organizations have opted to define AI agents as teammates or colleagues on org charts, but\nnew research\nsays this could erode trust and a sense of professional identity. It also raises new questions around accountability and ownership.\nThe role of management in addressing these concerns is critical, says Jayaswal. To maintain healthy dynamics, managers need to become skilled at orchestrating blended systems,\nsplitting their focus\nbetween supervising AI agents and motivating human employees as they also build and supervise AI agents.\nUpgrading employee well-being programs will be a core part of maintaining a robust workplace culture. “As there are more interactions with AI agents, you are losing some of the human touch that was provided by service delivery partners or leaders, or often even by colleagues and peers,” Jayaswal says. Employee services that encourage social connection and empathetic communication may help teams navigate this.\nAgentic AI looks set to scale at breakneck speed across many enterprises, and it will significantly transform how these organizations operate.\nCarefully considering and deciding how to adapt to this newly blended workforce is now a top priority for leadership teams. Reviewing and refining organizational strategies is essential for optimizing both technological gains and the employee experience.\nThis content was produced by Insights, the custom content arm of MIT Technology Review. It was not written by MIT Technology Review’s editorial staff. It was researched, designed, and written by human writers, editors, analysts, and illustrators. This includes the writing of surveys and collection of data for surveys. AI tools that may have been used were limited to secondary production processes that passed thorough human review.\nAccording to Stanford’s 2026 AI Index, AI is sprinting, and we’re struggling to keep up.\nMIT Technology Review's authoritative overview of the 10 technologies, emerging trends, bold ideas, and powerful movements in AI in 2026.\nLaunching next week on T-Mobile's network, the cell plan takes a nuclear approach to online safety.\nMusk kept his cool, and OpenAI’s lawyer bulldozed him with piercing questions about his motivations for suing the company.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more.","tp":"AI混合企业","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":"报告指出AI智能体的采用预计在未来两年内将大幅增长，企业管理层正在认真评估人机混合劳动力模式带来的影响。与依赖人工输入的传统企业自动化不同，AI智能体能够自主协调复杂任务并跨多个工具和组织环境交互，客服、人力资源和销售等领域的应用正在快速推进。"},{"t":"学习分子动力学长时间步长模拟的动作","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/shj2-hyw8","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Filippo Bigi, Johannes Spies, and Michele CeriottiMachine learning can reduce the number of time steps needed to accurately predict the progress of a dynamically evolving system.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 237301] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"卡夫亨氏：端到端可见性如何提高弹性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/kraft-heinz-how-end-to-end-visibility-drives-resilience","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Kraft Heinz: How End-to-End Visibility Drives Resilience\nPrioritise Us\nAs businesses navigate ongoing geopolitical events, experts argue that end-to-end visibility is the key to upholding supply chain resilience\nWhile facing ongoing disruption across the world, businesses need to have confidence in their own supply chains. For a multinational company like Kraft Heinz, this can be incredibly difficult.\nAs the third-largest food and beverage company in North America, the company has an expansive supply chain. This puts it at risk of disruption and supply chain fragmentation.\nTo avoid this, end-to-end visibility is key. Gaining these insights allows businesses to see which\nsuppliers are at risk\nand how they can gain more control over their supply chain.\nUntil the last few years, global organisations had been confident in their supply chain stability. Now, following a constant stream of geopolitical disruption, businesses are turning towards supply chain visibility tools in order to spot risks as they arise.\nIn its Global Supplier Risk and Sustainability Survey, Achilles – a global leader in risk management and business intelligence – examines where\nvisibility gaps\nstill remain.\nAccording to the report, only 6% of organisations state they have full visibility into Tier 2 and Tier 3 suppliers. Ongoing disruption and regulatory expansion are consistently adding new levels of complexity to businesses.\n“Supply chains today are more complex, more interconnected and more exposed to disruption than ever before,” explains Adam Whitfield, Head of Global Compliance and ESG at Achilles.\n“Building resilience now requires more than periodic\nsupplier assessments\n. Organisations need structured supplier data, consistent governance and continuous monitoring to identify emerging risks early and intervene before problems escalate.”\nLaís Piccinini Doi, Associate Director S&OP – Meals at Kraft Heinz Company, explains that\nCOVID was a majorly disruptive\nevent for the company, but it allowed Kraft Heinz to examine its operations.\n“It was a very good test to see how we perform in a very different system that we are used to,” she says.\n“We had to revamp all our operations to make the best with the resources that we had and still be able to maintain reliability, consistency and quality at a fair price to the customers.\n“Having full control of our operations is not feasible because there’s too many moving parts. We don’t know what's going to happen, but we know the weak links that we need to protect and work to make sure that we’re going to have a continuous and resilient operations and supply chain.”\nGoing through this major event, Kraft Heinz was able to see where the areas of risk sat.\nThough AI has made preparing for risk easier, there is still no way to fully predict it. As a result, having this overview of a supply chain and its potential risks allows businesses to prepare for the worst or to put in the resources to strengthen the risk point.\nIf a company fails to build visibility across its operations, it risks both company trust and also company stability. Through an increase in visibility, teams across the organisation can communicate better, leading to innovative strategy discussions and a more collaborative organisation.\n“Being able to tell the story end to end across all of our stakeholders really makes a difference in not only building credibility and trust, but also making changes to the system,” Laís adds.\nThrough these discussions, supplier bases can be discussed with the complete information needed – is this supplier risk too much, or can it be solved with a new strategy or larger investment?\n“It’s all about the trade offs,” Laís says.\n“You can have this reliable supplier with this price, but on the other hand, if you change to maybe a more competitive price supplier, how does that impact your operations?”\nThe benefit of visibility\ngoes both ways\n– if a company expects visibility from its suppliers, it should also ensure visibility to its suppliers.\n\"The suppliers nowadays also want more visibility,” Laís adds.\n“They want to make sure that they can count with the business for a longer period of time than just being one offs and all of those things play in the negotiations that we are going to have.”\nIf a supplier does not have the confidence in the organisation it is doing business with, it may look elsewhere. Communication and transparency are key for a number of reasons – strategy development,\nsupplier relationship\nbuilding and withstanding geopolitical disruption.\nHead of Compliance & ESG"},{"t":"介电工程共价有机框架中纳米限域差异界面摩擦驱动的离子选择性传输","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73670?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"固态电解质离子传输","kp":["电解质[固态电池]: 共价有机框架(COF)型","[离子选择传输]: 纳米限域差分界面摩擦机制"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出一种基于纳米限域差分界面摩擦机制实现离子选择性传输的策略，应用于固态电解质(SSE)设计。该机制利用纳米尺度受限空间内不同离子与界面间摩擦力的差异，同时兼顾高离子电导率和优异的离子选择性两大核心指标。传统固态电解质面临电导率与选择性难以兼顾的矛盾，该方法从界面物理化学角度提供新思路，对全固态电池、电化学分离等能源存储与转换领域具有重要指导意义。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Ion‐Selective Transport via Nanoconfined Differential Interfacial Friction in a Dielectric‐Engineered Covalent Organic F","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) that concurrently deliver high ionic conductivity, excellent ion selectivity, and robust electrochemical/thermal stability remains a central challenge for safe, high‐energy‐density solid‐state batteries (SSBs). Here, an all‐solid‐state covalent organic framework electrolyte with sectionalized chemical environments (SCE‐COF) is reported, constructed via nanoconfined copolymerization of a highly dielectric monomer within COF nanochannels. The resulting architecture affords a nano‐confined molecular interface that integrates electron‐rich polar short chains that form abundant Li\n                    +\n                    hopping sites with electron‐deficient pore‐wall regions that immobilize anions through specific hydrogen‐bonding interactions, thereby enabling efficient and differential ion transport decoupled from strongly bonded solvation cage and polymer segmental motion. Benefiting from these synergistic effects, SCE‐COF achieves ionic conductivity of 1.05 × 10\n                    −3\n                     S cm\n                    −1\n                    at 30°C, a high Li\n                    +\n                    transference number of 0.73 and a wide electrochemical window (4.87 V vs Li\n                    +\n                    /Li). Finally, all‐solid‐state full cells employing SCE‐COF deliver a high specific energy density of 442.0 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    under a controlled lithium source at ambient temperature.","aip":1},{"t":"非晶材料的定向性能逆向设计","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202522493?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"综述聚焦非晶(无序)材料的逆向设计方法，以玻璃等无序体系为对象，探讨如何针对特定目标性质反向设计材料组分与结构。与晶态材料可通过原子坐标精确定义不同，非晶材料缺乏长程有序结构，传统试错法效率低下。该工作梳理了结合机器学习、分子动力学模拟及实验验证的逆向设计框架，旨在加速发现具有特定光学、力学或电学性能的新型玻璃及非晶材料，推动无序材料从被动表征走向主动设计。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"非晶材料设计","kp":["[逆向设计]: ML驱动非晶材料目标性能逆向设计","[材料类型]: 玻璃等无序材料用于储能/光学/催化"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Inverse Design of Amorphous Materials With Targeted Properties","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Disordered (amorphous) materials, such as glasses, are emerging as promising candidates for applications within energy storage, nonlinear optics, and catalysis. Their lack of long‐range order and complex short‐ and medium‐range order, which depend on composition as well as thermal and pressure history, offer a vast materials design space. To this end, relying on machine learning methods instead of trial and error is promising, and among these, inverse design has emerged as a tool for generating materials with desired properties. Although inverse design methods based on diffusion models have shown success for crystalline materials and molecules, similar methods targeting amorphous materials remain less developed, mainly because of the limited availability of large‐scale datasets and the requirement for larger simulation cells. In this work, we propose and validate an inverse design method for amorphous materials, introducing AMDEN (Amorphous Material DEnoising Network), a diffusion model‐based framework that generates structures of amorphous materials. First, we demonstrate the inherent challenges for diffusion models to generate relaxed structures. These low‐energy configurations are typically obtained through a thermal motion‐driven random search‐like process that cannot be replicated by standard denoising procedures. We therefore introduce an energy‐based AMDEN variant that implements Hamiltonian Monte Carlo refinement for generating these relaxed structures. We further introduce several amorphous material datasets with diverse properties and compositions to evaluate our framework and support future development."},{"t":"胞内质子富集驱动双辅因子统一再生用于生物杂化CO₂固定","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.8155133?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物杂化固碳","kp":["[生物杂化CO2还原]: 胞内质子富集驱动双辅因子统一再生"],"dp":1,"as":"研究揭示胞内质子富集机制可统一驱动双辅因子(NADH/NADPH)再生，用于光催化生物杂化系统。该体系将光敏剂与全细胞生物催化剂耦合，光合作用产生的质子在胞内富集，同步驱动两种关键辅酶的循环再生，从而突破以往单一辅因子再生的限制。这一发现为光驱动的生物催化、人工光合作用及绿色化学品合成提供了更高效的能量与电子传递路径，有望提升生物杂化体系的催化效率与产物选择性。","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Intracellular Proton Enrichment Drives Unified Dual‐Cofactor Regeneration for Biohybrid CO2 Fixation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photocatalytic biohybrid systems, which interface photosensitizers with whole‐cell biocatalysts, represent a platform for sustainable solar‐to‐chemical CO\n                    2\n                    conversion. However, their efficiency is fundamentally constrained by kinetic mismatch between sluggish transmembrane electron injection and uncoupled proton flux required for bioenergetic transduction. This uncoupling restricts the regeneration of adenosine triphosphate (ATP) and reduced nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide (NADH), the dual cofactors essential for driving carbon fixation pathways. Here, we introduce a proton enrichment strategy utilizing protonated manganese‐doped carbon dots (HMnCDs) that function simultaneously as reversible proton buffers and photoelectron donors. HMnCDs localize to the periplasm of\n                    Cupriavidus necato\n                    r H16, where their labile protons reinforce the transmembrane proton gradient driving ATP synthase. Concurrently, cytoplasmic HMnCDs facilitate proton‐coupled electron transfer, accelerating NADH photoregeneration. The concerted management of proton and electron fluxes decouples ATP generation from respiratory NADH oxidation, creating a synergistic cofactor supply even under electron transport chain inhibition. Consequently, the biohybrid achieves light‐driven autotrophic growth and poly(3‐hydroxybutyrate) biosynthesis from CO\n                    2\n                    , attaining a record quantum efficiency of 20.8%. Multi‐omics analyses reveal global metabolic reprogramming, including upregulated carbon fixation pathways and adaptive modulation of energy homeostasis under the proton‐enriched microenvironment. This work establishes proton enrichment as a generalizable design principle for coupling photochemistry with cellular bioenergetics."},{"t":"界面诱导内建磁场增强自旋交换相互作用实现高效氧电催化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00163-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"磁场氧电催化","kp":["[氧电催化]: 界面内置磁场实现无外场自旋交换调控"],"dp":1,"as":"研究通过构建反铁磁/铁磁异质结构，利用界面诱导产生的内建磁场增强自旋交换相互作用。该内建磁场能够自洽地对齐界面自旋，有效调控磁交换耦合强度，为自旋电子学器件设计提供新机制。该策略有望应用于自旋阀、磁存储及低功耗自旋逻辑器件，拓展了基于界面工程调控磁性的研究路径，对发展高性能自旋电子材料具有指导价值。","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Interface-induced built-in magnetic field boosted spin exchange interactions to enable high-efficiency oxygen electrocat","b":"Engineered antiferromagnetic/ferromagnetic heterostructures generate an interfacial built-in magnetic field that aligns electron spins, an effect that enables external field-free control of spin-dependent oxygen electrocatalysis via rapid quantum spin exchange interactions. This strategy enhances oxygen evolution activity and reveals the critical role of spin polarization in governing reaction process; thus, it offers a general design principle for efficient energy conversion materials.","aip":1},{"t":"将营养重要性纳入陆生脊椎动物的保护中","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605237123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"There is global consensus on the need to prioritize conservation efforts to prevent biodiversity loss and defaunation. Most current conservation initiatives focus on areas with high species diversity or many threatened species, treating species independently and neglecting trophic interactions. To address these oversights, we developed a framework to quantify species’ roles along continuums of trophic importance (TI) and global endangerment (GE), estimated from a global terrestrial meta-food web of over 25,000 vertebrate species. We combined TI with IUCN Red List categories to create a Trophic Importance Global Endangerment (TIGE) index, integrating TI and extinction risk. Our analysis revealed that the TI index provides distinct and complementary insights beyond species endangerment. Systematic conservation planning indicated that prioritizing areas based on TIGE shows significant spatial inconsistency compared to traditional taxonomic approaches. Our findings emphasize the value of incorporating species trophic network importance into conservation strategies to reconcile species ecosystem functioning and biodiversity conservation."},{"t":"InfinityPV发布385-1300nm光照光谱范围的太阳光模拟器","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/infinitypv-releases-solar-simulator-with-385-1300-nm-illumination-spectral-range/","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"太阳能模拟器","kp":["光谱范围[太阳光模拟器]: 385-1300nm","光强[太阳光模拟器]: 最高7 suns","可调波长[LED]: 20个独立通道"],"as":"丹麦公司InfinityPV推出ISOSun Pro太阳能模拟器,照明光谱范围覆盖385至1300纳米,配备20个独立可调的LED波长通道,可精确模拟太阳光谱用于光伏器件测试。该设备支持多波长独立调控,为太阳能电池效率评估与材料表征提供了高灵活性的测试平台。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"InfinityPV发布385-1300nm光照光谱范围的太阳光模拟器 - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nThe Danish company said its ISOSun Pro Solar Simulator has 20 independently tunable LED wavelengths. It delivers intensities of up to 7 suns.\nTechnology & Products\nCells & modules\nThe ISOSun Pro Solar Simulator | Image: infinityPV\n, a Danish provider of printed electronics equipment, has announced a new laboratory solar simulator with illumination across the 385–1,300 nm spectral range.\nThe ISOSun Pro Solar Simulator has 20 independently tunable LED wavelengths, enabling reproduction of indoor and outdoor spectra, including the solar testing standard of AM1.5G.\n“The system supports illuminated areas up to 1,000 cm² and delivers intensities of up to 7 suns, with outstanding performance in spectral match, spatial uniformity, and temporal stability (up to class A+, A+, A+, respectively),” the company said in a statement. “This ensures reliable and consistent conditions for high-accuracy measurements.”\nThe new simulator can be used as a standalone unit or be controlled by a computer, using a spectrum-matching software for reference standards. The company adds that it comes in a durable benchtop configuration and is suitable for both small- and large-area solar cells, as well as controlled illumination research.\n“Optional accessories include high-performance aluminum reflectors designed for seamless interchangeability,” InfinityPV stated. “Other accessories are calibration platforms comprising silicon photodiode (350-1,100m), InGaAs photodiode (900-1,700nm), and a diffuse reflector for optical fiber output.”\nView author posts"},{"t":"印度电力公司签署335 MW/670 MWh电池储能合同 - Energy Storage","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/09/indian-utility-signs-contracts-for-335-mw-670-mwh-of-battery-storage/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能电池采购","kp":["总容量[BESS合同]: 335MW/670MWh"],"as":"印度古吉拉特邦电力公司GUVNL与Advait Energy Transitions签署电池储能采购协议,总规模达335MW/670MWh,其中首批150MW/300MWh。这标志着印度电网级储能部署加速推进,将助力可再生能源并网消纳与电力系统调峰。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":3.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Indian utility signs contracts for 335 MW/670 MWh of battery storage - Energy Storage","b":"India’s GUVNL has signed battery energy storage purchase agreements with Advait Energy Transitions for 150 MW/300 MWh of BESS capacity, Equentia Energy Bellatrix for 65 MW/130 MWh, and Sun Drops Energia for 120 MW/240 MWh.\nThe contracts have been awarded to Advait Energy Transitions, which secured 150 MW/300 MWh of capacity, Equentia Energy Bellatrix (65 MW/130 MWh), and Sun Drops Energia (120 MW/240 MWh).\nWith the latest agreements, GUVNL’s contracted battery storage portfolio has reached 2,730 MW/5,460 MWh. Based on two charge-discharge cycles per day, the portfolio can provide up to 10,920 MWh of daily energy storage services."},{"t":"直接敲除、耗散反应和碎片中填充的 $^{29}\\mathrm{S}$ 的束内 $γ$ 射线光谱","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6ls3-4bss","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): I. Dickenson, B. Longfellow, T. Beck, A. Gade, D. Weisshaar, B. A. Brown, D. Bazin, K. W. Brown, R. J. Charity, P. J. Farris, S. A. Gillespie, A. M. Hill, J. Li, W. Reviol, and D. RhodesExcited states in the neutron-deficient nucleus $^{29}\\mathrm{S}$ were populated in one-neutron knockout and several-nucleon removal reactions and studied using in-beam $γ$-ray spectroscopy. New excited states and $γ$-ray transitions were established using the Segmented Germanium Array SeGA and the …[Phys. Rev. C 113, 064308] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026"},{"t":"本期","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/iti2326123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"层间缠结三维共价有机框架中亚胺键异构调控荧光传感性能","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1228418?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架","kp":["[3D COF]: 亚胺键方向异构调控荧光传感性能"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究聚焦于由缠结二维层结构构建的三维共价有机框架(3D COF)中的亚胺键合异构现象。这类层缠结3D COF材料具有复杂拓扑结构,其连接异构性对孔道结构、比表面积及气体吸附等性能有显著影响,是功能多孔材料设计的前沿方向。","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Imine Linkage Isomerism in Layer‐Entangled Three‐Dimensional Covalent Organic Frameworks Modulates Fluorescent Sensing","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Three‐dimensional covalent organic frameworks (3D COFs) constructed from entangled two‐dimensional layers represent a rare yet intriguing structural class; however, the influence of variations in linkage structure within such architectures remains unexplored. Herein, we investigate a linkage‐isomeric pair of isoreticular layer‐entangled 3D COFs with opposite imine bond orientations (3D‐An‐CN‐COF and 3D‐An‐NC‐COF). Remarkably, although these two frameworks share nearly identical composition, topology, and porosity, the subtle difference in C═N bond orientation leads to pronounced differences in their optoelectronic properties and fluorescent sensing behaviors. In particular, 3D‐An‐CN‐COF exhibits nearly an order‐of‐magnitude higher sensitivity toward 2,4,6‐trinitrophenol (TNP) in aqueous media than 3D‐An‐NC‐COF, with a quenching constant of 3.27 × 10\n                    6\n                     M\n                    −1\n                    and a detection limit of 9.5 nmol L\n                    −1\n                    , placing it among the most sensitive COF‐based fluorescent sensors for TNP reported to date. These results establish imine linkage isomerism as an effective structural parameter for reprogramming the optoelectronic properties and sensing behavior of layer‐entangled 3D COFs, offering new insight into the rational design of high‐performance fluorescent sensing materials."},{"t":"确定抗生素耐药性的驱动因素：“同一个健康”干预措施的数学模型重点关注传播和","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(26)00119-3?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"One Earth","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"IDC 分析师：WWDC26 是苹果 AI 的“可信度”测试","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/129.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","tp":"苹果AI助手","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"as":"IDC分析师认为，WWDC26是苹果AI战略的\"可信度\"关键测试。在经历多年AI功能延期和落地不顺后，苹果试图通过新一代操作系统证明其在AI时代的竞争力。据报道，苹果新系统核心基于重构的Siri和端侧大模型能力，重点展示AI与系统级应用的深度融合。此次发布将决定市场对苹果AI战略的信心走向。","b":"6 月 9 日消息，彭博社记者马克 · 古尔曼 9 日（今天）撰文称，苹果在全球开发者大会上为新一代产品铺路，试图向外界证明，在经历多年 AI 功能延期和落地不顺之后，自己仍有能力在 AI 时代参与竞争。\n苹果最新一代操作系统的核心，是经过全面改造的\n，覆盖 iOS 27、macOS 27 Golden Gate、watchOS 27 和 visionOS 27。Siri AI 被设计得\n更智能、更可靠，可以理解上下文\n，并能更精准地控制多种应用。\nIDC 分析师弗朗西斯科 · 杰罗尼莫在报告中提到：“\n是苹果的 AI 可信度测试。苹果不需要靠最大模型或最夸张的演示赢下 AI，苹果需要让 AI\n在整个生态系统中变得可信、有用，而且无处不在却不打扰用户\n苹果仍要面对投资者对 AI 战略的怀疑。发布会期间，\n苹果股价下跌，收盘跌幅达到 1.9%\n苹果也承认，新功能不会一次性全面铺开。Siri AI 初期只支持英语，今年秋季面向消费者推出时\n，中国和欧盟用户最初也无法使用最新 AI 功能。\n古尔曼称，发布会不仅是在展示未来，也是在弥补过去的短板。通过重建 Siri、升级 AI 技术，苹果正在为未来一批更依赖 AI 能力的产品打基础。\nIT之家从报道中获悉，IDC 分析师纳比拉 · 波帕尔表示：“这些功能将成为推动\n及更早机型用户升级的巨大催化剂\n，尤其是那些原本可能因为通胀压力或经济不确定性而推迟购机的用户。说服\n持有旧机但仍在犹豫的消费者升级\n，将帮助苹果维持当前势头。在智能手机市场走弱的背景下，这是一项重要成就。”"},{"t":"中国燃油车销量持续下滑，销量前16名已全部是电动车","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/09/ice-car-sales-continue-to-plummet-in-china-the-top-16-cars-are-now-evs/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动汽车市场","kp":["[NEV市场份额]: 62.9%（2026年5月中国乘用车）","[销量排名]: 前16名均为电动车"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":8.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.5,"t":9.0},"as":"据中国乘联会数据，2026年5月中国销量前16的车型全部为电动汽车，燃油车（ICE）销量持续暴跌。这一里程碑数据标志着中国汽车市场电动化转型进入加速临界点——电动汽车不再仅占据榜首个别位置，而是全面主导畅销榜单。燃油车市场份额的急剧萎缩对传统车企构成生存压力，也印证了中国新能源汽车政策的深远成效。","ot":"ICE car sales continue to plummet in China, the top 16 cars are now electric","b":"| Jun 9 2026 - 5:00 am PT\nEvery one of the top sixteen cars sold in China was an EV in May according to China Passenger Car Association data, as gasoline-powered cars continue their structural decline in the world’s largest auto market.\nChina set a new milestone in May, reaching a new high of 62.9% NEV market share, up from 61.4%\njust last month\n. China counts both BEVs and PHEVs under the same “NEV” category.\nThis was enough to kick every single gas-powered vehicle out of the monthly top ten list. Last month, there was\none ICE-powered straggler left\n, the Geely Coolray, but this month, they’re all NEVs.\nThe top ten now reads:\nIn fact, it’s not just the top ten list that’s missing gas cars, but the top\ncars are NEVs.\nThe Geely Coolray, the best-selling ICE-only car in the country, fell from 8th place in April all the way to 17th place in May.\nThe prime culprit wasn’t so much a rise in EV sales as a collapse in\nEV sales. ICE-only car sales went down by a whopping 39% year over year, a slightly larger drop than last month’s 37%.\nThe sales drop carried over into basically anything that has an ICE engine: PHEV sales dropped 24% YoY, EREV sales dropped 28%, and hybrid sales dropped 24.4%. The ICE age is truly ending in the world’s largest auto market.\nDue to the drop in PHEV and EREV sales, NEV sales overall were down 7.5%, but the rest of the market dropped so much that market share still increased. Notably though, when splitting the “NEV” category into its constituent parts, BEV-only sales were actually up.\nBEVs were the only type of car that saw an increase in sales, up 3.9% from last May, at 637,000 cars. And that’s even after an incentive change at the beginning of this year which led to a slow start for BEV sales in the first 3 months of the year.\nWhile EV share has been rising in China (\nand the world, even as media continues to wrongly claim otherwise\n), the significant drop in gas-powered car sales seems tied to the\nglobal spike in oil prices\nbrought on by an idiotic US war against Iran.\nThe war and disruption to global oil supply associated with it has caused intelligent countries to rethink ways to move off of their oil addiction – and unintelligent ones to\ndouble down on it\nThose intelligent countries are buying more EVs and fewer ICE cars, and China is happy to supply them. While manufacturers from other countries are\nbacking off on their EV commitments\n, China once again showed a massive increase in NEV exports, up 112.6% year over year, with 424,000 units exported in May. More than half (54%) of China’s car exports were NEVs, another record.\nChina remains the largest car exporting country in the world, a position it\ntook in 2024\n, after five decades of dominance from Germany and Japan. (Something that automakers\nmight have been warned of\nif they read a certain\nsaid last month\n, this rapid change in the world’s largest auto market and auto exporter should give pause to any automakers outside of China. As Western automakers commit more to the falling part of the market, ICE cars, China is committing to the growing part of the market, and seeing great success.\nIt’s not a secret and it doesn’t require some sort of incredible strategy or foresight. It just requires seeing the very obvious public numbers over the last decade, showing declining ICE sales and increasing EV sales. Yes,\neven oilprice.com\nnow recognizes this trend that’s been happening\nfor a whole decade now\nSo – and this is directed at all non-Chinese manufacturers and the governments who are\nchanging rules to make it easier for them to pollute\n– rather than telling yourselves comforting little lies,\npretending EV sales are falling when they are not\n, maybe it would be a good idea to compete in the market that exists, instead of the\nridiculous fantasy bouncing around in Akio Toyoda’s headcase\nCharge your electric vehicle at home using rooftop solar panels. Find a reliable and competitively priced solar installer near you on\n, for free. They have pre-vetted installers competing for your business, ensuring high-quality solutions and 20-30% savings. It’s free, with no sales calls until you choose an installer. Compare personalized solar quotes online and receive guidance from unbiased Energy Advisers. Get started\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nJameson has been driving electric cars since 2009, and covering EVs, sustainability and policy for Electrek since 2016.\nUse our Aptera Referral Code for $30 off a reservation for the upcoming Aptera solar electric vehicle.\nFind a reliable home solar/battery installer and save 20-30% compared to going it alone."},{"t":"NiOx上羟基界面工程实现自组装单分子层锚定，制备高效稳定钙钛矿器件","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73656?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿界面工程","kp":["[空穴传输层]: NiOx+羟基化V2CTx MXene","[策略]: 羟基位点锚定自组装单分子层","[应用]: 倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池(PSCs)中界面损耗制约性能的问题，研究提出一种羟基界面工程策略，通过在NiOx表面构建自组装单分子层(SAM)锚定结构，改善空穴传输层与钙钛矿之间的界面接触。该方法有效降低界面非辐射复合损失，提升电荷提取效率，从而实现更高光电转换效率和长期运行稳定性的钙钛矿太阳能电池。","ot":"Hydroxyl Interfacial Engineering for Self‐Assemble Monolayers Anchoring on NiOx Enables Efficient and Stable Perovskite ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The performance of inverted perovskite solar cells (PSCs) is critically constrained by interfacial losses arising from the insufficient coverage and weak adhesion of self‐assembled monolayers (SAM). Herein, we report a SAM regulation strategy by mixing hydroxylated V\n                    2\n                    CT\n                    x\n                    MXene (V\n                    2\n                    C‐OH) with nickel oxide (NiO\n                    x\n                    ), which can provide abundant hydroxyl sites for SAM anchoring, thereby forming a uniform and dense SAM layer. First‐principles calculations further reveal that the binding energy between SAM and hydroxyl groups on V\n                    2\n                    C‐OH is stronger than that on pristine NiO\n                    x\n                    , explaining the enhanced thermal stability of SAM on the hybrid substrate. Meanwhile, the highly ordered and tightly packed SAM layer promotes vertical growth and [001]‐preferred orientation of perovskite grains. Therefore, the introduction of V\n                    2\n                    C‐OH enables a top‐down modulation of the NiO\n                    x\n                    , SAM, and perovskite layers, improving their morphology and interfacial properties. The resulting PSCs achieve a champion power conversion efficiency of 26.6% (certified at 26.2%) for a 0.0524 cm\n                    2\n                    device and 24.7% for a 1 cm\n                    2\n                    device, along with outstanding long‐term operational stability.","aip":1},{"t":"水凝胶作为水-能关联系统的界面材料","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/joule/fulltext/S2542-4351(26)00183-2?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Joule","tg":"观点评论","tp":"水凝胶界面材料","kp":["[平台]: 水凝胶调控水/离子/热/电荷界面输运","[应用]: 太阳能水生成/大气取水/水伏发电/水系电池"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"综述了水凝胶作为界面材料在水-能源关联领域的应用前景。水凝胶作为软物质平台，可在界面处调控水分子、离子、热量和电荷的输运过程，在海水淡化、太阳能蒸发、渗透能收集等水能交叉技术中展现出独特优势。文章系统讨论了水凝胶的分子设计、界面工程策略及其在可持续水处理和能源转换中的应用潜力。","ot":"Hydrogels as interfacial materials for the water-energy nexus","b":"Hydrogels offer a soft-matter platform for controlling water, ion, heat, and charge transport at interfaces central to the water-energy nexus. This review examines how hydrogel chemistry and architecture regulate chemical/electrochemical-potential gradients and transport kinetics, enabling solar water generation, atmospheric water harvesting, hydrovoltaic power generation, and aqueous batteries. These principles guide the design of scalable, resilient hydrogel interfaces for sustainable water and energy technologies."},{"t":"基于水凝胶的湿气发电机：材料、机制与可持续器件设计","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01584K","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"水凝胶湿气发电","kp":["[器件]: 水凝胶湿气发电机(MEG)","[现存瓶颈]: 低功率输出/不稳定/可扩展性有限"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":4.0},"as":"综述了基于水凝胶的湿气发电(MEG)器件的材料体系、工作机制和可持续设计策略。环境中广泛存在的湿气可作为替代能源来源，水凝胶通过吸附水分引发离子分离与定向迁移从而产生电能。文章涵盖了不同水凝胶材料（如聚电解质、氧化石墨烯复合体系）的发电机制、器件架构优化及提升输出功率密度的关键策略，为绿色自供电器件提供了新思路。","ot":"Hydrogel-Based Moisture Electricity Generators: Materials, Mechanisms, and Sustainable Device Design","b":"Global environmental crises and energy shortages pose a grave threat to human society. The widespread moisture offers an endless source of power for sustainable electricity production. However, traditional moisture electricity generation devices (MEGs) encounter issues such as low power output, instability, and limited scalability. Hydrogels, with their exceptional moisture absorption and retention properties, efficient ionic transport channels, and outstanding flexibility and adaptability, provide an ideal material platform for constructing high-performance, high-stability, and scalable MEGs.Herein, a systematic overview of recent advances in hydrogel-based moisture electricity generation devices (HMEGs) is presented. First, the fundamental mechanisms of HMEG are described thoroughly, including moisture-hydrogel interactions and power generation. Subsequently, the selection of materials for HMEGs is introduced. Strategies to improve HMEG performance are then discussed, including the construction of porous transport pathways, the design of asymmetric gradients, the modification of electrodes, and the exploitation of synergistic effects for multi-source energy harvesting. Applications of high-performance HMEGs in self-powered and wearable electronics, environmental monitoring, and sensing are also reviewed. Finally, we summarize the advantages of HMEGs and provide a critical analysis of current challenges and future perspectives, aiming to offer fundamental insights for the development of nextgeneration sustainable HMEGs."},{"t":"座头鲸15,000公里的跨洋之旅令科学家震惊","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/humpback-whale-stuns-scientists-with-15000-kilometer-journey-across-oceans/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","tg":"行业观察","b":"Two humpback whales crossed entire oceans between Australia and Brazil, setting migration records and surprising scientists.\nScientists have documented an extraordinary feat of long-distance travel by humpback whales, confirming for the first time that individual animals have moved between breeding areas off eastern Australia and Brazil.\nThe discovery reveals ocean crossings of more than 14,000 kilometers and establishes new records for the greatest distances ever confirmed between sightings of individual humpback whales anywhere in the world.\n“Discoveries like this are only possible because of investment into long-term multi-decadal research programs and international collaboration,” Griffith University PhD candidate and co-author Stephanie Stack said.\n“These whales were photographed decades apart, by different people, in opposite parts of the world, separated by two different oceans, and yet we can connect their journey.”\nTo make the discovery, researchers compared tens of thousands of photographs of humpback whale tails, known as flukes. Because each whale’s fluke has a unique pattern, scientists can use the images much like fingerprints to identify individual animals over time.\nThe team found two whales that had been photographed in both eastern Australia and Brazil.\nOne of the whales was first photographed in Hervey Bay, Queensland, in 2007. It was seen again in the same region in 2013 before being photographed off São Paulo, Brazil, in 2019.\nThe straight-line distance between those two breeding regions is about 14,200 kilometers, roughly equivalent to the distance between Sydney and London.\nBecause researchers only know where the whale was photographed and not the exact route it followed, the total distance it actually swam could have been even greater.\nThe second whale set an even more remarkable record.\nResearchers first photographed it in 2003 at Abrolhos Bank, Brazil’s primary humpback whale nursery off the coast of Bahia. At the time, it was part of an energetic group of nine adult whales.\nTwenty-two years later, in September 2025, the same whale was spotted alone in Hervey Bay, Australia.\nThe distance between those sightings was approximately 15,100 kilometers, making it the longest documented distance ever recorded between sightings of the same individual humpback whale.\nThe research relied on 19,283 high-quality fluke photographs collected between 1984 and 2025 from eastern Australia and Latin America.\nImages came from both professional researchers and members of the public who contributed observations through the global whale identification platform Happywhale.\nScientists used an automated image recognition system to scan the photographs for potential matches. Every match was then independently reviewed by researchers to confirm the identification.\n“This kind of research highlights the value of citizen science,” said lead researcher Dr. Cristina Castro from Pacific Whale Foundation.\n“Every photo contributes to our understanding of whale biology and, in this case, helped uncover one of the most extreme movements ever recorded.”\nThe researchers emphasized that these journeys appear to be exceptionally uncommon.\nAcross more than four decades of data covering nearly 20,000 identified humpback whales, only two individuals were found to have traveled between the Australian and Brazilian breeding grounds. That represents just 0.01 percent of all identified whales in the study.\n“Despite their rarity, these exchanges matter for the long-term health of whale populations,” Ms. Stack said.\n“Occasional individuals moving between distant breeding grounds can help maintain genetic diversity across populations and may even carry new song styles from one region to another – humpback whale songs are known to spread culturally across ocean basins, much like music trends in human populations.”\nThe findings also lend support to what scientists call the Southern Ocean Exchange hypothesis.\nAccording to this idea, humpback whales from different breeding populations occasionally encounter one another while feeding in Antarctic waters. Some whales may then return along a different migration route, eventually joining an entirely new breeding population.\nResearchers suggest that environmental changes in the Southern Ocean could influence how often these rare movements occur.\nClimate-driven shifts in sea ice and changes in the distribution of Antarctic krill (the whale’s main prey) may be increasing the likelihood of whales making these unusual ocean crossings.\nThe study, “First evidence of bidirectional exchange between distant humpback whale breeding populations in eastern Australia and Brazil,” was published in\nRoyal Society Open Science\nReference: “First evidence of bidirectional exchange between distant humpback whale breeding populations in eastern Australia and Brazil” by Cristina Castro Ayala, Stephanie H. Stack, Milton C. C. Marcondes, Julio Cardoso, Ted Cheeseman, Jens J. Currie, Arlaine Francisco, Marilia Olio, Bianca Righi, Silke Stuckenbrock and Renata S. Sousa-Lima, 20 May 2026,\nRoyal Society Open Science\nDOI: 10.1098/rsos.260251\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nGriffith University\nHumpback Whale Comeback Reveals Surprising Shift in Mating Success\nHow Whale Waste Powers Marine Ecosystems\nSquid Collapse Triggers Massive Sperm Whale Migration From the Gulf of California\nSolving the Krill Paradox: Researchers Find Whales Eat (and Poop) Far More Than Previously Thought\nWorld’s Largest Whales Eat 3x More Than Previously Thought, Amplifying Their Role As Global Ecosystem Engineers\nScientists Use Whale Carcasses to Help Answer Mysteries of Elusive Species\nBlue Whales Return to South Georgia After Near Extinction From Whaling 50 Years Ago\nResearchers Report That Anthropogenic CO2 Emissions Have Raised Ocean Acidity\nJacques Cousteau Predicted Detrimental Change in Coral Reefs"},{"t":"华为发布构网型储能变流器（PCS）","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/huawei-unveils-grid-forming-pcs/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"构网型PCS","kp":["[构网型PCS]: 集成硬件+电站级控制+AI能量管理"],"sc":8.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"华为发布新型构网型储能变流器(PCS)解决方案，集成PCS硬件、电站级控制系统和基于AI的能源管理平台。构网型PCS可在无电网支撑的情况下自主建立电压和频率参考，为弱电网和高比例新能源并网场景提供电网支撑能力。该方案面向大规模储能电站应用，提升了新能源场站的电网惯量和稳定性。","ot":"Huawei unveils grid-forming PCS - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nThe new solution combines PCS hardware, plant-level controls and AI-based energy management.\nVincent Shaw\nTechnology & Products\nEnergy Storage\nUtility-scale\nImage: pv magazine\nHuawei Digital Power has launched a new generation of smart string grid-forming power conversion system (PCS) at SNEC 2026 in Shanghai, expanding its grid-forming technology portfolio across energy storage, PV and load-side applications.\nThe company presented the solution during its FusionSolar strategy and product launch event on June 3 under the theme “Building the green power driving force for an intelligent world.” The announcement also covered the FusionSolar Agent energy AI architecture.\nThe new PCS platform includes a 430 kW smart string grid-forming PCS, an intelligent sub-array controller, an intelligent plant controller and an intelligent plant management system. Huawei said the system is designed as a core control unit for energy storage plants, integrating battery management and grid-stability functions.\nThe 430 kW PCS uses a 1,000 V AC architecture and supports a DC operating voltage range of 550 V to 1,500 V. According to Huawei, the wide voltage range enables compatibility with lithium-ion, sodium-ion and other battery chemistries. The company claims a system cycle efficiency of 97.8%, compared with an industry average of 96.7%, while the power converter efficiency reaches 99.35%.\nThe system supports six grid-forming functions: short-circuit current support, virtual inertia, wide-band oscillation suppression, fast primary frequency regulation, minute-level black start capability and seamless on-grid/off-grid switching. It also features string-level DC management to improve availability and operational visibility.\nZhou Tao, president of Huawei Digital Power’s Smart PV & ESS product line, said the string grid-forming PCS is “not simply a power converter but an intelligent brain for energy storage plants, combining string architecture with dual-stage power conversion to improve reliability, voltage compatibility and grid support capability.”\nHuawei is also promoting a 4S architecture around the PCS, covering PCS, BMS, EMS and TMS. The company said it is working with more than 20 DC-side ecosystem partners and more than 10 AC-side partners, and has already deployed several demonstration projects.\nThe second launch was an updated version of the FusionSolar Agent architecture. First introduced in 2025, the latest version shifts from a digital platform approach to an energy-domain AI agent model. The architecture focuses on four areas: value, capability, safety and interaction, and is designed to support full lifecycle management of renewable power plants, including sensing, analysis, decision-making, coordination and continuous optimization.\nHuawei also showcased its wider FusionSolar portfolio at SNEC, including FusionSolar 9.0, a 460 kW smart string inverter, smart microgrid solutions, commercial and industrial source-grid-load-storage systems, residential PV-storage systems and an AIDC source-grid-load-storage solution for AI data centers.\nThe company said these developments reflect a broader industry shift in renewable energy from capacity expansion toward system-level value optimization.\nVincent Shaw\nView author posts"},{"t":"冰是如何形成的还是个谜——现在科学家正在破解这个谜团","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01817-w","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Theories about how ice crystals grow in cooling liquids are wildly inaccurate when compared with experimental data, but studies are starting to illuminate the earliest moments in freezing. Theories about how ice crystals grow in cooling liquids are wildly inaccurate when compared with experimental data, but studies are starting to illuminate the earliest moments in freezing."},{"t":"瘤胃 6-羟基褪黑激素的宿主基因调控可减少奶牛的甲烷排放","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604454123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"The mechanisms linking host genetics to ruminal methane emissions remain unclear. Here, we integrated multiomics data from 304 lactating cows and demonstrated that methane emission per dry matter intake (M/D) exhibitd higher heritability (\n                    \n                      h\n                      2\n                    \n                    = 0.42) than microbiability (\n                    \n                      m\n                      2\n                    \n                    = 0.19), highlighting the predominant role of host genetics. Mendelian randomization (MR) analysis identified three heritable\n                    Prevotella\n                    species (including\n                    Prevotella_bryantii\n                    ) that causally reduce methane emissions. Network suggested that\n                    Prevotella_bryantii\n                    , which harbors the [NiFe]_Group_1d hydrogenase, exerts this effect by competing with methanogens for H₂. Furthermore, the methane-reducing effect of\n                    Prevotella _bryantii\n                    was confirmed by in vitro fermentation experiments. To trace the host regulation upstream, the host-derived metabolite 6-hydroxymelatonin was identified as a key regulator that positively influences these\n                    Prevotella\n                    species by MR analysis, which was further validated by in vitro fermentation and pure bacterial culture experiments. Genome-wide association studies linked ruminal 6-hydroxymelatonin levels to host genetic variants (e.g., 5:106926534) near candidate genes including\n                    ITFG\n                    2. Functional studies in bovine hepatocytes revealed that\n                    ITFG\n                    2 knockdown activated the mTORC1 pathway, upregulated\n                    CYP\n                    1\n                    A\n                    2 expression, and increased 6-hydroxymelatonin synthesis. Furthermore, cattle carrying the TA genotype at 5:106926534 exhibited significantly lower predicted and measured methane emissions. Collectively, this study unveils a pathway whereby host genetics (via\n                    ITFG\n                    2/mTORC1) modulate hepatic 6-hydroxymelatonin synthesis, which enriches specific rumen\n                    Prevotella\n                    that compete with methanogens for hydrogen, thereby reducing methane.","tp":"甲烷减排法","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究整合了304头泌乳奶牛的多组学数据，揭示瘤胃6-羟基褪黑激素的宿主基因调控与甲烷排放之间的关联。研究发现单位干物质采食量的甲烷排放遗传力（h²=0.42）显著高于微生物可遗传性（m²=0.19），为通过宿主基因选育降低奶牛甲烷排放提供了分子靶标。","aip":1},{"t":"海辰储能推出1300Ah电芯与6.9MWh系统，瞄准8小时储能","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/hithium-targets-8-hour-storage-with-1300-ah-cell-and-6-9-mwh-system/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"pv magazine","tg":"产业进展","tp":"长时储能电芯","kp":["电芯容量[LFP电池]: 1300Ah","系统容量[储能系统]: 6.9MW/55.2MWh","储能时长[系统]: 8小时"],"sc":9.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":8.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"中国电池制造商海辰储能(Hithium)推出面向4-8小时长时储能应用的大容量1300Ah电芯和6.9MWh集装箱储能系统。大容量电芯可降低系统单位成本和占地面积，提升能量密度。该产品在2026年上海SNEC展会上亮相，瞄准电网侧长时储能市场，应对可再生能源消纳对更长放电时长的需求。","ot":"Hithium targets 8-hour storage with 1300 Ah cell and 6.9 MWh system - pv magazine Global","cl":"335db3e8c2","cp":0,"cln":"海辰储能|1300Ah电芯+6.9MWh系统|SNEC发布|2026-06-10","b":"Technology & Products\nThe Chinese battery manufacturer is targeting 4- to 8-hour energy storage applications with new large-format cells and containerized systems.\nVincent Shaw\nTechnology & Products\nEnergy Storage\nUtility-scale\nImage: pv magazine\nithium presented two large-format energy storage cells and associated containerized systems at SNEC 2026 in Shanghai, as it expands its focus on the long-duration energy storage segment.\nThe company introduced the mass-production version of its ∞Cell 1300 Ah LFP cell, first announced in December 2025, alongside the first mass-production-level display of its ∞Power 6.9 MW/55.2 MWh eight-hour containerized storage system based on the cell. It also presented its ∞Cell 650 Ah cell and an ∞Power 10+ MWh system. The products were shown under the exhibition theme “Long-Duration Powering, Green Energy Enduring.”\nHithium said the 1300 Ah cell is designed for eight-hour storage applications. The company stated that the cell was developed based on system-level requirements, including 20-foot container dimensions, international transport constraints, and 1,500 V DC system architectures commonly used in energy storage.\nAccording to the company, the ∞Cell 1300 Ah uses LFP chemistry, with a nominal capacity of 1300 Ah, gravimetric energy density of at least 190 Wh/kg, volumetric energy density of at least 406 Wh/L, and a design life exceeding 25 years. HiTHIUM said the cell incorporates materials and structural optimizations to reduce temperature rise.\nThe ∞Power 6.9 MWh system uses a 4 × 1P416S configuration, liquid cooling, and CAN, RS485, and Ethernet communications. The company lists system-level gravimetric energy density of at least 135 Wh/kg and volumetric energy density of at least 160 Wh/L. The system supports side-by-side and back-to-back deployment and features low-noise cooling, a low-GWP refrigerant, recyclable structural components, and multi-stage active fire detection and protection. It is designed to comply with NFPA 855.\nHithium said the newly introduced 650 Ah cell and ∞Power 10+ MWh system are intended to expand its large-format product portfolio. Public information on the 650 Ah cell remains limited. The company said the platform is designed to improve project economics through higher energy density and improved system integration efficiency. Delivery is expected to begin in 2027.\nThe launch builds on Hithium’s long-duration storage roadmap over the past year.\nIn December 2024, the company introduced 1175 Ah and 587 Ah cells and a 6.25 MWh system, which it later said entered mass production and global delivery. In December 2025, it launched the ∞Cell 1300 Ah cell and the ∞Power 6.9 MW/55.2 MWh eight-hour system concept, with mass delivery planned for the fourth quarter of 2026.\nHiTHIUM has also outlined manufacturing plans in Chongqing and Heze, Shandong province, with more than 70 GWh of planned long-duration storage capacity expected to support deliveries from 2027. The company said its portfolio now covers 1- to 8-hour applications, combining LFP and sodium-ion technologies for utility-scale, commercial and industrial, and residential use cases.\nVincent Shaw\nView author posts"},{"t":"海辰储能推出1300Ah电芯与6.9MWh系统，瞄准8小时储能","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/09/hithium-targets-8-hour-storage-with-1300-ah-cell-and-6-9-mwh-system/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","tg":"产业进展","tp":"长时储能系统","kp":["电芯容量[LFP量产]: 1300Ah","系统容量[8h储能]: 6.9MW/55.2MWh","储能时长[系统]: 8小时"],"sc":8.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":8.0,"r":4.0,"d":8.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"海辰储能在2026年上海SNEC展会上发布两款大容量储能电芯及配套集装箱系统，重点面向4-8小时长时储能应用场景。新产品采用大尺寸电芯设计以降低系统BOM成本和提升能量密度。该布局反映了储能行业向更长时长、更低度电成本方向发展的趋势，满足电网级储能对长时放电能力的需求。","ot":"Hithium targets 8-hour storage with 1300 Ah cell and 6.9 MWh system - Energy Storage","cl":"335db3e8c2","cp":1,"cln":"海辰储能|1300Ah电芯+6.9MWh系统|SNEC发布|2026-06-10","b":"Hithium presented two large-format energy storage cells and associated containerized systems at SNEC 2026 in Shanghai, as it expands its focus on the long-duration energy storage segment.\nThe company introduced the mass-production version of its ∞Cell 1300 Ah LFP cell, first announced in December 2025, alongside the first mass-production-level display of its ∞Power 6.9 MW/55.2 MWh eight-hour containerized storage system based on the cell. It also presented its ∞Cell 650 Ah cell and an ∞Power 10+ MWh system. The products were shown under the exhibition theme “Long-Duration Powering, Green Energy Enduring.”\nHithium said the 1300 Ah cell is designed for eight-hour storage applications. The company stated that the cell was developed based on system-level requirements, including 20-foot container dimensions, international transport constraints, and 1,500 V DC system architectures commonly used in energy storage.\nAccording to the company, the ∞Cell 1300 Ah uses LFP chemistry, with a nominal capacity of 1300 Ah, gravimetric energy density of at least 190 Wh/kg, volumetric energy density of at least 406 Wh/L, and a design life exceeding 25 years. HiTHIUM said the cell incorporates materials and structural optimizations to reduce temperature rise.\nThe ∞Power 6.9 MWh system uses a 4 × 1P416S configuration, liquid cooling, and CAN, RS485, and Ethernet communications. The company lists system-level gravimetric energy density of at least 135 Wh/kg and volumetric energy density of at least 160 Wh/L. The system supports side-by-side and back-to-back deployment and features low-noise cooling, a low-GWP refrigerant, recyclable structural components, and multi-stage active fire detection and protection. It is designed to comply with NFPA 855.\nHithium said the newly introduced 650 Ah cell and ∞Power 10+ MWh system are intended to expand its large-format product portfolio. Public information on the 650 Ah cell remains limited. The company said the platform is designed to improve project economics through higher energy density and improved system integration efficiency. Delivery is expected to begin in 2027.\nThe launch builds on Hithium’s long-duration storage roadmap over the past year.\nIn December 2024, the company introduced 1175 Ah and 587 Ah cells and a 6.25 MWh system, which it later said entered mass production and global delivery. In December 2025, it launched the ∞Cell 1300 Ah cell and the ∞Power 6.9 MW/55.2 MWh eight-hour system concept, with mass delivery planned for the fourth quarter of 2026.\nHiTHIUM has also outlined manufacturing plans in Chongqing and Heze, Shandong province, with more than 70 GWh of planned long-duration storage capacity expected to support deliveries from 2027. The company said its portfolio now covers 1- to 8-hour applications, combining LFP and sodium-ion technologies for utility-scale, commercial and industrial, and residential use cases."},{"t":"高能面取向介孔单晶金属氧化物用于选择性氧化催化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73641?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"介孔单晶氧化物","kp":["[介孔单晶金属氧化物]: 无模板能量驱动高能晶面取向结晶"],"dp":1,"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究报道了具有高能面取向的介孔单晶金属氧化物材料的合成及其在选择性氧化催化反应中的应用。介孔单晶结构兼具高比表面积和优异的晶面效应，高能暴露晶面提供更丰富的催化活性位点。该材料在选择性氧化反应中展现出增强的催化活性和产物选择性，为设计高效多相催化剂提供了晶面工程与多孔结构协同调控的新策略。","ot":"High‐Energy‐Facet‐Oriented Mesoporous Single‐Crystal Metal Oxides for Selective Oxidation Catalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mesoporous single‐crystal metal oxides are highly attractive for heterogeneous catalysis because they combine high surface accessibility with long‐range lattice coherence; however, their synthesis remains fundamentally challenging due to the thermodynamic incompatibility between crystallization and pore formation. Here we report a template‐free, energy‐driven facet‐oriented crystallization strategy that enables the formation of mesoporous single‐crystal metal oxides with tunable pore architectures and exposed high‐energy facets. Polyvinylpyrrolidone functions simultaneously as a pore maintainer and surface‐energy regulator, preserving mesoporosity while selectively stabilizing high‐energy facets to direct single‐crystal growth. The method is applicable to multiple oxides, including Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , MgO, NiO, and mixed‐metal systems. As a representative example, mesoporous single‐crystal Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    with preferentially exposed (111) facets exhibits outstanding performance in the selective oxidation of aromatic alkanes, achieving up to 99% conversion and selectivity under mild conditions. Experimental and theoretical analyses suggest that the synergy between mesoporosity and active‐facet exposure enhances reactant adsorption, oxygen activation, and reaction kinetics, providing a general design principle for crystallographically defined porous catalysts."},{"t":"高效靶向线粒体转移和 AUTAC4 增强双重更新策略治疗类风湿关节炎 (Adv.","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73488?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","b":"Dual Renewal Strategy for Rheumatoid Arthritis Inspired by Chinese philosophy, this cover illustrates a dual-action mitochondrial renewal therapy (DAMRT) for rheumatoid arthritis. Like a lotus leaf, a folate-modified macrophage membrane precisely encapsulates healthy mitochondria and AUTAC4. This biomimetic system targets inflamed joints, delivering fresh mitochondria while degrading dysfunctional ones to effectively restore cellular metabolic homeostasis. More details can be found in the Research Article by Ke Xu, Yan Hu, Long Bai, Jiacan Su, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202514070)."},{"t":"二碳分子的高激发电子态：从光谱学到动力学","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73631?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The dicarbon molecule (C\n                    2\n                    ) serves not only as a benchmark for studying chemical bonding, but also as an elementary building block in the bottom‐up synthesis of carbon materials, and a key species in astrochemistry. The spectroscopic and dynamic studies of C\n                    2\n                    have lasted for longer than two centuries, which provide invaluable insights into its complex electronic structure manifested as dense manifolds of low‐lying electronic states, quasi‐degenerate frontier orbitals, and significant multi‐configurational characters. From a materials perspective, spectroscopic and dynamical insights into the excited states of C\n                    2\n                    are pivotal for controlling the non‐equilibrium carbon chemistry in chemical vapor deposition (CVD) processes, where C\n                    2\n                    acts as a primary building block. Here, we present a comprehensive review of recent progress on the spectroscopic and dynamic study of C\n                    2\n                    , focusing on its highly excited states near or above the lowest dissociation threshold. These advances not only led to the identification of several new highly excited states but also provided important information on the decay dynamics in excited states, including state‐specific lifetimes and predissociation dynamics. Despite these advances, our understanding of the predissociation dynamics of C\n                    2\n                    remains limited; thus, several future prospects are proposed, and implications for the precise controlled synthesis of carbon materials are also mentioned.","tp":"C2光谱学","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.5,"t":3.0},"as":"二碳分子（C₂）不仅是研究化学键理论的基准体系，也是碳材料自下而上合成的基本构建单元和天体化学中的关键物种。该综述系统梳理了长达两个多世纪的C₂光谱学和动力学研究进展，深入解析其复杂电子结构的高激发态特征，为碳基材料设计和星际化学研究提供基础理论支撑。"},{"t":"隐藏的太阳风暴可能会用巨大的红色极光照亮日本的天空","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/?p=521997","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"scitechdaily","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Unusually tall red auroras over Japan may be revealing that some solar storms are stronger than scientists realize.\nA study published in the\nJournal of Space Weather and Space Climate\nreports that red auroras observed over Japan extended to altitudes of roughly 500-800 kilometers above Earth.\nThe discovery was made by researchers from\nHokkaido University\nand the Okinawa Institute of Science and Technology, who examined several auroral events that occurred between June 2024 and March 2025.\nAuroras are typically associated with geomagnetic storms, which occur when streams of charged particles from the Sun disturb Earth’s magnetic field. Bright auroras are most commonly seen near the polar regions, but they can occasionally appear farther south, including over Japan, during especially strong storms.\nWhen red auroras occur at these lower latitudes, they are generally found at altitudes of around 200 to 400 kilometers. The newly observed events, however, reached much higher into space than expected.\n“We found that red auroras can extend to extremely high altitudes even during those storms that are measured as moderately intense. I was really surprised because I didn’t expect such tall auroras to appear even during moderately intense storms,” says Tomohiro M. Nakayama, lead author of the study. “This suggests that these storms may actually be stronger than conventional indices indicate.”\nVideo of a low-latitude aurora observed on November 9, 2024, in Otaru, Hokkaido, Japan. Credit: Tomohiro M. Nakayama\nTo better understand what was happening, the researchers analyzed five auroral events recorded from Hokkaido. During each event, incoming bursts of charged solar particles compressed Earth’s magnetosphere, the protective magnetic region surrounding the planet.\nAlthough standard measurements classified the storms as only moderate in strength, the compression of the magnetosphere was unusually intense.\nThe research team believes dense streams of solar wind may have dramatically squeezed Earth’s magnetic shield, heating the upper atmosphere and pushing the region where red auroras form to much higher altitudes. At the same time, the movement of charged particles away from the region may have made the storms appear weaker than they truly were, masking their actual intensity.\nIf correct, the findings suggest that some geomagnetic storms could be more powerful than current space weather indices indicate.\nThe researchers combined satellite observations with photographs taken by citizen scientists across Japan. Using the images, they measured the apparent elevation of the auroras and traced their positions along Earth’s magnetic field lines to estimate how high the glowing structures extended.\nContributions from observers throughout the country proved especially valuable. Because the auroras were photographed from multiple locations, the team was able to reconstruct rare events in greater detail than would have been possible using traditional observation networks alone.\nThe findings are important for more than understanding beautiful displays in the night sky.\nWhen the upper atmosphere becomes heated, it expands. This increases atmospheric drag on satellites orbiting Earth, which can alter their trajectories and cause some spacecraft to lose altitude faster than expected.\n“As the number of satellites in low Earth orbit continues to grow, understanding these effects is increasingly important,” says Nakayama. “Our results could help improve space weather forecasting and support safer satellite operations.”\nReference: “Faint red auroras as seen from Japan associated with intense magnetospheric compression” by Tomohiro M. Nakayama and Ryuho Kataoka, 19 May 2026,\nJournal of Space Weather and Space Climate\nDOI: 10.1051/swsc/2026004\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nAtmospheric Science\nHokkaido University\nSpace Weather\nEdge of Space: The Science of NASA’s AIM Spacecraft\nNewly Discovered Atmospheric Circulation Enhances Heatwaves and Wildfires Around the Arctic\nDiffuse Auroral Eraser: Physicists Discover a New Type of Aurora\nSocial Network Inspired Algorithms Reveal Lifecycle of Auroral Substorms, a Key Element of Space Weather\nRare & Magical Pulsating Aurora Lights: Killer Electrons in Strumming Sky Lights\nAurora, Meet Airglow: Two of Earth’s Most Colorful Atmospheric Phenomena Meet in Stunning Photo From Space Station\nAmateur Photographers Have Discovered a New Form of the Northern Lights\nNASA Scientists Reveal the Role of Electrons in Pulsating Auroras\nImage of the Aurora Australis Over Concordia Station","tp":"隐形太阳风","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.5},"as":"日本北海道大学和冲绳科学技术研究所的研究发现，日本上空观测到的异常高大红色极光延伸至约500-800公里高度，暗示部分太阳风暴的实际强度可能被低估。该研究发表于《空间天气与空间气候期刊》，分析了2024年6月至2025年3月间的多次极光事件，为提升太阳风暴监测和空间天气预报能力提供了新证据。"},{"t":"哈雷LiveWire新款S4电动摩托车定价出乎意料地低","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/09/harleys-livewire-reveals-surprisingly-low-pricing-on-new-s4-electric-motorcycles/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动摩托车","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"as":"哈雷戴维森旗下电动摩托车品牌LiveWire公布了全新S4系列电动摩托车的定价，价格低于市场预期。S4系列定位中端市场，旨在扩大电动摩托车的大众可及性。该车型延续了LiveWire的电动动力平台，在续航和性能方面针对城市通勤场景优化。较低定价策略反映了电动摩托车市场竞争加剧和品牌下沉趋势。","ot":"Harley's LiveWire reveals surprisingly low pricing on new S4 electric motorcycles","b":"| Jun 9 2026 - 6:36 am PT\nDespite being unveiled\nless than a year ago\n, it feels like we’ve been waiting forever for LiveWire’s new S4 Honcho to reveal its official pricing and begin production. Today, we got both, as the Harley-Davidson spinoff pulled the last curtain off, revealing the final secrets behind the brand’s new low-cost electric motorcycles headed to streets and trails near you soon.\nis seen as LiveWire’s attempt to break into the e-moto market, dominated by small, affordable, and approachable electric two-wheelers with enough power and range for a good time, but modest enough to keep pricing reasonable.\nThe company has already shown us two versions of the bike, the S4 Honcho Trail designed for off-road shenanigans, and the street-legal S4 Honcho Street designed for commuter fun and urban riding.\nOfficial pricing was just announced, putting the S4 Honcho Trail at US $4,999 and the S4 Honcho Street at $5,499. Those figures landed lower than some analysts had expected, especially considering the lofty launch pricing previously seen on LiveWire’s\nlarger flagship electric motorcycles.\nBoth S4 models share similar performance and tech specs, including a pair of removable batteries totaling 3.5 kWh and offering an estimated mixed range of 53 miles (85 km), or a 20 mph (32 km/h) sustained range of up to 73 miles (117 km), with those figures determined using the somewhat optimistic World Motorcycle Test Cycle standard.\nThe bikes use an IEC 62196-6 charging connector and claim a 20-80% recharge time of 2 hours. The 120V charging is similar to most electric mini-motos, meaning a dedicated wall charger converts AC electricity into DC, similar to the charger for an electric bicycle. It’s a simple and low-cost (not to mention low-weight) solution, but it rules out the ability to charge via a local network of public Level 2 chargers.\nThat’s par for the course in this class, but it may come as a disappointment to those hoping to take advantage of nearby public charging stations.\nOn the other hand, though, it sure does make it easy to guerrilla charge at work on your boss’s dime when charging your motorcycle is effectively the same as charging your laptop.\nWith a top speed of 59 mph (95 km/h) and a 0-30 mph (0-48 km/h) time of 3.0 seconds, they pack enough performance for fun riding but aren’t exactly highway-screamers (though the Trail version shouldn’t see any highways anyway due to it not being homologated for public road use like the Street version).\nAs the company describes it, “With instant torque, rugged design, and punchy acceleration, S4 Honcho is made for errands, backroads, and everything in between. Whether you’re chasing first light at your fishing spot, or chasing green lights during your commute, Honcho keeps it fun.”\nWhile the performance figures are largely identical, the main differences in the two bikes versions, other than street legality, are the physical dimensions and the warranty. The Trail bike weighs 253 lb (116 kg) and has a 29-inch seat height (74 cm), while the Street version weighs a bit more with its homologated gear, tipping the scales at 266 lb (120 kg) and with a seat height of 30 inches (76 cm).\nThe Trail version includes a one year unlimited mileage warranty, while the street version doubles that to a two-year unlimited mileage warranty.\nThe company also shared images on social media showing the first bikes coming off the production line and being packaged for shipping, meaning we should be hoping for deliveries coming soon this summer.\nStarting at US $4,999 and $5,499 respectively, it’s apparent that LiveWire understands how price sensitive the mini-moto market is. Not only is the S4 Honcho competing against electric trail bikes like Sur Rons and Talarias, but also against established gasoline-powered mini-motorcycles like the Honda Grom.\nCompared to both categories, the S4 Honcho comes in only slightly more expensive than its competitors, though it has a major leg up on both. For the off-road category, the S4 Honcho Trail is backed by a major national brand (LiveWire), which itself is backed by an even more major international brand (Harley-Davidson). For example, if my LiveWire S2 Del Mar ever needs service, I have a Harley-Davidson dealership down the road. If a Sur Ron ever needs service, you’re usually stuck watching a shaky YouTube video that some 15-year-old filmed on his phone.\nAnd compared to street-legal mini-motos like a Honda Grom, the S4 Honcho Street has another major advantage: it’s electric. No one buys a mini-moto for the looks or the swagger – they do it for the convenience and cost of ownership. Those are two areas where electric motorcycles excel. Riders start every day fully fueled up, never have to seek out a gas station, and can spend literally pennies per week on electricity. Add in the major maintenance savings of electric drive, and you’ve got a seriously compelling case for switching from internal combustion to battery power.\nWith the S4 Honcho’s specs and pricing now fully revealed, there remains just one final question: Will anyone buy them? That remains to be seen, but if so, the S4 could be the saving grace LiveWire needs.\nBut I can at least tell you that they’ve likely got one sale already made, because I can sure see my name on a new S4 Honcho Street soon.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nMicah Toll is a personal electric vehicle enthusiast, battery nerd, and author of the Amazon #1 bestselling books\nDIY Lithium Batteries\nDIY Solar Power,\nThe Ultimate DIY Ebike Guide\nThe Electric Bike Manifesto\nThe e-bikes that make up Micah’s current daily drivers are the\n$999 Lectric XP 2.0\n$1,095 Ride1Up Roadster V2\n$1,199 Rad Power Bikes RadMission\n$3,299 Priority Current\n. But it’s a pretty evolving list these days.\nBest $999 electric bike ever!\nGreat e-bikes at great prices!"},{"t":"卤素离子调控聚三嗪亚胺结晶以实现高效光催化全分解水","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/matter/fulltext/S2590-2385(26)00224-9?rss=yes","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Matter","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化全解水","kp":["[材料]: 聚三嗪亚胺(PTI)","[策略]: 卤化物离子调控熔盐结晶","[应用]: 光催化全解水"],"sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究开发了一种卤素离子调控结晶策略，通过调节熔盐离子组成，合成出高结晶度的聚三嗪酰亚胺(PTI)光催化材料。卤素离子的引入有效调控了聚合物的晶体生长方向和缺陷密度，优化了光生载流子的分离与迁移效率。该材料在可见光驱动下实现了高效的光催化全解水反应，为无牺牲剂条件下太阳能制氢提供了新路径。","ot":"Halide ion-modulated crystallization of poly(triazine imide) for efficient photocatalytic overall water splitting","b":"A halide ion-modulated crystallization strategy is developed by tuning the molten salt ion composition, yielding poly(triazine imide) (PTI) with high crystallinity and partial ion depletion. The resulting structure effectively regulates defect states and charge carrier dynamics, suppresses multiple recombination pathways, facilitates charge transport and separation, and significantly improves solar to hydrogen conversion efficiency."},{"t":"H2sea获OMG-H2工程设计合同","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://hydrogentechworld.com/h2sea-wins-omg-h2-engineering-role","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Hydrogen Tech World","tg":"产业进展","tp":"海上氢能工程","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":7.0},"as":"H2sea公司获得OMG-H2项目的工程服务合同。同时，H2U与Vopak将合作推进Gladstone H2-Hub™绿氢枢纽项目。这些动态反映了澳大利亚绿氢产业链的加速布局，涵盖从工程设计到储存基础设施的多个环节，表明绿氢项目正从规划阶段向工程实施推进。","ot":"H2sea wins OMG-H2 engineering role","b":"H2U and Vopak to collaborate on H2-Hub™ Gladstone project"},{"t":"从源头做好回收——造福全球","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01823-y","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"家庭废物分类","sc":3.3,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"as":"新研究证实了家庭源头垃圾分类的显著环境效益。研究表明，居民在家庭层面进行可回收物与厨余垃圾的分类，可大幅提升后续回收效率并降低处理成本。但研究同时强调，相关政策需审慎考虑消费者行为的激励机制和便利性设计，避免因规则复杂或执行不便导致参与率下降。该发现为城市废物管理政策制定提供了实证依据。","ot":"Good recycling starts at home — and benefits the world","b":"New research supports the value of household-level waste separation. But policies must also carefully consider consumer behaviours to maximize the quality of material collected. New research supports the value of household-level waste separation. But policies must also carefully consider consumer behaviours to maximize the quality of material collected."},{"t":"FeOOH 纳米纺锤中谷胱甘肽诱导的原位氧空位促进声催化肿瘤治疗","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6524839?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Defect engineering can enhance carrier separation in sonocatalysts to boost reactive oxygen species (ROS) generation; however, the current methods still rely on in vitro physicochemical defect introduction that lacks tumor specificity and poses a risk of off‐target activation. Herein, we developed FeOOH nanospindles in which glutathione (GSH) within tumor cells triggers the formation of in situ oxygen vacancies (O\n                    vac\n                    ), promoting ROS generation during sonocatalytic therapy (SCT) to enhance antitumor efficacy while minimizing off‐target toxicity. The introduction of O\n                    vac\n                    narrows the bandgap, raises the Fermi level, promotes charge separation, and inhibits electron‐hole recombination, thereby significantly enhancing the sonocatalytic production of\n                    1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    . Concurrently, Fe\n                    3+\n                    ions catalyze oxygen evolution to alleviate tumor hypoxia, while Fe\n                    3+\n                    ions are reduced to Fe\n                    2+\n                    ions by GSH, which mediate the Fenton reaction, generating toxic •OH under ultrasound irradiation. This “three‐in‐one” design ingeniously integrates tumor microenvironment (TME) responsiveness, in situ defect engineering, and multiple catalytic mechanisms to disrupt redox homeostasis and trigger apoptosis and ferroptosis synergistically. By enabling in situ activation and site‐specific amplification of therapeutic functions, this work offers a great promise for advancing precision oncology and overcoming the current limitations of ROS‐based tumor therapies.","tp":"声催化治癌","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"该研究开发了FeOOH纳米纺锤体声敏剂，利用肿瘤细胞内谷胱甘肽（GSH）触发原位氧空位生成，克服了传统缺陷工程依赖体外物理化学引入、缺乏肿瘤特异性和易脱靶激活的风险。该策略增强了载流子分离和活性氧（ROS）生成，显著提升了声动力肿瘤治疗效果。"},{"t":"2025年全球光伏跟踪支架市场增长19%","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/global-solar-tracker-market-grew-19-in-2025/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"Wood Mackenzie分析报告显示，2025年全球太阳能跟踪支架出货量创历史新高，达134 GWdc，同比增长19%。跟踪支架通过实时调整光伏板朝向以最大化发电效率，已成为大型地面电站的核心组件，市场增速反映全球 Utility-scale 光伏装机持续扩张。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏跟踪支架","kp":["年出货量[全球光伏跟踪器]: 134 GWdc","年增长率[全球光伏跟踪器]: 19%"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Global solar tracker market grew 19% in 2025 - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nAnalysis by Wood Mackenzie finds global tracker shipments reached a record 134 GWdc last year, with US-based Nextpower maintaining the largest market share for the eleventh consecutive year.\nPatrick Jowett\nTechnology & Products\nImage: Nextpower\nThe global solar tracker market increased 19% year-on-year in 2025 with more than 134 GWdc of equipment shipping, according to analysis by\nWood Mackenzie\n. The result is a record year for global tracker shipments, outperforming the\nmaintained its top global position for the eleventh straight year, with its core tracker business growing to nearly 40 GWdc of shipments globally.\nGamechange Energy\nArchtech Solar\nArray Technologies\nrounded out the top five worldwide, representing the same group as the previous two years.\nWood Mackenzie’s analysis says Gamechange Energy enjoyed a particularly strong year for shipments to India and Africa, the latter of which it says its the fastest growing region for tracker demand. Arctech’s performance last year was highlighted by success in Saudi Arabia, which surpassed Spain as the third largest tracker market.\nThe US domestic tracker demand rebounded by more than 25% compared to 2024, surpassing 40 GWdc of shipments for the first time. Nextpower extended its market share above 50% in the US, widening its gap over Array Technologies and Gamechange. Together, these three companies account for nearly 90% of the entire US solar tracker market.\nJoe Shangraw, Research Analyst at Wood Mackenzie, says the US market remains uniquely important to the top American vendors.\n“Not only is the revenue-per-watt significantly higher than international averages, but the US is the epicenter for tracker innovation in this current era of mergers and acquisitions activity, smart software and expanded product offerings,” Shangraw said. “Success in the US is the best tool for global expansion.”\nEurope’s tracker market also grew last year, reaching a new shipment record of 25 GWdc. Valencia-headquartered\ncaptured the highest market share in Europe, Wood Mackenzie says, thanks to its key markets in EU countries, such as Italy, where funding its being used to support dual land use projects.\nPatrick Jowett\nView author posts"},{"t":"Glint Solar任命Otovo联合创始人为CEO，瞄准美国市场扩张与数据中心业务","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/glint-solar-names-otovo-co-founder-as-ceo-targets-us-expansion-and-data-center-push/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"挪威太阳能选址分析平台Glint Solar任命Otovo联合创始人Simen Fure Jørgensen为新任CEO，战略重心转向美国市场拓展及数据中心供电需求。此举反映AI驱动的数据中心正成为可再生能源开发的新兴大客户，选址智能化工具需求上升。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"光伏项目开发","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Glint Solar names Otovo co-founder as CEO, targets US expansion and data center push - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nFounder Harald Olderheim tells pv magazine time is right for Otovo co-founder Simen Fure Jørgensen to take on chief executive role, as the company pursues trans-Atlantic growth strategy. Adding data center features to solar and battery energy storage system (BESS) project design tools is a natural next step, according to Jørgensen.\nMatthew Lynas\nTechnology & Products\nEnergy Storage\nUtility-scale\nHarald Olderheim (left) and Simen Fure Jørgensen have set out ambitious expansion plans for the Glint Solar business, including more features for the AI data center sector. | Image: Glint Solar\nGlint Solar is targeting expansion in the US market and seeking new opportunities in the data center segment – and the Norwegian solar and battery storage software company has appointed a new CEO to support its ambitions.\nSimen Fure Jørgensen brings AI sector and startup scaling experience to Glint Solar. Jørgensen was the co-founder of Otovo, a European residential solar platform that uses Ai monitoring for system optimization.\n“It was my idea to get him in,” said Harald Olderheim, co-founder of Glint Solar and now former CEO. “I’ve seen what he’s done with Otovo and he scaled the team to 400 people and took it on the stock exchange. He took a Norwegian solar software tech company to a lot of countries so I asked him to join.”\nOlderheim told\nhe will still be active in the business, leading the company’s US expansion. Olderheim argued that to succeed in the US market “you really need a good founder presence.”\nThe sales pitch to the US solar industry will likely focus on protecting investment for renewables and data center developers by using software tools to develop the most viable sites. “It’s really about de-risking the development pipeline,” Jørgensen explained, highlighting Spain as an example of a market where a high volume of solar projects were cut from the grid connection queue after they were deemed not viable.\n“I don’t know how many millions of euros went out the door there, but that had to be a lot of lost cash,” Jørgensen said.\nAs it pursues US expansion, the core business for Glint Solar remains unchanged – offering software tools for identifying and designing utility-scale solar and battery storage projects – but with plans to increasingly incorporate features for data center developers.\n“This is an enormous market,” said Jørgensen. “Hundreds of billions of dollars are being poured into this, and speed to power is crucial for data centers.”\nAI tools such as a project visualization feature have also been integrated on Glint Solar’s platform, and Jørgensen teased a new customer facing AI assistant for developers that is currently in beta testing.\n“You can ask the agent to basically go over millions of potential sites and ask to get a ranked list of the top 100 sites in one US state, for example,” he said.\nOther recent additions to the range include a battery storage noise calculator which models the impact on the area surrounding a proposed BESS installation. Noise pollution is a common objection to BESS proposals and modeling this kind of impact can help streamline applications for planning consent, according to Glint Solar. It’s the type of feature the company hopes it can sell to the data center industry.\n“Early engagement from the community helps a lot, when [developers] are talking to them they can show that this will not be a problem,” Olderheim explained. “You can easily put up a noise wall in the software – it takes two seconds – and then you can see how that affects the noise, and this helps to have the community with you.”\nJørgensen also highlighted how renewables developers in many markets are facing shifting regulations, which he sees as an opportunity for Glint Solar as investors are forced to quickly adapt designs to meet new requirements. The new CEO highlighted ongoing reform in the German market as an example.\n“In Germany, we have these flexible connection agreements. But the German authorities change their minds on how this should work. We can change the setup for your project within a couple of clicks. For the siting, for the connection agreements and so on.”\nEuropean solar and storage professionals will also be able to get hands-on experience of Glint Solar product development at Intersolar Europe at The smarter E exhibition in Munich from June 23.\nOlderheim said Glint Solar will have engineers at the exhibition who are tasked with creating functional design software on the spot through what they call “Glint Labs”.\n“At Intersolar they can join us, say what they want, and then 20 minutes or half an hour later they can see the [software] feature they requested. They get a waffle and a coffee and then they can see what we build,” he said.\nMatthew Lynas\nView author posts"},{"t":"金属有机-无机络合物的玻璃化形成","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag349/8704113?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属有机复合玻璃","kp":["材料体系[玻璃]: 金属有机-无机复合物(MOIC)"],"as":"研究探讨金属有机-无机复合物（MOICs）的玻璃形成能力。虽然部分MOICs已知具备良好成玻璃性，但其成分范围受限，制约了配位可调性。研究深入分析了玻璃形成机制，为设计新型功能玻璃材料提供理论依据，潜在应用于光学、电子等领域。","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Glass formation of metal organic-inorganic complexes","b":"Some metal-organic-inorganic complexes (MOICs) are known for their glass-forming ability. However, the composition range of glass-forming MOICs is rather limited as the mechanism of MOIC glass formation has not been well understood. Here, we uncover the structural factors controlling MOIC glass formation and thereby develop new MOIC glass formers. MOIC glass formation relies on the creation of a hydrogen-bonded structural network. By properly choosing metal centers, anions, and organic ligands of MOICs, a supramolecular structural network can be constructed, thereby allowing property modulation. Furthermore, MOIC systems with mixed crystals are generated by ligand-mixing and then vitrified by melt-quenching. The glass-transition temperature (Tg) of the derived glasses can be linearly tuned through the substitution of benzimidazole for imidazole. Interestingly, vitrification led to disordering of hydrogen-bonded networks in MOICs at short-, medium-, and long-range scales. This work enables the expansion of the composition range of MOIC glasses with various functionalities."},{"t":"Gazelle推出新款28英里/时电动自行车，将荷兰舒适骑行体验带给美国高速骑行者","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/06/09/gazelle-launches-new-28-mph-e-bikes-bringing-dutch-comfort-to-fast-american-riders/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","tg":"产业进展","tp":"高速电动自行车","kp":["最高时速[Class 3电动自行车]: 28mph(45km/h)"],"as":"荷兰百年自行车品牌Gazelle在北美市场推出全新设计的Ultimate平台电动自行车，最高时速达28英里（约45 km/h）。该车型将荷兰经典舒适骑行理念与美式高速通勤需求结合，瞄准Class 3 e-bike细分市场，体现电动自行车在美国通勤场景的渗透加速。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Gazelle launches new 28 MPH e-bikes, bringing Dutch comfort to fast American riders","b":"| Jun 9 2026 - 6:00 am PT\nGazelle has unveiled a completely redesigned Ultimate platform in North America, giving riders a faster take on the company’s signature Dutch-inspired comfort and refinement.\nThe new Ultimate C380+ 2.0 and Ultimate T11+ are both Class 3 e-bikes capable of reaching speeds up to 28 mph (45 km/h), but\nsays the focus wasn’t simply on making a faster bike. Instead, the company aimed to create a platform that remains comfortable, stable, and confidence-inspiring at higher speeds.\nThat philosophy feels very much in line with Gazelle’s reputation. While many Class 3 e-bikes chase speed through bigger motors and more aggressive geometry, Gazelle has built its name around premium commuter and trekking bikes that emphasize ride quality just as much as performance.\nhad the chance to tour Gazelle’s factory\nin the Netherlands a couple of years ago, that focus on rider-first comfort and control was on display as key to the company’s ethos.\nAt the center of the new Ultimate platform is Bosch’s new Performance Line Sport motor, producing 85 Nm of torque and upgradable to 90 Nm through the Bosch Flow app. The motor is paired with Bosch’s Smart System ecosystem and is compatible with the Bosch PowerMore range extender for riders looking to add additional battery capacity for longer rides.\nTo help keep the bike composed at 28 mph (45 km/h), Gazelle has upgraded the chassis with an 80 mm (3.2 inch) suspension fork and wider 55 mm (2.2 inch) tires designed to improve grip, comfort, and stability on rough pavement and mixed terrain.\nThe company has also modernized the cockpit with an adjustable stem that integrates either Quad Lock or SP Connect smartphone mounting systems, allowing riders to use their phones as a navigation and ride-information display. Bosch’s compact Purion 200 display handles key ride data while maintaining a clean handlebar setup.\nGazelle’s attention to detail shows up elsewhere too. The redesigned frame features fully internal cable routing and a relocated charging port positioned in the rear triangle, helping create a cleaner front-end appearance while improving charging accessibility.\nThe lineup launches with two distinct models.\nThe $4,999 Ultimate C380+ 2.0 is designed as the low-maintenance option, featuring a Gates belt drive paired with an Enviolo Trekking continuously variable hub transmission. It’s available in both step-through and high-step frame configurations.\nMeanwhile, the $4,499 Ultimate T11+ takes a more performance-oriented approach with a traditional derailleur drivetrain aimed at riders who prefer a sportier and more responsive feel, particularly on steeper terrain.\nGazelle occupies an interesting position in the e-bike industry. The company’s high-end, Dutch-made bikes aren’t competing with direct-to-consumer brands on price, and Gazelle isn’t trying to win spec-sheet battles with oversized motors or giant batteries.\nInstead, Gazelle continues to focus on premium ride quality, thoughtful engineering, and long-term ownership experience.\nThe new Ultimate platform appears to double down on that formula while finally embracing the growing popularity of Class 3 speeds in North America. For commuters who regularly ride longer distances, the ability to cruise at 28 mph can dramatically shorten travel times, but only if the bike remains comfortable and stable enough to enjoy those speeds.\nOn paper, that’s exactly what Gazelle seems to be aiming for here: Dutch comfort, German Bosch reliability, and American Class 3 performance all rolled into one package.\nThe new Ultimate C380+ 2.0 and Ultimate T11+ are available now through Gazelle dealers across the United States, with additional models in the Ultimate lineup expected later this year.\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nMicah Toll is a personal electric vehicle enthusiast, battery nerd, and author of the Amazon #1 bestselling books\nDIY Lithium Batteries\nDIY Solar Power,\nThe Ultimate DIY Ebike Guide\nThe Electric Bike Manifesto\nThe e-bikes that make up Micah’s current daily drivers are the\n$999 Lectric XP 2.0\n$1,095 Ride1Up Roadster V2\n$1,199 Rad Power Bikes RadMission\n$3,299 Priority Current\n. But it’s a pretty evolving list these days.\nBest $999 electric bike ever!\nGreat e-bikes at great prices!"},{"t":"GPR15引导的CD8+ T调节细胞控制肠道炎症","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10749-4","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","b":"Inflammatory bowel disease (IBD) causes chronic suffering from gastrointestinal inflammation and dysfunction that can progress to colon cancer1,2. The disease prevalence is increasing and there is an urgent need to better understand its pathogenic mechanisms to improve treatment. We show that GPR15, a G protein-coupled receptor (GPCR) expressed in immune cells and previously described as an entry co-factor for human and simian immunodeficiency viruses3, is a marker and homing receptor for a subset of intramucosal GPR15-guided regulatory CD8+ T lymphocytes (CD8+ TIGR). Deleterious GPR15 gene variants in humans cause defective homing of CD8+ TIGR and are associated with severe early-onset IBD. Moreover, CD8+ TIGR cells are reduced in the intestinal mucosa of sporadic IBD patients. In mice, GPR15 deficiency impairs colonic homing of CD8+ TIGR cells, leading to accumulation of inflammatory macrophages and increased susceptibility to colitis. CD8+ TIGR cells potently kill macrophages activated by intestinal damage or disease using Fas ligand (FasL) and TNF-related weak inducer of apoptosis (TWEAK). The identification of CD8+ TIGR cells yields new insights into organ-specific immune regulation and potential therapeutics for IBD."},{"t":"G 蛋白调节网络控制受体内化动力学","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524866123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"G protein–coupled receptors (GPCRs) enable chemical communication between cells and are involved in nearly all essential functions. They transduce signals via heterotrimeric G proteins and are regulated by internalization, a process which redirects them from the cell surface to internal compartments and enables diversified signaling through spatial reorganization. Beyond the receptor, a vast regulatory network exists to further control G-protein signaling. However, it is unclear whether these modes of G-protein regulation also impact the upstream GPCR. Here, we systematically address how G-protein cycle regulation shapes GPCR internalization and establish several key principles and mechanisms governing this process. We find that timing of G-protein activation and deactivation and changes in G-protein cycle lifetime imparted by guanine nucleotide exchange factors, activators of G-protein signaling, and regulators of G-protein signaling can alter internalization outcomes. Furthermore, we determine how the activity and balance of discrete G-protein components interact with the G protein–coupled receptor kinase system to influence GPCR spatial distribution. Finally, we uncover that disease-associated variants of the most abundant G protein in the brain, GαoA, affect the regulatory network that drives GPCR internalization. Altogether, this study reveals that GPCR internalization is not a fixed receptor property but is dynamically governed by receptor–G-protein activation order, cycle lifetime, and the balance of Gα and Gβγ availability. As such, alterations in receptor internalization dynamics may contribute to the complex disease phenotypes associated with dysregulated G-protein networks."},{"t":"PDE6α和PDE6β亚基在视杆细胞-光感受器完整性中的功能不对称性和重要结构作用","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604088123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Tetrameric rod phosphodiesterase-6 (PDE6), comprised of an α/β heterodimeric catalytic core and two inhibitory γ subunits, critically regulates cyclic GMP (cGMP) levels in rod photoreceptors. While the rod-PDE6 catalytic core is a heterodimer, the cone isoform is an α′/α′ homodimer. This structural difference suggests a unique role for each rod subunit. Due to the lack of heterologous expression systems, we generated four transgenic mouse models to examine the functional contributions of the N-terminal pony-tail (Pt)-motifs and of the catalytic domains of the individual catalytic subunits of rod PDE6 in vivo. We generated two N-terminal deletions (PDE6αΔ2-48AA and PDE6βΔ2-46AA); and two active-site mutations (PDE6αH599A and PDE6βH597A) designed to selectively abolish catalytic activity. Native mass spectrometric analysis of heterozygous mice revealed that only wild-type enzyme was produced. While homozygous mutations in all lines caused complete photoreceptor degeneration, analysis of heterozygous lines revealed a disproportionately greater impact of β-subunit mutations on protein stability, enzymatic activity, and visual function. These findings establish that both active subunits are essential for rod integrity, but a significant functional asymmetry exists within the PDE6αβ heterodimer. Our results demonstrate that the PDE6β subunit plays a more dominant role in maintaining the structural and functional pool of PDE6 enzyme."},{"t":"利用液晶液滴阵列实现全矢量场传感","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73661?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"液晶光场传感","kp":["[全矢量光场传感]: 液晶液滴阵列测量振幅/相位/偏振"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出利用液晶液滴阵列实现光场全矢量传感的新方法。该方法可同时测定光的振幅、相位和偏振分布，对基础光学研究和实际应用（如光学通信、生物传感）具有重要意义。液晶液滴的各向异性特性使其成为紧凑、可集成的矢量光场探测平台。","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Full Vectorial Field Sensing Using Liquid Crystal Droplet Arrays","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Determining the amplitude, phase, and polarization profile of light is essential for both fundamental scientific discovery and applications spanning optical metrology, microscopy, astronomy, and optical communication/computing technologies. However, most modern measurement approaches are unable to retrieve such parameters readily, often relying on bulky and expensive hardware or lacking the capability for single‐shot sensing. Here, we introduce a low cost, compact, full vectorial field sensor based on an inkjet‐printed nematic liquid crystal droplet array that enables simultaneous measurement of these important characteristics of light. Polarization and intensity are measured via division‐of‐wavefront polarimetry, exploiting the droplets’ spatially varying birefringence, while the phase is reconstructed by treating each droplet as a separate microlens in a Shack‐Hartmann‐like wavefront sensor configuration. To demonstrate the system's performance, we characterize aberrated dual‐wavelength beams carrying distinct intensity, phase, and polarization information, confirming accurate retrieval of the optical field profiles for both spectral components."},{"t":"法国监管机构选定科西嘉岛五个储能项目，总规模近50MW","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/09/french-regulator-selects-five-corsica-energy-storage-projects-totaling-nearly-50-mw/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","as":"法国能源监管委员会（CRE）在科西嘉岛遴选出五个储能项目，总规模近50 MW。这些项目旨在提升海岛电网的灵活性和可再生能源消纳能力，解决科西嘉岛与大陆电网连接薄弱背景下的供电稳定性问题，体现法国对岛屿微电网储能的重视。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能项目入选","kp":["总容量[科西嘉储能]: ~48 MW","抽水蓄能[科西嘉]: 29.1 MW/132.4 MWh"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"French regulator selects five Corsica energy storage projects totaling nearly 50 MW - Energy Storage","b":"France’s Commission de Régulation de l’Énergie (CRE) has selected five electricity storage projects in Corsica with a combined capacity of about 48 MW, comprising two pumped hydro energy storage (PHES) facilities and three battery energy storage systems (BESS). The projects are scheduled to enter service between 2029 and 2030.\nThe selected projects include 29.1 MW/132.4 MWh of pumped hydro storage capacity and 19 MW/38 MWh of battery storage capacity. Their contracts will run until between 2044 and 2059, depending on the technology.\nCRE said competition among battery developers was limited, with six complete applications submitted by a small number of market participants. However, proposed project costs were lower than those seen in previous storage procurement rounds in Guadeloupe, Martinique and Réunion. Battery project costs were 16% below those recorded in Guadeloupe and about 45% lower than in Martinique and Réunion, reflecting continued declines in storage technology costs.\nThe regulator awarded 19 MW/38 MWh of battery storage capacity from a pool of applications totaling 39 MW/78 MWh. The volume fell short of the 40 MW battery procurement target set when the scheme was launched.\nRenewable integration\nCRE said all five projects will provide energy arbitrage services that improve renewable energy integration, particularly for solar generation. According to the regulator’s modelling, solar curtailment in Corsica would reach nearly 15% by 2038 without the planned storage assets. The addition of the selected pumped hydro and battery projects would reduce curtailment to below 5%.\nThe regulator said improved renewable integration would reduce reliance on thermal generation at the Ricanto and Lucciana power plants, as well as combustion turbines. The storage assets are also expected to increase use of the SACOI and SARCO interconnections, which have lower operating costs than thermal power stations.\nCRE added that the pumped hydro facilities will provide system inertia, including the Saint Antoine project, which includes a synchronous compensator. Battery systems will provide primary reserve services.\nFrance’s tariff equalization mechanism ensures electricity consumers in non-interconnected territories, including Corsica, pay prices comparable to those in mainland France despite higher generation costs. The resulting gap between electricity revenues and production costs is covered through the country’s public energy service levy.\nCRE estimated that public support payments for the five projects will total €181.6 million over their contractual lifetimes, comprising 15-year contracts for batteries and 30-year contracts for pumped hydro facilities. The regulator said the projects will avoid approximately €535.3 million in generation costs, resulting in net savings of €353.7 million over 30 years.\nCRE said it will soon announce details of the next storage procurement round in French Guiana."},{"t":"用于核废料处理的框架材料","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/CS/D6CS00154H","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"RSC - Chem. Soc. Rev. latest articles","tg":"观点评论","tp":"框架材料核废处理","kp":["[核废料处理]: 框架材料选择性捕获阴阳离子核素"],"dp":1,"as":"综述了框架材料（如金属有机框架MOFs、共价有机框架COFs等多孔材料）在核废料处理中的应用进展。受能源需求和环境安全驱动，该领域聚焦于放射性核素的选择性捕获、分离与固化，为核废料的长期安全处置提供材料层面的解决方案，支撑核能可持续发展。","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.5,"r":3.5,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Framework materials for nuclear waste treatment","b":"Driven by energy demand and environmental safety, the ability to treat and dispose of nuclear waste is sought to fulfil the demand for sustainable nuclear power. Radioactive byproducts generated by nuclear fission, including cationic radionuclides (235UO22+, 137Cs+, 90Sr2+, noble metals and partial actinide elements), anionic radionuclides (99TcO4−, 129/131I3−, 129/131I−, etc.), gaseous effluents (129/131I2, 85Kr, 127Xe, 222Rn, etc.), and tritium, should be managed safely and efficiently, underscoring the need for robust scientific solutions to minimize environmental contamination and foster public confidence. For this purpose, framework materials like metal–organic frameworks (MOFs), covalent organic frameworks (COFs), hydrogen-bonded organic frameworks (HOFs), supramolecular assembly frameworks (SAFs) and porous aromatic frameworks (PAFs) have emerged as highly promising platforms for radionuclide extraction and removal relying on their unique properties of abundant structures, customizable functionality, tunable pore sizes, and high specific surface area. Thus far, there is a lack of a comprehensive review that systematically integrates materials design, research progress, and practical applications for achieving comprehensive radionuclide separation. This review begins with a comprehensive overview of the scientific significance and structural characteristics of framework materials, followed by a summary of their design principles, synthetic strategies, and functional versatility. It then presents a detailed examination of recent applications across various radionuclide classes, with an in-depth discussion of advanced design paradigms, performance across diverse scenarios, and mechanisms. Finally, future perspectives are outlined to address unresolved scientific and technical challenges and to accelerate the practical implementation of next-generation framework materials. This work provides a foundational platform for engineering innovation and the broader application of framework materials, which is crucial for the effective and sustainable management of nuclear waste."},{"t":"富士康与博枫合作在越南联合开发1GW可再生能源项目","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/foxconn-brookfield-to-jointly-develop-1-gw-of-renewables-in-vietnam-1296152/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Renewables Now","as":"富士康与加拿大资产管理公司Brookfield宣布在越南合作开发1 GW可再生能源项目。此举契合富士康供应链绿色转型需求，越南作为全球电子制造重要基地正加速清洁能源布局，也反映跨国制造巨头在东南亚的脱碳战略及PPA（购电协议）模式推广。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"可再生能源开发","kp":["装机容量[越南可再生能源]: 1 GW"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":7.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":8.0},"ot":"Foxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam","b":"Foxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam | Renewable Energy News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nabout 8 hours ago\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nCIP sells minority stakes in 500-MW Scottish battery project Devilla\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nJun 9, 2026, 4:53:31 PM\nIvan Shumkov\nEnergy Storage\nRegion/Country:\nAsia Pacific\nLatest top stories\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nabout 8 hours ago\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nCIP sells minority stakes in 500-MW Scottish battery project Devilla\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nLatest in Energy storage\nEDPR, SRP wrap up 800-MWh Flatland BESS project in Arizona\nAlterric connects 2-MW BESS at German wind farm\nPowerBank safe harbours 30 MW of solar, 31 MWh of storage projects in US\nLatest in Solar power\nZenith nears 200-MWp Italian goal with new solar project buy\nGenneia powers up all 180 MW at San Rafael solar farm in Argentina\nPlenitude fully commissions 330-MW Renopool solar complex in Spain\nLatest in ASIA & PACIFIC\nSMFL Mirai, partners break ground on 84 MW battery project in Japan\nHindustan Construction wins job on Bhutan's Wangchhu hydro site\nEdify orders 2.4 GWh of CATL batteries for Aussie solar-BESS projects\nLatest in Orders\nNordex grabs 155 MW of turbine deals in Southern Europe, Turkey\nGoldwind wins 37.5-MW order from repeat customer in Turkey\nGE Vernova launches 3.8-MW wind turbine in India with 100-MW order\nLatest in Energy storage\nEDPR, SRP wrap up 800-MWh Flatland BESS project in Arizona\nLatest in Solar power\nZenith nears 200-MWp Italian goal with new solar project buy\nLatest in ASIA & PACIFIC\nSMFL Mirai, partners break ground on 84 MW battery project in Japan\nLatest in Orders\nNordex grabs 155 MW of turbine deals in Southern Europe, Turkey\nLatest in Vietnam\nVietnam’s EVN to add 270 MW of floating PV at hydropower sites\nMay 18, 2026\nMost read stories\nGoldenPeaks Poland files for bankruptcy in US amid Brookfield bid\nOffshore Wind\nGE Vernova denied reconsideration in Vineyard Wind dispute\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"质子辅助吸附演化法制备氟掺杂RuO2/TiO2催化剂用于高效稳定析氧反应","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9750153?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"掺氟钌析氧催化","kp":["催化剂[酸性OER]: F掺杂RuO2/TiO2","制备方法[催化剂]: 质子辅助吸附演化"],"dp":1,"as":"研究通过质子辅助吸附演化策略，将氟掺杂的RuO₂锚定在TiO₂载体上，实现高效稳定析氧反应（OER）催化剂。RuO₂理论OER活性优异且成本低于IrO₂，但稳定性不足。氟掺杂与TiO₂载体协同作用有效提升催化耐久性，为质子交换膜电解水制氢降本提供新路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Fluorine‐Doped RuO2 Anchored on TiO2 via Proton‐Assisted Adsorption Evolution for Efficient and Stable Oxygen Evolution ","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Although RuO\n                    2\n                    theoretically has superior oxygen evolution reaction (OER) activity and a relatively lower price than IrO\n                    2\n                    , balancing its activity and stability remains a significant challenge. The electronic structure of Ru centers plays a critical role in balancing the activity and durability of RuO\n                    2\n                    ‐based electrocatalysts for OER. This study developed an F‐doped RuO\n                    2\n                    loaded on TiO\n                    2\n                    (F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    ) to construct a Ru–O–Ti interface platform for electronegativity‐mediated charge redistribution. F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    exhibited excellent OER activity and superior durability, operating stably for 660 h and 253 h at 100 and 200 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively. A proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer assembled using F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    required only 1.57 and 1.68 V at 0.5 and 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively, and operated stably for 300 and 100 h, respectively. Both experimental and theoretical calculations showed that the high electronegativity of F enhances the Ru–O covalency, thereby accelerating the deprotonation of *OOH through the proton‐assisted adsorption evolution mechanism (PA‐AEM). Simultaneously, the dynamic charge redistribution established between Ru–O–Ti allowed TiO\n                    2\n                    to buffer charge fluctuations at Ru sites, thus further effectively mitigating over‐oxidation. These findings underscore the importance of electronegativity‐regulated proton‐transfer kinetics for stabilizing RuO\n                    2\n                    .","aip":1},{"t":"关于AI你必须知道的五件事","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/09/1138582/five-things-you-need-to-know-about-ai/","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"MIT Technology Review","as":"作者在SXSW伦敦大会上分享关于AI的五个核心认知，涵盖当前AI技术现状、能力边界、社会影响及未来趋势。内容面向非技术受众，旨在澄清公众对AI的常见误解，提供理性认知框架，帮助理解AI在各行业的实际应用价值与潜在风险。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI趋势观察","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Five things you need to know about AI","b":"EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\nAt SXSW London last week I gave a talk called “Five things you need to know about AI,” in which I shared what I think are the biggest themes in AI right now.\nI pulled a few things from our first AI10 list, an annual\nguide to the most important trends in this buzzy world\n, but I also veered off on a number of tangents. In my half-hour slot, I tried to cover the key talking points that I think help to make sense of what’s going on in tech—and thus the economy—today.\ntalk with the same title at SXSW London last year\nthings you needed to know. A lot has happened since then!)\nSo: This is how I’m thinking about AI midway through 2026. Let me know if you would pick different points!\nTongue in cheek? Maybe. But generative AI tools have already become mundane, used by millions to automate everyday office tasks (including producing and\ndelivering talks\n). It’s no surprise that one of the biggest questions out there right now is\nwhat this all means for jobs\n. People are confused and scared.\nThe frustrating answer is that despite the\nhype coming from the top\nabout the potential for AI to join the workforce soon—and viral social media posts yelling that something big is happening—there is almost no data to say either way what kind of effect this technology will have on employment and the economy overall. That’s not to say it won’t have an impact, even a huge one, but it’s just too soon to tell.\nteams of agents working together toward common goals\ncould become assembly lines for white-collar work, doing to offices this century what Henry Ford’s innovations did to factories in the 20th century.\nIn theory. Because in order to know what will happen to jobs, we need to know what will happen inside the companies that create those jobs. But\nmost companies are still figuring that out\nThere have been\nscary stories about AI\nfor years—claims that it will\nor bring about the end of civilization. There’s still a\nloud crowd of doomers\n, but those scenarios remain dystopian science fiction.\nWhat’s happened instead is that many of the worst near-term, real-world fears have come true.\nTake deepfakes\n, AI-generated images or videos of people doing things they didn’t actually do. Deepfakes have been used to incite violence, swing votes, and sow distrust. Trump’s White House is among those creating and publishing fake images.\nMany deepfakes are also used to abuse women and girls. One study found that 98% of deepfakes are pornographic and 99% involve women.\nAnother concern is the rise of dangerous and delusional relationships with chatbots. Many people turn to chatbots to seek private advice and to feel heard. But there are now multiple lawsuits against AI companies alleging that the technology encouraged or aided suicides and other forms of self-harm.\nAI is also being\nused in warfare in new and worrying ways\n. LLMs are now giving advice, not just being used for analysis. One US defense official told my colleague James O’Donnell that you could now give a military chatbot a list of targets and ask which one to hit first. Anyone who uses AI knows that its output needs to be reviewed carefully. In fact-paced, high-stress active conflict, the risk that corners get cut is high.\nI checked out an\nanti-AI protest in London\nearlier this year and found a very broad mix of complaints. Banners proclaiming the end times bounced along to chants of “Stop the slop! Stop the slop!” Protests are getting more organized and drawing larger crowds.\nThere’s pushback from fans of films and video games, who object to the use of generative AI in their favorite titles. In one notable case, the acclaimed 2025 game Clair Obscur was\nstripped of an award\nwhen the developers admitted to using AI in just one small, specific part of its production.\nAnd there’s the data center backlash. The US has more than 5,400 data centers and counting. With the energy demands of AI growing, people are unhappy about the environmental impact and their rising electricity bills. Activists are managing to stall development in a number of places.\nRegulation is becoming politically popular\n. Grassroots movements like\nhave gained momentum. A small number have turned to violence; a few weeks ago somebody threw a Molotov cocktail at Sam Altman’s house. It’s not clear where all this leads. But the apocalyptic hype from tech leaders is not helping people stay calm.\nIt’s early days yet, but the potential for AI to help make a genuine and important scientific discovery is greater than ever.\nGoogle DeepMind has developed Co-Scientist\n, a multipurpose tool that can help researchers dig up and compare previous results, generate hypotheses, and devise experiments to test them. OpenAI told me this year that its\nNorth Star is the goal of building a fully automated researcher\nMathematicians are excited too. Fundamental math underpins many everyday technologies, from internet security to video streaming. The last few months have seen a string of claims that AI has cracked unsolved math problems. And software that can solve really hard math problems will be able—so the argument goes—to solve more general-purpose real-world problems too.\nWhat are the downsides? Some scientists are warning that an overreliance on AI tools could narrow the scope of research because scientists may choose problems that are most suited to AI assistance. There are also concerns that AI-assisted research will lead to a flood of inaccurate or fake results: science slop.\nSo where does that leave us? There are a lot of exciting things, a lot of worrying things, and a lot of hot air. It can be exhausting to keep up, and yet\nit all feels inescapable\n. Some people will tell you we’re in a race to the top; some will tell you we’re in a race to the bottom. But it’s really not clear where we’re headed.\nAI companies want us to march to their tune and buy into the\npropaganda about artificial general intelligence\nwhatever that means\n. They are selling a vision that feels inevitable, but it isn’t.\nWe’ve built a\ntechnology that can do humanlike things\n, and I think that makes it hard to get our heads around the fact that it is still just a technology.\nSomething is happening. Maybe even something comparable to the invention of electricity or the internet. But technologies like that take time to settle and bring lasting change.\nGet ready for a marathon, not a sprint.\nThis story originally appeared in The Algorithm, our weekly newsletter on AI. To get stories like this in your inbox first,\nAccording to Stanford’s 2026 AI Index, AI is sprinting, and we’re struggling to keep up.\nMIT Technology Review's authoritative overview of the 10 technologies, emerging trends, bold ideas, and powerful movements in AI in 2026.\nLaunching next week on T-Mobile's network, the cell plan takes a nuclear approach to online safety.\nMusk kept his cool, and OpenAI’s lawyer bulldozed him with piercing questions about his motivations for suing the company.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more."},{"t":"五十年前，一个简单的方程描述了生物学的混乱","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01584-8","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"An exploration of chaos theory in population dynamics showed that unpredictable systems can often be modelled using surprisingly simple mathematics. An exploration of chaos theory in population dynamics showed that unpredictable systems can often be modelled using surprisingly simple mathematics.","tp":"混沌理论","sc":1.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":2.0,"r":2.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":"文章回顾混沌理论在种群动力学中的应用历史，强调看似完全不可预测的复杂生物系统，往往可以通过极其简单的数学方程进行有效建模和描述。这一发现源于五十年前的开创性研究，颠覆了传统认知，证明了简单数学规则可以产生高度复杂的混沌行为，为生态学、流行病学等多个领域的系统建模奠定了理论基础。"},{"t":"Factorial完成纳斯达克上市","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.electrive.com/2026/06/09/factorial-completes-nasdaq-listing/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"electrive","as":"美国固态电池开发商Factorial完成与SPAC（特殊目的收购公司）的业务合并，正式在纳斯达克挂牌上市。Factorial专注高能量密度固态电池技术，已与奔驰、现代等车企合作。上市为其量产化进程提供资金支持，反映固态电池产业化进入加速阶段。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"固态电池上市","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Factorial completes Nasdaq listing - electrive.com","b":"US solid-state battery developer Factorial has completed its business combination with special purpose acquisition company Cartesian Growth Corporation III. It now trades on Nasdaq under the ticker symbol ‘FAC’.\nImage: Mercedes-Benz\nThe transaction values the company at approximately $1.3 billion. The combined company now operates as Factorial Energy Inc. and received more than $100 million in gross proceeds through the transaction. According to the company, the capital will be used to accelerate the deployment of its solid-state batteries.\nThe company had announced its plans to join forces with a SPAC\n. A SPAC, or Special Purpose Acquisition Company, is a firm created solely to acquire another company and is already listed on the stock exchange. Factorial thus follows the same path as competitor\n. The Israeli battery startup, which develops technology for ultra-fast-charging electric vehicle batteries, announced its merger with a SPAC to list on the stock exchange in December last year.\nFactorial is pursuing a capital-light commercialisation strategy based on joint manufacturing partnerships. The company says this model is designed to enable faster scaling while reducing manufacturing costs and deployment risks. The US battery specialist is backed by several automotive groups including\nMercedes-Benz\n. All three automotive groups plan to use Factorial’s high-performance, lightweight solid-state batteries in future electric vehicles, which are expected to enable a range of over 1,200 kilometres.\n“We built Factorial to solve one of the hardest problems in energy – making solid-state real at scale,” said Siyu Huang, CEO of Factorial. “The automotive industry is the most demanding proving ground in the world, and we’ve shown our technology can perform in real cars on real roads.”\n“The team at Factorial is dedicated not just to powering the next generation of drones, robots, e-mobility and energy storage, but to creating long-term shareholder value,” said Peter Yu, Chairman and CEO of Cartesian Growth Corporation III.\nabout „Factorial completes Nasdaq listing“"},{"t":"双极性有机混合导体中的面外结晶实现均质光调制人工神经元","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag341/8704706?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光控人工神经元","kp":["[结晶工程]: 面内取向结晶提升OMIEC离子-电子传输","[应用]: 光调制人工神经元"],"dp":1,"as":"研究发现双极性有机混合导体中的面朝向（face-on）结晶可实现对光响应的均一调控，从而构建光调控人工神经元器件。该器件在临床视神经修复和仿生机器人领域具有应用潜力，利用有机材料的光敏与电荷传输双功能特性，为生物电子接口提供了柔性、可调的新方案。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Face-on crystallization in ambipolar organic mixed conductors enables homogeneous light-modulated artificial neurons","b":"Light-modulated artificial neurons are vital for clinical optic nerve repair and bionic robotics. Light-sensitive ambipolar organic mixed ionic-electronic conductors (OMIECs) allow for homogeneously integrated artificial neurons, free from issues such as voltage/resistance mismatch or digital-to-analog conversion. However, their development is constrained by a trade-off between ion and electron transport, which results in low figure-of-merit (μC*) values and P/N-mode imbalance. Here, through precise molecular weight tailoring, we develop an ambipolar OMIEC with a high face-on orientation ratio of 85.5% and a fourfold enhancement in backbone crystallinity. This approach simultaneously enhances vertical ionic transport and electron transport, enabling the synergetic optimization of electronic mobility and volumetric capacitance. The optimized material achieves high μC* values of 423.3 ± 17.3 F cm⁻¹ V⁻¹ s⁻¹ (N-type) and 359.8 ± 42.6 F cm⁻¹ V⁻¹ s⁻¹ (P-type). Using this OMIEC, we construct a homogeneous artificial neuron whose excitation/inhibition behaviors can be dually modulated by light and chemical environment, paving new paths for high-performance OMIECs in biological neural prosthetics and bionic machine vision systems."},{"t":"FRV计划到2029年在意大利部署2.9GW/11GWh电池储能","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/09/frv-targets-2-9-gw-11-gwh-of-battery-storage-in-italy-by-2029/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","as":"沙特Jameel Energy旗下的可再生能源开发商FRV宣布，计划到2029年在意大利开发超过2.9 GW/11 GWh的电池储能项目。意大利正加速电网级储能部署以支撑海上风电和光伏消纳，FRV的大规模布局反映欧洲储能市场在能源转型驱动下的快速增长，项目将参与意大利容量市场拍卖。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电池储能规划","kp":["规划容量[意大利电池储能]: 2.9 GW/11 GWh"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"ot":"FRV targets 2.9 GW/11 GWh of battery storage in Italy by 2029 - Energy Storage","b":"FRV, a renewable energy developer owned by Jameel Energy, said it plans to develop more than 2.9 GW of battery energy storage capacity in Italy, representing more than 11 GWh of storage.\nThe company said the portfolio is already in an advanced stage of development and is expected to reach ready-to-build status between 2026 and 2029.\nThe projects are spread across Sicily, Friuli-Venezia Giulia, Puglia, Tuscany, Marche, Campania, Molise, Lombardy, Emilia-Romagna, and Sardinia. Sicily, Friuli-Venezia Giulia, and Puglia account for the largest share of planned capacity.\nFRV plans five projects totaling 745 MW in Sicily, three projects totaling 663 MW in Friuli-Venezia Giulia, and four projects totaling 445 MW in Puglia. The remaining 966 MW is distributed across Molise (242 MW), Lombardy (201 MW), Marche (175 MW), Tuscany (146 MW), Emilia-Romagna (96 MW), Campania (58 MW), and Sardinia (48 MW).\nThe projects are being developed as standalone battery storage facilities designed to provide grid services and support the electricity system.\nThe announcement comes as investor interest in Italy’s utility-scale storage sector continues to grow ahead of the rollout of MACSE, the storage procurement mechanism established by transmission system operator Terna to support greater renewable energy integration and expand the role of energy storage in the power system.\nFRV Italy Managing Director Jaime Linares said battery storage investment can help increase renewable energy integration, strengthen grid stability, and improve the resilience of Italy’s electricity system."},{"t":"一维玻色气体中分数费米海的奇异临界态","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/j3s5-gjpf","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Alvise Bastianello, Yi Zeng, Sudipta Dhar, Zekui Wang, Xudong Yu, Milena Horvath, Grigori E. Astrakharchik, Yanliang Guo, Hanns-Christoph Nägerl, and Manuele LandiniCritical quantum field theories occupy a central position in modern theoretical physics for their inherent universality stemming from long-range correlations. As an example, the Tomonaga-Luttinger liquid (TLL) describes a wealth of one-dimensional quantum systems at low temperatures. Its behavior is…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230402] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"融合环境中钨氧化多维参数空间的进化优化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae72a2","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚变钨氧化","kp":["材料[聚变部件]: 钨","[氧化建模]: 进化优化多维参数空间"],"as":"研究采用进化优化算法对可控核聚变装置中钨材料氧化的多维参数空间进行系统性优化。钨是聚变堆面向等离子体部件的首选材料，但在特定条件下易快速氧化剥落，威胁装置寿命。该方法为提高钨基材料的抗氧性能、延长偏滤器服役周期提供了数据驱动的材料设计新思路。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Evolutionary optimization of the multidimensional parameter space governing tungsten oxidation in fusion environments","b":"Tungsten is a primary candidate for plasma-facing components in fusion devices, but its susceptibility to rapid oxidation during accidental air ingress poses significant safety risks. Existing models of tungsten oxidation often rely on individual parameters (such as oxygen diffusivity and adsorption energies) derived from first principles simulations, which frequently fall far from accurately explaining experimental oxidation rate trends. This study uses an improved multilayer interface tracking model that treats the oxide scale as a dynamic system of WO , WO , WO , and WO layers. To address the unknown nature of many layer-specific parameters, we employ a Differential Evolution genetic algorithm to optimize a 13-dimensional parameter space against a comprehensive database of experimental growth constants. The resulting optimized model accurately reproduces experimental oxidation kinetics and correctly predicts the temperature-dependent evolution of specific oxide phases, providing a more reliable tool for assessing the performance of fusion materials under extreme conditions. The model can be dynamically improved by incorporating experimental data as they become available, leading to parameters that reflect the state of the art in oxidation measurements and characterization."},{"t":"打破CF4水解活性-稳定性权衡的熵稳定铝酸盐催化剂","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6752036?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"熵稳定铝酸盐催化","kp":["催化剂[CF4水解]: 熵稳定铝酸盐打破活性-稳定性权衡"],"dp":1,"as":"研究开发熵稳定的铝酸盐催化剂，突破CF₄（四氟甲烷）催化水解中活性与稳定性的此消彼长瓶颈。CF₄是强效长效温室气体，广泛用于半导体干法刻蚀。传统催化剂在高温水解中易失活，熵稳定策略通过高熵效应维持结构稳定性，为半导体行业温室气体减排提供可行技术路径。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Entropy‐Stabilized Aluminate Catalysts That Break the Activity–Stability Tradeoff in CF4 Hydrolysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Tetrafluoromethane (CF\n                    4\n                    ) is a potent, long‐lived greenhouse gas widely used in semiconductor dry‐etching processes, yet its abatement via hydrolysis remains challenging due to the lack of catalysts that simultaneously exhibit high activity and durability under strongly fluorinating, steam‐rich conditions. Conventional alumina‐based catalysts suffer from severe activity–stability tradeoffs, offering good activity only at the cost of rapid deactivation through surface‐area loss, bulk fluorination, and the formation of catalytically inactive\n                    α\n                    ‐Al\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    . Here, we report an entropy‐stabilized aluminate catalyst that overcomes this long‐standing tradeoff by combining a multication aluminate framework with an entropy‐stabilized lattice. The incorporation of multiple metal cations produces an electron‐deficient Al–O environment that enhances heterolytic C–F bond activation while suppressing H\n                    2\n                    O poisoning, thereby increasing intrinsic activity under practical conditions. Simultaneously, the lattice stabilization via high configurational entropy inhibits the propagation of fluorination into the bulk lattice, effectively suppressing in situ AlF\n                    3\n                    formation and its subsequent hydrolysis to\n                    α\n                    ‐Al\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    . Mechanistic studies further establish that CF\n                    4\n                    hydrolysis proceeds via a Mars–van Krevelen‐type pathway in which lattice oxygen first oxidizes CF\n                    x\n                    surface intermediates and is replenished by H\n                    2\n                    O. These findings identify entropy‐stabilized aluminates as a robust materials platform capable of simultaneously achieving high activity and long‐term durability for CF\n                    4\n                    hydrolysis.","aip":1},{"t":"用于神经修复的工程丝素蛋白基生物材料","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73651?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Neurological injuries remain a major clinical challenge due to the limited regenerative capacity of neural tissue, the persistence of inhibitory post‐injury microenvironments, and the lack of biomaterials capable of simultaneously providing structural support and biological instruction. Growing evidence highlights that biomaterial‐mediated modulation of the neural microenvironment is essential for effective neural regeneration and functional recovery. Silk fibroin (SF), a naturally derived protein biomaterial, has attracted growing interest in neural repair owing to its tunable mechanical properties, controllable degradation, structural anisotropy, and versatile modification potential. Beyond serving as passive scaffolds, SF‐based biomaterials actively regulate axonal guidance, neural and glial cell behavior, and neuroinflammatory responses. This review systematically summarizes the physicochemical properties and modification strategies of SF, elucidates the underlying mechanisms by which SF‐based materials promote neural repair, and discusses diverse SF‐based material formats, including hydrogels, scaffolds, patches, nanofibers, and nerve conduits. Representative applications in peripheral nerve injury and central nervous system disorders, such as spinal cord injury, traumatic brain injury, cerebral palsy, ischemic stroke, and Parkinson's disease, are highlighted. Finally, current challenges and future perspectives of SF‐based neural biomaterials are discussed, with an emphasis on guiding the rational design and clinical translation of next‐generation neural repair strategies.","tp":"丝素蛋白","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":5.5},"as":"该综述聚焦工程化丝素蛋白基生物材料在神经修复中的应用。针对神经组织再生能力有限、损伤后微环境抑制及缺乏兼具结构支撑和生物活性引导的支架材料等挑战，系统阐述了丝素蛋白通过调控神经微环境促进神经再生和功能恢复的研究进展，为神经损伤临床治疗提供材料学新策略。"},{"t":"中美紧张局势阴影下的能源通胀：能源转型是通向稳定的途径吗？","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003563?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","tp":"能源转型","sc":1.8,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"家禽粪便热化学转化路径的能源与环境可持续性评估（基于_att指标）","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008056?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"禽畜废弃物热化学转化","as":"","sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Energy and environmental sustainability assessment of thermochemical conversion pathways for poultry litter from the att"},{"t":"通过CuH催化对映选择性合成新型稳定功能化环戊二烯","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6630116?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"as":"该研究报道了一类新型稳定且功能化环戊二烯（CpHs）的对映选择性合成方法。环戊二烯作为化学领域的基础构建块，因固有酸性和易聚合倾向长期限制其广泛应用。研究通过巧妙的手性催化策略，实现了对映体可控的功能化CpHs合成，显著提升了其稳定性与官能团兼容性。该突破为金属茂化学、不对称催化及功能材料设计开辟了新途径，有望推动环戊二烯衍生物在配体设计与精细合成中的实用化。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CuH催化合成","kp":["[催化方法]: CuH催化对映选择性合成稳定手性环戊二烯"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Enantioselective Synthesis of a New Class of Stable and Functionalized Cyclopentadienes via CuH‐Catalysis","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Cyclopentadienes (CpHs) are fundamental building blocks across chemistry, yet their inherent acidity and tendency to undergo rapid [1,5]‐hydrogen shifts have long limited access to structurally and configurationally stable chiral variants. Overcoming this intrinsic fluxionality remains a major synthetic challenge that limits the potential of CpHs in asymmetric synthesis. Here we present a CuH‐catalyzed transformation that converts simple precursors into highly functionalized and enantioenriched CpHs in high yield and with exceptional enantioselectivity. Computations uncover the origins of the observed selectivity and show the reaction mechanism to involve a rare example of nitrile activation in Cu‐catalysis. The disclosed new class of CpHs is unexpectedly stable, which was found to be attributed to a conjugated push–pull electronic effect that delineates a new general design principle for taming the intrinsic instability of CpHs."},{"t":"中国国家排放交易计划实施的实证和经济见解：来自第一届政府的证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003599?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"异质结构柔性薄膜中电化学介导的界面电荷极化用于动态电磁[屏蔽]","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523231?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"柔性电磁屏蔽膜","kp":["[电磁调控]: 电化学介导界面电荷极化动态调节"],"as":"针对异质结构材料中电磁波（EMW）响应的可调性与动态调控难题，提出电化学介导界面电荷极化新机制。通过电化学手段调控异质界面的电荷分布与极化状态，实现电磁波吸收/反射性能的连续可逆调节，为智能隐身、可调吸波器件与电磁屏蔽材料提供了新的设计范式与工程路径。","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Electrochemically Mediated Interfacial Charge Polarization in Heterostructured Flexible Films for Dynamic Electromagneti","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Tunable electromagnetic waves (EMWs) response and dynamic regulation play a critical role in fields such as radar and satellite communication, ranging from radiation protection to signal compatibility. However, the modulation capability and thin‐film development of current electromagnetic materials are limited in the integration development in an effective dynamic electromagnetic environment, owing to their conductivity‐dominated single response mechanism. Unlike the previously reported conductivity‐dominant mechanism, this work proposes a design strategy based on H\n                    +\n                    ‐induced electron‐interface cooperative regulation by constructing an ultrathin acetylene black/H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    (AB/H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    ) heterostructure film device for real‐time electromagnetic wave modulation. Specifically, the controllable transformation of H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    from the initial monoclinic phase to the tetragonal phase and eventually to the cubic phase driven by H\n                    +\n                    insertion triggers the valence state evolution from W\n                    6+\n                    to W\n                    4+\n                    and the reduction of the work function, which significantly enhances the\n                    n\n                    ‐type doping effect and promoting the increase in free electron density, thereby achieving tunable EMWs reflective shielding efficiency (SE\n                    R\n                    : 3.7 to 6.0 dB). Meanwhile, the introduction of AB leads to the reconstruction of the energy band structure during the protonation of WO\n                    3\n                    , inducing strong polarization domains and a mass of dipoles at the AB/H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    heterointerface, which significantly enhances the polarization loss capacity and thereby promotes significant modulation in EMWs absorption shielding efficiency (SE\n                    A\n                    : 9.9 to 18.0 dB). Based on the above electron density and interface polarization synergistic enhancement mechanism, the AB/H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    electrode with a thickness of only 80.16 µm achieves significant modulation of the total shielding efficiency from 13.6 to 24.0 dB in X‐band and obtains an exceptionally large thickness‐normalized specific shielding efficiency (ΔSSE\n                    T\n                    ) of 130 dB mm\n                    −1\n                    , significantly outperforming previous reports. These findings underscore the great potential of this lightweight, ultrathin device for integrated electronics and adaptive electromagnetic environment applications.","aip":1},{"t":"通过 ${\\mathrm{PbTiO}}_{3 中隐藏的极声耦合实现应变梯度和 90° 畴壁的电切换","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/yhk9-qf8c","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Yajun Zhang, Konstantin Shapovalov, Xu He, Chang Liu, Huadong Yong, Xingyi Zhang, Jie Wang, Kun Zhou, and Philippe GhosezAlthough strain gradients hold great promise for tailoring emergent functionalities, their flexible global control remains a fundamental challenge. Here, we address this concern in ${\\mathrm{PbTiO}}_{3}$ under biaxial tensile strain by uncovering the spontaneous appearance of strain gradients and 90…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236101] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"铁电材料","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究在PbTiO₃双轴拉伸应变条件下揭示了应变梯度和90°畴壁自发出现的机制，发现此前隐藏的极性-声子耦合效应可实现这些参量的电场切换。该突破为通过外部电场灵活全局控制应变梯度这一基本挑战提供了解决方案，对裁剪铁电材料的新兴功能特性具有重要意义。"},{"t":"在 $^{88}\\mathrm{Sr}$ 上进行弹性 $α$ 散射实验，以约束弱 $α$ 诱导的反应截面","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/7q3r-h51x","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Z. Kóródi, G. G. Kiss, P. Mohr, T. N. Szegedi, C. Marshall, R. Nunes, L. Csedreki, Gy. Gyürky, Z. Halász, T. Szücs, S. R. Kovács, Zs. Mátyus, Á. Tóth, G. L. Guardo, M. La Cognata, A. Tumino, A. Di Pietro, A. Nurmukhanbetova, L. Balliet, and C. FougèresBackground: Low-mass neutron-rich isotopes between Fe and Ag are predicted to be synthesized in neutrino-driven winds emitted after the collapse of a massive star. The modeling of this nucleosynthesis scenario, called weak $r$-process or $α$-process, requires large nuclear reaction network calculati…[Phys. Rev. C 113, L062801] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026"},{"t":"超冷微波屏蔽极性分子中的 Efimov 效应","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/qlvv-r93m","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Author(s): Shayamal Singh and Chris H. GreeneA quantum-mechanical description is presented for the three-body physics of shielded dipolar molecules, including a prediction of observable Efimov physics. Despite the anisotropic and long-range nature of the interaction, shielding enables a regime in which universality emerges already at the two-b…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 233402] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"独家：比亚迪、蔚来、伊芙等中国公司因涉嫌军事联系而被列入美国“黑名单” – Batteries Internat","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/byd-nio-eve-and-other-chinese-firms-added-to-us-blacklist-over-alleged-military-links/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Batteries International","tg":"政策监管","b":"Energy Storage\nEXCLUSIVE: BYD, Nio, Eve and other Chinese firms set for US ‘blacklist’ over alleged military links\n–  June 9, 2026 01:24 pm BST\nGlobal energy storage and EV battery majors including BYD are being added to a US ‘blacklist’ that alleges the firms and other tech partners have links to China’s military,\nBatteries International\nBYD, Nio and Eve Energy are among those named by the Pentagon in a list seen by\nBatteries International\nand which is due for publication in the US government’s official journal, the\nFederal Register\n, tomorrow (June 10).\nHowever, several of the companies named, including Chinese tech firm Baidu and the Alibaba Group, have already rejected claims about their operations as baseless and factually inaccurate.\nThe updated Section 1260H list ― the official list of companies the Department of Defense has designated as Chinese military companies operating in the US ― aims to highlight industry players at the heart of US-China technological competition.\nInclusion on the list does not automatically attract sanctions, but industry observers say it can lead to restrictions on future US government procurement and cause difficulties in terms of compliance in conducting business with US partners.\nFirms on the list also face increased scrutiny, potential restrictions on defence contracts and reputational damage ― although companies can petition to be removed from the list.\nSeveral of the companies included on the list have already issued statements refuting the US allegations, according to the Beijing-based daily\nGlobal Times.\nThe US claims BYD is directly and indirectly affiliated with the State-Owned Assets Supervision and Administration Commission of China’s State Council (SASAC) and is indirectly affiliated with the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT). BYD is alleged to be a military-civil fusion contributor to the Chinese defence industrial base because it is affiliated with MIIT and because it resides in or is affiliated with a military-civil fusion enterprise zone.\nAccording to the US, EVE Energy is a military-civil fusion contributor to the Chinese defence industrial base because it knowingly received assistance from the government of China through science, technology, research, or industrial efforts initiated, granted, or created by, or provided under, or related to, the Chinese military industrial planning apparatus, or in furtherance of Chinese military industrial planning objectives.\nBaidu and Alibaba are military-civil fusion contributors to the Chinese defence industrial base because of their affiliations with MIIT, according to the US.\nBaidu said on June 9: “As the company is neither a Chinese military company nor a military-civil fusion contributor to the Chinese defence industrial base, (we) believe there is no justification for the company’s inclusion on such a list.”\nBaidu said US government procurement limitations tied to the list would not impact the business of the company.\nIn September 2024, EVE Energy held a ceremony in California to mark the opening of its US regional headquarters.\nIn November 2025, BYD quoted the California Independent System Operator as confirming a newly installed 100MW/400MWh ESS it provided had been ranked No.1 in the state in terms of reliability and availability among all stand-alone energy storage projects.\nImage credit: Shutterstock","tp":"电池制裁","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":7.0,"r":8.0,"d":6.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"据报道，美国五角大楼即将公布一份黑名单，将比亚迪、蔚来、亿纬锂能等中国全球储能和电动汽车电池龙头企业列入其中，理由是涉嫌与中国军方存在关联。此举将进一步加剧中美在新能源产业链领域的脱钩压力，对中国电池企业的海外市场拓展和国际供应链合作构成重大挑战。"},{"t":"EWE与Salzgitter签订年产1万吨绿氢供应合同","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://hydrogentechworld.com/ewe-salzgitter-sign-10000-t-y-green-hydrogen-supply-contract","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Hydrogen Tech World","tg":"产业进展","tp":"绿氢供应合同","kp":["供应规模[绿氢合同]: 10000 t/y"],"sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":8.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"EWE与Salzgitter正式签订了年产1万吨的绿氢供应合同；同时，挪威氢气将为MaserFrakt船队提供燃料。","ot":"EWE, Salzgitter sign 10,000 t/y green hydrogen supply contract","b":"Norwegian Hydrogen to fuel MaserFrakt fleet"},{"t":"ENGIE与European Energy签署丹麦氢能合作协议","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://hydrogentechworld.com/engie-european-energy-sign-denmark-hydrogen-cooperation","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Hydrogen Tech World","tg":"产业进展","tp":"丹麦氢能合作","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.5,"r":3.5,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"as":"ENGIE与European Energy签署丹麦绿氢合作协议，计划在丹麦开发绿氢项目。同时，IMI向API SARPOM炼油厂交付4MW电解槽用于工业脱碳。这些动态反映了欧洲绿氢产业的加速发展，涵盖从可再生能源制氢到工业应用的完整链条，表明绿氢在炼油等高排放行业的替代应用正在进入工程实施阶段。","ot":"ENGIE, European Energy sign Denmark hydrogen cooperation","b":"IMI supplies 4 MW electrolyser to API SARPOM refinery"},{"t":"EDPR与SRP完成亚利桑那州Flatland 800MWh电池储能项目","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/edpr-srp-wrap-up-800-mwh-flatland-bess-project-in-arizona-1296154/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Renewables Now","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能电站建成","kp":["容量[BESS项目]: 800MWh"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":9.0},"as":"EDPR（EDP可再生能源）与SRP（盐河项目）完成了位于亚利桑那州的Flatland电池储能项目，总容量达800MWh。该项目标志着大型电网级电池储能系统在美国西南部的持续扩张，为区域可再生能源整合和电网稳定性提供支持。","ot":"EDPR, SRP wrap up 800-MWh Flatland BESS project in Arizona","b":"EDPR, SRP wrap up 800-MWh Flatland BESS project in Arizona | Energy Storage News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nabout 8 hours ago\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nCIP sells minority stakes in 500-MW Scottish battery project Devilla\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nEDPR, SRP wrap up 800-MWh Flatland BESS project in Arizona\nJun 9, 2026, 4:58:37 PM\nSladjana Djunisic\nEnergy Storage\nRegion/Country:\nLatest top stories\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nabout 8 hours ago\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nCIP sells minority stakes in 500-MW Scottish battery project Devilla\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nLatest in Capacity\nZenith nears 200-MWp Italian goal with new solar project buy\nGenneia powers up all 180 MW at San Rafael solar farm in Argentina\nAlterric connects 2-MW BESS at German wind farm\nLatest in Energy storage\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nPowerBank safe harbours 30 MW of solar, 31 MWh of storage projects in US\nDispatch energises 45-MW Dutch battery storage site\nLatest in USA\nQE Solar acquires Vanguard Energy Partners' O&M biz to expand in US\nZelestra inks PPA with Meta for 140-MW Palmera solar project in Texas\nTOYO to set up 1.5-GW HJT solar cell factory in Texas\nLatest in USA & CANADA\nRevolve to add 125 MW of solar to US project pipeline\n38 Degrees snaps up 104 MW of community solar from Cypress Creek\nSpain's Greening sells 2.1-MWp rooftop solar project portfolio in US\nLatest in Capacity\nZenith nears 200-MWp Italian goal with new solar project buy\nLatest in Energy storage\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nLatest in USA\nQE Solar acquires Vanguard Energy Partners' O&M biz to expand in US\nLatest in USA & CANADA\nRevolve to add 125 MW of solar to US project pipeline\nMost read stories\nGoldenPeaks Poland files for bankruptcy in US amid Brookfield bid\nOffshore Wind\nGE Vernova denied reconsideration in Vineyard Wind dispute\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"自噬体-线粒体接触的失调导致 tauop 中的自噬功能障碍和神经退行性变","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520331123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mitochondria (Mito) engage in extensive communication with other organelles through membrane contacts. Perturbed mitochondria–organelle interactions are indicated in a variety of neurodegenerative diseases, but the underlying mechanisms remain poorly understood. Here, we report a class of mitochondria–organelle communication: autophagosome/autophagic vacuole (AV)–Mito contact, which exhibits hypertethering in tauopathy neurons, consequently hampering AV retrograde transport. Such defects are attributed to accelerated turnover of the contact release factor TBC1D15, triggered by mitochondrial bioenergetic deficit-induced hyperactivity of the adenosine monophosphate-activated protein kinase (AMPK). Increasing TBC1D15 levels or repressing AMPK activity normalizes AV-Mito contact release and restores retrograde transport of AVs, thereby increasing autophagic cargo clearance and reducing tau burden in tauopathy axons. Furthermore, overexpression of TBC1D15 enhances autophagic clearance and attenuates tau pathology, alleviating neurodegeneration and cognitive dysfunction in tauopathy mice. Taken together, our study provides mechanistic insights into AV-Mito contact dysregulation in tauopathy-related autophagy failure, laying the groundwork for the development of potential therapeutics to combat tauopathy diseases.","tp":"神经退行","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"线粒体通过膜接触与其他细胞器广泛交流。研究发现，在tau蛋白病（tauopathy）神经元中，自噬体/自噬泡与线粒体的接触出现过度连接现象，阻碍了自噬泡的逆向运输，进而导致自噬功能障碍与神经退行性病变。"},{"t":"阶段演变的钯催化动态调控：实现木质素衍生醛的高效选择性加氢","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag338/8704110?rss=1","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钯催化木质素加氢","kp":["催化剂[木质素加氢]: 阶段演化Pd，Pd2+→限域纳米颗粒"],"as":"该研究聚焦钯(Pd)催化剂在木质素衍生醛类选择性加氢反应中的动态演化行为。传统催化剂在温和条件下难以同时兼顾高选择性与高原子利用效率。研究揭示了阶段演化型Pd催化体系中催化活性位点随反应进程动态重构的机制，通过精准调控Pd的价态与配位环境，在环境温度/压力下实现了对芳香醛C=O键的高选择性加氢。该策略打破了贵金属催化剂活性与选择性不可兼得的传统困境，为生物质增值转化提供了原子经济性更高的新路径。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dynamic evolution in stage-evolving Pd catalysis: unlocking efficient and selective hydrogenation of lignin-derived alde","b":"Selective hydrogenation of lignin-derived aldehydes, particularly achieving high catalyst atomic efficiency under ambient conditions, remains challenging. Here, we developed a stage-evolving Pd catalysis that bridges the functions of distinct Pd states to address this limitation. Operando monitoring reveals a sequential transformation from homogeneous Pd2+ to graphene-confined Pd nanoparticles (~3.26 nm), with each stage making a specific contribution. In the vanillin hydrogenation at 30 °C, this system achieves 99.4% conversion within 30 min with 95.0% yield toward 2-methoxy-4-methylphenol and a remarkable turnover frequency of 673.9 h−1, outperforming conventional static sites Pd catalysts reduced by H2 or NaBH4 (≤42.5% conversion, 12.1% yield). Comprehensive in-situ spectroscopic characterizations, combined with kinetic and theoretical investigations, have elucidated the interfacial reaction pathways governing vanillin hydrogenation at distinct Pd active sites and established the correlation between multi-stage catalysis and product selectivity. Mechanistically, the initial Pd2+ phase facilitates C = O adsorption and subsequent hydrogenation to C-OH (47.47 kJ/mol), whereas the in-situ generated Pd/Graphene promotes H2 homolytic dissociation into H* (rather than hydrogen transfer from the isopropanol solvent) and drives the rate-determining hydrodeoxygenation of C-OH (52.44 kJ/mol). This work paves the way for the rational design of dynamic catalytic systems to achieve atomically efficient hydrogenation of lignin-derived aldehydes.","aip":1},{"t":"适配体工程化限域微环境的双单原子催化剂：实现时空可控的选择性转化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73645?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双单原子催化","kp":["催化剂[时空控制转化]: 适配体功能化Au-Fe双单原子催化剂"],"dp":1,"as":"短寿命反应中间体的时空精准控制是多相催化的核心难题。该工作提出一种双单原子催化剂设计，借助核酸适配体(aptamer)在活性位点周围构建限域反应微环境，模拟酶催化中的底物识别与口袋效应。适配体通过特异性分子识别将反应物精准引导至双金属单原子位点，有效抑制副反应并提升目标产物选择性。该策略将生物分子的分子识别能力与单原子催化剂的高原子效率相结合，为设计具有酶级选择性的非均相催化体系开辟了全新范式。","sc":7.6,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Dual‐Single‐Atom Catalyst with Aptamer‐Engineered Confined Reactive Milieu for Spatiotemporally Controlled Selective Con","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Spatiotemporal control of short‐lived reactive intermediates remains a central challenge in heterogeneous catalysis, as non‐selective diffusion fundamentally limits efficiency in complex media. Inspired by enzymatic compartmentalization, we report an aptamer‐functionalized Au‐Fe dual‐single‐atom catalyst (Apt‐Au\n                    1\n                    ‐Fe\n                    1\n                    /NC) that mimics nature's precision by integrating atomically dispersed Au‐Fe sites with a genetically engineered recognition element. This material design creates a “smart reactive pocket” featuring two synergistic interfaces: the Au‐Fe heteronuclear pair electronically modulates the\n                    d\n                    ‐band center to lock the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) into a highly selective 3‐electron pathway with a lowered energy barrier (0.424 eV), while the grafted aptamer acts as a molecular gatekeeper for substrate pre‐enrichment. The resulting architecture achieves exceptional selectivity (87.0%–92.6%) for specific targets while suppressing non‐specific mineralization to below 5.3%—a stark contrast to conventional systems where selectivity is negligible and mineralization exceeds 90%. Mechanistically, the synergistic electronic interaction ensures localized ·OH generation, while the aptamer enforces a strict “proximity effect,” confining these radicals within the nanoscale space for instantaneous consumption by captured substrates. By imposing biological recognition‐based spatial constraints on inorganic active centers, this work establishes a universal paradigm for decoupling activity from selectivity, enabling precision chemical conversion in complex matrices.","aip":1},{"t":"通过轨道和关联协同作用双重增强 FeSe/SrTiO3 的超导性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602209123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"In iron-based superconductors, the\n                    \n                      d\n                      z\n                    \n                    2\n                    orbital band typically resides far below the Fermi level and has not been considered to participate in Cooper pairing. Here, using monolayer FeSe/SrTiO\n                    3\n                    as a model system, we demonstrate that tip-induced tensile strain controllably shifts the\n                    \n                      d\n                      z\n                    \n                    2\n                    band toward the Fermi level, driving a two-stage enhancement of superconductivity. In-plane lattice expansion first enhances electronic correlation, amplifying superconductivity in the initial stage. As strain further increases, the upward-shifted\n                    \n                      d\n                      z\n                    \n                    2\n                    band hybridizes with the\n                    \n                      d\n                      xy\n                    \n                    band, reconstructing the pairing-active\n                    d\n                    -orbital bands and inducing a secondary, stronger gap enhancement. Collectively, these two stages enlarge the superconducting gap from 17.8 to 23.6 meV. Throughout this process, invariant Fermi wave vectors confirm that the enhancement originates from band renormalization and reconstruction rather than carrier doping. Our work establishes a route to tailor superconducting states via strain-activated electronic correlations and band engineering, and reveals a previously unrecognized orbital-selective pairing mechanism with broad implications for correlated multiband superconductors.","tp":"铁基超导","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究以单层FeSe/SrTiO₃为模型体系，发现铁基超导体中通常远离费米能级的d_z²轨道带可通过针尖诱导的拉伸应变可控地移向费米能级。研究揭示了轨道与电子关联的协同作用可双重增强该体系的超导性，挑战了d_z²轨道不参与库珀配对的传统认知。"},{"t":"不要竞争，要合作：为什么集体资助申请是未来","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01815-y","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Scientists with disparate expertise writing grants together can identify knowledge gaps and drive progress — but systems must change to incentivize them. Scientists with disparate expertise writing grants together can identify knowledge gaps and drive progress — but systems must change to incentivize them."},{"t":"脑脊髓连接组中的分布式控制回路","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10735-w","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"Nature","as":"该研究构建了覆盖脑与脊髓的全神经系统连接组(connectome)图谱，并在其上识别分布式的控制回路。正如基因组革命重塑了分子遗传学，连接组学正在推动神经科学从结构描述走向功能机制解析。研究通过图论与网络控制理论，揭示了神经元与突触网络中信息流动的拓扑规律，刻画了跨脑-脊髓层级分布的控制节点与信号通路。该工作为理解运动控制、感觉整合等全脑协同功能的神经机制提供了系统级框架，对神经环路修复与脑机接口设计具有启示意义。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"脑脊髓连接组","kp":["模型[连接组]: 果蝇全脑+腹神经索连接组","规模[突触]: ~10⁸连接"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Distributed control circuits across a brain-and-cord connectome","b":"Just as genomes revolutionized molecular genetics, connectomes (maps of neurons and synapses) are transforming neuroscience. To date, the only organisms with complete connectomes are worms1–3, sea squirts4, and comb jellies5 (103–104 synapses). By contrast, the fruit fly is more complex (108 synaptic connections), with a brain that supports learning and spatial memory6,7 and an intricate ventral nerve cord analogous to the vertebrate spinal cord8–12. Here we report the first densely-reconstructed adult fly connectome that unites the brain and ventral nerve cord, and we leverage this resource to investigate principles of neural control. We show that effector neurons (motor neurons, endocrine cells, and efferent neurons targeting the viscera) are primarily influenced by sensory neurons in the same body part, forming local feedback loops. These local loops are linked by long-range circuits involving ascending and descending neurons organized into behavior-centric modules. Single ascending and descending neurons are often positioned to influence the voluntary movements of multiple body parts, together with the endocrine cells or visceral organs that support those movements. Brain regions involved in learning and navigation supervise these circuits. These results reveal an architecture that is distributed, parallelized, and embodied, reminiscent of distributed control architectures in engineered systems13,14.","aip":1},{"t":"剖析氢键能量学来回答这个古老的问题：“氢键对酶促反应有多大贡献”","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534793123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Enzymes are fundamental to life, providing the rapid reactions and specificity needed to sustain biological processes. While we have overcome the first major challenge in understanding enzymes—identifying their reaction mechanisms—the second major challenge of quantifying the contributions of each catalytic interaction and molecular mechanism remains largely unmet. In particular, hydrogen bonds are ubiquitous in enzyme active sites, yet their quantitative contributions to enzyme catalysis have remained a fundamental unresolved question. We first describe the limitations that prevent the assignment of hydrogen bond catalytic contributions from traditional approaches. These limitations are overcome by using linear free energy relationships (LFERs) to evaluate active site hydrogen bond energetics in a particularly amenable enzyme, ketosteroid isomerase (KSI). Multiple LFERs provide a consistent picture, suggesting that KSI’s active site hydrogen bond donors, tyrosine and protonated aspartic acid side chains, contribute to catalysis because they are inherently stronger hydrogen bond donors than water molecules, the donors in the analogous nonenzymatic reaction. These LFERs also provide evidence against models that invoke distinct enzyme environments that enhance hydrogen bond energetics, relative to aqueous solution. Instead, the LFERs suggest multiple dipoles in the protein and solvent environment surrounding the active site accommodate transition state charge accumulation and provide hydrogen bond energetics similar to what is observed in protic solvents. The quantitative models from this and prior studies allow us to quantitatively estimate the catalytic contributions changes from hydrogen bonds. This model, applied to additional enzymes, will test its generality and help identify additional mechanisms that enzymes may use to enhance catalysis.","tp":"酶催化","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究系统剖析酶活性位点中氢键的能量学特征，试图量化氢键对酶催化反应的具体贡献。尽管酶催化机制已基本阐明，但各催化相互作用和分子机制的定量贡献这一核心问题仍基本未解。该工作为回答氢键在酶促反应中究竟发挥多大作用这一长期悬而未决的问题提供了新思路。"},{"t":"非对称基元驱动的放电触发电子离域抑制锰基层状材料Jahn-Teller畸变","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE03005J","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锰基钠电正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: 锰基层状氧化物(阴离子氧化还原)","[抑制姜泰勒畸变]: MMCT机制触发非对称基元电子离域"],"dp":1,"as":"锰基层状氧化物正极因阴离子氧化还原活性成为钠离子电池的有力候选。该研究通过非对称结构基元在放电过程中触发电子离域化，有效抑制Jahn-Teller畸变，为提升钠离子电池正极的结构稳定性和循环寿命提供新策略。","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Discharge-Triggered Electronic Delocalization via Asymmetric Motifs Suppresses Jahn-Teller Distortion in Mn-Based Layere","b":"Mn-based layered oxide cathodes with anionic redox activity are promising candidates for sodium-ion batteries (SIBs) owing to their high operating voltage and energy density.However, the inevitable Mn 3+ generation after cycles results in severe Jahn-Teller distortion, damaging the long cycling stability of the cathodes. Herein, we present a metal-to-metal charge transfer (MMCT) mechanism that acts at the end of discharge to inhibit the generation of Mn 3+ , thereby improving the structural sustainability of the electrode. A P2-Na 0.69 Li 0.23 Ru 0.17 Mn 0.6 O 2 cathode is selected as a model. The doping of highly electronegative Ru regulates the covalency of asymmetrical Mn-O-Ru, ensuring the electron transfer between Mn 3+ and Ru 4+ , which reduces Mn 3+ content and mitigates the Jahn-Teller distortion.As a result, the electrode shows a robust structural stability with a minimal unit cell volume change of only 0.2%. Moreover, the cathode exhibits excellent electrochemical performance, maintaining capacity retention of over 90% after 900 cycles at 2-4.3 V. The findings provide fresh insights for inhibiting the Jahn-Teller effect, offering a new paradigm for the application of Mn-based layered cathodes with high energy density for sustainable SIBs."},{"t":"锂基电池运行中正极金属-配体氧化还原过程的直接证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41565-026-02189-y","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Nature Nanotechnology","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池正极氧化还原","kp":["[电池正极]: 亚纳米尺度直接观测金属-配体氧化还原过程"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提供锂基电池正极中金属-配体氧化还原过程的直接实验证据，指出仅基于过渡金属或氧氧化还原来描述正极反应可能导致机制误判，对正极材料设计和性能优化具有指导意义。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Direct evidence of metal–ligand redox processes in positive electrodes during lithium-based battery operation","b":"Describing lithium-based battery positive electrodes based on different transition metal or oxygen-redox regimes can cause confusion in understanding metal–ligand hybridization, oxygen dimerization and degradation processes. Therefore, it is urgent to investigate the electronic structure of these materials and identify the role each cation and anion has in charge compensation at the subnanoscale. Here, using X-ray resonance photoemission spectroscopy, single-impurity Anderson models, spectral simulations and theoretical calculations, we examine redox mechanisms in positive electrodes during lithium-based battery operation. This approach reconciles the redox description of two positive electrode active materials—LiMn0.6Fe0.4PO4 and LiNiO2—in terms of varying degrees of charge transfer using the Zaanen–Sawatzky–Allen framework. In LiMn0.6Fe0.4PO4, the lack of strong hybridization indicates that the capacity results from the depopulation of metal 3d states, that is, conventional metal redox. However, in cells with LiNiO2-based positive electrodes, negative charge transfer dominates, and redox occurs through the formation and elimination of ligand-hole states. These results clarify the role of oxygen in Ni-rich systems and provide a framework to explain how the charge/discharge capacities are linked to oxygen-dominated states in highly covalent systems, without the need to consider oxygen dimerization.","aip":1},{"t":"通过电极-电解质界面溶解实现废旧电池的电极级直接再生","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01118G","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"废电池电极再生","kp":["[电池回收]: DEER同步再生NMC与石墨"],"as":"该研究提出基于电极-电解质界面相互作用的电极到电极直接再生技术，可在保留电极结构完整性前提下回收退役锂电池，相比传统仅回收金属的破碎式工艺显著提升回收效率和材料再利用价值。","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":6.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Direct electrode-to-electrode regeneration of end-of-life batteries via electrode–electrolyte interphase dissolution","b":"Lithium-ion battery recycling remains constrained by processes that recover metals at the expense of electrode integrity, while even direct recycling typically requires shredding to black mass followed by binder removal, separation, and full electrode refabrication. Here, we introduce direct electrode-to-electrode regeneration (DEER), a simultaneous electrochemical regeneration of used NMC and graphite electrodes from end-of-life batteries in their intact form by dissolving the passivating electrode–electrolyte interphase (EEI). DEER employs 1,3-dimethyl-2-imidazolidinone (DMI), a high donor number solvent that creates a thermodynamic environment favorable for solubilizing redox inactive EEI components. DEER dissolves the thick EEI on both used electrodes while preserving electrode integrity, enabling up to 95% capacity regain and improved cycling stability with a residual LiF-rich interphase. Operando Raman, operando IR, and post-mortem NMR directly track the electrochemically driven dissolution of carbonate-derived EEI species in the used DMI-based recycling electrolyte. Technoeconomic and life-cycle analyses show that DEER reduces the cost of recycled cell manufacturing by 56% relative to pyro- and hydrometallurgy, while lowering energy use and greenhouse gas emissions. Overall, DEER establishes the first validated pathway to directly regenerate and reuse electrodes harvested from truly end-of-life batteries, converting the key interfacial bottleneck into a controllable dissolution process and opening a practical route toward electrode level circularity."},{"t":"DexAnyTwist：基于混合操作系统辨识的通用灵巧扭转操作学习","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag351/8704707?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/模型和具身操作系统","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"灵巧操作学习","kp":["[灵巧操作]: 混合动力学系统辨识解决异构数据优化冲突"],"dp":1,"as":"DexAnyTwist提出通用灵巧扭转操作学习框架，结合混合操作系统的物理参数辨识，通过自适应识别系统动力学参数实现对不同物体形状和材质的鲁棒操作，推进通用灵巧操控技术的泛化能力。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"DexAnyTwist: Learning General Dexterous Twisting with Hybrid Manipulation System Identification","b":"Developing general-purpose dexterous manipulation, particularly for intricate twisting tasks, remains a long-standing challenge. Large-scale training on massive datasets encompassing a vast spectrum of geometric and physical properties is a promising path. Yet, the hybrid dynamical space inherent in heterogeneous datasets creates optimization conflicts, where standard learning paradigms fail to synthesize a cohesive control strategy across disparate physical laws. This paper presents DexAnyTwist, a framework that reformulates the general twisting task as a problem of identification and control within a hybrid dynamical system. DexAnyTwist employs an iterative strategy to progressively partition the hybrid manipulation task into dynamically consistent subsystems. This approach utilizes forward partitioning to isolate data modes based on expert performance and backward refinement to optimize specialized policies. A learned gating mechanism then dynamically composes these experts, effectively mitigating interference between distinct dynamic modes. Beyond achieving state-of-the-art performance on our large-scale dataset, our framework spontaneously evolves manipulation primitives consistent with human twisting, and demonstrates superior zero-shot generalization to novel real-world geometries. This study not only solves a complex class of twisting tasks but also establishes a scalable pathway for robots to acquire general-purpose contact-rich manipulation skills.","aip":1},{"t":"DIII-D和KSTAR装置中面向钨兼容长脉冲运行的混合模式开发","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae6f2c","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","tp":"聚变长脉冲运行","kp":["[聚变运行]: DIII-D/KSTAR联合验证高混合场景与钨偏滤器兼容"],"dp":1,"as":"针对稳态聚变堆中钨偏滤器长脉冲高性能运行的挑战，DIII-D和KSTAR装置联合开展混合运行模式研究，聚焦钨等离子体面对部件兼容的长脉冲条件优化，为未来聚变堆稳态运行提供关键实验数据。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.5},"ot":"Developing the hybrid scenario in DIII-D and KSTAR for W-compatible long-pulse operation","b":"Long-pulse, high-performance operation with tungsten plasma-facing components is a crucial challenge for achieving steady-state (SS) goals in ITER and future fusion devices. This paper presents a joint international effort between the DIII-D and KSTAR tokamaks aimed at demonstrating the compatibility of the high hybrid scenario with a tungsten divertor and superconducting coils. A DIII-D hybrid scenario recipe is successfully tailored to KSTAR’s operational constraints, which facilitates cross-device studies. The results show successful 30 s long-pulse operation in KSTAR at a normalized beta ( = 2.4) with a benign 4/3 mode and effective mitigation of tungsten accumulation. Despite this success, the KSTAR scenario exhibits a greater than 25% reduction in thermal confinement compared to the DIII-D reference. To investigate this discrepancy, we performed a predictive TGYRO validation study, which suggests that the difference is likely caused by a weaker temperature pedestal in the KSTAR discharge due to a higher and narrower density pedestal. In addition, such lower thermal confinement leads to higher impurity accumulation, possibly due to a change in neoclassical transport with increased inward pinch, which further degrades global confinement. We also report that stationary, long-pulse operation with sustained thermal confinement requires consistent fueling and wall conditioning. These findings highlight the importance of optimized fueling and real-time wall conditioning in achieving a high temperature pedestal and strong global confinement during stable long-pulse operation. We propose potential approaches toward fully SS, long-pulse operation, including real-time wall conditioning using an impurity dropper in KSTAR and future tokamaks.","aip":1},{"t":"基于深度学习的EAST装置三维外加磁场扰动等离子体响应模型","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae70c0","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","tp":"深度学习等离子体","kp":["模型[等离子体响应预测]: iTransformer优于FNN和CNN-LSTM"],"dp":1,"as":"基于EAST托卡马克装置，该研究利用深度学习构建等离子体对三维外部磁场扰动的实时响应监测模型和基于物理特征的响应优化模型，可实时预测等离子体行为，为磁约束聚变运行控制提供智能化工具。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.5,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"ot":"Deep learning based plasma response models to 3D external magnetic field perturbations in EAST","b":"The real-time response monitoring model and the physics feature based response optimization model are proposed on EAST using three deep learning models. Compared with the widely used fully connected neural network (FNN) and convolutional neural network—long short-term memory (CNN–LSTM) models, the inverted transformer (iTransformer) model, which uses the attention mechanism to more naturally capture multivariate dependencies, demonstrates the best overall performance. For real-time response monitoring, the iTransformer model is trained on 133157 experimental samples with 4-fold toroidal phase symmetry augmentation. This model establishes a direct nonlinear mapping from resonant magnetic perturbation (RMP) coils and electromagnetic measurement sensors to the plasma response. With an inference time per discharge of less than , it can provide real-time response monitoring under flexible three-dimensional (3D) fields. For experimental response optimization, the physics feature based iTransformer model is trained on 12080 filtered experimental samples. This model captures the dependence of the response amplitude on key parameters, including , , , , , , and . Combined with SHapley Additive exPlanations (SHAP) analysis, it provides interpretable insights into parameter influences and directly guides the optimization of 3D field experimental discharges. This work establishes a comprehensive framework for real-time monitoring and physics feature based optimization of plasma responses based on statistical patterns in large datasets, thereby paving the way for active control of error-field locked mode and edge localized mode (ELM)."},{"t":"解码质子陶瓷膜：面向快速材料筛选与电池设计的代数模型","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007671?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/燃料电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"质子陶瓷膜电池设计","kp":["建模方法[质子陶瓷膜]: 代数模型快速选材"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Decoding protonic ceramic membranes: An algebraic model for rapid material selection and cell design"},{"t":"DayOne与马来西亚TNB子公司签署1.5 GWp光伏及2.2 GWh储能协议","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/09/dayone-signs-1-5-gwp-solar-and-2-2-gwh-storage-deal-with-tnb-units-in-malaysia/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ESS News","as":"新加坡数据中心运营商DayOne与马来西亚TNB旗下可再生能源子公司签署双边能源供应合同，涉及1.5 GWp太阳能和2.2 GWh储能项目，为数据中心提供清洁电力，反映东南亚数据中心绿色能源转型趋势。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏储能项目","kp":["装机容量[马来西亚光伏]: ~1.5 GWp","储能容量[马来西亚BESS]: 2.2 GWh"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"DayOne signs 1.5 GWp solar and 2.2 GWh storage deal with TNB units in Malaysia - Energy Storage","b":"Singapore-based data center operator DayOne has signed bilateral energy supply contracts with TNB Renewables Sdn. Bhd. and TNB Power Generation Sdn. Bhd. covering approximately 1.5 GWp of solar capacity and 2.2 GWh of battery energy storage in Malaysia.\nThe agreements, formalized under Malaysia’s Corporate Renewable Energy Supply Scheme (CRESS), include ground-mounted solar and hybrid hydro floating solar, and cover the transfer of associated renewable energy certificates. The signing was witnessed by Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim and senior government officials.\nThe contracts extend DayOne’s CRESS partnership with TNB, which began with a June 2025 agreement covering 500 MW of renewable energy over a 21-year term, bringing total secured renewable energy in Malaysia to more than 1 GW.\nDayOne said the partnership supports its target of 100% renewable energy across its platform by 2030 and a 42% absolute reduction in Scope 1 and 2 emissions from its 2025 baseline. The company operates two hyperscale campuses in Malaysia and has made a cumulative commitment of MYR 28 billion ($6.9 billion) by the end of 2026, which it describes as its largest global operational footprint."},{"t":"David Sinclair 计划在 XPrize 竞赛中测试全身回春药物","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/09/1138545/david-sinclair-plans-to-test-whole-body-rejuvenation-drugs-in-the-xprize-competition/","c":"未分类","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"产业进展","b":"EXECUTIVE SUMMARY\nThe outspoken longevity scientist David Sinclair has been predicting that one day, you’ll go to the doctor and get a prescription that will make you 10 years younger.\nMIT Technology Review\nhas learned that he has plans to launch human tests of an oral \"reprogramming\" drug as part of a $101 million\norganized by the XPrize Foundation.\nThe foundation is offering cash awards to teams able to “restore” a person to an earlier apparent age, as measured by improvements in immune, cognitive, and muscle function.\nThe grand prize goes to any team able to show a 10-year (or greater) relative improvement after one year of treatment.\nReached by phone, Sinclair, a biologist at Harvard Medical School, confirmed that he plans to give an oral drug mixture to volunteers in a bid to seek “evidence for age restoration in humans.”\nThe trial, if it goes forward, will be a significant new development in the race to harness so-called epigenetic reprogramming. That technology is based on the discovery, 20 years ago, of powerful genes able to turn an adult cell into a stem cell similar to those found in embryos.\nThe age-reversal effect is believed to occur via a resetting of molecular controls on DNA known as epigenetic marks, which help determine a cell’s overall metabolism and identity.\nCompanies are now racing to use that phenomenon for a new form of rejuvenation medicine. Only this January, one of Sinclair’s companies,\nLife Biosciences\n, made news by winning approval to launch an initial human trial using a set of powerful reprogramming genes. The company announced today it had treated its first patient.\nBut that test involves a\ncomplex gene therapy\nand is limited to patients’ eyes, where it could treat conditions like glaucoma.\nSinclair’s new plan is bolder: a reprogramming drug you’d swallow in order to promote such effects across the body.\n“What we’re aiming to do is to epigenetically restore the animal and eventually the person,” he says. “It is true that we’ve been doing extensive animal studies with the oral agent and are looking to compete in the XPrize.”\nThis alternative method, chemical reprogramming, uses drugs to mimic the effects of the embryonic genes. That is significant because drug compounds can travel through the bloodstream, reaching most or all cells in a person’s body.\nSome experts expressed caution, saying the chemical process, at least as used in labs, is extremely harsh and not even particularly effective. “Who doesn’t dream of whole-body rejuvenation? I think it’s a great goal,” says Sergiy Velychko, founder of Soxogen, a stealth reprogramming company in Boston. “But these chemicals are used in very, very high concentrations for cell reprogramming.”\nSinclair declined to describe the exact makeup of the drug candidate, code-named SL-100, calling its contents “highly, highly confidential.”\nHowever, he has previously published lab studies of what he called “epigenetic age-reversal cocktails,” which mixed powerful chemicals with known supplements and commercially available medicines.\nIt’s those latter components that would be easiest to test on people, since doctors are free to prescribe them, even for unusual objectives like age reversal.\nJames Clement\n, head of Betterhumans, an organization that specializes in life-extension studies using existing drugs, said in a message that he is “running clinical trials” of an oral reprogramming cocktail for Sinclair’s XPrize team.\nSinclair’s team is competing in the\nXPrize Healthspan Competition\n, launched in 2023. It follows several previous competitions that focused on commercial spaceflight, lunar landings, and other goals. The XPrize Foundation is led by executive chairman Peter Diamandis, also an active promoter of longevity research.\n“If two teams are equivalent, they would split the award,” says Jamie Justice, a doctor and executive director for the contest, which was bankrolled by Saudi Arabia’s\nHevolution Foundation,\n“But it will be incredibly hard to even get to one winner.”\nJustice says a judging panel is now in the process of picking 10 finalists from 65 teams that have been exploring health foods, lifestyle interventions, digital trackers, and drug compounds.\nSinclair’s team, Justice says, was a late entrant to the contest, but like all teams, it would be required to move into wider human tests starting this year. “You have to be ready and in trials,” she says.\nThe race to harness the reprogramming phenomenon and apply it to living people is heating up, even outside the XPrize competition. On June 2, a startup called NewLimit, founded by the crypto billionaire Brian Armstrong, said it had raised\na further $435 million\n, from investors including Peter Thiel’s Founders Fund, to support what it calls “age reprogramming.”\nThe company says it is working toward delivering genetic reprogramming instructions to the liver, to treat diseases of that organ.\nBut Sinclair has been saying that whole-body rejuvenation is a possibility too. And for that, chemicals, rather than gene therapy, could be the most practical strategy.\nSinclair says his lab has been searching for such compounds and is starting to use AI “to improve the oral agents that we’re testing.”\nChemical reprogramming cocktails, as used in labs, typically involve a mix of vitamins, approved drugs, and experimental molecules. For instance, one recipe Sinclair filed a patent on includes the supplement forskolin,  the antidepressant tranylcypromine, and an experimental chemical, laduviglusib, which has been tested against Alzheimer’s, among other ingredients.\n“In those days it was a six-factor cocktail,” Sinclair says of his earlier research. “But we’ve come a long way. I can’t disclose what's in it, but it’s an improvement and an advance on that, and we’ve done a number of animal studies. They are not published, but we’ve been doing them for a long time, and we want to make sure that we’ve done a full investigation of safety and efficacy before we release any of the data.”\nWhile Sinclair’s results aren’t published, other teams say attempts to reverse the age of entire animals using chemical drugs haven’t worked yet. Last year, the lab of Vadim Gladyshev, another Harvard biologist and a member of a different XPrize team, reported on its attempt to rejuvenate mice by installing pumps in their bodies that released controlled doses of seven compounds.\nGladyshev says the procedure\nproved to be toxic\n. “The idea was to see if we could rejuvenate whole animals. Unfortunately, we have not found [the right] conditions,” he says. “At low concentrations there was no effect, and high concentrations were toxic.\"\nGladyshev says he doesn’t know what is in Sinclair’s cocktail, but says that “trying to improve the combinations makes sense.”\nSinclair, who is the author of several books on aging and has a large social media following, has frequently been criticized by other scientists for making unproven rejuvenation claims.\nas president of the Academy for Health and Lifespan Research after claiming that a supplement developed by a company his brother runs had “reversed” the age of dogs, a claim for which there was so little evidence that one scientist called it a “\nPart of the problem is that scientists still disagree on how to measure aging. And they don’t have a reliable way to measure age reversal, either, should it ever be achieved.\nJustice, the XPRIZE director, says a primary purpose of the competition is to solve that problem by encouraging the development of standardized measures of aging. That is so that anti-aging drugs can be assessed reliably, and, one-day, approved by regulators if they work.\n“We as a scientific field have been forced to ask, ‘If a medicine improves how we age, how would we know?” Justice said during\na public meeting with FDA officials in May\n. “If something worked, what would convince us as scientists, what’s meaningful to the general public?”\nFinalists in the Healthspan competition will be announced in August.\nThe country wants to become a global leader in brain implants. Strong government support is expected to help accelerate that process.\nSynthetic biologists were tantalized by the idea of making mirror images of microbes. Then things got complicated.\nIn an early step towards artificial wombs, a biotech company claims it’s developed a “fully artificial” chicken egg.\nAutomation, AI, and screening technologies are already transforming reproductive medicine.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more.","tp":"抗衰药物","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"知名长寿科学家David Sinclair计划在一项由XPrize基金会组织、总奖金达1.01亿美元的竞赛中，启动一种口服“重编程”药物的人体测试。该基金会将奖励那些能够通过改善免疫和认知等功能，使人类在表观年龄上“恢复”到更早状态的团队。"},{"t":"Databricks正洽谈估值不低于1650亿美元的融资","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/databricks-talks-raise-165-billion-valuation","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"the information","as":"数据企业Databricks正在洽谈新一轮融资，目标估值不低于1650亿美元。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"AI平台估值","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":8.0},"ot":"Databricks in Talks for Valuation of at Least $165 Billion","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"每日简报：细胞“延缓衰老”试验治疗第一人称","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01861-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"The gene-therapy trial aims to treat glaucoma by rejuvenating cells in the optic nerve. Plus, the mystery of how things freeze and encouragement to go out into the sunlight. The gene-therapy trial aims to treat glaucoma by rejuvenating cells in the optic nerve. Plus, the mystery of how things freeze and encouragement to go out into the sunlight."},{"t":"每日简报：人类胚胎基因组被精确改变","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01852-7","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The use of 'base editing' to precisely tweak human embryos has divided researchers. Plus, the number of lives saved by less-polluting cars in China and how to tip the world towards a sustainable future. The use of 'base editing' to precisely tweak human embryos has divided researchers. Plus, the number of lives saved by less-polluting cars in China and how to tip the world towards a sustainable future."},{"t":"球形托卡马克等离子体合并启动过程中的电流重排","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae729f","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","tp":"球形托卡马克合并","kp":["[球形托卡马克]: 磁重联合并启动提供高功率离子加热"],"as":"该研究聚焦球形托卡马克等离子体合并启动过程中的电流重排现象。磁重联驱动的环形等离子体合并技术可提供高功率离子加热，有望显著提升紧凑型聚变装置效率，为球形托卡马克工程化应用提供物理基础。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Current rearrangement in merging start-up of spherical tokamak plasmas","b":"Torus plasma merging technique that provides high power ion heating by magnetic reconnection is expected to significantly expand the operation scenarios of spherical tokamak (ST) fusion reactors. When two torus plasmas with plasma currents in the same direction are merged, magnetic flux change induces a sheet current in the opposite direction between them. In order to establish ST equilibrium after merging, this opposite current must be reversed quickly. The plasma current rearrangement mechanism during/after plasma merging was investigated in the UTST plasma merging experiment. In the downstream region, a larger electrostatic field than that expected in the steady state is formed, and reversed the parallel electric field along the magnetic field lines. The radial profile of the parallel electric field shows good agreement with the toroidal current density and the soft x-ray emission distribution, indicating that the parallel electric field governs the behavior of electrons in the downstream region and contributes to form the plasma current distribution that sustain the equilibrium of the merged ST."},{"t":"Cryo-EM 揭示了 PCDH15 的右手双螺旋二聚体结构","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2607573123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Tip links connect the stereocilia of mechanosensory hair cells in the inner ear and transmit force onto mechanotransduction (MET) channels. Tip links consist of protocadherin 15 (PCDH15) and cadherin 23, which assemble into an extracellular filament approximately 150 nm in length. Rare freeze-etched electron microscopy (EM) images have suggested that tip links could be right-handed double helices in vivo, but direct structural evidence has been lacking. Using cryo-EM we determined the structure of a large part of the extracellular PCDH15 domain. Two PCDH15 molecules form a parallel cis dimer stabilized by several dimerization interfaces, including two strand crossovers and two parallel contacts, yielding a right-handed double helix. Functional studies show that mutations in PCDH15 dimerization-domains impair MET. Our results establish the molecular foundation for how PCDH15 forms a right-handed double helix to enable mechanical sensing.","tp":"冷冻电镜结构","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究人员利用冷冻电镜（cryo-EM）首次解析了原钙黏蛋白15（PCDH15）的右手双螺旋二聚体结构。PCDH15与钙黏蛋白23共同组装成约150纳米长的胞外纤维，连接内耳毛细胞静纤毛并将机械力传递至机械转导通道。早期冷冻蚀刻电镜曾提示该结构在体内呈右手双螺旋构象，但始终缺乏直接结构证据。本研究填补了这一空白，为理解听觉机械转导的分子机制提供了关键结构基础。"},{"t":"硅中静电定义量子点与⁷³Ge核自旋的耦合","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/49gt-msw9","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"硅量子点核自旋","kp":["[硅基量子计算]: 73Ge核自旋与静电定义量子点耦合"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究实现锗-73核自旋与硅中静电定义量子点的耦合，在硅量子点平台上操控锗核自旋为半导体量子计算提供长相干时间量子比特方案，推进可扩展固态量子处理器的发展。","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coupling a $^{73}\\mathrm{Ge}$ Nuclear Spin to an Electrostatically Defined Quantum Dot in Silicon","b":"Author(s): Paul Steinacker, Gauri Goenka, Rocky Yue Su, Tuomo Tanttu, Wee Han Lim, Santiago Serrano, Tim Botzem, Jesus D. Cifuentes, Shao Qi Lim, Jeffrey C. McCallum, Brett C. Johnson, Fay E. Hudson, Kok Wai Chan, Christopher C. Escott, Andre Saraiva, Chih Hwan Yang, Vincent Mourik, Andrea Morello, Andrew S. Dzurak, and Arne LauchtSingle nuclear spins in silicon are a promising resource for quantum technologies due to their long coherence times and excellent control fidelities. Qubits and qudits have been encoded on donor nuclei, with successful demonstrations of Bell states and quantum memories on the spin-$^{1}{/}_{2}$ $^{3…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230602] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"能源和环境政策在碳减排方面的成本效益协同：来自中国钢铁和钢铁行业的证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003551?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/黑色金属/钢铁","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","tp":"钢铁碳减排","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":1.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"共溶剂调控超分子手性揭示肽基纳米材料的显著压电响应","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3135255?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"肽基压电材料","kp":["[多肽压电材料]: 共溶剂调控超分子手性增强压电响应"],"dp":1,"as":"研究发现通过共溶剂调控肽基材料的超分子手性可显著增强其压电响应，揭示手性结构调控与压电性能的关系，为生物相容性压电材料在传感器和能量收集领域的应用开辟新途径。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Cosolvent‐Modulated Supramolecular Chirality Unveils Pronounced Piezoelectric Response in Peptide‐Based Nanomaterials","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Peptide‐based functional biomaterials have attracted widespread interest due to their inherent biocompatibility, biodegradability, and structural tunability. Among functional biomaterials, piezoelectric materials are particularly valuable for developing self‐powered biodevices in biomedical applications. However, peptide‐based piezoresponsive systems remain largely underexplored. In this study, we present a chromophore‐conjugated peptide (PEP‐A) that self‐assembles into nanomaterials exhibiting either piezo‐active or inactive states, with the functional behaviour closely linked to their chiroptical properties under different solvent conditions. Through a comprehensive investigation involving spectroscopy, microscopy, and atomistic simulations, we uncover how cosolvent‐induced modulation of the self‐assembly process co‐governs chiroptical and piezoelectric properties. Interestingly, PEP‐A forms elongated nanofibers in pure water that are both chiroptically and piezoelectrically inactive. However, the introduction of a minimal amount of cosolvent (1% DMSO or 1% DMF) triggers the emergence of supramolecular chirality alongside a significant piezoresponse, revealing a direct correlation between macroscopic chirality and piezoelectric functionality. Our findings highlight how subtle changes in the assembly environment can drive profound shifts in material properties, offering a powerful strategy to design responsive piezoelectric biomaterials. This study provides a novel approach to designing next‐generation, responsive, peptide‐based piezoelectric biomaterials for biomedical and bioelectronic applications."},{"t":"对“用于促进缺血组织血管再生的人工混合纳米细胞仿生设计”的修正","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73691?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"Salomon 等人的美国 COVID-19 趋势和影响调查的更正：对 COVID-19 系统的连续实时测量","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2617330123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"更正 McDonald 等人的问题：辅助指标能否改善 COVID-19 预测和热点预测？","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2617334123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"配位工程调控界面路径分配用于电催化CO₂转化及下游升级","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7212170?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2电催化还原","kp":["催化剂[CO2电还原]: Cu-Sn配位环境可调","[选择性调控]: Sn中心产甲酸/Cu中心产CO路径分离"],"dp":1,"as":"电化学CO₂还原反应（eCO₂RR）是碳中和技术链的关键环节，其商业化取决于产物选择性与能量效率。该研究提出配位工程驱动的界面路径分区策略，通过精准调控催化剂表面活性位点的配位环境，实现对多条还原路径的选择性分隔与引导，从而抑制副反应、提升目标碳产物的法拉第效率。该策略为电催化体系从实验室走向下游兼容的碳产品制备提供了新的结构设计范式。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coordination‐Engineered Interfacial Pathway Partitioning for Electrocatalytic CO2 Conversion and Downstream Upgrading","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (eCO\n                    2\n                    RR) is increasingly capable of delivering downstream‐compatible carbon products, yet the interfacial origin of pathway selection remains insufficiently understood. Here, coordination‐environment‐tunable Cu–Sn catalysts are employed to partition CO\n                    2\n                    electrosynthesis between a Sn‐centered formate‐selective pathway and a Cu‐centered CO‐selective pathway. In situ spectroscopy reveals coordination‐dependent evolution of adsorbed intermediate and interfacial water structures, while H/D kinetic isotope analysis and in situ electrochemical impedance spectroscopy‐distribution of relaxation times (EIS‐DRT) measurements resolve distinct proton‐coupled and polarization‐sensitive kinetic regimes. Density functional theory calculations further elucidate the energetic origin of pathway bifurcation through coordination‐dependent reconstruction of adsorption geometry and interfacial energetics. Sn‐centered medium‐coordination regimes favor oxygen‐bound intermediates and a proton‐coupled formate pathway, whereas Cu‐centered medium‐coordination regimes promote carbon‐bound adsorption and CO‐selective reactivity. In the downstream modules, electrodialysis achieves a 98.1% HCOOK‐to‐HCOOH conversion with 93.97% Faradaic efficiency (FE) at 300 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , while CO\n                    2\n                    ‐NH\n                    3\n                    route delivers formamide with a maximum FE of 45.2% and a production rate of 840 µmol cm\n                    −2\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    . This work establishes coordination‐engineered interfacial partitioning as a strategy for integrated CO\n                    2\n                    electrosynthesis with downstream upgrading."},{"t":"Ir-Mo原子对位点的配位工程突破酸性析氧反应的标度限制","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3665828?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铱钼原子对析氧","kp":["催化剂[酸性OER]: Ir-Mo原子对/MoO3","[打破标度关系]: 第二壳层配位工程调控Ir单原子构型"],"dp":1,"as":"单原子催化剂（SACs）在活性和耐久性上受限于线性标度关系，即中间体吸附能之间难以独立调控。该研究通过铱-钼（Ir-Mo）双原子对位点的配位工程，打破传统标度限制，实现对关键反应中间体吸附能的解耦优化。这种原子级双位点协同设计有效提升了催化剂的内在活性与长期稳定性，为高效能源转换反应（如氧还原、析氢等）提供了超越单原子构型的性能突破路径。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Coordination Engineering of Ir─Mo Atomic Pair Sites to Break Scaling Limitations for Acidic Oxygen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Coordination engineering of single‐atom catalysts (SACs) is a powerful strategy to address durability and activity challenges in the acidic oxygen evolution reaction (OER). Here, we obtain two distinct Ir single‐atom configurations on MoO\n                    3\n                    support by regulating the second‐shell coordination environment. Compared with the weakly interacting Ir─O─Mo structure, atomic pair sites formed through direct Ir─Mo coordination exhibit strong electronic coupling with the support, thereby enhancing atomic dispersion and structural stability. In situ experimental and theoretical studies reveal that the Ir─Mo pair sites trigger a new oxide‐mediated pathway, in which dynamic hydroxyl spillover from Mo to Ir site effectively facilitates *OOH formation. This process breaks the linear scaling relationship between *OH and *OOH adsorption, lowering the energy barrier of the rate‐limiting step and enabling superior OER kinetics. As a result, the Ir\n                    O+Mo\n                    /MoO\n                    3\n                    catalyst achieves outstanding stability for over 1500 h at 10 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    in acidic electrolyte and sustains continuous operation for 300 h at 1.0 A cm\n                    −2\n                    in the proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer. This work provides novel insights into the coordination engineering of SACs and opens a promising avenue for overcoming scaling limitations in acidic OER catalysis."},{"t":"用于非侵入式负荷监测的卷积神经网络：批判性分析与未来方向","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926007877?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"观点评论","tp":"负荷监测CNN","kp":["方法[非侵入负荷监测]: 卷积神经网络"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":2.0},"ot":"Convolutional neural networks for non-intrusive load monitoring: a critical analysis and future directions"},{"t":"利用反常磁近邻效应控制亚皮秒相干自旋与谷动力学","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/86pk-g8d6","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"自旋谷动力学","kp":["[自旋谷电子学]: 反常磁近邻调控亚皮秒相干动力学"],"as":"二维材料中的自旋-谷耦合效应赋予电子额外的量子自由度，是自旋电子学与谷电子学的核心基础。该研究利用反常机制对亚皮秒时间尺度下的相干自旋与谷动力学进行主动调控，实现了对自旋极化和谷占据的超快、相干操控。这一突破有望推动超低功耗、超高速信息存储与量子信息处理器件的发展，为下一代基于二维半导体的非易失性自旋谷电子器件奠定实验基础。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Controlling the Subpicosecond Coherent Spin and Valley Dynamics with Anomalous Magnetic Proximity Effect","b":"Author(s): Qian Hu, Yong Tan, Qirui Cui, Yuqing Huang, Wenkai Zhu, Xiaomin Zhang, Yujing Wang, Yue Wang, Xuan Qian, Jing Zhang, Zhongming Wei, Jingbi You, Yang Ji, Lixia Zhao, Qihua Xiong, and Kaiyou WangSpin-and-valley-tronics explores the spin and valley degree of freedom for power-efficient and high-speed information storage and processing. A critical challenge in advancing spin-and-valley-tronic devices toward quantum operation lies in achieving coherent control over the spin and valley dynamics…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236701] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026"},{"t":"病毒RNA聚合酶和核酸外切酶的连续催化步骤提出了一种克服内在核苷酸模拟的方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605725123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Nucleotide analogues (NAs) have been successfully used for the treatment of various RNA virus infections by selectively targeting the viral RNA-dependent RNA polymerase (RdRp) for incorporation into the viral genome. However two major families of human-infecting RNA viruses,\n                    Coronaviridae\n                    (CoV) and\n                    Arenaviridae,\n                    encode exonuclease domains that may recognize and remove incorporated NAs, thus providing natural resistance against some of these drugs. Both polymerization and excision reactions are mechanistically centered on the nucleotide α-phosphate, enabling the potential for sequential inhibition of both RNA synthesis and repair. Here, we provide structural evidence of inversion of configuration at the phosphorus center during polymerization, demonstrating that the SARS-CoV-2 RdRp proceeds through an S\n                    N\n                    2 mechanism. A 2.39 Å resolution cryo-EM structure of a ternary replication complex bound to RNA and an α-thio–modified NTP shows that incorporation of the preferred\n                    S\n                    P\n                    isomer at the 3′ end of the RNA yields a phosphorothioate linkage in the\n                    R\n                    P\n                    configuration. This\n                    R\n                    P\n                    -phosphorothioate RNA product shows reduced cleavage by both the SARS-CoV-2 and three arenavirus RNA exonucleases, revealing a stereochemical preference opposite to that of structurally related DNA exonucleases. This observation contradicts the prevailing assumption that sulfur substitution at the metal-coordinating oxygen universally blocks catalysis. Instead, RNA exonuclease stereoselectivity appears to be shaped not only by metal–sulfur interactions but also by the geometry of nucleophile activation. These findings provide mechanistic insights into phosphoryl transfer in viral polymerases and exonucleases and highlight opportunities to counteract intrinsic nuclease-mediated resistance against antiviral nucleotide analogues.","tp":"病毒聚合酶","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"核苷酸类似物（NAs）常用于治疗RNA病毒感染。然而，冠状病毒和沙粒病毒等编码的核酸外切酶结构域可识别并切除已整合的NAs，产生天然耐药性。该研究揭示了病毒RNA聚合酶与核酸外切酶的连续催化机制，提出了一种克服这种内在核苷酸模拟与耐药性的新方法。"},{"t":"嵌入金属硫化物中的构象自适应冠醚可实现出色的锶捕获","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9159294?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Precise conformational control of flexible supramolecular moieties (e.g., crown ethers) in crystalline‐state adsorbents is essential for efficient host–guest recognition. Traditional strategies relying on covalent chemistry are often limited by either tedious synthesis or a sacrifice of conformational flexibility. Here, we introduce a simple non‐covalent anchoring strategy where 18‐crown‐6 (18Cr6) molecules are\n                    in‐situ\n                    embedded between the interlayer galleries of a perforated thiostannate framework (18Cr6‐SnS) in one‐pot synthesis. This architecture not only ensures ordered alignment of crown ethers but also preserves the intrinsic coordination freedom, thereby enabling exceptional Sr\n                    2+\n                    binding affinity. 18Cr6‐SnS exhibits a record‐high distribution coefficient (\n                    K\n                    d\n                    = 4.9 × 10\n                    6 \n                    mL/g) under neutral conditions and excellent selectivity in simulated acidic high‐level liquid waste, displaying high separation factors (\n                    K\n                    d\n                    Sr\n                    /\n                    K\n                    d\n                    M\n                    ) for Cs\n                    +\n                    (96), Eu\n                    3+\n                    (245), and Ni\n                    2+\n                    (621) in 1 M HNO\n                    3\n                    . Experimental and theoretical analyses reveal that the superior Sr\n                    2+\n                    recognition arises from the conformational adaptability of intercalated crown ethers, coupled with adjustable interlayer spacing. This work establishes a cost‐effective and scalable route to develop advanced adsorbents by synergizing host materials with flexible supramolecular receptors for critical energy and environmental applications.","tp":"锶捕获材料","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出一种非共价锚定策略，将18-冠-6分子原位嵌入金属硫化物晶态吸附剂中，实现对柔性超分子基团的精确构象控制。该策略克服了传统共价化学方法合成繁琐或牺牲构象灵活性的局限，使冠醚在保持构象适应性的同时高效选择性捕获锶离子，在放射性核废料处理和环境修复等领域具有重要应用前景。"},{"t":"ICRF加热托卡马克等离子体中剪切Alfvén波爆裂与非爆裂行为的综合模拟","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae72a4","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","tp":"剪切阿尔芬波模拟","kp":["[阿尔芬波]: 首次kinetic-MHD混合模拟爆发型TAE"],"as":"本研究首次对离子回旋共振加热（ICRH）驱动的托卡马克等离子体中爆发现象与稳态剪切阿尔芬波进行了全面模拟。研究系统分析了阿尔芬波的不稳定性特征及其与高能粒子的相互作用，对理解磁约束聚变装置中等离子体行为、优化加热方案以减少能量损失具有重要意义。","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Comprehensive simulations of bursting and non-bursting shear Alfvén waves in ICRF heated tokamak plasmas","b":"This work reports the first comprehensive simulations of ion cyclotron resonance heating (ICRH) driven tokamak plasmas on the slowing-down timescale using the kinetic-MHD hybrid code MEGA, where shear Alfvén wave induced minority ion transport is self-consistently included during the high-energy tail formation. Bursting toroidal Alfvén eigenmodes (TAEs) are observed in both multi-n and single-n simulations of plasmas with a relatively low magnetic field ( ) and an ion-cyclotron-range-of-frequency (ICRF) resonance layer located at the magnetic axis or on the inboard side, while outboard heating always leads to non-bursting TAEs, where is the toroidal mode number. During bursting events, a series of discrete TAEs with distinct frequencies emerges for each toroidal harmonic, with spatial overlap between adjacent modes. In contrast, in non-bursting cases, harmonics with the same toroidal mode number but centered at different radial locations form a single broad structure with nearly identical frequencies. The results further show that, in the bursting case, minority particles remain far from the radio-frequency (RF) resonance layer, whereas in the non-bursting case they stay close to it and experience strong ICRF-driven velocity-space diffusion. This indicates that ICRF-driven velocity-space diffusion can help suppress bursting TAEs and sustain higher energetic particle beta, highlighting the sensitivity of Alfvén eigenmode (AE) dynamics to the ICRF resonance location, which may be utilized for future AE control strategies."},{"t":"通过偏滤器热负荷对称化补偿Wendelstein 7-X的1/1和2/2误差场","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1741-4326/ae738e","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"Nuclear Fusion - latest papers","tg":"研究论文","tp":"仿星器误差场补偿","kp":["[W7-X仿星器]: 偏滤器热负载对称化补偿误差场"],"as":"Wendelstein 7-X仿星器实验利用水冷高热流偏滤器，通过监测偏滤器热载荷分布成功实现了对1/1和2/2误差场的补偿校正。该成果展示了偏滤器热载信号作为诊断手段的有效性，为提升仿星器等离子体约束性能和长脉冲稳态运行提供了实用工程方案。","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.5},"ot":"Compensation of 1/1 and 2/2 error field in Wendelstein 7-X via divertor heat load symmetrization","b":"Recent experiments with the water-cooled, high-heat-flux divertor of the Wendelstein 7-X (W7-X) stellarator demonstrate substantial progress in error-field compensation. Numerical simulations reveal a pronounced sensitivity of divertor heat load distributions to error fields. Experimentally, wide-angle infrared cameras monitoring all ten divertor units show significant improvements in the symmetry of divertor thermal footprints when trim coils and control coils are employed to compensate intrinsic 1/1 and 2/2 error fields, respectively. The experimentally determined amplitude of the intrinsic 1/1 error field is consistent with results obtained seven years ago, despite different diagnostics, divertor components, and slight variation in magnetic configurations. For the first time, the intrinsic 2/2 error field has been compensated through a phase-scan experiment using control coil currents, supported and validated by simulations."},{"t":"认知不会自动影响感知：来自不同类别颜色的神经编码的证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538139123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"The firmest evidence in favor of models that posit early high-level influences of cognition on perception comes from electroencephalography (EEG). Enhanced early, preattentive processing of light and dark blue feature changes compared to light and dark green changes was reported in Greek speakers, who have two basic terms for “blue” (\n                    ghalazio/ble\n                    ). In the present three-experiment study, we systematically reevaluate this evidence and test an alternative model that the early difference waves in the human EEG instead mainly reflect contrast adaptation phenomena. We use the same classical oddball paradigm presenting alternating standards and deviants that systematically differ in color and/or luminance and chromatic contrast. We then calculate the visual mismatch negativity (vMMN), a putative index of preattentive feature change processing and predictive coding derived from EEG data, by subtracting the activity elicited by standards from that elicited by task-irrelevant deviants. Our experiments demonstrate the following: 1) vMMN is driven by contrast adaptation, being observable only in the presence of contrast differences between the stimuli and not reliably observed for categorically different hues equated in contrast; 2) there is no reliable difference between green- and blue-related difference waves in speakers (Russian) with two basic blue color categories, the difference waves, again, being driven by contrast rather than their categorical content. Our findings are highly significant for the debate concerning the interface between perception and cognition, as the absence of early categorical effects speaks against models that predict Whorfian-type preattentive cognitive influences on perception.","tp":"认知与感知","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":1.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"支持认知早期影响感知的脑电图（EEG）证据显示，拥有两个“蓝色”基础词汇的希腊语使用者在处理深浅蓝色变化时表现更好。本研究重新评估了这一证据，并提出了替代模型，证明了认知并不会自动或直接地影响人类视觉感知。"},{"t":"食物废料衍生的淀粉样蛋白吸附剂实现循环无热大气CO₂捕集","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535689123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"空气碳捕集吸附剂","kp":["吸附剂[直接空气捕集]: 食物废料衍生淀粉样蛋白","[捕集特性]: 无热循环、契合循环经济"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究团队开发了由食物废料衍生的淀粉样蛋白吸附剂，用于大气CO2的循环和无热捕获。该方案将食物废料这一重大碳排放源转化为碳捕集材料，兼具环境友好性和经济可行性。吸附剂可循环使用且无需高温再生，显著降低了碳捕集的能耗与成本，为废物资源化与气候减缓的协同路径提供了新思路。","ot":"Circular and athermal atmospheric CO2 capture by food waste-derived amyloid sorbents","b":"Food waste contributes substantially to global CO\n                    2\n                    emissions, yet it also offers underutilized opportunities for climate change mitigation within and beyond the food system. Direct air capture technologies can help offset these emissions, but most current sorbents are synthetic, energy-intensive, and poorly aligned with circular-economy principles, while bio-based alternatives typically feature low CO\n                    2\n                    capacity and poor stability. Here, we upcycle proteins recovered from dairy and tofu waste streams into functional amyloid fibril microbeads for ambient CO\n                    2\n                    capture. Atomic-level design and templated molding enable lysine and glutamine residues within the fibrils, along with hydroxyl groups introduced by mild KOH treatment, to form abundant active sites for CO\n                    2\n                    capture, achieving up to 2.20 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    under ambient air, and 2.51 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    under simulated air (oxygen-free). The microbeads are regenerated within 10 to 12 min via alternating dilute acid–alkali mist without any thermal input and remain stable over 30 cycles. Life cycle assessment, ranking efficiency product, and techno-economic analysis reveal superior sustainability and cost efficiency compared with conventional sorbents, validating a circular economy approach that upcycles food waste into CO\n                    2\n                    sorbents, which can, if needed, ultimately be reintegrated into the food system."},{"t":"Christian Böhlmann 和工程博士。 Simon Kothe – 新的双重领导层领导施塔德的自动化和生产技术","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://nachrichten.idw-online.de/2026/06/09/christian-boehlmann-und-dr-ing-simon-kothe-neue-doppelspitze-leitet-automatisierung-und-produktionstechnik-in-stade","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航空","a":"Informationsdienst Wissenschaft-idw","tg":"行业观察","b":"Christian Böhlmann und Dr.-Ing. Simon Kothe – Neue Doppelspitze leitet Automatisierung und Produktionstechnik in Stade\nHinweis zur Verwendung von Bildmaterial: Die Verwendung des Bildmaterials zur Pressemitteilung ist bei Nennung der Quelle vergütungsfrei gestattet. Das Bildmaterial darf nur in Zusammenhang mit dem Inhalt dieser Pressemitteilung verwendet werden. Falls Sie das Bild in höherer Auflösung benötigen oder Rückfragen zur Weiterverwendung haben, wenden Sie sich bitte direkt an die Pressestelle, die es veröffentlicht hat.\nNeue Doppelspitze für Automatisierung und Produktionstechnik: Christian Böhlmann (links) und Dr.-Ing. Simon Kothe (rechts) übernehmen die Leitung des Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade von Dr. Dirk Niermann (Mitte).\n| Copyright:\nFraunhofer IFAM\nAm 1. Juni 2026 übergab Dr. Dirk Niermann die Bereichsleitung der Außenstelle des Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade an die nächste Generation, um mit dem Aufbau des Geschäftsfelds Raumfahrt am Fraunhofer IFAM in Bremen zu beginnen.\nSeit 1. Juni 2026 leiten Christian Böhlmann und Dr.-Ing. Simon Kothe den Bereich Automatisierung und Produktionstechnik des Fraunhofer IFAM am Standort Stade im Forschungszentrum CFK NORD. Sie übernehmen den Staffelstab von Dr. Dirk Niermann, der die Außenstelle seit 2009 aufgebaut, zu einer weltweit renommierten FuE-Einrichtung ausgebaut sowie geleitet hat. Als Doppelspitze starten sie gemeinsam mit dem Stader FuE-Team in die automatisierte, digitale, KI-gestützte, wandlungsfähige Produktion der Zukunft.\nWeltweit renommiert – Automatisierung und Produktionstechnik aus Stade\nAm Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade wurden unter der Leitung von Dr. Dirk Niermann eine Reihe von Meilensteinen im Anwendungsfeld der automatisierten Montage und Bearbeitung großer Leichtbaustrukturen erreicht.\nDazu gehören die vollautomatische Form- und Lagekorrektur bei der Montage von Großbauteilen zu größeren Strukturen, wie beispielsweise Flugzeugrümpfen, das automatisierte Füllen von verbleibenden Fügespalten, die Steigerung der Absolutgenauigkeiten konventioneller Industrieroboter durch nachrüstbare Technologiebausteine sowie von Grund auf neu konstruierte, hochsteife Roboter, die u.a. durch Hybridantriebe auch Metallwerkstoffe, wie z.B. Stähle, mit bisher für Industrieroboter unerreichbarer Präzision bearbeiten können.\nDiese und weitere Technologien haben beispielsweise die weltweit erste vollautomatisierte Montage eines Thermoplast-Flugzeugrumpfsegments im Originalmaßstab eines Passagierflugzeugs im Projekt Clean Aviation Multi Functional Fuselage Demonstrator (MFFD) beim Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade ermöglicht.\nDoppelspitze – Ein starkes Zeichen für die Zukunft des Fraunhofer IFAM am Standort Stade\nMit der neuen Doppelspitze für Automatisierung und Produktionstechnik Christian Böhlmann und Dr.-Ing. Simon Kothe sendet das Fraunhofer IFAM ein klares Signal für die Zukunft: Der Standort Stade wird gezielt als führender Innovationshub für automatisierte Produktion und Großstrukturmontage weiterentwickelt.\nIm Fokus stehen der Transfer von Forschungsergebnissen in die industrielle Anwendung – insbesondere für die nächste Generation effizienter und emissionsfreier Flugzeuge – sowie der konsequente Ausbau von Schlüsseltechnologien für Robotik und Künstliche Intelligenz.\nGleichzeitig soll Stade mit seinen Forschungs- und Entwicklungsaktivitäten seine bedeutende Rolle über die Luftfahrtbranche hinaus stärken und ausbauen: durch neue Impulse in den Sektoren Raumfahrt, Energie, Mobilität, maritime Anwendungen und Agrar sowie durch eine noch engere und zielgerichtetere Zusammenarbeit mit Industrie, Politik und Wissenschaft.\nDie geteilte Standortleitung schafft die Voraussetzung, strategische Entwicklung, Wachstum sowie Technologietransfer deutlich zu beschleunigen und den Standort langfristig resilient aufzustellen.\nDarüber hinaus wird die Wissenschaftlichkeit der Forschungs- und Entwicklungsarbeiten weiterhin durch eine noch engere Zusammenarbeit mit und Anbindung des Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade an Hochschulen und Universitäten erhöht, beispielsweise durch Vorlesungen sowie gemeinsame Betreuung von Abschluss- und Promotionsarbeiten.\nDie Experten\nDr. Dirk Niermann ist seit 1997 als Wissenschaftler am Fraunhofer IFAM tätig und hat unter anderem als Projekt- und Kursleiter die Weiterbildung zum European Adhesive Engineer in deutscher und englischer Sprache aufgebaut sowie die Anerkannte Stelle für das Kleben von Schienenfahrzeugen und -fahrzeugteilen. Als Leiter und Auditor der Anerkannten Stelle hat er von 2006 bis 2009 weltweit Betriebe für das Kleben im Schienenfahrzeugbau nach DIN 6701 (heute DIN EN 17460) zertifiziert. Seit 2009 etablierte Dirk Niermann die Außenstelle Automatisierung und Produktionstechnik des Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade und leitete sie bis Mai 2026.\nIn Zukunft wird sich Dr. Dirk Niermann für das Fraunhofer IFAM am Standort Bremen dem Aufbau des Geschäftsfelds Raumfahrt widmen. Mit seinem langjährigen Erfahrungsschatz, seiner wissenschaftlichen Expertise und seinem Gespür für neue Anwendungsfelder wird er damit maßgeblich dazu beitragen, dass die Kompetenzen des Fraunhofer IFAM künftig auch in dieser Branche erfolgreich eingesetzt werden können.\nChristian Böhlmann, M.Eng., arbeitet seit 2013 am Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade und hat den Bereich Automatisierung und Produktionstechnik in verschiedenen Rollen aktiv mitentwickelt. Auf Basis seiner Berufserfahrungen bei Dow Chemical und Airbus Group Innovation übernahm er nach seinem Einstieg als wissenschaftlicher Mitarbeiter früh Verantwortung als Projekt- und Gruppenleiter. Bis Mai 2026 war Christian Böhlmann als Abteilungsleiter Integrierte Produktionssysteme sowie als stellvertretender Bereichs- bzw. Standortleiter aktiv. Seine Arbeit fokussiert auf hochpräzise, automatisierte Produktionslösungen, KI-basierte Mehrzweckrobotik sowie eine enge Verzahnung von Forschung und industrieller Anwendung.\nNeben der gemeinsamen Leitung der Außenstelle des Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade verantwortet Christian Böhlmann weiterhin die Abteilung Integrierte Produktionssysteme. Mit seiner langjährigen Erfahrung, seiner Führungskompetenz und seiner starken Verbundenheit mit dem Standort wird er die Weiterentwicklung des Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade engagiert mitgestalten.\nDr.-Ing. Simon Kothe ist seit 2011 am Fraunhofer IFAM tätig. Von 2011 bis 2017 war er Gruppenleiter am Standort Stade und verantwortete dort den Aufbau und die Leitung einer Forschungsgruppe im Bereich der robotischen Bearbeitung. Von 2018 bis 2026 leitete er dann die Abteilung Business Development und Kommunikation am Fraunhofer IFAM in Bremen. In dieser Funktion trug er maßgeblich zur strategischen Weiterentwicklung des Fraunhofer IFAM und der Fraunhofer-Gesellschaft im Luftfahrtbereich bei, insbesondere als Leiter der Geschäftsstelle von Fraunhofer AVIATION & SPACE und Sprecher des Fraunhofer Program Management Clean Aviation.\nNeben der gemeinsamen Leitung der Außenstelle des Fraunhofer IFAM in Stade verantwortet Simon Kothe weiterhin die Geschäftsfeldleitung Luftfahrt des Fraunhofer IFAM sowie die Geschäftsstelle der Fraunhofer Allianz AVIATION & SPACE. Seine Arbeit zeichnet sich durch strategischen Weitblick, ausgeprägte Führungserfahrung und eine enge, vertrauensvolle Vernetzung mit nationalen und internationalen Forschungs- und Industriepartnern aus.\nWeitere Informationen:\nhttps://www.ifam.fraunhofer.de/stade\nÄhnliche Pressemitteilungen im idw","tp":"自动化人事","sc":3.0,"scd":{"b":0.0,"i":3.0,"r":2.0,"d":1.0,"t":7.0},"as":"Christian Böhlmann和工程博士Simon Kothe被任命为德国施塔德地区自动化与生产技术部门的新联合负责人，形成双重领导架构。此为常规机构人事任命公告，介绍了两位新任领导的背景与职责分工。"},{"t":"具有晶体缺陷的 Kitaev 蜂窝模型的手性自旋液体不稳定性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/8w9t-cqzd","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","b":"Author(s): Arnab Seth, Fay Borhani, and Itamar KimchiWe study the spin-$1/2$ Kitaev honeycomb gapless spin liquid in the presence of Stone-Wales-type local lattice defects with odd-sided plaquettes. While the clean Kitaev model has no finite-temperature phase transitions, we find that introducing a finite defect density ${n}_{d}≈{10}^{−4}–{10}^{−2}$ p…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236704] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026","tp":"量子自旋液体","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":1.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者在含晶体缺陷的Kitaev蜂巢模型中发现手性自旋液体不稳定性。纯净Kitaev模型不存在有限温度相变，但引入Stone-Wales型局部晶格缺陷（含奇数边多边形）后，在缺陷密度约10⁻⁴至10⁻²范围内自旋液体基态出现失稳现象。该发现对理解量子自旋液体在非理想条件下的稳定性具有重要意义，发表于《物理评论快报》。"},{"t":"中国科学家利用氟化钾提升锌黄锡矿太阳能电池效率","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/chinese-scientists-improve-kesterita-solar-cell-efficiency-with-potassium-fluoride/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌黄锡矿电池","kp":["转换效率[黄铜矿太阳能电池]: 8.04%","[优化手段]: KF溶液处理"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":5.5,"t":7.5},"as":"中国科研团队利用氟化钾（KF）处理技术显著提升了锌黄锡矿（kesterite）太阳能电池的光电转换效率。锌黄锡矿电池作为不含稀有元素的环境友好型薄膜光伏技术，效率提升是产业化的关键瓶颈。KF处理通过优化材料界面和缺陷态，有效改善了器件性能，为低成本可持续光伏的大规模应用铺平道路。","ot":"Chinese scientists improve kesterite solar cell efficiency with potassium fluoride - pv magazine Global","b":"Research & Development\nA Chinese team improved kesterite solar cell efficiency using potassium fluoride (KF) treatment to optimize absorber quality and interface properties. The best device reached 8.04% efficiency, with gains driven by reduced interface defects and improved carrier management.\nResearch & Development\nCells & modules\nKF solution treatment | Image: Shandong Police College, Materials Today Communications, CC BY 4.0\nA research group from China’s Shandong Police College has developed a novel soft chemical treatment to improve the efficiency of kesterite-structured copper–zinc–tin selenide (CZTSe) solar cells.\n“At present, the mechanism of alkali metal treatment of kesterite solar cells still needs to be further studied,” the researchers explained. “Sodium (Na) or potassium (K) treatment can significantly boost the performance of thin-film solar cells. Alkali metal treatment can passivate the absorber surface, reduce grain-boundary defects, optimize crystal quality, and increase carrier concentration. The process of alkali metal treatment of the solar cell absorber layer also has a very important impact on the solar-cell device.”\nWith the proposed method, the absorber layer was prepared using a potassium fluoride (KF) solution.\nThe team fabricated the CZTSe solar cells on soda-lime glass (SLG) substrates coated with a molybdenum (Mo) back contact. Metallic copper (Cu), zinc (Zn), and tin (Sn) precursor layers were deposited via magnetron sputtering and adjusted to a copper-poor, zinc-rich composition. The precursors were then immersed in KF solutions at concentrations of 0, 3, 6, or 9 mmol/L for 20 minutes, followed by drying at 80 C for 20 minutes.\nSubsequently, the samples were selenized at 550 C in a selenium atmosphere to form the CZTSe absorber layer. The solar cells were completed by depositing a 50 nm cadmium sulfide (CdS) buffer layer, followed by intrinsic zinc oxide (i-ZnO), aluminum-doped zinc oxide (AZO), and nickel/aluminum (Ni/Al) front contacts. The final device structure was SLG/Mo/CZTSe/CdS/i-ZnO/AZO/Ni:Al.\nFollowing fabrication, the team characterized the devices using scanning electron microscopy (SEM), current density–voltage (J–V) measurements, external quantum efficiency (EQE) measurements, and capacitance–voltage (C–V) measurements. The results show that CZTSe performance improved with increasing KF concentration up to an optimum of 6 mmol/L. However, further increasing the KF concentration to 9 mmol/L led to performance degradation.\nSpecifically, the device treated with 6 mmol/L KF achieved an efficiency of 8.04%, an open-circuit voltage of 0.392 V, a short-circuit current density of 34.3 mA/cm², and a fill factor of 59.7%. These results compare with the reference device (without KF treatment), which showed values of 6.59%, 0.332 V, 33.7 mA/cm², and 58.8%.\nTo further understand the underlying mechanisms, the team used wxAMPS simulation software to study how interface defects and carrier density influence device performance. By varying these parameters, they found that reducing interface defects significantly improved efficiency and Voc by suppressing carrier recombination. In contrast, increasing carrier density was found to degrade device performance.\n“It has been demonstrated that potassium can promote the growth of CZTSe grains during high-temperature selenization and reduce void formation during film growth,” the team concluded. “In addition, the soft KF treatment also provided an excess potassium source and effectively suppressed surface decomposition. In particular, it reduced the loss of Sn through the desorption of SnSe(g), resulting in an improved CdS/CZTSe interface.”\nThe proposed technique was presented in “\nPotassium processing interface engineering for carrier regulation of efficient CZTSe solar cells\n,” published in\nMaterials Today Communications\nView author posts"},{"t":"气泡形成控制：通过过氧化氢酶涂覆的释氧氢化物制造厘米大小的组织状结构","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523593?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing thick three‐dimensional (3D) scaffolds remains challenging due to oxygen depletion and limited cell viability. Calcium peroxide (CaO\n                    2\n                    )‐catalase‐based oxygen‐releasing biomaterials are a common solution, but the uncontrolled release of oxygen bubbles often leading to structural damages is rarely discussed. Herein, we present a strategy to control the site of bubble formation in an oxygen‐releasing hydrogel, by applying a catalase nanocoating to its surface. CaO\n                    2\n                    undergoes hydrolytic decomposition with water, generating hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ), subsequently converts into O\n                    2\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O. Because H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    can induce cytotoxicity, direct catalase incorporation into hydrogel systems may accelerate O\n                    2\n                    bubble formation, leading in hydrogel collapse within 1 h of aqueous immersion. In comparison, catalase‐coated hydrogels exhibited improved structural stability, showing a 5.9‐fold smaller bubble size than hydrogels with mixed catalase after 24 h in ambient air. Under hypoxic conditions (O\n                    2\n                    &lt; 0.1%), centimeter‐scale constructs containing catalase‐coated hydrogels preserved up to 86% viable human fibroblast cells after 5 days of culture, compared with only 47% in non‐catalase coated hydrogels. Furthermore, the incorporation of catalase‐coated hydrogels promoted cell survival and neurite outgrowth of human neural stem cells cultured in neuronal differentiation conditions under severe hypoxia. These findings suggest the potential of the proposed strategy for oxygen‐supportive tissue engineering applications.","tp":"生物3D支架","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"针对厚三维组织工程支架中氧耗竭和细胞存活率低的问题，研究提出通过过氧化氢酶涂覆过氧化钙释氧材料来精确控制气泡形成位点的新策略。传统释氧材料中氧气的非受控释放常导致气泡无序生成并破坏结构，该方法实现了气泡生成位置的可控调节，成功构建出厘米级组织样结构，在厚组织工程和再生医学中具有重要应用价值。"},{"t":"文莱五处政府建筑启动光伏招标","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/brunei-tenders-solar-at-five-government-buildings/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"文莱政府启动招标，计划在五座政府建筑屋顶安装并网光伏发电系统，标志着该国在可再生能源部署方面迈出实质性步伐。该招标面向并网型太阳能安装，属于政府主导的公共建筑光伏试点，对推动文莱能源结构低碳转型具有示范意义。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"屋顶光伏系统","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Brunei tenders solar at five government buildings - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nA tender is open in Brunei for the development of grid-connected solar installations on the rooftop and carports of five government buildings. The deadline to submit applications is June 23.\nPatrick Jowett\nMarkets & Policy\nAsia-Pacific\nCommercial & industrial\nImage: Aboodi Vesakaran, Unsplash\nBrunei’s Department of Energy has published a tender for five grid-connected solar installations at five government buildings.\ntender notice\nsays the work will cover the design, build, operation and maintenance of the solar systems to be built on the rooftops and carports at five government buildings within the northeastern Brunei Muara district. The selected developer will also be required to determine the feasible PV capacity at each building.\nThe tender is open to local and international companies. Interested bidders can collect the tender document until June 9, ahead of a deadline for applications of June 23. The tender is also subject to a non-returnable fee of BND 1,000 ($776.85).\nBrunei had a cumulative solar capacity of 6 MW by the end of last year, according to figures published by the International Renewable Energy Agency (IRENA), an increase of 1 MW on figures from the year prior. The country has set a target of reaching 30% renewable energy in its electricity mix by 2035.\n30 MW solar project\nis under development in Brunei. A 25-year power purchase agreement is in place with the country’s government.\nPatrick Jowett\nView author posts"},{"t":"衔接国家气候目标与企业决策：中国钢铁脱碳路径的基于主体建模","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528009123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/黑色金属/钢铁","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钢铁脱碳路径","kp":["[建模方法]: 基于主体建模(ABM)"],"as":"该研究构建了一个基于主体的模型（ABM），旨在弥合国家气候目标与企业层面决策之间的鸿沟。研究以中国钢铁行业为案例，揭示该行业对全球脱碳至关重要，但受制于深度路径锁定。模型模拟了从政策制定到企业技术选择的传导链路，为政策制定者提供量化工具。","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":2.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":3.0},"ot":"Bridging national climate targets and firm-level decisions: An agent-based model of China’s steel decarbonization pathwa","b":"China’s steel sector is pivotal to national and global climate goals, yet decarbonization is constrained by entrenched coal-based processes and regional disparities. Top–down and bottom–up models often neglect firm-level heterogeneity and behavioral dynamics. Here, we develop an agent-based model linking policy signals—carbon caps, pollution standards, and resource limits—with firm-level investment decisions. We evaluate four scenarios combining current and strengthened climate and air targets with neutral or accelerated technology progress. All scenarios achieve deep CO\n                    2\n                    reductions (90 to 95% by 2060), but only the integrated policy-plus- technology pathway eliminates blast furnaces before midcentury, achieving the steepest declines. Policy- or technology-only pathways entail trade-offs, including lock-in to carbon capture and storage or delayed reductions. Our results show that synchronizing stringent climate policy with rapid technology cost declines is essential to steer China’s steel industry toward a carbon-neutral trajectory."},{"t":"非对称Pt-M位点打破吸附跷跷板效应实现PET电化学升级回收","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73610?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"PET电化学回收","kp":["电催化[PET废料]: 转化为乙醇酸升级","催化剂[不对称Pt-M]: 突破吸附跷跷板关系"],"as":"该研究提出通过不对称铂-金属双原子位点催化剂打破吸附平衡的限制，实现PET废弃塑料的电化学高值化升级，将废PET转化为高价值乙醇酸。该策略有望同步解决塑料污染和化学品增值问题，为塑料电化学回收提供了新催化机制。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Breaking the Adsorption Seesaw Via Asymmetric Pt‐M Sites for PET Electro‐Upcycling","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Electrochemical upgrading of polyethylene terephthalate (PET) waste to high‐value glycolic acid (GA) offers a sustainable route for plastic valorization. However, due to the uniform and limited electron density, the adsorption of the key intermediate ethylene glycol (EG) and hydroxyl (OH) on Pt catalysts is restricted by a linear‐scaling‐governed “see‐saw” relationship, which inevitably leads to a fundamental activity bottleneck. Herein, we find that constructing asymmetric nucleophilic – electrophilic Pt – M sites can overcome this bottleneck via coupled electronic and geometric effects. The nucleophilic Pt sites favor the moderate adsorption of EG, while the electrophilic M sites favor OH adsorption, breaking the linear‐scaling constraint. The synthesized Pt – Fe nanowires with asymmetric dual sites display breakthrough intrinsic activity with an onset potential of 0.225 V vs. RHE for GA evolution, and achieve energy – effective GA production in a continuous flow electrolyzer with a daily revenue of $258.97/ton in PET upcycling. Operando characterization confirms that the asymmetric construction disrupts the linear adsorption coupling behavior. Importantly, an “asymmetric dual – site electronic – geometric coupling” descriptor is proposed to capture the decoupled adsorption behavior, which is applicable to other Pt – M (Fe, Co, Ni, Pd, Au) catalysts."},{"t":"突破无负极锂离子软包电池的能量密度-应力权衡","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73652?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"无负极锂电池","kp":["[无负极锂软包]: 原理化设计打破能量密度-应力权衡"],"as":"该研究聚焦无负极锂金属软包电池中能量密度与应力之间的核心矛盾。锂金属负极在循环过程中的膨胀及其不良影响长期阻碍了锂金属电池的实际应用。研究提出抑制膨胀、缓解应力的新策略，以在不牺牲能量密度的前提下提升电池循环稳定性，推动高比能电池工程化。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Breaking Energy Density‐Stress Trade‐Off in Anode‐Free Lithium Pouch Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The swelling of the Li metal anode and its adverse impacts have barred lithium metal batteries (LMBs) from practical applications. Owing to insufficient recognition of the energy density–stress trade‐off, no viable solution has emerged to halt their expansion or diminish their internal stress accumulation (SA) while preserving their exceptional energy density. We proposed principle‐based criteria to guide the development of high‐energy and low‐swelling LMBs by defining the boundary parameters of strain‐buffering techniques. Taking a typical space‐adaptive buffering (SAB) layer as an example, we have materialized this criterion and verified its scientific validity and forward‐looking nature, effectively reducing SA and mitigating the local stress concentration (SC). As a result, the Ah‐level NCM9 (LiNi\n                    x\n                    Co\n                    y\n                    Mn\n                    1‐x‐y\n                    O\n                    2\n                    , x ≥ 0.9)||SAB‐Cu pouch cell prototype with the high bare‐cell energy densities of 465 Wh/kg and 1330 Wh/L exhibits the uniform stress distribution and low SC (extreme difference in local pressure&lt;2 MPa), avoiding the failure of Li dendrite puncture. Furthermore, the Ah‐level NCM811(Li\n                    1.2\n                    Ni\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    )||SAB‐Cu pouch cell demonstrates a perfect trade‐off among energy densities (418 Wh/kg and 1061 Wh/L), cycle life (164 cycles with 77% capacity retention), SA (&lt;2 MPa), and swelling ratio (3.6%), underscoring the practical feasibility of the SAB‐AF‐LMB.","aip":1},{"t":"机器人正在抓取开放数据——研究人员应该如何应对？","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01689-0","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","b":"The snowballing ability of artificial intelligence to trawl open data sets has some scientists worried about losing control of their information. The snowballing ability of artificial intelligence to trawl open data sets has some scientists worried about losing control of their information.","tp":"AI数据采集","sc":1.7,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"as":"人工智能大规模抓取开放数据集的能力日益增强，令部分科学家担忧可能失去对自身研究数据的控制权。文章探讨了AI工具自动采集和利用公开科研数据所带来的伦理、法律与科学影响，并讨论了研究人员应如何应对这一新兴挑战，包括数据管理策略调整和开放科学政策完善。"},{"t":"通过骨架刚性官能化提升天然橡胶性能","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1326350?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"天然橡胶改性","kp":["[功能化策略]: 主链刚性功能化","[回收性]: 可控解构实现回收"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出通过主链刚性官能化策略提升天然橡胶性能。传统硫化工艺形成致密不可逆交联网络，限制材料可回收性与功能调控空间。研究在橡胶主链上引入刚性官能团，在不依赖传统硫化的前提下增强链段运动阻力与力学强度，有望兼顾高性能与可再加工性，为弹性体材料设计提供新思路。","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Boosting Natural Rubber Performance by Backbone Rigid Functionalization","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Natural rubber relies on irreversible vulcanization to enhance material performance, but the resulting densely crosslinked networks resist breakdown, rendering conventional physical recycling methods ineffective. Developing backbone‐level functionalization strategies that simultaneously improve performance and enable controlled deconstruction remains a fundamental challenge. Here we develop a backbone rigid functionalization (BRF) strategy to install rigid, polar cyclobutane units directly into natural rubber via catalyst‐free [2+2] photocycloaddition. Incorporation of cyclobutane‐fused succinimide units substantially enhances tensile strength and toughness. Simply varying the reaction time enables continuous tuning of material behavior from viscoelastic polymers to elastomers and plastomers. When combined with vulcanization, the polar‐functionalized natural rubber yields high‐performance thermosets with a five‑fold improvement in stress, Young's modulus and toughness relative to conventional vulcanizates. Notably, the cyclobutane‐fused succinimide units undergo force‐triggered cycloreversion upon bulk ball‐milling, enabling vulcanized rubber with on‐demand hydrolytic degradability. This single‐step BRF process provides a practical pathway for accessing high‐performance rubbers with on‐demand degradability."},{"t":"Dynamics e.V.发布自主驾驶赛车RP 26 e/d——发布前夕仍在调试优化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://nachrichten.idw-online.de/2026/06/09/bis-kurz-vor-dem-rollout-wurde-noch-geschraubt-dynamics-e-v-praesentiert-den-autonomen-rp-26-e-d","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Informationsdienst Wissenschaft-idw","as":"德国大学生方程式车队 Dynamics e.V. 在发布前夕持续调试，正式推出自动驾驶赛车 RP 26 e/d。该车为电动驱动、具备自动驾驶能力，团队在正式 rollout 前对软硬件系统进行了多项优化。该展示体现了大学生工程团队在自动驾驶与电动赛车集成领域的实践进展。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"自动驾驶赛车","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Bis kurz vor dem Rollout wurde noch geschraubt: Dynamics e.V. präsentiert den autonomen RP 26 e/d","b":"Bis kurz vor dem Rollout wurde noch geschraubt: Dynamics e.V. präsentiert den autonomen RP 26 e/d\nHinweis zur Verwendung von Bildmaterial: Die Verwendung des Bildmaterials zur Pressemitteilung ist bei Nennung der Quelle vergütungsfrei gestattet. Das Bildmaterial darf nur in Zusammenhang mit dem Inhalt dieser Pressemitteilung verwendet werden. Falls Sie das Bild in höherer Auflösung benötigen oder Rückfragen zur Weiterverwendung haben, wenden Sie sich bitte direkt an die Pressestelle, die es veröffentlicht hat.\nMit Spannung erwartet: Das Moderatorenduo Christian Mann und Laura Glossner enthüllt den neuen Formula-Student-Rennwagen RP26 e/d vor rund 20.0 Gästen an der OTH Regensburg\nSimone Zenner\n| Copyright:\nOTH Regensburg\nHinweis zur Verwendung von Bildmaterial: Die Verwendung des Bildmaterials zur Pressemitteilung ist bei Nennung der Quelle vergütungsfrei gestattet. Das Bildmaterial darf nur in Zusammenhang mit dem Inhalt dieser Pressemitteilung verwendet werden. Falls Sie das Bild in höherer Auflösung benötigen oder Rückfragen zur Weiterverwendung haben, wenden Sie sich bitte direkt an die Pressestelle, die es veröffentlicht hat.\nBeim Kahoot-Quiz konnten Gäste und Teammitglieder ihr Wissen über den Dynamics e.V. und die Formula Student testen. Eifriges Mitraten, Smartphones in der Hand und viele lachende Gesichter prägten die entspannte Atmosphäre im Hörsaal.\nSimone Zenner\n| Copyright:\nOTH Regensburg\nVollautonom und elektrisch: Vor rund 200 Gästen hat das Formula-Student-Team Dynamics e.V. an der OTH Regensburg seinen neuen Rennwagen „RP26 e/d“ präsentiert.\nBis kurz vor dem Start lief die Arbeit in der Werkstatt des Rennteams auf Hochtouren: Noch am Tag des Events wurden hochfokussiert letzte Folien angeklebt, Bauteile zusammengesetzt und Kabel verlegt. Eine Stunde vor Beginn wurde das Fahrzeug schließlich in den Hörsaal S 054 an der OTH Regensburg gerollt. Als sich am Mittwochabend, 03. Juni 2026, die Türen für die rund 200 Gäste öffneten, stand er zunächst noch verhüllt da: der „RP26 e/d“, der neue, rein elektrische und autonom fahrende Rennwagen des Formula-Student-Teams Dynamics e.V.\nDurch den Abend führten das Moderatorenduo Christian Mann und Laura Glossner, die dem Publikum per interaktivem Live-Quiz die harten Fakten näherbrachten: Der Verein startet in der Formula Student, dem weltweit größten studentischen Konstruktionswettbewerb, bei dem Teams mit selbst gebauten Rennwagen gegeneinander antreten. Dass die Regensburger hier ganz vorne mitmischen, zeigen die Zahlen: 12 verschiedene Studiengänge, 51 Eventteilnahmen seit 2008 und aktuell Platz 51 in der Weltrangliste.\nFormula-Student-Team tief in Regensburg verwurzelt\nWie tief der Verein in der Hochschule und der Stadt Regensburg verwurzelt ist, zeigte auch der prominente Besuch. OTH-Präsident Prof. Dr. Ralph Schneider betonte seine innige Beziehung zum Team: „Es ist mir ein großes Anliegen heute hier dabei zu sein. Hier arbeiten um die 100 Studierende über Fakultätsgrenzen, über Disziplinen und über die Hochschule hinweg zusammen. Das macht mich besonders stolz.“\nAuch Regensburgs Oberbürgermeister Dr. Thomas Burger zeigte sich begeistert von der Innovationskraft des Teams. Er betonte, dass die Stadt Regensburg stolz darauf sei, mit dem Dynamics-Team ein echtes Aushängeschild zu haben. Dieses mache die Stadt nicht nur weit über die Grenzen hinaus international bekannt, sondern passe auch hervorragend zu Regensburgs Profil als Hightech- und Innovationsstandort.\nTechnische Detailarbeit\nWie viel Detailarbeit im RP 26 e/d steckt, machten die technischen Leiter Yannick Pleitner und Daniel Lambrecht im Interview deutlich. Für den autonomen Betrieb erfassen Sensoren des Rennwagens eine digitale Karte seiner Umgebung, die das System für die Navigation nutzt. Neu ist außerdem eine Bremssteuerung, mit der sich die Energierückgewinnung während der Fahrt präziser regeln lässt. Neue Vorgaben der Formula Student machten sogar Änderungen an der Aerodynamik notwendig. Das Team musste Teile des Fahrzeugs neu konstruieren und zahlreiche Simulationen durchführen, um das Fahrverhalten wieder optimal abzustimmen. Wie komplex das Gesamtsystem ist, zeigt der Blick ins Innere des Fahrzeugs: Hunderte Kabel verbinden die Steuergeräte des Rennwagens. Jeder einzelne Anschluss muss exakt sitzen, denn schon kleine Fehler können das gesamte System lahmlegen.\nEin Projekt, das Talente schmiedet\nGesamtteamleiter Thomas Simbeck erinnerte in seiner Rede an die vielen anstrengenden Projektphasen: „Wir wissen selbst, wir sind nicht das einfachste Projekt am Campus. Manchmal riecht es nach Harz, manchmal hört man Fräsgeräusche, und manchmal stehen Teile herum, bei denen man sich fragt: Ist das Kunst oder kann das weg? Aber genau in diesem Umfeld entsteht praktische Ingenieurskunst und die Nachwuchstalente von morgen.“\nFür den RP 26 e/d beginnt die Arbeit jetzt erst richtig. In den kommenden Wochen stehen ausgiebige Testfahrten und Optimierungen auf dem Programm, um den neuen Rennwagen perfekt auf die anstehenden internationalen Driverless-Events vorzubereiten.\nÄhnliche Pressemitteilungen im idw"},{"t":"Baks推出基于压载的平屋顶光伏支架解决方案","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/baks-launches-ballast-based-flat-roof-mounting-solution/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","as":"波兰制造商 Baks 推出一款基于压载式的平屋顶光伏支架安装解决方案。该产品主打快速、无穿透式安装，无需在屋顶打孔，降低防水层破坏风险与施工复杂度，适用于商业及工业平屋顶光伏项目。压载式设计兼顾安装效率与结构稳定性，拓展了分布式光伏的部署灵活性。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏支架系统","kp":["[安装方式]: 压载式无穿透平屋顶光伏支架"],"sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Baks launches ballast-based flat-roof mounting solution - pv magazine Global","b":"Technology & Products\nThe Polish manufacturer said its new product is designed for fast, non-penetrative deployment. It combines corrosion-resistant materials and simplified assembly to support efficient, scalable rooftop solar installations in commercial and industrial projects.\nEmiliano Bellini\nTechnology & Products\nCommercial & industrial\nPolish mounting system provider Baks has introduced its DP-DTH…-WZ mounting system for flat-roof photovoltaic installations.\nThe company said the system is designed to combine fast installation, ballast-based stability, and flexible tilt angles within a single modular platform. “The system allows module inclination at 10°, 15°, or 20°, enabling installers to optimize energy yield depending on roof geometry, shading conditions, and regional irradiation without switching between different product families,” a spokesperson from the company told\nThe structure is intended for flat commercial and industrial roofs and supports landscape-oriented module layouts with a wide range of standard PV module dimensions. Its ballast-based concept reportedly eliminates the need for roof penetration, reducing installation risk on waterproof membranes and making it suitable for bitumen and membrane roofing systems. Concrete ballast blocks are placed in dedicated trays or mounting channels, allowing flexible weight distribution depending on wind load requirements and roof load constraints.\nBaks said it focused the design on reducing component count and simplifying on-site assembly. Predefined connection points and modular row configurations help shorten installation time and streamline logistics for EPC contractors, according to the manufacturer. The system uses corrosion-resistant materials, including Magnelis-coated steel, aluminum elements, and stainless-steel fasteners, which the company says ensure durability in demanding outdoor environments.\nElectrical continuity is integrated through dedicated contact points between modules and the mounting structure, reducing the need for additional grounding components in many configurations.\nThe DP-DTH…-WZ is part of a broader Baks flat-roof portfolio that includes anchored and bonded variants, enabling standardized procurement across different project types.\nPositioned for commercial and industrial rooftop PV applications, the system comes with a 10-year warranty on the structure under standard installation conditions.\nEmiliano Bellini\nView author posts"},{"t":"草酸钙肾结石中的细菌生物膜：我们处于什么位置？","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606646123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"避免 MAIT 细胞是单核细胞增生李斯特菌发病机制的重要决定因素","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2601925123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Mucosal-associated invariant T (MAIT) cells are among the most conserved and abundant innate-like T cells in humans that recognize microbial-derived riboflavin precursors and elicit potent antimicrobial responses. The foodborne pathogen\n                    \n                      Listeria\n                      monocytogenes\n                    \n                    is a broad host-range facultative intracellular pathogen that lacks the riboflavin biosynthetic pathway, leading us to hypothesize that this deficiency is pathoadaptive and allows the pathogen to evade MAIT cells. Here, we show that\n                    \n                      L. monocytogenes\n                    \n                    strains engineered to produce riboflavin (\n                    \n                      L. monocytogenes\n                    \n                    -\n                    ribDEAHT\n                    ) are attenuated in wild-type mice but fully virulent in MAIT cell–deficient mice. Infection with\n                    \n                      L. monocytogenes\n                    \n                    -\n                    ribDEAHT\n                    prompted rapid and robust MAIT cell expansion in multiple tissues and required the cytolytic effector perforin to eliminate infected cells in vivo and in vitro. We also assessed the therapeutic potential of\n                    \n                      L. monocytogenes\n                    \n                    -\n                    ribDEAHT-\n                    stimulated MAIT cells in both infectious disease and cancer mouse models. Therapeutic administration of\n                    \n                      L. monocytogenes\n                    \n                    -\n                    ribDEAHT\n                    provided protection against\n                    Francisella tularensis\n                    in the lungs and inhibited tumor growth even in the absence of CD8\n                    +\n                    T cells. These findings reveal the importance of MAIT cell evasion during\n                    \n                      L. monocytogenes\n                    \n                    infection and highlight the therapeutic potential of engineered\n                    \n                      L. monocytogenes\n                    \n                    to activate and harness MAIT cells for protection against infectious disease and cancer."},{"t":"作者更正：用于高效全钙钛矿叠层电池的稳定锡铅钙钛矿墨水","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41560-026-02097-4","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Nature Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿叠层电池","as":"","sc":1.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":1.0,"d":1.0,"t":2.0},"ot":"Author Correction: Stable tin–lead perovskite inks for efficient all-perovskite tandems"},{"t":"作者更正：携带 PTC 的 mRNA 通过 Upf3a 和 COMPASS 组件引发遗传补偿反应","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10769-0","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"作者更正：准对称双组分蛋白质笼的从头设计","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10763-6","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Nature","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质笼设计","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":2.0,"r":1.0,"d":2.0,"t":3.0},"as":""},{"t":"作者更正：针对伽马疱疹病毒 gB 的广泛保护性抗体","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10745-8","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"埃博拉医院纵火袭击是对地区发展的呼声","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01846-5","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Letter to the Editor"},{"t":"拟南芥 YEATS 结构域蛋白通过同源定向途径促进 DNA 双链断裂修复","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2612171123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"DNA double-strand break (DSB) repair is required to maintain genome integrity and organismal fitness. This process occurs within chromatin and although accurate repair requires extensive changes in chromatin structure and composition, chromatin effectors facilitating DSB repair remain largely unknown in plants. Using reverse genetics, we identified two chromatin readers, YAF9A and YAF9B, as new factors required for DSB repair in\n                    Arabidopsis\n                    . While only\n                    YAF9B\n                    is induced by DNA damage, both YAF9A and YAF9B are required for DSB repair, including via homology-directed repair pathways. Mechanistically, we found YAF9A and YAF9B denote distinct remodeling complexes: While YAF9A associates with both NuA4 and SWR1, YAF9B only associates with NuA4, defining a DNA-damage-specific version of this remodeling complex and linking NuA4 to DSB repair in plants. We also uncovered direct roles for YAF9A and YAF9B in DNA repair, rather than indirect roles in gene regulation, as\n                    yaf9\n                    mutants showed normal transcriptional responses to DNA damage. Finally, we demonstrate that the YAF9B reader domain is required for DSB repair. These results link YAF9A, YAF9B, and their respective remodeling complexes, to DSB repair in a histone reader-dependent manner, expanding our understanding of how chromatin effectors regulate DSB repair in plants.","tp":"植物DNA修复","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究发现拟南芥中两个含YEATS结构域的染色质读取蛋白YAF9A和YAF9B是DNA双链断裂（DSB）修复的新因子。DSB修复发生在染色质环境中，尽管精确修复需要染色质结构和组成的大规模变化，但植物中介导该过程的染色质效应因子大多未知。通过反向遗传学筛选，研究证实二者在维持基因组完整性和DSB修复中发挥关键作用。"},{"t":"Aquila为德国电池项目获得2600万欧元融资 - 储能","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/06/09/aquila-secures-e26-million-financing-for-german-battery-project/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ESS News","as":"Aquila Capital为其德国独立电池储能项目（BESS） secured了2600万欧元的完全市场化融资，项目规模为56 MW/112 MWh，可提供2小时放电时长。此次融资的特殊性在于完全依赖市场化机制（merchant financing），而非传统的政府补贴或长期购电协议担保，反映了欧洲储能市场商业模式趋于成熟，投资者对电池储能项目的收入可预测性信心增强，也标志着欧洲独立储能市场融资模式的重要里程碑。","tg":"资本运作","tp":"电池储能系统","kp":["功率规模[BESS Wetzen]: 56MW","容量规模[BESS Wetzen]: 112MWh","融资额[BESS]: €2600万"],"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Aquila secures €26 million financing for German battery project - Energy Storage","b":"Aquila Capital said it has secured what it described as fully merchant financing for a standalone 56 MW/112 MWh BESS at Wetzen, near Lüneburg in Lower Saxony.\nING Deutschland is providing €26 million in debt financing for the project, which Aquila said is among the first large-scale battery storage projects in Germany to secure fully market-based financing.\nThe battery system was developed by Aquila Clean Energy. Construction was announced in November 2024.\nAquila said the project is now progressing toward commercial operation. When construction began, commissioning was expected in early 2026.\nThe two-hour battery system is intended to provide frequency regulation services and participate in Germany’s wholesale electricity market."},{"t":"通过电化学弛豫实现富锂正极电压衰减趋零","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73674?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"富锂正极材料","kp":["[富锂正极]: 电化学弛豫实现零电压衰减"],"as":"富锂层状氧化物正极材料凭借阳离子与阴离子协同氧化还原反应，可提供远超传统正极的能量密度，被视为高能锂电池的突破口。然而其实际应用长期受限于电压衰减问题——循环过程中结构相变和氧释放导致电压持续下降。该研究通过电化学手段实现接近零电压衰减，为破解富锂正极循环寿命瓶颈提供了新策略，对推动下一代高能量密度锂离子电池商业化具有重要意义。","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Approaching Zero Voltage Attenuation of Lithium‐Rich Cathodes through Electrochemical Relaxation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Li‐rich cathodes combining cationic/anionic redox have rejuvenated high‐energy batteries. However, their practical applications remain constrained by the inferior anion redox reversibility and stability. Herein, a facile electrochemical relaxation route was implemented for the first time in the initial charging process to tune the anion redox chemistry. It declares the electrochemical relaxation in the oxygen activation plateau of 4.6 V contributes to a lattice framework with reduced structural distortion and weakened O─O interactions. A back‐bonding\n                    π\n                    ‐bond is formed between Mn and the O─O dimer, strengthening the interactions between oxygen and Mn, mitigating structural degradation and local distortion during the electrochemical cycling. The relaxed material demonstrates a high capacity over 250 mAh g\n                    −1\n                    and a high plateau voltage of 3.57 V with a negligible voltage decay (0.8%) after 100 cycles at 1C. This strategy presents a straightforward methodology for high‐voltage activation of O redox cathodes.","aip":1},{"t":"苹果谨慎推进AI升级；OpenAI提交IPO申请","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/the-briefing/apples-cautious-ai-overhaul-openais-ipo-filing","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","as":"苹果公司正以谨慎的态度推进其人工智能（AI）升级；此外，OpenAI已提交了首次公开募股（IPO）申请。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI产业动态","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":9.0},"ot":"Apple’s Cautious AI Overhaul; OpenAI’s IPO Filing","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"苹果再次尝试重塑Siri","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/briefings/apple-tries-another-siri-reboot","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"the information","as":"苹果再次尝试重启Siri智能助手。作为最早进入语音助手领域的玩家之一，苹果的Siri近年来在AI能力上明显落后于ChatGPT等大语言模型驱动的竞品。此次重启计划旨在利用大模型技术重新构建Siri的对话理解、任务执行和多轮推理能力，试图缩小与新一代AI助手的差距。然而苹果在云端AI与端侧隐私之间的平衡取舍，以及与第三方应用的深度整合，仍是关键挑战。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"Siri智能助手","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.5,"t":8.0},"ot":"Apple Tries for Another Siri Reboot","b":"Apple Tries for Another Siri Reboot — The Information Read this briefing for free"},{"t":"Anthropic Mythos今日发布；苹果以温和目标重构Siri","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/ai-agenda/anthropics-mythos-coming-today-apple-pursues-modest-goals-siri-revamp","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","tg":"行业观察","tp":"大语言模型","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":9.0},"as":"Anthropic Mythos于今日发布；苹果正以温和的目标重新构建Siri。","ot":"Anthropic’s Mythos Is Coming Today; Apple Pursues Modest Goals with Siri Revamp","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"Anthropic与OpenAI助推风投融资步伐加快","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/anthropic-openai-stoke-brisk-pace-vc-fundraising","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"the information","tg":"资本运作","tp":"AI融资动态","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":8.0},"as":"Anthropic与OpenAI等AI企业的快速发展，正助推并加快风险投资的融资步伐。","ot":"Anthropic, OpenAI Stoke Brisk Pace of VC Fundraising","b":"Subscribe to unlock"},{"t":"古代地松鼠以“更新世僵尸”的尸体为食","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01840-x","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Fossilized poo harbours remains from mammoths, bison and big cats, including some of the oldest DNA ever reconstructed. Fossilized poo harbours remains from mammoths, bison and big cats, including some of the oldest DNA ever reconstructed."},{"t":"巴西亚马逊和塞拉多地区的乙醇繁荣和玉米价格上涨","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030142152600323X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"水甘油孔蛋白控制与海洋钙中囊泡矿物质形成相关的细胞水和二氧化碳电导","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524614123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Many marine organisms generate biominerals by endocytotic uptake of seawater which is modified within calcifying cells to produce an amorphous mineral precursor required to form the mineralized shell or skeleton. In this process, water must be removed from the endocytotic vesicles and the cell to promote concentration of calcification substrates and production of a water-free mineral. Here, we demonstrate that in the sea urchin larva, an aquaglyceroporin (spAQP9) is involved in the cellular calcification process. spAQP9 is found exclusively in the calcifying primary mesenchyme cells (PMCs), and spAQP9 expression is increased during mineralization underlining its role in skeleton formation. Heterologous expression of sp\n                    AQP9\n                    in\n                    \n                      Xenopus laevis\n                    \n                    oocytes demonstrated that this channel conducts water and carbon dioxide. The water conductance by spAQP9 is sensitive to phloretin with an IC\n                    50\n                    of ∼38 µM and treatment of larvae with phloretin or knock-down of spAQP9 impaired skeleton formation. Immunohistological analyses revealed localization of spAQP9 in vesicles with different subcellular distribution depending on the calcification activity of PMCs. Finally, we developed an in vivo assay to measure cellular and vesicular water permeability in PMCs and found a significant water permeability of the plasma membrane and membranes of calcium-rich vesicles. The results of this work highlight the importance of water transport mechanisms in the mineralization process. Here, aquaporins like spAQP9 represent key players that serve a dual function as a water and CO\n                    2\n                    conductance pathway and thereby can support ion concentration and carbon transport, two processes that are of fundamental importance to promote intracellular mineral precursor formation."},{"t":"基于自适应增强框架的HVAC系统极端不平衡场景新故障类别数据处理方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008445?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"HVAC故障数据增强","kp":["模型[HVAC故障增强]: 元扩散模型","场景[故障诊断]: 极端不平衡新类别"],"dp":1,"as":"","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":3.5,"d":2.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"An adaptive augmentation framework for new fault category data in HVAC systems under extremely imbalanced scenarios base"},{"t":"用于递送环状二核苷酸的氧化胺脂质纳米颗粒","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag340/8704106?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","as":"研究开发了一种基于胺氧化物脂质纳米颗粒的新型递送系统，用于递送环二核苷酸（CDN）。CDN是STING（干扰素基因刺激因子）的强效激动剂，在肿瘤免疫治疗中具有重要临床潜力。该脂质纳米颗粒体系可提高CDN的胞内递送效率与稳定性，有望增强STING通路激活，为癌症免疫治疗提供新的递送策略。","tg":"研究论文","tp":"脂质纳米载体","kp":["递送[环二核苷酸]: 胺氧化物脂质纳米颗粒(AOL)","靶点[CDN]: STING激动剂"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Amine oxide lipid nanoparticles for delivery of cyclic dinucleotides","b":"The clinical potential of cyclic dinucleotides (CDNs) as potent agonists of stimulator of interferon gene (STING) has been hampered by the lack of robust delivery systems. While lipid nanoparticles (LNPs) excel with large nucleic acids, they are unsuitable for delivering small, zwitterionic and highly hydrophilic CDNs. Here, we find that the tertiary amine oxide lipid (AOL) promotes stable encapsulation of CDNs into LNP through enhanced hydrogen bonding and electrostatic interactions, resulting in ultra-high encapsulation efficiency of 86.8%. Compared to cationic liposomes, AOL-incorporating LNP exhibits superior tumor penetration and cytosolic cargo delivery, eliciting broad and potent intratumoral STING activation. In line with growing emphasis on combination therapy in oncology, we further incorporate lipidated mitoxantrone in the LNP as an inducer of immunogenic cell death to enhance tumor antigen presentation and STING-driven immunotherapy. The obtained LNP provokes potent immunostimulatory and anti-tumor effects in multiple challenging animal models, including triple-negative breast cancer, pancreatic cancer and melanoma."},{"t":"亚马逊森林砍伐减少了巴西南部的降水量和大豆产量","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2525378123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Rapid agricultural expansion has driven forest loss worldwide. Deforestation reduces evaporation, potentially decreasing precipitation and crop yields far beyond agricultural frontiers. Here, we quantified the teleconnection impacts of Amazon deforestation on precipitation and soybean yields across Brazil during 1982–2018, using a Lagrangian moisture tracking model. Our analysis indicates that tree evaporation contributes one-third of growing-season precipitation, yet recent deforestation decreased seasonal precipitation by 6 to 30% across Brazilian soybean states, with replacement land covers providing limited compensation for the losses. Although precipitation declines were most pronounced near Amazonian deforestation, the largest yield reductions (227 kton, or\n                    \n                      \n                        ∼\n                      \n                    \n                    6% loss) occurred in the southern state of Rio Grande do Sul. Cumulatively, deforestation-driven precipitation declines resulted in a total soybean production loss of\n                    \n                      \n                        ∼\n                      \n                    \n                    700 kton. These findings reveal that expanding agriculture into forests undermines yields in established croplands, potentially creating a feedback where yield losses drive demand for additional forest clearing. Under continued deforestation and climate change, this feedback is likely to intensify, threatening Brazilian rainfed agriculture into the future.","tp":"森林降水效应","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究利用拉格朗日水汽追踪模型量化了1982至2018年间亚马逊森林砍伐对巴西南部降水和大豆产量的遥相关影响。分析表明树木蒸散贡献了生长季降水的三分之一，而近年来的森林砍伐已显著减少下风向地区降水量，进而导致大豆减产。该研究揭示了热带森林破坏对远离砍伐区域农业的连锁影响，强调了森林保护的经济价值。"},{"t":"Alterric在德国风电场接入2兆瓦电池储能系统","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://renewablesnow.com/news/alterric-connects-2-mw-bess-at-german-wind-farm-1296146/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Renewables Now","as":"德国可再生能源公司Alterric在一座风力发电场接入了一套2兆瓦（MW）电池储能系统（BESS）。该储能项目旨在配合风电输出，实现削峰填谷与电网稳定，提升可再生能源的消纳与调度能力。这是欧洲风电配储趋势的典型案例，反映储能与风光发电协同部署的加速推进。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"风电储能系统","kp":["功率规模[风电场配BESS]: 2MW"],"sc":3.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"ot":"Alterric connects 2-MW BESS at German wind farm","b":"Alterric connects 2-MW BESS at German wind farm | Energy Storage News | Renewables Now\nAdvanced search\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nPolicy & Tenders\nLatest top stories\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nabout 8 hours ago\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nCIP sells minority stakes in 500-MW Scottish battery project Devilla\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nAlterric connects 2-MW BESS at German wind farm\nJun 9, 2026, 3:58:48 PM\nSladjana Djunisic\nEnergy Storage\nRegion/Country:\nLatest top stories\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nabout 8 hours ago\nCrown Estate to tender abandoned 1.5-GW Morgan offshore wind site\nabout 15 hours ago\nUS solar installer SUNation to merge with solar cell maker Suniva\nCIP sells minority stakes in 500-MW Scottish battery project Devilla\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nLatest in Capacity\nEDPR, SRP wrap up 800-MWh Flatland BESS project in Arizona\nZenith nears 200-MWp Italian goal with new solar project buy\nGenneia powers up all 180 MW at San Rafael solar farm in Argentina\nLatest in Energy storage\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nPowerBank safe harbours 30 MW of solar, 31 MWh of storage projects in US\nDispatch energises 45-MW Dutch battery storage site\nLatest in EUROPE\nEuropean partners target 160,000t/y SAF plant in France\nPolish biogas producer PGB expands heating network\nPlenitude fully commissions 330-MW Renopool solar complex in Spain\nLatest in Germany\nAquila achieves fin close on 112-MWh battery in Lower Saxony\nChint Solar sells 56-MW BESS package in Germany to Second Foundation\nEnercity, Kraken to develop virtual power plant in Germany\nLatest in Capacity\nEDPR, SRP wrap up 800-MWh Flatland BESS project in Arizona\nLatest in Energy storage\nFoxconn, Brookfield to jointly develop 1 GW of renewables in Vietnam\nLatest in EUROPE\nEuropean partners target 160,000t/y SAF plant in France\nLatest in Germany\nAquila achieves fin close on 112-MWh battery in Lower Saxony\nMost read stories\nGoldenPeaks Poland files for bankruptcy in US amid Brookfield bid\nOffshore Wind\nGE Vernova denied reconsideration in Vineyard Wind dispute\nEDF in talks for EUR 4bn sale of N American renewables ops - report\nBoralex shareholders approve acquisition by Brookfield, La Caisse\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nToday in Hydrogen (daily)\nDaily Newsletter\nCorporate PPAs (weekly)\nUpcoming events\n4th Solar Energy Storage Future Germany 2026\nJun 22, 2026\nThe smarter E Europe 2026\nJun 23, 2026\nAlert section not found"},{"t":"α-突触核蛋白原纤维诱导线粒体衍生囊泡出芽","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2604082123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"α-synuclein (α-syn) aggregation is a hallmark of synucleinopathies, a class of neurodegenerative disorders such as Parkinson’s disease (PD). Several lines of evidence indicate the involvement of mitochondria in the disease pathology. Despite extensive study, the link between α-syn aggregation and mechanisms of mitochondrial toxicity remains not fully understood. Using high-resolution imaging with electron microscopy, we examined SH-SY5Y cells exposed to α-syn fibrils vs control cells with a focus on mitochondria. We found that upon exposure to α-syn fibrils, mitochondria cristae structure gets defects, and mitochondria enhance the budding of mitochondrial-derived vesicles (MDVs). MDV formation reflects an evolutionarily conserved mechanism reminiscent of bacterial outer membrane vesicle biogenesis. Structural proteomics analysis by mass spectrometry corroborates this microscopy observation by identifying changes in multiple proteins that regulate cristae structure, MDV formation, and trafficking. Our results suggest that α-syn may promote MDV generation, and support an important link between α-syn and mitochondria which will be important for future mechanistic studies. The processes we detected could be of interest for diagnostics and potential therapeutic interventions."},{"t":"在供应链现场：伦敦协调供应链战略","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/aligning-supply-chain-strategy-at-supply-chain-live-london","c":"不相关","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"行业观察","b":"Aligning Supply Chain Strategy at Supply Chain LIVE: London\nPrioritise Us\nJoin leaders at Supply Chain LIVE: The London Summit, as they explore transformation initiatives and aim to drive competitiveness in global markets\nSupply chain strategies have undergone significant changes in recent years, driven by ongoing global turbulence.\nInstead of being reactive and focusing on\noperational efficiency\n, supply chain leaders are now forming strategies which prioritise flexibility and resilience.\nOngoing trends,\nand sustainability, are proving to unlock strategic value within business plans, moving ESG targets higher on the priority list.\nAt Supply Chain LIVE: The London Summit, leaders will gather to explore the emerging strategies which are driving business success.\nTo make sure you do not miss out,\nsecure your ticket today\nSupply Chain LIVE: The London Summit is taking place at the QEII Centre in London on the 8-9 September. It will be co-located with Procurement LIVE and Sustainability LIVE. Join more than 1,000 attendees and hear insights from more than 50 speakers.\nAt the event, supply chain leaders will explore how they are aligning supply chain strategy with business objectives. This will include prioritising leadership strategies, as well as ongoing transformation initiatives. Throughout, attendees will be able to gain thorough insights through networking opportunities, specialist panel discussions, fireside chats and workshops.\nAttendees will gain insights into sustainability, risk and resilience, the\nin the supply chain and more. All of these trends are reshaping business strategy, forcing leaders to change how they are navigating the world, but also unlocking new potential for business success.\nLeaders will explore how to improve efficiency, competitiveness and agility in today's turbulent market.\nAttend the Supply Chain Strategy Forum to hear a focussed discussion on the topic.\nThe Supply Chain Strategy Forum:\n15:50-16:30 BST\nSupply Chain Stage\nSecure your ticket,\nor become a sponsor for the panel.\nIn an era marked by ongoing volatility and instability, navigating global supply chains can be a mighty beast. With new AI platforms and tools emerging on a regular basis, constantly changing trade regulations and a heightened consumer demand for sustainable practices, balancing new expectations while still saving money can feel impossible.\nConsumers are driving strategy more than ever, as studies show that they are prioritising purchasing from organisations with clear\nsustainability measures\nin place. According to Euromonitor, 60% of all new products which were launched in 2025 clearly display at least one sustainability claim. This demonstrates how consumer preferences are guiding how businesses source, produce and deliver goods.\nOrganisations now are understanding the value that comes with\nend-to-end visibility\nand supplier collaboration – both as a resilience builder but also to unlock new ideas.\nConflicting strategies are emerging, but are demonstrating success when applied correctly. Where some businesses are diversifying their supplier base, others are turning to nearshoring and only utilising domestic suppliers. Understanding which type of strategy would work for individual business needs can feel overwhelming, but at Supply Chain LIVE, leaders will attempt to help clear the fog.\nThose hoping to gain insights into the most efficient strategies will not want to miss Supply Chain LIVE: The London Summit.\nSecure your ticket now"},{"t":"知识增强大语言模型推进电池故障诊断","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag348/8704107?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池故障诊断","kp":["[电池诊断]: 知识增强LLM(BattFailScholar)"],"as":"针对储能系统电池故障诊断难题，提出知识增强大语言模型方法。现有诊断手段依赖专家经验且效率有限，该方案通过将领域知识库与LLM推理能力结合，有望提升电池失效模式的自动识别精度与可解释性，推动储能系统安全管理。","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Advancing battery failure diagnosis by knowledge-augmented large language models","b":"Battery failure diagnosis is crucial for ensuring the safety and reliability of energy storage systems. However, existing approaches from electrochemical modeling to deep learning often face limitations including heavy reliance on extensive training data, poor generalization, and interpretability issues. To address these challenges, we propose BattFailScholar, a knowledge- augmented large language model (LLM) framework for battery failure diagnosis. Our approach first constructs a case-level battery failure knowledge graph encompassing material properties, multi-source signals, and failure pathways. A knowledge-augmented generation method is then developed to enhance LLM diagnostic reasoning with failure feature-aware retrieval and optimization algorithms. Experimental results demonstrate that BattFailScholar achieves a 19.7% performance improvement in LLM-based diagnosis, with enhanced capability in alleviating long-tail problems and failure risk assessment. Moreover, the system achieves 86.2% accuracy in identifying potential failure mechanisms or causes, demonstrating strong potential for discovering failure chains and providing practical, reliable diagnostic support for battery research and development."},{"t":"基于Bang-Bang-Bang协议实现快速相干态传输的可适配路径","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/g22y-z8h3","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子态传输","kp":["[传输协议]: Bang-Bang-Bang三段式","[应用]: 量子态快速相干传输"],"dp":1,"as":"提出Bang-Bang-Bang协议实现量子相干态快速输运的新路径。研究团队展示了通过分段脉冲控制策略加速相干态在陷阱间的传输，为量子计算和量子信息处理中的态操控提供了更高效、更灵活的工程方案。","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"Adaptable Route to Fast Coherent State Transport via Bang-Bang-Bang Protocols","b":"Author(s): Ya-Tang Yu, Hsin-Lien Lee, Shao-Hung Chung, Ting Hsu, Guin-Dar Lin, Ying-Cheng Chen, and H. H. JenFast coherent state transport is essential to quantum computation and quantum information processing. While an adiabatic transport of atomic qubits guarantees a high fidelity of the state preparation, it requires a long timescale that defies efficient quantum operations. Here, we propose an adaptabl…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 230802] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","aip":1},{"t":"活性区可塑性耦合睡眠需要突触前低磷酸化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524065123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Sleep need is associated with both circuit dynamics and widespread synaptic plasticity, yet the specific synaptic changes underlying sleep homeostasis remain incompletely understood. In\n                    Drosophila\n                    , sleep loss has been shown to trigger plasticity of the presynaptic active zone, marked by increasing levels of the ELKS-family scaffold protein Bruchpilot (BRP). By titrating\n                    brp\n                    gene copy number, we previously established a presynapse-specific, dosage-dependent paradigm that modulates sleep pressure. Here, to elucidate the molecular landscape of this plasticity, we performed synapse-enriched integrated-omics. Proteomic and bioinformatic analyses revealed changes in immune and stress response pathways and local translation control. Strikingly, phospho-proteomic analysis uncovered a global shift toward hypophosphorylation, particularly in presynaptic proteins, indicating a reprogramming of the phosphorylation–dephosphorylation balance. This presynaptic hypophosphorylation is likely contributed by reduced activity of Protein Kinase A (PKA) and enhanced substrate affinity of Protein Phosphatase 1 (PP1) mediated by its regulatory subunit Spinophilin (Spn). Manipulating either PKA or PP1 activity was sufficient to suppress BRP-modulated sleep phenotypes. We propose that presynaptic hypophosphorylation constitutes a molecular signature of local synaptic remodeling that adaptively tunes sleep need via reversible posttranslational modification, a mechanism likely conserved across species.","tp":"睡眠与突触","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"睡眠需求与神经回路动态和广泛的突触可塑性密切相关，但其具体机制尚不完全清楚。在果蝇研究中发现，睡眠剥夺会引发突触前活性区的可塑性变化，主要表现为ELKS家族支架蛋白Bruchpilot（BRP）水平升高。研究指出，活性区可塑性耦合睡眠依赖于突触前的低磷酸化过程。"},{"t":"激活自组装多层膜的π电子共轭网络实现21.1%效率有机太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4154577?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机太阳能电池","kp":["转换效率[有机太阳能电池]: 21.1%","材料[自组装多层膜]: 二苯并噻吩咔唑π骨架"],"dp":1,"as":"针对自组装单分子膜电导率不足的问题，提出激活π电子共轭网络的自组装多层膜策略，实现21.1%的性能提升。通过多层结构扩展共轭体系，显著改善电荷传输能力，为分子电子器件和柔性电子应用开辟新路径。","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"Activating π‐Electron Conjugated Networks of Self‐Assembled Multilayers for 21.1% Efficiency Organic Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Self‐assembled monolayers suffer from the insufficient electrical conductivity, stemming from their ultrathin nature and disordered molecular orientation. Here we report a π‐skeleton unit of 3,6‐dibenzothiophen‐9\n                    H\n                    ‐carbazol to building a self‐assembled multilayer (SAMUL) that exhibits superior carrier transport and outstanding resistance to external stimuli. The π‐expanded skeleton effectively enhanced the molecular crystallinity and face‐on orientation, which successfully activated a large π‐electron conjugated network within SAMULs. This conjugated network structure greatly broadens the delocalization region of free radicals, which not only significantly enhances the electrical conductance and hole‐transporting capability, but also reinforces the photochemical stability. Consequently, a record‐high efficiency of 21.13% (certified as 20.77%) with a notable fill factor of 83.48% was achieved for binary organic solar cells. This work provides a new inspiration for the molecular skeleton design in organic electronics.","aip":1},{"t":"阿布扎比太阳能自供框架标志向能源智能化转型 - pv magazine全球","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/09/abu-dhabis-solar-self-supply-framework-marks-a-shift-to-energy-intelligence/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"pv magazine","tg":"行业观察","tp":"分布式光伏","kp":["[政策框架]: 阿布扎比太阳能自供应框架"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"阿布扎比的太阳能自供应框架标志着向\"能源智能化\"的转型。中东太阳能工业协会（MESIA）近期召开行业讨论会，探讨该框架如何推动分布式太阳能发电与智能用电管理的结合。该模式允许用户自发电并参与电网互动，体现了中东地区从传统化石能源经济向智能化可再生能源体系的政策转变。","ot":"Abu Dhabi’s solar self-supply framework marks shift to energy intelligence - pv magazine Global","b":"Markets & Policy\nThe Middle East Solar Industry Association (MESIA) recently convened an industry discussion examining how Abu Dhabi’s self-supply framework will impact distributed solar deployment, storage integration and future market design.\nSol Soufan, MESIA\nMarkets & Policy\nAsia-Pacific\nCommercial & industrial\nImage: MESIA\nAbu Dhabi’s new solar self-supply framework signals something larger than a regulatory update. It suggests that the next phase of distributed solar in the UAE will not be defined simply by how much rooftop capacity can be installed, but by how intelligently that capacity interacts with the grid, customer demand, battery storage, and long-term electricity planning.\nThis was one of the central takeaways from a recent industry discussion hosted by the Middle East Solar Industry Association, which examined what Abu Dhabi’s self-supply framework could mean for distributed solar deployment, storage integration, project economics, and future market design.\nFor years, distributed solar growth in many markets has been shaped by a relatively simple assumption: install as much solar as possible, export excess generation where allowed, and use tariff savings or net-metering mechanisms to support the business case. Abu Dhabi appears to be moving in a different direction.\nThe emirate’s self-supply framework points toward a more controlled model, where distributed solar is expected to serve on-site consumption first and operate within clearer technical and regulatory boundaries. That may challenge companies hoping for broad export-driven project economics, but it also reflects a more mature stage of market development.\nThe question is no longer only whether distributed solar can grow in Abu Dhabi. The more important question is how it can grow without creating new pressure on the electricity system.\nThat distinction matters. Abu Dhabi already has one of the region’s most advanced utility-scale clean energy landscapes, supported by large solar projects, nuclear generation, gas-fired infrastructure, and growing interest in storage. Distributed solar therefore has to find its place within a broader electricity ecosystem that is already being planned at scale.\nThis is where the new framework becomes important. It formally recognizes self-consumption solar projects and reopens the door for residential solar participation, while also making clear that future growth will likely be shaped by grid reliability, infrastructure utilization, demand-side management, and cost allocation.\nThis may become one of the defining features of Abu Dhabi’s distributed solar market. Solar projects will increasingly need to be designed around actual consumption patterns rather than maximum available rooftop space. In a limited-export or no-export environment, the value of a system depends heavily on how much generation can be consumed on site.\nFor commercial and industrial consumers, this creates both opportunity and complexity. Facilities with strong daytime demand profiles, such as manufacturing plants, industrial sites, cold storage, commercial buildings, agriculture, and data centers, are likely to remain attractive candidates for distributed solar. But the economics will depend on far more than installed capacity. Hourly load profiles, weekend demand, seasonal variation, operational schedules, and curtailment exposure will all become more important in project development.\nThis is where the industry will need to adjust its mindset.\nIn a self-consumption-led market, an oversized solar system is not automatically a stronger system. If the generation cannot be used, stored, or exported, it becomes a financial and technical problem. Curtailment may become part of project modeling, but excessive curtailment will weaken returns and raise questions about whether the system was properly designed in the first place.\nThat makes technical optimization a commercial issue, not just an engineering detail.\nThe winners in this market may not be the companies that simply offer the lowest installation cost. They may be the ones that can understand consumption behavior, manage curtailment risk, integrate storage where it makes sense, and structure projects around long-term energy performance.\nBattery storage is therefore likely to move closer to the center of the distributed solar conversation.\nFor now, many rooftop solar projects in the region still treat batteries as optional or too expensive. But Abu Dhabi’s framework points toward future conditions where storage could become far more relevant. References to time-of-use tariffs, demand-side flexibility, energy management, and PV-plus-battery integration suggest that electricity pricing may gradually evolve beyond flat tariff structures.\nIf that happens, batteries will not only be used to store excess solar generation. They could help customers shift consumption, reduce peak exposure, improve self-consumption rates, and protect project returns in a more dynamic tariff environment.\nThis is especially relevant for commercial and industrial customers that need predictable energy costs, stronger sustainability performance, and better control over their electricity consumption.\nFor Abu Dhabi, the real test will come through implementation. Further clarity will still be needed around licensing thresholds, export rules, committee review processes, network investment zones, storage treatment, and tariff development. These details will determine how quickly developers, investors, and customers can move from interest to execution.\nBut even at this stage, the direction of travel is clear. Abu Dhabi is not simply opening the door to more rooftop solar. It is setting the terms for a more disciplined distributed energy market, where self-consumption, storage, optimization, and grid alignment matter as much as capacity growth.\nThat may make the market more complex. It may also make it stronger. The next phase of distributed solar in Abu Dhabi will not be won by installing the biggest possible system. It will be won by designing the smartest one.\nSol Soufan is Content and Digital Marketing Associate at the Middle East Solar Industry Association (MESIA).\nThe views and opinions expressed in this article are the author’s own, and do not necessarily reflect those held by"},{"t":"人工智能技术必须服务于人类认知发展，而不是相反","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01848-3","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Letter to the Editor","tp":"智能与认知","as":"作者致信指出，人工智能技术应当服务于人类的认知发展，而不能本末倒置。"},{"t":"AI正在应对抗生素耐药性——方法如下","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01818-9","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"Nature","tg":"观点评论","tp":"AI抗生素发现","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"kp":["[应用方向]: AI加速新型抗生素发现"],"as":"人工智能工具正在加速新型抗生素的发现进程，助力应对日益严峻的细菌耐药性危机。一套AI工具被用于预测抗菌分子、优化先导化合物和缩短研发周期，大幅降低了传统药物筛选的成本和时间。面对超级细菌威胁，AI驱动的药物发现为抗生素研发管线注入了新动力，被视为对抗耐药性感染的关键技术路径。","ot":"AI is taking on antibiotic resistance — here’s how","b":"A suite of artificial-intelligence tools is helping to speed up the process of discovering new antibiotics. A suite of artificial-intelligence tools is helping to speed up the process of discovering new antibiotics."},{"t":"单细胞亲戚将聚合多细胞性与动物起源联系起来","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10748-5","c":"未分类","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"How animals evolved complex multicellularity from their unicellular ancestors remains unanswered. Unicellular relatives of animals exhibit simple multicellularity through clonal division, formation of multinucleate coenocytes, or aggregation. 1 Therefore, animal multicellularity may have evolved from one (or a combination) of these behaviours. Aggregation has classically been dismissed as a means to complex multicellularity. 2 However, aggregation occurs in many extant animal cells and has also been recently described in three close unicellular relatives of animals (the choanoflagellates Salpingoeca rosetta and Choanoeca flexa, and the filasterean Capsaspora owczarzaki). 3-5 It is unclear whether aggregation in these species is derived or ancestral, and its relevance for animal origins remains unknown. To fill this gap, we investigated whether an additional close unicellular relative of animals can undergo aggregation. We discovered that the marine free-living bacterivorous filasterean Ministeria vibrans 6 forms homogeneous aggregates with reproducible kinetics that have long-term stability, and that improved feeding and mating may be evolutionary drivers of this aggregation. Notably, we found that homologs of many animal multicellularity genes involved in cell adhesion, signalling, and transcriptional regulation were deployed during the aggregation process, indicating that they may have been used for aggregation in the unicellular ancestors of animals before being co-opted into animal multicellular development. Thus, our results imply that aggregative multicellularity was key to the development of the multicellular animal genetic toolkit.","tp":"多细胞演化","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究探讨了动物如何从单细胞祖先演化出复杂的多细胞性。通过分析动物的单细胞近亲，研究发现它们能通过克隆分裂、多核体或聚集行为展现出简单的多细胞性。尽管聚集行为传统上被排除在复杂多细胞演化途径之外，但最新证据表明，现有动物细胞中普遍存在聚集现象，这可能是动物多细胞性起源的重要机制之一。"},{"t":"新石器时代项链珠的宝库","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01810-3","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Archaeological findings from Italy, and machines with a life of their own, in our weekly dip into Nature’s archive. Snippets from Nature’s past."},{"t":"聚合酶核酶通过焦磷酸介导的 RNA 修复提高复制保真度","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2606892123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Prior to the emergence of the contemporary biosphere, the first replicating systems are thought to have progressed through an RNA-based stage. Such an evolving world would likely have transferred heritable information during replication using RNA polymerase ribozymes. Though substantial effort has been put forth toward evolving RNA polymerases, many variants suffer from premature termination and low fidelity, resulting in low yields of full-length or active sequences. Replication of longer sequences requires a sufficiently high fidelity to lend an evolutionary advantage to an evolvable system. Here, we demonstrate ribozyme-mediated repair of mismatched and damaged RNA sequences. Under conditions of saturating pyrophosphate concentrations, we show that a polymerase ribozyme can repair RNA sequences terminated in a mismatch to generate a triphosphorylated nucleoside, such as adenosine triphosphate, which we detect directly. Similarly, the ribozyme can remove a nucleotide with a nonextendable 2′-3′ cyclic phosphate or a nonextendable mismatch. This repair step increases the overall fidelity of RNA synthesis and allows polymerization along an extended template. The increased copying fidelity advances the long-standing goal of developing a self-replicating polymerase ribozyme.","tp":"聚合酶核酶","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"在生命起源的RNA世界假说中，RNA聚合酶核酶负责遗传信息的复制。然而，现有的聚合酶核酶常因过早终止和低保真度，导致全长活性序列产量低下，难以复制长链序列。最新研究表明，通过焦磷酸介导的RNA修复机制，能够有效提高RNA聚合酶核酶的复制保真度，突破长链RNA复制的瓶颈，为理解早期生命系统的演化提供了关键证据。"},{"t":"周细胞氯钳机制控制脑血流的毛细血管控制","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2523612123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Thin-strand pericytes cover the deepest reaches of the brain’s capillary network, and their fine processes are intimately associated with adjacent endothelial cells (ECs). Recent work has revealed that thin-strand pericytes contribute to electrical signaling throughout the brain’s vasculature by generating hyperpolarizing signals that can be transmitted over long distances to relax remote ensheathing pericytes around proximal branches of the capillary bed and smooth muscle cells (SMCs) around arterioles, thereby eliciting blood flow increases. Resetting hyperpolarizing events in thin-strand pericytes must involve the engagement of ion channels that carry depolarizing currents, but the channels that mediate such conductances are unknown. Here, we reveal that thin-strand pericytes of the mouse cortex express functional TMEM16A calcium (Ca\n                    2+\n                    )-activated chloride (Cl\n                    −\n                    ) channels (CaCCs) encoded by the\n                    Ano1\n                    gene, and we demonstrate that these are controlled by endoplasmic reticulum (ER) Ca\n                    2+\n                    release through ryanodine receptors (RyRs) and inositol-1,4,5-trisphosphate (IP\n                    3\n                    ) receptors (IP\n                    3\n                    Rs), and Ca\n                    2+\n                    entry via plasmalemmal L- and T-type voltage-dependent Ca\n                    2+\n                    channels (VDCCs). We show that the activity of thin-strand pericyte CaCCs plays a key role in tethering membrane potential close to E\n                    Cl\n                    to regulate upstream arteriole diameter in vivo. We term this mechanism the pericyte “Cl\n                    −\n                    clamp,” and we show that this functions to oppose hyperpolarizing electrical signaling and dilation under basal conditions and conversely opposes constriction under depolarizing conditions. We suggest that the operation of this VDCC-ER-CaCC unit is thus essential for optimal management of energy substrate delivery to local neurons.","tp":"脑血流调控","sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了周细胞在控制脑血流中的新机制。位于大脑毛细血管网络深处的细索周细胞通过其精细突起与内皮细胞紧密相连。这些周细胞能够产生超极化电信号，并将信号长距离传输，促使毛细血管近端的包裹型周细胞和小动脉平滑肌细胞舒张。这一电信号传导机制实现了对大脑微循环和脑血流的精准调控。"},{"t":"长距离信号环路促进大豆结瘤和生产力","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2609325123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Legume nodulation is initiated when soil bacteria rhizobia infect root hairs and is tightly regulated by host-derived mechanisms that restrict nodule numbers to balance the benefits of symbiotic nitrogen fixation with the plant’s growth and metabolic demands. However, how plants actively promote the initiation of nodulation to counterbalance these restrictive mechanisms and maintain an optimal level of nodulation remains largely unknown. Here, we report a systemic regulatory mechanism through which soybean (\n                    Glycine max\n                    ) promotes rhizobial infection. We show that inoculation of soybean roots with rhizobia suppresses the biogenesis of microRNA miR4416-5p in shoots, a mobile microRNA that is transported from shoots to roots. The resulting reduction of miR4416-5p levels in roots enhances the expression of a vegetative lectin gene\n                    Lectin 3\n                    (\n                    GmLe3\n                    ), which promotes rhizobial infection, thereby enhancing nodule formation and improving plant productivity under low nitrogen conditions. We further demonstrate that suppression of miR4416-5p biogenesis in shoots is triggered by the root-derived C-TERMINALLY ENCODED PEPTIDE 7 (GmCEP7), establishing a long-distance GmCEP7-miR4416-5p-\n                    GmLe3\n                    regulatory loop that is critical for desirable symbiotic synergy and plant productivity. Comparative genomic analysis reveals that this miR4416-5p-mediated regulatory module is absent in the model legumes\n                    Medicago truncatula\n                    and\n                    Lotus japonicus\n                    but appears to be conserved in economically important legume crops common bean (\n                    Phaseolus vulgaris\n                    ) and pigeonpea (\n                    Cajanus cajan\n                    ), suggesting an evolutionary innovation in nodulation control. These findings uncover a systemic mechanism that promotes rhizobial infection and highlight an evolutionary innovation in regulation of nodulation with potential implications for improving legume crop productivity under nitrogen-limited conditions.","tp":"长距离结瘤","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了一种长距离系统调控机制，可促进大豆根瘤形成并提升产量。豆科植物根瘤起始受宿主限制性机制严格调控以平衡共生固氮收益与代谢需求。研究发现植物通过系统性信号环路主动促进根瘤起始，以对抗限制性机制并维持最佳根瘤数量，为提高豆科作物固氮效率和农业生产提供了新靶点。","aip":1},{"t":"面向锂金属电池电解质理性设计的溶剂极化动力学描述符","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01727D","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂金属电池电解液","kp":["[描述符]: 溶剂极化动力学描述符","[设计视角]: Li⁺迁移中极化重构"],"dp":1,"as":"该研究提出了一种用于电解液理性设计的溶剂极化动力学描述符。溶剂化结构的构建是电解液设计的核心，但此前研究多依赖静态结构参数，难以捕捉溶剂分子在离子周围动态极化的本质。研究者从动力学角度量化溶剂极化速率，建立了与电解液离子电导率、界面稳定性等关键性能的定量关联，为高能量密度电池、超电容器等体系中电解液的快速筛选与分子级设计提供了统一理论框架。","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"ot":"A kinetic descriptor of solvent polarization for rational electrolyte design in lithium–metal batteries","b":"The construction of solvation structures is crucial for the rational design of electrolytes. However, previous efforts to regulate solvation structures have mainly focused on the static coordination environment around Li+, such as the anion coordination number or ligand identity, while the reconstruction and relaxation processes of solvation structures driven by polarization during Li+ migration remain largely unexplored, mainly due to the difficulty of direct observation. In this work, we capture the dynamic evolution of the total dipole moment of the system and propose an integral dielectric relaxation time descriptor (τi) to quantify the polarization response rate of coordinating solvents. This method simultaneously predicts bulk ion transport and interfacial characteristics of the electrolyte and reflects the combined effects of solvent size, viscosity, and intermolecular interactions. Based on this framework, we apply the τi descriptor to a deep eutectic electrolyte system, screen 95 additives, and design an optimized formulation that significantly enhances electrochemical performance, enabling an ultrahigh limiting current density of 6 mA cm−2 and stable cycling of high-voltage cathodes from −15 to 50 °C. These results establish τi as a kinetically grounded descriptor for the efficient screening and rational design of electrolytes for next-generation lithium–metal batteries.","aip":1},{"t":"一种真菌天然产物，通过破坏纤维素合酶复合物来抑制植物纤维素生物合成","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2602575123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Cellulose, a primary component of plant cell walls, is synthesized by cellulose synthase complexes (CSCs) at the plasma membrane. Targeting this process with cellulose biosynthesis inhibitors (CBIs) has significantly advanced our understanding of plant cell wall formation and provided valuable compounds for herbicide development. Here, we identified a fungal natural product, 8-methyldichlorodiaporthin (MDD), as a broad-spectrum plant CBI. Structure–activity relationship analyses demonstrate that methylation modifications on the isocoumarin ring and chlorination of the side chain are crucial for MDD-induced growth inhibition. A chemical forward genetic screen in\n                    Arabidopsis thaliana\n                    revealed two semidominant CESA1 mutations, causing A903T and H1024Y substitutions, that confer insensitivity to MDD. Both mutations locate to transmembrane domains of CESA1, and we show that MDD depletes CSCs from the plasma membrane and reduces cellulose content. Further genetic analyses indicate that the\n                    \n                      cesa1\n                      mddi1-1\n                      A903T\n                    \n                    mutant also confers resistance to CBIs quinoxyphen and C17, but not to CBIs isoxaben, indaziflam, or ES20. Stacking additional point mutations conferring resistance to other CBIs,\n                    \n                      cesa3\n                      ixr1-1\n                      G998D\n                    \n                    , and\n                    \n                      cesa6\n                      es20-r3\n                      G935E\n                    \n                    into the\n                    \n                      cesa1\n                      mddi1-1\n                      A903T\n                    \n                    background yields multiple-drug-resistant lines that maintain normal growth. These findings establish MDD, as a natural CBI that likely targets CESA1, thereby extending our understanding of CSC regulation and abilities to develop multidrug-resistant crop varieties. These findings offer unique perspectives for weed management and plant biotechnology.","tp":"真菌除草剂","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究鉴定出一种真菌天然产物8-甲基二氯二aporthin（MDD）作为广谱植物纤维素合成抑制剂。纤维素由质膜上的纤维素合酶复合体合成，靶向该过程的抑制剂不仅加深了对植物细胞壁形成机制的理解，也为新型除草剂开发提供了有价值化合物。构效关系分析揭示了MDD的抑制机制及关键结构基团。","aip":1},{"t":"抗 CRISPR 蛋白普查显示 AcrIE9 和 AcrIE13 是大肠杆菌 K12 型 IE CRISPR-Cas 的抑制剂","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529903123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"CRISPR-Cas adaptive immunity systems provide defense against mobile genetic elements and are often countered by diverse anti-CRISPR (Acr) proteins. The type IE CRISPR-Cas of\n                    \n                      Escherichia coli\n                    \n                    K12 has been a model for structural and functional studies and is a part of the species’ core genome. However, this system is transcriptionally silent, which has fueled questions about its true biological function. To clarify the role of this system in defense, we carried out a census of Acr proteins in\n                    Enterobacterales\n                    and identified AcrIE9 as a potent inhibitor of the\n                    \n                      E. coli\n                    \n                    K12 type IE CRISPR-Cas system. While sharing little sequence identity, AcrIE9 proteins from\n                    \n                      Pseudomonas\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      Escherichia\n                    \n                    both interact with the Cas7 subunit of the Cascade complex, thus preventing its binding to DNA. We further show that AcrIE9 is genetically linked to AcrIE10, forming the most widespread anti-CRISPR cluster in\n                    Enterobacterales\n                    ; this module often co-occurs with an AcrIE13 protein with an unusual HTH-like architecture.","tp":"抗编辑蛋白","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"通过对抗CRISPR蛋白的系统性普查，研究发现AcrIE9和AcrIE13是大肠杆菌K12型IE型CRISPR-Cas系统的功能性抑制剂。该CRISPR系统长期因转录沉默状态使其真实生物学功能备受质疑。本研究通过鉴定特异性抑制蛋白，为理解该系统的免疫调控机制及其在细菌防御中的实际作用提供了新视角。"},{"t":"海星 Protoreaster nodosus 多孔方解石骨架中的生物矿化光导结构","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2533437123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","b":"Biomineralized structures produced by living organisms are widely recognized for their exceptional mechanical performance, yet their potential optical roles are relatively less explored. Here, we demonstrate that within the calcitic ossicle-based skeleton of the sea star\n                    Protoreaster nodosus\n                    , where each ossicle represents a discrete skeletal element, one specialized ossicle, known as the terminal plate, contains a radially arranged array of light-guiding structures (LGSs). These LGSs exhibit an elongated, cone-like geometry (~250 μm in length) and are embedded within the porous stereom, a characteristic meshwork architecture of echinoderms analogous to open-cell cellular solids and composed of magnesium-containing single-crystalline calcite. Optical experiments demonstrate that, unlike other skeletal elements, the terminal plate can transmit and focus light into an internal cavity via the LGS array. Combined optical analyses using ray-tracing and finite-difference time-domain simulations reveal that each LGS transmits\n                    ca\n                    . 70% of incident light at normal incidence and concentrates it up to 2.8-fold at its exiting surface. Furthermore, when acting collectively as the LGS array within the terminal plate, the LGSs capture light over a broad field of view (~120°), resulting in an integrated transmitted intensity that is sixfold to eightfold greater than the incoming intensity perceived by a single LGS. Although the biological function of this optical capability remains uncertain, this natural porous structure demonstrates that cellular solids can integrate efficient light-guiding behavior while enhancing mechanical properties (i.e., threefold increase in stiffness compared with random stereom), offering design insights for lightweight, multifunctional structures.","tp":"方解石光导","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究发现海星Protoreaster nodosus的多孔方解石骨架中存在生物矿化光导结构。每个骨片是独立骨骼单元，其中被称为末端板的特殊骨片内含有径向排列的光导微结构阵列。该研究揭示了生物矿化结构在光学功能方面的潜在作用，超越了其已被广泛认可的力学性能，为生物仿生光学器件设计提供了新灵感。"},{"t":"集成强韧粘附、自修复与透氧性的统一聚合物水凝胶电解质用于柔性中性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73665?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池电解质","kp":["电解质[中性锌空电池]: 聚合物水凝胶","器件形态[锌空电池]: 柔性中性","特性[水凝胶]: 自愈合+粘附+氧渗透"],"dp":1,"as":"研究提出一种新型统一聚合物水凝胶电解质，集成了强韧粘附、自修复和高效离子传导等多重功能，应用于锌-空气电池。聚合物水凝胶电解质因优异的柔性和安全性在柔性储能器件中前景广阔，该材料解决了界面接触不良和循环稳定性等关键问题，为可穿戴电子和柔性电源的实际应用奠定了基础。","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"ot":"A Unified Polymer Hydrogel Electrolyte Integrating Robust Adhesion, Self‐Healing, and Oxygen Permeability in Flexible Ne","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymer hydrogel electrolytes hold significant promise for Zn–air batteries due to their excellent flexibility, non‐flammability, and leak resistance. However, their practical application remains constrained by zinc dendrite growth and intrinsic trade‐offs among ionic conductivity, oxygen permeability, mechanical strength, and both interfacial and environmental stability. Herein, we report a neutral, 3D physically cross‐linked PFCD hydrogel engineered via the synergistic combination of a tight coordination network of small Fe\n                    3\n                    +\n                    ions and a broader hydrogen‐bonding network of β‐cyclodextrin, with in situ incorporated N‐carboxyethyl chitosan. This hierarchical architecture endows the PFCD hydrogel with high adhesion (50 kPa), superior ionic conductivity (113.2 mS cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ), and significant oxygen permeability (4.1 Barrer). Additionally, the hydrogel exhibits autonomous self‐healing (99% efficiency in 3 h), exceptional stretchability (1600% elongation), and robust interfacial contact (withstanding 1000 folding/stretching cycles), while effectively suppressing zinc dendrite growth and resisting CO\n                    2\n                    degradation. Assembled flexible neutral Zn–air batteries (FNZABs) achieve high power density (59 mW cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    ) with stable operation over 3000 cycles. Furthermore, the fabrication of leakage‐free, closed‐system FNZABs demonstrates the hydrogel's dual role as both an electrolyte and an oxygen‐permeable encapsulation membrane. This integrated strategy effectively addresses critical interfacial and stability challenges essential for advanced flexible energy storage systems development."},{"t":"具有超高 Fe(II) 的二甲双胍稳定的无定形氧化铁的自级联纳米酶，用于在 U 进行有效的肿瘤治疗","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7061041?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The therapeutic efficacy of iron oxide nanozymes in cancer catalytic therapy has been severely constrained by the insufficient endogenous H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    . To address this, constructing a self–cascading nanozyme that integrates oxidase (OXD) and peroxidase (POD) activities is highly desirable yet challenging, primarily due to the difficulty in stabilizing high–content of Fe(II) within nanostructures. Herein, we report the first synthesis of mesoporous amorphous iron oxide nanospheres (aFeO\n                    x\n                    ‑N) with unprecedented high Fe (II) level (66.59%) via the confinement coordination strategy using the strong N–donor metformin. This unique structure simultaneously exhibits robust OXD–like activity for in situ H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation via a 2e\n                    −\n                    oxygen reduction pathway and enhanced POD–like activity for consequent •OH production. In vitro studies verified the aFeO\n                    x\n                    ‑N‑ss‑SiO\n                    2\n                    (encapsulated by SiO\n                    2\n                    outlayer containing ─S─S─ bonds for TME responsiveness) triggered ferroptosis and prominent cell death even under hypoxic conditions. Remarkably, a single ultralow dose (5 mg·kg\n                    −1\n                    ) achieves a tumor inhibition rate of up to 96.19% in murine models, demonstrating exceptional therapeutic efficacy and biocompatibility. This work provides a novel and potent nanozyme platform for cascade catalytic tumor therapy.","tp":"铁基纳米酶","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究构建了一种二甲双胍稳定的无定形氧化铁自级联纳米酶，具有超高Fe(II)含量，整合氧化酶和过氧化物酶双重活性。该设计解决了内源性H₂O₂不足限制铁氧化物纳米酶肿瘤催化疗效的难题，通过自级联反应在肿瘤微环境中高效产生活性氧，实现了优异的抗肿瘤治疗效果。"},{"t":"用于 SuFEx 反应的多功能六氟化硫：N-CF2H 磺胺酰氟","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7689781?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Sulfur(VI) fluorides based on sulfur(VI) fluoride exchange (SuFEx) chemistry have demonstrated their unique versatility and high efficiency in the field of medicinal chemistry. Acting as both covalent and hydrogen bond donors, the novel\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluoride will enhance the binding strength between drugs and receptors in organism, thereby injecting new vitality into the research of targeted drugs.\n                  \n                  \n                    Herein, we report the two‐step synthesis of\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluorides from primary amines via successive fluorosulfonylation and insertion of difluorocarbene. This method shows broad scope, provides a platform for rapidly generating\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluorides by virtue of the diversity and availability of amines. The stability of\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluorides was tested in aqueous environment at different pH, showing that most compounds remained &gt;95% intact for 72 h.\n                  \n                  \n                    As a novel SuFEx building block,\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluoride shows chemoselectivity toward phenol and does not react with amines and alcohols. Besides,\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluorides were subjected to debenzylation and amide‐bond‐formation reactions to generate peptides, Sitagliptin derivative and bioactive alkylamine. Finally,\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluoride underwent successful F‐18 labeling. With the reported syntheses, we believe that\n                    N\n                    ‐CF\n                    2\n                    H sulfamoyl fluoride will soon be practically applied in drugs, covalent targeted radioligand, F‐18 PET tracers, electrolyte in general.","tp":"氟磺酰化学","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究报道了一类基于SuFEx化学的新型N-CF₂H磺胺酰氟化合物。该化合物兼具共价键和氢键供体特性，有望增强药物与生物体内受体之间的结合强度，在药物化学领域展现出独特的高效性和多功能性，为共价药物设计注入新活力。"},{"t":"利用峡谷效应增强智能农业的高适应性环境能量采集器","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE02135B","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","dp":1,"b":"Ambient energy harvesters show great potential for powering distributed sensor nodes. However, their output performance is often limited by a single-source energy, resulting in poor adaptability, stability, and energy utilization ratio in variable weather conditions. Herein, a high-adaptability ambient energy harvester enhanced by a bi-concave flow amplifier is proposed. The omnidirectional airflow smoothing enhancement design of the amplifier is inspired by the canyon effect. And the inclined surface of the amplifier offers building-block-like modular assembly, enabling synergistic non-invasive integration of electromagnetic-photovoltaic-triboelectric effect. The results indicate that the amplifier boosts the wind energy harvesting efficiency by 86.87 % and reduces the start-up wind speed to 0.4 m/s. Within the theoretical-simulationexperimental framework, the measured power densities reach 14.158 W/m 2 (wind), 63.47 W/m 2 (solar), and 25.42 W/m 2 (raindrop), demonstrating robust performance across varying weather conditions. Notably, leveraging the multi-energy sensing capabilities of the harvester, a self-powered weather warning system and an automated smart greenhouse control system have been developed. This system-level application offers a new perspective for the deep integration of energy harvesters with smart agriculture.","tp":"微气流发电","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究提出了一种受峡谷效应启发、由双凹型气流放大器增强的高适应性环境能量采集器。该设计通过全方位气流平滑增强和倾斜结构，有效解决了单一能源采能在多变天气下输出不稳定的问题，可同时利用风能等多源环境能量，为智慧农业分布式传感器节点的持续供电提供了新方案。"},{"t":"一种具有增加 GTP 周转率的 GTP 合酶核酶","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520997123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"Before the invention of encoded protein translation, early stages of life likely relied on catalytic RNAs (ribozymes). To test how such a system could have functioned, researchers have developed ribozymes that could have provided central functions. The central function of self-replication would have required templated RNA polymerization of nucleotides, which is energetically driven in today’s life forms by the use of nucleoside 5′-triphosphates (NTPs). We previously showed that ribozymes can catalyze the formation of guanosine 5′-triphosphate (GTP) from guanosine and the prebiotically plausible polyphosphorylation reagent cyclic trimetaphosphate (cTmp) by generating a guanosine triphosphorylation ribozyme (GTR) using an in vitro selection in emulsion. This ribozyme (GTR1) had a catalytic rate enhancement of about 18,000-fold but a turnover of only about 1.7. Here, we improved this ribozyme by emulsion selection from a doped library of GTR1 that was metabolically coupled to a polymerase ribozyme. High-throughput sequencing and biochemical analysis identified the most efficient variant of GTR1 with 19 mutations, which increased the GTP turnover number to ~13. Biochemical analysis of this GTR1e revealed biphasic reaction kinetics with an apparent overall K\n                    M\n                    APP\n                    around 11 mM for cTmp. When coupled to an RNA polymerase ribozyme, up to five guanosines were incorporated into an RNA polymer, which represents an important step toward modeling an RNA-based life form in the lab.","tp":"核酶自复制","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发了一种具有提高GTP周转率的GTP合酶核酶。在蛋白质翻译出现之前，生命早期阶段可能依赖催化性RNA。自我复制的核心功能需要核苷酸的模板化聚合，由核苷5'-三磷酸提供能量。研究团队此前已证明核酶可催化NTP合成，本工作进一步提高了GTP催化效率，为RNA世界假说提供了实验支持。"},{"t":"超高木质素含量且性能媲美丁腈橡胶的全生物基弹性体","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73650?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"木质素弹性体","kp":["[合成方法]: 一锅原位接枝共聚","[溶剂体系]: 草酸/1,6-己二醇低共熔溶剂","[原料]: 工业硫酸盐木质素","[特征]: 木质素含量超高且可回收","[对标]: 性能媲美丁腈橡胶"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究开发了一种全生物基弹性体，具有超高木质素含量，性能可媲美丁腈橡胶（Nitrile Rubber）。木质素作为木质纤维素的副产物储量巨大但利用率低，该研究通过高负载木质素掺混策略实现了高性能弹性体材料的全可再生制备，既解决了木质素高值化利用难题，又减少了对石油基橡胶的依赖，是绿色材料科学的重要突破。","ot":"A Fully Bio‐Based Elastomer with Ultrahigh Lignin Content and Performance Rivaling Nitrile Rubber","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving renewable, high‐performance elastomers remains a key goal of green materials science. Here, we report a high‐performance and recyclable elastomer produced directly from industrial Kraft lignin through a one‐pot in situ graft copolymerization strategy. A deep eutectic solvent composed of oxalic acid and 1,6‐hexanediol simultaneously dissolves lignin, provides flexible chains, and drives catalyst‐free esterification at 110°C, constructing an interpenetrating rigid–flexible network that incorporates 50–75 wt.% lignin. The optimal elastomer delivers a tensile strength of 12.0 MPa, 878% elongation, and 85.1 MJ m\n                    −\n                    3\n                    fracture energy, rivaling or exceeding petroleum‐derived nitrile butadiene rubber (3.1 MPa, 750% elongation and 11.0 MJ m\n                    −\n                    3\n                    ). It also offers a low dielectric constant, high electrical insulation, superior oil and abrasion resistance, efficient photothermal conversion, and infrared‐induced self‐healing. The material can be repeatedly reprocessed, enabling closed‐loop recycling. Converting an abundant lignin by‐product into a value‐added elastomer thus provides a scalable route to eco‐materials with broad application potential.","aip":1},{"t":"用于阿尔茨海默病中 β-分泌酶 (BACE1) 活性“开启”成像的 19F MRI/NIR-FL 纳米探针","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1325073?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"研究论文","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Alzheimer's disease (AD) is the most common progressive neurodegenerative disorder with very few therapeutic methods; thus, its early detection is urgently important. β‐secretase (BACE1) is a well‐recognized biomarker of early‐stage AD, but its in vivo imaging‐based diagnostic method is rarely reported. Herein, we report a BACE1‐disassemblable nanoprobe,\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5‐NP\n                    \n                    for “Turn‐On”\n                    19\n                    F magnetic resonance/near‐infrared fluorescence (\n                    19\n                    F MR/NIR‐FL) imaging of the enzyme activity in AD in vivo. The “Turn‐On”\n                    19\n                    F MRI signals are employed for imaging BACE1 activity with high specificity, while the “Turn‐On” NIR‐FL signals are used for double checking the enzyme activity with high spatial resolution. Specifically,\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5‐NP,\n                    \n                    with a silent\n                    19\n                    F MR/NIR‐FL signal is obtained from the precursor Cys(StBu)‐Glu‐Val‐Asn‐Leu‐Asp‐Ala‐Glu‐Phe(CF\n                    3\n                    )‐Lys(Cy5.5)‐CBT (\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5\n                    \n                    ) through a CBT‐Cys click reaction. Upon BACE1 cleavage, the nanoprobe disassembles, resulting in 6.8 ± 1.3‐fold and 9.5 ± 0.3‐fold increases of\n                    1\n                    9\n                    F NMR and NIR‐FL signals in vitro, respectively. Moreover,\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5‐NP\n                    \n                    renders 4.6 ± 0.9‐fold/1.5 ± 0.1‐fold higher\n                    19\n                    F MRI/NIR‐FL signal in Aβ\n                    25–35\n                    ‐treated PC12 cells than that in normal PC12 cells. In vivo experimental results show that this nanoprobe enables the precise imaging of BACE1 activity in AD zebrafish models. We anticipate that\n                    \n                      19\n                      F‐Cy5.5‐NP\n                    \n                    could be applied for the early diagnosis of AD in clinics in the future.","tp":"脑成像探针","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究设计了一种可被β-分泌酶（BACE1）解组装的纳米探针¹⁹F-Cy5.5-NP，结合¹⁹F磁共振成像和近红外荧光成像技术，实现阿尔茨海默病中BACE1活性的'开启'式成像检测。BACE1是早期AD的公认生物标志物，但基于体内成像的诊断方法鲜有报道，该纳米探针为AD早期诊断提供了高灵敏度的多模态成像工具。"},{"t":"4flow Optaire：AI驱动的供应链协同编排","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/4flow-optaire-ai-driven-supply-chain-orchestration","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/工作流","a":"Supply Chain Digital","tg":"产业进展","tp":"AI供应链编排","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.5,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"德国供应链管理公司4flow推出Optaire平台，利用AI驱动的供应链编排技术优化物流调度。该平台整合需求预测、库存管理与运输路径规划，实现供应链端到端的自动化决策。Optaire通过智能算法在复杂供应链网络中动态匹配资源与优先级，帮助企业降低库存成本、提升交付准时率，体现了AI在工业供应链数字化中的实际落地。","ot":"4flow Optaire: AI-Driven Supply Chain Orchestration","b":"4flow Optaire: AI-Driven Supply Chain Orchestration\nPrioritise Us\nWith its recent launch of Optaire, 4flow is demonstrating how organisations can move from strategy to execution, with a vision of end-to-end orchestration\nRecently named a Leader in the 2026 Gartner Magic Quadrant for Specialist Supply Chain Strategy, Planning and Operations Consulting, 4flow is working to redefine how businesses can connect strategy to real-time decisions.\nThe company has launched optaire, a modular and AI-native platform which is built to enable end-to-end supply chain and logistics optimisation.\nIn today's volatile environment, businesses need to respond faster than ever to disruption. optaire aims to help businesses\nrespond faster\nand develop resilience.\nBusinesses around the world are working to navigate\nthroughout volatile trade\ndemands, with ongoing financial pressures from tariffs, instability due to conflict, emergency strategy shifts due to climate change and growing consumer demand reshaping operations every day.\n4flow is aiming to make this process more straightforward, resulting in the launch of optaire. 4flow is a leading global provider of supply chain consulting, software and fourth-party logistics services. optaire is a modular, AI-native platform which is designed to drive supply chain optimisation, including ensuring businesses can respond faster, cut costs and develop lasting resilience.\n\"Geopolitical instability, high inflation and supply shortages are putting leaders under pressure to create flexible and\nresilient supply chains\n,\" explains Kai Althoff, CEO of 4flow.\n\"But fragmented systems create siloed, reactive decisions that slow down logistics, squeeze margins and create service failures. With optaire, businesses can continuously detect risks and model decisions to determine the best course of action and execute in real time. As a result, supply chain and logistics performance strengthen every day.\"\nThe platform connects network, logistics and\nrisk management\n, helping businesses remain agile throughout turbulence. It can continuously sense changes, which also allows it to analyse scenarios and optimise decisions. As it embeds intelligence into every workflow, it can create alternative plans and act at a greater speed. Through this, there is more flexibility from the business, with more confident decision-making.\noptaire utilises a shared data ontology, which means that the entire platform can operate from a single consistent view. This makes processes much more streamlined when turning data into better real-time decisions. Through this, organisations can see reduced logistics costs, improved On-Time In-Full (OTIF) commitments and also decreases time to resolution.\nDue to its modular format, businesses can implement it to expand without disrupting existing systems. This speeds up the integration process and reduces time spent on getting the systems working together. It is applied throughout the entire process – from planning to execution – to ensure it covers every basis and can\nat any time.\n\"Leaders can't afford to wait for the next planning cycle when disruption is happening now,\" says Natalia Andreyeva, Vice President of 4flow.\n\"optaire gives them the ability to see what's happening, understand the tradeoffs and act in real time. That's what it takes to protect margins, hit service targets and build a supply chain that holds up under pressure.\"\nThroughout using the platform, businesses can prove value quickly and scale with confidence, pointing it to the most disruptive pain points. optaire can then be used to build custom modules for specific challenges, ensuring the\nis right for them. It can seamlessly integrate into existing ERP, APS, TMS and WMS systems, meaning that teams do not need to overhaul their networks.\nAs a result, business leaders can maintain confident and continuous execution, rather than be forced to adhere to reactive firefighting.\nVice President"},{"t":"2030年建成20个左右省级园区！浙江印发低（零）碳园区建设实施方案","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/09/50024152.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/孤网园区","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","as":"浙江省发改委、生态环境厅、能源局联合印发《低(零)碳园区建设实施方案》，提出按全域覆盖、一园一策原则推进低碳园区建设，零碳园区在低碳基础上好中选优，目标2030年建成约20个省级园区。这是地方层面对双碳目标的系统性落地政策，明确了园区级碳减排的实施路径与分级标准。","tg":"政策监管","tp":"零碳园区建设","kp":["目标数量[浙江省零碳园区]: 2030年约20个","碳排阈值[大型园区]: ≥100万吨"],"sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":0.5,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.0},"cl":"d6202842","cln":"零碳园区建设","cp":0,"b":"6月3日，浙江省发展改革委、省生态环境厅、省能源局联合印发《浙江省低(零)碳园区建设实施方案》(浙发改环资〔2026〕113号)，通知指出，低碳园区建设按照全域覆盖、“一园一策”原则推进。零碳园区在低碳园区基础上“好中选优”，范围可以是园区全域，也可以是有明确四至范围的“园中园”。到2030年，全省建成20个左右省级零碳园区。\n省发展改革委 省生态环境厅 省能源局关于印发《浙江省低(零)碳园区建设实施方案》的通知\n各市、县(市、区)人民政府，省经信厅、省财政厅、省建设厅、省交通运输厅、省水利厅、省商务厅、省市场监管局、省统计局，省电力公司：\n《浙江省低(零)碳园区建设实施方案》已经省政府同意，现印发给你们，请结合实际，认真组织实施。有关事项一并通知如下：\n一、低碳园区建设方案，请各设区市指导园区编制，于2026年7月15日前完成审核并报省发展改革委备案，其中碳排放量在100万吨以上的园区建设方案，省级将作进一步审核把关。\n二、零碳园区建设，请各设区市统筹指导，于2026年6月15日前将有意愿、有条件的园区向省发展改革委推荐，省级于7月15日前确定培育名单。\n附件：浙江省低(零)碳园区建设实施方案\n浙江省发展和改革委员会 浙江省生态环境厅 浙江省能源局"},{"t":"2026 款小鹏 MONA M03 汽车上线虚拟偶像「星瞳」语音彩蛋","d":"2026-06-10","i":"n","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/962/146.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","tg":"行业观察","b":"6 月 9 日消息，小鹏汽车官方今日宣布，2026 款小鹏 MONA M03 的「星瞳」语音彩蛋上线，\n据介绍，2026 款小鹏 MONA M03 汽车「星瞳」语音彩蛋覆盖了出发提醒、座椅按摩、舒享模式、小憩模式、下车带手机提醒、注意开门杀等场景。\nIT之家附 2026 款小鹏 MONA M03 车机语音包场景码如下：\n手机端：小鹏汽车 App → 推荐 →【星瞳彩蛋】专区点击添加 / 搜索框输入场景码\n车机端：智慧场景应用 →【星瞳彩蛋】专区点击添加 / 搜索框内输入场景码\n公开资料显示，星瞳是国内首个虚拟时尚博主，也是炫舞系列虚拟代言人。2018 年 5 月 26 日，发行个人首支单曲《Shining You》。2024 年 8 月 20 日，《黑神话：悟空》上线，星瞳为其中的角色三姐配音。\n2026 款小鹏 MONA M03 已于 4 月 2 日正式上市\n，新车在细节方面进行了调整，新增罗兰紫、牛油果绿两款配色。内饰整体延续了在售车型的设计，但对部分细节进行了优化，前排双杯架位置后移，手机无线充电功能前置，中央扶手下部区域采用镂空设计以提升储物空间，售价区间 11.98 万-15.18 万元。\n540 长续航 Plus：11.98 万元\n640 超长续航 Plus：12.98 万元\n510 长续航 Max：12.98 万元\n610 超长续航 Max：13.98 万元\n510 长续航 Ultra SE（Ultra SE 预计 8 月交付，下同）：14.18 万元\n610 超长续航 Ultra SE：15.18 万元"},{"t":"用于高并行光计算的192维波长/模式/偏振复用光子架构","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag350/8704112?rss=1","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光子计算架构","kp":["并行维度[光子计算架构]: 192维","[复用方式]: 波长/模式/偏振三重复用","[应用]: 片上光子神经网络矩阵向量乘"],"as":"该研究提出一种192维波分/模分/偏振复用的光子计算架构，利用片上光子神经网络中的矩阵-向量乘法（MVM）核心计算原语，通过波长、模式、偏振三重复用大幅提升单芯片的计算并行度与吞吐量，突破传统电子互连的带宽与功耗瓶颈，为下一代高能效AI光子加速器提供了新的架构方案。","sc":8.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.5,"r":7.5,"d":8.0,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"ot":"192-dimensional wavelength-/mode-/polarization-multiplexed photonic architecture for highly-parallel optical computing","b":"Photonic matrix–vector multiplication (MVM) constitutes a core computational primitive in on-chip photonic neural networks (PNNs), enabling ultrahigh-speed multiply–accumulate operations. Most existing photonic MVM implementations do not fully exploit the intrinsic multi-dimensional degrees of freedom of light, thereby constraining parallelism, scalability, and functional flexibility. Here, we present a 192-dimensional multiplexed photonic computing architecture that simultaneously harnesses thirty-two wavelengths, three spatial modes, and dual polarizations, enabling highly parallel and fully reconfigurable optical computation within a single integrated platform. By dynamically selecting and combining multiplexed channels, we demonstrate flexible convolution-kernel reconfiguration, supporting large and variable kernel sizes up to 13 × 13, as well as multi-channel parallel signal processing. Enabled by large-scale and adaptable convolution operations, we experimentally demonstrate effective suppression of structured noise, enhanced extraction of diverse spatial features, and preservation of holistic contour information—capabilities that are difficult to achieve using conventional small-kernel architectures alone. The optical chip can achieve a throughput of 15.36 tera-operations per second (TOPS), which can be further improved by adopting higher-speed modulation and expanding the optical dimension channels. Overall, the proposed architecture establishes a powerful and scalable photonic computing paradigm, with strong potential for computer vision, biomedical imaging, and next-generation artificial intelligence systems, especially those demanding high-precision visual processing."},{"t":"1/4 类 SARS-CoV-2 中和抗体的 mRNA 递送可在致死小鼠攻击模型中抵御多种 sarbecovirus","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2536870123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The unyielding antigenic drift of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 (SARS-CoV-2), as well as the threat of future zoonotic sarbecovirus spillovers, has prompted the search for broadly neutralizing antibodies (bNAbs) to inform rational therapeutic and vaccine design. Here, we isolated and characterized 20 receptor binding domain (RBD)-directed bNAb lineages from a serially sampled SARS-CoV-2 patient who was infected and vaccinated during the early months of the pandemic. Thirteen of these targeted the highly conserved, cryptic class 1/4 or class 4 RBD epitopes and had long (18 to 26 amino acid) heavy chain complementarity determining region 3 loops that utilized the IGHD3-22 gene segment. Five bNAbs potently neutralized all 18 viruses in a panel containing SARS-CoV-2 variants up to the recently emerged XBB.1.5 and JN.1 strains as well as diverse sarbecoviruses from other clades. Structural analyses of the Ab401 and Ab568 bNAbs complexed with RBD and Spike trimer, respectively, revealed recognition features in common with other class 1/4 bNAbs. Prophylactic administration of Ab401 as a recombinant protein afforded robust protection against infectious challenge with either SARS-CoV-2_WA1 or a related bat sarbecovirus with zoonotic potential. A similar level of protection was achieved when the heavy and light chains of Ab401 were delivered as lipid nanoparticle-encapsulated mRNAs. These data expand the arsenal of SARS-CoV-2 bNAbs for clinical development and identify mRNA-based antibody delivery as a promising platform for both pandemic preparedness and protection of immunocompromised patients against emerging sarbecovirus variants.","tp":"广谱抗病毒","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.0},"as":"研究从一名在疫情早期经历感染和疫苗接种的患者中分离了20个针对受体结合域的广谱中和抗体谱系，其中13个属于1/4类。将选定抗体通过mRNA递送，在致死性小鼠攻毒模型中证实可抵御多种sarbecovirus。该研究为开发广谱抗冠状病毒的mRNA免疫预防和治疗方案提供了重要依据。"},{"t":"在简单表面热力学的液体混合物中将气泡聚结速率调整多个数量级：实验和理论","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535299123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"The coalescence time of bubbles in a liquid depends on the nature of the liquid, which determines both its surface thermodynamics and the molecular interactions between the gas/liquid interfaces, and on the geometry, prescribed by the curvature of the bubbles. Coalescence is well described in pure liquids that have the same composition in bulk and at interfaces and in which the interactions are attractive. In contrast, the mechanisms are poorly understood in more complex liquids in which coalescence times are orders of magnitudes larger than in pure liquids and are unpredictable. To provide insight on these mechanisms, we use model systems: binary mixtures of miscible oils. In these liquids, interfaces have purely attractive molecular interactions and the surface thermodynamics can simply be described using a well-determined Gibbs elastic modulus, which is controlled by the composition of the mixture. We measure the coalescence rate by forming periodic trains of bubbles in millifluidic tubes whose radius varies over 1.5 decade. We report coalescence times spanning more than three decades and, for a given composition, varying according to a power law with curvature, with an exponent larger than that reported in pure liquids and independent of Gibbs elasticity. The experimental behavior is in excellent agreement with a numerical solution of the coupled thermodynamical and hydrodynamical equations, performed in the simple geometry of a suspended liquid film. Our results clearly reveal how geometry and surface thermodynamics modify the coalescence process of bubbles in the limit of small Gibbs elasticity.","tp":"表面热力学","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.0},"as":"液体中气泡聚结机制研究。纯液体（体相与界面组成一致、分子间作用为吸引）中的聚结已被充分描述，但复杂液体混合物中聚结机制尚不清晰。该研究通过实验和理论，在具有简单表面热力学的液体混合物中，将气泡聚结速率跨越数个数量级进行调控，揭示了液体表面热力学性质、气液界面分子间相互作用及气泡曲率几何如何共同决定聚结时间，对理解多相流体稳定性具有重要意义。"},{"t":"斯格明子晶格中的拓扑转变和位错弹性的出现：超越基特尔的磁极类比","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/4rww-4tsc","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Author(s): Kohta Kasai, Akihiro Uematsu, Yu Wang, Tao Xu, Chang Liu, Susumu Minami, and Takahiro ShimadaSkyrmion dislocations exhibit intrinsic core structures possessing large skyrmion deformation and topological phase transitions.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236703] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026","tp":"磁拓扑转变","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":1.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"斯格明子（skyrmion）晶格中的拓扑相变与位错弹性研究。研究发现斯格明子位错具有本征核心结构，伴随大幅斯格明子形变和拓扑相变，该发现超越了基特尔（Kittel）提出的经典磁极类比。由Kasai等人发表于Physical Review Letters，为理解磁性斯格明子晶格中缺陷的弹性行为和拓扑特性提供了新视角。"},{"t":"空肠弯曲杆菌鞭毛 V 形环可识别粘度水平，从而改变游泳速度、代谢基因表达和健康状况","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2603105123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"未分类","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"Campylobacter jejuni\n                    \n                    is an intestinal commensal of birds and animals and a leading cause of bacterial diarrheal disease in humans. In hosts,\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    primarily resides in the mucus layer atop the lower intestinal epithelium. Persistence in this niche requires a single flagellar motor at both\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    poles that generates high torque for flagellar rotation to facilitate motility and high swimming velocities. Unlike many bacterial flagellates,\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    swimming velocity increases as external viscosity increases. We identified a complex formed by FlgV, VidA, and VidC (Cjj81176_1732) positioned near the MS-ring-rotor junction in the flagellar motor we annotated as the V-ring. Viscosity-influenced growth, modulation of swimming velocity, and transcription of iron/heme acquisition, respiratory, and energy-generating systems were dependent on the V-ring.\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    Δ\n                    flgV\n                    and Δ\n                    vidC\n                    populations lacking a complete V-ring were motile, but could not optimally modulate swimming velocity. Like nonmotile flagellar stator or filament mutants, motile V-ring mutants had in vivo and in vitro growth and viability defects and dysregulated transcription of genes likely impacting physiology. Because the V-ring mutants behaved similarly as nonmotile mutants that experience little to no viscous drag on the filament, we propose\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    V-ring mutants cannot detect viscous drag on their rotating filaments. We propose the V-ring evolved in\n                    \n                      C. jejuni\n                    \n                    and potentially other bacteria producing high torque flagellar motors to monitor external viscosity information via viscous drag on the rotating flagellar filament to adjust swimming velocity, transcription, and physiology for optimal fitness in different host lower intestinal niches.","tp":"鞭毛粘度感","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"空肠弯曲杆菌是导致人类细菌性腹泻的主要病原体。该研究指出，其鞭马达底部的V形环结构具备感知环境黏度的能力。当感知到肠道黏液层的特定黏度时，细菌会自动调整游动速度，并改变自身的代谢基因表达。这种基于黏度感应的机制对于细菌在宿主肠道内定植、维持适应性以及保持整体生理健康具有至关重要的作用。"},{"t":"共价有机框架中噻吩给体的电子与空间协同工程实现高效CO₂光转化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5240027?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化CO2还原","kp":["[催化剂载体]: 噻吩富集COF耦合苯并噻二唑"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者通过电子效应与位阻效应协同工程化设计共价有机框架（COF）中的噻吩供体单元，实现高效CO₂光转化。COF材料具有宽光谱吸收和永久孔隙率等优势，是理想的光催化CO₂还原平台。通过精确调控噻吩供体的电子结构和空间构型，优化了光生载流子分离与CO₂吸附活化效率，为太阳能驱动的碳资源转化提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Synergistic Electronic and Steric Engineering of Thiophene Donors in Covalent Organic Frameworks for Efficient CO2 Photoconversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Covalent organic frameworks (COFs), featuring broad light absorption and permanent porosity, serve as excellent supports for metal catalytic sites in photocatalytic CO\n                    2\n                    reduction, offering great promise for efficient and stable CO\n                    2\n                    photoconversion. Herein, two rationally designed thiophene‐rich monomers enable the effective coupling of thiophene and benzothiadiazole units within the same COF materials, yielding D–A type COFs with\n                    bex\n                    topological structures (TTB‐COF and TTP‐COF). By modulating the central unit, the intramolecular built‐in electric field is enhanced, and the rotational freedom of thiophene units is also constrained, leading to a wavy structure in the monolayer COF, which significantly improves the material's photocatalytic performance. Using 2,2′‐bipyridine as an additive, TTB‐COF‐Co achieves a high CO production rate of 28.0 mmol g\n                    −1\n                     h\n                    −1\n                    with a selectivity of 88.4% in the presence of the photosensitizer [Ru(bpy)\n                    3\n                    ]Cl\n                    2\n                    ·6H\n                    2\n                    O and the sacrificial agent triethanolamine (TEOA), being one of the best performances among COF‐based catalysts. Analysis of the cumulative free energy change diagrams reveals that TTB‐COF‐Co lowers the energy barrier of the rate‐determining step in CO\n                    2\n                    photoreduction, thereby demonstrating superior photocatalytic performance. This work provides a referable design strategy for constructing high‐performance COF‐based photocatalysts for CO\n                    2\n                    reduction."},{"t":"电化学储能系统的结构化风险评估：整合一致性增强FAHP与复杂耦合关系网络","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008202?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"储能系统风险评估","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Structured risk assessment for electrochemical energy storage system: Integrating consistency enhanced-FAHP and complex coupling relationship network"},{"t":"柔性离子与电子摩擦纳米发电机：面向可贴附与可植入生物医学应用（Adv. Mater. 32/2026）","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73429?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"观点评论","tp":"柔性摩擦发电机","kp":["[器件]: 柔性离子/电子摩擦纳米发电机","[应用]: 可贴附/可植入生物医学"],"sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究综述了软态离子型与电子型摩擦纳米发电机（TENG）在可穿戴与植入式生物医学领域的最新进展。生物集成TENG可将人体机械能转化为电信号，用于自供电传感、组织电刺激等场景。通过柔性离子凝胶和可拉伸电子材料设计，软态TENG实现了与生物组织的良好界面适配，为无电池植入医疗器件开辟了新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Soft Ionic and Electronic Triboelectric Nanogenerators: Toward Attachable and Implantable Biomedical Applications (Adv. Mater. 32/2026)","b":"Soft Ionic and Electronic Triboelectric Nanogenerators The rapid expansion of bio-integrated triboelectric nanogenerators (TENG) has accelerated the development of sustainable power sources and self-powered biomedical sensors. This review systematically categorizes electronic and ionic TENG platforms into attachable and implantable configurations, analyzes their shared limitations, and proposes six strategic research directions, offering a comprehensive framework to guide next-generation clinically translatable biointerfaces. More details can be found in the Review by Sangyul Baik, Gwang-Bum Im, Younghoon Lee, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202517321).","aip":1},{"t":"通过连接体构象工程实现含六核锆结点的双链缠绕螺旋金属聚合物单晶","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7176356?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"螺旋金属聚合物","kp":["[材料]: 双股螺旋金属聚合物含六核锆结","[合成策略]: 连接体构象工程"],"sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者通过配体构象工程成功制备了含六核锆结点的双链缠绕螺旋金属聚合物的单晶。合成的一维螺旋聚合物是重要的功能材料，但获得高质量单晶长期是挑战。该研究利用有机配体的构象调控，实现了金属聚合物链的精确螺旋组装与结晶，为手性功能材料和分子机器的设计提供了结构基础。","dp":1,"ot":"Single Crystals of Double‐Stranded, Entwined, Helical Metallopolymers With Hexanuclear Zirconium Knots Achieved by Linker Conformation Engineering","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Synthetic one‐dimensional (1D) helical polymers are an intriguing class of functional materials that have been pursued for decades. Despite numerous reports of single‐stranded helical polymers, the synthesis of double‐stranded, entwined helical polymers with deterministic atomic coordinates remains a significant challenge. Herein, through judicious linker conformation engineering, we target two double‐stranded helical metallopolymer single crystals that consist of robust hexanuclear Zr\n                    6\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (OH)\n                    4\n                    clusters and inherently helical methano‐ or ethano‐Tröger base (TB) scaffolds. The racemic TB linkers undergo spontaneous resolution and narcissistic self‐sorting to from large single crystals of helical metallopolymer conglomerate, which can be rendered homochiral by employing enantiopure TB linkers. Characterization by single‐crystal X‐ray diffraction showed that, the two homochiral strands are bound together through Zr\n                    6\n                    ‐carboxylate knots, which further arrange with respect to\n                    6\n                    1\n                    screw axis to engender 1D hexagonal channels. The resulting chemically stable metallopolymer conglomerates were demonstrated to be capable of catalyzing the normally acidic hydrolysis of orthoformates in basic solution with exceptional reactivity and selectivity, while the homochiral version was shown to be a remarkable chiral fluorescent sensor for amino alcohols. Our work, therefore provides an unparalleled example where linker conformation engineering serves as powerful tool for architecting sophisticated helical polymeric structures and achieving enzyme‐mimic catalysis and recognition."},{"t":"耦合电力与交通网络的弹性价格驱动协调：学习增强混合整数重构方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192600810X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电网交通协同定价","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":5.0},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Resilient pricing-driven coordination of coupled power and transportation networks: A learning-augmented mixed-integer reformulation approach"},{"t":"回复 Wang 等人：将微生物代谢物和肠道上皮反应与微生物组定向治疗食品联系起来","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2613406123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"微生态治疗","as":"","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":1.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0}},{"t":"通过微生物组修复调节肠道上皮屏障和簇/杯状细胞反应：机遇和未来方向","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2535289123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","tp":"微生态修复","sc":2.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":1.0,"r":3.0,"d":2.0,"t":2.0},"as":""},{"t":"通过氨基硅氧烷功能接枝调控环保纤维素基复合电解质的锂离子传导用于可持续锂金属电池","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71171?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纤维素固态电解质","kp":["[电解质]: 纤维素基复合电解质","[改性]: 氨基硅氧烷功能化接枝","[应用]: 锂金属电池"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究者通过氨基-硅氧烷功能接枝调控环保型纤维素基复合电解质的锂离子传导性能，用于可持续锂金属电池。纤维素电解质具有低成本、可降解优势，但离子电导率受限。氨基-硅氧烷接枝在纤维素骨架上引入离子传输通道，提升了电解质的室温离子电导率和界面兼容性，为绿色固态锂电池的实用化提供了新方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Regulating Li‐Ions Conduction of Eco‐Friendly Cellulose‐Based Composite Electrolytes via Amino‐Siloxane Functional Grafting for Sustainable Li‐Metal Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cellulose‐based electrolytes are promising solid electrolyte candidates for low‐cost and eco‐friendly batteries owing to their natural characteristics of being renewable and biodegradable. Unfortunately, they have strong reactivity and high crystallinity, leading to critical challenges when used in Li‐ion batteries, including poor high‐voltage tolerance, slow Li‐ion conduction and heterogeneous Li‐ion flux. Here, we report a functional grafting modification to regulate Li‐ion conduction within cellulose‐based solid electrolytes. In‐situ sol‐gel self‐assembly accompanied by amino‐siloxane grafting is developed to achieve the homogeneous integration of cellulose−amino‐siloxane−ionic liquid composites, forming a compact solid‐state electrolyte membrane. Such functional design establishes continuous and uniform Li‐ion transport highways through amino coordination while disrupting native crystallinity of cellulose, endowing a rapid Li‐ion conductivity (1×10\n                    −3\n                    S cm\n                    −1\n                    ) and a high electrochemical oxidation potential (5 V). The obtained electrolyte membrane features a homogenous microstructure with high mechanical elasticity and thermodynamic stability, exhibiting high compatibility with Li metal and enabling excellent electrochemical performance. Consequently, solid‐state Li‐metal batteries exhibit exceptional cycle‐life, whereas LiFePO\n                    4\n                    cells run 592 cycles and LiNi\n                    0.8\n                    Co\n                    0.1\n                    Mn\n                    0.1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    cells run 403 cycles at 0.5 C rate until the capacity reduces to 80%. Notably, a comprehensive life‐cycle assessment verifies its advantages in energy conservation and carbon reduction. It presents a sustainable development of high‐performance cellulose‐based solid‐state electrolytes."},{"t":"量化需求侧管理在建筑能源灵活性中的作用：基于EPBD框架智能就绪指标评估的证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008512?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"建筑需求侧管理","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":2.0,"t":4.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Quantifying the role of Demand Side Management in building energy flexibility: evidence from Smart Readiness Indicator assessment under the EPBD framework"},{"t":"通过机械折纸编码互锁3D剪纸与纳米根锚定AgNWs-In-Ga多相合金导体实现可编程3D光伏","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523685?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"三维折纸结构光伏","kp":["[3D光伏]: 折纸编程互锁3D剪纸结构","[柔性导体]: 纳米根锚定AgNWs-In-Ga多相合金","[权衡]: 大拉伸率与面积功率输出之间基本矛盾"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"研究者开发了一种可编程3D光伏器件，结合折纸（Origami）编码的三维剪纸结构和纳米根锚定AgNWs-In-Ga多相合金导体实现。3D光伏可最大化空间利用率并捕获多角度入射光，折纸结构使器件具备可折叠和形变能力。多相合金导体保证了三维结构中的电学连通性，为便携式和自适应能源系统提供了创新设计思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Programmable 3D Photovoltaics via Mechanically Origami‐Coded Interlocked 3D Kirigami and Nano‐Root Anchored AgNWs–In–Ga Multiphasic Alloy Conductor","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  3D photovoltaics (3DPVs) are highly promising for next‐generation energy systems, as they maximize space utilization and power output. However, most reported 3DPVs remain unsuitable for deformable applications. When 3DPVs are integrated with mechanically deformable platforms, a fundamental trade‐off emerges: achieving large mechanical stretchability typically leads to a reduction in areal coverage. Here, we present a single‐material, mechanically origami‐coded 3D kirigami platform that enables programmable 3DPVs with unprecedented stretchability and areal coverage. Origami, which transforms 2D geometries into 3D forms, provides an effective structural strategy to overcome the long‐standing trade‐off between stretchability and areal coverage. Leveraging this concept, we introduce an origami‐inspired mechanical coding scheme that embeds programmable folding behavior into the structure. A simple extension–release cycle drives unit folding initiation and full origami activation, achieving ultrahigh stretchability (500%) and initial effective areal coverage (225%), while maintaining stable photovoltaic output under extreme deformation and repeated cycling. To ensure reliable electrical integration, an intrinsically integrable nano‐root anchored AgNWs–In–Ga multiphasic alloy conductor was co‐fabricated with the structure, providing stable conductivity and enabling reversible stack‐and‐connect operation. This approach highlights geometric programmability as a key enabler for freeform photovoltaics, establishing a pathway toward multifunctional 3D energy systems for adaptive devices, and urban energy harvesting."},{"t":"退役LFP电池放电预处理中铜沉积的预测与控制：可解释轻量鲁棒的电化学相变预测控制架构","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008275?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"退役电池回收","kp":["[方法]: 可解释轻量鲁棒电化学模型","[应用]: 退役LFP电池放电预处理"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":5.5,"r":4.5,"d":2.5,"t":5.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Prediction and control of copper plating in retired LFP battery discharge pretreatment via an explainable, lightweight, and robust electrochemical phase transition prediction and control architecture"},{"t":"正电化学电位增强3-硝基苯乙烯热催化加氢的化学选择性与活性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5569475?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电化学促进催化加氢","kp":["[电化学催化促进]: 正电势诱导多官能团底物完全化学选择性","[加氢选择性]: 3-硝基苯乙烯热催化加氢实现完全选择性"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.5,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"研究揭示了电化学催化促进效应在3-硝基苯乙烯热催化加氢反应中的应用。通过对催化剂施加正电化学电位，显著提升了催化活性和化学选择性，能够优先还原硝基而保留碳碳双键。该工作证明了电化学外部调控可精确控制热催化反应路径，为绿色化工中高选择性精细化学品合成提供了新策略。","dp":1,"ot":"Positive Electrochemical Potentials Induce Enhanced Chemoselectivity and Activity in the Thermocatalytic Hydrogenation of 3‐Nitrostyrene","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Electrochemical promotion of catalysis is emerging as a powerful approach to control chemical reactions externally without complex catalyst modification, but this has mostly been used for substrates with a single reactive group so far. Herein, we demonstrate that this approach can induce full chemoselectivity in catalytic transformations of substrates with multiple functional groups. Specifically, we show that application of a positive electrochemical potential during the thermocatalytic hydrogenation (TCH) of 3‐nitrostyrene exclusively delivered one single product, 1‐ethyl‐3‐nitrobenzene, with six‐fold enhanced yield, while a complex product mixture was obtained at open circuit voltage. These effects resulted from the combined effects of a positive electrode polarization and acidification of the bulk solution through a concurrent hydrogen oxidation reaction (HOR). Surface‐enhanced infrared absorption spectroscopy and kinetic experiments showed that the positive polarization optimized the surface concentrations of reactants and the adsorption properties of 3‐nitrostyrene and hydrogenation products. Validation with additional reactants and catalyst implies a possible broader relevance of our findings beyond the initial system of 3‐nitrostyrene hydrogenation. Overall, our work provides fundamental insight into the effects of electrode polarization on thermal hydrogenation reactions and opens new opportunities to use electrochemical promotion to control chemoselectivity and activity."},{"t":"神经网络实现超快激光微纳结构逆向设计制造的实时等离子体成像","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73601?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"激光微纳加工监测","kp":["[实时监控]: 神经网络实时等离子体成像绕过遮挡","[制造方法]: 飞秒激光逆向设计微纳结构"],"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"as":"提出一种基于神经网络的实时等离子体成像技术，用于超快激光加工微纳结构的反向设计制造。通过实时监测激光诱导等离子体的动态演化，实现对加工质量的在线反馈控制，神经网络模型可快速解析等离子体信号并预测加工结果，显著提升了微纳结构制造精度与一致性，为智能制造提供了闭环调控方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Neural Network Enabled Real‐Time Plasma Imaging for Inverse Designed Fabrication of Micro/Nano Structures with Ultrafast Laser","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Real‐time monitoring is essential for quality control in highprecision micro/nano structure fabrication with ultrafast laser. The laser‐induced plasma plume blocks the sample surface, preventing direct imaging of micro/nano structures during processing. This work proposes a neural networkenabled real‐time plasma imaging strategy and inverse design micro/nano fabrication method. The neural networks contain a conditional generative adversarial network (cGAN) for real‐time imaging and a multilayer perceptron (MLP) for inverse‐designed fabrication. Based on the fabrication of coffee‐ring feature structures, the cGAN generates high‐fidelity feature structure images from plasma intensity profiles, with a real‐time imaging latency of 1691 milliseconds. To validate the real‐time imaging strategy, dual‐pulse processing and sequential single‐pulse processing experiments are conducted across different materials. The MLP model establishes nonlinear relationships between laser parameters and feature structure size for inverse‐designed fabrication. Both forward prediction and inverse design results achieved a coefficient of determination (R\n                    2\n                    ) of 0.97, and the actual fabrication results align with the target values. This work provides a neural networkenabled strategy for real‐time process monitoring, advancing the development of intelligent laser fabrication."},{"t":"具有分子级界面接触的有机异质结多尺度活性位点调控用于高效光催化析氢","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aenm.71172?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Advanced Energy Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机异质结光催化产氢","kp":["[光催化析氢]: 有机异质结分子级界面接触","[合成方法]: 冰模板辅助光化学还原策略","[活性位点]: 多尺度活性位点工程"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"针对有机光催化剂驱动太阳能光解水产氢的商业化瓶颈，设计了具有分子级界面接触的有机异质结光催化剂。通过多尺度活性位点调控策略，优化了光生载流子的界面分离与传输效率，显著提高了光催化析氢速率。该工作为廉价、可规模化有机光催化体系的开发提供了界面工程新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Multiscale Active Site Modulation in Organic Heterojunction with Molecular‐Level Interfacial Contact for Efficient Photocatalytic Hydrogen Evolution","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The commercialization of green hydrogen production through organic photocatalyst‐promoted solar water splitting for hydrogen evolution is limited by inefficient charge separation and sluggish interfacial kinetics. Herein, this problem is addressed using an ice template–assisted photochemical reduction strategy that integrates molecular‐level interfacial contact between a trefoil‐shaped donor–acceptor molecule (DTAB) and ultrathin carbon nitride nanosheets (UCNS) with Cu single atoms (SAs) anchoring and Pt nanodots (NDs) deposition. The intimate interface in the resulting DTAB–UCNS/CuPt photocatalyst generates a built‐in electric field promoting the separation of photogenerated carriers. The DTAB harvests visible light and injects electrons into UCNS, with these electrons subsequently funneled to Pt NDs via Cu SAs. The electronic coupling between Cu SAs and Pt NDs affects the position of the Pt\n                    d\n                    ‐band, thus optimizing the H* adsorption/desorption equilibrium and enhancing surface reaction kinetics. The hydrogen evolution rate of DTAB–UCNS/CuPt (261.16 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) is 248.7 times higher than that of UCNS/Pt (1.05 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ) and ranks among the highest reported for carbon nitride–based photocatalysts under comparable conditions, highlighting the strong potential of our strategy to advance photocatalytic hydrogen evolution toward practical green hydrogen production."},{"t":"分子N型掺杂实现微腔集成OLED低阈值纳秒激光发射，迈向电泵浦有机激光器","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5388345?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机半导体激光掺杂","kp":["[OLED激光器]: 分子N型掺杂实现低阈值纳秒激光","[微腔集成]: 微腔集成OLED","[激光特性]: 低阈值纳秒级脉冲"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"有机半导体激光器长期受限于高激射阈值和电泵浦难题。本研究通过分子N型掺杂策略，在微腔集成的OLED器件中实现了低阈值纳秒级激光发射。N型掺杂有效降低了注入势垒并提高了载流子密度，为迈向电泵浦有机激光器迈出关键一步，对柔性、波长可调激光光源开发具有重要意义。","dp":1,"ot":"Molecular N‐Type Doping Unlocks Low‐Threshold Nanosecond Lasing in a Microcavity‐Integrated OLED Toward Electrically Pumped Organic Lasers","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Organic semiconductors are attractive for the development of flexible, wavelength‐tunable lasers. However, most reported organic micro/nanolasers rely on femtosecond‐pulsed optical pumping, which is impractical for real‐world applications. This limitation has urged the pursuit of electrically pumped organic lasers; yet their realization remains a long‐standing challenge primarily due to a fundamental materials dilemma, in which high‐gain organic semiconductors often suffer from poor, unbalanced charge transport. Here, we demonstrate that this intrinsic trade‐off can be effectively alleviated through a molecular doping strategy. Employing a high‐gain spirofluorene derivative as the emissive layer, we introduce an n‐type doped layer to construct an organic light‐emitting diode (OLED), achieving more balanced charge transport while preserving outstanding optical gain. Consequently, singlet‐polaron annihilation is significantly suppressed, as evidenced by reduced efficiency roll‐off and electrically pumped transient absorption measurements. When integrated with a distributed feedback (DFB) resonator, the resulting device exhibits ultra‐narrow (∼2 nm) electroluminescence under pulsed current injections and delivers low‐threshold nanosecond lasing under an optical–electrical co‐pumping configuration, thereby demonstrating a practical architecture for implementing organic laser diodes. Our work provides a general strategy to overcome the intrinsic paradox where high‐gain organic semiconductors struggle to maintain balanced charge transport, illuminating a pathway toward light amplification under electrical excitation."},{"t":"调控NiV层状双氢氧化物微球中Ni-O-V桥键以实现1,5-戊二醇氧化与硝酸盐还原的稳健电催化耦合","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5292155?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电催化偶联","kp":["[催化剂]: NiV层状双氢氧化物微球","[活性位点]: Ni-O-V桥结构工程化","[耦合反应]: 1,5-戊二醇氧化与硝酸盐还原双通道"],"sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"构建了耦合阳极生物质衍生多元醇氧化与阴极硝酸盐还原的共电解系统。通过调控NiV层状双氢氧化物微球中的Ni-O-V桥键结构，优化了双功能电催化活性位点，实现了1,5-戊二醇选择性氧化与硝酸盐高效还原的协同匹配。该策略为生物质高值化利用与含氮废水处理提供了电催化耦合新路径。","dp":1,"ot":"Modulating Ni‐O‐V Bridges in NiV‐Layered Double Hydroxides Microspheres for Robust Electrocatalytic Coupling of 1,5‐Pentanediol Oxidation and Nitrate Reduction","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The co‐electrolysis system that couples anodic oxidation of biomass‐derived polyols with cathodic nitrate reduction reaction (NO\n                    3\n                    RR) represents a promising strategy for biomass valorization and treatment of high‐salinity wastewater. Here, we synthesize thin NiV‐layered double hydroxides (NiV‐LDHs) microspheres featuring engineered Ni‐O‐V bridge structures as dual‐channel electrocatalysts. The newly constructed Ni‐O‐V bridges confirmed by x‐ray absorption spectroscopy effectively modulate the electronic structures of both Ni and V sites. This synergistic enhancement boosts the performance of both anodic 1,5‐pentanediol electrooxidation to produce glutaric acid (GA) and NO\n                    3\n                    RR to ammonia. The NiV‐LDHs anode enables electrolysis at a low cell voltage of 1.5 V versus RHE, exhibiting a GA Faradaic efficiency of 98.5% and a high GA yield of 2.56 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    . Operando studies and density functional theory reveal that the strong electronic coupling within NiV‐LDHs optimizes the competitive adsorption between 1,5‐pentanediol and OH* on the catalyst surface. Moreover, the NiV‐LDHs cathode exhibits outstanding NO\n                    3\n                    RR performance, achieving a high ammonia yield of 2.28 mmol h\n                    −1\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    with a Faradaic efficiency of 96.1%, surpassing most reported electrocatalysts. A continuous paired electrolysis operation over 240 h successfully produced GA (55.98 g) and NH\n                    4\n                    Cl (23.48 g) powders, demonstrating great potential for industrial application."},{"t":"低临界溶解温度（LCST）介导的高容量低再生能耗二氧化碳直接空气捕集","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE01563H","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/CCUS","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"直接空气碳捕集","kp":["CO₂吸附量[直接空气捕集]: 2.82 mmol/g","吸附剂[DAC]: PEI浸渍PNIPAM接枝纤维素网络","[再生]: LCST驱动低再生温度"],"sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":5.5,"d":6.5,"t":6.5},"aip":1,"as":"针对直接空气捕集CO2中吸附剂热再生能耗高的核心瓶颈，提出利用低临界溶解温度（LCST）特性实现CO2的高容量捕集与低能耗再生。LCST型吸附剂在温度变化驱动下发生相变，大幅降低了解吸能耗，提升了循环稳定性，为低成本规模化DAC技术提供了新型热响应材料设计思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Lower Critical Solution Temperature (LCST) Mediated Direct Air Capture of Carbon Dioxide with High Capacity and Low Regeneration Energy","b":"Direct air capture of carbon dioxide has been limited by the energy-intensive thermal regeneration of adsorbents imposed by the low CO2 uptake capacity, high regeneration temperature and parasitic water evaporation. Herein, we demonstrated a class of thermo-responsive CO2 adsorbents—PEI impregnated PNIPAM-grafted cellulose network (TRCNF/PEI)—achieving high CO2 uptake of 2.82 mmol g-1 from air at 25 °C and 4.33 mmol g-1 at 5 °C, and low regeneration temperature below 65 °C. The thermo-responsive adsorbent features lower critical solution temperature (LCST) phase transition that enables a swell-adsorption/collapse-desorption mechanism. At room temperature, TRCNF/PEI is at a hydrophilic swollen state, effectively exposing the PEI amine sites for efficient CO2 capture. Above LCST, it transitions to a hydrophobic collapsed state. Water is expelled in liquid phase, destabilizing bicarbonate intermediates and thereby driving rapid CO2 desorption. This obviated the latent heat penalty of water, leading to unprecedentedly low regeneration thermal energy demand of 4.36 GJ ton-1CO2 that can be satisfied solely by low-grade waste heat. Unlike zeolites activated carbons and MOFs vulnerable to high humidity where liquid water inhibits CO2 uptake due to competitive adsorption, TRCNF/PEI leverages water to enhance adsorption and exhibits exceptional cyclic stability. Notably, the CO2 uptake of TRCNF/PEI further increases at lower temperatures (4.33 mmol g-1 at 5 °C), demonstrating its carbon capture potential in cold area. The unique LCST phase transition presents a transformative strategy to couple DAC with vast low-grade industrial waste heat, significantly advancing the energy efficiency and durability of carbon removal technologies."},{"t":"介电工程化共价有机框架中纳米限域差异界面摩擦驱动的离子选择性传输及其分区化学环境","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73670?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架电解质","kp":["[固态电解质]: 分区化学环境共价有机框架(SCE-COF)","[离子选择性]: 纳米限域差异界面摩擦调控","[介电工程]: 介电工程化COF"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了介电工程化的共价有机框架（COF）固态电解质，利用纳米限域差分界面摩擦实现离子选择性传输。COF内分段化化学环境创造了不对称离子传输通道，同时实现了高离子导电率和优异的离子选择性。该设计为安全固态电池中兼具高导电与高选择性的电解质材料提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Ion‐Selective Transport via Nanoconfined Differential Interfacial Friction in a Dielectric‐Engineered Covalent Organic Framework With Sectionalized Chemical Environments","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing solid‐state electrolytes (SSEs) that concurrently deliver high ionic conductivity, excellent ion selectivity, and robust electrochemical/thermal stability remains a central challenge for safe, high‐energy‐density solid‐state batteries (SSBs). Here, an all‐solid‐state covalent organic framework electrolyte with sectionalized chemical environments (SCE‐COF) is reported, constructed via nanoconfined copolymerization of a highly dielectric monomer within COF nanochannels. The resulting architecture affords a nano‐confined molecular interface that integrates electron‐rich polar short chains that form abundant Li\n                    +\n                    hopping sites with electron‐deficient pore‐wall regions that immobilize anions through specific hydrogen‐bonding interactions, thereby enabling efficient and differential ion transport decoupled from strongly bonded solvation cage and polymer segmental motion. Benefiting from these synergistic effects, SCE‐COF achieves ionic conductivity of 1.05 × 10\n                    −3\n                     S cm\n                    −1\n                    at 30°C, a high Li\n                    +\n                    transference number of 0.73 and a wide electrochemical window (4.87 V vs Li\n                    +\n                    /Li). Finally, all‐solid‐state full cells employing SCE‐COF deliver a high specific energy density of 442.0 Wh kg\n                    −1\n                    under a controlled lithium source at ambient temperature.","aip":1},{"t":"界面诱导内建磁场增强自旋交换相互作用实现高效氧电催化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.cell.com/chem/fulltext/S2451-9294(26)00163-4?rss=yes","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Chem","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氧电催化","kp":["[氧电催化]: 反铁磁/铁磁异质结构界面内建磁场","[自旋调控]: 无外场量子自旋交换控制自旋依赖反应","[机制]: 界面内建磁场对齐电子自旋"],"sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"通过构建反铁磁/铁磁异质结构，界面处产生内建磁场并增强自旋交换相互作用，使催化剂表面电子自旋态有序排列，从而促进氧析出/氧还原反应中间体的吸附与转化。该界面磁场工程策略显著提升了双功能氧电催化效率，为磁控电催化和锌空电池等能源器件提供了自旋调控新机制。","dp":1,"ot":"Interface-induced built-in magnetic field boosted spin exchange interactions to enable high-efficiency oxygen electrocatalysis","b":"Engineered antiferromagnetic/ferromagnetic heterostructures generate an interfacial built-in magnetic field that aligns electron spins, an effect that enables external field-free control of spin-dependent oxygen electrocatalysis via rapid quantum spin exchange interactions. This strategy enhances oxygen evolution activity and reveals the critical role of spin polarization in governing reaction process; thus, it offers a general design principle for efficient energy conversion materials."},{"t":"确定抗生素耐药性的驱动因素：One Health 干预措施的数学模型重点关注传播和环境途径","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.cell.com/one-earth/fulltext/S2590-3322(26)00119-3?rss=yes","c":"不相关","a":"One Earth","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"自组装单分子层锚定NiOx的羟基界面工程实现高效稳定钙钛矿太阳能电池","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73656?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿界面工程","kp":["空穴传输层[倒置钙钛矿电池]: NiOx混合V₂C-OH MXene","[界面工程]: 羟基化MXene提供SAM锚定位点"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"针对倒置钙钛矿太阳能电池界面损耗制约效率的问题，采用羟基界面工程策略，在NiOx表面构建自组装单分子层锚定结构。通过优化界面化学键合与能级对齐，有效抑制了界面非辐射复合电荷损失，同时提升了器件的光电转换效率和长期运行稳定性，为高效稳定钙钛矿电池界面设计提供了实用方案。","dp":1,"ot":"Hydroxyl Interfacial Engineering for Self‐Assemble Monolayers Anchoring on NiOx Enables Efficient and Stable Perovskite Solar Cells","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The performance of inverted perovskite solar cells (PSCs) is critically constrained by interfacial losses arising from the insufficient coverage and weak adhesion of self‐assembled monolayers (SAM). Herein, we report a SAM regulation strategy by mixing hydroxylated V\n                    2\n                    CT\n                    x\n                    MXene (V\n                    2\n                    C‐OH) with nickel oxide (NiO\n                    x\n                    ), which can provide abundant hydroxyl sites for SAM anchoring, thereby forming a uniform and dense SAM layer. First‐principles calculations further reveal that the binding energy between SAM and hydroxyl groups on V\n                    2\n                    C‐OH is stronger than that on pristine NiO\n                    x\n                    , explaining the enhanced thermal stability of SAM on the hybrid substrate. Meanwhile, the highly ordered and tightly packed SAM layer promotes vertical growth and [001]‐preferred orientation of perovskite grains. Therefore, the introduction of V\n                    2\n                    C‐OH enables a top‐down modulation of the NiO\n                    x\n                    , SAM, and perovskite layers, improving their morphology and interfacial properties. The resulting PSCs achieve a champion power conversion efficiency of 26.6% (certified at 26.2%) for a 0.0524 cm\n                    2\n                    device and 24.7% for a 1 cm\n                    2\n                    device, along with outstanding long‐term operational stability."},{"t":"类风湿关节炎的高效靶向线粒体转移和 AUTAC4 增强双重更新策略（Adv. Mater. 32/2026）","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73488?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Dual Renewal Strategy for Rheumatoid Arthritis Inspired by Chinese philosophy, this cover illustrates a dual-action mitochondrial renewal therapy (DAMRT) for rheumatoid arthritis. Like a lotus leaf, a folate-modified macrophage membrane precisely encapsulates healthy mitochondria and AUTAC4. This biomimetic system targets inflamed joints, delivering fresh mitochondria while degrading dysfunctional ones to effectively restore cellular metabolic homeostasis. More details can be found in the Research Article by Ke Xu, Yan Hu, Long Bai, Jiacan Su, and co-workers (DOI: 10.1002/adma.202514070)."},{"t":"通过质子辅助吸附演化将氟掺杂RuO2锚定于TiO2以实现酸性条件下高效稳定析氧反应","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9750153?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"析氧电催化剂","kp":["催化剂[酸性OER]: F掺杂RuO₂/TiO₂","[合成方法]: 质子辅助吸附演化法"],"sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.5,"t":5.5},"as":"针对RuO2在酸性析氧反应（OER）中溶解失稳的难题，通过质子辅助吸附演化策略将氟掺杂RuO2锚定在TiO2载体上。F掺杂优化了Ru位点的电子结构并增强金属-载体相互作用，显著提升了酸性OER催化活性和长期耐久性，为质子交换膜电解水等酸性介质中的低成本高效OER电催化剂提供了设计思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Fluorine‐Doped RuO2 Anchored on TiO2 via Proton‐Assisted Adsorption Evolution for Efficient and Stable Oxygen Evolution Reaction in Acid","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Although RuO\n                    2\n                    theoretically has superior oxygen evolution reaction (OER) activity and a relatively lower price than IrO\n                    2\n                    , balancing its activity and stability remains a significant challenge. The electronic structure of Ru centers plays a critical role in balancing the activity and durability of RuO\n                    2\n                    ‐based electrocatalysts for OER. This study developed an F‐doped RuO\n                    2\n                    loaded on TiO\n                    2\n                    (F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    ) to construct a Ru–O–Ti interface platform for electronegativity‐mediated charge redistribution. F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    exhibited excellent OER activity and superior durability, operating stably for 660 h and 253 h at 100 and 200 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively. A proton exchange membrane water electrolyzer assembled using F‐RuO\n                    2\n                    @TiO\n                    2\n                    required only 1.57 and 1.68 V at 0.5 and 1 A cm\n                    −2\n                    , respectively, and operated stably for 300 and 100 h, respectively. Both experimental and theoretical calculations showed that the high electronegativity of F enhances the Ru–O covalency, thereby accelerating the deprotonation of *OOH through the proton‐assisted adsorption evolution mechanism (PA‐AEM). Simultaneously, the dynamic charge redistribution established between Ru–O–Ti allowed TiO\n                    2\n                    to buffer charge fluctuations at Ru sites, thus further effectively mitigating over‐oxidation. These findings underscore the importance of electronegativity‐regulated proton‐transfer kinetics for stabilizing RuO\n                    2\n                    ."},{"t":"从归因和后果视角评估家禽粪便热化学转化路径的能源与环境可持续性","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008056?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"生物质热转化评估","kp":["[热化学转化]: 禽畜废弃物热化学转化路径评估"],"sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":4.5,"r":3.5,"d":2.0,"t":4.5},"as":"","dp":1,"ot":"Energy and environmental sustainability assessment of thermochemical conversion pathways for poultry litter from the attributional and consequential perspectives"},{"t":"中国国家排放交易计划执行的经验和经济见解：来自第一个履约期的证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003599?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"异质结构柔性薄膜中电化学介导界面电荷极化用于动态电磁调控","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523231?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电磁波调控薄膜","kp":["调控机制[电磁波]: 电化学介导界面电荷极化","材料[电磁调控]: 异质结构柔性薄膜"],"sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了一种异质结构柔性薄膜，通过电化学调控界面电荷极化状态实现电磁波的动态响应与可调调节。该策略利用电化学驱动离子插层/脱嵌改变界面电荷分布，从而连续调控薄膜的电磁波吸收/屏蔽性能，在雷达隐身、可穿戴电磁防护和智能通信领域具有广阔应用前景。","dp":1,"ot":"Electrochemically Mediated Interfacial Charge Polarization in Heterostructured Flexible Films for Dynamic Electromagnetism Regulation","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Tunable electromagnetic waves (EMWs) response and dynamic regulation play a critical role in fields such as radar and satellite communication, ranging from radiation protection to signal compatibility. However, the modulation capability and thin‐film development of current electromagnetic materials are limited in the integration development in an effective dynamic electromagnetic environment, owing to their conductivity‐dominated single response mechanism. Unlike the previously reported conductivity‐dominant mechanism, this work proposes a design strategy based on H\n                    +\n                    ‐induced electron‐interface cooperative regulation by constructing an ultrathin acetylene black/H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    (AB/H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    ) heterostructure film device for real‐time electromagnetic wave modulation. Specifically, the controllable transformation of H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    from the initial monoclinic phase to the tetragonal phase and eventually to the cubic phase driven by H\n                    +\n                    insertion triggers the valence state evolution from W\n                    6+\n                    to W\n                    4+\n                    and the reduction of the work function, which significantly enhances the\n                    n\n                    ‐type doping effect and promoting the increase in free electron density, thereby achieving tunable EMWs reflective shielding efficiency (SE\n                    R\n                    : 3.7 to 6.0 dB). Meanwhile, the introduction of AB leads to the reconstruction of the energy band structure during the protonation of WO\n                    3\n                    , inducing strong polarization domains and a mass of dipoles at the AB/H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    heterointerface, which significantly enhances the polarization loss capacity and thereby promotes significant modulation in EMWs absorption shielding efficiency (SE\n                    A\n                    : 9.9 to 18.0 dB). Based on the above electron density and interface polarization synergistic enhancement mechanism, the AB/H\n                    \n                      x\n                    \n                    WO\n                    3\n                    electrode with a thickness of only 80.16 µm achieves significant modulation of the total shielding efficiency from 13.6 to 24.0 dB in X‐band and obtains an exceptionally large thickness‐normalized specific shielding efficiency (ΔSSE\n                    T\n                    ) of 130 dB mm\n                    −1\n                    , significantly outperforming previous reports. These findings underscore the great potential of this lightweight, ultrathin device for integrated electronics and adaptive electromagnetic environment applications."},{"t":"PbTiO3中通过隐藏极性-声学耦合实现应变梯度与90°畴壁的电学切换","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/yhk9-qf8c","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电应变梯度调控","kp":["材料[应变梯度电学开关]: PbTiO₃","[耦合机制]: 隐匿极性-声学耦合"],"sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.5,"d":5.5,"t":6.5},"as":"在PbTiO3钙钛矿铁电体中发现了隐藏的极性-声学耦合机制，实现了对应变梯度和90°畴壁的电学切换。研究通过外加电场驱动极化-声学耦合效应，在无机械应力条件下实现了铁电畴结构的大幅可逆调控，为铁电材料中力电耦合机理的理解和新型非易失性存储器件设计提供了新物理基础。","dp":1,"ot":"Electrical Switching of Strain Gradients and 90° Domain Walls via Hidden Polar-Acoustic Coupling in ${\\mathrm{PbTiO}}_{3}$","b":"Author(s): Yajun Zhang, Konstantin Shapovalov, Xu He, Chang Liu, Huadong Yong, Xingyi Zhang, Jie Wang, Kun Zhou, and Philippe GhosezAlthough strain gradients hold great promise for tailoring emergent functionalities, their flexible global control remains a fundamental challenge. Here, we address this concern in ${\\mathrm{PbTiO}}_{3}$ under biaxial tensile strain by uncovering the spontaneous appearance of strain gradients and 90…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 136, 236101] Published Tue Jun 09, 2026"},{"t":"在 $^{88}\\mathrm{Sr}$ 上进行弹性 $α$ 散射实验，以约束 $α$ 诱导的反应截面，以进行弱 $r$ 过程研究","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/7q3r-h51x","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Author(s): Z. Kóródi, G. G. Kiss, P. Mohr, T. N. Szegedi, C. Marshall, R. Nunes, L. Csedreki, Gy. Gyürky, Z. Halász, T. Szücs, S. R. Kovács, Zs. Mátyus, Á. Tóth, G. L. Guardo, M. La Cognata, A. Tumino, A. Di Pietro, A. Nurmukhanbetova, L. Balliet, and C. FougèresBackground: Low-mass neutron-rich isotopes between Fe and Ag are predicted to be synthesized in neutrino-driven winds emitted after the collapse of a massive star. The modeling of this nucleosynthesis scenario, called weak $r$-process or $α$-process, requires large nuclear reaction network calculati…[Phys. Rev. C 113, L062801] Published Mon Jun 08, 2026"},{"t":"独家报道：比亚迪、蔚来、伊芙和其他中国公司因涉嫌军事联系而被列入美国“黑名单” – 国际电池公司","d":"2026-06-10","i":"news","u":"https://www.batteriesinternational.com/news/byd-nio-eve-and-other-chinese-firms-added-to-us-blacklist-over-alleged-military-links/","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Batteries International","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","b":"Energy Storage\nEXCLUSIVE: BYD, Nio, Eve and other Chinese firms set for US ‘blacklist’ over alleged military links\n–  June 9, 2026 01:24 pm BST\nGlobal energy storage and EV battery majors including BYD are being added to a US ‘blacklist’ that alleges the firms and other tech partners have links to China’s military,\nBatteries International\nBYD, Nio and Eve Energy are among those named by the Pentagon in a list seen by\nBatteries International\nand which is due for publication in the US government’s official journal, the\nFederal Register\n, tomorrow (June 10).\nHowever, several of the companies named, including Chinese tech firm Baidu and the Alibaba Group, have already rejected claims about their operations as baseless and factually inaccurate.\nThe updated Section 1260H list ― the official list of companies the Department of Defense has designated as Chinese military companies operating in the US ― aims to highlight industry players at the heart of US-China technological competition.\nInclusion on the list does not automatically attract sanctions, but industry observers say it can lead to restrictions on future US government procurement and cause difficulties in terms of compliance in conducting business with US partners.\nFirms on the list also face increased scrutiny, potential restrictions on defence contracts and reputational damage ― although companies can petition to be removed from the list.\nSeveral of the companies included on the list have already issued statements refuting the US allegations, according to the Beijing-based daily\nGlobal Times.\nThe US claims BYD is directly and indirectly affiliated with the State-Owned Assets Supervision and Administration Commission of China’s State Council (SASAC) and is indirectly affiliated with the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT). BYD is alleged to be a military-civil fusion contributor to the Chinese defence industrial base because it is affiliated with MIIT and because it resides in or is affiliated with a military-civil fusion enterprise zone.\nAccording to the US, EVE Energy is a military-civil fusion contributor to the Chinese defence industrial base because it knowingly received assistance from the government of China through science, technology, research, or industrial efforts initiated, granted, or created by, or provided under, or related to, the Chinese military industrial planning apparatus, or in furtherance of Chinese military industrial planning objectives.\nBaidu and Alibaba are military-civil fusion contributors to the Chinese defence industrial base because of their affiliations with MIIT, according to the US.\nBaidu said on June 9: “As the company is neither a Chinese military company nor a military-civil fusion contributor to the Chinese defence industrial base, (we) believe there is no justification for the company’s inclusion on such a list.”\nBaidu said US government procurement limitations tied to the list would not impact the business of the company.\nIn September 2024, EVE Energy held a ceremony in California to mark the opening of its US regional headquarters.\nIn November 2025, BYD quoted the California Independent System Operator as confirming a newly installed 100MW/400MWh ESS it provided had been ranked No.1 in the state in terms of reliability and availability among all stand-alone energy storage projects.\nImage credit: Shutterstock","tp":"电池黑名单","sc":7.7,"scd":{"b":0,"i":8,"r":9,"d":3,"t":10},"aip":1,"as":"比亚迪、蔚来、亿纬锂能等中国电池及新能源汽车企业因涉嫌与中国军方有关联，被美国五角大楼列入即将公布的\"黑名单\"。该名单涵盖全球储能和电动车电池行业主要企业及其技术合作伙伴，标志着美国对中国新能源产业链的限制进一步升级，可能对相关企业的国际供应链和融资产生重大影响。"},{"t":"自噬体-线粒体接触的失调导致 tau 蛋白病中的自噬功能障碍和神经退行性变","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2520331123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Mitochondria (Mito) engage in extensive communication with other organelles through membrane contacts. Perturbed mitochondria–organelle interactions are indicated in a variety of neurodegenerative diseases, but the underlying mechanisms remain poorly understood. Here, we report a class of mitochondria–organelle communication: autophagosome/autophagic vacuole (AV)–Mito contact, which exhibits hypertethering in tauopathy neurons, consequently hampering AV retrograde transport. Such defects are attributed to accelerated turnover of the contact release factor TBC1D15, triggered by mitochondrial bioenergetic deficit-induced hyperactivity of the adenosine monophosphate-activated protein kinase (AMPK). Increasing TBC1D15 levels or repressing AMPK activity normalizes AV-Mito contact release and restores retrograde transport of AVs, thereby increasing autophagic cargo clearance and reducing tau burden in tauopathy axons. Furthermore, overexpression of TBC1D15 enhances autophagic clearance and attenuates tau pathology, alleviating neurodegeneration and cognitive dysfunction in tauopathy mice. Taken together, our study provides mechanistic insights into AV-Mito contact dysregulation in tauopathy-related autophagy failure, laying the groundwork for the development of potential therapeutics to combat tauopathy diseases."},{"t":"阶段演化钯催化中的动态演化：解锁木质素衍生醛的高效选择性加氢","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag338/8704110?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","tg":"研究论文","tp":"木质素加氢催化","kp":["催化演化[Pd]: Pd²⁺→石墨烯限域纳米颗粒(~3nm)","反应[木质素醛]: 选择性加氢"],"sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.5,"r":4.5,"d":6.0,"t":5.5},"as":"揭示了Pd催化剂在木质素衍生醛类选择性加氢中的动态演化机制。研究发现Pd催化活性物种在反应过程中经历阶段性结构演变，活性位点的动态重构使催化剂在温和条件下实现高原子效率的醛基选择性加氢，同时抑制过度加氢副反应。该发现为木质素高值化利用中廉价高效催化剂的设计提供了动态催化新认知。","dp":1,"ot":"Dynamic evolution in stage-evolving Pd catalysis: unlocking efficient and selective hydrogenation of lignin-derived aldehydes","b":"Selective hydrogenation of lignin-derived aldehydes, particularly achieving high catalyst atomic efficiency under ambient conditions, remains challenging. Here, we developed a stage-evolving Pd catalysis that bridges the functions of distinct Pd states to address this limitation. Operando monitoring reveals a sequential transformation from homogeneous Pd2+ to graphene-confined Pd nanoparticles (~3.26 nm), with each stage making a specific contribution. In the vanillin hydrogenation at 30 °C, this system achieves 99.4% conversion within 30 min with 95.0% yield toward 2-methoxy-4-methylphenol and a remarkable turnover frequency of 673.9 h−1, outperforming conventional static sites Pd catalysts reduced by H2 or NaBH4 (≤42.5% conversion, 12.1% yield). Comprehensive in-situ spectroscopic characterizations, combined with kinetic and theoretical investigations, have elucidated the interfacial reaction pathways governing vanillin hydrogenation at distinct Pd active sites and established the correlation between multi-stage catalysis and product selectivity. Mechanistically, the initial Pd2+ phase facilitates C = O adsorption and subsequent hydrogenation to C-OH (47.47 kJ/mol), whereas the in-situ generated Pd/Graphene promotes H2 homolytic dissociation into H* (rather than hydrogen transfer from the isopropanol solvent) and drives the rate-determining hydrodeoxygenation of C-OH (52.44 kJ/mol). This work paves the way for the rational design of dynamic catalytic systems to achieve atomically efficient hydrogenation of lignin-derived aldehydes."},{"t":"适配体工程化限域反应微环境双单原子催化剂用于时空可控选择性转化","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73645?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"双单原子催化剂","kp":["催化剂[时空选择性转化]: Apt-Au₁-Fe₁/NC双单原子","[设计策略]: 适配体仿酶区室化控制中间体"],"sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"研究提出双单原子催化剂结合适配体工程化限域反应微环境，实现对短寿命活性中间体的时空可控选择性转化。该策略通过精确调控催化活性位点的空间分布与反应微环境，有效抑制副反应，为多相催化中高活性中间体的可控利用提供了新范式。","dp":1,"ot":"Dual‐Single‐Atom Catalyst with Aptamer‐Engineered Confined Reactive Milieu for Spatiotemporally Controlled Selective Conversion","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Spatiotemporal control of short‐lived reactive intermediates remains a central challenge in heterogeneous catalysis, as non‐selective diffusion fundamentally limits efficiency in complex media. Inspired by enzymatic compartmentalization, we report an aptamer‐functionalized Au‐Fe dual‐single‐atom catalyst (Apt‐Au\n                    1\n                    ‐Fe\n                    1\n                    /NC) that mimics nature's precision by integrating atomically dispersed Au‐Fe sites with a genetically engineered recognition element. This material design creates a “smart reactive pocket” featuring two synergistic interfaces: the Au‐Fe heteronuclear pair electronically modulates the\n                    d\n                    ‐band center to lock the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) into a highly selective 3‐electron pathway with a lowered energy barrier (0.424 eV), while the grafted aptamer acts as a molecular gatekeeper for substrate pre‐enrichment. The resulting architecture achieves exceptional selectivity (87.0%–92.6%) for specific targets while suppressing non‐specific mineralization to below 5.3%—a stark contrast to conventional systems where selectivity is negligible and mineralization exceeds 90%. Mechanistically, the synergistic electronic interaction ensures localized ·OH generation, while the aptamer enforces a strict “proximity effect,” confining these radicals within the nanoscale space for instantaneous consumption by captured substrates. By imposing biological recognition‐based spatial constraints on inorganic active centers, this work establishes a universal paradigm for decoupling activity from selectivity, enabling precision chemical conversion in complex matrices."},{"t":"剖析氢键能量学以回答经典问题：氢键对酶催化的贡献有多大？","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2534793123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","tg":"研究论文","tp":"酶催化氢键能量","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究系统量化解析了酶催化中氢键的贡献，回答了氢键对酶催化作用究竟有多大的经典问题。通过能量学拆解方法，研究揭示了氢键在稳定过渡态、降低活化能中的具体量化作用，为理解酶催化效率的分子起源和蛋白质工程设计提供了定量依据。","dp":1,"ot":"Dissecting hydrogen bond energetics to answer the age-old question: “How much do hydrogen bonds contribute to enzymatic catalysis?”","b":"Enzymes are fundamental to life, providing the rapid reactions and specificity needed to sustain biological processes. While we have overcome the first major challenge in understanding enzymes—identifying their reaction mechanisms—the second major challenge of quantifying the contributions of each catalytic interaction and molecular mechanism remains largely unmet. In particular, hydrogen bonds are ubiquitous in enzyme active sites, yet their quantitative contributions to enzyme catalysis have remained a fundamental unresolved question. We first describe the limitations that prevent the assignment of hydrogen bond catalytic contributions from traditional approaches. These limitations are overcome by using linear free energy relationships (LFERs) to evaluate active site hydrogen bond energetics in a particularly amenable enzyme, ketosteroid isomerase (KSI). Multiple LFERs provide a consistent picture, suggesting that KSI’s active site hydrogen bond donors, tyrosine and protonated aspartic acid side chains, contribute to catalysis because they are inherently stronger hydrogen bond donors than water molecules, the donors in the analogous nonenzymatic reaction. These LFERs also provide evidence against models that invoke distinct enzyme environments that enhance hydrogen bond energetics, relative to aqueous solution. Instead, the LFERs suggest multiple dipoles in the protein and solvent environment surrounding the active site accommodate transition state charge accumulation and provide hydrogen bond energetics similar to what is observed in protic solvents. The quantitative models from this and prior studies allow us to quantitatively estimate the catalytic contributions changes from hydrogen bonds. This model, applied to additional enzymes, will test its generality and help identify additional mechanisms that enzymes may use to enhance catalysis."},{"t":"放电触发非对称基元电子离域抑制锰基层状氧化物的Jahn-Teller畸变","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"http://pubs.rsc.org/en/Content/ArticleLanding/2026/EE/D6EE03005J","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"RSC - Energy Environ. Sci. latest articles","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电池锰基正极","kp":["正极材料[钠离子电池]: Mn基层状氧化物阴离子氧化活性","[稳定机制]: MMCT抑制Jahn-Teller畸变"],"sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.5,"r":5.5,"d":7.5,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对钠离子电池锰基层状氧化物正极材料中Jahn-Teller畸变导致结构退化的难题，研究提出通过放电触发的非对称基元实现电子离域化策略，有效抑制Mn³⁺引起的畸变。该方法显著提升了正极材料的循环稳定性与容量保持率，为高能量密度钠电池正极设计提供了新思路。","dp":1,"ot":"Discharge-Triggered Electronic Delocalization via Asymmetric Motifs Suppresses Jahn-Teller Distortion in Mn-Based Layered Oxides","b":"Mn-based layered oxide cathodes with anionic redox activity are promising candidates for sodium-ion batteries (SIBs) owing to their high operating voltage and energy density.However, the inevitable Mn 3+ generation after cycles results in severe Jahn-Teller distortion, damaging the long cycling stability of the cathodes. Herein, we present a metal-to-metal charge transfer (MMCT) mechanism that acts at the end of discharge to inhibit the generation of Mn 3+ , thereby improving the structural sustainability of the electrode. A P2-Na 0.69 Li 0.23 Ru 0.17 Mn 0.6 O 2 cathode is selected as a model. The doping of highly electronegative Ru regulates the covalency of asymmetrical Mn-O-Ru, ensuring the electron transfer between Mn 3+ and Ru 4+ , which reduces Mn 3+ content and mitigates the Jahn-Teller distortion.As a result, the electrode shows a robust structural stability with a minimal unit cell volume change of only 0.2%. Moreover, the cathode exhibits excellent electrochemical performance, maintaining capacity retention of over 90% after 900 cycles at 2-4.3 V. The findings provide fresh insights for inhibiting the Jahn-Teller effect, offering a new paradigm for the application of Mn-based layered cathodes with high energy density for sustainable SIBs."},{"t":"能源与环境政策在碳减排中的成本效益协同：来自中国钢铁行业的证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526003551?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/黑色金属/钢铁","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","dp":1,"tg":"政策监管","tp":"钢铁碳减排","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":0,"i":8,"r":3,"d":6,"t":3},"as":""},{"t":"Salomon 等人的《美国 COVID-19 趋势和影响调查》的更正：持续实时测量 COVID-19 症状、风险、保护行为、检测和疫苗接种","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2617330123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"病毒RNA聚合酶和核酸外切酶的连续催化步骤提出了一种克服内在核苷酸类似物耐药性的方法","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2605725123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Nucleotide analogues (NAs) have been successfully used for the treatment of various RNA virus infections by selectively targeting the viral RNA-dependent RNA polymerase (RdRp) for incorporation into the viral genome. However two major families of human-infecting RNA viruses,\n                    Coronaviridae\n                    (CoV) and\n                    Arenaviridae,\n                    encode exonuclease domains that may recognize and remove incorporated NAs, thus providing natural resistance against some of these drugs. Both polymerization and excision reactions are mechanistically centered on the nucleotide α-phosphate, enabling the potential for sequential inhibition of both RNA synthesis and repair. Here, we provide structural evidence of inversion of configuration at the phosphorus center during polymerization, demonstrating that the SARS-CoV-2 RdRp proceeds through an S\n                    N\n                    2 mechanism. A 2.39 Å resolution cryo-EM structure of a ternary replication complex bound to RNA and an α-thio–modified NTP shows that incorporation of the preferred\n                    S\n                    P\n                    isomer at the 3′ end of the RNA yields a phosphorothioate linkage in the\n                    R\n                    P\n                    configuration. This\n                    R\n                    P\n                    -phosphorothioate RNA product shows reduced cleavage by both the SARS-CoV-2 and three arenavirus RNA exonucleases, revealing a stereochemical preference opposite to that of structurally related DNA exonucleases. This observation contradicts the prevailing assumption that sulfur substitution at the metal-coordinating oxygen universally blocks catalysis. Instead, RNA exonuclease stereoselectivity appears to be shaped not only by metal–sulfur interactions but also by the geometry of nucleophile activation. These findings provide mechanistic insights into phosphoryl transfer in viral polymerases and exonucleases and highlight opportunities to counteract intrinsic nuclease-mediated resistance against antiviral nucleotide analogues."},{"t":"认知不会自动影响感知：来自不同类别颜色神经编码的证据","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2538139123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"The firmest evidence in favor of models that posit early high-level influences of cognition on perception comes from electroencephalography (EEG). Enhanced early, preattentive processing of light and dark blue feature changes compared to light and dark green changes was reported in Greek speakers, who have two basic terms for “blue” (\n                    ghalazio/ble\n                    ). In the present three-experiment study, we systematically reevaluate this evidence and test an alternative model that the early difference waves in the human EEG instead mainly reflect contrast adaptation phenomena. We use the same classical oddball paradigm presenting alternating standards and deviants that systematically differ in color and/or luminance and chromatic contrast. We then calculate the visual mismatch negativity (vMMN), a putative index of preattentive feature change processing and predictive coding derived from EEG data, by subtracting the activity elicited by standards from that elicited by task-irrelevant deviants. Our experiments demonstrate the following: 1) vMMN is driven by contrast adaptation, being observable only in the presence of contrast differences between the stimuli and not reliably observed for categorically different hues equated in contrast; 2) there is no reliable difference between green- and blue-related difference waves in speakers (Russian) with two basic blue color categories, the difference waves, again, being driven by contrast rather than their categorical content. Our findings are highly significant for the debate concerning the interface between perception and cognition, as the absence of early categorical effects speaks against models that predict Whorfian-type preattentive cognitive influences on perception."},{"t":"气泡形成控制：通过过氧化氢酶涂覆的释氧水凝胶制造厘米大小的组织状结构","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.202523593?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Developing thick three‐dimensional (3D) scaffolds remains challenging due to oxygen depletion and limited cell viability. Calcium peroxide (CaO\n                    2\n                    )‐catalase‐based oxygen‐releasing biomaterials are a common solution, but the uncontrolled release of oxygen bubbles often leading to structural damages is rarely discussed. Herein, we present a strategy to control the site of bubble formation in an oxygen‐releasing hydrogel, by applying a catalase nanocoating to its surface. CaO\n                    2\n                    undergoes hydrolytic decomposition with water, generating hydrogen peroxide (H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    ), subsequently converts into O\n                    2\n                    and H\n                    2\n                    O. Because H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    can induce cytotoxicity, direct catalase incorporation into hydrogel systems may accelerate O\n                    2\n                    bubble formation, leading in hydrogel collapse within 1 h of aqueous immersion. In comparison, catalase‐coated hydrogels exhibited improved structural stability, showing a 5.9‐fold smaller bubble size than hydrogels with mixed catalase after 24 h in ambient air. Under hypoxic conditions (O\n                    2\n                    &lt; 0.1%), centimeter‐scale constructs containing catalase‐coated hydrogels preserved up to 86% viable human fibroblast cells after 5 days of culture, compared with only 47% in non‐catalase coated hydrogels. Furthermore, the incorporation of catalase‐coated hydrogels promoted cell survival and neurite outgrowth of human neural stem cells cultured in neuronal differentiation conditions under severe hypoxia. These findings suggest the potential of the proposed strategy for oxygen‐supportive tissue engineering applications."},{"t":"连接国家气候目标和企业决策：基于代理的中国钢铁脱碳路径模型","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2528009123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/无机物/黑色金属/钢铁","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"China’s steel sector is pivotal to national and global climate goals, yet decarbonization is constrained by entrenched coal-based processes and regional disparities. Top–down and bottom–up models often neglect firm-level heterogeneity and behavioral dynamics. Here, we develop an agent-based model linking policy signals—carbon caps, pollution standards, and resource limits—with firm-level investment decisions. We evaluate four scenarios combining current and strengthened climate and air targets with neutral or accelerated technology progress. All scenarios achieve deep CO\n                    2\n                    reductions (90 to 95% by 2060), but only the integrated policy-plus- technology pathway eliminates blast furnaces before midcentury, achieving the steepest declines. Policy- or technology-only pathways entail trade-offs, including lock-in to carbon capture and storage or delayed reductions. Our results show that synchronizing stringent climate policy with rapid technology cost declines is essential to steer China’s steel industry toward a carbon-neutral trajectory.","tp":"钢铁脱碳径","sc":3.5,"scd":{"b":1,"i":5,"r":3,"d":6,"t":3},"as":"构建基于代理（agent-based）的中国钢铁行业脱碳路径模型，弥补自上而下和自下而上模型忽视企业异质性和行为动态的不足。模型将碳配额、污染标准和资源限制等政策信号与企业投资决策关联，评估当前和强化气候与空气目标的四种情景组合，揭示了区域差异和煤基工艺路径锁定对脱碳的制约。"},{"t":"水甘油孔蛋白控制与海洋钙化器中的囊泡矿物质形成相关的细胞水和二氧化碳电导","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2524614123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"不相关","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"Many marine organisms generate biominerals by endocytotic uptake of seawater which is modified within calcifying cells to produce an amorphous mineral precursor required to form the mineralized shell or skeleton. In this process, water must be removed from the endocytotic vesicles and the cell to promote concentration of calcification substrates and production of a water-free mineral. Here, we demonstrate that in the sea urchin larva, an aquaglyceroporin (spAQP9) is involved in the cellular calcification process. spAQP9 is found exclusively in the calcifying primary mesenchyme cells (PMCs), and spAQP9 expression is increased during mineralization underlining its role in skeleton formation. Heterologous expression of sp\n                    AQP9\n                    in\n                    \n                      Xenopus laevis\n                    \n                    oocytes demonstrated that this channel conducts water and carbon dioxide. The water conductance by spAQP9 is sensitive to phloretin with an IC\n                    50\n                    of ∼38 µM and treatment of larvae with phloretin or knock-down of spAQP9 impaired skeleton formation. Immunohistological analyses revealed localization of spAQP9 in vesicles with different subcellular distribution depending on the calcification activity of PMCs. Finally, we developed an in vivo assay to measure cellular and vesicular water permeability in PMCs and found a significant water permeability of the plasma membrane and membranes of calcium-rich vesicles. The results of this work highlight the importance of water transport mechanisms in the mineralization process. Here, aquaporins like spAQP9 represent key players that serve a dual function as a water and CO\n                    2\n                    conductance pathway and thereby can support ion concentration and carbon transport, two processes that are of fundamental importance to promote intracellular mineral precursor formation."},{"t":"基于元扩散模型的极不平衡场景下HVAC系统新故障类别数据的自适应增强框架","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008445?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"不相关","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"抗 CRISPR 蛋白普查显示 AcrIE9 和 AcrIE13 是大肠杆菌 K12 型 IE CRISPR-Cas 系统的抑制剂","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://www.pnas.org/doi/abs/10.1073/pnas.2529903123?mi=eymic2&af=R&access=on&content=articlesChapters&publication=pnas&sortBy=Earliest&target=default","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences: Keyword search for query","dp":1,"tg":"行业观察","b":"CRISPR-Cas adaptive immunity systems provide defense against mobile genetic elements and are often countered by diverse anti-CRISPR (Acr) proteins. The type IE CRISPR-Cas of\n                    \n                      Escherichia coli\n                    \n                    K12 has been a model for structural and functional studies and is a part of the species’ core genome. However, this system is transcriptionally silent, which has fueled questions about its true biological function. To clarify the role of this system in defense, we carried out a census of Acr proteins in\n                    Enterobacterales\n                    and identified AcrIE9 as a potent inhibitor of the\n                    \n                      E. coli\n                    \n                    K12 type IE CRISPR-Cas system. While sharing little sequence identity, AcrIE9 proteins from\n                    \n                      Pseudomonas\n                    \n                    and\n                    \n                      Escherichia\n                    \n                    both interact with the Cas7 subunit of the Cascade complex, thus preventing its binding to DNA. We further show that AcrIE9 is genetically linked to AcrIE10, forming the most widespread anti-CRISPR cluster in\n                    Enterobacterales\n                    ; this module often co-occurs with an AcrIE13 protein with an unusual HTH-like architecture.","tp":"抗CRISPR","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":7,"i":2,"r":5,"d":7,"t":5},"as":"抗CRISPR（Acr）蛋白普查研究发现AcrIE9和AcrIE13是大肠杆菌K12型IE CRISPR-Cas系统的有效抑制剂。大肠杆菌IE系统是结构功能研究的经典模型且属于物种核心基因组，但该系统长期处于转录沉默状态，其真实生物学功能存疑。该研究通过系统筛查揭示了调控该CRISPR系统的特定抗CRISPR蛋白，为理解CRISPR-Cas免疫与噬菌体反防御之间的军备竞赛提供了新线索。"},{"t":"兼具稳健粘附、自愈合与透氧性的统一聚合物水凝胶电解质用于柔性中性锌空气电池","d":"2026-06-10","i":"l","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.73665?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/其它电池体系","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌空气电池电解质","kp":["[凝胶电解质]: 集成粘附/自修复/透氧","[器件形态]: 柔性中性锌空电池"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":4.5,"d":7.0,"t":5.5},"as":"研究开发了一种统一聚合物水凝胶电解质，集成强粘附性、自修复和氧渗透性于一体，用于柔性中性锌空气电池。该电解质解决了传统柔性电池中界面接触差和锌阳极腐蚀问题，自修复功能提升了器件耐久性，为可穿戴电子中柔性储能器件提供了多功能一体化方案。","dp":1,"ot":"A Unified Polymer Hydrogel Electrolyte Integrating Robust Adhesion, Self‐Healing, and Oxygen Permeability in Flexible Neutral Zn‐Air Batteries","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Polymer hydrogel electrolytes hold significant promise for Zn–air batteries due to their excellent flexibility, non‐flammability, and leak resistance. However, their practical application remains constrained by zinc dendrite growth and intrinsic trade‐offs among ionic conductivity, oxygen permeability, mechanical strength, and both interfacial and environmental stability. Herein, we report a neutral, 3D physically cross‐linked PFCD hydrogel engineered via the synergistic combination of a tight coordination network of small Fe\n                    3\n                    +\n                    ions and a broader hydrogen‐bonding network of β‐cyclodextrin, with in situ incorporated N‐carboxyethyl chitosan. This hierarchical architecture endows the PFCD hydrogel with high adhesion (50 kPa), superior ionic conductivity (113.2 mS cm\n                    −\n                    1\n                    ), and significant oxygen permeability (4.1 Barrer). Additionally, the hydrogel exhibits autonomous self‐healing (99% efficiency in 3 h), exceptional stretchability (1600% elongation), and robust interfacial contact (withstanding 1000 folding/stretching cycles), while effectively suppressing zinc dendrite growth and resisting CO\n                    2\n                    degradation. Assembled flexible neutral Zn–air batteries (FNZABs) achieve high power density (59 mW cm\n                    −\n                    2\n                    ) with stable operation over 3000 cycles. Furthermore, the fabrication of leakage‐free, closed‐system FNZABs demonstrates the hydrogel's dual role as both an electrolyte and an oxygen‐permeable encapsulation membrane. This integrated strategy effectively addresses critical interfacial and stability challenges essential for advanced flexible energy storage systems development."},{"t":"具有超高 Fe(II) 的二甲双胍稳定的无定形氧化铁的自级联纳米酶，可在超低剂量下有效治疗肿瘤","d":"2026-06-10","i":"literature","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7061041?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","dp":1,"tg":"技术突破","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The therapeutic efficacy of iron oxide nanozymes in cancer catalytic therapy has been severely constrained by the insufficient endogenous H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    . To address this, constructing a self–cascading nanozyme that integrates oxidase (OXD) and peroxidase (POD) activities is highly desirable yet challenging, primarily due to the difficulty in stabilizing high–content of Fe(II) within nanostructures. Herein, we report the first synthesis of mesoporous amorphous iron oxide nanospheres (aFeO\n                    x\n                    ‑N) with unprecedented high Fe (II) level (66.59%) via the confinement coordination strategy using the strong N–donor metformin. This unique structure simultaneously exhibits robust OXD–like activity for in situ H\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    generation via a 2e\n                    −\n                    oxygen reduction pathway and enhanced POD–like activity for consequent •OH production. In vitro studies verified the aFeO\n                    x\n                    ‑N‑ss‑SiO\n                    2\n                    (encapsulated by SiO\n                    2\n                    outlayer containing ─S─S─ bonds for TME responsiveness) triggered ferroptosis and prominent cell death even under hypoxic conditions. Remarkably, a single ultralow dose (5 mg·kg\n                    −1\n                    ) achieves a tumor inhibition rate of up to 96.19% in murine models, demonstrating exceptional therapeutic efficacy and biocompatibility. This work provides a novel and potent nanozyme platform for cascade catalytic tumor therapy.","tp":"纳米酶抗癌","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.5,"t":6.0},"as":"开发了一种二甲双胍稳定的超高Fe(II)含量无定形氧化铁自级联纳米酶，用于肿瘤催化治疗。该纳米酶整合氧化酶（OXD）和过氧化物酶（POD）双重活性，通过自级联反应克服了内源性H2O2不足的限制，同时高含量Fe(II)的稳定化解决了传统铁氧化物纳米酶活性受限的难题，实现在超低剂量下有效抑制肿瘤。"},{"t":"轴向磁通电机首次批量生产--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"news","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260608_1893542.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","as":"上海盘毂动力在浙江金华发布系列高性能轴向磁通电机并实现首次批量生产，产品自重减轻50%、尺寸缩减50%、金属耗材节约50%。轴向磁通电机相比传统径向磁通电机具有功率密度更高、轴向更薄的优势，在电动汽车、机器人等对空间和重量敏感的场景具有显著应用前景，标志着该技术从实验室走向工程量产。","tg":"产业进展","tp":"轴向磁通电机","kp":["自重减轻[轴向磁通电机]: 50%","尺寸缩减[轴向磁通电机]: 50%","金属耗材节约[轴向磁通电机]: 50%","磁性材料[轴向磁通电机]: PGH高温不退磁","[量产状态]: 全球首次批量生产"],"sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":7.5,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"b":"轴向磁通电机首次批量生产--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n自重减轻50%、尺寸缩减50%、金属耗材节约50%……近日，上海盘毂动力科技股份有限公司（以下简称“盘毂动力”）在浙江金华发布系列高性能轴向磁通电机，标志着我国轴向磁通电机在全球范围内首次实现批量生产。\n电机俗称“马达”，是利用电磁感应定律将电能和机械能相互转换的装置。按照内部磁通方向的不同，电机分为轴向磁通电机和径向磁通电机。尽管轴向磁通电机是人类历史上最早出现的电机形态，但受限于核心制造材料、精密生产工艺及制造设备存在短板，这项技术长期处于实验室研究阶段。\n从2018年起，盘毂动力联合中国科学院宁波材料技术与工程研究所，向电机用磁性材料发起攻关。研发团队对磁性材料的成分设计、结构调控、制备工艺等进行全维度优化，配比出能在高温环境下不退磁的轴向磁通电机专用材料PGH（PanGood High）高性能磁钢。在此基础上，盘毂动力建立起全球首条轴向磁通电机规模化量产线，实现我国轴向磁通电机产业从基础理论研究、核心材料研发、量产装备工艺开发到规模量产的全方位跨越。\n基于PGH高性能磁钢研发的轴向磁通电机性能优异。其有效功率密度可达25.73千瓦/千克；每分钟最高转速突破18000转；总成扭矩密度达到每米、每千克293牛，较对标产品提升22%。据介绍，搭载PGH高性能磁钢的轴向磁通电机适用于新能源汽车、人形机器人、低空飞行器等战略性新兴产业。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立\n香港理工大学·月山能源新一代矿业联合实验室揭牌\n全国首个绿色算力全栈AI平台上线运行\n氢铀反应起始过程首次完整记录"},{"t":"轴向磁通电机首次批量生产--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260608_1893542.html","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"产业进展","tp":"轴向磁通电机","kp":["自重减轻[轴向磁通电机]: 50%","尺寸缩减[轴向磁通电机]: 50%","金属耗材节约[轴向磁通电机]: 50%","[磁性材料]: PGH专用材料高温不退磁"],"dp":1,"as":"上海盘毂动力在浙江金华发布系列高性能轴向磁通电机并实现首次批量生产，产品自重减轻50%、尺寸缩减50%、金属耗材节约50%。轴向磁通电机相比传统径向磁通电机具有功率密度更高、轴向更薄的优势，在电动汽车、机器人等对空间和重量敏感的场景具有显著应用前景，标志着该技术从实验室走向工程量产。","sc":8.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":8.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"b":"轴向磁通电机首次批量生产--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n轴向磁通电机首次批量生产\n自重减轻50%、尺寸缩减50%、金属耗材节约50%……近日，上海盘毂动力科技股份有限公司（以下简称“盘毂动力”）在浙江金华发布系列高性能轴向磁通电机，标志着我国轴向磁通电机在全球范围内首次实现批量生产。\n电机俗称“马达”，是利用电磁感应定律将电能和机械能相互转换的装置。按照内部磁通方向的不同，电机分为轴向磁通电机和径向磁通电机。尽管轴向磁通电机是人类历史上最早出现的电机形态，但受限于核心制造材料、精密生产工艺及制造设备存在短板，这项技术长期处于实验室研究阶段。\n从2018年起，盘毂动力联合中国科学院宁波材料技术与工程研究所，向电机用磁性材料发起攻关。研发团队对磁性材料的成分设计、结构调控、制备工艺等进行全维度优化，配比出能在高温环境下不退磁的轴向磁通电机专用材料PGH（PanGood High）高性能磁钢。在此基础上，盘毂动力建立起全球首条轴向磁通电机规模化量产线，实现我国轴向磁通电机产业从基础理论研究、核心材料研发、量产装备工艺开发到规模量产的全方位跨越。\n基于PGH高性能磁钢研发的轴向磁通电机性能优异。其有效功率密度可达25.73千瓦/千克；每分钟最高转速突破18000转；总成扭矩密度达到每米、每千克293牛，较对标产品提升22%。据介绍，搭载PGH高性能磁钢的轴向磁通电机适用于新能源汽车、人形机器人、低空飞行器等战略性新兴产业。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立\n香港理工大学·月山能源新一代矿业联合实验室揭牌\n全国首个绿色算力全栈AI平台上线运行\n氢铀反应起始过程首次完整记录"},{"t":"短剧产业走向价值红利阶段","d":"2026-06-09","i":"news","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260608/702ccecfd1164e64be54584d9b632441/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"新华网科技","as":"短剧产业在爆发式增长后正从流量驱动转向价值红利阶段。AI视频模型公司、内容平台与产业资本加速入局，推动AI短剧成为新兴风口。中国网络视听协会数据显示一季度微短剧上线量持续攀升，行业格局正经历从粗放扩张到精品化、专业化运营的关键转型。","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI视频生成","kp":["AI占比[微短剧]: 超95%"],"sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"b":"短剧产业走向价值红利阶段-新华网\n短剧产业走向价值红利阶段\n短剧产业走向价值红利阶段\n近年来，短剧产业迎来爆发式增长，随着AI视频模型公司、内容平台、产业资本加速入局，AI短剧成为新的产业风口。中国网络视听协会数据显示，一季度全行业上线微短剧约12.8万部，其中AI微短剧约12.2万部，占比超过95%。\n市场竞争日趋激烈，推动短剧产业从“拼数量”向“拼质量”转变。在近日抖音集团短剧版权中心举办的首届短剧产业大会上，专家表示，短剧正持续向精品化、系列化迈进，是一条前景广阔的商业赛道。\n中国电影评论学会常务副会长张卫介绍，不少平台对关照现实生活、追求积极社会效应的短剧作品进行专项扶持，资金向好剧本、好内容集中。同时，平台取消无差别保底、收紧审核、提高准入门槛，这些都在加速低质、劣俗的短剧退场。\n2025年2月，国家广播电视总局发布通知，要求落实微短剧“分类分层审核”制度。北京电影学院智能影像工程学院教授程樯认为，这标志着真人短剧告别了依靠低俗、擦边、贩卖焦虑来博眼球的草莽时代。大浪淘沙之后，留下的将是真正懂创作、敬畏内容的创作者。\n目前，一批贴近现实、贴近生活、贴近百姓的现实题材短剧精品正不断涌现。例如短剧《北往》将笔墨聚焦于两位骑摩托车从云南返回东北的农民工，讲述小人物在困苦中的道德坚守，激发了观众浓厚的观看兴趣，获得6亿次有效播放量。\n“短剧正从规模红利阶段逐步走向价值红利阶段。过去比拼的是流量，现在到了比拼质量的时候。”中国传媒大学网络视频研究中心主任王晓红表示，质量就是价值创造力，即创造审美、情感和社会价值的能力。精品化是价值红利时代最重要的生产方式。\n各平台也纷纷加大对优质短剧作品的支持力度。红果短剧总编辑乐力介绍，抖音集团短剧版权中心近期已陆续推出多项真人短剧扶持计划，大力激励优质短剧的内容题材创新，平台也同步完成创作者后台升级，推动分账透明化。红果短剧将在新升级的短剧创作者中心投入专项资金，以出品人身份投资生产千部优质短剧项目，聚焦现实题材，让更多从业者参与短剧创作，为观众讲述更多属于普通人的故事。\n拍摄技术的下沉以及平台更精准的推流，极大提高了制片和播发效率。程樯建议，创作者应建立自己的“厂牌”，把单次爆款做成系列化IP，赋予人物、世界观足够深度的生命力，让观众为好的IP买单。系列化不仅能拉长作品的生命周期，更能摊薄制作成本，增加长尾分账收益。\n从短剧+文旅、短剧+助农，到短剧+普法、短剧+科普，精品短剧通过沉浸式的情感共鸣，成为撬动消费的新支点。清华大学新闻与传播学院副院长张铮认为，真人短剧正以其独特的叙事魅力，成为连接不同受众、品牌、产业的最大公约数。一部短剧可能会带火一座城、打造城市的IP，也可能会塑造企业的品牌，成为种草、引流的新模式。\n如何将短剧产业的规模做得更大，实现行业可持续发展？清华大学影视传播研究中心主任司若提出“产业联动”发展路径——短剧借助短平快的打法，与各类产业形成互动，能够产生联动效应，形成商业的良性循环。下一步可以考虑有意识地做生态化布局，用情感的锚点将观众、作品以及作品所推荐的产品相结合，实现IP价值的增值和产业价值的提升。\n“短剧的长远发展需经历3个阶段：从让人心动产生情感共鸣，到让人行动去打卡、消费，最终实现让人追随成为IP忠诚用户。通过矩阵化运营，将核心用户辐射至潜在用户，微短剧产业将在精品化的道路上，实现从内容繁荣到产业共赢的深刻变革。”司若说。（记者 赖奇春）\n家政服务业破局探路的成都样本观察\n专访丨中国在全球海洋治理中发挥积极作用\n一封“战书”没写成，却成了温暖的家书\n6月9日起精彩天幕“连续剧”将上演\n科学圆桌会丨1.5亿只蝴蝶为何同时扇动翅膀？\n盘点伊朗战事百日经济冲击波\n全球瞭望丨霍尔木兹海峡“梗阻”或致油轮利润“过山车”\n从“退养还滩”到“苇绿鹤归”——辽东湾海岸生态修复观察\n短剧产业走向价值红利阶段"},{"t":"未来产业获政策加码 重点赛道将培育更多“独角兽”","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260608/4aeeb441129047ccbc6523b859c68565/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"新华网科技","tg":"政策监管","b":"未来产业获政策加码 重点赛道将培育更多“独角兽”-新华网\n未来产业获政策加码 重点赛道将培育更多“独角兽”\n未来产业获政策加码 重点赛道将培育更多“独角兽”\n日前召开的国务院常务会议研究未来产业发展有关工作，并作出系列部署，包括“鼓励产业链上下游密切合作，在重点赛道培育更多初创企业和独角兽企业”“发挥好政府投资基金等引导作用，建立投入增长和风险分担机制”等。\n受访专家表示，未来产业前瞻带动作用突出，不仅能催生经济发展新增长点，还能带动产业全链条升级重构。展望下一步，量子科技、生物制造、可控核聚变等多个赛道有望实现从技术突破到产业化落地的关键跨越。需推动各类创新资源向企业集聚，激发企业创新创造活力。\n会议指出，要根据未来产业特点，进一步加强前瞻布局、加大推动力度，牢牢把握发展主动权。要筑牢技术根基，持续增加基础研究投入，系统布局原创性、颠覆性技术攻关。\n记者从工业和信息化部获悉，当前多个未来产业方向取得标志性成果。如，脑机接口应用正从医疗领域向教育、工业等领域加速拓展；单原子催化材料、原子级制造装备等重点产品年销售额突破百亿元。\n中国电子信息产业发展研究院未来产业研究中心副所长李艺铭表示，前沿技术融合化、智能化趋势将更加显著，未来产业多赛道有望实现从实验室到产业化的关键跨越，场景驱动有望加速技术到产业的转化进程。其中，量子科技逐步从实验室走向特定场景应用，在金融风控、药物研发等领域开展试点示范；可控核聚变进入工程可行性验证关键阶段，商业化落地加速。\n会议要求，要注重生态建设，推动产学研用深度融合，鼓励产业链上下游密切合作，在重点赛道培育更多初创企业和独角兽企业。\n“未来产业不是单一行业的独立发展，而是以核心技术为原点，串联起基础材料、核心元器件、高端装备、场景服务等多个环节，既拉动上游基础工业升级，又拓展下游应用空间，持续拉长产业链条、丰富产业形态。”国研新经济研究院创始院长、湾区低空经济研究院院长朱克力表示，例如，6G、量子科技等信息类未来产业，会推动新型通信器件、算力硬件、仿真平台迭代，同时为低空经济、智慧海洋等领域提供底层技术支撑。\n李艺铭表示，未来产业将新增部分产业环节，重构产业链配套。如，在核聚变能领域，据行业预测，2030年全球核聚变市场规模可达5000亿美元，将带动超导材料、特种金属、精密制造等上下游产业生态。在量子科技领域，上游测控设备、低温系统、量子芯片等环节将率先放量，下游金融建模、药物研发等应用场景加速打开。\n在企业培育方面，目前我国累计培育专精特新“小巨人”企业超1.7万家，在人工智能、具身智能、生物技术、可控核聚变等未来产业领域集中涌现出一批优秀独角兽企业。\n朱克力认为，推动产业链上下游协同、培育初创企业与独角兽，需要从平台搭建、主体联动、生态培育、服务保障等多方面协同发力。其中，需要完善产学研用融合体系，布局一批概念验证、中试转化平台，打通从实验室技术到市场化产品的通道，降低初创企业研发试错成本。搭建梯度培育体系，针对早期初创项目提供孵化场地、技术指导、创业辅导，对成长型企业精准推送市场资源，助力优质企业快速壮大。\n培育发展未来产业是一项长期性、战略性任务。会议提出，要完善支持政策，发挥好政府投资基金等引导作用，建立投入增长和风险分担机制。\n李艺铭表示，未来产业的独特属性，决定了其投入增长机制必须超越传统模式，构建起更加系统、敏捷且风险共担的投入增长机制。其中，作为要素投入引导者与保障者，政府通过引导基金、风险补偿等弥补早期资金缺口；金融机构发挥支持协同作用，注入金融活水。在要素投入中，构建全周期资本接力体系，通过专项基金支持人才与技术转化，探索数据资产价值化路径。（记者 郭倩）\n“农业农村是大有可为的广阔天地”\n专访丨中国在全球海洋治理中发挥积极作用\n算力普惠浪潮奔涌 赋能产业民生双升级\n一封“战书”没写成，却成了温暖的家书\n科学圆桌会丨1.5亿只蝴蝶为何同时扇动翅膀？\n盘点伊朗战事百日经济冲击波\n全球瞭望丨霍尔木兹海峡“梗阻”或致油轮利润“过山车”\n从“退养还滩”到“苇绿鹤归”——辽东湾海岸生态修复观察\n未来产业获政策加码 重点赛道将培育更多“独角兽”","tp":"未来产业策","sc":2.8,"scd":{"b":0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":1.0,"t":6.0},"as":"国务院常务会议研究部署未来产业发展，鼓励产业链上下游合作，在重点赛道培育更多初创企业和独角兽企业，发挥政府投资基金引导作用。专家指出量子科技、生物制造、可控核聚变等赛道有望实现从技术突破到产业化落地的关键跨越。当前脑机接口从医疗向教育、工业拓展，单原子催化材料和原子级制造装备年销售额已突破百亿元。会议强调持续增加基础研究投入，系统布局原创性颠覆性技术攻关。"},{"t":"数据中心建设强化“算电协同”","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260608/05f785a31b4241d2a3abd6454c0fa9b0/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"数据中心算电协同","kp":["用电量[数据中心2025]: 1960亿千瓦时(占1.9%)","用电量[数据中心2030预测]: 超7000亿千瓦时"],"as":"数据中心作为人工智能、云计算、物联网、区块链等数字基础设施的核心载体，建设正强化算力与电力协同布局。算电协同旨在解决大规模算力扩张带来的电力供需矛盾，通过源网荷储一体化、绿电直供等方式提升能效，保障数据中心可持续发展。","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.5,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":6.5},"b":"数据中心建设强化“算电协同”-新华网\n数据中心建设强化“算电协同”\n数据中心建设强化“算电协同”\n数据中心是由计算机场地，其他基础设施、信息系统软硬件、信息资源（数据）和人员以及相应的规章制度组成的实体，是人工智能、云计算、物联网、区块链等新一代信息技术的重要载体。随着我国数字经济蓬勃发展，数据中心等数字基础设施的耗能问题越来越受关注。\n专家表示，推动数据中心等数字基础设施节能降碳，对于数字经济高质量发展和实现“双碳”目标具有重要的现实意义。如果不采取有力措施推动节能降碳，算力高速扩张将逐步逼近能源供给天花板，最终反过来制约数字经济的发展空间。\n数据中心的耗能问题，已成为发展数字经济不可忽视的挑战。数据显示，我国数据中心用电量从2022年的1300亿千瓦时增长至2025年的1960亿千瓦时，占全社会用电量的比例从1.5%提升至1.9%。预计到2030年，数据中心用电量或将超过7000亿千瓦时，占全社会用电量5%以上。\n“算力是数字经济时代的‘新电力’，但若放任算力增长以成倍增加能耗为代价，数字经济的可持续性将受到根本挑战。”赛智产业研究院智能经济研究所所长李铭岩说。\n据了解，数据中心的能耗主要分布在3个环节。其中，信息技术设备是能耗主体，服务器、存储、网络设备等直接承担计算任务，占总能耗的45%至60%。制冷系统是第二大耗能环节。业界普遍认为，制冷能耗占比在30%至40%之间，服务器运行产生的废热若未有效利用，就造成了巨大的能源浪费。在高密度AI算力集群中，单机柜功率已从传统的几千瓦攀升至数十千瓦甚至上百千瓦，风冷系统面临散热瓶颈，传统风冷数据中心PUE（电能利用效率）长期徘徊在1.8以上。此外，供配电系统（含配电柜、变压器等）约占能耗的5%至10%，照明、安防等其他辅助设施占比约3%至5%。\n“综合来看，制冷系统是能耗压力最突出的环节。”李铭岩表示，在AI高密部署趋势下，传统风冷能效极限已难以满足散热需求，液冷技术升级和设备能效管控刻不容缓。\n赛迪研究院政策法规研究所副研究员陈又新表示，当前，电力成本是数据中心运营成本的重要组成部分。随着人工智能大模型等应用加速普及，全社会对算力的需求呈现指数级增长态势。数据中心等数字基础设施若未能有效推进节能降碳，不断攀升的巨额电费将直接挤压经济收益，甚至可能使大量创新项目因负担不起能源成本而陷入停滞。\n随着生成式AI技术持续突破，AI计算走向高密度，满足高功耗散热需求的液冷数据中心成为下一代数据中心建设的主流方向，目前行业正深耕技术突破。例如浪潮信息发布的全栈液冷产品，全线服务器产品均支持冷板式液冷。2025年初投运的元脑算力工厂，遵循“高密+绿色”的未来智算中心设计理念，其中算力单元部署了高密智算算力仓，采用光伏、储能、余热回收等绿色节能技术，使PUE降至1.1以下。\n“数字基础设施节能降碳是‘双碳’目标中最直接见效的领域之一，为‘双碳’目标提供实质性减排贡献。”李铭岩表示。\n以落地的算电协同项目为例，宁夏中卫首个大规模算电协同绿电直供项目全容量投产后，项目发电量将达43亿千瓦时，相当于每年减少碳排放365万吨。\n李铭岩介绍，在“东数西算”工程推动下，八大国家枢纽节点新建数据中心PUE已普遍降到1.2至1.3区间，累计建成306家国家绿色算力设施，PUE平均值降至1.25。在国家级零碳园区建设大框架下，一批标杆项目加速形成绿色运营体系。\n在安徽省合肥市，极具科技感的“巢湖明月”硅立方成为当地的新地标，这是曙光数创采用创新“正方体”立体架构打造的高密度浸没式液冷AI计算机。依托曙光数创的浸没相变液冷技术，电子元件被完全浸没在特殊冷媒中，元件发热让液体沸腾汽化，通过相变带走热量。这种液冷技术可实现PUE低至1.04，整体能耗降低30%，产品单机柜功率密度较传统风冷提升4倍至5倍。\n在李铭岩看来，数字基础设施本身就具备极高的低碳乘数效应——依托大数据、智能算力和智能调度系统，可以深度赋能工业制造、城市治理、交通运输等领域。以数字化领域小投入撬动实体产业大幅减碳，这是数字基础设施助力全社会降碳的价值延伸。\n陈又新表示，推动数据中心等数字基础设施节能降碳，成为实现“双碳”目标的关键战场和转型引擎。数据中心是我国能耗和碳排放显著增长的行业之一，遏制其碳排放的过快增长，本身就是对实现碳达峰、碳中和目标的直接贡献。此外，数字基础设施通过赋能千行百业，其减碳价值远超自身。\n当前，我国绿色数据中心建设取得显著成效，能效水平持续优化、技术创新加速突破、发展模式产生深刻变革。但也要看到，尽管政策力度持续加大，在实际推进中，仍面临多重结构性挑战。\n首先，国内绿电资源集中在西部，而大量实时推理算力需求集中在东部，同时新能源出力受天气影响剧烈，而AI大模型训练等核心任务则需要长时间、高稳定的电力保障，二者存在时空维度上的矛盾。\n其次是规划节奏错位。算力需求爆发式增长是“快变量”，而电网建设周期长是“慢变量”，两者节奏不匹配的问题已在部分地区显现。\n而在技术标准与市场机制方面，异构算力互联互通、跨区域算力调度等技术标准化进展较缓。同时，绿电直连的定价机制、跨区域交易规则、碳排放核算标准等仍有待完善。\n“推动数字基础设施节能降碳，是一项涉及技术、政策、市场、标准多个维度的系统性工程，需要统筹推进、久久为功。”李铭岩说。\n李铭岩建议，将绿电使用占比作为项目布局的重要参考指标，新建算力设施同步配置绿电供应与储能配套，从源头杜绝“先建后配”导致的能耗失控；探索建立绿电直连的价格传导机制，在绿电富集地区试点“绿电直供+价格优惠”组合政策，吸引更多算力企业主动选择绿电；设立绿色算力技术攻关专项，支持液冷、自然冷却、高效供配电、余热回收等关键技术的规模化应用；建立从算力生产、传输到应用的全生命周期碳足迹核算框架；探索算力设施作为电网柔性负荷参与需求侧响应，将数据中心从纯粹的“耗能大户”转变为电网的平衡调节资源，获得额外收益。\n随着人工智能产业快速发展，数字经济面临算力快速扩张与能源供给约束之间的平衡难题。\n陈又新表示，平衡算力扩张与能耗约束，并非简单做加减法，而是要进行系统性的优化革命。既要从源头优化，通过“东数西算”等国家工程将新建算力设施向可再生能源丰富的西部地区倾斜，也要通过技术革新提升运行效率，在消耗同样多能源的情况下，释放出更多算力。此外，还应改革运行模式，通过“算电协同”机制，将算力负载从刚性需求转变为柔性资源，主动适配绿色电力的时空分布。（记者 赖奇春 黄 鑫）\n家政服务业破局探路的成都样本观察\n专访丨中国在全球海洋治理中发挥积极作用\n一封“战书”没写成，却成了温暖的家书\n6月9日起精彩天幕“连续剧”将上演\n科学圆桌会丨1.5亿只蝴蝶为何同时扇动翅膀？\n盘点伊朗战事百日经济冲击波\n全球瞭望丨霍尔木兹海峡“梗阻”或致油轮利润“过山车”\n从“退养还滩”到“苇绿鹤归”——辽东湾海岸生态修复观察\n数据中心建设强化“算电协同”"},{"t":"招聘专栏：香港科技大学（广州）章勇课题组招收钙钛矿太阳能电池方向博士生、博士后_手机网易网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://www.163.com/dy/article/KUT5I6O20552LHQK.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"网易知光谷","tg":"行业观察","b":"章勇博士，香港科技大学（广州）可持续能源与环境学域助理教授、博士生导师，独立课题组负责人。2020 年获韩国成均馆大学化学工程博士学位，师从Nam-Gyu Park教授；博士毕业后任职南方科技大学，历任校长卓越博士后、研究助理教授（副研究员），2025年2月正式加入港科广。\n研究聚焦钙钛矿光电材料与高效光伏器件，核心方向包括新型光活性材料设计、高纯\n前驱体合成、电池界面工程与稳定性优化、卤化铅钙钛矿回收及 AI 辅助光伏研发，在低成本、高效率、长寿命钙钛矿太阳能电池领域成果突出。截至2026年，累计发表 SCI 论文76篇，其中（共同）第一/通讯作者30篇，发表于Nature（2 篇）、Science、Nature Materials、Nature Energy、Nature Synthesis等期刊，总引用超5200次。获评2021年国家优秀自费留学生、深圳市B类海外高层次人才；兼任eScience、Energy Materials期刊青年编委。\n课题组依托校内一流科研平台，科研经费充足，实验设备完备，科研氛围自由融洽，大力支持学科交叉创新，聚力突破钙钛矿光伏产业化核心技术难题。\n-钙钛矿微晶精准合成与调控\n-卤化铅基钙钛矿资源化回收利用\n-人工智能赋能钙钛矿光伏前沿研究\n开放名额：2026秋季/2027春季入学\n；港科广已获MPhil红鸟硕士offer者可发邮件申请加入。\n、研究助理，欢迎材料、物理、化学、电子等相关专业优秀人才加盟。\n1. 具有具有材料、物理、化学、电子等相关专业的本科或硕士学位，或即将毕业的优秀学生。对于特别优秀的申请者，专业背景可不作硬性要求。\n2. 热爱科研，勇于探索，具备较强的自驱力和团队合作精神。\n3. 学术成绩优秀，具备一定的科研经历和论文发表经验者优先。\n4. 良好的英语口语与学术写作能力。具体英语语言要求请参考港科大（\n5. 红鸟硕士班的同学，在进行前6个月的自主学术探索后，可通过双向选择确定学术导师。详情请参考港科大（广州）官网红鸟硕士项目要求。\n1. 博士生全额奖学金1.5万元人民币/月。\n2. 博士后待遇：提供丰厚的生活补助与科研经费，并享受国家、广东省及广州市博士后支持政策。\n*博士后待遇与要求，请参考港科大（广州）官网，以官网最新发布信息为准。\n*硕士助学金请参考港科大（广州）官网“红鸟”硕士项目规定。\n3. 香港或境外研究机构的交流机会。\n知光谷光伏器件学术QQ群：641345719\n钙钛矿产教融合交流@知光谷（微信群）：需添加编辑微信\n为加强科研合作，我们为海内外科研人员专门开通了\n，备注：姓名-单位-研究方向（无备注请恕不通过），由编辑审核后邀请入群。","tp":"钙钛矿光伏","as":"香港科技大学（广州）可持续能源与环境学域章勇课题组招收钙钛矿太阳能电池方向博士生和博士后。章勇2020年获韩国成均馆大学博士学位，师从Nam-Gyu Park教授，研究聚焦钙钛矿光电材料设计、前驱体合成、界面工程与稳定性优化及AI辅助光伏研发。截至2026年发表SCI论文76篇，含Nature两篇、Science等，总引用超5200次。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0}},{"t":"我国海上风电加快向深远海发展--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260608_1893516.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"产业进展","tp":"深远海风电","kp":["输电容量[海上换流站]: 汇聚163台风机年输60亿度","系泊缆[漂浮式海上风电]: 单根承受约1300吨拉力"],"as":"我国海上风电开发加快从近海走向深远海。今年以来关键装备自主化水平持续提升，世界最大海上换流站完成安装，支撑远海风场电力高效送出。深远海风电被视为未来规模化发展的核心方向，对柔性直流输电、漂浮式风机等工程技术提出更高要求。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"b":"我国海上风电加快向深远海发展--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n今年以来，我国海上风电关键装备自主化水平不断提升，推动海上风电开发加快从近海走向深远海。\n近日，世界最大海上换流站“\n此次安装完成的海上换流站，可以将周围海域163台风机发出的交流电汇集，转换成高压直流电送出，大幅减少送电损耗，标志着我国攻克了深远海大功率输电难题。投产后，每年可输送约60亿度绿电。\n随着近海资源开发逐步趋于成熟，深远海正成为我国海上风电发展的主战场。\n今年以来，围绕着深远海，从核心设备到安装能力，一系列技术都在加速突破。不久前安装完成的全球单机容量最大漂浮式海上风电平台，首次应用了国产化特种聚酯纤维系泊缆，单根可承受约1300吨拉力。截至目前，我国累计完成50余座大型海洋平台浮托安装，总重量突破70万吨，实现全天候、全序列、全海域的\n下一步，我国将持续推动大容量风机、超长叶片、\n等产业链上下游创新发展，为“十五五”时期海上风电并网装机突破一亿千瓦奠定坚实基础。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核\n宁夏迈入千万千瓦级储能大省行列\n固废变资源 推动新能源产业“绿色循环”\n新能源渗透率连续“破六”！充电桩够吗？保费会降吗？\n全球最大储能实证平台在厦门启动","aip":1},{"t":"我国海上风电加快向深远海发展--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260608_1893516.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/风电","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"产业进展","tp":"深远海风电","kp":["输电容量[海上换流站]: 汇聚163台风机年输60亿度","系泊缆[漂浮式海上风电]: 单根承受约1300吨拉力"],"dp":1,"as":"中国海上风电关键装备自主化水平持续提升，推动开发从近海向深远海迈进。世界最大海上换流站完成安装，标志着深远海风电送出技术取得突破。深远海风资源更丰富、风速更稳定，是未来海上风电规模化发展的主方向，但对浮式基础、高压直流输电等工程能力提出更高要求。","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":7.0,"r":1.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"b":"我国海上风电加快向深远海发展--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n今年以来，我国海上风电关键装备自主化水平不断提升，推动海上风电开发加快从近海走向深远海。\n近日，世界最大海上换流站“\n此次安装完成的海上换流站，可以将周围海域163台风机发出的交流电汇集，转换成高压直流电送出，大幅减少送电损耗，标志着我国攻克了深远海大功率输电难题。投产后，每年可输送约60亿度绿电。\n随着近海资源开发逐步趋于成熟，深远海正成为我国海上风电发展的主战场。\n今年以来，围绕着深远海，从核心设备到安装能力，一系列技术都在加速突破。不久前安装完成的全球单机容量最大漂浮式海上风电平台，首次应用了国产化特种聚酯纤维系泊缆，单根可承受约1300吨拉力。截至目前，我国累计完成50余座大型海洋平台浮托安装，总重量突破70万吨，实现全天候、全序列、全海域的\n下一步，我国将持续推动大容量风机、超长叶片、\n等产业链上下游创新发展，为“十五五”时期海上风电并网装机突破一亿千瓦奠定坚实基础。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核\n宁夏迈入千万千瓦级储能大省行列\n固废变资源 推动新能源产业“绿色循环”\n新能源渗透率连续“破六”！充电桩够吗？保费会降吗？\n全球最大储能实证平台在厦门启动"},{"t":"总投资1亿元！钙钛矿新锐叠层电池项目获批","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/08/50024089.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","tp":"钙钛矿叠层电池","kp":["投资[钙钛矿叠层]: 1亿元","规模[中试]: MW级晶硅-钙钛矿叠层试验线"],"as":"康叶光能晶硅-钙钛矿叠层电池研发项目获安徽省审批备案，总投资1亿元，落地合肥包河经开区。钙钛矿叠层技术通过将宽带隙钙钛矿顶电池与硅底电池串联，可突破单结硅电池效率理论极限，是目前光伏效率提升最具潜力的路线之一，多家企业正加速从中试迈向量产。","sc":6.3,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":6.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.5,"t":7.5},"aip":1,"b":"据安徽省投资项目在线审批监管平台发布信息，康叶光能晶硅-钙钛矿叠层电池研发项目备案于6月3日完成审批。\n项目名称：康叶光能晶硅-钙钛矿叠层电池研发项目;项目代码：2606-340111-04-02-499297;审批部门：安徽合肥包河经济开发区管理委员会。\n2026年4月，合肥市包河区与合肥康叶光能科技有限公司签署合作协议，康叶光能钙钛矿叠层电池片项目落户包河。根据合作协议，康叶光能将在包河经开区建设钙钛矿叠层电池片项目，计划总投资1亿元，主要建设MW级钙钛矿电池中试试验线，重点围绕钙钛矿电池及晶硅—钙钛矿叠层电池的中试量产关键环节开展投入，全面贯通从原材料制备、电池片加工到组件封装的全流程工艺，最终实现面向量产的商用尺寸晶硅—钙钛矿叠层电池片及大面积组件的稳定产出。\n康叶光能成立于2024年，由国家杰青中国科大徐集贤教授创立，中国科大顶尖科研团队领衔、专注于晶硅——钙钛矿叠层高效光伏电池研发与产业化的科技企业，核心技术多次刷新全球电池效率纪录，处于行业前沿。\n图 | 徐集贤团队在世界权威的光伏纪录榜(NREL)连续创造钙钛矿电池世界纪录\n企业依托中科大碳中和研究院和精准智能化学全国重点实验室开展技术攻关，聚焦下一代高效光伏技术，致力于推动高效光伏电池技术产业化落地，助力光伏产业升级与绿色低碳发展。2026年3月完成由合肥创新投、包河创投等机构参与的数千万元天使轮融资。\n据悉，钙钛矿叠层电池属于下一代太阳能技术，具有高效率、低成本，轻量化和柔性等优势，应用场景广泛、市场空间广阔。面对商用落地的拐点，康叶光能正加紧从技术积累、场景验证迈向量产交付，以科研成果产业化落地，驱动技术迭代升级与商业化模式创新。\n图 | 晶硅-钙钛矿叠层电池片"},{"t":"塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260608_1893554.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"产业进展","tp":"沙漠光伏发电","kp":["发电量[塔里木油田2026]: 绿电超11亿度","装机规模[集中式光伏]: 260万千瓦(5座)"],"as":"中国石油塔里木油田依托环塔克拉玛干沙漠丰富的太阳能资源，今年累计绿电发电量已突破11亿度。作为传统油气田向综合能源转型的典型案例，塔里木油田将沙漠光伏与油气生产用电相结合，既是减碳路径也是新能源业务拓展，体现了西北沙漠地区光伏开发的巨大潜力。","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.5,"r":3.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.5},"b":"塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n记者6月7日从中国石油了解到，今年以来，塔里木油田利用环塔克拉玛干沙漠的太阳能资源，已累计生产绿电突破11亿度。\n塔里木油田充分利用环塔克拉玛干沙漠地区得天独厚的太阳能资源，加快构建清洁低碳、安全高效的现代能源体系。目前，油田已建成5座集中式光伏电站，总装机规模达到260万千瓦。\n在存量光伏项目安全稳定运行的基础上，塔里木油田正加速推进新建项目建设。在新疆若羌县南部的戈壁荒漠上，占地25903亩的塔里木油田若羌百万千瓦光伏项目正在如火如荼地施工。现场创新采用智能光伏安装机器人开展作业，作业效率大幅提升。\n中国石油塔里木油田新能源事业部经理 梁玉磊：\n若羌项目是塔里木油田建设的第二个百万千瓦级光伏项目，现在已正式进入大规模光伏板安装阶段，计划今年11月底建成并网。项目投运后，年发电量可达16.17亿千瓦时。\n据了解，除若羌百万千瓦光伏项目外，塔里木油田还有3个光伏发电项目正加紧建设，新建项目总装机规模达180万千瓦，全部计划于今年内建成投运。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核\n宁夏迈入千万千瓦级储能大省行列\n固废变资源 推动新能源产业“绿色循环”\n新能源渗透率连续“破六”！充电桩够吗？保费会降吗？"},{"t":"塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/xny/202606/t20260608_1893554.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"中国电力新闻网-新能源","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏发电","kp":["发电量[塔里木油田2026]: 绿电超11亿度","装机规模[集中式光伏]: 260万千瓦(5座)"],"dp":1,"as":"中国石油塔里木油田依托环塔克拉玛干沙漠丰富的太阳能资源，今年累计绿电发电量已突破11亿度。作为传统油气田向综合能源转型的典型案例，塔里木油田将沙漠光伏与油气生产用电相结合，既是减碳路径也是新能源业务拓展，体现了西北沙漠地区光伏开发的巨大潜力。","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.5,"r":1.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.5},"b":"塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n塔里木油田今年绿电发电量已突破11亿度\n记者6月7日从中国石油了解到，今年以来，塔里木油田利用环塔克拉玛干沙漠的太阳能资源，已累计生产绿电突破11亿度。\n塔里木油田充分利用环塔克拉玛干沙漠地区得天独厚的太阳能资源，加快构建清洁低碳、安全高效的现代能源体系。目前，油田已建成5座集中式光伏电站，总装机规模达到260万千瓦。\n在存量光伏项目安全稳定运行的基础上，塔里木油田正加速推进新建项目建设。在新疆若羌县南部的戈壁荒漠上，占地25903亩的塔里木油田若羌百万千瓦光伏项目正在如火如荼地施工。现场创新采用智能光伏安装机器人开展作业，作业效率大幅提升。\n中国石油塔里木油田新能源事业部经理 梁玉磊：\n若羌项目是塔里木油田建设的第二个百万千瓦级光伏项目，现在已正式进入大规模光伏板安装阶段，计划今年11月底建成并网。项目投运后，年发电量可达16.17亿千瓦时。\n据了解，除若羌百万千瓦光伏项目外，塔里木油田还有3个光伏发电项目正加紧建设，新建项目总装机规模达180万千瓦，全部计划于今年内建成投运。\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n我国海上风电加快向深远海发展\n新能源二手车交易量同比增长近30%\n中广核单机容量最大的风电机组完成吊装\n“海风之心”抵达广东阳江海域 进入浮托安装阶段\n全国单体最大陆上风电项目通过试运行考核\n宁夏迈入千万千瓦级储能大省行列\n固废变资源 推动新能源产业“绿色循环”\n新能源渗透率连续“破六”！充电桩够吗？保费会降吗？"},{"t":"国家能源集团：2.5GW风、光项目涉及造假","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/08/50024075.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"行业观察","b":"国家能源集团内蒙古电力有限公司发布《关于假冒公司进行新能源项目开发的声明》。\n近期，有不法分子冒用我公司名义、人员身份发布项目合作、对接及招标信息，涉及神华包头煤制烯烃升级示范项目、吉林省松原市乾安县安宇乡1GW风电项目、乌拉特后旗1.5GW光伏发电项目。\n我公司从未委托其他机构或个人开展上述新能源项目合作、招标、洽谈、收费等工作。提醒各投标人不要轻信网上不实的招标信息及中标信息，谨防上当受骗。","tp":"新能源打假","sc":3.4,"scd":{"b":0,"i":1.0,"r":4.0,"d":1.0,"t":8.0},"as":"国家能源集团内蒙古电力有限公司发布声明，指出有不法分子冒用公司及人员身份，发布神华包头煤制烯烃升级示范项目、吉林松原乾安县1GW风电项目、乌拉特后旗1.5GW光伏发电项目等虚假招标和合作信息，涉及总规模达2.5GW。公司强调从未委托任何机构或个人开展上述项目合作、招标及收费，提醒各方谨防上当受骗。"},{"t":"出口量增长267%！光伏海外订单排产饱满","d":"2026-06-09","i":"news","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/08/50024073.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏组件出口","kp":["出口增长[光伏产品1-4月]: 同比+43%","出口增长[东南亚组件4月]: 同比+267%"],"sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.0,"r":3.5,"d":7.5,"t":8.0},"as":"海关数据显示，2026年1-4月中国光伏产品累计出口量同比增长约43%，尽管4月起出口退税取消，海外需求仍强劲。东南亚市场表现突出，4月单月组件出口量同比增长267%。海外订单排产饱满，浙江义乌等地企业满负荷生产，反映中国光伏产业链全球竞争力持续增强。","b":"海关数据显示，2026年1月到4月中国光伏产品累计出口量同比增长约43% ，尽管4月1日起光伏产品出口退税取消，但国外需求依然强劲。尤其在东南亚市场，今年4月，单月组件出口量同比增长267% 。\n海外订单排产饱满，企业满负荷生产\n在浙江义乌的一家光伏企业生产车间，电池片生产线繁忙有序，自动化设备高速运转，相关负责人介绍，这批产品将出口欧洲，目前企业的海外订单排产饱满，多个基地都在满负荷生产。\n爱旭股份董事长 陈刚：去年订单跟前年相比增长130%，因为现在产能有限，只能是把国内的产能调整到海外，所以今年跟去年相比大概增长50%左右。出口退税取消情况下，客户依然很理解，绝大部分都是跟着退税调整了销售价格。\n近年来，我国光伏产品在国际市场上的需求保持持续增长，虽然今年4月份以来出口退税补贴取消，但需求不减，尤其在东南亚市场，今年4月，单月组件出口量同比增长267% 。\n业内人士认为， 2026年全球光伏新增装机规模将保持在500GW以上，国内光伏企业在抓住全球新能源转型的同时，正加快技术升级与结构优化，实现从规模扩张向质量效益提升的转变。"},{"t":"你的分类选择，正悄悄影响塑料“重生”品质","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260608/f166be0864c04afd81842e5ae8834884/c.html","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"塑料回收再生","kp":["产量[全球塑料2024]: 4.138亿吨","回收率[全球塑料]: 仅9%"],"sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"报道分析了塑料回收再生利用中前端分类对再生材料品质的关键影响。指出尽管塑料循环利用规模庞大，但真正转化为高品质再生材料的比例很低，根源在于分类不精准导致杂质混入。文章呼吁公众提升分类意识，从源头改善再生塑料品质，推动塑料循环经济闭环。","b":"你的分类选择，正悄悄影响塑料“重生”品质-新华网\n你的分类选择，正悄悄影响塑料“重生”品质\n你的分类选择，正悄悄影响塑料“重生”品质\n如果把塑料循环看成一条河，上游的流量已经大到惊人，而真正回到可用再生材料的那部分其实很少。换句话说，绝大多数塑料仍在“用过就走”的路径里，而不是能进到循环里转起来。\n当你站在分类垃圾桶前，将一只塑料瓶投入正确入口，这或许正在悄悄影响它“重生”后的品质。因为科学家的研究揭示，相比从一堆“混合回收”的垃圾中分拣出塑料，从源头就分好类的塑料废弃物，再生后质量明显更优。\n研究背后是一个不容忽视的全球现实：2024年，全球塑料产量已突破4.138亿吨，然而仅有9%得到回收。精细分类本是塑料高质量再生的关键，但完全依赖公众自觉分类，目前仍存在挑战，同时回收工厂的分拣能力也存在天花板。\n为探寻“混合回收”是否可行，科学家深入荷兰一家回收厂，对即将重获新生的塑料进行了细致“体检”。他们比较了来自家庭分类的塑料与“混合回收”的塑料发现，两者材质构成相似，但混合回收塑料中藏着更多“杂质”，包括早已禁用的镉、铅等金属。若未被清除，它们可能随再生制品潜入生活。此外，混合塑料湿度更高、更脏，需要额外清洗，增加了处理负担。\n科学家还推演了更广范围的影响。以欧美国家为例，“混合回收”需提升对混合废塑料的分拣能力，这样做回收总量会增加，但需面对高昂成本。欧洲需投入约180亿欧元，美国约需500亿美元，才能将混合废塑料回收量提升75%。\n“混合回收”虽然可能提高了总体回收量，但要真正走通这条路，必须攻克污染物控制、分拣成本等难关。其代价要么是降低了回收产品质量，要么是成本剧增。而公众从源头分类，仍是保障再生品质的根本，“混合回收”则可以作为一种补充。\n这也意味着，你的每一次准确分类，都在为地球减负，同时也在默默守护着资源循环的品质与安全。（记者 张梦然）\n家政服务业破局探路的成都样本观察\n专访丨中国在全球海洋治理中发挥积极作用\n一封“战书”没写成，却成了温暖的家书\n6月9日起精彩天幕“连续剧”将上演\n科学圆桌会丨1.5亿只蝴蝶为何同时扇动翅膀？\n盘点伊朗战事百日经济冲击波\n全球瞭望丨霍尔木兹海峡“梗阻”或致油轮利润“过山车”\n从“退养还滩”到“苇绿鹤归”——辽东湾海岸生态修复观察\n你的分类选择，正悄悄影响塑料“重生”品质"},{"t":"从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道","d":"2026-06-09","i":"news","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260608/9cc1c0fed2ee4844bf0a58abb6a0cde0/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI智能玩具","kp":["市场规模[AI玩具2030]: 850亿元"],"sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":3.5,"d":3.5,"t":5.5},"as":"AI玩具正从传统玩具向智能陪伴伙伴演进，开辟新消费赛道。具备情绪安抚、生活陪伴功能的AI毛绒玩具，融合编程启蒙与自主交互的AI积木机器人，以及支持沉浸式互动的AI产品快速涌现。AI技术赋能玩具实现自然语言对话、个性化学习和情感连接，推动玩具产业智能化升级。","cl":"b96b4bb4","cln":"AI智能玩具","cp":0,"b":"从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道-新华网\n从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道\n从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道\n具备情绪安抚和生活陪伴等功能的AI毛绒玩具，将编程启蒙、自主交互与动手搭建深度结合的AI积木机器人，能实现沉浸式互动游戏和个性化故事创作的AI语音情感陪伴机器人……当前，能互动、有性格、有记忆的AI玩具在各大商超玩具专区、线上电商直播间持续走红，成为行业竞争新赛道。\n“我国玩具产业正迈向智能化发展的全新阶段，尤其是人工智能技术与传统玩具产业深度融合，加速重塑产品形态与价值链结构，AI玩具正成为推动产业高质量发展的新引擎。”工业和信息化部消费品工业司司长何亚琼说。\n这一观点在相关机构的数据中得到进一步体现：中商产业研究院发布的研究报告预测，到2030年，我国AI玩具市场规模将增至850亿元。\n需求迭代，情绪价值成新引擎\n在行业从业者看来，AI玩具的火爆，是消费需求迭代与产业技术升级的双向奔赴，在玩具领域，当前消费者更看重互动价值、情绪价值与成长价值。\n相较于传统玩具，AI玩具正从单一娱乐功能进化为融合教育启蒙、互动陪伴等属性于一体的“智慧伙伴”。\n以深圳跃然创新科技有限公司推出的CocoMate系列AI玩具为例，与经典IP奥特曼联动，当CocoMate机身被放置在官方玩偶内，通过自然语音对话等方式，玩具能“理解”用户的情感、需求和想法，用奥特曼的口吻和语气给予陪伴和共情。\n“从最初的语音故事机到如今的AI玩具，核心的变化是产品观的重构。”跃然创新公关总监钟文杰说，现在的AI玩具，从“功能”转向“陪伴”，不再只是单向的内容灌输，而是在交互对话过程中回应孩子的奇思妙想、启发想象，甚至帮助家长更深入了解孩子。\n情绪价值和实用价值叠加，让AI玩具用户范围从儿童扩展到“全龄段”。\n一款AI毛绒包挂，不仅能与用户沟通交流，还可以通过“碰一碰”加好友，为年轻人提供情感陪伴；一款AI记忆助手玩具，既能通过语音提醒老年人按时用药、预约就医，还能播放老歌、讲述历史故事……用科技填补情感缺口，用智能陪伴成长，AI玩具正围绕“更自然的交互”和“更温暖的陪伴”不断演进。\n技术赋能，兼顾创新与安全\nAI玩具实现共情能力，背后依托的是底层技术的飞速发展。\n语言大模型、视觉大模型等让玩具产品“听得懂”“看得到”“能思考”：上海珞博智能科技有限公司推出的AI潮玩芙崽，通过接入豆包等大模型和自研模型，能够实现高精度的情绪感知与拟人化反馈，还具有长期记忆；浙江金科汤姆猫文化产业股份有限公司的“情感陪伴垂直模型”，提升对话温度，实现从手游IP到家庭陪伴赛道的延伸。\n钟文杰说，AI玩具互动不能只依赖通用大模型简单“套壳”，让产品成为适配用户需求的智能玩伴与互动搭档，必须在大模型底层针对场景开展深度定制与专项优化，打造专属的智能交互解决方案。\n技术带来便利，也引发新的思考。“高度拟人化是否会引发情感依赖、认知混淆、隐私泄露等新型风险？”“如何平衡‘科技陪伴’和‘真人互动’的关系？”网络上，有关AI玩具使用的伦理争议伴随使用群体的增加逐渐显现。\n技术向善，需以规范护航。国家网信办等五部门联合公布的《人工智能拟人化互动服务管理暂行办法》将于2026年7月15日起施行。办法提出，鼓励拟人化互动服务创新发展，对拟人化互动服务实行包容审慎和分类分级监管，促进拟人化互动服务向上向善。\n同济大学党委书记、中国工程院院士郑庆华表示，办法精准聚焦拟人化互动服务特有风险，确立“身份提醒”机制，建立“防沉迷与心理保护”体系，强化“数据安全与隐私保护”。\n“办法明确了人工智能拟人化互动服务‘辅助人类、服务人类’的定位，划定伦理红线，禁止其替代或扭曲真实社会关系和人际交往，严防人机边界模糊可能带来的认知混淆与情感异化。”郑庆华说。\n产业升级，转型出海拓新局\n从“制造玩具”到“智造伙伴”，AI正在重塑玩具赛道，传统玩具产业拥抱转型升级新机遇。\n在“世界超市”义乌，AI玩具正在成为外贸出口的爆款。义乌全球数贸中心红太阳科技店铺负责人付华说，店内爆款“悟空”机器人能够用流利的外语和客户交流，吸引大批海外客户咨询。“高峰时曾经半天就获得数十万元订单。”\n不少在义乌从事玩具行业的商户，近两年顺应市场新需求，主动加强研发创新，全力对接AI技术资源，推出智能对话公仔、AI编程玩具、智能互动益智玩具等新品，备受海外客商青睐。相关产品销售至东南亚、欧洲、中东等多个地区，市场竞争力大幅增强。\n走俏海外市场的AI玩具，不仅为商户打开新的利润空间，也折射出中国制造向更高附加值领域延伸的趋势。据义乌海关统计，2025年义乌市玩具用品出口256.3亿元，增长20.1%。\n业内人士表示，未来随着人工智能技术持续迭代、内容生态不断完善，AI玩具的陪伴属性、教育属性等将进一步凸显，玩具产业依托成熟的产业链优势，叠加前沿科技赋能，有望持续释放创新活力，在国内消费升级与全球市场竞争中，跑出产业转型新速度。（记者 王悦阳 魏一骏）\n“农业农村是大有可为的广阔天地”\n专访丨中国在全球海洋治理中发挥积极作用\n算力普惠浪潮奔涌 赋能产业民生双升级\n一封“战书”没写成，却成了温暖的家书\n科学圆桌会丨1.5亿只蝴蝶为何同时扇动翅膀？\n盘点伊朗战事百日经济冲击波\n全球瞭望丨霍尔木兹海峡“梗阻”或致油轮利润“过山车”\n从“退养还滩”到“苇绿鹤归”——辽东湾海岸生态修复观察\n从玩具到伙伴 AI玩具“玩”出新赛道"},{"t":"人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"l","u":"https://cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260608_1893544.html","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化制甲醇","kp":["产率提升[人造叶片制甲醇]: 较此前提升32倍","催化剂[CO₂制甲醇]: 酞菁钴单分子锚定碳纳米管","[还原过程]: CO₂六电子还原"],"sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.5,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"美国耶鲁大学团队研发新型人造'叶片'，以创纪录效率模拟光合作用，利用阳光、水和二氧化碳直接合成液体燃料甲醇。该技术突破为人工光合作用制备液体燃料提供了新路径，有望实现太阳能到化学能的高效转化，对碳中性能源和二氧化碳资源化利用具有重要意义。","b":"人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n美国耶鲁大学科学家领衔的团队研制出一款新型人造“叶片”，能以创纪录效率模拟光合作用，将阳光、水和二氧化碳直接合成液体燃料甲醇。甲醇产率是此前制醇的人造“叶片”的32倍。相关论文发表于新一期《美国化学学会杂志》。\n新系统凝聚了团队数十年的研究精髓：独特的催化剂与创新的光电极。二者共同构建出一套更强、更精简的转化路径，并可拓展至更广阔的应用场景。\n团队此前已开发出这款催化剂，其利用电能将二氧化碳和水转化为甲醇，催化活性中心是酞菁钴（或其衍生物）的单分子结构。他们将该分子结构锚定在碳纳米管表面。碳纳米管强度极高，导电导热性能优异，可源源不断地将电子高速输送到催化位点，从而把二氧化碳还原为甲醇。这是一个六电子还原过程，即向一个二氧化碳分子中注入六个电子。而在此发现之前，电子传递受限，止步于双电子还原，分子催化剂只能将二氧化碳转化为一氧化碳等产物。\n光电极则由一系列覆盖着富勒烯碳的硅微柱阵列构成。这一结构设计独具匠心，兼具理想的电荷产生与分离几何结构、量身定制的电子转移界面以及更大的催化剂锚定表面积。\n此次，团队将该光电极、催化剂与多结钙钛矿光伏微型模块集成为独立的太阳能燃料系统，实现了有史以来基于硅的二氧化碳到甲醇光电催化转化的最高效率。其光转化甲醇效率为0.8%，是此前人造“叶片”光转醇纪录的32倍。\n这片新型“叶片”可从空气中捕获气候变化的“元凶”二氧化碳，产出日益受到青睐的化学原料和替代液体燃料甲醇，开辟了一条可行的太阳能转化与储存新路径。团队计划继续优化这款新“叶片”的结构，以进一步提升转化效率。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立\n香港理工大学·月山能源新一代矿业联合实验室揭牌\n全国首个绿色算力全栈AI平台上线运行\n氢铀反应起始过程首次完整记录\n太阳能新技术实现海水淡化及固体盐分离"},{"t":"人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇--中国能源新闻网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"l","u":"http://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/kj/202606/t20260608_1893544.html","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"中国电力新闻网-科技","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化制甲醇","kp":["产率提升[人造叶片制甲醇]: 较此前提升32倍","催化剂[CO₂制甲醇]: 酞菁钴单分子锚定碳纳米管","[还原过程]: CO₂六电子还原"],"dp":1,"sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.5,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"美国耶鲁大学团队研发新型人造'叶片'，以创纪录效率模拟光合作用，利用阳光、水和二氧化碳直接合成液体燃料甲醇。该技术突破为人工光合作用制备液体燃料提供了新路径，有望实现太阳能到化学能的高效转化，对碳中性能源和二氧化碳资源化利用具有重要意义。","b":"人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇--中国能源新闻网\n中电传媒股份有限公司主办\n人造“叶片”模拟光合作用高效制甲醇\n美国耶鲁大学科学家领衔的团队研制出一款新型人造“叶片”，能以创纪录效率模拟光合作用，将阳光、水和二氧化碳直接合成液体燃料甲醇。甲醇产率是此前制醇的人造“叶片”的32倍。相关论文发表于新一期《美国化学学会杂志》。\n新系统凝聚了团队数十年的研究精髓：独特的催化剂与创新的光电极。二者共同构建出一套更强、更精简的转化路径，并可拓展至更广阔的应用场景。\n团队此前已开发出这款催化剂，其利用电能将二氧化碳和水转化为甲醇，催化活性中心是酞菁钴（或其衍生物）的单分子结构。他们将该分子结构锚定在碳纳米管表面。碳纳米管强度极高，导电导热性能优异，可源源不断地将电子高速输送到催化位点，从而把二氧化碳还原为甲醇。这是一个六电子还原过程，即向一个二氧化碳分子中注入六个电子。而在此发现之前，电子传递受限，止步于双电子还原，分子催化剂只能将二氧化碳转化为一氧化碳等产物。\n光电极则由一系列覆盖着富勒烯碳的硅微柱阵列构成。这一结构设计独具匠心，兼具理想的电荷产生与分离几何结构、量身定制的电子转移界面以及更大的催化剂锚定表面积。\n此次，团队将该光电极、催化剂与多结钙钛矿光伏微型模块集成为独立的太阳能燃料系统，实现了有史以来基于硅的二氧化碳到甲醇光电催化转化的最高效率。其光转化甲醇效率为0.8%，是此前人造“叶片”光转醇纪录的32倍。\n这片新型“叶片”可从空气中捕获气候变化的“元凶”二氧化碳，产出日益受到青睐的化学原料和替代液体燃料甲醇，开辟了一条可行的太阳能转化与储存新路径。团队计划继续优化这款新“叶片”的结构，以进一步提升转化效率。（\n“十四五”能源高质量发展\n3.8分钟的跨越——国网张家口光伏智能断路器斩获日内瓦国际发明展金奖\n矿大（北京）未来能源与智慧应急智库中心成立\n能拉动10吨卡车的小丝束碳纤维量产\n广西电力科学技术协会揭牌成立\n香港理工大学·月山能源新一代矿业联合实验室揭牌\n全国首个绿色算力全栈AI平台上线运行\n氢铀反应起始过程首次完整记录\n太阳能新技术实现海水淡化及固体盐分离","aip":1},{"t":"中核浙江210MW光伏项目环评公示！","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://news.solarbe.com/202606/08/50024082.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"索比光伏-综合新闻","tg":"产业进展","tp":"光伏项目建设","kp":["装机容量[光伏项目]: 210MW(直流214.33MWp)","组件[光伏]: 740Wp单晶双面N型"],"sc":5.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":7.0,"r":2.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"浙江省台州市生态环境局三门分局发布三门汇科新能源210MW光伏项目环评公示。项目位于三门县浦坝港镇，总投资68000万元，施工工期12个月。该环评公示标志着中核集团在浙江新能源布局持续推进，大型地面光伏项目进入实质性审批阶段。","b":"6月2日，浙江省台州市生态环境局三门分局发布三门汇科新能源有限公司三门东部二期210MW光伏项目环评文件的公示。\n公示内容显示，三门东部二期210MW光伏项目位于台州市三门县浦坝港镇下栏塘区块，总投资68000万元，施工工期12个月。该项目租用村集体养殖塘2797.75亩，直流侧装机容量约为214.33MWp，交流侧装机容量约209.92MW，交流侧最大出力约174.93MW，采用740Wp单晶双面高效N型组件。\n项目建设单位为三门汇科新能源有限公司。该公司成立于2023年9月，经营范围涵盖太阳能发电技术服务，风力发电技术服务，储能技术服务等。该公司由中核汇能间接控股。"},{"t":"中国科学技术大学AM详细解读：聚合物化表面钝化反式钙钛矿电池，1600小时MPP稳定运行_手机网易网","d":"2026-06-09","i":"l","u":"https://www.163.com/dy/article/KUT5GK4R0552LHQK.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"网易知光谷","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿表面钝化","kp":["转换效率[反式钙钛矿电池]: 26.54%","稳定性[MPP运行]: 1600小时","钝化材料[钙钛矿]: 乙烯基膦酸(VPA)原位聚合"],"sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.5,"t":6.0},"as":"中国科学技术大学团队在反式钙钛矿太阳能电池研究中取得突破，采用聚合物化表面钝化策略有效抑制界面缺陷。器件在连续光照下实现1600小时最大功率点（MPP）稳定运行，显著提升了反式钙钛矿电池的长期运行可靠性。研究发表于Advanced Materials，为钙钛矿电池商业化稳定性瓶颈提供了可行的工程化解决路径。","b":"第一作者：Wenjie Zhao, Jingchen Yang, Chang Ji and Junyao Gao\n通讯作者：Yu Tong, Changkui Duan, Shangfeng Yang, Weiren Cheng, Zhengguo Xiao\n1.设计并采用可聚合表面钝化材料乙烯基膦酸（VPA），其膦酸基团（-PO₃H₂）与钙钛矿表面未配位Pb²⁺强\n，同时乙烯基（C=C）在低温热退火下原位聚合，形成共价交联网络。\n2.与传统有机铵小分子（如PEAI）相比，聚合后的PVPA\n层具有更高的热稳定性和化学稳定性，不易脱附、去质子化或分解，显著提升了器件的长期运行稳定性。\n3.DFT计算和实验证实，PVPA在钙钛矿表面形成紧密堆积的聚合层，其C–C键骨架与钙钛矿晶格参数匹配，实现了高效的缺陷钝化和界面能级优化。\n4.基于PVPA钝化的反式钙钛矿太阳能电池实现了26.54%的实验室效率（认证26.24%），并在室温最大功率点追踪（MPPT）下运行1600小时后仍保持超过90%的初始效率，在60°C高温MPPT下700小时后仍保持90%效率。\n一、本研究针对的问题与挑战\n表面钝化是提升钙钛矿太阳能电池效率和稳定性的关键策略，目前主流钝化材料为有机氨基氢碘酸盐（如PEAI、3F-PEAI等），这些小分子通过氢键或离子配位钝化表面缺陷。然而，这类有机铵配体在光热应力下易发生脱附、去质子化或分解，导致钝化层失效，加速器件性能衰减。尤其在高温（>85°C）或连续光照下，其不稳定性严重制约了钙钛矿光伏的商业化。\n本文提出了一种新型可聚合表面钝化材料——乙烯基膦酸（VPA）。VPA分子同时含有膦酸基团（强配位能力）和乙烯基（可聚合官能团）。在旋涂并热退火（100°C）后，VPA单体在钙钛矿表面原位聚合形成共价交联网络（PVPA），该聚合物层与钙钛矿表面牢固结合，且因聚合后分子运动受限，显著抑制了脱附和分解。DFT计算表明，PVPA在钙钛矿表面的结合能远高于VPA单体，且其C–C键骨架与钙钛矿\n参数匹配，形成紧密堆积的钝化层。实验结果表明，PVPA钝化后钙钛矿薄膜的光致发光强度显著增强，载流子寿命从603 ns延长至2181 ns，缺陷态密度大幅降低。基于PVPA的反式器件效率达26.54%（认证26.24%），且未封装器件在室温MPP跟踪下1600小时后仍保持90%以上初始效率，在60°C高温MPP下700小时后仍保持90%效率，远优于PEAI钝化和未钝化器件。该策略为解决钙钛矿表面钝化层的光热不稳定性提供了新思路。\nVPA的聚合及PVPA层的形成\n通过旋涂VPA异丙醇溶液（1 mg/mL）于钙钛矿表面，并在100°C退火10分钟，实现原位聚合。¹H NMR和¹³C NMR显示，聚合后出现0.9–2.1 ppm的-CH-和-CH₂-特征峰，以及27.2和59.7 ppm的碳信号。FTIR中观察到2922.6和2853.2 cm⁻¹的-CH₂-不对称和对称伸缩振动峰，证实了乙烯基聚合。XPS显示PVPA处理后，Pb 4f峰向低结合能移动0.22 eV（P–O–Pb配位），O 1s、P 2p峰向高结合能移动，表明磷酰基与Pb²⁺强相互作用。DFT计算比较了VPA单体及三种PVPA构型在钙钛矿表面的结合能，结果显示紧密堆积的\n层构型最为稳定（-3.1 eV），且C–C键平均长度约1.55 Å，相邻P=O间距6.2–7.7 Å，与钙钛矿晶格参数（6.31 Å）匹配，有利于形成致密覆盖层。\n静电势（ESP）计算表明，PVPA的偶极矩为0.46 D，显著小于PEAI（2.15 D），更对称的电荷分布有利于电子提取。UPS显示PVPA处理后钙钛矿的功函数从4.25 eV降至4.14 eV，价带顶从1.17 eV上移至1.32 eV，有利于与电子传输层（C₆₀）的能级匹配，抑制界面复合。稳态PL和TRPL表明，PVPA处理后PL强度显著增强，平均载流子寿命从603.1 ns（对照）和632.6 ns（PEAI）大幅提升至2181.1 ns，表明非辐射复合被有效抑制。C-AFM显示PVPA处理后的薄膜电流分布更均匀，且电流信号增强，表明聚合钝化层改善了表面电学均匀性和电荷传输。\n器件结构：ITO/Me-4PACz/钙钛矿（FA₀.₉₂₅MA₀.₀₀₅Cs₀.₀₅Rb₀.₀₂Pb(I₀.₉₉₅Br₀.₀₀₅)₃）/C₆₀/BCP/Cu。对照器件PCE为24.11%，PEAI钝化器件为24.86%，而PVPA钝化器件最佳PCE达26.54%（Jsc 26.78 mA/cm²，Voc 1.190 V，FF 83.27%），认证效率26.24%。EQE积分Jsc为26.18 mA/cm²，与J-V一致。稳态功率输出（MPPT）为25.5%。EL外量子效率（EQE_EL）测试显示，PVPA器件在注入电流等于Jsc时，EQE_EL接近5%，远高于对照（0.8%）和PEAI（2.4%），依据ΔVoc = (kT/q)·ln(EQE_PVPA/EQE_PEAI)计算，Voc提升约0.021 V，与实验值相符。光强依赖Voc显示PVPA器件的理想因子为1.17 kT/q，低于对照（1.57）和PEAI（1.54），表明陷阱辅助复合被抑制。TPV寿命从3.25 ms延长至6.07 ms，TPC寿命从5.5 μs缩短至4.1 μs，EIS复合电阻增加，均证实PVPA有效抑制了界面复合并促进了载流子提取。\n在60% RH空气中监测薄膜稳定性：对照薄膜28小时内明显降解，PEAI薄膜降解更快（因PEAI吸湿），而PVPA薄膜在80小时内无明显变化。PL强度演化同样证实PVPA薄膜更稳定。未封装器件在室温MPP跟踪下，PVPA器件T90寿命达1600小时，而对照和PEAI器件在更短时间内损失超过35%效率。在60°C高温MPP下，PVPA器件700小时后仍保持90%初始效率，对照和PEAI器件在250小时后仅剩57%和60%。这些提升归因于聚合层共价交联网络的高稳定性，以及膦酸基团的强锚定作用。使用非可聚合的乙基膦酸（EPA）和丙烯酸（AA）进行对照。EPA虽含膦酸基但无可聚合乙烯基，AA含乙烯基但羧酸配位能力弱。两者均仅带来微小效率提升和稳定性改善，说明聚合与强配位两者缺一不可。这进一步证实了PVPA的协同优势。\n本文报道了一种可聚合表面钝化材料——乙烯基膦酸（VPA），其在钙钛矿表面原位热聚合形成共价交联网络（PVPA）。膦酸基团与未配位Pb²⁺强配位，有效钝化表面缺陷；聚合物层的共价网络显著提高了钝化层的热稳定性和化学稳定性，避免了传统有机铵小分子易脱附和分解的问题。基于PVPA钝化的反式钙钛矿太阳能电池实现了26.54%的实验室效率（认证26.24%），并在室温MPP追踪下1600小时后仍保持超过90%的初始效率，在60°C高温下700小时后仍保持90%效率。这项工作为开发高稳定性、高效率的钙钛矿太阳能电池提供了新的表面钝化策略，并指出具有强配位能力和可聚合官能团的分子设计是未来方向。\nZhao, W., Yang, J., Ji, C. et al. Polymerized surface passivation for stable and efficient inverted perovskite solar cells. Adv. Mater. (2026).\nhttps://doi.org/10.1002/adma.202673618\n知光谷光伏器件学术QQ群：641345719\n钙钛矿产教融合交流@知光谷（微信群）：需添加编辑微信\n为加强科研合作，我们为海内外科研人员专门开通了\n，备注：姓名-单位-研究方向（无备注请恕不通过），由编辑审核后邀请入群。"},{"t":"“人工智能+”能源向体系化推进","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://www.news.cn/tech/20260608/fbfee555f23e458ba0c56bb8bb8d2fbe/c.html","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"新华网科技","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI赋能能源","kp":["智算集群[2025]: 42个万卡级","用电量[算力中心2025]: 1700亿千瓦时","[高价值场景]: 首批51个AI+能源场景"],"sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.5,"r":3.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"新华网报道，我国\"人工智能+\"能源融合进入体系化推进阶段。2025年已建成42个万卡级智算集群，全国算力中心总用电量达1700亿千瓦时，AI与能源的双向赋能已具备坚实基础。一方面AI赋能能源系统优化与调度，另一方面能源转型为算力基础设施供电保障提出新要求，形成相互驱动的产业格局。","b":"“人工智能+”能源向体系化推进 -新华网\n“人工智能+”能源向体系化推进\n“人工智能+”能源向体系化推进\n·2025年，我国已建成42个万卡级智算集群，全国算力中心总用电量达1700亿千瓦时。\n·总体来看，我国人工智能与能源双向赋能已具备坚实基础。在量的保障上，我国已建成全球规模最大的电力系统；在质的优化上，全国用电营商环境显著提升，多项“获得电力”指标在世界银行营商环境评价企业调查中达到或接近国际最佳水平。\n人工智能（AI）是建设能源强国、发展能源新质生产力的重要引擎。国家能源局近日召开全国“人工智能+”能源现场推进会，发布首批共51个“人工智能+”能源高价值场景，25家能源企业签署《开放能源领域人工智能应用高价值场景倡议书》。人工智能与能源融合发展由点位突破向体系化推进，将催生更多产业新机遇。\n国家能源局组织编制的《中国“人工智能+”能源发展报告2026》显示，人工智能快速发展正带动全球算力设施用电需求持续增长。据国际能源署预测，到2030年，全球数据中心用电量将较2025年接近翻番。2025年，我国已建成42个万卡级智算集群，全国算力中心总用电量达1700亿千瓦时。\n国家能源局局长王宏志表示，伴随人工智能蓬勃发展，超大规模智算集群持续升级，芯片制造等新质生产力加速聚集，用电负荷呈现高增速、高密度、布局集中化、运行复杂化等新特征新趋势，高品质供电需求日益提升。预计“十五五”时期，全国算力用电量年均新增1000亿千瓦时以上，到2030年预计达8000亿千瓦时，占全社会用电量6%左右。\n当前，算力设施正由十万千瓦级向百万千瓦级跃升，对稳定、绿色、经济的能源供给提出了更高要求。“算力设备对电压稳定性、频率偏差等指标要求极高，微小的电能质量偏差都可能导致数据传输错误、设备故障，电力供应既要有‘量的满足’，更要有‘质的稳定’。”王宏志说。\n在远景赤峰零碳产业园，远景科技集团打造了“算电协同”国家战略的全球首个系统级实践样本——基于100%可再生能源电力系统，实现风电、光伏、储能、算力之间动态协同，通过AI电力系统持续提升能源利用效率。\n远景科技集团董事长张雷表示，限制人工智能发展的不只是芯片，还有整个人工智能系统的能量管理，否则模型再大、算力再强，电力系统的物理天花板也会约束住人工智能发展。未来人工智能的竞争，不仅是模型竞争、芯片竞争，更是电力系统的竞争——每一兆瓦电力能够产生多少有效智能的竞争。“通过AI电力系统，我们可以让有限能源支撑更多计算，让每千瓦时绿电创造更多智能价值。”张雷说。\n总体来看，我国人工智能与能源双向赋能已具备坚实基础。在量的保障上，我国已建成全球规模最大的电力系统；在质的优化上，全国用电营商环境显著提升，多项“获得电力”指标在世界银行营商环境评价企业调查中达到或接近国际最佳水平。此外，我国绿色电力供应规模持续扩大，跨省跨区绿电交易规模稳步攀升，建成全球最大绿证市场。内蒙古和林格尔、甘肃庆阳等地新建数据中心的绿电消费占比已超80%。\n推进人工智能与能源融合发展，持续深化能源领域应用场景开放是重中之重。此次发布的51个高价值场景聚焦八大类典型应用场景，探索形成综合解决方案可规模复制、商业模式可参考借鉴的“人工智能+”能源融合发展新范式，推动提升能源行业智能化发展水平。其中，在电网领域，聚焦规划评审、调度运行等场景，人工智能提升电网运营管理效率；在能源新业态领域，围绕虚拟电厂、车网互动等场景，人工智能为新业态的孵化培育和规模化发展提供支撑；在新能源领域，通过多元数据融合，人工智能助力功率预测、市场化运营，提升新能源市场参与度和基地化运营能力；等等。\n专家认为，这些高价值应用场景具备全行业推广潜力，大规模应用后能助推能源产业转型升级。\n围绕扎实做好人工智能与能源双向赋能工作，王宏志表示，将持续深化能源应用场景开放。能源央企要发挥好“领头羊”作用，在保障安全的前提下，主动开放高价值应用场景。民营企业要发挥“主力军”作用，积极揭榜，投身到场景开放和解决方案研究工作中。\n我国“人工智能+”能源从概念走向实践、从探索走向推广，将加快推动人工智能和能源双向赋能，促进能源领域新质生产力发展和生产关系深层次变革。（记者 王轶辰）\n家政服务业破局探路的成都样本观察\n专访丨中国在全球海洋治理中发挥积极作用\n一封“战书”没写成，却成了温暖的家书\n6月9日起精彩天幕“连续剧”将上演\n科学圆桌会丨1.5亿只蝴蝶为何同时扇动翅膀？\n盘点伊朗战事百日经济冲击波\n全球瞭望丨霍尔木兹海峡“梗阻”或致油轮利润“过山车”\n从“退养还滩”到“苇绿鹤归”——辽东湾海岸生态修复观察\n“人工智能+”能源向体系化推进"},{"t":"野火风险指标对公共安全停电成本节约的影响","d":"2026-06-09","i":"l","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926008172?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","tg":"研究论文","tp":"野火停电成本","dp":1,"sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"","ot":"Wildfire risk metric impact on public safety power shutoff cost savings"},{"t":"为什么今年的世界杯用球可能不会飞得那么远","d":"2026-06-09","i":"n","u":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/06/08/1138470/why-this-years-world-cup-ball-may-not-fly-as-far/","c":"不相关","a":"MIT Technology Review","tg":"行业观察","b":"Much is new about this month’s upcoming FIFA World Cup tournament, which will be held in the US, Canada, and Mexico. It hosts more teams than ever before. It’s the first to occur in three different host countries. And, like predecessor cups for over half a century, it will employ a soccer ball with a brand-new design.\nOne group of researchers that has been testing the physics of World Cup balls for the past 20 years\nrecently studied\nthis new entry, called the Trionda. Made by Adidas, the Trionda features four red, green, and blue panels textured with deep grooves and maple leaf, green eagle, and star emblems to represent the three host countries. Through wind-tunnel experiments, the research team found that this ball improves over previous versions in some ways, but long-distance kicks might not go as far as they did in the past.\n“The simple picture is that Trionda may very slightly punish extreme distance, but it should reward clean technique and predictable flight,” says team member John Eric Goff, who researches sports physics and is an incoming professor of engineering practice at Purdue University. “Goalkeepers, defenders hitting long passes, and long-range shooters are where I would look first for visible differences.”\nTAKESHI ASAI, SUNGCHAN HONG, AND RICHONG LIU\nAdidas has been\ndesigning new balls\nfor each World Cup since the 1970s. Some of the design changes in the first few decades were aesthetic: The 1986 ball featured graphics inspired by Aztec temples for the Mexico tournament, and 1994’s had space graphics in honor of the moon landing’s 25th anniversary. There were some structural differences too, such as upgraded foam cores and improved water resistance. But by and large, the balls used the same design of 32 pentagonal panels stitched together.\nThat changed in the 2006 World Cup in Germany, when Adidas introduced the +Teamgeist ball. It featured just 14 curved panels, which were thermally bonded together rather than stitched. The design helped keep moisture out so the ball wouldn’t grow heavier throughout the game, Goff says. It was around this time that he started studying soccer balls. In the years since then, he and his colleagues have followed the transformations as Adidas has released balls with different surface textures and even fewer panels—design changes significant enough to affect game play.\nGoff discovered early on that by analyzing a ball’s trajectory data, he could derive its drag coefficient—a number that determines the air resistance it experiences midflight at a given speed. Shortly after, he began working with a team in Japan to analyze how the World Cup ball’s in-flight behavior changes with each new design.\nThe experiments, carried out at the University of Tsukuba in Japan, have been purposely consistent over the years because “maintaining continuity is important for comparing new data with historical data sets,” says Takeshi Asai, a professor there\nwho works on the experiments. They entail attaching the ball to a metal rod connected to an instrument called a force balance, which measures aerodynamic forces such as drag and lift as the ball is exposed to the same wind speeds it would experience in a real soccer game—seven to 35 meters per second.\nThe team tests the ball in different orientations, “but you can only do a few because the Trionda ball is $170,” Goff says, and each new test effectively destroys it. The experiments show the team how the drag coefficient changes with speed, and Goff then writes code to simulate the ball’s overall trajectory as it flies through the air.\nThe team’s analysis has shown how recent World Cup balls evolved since the eight-panel Jabulani ball for the 2010 event. The Jabulani faced much criticism from players—particularly goalkeepers, who said it had a deceptive trajectory that “dipped wickedly,” as one player told the\nTAKESHI ASAI, SUNGCHAN HONG, RICHONG LIU\nThe 2010 Jabulani ball (left) had eight panels and a smooth texture that translated into unpredictable performance. Later balls, like the 2014 Brazuca (center) and this year's Trionda (right), have fewer panels but more roughness.\nThe ball had one key flaw: It was too smooth. Even though its drag coefficient was relatively low at high speeds, once the ball slowed to a certain point the coefficient would ratchet up, causing it to lose speed quite fast and behave as the 2010 players complained. This sudden transition—called the drag crisis—occurs at higher speeds for smoother balls, but with added texture like seams and grooves, the transition can be avoided until a ball reaches lower speeds. This allows the ball to travel farther and generally behave in a more predictable way during typical play.\n“It’s the same reason why golf balls have dimples and baseballs have those nice 108 double stitches. If those rough features of those balls were not there, you would not get anywhere near the kind of distance when those balls are thrown or hit that you see now,” Goff says. “There has to be some kind of a roughness on the ball to move this transition to a smaller speed.”\nSubsequent designs have been able to push the drag crisis to lower speeds, according to the analysis by Goff and his colleagues. The Brazuca ball used in 2014, for instance, has only six panels, but their total seam length is much longer, adding to the surface’s roughness. And this year’s Trionda ball contains just four panels, but each panel also has three deep grooves for more texture.\nThere’s a trade-off to this roughness, though. While Goff and his colleagues found that the Trionda ball experiences the drag crisis at the slowest speed since 2010, its drag coefficient is also\nthan that of the other balls at high speeds. That means that even though the most dramatic change doesn’t happen until the ball is moving quite slowly, the ball will still slow down faster than its recent predecessors during the faster portion of its flight. So the trajectories of long kicks may be a few meters shorter, Goff says. Adidas did not respond to a request for comment.\nFortunately, players in the upcoming World Cup should already be familiar with these added nuances, as they’ve had access to the new ball for at least a few months. The ball, Goff notes, is quite similar to Nike’s Flight ball in design, so players who’ve spent more time with that ball may have an added advantage.\nMeanwhile, Goff continues sending the group’s papers to his colleagues FIFA and Adidas in hope of providing some new insights, and he’s been sent balls by Adidas in the past. Adidas does perform its own unpublished tests of each new ball. The\nNew York Times\nreported last year\nthat the Trionda’s 3.5-year testing process included robotics designed to kick the ball at specific speeds as well as testing in seven of the 16 host locations.\nBut as Goff sees it, soccer is “the world’s most popular sport, [this is] its most important tournament, and the most important piece of equipment in that tournament is this ball right here,” indicating the the Trionda ball that he had on camera with him during our Zoom call. “I think they’re interested in what some external testing looks like.”\nKeep Reading\nAccording to Stanford’s 2026 AI Index, AI is sprinting, and we’re struggling to keep up.\nMIT Technology Review's authoritative overview of the 10 technologies, emerging trends, bold ideas, and powerful movements in AI in 2026.\nMusk kept his cool, and OpenAI’s lawyer bulldozed him with piercing questions about his motivations for suing the company.\nLaunching next week on T-Mobile's network, the cell plan takes a nuclear approach to online safety.\nIllustration by Rose Wong\nDiscover special offers, top stories,\nupcoming events, and more."},{"t":"为什么这么多年轻人得癌症？研究人员知道什么和不知道什么","d":"2026-06-09","i":"l","u":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-01780-6","c":"不相关","a":"Nature","dp":1,"tg":"观点评论","b":"Candidates for the trend are emerging, but are likely to vary from one type of tumor to another. Candidates for the trend are emerging, but are likely to vary from one type of tumor to another."},{"t":"原位生长含偶氮二维共轭共价有机框架薄膜的湿法转移用于光开关","d":"2026-06-09","i":"l","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2260268?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","tg":"研究论文","tp":"共价有机框架薄膜","kp":["[制备方法]: 原位生长+湿法转移","[材料]: 偶氮二维共轭COF薄膜","[功能]: 光开关电子器件"],"as":"研究报道了一种含偶氮基团的二维π共轭共价有机框架（2D π-COF）的原位生长及湿法转移技术。2D π-COF结合面内π电子离域与周期性孔道结构，在柔性电子、光电器件等领域具重要潜力。该工作通过原位生长实现大面积高质量薄膜制备，再用湿法转移将其转移到目标基底上，解决了传统粉体材料难以器件化集成的瓶颈，为二维共轭聚合物材料的器件级应用提供了可行路径。","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"ot":"Wet Transfer of In Situ Grown Azo‐Containing Two‐Dimensional Conjugated Covalent Organic Framework Films for Photoswitch","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Two‐dimensional π‐conjugated covalent organic frameworks (2D π‐COFs) combine in‐plane π‐delocalization with periodic open channels, making them versatile platforms for integrating functional groups into optoelectronic and neuromorphic systems. However, their predominant powder form has fundamentally constrained device integration and interfacial engineering. Herein, we demonstrate a general strategy for constructing high‐quality transition‐metal chalcogenide@2D π‐COF van der Waals heterostructures (vdWHs). Large‐area, atomically flat 2D π‐COF films are first grown on SiO\n                    2\n                    substrates via a liquid–solid interfacial reaction and subsequently transferred onto monolayer MoS\n                    2\n                    through a mild in situ wet‐transfer process. The resulting COF films exhibit atomic‐scale flatness and form clean interfaces, promoting efficient interfacial charge transfer in COF@MoS\n                    2\n                    heterojunctions. As a model system, we employ a robust imidazole‐linked 2D π‐COF (COF‐Azo) functionalized with azobenzene moieties, whose reversible\n                    trans‐cis\n                    photoisomerization dynamically modulates the heterojunction's electronic structure. The COF‐Azo@MoS\n                    2\n                    devices display pronounced and reversible photoswitching behavior, achieving a carrier density modulation of ∼6.7 × 10\n                    11\n                    cm\n                    −2\n                    and an on‐state current variation of ∼43.7%. Importantly, optical control over the isomerization fraction enables non‐volatile memory behavior within the vdWHs. This work establishes a scalable route to atomically flat 2D π‐COF films as viable building blocks for vdW heterostructures and introduces a robust platform for optically reconfigurable optoelectronics and memory devices."}]);